  ('809321617146913044', '10.5', 2004, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'John Lafia', null, 'Kim Delaney, Beau Bridges, Fred Ward, Dulé Hill, Ivan Sergei, John Schneider, Kaley Cuoco, Rebecca Jenkins', 'TV-PG', 'Dr. Samantha Hill is an earthquake research scientist at a noted university in Washington State. Her alternative theories and her take-charge attitude cause friction with her peers. When the controversial Dr. Hill is ultimately put in charge, she is effectively entrusted with saving the entire population of the West Coast from a series of earthquakes that threaten to permanently fracture the West Coast from the rest of North America.', 'Dr. Samantha Hill is an earthquake research scientist at a noted university in Washington State. Her alternative theories and her take-charge attitude cause friction with her peers. When the controversial Dr. Hill is ultimately put in charge, she is effectively entrusted with saving the entire population of the West Coast from a series of earthquakes that threaten to permanently fracture the West Coast from the rest of North America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abnY1ze2BaHh5bqIX72up8GPEbe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:49191'),
  ('748616408379580506', '10.5: Apocalypse', 2006, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'John Lafia', null, 'Frank Langella, Glenda Braganza, Barbara Eve Harris, Beau Bridges, Kim Delaney, Francis X. McCarthy, Natalie Brown, Dean Cain', null, 'Deadly seismic activities that peaked with a 10.5 earthquake and devastated the West Coast have altered the core structure of the earth and now threaten to jeopardize North America and the Western hemisphere. In a desperate bid to save lives - and the country - President Hollister calls once again upon one of the nation''s top seismologists, controversial scientist Dr. Samantha Hill and her supervisor and former boyfriend Dr. Jordan Fisher, to interpret the latest onslaught of quakes.', 'Deadly seismic activities that peaked with a 10.5 earthquake and devastated the West Coast have altered the core structure of the earth and now threaten to jeopardize North America and the Western hemisphere. In a desperate bid to save lives - and the country - President Hollister calls once again upon one of the nation''s top seismologists, controversial scientist Dr. Samantha Hill and her supervisor and former boyfriend Dr. Jordan Fisher, to interpret the latest onslaught of quakes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5J3LDmL2sA6PeY1yA7zsODv855C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9203'),
  ('52989172892182967', '100 Centre Street', 2001, 'Drama', null, null, 'Paula Devicq, Alan Arkin, Bobby Cannavale, James Murtaugh, LaTanya Richardson Jackson, Joel de la Fuente, Dennis Boutsikaris, Joseph Lyle Taylor', null, '100 Centre Street is an American legal drama created by Sidney Lumet and starring Alan Arkin, Val Avery, Bobby Cannavale, Joel de la Fuente and Paula Devicq.', '100 Centre Street is an American legal drama created by Sidney Lumet and starring Alan Arkin, Val Avery, Bobby Cannavale, Joel de la Fuente and Paula Devicq.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avwtuzs39Sk7JIarhYiO4UqBWjn.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:12327'),
  ('1024133107291696756', '100 Code', 2015, 'Crime', 'Bobby Moresco', null, 'Michael Nyqvist, Dominic Monaghan, Kristoffer Berglund, Peter Eggers, Hedda Stiernstedt, Roisin Murphy, Anna Åström', 'NR', 'New York, USA. Stockholm, Sweden. Over the past twelve months young, blonde, blue-eyed women have been found dead in a meadow where Asphodel flowers grow. New York Detective Tommy Conley gets a special dispensation from the NYPD to go observe and act as an adviser to the Stockholm Police Department in order to help solve these crimes.', 'New York, USA. Stockholm, Sweden. Over the past twelve months young, blonde, blue-eyed women have been found dead in a meadow where Asphodel flowers grow. New York Detective Tommy Conley gets a special dispensation from the NYPD to go observe and act as an adviser to the Stockholm Police Department in order to help solve these crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tg9fpeSvD8QvPOjt1ZASz3GkqT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62146'),
  ('1044447683731404928', '100 Days My Prince', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'So Jae-hyun, Lee Jong-jae', 'Noh Ji-sul', 'Doh Kyung-soo, Nam Ji-hyun, Cho Seong-ha, Cho Han-cheul, Oh Yeon-ah, Ji Min-hyuk, Kim Seon-ho, Jung Hae-kyun', 'TV-14', 'Lee Yool falls off a cliff and nearly dies in an attempted assassination. He loses his memory, and wanders for 100 days under a new name and personality. During this period, he meets Hong Sim, head of the first detective agency in Joseon.', 'Lee Yool falls off a cliff and nearly dies in an attempted assassination. He loses his memory, and wanders for 100 days under a new name and personality. During this period, he meets Hong Sim, head of the first detective agency in Joseon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5GoF6fZGqEycUqgcCNmBCN3OdWM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81821'),
  ('335434408957275010', '100 Deeds for Eddie McDowd', 1999, 'Family, Comedy', null, 'Erin O''Malley', 'Brenda Song, Seth Green, Jason Hervey, Richard Moll, Joe Piscopo, Catherine MacNeal, Diane Delano, Jim Fitzpatrick', 'TV-Y7', 'When the school bully is turned into a talking dog, he can only regain his human form by performing 100 good deeds—with the help of his new owner, the kid who was his last victim.', 'When the school bully is turned into a talking dog, he can only regain his human form by performing 100 good deeds—with the help of his new owner, the kid who was his last victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSkC921dcN2QicV61OdFbu8GAGT.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:6518'),
  ('167863305416650458', '100 días para enamorarnos', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ricardo Alvarez Canales', null, 'Ilse Salas, Mariana Treviño, Erick Elías, David Chocarro, Sylvia Sáenz, Héctor Suárez Gomís, Sofía Lama, Humberto Zurita', null, 'Two couples who struggle to be near each other decide to give another chance for each other, 100 days for them to fall back in love.', 'Two couples who struggle to be near each other decide to give another chance for each other, 100 days for them to fall back in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r13t1ohRQAlZpsjxgTKY7ypkWPc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:102966'),
  ('44294494256868240', '100 Foot Wave', 2021, 'Documentary, Reality', 'Chris Smith', null, 'Garrett McNamara', 'TV-14', 'The decade-long odyssey of surfing pioneer Garrett McNamara, who, after visiting Nazaré, Portugal in hopes of conquering a 100-foot wave, pushed the sport to ever-greater heights and alongside locals helped transform the small fishing village into the world’s preeminent big-wave surfing destination.', 'The decade-long odyssey of surfing pioneer Garrett McNamara, who, after visiting Nazaré, Portugal in hopes of conquering a 100-foot wave, pushed the sport to ever-greater heights and alongside locals helped transform the small fishing village into the world’s preeminent big-wave surfing destination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubwVtWy86MmIEGpOOlzSdyUB4dn.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:121481'),
  ('632638798852459016', '100 Höjdare', 2004, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Filip Hammar, Fredrik Wikingsson', null, 'Filip Hammar, Fredrik Wikingsson', null, '100 höjdare was a Swedish TV series which was produced and aired on Kanal 5. Six seasons of the show were produced and it ran from 2004 to 2008. It was hosted by the comedy duo Filip Hammar & Fredrik Wikingsson. In the first three seasons the hosts presented funny moments, often in the form of video clips, listing their 100 all-time favorites. In season two and three they also discuss the clips with celebrity guests. By season four the format changed and instead of showing clips, Filip and Fredrik made impromptu interviews with people, often in their homes.', '100 höjdare was a Swedish TV series which was produced and aired on Kanal 5. Six seasons of the show were produced and it ran from 2004 to 2008. It was hosted by the comedy duo Filip Hammar & Fredrik Wikingsson. In the first three seasons the hosts presented funny moments, often in the form of video clips, listing their 100 all-time favorites. In season two and three they also discuss the clips with celebrity guests. By season four the format changed and instead of showing clips, Filip and Fredrik made impromptu interviews with people, often in their homes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8uo24zLWST9rPN9hMhFvOleRtH.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:5319'),
  ('79205803527482162', '100 Humans: Life''s Questions. Answered.', 2020, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, 'Haley Bockrath, Tyanta Snow, Komalpreet Batth, Braxton Hale, Alfredo Tavares, Alie Ward', 'TV-14', 'One hundred hardy souls from diverse backgrounds participate in playful experiments exploring age, sex, happiness and other aspects of being human.', 'One hundred hardy souls from diverse backgrounds participate in playful experiments exploring age, sex, happiness and other aspects of being human.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykN9uhnGdtjvx9Lk8bYvdprNQsC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100429'),
  ('927429558734192875', '100 Love Scenes', 2008, 'Drama', null, null, 'Hiro Mizushima, Saya Yūki, Misa Uehara, Yumi Sugimoto, Shūichirō Masuda', null, 'Mizushima Hiro interprets the role of a surfer, a stylist, and a hairdresser in three different love stories.', 'Mizushima Hiro interprets the role of a surfer, a stylist, and a hairdresser in three different love stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rFbkq520MrxjvRgn4abhN1A4NIw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79522'),
  ('626488350197130566', '100 Questions', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Christopher Moynihan', null, 'Sophie Winkleman, David Walton, Smith Cho, Collette Wolfe, Christopher Moynihan, Michael Benjamin Washington', null, '100 Questions is an American situation comedy series which premiered on NBC on May 27, 2010. In May 2009 the network announced that the show would debut midseason in March 2010 on Tuesday nights at 9:30 pm, after NBC''s coverage of the 2010 Winter Olympics was completed. However the show was later pushed back to debut on May 27, 2010, with the episode order reduced from thirteen to six. 100 Questions is produced by Universal Media Studios, with executive producers Christopher Moynihan, Kelly Kulchak, Ron West, and Michelle Nader. The cancellation of 100 Questions was announced on July 8, 2010.', '100 Questions is an American situation comedy series which premiered on NBC on May 27, 2010. In May 2009 the network announced that the show would debut midseason in March 2010 on Tuesday nights at 9:30 pm, after NBC''s coverage of the 2010 Winter Olympics was completed. However the show was later pushed back to debut on May 27, 2010, with the episode order reduced from thirteen to six. 100 Questions is produced by Universal Media Studios, with executive producers Christopher Moynihan, Kelly Kulchak, Ron West, and Michelle Nader. The cancellation of 100 Questions was announced on July 8, 2010.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/euoAQcVBtmue99RVuimdc6FZNJL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:18469'),
  ('1052360487449894804', '100 Scariest Movie Moments', 2004, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Keiko Agena, David Arquette, Clive Barker, Amber Benson, Xander Berkeley, Jami Bernard, Lombardo Boyar, Aviva Briefel', null, 'Featuring interviews, film clips, and production stills, this miniseries explores what went into the making of most bone-chilling moments in cinematic history and searches beyond the conventions of the genre to uncover the number one scary movie moment of all time.', 'Featuring interviews, film clips, and production stills, this miniseries explores what went into the making of most bone-chilling moments in cinematic history and searches beyond the conventions of the genre to uncover the number one scary movie moment of all time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6JAv5yFllI7BNH8JBUUDNv1sQRm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:50646'),
  ('114949338969881707', '100 Things to Do Before High School', 2014, 'Comedy, Family', 'Scott Fellows', null, 'Isabela Merced, Jaheem Toombs, Owen Patrick Joyner, Jack De Sena', 'TV-G', 'With real life and teen drama awaiting her after 8th grade graduation, CJ Martin has only a short time left to make the most of her middle school years. Together with her two lifelong best friends Fenwick and Crispo, she is determined to get the most out of this time, using an ever-expanding list of challenges as a guide. For this group, growing up means trying everything and taking chances while they still can.', 'With real life and teen drama awaiting her after 8th grade graduation, CJ Martin has only a short time left to make the most of her middle school years. Together with her two lifelong best friends Fenwick and Crispo, she is determined to get the most out of this time, using an ever-expanding list of challenges as a guide. For this group, growing up means trying everything and taking chances while they still can.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aDJ6YsH3HCxg67qpKGQ4HswZACh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63038'),
  ('591348414668047311', '100 Years of Warner Bros.', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Morgan Freeman', 'TV-MA', 'Tracing a century of movie and TV history, these four documentary specials explore the unparalleled global impact of Warner Bros. on art, commerce, and culture.', 'Tracing a century of movie and TV history, these four documentary specials explore the unparalleled global impact of Warner Bros. on art, commerce, and culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vGotZtJzU5eGCndAO4lqxylPK5t.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223249'),
  ('56788675142423018', '100% Poker', 2023, 'Talk', null, null, 'Erika Moulet, Willy Dias, PonceP', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j4Vs19OnknuvzQxoVesSlNhgcZo.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:284408'),
  ('1102469165497575840', '1000 Ways to Die', 2009, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Thom Beers', 'H.A. Arnarson, Tom McMahon, Geoff Miller', 'Ron Perlman', 'TV-14', 'The science of living and the randomness of death are combined with a dash of Darwinism. Forensic experts, pathologists, toxicologists, herpetologists, and other experts offer eloquent explanations of mortality.', 'The science of living and the randomness of death are combined with a dash of Darwinism. Forensic experts, pathologists, toxicologists, herpetologists, and other experts offer eloquent explanations of mortality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKZYX4D30R7ywy6f5yQDuXagSCr.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:15826'),
  ('573730668992506252', '1000-lb Sisters', 2020, 'Reality', null, null, 'Amy Slaton, Tammy Slaton', 'TV-14', 'The Slaton sisters averaging over a thousand pounds, have always depended on each other for support. Now in their 30s, Amy wants to have children, but cannot due to her weight, while her elder sister Tammy is near bedridden.', 'The Slaton sisters averaging over a thousand pounds, have always depended on each other for support. Now in their 30s, Amy wants to have children, but cannot due to her weight, while her elder sister Tammy is near bedridden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHsnlkzfHAxyzRFxKLbdLkPFL4o.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:98410'),
  ('1067512279871315377', '101 Dalmatian Street', 2019, 'Animation, Family, Kids', 'Miklos Weigert', null, 'Margot Powell, Michaela Dietz, Josh Brener, Abigail Zoe Lewis, Aimee-Ffion Edwards, Rhys Isaac-Jones, Lauren Lindsey Donzis, Ella Kenion', 'TV-Y7', 'Follow the adventures of eldest siblings Dolly and Dylan, their Mum Delilah and Dad Doug, and their 97 younger brothers and sisters as they embark on urban adventures and extreme sibling rivalry. Together, the pups explore growing up and finding their own spot inside the biggest, messiest, furriest blended family ever.', 'Follow the adventures of eldest siblings Dolly and Dylan, their Mum Delilah and Dad Doug, and their 97 younger brothers and sisters as they embark on urban adventures and extreme sibling rivalry. Together, the pups explore growing up and finding their own spot inside the biggest, messiest, furriest blended family ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5meA7Ik8h9t2Bd3VR7Pw85pXECV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75523'),
  ('131287832857675285', '101 Dalmatians Series', 1997, 'Kids, Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Jim Jinkins', null, 'Kath Soucie, Tara Strong, Jeff Bennett, Frank Welker, April Winchell, Charlotte Rae, Pamela Adlon, Debi Mae West', 'TV-Y7', 'After foiling Cruella DeVil''s plot to make a fur coat with the puppies'' skins, the Dearly Family (Roger and Anita Dearly, Nanny, Pongo, Perdita, their 15 birth puppies and 84 adopted puppies) move to a new farm home in the country. Join Pongo and Perdy''s pups, brave Lucky, tubby Rolly and Cadpig the runt, together with their chicken friend Spot, as they defend their new home from Cruella DeVil (Anita''s boss and now new neighbor), continually get in and out of trouble, sneak into Grutely, and have all sorts of crazy adventures around the farm. Also along for the fun is Tripod, Patch, Two-Tone, Wizzer, Dipstick, Mooch, and the rest of their barnyard friends.', 'After foiling Cruella DeVil''s plot to make a fur coat with the puppies'' skins, the Dearly Family (Roger and Anita Dearly, Nanny, Pongo, Perdita, their 15 birth puppies and 84 adopted puppies) move to a new farm home in the country. Join Pongo and Perdy''s pups, brave Lucky, tubby Rolly and Cadpig the runt, together with their chicken friend Spot, as they defend their new home from Cruella DeVil (Anita''s boss and now new neighbor), continually get in and out of trouble, sneak into Grutely, and have all sorts of crazy adventures around the farm. Also along for the fun is Tripod, Patch, Two-Tone, Wizzer, Dipstick, Mooch, and the rest of their barnyard friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wL0BebqMDxYZiXDdcCmPvtyaeYk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2198'),
  ('505469395808677338', '1066: The Battle for Middle Earth', 2009, 'Action & Adventure, Documentary, War & Politics', null, 'Peter Harness', 'Ian Holm, Mike Bailey, Francis Magee, Tim Plester, Katrine Bach, Kate Ambler, Gemma Lawrence, Sam Hardy', null, 'In this blend of historical drama and original source material, the story of this decisive year is remagined, not from the saddles of kings and conquerors, but through the eyes of the ordinary men who fought on their behalf.', 'In this blend of historical drama and original source material, the story of this decisive year is remagined, not from the saddles of kings and conquerors, but through the eyes of the ordinary men who fought on their behalf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ExXTegt0TcCg2VGh2VLzNTU5Af.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37656'),
  ('921680156607091425', '11 Minutes', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Jeff Zimbalist', null, 'Jason Aldean, Storme Warren, Natalie Grumet, Gianna Baca, Parker Marx, Natalia Baca, Dean McAuley, Billy Marx', 'TV-MA', 'A four-part documentary that takes viewers inside the heart-stopping stories of terror and survival experienced by those who were at the 2017 Route 91 Harvest Music Festival in Las Vegas.', 'A four-part documentary that takes viewers inside the heart-stopping stories of terror and survival experienced by those who were at the 2017 Route 91 Harvest Music Festival in Las Vegas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tGsPlNcqDlduY267EP5jMRFnff.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210091'),
  ('709131029840863917', '11.22.63', 2016, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'James Franco, Sarah Gadon, Chris Cooper, Daniel Webber, Lucy Fry, George MacKay', 'TV-MA', 'An English teacher travels back in time to prevent the Kennedy assassination, but discovers he is attached to the life he has made in a bygone era.', 'An English teacher travels back in time to prevent the Kennedy assassination, but discovers he is attached to the life he has made in a bygone era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fH41ccMKvgDTbbcCxWWH6fznah.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64464'),
  ('478233685303520265', '112 Vandaag', 2021, null, null, null, null, null, 'Reporters across the country go after the 112 calls of the past 24 hours. They report on the emergency calls that came in and how the police, fire brigade, ambulance, or rescue services subsequently responded.', 'Reporters across the country go after the 112 calls of the past 24 hours. They report on the emergency calls that came in and how the police, fire brigade, ambulance, or rescue services subsequently responded.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7TLOTLJZREBDhYAKAkp3Dz8Rwym.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:284058'),
  ('382352917262052236', '11eyes', 2009, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Daisuke Ono, Ayano Niina, Chiaki Takahashi, Mai Gotou, Emiko Hagiwara, Noriko Rikimaru, Yuu Asakawa, Yokote Kumiko', null, 'Satsuki Kakeru lost his sister by suicide and has been living a dull life ever since then. One day, he is transported into a bizarre world "Red Night" along with his friend Minase Yuka. In order to survive and escape from Red Night, he fights against Dark Spirits (Ralva) and Black Nights.', 'Satsuki Kakeru lost his sister by suicide and has been living a dull life ever since then. One day, he is transported into a bizarre world "Red Night" along with his friend Minase Yuka. In order to survive and escape from Red Night, he fights against Dark Spirits (Ralva) and Black Nights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6mRx6i58ffk1RMhnQGOYkj0PDOu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44310'),
  ('118788756419169439', '12 Deadly Days', 2016, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Chris Cullari, Jennifer Raite', null, 'Anna Akana, Jon Fletcher, J. Claude Deering, Robert Belushi, Betty Gabriel, John Kassir', null, 'In the cursed town of Saturn, CA, during the 12 days leading up to Christmas, watch these interconnected tales showing the town''s residents dealing will all kinds of evil.', 'In the cursed town of Saturn, CA, during the 12 days leading up to Christmas, watch these interconnected tales showing the town''s residents dealing will all kinds of evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4NHB13MAyydLwQW1nG4kDJWn2IW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69060'),
  ('1049863057884874306', '12 Monkeys', 2015, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Terry Matalas, Travis Fickett', 'David Webb Peoples, Janet Peoples', 'Aaron Stanford, Amanda Schull, Barbara Sukowa, Emily Hampshire, Alisen Down, Todd Stashwick', 'TV-14', 'The provocative story of Cole, a time traveler from a decimated future in a high-stakes race against the clock. Utilizing a dangerous and untested method of time travel, he journeys from 2043 to the present day on a mission to locate and eradicate the source of a deadly plague that will all but annihilate the human race.', 'The provocative story of Cole, a time traveler from a decimated future in a high-stakes race against the clock. Utilizing a dangerous and untested method of time travel, he journeys from 2043 to the present day on a mission to locate and eradicate the source of a deadly plague that will all but annihilate the human race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w5u1PqBYfDyfrlkxADTA38jYG3I.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:60948'),
  ('1066705926828405878', '12 O''Clock High', 1964, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Paul Burke, Frank Overton, Chris Robinson, Barney Phillips, Andrew Duggan, Robert Dornan', 'TV-PG', 'This series chronicles the adventures--in the air and on the ground--of the men of the 918th Bombardment Group of the U.S. Eighth Air Force. First commanded by irascible General Frank Savage--and later by Colonel Joe Gallagher, the son of a Pentagon General--the Group is stationed in England, and flies long-range bombing missions into German-held Europe.', 'This series chronicles the adventures--in the air and on the ground--of the men of the 918th Bombardment Group of the U.S. Eighth Air Force. First commanded by irascible General Frank Savage--and later by Colonel Joe Gallagher, the son of a Pentagon General--the Group is stationed in England, and flies long-range bombing missions into German-held Europe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ocq6H8uIitqJQO4qD1odhRYaEbC.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:13905'),
  ('870613886325561034', '12 oz. Mouse', 2005, 'Animation, Comedy, Mystery', 'Matt Maiellaro', 'Matt Maiellaro', 'Matt Maiellaro, Kurt Soccolich, Matt Harrigan', 'TV-MA', '12 oz. Mouse revolves around Mouse Fitzgerald, nicknamed "Fitz", an alcoholic mouse who performs odd jobs so he can buy more beer. Together with his chinchilla companion Skillet, Fitz begins to recover suppressed memories that he once had a wife and a child who have now vanished. This leads him to seek answers about his past and the shadowy forces that seem to be manipulating his world.', '12 oz. Mouse revolves around Mouse Fitzgerald, nicknamed "Fitz", an alcoholic mouse who performs odd jobs so he can buy more beer. Together with his chinchilla companion Skillet, Fitz begins to recover suppressed memories that he once had a wife and a child who have now vanished. This leads him to seek answers about his past and the shadowy forces that seem to be manipulating his world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lt7ltHs5s1pdIqxsNN0TeI9L10.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:3043'),
  ('944774104593040799', '12-sai.: Chicchana Mune no Tokimeki', 2016, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Sayuri Hara, Ai Kakuma, Juri Kimura, Shun Horie, Tetsuya Kakihara, Shinnosuke Tachibana, Taishi Murata, Soma Saito', null, 'The story begins with Hanabi, a sixth-grade girl who is neither an adult nor a child. She deals with issues such as accidentally witnessing her homeroom teacher kissing, and worrying about experiencing physiological changes before her friends. The series depicts a 12-year-old girl''s innocent worries and first love.', 'The story begins with Hanabi, a sixth-grade girl who is neither an adult nor a child. She deals with issues such as accidentally witnessing her homeroom teacher kissing, and worrying about experiencing physiological changes before her friends. The series depicts a 12-year-old girl''s innocent worries and first love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5MQhvVnEUc8VztssOVcrt1WocP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:65928'),
  ('595438246601632953', '13 Commandments', 2018, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Ed Vanderweyden', 'Maarten Moerkerke, Koen Sonck, Geert Verbanck', 'Lola Rose Delany, Bert Haelvoet, Jeroen Perceval, Kim Hertogs, Karlijn Sileghem, Marie Vinck, Ella Leyers, Line Pillet', null, 'A serial killer reverts to the 10 commandments in order to kick society a conscience with his crimes.', 'A serial killer reverts to the 10 commandments in order to kick society a conscience with his crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jvR6hnctpLpyfUpChIvPIzwW3j.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75680'),
  ('97682434905609463', '13 Klinicheskaya', 2022, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Vadim Sokolovsky, Ilya Burets', 'Andrey Zolotarev', 'Danila Kozlovsky, Paulina Andreeva, Viktoriya Isakova, Vladimir Steklov, Dmitry Lysenkov, Nino Ninidze, Denis Sinyavskiy', null, 'Terminally ill surgeon Kirill finds a job in a clinic where doctors struggle with supernatural phenomena. The only way to survive is to show his best side and convince the new management that the hospital needs him. Kirill plunges into the intricacies of the relationships of people, witches and demons, increasingly doubting that he is able to correctly determine who exactly represents good and who is evil here. The diagnosis is imperfect, and the enemy may be someone who initially did not seem to them. To avoid such mistakes, Kirill and his colleagues will have to spend a lot of time studying the circumstances of patients'' illnesses.', 'Terminally ill surgeon Kirill finds a job in a clinic where doctors struggle with supernatural phenomena. The only way to survive is to show his best side and convince the new management that the hospital needs him. Kirill plunges into the intricacies of the relationships of people, witches and demons, increasingly doubting that he is able to correctly determine who exactly represents good and who is evil here. The diagnosis is imperfect, and the enemy may be someone who initially did not seem to them. To avoid such mistakes, Kirill and his colleagues will have to spend a lot of time studying the circumstances of patients'' illnesses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGnCS11Qs2e9zPibGNgY2Uspdts.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:216827'),
