  ('901750384545716904', '15 Storeys High', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Sean Lock, Mark Lamarr, Martin Trenaman', null, 'Sean Lock, Benedict Wong', null, '15 Storeys High is a critically acclaimed British sitcom, set in a tower block. The main characters are Vince Clark, a misanthropic, cynical recluse played by Sean Lock, and Errol Spears, Vince''s exact opposite and whipping boy, played by Benedict Wong.', '15 Storeys High is a critically acclaimed British sitcom, set in a tower block. The main characters are Vince Clark, a misanthropic, cynical recluse played by Sean Lock, and Errol Spears, Vince''s exact opposite and whipping boy, played by Benedict Wong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hsgp3xqZld98CKfwC47R7jmhDS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:909'),
  ('960537318959819506', '16 and Pregnant', 2009, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-14', '16 and Pregnant is an American reality television series that debuted June 11, 2009, on MTV. It follows the stories of pregnant teenage girls in high school dealing with the hardships of teenage pregnancy. Each episode features a different teenage girl, with the episode typically beginning when she is 4 ¹⁄2 – 8 months into her pregnancy. The episode typically ends when the baby is a few months old. The series is produced in a documentary format, with an animation on notebook paper showing highlights during each episode preceding the commercial breaks. 16 and Pregnant has spawned several spin-off series: Teen Mom, Teen Mom 2 and Teen Mom 3. Each series follows the lives of four girls from their respective season of 16 and Pregnant as they navigate their first years of motherhood. As of July 2013, casting for the fifth season of the series is taking place.', '16 and Pregnant is an American reality television series that debuted June 11, 2009, on MTV. It follows the stories of pregnant teenage girls in high school dealing with the hardships of teenage pregnancy. Each episode features a different teenage girl, with the episode typically beginning when she is 4 ¹⁄2 – 8 months into her pregnancy. The episode typically ends when the baby is a few months old. The series is produced in a documentary format, with an animation on notebook paper showing highlights during each episode preceding the commercial breaks. 16 and Pregnant has spawned several spin-off series: Teen Mom, Teen Mom 2 and Teen Mom 3. Each series follows the lives of four girls from their respective season of 16 and Pregnant as they navigate their first years of motherhood. As of July 2013, casting for the fifth season of the series is taking place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNNHlx6ySP9Xyfx7RetkI4hV5x1.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:31673'),
  ('842293383816639578', '1600 Penn', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Jason Winer, Jon Lovett, Josh Gad', null, 'Josh Gad, Bill Pullman, Jenna Elfman, Martha MacIsaac, André Holland, Amara Miller, Benjamin Stockham', 'TV-PG', '1600 Penn is an American single camera television comedy series about a dysfunctional family living in the White House.', '1600 Penn is an American single camera television comedy series about a dysfunctional family living in the White House.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7daLZojK2dj8LuBbR0SOXSmQBTy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43243'),
  ('282296454061753877', '1670', 2023, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Bartłomiej Topa, Katarzyna Herman, Kirył Pietruczuk, Martyna Byczkowska, Michał Sikorski, Dobromir Dymecki', 'NR', 'A zany nobleman contends with family feuds and clashes with peasants in his quest to become the most famous person in Poland.', 'A zany nobleman contends with family feuds and clashes with peasants in his quest to become the most famous person in Poland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMPLjSZYJEeeXfxeKQ7Ct7SEYuV.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:236450'),
  ('626184629553360277', '16bit Sensation: Another Layer', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Aoi Koga, Atsushi Abe, Yui Horie, Ayako Kawasumi, Kentaro Ito, Jun Fukushima, Aya Yamane', 'TV-14', 'Konoha Akisato is an illustrator that loves beautiful girls and bishojo games. Her dream is to become a super-popular illustrator, so she is working hard at a bishojo game production company, but reality isn''t that kind... With the golden age of social network games in full force, Konoha''s company isn''t doing well, and she works as a sub illustrator, spending her days painting the backs of random background characters. One day, the owner of a game shop gives her a classic bishojo game. With all her excitement over the golden age of bishojo games, she opens the package to "Dokyusei," and is enveloped by a bright light. Konoha then realizes that she just traveled back in time! She ends up in the year 1992! It''s the dawn of the bishojo game era! Konoha ends up working at a company called Alcohol Soft. Will she be able to think about, draw, and create all the beautiful girls she’s ever wanted?! A story about a girl and her overwhelming love for beautiful girls—"Now, let''s begin!"', 'Konoha Akisato is an illustrator that loves beautiful girls and bishojo games. Her dream is to become a super-popular illustrator, so she is working hard at a bishojo game production company, but reality isn''t that kind... With the golden age of social network games in full force, Konoha''s company isn''t doing well, and she works as a sub illustrator, spending her days painting the backs of random background characters. One day, the owner of a game shop gives her a classic bishojo game. With all her excitement over the golden age of bishojo games, she opens the package to "Dokyusei," and is enveloped by a bright light. Konoha then realizes that she just traveled back in time! She ends up in the year 1992! It''s the dawn of the bishojo game era! Konoha ends up working at a company called Alcohol Soft. Will she be able to think about, draw, and create all the beautiful girls she’s ever wanted?! A story about a girl and her overwhelming love for beautiful girls—"Now, let''s begin!"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgjZsuLBwOGgUaIyLkpVPxl8Ii0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217512'),
  ('486572573643696794', '17.3 about a sex', 2020, 'Drama', null, null, 'Riko Nagase, Ririka Tanabe, Shiori Akita, Taisuke Niihara, Yoshiki Fujieda, Raizou Ishikawa, Sonim, Norika Fujiwara', null, '"The world average age for the first sexual experience... 17.3". Is that early? Late? Seno Sakura has a serious personality. Hara Tsumugi has never liked a member of the opposite sex before. Minagawa Yuna is experienced and is currently dating a company employee. At the age of 17, the girl''s "sexual values" begin to fluctuate.', '"The world average age for the first sexual experience... 17.3". Is that early? Late? Seno Sakura has a serious personality. Hara Tsumugi has never liked a member of the opposite sex before. Minagawa Yuna is experienced and is currently dating a company employee. At the age of 17, the girl''s "sexual values" begin to fluctuate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xsrBKPtEvwmgc9aKWaiqsE5mC1e.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109590'),
  ('885561706684130182', '1703', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Denis Artamonov', 'Kuzma Saprykin, Gosha Kutsenko, Sofia Lebedeva, Varvara Feofanova, Andrey Fedortsov, Ivan Kupreenko, Pavel Tabakov, Sharlot', null, 'Vadik, a young opera singer from Moscow, is being transferred to St. Petersburg because his fiancee lives here. As a mentor, Vadik receives a senior operative, Captain Gosha Kolpakov, a psychotic suicidal and misanthropic man living the darkest moment of his life. Two partners travel around St. Petersburg near Bulanov and investigate the case of the disappearance of the corpses of young girls from morgues.', 'Vadik, a young opera singer from Moscow, is being transferred to St. Petersburg because his fiancee lives here. As a mentor, Vadik receives a senior operative, Captain Gosha Kolpakov, a psychotic suicidal and misanthropic man living the darkest moment of his life. Two partners travel around St. Petersburg near Bulanov and investigate the case of the disappearance of the corpses of young girls from morgues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c7CLGkE23wwX3jd2X3YJmXEfqOk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211220'),
  ('867188582807711011', '18 Again', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ha Byung-hoon', 'Kim Do-yeon, An Eun-bin, Choi Yi-ryun', 'Lee Do-hyun, Kim Ha-neul, Yoon Sang-hyun, Roh Jeong-eui, Ryeoun, Wi Ha-jun, Kim Kang-hyun, Lee Mi-do', null, 'At a difficult place in his marriage and career, a middle-aged man gets a shot at a do-over when he''s transformed back into his 18-year-old body.', 'At a difficult place in his marriage and career, a middle-aged man gets a shot at a do-over when he''s transformed back into his 18-year-old body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AwoC5PiNdi1RZTZTgOGGdHqCzrC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99654'),
  ('609243360909018475', '18 Wheels of Justice', 2000, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Richard C. Okie', null, 'Lucky Vanous, Lisa Thornhill, Billy Dee Williams, G. Gordon Liddy, Krista Allen', null, 'Justice Department undercover agent Michael Cates’s family was killed after he testified against crime boss Jacob Calder. Now Cates is working out of an 18 Wheeler under another undercover identity, that of Chance Bowman. As Cates wanders America listening to country music and helping people he is also dodging hit-men and still trying to take down Calder.', 'Justice Department undercover agent Michael Cates’s family was killed after he testified against crime boss Jacob Calder. Now Cates is working out of an 18 Wheeler under another undercover identity, that of Chance Bowman. As Cates wanders America listening to country music and helping people he is also dodging hit-men and still trying to take down Calder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7dSu15ztcPKVlYtRyRSL3EvRE4b.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:25405'),
  ('136879513453532808', '180 Degree Longitude Passes Through Us', 2022, 'Drama', 'Punnasak Sukee', null, 'Ponlawit Ketprapakorn, Nitidon Pomsuwan, Kathaleeya McIntosh, Raywat Peanpojjananarth', null, 'On a road trip with his spirited mother, a student meets his late father’s elusive best friend, uncovering clues to a past both men seem desperate to keep hidden.', 'On a road trip with his spirited mother, a student meets his late father’s elusive best friend, uncovering clues to a past both men seem desperate to keep hidden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abeC470uFbtCBklHU9kQfEVpcOF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208146'),
  ('168935329333389225', '1864', 2014, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Ole Bornedal', 'Ole Bornedal', 'Jakob Oftebro, Pilou Asbæk, Marie Tourell Søderberg, Jens Sætter-Lassen, Eva Podzimková, Søren Malling, Nicolas Bro, Søren Pilmark', null, 'When Prussia and Austria declare war on Denmark, two brothers are called to serve in the bloodiest battle in Denmark''s history.', 'When Prussia and Austria declare war on Denmark, two brothers are called to serve in the bloodiest battle in Denmark''s history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRpZblRauwCiBbNdcwTOdpMCN66.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:54357'),
  ('710678177212840645', '1883', 2021, 'Drama, Western', 'Taylor Sheridan', 'Taylor Sheridan', 'Sam Elliott, Tim McGraw, Faith Hill, Isabel May, LaMonica Garrett, Marc Rissmann, Audie Rick, James Landry Hébert', 'TV-MA', 'Follow the Dutton family as they embark on a journey west through the Great Plains toward the last bastion of untamed America. A stark retelling of Western expansion, and an intense study of one family fleeing poverty to seek a better future in America’s promised land — Montana.', 'Follow the Dutton family as they embark on a journey west through the Great Plains toward the last bastion of untamed America. A stark retelling of Western expansion, and an intense study of one family fleeing poverty to seek a better future in America’s promised land — Montana.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/waLbm384SQDwLTCn6ttPqQS5kfV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:118357'),
  ('558981438730235353', '1899', 2022, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Jantje Friese, Baran bo Odar', null, 'Emily Beecham, Andreas Pietschmann, Aneurin Barnard, Isabella Wei, Maciej Musiał, Yann Gael, Miguel Bernardeau, Clara Rosager', 'TV-MA', 'When mysterious events change the course of an immigrant ship headed for New York in 1899, a mind-bending riddle unfolds for its bewildered passengers.', 'When mysterious events change the course of an immigrant ship headed for New York in 1899, a mind-bending riddle unfolds for its bewildered passengers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZleGu1MQVBArH2dlpZ9CGi0hhy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90669'),
  ('94128371918524699', '18if', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Nobunaga Shimazaki, Takehito Koyasu, Kaori Nazuka, Ai Kakuma, Aya Endo, Ayaka Shimizu, Ayako Kawasumi, Azumi Asakura', 'TV-MA', 'Haruto Tsukishiro wakes up in a dream world dominated by strange and powerful entities called Witches. To survive, he gets the assistance of research professor Katsumi Kanzaki and a mysterious white-haired girl called Lily. With their help, Haruto must outsmart the witches and find a way to return to the real world.', 'Haruto Tsukishiro wakes up in a dream world dominated by strange and powerful entities called Witches. To survive, he gets the assistance of research professor Katsumi Kanzaki and a mysterious white-haired girl called Lily. With their help, Haruto must outsmart the witches and find a way to return to the real world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gvKKFv5aIYSAyRY0lCmcYvHqIsN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72737'),
  ('922424188902216483', '19 Kids and Counting', 2008, 'Reality, Documentary, Drama, Family', null, null, 'Jim Bob Duggar, Michelle Duggar, Jill Dillard, Josh Duggar, Jinger Vuolo, Jessa Seewald, Anna Duggar, Derick Dillard', 'TV-PG', '19 Kids and Counting, rendered graphically as 19 Kids & Counting in its onscreen logo, is an American reality television show on TLC. The show is about the Duggar family, which consists of parents Jim Bob and Michelle Duggar and their 19 children—nine girls and ten boys, all of whose names begin with the letter "J". The series began on September 29, 2008. The twelfth season premiere was September 17, 2013.', '19 Kids and Counting, rendered graphically as 19 Kids & Counting in its onscreen logo, is an American reality television show on TLC. The show is about the Duggar family, which consists of parents Jim Bob and Michelle Duggar and their 19 children—nine girls and ten boys, all of whose names begin with the letter "J". The series began on September 29, 2008. The twelfth season premiere was September 17, 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2lH5OyY3v5nvRbPm8Z1bifgJQkP.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:5985'),
  ('519605936581103964', '19-2', 2011, 'Crime, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Claude Legault, Réal Bossé, Véronique Beaudet, Louis-Philippe Dandenault, Benz Antoine, Julie Perreault, Jean Petitclerc, Catherine Bérubé', 'TV-MA', '19-2 is a riveting French-language Canadian drama series set in Montreal. The show follows two police officers, seasoned veteran Nick Barron and rural newcomer Ben Chartier, as they navigate the challenges of working in the 19th precinct. Despite their contrasting approaches to policing, the duo forms a strong partnership while facing dangerous criminals, corruption within the force, and their personal struggles. As the series unfolds, it delves into the emotional and psychological impact of their demanding profession, providing an authentic look into the lives of law enforcement officers.', '19-2 is a riveting French-language Canadian drama series set in Montreal. The show follows two police officers, seasoned veteran Nick Barron and rural newcomer Ben Chartier, as they navigate the challenges of working in the 19th precinct. Despite their contrasting approaches to policing, the duo forms a strong partnership while facing dangerous criminals, corruption within the force, and their personal struggles. As the series unfolds, it delves into the emotional and psychological impact of their demanding profession, providing an authentic look into the lives of law enforcement officers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tDSZTZwicvFbgZF6QpTFGQJue9r.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:38527'),
  ('334323091428927669', '19-2', 2014, 'Crime, Drama', 'Réal Bossé, Claude Legault', null, 'Adrian Holmes, Jared Keeso, Benz Antoine, Mylène Dinh-Robic, Dan Petronijevic, Laurence Leboeuf', 'TV-MA', 'The day-to-day life of two unwilling partners of the Montreal Police Department, Officers Nick Barron and Ben Chartier. These two beat cops patrol the urban sprawl of downtown''s 19th district, in cruiser No. 2. 19-2 is about the tensions and bonds that develop between two incompatible men of very different temperaments and life experiences. Over time, Nick and Ben''s mistrust and antagonism for each other give way to moments of mutual respect and a wavering chance at a true partnership.', 'The day-to-day life of two unwilling partners of the Montreal Police Department, Officers Nick Barron and Ben Chartier. These two beat cops patrol the urban sprawl of downtown''s 19th district, in cruiser No. 2. 19-2 is about the tensions and bonds that develop between two incompatible men of very different temperaments and life experiences. Over time, Nick and Ben''s mistrust and antagonism for each other give way to moments of mutual respect and a wavering chance at a true partnership.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UVgpebTCmlW8URV1Y7KlN1mWJl.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:61546'),
  ('393057118127096431', '1923', 2022, 'Drama, Western', 'Taylor Sheridan', null, 'Helen Mirren, Harrison Ford, Brandon Sklenar, Julia Schlaepfer, Jerome Flynn, Darren Mann, Isabel May, Brian Geraghty', 'TV-MA', 'Follow a new generation of the Dutton family during the early twentieth century when pandemics, historic drought, the end of Prohibition and the Great Depression all plague the mountain west, and the Duttons who call it home.', 'Follow a new generation of the Dutton family during the early twentieth century when pandemics, historic drought, the end of Prohibition and the Great Depression all plague the mountain west, and the Duttons who call it home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgZRJZvZn5cpsWAB0zMUdad3iZd.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:157744'),
  ('974777546676060299', '1971: The Year That Music Changed Everything', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'In a tumultuous era, 1971 was a year of musical innovation and rebirth fueled by the political and cultural upheaval of the time. Stars reached new heights, fresh talent exploded onto the scene, and boundaries expanded like never before.', 'In a tumultuous era, 1971 was a year of musical innovation and rebirth fueled by the political and cultural upheaval of the time. Stars reached new heights, fresh talent exploded onto the scene, and boundaries expanded like never before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tmq56JYUMh5xik1FHMgtbhjwHOP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:124339'),
  ('200396877721006333', '1983', 2018, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Joshua Long, Maciej Musiał', 'Joshua Long', 'Robert Więckiewicz, Maciej Musiał, Michalina Olszańska, Andrzej Chyra, Zofia Wichłacz, Agnieszka Żulewska', 'TV-MA', 'Twenty years after a devastating terrorist attack in 1983 that halted the course of Poland''s liberation and the subsequent downfall of the Soviet Union, an idealistic law student Kajetan and a disgraced police investigator Anatol stumble upon a conspiracy that has kept the Iron Curtain standing and Poland living under a repressive police state.', 'Twenty years after a devastating terrorist attack in 1983 that halted the course of Poland''s liberation and the subsequent downfall of the Soviet Union, an idealistic law student Kajetan and a disgraced police investigator Anatol stumble upon a conspiracy that has kept the Iron Curtain standing and Poland living under a repressive police state.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zv2R0UvZ93hpeNcIkSKDeHtQC3S.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82798'),
  ('224442791938119464', '1985', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Wouter Bouvijn', 'Willem Wallyn', 'Tijmen Govaerts, Aimé Claeys, Mona Mina Leon, Tom Vermeir, Titus De Voogdt, Ruth Becquart, Peter van den Begin, Roda Fawaz', 'TV-14', 'In the turbulent 1980s, friends Marc and Franky, and his sister Vicky, move to Brussels for a career with the Gendarmerie. Soon the three young people are sucked into a spiral of crimes that are attributed to the so-called "Bende van Nijvel" gang.', 'In the turbulent 1980s, friends Marc and Franky, and his sister Vicky, move to Brussels for a career with the Gendarmerie. Soon the three young people are sucked into a spiral of crimes that are attributed to the so-called "Bende van Nijvel" gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5uifVE4rG4SCPShxXxY6KQLZTUV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:104649'),
  ('406672831455315118', '1986', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Nuno Markl', 'Filipe Homem Fonseca, Ana Markl, Joana Stichini Vilela', 'Miguel Moura e Silva, Laura Dutra, Eva Fisahn, Henrique Gil, Mafalda Santos, Tiago Garrinhas, Simon Frankel, Joana Flora', null, 'A dramatic comedy told from the point of view of high school students, and their parents and teachers, about one of the most striking moments of Portuguese democracy: the presidential elections and the dispute between Freitas do Amaral and Mário Soares.', 'A dramatic comedy told from the point of view of high school students, and their parents and teachers, about one of the most striking moments of Portuguese democracy: the presidential elections and the dispute between Freitas do Amaral and Mário Soares.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/di4Hkcv3d7eXv0kLvMsJtscbmDT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73976'),
  ('980937317891972027', '1992', 2015, 'Drama', 'Alessandro Fabbri, Ludovica Rampoldi, Stefano Sardo', null, 'Stefano Accorsi, Guido Caprino, Miriam Leone, Domenico Diele, Tea Falco, Alessandro Roja', 'TV-MA', 'As a major criminal investigation tries to stem the flow of corruption, Italy is poised on the brink of collapse.', 'As a major criminal investigation tries to stem the flow of corruption, Italy is poised on the brink of collapse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/414wd7iLed81v1m4aq34I8gK8G5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62459'),
  ('682682774950990590', '1992', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Álex de la Iglesia, Jorge Guerricaechevarría', null, 'Fernando Valdivielso, Marian Álvarez, Víctor Rivas, Carlos Santos, Álex Gadea, Jaime Ordóñez, Marieta Sánchez, Paz Vega', 'TV-MA', 'After the death of her husband, a grieving widow and a tormented ex-cop investigate a series of murders apparently related to the Universal Expo held in Seville in 1992.', 'After the death of her husband, a grieving widow and a tormented ex-cop investigate a series of murders apparently related to the Universal Expo held in Seville in 1992.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/brg7JhfiUDZWsKCMLi7nQK4rAi3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:225467'),
  ('839955550095202981', '1993', 2017, 'Drama', null, null, 'Stefano Accorsi, Guido Caprino, Miriam Leone, Antonio Gerardi, Tea Falco, Eros Galbiati, Domenico Diele, Camilla Semino Favro', null, 'Rome, 30 April 1993. A crowd throws coins at Italian politician Bettino Craxi - as if the Civil War has begun. Be quick if you want a place in the new system. Now, it''s every man for himself. 1993 is the last chance to set up the Second Republic. Everyone fights their own battles.', 'Rome, 30 April 1993. A crowd throws coins at Italian politician Bettino Craxi - as if the Civil War has begun. Be quick if you want a place in the new system. Now, it''s every man for himself. 1993 is the last chance to set up the Second Republic. Everyone fights their own battles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1hMZOQn4VdNuR5H1fkETn7xqM7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99688'),
  ('992927889284628373', '1994', 2019, 'Drama', null, 'Gianluca Bernardini', 'Stefano Accorsi, Guido Caprino, Miriam Leone, Antonio Gerardi, Paolo Pierobon, Giovanni Ludeno, Paolo Mazzarelli, Elena Radonicich', null, 'After the breakdown of the old government, and with it the First Republic, Italy changed for good in 1994. Spinster Leo is all too aware of this. He pushed hard to see Berlusconi get elected Prime Minister. He knows it''s not easy to win power, but holding on to it verges on the impossible. By the same token, it seems equally impossible for populist politician Pietro to change. Even now that he has an office at the Prime Minister''s premises in Rome, he still can''t cast off his old bad habits. Nor can he forget the only woman he has ever loved. A former TV starlet now turned politician and Congresswoman, Veronica has to decide who the man of her life is going to be. She has realized she no longer wants to be just a woman on the arm of powerful men. It is the start of her own push for power.', 'After the breakdown of the old government, and with it the First Republic, Italy changed for good in 1994. Spinster Leo is all too aware of this. He pushed hard to see Berlusconi get elected Prime Minister. He knows it''s not easy to win power, but holding on to it verges on the impossible. By the same token, it seems equally impossible for populist politician Pietro to change. Even now that he has an office at the Prime Minister''s premises in Rome, he still can''t cast off his old bad habits. Nor can he forget the only woman he has ever loved. A former TV starlet now turned politician and Congresswoman, Veronica has to decide who the man of her life is going to be. She has realized she no longer wants to be just a woman on the arm of powerful men. It is the start of her own push for power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4TTdhOO0SIU1YJ2uzVlye1gxkyi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:102229'),
  ('409367957287823864', '19th Floor', 2024, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Sun Qian, Miles Wei, Bai Shu, Rachel Wang, Luo Yutong, Pan Yuetong, Xiao Kaizhong, Dai Yaqi', null, 'College student Chunyu, estranged from her father, is pulled into a mysterious game called "19 Floors." Teaming up with clever and strong allies, she must survive terrifying challenges and uncover the game''s secrets.', 'College student Chunyu, estranged from her father, is pulled into a mysterious game called "19 Floors." Teaming up with clever and strong allies, she must survive terrifying challenges and uncover the game''s secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7w8X8byculytjApRT1rMezyHLYt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:243569'),
  ('28564470277658966', '1st & Ten', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Carl Kleinschmitt', null, 'Reid Shelton, O. J. Simpson, Shannon Tweed, Cliff Frazier, Donald Gibb, Prince Hughes, John Kassir, Keith Amos', 'NR', '1st & Ten is an American situation comedy that aired between December 1984 and January 1991 on the cable television network HBO. Featuring series regulars Delta Burke and veteran Reid Shelton, it was one of cable''s first attempts to lure the lucrative sit-com audience away from the "Big Three", by taking advantage of their freedom to include occasional cursing and nudity.', '1st & Ten is an American situation comedy that aired between December 1984 and January 1991 on the cable television network HBO. Featuring series regulars Delta Burke and veteran Reid Shelton, it was one of cable''s first attempts to lure the lucrative sit-com audience away from the "Big Three", by taking advantage of their freedom to include occasional cursing and nudity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1NQICCAkwDhBtEZhO0ZtD8ZkhkS.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:10021'),
  ('410879943122521965', '2 Broke Girls', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Whitney Cummings, Michael Patrick King', null, 'Kat Dennings, Beth Behrs, Garrett Morris, Jonathan Kite, Matthew Moy, Jennifer Coolidge', 'TV-14', 'Comedy about the unlikely friendship that develops between two very different young women who meet waitressing at a diner in trendy Williamsburg, Brooklyn, and form a bond over one day owning their own successful cupcake business. Only one thing stands in their way – they’re broke.', 'Comedy about the unlikely friendship that develops between two very different young women who meet waitressing at a diner in trendy Williamsburg, Brooklyn, and form a bond over one day owning their own successful cupcake business. Only one thing stands in their way – they’re broke.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wW1SDEoZ6pDfnSkVQuXwOo8ICep.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:39340'),
  ('76761282708798459', '2 Days and 1 Night', 2007, 'Comedy, Reality', 'Na Yeong-seok', null, 'Kim Jong-min, Moon Se-yoon, DinDin, Yoo Seon-ho, Jo Se-ho, Lee Joon', 'NR', '2 Days & 1 Night is a South Korean reality-variety show with the motto "real wild road variety." Its main concept is to recommend various places of interest that viewers can visit in South Korea.', '2 Days & 1 Night is a South Korean reality-variety show with the motto "real wild road variety." Its main concept is to recommend various places of interest that viewers can visit in South Korea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qezeCEkIKHQM5iwyVeYBuXmYA2h.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:30801'),
  ('529625261880840499', '2 Dope Queens', 2018, 'Comedy', null, 'Jessica Williams, Phoebe Robinson', 'Phoebe Robinson, Jessica Williams', 'TV-MA', 'A series of specials featuring Phoebe Robinson and Jessica Williams based on the hit comedy podcast of the same name. The show features the fun, fearless queens dishing on “Cocoa Khaleesis,” dating white baes, sex, New York-living, the best borough for pizza and more.', 'A series of specials featuring Phoebe Robinson and Jessica Williams based on the hit comedy podcast of the same name. The show features the fun, fearless queens dishing on “Cocoa Khaleesis,” dating white baes, sex, New York-living, the best borough for pizza and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8Pd2UHm7WEkXgDbElszSvu0GWd.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:75968'),
  ('279921796762388577', '2 Good 2 Be True', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Denise O''Hara, Jaymar Santos Castro, Raymund Barcelon', 'Kathryn Bernardo, Daniel Padilla, Ronaldo Valdez, Gloria Diaz, Gelli De Belen, Cris Villanueva, Bianca de Vera, Romnick Sarmenta', null, 'Car mechanic Eloy makes a terrible first impression on Ali, who works for a real estate magnate. But both of them are hiding their true personas.', 'Car mechanic Eloy makes a terrible first impression on Ali, who works for a real estate magnate. But both of them are hiding their true personas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Wf5ySCPcnp8lRhbSD7jt0YLz5A.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135647'),
  ('224438754887956180', '2 Minuten 2 Millionen - Die PULS 4 Start Up Show', 2013, null, null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 14, 'tmdb:tv:99033'),
  ('649456817840422673', '2 Moons 2', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Chiffon_cake', null, 'Teerapat Ruangritkul, Benjamin Brasier, Archen Aydin, Kornchid Boonsathitpakdee, Naret Promphaopun, Woranart Ratthanaphast, Samantha Melanie Coates, Ruethaiphat Phatthananapaphangkorn', null, 'On campus, three pairs of students face friendship, rivalry, and romance as they learn what it truly means to fall in love.', 'On campus, three pairs of students face friendship, rivalry, and romance as they learn what it truly means to fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xSWU6VPVYfwSRRNi4AGh5uoMPdZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:122894'),
  ('935197437401722317', '2 Stupid Dogs', 1993, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family', 'Donovan Cook', null, 'Brad Garrett, Mark Schiff, Brian Cummings', 'TV-Y7', '“Two Stupid Dogs” follows the lives of two dogs: the overly excited Little Dog (the dachshund) and easy-paced Big Dog (the sheepdog). These crazy canines don''t know how to fit in the world, and they definitely don''t have any know-how. They often find themselves in commonplace situations (going to the drive-in, walking through the mall, working on the farm), some not so common situations (stuck on a space shuttle, a contestant on a game show, getting mistaken for the prime minister) and even in some familiar situations (little red riding hood, Noah''s ark, and Hanzel and Gretel). But no matter the situation, their stupidity usually leads them to calamitous results.', '“Two Stupid Dogs” follows the lives of two dogs: the overly excited Little Dog (the dachshund) and easy-paced Big Dog (the sheepdog). These crazy canines don''t know how to fit in the world, and they definitely don''t have any know-how. They often find themselves in commonplace situations (going to the drive-in, walking through the mall, working on the farm), some not so common situations (stuck on a space shuttle, a contestant on a game show, getting mistaken for the prime minister) and even in some familiar situations (little red riding hood, Noah''s ark, and Hanzel and Gretel). But no matter the situation, their stupidity usually leads them to calamitous results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Lyc5VqhTqq76vmKUn1an8rlnP7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1916'),
  ('455560508539930256', '2.43: Seiin High School Boys Volleyball Team', 2021, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Yuuichirou Umehara, Kensho Ono, Shouta Aoi, Junya Enoki, Kent Ito, Subaru Kimura, Kaito Takeda, Yu Wakabayashi', 'TV-14', 'Kimichika Haijima moves back to his hometown in Fukui and reunites with childhood friend Yuni Kuroba on the volleyball court.', 'Kimichika Haijima moves back to his hometown in Fukui and reunites with childhood friend Yuni Kuroba on the volleyball court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/utYAqKUQdUOVVQlM2FJBTWdONf9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105004'),
  ('257536909212297674', '2.5 Dimensional Seduction', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Junya Enoki, Kaori Maeda, Akari Kito, Sayumi Suzushiro, Sayumi Watabe, Mao Ichimichi', 'TV-14', 'When cosplayer Ririsa joins Okumura''s manga club, the line between 2D and 3D blurs when she asks him to be her photographer.', 'When cosplayer Ririsa joins Okumura''s manga club, the line between 2D and 3D blurs when she asks him to be her photographer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/clrEz6ad3cFEae5q08iWsbnhhCW.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:216074'),
  ('1134021158727554805', '20 Minutes', 2013, 'Family, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Kerem Deren, Pınar Bulut', 'Kerem Deren, Pınar Bulut', 'Tuba Büyüküstün, İlker Aksum, Fırat Çelik, İpek Bilgin, Metin Çekmez, Miray Akay, Müjde Uzman, Murat Prosçiler', null, 'An innocent pastrycook Melek gets accused of injuring an important politician''s son. Her loving husband Ali wants to help his wife to escape from prison.', 'An innocent pastrycook Melek gets accused of injuring an important politician''s son. Her loving husband Ali wants to help his wife to escape from prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/putH2FIRYastICb1purKuBaNLyt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:48041'),
  ('268033034150006831', '20,000 Leagues Under the Sea', 1997, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Jules Verne', null, 'Michael Caine, Mia Sara, Bryan Brown, John Bach, Nicholas Hammond, Peter McCauley, Kerry Armstrong, Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje', null, 'New England, 1886: a creature of unknown origin is destroying ships at sea. It is the job of Professor Pierre Aronnax, a marine expert, and Ned Land, the iron willed sailor, to learn the truth about the monster roaming the seas. In their search, they come across the sophisticated submarine Nautilus, secretly cruising under the ocean, and its charismatic captain Nemo.', 'New England, 1886: a creature of unknown origin is destroying ships at sea. It is the job of Professor Pierre Aronnax, a marine expert, and Ned Land, the iron willed sailor, to learn the truth about the monster roaming the seas. In their search, they come across the sophisticated submarine Nautilus, secretly cruising under the ocean, and its charismatic captain Nemo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3NQE1PsgJVxZeGLpRd6WxHXdHU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76318'),
  ('555791661118432491', '20/20', 1978, 'News, Documentary', 'Roone Arledge', null, 'David Muir, Deborah Roberts', 'TV-14', '20/20 is an American television newsmagazine that has been broadcast on ABC since June 6, 1978. Created by ABC News executive Roone Arledge, the show was designed similarly to CBS''s 60 Minutes but focuses more on human interest stories than international and political subjects. The program''s name derives from the "20/20" measurement of visual acuity. The hour-long program has been a staple on Friday evenings for much of the time since it moved to that timeslot from Thursdays in September 1987, though special editions of the program occasionally air on other nights.', '20/20 is an American television newsmagazine that has been broadcast on ABC since June 6, 1978. Created by ABC News executive Roone Arledge, the show was designed similarly to CBS''s 60 Minutes but focuses more on human interest stories than international and political subjects. The program''s name derives from the "20/20" measurement of visual acuity. The hour-long program has been a staple on Friday evenings for much of the time since it moved to that timeslot from Thursdays in September 1987, though special editions of the program occasionally air on other nights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cmqmilQ6l9zAWImNCvRLtXlvQ3Q.jpg', 28, 'tmdb:tv:2035'),
  ('433467541164907172', '20/22', 2024, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, War & Politics', 'Andrey Simonov', 'Denis Rodimin, Andrey Simonov, Rinat Esenaliev', 'Aristarkh Venes, Daria Kukarskih, Alexandr Yugov, Aleksei Shevchenkov, Vladimir Karpuk, Dmitriy Bogdan, Valentin Smirnitskiy, Sergey Cherdantsev', null, 'A student of the journalism faculty, Danil, goes as a volunteer to the zone of his SMO (Special Military Operation), tired of the hypocrisy of the capital. He is from Sevastopol and knows a little more about the neighboring state than his friends. His anti-war-minded girlfriend Alice, realizing that she is expecting a child, decides to protect her young man from a fatal mistake and goes after him. Finding a loved one in the chaos of war is proving difficult.', 'A student of the journalism faculty, Danil, goes as a volunteer to the zone of his SMO (Special Military Operation), tired of the hypocrisy of the capital. He is from Sevastopol and knows a little more about the neighboring state than his friends. His anti-war-minded girlfriend Alice, realizing that she is expecting a child, decides to protect her young man from a fatal mistake and goes after him. Finding a loved one in the chaos of war is proving difficult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z9vNFSP46w4zrdm6GuG35z0645r.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:247231'),
