  ('414854666416250226', '25-Year-Old High School Girl, I Wouldn’t Do This with a Kid', 2018, 'Animation', null, null, 'Hitomi Harada, Chiharu Sawashiro, Tomohito Takatsuka', 'TV-MA', 'Once most students are done with high school, they leave and never come back. However, at 25 years old, Hana Natori finds herself in the role of a student once more at her aunt''s request. Since Hana''s cousin, Kaho Miyoshi, refuses to go to school, her aunt begs Hana to take Kaho''s place, since the two of them are practically identical. But as luck would have it, she is recognized by Okito Kanie—an old classmate from her days in high school—who is now a teacher! With her cover blown, Hana assumes Kanie will expose her secret. But when he suddenly kisses her, she soon learns he has other ideas.', 'Once most students are done with high school, they leave and never come back. However, at 25 years old, Hana Natori finds herself in the role of a student once more at her aunt''s request. Since Hana''s cousin, Kaho Miyoshi, refuses to go to school, her aunt begs Hana to take Kaho''s place, since the two of them are practically identical. But as luck would have it, she is recognized by Okito Kanie—an old classmate from her days in high school—who is now a teacher! With her cover blown, Hana assumes Kanie will expose her secret. But when he suddenly kisses her, she soon learns he has other ideas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ypjJNB2AZ8bffNULuWKwpYUoxC1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75778'),
  ('535811636118075454', '26 Men', 1957, 'Western, Crime', null, null, 'Tristram Coffin, Kelo Henderson', 'NR', '26 Men is a syndicated American western television series about the Arizona Rangers, an elite group commissioned in 1901 by the legislature of the Arizona Territory and limited, for financial reasons, to twenty-six active members. Russell Hayden was the producer of the series and the co-composer of the theme song. The series aired between October 15, 1957 and June 30, 1959, for a total of 78 episodes.', '26 Men is a syndicated American western television series about the Arizona Rangers, an elite group commissioned in 1901 by the legislature of the Arizona Territory and limited, for financial reasons, to twenty-six active members. Russell Hayden was the producer of the series and the co-composer of the theme song. The series aired between October 15, 1957 and June 30, 1959, for a total of 78 episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQDvw5BhIfqk3l7aWqHqRLbTc9f.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:17555'),
  ('123560996799042277', '28 Days Haunted', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Three teams each spend 28 days in some of America''s most haunted locations for a paranormal experiment based on the theories of Ed and Lorraine Warren.', 'Three teams each spend 28 days in some of America''s most haunted locations for a paranormal experiment based on the theories of Ed and Lorraine Warren.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AqcHMbvN4lkYUXKNalOxOFe025K.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210922'),
