  ('593086044601465776', 'A Boss And A Babe', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Brave2Y', null, 'Jiratchapong Srisang, Kasidet Plookphol, Chinnarat Siriphongchawalit, Pusit Dittapisit, Thipakorn Thitathan, Leo Saussay, Bhobdhama Hansa, Yardpirun Poolun', null, 'A gamer interning at a game company grows close to his strict boss, who secretly loves his ASMR videos, sparking an unexpected romance.', 'A gamer interning at a game company grows close to his strict boss, who secretly loves his ASMR videos, sparking an unexpected romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqnhudS155dnqjXk9Rc6ieSRgbA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217806'),
  ('618361526537105097', 'A Boy Named Flora A', 2017, 'Drama', null, '杨富闵', 'Crowd Lu, Lung Siu Wa, Chin-Jung Kang, Alex Ko, Lotus Wang, Chin Tzu-yen, Tsai Chen-nan, Chiung Hua Yang', null, 'A 28-year-old layabout begins to re-examine his life when his dysfunctional family assembles to pay respects to a dying grandmother who won’t pass on.', 'A 28-year-old layabout begins to re-examine his life when his dysfunctional family assembles to pay respects to a dying grandmother who won’t pass on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJ87odPYdiflsVVQIVnh6CFVnXI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73638'),
  ('816415536352855322', 'A Breeze of Love', 2023, 'Drama', 'Gwendolyn', null, 'Shin Jeong-u, Woo Ji-han, Kim Hyun-jae, Lee Seo-bin', null, 'Do-hyun, the captain of the basketball team, is preparing for the championship. Hye-in, the team manager, brings Dong-wook, Do-hyun''s first love, to fill in for an injured teammate.', 'Do-hyun, the captain of the basketball team, is preparing for the championship. Hye-in, the team manager, brings Dong-wook, Do-hyun''s first love, to fill in for an injured teammate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLciPmW1uKpfvtXKeSLOl9J6l03.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:238566'),
  ('455497456384033970', 'A Bridge to the Starry Skies', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shintaro Asanuma, Eriko Nakamura, Ringo Aoba, Chiaki Takahashi, Aiko Okubo, Mayumi Yoshida, Ai Shimizu, Mai Kadowaki', null, 'Kazuma Hoshino moves to the beautiful countryside to take care of his little brother, Ayumu Hoshino. They ended up they getting lost on their way to the Japanese Inn.', 'Kazuma Hoshino moves to the beautiful countryside to take care of his little brother, Ayumu Hoshino. They ended up they getting lost on their way to the Japanese Inn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dSUsT4JKMLN31XZFJ8ibSb4t0Q3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44300'),
  ('934796489579842020', 'A Brutal Pact: The Murder of Daniella Perez', 2022, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Daniella Perez, Glória Perez, Raul Gazolla, Cláudia Raia, Fábio Assunção, Maurício Mattar, Alexandre Frota, Stênio Garcia', 'TV-MA', 'In 1992, actress and dancer Daniella Perez was murdered by her co-star, Guilherme de Pádua and his wife, Paula Thomaz, in a cruelly premeditated crime. The untimely death of the 22-year-old, daughter of Brazilian author and producer, International Emmy winner Gloria Perez, shocked the country, gained notoriety and occupied the front pages of national newspapers for years.', 'In 1992, actress and dancer Daniella Perez was murdered by her co-star, Guilherme de Pádua and his wife, Paula Thomaz, in a cruelly premeditated crime. The untimely death of the 22-year-old, daughter of Brazilian author and producer, International Emmy winner Gloria Perez, shocked the country, gained notoriety and occupied the front pages of national newspapers for years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ab2M6OnATtNtQU1xvYS8ZaLUxe2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204774'),
  ('450391054472087697', 'A Case For Two', 1981, 'Drama, Crime', 'Karl Heinz Willschrei', null, 'Claus Theo Gärtner, Paul Frielinghaus', null, 'Ein Fall für zwei is a German television series, which premiered on September 11, 1981 on ZDF. The series, located in Frankfurt am Main, features two main characters who solve crimes: a defense attorney and a private investigator. Josef Matula, a former German police officer, has gone into private business. His method of investigation is very effective and direct, and he sometimes even resorts to dirty tricks. Claus Theo Gärtner has portrayed the role since the start of the series.', 'Ein Fall für zwei is a German television series, which premiered on September 11, 1981 on ZDF. The series, located in Frankfurt am Main, features two main characters who solve crimes: a defense attorney and a private investigator. Josef Matula, a former German police officer, has gone into private business. His method of investigation is very effective and direct, and he sometimes even resorts to dirty tricks. Claus Theo Gärtner has portrayed the role since the start of the series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7cztFGBj6xmJLS39UlhRDRWoEAq.jpg', 33, 'tmdb:tv:12433'),
  ('359073798163491365', 'A Case of Misadventure', 2002, null, null, null, 'William So Wing-Hong, Flora Chan Wai-Shan, Kwan Ching, Ram Chiang Chi-Kwong, Irene Wong Lam, Stephen Au Kam-Tong, Samuel Kwok Fung, Derek Kwok Jing-Hung', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s555JE1CXrqz84dBRCeHwtlUnZu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108230'),
  ('746110363937224554', 'A Centaur''s Life', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Haruka Shiraishi, Seria Fukagawa, Yuuki Kuwahara, Yuna Kamakura, Atsumi Tanezaki, Daisuke Motohashi, Emi Miyajima, Honoka Kuroki', 'TV-MA', 'Kimihara Himeno, also known as "Hime," goes about her life, love, and studies just like any ordinary high school girl. The only difference is that she''s a centaur. She enjoys her school life along with classmates of many unique shapes, including Nozomi the draconid, Kyoko the goatfolk, an angelfolk class representative, and Sassas-chan the Antarctican. Hime''s younger cousin Shino-chan, her friend Maki-chan, and the class representative''s four younger sisters also join the cast in this very cute slice-of-life story about girls who are human, yet aren''t!', 'Kimihara Himeno, also known as "Hime," goes about her life, love, and studies just like any ordinary high school girl. The only difference is that she''s a centaur. She enjoys her school life along with classmates of many unique shapes, including Nozomi the draconid, Kyoko the goatfolk, an angelfolk class representative, and Sassas-chan the Antarctican. Hime''s younger cousin Shino-chan, her friend Maki-chan, and the class representative''s four younger sisters also join the cast in this very cute slice-of-life story about girls who are human, yet aren''t!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3WqZmeXgdjTu6ZieU4wFGjmjR8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72506'),
  ('1087844734735463863', 'A Certain Magical Index', 2008, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Mystery', null, null, 'Atsushi Abe, Yuka Iguchi, Rina Sato, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Satoshi Hino', 'TV-14', 'Touma Kamijou is a student living in Academy City, a highly advanced place in terms of technology. Despite being gauged as a level zero esper (no powers), he possesses on his right hand the Imagine Breaker, an ability that negates any power whatsoever. Touma finds a young girl named Index who is trying to run away from Necessarius, a powerful magic organization that she is member of. Blessed with the skill of memorizing any sort of information, she holds 103,000 forbidden magical books within her head. As science and magic cross paths, Touma must face several dangers amid espers and magicians who appear in the exciting scientific town.', 'Touma Kamijou is a student living in Academy City, a highly advanced place in terms of technology. Despite being gauged as a level zero esper (no powers), he possesses on his right hand the Imagine Breaker, an ability that negates any power whatsoever. Touma finds a young girl named Index who is trying to run away from Necessarius, a powerful magic organization that she is member of. Blessed with the skill of memorizing any sort of information, she holds 103,000 forbidden magical books within her head. As science and magic cross paths, Touma must face several dangers amid espers and magicians who appear in the exciting scientific town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3Ka0J3iMte50oiH4cmXPISM3rm.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:30980'),
  ('257306605591278711', 'A Certain Scientific Accelerator', 2019, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Nobuhiko Okamoto, Rina Hidaka, Yurika Kubo, Sayumi Watabe, Yuhko Kaida, Ryota Osaka, Yumi Touma', null, 'After rescuing Last Order and subsequently taking a bullet to the head, Academy City’s top-ranked esper rests in the hospital. But Accelerator’s recovery is cut short when a mysterious girl carrying a photo of his little clone companion asks for help. Now they’re taking on Disciplinary Action—an anti-evil coalition whose sinister plans threaten Last Order, Academy City, and even the entire world!', 'After rescuing Last Order and subsequently taking a bullet to the head, Academy City’s top-ranked esper rests in the hospital. But Accelerator’s recovery is cut short when a mysterious girl carrying a photo of his little clone companion asks for help. Now they’re taking on Disciplinary Action—an anti-evil coalition whose sinister plans threaten Last Order, Academy City, and even the entire world!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10KGPY9ihuI5v9an0VF1eU5cxOs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90546'),
  ('409381917432817188', 'A Certain Scientific Railgun', 2009, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Motoi Fuyukawa, Hiroshi Onogi, Kiyotaka Haimura', 'Rina Sato, Satomi Arai, Aki Toyosaki, Kanae Itou, Minako Kotobuki, Atsuko Tanaka, Atsushi Abe, Kana Ueda', 'TV-14', 'Misaka''s electro-manipulation skills - and her delightfully destructive railgun projectile movement - make her a rock star in Academy City. The techno-metropolis is filled with supernaturally powerful students known as Espers, including Misaka''s flirtatious friend and roommate, Shirai Kuroko. She uses her teleportation skills as a member of the Judgment law enforcement team, fighting crime alongside fellow agent Uiharu. Joined by their friend Saten, a spunky Level 0 Esper, Misaka, Kuroko, and Uiharu have a blast taking on danger whenever and wherever it arises.', 'Misaka''s electro-manipulation skills - and her delightfully destructive railgun projectile movement - make her a rock star in Academy City. The techno-metropolis is filled with supernaturally powerful students known as Espers, including Misaka''s flirtatious friend and roommate, Shirai Kuroko. She uses her teleportation skills as a member of the Judgment law enforcement team, fighting crime alongside fellow agent Uiharu. Joined by their friend Saten, a spunky Level 0 Esper, Misaka, Kuroko, and Uiharu have a blast taking on danger whenever and wherever it arises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZt1dqw0K4JGhwcqTh8yExHYK9w.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:30977'),
  ('218956813508397142', 'A Clear Midsummer Night', 2013, 'Drama, Family', null, null, 'Yang Mi, Hawick Lau Hau-Wai, Louis Fan Siu-Wong, Jerry Wu, Liang Yolin, Wang Xiao, Michael Tong Chun-Chung, Maggie Huang', null, 'The daughter of a real estate mogul Xia Wan Qing, has seemingly no way of retreating after a friend''s betrayal and her boyfriend backing out of their wedding. Fortunately, she''s saved by business genius Qiao Jin Fan. Jin Fan is a "playboy" and the future successor for Qiao corporation. He extends an offering hand and together they embark on a path of revenge. Each for reasons of their own, begin a love with "uncertain motives." After enduring circumstances because of their families'' competing interests and a number of conspiracies the two find true love.', 'The daughter of a real estate mogul Xia Wan Qing, has seemingly no way of retreating after a friend''s betrayal and her boyfriend backing out of their wedding. Fortunately, she''s saved by business genius Qiao Jin Fan. Jin Fan is a "playboy" and the future successor for Qiao corporation. He extends an offering hand and together they embark on a path of revenge. Each for reasons of their own, begin a love with "uncertain motives." After enduring circumstances because of their families'' competing interests and a number of conspiracies the two find true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxz8YqOLljMWvuhKa3vricC8XLW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:126684'),
  ('168880962134436825', 'A Condition Called Love', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Kana Hanazawa, Chiaki Kobayashi', 'TV-14', 'High school freshman Hotaru Hinase has a vibrant life full of family and friendship, but not much luck in romance. That all changes when she makes a warm gesture to her handsome and heartbroken classmate, Hananoi, leading to him asking her out and her becoming flustered. Witness a girl who grapples with the enigma of love and a boy who is heavy handed with it.', 'High school freshman Hotaru Hinase has a vibrant life full of family and friendship, but not much luck in romance. That all changes when she makes a warm gesture to her handsome and heartbroken classmate, Hananoi, leading to him asking her out and her becoming flustered. Witness a girl who grapples with the enigma of love and a boy who is heavy handed with it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aaYPPivWuebwIKQvFYuWkp9m0q5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:239214'),
  ('51605587668834484', 'A Confession', 2019, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jeff Pope', 'Jeff Pope', 'Martin Freeman, Siobhan Finneran, Imelda Staunton, Peter Wight, Derek Riddell, Owain Arthur, Jake Davies, Jessica D''Arcy', 'TV-14', 'The story of how Detective Superintendent Steve Fulcher deliberately breached police procedure and protocol to catch a killer, a decision that ultimately cost him his career and reputation.', 'The story of how Detective Superintendent Steve Fulcher deliberately breached police procedure and protocol to catch a killer, a decision that ultimately cost him his career and reputation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6c6q8m5PCiXv3TlxmM0vIcLylb0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93168'),
  ('717565953366503133', 'A Corazón Abierto', 2010, 'Drama', 'Shonda Rhimes, Fernando Gaitán', null, 'Verónica Orozco, Rafael Novoa, Jorge Enrique Abello, Carolina Gómez, Jorge Cao, Rolando Tarajano, Juan Pablo Espinosa, Santiago Moure', 'NR', 'María Alejandra Rivas Cavalier, a young aspiring surgeon with a prestigious family name, joins the highly regarded internship program at Santa María University Hospital. There, alongside a group of new friends and her relationship with renowned surgeon Andrés Guerra, she faces medical and personal challenges that shape her journey. Amid intriguing medical cases and the quest for her own path, the hospital becomes her new home and the stage where friendship, love, and sacrifice intertwine.', 'María Alejandra Rivas Cavalier, a young aspiring surgeon with a prestigious family name, joins the highly regarded internship program at Santa María University Hospital. There, alongside a group of new friends and her relationship with renowned surgeon Andrés Guerra, she faces medical and personal challenges that shape her journey. Amid intriguing medical cases and the quest for her own path, the hospital becomes her new home and the stage where friendship, love, and sacrifice intertwine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipH8hykZHXhGWPeD75etXLttq4E.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:32702'),
  ('1054384554892823773', 'A Country Practice', 1981, 'Soap, Drama', 'James Davern', null, null, null, 'A Country Practice was an Australian television drama series. At its inception, one of the longest-running of its kind, produced by James Davern of JNP Productions, who had wrote the pilot episode and entered a script contest for the network in 1979, coming third and winning a merit award. It ran on the Seven Network for 1,058 episodes from 18 November 1981 to 22 November 1993. It was produced in ATN-7''s production facility at Epping, Sydney. After its lengthy run on the seven network it was picked up by network ten with a mainly new cast from April to November 1994 for 30 episodes, although the ten series was not as successful as its predecessor . The Channel Seven series was also filmed on location in Pitt Town, while, the Channel Ten series was filmed on location in Emerald, Victoria.', 'A Country Practice was an Australian television drama series. At its inception, one of the longest-running of its kind, produced by James Davern of JNP Productions, who had wrote the pilot episode and entered a script contest for the network in 1979, coming third and winning a merit award. It ran on the Seven Network for 1,058 episodes from 18 November 1981 to 22 November 1993. It was produced in ATN-7''s production facility at Epping, Sydney. After its lengthy run on the seven network it was picked up by network ten with a mainly new cast from April to November 1994 for 30 episodes, although the ten series was not as successful as its predecessor . The Channel Seven series was also filmed on location in Pitt Town, while, the Channel Ten series was filmed on location in Emerald, Victoria.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxtsmmB1NsglgitpfmUMCQ2Cjnt.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:4328'),
  ('666285214823215698', 'A Couple of Cuckoos', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Kaito Ishikawa, Akari Kito, Nao Toyama, Konomi Kohara, Hina Youmiya, Ryohei Kimura, Yoko Hikasa, Toshiyuki Morikawa', 'TV-14', '16-year-old super-studier Nagi Umino, second-year student at the Megurogawa Academy high school, was switched at birth. On his way to a dinner to meet his birth parents, he accidentally meets the brash, outspoken, Erika Amano, who is determined to make Nagi her fake boyfriend as she never wants to actually marry. But once Nagi makes it to dinner, he finds his parents have decided to resolve the hospital switch by conveniently having him marry the daughter his birth parents raised...who turns out to be none other than Erika herself!', '16-year-old super-studier Nagi Umino, second-year student at the Megurogawa Academy high school, was switched at birth. On his way to a dinner to meet his birth parents, he accidentally meets the brash, outspoken, Erika Amano, who is determined to make Nagi her fake boyfriend as she never wants to actually marry. But once Nagi makes it to dinner, he finds his parents have decided to resolve the hospital switch by conveniently having him marry the daughter his birth parents raised...who turns out to be none other than Erika herself!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5QErGBshq37p0UKGUHhcYwLufSq.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:122587'),
  ('875251354670116493', 'A Crime to Remember', 2013, 'Documentary, Drama, Crime, Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Showcasing the most compelling crimes of yesteryear, when secrets festered, passions ran wild and cops had nothing but shoe-leather and gut instinct to catch a killer. Fashions may change but murder never goes out of style.', 'Showcasing the most compelling crimes of yesteryear, when secrets festered, passions ran wild and cops had nothing but shoe-leather and gut instinct to catch a killer. Fashions may change but murder never goes out of style.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNgUG7iARtOr6jOdgREC6mp0uMD.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:68549'),
  ('672151015074388931', 'A Cruel Love: The Ruth Ellis Story', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Kelly Jones', null, 'Lucy Boynton, Toby Jones, Laurie Davidson, Mark Stanley, Arthur Darvill, Bessie Carter, Joe Armstrong, Nigel Havers', 'TV-MA', 'A 1950s true crime drama about Ruth Ellis, the last woman in Britain to be hanged. This startling story reveals hidden truths about Ruth''s murder of her lover, the legal case surrounding it and those who were also complicit.', 'A 1950s true crime drama about Ruth Ellis, the last woman in Britain to be hanged. This startling story reveals hidden truths about Ruth''s murder of her lover, the legal case surrounding it and those who were also complicit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2qEUE5dj3brA99H0kkLkH6RfnM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:246770'),
  ('135869819903200960', 'A Dark Rabbit Has Seven Lives', 2011, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Megumi Takamoto, Shinnosuke Tachibana, Yuichi Nakamura, Chiharu Kitaoka, Chika Horikawa, Iori Nomizu, Jun Fukuyama, Kenichi Suzumura', null, 'Taito has been really sleepy lately, and keeps dreaming of a female vampire who says she has given him her "poison." Sometimes he even thinks he hears her voice when he''s awake. But after surviving an accident that should have killed him, Taito''s world changes drastically and he realizes that his dreams are more real than he thought.', 'Taito has been really sleepy lately, and keeps dreaming of a female vampire who says she has given him her "poison." Sometimes he even thinks he hears her voice when he''s awake. But after surviving an accident that should have killed him, Taito''s world changes drastically and he realizes that his dreams are more real than he thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wDFvddtioQmp2mbydtyw9da6qRn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45203'),
  ('603928067884117458', 'A Date With the Future', 2023, 'Drama', null, 'Li Jie', 'William Chan, Zhang Ruonan, Ren Hao, Ci Sha, Luo Qiuyun, Ganana, Zhou Shuai, Yuan Mingze', null, 'A decade after being rescued from a devastating earthquake, Xu Lai returns to China as a reporter and dog trainer. Reuniting with firefighter Jin Shichuan—who doesn’t recognize her—they clash at first but are soon forced to work together to form a search and rescue dog team. As they face life-threatening missions side by side, their past connection resurfaces and a deeper bond begins to grow.', 'A decade after being rescued from a devastating earthquake, Xu Lai returns to China as a reporter and dog trainer. Reuniting with firefighter Jin Shichuan—who doesn’t recognize her—they clash at first but are soon forced to work together to form a search and rescue dog team. As they face life-threatening missions side by side, their past connection resurfaces and a deeper bond begins to grow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uYMaig5XjfeeTkmwOzqrFAdnngk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:196550'),
  ('73660101173928007', 'A Decent Man', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', null, null, 'Krzysztof Czeczot, Agnieszka Żulewska, Konrad Kąkol, Magdalena Czerwińska, Antoni Tyszkiewicz, Dobromir Dymecki', 'TV-MA', 'Paweł is a decent man - a devoted husband, father, and skilled heart surgeon. One hasty decision alters the course of his perfect life forever.', 'Paweł is a decent man - a devoted husband, father, and skilled heart surgeon. One hasty decision alters the course of his perfect life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kTwDoqExFn8SFz04LGqWOzlQeQt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:270443'),
  ('467117310218183737', 'A Destructive God Sits Next to Me', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Arata Aki', null, 'Jun Fukuyama, Takahiro Sakurai, Ai Kayano, Yoshiko Ikuta, Chinatsu Akasaki, Ryohei Kimura, Tsubasa Yonaga, Shinnosuke Tachibana', 'TV-14', 'Koyuki Seri is just trying to have a normal school life, but instead he ends up acting as the straight man to his odd classmate, Hanatori Kabuto. Kabuto is is a delusional high school student, whose fantasies range from believing he is a knight on a journey, to claiming that removing his eyepatch will release a darker alter-ego who he refers to as Michael Offenbarung Dunkelheit. Seri is determined not to let himself get pushed around by Kabuto, but it seems that this will be easier said than done!', 'Koyuki Seri is just trying to have a normal school life, but instead he ends up acting as the straight man to his odd classmate, Hanatori Kabuto. Kabuto is is a delusional high school student, whose fantasies range from believing he is a knight on a journey, to claiming that removing his eyepatch will release a darker alter-ego who he refers to as Michael Offenbarung Dunkelheit. Seri is determined not to let himself get pushed around by Kabuto, but it seems that this will be easier said than done!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A0ChBtZltGBkUWgzoCJzknwGFcw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93822'),
  ('1143030657780369834', 'A Diarista', 2004, 'Comedy, Family', 'Glória Perez', 'Bruno Mazzeo, Aloísio de Abreu', 'Cláudia Rodrigues, Dira Paes, Helena Fernandes, Cláudia Mello, Serjão Loroza', 'NR', 'It shows the life and problems of Marinete, a cleaning lady with a short temper. She always ends up depending on her friends, who are distracted by any stupid thing and leave her to solve things on her own.', 'It shows the life and problems of Marinete, a cleaning lady with a short temper. She always ends up depending on her friends, who are distracted by any stupid thing and leave her to solve things on her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7uzLfBI8CVy1W0VxVqC24VaSY0.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:17322'),
  ('1088098200816797555', 'A Different View', 2018, 'Drama', 'Jaime Vaca, Josep Cister Rubio', null, 'Patricia López Arnaiz, Macarena García, Carla Campra, Gloria Muñoz, Ana Wagener, Álvaro Mel, Carlos Olalla, Begoña Vargas', null, 'Things change massively at a girls'' school in 1920s Sevilla when a new teacher arrives with a secret goal related to the academy itself.', 'Things change massively at a girls'' school in 1920s Sevilla when a new teacher arrives with a secret goal related to the academy itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o8AEbrz3hwpu2azzujdcAvDf5Yo.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:79082'),
  ('158710742973259895', 'A Different World', 1987, 'Comedy, Family', 'Bill Cosby', null, 'Jasmine Guy, Kadeem Hardison, Darryl M. Bell, Cree Summer, Charnele Brown, Lou Myers, Glynn Turman, Ajai Sanders', 'TV-PG', 'A Different World is a spin-off series from The Cosby Show and originally centered on Denise Huxtable and the life of students at Hillman College, a fictional mixed but historically black college in the state of Virginia. After Bonet''s departure in the first season, the remainder of the series primarily focused more on Southern belle Whitley Gilbert and mathematics whiz Dwayne Wayne. The series frequently depicted members of the major historically black fraternities and sororities.', 'A Different World is a spin-off series from The Cosby Show and originally centered on Denise Huxtable and the life of students at Hillman College, a fictional mixed but historically black college in the state of Virginia. After Bonet''s departure in the first season, the remainder of the series primarily focused more on Southern belle Whitley Gilbert and mathematics whiz Dwayne Wayne. The series frequently depicted members of the major historically black fraternities and sororities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7fuifcJjcqQxAsOjPviupcmFIZ.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:115'),
  ('399134747995115421', 'A Discovery of Witches', 2018, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Kate Brooke', null, 'Teresa Palmer, Matthew Goode, Edward Bluemel, Malin Buska, Alex Kingston, Jacob Ifan, Aiysha Hart, Gregg Chillin', 'TV-MA', 'Closet witch Diana Bishop and centuries-old vampire Matthew Clairmont are drawn into a deadly mystery and forbidden romance when a magical book shows up in an Oxford library.', 'Closet witch Diana Bishop and centuries-old vampire Matthew Clairmont are drawn into a deadly mystery and forbidden romance when a magical book shows up in an Oxford library.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l7MUpFAE8UEWYnO2Uv7SFtdZ2OJ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:77236'),
  ('836171616684110396', 'A doctor in the family', 1998, 'Comedy, Family', 'Carlo Bixio', null, 'Lino Banfi, Milena Vukotić, Michael Cadeddu, Eleonora Cadeddu, Paolo Sassanelli, Francesca Cavallin, Margot Sikabonyi, Giorgio Marchesi', null, 'The adventures of the unpredictable Martini family led by the tireless Grandpa Libero.', 'The adventures of the unpredictable Martini family led by the tireless Grandpa Libero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4nRaX8FWX2ZtFYKhNRFvss3g24.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:31390'),
  ('872861374743925130', 'A Dog of Flanders', 1975, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Michie Kita, Reiko Katsura, Kuriko Komamura, Sumiko Shirakawa, Masako Sugaya, Taeko Nakanishi, Yasuo Muramatsu, Hiroo Oikawa', null, 'Nello Tarth is a poor but happy orphan who lives with his grandfather Jehan in a little village nearby Antwerp. Nello has a talent for drawing pictures and has been fascinated by it since he saw one of Rubens (a famous artist) pictures as a little boy. Helping Jehan with the daily milk delivery to Antwerp, Nello one day discovers Patrash, a working dog who has been mistreated and abandoned by his former owner. He treats the exhausted animal and after a little while a close and dependable friendship develops. Alois Cojez, the daughter of the richest and hence most influential man in Blacken Village, is Nellos best friend. When Nello decides to become an artist he has to experience firsthand the ignorance and cruelty of the villagers. Especially Alois father thinks of him as a slacker who cannot earn his living by drawing pictures. Nontheless Nello perseveres and never gives up to achieve his dream and to win their appreciation and respect while strenuously struggling with his poverty.', 'Nello Tarth is a poor but happy orphan who lives with his grandfather Jehan in a little village nearby Antwerp. Nello has a talent for drawing pictures and has been fascinated by it since he saw one of Rubens (a famous artist) pictures as a little boy. Helping Jehan with the daily milk delivery to Antwerp, Nello one day discovers Patrash, a working dog who has been mistreated and abandoned by his former owner. He treats the exhausted animal and after a little while a close and dependable friendship develops. Alois Cojez, the daughter of the richest and hence most influential man in Blacken Village, is Nellos best friend. When Nello decides to become an artist he has to experience firsthand the ignorance and cruelty of the villagers. Especially Alois father thinks of him as a slacker who cannot earn his living by drawing pictures. Nontheless Nello perseveres and never gives up to achieve his dream and to win their appreciation and respect while strenuously struggling with his poverty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Nfu4THgMIo08FlR7BEeiLMqytm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45657'),
  ('238677045890972223', 'A Dream of Splendor', 2022, 'Drama', 'Guan Hanqing', 'Zhang Wei', 'Liu Yifei, Chen Xiao, Liu Yan, Lin Yun, Joe Xu, Dai Xu, Zhang Xiaoqian, Guan Yunpeng', null, 'Zhao Pan''er is a smart and savvy teahouse owner in Qiantang, living alongside her two best friends Sun Sanniang and Song Yinzhang. When she finds out her fiancé left her for another woman of a high ranking officer after becoming an official in the capital of Bianjing, she refuses to give into her fate and decides to travel to the capital in search for the truth. On her way there, she crosses paths with both of her best friends whose lives she saves, and they follow her onward. Gu Qianfan is a commander in an elite capital squadron nicknamed "Living Devil". He is setup by the very people he swears allegiance to and must find out the truth behind a nefarious scheme involving the imperial court. When he first meets Zhao Pan''er, they don''t see eye to eye, however this intelligent businesswoman has caught his attention and as they help each other, they get closer to their own goals.', 'Zhao Pan''er is a smart and savvy teahouse owner in Qiantang, living alongside her two best friends Sun Sanniang and Song Yinzhang. When she finds out her fiancé left her for another woman of a high ranking officer after becoming an official in the capital of Bianjing, she refuses to give into her fate and decides to travel to the capital in search for the truth. On her way there, she crosses paths with both of her best friends whose lives she saves, and they follow her onward. Gu Qianfan is a commander in an elite capital squadron nicknamed "Living Devil". He is setup by the very people he swears allegiance to and must find out the truth behind a nefarious scheme involving the imperial court. When he first meets Zhao Pan''er, they don''t see eye to eye, however this intelligent businesswoman has caught his attention and as they help each other, they get closer to their own goals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/liT1qsjEoVjZRZbigDH72xIhA4C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:202876'),
  ('1076154101919367076', 'A Dream Within a Dream', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Li Yitong, Liu Yuning, Zhu Xudan, Riley Wang, Wang Youshuo, Wang Chengsi, Su Mengyun, Wang Lina', null, 'When Song Xiaoyu is unexpectedly pulled into a scripted world as a tragic heroine fated to be discarded by the villainous male lead, she tries to escape, only to be trapped in an endless loop of fatal outcomes each time she strays from the plot. No matter how hard she resists, the story keeps pushing her toward Nan Heng, the cold and calculating lead. As she navigates this paper-thin world where every character is bound by fate, Song Xiaoyu must fight not just for her survival, but for control over her own story.', 'When Song Xiaoyu is unexpectedly pulled into a scripted world as a tragic heroine fated to be discarded by the villainous male lead, she tries to escape, only to be trapped in an endless loop of fatal outcomes each time she strays from the plot. No matter how hard she resists, the story keeps pushing her toward Nan Heng, the cold and calculating lead. As she navigates this paper-thin world where every character is bound by fate, Song Xiaoyu must fight not just for her survival, but for control over her own story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGPTJ9RS5hnVhH3hs53x8qieBRV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:253193'),
  ('655467189779433821', 'A Familiar Stranger', 2021, 'Drama', 'Delinda Jacobs', 'Delinda Jacobs', 'Marvin Ouaret, Thibault de Montalembert, Clotilde Courau, Salomé Dewaels, Laëtitia Eïdo, Lionel Erdogan, Marie Denarnaud, Olivier Rabourdin', null, 'Nine years after little Marina went missing along a highway near Dunkerque, a young woman with amnesia who looks just like her reappears in practically the same spot.', 'Nine years after little Marina went missing along a highway near Dunkerque, a young woman with amnesia who looks just like her reappears in practically the same spot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKUbFBzHJs3iElgcQU3GcZCD8zz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132550'),
  ('790128618904746686', 'A Fan Celebration of Moana', 2024, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-G', 'Fans around the world celebrate Moana. This series features select fan videos.', 'Fans around the world celebrate Moana. This series features select fan videos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9dyrriH74dFavsMbQIzZQ13uAwV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:281652'),
  ('873171982732025158', 'A Favorita', 2008, 'Soap, Drama, Mystery', 'João Emanuel Carneiro', 'João Emanuel Carneiro, Márcia Prates, Denise Bandeira', 'Patricia Pillar, Cláudia Raia, Murilo Benício, Mariana Ximenes, Cauã Reymond, Carmo Dalla Vecchia, Ary Fontoura, Glória Menezes', null, 'Donatela and Flora, two friends who became rivals. One of them committed a homicide and pretends to be innocent. There are two versions for the same story. Who, after all, is telling the truth? Donatela or Flora?', 'Donatela and Flora, two friends who became rivals. One of them committed a homicide and pretends to be innocent. There are two versions for the same story. Who, after all, is telling the truth? Donatela or Flora?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sp6VyduIK2FnRQOALEAHF9D0jAb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:7448'),
  ('7268759994350726', 'A Fazenda', 2009, 'Reality', null, null, 'Adriane Galisteu, Dudu Camargo, Rayane Figliuzzi, Gabriela Spanic, Yoná Sousa, Shia Phoenix, Nizam Hayek, Guilherme Boury', null, 'A Fazenda is the current Brazilian version of the The Farm reality television show based on the Swedish television series of the same name that was originally created in 2001 by Strix and produced in association with Sony Entertainment and Endemol. The show is based on a group of celebrities living together twenty-four hours a day in a Farm, isolated from the outside world while having all their steps followed by cameras around-the-clock, with no privacy for three months. The contestants compete for the chance to win the grand prize by avoiding weekly eviction, until the last celebrity remains at the end of the season that can claim the grand prize. The show is presented by news reporter Britto Junior alongside actress Chris Couto and directed by Rodrigo Carelli. Record''s website and a Record-owned pay-per-view channel offer round-the-clock coverage.', 'A Fazenda is the current Brazilian version of the The Farm reality television show based on the Swedish television series of the same name that was originally created in 2001 by Strix and produced in association with Sony Entertainment and Endemol. The show is based on a group of celebrities living together twenty-four hours a day in a Farm, isolated from the outside world while having all their steps followed by cameras around-the-clock, with no privacy for three months. The contestants compete for the chance to win the grand prize by avoiding weekly eviction, until the last celebrity remains at the end of the season that can claim the grand prize. The show is presented by news reporter Britto Junior alongside actress Chris Couto and directed by Rodrigo Carelli. Record''s website and a Record-owned pay-per-view channel offer round-the-clock coverage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cJc8hNQP4lWouAzD0duQ4inktin.jpg', 17, 'tmdb:tv:31342'),
  ('1123083131924376150', 'A Female Student Arrives at the Imperial College', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery, Comedy', null, null, 'Zhao Lusi, Xu Kaicheng, Ren Hao, An Yongchang, Ao Ruipeng, Zhang Yue, Meng En, Li Xingyao', null, 'Story of the only daughter of the Grand Marshal, Sang Qi, who becomes the only female student at the Imperial College due to a gamble. She was tasked to make Yan Yunzhi, the number one young master of Yan Kingdom, accept her embroidered pouch and her invitation to the Lantern Festival. If she does not succeed, she must replace the famed musician to perform in the festival. Initially, Sang Qi thought this would be an easy task. However she was chased away each and every time she went to Yan Manor. When she knew that Yan Yunzhi is studying at the Imperial College, she decides to enter the college in order to complete her mission. After numerous begging and persuasion attempts by her father, the Emperor finally accepts Sang Qi''s requests to enroll into the Imperial College. Thus with her good childhood friend Zhuo Wenyuan and other brocade-uniformed young masters, she embarks on campus life and becomes the only female student to be enrolled in the Imperial College in history.', 'Story of the only daughter of the Grand Marshal, Sang Qi, who becomes the only female student at the Imperial College due to a gamble. She was tasked to make Yan Yunzhi, the number one young master of Yan Kingdom, accept her embroidered pouch and her invitation to the Lantern Festival. If she does not succeed, she must replace the famed musician to perform in the festival. Initially, Sang Qi thought this would be an easy task. However she was chased away each and every time she went to Yan Manor. When she knew that Yan Yunzhi is studying at the Imperial College, she decides to enter the college in order to complete her mission. After numerous begging and persuasion attempts by her father, the Emperor finally accepts Sang Qi''s requests to enroll into the Imperial College. Thus with her good childhood friend Zhuo Wenyuan and other brocade-uniformed young masters, she embarks on campus life and becomes the only female student to be enrolled in the Imperial College in history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ur4WjqL2n8BNbFEpdlazsqQJ1vk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:126892'),
  ('1029247005116993926', 'A Football Life', 2011, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'A Football Life is a documentary series developed by NFL Films and aired on NFL Network that documents the lives of select National Football League players, coaches, owners, and teams. Friends, teammates, family members and other players and coaches associated with the subjects are interviewed. The name of the series originated in a quote from Steve Sabol of NFL Films: Originating as an NFL Network special on the career of Bill Parcells in November 2010, it premiered as an episodic series on September 15, 2011, with the first part of Bill Belichick''s documentary. The documentary was viewed by about 657,000 viewers, the most-watched documentary in NFL Network''s history, and was the second-most watched program in Boston at the time with 151,000 viewers, trailing behind a Boston Red Sox game. Season One was eventually released on DVD. Season Two began on September 12, 2012, with The Faces of Tebow. The series was nominated for an Emmy Award for "Outstanding Edited Sports Series/Anthology" and "Outstanding Promotional Announcement – Episodic" for Belichick''s episode in 2012.', 'A Football Life is a documentary series developed by NFL Films and aired on NFL Network that documents the lives of select National Football League players, coaches, owners, and teams. Friends, teammates, family members and other players and coaches associated with the subjects are interviewed. The name of the series originated in a quote from Steve Sabol of NFL Films: Originating as an NFL Network special on the career of Bill Parcells in November 2010, it premiered as an episodic series on September 15, 2011, with the first part of Bill Belichick''s documentary. The documentary was viewed by about 657,000 viewers, the most-watched documentary in NFL Network''s history, and was the second-most watched program in Boston at the time with 151,000 viewers, trailing behind a Boston Red Sox game. Season One was eventually released on DVD. Season Two began on September 12, 2012, with The Faces of Tebow. The series was nominated for an Emmy Award for "Outstanding Edited Sports Series/Anthology" and "Outstanding Promotional Announcement – Episodic" for Belichick''s episode in 2012.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXBaIjHnmZhVeHaS80rXVFm35ve.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:45559'),
  ('367770097402118276', 'A French Case', 2021, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jérémie Guez, Alexandre Smia', 'Trân-Minh Nam, Alexandre Smia, Jérémie Guez', 'Marie Hattermann, Blandine Bellavoir, Guillaume Gouix, Guillaume de Tonquédec, Laurent Stocker, Gérard Jugnot, Michaël Youn, Laurence Arné', null, 'When four-year-old Gregory is murdered, his devastated parents, the police and the judiciary are tested to their limits.', 'When four-year-old Gregory is murdered, his devastated parents, the police and the judiciary are tested to their limits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1q4foQrPLUgqJDAjxEXe80z5GDW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132548'),
  ('5556054311977594', 'A French Village', 2009, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Frédéric Krivine, Philippe Triboit, Emmanuel Daucé', null, 'Robin Renucci, Audrey Fleurot, Nicolas Gob, Thierry Godard, Nade Dieu, Emmanuelle Bach, Marie Kremer', null, 'The stories of the people of Villeneuve, a fictional subprefecture, in the Jura, in German–occupied France during the Second World War.', 'The stories of the people of Villeneuve, a fictional subprefecture, in the Jura, in German–occupied France during the Second World War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/269o4Ti0R7u54lJOhTWIXjh76T3.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:35046'),
  ('323222125770583879', 'A Friend of the Family', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Nick Antosca', 'Alana B. Lytle', 'Jake Lacy, Colin Hanks, Anna Paquin, Lio Tipton, Mckenna Grace, Hendrix Yancey', 'TV-MA', 'The Brobergs are completely unprepared for the sophisticated tactics a neighbor of theirs uses to exploit their vulnerabilities, separate them and turn their daughter against them.', 'The Brobergs are completely unprepared for the sophisticated tactics a neighbor of theirs uses to exploit their vulnerabilities, separate them and turn their daughter against them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bmJkzDE6s0QYBGtpA4i2JLBco0j.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197434'),
  ('572293875398935489', 'A Friend, a Murderer', 2026, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'A Danish town feared a serial criminal for eight years. When caught, Amanda, Nichlas and Kiri discovered the perpetrator was their close friend who''d committed assaults, kidnappings and murder while spending time with them.', 'A Danish town feared a serial criminal for eight years. When caught, Amanda, Nichlas and Kiri discovered the perpetrator was their close friend who''d committed assaults, kidnappings and murder while spending time with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e1iNUL5IY6RDQwzMdkXPKW9e1g1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:315755'),
  ('1127936654769924664', 'A Galaxy Next Door', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Taku Yashiro, Yuu Wakui, Rina Endou, Maria Naganawa', 'TV-14', 'After his father’s death, Ichiro is left to care for his siblings alone. They’re barely scraping by with only a small inheritance and his job as a manga artist, which isn’t going so great. That is until a talented and beautiful assistant is hired! Her name is Shiori, and she’s a gift from above—literally. While working late one night, her true identity is revealed and they’re instantly engaged!?', 'After his father’s death, Ichiro is left to care for his siblings alone. They’re barely scraping by with only a small inheritance and his job as a manga artist, which isn’t going so great. That is until a talented and beautiful assistant is hired! Her name is Shiori, and she’s a gift from above—literally. While working late one night, her true identity is revealed and they’re instantly engaged!?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/otbEkcLvoI1XfJTBnkc8HPIvXcr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:200732'),
  ('164674992835099661', 'A Gatherer''s Adventure in Isekai', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Nobunaga Shimazaki, Makoto Koichi, Ayasa Ito', 'TV-14', 'Kamishiro Takeru is a completely ordinary salaryman who reincarnates in another world—a world of swords and magic called Madeus—and starts his new isekai life with lots of new skills! Takeru must make the most of his enhanced physical strength, unbelievable magic power, and the "Search" ability that allows him to find items of worth as his great isekai journey begins!', 'Kamishiro Takeru is a completely ordinary salaryman who reincarnates in another world—a world of swords and magic called Madeus—and starts his new isekai life with lots of new skills! Takeru must make the most of his enhanced physical strength, unbelievable magic power, and the "Search" ability that allows him to find items of worth as his great isekai journey begins!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AtpIf9wnT6IaHoG31XsdqZEEf80.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:284442'),
  ('885048797049692950', 'A Gentle Noble''s Vacation Recommendation', 2026, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Soma Saito, Yuuichirou Umehara', 'TV-14', 'Lizel, a brilliant young chancellor of a powerful nation in a fantasy realm, suddenly finds himself transported to another world—mid-conversation, no less. Unfazed, he decides to treat it like a vacation and become an adventurer! Teaming up with Gil, a lone wolf top-ranker, Lizel uses his wit, charm, and intellect to navigate this new world. So begin the whimsical adventures of a noble off duty!', 'Lizel, a brilliant young chancellor of a powerful nation in a fantasy realm, suddenly finds himself transported to another world—mid-conversation, no less. Unfazed, he decides to treat it like a vacation and become an adventurer! Teaming up with Gil, a lone wolf top-ranker, Lizel uses his wit, charm, and intellect to navigate this new world. So begin the whimsical adventures of a noble off duty!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUTmnF7QXmiRDTxfGNkL8zjIRhl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:274141'),
  ('637759099499414756', 'A Gentleman in Moscow', 2024, 'Drama', 'Ben Vanstone', null, 'Ewan McGregor, Mary Elizabeth Winstead, Johnny Harris, Fehinti Balogun, Alexa Goodall, Marcus Hodson', 'TV-MA', 'Count Alexander Rostov finds himself going from riches to rags following the Russian revolution. A Soviet tribunal banishes him to the attic room of an opulent hotel, where, oblivious to the world outside, he discovers the true value of friendship, family and love.', 'Count Alexander Rostov finds himself going from riches to rags following the Russian revolution. A Soviet tribunal banishes him to the attic room of an opulent hotel, where, oblivious to the world outside, he discovers the true value of friendship, family and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aBU2mlyZT5BzvCkXXUewH7wfhkK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208942'),
  ('504949616352520087', 'A Gentleman''s Dignity', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kim Eun-sook', 'Kim Eun-sook', 'Jang Dong-gun, Kim Ha-neul, Kim Soo-ro, Kim Min-jong, Lee Jong-hyun, Yoon Se-a, Kim Jung-nan, Yoon Jin-yi', null, 'Four men with complicated love lives refuse to admit they''re getting older, and attempt to prove that forty is the new thirty!', 'Four men with complicated love lives refuse to admit they''re getting older, and attempt to prove that forty is the new thirty!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zdYmI1uYrHsNbw9qMHiWDnGRwXX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43135'),
  ('659768362105044970', 'A Gifted Man', 2011, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Susannah Grant', null, 'Patrick Wilson, Jennifer Ehle, Liam Aiken, Rachelle Lefevre, Margo Martindale, Pablo Schreiber, Julie Benz, Quincy Dunn-Baker', 'TV-PG', 'A talented but self-absorbed surgeon starts questioning his purpose in life when he is visited by the spirit of his deceased ex-wife.', 'A talented but self-absorbed surgeon starts questioning his purpose in life when he is visited by the spirit of his deceased ex-wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2G3YfOYTshX9gzlF4oRLeczW8ng.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39913'),
  ('368102715606767325', 'A Girl & Her Guard Dog', 2023, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Akari Kito, Yuuichirou Umehara, Junya Enoki, Mai Nakahara, Yoshino Aoyama, Hitomi Ueda', 'TV-14', 'Isaku just wants to live a normal life. But as the granddaughter of a yakuza boss, that’s a pretty tall order. For years, it’s been difficult for Isaku to make friends and find love. So, she decides to enroll in a high school far from her hometown in hopes of a fresh start. But her plans take an unexpected turn when a worried member of the yakuza, Keiya, enrolls in the same school to protect her.', 'Isaku just wants to live a normal life. But as the granddaughter of a yakuza boss, that’s a pretty tall order. For years, it’s been difficult for Isaku to make friends and find love. So, she decides to enroll in a high school far from her hometown in hopes of a fresh start. But her plans take an unexpected turn when a worried member of the yakuza, Keiya, enrolls in the same school to protect her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kH1gkpmAW1timu2FOuiso5Hfs2M.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:212053'),
  ('866673873357337534', 'A Girl & Three Sweethearts', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Mirei Kiritani, Kento Yamazaki, Shohei Miura, Shuhei Nomura, Nanao, Kotaro Yoshida, Sakurako Ohara, Kenta Hamano', null, 'Sakurai Misaki has not dated in a long time. She has focused on her work as a pâtissier to eventually run her own business. One day, she gets fired from work. She then meets her first love from high school Shibasaki Chiaki. Misaki works part-time at Chiaki''s restaurant and also stays there. While she lives with Chiaki at his restaurant, she realizes that Chiaki''s two younger brothers Touma and Kanata also live there.', 'Sakurai Misaki has not dated in a long time. She has focused on her work as a pâtissier to eventually run her own business. One day, she gets fired from work. She then meets her first love from high school Shibasaki Chiaki. Misaki works part-time at Chiaki''s restaurant and also stays there. While she lives with Chiaki at his restaurant, she realizes that Chiaki''s two younger brothers Touma and Kanata also live there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67bmfuVVhUqHvFK0qUk9vuKmCoE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67355'),
  ('479157456153683908', 'A Girl and an Astronaut', 2023, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, 'Agata Malesińska', 'Vanessa Aleksander, Magdalena Boczarska, Magdalena Cielecka, Anna Cieślak, Andrzej Chyra, Grzegorz Damięcki, Jędrzej Hycnar, Jakub Sasak', 'TV-MA', 'An astronaut''s return after a 30-year disappearance rekindles a lost love and sparks interest from a corporation determined to learn why he hasn''t aged.', 'An astronaut''s return after a 30-year disappearance rekindles a lost love and sparks interest from a corporation determined to learn why he hasn''t aged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5GDhb86zGf7evaoR2ZTdNfrsU0j.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217858'),
  ('122527844852960219', 'A Girl''s Guide to 21st Century Sex', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Catherine Hood', null, 'Catherine Hood, Elizabeth Lawrence, Stefan Hard, Ava Cadell, Erin Sharkey, Raj Patel', null, 'A Girl''s Guide to 21st Century Sex is a documentary TV series about sex, which ran in eight episodes on Channel 5 and was presented by Dr Catherine Hood. The 45-minute long episodes were broadcast on Monday nights. The series started on 30 October 2006, with the final programme broadcast on 18 December 2006. Each episode explained a sex position and covered a sexually transmitted disease. Additionally, the following topics were discussed: sex among handicapped and overweight people, penis enlargement devices, penis enlargement surgery, sexual violence against men and penis removal, tantric sex, the g-spot, erectile dysfunction, sex reassignment surgery, cosmetic surgery of the vagina, swinging, lichen sclerosus, the use of recreational drugs during sex, male homosexual sex in public toilets, full body plastic wrap bondage, and sex dolls.', 'A Girl''s Guide to 21st Century Sex is a documentary TV series about sex, which ran in eight episodes on Channel 5 and was presented by Dr Catherine Hood. The 45-minute long episodes were broadcast on Monday nights. The series started on 30 October 2006, with the final programme broadcast on 18 December 2006. Each episode explained a sex position and covered a sexually transmitted disease. Additionally, the following topics were discussed: sex among handicapped and overweight people, penis enlargement devices, penis enlargement surgery, sexual violence against men and penis removal, tantric sex, the g-spot, erectile dysfunction, sex reassignment surgery, cosmetic surgery of the vagina, swinging, lichen sclerosus, the use of recreational drugs during sex, male homosexual sex in public toilets, full body plastic wrap bondage, and sex dolls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9NSX2YrFGBIih0XqRedsSbDVx4U.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13805'),
  ('993388489124338044', 'A Good Day to be a Dog', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Lee Hye', null, 'Park Gyu-young, Cha Eun-woo, Lee Hyun-woo, Yoon Hyun-soo, Kim Yi-kyeong, Ryu Abel, Cho Jin-se, Lee Seo-el', 'TV-14', 'Hae-na who is bound to inherit her family curse which is turning into a dog after getting her first kiss. The only way to break the curse is to get a second kiss. The problem is the guy who gave Hae-na her first kiss is afraid of dogs.', 'Hae-na who is bound to inherit her family curse which is turning into a dog after getting her first kiss. The only way to break the curse is to get a second kiss. The problem is the guy who gave Hae-na her first kiss is afraid of dogs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5w68XVoHs3hetvBMhOvguLbvikf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209502'),
  ('204655421214432907', 'A Good Girl''s Guide to Murder', 2024, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Poppy Cogan', null, 'Emma Myers, Zain Iqbal', 'TV-MA', 'Five years after the death of schoolgirl Andie Bell, Pippa Fitz-Amobi sets out to uncover what really happened to her. Sal Singh, Andie''s boyfriend, admitted to the murder before taking his own life, but Pip doesn''t believe he''s responsible and teams up with Sal''s brother Ravi to uncover the truth. If Sal Singh isn''t a murderer and the real killer is still out there, how far will they go to keep Pip from finding out the truth?', 'Five years after the death of schoolgirl Andie Bell, Pippa Fitz-Amobi sets out to uncover what really happened to her. Sal Singh, Andie''s boyfriend, admitted to the murder before taking his own life, but Pip doesn''t believe he''s responsible and teams up with Sal''s brother Ravi to uncover the truth. If Sal Singh isn''t a murderer and the real killer is still out there, how far will they go to keep Pip from finding out the truth?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzkstyDSsTRswCMRvoBD5ULPnIt.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:218342'),
  ('1045215426718176617', 'A Good Librarian Like a Good Shepherd', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Junji Majima, Madoka Yonezawa, Nozomi Yamamoto, Atsumi Tanezaki, Yuka Saitou, Eri Sendai, Satoshi Tsuruoka, Showtaro Morikubo', null, 'Kyotaro Kakei has always had an affinity towards books in hopes to find answers to his life. With a mentor''s promise, he continues to search for a book with his absolute hope. However, this changes when he receives a foretelling message saying that "Today, something will happen that will change your fate. --From the Shepherd." Due to this premonition, his normal school life at Shiomoi Academy becomes entangled due to the optimistic Tsugumi Shirasaki and the Shimoi Happy Project.', 'Kyotaro Kakei has always had an affinity towards books in hopes to find answers to his life. With a mentor''s promise, he continues to search for a book with his absolute hope. However, this changes when he receives a foretelling message saying that "Today, something will happen that will change your fate. --From the Shepherd." Due to this premonition, his normal school life at Shiomoi Academy becomes entangled due to the optimistic Tsugumi Shirasaki and the Shimoi Happy Project.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aP3hk0nBcmtTMGDhvEodcueVOav.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65851'),
  ('17660585383832987', 'A Good Wife', 2013, 'Drama', 'Pan Yi Qun', null, 'Tien Hsin, Christopher Lee, Darren Chiu, Shara Lin, Man-Ning Hsi, Chu De-kang', 'TV-14', 'As her seemingly idyllic life begins to crumble, a lonely woman in a restrictive marriage starts an affair with a gentle bookstore owner.', 'As her seemingly idyllic life begins to crumble, a lonely woman in a restrictive marriage starts an affair with a gentle bookstore owner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Dk4v4LjtSMU1ZR4r7rVqMgRFjY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:57146'),
  ('879695019305857301', 'A Grande Família', 2001, 'Comedy, Family', 'Cláudio Paiva', null, 'Marco Nanini, Marieta Severo, Pedro Cardoso, Guta Stresser, Lúcio Mauro Filho, Marcos Oliveira, Tonico Pereira, Vinicius Moreno', 'NR', 'The daily lives of a typical Brazilian middle-class family, that are always very close and tries, in their way, to survive the financial and relationship difficulties.', 'The daily lives of a typical Brazilian middle-class family, that are always very close and tries, in their way, to survive the financial and relationship difficulties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/draJzGrnfB8gEqCGJrPhNORu0nz.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:16183'),
  ('226315735293857749', 'A gURLs wURLd', 2010, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family, Comedy, Drama, Kids', null, null, 'Sophie Karbjinski, Julie Wee, Takaya Honda, Marny Kennedy, Sam Fraser, Charlotte Nicdao, Jannik Schümann, Luke Erceg', 'NR', 'A gURLs wURLd, also known as Emma''s Chatroom and Cyber Girls, is an Australian children''s television series, co-produced by Screen Australia, Southern Star Entertainment, Southern Star Singapore, the Media Development Authority of Singapore, NDR, the German Norddeutscher Rundfunk and TV Plus Production. It first aired on the Nine Network on 2 July 2011. There are 26 half hour episodes in the series.', 'A gURLs wURLd, also known as Emma''s Chatroom and Cyber Girls, is an Australian children''s television series, co-produced by Screen Australia, Southern Star Entertainment, Southern Star Singapore, the Media Development Authority of Singapore, NDR, the German Norddeutscher Rundfunk and TV Plus Production. It first aired on the Nine Network on 2 July 2011. There are 26 half hour episodes in the series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ey78XIsgflQcWszs4vnjnxtsha.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38949'),
  ('438889808299857135', 'A Guy, a Girl', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Guy A. Lepage', null, 'Jean Dujardin, Alexandra Lamy', 'NR', 'This series tells the daily life of a couple : Jean and Alexandra. From easy cases: in bed, in the living room, in the kitchen, by phone... to rare ones: lost on an island or in the country, in Hong Kong, during a wedding... Jean and Alexandra''s life is not exactly a long, quiet river.', 'This series tells the daily life of a couple : Jean and Alexandra. From easy cases: in bed, in the living room, in the kitchen, by phone... to rare ones: lost on an island or in the country, in Hong Kong, during a wedding... Jean and Alexandra''s life is not exactly a long, quiet river.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zJO5th3bB2RPZv4ONm6dC9VE6Ob.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:61679'),
  ('1001985722078039520', 'A Haunting', 2005, 'Documentary, Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Anthony D. Call', 'TV-PG', 'These are the true stories of the innocent and the unimaginable. Based on true events, A Haunting dramatises some of the scariest stories, revealing a world in which tragedy, suicide and murder have left psychic impressions so powerful that innocent people become forced to deal with them decades later. Through mesmerizing first-person accounts, the mystery and origin of each haunting is powerfully revealed and leaves a lingering sense that life—and death—are much stronger then anyone could have possibly imagined.', 'These are the true stories of the innocent and the unimaginable. Based on true events, A Haunting dramatises some of the scariest stories, revealing a world in which tragedy, suicide and murder have left psychic impressions so powerful that innocent people become forced to deal with them decades later. Through mesmerizing first-person accounts, the mystery and origin of each haunting is powerfully revealed and leaves a lingering sense that life—and death—are much stronger then anyone could have possibly imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c7GMWnH8Bl9UCZYQ5UzExiYqkD8.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:4038'),
  ('926716457589482648', 'A Herbivorous Dragon of 5,000 Years Gets Unfairly Villainized', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Xing Kaixin, Lan Jiu, Wei Ruchen, Meme Yan, Shan Xin', 'TV-14', 'Desperate to defend her village from the demon king, Reiko offers herself to a 5,000-year-old dragon for his help in exchange, but the flame-breathing beast is vegetarian and a total weakling. Together they embark on a journey to take down the demon king. With her dragon comrade, Reiko claims that she''s his disciple, able to draw from his infinite powers, but is it really from him?', 'Desperate to defend her village from the demon king, Reiko offers herself to a 5,000-year-old dragon for his help in exchange, but the flame-breathing beast is vegetarian and a total weakling. Together they embark on a journey to take down the demon king. With her dragon comrade, Reiko claims that she''s his disciple, able to draw from his infinite powers, but is it really from him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQQfFEWTOyKxW3pfpqNyhfhISAX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:139161'),
  ('379724464250061119', 'A Herdeira', 2017, 'Drama, Soap', 'Maria João Mira', null, 'Lourenço Ortigão, Alexandra Lencastre, Maya Booth, Melânia Gomes, Marisa Cruz, Rita Pereira, Pedro Granger, Lia Gama', null, 'The story of a girl created by the gypsy community but who in fact is heiress of a great empire. The woman who robbed her in the past now sees her future threatened. The return of the Heiress unleashes struggles of power and affections and a love to withstand anything.', 'The story of a girl created by the gypsy community but who in fact is heiress of a great empire. The woman who robbed her in the past now sees her future threatened. The return of the Heiress unleashes struggles of power and affections and a love to withstand anything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Acf1EEhOZwDNB0IuuICwyIDfYqF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:73951'),
  ('117757968566130682', 'A História de Ester', 2010, 'Drama', 'Vivian de Oliveira', 'Camilo Pellegrini, Altenir Silva, Maria Cláudia Oliveira', 'Gabriela Durlo, Marcos Pitombo, Paulo Gorgulho, Vanessa Gerbelli, Ewerton de Castro, Letícia Colin, Paulo Nigro, Giuseppe Oristanio', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mLAXUbqTzk6lZz7kIiWf90Zk510.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72658'),
  ('344379430847921549', 'A History of Britain', 2000, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Simon Schama, Michael Kitchen, Lindsay Duncan', null, 'Stretching from the Stone Age to the year 2000, Simon Schama''s Complete History of Britain does not pretend to be a definitive chronicle of the turbulent events which buffeted and shaped the British Isles. What Schama does do, however, is tell the story in vivid and gripping narrative terms, free of the fustiness of traditional academe, personalising key historical events by examining the major characters at the centre of them. Not all historians would approve of the history depicted here as shaped principally by the actions of great men and women rather than by more abstract developments, but Schama''s way of telling it is a good deal more enthralling as a result. Schama successfully gives lie to the idea that the history of Britain has been moderate and temperate, passing down the generations as stately as a galleon, taking on board sensible ideas but steering clear of sillier, revolutionary ones. Nonsense. Schama retells British history the way it was--as bloody, convulsive, precarious, hot-blooded and several times within an inch of haring off onto an entirely different course. Schama seems almost to delight in the goriness of history. Themes returned to repeatedly include the wars between the Scots and the Irish and the Catholic/Protestant conflicts--only the Irish question remains unresolved by the new millennium. As Britain becomes a constitutional monarchy, Schama talks less of Kings and Queens but of poets and idea-makers like Orwell. Still, with his pungent, direct manner and against an evocative visual and aural backdrop, Schama makes history seem as though it happened yesterday, the bloodstains not yet dry.', 'Stretching from the Stone Age to the year 2000, Simon Schama''s Complete History of Britain does not pretend to be a definitive chronicle of the turbulent events which buffeted and shaped the British Isles. What Schama does do, however, is tell the story in vivid and gripping narrative terms, free of the fustiness of traditional academe, personalising key historical events by examining the major characters at the centre of them. Not all historians would approve of the history depicted here as shaped principally by the actions of great men and women rather than by more abstract developments, but Schama''s way of telling it is a good deal more enthralling as a result. Schama successfully gives lie to the idea that the history of Britain has been moderate and temperate, passing down the generations as stately as a galleon, taking on board sensible ideas but steering clear of sillier, revolutionary ones. Nonsense. Schama retells British history the way it was--as bloody, convulsive, precarious, hot-blooded and several times within an inch of haring off onto an entirely different course. Schama seems almost to delight in the goriness of history. Themes returned to repeatedly include the wars between the Scots and the Irish and the Catholic/Protestant conflicts--only the Irish question remains unresolved by the new millennium. As Britain becomes a constitutional monarchy, Schama talks less of Kings and Queens but of poets and idea-makers like Orwell. Still, with his pungent, direct manner and against an evocative visual and aural backdrop, Schama makes history seem as though it happened yesterday, the bloodstains not yet dry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sVp2CXA2p6CFnw5o8J9IcuNj0VH.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:14269'),
  ('429070871230447859', 'A History of Horror', 2010, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Mark Gatiss, John Carpenter, Roger Corman, Tobe Hooper, George A. Romero, Barbara Steele, Jimmy Sangster, David Warner', 'TV-MA', 'Mark Gatiss examines the history of the horror film, from classic Hollywood monsters to Hammer''s glory days and beyond.', 'Mark Gatiss examines the history of the horror film, from classic Hollywood monsters to Hammer''s glory days and beyond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fzm3QDrfH0vq3ZJOw8EiAZTIFn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:36002'),
  ('661821916285798596', 'A Hot Night With My Boss in a Capsule Hotel', 2018, 'Animation', null, null, 'Hiromi Igarashi, Daisuke Hirose, Taku Yashiro', null, 'The anime centers on Minori, an office worker, and her boss Hadano, who are constantly arguing with each other. One night, after a company drinking party, Minori and Hadano are having their usual argument, when Minori realizes that she has missed the last train. They decide to spend the night at a nearby capsule hotel, but an incident forces them to share the same unit. (Source: ANN)', 'The anime centers on Minori, an office worker, and her boss Hadano, who are constantly arguing with each other. One night, after a company drinking party, Minori and Hadano are having their usual argument, when Minori realizes that she has missed the last train. They decide to spend the night at a nearby capsule hotel, but an incident forces them to share the same unit. (Source: ANN)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogANREOg2iRnI9J1hHX6rE19v0P.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83073'),
  ('705965732904537129', 'A House is Not a Home', 1977, 'Drama', 'Kitty Ip Kit-Hing, Selina Chow Liang Shuk-yee', null, 'Liza Wong Ming-Chuen, Chow Yun-Fat, Nam Hung, Tang Pik-Wan, Simon Yam, Paul Chu Kong, Pak Man-Biu, Ha Yue', null, 'A House Is Not a Home is a TVB television series, premiered on 1 August 1977. It is a very successful classic series boasting the likes of stars Liza Wang, Simon Yam, Ha Yu and also veteran actors like Bak Man-biu, Tang Pik-wan and Lee Heung-kam. The show became a 1970s drama classic, well-known also for its theme song, "A House Is Not a Home"; 家變, which was composed and arranged by Joseph Koo, with lyrics by the late Wong Jim and sung by Roman Tam.', 'A House Is Not a Home is a TVB television series, premiered on 1 August 1977. It is a very successful classic series boasting the likes of stars Liza Wang, Simon Yam, Ha Yu and also veteran actors like Bak Man-biu, Tang Pik-wan and Lee Heung-kam. The show became a 1970s drama classic, well-known also for its theme song, "A House Is Not a Home"; 家變, which was composed and arranged by Joseph Koo, with lyrics by the late Wong Jim and sung by Roman Tam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93hFc0PliiWheLTaZvzYtQFvVmR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109622'),
  ('1059998696663669893', 'A Hundred Memories', 2025, 'Drama', null, 'Yang Hui-seung', 'Kim Da-mi, Shin Ye-eun, Heo Nam-jun, Lee Won-jeong, Jeon Seong-woo, Park Ye-ni, Jung Bo-min, Lee Min-ji', null, 'A heartbreaking first love story of a man who was destined to be the fate of two women who were bus guides in the 1980s, and a melodrama-comedy of shining youths who were destined to be brilliant.', 'A heartbreaking first love story of a man who was destined to be the fate of two women who were bus guides in the 1980s, and a melodrama-comedy of shining youths who were destined to be brilliant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGHE2Wk0dhRRGnZghMorr07FTHt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:271889'),
  ('289956087759694441', 'A Hundred Scenes of AWAJIMA', 2026, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Niina Nakabayashi, You Taichi, Ai Kayano, Natsumi Fujiwara, Ayumi Tsunematsu, Kana Ichinose, Risa Shimizu, Asuna Tomari', null, 'At Awajima Opera School, girls from across Japan strive to earn a place on stage. Wakana is driven by her love of musical theater, while Kinue studies with quiet discipline. Scholarship student Emi draws attention from all—but especially from Keiko, who struggles with admiration and comparison. Through shifting perspectives, their intertwined days explore ambition, friendship, and self-discovery.', 'At Awajima Opera School, girls from across Japan strive to earn a place on stage. Wakana is driven by her love of musical theater, while Kinue studies with quiet discipline. Scholarship student Emi draws attention from all—but especially from Keiko, who struggles with admiration and comparison. Through shifting perspectives, their intertwined days explore ambition, friendship, and self-discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMlsSTcLfpjaMF7YzsiAxWPUGLa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:291403'),
  ('1115887085562207179', 'A Journey Through Another World: Raising Kids While Adventuring', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Aina Suzuki, Miharu Hanai, Yusuke Shirai, Haruka Tomatsu', null, 'After a god accidentally slays him, Takumi’s reborn with new skills in a monster-filled forest where he stumbles upon twins. They’re sweet, adorable, and super strong! Won over instantly, he names them Alan and Elena, becomes their guardian, and joins an adventurers’ guild to provide for his new family. And so starts his chill life of adventure, watching over Alan and Elena’s growth!', 'After a god accidentally slays him, Takumi’s reborn with new skills in a monster-filled forest where he stumbles upon twins. They’re sweet, adorable, and super strong! Won over instantly, he names them Alan and Elena, becomes their guardian, and joins an adventurers’ guild to provide for his new family. And so starts his chill life of adventure, watching over Alan and Elena’s growth!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xvFV6ADOmUZfK28aLrPAXmxrEZO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:240633'),
  ('969193284926383908', 'A Journey to Love', 2023, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, 'Zhang Wei', 'Liu Shishi, Liu Yuning, Fang Yilun, He Landou, Chen Haoyu, Chang Huasen, Li Huan, Zhang Fan', null, 'Two top assassins from rival agencies and their six-member team who with diverse backgrounds, and unique skills embark on a journey filled with challenges and crises.', 'Two top assassins from rival agencies and their six-member team who with diverse backgrounds, and unique skills embark on a journey filled with challenges and crises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7DKpFBcZNZWsmApAtYhuQWo1LJD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210191'),
  ('1053916049768687356', 'A Killer Paradox', 2024, 'Crime, Comedy, Mystery, Drama', 'Lee Chang-hee, Kim Da-min', null, 'Choi Woo-shik, Son Suk-ku, Lee Hee-jun, Kwon Da-ham', 'TV-MA', 'When one accidental killing leads to another, an ordinary young man finds himself stuck in an endless cat-and-mouse chase with a shrewd detective.', 'When one accidental killing leads to another, an ordinary young man finds himself stuck in an endless cat-and-mouse chase with a shrewd detective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2yYZGT2If8XcCZS9ASF1g13MiT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:202783'),
  ('258398692832423293', 'A Killer Uncaged', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'In this crime docuseries spinoff, a convict is paroled 30 years after being sentenced to death for murder. Then he makes a stunning confession.', 'In this crime docuseries spinoff, a convict is paroled 30 years after being sentenced to death for murder. Then he makes a stunning confession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/15pagEZ6EKRDXThfKndHPPtJAIL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108347'),
  ('1003872196384260561', 'A Killer''s Mind', 2024, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Vladimir Mirzoev', null, 'Anastasiya Evgrafova, Tikhon Zhiznevsky, Yana Sekste, Sergey Shakurov, Darya Konyzheva, Sergey Gilev, Veronika Mokhireva, Anastasiya Krasovskaya', null, 'Profiler Zoya Volgina is the best in the business: crime scenes literally come to life before her eyes. It is Zoya and a special employee of the Investigative Committee, Timofey Volokh, who are involved in a new investigation: in St. Petersburg, an unknown strangler embalms the bodies of his victims, turning them into statues. Zoya is familiar with his “handwriting” - many years ago she already encountered a very similar person.', 'Profiler Zoya Volgina is the best in the business: crime scenes literally come to life before her eyes. It is Zoya and a special employee of the Investigative Committee, Timofey Volokh, who are involved in a new investigation: in St. Petersburg, an unknown strangler embalms the bodies of his victims, turning them into statues. Zoya is familiar with his “handwriting” - many years ago she already encountered a very similar person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMZtYld55dtiTz9YuDfSNFFo9mY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:244795'),
  ('289806070639754022', 'A Kind of Spark', 2023, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Elle McNicoll, Anna McCleery', null, 'Lola Blue, Georgia de Gidlow, Cait Hamilton, Geoffrey Newland, Zahra Browne, Eve Midgley, Ella Maisy Purvis, Garry Harper', null, 'When she discovers a centuries-old mystery within her town, autistic teen Addie finds her voice and lets her light shine as she stands up for those who were persecuted for being different like her.', 'When she discovers a centuries-old mystery within her town, autistic teen Addie finds her voice and lets her light shine as she stands up for those who were persecuted for being different like her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXUtfKcNknuumcNFVCwHmwWAuS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:223116'),
  ('1089090650958679866', 'A Kindred Spirit', 1995, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Louise Lee Si-Kei, Danny Lau Dan, Ram Chiang Chi-Kwong, Louisa So Yuk-Wah, Kenix Kwok Ho-Ying, Ben Wong Chi-Yin, Angie Cheung Wai-Yee, Florence Kwok Siu-Wan', null, 'A Kindred Spirit was a television drama series that was broadcast on TVB Jade in Hong Kong from 15 May 1995 to 13 November 1999. It is one of the longest running drama shows in Hong Kong television history. Its exceptional longevity still amazes people in a city where scripted TV drama programs typically only last around 20 episodes. The total number of episodes is 1,128. Each episode airs a few days in each week. The show centres on a family who operates a barbecue pork restaurant in Happy Valley, Hong Kong, and their life.', 'A Kindred Spirit was a television drama series that was broadcast on TVB Jade in Hong Kong from 15 May 1995 to 13 November 1999. It is one of the longest running drama shows in Hong Kong television history. Its exceptional longevity still amazes people in a city where scripted TV drama programs typically only last around 20 episodes. The total number of episodes is 1,128. Each episode airs a few days in each week. The show centres on a family who operates a barbecue pork restaurant in Happy Valley, Hong Kong, and their life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fpOAhBePSowxPsRUUT0ov9tMXwc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15844'),
  ('687644223615454205', 'A Knight of the Seven Kingdoms', 2026, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'George R.R. Martin, Ira Parker', null, 'Peter Claffey, Dexter Sol Ansell', 'TV-MA', 'A century before the events of Game of Thrones, two unlikely heroes wandered Westeros: a young, naive but courageous knight, Ser Duncan the Tall, and his diminutive squire, Egg. Set in an age when the Targaryen line still holds the Iron Throne and the last dragon has not yet passed from living memory, great destinies, powerful foes, and dangerous exploits await these improbable and incomparable friends.', 'A century before the events of Game of Thrones, two unlikely heroes wandered Westeros: a young, naive but courageous knight, Ser Duncan the Tall, and his diminutive squire, Egg. Set in an age when the Targaryen line still holds the Iron Throne and the last dragon has not yet passed from living memory, great destinies, powerful foes, and dangerous exploits await these improbable and incomparable friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k8yARbD9iYn2nRX2HvsopfKDN2r.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:224372'),
  ('303305839364071224', 'A Korean Odyssey', 2017, 'Comedy, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Hong Mi-ran, Kim Byeong-su, Park Hong-kyun', 'Hong Jeong-eun, Hong Mi-ran', 'Lee Seung-gi, Cha Seung-won, Oh Yeon-seo, Lee Hong-gi, Jang Kwang, Lee El, Lee Se-young, Kim Seung-o', 'TV-MA', 'A self-serving mythical creature''s bid for invincibility backfires when he finds himself at the mercy of a woman who can see otherworldly beings.', 'A self-serving mythical creature''s bid for invincibility backfires when he finds himself at the mercy of a woman who can see otherworldly beings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJfF9m2bDXZf6Lng8kkyd0o0Qjz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75123'),
  ('266331622784177954', 'A League of Nobleman', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Da Feng Gua Guo', null, 'Jing Boran, Song Weilong, Guo Cheng, Hong Yao, Wang Duo, Shawn Zhang', null, 'A brilliant commoner and a mysterious minister team up to solve crimes and expose corruption in the royal court of ancient China.', 'A brilliant commoner and a mysterious minister team up to solve crimes and expose corruption in the royal court of ancient China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uW1D3XuKDHfGPozPJO0FUr6InB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128712'),
  ('563294492659033716', 'A League of Their Own', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Paul Brassey', null, 'Jamie Redknapp, Micah Richards, Jill Scott, Romesh Ranganathan', null, 'Two teams comprised of comedians, celebrities and sports stars compete against each other in a test of their sporting knowledge, taking place over three rounds.', 'Two teams comprised of comedians, celebrities and sports stars compete against each other in a test of their sporting knowledge, taking place over three rounds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vmXpD2S6RX2n1RhdBPLo0QPjf3v.jpg', 20, 'tmdb:tv:32348'),
  ('115907173977808364', 'A League of Their Own', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Abbi Jacobson, Will Graham', 'Lowell Ganz, Kelly Candaele, Kim Wilson', 'Abbi Jacobson, Chanté Adams, D''Arcy Carden, Gbemisola Ikumelo, Kelly McCormack, Roberta Colindrez, Melanie Field, Priscilla Delgado', 'TV-14', 'In 1943, Carson Shaw travels to Chicago to try out for the All-American Girls Professional Baseball League. There, she meets other women who also dream of playing pro baseball and makes connections that open up her world. Rockford local Max Chapman also comes to the tryouts but is turned away. With the support of her best friend Clance, she must forge a new path to pursue her dream.', 'In 1943, Carson Shaw travels to Chicago to try out for the All-American Girls Professional Baseball League. There, she meets other women who also dream of playing pro baseball and makes connections that open up her world. Rockford local Max Chapman also comes to the tryouts but is turned away. With the support of her best friend Clance, she must forge a new path to pursue her dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3sqXMRpidT15QylW6GlQFuGpGCc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107005'),
