  ('136445373780977632', 'A Life for a Life', 2025, 'Crime, Drama', null, '熊语真, Lu Chuan', 'Qin Hao, Han Geng, Zhong Chuxi, Shi Pengyuan, Lin Boyang, Liu Xiaohai, Su Xiaoding, Zhang Jingwei', null, 'In the early 1990s, Du Xiangdong, a top student at the police academy, was reluctantly assigned to a detention center. When two suspects under his supervision unexpectedly escaped, it sparked Du Xiangdong''s relentless pursuit that spanned over 20 years.', 'In the early 1990s, Du Xiangdong, a top student at the police academy, was reluctantly assigned to a detention center. When two suspects under his supervision unexpectedly escaped, it sparked Du Xiangdong''s relentless pursuit that spanned over 20 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdVQUbsQuKft3aJYCyy0vqlz8zV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:261592'),
  ('733624656391558642', 'A Life Time Love', 2017, 'Drama', null, null, 'Victoria Song, Huang Xiaoming, Peter Sheng, Zhang Li, Zhai Tianlin, Janice Wu, Luo Yunxi', null, 'Chi Yun is a skilled martial artist who grew up in the wilderness. He falls in love with Mu Qingmo at first sight, and openly pursues her once they meet again a couple of years later. She eventually reciprocates his affections, even though her brother had already promised her hand in marriage to the powerful noble Lingyun Shenglun. Shenglun is aware their marriage is only for alliance purposes, and promises to keep their relationship platonic. However, he eventually becomes attracted to the heroine, and is determined to keep her by his side forever.', 'Chi Yun is a skilled martial artist who grew up in the wilderness. He falls in love with Mu Qingmo at first sight, and openly pursues her once they meet again a couple of years later. She eventually reciprocates his affections, even though her brother had already promised her hand in marriage to the powerful noble Lingyun Shenglun. Shenglun is aware their marriage is only for alliance purposes, and promises to keep their relationship platonic. However, he eventually becomes attracted to the heroine, and is determined to keep her by his side forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGzbH7PzVpa49v5ruSi32Ss9MOa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71920'),
  ('76718917891634916', 'A Life to Die For', 2021, 'Soap, Comedy, Drama', 'Mauro Wilson', 'Marcelo Gonçalves, Mauro Wilson, Rodrigo Salomão', 'Giovanna Antonelli, Vladimir Brichta, Mateus Solano, Valentina Herszage, Júlia Lemmertz, Bruno Cabrerizo, Bárbara Colen, Ana Lúcia Torre', 'NR', 'Tells the story of the quartet formed by a friendly and bankrupt ex-football player, a rich and snobby surgeon, a powerful and arrogant executive and a scammer with a heart of stone. They are victims of a plane crash on the same day they met each other and end up dying. When they meet Death, they are told that their time to go has not yet come and that they must return to life to deal with their personal issues. However, Death warns that, in a year, one of them will actually die and the four decide to take this second chance to achieve their greatest goals in life.', 'Tells the story of the quartet formed by a friendly and bankrupt ex-football player, a rich and snobby surgeon, a powerful and arrogant executive and a scammer with a heart of stone. They are victims of a plane crash on the same day they met each other and end up dying. When they meet Death, they are told that their time to go has not yet come and that they must return to life to deal with their personal issues. However, Death warns that, in a year, one of them will actually die and the four decide to take this second chance to achieve their greatest goals in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGswiNNfkNvSNdgiUukiRgVK6Ya.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:139009'),
  ('551193216707289505', 'A Life Worth Living', 2019, 'Drama, Crime, Family', 'Rosane Svartman, Paulo Halm', 'Charles Peixoto, Claudia Sardinha, Rosane Svartman', 'Grazi Massafera, Antônio Fagundes, Romulo Estrela, David Junior, Ingrid Guimarães, Fabiula Nascimento, Armando Babaioff, Sheron Menezzes', null, 'A dreamy seamstress and mother of three''s life is turned upside down when she''s wrongly diagnosed with a terminal disease along with an actually terminally ill wealthy book publisher.', 'A dreamy seamstress and mother of three''s life is turned upside down when she''s wrongly diagnosed with a terminal disease along with an actually terminally ill wealthy book publisher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3adwUyOyEYKToRIejwn0aeq8GcN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91748'),
  ('572663786225740161', 'A Lifelong Journey', 2022, 'Drama', 'Liang Xiaosheng, Li Lu', 'Wang Hailing, Liang Xiaosheng', 'Lei Jiayin, Xin Baiqing, Song Jia, Yin Tao, Ding Yongdai, Sa Rina, Cheng Taishen, Song Chunli', null, 'A story that details the the lives of ordinary civilians amidst the magnanimous changes in Chinese society over the years. At the end of the 1970s, the Zhou family lived in a provincial city in the north. The father, Zhu Zhi Gang, has just participated in the Third Front Movement in Xi Nan. The eldest son, Zhou Bing Yi, responds to a national call to become part of the first batch of "educated" youths sent to live and work in rural areas. The eldest daughter, Zhou Rong, follows her poet husband to the countryside of Guizhou. The youngest son, Zhou Bing Kun, is the only one left at home with their mother. In the span of 50 years, the Zhou family is swept by the tides of change in China.', 'A story that details the the lives of ordinary civilians amidst the magnanimous changes in Chinese society over the years. At the end of the 1970s, the Zhou family lived in a provincial city in the north. The father, Zhu Zhi Gang, has just participated in the Third Front Movement in Xi Nan. The eldest son, Zhou Bing Yi, responds to a national call to become part of the first batch of "educated" youths sent to live and work in rural areas. The eldest daughter, Zhou Rong, follows her poet husband to the countryside of Guizhou. The youngest son, Zhou Bing Kun, is the only one left at home with their mother. In the span of 50 years, the Zhou family is swept by the tides of change in China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yodcyHtkXKOqQQoIptZZ0bBiS9J.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156568'),
  ('730863923431907537', 'A Little Help with Carol Burnett', 2018, 'Comedy, Talk', 'Carol Burnett', null, 'Carol Burnett', null, 'In this unscripted series starring comedy legend Carol Burnett, kids dish out advice to celebrities and everyday people in front of a live audience.', 'In this unscripted series starring comedy legend Carol Burnett, kids dish out advice to celebrities and everyday people in front of a live audience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6DVqLqSpG60e4quPCv2GWrZXkXX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73113'),
  ('344385008642260633', 'A Little Late with Lilly Singh', 2019, 'Comedy, Talk', null, null, 'Lilly Singh', null, 'The comedian, actress, social media sensation, producer and author of "How to Be a Bawse: A Guide to Conquering Life," Lilly Singh brings her unique perspective to late night as she hosts celebrity interviews, talks current events, performs musical and sketch comedy, plays games, and more.', 'The comedian, actress, social media sensation, producer and author of "How to Be a Bawse: A Guide to Conquering Life," Lilly Singh brings her unique perspective to late night as she hosts celebrity interviews, talks current events, performs musical and sketch comedy, plays games, and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1o8OOaHP4JTKCSDDgsBrkRZVA1O.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:93660'),
  ('827357016117532948', 'A Little Mood For Love', 2021, 'Family', null, 'Huang Lei', 'Zhou Xun, Huang Lei, Tang Yixin, Tu Songyan, Liu Lili, Qin Hailu, Han Tongsheng, Feng Lei', null, 'Sisters Liu Xiaomin and Liu Xiaojie both face divorce in their thirties and navigate new relationships with unexpected challenges. Xiaomin falls for a fellow divorcé while managing complex family dynamics, while Xiaojie’s romance with a younger man faces strong parental opposition. With their mother’s guidance, they overcome obstacles, finding love, growth, and happiness.', 'Sisters Liu Xiaomin and Liu Xiaojie both face divorce in their thirties and navigate new relationships with unexpected challenges. Xiaomin falls for a fellow divorcé while managing complex family dynamics, while Xiaojie’s romance with a younger man faces strong parental opposition. With their mother’s guidance, they overcome obstacles, finding love, growth, and happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cDgIi1mif5BYVKuktuTKy3y7P1Y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138293'),
  ('276740038149463819', 'A Little Princess', 1987, 'Drama', 'Jeremy Burnham', null, 'Amelia Shankley, Maureen Lipman, Miriam Margolyes, Annette Badland, Natalie Abbott, Alison Reynolds, Katrina Heath, Joanna Dukes', null, 'Sara Crewe is the pampered daughter of an army colonel in a Victorian London girls'' school. But when her father dies, penniless, Sara becomes a skivvy in Miss Michin''s school, befriended only by the scullery maid, Becky, her friends Ermengarde and Lottie, a little monkey, a lascar, and the mysterious man next door. Based upon the novel by Frances Hodgson Burnett.', 'Sara Crewe is the pampered daughter of an army colonel in a Victorian London girls'' school. But when her father dies, penniless, Sara becomes a skivvy in Miss Michin''s school, befriended only by the scullery maid, Becky, her friends Ermengarde and Lottie, a little monkey, a lascar, and the mysterious man next door. Based upon the novel by Frances Hodgson Burnett.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yPpPAVqWBENNuxPb59oNjYCAtDc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2953'),
  ('104898410997295773', 'A Little Reunion', 2019, 'Drama', 'Wang Jun', null, 'Huang Lei, Hai Qing, Tao Hong, Sha Yi, Wang Yanhui, Yong Mei, Zhou Qi, Victor Liu', null, 'This story focuses on China''s notorious college entrance exam, the "gaokao." It follows three seniors in high school and their families as they navigate the ups and downs of their lives whilst preparing for this exam that they believe will determine the trajectory of the rest of their lives.', 'This story focuses on China''s notorious college entrance exam, the "gaokao." It follows three seniors in high school and their families as they navigate the ups and downs of their lives whilst preparing for this exam that they believe will determine the trajectory of the rest of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qK3JnvL4C0NBQqVaZ7IyoERy6Zn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93088'),
  ('104450391576487827', 'A Little Thing Called First Love', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Wu Xueying, Hu Xiao Yu, Zhao Qian Qian', 'Lai Guan-lin, Zhao Jinmai, Wang Runze, Chai Wei, Yu Shuige, Wang Yimiao, Wang Bowen, Joe Xu', null, 'The story of an ordinary girl who falls head over heels for the most popular guy in school.', 'The story of an ordinary girl who falls head over heels for the most popular guy in school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/TyiGKJFSNfB0jBJpV7wFKvjwYZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95100'),
  ('249297312900022369', 'A Love Never Lost', 2025, 'Drama', '王伟', '江奇涛, 胡亚, Zhang Yong', 'Li Xian, Wei Daxun, Jessie Li, Zhou You, Zhu Yawen, Wu Yue, Li Chengru, Jiang Han', null, 'After the Gengzi Kingdom changed, the land of China was devastated, and young people with aspirations rose up to save their homeland. Aristocratic youth Liang Xiang, revolutionary party Yang Kaizhi, and Beiyang Wuyou Guardian Li Renjun became the first batch of progressive young people who went to Japan to study at a non-commissioned officer’s school. They met revolutionary exiles Yu Tianbai and Qiu Hong on a cruise ship. Since then, the five people have been fatefully linked.', 'After the Gengzi Kingdom changed, the land of China was devastated, and young people with aspirations rose up to save their homeland. Aristocratic youth Liang Xiang, revolutionary party Yang Kaizhi, and Beiyang Wuyou Guardian Li Renjun became the first batch of progressive young people who went to Japan to study at a non-commissioned officer’s school. They met revolutionary exiles Yu Tianbai and Qiu Hong on a cruise ship. Since then, the five people have been fatefully linked.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQxyDvhFbCzrfi2y2eQutd255yj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:206219'),
  ('740569542241026254', 'A Love So Beautiful', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Zhao Qian Qian', 'Zhao Qian Qian, Wu Tong, Zhou Chucen', 'Hu Yitian, Shen Yue, Gao Zhiting, Wang Ziwei, Sun Ning, Monica Lv, Zhang He Hao Zhen, Zhou Zixin', 'TV-14', 'The ups and downs of school, family and growing up test the affection between a budding artist and her handsome but indifferent classmate and neighbor.', 'The ups and downs of school, family and growing up test the affection between a budding artist and her handsome but indifferent classmate and neighbor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8bDIVyoxqOkYbBhzhrjY2F9Wep2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75387'),
