  ('44004596062463635', 'A Moody Christmas', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Trent O''Donnell, Phil Lloyd', null, 'Ian Meadows, Patrick Brammall, Jane Harber, Danny Adcock, Robina Beard, Tina Bursill, Guy Edmonds, Darren Gilshenan', null, 'Focused on the lovable, yet seasonally dysfunctional Moody family, A Moody Christmas is set against the backdrop of the one occasion that can bring out the best (and the worst) in people … Christmas Day.', 'Focused on the lovable, yet seasonally dysfunctional Moody family, A Moody Christmas is set against the backdrop of the one occasion that can bring out the best (and the worst) in people … Christmas Day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lSWNWUX1LTKittrghwTer4Q7nvn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46415'),
  ('391868273529529590', 'A Moonlight Nights Passing', 2026, 'Mystery', 'Rikako Akiyoshi', null, 'Haru, Kumiko Aso, Shuntaro Yanagi, Ryūto Sakuma, Kiyohiko Shibukawa, Naoki Tanaka', null, 'A transgender bar owner and a troubled housewife uncover buried regrets and get caught in a murder mystery in Osaka, where literature and intuition guide them toward the truth.', 'A transgender bar owner and a troubled housewife uncover buried regrets and get caught in a murder mystery in Osaka, where literature and intuition guide them toward the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6s7j5SGdcprXHfg7FqayaNih1hQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:314644'),
  ('87104258231592891', 'A Mother''s Love', 2019, 'Soap, Drama, Crime, Family', 'Manuela Dias', 'Manuela Dias, Roberto Vitorino, Mariana Mesquita', 'Regina Casé, Adriana Esteves, Taís Araújo, Murilo Benício, Irandhir Santos, Vladimir Brichta, Juliano Cazarré, Chay Suede', null, 'Lurdes is a mother of five who tirelessly seeks for Domenico, a child of hers who was sold by his own father 26 years ago; Thelma is an overprotective mother who finds out she has a terminal illness, and must race against time to make her dreams come true and prepare her son for a life without her presence; Vitória is a successful lawyer who sees the end of her marriage after countless failed attempts to have a baby and decides for adoption, but finds out she is pregnant during the process. In "A Mother''s Love", the lives of these women are intertwined while they recognize themselves in the unconditional love provided by motherhood.', 'Lurdes is a mother of five who tirelessly seeks for Domenico, a child of hers who was sold by his own father 26 years ago; Thelma is an overprotective mother who finds out she has a terminal illness, and must race against time to make her dreams come true and prepare her son for a life without her presence; Vitória is a successful lawyer who sees the end of her marriage after countless failed attempts to have a baby and decides for adoption, but finds out she is pregnant during the process. In "A Mother''s Love", the lives of these women are intertwined while they recognize themselves in the unconditional love provided by motherhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FGuE5rGu9OixjmDHuIaW2ld92F.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95885'),
  ('83782049309080717', 'A Mother''s Love', 2022, 'Drama, Soap', 'Yasemin Erkul Türkmenli, Ece Tahtalıoğlu Pertez', null, 'Erol Gedik, Selin Sezgin, Gece Işık Demirel, Cansın Mısırlı, Serdar Yıldırım, Dilara Büyükbayraktar, Faruk Pakiş, Kayra Zabcı', null, 'Zeynep is an innocent and beautiful girl who''s very fond of her mother. One day, her mother Cemre dies in an accident. No one can bring themselves to tell Zeynep that her mother is dead. Zeynep was born with a heart condition and she is not strong enough to bear the news. When she was dying, Zeynep''s mother is slandered so that Murat, who used to love her madly, now hates her deeply. Now that Asude, her grandmother has the perfect conditions to make Murat marry Melek, the woman she''d like to see as her daughter-in-law. The night that Zeynep finds out about her mother''s death, she also finds out that Murat is to marry Melek and she has an attack. When Zeynep''s heart is about to stop, a miracle happens. Zeynep comes across Nazli, who looks exactly like her mother.', 'Zeynep is an innocent and beautiful girl who''s very fond of her mother. One day, her mother Cemre dies in an accident. No one can bring themselves to tell Zeynep that her mother is dead. Zeynep was born with a heart condition and she is not strong enough to bear the news. When she was dying, Zeynep''s mother is slandered so that Murat, who used to love her madly, now hates her deeply. Now that Asude, her grandmother has the perfect conditions to make Murat marry Melek, the woman she''d like to see as her daughter-in-law. The night that Zeynep finds out about her mother''s death, she also finds out that Murat is to marry Melek and she has an attack. When Zeynep''s heart is about to stop, a miracle happens. Zeynep comes across Nazli, who looks exactly like her mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pPjyZWvaLzu2MRllG64p6eyQyre.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:49608'),
  ('255579715884803985', 'A Mother''s Son', 2012, 'Crime, Drama', null, 'Chris Lang', 'Hermione Norris, Martin Clunes, Paul McGann, Alexander Arnold, Nicola Walker, Annabelle Apsion, Antonia Clarke, Jake Davies', null, 'A mother suspects that her son could be the killer of a recently found dead girl, and becomes caught in a torturous dilemma of whether to denounce him, or protect him and hide the act.', 'A mother suspects that her son could be the killer of a recently found dead girl, and becomes caught in a torturous dilemma of whether to denounce him, or protect him and hide the act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/spqETTrL69k6heBkBolmw5ZIAKN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61574'),
  ('1045824007660668497', 'A Murder at the End of the World', 2023, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Brit Marling, Zal Batmanglij', null, 'Emma Corrin, Brit Marling, Harris Dickinson, Alice Braga, Joan Chen, Raúl Esparza, Jermaine Fowler, Pegah Ferydoni', 'TV-MA', 'Gen Z amateur sleuth and tech-savvy hacker Darby Hart and eight other guests are invited by a reclusive billionaire to participate in a retreat at a remote location. When one of the other guests is found dead, Darby must use her skills to prove it was murder before the killer takes another life.', 'Gen Z amateur sleuth and tech-savvy hacker Darby Hart and eight other guests are invited by a reclusive billionaire to participate in a retreat at a remote location. When one of the other guests is found dead, Darby must use her skills to prove it was murder before the killer takes another life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mWCXJefbNU1E2XPJVM2vejMSZO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:134095'),
  ('136182710350682650', 'A Murderous Affair in Horizon Tower', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery', null, 'Yang Shen, Shu Qiao', 'Yang Zishan, Guo Tao, AngelaBaby, Lü Yulai, Zhang Bojia, Jiao Gang, Ni Hongjie, Liu Dan', 'NR', 'The mysterious death of coffee shop owner Zhong Meibao, known as the "Doll Murder Case," shakes the Horizon Tower. While initial suspects include those linked to her romantically, new evidence reveals dark secrets from her past, pulling her family into the unfolding mystery.', 'The mysterious death of coffee shop owner Zhong Meibao, known as the "Doll Murder Case," shakes the Horizon Tower. While initial suspects include those linked to her romantically, new evidence reveals dark secrets from her past, pulling her family into the unfolding mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/divNuMfcVFOnZuLXxYQWsoArOXL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107723'),
  ('1071673163945040588', 'A Nagy Duett', 2011, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyQFl4zVlCDro3U06xxhgARBlhU.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:289232'),
  ('816440575978245146', 'A Nearly Normal Family', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', null, 'Anna Platt, Hans Jörnlind', 'Alexandra Karlsson Tyrefors, Lo Kauppi, Björn Bengtsson, Christian Fandango Sundgren, Melisa Ferhatovic, Håkan Bengtsson, Vera Olin, Cedomir Glisovic', 'TV-MA', 'The world of a seemingly perfect family shatters when a shocking murder proves that they''re willing to make desperate moves to protect one another.', 'The world of a seemingly perfect family shatters when a shocking murder proves that they''re willing to make desperate moves to protect one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oXQZaoKFYXkSTRBXeerj4MJ5eXQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:235571'),
  ('373584550158655453', 'A Nero Wolfe Mystery', 2001, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'Maury Chaykin, Timothy Hutton, Colin Fox, Bill Smitrovich', 'TV-PG', 'Genius detective Nero Wolfe and his right-hand man, Archie Goodwin, solve seemingly impossible crimes.', 'Genius detective Nero Wolfe and his right-hand man, Archie Goodwin, solve seemingly impossible crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/VT1DGePeuqweHp13Ce6b3PnTXr.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1205'),
  ('950502514153043805', 'A Ninja and an Assassin Under One Roof', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Haruna Mikawa, Kana Hanazawa, Yu Serizawa, Eri Kitamura, Rumi Okubo', 'TV-14', 'On the way home from school one day, Konoha Koga rescues Satoko Kusagakure, a ninja who escaped her village. Soon, pursuers from the village show up in search of Satoko only to be deftly dealt with by Konoha. As it turns out, the unassuming high schooler is actually an assassin. Thus, the potentially cutthroat cohabitation of a ninja and an assassin begins!', 'On the way home from school one day, Konoha Koga rescues Satoko Kusagakure, a ninja who escaped her village. Soon, pursuers from the village show up in search of Satoko only to be deftly dealt with by Konoha. As it turns out, the unassuming high schooler is actually an assassin. Thus, the potentially cutthroat cohabitation of a ninja and an assassin begins!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9D0Wnq426kYQpizGU3McFqxOXPe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278050'),
  ('987385283861110416', 'A Nobody''s Way Up to an Exploration Hero', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kana Hanazawa, Yuya Hozumi, Azumi Waki, Mayu Sagara, Yoshino Aoyama, Saika Kitamori, Ryotaro Okiayu, Akari Miyazaki', 'TV-14', 'Meet Kaito Takagi, your typical high schooler with a low profile. He spends his days exploring dungeons in Japan, hunting slimes for some extra cash. On the side, he quietly admires his childhood friend, the popular girl in class. One day, a rare golden slime shows up, and after Kaito defeats it, he finds a super valuable item—a card that can summon mythical beings! He decides to use it and summons a stunning warrior maiden. Now, Kaito has a chance to rise above his ordinary explorer life. Get ready for a modern fantasy story filled with battles!', 'Meet Kaito Takagi, your typical high schooler with a low profile. He spends his days exploring dungeons in Japan, hunting slimes for some extra cash. On the side, he quietly admires his childhood friend, the popular girl in class. One day, a rare golden slime shows up, and after Kaito defeats it, he finds a super valuable item—a card that can summon mythical beings! He decides to use it and summons a stunning warrior maiden. Now, Kaito has a chance to rise above his ordinary explorer life. Get ready for a modern fantasy story filled with battles!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x64bUD0D2K5h5z5IKGHaMJlrZ0e.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:244620'),
  ('379681490991880998', 'A Nobreza do Amor', 2026, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Soap', 'Duca Rachid, Júlio Fischer, Elísio Lopes Jr.', 'Dimas Novais, Duca Rachid, Júlio Fischer', 'Duda Santos, Ronald Sotto, Lázaro Ramos, Nicolas Prattes, Erika Januza, Rodrigo Simas, Zezé Motta, Cássio Gabus Mendes', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKWeDBBVlFTeBjCJKr9Dc7A1OGz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:301557'),
  ('16950990453934993', 'A Passionate Woman', 2010, 'Drama', null, 'Kay Mellor', 'Sue Johnston, Billie Piper, Joe Armstrong, Alun Armstrong, Theo James, Kelly Harrison', null, '1950s period drama based on the true story of a housewife and mother whose life is turned upside down by a handsome Polish man at her local dance hall.', '1950s period drama based on the true story of a housewife and mother whose life is turned upside down by a handsome Polish man at her local dance hall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2R9hvtCrmw00VT9EkAZmR9VtP53.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35115'),
  ('290289337404071575', 'A Patch by Lundini', 2020, 'Comedy, Talk', 'Valerio Lundini, Giovanni Benincasa', null, 'Valerio Lundini, Emanuela Fanelli', null, 'A patch is something commonly used to cover a hole in a dress. Valerio Lundini is a Roman surrealist comedian, who is called every night to replace a programme that, for various reasons, cannot go on air -- he basically puts "a patch" in a TV schedule. But can he?', 'A patch is something commonly used to cover a hole in a dress. Valerio Lundini is a Roman surrealist comedian, who is called every night to replace a programme that, for various reasons, cannot go on air -- he basically puts "a patch" in a TV schedule. But can he?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1nFVXPgfKDKTESQKAzrMIcdZcOs.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:112364'),
  ('889619246485438425', 'A Perfect Crime', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Christian Beetz, Georg Tschurtschenthaler', null, 'Oliver Reissig, Beate Malkus, Tom Pilath, Juliane Werner, Peter Miklusz, Alfred Hartung, Tobias Kasimirowicz', null, 'In April 1991, Detlev Rohwedder, the head of Treuhand, the East German Privatization and Restructuring Agency, was assassinated in Dusseldorf. This documentary details the strange evidence recovered.', 'In April 1991, Detlev Rohwedder, the head of Treuhand, the East German Privatization and Restructuring Agency, was assassinated in Dusseldorf. This documentary details the strange evidence recovered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2g4LcosEOoEOxD2ICeIlw5agMJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110412'),
  ('309687631750682330', 'A Perfect Planet', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'David Attenborough', 'TV-PG', 'A unique fusion of blue chip natural history and earth science that explains how our living planet operates. This five-part series shows how the forces of nature drive, shape and support Earth’s great diversity of wildlife.', 'A unique fusion of blue chip natural history and earth science that explains how our living planet operates. This five-part series shows how the forces of nature drive, shape and support Earth’s great diversity of wildlife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8JJa4gduVytwpXQzFtZNibRA6S.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:115194'),
  ('255740019244784311', 'A Perfect Spy', 1987, 'Drama', 'Arthur Hopcraft, John le Carré', 'Arthur Hopcraft', 'Peter Egan, Ray McAnally, Alan Howard, Rüdiger Weigang, Peggy Ashcroft, Jane Booker, Tim Healy', null, 'The life of British MI6 spy Magnus Pym, from his school days to his mysterious disappearance.', 'The life of British MI6 spy Magnus Pym, from his school days to his mysterious disappearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5tn1nOS2obvjKJCrQt37rTYp56h.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34344'),
  ('290726002209178482', 'A Perfect Story', 2023, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Anna Castillo, Álvaro Mel', 'TV-MA', 'When Margot flees her own wedding, she is left feeling adrift. Little does she know, it is David and his delightful chaos who can help her find her way.', 'When Margot flees her own wedding, she is left feeling adrift. Little does she know, it is David and his delightful chaos who can help her find her way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSowy1T1FmIQKN7n2ftDwy5d4mM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:226216'),
  ('702424299399922486', 'A Personal Journey with Martin Scorsese Through American Movies', 1995, 'Documentary', null, 'Martin Scorsese, Michael Henry Wilson', 'Martin Scorsese', null, 'Filmmaker Martin Scorsese celebrates US movies from the silent classics to the Hollywood of the seventies.', 'Filmmaker Martin Scorsese celebrates US movies from the silent classics to the Hollywood of the seventies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YKtAPHaXF6n5M3pqMFxmmpSsBO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:153293'),
  ('502484915997632245', 'A Piece of Your Mind', 2020, 'Drama', 'Lee Suk-yeon', 'Lee Suk-yeon', 'Jung Hae-in, Chae Soo-bin, Lee Ha-na, Kim Sung-kyu, Woo Ji-hyun, Lee Sang-hee, Park Ju-hyun, Kang Bong-sung', null, 'Moon Ha-won is an AI programmer and he is the founder of AH Company. He is a consistent person with a good heart. Meanwhile, Han Seo-woo works as a classical music recording engineer. Her life is unstable without a family or house, but she is a positive person.', 'Moon Ha-won is an AI programmer and he is the founder of AH Company. He is a consistent person with a good heart. Meanwhile, Han Seo-woo works as a classical music recording engineer. Her life is unstable without a family or house, but she is a positive person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u25Bd08J1kdsLXdHymXkFJsseV7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99112'),
  ('224271558753793093', 'A Place Further than the Universe', 2018, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Inori Minase, Kana Hanazawa, Yuka Iguchi, Saori Hayami', null, 'Scenery that we have never seen. Sounds that we have never heard. Scent that we have never smelled. Food that we have never tasted. And the surge of emotion that we have never experienced. This is the expedition of recollecting the pieces torn apart and sensation left alone. When we reach that place, what will we think? Howling, 40 degree angle. Raging, 50 degree angle. Shouting, 60 degree angle. A wilderness beyond the heavy sea. The furthest south, far from civilization. At the top of the Earth. We will find lights through the girls'' eyes to live tomorrow.', 'Scenery that we have never seen. Sounds that we have never heard. Scent that we have never smelled. Food that we have never tasted. And the surge of emotion that we have never experienced. This is the expedition of recollecting the pieces torn apart and sensation left alone. When we reach that place, what will we think? Howling, 40 degree angle. Raging, 50 degree angle. Shouting, 60 degree angle. A wilderness beyond the heavy sea. The furthest south, far from civilization. At the top of the Earth. We will find lights through the girls'' eyes to live tomorrow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7FxjyLe7co1U8xLYYkpLbXfkTh1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76059'),
  ('836948023610129849', 'A Place to Call Home', 2013, 'Drama, Soap', 'Bevan Lee', null, 'Marta Dusseldorp, Noni Hazlehurst, Brett Climo, Craig Hall, David Berry, Arianwen Parkes-Lockwood, Abby Earl, Sara Wiseman', 'TV-PG', 'A mysterious woman is perched between the harsh legacy of World War II and the hope of a new life in Australia. A sweeping romantic drama set in 1950s rural Australia following the lives of the Blighs, a wealthy and complicated pastoralist family, who lives in Inverness, NSW.', 'A mysterious woman is perched between the harsh legacy of World War II and the hope of a new life in Australia. A sweeping romantic drama set in 1950s rural Australia following the lives of the Blighs, a wealthy and complicated pastoralist family, who lives in Inverness, NSW.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctjoNliuHbsRK3asfSjP7z8qhum.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:47335');
insert into temp_tv_shows_seed (id, title, year, genre, creator, writers, cast_members, age_rating, overview, synopsis, poster_url, seasons, source_key)
values
  ('1150045201553967673', 'A Playthrough of a Certain Dude''s VRMMO Life', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kaito Ishikawa, Daisuke Namikawa, Reina Ueda, Tasuku Hatanaka, Miho Okasaki, Shiori Izawa', 'TV-14', 'Taichi Tanaka is just an ordinary 38-year-old who enjoys video games. He starts a new virtual reality multiplayer game called One More Free Life Online, naming his character Earth. Unlike his fellow players, he decides to master the most menial of skills in the game. He cooks the finest meals, overbrews complicated potions, and hunts monsters with handmade weapons. His fantasy life begins!', 'Taichi Tanaka is just an ordinary 38-year-old who enjoys video games. He starts a new virtual reality multiplayer game called One More Free Life Online, naming his character Earth. Unlike his fellow players, he decides to master the most menial of skills in the game. He cooks the finest meals, overbrews complicated potions, and hunts monsters with handmade weapons. His fantasy life begins!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g7bI6JkJ1VhlxgqEZpaWMLlEJ5Q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:229610'),
  ('572714100878385183', 'A Poem A Day', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Lee Yu-bi, Lee Jun-hyuk, Jang Dong-yoon, Shin Jae-ha, Lee Chae-young, Kim Jae-beom, Defconn, Park Sun-ho', null, 'Story follows a group of physical therapists, nurses, radiological technologists and trainees. Ye Jae-Wook works as a physical therapist and also teaches in the same field. He begins to work as a team leader at a hospital. Woo Bo-Young has been working as a physical therapist for 3 years. She wanted to become a poet, but due to her poor family background she studied to become a physical therapist. Shin Min-Ho is a trainee, but he isn''t interested in physical therapy. His grades weren''t good enough for medical school and his parents, who are both doctors, made him study physical therapy.', 'Story follows a group of physical therapists, nurses, radiological technologists and trainees. Ye Jae-Wook works as a physical therapist and also teaches in the same field. He begins to work as a team leader at a hospital. Woo Bo-Young has been working as a physical therapist for 3 years. She wanted to become a poet, but due to her poor family background she studied to become a physical therapist. Shin Min-Ho is a trainee, but he isn''t interested in physical therapy. His grades weren''t good enough for medical school and his parents, who are both doctors, made him study physical therapy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogYCFZ0qTHbRGPYauOIVVOSPurj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78060'),
  ('1065076370857180783', 'A Polish Family', 2011, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Tomasz Karolak, Małgorzata Kożuchowska, Maciej Musiał, Adam Zdrójkowski, Mateusz Pawłowski, Jacek Braciak, Agata Kulesza, Julia Wieniawa', null, 'Ludwik and Natalia Boski navigate the chaos of raising three children while also managing their busy careers.', 'Ludwik and Natalia Boski navigate the chaos of raising three children while also managing their busy careers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mlDzytURLa1AOSxjgLsyf88Vq3J.jpg', 18, 'tmdb:tv:48175'),
  ('280421529360772174', 'A Predator in a Skirt', 2017, 'Animation', null, null, 'Miho Hayashi, Shiori Satsuki, Koudai Sakai, Yuri Katou', null, 'The story begins when the reserved Shizuka attends a local mixer party but has trouble adjusting to the atmosphere. A beautiful older female college student named Ryou starts talking to her, and the pair hit it off. Shizuka goes to spend the night at Ryou''s place. However, Ryou unexpectedly kisses Shizuka and pushes her down. Shizuka thinks the beautiful woman is a lesbian but soon discovers that Ryou is actually a man dressed as a woman.', 'The story begins when the reserved Shizuka attends a local mixer party but has trouble adjusting to the atmosphere. A beautiful older female college student named Ryou starts talking to her, and the pair hit it off. Shizuka goes to spend the night at Ryou''s place. However, Ryou unexpectedly kisses Shizuka and pushes her down. Shizuka thinks the beautiful woman is a lesbian but soon discovers that Ryou is actually a man dressed as a woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5o2TArFnXPzBvLdH97AOnJCfwW0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72520'),
  ('582160026639351147', 'A priori', 2025, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Benoît Masocco', null, 'Florent Manaudou', null, 'After graduating at the top of her class from the police academy, 27-year-old Iris joins a police station in the south of France. Upon arriving at this brigade of colorful police officers, she receives a less than warm welcome. Her in-depth knowledge of the law and her insistence on following the rules do not sit well with everyone, particularly Victor, 54, her designated partner, a lone wolf cop whose methods are considered outdated. Despite their differences in age and background, when Iris and Victor are assigned a case that seems almost closed in advance, by combining their talents, they discover that it is not a simple traffic accident but a premeditated crime. While their success brings the duo closer together, Victor quickly discovers that Iris is not just anyone''s daughter... What secret from the past threatens to resurface?', 'After graduating at the top of her class from the police academy, 27-year-old Iris joins a police station in the south of France. Upon arriving at this brigade of colorful police officers, she receives a less than warm welcome. Her in-depth knowledge of the law and her insistence on following the rules do not sit well with everyone, particularly Victor, 54, her designated partner, a lone wolf cop whose methods are considered outdated. Despite their differences in age and background, when Iris and Victor are assigned a case that seems almost closed in advance, by combining their talents, they discover that it is not a simple traffic accident but a premeditated crime. While their success brings the duo closer together, Victor quickly discovers that Iris is not just anyone''s daughter... What secret from the past threatens to resurface?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pItxtzVqeZjGbJAB1I9LMnHrofC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:258003'),
  ('231261859186980123', 'A Private Affair', 2022, 'Comedy, Mystery, Drama', 'Teresa Fernández-Valdés, Ramón Campos, Gema R. Neira', null, 'Jean Reno, Aura Garrido, Gorka Otxoa, Pablo Molinero, Álex García, Ángela Molina, Tito Valverde', null, 'Marina Quiroga, a daring upper-class girl with a detective''s soul, sets off to catch the serial killer that has been terrorizing her town with her faithful butler Hector''s help.', 'Marina Quiroga, a daring upper-class girl with a detective''s soul, sets off to catch the serial killer that has been terrorizing her town with her faithful butler Hector''s help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lmGRZEuIQtArmyGjt6Ay5Y74hk2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112321'),
  ('201173294940383169', 'A Professor', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Alessandro D''Alatri', null, 'Alessandro Gassmann, Claudia Pandolfi, Nicolas Maupas, Damiano Gavino, Christiane Filangieri, Francesca Cavallin, Paolo Conticini, Federica Cifola', null, 'Based on the Catalan format Merlí by Hector Lozano, produced by Veranda for TV3 Lagardère Studios Distribution. Dante Balestra is a philosophy teacher who, after many years away, returns to Rome to care for his son Simone. Charming and unconventional, the teacher takes a class at the Leonardo Da Vinci High School, where he applies his unconventional teaching methods and develops a very special relationship with his students, including Simone. But his approach quickly leads to his personal and professional lives becoming confused, and the return from the past of Anita, a former flame of his and now the mother of Manuel, the class "black sheep," makes things even more complicated.', 'Based on the Catalan format Merlí by Hector Lozano, produced by Veranda for TV3 Lagardère Studios Distribution. Dante Balestra is a philosophy teacher who, after many years away, returns to Rome to care for his son Simone. Charming and unconventional, the teacher takes a class at the Leonardo Da Vinci High School, where he applies his unconventional teaching methods and develops a very special relationship with his students, including Simone. But his approach quickly leads to his personal and professional lives becoming confused, and the return from the past of Anita, a former flame of his and now the mother of Manuel, the class "black sheep," makes things even more complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g1Z60kHQ8NsryXtsrXfEysTAQs2.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:138395'),
  ('557435783485817525', 'A Prophet', 2026, 'Crime, Drama', 'Nicolas Peufaillit, Abdel Raouf Dafri', null, 'Mamadou Sidibé, Sami Bouajila, Ouassini Embarek, Matthieu Lucci, Nailia Harzoune, Foued Nabba, Moussa Maaskri, Salim Kéchiouche', null, 'Based on the Academy Award nominated film by EMILIA PÉREZ’s director Jacques Audiard, A PROPHET is a visceral, riveting crime drama about a young African immigrant''s rise to power in Marseille’s brutal underworld.', 'Based on the Academy Award nominated film by EMILIA PÉREZ’s director Jacques Audiard, A PROPHET is a visceral, riveting crime drama about a young African immigrant''s rise to power in Marseille’s brutal underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qupRQOXlxykkFXpXSmuduRqnemg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:224006'),
  ('864062455676899421', 'A Protegida', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Patrícia Müller', 'Patrícia Müller', 'Matilde Reymão, Pedro Sousa, Diogo Morgado, Alexandra Lencastre, Paulo Pires, Maria do Céu Guerra, Fernanda Serrano, Catarina Nifo', null, 'In the heart of the Alentejo countryside, Mariana and José Diogo are two children whose backgrounds could not be more different: she is the fruit of a loving relationship; he''s an orphan. She has a safe haven in her family to run to when she gets hurt; he can only run to her.', 'In the heart of the Alentejo countryside, Mariana and José Diogo are two children whose backgrounds could not be more different: she is the fruit of a loving relationship; he''s an orphan. She has a safe haven in her family to run to when she gets hurt; he can only run to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUcK2iHLuYlAXbq3bEmWmQ93zlc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:274186'),
  ('527479280434144236', 'A Próxima Vítima', 1995, 'Soap, Crime, Drama', 'Silvio de Abreu', 'Alcides Nogueira, Maria Adelaide Amaral, Silvio de Abreu', 'Tony Ramos, José Wilker, Susana Vieira, Lima Duarte, Glória Menezes, Aracy Balabanian, Gianfrancesco Guarnieri, Natália do Vale', null, 'A young law student starts to work as a detective, decided to uncover the identity behind a series of murders, as well as who is next.', 'A young law student starts to work as a detective, decided to uncover the identity behind a series of murders, as well as who is next.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzjDrUCgErrWvjyiTTL6OUYysRA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46121'),
  ('846899379373804430', 'A Pup Named Scooby-Doo', 1988, 'Animation, Mystery, Comedy, Family, Kids', 'Tom Ruegger', null, 'Don Messick, Casey Kasem, Carl Steven, Kellie Martin, Christina Lange, Scott Menville, Lars Thiesgaard, Timm Mehrens', 'TV-G', 'The world''s favorite chicken-hearted canine, as a puppy? That''s right! And the old gang is back with him. Shaggy, Daphne, Velma, and Freddy are all here as gangly kids — goofing off, solving kid-size mysteries, and having run-ins with ghouls, ghosts, and goblins.', 'The world''s favorite chicken-hearted canine, as a puppy? That''s right! And the old gang is back with him. Shaggy, Daphne, Velma, and Freddy are all here as gangly kids — goofing off, solving kid-size mysteries, and having run-ins with ghouls, ghosts, and goblins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KLZCKbql421IIORH1GGQn1R5Qh.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:418'),
