  ('353032301459304858', 'A Recipe for the Heart', 1997, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Lydia Shum Tin-Ha, Jessica Hsuan, Bobby Au-Yeung Tsan-Wah, Maggie Cheung Ho-Yee, Paul Chun Pui, Esther Kwan Wing-Ho, Louis Koo, Miriam Yeung Chin-Wah', null, 'A heartwarming drama about two chefs competing for the coveted title of “Master of All Chefs”, “A Recipe for the Heart” is a delightful combination of gracefully concocted food and great comedy. Shek (Chun Pui) was the chef as well as the owner of the restaurant Delicious Garden. He disappeared after defeating by his good friend Shan (Bobby Au-Yeung) in a cooking contest, leaving behind his wife Yuen (Lydia Shum) and his daughter So So (Esther Kwan). Shan then disguised as Kut to help the two women and inspired So to be a good chef. The two became an odd couple but admired each other. Their relationships got complicated when Song (Jessica Hester Hsuan) claimed to be Kut’s fiancee... .', 'A heartwarming drama about two chefs competing for the coveted title of “Master of All Chefs”, “A Recipe for the Heart” is a delightful combination of gracefully concocted food and great comedy. Shek (Chun Pui) was the chef as well as the owner of the restaurant Delicious Garden. He disappeared after defeating by his good friend Shan (Bobby Au-Yeung) in a cooking contest, leaving behind his wife Yuen (Lydia Shum) and his daughter So So (Esther Kwan). Shan then disguised as Kut to help the two women and inspired So to be a good chef. The two became an odd couple but admired each other. Their relationships got complicated when Song (Jessica Hester Hsuan) claimed to be Kut’s fiancee... .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8VIe6FpoXh1kt0knKJMSEPihHkU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34250'),
  ('536976347824374247', 'A Record of a Mortal''s Journey to Immortality', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Qian Wenqing, Ireine Song, Li Shimeng, Xu Jiaqi, Yang Mo, Gu Jiangshan, Qiao Shiyu, Zhang Fuzheng', 'TV-14', 'A poor and ordinary boy from a village joins a minor sect in Jiang Hu and becomes an Unofficial Disciple by chance. How will Han Li, a commoner by birth, establish a foothold for himself in his sect? With his mediocre aptitude, he must successfully traverse the treacherous path of cultivation and avoid the notice of those who may do him harm. This is a story of an ordinary mortal who, against all odds, clashes with devilish demons and ancient celestials in order to find his own path towards immortality.', 'A poor and ordinary boy from a village joins a minor sect in Jiang Hu and becomes an Unofficial Disciple by chance. How will Han Li, a commoner by birth, establish a foothold for himself in his sect? With his mediocre aptitude, he must successfully traverse the treacherous path of cultivation and avoid the notice of those who may do him harm. This is a story of an ordinary mortal who, against all odds, clashes with devilish demons and ancient celestials in order to find his own path towards immortality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i6SYuRHPtODpZ8VX9ql21nj0tDq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106449'),
  ('384949815568313964', 'A Remarkable Place to Die', 2024, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Philly de Lacey', 'Philly de Lacey', 'Chelsie Preston Crayford, Rebecca Gibney, Indiana Evans, Alex Tarrant, Nathalie Boltt, Matt Whelan, Lucinda Jane Tarrant, Mike Edward', null, 'Anaís Mallory is a smart and savvy homicide investigator who after returning to her hometown, and taking the lead detective position, faces a series of startlingly complex murders with links to her family''s tragic history.', 'Anaís Mallory is a smart and savvy homicide investigator who after returning to her hometown, and taking the lead detective position, faces a series of startlingly complex murders with links to her family''s tragic history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/29qrKi8dK8ppPkwIVkfKvZBwRB9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:275453'),
  ('590870395144321229', 'A Returner''s Magic Should Be Special', 2023, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Takuma Terashima, Sayumi Suzushiro, Natsumi Fujiwara, Asami Seto, Show Hayami', 'TV-14', 'In a land dominated by the formidable Shadow Worlds, most of humanity has been destroyed. To rescue their planet from impending doom, six brave heroes fight a perilous battle…and fail. But there’s a glimpse of hope when Desir, one of the last mages, is suddenly sent back in time 13 years! Now armed with knowledge of the grim future, can he alter the course of history and save the world?', 'In a land dominated by the formidable Shadow Worlds, most of humanity has been destroyed. To rescue their planet from impending doom, six brave heroes fight a perilous battle…and fail. But there’s a glimpse of hope when Desir, one of the last mages, is suddenly sent back in time 13 years! Now armed with knowledge of the grim future, can he alter the course of history and save the world?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svwCvfLCUqc5tn85lijkKqTXQLF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:230050'),
  ('939553175881827398', 'A River Runs Through It', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Jin Yuanyuan', 'Wang Ruichang, Hu Yixuan, Chen Bohao, Qi Yandi, Jiang Zhuojun, Tan Quan', null, 'A coming-of-age story of a group of youths. Xia Xiaoju transfers to a new school just before the high school entrance examinations, and there she forge a friendship with a bunch of classmates. After entering university, Xia Xiaoju begins to fall in love with Cheng Lang, but finds out that Chen Lang likes her close friend Lin You, while Lin You has a crush on Yuan Ancheng. Meanwhile, Xiaoju does not notice that her protector and guardian Lu Shiyi has fallen for her.', 'A coming-of-age story of a group of youths. Xia Xiaoju transfers to a new school just before the high school entrance examinations, and there she forge a friendship with a bunch of classmates. After entering university, Xia Xiaoju begins to fall in love with Cheng Lang, but finds out that Chen Lang likes her close friend Lin You, while Lin You has a crush on Yuan Ancheng. Meanwhile, Xiaoju does not notice that her protector and guardian Lu Shiyi has fallen for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nhbemePry3yWHBr1q0QGMPAvhPi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129496'),
  ('361158504529039494', 'A Romance of the Little Forest', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Vin Zhang, Yu Shuxin, Li Jiaqi, Ding Guansen, Jerron Wu, An Ge, Liu Jieyi', null, 'A story following a botany professor focusing only on research and does not care for fame, money, or love. Meeting a girl he had ill feelings with in the past, their interest in one another develops as she shows off her doctorate knowledge in ornithology.', 'A story following a botany professor focusing only on research and does not care for fame, money, or love. Meeting a girl he had ill feelings with in the past, their interest in one another develops as she shows off her doctorate knowledge in ornithology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXvHtFUV8Nk21RtBQKyi9yk3Qe1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135185'),
  ('453628784313097337', 'A Rooster for Esculapio', 2017, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Sebastián Ortega, Bruno Stagnaro', 'Gabriel Stagnaro', 'Andrea Rincón, Luis Luque, Julieta Ortega, Ariel Staltari, Peter Lanzani, Juan Leyrado', 'NR', 'A young working-class man comes from Misiones (an Argentinian province) to Buenos Aires, with a fighting rooster, looking for his brother, and gets involved with low life characters, who introduce him to a world of crime.', 'A young working-class man comes from Misiones (an Argentinian province) to Buenos Aires, with a fighting rooster, looking for his brother, and gets involved with low life characters, who introduce him to a world of crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNqJgMG0YYUgdlkbUKU6YMIifKG.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:73700'),
  ('534960648018240980', 'A Round of Applause', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Berkun Oya', 'Berkun Oya', 'Aslihan Gurbuz, Fatih Artman', null, 'Struggling with existential angst and longing for his past life in an orange, a man navigates his quirky family in this decades-spanning drama.', 'Struggling with existential angst and longing for his past life in an orange, a man navigates his quirky family in this decades-spanning drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hN53LaEFmHk3O29AlmtjqchwWt0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:244842'),
  ('214382082560067057', 'A Salad Bowl of Eccentrics', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Makoto Furukawa, Hinaki Yano, Mao Ichimichi, You Taichi, Akane Fujita, Manami Numakura, Yuuki Takada, Mizuki Mano', 'TV-14', 'Sosuke Kaburaya is a detective struggling to make ends meet. While on a case, he happens upon Sara da Odin, a princess from another world who wields magical powers. Sara quickly adjusts to modern Japanese life as Livia de Udis, a knight from Sara’s kingdom, arrives to find her. Soon enough, both Sara and Livia’s positivity begins to rub off on Sōsuke and the neighborhood’s cast of characters.', 'Sosuke Kaburaya is a detective struggling to make ends meet. While on a case, he happens upon Sara da Odin, a princess from another world who wields magical powers. Sara quickly adjusts to modern Japanese life as Livia de Udis, a knight from Sara’s kingdom, arrives to find her. Soon enough, both Sara and Livia’s positivity begins to rub off on Sōsuke and the neighborhood’s cast of characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6dumHhfa0BMzjwEZpj9o4uVcGpP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:236392'),
  ('459271793976795524', 'A Sentimental Story', 1994, 'Drama, Family', 'Zhao Baogang', 'Xiaoming Li', 'Wang Zhiwen, Jiang Shan, Zhao Liang, Shi Ke, Liu Bei, Li Chengru', null, 'Fang Yan and Du Mei experience a profound and unforgettable love, just like any other couple, through a series of quarrels, breakups, and reconciliations. Initially, their relationship is rocky. First, Du Mei misunderstands that Fang Yan already has a girlfriend, and later, she subtly hints that she is attending a dance, indirectly inviting Fang Yan to be her partner. However, more misunderstandings follow, leading to a stalemate in their relationship.', 'Fang Yan and Du Mei experience a profound and unforgettable love, just like any other couple, through a series of quarrels, breakups, and reconciliations. Initially, their relationship is rocky. First, Du Mei misunderstands that Fang Yan already has a girlfriend, and later, she subtly hints that she is attending a dance, indirectly inviting Fang Yan to be her partner. However, more misunderstandings follow, leading to a stalemate in their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AjvOcAemqddNl0rSOkLbNQXaBxd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86471'),
  ('200010658339494072', 'A Series of Unfortunate Events', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Family, Comedy, Mystery', 'Barry Sonnenfeld, Daniel Handler', null, 'Neil Patrick Harris, Patrick Warburton, Malina Weissman, Louis Hynes, K. Todd Freeman, Presley Smith', 'TV-PG', 'The orphaned Baudelaire children face trials, tribulations and the evil Count Olaf, all in their quest to uncover the secret of their parents'' death.', 'The orphaned Baudelaire children face trials, tribulations and the evil Count Olaf, all in their quest to uncover the secret of their parents'' death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qg7WXAatXyQq6zO3SnWnRJEayeZ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:65294'),
  ('342531558407303227', 'A Servant of Two Masters', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Zhang Jiayi, Yan Ni, Maggie Jiang, Guan Xiaotong, You Yongzhi, Ta Ji, Sun Hao, Hai Qing', null, 'Yang Shu, a personal driver for businesswoman Tang Hong, faces challenges with his rebellious daughter, Yang Shumiao. Though Tang Hong loves him, their social differences prevent Yang Shu from accepting her. When he meets Gu Qingqing, a woman who resembles his late wife, he finds himself torn between the two women, sparking a series of emotional conflicts.', 'Yang Shu, a personal driver for businesswoman Tang Hong, faces challenges with his rebellious daughter, Yang Shumiao. Though Tang Hong loves him, their social differences prevent Yang Shu from accepting her. When he meets Gu Qingqing, a woman who resembles his late wife, he finds himself torn between the two women, sparking a series of emotional conflicts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/86Rg1OJZvOFWadENzqf0SK9RX1z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91143'),
  ('175350361662435958', 'A Shop for Killers', 2024, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Mystery, Crime', 'E.oni, Lee Kwon', null, 'Lee Dong-wook, Kim Hye-jun, Seo Hyun-woo, Geum Hannah, Park Ji-bin, Jo Han-sun, Lee Tae-young, Min Kim', 'TV-MA', 'A niece who lost her parents and grew up in the hands of an uncle who runs a shopping mall faces a new truth after her uncle''s sudden death.', 'A niece who lost her parents and grew up in the hands of an uncle who runs a shopping mall faces a new truth after her uncle''s sudden death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7yUY1HUyQuybbvkAAhLzQ7x1l9g.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:215072'),
  ('251544375871518749', 'A Shot at Love with Tila Tequila', 2007, 'Reality', null, null, 'Tila Tequila, Amanda Ireton, Dani Campbell', null, 'A Shot at Love with Tila Tequila is an American reality television dating game show similar to the TV show The Bachelor. It premiered on October 9, 2007 on MTV starring Tila Tequila. The series is a bisexual-themed reality dating show where 16 hetero males and 16 lesbian-identified female contestants live in Tequila''s house and compete for her attention and affection. The contestants were not aware of Tequila''s bisexuality until the end of the first episode, after ten contestants had been eliminated. The remaining contestants, both male and female, then shared the same home for the remainder of the series. The ten episode series is produced by 495 Productions and MTV. A Shot at Love II premiered on April 22, 2008.', 'A Shot at Love with Tila Tequila is an American reality television dating game show similar to the TV show The Bachelor. It premiered on October 9, 2007 on MTV starring Tila Tequila. The series is a bisexual-themed reality dating show where 16 hetero males and 16 lesbian-identified female contestants live in Tequila''s house and compete for her attention and affection. The contestants were not aware of Tequila''s bisexuality until the end of the first episode, after ten contestants had been eliminated. The remaining contestants, both male and female, then shared the same home for the remainder of the series. The ten episode series is produced by 495 Productions and MTV. A Shot at Love II premiered on April 22, 2008.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1m5t5KjDW5gLibYUrntBCsAwHqG.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:14420'),
  ('835877746230103556', 'A Shoulder to Cry On', 2023, 'Drama', 'Dong Mul', 'Kang Jae-hyun', 'Kim Jae-han, Shin Ye-chan, Shin Si-ye, Jeong Ho-gyun, Kim Dong-won, Kwon Joo Seok', null, 'Lee Da Yeol is an outsider at school, but an ill-timed run-in with a classmate puts his scholarship in jeopardy.', 'Lee Da Yeol is an outsider at school, but an ill-timed run-in with a classmate puts his scholarship in jeopardy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1TJSkVjupmQ5tEeMrVzIa0Ry1gG.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:220521'),
  ('356806940441147361', 'A Sign of Affection', 2024, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Sumire Morohoshi, Yu Miyazaki, Takeo Otsuka, Kaede Hondo, Ryota Osaka, Nao Toyama, Tasuku Hatanaka', 'TV-14', 'Yuki Itose is just a typical student dealing with the pressures of college. She is struggling one day on the train when an upperclassman named Itsuomi Nagi helps her out. As he gradually opens a new world to her, Yuki develops feelings for Itsuomi. A pure love story begins to grow.', 'Yuki Itose is just a typical student dealing with the pressures of college. She is struggling one day on the train when an upperclassman named Itsuomi Nagi helps her out. As he gradually opens a new world to her, Yuki develops feelings for Itsuomi. A pure love story begins to grow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ntgph4kCtxzDsVQIK2gJfrG3PyM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:230059'),
  ('451691422596549592', 'A Sinister Sect: Colonia Dignidad', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'A colony of German Christians with a charismatic and manipulative leader establishes itself in Chile and becomes instrumental to the dictatorship.', 'A colony of German Christians with a charismatic and manipulative leader establishes itself in Chile and becomes instrumental to the dictatorship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNELomN08aduocxuxcQtQ6JAS8i.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:133089'),
  ('856852578719889602', 'A Sister''s All You Need', 2017, 'Comedy, Animation', null, null, 'Satoshi Hino, Hisako Kanemoto, Akane Fujita, Kohsuke Toriumi, Manami Numakura, Ai Kakuma, Chinatsu Akasaki, Yusuke Kobayashi', 'TV-MA', 'Itsuki Hashima is a light novelist obsessed with little sisters, strictly focusing on them when he writes his stories. Despite his personality, he''s surrounded by a tight circle of friends, including a beautiful genius writer who loves him, a big-sisterly college classmate, a fellow male writer, a sadistic tax accountant, his editor, and Chihiro, his perfect younger step-brother who takes care of the housework and cooking. As the story progresses, the underlying conflicts of dreams and goals surface, as each character attempts to achieve their dreams, in their own way.', 'Itsuki Hashima is a light novelist obsessed with little sisters, strictly focusing on them when he writes his stories. Despite his personality, he''s surrounded by a tight circle of friends, including a beautiful genius writer who loves him, a big-sisterly college classmate, a fellow male writer, a sadistic tax accountant, his editor, and Chihiro, his perfect younger step-brother who takes care of the housework and cooking. As the story progresses, the underlying conflicts of dreams and goals surface, as each character attempts to achieve their dreams, in their own way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxRDq6TlaZSO1qZbtYI3N3karrm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74092'),
  ('925321653738288952', 'A Small Light', 2023, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Joan Rater, Tony Phelan', 'Ben Esler, Alyssa Margarite Jacobson', 'Bel Powley, Joe Cole, Liev Schreiber, Amira Casar, Billie Boullet, Ashley Brooke, Ian McElhinney, Sally Messham', 'TV-14', 'Miep Gies didn''t hesitate when her boss Otto Frank came to her and asked her to hide his family from the Nazis during World War II. For the next two years, Miep, her husband Jan, and the other helpers watched over the eight souls in hiding in the Secret Annex. And it was Miep who found Anne''s Diary and kept it safe so Otto, the only one of the eight who survived, could later share it with the world as one of the most powerful accounts of the Holocaust.', 'Miep Gies didn''t hesitate when her boss Otto Frank came to her and asked her to hide his family from the Nazis during World War II. For the next two years, Miep, her husband Jan, and the other helpers watched over the eight souls in hiding in the Secret Annex. And it was Miep who found Anne''s Diary and kept it safe so Otto, the only one of the eight who survived, could later share it with the world as one of the most powerful accounts of the Holocaust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ksDDvTxUp07yu8FdOAXwJeyTilu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157160'),
  ('116115910643608232', 'A Smiling Ghost Story', 1999, 'Drama', null, null, 'Maggie Cheung Ho-Yee, Roger Kwok Chun-On, Monica Chan Fat-Yung, Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Jerry Lamb Hiu-Fung, Felix Lok Ying-Kwan, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Wong Hoi-Yan', null, 'Lam Ka Yi is a kindhearted girl who was electrocuted while saving a kid from a falling signboard. Passerby Ku Dak Ming tries to revive her through mouth-to-mouth resuscitation, but fails to bring her back to life. However, this incident causes Ka Yi''s spirit and Dak Ming to have a special link. Thus, when Ka Yi learns that her future parents are actually her cousin Man Siu Ying and Dak Ming''s best friend Fong Chi Lung who are loggerheads, she tries to get Dak Ming to help bring them together, much to his frustration. Nevertheless, Ka Yi and Dak Ming found themselves falling for each other over time; but can a ghost-human relationship work out?', 'Lam Ka Yi is a kindhearted girl who was electrocuted while saving a kid from a falling signboard. Passerby Ku Dak Ming tries to revive her through mouth-to-mouth resuscitation, but fails to bring her back to life. However, this incident causes Ka Yi''s spirit and Dak Ming to have a special link. Thus, when Ka Yi learns that her future parents are actually her cousin Man Siu Ying and Dak Ming''s best friend Fong Chi Lung who are loggerheads, she tries to get Dak Ming to help bring them together, much to his frustration. Nevertheless, Ka Yi and Dak Ming found themselves falling for each other over time; but can a ghost-human relationship work out?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rOekRJERMfpt4tJrrLi1R03ytb8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:101334'),
  ('815050847988960737', 'A Splendid Life in Beijing', 2017, 'Drama', null, null, 'Jiang Wu, Qu Zheming, Che Xiao, Jill Hsu, Zhang Jiayi, Guo Jinglin, Sun Yi, Danni Chong', null, 'On April 26, 1970, the third boy (Guo Jinglin) of the Guo family in Beijing''s Hutong was born. However, in a slapstick, Big Brother (Jiang Wu) but lost his knife with a knife to the neighbor''s older son David directly stabbed his brother paid for their actions. After being released from prison, big brother experience another trough of life, decided to abandon everything, go alone to the prairie. Brother (Zhang Jia Yi) from the initial sale of green bean sprouts to start doing business, from the business apparel factory to invest in stocks, repeated defeats, repeated defeats. His insistence for business just as much about his mind to Miss Er. After graduating, the third directly devoted himself to the stock market. Under the leadership of his master, he continued to grow and finally became independent. Once, he fell into two feelings can not choose, and ultimately go alone to Hainan. Youngest fourth son (Qu Zheming) suffering from congenital asthma, stuttering. In order not to drag the family, exercise themselves, hard tongue twisters and crosstalk, eventually becoming a postman, but also because of this job, find his true love.', 'On April 26, 1970, the third boy (Guo Jinglin) of the Guo family in Beijing''s Hutong was born. However, in a slapstick, Big Brother (Jiang Wu) but lost his knife with a knife to the neighbor''s older son David directly stabbed his brother paid for their actions. After being released from prison, big brother experience another trough of life, decided to abandon everything, go alone to the prairie. Brother (Zhang Jia Yi) from the initial sale of green bean sprouts to start doing business, from the business apparel factory to invest in stocks, repeated defeats, repeated defeats. His insistence for business just as much about his mind to Miss Er. After graduating, the third directly devoted himself to the stock market. Under the leadership of his master, he continued to grow and finally became independent. Once, he fell into two feelings can not choose, and ultimately go alone to Hainan. Youngest fourth son (Qu Zheming) suffering from congenital asthma, stuttering. In order not to drag the family, exercise themselves, hard tongue twisters and crosstalk, eventually becoming a postman, but also because of this job, find his true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hgHUE0YBrBDK3iT73KAWtdA7o5N.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81306'),
  ('736485329225766722', 'A Spy Among Friends', 2022, 'War & Politics, Drama', 'Ben Macintyre, Alexander Cary', null, 'Guy Pearce, Damian Lewis, Anna Maxwell Martin, Stephen Kunken, Adrian Edmondson, Nicholas Rowe, Monika Gossmann', 'TV-MA', 'Follow the defection of notorious British intelligence officer and KGB double agent, Kim Philby, through the lens of his complex relationship with MI6 colleague and close friend, Nicholas Elliott.', 'Follow the defection of notorious British intelligence officer and KGB double agent, Kim Philby, through the lens of his complex relationship with MI6 colleague and close friend, Nicholas Elliott.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWB27W5tuNiRBJbVIbxI68q0buP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138624'),
  ('235721625110582308', 'A Star Brighter than the Sun', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Minori Fujidera, Yuki Ono, Hina Youmiya, Taito Ban, Mutsumi Tamura, Ryota Osaka, Haruka Shiraishi', null, 'Sae Iwata, a slightly tougher-than-average girl, falls for the gentle smile of Koki Kamishiro, a delicate boy, back in elementary school. By the time they enter junior high school, Koki has grown into a charming and popular teen who now feels out of reach. When they are assigned to the sports festival committee together, Sae’s long-hidden first love begins to stir once more.', 'Sae Iwata, a slightly tougher-than-average girl, falls for the gentle smile of Koki Kamishiro, a delicate boy, back in elementary school. By the time they enter junior high school, Koki has grown into a charming and popular teen who now feels out of reach. When they are assigned to the sports festival committee together, Sae’s long-hidden first love begins to stir once more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tMCyjS1Qif5VhmRakSJpF0TzdQj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:283818'),
  ('281550667441922271', 'A Step Into The Past', 2001, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Wai-kin Chong', 'Kwok Fai Huang', 'Louis Koo, Kwong Wa, Jessica Hsuan, Sonija Kwok Sin-Nae, Raymond Lam Fung, Joyce Tang Lai-Ming, Michelle Saram, Waise Lee Chi-Hung', null, 'A Step into the Past is a 2001 Hong Kong television series produced by TVB and based on Huang Yi''s novel of the same Chinese title. The series tells the story of a 21st-century Hong Kong VIPPU officer who travels back in time to the Warring States period of ancient China. He is involved in a number of important historical events that leads to the first unification of China under the Qin Dynasty. The series'' first original broadcast ran from 15 October to 7 December 2001 on the TVB Jade network in Hong Kong.', 'A Step into the Past is a 2001 Hong Kong television series produced by TVB and based on Huang Yi''s novel of the same Chinese title. The series tells the story of a 21st-century Hong Kong VIPPU officer who travels back in time to the Warring States period of ancient China. He is involved in a number of important historical events that leads to the first unification of China under the Qin Dynasty. The series'' first original broadcast ran from 15 October to 7 December 2001 on the TVB Jade network in Hong Kong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjg1nz7Cp1DBOftKOhFiWwlKfGm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1375'),
  ('434994281852021519', 'A Storm for Christmas', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Per-Olav Sørensen, Lars Saabye Christensen', 'Per-Olav Sørensen, Lars Saabye Christensen, Jan Trygve Røyneland', 'Ida Elise Broch, Dennis Storhøi, Maibritt Saerens, Jon Øigarden, Jan Gunnar Røise, Thea Sofie Loch Næss, Evelyn Rasmussen Osazuwa, Ariadna Cabrol', null, 'A group of people arrive at Oslo airport. Some to welcome their loved ones, some to fly home to their families, and some who want to fly away and escape Christmas. But in one way or another, their Christmas mission goes awry. They are all stranded at the airport and the clock is ticking… only 24 hours till Christmas – so what do they do?', 'A group of people arrive at Oslo airport. Some to welcome their loved ones, some to fly home to their families, and some who want to fly away and escape Christmas. But in one way or another, their Christmas mission goes awry. They are all stranded at the airport and the clock is ticking… only 24 hours till Christmas – so what do they do?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ljsMCs9tDuEOfm2LGn2Qf1OLKeR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210532'),
  ('976092724150299113', 'A Story to Read When You First Fall in Love', 2019, 'Drama', 'Tomoko Yoshizawa', null, 'Kyoko Fukada, Ryusei Yokohama, Kento Nagayama, Tomoya Nakamura, Fumi Dan, Kenjirou Ishimaru, Katsuhisa Namase, Yo Takahashi', null, 'Junko Harumi was once a model student during her middle school and high school days. She failed to enter prestigious Tokyo University and her life has not gone smoothly since then. She has a hard time finding a job and having relationships with men. Now, at the age of 31, she works as a teacher at a private institute. 3 men, who vary in type, appear in front of her. Masashi Yakumo is smart and a cousin of Junko, Kyohei Yuri is a disorderly high school student and Kazuma Yamashita is Kyohei ’s teacher in high school.', 'Junko Harumi was once a model student during her middle school and high school days. She failed to enter prestigious Tokyo University and her life has not gone smoothly since then. She has a hard time finding a job and having relationships with men. Now, at the age of 31, she works as a teacher at a private institute. 3 men, who vary in type, appear in front of her. Masashi Yakumo is smart and a cousin of Junko, Kyohei Yuri is a disorderly high school student and Kazuma Yamashita is Kyohei ’s teacher in high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wX7cVm7xoHqSZyui1GsZ1pIZsSy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86066'),
  ('77894537871276638', 'A Suffocatingly Lonely Death', 2024, 'Drama', 'Okamoto Koichi, Eisuke Naito, Ninomiya Takashi', null, 'Ryo Narita, Ai Yoshikawa, Fumiyo Kohinata, Meisa Kuroki, Taiki Sato, Riku Hagiwara, Toru Nomaguchi, Bambi Naka', null, 'The suspense story begins when Jin Saeki, a policeman in Yamanashi Prefecture, arrives at a prominent estate residence in response to a tip, and finds the skeletal remains of 13 children, as well as a mysterious marking. Jūzō Haikawa, the long-missing owner of the estate, immediately becomes the prime suspect. Saeki collaborates with a woman named Kanon Hasumi, who has a connection to Haikawa, and together they search for the truth behind the case. In a parallel story set in Tokyo seven years after the case, a girl with a connection to the mark left on the Haikawa estate runs away from home.', 'The suspense story begins when Jin Saeki, a policeman in Yamanashi Prefecture, arrives at a prominent estate residence in response to a tip, and finds the skeletal remains of 13 children, as well as a mysterious marking. Jūzō Haikawa, the long-missing owner of the estate, immediately becomes the prime suspect. Saeki collaborates with a woman named Kanon Hasumi, who has a connection to Haikawa, and together they search for the truth behind the case. In a parallel story set in Tokyo seven years after the case, a girl with a connection to the mark left on the Haikawa estate runs away from home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kwinkblAwj9jn4h4vWpRZ6GOsDC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:256397'),
  ('969600215464606144', 'A Suitable Boy', 2020, 'Drama', 'Andrew Davies', 'Andrew Davies', 'Tanya Maniktala, Ishaan Khatter, Tabu, Mahira Kakkar, Rasika Dugal, Shahana Goswami, Ram Kapoor, Aamir Bashir', 'TV-14', 'Modernity confronts tradition in 1950s post-Partition India as a young woman resists an arranged marriage in favour of pursuit of love and a politician''s son becomes involved in a transgressive affair.', 'Modernity confronts tradition in 1950s post-Partition India as a young woman resists an arranged marriage in favour of pursuit of love and a politician''s son becomes involved in a transgressive affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rS2osLCatyLuRsrwxfDLheaR3hG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105883'),
  ('952639228554230412', 'A Superior Day', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Lee Ji-hyun', 'Jin Goo, Ha Do-kwon, Lee Won-keun, Im Hwa-young, Na Chul, Yang Hyun-min', null, 'A thriller set in 24 hours where only the superior survives, and the ordinary man who has to save his kidnapped daughter by killing a serial killer.', 'A thriller set in 24 hours where only the superior survives, and the ordinary man who has to save his kidnapped daughter by killing a serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6R0rOAOQHC3TAvLAPk1vdj3ZVAI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138481'),
  ('595621052524374698', 'A Tale Dark & Grimm', 2021, 'Kids, Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Andre Robinson, Raini Rodriguez, Cari Kabinoff, Tom Hollander, Scott Adsit, Ron Funches, Erica Rhodes, Eric Bauza', 'TV-Y7', 'Follow Hansel and Gretel as they walk out of their own story into a winding and wickedly witty tale full of strange — and scary — surprises.', 'Follow Hansel and Gretel as they walk out of their own story into a winding and wickedly witty tale full of strange — and scary — surprises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iiek30wIfp96UR07jkCdrtlOx4x.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:133355'),
  ('627959912910781215', 'A Tale of Thousand Stars', 2021, 'Drama', 'Bacteria', 'Noppharnach Chaiyahwimhon, Pongsate Lucksameepong', 'Sahaphap Wongratch, Pirapat Watthanasetsiri, Sarunchana Apisamaimongkol, Krittanai Arsalprakit, Thanawat Ratanakitpaisan, Sattabut Laedeke, Wittaya Jetapai, Nattharat Kornkaew', null, 'After a heart transplant, Tian follows his donor''s path to the mountains and finds both love and purpose with forest officer Phupha.', 'After a heart transplant, Tian follows his donor''s path to the mountains and finds both love and purpose with forest officer Phupha.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vXiKn65oEwNRVh8qWP4F0GZf3fZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114703'),
  ('107072582270381763', 'A Taste for Murder', 2026, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Matt Baker', null, 'Warren Brown, Phyllis Logan, Beau Gadsdon, Cristiana Dell''Anna, Urbano Barberini, Alessandro Fella, Gaia Scodellaro, Alessandro Bedetti', null, 'Follows DCI Joe Mottram, a star detective with the Metropolitan police who, after a personal tragedy, retreats to Capri in Italy with his daughter to stay with his Italian in-laws for the summer.', 'Follows DCI Joe Mottram, a star detective with the Metropolitan police who, after a personal tragedy, retreats to Capri in Italy with his daughter to stay with his Italian in-laws for the summer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQMSIHR6hPN53h7TILztOZuYOcl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:316835'),
  ('958792380371586567', 'A Taste Gathering', 2023, 'Reality', null, null, 'Yang Di, Yin Zheng', null, 'A Tasty Gathering is a travel reality show where local friends take you to eat authentic food. The MCs will go to the 6 most famous cities for their delicious food in China with local friends. They will taste the most authentic specialties, experience local friends'' favorite entertainment projects and lives. During the 2-day and 1-night journey, they will harvest wonderful food and happiness.', 'A Tasty Gathering is a travel reality show where local friends take you to eat authentic food. The MCs will go to the 6 most famous cities for their delicious food in China with local friends. They will taste the most authentic specialties, experience local friends'' favorite entertainment projects and lives. During the 2-day and 1-night journey, they will harvest wonderful food and happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejLDGoMpma3VUv7wN3lCfowvbd2.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:228667'),
  ('968296395583870171', 'A Teacher', 2020, 'Drama', 'Hannah Fidell', 'Hannah Fidell', 'Kate Mara, Nick Robinson', 'TV-MA', 'Claire Wilson, a young teacher at a suburban Texas high school, begins an affair with her student, Eric Walker. But their relationship accelerates faster than anticipated and the permanent damage becomes impossible to ignore.', 'Claire Wilson, a young teacher at a suburban Texas high school, begins an affair with her student, Eric Walker. But their relationship accelerates faster than anticipated and the permanent damage becomes impossible to ignore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rH2eEuThzRQh87Uxz6SY3BuVNBD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103992'),
  ('1130310815062307871', 'A Terra Prometida', 2016, 'Soap', 'Renato Modesto', 'Renato Modesto, Aimar Labaki', 'Sidney Sampaio, Thais Melchior, Paloma Bernardi, Beth Goulart, Raymundo de Souza, Igor Rickli, Juliana Silveira, Miriam Freeland', 'NR', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9YPIO7IX5EYfjd1LzYYXDXrruF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66825'),
  ('236401383111340781', 'A Terrified Teacher at Ghoul School!', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ryota Osaka, Ryota Suzuki, Reo Tanie, Taito Ban, Akari Kito, Shun Horie, Ryota Iwasaki, Jun Fukuyama', 'TV-14', 'Haruaki Abe is happy to finally fulfill his dream of becoming a teacher. That happiness is short-lived after he arrives at Hyakki Academy and finds out the school is full of monsters! Can Abe overcome his cowardice and get his supernatural students under control? Join the timid teacher and his bizarre class for a tale of ghoulish mischief and paranormal education.', 'Haruaki Abe is happy to finally fulfill his dream of becoming a teacher. That happiness is short-lived after he arrives at Hyakki Academy and finds out the school is full of monsters! Can Abe overcome his cowardice and get his supernatural students under control? Join the timid teacher and his bizarre class for a tale of ghoulish mischief and paranormal education.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/km1hhFIIMOoA2hk6k3UM38WH5yL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259788'),
  ('167679279244709363', 'A Thirty-Year Old''s Health and Physical Education', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Hiro Shimono, Rei Matsuzaki, Ryotaro Okiayu, Kaori Nazuka, Kana Akutsu, Yui Watanabe, Eri Kitamura, Yasumichi Kushida', 'TV-MA', 'Hayao Imagawa is a 30 year-old virgin bachelor. One day, a cupid descends from heaven with the express purpose of forcing him to graduate from virginity. Thus unfolds a pure love story between a 30 year-old bachelor and a 30 year-old bachelorette.', 'Hayao Imagawa is a 30 year-old virgin bachelor. One day, a cupid descends from heaven with the express purpose of forcing him to graduate from virginity. Thus unfolds a pure love story between a 30 year-old bachelor and a 30 year-old bachelorette.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/izvmVfsgwUjxbEBLhM4UL5agJSZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67922'),
  ('911495930912210736', 'A Thousand Blows', 2025, 'Drama', 'Steven Knight', null, 'Malachi Kirby, Erin Doherty, Stephen Graham, Caoilfhionn Dunne, Morgan Hilaire, Jemma Carlton, James Nelson-Joyce, Hannah Walters', 'TV-MA', 'Hezekiah and Alec, two friends from Jamaica, finds themselves thrust into the criminal underbelly of London''s East End. Here they meet Mary Carr, Queen of an all-female criminal gang known as the Forty Elephants, and run afoul of Sugar Goodson, criminal kingpin and notorious boxer.', 'Hezekiah and Alec, two friends from Jamaica, finds themselves thrust into the criminal underbelly of London''s East End. Here they meet Mary Carr, Queen of an all-female criminal gang known as the Forty Elephants, and run afoul of Sugar Goodson, criminal kingpin and notorious boxer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/598wQ3wr0fxpGemkR7ZVFTuHPXg.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:208851'),
  ('617331089080898871', 'A Thousand Fangs', 2021, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Guillermo Escalona, Jaime Osorio Márquez', null, 'Claudio Cataño, Alejandro Buitrago, Hector Sánchez, Andrea Olaya, Jaisson Jeack, Carolina Ribón, Adriano Marquez, Andres Londono', 'TV-MA', 'An elite commando is on a mission, deep in the jungle, to find and destroy a powerful and mysterious leader.', 'An elite commando is on a mission, deep in the jungle, to find and destroy a powerful and mysterious leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tayfazRzkhpyKAhKS6PALXKJUj1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135385'),
  ('943050889721216144', 'A Time Called You', 2023, 'Drama', 'Kim Jin-won, Choi Hyo-bi', null, 'Ahn Hyo-seop, Jeon Yeo-been, Kang Hoon, Jang Hye-jin, Park Hyuk-kwon, Yun Sang-jeong, Han Ji-won, Song Ji-woo', 'TV-MA', 'A grieving woman magically travels through time to 1998, where she meets a man with an uncanny resemblance to her late love.', 'A grieving woman magically travels through time to 1998, where she meets a man with an uncanny resemblance to her late love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5Rmy2xJekCNY7raZEjpYPyhf6h.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:196474'),
