  ('867862626763182221', 'A to Z', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Ben Queen', null, 'Ben Feldman, Cristin Milioti, Henry Zebrowski, Lenora Crichlow, Christina Kirk, Katey Sagal', 'TV-14', 'The story follows the lives of Andrew, an employee at an internet dating site who dreams of meeting the girl of his dreams, and Zelda, a no-nonsense lawyer who was raised by a hippie mother and carries a rebellious streak. By an accidental chance of fate, Zelda meets Andrew to resolve a mismatch dating dispute and these two single people suddenly find themselves falling for each other.', 'The story follows the lives of Andrew, an employee at an internet dating site who dreams of meeting the girl of his dreams, and Zelda, a no-nonsense lawyer who was raised by a hippie mother and carries a rebellious streak. By an accidental chance of fate, Zelda meets Andrew to resolve a mismatch dating dispute and these two single people suddenly find themselves falling for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVamVIBP8JoKfPRBbmFCtmHF0nv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61268'),
  ('894085666626524511', 'A Touch of Cloth', 2012, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Charlie Brooker, Boris Starling', null, 'John Hannah, Suranne Jones, Julian Rhind-Tutt, Adrian Bower, Navin Chowdhry, Daisy Beaumont, Theo Barklem-Biggs', 'TV-14', 'Hannah plays DI Jack Cloth, who is called in to investigate an apparent series of serial killings alongside his new partner, DC Anne Oldman, described as a "plucky, no-nonsense sidekick". Playing with the cliches and conventions of British police dramas, subplots include Cloth dealing with visions of his dead wife and the bisexual DC Oldman coming to grips with her feelings for both her female fiancee and Cloth.', 'Hannah plays DI Jack Cloth, who is called in to investigate an apparent series of serial killings alongside his new partner, DC Anne Oldman, described as a "plucky, no-nonsense sidekick". Playing with the cliches and conventions of British police dramas, subplots include Cloth dealing with visions of his dead wife and the bisexual DC Oldman coming to grips with her feelings for both her female fiancee and Cloth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMSkzU1yWltiqY1cqMgJDWFmWkc.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:45482'),
  ('746722519316071860', 'A Touch of Frost', 1992, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Roger Bamford', null, 'David Jason, David McKail, David Gooderson, Caroline Harker, Bruce Alexander, John Lyons', null, 'Jack Frost is a gritty, dogged and unconventional detective with sympathy for the underdog and an instinct for moral justice who attracts trouble like a magnet. Despite some animosity with his superintendent, Norman “Horn-rimmed Harry” Mullett, Frost and his ever-changing roster of assistants manage to solve cases via his clever mind, good heart, and cool touch.', 'Jack Frost is a gritty, dogged and unconventional detective with sympathy for the underdog and an instinct for moral justice who attracts trouble like a magnet. Despite some animosity with his superintendent, Norman “Horn-rimmed Harry” Mullett, Frost and his ever-changing roster of assistants manage to solve cases via his clever mind, good heart, and cool touch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dgpUNSkIWdU1i9vjc7MQPfGBFLo.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:2474'),
  ('887593900000492204', 'A Touch of Green', 2015, 'Drama, Family', 'Jui-Yuan Tsao', null, 'Cheryl Yang, Weber Yang, Tien Hsin, Gabriel Lan, Lien Yu-han, Wu Kang-ren, Hans Chung, Chen-Ling Wen', null, 'The drama tells the story of air force pilots and their families from 1945 to 1971. As the husbands embarked on patriotic missions to fight against the enemies, their families must content with horror of wars, mass emigration to distant land, and death of love ones. Their shared experience brought the military families together to support one another.', 'The drama tells the story of air force pilots and their families from 1945 to 1971. As the husbands embarked on patriotic missions to fight against the enemies, their families must content with horror of wars, mass emigration to distant land, and death of love ones. Their shared experience brought the military families together to support one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qxinfcqL3GoMW0gjyMTHm8MNnCr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70432'),
  ('793915341055735413', 'A Town Called Malice', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', 'Nick Love', null, 'Jack Rowan, Tahirah Sharif, Eliza Butterworth, Daniel Sharman, Lex Shrapnel, George Jaques, Jason Flemyng, Martha Plimpton', null, 'Set amongst the beach clubs and palm trees of the Costa del Sol in the early 80s, A Town Called Malice follows the Lords, a crime family of petty thieves from South London, as they decamp from London to Spain to profit from an unexpected windfall – and to escape the attention of the police in a high-profile murder enquiry.', 'Set amongst the beach clubs and palm trees of the Costa del Sol in the early 80s, A Town Called Malice follows the Lords, a crime family of petty thieves from South London, as they decamp from London to Spain to profit from an unexpected windfall – and to escape the attention of the police in a high-profile murder enquiry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c2airHR0f50H3NA6V1649rznOYS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:194632'),
  ('687822964336838975', 'A Town Called Panic', 2002, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Stéphane Aubier, Vincent Patar', null, 'Stéphane Aubier, Vincent Patar, Bruce Ellison, Bouli Lanners, Benoît Poelvoorde, Christian Hecq, Véronique Dumont, Frédéric Jannin', null, 'Follows the everyday events of Cowboy, Indian and Horse in a small rural town as they go about their lives.', 'Follows the everyday events of Cowboy, Indian and Horse in a small rural town as they go about their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f7hPC3O8CATaYxXuNxqUvEv0i33.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11321'),
  ('493254342013575214', 'A Town Where You Live', 2013, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Megumi Nakajima, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Daisuke Ono, Ayane Sakura, Nana Kouno, Sayuri Yahagi', null, 'Haruto Kirishima lived a calm life out in the countryside, away from the fast-paced life of the city. Then Yuzuki Eba appeared in his life out of nowhere, having come from Tokyo to briefly live with her family. Their time together left him enamored with the memories of that short period before she just as abruptly disappeared from his life, and left him full of questions.Kimi no Iru Machi begins some time later, after Haruto moves to Tokyo to live with his sister, in order to pursue a career as a cook. In reality though he wishes to be with Yuzuki. Things don''t start good though. When he arrives he is mistaken for a burglar and attacked by his sister''s neighbour Mishima Asuka. After the misunderstand is cleared his feelings begin to waver though. Is Eba, who keeps avoiding him for seemingly no reason, the one for him or is it Asuka?', 'Haruto Kirishima lived a calm life out in the countryside, away from the fast-paced life of the city. Then Yuzuki Eba appeared in his life out of nowhere, having come from Tokyo to briefly live with her family. Their time together left him enamored with the memories of that short period before she just as abruptly disappeared from his life, and left him full of questions.Kimi no Iru Machi begins some time later, after Haruto moves to Tokyo to live with his sister, in order to pursue a career as a cook. In reality though he wishes to be with Yuzuki. Things don''t start good though. When he arrives he is mistaken for a burglar and attacked by his sister''s neighbour Mishima Asuka. After the misunderstand is cleared his feelings begin to waver though. Is Eba, who keeps avoiding him for seemingly no reason, the one for him or is it Asuka?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vYrzfIc4tBAnm2Q0CPRLTWvNmbd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70228'),
  ('976024120264110226', 'A Town Without Seasons', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Kankuro Kudo', 'Sosuke Ikematsu, Taiga Nakano, Daichi Watanabe, Toko Miura, Gaku Hamada, Maryjun Takahashi, Yoshiyoshi Arakawa, MEGUMI', null, 'It follows a group of people who are still living in temporary housing 12 years after a natural disaster called "Nani" destroyed their town.', 'It follows a group of people who are still living in temporary housing 12 years after a natural disaster called "Nani" destroyed their town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mkFp6eRDhUwpPWqi6QGHIDp8qy3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:226511'),
  ('293667060397080034', 'A Tragedy Foretold: Flight 3054', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'The untold stories and human tragedy behind Latin America''s deadliest air disaster are investigated in this three-part documentary series.', 'The untold stories and human tragedy behind Latin America''s deadliest air disaster are investigated in this three-part documentary series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBZrnnkGliN6QWTj3i6fUSwP7ui.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:287420'),
  ('40269237158648533', 'A Trick of Fate', 2022, 'Soap, Drama', 'Alessandra Poggi', 'Alessandra Poggi, Adriana Chevalier, Letícia Mey', 'Rafael Vitti, Larissa Manoela, Antonio Calloni, Malu Galli, Danilo Mesquita, Bárbara Paz, Marcello Novaes, Palomma Duarte', null, 'After spending ten years wrongfully imprisoned for the death of his girlfriend Elisa, the illusionist Davi returns to the farm that belongs to his girlfriend’s family under another identity and discovers that her younger sister, Isadora, has become exactly like Elisa. The two fall madly in love, but they will have to fight against nasty Joaquim and other external factors that threaten this great passion.', 'After spending ten years wrongfully imprisoned for the death of his girlfriend Elisa, the illusionist Davi returns to the farm that belongs to his girlfriend’s family under another identity and discovers that her younger sister, Isadora, has become exactly like Elisa. The two fall madly in love, but they will have to fight against nasty Joaquim and other external factors that threaten this great passion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ItNPuofB5LoOG4TsXWAiBayfcJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:154911'),
