  ('150976838682121667', 'A Very British Coup', 1988, 'War & Politics, Drama', null, null, 'Ray McAnally, Tim McInnerny, Keith Allen, Christine Kavanagh, Clive Merrison, Hugh Martin, Harmage Singh Kalirai, Stephanie Fayerman', 'NR', 'A Very British Coup is a British political thriller series based on the novel by Chris Mullin. It stars Ray McAnally as the newly elected left-wing prime minister Harry Perkins, who soon finds himself up to his neck in conspiracy.', 'A Very British Coup is a British political thriller series based on the novel by Chris Mullin. It stars Ray McAnally as the newly elected left-wing prime minister Harry Perkins, who soon finds himself up to his neck in conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5KthHbeccVV37Kc74W95ha1rYtA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:29642'),
