  ('536233918619477645', 'A Virtuous Business', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Choi Bo-rim', null, 'Kim So-yeon, Yeon Woo-jin, Kim Sung-ryung, Kim Sun-young, Lee Se-hee, Kim Won-hae, Kim Jeong-jin, Choi Jae-rim', 'TV-MA', 'In search of purpose, opportunity and independence, four rural women start an adult products business in 1992 — embarking on a journey of self-discovery.', 'In search of purpose, opportunity and independence, four rural women start an adult products business in 1992 — embarking on a journey of self-discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQfZZT645qUQang5OB56hRZ6Rir.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:255086'),
  ('631878549277818898', 'A Wild Last Boss Appeared!', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Ami Koshimizu, Yuri Usui, Yukina Shuto, Naoya Uchida, Hisako Tojo, Cocoro Omori', 'TV-14', 'An MMO gamer awakens as the Black-Winged Tyrant, Lufas Maphaahl, rising from her sealed fate—only to find this is very real. Her defeat 200 years ago unleashed monsters of death, and the legend is one of terror. Now, trapped in the body of history''s most feared conqueror, he must survive a world that wants her dead…and uncover why he''s here.', 'An MMO gamer awakens as the Black-Winged Tyrant, Lufas Maphaahl, rising from her sealed fate—only to find this is very real. Her defeat 200 years ago unleashed monsters of death, and the legend is one of terror. Now, trapped in the body of history''s most feared conqueror, he must survive a world that wants her dead…and uncover why he''s here.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xh9lu8gDgzwMBiByTRtTsclluZf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:280042'),
  ('792576934337192484', 'A Wilderness of Error', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Errol Morris', 'TV-MA', 'When Army surgeon Jeffrey MacDonald is sent to prison for killing his family, a storm of swirling narratives challenges our very ability to find the truth all the while overshadowing a chilling possibility: MacDonald may be an innocent man. Based on the best-selling book by Errol Morris.', 'When Army surgeon Jeffrey MacDonald is sent to prison for killing his family, a storm of swirling narratives challenges our very ability to find the truth all the while overshadowing a chilling possibility: MacDonald may be an innocent man. Based on the best-selling book by Errol Morris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cBotXKdOYKEFNmGPW7N0vw0d5Dm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107597'),
  ('783704816131348203', 'A Will Eternal', 2020, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Su Shangqing, Li Shimeng, Guo Haoran, Qiao Shiyu, Chen Zhangtaikang, Shuai Guan, Ma Cheng, Shuang Zhao', null, 'One will to create oceans. One will to summon the mulberry fields. One will to slaughter countless devils. One will to eradicate innumerable immortals. Only my will... is eternal. A Will Eternal tells the tale of Bai Xiaochun, an endearing but exasperating young man who is driven primarily by his fear of death and desire to live forever, but who deeply values friendship and family.', 'One will to create oceans. One will to summon the mulberry fields. One will to slaughter countless devils. One will to eradicate innumerable immortals. Only my will... is eternal. A Will Eternal tells the tale of Bai Xiaochun, an endearing but exasperating young man who is driven primarily by his fear of death and desire to live forever, but who deeply values friendship and family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZUiYywoHiNTgzIN8vBOxxcxzj0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107371'),
  ('1041126091548663601', 'A Woman of Her Own', 2022, 'Drama, Soap', 'Giselle González', null, 'Arap Bethke, Azela Robinson, Livia Brito Pestana, Marcus Ornellas, Carmen Aub, Cynthia Klitbo, Plutarco Haza, Sergio Bonilla', null, 'After her father passed away her stepmother who never loved her (Isaura) treated her cruelly. In spite of that Lucia met Fernando who made her discover what true love is.', 'After her father passed away her stepmother who never loved her (Isaura) treated her cruelly. In spite of that Lucia met Fernando who made her discover what true love is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dgW4EZRxyJfYeiKwoo1UP5ziZfX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203888'),
  ('836735338813553820', 'A Woman Scorned', 2020, 'Drama', null, 'Mike Bartlett, Merve Girgin, Kemal Hamamcıoğlu', 'Cansu Dere, Caner Cindoruk, Melis Sezen, Eren Vurdem, Alp Akar, Taro Emir Tekin, Nazlı Bulum, Yeliz Kuvancı', null, 'Asya is a successful doctor and she has a perfect life with her husband and her son. But after finding a blonde hair on her husband''s scarf, everything changes and she discovers her husband''s extramarital affair.', 'Asya is a successful doctor and she has a perfect life with her husband and her son. But after finding a blonde hair on her husband''s scarf, everything changes and she discovers her husband''s extramarital affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4dD4K0udXVosxOa7wBXpkCKgP1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:110562'),
  ('750830264309145355', 'A World of Calm', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-G', 'A timely antidote for our modern lives, this revolutionary series takes audiences on an immersive audiovisual journey designed to help you relax and transform how you feel. Each episode is brought to life by narration from some of the smoothest voices in Hollywood.', 'A timely antidote for our modern lives, this revolutionary series takes audiences on an immersive audiovisual journey designed to help you relax and transform how you feel. Each episode is brought to life by narration from some of the smoothest voices in Hollywood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mAHwKoRDxL0ZeNdTIBBrzbVYcaA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106081'),
  ('1092407929318136112', 'A Young Doctor''s Notebook', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kenton Allen', null, 'Jon Hamm, Daniel Radcliffe, Adam Godley, Vicki Pepperdine, Rosie Cavaliero', 'TV-MA', 'A young doctor who has graduated at the top of his class from the Moscow State University of Medicine and Dentistry is thrust out into an isolated and impoverished country side as the village''s only doctor. As he learns to adapt to his new lifestyle, he develops a morphine addiction to stay his sanity while realizing what being a doctor in the real world means.', 'A young doctor who has graduated at the top of his class from the Moscow State University of Medicine and Dentistry is thrust out into an isolated and impoverished country side as the village''s only doctor. As he learns to adapt to his new lifestyle, he develops a morphine addiction to stay his sanity while realizing what being a doctor in the real world means.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vIq5UiskJjBFOPKXz8EgxQgGPSR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:47523'),
  ('100701233676366227', 'A-Channel', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Aoi Yuuki, Kaori Fukuhara, Minako Kotobuki, Yumi Uchiyama, Miyuki Sawashiro, Momoko Saito, Minori Chihara, Ai Matayoshi', null, 'Tooru and Run have been best friends forever, so when Tooru learns that she''s managed to get into the same high school as Run, she runs to tell her... only to find Run in a compromising position with yet another girl, Yuko. Needless to say, that makes things a bit awkward at school, with Tooru fending off those who might be interested in Run while Yuko and their other girlfriend, Nagi, have to deal with Run''s own penchant for drama.', 'Tooru and Run have been best friends forever, so when Tooru learns that she''s managed to get into the same high school as Run, she runs to tell her... only to find Run in a compromising position with yet another girl, Yuko. Needless to say, that makes things a bit awkward at school, with Tooru fending off those who might be interested in Run while Yuko and their other girlfriend, Nagi, have to deal with Run''s own penchant for drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8v5DNnmMgFpjSw4RPrEDP86Isxr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69189'),
  ('301411414628886352', 'A-List to Playlist', 2024, 'Reality', 'Lee Jung-won, Yang Jung-woo', null, 'Cho Jung-seok', 'TV-14', 'With a 20-year acting career, Cho Jung-seok takes on the challenge of debuting as a singer in 100 days, mobilizing his entire network against the clock!', 'With a 20-year acting career, Cho Jung-seok takes on the challenge of debuting as a singer in 100 days, mobilizing his entire network against the clock!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4EWnaPJiiVeCBJyDDDXwivuPA4F.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:248123'),
  ('60234318378348250', 'A-TEEN', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'kim sarah', 'Shin Ye-eun, Lee Na-eun, Kim Dong-hee, Choi Bo-min, Shin Seung-ho, Suhyeon, Ryu Ui-hyun, Kang Min-ah', null, 'It''s easy to talk about teenagers, but we are now in our teens for the first time. All the moments were too serious to say I was not worried. Teenage school romance web drama.', 'It''s easy to talk about teenagers, but we are now in our teens for the first time. All the moments were too serious to say I was not worried. Teenage school romance web drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzSCSXC3JUTTMjRLum5QHhgwFT5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:87687'),
  ('740585046024930978', 'A.B.I.: A Broken Inheritance', 2026, 'Drama', 'Gülseren Budayıcıoğlu', 'Eylem Canpolat', 'Kenan İmirzalıoğlu, Afra Saraçoğlu, Asude Kalebek, Sinan Tuzcu, Diren Polatoğulları, Tarık Papuççuoğlu, Tülay Bursa, Nihal Koldaş', null, 'Dogan is a successful surgeon in Izmir. When he was young, a shocking incident with his father, Tahir Hancıoglu, caused him to break away from his family. Now devoted to saving lives, Dogan has almost no connection with his family except his younger sister, Melek. At Melek’s insistence, Dogan returns to Istanbul for his sister Gulusan’s wedding. His return brings back long-buried traumas and hidden crimes. Dogan meets Cagla, a strong, determined lawyer. Their painful pasts create a deep connection. The family’s enemy, Behram, watches from the shadows, waiting for the right moment to confront the past. An attempted murder on the wedding night changes everything. Old secrets surface and members of his family appear among the suspects. Dogan must make a choice: leave and return to his old life, or stay and face the truth by uncovering the secrets at the heart of his family.', 'Dogan is a successful surgeon in Izmir. When he was young, a shocking incident with his father, Tahir Hancıoglu, caused him to break away from his family. Now devoted to saving lives, Dogan has almost no connection with his family except his younger sister, Melek. At Melek’s insistence, Dogan returns to Istanbul for his sister Gulusan’s wedding. His return brings back long-buried traumas and hidden crimes. Dogan meets Cagla, a strong, determined lawyer. Their painful pasts create a deep connection. The family’s enemy, Behram, watches from the shadows, waiting for the right moment to confront the past. An attempted murder on the wedding night changes everything. Old secrets surface and members of his family appear among the suspects. Dogan must make a choice: leave and return to his old life, or stay and face the truth by uncovering the secrets at the heart of his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mGnrjWWi6ZeXlt0U3Ky8gzpOhO3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:306529'),
  ('1117650627951411994', 'A.D.', 1985, 'Drama', 'Vincenzo Labella, Anthony Burgess', null, 'Susan Sarandon, Ben Vereen, Tony Vogel, Vincent Riotta, Rebecca Saire, Tom Durham, Anthony Pedley, Harold Kasket', null, 'A.D. is a 1985 television drama miniseries created and written by Vincenzo Labella and Anthony Burgess, based on Burgess'' historical novel The Kingdom of the Wicked. The five-part serial is considered the third and final part of a trilogy, preceded by Moses the Lawgiver (1974) and Jesus of Nazareth (1977). Set just after Jesus'' Crucifixion, the lives and adventures of His disciples are explored, and events in Rome during the reigns of Emperors Tiberius, Caligula, Claudius and Nero.', 'A.D. is a 1985 television drama miniseries created and written by Vincenzo Labella and Anthony Burgess, based on Burgess'' historical novel The Kingdom of the Wicked. The five-part serial is considered the third and final part of a trilogy, preceded by Moses the Lawgiver (1974) and Jesus of Nazareth (1977). Set just after Jesus'' Crucifixion, the lives and adventures of His disciples are explored, and events in Rome during the reigns of Emperors Tiberius, Caligula, Claudius and Nero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5n26LwZ5Em1ibvdPqjL7AOXKx3s.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16062'),
  ('381574980032122128', 'A.D. Police', 1999, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Crime, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Taiko Hoshikawa, Tony Takezaki', 'Susumu Chiba, Takumi Yamazaki, Ayako Kawasumi', null, 'MegaTokyo 2038: A.D. Police Officer Kenji Sasaki loses another partner to a rabid boomer. A day after he''s sent off-duty, he receives a new partner: German cop Hans Kleif.', 'MegaTokyo 2038: A.D. Police Officer Kenji Sasaki loses another partner to a rabid boomer. A day after he''s sent off-duty, he receives a new partner: German cop Hans Kleif.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xh895Mq6cSxdlA5UFqPbNcaF7kJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31091'),
  ('116319881634662857', 'A.D. Police Files', 1990, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Toshio Furukawa, Yoko Matsuoka, Tessyo Genda, Mina Tominaga, Yoko Asagami, Norio Wakamoto, Atsushi Abe, Sakiko Tamagawa', null, 'MegaTokyo 2027: Relentless technological development has resulted in the creation of Boomers. These are artificially intelligent androids with the potential to free mankind from physical labor; but anything that can be used can also be misused.', 'MegaTokyo 2027: Relentless technological development has resulted in the creation of Boomers. These are artificially intelligent androids with the potential to free mankind from physical labor; but anything that can be used can also be misused.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qkvnFr3kN40sGBkqUmoIv0gGYoH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67818'),
  ('518492664277794347', 'A.D. The Bible Continues', 2015, 'Drama', 'Roma Downey', 'Simon Block', 'Fraser Ayres, Andrew Gower, Farzana Dua Elahe, Pedro Lloyd Gardiner, Jóhannes Haukur Jóhannesson, Harry Taurasi, Richard Coyle, Greta Scacchi', null, '"A.D. The Bible Continues" picks up where the smash hit miniseries "The Bible" left off, continuing the greatest story ever told and exploring the exciting and inspiring events that followed the Crucifixion of Christ. The immediate aftermath of Christ''s death had a massive impact on his disciples, his mother, Mary, and key political and religious leaders of the era, completely altering the entire world in an instant. Beginning at that fateful moment of the Crucifixion and the Resurrection, "A.D. The Bible Continues" will focus on the disciples who had to go forward and spread the teachings of Christ to a world dominated by political unrest, and the start of a whole new religion that would dramatically reshape the history of the world.', '"A.D. The Bible Continues" picks up where the smash hit miniseries "The Bible" left off, continuing the greatest story ever told and exploring the exciting and inspiring events that followed the Crucifixion of Christ. The immediate aftermath of Christ''s death had a massive impact on his disciples, his mother, Mary, and key political and religious leaders of the era, completely altering the entire world in an instant. Beginning at that fateful moment of the Crucifixion and the Resurrection, "A.D. The Bible Continues" will focus on the disciples who had to go forward and spread the teachings of Christ to a world dominated by political unrest, and the start of a whole new religion that would dramatically reshape the history of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MqDwyYfPhEeVgV8a0KXi9baMQh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62287'),
  ('213249255450002682', 'A.I.C.O. -Incarnation-', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yusuke Kobayashi, Haruka Shiraishi, Takehito Koyasu, Toru Okawa, Taishi Murata, Mao Ichimichi, Atsuko Tanaka, Makoto Furukawa', 'TV-14', 'In Japan in the year 2035, an accident known as the "Burst" occurs during a research project, spawning an out-of-control artificial life form called "Matter" that has spread throughout the Kurobe Gorge. The research city that was once hailed as the hope for humanity is cordoned off by the government. Two years later, 15-year-old Aiko Tachibana, who lost her family in the Burst, learns something unbelievable from Yuya Kanzaki, a new student at her school. A secret is hidden within her body, and the answer to the puzzle lies at the "Primary Point" that was the center of the Burst. Aiko resolves to infiltrate the restricted area, escorted by a team of divers and with Yuya as her guide. When boy meets girl with the fate of humanity in their hands, what new truth will come to light?', 'In Japan in the year 2035, an accident known as the "Burst" occurs during a research project, spawning an out-of-control artificial life form called "Matter" that has spread throughout the Kurobe Gorge. The research city that was once hailed as the hope for humanity is cordoned off by the government. Two years later, 15-year-old Aiko Tachibana, who lost her family in the Burst, learns something unbelievable from Yuya Kanzaki, a new student at her school. A secret is hidden within her body, and the answer to the puzzle lies at the "Primary Point" that was the center of the Burst. Aiko resolves to infiltrate the restricted area, escorted by a team of divers and with Yuya as her guide. When boy meets girl with the fate of humanity in their hands, what new truth will come to light?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZKj6x6Wa8xyfj2VWoLDq0Or6OC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77778'),
  ('476835015568311225', 'A.mar, donde el amor teje sus redes', 2025, 'Soap, Drama, Family', 'Juan Carlos Alcalá', null, 'David Zepeda, Eva Cedeño, Pedro Moreno, Laura Carmine, Víctor González, Sergio Reynoso, Ana Martín, Diego de Erice', null, 'Estrella Contreras, a single mother struggling to raise her daughter Azul, finds herself having to return to her hometown after the fateful death of her father Ulises, where she meets Fabián Bravo, a widowed father and fisherman by profession who is fighting to regain custody of his teenage daughter Yazmin. Love blossoms between them, but it will be complicated by the intrigues of Érika Méndez, Fabián''s ex-partner, and the ambition of Sergio Falcón, a powerful businessman and Azul''s father, who will relentlessly seek to prevent this relationship, even if it means ending the customs and traditions of an entire fishing village, which will lead Fabián and Estrella to face a hurricane of calamities, always putting the well-being of their families first.', 'Estrella Contreras, a single mother struggling to raise her daughter Azul, finds herself having to return to her hometown after the fateful death of her father Ulises, where she meets Fabián Bravo, a widowed father and fisherman by profession who is fighting to regain custody of his teenage daughter Yazmin. Love blossoms between them, but it will be complicated by the intrigues of Érika Méndez, Fabián''s ex-partner, and the ambition of Sergio Falcón, a powerful businessman and Azul''s father, who will relentlessly seek to prevent this relationship, even if it means ending the customs and traditions of an entire fishing village, which will lead Fabián and Estrella to face a hurricane of calamities, always putting the well-being of their families first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bPXEgBoxbLtUAbbGsG7P7xolSxb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:274971'),
  ('98164034847001526', 'A.N.T. Farm', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Dan Signer', 'Dan Signer', 'China Anne McClain, Sierra McCormick, Jake Short, Stefanie Scott, Aedin Mincks', 'TV-G', 'Chyna Parks, an 11 year old musical prodigy, gets into a gifted program called Advanced Natural Talents at the local high school. Along with her fellow elementary school-aged ''ANTs'', she must navigate the halls of a new school of older kids who are not particularly fond of grade-skipping newbies.', 'Chyna Parks, an 11 year old musical prodigy, gets into a gifted program called Advanced Natural Talents at the local high school. Along with her fellow elementary school-aged ''ANTs'', she must navigate the halls of a new school of older kids who are not particularly fond of grade-skipping newbies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rnO9xtMhfudmd4LBiXoYWb4ckog.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:34573'),
  ('345551765779437324', 'A.P. Bio', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Michael Patrick O''Brien', null, 'Glenn Howerton, Patton Oswalt, Paula Pell, Lyric Lewis, Mary Sohn, Jean Villepique', 'TV-14', 'When disgraced Harvard philosophy scholar Jack Griffin loses out on his dream job, he is forced to return to Toledo, Ohio, and work as a high school Advanced Placement biology teacher.', 'When disgraced Harvard philosophy scholar Jack Griffin loses out on his dream job, he is forced to return to Toledo, Ohio, and work as a high school Advanced Placement biology teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8GwiuZazRFNrmvSkagZlEDH7qSS.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:71737'),
  ('750807221265767651', 'A3!', 2020, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Yuichi Jose, Chiharu Sawashiro, Shunsuke Takeuchi, Kento Hama, Kentaro Kumagai, Seiya Konishi, Atsushi Tamaru, Takuya Sato', 'TV-14', 'In Tokyo, there is a place called Velude Way. It is a district notorious for its performers and theatrical groups. Izumi Tachibana, who was previously a stage actress, arrives with a letter that reads, "Full of debt! Zero customers! Only one actor!" It describes the current state of the once-popular theater group Mankai Company. Her task is to rebuild the company to its former glory as the new owner and chief director.', 'In Tokyo, there is a place called Velude Way. It is a district notorious for its performers and theatrical groups. Izumi Tachibana, who was previously a stage actress, arrives with a letter that reads, "Full of debt! Zero customers! Only one actor!" It describes the current state of the once-popular theater group Mankai Company. Her task is to rebuild the company to its former glory as the new owner and chief director.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2QROy0rSIv3bbtPid79vagE6zBl.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:96860'),
  ('612727692272743070', 'Aaahh!!! Real Monsters', 1994, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Gábor Csupó, Peter Gaffney', null, 'Charlie Adler, Christine Cavanaugh, David Eccles, Gregg Berger, Jim Belushi, Kath Soucie, Lacey Chabert, Michael Dorn', 'TV-Y', 'Three young monsters — Ickis, Oblina and Krumm — attends an institute for monsters under a city dump and learn to frighten humans.', 'Three young monsters — Ickis, Oblina and Krumm — attends an institute for monsters under a city dump and learn to frighten humans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fnh1Mi108eNKayutKLSqesFgaRv.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2429'),
  ('606212230006270478', 'Aalta Phoring', 2022, 'Drama, Family', 'Sushanta Das', null, 'Kheyali Mondal, Abhishek Bose, Saoli Chattopadhyay, Arnab Riingo Banerjee', null, 'Phoring, the illegitimate daughter of an ex-gymnast is unaware of the talent she''s born with. Facing the hardships of life, will she realise her true potential?', 'Phoring, the illegitimate daughter of an ex-gymnast is unaware of the talent she''s born with. Facing the hardships of life, will she realise her true potential?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gq8AVH8CbUNctlekCbJ7O4N9nLs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204923'),
  ('504931024134010838', 'AARO -All-domain Anomaly Resolution Office-', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Junichi Ishikawa, Tsutomu Kuroiwa', null, 'Alice Hirose, Tatsuya Fujiwara, Fumiyo Kohinata, Hayato Kakizawa, Riko Fukumoto, Rio Komiya, Takaya Sakoda, Riko Narumi', null, 'A special investigative unit tackles everything from mysterious disappearances and shadowy figures to eerie supernatural phenomena.', 'A special investigative unit tackles everything from mysterious disappearances and shadowy figures to eerie supernatural phenomena.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyx0hdkEWfCHmhiWVcogKMd7hVD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:261792'),
  ('1125165904313463391', 'Aaron Stone', 2009, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Family', null, 'Gail Morgan Hickman, Dan Cross', 'Kelly Blatz, J.P. Manoux, David Lambert, Tania Gunadi, Shauna MacDonald, Anthony J. Mifsud, Jacob Kraemer, Daniel DeSanto', 'TV-Y7', 'Charlie Landers is a whiz at the online video game Hero Rising. In fact, he and his online avatar, Aaron Stone, hold its highest rank. But Charlie''s life is thrown into chaos when reclusive billionaire T. Abner Hall, creator of the game, asks Charlie to use his avatar to become a real-life crime-fighter. Aided by his Sentient Tactical Assisting Neohuman (S.T.A.N.), Charlie, as Aaron Stone, rights wrongs committed around the world by the Omega Defiance.', 'Charlie Landers is a whiz at the online video game Hero Rising. In fact, he and his online avatar, Aaron Stone, hold its highest rank. But Charlie''s life is thrown into chaos when reclusive billionaire T. Abner Hall, creator of the game, asks Charlie to use his avatar to become a real-life crime-fighter. Aided by his Sentient Tactical Assisting Neohuman (S.T.A.N.), Charlie, as Aaron Stone, rights wrongs committed around the world by the Omega Defiance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dp5SmLaTcr2v8ndBA6PCmOgJ9XZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:7486'),
  ('118716693774890732', 'Aarya', 2020, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ram Madhvani', null, 'Sushmita Sen, Vikas Kumar, Viren Vazirani, Sikandar Kher, Pratyaksh Panwar, Priyasha Bhardwaj, Virti Vaghani, Sohaila Kapur', 'TV-MA', 'When her world suddenly turns upside down, will Aarya become the very thing she hated? How far will she go to survive and protect her family?', 'When her world suddenly turns upside down, will Aarya become the very thing she hated? How far will she go to survive and protect her family?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHxzABVwpFtUg5kHu9PAEFWs67u.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:104913'),
  ('915567220729516859', 'Aashiqana', 2022, 'Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'Khushi Dubey, Zayn Ibad Khan', null, 'A serial killer sparks the story of uptight Yashvardhan and feisty Chikki. Plagued by misunderstandings, how far do they have to go to nab the murderer?', 'A serial killer sparks the story of uptight Yashvardhan and feisty Chikki. Plagued by misunderstandings, how far do they have to go to nab the murderer?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a4Z6Uohb6Ln5vcPvMUzwyn3WBjP.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:203504'),
  ('796211728905606386', 'Aashram', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', 'Prakash Jha', null, 'Bobby Deol, Chandan Roy Sanyal, Darshan Kumaar, Aaditi Pohankar, Tridha Choudhury, Tushar Pandey, Sachin Shroff, Anupriya Goenka', null, 'A duplicitous, aashram based, Indian Godman''s good deeds serve activities criminal and unholy, such as rapes, murders, drugs, vote bank politics and forced male emasculation. The law and a few crusaders investigate to bring him to account.', 'A duplicitous, aashram based, Indian Godman''s good deeds serve activities criminal and unholy, such as rapes, murders, drugs, vote bank politics and forced male emasculation. The law and a few crusaders investigate to bring him to account.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5tK4hBaHXqEcz1iHRr0nCgaABPk.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:107588'),
  ('53461318647995142', 'Abandoned Engineering', 2017, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Tom Ward', 'TV-PG', 'These are some of the most spectacular examples of abandoned engineering the world has ever known. The series explores how and why they were built, consider the financial and social costs of their failure and examine the environmental and ecological impacts. The series also explores how experts came up with plans to make something beautiful or useful from the ruins.', 'These are some of the most spectacular examples of abandoned engineering the world has ever known. The series explores how and why they were built, consider the financial and social costs of their failure and examine the environmental and ecological impacts. The series also explores how experts came up with plans to make something beautiful or useful from the ruins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2lsIWLcDIkg3f0vRnXpGsh4okzN.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:73693'),
  ('1089028725213654459', 'Abandoned: The Woman in the Decaying House', 2025, 'Documentary', null, 'Fernanda Polacow, Mariana Paiva', 'Chico Felitti', 'TV-14', 'After almost 30 years of silence, a victim shares new and disturbing details of the horror she experienced in the home of the person who became known throughout Brazil as the woman with white ointment on her face.', 'After almost 30 years of silence, a victim shares new and disturbing details of the horror she experienced in the home of the person who became known throughout Brazil as the woman with white ointment on her face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dpYXNGHQBsAr4GhiExDxk4LLAJD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:293031'),
  ('763711099439416071', 'Abarenbo Shogun', 1978, 'Family, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Ken Matsudaira, Saburo Kitajima, Tadashi Yokouchi', null, 'Set in the 18th century, the show follows the Shogun Yoshimune, who likes to disguise himself as a low-ranking samurai and go into his capital of Edo to see the life of the common man, as well as to seek out and punish evildoers who would hurt his citizens. He is aided by Magistrate Oo''oka and a vivacious fireman, Tatsugoro, as well as a rotating cast of other recurring characters. Along with Zenigata Heiji and Mito Kōmon, it ranks among the longest-running series in the jidaigeki genre. Like so many other jidaigeki, it falls in the category of kanzen-chōaku, loosely, "rewarding good and punishing evil."', 'Set in the 18th century, the show follows the Shogun Yoshimune, who likes to disguise himself as a low-ranking samurai and go into his capital of Edo to see the life of the common man, as well as to seek out and punish evildoers who would hurt his citizens. He is aided by Magistrate Oo''oka and a vivacious fireman, Tatsugoro, as well as a rotating cast of other recurring characters. Along with Zenigata Heiji and Mito Kōmon, it ranks among the longest-running series in the jidaigeki genre. Like so many other jidaigeki, it falls in the category of kanzen-chōaku, loosely, "rewarding good and punishing evil."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2SVXj2f1ep2Day2yCiLdm3iyIq.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:15680'),
  ('215028721549081311', 'Abbott Elementary', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Quinta Brunson', null, 'Quinta Brunson, Tyler James Williams, Sheryl Lee Ralph, Lisa Ann Walter, Chris Perfetti, Janelle James, William Stanford Davis', 'TV-14', 'In this workplace comedy, a group of dedicated, passionate teachers — and a slightly tone-deaf principal — are brought together in a Philadelphia public school where, despite the odds stacked against them, they are determined to help their students succeed in life. Though these incredible public servants may be outnumbered and underfunded, they love what they do — even if they don’t love the school district’s less-than-stellar attitude toward educating children.', 'In this workplace comedy, a group of dedicated, passionate teachers — and a slightly tone-deaf principal — are brought together in a Philadelphia public school where, despite the odds stacked against them, they are determined to help their students succeed in life. Though these incredible public servants may be outnumbered and underfunded, they love what they do — even if they don’t love the school district’s less-than-stellar attitude toward educating children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBe1e3JJEZ6veGrVXNF0fRoLu56.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:125935'),
  ('149121349103652793', 'Abby''s', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Josh Malmuth', 'Savannah Rodin', 'Natalie Morales, Nelson Franklin, Neil Flynn, Kimia Behpoornia, Jessica Chaffin, Leonard Ouzts', 'TV-PG', 'The best bar in San Diego is an unlicensed, makeshift bar nestled in Abby''s backyard. There are rules at Abby''s: no cell phones, not even to "look something up," earning a seat at the bar takes time, and losing a challenge means drinking a limey, sugary "not-beer" drink.', 'The best bar in San Diego is an unlicensed, makeshift bar nestled in Abby''s backyard. There are rules at Abby''s: no cell phones, not even to "look something up," earning a seat at the bar takes time, and losing a challenge means drinking a limey, sugary "not-beer" drink.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nPeyYoSuBUBiLgC0d3BTKdmUnyU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81945'),
  ('161687576773612455', 'ABC Afterschool Special', 1972, 'Drama', 'Guy Fraumeni', null, null, null, 'Dramatically presented situations, often controversial, of interest to children and teenagers. Several episodes were either in animated form or presented as documentaries. Topics included illiteracy, substance abuse and teenage pregnancy.', 'Dramatically presented situations, often controversial, of interest to children and teenagers. Several episodes were either in animated form or presented as documentaries. Topics included illiteracy, substance abuse and teenage pregnancy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uOx0dDmt72hjIC5gmCzxEdn8qt0.jpg', 25, 'tmdb:tv:18162'),
