  ('1023997749872832731', 'Aber Bergen', 2016, 'Drama', 'Kjell Jørgen Holbye, Gjermund Stenberg Eriksen', null, 'Odd-Magnus Williamson, Ellen Dorrit Petersen, Line Verndal, Lykke Kristine Moen, Torgny Aanderaa, Siv Torin Knudsen Petersen', null, 'Aber Bergen is an entertaining courtroom drama about the recently separated , but for the time being professional partners, Erik Aber and Elea Bergen. They are two of the country''s sharpest defense attorneys, who together with an unorthodox team lawyers have built up a reputable law firm, where they attempt to balance professional and private as they are thrown between moral, political and legal dilemmas.', 'Aber Bergen is an entertaining courtroom drama about the recently separated , but for the time being professional partners, Erik Aber and Elea Bergen. They are two of the country''s sharpest defense attorneys, who together with an unorthodox team lawyers have built up a reputable law firm, where they attempt to balance professional and private as they are thrown between moral, political and legal dilemmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1YNi1DCLdhvppZhVlpJ1H3iLH6b.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:67943'),
  ('82247070269405690', 'Abhay', 2019, 'Crime, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Kunal Khemu, Palak Singh, Asha Negi, Vijay Raaz, Rahul Dev, Tanuj Virwani, Divya Agarwal, Nidhi Singh', null, 'Inspired by true events, the crime thriller revolves around Abhay Pratap Singh, a sharp investigating officer with the mind of a criminal, who can go to any extent to solve a case. Join Abhay as he sets out in the dark gruesome world of crime to save innocent lives, while dealing with his own personal demons.', 'Inspired by true events, the crime thriller revolves around Abhay Pratap Singh, a sharp investigating officer with the mind of a criminal, who can go to any extent to solve a case. Join Abhay as he sets out in the dark gruesome world of crime to save innocent lives, while dealing with his own personal demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7dxOZifAwuWF5zHYco6bhuzBrQr.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:87324'),
  ('612417001019288187', 'Abla Fahita: Drama Queen', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Abla Fahita', 'George Azmi, Donia Maher, Dina Maher', 'Abla Fahita, Caro, Bassem Samra, Donia Maher, Rehab Hussein, Mnaa Adel, Bossy Shalaby, Zeina Mansour', null, 'After disappearing from the limelight due to an ethical scandal, Abla Fahita falls victim to the ploy of a nightclub owner who seeks to exploit her, and when he is murdered under mysterious circumstances, Fahita soon becomes the prime suspect in the crime.', 'After disappearing from the limelight due to an ethical scandal, Abla Fahita falls victim to the ploy of a nightclub owner who seeks to exploit her, and when he is murdered under mysterious circumstances, Fahita soon becomes the prime suspect in the crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yk4Sqs13O2UQxMeGaYsvnniVKIi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:104043'),
