  ('156771952251830259', 'ABO Desire', 2025, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Nong Jian', 'Nong Jian', 'Huang Xing, Qiu Dingjie, Li Peien, Jiang Heng', null, 'When an arrogant Alpha infiltrates a rival’s company and falls for a seemingly delicate Omega, he’s pulled into a dangerous game that challenges everything he knows.', 'When an arrogant Alpha infiltrates a rival’s company and falls for a seemingly delicate Omega, he’s pulled into a dangerous game that challenges everything he knows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fKmsS7HRGvhSNiLysVIj1zoBHnt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:280100'),
  ('22524822475084764', 'Abominable and the Invisible City', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy', 'Katherine Nolfi', null, 'Chloe Bennet, Tenzing Norgay Trainor, Ethan Loh, Karen Huie, Darin De Paul, Michelle Wong', 'TV-Y7', 'Through Everest, the yeti, Yi, Jin, and Peng know that there’s a whole magical world out there, and now it’s even closer than they think! When they discover that their surroundings are teeming with magical creatures in need of their help, the kids will set out on extraordinary and heartfelt adventures throughout their city and beyond.', 'Through Everest, the yeti, Yi, Jin, and Peng know that there’s a whole magical world out there, and now it’s even closer than they think! When they discover that their surroundings are teeming with magical creatures in need of their help, the kids will set out on extraordinary and heartfelt adventures throughout their city and beyond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKtjZTrJvQLqhVnkBjtsZUg4e1B.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:157433'),
  ('33967320848466518', 'About a Boy', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nick Hornby', null, 'David Walton, Minnie Driver, Benjamin Stockham, Al Madrigal, Annie Mumolo', 'TV-PG', 'Will Freeman lives a charmed existence as the ultimate man-child. After writing a hit song, he was granted a life of free time, free love and freedom from financial woes. He''s single, unemployed and loving it. So imagine his surprise when Fiona, a needy single mom and her oddly charming 11-year-old son, Marcus, move in next door and disrupt his perfect world. When Marcus begins dropping by his home unannounced, Will''s not so sure about being a kid''s new best friend, until, of course, Will discovers that women find single dads irresistible. That changes everything and a deal is struck: Marcus will pretend to be Will''s son and, in return, Marcus is allowed to chill at Will''s house. Before he realizes it, Will starts to enjoy the visits and even finds himself looking out for the kid. In fact, this newfound friendship may very well teach him a thing or two that he never imagined possible - about himself and caring for others.', 'Will Freeman lives a charmed existence as the ultimate man-child. After writing a hit song, he was granted a life of free time, free love and freedom from financial woes. He''s single, unemployed and loving it. So imagine his surprise when Fiona, a needy single mom and her oddly charming 11-year-old son, Marcus, move in next door and disrupt his perfect world. When Marcus begins dropping by his home unannounced, Will''s not so sure about being a kid''s new best friend, until, of course, Will discovers that women find single dads irresistible. That changes everything and a deal is struck: Marcus will pretend to be Will''s son and, in return, Marcus is allowed to chill at Will''s house. Before he realizes it, Will starts to enjoy the visits and even finds himself looking out for the kid. In fact, this newfound friendship may very well teach him a thing or two that he never imagined possible - about himself and caring for others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fTMbfMqUZ1OCqh9CQq5H5Pi13CH.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:51388'),
  ('97428485178598567', 'About Time', 2018, 'Drama', 'Choo Hye-mi, Kim Hyung-sik', 'Choo Hye-mi', 'Lee Sang-yun, Lee Sung-kyung, Lim Se-mi, Kim Dong-jun, Han Seung-yeon, Rowoon, Jeong Dong-hwan, Kim Hae-sook', 'TV-14', 'Our heroine will have the unfortunate ability to see the “life clocks” of everyone around her, including herself, and the hero will somehow be able to stop her “time” without lifting a finger. This story will follow time that is stopped, extended, and even erased through the love they have for each other.', 'Our heroine will have the unfortunate ability to see the “life clocks” of everyone around her, including herself, and the hero will somehow be able to stop her “time” without lifting a finger. This story will follow time that is stopped, extended, and even erased through the love they have for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/toOQhrPZEDyMd4ghTID2I1Io4LL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78742'),
  ('569987220907146291', 'About Youth', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Jyun Shen, Li Zhenhao, Tim Hsu, Andy Huang, Vera Chen, David Te-Yang Chiu, Winnie Chang, Yen-chuang Chen', null, 'A head-student election campaign turns personal when Guang falls for Chang, the quiet guitarist who makes him feel seen for the first time.', 'A head-student election campaign turns personal when Guang falls for Chang, the quiet guitarist who makes him feel seen for the first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1oj5853TFK56y6eEYck2GeWJfN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:202460'),
  ('777267833756261061', 'Above Justice', 2016, 'Drama, Crime', 'Manuela Dias', 'Walter Daguerre, Roberto Vitorino, Manuela Dias', 'Juan Paiva, Murilo Benício, Nanda Costa, Leandra Leal, Belize Pombal, Paolla Oliveira, Alice Wegmann, Marco Ricca', 'TV-14', 'In this realistic and touching series told in an innovative format, seemingly independent plots intertwine to show how justice can sometimes be a personal matter.', 'In this realistic and touching series told in an innovative format, seemingly independent plots intertwine to show how justice can sometimes be a personal matter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yfkhcajSmDNrWsRy2D9oN2vhmTg.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67535'),
  ('173477830960254152', 'Above Suspicion', 2009, 'Drama', 'Lynda La Plante', 'Lynda La Plante', 'Kelly Reilly, Ciarán Hinds, Michelle Holmes, Shaun Dingwall, Amanda Lawrence, Celyn Jones', null, 'Above Suspicion is a British TV series based on Lynda La Plante''s novels Above Suspicion, The Red Dahlia, Deadly Intent and Silent Scream. It stars Kelly Reilly and Ciarán Hinds, and features the career of La Plante''s latest heroine DC Anna Travis. The first series, Above Suspicion, was shown on the fourth and fifth of January 2009; the second series, Above Suspicion: The Red Dahlia, was shown on the fourth, fifth and sixth of January 2010. The third series, Above Suspicion: Deadly Intent, was shown on the third, fourth and fifth of January 2011. The fourth series, Above Suspicion – Silent Scream was shown on the ninth, sixteenth and twenty-third of January 2012; in a break from the previous broadcasts, which were broadcast on consecutive days, this latest tale was serialised weekly. ITV cancelled Above Suspicion on May 28, 2012.', 'Above Suspicion is a British TV series based on Lynda La Plante''s novels Above Suspicion, The Red Dahlia, Deadly Intent and Silent Scream. It stars Kelly Reilly and Ciarán Hinds, and features the career of La Plante''s latest heroine DC Anna Travis. The first series, Above Suspicion, was shown on the fourth and fifth of January 2009; the second series, Above Suspicion: The Red Dahlia, was shown on the fourth, fifth and sixth of January 2010. The third series, Above Suspicion: Deadly Intent, was shown on the third, fourth and fifth of January 2011. The fourth series, Above Suspicion – Silent Scream was shown on the ninth, sixteenth and twenty-third of January 2012; in a break from the previous broadcasts, which were broadcast on consecutive days, this latest tale was serialised weekly. ITV cancelled Above Suspicion on May 28, 2012.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ms6LrCx3RowpeGg2PWZq0XEY2Y.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:16343'),
  ('49261066094324234', 'Absentia', 2017, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Matthew Cirulnick, Gaia Violo', null, 'Stana Katic, Patrick Heusinger, Neil Jackson, Matthew Le Nevez, Natasha Little, Christopher Colquhoun, Paul Freeman, Patrick McAuley', 'TV-MA', 'A missing FBI agent reappears six years after being declared dead.', 'A missing FBI agent reappears six years after being declared dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t3yVaAlmCLBwbqTrKGcWHwuCmkh.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:72755'),
  ('771172054426298231', 'Absolute Beginners', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Martyna Byczkowska, Bartłomiej Deklewa, Jan Sałasiński, Paulina Krzyżańska, Katarzyna Warnke, Piotr Witkowski, Anna Krotoska, Andrzej Konopka', 'TV-MA', 'Two childhood best friends enjoying their final seaside summer as they prepare for film school meet an aspiring athlete who ignites unfamiliar desires.', 'Two childhood best friends enjoying their final seaside summer as they prepare for film school meet an aspiring athlete who ignites unfamiliar desires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AkLuQdpKGZT2FjPJSYY2dVmuQH5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:230372'),
  ('750362329321144504', 'Absolute Boyfriend', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Takuya Kanai', null, 'Mokomichi Hayami, Hiro Mizushima, Saki Aibu, Eisuke Sasai, Natsuhi Ueno, Kenta Satoi, Komoto Maki, Kaji Masaki', null, 'Robot maker, Kronos Heaven, finally develops "Night Tenjō", the perfect male humanoid programmed to be devoted and completely loyal to his lover. The company chooses temp worker Riko Izawa to take part in a five-day free trial. At first, Riko only sees Night as a household appliance. But when she finds out how deep Night''s devotion to herself is, Riko finds herself falling in love with him. Joining the love triangle is Sōshi Asamoto, a distinguished young executive at her company who has feelings for her.', 'Robot maker, Kronos Heaven, finally develops "Night Tenjō", the perfect male humanoid programmed to be devoted and completely loyal to his lover. The company chooses temp worker Riko Izawa to take part in a five-day free trial. At first, Riko only sees Night as a household appliance. But when she finds out how deep Night''s devotion to herself is, Riko finds herself falling in love with him. Joining the love triangle is Sōshi Asamoto, a distinguished young executive at her company who has feelings for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Cpa9HhjuuxV4zKiXvaZxpMhQQF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:20368'),
  ('1145422625461761334', 'Absolute Duo', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Nozomi Yamamoto, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Ayaka Suwa, Haruka Yamazaki, Nozomi Nishida, Kentaro Ito, Manami Tanaka, Mami Uchida', 'TV-MA', 'This is the story of Tooru Kokonoe who has enrolled at Kouryou Academy, a school which trains students in wielding Blaze, soul powered weapons to prepare them for the Dorn Agency''s special peacekeeping corps. When Tooru is partnered with a mysterious girl: Julie Sigtuna, he finds he has to overcome many hurdles to ensure their teamwork and fighting skills are up to par for the duration of their training.', 'This is the story of Tooru Kokonoe who has enrolled at Kouryou Academy, a school which trains students in wielding Blaze, soul powered weapons to prepare them for the Dorn Agency''s special peacekeeping corps. When Tooru is partnered with a mysterious girl: Julie Sigtuna, he finds he has to overcome many hurdles to ensure their teamwork and fighting skills are up to par for the duration of their training.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cf6GkYshYuvSkh4EWuvq9eNatV7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65764'),
  ('857710756826034413', 'Absolute Power', 2003, 'Comedy', null, null, 'John Bird, Stephen Fry, Geoffrey Palmer, Sally Bretton, Nicholas Burns, James Lance, Zoe Telford', null, 'Stephen Fry and John Bird star as spin doctors Charles Prentiss and Martin McCabe as they bring the popular and satirical Radio 4 comedy Absolute Power to BBC Two. Stephen as Prentiss and John as McCabe are an unscrupulous pair who run the blue chip PR agency Prentiss McCabe. Dealing with commercial as well as personal PR, their remit covers everything from political communications to celebrity media relations. Their manipulation skills are tested to the full as they frequently find that their work brings them into conflict with political parties, newspaper editors and celebrities.', 'Stephen Fry and John Bird star as spin doctors Charles Prentiss and Martin McCabe as they bring the popular and satirical Radio 4 comedy Absolute Power to BBC Two. Stephen as Prentiss and John as McCabe are an unscrupulous pair who run the blue chip PR agency Prentiss McCabe. Dealing with commercial as well as personal PR, their remit covers everything from political communications to celebrity media relations. Their manipulation skills are tested to the full as they frequently find that their work brings them into conflict with political parties, newspaper editors and celebrities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8O8C2OsM0DIyGmjlev7XlBzGCE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2058'),
  ('1150866628978347683', 'Absolute Value of Romance', 2026, 'Drama', '이민주', '이민주', 'Kim Hyang-gi, Cha Hak-yeon, Kim Jae-hyun, Demian, Kim Dong-kyu, Gladys Bay, 한세희, 노주은', null, 'A quiet student by day, a romance novelist by night, Eui-ju is inspired when four gorgeous teachers appear: icy Woo-su, lively Da-ju, gruff Gi-jeon, and gentle Dong-ju. She writes them into her new novel, which blows up overnight! But her secret is discovered by Woo-su, her worst enemy since day one. She accepts his deal to protect her secret, but can she finish this novel unscathed?', 'A quiet student by day, a romance novelist by night, Eui-ju is inspired when four gorgeous teachers appear: icy Woo-su, lively Da-ju, gruff Gi-jeon, and gentle Dong-ju. She writes them into her new novel, which blows up overnight! But her secret is discovered by Woo-su, her worst enemy since day one. She accepts his deal to protect her secret, but can she finish this novel unscathed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wY4rhPE90jJ4bp1JZOFY0MeRJQX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:314784'),
  ('771593473450190542', 'Absolute Zero', 2010, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'You Yokoyama, Yasuko Sawaguchi, Ken Yasuda, Yuina Kuroshima, Hayate Ichinose, Azusa Babazono, Satoshi Kanada, Yohei Matsukado', null, 'Izumi Sakuragi is a new police sergeant with the Special Investigations Office, which was set up within the Metropolitan Police in November last year. The new investigation team uses DNA analysis and the latest in forensics science to investigate cold cases as well as cases suspected to involve missing persons.', 'Izumi Sakuragi is a new police sergeant with the Special Investigations Office, which was set up within the Metropolitan Police in November last year. The new investigation team uses DNA analysis and the latest in forensics science to investigate cold cases as well as cases suspected to involve missing persons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqk2GROSyVnQpHDyTC4g5wjgJXl.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:40395'),
  ('73498770370519121', 'Absolutely Fabulous', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Dawn French, Jennifer Saunders', 'Jennifer Saunders', 'Jennifer Saunders, Joanna Lumley, Julia Sawalha, June Whitfield, Jane Horrocks', 'TV-PG', 'Set in the world of fashion and PR, immature fun-loving mother Edina Monsoon and her best friend Patsy drive Eddie''s sensible daughter, Saffron, up the wall with their constant drug abuse and outrageous selfishness. Numerous in-jokes and heavy doses of cruel humour have made this series a cult hit in the UK and abroad.', 'Set in the world of fashion and PR, immature fun-loving mother Edina Monsoon and her best friend Patsy drive Eddie''s sensible daughter, Saffron, up the wall with their constant drug abuse and outrageous selfishness. Numerous in-jokes and heavy doses of cruel humour have made this series a cult hit in the UK and abroad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6HrSQwSwtzLlJYq2yeur3J5iR9.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:4493'),
  ('684809303985452743', 'Abstract: The Art of Design', 2017, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Step inside the minds of the most innovative designers in a variety of disciplines and learn how design impacts every aspect of life.', 'Step inside the minds of the most innovative designers in a variety of disciplines and learn how design impacts every aspect of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mBpWUNGlB66cP6ght7NyT3jXmWN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:70177'),
  ('1072267763402792043', 'Absurd Planet', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Afi Ekulona, Jeff Wild, Paul E. Raff', 'TV-PG', 'A cast of quirky critters and Mother Nature herself narrate this funny science series, which peeks into the lives of Earth''s most incredible animals.', 'A cast of quirky critters and Mother Nature herself narrate this funny science series, which peeks into the lives of Earth''s most incredible animals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhOeImIxEoNERkokViRBK5jKItO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:101836'),
  ('113425472253434794', 'Abyss', 2019, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Drama', 'Yu Je-won', null, 'Park Bo-young, Ahn Hyo-seop, Lee Sung-jae, Lee Si-eon, Song Sang-eun, Han So-hee, Kwon Soo-hyun, Yun Yoo-sun', 'TV-14', 'After meeting an untimely demise in separate incidents, Cha Min and Go Se-yeon discover they’ve come back to life in new bodies they don’t recognize.', 'After meeting an untimely demise in separate incidents, Cha Min and Go Se-yeon discover they’ve come back to life in new bodies they don’t recognize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttcqbLutnHABQwDiW1k7dxnsJLV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88328'),
  ('1033275580399847967', 'Abyss of Passion', 2012, 'Drama', 'Caridad Bravo Adams', null, 'Angelique Boyer, David Zepeda, Sabine Moussier, Blanca Guerra, Alejandro Camacho, Mark Tacher, Livia Brito Pestana, Altaír Jarabo', 'TV-14', 'Rosendo Arango, the owner of Grupo La Anita, is married to Alfonsina. They have one son, Damian. Estefanía Bouvier is married to Augusto Castanon and they have one daughter, Elisa. Rosendo cheats on his wife with Carmina Bouvier, Estefanía''s sister. Damian and Elisa become friends because Augusto and Rosendo were best friends. But one day, Rosendo and Carmina try to go away from La Ermita, the pueblo in which they live in. But, Estefanía, who had found out about their plans, wants to prevent this, shuts Carmina in her room and then goes with Rosendo in his car, trying to convince him not to run away with Carmina. They have an accident and die and everyone thinks they were lovers.', 'Rosendo Arango, the owner of Grupo La Anita, is married to Alfonsina. They have one son, Damian. Estefanía Bouvier is married to Augusto Castanon and they have one daughter, Elisa. Rosendo cheats on his wife with Carmina Bouvier, Estefanía''s sister. Damian and Elisa become friends because Augusto and Rosendo were best friends. But one day, Rosendo and Carmina try to go away from La Ermita, the pueblo in which they live in. But, Estefanía, who had found out about their plans, wants to prevent this, shuts Carmina in her room and then goes with Rosendo in his car, trying to convince him not to run away with Carmina. They have an accident and die and everyone thinks they were lovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eMo6VTGf3uNZrh9RShZDFSwwpfQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42280'),
  ('183053526678181217', 'Acacias 38', 2015, 'Drama', null, null, 'Marita Zafra, Inma Pérez-Quirós, Rebeca Alemañy, David V. Muro, Marc Parejo, Juanma Navas, Sandra Marchena, Rubén de Eguía', null, 'Acacias 38, the address of a stately apartment building where our stories unfold, is set in 1899 and tells the story of a group of maids and the bourgeois families they serve, in a single block in a distinguished neighborhood of a large Spanish city. Two worlds colliding in a universe of crossed lives.', 'Acacias 38, the address of a stately apartment building where our stories unfold, is set in 1899 and tells the story of a group of maids and the bourgeois families they serve, in a single block in a distinguished neighborhood of a large Spanish city. Two worlds colliding in a universe of crossed lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uApImWv5VMhXKvv543EvJlAN29O.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:62521'),
  ('39836496247987805', 'Acapulco', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Austin Winsberg, Jason Shuman, Eduardo Cisneros', null, 'Eugenio Derbez, Enrique Arrizon, Raphael Alejandro, Camila Perez, Chord Overstreet, Fernando Carsa, Jessica Collins, Vanessa Bauche', 'TV-14', 'In 1984, Maximo Gallardo''s dream comes true when he gets the job of a lifetime at Acapulco''s hottest resort, Las Colinas. But he soon realizes that working there will be far more complicated than he ever imagined.', 'In 1984, Maximo Gallardo''s dream comes true when he gets the job of a lifetime at Acapulco''s hottest resort, Las Colinas. But he soon realizes that working there will be far more complicated than he ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gzBkO4zFr75A13GKnjvTeg25pze.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:133727'),
  ('1136458539831979255', 'Acapulco H.E.A.T.', 1993, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Max A. Keller, Micheline H. Keller', null, 'Alison Armitage, Michael Worth, Christa Sauls, Lydie Denier', 'TV-14', 'Acapulco H.E.A.T. is a 1993 syndicated television series that followed the Hemisphere Emergency Action Team [H.E.A.T.], a group of top-secret agents based in Acapulco, Mexico and recruited by C-5, a secret government coalition, to fight terrorism and international crime. The team kept a low profile, by acting as models and photographers who represented a Beach Fashion enterprise.', 'Acapulco H.E.A.T. is a 1993 syndicated television series that followed the Hemisphere Emergency Action Team [H.E.A.T.], a group of top-secret agents based in Acapulco, Mexico and recruited by C-5, a secret government coalition, to fight terrorism and international crime. The team kept a low profile, by acting as models and photographers who represented a Beach Fashion enterprise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xh688GLiHihEqmf2yyBwmgcBOv5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:739'),
  ('385037356436366995', 'Acapulco Shore', 2014, 'Reality', null, null, 'Karime Pindter', 'TV-MA', 'A reality-based look at the vapid lives of several Mexican 20-somethings and their respective friends and/or hook-ups during their stay in Acapulco for a Summer vacation.', 'A reality-based look at the vapid lives of several Mexican 20-somethings and their respective friends and/or hook-ups during their stay in Acapulco for a Summer vacation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/81FW5jz4smr75wNYj1loJftzFrq.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:66084'),
  ('449858309503313815', 'ACCA: 13-Territory Inspection Dept.', 2017, 'Animation, Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Hiro Shimono, Aoi Yuuki, Kenjiro Tsuda, Junichi Suwabe, Koji Yusa, Hikaru Midorikawa, Hiroki Yasumoto, Toru Okawa', 'TV-14', '"ACCA" is a giant unified syndicate residing in a kingdom split into 13 autonomous regions. ACCA was formed back when there was threat of a coup d''etat, and has continued to protect the peace for almost one hundred years. Jean Otus, vice-chairman of the inspections department at ACCA headquarters, wanders through the 13 districts, checking to see if there is any foul play afoot. His quiet everyday life slowly gets swallowed up into the world''s conspiracies!', '"ACCA" is a giant unified syndicate residing in a kingdom split into 13 autonomous regions. ACCA was formed back when there was threat of a coup d''etat, and has continued to protect the peace for almost one hundred years. Jean Otus, vice-chairman of the inspections department at ACCA headquarters, wanders through the 13 districts, checking to see if there is any foul play afoot. His quiet everyday life slowly gets swallowed up into the world''s conspiracies!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/levpmW2U8QClpQYqYcpFAVw3vDq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69225'),
  ('715683912162489909', 'Accel World', 2012, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Hiroyuki Yoshino', 'Yuki Kaji, Sachika Misawa, Ayako Kawasumi, Kenichi Suzumura, Aki Toyosaki, Shintaro Asanuma, Sanae Kobayashi, Rina Hidaka', 'TV-14', 'A short, overweight student uses the Neuro Link, an evolution of the Nerve Gear, to escape himself from the reality. But his skills in the virtual world brings him to the attention of Kuroyukihime, a popular student who introduces him to the Brain Burst.', 'A short, overweight student uses the Neuro Link, an evolution of the Nerve Gear, to escape himself from the reality. But his skills in the virtual world brings him to the attention of Kuroyukihime, a popular student who introduces him to the Brain Burst.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eNodkllQPCOrWlPCRfPUc9Deyo2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43167'),
  ('226856876628155539', 'Acceptable Risk', 2017, 'Drama, Crime', 'Ron Hutchinson', 'Ron Hutchinson', 'Elaine Cassidy, Morten Suurballe, Angeline Ball, Lisa Dwyer Hogg, Geordie Johnson, Paul Popowich, Risteard Cooper, Kate Moran', 'NR', 'When her husband, Lee, is murdered, Sarah Manning comes to realize that she knows nothing about his past. Sarah begins to question who Lee actually was and what he did in his work for a powerful global organization. And why did Lee, a salesman, need to carry a gun?', 'When her husband, Lee, is murdered, Sarah Manning comes to realize that she knows nothing about his past. Sarah begins to question who Lee actually was and what he did in his work for a powerful global organization. And why did Lee, a salesman, need to carry a gun?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zzsVICf0QcopipyC2EBVINtgMeG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75019'),
  ('75612993588293808', 'Access Hollywood', 1996, 'News', null, null, 'Billy Bush, Kit Hoover', 'TV-G', 'Access Hollywood is a weekday television entertainment news program covering events and celebrities in the entertainment industry. It was created by former Entertainment Tonight executive producer Jim Van Messel, and is currently directed by Robert Silverstein. In previous years, Doug Dougherty and later Christopher A. Berry directed the program. Access Hollywood primarily focuses on news in the music, television, and film industries. The United States version began broadcasting on September 9, 1996, and is nationally syndicated in the United States. In 2003, a British version of the show began production and in an Irish version began in 2006 airing on the now defunct Channel 6, now known as 3e. In Canada, CTV Two has aired the program since September 5, 2011.', 'Access Hollywood is a weekday television entertainment news program covering events and celebrities in the entertainment industry. It was created by former Entertainment Tonight executive producer Jim Van Messel, and is currently directed by Robert Silverstein. In previous years, Doug Dougherty and later Christopher A. Berry directed the program. Access Hollywood primarily focuses on news in the music, television, and film industries. The United States version began broadcasting on September 9, 1996, and is nationally syndicated in the United States. In 2003, a British version of the show began production and in an Irish version began in 2006 airing on the now defunct Channel 6, now known as 3e. In Canada, CTV Two has aired the program since September 5, 2011.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jo4GGkoqqphE4rqpbNpnTTIUeRU.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:301'),
  ('92605358282745611', 'Accidentally in Love', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Chen Guang Xi Wei', 'Zhong Qing', 'Sun Yining, Guo Junchen, Ma Li, Zhao Yiqin, Zhou Mo, Cheng Muxuan, Yan Hao Yuan, Hou Xin Wei', 'TV-14', 'When Situ Feng decides to go back to school, he becomes the center of attention as fans, classmates and the media follow his every move. He meets Chen Qingqing, an ordinary student with a dual personality.', 'When Situ Feng decides to go back to school, he becomes the center of attention as fans, classmates and the media follow his every move. He meets Chen Qingqing, an ordinary student with a dual personality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPpOYJg3ARYmc3PpB8zDWOhJRWo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81494'),
  ('1002136670303671785', 'Accidentally on Purpose', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Claudia Lonow', null, 'Jenna Elfman, Jon Foster, Ashley Jensen, Lennon Parham, Nicolas Wright, Grant Show', 'TV-PG', 'A newspaper film critic, Billie is a single woman who finds herself "accidentally" pregnant after a one-night stand with a much younger guy, and decides to keep the baby... and the guy.', 'A newspaper film critic, Billie is a single woman who finds herself "accidentally" pregnant after a one-night stand with a much younger guy, and decides to keep the baby... and the guy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tokyJacZ4Fhfafs23PGsyhYdEj1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:18637'),
  ('514292398549943616', 'According to Jim', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Jonathan Stark, Tracy Newman', null, 'Jim Belushi, Courtney Thorne-Smith, Larry Joe Campbell, Taylor Atelian, Billi Bruno, Conner Rayburn', 'TV-PG', 'Jim is the typical all-American guy — a macho "everyman" — with a soft spot for his beautiful wife and children. Jim''s boyish bravado and humorous antics keep a certain level of turmoil in their home, but there''s never a doubt that this "opposites attract" couple are in their marriage for keeps!', 'Jim is the typical all-American guy — a macho "everyman" — with a soft spot for his beautiful wife and children. Jim''s boyish bravado and humorous antics keep a certain level of turmoil in their home, but there''s never a doubt that this "opposites attract" couple are in their marriage for keeps!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iNegoiByXFILSmBccfISNpVmTAK.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:1739'),
  ('662386311616871533', 'Accused', 2010, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jimmy McGovern', null, null, 'TV-14', 'How certain people end up being accused of a crime.', 'How certain people end up being accused of a crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cNTmeTD26zh3IGmWbiByHdsk8Ky.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:32940'),
  ('1145751327207106294', 'Accused', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'In this crime anthology series, viewers discover how an ordinary person got caught up in an extraordinary situation, ultimately revealing how one wrong turn leads to another, until it’s too late to turn back. Told from the defendant’s point of view, each episode opens in a courtroom on the accused without knowing their crime or how they ended up on trial.', 'In this crime anthology series, viewers discover how an ordinary person got caught up in an extraordinary situation, ultimately revealing how one wrong turn leads to another, until it’s too late to turn back. Told from the defendant’s point of view, each episode opens in a courtroom on the accused without knowing their crime or how they ended up on trial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w0zeTmejqPqVw07jVDkeQqJvxqq.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:202097'),
  ('337978272752081802', 'Accused: Guilty or Innocent?', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'An intimate account of what happens when someone is formally charged with a crime and sent to trial – all solely from the perspective of the accused, their legal team and family members.', 'An intimate account of what happens when someone is formally charged with a crime and sent to trial – all solely from the perspective of the accused, their legal team and family members.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fh0CGgySROOzd8hSbnNW6VRtZ0u.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:102287'),
  ('208488333673240292', 'Ace Attorney', 2016, 'Animation, Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Yuki Kaji, Aoi Yuuki, Masashi Tamaki, Saori Yumiba, Akio Otsuka, Ben Hiura, Chie Nakamura, Masami Iwasaki', 'TV-14', 'A rookie lawyer Ryuuichi Naruhodou stands up to save his defendants by proving their innocence from unusual cases! Is the defendant guilty or innocent...? Believing his client''s innocence Naruhodou stands in court and battles his rival judges. With the word of "OBJECTION!" and limited evidence, Naruhodou makes a comeback when all odds are against him and seems like there is nothing more he can do. Don''t miss out on the comical episodes between him and his mentor Chihiro Ayasato, assistant Mayoi Ayasato, rival prosecutor Reiji Mitsurugi, and numerous unique characters! The anime also depicts the childhood relationship between Naruhodou and his friends. With the skills inherited from his mentor Naruho reveals the truth!', 'A rookie lawyer Ryuuichi Naruhodou stands up to save his defendants by proving their innocence from unusual cases! Is the defendant guilty or innocent...? Believing his client''s innocence Naruhodou stands in court and battles his rival judges. With the word of "OBJECTION!" and limited evidence, Naruhodou makes a comeback when all odds are against him and seems like there is nothing more he can do. Don''t miss out on the comical episodes between him and his mentor Chihiro Ayasato, assistant Mayoi Ayasato, rival prosecutor Reiji Mitsurugi, and numerous unique characters! The anime also depicts the childhood relationship between Naruhodou and his friends. With the skills inherited from his mentor Naruho reveals the truth!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Rfcx9QxZqvsEl1Kh7yFhPpzb9R.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66103'),
  ('586134206971643130', 'Ace of Cakes', 2006, 'Reality', null, null, 'Duff Goldman', null, 'Ace of Cakes is an American reality television show that aired on the Food Network. The show focused on the daily operations of Duff Goldman''s custom cake shop, Charm City Cakes, in Baltimore, Maryland; including small-business ownership, working with various vendors, tasting with customers, constructing cakes, and delivering his products.', 'Ace of Cakes is an American reality television show that aired on the Food Network. The show focused on the daily operations of Duff Goldman''s custom cake shop, Charm City Cakes, in Baltimore, Maryland; including small-business ownership, working with various vendors, tasting with customers, constructing cakes, and delivering his products.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eALjxtP1jktXjEgzcJlAMezYfJt.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:740'),
  ('252174338659171931', 'Ace of the Diamond', 2013, 'Animation', null, null, 'Ryota Osaka, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Takahiro Sakurai, Natsuki Hanae, Shintaro Asanuma', 'TV-14', 'Scouted for his potential, brash left-handed pitcher Eijun Sawamura joins baseball powerhouse Seido High to become the undisputed ace of the team.', 'Scouted for his potential, brash left-handed pitcher Eijun Sawamura joins baseball powerhouse Seido High to become the undisputed ace of the team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2kqZX7OKVHkLm2XmI2AXxAd0MrA.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:60761'),
  ('135549672053548747', 'Ace Troops', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, War & Politics, Drama', null, '刘岩', 'Johnny Huang, Xiao Zhan, Zhong Chuxi, Li Youbin, Nikita Mao, Fu Chengpeng, Xu Honghao, Sun Xun', null, 'In a time span of nearly 40 years, the series tells the story of a group of young soldiers going through hardship and forging ahead to become the aces of the troop.', 'In a time span of nearly 40 years, the series tells the story of a group of young soldiers going through hardship and forging ahead to become the aces of the troop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A5Ug19rH4dpnEA8Pe7B0NNXtuRJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:154181'),
  ('57472865160714900', 'Ace Ventura: Pet Detective', 1995, 'Comedy, Animation, Kids', 'Tom Ruegger', null, 'Michael Daingerfield, Richard Binsley', 'TV-Y', 'The hilarious, wacky investigator and his pal Spike attempt to solve a series of baffling cases involving missing or stolen animals.', 'The hilarious, wacky investigator and his pal Spike attempt to solve a series of baffling cases involving missing or stolen animals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b8JcKGLEqlMTYSbN2GCIy2pkbZI.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2831'),
