  ('838071792582701521', 'Ahsoka', 2023, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Dave Filoni', 'George Lucas', 'Rosario Dawson, Natasha Liu Bordizzo, Ray Stevenson, Ivanna Sakhno, Mary Elizabeth Winstead, Diana Lee Inosanto, David Tennant', 'TV-14', 'Former Jedi Knight Ahsoka Tano investigates an emerging threat to a vulnerable galaxy.', 'Former Jedi Knight Ahsoka Tano investigates an emerging threat to a vulnerable galaxy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eiJeWeCAEZAmRppnXHiTWDcCd3Q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114461'),
  ('178775489020974165', 'AI Football GGO', 2010, 'Comedy, Animation, Family', null, null, 'Lin Zhang, Tuan Li, Yuebin Ju, Xuqiao Li, Tan Xiao, Ding Dang, Wang Zhen, Zhang Youwu', 'NR', 'Artificial Intelligent Football GGO is made by Puzzle Animation studio Ltd. It''s an animation series about football and future technology.', 'Artificial Intelligent Football GGO is made by Puzzle Animation studio Ltd. It''s an animation series about football and future technology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1TmnV1JruItCrmhTFEpnDzRF1M.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:33951'),
  ('890067725076572667', 'Ai Long Nhai', 2022, 'Drama', 'Nathakorn', null, 'Nichakoon Khajornborirak, Krittanun Aunchananun, Gun Tieosuwan, Save Saisawat, Jom Thanathorn Khuankaew, Nice Pitayut Orsuwan, Apiwat Apiwatsayree, Sappanyoo Panatkool', null, 'Expelled from school abroad, Ai starts fresh and falls for Nhai, a carefree student who doesn’t like him back—yet.', 'Expelled from school abroad, Ai starts fresh and falls for Nhai, a carefree student who doesn’t like him back—yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2U1TfKVvSSLn8U6WJWgDYZpzKya.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208591'),
  ('744090147748276951', 'Ai no Kusabi', 1992, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Toshihiko Seki, Kaneto Shiozawa, Show Hayami, Hideyuki Tanaka, Koji Tsujitani, Shigeru Chiba, Hideyuki Hori, Masami Kikuchi', null, 'On planet Amoi, a great society has developed, creating a computerized city called Tanagura, ruled by a supercomputer, Jupiter. The populace is almost entirely male and is based on hair color; light-haired men, "blondies", are the elites, and dark-haired are the bottom of society, often known as "mongrels". Blondies keep young boys as "pets" for a few years to perform sexual actions for the Blondie''s voyeurism entertainment. Blondies aren''t supposed to keep pets for long or interact sexually with pets, but one blondie named Iason Mink has kept a pet named Riki for years and is rumored to sleep with him. Iason refuses to let go of Riki, even with Jupiter''s disapproval. Iason is obsessed with keeping Riki, and Riki doesn''t know what to do; fight against him or surrender to him, nor what to do about his old friend/lover Guy and their gang.', 'On planet Amoi, a great society has developed, creating a computerized city called Tanagura, ruled by a supercomputer, Jupiter. The populace is almost entirely male and is based on hair color; light-haired men, "blondies", are the elites, and dark-haired are the bottom of society, often known as "mongrels". Blondies keep young boys as "pets" for a few years to perform sexual actions for the Blondie''s voyeurism entertainment. Blondies aren''t supposed to keep pets for long or interact sexually with pets, but one blondie named Iason Mink has kept a pet named Riki for years and is rumored to sleep with him. Iason refuses to let go of Riki, even with Jupiter''s disapproval. Iason is obsessed with keeping Riki, and Riki doesn''t know what to do; fight against him or surrender to him, nor what to do about his old friend/lover Guy and their gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mIc2LLqfAsQR4sL9YhR5cOUZLN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67325'),
  ('201106015072811516', 'Ai no Kusabi', 2012, 'Drama, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Rieko Yoshihara', null, 'Shin-ichiro Miki, Kentaro Ito, Toru Okawa, Kohsuke Toriumi, Showtaro Morikubo, Takaya Kuroda', null, 'This futuristic tale is set in a world where men are assigned various social classes based on their hair color. Iason Mink, a high-class Blondie, runs into Riki, a black-haired Mongrel, and makes him his "Pet." As Riki learns of the dangers Iason faces by keeping him, he finds himself developing feelings for his master. This is a remake of the 1992 OVA of the same name.', 'This futuristic tale is set in a world where men are assigned various social classes based on their hair color. Iason Mink, a high-class Blondie, runs into Riki, a black-haired Mongrel, and makes him his "Pet." As Riki learns of the dangers Iason faces by keeping him, he finds himself developing feelings for his master. This is a remake of the 1992 OVA of the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJUVBxZKzCBa55g0OhJ3j2hgLqY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43927'),
  ('999661236327677772', 'Ai Tenchi Muyo!', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Masaki Kajishima', null, 'Masami Kikuchi, You Taichi, Nao Toyama, Ai Orikasa, Yuko Kobayashi, Chisa Yokoyama, Haruhi Nanao, Yuko Mizutani', 'TV-14', 'In this story, the world is in chaos, thanks to Washu. Now in order to save it, Tenchi Masaki must go undercover as a student teacher at an all-girls school. Unfortunately for him, trouble always comes his way as he has a hard time dealing with the hijinks of his new students.', 'In this story, the world is in chaos, thanks to Washu. Now in order to save it, Tenchi Masaki must go undercover as a student teacher at an all-girls school. Unfortunately for him, trouble always comes his way as he has a hard time dealing with the hijinks of his new students.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rfRVtVJtGzhg6v3mfR5qzspQdI7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76645'),
  ('1091678767314534761', 'Ai the Video Girl', 2018, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Masakazu Katsura', 'Kohei Kiyasu', 'Nanase Nishino, Shuhei Nomura, Marie Iitoyo, Hiroya Shimizu, Karen Otomo, Shigeyuki Totsugi, Jun Murakami', null, 'The story is set in 2018, 25 years after the original manga''s "Video Girl Ai" arc ("Video Girl Len" arc was set seven years after the first arc). Sho Moteuchi (Shuhei Nomura) is a high school student. After his parents divorced, he begins to live with his uncle. At school, he develops feelings for his classmate Nanami, but Nanami likes his friend Tomoaki. One day, he finds an old broken video cassette recorder at his uncle’s house. Sho repairs the video cassette recorder and suddenly a video of girl plays. The girl in the video introduces herself as Video Girl Ai. The girl then steps out of the video and lives with Sho for the next 3 months.', 'The story is set in 2018, 25 years after the original manga''s "Video Girl Ai" arc ("Video Girl Len" arc was set seven years after the first arc). Sho Moteuchi (Shuhei Nomura) is a high school student. After his parents divorced, he begins to live with his uncle. At school, he develops feelings for his classmate Nanami, but Nanami likes his friend Tomoaki. One day, he finds an old broken video cassette recorder at his uncle’s house. Sho repairs the video cassette recorder and suddenly a video of girl plays. The girl in the video introduces herself as Video Girl Ai. The girl then steps out of the video and lives with Sho for the next 3 months.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3exMyvVKEtg2NJ5JLxL2QqAk3q3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77042'),
  ('224182484498068358', 'Ai Yori Aoshi', 2002, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Ayako Kawasumi, Soichiro Hoshi, Akiko Hiramatsu, Haruko Momoi, Kaori Mizuhashi, Satsuki Yukino, Sayaka Narita, Chiharu Suzuka', 'TV-14', 'Kaoru is a college boy with everything going for him. He lives in a mansion with his beautiful fiancé, Aoi, all his roommates are babes, and they all have the hots for him. There’s just one hitch: due to family complications, Kaoru and his beloved have to keep their engagement a secret. As he gets tangled in countless steamy situations, can Kaoru overcome temptation and stay true to the lovely Aoi?', 'Kaoru is a college boy with everything going for him. He lives in a mansion with his beautiful fiancé, Aoi, all his roommates are babes, and they all have the hots for him. There’s just one hitch: due to family complications, Kaoru and his beloved have to keep their engagement a secret. As he gets tangled in countless steamy situations, can Kaoru overcome temptation and stay true to the lovely Aoi?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBqJgnOAIJzc8MO6okjlH4ePfJh.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:42567'),
  ('1119285805366989398', 'Ai-Mai-Mi', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Ai Kayano, Maaya Uchida, Aya Uchida, Yuka Otsubo, Tenshin Mukai, Mikoi Sasaki, NEEKO, Ayane Sakura', null, 'Ai, Mai, and Mi, are the three girls that make up the manga club. Although they possess ample imagination, their far-out fantasies and insane adventures usually distract them from actually drawing any manga. From rescuing an abandoned cat, to getting addicted to video games, these girls handle ordinary things in extraordinary ways.', 'Ai, Mai, and Mi, are the three girls that make up the manga club. Although they possess ample imagination, their far-out fantasies and insane adventures usually distract them from actually drawing any manga. From rescuing an abandoned cat, to getting addicted to video games, these girls handle ordinary things in extraordinary ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1hVJnWV0ghfhN3TLKFUxkYn9S2i.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:50071'),
  ('823312208022143662', 'Ai''s Kitchen', 2024, 'Reality', null, null, 'Sylvia Chang, Tony Yang, Ko Chia-Yen, Darren Wang', null, 'Acclaimed actor, director and writer Sylvia Chang puts on a chef''s hat and leads a team to conquer the many hurdles of opening a diner.', 'Acclaimed actor, director and writer Sylvia Chang puts on a chef''s hat and leads a team to conquer the many hurdles of opening a diner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m4xwCzOF2doOIQOQEaboQ7Kbcdf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:262859'),
  ('395770953424125268', 'AIBOU: Tokyo Detective Duo', 2002, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'Yutaka Mizutani, Takashi Yamanaka, Kazuhisa Kawahara, Atsushi Yamanishi, Ryuji Katagiri, Ryo Ono, Mitsuhiro Oikawa', 'NR', 'Detective Ukyo Sugishita confronts crime on the basis of his own convictions. He has a partner that works for him in the Special Task Unit. For the first 7 seasons, Ukyo’s first partner is Kaoru Kameyama. He is a good-natured, hot-tempered, straightforward and somewhat scattered detective. Beginning in Season 8, Takeru Kanbe replaces Kameyama. Contrary to his predecessor, Takeru is a lanky, cool, conceited and confident detective. From Season 11 to Season 13, Ukyo’s partner is a young detective Toru Kai. Toru is a son of Deputy Director-General of The National Police Agency. But he became a detective by his own effort. And starting with Season 14, Ukyo’s current partner is Wataru Kaburagi, an elite bureaucrat who came to the Metropolitan Police Department on temporary assignment. As the first partner without any career of a police officer, he will face challenging cases together with Ukyo.', 'Detective Ukyo Sugishita confronts crime on the basis of his own convictions. He has a partner that works for him in the Special Task Unit. For the first 7 seasons, Ukyo’s first partner is Kaoru Kameyama. He is a good-natured, hot-tempered, straightforward and somewhat scattered detective. Beginning in Season 8, Takeru Kanbe replaces Kameyama. Contrary to his predecessor, Takeru is a lanky, cool, conceited and confident detective. From Season 11 to Season 13, Ukyo’s partner is a young detective Toru Kai. Toru is a son of Deputy Director-General of The National Police Agency. But he became a detective by his own effort. And starting with Season 14, Ukyo’s current partner is Wataru Kaburagi, an elite bureaucrat who came to the Metropolitan Police Department on temporary assignment. As the first partner without any career of a police officer, he will face challenging cases together with Ukyo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8u8rCCeuBufMQ1VlGX0lruhDaPR.jpg', 24, 'tmdb:tv:40663'),
  ('656479628319570969', 'Aída', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Paco León, Melani Olivares, Pepe Viyuela, Mariano Peña, Miren Ibarguren, Marisol Ayuso, Dani Martínez, David Castillo', 'TV-PG', 'Aída is a Spanish comedy sitcom set in Madrid, that spin off from another sitcom called 7 Vidas. The show first aired on January 16, 2005 and is produced by Globomedia for the Spanish network Telecinco. It currently started its ninth season. The show stars Carmen Machi as the title character, Aída García, a working, single mother with two teenage children, forced to move in with her mother and brother to make ends meet. The show has received favorable criticism from the audience and has been the most viewed show in Spain since 2007. It has also received several awards like the Ondas Award for Best Spanish Sitcom. The Polish re-make of the series began airing in March 2012 on TVP2 channel.', 'Aída is a Spanish comedy sitcom set in Madrid, that spin off from another sitcom called 7 Vidas. The show first aired on January 16, 2005 and is produced by Globomedia for the Spanish network Telecinco. It currently started its ninth season. The show stars Carmen Machi as the title character, Aída García, a working, single mother with two teenage children, forced to move in with her mother and brother to make ends meet. The show has received favorable criticism from the audience and has been the most viewed show in Spain since 2007. It has also received several awards like the Ondas Award for Best Spanish Sitcom. The Polish re-make of the series began airing in March 2012 on TVP2 channel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/poEaDSpLbpKeA2OI4n2X6K4udYd.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:1032'),
  ('245175943145044030', 'AIKa', 1997, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Hiroko Konishi, Rei Sakuma, Minami Takayama, Jurota Kosugi, Sakiko Tamagawa, Masaya Onosaka, Atsuko Tanaka, Kaneto Shiozawa', 'TV-MA', 'Aika Sumeragi works as a salvager for hire, but gets caught up in a plot for world domination.', 'Aika Sumeragi works as a salvager for hire, but gets caught up in a plot for world domination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0ooRM2kpIlzRpGpJ7oxBFGB0lW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43249'),
  ('455720059301952019', 'AIKa R-16 Virgin Mission', 2007, 'Animation', null, null, 'Ami Koshimizu, Misato Fukuen, Mamiko Noto, Naoko Suzuki', 'TV-MA', 'Aika is a skilled but impulsive high school student who earns a C-class salvager license yet struggles to find work due to her age and reputation. After advertising her services at school, she is hired by Erika, a wealthy student and leader of the Treasure Hunting Club. What begins as a simple salvage job quickly turns dangerous, leading Aika into a high-stakes mission, a clash in the southern islands, and the mystery surrounding a girl named Karen.', 'Aika is a skilled but impulsive high school student who earns a C-class salvager license yet struggles to find work due to her age and reputation. After advertising her services at school, she is hired by Erika, a wealthy student and leader of the Treasure Hunting Club. What begins as a simple salvage job quickly turns dangerous, leading Aika into a high-stakes mission, a clash in the southern islands, and the mystery surrounding a girl named Karen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUdRWc50BpSfhyN57NpA90vPmMO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68417'),
  ('19798937399838649', 'AIKa ZERO', 2009, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Ami Koshimizu, Miyuki Sawashiro, Misato Fukuen, Mikako Takahashi, Mamiko Noto, Akio Otsuka, Asami Shimoda, Naoko Suzuki', 'TV-MA', 'In the future — in a world mostly submerged under water — the 19-year-old Sumeragi Aika goes to college while training as an agent by assisting in Aida Gozo''s salvaging business.', 'In the future — in a world mostly submerged under water — the 19-year-old Sumeragi Aika goes to college while training as an agent by assisting in Aida Gozo''s salvaging business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4tRLDshDPOyQTlt9rARCoLyV9l.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43631'),
  ('170455098412539062', 'Aikatsu Friends!', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Family, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yui Ninomiya, Akane Matsunaga, Yuuki Kuwahara, Saori Onishi, Emiri Suyama, Azusa Tadokoro, Ayaka Ohashi, Sumire Morohoshi', null, 'Aine Yūki is good at making friends, and is enrolled in Star Harmony Academy''s general education track. She befriends Mio Minato, the school''s top idol, and becomes an idol herself.', 'Aine Yūki is good at making friends, and is enrolled in Star Harmony Academy''s general education track. She befriends Mio Minato, the school''s top idol, and becomes an idol herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pM5ND1TiH6jArgMjMbJcnGMhk5W.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:79024'),
  ('298445933711738332', 'Aikatsu Planet!', 2021, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Drama, Family, Kids', null, null, 'Kaaya Date, Rio Ogura, Mizuki, Shizune Nagao, Rion Watanabe, Amy, Narumi Uno, Rurika Uno', null, 'Its story is set in Aikatsu Planet, a world where everyone can become cute idols using an avatar. While spending school life, the main characters are aiming to become top idols. Everyday parts such as the main character''s school life will be filmed in live-action, and the Aikatsu Planet! world will be drawn in anime and 3DCG (like the previous series). The live-action part''s cast members will form a unit "STARRY PLANET*" and perform as idols at events and on YouTube. A new Data Carddass game linked to the TV series, "Data Carddass Aikatsu Planet!" is also scheduled to begin its service this winter.', 'Its story is set in Aikatsu Planet, a world where everyone can become cute idols using an avatar. While spending school life, the main characters are aiming to become top idols. Everyday parts such as the main character''s school life will be filmed in live-action, and the Aikatsu Planet! world will be drawn in anime and 3DCG (like the previous series). The live-action part''s cast members will form a unit "STARRY PLANET*" and perform as idols at events and on YouTube. A new Data Carddass game linked to the TV series, "Data Carddass Aikatsu Planet!" is also scheduled to begin its service this winter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sqV6odZ8PRnxPBLCaiIceghUp6q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107315'),
  ('530482774494776396', 'Aikatsu Stars!', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Family, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Miyu Tomita, Ayaka Asai, Natsumi Murakami, Yume Miyamoto, Minami Tsuda, Sumire Morohoshi, Azusa Tadokoro, Ayaka Ohashi', null, 'Yume Nijino aims to become a top idol, and she enrolls in the Yotsuboshi Gakuen (Four Stars Academy). This academy has a special group called the S4, who are the top four active idols in the school. Yume and the other first-year students aim to become a part of the S4.', 'Yume Nijino aims to become a top idol, and she enrolls in the Yotsuboshi Gakuen (Four Stars Academy). This academy has a special group called the S4, who are the top four active idols in the school. Yume and the other first-year students aim to become a part of the S4.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fiWqW5wYF702dpQWwSeRwKOyXqZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:65929'),
  ('736705050248972880', 'Aikatsu!', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Sumire Morohoshi, Ayaka Ohashi, Azusa Tadokoro, Aya Suzaki, Minako Kotobuki, Tomoyo Kurosawa, Sanae Fuku, Shino Shimoji', null, 'Ichigo Hoshimiya is a regular, ordinary middle school girl. But when her best friend Aoi invites her to join the idol training academy, Starlight Academy, her whole world is turned upside down. As she encounters all kinds of rivals and learns what it takes to be an idol, she uses her Aikatsu Cards to challenge countless auditions.', 'Ichigo Hoshimiya is a regular, ordinary middle school girl. But when her best friend Aoi invites her to join the idol training academy, Starlight Academy, her whole world is turned upside down. As she encounters all kinds of rivals and learns what it takes to be an idol, she uses her Aikatsu Cards to challenge countless auditions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tRALkRAPfXlDsJ8XPx9Shz4mvsC.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:65503'),
  ('847845295670117755', 'Aiming High', 2000, 'Drama', 'Wai-kin Chong', null, 'Nicholas Tse Ting-Fung, Nicola Cheung Sun-Yuet, Yuen Wah, Fiona Leung Ngai-Ling, Hawick Lau Hau-Wai, Cindy Au, Willie Wai Ga-Hung, Lee San-San', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0rFGZUSWWYSSIQfycWP9dwdkYu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:48203'),
  ('260382084593591608', 'Ainori Love Wagon: Asian Journey', 2017, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'Seven men and women board a pink bus in search of true love. On a journey through Asia with strangers, their goal is to return to Japan as a couple.', 'Seven men and women board a pink bus in search of true love. On a journey through Asia with strangers, their goal is to return to Japan as a couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umpeZ1nddrHNrgaXL8jGxjGqcSE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:80513'),
  ('520949853706313973', 'Air', 2005, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tomoko Kawakami', 'TV-14', 'Yukito Kunisaki is on a journey in search of the Winged Maiden who was bound to the sky centuries ago after hearing the old childhood tale from his mother. As Yukito shows his puppet show to people in an attempt to make some money, he finds himself in a small town in which he did not expect to stay very long. However, when he meets an unusual girl named Misuzu, things take a drastic turn as he is invited to stay with her.', 'Yukito Kunisaki is on a journey in search of the Winged Maiden who was bound to the sky centuries ago after hearing the old childhood tale from his mother. As Yukito shows his puppet show to people in an attempt to make some money, he finds himself in a small town in which he did not expect to stay very long. However, when he meets an unusual girl named Misuzu, things take a drastic turn as he is invited to stay with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZ97grqenZ0oB3Da9NKkucNbSpj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:26201'),
  ('1070420763750097151', 'Air Crash Investigation: Special Report', 2018, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, 'Jonathan Aris', null, 'In this special season of Air Crash Investigation, every episode examines multiple aviation disasters that prove to have similarities including; engines that separated from their aircrafts mid-flight, mismatched pilot pairings that led to deadly crashes, and improvised landings with tragic consequences.', 'In this special season of Air Crash Investigation, every episode examines multiple aviation disasters that prove to have similarities including; engines that separated from their aircrafts mid-flight, mismatched pilot pairings that led to deadly crashes, and improvised landings with tragic consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u3OWTRIcjRLziLStbrrruLE2hDi.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:120324'),
  ('426283095690312205', 'Air Disasters', 2011, 'Documentary', 'André Barro, Bernard Vaillot', null, 'Stephen Bogaert', null, 'Catastrophic incidents in aviation history are meticulously reenacted, providing insight into what went wrong and if the crashes and near-disasters could have been prevented. Accounts from survivors combine with cockpit recordings and computer images to weave the gripping tales, and expert testimony reveals the hows and whys behind the events, some of which have resulted in important changes to aviation safety and regulations.', 'Catastrophic incidents in aviation history are meticulously reenacted, providing insight into what went wrong and if the crashes and near-disasters could have been prevented. Accounts from survivors combine with cockpit recordings and computer images to weave the gripping tales, and expert testimony reveals the hows and whys behind the events, some of which have resulted in important changes to aviation safety and regulations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ffMI8g8wUNFXL4UWpii9erWn5Pm.jpg', 25, 'tmdb:tv:60760'),
  ('173527972673301189', 'Air Gear', 2006, 'Comedy, Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Kenta Kamakari, Mariya Ise, KENN, Masami Kikuchi, Hitoshi Bifu, Cocoro Kikuchi, Shoko Ishii, Yukiko Hanioka', 'TV-MA', 'Itsuki Minami is a school student notorious for engaging in street fights, a reckless punk that will break through any obstacle, alongside his best friends Kazuma Mikura and Onigiri. However, when he discovers a pair of Air Trecks his true desire to rule the skies takes off.', 'Itsuki Minami is a school student notorious for engaging in street fights, a reckless punk that will break through any obstacle, alongside his best friends Kazuma Mikura and Onigiri. However, when he discovers a pair of Air Trecks his true desire to rule the skies takes off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2L56xOGEgYTasjzYMUylEc29eyb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31670'),
  ('1022331944571078235', 'Air Master', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Romi Park, Tomoko Kaneda, Mika Doi, Masumi Asano, Yukana, Mariko Suzuki, Toshio Furukawa, Kenyu Horiuchi', 'TV-14', 'Former gymnast Aikawa Maki has turned her skills to a different way of life - street fighting. The only thing that truly makes her feel alive is violence.', 'Former gymnast Aikawa Maki has turned her skills to a different way of life - street fighting. The only thing that truly makes her feel alive is violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zGzDKBByPb3AmIvqCbHBGCKtHBg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34698'),
  ('735165495758989389', 'Airwolf', 1984, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Donald P. Bellisario', null, 'Geraint Wyn Davies, Michele Scarabelli, Anthony Sherwood, Barry Van Dyke', 'TV-PG', 'As part of a deal with an intelligence agency to look for his missing brother, a renegade pilot goes on missions with an advanced battle helicopter.', 'As part of a deal with an intelligence agency to look for his missing brother, a renegade pilot goes on missions with an advanced battle helicopter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4PAN7zPqmR9b73een97WkxqCTQN.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2119'),
  ('159954797651493850', 'Aishite Knight', 1983, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Mitsuko Horie, Chiyoko Kawashima, Hideyuki Hori, Isao Sasaki, Kaneto Shiozawa, Katsuji Mori, Masashi Amenomori, Mugihito', null, 'Yakko is an 18 year old girl working in her father''s restaurant. One day Yakko casually meets a little boy, Hashizo and his odd cat Juliano. Hashizo has lost both parents when still a baby and has been brought up by his elder brother. Hashizo''s brother Go is the lead singer of the emerging rock band "Bee Hive." When Yakko meets Go and his friend and Bee Hive member Satomi an unexpected series of events unfolds. Love, jealousy, rock''n roll and the sparkle of newly born stars is what makes this anime so lovable.', 'Yakko is an 18 year old girl working in her father''s restaurant. One day Yakko casually meets a little boy, Hashizo and his odd cat Juliano. Hashizo has lost both parents when still a baby and has been brought up by his elder brother. Hashizo''s brother Go is the lead singer of the emerging rock band "Bee Hive." When Yakko meets Go and his friend and Bee Hive member Satomi an unexpected series of events unfolds. Love, jealousy, rock''n roll and the sparkle of newly born stars is what makes this anime so lovable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hmHGq255s3Wydf6JKHbUGBri2sO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19837'),
  ('645839114890247850', 'Aishiteruze Baby', 2004, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Miyu Tsuzurahara, Maki Saito, Masami Suzuki, Fuyuka Ono, Fumina Hara, Aoi Yuuki, Kumiko Endo, Ayumi Furuyama', null, 'Kippei is a ladies man. Always in trouble for flirting in class, after class, anytime he can. So it is some big surprise to him when he gets saddled with watching Yuzuyu, a cute little girl.Yuzuyu`s mother has gone missing, and so Kippei`s family is watching her until her mother can be found. Of course, since Kippei could use a few lessons in responsibility, he is the "best" choice for the job.This story is working out to be very cute. Kippei`s natural "mother" instinct is really brought to the front while trying to to his best for Yuzuyu, but he is a boy. His ineptitude regarding the smallest things a mother would need to know [like packing a lunch for school] are endearing rather than hokey, and the character of Yuzuyu is cute, without being overly so.', 'Kippei is a ladies man. Always in trouble for flirting in class, after class, anytime he can. So it is some big surprise to him when he gets saddled with watching Yuzuyu, a cute little girl.Yuzuyu`s mother has gone missing, and so Kippei`s family is watching her until her mother can be found. Of course, since Kippei could use a few lessons in responsibility, he is the "best" choice for the job.This story is working out to be very cute. Kippei`s natural "mother" instinct is really brought to the front while trying to to his best for Yuzuyu, but he is a boy. His ineptitude regarding the smallest things a mother would need to know [like packing a lunch for school] are endearing rather than hokey, and the character of Yuzuyu is cute, without being overly so.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtLAUCxO75YKKd7D4ceEvKYgIuC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34072'),
  ('1122436260269579624', 'Aiura', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yui Nakajima, Yuuko Iida, Nao Tamura, Tomokazu Sugita, Yukari Tamura, Yumiri Hanamori, Yumi Uchiyama, Ayane Sakura', null, 'They don''t always see eye-to-eye, but that just makes these high school girls'' daily lives more fun. "Their lives happen when nothing is happening".', 'They don''t always see eye-to-eye, but that just makes these high school girls'' daily lives more fun. "Their lives happen when nothing is happening".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jghz8BJVYNbrMeQPRGicgiPZvn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:50076'),
  ('1126391580937186738', 'AJ and the Queen', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'RuPaul, Michael Patrick King', null, 'RuPaul, Izzy G., Michael-Leon Wooley, Josh Segarra, Katerina Tannenbaum, Tia Carrere', 'TV-14', 'While traveling across the country in a run-down RV, drag queen Ruby Red discovers an unlikely sidekick in AJ: a tough-talking 10-year-old stowaway.', 'While traveling across the country in a run-down RV, drag queen Ruby Red discovers an unlikely sidekick in AJ: a tough-talking 10-year-old stowaway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4rxVYDVCTeHAyZf1W8tlUMvd1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84896'),
  ('275941828620148494', 'Ajin', 2016, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Mystery', null, null, 'Mamoru Miyano, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Aya Suzaki, Daisuke Hirakawa, Hiroyuki Kinoshita, Hochu Otsuka, Jun Fukuyama, Kenichi Suzumura', 'TV-MA', '17 years ago, immortals first appeared on the battlefields of Africa. Later, rare, unknown new immortal lifeforms began appearing among humans, and they became known as "Ajin" (demi-humans). Just before summer vacation, a Japanese high school student is instantly killed in a traffic accident on his way home from school. However, he is revived, and a price is placed on his head. Thus begins a boy''s life on the run from all of humankind.', '17 years ago, immortals first appeared on the battlefields of Africa. Later, rare, unknown new immortal lifeforms began appearing among humans, and they became known as "Ajin" (demi-humans). Just before summer vacation, a Japanese high school student is instantly killed in a traffic accident on his way home from school. However, he is revived, and a price is placed on his head. Thus begins a boy''s life on the run from all of humankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fnHBwIKxwrFleSzvHzTqcAzDRM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:65292'),
  ('301324935846305836', 'aka Charlie Sheen', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Andrew Renzi', null, 'Charlie Sheen, Jon Cryer, Sean Penn, Ramon Estevez, Chris Tucker, Tony Todd, Martin Sheen, Emilio Estevez', 'TV-MA', 'Actor Charlie Sheen tells his story in this candid two-part documentary tracing his dazzling Hollywood rise, tabloid-topping fall and road to recovery.', 'Actor Charlie Sheen tells his story in this candid two-part documentary tracing his dazzling Hollywood rise, tabloid-topping fall and road to recovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pHAM8Fzek7xwTbqmaxPXAjCAjz1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:298234'),
  ('24463930666159883', 'Akagi', 2005, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Masato Hagiwara, Toru Furuya', null, 'Nangou is a compulsive gambler who has accumulated debt over three million yen. In a last ditch attempt to clear his record, he decides to wager his life on a game of mahjong with the mafia. Unfortunately, as the game progresses, Nangou only moves further from the prize and closer to death. When all hope seems lost, the game parlor is suddenly intruded upon by Shigeru Akagi, a young boy on the run from the police. Desperate to turn the game around, Nangou hands the game over to Akagi after teaching him a few of the rules. The mafia can only smirk as Akagi sits down to play. However, they soon come to learn that Akagi is a natural born gambler. An imposing figure who does not fear death. One who is destined to become a legend.', 'Nangou is a compulsive gambler who has accumulated debt over three million yen. In a last ditch attempt to clear his record, he decides to wager his life on a game of mahjong with the mafia. Unfortunately, as the game progresses, Nangou only moves further from the prize and closer to death. When all hope seems lost, the game parlor is suddenly intruded upon by Shigeru Akagi, a young boy on the run from the police. Desperate to turn the game around, Nangou hands the game over to Akagi after teaching him a few of the rules. The mafia can only smirk as Akagi sits down to play. However, they soon come to learn that Akagi is a natural born gambler. An imposing figure who does not fear death. One who is destined to become a legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hsXnmIZfp8B8TobylmIbe8wHyDi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42877'),
  ('83175481168019939', 'Akame ga Kill!', 2014, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Soma Saito, Sora Amamiya, Yukari Tamura, Yuu Asakawa, Anri Katsu, Ayaka Ohashi, Eiji Takemoto, Eriko Matsui', 'TV-MA', 'Young Tatsumi travels to the capital of the Empire in order to earn money for his starving people and encounters a world of unimaginable depravity, dominated by the ruthless Prime Minister who controls the child Emperor. Tatsumi is recruited by Night Raid, a group of assassins dedicated to eliminating corruption by mercilessly killing officials and privileged nobles.', 'Young Tatsumi travels to the capital of the Empire in order to earn money for his starving people and encounters a world of unimaginable depravity, dominated by the ruthless Prime Minister who controls the child Emperor. Tatsumi is recruited by Night Raid, a group of assassins dedicated to eliminating corruption by mercilessly killing officials and privileged nobles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMpvMbSlPbm5QYfFem9fx2Jnttq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61223'),
  ('46790326292817506', 'Akane-banashi', 2026, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Anna Nagase, Takuya Eguchi, Rie Takahashi, Jun Fukuyama, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Chiaki Kobayashi, Yohei Azakami, Seiichiro Yamashita', null, 'Akane Osaki, captivated since childhood by the magical performances of her father, Shinta Arakawa, witnesses a shocking incident during his decisive performance for promotion to shin''uchi (master rank). Six years later, now a high school student, she sets her sights on becoming a shin''uchi herself—pushing forward in the highly competitive world of rakugo.', 'Akane Osaki, captivated since childhood by the magical performances of her father, Shinta Arakawa, witnesses a shocking incident during his decisive performance for promotion to shin''uchi (master rank). Six years later, now a high school student, she sets her sights on becoming a shin''uchi herself—pushing forward in the highly competitive world of rakugo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wqpVouqT0vX8CQ0hO3DUdDQbZcP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:297438'),
  ('870994917599349118', 'Akashic Records of Bastard Magic Instructor', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Soma Saito, Akane Fujita, Yume Miyamoto, Ari Ozawa, Hiroki Takahashi, Eri Kitamura', 'TV-MA', 'The Alzano Imperial Magic Academy is located in the southern part of the Alzano Empire and is among most prominent magic schools in the world, where students can learn the highest forms of magic. All those who strive to learn magic dream of studying at this academy, and its students as well as its teachers are proud to be a part of its 400-year history. Glenn Radars is a new instructor who has suddenly been appointed to teach part-time at this highly respected academy. The previously unheard-of lessons of this man known as a good-for-nothing bastard are about to begin.', 'The Alzano Imperial Magic Academy is located in the southern part of the Alzano Empire and is among most prominent magic schools in the world, where students can learn the highest forms of magic. All those who strive to learn magic dream of studying at this academy, and its students as well as its teachers are proud to be a part of its 400-year history. Glenn Radars is a new instructor who has suddenly been appointed to teach part-time at this highly respected academy. The previously unheard-of lessons of this man known as a good-for-nothing bastard are about to begin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTsIeYiZF1DJN1alsgVgk8iA5ci.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70637'),
  ('669475091924744228', 'Akasya Durağı', 2008, 'Comedy, Family', 'Türker İnanoğlu', 'Resul Ertaş, Resul Ertaş', 'Zeki Alasya, Cezmi Baskın, Levent Ülgen, Onur Şan, Nilgün Belgün, Aslı Altaylar, Timur Acar, Gülay Baltacı', null, 'Akasya Durağı is a Turkish comedy television series on Kanal D, which initially broadcast in 2008 The Story: Nuri is a very old driver and when he become retired he start his own taxi company with money that earned for all of his life. There are a few sympathetic driver and pure tea maker-office boy at the taxi company. And all of them life is very interesting and very funny. They have great time at the taxi company. Too many events do and find our drivers and their lives''. The story goes so... By the way, everyone says to Nuri ''Nuri Dad'' because he is a very good man.', 'Akasya Durağı is a Turkish comedy television series on Kanal D, which initially broadcast in 2008 The Story: Nuri is a very old driver and when he become retired he start his own taxi company with money that earned for all of his life. There are a few sympathetic driver and pure tea maker-office boy at the taxi company. And all of them life is very interesting and very funny. They have great time at the taxi company. Too many events do and find our drivers and their lives''. The story goes so... By the way, everyone says to Nuri ''Nuri Dad'' because he is a very good man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aZVlKCq6vRRes1wvzYMV8NTBwKd.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:32915'),
  ('951170852275374746', 'AKB0048', 2012, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Sayaka Nakaya, Amina Sato, Sawako Hata, Sumire Sato, Karen Iwata, Haruka Ishida, Kumi Yagami, Mayu Watanabe', null, 'AKB0048, sometimes stylized AKB∞48, is a 2012 Japanese anime television series based on the popular AKB48 idol group. The anime is produced by Satelight, with Shōji Kawamori as chief director and writer. The first season aired in Japan between April and July 2012 whilst the second season aired between January and March 2013.', 'AKB0048, sometimes stylized AKB∞48, is a 2012 Japanese anime television series based on the popular AKB48 idol group. The anime is produced by Satelight, with Shōji Kawamori as chief director and writer. The first season aired in Japan between April and July 2012 whilst the second season aired between January and March 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRTmEAerrjdBEqGzRA8y1lp8BoF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45982'),
  ('286707777878525996', 'AKBINGO!', 2008, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Daisuke Muramoto', null, 'AKBINGO! is a long-running variety show featuring Japanese idol group AKB48. Its opening theme song was the AKB48 single "Aitakatta" until 2016, when it was changed to an instrumental jingle. In each episode, members from AKB48, and sometimes its sister groups, participate in a series of games and activities. The show was hosted by owarai comedy duo Bad Boys, Omizo Kiyoto and Sata Masaki, until they were replaced by Woman Rush Hour, Muramoto Daisuke & Nakagawa Paradise, in July 2016. The show aired on "late night" Wednesdays until it was moved to "late night" Tuesdays in April 2013.', 'AKBINGO! is a long-running variety show featuring Japanese idol group AKB48. Its opening theme song was the AKB48 single "Aitakatta" until 2016, when it was changed to an instrumental jingle. In each episode, members from AKB48, and sometimes its sister groups, participate in a series of games and activities. The show was hosted by owarai comedy duo Bad Boys, Omizo Kiyoto and Sata Masaki, until they were replaced by Woman Rush Hour, Muramoto Daisuke & Nakagawa Paradise, in July 2016. The show aired on "late night" Wednesdays until it was moved to "late night" Tuesdays in April 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fDxpGJXLmCe6FkUD0ltDQ2TQww.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:40049'),
  ('688278449674642657', 'Akebi''s Sailor Uniform', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Manatsu Murakami, Sora Amamiya, Akari Kito, Shion Wakayama, Akira Sekine, Shizuka Ishigami, Yui Ishikawa, Momo Asakura', 'TV-14', 'It’s Komichi Akebi’s first year of junior high and she has her heart set on one thing: Robai Private Academy’s sailor uniform. As the next chapter of her life gets closer, she dreams of all the exciting new experiences she’ll get to have—school lunches, classes, club activities, and of course, making lots of friends! With her favorite outfit on, Komichi feels ready for anything.', 'It’s Komichi Akebi’s first year of junior high and she has her heart set on one thing: Robai Private Academy’s sailor uniform. As the next chapter of her life gets closer, she dreams of all the exciting new experiences she’ll get to have—school lunches, classes, club activities, and of course, making lots of friends! With her favorite outfit on, Komichi feels ready for anything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGMOxl3o9QNeRzAvmeDJaaxLrtV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121792'),
  ('754986590033001097', 'Akiba Maid War', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Crime', null, null, 'Reina Kondo, Rina Sato, Minami Tanaka, Tomoyo Kurosawa, Jenya Davidyuk, Ayahi Takagaki, Aya Hirano, Koki Uchiyama', 'TV-MA', 'Akihabara is the center of the universe for the coolest hobbies and quirkiest amusements. In the spring of 1999, bright-eyed Nagomi Wahira moves there with dreams of joining a maid café. She quickly dons an apron at café Ton Tokoton, AKA the Pig Hut. But adjusting to life in bustling Akihabara isn''t as easy as serving tea and delighting customers. Paired with the dour Ranko who never seems to smile, Nagomi must do her best to elevate the Pig Hut over all other maid cafés vying for top ranking. Along the way she''ll slice out a place for herself amid the frills and thrills of life at the Pig Hut. Just when Nagomi''s dreams are within her grasp, she discovers not everything is as it seems amid the maid cafés of Akihabara.', 'Akihabara is the center of the universe for the coolest hobbies and quirkiest amusements. In the spring of 1999, bright-eyed Nagomi Wahira moves there with dreams of joining a maid café. She quickly dons an apron at café Ton Tokoton, AKA the Pig Hut. But adjusting to life in bustling Akihabara isn''t as easy as serving tea and delighting customers. Paired with the dour Ranko who never seems to smile, Nagomi must do her best to elevate the Pig Hut over all other maid cafés vying for top ranking. Along the way she''ll slice out a place for herself amid the frills and thrills of life at the Pig Hut. Just when Nagomi''s dreams are within her grasp, she discovers not everything is as it seems amid the maid cafés of Akihabara.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uSbDmK5y8dWVxngbWSWpmO47EI9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204716'),
  ('961004148704374162', 'Akiba''s Trip The Animation', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yuki Takao, Rie Takahashi, Haruki Ishiya, Haruka Yamazaki, Yu Serizawa, Chinami Hashimoto, Mariko Honda, Kazuyuki Okitsu', 'TV-14', 'Set in Akihabara, the shopping area has been invaded by creatures known as "Synthisters" who prey on the patrons of Akihabara, feasting on their social energy and will to live. These enemies can only be stopped by direct exposure to sunlight, meaning to defeat these synthisters their clothes need to be ripped off exposing them to sunlight.', 'Set in Akihabara, the shopping area has been invaded by creatures known as "Synthisters" who prey on the patrons of Akihabara, feasting on their social energy and will to live. These enemies can only be stopped by direct exposure to sunlight, meaning to defeat these synthisters their clothes need to be ripped off exposing them to sunlight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHba6T5GKimojrXTLvEETDdFSr7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69230'),
  ('88847499663693344', 'Akihabara@DEEP', 2006, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Yuki Himura, Toma Ikuta, Kazuki Kitamura, Gen Hoshino, Hatsune Matsushima, Manami Honjo, Shunsuke Kazama, Yuka Kosaka', null, 'Akihabara is a Tokyo district full of manga, anime, electronics, video games, figurines, etc. It is a place that gathers fanatics of such themes, people who are commonly referred to as otaku. Page, Box, Akira, Taiko, Daruma, and Izumu are six otaku each with his/her own troubles and sought relief through a website called "Yui''s Lifeguard." When site owner Yui died of a mysterious death, the six who are each experts in their own fields gathered to form "Akihabara@DEEP", a "trouble shooter" group that vows to protect Akihabara and solve the problems of its inhabitants.', 'Akihabara is a Tokyo district full of manga, anime, electronics, video games, figurines, etc. It is a place that gathers fanatics of such themes, people who are commonly referred to as otaku. Page, Box, Akira, Taiko, Daruma, and Izumu are six otaku each with his/her own troubles and sought relief through a website called "Yui''s Lifeguard." When site owner Yui died of a mysterious death, the six who are each experts in their own fields gathered to form "Akihabara@DEEP", a "trouble shooter" group that vows to protect Akihabara and solve the problems of its inhabitants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eUo2tRjkwbTuAze7HA92KmUR7Zc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46231'),
  ('480977771927541772', 'Akikan!', 2009, 'Comedy, Animation', null, null, 'Jun Fukuyama, Aki Toyosaki, Ryo Hirohashi, Sayaka Narita, Mamiko Noto, Aoi Yuuki, Megumi Nakajima, Aiko Okubo', null, 'Daichi Kakeru is a high school student who has never had a girlfriend. Little did he know that everything was about to change when he bought a melon soda on his way home from school as the can came to life in the form of a girl, whom he calls "Melon".', 'Daichi Kakeru is a high school student who has never had a girlfriend. Little did he know that everything was about to change when he bought a melon soda on his way home from school as the can came to life in the form of a girl, whom he calls "Melon".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lo2WdY9x0dm3Q5Qs3Lc3Zyj0DWp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43634'),
  ('1068119610229540289', 'Akinai Seiden: Kin to Gin', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, null, null, 'Set in the mid-Edo period, this drama follows Sachi, who works as an apprentice at the Osaka Tenma kimono merchant Isuzuya and strives to carve a way to success despite the challenges she faces.', 'Set in the mid-Edo period, this drama follows Sachi, who works as an apprentice at the Osaka Tenma kimono merchant Isuzuya and strives to carve a way to success despite the challenges she faces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/baM6A1nFG7pZ8HMuTXQMX91IsEj.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:231127'),
  ('374559110694599516', 'Akō Rōshi', 1964, 'Drama', null, null, 'Onoe Baiko VII, Kazuo Hasegawa, Rokkō Toura, Osamu Takizawa, Yoichi Hayashi, Isuzu Yamada, Katsuo Nakamura, Kyôko Kishida', null, '"Ako Roshi" is a group of 47 former retainers of Lord Asano. Lord Asano was forced to commit suicide after attempting to kill Lord Kira. Once the retainers hear about their Lord''s death, they sacrifice their lives to regain the honor of their former master.', '"Ako Roshi" is a group of 47 former retainers of Lord Asano. Lord Asano was forced to commit suicide after attempting to kill Lord Kira. Once the retainers hear about their Lord''s death, they sacrifice their lives to regain the honor of their former master.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUmE1LGb4W81LNZ3Hp95VxkbzKf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:118161'),
  ('946998264511760196', 'Akudama Drive', 2020, 'Animation, Mystery, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Crime', null, null, 'Tomoyo Kurosawa, Yuuichirou Umehara, Shunsuke Takeuchi, Shun Horie, Megumi Ogata, Subaru Kimura, Takahiro Sakurai', 'TV-MA', 'Many years ago, a Great Civil War ravaged Japan, leaving the country fragmented between two regions: Kansai and Kanto. In Kansai, a group of six Akudama carry out missions given to them by a mysterious black cat, while evading the police. But a dangerous journey is about to unfold when a civilian girl becomes twisted into the Akudama''s way of life and witnesses their criminal drives.', 'Many years ago, a Great Civil War ravaged Japan, leaving the country fragmented between two regions: Kansai and Kanto. In Kansai, a group of six Akudama carry out missions given to them by a mysterious black cat, while evading the police. But a dangerous journey is about to unfold when a civilian girl becomes twisted into the Akudama''s way of life and witnesses their criminal drives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1s3fwsH3AjuyzObYHiptiYRgFa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100436'),
  ('770841871422067361', 'Akuma Kun', 2023, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Crime', null, null, 'Yuki Kaji, Toshio Furukawa, Ryoko Shiraishi, Yumiri Hanamori, Fairouz Ai, Yukiyo Fujii, Michiyo Yanagisawa, Yusaku Yara', 'TV-MA', 'Akuma Kun, a boy raised by a demon, works with his half-human partner Mephisto III as paranormal investigators to solve various murder and mysteries.', 'Akuma Kun, a boy raised by a demon, works with his half-human partner Mephisto III as paranormal investigators to solve various murder and mysteries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zPPYeLhEFbZjImIvGcfvZEIBFQl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:120241'),
  ('243064548627842691', 'Al Bernameg', 2011, 'News, Talk', 'Bassem Youssef, Tarek ElKazzaz', null, 'Bassem Youssef', null, 'Al Bernameg is a popular Egyptian satirical program. The series is hosted by satirical comedian Bassem Youssef on the satellite channel CBC. The press has compared it to The Daily Show hosted by Jon Stewart, which was the inspiration for this show. Youssef visited The Daily Show as a guest in April 2013, while Stewart, on hiatus from his own hosting duties, returned the favor on El Bernameg in June 2013.', 'Al Bernameg is a popular Egyptian satirical program. The series is hosted by satirical comedian Bassem Youssef on the satellite channel CBC. The press has compared it to The Daily Show hosted by Jon Stewart, which was the inspiration for this show. Youssef visited The Daily Show as a guest in April 2013, while Stewart, on hiatus from his own hosting duties, returned the favor on El Bernameg in June 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5IjRO4rRCGPBy1BsLo6fL7G8A3V.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:44446'),
  ('261047843913790494', 'Al cotxe!', 2017, 'Talk', null, null, 'Eloi Vila', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ymb3jR4uLJ2mWt3X4YgWKxuAXsV.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:295952'),
  ('110889137706131566', 'Al Fondo Hay Sitio', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Efrain Aguilar', null, 'Yvonne Frayssinet, Mónica Sánchez, Gustavo Bueno, Adolfo Chuiman, Magdyel Ugaz, Erick Elera, László Kovács, David Almandoz', 'NR', 'Al fondo hay sitio is a Peruvian TV series created in 2008-2009 by Efraín Aguilar. It deals with the problems of social differences and economic status. It''s one of the most popular shows in Peru and is now being shown in Ecuador, Bolivia, Paraguay and Uruguay.', 'Al fondo hay sitio is a Peruvian TV series created in 2008-2009 by Efraín Aguilar. It deals with the problems of social differences and economic status. It''s one of the most popular shows in Peru and is now being shown in Ecuador, Bolivia, Paraguay and Uruguay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BkYVoybIvM2U7zeg2JTT5M5dwF.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:32209'),
  ('1012149173321682696', 'Al Hayba', 2017, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Hozan Akko, Said Serhan', null, 'Tim Hassan, Mona Wassef, Aimee Sayah, Owais Mukhalalti, Abdo Shahin, Nazem Issa, Rouzaina Lazkani, Abdel Moneim Amayri', 'TV-14', 'In a village by the Lebanon-Syria border, the head of an arms-smuggling clan contends with family conflicts, power struggles and complicated love.', 'In a village by the Lebanon-Syria border, the head of an arms-smuggling clan contends with family conflicts, power struggles and complicated love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/heUxSI3Ul0L53XuziidcWv9GoQo.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:84299'),
  ('382837911332933349', 'Al Maddah', 2021, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Amin Gamal', 'Amin Gamal', 'Hamada Helal, Heba Magdi, Hanan Soliman, Donia Abdel Azziz, Yosra El Lozy, Tamer Shaltout, Fathy Abdel Wahab, Sahar Al Sayegh', null, 'Saber returns from the dead to face the greatest the earth has ever known: the daughters of Satan! We hear about a mission to destroy humanity, and to free their greatest master Satan by any means possible…', 'Saber returns from the dead to face the greatest the earth has ever known: the daughters of Satan! We hear about a mission to destroy humanity, and to free their greatest master Satan by any means possible…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qlVgLDGVrzFJGJdNPgKKhtXUguZ.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:122543'),
  ('392918206111115257', 'Al rojo vivo', 2011, 'News, Talk', 'Antonio García Ferreras', null, 'Antonio García Ferreras', null, '"Al rojo vivo" is a program on laSexta focused on the analysis and debate of national and international political current affairs. The format is hosted and directed by Antonio García Ferreras and produced by the News Services of laSexta.', '"Al rojo vivo" is a program on laSexta focused on the analysis and debate of national and international political current affairs. The format is hosted and directed by Antonio García Ferreras and produced by the News Services of laSexta.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ag6PmoBxkF2s1uY3An618NCEt3g.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:101463'),
  ('1077322701786425418', 'Al salir de clase', 1997, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Sergio Villoldo, Ana María Vidal, Alex Cueva, Olivia Molina, Carola Baleztena, Patricia Figón, Nela Aragón, Vanessa Lozano', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tzXHkY82GZUDgbGlZaZLa2ax74C.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:36126'),
  ('836027758112027389', 'Al Waseya', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Ayman Wattar', 'Ayman Wattar, Mustafa Helmy, Diaa Mohamed', 'Akram Hosni, Ahmed Amin, Reem Mostafa, Khaled Kamal, Arefa Abdul Rasoul, Mohamed Taiema, Bahgat Adly, Sara Salama', 'TV-PG', 'When Ebbo''s father dies, he leaves behind a will that compels Ebbo to complete a list of tasks to be able to get his inheritance. Ebbo enlists his friend Semsem''s help to complete the tasks.', 'When Ebbo''s father dies, he leaves behind a will that compels Ebbo to complete a list of tasks to be able to get his inheritance. Ebbo enlists his friend Semsem''s help to complete the tasks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJ0qXbObBWmE4wUDxdzP8wdVRoa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79650'),
  ('917550755449468130', 'Aladdin', 1994, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, 'Scott Weinger, Linda Larkin, Dan Castellaneta, Gilbert Gottfried, Frank Welker, Val Bettin', 'TV-G', 'Coming on the heels of the direct-to-video sequel The Return of Jafar, the series picked up where that installment left off, with Aladdin now living in the palace, engaged to beautiful and spunky Princess Jasmine. "Al" and Jasmine went together into peril among sorcerers, monsters, thieves, and more. Monkey sidekick Abu, the animated Magic Carpet, and the fast-talking, shape-shifting Genie came along to help, as did sassy, complaining parrot Iago, formerly Jafar’s pet but now an antihero.', 'Coming on the heels of the direct-to-video sequel The Return of Jafar, the series picked up where that installment left off, with Aladdin now living in the palace, engaged to beautiful and spunky Princess Jasmine. "Al" and Jasmine went together into peril among sorcerers, monsters, thieves, and more. Monkey sidekick Abu, the animated Magic Carpet, and the fast-talking, shape-shifting Genie came along to help, as did sassy, complaining parrot Iago, formerly Jafar’s pet but now an antihero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nlaiczW81kY46GBdfIcTrBIqr8I.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2745'),
  ('342843547658105796', 'Alan Carr: Chatty Man', 2009, 'Talk, Comedy', null, null, 'Alan Carr', null, 'Alan Carr: Chatty Man is a BAFTA award-winning British comedy chat show presented by comedian Alan Carr. The show features interviews with celebrity guests, sketches, topical chat and music.', 'Alan Carr: Chatty Man is a BAFTA award-winning British comedy chat show presented by comedian Alan Carr. The show features interviews with celebrity guests, sketches, topical chat and music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8GLTQ9uNBr4PwG9ghqhfKdnLKEO.jpg', 18, 'tmdb:tv:19105'),
  ('599531859313139931', 'Alan Davies: As Yet Untitled', 2014, 'Talk, Comedy', null, null, 'Alan Davies', null, 'One of Britain’s favourite comedians doing what he does best – being funny. But Alan Davies isn’t on a stage, or behind his QI desk sparring with Stephen Fry, or even wearing his Jonathan Creek duffle coat… instead, Alan is at his most relaxed and most natural – sitting around chatting with some of his best comedian friends.', 'One of Britain’s favourite comedians doing what he does best – being funny. But Alan Davies isn’t on a stage, or behind his QI desk sparring with Stephen Fry, or even wearing his Jonathan Creek duffle coat… instead, Alan is at his most relaxed and most natural – sitting around chatting with some of his best comedian friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bpKZWTxpM0QIAPPOeuHlkfs8GF.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:70952'),
  ('812385932547336493', 'Alarm for Cobra 11: The Motorway Police', 1996, 'Drama, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Hermann Joha, Claude Cueni', null, 'Erdoğan Atalay, Gizem Emre, Nicolas Wolf, Pia Stutzenstein, Sascha Star', 'TV-14', 'A long-running German television series about a two-man team of highway police, originally set in Berlin and later in North Rhine-Westphalia.', 'A long-running German television series about a two-man team of highway police, originally set in Berlin and later in North Rhine-Westphalia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vd4GYNpGugeXMt6hsCmnnf5TFNx.jpg', 50, 'tmdb:tv:1338'),
  ('1059545050292561028', 'Alas Smith and Jones', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Mel Smith, Griff Rhys Jones', 'Mel Smith, Griff Rhys Jones, Chris Lang', 'Mel Smith, Griff Rhys Jones', null, 'A British comedy sketch television series featuring Mel Smith and Griff Rhys Jones that ran on BBC One and BBC Two from 31 January 1984 to 14 October 1998. From series 5 in 1989 the ''Alas'' title was dropped and became simply Smith and Jones.', 'A British comedy sketch television series featuring Mel Smith and Griff Rhys Jones that ran on BBC One and BBC Two from 31 January 1984 to 14 October 1998. From series 5 in 1989 the ''Alas'' title was dropped and became simply Smith and Jones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBOcE8rzWngAo4lTGJGXRu0vipE.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:906'),
  ('954194261090841916', 'Alaska Daily', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Tom McCarthy', null, 'Hilary Swank, Jeff Perry, Matt Malloy, Meredith Holzman, Grace Dove, Pablo Castelblanco, Ami Park, Craig Frank', 'TV-PG', 'A star journalist moves to Alaska for a fresh start after a career-killing misstep, and finds redemption personally and professionally joining a daily metro newspaper in Anchorage.', 'A star journalist moves to Alaska for a fresh start after a career-killing misstep, and finds redemption personally and professionally joining a daily metro newspaper in Anchorage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2IGg89Ni3uO5E78CROvF11FkN63.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:201948'),
  ('121420267520883628', 'Alaska State Troopers', 2009, 'Documentary, Crime, Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'They are the first line of defense on the last frontier, the roughly 400 state troopers who patrol the rugged and unforgiving terrain of America’s largest state — Alaska. One of the toughest law enforcement agencies in the nation, these officers often travel hundreds of miles in piercing subzero temperatures to uphold the law. Responding by land, air and sea — with backup sometimes days away — they face danger to protect the people and wildlife of Alaska.', 'They are the first line of defense on the last frontier, the roughly 400 state troopers who patrol the rugged and unforgiving terrain of America’s largest state — Alaska. One of the toughest law enforcement agencies in the nation, these officers often travel hundreds of miles in piercing subzero temperatures to uphold the law. Responding by land, air and sea — with backup sometimes days away — they face danger to protect the people and wildlife of Alaska.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iwI0baUzUbT4k0EpZoY245lTk0s.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:35086'),
  ('852052666495864035', 'Alaska: The Last Frontier', 2011, 'Reality', null, null, 'Atz Kilcher, Atz Lee Kilcher, Otto Kilcher, Charlotte Kilcher', 'TV-14', 'Centers on the Kilcher family and their community outside Homer, Alaska. Begun by patriarch Yule Kilcher who immigrated from Europe during WWII, and currently led by his sons, Otto and Atz Kilcher (singer Jewel''s father) the family have lived on their land for four generations. The show also features the homesteaders who live nearby and interact with the Kilchers.', 'Centers on the Kilcher family and their community outside Homer, Alaska. Begun by patriarch Yule Kilcher who immigrated from Europe during WWII, and currently led by his sons, Otto and Atz Kilcher (singer Jewel''s father) the family have lived on their land for four generations. The show also features the homesteaders who live nearby and interact with the Kilchers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hBwlagcxxVTQTTQUAMNbwfRWZ86.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:63313'),
  ('635004010113301918', 'Alaskan Bush People', 2014, 'Reality, Family', null, null, 'Asa Siegel, Billy Brown, Ami Brown, Joshua "Bam" Brown, Gabe Brown, Solomon "Bear" Brown, Noah Brown, Bird Brown', 'TV-14', 'Deep in the Alaskan wilderness lives a newly discovered family who was born and raised wild. Billy Brown, his wife Ami and their seven grown children – 5 boys and 2 girls – are so far removed from civilization that they often go six to nine months of the year without seeing an outsider. They’ve developed their own accent and dialect, refer to themselves as a "wolf pack," and at night, all nine sleep together in a one-room cabin. Simply put, they are unlike any other family in America. Recently, according to the Browns, the cabin where they lived for years was seized and burned to the ground for being in the wrong location on public land.', 'Deep in the Alaskan wilderness lives a newly discovered family who was born and raised wild. Billy Brown, his wife Ami and their seven grown children – 5 boys and 2 girls – are so far removed from civilization that they often go six to nine months of the year without seeing an outsider. They’ve developed their own accent and dialect, refer to themselves as a "wolf pack," and at night, all nine sleep together in a one-room cabin. Simply put, they are unlike any other family in America. Recently, according to the Browns, the cabin where they lived for years was seized and burned to the ground for being in the wrong location on public land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uUrQfZHcnaSwmW7ZtkLEQ1lmpYl.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:61789'),
  ('43947478323049050', 'Alba', 2021, 'Drama', 'Ignasi Rubio, Carlos Martín', null, 'Elena Rivera, Eric Masip', null, 'Alba wakes up on a beach after a rape she doesn''t remember. And then she discovers that her rapists are friends of her lover.', 'Alba wakes up on a beach after a rape she doesn''t remember. And then she discovers that her rapists are friends of her lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pubcatJw5MZNuTJ78atJBkw9crW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:115521'),
  ('35512290371261722', 'Albertano Contra los Mostros', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Carlos Miramontes, Luis Cravioto', 'Carlos Miramontes, Ariel Miramontes, Luis Cravioto', 'Ariel Miramontes, Maribel Guardia, Benito Castro, Paola Fernández, José Luis Guarneros, Rebeca Duvignau, Olivia Collins, Mariano Soria', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMgGkakqjl0dzGNhwTRcc3qUYKM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197888'),
  ('405552814886076884', 'Alborada', 2005, 'Drama', 'María Zarattini', null, 'Lucero, Fernando Colunga, Daniela Romo, Luis Roberto Guzmán, Arturo Peniche, Ernesto Laguardia, Irán Castillo, Valentino Lanús', 'TV-14', 'Alborada is a telenovela made by the Mexican TV network Televisa. It is an historical drama, set in colonial Panama and Mexico a few years before Mexican Independence from Spain. The series was broadcast from December 2005 to April 2006 on Univision in the United States. Alborada won the TV y Novelas award for best telenovela of the year.', 'Alborada is a telenovela made by the Mexican TV network Televisa. It is an historical drama, set in colonial Panama and Mexico a few years before Mexican Independence from Spain. The series was broadcast from December 2005 to April 2006 on Univision in the United States. Alborada won the TV y Novelas award for best telenovela of the year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nPoEPGZ7rRwQIKXX4CDlVy6BJHk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13010'),
  ('561288841209534324', 'Alcanzar una estrella', 1990, 'Drama', 'Jesus Calzada', null, 'Mariana Garza, Eduardo Capetillo, Ana Silvia Garza, Enrique Lizalde, Rita Macedo, Kenia Gascón, Oscar Traven, Marcos Valdés', null, 'Alcanzar una estrella is a Mexican telenovela first broadcast on Canal de las Estrellas in 1990. The telenovela, which was also broadcast in Latin America and on Univision in the United States, tells the story of an introverted girl''s infatuation with her teen idol. The leading roles were played by singers Mariana Garza and Eduardo Capetillo, ex-members of the Mexican pop band Timbiriche. The two also sang the theme songs for the telenovela, which were written by Ricardo Arjona. Arjona and other singers such as Patricia Manterola also made acting cameos. The telenovela was remade into an American show on Nickelodeon called Hollywood Heights. The show premiered June 2012. The success of the telenovela was such that it was made into a film Más que alcanzar una estrella and a sequel telenovela Alcanzar una estrella II, starring Sasha Sokol and Ricky Martin. The story was produced by Luis de Llano, producer and manager of Timbiriche and Garibaldi, and written by actress Rita Macedo, de Llano''s mother. Alcanzar una estrella turned out to be Macedo''s last credit as an actress before she committed suicide in the mid-1990s.', 'Alcanzar una estrella is a Mexican telenovela first broadcast on Canal de las Estrellas in 1990. The telenovela, which was also broadcast in Latin America and on Univision in the United States, tells the story of an introverted girl''s infatuation with her teen idol. The leading roles were played by singers Mariana Garza and Eduardo Capetillo, ex-members of the Mexican pop band Timbiriche. The two also sang the theme songs for the telenovela, which were written by Ricardo Arjona. Arjona and other singers such as Patricia Manterola also made acting cameos. The telenovela was remade into an American show on Nickelodeon called Hollywood Heights. The show premiered June 2012. The success of the telenovela was such that it was made into a film Más que alcanzar una estrella and a sequel telenovela Alcanzar una estrella II, starring Sasha Sokol and Ricky Martin. The story was produced by Luis de Llano, producer and manager of Timbiriche and Garibaldi, and written by actress Rita Macedo, de Llano''s mother. Alcanzar una estrella turned out to be Macedo''s last credit as an actress before she committed suicide in the mid-1990s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zprNVq0qi1zyOEwMJqs1eJ3hcv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12748'),
  ('17382966621708214', 'Alcatraz', 2012, 'Mystery, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Elizabeth Sarnoff, Steven Lilien, Bryan Wynbrandt', null, 'Sarah Jones, Sam Neill, Jorge Garcia, Parminder Nagra, Jason Butler Harner, Jonny Coyne, Robert Forster', 'TV-14', 'A unique team, consisting of a federal agent, a police officer and a conspiracy theory novelist, investigate the shocking reappearance of Alcatraz''s most notorious prisoners, fifty years after they supposedly vanished.', 'A unique team, consisting of a federal agent, a police officer and a conspiracy theory novelist, investigate the shocking reappearance of Alcatraz''s most notorious prisoners, fifty years after they supposedly vanished.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yES1yqjp6Jl2CEVKHdfwKrIsnqd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35339'),
  ('225677406781700766', 'Alchemist', 2015, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Heo Young-ji, Han Ki-woong, Cho Hye-jeong, An Woo-yeon, Kim Jong-hoon', null, '“Alchemist” centers on a group of college students who start a club to support each other in their decisions to abstain from dating and love. But despite their best intentions, some of the members start to have feelings for each other. Youngji plays the lead female character, Oh Youngji, a student who joins the club because she’s fallen in love with one of the members.', '“Alchemist” centers on a group of college students who start a club to support each other in their decisions to abstain from dating and love. But despite their best intentions, some of the members start to have feelings for each other. Youngji plays the lead female character, Oh Youngji, a student who joins the club because she’s fallen in love with one of the members.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVooDn7Lf4ESC7mY7joX7yncuDV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64322'),
  ('531254212452065489', 'Alchemy of Souls', 2022, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Mystery', 'Hong Jeong-eun, Hong Mi-ran, Park Joon-hwa', null, 'Lee Jae-wook, Go Youn-jung, Minhyun, Moon Seong-hyun, Shin Seung-ho, Yu Jun-sang, Oh Na-ra, Yoo In-soo', 'TV-14', 'A powerful sorceress in a blind woman''s body encounters a man from a prestigious family, who wants her help to change his destiny.', 'A powerful sorceress in a blind woman''s body encounters a man from a prestigious family, who wants her help to change his destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gvOZN1NlAoL8iz9ghpES1zWA3w3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:135157'),
  ('606230009912562159', 'Alcoa Theatre', 1957, 'Drama', null, null, null, null, 'Alcoa Theatre is a half-hour American anthology series telecast on NBC at 9:30 pm on alternate Monday nights from October 7, 1957 to September 16, 1960. The program also aired under the title Turn of Fate, with the stories depicting the difficulties faced by individuals who are suddenly thrust into unexpected and perilous dangers. Alcoa Theatre was syndicated together with Goodyear Theatre as Award Theatre. In 1955, The Alcoa Hour premiered in a one-hour format aired on Sunday nights, but it was reduced to 30 minutes, retitled Alcoa Theatre, and moved to Monday evening in 1957. The show employed an alternating rotating company of actors: David Niven, Robert Ryan, Jane Powell, Jack Lemmon and Charles Boyer. Each appeared in dramatic and light comedic roles through the first season.', 'Alcoa Theatre is a half-hour American anthology series telecast on NBC at 9:30 pm on alternate Monday nights from October 7, 1957 to September 16, 1960. The program also aired under the title Turn of Fate, with the stories depicting the difficulties faced by individuals who are suddenly thrust into unexpected and perilous dangers. Alcoa Theatre was syndicated together with Goodyear Theatre as Award Theatre. In 1955, The Alcoa Hour premiered in a one-hour format aired on Sunday nights, but it was reduced to 30 minutes, retitled Alcoa Theatre, and moved to Monday evening in 1957. The show employed an alternating rotating company of actors: David Niven, Robert Ryan, Jane Powell, Jack Lemmon and Charles Boyer. Each appeared in dramatic and light comedic roles through the first season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uiaO4sVZbx4SJqJWdnDnNHO8HS2.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:11477'),
  ('465214904697568834', 'Alderamin on the Sky', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Drama, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Nobuhiko Okamoto, Risa Taneda, Inori Minase, Haruka Chisuga, Junji Majima, Ryosuke Kanemoto, Ayumu Akikawa, Eri Suzuki', 'TV-MA', 'The huge Katvana Empire is at war with the neighboring Kioka republic. In a corner of the empire, a young man is about be caught up in the flames of war. His name is Ikta Solork. He''s lazy, a philanderer, and he hates war. He''s about as far from a soldier as you can get. On his way towards the next stage of officer''s qualification exams, he and his childhood friend Yatorishino Igsem encounter the nurse trainee Harouma Beckle, Mashuu Tetrijirch, a member of the old military faction, and Torwey Lemion....', 'The huge Katvana Empire is at war with the neighboring Kioka republic. In a corner of the empire, a young man is about be caught up in the flames of war. His name is Ikta Solork. He''s lazy, a philanderer, and he hates war. He''s about as far from a soldier as you can get. On his way towards the next stage of officer''s qualification exams, he and his childhood friend Yatorishino Igsem encounter the nurse trainee Harouma Beckle, Mashuu Tetrijirch, a member of the old military faction, and Torwey Lemion....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sO6DDaOpJH9ONVvgtvwLDM3l7JY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65954'),
  ('903301697938531470', 'Aldnoah.Zero', 2014, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Natsuki Hanae, Kensho Ono, Sora Amamiya, Mikako Komatsu, Sayaka Ohara, Sachika Misawa, Kazuya Nakai, Ai Kayano', 'TV-MA', 'In 1972, the Apollo 17 mission discovered a hypergate to Mars on the surface of the moon. Soon a war breaks out between Earth and Mars, and Martian soldiers begin to descend from the sky, riding steel giants, intent on exterminating humanity.', 'In 1972, the Apollo 17 mission discovered a hypergate to Mars on the surface of the moon. Soon a war breaks out between Earth and Mars, and Martian soldiers begin to descend from the sky, riding steel giants, intent on exterminating humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7DCN1z9fFOjHw5hMiAlnTcC1Gv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61259'),
  ('616217805625204244', 'Alegrijes y Rebujos', 2003, 'Family, Soap, Kids', 'Palmira Olguín', null, 'Jacqueline Bracamontes, Miguel de León, Eugenia Cauduro, Cecilia Gabriela, Luis Roberto Guzmán, Héctor Ortega, Rosa María Bianchi, Salvador Sánchez', 'TV-14', 'Alegrijes y Rebujos is a Mexican soap opera which became very popular with children and adults in 2003 and 2004. The child actors came from the reality show Código F.A.M.A.. The first place winner, Miguel Martinez, earned the lead role. He shared the spotlight with the other finalists María Chacón, Diego González, Allisson Lozano, Michelle Álvarez, Nora Cano, Jesús Zavala and Tony Cobian.', 'Alegrijes y Rebujos is a Mexican soap opera which became very popular with children and adults in 2003 and 2004. The child actors came from the reality show Código F.A.M.A.. The first place winner, Miguel Martinez, earned the lead role. He shared the spotlight with the other finalists María Chacón, Diego González, Allisson Lozano, Michelle Álvarez, Nora Cano, Jesús Zavala and Tony Cobian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4q4aWDunOGSw6HcDZf775SOrsk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11823'),
  ('64310854887385406', 'Alejo, la Búsqueda del Amor', 1999, 'Drama', null, null, 'Ismael Barrios, Xiomara Xibille, Moisés Angulo, Carolina Lizarazo, Manuel Cabral', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7dQm7vHNZhhyC6nFpDgbG1Bqce.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:122050'),
  ('857329180350881578', 'Alemin Kıralı', 2011, 'Comedy, Family', 'Ali Gündoğdu', 'Kamuran Süner', 'Şafak Sezer, Zeynep Gülmez, Oya Başar, Evrim Akın, Elvin Levinler, Yağmur Ün, Birsu Demir, Ececan Gümeci', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/670Pn0vg1sP4DarCgXQyXt15DUT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:48659'),
  ('156393317575292148', 'Aleph', 2020, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Emre Kayiş', 'Emre Kayiş', 'Kenan İmirzalıoğlu, Ahmet Mümtaz Taylan, Melisa Sözen, Sevinç Kumaş, Müfit Kayacan, Ercan Kesal, Hatice Aslan, Rıza Akın', null, 'When close-to-retirement homicide detective Settar Öztürk is assigned a final case with his case partner Kemal McAllister, they discover a series of ruthless and operose murders. They soon discover they are dealing with a serial killer whose motives are connected with Islamic heresy and sufism. As the case disentangles, the detectives find out solving the case is not their only role in this picture.', 'When close-to-retirement homicide detective Settar Öztürk is assigned a final case with his case partner Kemal McAllister, they discover a series of ruthless and operose murders. They soon discover they are dealing with a serial killer whose motives are connected with Islamic heresy and sufism. As the case disentangles, the detectives find out solving the case is not their only role in this picture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k8kkhYmrbg8Mw6CWGfZmZwYQF3J.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:99815'),
  ('276289638679856354', 'Alert: Missing Persons Unit', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'John Eisendrath, Jamie Foxx', null, 'Scott Caan, Ryan Broussard, Adeola Role', 'TV-14', 'When police officer Nikki Batista’s son goes missing, she joins the Philadelphia Police Department''s Missing Person’s Unit (MPU) to help other people find their loved ones, even as she searches for her own. Six years later, her world is turned upside-down when her ex-husband, Jason Grant, a former police officer, shows up with a proof-of-life photo of their missing boy. Or is it?', 'When police officer Nikki Batista’s son goes missing, she joins the Philadelphia Police Department''s Missing Person’s Unit (MPU) to help other people find their loved ones, even as she searches for her own. Six years later, her world is turned upside-down when her ex-husband, Jason Grant, a former police officer, shows up with a proof-of-life photo of their missing boy. Or is it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lLRC3GSYiFVHsxgc9tvmR6WjcOu.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:202308'),
