  ('455517390838112787', 'Alias', 2001, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'J.J. Abrams', null, 'Jennifer Garner, Victor Garber, Ron Rifkin, Carl Lumbly, Kevin Weisman, Rachel Nichols, Amy Acker, Balthazar Getty', 'TV-14', 'Sydney Bristow, an agent who has been tricked to believe she is working for the U.S. government, is actually working for a criminal organization named the Alliance of Twelve. Upon learning this, Sydney becomes a double agent for the real CIA.', 'Sydney Bristow, an agent who has been tricked to believe she is working for the U.S. government, is actually working for a criminal organization named the Alliance of Twelve. Upon learning this, Sydney becomes a double agent for the real CIA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Dl3KIxWlSEvnXogNHxdXA4pbAk.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:2046'),
  ('670520942924360140', 'Alias el Mexicano', 2013, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Gerardo Reyes', null, 'Juan Sebastián Calero, Biassini Segura, Carolina Gaitán, Rafael Novoa, Fabio Rubiano, Waldo Urrego, Rubén Zamora, Rodrigo Oviedo', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/au9bEshvTV2tHpTIcutiyXt1Dln.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81733'),
  ('1099537722735442426', 'Alias Grace', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Sarah Polley', null, 'Sarah Gadon, Edward Holcroft, Rebecca Liddiard, Zachary Levi, Kerr Logan, David Cronenberg, Paul Gross, Anna Paquin', 'TV-MA', 'Based on the true story of Grace Marks, a housemaid and immigrant from Ireland who was imprisoned in 1843, perhaps wrongly, for the murder of her employer Thomas Kinnear. Grace claims to have no memory of the murder yet the facts are irrefutable. A decade after, Dr. Simon Jordan tries to help Grace recall her past.', 'Based on the true story of Grace Marks, a housemaid and immigrant from Ireland who was imprisoned in 1843, perhaps wrongly, for the murder of her employer Thomas Kinnear. Grace claims to have no memory of the murder yet the facts are irrefutable. A decade after, Dr. Simon Jordan tries to help Grace recall her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m6ChYjCPMpzAPzR7jm0omLbu9hS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72615'),
  ('724043097425096887', 'Alias Smith and Jones', 1971, 'Western, Crime', 'Glen A. Larson', null, 'Ben Murphy, Roger Davis', 'TV-PG', 'Alias Smith and Jones is an American Western series that originally aired on ABC from 1971 to 1973. It stars Pete Duel as Hannibal Heyes and Ben Murphy as Jedediah "Kid" Curry, a pair of cousin outlaws trying to reform. The governor offers them a conditional amnesty, as he wants to keep the pact under wraps for political reasons. The condition is that they will still be wanted— until the governor can claim they have reformed and warrant clemency.', 'Alias Smith and Jones is an American Western series that originally aired on ABC from 1971 to 1973. It stars Pete Duel as Hannibal Heyes and Ben Murphy as Jedediah "Kid" Curry, a pair of cousin outlaws trying to reform. The governor offers them a conditional amnesty, as he wants to keep the pact under wraps for political reasons. The condition is that they will still be wanted— until the governor can claim they have reformed and warrant clemency.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvivxPeLnXUGiZtgeHdLVA6xGmb.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:3275'),
  ('130401015003300675', 'Alibi', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Evgeniy Stychkin, Olga Sutulova, Timofey Tribuntsev, Yakov Levda, Varvara Borodina, Aleksandr Ustyugov, Taisiya Vilkova, Vilma Kutaviciute', null, 'Petr is not only a successful writer but also is the owner of the agen- cy called Alibi — that creates alibis for the clients who need to hide their lies and failures. His second business is hidden, so he himself has a double life. But his attitude to lies changes when his own wife appears at the agency asking for an alibi. From this moment on, he will solve not only his client’s problems, but his own. Unfortu- nately, he’ll be able to help everyone but himself.', 'Petr is not only a successful writer but also is the owner of the agen- cy called Alibi — that creates alibis for the clients who need to hide their lies and failures. His second business is hidden, so he himself has a double life. But his attitude to lies changes when his own wife appears at the agency asking for an alibi. From this moment on, he will solve not only his client’s problems, but his own. Unfortu- nately, he’ll be able to help everyone but himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8K6vEcm0sol6ljAgF8Heqqz1O3j.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137031'),
  ('727920462269514169', 'Alice', 1976, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Robert Getchell', null, 'Linda Lavin, Vic Tayback, Beth Howland, Celia Weston, Philip McKeon, Charles Levin', 'TV-PG', 'Alice is an American sitcom television series that ran from August 31, 1976 to March 19, 1985 on CBS. The series is based on the 1974 film Alice Doesn''t Live Here Anymore. The show stars Linda Lavin in the title role, a widow who moves with her young son to start her life over again, and finds a job working at a roadside diner on the outskirts of Phoenix, Arizona. Most of the episodes revolve around events at Mel''s Diner.', 'Alice is an American sitcom television series that ran from August 31, 1976 to March 19, 1985 on CBS. The series is based on the 1974 film Alice Doesn''t Live Here Anymore. The show stars Linda Lavin in the title role, a widow who moves with her young son to start her life over again, and finds a job working at a roadside diner on the outskirts of Phoenix, Arizona. Most of the episodes revolve around events at Mel''s Diner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iEEtQs1mPz3kvvaEFR7HVnME9Or.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:494'),
  ('46710806321824248', 'Alice', 2009, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Nick Willing', null, 'Caterina "Hiding in the closet" Scorsone, Andrew-Lee Potts, Matt Frewer, Harry Dean Stanton, Alessandro Juliani, Eugene Lipinski, Tim Curry, Charlotte Sullivan', 'NR', 'Alice Hamilton, a fiercely independent twenty-something, watches as her lover Jack Chase is kidnapped and driven into darkness. Desperate to find Jack, Alice puts her trust in a stranger who calls himself White Rabbit and suddenly finds herself on the other side of a looking glass.', 'Alice Hamilton, a fiercely independent twenty-something, watches as her lover Jack Chase is kidnapped and driven into darkness. Desperate to find Jack, Alice puts her trust in a stranger who calls himself White Rabbit and suddenly finds herself on the other side of a looking glass.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2lvWLSOPtsqkgVIfEz9ai7D6TUr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:33466'),
  ('72397549263325917', 'Alice', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kim Hee-seon, Joo Won, Kwak Si-yang, Choi Won-young, Lee Da-in, Yeon Woo, Bae Hae-seon, Lim Jae-hyeok', null, 'It’s the year 2050 and time travel exists thanks to Alice, the mechanism through which the intriguing practice is made possible. But a rumor based on a prophecy beings to spread about time travel coming to an end. When You Min Hyuk and Yoon Tae Yi are sent to the year 1992 to find out about the prophecy, Tae Yi realizes she’s pregnant and decides to stay in the past by herself. She changes her name to Park Sun Young and eventually gives birth to a beautiful son named Park Jin Gyeom, whose mental health suffers due to radiation exposure. Fast forward to the year 2010, and Sun Young is murdered by someone. 10 years after her death, her son Jin Gyeom is on a mission to find who is responsible for his mother’s death. But while searching, he runs into Yoon Tae Yi, a physics professor who looks exactly like this mother. What will become of these individuals caught tragically between time and space?', 'It’s the year 2050 and time travel exists thanks to Alice, the mechanism through which the intriguing practice is made possible. But a rumor based on a prophecy beings to spread about time travel coming to an end. When You Min Hyuk and Yoon Tae Yi are sent to the year 1992 to find out about the prophecy, Tae Yi realizes she’s pregnant and decides to stay in the past by herself. She changes her name to Park Sun Young and eventually gives birth to a beautiful son named Park Jin Gyeom, whose mental health suffers due to radiation exposure. Fast forward to the year 2010, and Sun Young is murdered by someone. 10 years after her death, her son Jin Gyeom is on a mission to find who is responsible for his mother’s death. But while searching, he runs into Yoon Tae Yi, a physics professor who looks exactly like this mother. What will become of these individuals caught tragically between time and space?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o9RCm67BVGmqYyr1S3vfR2z22Yk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97267'),
  ('1134793836534463278', 'Alice & Jack', 2024, 'Drama', 'Victor Levin', null, 'Andrea Riseborough, Domhnall Gleeson, Aimee Lou Wood, Sunil Patel', null, 'When Alice and Jack first meet, they have a connection so powerful it seems nothing can break it, but can they find happiness together, or will their own emotional complexities get in the way?', 'When Alice and Jack first meet, they have a connection so powerful it seems nothing can break it, but can they find happiness together, or will their own emotional complexities get in the way?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5m3z9wVf0lzl47TLkKV8pvpeOJc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:232315'),
  ('552424592996378492', 'Alice & Zoroku', 2017, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hitomi Ohwada, Akio Otsuka, Aki Toyosaki, Ami Koshimizu, Akari Kito, Natsumi Fujiwara, Mamiko Noto, Shu Uchida', 'TV-14', 'The story centers on a little girl called Sana, who is one of the children that holds the power of "Alice''s Dream," an ability that enables her to materialize anything she imagines. After escaping a lab where she was a test subject, Sana ends up in a normal world where she encounters an old man named Zouroku, but will he help her?', 'The story centers on a little girl called Sana, who is one of the children that holds the power of "Alice''s Dream," an ability that enables her to materialize anything she imagines. After escaping a lab where she was a test subject, Sana ends up in a normal world where she encounters an old man named Zouroku, but will he help her?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHYmjLTc5niV7uuTBmIz4oTrSx6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70594'),
  ('531372846363617121', 'Alice in Borderland', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation', null, null, 'Maaya Sakamoto, Takahiro Sakurai, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Tsubasa Yonaga, Minako Kotobuki, Yoshimasa Hosoya', null, 'Arisu, Karube, and Segawa, a trio of highschool delinquents, are bored with their current lives. During a firework celebration, Arisu wishes that he could live in a different world which would be more exciting for him. As such, his wish was granted, and the three were transported into a seemingly post-apocalyptic-like parallel world. After stepping into what seems to be an empty festival, they are greeted by a woman who tells them that they have already "entered their game". After clearing the game, she reveals to them that, in Borderlands, they must play games to survive.', 'Arisu, Karube, and Segawa, a trio of highschool delinquents, are bored with their current lives. During a firework celebration, Arisu wishes that he could live in a different world which would be more exciting for him. As such, his wish was granted, and the three were transported into a seemingly post-apocalyptic-like parallel world. After stepping into what seems to be an empty festival, they are greeted by a woman who tells them that they have already "entered their game". After clearing the game, she reveals to them that, in Borderlands, they must play games to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8huvRDPvqQ6N17krzUJf2tmb9PH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71907'),
  ('663566960468262151', 'Alice in Borderland', 2020, 'Mystery, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Kento Yamazaki, Tao Tsuchiya', 'TV-MA', 'With his two friends, a video-game-obsessed young man finds himself in a strange version of Tokyo where they must compete in dangerous games to win.', 'With his two friends, a video-game-obsessed young man finds himself in a strange version of Tokyo where they must compete in dangerous games to win.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ac8ruycRXzgcsndTZFK6ouGA0FA.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:110316'),
  ('849444248018080646', 'Alice in Wonderland', 1983, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'TARAKO, Kenichi Ogata, Masako Nozawa, Issei Futamata, Shozo Iizuka, Noriko Uemura, Kumiko Mizukura, Yoshiko Matsuo', null, 'A young girl named Alice follows a white rabbit into a hole, only to find herself in Wonderland, where she meets many interesting characters, including the mysterious Cheshire Cat and the terrible Queen of Hearts.', 'A young girl named Alice follows a white rabbit into a hole, only to find herself in Wonderland, where she meets many interesting characters, including the mysterious Cheshire Cat and the terrible Queen of Hearts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipLBlkU7IXDS6bMgpG4cv92eHwG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65305'),
  ('1077073732045746819', 'Alice in Wonderland', 1985, 'Action & Adventure, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Lewis Carroll', 'Natalie Gregory, Sheila Allen, Red Buttons, Anthony Newley, Roddy McDowall, Arte Johnson, Jayne Meadows, Robert Morley', null, 'Sometimes she''s too big. Or much too small. Sometimes things are backwards. And there''s always too much pepper in the soup! Nothing is quite right since Alice chased a very unusual White Rabbit and stumbled into an adventure that grows curiouser and curiouser. One of the greatest childhood fantasies is captured in Irwin Allen''s colorful production adapted from Lewis Carroll''s "Alice''s Adventures in Wonderland." Originally aired over two nights in 1985 on CBS.', 'Sometimes she''s too big. Or much too small. Sometimes things are backwards. And there''s always too much pepper in the soup! Nothing is quite right since Alice chased a very unusual White Rabbit and stumbled into an adventure that grows curiouser and curiouser. One of the greatest childhood fantasies is captured in Irwin Allen''s colorful production adapted from Lewis Carroll''s "Alice''s Adventures in Wonderland." Originally aired over two nights in 1985 on CBS.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HOFLKqXrfuWBUD2l52tbA3Fuex.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42553'),
  ('426869535674425514', 'Alice Nevers, le juge est une femme', 2002, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Pascale Breugnot, Vincent Mouluquet', null, 'Marine Delterme', 'NR', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uhhiPEVE7MAW3oOyICv9zFPNhi4.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:49953'),
  ('1125400416352472776', 'Alice or Alice', 2018, 'Animation', null, null, 'Rina Hidaka, Ayane Sakura, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Ayaka Suwa, Hiyori Nitta, Natsumi Takamori, Saori Onishi, Sora Tokui', 'TV-14', 'This story gives a look at the daily life of a pair or Alice twins and their older brother who has a sister complex. Them eating meals, getting into fights, playing with friends... Would you like to peek at the heart-full daily life of the cute Alices?', 'This story gives a look at the daily life of a pair or Alice twins and their older brother who has a sister complex. Them eating meals, getting into fights, playing with friends... Would you like to peek at the heart-full daily life of the cute Alices?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ZnRVm38i0lGynbBlDZrm4JWlHS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78456'),
  ('1078281269582511593', 'Alice, the Final Weapon', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Lee Byeong-heon', 'Lee Byeong-heon, Seo Seong-won', 'Park Se-wan, Song Geon-hee, Kim Seung-o, Lee Jung-hyoung, Kim Tae-hun, Jung Seung-kil, Cha Joo-young, Do Yu', null, 'A youth action romance about the bloody high school lives of mysterious transfer student and killer Gyeo Wool and traumatized high school student Yeo Reum as they meet and get chased down by a criminal organization.', 'A youth action romance about the bloody high school lives of mysterious transfer student and killer Gyeo Wool and traumatized high school student Yeo Reum as they meet and get chased down by a criminal organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vgFlYUTtg2Xzx6TXiVFCpjUE8k.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135896'),
  ('341636424065985160', 'Alice''s Wonderland Bakery', 2022, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy', 'Chelsea Beyl', null, 'Libby Rue, Abigail Estrella, CJ Uy, Jack Stanton, Secunda Wood, Audrey Wasilewski', 'TV-G', 'Alice, the great-granddaughter of the original Alice and a budding young baker at the enchanted Wonderland Bakery, where treats bring a new generation of characters together.', 'Alice, the great-granddaughter of the original Alice and a budding young baker at the enchanted Wonderland Bakery, where treats bring a new generation of characters together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZCirprTOUIHYnKAMU2WwPtVh5j.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:154820'),
  ('801085175397829140', 'Alien Nation', 1989, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Kenneth Johnson, Rockne S. O''Bannon', null, 'Gary Graham, Eric Pierpoint, Michele Scarabelli, Lauren Woodland, Sean Six, Terri Treas, Jeffrey Marcus, Ron Fassler', null, 'Detective Matthew Sikes, a Los Angeles police officer reluctantly works with "Newcomer" alien George Francisco. Sikes also has an ''on again off again'' flirtation with a female Newcomer, Cathy Frankel.', 'Detective Matthew Sikes, a Los Angeles police officer reluctantly works with "Newcomer" alien George Francisco. Sikes also has an ''on again off again'' flirtation with a female Newcomer, Cathy Frankel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mSnZFa4Yv3dFCMdcyJXjlq0lj4c.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5383'),
  ('622681418509526009', 'Alien Nine', 2001, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Juri Ihata, Kaori Shimizu, Noriko Shitaya, Aya Hisakawa, Akira Ishida, Ryusei Nakao, Sara Nakayama, Chinatsu Kasahara', null, 'Yuri Otani, much to her disgust, has been elected by her class for alien fighting duty. Together with Kasumi Tonime, who joined the alien fighter simply for the sake of doing so, and Kumi Kawamura, who became and alien fighter to avoid the responsibility of yet another year of class presidency, she must defend her school from periodic alien attacks. Introspection, fear, anxiety and friendship await Yuri as she is forced to stare life itself in the mouth in her chaotic coming of age.', 'Yuri Otani, much to her disgust, has been elected by her class for alien fighting duty. Together with Kasumi Tonime, who joined the alien fighter simply for the sake of doing so, and Kumi Kawamura, who became and alien fighter to avoid the responsibility of yet another year of class presidency, she must defend her school from periodic alien attacks. Introspection, fear, anxiety and friendship await Yuri as she is forced to stare life itself in the mouth in her chaotic coming of age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aBxNIWTnMSfFxHdpukkN9q0PQAA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43086'),
  ('876587971298423956', 'Alien TV', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Kids', 'Olivier Dumont', null, null, null, 'Alien reporters Ixbee, Pixbee and Squee travel to a lovely but odd planet called Earth, where they attempt to make sense of humans and their hobbies.', 'Alien reporters Ixbee, Pixbee and Squee travel to a lovely but odd planet called Earth, where they attempt to make sense of humans and their hobbies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqSDgXn18t1j3OUPem92vfUd7CU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:107422'),
  ('1024198939381851771', 'Alien Worlds', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Sophie Okonedo', 'TV-PG', 'Applying the laws of life on Earth to the rest of the galaxy, this series blends science fact and fiction to imagine alien life on other planets.', 'Applying the laws of life on Earth to the rest of the galaxy, this series blends science fact and fiction to imagine alien life on other planets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9EZSfJ4kc4wxk3EgqeGpw4xvcUj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113178'),
  ('870390134624227364', 'Alien: Earth', 2025, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Noah Hawley', null, 'Sydney Chandler, Alex Lawther, Essie Davis, Samuel Blenkin, Babou Ceesay, Adarsh Gourav, Erana James, Lily Newmark', 'TV-MA', 'When the mysterious deep space research vessel USCSS Maginot crash-lands on Earth, Wendy and a ragtag group of tactical soldiers make a fateful discovery that puts them face-to-face with the planet''s greatest threat.', 'When the mysterious deep space research vessel USCSS Maginot crash-lands on Earth, Wendy and a ragtag group of tactical soldiers make a fateful discovery that puts them face-to-face with the planet''s greatest threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yueXS3q8BtoWekcHOATFHicLl3e.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157239'),
  ('1023626995727741387', 'Alien: Isolation - The Digital Series', 2019, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation', 'Fabien Dubois, Sarah Kinga Smith', null, 'Emerald O''Hanrahan, Andrea Deck, Anthony Howell, Sean Gilder', null, 'Fifteen years have passed since the deep-space freighter Nostromo disappeared with all hands. Representatives from the Weyland-Yutani Corporation approach Amanda Ripley with news that the Nostromo''s flight recorder has finally been found and brought to the space station Sevastopol.', 'Fifteen years have passed since the deep-space freighter Nostromo disappeared with all hands. Representatives from the Weyland-Yutani Corporation approach Amanda Ripley with news that the Nostromo''s flight recorder has finally been found and brought to the space station Sevastopol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uLc3qwuXLnU2SJq2uJ3HSkeGWOs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87212'),
  ('110283634802284718', 'Aliens Among Immortals', 2026, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, null, null, 'Due to a marriage arranged for the purpose of benefit exchange, Jiang Yuan, an assassin from the Taixuan Building, and Shao Yue, the holy daughter of the Jiuxuan Sect, were ordered to get married. The two initiated an assassination on their wedding night, only to discover that they were both immortal. In order to obtain the secret treasures of the other sect, the Demon Suppressing Bell and the Demon Suppressing Bell, the two turned from mortal enemies into ostensible spouses, feigning harmony. However, the two were unaware that the other was also an alien survivor whose homeland had been destroyed by "Nihility". This pair of fated lovers formed an alliance amidst vigilance and probing, not only to search for the secret treasure formed from the lost spaceship, but also to confront the entire cultivation world that was eyeing them covetously, seeking hope to defeat "Nihility" amidst peril.', 'Due to a marriage arranged for the purpose of benefit exchange, Jiang Yuan, an assassin from the Taixuan Building, and Shao Yue, the holy daughter of the Jiuxuan Sect, were ordered to get married. The two initiated an assassination on their wedding night, only to discover that they were both immortal. In order to obtain the secret treasures of the other sect, the Demon Suppressing Bell and the Demon Suppressing Bell, the two turned from mortal enemies into ostensible spouses, feigning harmony. However, the two were unaware that the other was also an alien survivor whose homeland had been destroyed by "Nihility". This pair of fated lovers formed an alliance amidst vigilance and probing, not only to search for the secret treasure formed from the lost spaceship, but also to confront the entire cultivation world that was eyeing them covetously, seeking hope to defeat "Nihility" amidst peril.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4l4LfiTnQkyWW5Lzh59cOsTBnXl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:315088'),
  ('522789544848087544', 'Aliens in America', 2007, 'Comedy, Family', 'David Guarascio, Moses Port', null, 'Dan Byrd, Adhir Kalyan, Amy Pietz, Lindsey Shaw, Scott Patterson', 'TV-PG', 'Justin Tolchuk is a sensitive, lanky 16-year-old just trying to make it through the social nightmare of high school in Medora, Wisconsin. When his well-meaning mom Franny signs up for the school''s international exchange student program, she pictures an athletic, brilliant Nordic teen who will bestow instant coolness on her outsider son. However, when the Tolchuk''s exchange student arrives, he turns out to be Raja Musharaff, a 16-year-old Pakistani Muslim. It''s going to be a very interesting year for Raja, Justin, his family and the entire population of Medora.', 'Justin Tolchuk is a sensitive, lanky 16-year-old just trying to make it through the social nightmare of high school in Medora, Wisconsin. When his well-meaning mom Franny signs up for the school''s international exchange student program, she pictures an athletic, brilliant Nordic teen who will bestow instant coolness on her outsider son. However, when the Tolchuk''s exchange student arrives, he turns out to be Raja Musharaff, a 16-year-old Pakistani Muslim. It''s going to be a very interesting year for Raja, Justin, his family and the entire population of Medora.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wqfCYDdTg4FMdpokvnW3rr8J0cO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3538'),
  ('821417968730752093', 'Alistair MacLean''s Air Force One Is Down', 2014, 'Action & Adventure', null, 'Niall Leonard', 'Rupert Graves, Jamie Thomas King, Ken Duken, Cas Anvar, Linda Hamilton, Paul Birchard, Stefan Weinert, Gary McDonald', 'TV-PG', 'A fearless rogue soldier, a former general and the U.S. President become pawns in a deadly contest of wills on a global scale.', 'A fearless rogue soldier, a former general and the U.S. President become pawns in a deadly contest of wills on a global scale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0AziG27u5tcFEmhBKRsz2hYKNO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76495'),
  ('875207784406089564', 'Alkhallat+: The Series', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Ali Kalthami', null, 'Mohammed Aldokhei, Fahad Al-Mutairi, Ziyad Al-Amri, Umar Qadi, Mane’e Bin Shalhat, Abdullah Al-Drees, Ali Kalthami, Faisal Al-Ahmari', null, 'Spanning from the desert to the city, this offbeat comedy anthology tells unique tales of desire, ambition… and those tempted enough to seek them out.', 'Spanning from the desert to the city, this offbeat comedy anthology tells unique tales of desire, ambition… and those tempted enough to seek them out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKNXdTsvwTSIkMa92IB4taCL5O5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:318188'),
  ('362859320813598565', 'All About Eve', 2000, 'Drama', null, null, 'Park Chae-rim, Kim So-yeon, Kim Jung-eun, Jang Dong-gun, Leeteuk, Han Jae-suk, Park Won-sook, Kim Hyo-jin', null, 'This drama is about two girls, Jin Sun Mi and Heo Young Mi. Sun Mi had a nice childhood and grew up with lots of love from her father. Young Mi''s mother left her when she was young and her father was a drunk who recently died. She had a hard childhood but never gave up and made it into college.', 'This drama is about two girls, Jin Sun Mi and Heo Young Mi. Sun Mi had a nice childhood and grew up with lots of love from her father. Young Mi''s mother left her when she was young and her father was a drunk who recently died. She had a hard childhood but never gave up and made it into college.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4w8f5pdTjlgEY4rjyxByRgXx0A.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3262'),
  ('399941084536246533', 'All About My Mom', 2015, 'Drama, Family', null, 'Yun Gyeong-a', 'Eugene, Lee Sang-woo, Goh Doo-shim, Kim Kap-soo, Kim Mi-sook, Son Yeo-eun, Oh Min-suk, Cho Bo-ah', null, 'A story about the tiring but sad love and hatred between a mother and her daughters. Lee Jin-ae has a love and hate relationship with her mother, Im San-ok. She dreams of becoming independent from her family and especially from her mother. Jin-ae falls in love with Kang Hoon-jae and marries to him. Meanwhile, what awaits for Jin-ae is her new mother-in-law, Hwang Young-sun. While experiencing difficult times with her mother-in-law, Jin-ae begins to understand her mother San-ok for the first time.', 'A story about the tiring but sad love and hatred between a mother and her daughters. Lee Jin-ae has a love and hate relationship with her mother, Im San-ok. She dreams of becoming independent from her family and especially from her mother. Jin-ae falls in love with Kang Hoon-jae and marries to him. Meanwhile, what awaits for Jin-ae is her new mother-in-law, Hwang Young-sun. While experiencing difficult times with her mother-in-law, Jin-ae begins to understand her mother San-ok for the first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/arSA7rivMN6Ifr8j1q1fX9We05I.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63602'),
  ('958688049638941361', 'All About the Washingtons', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Jeremy Bronson', null, 'Joseph Simmons, Justine Simmons, Nathan Anderson, Leah Rose Randall, Maceo Smedley, Kiana Ledé, Trinitee, Sanai Victoria', 'TV-G', 'The wife of a legendary rapper launches her own career, which puts his life into a tailspin.', 'The wife of a legendary rapper launches her own career, which puts his life into a tailspin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bDNEWowpAE8iHl3X8r1qpshSSfp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80309'),
  ('690442488924448717', 'All Against All', 2019, 'Reality', 'Filip Hammar, Fredrik Wikingsson', null, 'Filip Hammar, Fredrik Wikingsson', null, 'Filip Hammar and Fredrik Wikingsson put the general knowledge of popular celebrities to the test - with a brand new twist.', 'Filip Hammar and Fredrik Wikingsson put the general knowledge of popular celebrities to the test - with a brand new twist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lj92q39TbCTD9PjtSGpdXulGutV.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:87362');
