  ('180075264878989882', 'Amityville: An Origin Story', 2023, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'John Carpenter, Diane Franklin, Christopher Lutz, Tommy Maher, Carol Soviero, Laura DiDio, Paula Uruburu, Gloria Gangitano', 'TV-MA', 'The story behind the world''s most infamous haunted house tale: the Amityville murders. This is the first elevated look at every aspect of this wildly layered story about the heinous murder of a family of six that became eclipsed by paranormal controversy.', 'The story behind the world''s most infamous haunted house tale: the Amityville murders. This is the first elevated look at every aspect of this wildly layered story about the heinous murder of a family of six that became eclipsed by paranormal controversy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uydSkjtL2O0FcEOw9vIBTsrjCy7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223305'),
  ('246521393918447058', 'Amnesia', 2013, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', null, null, 'Kaori Nazuka, Kisho Taniyama, Kouki Miyata, Akira Ishida, Satoshi Hino, Tetsuya Kakihara, Kana Akutsu, Satomi Moriya', 'NR', 'This story takes place in a fictional town, in a fictional country, in a fictional world. One morning, a young lady awakens to find that she has lost all her memories prior to that morning. Her life, her relationships, her very name—all gone. All that''s left is a cell phone with numbers and names she doesn''t recognize and Orion, a young boy that only she appears to be able to see. With Orion''s guidance, she struggles to make sense of herself, a boyfriend she doesn''t know and the thousand and one little things that make up a daily life. But with no memories left, the only alternative is to forge new ones, even if that means leaving old loves behind.', 'This story takes place in a fictional town, in a fictional country, in a fictional world. One morning, a young lady awakens to find that she has lost all her memories prior to that morning. Her life, her relationships, her very name—all gone. All that''s left is a cell phone with numbers and names she doesn''t recognize and Orion, a young boy that only she appears to be able to see. With Orion''s guidance, she struggles to make sense of herself, a boyfriend she doesn''t know and the thousand and one little things that make up a daily life. But with no memories left, the only alternative is to forge new ones, even if that means leaving old loves behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7KUzl5hXPmLXK3MgWIxjr5gLwQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:50087'),
  ('1042896175740016367', 'Among Friends', 1998, 'Drama, Family', null, null, 'Zoltán Szőke, Izabella Varga, Virág Pásztor, Edina Som-Balogh', null, 'Miklós introduces viewers into the world of Money and Charm.', 'Miklós introduces viewers into the world of Money and Charm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kBBbSgNchtMvsgD6z1oI1RRluHP.jpg', 23, 'tmdb:tv:50821'),
  ('131619665877475111', 'Among the Stars', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Chris Cassidy, Samuel Ting', 'TV-PG', 'A six-part docuseries with fly on the wall access into the wider world of NASA, with cameras on Earth and in space. NASA astronaut Captain Chris Cassidy is on a quest to get back in his spacesuit for one last mission. This series follows Chris and the wider team who take on missions that risk life, limb and reputation for the greater good of humankind. Join them as their missions unfold.', 'A six-part docuseries with fly on the wall access into the wider world of NASA, with cameras on Earth and in space. NASA astronaut Captain Chris Cassidy is on a quest to get back in his spacesuit for one last mission. This series follows Chris and the wider team who take on missions that risk life, limb and reputation for the greater good of humankind. Join them as their missions unfold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLICbkQBQ7YXfeFoUAQy1CDvavt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:133637'),
  ('874578270566125230', 'Amongst Men', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', 'Germán Maggiori', 'Pablo Fendrik, Germán Maggiori', 'Gabriel Goity, Nicolás Furtado, Diego Velázquez, Diego Cremonesi, Claudio Rissi, Lautaro Bettoni, Alan Daicz, Braian Rosales', 'NR', 'It is the golden age of gangs, and one of the darkest times for the police, who are controlled by a group of millionaire commissioners sharing in the illicit businesses of Buenos Aires.', 'It is the golden age of gangs, and one of the darkest times for the police, who are controlled by a group of millionaire commissioners sharing in the illicit businesses of Buenos Aires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ua7QFNnspjLcjrc0nCY9RRonmHS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100354'),
  ('812031839934943370', 'Amor amargo', 2024, 'Soap, Drama', 'Manolo Fernández, Juan Carlos Muñoz, Jorge Robles', null, 'Ana Belena, Daniela Romo, Andrés Palacios, Ricardo Franco, Federico Espejo, Martha Julia, Karina Flores, Arturo Peniche', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u8TkzDfknYHbx0NEsD8TSzw3M5f.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:273825'),
  ('1071382281403883461', 'Amor Dividido', 2022, 'Soap, Drama, Family', 'Juan Carlos Alcalá', null, 'Eva Cedeño, Gabriel Soto, Andrés Palacios, Irina Baeva, Arturo Peniche, Lambda García, Elsa Ortiz, Iván Ochoa', 'TV-PG', 'April and Max thought they had a made life, until fate decided to radically change it, to unite them in the midst of loneliness and disappointment. Learn about the importance of love for family and how people can learn from their mistakes to get ahead.', 'April and Max thought they had a made life, until fate decided to radically change it, to unite them in the midst of loneliness and disappointment. Learn about the importance of love for family and how people can learn from their mistakes to get ahead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fmYGE1sUzEg69UH7qTIbWcSO9c.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155761'),
  ('617968471065919264', 'Amor en custodia', 2009, 'Soap', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJKjDGAbPMagzjlds4Y21SIOoPU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94175'),
  ('602432405636068231', 'Amor en Custodia', 2005, 'Drama', 'Emilia Lamothe', null, 'Margarita Gralia, Paola Nuñez, Sergio Basañez, Adriana Louvier, Andrés Palacios, Irene Arcila, Lupita Sandoval', null, 'Amor en Custodia is a Mexican television drama, inspired by the popular Argentine telenovela of the same name, and developed and produced by Emilia Lamothe. Amor en Custodia focuses on and satirizes the lives of socialite teens and young adults growing up in Mexico city. It deals with sexuality, drugs, money, jealousy and other issues. It first aired on June 19, 2005 in Mexico City, on Canal 7, and was broadcast nationally a day later by TV Azteca. The pilot episode was also made available as a free download on the series'' official website. The series was first shown in the United States by Azteca America on July 18, 2005, and the final episode of the final season was broadcast in Mexico on September 12, 2008 and in the USA on October 3. Amor en Custodia holds the record for longest TV series in Mexico, with eleven seasons and 280 episodes. It has been shown in more than 13 countries, including the USA, Europe, Japan, Thailand, and Latin America, and has been translated into English, French, Japanese, and German.', 'Amor en Custodia is a Mexican television drama, inspired by the popular Argentine telenovela of the same name, and developed and produced by Emilia Lamothe. Amor en Custodia focuses on and satirizes the lives of socialite teens and young adults growing up in Mexico city. It deals with sexuality, drugs, money, jealousy and other issues. It first aired on June 19, 2005 in Mexico City, on Canal 7, and was broadcast nationally a day later by TV Azteca. The pilot episode was also made available as a free download on the series'' official website. The series was first shown in the United States by Azteca America on July 18, 2005, and the final episode of the final season was broadcast in Mexico on September 12, 2008 and in the USA on October 3. Amor en Custodia holds the record for longest TV series in Mexico, with eleven seasons and 280 episodes. It has been shown in more than 13 countries, including the USA, Europe, Japan, Thailand, and Latin America, and has been translated into English, French, Japanese, and German.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vU99HM3Zff6RJPP0n3OO6kfAlwF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8257'),
  ('640007255279677066', 'Amor mío', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Romina Yan, Cris Morena, Lily Ann Martin', null, 'Vanessa Guzmán, Raúl Araiza, Manuel ''Flaco'' Ibáñez, Rosa María Bianchi', 'TV-14', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rAwQL451YbDU4xlJivVuPdiBDIR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:101937'),
  ('152437946983906461', 'Amor Real', 2003, 'Soap, Drama', 'Caridad Bravo Adams', 'María Zarattini', 'Adela Noriega, Fernando Colunga, Mauricio Islas, Helena Rojo, Chantal Andere, Ernesto Laguardia, Mariana Levy, Ana Bertha Espín', 'NR', 'True love threatens to tear a family apart in this epic Mexican serial set in the 1800s. Rich and beautiful Matilde falls in love with Adolfo, but her mother, Augusta, disapproves of the relationship when she learns Adolfo is poor. Augusta forces her daughter to marry rich and handsome Manuel Fuentes Guerra, but Matilde plays with fire by continuing to be with Adolfo. Adela Noriega, Fernando Colunga, Helena Rojo and Chantal Andere star.', 'True love threatens to tear a family apart in this epic Mexican serial set in the 1800s. Rich and beautiful Matilde falls in love with Adolfo, but her mother, Augusta, disapproves of the relationship when she learns Adolfo is poor. Augusta forces her daughter to marry rich and handsome Manuel Fuentes Guerra, but Matilde plays with fire by continuing to be with Adolfo. Adela Noriega, Fernando Colunga, Helena Rojo and Chantal Andere star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w9syPXee6FK4mSpNVRg9jGYSRfB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13027'),
  ('242136748028432283', 'Amorcito Corazón', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Valentina Párraga', 'Luis Reynoso, Carmen Sepúlveda, Lucero Suárez', 'Elizabeth Álvarez, Diego Olivera, Fabiola Campomanes, Mariana Karr, Silvia Mariscal, Macaria, Alejandro Ibarra, Grettell Valdéz', 'TV-14', 'Amorcito Corazón is a Mexican telenovela produced by Televisa by Lucero Suarez. Rehabilitation of the Venezuelan RCTV telenovela Trapos Intimos. It stars Elizabeth Álvarez, Diego Olivera, Africa Zavala and Daniel Arenas, involving Fabiola Campomanes, Gerardo Murguia and Macaria as the main villains and stellar performances by the leading lady Mariana Karr, and Grettell Valdez. Canal de las Estrellas broadcast Amorcito Corazón from August 29, 2011, to June 10, 2012, with Cachito de Cielo replacing it. Univision confirmed an afternoon airing of Amorcito Corazón, and is currently seen weekday afternoons at 2pm central. Previously, Univision broadcast it at 3pm, replacing Dos Hogares from May 30 to June 15, 2012.', 'Amorcito Corazón is a Mexican telenovela produced by Televisa by Lucero Suarez. Rehabilitation of the Venezuelan RCTV telenovela Trapos Intimos. It stars Elizabeth Álvarez, Diego Olivera, Africa Zavala and Daniel Arenas, involving Fabiola Campomanes, Gerardo Murguia and Macaria as the main villains and stellar performances by the leading lady Mariana Karr, and Grettell Valdez. Canal de las Estrellas broadcast Amorcito Corazón from August 29, 2011, to June 10, 2012, with Cachito de Cielo replacing it. Univision confirmed an afternoon airing of Amorcito Corazón, and is currently seen weekday afternoons at 2pm central. Previously, Univision broadcast it at 3pm, replacing Dos Hogares from May 30 to June 15, 2012.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/po3TuCqukw9hEewmfO9TsQQv7GI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40408'),
  ('1132503380573474513', 'AMORE MORE', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Yuliya Tupikina', 'Yuriy Chursin, Aleksandra Ursulyak, Andrey Burkovskiy, Iana Gladkikh, Maxim Didenko, Stepan Devonin, Kseniya Kutepova, Viktoriya Korlyakova', null, 'At the center of the story are two couples of young people with relationship difficulties. Poliamor Georgiy does not know how to explain to his new beloved Alice that she will never be his only one. The marriage of another couple - chef Sergey and accountant Elena - is bursting at the seams: after the pandemic, Sergey''s business collapsed, he fell into a deep depression and wants - literally - nothing. Georgiy proposes a plan to his wife Elena: together they open a bar called AMORE MORE, where they will hold parties for couples. Sergey will return to work, Alisa will be able to reconsider her attitude towards polyamory. But the plan collapses - real feelings interfere in the matter.', 'At the center of the story are two couples of young people with relationship difficulties. Poliamor Georgiy does not know how to explain to his new beloved Alice that she will never be his only one. The marriage of another couple - chef Sergey and accountant Elena - is bursting at the seams: after the pandemic, Sergey''s business collapsed, he fell into a deep depression and wants - literally - nothing. Georgiy proposes a plan to his wife Elena: together they open a bar called AMORE MORE, where they will hold parties for couples. Sergey will return to work, Alisa will be able to reconsider her attitude towards polyamory. But the plan collapses - real feelings interfere in the matter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wF956vHrXMxswaeBktZvpmiqiFf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:202164'),
  ('571622937163886830', 'Amores verdaderos', 2012, 'Drama, Soap', 'Marcela Citterio, Kary Fajer, Enrique Estevanez', null, 'Erika Buenfil, Eduardo Yáñez, Eiza González, Sebastián Rulli, Marjorie de Sousa, Francisco Gattorno, Susana González, Gabriela Goldsmith', 'TV-14', 'Amores verdaderos is a 2012 Mexican telenovela produced by Nicandro Díaz Gonzalez for Televisa. It is based on Amor en Custodia, produced in Colombia, Argentina, and Mexico.', 'Amores verdaderos is a 2012 Mexican telenovela produced by Nicandro Díaz Gonzalez for Televisa. It is based on Amor en Custodia, produced in Colombia, Argentina, and Mexico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/smcTh9fyEBQkasD5TSuqdNeFlzW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46901'),
  ('127170843516339861', 'Amphibia', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family', 'Matt Braly', null, 'Brenda Song, Justin Felbinger, Amanda Leighton, Bill Farmer, On Braly, Brian Sounalath', 'TV-Y7', 'The adventures of 13-year-old, self-centered Anne Boonchuy who is magically transported to the fictitious world of Amphibia, a rural marshland full of frog-people. With the help of an excitable young frog named Sprig, Anne will become a hero and discover the first true friendship of her life.', 'The adventures of 13-year-old, self-centered Anne Boonchuy who is magically transported to the fictitious world of Amphibia, a rural marshland full of frog-people. With the help of an excitable young frog named Sprig, Anne will become a hero and discover the first true friendship of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFCgv9iWZECWSDxNQYc9soqvwjx.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:85349'),
  ('269284540449487772', 'Amsterdam Empire', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Bart Uytdenhouwen, Nico Moolenaar, Piet Matthys', null, 'Famke Janssen, Jacob Derwig, Elise Schaap, Jade Olieberg, Jesse Mensah, Yannick van de Velde', 'TV-MA', 'When Jack''s affair comes to light, his wife Betty hatches a bitter plan to strip him of the thing he loves most: The Jackal, his coffeeshop empire.', 'When Jack''s affair comes to light, his wife Betty hatches a bitter plan to strip him of the thing he loves most: The Jackal, his coffeeshop empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bssBGroBgZCHmn4jbbTmttt7VEq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:249586'),
  ('721281306359022755', 'Amy Bradley Is Missing', 2025, 'Documentary, Crime, Mystery', null, 'Phil Lott, Ari Mark', 'Iva Bradley, Ron Bradley, Brad Bradley, Erin Sheridan, Erin Cullather, Sarah Luck, David Carmichael, Kirk Detweiler', 'TV-14', 'This true-crime series investigates the 1998 disappearance of a 23-year-old woman from a Caribbean cruise and her family''s tireless search for answers.', 'This true-crime series investigates the 1998 disappearance of a 23-year-old woman from a Caribbean cruise and her family''s tireless search for answers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bS7hWmAGEFXbgSYyKqX0uapxWO7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:294726'),
  ('888944178443402134', 'Amy, la niña de la mochila azul', 2004, 'Family, Kids, Drama', 'Rubén Galindo, Jaime Santos', null, 'Amy Granados, Matías Granados, Eduardo Capetillo, Pedro Armendáriz Jr., Carlos Speitzer, David Ostrosky, Alejandro Speitzer, Lucero Lander', 'TV-Y7', 'Amy, la niña de la mochila azul is a Mexican telenovela produced by Televisa in 2004. Starring Danna Paola as Amy, Nora Salinas, Eduardo Capetillo, Pedro Armendáriz Jr. and Tatiana.', 'Amy, la niña de la mochila azul is a Mexican telenovela produced by Televisa in 2004. Starring Danna Paola as Amy, Nora Salinas, Eduardo Capetillo, Pedro Armendáriz Jr. and Tatiana.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n5cKXFBnzdMnVdBrwpNhtn0TISM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:58565'),
  ('1067520563736111129', 'An Adoption Story', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Alex Gilbert', null, null, null, 'An Adoption Story is an online series where we follow the lives of adoptees'' with their journeys. Sitting down with Russian-New Zealand adoptee, Alex Gilbert to give an insight to their lives that may come with challenges along the way.', 'An Adoption Story is an online series where we follow the lives of adoptees'' with their journeys. Sitting down with Russian-New Zealand adoptee, Alex Gilbert to give an insight to their lives that may come with challenges along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kBn8KIfbdTXXCILiAY8U7LiTRd5.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:234672'),
  ('40011028251818831', 'An Adventurer''s Daily Grind at Age 29', 2026, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Makoto Furukawa, Sayumi Suzushiro, Shizuka Itoh, Yuuki Kuwahara, Yuna Ogata, Kaori Maeda, Tomohiro Ono, Haruka Shiraishi', 'TV-14', 'Born and raised in the slums, 29-year-old adventurer Hajime Shinonome now lives a quiet life in Komai Village. But his peaceful days take a turn when he discovers Lirui, an abandoned young girl, being attacked by a slime. Moved by her desperation and reminded of his own past, he takes her back to the village. Hajime and Lirui begin a new chapter filled with unexpected challenges and gentle days!', 'Born and raised in the slums, 29-year-old adventurer Hajime Shinonome now lives a quiet life in Komai Village. But his peaceful days take a turn when he discovers Lirui, an abandoned young girl, being attacked by a slime. Moved by her desperation and reminded of his own past, he takes her back to the village. Hajime and Lirui begin a new chapter filled with unexpected challenges and gentle days!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tx6XZPOJ5UgVzvo8BXb2cNhFBq5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:290667'),
  ('674228614055393015', 'An Age of Kings', 1960, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Peter Dews', null, null, null, 'A linking together of Shakespeare''s history plays — Richard II, 1 Henry IV, 2 Henry IV, Henry V, 1 Henry VI, 2 Henry VI, 3 Henry VI, and Richard III — chronicling the rise and fall of monarchs over the 86 years between Richard II and Richard III.', 'A linking together of Shakespeare''s history plays — Richard II, 1 Henry IV, 2 Henry IV, Henry V, 1 Henry VI, 2 Henry VI, 3 Henry VI, and Richard III — chronicling the rise and fall of monarchs over the 86 years between Richard II and Richard III.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wktuD6RcbSJmAWpeT01szcRfYVV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:18260'),
  ('661474911548199498', 'An American Murder Mystery: The Staircase', 2018, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Diane Dimond, Diane Fanning', 'TV-14', 'Novelist Michael Peterson and his wife Kathleen are the toast of Durham, North Carolina. But that all changes on December 9, 2001, when Kathleen is found dead in her home at the bottom of a staircase. Michael claims it was a tragic, accidental fall. But was she murdered? In this three-part series, we investigate the shocking details of the case through the people closest to it. We''ll also reveal a 16-year-old secret and examine one of the most dramatic trials in recent history.', 'Novelist Michael Peterson and his wife Kathleen are the toast of Durham, North Carolina. But that all changes on December 9, 2001, when Kathleen is found dead in her home at the bottom of a staircase. Michael claims it was a tragic, accidental fall. But was she murdered? In this three-part series, we investigate the shocking details of the case through the people closest to it. We''ll also reveal a 16-year-old secret and examine one of the most dramatic trials in recent history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ol6BurbIg7aj4HUf3Nll04a8VIu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78602'),
  ('766441437537440887', 'An Ancient Love Song', 2023, 'Drama', 'Zhi Zhu', 'He Yuduan, Dai Chao Chao, Cui Xi Xi', 'Zhang Yaqin, Guo Jianan, Bubble Zhu, Quan Yilun, Zhuang Han, Huang Jingzhou', null, 'Professor Shen Bu Yan accidentally travels to the ancient era of Acacia, where he becomes obsessed with finding the ancient secret of this era. With the help of the warm girl, Lu Yuan, will he be able to unravel the mystery?', 'Professor Shen Bu Yan accidentally travels to the ancient era of Acacia, where he becomes obsessed with finding the ancient secret of this era. With the help of the warm girl, Lu Yuan, will he be able to unravel the mystery?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ss97wzqPmeLyc9F3Y10mcn0HO5r.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:229229'),
  ('691022023240088199', 'An Andalusian Bitch', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Pablo Tocino', 'Pablo Tocino', 'Sara Perogil, Enmanuel García, Jota Palacios, Esther de los Reyes, Yir Campos, Maialen Ruiz, Manuel Horus, Lola Buero', null, 'Sofia, Samu, Tamara, Marcos, Sylvia and Judit are, each in their own way, an Andalusian bitch. Like many kids their age, they feel quite lost, and they try to find their way, a path greatly influenced by the relationship (repressed, released or overstimulated) they have with sex, and which can only be defined as "dramarracha". The motto of these Andalusian bitches is clear: as their compatriot Machado said, "Walker, there is no path, the path is made by shitting."', 'Sofia, Samu, Tamara, Marcos, Sylvia and Judit are, each in their own way, an Andalusian bitch. Like many kids their age, they feel quite lost, and they try to find their way, a path greatly influenced by the relationship (repressed, released or overstimulated) they have with sex, and which can only be defined as "dramarracha". The motto of these Andalusian bitches is clear: as their compatriot Machado said, "Walker, there is no path, the path is made by shitting."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFF27f2wER4thhWwiKge1oRsgWF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:137402'),
  ('251310095819505801', 'An Archdemon''s Dilemma: How to Love Your Elf Bride', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kana Ichinose, Yusuke Kobayashi, Hana Hishikawa, Kisho Taniyama, Akane Misaka, Tetsu Inada, Ayasa Ito, Toshiyuki Morikawa', 'TV-14', 'Zagan might be the most feared evil sorcerer, but when it comes to social interactions, he''s the most inept. All those days studying the dark arts won''t help him when he falls in love at first sight with Nephelia, the beautiful elven slave, and spends his entire fortune to purchase her. With no clue how to talk to each other, the awkward arrangement for a bumbling sorcerer and timid elf begins.', 'Zagan might be the most feared evil sorcerer, but when it comes to social interactions, he''s the most inept. All those days studying the dark arts won''t help him when he falls in love at first sight with Nephelia, the beautiful elven slave, and spends his entire fortune to purchase her. With no clue how to talk to each other, the awkward arrangement for a bumbling sorcerer and timid elf begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yrtmTLOnHWJxlqDHNyxm0eUHr1U.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:238848'),
  ('796101869312222440', 'An Astrological Guide for Broken Hearts', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Bindu De Stoppani, Silvia Zucca, Michela Andreozzi', null, 'Claudia Gusmano, Lorenzo Adorni, Michele Rosiello', 'TV-MA', 'Alice is heartbroken and hopelessly single. But after befriending a charismatic astrology guru, she looks to the stars to find her perfect match.', 'Alice is heartbroken and hopelessly single. But after befriending a charismatic astrology guru, she looks to the stars to find her perfect match.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9evrUJvsRsygxB6N2LRuRUXu7e.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:135908'),
  ('564463133399808715', 'An Audience with...', 1978, 'Talk', null, null, null, null, 'An Audience with... is a British entertainment television show produced by London Weekend Television, in which a host, usually a singer or comedian, performs for an invited audience of celebrity guests, interspersed with questions from the audience, in a light hearted revue/tribute style.', 'An Audience with... is a British entertainment television show produced by London Weekend Television, in which a host, usually a singer or comedian, performs for an invited audience of celebrity guests, interspersed with questions from the audience, in a light hearted revue/tribute style.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lB8kUSnmvM3hLTXxVHpN9LYTpDE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:5111'),
  ('486142240353309529', 'An Exciting Offer', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, 'He Junlin, Ming Chen, Wang Ziqi, Xu Zhisheng, Zhang Quanling, Bai Xu Xu, Chen Chen, Chen Luyu', null, 'An Exciting Offer is the first career reality show in China. Five male students and three female students that graduated from well-known law schools will have internship for a month and complete the tasks under the guidance of four lawyers. After which they''ll vie for two full-time positions. The celebrity group, including He Jiong, Guo Jingfei, Vin Zhou, Lan Yingying, Miss Papi, and a lawyer Yue Shenshan, will observe the interns'' growth and learning in their work. The interns will learn professional and social skills of lawyers in the process.', 'An Exciting Offer is the first career reality show in China. Five male students and three female students that graduated from well-known law schools will have internship for a month and complete the tasks under the guidance of four lawyers. After which they''ll vie for two full-time positions. The celebrity group, including He Jiong, Guo Jingfei, Vin Zhou, Lan Yingying, Miss Papi, and a lawyer Yue Shenshan, will observe the interns'' growth and learning in their work. The interns will learn professional and social skills of lawyers in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jt0mIHdH5G6emIPG95HU38LTjNU.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:106621'),
  ('622959996114376692', 'An Idiot Abroad', 2010, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Ricky Gervais', null, 'Karl Pilkington, Ricky Gervais, Warwick Davis', 'TV-MA', 'An Idiot Abroad is a British travel documentary television series broadcast on Sky1 and Science, as well as spin-off books published by Canongate Books, created by Ricky Gervais and Stephen Merchant and starring Karl Pilkington. The ongoing theme of both the television series and the books is that Pilkington has no interest in global travel, so Merchant and Gervais make him travel while they stay in the United Kingdom and monitor his progress.', 'An Idiot Abroad is a British travel documentary television series broadcast on Sky1 and Science, as well as spin-off books published by Canongate Books, created by Ricky Gervais and Stephen Merchant and starring Karl Pilkington. The ongoing theme of both the television series and the books is that Pilkington has no interest in global travel, so Merchant and Gervais make him travel while they stay in the United Kingdom and monitor his progress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gTU5vFGhyxOoMrJGXvNJS1gRNM.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:34014'),
  ('1030780761817401092', 'An Incurable Case of Love', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Arisa Kaneko', 'Mone Kamishiraishi, Takeru Satoh, Karina, Katsuya Maiguma, Nana Katase, Keisuke Watanabe, Ai Yoshikawa, Koji Yamamoto', null, 'Nanase fell in love with Dr. Tendo five years ago. Now she''s a nurse and ready to meet him again. But he''s nothing like the nice guy she thought he was!', 'Nanase fell in love with Dr. Tendo five years ago. Now she''s a nurse and ready to meet him again. But he''s nothing like the nice guy she thought he was!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggn32nGCGpdweIJ363Ji0JoZbUK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97948'),
  ('164707276562089165', 'An Istanbul Tale', 2003, 'Drama', 'Sertaç Ergin', 'Gaye Boralıoğlu, Sertaç Ergin, Gökhan Horzum', 'Ahu Türkpençe, Mehmet Aslantuğ, Vahide Perçin, Ozan Güven, Emre Karayel, İsmail Hacıoğlu, Arsen Gürzap, Yasemin Baştan', null, 'The series is made into 71 episodes. It takes place in Istanbul, Turkey. The story centers around two rich brothers Selim Arhan the elder and Demir Arhan the younger one. They are still living at home with their parents Omar Arhan and Baheye Arhan. They live in a large house and have a cook by the name of Suzanne and her husband the driver whose name is Jamal Kozan. They have three children; Cheche the eldest is 28, Esma the second daughter who is the star of the series and finally a son who is in his final year at school. Esma has loved Demir, the younger son, ever since she was a child but he never noticed her. She always followed his news in the magazines. One night she climbed a tree to watch the annual Spring party that his family was holding but her sister followed her and tried to force to come down from the tree resulting in her falling over the large cake and hurting her ankle. The next morning, Selim found her sitting in the garden of his house and discovered that her foot was hurting so he decided to take her to a doctor. Esma was going to audition that day for a dance but her father didn''t know about it. She failed the audition because she couldn''t dance well. One night Demir came home followed by one of his girlfriends who refused to leave and wanted to be invited inside. He told her that his girlfriend was there and so he couldn''t receive her. To convince that girl to go away, he kissed Esma who was in standing there. She thought that such a kiss was a sign that he was beginning to notice her. One night Demir came home drunk and couldn''t go to his room. Esma had a copy of the house keys and so went to him to help him to his room. She tired to help him out of his clothes when his mother came in and saw them together in bed. When Selim was told about that he thought that he could save matters by putting her name as one to the people who were going to do their training at Arhan indutries which happened to be the largest company in Turkey and where many people were always trying to get their training there to put it on their CVs.', 'The series is made into 71 episodes. It takes place in Istanbul, Turkey. The story centers around two rich brothers Selim Arhan the elder and Demir Arhan the younger one. They are still living at home with their parents Omar Arhan and Baheye Arhan. They live in a large house and have a cook by the name of Suzanne and her husband the driver whose name is Jamal Kozan. They have three children; Cheche the eldest is 28, Esma the second daughter who is the star of the series and finally a son who is in his final year at school. Esma has loved Demir, the younger son, ever since she was a child but he never noticed her. She always followed his news in the magazines. One night she climbed a tree to watch the annual Spring party that his family was holding but her sister followed her and tried to force to come down from the tree resulting in her falling over the large cake and hurting her ankle. The next morning, Selim found her sitting in the garden of his house and discovered that her foot was hurting so he decided to take her to a doctor. Esma was going to audition that day for a dance but her father didn''t know about it. She failed the audition because she couldn''t dance well. One night Demir came home followed by one of his girlfriends who refused to leave and wanted to be invited inside. He told her that his girlfriend was there and so he couldn''t receive her. To convince that girl to go away, he kissed Esma who was in standing there. She thought that such a kiss was a sign that he was beginning to notice her. One night Demir came home drunk and couldn''t go to his room. Esma had a copy of the house keys and so went to him to help him to his room. She tired to help him out of his clothes when his mother came in and saw them together in bed. When Selim was told about that he thought that he could save matters by putting her name as one to the people who were going to do their training at Arhan indutries which happened to be the largest company in Turkey and where many people were always trying to get their training there to put it on their CVs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zTz6QFrcBUFxkSpwubR3hlolnPA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:42783'),
  ('1056313441262426779', 'An Observation Log of My Fiancée Who Calls Herself a Villainess', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yusuke Kobayashi, Miyu Tomita', null, 'Bertia is reincarnated into her favorite otome game—not as the heroine, but as the villainess engaged to the perfect Crown Prince Cecil! Fully aware that her role is to sabotage his future romance, she’s determined to bloom as a wicked flower and wither away according to the story. But no matter how hard she tries to scheme, her “evil” plans only make her more endearing!', 'Bertia is reincarnated into her favorite otome game—not as the heroine, but as the villainess engaged to the perfect Crown Prince Cecil! Fully aware that her role is to sabotage his future romance, she’s determined to bloom as a wicked flower and wither away according to the story. But no matter how hard she tries to scheme, her “evil” plans only make her more endearing!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xlpYhXiyX52t6Dtg1fFN0CqLbK4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:288590'),
  ('1085978631874628887', 'An Ordinary Woman', 2018, 'Drama, Crime', 'Denis Utochkin, Mariya Melenevskaya', null, 'Anna Mikhalkova, Evgeniy Grishkovec, Aleksandra Bortich, Elizaveta Kononova, Tatyana Dogileva, Mariya Andreeva, Julia Melnikova, Aglaya Tarasova', null, 'Marina is in her late 30s, she has a successful business and a close-knit family. Her husband is a surgeon and her daughters study at fancy establishments. To everybody her life seems perfect. Though, it is all just a facade concealing the real problems: her husband has a mistress, her elder daughter is a slacker and drug-dealer, her youngest is a sociopath. Well, Marina herself is not really a flower-lady, but a brothel-keeper who is hiding her dark business from everyone. The truth may come out when a girl of Marina’s is found dead.', 'Marina is in her late 30s, she has a successful business and a close-knit family. Her husband is a surgeon and her daughters study at fancy establishments. To everybody her life seems perfect. Though, it is all just a facade concealing the real problems: her husband has a mistress, her elder daughter is a slacker and drug-dealer, her youngest is a sociopath. Well, Marina herself is not really a flower-lady, but a brothel-keeper who is hiding her dark business from everyone. The truth may come out when a girl of Marina’s is found dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gkd9UJ0TbbRCwXnQpsMMO6NxXJN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:83377'),
  ('997887479989028077', 'An Oriental Odyssey', 2018, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Miao Juan', 'Janice Wu, Zheng Yecheng, Zhang Yujian, Dong Qi, Yuan Wenkang, Liu Tianzuo, Yin Xiaotian, Yao Zhuojun', null, 'Ye Yuanan is the daughter of the Assistant Minister of Revenue during the Tang Dynasty. Somewhat of an amateur sleuth, Yuanan loves solving mysteries and is constantly in competition with Zhao Lanzhi, a police officer who is trying to do his job. Yuanan has the assistance of Mu Le, a young man she took in as a family servant after saving him from danger. But what will Yuanan do when she discovers Mu Le’s true identity?', 'Ye Yuanan is the daughter of the Assistant Minister of Revenue during the Tang Dynasty. Somewhat of an amateur sleuth, Yuanan loves solving mysteries and is constantly in competition with Zhao Lanzhi, a police officer who is trying to do his job. Yuanan has the assistance of Mu Le, a young man she took in as a family servant after saving him from danger. But what will Yuanan do when she discovers Mu Le’s true identity?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8g6DBJM9rkuKUAbrbMggOBgQoM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83236'),
  ('1102673708275746555', 'An Unknown Enemy', 2018, 'Drama, War & Politics, Crime', 'Gabriel Ripstein', null, 'Daniel Giménez Cacho, Antonio de la Vega, Karina Gidi, Kristyan Ferrer, Roberto Duarte, Alex Cox, Suzanne Aguilera, Jero Medina', null, 'Fernando Barrientos, Head of the National Security Directorate, Mexico''s Secret Police, is trying to reach the highest position in the country. On his way, he''ll have to manipulate, betray, and kill, and he''s well prepared for it. However, his path will be full of obstacles. Nobody, not even his family, will be immune to the chaos left in his quest for total power.', 'Fernando Barrientos, Head of the National Security Directorate, Mexico''s Secret Police, is trying to reach the highest position in the country. On his way, he''ll have to manipulate, betray, and kill, and he''s well prepared for it. However, his path will be full of obstacles. Nobody, not even his family, will be immune to the chaos left in his quest for total power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/swabeIFoJmAWKgtYijqOEMUiZfS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:82297'),
  ('282564294642751975', 'Ana', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ana de la Reguera', null, 'Ana de la Reguera', 'TV-MA', 'Ana was raised to be stunning and famous until she comes to terms with how superficial this is. This is the late-coming of age of a woman who is no longer scared of getting lost to find herself.', 'Ana was raised to be stunning and famous until she comes to terms with how superficial this is. This is the late-coming of age of a woman who is no longer scared of getting lost to find herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hg2GfkZeaXkQ8KBQYXymg4liPon.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:102625'),
  ('8811342551062973', 'Ana de nadie', 2023, 'Soap, Drama', 'Bernardo Romero Pereiro, Mónica Agudelo', null, 'Paola Turbay, Sebastián Carvajal, Jorge Enrique Abello, Laura Archbold, Carlos Báez, Ilenia Antonini, Adriana Arango, Camila Zarate', null, 'Ana, a dedicated wife and mother, must reinvent her life after divorcing her philandering husband. When she meets and falls in love with a much younger man named Joaquín, her family and future change forever.', 'Ana, a dedicated wife and mother, must reinvent her life after divorcing her philandering husband. When she meets and falls in love with a much younger man named Joaquín, her family and future change forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9HMJ9bLOVCqsnGNryCFklvG20Sd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:221573'),
  ('232704747455383292', 'Ana y los 7', 2002, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Ana Obregón', null, 'Ana Obregón, Roberto Álvarez, Silvia Marsó, Aarón Guerrero, Nerea García, Alejandro Gallego, Guillermo Gallego, Juan Antonio Quintana', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1M0ihgk8dLf8ZCJn3OYDWEXkkf4.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:76671'),
  ('856640952345580864', 'Ana. All In.', 2021, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Roberto Santiago', null, 'Maribel Verdú, Natalia Verbeke, Israel Elejalde, Luis Bermejo, Unax Ugalde, Juan Manuel Cifuentes', null, 'Ana Tramel is a brilliant criminal lawyer in her lowest hours. She receives a call from her brother, who has been accused of murdering the director of a famous casino. With a small team, she will have to face a huge corporation.', 'Ana Tramel is a brilliant criminal lawyer in her lowest hours. She receives a call from her brother, who has been accused of murdering the director of a famous casino. With a small team, she will have to face a huge corporation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owJ8VeYBmh9gncWFL5R1m8pGngX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128031'),
  ('738799518460193841', 'Analog Squad', 2023, 'Drama', 'Nithiwat Tharathorn, Aummaraporn Phandintong', null, 'Nopachai Jayanama, Kullanat Preeyawat, Kritsanapoom Pibulsonggram, Wipawee Patnasiri, Surasee Ithikul, Took Viyada Komarakul Na Nakorn, Gasab Jumpadib, Yoko Takano', null, 'After learning of his estranged father''s sickness, a scheming middle-aged man assembles a fake family to reunite with him for one last time.', 'After learning of his estranged father''s sickness, a scheming middle-aged man assembles a fake family to reunite with him for one last time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5irKf1mS3Tsb59htrntlYzL0sUN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:238557'),
  ('821500922722710351', 'Anatomy of a Scandal', 2022, 'Drama', 'David E. Kelley, Melissa James Gibson', null, 'Sienna Miller, Rupert Friend, Michelle Dockery, Naomi Scott, Josette Simon, Joshua McGuire, Sebastian Selwood, Amelie Bea Smith', 'TV-MA', 'Sophie''s privileged life as the wife of powerful politician James unravels when scandalous secrets surface — and he stands accused of a shocking crime.', 'Sophie''s privileged life as the wife of powerful politician James unravels when scandalous secrets surface — and he stands accused of a shocking crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e1pUQkXbFNI6xH4oDuHnyJoOSib.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113984'),
  ('132064097296359274', 'Anatomy of Lies', 2024, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Elisabeth R. Finch', 'TV-MA', 'Reveals the rise and fall of Grey''s Anatomy star writer Elisabeth Finch, whose jaw-dropping lies fooled Hollywood for years, and became fodder for many high-profile episodes of Grey''s. The story is told by some of her closest contacts, many speaking for the first time.', 'Reveals the rise and fall of Grey''s Anatomy star writer Elisabeth Finch, whose jaw-dropping lies fooled Hollywood for years, and became fodder for many high-profile episodes of Grey''s. The story is told by some of her closest contacts, many speaking for the first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6PBxSlpAxXCjY85GYTBNWE9iXDO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:271815'),
  ('1119969082712962409', 'Anchored', 2015, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Miren Ibarguren, Rossy de Palma, Alfonso Lara, Joaquín Reyes, Úrsula Corberó, Miki Esparbé, Sara Vega, Fernando Gil', 'TV-G', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ea7qFFjlKD2VV79SFJ8o5jfm7Xj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62728'),
  ('197729468958923918', 'Ancient Aliens', 2010, 'Documentary, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kevin Burns', null, 'Robert Clotworthy, Giorgio A. Tsoukalos, Ariel Bar Tzadok, Jonathan Young, David Childress, Erich von Däniken, Linda Moulton Howe, David Wilcock', 'TV-PG', 'Did intelligent beings from outer space visit Earth thousands of years ago? From the age of the dinosaurs to ancient Egypt, from early cave drawings to continued mass sightings in the US, each episode gives historic depth to the questions, speculations, provocative controversies, first-hand accounts and grounded theories surrounding this age old debate.', 'Did intelligent beings from outer space visit Earth thousands of years ago? From the age of the dinosaurs to ancient Egypt, from early cave drawings to continued mass sightings in the US, each episode gives historic depth to the questions, speculations, provocative controversies, first-hand accounts and grounded theories surrounding this age old debate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6X2hftdC8y78SKMSgfzeUItqaVq.jpg', 22, 'tmdb:tv:32608'),
  ('823734989153488805', 'Ancient Apocalypse', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Graham Hancock', null, 'Graham Hancock', null, 'Journalist and writer Graham Hancock travels the globe hunting for evidence of mysterious, lost civilizations dating back to the last Ice Age. He attempts to prove that a climatic event 12,000 years ago wiped out an entire civilization far more sophisticated than the simple hunter-gatherers some archaeologists believe lived at that time.', 'Journalist and writer Graham Hancock travels the globe hunting for evidence of mysterious, lost civilizations dating back to the last Ice Age. He attempts to prove that a climatic event 12,000 years ago wiped out an entire civilization far more sophisticated than the simple hunter-gatherers some archaeologists believe lived at that time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zvEXNgE13GZLlbYdbZj4sxu97BG.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:212869'),
  ('447447991040588880', 'Ancient Black Ops', 2014, null, null, null, 'Kumud Pant, Umit Ulgen, Murtaza Arif, Max Bracey, Martin Krøis Holtmann, Nicholas Marshall', null, 'From Ancient Greece to the frozen North, rulers have always needed their elite troops – men trained to perfection, skilled with a devastating array of weaponry – men who will track down their leader’s enemies and kill them. All assassination teams faced one big problem: getting close enough to kill. No one in the ancient world had sniper rifles. As a result even the most formidable Japanese Ninjas got captured and tortured. This series brings some of the most dramatic tales of antiquity to life with a mixture of dramatic reconstruction, documentary filming and expert testimony. Each episode details the intricate complexity of the elite troops who performed the assassination missions and how they worked. It shows what they had to do to achieve elite status, how they could dress, and the weapons they got to use when they completed their first mission.', 'From Ancient Greece to the frozen North, rulers have always needed their elite troops – men trained to perfection, skilled with a devastating array of weaponry – men who will track down their leader’s enemies and kill them. All assassination teams faced one big problem: getting close enough to kill. No one in the ancient world had sniper rifles. As a result even the most formidable Japanese Ninjas got captured and tortured. This series brings some of the most dramatic tales of antiquity to life with a mixture of dramatic reconstruction, documentary filming and expert testimony. Each episode details the intricate complexity of the elite troops who performed the assassination missions and how they worked. It shows what they had to do to achieve elite status, how they could dress, and the weapons they got to use when they completed their first mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCnlVzhNS72j89s9m5WAXEfv5zh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61476'),
  ('284403962400968078', 'Ancient Detective', 2020, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Yu Jiwei, Wang Yanyang, Rachel Wang, Ma Zehan, Hao Shuai, Wang Xingwei, Huang Riying, Du Yafei', 'TV-14', 'The story follows the amnesiac detective Jian Buzhi who starts on a quest to finding the truth and unmasking his father''s killer. Along the way, he finds a love interest and a good friend who work hand in hand with him to solve mysterious cases.', 'The story follows the amnesiac detective Jian Buzhi who starts on a quest to finding the truth and unmasking his father''s killer. Along the way, he finds a love interest and a good friend who work hand in hand with him to solve mysterious cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9KzVMwCxMNwEKlbNsHvu1EGqPsZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:102266'),
  ('71979869167810570', 'Ancient Love Poetry', 2021, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Xing Ling', 'Rao Jun, Li Zhenru', 'Zhou Dongyu, Xu Kai, Liu Xueyi, Li Zefeng, Luo Qiuyun, Zhang Yaqin, Lai Yi, Zhong Qi', null, 'The love story between Bai Jue, one of the four true Gods, and Shang Gu. As Shang Gu grows from an inexperienced mortal to a powerful immortal, their bond faces immense challenges. Bai Jue, deeply in love with her, waits for 60,000 years, willing to sacrifice everything to be with her.', 'The love story between Bai Jue, one of the four true Gods, and Shang Gu. As Shang Gu grows from an inexperienced mortal to a powerful immortal, their bond faces immense challenges. Bai Jue, deeply in love with her, waits for 60,000 years, willing to sacrifice everything to be with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dF4waBOWABTMSZ11IICfs3GwvM3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:102777'),
  ('324495366704979920', 'Ancient Mysteries', 1994, 'Documentary, Mystery', null, null, 'Leonard Nimoy', 'TV-G', 'Ancient Mysteries is a television series that was produced by FilmRoos and originally broadcast on A&E between 7 January 1994 and 3 May 1998 with reruns airing until 2000. Reruns were also re-broadcast on The Biography Channel during the 2000s. The series deals with historical mysteries and is mostly hosted by Leonard Nimoy, which recalls the late-1970s TV series In Search Of ...', 'Ancient Mysteries is a television series that was produced by FilmRoos and originally broadcast on A&E between 7 January 1994 and 3 May 1998 with reruns airing until 2000. Reruns were also re-broadcast on The Biography Channel during the 2000s. The series deals with historical mysteries and is mostly hosted by Leonard Nimoy, which recalls the late-1970s TV series In Search Of ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dc3GhuA0o02XNohSogF9A4hjNeO.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:10275'),
  ('803858245660518319', 'Ancient Recipes', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'Food is living history. It reflects great shifts in the past and preserves the fine details of ancient life. The documentary Ancient Recipes lightly unlocks the flavors of the past, using food to reveal the history and stories behind it. Taiwanese writer and cultural scholar Gao Wenqi hosts the kitchen, joined by guests from food and culture. In a relaxed, humorous setting, they recreate centuries-old dishes and the traditional wisdom hidden within them.', 'Food is living history. It reflects great shifts in the past and preserves the fine details of ancient life. The documentary Ancient Recipes lightly unlocks the flavors of the past, using food to reveal the history and stories behind it. Taiwanese writer and cultural scholar Gao Wenqi hosts the kitchen, joined by guests from food and culture. In a relaxed, humorous setting, they recreate centuries-old dishes and the traditional wisdom hidden within them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2UcjrcFziKt9eDI6W4XPVHP1u2U.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:306539'),
  ('903454188930403100', 'Ancient Rome: The Rise and Fall of an Empire', 2006, 'Documentary', 'James Wood', null, 'Alisdair Simpson', 'TV-14', 'Turning points in ancient Roman history and some of the Empire''s greatest stories are brought to life in this drama documentary series.', 'Turning points in ancient Roman history and some of the Empire''s greatest stories are brought to life in this drama documentary series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qMVzcLIWRqwe0TddlDG8WQMfmjx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13398'),
  ('1044043505209901258', 'Ancient X-Files', 2010, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Chris Porter', 'TV-PG', 'Ancient X Files travels around the world to solve some intriguing riddles. Each story is a piece of detective work by an expert trying to make sense of some puzzling ancient artefact, to find the truth behind some extraordinary legend, to discover the origins of a bizarre myth or to establish the authenticity of a venerated religious relic. This series explores the bits of archaeology and history which seem to defy explanation. Our experts are following chains of clues and putting theories to the test, in an effort to explain the unexplained. Ancient X Files investigates claims about the whereabouts of the lost Ark of the Covenant; attempts to establish the authenticity of a cup some believe to be the Holy Grail; tries to de-code the mysterious Phaistos disc; investigates a cloth which is believed to carry traces of the DNA of Jesus Christ; and deciphers an encrypted book of alchemy written by the great Sir Isaac Newton.', 'Ancient X Files travels around the world to solve some intriguing riddles. Each story is a piece of detective work by an expert trying to make sense of some puzzling ancient artefact, to find the truth behind some extraordinary legend, to discover the origins of a bizarre myth or to establish the authenticity of a venerated religious relic. This series explores the bits of archaeology and history which seem to defy explanation. Our experts are following chains of clues and putting theories to the test, in an effort to explain the unexplained. Ancient X Files investigates claims about the whereabouts of the lost Ark of the Covenant; attempts to establish the authenticity of a cup some believe to be the Holy Grail; tries to de-code the mysterious Phaistos disc; investigates a cloth which is believed to carry traces of the DNA of Jesus Christ; and deciphers an encrypted book of alchemy written by the great Sir Isaac Newton.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDDPooOGUWR8Z77I0ebtwqtdYXc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69916'),
  ('1073677247411104763', 'And Just Like That…', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Darren Star', null, 'Sarah Jessica Parker, Cynthia Nixon, Kristin Davis, Mario Cantone, Sarita Choudhury, Evan Handler, Nicole Ari Parker', 'TV-MA', 'This new chapter of “Sex and the City” follows Carrie, Miranda and Charlotte as they navigate the journey from the complicated reality of life and friendship in their 30s to the even more complicated reality of life and friendship in their 50s.', 'This new chapter of “Sex and the City” follows Carrie, Miranda and Charlotte as they navigate the journey from the complicated reality of life and friendship in their 30s to the even more complicated reality of life and friendship in their 50s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2b6E0pN19IGsmxSv6HyTKydKKdb.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:116450'),
  ('718181393986837142', 'And Then There Were None', 2015, 'Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Charles Dance, Maeve Dermody, Aidan Turner, Burn Gorman, Toby Stephens, Miranda Richardson, Noah Taylor, Sam Neill', 'TV-14', 'Ten strangers, drawn away from their normal lives to an isolated rock off the Devon coast. But as the mismatched group waits for the arrival of the hosts -- the improbably named Mr. and Mrs. U.N. Owen -- the weather sours and they find themselves cut off from civilization. Very soon, the guests, each struggling with their conscience, will start to die -- one by one, according to the rules of the nursery rhyme ''Ten Little Soldier Boys'' -- a rhyme that hangs in every room of the house and ends with the most terrifying words of all: ''... and then there were none.', 'Ten strangers, drawn away from their normal lives to an isolated rock off the Devon coast. But as the mismatched group waits for the arrival of the hosts -- the improbably named Mr. and Mrs. U.N. Owen -- the weather sours and they find themselves cut off from civilization. Very soon, the guests, each struggling with their conscience, will start to die -- one by one, according to the rules of the nursery rhyme ''Ten Little Soldier Boys'' -- a rhyme that hangs in every room of the house and ends with the most terrifying words of all: ''... and then there were none.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xbcGTnlxszacXztaOdY2hu5TI7K.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64684'),
  ('239770624348899820', 'And Yet the Town Moves', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Chiaki Omigawa, Rieka Yazawa, Aoi Yuuki, Takahiro Sakurai, Miyu Matsuki, Miyu Irino, Satsuki Yukino, Tomokazu Sugita', 'TV-MA', 'Clumsy Hotori Arashiyama is a girl with a love for mysteries and a knack for getting into trouble. Hotori works as a waitress in an unsuccessful coffee shop when the manager comes up with a plan to increase its fortunes by changing into a maid cafe. Unfortunately, no one knows how to make a successful maid cafe other than dressing everyone in a maid outfit. What follows is a wacky series of incidents involving Hotori’s many friends, mismatched love stories… and ghosts and aliens.', 'Clumsy Hotori Arashiyama is a girl with a love for mysteries and a knack for getting into trouble. Hotori works as a waitress in an unsuccessful coffee shop when the manager comes up with a plan to increase its fortunes by changing into a maid cafe. Unfortunately, no one knows how to make a successful maid cafe other than dressing everyone in a maid outfit. What follows is a wacky series of incidents involving Hotori’s many friends, mismatched love stories… and ghosts and aliens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zsmtixjPe4putvCrn1xKKXdOUXF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37102'),
  ('423483907574387230', 'And You Thought There Is Never a Girl Online?', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Toshiyuki Toyonaga, Rina Hidaka, Inori Minase, Mao Ichimichi, Hitomi Ohwada, Yoshino Nanjo, Seiichiro Yamashita, Koji Yusa', 'TV-14', 'After Hideki Nishimura confesses to a girl online, he is shocked when she turns out to be a boy. Traumatized, he swears to never trust any “girl” players. That is, until one confesses to him! Ako Tamaki is a beautiful loner who has trouble differentiating between what’s reality and the online world she spends so much of her time in. Can Hideki and his guild friends help fix socially inept Ako?', 'After Hideki Nishimura confesses to a girl online, he is shocked when she turns out to be a boy. Traumatized, he swears to never trust any “girl” players. That is, until one confesses to him! Ako Tamaki is a beautiful loner who has trouble differentiating between what’s reality and the online world she spends so much of her time in. Can Hideki and his guild friends help fix socially inept Ako?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wOfBbIglS8dqbH9gTgCJYIb2CA4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65948'),
  ('595356868639624688', 'Andante', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'You Jay, Kim Jin-kyung, Kai, Ahn Seung-gyun, Jeon Mi-seon, Seong Byeong-suk, Park Ji-yeon, Kim Kwang-shik', null, 'High school student Lee Shi Kyung suddenly moves out to the countryside and transfers to a mysterious high school. Getting through unfamiliar experiences, he realizes the meaning of life and love.', 'High school student Lee Shi Kyung suddenly moves out to the countryside and transfers to a mysterious high school. Getting through unfamiliar experiences, he realizes the meaning of life and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mK66xCbXpr00W7l5ifBfRdRN4fw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74021'),
