  ('787798133125535372', 'Andy''s East Coast Kitchen Crawl', 2026, null, null, null, null, null, 'Chef and content creator Andy Hay has built a large following of fans who admire his inspiring yet easily approachable recipes almost as much as they like his humble yet engaging personality. ANDY’S EAST COAST KITCHEN CRAWL sees Andy travel the eastern coast of Canada to find the food, people and ingredients to inspire his next meal.', 'Chef and content creator Andy Hay has built a large following of fans who admire his inspiring yet easily approachable recipes almost as much as they like his humble yet engaging personality. ANDY’S EAST COAST KITCHEN CRAWL sees Andy travel the eastern coast of Canada to find the food, people and ingredients to inspire his next meal.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:319190'),
  ('1005198110900581331', 'Ange Vierge', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Aki Toyosaki, Minako Kotobuki, Rika Tachibana, Sarah Emi Bridcutt, Yumi Hara, Ayane Sakura, Kana Hanazawa, Mai Aizawa', null, 'The story of the card game follows what happens when "Hairou" portals suddenly open, fusing five different worlds together. As a result, various mysterious "Exceed" powers are awakened in teenaged girls. An academy for these so-called "Progress" girls is built on the isolated Seiran Island in the Pacific.', 'The story of the card game follows what happens when "Hairou" portals suddenly open, fusing five different worlds together. As a result, various mysterious "Exceed" powers are awakened in teenaged girls. An academy for these so-called "Progress" girls is built on the isolated Seiran Island in the Pacific.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZrS6g3H6fKr6gG9d7JZRbpxGtg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67054'),
  ('535957125730997817', 'Angel', 1999, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Joss Whedon, David Greenwalt', null, 'David Boreanaz, Amy Acker, Alexis Denisof, J. August Richards, James Marsters, Andy Hallett', 'TV-14', 'The vampire Angel, cursed with a soul, moves to Los Angeles and aids people with supernatural-related problems while questing for his own redemption. A spin-off from Buffy the Vampire Slayer.', 'The vampire Angel, cursed with a soul, moves to Los Angeles and aids people with supernatural-related problems while questing for his own redemption. A spin-off from Buffy the Vampire Slayer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7dRU3wdMJba3PedicxEYSks0oJx.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:2426'),
  ('809325517120118000', 'Angel Beats!', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Hiroshi Kamiya, Harumi Sakurai, Kana Hanazawa, Ryohei Kimura, Yuuki Masuda, Yumiko Kobayashi, Shun Takagi, Megumi Ogata', 'TV-14', 'Angel Beats takes place in the afterlife and focuses on Otonashi, a boy who lost his memories of his life after dying. He is enrolled into the afterlife school and meets a girl named Yuri who invites him to join the Afterlife Battlefront — an organization she leads which fights against God. The Battlefront fight against the student council president Angel, a girl with supernatural powers.', 'Angel Beats takes place in the afterlife and focuses on Otonashi, a boy who lost his memories of his life after dying. He is enrolled into the afterlife school and meets a girl named Yuri who invites him to join the Afterlife Battlefront — an organization she leads which fights against God. The Battlefront fight against the student council president Angel, a girl with supernatural powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wz1PuXrg5ERQvyXKex3cGDie2hj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42942'),
  ('988889591720714296', 'Angel City', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'A gripping docuseries that goes behind the scenes and onto the pitch of the groundbreaking Los Angeles-based professional women’s soccer team, Angel City Football Club.', 'A gripping docuseries that goes behind the scenes and onto the pitch of the groundbreaking Los Angeles-based professional women’s soccer team, Angel City Football Club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1xxOop0mWgDSlMcHdjW4GWY6dGQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223237'),
  ('388526186484687263', 'Angel Cop', 1989, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Crime', 'Ichiro Itano', null, 'Mika Doi, Kenji Utsumi, Masashi Ebara, Nozomu Sasaki, Osamu Saka', 'TV-MA', 'In the future, Japan is in the grip of terrorism, and the police have become as brutal as the criminals. The Special Security Force stands out, led by the fearless Angel, an elite agent who, alongside her partner Raiden, investigates a series of brutal murders.', 'In the future, Japan is in the grip of terrorism, and the police have become as brutal as the criminals. The Special Security Force stands out, led by the fearless Angel, an elite agent who, alongside her partner Raiden, investigates a series of brutal murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tsl1tJdy8qH0WgawBZfIh7oCmL5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65965'),
  ('424414505810034787', 'Ángel Di María: Breaking Down the Wall', 2024, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Ángel Di María, Jorgelina Cardoso, Lionel Messi, Emiliano Martínez, Neymar, Lionel Scaloni, Ander Herrera', 'TV-14', 'From his humble origins to becoming champion of the world, this documentary series recounts the life and career of the iconic Argentinian soccer player.', 'From his humble origins to becoming champion of the world, this documentary series recounts the life and career of the iconic Argentinian soccer player.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fH6EydLuyaXTdwGVp5RnjM7kwgz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:258154'),
  ('1090076524822632371', 'Angel Eyes', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', null, 'Yoon Ji-ryun', 'Lee Sang-yun, Koo Hye-sun, Kang Ha-neul, Nam Ji-hyun, Kim Ji-seok, Yoon Ye-joo, Jung Jin-young, Gong Hyung-jin', 'TV-14', 'Yoon Soo-wan and Park Dong-joo were each other''s first loves, but were forced to separate due to painful family circumstances. Soo-wan, who had been blind, eventually undergoes an eye transplant surgery that restores her sight.', 'Yoon Soo-wan and Park Dong-joo were each other''s first loves, but were forced to separate due to painful family circumstances. Soo-wan, who had been blind, eventually undergoes an eye transplant surgery that restores her sight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l4O5DMWL806Ty6RxxRDzYysvb2G.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63787'),
  ('645264528025231842', 'Angel from Hell', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Tad Quill', null, 'Jane Lynch, Maggie Lawson, Kyle Bornheimer, Kevin Pollak', 'TV-14', 'When over-the-top Amy enters Allison’s organized but imperfect life and claims to be her guardian angel, they form an unlikely friendship and Allison can’t be sure if Amy is actually an angel or just nuts.', 'When over-the-top Amy enters Allison’s organized but imperfect life and claims to be her guardian angel, they form an unlikely friendship and Allison can’t be sure if Amy is actually an angel or just nuts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wDisTsrsZwGAnFZcQtXUsaRNFYU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63259'),
  ('820628524808404165', 'Angel Heart', 2005, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Mao Kawasaki, Yoko Asagami, Kazue Ikura, Akira Kamiya, Chihiro Suzuki', null, 'The last time she closed her eyes, Glass Heart prayed that she''d be set free from the torment she''d wrought as an assassin. A year later, she awakes from a coma to discover a deep scar on her chest and memories that aren''t hers. These vivid flash-backs lead the young assassin to Shinjuku and the doorstep of Ryo Saeba, the legendary City Hunter. However, it quickly becomes apparent that Ryo isn''t the sweeper he once was.', 'The last time she closed her eyes, Glass Heart prayed that she''d be set free from the torment she''d wrought as an assassin. A year later, she awakes from a coma to discover a deep scar on her chest and memories that aren''t hers. These vivid flash-backs lead the young assassin to Shinjuku and the doorstep of Ryo Saeba, the legendary City Hunter. However, it quickly becomes apparent that Ryo isn''t the sweeper he once was.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5o0fpeaB5wnq8HDNMendjlJ3pzX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42999'),
  ('884335877723305275', 'Angel Links', 1999, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ryoka Yuzuki, Atsuko Tanaka, Hikaru Midorikawa, Kenji Utsumi, Kazuo Hayashi, Akiko Kimura, Katsuyuki Konishi, Kazuya Nakai', null, 'Li Meifon is the head of a free, no expenses paid protection/security agency for escorting ships across outer space. Though only 16, she posesses great skill and leadership qualities while commanding her crew aboard their ship, the "Angel Links." However, some unpleasant memories begin to trouble her and she starts questioning her own past and reason for existence. Join Li Meifon and the rest of the Angel Links crew on their adventures through the Oracion star system as they battle pirates, government organizations, and a Tao master, all while finally uncovering Meifon''s dark and mysterious past.', 'Li Meifon is the head of a free, no expenses paid protection/security agency for escorting ships across outer space. Though only 16, she posesses great skill and leadership qualities while commanding her crew aboard their ship, the "Angel Links." However, some unpleasant memories begin to trouble her and she starts questioning her own past and reason for existence. Join Li Meifon and the rest of the Angel Links crew on their adventures through the Oracion star system as they battle pirates, government organizations, and a Tao master, all while finally uncovering Meifon''s dark and mysterious past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r7SWiW9GamCnMM4bmTArCxB1azc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34813'),
  ('36566208831778103', 'Angel of Death', 2020, 'Crime, Drama', null, 'Michał Godzic', 'Aleksandra Popławska, Maciej Stuhr, Bartosz Gelner, Piotr Trojan, Karolina Kominek', null, 'A small-town policewoman is chasing a vicious serial killer; at stake is first a country girl''s life, and then her own life.', 'A small-town policewoman is chasing a vicious serial killer; at stake is first a country girl''s life, and then her own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lPTBeUmMBC9hhRwdOVxpeRQIVLq.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:99144'),
