  ('824352407455993268', 'Angel Sanctuary', 2000, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kaori Yuki', null, 'Fujiko Takimoto, Ayako Kawasumi, Kenji Nojima, Ai Orikasa, Mayumi Asano, Shin-ichiro Miki, Yuji Ueda, Yuko Miyamura', 'TV-MA', 'Setsuna, a High School student, not only has to deal with bullies and more then appropiate feelings for his own sister, but also must come to terms with the fact that he is the reincarnation of the Organic Angel Alexiel who rebelled against God. Being thrust into a world he never knew existed he must believe that angels and demons exist for the sake of Heaven, Earth and even Hell.', 'Setsuna, a High School student, not only has to deal with bullies and more then appropiate feelings for his own sister, but also must come to terms with the fact that he is the reincarnation of the Organic Angel Alexiel who rebelled against God. Being thrust into a world he never knew existed he must believe that angels and demons exist for the sake of Heaven, Earth and even Hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zkWgHLlS2cJbJHTIrjVz6P1fXZZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:26173'),
  ('41358219968056962', 'Angel''s 3Piece!', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Aoi Koga, Yurika Endo, Yuko Ono, Yuki Inoue, Kana Hanazawa, Kanae Itou, Rina Hidaka, Toru Okawa', 'TV-14', 'A shut-in ever since he had a traumatic experience, Nukui Hibiki''s biggest hobby has been using vocalization software to create and uploading songs online. One day, he receives an email from some fifth-grader girls, asking to meet and discuss something with him. The three girls, who have grown up together almost like siblings, ask him to help them show their gratitude to the people who have taken care of them. The method they''ve devised? Putting on a successful concert at a place full of memories.', 'A shut-in ever since he had a traumatic experience, Nukui Hibiki''s biggest hobby has been using vocalization software to create and uploading songs online. One day, he receives an email from some fifth-grader girls, asking to meet and discuss something with him. The three girls, who have grown up together almost like siblings, ask him to help them show their gratitude to the people who have taken care of them. The method they''ve devised? Putting on a successful concert at a place full of memories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVmLA24NypvwPkh9BGASQlOLuLu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72523'),
  ('921363187145779822', 'Angel''s Friends', 2009, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Simona Ferri', null, null, 'NR', 'Four Angels and four Devils are sent to Earth, in an unused area of the Golden School, where they learn everything they need to become Guardian Angels and Guardian Devils.', 'Four Angels and four Devils are sent to Earth, in an unused area of the Golden School, where they learn everything they need to become Guardian Angels and Guardian Devils.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fE8HddP4EXa5iaKXogZ5EbcDFk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:34901'),
  ('504232786053675131', 'Angel''s Last Mission: Love', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Choi Yoon-Kyo', 'Choi Yoon-Kyo', 'Shin Hye-sun, L, Lee Dong-gun, Kim Bo-mi, Do Ji-won, Kim In-kwon, Woo Hee-jin, Lee Hwa-ryong', null, 'As a punishment for meddling in human affairs, an angel faces the impossible task of finding a soulmate for a cold-hearted ballerina.', 'As a punishment for meddling in human affairs, an angel faces the impossible task of finding a soulmate for a cold-hearted ballerina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ltoY1cMTdh5ovUe6JhEsuU5Twd3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88974'),
  ('330007762834082158', 'Ángela', 1998, 'Soap, Drama', 'Cuauhtémoc Blanco, María del Carmen Peña', 'María del Carmen Peña, Cuauhtémoc Blanco', 'Angélica Rivera, Juan Soler, Jacqueline Andere, Patricia Navidad, Ignacio López Tarso, Aurora Molina, Ana Bertha Lepe, Olivia Bucio', null, 'Angela is a Mexican telenovela, which was produced by Televisa and broadcast on Canal de las Estrellas in 1998. The series was first debuted on May 17, 1999 on Univision in the United States, replacing that year''s hit La Mentira, and ended on September 9, 1999, being replaced by Tres Mujeres. It aired a second and a third time on Galavisión on March 15, 2000 and May 8, 2001, and ended a second and a third time on July 1, 2000 and August 24, 2001. It aired a fourth time back to Univision''s late night "Grandes Historias" lineup, aired on October 28, 2003, and ended on February 27, 2004. It aired a fifth time on TeleFutura on September 18, 2006, and ended on January 8, 2007. This telenovela contained 78 episodes.', 'Angela is a Mexican telenovela, which was produced by Televisa and broadcast on Canal de las Estrellas in 1998. The series was first debuted on May 17, 1999 on Univision in the United States, replacing that year''s hit La Mentira, and ended on September 9, 1999, being replaced by Tres Mujeres. It aired a second and a third time on Galavisión on March 15, 2000 and May 8, 2001, and ended a second and a third time on July 1, 2000 and August 24, 2001. It aired a fourth time back to Univision''s late night "Grandes Historias" lineup, aired on October 28, 2003, and ended on February 27, 2004. It aired a fifth time on TeleFutura on September 18, 2006, and ended on January 8, 2007. This telenovela contained 78 episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ha9sEyjogHIz8ZdQO8gSIvsx6q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16372'),
  ('308208932768915517', 'Ángela', 2024, 'Drama', 'Norberto López Amado', null, 'Verónica Sánchez, Daniel Grao, Jaime Zatarain, Lucía Jiménez, Ane Gabarain, María Isabel Díaz Lago, Maia Zaitegi, Sua Díez', null, 'Angela''s comfortable London existence implodes when she recognizes domestic mistreatment. A detective unveils her spouse''s ominous mysteries, disorienting Angela. Craving freedom, she abandons routine for a dangerous truth-chase.', 'Angela''s comfortable London existence implodes when she recognizes domestic mistreatment. A detective unveils her spouse''s ominous mysteries, disorienting Angela. Craving freedom, she abandons routine for a dangerous truth-chase.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osF1AE0hpUPM2xvOq5LK4MuT2v3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:231452'),
  ('509539700584457240', 'Angela Anaconda', 1999, 'Kids, Animation, Comedy', 'Sue Rose, Joanna Ferrone', null, 'Sue Rose, Al Mukadam, Bryn McAuley, Ruby Smith-Merovitz, Kevin Duhaney, Rob Tinkler, Edward Glen, Annick Obonsawin', 'TV-G', 'A unique style of cutout animation tells the story of eight-year-old Angela, her weird and wonderful friends, and her sworn enemy--snobby Nanette Manoir.', 'A unique style of cutout animation tells the story of eight-year-old Angela, her weird and wonderful friends, and her sworn enemy--snobby Nanette Manoir.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFp7Qupi4MGVsVvSozo4J9Ton9d.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:5373'),
  ('816232225049040462', 'Angela Black', 2021, 'Drama', 'Harry Williams, Jack Williams', null, 'Joanne Froggatt, Michiel Huisman, Samuel Adewunmi', null, 'Angela Black leads a seemingly idyllic life with two beautiful sons and a charming, hard-working husband while covering the fact that she is a victim of domestic violence. Until one day when Angela is approached by Ed – a Private Investigator - and he smashes her already strained domestic life to pieces.', 'Angela Black leads a seemingly idyllic life with two beautiful sons and a charming, hard-working husband while covering the fact that she is a victim of domestic violence. Until one day when Angela is approached by Ed – a Private Investigator - and he smashes her already strained domestic life to pieces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJy3tQLVZWo7sfDj90HKKLfgy16.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:136069'),
  ('1131239063660335472', 'Ângela Diniz: Murdered and Convicted', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Andrucha Waddington', 'Elena Soarez', 'Marjorie Estiano, Emílio Dantas, Antônio Fagundes, Thiago Lacerda, Camila Márdila, Yara de Novaes, Thelmo Fernandes, Renata Gaspar', null, 'Based on true events, it follows socialite Ângela Diniz as her murder becomes a national flashpoint, turning the ensuing trial into a defining moment in the country’s history', 'Based on true events, it follows socialite Ângela Diniz as her murder becomes a national flashpoint, turning the ensuing trial into a defining moment in the country’s history', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/44bVjbOYytNx6poKqPeIqM2hpAi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:260637'),
