  ('1023859409105746668', 'Angelique: Twin Collection', 2002, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Animation', null, null, 'Atsushi Kisaichi, Fumihiko Tachiki, Hideyuki Tanaka, Hiro Yuuki, Ken Narita, Kenyu Horiuchi, Mitsuaki Madono, Mitsuo Iwata', null, 'As the title implies, this series features a pair of characters per episode. Each DVD has one music video for each character, plus one part of an eight part story. Annoyingly, the music videos are for the short versions of the songs, not the full versions... to get those, you had to buy the Twin Collection CDs.', 'As the title implies, this series features a pair of characters per episode. Each DVD has one music video for each character, plus one part of an eight part story. Annoyingly, the music videos are for the short versions of the songs, not the full versions... to get those, you had to buy the Twin Collection CDs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vCTk3LfY2Ux7IngTTUSxejLcSJW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132564'),
  ('343407705980165100', 'Angelo Rules', 2010, 'Family, Kids, Animation', 'Sébastien Diologent, Sylvie de Mathuisieulx', null, 'Tammo Kaulbarsch, Tim Kreuer, Merete Brettschneider, Kerstin Draeger, Martin Lohmann, Katharina von Keller, Gail Thomas, Jackson Rheingold', 'TV-Y7', 'Angelo is the kid who tries to be the wise guy. He is constantly coming up with plans and strategies to get out of trouble. ... Angelo isn''t put off by the natural setbacks most kid have to confront: like parents, siblings and rules but that doesn''t deter him.', 'Angelo is the kid who tries to be the wise guy. He is constantly coming up with plans and strategies to get out of trouble. ... Angelo isn''t put off by the natural setbacks most kid have to confront: like parents, siblings and rules but that doesn''t deter him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vvH2VBpGvXJh9MROeTHrlaVIS4p.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:38965'),
  ('1019885052414803430', 'Angels', 1975, 'Drama', null, null, 'Shirley Cheriton, Judith Jacob, Kathryn Apanowicz, Fiona Fullerton, Julie Dawn Cole, Emma Ware', null, 'Angels is a BBC medical soap-opera which launched on 1st September 1975 and was the blue print for such medical soaps as Casualty, Holby City, plus daytime soap, Doctors. The medical soap focuses on different departments within Heath Green Hospital and was a highly successful continuing drama.', 'Angels is a BBC medical soap-opera which launched on 1st September 1975 and was the blue print for such medical soaps as Casualty, Holby City, plus daytime soap, Doctors. The medical soap focuses on different departments within Heath Green Hospital and was a highly successful continuing drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZl7FUtZwTDZ2R0P7I2caQ6PoHo.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:12719'),
  ('883415934990941933', 'Angels in America', 2003, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Tony Kushner', null, 'Al Pacino, Justin Kirk, Ben Shenkman, Mary-Louise Parker, Meryl Streep, Jeffrey Wright, Patrick Wilson', 'TV-MA', 'God has abandoned Heaven. It''s 1985: the Reagans are in the White House and Death swings the scythe of AIDS. In Manhattan, Prior Walter tells Louis, his lover of four years, he''s ill; Louis leaves but asvdisease and loneliness ravage Prior, guilt invades Louis. Joe Pitt, a Mormon Republican attorney, is pushed by right-wing fixer Roy Cohn toward a job at the Justice Department. Pitt and Cohn are closeted: Pitt, out of shame and religious turmoil; Cohn, to preserve his power and access. Pitt''s wife Harper is strung out on Valium, aching to escape a sexless marriage. An angel invites Prior to be a prophet in death.', 'God has abandoned Heaven. It''s 1985: the Reagans are in the White House and Death swings the scythe of AIDS. In Manhattan, Prior Walter tells Louis, his lover of four years, he''s ill; Louis leaves but asvdisease and loneliness ravage Prior, guilt invades Louis. Joe Pitt, a Mormon Republican attorney, is pushed by right-wing fixer Roy Cohn toward a job at the Justice Department. Pitt and Cohn are closeted: Pitt, out of shame and religious turmoil; Cohn, to preserve his power and access. Pitt''s wife Harper is strung out on Valium, aching to escape a sexless marriage. An angel invites Prior to be a prophet in death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrV0kCmzcP8oB00gemSZDns90rb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11245'),
  ('571217880932629235', 'Angels of Death', 2018, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', null, null, 'Haruka Chisuga, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Takahiro Sakurai, Hochu Otsuka, Mariya Ise, Natsumi Fujiwara', 'TV-MA', 'Most girls waking up without any memory and meeting a serial killer would panic, but not Rachel. In fact, far from being her biggest problem, killer Zack might just prove a convenient resource when it comes to finding a way out of the building in which they''re both trapped!', 'Most girls waking up without any memory and meeting a serial killer would panic, but not Rachel. In fact, far from being her biggest problem, killer Zack might just prove a convenient resource when it comes to finding a way out of the building in which they''re both trapped!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/74OJEbRx1swuh5EuT7VNWxyWTZd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80477'),
  ('344426653882424796', 'Angels of Death', 2021, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Richard Boylan, Boman Modine', 'Story Forge Team', 'Jonathan Keeble, Emma Gregory, Andrew Wincott, Toby Longworth', 'TV-14', 'The story follows a band of Blood Angels Space Marines as they face a dangerous and insidious foe.', 'The story follows a band of Blood Angels Space Marines as they face a dangerous and insidious foe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7QxkJNK2CWDELPpC0zZssQ9iOI0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132123'),
  ('906736914358516316', 'Angelyne', 2022, 'Drama', 'Nancy Oliver, Allison Miller', null, 'Emmy Rossum, Alex Karpovsky', 'TV-MA', 'A mysterious blonde bombshell takes over Los Angeles billboards in the mid-80s, ushering in the era of famous-for-being-famous influencer culture.', 'A mysterious blonde bombshell takes over Los Angeles billboards in the mid-80s, ushering in the era of famous-for-being-famous influencer culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dCSmm9aRal83ql1QbCujIKyoqGl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93751'),
  ('747599600374985405', 'Anger Management', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Bruce Helford', null, 'Charlie Sheen, Shawnee Smith, Noureen DeWulf, Michael Arden, Derek Richardson, Barry Corbin', 'TV-14', 'Charlie is a non-traditional therapist specializing in anger management. He has a successful private practice and he performs pro bono counseling for an inmate group at a state prison. Prior to his career as a therapist, he was a major league baseball player whose career was put on the shelf for good by his own struggle with anger issues.', 'Charlie is a non-traditional therapist specializing in anger management. He has a successful private practice and he performs pro bono counseling for an inmate group at a state prison. Prior to his career as a therapist, he was a major league baseball player whose career was put on the shelf for good by his own struggle with anger issues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekItnn6W73RN9muvLTbeRW8LHlo.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:42878'),
  ('978239162559935479', 'Angie Tribeca', 2016, 'Comedy, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Steve Carell, Nancy Carell', null, 'Rashida Jones, Bobby Cannavale, Andree Vermeulen, Jere Burns, Kiersey Clemons', 'TV-14', 'Lone-wolf detective Angie Tribeca and a squad of committed LAPD detectives investigate the most serious cases, from the murder of a ventriloquist to a rash of baker suicides.', 'Lone-wolf detective Angie Tribeca and a squad of committed LAPD detectives investigate the most serious cases, from the murder of a ventriloquist to a rash of baker suicides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xi6gGST5L7FiUiYDPifHGtzl3zG.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:61969'),
  ('1071970755863476279', 'Angolmois: Record of Mongol Invasion', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, War & Politics', null, null, 'Asumi Yoneyama, Yuki Ono, Lynn, Rikiya Koyama, Shirou Saitou, Shun Horie, Ryota Takeuchi, Yusuke Kobayashi', 'TV-MA', 'The story follows a group of samurai attempting to defend Japan from the first Mongol invasion in 1274.', 'The story follows a group of samurai attempting to defend Japan from the first Mongol invasion in 1274.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osDHL65kfdtwYLpB8mhyNenbcWL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80767'),
  ('575978284440895897', 'Angry Birds Toons', 2013, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Mikael Hed, Mikko Pöllä, Lauri Konttori', null, 'Antti Pääkkönen, Antti LJ Pääkkönen, Helja Heikkinen, Lynne Guaglione, Pasi Ruohonen, Antti LJ Pääkkönen, Helja Heikkinen, Rauno Ahonen', 'TV-PG', 'Angry Birds Toons tells how life is not always easy on Piggy Island. Red and his angry feathered companions, Chuck, Matilda, Bomb, the Blues and Terence must come together to protect their eggs - and future - of the cunning plots of Bad Piggies. Having only guides for their intelligence and determination, they absolutely must thwart the pigs'' advanced technology. Nevertheless, they have a huge advantage... the incredible stupidity of the Bad Piggies! Angry Birds Toons gives life to the characters and adventures of one of the most popular games in history and presents the amusing world, and cunning of the Angry Birds and their sworn enemies, the Bad Piggies.', 'Angry Birds Toons tells how life is not always easy on Piggy Island. Red and his angry feathered companions, Chuck, Matilda, Bomb, the Blues and Terence must come together to protect their eggs - and future - of the cunning plots of Bad Piggies. Having only guides for their intelligence and determination, they absolutely must thwart the pigs'' advanced technology. Nevertheless, they have a huge advantage... the incredible stupidity of the Bad Piggies! Angry Birds Toons gives life to the characters and adventures of one of the most popular games in history and presents the amusing world, and cunning of the Angry Birds and their sworn enemies, the Bad Piggies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lN3RNXtCdFMMb6kbpdrmdsuRr2.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:46848'),
  ('454784746477698398', 'Angry Birds: Summer Madness', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Kids', 'Rob Doherty, Scott Sonneborn', null, 'Ian Hanlin, Deven Mack, Ty Olsson, Gigi Saul Guerrero, Ana Sani, Adam Kirschner, Peter Kelamis, Tabitha St. Germain', 'TV-PG', 'Teen birds Red, Chuck, Bomb and Stella are crashing through Camp Splinterwood with their fellow feathered campers for a summer of high-flying hijinks!', 'Teen birds Red, Chuck, Bomb and Stella are crashing through Camp Splinterwood with their fellow feathered campers for a summer of high-flying hijinks!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ko4jfA5BrcRADDaAfMagZ4ZGpG.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:154647'),
  ('351341327346803360', 'Angry Boys', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Chris Lilley', null, 'Chris Lilley, Greg Fairall, Liam Keltie, Deborah Jones', 'TV-14', 'Angry Boys is an Australian television mockumentary series written by and starring Chris Lilley. Continuing the mockumentary style of his previous series, the show explores the issues faced by young males in the 21st century – their influences, their pressures, their dreams and ambitions. In Angry Boys, Lilley plays multiple characters: S.mouse, an American rapper; Jen, a manipulative Japanese mother; Blake Oakfield, a champion surfer; Ruth "Gran" Sims, a guard at a juvenile detention facility; and her grandchildren, South Australian twins Daniel and Nathan Sims. The series is a co-production between the Australian Broadcasting Corporation and US cable channel HBO, with a pre-sale to BBC Three in the United Kingdom. Filmed in Melbourne, Los Angeles and Tokyo, Angry Boys premièred on 11 May 2011 at 9:00 pm on ABC1.', 'Angry Boys is an Australian television mockumentary series written by and starring Chris Lilley. Continuing the mockumentary style of his previous series, the show explores the issues faced by young males in the 21st century – their influences, their pressures, their dreams and ambitions. In Angry Boys, Lilley plays multiple characters: S.mouse, an American rapper; Jen, a manipulative Japanese mother; Blake Oakfield, a champion surfer; Ruth "Gran" Sims, a guard at a juvenile detention facility; and her grandchildren, South Australian twins Daniel and Nathan Sims. The series is a co-production between the Australian Broadcasting Corporation and US cable channel HBO, with a pre-sale to BBC Three in the United Kingdom. Filmed in Melbourne, Los Angeles and Tokyo, Angry Boys premièred on 11 May 2011 at 9:00 pm on ABC1.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kviE2G5B4X5SfuQOITDkKhyYepH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32722'),
  ('117070974474517424', 'Angry Mom', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', null, null, 'Kim Hee-seon, Ji Hyun-woo, Kim Yoo-jung, Lim Hyung-jun, Koh Soo-hee, Kim Seul-gi, Jeon Kuk-hwan, Kang Moon-Young', null, 'When Jo Gang-Ja attended high school, she was notorious for fighting. She gave birth to her daughter A-Ran in her late teens and became more responsible. Her daughter A-Ran is now a high school student, but A-Ran is bullied at school. Jo Gang-Ja decides to go back to high school to protect her daughter. Jo Gang-Ja becomes a high school student again.', 'When Jo Gang-Ja attended high school, she was notorious for fighting. She gave birth to her daughter A-Ran in her late teens and became more responsible. Her daughter A-Ran is now a high school student, but A-Ran is bullied at school. Jo Gang-Ja decides to go back to high school to protect her daughter. Jo Gang-Ja becomes a high school student again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCqKUifoZnNAwLCubqCVheASwSL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62244'),
  ('308324037671996238', 'Ani*Kuri15', 2007, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, null, null, 'Ani-Kuri 15 is a series of fifteen 1-minute shorts that aired on the Japanese TV station, NHK between May 2007 and 2008. Intended as companion pieces to the AniKuri program and as filler between regularly scheduled programs, the shorts were broadcast in three seasons of 5 episodes. Each short was directed by a different director and the episodes were collected and uploaded to the official AniKuri15 website in 2008.', 'Ani-Kuri 15 is a series of fifteen 1-minute shorts that aired on the Japanese TV station, NHK between May 2007 and 2008. Intended as companion pieces to the AniKuri program and as filler between regularly scheduled programs, the shorts were broadcast in three seasons of 5 episodes. Each short was directed by a different director and the episodes were collected and uploaded to the official AniKuri15 website in 2008.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6r6n7Z4dmIVrzbBr0uRISz2bzM.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:44587'),
  ('679856635508001732', 'Aniela', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Małgorzata Kożuchowska, Jacek Poniedziałek, Lila Vasina, Cezary Pazura, Gabriela Muskała, Pitry Pitry, Anita Szepelska, Maja Kowalska', 'TV-MA', 'After her wealthy husband leaves her with nothing, a high-society Warsaw snob is forced to use the only survival skills she has left — her sharp wit.', 'After her wealthy husband leaves her with nothing, a high-society Warsaw snob is forced to use the only survival skills she has left — her sharp wit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dcQsD6mUUchYQ0OCFUE6pnTp5xR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:288915'),
  ('411678807413202425', 'Animal', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'This immersive series follows the world''s most magnificent creatures, capturing never-before-seen moments from the heartwarming to the outrageous.', 'This immersive series follows the world''s most magnificent creatures, capturing never-before-seen moments from the heartwarming to the outrageous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTUzqX7Ude2JskIBQVgldRLEaaS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:137646'),
  ('938169042416027806', 'Animal Control', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Bob Fisher, Rob Greenberg, Dan Sterling', null, 'Joel McHale, Vella Lovell, Michael Rowland, Ravi Patel, Grace Palmer', 'TV-14', 'A group of local animal control workers'' lives are complicated by the fact that animals are simple, but humans are not. Leading the crew is Frank, an opinionated, eccentric animal control officer who may not have gone to college but is still the most well-read person in the room. In his past life as a cop, Frank tried to expose corruption in his department, but his efforts got him fired, leaving him cynical and curmudgeonly. Despite his rough exterior, he is blessed with an almost superhuman ability to understand animals.', 'A group of local animal control workers'' lives are complicated by the fact that animals are simple, but humans are not. Leading the crew is Frank, an opinionated, eccentric animal control officer who may not have gone to college but is still the most well-read person in the room. In his past life as a cop, Frank tried to expose corruption in his department, but his efforts got him fired, leaving him cynical and curmudgeonly. Despite his rough exterior, he is blessed with an almost superhuman ability to understand animals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h2dXm0CXMkycA9LrZbXMUD8SuTL.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:214162'),
  ('779052540360139913', 'Animal Cops: Houston', 2003, 'Crime, Documentary, Reality, Drama', 'Paul Berriff', null, null, 'TV-PG', 'The dedicated team at the Houston Society for the Prevention of Cruelty to Animals, a private charity, responds to a variety of distress calls involving an average of more than 100 animals per day. This series documents the work they do, from the initial investigation through, in some cases, the animals being adopted into loving homes.', 'The dedicated team at the Houston Society for the Prevention of Cruelty to Animals, a private charity, responds to a variety of distress calls involving an average of more than 100 animals per day. This series documents the work they do, from the initial investigation through, in some cases, the animals being adopted into loving homes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pT5AqjPB7kxTDmaO5xsKpBpmD0U.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:1768'),
  ('644481682734737284', 'Animal Detectives Kiruminzoo', 2009, 'Comedy, Animation, Kids', null, null, 'Chika Anzai, Mutsumi Tamura, Satomi Sato, Aoi Yuuki, Akemi Kanda, Aya Hisakawa, Akeno Watanabe, Bin Shimada', null, 'While searching for a run-away cat the twins Riko and Rimu Mikogami find a strange device that transforms them into "Kirumin." It also enables them to turn into real animals. Their older sister Nagisa soon joins them. Now the three have cute, funny and sometimes dangerous adventures.', 'While searching for a run-away cat the twins Riko and Rimu Mikogami find a strange device that transforms them into "Kirumin." It also enables them to turn into real animals. Their older sister Nagisa soon joins them. Now the three have cute, funny and sometimes dangerous adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/syQb8Cu5TgOu2p4137exDRAgTTQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42569'),
  ('120264045291663741', 'Animal Kingdom', 2016, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jonathan Lisco', null, 'Finn Cole, Shawn Hatosy, Ben Robson, Jake Weary, Leila George', 'TV-MA', '17-year-old Joshua "J" Cody moves in with his freewheeling relatives in their Southern California beach town after his mother dies of a heroin overdose. Headed by boot-tough matriarch Janine "Smurf" Cody and her right-hand Baz, who runs the business and calls the shots, the clan also consists of Pope, the oldest and most dangerous of the Cody boys; Craig, the tough and fearless middle son; and Deran, the troubled, suspicious "baby" of the family.', '17-year-old Joshua "J" Cody moves in with his freewheeling relatives in their Southern California beach town after his mother dies of a heroin overdose. Headed by boot-tough matriarch Janine "Smurf" Cody and her right-hand Baz, who runs the business and calls the shots, the clan also consists of Pope, the oldest and most dangerous of the Cody boys; Craig, the tough and fearless middle son; and Deran, the troubled, suspicious "baby" of the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rzvdKrnSRKPFI0pgqMQknDPpRC9.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:66025'),
  ('119603953518238200', 'ANIMAL LOVE', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Franco Masini, Tatu Glikman, Santiago Achaga, Valentina Zenere, Olivia Nuss, Toto Rovito, Inés Estévez, Antonio Birabent', null, 'In this fictional drama, Kaia, a trap artist from the outskirts of the city, meets Nico, an upper-class young man with existential angst. Despite their different realities and the outside forces pushing them apart, they try to make space for their love to grow, and in doing so, unleash a gang war.', 'In this fictional drama, Kaia, a trap artist from the outskirts of the city, meets Nico, an upper-class young man with existential angst. Despite their different realities and the outside forces pushing them apart, they try to make space for their love to grow, and in doing so, unleash a gang war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5KqSO36KhOCdh2rVlhg3CR85tLz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:299172'),
  ('1056364011851042944', 'Animal Mechanicals', 2008, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Jeff Rosen', null, 'Jim Fowler, Lenore Zann, Leah Ostry, Shannon Lynch, Abigail Gordon, Ian MacDougall', 'TV-Y', 'Animal Mechanicals is a Decode Entertainment television series created by Jeff Rosen and produced by Halifax Film, a DHX Media Company, in association with CBC. Animal Mechanicals Rex, Unicorn, Komodo, Mouse, and Sasquatch, live and play in a place unlike any other; a colorful "snap-together-take-apart" world which can also transform. Things are always popping up, changing shape and most of all presenting challenges to the animal mechanicals. In each adventure the animal mechanicals get their new mission from Island Owl who displays images on her face, which changes to a screen. Each adventure has a variety of small challenges to overcome on the road to accomplishing the mission they are given. The challenges vary requiring the animal mechanicals to use their wide array of unique transformed "Mechana" abilities. The animal mechanicals must decide who should face each challenge.', 'Animal Mechanicals is a Decode Entertainment television series created by Jeff Rosen and produced by Halifax Film, a DHX Media Company, in association with CBC. Animal Mechanicals Rex, Unicorn, Komodo, Mouse, and Sasquatch, live and play in a place unlike any other; a colorful "snap-together-take-apart" world which can also transform. Things are always popping up, changing shape and most of all presenting challenges to the animal mechanicals. In each adventure the animal mechanicals get their new mission from Island Owl who displays images on her face, which changes to a screen. Each adventure has a variety of small challenges to overcome on the road to accomplishing the mission they are given. The challenges vary requiring the animal mechanicals to use their wide array of unique transformed "Mechana" abilities. The animal mechanicals must decide who should face each challenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmLKVSUnhM4AYTY5vevJDHrY97a.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:21086'),
  ('786181112475115371', 'Animal Practice', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Alessandro Tanaka, Brian Gatewood', null, 'Justin Kirk, JoAnna Garcia Swisher, Tyler Labine, Bobby Lee, Kym Whitley, Betsy Sodaro', 'TV-PG', 'Dr. George Coleman is a top veterinarian with an impressive list of famous animal patients at the Crane Animal Hospital—a bustling New York City veterinary practice where it often seems as if the patients are running the place. Much to his chagrin, George recently learned that his ex-girlfriend, Dorothy Crane, has inherited the family business and is now George''s boss.', 'Dr. George Coleman is a top veterinarian with an impressive list of famous animal patients at the Crane Animal Hospital—a bustling New York City veterinary practice where it often seems as if the patients are running the place. Much to his chagrin, George recently learned that his ex-girlfriend, Dorothy Crane, has inherited the family business and is now George''s boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrWcS77Fr6bOlRMRqkpD07NZjMk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44004'),
  ('896906531127979987', 'Animals Up Close with Bertie Gregory', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Bertie Gregory', null, 'Bertie Gregory', 'TV-PG', 'Bertie Gregory travels the world to show animals'' lives like never before.', 'Bertie Gregory travels the world to show animals'' lives like never before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4KnC58e1BbIB5LB8lu3uhPiWO4M.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:231311'),
  ('479495206246367135', 'Animals.', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Phil Matarese, Mike Luciano', null, 'Mike Luciano, Phil Matarese, Katie Aselton', 'TV-MA', 'An animated comedy focusing on the downtrodden creatures native to Earth’s least-habitable environment: New York City. Whether it’s lovelorn rats, gender-questioning pigeons or aging bedbugs in the midst of a midlife crisis, the awkward small talk, moral ambiguity and existential woes of non-human urbanites prove startlingly similar to our own.', 'An animated comedy focusing on the downtrodden creatures native to Earth’s least-habitable environment: New York City. Whether it’s lovelorn rats, gender-questioning pigeons or aging bedbugs in the midst of a midlife crisis, the awkward small talk, moral ambiguity and existential woes of non-human urbanites prove startlingly similar to our own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9w6Njoioimlr1mEyURF5HqeAhV.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:65228'),
  ('1094666101619088889', 'Animaniacs', 1993, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Rob Paulsen, Jess Harnell, Tress MacNeille, Maurice LaMarche, Sherri Stoner, Chick Vennera, John Mariano, Nathan Ruegger', 'TV-Y7', 'The two Warner Brothers Yakko and Wakko and their Warner sister Dot had been (supposedly) created in the 1930''s, but their cartoons were too screwy for the general public to handle. The three Warners were locked up in the studio water tower until they escaped in the 90''s. There, they run wild, causing chaos everywhere!', 'The two Warner Brothers Yakko and Wakko and their Warner sister Dot had been (supposedly) created in the 1930''s, but their cartoons were too screwy for the general public to handle. The three Warners were locked up in the studio water tower until they escaped in the 90''s. There, they run wild, causing chaos everywhere!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bqUIqC7zMKYkdZpK6I7ZfJE3I3g.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:82'),
  ('1015954188070065205', 'Animaniacs', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Rob Paulsen, Jess Harnell, Tress MacNeille, Maurice LaMarche', 'TV-PG', 'Yakko, Wakko and Dot return for all-new big laughs and the occasional epic takedown of authority figures in serious need of an ego check. Joining the Warners are Starbox & Cindy on their latest play date while Pinky and the Brain''s ideas for world domination lead them to all new adventures.', 'Yakko, Wakko and Dot return for all-new big laughs and the occasional epic takedown of authority figures in serious need of an ego check. Joining the Warners are Starbox & Cindy on their latest play date while Pinky and the Brain''s ideas for world domination lead them to all new adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wmPZzLov9OhiknK4jW4qE6mgvHf.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:107124'),
  ('573660918559826121', 'Animated Stories from the Bible', 1992, 'Animation, Family', 'Richard Rich', null, null, null, 'The series is a non-sectarian educational collection of stories from the Hebrew Bible, intended to foster positive values and character traits in young people.', 'The series is a non-sectarian educational collection of stories from the Hebrew Bible, intended to foster positive values and character traits in young people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNxuDYxVFOubEAhDR0A9JDze5pI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:247185'),
  ('226270100911694335', 'Anime Crimes Division', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Darnell Murphy, Freddie Wong', null, 'SungWon Cho, Geoff Ross, Yohan Lee, Danny Vink, Riley Rose Critchlow, Charley Rossman', null, 'When someone commits a crime against anime, they don''t call the police; they call the Anime Crimes Division. Detective Furaya is here to kick ass and eat Pocky, and he''s all out of Pocky.', 'When someone commits a crime against anime, they don''t call the police; they call the Anime Crimes Division. Detective Furaya is here to kick ass and eat Pocky, and he''s all out of Pocky.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPaFjwn1zYqjrmfr3ljkf2Fmr4e.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:75753'),
  ('1031640535339678058', 'Anime de Training! Ex', 2015, 'Animation', null, null, 'Miku Ito, Azumi Waki, Miyu Komaki, Maria Naganawa, Kanon Takao, Eri Suzuki', 'TV-14', 'The Series follows six young aspiring idols as they train and teach the audience using various exercise routines.', 'The Series follows six young aspiring idols as they train and teach the audience using various exercise routines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wdPWxokwuZvHiL4R4lNg3Xg2Sz4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:68134'),
  ('766792061602793879', 'Anime-Gataris', 2017, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Hisako Tojo, Kaede Hondo, Sayaka Senbongi, Hironori Kondoh, Anju Inami, Asuka Nishi, Junta Terashima, Kana Hanazawa', null, 'After dreaming about an anime she used to watch as a child, Minoa Asagaya could not forget a particularly memorable scene. However, despite her best efforts, she cannot recall the name of the show. Due to this, Minoa asks for help from her fellow classmates at Sakaneko High School. Her conversation is overheard by Arisu Kamiigusa, the most popular and wealthy girl in class who is also a hardcore otaku. Yet even with her vast knowledge, Arisu does not recognize the show. After discovering that there isn''t an anime club at their school, Minoa and Arisu create the Anime Research Club, as they may obtain the answer to Minoa''s mystery if they gather people who share the same interest. Thus, Minoa is exposed to a bizarre new world—the world of anime!', 'After dreaming about an anime she used to watch as a child, Minoa Asagaya could not forget a particularly memorable scene. However, despite her best efforts, she cannot recall the name of the show. Due to this, Minoa asks for help from her fellow classmates at Sakaneko High School. Her conversation is overheard by Arisu Kamiigusa, the most popular and wealthy girl in class who is also a hardcore otaku. Yet even with her vast knowledge, Arisu does not recognize the show. After discovering that there isn''t an anime club at their school, Minoa and Arisu create the Anime Research Club, as they may obtain the answer to Minoa''s mystery if they gather people who share the same interest. Thus, Minoa is exposed to a bizarre new world—the world of anime!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xfVB4VaFot6JDHySoiSC1pQoxDC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74080'),
  ('748423562514067854', 'Animorphs', 1998, 'Drama, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Katherine Applegate', null, 'Shawn Ashmore, Brooke Nevin, Paulo Costanzo, Nadia-Leigh Nascimento, Boris Cabrera, Christopher Ralph', 'TV-Y7', 'Five kids are given the power to morph into any creature they wish to help them fight villainous Visser Three and his fellow Yeerks, a breed of parasitic aliens threatening Earth.', 'Five kids are given the power to morph into any creature they wish to help them fight villainous Visser Three and his fellow Yeerks, a breed of parasitic aliens threatening Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRySFvDrJOTW1f1WuE5BlVFXEt7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:6636'),
  ('205140355223506491', 'Anitta: Made in Honório', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Anitta, Miriam Macedo, Renan Macedo, Mauro Machado', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nPVcV461ZTj72w9ZtHvZr6ASgzM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113415'),
  ('498868589440947995', 'Anna', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Niccolò Ammaniti', 'Niccolò Ammaniti, Francesca Manieri', 'Giulia Dragotto, Alessandro Pecorella, Elena Lietti, Roberta Mattei, Giovanni Mavilla, Clara Tramontano, Viviana Mocciaro', null, 'A 13-year-old Sicilian girl must contend with a viral contagion that has killed off all adults on the island as she sets out in search of her kidnapped brother.', 'A 13-year-old Sicilian girl must contend with a viral contagion that has killed off all adults on the island as she sets out in search of her kidnapped brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/957Zi8wV3Em9NDEiRLlkkF27dX6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:123925'),
  ('61651305245647420', 'Anna', 2022, 'Drama', 'Lee Zoo-young', null, 'Suzy, Jung Eun-chae, Kim Jun-han, Park Ye-yeong, Kim Jung-young, Park Soo-yeon, Kang Shin-chul, Baek Ji-won', null, 'The story of a woman who ends up living a completely different life due to a petty lie.', 'The story of a woman who ends up living a completely different life due to a petty lie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Dq9A4l5KaoBz1LerrDcBVgHdJm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:196268'),
  ('296144679911937989', 'Anna Karenina', 2000, 'Drama', null, 'Allan Cubitt', 'Helen McCrory, Kevin McKidd, Abigail Cruttenden, Amanda Root, Sara Kestelman, Paul Rhys, Mark Strong, Paloma Baeza', 'TV-PG', 'In Imperial Russia, Anna, wife of the officer Karenin, goes to Moscow to visit her brother. On the way, she meets charming cavalry officer Vronsky, to whom she''s immediately attracted. But in St. Petersburg’s high society, a relationship like this could destroy a woman’s reputation. A four-part British television adaptation of Tolstoy''s novel.', 'In Imperial Russia, Anna, wife of the officer Karenin, goes to Moscow to visit her brother. On the way, she meets charming cavalry officer Vronsky, to whom she''s immediately attracted. But in St. Petersburg’s high society, a relationship like this could destroy a woman’s reputation. A four-part British television adaptation of Tolstoy''s novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhnQl7DCuGoACzfDgWZ0dKk7tlS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:25646'),
  ('1085950884802279570', 'Anna Karenina', 2013, 'Drama', null, null, 'Vittoria Puccini, Santiago Cabrera, Benjamin Sadler, Lou de Laâge, Max von Thun, Carlotta Natoli, Pietro Sermonti, Ángela Molina', null, 'Anna and Kitty. Two lives. One of desperate passion that ends in tragedy, the other, an existence made real through love. Two destinies that interweave, giving rise to two, so very different stories, yet lived in pursuit of the same desire- to find a love that lets them fully be themselves, to live without having to conform to society’s pretenses.', 'Anna and Kitty. Two lives. One of desperate passion that ends in tragedy, the other, an existence made real through love. Two destinies that interweave, giving rise to two, so very different stories, yet lived in pursuit of the same desire- to find a love that lets them fully be themselves, to live without having to conform to society’s pretenses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6seDdJl7B1bRcy32qgAqZAMNNY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74169'),
  ('1064107304030874222', 'Anna Pihl', 2006, 'Crime, Drama', 'Adam Price', 'Adam Price', 'Charlotte Munck, Peter Mygind, Ola Rapace, Kurt Ravn, Tammi Øst, Ole Lemmeke, Henrik Birch, Iben Hjejle', 'TV-14', 'A policewoman is doing her best at the job, but struggles to be there for her son.', 'A policewoman is doing her best at the job, but struggles to be there for her son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUivs0NhuznUnSZPavOjaC8FYHE.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:14208'),
  ('776552542535032983', 'Anna und die Liebe', 2008, 'Drama, Soap', null, null, 'Jeanette Biedermann, Franziska Arnold, Roy Peter Link, Lars Löllmann, Heike Jonca, Josephine Schmidt', null, 'Anna und die Liebe is the eleventh Telenovela made in Germany. It has aired since August 25, 2008 on German channel Sat.1 and Austrian Channel ORF 1.', 'Anna und die Liebe is the eleventh Telenovela made in Germany. It has aired since August 25, 2008 on German channel Sat.1 and Austrian Channel ORF 1.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/an5gLn6U5yBwRFdy3YdY0hb1Wpd.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:7812'),
  ('1122520161265928113', 'AnnDroid', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Maxim Pezhemsky', null, 'Zoya Berber, Anton Filipenko, Fyodor Lavrov, Kuzma Saprykin, Aleksandr Ilin, Nikita Tarasov, Marusya Klimova, Sergey Chikhachyov', null, 'Russian scientists have created an android policeman. Perfect in all respects, Captain Anna Nikolaevna Korolkevich goes to serve in a provincial city to see real life and become a human. Colleagues think that Anna Nikolaevna is the daughter of the deputy minister, and nothing portends trouble until humanization goes too far.', 'Russian scientists have created an android policeman. Perfect in all respects, Captain Anna Nikolaevna Korolkevich goes to serve in a provincial city to see real life and become a human. Colleagues think that Anna Nikolaevna is the daughter of the deputy minister, and nothing portends trouble until humanization goes too far.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vXf9bN3ENUv88L5d8TLRvUmUerl.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:100913'),
  ('608640040614053011', 'Anne', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Kevin Sampson', 'Maxine Peake, Stephen Walters, Bobby Schofield, Lily Shepherd, Ellie May Davies, Rob Jarvis, Polly Highton, Clare Calbraith', null, 'Anne Williams, from Formby, near Liverpool, was devastated by the loss of her son, 15-year-old Kevin, who was tragically killed at the FA Cup semi-final in 1989 between Liverpool and Nottingham Forest. Anne stood defiantly alongside other parents and their families who fought for justice for the 96 loved ones who lost their lives at a football match.', 'Anne Williams, from Formby, near Liverpool, was devastated by the loss of her son, 15-year-old Kevin, who was tragically killed at the FA Cup semi-final in 1989 between Liverpool and Nottingham Forest. Anne stood defiantly alongside other parents and their families who fought for justice for the 96 loved ones who lost their lives at a football match.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jljOr5ASQcb4JgFQoczGcshawMk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90040'),
  ('378626701428682234', 'Anne Boleyn', 2021, 'Drama', 'Eve Hedderwick Turner', null, 'Jodie Turner-Smith, Kris Hitchen, Barry Ward, Thalissa Teixeira, Isabella Laughland, Paapa Essiedu, Anna Brewster, Amanda Burton', 'TV-MA', 'The final months of Anne Boleyn''s life, her struggle with Tudor England''s patriarchal society, her desire to secure a future for her daughter, Elizabeth, and the brutal reality of her failure to provide Henry with a male heir.', 'The final months of Anne Boleyn''s life, her struggle with Tudor England''s patriarchal society, her desire to secure a future for her daughter, Elizabeth, and the brutal reality of her failure to provide Henry with a male heir.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1vC3LpIJl9BkNNsYVPhT9qGIYTY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:126400'),
  ('871829598686984592', 'Anne Frank: The Whole Story', 2001, 'Drama', null, null, 'Ben Kingsley, Hannah Taylor-Gordon, Tatjana Blacher, Brenda Blethyn, Jessica Manley, Lili Taylor, Joachim Król, Jan Niklas', null, 'The life of Anne Frank and her family from 1939 to 1945: pre-war fears, invasion of Netherlands by German troops, hiding in Amsterdam, deportation to the camps, return of Anne''s father.', 'The life of Anne Frank and her family from 1939 to 1945: pre-war fears, invasion of Netherlands by German troops, hiding in Amsterdam, deportation to the camps, return of Anne''s father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fr2RNdYjLsdb5vDrIY9dvmgYPfs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21276'),
  ('454477190986447918', 'Anne Happy♪', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Haruka Shiraishi, Hibiku Yamamura, Kiyono Yasuno, Mayu Yoshioka, Yumiri Hanamori, Chitose Morinaga, Yumi Hara, Yuko Gibu', 'TV-14', 'The story centers around class 1-7 of Tennomifune Academy, where all the students with "bad karma" or misfortune seem to have been gathered. Hibari, a student in this class, meets the unlucky Hanako and the perennially unhealthy Botan on her first day of school, and together they try to find a way to turn their school life into a happy one.', 'The story centers around class 1-7 of Tennomifune Academy, where all the students with "bad karma" or misfortune seem to have been gathered. Hibari, a student in this class, meets the unlucky Hanako and the perennially unhealthy Botan on her first day of school, and together they try to find a way to turn their school life into a happy one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hpsAXLYRIZtaZZiFGE9FoM9pBM9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66113'),
  ('224426026049837379', 'Anne of Green Gables', 1979, 'Animation, Drama, Family', null, null, 'Eiko Yamada', null, 'Anne Shirley is a freckle-faced, red-haired girl, who grows up in an orphanage having lost her parents at a very early age. Anne is always cheerful and fun-loving despite being brought up without love or affection. When she turns 11, she is adopted by the old farmer Matthew Cuthbert and his sister Marilla. Anne starts her new life at Green Gables, but actually the Cuthberts wanted a boy who could help with their work on the farm...', 'Anne Shirley is a freckle-faced, red-haired girl, who grows up in an orphanage having lost her parents at a very early age. Anne is always cheerful and fun-loving despite being brought up without love or affection. When she turns 11, she is adopted by the old farmer Matthew Cuthbert and his sister Marilla. Anne starts her new life at Green Gables, but actually the Cuthberts wanted a boy who could help with their work on the farm...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxAkN3hatitAojYaaFZxnyg4VHJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16047'),
  ('163545112975828363', 'Anne of Green Gables', 1985, 'Drama, Family', null, null, 'Megan Follows, Colleen Dewhurst, Richard Farnsworth, Jonathan Crombie, Charmion King, Schuyler Grant, Jackie Burroughs, Patricia Hamilton', null, 'When Anne Shirley arrives at the Cuthbert’s Farm on Prince Edward Island, she is a precocious, romantic child, desperate to be loved, and highly sensitive about her red hair and homely looks. Anne moves from one mishap to another as her wild imagination and far-fetched antics combine to constantly bring trouble upon her shoulders.', 'When Anne Shirley arrives at the Cuthbert’s Farm on Prince Edward Island, she is a precocious, romantic child, desperate to be loved, and highly sensitive about her red hair and homely looks. Anne moves from one mishap to another as her wild imagination and far-fetched antics combine to constantly bring trouble upon her shoulders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ueSbEVZf0vHzvEmPpeXzcDUOeFB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5874'),
  ('69821379769184429', 'Anne of Green Gables: The Continuing Story', 2000, 'Drama, Family', 'kevin Sullivan', 'Laurie Pearson', 'Megan Follows, Jonathan Crombie, Schuyler Grant, Greg Spottiswood, Janet-Laine Green, Patricia Hamilton, Shannon Lawson, Victoria Snow', null, 'Now in her twenties, Anne returns to Avonlea for the first time since Marilla Cuthbert''s death. Gilbert has been offered a position in a hospital in New York, and he persuades Anne to come with him. He arranges a position for her at a large publishing house. Big city life isn''t what they expected. Anne''s manuscript is stolen by a dashing American writer, Jack Garrison. Thus the stage is set for a final three hour installment in the "Anne of Green Gables" story which follows the characters from New York, the war effort in Europe and eventually returns them to the red earth of Prince Edward Island.', 'Now in her twenties, Anne returns to Avonlea for the first time since Marilla Cuthbert''s death. Gilbert has been offered a position in a hospital in New York, and he persuades Anne to come with him. He arranges a position for her at a large publishing house. Big city life isn''t what they expected. Anne''s manuscript is stolen by a dashing American writer, Jack Garrison. Thus the stage is set for a final three hour installment in the "Anne of Green Gables" story which follows the characters from New York, the war effort in Europe and eventually returns them to the red earth of Prince Edward Island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5a2840F2BCbhyh5KltsvUif0J8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5875'),
  ('450273235080532670', 'Anne of Green Gables: The Sequel', 1987, 'Drama, Family', null, 'Kevin Sullivan', 'Megan Follows, Jonathan Crombie, Colleen Dewhurst, Patricia Hamilton, Schuyler Grant, Rosemary Dunsmore, Frank Converse, Genevieve Appleton', 'TV-G', 'Anne Shirley, now a schoolteacher, has begun writing stories and collecting rejection slips. She acts as Diana''s maid of honor, develops a relationship with Gilbert Blythe, and finds herself at Kingsport Ladies'' College. But while Anne enjoys the battles and the friends she makes, she finds herself returning to Avonlea.', 'Anne Shirley, now a schoolteacher, has begun writing stories and collecting rejection slips. She acts as Diana''s maid of honor, develops a relationship with Gilbert Blythe, and finds herself at Kingsport Ladies'' College. But while Anne enjoys the battles and the friends she makes, she finds herself returning to Avonlea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9AzIKMG5yZFLvrU0KnmARzhAQNb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15847'),
  ('2543537607269908', 'Anne Shirley', 2025, 'Animation, Drama, Family', null, null, 'Honoka Inoue, Aya Nakamura, Naoya Miyase, Yume Miyamoto', 'TV-G', 'Anne Shirley, a redheaded eleven-year-old girl, moves from an orphanage to Green Gables, home of the elderly Cuthbert siblings Mathew and Marilla. Her abundant imagination, cheer, and earnest heart begin to change the people around her.', 'Anne Shirley, a redheaded eleven-year-old girl, moves from an orphanage to Green Gables, home of the elderly Cuthbert siblings Mathew and Marilla. Her abundant imagination, cheer, and earnest heart begin to change the people around her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttSQg44aZMwcwotm4cBAzsh5KcB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:277665'),
  ('116175066379895026', 'Anne with an E', 2017, 'Drama, Family', 'Moira Walley-Beckett', null, 'Amybeth McNulty, Geraldine James, R.H. Thomson, Lucas Jade Zumann, Joanna Douglas', 'TV-G', 'A coming-of-age story about an outsider who, against all odds and numerous challenges, fights for love and acceptance and for her place in the world. The series centers on a young orphaned girl in the late 1890s, who, after an abusive childhood spent in orphanages and the homes of strangers, is mistakenly sent to live with an elderly woman and her aging brother. Over time, 13-year-old Anne will transform their lives and eventually the small town in which they live with her unique spirit, fierce intellect and brilliant imagination.', 'A coming-of-age story about an outsider who, against all odds and numerous challenges, fights for love and acceptance and for her place in the world. The series centers on a young orphaned girl in the late 1890s, who, after an abusive childhood spent in orphanages and the homes of strangers, is mistakenly sent to live with an elderly woman and her aging brother. Over time, 13-year-old Anne will transform their lives and eventually the small town in which they live with her unique spirit, fierce intellect and brilliant imagination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6P6tXhjT5tK3qOXzxF9OMLlG7iz.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:70785'),
  ('1067267298649153722', 'ANNE+', 2018, 'Drama', 'Maud Wiemeijer', null, 'Hanna van Vliet', null, 'The weekend Anne (24) moves into her own place she unexpectedly runs into her ex-girlfriend Lily, and a lot has happened since they broke up four years ago. Over the weekend, Anne reflects on the relationships she has had throughout her student years in Amsterdam.', 'The weekend Anne (24) moves into her own place she unexpectedly runs into her ex-girlfriend Lily, and a lot has happened since they broke up four years ago. Over the weekend, Anne reflects on the relationships she has had throughout her student years in Amsterdam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3mlJXXunjkBpYxVlk0brMny87bv.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:82835'),
