  ('707518657283561154', 'Ask God For Forgiveness... Not Me', 2015, 'Drama, Soap', 'Caridad Bravo Adams, Liliana Abud, René Muñoz', 'Liliana Abud, Rossana Ruiz, René Muñoz', 'Zuria Vega, Mark Tacher, Sergio Goyri, Sabine Moussier, Rebecca Jones, Altaír Jarabo, María Sorté, René Strickler', 'TV-PG', 'The story of Renata Flores del Angel, a young woman from a wealthy family who falls for Pablo Ramos, the foreman of her father''s estate.', 'The story of Renata Flores del Angel, a young woman from a wealthy family who falls for Pablo Ramos, the foreman of her father''s estate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7rEhuowbJXUPdRAMVuTgQ6s7Wh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62066'),
  ('966103593487240471', 'Ask the Storybots', 2016, 'Kids, Animation', 'Evan Spiridellis, Gregg Spiridellis', null, 'Judy Greer, Fred Tatasciore, Jeff Gill, Gregg Spiridellis, Evan Spiridellis, Erin Fitzgerald', 'TV-Y', 'Based on the award-winning educational apps, the StoryBots are curious little creatures who live in the world beneath our screens and go on fun adventures to help answer kids'' questions, like how night happens or why we need to brush our teeth.', 'Based on the award-winning educational apps, the StoryBots are curious little creatures who live in the world beneath our screens and go on fun adventures to help answer kids'' questions, like how night happens or why we need to brush our teeth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6IY8bmJcUGmgcB9ERnx8hLw7Qz5.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:70437'),
  ('695601168565502280', 'Ask This Old House', 2002, 'Documentary', 'Russell Morash', null, 'Richard Trethewey, Norm Abram, Roger Cook, Kevin O''Connor, Tom Silva, Steve Thomas Rooney', 'TV-G', 'The crew at This Old House take on some pretty big projects, which means they can only work on one or two houses a year. But homeowners have a virtual truckload of questions on smaller projects, and the This Old House crew is ready to answer. Ask This Old House solves the steady stream of home improvement problems faced by viewers - and the crew even makes house calls!', 'The crew at This Old House take on some pretty big projects, which means they can only work on one or two houses a year. But homeowners have a virtual truckload of questions on smaller projects, and the This Old House crew is ready to answer. Ask This Old House solves the steady stream of home improvement problems faced by viewers - and the crew even makes house calls!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bsXGUoRxzelzpOyFDYyC5LpL21T.jpg', 24, 'tmdb:tv:23545'),
  ('873731648720354940', 'Aşk ve Gurur', 2025, 'Drama', 'Murat Senöy', null, 'Deniz Çatalbaş, Batuhan Demir, Ceylan Batı, Ali Pınar, Lara Aksüt', null, 'A wealthy family faces bankruptcy and must marry off one of their three daughters to Tolga, a seemingly rich heir. The eldest daughter resists despite mutual attraction, while her sister pursues him. Unknown to all, Tolga is also broke.', 'A wealthy family faces bankruptcy and must marry off one of their three daughters to Tolga, a seemingly rich heir. The eldest daughter resists despite mutual attraction, while her sister pursues him. Unknown to all, Tolga is also broke.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gBDmgxljJGE7t1tzXdAxZaXSdVM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:244812'),
  ('61156275051895619', 'Asla Vazgeçmem', 2015, 'Drama', null, null, 'Tolgahan Sayışman, Amine Gülşe, Şafak Pekdemir, Ayşegül Günay, Yonca Şahinbaş, Tugay Mercan, Hülya Gülşen Irmak, Ümit Yesin', 'NR', 'A beautiful and intense tv show about finding and holding on to love. Nur, a simple woman from countryside goes to Istanbul and finds what she expected the least; love.', 'A beautiful and intense tv show about finding and holding on to love. Nur, a simple woman from countryside goes to Istanbul and finds what she expected the least; love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKAUTdLK6Y9f9giQ4AZv5fSMVKj.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:70583'),
  ('474294979078851898', 'Asobi Asobase - workshop of fun -', 2018, 'Comedy, Animation', null, null, 'Konomi Kohara, Rika Nagae, Hina Kino, Maki Izawa', 'TV-14', 'During recess, Olivia, a foreign transfer student who doesn''t know English, plays a game of "look-the-other-way" with Hanako Honda, a loud-mouthed airhead. Their rowdy behavior spurs the ire of Kasumi Nomura, a deadpan loner constantly teased by her older sister for her tendency to lose games. Not willing to compete, Kasumi declines Olivia''s offer to join the fun, but eventually gets involved anyway and dispenses her own brand of mischief. Soon, a strange friendship blossoms between the peculiar trio, and they decide to form the "Pastime Club," where they are free to resume their daily hijinks. Whether it be failing to learn English, trying desperately to become popular, or getting caught by teachers at the wrong time, school life will never be boring when these girls are up to their hilarious antics.', 'During recess, Olivia, a foreign transfer student who doesn''t know English, plays a game of "look-the-other-way" with Hanako Honda, a loud-mouthed airhead. Their rowdy behavior spurs the ire of Kasumi Nomura, a deadpan loner constantly teased by her older sister for her tendency to lose games. Not willing to compete, Kasumi declines Olivia''s offer to join the fun, but eventually gets involved anyway and dispenses her own brand of mischief. Soon, a strange friendship blossoms between the peculiar trio, and they decide to form the "Pastime Club," where they are free to resume their daily hijinks. Whether it be failing to learn English, trying desperately to become popular, or getting caught by teachers at the wrong time, school life will never be boring when these girls are up to their hilarious antics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zWE3bnCILcRpfQCsxBkMsgcEjOE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80539'),
  ('565984823107348001', 'Aspe', 2004, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Pieter Aspe', null, 'Herbert Flack, Michel van Dousselaere, Herman Boets', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/boRYT7cfmIdRe7ajrUVsZDgE3Yz.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:30639'),
  ('231820471710113035', 'aspekte', 1965, 'Talk, Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'A 30-minute weekly cultural magazine program. The head of aspekte, Wolgang Herles, describes the program as follows: "For 40 years, "aspekte" has repeatedly set out to enrich television with cultural contrasts. "aspekte" understands culture not as the sum of facts and events, but as the taste, the sound, the rhythms of the times. It has proven itself as a journal of true luxury and fashions as well as an instrument of public education and information."', 'A 30-minute weekly cultural magazine program. The head of aspekte, Wolgang Herles, describes the program as follows: "For 40 years, "aspekte" has repeatedly set out to enrich television with cultural contrasts. "aspekte" understands culture not as the sum of facts and events, but as the taste, the sound, the rhythms of the times. It has proven itself as a journal of true luxury and fashions as well as an instrument of public education and information."', null, 33, 'tmdb:tv:106011'),
  ('284804273214754979', 'Aspirants', 2021, 'Drama', 'Arunabh Kumar, Shreyansh Pandey, Deepesh Sumitra Jagdish', 'Anurag Goswami, Anurag Shukla, Deepesh Sumitra Jagdish', 'Naveen Kasturia, Shivankit Singh Parihar, Abhilash Thapliyal, Sunny Hinduja, Namita Dubey, Jatin Goswami, Tengam Celine', null, 'Aspirants is a story of 3 friends - Abhilash, SK, and Guri. The story takes place in the past and the present where the past captures the struggle and the drama behind the making of UPSC CSE aspirants in Old Rajinder Nagar of Delhi, while the present talks about the aftermath. It is the story of three UPSC aspirants journey.', 'Aspirants is a story of 3 friends - Abhilash, SK, and Guri. The story takes place in the past and the present where the past captures the struggle and the drama behind the making of UPSC CSE aspirants in Old Rajinder Nagar of Delhi, while the present talks about the aftermath. It is the story of three UPSC aspirants journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lG8wK40jH4EX6dbVFI1fzw2E96N.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:124411'),
  ('414453749637180954', 'Assassin''s Creed: Lineage', 2009, 'Action & Adventure', 'Yves Simoneau', null, 'Romano Orzari, Manuel Tadros, Jesse Rath, Devon Bostick, Alex Ivanovici, Michel Perron, Arthur Grosser, Peter Miller', 'NR', 'When the Duke of Milan is brutally murdered, the Assassin Giovanni Auditore is dispatched to investigate. What he uncovers implicates Italy''s most powerful families reaching all the way back to the Vatican itself. As Giovanni draws closer to the truth, he becomes hunted himself. He must expose the conspirators before he joins their ever-growing list of victims. Three short films based on the Assassin''s Creed II video game.', 'When the Duke of Milan is brutally murdered, the Assassin Giovanni Auditore is dispatched to investigate. What he uncovers implicates Italy''s most powerful families reaching all the way back to the Vatican itself. As Giovanni draws closer to the truth, he becomes hunted himself. He must expose the conspirators before he joins their ever-growing list of victims. Three short films based on the Assassin''s Creed II video game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w5wmsgZ6SaAxMCwlYRfAbq5jzb2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40137'),
  ('922420352075561525', 'Assassination Classroom', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Jun Fukuyama, Mai Fuchigami, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Aya Suzaki, Ayaka Suwa, Ayako Kawasumi, Chie Matsuura, Eiji Miyashita', 'TV-14', 'The students of Class 3-E have a mission: kill their teacher before graduation. He has already destroyed the moon, and has promised to destroy the Earth if he can not be killed within a year. But how can this class of misfits kill a tentacled monster, capable of reaching Mach 20 speed, who may be the best teacher any of them have ever had?', 'The students of Class 3-E have a mission: kill their teacher before graduation. He has already destroyed the moon, and has promised to destroy the Earth if he can not be killed within a year. But how can this class of misfits kill a tentacled monster, capable of reaching Mach 20 speed, who may be the best teacher any of them have ever had?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qf0l0nQ2t06Es3cSXflqx6l6vsJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62110'),
  ('894012555925512479', 'ASSASSINS PRIDE', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama, Mystery, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuki Ono, Tomori Kusunoki, Yui Ishikawa, Ayane Sakura, Azumi Waki, Maaya Uchida, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Tatsuhisa Suzuki', 'TV-PG', 'In the world only the aristocrats have the power to fight the monster - mana. Even though Melida Angel was born in an aristocracy and studies at an academy developing mana users, she has no mana. To find her talent for mana, Kufa Vampir was sent to be her tutor but at the same time, he was ordered to assassinate her if she has no talent for mana. He makes a cruel decision to assassinate her because he thinks that it is a wasted effort that people who have not any mana are working hard in this world... However, he asks her, "Do you want to try to entrust your life to me?" He is not as an assassin nor a tutor. He is someone betting on his pride as an assassin tutor, to show the world what Melida is capable of!', 'In the world only the aristocrats have the power to fight the monster - mana. Even though Melida Angel was born in an aristocracy and studies at an academy developing mana users, she has no mana. To find her talent for mana, Kufa Vampir was sent to be her tutor but at the same time, he was ordered to assassinate her if she has no talent for mana. He makes a cruel decision to assassinate her because he thinks that it is a wasted effort that people who have not any mana are working hard in this world... However, he asks her, "Do you want to try to entrust your life to me?" He is not as an assassin nor a tutor. He is someone betting on his pride as an assassin tutor, to show the world what Melida is capable of!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oR5GH0hdYClkRgaTTu3eJbtjyyY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91299'),
  ('28200978409613297', 'Assault Lily: BOUQUET', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hikaru Akao, Mikako Izawa, Rimi Nishimoto, Haruki Iwata, Karin Takahashi, Yuko Natsuyoshi, Risa Tsumugi, Hikaru Tono', 'TV-14', 'On Earth in the near future, humanity faced imminent destruction from mysterious giant creatures known as "Huge." The entire world unites against the Huge, and successfully develops weaponry known as "CHARM" (Counter Huge Arms) by combining science and magic. CHARM exhibits high rates of synchronization with teenaged girls, and the girls who use CHARM are viewed as heroes called "Lilies." Throughout the world, "Garden" military academies are established to train Lilies to face the Huge and to serve as bases to protect and guide people. Riri Hitotsuyanagi managed to pass the exam to enter the prestigious Garden known as Yurigaoka Girls'' School. She entered in an attempt to find Yuyu Shirai, a girl who rescued her in her past. This is a story about Riri and other girls who aim to become Lilies at one such Garden.', 'On Earth in the near future, humanity faced imminent destruction from mysterious giant creatures known as "Huge." The entire world unites against the Huge, and successfully develops weaponry known as "CHARM" (Counter Huge Arms) by combining science and magic. CHARM exhibits high rates of synchronization with teenaged girls, and the girls who use CHARM are viewed as heroes called "Lilies." Throughout the world, "Garden" military academies are established to train Lilies to face the Huge and to serve as bases to protect and guide people. Riri Hitotsuyanagi managed to pass the exam to enter the prestigious Garden known as Yurigaoka Girls'' School. She entered in an attempt to find Yuyu Shirai, a girl who rescued her in her past. This is a story about Riri and other girls who aim to become Lilies at one such Garden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXLZtzmxRPMMYyNtSOysGWLEmd1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94541'),
  ('944103678434540730', 'Assy McGee', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Matt Harrigan, Carl W. Adams', null, 'Larry Murphy, H. Jon Benjamin, Carl W. Adams', 'TV-MA', 'Assy McGee is an animated sitcom featuring police detective Assy McGee, a parody of tough-guy cop shows and movies, who is literally a walking pair of buttocks. Along with his partner Don Sanchez, the trigger-happy McGee solves crimes in a fictionalized Exeter, New Hampshire. Larry Murphy voices all of the main characters. The series premiered on November 26, 2006, on Adult Swim and was canceled after season two ended on July 6, 2008.', 'Assy McGee is an animated sitcom featuring police detective Assy McGee, a parody of tough-guy cop shows and movies, who is literally a walking pair of buttocks. Along with his partner Don Sanchez, the trigger-happy McGee solves crimes in a fictionalized Exeter, New Hampshire. Larry Murphy voices all of the main characters. The series premiered on November 26, 2006, on Adult Swim and was canceled after season two ended on July 6, 2008.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/stSGJNl7TDWqD6QFOdo3sXDakwo.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:6318'),
  ('7226918645121542', 'Astarotte''s Toy', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Rie Kugimiya, Rina Sato, Yukari Tamura, Hitomi Nabatame, Yui Horie', null, 'While job hunting, Naoya is taken by a mysterious girl to a magical land where he is installed in the harem of the succubus Princess Lotte. Thanks to trauma from her childhood, Lotte hates men and surrounds herself with lots of other women, who all have quirks of their own. In spite of her selfishness, when Naoya learns that Lotte is really quite lonely he agrees to stay in her world...if he can bring his daughter Asuha with him.', 'While job hunting, Naoya is taken by a mysterious girl to a magical land where he is installed in the harem of the succubus Princess Lotte. Thanks to trauma from her childhood, Lotte hates men and surrounds herself with lots of other women, who all have quirks of their own. In spite of her selfishness, when Naoya learns that Lotte is really quite lonely he agrees to stay in her world...if he can bring his daughter Asuha with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZmANWHQHRchkLdNJcgcZhbhqCC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42508'),
  ('734249811747131723', 'Asterix & Obelix: The Big Fight', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family', 'Alain Chabat', null, 'Alain Chabat, Gilles Lellouche, Anaïs Demoustier, Laurent Lafitte, Thierry Lhermitte, Géraldine Nakache, Jean-Pascal Zadi, Grégoire Ludig', 'TV-PG', 'When their druid forgets how to prepare the magic potion, Asterix and Obelix must defend the village as Caesar plots to use a Gallic law against them.', 'When their druid forgets how to prepare the magic potion, Asterix and Obelix must defend the village as Caesar plots to use a Gallic law against them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yiBvCHwN3zFBTENZrkhMqy3BClO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:122781'),
  ('876861489314588289', 'Asteroid in Love', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Maria Sashide, Tomoyo Takayanagi, Megumi Yamaguchi, Sumire Uesaka, Nao Toyama', 'TV-PG', 'In a fateful childhood encounter, Mira Kinohata met a stargazing dreamer named Ao Manaka. Though their time together was short, Ao showed Mira the wonders of astronomy, from orbiting planets to distant stars. Before they parted, Mira learned that a star with her name exists, but there are none with Ao''s. And so, she forged a promise: one day, she would discover a new asteroid and name it after Ao. Years later, Mira is still fascinated with astronomy. Now in high school at Hoshizaki Academy, she tries to join the Astronomy Club. Unfortunately, she finds out that the club has been merged with the Geology Club to form a single Earth Sciences Club. She joins this new club and finds a pleasant surprise—she reunites with Ao after years of separation. Alongside their new clubmates, Mira and Ao begin their journey together to fulfill their promise. How hard could it possibly be to find an asteroid?', 'In a fateful childhood encounter, Mira Kinohata met a stargazing dreamer named Ao Manaka. Though their time together was short, Ao showed Mira the wonders of astronomy, from orbiting planets to distant stars. Before they parted, Mira learned that a star with her name exists, but there are none with Ao''s. And so, she forged a promise: one day, she would discover a new asteroid and name it after Ao. Years later, Mira is still fascinated with astronomy. Now in high school at Hoshizaki Academy, she tries to join the Astronomy Club. Unfortunately, she finds out that the club has been merged with the Geology Club to form a single Earth Sciences Club. She joins this new club and finds a pleasant surprise—she reunites with Ao after years of separation. Alongside their new clubmates, Mira and Ao begin their journey together to fulfill their promise. How hard could it possibly be to find an asteroid?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4YBxIk2XrCmS30z4Xrbc0C3Gc2p.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91585'),
  ('1040182908072647897', 'Astonishing X-Men', 2009, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Trevor Devall, Brian Drummond, Lara Gilchrist, Ron Halder, Laura Harris, Mark Hildreth', 'TV-MA', 'Facing a powerful new enemy, the team of mutant superheroes find themselves further imperiled when a "cure" for mutants is discovered.', 'Facing a powerful new enemy, the team of mutant superheroes find themselves further imperiled when a "cure" for mutants is discovered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kkpr7lhAmXfNTT4KsbMcHJ0GNyE.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:117657'),
  ('740487431925087657', 'Astra Lost in Space', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Inori Minase, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Naoki Tatsuta, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Hina Kino, Risae Matsuda, Tomoyo Kurosawa, Koki Uchiyama', 'TV-14', 'In the year 2063, eight high school students and a kid are flown out to Planet Camp, tasked with surviving on their own for a few days. But shortly after arriving, an ominous glowing orb warps them to an unknown quadrant of space, nearly 5,012 light years away. Now, the only way back home is a slow, dangerous trek across the universe—a journey that’ll test them in ways Planet Camp never could.', 'In the year 2063, eight high school students and a kid are flown out to Planet Camp, tasked with surviving on their own for a few days. But shortly after arriving, an ominous glowing orb warps them to an unknown quadrant of space, nearly 5,012 light years away. Now, the only way back home is a slow, dangerous trek across the universe—a journey that’ll test them in ways Planet Camp never could.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bprvOBSMKxGdI4Egcy3dqMhKytS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88041'),
  ('69460646100613298', 'Astrid & Lilly Save the World', 2022, 'Comedy, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Noelle Stehman, Betsy Van Stone', null, 'Jana Morrison, Samantha Aucoin, Spencer MacPherson', null, 'High school is hard enough when you''re different, but when outcast BFFs Astrid and Lilly accidentally crack open a portal to a terrifyingly quirky monster dimension, it gets a lot more complicated. It''s up to them to vanquish the creepy creatures and save the world, becoming the badass heroes they were meant to be. That is, if they can survive the horrors of high school.', 'High school is hard enough when you''re different, but when outcast BFFs Astrid and Lilly accidentally crack open a portal to a terrifyingly quirky monster dimension, it gets a lot more complicated. It''s up to them to vanquish the creepy creatures and save the world, becoming the badass heroes they were meant to be. That is, if they can survive the horrors of high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dgYFcMUOojIeK7jZEjkjK3tOqTe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:153269'),
  ('785781881143845531', 'Astrid et Raphaëlle', 2020, 'Crime', 'Laurent Burtin, Alexandre de Seguin', null, 'Sara Mortensen, Lola Dewaere, Benoît Michel, Husky Kihal', null, 'Astrid Nielsen works in the library of the judicial police. She has Asperger''s syndrome. With an incredible memory, she excels at analyzing files of ongoing investigations. The district commander decides to use it to the fullest, entrusting her with very complex investigations which have remained unsolved to date.', 'Astrid Nielsen works in the library of the judicial police. She has Asperger''s syndrome. With an incredible memory, she excels at analyzing files of ongoing investigations. The district commander decides to use it to the fullest, entrusting her with very complex investigations which have remained unsolved to date.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhzLDXqjNyXOwUWvTV0TR1SJRHd.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:88384'),
  ('833434239551266599', 'Astro Boy', 1963, 'Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Osamu Tezuka', 'Osamu Tezuka', 'Mari Shimizu, Kazue Tagami, Youko Mizugaki, Akihiko Mitsueda, Seizo Kato, Shingo Kanemoto, Kiyoshi Komiyama, Masaaki Yajima', 'TV-PG', 'In the year 2000, Dr. Boyton creates a super-robot in his deceased son''s image. He calls the robot Astro Boy. Astro Boy can swim oceans, leap over mountains, even fly into space on his own power. However, Astro Boy can''t replace his son. Dr. Boyton becomes dissatisfied with the boy robot and disowns him. Astro Boy is befriended by Dr. Packadermus J. Elefun of the Institute of Science, who guides him through his adventures. Endowed with super strength, rocket-powered flight, a selfless heart and a kind demeanor, Astro Boy fights a never-ending crusade against the forces of evil!', 'In the year 2000, Dr. Boyton creates a super-robot in his deceased son''s image. He calls the robot Astro Boy. Astro Boy can swim oceans, leap over mountains, even fly into space on his own power. However, Astro Boy can''t replace his son. Dr. Boyton becomes dissatisfied with the boy robot and disowns him. Astro Boy is befriended by Dr. Packadermus J. Elefun of the Institute of Science, who guides him through his adventures. Endowed with super strength, rocket-powered flight, a selfless heart and a kind demeanor, Astro Boy fights a never-ending crusade against the forces of evil!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/imCrEQ7DXqM83SKgvk0l8atUaUO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10826'),
  ('988809315199243961', 'Astro Boy', 1980, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Family, Kids', 'Osamu Tezuka', null, 'Mari Shimizu, Hisashi Katsuta, Ichiro Nagai, Katsuji Mori, Masako Sugaya, Yusaku Yara', null, 'In 2030 AD, after being abandoned by his creator, a young boy robot is rescued by an Android Advocate, Dr Elefun, who adopts him as his own and guides him in the use of his special powers to aid and protect mankind and robot-kind.', 'In 2030 AD, after being abandoned by his creator, a young boy robot is rescued by an Android Advocate, Dr Elefun, who adopts him as his own and guides him in the use of his special powers to aid and protect mankind and robot-kind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u3LVqlU9OLVN18uwIazxwgDVgdZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:23022'),
  ('930025842413161083', 'Astro Boy', 2003, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family, Comedy, Kids', 'Osamu Tezuka', null, 'Makoto Tsumura, Miki Maruyama, Hisashi Katsuta, Shin''ya Ohwada, Kazuo Kumakura', null, 'Astro is a robotic boy created by Dr. Tenma to replace his late son. When Tenma destroys his laboratory and shuts down Astro, the Ministry of Science revives him and tries to give him a normal life as a 6th-grade student who occasionally helps keep renegade robots from causing harm.', 'Astro is a robotic boy created by Dr. Tenma to replace his late son. When Tenma destroys his laboratory and shuts down Astro, the Ministry of Science revives him and tries to give him a normal life as a 6th-grade student who occasionally helps keep renegade robots from causing harm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vl2geBaVhcSEjzyk3WeL55ghd3i.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12050'),
  ('392457259942927297', 'Astro Note', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Maaya Uchida, Soma Saito, Rie Kugimiya, Tomokazu Sugita, Shin-ichiro Miki, Ai Furihata, Yui Ogura, Junichi Suwabe', 'TV-14', 'Takumi, a gifted chef, just landed a new job. He works at the Astro Manor apartment building that offers breakfast, and there he encounters the beautiful landlady—Mira. It’s love at first sight, and he hopes to charm her, but the quirky tenants and bizarre phenomena don’t make it easy. He even learns by pure chance that Mira is secretly an alien! Will their love survive these unearthly oddities?', 'Takumi, a gifted chef, just landed a new job. He works at the Astro Manor apartment building that offers breakfast, and there he encounters the beautiful landlady—Mira. It’s love at first sight, and he hopes to charm her, but the quirky tenants and bizarre phenomena don’t make it easy. He even learns by pure chance that Mira is secretly an alien! Will their love survive these unearthly oddities?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7S713gLbVcNrqpys8kInhmbm8jW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:240682'),
  ('1108122040032992437', 'Asur', 2020, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Gaurav Shukla, Vibhav Shikdar, Shweta More', null, 'Arshad Warsi, Anupriya Goenka, Ridhi Dogra, Sharib Hashmi, Barun Sobti, Amey Wagh, Vishesh Bansal, Meiyang Chang', null, 'Set in the backdrop of the mystical city of Varanasi, Asur follows Nikhil Nair, a forensic-expert-turned-teacher, who returns to his roots at the Central Bureau of Investigation, and along with his former mentor Dhananjay Rajpoot, finds himself caught in a cat-and-mouse game with a brutal serial killer. What follows is a blend of suspense, mythology and the murders of some people totally unrelated.', 'Set in the backdrop of the mystical city of Varanasi, Asur follows Nikhil Nair, a forensic-expert-turned-teacher, who returns to his roots at the Central Bureau of Investigation, and along with his former mentor Dhananjay Rajpoot, finds himself caught in a cat-and-mouse game with a brutal serial killer. What follows is a blend of suspense, mythology and the murders of some people totally unrelated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQ7H87WvamQRyduAqN2zAZeirji.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:100911'),
  ('138548648273765536', 'Asura', 2025, 'Drama', 'Hirokazu Kore-eda', 'Hirokazu Kore-eda', 'Rie Miyazawa, Machiko Ono, Yu Aoi, Suzu Hirose, Masahiro Motoki, Ryuhei Matsuda, Kisetsu Fujiwara, Seiyo Uchino', 'TV-14', 'In 1979 Tokyo, four distinct sisters uncover their aging father''s affair, causing their happy facades and bottled-up emotions to slowly unravel.', 'In 1979 Tokyo, four distinct sisters uncover their aging father''s affair, causing their happy facades and bottled-up emotions to slowly unravel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6d4IrjS3t3O7dFynAmrLKXrSNwe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:239137'),
  ('892547324050575447', 'Asura Cryin''', 2009, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Gakuto Mikumo', null, 'Miyu Irino, Haruka Tomatsu, Ai Nonaka, Aki Toyosaki, Hiro Shimono, Showtaro Morikubo, Yuhko Kaida, Eri Kitamura', null, 'Tomoharu is a normal high school student... except for the fact that he is never alone. Haunted by the ghost of his dead childhood friend, he moves into a new residence at the beginning of the school year. Life turns out to be a little more difficult than expected, though, when his house is overrun by various female occult users. To make things even worse he is pulled into an epic struggle to protect a mysterious trunk, that is presently hidden in the house.', 'Tomoharu is a normal high school student... except for the fact that he is never alone. Haunted by the ghost of his dead childhood friend, he moves into a new residence at the beginning of the school year. Life turns out to be a little more difficult than expected, though, when his house is overrun by various female occult users. To make things even worse he is pulled into an epic struggle to protect a mysterious trunk, that is presently hidden in the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2aPuDNtfDRSTsZznGXRNwrc4gSi.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:42425'),
  ('400289881424982248', 'Asylum', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Edgar Wright', 'Julian Barratt, Adam Bloom, Jessica Hynes', 'Jessica Hynes, Julian Barratt, Simon Pegg, Mick O''Connor, David Devant and his Spirit Wife, Paul Morocco, Norman Lovett, Adam Bloom', null, 'Asylum is a British comedy series which was shown on Paramount Comedy Channel in 1996. Set in a mental asylum, it ran for one series of six episodes. Unlike traditional sitcoms or comedy television shows, it was to some extent an opportunity for stand-up routines by various comedians, mixed with an overall story involving much black humour. It is significant for involving a large number of British comedians, many who have gone on to work on some of the most successful comedy programmes of the last decade. It marked the first collaboration of Edgar Wright, Simon Pegg and Jessica Stevenson, who would go on to make cult sitcom Spaced. Many of the characters names were the same as those of the actors who portrayed them. David Devant & His Spirit Wife were the "house band" for the series, performing segments in every episode, from their first album, Work, Lovelife, Miscellaneous. The lead-in track "Ginger" served as the programme''s title music. The series has yet to be released on DVD; however, the full episodes are viewable on Norman Lovett''s website.', 'Asylum is a British comedy series which was shown on Paramount Comedy Channel in 1996. Set in a mental asylum, it ran for one series of six episodes. Unlike traditional sitcoms or comedy television shows, it was to some extent an opportunity for stand-up routines by various comedians, mixed with an overall story involving much black humour. It is significant for involving a large number of British comedians, many who have gone on to work on some of the most successful comedy programmes of the last decade. It marked the first collaboration of Edgar Wright, Simon Pegg and Jessica Stevenson, who would go on to make cult sitcom Spaced. Many of the characters names were the same as those of the actors who portrayed them. David Devant & His Spirit Wife were the "house band" for the series, performing segments in every episode, from their first album, Work, Lovelife, Miscellaneous. The lead-in track "Ginger" served as the programme''s title music. The series has yet to be released on DVD; however, the full episodes are viewable on Norman Lovett''s website.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHjSbpAGSEwLlWxw7IJWLYQUKLC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2554'),
  ('341164651979580107', 'At 25:00, in Akasaka', 2024, 'Drama', 'Hiroko Natsuno', null, 'Taisuke Niihara, Kiita Komagine, Takuma Usa, Shoma Nagumo', null, 'When a rookie actor is cast alongside a charming former classmate, he struggles to separate his on-set performance from his true feelings.', 'When a rookie actor is cast alongside a charming former classmate, he struggles to separate his on-set performance from his true feelings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pTGgnjfAMdvjtrF5dNpdWPIa8ti.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:248433'),
  ('360443243362811200', 'At a Distance, Spring is Green', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ji Nyoong', 'Ko Yeon-su', 'Park Ji-hoon, Bae In-hyuk, Kang Min-ah, Kwon Eun-bin, Woo Da-vi, Choi Jung-woo, Lee Woo-je, Yoo In-soo', null, 'A coming of age story about young people in their twenties and the problems they face in university. Nam Soo-hyun and Yeon Joo, two boys with contrasting personalities, unexpectedly become friends when they work on a project together.', 'A coming of age story about young people in their twenties and the problems they face in university. Nam Soo-hyun and Yeon Joo, two boys with contrasting personalities, unexpectedly become friends when they work on a project together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/34x7p7y2Nbo3Khe49tplJz6AexR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:126436'),
  ('701358425856691762', 'At Eighteen', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sim Na-yeon, Yun Gyeong-a', 'Yun Gyeong-a', 'Ong Seong-wu, Kim Hyang-gi, Shin Seung-ho, Kang Ki-young, Shim Yi Young, Kim Sun-young, Choi Jae-woong, Moon Bin', null, 'A misunderstood loner is drawn out of his shell after transferring to another high school, where he comes across new ordeals -- and first love.', 'A misunderstood loner is drawn out of his shell after transferring to another high school, where he comes across new ordeals -- and first love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AbEoQOZO6xnXg52Ehrd8aXchpLF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90407'),
  ('951094674476449712', 'At Home - Spain', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Paula Ortiz, Elena Martín Gimeno, Rodrigo Sorogoyen', null, null, null, 'Through different genres (such as romantic comedy, drama or even fantasy), this show takes a look through the viewpoint of five different filmmakers at the unusual context that the coronavirus quarantine provides.', 'Through different genres (such as romantic comedy, drama or even fantasy), this show takes a look through the viewpoint of five different filmmakers at the unusual context that the coronavirus quarantine provides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90JZFtUBLZDayyTuWPFazNzwkGe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:104453'),
  ('1043714300744031303', 'At Home With Olaf', 2020, 'Animation, Family', 'Hyrum Virl Osmond, Josh Gad', null, 'Josh Gad', null, 'Enjoy an all-new original Disney Animation digital series with everyone''s favorite snowman, Olaf. At Home With Olaf, created at home by Hyrum Osmond and voiced from home by Josh Gad.', 'Enjoy an all-new original Disney Animation digital series with everyone''s favorite snowman, Olaf. At Home With Olaf, created at home by Hyrum Osmond and voiced from home by Josh Gad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bHBEiLzOXmQTabGrGUUniB2dhT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103848'),
  ('933971985865804487', 'At Home with the Braithwaites', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sally Wainwright', null, 'Peter Davison, Amanda Redman, Sarah Churm, Damian Zuk, Scott Cooper, Sarah Smart, Keeley Fawcett, Ishia Bennison', null, 'At Home with the Braithwaites is a British comedy-drama television series, created and written by Sally Wainwright. The storyline follows a suburban family from Leeds, whose life is turned upside down when the mother of the family wins 38 million pounds on the lottery. It was broadcast on ITV, for 26 episodes, from 20 January 2000 to 9 April 2003. At the beginning of the first series, each member of the Braithwaite family has an issue. Alison has to decide what to do with the winnings, and when to tell her family. David is having an affair with Elaine, his secretary at work. Virginia is on the verge of flunking out of university. Sarah has a crush on her drama teacher. Charlotte suspects that her mother may be the mystery lottery winner.', 'At Home with the Braithwaites is a British comedy-drama television series, created and written by Sally Wainwright. The storyline follows a suburban family from Leeds, whose life is turned upside down when the mother of the family wins 38 million pounds on the lottery. It was broadcast on ITV, for 26 episodes, from 20 January 2000 to 9 April 2003. At the beginning of the first series, each member of the Braithwaite family has an issue. Alison has to decide what to do with the winnings, and when to tell her family. David is having an affair with Elaine, his secretary at work. Virginia is on the verge of flunking out of university. Sarah has a crush on her drama teacher. Charlotte suspects that her mother may be the mystery lottery winner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8f51TuzzqQXpLurcwxNMm5zFd80.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:10466'),
  ('259025967446504527', 'At Home with the Furys', 2023, 'Reality, Family, Documentary', null, null, 'Tyson Fury', null, 'Undefeated heavyweight champion Tyson Fury retires from boxing to embrace the eccentricities of family life in this hilarious and heartfelt docusoap.', 'Undefeated heavyweight champion Tyson Fury retires from boxing to embrace the eccentricities of family life in this hilarious and heartfelt docusoap.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9MMDK85gpE9usy6QCCLGgTzgroW.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:230939'),
  ('385027827888323948', 'At Last the 1948 Show', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Marty Feldman, Graham Chapman, Tim Brooke-Taylor', null, 'John Cleese, Graham Chapman, Tim Brooke-Taylor, Marty Feldman, Aimi MacDonald, Bill Oddie, Eric Idle, Barry Cryer', null, 'A groundbreaking, splendidly silly, surreal sketch comedy series written by and starring The Goodies'' Tim Brooke-Taylor, Monty Python''s Graham Chapman and John Cleese, and comedy legend Marty Feldman.', 'A groundbreaking, splendidly silly, surreal sketch comedy series written by and starring The Goodies'' Tim Brooke-Taylor, Monty Python''s Graham Chapman and John Cleese, and comedy legend Marty Feldman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jn2Y6psl6Vk48k6TjYKfytYaWc6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:189'),
  ('352263381036709449', 'At the Mercy of the Sky', 2009, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Tomoaki Maeno, Kanae Itou, Haruka Tomatsu, Ami Koshimizu, Junji Majima', 'TV-14', 'Saku Oyagi returns to his old hometown in order to start school at Soei High School. On the first day, he runs into an old childhood friend: a second year named Mihoshi Akeno. As children, the two used to play together, with Mihoshi, or Mii-chan, being extremely fond of astronomy. After convincing Saku to join the school''s astronomy club, another girl, Hime Makita, joins the club in hopes of winning over Saku. This is the story of the 6 club members of the Soei High School Astronomy Club as they soar through their lives, each maturing and changing their outlooks on life.', 'Saku Oyagi returns to his old hometown in order to start school at Soei High School. On the first day, he runs into an old childhood friend: a second year named Mihoshi Akeno. As children, the two used to play together, with Mihoshi, or Mii-chan, being extremely fond of astronomy. After convincing Saku to join the school''s astronomy club, another girl, Hime Makita, joins the club in hopes of winning over Saku. This is the story of the 6 club members of the Soei High School Astronomy Club as they soar through their lives, each maturing and changing their outlooks on life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mahRk2erOZ2NAmbJ330tzPEG4o.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38141'),
  ('199946333164864255', 'At the Moment', 2023, 'Drama', 'Du Zheng-zhe, Lien Yi-chi', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'This anthology series set during the pandemic follows 10 unique love stories of passion and heartache.', 'This anthology series set during the pandemic follows 10 unique love stories of passion and heartache.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qe6qvFD01iYxLEnSDVC3IE2m3gi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218177'),
  ('623985219577615419', 'At the Movies', 1982, 'Talk', null, null, 'Roger Ebert, Gene Siskel, Rex Reed', null, 'At the Movies is a movie review television program that aired from 1982 to 1990. It was produced by Tribune Entertainment and created by Gene Siskel and Roger Ebert, who had left Sneak Previews the previous year. Siskel and Ebert left in 1986 in a dispute with Tribune Entertainment; they went on to create Siskel & Ebert with Buena Vista Television. They were replaced by film critics Rex Reed and Bill Harris, a gossip correspondent for Entertainment Tonight. Under Reed and Harris, the show expanded beyond movie reviews, adding show business news. Harris left in 1988 and was replaced by former ET host Dixie Whatley.', 'At the Movies is a movie review television program that aired from 1982 to 1990. It was produced by Tribune Entertainment and created by Gene Siskel and Roger Ebert, who had left Sneak Previews the previous year. Siskel and Ebert left in 1986 in a dispute with Tribune Entertainment; they went on to create Siskel & Ebert with Buena Vista Television. They were replaced by film critics Rex Reed and Bill Harris, a gossip correspondent for Entertainment Tonight. Under Reed and Harris, the show expanded beyond movie reviews, adding show business news. Harris left in 1988 and was replaced by former ET host Dixie Whatley.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:7615'),
  ('1015725553481362136', 'At the Movies', 1986, 'Talk', null, null, 'Ben Lyons, Gene Siskel, Roger Ebert', null, 'At the Movies is a movie review television program produced by Disney-ABC Domestic Television in which two film critics shared their opinions of newly released films. The program aired under various names. Its original hosts were Roger Ebert of the Chicago Sun-Times and WLS-TV and Gene Siskel of the Chicago Tribune and WBBM-TV. Richard Roeper of the Sun-Times became Ebert''s regular partner in 2000 after Siskel died in 1999.', 'At the Movies is a movie review television program produced by Disney-ABC Domestic Television in which two film critics shared their opinions of newly released films. The program aired under various names. Its original hosts were Roger Ebert of the Chicago Sun-Times and WLS-TV and Gene Siskel of the Chicago Tribune and WBBM-TV. Richard Roeper of the Sun-Times became Ebert''s regular partner in 2000 after Siskel died in 1999.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRXcgV3d0dexf7WFyNpPZcMmr2p.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3836'),
  ('507595341392323838', 'At the Threshold of an Era', 1999, 'Drama', 'Jonathan Ki-Yee Chik', null, 'Gallen Lo Ka-Leung, Roger Kwok Chun-On, Nicky Wu, Louis Koo, Ada Choi Siu-Fan, Maggie Shiu, Chow Chung, Suet Nei', null, 'Spanning 20 years, from 1990 to 2010, the series tells of three entrepreneurs who founded a company together to achieve the ultimate goal of developing a pollution-free town in Hong Kong. Through the years, they face many struggles, but most particularly, the family vendetta between two of the company founders.', 'Spanning 20 years, from 1990 to 2010, the series tells of three entrepreneurs who founded a company together to achieve the ultimate goal of developing a pollution-free town in Hong Kong. Through the years, they face many struggles, but most particularly, the family vendetta between two of the company founders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/39yxDxCpVPSI6HQreIAiPDu3OLB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1358'),
  ('571093795408040331', 'At the Threshold of an Era 2', 2000, 'Drama', null, null, 'Gallen Lo Ka-Leung, Louis Koo, Sunny Chan Kam-Hung, Roger Kwok Chun-On, Nicky Wu, Joe Ma Tak-Chung, Samuel Kwok Fung, Paul Chun Pui', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z7rFSt0JRj785EKwcML7L99nNKI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109743'),
  ('704128907426391921', 'Atasco', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Rodrigo Sopeña', null, null, null, 'A major traffic jam throws thousands of citizens on the outskirts of Madrid into chaos, disrupting their plans. This everyday situation will be the starting point for unexpected, comical, and emotional plots.', 'A major traffic jam throws thousands of citizens on the outskirts of Madrid into chaos, disrupting their plans. This everyday situation will be the starting point for unexpected, comical, and emotional plots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hHgJJBvYUML7qvwjMmyvUXd5y5o.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:248960'),
  ('726612418832787102', 'Atashin''chi', 2002, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Kumiko Watanabe, Fumiko Orikasa, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Kenichi Ogata', null, 'A light hearted comedy based on the about the daily life of a "normal" Japanese family. The Tachibana family consists of a housewife mom, a salary-man dad, and teenager Mikan and Yuzuhiko.', 'A light hearted comedy based on the about the daily life of a "normal" Japanese family. The Tachibana family consists of a housewife mom, a salary-man dad, and teenager Mikan and Yuzuhiko.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bQCZvbyTJFWt3majCn37ykJBpIf.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:9537'),
  ('577060732782059494', 'Atelier', 2015, 'Drama', 'Naoko Adachi', null, 'Mirei Kiritani, Mao Daichi, Mayuko Kawakita, Ken Kaito, Wakana Sakai, Maiko, Masako Chiba, Nicole Ishida', 'TV-PG', 'A young "fabric geek" lands a job at an upscale Japanese lingerie company — and quickly discovers she''ll need help to survive.', 'A young "fabric geek" lands a job at an upscale Japanese lingerie company — and quickly discovers she''ll need help to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJbIqJMPxxnp9WwiZlmLdyqzUjP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65584'),
  ('828721555088558629', 'Atelier Escha & Logy: Alchemists of the Dusk Sky', 2014, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Rie Murakawa, Kaito Ishikawa, Mariko Honda, Kenji Akabane, Yasunori Masutani, Chiharu Kitaoka', 'TV-14', 'In order to survive the eventual arrival of the "Dusk End," people of the western reaches of the "Land of Dusk" devoted their efforts to rediscover and recreate lost alchemic technologies. Those technologies were then gathered in the alchemy city known as "Central," where research was conducted on how to halt the advance of the twilight. Having learned the newest alchemic techniques in Central, young alchemist Logy requested a transfer to an understaffed town of Colseit on the frontier to make use of his abilities. There he meets Escha, an apprentice girl assigned to the Development Department. Together, the two make a promise to use their alchemic techniques to bring success to the Development Department.', 'In order to survive the eventual arrival of the "Dusk End," people of the western reaches of the "Land of Dusk" devoted their efforts to rediscover and recreate lost alchemic technologies. Those technologies were then gathered in the alchemy city known as "Central," where research was conducted on how to halt the advance of the twilight. Having learned the newest alchemic techniques in Central, young alchemist Logy requested a transfer to an understaffed town of Colseit on the frontier to make use of his abilities. There he meets Escha, an apprentice girl assigned to the Development Department. Together, the two make a promise to use their alchemic techniques to bring success to the Development Department.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pShJY1Ex8r8RkmPSgPrdTDBdXJa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60819'),
  ('1004402365754484390', 'Atelier Ryza: Ever Darkness & the Secret Hideout the Animation', 2023, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Yuri Noguchi, Hitomi Ohwada, Takuma Terashima, Yui Kondo, Hirofumi Nojima, Haruka Terui', 'TV-14', 'Ryza is an ordinary girl. Tired of boring village life, she escapes the village to gather with her good friends in a secret location to talk of their dreams and plan thrilling adventures. One day, the determined Ryza and company decide to head for the forbidden "island across the shore" as their first exploration trip. Together with the alchemist and other friends they meet there, they have a "summer adventure" that they will never forget.', 'Ryza is an ordinary girl. Tired of boring village life, she escapes the village to gather with her good friends in a secret location to talk of their dreams and plan thrilling adventures. One day, the determined Ryza and company decide to head for the forbidden "island across the shore" as their first exploration trip. Together with the alchemist and other friends they meet there, they have a "summer adventure" that they will never forget.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kN9h3DtTqQD4gruBHFttKAT2rkH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222625'),
  ('771738486601059537', 'Athena: Goddess of War', 2010, 'Drama', null, 'Kim Hyeon-jun', 'Jung Woo-sung, Cha Seung-won, Soo Ae, Lee Ji-ah, Choi Si-won, Kim Min-jong, Kim Seung-woo, Oh Yoon-ah', null, 'Athena: Goddess of War is a South Korean espionage television drama series broadcast by SBS in 2010 and a spin-off of 2009''s Iris. Budgeted at ₩20 billion like its predecessor, the two series are among the most expensive Korean dramas ever produced. Starring Jung Woo-sung, Cha Seung-won, Soo Ae, and Lee Ji-ah, the series premiered in December 2010 after filming in a number of overseas locations, including Italy, New Zealand, Japan, and the United States. The series is set in the same universe as its predecessor, allowing for select characters from Iris to reprise their roles throughout the story.', 'Athena: Goddess of War is a South Korean espionage television drama series broadcast by SBS in 2010 and a spin-off of 2009''s Iris. Budgeted at ₩20 billion like its predecessor, the two series are among the most expensive Korean dramas ever produced. Starring Jung Woo-sung, Cha Seung-won, Soo Ae, and Lee Ji-ah, the series premiered in December 2010 after filming in a number of overseas locations, including Italy, New Zealand, Japan, and the United States. The series is set in the same universe as its predecessor, allowing for select characters from Iris to reprise their roles throughout the story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gp0NbwT8sAu8f1owB9lMRTbGHXq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32437'),
  ('132534085317734340', 'Atlanta', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Donald Glover', null, 'Donald Glover, Brian Tyree Henry, LaKeith Stanfield, Zazie Beetz', 'TV-MA', 'Two cousins work through the Atlanta music scene in order to better their lives and the lives of their families.', 'Two cousins work through the Atlanta music scene in order to better their lives and the lives of their families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8HZyGMnPLVVb00rmrh6A2SbK9NX.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:65495'),
  ('1091517263046583368', 'Atlanta''s Missing and Murdered: The Lost Children', 2020, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'This docuseries explores the period between 1979 and 1981 when at least 30 African-American children and young adults disappeared or were murdered in Atlanta, Georgia.', 'This docuseries explores the period between 1979 and 1981 when at least 30 African-American children and young adults disappeared or were murdered in Atlanta, Georgia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sj7ypoywE2RooXnTjcggd0ooYPC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100369'),
  ('1104501737350496442', 'Atlantic Crossing', 2020, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Alexander Eik', null, 'Sofia Helin, Kyle MacLachlan, Tobias Santelmann, Søren Pilmark, Harriet Sansom Harris, Daniel Betts, Lucy Russell, Suzanne Bertish', 'TV-14', 'The incredible, true story of the Norwegian Crown Princess Märtha’s efforts to support her country during World War II. After a headlong flight from the Nazis, she was forced to part from her husband and cross the Atlantic Ocean to seek refuge in the United States. There, she soon found herself involved in a close relationship with the President of the United States: Franklin D. Roosevelt.', 'The incredible, true story of the Norwegian Crown Princess Märtha’s efforts to support her country during World War II. After a headlong flight from the Nazis, she was forced to part from her husband and cross the Atlantic Ocean to seek refuge in the United States. There, she soon found herself involved in a close relationship with the President of the United States: Franklin D. Roosevelt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPJgbaxEWUOsZpfJlnBtDNOH6uX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96919'),
  ('124525269367773209', 'Atlantis', 2013, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Howard Overman', null, 'Mark Addy, Jack Donnelly, Robert Emms, Aiysha Hart, Sarah Parish, Juliet Stevenson, Jemima Rooper, Amy Manson', 'TV-PG', 'A fantasy drama set in a world of legendary heroes and mythical creatures. Far from home and desperate for answers, Jason washes up on the shores of an ancient land. A mysterious place; a world of bull leaping, of snake haired goddesses and of palaces so vast it was said they were built by giants - this is the city of Atlantis. Aided by his two new friends, Pythagoras and Hercules, Jason embarks on a voyage of discovery, and salvation, which sees him brush shoulders with Medusa, come face to face with the Minotaur and even do battle with the dead.', 'A fantasy drama set in a world of legendary heroes and mythical creatures. Far from home and desperate for answers, Jason washes up on the shores of an ancient land. A mysterious place; a world of bull leaping, of snake haired goddesses and of palaces so vast it was said they were built by giants - this is the city of Atlantis. Aided by his two new friends, Pythagoras and Hercules, Jason embarks on a voyage of discovery, and salvation, which sees him brush shoulders with Medusa, come face to face with the Minotaur and even do battle with the dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bmdlBu7y0pZq3KZwtFFHzWPEsbP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:47054'),
  ('1028806221335389226', 'Atom', 2007, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Jim Al-Khalili', 'NR', 'The story of the discovery that everything is made from atoms, one of the greatest scientific breakthroughs in history, and the brilliant minds behind it.', 'The story of the discovery that everything is made from atoms, one of the greatest scientific breakthroughs in history, and the brilliant minds behind it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/frVWcn3DSEpsqmUxpJUUMo8KXVP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37934'),
  ('806365712486573845', 'Atom: The Beginning', 2017, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Takuma Terashima, Yuichi Nakamura, Yuki Inoue, Mikako Komatsu, Yoshino Nanjo, Ayane Sakura, Kengo Kawanishi, Mitsuki Saiga', null, 'Japan in the near future suffers an unexplained major disaster. Five years later, reconstruction is well underway. Two young researchers at a university are pinning all their hopes on robot development. Now their new interpretation of the eternal hero Astro Boy up until his birth is just about to start!', 'Japan in the near future suffers an unexplained major disaster. Five years later, reconstruction is well underway. Two young researchers at a university are pinning all their hopes on robot development. Now their new interpretation of the eternal hero Astro Boy up until his birth is just about to start!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AiAFZiPnqvDpMq38eU69Gi3AOUe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70886'),
  ('1127102246138625093', 'Atom''s Last Shot', 2022, 'Drama', 'Okamoto Shingo, Daisuke Yamamuro', 'Marie Kamimori', 'Kento Yamazaki, Kouhei Matsushita, Yukino Kishii, Joe Odagiri, Dai Okabe, Shuntaro Yanagi, Muga Tsukaji, Denden', null, 'Nayuta is a young genius video game developer who works independently. His anonymity had gained him the moniker “the Banksy of video games,” until a certain incident caused him to shy away from games and live quietly. Meanwhile, the long-standing toy company Atom decides to delve into the video game industry in order to overcome their financial crisis. With no funds or experience, the people at Atom make a desperate attempt to contact Nayuta, the Banksy of video games, but will they succeed? Can they write a new chapter in the cut-throat world of video games', 'Nayuta is a young genius video game developer who works independently. His anonymity had gained him the moniker “the Banksy of video games,” until a certain incident caused him to shy away from games and live quietly. Meanwhile, the long-standing toy company Atom decides to delve into the video game industry in order to overcome their financial crisis. With no funds or experience, the people at Atom make a desperate attempt to contact Nayuta, the Banksy of video games, but will they succeed? Can they write a new chapter in the cut-throat world of video games', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5js5usiiBQO72Gzj84ZiYoRcHFT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211565'),
  ('415036381803358281', 'Atomes crochus', 2010, null, null, null, 'Alexandre Barrette', null, 'A hilarious game show in which two contestants and a panel of six stars attempt to fill in the "hole" left in a wacky sentence. The contestant who goes to the final game has a chance to walk away with the grand prize if they play in perfect symbiosis with a randomly selected star.', 'A hilarious game show in which two contestants and a panel of six stars attempt to fill in the "hole" left in a wacky sentence. The contestant who goes to the final game has a chance to walk away with the grand prize if they play in perfect symbiosis with a randomly selected star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/53SD7k0jGQXwdfDwejGYWFneDfe.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:64488'),
  ('981036713574011168', 'Atomic', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Gregory Burke, Alfie Allen, Shazad Latif', null, 'Alfie Allen, Shazad Latif, Samira Wiley, Avital Lvova, Stuart Martin, Franklin Vírgüez, Charlie Murphy, Brian Gleeson', null, 'When the path of free-spirited drug smuggler Max collides with JJ, an enigmatic outsider on the run, an unlikely friendship is formed. They''re swept into a chaotic, high-stakes mission they never signed up for, trafficking highly enriched uranium across North Africa and the Middle East, with the CIA, MI6, and a global web of opposing forces closing in fast.', 'When the path of free-spirited drug smuggler Max collides with JJ, an enigmatic outsider on the run, an unlikely friendship is formed. They''re swept into a chaotic, high-stakes mission they never signed up for, trafficking highly enriched uranium across North Africa and the Middle East, with the CIA, MI6, and a global web of opposing forces closing in fast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVpapvAdSQEE5OZOxOvjVlFZhYx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:254701'),
  ('669946307978234014', 'Atomic Betty', 2004, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Kids', 'Trevor Bentley, Mauro Casalese, Bob Davies', null, 'Catherine Disher, Colin Fox, Tajja Isen, Kristina Nicoll, Peter Oldring, Robin Duke, Laurie Elliott, Adrian Truss', 'TV-Y7', 'Seemingly ordinary Betty Barrett lives a double life as she fights crime with the help of a loud-mouthed alien and a know-it-all robot, protecting the galaxy from the evil clutches of Maximus IQ.', 'Seemingly ordinary Betty Barrett lives a double life as she fights crime with the help of a loud-mouthed alien and a know-it-all robot, protecting the galaxy from the evil clutches of Maximus IQ.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2yhMWAmzKcCTgTSh1UkdFxTMLke.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2030'),
  ('1099195790636473813', 'Atomic Train', 1999, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'David Jackson, Dick Lowry', null, 'Rob Lowe, Kristin Davis, Mena Suvari, Esai Morales, John Finn, Erik King, Blu Mankuma, Don S. Davis', null, 'A train carrying a Russian atomic weapon is on a runaway course with disaster - and time''s running out! Only John Seger, a renegade investigator for the NTSB, can stop the speeding locomotive.', 'A train carrying a Russian atomic weapon is on a runaway course with disaster - and time''s running out! Only John Seger, a renegade investigator for the NTSB, can stop the speeding locomotive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7lAf5faocOuXt487xckx7LZNjE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74170'),
  ('68841870391280944', 'Atrévete a Olvidarme', 2001, 'Soap, Drama', 'Martha Carrillo', 'María Eugenia Argomedo', 'Adriana Fonseca, Jorge Salinas, Mariana Seoane, Alexis Ayala, Ignacio López Tarso, José Carlos Ruiz, Ana Martín, Macaria', null, 'Atrévete a Olvidarme is a short-lived Mexican telenovela. Running for only one month in 2001, the program starred Adriana Fonseca and Jorge Salinas.', 'Atrévete a Olvidarme is a short-lived Mexican telenovela. Running for only one month in 2001, the program starred Adriana Fonseca and Jorge Salinas.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:59159'),
  ('42762631573118539', 'Atrévete a Soñar', 2009, 'Drama', 'Martha Oláiz, María Eugenia Argomedo', null, 'Vanessa Guzmán, René Strickler, Cynthia Klitbo, Danna Paola, Violeta Isfel, Eleazar Gómez, Julissa, Adriana Ahumada', 'NR', 'Danna Paola stars as Patito, Eleazar Gómez as Mateo, Violeta Isfel and Cynthia Klitbo, play antagonist roles as Antonella and Bianca. The telenovela features adult protagonists also, René Strickler and Vanessa Guzmán. It first aired on Sunday, 8 March 2009, as the first telenovela to debut on a Sunday in Mexico. After a year of success, becoming a major hit in Mexico, especially among children, its final episode was also on a Sunday, 7 March 2010.', 'Danna Paola stars as Patito, Eleazar Gómez as Mateo, Violeta Isfel and Cynthia Klitbo, play antagonist roles as Antonella and Bianca. The telenovela features adult protagonists also, René Strickler and Vanessa Guzmán. It first aired on Sunday, 8 March 2009, as the first telenovela to debut on a Sunday in Mexico. After a year of success, becoming a major hit in Mexico, especially among children, its final episode was also on a Sunday, 7 March 2010.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5l9c4cjcauBpogEqaVbsITHA47K.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:18350'),
  ('802892396849647993', 'ATRI -My Dear Moments-', 2024, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kensho Ono, Hikaru Akao, Minami Takahashi, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Yoko Hikasa, Anzu Haruno', 'TV-14', 'In the near future, a sudden and unexplained sea rise has left much of human civilization underwater. Ikaruga Natsuki, a boy who lost his mother and one of his legs in an accident some years earlier, returns disillusioned from a harsh life in the big city to find his old countryside home half-swallowed by the sea. Left without a family, all he has to his name is the ship and submarine left to him by his oceanologist grandmother, and her debts. His only hope to restore the dreams for the future that he has lost is to take up an opportunity presented to him by the suspicious debt collector Catherine. They set sail to search the sunken ruins of his grandmother''s laboratory in order to find a treasure rumor says she left there. But what they find is not riches or jewels; it is a strange girl lying asleep in a coffin at the bottom of the sea, Atri. Atri is a robot, but her appearance and her wealth of emotions would fool anyone into thinking she''s a living, breathing human being.', 'In the near future, a sudden and unexplained sea rise has left much of human civilization underwater. Ikaruga Natsuki, a boy who lost his mother and one of his legs in an accident some years earlier, returns disillusioned from a harsh life in the big city to find his old countryside home half-swallowed by the sea. Left without a family, all he has to his name is the ship and submarine left to him by his oceanologist grandmother, and her debts. His only hope to restore the dreams for the future that he has lost is to take up an opportunity presented to him by the suspicious debt collector Catherine. They set sail to search the sunken ruins of his grandmother''s laboratory in order to find a treasure rumor says she left there. But what they find is not riches or jewels; it is a strange girl lying asleep in a coffin at the bottom of the sea, Atri. Atri is a robot, but her appearance and her wealth of emotions would fool anyone into thinking she''s a living, breathing human being.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8r5dCiCwejHJhcE09KEoSZEg4p5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210875'),
  ('446281975195115540', 'Atsuhime', 2008, 'Drama', 'Tomiko Miyao', null, 'Aoi Miyazaki, Eita Nagayama, Maki Horikita, Rie Tomosaka, Ikki Sawamura, Hideki Takahashi, Taizo Harada, Kimiko Yo', null, 'The 47th NHK Taiga Drama is a life story of Princess Atsu, who was born in Kagoshima Prefecture, then called Satsuma, and became the wife of Tokugawa Iesada, the 13th shogun of the Tokugawa shogunate. She accedes to the highest rank in Ooku, the inner palace of the Edo castle where women related to the reigning shogun resided. Iesada dies soon after their marriage and Atsuhime assumes the name Tenshoin at the age of 23. She exerts herself for the Tokugawa clan and for the nation during the upheaval in the Meiji Restoration, headed by those from Satsuma.', 'The 47th NHK Taiga Drama is a life story of Princess Atsu, who was born in Kagoshima Prefecture, then called Satsuma, and became the wife of Tokugawa Iesada, the 13th shogun of the Tokugawa shogunate. She accedes to the highest rank in Ooku, the inner palace of the Edo castle where women related to the reigning shogun resided. Iesada dies soon after their marriage and Atsuhime assumes the name Tenshoin at the age of 23. She exerts herself for the Tokugawa clan and for the nation during the upheaval in the Meiji Restoration, headed by those from Satsuma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GQI2JeAIgsk5Ic4lJpawD5MY3O.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:20573'),
  ('743656827648222689', 'Attack Number One', 1969, 'Animation, Drama', 'Chikako Urano', null, 'Sumie Sakai, Kurumi Kobato, Masahiko Murase, Katsuji Mori, Keiko Yamamoto, Masako Ebisu, Reiko Mutoh', 'TV-PG', 'The story is about Kozue Ayuhara, a girl who transferred to Fujimi College and tried out for the school volleyball team. She develops a friendship with her teammate Midori Hayakawa, and her talents impress coach Hongō more and more each day. Though she showcases extraordinary volleyball skills, she makes enemies with Yoshimura, the star of the current team. Kozue discovers that being at the top would bring stress, incompatibilities and other dilemmas into her life. Her high expectations of becoming the best volleyball player in the school, Japan and eventually the world, set the tone for the drama to follow.', 'The story is about Kozue Ayuhara, a girl who transferred to Fujimi College and tried out for the school volleyball team. She develops a friendship with her teammate Midori Hayakawa, and her talents impress coach Hongō more and more each day. Though she showcases extraordinary volleyball skills, she makes enemies with Yoshimura, the star of the current team. Kozue discovers that being at the top would bring stress, incompatibilities and other dilemmas into her life. Her high expectations of becoming the best volleyball player in the school, Japan and eventually the world, set the tone for the drama to follow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubdlKL4ejScebWB6dmLpwCtXQUH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46348'),
  ('946167598007608381', 'Attack of the Killer Tomatoes', 1990, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', null, null, 'Kath Soucie, Christian Guzek, John Astin, Cam Clarke, S. Scott Bullock, Thom Bray, Maurice LaMarche, Neil Ross', null, 'A group of people thwart a mad scientist trying to take over the world with evil mutated tomatoes that he can change into people.', 'A group of people thwart a mad scientist trying to take over the world with evil mutated tomatoes that he can change into people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AuP1wqOy2yLfqHmLUHPhDveHiCx.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:11044'),
  ('106588633957707674', 'Attack of the Show!', 2005, 'News, Comedy', null, null, 'Kevin Pereira, Candace Bailey, Alison Haislip, Chris Hardwick', null, 'Attack of the Show! is an American live television program that formerly aired weeknights on G4, G4 Canada Fuel TV, HOW TO Channel, and Maxxx. Episodes were hosted by Kevin Pereira, Olivia Munn, Zach Selwyn, Layla Kayleigh, Sarah Lane, Alison Haislip, Candace Bailey, and Sara Underwood. Attack of the Show! reviewed new technological items, parodies, pop culture, and general daily news, and gave previews of video games, movies, and digital media.', 'Attack of the Show! is an American live television program that formerly aired weeknights on G4, G4 Canada Fuel TV, HOW TO Channel, and Maxxx. Episodes were hosted by Kevin Pereira, Olivia Munn, Zach Selwyn, Layla Kayleigh, Sarah Lane, Alison Haislip, Candace Bailey, and Sara Underwood. Attack of the Show! reviewed new technological items, parodies, pop culture, and general daily news, and gave previews of video games, movies, and digital media.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jmaVEytsCdkJaEjlJUsiKAKn2lb.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:13453'),
  ('280275441672194165', 'Attack on London: Hunting the 7/7 Bombers', 2025, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Doug McKenna, Tony Blair, Peter Clarke, Eliza Manningham-Buller, Dan Biddle, Cliff Todd', 'TV-MA', 'Insider accounts and never-seen-before footage tell the story of the 7/7 bombings on London''s transport network in 2005 — and its explosive aftermath.', 'Insider accounts and never-seen-before footage tell the story of the 7/7 bombings on London''s transport network in 2005 — and its explosive aftermath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJGFiBuLAr8wZRL4u6esqeZivNm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:262277'),
  ('127724164498620238', 'Attack on Titan', 2013, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Yuki Kaji, Yui Ishikawa, Marina Inoue, Kisho Taniyama, Hiro Shimono, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Takehito Koyasu, Ayane Sakura', 'TV-MA', '100 years ago, the last remnants of humanity were forced to retreat behind the towering walls of a fortified city to escape the massive, man-eating Titans that roamed the land outside their fortress. Only the members of the Scouting Legion dared to stray beyond the safety of the walls – but even those brave warriors seldom returned alive. Those within the city clung to the illusion of a peaceful existence until the day that dream was shattered, and their slim chance at survival was reduced to one horrifying choice: kill – or be devoured!', '100 years ago, the last remnants of humanity were forced to retreat behind the towering walls of a fortified city to escape the massive, man-eating Titans that roamed the land outside their fortress. Only the members of the Scouting Legion dared to stray beyond the safety of the walls – but even those brave warriors seldom returned alive. Those within the city clung to the illusion of a peaceful existence until the day that dream was shattered, and their slim chance at survival was reduced to one horrifying choice: kill – or be devoured!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTP1DtLGFamjfu8WqjnuQdP1n4i.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1429'),
  ('28501447726478914', 'Attack on Titan: Counter Rockets', 2015, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Satomi Ishihara, Hitomi Miyauchi, Rina Takeda, Shu Watanabe, Yuta Hiraoka', null, 'The daily lives and secrets of the soldiers of the Scout Regiment.', 'The daily lives and secrets of the soldiers of the Scout Regiment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6oKXmDiGhbCfaZKPjWCpMSfG9SH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65242'),
  ('759256335768377898', 'Attack on Titan: Junior High', 2015, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuki Kaji, Yui Ishikawa, Marina Inoue, Hiroshi Kamiya, Yu Kobayashi, Romi Park, Kisho Taniyama, Hiro Shimono', 'TV-14', 'Your favorite characters from Attack on Titan are back in…junior high school? Adapted from the hit spinoff manga series—Attack on Titan: Junior High (written by Saki Nakagawa), this parody reimagines Eren, Mikasa, Armin, and other characters from the original manga as students and teachers at Titan Junior High School.', 'Your favorite characters from Attack on Titan are back in…junior high school? Adapted from the hit spinoff manga series—Attack on Titan: Junior High (written by Saki Nakagawa), this parody reimagines Eren, Mikasa, Armin, and other characters from the original manga as students and teachers at Titan Junior High School.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/el6yFiXQxiPLZLCJsukAI9UTI6J.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63510'),
  ('137821212974779030', 'Attack, Jun', 1979, 'Drama', null, null, 'Yumiko Araki, Yutaka Nanjō, Tamaki Funakura, Ban Kojika, Kakuko Motoyama, Sumio Hoshi, Katsuya Hayakawa, Chie Kawashima', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBnqlwABhzTq9dMeYQmwEO8Xcv1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67560'),
  ('298520744791779963', 'Attacker You!', 1984, 'Animation', null, null, 'Yuko Kobayashi, Kenyu Horiuchi, Yumi Takada, Naoko Matsui, Kumiko Takizawa, Kazuyuki Sogabe, Shigezo Sasaoka, Satoko Kitô', null, 'Attacker You! is the story of ambitious and energetic 13-year-old junior high schoolgirl You Hazuki (variously known as "Mila," "Jeanne" or "Juana" in Western dubbed versions of the anime), who moves to Tokyo from Osaka to live with her father Toshihiko, a cameraman recently returned from Peru, and attend school. You''s mother is not in the picture, having left when You was very young. Also living with You and her father is her younger brother Sunny, who is very attached to his older sister and tends to follow her everywhere she goes, including to school and to her volleyball matches. You is also curious about Kyushi Tajima, the pretty blonde woman whom she sees covering volleyball games on television, and about why her father becomes very angry whenever You mentions her.', 'Attacker You! is the story of ambitious and energetic 13-year-old junior high schoolgirl You Hazuki (variously known as "Mila," "Jeanne" or "Juana" in Western dubbed versions of the anime), who moves to Tokyo from Osaka to live with her father Toshihiko, a cameraman recently returned from Peru, and attend school. You''s mother is not in the picture, having left when You was very young. Also living with You and her father is her younger brother Sunny, who is very attached to his older sister and tends to follow her everywhere she goes, including to school and to her volleyball matches. You is also curious about Kyushi Tajima, the pretty blonde woman whom she sees covering volleyball games on television, and about why her father becomes very angry whenever You mentions her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6iiSUJbxIA2XiFfEZCHk15LmlOG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9477'),
  ('603608295048832851', 'Attaway General', 2020, 'Drama', null, null, 'Daniel Burgess-Wise, Bree Mignano, Jennifer Castillo, M''Kaila Brown, Jacob Rodriguez, Liza Ariza', 'TV-Y7', 'When four very different teens arrive at Attaway General Hospital’s prestigious volunteer program, they must learn to work together to survive the program and make a difference in the lives of their patients. With breakout performances from Dixie D''Amelio, Madi Monroe and more, Attaway General is a medical procedural with humor, excitement, and high stakes.', 'When four very different teens arrive at Attaway General Hospital’s prestigious volunteer program, they must learn to work together to survive the program and make a difference in the lives of their patients. With breakout performances from Dixie D''Amelio, Madi Monroe and more, Attaway General is a medical procedural with humor, excitement, and high stakes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Av8lcAEmjQD9wsY9fu8aKyqB6S.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:103797'),
  ('28554272097976049', 'Attenborough''s Life in Colour', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'David Attenborough', 'TV-PG', 'Exploring the vital role colour plays in the daily lives of many species.', 'Exploring the vital role colour plays in the daily lives of many species.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mIanPgm20EZyASoPayPUrDmeEH1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:119815'),
  ('950200810438898195', 'Attila', 2001, 'Drama', null, 'Robert Cochran', 'Gerard Butler, Powers Boothe, Simmone Mackinnon, Reg Rogers, Alice Krige, Pauline Lynch, Steven Berkoff, Tommy Flanagan', null, 'Attila was an American TV miniseries set during the waning days of the Western Roman Empire, in particular during the invasions of the Huns in Europe.', 'Attila was an American TV miniseries set during the waning days of the Western Roman Empire, in particular during the invasions of the Huns in Europe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e8sSkLQ9CMH9nckLk5RSc0gxOfh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16072'),
  ('176276693851942407', 'Atypical', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Robia Rashid', null, 'Keir Gilchrist, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Jack Haven, Michael Rapaport', 'TV-14', 'Sam, an 18-year-old on the autism spectrum, takes a funny, yet painful, journey of self-discovery for love and independence and upends his family.', 'Sam, an 18-year-old on the autism spectrum, takes a funny, yet painful, journey of self-discovery for love and independence and upends his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNif3eZAjQ7qU3Ol9E7zo0kjPMo.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:71578'),
  ('659341058596372895', 'Au Revoir Shanghai', 2008, null, null, null, 'Michael Miu Kiu-Wai, Bosco Wong Chung-Chak, Anne Heung Hoi-Lam, Shirley Yeung Sze-Kei, Power Chan Kwok-Pong, Derek Kwok Jing-Hung, Eddy Ko Hung, Ngo Ka-Nin', null, 'The story takes place in the 1930s. NIP CHUN (MIU KIU WAI), one of the most influential gang leaders in Shanghai for the past twenty years, decides to step down after the sudden death of his wife. He earns his living by selling Shanghai steamed buns, and to make it up to HO SHUI-SAU (HEUNG HOI LAN, ANNE), he hires the lady as his helper. His withdrawal from gang activities has deeply disappointed SHEK SAI-KAU (WONG CHUNG CHAK, BOSCO), who is an ardent follower of him. CHUN was determined not to get involved with any criminal activities. But when he finds out that WU TAI-TSUEN, a buddy from his gang, may have something to do with his wife’s death, and when he sees how his former gang mates are mysteriously killed one by one...', 'The story takes place in the 1930s. NIP CHUN (MIU KIU WAI), one of the most influential gang leaders in Shanghai for the past twenty years, decides to step down after the sudden death of his wife. He earns his living by selling Shanghai steamed buns, and to make it up to HO SHUI-SAU (HEUNG HOI LAN, ANNE), he hires the lady as his helper. His withdrawal from gang activities has deeply disappointed SHEK SAI-KAU (WONG CHUNG CHAK, BOSCO), who is an ardent follower of him. CHUN was determined not to get involved with any criminal activities. But when he finds out that WU TAI-TSUEN, a buddy from his gang, may have something to do with his wife’s death, and when he sees how his former gang mates are mysteriously killed one by one...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/txqEqz0G6VzNhbOCM7X49SlAbid.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109659'),
  ('294072478774556789', 'Auction Hunters', 2010, 'Reality', null, null, 'Allen Lee Haff, Clinton ''Ton'' Jones', 'TV-PG', 'Auction Hunters is an American reality television series that premiered on November 9, 2010, on Spike and is produced by Gurney Productions Inc. It also airs internationally. In June 2011, Spike announced that it had ordered a third season of 26 episodes. In August 2012, Spike announced that it had ordered a fourth season of 26 episodes. The fourth season premiered on January 30, 2013.', 'Auction Hunters is an American reality television series that premiered on November 9, 2010, on Spike and is produced by Gurney Productions Inc. It also airs internationally. In June 2011, Spike announced that it had ordered a third season of 26 episodes. In August 2012, Spike announced that it had ordered a fourth season of 26 episodes. The fourth season premiered on January 30, 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbkGPIK6I8yOhMqCA14hUsW5eGh.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:34575'),
  ('1078068943274948113', 'Auf Achse', 1980, 'Action & Adventure', 'Joseph Vilsmaier, Georg Feil, Hartmut Griesmayr', null, 'Manfred Krug, Monica Bleibtreu, Rüdiger Kirschstein, Armin Rohde', null, 'The adventures of a group of German truckers on jobs all over the world.', 'The adventures of a group of German truckers on jobs all over the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3ESUdzxmPABLstbcelU5WNGvTQ.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:6855'),
  ('781062677670312485', 'Auf Wiedersehen, Pet', 1983, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Franc Roddam', null, 'Tim Healy, Kevin Whately, Jimmy Nail, Christopher Fairbank, Timothy Spall, Pat Roach, Julia Tobin, Zoë Eeles', null, 'Seven British construction workers escape Britain''s ever growing dole queues and travel to Germany to work on a site in Dusseldorf. We follow their trials and tribulations of working away from home and away from the women they left behind.', 'Seven British construction workers escape Britain''s ever growing dole queues and travel to Germany to work on a site in Dusseldorf. We follow their trials and tribulations of working away from home and away from the women they left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zm2idxDPAVDx97mF3neoJn9MhmY.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:4628'),
  ('586811753800415475', 'Aufschneider', 2010, 'Comedy, Crime', 'David Schalko', null, 'Josef Hader, Ursula Strauss, Pia Hierzegger, Tanja Raunig, Georg Friedrich, Raimund Wallisch, Manuel Rubey, Simon Schwarz', null, 'Fuhrmann''s colleague Dr. Wehninger has abducted her deceased father from the pathology department to her home in order to prevent an autopsy, and it is only with great difficulty that Fuhrmann manages to persuade her to turn back. But it''s not that easy to get to the hospital with a dead body without being recognized. Fuhrmann himself remains stubbornly confrontational, especially when it comes to Dr. Böck, and even more so since it turns out that Böck and Fuhrmann''s ex-wife are expecting a child together. Assistant Dr. Winkler encounters unexpected difficulties when he discovers that the prosector''s assistant and the mortician are engaged in a lively trade in corneas from deceased patients. They are not about to let this business go to waste without a fight.', 'Fuhrmann''s colleague Dr. Wehninger has abducted her deceased father from the pathology department to her home in order to prevent an autopsy, and it is only with great difficulty that Fuhrmann manages to persuade her to turn back. But it''s not that easy to get to the hospital with a dead body without being recognized. Fuhrmann himself remains stubbornly confrontational, especially when it comes to Dr. Böck, and even more so since it turns out that Böck and Fuhrmann''s ex-wife are expecting a child together. Assistant Dr. Winkler encounters unexpected difficulties when he discovers that the prosector''s assistant and the mortician are engaged in a lively trade in corneas from deceased patients. They are not about to let this business go to waste without a fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNVeosU1xiNqT9BlU6iTs9gLpu1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43763'),
  ('182730983749295655', 'Augie Doggie and Doggie Daddy', 1959, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', 'Michael Maltese', 'Daws Butler, Doug Young', null, 'Augie Doggie and Doggie Daddy are Hanna-Barbera cartoon characters who debuted on The Quick Draw McGraw Show and appeared in their own segment of that show.', 'Augie Doggie and Doggie Daddy are Hanna-Barbera cartoon characters who debuted on The Quick Draw McGraw Show and appeared in their own segment of that show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hEnbZzRBmlx713Mc4Sg1hpiK2rt.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:19053'),
