  ('1073225916765048180', 'Aura Battler Dunbine', 1983, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics, Action & Adventure', 'Yoshiyuki Tomino', null, 'Shigeru Nakahara, Mika Doi, Maria Kawamura, Michie Tomizawa, Masako Ikeda, Norio Wakamoto, Miki Takahashi, Fumihiko Tachiki', 'TV-14', 'After a motocross accident, Sho Zama was pulled from Japan into the mystical world of Byston Well, where he and others from Earth were reicruited by Lord Drake Luft to pilot his newest weapons, the Aura Battlers, a combination of Byston Well magic and Earthien technology. However, in the heat of battle, Sho is approached by Marvel, a woman from Earth, who convinces him of Luft''s sinister intentions.', 'After a motocross accident, Sho Zama was pulled from Japan into the mystical world of Byston Well, where he and others from Earth were reicruited by Lord Drake Luft to pilot his newest weapons, the Aura Battlers, a combination of Byston Well magic and Earthien technology. However, in the heat of battle, Sho is approached by Marvel, a woman from Earth, who convinces him of Luft''s sinister intentions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5PtPwM1r86RoBCCyHfpPCKdOtPt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34190'),
  ('120946538221703968', 'Aurora', 2010, 'Mystery, Soap, Drama, Crime', 'Marcela Citterio', 'Consuelo Anzola, Claudia Morales, Juan Marcos Blanco', 'Sara Maldonado, Eugenio Siller, Sonya Smith, Jorge Luis Pila, Aylín Mújica, Lisette Morelos, Vanessa Pose, Carolina Tejera', 'NR', 'Having been cryogenically frozen for 20 years, Aurora''s heart torn between past and present : memories of an old love and chance of a new one.', 'Having been cryogenically frozen for 20 years, Aurora''s heart torn between past and present : memories of an old love and chance of a new one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sAfj9bfJ9c0jf2lPl14oISIEfJp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34035'),
  ('28948164935012196', 'Auschwitz: The Nazis and the Final Solution', 2005, 'Documentary, Crime, War & Politics', null, null, 'Linda Ellerbee, Linda Hunt, Samuel West, Linda Ellerbee, Horst-Günter Marx, Gordon Newell', 'TV-MA', 'This documentary series tackles one of history''s most horrifying subjects: the Holocaust and the infamous Auschwitz-Birkenau concentration camp.', 'This documentary series tackles one of history''s most horrifying subjects: the Holocaust and the infamous Auschwitz-Birkenau concentration camp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLomUa8wQd8IKursGSuGW2n6kt2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:7361'),
  ('396710413528720671', 'Aussie Gold Hunters', 2016, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Three hard-core crews of gold prospectors take the gamble of a lifetime and battle to strike it big, deep in the wild west of outback Australia. The soaring highs and the crushing lows of the gold season are revealed as the crews pursue their all-important targets - braving brutal heat, punishing conditions, mechanical breakdowns and constant pressure.', 'Three hard-core crews of gold prospectors take the gamble of a lifetime and battle to strike it big, deep in the wild west of outback Australia. The soaring highs and the crushing lows of the gold season are revealed as the crews pursue their all-important targets - braving brutal heat, punishing conditions, mechanical breakdowns and constant pressure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pZfb5gtb0ZuzmJH7ka0tRPfDwIY.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:71322'),
  ('77239567307259359', 'Austin', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Joe Tucker, Lloyd Woolf, Ben Miller', null, 'Claire Lovering', null, 'A best-selling, but recently cancelled, children''s author has a meltdown when approached by Austin, a neurodivergent 20-something claiming to be his son. He then realises that embracing the young man may be the path to redemption.', 'A best-selling, but recently cancelled, children''s author has a meltdown when approached by Austin, a neurodivergent 20-something claiming to be his son. He then realises that embracing the young man may be the path to redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hgDf5LOkJ9HS2egAitWT2AgEI5v.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:256371'),
  ('1510266037299567', 'Austin & Ally', 2011, 'Comedy, Kids, Drama', 'Heath Seifert, Kevin Kopelow', null, 'Ross Lynch, Laura Marano, Raini Rodriguez, Calum Worthy', 'TV-G', 'A comedy about the unique relationship between a young songwriter, Ally Dawson, and Austin Moon, the overnight internet sensation who gains sudden notoriety after performing one of Ally''s songs. Austin and Ally struggle with how to maintain and capitalize on Austin''s newfound fame. Austin is more of a rebel type who doesn''t follow the rules and is somewhat immature for his age, while Ally is conservative yet self-conscious.', 'A comedy about the unique relationship between a young songwriter, Ally Dawson, and Austin Moon, the overnight internet sensation who gains sudden notoriety after performing one of Ally''s songs. Austin and Ally struggle with how to maintain and capitalize on Austin''s newfound fame. Austin is more of a rebel type who doesn''t follow the rules and is somewhat immature for his age, while Ally is conservative yet self-conscious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wk81zTtu5yNM6ohgMpVrNvzJp3B.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:35279'),
  ('852419594551787128', 'Austin City Limits', 1975, 'Documentary', 'Bill Arhos', null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Now the longest-running music series in American television history, ACL showcases popular music legends and innovators from every genre.', 'Now the longest-running music series in American television history, ACL showcases popular music legends and innovators from every genre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5jxpBFJvwMeqMI7Rg5cqZPdE7V.jpg', 48, 'tmdb:tv:10472'),
  ('251268454287172883', 'Australian Idol', 2003, 'Reality', null, null, 'Marcia Hines, Kyle Sandilands, Ricki-Lee Coulter, Scott Tweedie, Amy Shark', null, 'Australian Idol is an Australian singing competition, which began its first season in July 2003 and ended its original run in November 2009 before being revived in January 2023. As part of the Idol franchise, Australian Idol originated from the reality program Pop Idol, which was created by British entertainment executive Simon Fuller. Australian Idol was televised on Network Ten for its first seven series and was broadcast on Austereo Radio Network between 2005 and 2007.', 'Australian Idol is an Australian singing competition, which began its first season in July 2003 and ended its original run in November 2009 before being revived in January 2023. As part of the Idol franchise, Australian Idol originated from the reality program Pop Idol, which was created by British entertainment executive Simon Fuller. Australian Idol was televised on Network Ten for its first seven series and was broadcast on Austereo Radio Network between 2005 and 2007.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPJikcSXNcJhzymdzpvDOL2BHGf.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:4204'),
  ('569346548384967113', 'Australian Rally Championship', null, null, null, null, null, null, 'Australian Rally Championship', 'Australian Rally Championship', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:312452'),
  ('999364176876023329', 'Australian Story', 1996, 'Documentary, News', null, null, 'Leigh Sales', null, 'Putting the "real" back into reality television, Australian Story is an award-winning documentary series with no narrator and no agendas — just authentic stories told entirely in people''s own words.', 'Putting the "real" back into reality television, Australian Story is an award-winning documentary series with no narrator and no agendas — just authentic stories told entirely in people''s own words.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AdVz2lrwXb4SOV8V3yV8JSAuqWI.jpg', 31, 'tmdb:tv:12317'),
  ('24885934545753135', 'Australian Survivor', 2016, 'Reality', 'Charlie Parsons', null, 'David Genat', null, 'Tough and tenacious people are marooned on a tropical island with little more than the clothes on their backs and the drive to be the sole survivor.', 'Tough and tenacious people are marooned on a tropical island with little more than the clothes on their backs and the drive to be the sole survivor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5G3LGwqsK4lkiGLmjXyb9TDqfU.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:10957'),
  ('51991097024900658', 'Auto Boy – Carl from Mobile Land', 2020, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy', null, null, 'Ayahi Takagaki, Yuka Maruyama, Junji Majima, Sakura Tange, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Wasabi Mizuta, Tessyo Genda, Show Hayami', null, 'Mobile Land is an island where vehicles live. Carl arrives on the island and starts working as a delivery boy. He delivers packages to all kinds of vehicles. Ruster sometime gets in the way and is always trying to turn everyone into rust, but Carl works hard at his deliveries.', 'Mobile Land is an island where vehicles live. Carl arrives on the island and starts working as a delivery boy. He delivers packages to all kinds of vehicles. Ruster sometime gets in the way and is always trying to turn everyone into rust, but Carl works hard at his deliveries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4OpARqWUa4RqIpkpx7P8Bhd3sf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128051'),
  ('1108703144639198745', 'Autodefensa', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Berta Prieto, Belén Barenys, Miguel Ángel Blanca', null, 'Berta Prieto, Belén Barenys', null, 'Berta Prieto and Belén Barenys write, together with Miguel Ángel Blanca (Magaluf Ghost Town) this series about the vital moment of a generation, of which five episodes will be screened. Autodefensa is about two friends who have a great time together without having to ask anyone''s permission. The film is about being in your twenties, living in Barcelona and wanting to step over every possible emotional red line to discover who you really are. It''s about the adventures of two cheeky lunatics who don''t want anyone to tell them how to do things, creating their own world in order to be queens. Actually, Autodefensa is about two girls who are really scared and having fun in self-defence. They say they''re sorry, it was all ''self-defence'', they were just too scared.', 'Berta Prieto and Belén Barenys write, together with Miguel Ángel Blanca (Magaluf Ghost Town) this series about the vital moment of a generation, of which five episodes will be screened. Autodefensa is about two friends who have a great time together without having to ask anyone''s permission. The film is about being in your twenties, living in Barcelona and wanting to step over every possible emotional red line to discover who you really are. It''s about the adventures of two cheeky lunatics who don''t want anyone to tell them how to do things, creating their own world in order to be queens. Actually, Autodefensa is about two girls who are really scared and having fun in self-defence. They say they''re sorry, it was all ''self-defence'', they were just too scared.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jBN0zpT7m2yH7YcBU7kFDP1SvX6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215336'),
  ('319879453248954158', 'Automan', 1983, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Glen A. Larson', null, 'Desi Arnaz Jr., Chuck Wagner, Heather McNair, Gerald S. O''Loughlin, Robert Lansing', null, 'Automan is an American science fiction superhero television series produced by Glen A. Larson. It aired for only 12 episodes on ABC between 1983 and 1984.', 'Automan is an American science fiction superhero television series produced by Glen A. Larson. It aired for only 12 episodes on ABC between 1983 and 1984.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4dOlxvavpgpDyAFmLNIre1JmcCf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12751'),
