  ('739014655244532907', 'Autopsy: The Last Hours of...', 2014, 'Documentary, Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Michael Hunter, Eric Meyers', 'TV-14', 'Revealing the truth behind the controversial deaths of some of the most famous celebrities. Crucial medical evidence gained from the actual autopsies explains what killed the stars and reveals how they died, finally putting an end to the speculation.', 'Revealing the truth behind the controversial deaths of some of the most famous celebrities. Crucial medical evidence gained from the actual autopsies explains what killed the stars and reveals how they died, finally putting an end to the speculation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSqKkfHiEJGHaWpZaOgjQeOE08b.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:67834'),
  ('567956116175015121', 'Autumn Cicada', 2020, 'Drama', null, null, 'Ren Jialun, Li Man, Liu Huan, He Dujuan, Jian Renzi, Liu Xueyi, Vicky Liang, Fu Fangjun', 'TV-14', 'From December 1941 to August 1945, Hong Kong experienced the darkest years in history. Those 3 years and 8 months have become the collective memory of the nightmare of Hong Kong people... This war in Hong Kong is An important part of the Eastern battlefield during World War II is a history that should not be forgotten, a dark period of sad history... The TV series Qiu Chan is a youth spy drama based on this history, It tells the passionate story of the patriotic young Ye Chong and other underground party comrades fighting for the victory of the War of Resistance in those isolated island years.', 'From December 1941 to August 1945, Hong Kong experienced the darkest years in history. Those 3 years and 8 months have become the collective memory of the nightmare of Hong Kong people... This war in Hong Kong is An important part of the Eastern battlefield during World War II is a history that should not be forgotten, a dark period of sad history... The TV series Qiu Chan is a youth spy drama based on this history, It tells the passionate story of the patriotic young Ye Chong and other underground party comrades fighting for the victory of the War of Resistance in those isolated island years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzp6clE7ACd9pmgVxgo8dgo8NNX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103052'),
  ('697292490413543064', 'Autumn in My Heart', 2000, 'Drama', 'Oh Soo Yun', null, 'Song Seung-heon, Song Hye-kyo, Won Bin, Han Chae-young, Han Na-na, Sunwoo Eun-Sook, Jeong Dong-hwan, Lee Han-wi', 'TV-14', 'Two men and two women, their relationship begins in tragic fates, and it grows into love, agony, and parting.', 'Two men and two women, their relationship begins in tragic fates, and it grows into love, agony, and parting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zAto9OSTtB14PMGK0pIKLQYEyQl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14807'),
  ('226942257263779800', 'Autumn of the Heart', 2024, 'Drama, Family', 'Alaa Hamza', null, 'Abdul Mohsen Al-Nimr, Elham Ali, Ibrahim Al-Harbi, مروه محمد, Lubna Abdulaziz, Faisal Al-Dokhi, Hind Mohammad, ميرال مصطفى', null, 'A devastating car accident unearths a long-buried secret that turns wealthy businessman Rashid and hardworking Nahla''s life around; fifteen years ago, their daughters were switched at birth.', 'A devastating car accident unearths a long-buried secret that turns wealthy businessman Rashid and hardworking Nahla''s life around; fifteen years ago, their daughters were switched at birth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8uDmIxjBx90y5OCwJDBADtQzxb7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:251691'),
  ('11727386648669101', 'Autumn''s Concerto', 2009, 'Drama, Family', null, 'Chen Wei-Ling', 'Ady An, Vanness Wu, Hsu Wei-ning, Wu Kang-ren, Xiao Xiao Bin, James Wen, Amanda Zhu', 'TV-14', 'Ren Guang-xi, a cocky law student, seems to lead the perfect life. He''s the sole successor to a huge and famous business and is a talented ice hockey player. But in reality, his lonely life lacks joy, laughter and motivation. That is until he meets Liang Mu-cheng, the new bento seller at his school canteen. A harmless bet brings the two together and Guang-xi slowly changes as Mu-cheng teaches him how to give and love. Tragedy strikes when Guang-xi suddenly has to go through a major brain surgery which causes him to lose his memory.', 'Ren Guang-xi, a cocky law student, seems to lead the perfect life. He''s the sole successor to a huge and famous business and is a talented ice hockey player. But in reality, his lonely life lacks joy, laughter and motivation. That is until he meets Liang Mu-cheng, the new bento seller at his school canteen. A harmless bet brings the two together and Guang-xi slowly changes as Mu-cheng teaches him how to give and love. Tragedy strikes when Guang-xi suddenly has to go through a major brain surgery which causes him to lose his memory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o81XOL2dWOQFLcZxtKRiWkNytI6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31360'),
  ('1040913088450362223', 'Avalanche', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery, Action & Adventure, War & Politics, Crime', null, null, 'Go Ayano, Yoshino Kimura, Sota Fukushi, Maryjun Takahashi, Yudai Chiba, Yoji Tanaka, Atsuro Watabe, Taro Suruga', null, 'Seiichi Habu is a member of the mysterious outlaw group Avalanche. The group exists at a time when moral hazards run rampant among politicians, bureaucrats, businesses, and even among ordinary people.', 'Seiichi Habu is a member of the mysterious outlaw group Avalanche. The group exists at a time when moral hazards run rampant among politicians, bureaucrats, businesses, and even among ordinary people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7cewmPLDX6yly1lLo9GFkX8QJHP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:136630'),
  ('294157545862706826', 'Avatar the Last Airbender', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Albert Kim', null, 'Gordon Cormier, Kiawentiio, Ian Ousley, Dallas Liu, Paul Sun-Hyung Lee, Ken Leung, Daniel Dae Kim', 'TV-PG', 'A young boy known as the Avatar must master the four elemental powers to save a world at war — and fight a ruthless enemy bent on stopping him.', 'A young boy known as the Avatar must master the four elemental powers to save a world at war — and fight a ruthless enemy bent on stopping him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lzZpWEaqzP0qVA5nkCc5ASbNcSy.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:82452'),
  ('619025936753473684', 'Avatar: The Last Airbender', 2005, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Michael Dante DiMartino, Bryan Konietzko', null, 'Zach Tyler Eisen, Mae Whitman, Jack De Sena, Dante Basco, Michaela Jill Murphy, Dee Bradley Baker', 'TV-Y7', 'In a war-torn world of elemental magic, a young boy reawakens to undertake a dangerous mystic quest to fulfill his destiny as the Avatar, and bring peace to the world.', 'In a war-torn world of elemental magic, a young boy reawakens to undertake a dangerous mystic quest to fulfill his destiny as the Avatar, and bring peace to the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9RQhVb3r3mCMqYVhLoCu4EvuipP.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:246'),
  ('223531546501866706', 'Avataro Sentai Donbrothers', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, 'Toshiki Inoue', 'Kouhei Higuchi, Kohaku Shida, Yuuki Beppu, Hirofumi Suzuki, Totaro, Raizou Ishikawa, Yuya Tominaga, Amisa Miyazaki', null, '21 years ago, a baby arrived on earth inside of a peach. Today, five warriors based on the legend of Momotaro fight enemies that are inhabiting humans, invisible to the naked eye. Together they fight to take back gears based on previous Super Sentai.', '21 years ago, a baby arrived on earth inside of a peach. Today, five warriors based on the legend of Momotaro fight enemies that are inhabiting humans, invisible to the naked eye. Together they fight to take back gears based on previous Super Sentai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9BS5mYcXe4KQGYXbjXXZONsKKwi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:153918'),
  ('225206334983024613', 'Ave Mujica - The Die Is Cast -', 2025, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Rico Sasaki, Yuzuki Watase, Mei Okada, Akane Yonezawa, Kanon Takao', 'TV-14', 'After losing everything in a single night, Sakiko Togawa reaches out toward an even deeper abyss, one that will drag everyone around her down as well. Gathering the lives of girls burdened with their own troubles and desires, Sakiko raises the curtain on a perfect masquerade. On a stage where sorrow, death, fear, love—even the solace of forgetting—are stripped away, will their masks be torn off and shatter into oblivion?', 'After losing everything in a single night, Sakiko Togawa reaches out toward an even deeper abyss, one that will drag everyone around her down as well. Gathering the lives of girls burdened with their own troubles and desires, Sakiko raises the curtain on a perfect masquerade. On a stage where sorrow, death, fear, love—even the solace of forgetting—are stripped away, will their masks be torn off and shatter into oblivion?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2oq4QR3CtiAaRYHOjdYWgZAby63.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:274580'),
  ('406572460863017035', 'Avengers Social Club', 2017, 'Drama', 'Kwon Seok-jang', 'Hwang Da-eun, 김이지', 'Lee Yo-won, Ra Mi-ran, Myung Se-bin, Lee Jun-young, Choi Byung-mo, Jung Ae-yeun, Jang Yong, Seong Byeong-suk', null, 'Women gather power to revenge on targets, as well as uncover social injustice.', 'Women gather power to revenge on targets, as well as uncover social injustice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5UFDwXBLFWGAomUHMAEdONcGyFr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74473'),
  ('54106788311913274', 'Avenue 5', 2020, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Armando Iannucci', null, 'Hugh Laurie, Josh Gad, Lenora Crichlow, Zach Woods, Nikki Amuka-Bird, Suzy Nakamura, Ethan Phillips, Rebecca Front', 'TV-MA', '40 years in the future, space captain Ryan Clark and the crew of the luxury space cruise ship Avenue 5 navigate disgruntled passengers and unexpected events after experiencing technical difficulties onboard.', '40 years in the future, space captain Ryan Clark and the crew of the luxury space cruise ship Avenue 5 navigate disgruntled passengers and unexpected events after experiencing technical difficulties onboard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/inSe4HBqnwIoeqoChGlagVs0avG.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:90811'),
  ('693279669258350996', 'Average Joe', 2023, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Robb Cullen', null, 'Deon Cole, Pasha D. Lychnikoff, Ashani Roberts, Patti Tippo', null, 'Blue-collar plumber, Joe Washington, discovers his recently deceased father lived a secret, second life and stole millions of dollars from dangerous people just before he died. Now those people think Joe knows where it is. A bloody and violent confrontation triggers a chain of events that force Joe and his close-knit circle of family and friends out of their very average and mundane lives into a life-or-death race against time to find the truth and the millions.', 'Blue-collar plumber, Joe Washington, discovers his recently deceased father lived a secret, second life and stole millions of dollars from dangerous people just before he died. Now those people think Joe knows where it is. A bloody and violent confrontation triggers a chain of events that force Joe and his close-knit circle of family and friends out of their very average and mundane lives into a life-or-death race against time to find the truth and the millions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jsLYlsWA3CsE7V1owlSqfU9QzVG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:228421'),
  ('559700310616333259', 'Avoidance', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Romesh Ranganathan', null, 'Kieran Logendra, Romesh Ranganathan, Jessica Knappett, Lisa McGrillis, Mandeep Dhillon, Aisling Bea', null, 'Jonathan''s life revolves around his nine year-old son Spencer, and he''s always deferred the big and small decisions to his partner Claire. So when Claire asks him to leave, Jonathan realises he has no home, no friends and no ambition. Except one: to try to preserve his son''s happiness in the face of his parents'' break-up.', 'Jonathan''s life revolves around his nine year-old son Spencer, and he''s always deferred the big and small decisions to his partner Claire. So when Claire asks him to leave, Jonathan realises he has no home, no friends and no ambition. Except one: to try to preserve his son''s happiness in the face of his parents'' break-up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nl926OO3f8Arq5PMF7mt9G5ew96.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:203817'),
  ('512878326436289099', 'Avrodh: The Siege Within', 2020, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Raj Acharya, Sudeep Nigam', 'Bijesh Jayrajan, Sudeep Nigam', 'Vijay Krishnan, Meghana Kaushik, Abir Chaterjee, Aahana Kumra, Ananth Narayan Mahadevan, Krishna Hebbale, Mohan Agashe, Neeraj Kabi', null, 'Avrodh is a series of untold incidents where India was laid to a kind of siege, and had to tap into its bravest frontier heroes to investigate, save, protect and fight fearlessly for the country.', 'Avrodh is a series of untold incidents where India was laid to a kind of siege, and had to tap into its bravest frontier heroes to investigate, save, protect and fight fearlessly for the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4fMUfvXYdkUBNNvHoU1tbOkicl.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:106581'),
  ('1139918892316141742', 'Awaiting Kirin', 2020, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Masahiro Motoki, Shota Sometani, Hiroki Hasegawa, Haruna Kawaguchi, Satoshi Tokushige, Katsunori Takahashi, Sayuri Ishikawa, Rei Dan', null, 'After the Onin War, the world is plunged into chaos. Amid this situation, heroes of the warring states begin to emerge in an attempt to unify the country and rule in these turbulent times. In the mid-1540s, there is a young wandering samurai in Mino which is strategically located between the East and West. His name is Akechi Mitsuhide. At this time, there is plenty of internal strife within the Toki clan which rules Mino. Surrounded by the Oda of Owari, the Imagawa of Suruga and the Asakura of Echizen, Mino has constantly faced the risk of invasion. Mitsuhide is pulled into battle and destroys the enemy. His bravery as well as stratagem catches the attention of Saito Toshimasa, the chief retainer of the Toki clan, and he is singled out. This man who is also known as Saito Dosan will go on to takeover the Toki and make Mino his own.', 'After the Onin War, the world is plunged into chaos. Amid this situation, heroes of the warring states begin to emerge in an attempt to unify the country and rule in these turbulent times. In the mid-1540s, there is a young wandering samurai in Mino which is strategically located between the East and West. His name is Akechi Mitsuhide. At this time, there is plenty of internal strife within the Toki clan which rules Mino. Surrounded by the Oda of Owari, the Imagawa of Suruga and the Asakura of Echizen, Mino has constantly faced the risk of invasion. Mitsuhide is pulled into battle and destroys the enemy. His bravery as well as stratagem catches the attention of Saito Toshimasa, the chief retainer of the Toki clan, and he is singled out. This man who is also known as Saito Dosan will go on to takeover the Toki and make Mino his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q154lnWWb033iljRHvPUhPNsv6p.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98928'),
  ('214901604049683235', 'Awake', 2012, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kyle Killen', null, 'Jason Isaacs, Wilmer Valderrama, Steve Harris, Dylan Minnette, Laura Allen, Michaela McManus, Cherry Jones, BD Wong', 'TV-14', 'Michael lives in two separate realities after a car accident. In one reality, his wife Hannah survives the accident; in the other reality, his son Rex survives. Michael does not know which reality is "real", and uses the wristbands to differentiate the two. He sees two therapists: Dr. Jonathan Lee in the "red reality" and Dr. Judith Evans in the "green reality". At work, Michael''s erratic behavior triggers clashes with his team; they do not know about Michael''s uncanny ability to solve crimes using details from both realities.', 'Michael lives in two separate realities after a car accident. In one reality, his wife Hannah survives the accident; in the other reality, his son Rex survives. Michael does not know which reality is "real", and uses the wristbands to differentiate the two. He sees two therapists: Dr. Jonathan Lee in the "red reality" and Dr. Judith Evans in the "green reality". At work, Michael''s erratic behavior triggers clashes with his team; they do not know about Michael''s uncanny ability to solve crimes using details from both realities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/piQ9vr0zqHM8Rg9IeJCtUtMadNZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39361'),
  ('767179345367449289', 'Awaken', 2020, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'So Jae-hyun', null, 'Namkoong Min, Kim Seol-hyun, Lee Chung-ah, Yoon Sun-woo, Kim Chang-wan, Shin Jae-whi, Kim Won-hae, Lee Sin-young', null, 'While unraveling an enigmatic murder mystery, a special force leader realizes this case is related to the incident that took 28 years ago in a small town.', 'While unraveling an enigmatic murder mystery, a special force leader realizes this case is related to the incident that took 28 years ago in a small town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eSKR3E8Jqf58MmmeyEy27lxXddP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113113'),
  ('309161987489691826', 'Awakening Age', 2021, 'Drama', null, 'Long Pingping', 'Yu Hewei, Zhang Tong, Zhang Wanyi, Ma Shaohua, Cao Lei, Bi Yanjun, Hou Jingjian, Zheng Hao', 'TV-14', 'During a turbulent time from 1915 to 1921, Chen Du Xiu and Li Da Zhao, along with other like-minded individuals, founded the Magazine La Jeunesse that started the New Culture Movement. The magazine promoted science and democracy and revolutionized the thinking of the masses and encouraged them to fight against imperialism that has been ingrained in everyone. The series follows a colorful cast with various well-known authors, politicians, and revolutionists as they all try in their own way to save their country.', 'During a turbulent time from 1915 to 1921, Chen Du Xiu and Li Da Zhao, along with other like-minded individuals, founded the Magazine La Jeunesse that started the New Culture Movement. The magazine promoted science and democracy and revolutionized the thinking of the masses and encouraged them to fight against imperialism that has been ingrained in everyone. The series follows a colorful cast with various well-known authors, politicians, and revolutionists as they all try in their own way to save their country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2SAweqnRlGQe7NJStwSabBCLxoK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117954'),
  ('135488166411501476', 'Awakening of Insects', 2019, 'Action & Adventure', null, 'Fei Hai', 'Zhang Ruoyun, Wang Ou, Sun Yizhou, Kan Qingzi, Wang Longzheng, Li Qiang, Gao Shuguang, Yu Jinwei', null, 'Set during the Japanese occupation of Shanghai in 1941, the drama follows Chen Shan who was forced to be a Japanese spy to save his younger sister who was held in captive; and his journey to become a patriotic fighter.', 'Set during the Japanese occupation of Shanghai in 1941, the drama follows Chen Shan who was forced to be a Japanese spy to save his younger sister who was held in captive; and his journey to become a patriotic fighter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ww9ZCDJGwv6UUdzHEEpoX4fDub4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95890'),
  ('261988565951666807', 'Away', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Andrew Hinderaker', null, 'Hilary Swank, Mark Ivanir, Ray Panthaki, Vivian Wu, Ato Essandoh, Talitha Eliana Bateman', 'TV-14', 'American astronaut Emma Green must leave her husband and teenage daughter behind to command an international space crew embarking upon a treacherous mission. A series about hope, humanity and how we need one another if we are to achieve impossible things.', 'American astronaut Emma Green must leave her husband and teenage daughter behind to command an international space crew embarking upon a treacherous mission. A series about hope, humanity and how we need one another if we are to achieve impossible things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkT776mSvQ9wZ8wkYsnpQuogp10.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89233'),
  ('426995176021188398', 'Awkwafina Is Nora from Queens', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Awkwafina', null, 'Awkwafina, BD Wong, Lori Tan Chinn', 'TV-14', 'Nora Lin leans on her family as she navigates life and young adulthood in outer borough-NYC.', 'Nora Lin leans on her family as she navigates life and young adulthood in outer borough-NYC.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jGgXHR8b9zOLFsqo57mmTNKKjY.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:96231'),
  ('930571784079722508', 'Awkward.', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lauren Iungerich', null, 'Ashley Rickards, Beau Mirchoff, Nikki DeLoach, Jillian Rose Reed, Brett Davern, Molly Tarlov, Greer Grammer', 'TV-14', 'An irreverent look at the conflict, chaos and humor that defines teenage life through the eyes of 15-year-old Jenna Hamilton whose life begins to change when a simple accident becomes an epic misunderstanding and is blown way out of proportion. Narration in the first-person voice of Jenna''s blog posts captures the humor within the struggles and experiences everyone can relate to from their formative years.', 'An irreverent look at the conflict, chaos and humor that defines teenage life through the eyes of 15-year-old Jenna Hamilton whose life begins to change when a simple accident becomes an epic misunderstanding and is blown way out of proportion. Narration in the first-person voice of Jenna''s blog posts captures the humor within the struggles and experiences everyone can relate to from their formative years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PLO6PdGmfKiV3KER2Rd08Ga8kM.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:39859'),
  ('594529461529433028', 'AWOL -Absent Without Leave-', 1998, 'Animation', null, null, 'Jouji Nakata, Shin-ichiro Miki, Shinobu Adachi, Daiki Nakamura, Atsuko Tanaka, Ryusei Nakao', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Nctut3GEfSORJrNK3uZLVFWvCg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:22900'),
  ('493793037002058817', 'Ax Men', 2008, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Danger is a full-time job for these brave men who put everything on the line each and every day to retrieve the Pacific Northwest timber with which we build our country. Snapped cables, runaway logs and razor-sharp chainsaws are just some of the dangers that threaten their lives daily. Even with new technology that should make the job easier, anything and everything can and does go wrong.', 'Danger is a full-time job for these brave men who put everything on the line each and every day to retrieve the Pacific Northwest timber with which we build our country. Snapped cables, runaway logs and razor-sharp chainsaws are just some of the dangers that threaten their lives daily. Even with new technology that should make the job easier, anything and everything can and does go wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iwYZ8GboHzyperyctM1WLIFbHhT.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:15563'),
  ('941897347903185051', 'Axe Cop', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Malachai Nicolle, Ethan Nicolle', null, 'Ken Marino, Nick Offerman', 'TV-MA', 'Axe Cop is an animated series based on the webcomic of the same name. It premiered on Fox on July 21, 2013, as a part of the channel''s Animation Domination HD programming block. The series aired 6 11-minute episodes in its first season, which will later expand to half-hour episodes should the show be renewed for a second season.', 'Axe Cop is an animated series based on the webcomic of the same name. It premiered on Fox on July 21, 2013, as a part of the channel''s Animation Domination HD programming block. The series aired 6 11-minute episodes in its first season, which will later expand to half-hour episodes should the show be renewed for a second season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v4ETEzVOIFWhnLNM3n04gNMknWv.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:49008'),
  ('862987228441402104', 'Axios', 2018, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Leading Axios journalists highlight the week ahead in politics, business and technology – and the big topics shaping the future. Each edition features coverage of a timely big issue, followed by documentary shorts, illuminating interviews with major newsmakers and trustworthy insights delivered with Axios’ signature “Smart Brevity” in a succinct, shareable format.', 'Leading Axios journalists highlight the week ahead in politics, business and technology – and the big topics shaping the future. Each edition features coverage of a timely big issue, followed by documentary shorts, illuminating interviews with major newsmakers and trustworthy insights delivered with Axios’ signature “Smart Brevity” in a succinct, shareable format.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lONMfKRAeIACU8luTLcfiAg4BO0.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:83114'),
  ('741376709996171339', 'AYAKA', 2023, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuto Uemura, Takuma Terashima, Yuuichirou Umehara, Kohsuke Toriumi', 'TV-14', 'The story follows Yukito Yanagi, an orphan who one day encounters an eccentric disciple of his father''s. The strange man takes him to his birthplace on Ayakajima, made up of seven islands where mysterious beings called "Mitama" and dragons are rumored to reside. There, Yukito meets his father''s two other disciples, who protect the harmony of Ayakajima… which soon threatens to collapse.', 'The story follows Yukito Yanagi, an orphan who one day encounters an eccentric disciple of his father''s. The strange man takes him to his birthplace on Ayakajima, made up of seven islands where mysterious beings called "Mitama" and dragons are rumored to reside. There, Yukito meets his father''s two other disciples, who protect the harmony of Ayakajima… which soon threatens to collapse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8v6p3nkSVW5p1UIpoaTIGHCz6hO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213233'),
  ('804761999664533433', 'AYAKA is in LOVE with HIROKO', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Shiho Kato, Kanna Mori', null, 'Soft and bubbly office lady Ayaka is madly in love with her senior at work, Hiroko! Two lovestruck coworkers who both think the other is straight totally crush on each other...', 'Soft and bubbly office lady Ayaka is madly in love with her senior at work, Hiroko! Two lovestruck coworkers who both think the other is straight totally crush on each other...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pS5d64hiz0ITNpP2pSp7IthaLUy.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:256384'),
  ('755806064909477165', 'Ayakashi Triangle', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shoya Chiba, Miyu Tomita, Kana Ichinose, Tessyo Genda, Haruka Tomatsu, Hina Kino, Shoya Ishige, Satomi Arai', 'TV-14', 'Japan may be brimming with mysterious monsters called ayakashi, but they have a special exorcist ninja force to counter the threat! Young exorcist ninja Matsuri spends his days fighting ayakashi to protect his childhood friend Suzu. But when an ayakashi cat named Shirogane shows up, things get turned upside down!', 'Japan may be brimming with mysterious monsters called ayakashi, but they have a special exorcist ninja force to counter the threat! Young exorcist ninja Matsuri spends his days fighting ayakashi to protect his childhood friend Suzu. But when an ayakashi cat named Shirogane shows up, things get turned upside down!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sio2EmpowZXOtHv7bqB0gv9AZ0u.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:153697'),
  ('599744824737088069', 'Ayakashi: Samurai Horror Tales', 2006, 'Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hiroaki Hirata, Mami Koyama, Yuko Nagashima, Keiichi Sonobe, Ryo Hirohashi, Wataru Takagi, Hikaru Midorikawa, Houko Kuwashima', 'TV-MA', 'An anthology of three classic Japanese horror stories: "Yotsuya Ghost Story", the story of a wife betrayed by her husband who seeks vengeance even in death; "Goddess of the Dark Tower", the story of forbidden love between a goddess and a human; and "Goblin Cat", the story of a mysterious cat monster with a vendetta against a certain family.', 'An anthology of three classic Japanese horror stories: "Yotsuya Ghost Story", the story of a wife betrayed by her husband who seeks vengeance even in death; "Goddess of the Dark Tower", the story of forbidden love between a goddess and a human; and "Goblin Cat", the story of a mysterious cat monster with a vendetta against a certain family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2ZxUTQyCvqa3IIJ3oyqPZzKLLz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42963'),
  ('322894373208193027', 'Aynen Aynen', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Yunus Ozan Korkut', 'Alper Erze', 'Nilperi Şahinkaya, Diyar Karatas, Beyhan Kübra Esen, Zekeriya Yesir, Hira Koyuncuoğlu, Ahmet Kayakesen, Serkan Şengül, Kerem Bürsin', null, 'A humorous take on modern relationships, following Nil and Emir from their very first date. As their relationship unfolds, the couple reveals both the versions of themselves they present to each other and their true personalities, holding up a mirror to society in the process.', 'A humorous take on modern relationships, following Nil and Emir from their very first date. As their relationship unfolds, the couple reveals both the versions of themselves they present to each other and their true personalities, holding up a mirror to society in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/clqQaVbpnrFG7dvpjFA0lX1i5mi.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:95552'),
  ('993118237226189635', 'Ayrılsak da Beraberiz', 1999, 'Comedy, Family', 'Fatih Solmaz', null, 'Hakan Yılmaz, Necmi Yapıcı, Ayşe Tolga, Tuluğ Çizgen, Cezmi Baskın, Suzan Aksoy, Simge Selçuk, İhsan Aydın', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e5BRK6uoOUAP44SuInXDBOgHdBy.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:49390'),
  ('676596279886938540', 'Ayu no uta', 1979, 'Drama', null, null, 'Jirô Takada, Senri Yamazaki, Sayuri Yoshinaga, Haruko Mabuchi, Isao Kimura, Tatsuya Miyazaki, Chōchō Miyako, Takuya Fujioka', null, 'The 24th NHK Asadora. Starring Senri Yamazaki as a woman who makes her life at a fishing port.', 'The 24th NHK Asadora. Starring Senri Yamazaki as a woman who makes her life at a fishing port.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7kW49s9p6Mv62mqu2YEUypqCEG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207702'),
  ('1004458670608326565', 'Azize', 2019, 'Drama', 'Volkan Kocatürk', null, 'Buğra Gülsoy, Hande Erçel, Duygu Sarışın, Mustafa Avkıran, Selen Öztürk, Tugay Mercan, Çetin Sarıkartal, Mustafa Yıldıran', null, 'Azize, which tells a passionate but impossible love story.', 'Azize, which tells a passionate but impossible love story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i3Rz8aGtMNUJLhN7Djn8Fn9hLte.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:49513'),
  ('331172862401618771', 'Azumanga Daioh', 2002, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Tomoko Kaneda, Yuki Matsuoka, Chieko Higuchi, Rie Tanaka, Yuu Asakawa, Akiko Hiramatsu, Aya Hisakawa, Houko Kuwashima', 'TV-PG', 'Ten year old child prodigy, Chiyo Mihama, is finding it tough fitting in at high school with the girls five years her elder: Osaka (dimwitted with a weird take on the world), Tomo (a powder keg that goes off at a moment’s notice), Kagura (the competitive athlete of the bunch), Yomi (the hothead), and Sakaki (timid and obsessed with a love of animals that isn’t reciprocated). Together with their teacher, they navigate the rough waters and fun times of high school.', 'Ten year old child prodigy, Chiyo Mihama, is finding it tough fitting in at high school with the girls five years her elder: Osaka (dimwitted with a weird take on the world), Tomo (a powder keg that goes off at a moment’s notice), Kagura (the competitive athlete of the bunch), Yomi (the hothead), and Sakaki (timid and obsessed with a love of animals that isn’t reciprocated). Together with their teacher, they navigate the rough waters and fun times of high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rvKqdJUmTjx99sOapCrTjIvwYP2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12143'),
  ('872886007485574239', 'Azur Lane', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation', null, null, 'Yui Ishikawa, Mai Nakahara, Maria Naganawa, Nozomi Yamane, Yui Horie, You Taichi', 'TV-14', 'Azur Lane, a combination of all the different Camps in the world, was once successful in repelling the underwater menace, the Siren. Now splintered, they must face a new threat in Red Axis, former allies who crave to wield this otherworldly Siren technology for their own nefarious desires! Who will be victorious in the never-ending war between these battleship girls!?', 'Azur Lane, a combination of all the different Camps in the world, was once successful in repelling the underwater menace, the Siren. Now splintered, they must face a new threat in Red Axis, former allies who crave to wield this otherworldly Siren technology for their own nefarious desires! Who will be victorious in the never-ending war between these battleship girls!?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7k9GZBSjsQCwhYXeTGqPcStpjOF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91455'),
  ('702663538679757148', 'Azur Lane: Slow Ahead!', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Nozomi Yamane, Ayane Sakura, Rika Abe, Sumire Uesaka, Maria Naganawa, You Taichi, Minami Takahashi', null, 'This is a slightly peculiar world where the shipgirls live in. A lively and enjoyable school life for girls from different factions will begin at the naval port of Azur Lane. Living out their lives to the fullest, these girls get into various shenanigans—slowly but surely!', 'This is a slightly peculiar world where the shipgirls live in. A lively and enjoyable school life for girls from different factions will begin at the naval port of Azur Lane. Living out their lives to the fullest, these girls get into various shenanigans—slowly but surely!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evNjloRQilbYco1HIP1c6IpZH4c.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:109805'),
  ('310573249299771655', 'B Positive', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Marco Pennette', null, 'Annaleigh Ashford, Thomas Middleditch, Kether Donohue, Darryl Stephens, Linda Lavin, David Anthony Higgins, Héctor Elizondo, Jane Seymour', 'TV-14', 'Faced with finding a kidney donor, newly divorced dad Drew is at the end of his rope when he runs into Gina, a rough-around-the edges woman from his past who volunteers her own. Together they form an unlikely bond and begin a journey that will change both of their lives.', 'Faced with finding a kidney donor, newly divorced dad Drew is at the end of his rope when he runs into Gina, a rough-around-the edges woman from his past who volunteers her own. Together they form an unlikely bond and begin a journey that will change both of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xi1FWI0ckVEurtRFRMplHtXHn9y.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:104714'),
  ('56556146688240680', 'B-Fighter Kabuto', 1996, 'Action & Adventure, Kids', null, null, 'Hideomi Nakazato, Naoto Adachi, Yukina Kurisu, Ryoichi Yamaguchi, Kaori Asoh, Hideki Anzai, Akira Ooka, Akiko Yoshio', null, 'B-Fighter Kabuto is a Japanese television series in the Metal Hero Series. It is the sequel to Juukou B-Fighter, taking place five years after the preceding B-Fighter series. Kabuto aired from 1996 to 1997. The action footage and props were used for the Beetleborgs Metallix series.', 'B-Fighter Kabuto is a Japanese television series in the Metal Hero Series. It is the sequel to Juukou B-Fighter, taking place five years after the preceding B-Fighter series. Kabuto aired from 1996 to 1997. The action footage and props were used for the Beetleborgs Metallix series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/titYjBGmlttQkSOoByJtZzXk4Pi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6342'),
  ('1003162296641922387', 'B-Robo Kabutack', 1997, 'Drama, Kids', null, null, 'Kazuki Futami, Takeshi Kusao, Miyabi Kimura, Daiki Nakamura, Dai Matsumoto, Chafurin, Hisao Egawa, Shigeru Chiba', null, 'B-Robo Kabutack is a Japanese television series and is the sixteenth series as part of Toei Company''s Metal Hero Series of tokusatsu programs. It aired from February 23, 1997 to March 1, 1998. It is the first of the kiddie shows made by Toei in the Metal Hero Series line.', 'B-Robo Kabutack is a Japanese television series and is the sixteenth series as part of Toei Company''s Metal Hero Series of tokusatsu programs. It aired from February 23, 1997 to March 1, 1998. It is the first of the kiddie shows made by Toei in the Metal Hero Series line.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g4yxg6okcVjaPb9p3F9sUO0gF6v.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85995'),
  ('479768024529538342', 'B: The Beginning', 2018, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Drama, Crime, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Asami Seto, Hiroaki Hirata, Yuki Kaji', 'TV-MA', 'Genius investigator Keith Flick rejoins the royal police force just as serial killer "B" emerges. Mysterious youth Koku may be an ally, or a target.', 'Genius investigator Keith Flick rejoins the royal police force just as serial killer "B" emerges. Mysterious youth Koku may be an ally, or a target.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ouigEf38GDHsH5U46J7iwNUBqIN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:77529'),
  ('815676500601503798', 'B. J. and the Bear', 1979, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Glen A. Larson', null, 'Greg Evigan, Candi Brough, Randi Brough, Sheila Wills, Amanda Horan Kennedy, Judy Landers, Linda McCullough, Sherilyn Wolter', null, 'B.J. and the Bear is an American comedy series which aired on NBC from 1979 to 1981. Created by Christopher Crowe and Glen A. Larson, the series stars Greg Evigan and Claude Akins.', 'B.J. and the Bear is an American comedy series which aired on NBC from 1979 to 1981. Created by Christopher Crowe and Glen A. Larson, the series stars Greg Evigan and Claude Akins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pFYowtsK6oYOZySPnNXf4TlIoBT.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:961'),
  ('833133505591000013', 'B.King', 2026, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'UKA', null, 'This is a story about an animator who rises to fame for his anime "B.King". But many years later, he''s at his wit''s end, and has to attract attention by abandoning his anime characters. One day, a mysterious incoming call absorbs the animator into the World of B.King, where he becomes an anime character called Wang Xiaoming. Therefore, with the knowledge of the "Creator", Wang Xiaoming embarks on a fantastic journey together with his other anime characters. This is a shortcut to become immortal.', 'This is a story about an animator who rises to fame for his anime "B.King". But many years later, he''s at his wit''s end, and has to attract attention by abandoning his anime characters. One day, a mysterious incoming call absorbs the animator into the World of B.King, where he becomes an anime character called Wang Xiaoming. Therefore, with the knowledge of the "Creator", Wang Xiaoming embarks on a fantastic journey together with his other anime characters. This is a shortcut to become immortal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAWdKu5VOE3vSaEqcn79Kn0XXDk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:280095'),
  ('502203435290925758', 'B''T X', 1996, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Yoshiyuki Suga', 'Nobuyuki Hiyama, Jin Horikawa, Nozomu Sasaki, Megumi Ogata, Emi Shinohara, Kazuya Ichijo, Asako Dodo, Keiji Fujiwara', 'TV-PG', 'After years of absence, Teppei’s joyous reunion with his brother is cut short when the two brothers are attacked. When his brother is kidnapped, Teppei gives chase only to find himself cornered in a junkyard when a miracle appears. His spilled blood awakens the legendary B’t X.', 'After years of absence, Teppei’s joyous reunion with his brother is cut short when the two brothers are attacked. When his brother is kidnapped, Teppei gives chase only to find himself cornered in a junkyard when a miracle appears. His spilled blood awakens the legendary B’t X.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6wEUIRqChdiGpzEgIjgfIpGFG6T.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:30386'),
  ('443612732687725136', 'B&B Vol Liefde', 2021, 'Reality', null, null, 'Jeroen Kijk in de Vegte, Leonie ter Braak, Dick Lock, Daniël Zuiddam, Eveline Engels, Ingrid Peeters, Illya Rijnberg, Jean-Paul Schoons', null, 'Reality series in which six single B&B owners spread over Europe go looking for the love of their lives. Which Dutch partner dares to look across the border and make the B&B owners'' adventure complete?', 'Reality series in which six single B&B owners spread over Europe go looking for the love of their lives. Which Dutch partner dares to look across the border and make the B&B owners'' adventure complete?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oW1TpjHFYCoCMAwE3ZmrlhEVAT5.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:124428'),
  ('111666786725535336', 'Baa Baa Black Sheep', 1976, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, War & Politics', 'Stephen J. Cannell', null, 'Robert Conrad, Simon Oakland, Dana Elcar, Dirk Blocker, W.K. Stratton, James Whitmore Jr., Robert Ginty, John Larroquette', 'TV-PG', 'The dramatized World War II adventures of US Major Gregory "Pappy" Boyington and his Marine Attack Squadron 214, AKA The Black Sheep Squadron.', 'The dramatized World War II adventures of US Major Gregory "Pappy" Boyington and his Marine Attack Squadron 214, AKA The Black Sheep Squadron.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4VN9UMiUfPVgIvtubGQyfrZ581.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:5027'),
  ('835623590327479174', 'Baantjer', 1995, 'Crime', null, null, 'Piet Römer, Victor Reinier, Kirsten van Dissel, Serge-Henri Valcke, Hans Karsenbarg, Martin Schwab, Nienke Sikkema, Wimie Wilhelm', null, 'Baantjer is a Dutch television programme which was broadcast by RTL 4 from 6 October 1995 until 1 December 2006 for a total of 123 episodes in 12 seasons. It stars Piet Römer as Jurriaan ''Jurre'' de Cock, a police detective, and Victor Reinier as Dick Vledder, his helper. The series is based on the novels of writer A. C. Baantjer. In 1999, RTL 4 broadcast the television film Baantjer, de film: De Cock en de wraak zonder einde because of the tenth anniversary of the network.', 'Baantjer is a Dutch television programme which was broadcast by RTL 4 from 6 October 1995 until 1 December 2006 for a total of 123 episodes in 12 seasons. It stars Piet Römer as Jurriaan ''Jurre'' de Cock, a police detective, and Victor Reinier as Dick Vledder, his helper. The series is based on the novels of writer A. C. Baantjer. In 1999, RTL 4 broadcast the television film Baantjer, de film: De Cock en de wraak zonder einde because of the tenth anniversary of the network.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5R9rzh0eaFWFCfVJt9JdLITpjKt.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:14555'),
  ('351692498016896971', 'Bab Al-Hara', 2006, 'Drama', null, null, null, null, 'A social drama set in the 1920s in Damascus. It highlights Damascene life, noble values, and ancient customs and traditions represented by the people of Harat al-Dabeh who fled to Harat al-Salihiyah after the French bombed Harat al-Dabeh. The events take place after the gold is stolen from the house of the cloth merchant Abu Ibrahim, and the guard Abu al-Samu is killed. The men of the neighborhood try to find the thief.', 'A social drama set in the 1920s in Damascus. It highlights Damascene life, noble values, and ancient customs and traditions represented by the people of Harat al-Dabeh who fled to Harat al-Salihiyah after the French bombed Harat al-Dabeh. The events take place after the gold is stolen from the house of the cloth merchant Abu Ibrahim, and the guard Abu al-Samu is killed. The men of the neighborhood try to find the thief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d4L86KrV2hZboblytCJ9c4hqhrL.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:30695'),
  ('745197779190393562', 'Babanba Banban Vampire', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Daisuke Namikawa, Yusuke Kobayashi, Mayuko Kazama, Taku Yashiro, Akira Sekine, Katsuyuki Konishi', 'TV-MA', 'When 15-year-old Rihito falls in love, an ancient vampire who craves 18-year-old virgin blood must protect the teen''s virginity at all costs.', 'When 15-year-old Rihito falls in love, an ancient vampire who craves 18-year-old virgin blood must protect the teen''s virginity at all costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78lgjWEb89leZX5FHmlLCblkDKM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:273051'),
  ('218653840932798041', 'Babar', 1989, 'Animation, Family', null, null, 'Dan Lett, Janet-Laine Green, Kyle Fairlie, Kristen Bone, Noah Reid, Philip Williams', 'TV-G', 'Inspired by Jean de Brunhoff and Laurent de Brunhoff''s beloved children''s books, this animated series tells Babar''s life story from the elephant king''s point of view, reliving his early days as a young pachyderm with important lessons to learn.', 'Inspired by Jean de Brunhoff and Laurent de Brunhoff''s beloved children''s books, this animated series tells Babar''s life story from the elephant king''s point of view, reliving his early days as a young pachyderm with important lessons to learn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ZHUj7Doria6U1ckYgGWdd5EENl.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:1232'),
  ('23283445107543244', 'Babies', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Annabel Gillings', null, 'Pascal Wallisch', 'TV-PG', 'From nature to nurture, this docuseries explores the groundbreaking science that reveals how infants discover life during their very first year.', 'From nature to nurture, this docuseries explores the groundbreaking science that reveals how infants discover life during their very first year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3vDzamSJDHdzMs7RVaPenhJcXi.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:99103'),
  ('357834942800670134', 'Babies', 2026, 'Drama', 'Stefan Golaszewski', null, 'Paapa Essiedu, Siobhán Cullen, Jack Bannon, Charlotte Riley', null, 'Lisa and Stephen are dealing with the painful struggle of pregnancy loss while life continues around them. However, despite facing dark times of grief and loneliness, they are finding their way through it with a burning sense of hope, humour, and love, realising the strength of their relationship, which will ultimately bring them closer than ever.', 'Lisa and Stephen are dealing with the painful struggle of pregnancy loss while life continues around them. However, despite facing dark times of grief and loneliness, they are finding their way through it with a burning sense of hope, humour, and love, realising the strength of their relationship, which will ultimately bring them closer than ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/M1UADUxyIcEkiHWiqBmSCDmqLd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278283'),
  ('322252893064915982', 'Baby', 2018, 'Drama', 'Andrea De Sica, Antonio Le Fosse, Giacomo Mazzariol', null, 'Benedetta Porcaroli, Alice Pagani, Riccardo Mandolini, Chabeli Sastre González, Brando Pacitto, Lorenzo Zurzolo, Massimo Poggio, Galatea Ranzi', 'TV-MA', 'Fed up with their families and classmates, two teen girls from a wealthy part of Rome are drawn to the city''s underworld and start leading double lives.', 'Fed up with their families and classmates, two teen girls from a wealthy part of Rome are drawn to the city''s underworld and start leading double lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xswkOJni9tJYda2yN1QQtgBVaVJ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:82700'),
  ('541416749015828558', 'Baby and Me', 1996, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Kappei Yamaguchi, Chika Sakamoto, Mitsuru Miyamoto, Yoshiko Kamei, Yumi Kuroda, Hisako Kyoda, Hiro Yuuki, Misa Watanabe', 'NR', 'Young Takuya has it tough. After his mother passed away it has been his job to take care of his baby brother, Minoru while their father, Harumi, works the long hours of a Japanese salaryman. Takuya must sacrifice the playtime usually associated with childhood for the responsibilities of an adult. Cooking, cleaning, sewing and scolding are all now an integral part of the young boy''s life. "All work and no play" has Takuya incredibly frustrated and resentful of his little brother. Will Takuya find it in his heart to love the brother who is causing him so much grief?', 'Young Takuya has it tough. After his mother passed away it has been his job to take care of his baby brother, Minoru while their father, Harumi, works the long hours of a Japanese salaryman. Takuya must sacrifice the playtime usually associated with childhood for the responsibilities of an adult. Cooking, cleaning, sewing and scolding are all now an integral part of the young boy''s life. "All work and no play" has Takuya incredibly frustrated and resentful of his little brother. Will Takuya find it in his heart to love the brother who is causing him so much grief?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNAJjdSvSXwAsR4RCprD8oNjo9J.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:22077'),
  ('61133894060148796', 'Baby Assassins Everyday!', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Akari Takaishi, Saori Izawa, Tsubasa Tobinaga, Tomo Nakai, Atomu Mizuishi, Fujiko Kojima, Ryu Ichinose, Takenori Goto', 'TV-MA', 'Two socially awkward young women live a seemingly laid-back life in a shared house with others - when they''re not working as elite assassins.', 'Two socially awkward young women live a seemingly laid-back life in a shared house with others - when they''re not working as elite assassins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqNpIMxxDIomyyJy9lYjDRHQ2op.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:254021'),
  ('545282774145845699', 'Baby Bandito', 2024, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'After skater Kevin and his crew pull off Chile''s biggest heist, reckless love –and social media– threatens everyone''s fortunes.', 'After skater Kevin and his crew pull off Chile''s biggest heist, reckless love –and social media– threatens everyone''s fortunes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c06cdVG5p87DxSaRsHJUjoC1nPy.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:241480'),
  ('829037139054010447', 'Baby Daddy', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Dan Berendsen', null, 'Jean-Luc Bilodeau, Tahj Mowry, Derek Theler, Melissa Peterman, Chelsea Kane', 'TV-14', 'Baby Daddy follows Ben, a young man in his early 20s living the life of a bachelor in New York City with his buddy, Tucker, and his brother, Danny. Their lives are turned upside down when they come home one day to find a baby girl left on the doorstep by an ex-girlfriend of Ben''s. After much deliberation, Ben decides to raise the baby with the help of his friends and his protective and sometimes over-bearing mother, Bonnie, and his close female friend, Riley.', 'Baby Daddy follows Ben, a young man in his early 20s living the life of a bachelor in New York City with his buddy, Tucker, and his brother, Danny. Their lives are turned upside down when they come home one day to find a baby girl left on the doorstep by an ex-girlfriend of Ben''s. After much deliberation, Ben decides to raise the baby with the help of his friends and his protective and sometimes over-bearing mother, Bonnie, and his close female friend, Riley.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lwpaNYFacUITOtfIZ1UDq7vnKeD.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:42272'),
  ('915977711132772072', 'Baby Fever', 2022, 'Drama', 'Amalie Næsby Fick, Nikolaj Feifer', null, 'Josephine Park, Olivia Joof Lewerissa, Simon Sears, Charlotte Munck, Mikael Birkkjær', null, 'When a fertility doctor drunkenly inseminates herself with her ex-boyfriend''s sperm, she scrambles to explain her pregnancy — and win back her lost love.', 'When a fertility doctor drunkenly inseminates herself with her ex-boyfriend''s sperm, she scrambles to explain her pregnancy — and win back her lost love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tXGd6hBT7luufhZCpAgADyKIFIE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:202311'),
  ('347264829928820738', 'Baby Looney Tunes', 2002, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Tom Minton, Ron Myrick, Gloria Jenkins', null, 'Sam Vincent, Terry Klassen, Britt McKillip, Ian James Corlett, June Foray, Janyse Jaud, Chiara Zanni', 'TV-Y', 'The world''s most beloved animated characters as precocious preschoolers, discovering the world one baby step at a time.', 'The world''s most beloved animated characters as precocious preschoolers, discovering the world one baby step at a time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l7SLxIuRdyrpIVWSEDBdtxCOSCI.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:670'),
  ('606662143426171310', 'Baby Reindeer', 2024, 'Drama', 'Richard Gadd', null, 'Richard Gadd, Jessica Gunning, Nava Mau', 'TV-MA', 'When a struggling comedian shows one act of kindness to a vulnerable woman, it sparks a suffocating obsession which threatens to wreck both their lives.', 'When a struggling comedian shows one act of kindness to a vulnerable woman, it sparks a suffocating obsession which threatens to wreck both their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tN9OcbkAOPwHSr1sgMornZtQZBx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241259'),
  ('519346524577226765', 'Baby Steps', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Taishi Murata, Minako Kotobuki, Daisuke Namikawa, Asami Seto, Hiro Shimono, Taiten Kusunoki, Takuma Terashima, Tetsuya Kakihara', null, 'Eiichirō Maruo (nicknamed "Ei-chan" for his grades being straight "A") is an honor student, bookworm, and is not interested in anything other than studying. In order to solve his problem of lacking physical strength, he enrolled a tennis school and soon found the fascinating side of tennis. Being a tennis newbie lacking physical strength, he supplement his shortcomings with his excellent observing and analyzing skills.', 'Eiichirō Maruo (nicknamed "Ei-chan" for his grades being straight "A") is an honor student, bookworm, and is not interested in anything other than studying. In order to solve his problem of lacking physical strength, he enrolled a tennis school and soon found the fascinating side of tennis. Being a tennis newbie lacking physical strength, he supplement his shortcomings with his excellent observing and analyzing skills.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVXgyHizeUbL1RdyKd58WjVGrNv.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:60844'),
  ('1135348105403943350', 'Babylon', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Danny Boyle, Sam Bain, Jesse Armstrong', null, 'James Nesbitt, Brit Marling, Ella Smith, Nick Blood, Andrew Brooke, Bertie Carvel, Paterson Joseph, Daniel Kaluuya', 'TV-MA', 'London''s police force is in need of a public image revamp. And Chief Constable Richard Miller has found just the woman to do it...American visionary from the world of new media Liz Garvey, sets out to revolutionise the force''s PR department just as an outbreak of violence erupts.', 'London''s police force is in need of a public image revamp. And Chief Constable Richard Miller has found just the woman to do it...American visionary from the world of new media Liz Garvey, sets out to revolutionise the force''s PR department just as an outbreak of violence erupts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5BDBMC1EZ0JwEiglbyz6jT0p6l.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61815'),
  ('265959961286096055', 'Babylon', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Mystery, Crime', null, null, 'Yuichi Nakamura, Satsuki Yukino, Takahiro Sakurai, Kensho Ono, Mao Ichimichi, Kenyu Horiuchi, Kazuyuki Okitsu, Katsuhisa Houki', 'TV-MA', 'Zen Seizaki is a prosecutor with the Tokyo District Public Prosecutors'' Office. While investigating illegal acts by a certain pharmaceutical company, Seizaki stumbles upon a page stained with a mixture of blood, hair and skin, along with the letter "F" scribbled all across the sheet. As he investigates further, the case goes beyond Zen''s imagination and becomes vastly complex, challenging his sense of justice and his knowledge of the truth. Digging deeper into the investigation, Zen begins to uncover a concealed plot behind the ongoing mayoral election and ties to many people of interest involved in the election and those closer than he thinks. The case grows more severe and propels Zen into an unforeseen hurricane of corruption and deceit behind the election, the establishment of the Shiniki district, and the mysterious woman associated with it all.', 'Zen Seizaki is a prosecutor with the Tokyo District Public Prosecutors'' Office. While investigating illegal acts by a certain pharmaceutical company, Seizaki stumbles upon a page stained with a mixture of blood, hair and skin, along with the letter "F" scribbled all across the sheet. As he investigates further, the case goes beyond Zen''s imagination and becomes vastly complex, challenging his sense of justice and his knowledge of the truth. Digging deeper into the investigation, Zen begins to uncover a concealed plot behind the ongoing mayoral election and ties to many people of interest involved in the election and those closer than he thinks. The case grows more severe and propels Zen into an unforeseen hurricane of corruption and deceit behind the election, the establishment of the Shiniki district, and the mysterious woman associated with it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPui8oETvkX3K9c3YHjVMhUiBdV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92599'),
  ('1099292851032127901', 'Babylon 5', 1994, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'J. Michael Straczynski', null, 'Bruce Boxleitner, Jerry Doyle, Mira Furlan, Richard Biggs, Andreas Katsulas, Peter Jurasik, Stephen Furst, Bill Mumy', 'TV-PG', 'Babylon 5 is a five-mile long space station located in neutral space. Built by the Earth Alliance in the 2250s, its goal is to maintain peace among the various alien races by providing a sanctuary where grievances and negotiations can be worked out among duly appointed ambassadors. A council made up of representatives from the five major space-faring civilizations - the Earth Alliance, Minbari Federation, Centauri Republic, Narn Regime, and Vorlon Empire - work with the League of Non-Aligned Worlds to keep interstellar relations under control. Aside from its diplomatic function, Babylon 5 also serves as a military post for Earth and a port of call for travelers, traders, businessmen, criminals, and Rangers.', 'Babylon 5 is a five-mile long space station located in neutral space. Built by the Earth Alliance in the 2250s, its goal is to maintain peace among the various alien races by providing a sanctuary where grievances and negotiations can be worked out among duly appointed ambassadors. A council made up of representatives from the five major space-faring civilizations - the Earth Alliance, Minbari Federation, Centauri Republic, Narn Regime, and Vorlon Empire - work with the League of Non-Aligned Worlds to keep interstellar relations under control. Aside from its diplomatic function, Babylon 5 also serves as a military post for Earth and a port of call for travelers, traders, businessmen, criminals, and Rangers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/td8O6KJQpN9ZRiuyFUILziXFMrk.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:3137'),
  ('573375911472701768', 'Babylon Berlin', 2017, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Tom Tykwer, Achim von Borries, Hendrik Handloegten', null, 'Volker Bruch, Liv Lisa Fries, Lars Eidinger, Benno Fürmann, Ronald Zehrfeld, Meret Becker, Fritzi Haberlandt, Jördis Triebel', 'TV-MA', 'Beneath the decadence of 1929 Berlin, lies an underworld city of sin. Police investigator Gereon Rath has been transferred from Cologne to the epicenter of political and social changes in the Golden Twenties.', 'Beneath the decadence of 1929 Berlin, lies an underworld city of sin. Police investigator Gereon Rath has been transferred from Cologne to the epicenter of political and social changes in the Golden Twenties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/om7Ri353ddUsg0gDJsOZIQJBRwL.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:66980'),
  ('257053486569884503', 'BabyRiki', 2015, 'Animation, Family, Kids, Comedy', 'Marina Moshkova', null, 'Marianna Mokshina, Svetlana Kuznetsova, Anna Geller, Kseniya Brzhezovskaya', null, 'BabyRiki characters are toys that have come to life in a children''s bedroom. They explore and discover their world, making friends and learning new things along the way. Storylines are simple and related to familiar things for this age group, such as eating, activities, playing, sleeping and other daily routines.', 'BabyRiki characters are toys that have come to life in a children''s bedroom. They explore and discover their world, making friends and learning new things along the way. Storylines are simple and related to familiar things for this age group, such as eating, activities, playing, sleeping and other daily routines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Ayg9BG9msvpBQMUMGNrV8QChEy.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:78579'),
  ('910790738594085420', 'Baccano!', 2007, 'Comedy, Action & Adventure, Animation, Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'Masaya Onosaka, Sayaka Aoki, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Hiroyuki Yoshino, Kinryu Arimoto, Mitsuru Miyamoto, Ryo Hirohashi, Yu Kobayashi', 'TV-MA', 'Alchemists, swindlers, thieves, and gangsters cross paths on The Flying Pussyfoot, a 1930s American transcontinental train, as it embarks on a legendary voyage that leaves a trail of blood all over the country.', 'Alchemists, swindlers, thieves, and gangsters cross paths on The Flying Pussyfoot, a 1930s American transcontinental train, as it embarks on a legendary voyage that leaves a trail of blood all over the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMGIGtHzcX8tmjEUpGM7g2vXtAz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34121'),
  ('135806074732546930', 'Bachelor Czech Republic', 2024, 'Reality', null, null, 'Míra Dubovický, Martin Dubovický', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWgMfwbPYvEuRewBHusRsWBTvGf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:275636'),
  ('482763035857579734', 'Bachelor Father', 1957, 'Comedy, Family', null, null, 'John Forsythe, Sammee Tong, Noreen Corcoran', 'TV-G', 'Bachelor Father is an American sitcom starring John Forsythe, Noreen Corcoran, and Sammee Tong. The series first premiered on CBS in September 1957 before moving to NBC for the third season in 1959. The series'' fifth and final season aired on ABC from 1961 to 1962. A total of 157 episodes were aired. The series was based on "A New Girl in His Life", which aired on General Electric Theater on May 26, 1957. Bachelor Father is the only primetime series ever to run in consecutive years on the three major televisions networks.', 'Bachelor Father is an American sitcom starring John Forsythe, Noreen Corcoran, and Sammee Tong. The series first premiered on CBS in September 1957 before moving to NBC for the third season in 1959. The series'' fifth and final season aired on ABC from 1961 to 1962. A total of 157 episodes were aired. The series was based on "A New Girl in His Life", which aired on General Electric Theater on May 26, 1957. Bachelor Father is the only primetime series ever to run in consecutive years on the three major televisions networks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knAE7Of58hD1EYytaY2CMeBK7Vg.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:10990'),
  ('514052382472307781', 'Bachelor in Paradise', 2014, 'Reality, Drama', null, null, 'Jesse Palmer, Wells Adams, Hannah Brown', 'TV-14', 'Some of The Bachelor''s biggest stars and villains are back. They all left The Bachelor or The Bachelorette with broken hearts, but now they know what it really takes to find love, and on Bachelor in Paradise they''ll get a second chance to find their soul mates. Contestants live together in an isolated romantic paradise in Mexico and we follow these former bachelors and bachelorettes as they explore new romantic relationships.', 'Some of The Bachelor''s biggest stars and villains are back. They all left The Bachelor or The Bachelorette with broken hearts, but now they know what it really takes to find love, and on Bachelor in Paradise they''ll get a second chance to find their soul mates. Contestants live together in an isolated romantic paradise in Mexico and we follow these former bachelors and bachelorettes as they explore new romantic relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vFD4LFBKteMbsgcjOMbmlDmnX22.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:61190'),
  ('162100145734449776', 'Back', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Simon Blackwell', null, 'David Mitchell, Robert Webb, Penny Downie, Jessica Gunning, Oliver Maltman, Olivia Poulet, Louise Brealey', 'TV-MA', 'Estranged foster-brothers Stephen and Andrew vie to take over the family business following the death of their father.', 'Estranged foster-brothers Stephen and Andrew vie to take over the family business following the death of their father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQW08vw2nmKJUng3jqWGSAp7Esg.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:73781'),
  ('1021827426931879002', 'BACK ARROW', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuki Kaji, Anna Nagase, Aya Suzaki, Ari Ozawa, Kensho Ono, Ryotaro Okiayu, Tomokazu Sugita, Tomokazu Seki', 'TV-14', 'Lingalind is a land enclosed by the Wall. The Wall covers, protects, cultivates, and nurtures the land. One day in Edger, a village on the outskirts of Lingalind, a mysterious man named Back Arrow appears. Arrow has lost his memory, but he claims that all he knows is that “I came from outside the Wall.”', 'Lingalind is a land enclosed by the Wall. The Wall covers, protects, cultivates, and nurtures the land. One day in Edger, a village on the outskirts of Lingalind, a mysterious man named Back Arrow appears. Arrow has lost his memory, but he claims that all he knows is that “I came from outside the Wall.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w3RUD613FuVRRiS1g9IALhKdhVe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96942'),
  ('786938483335138376', 'Back at the Barnyard', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Steve Oedekerk', null, 'Chris Hardwick, Leigh-Allyn Baker, Jeffrey Garcia, Tino Insana, Cam Clarke, Rob Paulsen, Dom Irrera, Wanda Sykes', 'TV-Y7', 'What do farm animals really do when the humans aren''t looking? Just ask Otis, a carefree "party cow" who inherited the job of keeping the barn... and it''s residents... in order. But instead of responsibility, Otis is driven by an insatiable need for fun, fun, fun. Along with his barnyard friends Pip, Pig and Freddy, Otis will stop at nothing in his pursuit of a good time... which usually means a few close calls with humans and other threats to what really goes on behind closed barndoors.', 'What do farm animals really do when the humans aren''t looking? Just ask Otis, a carefree "party cow" who inherited the job of keeping the barn... and it''s residents... in order. But instead of responsibility, Otis is driven by an insatiable need for fun, fun, fun. Along with his barnyard friends Pip, Pig and Freddy, Otis will stop at nothing in his pursuit of a good time... which usually means a few close calls with humans and other threats to what really goes on behind closed barndoors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9O988PZT6hOyA9Pqb14YAEA1r6C.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:9921'),
  ('742578029364623669', 'Back for You', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Mystery, Drama', null, 'Tony Chan', 'Wang Anyu, Kuang Muye', null, 'In the early Republic of China, police officer A Lai is saved by a mysterious woman, Lu Na, who falls into a coma. Using her comic books, he solves cases and uncovers clues about her past, all while facing rising dangers linked to his newfound success.', 'In the early Republic of China, police officer A Lai is saved by a mysterious woman, Lu Na, who falls into a coma. Using her comic books, he solves cases and uncovers clues about her past, all while facing rising dangers linked to his newfound success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oWlXqL2mIyXdXw7RdstMe6VAK6n.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:232610'),
  ('415137386527929067', 'Back From the Brink', 2023, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hou Minghao, Zhou Ye, Riley Wang, Maggie Chen, Zuo Ye, Kenny Kwan, Ken Chang Tzu-Yao, Zhang Kaiying', null, 'Tian Yao is a dragon spirit who was betrayed by his lover and stripped of his dragon bones. He meets Yan Hui, a free-spirited young maiden who holds the key to help him regain his powers and his faith in love. Mysteries will abound as Yan Hui come to learn of her true origin.', 'Tian Yao is a dragon spirit who was betrayed by his lover and stripped of his dragon bones. He meets Yan Hui, a free-spirited young maiden who holds the key to help him regain his powers and his faith in love. Mysteries will abound as Yan Hui come to learn of her true origin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5Zkg5k0qNWhkSD8kOKlEAV6bep.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:146393'),
  ('138159817397709686', 'Back in the Game', 2013, 'Comedy, Family', 'Mark Cullen, Robb Cullen', null, 'James Caan, Maggie Lawson, Benjamin Koldyke, Griffin Gluck, Lenora Crichlow, Kennedy Waite, Josie Totah, Cooper Roth', 'TV-PG', 'Terry Gannon Jr. was an All Star softball player until life threw her a couple curve balls: a baby, a lost college scholarship and a loser for a husband. After striking out on her own, Terry and her son Danny move in with her estranged father, Terry Sr. aka "The Cannon," an opinionated, beer-guzzling, ex-athlete who never quite made the cut as a single father or professional baseball player. When Terry reluctantly offers to coach Danny and a group of other athletically-challenged hopefuls, her past comes rushing back.', 'Terry Gannon Jr. was an All Star softball player until life threw her a couple curve balls: a baby, a lost college scholarship and a loser for a husband. After striking out on her own, Terry and her son Danny move in with her estranged father, Terry Sr. aka "The Cannon," an opinionated, beer-guzzling, ex-athlete who never quite made the cut as a single father or professional baseball player. When Terry reluctantly offers to coach Danny and a group of other athletically-challenged hopefuls, her past comes rushing back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cnqbC4kgIV5dvn6KqN2Cp9Lmnmd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:50832'),
  ('642910072803212935', 'Back of Father', 2014, 'Drama, Family', null, 'Tsutomu Izumi, Atsuko Hashibe, Sō Kuramoto', null, null, 'A 10-part omnibus drama by 10 different scriptwriters on the theme of fathers and their sons and daughters.', 'A 10-part omnibus drama by 10 different scriptwriters on the theme of fathers and their sons and daughters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A333OGEr28WR4gf2Az3BMeFiQ1a.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88921'),
  ('174175755276930112', 'Back Roads', 2015, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Heather Ewart', 'NR', 'Take a road less travelled to the small towns and communities that make Australia special. Join Heather Ewart and guest presenters as they discover remarkable stories and inspiring people you''ll never forget.', 'Take a road less travelled to the small towns and communities that make Australia special. Join Heather Ewart and guest presenters as they discover remarkable stories and inspiring people you''ll never forget.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qGitOpZpYlFDn8VxZpec2R1R9hQ.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:65405'),
  ('1049937712815655668', 'Back Street Girls -GOKUDOLS-', 2018, 'Comedy, Animation', null, null, 'Daisuke Ono, Satoshi Hino, Kazuyuki Okitsu, Keiji Fujiwara, Kaori Maeda, Yuka Nukui, Junichi Suwabe, Natsuki Hanae', null, 'A group of 3 yakuza failed their boss for the last time. After messing up an important job, the boss gave them 2 choices: honorably commit suicide, or go to Thailand to get a sex reassignment surgery in order to become "female" idols. After a gruesome year training to become idols, they successfully debut, with overwhelming popularity, much to their dismay. This is where their tragedy truly begins.', 'A group of 3 yakuza failed their boss for the last time. After messing up an important job, the boss gave them 2 choices: honorably commit suicide, or go to Thailand to get a sex reassignment surgery in order to become "female" idols. After a gruesome year training to become idols, they successfully debut, with overwhelming popularity, much to their dismay. This is where their tragedy truly begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j1MtPZ0zq3aE2NiASGVgXRUhDCK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80613'),
  ('574403948738753432', 'Back Street Girls: Gokudols', 2019, 'Comedy, Crime', null, 'Shoichiro Masumoto, Hidehiro Ito', 'Jin Shirasu, Reiya Masaki, Masato Hanazawa, Natsumi Okamoto, Ruka Matsuda, Akane Sakanoue', null, 'Tough gangland retribution takes a disturbingly bright, shiny turn in this insanely guilty pleasure about 3 yakuzas who, as repayment for their failures, must undergo major surgery and become … a hot female idol trio! So what happens when they become the next big pop sensation!?', 'Tough gangland retribution takes a disturbingly bright, shiny turn in this insanely guilty pleasure about 3 yakuzas who, as repayment for their failures, must undergo major surgery and become … a hot female idol trio! So what happens when they become the next big pop sensation!?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fE3RtM8w8Hr8RH0kpMfdGGxKsrQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88791'),
  ('664107944544873389', 'Back Streets', 2006, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama, Family, Mystery, Comedy', null, 'Ahmet Yurdakul, Ozan Yurdakul, Ömer Genç', 'Zafer Ergin, Şevket Çoruh, Özgür Ozan, Oya Okar, Ozan Çobanoğlu, Alp Korkmaz, Ebru Cündübeyoğlu, Sarp Levendoğlu', 'NR', 'The series tells the story of the family lives of the police officers working in a special team of the Istanbul Police Department''s Public Security Department and their adventures on the streets of Istanbul. The team encounters different and diverse human stories during their missions. The Istanbul Police Chief Rıza Soylu (Zafer Ergin), with his years of experience and fatherhood, approaches these stories, which at times make them smile and at other times are heartbreaking, and guides the other young members of the team.', 'The series tells the story of the family lives of the police officers working in a special team of the Istanbul Police Department''s Public Security Department and their adventures on the streets of Istanbul. The team encounters different and diverse human stories during their missions. The Istanbul Police Chief Rıza Soylu (Zafer Ergin), with his years of experience and fatherhood, approaches these stories, which at times make them smile and at other times are heartbreaking, and guides the other young members of the team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxFzuKK8yEz9KdJXb6sPlhUU07s.jpg', 20, 'tmdb:tv:32836'),
  ('210698934349040684', 'Back to 15', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Janaina Tokitaka', 'André Hanks', 'Maisa Silva, Camila Queiroz, Klara Castanho, João Guilherme Ávila, Larissa Manoela, Nila, Antonio Carrara, Dora Freind', 'TV-14', 'Unhappy at work and in her personal life, Anita discovers a way to travel back to age 15. What will she change in her past?', 'Unhappy at work and in her personal life, Anita discovers a way to travel back to age 15. What will she change in her past?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iWZzSoADrns90iSrl0RIk6gupVu.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:132009'),
  ('518377083199172027', 'Back to 1989', 2016, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Family', 'Joyce Liu', null, 'Marcus Chang, Ray Yang, Ivy Shao, Tsai Huang Ru, Chieh Chang, Yorke Sun', null, 'A young successful young man has always felt something missing in his life because he never knew his father. At 26, Che Chen is already a successful assistant manager for an investment trust. But he was raised by his single mother Chen Mu and never knew the identity of his father, and that void has been nagging at him. But a freak accident sends Che back 27 years into the past, to the year before he was born. When he meets 22-year-old Zhen Zhen Ye, Che realizes that this naïve and trusting young woman is his mother''s best friend! When Che realizes that anything he does in the year 1989 could alter his mother’s future, will he do anything to alter the course of his own life?', 'A young successful young man has always felt something missing in his life because he never knew his father. At 26, Che Chen is already a successful assistant manager for an investment trust. But he was raised by his single mother Chen Mu and never knew the identity of his father, and that void has been nagging at him. But a freak accident sends Che back 27 years into the past, to the year before he was born. When he meets 22-year-old Zhen Zhen Ye, Che realizes that this naïve and trusting young woman is his mother''s best friend! When Che realizes that anything he does in the year 1989 could alter his mother’s future, will he do anything to alter the course of his own life?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e7nnaWIN9C8XZhaJ5fUZFy1yllp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69446'),
  ('274622305316455041', 'Back to Field', 2017, 'Reality', '张航希, Zhengyu Wang, Chen Gezhou', null, 'Huang Lei, He Jiong, Peng Yuchang, Zhang Zifeng', null, 'The show documents the simplistic lifestyle of living away from the bustling city centers. Each season takes place in a different rural part of China. The cast members are only provided with the basic life necessities and have to take care of everything else such as cooking their own meals and building their own furniture. To "buy" different cooking ingredients and other tools, they have to complete certain tasks assigned by the production crew, such as planting and harvesting crops. Different guests join the cast in each episode and help out with the daily chores. The goal of the program is to bring the audience along on a slower pace of life and to illustrate the joys of a simple lifestyle.', 'The show documents the simplistic lifestyle of living away from the bustling city centers. Each season takes place in a different rural part of China. The cast members are only provided with the basic life necessities and have to take care of everything else such as cooking their own meals and building their own furniture. To "buy" different cooking ingredients and other tools, they have to complete certain tasks assigned by the production crew, such as planting and harvesting crops. Different guests join the cast in each episode and help out with the daily chores. The goal of the program is to bring the audience along on a slower pace of life and to illustrate the joys of a simple lifestyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vyKJRdzZaOyWTJt62O3vBTbdz96.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:88939'),
  ('965762530143526133', 'Back to Life', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Daisy Haggard', null, 'Daisy Haggard, Geraldine James, Richard Durden, Jo Martin, Adeel Akhtar, Jamie Michie, Christine Bottomley', 'TV-MA', 'When Miri Matteson returns home after eighteen years, can she integrate back into her old life? With a terrible event from her past hanging over her, it won’t be easy.', 'When Miri Matteson returns home after eighteen years, can she integrate back into her old life? With a terrible event from her past hanging over her, it won’t be easy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/opMb4UHDVKCVSknT5DIPUaSRaSP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:88510'),
  ('1039784097897655765', 'Back to the Future', 1991, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'David Kaufman, Cathy Cavadini, Mary Steenburgen, Dan Castellaneta, Josh Keaton, Danny Mann, Bill Nye, Christopher Lloyd', 'TV-Y', 'An animated series for television based on the Back to the Future trilogy of feature films. Based on the highly successful Back to the Future movie trilogy, this series is set, um, "after" the events of the last film, as the adventures of Marty McFly and Doc Brown in their DeLorean time machine continue. Joining the ride is Clara, (Doc''s wife from Back To The Future Part III,) Jules and Verne (their sons) Einstein the dog and Jennifer (Marty''s girlfriend). And apparently there''s a Tannen in every time as relatives of Biff keep popping up, and creating conflict. Mary Steenburgen and Tom Wilson reprise their roles from the movies. During live portions of the show, Christopher Lloyd reprised his role as Doc Brown and was joined by Bill Nye, who conducted experiments that were used in the show.', 'An animated series for television based on the Back to the Future trilogy of feature films. Based on the highly successful Back to the Future movie trilogy, this series is set, um, "after" the events of the last film, as the adventures of Marty McFly and Doc Brown in their DeLorean time machine continue. Joining the ride is Clara, (Doc''s wife from Back To The Future Part III,) Jules and Verne (their sons) Einstein the dog and Jennifer (Marty''s girlfriend). And apparently there''s a Tannen in every time as relatives of Biff keep popping up, and creating conflict. Mary Steenburgen and Tom Wilson reprise their roles from the movies. During live portions of the show, Christopher Lloyd reprised his role as Doc Brown and was joined by Bill Nye, who conducted experiments that were used in the show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4V6DH7zvZCRhTMRRkouI9kosQ0C.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:4745'),
  ('109660540198047909', 'Back To The Island', 2017, 'Family, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Umberto Riccioni Carteni', null, 'Gianni Morandi, Alma Noce, Cosima Coppola, Chiara Baschetti, Michele Rosiello', null, 'Carloforte, a small island overlooking Sardinian Sea, someday shocked by an accident… a tuna factory explodes, killing some young, having there a party', 'Carloforte, a small island overlooking Sardinian Sea, someday shocked by an accident… a tuna factory explodes, killing some young, having there a party', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ujbS9ogl3MJQHmElLE48AJy0Rm.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:86822'),
  ('1075261643362924558', 'Back to You', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Christopher Lloyd, Steven Levitan', null, 'Kelsey Grammer, Patricia Heaton, Ty Burrell, Fred Willard, Josh Gad', null, 'Back to You is an American situation comedy series, which aired on Fox from September 19, 2007 to May 14, 2008. The creators and executive producers were Christopher Lloyd and Steven Levitan, and the director was James Burrows. The series starred Kelsey Grammer and Patricia Heaton as squabbling anchors of a news program.', 'Back to You is an American situation comedy series, which aired on Fox from September 19, 2007 to May 14, 2008. The creators and executive producers were Christopher Lloyd and Steven Levitan, and the director was James Burrows. The series starred Kelsey Grammer and Patricia Heaton as squabbling anchors of a news program.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/csGDLzcZA9XsmzSzfFMUzjOeSdQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5540'),
  ('357963656745239410', 'Backdoor', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Luz Aldán, Tato Alexander, Alfonso Borbolla, Verónica Bravo, Yuriria del Valle, Karla Farfán, Daniel Garcia, Daniel Haddad', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lnAzfeRootp20YdXUJJcxFVxwPW.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:105392'),
  ('680632486361903297', 'Backflip!!', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Shimba Tsuchiya, Kaito Ishikawa, Daisuke Ono, Takashi Kondo, Hiro Shimono, Hiroshi Kamiya, Ayumu Murase, Katsuyuki Konishi', 'TV-14', 'The final summer of middle school, Shotaro Futaba discovers boys gymnastics and is completely enamored by it. Shotaro ends up going to Soshukan Private High School (aka Ao High) and decides to visit the boys gymnastics club. He''s greeted by very unique senpais and a star gymnast named Misato Ryoya. Dedicating your life to something you love during your fiery days of youth... Of course, there is frustration, and fights, but see how these boys work together as a team towards a similar goal in this drama about sports and youth.', 'The final summer of middle school, Shotaro Futaba discovers boys gymnastics and is completely enamored by it. Shotaro ends up going to Soshukan Private High School (aka Ao High) and decides to visit the boys gymnastics club. He''s greeted by very unique senpais and a star gymnast named Misato Ryoya. Dedicating your life to something you love during your fiery days of youth... Of course, there is frustration, and fights, but see how these boys work together as a team towards a similar goal in this drama about sports and youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3cABr1YfivCljLO6BvupeOaTsxX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112601'),
  ('931125846278609952', 'Backstage', 2016, 'Drama, Family', 'Jennifer Pertsch, Lara Azzopardi', null, 'Alyssa Trask, Aviva Mongillo, Josh Bogert, Devyn Nekoda, Matthew Isen', 'NR', 'A group of “very talented” teenagers sing, dance, and perform their way to the top at the famous Keaton School of the Arts! From the disappointments of failure, to the new friendships and crowning achievements, being a student at Keaton means you''re on the path to becoming a star!', 'A group of “very talented” teenagers sing, dance, and perform their way to the top at the famous Keaton School of the Arts! From the disappointments of failure, to the new friendships and crowning achievements, being a student at Keaton means you''re on the path to becoming a star!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hnubRmEZjLPrw1mXgLule1AxcNA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66659'),
  ('872803904354612479', 'Backstreet Rookie', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lee Myung-woo, Son Geun-joo', 'Son Geun-joo', 'Ji Chang-wook, Kim Yoo-jung, Do Sang-woo, Han Seon-hwa, Ahn Sol-bin, Kim Min-gue, Lee Byung-joon, Kim Sun-young', 'TV-14', 'It tells an unpredictable 24-hour love story of the four-dimensional innocent girl Jung Saet Byeol who was once a troublemaker and the adorkable caring male store manager, Choi Dae Hyun, in the context of a convenience store. They have met each other accidentally 4 years ago, back then Saet Byeol asked Dae Hyun to buy cigarettes for them. Until now, Saet Byeol comes to the convenience store Dae Hyun runs for a part-time job, their hilarious romantic story starts.', 'It tells an unpredictable 24-hour love story of the four-dimensional innocent girl Jung Saet Byeol who was once a troublemaker and the adorkable caring male store manager, Choi Dae Hyun, in the context of a convenience store. They have met each other accidentally 4 years ago, back then Saet Byeol asked Dae Hyun to buy cigarettes for them. Until now, Saet Byeol comes to the convenience store Dae Hyun runs for a part-time job, their hilarious romantic story starts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHoNkQhhYFXSAG0RPRnyDdGi0jy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98827'),
  ('1090353696713594978', 'Backstrom', 2015, 'Crime, Drama', 'Hart Hanson', null, 'Rainn Wilson, Beatrice Rosen, Dennis Haysbert, Genevieve Angelson, Kristoffer Polaha, Page Kennedy, Thomas Dekker', 'TV-14', 'Detective Lieutenant Everett Backstrom is a man with no filter. After a five-year exile to the traffic division for offensive behavior, he has returned from disgrace to lead Portland''s newly minted S.C.U. Tasked with navigating the city''s most sensitive and serious cases, he must solve each crime as he tries, and fails, to change his own self-destructive behavior. Based on renowned Swedish criminologist and novelist Leif G.W. Persson’s hit series of books of the same name.', 'Detective Lieutenant Everett Backstrom is a man with no filter. After a five-year exile to the traffic division for offensive behavior, he has returned from disgrace to lead Portland''s newly minted S.C.U. Tasked with navigating the city''s most sensitive and serious cases, he must solve each crime as he tries, and fails, to change his own self-destructive behavior. Based on renowned Swedish criminologist and novelist Leif G.W. Persson’s hit series of books of the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jX1hRlRiBilKbOciczFgOibe6rO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:50971'),
  ('57350496212081581', 'Bäckström', 2020, 'Crime, Drama', 'Leif G.W. Persson', 'Dennis Magnusson, Jonathan Sjöberg', 'Kjell Bergqvist, Agnes Lindström Bolmgren, Filip Berg, Peshang Rad, Rolf Lydahl', null, 'Murder investigator Evert Bäckström is convinced that crimes have been committed when a women''s cranium is found on an island in the archipelago. But his investigation is countered by the police chief and when the woman''s identity is clarified, the entire investigation is turned upside down.', 'Murder investigator Evert Bäckström is convinced that crimes have been committed when a women''s cranium is found on an island in the archipelago. But his investigation is countered by the police chief and when the woman''s identity is clarified, the entire investigation is turned upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eTygPCwM7LvXNVyJbvCYLSqeRI1.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:100884'),
  ('595677473164698484', 'Bad and Crazy', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kim Sae-bom', 'Kim Sae-bom', 'Lee Dong-wook, Wi Ha-jun, Han Ji-eun, Cha Hak-yeon, Kang Ae-sim, Kim Dae-gon, Cha Si-won, Lee Sang-hong', 'TV-MA', 'A superhero drama about Soo-yeol who has lived his whole life as a materialistic police detective, but changes into a champion for justice and fights against police corruption when a hidden persona called "K" awakens inside him.', 'A superhero drama about Soo-yeol who has lived his whole life as a materialistic police detective, but changes into a champion for justice and fights against police corruption when a hidden persona called "K" awakens inside him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t9CRsIT1sGZY3bEpkWPZjMb4EWy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132979'),
  ('594943985496677530', 'Bad Banks', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', 'Christian Schwochow', null, 'Paula Beer, Barry Atsma, Désirée Nosbusch, Albrecht Schuch, Mai Duong Kieu, Tobias Moretti, Jean-Marc Barr, Germain Wagner', null, 'Ambitious Jana is confronted with the unscrupulous machinations of the world of finance. Her working life is determined by egotism, the pressure to succeed and machismo. She soon has to decide how far she is prepared to go for her career.', 'Ambitious Jana is confronted with the unscrupulous machinations of the world of finance. Her working life is determined by egotism, the pressure to succeed and machismo. She soon has to decide how far she is prepared to go for her career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MyD8UAf8Ae0uODBf6NukdNkgpo.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:76892'),
  ('1075611875446095155', 'Bad Behaviour', 2023, 'Drama', 'Corrie Chen', 'Pip Karmel, Magda Wozniak', 'Jana McKinnon, Markella Kavenagh, Yerin Ha, Erana James, Melissa Kahraman, Mantshologane Maile, Tuuli Narkle, Daya Czepanski', null, 'At the Silver Creek boarding school for girls in the Australian outback, students are largely left to their own devices in their spare time. This series tells the gripping and unsparing story of how the desire to belong sets in motion a cruel dynamic.', 'At the Silver Creek boarding school for girls in the Australian outback, students are largely left to their own devices in their spare time. This series tells the gripping and unsparing story of how the desire to belong sets in motion a cruel dynamic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lKEZdbcmeIDGfl0uvxu0yWl0sdX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207368'),
  ('544648073056369988', 'Bad Blood', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Simon Barry', null, 'Kim Coates, Louis Ferreira, Daniel Kash, Dylan Taylor, Lisa Berry, Melanie Scrofano, Franco Lo Presti', 'TV-MA', 'A dramatization of the life and death of Montreal mob boss Vito Rizzuto.', 'A dramatization of the life and death of Montreal mob boss Vito Rizzuto.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ukrAdTtJHHEaDRUJmi4XYwBUpRu.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:72742'),
  ('1139778293758586907', 'Bad Boy', 2024, 'Drama', 'Hagar Ben-Asher', null, 'Guy Menaster, Daniel Chen, Liraz Chamami, Havtamo Freda, Yishai Lalush, Bat-Chen Sabag, Neta Plotnik, Ben Sultan', null, 'Dean, a young teen living with his mother and younger brother, prepares to turn in for the night when a knock on the door changes his life forever. Correctional officers storm into his room and haul him, barely clothed, out of the house.', 'Dean, a young teen living with his mother and younger brother, prepares to turn in for the night when a knock on the door changes his life forever. Correctional officers storm into his room and haul him, barely clothed, out of the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/900OfLil2NMGnzvMXmBSEkXVW8Q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:234034'),
  ('55959671937350530', 'Bad Boy Billionaires: India', 2020, 'Crime, Documentary', null, null, 'Aayush Ailawadi', null, 'This investigative docuseries explores the greed, fraud, and corruption that built up - and ultimately brought down - India''s most infamous tycoons.', 'This investigative docuseries explores the greed, fraud, and corruption that built up - and ultimately brought down - India''s most infamous tycoons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dosaLkSyo4S98wjWgKsEaf1v5zQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:111086'),
  ('67017230110867919', 'Bad Buddy', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Pitchaya Sukphat', 'Pratchaya Thavornthummarut, Pongsate Lucksameepong', 'Korapat Kirdpan, Pawat Chittsawangdee, Pattranite Limpatiyakorn, Pansa Vosbein, Jitaraphol Potiwihok, Sattabut Laedeke, Natarit Worakornlertsith, Theepakorn Kwanboon', 'NR', 'At university, two young men raised to hate each other find music and love instead, forcing them to question family legacies and choose their own path.', 'At university, two young men raised to hate each other find music and love instead, forcing them to question family legacies and choose their own path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8slFjcbVZhr3rTTvrltmpLhdj4N.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:122009'),
  ('855758058792213878', 'Bad Education', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Jack Whitehall', null, 'Mathew Horne, Jack Binstead, Layton Williams, Charlie Wernham, Laura Marcus', null, 'Young teacher Alfie Wickers is "the worst teacher ever to grace the British education system" – at Abbey Grove School, in Watford, Hertfordshire.', 'Young teacher Alfie Wickers is "the worst teacher ever to grace the British education system" – at Abbey Grove School, in Watford, Hertfordshire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQ3OYgb9Q34NZPsTs99l4U2FdIn.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:58460'),
  ('793064502484699610', 'Bad Exorcist', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Bartosz Walaszek', null, 'No demon is safe as Bogdan Boner, the alcohol-loving, self-taught exorcist-for-hire, returns with more inventive, obscene and deadly deeds.', 'No demon is safe as Bogdan Boner, the alcohol-loving, self-taught exorcist-for-hire, returns with more inventive, obscene and deadly deeds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ed6ObDGwIPRQPvtoFLHgBKlmUU.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:114183'),
  ('1052733207198390303', 'Bad Genius: The Series', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', 'Pat Boonnitipat', 'Pat Boonnitipat, Tanida Hantaweewatana, Vasudhorn Piyaromna', 'Plearnpichaya Komalarajun, Sawanya Paisarnpayak, Jinjett Wattanasin, Paris Intarakomalyasut, Saksit Tangthong, Apasiri Nitibhon, Ratchanok Saeng-Chuto, Willie McIntosh', null, 'A top student gets pulled into a cheating racket with increasingly higher risks and even higher rewards. But she may lose much more than she gains.', 'A top student gets pulled into a cheating racket with increasingly higher risks and even higher rewards. But she may lose much more than she gains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYpWGXTOGWHg1Fs2zjmgRJrnHT4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106868'),
  ('850839473535396526', 'Bad Girl', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Azusa Tachibana, Nina Hanamiya, Misato Matsuoka, Miharu Hanai, Kaori Maeda, Lynn, Yui Horie', 'TV-14', 'At heart, Yuu Yuutani is a total goody-two-shoes and only has eyes for the school''s Madonna, Atori Mizutori. To get the attention of Atori, Yuu gives up the honor roll to become a bad girl! Too bad this very good girl isn''t very good at being bad!', 'At heart, Yuu Yuutani is a total goody-two-shoes and only has eyes for the school''s Madonna, Atori Mizutori. To get the attention of Atori, Yuu gives up the honor roll to become a bad girl! Too bad this very good girl isn''t very good at being bad!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/16y6aBnSSNUOikPkk21SFyhGgjD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:258000'),
  ('554248785965569947', 'Bad Girl Antics', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Juan Pablo Di Pace', 'TV-14', 'It is the story between Ricardo, a man trapped in a routine, and his teenage love, a nonconformist and adventurous woman who will take him out of his realistic framework.', 'It is the story between Ricardo, a man trapped in a routine, and his teenage love, a nonconformist and adventurous woman who will take him out of his realistic framework.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4uYXnoKk7tDPHwApbYudCM12loP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:216133'),
  ('535977333607535399', 'Bad Girlfriend', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Chae Seo-an, Yang Hyuk, Park Young-woon, Yoo Jung-hoo', 'TV-PG', 'Ji Soo, an advertising planner who is faithful to her desire to date someone she likes, is proud of her working abilities at her company. She is dating Tae Oh who is her superior at work and Ji Ho, a cheerful young man, who is out there trying to make ends meet. But when Ji Ho went to work at Ji Soo''s company, Ji Soo''s daily life, which seemed perfect, began to collapse... Will Ji Soo be able to handle all this and continue her two-legged relationship?', 'Ji Soo, an advertising planner who is faithful to her desire to date someone she likes, is proud of her working abilities at her company. She is dating Tae Oh who is her superior at work and Ji Ho, a cheerful young man, who is out there trying to make ends meet. But when Ji Ho went to work at Ji Soo''s company, Ji Soo''s daily life, which seemed perfect, began to collapse... Will Ji Soo be able to handle all this and continue her two-legged relationship?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vseKAWDPbmIBjnHSoptaIZnMm9l.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204625'),
  ('631324974934103150', 'Bad Girls', 1999, 'Drama, Crime', 'Maureen Chadwick, Ann McManus', null, 'Victoria Alcock, Kika Mirylees, Helen Fraser, Antonia Okonma, Nicola Stapleton, Stephanie Beacham, Amanda Barrie, Liz May Brice', 'TV-14', 'Bad Girls is a British television drama series that was broadcast on ITV from 1 June 1999 to 20 December 2006 and starred Simone Lahbib, Mandana Jones, Debra Stephenson, Linda Henry, Jack Ellis and many more throughout the eight-year run. The series was broadcast in 17 countries and was produced by Shed Productions, the company which later produced Footballers'' Wives and Waterloo Road. It is set in the fictional women''s prison of Larkhall, and features a mixture of serious and light storylines focusing on the prisoners and staff of G Wing. From 2010, the UK broadcast rights were bought by CBS Drama, and is repeated regularly – as of September 2012, the channel is re-running the series again in a late-night time slot.', 'Bad Girls is a British television drama series that was broadcast on ITV from 1 June 1999 to 20 December 2006 and starred Simone Lahbib, Mandana Jones, Debra Stephenson, Linda Henry, Jack Ellis and many more throughout the eight-year run. The series was broadcast in 17 countries and was produced by Shed Productions, the company which later produced Footballers'' Wives and Waterloo Road. It is set in the fictional women''s prison of Larkhall, and features a mixture of serious and light storylines focusing on the prisoners and staff of G Wing. From 2010, the UK broadcast rights were bought by CBS Drama, and is repeated regularly – as of September 2012, the channel is re-running the series again in a late-night time slot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vlYanINWRod3cKUyV4evJJsq1xW.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:2850'),
  ('479779487048652292', 'Bad Girls Club', 2006, 'Reality', 'Jonathan Murray, Mary-Ellis Bunim', null, null, 'TV-14', 'A cast of young women, who recognize that their outrageous behavior has hindered their relationships, careers and lives, are brought together in a beautiful mansion. They claim they want to change, but will living together help them move forward and turn their lives around – or will chaos rule?', 'A cast of young women, who recognize that their outrageous behavior has hindered their relationships, careers and lives, are brought together in a beautiful mansion. They claim they want to change, but will living together help them move forward and turn their lives around – or will chaos rule?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cEMlNl2madv94cfsNHbPiFBCaFg.jpg', 17, 'tmdb:tv:4940'),
  ('820782625491926928', 'Bad Guy', 2010, 'Drama', null, null, 'Han Ga-in, Kim Nam-gil, Kim Jae-uck, Mun Ka-young, Jung So-min, Park Joon Mok, Oh Yeon-soo, Kim Hye-ok', 'TV-14', 'Bad Guy is a 2010 South Korean melodrama television series, starring Kim Nam-gil, Han Ga-in, Kim Jae-wook, Oh Yeon-soo and Jung So-min. Directed by Lee Hyung-min, it aired on SBS from May 26 to August 5, 2010 on Wednesdays and Thursdays at 21:55 for 17 episodes.', 'Bad Guy is a 2010 South Korean melodrama television series, starring Kim Nam-gil, Han Ga-in, Kim Jae-wook, Oh Yeon-soo and Jung So-min. Directed by Lee Hyung-min, it aired on SBS from May 26 to August 5, 2010 on Wednesdays and Thursdays at 21:55 for 17 episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wwE3VvcyGhtsRMZhLVKNz32Xuwd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32784'),
  ('944668404238552035', 'Bad Guys', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama', null, 'Han Jung-hoon', 'Kim Sang-joong, Park Hae-jin, Don Lee, Kang Ye-won, Cho Dong-hyuk, Hwang Seung-eon, Kim Tae-hun', null, 'To combat rising violent crimes, the Police Chief asks Detective Oh Goo Tak to form a team consisting of criminals. He is currently suspended from the police force for using excessive force. He then gathers team members: Park Woong Chul who is a gangster, Lee Jung Moon who is the youngest serial killer with extraordinary intelligence and Jung Tae Soo who is a contract killer. Police Inspector Yoo Mi Young also joins the team and she tries to have these guys work as a team by dealing with them rationally and sometimes emotionally.', 'To combat rising violent crimes, the Police Chief asks Detective Oh Goo Tak to form a team consisting of criminals. He is currently suspended from the police force for using excessive force. He then gathers team members: Park Woong Chul who is a gangster, Lee Jung Moon who is the youngest serial killer with extraordinary intelligence and Jung Tae Soo who is a contract killer. Police Inspector Yoo Mi Young also joins the team and she tries to have these guys work as a team by dealing with them rationally and sometimes emotionally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xaUyUOf3CPV5MxaALRxUQMxsDvE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61700'),
  ('347433698438830358', 'Bad Guys: Vile City', 2017, 'Crime, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Han Jung-hoon', 'Han Jung-hoon', 'Kim Moo-yul, Yang Ik-june, Ju Jin-mo, Kim Ji-soo, Song Young-chang, Kim Jong Yoon, Hong Ji-yoon, Ju Jin-mo', 'TV-MA', 'Ordered to take down a villainous business leader who controls the city, a prosecutor gathers a team of men who may not be so clean themselves.', 'Ordered to take down a villainous business leader who controls the city, a prosecutor gathers a team of men who may not be so clean themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ob8JeEgAjUwAZAATI6uqOI743R2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75765'),
  ('745505165616441321', 'Bad Influence: The Dark Side of Kidfluencing', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Kief Davidson', 'Kief Davidson', 'Claire RockSmith, Corinne Joy, Sophie Fergi, Sawyer Sharbino, Brandon Stewart, Taylor Lorenz, Ashley RockSmith, Karen North', 'TV-MA', 'In this eye-opening documentary exposé, teens and parents reveal disturbing accounts of abuse and exploitation within the world of child influencers.', 'In this eye-opening documentary exposé, teens and parents reveal disturbing accounts of abuse and exploitation within the world of child influencers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbgdBz6VezAOCgNAhzNP6dL7XBC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:286338'),
  ('232664419838155921', 'Bad Internet', 2016, 'Comedy', null, 'Mike Trapp', null, null, 'A satirical anthology series about the terrifying potential futures of internet technology and culture. Not at all similar to any other shows about technological overreaching.', 'A satirical anthology series about the terrifying potential futures of internet technology and culture. Not at all similar to any other shows about technological overreaching.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogqVsgXKk9gEUynU2eF4ENZaSM4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66733'),
  ('57909350599197861', 'Bad Judge', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Anne Heche', null, 'Kate Walsh, Tone Bell, Ryan Hansen, John Ducey, Miguel Sandoval', 'TV-14', 'The series chronicles the personal life (and the wild lifestyle) of Rebecca Wright, a tough-as-nails judge serving on the Los Angeles County Circuit Court, whose time off the bench is spent partying and displaying a reckless behavior. Her reputation is about to be tamed—and judged—by Robby Shoemaker, a eight-year-old boy whose parents Rebecca put behind bars. He might be the one that can turn Rebecca''s life around.', 'The series chronicles the personal life (and the wild lifestyle) of Rebecca Wright, a tough-as-nails judge serving on the Los Angeles County Circuit Court, whose time off the bench is spent partying and displaying a reckless behavior. Her reputation is about to be tamed—and judged—by Robby Shoemaker, a eight-year-old boy whose parents Rebecca put behind bars. He might be the one that can turn Rebecca''s life around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t6xaYRcLvUAWwaoGw6EoUG39U7V.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60783'),
  ('770798917355448792', 'Bad Kid Good Partner', 2026, 'Drama', 'Millmill, Seonok', null, 'Bang Won-kyou, Hwang Dong-hee, Park Jun-mok', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGKOMbOFG22lrqbQxVNFmSLstbo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317062'),
  ('367842711622285563', 'Bad Monkey', 2024, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Bill Lawrence', null, 'Vince Vaughn, L. Scott Caldwell, Rob Delaney, Meredith Hagner, Natalie Martinez, Alex Moffat, Michelle Monaghan, Ronald Peet', 'TV-MA', 'A detective turned restaurant inspector in Southern Florida is pulled into a world of greed and corruption after a tourist finds a severed arm while fishing. And yes, there''s a monkey.', 'A detective turned restaurant inspector in Southern Florida is pulled into a world of greed and corruption after a tourist finds a severed arm while fishing. And yes, there''s a monkey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lUGG3lxIF3f2N796t4aHmxDhLK5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130853'),
  ('291422418982301656', 'Bad Mothers', 2019, 'Drama', 'Rachel Lang, Gavin Strawhan', null, 'Jagger Serafin, Paityn Batchelor, Jessica Tovey, Mandy McElhinney, Shalom Brune-Franklin, Tess Haubrich, Don Hany, Daniel MacPherson', null, 'Sarah’s perfect life as a GP, wife and mother is shattered when she discovers her husband is having an affair. Then her best friend is found murdered and Sarah’s husband, Anton, is arrested. She finds unlikely sisterhood and support in a ragtag group of outsiders.', 'Sarah’s perfect life as a GP, wife and mother is shattered when she discovers her husband is having an affair. Then her best friend is found murdered and Sarah’s husband, Anton, is arrested. She finds unlikely sisterhood and support in a ragtag group of outsiders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vS28RACtizHhOlKXiouy7BRxs2R.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86743'),
  ('367693177761662607', 'Bad Move', 2017, 'Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Jack Dee, Kerry Godliman, Miles Jupp, Seann Walsh, Sue Vincent, Philip Jackson', null, 'Steve and Nicky are both on their second marriages and have decided that moving to the countryside from the city is the answer to all their dreams. They''ve watched all the TV relocation shows and read the glossy lifestyle magazines and fell in love with the idea of ''getting away from the rat race''.', 'Steve and Nicky are both on their second marriages and have decided that moving to the countryside from the city is the answer to all their dreams. They''ve watched all the TV relocation shows and read the glossy lifestyle magazines and fell in love with the idea of ''getting away from the rat race''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7RIV6qXGjYAEmJtToxPp32FEqU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:74014'),
  ('176637013906541502', 'Bad Papa', 2018, 'Drama, Family', 'Son Hyung-Suk', null, 'Jang Hyuk, Son Yeo-eun, Shin Eun-soo, Ha Jun, Kim Jae-kyung, Kim Beong-choun, Kim Wook, Jeong Man-sik', null, 'Yoo Ji-Cheol used to be a top boxer, but he lost everything in a moment. All of his money and fame vanished and his life was ruined. He decides to gain control of his life through mixed martial arts.', 'Yoo Ji-Cheol used to be a top boxer, but he lost everything in a moment. All of his money and fame vanished and his life was ruined. He decides to gain control of his life through mixed martial arts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWKec54hDGiDjtQh1savtkwrhcj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82464'),
  ('96230806358932734', 'Bad Prosecutor', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, 'Im Young-bin', 'Doh Kyung-soo, Lee Se-hee, Ha Jun, Kim Sang-ho, Lee Si-eon, Joo Bo-young, Yeon Jun-seok, Kim Chang-wan', null, 'The delinquent prosecutor destroys everything corrupted with wealth and power. His face-off with evil begins.', 'The delinquent prosecutor destroys everything corrupted with wealth and power. His face-off with evil begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFH9Ze9RbviL3NcAfhi9DH3nH3W.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209408'),
  ('488385950306793828', 'Bad Romance', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'Thanutnun Vitsivakun', null, 'Tanshi Bumrungkit, Nattapol Diloknawarit, Pakorn Thanasrivanitchai, Tomo Visava Thaiyanont, Raweewit Jiraphongkanon, Petei Hokari', null, 'Yihwa lives fine without love—until Cho walks in and flips her world upside down, one misunderstanding at a time.', 'Yihwa lives fine without love—until Cho walks in and flips her world upside down, one misunderstanding at a time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z0MZsB4p4V1bUJN7eU3KlwtJTf9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70207');
