  ('452109898583116471', 'Bad Sisters', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Sharon Horgan, Dave Finkel, Brett Baer', null, 'Sharon Horgan, Eva Birthistle, Sarah Greene, Eve Hewson, Owen McDonnell', 'TV-MA', 'The tight-knit Garvey sisters have always looked out for one another. But when the toxic brother-in-law they all wanted dead actually dies, it turns their lives upside down and tests their bond like nothing before.', 'The tight-knit Garvey sisters have always looked out for one another. But when the toxic brother-in-law they all wanted dead actually dies, it turns their lives upside down and tests their bond like nothing before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z63D1Y8udrrFOhLFCT9YElcTr0w.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:199318'),
  ('349655541852706849', 'Bad Sport', 2021, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Randy Lanier, Pete Cullen, Jamie Salé', null, 'True crime and sports come together in this docuseries. Global controversies and scandals are explored through reports from those involved.', 'True crime and sports come together in this docuseries. Global controversies and scandals are explored through reports from those involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lst1t3sln5F7p2MsYwFevVNDOJV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:133358'),
  ('815823778999368870', 'Bad Surgeon: Love Under the Knife', 2023, 'Crime, Documentary', null, null, 'Dr. Paolo Macchiarini, Benita Alexander', 'TV-MA', 'Dr. Paolo Macchiarini is world famous for his revolutionary stem cell-infused windpipe transplants. There''s just one problem: His patients keep dying.', 'Dr. Paolo Macchiarini is world famous for his revolutionary stem cell-infused windpipe transplants. There''s just one problem: His patients keep dying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zD6asd71uBj1TMRRuGMeeqU2nnh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:238959'),
  ('1139552045510302713', 'Bad Teacher', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Hilary Winston', 'Amy Pocha', 'Ari Graynor, Sara Gilbert, Ryan Hansen, Sara Rodier, Kristin Davis, David Alan Grier, Caitlin Kimball', null, 'An always inappropriate, fearless and unapologetic former trophy wife masquerades as a teacher in order to find a new man after her wealthy husband leaves her penniless.', 'An always inappropriate, fearless and unapologetic former trophy wife masquerades as a teacher in order to find a new man after her wealthy husband leaves her penniless.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4VSo1nu0l4GuZKe4d5Q81tWgU09.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:49929'),
  ('289046071110716162', 'Bad Thoughts', 2025, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Tom Segura', 'TV-MA', 'A collection of hilariously disturbing stories that push the boundaries of decency in ways only Tom Segura could imagine.', 'A collection of hilariously disturbing stories that push the boundaries of decency in ways only Tom Segura could imagine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ByjkAKVjiMRwFTCX3AxibwennT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:251608'),
  ('1059556383671147434', 'Bad Vegan: Fame. Fraud. Fugitives.', 2022, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Chris Smith', null, 'Sarma Melngailis, Anthony Strangis, Allen Salkin, Ilze Melngailis, Bonnie Crocker, John Melngailis, Joey Repice, Nikki King Bennett', 'TV-MA', 'After marrying a mysterious man who claimed he could make her dog immortal, a celebrated vegan restaurateur finds her life veering off the rails.', 'After marrying a mysterious man who claimed he could make her dog immortal, a celebrated vegan restaurateur finds her life veering off the rails.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kcZ0dcgRo5miznCTJtqoB2b6p4j.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157709'),
  ('547319201282745389', 'Baddies Caribbean', 2024, 'Comedy, Reality, Drama', 'Natalie Nunn, Lemuel Plummer', null, 'Natalie Nunn, Scotlynd Ryan, Jelaminah Lanier, Sydonie Person, Anyssa Santiago, Asian Doll, Aubrey O''Day, Bianca Dupree', null, 'The Baddies head to the Caribbean where they plan on creating more of a storm than a Hurricane.', 'The Baddies head to the Caribbean where they plan on creating more of a storm than a Hurricane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/72C1GBm0MO2scR4oLOgnqMFfNjj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:253092'),
  ('809576193439353586', 'Baddies East', 2023, 'Reality', 'Natalie Nunn', null, null, null, 'Executive Producer Natalie Nunn, Chrisean Rock, Rollie and more of the OG Baddies are back to show up and show out with newbies like Sukihana and Sky — to take over the East Coast!', 'Executive Producer Natalie Nunn, Chrisean Rock, Rollie and more of the OG Baddies are back to show up and show out with newbies like Sukihana and Sky — to take over the East Coast!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cASNGLEWbMJ3v6MNXjDwk1beT2b.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:234927'),
  ('554145737717943578', 'Baddies Midwest', 2024, 'Reality', 'Natalie Nunn', null, 'Natalie Nunn, Rollie Pollie, Scotlynd Ryan', null, 'The Baddies are back - this time bringing it to the Midwest!', 'The Baddies are back - this time bringing it to the Midwest!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2FlU2ErTTQMyZNl763QOwA4hUg2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:275096'),
  ('765879886974746168', 'Baddies South', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Natalie Nunn, Scotlynd Ryan, Sidney Starr', null, 'The Baddies are back, but this time with some new ladies looking to take the entire Dirty South by storm — in a big ass, decked-out tour bus. Along the way, the ladies will crash in luxurious homes, host and perform at the hottest clubs and parties, tap into the wild and dark side of southern culture and prove why they are the baddest girls around.', 'The Baddies are back, but this time with some new ladies looking to take the entire Dirty South by storm — in a big ass, decked-out tour bus. Along the way, the ladies will crash in luxurious homes, host and perform at the hottest clubs and parties, tap into the wild and dark side of southern culture and prove why they are the baddest girls around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jz0xUwZEt0Ke0QwZ9T1Tf1dPkZh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204410'),
  ('176163747259154597', 'Baddies USA', 2025, 'Reality', null, null, 'Natalie Nunn, Chrisean Rock, Tommie Lee, Ahna Mac, Mariahlynn Carattini, Tesehki, Big Lex', null, 'Baddies USA is the eighth season of the popular Zeus Network reality franchise, serving as an all-star, cross-country edition featuring veteran cast members from previous Baddies seasons and Bad Girls Club, focusing on promotional events, touring U.S. cities, and inevitable drama, fights, and unexpected alliances among personalities like Natalie Nunn, Rollie, Tommie Lee, Chrisean Rock, and Tanisha Thomas, all centered around hosting parties and confronting personal beefs.', 'Baddies USA is the eighth season of the popular Zeus Network reality franchise, serving as an all-star, cross-country edition featuring veteran cast members from previous Baddies seasons and Bad Girls Club, focusing on promotional events, touring U.S. cities, and inevitable drama, fights, and unexpected alliances among personalities like Natalie Nunn, Rollie, Tommie Lee, Chrisean Rock, and Tanisha Thomas, all centered around hosting parties and confronting personal beefs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/27IYhrFLxogxRNKIVWivDnNfwF9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:309280'),
  ('523381342345070748', 'Baddies USA Reunion', 2026, null, null, null, null, null, 'Natalie Nunn and the USA cast rejoin each other on stage. Hosted by Janeisha John and Saucy Santana.', 'Natalie Nunn and the USA cast rejoin each other on stage. Hosted by Janeisha John and Saucy Santana.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:318258'),
  ('175147440759455468', 'Baddies West', 2023, 'Reality', null, null, 'Natalie Nunn, Catya Washington, Stunna Girl, Tommie Lee, Scotlynd Ryan', null, 'Executive Producer Natalie Nunn returns with the big bad tour bus and even badder Baddies. On this western leg, the ladies will be performing and hosting at some of the most lit clubs the cities have to offer, all while testing their patience and friendships. One thing is for sure: The wild west just got a whole lot wilder!', 'Executive Producer Natalie Nunn returns with the big bad tour bus and even badder Baddies. On this western leg, the ladies will be performing and hosting at some of the most lit clubs the cities have to offer, all while testing their patience and friendships. One thing is for sure: The wild west just got a whole lot wilder!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bQLnGcAbWNQ1nFfmeUUlZAkSyKv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218537'),
