  ('782813116937207067', 'Bag of Bones', 2011, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Stephen King', 'Matt Venne', 'Pierce Brosnan, Melissa George, Annabeth Gish, Anika Noni Rose, Matt Frewer, Jason Priestley, Caitlin Carmichael, Peter MacNeill', null, 'Bestselling novelist Mike Noonan, unable to cope after his wife''s sudden death, returns to the couple''s lakeside retreat in Maine, where he becomes involved in a custody battle between a young widow and her child''s enormously wealthy grandfather. Mike inexplicably receives mysterious ghostly visitations, escalating nightmares and the realization that his late wife still has something to tell him.', 'Bestselling novelist Mike Noonan, unable to cope after his wife''s sudden death, returns to the couple''s lakeside retreat in Maine, where he becomes involved in a custody battle between a young widow and her child''s enormously wealthy grandfather. Mike inexplicably receives mysterious ghostly visitations, escalating nightmares and the realization that his late wife still has something to tell him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDaGB39D8bIk8Jja8QYbv8nGaGj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39758'),
  ('770960593086679096', 'Baghdad Central', 2020, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Waleed Zuaiter, July Namir, Bertie Carvel, Corey Stoll, Leem Lubany, Clara Khoury, Neil Maskell, Tawfeek Barhom', 'TV-14', 'Shortly after the fall of Saddam Hussein, Iraqi ex-policeman Muhsin al-Khafaji has lost everything and is battling daily to keep himself and his sick daughter, Mrouj safe. But when he learns that his estranged elder daughter Sawsan is missing Khafaji is forced into a desperate search to find her.', 'Shortly after the fall of Saddam Hussein, Iraqi ex-policeman Muhsin al-Khafaji has lost everything and is battling daily to keep himself and his sick daughter, Mrouj safe. But when he learns that his estranged elder daughter Sawsan is missing Khafaji is forced into a desperate search to find her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/61ASRzboWIc5eVHddN93IM2Otm4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98272'),
  ('1061657888453718994', 'Bahar', 2024, 'Family, Drama', 'Neslihan Yeşilyurt', null, 'Demet Evgar, Buğra Gülsoy, Ecem Özkaya, Elit Andaç Çam, Demirhan Demircioğlu, Nil Sude Albayrak, Füsun Demirel, Hatice Aslan', null, 'When Bahar faces death, she will encounter another side of her family, especially her husband Timur, who seems ''perfect'' from the outside. Bahar''s sudden illness will change all dynamics in the family. In this period, Evren will become Timur''s rival in every sense. Bahar''s rebuilding of her life will instill hope in the viewers with often tragicomic stories.', 'When Bahar faces death, she will encounter another side of her family, especially her husband Timur, who seems ''perfect'' from the outside. Bahar''s sudden illness will change all dynamics in the family. In this period, Evren will become Timur''s rival in every sense. Bahar''s rebuilding of her life will instill hope in the viewers with often tragicomic stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Adjn7rsb1picDMUcYNjEDobhvAk.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:245914'),
  ('802962340177323641', 'Băieți de oraș', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Mihai Bendeac', null, 'Vlad Drăgulin, Lorena Luchian, Doina Teodoru, Cosmin Nedelcu, Mihai Bendeac, Anca Dinicu', null, 'Băieți de oraș is a TV series created by Mihai Bendeac. He exposes the lives of 4 teenagers: Roby Roberto, Malone, Robotzelu and Dorian. In this series, besides the protagonists, there were also famous actors from Romanian cinemas such as Rodica Popescu Bitănescu or Carmen Tănase. The intro song of the series is composed and performed by the Romanian rapper Cheloo. The Băieți de oraș comedy series is one of the most watched TV series in Romania.', 'Băieți de oraș is a TV series created by Mihai Bendeac. He exposes the lives of 4 teenagers: Roby Roberto, Malone, Robotzelu and Dorian. In this series, besides the protagonists, there were also famous actors from Romanian cinemas such as Rodica Popescu Bitănescu or Carmen Tănase. The intro song of the series is composed and performed by the Romanian rapper Cheloo. The Băieți de oraș comedy series is one of the most watched TV series in Romania.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rvdwJfiGdHqTiGEI8ukLGmmm7FW.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:68175'),
  ('354797434296288884', 'Bait', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Riz Ahmed', null, 'Riz Ahmed', 'TV-MA', 'Shah Latif is a struggling actor on the cusp of landing the role of a lifetime, only to find himself thrust into a full blown existential crisis and trippy conspiracy thriller all at the same time.', 'Shah Latif is a struggling actor on the cusp of landing the role of a lifetime, only to find himself thrust into a full blown existential crisis and trippy conspiracy thriller all at the same time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gX9zWmUnrjCZEPpultvvFtSUb93.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:257519'),
