  ('822783593166259456', 'Bakuage Sentai Boonboomger', 2024, 'Kids, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Haruhi Iuchi, Yuki Hayama, Miu Suzuki, Ryu Saito, Satoru Soma, Yu Miyazawa, Rica Matsumoto, Natsuki Hanae', null, 'When the Cosmic Invading Grand Racing Crew, Hashiriyan intends to expand their territory with Earth being their next target to take over, five genius mechanics join forces with an alien machine named Bundorio Bunderas to create their own supercars and special equipment to defend the planet as the Bakuage Sentai Boonboomger!', 'When the Cosmic Invading Grand Racing Crew, Hashiriyan intends to expand their territory with Earth being their next target to take over, five genius mechanics join forces with an alien machine named Bundorio Bunderas to create their own supercars and special equipment to defend the planet as the Bakuage Sentai Boonboomger!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yuoeMpIDKHHsjtiJmMerAtpOBbt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:234667'),
  ('215655113397690447', 'Bakugan', 2018, 'Animation, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Steven T. Seagle, Joe Kelly, Joe Casey', null, 'Jonah Wineberg, Margarita Valderrama, Deven Mack', 'TV-Y7', 'Follow the adventures of Dan Kouzo and his best friends: the first kids on Earth to bond with the mysterious creatures known as Bakugan!', 'Follow the adventures of Dan Kouzo and his best friends: the first kids on Earth to bond with the mysterious creatures known as Bakugan!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lg6QqCdvZOZM7EWf9zFJL12EsKv.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:87247'),
  ('210278602654559489', 'Bakugan Battle Brawlers', 2007, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Atsushi Maekawa', 'Joe Casey, Duncan Rouleau, Shelley Hoffman', 'Yu Kobayashi, Keiji Fujiwara, Ryo Hirohashi, Chihiro Suzuki, Chiharu Suzuka, Atsushi Ono, Eiji Miyashita, Hiroki Yasumoto', 'TV-Y7', 'Centers on the lives of creatures called Bakugan and the battle brawlers who possess them.', 'Centers on the lives of creatures called Bakugan and the battle brawlers who possess them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYSZCSW6wbHoS9aEijTv4xHgGbZ.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:34109'),
  ('638424999125634719', 'Bakuman', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Atsushi Abe, Satoshi Hino, Saori Hayami, Sayuri Yahagi, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Tomoyuki Shimura, Ayako Kawasumi, Ayumi Fujimura', 'TV-PG', 'Moritaka Mashiro and Akito Takagi are pretty much foils of each other. Mashiro, an average 9th grade student but talented artist, and Takagi, an overall advanced 9th grader and aspiring writer. After great convincing, Takagi convinces Mashiro to join him in becoming the greatest mangakas Japan has ever seen. Takagi, with his gift of writing, hopes to become a successful mangaka, and Mashiro, with his gift of art, hopes to marry the girl of his dreams, Azuki Miho.', 'Moritaka Mashiro and Akito Takagi are pretty much foils of each other. Mashiro, an average 9th grade student but talented artist, and Takagi, an overall advanced 9th grader and aspiring writer. After great convincing, Takagi convinces Mashiro to join him in becoming the greatest mangakas Japan has ever seen. Takagi, with his gift of writing, hopes to become a successful mangaka, and Mashiro, with his gift of art, hopes to marry the girl of his dreams, Azuki Miho.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwch4T5aUDPuJ6zUzkub8prfhtI.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:36041'),
  ('1015944001505779188', 'Bakuon!!', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Kikuko Inoue, Reina Ueda, Nao Toyama, Ibuki Kido, Rikako Yamaguchi, Yumi Uchiyama', null, 'The story revolves around high school girls who discover the appeal of motorcycles. Sakura Hane is a high school student who looks a little bit like an airhead. On the way to her all-female high school one day, she is worn-out climbing a hilly road with a bicycle, but she sees a girl named Onsa Amano who is riding a motorcycle. Sakura immediately becomes interested in motorcycles, and she and Onsa join the motorcycle club at the school. Then, Sakura sets out to get her license.', 'The story revolves around high school girls who discover the appeal of motorcycles. Sakura Hane is a high school student who looks a little bit like an airhead. On the way to her all-female high school one day, she is worn-out climbing a hilly road with a bicycle, but she sees a girl named Onsa Amano who is riding a motorcycle. Sakura immediately becomes interested in motorcycles, and she and Onsa join the motorcycle club at the school. Then, Sakura sets out to get her license.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCnI1xttsX9Yf3cT25lM7WsBPy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65926'),
  ('16644937709525022', 'Bakuryu Sentai Abaranger', 2003, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Kids', null, null, 'Kouichiro Nishi, Shou Tomita, Aiko Ito, Kaoru Abe, Kotaro Tanaka, Miyuki Nishijima, Kōen Okumura, Maya Suzuno', null, 'The meteorite believed to have once killed off the dinosaurs actually rattled the Earth into two parallel universes — Another Earth and Dino Earth, where dinosaurs continued to thrive. Now they have evolved into the Saurians, a race of humanoid dinosaurs, and the Bakuryu , a race of mechanized dinosaurs. But the wall between our universes has been breached. The Evolians that have been at war with the Saurians and Bakuryu have invaded, and it''s up to the Abarangers to protect the world!', 'The meteorite believed to have once killed off the dinosaurs actually rattled the Earth into two parallel universes — Another Earth and Dino Earth, where dinosaurs continued to thrive. Now they have evolved into the Saurians, a race of humanoid dinosaurs, and the Bakuryu , a race of mechanized dinosaurs. But the wall between our universes has been breached. The Evolians that have been at war with the Saurians and Bakuryu have invaded, and it''s up to the Abarangers to protect the world!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bDoHBImQZI7ruSkxWtnkxDLra58.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5281'),
  ('1063223298339733699', 'Bakusou Kyoudai Let''s & Go!!', 1996, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Hiroyuki Hoshiyama', null, 'Yuriko Fuchizaki, Haruna Ikezawa, Chie Koujiro, Noriko Hidaka, Kumiko Watanabe, Makiko Ohmoto, Junko Noda', null, 'Mini 4WD racing is an interesting hobby in where kids and adults compete using customized motorized miniature cars. Every year, competitions revolving around the hobby circulated around the world, with both kids and adults test out their spirit and passion in racing and companies developing new technologies and innovations for Mini 4WD. The story revolves around the competitive Seiba Brothers: Go and Retsu, who were once constantly arguing on each other to see who''s the best racer. However one day after a community-sponsored race, they both met Dr. Tsuchiya, the head of the Tsuchiya Racing Factory who gave them two Mini 4WD Cars of the prototype Saber Series: Sonic Saber and Magnum Saber. With his advice on telling the twins to customize them for the upcoming race, they are now determined to win and race to victory and set off to their wildest race of their lives. While meeting both friends and enemies in the Mini 4WD Racing world.', 'Mini 4WD racing is an interesting hobby in where kids and adults compete using customized motorized miniature cars. Every year, competitions revolving around the hobby circulated around the world, with both kids and adults test out their spirit and passion in racing and companies developing new technologies and innovations for Mini 4WD. The story revolves around the competitive Seiba Brothers: Go and Retsu, who were once constantly arguing on each other to see who''s the best racer. However one day after a community-sponsored race, they both met Dr. Tsuchiya, the head of the Tsuchiya Racing Factory who gave them two Mini 4WD Cars of the prototype Saber Series: Sonic Saber and Magnum Saber. With his advice on telling the twins to customize them for the upcoming race, they are now determined to win and race to victory and set off to their wildest race of their lives. While meeting both friends and enemies in the Mini 4WD Racing world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ptP84CfR8oigi3jnnIHEFke7fae.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:81157'),
