  ('113120016236487241', 'Be My Guest with Ina Garten', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Ina Garten', null, 'Ina Garten welcomes fun, interesting people into her home for food and conversation.', 'Ina Garten welcomes fun, interesting people into her home for food and conversation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCUEj68fNhGwFfgyVzQZup87hKM.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:196912'),
  ('151808867207050999', 'Be My Sunshine', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ali Bilgin', null, 'Ayça Ayşin Turan, Alp Navruz, Nihan Büyükağaç, İpek Tenolcay, Bülent Çolak, Rami Narin, Merve Nur Bengi, Fatih Yücebağ', 'NR', 'The paths of city businesswoman Haziran and Poyraz, a handsome and helpful young man, intersect on Swallow Island, and love arises from the disagreements of these two opposite characters.', 'The paths of city businesswoman Haziran and Poyraz, a handsome and helpful young man, intersect on Swallow Island, and love arises from the disagreements of these two opposite characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/keT555XS9rBrhqB3Fo917CiZBBT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:126255'),
  ('820404522534586646', 'Be Passionately in Love', 2025, 'Drama, Soap', 'Er Dong Tu Zi', null, 'Liu Haocun, Wang Anyu, Wu Hankun, Zhang Xinyi, Sun Zhihong', null, 'After her college entrance examination, Xu Zhi became the greatest winner in Ruijun Middle School, but she didn''t expect that she was about to be defeated in love.', 'After her college entrance examination, Xu Zhi became the greatest winner in Ruijun Middle School, but she didn''t expect that she was about to be defeated in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lHwDCUgN5bjOgWgASt0BMgHQVIQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259857'),
  ('566604326460564133', 'Be Positive', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Lee Byeong-heon', 'Doh Kyung-soo, Chae Seo-jin, David Lee, Kim Jong-soo, Heo Joon-seok, Kim Eui-sung, Nam Kee-ae', null, 'Film student Hwan-dong reunites with his ex, popular drama actress Hye-jeong to make his debut film. Hwan-dong struggles with such things as casting and budget, which reality does not make easy.', 'Film student Hwan-dong reunites with his ex, popular drama actress Hye-jeong to make his debut film. Hwan-dong struggles with such things as casting and budget, which reality does not make easy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hGlnroGLVmTng5UEOjWp696iUju.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68489'),
  ('605959679823385831', 'Be With You', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Zhou Miao', 'Ji Xiaobing, Zhang Yaqin, Li Mingde, Yang Yutong, Zhou Kaikai, Xu Weihao, Xiang Hao, Ma Li', null, 'A young cartoonist intentionally gets near Ji Yan Xin, a cold and arrogant professor. Qi Nian, a girl with a straightforward personality hopes that interacting with Ji Yan Xin would give her inspiration and creative materials for her comic plot. Coincidentally Ji Yan Xin’s younger brother Ji Si Qi becomes Qi Nian’s assistant and a catalyst for their relationship to progress and blossom.', 'A young cartoonist intentionally gets near Ji Yan Xin, a cold and arrogant professor. Qi Nian, a girl with a straightforward personality hopes that interacting with Ji Yan Xin would give her inspiration and creative materials for her comic plot. Coincidentally Ji Yan Xin’s younger brother Ji Si Qi becomes Qi Nian’s assistant and a catalyst for their relationship to progress and blossom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vv48WBi4TziwamYSEHxQ1is1TcH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113440'),
  ('460807245036140794', 'Be Yourself', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Yuan Yuan', 'Vivienne Tien, Shen Yue, Zhang Ruonan, Zhang Xinyi, Liang Jingkang, Zhai Zilu, Ding Guansen, Li Jiahang', null, 'Four women from varying walks of life meet as journalism majors and develop a lasting friendship that guides them through the journey of growing up.', 'Four women from varying walks of life meet as journalism majors and develop a lasting friendship that guides them through the journey of growing up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJVnEi58Ik368gT4VlEwOOb0Otc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129349'),
  ('64904222536814531', 'Beach Boys', 1997, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Takashi Sorimachi, Yutaka Takenouchi, Hirosue Ryoko, Izumi Inamori, Mike Maki, Yûki Akimoto, Sachie Hara, Masaomi Hiraga', null, 'Hiromi and Kaito end up in a guesthouse run by an ageing surfer and his granddaughter Makoto. The summer passes amidst the comings and goings of guests, each one gradually discovering the others.', 'Hiromi and Kaito end up in a guesthouse run by an ageing surfer and his granddaughter Makoto. The summer passes amidst the comings and goings of guests, each one gradually discovering the others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m4lLQKVbLoW1zhQDaEBKHAc7k8v.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:23974'),
  ('681206227994641303', 'Beacon 23', 2023, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Zak Penn', null, 'Stephan James', 'TV-MA', 'Aster Calyx and Halan Kai Nielsen are inextricably drawn to Beacon 23. Navigating one threat after another, they unravel the beacon’s mysteries, just in time to face their most powerful enemy.', 'Aster Calyx and Halan Kai Nielsen are inextricably drawn to Beacon 23. Navigating one threat after another, they unravel the beacon’s mysteries, just in time to face their most powerful enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/navBdlLzcebb6ANZVg24Szfil9h.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:112388'),
  ('925163068600753658', 'Beakman''s World', 1992, 'Comedy, Kids', 'Jok R. Church', null, 'Paul Zaloom, Mark Ritts, Senta Moses, Bert Berdis, Alan Barzman', 'TV-Y', 'Beakman''s World is an educational children''s television show. The program is based on the Universal Press Syndicate syndicated comic strip You Can with Beakman and Jax created by Jok Church. The series premiered September 18, 1992 on The Learning Channel cable network and in national syndication. On September 18, 1993 it moved from national syndication to CBS Saturday morning children’s lineup. At the peak of its popularity, it was seen in nearly 90 countries around the world. The series was canceled in 1998. Reruns returned to national syndication in September 2006, after which it was transferred to local stations such as KICU. The show debuted a year prior to Bill Nye the Science Guy, which covered similar topics. The show''s host, Paul Zaloom, still performs as Beakman in live appearances around the globe.', 'Beakman''s World is an educational children''s television show. The program is based on the Universal Press Syndicate syndicated comic strip You Can with Beakman and Jax created by Jok Church. The series premiered September 18, 1992 on The Learning Channel cable network and in national syndication. On September 18, 1993 it moved from national syndication to CBS Saturday morning children’s lineup. At the peak of its popularity, it was seen in nearly 90 countries around the world. The series was canceled in 1998. Reruns returned to national syndication in September 2006, after which it was transferred to local stations such as KICU. The show debuted a year prior to Bill Nye the Science Guy, which covered similar topics. The show''s host, Paul Zaloom, still performs as Beakman in live appearances around the globe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6wXEkbyhwh98kFWPtfjn5EdVHu.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:5343'),
  ('846989196078417876', 'Bear Grylls: Escape From Hell', 2013, 'Reality, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Bear Grylls', 'TV-PG', 'Bear Grylls takes his survival expertise one step further as he reveals the incredible stories of ordinary people stranded in devastatingly dire situations. Coupled with incredible archive footage and interviews with the survivors, Bear will pit himself against the very same dangers and scenarios, reliving their journeys through first-hand experience and showing us how to survive through some of the world''s most desolate landscapes.', 'Bear Grylls takes his survival expertise one step further as he reveals the incredible stories of ordinary people stranded in devastatingly dire situations. Coupled with incredible archive footage and interviews with the survivors, Bear will pit himself against the very same dangers and scenarios, reliving their journeys through first-hand experience and showing us how to survive through some of the world''s most desolate landscapes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRFr8E4rE3igUBiRM1HA3kQo1JC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63375'),
  ('319437797158448216', 'Bear in the Big Blue House', 1997, 'Kids', 'Mitchell Kriegman', null, 'Noel MacNeal, Lynne Thigpen, Carmen Osbahr, Geoffrey Holder, Tyler Bunch, Peter Linz, Vicki Kenderes-Eibner, Tara Mooney', 'TV-Y', 'The series provides children with valuable tools for growth in key areas of music, social skill development, and cognitive learning through integrated programs combining music, movement, and exploration. With Bear and all his friends, learn about cooperation, teamwork and more.', 'The series provides children with valuable tools for growth in key areas of music, social skill development, and cognitive learning through integrated programs combining music, movement, and exploration. With Bear and all his friends, learn about cooperation, teamwork and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hww73tErgeSOQ6YlcKjey0smc8s.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:207'),
  ('445101064836179298', 'Beartown', 2020, 'Drama', 'Anders Weidemann, Linn Gottfridsson, Antonia Pyk', null, 'Miriam Ingrid, Oliver Dufåker, Otto Fahlgren, Ulf Stenberg, Aliette Opheim, Tobias Zilliacus, Tyler Shamy', 'TV-MA', 'Hockey is the last beacon of hope for the citizens of Björnstad, so when its junior hockey team makes the national semifinal, the burden of the entire town’s dreams weigh heavily on the shoulders of its teenage superstars. However, the day of the semi-final is also the catalyst for a violent act that will leave a young girl traumatised and the town in turmoil.', 'Hockey is the last beacon of hope for the citizens of Björnstad, so when its junior hockey team makes the national semifinal, the burden of the entire town’s dreams weigh heavily on the shoulders of its teenage superstars. However, the day of the semi-final is also the catalyst for a violent act that will leave a young girl traumatised and the town in turmoil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82fby3JG8ObTxXwiB1cSaA37oB0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110173'),
  ('281909595793819662', 'Beast Games', 2024, 'Reality', 'Jimmy Donaldson, Tyler Conklin, Sean Klitzner', null, 'Jimmy Donaldson, Chandler Hallow, Karl Jacobs, Nolan Hansen, Tareq Salameh, Mack Hopkins, Sean Klitzner', 'TV-PG', 'I gathered 1,000 people to fight for $5,000,000, the LARGEST cash prize in TV history! We''re also giving away a private island, Lamborghinis, and millions more in cash throughout the competition! Go watch to see the greatest show ever made!', 'I gathered 1,000 people to fight for $5,000,000, the LARGEST cash prize in TV history! We''re also giving away a private island, Lamborghinis, and millions more in cash throughout the competition! Go watch to see the greatest show ever made!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Zww0KyC518xni9m12dA3qB392D.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:249522'),
  ('1050929372453718208', 'Beast King GoLion', 1981, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kazuhiko Inoue, Yu Mizushima, Masako Nozawa, Ryusei Nakao, Rumiko Ukai, Tessyo Genda, Yuji Fujishiro, Kazuyo Aoki', 'TV-14', 'Long ago, a powerful sentient robot known as GoLion, abused his great powers by attacking and killing creatures known as Deathblack Beastmen, boasting that no one could defeat him. For his arrogance, The Goddess of the Universe punished GoLion by separating him into 5 different lion robots. In the year 1999, a group of 5 young men returned to Earth after a space voyage, only to find it ravaged by nuclear war. After encountering the alien race known as the Galra, the 5 youths end up on the planet Altea and learn that the 5 lion robots that GoLion was split into are in hibernation in various parts of Altea. Somehow, they must reunite the lions and form GoLion, the only hope for the human race.', 'Long ago, a powerful sentient robot known as GoLion, abused his great powers by attacking and killing creatures known as Deathblack Beastmen, boasting that no one could defeat him. For his arrogance, The Goddess of the Universe punished GoLion by separating him into 5 different lion robots. In the year 1999, a group of 5 young men returned to Earth after a space voyage, only to find it ravaged by nuclear war. After encountering the alien race known as the Galra, the 5 youths end up on the planet Altea and learn that the 5 lion robots that GoLion was split into are in hibernation in various parts of Altea. Somehow, they must reunite the lions and form GoLion, the only hope for the human race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2SY3q7ECRGxbAKLyrD0IvVAPIv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13784'),
  ('254442832863507857', 'Beast Machines: Transformers', 1999, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids', null, null, 'Garry Chalk, David Kaye, Ian James Corlett, Venus Terzo, Scott McNeil, Kathleen Barr, Jim Byrnes, Alessandro Juliani', null, 'After the end of the Beast Wars, the Maximals awaken on their home planet of Cybertron and are chased by mindless Vehicons created by Megatron. The Maximals must free the planet from Megatron and restore it to its real way of living.', 'After the end of the Beast Wars, the Maximals awaken on their home planet of Cybertron and are chased by mindless Vehicons created by Megatron. The Maximals must free the planet from Megatron and restore it to its real way of living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNvziasPFwBlWDpmM346OnUB6E6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:932'),
  ('608731690232803344', 'Beast Tamer', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shoya Chiba, Azumi Waki, Rumi Okubo, Minami Tanaka, Maria Sashide, Marika Kouno, Rie Takahashi', 'TV-14', 'Rein is a Beast Tamer who fights alongside heroes to bring down the Demon King. But one day his comrades declare him useless and kick him out of the party, after which he decides to start a carefree life as an adventurer. During the test he must pass to become an adventurer, he runs into a girl named Kanade who is being attacked by a monster. Rein risks his life to make sure she can escape, but then she brings down the monster in one hit. It turns out that Kanade is from the inordinately powerful tribe of cat people, one of the strongest species! She becomes attracted to his combination of talent and gentle nature and asks: "Would you try to tame me?" Rein forms a contract with the strongest cat-eared girl and starts his new life as an adventurer. The heroes who kicked him out of the party, as well as other stronger species, take notice of his power.', 'Rein is a Beast Tamer who fights alongside heroes to bring down the Demon King. But one day his comrades declare him useless and kick him out of the party, after which he decides to start a carefree life as an adventurer. During the test he must pass to become an adventurer, he runs into a girl named Kanade who is being attacked by a monster. Rein risks his life to make sure she can escape, but then she brings down the monster in one hit. It turns out that Kanade is from the inordinately powerful tribe of cat people, one of the strongest species! She becomes attracted to his combination of talent and gentle nature and asks: "Would you try to tame me?" Rein forms a contract with the strongest cat-eared girl and starts his new life as an adventurer. The heroes who kicked him out of the party, as well as other stronger species, take notice of his power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7L6yRZ0sXOHs588A68uWERSNMMg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203780'),
  ('694258297484494617', 'Beast Wars: Transformers', 1996, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids', 'Bob Forward, Larry DiTillio', null, 'Garry Chalk, David Kaye, Colin Murdock, Scott McNeil, Ian James Corlett, Richard Newman, Venus Terzo, Jim Byrnes', 'TV-Y7', 'Two spaceships, one manned by benevolent Maximals, the other by evil Predacons, crash-land on a pre-humanoid planet while en route to Earth. Their crews assume indigenous animal forms to protect themselves from an overabundance of natural energy, transforming into robots to do battle. Thus, the Beast Wars have begun...', 'Two spaceships, one manned by benevolent Maximals, the other by evil Predacons, crash-land on a pre-humanoid planet while en route to Earth. Their crews assume indigenous animal forms to protect themselves from an overabundance of natural energy, transforming into robots to do battle. Thus, the Beast Wars have begun...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lcXv4pFn3NhhFAL7oe6u7DmO40w.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:958'),
  ('401928853003057803', 'BEASTARS', 2019, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery, Crime', null, null, 'Chikahiro Kobayashi, Sayaka Senbongi, Yuki Ono', 'TV-MA', 'In a world where beasts of all kinds coexist, a gentle wolf awakens to his own predatory urges as his school deals with a murder within its midst.', 'In a world where beasts of all kinds coexist, a gentle wolf awakens to his own predatory urges as his school deals with a murder within its midst.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sh9iNWkleOjEHRHj8WPHhmMi8HL.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:90937'),
  ('972314817977155047', 'BeastMaster', 1999, 'Action & Adventure, Mystery, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Andre Norton', null, 'Daniel Goddard, Jackson Raine', 'TV-PG', 'BeastMaster chronicles the adventures of Dar, the last surviving male of the storied Sula tribe, who is blessed with the ability to communicate telepathically with the animals of his ancient world. Also endowed with the strength, courage and fighting skills of a great warrior, he uses his gifts to defend all living creatures oppressed by the forces of evil.', 'BeastMaster chronicles the adventures of Dar, the last surviving male of the storied Sula tribe, who is blessed with the ability to communicate telepathically with the animals of his ancient world. Also endowed with the strength, courage and fighting skills of a great warrior, he uses his gifts to defend all living creatures oppressed by the forces of evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kp0BYJwFfPlkSejAoIGc2GR77bD.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2925'),
  ('532232492176138401', 'Beat', 2018, 'Drama', 'Marco Kreuzpaintner', null, 'Jannis Niewöhner, Carlo Ljubek, Karl Markovics, Nina Gummich, Waldemar Kobus, Svenja Jung, Anna Bederke, Christian Berkel', 'TV-MA', 'Robert Schlag, nicknamed "Beat", is a Berlin club promoter who lives for the excesses of sex, drugs and the city nightlife. His connections to the underworld lead the police to use Beat to try and infiltrate a notorious organ smuggling ring.', 'Robert Schlag, nicknamed "Beat", is a Berlin club promoter who lives for the excesses of sex, drugs and the city nightlife. His connections to the underworld lead the police to use Beat to try and infiltrate a notorious organ smuggling ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n93VE8dIgmIt9leH5zBRZbTdBcc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83872'),
  ('700907412098022169', 'Beat Bobby Flay', 2013, 'Reality', 'Bobby Flay', null, 'Bobby Flay', 'TV-G', 'Two talented chefs go head-to-head for the chance to Beat Bobby Flay. To get to Bobby the chefs must first face off against each other, creating a spectacular dish with a secret ingredient of Bobby''s choice. Judges Alex Guarnaschelli and Jeff Mauro know Bobby''s strengths and his weaknesses. Their goal: Pick the chef who has the skills to take down Bobby Flay in his own arena. The winning chef gets to challenge Bobby with his or her surprise signature dish. If Bobby goes down, the winner can tell the world, "I beat Bobby Flay!"', 'Two talented chefs go head-to-head for the chance to Beat Bobby Flay. To get to Bobby the chefs must first face off against each other, creating a spectacular dish with a secret ingredient of Bobby''s choice. Judges Alex Guarnaschelli and Jeff Mauro know Bobby''s strengths and his weaknesses. Their goal: Pick the chef who has the skills to take down Bobby Flay in his own arena. The winning chef gets to challenge Bobby with his or her surprise signature dish. If Bobby goes down, the winner can tell the world, "I beat Bobby Flay!"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vY8Bep9K9oFSz0C9gnTVipfBciU.jpg', 42, 'tmdb:tv:62481'),
  ('617226759643524240', 'Beat Shazam', 2017, 'Reality', 'Jeff Apploff, Wes Kauble', null, 'Jamie Foxx, Corinne Foxx, DJ Irie', 'TV-14', 'Game show in which teams of two race against the clock and each other as they attempt to identify the biggest hit songs of all time. In the end, the team with the highest score will outlast the competition and go against Shazam, the world’s most popular song identification app, for the chance to win a cash prize.', 'Game show in which teams of two race against the clock and each other as they attempt to identify the biggest hit songs of all time. In the end, the team with the highest score will outlast the competition and go against Shazam, the world’s most popular song identification app, for the chance to win a cash prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2U5Iulo8NWWiOiVx0f7VX9o4RM.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:71654'),
  ('842198353528860060', 'Beating Again', 2015, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', null, '유희경', 'Jung Kyung-ho, Kim So-yeon, Yoon Hyun-min, Park Young-kyu, Ahn Suk-hwan, Cho Eun-ji, Lee Si-eon, Kong Hyun-joo', null, 'After his uncle''s unjust takeover of the family company, Kang Min Ho grows up to be a successful, if not cynical investor who only cares about money. But when he undergoes a sudden heart transplant surgery, Min Ho literally has a change of heart when he inherits a warm and compassionate heart. In the midst of seeing the world anew, including falling for the kind Kim Soon Jung, Min Ho must mitigate his newfound personality with the demands of his cutthroat career.', 'After his uncle''s unjust takeover of the family company, Kang Min Ho grows up to be a successful, if not cynical investor who only cares about money. But when he undergoes a sudden heart transplant surgery, Min Ho literally has a change of heart when he inherits a warm and compassionate heart. In the midst of seeing the world anew, including falling for the kind Kim Soon Jung, Min Ho must mitigate his newfound personality with the demands of his cutthroat career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2BZknHHXDOUxE5qifjDRLMbaXq7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62267'),
  ('270573521872032205', 'Beatless', 2018, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Satoshi Hase', null, 'Saki Ono, Emiri Suyama, Misako Tomioka, Sora Amamiya, Nao Toyama, Uki Satake, Kaito Ishikawa, Hiromi Igarashi', null, 'Most of the world''s needs are fulfilled by humanoid robots called hIE''s. One day, 17-year-old Arato Endo meets the android Lacia and becomes her owner. She is one of five androids with advanced AI. Each of the five units have their own motivations, and fight to gain each other''s abilities. What will the relationship between man and machine be moving forward? That is something Arato must find.', 'Most of the world''s needs are fulfilled by humanoid robots called hIE''s. One day, 17-year-old Arato Endo meets the android Lacia and becomes her owner. She is one of five androids with advanced AI. Each of the five units have their own motivations, and fight to gain each other''s abilities. What will the relationship between man and machine be moving forward? That is something Arato must find.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2PtN9nZJYEXiklRe1T5DxwIKED9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76062'),
  ('250494915980500824', 'Beau geste', 2023, 'Talk', 'Pierre Lescure', null, 'Pierre Lescure', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjSEePJBEr7A3bUNCRtBXHLU0Le.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:219282'),
  ('217938207222996230', 'Beautiful Bones: Sakurako''s Investigation', 2015, 'Animation, Crime, Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Junya Enoki, Shizuka Itoh, Kikuko Inoue, Ayaka Imamura, Akira Ishida, Masako Isobe', 'TV-MA', 'Shōtarō Tatewaki is a normal high school student with a serious demeanor hangs around with Sakurako Kujō. Sakurako is an extraordinarily beautiful woman in her mid-20s from a rich family who loves "beautiful bones." The two live in the city of Asahikawa in Hokkaido, and they get involved in various incidents regarding bones.', 'Shōtarō Tatewaki is a normal high school student with a serious demeanor hangs around with Sakurako Kujō. Sakurako is an extraordinarily beautiful woman in her mid-20s from a rich family who loves "beautiful bones." The two live in the city of Asahikawa in Hokkaido, and they get involved in various incidents regarding bones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zZVY6Sx4mFOuWsWwOKXhyTrxYZy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64699'),
  ('1090722189371447804', 'Beautiful Charm', 2010, 'Comedy, Family', 'Gani Müjde', 'Emre Bülbül, Gani Müjde, Özlem Aybek', 'Hakan Yılmaz, Aslihan Gurbuz, Gökçe Özyol, Hande Katipoğlu, Sezai Aydın, Serhan Arslan, Erdal Türkmen, Ege Kökenli', null, 'Cazibe, an Azerbaijani immigrant, marries Kemal to become a Turkish citizen. Ms. Gül who deals with illegal marriages arranges this marriage which will last for 3 years according to the agreement. Kemal receives 10,000 Turkish liras from Cazibe. But Kemal has a girlfriend, Simge, who is the daughter of Kemal''s boss. Kemal''s boss does not know that Kemal and his daughter are in a relationship. Simge thinks that Cazibe is Kemal''s maid. However, Ejder is the foreign marriage detective and he is trying to find proof that Cazibe only married Kemal to become a Turkish Citizen. The word "Yahşi" comes from Azerbaijani and means "beautiful, nice, attractive". "Cazibe" means seduction.', 'Cazibe, an Azerbaijani immigrant, marries Kemal to become a Turkish citizen. Ms. Gül who deals with illegal marriages arranges this marriage which will last for 3 years according to the agreement. Kemal receives 10,000 Turkish liras from Cazibe. But Kemal has a girlfriend, Simge, who is the daughter of Kemal''s boss. Kemal''s boss does not know that Kemal and his daughter are in a relationship. Simge thinks that Cazibe is Kemal''s maid. However, Ejder is the foreign marriage detective and he is trying to find proof that Cazibe only married Kemal to become a Turkish Citizen. The word "Yahşi" comes from Azerbaijani and means "beautiful, nice, attractive". "Cazibe" means seduction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOt5Ac7AjIkheZiZhFMBd5v1E7J.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:37647'),
  ('1038964505292275408', 'Beautiful Cooking', 2006, 'Reality', null, null, 'Ronald Cheng Chung-Kei, Alex Fong Lik-Sun, Edmond Leung Hon-Man', null, 'Beautiful Cooking is a Hong Kong variety show broadcast on TVB. The show began broadcasting on May 28, 2006 hosted by Ronald Cheng, Alex Fong and Edmond Leung. The second season began broadcast from April 5, 2009.', 'Beautiful Cooking is a Hong Kong variety show broadcast on TVB. The show began broadcasting on May 28, 2006 hosted by Ronald Cheng, Alex Fong and Edmond Leung. The second season began broadcast from April 5, 2009.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhYdAg0lWPwDInZCOeVyM2Z7cv3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:15460'),
  ('901806417410543756', 'Beautiful frame', 2023, 'Comedy, Talk', null, null, 'Geppi Cucciari', null, 'Geppi Cucciari presents a people show, attentive to current events. The story of today''s world with irony and lightness through books, films, social networks, television and art. Actors, friends and witnesses of our time bring an exclusive collection of words, anecdotes, curiosities, objects to TV and build the week moment by moment.', 'Geppi Cucciari presents a people show, attentive to current events. The story of today''s world with irony and lightness through books, films, social networks, television and art. Actors, friends and witnesses of our time bring an exclusive collection of words, anecdotes, curiosities, objects to TV and build the week moment by moment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ycdn1afQknSeqd3TAt3ykoYgD8z.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:218764'),
  ('648915448041286780', 'Beautiful Gong Shim', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Baek Su-chan, Nam Tae-jin', 'Lee Hee-myung', 'Namkoong Min, Bang Min-ah, On Ju-wan, Seo Hyo-rim, Oh Hyun-kyung, Woo Hyeon, Jeong Hye-seon, Kyeon Mi-ri', null, 'Needing funds to study art abroad, Gong Shim rents out her rooftop room to a pro bono lawyer, who begins shaking up her otherwise dispiriting life.', 'Needing funds to study art abroad, Gong Shim rents out her rooftop room to a pro bono lawyer, who begins shaking up her otherwise dispiriting life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/peO3vXCws2bD7xz2rWxgJ1CHYC1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66431'),
  ('884840193588219985', 'Beautiful Life', 2000, 'Drama', null, null, 'Takuya Kimura, Takako Tokiwa, Atsuro Watabe, Miki Mizuno, Hiroyuki Ikeuchi, Chiaki Hara, Takanori Nishikawa, Kawarazaki Kenzo', 'TV-14', 'Kyoko''s, a wheelchair-bound librarian, first meeting with her hairdresser leads to more encounters as Kyoko starts to like him because he treats her normally despite her condition.', 'Kyoko''s, a wheelchair-bound librarian, first meeting with her hairdresser leads to more encounters as Kyoko starts to like him because he treats her normally despite her condition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KRa1Kt0aHG73cxs0R1Z1uyUjEQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21297'),
  ('1042891649227750688', 'Beautiful Love, Wonderful Life', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bae Yoo-mi', 'Bae Yoo-mi, Koo Ji-won', 'Cho Yu-jung, Yoon Park, Jo Yoon-hee, Oh Min-suk, Kim Jae-young, Park Young-kyu, Park Hae-mi, Kim Mi-sook', null, 'Follow four people as they seek love and happiness: Kim Seol-A who once worked as an announcer and is now married to CEO Do Jin-Woo; Moon Tae-Rang, a chef and the oldest brother from a family of adoptees; and Moon Hae-Rang, Moon Tae-Rang''s younger sister, who works as a secretary for Do Jin-Woo.', 'Follow four people as they seek love and happiness: Kim Seol-A who once worked as an announcer and is now married to CEO Do Jin-Woo; Moon Tae-Rang, a chef and the oldest brother from a family of adoptees; and Moon Hae-Rang, Moon Tae-Rang''s younger sister, who works as a secretary for Do Jin-Woo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aXlXQDiXxWcvACcWXCBI5rVARbO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94083'),
  ('369641179359924113', 'Beautiful Mind', 2016, 'Drama, Mystery', null, 'Kim Tae-hee', 'Jang Hyuk, Park So-dam, Yoon Hyun-min, Park Se-young, Huh Joon-ho, Kim Jong-soo, Lee Jae-ryong, Oh Jung-se', null, 'Lee Young-O is an excellent neurosurgeon with zero sympathy. One day, he becomes involved in bizarre patient deaths. He also falls in love and recovers his humanity.', 'Lee Young-O is an excellent neurosurgeon with zero sympathy. One day, he becomes involved in bizarre patient deaths. He also falls in love and recovers his humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNtzc6d2vJ4FkRaSQukfDtq7eSk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66387'),
  ('307647521798539469', 'Beautiful People', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Jonathan Harvey', 'Luke Ward-Wilkinson, Layton Williams, Olivia Colman, Aidan McArdle, Samuel Barnett, Sophie Ash, Sarah Niles, Meera Syal', 'TV-PG', 'Beautiful People is a British comedy drama television series based on the memoirs of Barneys creative director Simon Doonan. The series takes place in Reading, Berkshire, in 1997, where thirteen-year-old Simon Doonan and his best friend Kylie dream of escaping their dreary suburban surroundings and moving to cosmopolitan London "to live amongst the beautiful people." The first episode aired on BBC Two on 2 October 2008 and recorded overnight ratings of 1.5 million viewers and positive critical reaction. Episodes are self-contained, but do follow a loose story arc throughout the course of each series. The second and final series finished airing on 18 December 2009.', 'Beautiful People is a British comedy drama television series based on the memoirs of Barneys creative director Simon Doonan. The series takes place in Reading, Berkshire, in 1997, where thirteen-year-old Simon Doonan and his best friend Kylie dream of escaping their dreary suburban surroundings and moving to cosmopolitan London "to live amongst the beautiful people." The first episode aired on BBC Two on 2 October 2008 and recorded overnight ratings of 1.5 million viewers and positive critical reaction. Episodes are self-contained, but do follow a loose story arc throughout the course of each series. The second and final series finished airing on 18 December 2009.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozpWM6aLMkHyCtChl7Esnxpyzu5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:7871'),
  ('317165783378893896', 'Beautiful to Die For', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', 'Andrea Molaioli', null, 'Cristiana Capotondi, Lucrezia Lante della Rovere, Matteo Martari', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oMKzsJ3D2K08GwOrI4uOuZCrZFh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100572'),
  ('954872963335649754', 'Beautiful World', 2019, 'Drama', 'Park Jae-beom', 'Kim Ji-woo', 'Choo Ja-hyun, Park Hee-soon, Nam Da-reum, Kim Hwan-hee, Suh Dong-hyun, Lee Chung-ah, Oh Man-seok, Cho Yeo-jeong', null, 'This drama tells the story of a boy who becomes critically injured due to an incident of school violence and his family who seeks the truth and fights for justice in his name.', 'This drama tells the story of a boy who becomes critically injured due to an incident of school violence and his family who seeks the truth and fights for justice in his name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vXX5V6ZdLRlVRGUCGEEajazODX0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87405'),
  ('354437791293916663', 'Beauty and the Baker', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Assi Azar', null, 'Rotem Sela, Aviv Alush, Ofer Hayoun, Uri Gavriel, Dar Zuzovsky', null, 'Amos, a 28-year-old baker, still lives with his parents and works in the family business. Noa is the most famous woman in the country and the beautiful daughter of a hotel magnate. Noa and Amos will meet by mistake, but it''s a meeting neither will ever forget...', 'Amos, a 28-year-old baker, still lives with his parents and works in the family business. Noa is the most famous woman in the country and the beautiful daughter of a hotel magnate. Noa and Amos will meet by mistake, but it''s a meeting neither will ever forget...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AcnUsMc1rbP12fRTTX0noCdN5FT.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:63395'),
  ('21442897613362919', 'Beauty and the Beast', 1987, 'Drama, Crime, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ron Koslow', 'Ron Koslow', 'Linda Hamilton, Ron Perlman, Roy Dotrice, Jay Acovone, Ren Woods, Ellen Geer, Ritch Brinkley, Stephen McHattie', 'TV-PG', 'Beauty and the Beast is an American drama series which first aired on CBS in 1987. Creator Ron Koslow''s updated version of the fairy tale has a double focus: the relationship between Vincent, a mythic, noble man-beast, and Catherine, a savvy Assistant District Attorney in New York; and a secret Utopian community of social outcasts living in a subterranean sanctuary. Through an empathetic bond, Vincent senses Catherine''s emotions, and becomes her guardian.', 'Beauty and the Beast is an American drama series which first aired on CBS in 1987. Creator Ron Koslow''s updated version of the fairy tale has a double focus: the relationship between Vincent, a mythic, noble man-beast, and Catherine, a savvy Assistant District Attorney in New York; and a secret Utopian community of social outcasts living in a subterranean sanctuary. Through an empathetic bond, Vincent senses Catherine''s emotions, and becomes her guardian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlCUA3bUpkgOULFM9bC8N7hra19.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2397'),
  ('319946026602949770', 'Beauty and the Beast', 2012, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ron Koslow, Sherri Cooper-Landsman, Jennifer Levin', null, 'Kristin Kreuk, Jay Ryan, Nina Lisandrello, Austin Basis, Nicole Gale Anderson, F. Murray Abraham', 'TV-PG', 'Detective Catherine Chandler is a smart, no-nonsense homicide detective. When she was a teenager, she witnessed the murder of her mother at the hands of two gunmen and herself was saved by someone – or something. Years have passed and while investigating a murder, Catherine discovers a clue that leads her to Vincent Keller, who was reportedly killed in 2002. Catherine learns that Vincent is actually still alive and that it was he who saved her many years before. For mysterious reasons that have forced him to live outside of traditional society, Vincent has been in hiding for the past 10 years to guard his secret – when he is enraged, he becomes a terrifying beast, unable to control his super-strength and heightened senses.', 'Detective Catherine Chandler is a smart, no-nonsense homicide detective. When she was a teenager, she witnessed the murder of her mother at the hands of two gunmen and herself was saved by someone – or something. Years have passed and while investigating a murder, Catherine discovers a clue that leads her to Vincent Keller, who was reportedly killed in 2002. Catherine learns that Vincent is actually still alive and that it was he who saved her many years before. For mysterious reasons that have forced him to live outside of traditional society, Vincent has been in hiding for the past 10 years to guard his secret – when he is enraged, he becomes a terrifying beast, unable to control his super-strength and heightened senses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6rZ2I1xRemLORb65spepVmsvnf7.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:44606'),
  ('939991508798743409', 'Beauty and the Beast', 2014, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Alessandro Preziosi, Blanca Suárez, Massimo Wertmüller, Andy Luotto, Francesca Beggio, Cecilia Dazzi, Andrea Santonastaso, Giovanni Calcagno', null, 'France, late 1700s. Leon Dalville is a prince who has it all - good looks, love and wealth. One mysterious night, however, he loses everything. His young wife passes away in a fire and the prince’s face is permanently marred. To hide his disfigurement, he wears a silver mask that only partially covers his face, turning him into a mysterious and cruel man who is tormented by his past and hated and feared by all. Innocent and naive Bella Dubois comes to Leon’s castle to offer her services as a maid, to pay back the debts her father has with the prince. Leon’s cousin Helene, who has always been in love with him, challenges the prince: he must seduce and abandon Bella. But, despite Helene’s cruel and deceitful tricks, Leon falls in love with Bella.', 'France, late 1700s. Leon Dalville is a prince who has it all - good looks, love and wealth. One mysterious night, however, he loses everything. His young wife passes away in a fire and the prince’s face is permanently marred. To hide his disfigurement, he wears a silver mask that only partially covers his face, turning him into a mysterious and cruel man who is tormented by his past and hated and feared by all. Innocent and naive Bella Dubois comes to Leon’s castle to offer her services as a maid, to pay back the debts her father has with the prince. Leon’s cousin Helene, who has always been in love with him, challenges the prince: he must seduce and abandon Bella. But, despite Helene’s cruel and deceitful tricks, Leon falls in love with Bella.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Wvca71Xt8s1Hk1pb10Lq7vTG5f.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64248'),
  ('140602657409086034', 'Beauty and the Geek', 2005, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'A group of "Beauties" and a group of "Geeks" are paired up to compete as couples for a shared $250,000 and other prizes. Each beauty lives together in a room with her geek during the course of the competition. There are challenges shown each episode, one testing the beauties on a primarily academic subject, and another that has the geeks competing in a more popular/social realm. The winners of the challenges select two teams to compete against each other in a pure "quiz show" type question and answer session: the team with fewer correct answers gets eliminated.', 'A group of "Beauties" and a group of "Geeks" are paired up to compete as couples for a shared $250,000 and other prizes. Each beauty lives together in a room with her geek during the course of the competition. There are challenges shown each episode, one testing the beauties on a primarily academic subject, and another that has the geeks competing in a more popular/social realm. The winners of the challenges select two teams to compete against each other in a pure "quiz show" type question and answer session: the team with fewer correct answers gets eliminated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/83lFzXescQFVzVkUmjwg1zqeMlm.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:743'),
  ('477639460460409001', 'Beauty in Black', 2024, 'Drama', 'Tyler Perry', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'A stripper''s fate takes a turn when she crosses paths with the wealthy, dysfunctional family behind a cosmetics dynasty and a devious trafficking scheme.', 'A stripper''s fate takes a turn when she crosses paths with the wealthy, dysfunctional family behind a cosmetics dynasty and a devious trafficking scheme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i98Jl46WBpK7ymttNOakowtNuFF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:246246'),
  ('1037035560808020628', 'Beauty Newbie', 2024, 'Drama', 'Gi Maeng-gi', null, 'Pimchanok Luevisadpaibul, Metawin Opas-iamkajorn, Sapol Assawamunkong, Methika Jiranorraphat, Sattabut Laedeke, Thanawin Teeraphosukarn, Thanaboon Kiatniran, Thasorn Klinnium', null, 'Liu has been bullied for her looks her whole life. To fit in at university and escape the judgment, she undergoes plastic surgery. After her transformation, she befriends Faye, a stunning natural beauty. However, Liu’s life takes a turn when Guy, a handsome acquaintance from middle school, warns her to stay away from Faye. This angers Liu, especially compared to Saint, her kind and supportive neighbor. When Liu’s secret is revealed, her friends turn on her, leaving her to question if she will ever truly be accepted for who she is.', 'Liu has been bullied for her looks her whole life. To fit in at university and escape the judgment, she undergoes plastic surgery. After her transformation, she befriends Faye, a stunning natural beauty. However, Liu’s life takes a turn when Guy, a handsome acquaintance from middle school, warns her to stay away from Faye. This angers Liu, especially compared to Saint, her kind and supportive neighbor. When Liu’s secret is revealed, her friends turn on her, leaving her to question if she will ever truly be accepted for who she is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9r4fOH6Lika1gtvAQFyWMxGkiTz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:232671'),
  ('1072229648141199761', 'Beauty of Resilience', 2023, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Jue Qian', 'Ju Jingyi, Guo Junchen, Liu Dongqin, Lu Tingyu, Ma Yue, Zhang Zhihao, Song Xinran, Nie Zihao', null, 'Wei Zhi is reincarnated as a phoenix, and Yan Yue, the male protagonist is the Sun God. They go through hardships and finally break the destiny of how the "phoenix nirvana will shake the three worlds" and rewrite their own story together.', 'Wei Zhi is reincarnated as a phoenix, and Yan Yue, the male protagonist is the Sun God. They go through hardships and finally break the destiny of how the "phoenix nirvana will shake the three worlds" and rewrite their own story together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/klShiY7iCmVlC0ijtLvaMZhTchv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:220261'),
  ('48314579986716141', 'Beauty Private Kitchen', 2016, 'Drama', null, null, 'Ma Tianyu, Zheng Shuang, Jiang Yi, Kingdom Yuen King-Tan, Wu Jun, Zhang Chenghe, Wang Chun, Bai Yu', null, 'Song Yu Die, a renowned chef in the Jiangnan area, was actually a lost Song Dynasty princess. She grew up among the commoners and learned her trade from her adoptive mother. Just when she was about to marry her childhood sweetheart, she got entangled in a warfare between a Song prince and a Jin general. To settle the conflicts between the two countries, she left her beloved to marry her country''s enemy.', 'Song Yu Die, a renowned chef in the Jiangnan area, was actually a lost Song Dynasty princess. She grew up among the commoners and learned her trade from her adoptive mother. Just when she was about to marry her childhood sweetheart, she got entangled in a warfare between a Song prince and a Jin general. To settle the conflicts between the two countries, she left her beloved to marry her country''s enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tb3k4q4a2IzyuXNxKgcYrwELaO3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68866'),
  ('179173751397954460', 'Beaver Falls', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Iain Hollands', 'Iain Hollands', 'Samuel Robertson, Arsher Ali, John Dagleish', 'TV-14', 'Three British graduates blag jobs at an elite American summer camp. The guys want a summer of fun, but they have to set an example to the gorgeous teenage offspring of California''s rich and powerful.', 'Three British graduates blag jobs at an elite American summer camp. The guys want a summer of fun, but they have to set an example to the gorgeous teenage offspring of California''s rich and powerful.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/paw94wDwNdPquo5mRlp1ye1wLRW.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:40107'),
  ('1034560840745935694', 'Beavis and Butt-Head', 1993, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Mike Judge', null, 'Mike Judge', 'TV-14', 'Two dimwitted teenagers discuss TV, heavy-metal music, nachos, and trying to "score with chicks." When the duo aren''t sitting on the couch, they try to pick up girls at the local convenience store, slack off at school, or wreak havoc while working at a burger joint.', 'Two dimwitted teenagers discuss TV, heavy-metal music, nachos, and trying to "score with chicks." When the duo aren''t sitting on the couch, they try to pick up girls at the local convenience store, slack off at school, or wreak havoc while working at a burger joint.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BwmD9hMsfUHTAAsVephjJS8pIF.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:13943'),
  ('1124887612138289799', 'Because I Don''t Like My Big Brother At-All--!!', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Eri Kitamura, Kazusa Aranami, Toshiyuki Toyonaga, Sayaka Ohara, Hideki Ogihara, Ryoko Shiraishi, Shinnosuke Tachibana, Eriko Nakamura', 'TV-MA', 'Nao Takanashi loves her brother Shūsuke despite the incest taboo. Nao thinks that Shūsuke is her blood relative, but in fact she is an adopted daughter, whose parents have died. After Nao learns the fact, she wants to fall in love normally with Shūsuke because siblings by adoption can marry under the family law in Japan. However, she finds herself competing with Shūsuke''s childhood friend, Iroha Tsuchiura, and his class president and yaoi lover, Mayuka Kondō.', 'Nao Takanashi loves her brother Shūsuke despite the incest taboo. Nao thinks that Shūsuke is her blood relative, but in fact she is an adopted daughter, whose parents have died. After Nao learns the fact, she wants to fall in love normally with Shūsuke because siblings by adoption can marry under the family law in Japan. However, she finds herself competing with Shūsuke''s childhood friend, Iroha Tsuchiura, and his class president and yaoi lover, Mayuka Kondō.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/94NSjNHU9fOfoUXSYG2nzKafYww.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46170'),
  ('555799333776481273', 'Because of Love', 2023, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Umariga', 'Pranpramoon', 'James Ma, Rinrada Kaewbuasai, Suriyont Arunwattanakul, Tantachj Tharinpirom, Pimpawee Kograbin, Chattarika Sittiprom, Sarawit Subun, Kosawis Piyasakulkaew', null, 'Nuring was adopted into Singh''s family protection in order to have ability that allows her to save people around from any danger. She decided to run away after being arranged to marry Singh because she was scared of disappointment. Now she works as a bodyguard for a foreign customer. Singh took over his family''s business since he was 20. He''s strict and smart but is always being harmed by his rival, so he needs to get Nuring back. After Nuring came back to Singh, she must be a bodyguard for his rival''s daughter, meanwhile disguising herself to protect Singh. She''s doing this due to gratitude to his family who raised her. Meanwhile, he doesn''t want her to do it because he''s scared something might happen to her, but he accepts it because of his grandfather.', 'Nuring was adopted into Singh''s family protection in order to have ability that allows her to save people around from any danger. She decided to run away after being arranged to marry Singh because she was scared of disappointment. Now she works as a bodyguard for a foreign customer. Singh took over his family''s business since he was 20. He''s strict and smart but is always being harmed by his rival, so he needs to get Nuring back. After Nuring came back to Singh, she must be a bodyguard for his rival''s daughter, meanwhile disguising herself to protect Singh. She''s doing this due to gratitude to his family who raised her. Meanwhile, he doesn''t want her to do it because he''s scared something might happen to her, but he accepts it because of his grandfather.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evtiHZYfYToJmldZEeQxJc6YDeT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:219866'),
  ('334292206348490054', 'Because of You', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Yang Yi Hua', 'Muji Hsu, Lee Si-kang, Su Wei-hua, Huang Shi Jie, Will Chang, Yu-chen Kuo, Francesca Kao, Kamu Shiu', 'TV-14', 'Bound by blood but divided by love, the Yuan brothers must fight impossible odds to follow their hearts.', 'Bound by blood but divided by love, the Yuan brothers must fight impossible odds to follow their hearts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4lbhmMRbpXDdowZKE9xFKMcH5b6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99361'),
  ('17932609310104211', 'Because the Mountain is There', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Manami Honjo, Seina Sagiri, Takatoshi Kaneko, Yoko Minamino, Nao Minamisawa', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEnjVU3iy163rJ1KNUkXP3pglW2.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:203278'),
  ('571199188225548329', 'Because This Is My First Life', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Park Joon-hwa, Yoon Nan-joong', null, 'Lee Min-ki, Jung So-min, Park Byung-eun, Esom, Kim Min-seok, Kim Ga-eun, Jeon Hye-won, Kim Eung-soo', null, 'Two housemates get married for financial convenience, but discover nothing is simple when it comes to demanding in-laws — or facing their growing bond.', 'Two housemates get married for financial convenience, but discover nothing is simple when it comes to demanding in-laws — or facing their growing bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tEGLv0BdgvJN7K4Me4fpuhdPLRg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74074'),
  ('32660438269114823', 'Because We Forget Everything', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Hiroshi Abe, Machiko Ono, Chara, Kankuro Kudo, Daichi Watanabe, Yuzu Aoki, Yui Narumi, Mieharu', 'NR', 'M, a mystery writer, has a girlfriend of five years named F, who disappeared on Halloween night. When a woman comes and claims to be her sister, M begins the search for his girlfriend. Along the way, the people he meets describe a woman very unlike the F he knew.', 'M, a mystery writer, has a girlfriend of five years named F, who disappeared on Halloween night. When a woman comes and claims to be her sister, M begins the search for his girlfriend. Along the way, the people he meets describe a woman very unlike the F he knew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7w2Ym52K93fPClDzTAfEi68iozK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204070'),
  ('297697727260867397', 'Beck', 1999, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Kjell Sundvall', null, 'Peter Haber, Jennie Silfverhjelm, Måns Nathanaelson, Martin Wallström, Elmira Arikan, Valter Skarsgård', 'TV-14', 'Beck follows Swedish police officer Martin Beck and his team as they investigate various crimes.', 'Beck follows Swedish police officer Martin Beck and his team as they investigate various crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOHVlOM3l0etyCVAWA3ity4EJqm.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:38148'),
  ('1022346493685481004', 'Beck: Mongolian Chop Squad', 2004, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Daisuke Namikawa, Yuuma Ueno, Miho Saiki, Kenji Nojima, Shintaro Ohata, Toru Nara, Tomohisa Aso', 'TV-MA', 'Koyuki Tanaka''s boring life is changed after meeting Ryusuke Minami, a local musician with a bad attitude, who introduces him to foreign music.', 'Koyuki Tanaka''s boring life is changed after meeting Ryusuke Minami, a local musician with a bad attitude, who introduces him to foreign music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oUWKvp5WaSo25UPzoEcGJuAdzYf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43288'),
  ('420586316192114632', 'Becker', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Dave Hackel', null, 'Ted Danson, Hattie Winston, Shawnee Smith, Alex Désert, Jorge Garcia, Nancy Travis', 'TV-PG', 'Becker is a dedicated, outspoken and talented doctor with a gruff exterior. While he tends to offend those who try to get close to him, he is extremely dedicated to his medical practice in the Bronx, N.Y., where he always goes the extra mile to help those in need. But Dr. John Becker looks at the world around him and sees a society gone mad, full of incongruities and just plain wrong thinking. And he has no qualms about saying anything that comes to mind – anything.', 'Becker is a dedicated, outspoken and talented doctor with a gruff exterior. While he tends to offend those who try to get close to him, he is extremely dedicated to his medical practice in the Bronx, N.Y., where he always goes the extra mile to help those in need. But Dr. John Becker looks at the world around him and sees a society gone mad, full of incongruities and just plain wrong thinking. And he has no qualms about saying anything that comes to mind – anything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hno1hP545G5xS1l4mLBXaY7NIqn.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:4477'),
  ('864869845546449214', 'Beckham', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'David Beckham, Victoria Beckham, Alex Ferguson, Gary Neville, Rio Ferdinand, Ole Gunnar Solskjaer, Roy Keane, Paul Scholes', 'TV-MA', 'With never-before-seen footage, this docuseries follows David Beckham''s meteoric rise from humble beginnings to global football stardom.', 'With never-before-seen footage, this docuseries follows David Beckham''s meteoric rise from humble beginnings to global football stardom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y9d3trMAczZWFqYvGSW6V695vf3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:235345'),
