  ('829223087954101442', 'Become a Farmer', 2023, 'Reality', 'changling yang', null, 'Dunhao Jiang, Zhuo Lu, Li Gengyun, Li Hao, Zhao Yibo, Yuan Zhuo, Xiaotong Zhao, Haonan He', null, 'A labor documentary interactive reality show that selects 10 young individuals to form the ''Farming Squad,'' which will authentically document their entire process of operating a farm on 142.8 acres of land over 190 days. This includes sowing, irrigating, fertilizing, and harvesting, as well as live-streaming their sales to establish a self-sustaining farmers'' market.', 'A labor documentary interactive reality show that selects 10 young individuals to form the ''Farming Squad,'' which will authentically document their entire process of operating a farm on 142.8 acres of land over 190 days. This includes sowing, irrigating, fertilizing, and harvesting, as well as live-streaming their sales to establish a self-sustaining farmers'' market.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sVl6l68ANHlXHBgFakclH9xTBt9.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:219934'),
  ('664715886162349900', 'Becoming Elizabeth', 2022, 'Drama', 'Anya Reiss', null, 'Alicia von Rittberg, Romola Garai, Oliver Zetterström, John Heffernan, Jamie Parker, Leo Bill, Ekow Quartey', 'TV-MA', 'The fascinating story of the early life of England’s most iconic Queen, Elizabeth Tudor, an orphaned teenager who became embroiled in the political and sexual politics of the English court on her journey to obtain the crown.', 'The fascinating story of the early life of England’s most iconic Queen, Elizabeth Tudor, an orphaned teenager who became embroiled in the political and sexual politics of the English court on her journey to obtain the crown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/84fIwd3uL6AIs4PcvBFCqI2noV0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:198085'),
  ('459191309888775219', 'Becoming Karl Lagerfeld', 2024, 'Drama', 'Isaure Pisani-Ferry, Jennifer Have, Raphaëlle Bacqué', null, 'Daniel Brühl, Théodore Pellerin, Arnaud Valois, Alex Lutz, Lisa Kreuzer, Sunnyi Melles, Paul Spera, Agnès Jaoui', null, 'In 1972, Karl Lagerfeld is an unknown 38-year-old designer of ready-to-wear fashion, largely unknown to the public. His encounter with the young Jacques de Bascher, an ambitious and seductive dandy, changes everything.', 'In 1972, Karl Lagerfeld is an unknown 38-year-old designer of ready-to-wear fashion, largely unknown to the public. His encounter with the young Jacques de Bascher, an ambitious and seductive dandy, changes everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tfaRjAqNpDj5zngrReu6YbebrzO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132503'),
  ('352779601343711413', 'Becoming Witch', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Park Pa-Ran', null, 'Lee Yu-ri, Lee Min-young, Yoon So-Yi, Jung Sang-hoon, Kim Young-jae, Ryu Yeon-seok, Kim Sa-Kwon, Gi So-you', null, 'Three female friends, who come from totally different backgrounds, encounter enemies that they want to kill.', 'Three female friends, who come from totally different backgrounds, encounter enemies that they want to kill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3gQ8OTG1AbtBsQbAHIe1z9qcv63.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157236'),
  ('769356752582526676', 'Bed Friend', 2023, 'Drama', 'littlebbear96', null, 'Siraphop Manithikhun, Supamongkon Wongwisut, Pharinyakorn Khansawa, Teetut Chungmanirat, Sorntast Buangam, Parnupat Anomakiti, Thanatchaphan Buranachiwawilai', null, 'After an unexpected hook-up, two rival coworkers try to keep their fling purely physical, but growing feelings threaten their fragile arrangement.', 'After an unexpected hook-up, two rival coworkers try to keep their fling purely physical, but growing feelings threaten their fragile arrangement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrLKRmz0gnaKMi7O7qcVlzEHr9H.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217735'),
  ('483469088469893359', 'Bedlam', 2011, 'Drama, Mystery', 'David Allison, Chris Parker, Neil Jones', 'Neil Jones, David Allison, Chris Parker', 'Hugo Speer, Lacey Turner, Gemma Chan, Jack Roth, Nikesh Patel', 'TV-14', 'Welcome to Bedlam Heights. Converted from an imposing former lunatic asylum, this apartment building offers the ultimate in stylish 21st century urban living. But little do its new residents suspect that behind the luxury fittings lay unimaginable horrors.', 'Welcome to Bedlam Heights. Converted from an imposing former lunatic asylum, this apartment building offers the ultimate in stylish 21st century urban living. But little do its new residents suspect that behind the luxury fittings lay unimaginable horrors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b39xZdSXuXVzk2wB7F3snflNDpU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:37618'),
  ('812446795386370185', 'Bee and PuppyCat', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family', 'Natasha Allegri', null, 'Allyn Rachel', 'TV-PG', 'On a charming magical island, the impulsive Bee and her furry pal get up to all sorts of adventures while working for an intergalactic temp agency.', 'On a charming magical island, the impulsive Bee and her furry pal get up to all sorts of adventures while working for an intergalactic temp agency.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qwIq9Dqceine5TPwf50iQdqL3G.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61174'),
  ('710875248727707088', 'Bee and PuppyCat', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Natasha Allegri', null, 'Allyn Rachel', 'TV-14', 'Bee is a young lady trying to make her way in the world. She often acts before thinking, which can lead her into trouble (and adventure!). She also has a strong, nurturing personality, and doesn’t think twice about taking in Puppycat when he needs help. Although her laid-back-space-casey attitude and lack of skills tend to keep her from maintaining a job for long in the human world, she isn’t someone who easily gives up, and with the experiences she gains at the magical temp agency she stumbles on, she’ll finally have the chance to find out what she’s meant to do with her life.', 'Bee is a young lady trying to make her way in the world. She often acts before thinking, which can lead her into trouble (and adventure!). She also has a strong, nurturing personality, and doesn’t think twice about taking in Puppycat when he needs help. Although her laid-back-space-casey attitude and lack of skills tend to keep her from maintaining a job for long in the human world, she isn’t someone who easily gives up, and with the experiences she gains at the magical temp agency she stumbles on, she’ll finally have the chance to find out what she’s meant to do with her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ki6vzzyqC8fkayJnHa9v7VnqTNd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:205783'),
  ('797463557317181096', 'Beecham House', 2019, 'Drama', 'Gurinder Chadha, Shahrukh Husain, Paul Mayeda Berges', null, 'Tom Bateman, Dakota Blue Richards, Pallavi Sharda, Lesley Nicol, Bessie Carter, Shriya Pilgaonkar, Leo Suter, Grégory Fitoussi', 'TV-14', 'On the cusp of the 19th century in Delhi, we follow the fortunes of the residents of the titular mansion. The story begins as handsome and soulful former English soldier John Beecham has acquired the house to start a new life for his family and a business as a trader.', 'On the cusp of the 19th century in Delhi, we follow the fortunes of the residents of the titular mansion. The story begins as handsome and soulful former English soldier John Beecham has acquired the house to start a new life for his family and a business as a trader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eK7NDOQCQn9spHF0nXq9q921Xy2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90214'),
  ('267937647940558456', 'BEEF', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lee Sung Jin', null, 'Charles Melton, Cailee Spaeny, Oscar Isaac, Carey Mulligan, Youn Yuh-jung, Song Kang-ho, Seoyeon Jang, William Fichtner', 'TV-MA', 'A road rage incident between two strangers — a failing contractor and an unfulfilled entrepreneur — sparks a feud that brings out their darkest impulses.', 'A road rage incident between two strangers — a failing contractor and an unfulfilled entrepreneur — sparks a feud that brings out their darkest impulses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wSPOstFgu3Ogs61H6A86txGcWCM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:154385'),
  ('1111292623404138601', 'Beelzebub', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Miyuki Sawashiro, Katsuyuki Konishi, Shizuka Itoh, Takahiro Mizushima, Aki Toyosaki, Daisuke Hirakawa, Daisuke Kishio, Haruna Ikezawa', 'TV-14', 'Violent delinquent Oga encounters a baby one day, which crawls onto his back and immediately forms an attachment to him. Though he doesn''t know it yet, this baby is named Kaiser de Emperana Beelzebub IV, or "Baby Beel" for short—the son of the Demon Lord!', 'Violent delinquent Oga encounters a baby one day, which crawls onto his back and immediately forms an attachment to him. Though he doesn''t know it yet, this baby is named Kaiser de Emperana Beelzebub IV, or "Baby Beel" for short—the son of the Demon Lord!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/41QZ3NTTBY3nZcGrkIL1fXbDFBK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38603'),
  ('447515969590828041', 'Beethoven', 1994, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy', null, null, 'Nicholle Tom, Joel Murray, Dean Jones, Kath Soucie, J.D. Daniels, Francesca Marie Smith, Tress MacNeille, Joe Pantoliano', 'TV-Y7', 'Beethoven is an animated sitcom, loosely based on the 1992 motion picture of the same name. The series was produced by Northern Lights Entertainment, Universal Animation Studios, and Universal Television, and aired for one season on CBS, with 26 fifteen-minute episodes produced.', 'Beethoven is an animated sitcom, loosely based on the 1992 motion picture of the same name. The series was produced by Northern Lights Entertainment, Universal Animation Studios, and Universal Television, and aired for one season on CBS, with 26 fifteen-minute episodes produced.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9mp31hI22lCCEA7INKIjmGNnby.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9805'),
  ('483543869778745349', 'Beetlejuice', 1989, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Tim Burton, David Geffen', null, 'Stephen Ouimette, Alyson Court, Tabitha St. Germain, Len Carlson, Elizabeth Hanna, Roger Dunn, John Stocker, Tara Strong', 'TV-Y7', 'The adventures of preteen goth Lydia Deetz and her undead friend Beetlejuice as they explore The Neitherworld, a wacky afterlife realm inhabited by monsters, ghosts, ghouls and zombies.', 'The adventures of preteen goth Lydia Deetz and her undead friend Beetlejuice as they explore The Neitherworld, a wacky afterlife realm inhabited by monsters, ghosts, ghouls and zombies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6KZUc5WlukYvlixgNYJaFXzgdkv.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:4288'),
  ('341026153598618573', 'Before', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Sarah Thorp', null, 'Billy Crystal, Judith Light, Rosie Perez, Jacobi Jupe, Maria Dizzia, Ava Lalezarzadeh', 'TV-MA', 'After tragically losing his wife, child psychiatrist Dr. Eli Adler encounters a troubled young boy who seems to have a haunting connection to Eli''s past.', 'After tragically losing his wife, child psychiatrist Dr. Eli Adler encounters a troubled young boy who seems to have a haunting connection to Eli''s past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AeoPVoc7Ojq7zZ6bujJCZFeKhDM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:240920'),
  ('246511853814672807', 'Before I Forget', 2021, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jorge Tijerina', 'Alejandro Gerber Bicecci, Itzel Lara', 'Damián Alcázar, Paulina Gaitán, Erik Hayser', 'TV-14', 'Pascual León, a retired 65-year-old man, finds out how to give meaning to his last days after being diagnosed with Alzheimer''s: to avenge a past crime before his memory loss erases everything that he is.', 'Pascual León, a retired 65-year-old man, finds out how to give meaning to his last days after being diagnosed with Alzheimer''s: to avenge a past crime before his memory loss erases everything that he is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vlx2Lmp1SiEheDPYDX74lFkWwfo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:134174'),
  ('1000340076996226785', 'Before We Die', 2017, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Wilhelm Behrman, Niklas Rockström', null, 'Marie Richardson, Adam Pålsson, Magnus Krepper, Čedomir Đorđević, Richard Forsgren, Sandra Redlaff, Małgorzata Pieczyńska, Shada-Helin Sulhav', null, 'The police woman Hanna Svensson has a strained relationship to her son after having arrested him for drug dealing. Her married police man lover disappears, possibly kidnapped by MC gangs, although ties to Bosnia also appear.', 'The police woman Hanna Svensson has a strained relationship to her son after having arrested him for drug dealing. Her married police man lover disappears, possibly kidnapped by MC gangs, although ties to Bosnia also appear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nfOWtcSi8vrdC4J0qcORJJUcU9I.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:70337'),
  ('1138142058953514433', 'Before We Die', 2021, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Niklas Rockström, Matt Baker', null, 'Lesley Sharp, Vincent Regan', 'TV-MA', 'Detective Hannah Laing becomes deeply conflicted when she discovers her son is playing a crucial role as an undercover informant in a brutal murder investigation.', 'Detective Hannah Laing becomes deeply conflicted when she discovers her son is playing a crucial role as an undercover informant in a brutal murder investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rBz7joOAR4SYm7oDElynmhziNVu.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:126441'),
  ('171237085861874982', 'Before We Get Married', 2019, 'Drama', null, 'Fei Gong-Yi', 'Jasper Liu, Puff Kuo, Steven Sun, Nita Hsia Jo-Yen, Phoebe Yuan, Daniel Chen, Leo Lee', null, 'Zhou Wei-wei is about to marry her successful, devoted fiancé. And Chu Ke-huan is also planning to tie the knot with the beautiful woman he thinks he wants to spend the rest of his life with. There’s just one hitch – as their respective wedding days approach, Wei-wei and Ke-huan are starting to develop feelings for one another. Despite their intentions to keep things platonic, Cupid seems to have other plans for them.', 'Zhou Wei-wei is about to marry her successful, devoted fiancé. And Chu Ke-huan is also planning to tie the knot with the beautiful woman he thinks he wants to spend the rest of his life with. There’s just one hitch – as their respective wedding days approach, Wei-wei and Ke-huan are starting to develop feelings for one another. Despite their intentions to keep things platonic, Cupid seems to have other plans for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4cQRAPe8bDxYtceAoVF7DuQtG4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90022'),
  ('201076718231496230', 'Beforeigners', 2019, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Anne Bjørnstad, Eilif Skodvin', null, 'Nicolai Cleve Broch, Krista Kosonen', 'TV-MA', 'In the near future a new phenomenon starts happening all over the world with powerful flashes of light occurring in the ocean and people from the past mysteriously reappearing. Called "beforeigners," these people come from three separate time periods: the Stone Age, the Viking era and late 19th century. A couple of years later, Alfhildr – who comes from the Viking Age – has to partner up with a burned-out police officer, Lars Haaland, to investigate the murder of a beforeigner. The pair begins to unravel a larger conspiracy behind the origin of the mysterious mass arrivals.', 'In the near future a new phenomenon starts happening all over the world with powerful flashes of light occurring in the ocean and people from the past mysteriously reappearing. Called "beforeigners," these people come from three separate time periods: the Stone Age, the Viking era and late 19th century. A couple of years later, Alfhildr – who comes from the Viking Age – has to partner up with a burned-out police officer, Lars Haaland, to investigate the murder of a beforeigner. The pair begins to unravel a larger conspiracy behind the origin of the mysterious mass arrivals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVX1jUchy3zTaZeL12Lo7HqDEly.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:91520'),
  ('825963668246949655', 'Begin Again', 2017, 'Reality', '오윤환, 강영미', null, null, null, 'A variety show gathering some of Korea’s best musicians for a series of street performances abroad.', 'A variety show gathering some of Korea’s best musicians for a series of street performances abroad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/auRCHtuXwk4OJdir58NFmWOewsT.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:73068'),
  ('1031218964921238526', 'Begin Again', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Krung Ya Chat', 'Jiang Yue Hua, Chen Li Wen', 'Zhou Yutong, Gong Jun, Jin Ze, Wu Mansi, Li Siqi, Zhang Shulun', null, 'Furniture firm CEO Lu Fangning is approaching 30 – and, under pressure from her family, agrees to marry. She fixes her sights on the handsome surgeon Ling Rui and convinces him to tie the knot with her. But she soon finds that married life isn’t quite what she had hoped for. Cracks begin to appear in the already-frail relationship. But as she starts to mull divorce, Fangning suddenly finds herself falling for Ling Rui. Is it too late for love? Or can romance help them save their marriage?', 'Furniture firm CEO Lu Fangning is approaching 30 – and, under pressure from her family, agrees to marry. She fixes her sights on the handsome surgeon Ling Rui and convinces him to tie the knot with her. But she soon finds that married life isn’t quite what she had hoped for. Cracks begin to appear in the already-frail relationship. But as she starts to mull divorce, Fangning suddenly finds herself falling for Ling Rui. Is it too late for love? Or can romance help them save their marriage?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jKI1eCz4rTcN9wI1HRhXVRwhHiY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112280'),
  ('247072664560099316', 'Begin Again', 2024, 'Drama', null, 'Li Mo, 朱丹妮, 李林悦', 'Zhong Chuxi, Elvis Han, Sunny Sun, Chen Haoyu, Ni Hongjie, Geng Le, Selena Lee, Sun Yihan', null, 'In Macau, where modernity meets tradition, four lives intertwine. Art curator Chen Jiahui seeks inspiration, race car driver Han Junhao chases redemption, and career-driven Mai Youge questions her path after meeting the enigmatic Xu Junle. Amid the city’s charm, they each embark on journeys of self-discovery.', 'In Macau, where modernity meets tradition, four lives intertwine. Art curator Chen Jiahui seeks inspiration, race car driver Han Junhao chases redemption, and career-driven Mai Youge questions her path after meeting the enigmatic Xu Junle. Amid the city’s charm, they each embark on journeys of self-discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ps9dVeMadleU3Fv6m7aYByY0pgy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:272104'),
  ('373061831442814456', 'Beguinas', 2024, 'Drama', 'Irene Rodríguez', null, 'Amaia Aberasturi, Yon González, Bea Segura, Jaime Olías, Silma López, Ella Kweku, Melani Olivares, Lucía Caraballo', null, 'Follows Lucía de Avellaneda as she celebrates her engagement party with the Marquis of Peñarrosa, but her fiancée receives a letter from a woman claiming to be her mother requesting her to come to her deathbed.', 'Follows Lucía de Avellaneda as she celebrates her engagement party with the Marquis of Peñarrosa, but her fiancée receives a letter from a woman claiming to be her mother requesting her to come to her deathbed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ZXQs75Go1yaNMRjzF7pOCbWyyN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:225327'),
  ('153016193253658527', 'Beheneko: The Elf-Girl''s Cat Is Secretly an S-Ranked Monster!', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hinaki Yano, Tasuku Hatanaka, Hitomi Ueda, Tomori Kusunoki, Yuu Wakui, Nonoka Obuchi, Maaya Uchida, Nobuyuki Hiyama', 'TV-MA', 'After dying in a fight against the forces of evil, a knight found himself reincarnated as one of the most powerful monsters in the world: a behemoth! Problem is, he has to grow up before he can really strut his stuff, and a baby behemoth looks an awful lot like…a housecat?! And when an elf adventurer decides to take him in, she may need his help as much as he needs hers!', 'After dying in a fight against the forces of evil, a knight found himself reincarnated as one of the most powerful monsters in the world: a behemoth! Problem is, he has to grow up before he can really strut his stuff, and a baby behemoth looks an awful lot like…a housecat?! And when an elf adventurer decides to take him in, she may need his help as much as he needs hers!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6EUZcmKU8JsRfsLQEDVBbiCuQ9G.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:249545'),
  ('305927747985805341', 'Behind Closed Doors', 2011, 'Mystery, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Luis Manzo, Jairo Arcila, José Ignacio Valenzuela', null, 'Catherine Siachoque, Sarah Mintz, Angélica María, Miguel Varoni, Gabriel Porras, David Chocarro, Karla Monroig, Ximena Duque', null, 'Two powerful families are caught in the web of slander, money, sex, and murder that they both built.', 'Two powerful families are caught in the web of slander, money, sex, and murder that they both built.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aWvfk8xyktcdow7asUgGO4fchSF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38890'),
