  ('959860636047247820', 'Berlin, Berlin', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'David Safier', null, 'Felicitas Woll, Jan Sosniok, Maverick Quek, Matthias Klimsa, Rhea Harder, Alexander Scheer, Matthias Schloo, Alicia Ziegler', 'NR', 'Berlin, Berlin is a television series produced for the ARD. It aired in Germany from 2002 to 2005 Tuesdays through Fridays at 6:50PM on the German public TV network Das Erste. The show won both national and international awards.', 'Berlin, Berlin is a television series produced for the ARD. It aired in Germany from 2002 to 2005 Tuesdays through Fridays at 6:50PM on the German public TV network Das Erste. The show won both national and international awards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2G03Bo89QP6cBA5Q9utBLrgFshB.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:11904'),
  ('942462207863323963', 'Bernard', 2006, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy, Family', null, null, null, 'TV-Y', 'Bernard is a series of animated shorts centered on the fictional polar bear and main character of the same name. It is a Korean-Spanish-French co-production. Each three-minute episode focuses on the bear''s curiosity and have many moments of slapstick. Bernard never speaks with the exception of unintelligible noises. Bernard is accompanied in the cartoons by a few other characters: Lloyd and Eva the penguins, Zack the lizard, Goliat the chihuahua, Sam the baby, Pilot the dog, Pokey the porcupine and Santa Claus. He usually gets knocked unconscious or severely injured at the end of an episode, due to some calamity caused by his bumbling.', 'Bernard is a series of animated shorts centered on the fictional polar bear and main character of the same name. It is a Korean-Spanish-French co-production. Each three-minute episode focuses on the bear''s curiosity and have many moments of slapstick. Bernard never speaks with the exception of unintelligible noises. Bernard is accompanied in the cartoons by a few other characters: Lloyd and Eva the penguins, Zack the lizard, Goliat the chihuahua, Sam the baby, Pilot the dog, Pokey the porcupine and Santa Claus. He usually gets knocked unconscious or severely injured at the end of an episode, due to some calamity caused by his bumbling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9SXIJY21rm67eQvlPBTTXIiRumG.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:7011'),
  ('125556737926428133', 'Berserk', 1997, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation', null, null, 'Nobutoshi Canna, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Yuko Miyamura, Tomohiro Nishimura, Unsho Ishizuka', 'TV-MA', 'Guts, a wandering mercenary, joins the Band of the Hawk after being defeated in a duel by Griffith, the group''s leader and founder. Together, they dominate every battle, but something menacing lurks in the shadows.', 'Guts, a wandering mercenary, joins the Band of the Hawk after being defeated in a duel by Griffith, the group''s leader and founder. Together, they dominate every battle, but something menacing lurks in the shadows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48c5cdDOHCGzhH9V1qiIgptc5ma.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35935'),
  ('741207225490394453', 'Berserk', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hiroaki Iwanaga, Toa Yukinari, Kaoru Mizuhara, Yoko Hikasa, Kazuyuki Okitsu, Hiro Shimono', 'TV-MA', 'Spurred by the flame raging in his heart, the Black Swordsman Guts continues his seemingly endless quest for revenge. Standing in his path are heinous outlaws, delusional evil spirits, and a devout child of god. Even as it chips away at his life, Guts continues to fight his enemies, who wield repulsive and inhumane power, with nary but his body and sword—his strength as a human.', 'Spurred by the flame raging in his heart, the Black Swordsman Guts continues his seemingly endless quest for revenge. Standing in his path are heinous outlaws, delusional evil spirits, and a devout child of god. Even as it chips away at his life, Guts continues to fight his enemies, who wield repulsive and inhumane power, with nary but his body and sword—his strength as a human.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kN0Nca1Deq0iK1AK5RtAiohWhZ9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66053'),
  ('682726033403703183', 'Berserk of Gluttony', 2023, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ryota Osaka, Tomokazu Seki, Hisako Tojo, Hitomi Sekine, Misato Matsuoka', null, 'Fate Graphite was born into a world where magical skills shape your destiny. His skill is Gluttony, a seemingly useless curse of unending hunger that has left him shunned and looked down upon. Until one day, after he takes the life of a thief, his true power awakens: he can devour the skill of anyone he kills to feed his appetite. Will he learn to control this gruesome ability for the better?', 'Fate Graphite was born into a world where magical skills shape your destiny. His skill is Gluttony, a seemingly useless curse of unending hunger that has left him shunned and looked down upon. Until one day, after he takes the life of a thief, his true power awakens: he can devour the skill of anyone he kills to feed his appetite. Will he learn to control this gruesome ability for the better?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wQMcq5YUjMfoIEqLRzrNQVt4ROl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213331'),
  ('848658721028025667', 'Berserk: The Golden Age Arc – Memorial Edition', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hiroaki Iwanaga, Takahiro Sakurai, Toa Yukinari, Kendo Kobayashi, Minako Kotobuki, Takahiro Fujiwara, Yoshiro Matsumoto, Yuki Kaji', null, 'A wandering warrior ends up joining a mercenary group led by a charismatic leader, in this remastered, episodic cut of the film trilogy.', 'A wandering warrior ends up joining a mercenary group led by a charismatic leader, in this remastered, episodic cut of the film trilogy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7esafbDoMRZsVR7AHZYAMkrOnK7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211057'),
