  ('311775343993886442', 'Besa', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', 'Dušan Lazarević', null, 'Radivoje Bukvić, Arben Bajraktaraj, Miloš Timotijević, Lana Barić, Hana Selimović, Milica Gojković, Sascha Star', null, 'Besa is a strong promise for the Albanians, which must be maintained, even at the cost of living. It is most often used in the form of blood feuds, which is certainly a suitable ground for the action of the series that is in front of us.', 'Besa is a strong promise for the Albanians, which must be maintained, even at the cost of living. It is most often used in the form of blood feuds, which is certainly a suitable ground for the action of the series that is in front of us.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aNn4Nis3e80ZxAQdkUNeVaqSG9E.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:85265'),
