  ('170926610416421990', 'Betrothed to My Sister''s Ex', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Rena Motomura, Daiki Hamano, Minami Tanaka, Ryohei Kimura, Yoko Hikasa, Sayaka Ohara, Tetsuya Kakihara, Tatsuyuki Kobayashi', 'TV-14', 'Marie, the second daughter of a poor baron’s household, is treated like a servant by her parents. Even at Marie’s birthday party, her beautiful elder sister, Anastasia, is the star. Outside, Marie bumps into Count Kyuros Granado, who falls for her at first sight. Yet, due to a misunderstanding, the Count proposes to Anastasia. After a tragic accident, Marie must marry the count instead!', 'Marie, the second daughter of a poor baron’s household, is treated like a servant by her parents. Even at Marie’s birthday party, her beautiful elder sister, Anastasia, is the star. Outside, Marie bumps into Count Kyuros Granado, who falls for her at first sight. Yet, due to a misunderstanding, the Count proposes to Anastasia. After a tragic accident, Marie must marry the count instead!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o7oX9Ap3Rvgt3225mvuIBvk7vlW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:279989'),
  ('175328712238517276', 'Better', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jonathan Brackley, Sam Vincent', null, 'Leila Farzad, Lucy Black, Olivia Nakintu, Carolin Stoltz, Andrew Buchan, Samuel Edward-Cook, Gavin Spokes, Mark Monero', null, 'After a family tragedy is narrowly averted, a corrupt police detective undergoes a painful moral awakening and decides to put right twenty years of wrongdoing but satisfying her newfound conscience won''t be straightforward.', 'After a family tragedy is narrowly averted, a corrupt police detective undergoes a painful moral awakening and decides to put right twenty years of wrongdoing but satisfying her newfound conscience won''t be straightforward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bVkFNpY3U1yFL8sjErs6cJ6gHJ7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209183'),
  ('717714881240585085', 'Better Call Saul', 2015, 'Crime, Drama', 'Vince Gilligan, Peter Gould', null, 'Bob Odenkirk, Jonathan Banks, Rhea Seehorn, Tony Dalton, Giancarlo Esposito', 'TV-MA', 'Six years before Saul Goodman meets Walter White. We meet him when the man who will become Saul Goodman is known as Jimmy McGill, a small-time lawyer searching for his destiny, and, more immediately, hustling to make ends meet. Working alongside, and, often, against Jimmy, is “fixer” Mike Ehrmantraut. The series tracks Jimmy’s transformation into Saul Goodman, the man who puts “criminal” in “criminal lawyer".', 'Six years before Saul Goodman meets Walter White. We meet him when the man who will become Saul Goodman is known as Jimmy McGill, a small-time lawyer searching for his destiny, and, more immediately, hustling to make ends meet. Working alongside, and, often, against Jimmy, is “fixer” Mike Ehrmantraut. The series tracks Jimmy’s transformation into Saul Goodman, the man who puts “criminal” in “criminal lawyer".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zjg4jpK1Wp2kiRvtt5ND0kznako.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:60059'),
  ('505076511715059068', 'Better Call Saul Employee Training', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Ariel Levine', null, 'Josh Fadem, Hayley Holmes, Julian Bonfiglio', null, 'Better Call Saul''s Emmy-Award winning Employee Training digital series. It consists of 4 seasons of 36 minisodes published on the AMC website. The first season aired shortly before the release of season 3 and celebrates the return of Gustavo Fring. The second season precedes the release of season 4 and highlights Mike Ehrmantraut''s talents. The third season concurs the release of season 5 is hosted by Kim Wexler. The fourth season, released alongside season 6 is hosted by Marshall, Phil, and Sherry of Saul Goodman Productions. The first three seasons of the series consisted of 10 episodes. The last season consisted of 6 episodes.', 'Better Call Saul''s Emmy-Award winning Employee Training digital series. It consists of 4 seasons of 36 minisodes published on the AMC website. The first season aired shortly before the release of season 3 and celebrates the return of Gustavo Fring. The second season precedes the release of season 4 and highlights Mike Ehrmantraut''s talents. The third season concurs the release of season 5 is hosted by Kim Wexler. The fourth season, released alongside season 6 is hosted by Marshall, Phil, and Sherry of Saul Goodman Productions. The first three seasons of the series consisted of 10 episodes. The last season consisted of 6 episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4XJEZlMpzPOeFtdF58T8gRvOJC.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:90746'),
  ('244176389902973547', 'Better Call Saul Presents: Slippin'' Jimmy', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Sean Giambrone, Kyle S. More', null, 'The misadventures of a young Jimmy McGill and his childhood friends in Chicago, Illinois. Told in the style of classic 70s-era cartoons, each episode is an ode to a specific movie genre — from spaghetti westerns and Buster Keaton to The Exorcist.', 'The misadventures of a young Jimmy McGill and his childhood friends in Chicago, Illinois. Told in the style of classic 70s-era cartoons, each episode is an ode to a specific movie genre — from spaghetti westerns and Buster Keaton to The Exorcist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wSeVvdVWUMnANCyhn963T99HPhF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158704'),
  ('1125765422328129182', 'Better Late Than Never', 2016, 'Reality, Comedy', null, null, 'George Foreman, Terry Bradshaw, Henry Winkler, William Shatner, Jeff Dye', null, 'This hilarious fish-out-of-water comedy/reality show follows cultural icons Henry Winkler, William Shatner, Terry Bradshaw and George Foreman on their greatest adventure yet. Deciding it''s Better Late Than Never, these four national treasures embark on the journey of a lifetime, traveling across Asia on their own with no schedule and no itinerary. The only "help" will come from Jeff Dye, a young, strong, tech-savvy comedian with an agenda of his own - who isn''t above leading the men off track. Each stop is packed with hilarious cultural experiences, heartwarming spectacles and unexpected twists as our legends take on this unforgettable adventure.', 'This hilarious fish-out-of-water comedy/reality show follows cultural icons Henry Winkler, William Shatner, Terry Bradshaw and George Foreman on their greatest adventure yet. Deciding it''s Better Late Than Never, these four national treasures embark on the journey of a lifetime, traveling across Asia on their own with no schedule and no itinerary. The only "help" will come from Jeff Dye, a young, strong, tech-savvy comedian with an agenda of his own - who isn''t above leading the men off track. Each stop is packed with hilarious cultural experiences, heartwarming spectacles and unexpected twists as our legends take on this unforgettable adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/13AQ0k3E7zwIc2zp5c7luXVbsJg.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67556'),
  ('1116961079332307158', 'Better Late Than Single', 2025, 'Reality', 'Cho Wook Hyung, Kim Noh-eun, Won Seung-jae', null, 'Seo In-guk, Kang Hanna, Lee Eun-ji, Car, the garden', 'TV-14', 'Ready to step into the dating world, lifelong singles get expert help for style, health and confidence. Will they manage hiccups on their way to love?', 'Ready to step into the dating world, lifelong singles get expert help for style, health and confidence. Will they manage hiccups on their way to love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1K7lEPEKxq6mcjtV7At4TcLld46.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:288912'),
  ('685145099532621799', 'Better Off Ted', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Victor Fresco', 'Ingrid Escajeda', 'Jay Harrington, Portia De Rossi, Andrea Anders, Jonathan Slavin, Malcolm Barrett', 'TV-PG', 'Ted, a successful but morally conscious man, runs a research and development department at a morally questionable corporation, Veridian Dynamics. No achievement is too far fetched and no invention too unorthodox for Veridian. Ted loves his seemingly perfect job; he loves his superhuman boss, Veronica, and colleagues Lem, Phil and Linda, but he''s starting to take a closer look at the company''s extremely questionable practices... especially when they try to cryogenically freeze one of Ted''s scientists for testing purposes.', 'Ted, a successful but morally conscious man, runs a research and development department at a morally questionable corporation, Veridian Dynamics. No achievement is too far fetched and no invention too unorthodox for Veridian. Ted loves his seemingly perfect job; he loves his superhuman boss, Veronica, and colleagues Lem, Phil and Linda, but he''s starting to take a closer look at the company''s extremely questionable practices... especially when they try to cryogenically freeze one of Ted''s scientists for testing purposes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvmafNGqMFA03fJcbUXxjgzSToX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:7777'),
  ('876647619063123629', 'Better Than Us', 2018, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Paulina Andreeva, Kirill Käro, Olga Lomonosova, Vitaliya Kornienko, Eldar Kalimulin, Vera Kincheva, Aleksandr Kuznetsov, Irina Tarannik', null, 'Moscow in a not so distant future where human beings share their daily lives with robots. Georgy, a forensic who has a robot assistant, suddenly finds himself caught up in the first murder committed by a new kind of experimental humanoid.', 'Moscow in a not so distant future where human beings share their daily lives with robots. Georgy, a forensic who has a robot assistant, suddenly finds himself caught up in the first murder committed by a new kind of experimental humanoid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUigUEoz7IlImY4uJLtqnLRYEU3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84380'),
  ('513051983420672001', 'Better Things', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Pamela Adlon, Louis C.K.', null, 'Pamela Adlon, Celia Imrie, Mikey Madison, Hannah Riley, Olivia Edward, Kevin Pollak', 'TV-MA', 'Sam Fox is a single, working actor with no filter trying to raise her three daughters – Max, Frankie and Duke – in Los Angeles. She is mom, dad, referee and the cops.', 'Sam Fox is a single, working actor with no filter trying to raise her three daughters – Max, Frankie and Duke – in Los Angeles. She is mom, dad, referee and the cops.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oydV7sWkFSBvHK57DfbPZzz4aDJ.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:66859'),
  ('345877901472954388', 'Better Times', 2004, 'Drama', 'Stig Thorsboe', 'Hanna Lundblad, Stig Thorsboe', 'Anne Louise Hassing, Ken Vedsegaard, Waage Sandø, Stina Ekblad, Maibritt Saerens, Anders W. Berthelsen, Dick Kaysø, Pernille Højmark', null, 'Krøniken is a Danish television drama which aired on Sunday evenings between January 2004 and January 2007. The 22-episode series relates the lives of two fictional families during the historical development of the Danmarks Radio television network from the 1950s to the 1970s. Created by Stig Thorsbøe for the DR broadcast-television network, the series debuted on 4 January 2004. The program''s first season set popularity records. Five of the episodes were listed among the ten most watched television programs since records began in Denmark in 1992. The first season finale topped the list with 2,717,000 viewers. In 2004, the program was nominated for the International Emmy Award for Best Drama but lost to Waking the Dead. The series concluded with the 22nd episode airing on 1 January 2007 and watched by 2.4 million viewers.', 'Krøniken is a Danish television drama which aired on Sunday evenings between January 2004 and January 2007. The 22-episode series relates the lives of two fictional families during the historical development of the Danmarks Radio television network from the 1950s to the 1970s. Created by Stig Thorsbøe for the DR broadcast-television network, the series debuted on 4 January 2004. The program''s first season set popularity records. Five of the episodes were listed among the ten most watched television programs since records began in Denmark in 1992. The first season finale topped the list with 2,717,000 viewers. In 2004, the program was nominated for the International Emmy Award for Best Drama but lost to Waking the Dead. The series concluded with the 22nd episode airing on 1 January 2007 and watched by 2.4 million viewers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3uWiDIK5CRTyLW7wk065hGsIgFS.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:4484'),
  ('790503783154349595', 'Better With You', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Shana Goldberg-Meehan', null, 'JoAnna Garcia Swisher, Jennifer Finnigan, Josh Cooke, Jake Lacy, Kurt Fuller, Debra Jo Rupp', null, 'Maddie and Ben have been dating for nine years and they know each other inside and out. Maddie''s younger sister, Mia, has been dating Casey for seven weeks. With a shared c''est la vie attitude, Mia and Casey announce they''re getting married and having a baby. It''s news that throws Maddie for a loop. Surprisingly, the girls'' parents, who have recently adopted a carpe diem sort of philosophy, couldn''t be more pleased.', 'Maddie and Ben have been dating for nine years and they know each other inside and out. Maddie''s younger sister, Mia, has been dating Casey for seven weeks. With a shared c''est la vie attitude, Mia and Casey announce they''re getting married and having a baby. It''s news that throws Maddie for a loop. Surprisingly, the girls'' parents, who have recently adopted a carpe diem sort of philosophy, couldn''t be more pleased.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4YWYONqSSWzVS09ZTpbvYdCHQz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34052'),
  ('715017841563470578', 'Betterman', 1999, 'Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Yoshitomo Yonetani', 'Hiroshi Yamaguchi', 'Kappei Yamaguchi, Takehito Koyasu, Chafurin, Chafurin, Houko Kuwashima, Houko Kuwashima, Junko Iwao, Shin-ichiro Miki', null, 'A deadly virus known as "Algernon" has attacked humanity. At the forefront of the battle is the mysterious Akamatsu Industries, this undercover organization uses enhanced weapons known as NeuroNoids to battle Algernon. Also helping with their secret efforts is the mysterious mutant who is known as "Betterman."', 'A deadly virus known as "Algernon" has attacked humanity. At the forefront of the battle is the mysterious Akamatsu Industries, this undercover organization uses enhanced weapons known as NeuroNoids to battle Algernon. Also helping with their secret efforts is the mysterious mutant who is known as "Betterman."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/comP8hOIxXl2k2IrdZxy0mrHoYO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34833'),
  ('866969707725811', 'Betting on Fact', 2026, 'Reality', null, null, 'Jang Dong-min, Lee Yong-jin, Jin Joong-gwon, Yong-jin Jeong, Kim Ye-won', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4kVLzDDGvQz8R4wqKluQP7ZEXE1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317679'),
  ('1071944671419357138', 'Betty', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Crystal Moselle, Lesley Arfin', 'Wally Baram', 'Dede Lovelace, Kabrina Adams, Nina Moran, Ajani Russell, Rachelle Vinberg', 'TV-MA', 'A diverse group of young women navigate their lives through the male-dominated world of skateboarding in New York City. Inspired by the critically acclaimed film Skate Kitchen.', 'A diverse group of young women navigate their lives through the male-dominated world of skateboarding in New York City. Inspired by the critically acclaimed film Skate Kitchen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ui9Ii7dKaEZBl0N0bSGBY9wH26k.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:95170'),
  ('292642553167584982', 'Betty in New York', 2019, 'Comedy, Family', 'Valentina Párraga, Sandra Velasco', null, 'Cesar Bono, Elyfer Torres, Erick Elías, Amaranta Ruiz, Sabrina Seara, Jaime Aymerich, Héctor Suárez Gomís, Mauricio Garza', null, 'Betty is a young Latina in New York who, rejected in multiple jobs, accepts one below her qualifications in the fashion industry. Amid the glamor and business, the war between the pretty and the ugly, Betty grows and faces the biggest challenge of her life: love.', 'Betty is a young Latina in New York who, rejected in multiple jobs, accepts one below her qualifications in the fashion industry. Amid the glamor and business, the war between the pretty and the ugly, Betty grows and faces the biggest challenge of her life: love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPmwvryzRnCoEv8oeTAT2jeM8Yy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86189'),
  ('71812238718467796', 'Betty la Fea, the Story Continues', 2024, 'Soap, Comedy, Drama', 'Juan Carlos Pérez, César Betancur, Marta Betoldi', null, 'Ana María Orozco, Jorge Enrique Abello, Lorna Cepeda, Natalia Ramírez, Julián Arango', 'TV-14', 'While an empowered and wiser Betty works hard on rebuilding her relationship with her teenage daughter Mila, her relationship with Armando begins to deteriorate, making her question if she made the right decision 20 years ago.', 'While an empowered and wiser Betty works hard on rebuilding her relationship with her teenage daughter Mila, her relationship with Armando begins to deteriorate, making her question if she made the right decision 20 years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/huEeQQBmZsZ5qDXkWl0pS5vPWIU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:230424'),
  ('1056408811993948620', 'Betty Toons', 2002, null, null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/orMz076QS8QWvNrdwcGE8AfiO8G.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:200755'),
  ('139808450003023738', 'Bettys Diagnose', 2015, 'Drama', null, null, 'Sybille J. Schedwill, Claudia Hiersche, Ercan Durmaz, Henrike Hahn, Florian Frowein, Constantin Lücke', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqjQzreyt8ahKAEAUXPEiC3O10F.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:62022'),
  ('415794826905477480', 'Between', 2015, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Michael McGowan', null, 'Jennette McCurdy, Jesse Carere, Ryan Allen, Justin Kelly, Kyle Mac, Samantha Munro, Jack Murray, Mercedes Morris', 'TV-14', 'Between is the story of a town under siege from a mysterious disease that has wiped out everybody except those 21 years old and under. The series explores the power vacuum that results when a government has quarantined a 10-mile diameter area and left the inhabitants to fend for themselves.', 'Between is the story of a town under siege from a mysterious disease that has wiped out everybody except those 21 years old and under. The series explores the power vacuum that results when a government has quarantined a 10-mile diameter area and left the inhabitants to fend for themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uO5dfkfesnbtJIOMmcGfzfhYNZy.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62433'),
  ('707626500894004915', 'Between Lands', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Megan Montaner, Rodolfo Sancho, Silvia Abascal, Ginés García Millán, José Pastor, Itziar Miranda, Clara Garrido, Germán Alcarazu', 'TV-MA', 'To protect her sister and save her family from ruin, a selfless woman navigates an arranged marriage with a wealthy man who hides dark secrets.', 'To protect her sister and save her family from ruin, a selfless woman navigates an arranged marriage with a wealthy man who hides dark secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Ea63e9yhMGKCTmRVvD5H9FZuUW.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:233592'),
  ('455452931247046775', 'Between the Lines', 1992, 'Drama', 'J.C. Wilsher', null, 'Siobhan Redmond, Tom Georgeson, Neil Pearson, Tony Doyle, Dorian Healy, Nigel Lindsay, Sylvestra Le Touzel, Robin McCallum', null, 'Detective Superintendent Tony Clark is an ambitious member of the Complaints Investigation Bureau, an internal organisation that investigates claims of corruption inside the police in England and Wales. Along the way Clark overcomes strong influence from his superiors and problems in his private life, most notably the break-up of his marriage following an affair with WPC Jenny Dean.', 'Detective Superintendent Tony Clark is an ambitious member of the Complaints Investigation Bureau, an internal organisation that investigates claims of corruption inside the police in England and Wales. Along the way Clark overcomes strong influence from his superiors and problems in his private life, most notably the break-up of his marriage following an affair with WPC Jenny Dean.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hGWVJMXV6T7lMDfPG8K7TX793uQ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2997'),
  ('696267148422343526', 'Between the World and Us', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Pınar Bulut', 'Demet Özdemir, Buğra Gülsoy, Hafsanur Sancaktutan, Zerrin Tekindor', 'NR', 'Ilkin worries that her boyfriend, a famous actor, is no longer in love with her. One day, she decides to reach out to him from a fake social media account and almost creates the woman who can seduce her lover with her own hands.', 'Ilkin worries that her boyfriend, a famous actor, is no longer in love with her. One day, she decides to reach out to him from a fake social media account and almost creates the woman who can seduce her lover with her own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rOF5Rvbq6hgVK2YCBF3mZ5pVLT3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203741'),
  ('1057692330249434703', 'Between Two Ferns with Zach Galifianakis', 2008, 'Comedy, Talk', null, null, 'Zach Galifianakis', null, 'Host Zach Galifianakis conducts comical celebrity interviews sitting with his guests between two potted ferns on a sparse set, in the awkward style of low-budget community access cable channels.', 'Host Zach Galifianakis conducts comical celebrity interviews sitting with his guests between two potted ferns on a sparse set, in the awkward style of low-budget community access cable channels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1yPbXelb8SROT1e2zL2dZtK4ftZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39754');
