values
  ('308805399434573238', 'Between Us', 2022, 'Drama', 'LazySheep', null, 'Noppanut Guntachai, Warut Chawalitrujiwong, Thitiwat Ritprasert, Natouch Siripongthon, Samantha Melanie Coates, Suphadach Wilairat, Patsit Permpoonsavat, Puwanai Sangwan', null, 'A swimmer with insomnia finds comfort in a senior who lets him stay in his room, and as competitions near, their bond pushes both to face their fears.', 'A swimmer with insomnia finds comfort in a senior who lets him stay in his room, and as competitions near, their bond pushes both to face their fears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xeNg3ZJNqRde0yMX1MSTWK1XdyY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138392'),
  ('1107029454675288934', 'Between Walls', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Ariana Saiegh', null, 'Aislinn Derbez, Christian Vazquez, Marianna Burelli, Armando Hernández, Ana Layevska, Octavio Hinojosa Martínez, Thalí García, Giuseppe Gamba', 'TV-MA', 'Marga and Martín meet and feel attracted to each other, not realizing they''ll be neighbors.', 'Marga and Martín meet and feel attracted to each other, not realizing they''ll be neighbors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tK0hOBpoUgxmzSbiF67drVJ18JF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:283085'),
  ('50786762255039963', 'Beverly Hills Teens', 1987, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Kids, Drama', null, null, 'Hadley Kay, Jonathan Potts, Sean Roberge, Terri Hawkes, Corrine Koslo, Linda Sorensen, Mark Saunders, Tracey Moore', 'NR', 'Beverly Hills Teens is an animated children''s television program which debuted in 1987, animated by DIC Entertainment. The namesake teenagers have exaggerated wealth, and face stereotypical teenage concerns. They represent a variety of English backgrounds. In 1989, Beverly Hills Teens was nominated for the Young Artist award for Best Animated Series. In the same year, the show was syndicated by Claster Television. The French dub is known as BéCéBéGé, or sometimes Le Club BCBG, a title derived from the acronym BCBG.', 'Beverly Hills Teens is an animated children''s television program which debuted in 1987, animated by DIC Entertainment. The namesake teenagers have exaggerated wealth, and face stereotypical teenage concerns. They represent a variety of English backgrounds. In 1989, Beverly Hills Teens was nominated for the Young Artist award for Best Animated Series. In the same year, the show was syndicated by Claster Television. The French dub is known as BéCéBéGé, or sometimes Le Club BCBG, a title derived from the acronym BCBG.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3fG5N6yRIrz7PH1tp2NFK0bWdJq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10299'),
  ('992774315665412422', 'Beverly Hills, 90210', 1990, 'Drama, Soap', 'Aaron Spelling, Darren Star', null, 'Jennie Garth, Ian Ziering, Luke Perry, Brian Austin Green, Tori Spelling, Vincent Young, Lindsay Price, Daniel Cosgrove', 'TV-14', 'Follow the lives of a group of teenagers living in the upscale, star-studded community of Beverly Hills, California and attending the fictitious West Beverly Hills High School and, subsequently, the fictitious California University after graduation.', 'Follow the lives of a group of teenagers living in the upscale, star-studded community of Beverly Hills, California and attending the fictitious West Beverly Hills High School and, subsequently, the fictitious California University after graduation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b7BYfkhu653D894krwGO1ysIKTf.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:2025'),
  ('239112384221690941', 'Beware the Batman', 2013, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Kids', 'Sam Register, Glen Murakami', null, 'Anthony Ruivivar, JB Blanc, Sumalee Montano, Kurtwood Smith', 'TV-PG', 'Set during Bruce Wayne''s early years as the Batman, following his initial period of battling organized crime. He hones his skills with the assistance of his butler, Alfred Pennyworth. Bruce is introduced to Alfred''s goddaughter, Tatsu Yamashiro. Tatsu is a martial arts swordsmaster hired to act as Bruce''s bodyguard, but also recruited to act as a superhero partner to Batman.', 'Set during Bruce Wayne''s early years as the Batman, following his initial period of battling organized crime. He hones his skills with the assistance of his butler, Alfred Pennyworth. Bruce is introduced to Alfred''s goddaughter, Tatsu Yamashiro. Tatsu is a martial arts swordsmaster hired to act as Bruce''s bodyguard, but also recruited to act as a superhero partner to Batman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4qHERbfhZlgK8ecaNyCvbHbsRfd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:41676'),
  ('1038578971886997090', 'Bewitched', 1964, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Sol Saks', null, 'Elizabeth Montgomery, Dick Sargent, Agnes Moorehead, David White', 'TV-G', 'Samantha Stephens is a seemingly normal suburban housewife who also happens to be a genuine witch, with all the requisite magical powers. Her husband Darrin insists that Samantha keep her witchcraft under wraps, but situations invariably require her to indulge her powers while keeping her bothersome mother Endora at bay.', 'Samantha Stephens is a seemingly normal suburban housewife who also happens to be a genuine witch, with all the requisite magical powers. Her husband Darrin insists that Samantha keep her witchcraft under wraps, but situations invariably require her to indulge her powers while keeping her bothersome mother Endora at bay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7UZVO1SclbgVWM2ELrwWGaS7i94.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:4482'),
  ('29831315257398693', 'Beyaz Show', 1996, 'Talk', null, null, 'Beyaz', null, 'Beyaz Show is a popular Talk Show program hosted by Turkish television personality Beyazıt Öztürk. It has been on air on Kanal D since December 1996. The program is among the most highest rated television shows in Turkey. The program consists Beyaz interviewing various celebrities and segments of his unique brand of humour.', 'Beyaz Show is a popular Talk Show program hosted by Turkish television personality Beyazıt Öztürk. It has been on air on Kanal D since December 1996. The program is among the most highest rated television shows in Turkey. The program consists Beyaz interviewing various celebrities and segments of his unique brand of humour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQUezFWCY4CfdI72Whv17RoFMYF.jpg', 22, 'tmdb:tv:20516'),
  ('1040319282089429724', 'Beyblade', 2001, 'Kids, Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Motoko Kumai, Kiyu Morita, Daisuke Namikawa, Urara Takano, Chikao Ohtsuka, Hiroshi Kamiya, Kazuyuki Ishikawa, Kaori Saiki', 'TV-Y7', 'Thirteen-year-old Takao Kinomiya (Tyson Granger), along with his fellow teammates, Kai Hiwatari, Max Mizuhura (Max Tate), and Rei Kon (Ray Kon), strive to become the greatest Beybladers in the world. With the technical help of the team''s resident genius, Kyoujyu (Kenny), and with the powerful strength of their BitBeasts, the Bladebreakers armed with their Beys attempt to reach their goal.', 'Thirteen-year-old Takao Kinomiya (Tyson Granger), along with his fellow teammates, Kai Hiwatari, Max Mizuhura (Max Tate), and Rei Kon (Ray Kon), strive to become the greatest Beybladers in the world. With the technical help of the team''s resident genius, Kyoujyu (Kenny), and with the powerful strength of their BitBeasts, the Bladebreakers armed with their Beys attempt to reach their goal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6ZQhEHjtOd9t6lOvVGzs5YEHcG.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:54728'),
  ('969277372352738807', 'Beyblade Burst', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family', null, null, 'Marina Inoue, Junya Enoki, Ryoko Shiraishi, Mutsumi Tamura', 'TV-Y', 'Middle schooler Valt Aoi, with his Beyblade Valkyrie (Valtryek), faces off against friends, classmates, and rivals to become the world''s number one Blader.', 'Middle schooler Valt Aoi, with his Beyblade Valkyrie (Valtryek), faces off against friends, classmates, and rivals to become the world''s number one Blader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fG7BHxDlntPyB57UuNo9sXmAmLV.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:67667'),
  ('366244343354954650', 'Beyblade X', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, 'Soma Saito, Shuichiro Umeda, Ruriko Noguchi, Kaito Ishikawa, KENN, Tomohiro Ohmachi, Fumitake Ishiguro, Ryota Suzuki', 'TV-Y7', 'Beginner blader Robin Kazami joins up with influencer Multi Nana-iro and former champion Jaxon Cross to form this unlikely trio - ready to climb to the top of The X and win the title of champion blader!', 'Beginner blader Robin Kazami joins up with influencer Multi Nana-iro and former champion Jaxon Cross to form this unlikely trio - ready to climb to the top of The X and win the title of champion blader!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66wkm14IWdrY5LaKZDAbkD2T9Jt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:226688'),
  ('661552837628337682', 'Beyblade: Metal Fight Beyblade', 2009, 'Animation, Mystery, Action & Adventure, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Nobuhiko Okamoto, Koki Uchiyama, Takuma Terashima, Yuuki Kodaira, Sumire Morohoshi', 'TV-Y7', 'A new cast of characters take on the continued battle between good and evil. Gingka, our hero, and his group of loyal friends take on a dangerous group called the Dark Nebula. Dark Nebula’s mission is to take over the world and unleash their evil upon it; but before they can do so, they must destroy Gingka as he is the only person that’s strong enough to stand in their way. The plot thickens as friends become enemies and enemies become allies. Everything starts and ends with Gingka as he struggles to find the strength to defend his world and the honor of Beyblade.', 'A new cast of characters take on the continued battle between good and evil. Gingka, our hero, and his group of loyal friends take on a dangerous group called the Dark Nebula. Dark Nebula’s mission is to take over the world and unleash their evil upon it; but before they can do so, they must destroy Gingka as he is the only person that’s strong enough to stand in their way. The plot thickens as friends become enemies and enemies become allies. Everything starts and ends with Gingka as he struggles to find the strength to defend his world and the honor of Beyblade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvzR1LroQFPs8mtvW761BZX92qx.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:37807'),
  ('529725941721314747', 'Beyond', 2017, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Adam Nussdorf', null, 'Burkely Duffield, Dilan Gwyn, Jonathan Whitesell, Eden Brolin, Jeff Pierre, Romy Rosemont, Michael McGrady', 'TV-14', 'Holden wakes up from a coma after 12 years and discovers new abilities that propel him into the middle of a dangerous conspiracy.', 'Holden wakes up from a coma after 12 years and discovers new abilities that propel him into the middle of a dangerous conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wbioiPregE2EZZK93H7KcRA8JXi.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67726'),
  ('72974087455112524', 'Beyond', 2022, 'Drama', 'Zhang Xiaobo', null, 'Li Gengxi, Hu Jun, Sha Yi, Sa Rina, Tu Songyan, Ma Li, Mei Ting, Tong Yao', null, 'After Beijing won the bid for the 2022 Winter Olympics, former speed skater Zheng Kaixin builds the Qingdao speed skating team, searching for new talent. Passionate roller skater Chen Mian joins, determined to prove himself. As he rises through the ranks, past conflicts and Olympic dreams collide, shaping the future of China’s ice sports.', 'After Beijing won the bid for the 2022 Winter Olympics, former speed skater Zheng Kaixin builds the Qingdao speed skating team, searching for new talent. Passionate roller skater Chen Mian joins, determined to prove himself. As he rises through the ranks, past conflicts and Olympic dreams collide, shaping the future of China’s ice sports.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9cyQCpihGVu4uKklyo6krMuSjGc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155364'),
  ('444851168636474217', 'Beyond Belief: Fact or Fiction', 1997, 'Documentary, Mystery, Reality', null, null, 'Jonathan Frakes', 'TV-PG', 'Can you tell the difference between fact and fiction? Several stories of strange, mysterious and incredible occurrences are chronicled during each episode. It is up to the viewer to decide which stories actually happened and which were completely fabricated by the show’s writers. The answer is revealed by Jonathan Frakes at the conclusion of each episode.', 'Can you tell the difference between fact and fiction? Several stories of strange, mysterious and incredible occurrences are chronicled during each episode. It is up to the viewer to decide which stories actually happened and which were completely fabricated by the show’s writers. The answer is revealed by Jonathan Frakes at the conclusion of each episode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6t4LPGYdCLqsdijZqSOxzic3Tj.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:12323'),
  ('206160885289634947', 'Beyond Evil', 2021, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Sim Na-yeon, Kim Soo-jin', 'Kim Soo-jin', 'Shin Ha-kyun, Yeo Jin-goo, Choi Dae-hoon, Choi Sung-eun, Kim Shin-rock, Cheon Ho-jin, Park Ji-hoon, Choi Jin-ho', 'TV-MA', 'As a killing resembling a cold case resurfaces in a small town, the chase for the truth falls on two policemen who each harbor secrets of their own.', 'As a killing resembling a cold case resurfaces in a small town, the chase for the truth falls on two policemen who each harbor secrets of their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvR2V6BlXrJ7VTuhEfnXc4rTJTR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:116612'),
  ('147308213869441664', 'Beyond Goodbye', 2024, 'Drama', 'Hiroshi Kurosaki', null, 'Kasumi Arimura, Kentaro Sakaguchi, Eita Okuno, Ayumi Ito, Toma Ikuta, Issey Ogata, Kanji Furutachi, Tomokazu Miura', 'TV-14', 'After losing her fiancé in an accident, Saeko feels an inexplicable connection to a stranger — who, by a twist of fate, received his heart and memories.', 'After losing her fiancé in an accident, Saeko feels an inexplicable connection to a stranger — who, by a twist of fate, received his heart and memories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfBIufqT9QcupV17pEqQuGk29Io.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:234674'),
  ('803531578424051198', 'Beyond Paradise', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Robert Thorogood, Tony Jordan', null, 'Kris Marshall, Sally Bretton, Zahra Ahmadi, Dylan Llewellyn, Felicity Montagu', null, 'After leaving paradise and seeking a quieter life, Humphrey has taken a job as Detective Inspector in his fiancée Martha''s hometown. But with the high crime rate, maybe things will be louder than expected.', 'After leaving paradise and seeking a quieter life, Humphrey has taken a job as Detective Inspector in his fiancée Martha''s hometown. But with the high crime rate, maybe things will be louder than expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zwbypEzcjOyNuTLSD43fTB9kR8.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:205072'),
  ('291206804314848960', 'Beyond Scared Straight', 2011, 'Reality, Documentary, Crime', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Observing programs for troubled teens in which inmates reveal the realities of prison life in the hope of deterring them from a life of crime.', 'Observing programs for troubled teens in which inmates reveal the realities of prison life in the hope of deterring them from a life of crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99OZnLeMq7n0M4NSkGfvlwgt40v.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:38785'),
  ('759889666503508822', 'Beyond Skinwalker Ranch', 2023, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, 'Brandon Fugal, Paul Beban, Andy Bustamante, Travis Taylor, Erik Bard', 'TV-PG', 'Utilizing a team of reputable professionals working alongside "The Secret of Skinwalker Ranch" veterans, this series explores other sites of unusual activity and "high strangeness" phenomena in an effort to discover if the activity documented on Skinwalker Ranch is not only real, but pervasive.', 'Utilizing a team of reputable professionals working alongside "The Secret of Skinwalker Ranch" veterans, this series explores other sites of unusual activity and "high strangeness" phenomena in an effort to discover if the activity documented on Skinwalker Ranch is not only real, but pervasive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ntHLkOW6nHhyba4Yud9l5rBmWk.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:227384'),
  ('402627919588181720', 'Beyond Stranger Things', 2017, 'Talk, Documentary', null, null, 'Jim Rash', 'TV-14', 'Secrets from the "Stranger Things 2" universe are revealed as cast and guests discuss the latest episodes with host Jim Rash. Caution: spoilers ahead!', 'Secrets from the "Stranger Things 2" universe are revealed as cast and guests discuss the latest episodes with host Jim Rash. Caution: spoilers ahead!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHCFO8RJ3Hg6a8KjWAsvAsa38hp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74851'),
  ('869531682122804707', 'Beyond the Bar', 2025, 'Drama', 'Kim Jae-hong', null, 'Lee Jin-uk, Jung Chae-yeon, Jeon Hye-bin, Lee Hak-ju, Kang Sang-jun, Kwon Ah-reum, Kim Yeo-jin, Hong Seo-jun', 'TV-MA', 'A young, rookie lawyer with a strong sense of justice joins a top law firm — navigating the complex legal world under a cold, demanding mentor.', 'A young, rookie lawyer with a strong sense of justice joins a top law firm — navigating the complex legal world under a cold, demanding mentor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nN6mZZxJBPZXBjLxnjgpnoRvswk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:281004'),
  ('605172834475970163', 'Beyond the Boundary', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'KENN, Risa Taneda, Ayako Kawasumi, Yuri Yamaoka, Moe Toyota, Minori Chihara, Masaya Matsukaze, Naomi Shindo', 'TV-PG', 'The dark fantasy follows a high school sophomore named Akihito Kanbara. Although the boy appears human, he is half Youmu and invulnerable to wounds because he can heal quickly. One day, Akihito meets freshman Mirai Kuriyama when it seems she is about to jump from the school rooftop. Mirai is isolated because of her ability to manipulate blood, which is considered heresy among members of the spirit world. Disturbing events begin to unfold after Akihito saves Mirai.', 'The dark fantasy follows a high school sophomore named Akihito Kanbara. Although the boy appears human, he is half Youmu and invulnerable to wounds because he can heal quickly. One day, Akihito meets freshman Mirai Kuriyama when it seems she is about to jump from the school rooftop. Mirai is isolated because of her ability to manipulate blood, which is considered heresy among members of the spirit world. Disturbing events begin to unfold after Akihito saves Mirai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6cmtMbEZAYm3aWzthFRk6048LFi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61695'),
  ('135099705236685447', 'Beyond the Gates', 2025, 'Soap, Drama', 'Michele Val Jean', null, null, 'TV-14', 'A powerful and prestigious family reigns over a posh gated community with juicy secrets and scandals waiting to be uncovered.', 'A powerful and prestigious family reigns over a posh gated community with juicy secrets and scandals waiting to be uncovered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ah7Flh6FSq8WWxMkzRlazSFp2AX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:248361'),
  ('527245471164542660', 'Beyond the Realm of Conscience', 2009, 'Drama', 'Mui Siu-Ching', 'Wai-Nam Ku', 'Tavia Yeung, Moses Chan Ho, Charmaine Sheh Sze-Man, Kevin Cheng Ka-Wing, Susanna Kwan, Michelle Yim, Selena Lee, Edwin Siu', null, 'Beyond the Realm of Conscience is a 2009 Hong Kong television series. Produced by Mui Siu-ching, the serial is one of the two grand TVB productions to celebrate along with the channel''s 42nd anniversary, the other being Born Rich. The drama aired five days a week on the TVB network with 45-minute episodes starting October 19, 2009. Set in the latter years of the Tang Dynasty, Beyond the Realm of Conscience tells the story of palace maid Lau Sam-ho and her relations in the Imperial Palace, beginning with her experiences in the Imperial Household Bureau. The series title roughly means "Plots in the Palace" and is a play on the phrase, a homonym which roughly means "Plots that target and attack the heart".', 'Beyond the Realm of Conscience is a 2009 Hong Kong television series. Produced by Mui Siu-ching, the serial is one of the two grand TVB productions to celebrate along with the channel''s 42nd anniversary, the other being Born Rich. The drama aired five days a week on the TVB network with 45-minute episodes starting October 19, 2009. Set in the latter years of the Tang Dynasty, Beyond the Realm of Conscience tells the story of palace maid Lau Sam-ho and her relations in the Imperial Palace, beginning with her experiences in the Imperial Household Bureau. The series title roughly means "Plots in the Palace" and is a play on the phrase, a homonym which roughly means "Plots that target and attack the heart".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2b4t70bPnbUjKnsduuxj57lo7S.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16209'),
  ('638331774899558137', 'Beyond the Walls', 2016, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Hervé Hadmar, Marc Herpoux, Sylvie Chanteux', 'Marc Herpoux, Hervé Hadmar, Sylvie Chanteux', 'Cédric Lechapelier, Lila-Rose Gilberti, Veerle Baetens, François Deblock, Geraldine Chaplin, Carmelo Carpenito, Philippe Grand''Henry', null, 'A young woman mysteriously inherits the house across the street from a man unknown to her who died twenty years prior. When she moves in, she discovers a sinister labyrinth inside the walls and becomes trapped in its ever-changing corridors.', 'A young woman mysteriously inherits the house across the street from a man unknown to her who died twenty years prior. When she moves in, she discovers a sinister labyrinth inside the walls and becomes trapped in its ever-changing corridors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ecd3nrNU7Y7i5yeE3JrtvUNTdA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67979'),
