  ('730406555711396127', 'Beyond Twilight', 2026, 'Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Nobuhiko Okamoto, Kazuki Kyan, Ikumi Hasegawa, Hironori Kondoh', null, 'Ritsu inherited his sixth sense from his grandfather, along with a demon guardian named Blue Storm. Strange things just seem to happen around these two, and it''s left to them to get to the bottom of all these mysterious events. Each story is independent but features recurring characters you''ll come to know and appreciate as they, each in their own way, try to deal with things ''not of this world''.', 'Ritsu inherited his sixth sense from his grandfather, along with a demon guardian named Blue Storm. Strange things just seem to happen around these two, and it''s left to them to get to the bottom of all these mysterious events. Each story is independent but features recurring characters you''ll come to know and appreciate as they, each in their own way, try to deal with things ''not of this world''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wDQzkX6Fd60zQSQVkyaD9YgwRD8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:318478'),
  ('934596026648420620', 'Beyond Westworld', 1980, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Crime, Action & Adventure', 'Michael Crichton, Lou Shaw', null, 'Jim McMullan, James Wainwright, William Jordan, Nancy Harewood, Severn Darden, Connie Sellecca', null, 'Beyond Westworld was a short-lived 1980 television series that carried on the stories of the two feature films, Westworld and Futureworld. It featured Jim McMullan as Security Chief John Moore of the Delos Corporation. The story revolved around John Moore having to stop the evil scientist, Quaid, as he planned to use the robots in Delos to try to take over the world. Despite being nominated for two Emmys, only five episodes were produced, and only three of them were aired before cancellation.', 'Beyond Westworld was a short-lived 1980 television series that carried on the stories of the two feature films, Westworld and Futureworld. It featured Jim McMullan as Security Chief John Moore of the Delos Corporation. The story revolved around John Moore having to stop the evil scientist, Quaid, as he planned to use the robots in Delos to try to take over the world. Despite being nominated for two Emmys, only five episodes were produced, and only three of them were aired before cancellation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rseAYsyWtvwXGQSF02wJrXgFgcK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:411'),
  ('1121546115850765820', 'BG: Personal Bodyguard', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Takuya Kimura, Takumi Saitoh, Nanao, Shotaro Mamiya, Toru Nakamura, Mikako Ichikawa, Masanobu Katsumura, Shunsuke Michieda', null, 'Akira Shimazaki (Takuya Kimura) lives with his middle school student son. He used to work as a bodyguard, but, due to an incident, he now works as a security guard at a construction site. The private security company where he works establishes a new bodyguard division. Hiding his past as a bodyguard, Akira Shimazaki begins work as a novice bodyguard.', 'Akira Shimazaki (Takuya Kimura) lives with his middle school student son. He used to work as a bodyguard, but, due to an incident, he now works as a security guard at a construction site. The private security company where he works establishes a new bodyguard division. Hiding his past as a bodyguard, Akira Shimazaki begins work as a novice bodyguard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/va21D8IVfXQbEWGcuVG4Ea9MeMe.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:77271'),
  ('618729685601056714', 'BH90210', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jennie Garth, Tori Spelling, Chris Alberghini', null, 'Ian Ziering, Ty Wood, Tori Spelling, Jason Priestley, Jennie Garth, Gabrielle Carteris, Brian Austin Green, Shannen Doherty', 'TV-MA', 'Having gone their separate ways since the original series ended 19 years ago, the cast of Beverly Hills, 90210 reunites when one of them suggests it’s time to get a reboot up and running. But getting it going might make for an even more delicious soap than the reboot itself.', 'Having gone their separate ways since the original series ended 19 years ago, the cast of Beverly Hills, 90210 reunites when one of them suggests it’s time to get a reboot up and running. But getting it going might make for an even more delicious soap than the reboot itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z6Sj4dqUc5AVe66HddTN5wj7zYw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89235'),
  ('1036803837534505955', 'Bhagya Lakshmi', 2021, 'Soap', 'Ekta Kapoor', null, 'Aishwarya Khare, Rohit Suchanti, Maera Mishra, Aman Gandhi, Munira Kudrati, Smita Bansal, Uday Tikekar, Neena Cheema', null, 'Hailing from a middle-class family, Lakshmi’s life is upended when she realises that her marriage to Rishi Oberoi, an industrialist’s son, is a sham to keep his death at bay.', 'Hailing from a middle-class family, Lakshmi’s life is upended when she realises that her marriage to Rishi Oberoi, an industrialist’s son, is a sham to keep his death at bay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gG7VzFKAOuGqCJyHQJRTn9f7UMl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130542'),
  ('1125766321903309067', 'Bhaukaal', 2020, 'Crime', null, null, null, null, 'Naveen Sikhera makes his way into the sin city as the new SSP, he is hit by the prevailing chaos and lawlessness in the city. Muzaffarnagar is ruled by Shaukeen gang in the east and the Dedha brothers rule the west.', 'Naveen Sikhera makes his way into the sin city as the new SSP, he is hit by the prevailing chaos and lawlessness in the city. Muzaffarnagar is ruled by Shaukeen gang in the east and the Dedha brothers rule the west.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AtJ3wC0GhROcelqE8RNM5j4vgNj.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:100732'),
  ('158486014007661572', 'BIA', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy, Soap, Family', 'Jorge Edelstein, Carmen López Areal, Marina Efron', null, 'Isabela Souza, Julio Peña, Guido Messina, Andrea de Alba, Gabriella Di Grecco, Rhener Freitas, Fernando Dente, Giulia Guerrini', null, 'BIA tells the story of a group of teens who discover, share and develop their talents in the "Fundom", a place where they gather to hang out, create and express their art in a fun-filled and casual environment. Bia Urquiza, the main character, is a 16-year-old girl with great imagination and creativity.', 'BIA tells the story of a group of teens who discover, share and develop their talents in the "Fundom", a place where they gather to hang out, create and express their art in a fun-filled and casual environment. Bia Urquiza, the main character, is a 16-year-old girl with great imagination and creativity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jd80sReyYSiXME07CZE4XRk3k9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:90823'),
  ('874186153178757430', 'BIANCA', 2022, 'Talk', 'Bianca Ingrosso', null, 'Bianca Ingrosso', null, 'Unfiltered and unexpected when Bianca Ingrosso invites Swedish and international stars to Sweden''s new big talk show - BIANCA.', 'Unfiltered and unexpected when Bianca Ingrosso invites Swedish and international stars to Sweden''s new big talk show - BIANCA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yB2hy0AHd571ED2G6rI9kZ3Csvr.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:212239'),
