  ('954654149708186185', 'Bibi Blocksberg', 1997, 'Animation, Comedy, Crime', 'Elfie Donnelly', null, 'Susanna Bonaséwicz, Guido Weber, Gabriele Streichahn, Gisela Fritsch', 'NR', 'Bibi Blocksberg is a normal little girl - although she can do magic she still has a lot to learn. She''s always full of entertaining ideas, one little "Wizz-wizz" and a problem is solved or maybe it''s just the start of one.', 'Bibi Blocksberg is a normal little girl - although she can do magic she still has a lot to learn. She''s always full of entertaining ideas, one little "Wizz-wizz" and a problem is solved or maybe it''s just the start of one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tVmj17WR1eZtctXIkme26EbABu4.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:63361'),
  ('213425963751457967', 'Bibliophile Princess', 2022, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Reina Ueda, Ryohei Kimura, Koki Uchiyama, Yuma Uchida, Wataru Hatano, Gen Sato, Yohei Azakami, Nobunaga Shimazaki', 'TV-14', 'When book-loving Lady Elianna spots Prince Christopher—her betrothed in name only—consorting with another noble lady, she realizes the recent rumors must be true. The prince has someone he truly loves, which means the annulment of their engagement is both inevitable and fast-approaching. What she doesn''t realize is that this is merely a surface ripple—one of many where the truth runs deep, in a conspiracy surpassing her imagination!', 'When book-loving Lady Elianna spots Prince Christopher—her betrothed in name only—consorting with another noble lady, she realizes the recent rumors must be true. The prince has someone he truly loves, which means the annulment of their engagement is both inevitable and fast-approaching. What she doesn''t realize is that this is merely a surface ripple—one of many where the truth runs deep, in a conspiracy surpassing her imagination!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/S0xduJgRyZCDVzTjtZVuHIGlhj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156510'),
  ('510769469830901552', 'Bicchoo Ka Khel', 2020, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Divyendu Sharma, Syed Zeeshan Qadri, Mukul Chadda, Trishna Mukherjee, Gagan Anand, Abhinav Anand, Akanksha Thakur, Prashansa Sharma', null, 'What happens when a young student loses his father to a cover-up? Can he find it in himself to forget the past and move on, or is revenge the only thing that can give him some peace of mind?', 'What happens when a young student loses his father to a cover-up? Can he find it in himself to forget the past and move on, or is revenge the only thing that can give him some peace of mind?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1lU7XUtlZ7nDtN5k5NUsXHQo6Qh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113361'),
  ('189688974058487887', 'Big', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Hong Jeong-eun, Hong Mi-ran', 'Hong Jeong-eun, Hong Mi-ran', 'Gong Yoo, Lee Min-jung, Suzy, Jang Hee-jin, Shin Won-ho, Jang Hyun-sung, Koh Soo-hee, Im Ji-eun', null, '18-year-old Kang Gyung-Joon''s spirit suddenly becomes transplanted in the body of 30-year-old Seo Yoon Jae. Seo-Yon-Jae is a successful doctor and engaged to high school teacher Gil Da-Ran. Gil Da-Ran just so happens to be the teacher of 18-year old Kang Gyung-Joon. More problems ensue when 30-year-old Seo Yoon Jae falls in love with another woman.', '18-year-old Kang Gyung-Joon''s spirit suddenly becomes transplanted in the body of 30-year-old Seo Yoon Jae. Seo-Yon-Jae is a successful doctor and engaged to high school teacher Gil Da-Ran. Gil Da-Ran just so happens to be the teacher of 18-year old Kang Gyung-Joon. More problems ensue when 30-year-old Seo Yoon Jae falls in love with another woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/siINo7BXXBFmpnVNT2e4awuAQX3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43083'),
  ('199079119306236482', 'Big Al', 2000, 'Documentary', 'Tim Haines', 'Kate Bartlett, Michael Olmert', 'Kenneth Branagh', null, '145 million years ago an adolescent Allosaurus lay down to die in a dried up river bed. In 1991 scientists discovered his perfectly preserved body and nicknamed him Big Al. This is the story of this predatory dinosaur''s life - how he grew from a tiny hatchling to the terror of the Jurassic plains, why his body was covered in so many wounds and how he ended up in the river bed. The second part tells the story of the extraordinary forensics, spectacular paleontological finds and intricate studies of Al''s closest living relatives to unravel his intriguing life for the film.', '145 million years ago an adolescent Allosaurus lay down to die in a dried up river bed. In 1991 scientists discovered his perfectly preserved body and nicknamed him Big Al. This is the story of this predatory dinosaur''s life - how he grew from a tiny hatchling to the terror of the Jurassic plains, why his body was covered in so many wounds and how he ended up in the river bed. The second part tells the story of the extraordinary forensics, spectacular paleontological finds and intricate studies of Al''s closest living relatives to unravel his intriguing life for the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AftJZkzOKmjctzm7I0voRmIIjV1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19640'),
  ('557301769215038209', 'Big Bad BeetleBorgs', 1996, 'Action & Adventure, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Herbie Baez, Wesley Barker, Brittany Konarzewski, Billy Forester, David Fletcher, Joe Hackett, Blake Torney, Lina Godouse', 'TV-Y7', 'When three kids explore Charterville''s haunted Hillhurst Mansion on a dare, they discover a lot more than they bargain for! The trio find a wild and wacky phasm named Flabber, who changes their lives forever when he grants their wish to become the superheroes they''ve read about in BeetleBorgs comics. However, not only does Flabber grant the kids'' wish, but he also accidentally facilitates the escape of supervillains from the comic books as well! Now it''s up to these three newly tapped superheroes - aided by a friendly neighborhood phasm and armed with fantastic powers and awesome vehicles - to save the world from the forces of darkness that threaten the peace and harmony of all mankind.', 'When three kids explore Charterville''s haunted Hillhurst Mansion on a dare, they discover a lot more than they bargain for! The trio find a wild and wacky phasm named Flabber, who changes their lives forever when he grants their wish to become the superheroes they''ve read about in BeetleBorgs comics. However, not only does Flabber grant the kids'' wish, but he also accidentally facilitates the escape of supervillains from the comic books as well! Now it''s up to these three newly tapped superheroes - aided by a friendly neighborhood phasm and armed with fantastic powers and awesome vehicles - to save the world from the forces of darkness that threaten the peace and harmony of all mankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aIHIj3VxKTlhdeclpnw1dT9581w.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2136'),
  ('501447195246062868', 'Big Beasts', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Tom Hiddleston', 'TV-PG', 'Travel from freezing poles to tropical rainforests to meet nature’s most captivating giants, who prove being big comes with enormous challenges.', 'Travel from freezing poles to tropical rainforests to meet nature’s most captivating giants, who prove being big comes with enormous challenges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66CZm1hKApeFAqAd3CtK0uodetF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223528'),
  ('571593956330472587', 'Big Bet', 2022, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Kang Yun-sung', 'Kang Yun-sung', 'Choi Min-sik, Son Suk-ku, Lee Dong-hwi, Heo Sung-tae', 'TV-MA', 'Cha Moosik runs a casino bar, only to flee to the Philippines due to a crackdown by the National Tax Service. He launches a full-fledged casino business, and strategizes winning over the political and business circles in the Philippines. However, he is suddenly framed as a suspect in Min Seokjun''s death, and is tracked by Oh Seunghoon of the Korean Desk. Betrayal is rampant in the presence of money.', 'Cha Moosik runs a casino bar, only to flee to the Philippines due to a crackdown by the National Tax Service. He launches a full-fledged casino business, and strategizes winning over the political and business circles in the Philippines. However, he is suddenly framed as a suspect in Min Seokjun''s death, and is tracked by Oh Seunghoon of the Korean Desk. Betrayal is rampant in the presence of money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GEGH8kT7XK8iUXl76cWsCt8e46.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:112486'),
  ('980902899065459119', 'Big Boys', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jack Rooke', 'Jack Rooke', 'Dylan Llewellyn, Jon Pointing, Camille Coduri, Katy Wix, Izuka Hoyle, Olisa Odele, Jack Rooke', null, 'Big Boys is a silly, sweet comedy about two boys from very different ends of the “spectrum of masculinity” who become best mates at Brent Uni Freshers Week 2013.', 'Big Boys is a silly, sweet comedy about two boys from very different ends of the “spectrum of masculinity” who become best mates at Brent Uni Freshers Week 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/reMAnYY36uIrYZaUjoDUnP21llT.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:202851'),
  ('686706827166849965', 'Big Brother', 2000, 'Reality', 'John de Mol', null, 'Julie Chen, Clayton Halsey', 'TV-14', 'American version of the reality game show which follows a group of HouseGuests living together 24 hours a day in the "Big Brother" house, isolated from the outside world but under constant surveillance with no privacy for three months.', 'American version of the reality game show which follows a group of HouseGuests living together 24 hours a day in the "Big Brother" house, isolated from the outside world but under constant surveillance with no privacy for three months.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2TMOpJITXP2sHd6CrBmO7FvYk1.jpg', 27, 'tmdb:tv:10160'),
  ('355464054874435902', 'Big Brother', 2001, 'Reality', 'John de Mol', null, 'Mike Goldman, Mel Tracina', null, 'Big Brother is an Australian reality show based on the international Big Brother format created by John de Mol. Following the premise of other versions of the format, the show features a group of contestants, known as "housemates" who live together in a specially constructed house that is isolated from the outside world. The housemates are continuously monitored during their stay in the house by live television cameras as well as personal audio microphones. Throughout the course of the competition, housemates are evicted from the house - eliminated from the competition. The last remaining housemate wins the competition and is awarded a cash prize.', 'Big Brother is an Australian reality show based on the international Big Brother format created by John de Mol. Following the premise of other versions of the format, the show features a group of contestants, known as "housemates" who live together in a specially constructed house that is isolated from the outside world. The housemates are continuously monitored during their stay in the house by live television cameras as well as personal audio microphones. Throughout the course of the competition, housemates are evicted from the house - eliminated from the competition. The last remaining housemate wins the competition and is awarded a cash prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obl5RDSapabogimvwVVAKw5dZhA.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:990'),
  ('534722505952508897', 'Big Brother', 2021, 'Reality', 'John de Mol', null, 'Geraldine Kemper', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zmXxCP0op3PoCSiqXkSKDySbxe8.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:114885'),
  ('201863697135877161', 'Big Brother', 2023, 'Reality', 'John de Mol', null, 'AJ Odudu, Will Best', null, 'Britain’s ultimate social experiment. Follow every twist and turn as a group of housemates live under the gaze of 24/7 cameras and try to avoid eviction. Big Brother sees it all...', 'Britain’s ultimate social experiment. Follow every twist and turn as a group of housemates live under the gaze of 24/7 cameras and try to avoid eviction. Big Brother sees it all...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wTElPx0XRtqaevVNqKw4zoWzOB9.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:237243'),
