  ('482756370340491163', 'Bill Nye Saves the World', 2017, 'Reality, Talk, Documentary', null, 'Mike Drucker', 'Bill Nye', 'TV-14', 'Bill Nye explores science and its impact on politics, society and pop culture. Each episode tackles a topic from a scientific point of view, dispelling myths, and refuting anti-scientific claims that may be espoused by politicians, religious leaders or titans of industry.', 'Bill Nye explores science and its impact on politics, society and pop culture. Each episode tackles a topic from a scientific point of view, dispelling myths, and refuting anti-scientific claims that may be espoused by politicians, religious leaders or titans of industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6PszgaH7rYC9TaBypZTMw2J603N.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:69373'),
  ('189671342343511191', 'Bill Nye the Science Guy', 1993, 'Comedy, Documentary, Kids', 'Bill Nye', 'Lynn Brunelle, Michael Gross, Bill Nye', 'Bill Nye, Rachel Glenn, Jennifer Lin, Amy Broder, Ethan Ferkiss', 'TV-Y', 'It''s "Mr. Wizard" for a different decade. Bill Nye is the Science Guy, a host who''s hooked on experimenting and explaining. Picking one topic per show (like the human heart or electricity), Nye gets creative with teaching kids and adults alike the nuances of science.', 'It''s "Mr. Wizard" for a different decade. Bill Nye is the Science Guy, a host who''s hooked on experimenting and explaining. Picking one topic per show (like the human heart or electricity), Nye gets creative with teaching kids and adults alike the nuances of science.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdGGiQ8gBEwjyafLxW34IK8sblZ.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:3483'),
  ('427222596250337097', 'Bill Russell: Legend', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Corey Stoll, Bill Russell, Oscar Robertson, Stephen Curry, Bob Ryan, Larry Bird, Magic Johnson, Satch Sanders', 'TV-MA', 'Winningest NBA champion and civil rights icon Bill Russell builds a larger-than-life legacy on and off the court in this biographical documentary.', 'Winningest NBA champion and civil rights icon Bill Russell builds a larger-than-life legacy on and off the court in this biographical documentary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvjzYzjJB5X2jfxcRnVb09kN5Me.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:220030'),
  ('553149725971903652', 'Billion x School', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Shota Gajin', null, 'Ryosuke Yamada, Haruka Kinami, Miki Mizuno, Rintaro Mizusawa, Coki Yamashita, Haru Kashiwagi, Juri Kosaka, Genta Matsuda', null, 'Rei Kagami (Ryosuke Yamada) is a billionaire and the CEO of the leading conglomerate company Kagami Group. He is an extremely smart inventor, who has developed revolutionary products, and is now doing research on high precision AI. When he was little, he was a curious and kind kid. As he grew up, his curiosity remained, but he became self-centered. For certain reasons, he begins to teach at a school, while hiding his identity as a billionaire and the CEO of Kagami Group. His performance as a teacher is quite poor compared to his excellent work as a CEO. He is incapable of understanding the ordinary lives of the teachers and students around him.', 'Rei Kagami (Ryosuke Yamada) is a billionaire and the CEO of the leading conglomerate company Kagami Group. He is an extremely smart inventor, who has developed revolutionary products, and is now doing research on high precision AI. When he was little, he was a curious and kind kid. As he grew up, his curiosity remained, but he became self-centered. For certain reasons, he begins to teach at a school, while hiding his identity as a billionaire and the CEO of Kagami Group. His performance as a teacher is quite poor compared to his excellent work as a CEO. He is incapable of understanding the ordinary lives of the teachers and students around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qahu2FSjOhor5HLXqN6SwBwBrVZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:254263'),
  ('850550169963236170', 'Billionaire Island', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Anne Bjørnstad, Eilif Skodvin', 'Anne Bjørnstad, Eilif Skodvin', 'Trine Wiggen, Svein Roger Karlsen, Ragne Grande, Kåre Conradi, Hanne Skille Reitan, Tor Ivar Hagen, Vetle Røsten Granås, Nemi Storm', 'TV-MA', 'The ruthless owner of a Norwegian fish farming company plans a hostile takeover of her local rival to become the world''s largest salmon producer.', 'The ruthless owner of a Norwegian fish farming company plans a hostile takeover of her local rival to become the world''s largest salmon producer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vZXSWqFklMIncnGCZVuyul9yNgF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223785'),
  ('595144596401004393', 'Billionaires'' Bunker', 2025, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Mystery', 'Álex Pina, Esther Martínez Lobato', null, 'Miren Ibarguren, Joaquín Furriel, Natalia Verbeke, Carlos Santos, Montse Guallar, Pau Simon, Alícia Falcó, Agustina Bisio', 'TV-MA', 'When a group of billionaires takes shelter in a luxury bunker, an old feud between two families resurfaces amid an unprecedented global conflict.', 'When a group of billionaires takes shelter in a luxury bunker, an old feud between two families resurfaces amid an unprecedented global conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hNVb60dPG34wYjazGgFolJhqfxp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:245648'),
  ('1035701637494809670', 'Billions', 2016, 'Drama', 'Andrew Ross Sorkin, Brian Koppelman, David Levien', null, 'Paul Giamatti, Maggie Siff, David Costabile, Dola Rashad, Jeffrey DeMunn, Kelly AuCoin, Asia Kate Dillon, Corey Stoll', 'TV-MA', 'Shrewd, savvy U.S. Attorney Chuck Rhoades and the brilliant, ambitious hedge fund king Bobby "Axe" Axelrod are on an explosive collision course, with each using all of his considerable smarts, power and influence to outmaneuver the other. The stakes are in the billions in this timely, provocative series.', 'Shrewd, savvy U.S. Attorney Chuck Rhoades and the brilliant, ambitious hedge fund king Bobby "Axe" Axelrod are on an explosive collision course, with each using all of his considerable smarts, power and influence to outmaneuver the other. The stakes are in the billions in this timely, provocative series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/edwYPQdZE998d748AdwWLsfy0rl.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:62852'),
  ('381420374857781118', 'Billy & Billie', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Neil LaBute', null, 'Adam Brody, Lisa Joyce, Gia Crovatin, Jake Lacy, Victor Slezak, Phil Burke, Jan Maxwell, Li Jun Li', null, 'Billy & Billie centers on two young adults as they fall in love. They face the usual barrage of attention from their friends and family, and the normal anxieties that come at the start of a new relationship-all further complicated by the fact that they''re stepbrother and sister.', 'Billy & Billie centers on two young adults as they fall in love. They face the usual barrage of attention from their friends and family, and the normal anxieties that come at the start of a new relationship-all further complicated by the fact that they''re stepbrother and sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3LsRiEgGnnD8KdmUW6zCfMC8DB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62178'),
  ('626508590894750070', 'Billy Joel: And So It Goes', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Susan Lacy, Jessica Levin', null, 'Billy Joel', null, 'An expansive portrait of the life and music of Billy Joel, exploring the love, loss, and personal struggles that fuel his songwriting. With unprecedented access to never-before-seen performances, home movies, and personal photographs, along with extensive, in-depth one-on-one interviews, the documentary intimately explores the life and work of Joel, whose music has endured across generations.', 'An expansive portrait of the life and music of Billy Joel, exploring the love, loss, and personal struggles that fuel his songwriting. With unprecedented access to never-before-seen performances, home movies, and personal photographs, along with extensive, in-depth one-on-one interviews, the documentary intimately explores the life and work of Joel, whose music has endured across generations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xxXyWzAMNanhgiBzvfpRZJ5RdMU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:287967'),
  ('955302571433775634', 'Billy on the Street', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Billy Eichner', null, 'Billy Eichner', 'TV-14', 'Comedian Billy Eichner, unfiltered and unapologetic, hits the streets of New York City to test unsuspecting strangers on their knowledge of music and pop culture. With microphone in hand and money in tow, Eichner gives contestants the chance to win cash by answering a series of hilarious and spontaneous questions. The catch? The final round is subjective - Don''t agree with Billy? You lose.', 'Comedian Billy Eichner, unfiltered and unapologetic, hits the streets of New York City to test unsuspecting strangers on their knowledge of music and pop culture. With microphone in hand and money in tow, Eichner gives contestants the chance to win cash by answering a series of hilarious and spontaneous questions. The catch? The final round is subjective - Don''t agree with Billy? You lose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uXglruQ9ymN9WPTjoAjrW8Zkt7d.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:43822'),
  ('846904451803674294', 'Billy the Kid', 2022, 'Western, Drama', 'Michael Hirst', null, 'Tom Blyth, Daniel Webber, Alex Roe', 'TV-MA', 'An epic romantic adventure series based on the life of famous American outlaw Billy the Kid — from his humble Irish roots, to his early days as a cowboy and gunslinger in the American frontier, to his pivotal role in the Lincoln County War and beyond.', 'An epic romantic adventure series based on the life of famous American outlaw Billy the Kid — from his humble Irish roots, to his early days as a cowboy and gunslinger in the American frontier, to his pivotal role in the Lincoln County War and beyond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hwPPA0sqlU9kGRHDDyl4cVp4Vum.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:138971'),
  ('804590526033102126', 'Bing', 2014, 'Kids, Animation, Family', 'Ted Dewan', null, 'Mark Rylance, Elliot Kerley, Eve Bentley, Shai Portnoy, Bryony Hannah, Akiya Henry, Poppy Hendley, Tamsin Greig', 'TV-Y', 'Bing is a young and lovable bunny learning about the big world around him, with the help of his friends. A warm and gentle animation, based on the bestselling books by Ted Dewan.', 'Bing is a young and lovable bunny learning about the big world around him, with the help of his friends. A warm and gentle animation, based on the bestselling books by Ted Dewan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2p7S8pkFQsmZjSLaCZmCphdLaXz.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:69501'),
  ('450537894277130720', 'Binnelanders', 2005, 'Soap', 'Human Stark, Elsje Stark', null, 'Hans Strydom, Reynardt Hugo, Germandt Geldenhuys, Je-ani Swiegelaar, Kate Roothman, Gerald Steyn, Marlee van der Merwe, Roberto Kyle', null, 'A South African Afrikaans soap opera. It is set in and around the fictional private hospital, Binneland Kliniek, in Pretoria, and the storyline follows the trials, trauma and tribulations of the staff and patients of the hospital.', 'A South African Afrikaans soap opera. It is set in and around the fictional private hospital, Binneland Kliniek, in Pretoria, and the storyline follows the trials, trauma and tribulations of the staff and patients of the hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bzECfllho8PphdYujLUIuhncJD.jpg', 21, 'tmdb:tv:206559'),
  ('761684330610018471', 'Biography', 1987, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Biography is a documentary television series. It was originally a half-hour filmed series produced for CBS by David Wolper from 1961 to 1964 and hosted by Mike Wallace. The A&E Network later re-ran it and has produced new episodes since 1987. The older version featured historical figures such as Helen Keller and Mark Twain, or long-dead entertainment figures such as Will Rogers or John Barrymore. The A&E series has placed the emphasis on such people as Marilyn Monroe, Elvis Presley, Plácido Domingo, Freddie Mercury, Jacqueline Kennedy Onassis, Eric Clapton, Pope John Paul II, Gene Tierney, Selena, Diego Rivera, Mao Zedong and Queen Elizabeth II, and fictional characters like The Phantom, Superman, Hamlet, Betty Boop, and Santa Claus. The program ended up profiling enough figures that in 1999, A&E spun it off into an entire network, The Biography Channel.', 'Biography is a documentary television series. It was originally a half-hour filmed series produced for CBS by David Wolper from 1961 to 1964 and hosted by Mike Wallace. The A&E Network later re-ran it and has produced new episodes since 1987. The older version featured historical figures such as Helen Keller and Mark Twain, or long-dead entertainment figures such as Will Rogers or John Barrymore. The A&E series has placed the emphasis on such people as Marilyn Monroe, Elvis Presley, Plácido Domingo, Freddie Mercury, Jacqueline Kennedy Onassis, Eric Clapton, Pope John Paul II, Gene Tierney, Selena, Diego Rivera, Mao Zedong and Queen Elizabeth II, and fictional characters like The Phantom, Superman, Hamlet, Betty Boop, and Santa Claus. The program ended up profiling enough figures that in 1999, A&E spun it off into an entire network, The Biography Channel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8R9gswhn3Cpul7dmjMpLv4aPYrK.jpg', 27, 'tmdb:tv:4994'),
  ('338433456408543970', 'Biography: WWE Legends', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'The stories behind some of the most memorable WWE Superstars of all time.', 'The stories behind some of the most memorable WWE Superstars of all time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bVc6bYz7hLPNNdpuqlU7CEmJ2Dh.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:119985'),
  ('878151425661153489', 'Biohackers', 2020, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Mystery', 'Christian Ditter', null, 'Luna Wedler, Jessica Schwarz, Adrian Julius Tillmann, Thomas Prenn, Jing Xiang, Caro Cult, Sebastian Jakob Doppelbauer, Josh Universe', 'TV-MA', 'A medical student enters a top German university on a secret mission to uncover a conspiracy linking a family tragedy to a visionary biology professor.', 'A medical student enters a top German university on a secret mission to uncover a conspiracy linking a family tragedy to a visionary biology professor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g8HVazVTozhRyc9NcshHokPn3LY.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:100074'),
  ('1023387048755236822', 'Bionic Six', 1987, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family', null, null, 'John Stephenson, Jim MacGeorge, Carol Bilger, Hal Rayle, Bobbie Block, Brian Tochi, Norman Bernard, Neil Ross', null, 'The title characters of the series are a family of machine-enhanced human beings possessing unique powers after being augmented with bionic technology, much like The Six Million Dollar Man and The Bionic Woman. Each family member is given specific bionic powers, and thus they form a superhero team named Bionic Six.', 'The title characters of the series are a family of machine-enhanced human beings possessing unique powers after being augmented with bionic technology, much like The Six Million Dollar Man and The Bionic Woman. Each family member is given specific bionic powers, and thus they form a superhero team named Bionic Six.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdI7RkGufJ1dGIWNaQtjW7VM9EI.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:11092'),
  ('363397580771874542', 'Bionic Woman', 2007, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'David Eick, Kenneth Johnson, Martin Caidin', null, 'Michelle Ryan, Miguel Ferrer, Molly Price, Lucy Hale, Will Yun Lee', null, 'Jaime Sommers is saved from death after receiving experimental medical implants. While adjusting to her new bionic powers and raising a rebellious younger sister, Jaime agrees to work for the Berkut Group, a quasi-governmental private organisation that performed her surgery.', 'Jaime Sommers is saved from death after receiving experimental medical implants. While adjusting to her new bionic powers and raising a rebellious younger sister, Jaime agrees to work for the Berkut Group, a quasi-governmental private organisation that performed her surgery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lAJPZbL8x0HKtqQZLW1gfNFlPWc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1246'),
  ('882508070711961587', 'Bir Demet Tiyatro', 1995, 'Comedy, Family, Talk', 'Yılmaz Erdoğan', 'Yılmaz Erdoğan', 'Yılmaz Erdoğan, Neslihan Yeldan, Zerrin Sümer, Erdal Tosun, Sinan Bengier, Ayberk Atilla, Demet Akbağ, Serhat Özcan', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42kSiyNgrhGp1yEvQYAB44mwISS.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:48535'),
  ('809391838085878827', 'Bir Küçük Gün Işığı', 2022, 'Family, Drama', 'Emre Kabakuşak', 'Özgür Evren Heptürk', 'Seray Kaya, Berk Oktay, Esra Dermancıoğlu, Tuğçe Açıkgöz, Şeyma Korkmaz, Yilmaz Bayraktar, Güneş Hayat, Gizem Ünsal', null, 'Elif is very much in love with Hakan. The only thing missing from their marriage is a child. While Elif is thinking about starting the adoption procedure, she learns that Hakan had an accident. And his life begins to change irreversibly. Fırat, on the other hand, finds the trace of his brother Dila, who has been missing for years, and brings him back home. Fırat is left between her mother Ümran, who is prescriptive and oppressive, and her rebellious and Decadent brother Dila. While Elif’s life is turned upside down, Euphrates is unaware of the web that fate has woven for her. The path of Elif and Euphrates intersects in a way that they will never be separated again.', 'Elif is very much in love with Hakan. The only thing missing from their marriage is a child. While Elif is thinking about starting the adoption procedure, she learns that Hakan had an accident. And his life begins to change irreversibly. Fırat, on the other hand, finds the trace of his brother Dila, who has been missing for years, and brings him back home. Fırat is left between her mother Ümran, who is prescriptive and oppressive, and her rebellious and Decadent brother Dila. While Elif’s life is turned upside down, Euphrates is unaware of the web that fate has woven for her. The path of Elif and Euphrates intersects in a way that they will never be separated again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1xFxOrjDeJtoP6OUGpacorxRPVV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209544'),
  ('466252688176242589', 'Birdgirl', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Michael Ouweleen, Erik Richter', null, 'Paget Brewster, Negin Farsad, Rob Delaney, Sonia Denis, Kether Donohue, John Doman, Tony Hale, River L. Ramirez', 'TV-14', 'After being named CEO of the world''s largest and most non-sensical corporation, Sebben & Sebben, Judy Ken Sebben aka Birdgirl has to find a way to maintain her work/superhero life balance.', 'After being named CEO of the world''s largest and most non-sensical corporation, Sebben & Sebben, Judy Ken Sebben aka Birdgirl has to find a way to maintain her work/superhero life balance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vL4O0WQG4P4O8MpbmIRrVUFNMGC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:122486'),
  ('757365500054677484', 'BIRDIE WING -Golf Girls'' Story-', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Akari Kito, Asami Seto, Ami Koshimizu, Akira Sekine, Toru Furuya, Shuichi Ikeda, Toa Yukinari, Saki Fujita', 'TV-14', 'Fore! After Eve’s first meet-up with Aoi on the grass left her in defeat, she’s had her eyes set on a rematch to return the favor. Both these up-and-coming golfers are highly skilled, highly unique and most of all, highly competitive. With dreams of making it pro, a rivalry is getting in full swing as they both battle it out in the biggest tournaments.', 'Fore! After Eve’s first meet-up with Aoi on the grass left her in defeat, she’s had her eyes set on a rematch to return the favor. Both these up-and-coming golfers are highly skilled, highly unique and most of all, highly competitive. With dreams of making it pro, a rivalry is getting in full swing as they both battle it out in the biggest tournaments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQzXueKaedZ5fs68MLq6cKZ76BD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137390'),
  ('462457575365703076', 'Birdman and the Galaxy Trio', 1967, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation', null, null, 'Keith Andes, Don Messick, Virginia Eiler, Ted Cassidy, John Stephenson', null, 'Granted the power and wings of an eagle by high priests, Birdman defends the rights of mankind across the universe accompanied by his constant companion, an eagle named Avenger.', 'Granted the power and wings of an eagle by high priests, Birdman defends the rights of mankind across the universe accompanied by his constant companion, an eagle named Avenger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/52DGvCSbyKfprQ9OwPcxpBMdpv6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1029'),
  ('272187847471451244', 'Birds of a Feather', 1989, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Laurence Marks, Maurice Gran', null, 'Pauline Quirke, Linda Robson, Lesley Joseph, Charlie Quirke', null, 'Birds of a Feather is a British sitcom that was broadcast on BBC One from 1989 until 1998 and on ITV from 2013. Starring Pauline Quirke, Linda Robson and Lesley Joseph, it was created by Laurence Marks and Maurice Gran, who also wrote some of the episodes along with many other writers. The first episode sees sisters Tracey Stubbs and Sharon Theodopolopodos brought together when their husbands are sent to prison for armed robbery. Sharon, who lived in an Edmonton council flat, moves into Tracey''s expensive house in Chigwell, Essex. Their next-door neighbour, and later friend, Dorien Green is a middle-aged married woman who is constantly having affairs with younger men. In the later series the location is changed to Hainault. The series ended on Christmas Eve 1998 after a 9-year-run.', 'Birds of a Feather is a British sitcom that was broadcast on BBC One from 1989 until 1998 and on ITV from 2013. Starring Pauline Quirke, Linda Robson and Lesley Joseph, it was created by Laurence Marks and Maurice Gran, who also wrote some of the episodes along with many other writers. The first episode sees sisters Tracey Stubbs and Sharon Theodopolopodos brought together when their husbands are sent to prison for armed robbery. Sharon, who lived in an Edmonton council flat, moves into Tracey''s expensive house in Chigwell, Essex. Their next-door neighbour, and later friend, Dorien Green is a middle-aged married woman who is constantly having affairs with younger men. In the later series the location is changed to Hainault. The series ended on Christmas Eve 1998 after a 9-year-run.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Y8SEh4l96XfdXIMcxdyFWajqX5.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:2045'),
  ('266973267455805149', 'Birds of Prey', 2002, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Laeta Kalogridis', null, 'Ashley Scott, Dina Meyer, Rachel Skarsten, Shemar Moore, Ian Abercrombie, Mia Sara', 'TV-14', 'The series is set in New Gotham City, several years after it has been apparently abandoned by Batman. In his absence, Huntress, Oracle and Dinah are now the protectors of New Gotham: the Birds of Prey, and had taken over his war on crime. They are joined by Alfred Pennyworth, who serves Helena as she is heir to the Wayne estate; and Detective Jesse Reese, a police officer confronted with crimes and abilities he cannot explain. A central feature of the series is the concept of metahumans: individuals born with powers that cannot be explained. No two metahumans have the same abilities (unless hereditary), and there exists a whole subculture of metahuman society that the outside world knows nothing about.', 'The series is set in New Gotham City, several years after it has been apparently abandoned by Batman. In his absence, Huntress, Oracle and Dinah are now the protectors of New Gotham: the Birds of Prey, and had taken over his war on crime. They are joined by Alfred Pennyworth, who serves Helena as she is heir to the Wayne estate; and Detective Jesse Reese, a police officer confronted with crimes and abilities he cannot explain. A central feature of the series is the concept of metahumans: individuals born with powers that cannot be explained. No two metahumans have the same abilities (unless hereditary), and there exists a whole subculture of metahuman society that the outside world knows nothing about.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXeFSST0xqy5XNgrbuEaa5BxvDM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1469'),
  ('1150804797395936692', 'Birdsong', 2012, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, 'Abi Morgan', 'Eddie Redmayne, Clémence Poésy, Matthew Goode, Joseph Mawle, Richard Madden, Thomas Turgoose, Misi Dunai, George MacKay', null, 'As an English soldier fights in the horrific trenches of northern France, he is haunted by the memories of his forbidden love affair with a French woman.', 'As an English soldier fights in the horrific trenches of northern France, he is haunted by the memories of his forbidden love affair with a French woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x4QdPNpWjmI47iv9Z7F46BT3gQW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43271'),
  ('149944359772381017', 'Birdy the Mighty', 1996, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kotono Mitsuishi, Tetsuya Iwanaga, Motomu Kiyokawa, Yukana, Keiji Fujiwara, Makoto Higo, Keaton Yamada, Tomoko Maruo', null, 'Tsutomu, an average middle school kid busy studying for the final exams to enter high school runs into a man running from someone and gets caught up in the chase. In all the confusion he gets accidentally killed. Luckily Birdy (an interplanetary agent) knows a way to save him, unfortunately that means joining bodies to become one. So now he is stuck with this officer and along for the ride capturing criminals and saving lives.', 'Tsutomu, an average middle school kid busy studying for the final exams to enter high school runs into a man running from someone and gets caught up in the chase. In all the confusion he gets accidentally killed. Luckily Birdy (an interplanetary agent) knows a way to save him, unfortunately that means joining bodies to become one. So now he is stuck with this officer and along for the ride capturing criminals and saving lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6a6wcA8DVnD9GRnHrgjz0R4S48.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95916'),
  ('746127293472087591', 'Birdy the Mighty: Decode', 2008, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Keiji Fujiwara, Kaori Nazuka, Saeko Chiba, Miyu Irino, Masaya Matsukaze, Ako Mayama, Atsushi Ono, Mamiko Noto', null, 'While pursuing fugitives the Space Federation police officer Birdy Cephon Altera finds herself on Earth.', 'While pursuing fugitives the Space Federation police officer Birdy Cephon Altera finds herself on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MhyFK76viQc94A8Qbld4Ld2lSj.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:37264'),
  ('138447863747247550', 'Birth of a Beauty', 2014, 'Comedy', null, 'Yoon Young-mi', 'Ju Sang-uk, Han Ye-seul, Jung Gyu-woon, Wang Ji-hye, Han Sang-jin, Ha Jae-sook, In Gyo-jin, Han Jin-hee', 'TV-14', 'After a nearly-fatal accident, a divorced woman undergoes a head-to-toe transformation with help from a wealthy stranger to get revenge on her ex.', 'After a nearly-fatal accident, a divorced woman undergoes a head-to-toe transformation with help from a wealthy stranger to get revenge on her ex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6z9mEvrF6g9UPTan7xhWq9ssE5Y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61606'),
  ('804831010147761119', 'Birthcare Center', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Kim Ji-soo, Im Yeon-su', 'Uhm Ji-won, Park Ha-seon, Jang Hye-jin, Yoon Park, Choi Ri, Im Hwa-young, Bae Woo-hee, Moo Jin-sung', 'TV-14', 'Oh Hyun-jin is the youngest executive at her company. She gives birth to a baby and stays at a postnatal care center. She is the oldest guest at the center for mothers and their newborn babies. While staying there, she meets other women, including Jo Eun-jeong, and they grow together as adults.', 'Oh Hyun-jin is the youngest executive at her company. She gives birth to a baby and stays at a postnatal care center. She is the oldest guest at the center for mothers and their newborn babies. While staying there, she meets other women, including Jo Eun-jeong, and they grow together as adults.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXPP452gajhEMO5lmQiiPkekJty.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:111292'),
  ('503145427570333046', 'Bit City', 2024, 'Comedy, Reality, Talk', 'Ian Hecox, Anthony Padilla, Erin Dougal', null, 'Angela Giarratana', null, 'The Smosh cast recreates late-night television in wacky, weird ways. From Shrimp: The Musical to the Tetris reunion, Angela Giarratana hosts a fever-dream of a show.', 'The Smosh cast recreates late-night television in wacky, weird ways. From Shrimp: The Musical to the Tetris reunion, Angela Giarratana hosts a fever-dream of a show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vtxLmu0WMQNsK2In9KeYOYjsWXF.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:280630'),
  ('867879722436880086', 'Bitch X Rich', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Jung Sung-eun, Min Ji-young', null, 'Lee Eun-saem, YERI, Lee Jong-hyuk, Park Si-woo, Jang Sung-yoon, Jang Deok-su, Kim Min-kyu, Won Gyu-bin', null, 'Kim Hye-in has to transfer to Cheongdam International High School after witnessing a murder. She crosses paths with Baek Je-na, a bully who happens to be connected to the case.', 'Kim Hye-in has to transfer to Cheongdam International High School after witnessing a murder. She crosses paths with Baek Je-na, a bully who happens to be connected to the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gigYIx6DCgs9cFmvFEXTBo2Zwkm.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:214994'),
  ('469074258079926782', 'Bite Club', 2018, 'Drama, Crime', null, 'John Ridley, Sarah Smith', 'Dominic Monaghan, Deborah Mailman, Ash Ricardo, Robert Mammone, Todd Lasance, Darcie Irwin-Simpson, Arka Das, Pia Miller', null, 'After surviving a shark attack, homicide detectives Dan Cooper and Zoe Rawlings join forces to hunt the ultimate predator - a serial killer who is also hunting them. Not only are they survivors but also ex-lovers. Exceptional at what they do, together they''re a force like no other. Zoe is happy in a new relationship, but after three years away Dan knows Zoe was the one he let go and wants her back. Will Dan and Zoe be able to work together to hunt down the serial killer or will they become the killer''s next victims?', 'After surviving a shark attack, homicide detectives Dan Cooper and Zoe Rawlings join forces to hunt the ultimate predator - a serial killer who is also hunting them. Not only are they survivors but also ex-lovers. Exceptional at what they do, together they''re a force like no other. Zoe is happy in a new relationship, but after three years away Dan knows Zoe was the one he let go and wants her back. Will Dan and Zoe be able to work together to hunt down the serial killer or will they become the killer''s next victims?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9zwMmiuyPh8FDev2HMSho2UNN0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81676'),
  ('91730031357616899', 'Bitten', 2014, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Daegan Fryklind', null, 'Laura Vandervoort, Greyston Holt, Greg Bryk, Steve Lund, Genelle Williams, Tommie-Amber Pirie, John Ralston, Alex Ozerov-Meyer', 'TV-MA', 'Elena Micheals thought she left the world of supernatural behind when she left Stonehaven behind ''for good this time'' she thought. Until the night she got the mysterious call from her pack leader asking her to come back. So now she is heading back, leaving her life as a normal photographer in Toronto for the moment to re-enter the world of werewolves, rules about protect the pack and a man she has spent years trying to get out of her system. Oh and did she mention she was the only living female werewolf in existence?', 'Elena Micheals thought she left the world of supernatural behind when she left Stonehaven behind ''for good this time'' she thought. Until the night she got the mysterious call from her pack leader asking her to come back. So now she is heading back, leaving her life as a normal photographer in Toronto for the moment to re-enter the world of werewolves, rules about protect the pack and a man she has spent years trying to get out of her system. Oh and did she mention she was the only living female werewolf in existence?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guhxl5I8J1WVEA3yeDt8hwgpYWx.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:60556'),
  ('650734201038894184', 'Bitter Coffee', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mehran Modiri', 'Amir Mahdi Jule, Khashayar Alvand', 'Siamak Ansari, Mohammadreza Hedayati, Mehran Modiri, Elika Abdolrazzaghi, Sahar Zakaria, Reza Feyznorouzi, Maryam Bbakhshi, Sahar Jafari Jozani', 'TV-14', 'The series begins with history teacher Nima Zande-Karimi (Siamak Ansari) realizing that his extensive research on Persian and world history is of little use to financing his day-to-day life. He is about to leave Tehran for good to go back to his hometown by the name of Darab, when he comes across young university student Roya Atabaki (Sahar Jafari-Jozani) who is researching for her final year dissertation, which is regarding the period 1198–1203, that is said to be a period of turmoil for Iran''s ruling elite. Such turmoil that, very few books are available on that period for Roya''s research. It is then that Nima receives an anonymous telephone call, which leads him to Niavaran Palace (currently a museum), where he is told to have a coffee and wait. The coffee (which is bitter) is ready and he duly drinks it, his sight becomes hazy, and when he manages to refocus he is in the year 1201 (1822 AD), and the story develops therein.', 'The series begins with history teacher Nima Zande-Karimi (Siamak Ansari) realizing that his extensive research on Persian and world history is of little use to financing his day-to-day life. He is about to leave Tehran for good to go back to his hometown by the name of Darab, when he comes across young university student Roya Atabaki (Sahar Jafari-Jozani) who is researching for her final year dissertation, which is regarding the period 1198–1203, that is said to be a period of turmoil for Iran''s ruling elite. Such turmoil that, very few books are available on that period for Roya''s research. It is then that Nima receives an anonymous telephone call, which leads him to Niavaran Palace (currently a museum), where he is told to have a coffee and wait. The coffee (which is bitter) is ready and he duly drinks it, his sight becomes hazy, and when he manages to refocus he is in the year 1201 (1822 AD), and the story develops therein.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfrLuUuCFNWXAA1jdEoBYpqY6KP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34277'),
  ('974379590157123509', 'Bitter Daisies', 2018, 'Drama', 'Raquel Arias, Eligio R. Montero', 'Eligio R. Montero, Raquel Arias, Ghaleb Jaber Martínez', 'María Mera, Santi Prego, Noelia Castaño, Rebeca Stones, César Cambeiro, David Seijo, Sara Sanz', 'TV-MA', 'While investigating the disappearance of a teen girl in a tight-knit Galician town, a Civil Guard officer uncovers secrets linked to a loss of her own.', 'While investigating the disappearance of a teen girl in a tight-knit Galician town, a Civil Guard officer uncovers secrets linked to a loss of her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Iw9c8l858yRtCZEdOuTHSExGX8.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:88027'),
  ('772809351403806904', 'Bitter Lands', 2018, 'Family, Drama', 'Ayfer Tunç', 'Ayfer Tunç', 'Hilal Altınbilek, Kerem Alışık, Bülent Polat, Selin Yeninci, Sibel Taşçıoğlu, Selin Genç, Polen Emre, Serpil Tamur', 'NR', 'The love story of Zuleyha, ​​who grew up without a father and works with Yilmaz as an auxiliary weaver in order to earn money for her brother, a gambler. The lives of these two young people blinded by the love of one ordinary night will turn into a dark nightmare. This nightmare will take them first from Istanbul and far away, and later to the estate of the Yaman family. In the first episode of the series, Yilmaz and Zuleyha set out to work on the Yaman estate. However, because of one of Zuleyha''s lies - the lives of all of them will change radically.', 'The love story of Zuleyha, ​​who grew up without a father and works with Yilmaz as an auxiliary weaver in order to earn money for her brother, a gambler. The lives of these two young people blinded by the love of one ordinary night will turn into a dark nightmare. This nightmare will take them first from Istanbul and far away, and later to the estate of the Yaman family. In the first episode of the series, Yilmaz and Zuleyha set out to work on the Yaman estate. However, because of one of Zuleyha''s lies - the lives of all of them will change radically.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eqSfCYEnNWSmsnCPYI8jzR80ML4.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:82328'),
  ('477023968096169003', 'Bizaardvark', 2016, 'Family, Comedy', 'Josh Lehrman, Kyle Stegina', null, 'Olivia Rodrigo, Madison Hu, DeVore Ledridge, Ethan Wacker, Maxwell Simkins, Elie Samouhi', 'TV-G', 'The live-action comedy follows comedy duo Paige and Frankie, two quirky teens who write funny songs and create music comedy videos for their online channel. With the help of friend and aspiring agent Bernie plus Vuuugle stars Dirk and Amelia, the best friends embark on comedic adventures in their quest to take the video blogging world by storm.', 'The live-action comedy follows comedy duo Paige and Frankie, two quirky teens who write funny songs and create music comedy videos for their online channel. With the help of friend and aspiring agent Bernie plus Vuuugle stars Dirk and Amelia, the best friends embark on comedic adventures in their quest to take the video blogging world by storm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3zf9m6nvK55KhMukTqAg5rVEW7.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:66456'),
  ('940396496989439237', 'Bizarre Foods with Andrew Zimmern', 2007, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, null, 'NR', 'Bizarre Foods with Andrew Zimmern is a travel and cuisine television show hosted by Andrew Zimmern on the Travel Channel. The first season debuted on Monday, February 26, 2007 at 9pm ET/PT. Bizarre Foods focuses on regional cuisine from around the world which is typically perceived by Americans as being disgusting, exotic, or bizarre. In each episode, Zimmern focuses on the cuisine of a particular country or region. He typically shows how the food is procured, where it is served, and, usually without hesitation, eats it. Originally a one-hour documentary titled Bizarre Foods of Asia, repeated showings on the Travel Channel drew consistent, considerable audiences. In late 2006, it was decided to turn the documentary into a weekly, one-hour show with the same premise and with Andrew Zimmern as the host. In 2009, Zimmern took a break from Bizarre Foods to work on one season of the spin-off Bizarre World.', 'Bizarre Foods with Andrew Zimmern is a travel and cuisine television show hosted by Andrew Zimmern on the Travel Channel. The first season debuted on Monday, February 26, 2007 at 9pm ET/PT. Bizarre Foods focuses on regional cuisine from around the world which is typically perceived by Americans as being disgusting, exotic, or bizarre. In each episode, Zimmern focuses on the cuisine of a particular country or region. He typically shows how the food is procured, where it is served, and, usually without hesitation, eats it. Originally a one-hour documentary titled Bizarre Foods of Asia, repeated showings on the Travel Channel drew consistent, considerable audiences. In late 2006, it was decided to turn the documentary into a weekly, one-hour show with the same premise and with Andrew Zimmern as the host. In 2009, Zimmern took a break from Bizarre Foods to work on one season of the spin-off Bizarre World.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mV7A1F4xfglJnwZn9smv9glUqD9.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:4898'),
  ('643564701704001409', 'Black', 2017, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Kim Hong-sun', 'Choi Ran', 'Song Seung-heon, Go Ara, Lee El, Kim Dong-jun, Kim Won-hae, Kim Jong Yoon, Park Doo-sik, Jo Jae-yun', null, 'A Grim Reaper, a detective and a woman who foresees death get ensnared in matters of life and death -- and dark mysteries of twenty years past.', 'A Grim Reaper, a detective and a woman who foresees death get ensnared in matters of life and death -- and dark mysteries of twenty years past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1cBjzxqoNC9NTAKI4PeivjIEHoa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73944'),
  ('393019793285800322', 'Black & White', 2009, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Yu Hsiao-hui, Tsai Yueh-Hsun', 'Kelly Chen, Wu Luo-ying', 'Mark Chao You-Ting, Vic Chou, Ivy Chen, Janine Chang Chun-Ning, Shiou Chieh-kai, Allen Chao, Tong Chih-wei, Kingone Wang', 'TV-PG', 'Pi Zi and Ying Xiong are two cops who are as different as day and night. One lives a luxurious lifestyle and does nothing but drink coffee and wait for information from dubious sources to crack his cases. Another believes law and justice are the pillars of society and is constantly on the street catching criminals. When a case brings these two top crime solvers together, sparks fly and light begins to creep into the dark corners of Taipei.', 'Pi Zi and Ying Xiong are two cops who are as different as day and night. One lives a luxurious lifestyle and does nothing but drink coffee and wait for information from dubious sources to crack his cases. Another believes law and justice are the pillars of society and is constantly on the street catching criminals. When a case brings these two top crime solvers together, sparks fly and light begins to creep into the dark corners of Taipei.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5PpXA0xCUheuqIcLgX3pOuorsv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37666'),
  ('642257970998643863', 'Black Beauty', 1978, 'Drama', null, null, 'Edward Albert, Peter Breck, Eileen Brennan, Lonny Chapman, Ken Curtis, Don DeFore, William Devane, Jack Elam', null, 'Born free in the American West, Black Beauty is a horse rounded up and brought to Birtwick Stables, where she meets spirited teenager Jo Green. The two forge a bond that carries Beauty through the different chapters, challenges and adventures.', 'Born free in the American West, Black Beauty is a horse rounded up and brought to Birtwick Stables, where she meets spirited teenager Jo Green. The two forge a bond that carries Beauty through the different chapters, challenges and adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yOhSTFIgiUBZSFjDaA9Lkwn7Xen.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77354'),
  ('962818677359183712', 'Black Bird', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Dennis Lehane', null, 'Taron Egerton, Paul Walter Hauser, Sepideh Moafi, Greg Kinnear, Ray Liotta', 'TV-MA', 'As Jimmy Keene begins a 10-year prison sentence, he gets an incredible offer: If he can elicit a confession from suspected killer Larry Hall, Jimmy will be freed. Completing this mission becomes the challenge of a lifetime.', 'As Jimmy Keene begins a 10-year prison sentence, he gets an incredible offer: If he can elicit a confession from suspected killer Larry Hall, Jimmy will be freed. Completing this mission becomes the challenge of a lifetime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qu312pwM61NPTr7nexvovCClDNP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155537'),
  ('642963928958836715', 'Black Blood Brothers', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Takahiro Sakurai, Omi Minami, Miyuki Sawashiro, Ryoko Nagata', null, 'Black Blood Brothers, also known as BBB, is a light novel series written by Kōhei Azano and illustrated by Yuuya Kusaka. In 2006, Studio Live and Group TAC produced an anime based on the series. It is directed by Hiroaki Yoshikawa. It was licensed for North American release by Funimation Entertainment, with the first DVD being released in February 2008.', 'Black Blood Brothers, also known as BBB, is a light novel series written by Kōhei Azano and illustrated by Yuuya Kusaka. In 2006, Studio Live and Group TAC produced an anime based on the series. It is directed by Hiroaki Yoshikawa. It was licensed for North American release by Funimation Entertainment, with the first DVD being released in February 2008.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tAA1BKAqpRtnemHL8zF4cG7NtYn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31741'),
  ('424073961496197559', 'Black Books', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Dylan Moran, Graham Linehan', null, 'Dylan Moran, Bill Bailey, Tamsin Greig', 'TV-PG', 'Black Books centres around the foul tempered and wildly eccentric bookshop owner Bernard Black. Bernard’s devotion to the twin pleasures of drunkenness and wilful antagonism deepens and enriches both his life and that of Manny, his assistant. Bearded, sweet and good, Manny is everything that Bernard isn’t and is punished by Bernard relentlessly just for the crime of existing. They depend on each other for meaning as Fran, their oldest friend, depends on them for distraction. Black Books is a haven of books, wine and conversation, the only threat to the group’s peace and prosperity is their own limitless stupidity.', 'Black Books centres around the foul tempered and wildly eccentric bookshop owner Bernard Black. Bernard’s devotion to the twin pleasures of drunkenness and wilful antagonism deepens and enriches both his life and that of Manny, his assistant. Bearded, sweet and good, Manny is everything that Bernard isn’t and is punished by Bernard relentlessly just for the crime of existing. They depend on each other for meaning as Fran, their oldest friend, depends on them for distraction. Black Books is a haven of books, wine and conversation, the only threat to the group’s peace and prosperity is their own limitless stupidity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uqSCTPmYHa8I8SiK0k6qgmK93Rj.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:903'),
  ('615753282672716076', 'Black Box', 2014, 'Drama', 'Amy Holden Jones', null, 'Kelly Reilly, Ditch Davey, David Ajala, Laura Fraser, Siobhan Williams, David Chisum, Ali Wong, Terry Kinney', 'TV-14', 'Catherine Black is a world-famous neurologist at the state-of-the-art medical institution known as "The Cube". Catherine is brilliant, beautiful, and at the top of her game, though she''s hiding a secret of her own: she''s bipolar. Each week, the doctors on staff attempt to unravel the mysteries of the brain and are constantly challenged by cases never-before-seen on television. The medical stories are moving, bizarre and a visual feast. The personal stories are riveting. The patients have rare, highly visual, often hallucinogenic and startling conditions, which we’ll see through their eyes as Catherine diagnoses and treats them.', 'Catherine Black is a world-famous neurologist at the state-of-the-art medical institution known as "The Cube". Catherine is brilliant, beautiful, and at the top of her game, though she''s hiding a secret of her own: she''s bipolar. Each week, the doctors on staff attempt to unravel the mysteries of the brain and are constantly challenged by cases never-before-seen on television. The medical stories are moving, bizarre and a visual feast. The personal stories are riveting. The patients have rare, highly visual, often hallucinogenic and startling conditions, which we’ll see through their eyes as Catherine diagnoses and treats them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bjfxUhq0IflP9OOsZ19SOVAmhDR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:51675'),
  ('167004889643727928', 'Black Bullet', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuki Kaji, Rina Hidaka, Yui Horie, Tomoyo Kurosawa, Rikiya Koyama, Aki Toyosaki, Yuhko Kaida, Tamio Ohki', 'TV-MA', 'A near future, where humans have been defeated by the viral parasites named Gastrea. They have been exiled into a small territory and live in despair, side-by-side in terror. In this world trapped in darkness— Rentaro, a boy living near Tokyo and member of the "Civil Security"—an organization specializing in fighting against the Gastrea—is used to accomplishing dangerous tasks. His partner is Enju, a precocious young girl. They fight thanks to their peculiar powers until one day, when they receive a special assignment from the government. This top secret mission is to prevent the destruction of Tokyo... Set in a near future, this thrilling heroic-action story... starts now!', 'A near future, where humans have been defeated by the viral parasites named Gastrea. They have been exiled into a small territory and live in despair, side-by-side in terror. In this world trapped in darkness— Rentaro, a boy living near Tokyo and member of the "Civil Security"—an organization specializing in fighting against the Gastrea—is used to accomplishing dangerous tasks. His partner is Enju, a precocious young girl. They fight thanks to their peculiar powers until one day, when they receive a special assignment from the government. This top secret mission is to prevent the destruction of Tokyo... Set in a near future, this thrilling heroic-action story... starts now!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4UOpAafs6PCsZ8AwlCjGVIVn2ET.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60834'),
  ('134529934924327981', 'Black Butler', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Daisuke Ono, Maaya Sakamoto', 'TV-MA', 'In Victorian London, 12-year-old business magnate Ciel Phantomhive thwarts dangers to the queen as he''s watched over by his demon butler, Sebastian.', 'In Victorian London, 12-year-old business magnate Ciel Phantomhive thwarts dangers to the queen as he''s watched over by his demon butler, Sebastian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXGs130TRoUplHf0o86zp9MqAYc.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:50712'),
  ('984861006771057073', 'Black Butterflies', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Olivier Abbou, Bruno Merle', 'Bruno Merle, Olivier Abbou', 'Nicolas Duvauchelle, Niels Arestrup, Axel Granberger, Alyzée Costes, Brigitte Catillon, Marie Denarnaud, Lola Créton, Henny Reents', 'TV-MA', 'Low on inspiration for his second book, a gloomy novelist agrees to write a memoir for a dying man — and swiftly becomes part of his bloodstained past.', 'Low on inspiration for his second book, a gloomy novelist agrees to write a memoir for a dying man — and swiftly becomes part of his bloodstained past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ge19H0tu8EAfpmyOjCVL1p980h2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208691'),
  ('337966882893050953', 'Black Cake', 2023, 'Drama', 'Marissa Jo Cerar', null, 'Chipo Chung, Rupert Evans, Ashley Thomas, Adrienne Warren, Rebecca Calder, Cara Horgan, Tom McKay, Mia Isaac', 'TV-MA', 'Two estranged siblings must set aside their differences to deal with their mother''s death and her hidden past – a journey of discovery that takes them from the Caribbean to London to California and ends with her famous black cake.', 'Two estranged siblings must set aside their differences to deal with their mother''s death and her hidden past – a journey of discovery that takes them from the Caribbean to London to California and ends with her famous black cake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jffJMsY4oQMJNP4iuaPMazWbRC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:230225'),
  ('34926061471885474', 'Black Cat', 2005, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Takashi Kondo, Keiji Fujiwara, Misato Fukuen, Yukana, Shin-ichiro Miki, Show Hayami, Chiemi Chiba, Megumi Toyoguchi', 'TV-PG', 'The bounty hunter Sven is barely scraping by when he crosses paths with the Black Cat (a.k.a. Train Heartnet) and the young bio-weapon Eve. The three new companions will need more than luck to survive when they find themselves sought by both the Chronos Numbers and a Taoist revolutionary group called the Apostles of the Star.', 'The bounty hunter Sven is barely scraping by when he crosses paths with the Black Cat (a.k.a. Train Heartnet) and the young bio-weapon Eve. The three new companions will need more than luck to survive when they find themselves sought by both the Chronos Numbers and a Taoist revolutionary group called the Apostles of the Star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1GpXrmDmQmRrsXLbMY8y0YaxHLL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34065'),
  ('680173226269925381', 'Black Clover', 2017, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Gakuto Kajiwara, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Kana Yuuki, Junichi Suwabe, Genki Muro, Ayumu Murase, Jun Fukuyama, Satoshi Hino', 'TV-MA', 'Asta and Yuno are two orphans who want the same thing: to become the Wizard King. Locked in a friendly rivalry, they work hard towards their goal. While Yuno excels at magic, Asta has a problem uncommon in this world: he has no powers! But, on the day they receive their grimoires, they surprise everyone. To reach their goal, they’ll each find their own path to greatness—with or without magic.', 'Asta and Yuno are two orphans who want the same thing: to become the Wizard King. Locked in a friendly rivalry, they work hard towards their goal. While Yuno excels at magic, Asta has a problem uncommon in this world: he has no powers! But, on the day they receive their grimoires, they surprise everyone. To reach their goal, they’ll each find their own path to greatness—with or without magic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kaMisKeOoTBPxPkbC3OW7Wgt6ON.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73223'),
  ('226850420635376785', 'Black Dog', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Park Ju-yeon, Hwang Joon-hyuk', 'Park Ju-yeon', 'Seo Hyun-jin, Ra Mi-ran, Ha Jun, Lee Chang-hoon, Lee Yoon-hee, Kim Hong-pa, Ye Su-jeong, Jo Yeon-hee', 'TV-14', 'In a temporary position at a private high school, a compassionate teacher fights to support her students'' dreams while navigating school politics.', 'In a temporary position at a private high school, a compassionate teacher fights to support her students'' dreams while navigating school politics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uBlTyrvCu08h9APMvSajBiNpsyV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95067'),
  ('693361673954045137', 'Black Doves', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Mystery, Crime', 'Joe Barton', null, 'Keira Knightley, Ben Whishaw, Sarah Lancashire', 'TV-MA', 'When a spy posing as a politician''s wife learns her lover has been murdered, an old assassin friend joins her on a quest for truth — and vengeance.', 'When a spy posing as a politician''s wife learns her lover has been murdered, an old assassin friend joins her on a quest for truth — and vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uoXtkm2P4HPPL8T3IBJ02G3hCC4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:225385'),
  ('94019041555121965', 'Black Dynamite', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy', 'Byron Minns, Michael Jai White', null, 'Michael Jai White, Byron Minns, Kym Whitley, Tommy Davidson, Debra Wilson', 'TV-MA', 'Black Dynamite is an American animated television series based on the 2009 film of the same name, although the series follows a separate continuity, with some back-references to the film. The series was announced shortly after the release of the film, the 10-minute pilot episode was released on Adult Swim Video on August 8, 2011, and the full series premiered on Cartoon Network''s late night programming block, Adult Swim, on July 15, 2012. Michael Jai White, Byron Minns, Tommy Davidson and Kym Whitley reprise their film roles as Black Dynamite, Bullhorn, Cream Corn and Honeybee, respectively.', 'Black Dynamite is an American animated television series based on the 2009 film of the same name, although the series follows a separate continuity, with some back-references to the film. The series was announced shortly after the release of the film, the 10-minute pilot episode was released on Adult Swim Video on August 8, 2011, and the full series premiered on Cartoon Network''s late night programming block, Adult Swim, on July 15, 2012. Michael Jai White, Byron Minns, Tommy Davidson and Kym Whitley reprise their film roles as Black Dynamite, Bullhorn, Cream Corn and Honeybee, respectively.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1E5J4QQ3ATBpns69LR5FQy1QJI.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:40064'),
  ('453155798988646372', 'Black Earth Rising', 2018, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'Michaela Coel, John Goodman, Noma Dumezweni, Lucian Msamati, Tyrone Huggins, Tamara Tunie, Emmanuel Imani, Abena Ayivor', 'TV-MA', 'As a child, Kate Ashby was rescued from the horrific aftermath of the Rwandan genocide and brought to the UK. But the tragic shadow of her past proves impossible to escape.', 'As a child, Kate Ashby was rescued from the horrific aftermath of the Rwandan genocide and brought to the UK. But the tragic shadow of her past proves impossible to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/77MPYFMYiMi0PFXk1Kr5Nv9yaO7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82209'),
  ('18113232377531144', 'Black Heart', 2024, 'Drama', 'Uluç Bayraktar', null, 'Ece Uslu, Burak Sergen, Burak Tozkoparan, Leyla Tanlar, Hafsanur Sancaktutan, Aras Aydın, Genco Özak, Esra Dermancıoğlu', null, 'Sumru left the children she gave birth to at a young age and built a new life and family for herself. Melek and Nuh learn their mother''s identity from their grandmother''s final words and set out to find her. Sumru, who is now married to one of Cappadocia''s wealthiest businessmen, Samet, continues her lavish life with the children she had with him. However, she has different plans regarding Samet''s son from his first marriage, Cihan. The paths of Melek and Nuh, who are seeking to confront their mother, will unexpectedly cross with Cihan and his reluctant fiancée, Sevilay.', 'Sumru left the children she gave birth to at a young age and built a new life and family for herself. Melek and Nuh learn their mother''s identity from their grandmother''s final words and set out to find her. Sumru, who is now married to one of Cappadocia''s wealthiest businessmen, Samet, continues her lavish life with the children she had with him. However, she has different plans regarding Samet''s son from his first marriage, Cihan. The paths of Melek and Nuh, who are seeking to confront their mother, will unexpectedly cross with Cihan and his reluctant fiancée, Sevilay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bRscQAgNbHmLXMSznCBSQEc1vCw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:271014'),
  ('49854251456591518', 'Black Heart White Soul', 2014, 'Drama', null, null, 'Roger Kwok Chun-On, Kristal Tin Yui-Nei, Ron Ng Cheuk-Hai, Kiki Sheung, Louis Cheung, Waise Lee Chi-Hung, Jason Chan Chi-San, Mat Yeung', null, 'A robbery case subtly interweaves the fate of three strangers: a barrister in a wheelchair Matt Ko Chit-hang, a Hong Kong girl May Tam Mei-ching, and District Crime Unit detective Funny Cheung Lap-fan. Implicated by her gangster boyfriend, Mei-ching is charged with attempted robbery and is found guilty. Although Chit-hang, as the lawyer representing Mei-ching, fails to exculpate her from the charge, the two fall in love with each other. Gradually, under Chit-hang''s guidance, Mei-ching manages to turn over a new leaf after getting out of jail. Through his investigation, Lap-fan learns that, many years ago, he negligently shot and thereby paralyzed a civilian, who turns out to be Chit-hang...', 'A robbery case subtly interweaves the fate of three strangers: a barrister in a wheelchair Matt Ko Chit-hang, a Hong Kong girl May Tam Mei-ching, and District Crime Unit detective Funny Cheung Lap-fan. Implicated by her gangster boyfriend, Mei-ching is charged with attempted robbery and is found guilty. Although Chit-hang, as the lawyer representing Mei-ching, fails to exculpate her from the charge, the two fall in love with each other. Gradually, under Chit-hang''s guidance, Mei-ching manages to turn over a new leaf after getting out of jail. Through his investigation, Lap-fan learns that, many years ago, he negligently shot and thereby paralyzed a civilian, who turns out to be Chit-hang...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mr00rXTNX3SbaEb2BvBr3n4miWF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95462'),
  ('326209081747879183', 'Black Ink Crew Chicago', 2015, 'Reality', null, null, 'Donald Brumfield Jr.', 'TV-14', 'Follow the tattoo artists at 9Mag in Chicago as they band together to create new identities for themselves, their families, and their business.', 'Follow the tattoo artists at 9Mag in Chicago as they band together to create new identities for themselves, their families, and their business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/afKCDnjYzr8rkVzhrTq3bpMwRLo.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:64751'),
  ('749470503548108848', 'Black Ink Crew Compton', 2019, null, null, null, 'Katrina Jackson, Danny Kirkpatrick', null, 'Follow Danny “KP” Kirkpatrick and his crew at ''IAMCompton,'' the first-ever tattoo shop in Compton. Compton, known for its musical influence and iconic street art, is an artistic melting-pot ready for the newest tat crew to share their talent.', 'Follow Danny “KP” Kirkpatrick and his crew at ''IAMCompton,'' the first-ever tattoo shop in Compton. Compton, known for its musical influence and iconic street art, is an artistic melting-pot ready for the newest tat crew to share their talent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jyLwlwnqlzi740jZ3MQdPJiB0C.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:92421'),
  ('1106041804034268837', 'Black Ink Crew New York', 2013, 'Reality', null, null, 'Ceases Emmanuel', 'TV-14', 'Reality series chronicling the daily operations and staff drama at an African American-owned and operated tattoo shop in Harlem, New York.', 'Reality series chronicling the daily operations and staff drama at an African American-owned and operated tattoo shop in Harlem, New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hGjBqwaX6bjcGN29ESxlb0jv2QV.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:58796'),
  ('557032331205076168', 'Black Jack', 1993, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Akio Otsuka, Yuko Mizutani', null, 'Kuroo Hazama, also known as "Black Jack," is a legend in the medical world. Famous for being one of the best, as well as not having a license, Hazama and his assistant Pinoko save countless lives that other doctors cannot... for a price; an exorbitant price, in fact, which causes many to view the genius as greedy and heartless. Despite these claims, however, none can deny his skill and the lengths that he will go to treat his patients. This dark medical drama tells the story of the ominous and mysterious world of underground medicine as Black Jack risks his life to cure some of the most bizarre diseases imaginable, even if it means breaking every law in the process.', 'Kuroo Hazama, also known as "Black Jack," is a legend in the medical world. Famous for being one of the best, as well as not having a license, Hazama and his assistant Pinoko save countless lives that other doctors cannot... for a price; an exorbitant price, in fact, which causes many to view the genius as greedy and heartless. Despite these claims, however, none can deny his skill and the lengths that he will go to treat his patients. This dark medical drama tells the story of the ominous and mysterious world of underground medicine as Black Jack risks his life to cure some of the most bizarre diseases imaginable, even if it means breaking every law in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aveuKnsIiDhWVaC1X6qmafiSLUu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:30083'),
  ('978841206248469357', 'Black Jack', 2004, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Akio Otsuka, Yuko Mizutani, Mako Hyodo', 'TV-14', 'Black Jack is an "unregistered" doctor with a clouded, mysterious past. He works with his little assistant Pinoko (who has a massive crush on the doctor), dealing with medical cases not very well known, which can be strange, dangerous, or not known at all. But he is a genius, and can save almost any of his patients'' life (as long as they have the money for it, that is), and is known to many around the world, especially to those of medicine and science. He''s a man of science himself, and does not believe much until he has seen it, yet it is many times he is surprised by love and nature often overpowering the science he bases his life in.', 'Black Jack is an "unregistered" doctor with a clouded, mysterious past. He works with his little assistant Pinoko (who has a massive crush on the doctor), dealing with medical cases not very well known, which can be strange, dangerous, or not known at all. But he is a genius, and can save almost any of his patients'' life (as long as they have the money for it, that is), and is known to many around the world, especially to those of medicine and science. He''s a man of science himself, and does not believe much until he has seen it, yet it is many times he is surprised by love and nature often overpowering the science he bases his life in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2wN0WnOdlpPejL16nr74W2F9X2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:35868'),
  ('746190716792873993', 'Black Jesus', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Aaron McGruder', null, 'Gerald ''Slink'' Johnson, Kali Hawk, Corey Holcomb, John Witherspoon, Angela Elayne Gibbs, Dominique Witten', null, 'A TV series finds Jesus living in present day Compton, CA on a daily mission to spread love and kindness throughout the neighborhood with the help of his small but loyal group of downtrodden followers.', 'A TV series finds Jesus living in present day Compton, CA on a daily mission to spread love and kindness throughout the neighborhood with the help of his small but loyal group of downtrodden followers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4bc5xzWZZvUrbZD5oCQfvGz8Gak.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:61161'),
  ('242853356445162438', 'Black Knight', 2017, 'Drama', 'Kim In Young', 'Kim In Young', 'Kim Rae-won, Shin Sae-kyeong, Seo Ji-hye, Chang Mi-hee, Shin So-yul, Kim Hyun-joon, Han Ji-Sun, Park Sung-hoon', 'TV-14', 'A successful executive determined to do whatever it takes to protect the woman he loves, meets a travel agent, who may be linked to his past.', 'A successful executive determined to do whatever it takes to protect the woman he loves, meets a travel agent, who may be linked to his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dONaJyzTAG973ifDGX0StnWMrC4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75066'),
  ('10583715089934567', 'Black Knight', 2023, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Cho Ui-seok', 'Cho Ui-seok', 'Kim Woo-bin, Kang You-seok, Esom, Song Seung-heon, Kim Eui-sung, Nam Kyung-eup, Jin Kyung, Roh Yoon-seo', 'TV-MA', 'In a dystopian 2071 devastated by air pollution, the survival of humanity depends on the Black Knights — and they’re far from your average delivery men.', 'In a dystopian 2071 devastated by air pollution, the survival of humanity depends on the Black Knights — and they’re far from your average delivery men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ucz3ZboT2Sb12yum51Q4J8M0myb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137040'),
  ('764242622363093739', 'Black Lagoon', 2006, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Megumi Toyoguchi, Daisuke Namikawa, Tsutomu Isobe, Hiroaki Hirata', 'TV-MA', 'The story follows a team of pirate mercenaries known as the Lagoon Company, that smuggles goods in and around the seas of Southeast Asia in the early to mid 1990s. Their base of operations is located in the fictional harbor city of Roanapur in southeast Thailand near the border of Cambodia.', 'The story follows a team of pirate mercenaries known as the Lagoon Company, that smuggles goods in and around the seas of Southeast Asia in the early to mid 1990s. Their base of operations is located in the fictional harbor city of Roanapur in southeast Thailand near the border of Cambodia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQlHhWScg6qmakL1ywtcjjVKKqV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12598'),
  ('394050244580281576', 'Black Lagoon: Roberta''s Blood Trail', 2010, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Animation, Drama', 'Rei Hiroe', null, 'Megumi Toyoguchi, Daisuke Namikawa, Tsutomu Isobe, Hiroaki Hirata', 'TV-MA', 'The ''bloodhound'' awakens when her master, and head of the Lovelace family is assassinated.', 'The ''bloodhound'' awakens when her master, and head of the Lovelace family is assassinated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdLLOA72JDVs1pLeBN95rRQY91b.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:254198'),
  ('391399153986506808', 'Black Lake', 2016, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Ulf Kvensler, Jonathan Sjöberg, David Berron', null, 'Ester Uddén, Daniel Larsson, Anja Landgré, Bahar Pars, Hedda Stiernstedt, Filip Berg, Alida Morberg, André Eriksen', 'TV-MA', 'An unsettling chain of events are set into motion when a group of young friends an visit an abandoned ski resort in the far reaches of Sweden. The remote and neglected Black Lake has been closed for years when Johan invites his friends to stay there. He dreams of reopening the isolated hotel and restoring it to a luxury ski resort, but what begins as a fun research trip soon takes a sinister turn as the group is gripped by a series of unexplained and disturbing events. They soon uncover the real reason Black Lake was abandoned all those years before, and solving the mystery rapidly becomes a matter of life and death.', 'An unsettling chain of events are set into motion when a group of young friends an visit an abandoned ski resort in the far reaches of Sweden. The remote and neglected Black Lake has been closed for years when Johan invites his friends to stay there. He dreams of reopening the isolated hotel and restoring it to a luxury ski resort, but what begins as a fun research trip soon takes a sinister turn as the group is gripped by a series of unexplained and disturbing events. They soon uncover the real reason Black Lake was abandoned all those years before, and solving the mystery rapidly becomes a matter of life and death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q9UM8Ul0ZRmjfHyCJBIWvWxjmUK.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:68127'),
  ('376809688655238416', 'Black Lightning', 2018, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Salim Akil', null, 'Cress Williams, Nafessa Williams, Christine Adams, Marvin Jones III, James Remar, Chantal Thuy', 'TV-14', 'Jefferson Pierce is a man wrestling with a secret. As the father of two daughters and principal of a charter high school that also serves as a safe haven for young people in a New Orleans neighborhood overrun by gang violence, he is a hero to his community.', 'Jefferson Pierce is a man wrestling with a secret. As the father of two daughters and principal of a charter high school that also serves as a safe haven for young people in a New Orleans neighborhood overrun by gang violence, he is a hero to his community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h1xbvvO6oqchfLe6xh0yLNnQxeM.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:71663'),
  ('1100127670942064760', 'Black Midnight', 2008, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Dimitra Sakali, Vassilis Risvas', 'Vassilis Risvas, Dimitra Sakali', 'Stelios Mainas, Panagiota Vlanti, Bessy Malfa, Ersi Malikenzou, Youlika Skafida, Panagiotis Karmatis, Vassilis Risvas, Makis Papadimitriou', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ju0QDu0awInxGZs0Q3NOsn5Uwem.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:51267'),
  ('1102018186046462048', 'Black Mirror', 2011, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Mystery', 'Charlie Brooker', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Twisted tales run wild in this mind-bending anthology series that reveals humanity''s worst traits, greatest innovations and more.', 'Twisted tales run wild in this mind-bending anthology series that reveals humanity''s worst traits, greatest innovations and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/seN6rRfN0I6n8iDXjlSMk1QjNcq.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:42009'),
  ('641340223146551383', 'Black Monday', 2019, 'Comedy, Crime', 'David Caspe, Jordan Cahan', null, 'Don Cheadle, Andrew Rannells, Regina Hall, Paul Scheer, Casey Wilson', 'TV-MA', 'Travel back to October 19, 1987 – aka Black Monday, the worst stock market crash in Wall Street history – this is the story of how a group of outsiders took on the blue-blood, old-boys club of Wall Street and ended up crashing the world’s largest financial system, a Lamborghini limousine, Don Henley''s birthday party and the glass ceiling.', 'Travel back to October 19, 1987 – aka Black Monday, the worst stock market crash in Wall Street history – this is the story of how a group of outsiders took on the blue-blood, old-boys club of Wall Street and ended up crashing the world’s largest financial system, a Lamborghini limousine, Don Henley''s birthday party and the glass ceiling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yidvzRidnDDpLxAXpO7aLNXRsS8.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:80230'),
  ('717792920788954686', 'Black Money Love', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Sema Ergenekon, Eylem Canpolat', null, 'Engin Akyürek, Tuba Büyüküstün, Erkan Can, Saygın Soysal, Burak Tamdoğan, Bestemsu Özdemir, Elif İnci, Ali Yörenç', 'TV-MA', 'Ömer is a police officer. After the death of his fiancée, he suffers great pain. The body of Sibel, Ömer''s fiancée, was found on the top of a cliff, in a car next to a fairly old, rich business man. After the shock of her sudden death and the accusations of his love cheating on him, Ömer realizes that there is more behind her suspicious murder', 'Ömer is a police officer. After the death of his fiancée, he suffers great pain. The body of Sibel, Ömer''s fiancée, was found on the top of a cliff, in a car next to a fairly old, rich business man. After the shock of her sudden death and the accusations of his love cheating on him, Ömer realizes that there is more behind her suspicious murder', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ud39J949yldVdbmyLottd9E2VeW.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:60929'),
  ('1019133073898472867', 'Black Narcissus', 2020, 'Drama', null, null, 'Gemma Arterton, Alessandro Nivola, Aisling Franciosi, Diana Rigg, Jim Broadbent, Rosie Cavaliero, Karen Bryson, Patsy Ferran', 'TV-MA', 'Himalayas, 1934. A remote clifftop palace once known as the ‘House of Women’ holds many dark secrets. When the young nuns of St. Faith attempt to establish a mission there, its haunting mysteries awaken forbidden desires that seem destined to repeat a terrible tragedy. Adaptation of the 1939 novel by Rumer Godden.', 'Himalayas, 1934. A remote clifftop palace once known as the ‘House of Women’ holds many dark secrets. When the young nuns of St. Faith attempt to establish a mission there, its haunting mysteries awaken forbidden desires that seem destined to repeat a terrible tragedy. Adaptation of the 1939 novel by Rumer Godden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2N8V5ELOgoU34tbOOxkY7TJIdL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110344'),
  ('406888809699247787', 'Black Ops', 2023, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Gbemisola Ikumelo, Akemnji Ndifornyen', 'Joe Tucker, Lloyd Woolf', 'Hammed Animashaun, Akemnji Ndifornyen, Gbemisola Ikumelo, Robbie Gee, Jo Martin, Cathy Tyson, Tom Bell, Cavan Clerkin', null, 'Dom and Kay join the Met Police in the hope of cleaning up their community, but are unwittingly thrust into the murky world of deep cover infiltration as they become part of a powerful criminal enterprise. But for Dom and Kay it quickly becomes more of a fiasco than Donnie Brasco…', 'Dom and Kay join the Met Police in the hope of cleaning up their community, but are unwittingly thrust into the murky world of deep cover infiltration as they become part of a powerful criminal enterprise. But for Dom and Kay it quickly becomes more of a fiasco than Donnie Brasco…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iwYwUyBF7RVUQJNLzDOXjetcPZN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:155508'),
  ('1056678548381981460', 'Black Out', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Byun Young-joo', 'Seo Joo-yeon', 'Byun Yo-han, Go Joon, Go Bo-gyeol, Kim Bo-ra, Bae Jong-ok, Kwon Hae-hyo, Lee Ga-sub, Kong Jeong-hwan', 'TV-MA', 'Two 19 year old girls were brutally murdered. The bodies were abandoned and could not be found anywhere inside the warehouse scattered with blood. The only suspect, was their friend. He was drunk on the night of the incident. He doesn’t recall a single memory. No memories of committing a murder. No memories of not committing a murder either. The boy had become a young adult by the time he was released from prison in 11 years. He wished to pursue a quiet life… But another murder flips the village. A white bone carcass has been discovered. The real devil is hiding somewhere within the seemingly peaceful village. Who’s the real devil?', 'Two 19 year old girls were brutally murdered. The bodies were abandoned and could not be found anywhere inside the warehouse scattered with blood. The only suspect, was their friend. He was drunk on the night of the incident. He doesn’t recall a single memory. No memories of committing a murder. No memories of not committing a murder either. The boy had become a young adult by the time he was released from prison in 11 years. He wished to pursue a quiet life… But another murder flips the village. A white bone carcass has been discovered. The real devil is hiding somewhere within the seemingly peaceful village. Who’s the real devil?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qITIFCaAD594CTV2MdsOcYvfAoo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135658'),
  ('1038331156254605650', 'Black Panther', 2010, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', 'Reginald Hudlin', null, 'Djimon Hounsou, Kerry Washington, Alfre Woodard, Stephen Stanton, Jill Scott, Stan Lee, Phil Morris, Phil LaMarr', null, 'Deep in the heart of Africa lies Wakanda, an advanced and unconquerable civilization. A family of warrior kings possessing superior speed, strength and agility has governed this mysterious nation as long as time itself. The latest in this famed line is young King T’Challa, the great hero known worldwide as the Black Panther. Now, outsiders once again threaten to invade and plunder Wakanda.', 'Deep in the heart of Africa lies Wakanda, an advanced and unconquerable civilization. A family of warrior kings possessing superior speed, strength and agility has governed this mysterious nation as long as time itself. The latest in this famed line is young King T’Challa, the great hero known worldwide as the Black Panther. Now, outsiders once again threaten to invade and plunder Wakanda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/op1gn2mK4ohZfhpKj92KEbwvc9C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19757'),
  ('1136544116679625686', 'Black Pean', 2018, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Kazunari Ninomiya, Ryoma Takeuchi, Seiyo Uchino, Kotaro Koizumi, Shuri, Wakana Aoi, Satoshi Hashimoto, Haruka Uchimura', null, 'Seishiro Tokai (Kazunari Ninomiya) works as a surgeon at a university hospital. He possesses excellent technique with suture and carries a surgery success rate of 100%. Due to his arrogant attitude and personality, he comes into conflict with those around him. A new doctor tries to introduce the latest medical device for surgery, which doesn''t need a surgeon''s hand. Seishiro Tokai is skeptical of the device. He faces the university hospital administration and reveals corruption and hidden past behind the medical device.', 'Seishiro Tokai (Kazunari Ninomiya) works as a surgeon at a university hospital. He possesses excellent technique with suture and carries a surgery success rate of 100%. Due to his arrogant attitude and personality, he comes into conflict with those around him. A new doctor tries to introduce the latest medical device for surgery, which doesn''t need a surgeon''s hand. Seishiro Tokai is skeptical of the device. He faces the university hospital administration and reveals corruption and hidden past behind the medical device.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fK5YHEyF0AxN67pbZFwwPNf4luD.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:79289'),
  ('85643858526666451', 'Black Rabbit', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Zach Baylin, Kate Susman', null, 'Jason Bateman, Jude Law, Chris Coy, Troy Kotsur, Abbey Lee, Odessa Young, Robin de Jesús', 'TV-MA', 'A rising-star restaurateur is forced into New York''s criminal underworld when his chaotic brother returns to town with loan sharks on his trail.', 'A rising-star restaurateur is forced into New York''s criminal underworld when his chaotic brother returns to town with loan sharks on his trail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4e9CraVtGY00jLP2YGwsuEtaIjR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:249039'),
  ('604143317783005820', 'Black Rock Shooter', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Miyuki Sawashiro, Kana Asumi, Kana Hanazawa, Eri Kitamura, Mamiko Noto', 'TV-PG', 'On the first day of junior high school, Mato Kuroi happens to run into Yomi Takanashi, a shy, withdrawn girl whom she immediately takes an interest in. Mato tries her best to make conversation with Yomi, wanting to befriend her. At first, she is avoided, but the ice breaks when Yomi happens to notice a decorative blue bird attached to Mato''s phone, which is from the book "Li''l Birds At Play." Discovering they have a common interest, the two form a strong friendship. In an alternate universe, the young girls exist as parallel beings, Mato as Black★Rock Shooter, and Yomi as Dead Master. Somehow, what happens in one world seems to have an effect on the other, and unaware of this fact, the girls unknowingly become entangled by the threads of fate.', 'On the first day of junior high school, Mato Kuroi happens to run into Yomi Takanashi, a shy, withdrawn girl whom she immediately takes an interest in. Mato tries her best to make conversation with Yomi, wanting to befriend her. At first, she is avoided, but the ice breaks when Yomi happens to notice a decorative blue bird attached to Mato''s phone, which is from the book "Li''l Birds At Play." Discovering they have a common interest, the two form a strong friendship. In an alternate universe, the young girls exist as parallel beings, Mato as Black★Rock Shooter, and Yomi as Dead Master. Somehow, what happens in one world seems to have an effect on the other, and unaware of this fact, the girls unknowingly become entangled by the threads of fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dBC4N5XvfiJe5KkHT2uLycCrWcf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43079'),
  ('828313179338272347', 'Black Rock Shooter: Dawn Fall', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Yui Ishikawa, Saori Hayami, Megumi Han, Takuya Kirimoto, Ayaka Asai, Misaki Kuno, Tomokazu Sugita, Akane Tomonaga', 'TV-14', 'The year is 2062. Earth has been left in ruin after the failure of a labor automation project when the AI called Artemis waged war against humanity. A girl, Empress, awakens in a research lab. As one of the three surviving guardians, she must destroy the Orbital Elevator before Artemis can complete its construction. Failure will result in a machine army overrunning Earth.', 'The year is 2062. Earth has been left in ruin after the failure of a labor automation project when the AI called Artemis waged war against humanity. A girl, Empress, awakens in a research lab. As one of the three surviving guardians, she must destroy the Orbital Elevator before Artemis can complete its construction. Failure will result in a machine army overrunning Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fjwT6zU73MTptIkqta16dBKycGq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:133733'),
  ('325733023918010218', 'Black Rose', 2013, 'Family, Drama', 'Sema Ergenekon, Eylem Canpolat', 'Eylem Canpolat, Sema Ergenekon', 'Ece Uslu, Yavuz Bingöl, Özlem Conker, Mesut Akusta, Sebahat Kumaş, Ogün Kaptanoğlu, Hülya Duyar, Hilal Altınbilek', 'NR', 'A married women has to fight for the things she lost because of the revealed secrets of her husband.', 'A married women has to fight for the things she lost because of the revealed secrets of her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MGWHmUR0ezgQS5FQbjydG2nfLC.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:50236'),
  ('78494307084197162', 'Black Saddle', 1959, 'Western, Drama', 'Hal Hudson, John McGreevey', null, 'Peter Breck, Russell Johnson', null, 'Black Saddle is an American Western television series starring Peter Breck that aired 44 episodes on ABC from January 10, 1959 to May 6, 1960. The half-hour program was produced by Dick Powell''s Four Star Television, and the original pilot was an episode of CBS''s Dick Powell''s Zane Grey Theater, with Chris Alcaide portraying the principal character, Clay Culhane. For syndicated reruns, Black Saddle was combined with three other Western series from the same company, Law of the Plainsman starring Michael Ansara, Johnny Ringo starring Don Durant and Mark Goddard, and the critically acclaimed creation of Sam Peckinpah, The Westerner with Brian Keith, under the umbrella title, The Westerners, with new hosting sequences by Keenan Wynn.', 'Black Saddle is an American Western television series starring Peter Breck that aired 44 episodes on ABC from January 10, 1959 to May 6, 1960. The half-hour program was produced by Dick Powell''s Four Star Television, and the original pilot was an episode of CBS''s Dick Powell''s Zane Grey Theater, with Chris Alcaide portraying the principal character, Clay Culhane. For syndicated reruns, Black Saddle was combined with three other Western series from the same company, Law of the Plainsman starring Michael Ansara, Johnny Ringo starring Don Durant and Mark Goddard, and the critically acclaimed creation of Sam Peckinpah, The Westerner with Brian Keith, under the umbrella title, The Westerners, with new hosting sequences by Keenan Wynn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yxNU8FYaVt17ldbNzDJSrVTvL2t.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:13815'),
  ('869396715932964946', 'Black Sails', 2014, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Robert Levine, Jonathan E. Steinberg', null, 'Toby Stephens, Luke Arnold, Hannah New, Jessica Parker Kennedy, Toby Schmitz, Tom Hopper, Clara Paget, Ray Stevenson', 'TV-MA', 'The pirate adventures of Captain Flint and his men twenty years prior to Robert Louis Stevenson’s classic “Treasure Island.” Flint, the most brilliant and most feared pirate captain of his day, takes on a fast-talking young addition to his crew who goes by the name John Silver. Threatened with extinction on all sides, they fight for the survival of New Providence Island, the most notorious criminal haven of its day – a debauched paradise teeming with pirates, prostitutes, thieves and fortune seekers, a place defined by both its enlightened ideals and its stunning brutality.', 'The pirate adventures of Captain Flint and his men twenty years prior to Robert Louis Stevenson’s classic “Treasure Island.” Flint, the most brilliant and most feared pirate captain of his day, takes on a fast-talking young addition to his crew who goes by the name John Silver. Threatened with extinction on all sides, they fight for the survival of New Providence Island, the most notorious criminal haven of its day – a debauched paradise teeming with pirates, prostitutes, thieves and fortune seekers, a place defined by both its enlightened ideals and its stunning brutality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZcSwrDdw6cdOVgXm496DgwrQcQ.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:47665'),
  ('390250630592139163', 'Black Sands', 2021, 'Crime, Drama', 'Aldís Amah Hamilton, Ragnar Jónsson, Andri Óttarsson', null, 'Aldís Amah Hamilton, Kolbeinn Arnbjörnsson, Steinunn Ólína Þorsteinsdóttir, Ævar Þór Benediktsson, Lára Jóhanna Jónsdóttir, Aron Már Ólafsson, Aðalbjörg Emma Hafsteinsdóttir, Sólveig Arnarsdóttir', null, 'A troubled police officer is forced back to her hometown. Confronting her abusive mother is inescapable but the discovery of a body changes everything. She''s forced to search for a dangerous serial killer while stuck in a dark pit.', 'A troubled police officer is forced back to her hometown. Confronting her abusive mother is inescapable but the discovery of a body changes everything. She''s forced to search for a dangerous serial killer while stuck in a dark pit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBX7E6L2anSSfORhcMEJb5lj8Y9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:133485'),
  ('244581889102821625', 'Black Snow', 2023, 'Crime', 'Lucas Taylor', null, 'Travis Fimmel, Jana McKinnon, Megan Smart, Dan Spielman, Victoria Haralabidou, Benedict Samuel, Vinnie Bennett, Amali Golden', 'TV-MA', 'Unsolved murders, missing people, cold cases. How do you cope with not knowing what happened? Detective James Cormack (Travis Fimmel) is focused on solving cold-case mysteries. At the same time, he’s haunted by his personal quest to find his younger brother, who vanished when they were children.', 'Unsolved murders, missing people, cold cases. How do you cope with not knowing what happened? Detective James Cormack (Travis Fimmel) is focused on solving cold-case mysteries. At the same time, he’s haunted by his personal quest to find his younger brother, who vanished when they were children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8cYzv4vR2u4IA8rx7yk0r8P8uIp.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:210178'),
  ('844043032609364550', 'Black Space', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', 'Anat Gafni, Sahar Shavit', null, 'Guri Alfi, Reut Alush, Moris Cohen, Naya Bienstock, Omer Nudelman, Noa Astanjelove, Yoram Toledano, Ido Tako', null, 'A rogue detective with unorthodox means leads an investigation into a massacre committed by unicorn mask-wearing assassins at an Israeli high school.', 'A rogue detective with unorthodox means leads an investigation into a massacre committed by unicorn mask-wearing assassins at an Israeli high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lr1nls8ybKrMUxrggIULMNafNTm.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:116569'),
  ('218340000308468414', 'Black Spot', 2017, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Mathieu Missoffe', 'Florent Meyer, Mathieu Missoffe, Antonin Martin-Hilbert', 'Laurent Capelluto, Renaud Rutten, Hubert Delattre, Suliane Brahim, Camille Aguilar, Tiphaine Daviot, Naidra Ayadi, Samuel Jouy', 'TV-MA', 'In the small bordertown of Villefranche, lost in the heart of a large forest, crime rate is six times higher than elsewhere in the area. Each new crime Major Laurène Weiss solves with the help of her unusual team makes her sink deeper and deeper into secrets of the area.', 'In the small bordertown of Villefranche, lost in the heart of a large forest, crime rate is six times higher than elsewhere in the area. Each new crime Major Laurène Weiss solves with the help of her unusual team makes her sink deeper and deeper into secrets of the area.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/24YXi0GA3DsrPBe7ttw8XVV3uL7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:70613'),
  ('978089156943692724', 'Black Summer', 2019, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Karl Schaefer, John Hyams', null, 'Jaime King, Christine Lee, Zoe Marlett', 'TV-MA', 'In the dark, early days of a zombie apocalypse, complete strangers band together to find the strength they need to survive and get back to loved ones.', 'In the dark, early days of a zombie apocalypse, complete strangers band together to find the strength they need to survive and get back to loved ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d27fZpY8jSZDOs1k0JCL0RY0b94.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:88052'),
  ('811737911700967955', 'Black Summoner', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Koki Uchiyama, Manaka Iwami, Reina Ueda, Randhi, Yosuke Akimoto, Minori Suzuki, Yume Miyamoto, Konomi Inagaki', 'TV-14', 'Waking up in a strange new place with no memory of his past life, Kelvin learns that he''s bartered away those very memories in exchange for powerful new abilities during his recent transmigration. Heading out into a whole new world as a Summoner — with his first Follower being the very goddess who brought him over! — Kelvin begins his new life as an adventurer, and it isn''t long before he discovers his hidden disposition as a battle junkie. From the Black Knight of the Ancient Castle of Evil Spirits to the demon within the Hidden Cave of the Sage, he revels in the fight against one formidable foe after another. Join this OP adventurer in an exhilarating and epic saga as he and his allies carve their way into the annals of history!', 'Waking up in a strange new place with no memory of his past life, Kelvin learns that he''s bartered away those very memories in exchange for powerful new abilities during his recent transmigration. Heading out into a whole new world as a Summoner — with his first Follower being the very goddess who brought him over! — Kelvin begins his new life as an adventurer, and it isn''t long before he discovers his hidden disposition as a battle junkie. From the Black Knight of the Ancient Castle of Evil Spirits to the demon within the Hidden Cave of the Sage, he revels in the fight against one formidable foe after another. Join this OP adventurer in an exhilarating and epic saga as he and his allies carve their way into the annals of history!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/otO9fEZRVa5GRGswglYXXmcSnWF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157842'),
  ('378035815321374988', 'Black Sun', 2024, 'Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Yuriy Chursin, Maksim Stoyanov, Yuri Belyayev, Evgeny Kharitonov, Marina Petrenko, Александра Большакова, Phillip Azarov, Mikhail Safronov', null, 'Investigator Igor Zhuk arrives at his new duty station in Vyborg, but fate does not let him go. When the disfigured body of a young girl is found in the nearby forest, he realizes that he has already seen a similar case. The brutal murder has something to do with the fate of his dead wife, and Igor decides to find the perpetrators by all means. He teams up with police Captain Chagin, a talented detective who is used to acting not according to the rules, but according to justice.', 'Investigator Igor Zhuk arrives at his new duty station in Vyborg, but fate does not let him go. When the disfigured body of a young girl is found in the nearby forest, he realizes that he has already seen a similar case. The brutal murder has something to do with the fate of his dead wife, and Igor decides to find the perpetrators by all means. He teams up with police Captain Chagin, a talented detective who is used to acting not according to the rules, but according to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bIm2pwAbglAMBolGRXiwY3nmIes.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:248526'),
  ('618362651800501967', 'Black Warrant', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Vikramaditya Motwane, Satyanshu Singh', 'Satyanshu Singh, Arkesh Ajay', 'Zahan Kapoor, Rahul Bhat, Paramvir Singh Cheema, Anurag Thakur, Rajshri Deshpande, Rajendra Gupta, Sidhant Gupta, Tota Roy Chowdhury', 'TV-MA', 'When an upright officer accepts a job at Tihar Jail, he vows to make amends after witnessing cold-blooded corruption within its walls.', 'When an upright officer accepts a job at Tihar Jail, he vows to make amends after witnessing cold-blooded corruption within its walls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6Gs1IzzPJsmXKdc9alGaxtChQu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:279339'),
  ('277028474729812871', 'Black Widows: Wh*res & Hustlers', 2025, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Malena Pichot', null, 'Malena Pichot, Pilar Gamboa, Maria Fernanda Callejón, Mónica Antonópulos, Minerva Casero, Agustina Tremari, Paula Grinszpan, Alan Sabbagh', null, 'A former pair of thieves must dust off their old seduction tricks when blackmail threatens to expose their dirty laundry.', 'A former pair of thieves must dust off their old seduction tricks when blackmail threatens to expose their dirty laundry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h71jvjjaJOzYeOCMJutkMh3TbhO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:294972'),
  ('1032969960363342710', 'Black Work', 2015, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Tom Mullens', null, 'Sheridan Smith, Matthew McNulty, Douglas Henshall, James Foster, Sharon Duce, Geraldine James, Kenny Doughty, Andrew Knott', null, '''Black Work'' is the story of Jo Gillespie, a woman who''s husband is shot dead in the line of action, in his job as a undercover cop. Jo, a police officer herself soon has to confront issues in her marriage and family life in order to discover who really killed her husband.', '''Black Work'' is the story of Jo Gillespie, a woman who''s husband is shot dead in the line of action, in his job as a undercover cop. Jo, a police officer herself soon has to confront issues in her marriage and family life in order to discover who really killed her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jOWg5kZJ2z0mMz1NwengsRXrChP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62504'),
  ('623610869944162069', 'black-ish', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Kenya Barris', null, 'Anthony Anderson, Tracee Ellis Ross, Marcus Scribner, Marsai Martin, Miles Brown, Jenifer Lewis, Deon Cole, Peter MacKenzie', 'TV-14', 'A family man struggles to gain a sense of cultural identity while raising his kids in a predominantly white, upper-middle-class neighborhood.', 'A family man struggles to gain a sense of cultural identity while raising his kids in a predominantly white, upper-middle-class neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ga1zJ6UejPIfyL8BA22pK6dqsC8.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:61381'),
  ('457231130481830121', 'Black-out', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', null, 'Bas Adriaensen, Geert Verbanck, Philippe De Schepper', 'Sara De Roo, Geert Van Rampelberg, Anna De Ceulaer, Tom van Bauwel, Lucas Van den Eynde, Nora Gharib, Michaël Pas, Matthieu Sys', null, 'When a nuclear plant is sabotaged, the power grid in Belgium crashes. Prime Minister Annemie Hillebrand is forced to prolong the blackout, otherwise her daughter -who has been kidnapped- will die. Can Michael Dendoncker of the counter terrorism unit, rescue the girl in a country that''s off the grid.', 'When a nuclear plant is sabotaged, the power grid in Belgium crashes. Prime Minister Annemie Hillebrand is forced to prolong the blackout, otherwise her daughter -who has been kidnapped- will die. Can Michael Dendoncker of the counter terrorism unit, rescue the girl in a country that''s off the grid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NhZ2ZEewjwACuvCqiKiUAoYHZY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100013'),
  ('284703796721679157', 'Blackadder', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Richard Curtis, Rowan Atkinson, Ben Elton', 'Ben Elton, Richard Curtis', 'Rowan Atkinson, Tony Robinson, Hugh Laurie, Tim McInnerny, Stephen Fry', 'TV-PG', 'Blackadder traces the deeply cynical and self-serving lineage of various Edmund Blackadders throughout British history, from the muck of the Middle Ages to the frontline of The Great War.', 'Blackadder traces the deeply cynical and self-serving lineage of various Edmund Blackadders throughout British history, from the muck of the Middle Ages to the frontline of The Great War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3rXOeklqhZ7BTBveW5WLJqyjgU.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:7246'),
  ('413921623616256151', 'Blackbeard', 2006, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Kevin Connor, Bryce Zabel', 'Bryce Zabel', 'Angus Macfadyen, Mark Umbers, Richard Chamberlain, Jessica Chastain, Stacy Keach, Rachel Ward, Anthony Green, Danny Midwinter', null, 'Bristol, England, 1717. Lieutenant Robert Maynard of the Royal Navy scouts the seas in order to restore safe passage to the sea lanes. He meets his match when he''s taken by a fearsome hulk of a menace in the West Indies—a pirate sailing off the Island of St. Vincent. Edward Teach has no plans for retirement. In fact, his goal-to find and lay claim to the fabled treasures of Captain Kidd.', 'Bristol, England, 1717. Lieutenant Robert Maynard of the Royal Navy scouts the seas in order to restore safe passage to the sea lanes. He meets his match when he''s taken by a fearsome hulk of a menace in the West Indies—a pirate sailing off the Island of St. Vincent. Edward Teach has no plans for retirement. In fact, his goal-to find and lay claim to the fabled treasures of Captain Kidd.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pK5Lh2BW9Yx4NCg4hPFfzqCsyIO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72954'),
  ('157382207862045779', 'Blacklist', 2019, 'Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Korapat Kirdpan, Wachirawit Ruangwiwat, Pawat Chittsawangdee, Sattabut Laedeke, Kanaphan Puitrakul, Thanatsaran Samthonglai, Sureeyares Yakares, Preeti Barameeanant', null, 'Akeanan is an outstanding school in all aspects: education, sports… and secrets. Traffic comes to Akeanan to look for his sister Fah, who disappeared months prior and with neither the police nor the school finding any trace of her. In the course of his investigation, Traffic finds himself in Room 4/6 and meets the outsiders of the class: bad boy Andrew, the quiet Highlight, the strong and powerful Title, friendly and playful Jim Bae, and the academic genius Buntad. Traffic gets an invitation from their teacher to join this group of boys, the secret shadow society known as Blacklist, dedicated to investigating the mysterious occurrences in their school. Together, Blacklist will find out not just what happened to Fah but will also slowly uncover the deep dark secrets of Akeanan School.', 'Akeanan is an outstanding school in all aspects: education, sports… and secrets. Traffic comes to Akeanan to look for his sister Fah, who disappeared months prior and with neither the police nor the school finding any trace of her. In the course of his investigation, Traffic finds himself in Room 4/6 and meets the outsiders of the class: bad boy Andrew, the quiet Highlight, the strong and powerful Title, friendly and playful Jim Bae, and the academic genius Buntad. Traffic gets an invitation from their teacher to join this group of boys, the secret shadow society known as Blacklist, dedicated to investigating the mysterious occurrences in their school. Together, Blacklist will find out not just what happened to Fah but will also slowly uncover the deep dark secrets of Akeanan School.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yxNA06bLLoyDY6Tt5ngRPTfwGle.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95845'),
  ('703862824241517171', 'Blackout', 2012, 'Drama', null, 'Bill Gallagher', 'Christopher Eccleston, MyAnna Buring, Ewen Bremner, Dervla Kirwan, Andrew Scott, Olivia Cooke', 'TV-14', 'Daniel Demoys has gone from being an idealistic young man with a burning desire to make the world a better place, to a disillusioned and corrupt council official. His alcoholism has driven a wedge between him and his family. When Daniel wakes up after another drunken night, he realizes that he might be responsible for a murder. A dramatic act of redemption buys him public adoration, so much so that he has become a candidate in the race for Mayor, but as his public star rises ever higher and he tries to repair the damage done to his private life, he is painfully aware that it could all come crashing down at any moment.', 'Daniel Demoys has gone from being an idealistic young man with a burning desire to make the world a better place, to a disillusioned and corrupt council official. His alcoholism has driven a wedge between him and his family. When Daniel wakes up after another drunken night, he realizes that he might be responsible for a murder. A dramatic act of redemption buys him public adoration, so much so that he has become a candidate in the race for Mayor, but as his public star rises ever higher and he tries to repair the damage done to his private life, he is painfully aware that it could all come crashing down at any moment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZgVzKf2JPocAZQY2tV95OeABSA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44140'),
  ('796005541522158747', 'Blackout: Tomorrow Is Too Late', 2021, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Marc Elsberg', 'Kai-Uwe Hasenheit, Lancelot von Naso', 'Moritz Bleibtreu, Milena Dreißig, Heiner Lauterbach, Stephan Kampwirth, Herbert Knaup, Jessica Schwarz, Caroline Hartig, Anselm Bresgott', 'TV-MA', 'A chain reaction in the European power grid plunges the continent into darkness. Hacker Pierre Manzano realizes that a code he wrote is to blame. In Germany Frauke Michelsen heads the country’s crisis response team. Disaster looms.', 'A chain reaction in the European power grid plunges the continent into darkness. Hacker Pierre Manzano realizes that a code he wrote is to blame. In Germany Frauke Michelsen heads the country’s crisis response team. Disaster looms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8MmY9PpeChgrvUYb3n2L37oqLI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:136365'),
  ('93109608071096151', 'Blackpool', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Peter Bowker', 'Julie Anne Robinson', 'David Morrissey, Georgia Taylor, David Tennant, Sarah Parish, Steve Pemberton, Thomas Morrison, Bryan Dick, David Bradley', null, 'Ripley Holden is a small-time entrepreneur desperate to make it big with his new state-of-the-art amusement arcade. The opening extravaganza is overshadowed by the find of a dead body on the premises. DI Carlisle is called in and quickly finds he has more on his mind than murder, when he falls in love with Ripley''s long-suffering wife.', 'Ripley Holden is a small-time entrepreneur desperate to make it big with his new state-of-the-art amusement arcade. The opening extravaganza is overshadowed by the find of a dead body on the premises. DI Carlisle is called in and quickly finds he has more on his mind than murder, when he falls in love with Ripley''s long-suffering wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTfqEIqtMbehNWXliWXmu4Ki1E1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1023'),
  ('427091960085530651', 'Blackport', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', 'Gísli Örn Garðarsson, Björn Hlynur Haraldsson, Nína Dögg Filippusdóttir', 'Mikael Torfason, Gísli Örn Garðarsson, Björn Hlynur Haraldsson', 'Nína Dögg Filippusdóttir, Gísli Örn Garðarsson, Björn Hlynur Haraldsson, Guðjón Davíð Karlsson, Unnur Ösp Stefánsdóttir, Anna Svava Knútsdóttir, Kristín Þóra Haraldsdóttir, Selma Björnsdóttir', null, 'Follows a young married couple who see their livelihoods threatened when the government starts enforcing restrictive fishing quotas after they build a small fishing empire in a village.', 'Follows a young married couple who see their livelihoods threatened when the government starts enforcing restrictive fishing quotas after they build a small fishing empire in a village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUWftMIimlzLNagVtdEVSHmvRc4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:136787'),
  ('87932457481164132', 'Blackshore', 2024, 'Crime, Drama', 'Dathaí Keane, Kate O''Riordan', null, 'Lisa Dwan, Rory Keenan, Amy De Bhrún, Aidan McArdle, Stanley Townsend, Andrew Bennett, Lisa Dwyer Hogg, Jade Jordan', null, 'A police detective returns to her hometown and becomes involved in a missing person case, which is linked to her traumatic past and the town''s dark history.', 'A police detective returns to her hometown and becomes involved in a missing person case, which is linked to her traumatic past and the town''s dark history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wK8yhGy6aAbBeqCgv4GHzf5REiy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:245547'),
  ('794236544815469256', 'Blackstar', 1981, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Norm Prescott, Lou Scheimer', null, 'George DiCenzo, Alan Oppenheimer, Frank Welker, Linda Gary, Patrick Pinney', null, 'Blackstar is an American animated television series, a science fantasy story sometimes reported as being inspired by Thundarr the Barbarian. It was produced in 1981 by Lou Scheimer and Norm Prescott for Filmation. The series was Filmation''s second fantasy epic, the first being tucked in as a segment of Tarzan and Tarzan and the Super 7, The Freedom Force. Blackstar has many notable similarities to He-Man and the Masters of the Universe, which was produced shortly afterwards.', 'Blackstar is an American animated television series, a science fantasy story sometimes reported as being inspired by Thundarr the Barbarian. It was produced in 1981 by Lou Scheimer and Norm Prescott for Filmation. The series was Filmation''s second fantasy epic, the first being tucked in as a segment of Tarzan and Tarzan and the Super 7, The Freedom Force. Blackstar has many notable similarities to He-Man and the Masters of the Universe, which was produced shortly afterwards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujWNJd0ckjohwNrUsHM0tuBNZj8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12140'),
  ('353358442307818334', 'Blackwater', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Kerstin Ekman', 'Kerstin Ekman, Maren Louise Käehne, Karin Arrhenius', 'Asta Kamma August, Pernilla August, Rolf Lassgård, Sven Boräng, Alba August, Alva Adermark, Liam Gabrielsson Lövbrand, Erik Ehn', null, 'Set in the 1970s, Blackwater tells the story of how four random people''s lives converge after two tourists are found murdered in a tent near the Swedish mountain town of Blackwater.', 'Set in the 1970s, Blackwater tells the story of how four random people''s lives converge after two tourists are found murdered in a tent near the Swedish mountain town of Blackwater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sePPXfvn7ihTzS9hDN5EjwuzsCt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218131'),
  ('564957820953657531', 'Blade', 2011, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Akio Otsuka, Maaya Sakamoto, Tsutomu Isobe, Osamu Saka', 'TV-14', 'Legendary half-vampire, half-human vampire hunter Blade is tracking Deacon Frost, a very powerful and influential vampire who killed his mother and who heads Existence, a secretive vampire organization that operates in Southeast Asia.', 'Legendary half-vampire, half-human vampire hunter Blade is tracking Deacon Frost, a very powerful and influential vampire who killed his mother and who heads Existence, a secretive vampire organization that operates in Southeast Asia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ql9YpFD8J1zeWzLMHHjp4nKKD4n.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62798'),
  ('538583584568334519', 'Blade and Soul', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuki Takao, Ayahi Takagaki, Sayaka Ohara, Aoi Yuuki, Sora Amamiya, Marina Inoue, Ryoko Shiraishi, Shizuka Itoh', 'TV-MA', 'Alka is an assassin for the Clan of the Sword. She''s on a journey to find the woman Jin Valel, who killed her master Hon. Jin is demon-like woman who controls the Energy of Chaos and kills without feeling - not unlike how Alka has learned to kill in her work as an assassin. On her journey, Alka encounters three strange women, each great warriors in their own right, and grapples with her slain master''s wish that she leave the life of an assassin behind.', 'Alka is an assassin for the Clan of the Sword. She''s on a journey to find the woman Jin Valel, who killed her master Hon. Jin is demon-like woman who controls the Energy of Chaos and kills without feeling - not unlike how Alka has learned to kill in her work as an assassin. On her journey, Alka encounters three strange women, each great warriors in their own right, and grapples with her slain master''s wish that she leave the life of an assassin behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aheo8qBUXTFSppHdgkZfc7fIovB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60814'),
  ('429323392644199860', 'Blade Dance of Elementalers', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Hanpen Sakura', null, 'Makoto Furukawa, Ibuki Kido, Saori Onishi, Shizuka Ishigami, Kana Yuuki, Ai Kakuma, Yoko Hikasa, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', 'TV-14', 'Only a pure maiden can have the privilege to contract with a spirit. Priestesses, who can summon spirits from Astral Zero, the world of spirits, and have full command of their power, are called elementalists. Kamito Kazehaya is the only male with this privilege, and due to what happened in the past he comes to Areisha Spirit Academy where priestesses are trained to become elementalists. He is then told that he is to transfer to the school, form a team with priestesses to compete in Blade Dance where the most powerful elementalist is chosen, and win.', 'Only a pure maiden can have the privilege to contract with a spirit. Priestesses, who can summon spirits from Astral Zero, the world of spirits, and have full command of their power, are called elementalists. Kamito Kazehaya is the only male with this privilege, and due to what happened in the past he comes to Areisha Spirit Academy where priestesses are trained to become elementalists. He is then told that he is to transfer to the school, form a team with priestesses to compete in Blade Dance where the most powerful elementalist is chosen, and win.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wAzDvjpbFA29gIYlMibFUFqx4c3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61287'),
  ('112827994188392337', 'Blade Heart', 2004, null, null, null, 'Adam Cheng Siu-Chow, Liza Wong Ming-Chuen, Raymond Lam Fung, Shirley Yeung Sze-Kei, Yang Xue, Chen Hung-Lieh, Lo Hoi-Pang, Steve Lee Ka-Ting', null, 'The Szema family murdered the Tong family in order to monopolize the weapons industry. Twenty years later, the chief of Brocade Guards, YUEMAN FUNG (CHENG SIU CHOW, ADAM), fights against MRS. WONG (WANG MING CHUN, LIZA) of the biggest escort carrier in town. During the fight, they realize they might know each other… FUNG has changed his name, put on an eye patch and become a Brocade Guard. His wife, TONG PIK, has married WONG. They live with humiliation while they wait for the day of revenge. However, they both are in situations where they can’t reveal their identities. PIK hires MANG LUI (LAM RAYMOND) as a fighter. He falls in love with PIK’s daughter YEE (YEUNG SZE KI, SHIRLEY). Ironically, LUI is PIK’s son, whom she lost many years ago, and so love between the two is impossible. How can love and hatred end between two generations?', 'The Szema family murdered the Tong family in order to monopolize the weapons industry. Twenty years later, the chief of Brocade Guards, YUEMAN FUNG (CHENG SIU CHOW, ADAM), fights against MRS. WONG (WANG MING CHUN, LIZA) of the biggest escort carrier in town. During the fight, they realize they might know each other… FUNG has changed his name, put on an eye patch and become a Brocade Guard. His wife, TONG PIK, has married WONG. They live with humiliation while they wait for the day of revenge. However, they both are in situations where they can’t reveal their identities. PIK hires MANG LUI (LAM RAYMOND) as a fighter. He falls in love with PIK’s daughter YEE (YEUNG SZE KI, SHIRLEY). Ironically, LUI is PIK’s son, whom she lost many years ago, and so love between the two is impossible. How can love and hatred end between two generations?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8pqN2GzWnh2jiqeefB1IoWLLcNd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109215'),
  ('884231615035555233', 'Blade Man', 2014, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Kim Kyu-wan', 'Kim Gyu-wan', 'Lee Dong-wook, Shin Sae-kyeong, Kim Kap-soo, Han Jung-soo, Jung Yoo Geun, Shin Seung-hwan, Jung Jin, Lee Mi-sook', 'TV-14', 'Hong Bin might''ve been oppressed by love and his father. However, he comes across his first love again.', 'Hong Bin might''ve been oppressed by love and his father. However, he comes across his first love again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pRt6yU9zAJfzc9VhARcmn8tIFNl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61739'),
  ('181863287180993907', 'Blade of the Immortal', 2008, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Rina Sato, Tomokazu Seki, Daisuke Namikawa, Hirofumi Nojima, Katsuyuki Konishi, Kazuya Nakai, Mamiko Noto, Masashi Ebara', null, 'Manji is a crass, violent samurai with a special ability: he cannot die. Cursed with immortality by the nun Yobikuni as punishment for his ruthless deeds, he has grown weary of his ageless life. The only way to lift the curse is to slay 1,000 evil men. So Manji wanders Japan, shedding the blood of the wicked on his quest to finally die.', 'Manji is a crass, violent samurai with a special ability: he cannot die. Cursed with immortality by the nun Yobikuni as punishment for his ruthless deeds, he has grown weary of his ageless life. The only way to lift the curse is to slay 1,000 evil men. So Manji wanders Japan, shedding the blood of the wicked on his quest to finally die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ufo6y5FUdhUOXc97zZhpvmcQLRP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34697'),
  ('933715902294222117', 'Blade of the Immortal', 2019, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Houko Kuwashima, Ayane Sakura, Kenjiro Tsuda, Ako Mayama, Nozomu Sasaki, Shinya Fukumatsu, Masato Obara, Chikahiro Kobayashi', 'TV-MA', 'Manji is a crass, violent samurai with a special ability: he cannot die. Cursed with immortality by the nun Yobikuni as punishment for his ruthless deeds, he has grown weary of his ageless life. The only way to lift the curse is to slay 1,000 evil men. So Manji wanders Japan, shedding the blood of the wicked on his quest to finally die.', 'Manji is a crass, violent samurai with a special ability: he cannot die. Cursed with immortality by the nun Yobikuni as punishment for his ruthless deeds, he has grown weary of his ageless life. The only way to lift the curse is to slay 1,000 evil men. So Manji wanders Japan, shedding the blood of the wicked on his quest to finally die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qVCqyoLFIMMpB3dJxsEW4aHIxzO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92090'),
  ('726177428567692603', 'Blade Runner: Black Lotus', 2021, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Shinji Aramaki, Kenji Kamiyama', null, 'Jessica Henwick, Will Yun Lee, Wes Bentley, Samira Wiley', 'TV-14', 'Los Angeles 2032. A young woman wakes up with no memories, and possessing deadly skills. The only clues to her mystery are a locked data device and a tattoo of a black lotus. Putting together the pieces, she must hunt down the people responsible for her brutal and bloody past to find the truth of her lost identity.', 'Los Angeles 2032. A young woman wakes up with no memories, and possessing deadly skills. The only clues to her mystery are a locked data device and a tattoo of a black lotus. Putting together the pieces, she must hunt down the people responsible for her brutal and bloody past to find the truth of her lost identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aR06SJRDGqRmGQYXAXqeOkRZq7T.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84553'),
  ('915107371256701387', 'Blade: The Series', 2006, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Mystery', 'David S. Goyer', null, 'Sticky Fingaz, Jill Wagner, Nelson Lee, Jessica Gower, Neil Jackson', 'TV-14', 'Blade is a half-man, half-vampire who employs his extraordinary powers in a crusade to save mankind from the demonic creatures who walk the night. Set in Detroit, Blade investigates the vampire house of Chthon. Along the way he forms an uneasy alliance with Krista Starr, a former military veteran who becomes entrenched in the world of vampires while investigating the murder of her twin brother.', 'Blade is a half-man, half-vampire who employs his extraordinary powers in a crusade to save mankind from the demonic creatures who walk the night. Set in Detroit, Blade investigates the vampire house of Chthon. Along the way he forms an uneasy alliance with Krista Starr, a former military veteran who becomes entrenched in the world of vampires while investigating the murder of her twin brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xthJ8MoYaJROntPHaI5mUrXd4Qs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4619'),
  ('38542445075427896', 'Blades of the Guardians', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Xu Xianzhe', null, 'Liu Beichen, Wan Qian, Zhao Qianjing, Wang Xiaobing, Yan Ning, Huang Xiangyu, Li Chanfei, Sanshi', null, 'A extraordinary guard walks in the desert of the Western regions. On the way escaping the killing by the government, he took a guarding task with destination to the capital Chang ''an. The task was thought as just a simple one, but actually it is a road full of crisis and danger. A journey affecting the fate of the world begins......', 'A extraordinary guard walks in the desert of the Western regions. On the way escaping the killing by the government, he took a guarding task with destination to the capital Chang ''an. The task was thought as just a simple one, but actually it is a road full of crisis and danger. A journey affecting the fate of the world begins......', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ck4VbauqthkMldF661byC693ify.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107463'),
  ('866989574514180403', 'Blake''s 7', 1978, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Terry Nation', null, 'Josette Simon, Michael Keating, Paul Darrow, Peter Tuddenham, Steven Pacey, Glynis Barber', null, 'A group of convicts and outcasts fight a guerrilla war against the totalitarian Terran Federation from a highly advanced alien spaceship.', 'A group of convicts and outcasts fight a guerrilla war against the totalitarian Terran Federation from a highly advanced alien spaceship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Q0hgpABuPQrH0RjvQfneEcMz6S.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1731'),
  ('238155473882700568', 'Blanca', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, null, null, 'Blanca Ferrando is a young woman who became blind at the age of twelve, due to a dramatic fire in which her older sister Beatrice died and which was caused by her violent boyfriend, Sebastian. This tragedy made her develop a very strong sense of justice to the point of pushing her to join the police. Blanca is helped by her most trusted friends: her guide dog Linneo, a female bulldog who protects and comforts her in the most difficult moments, and her beautician friend, Stella. After overcoming her work challenges, she finds herself facing sentimental ones: torn between two men, Inspector Michele Liguori, a man of many secrets, and Nanni, a young cook.', 'Blanca Ferrando is a young woman who became blind at the age of twelve, due to a dramatic fire in which her older sister Beatrice died and which was caused by her violent boyfriend, Sebastian. This tragedy made her develop a very strong sense of justice to the point of pushing her to join the police. Blanca is helped by her most trusted friends: her guide dog Linneo, a female bulldog who protects and comforts her in the most difficult moments, and her beautician friend, Stella. After overcoming her work challenges, she finds herself facing sentimental ones: torn between two men, Inspector Michele Liguori, a man of many secrets, and Nanni, a young cook.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ygLft4UvzyeMUZegHNwcCKo7TgG.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:139309'),
  ('988203956029870106', 'Blandings', 2013, 'Comedy', 'P.G. Wodehouse', 'Guy Andrews', 'Timothy Spall, Jennifer Saunders, Jack Farthing, Tim Vine', null, 'Blandings is a British comedy television series adapted by Guy Andrews from the Blandings Castle stories of P.G. Wodehouse. It was first broadcast on BBC One from 13 January 2013, and stars Timothy Spall, Jennifer Saunders and Mark Williams. The series was produced with the partial financial assistance of the European Regional Development Fund.', 'Blandings is a British comedy television series adapted by Guy Andrews from the Blandings Castle stories of P.G. Wodehouse. It was first broadcast on BBC One from 13 January 2013, and stars Timothy Spall, Jennifer Saunders and Mark Williams. The series was produced with the partial financial assistance of the European Regional Development Fund.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6a050ZEWJx6lz2HI3Eood0HBzXT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:59440'),
  ('1100810335435482454', 'Blankety Blank', 2021, 'Family, Comedy', null, null, 'Bradley Walsh', null, 'Bradley Walsh presents the triumphant return of Britain''s blank-iest game show. Can he control his celebrity panel and help contestants win the coveted cheque book and pen?', 'Bradley Walsh presents the triumphant return of Britain''s blank-iest game show. Can he control his celebrity panel and help contestants win the coveted cheque book and pen?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pv76mJpZfrmSJQhXw2lGxKHEYxV.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:136009'),
  ('1064873502810028583', 'Blassreiter', 2008, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics', null, null, 'Masaya Matsukaze, Kenta Miyake, Kana Hanazawa, Junko Minagawa, Unsho Ishizuka, Yuichi Nakamura, Shizuka Itoh, Unsho Ishizuka', 'TV-MA', 'The story is set in a fictional Germany and centers around the outbreak of bio-mechanical creatures named "Demoniacs", who rise from corpses and attack people mindlessly. All the while, a number of human-turned-Demoniacs appear. Some use their powers for good whilst others for evil. One will rise above all other Demoniacs to become the "Blassreiter".', 'The story is set in a fictional Germany and centers around the outbreak of bio-mechanical creatures named "Demoniacs", who rise from corpses and attack people mindlessly. All the while, a number of human-turned-Demoniacs appear. Some use their powers for good whilst others for evil. One will rise above all other Demoniacs to become the "Blassreiter".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v4jPxBJEdl17MxnRlZLcxbmlnmJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34216'),
  ('75917157626978386', 'Blast of Tempest', 2012, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Koki Uchiyama, Miyuki Sawashiro, Toshiyuki Toyonaga, Kana Hanazawa, Yuki Kaji, Nana Mizuki, Hirofumi Nojima, Shintaro Asanuma', null, 'The Kusaribe family is a family of sorcerers under the protection of the ‘Tree of Origins.’ Their princess, Hakaze Kusaribe, was the greatest sorceress of their family. But Samon Kusaribe, a member of their family seeking to resurrect the ‘Tree of World''s End,’ a tree that opposes the ‘Tree of Origins’ and controls the power of destruction, stuffs her into a barrel, and banishes her to a deserted island.', 'The Kusaribe family is a family of sorcerers under the protection of the ‘Tree of Origins.’ Their princess, Hakaze Kusaribe, was the greatest sorceress of their family. But Samon Kusaribe, a member of their family seeking to resurrect the ‘Tree of World''s End,’ a tree that opposes the ‘Tree of Origins’ and controls the power of destruction, stuffs her into a barrel, and banishes her to a deserted island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUU9HoXlExmFCEO8p9oceJqYlDP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46283'),
  ('90804246885930130', 'Blauer Panther', 1989, 'News', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 37, 'tmdb:tv:89026'),
  ('461545274612114970', 'BlazBlue Alter Memory', 2013, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Tomokazu Sugita, Kanako Kondo, Tetsuya Kakihara, Yuichi Nakamura, Kana Ueda', 'TV-14', 'In the year 2199, humanity eagerly waits for the dawn of the new century, following the end of a series of devastating magic wars. When the world''s most wanted man, Ragna the Bloodedge (also known as the Grim Reaper) make a move to destroy society, a group of ragtag fighters come together to stop him.', 'In the year 2199, humanity eagerly waits for the dawn of the new century, following the end of a series of devastating magic wars. When the world''s most wanted man, Ragna the Bloodedge (also known as the Grim Reaper) make a move to destroy society, a group of ragtag fighters come together to stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wmC3YkMj5SbnZv1e9uS1WU01Xws.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68485'),
  ('968790022132659083', 'Blaze and the Monster Machines', 2014, 'Kids, Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Jeff Borkin, Ellen Martin', null, 'Nolan North, Kevin Michael Richardson, Nat Faxon, Sunil Malhotra, Susan Silo, Billy Ray Cyrus, Angelina Wahler, James Patrick Stuart', 'TV-G', 'AJ is an 8-year-old techie who drives monster-truck Blaze, the top racer in Axle City. The two go on adventures that have them taking on problems involving science and math. Many predicaments they face are caused by Blaze''s rival, Crusher, a tractor-trailer that will do anything to beat other vehicles to the finish line. The animated series is billed as the first TV show for preschoolers to comprehensively cover areas of science, technology, engineering and math. Each episode introduces different STEM concepts, including buoyancy and trajectory.', 'AJ is an 8-year-old techie who drives monster-truck Blaze, the top racer in Axle City. The two go on adventures that have them taking on problems involving science and math. Many predicaments they face are caused by Blaze''s rival, Crusher, a tractor-trailer that will do anything to beat other vehicles to the finish line. The animated series is billed as the first TV show for preschoolers to comprehensively cover areas of science, technology, engineering and math. Each episode introduces different STEM concepts, including buoyancy and trajectory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5DzjYIdgoePjMlmS7RCyUYWhpIK.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:64198'),
  ('898502781572148202', 'Bleach', 2004, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Masakazu Morita, Fumiko Orikasa, Hiroki Yasumoto, Yuki Matsuoka, Noriaki Sugiyama', 'TV-14', 'For as long as he can remember, Ichigo Kurosaki has been able to see ghosts. But when he meets Rukia, a Soul Reaper who battles evil spirits known as Hollows, he finds his life is changed forever. Now, with a newfound wealth of spiritual energy, Ichigo discovers his true calling: to protect the living and the dead from evil.', 'For as long as he can remember, Ichigo Kurosaki has been able to see ghosts. But when he meets Rukia, a Soul Reaper who battles evil spirits known as Hollows, he finds his life is changed forever. Now, with a newfound wealth of spiritual energy, Ichigo discovers his true calling: to protect the living and the dead from evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5iVUUnE2tgBPypACYNobCKHagfV.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:30984'),
  ('1011726706746743261', 'Bleak House', 2005, 'Drama', null, null, 'Anna Maxwell Martin, Denis Lawson, Carey Mulligan, Gillian Anderson, Charles Dance, Patrick Kennedy, Richard Harrington, Natalie Press', null, 'The generous John Jarndyce, struggling with his own past, and his two young wards Richard and Ada, are all caught up, like Lady Dedlock, in the infamous case of Jarndyce vs. Jarndyce, which will make one of them rich beyond imagination if it can ever be brought to a conclusion. As Tulkinghorn digs deeper into Lady Dedlock''s past, he unearths a secret that will change their lives forever, and which is almost as astounding as the final outcome of the Jarndyce case.', 'The generous John Jarndyce, struggling with his own past, and his two young wards Richard and Ada, are all caught up, like Lady Dedlock, in the infamous case of Jarndyce vs. Jarndyce, which will make one of them rich beyond imagination if it can ever be brought to a conclusion. As Tulkinghorn digs deeper into Lady Dedlock''s past, he unearths a secret that will change their lives forever, and which is almost as astounding as the final outcome of the Jarndyce case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEXvWTXCQogRIKlUWBLrj5ihOWi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2489'),
  ('170414396432603029', 'BLEND-S', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Miyuki Nakayama', null, 'Azumi Waki, Akari Kito, Anzu Haruno, Atsumi Tanezaki, Sora Tokui, Tomoaki Maeno, Tatsuhisa Suzuki', 'TV-14', 'High school girl Maika Sakuranomiya has trouble finding a part-time job because of how scary she looks when smiling. However, she is scouted one day by Dino, the manager of the café Stile where its waitresses play unique traits such as tsundere and younger sister. Maika is given a sadist trait because of her looks and has to adopt a dominant and cruel persona when servicing customers, particularly masochist ones.', 'High school girl Maika Sakuranomiya has trouble finding a part-time job because of how scary she looks when smiling. However, she is scouted one day by Dino, the manager of the café Stile where its waitresses play unique traits such as tsundere and younger sister. Maika is given a sadist trait because of her looks and has to adopt a dominant and cruel persona when servicing customers, particularly masochist ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cRN22Xeb4kZ3GVBdfIJVPgD3ZH0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74081'),
  ('190533812610518269', 'Bless the Harts', 2019, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Emily Spivey', null, 'Maya Rudolph, Ike Barinholtz, Jillian Bell, Kristen Wiig, Fortune Feimster', 'TV-14', 'The lives of a group of Southerners who are always broke as a joke and struggling for the American dream of status and wealth. What they don’t realize is that they’re already rich — in friends, family and laughter.', 'The lives of a group of Southerners who are always broke as a joke and struggling for the American dream of status and wealth. What they don’t realize is that they’re already rich — in friends, family and laughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/havvMQWenLDVRMF46ncF1vVoLLU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:82653'),
  ('121988681511994863', 'Bless This House', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Harry Driver, Vince Powell', null, 'Sidney James, Diana Coupland, Sally Geeson, Robin Stewart', null, 'Bless this house is a British sitcom starring Sid James and Diana Coupland that aired on ITV from the 2nd February 1971 to the 22nd April 1976. It was written by Derek Collyer, David Comming, B.C. Cummins, Harry Driver, George Evans, Dave Freeman, Carla Lane, Brian Platt, Vince Powell, Adele Rose, Mike Sharland, Bernie Sharp, Myra Taylor, Jon Watkins and Lawrie Wyman. It was made for the ITV network by Thames Television. In 2004, Bless this house came 67th in Britain''s best sitcom.', 'Bless this house is a British sitcom starring Sid James and Diana Coupland that aired on ITV from the 2nd February 1971 to the 22nd April 1976. It was written by Derek Collyer, David Comming, B.C. Cummins, Harry Driver, George Evans, Dave Freeman, Carla Lane, Brian Platt, Vince Powell, Adele Rose, Mike Sharland, Bernie Sharp, Myra Taylor, Jon Watkins and Lawrie Wyman. It was made for the ITV network by Thames Television. In 2004, Bless this house came 67th in Britain''s best sitcom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJCHhmbswZ8KaBfwqELtH7thHHN.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:198'),
  ('853470918829608645', 'Bless This Mess', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Lake Bell, Elizabeth Meriwether', null, 'Lake Bell, Dax Shepard, Langston Kerman, Lennon Parham, David Koechner, Pam Grier, Ed Begley Jr., JT Neal', 'TV-PG', 'After dropping everything to make the move from skyscrapers to farmhouses, Rio and Mike soon realize that the simpler life isn''t as easy as they planned.', 'After dropping everything to make the move from skyscrapers to farmhouses, Rio and Mike soon realize that the simpler life isn''t as easy as they planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ibUyKwysja93kq4qC9Z8lqFHFjE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:86129'),
  ('758304949898292484', 'Blind', 2022, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', null, 'Kwon Ki-kyung', 'Ok Taec-yeon, Ha Seok-jin, Jung Eun-ji, Park Ji-bin, Jeong In-gi, Kim Pub-lae, Kang Na-eon, Oh Seung-yun', null, 'A homicide squad detective, suspected of serial murder, searches for the real culprit.', 'A homicide squad detective, suspected of serial murder, searches for the real culprit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJCRPKltKrr7JvOrorJ1dOdeBzG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158865'),
  ('183601407703195466', 'Blind Date', 2019, 'Soap, Comedy', 'Andrés Burgos', null, 'Sofía Garza, Gonzalo Peña, Victoria Ruffo, Adrián Di Monte, Omar Fierro, Arturo Peniche, Okairy Giner', null, 'Lucía is a vlogger whose life depends on other people''s opinions, and especially that of Maura, her mother, who watches over her all day. When Lucía''s sister announces her engagement, her mother begins to worry about Lucía''s appearance and emotional stability, betting that she will attend the wedding alone, dressed in black and heavier than ever. Lucía will have 258 days to lose weight, change her image and find a boyfriend. The bet with her mother goes viral and throughout the story Lucía shares the events of each blind date.', 'Lucía is a vlogger whose life depends on other people''s opinions, and especially that of Maura, her mother, who watches over her all day. When Lucía''s sister announces her engagement, her mother begins to worry about Lucía''s appearance and emotional stability, betting that she will attend the wedding alone, dressed in black and heavier than ever. Lucía will have 258 days to lose weight, change her image and find a boyfriend. The bet with her mother goes viral and throughout the story Lucía shares the events of each blind date.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oH9qqdEz80IYxACAb1i9eFBz7jp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91241'),
