  ('892320809914910909', 'Breaking the Shadows', 2025, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', null, 'Wang Bu, Yiying Liu', 'Sun Li, Luo Jin, Ding Guansen, Li Xiaoran, Wang Ziyi, Huang Man, Yiying Liu, Kaavie Wong', null, 'When her longtime partner Zhong Wei goes missing during a case, stoic detective Han Qing refuses to give up the search. As she investigates a new murder, she uncovers a connection to Zhong Wei’s disappearance and a hidden criminal network involving murder, abductions, and drug trafficking. With her team, Han Qing races to unravel the truth and bring the syndicate to justice.', 'When her longtime partner Zhong Wei goes missing during a case, stoic detective Han Qing refuses to give up the search. As she investigates a new murder, she uncovers a connection to Zhong Wei’s disappearance and a hidden criminal network involving murder, abductions, and drug trafficking. With her team, Han Qing races to unravel the truth and bring the syndicate to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/weHTKnnTnSjxb2zs8wqS7wuwldB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:252572'),
  ('718969746823570448', 'Breakout Kings', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Matt Olmstead, Nick Santora', null, 'Laz Alonso, Domenick Lombardozzi, Serinda Swan, Jimmi Simpson, Brooke Nevin, Jason Cerbone, Mark Day, Rufus Crawford', 'TV-14', 'Driven by the fact that there are few things more dangerous than a prisoner who has just escaped, and tired of following protocol and resorting to outdated methods of law enforcement, veteran U.S. Marshals Charlie Duchamp and Ray Zancanelli are taking an unorthodox approach to their work: using former fugitives to catch fugitives.', 'Driven by the fact that there are few things more dangerous than a prisoner who has just escaped, and tired of following protocol and resorting to outdated methods of law enforcement, veteran U.S. Marshals Charlie Duchamp and Ray Zancanelli are taking an unorthodox approach to their work: using former fugitives to catch fugitives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAAuZlwVnAKEquHbie1LD4EPK0B.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:32861'),
  ('171514175617659744', 'Breakthrough', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Ron Howard', null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Providing a thought-provoking and imaginative perspective on scientific discovery as it unfolds, each episode follows scientific explorers working on cutting-­edge projects with breakthrough potential, revealing the world of tomorrow... today.', 'Providing a thought-provoking and imaginative perspective on scientific discovery as it unfolds, each episode follows scientific explorers working on cutting-­edge projects with breakthrough potential, revealing the world of tomorrow... today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n8QaodjwN1lbHnU0HnksJS64xiF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:64220'),
  ('1047166465113003041', 'Breathe', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', 'Mayank Sharma', 'Vikram Tuli', 'R. Madhavan, Amit Sadh, Sapna Pabbi, Atharva Vishwakarma, Shriswara Dubey, Nina Kulkarni, Hrishikesh Joshi, Tarun Gahlot', null, 'Kabir, a brilliant but non-conventional officer of the Crime Branch, puts the pieces together of seemingly unconnected deaths of organ donors that lead up to an unlikely suspect - the affable Danny. Kabir will not stop till he cracks the case and delivers justice.', 'Kabir, a brilliant but non-conventional officer of the Crime Branch, puts the pieces together of seemingly unconnected deaths of organ donors that lead up to an unlikely suspect - the affable Danny. Kabir will not stop till he cracks the case and delivers justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCgpMmMt73bp2sLQOmbXPIHAgWS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76659'),
  ('142357526964056072', 'Breathe: Into the Shadows', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Mayank Sharma', null, null, null, 'A 6-year old girl is kidnapped by a mysterious masked man, who demands an unusual ransom. To save his daughter, Dr. Avinash Sabharwal must kill someone! Meanwhile, Kabir Sawant''s journey continues in the hostile environment of the Delhi Crime branch. Lies, deceit and mind games begin when Kabir is given charge of the investigation, and meets Avinash.', 'A 6-year old girl is kidnapped by a mysterious masked man, who demands an unusual ransom. To save his daughter, Dr. Avinash Sabharwal must kill someone! Meanwhile, Kabir Sawant''s journey continues in the hostile environment of the Delhi Crime branch. Lies, deceit and mind games begin when Kabir is given charge of the investigation, and meets Avinash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mWAkrsBHsrpYGy1E2JzaRkKjfAh.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:105521'),
  ('839032346757488992', 'Breathless', 2024, 'Drama', 'Carlos Montero', null, 'Manu Ríos, Borja Luna, Blanca Suárez, Najwa Nimri, Aitana Sánchez-Gijón, Ana Rayo, Alfonso Bassave, Xoán Fórneas', 'TV-MA', 'A passionate medical team is devoted to saving lives in a bustling public hospital where tensions — and romance — keep their pulses racing.', 'A passionate medical team is devoted to saving lives in a bustling public hospital where tensions — and romance — keep their pulses racing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6qEnmFxRqQQhjPAZPNHlwPc75y.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:230069'),
  ('1070278276118357138', 'Breathtaking', 2024, 'Drama', 'Rachel Clarke, Prasanna Puwanarajah, Jed Mercurio', 'Jed Mercurio, Prasanna Puwanarajah', 'Joanne Froggatt, Lucy Montgomery, Jodie McNee, Mark Dexter, Bhav Joshi, Donna Banya, Stephanie Street, Naomi Denny', null, 'A searing, thought-provoking and poignant account of an NHS doctor in the eye of the storm during the early days of the Covid-19 pandemic.', 'A searing, thought-provoking and poignant account of an NHS doctor in the eye of the storm during the early days of the Covid-19 pandemic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d6nspun5EJ2ve0L1s2CBzqnXMeT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241098'),
  ('340735983296364315', 'Breeders', 2020, 'Comedy, Family', 'Simon Blackwell', null, 'Martin Freeman, Daisy Haggard, Oscar Kennedy, Zoë Athena', 'TV-MA', 'Exposing the parental-paradox that it is possible, in the very same moment, to love your child to the horizon of the universe, while being apoplectically angry enough to want to send them there.', 'Exposing the parental-paradox that it is possible, in the very same moment, to love your child to the horizon of the universe, while being apoplectically angry enough to want to send them there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cTz7gZuCd6wtvXWt55ALWlTqYc6.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:93290'),
