  ('1103338510105096102', 'Bridge of Lies', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Ross Kemp', null, 'Ross Kemp hosts a nail-biting quiz. Using knowledge, strategy and a little luck, contestants must cross the bridge, spotting the lies. One wrong step and they lose everything.', 'Ross Kemp hosts a nail-biting quiz. Using knowledge, strategy and a little luck, contestants must cross the bridge, spotting the lies. One wrong step and they lose everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxvNRBiwabrhBa1sdZf7H1zgt1A.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:195230'),
