  ('535327620410066206', 'Bridget & Eamon', 2016, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Jennifer Maguire, Bernard O''Shea, Sharon Mannion, Colum McDonnell, Eleanor Tiernan, Edwin Sammon, Norma Sheahan', null, 'Bridget & Eamon are the typical unhappily married 80s Irish couple. They live somewhere in the Midlands with their indeterminate number of children. Chain-smoking Bridget has notions. She wants the lifestyle from the pages of Woman''s Way but wouldn''t want to think about how much it would cost to heat South Fork.', 'Bridget & Eamon are the typical unhappily married 80s Irish couple. They live somewhere in the Midlands with their indeterminate number of children. Chain-smoking Bridget has notions. She wants the lifestyle from the pages of Woman''s Way but wouldn''t want to think about how much it would cost to heat South Fork.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5KaKABatnfdOLrkJndit18CRTOB.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:65537'),
  ('718856295481043557', 'Brief Encounters', 2016, 'Drama', 'Oriane Messina, Fay Rusling', null, 'Sophie Rundle, Angela Griffin, Sharon Rooney, Penelope Wilton, Peter Wight, Karl Davies, Don Gilet, Will Merrick', null, 'In the early 1980s the lives of four ordinary women, their husbands, mothers, families and community are turned around when they become Ann Summers party plan saleswomen.', 'In the early 1980s the lives of four ordinary women, their husbands, mothers, families and community are turned around when they become Ann Summers party plan saleswomen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fpllvSi8EFBXnu2n7CZ8Nmshvj4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67073'),
  ('233885196007977311', 'Brigada', 2002, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', null, 'Alexandr Veledinsky, Alexey Sidorov, Igor Porublyov', 'Sergei Bezrukov, Dmitriy Dyuzhev, Vladimir Vdovichenkov, Pavel Maykov, Andrei Panin, Ekaterina Guseva, Mukhamadali Makhmadov, Aleksandr Vysokovskiy', null, 'A quartet of childhood pals who create a business together find themselves at the core of a powerful Moscow gang in the aftermath of an unplanned murder.', 'A quartet of childhood pals who create a business together find themselves at the core of a powerful Moscow gang in the aftermath of an unplanned murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ss5Z7r6Z1B5wFadd4Ku78mnig6y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:30877'),
  ('26181154381761035', 'Brigands: The Quest for Gold', 2024, 'Drama', null, null, 'Michela De Rossi, Matilda Lutz, Lorenzo de Moor, Nando Paone, Marlon Joubert, Giuseppe Lo Piccolo, Alessio Praticò', null, 'In the 19th century, when the southern lands of Italy are bandit territory, Filomena escapes her wealthy but sad life to lead a risky treasure hunt.', 'In the 19th century, when the southern lands of Italy are bandit territory, Filomena escapes her wealthy but sad life to lead a risky treasure hunt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xD44FCYwkOeA5iwYu175cUQlVUi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:235779'),
  ('210059841198800265', 'Bright Eyes in the Dark', 2023, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, 'Sun Ran', 'Johnny Huang, Zhang Jingyi, Tang Xiaotian, Zhang Jin, Lu Siyu, Li Mingjun, Chen Kang, Yu Li', null, 'Lin Luxiao possesses exceptional firefighting skills and extensive experience. He is the head of the Special Operations Station on Heping Road in Beixun City. By a twist of fate, he is chosen to become an instructor for a reality show aimed at promoting firefighting knowledge. During the show, Lin Luxiao coincidentally encounters Nan Chu, a dancer he had rescued from a fire years ago. Nan Chu develops a fondness for Lin Luxiao, but he keeps his distance due to the inherent dangers of his profession. The firefighters of different generations collaborate in rescue operations involving fires, earthquakes, and aerial rescues, raising the level of fire safety in Beixun City. As Nan Chu and Lin Luxiao gradually deepen their understanding of each other, they affirm their feelings. Faced with the most dangerous forest fire, Lin Luxiao and his teammates choose to advance against the flames.', 'Lin Luxiao possesses exceptional firefighting skills and extensive experience. He is the head of the Special Operations Station on Heping Road in Beixun City. By a twist of fate, he is chosen to become an instructor for a reality show aimed at promoting firefighting knowledge. During the show, Lin Luxiao coincidentally encounters Nan Chu, a dancer he had rescued from a fire years ago. Nan Chu develops a fondness for Lin Luxiao, but he keeps his distance due to the inherent dangers of his profession. The firefighters of different generations collaborate in rescue operations involving fires, earthquakes, and aerial rescues, raising the level of fire safety in Beixun City. As Nan Chu and Lin Luxiao gradually deepen their understanding of each other, they affirm their feelings. Faced with the most dangerous forest fire, Lin Luxiao and his teammates choose to advance against the flames.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2D7WwmmLlYmZMgkk6EhZPaGuod.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:234919'),
  ('569664402682799381', 'Bright Future', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Wang Xiaoqiang', 'Hu Ge, Wu Yue, Zhang Xincheng, Wang Xiao, Ren Chengwei, You Yongzhi, Ning Wentong, Fang Zibin', null, 'The story of county party secretary Mei Xiaoge and the reforms he and his colleagues introduce to bring about much-needed change and development to the lives of the people of Guangming County.', 'The story of county party secretary Mei Xiaoge and the reforms he and his colleagues introduce to bring about much-needed change and development to the lives of the people of Guangming County.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8EMAJf52nAWzYqVadcQCA1OOIgo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210747'),
  ('240620476187094242', 'Bright-eyed Revenge', 2016, 'Drama, Crime', 'Franck Ollivier', null, 'Laëtitia Milot, Bernard Yerlès, Benoît Michel, Claire Borotra, Roby Schinasi, Sophie Duez, Aurélien Wiik, Lola Dewaere', null, 'Ten years after surviving a car accident in which her mother and brother were murdered, Olivia, returns to the French Riviera with a new identity and a single purpose: Retribution.', 'Ten years after surviving a car accident in which her mother and brother were murdered, Olivia, returns to the French Riviera with a new identity and a single purpose: Retribution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oGQZDrXFDL6jDaJAcR4ARbk2aaY.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67736'),
  ('673609591462226745', 'Brilliant Legacy', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'So Hyun Kyung', 'So Hyun Kyung', 'Han Hyo-joo, Lee Seung-gi, Moon Chae-won, Bae Soo-bin, Ban Hyo-jung, Lee Seung-Hyung, Yeon Jun-seok, Kim Mi-sook', null, 'A series of misunderstandings and unfortunate events conspire to shatter the once-promising life of girl from an affluent family.', 'A series of misunderstandings and unfortunate events conspire to shatter the once-promising life of girl from an affluent family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9J2Hft0EcAp6woba5rPk3FzNQyA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31120'),
  ('80624274606911009', 'Brilliant Minds', 2024, 'Drama', 'Michael Grassi', null, 'Zachary Quinto, Tamberla Perry, Ashleigh LaThrop, Aury Krebs, Teddy Sears, Brian Altemus, John Clarence Stewart, Al Calderon', 'TV-14', 'A rare condition — face blindness — gives an eccentric yet incredibly gifted neurologist a unique perspective on care, fueling his mission to change the way people see his patients. Alongside a team of brilliant young interns, he solves some of the world''s most puzzling psychological cases while navigating the complicated relationships that come with the job.', 'A rare condition — face blindness — gives an eccentric yet incredibly gifted neurologist a unique perspective on care, fueling his mission to change the way people see his patients. Alongside a team of brilliant young interns, he solves some of the world''s most puzzling psychological cases while navigating the complicated relationships that come with the job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vG6Bw2IwDf1DVkPd7nZwMExp0U5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:237748'),
  ('1113668097083978850', 'Brimstone', 1998, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ethan Reiff, Cyrus Voris', null, 'Peter Horton, John Glover', null, 'Brimstone is a short-lived Fox television series, featuring a dead police detective whose mission is to return to Hell 113 spirits who have escaped to Earth. The series ran for only one partial season. Since cancellation, Brimstone reruns have aired on Syfy in the United States from the summer of 1999 onward. The reruns have no set schedule, but are usually aired in marathons during the channel''s seasonal events like "Creatureland", "Inhumanland" and "the 31 Days of Halloween". Chiller also began airing reruns, on July 28, 2007. It currently airs in sporadic weekday marathons, like Syfy, and has no set airing schedule.', 'Brimstone is a short-lived Fox television series, featuring a dead police detective whose mission is to return to Hell 113 spirits who have escaped to Earth. The series ran for only one partial season. Since cancellation, Brimstone reruns have aired on Syfy in the United States from the summer of 1999 onward. The reruns have no set schedule, but are usually aired in marathons during the channel''s seasonal events like "Creatureland", "Inhumanland" and "the 31 Days of Halloween". Chiller also began airing reruns, on July 28, 2007. It currently airs in sporadic weekday marathons, like Syfy, and has no set airing schedule.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hAKnq2PnhyfkPwCLWmy7lZ2G5IQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2229'),
  ('889014627577348070', 'Bring It On, Ghost', 2016, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Park Joon-hwa', 'Lee Dae-il', 'Kim So-hyun, Ok Taec-yeon, Kwon Yul, Kim Sang-ho, David Lee, Kang Ki-young, Baek Seo-yi, Lee Do-yeon', null, 'Hyun-Ji, a 19-year-old ghost meets exorcist Park Bong-Pal. They team up to listen to and solve the problems of various ghosts in order to help them rest peacefully.', 'Hyun-Ji, a 19-year-old ghost meets exorcist Park Bong-Pal. They team up to listen to and solve the problems of various ghosts in order to help them rest peacefully.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tPDqJOnOPDwYv2CN7OPE29UoS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66393'),
  ('975606134004761674', 'Bring It!', 2014, 'Reality', null, null, 'Dianna Williams', 'TV-PG', 'A spotlight on the elite world of hip-hop majorette competitions. Coach Dianna Williams (aka "Miss D") and her Dancing Dolls troupe refuse to lose, pushing themselves to the limit each week in the relentless pursuit of victory. Every pump, thrust and high kick on "Bring It!" highlights the triumphs and struggles of intense competition, where errors aren''t tolerated, mediocrity isn’t excused and only a win is acceptable.', 'A spotlight on the elite world of hip-hop majorette competitions. Coach Dianna Williams (aka "Miss D") and her Dancing Dolls troupe refuse to lose, pushing themselves to the limit each week in the relentless pursuit of victory. Every pump, thrust and high kick on "Bring It!" highlights the triumphs and struggles of intense competition, where errors aren''t tolerated, mediocrity isn’t excused and only a win is acceptable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gmk0oDoemqEfdXHbcrjHGNw3nfN.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:61944'),
  ('1043413235085042247', 'Bring The Soul: Docu-Series', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Jung Kook, Suga, Jin, RM, j-hope, V, Jimin', null, '‘LOVE YOURSELF.’ One message that touched the hearts of ‘ARMY’ across the world. Behind the free and spirited presence on the stage, are the members doing their best to love themselves, personifying the message delivered throughout the tour. But the sense of responsibility, along with the worries and anxiety, is mounting more weight on the shoulders of the members. The docu-series captures BTS members telling the stories untold in ‘BRING THE SOUL: THE MOVIE’ and finally revealing their genuine stories.', '‘LOVE YOURSELF.’ One message that touched the hearts of ‘ARMY’ across the world. Behind the free and spirited presence on the stage, are the members doing their best to love themselves, personifying the message delivered throughout the tour. But the sense of responsibility, along with the worries and anxiety, is mounting more weight on the shoulders of the members. The docu-series captures BTS members telling the stories untold in ‘BRING THE SOUL: THE MOVIE’ and finally revealing their genuine stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ZPl862clCjKKZDJNc2JTqoLRmu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103104'),
  ('339228920054385338', 'Bringing Up Bates', 2015, 'Reality', null, null, 'Gil Bates, Kelly Jo Bates, Zach Bates, Whitney Bates, Erin Paine, Tori Smith, Michael Keilen, Carlin Stewart', 'NR', 'Twenty-seven years ago Gil and Kelly Jo Bates tied the knot with no plans to have kids. Fast forward 19 kids later and this tight-knit family, seemingly too good to be true, has a tremendous bond but are far from perfect. As you will see, when you have a house full of 19 children, from ages two to 25, daily chaos is multiplied exponentially, but so are the joyful and poignant moments that life can bring.', 'Twenty-seven years ago Gil and Kelly Jo Bates tied the knot with no plans to have kids. Fast forward 19 kids later and this tight-knit family, seemingly too good to be true, has a tremendous bond but are far from perfect. As you will see, when you have a house full of 19 children, from ages two to 25, daily chaos is multiplied exponentially, but so are the joyful and poignant moments that life can bring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kThYSs6Mm6oy8ldoQSKX2feqR7R.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:62881'),
