  ('165959958312639187', 'Bump', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kelsey Munro, Claudia Karvan', null, 'Nathalie Morris, Claudia Karvan, Carlos Sanson Jr., Angus Sampson, Paula Garcia, Ioane Sa''ula, Safia Arain', null, 'An unexpected pregnancy complicates the lives of two families. The series centers around Oly, an ambitious and high-achieving teenage girl who has a surprise baby.', 'An unexpected pregnancy complicates the lives of two families. The series centers around Oly, an ambitious and high-achieving teenage girl who has a surprise baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hbgldqIwKWJehEWHkk48B8qkzJC.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:115639'),
