  ('102978456384396712', 'Bungo and Alchemist -Gears of Judgement-', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuuki Tai, Junichi Suwabe, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Kouji Takahashi', null, 'Based on the popular mobile game of the same name. Bungo and Alchemist -Gears of Judgement- is set in a fantasy world with famous and handsome historical figures from the field of literature, who must call upon their magical abilities to save books that have been tainted by evil forces.', 'Based on the popular mobile game of the same name. Bungo and Alchemist -Gears of Judgement- is set in a fantasy world with famous and handsome historical figures from the field of literature, who must call upon their magical abilities to save books that have been tainted by evil forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rdyxjRbAgdpvDVSBAdTDgiLkPlL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100353'),
  ('588598858331748961', 'Bungo Stray Dogs', 2016, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Crime', null, null, 'Mamoru Miyano, Yuto Uemura, Masaaki Mizunaka, Hiroyuki Yoshino, Sumire Morohoshi, Junichi Suwabe, Shunsuke Takeuchi, Takayuki Sugo', 'TV-14', 'Stalked by a beastly white tiger, Atsushi Nakajima has no idea that the menace lives inside him—a power that catches the attention of the Armed Detective Agency. Using inhuman abilities to combat crime, this team takes Atsushi under the wing of their most eccentric member, Dazai. Together, they tear through mafia-muddled mysteries while enemies keep an eye on the tiger’s lofty bounty.', 'Stalked by a beastly white tiger, Atsushi Nakajima has no idea that the menace lives inside him—a power that catches the attention of the Armed Detective Agency. Using inhuman abilities to combat crime, this team takes Atsushi under the wing of their most eccentric member, Dazai. Together, they tear through mafia-muddled mysteries while enemies keep an eye on the tiger’s lofty bounty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6AQmGhkYwAqW2OevjXbsh7tZnNO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65931'),
  ('8597963641687523', 'Bungo Stray Dogs Wan!', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Mamoru Miyano, Kensho Ono, Kisho Taniyama, Yuto Uemura, Sumire Morohoshi, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Hiroshi Kamiya, Kitsune Kagura', null, 'The peaceful days of the very popular work Bungou Stray Dogs are here. The characters of the Armed Detective Agency and the Mafia are in miniature form?! Due to Atsushi and co. becoming cute, this is a different experience to the original work—a pleasant gag manga!', 'The peaceful days of the very popular work Bungou Stray Dogs are here. The characters of the Armed Detective Agency and the Mafia are in miniature form?! Due to Atsushi and co. becoming cute, this is a different experience to the original work—a pleasant gag manga!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/37e40AS92eZKuvdxRuruNihiTOS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110837'),
  ('357281926489162564', 'Bunheads', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Amy Sherman-Palladino', null, 'Sutton Foster, Kelly Bishop, Julia Goldani Telles, Bailey De Young, Emma Dumont, Kaitlyn Jenkins', 'TV-14', 'Michelle, a Las Vegas showgirl, impulsively marries a man, moves to his sleepy coastal town, and takes an uneasy role at her new mother-in-law''s dance school.', 'Michelle, a Las Vegas showgirl, impulsively marries a man, moves to his sleepy coastal town, and takes an uneasy role at her new mother-in-law''s dance school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eSQxZYyOiQ4ZUuM0hCckKFlqVX5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42329'),
  ('1109550464462797508', 'BUNK''D: Learning the Ropes', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Pamela Eells', null, 'Miranda May, Mallory James Mahoney, Israel Johnson, Trevor Tordjman, Shiloh Verrico, Alfred Lewis, Luke Busey', 'TV-G', 'Siblings Emma, Ravi, and Zuri Ross leave their extravagant New York City penthouse once again to return to Camp Kikiwaka, a rustic summer camp in Maine where their parents met as teenagers.', 'Siblings Emma, Ravi, and Zuri Ross leave their extravagant New York City penthouse once again to return to Camp Kikiwaka, a rustic summer camp in Maine where their parents met as teenagers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/at3gMIGpvoofKMgmsnhVFgmBnAe.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:62875'),
  ('654724749452546002', 'Bunker', 2021, 'Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Esteban Seimandi', 'Ariel Amestoy, Adriano Dalla Torre, Esteban Seimandi', 'Bruno Bichir, Miguel Rodarte, Claudette Maillé, Liz Gallardo, Ricardo Polanco, Gisselle Kuri, Jesús Zavala, Victor Oliveira', null, 'Vladimiro''s illusion of finding peace and quiet away from his family in his underground fallout bunker is ruined when he''s forced to share it with a shady tycoon hounded by kidnappers, terrorists and activists.', 'Vladimiro''s illusion of finding peace and quiet away from his family in his underground fallout bunker is ruined when he''s forced to share it with a shady tycoon hounded by kidnappers, terrorists and activists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9XtMkit6yjXMxWD2sp5p2THWu6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:124791'),
  ('762728074320023261', 'Bunnicula', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Jessica Borutski, Maxwell Atoms', null, 'Sean Astin, Brian Kimmet, Chris Kattan, Kari Wahlgren, Eric Bauza, Richard Steven Horvitz', 'TV-Y7', 'A dark comedic adventure about the titular Bunnicula, a vampire rabbit, Mina, his owner, and her two pets, Chester the cat and Harold the dog. Instead of blood, Bunnicula feeds on carrots to sustain himself which gives him super abilities which come in handy on his and his friends escapades.', 'A dark comedic adventure about the titular Bunnicula, a vampire rabbit, Mina, his owner, and her two pets, Chester the cat and Harold the dog. Instead of blood, Bunnicula feeds on carrots to sustain himself which gives him super abilities which come in handy on his and his friends escapades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zpL2TN3GsvwiA0XJjpaJSwdV5Wo.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:65564'),
