  ('584935267768103974', 'Burke''s Law', 1963, 'Drama', 'Ivan Goff, Frank D. Gilroy, Ernest Kinoy', null, 'Gene Barry, Regis Toomey, Leon Lontoc, Gary Conway', null, 'Burke''s Law is an American detective series that ran on ABC from 1963 to 1965 and was revived on CBS in the 1990s. The show starred Gene Barry as Amos Burke, millionaire captain of Los Angeles police homicide division, who was chauffeured around to solve crimes in his Rolls-Royce Silver Cloud II.', 'Burke''s Law is an American detective series that ran on ABC from 1963 to 1965 and was revived on CBS in the 1990s. The show starred Gene Barry as Amos Burke, millionaire captain of Los Angeles police homicide division, who was chauffeured around to solve crimes in his Rolls-Royce Silver Cloud II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePKRW7T0RCgzSzuVJPwHxcqBPXG.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:945'),
  ('268322736665257207', 'Burke''s Law', 1994, 'Drama, Crime', 'James L. Conway', null, 'Gene Barry, Peter Barton, Danny Kamekona, Bever-Leigh Banfield', 'TV-PG', 'Burke''s Law, a revival of the 1960s cop television series of the same name, aired on CBS from 1994 to 1995. The series centers on Amos Burke, a senior Los Angeles police officer and millionaire, and his son, Peter, who is a detective under his command.', 'Burke''s Law, a revival of the 1960s cop television series of the same name, aired on CBS from 1994 to 1995. The series centers on Amos Burke, a senior Los Angeles police officer and millionaire, and his son, Peter, who is a detective under his command.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tnOWB4fz87LotPsKIVHU1k8Nmi7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:44187'),
  ('860890344721759182', 'Burn Notice', 2007, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Matt Nix', null, 'Jeffrey Donovan, Gabrielle Anwar, Bruce Campbell, Sharon Gless, Coby Bell', 'TV-PG', 'A formerly blacklisted spy uses his unique skills and training to help people in desperate situations.', 'A formerly blacklisted spy uses his unique skills and training to help people in desperate situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2fnD3SNiQjGVgA2C3ezaeh2HK.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:2919'),
  ('921788235519803787', 'Burn the House Down', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Arisa Kaneko', null, 'Mei Nagano, Kyoka Suzuki, Yuri Tsunematsu, Michiko Kichise, Taishi Nakagawa, Asuka Kudo, Mitsuhiro Oikawa, Kie Kitano', 'TV-14', 'After her mother took the blame for a tragic fire 13 years ago, Anzu plots revenge by working as a housekeeper under a pseudonym for her icy stepmother.', 'After her mother took the blame for a tragic fire 13 years ago, Anzu plots revenge by working as a housekeeper under a pseudonym for her icy stepmother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s4Ot7YP5GjEW8ggmjXbf79u6b2N.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210268'),
  ('1070870649425970278', 'BURN THE WITCH', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Asami Tano, Yuina Yamada, Shimba Tsuchiya, Hiroaki Hirata, Saori Hayami, Chikahiro Kobayashi, Rie Hikisaka', 'TV-14', 'Historically 72% of all the deaths in London are related to dragons, fantastical beings invisible to the majority of the people. While unknown to most, some people have been standing up to these dragons. Only inhabitants of Reverse London who live in the hidden “reverse” side of London can see the dragons. Even then, only a selected few become qualified enough as witches or wizards to make direct contact with them. The protagonists of the story are witch duo Noel Niihashi and Ninny Spangcole. They are protection agents for Wing Bind (WB), an organization for dragon conservation and management. Their mission is to protect and manage the dragons within London on behalf of the people.', 'Historically 72% of all the deaths in London are related to dragons, fantastical beings invisible to the majority of the people. While unknown to most, some people have been standing up to these dragons. Only inhabitants of Reverse London who live in the hidden “reverse” side of London can see the dragons. Even then, only a selected few become qualified enough as witches or wizards to make direct contact with them. The protagonists of the story are witch duo Noel Niihashi and Ninny Spangcole. They are protection agents for Wing Bind (WB), an organization for dragon conservation and management. Their mission is to protect and manage the dragons within London on behalf of the people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eNq68NjT1KOdorphIqYeZF0BM9b.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110911'),
  ('790948854181282626', 'Burn! Top Striker', 1991, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxVW9hP7NvFa9qIGDWcYL7Ew2DU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:51557'),
  ('909193798164365414', 'Burning Body', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Laura Sarmiento', null, 'Úrsula Corberó, Quim Gutiérrez, José Manuel Poga, Isak Férriz, Eva Llorach, Pep Tosar, Mamen Duch, Guiomar Caiado', 'TV-MA', 'When a police officer is murdered and set on fire, all eyes focus on two other agents: his girlfriend and her lover.', 'When a police officer is murdered and set on fire, all eyes focus on two other agents: his girlfriend and her lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttUAM6vZ7IhLfEFeBtWKVom3LVQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:229962'),
  ('416353782779034478', 'Burning Bush', 2013, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Agnieszka Holland', null, 'Tatiana Pauhofová, Jaroslava Pokorná, Petr Stach, Vojtěch Kotek, Patrik Děrgel, Martin Huba, Igor Bareš, Adrian Jastraban', null, 'Based on real characters and events, this haunting drama focuses on the personal sacrifice of a Prague history student, Jan Palach, who set himself on fire in protest against the Soviet occupation of Czechoslovakia in 1969. Dagmar Burešová, a young female lawyer, became part of his legacy by defending Jan''s family in a trial against the communist government, a regime which tried to dishonour Palach’s sacrifice, a heroic action for the freedom of Czechoslovakia.', 'Based on real characters and events, this haunting drama focuses on the personal sacrifice of a Prague history student, Jan Palach, who set himself on fire in protest against the Soviet occupation of Czechoslovakia in 1969. Dagmar Burešová, a young female lawyer, became part of his legacy by defending Jan''s family in a trial against the communist government, a regime which tried to dishonour Palach’s sacrifice, a heroic action for the freedom of Czechoslovakia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p2MmFaXEf74UBrLnbe2R9YpVxX4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:59149'),
  ('407476160389156450', 'Burning Flame', 1998, 'Drama', 'Sum-Wai Wong', 'Chu Kang-Ki, 關頌玲, Yuk Tak Wong', 'Wong Hei, Louis Koo, Esther Kwan Wing-Ho, Jade Leung Tsang, Chin Ka-Lok, Joseph Cheng King-Kei, Waise Lee Chi-Hung, Melissa Ng Mei-Heng', null, 'Burning Flame is a TVB modern action drama that focuses on the duties and challenges of Hong Kong firefighters. It is the first installment in the Burning Flame series. The series was specifically filmed to celebrate TVB''s 31st Anniversary and was supported by Hong Kong Fire Services Department.', 'Burning Flame is a TVB modern action drama that focuses on the duties and challenges of Hong Kong firefighters. It is the first installment in the Burning Flame series. The series was specifically filmed to celebrate TVB''s 31st Anniversary and was supported by Hong Kong Fire Services Department.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ocAbfmY2l6bzBH7do6jJrGBM6g6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42372'),
  ('557633646146122940', 'Burning Flame II', 2002, 'Drama', 'Sum-Wai Wong', null, 'Wong Hei, Alex Fong Chung-Sun, Kevin Cheng Ka-Wing, Maggie Cheung Ho-Yee, Yoyo Mung Ka-Wai, Flora Chan Wai-Shan, Yuen Wah, Stephen Au Kam-Tong', null, 'Burning Flame II is a TVB modern action drama that focuses on the duties and challenges of Hong Kong firefighters. Wong He continues to be the leading star in this series along with other new cast members including Alex Fong, Maggie Cheung Ho Yee, Stephen Au, Yoyo Mung, and Flora Chan. Although it is the second installment in the Burning Flame series, the story and the characters are completely different from the first.', 'Burning Flame II is a TVB modern action drama that focuses on the duties and challenges of Hong Kong firefighters. Wong He continues to be the leading star in this series along with other new cast members including Alex Fong, Maggie Cheung Ho Yee, Stephen Au, Yoyo Mung, and Flora Chan. Although it is the second installment in the Burning Flame series, the story and the characters are completely different from the first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Tsj2ipWDqACe4MCbfCSvJRGN92.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42297'),
  ('194140333350982342', 'Burning Flame III', 2009, 'Drama', 'Sum-Wai Wong', null, 'Kevin Cheng Ka-Wing, Bosco Wong Chung-Chak, Myolie Wu Hang-Yee, Wong Hei, Aimee Chan, Wong Ka-Lok, Elaine Yiu, Ruco Chan', null, 'Encouraged by the fireman leader Chung Yau-sing, young and playful Fong Lei-on joins the team and gets to know Cheuk Pak-yu. Unfortunately, the two of them are having lots of misunderstanding at work. Lei-on believes that Pak-yu has stolen Yau-sing''s lover, fire department clerk Ko Wai-ying, and causes the serious injury of Yau-sing. Meanwhile, a gruesome fire accident has drawn everyone into a twist of fate that has led them to find a deeper sense of awareness.', 'Encouraged by the fireman leader Chung Yau-sing, young and playful Fong Lei-on joins the team and gets to know Cheuk Pak-yu. Unfortunately, the two of them are having lots of misunderstanding at work. Lei-on believes that Pak-yu has stolen Yau-sing''s lover, fire department clerk Ko Wai-ying, and causes the serious injury of Yau-sing. Meanwhile, a gruesome fire accident has drawn everyone into a twist of fate that has led them to find a deeper sense of awareness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yJh1PJZX2IEfSBG4QCb5SshiOAn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5518'),
  ('1069756826728261174', 'Burning Flames', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Ren Jialun, Xing Fei, Zhu Xudan, Kevin Yan, Zhu Zhengting, Merxat', null, 'After the fall of his kingdom and the slaughter of his family, Prince Wu Geng is forced into slavery, but fueled by grief and guided by powerful allies, he rises to challenge the mighty Yun clan and reclaim his destiny.', 'After the fall of his kingdom and the slaughter of his family, Prince Wu Geng is forced into slavery, but fueled by grief and guided by powerful allies, he rises to challenge the mighty Yun clan and reclaim his destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fIN9thyODZXqpp1Qega3NL37cLw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:231040'),
  ('237541823171777634', 'Burning Flower', 2015, 'Drama', null, null, 'Mao Inoue, Taizo Harada, Kanji Ishimaru, Hideki Takahashi, Umika Kawashima, Mizuki Itagaki, Kengo Kora, Fumi Dan', null, 'Fumi becomes Genzui Kusaka’s wife. During the turbulent times of the closing days for the Tokugawa shogunate, she lives positively and tries to keep up Shoin Yoshida''s will. Shoin Yoshida is her older brother and intellectual.', 'Fumi becomes Genzui Kusaka’s wife. During the turbulent times of the closing days for the Tokugawa shogunate, she lives positively and tries to keep up Shoin Yoshida''s will. Shoin Yoshida is her older brother and intellectual.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PkXmhz72FomdmIJfH4muH289pK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88388'),
  ('949464335452079187', 'Burning for Revenge', 2008, 'Drama, Mystery, Soap', 'Liliana Abud, Julio Jiménez', 'Ricardo Fiallega, Liliana Abud, Julio Jiménez', 'Adela Noriega, Eduardo Yáñez, Elizabeth Álvarez, Jorge Salinas, Nora Salinas, Pablo Montero, Diana Bracho, María Sorté', 'TV-14', 'Fuego en la sangre is a telenovela that began transmissions on January 21, 2008, through Mexico''s Canal de las Estrellas network. Starring Adela Noriega, Eduardo Yáñez, Diana Bracho, and Guillermo García Cantú. It is the Mexican remake of the Colombian soap operas Las Aguas Mansas and Pasion de Gavilanes. The theme song called "Para Siempre" is sung by Vicente Fernández. The telenovela received TVyNovelas Award for Best Telenovela, in 2009.', 'Fuego en la sangre is a telenovela that began transmissions on January 21, 2008, through Mexico''s Canal de las Estrellas network. Starring Adela Noriega, Eduardo Yáñez, Diana Bracho, and Guillermo García Cantú. It is the Mexican remake of the Colombian soap operas Las Aguas Mansas and Pasion de Gavilanes. The theme song called "Para Siempre" is sung by Vicente Fernández. The telenovela received TVyNovelas Award for Best Telenovela, in 2009.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTbAFrYK6jIlvHwv7qdvRKfA3jE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:7022'),
  ('693142408205196240', 'Burning Hearts', 2016, 'Soap', 'Daniel Ortiz', 'Patrícia Moretzsohn, Isabel Muniz, Daniel Ortiz', 'Mariana Ximenes, Malvino Salvador, João Baldasserini, Jayme Matarazzo, Agatha Moreira, Fernanda Vasconcellos, Tatá Werneck, Gabriel Godoy', null, 'Tancinha is a charming fruit seller known for her hot temper who gets torn between an explosive relationship with passionate truck driver Apolo, her neighbour and childhood sweetheart, and an irresistible attraction for Beto, a lady-killer who will not take no for an answer. The girl ends up being caught up in a family feud over the disappearance of her father whom she believed to be dead. Tancinha will leave a path of turmoil along her way to unveil this mystery.', 'Tancinha is a charming fruit seller known for her hot temper who gets torn between an explosive relationship with passionate truck driver Apolo, her neighbour and childhood sweetheart, and an irresistible attraction for Beto, a lady-killer who will not take no for an answer. The girl ends up being caught up in a family feud over the disappearance of her father whom she believed to be dead. Tancinha will leave a path of turmoil along her way to unveil this mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96Jixdjy5z33livtpFY1H50A6Sm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86200'),
  ('876457719937097406', 'Burning Ice', 2017, 'Drama, Crime', 'Zi Jin Chen', null, 'Qin Hao, Deng Jiajia, Yao Lu, Dai Xu, Wang Zhener, Ning Li, Lin Peng, Cheng Yong', null, 'To protect the woman he loves, a white collar worker unintentionally becomes involved in a murder case and is from then on a suspect. In the blink of an eye, his quiet and boring life gets completely shaken up as he suddenly is both being chased by the police as well as gangsters.', 'To protect the woman he loves, a white collar worker unintentionally becomes involved in a murder case and is from then on a suspect. In the blink of an eye, his quiet and boring life gets completely shaken up as he suddenly is both being chased by the police as well as gangsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xufu1tAufjKOsCMkY3T6QqubJTf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73386'),
  ('87317593269384980', 'Burning Kabaddi', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Shuichi Uchida, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Yuma Uchida, Gen Sato, Makoto Furukawa, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Shunsuke Takeuchi, Shinichiro Kamio', 'TV-14', 'Yoigoshi Tatsuya was a star soccer player known as "Yoigoshi the Unstoppable," but when he entered high school, he severed all involvement with sports. Now, he has been invited to a certain sports team. In these matches, victory is achieved through teammates working together to catch and defeat the opponents invading their territory... You could call it a sort of running combat sport. And the name of this game is... Kabaddi.', 'Yoigoshi Tatsuya was a star soccer player known as "Yoigoshi the Unstoppable," but when he entered high school, he severed all involvement with sports. Now, he has been invited to a certain sports team. In these matches, victory is achieved through teammates working together to catch and defeat the opponents invading their territory... You could call it a sort of running combat sport. And the name of this game is... Kabaddi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/I1WPv4syO2X8lyOhH29oVH1zrI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105721'),
  ('102104697399652448', 'Burning Love', 2012, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Ken Marino, Helen Slayton-Hughes, June Diane Raphael, Michael Ian Black, Natasha Leggero, Ryan Hansen, Rob Huebel, Joe Lo Truglio', null, 'Burning Love is a scripted comedy series which is a web spoof of the television shows The Bachelor, The Bachelorette and Bachelor Pad. Depending on the season, the show either follows a man or a woman who is looking for the perfect mate from a pool of contestants, or has contestants living together in a mansion competing for a cash prize. Ben Stiller is executive co-producer. Season 1 showcases fireman Mark Orlando as the bachelor. Season 2 of the series, which premiered in February 2013, stars June Diane Raphael reprising her role as season 1 contestant Julie, now the bachelorette given the chance to find the perfect man. Season 3 also premiered in 2013 and starred former contestants from Seasons 1 and 2 competing for a $900 prize rather than for love.', 'Burning Love is a scripted comedy series which is a web spoof of the television shows The Bachelor, The Bachelorette and Bachelor Pad. Depending on the season, the show either follows a man or a woman who is looking for the perfect mate from a pool of contestants, or has contestants living together in a mansion competing for a cash prize. Ben Stiller is executive co-producer. Season 1 showcases fireman Mark Orlando as the bachelor. Season 2 of the series, which premiered in February 2013, stars June Diane Raphael reprising her role as season 1 contestant Julie, now the bachelorette given the chance to find the perfect man. Season 3 also premiered in 2013 and starred former contestants from Seasons 1 and 2 competing for a $900 prize rather than for love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zVSpYSuACSvqLDBFL35ZmlWDzQU.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:44189'),
  ('1125685189513733507', 'Burnistoun', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Iain Connell, Robert Florence', 'Iain Connell', 'Iain Connell, Robert Florence, Richard Rankin, Kirsty Strain, Louise Stewart, Gerry McLaughlin', null, 'Comedy sketch show set in the fictional Scottish town of Burnistoun near Glasgow. The show follows the exploits of characters such as an aspiring girl band and a serial killer who is unhappy at his portrayal in the local media.', 'Comedy sketch show set in the fictional Scottish town of Burnistoun near Glasgow. The show follows the exploits of characters such as an aspiring girl band and a serial killer who is unhappy at his portrayal in the local media.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3k1aC1GhcgH1T8NHB2kIXvSDKC2.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:32125'),
  ('377688968126457071', 'Burnout Syndrome', 2025, 'Drama', 'JittiRain, Anucha Boonyawatana', null, 'Atthaphan Phunsawat, Jumpol Adulkittiporn, Jirawat Sutivanichsak, Thasorn Klinnium, Thinnaphan Tantui, Chayapol Jutamas', null, 'After losing his dream job, a burned-out artist falls between two men—a charming IT guy and a reclusive tycoon who hires him to be his public face.', 'After losing his dream job, a burned-out artist falls between two men—a charming IT guy and a reclusive tycoon who hires him to be his public face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDTR1noFGGJGsyJedfh1DD0BiuY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278142'),
  ('774285041264763534', 'Burst Angel', 2004, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Megumi Toyoguchi, Rie Tanaka, Mikako Takahashi, Akeno Watanabe, Susumu Chiba, Kyoko Hikami, Katsuhisa Houki, Risa Hayamizu', 'TV-14', 'The future’s looking bleak. It’s a good thing there’s a new sheriff in town. Her name is Jo and she’s an enigma even to herself. Alongside her partners Sei, Amy, and Meg, Jo fights for the citizens who can’t defend themselves. Confronting corruption and twisted science, these gals are on fire—and they’re the best chance the wounded city’s got.', 'The future’s looking bleak. It’s a good thing there’s a new sheriff in town. Her name is Jo and she’s an enigma even to herself. Alongside her partners Sei, Amy, and Meg, Jo fights for the citizens who can’t defend themselves. Confronting corruption and twisted science, these gals are on fire—and they’re the best chance the wounded city’s got.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePCzPNEfafaWA9NpvdzsHuaNBkq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31701'),
  ('1031380757152860959', 'Bus Stop', 1961, 'Drama', 'Roy Huggins', null, 'Marilyn Maxwell, Richard Anderson, Rhodes Reason, Joan Freeman', null, 'Bus Stop is a 26-episode American drama which aired on ABC from October 1, 1961, until March 25, 1962, starring Marilyn Maxwell as Grace Sherwood, the owner of a bus station and diner in the fictitious town of Sunrise in the Colorado Rockies. The program was adapted from William Inge''s play, Bus Stop, and Inge was a script consultant for the series, which followed the lives of travelers passing through the bus station and the diner. Maxwell''s co-stars were Richard Anderson as District Attorney Glenn Wagner, Rhodes Reason as Sheriff Will Mayberry, Joan Freeman as waitress Elma Gahrigner, Bernard Kates as Ralph the coroner, and Buddy Ebsen as Virge Blessing.', 'Bus Stop is a 26-episode American drama which aired on ABC from October 1, 1961, until March 25, 1962, starring Marilyn Maxwell as Grace Sherwood, the owner of a bus station and diner in the fictitious town of Sunrise in the Colorado Rockies. The program was adapted from William Inge''s play, Bus Stop, and Inge was a script consultant for the series, which followed the lives of travelers passing through the bus station and the diner. Maxwell''s co-stars were Richard Anderson as District Attorney Glenn Wagner, Rhodes Reason as Sheriff Will Mayberry, Joan Freeman as waitress Elma Gahrigner, Bernard Kates as Ralph the coroner, and Buddy Ebsen as Virge Blessing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8gExaqE5uzqifySIRnNZw5dXpC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8290'),
  ('934596875209888510', 'Buscando a Frida', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sandra Velasco', null, 'Victoria White, Ximena Martínez, Ximena Herrera, Grettell Valdéz, Rubén Zamora, Germán Bracco, Eduardo Santamarina, Mikel Mateos', 'NR', 'The lives of the members of the Pons family change suddenly when Frida mysteriously disappears on the night of her father''s birthday party.', 'The lives of the members of the Pons family change suddenly when Frida mysteriously disappears on the night of her father''s birthday party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpXAkjCgMOZ2HkrAkgLk9pNUWPs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117732'),
  ('549599011538055198', 'Business as Usual', 2025, 'Drama', 'Moscareto', null, 'Chae Jong-hyeok, Seong Seung-ha, Jung Do-myung, Lee Yoo-jin, Lee Ui-seop, Lee Yoon-gi, Lee Sang-hoon, Lee Sang-won', null, 'Min-jun, feeling stuck in his 9-to-5 job, is shocked when his ex, Jin-hwan, returns as a new colleague. As Min-jun struggles with his past, Jin-hwan has other ideas.', 'Min-jun, feeling stuck in his 9-to-5 job, is shocked when his ex, Jin-hwan, returns as a new colleague. As Min-jun struggles with his past, Jin-hwan has other ideas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ndVWj0sVXC6YdyC3pujdikgtbGx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:238588'),
  ('585594971103750998', 'Business Proposal', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Han Sul-hee, Park Seon-ho, Hong Bo-hee', null, 'Ahn Hyo-seop, Kim Se-jeong, Kim Min-gue, Seol In-a, Lee Duck-hwa, Kim Kwang-kyu, Jeong Young-ju, Kim Hyun-sook', 'TV-14', 'In disguise as her friend, Ha-ri shows up to a blind date to scare him away. But plans go awry when he turns out to be her CEO — and makes a proposal.', 'In disguise as her friend, Ha-ri shows up to a blind date to scare him away. But plans go awry when he turns out to be her CEO — and makes a proposal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iLh7L8ZuvgdxFaM9sImyv2iKYLe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:154825'),
  ('846008896567904903', 'Buso Renkin', 2006, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Nobuhiro Watsuki', null, 'Jun Fukuyama, Ryoka Yuzuki, Aya Hirano, Hitomi Nabatame, Kisho Taniyama, Masashi Ebara, Mitsuaki Madono, Sayuri Yahagi', 'TV-14', 'The story begins when high school student Kazuki Muto is killed one night saving a mysterious girl from a monster, only to wake up in his school dorm, believing it to have been a dream; however, he soon finds out that dream wasn''t a dream at all when a giant serpentine monster attacks him and his sister. Tokiko Tsumura, the girl he saved, explains that the monster is a homunculus. Kazuki had been attacked and killed by it when he was rescuing her; however, she, feeling responsible for him, revived him by placing a Kakugane medallion in his chest, serving as a replacement heart.', 'The story begins when high school student Kazuki Muto is killed one night saving a mysterious girl from a monster, only to wake up in his school dorm, believing it to have been a dream; however, he soon finds out that dream wasn''t a dream at all when a giant serpentine monster attacks him and his sister. Tokiko Tsumura, the girl he saved, explains that the monster is a homunculus. Kazuki had been attacked and killed by it when he was rescuing her; however, she, feeling responsible for him, revived him by placing a Kakugane medallion in his chest, serving as a replacement heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dx4wVPrb5mHfbD9W98KmXJQFBV4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31575'),
  ('1002171179480719657', 'Busou Shinki: Armored War Goddess', 2012, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kana Asumi, Minori Chihara, Kaori Mizuhashi, Megumi Nakajima, Yui Horie, Yukari Tamura, Emiri Kato, Eri Kitamura', null, 'High school student Masato has been living abroad and only now returning to Japan. On his first day at school, he is awoken by Ann, his Arnval model Shinki. As he hurriedly prepares to depart, Ines, an Altines model, and Lene, an Altlene model, both make their way out of the boxes they have been to neatly packed into. For the sake of their Master, they enthusiastically go about cleaning and squaring away Masato''s belongings. In the midst of this, they come across a box labeled Valuable. What could be inside?', 'High school student Masato has been living abroad and only now returning to Japan. On his first day at school, he is awoken by Ann, his Arnval model Shinki. As he hurriedly prepares to depart, Ines, an Altines model, and Lene, an Altlene model, both make their way out of the boxes they have been to neatly packed into. For the sake of their Master, they enthusiastically go about cleaning and squaring away Masato''s belongings. In the midst of this, they come across a box labeled Valuable. What could be inside?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6bMwmmBBsRdpo8iNgBp7RdZD1zP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72698'),
  ('890733849215923571', 'Bust Down', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Sam Jay, Langston Kerman, Jak Knight', null, 'Jak Knight, Langston Kerman, Sam Jay, Chris Redd', 'TV-MA', 'Four friends working dead-end casino jobs in a dead-end town in Middle America attempt to find self-worth in their bad ideas.', 'Four friends working dead-end casino jobs in a dead-end town in Middle America attempt to find self-worth in their bad ideas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bPp7YceqwTsq7UzrveKGgsEkpv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156575'),
  ('118077734299360723', 'Busted!', 2018, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Jo Hyo-jin', null, 'Yoo Jae-suk, Park Min-young, Sehun, Kim Se-jeong, Lee Kwang-soo, Lee Seung-gi, Kim Jong-min', 'TV-14', 'Suspense, surprises and fun abound in this Korean variety game show featuring big personalities and even bigger mysteries in every episode.', 'Suspense, surprises and fun abound in this Korean variety game show featuring big personalities and even bigger mysteries in every episode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6oTuXYHY6sqgy3haRh04GixUr7f.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:78798'),
  ('590411430824244716', 'Buster Keaton: A Hard Act to Follow', 1987, 'Documentary', null, 'David Gill, Kevin Brownlow', 'Buster Keaton, Lindsay Anderson, Eleanor Keaton, James Karen, William Collier Jr., Viola Dana, Marion Mack, Charles Lamont', 'NR', 'A series about the life, career and works of the movie comedy genius.', 'A series about the life, career and works of the movie comedy genius.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sKlU5jCHKhP8v3wk7VjbLOXrFef.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42549'),
  ('1030798431139797499', 'Butareba -The Story of a Man Turned Into a Pig-', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Tomori Kusunoki', 'TV-14', 'I am a dull otaku who lost consciousness after eating raw pork liver. When I awoke, it seemed that I had been reincarnated into another world... but I had also become a pig! As I was rolling around in a pigsty covered in mud, Jess, a kind, angelic, beautiful girl, came to my rescue. "Oink!!" "Um, you don''t have to force yourself to talk. I''m able to... understand you." This girl who was devotedly caring after my pig-self was a member of the Yethma, and her people have the ability to read minds. "This is bad! That means she can see through all of my lustful delusions!" Now in Mesteria, a world run by swords and magic, a pig and a mind-reading beauty set off on their lovey-dovey fantasy adventure! ... Or do they?', 'I am a dull otaku who lost consciousness after eating raw pork liver. When I awoke, it seemed that I had been reincarnated into another world... but I had also become a pig! As I was rolling around in a pigsty covered in mud, Jess, a kind, angelic, beautiful girl, came to my rescue. "Oink!!" "Um, you don''t have to force yourself to talk. I''m able to... understand you." This girl who was devotedly caring after my pig-self was a member of the Yethma, and her people have the ability to read minds. "This is bad! That means she can see through all of my lustful delusions!" Now in Mesteria, a world run by swords and magic, a pig and a mind-reading beauty set off on their lovey-dovey fantasy adventure! ... Or do they?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qEyV0cNIjjRuu8kTmjWu5N9cU5r.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:153336'),
  ('650149066634848058', 'Butt Detective', 2018, 'Animation, Kids', null, 'Natsuko Takahashi', 'Yuko Sanpei, Ayaka Saito, Takahiro Sakurai, Ikkei Watanabe, Takayuki Sugo, Reika Uyama', null, 'A polite and meticulous super sleuth known as the Butt Detective solves a myriad of baffling mysteries, blowing raspberries in the face of crime.', 'A polite and meticulous super sleuth known as the Butt Detective solves a myriad of baffling mysteries, blowing raspberries in the face of crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iviuqq0gha1pFeXs8luPmptioXQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96117'),
  ('691761723598202366', 'Butterflies', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Carla Lane', null, 'Wendy Craig, Geoffrey Palmer, Nicholas Lyndhurst, Andrew Hall, Bruce Montague, Michael Ripper, Joyce Windsor, Brian Murphy', 'TV-PG', 'Ria Parkinson is a bored housewife and mother. She spends her time daydreaming, and meets regularly with wealthy businessman Leonard to relieve the monotony. Husband Ben, a dentist and avid butterfly collector is oblivious to it all, and her unemployed grown up sons, who both live at home also have other things on their minds, especially girlfriends.', 'Ria Parkinson is a bored housewife and mother. She spends her time daydreaming, and meets regularly with wealthy businessman Leonard to relieve the monotony. Husband Ben, a dentist and avid butterfly collector is oblivious to it all, and her unemployed grown up sons, who both live at home also have other things on their minds, especially girlfriends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AjzWayWHnSNt61JWwCfROpEq5tF.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2248'),
  ('743660497335863613', 'Butterfly', 2018, 'Drama', 'Tony Marchant', null, 'Emmett J. Scanlan, Callum Booth-Ford, Anna Friel, Lorraine Burroughs, Millie Gibson, Alison Steadman, Sean McGinley, Amy Huberman', null, 'From a young age, 11-year-old, Max, has identified as a girl and as puberty looms, she begins to present increasing signs of gender variance. When Max was eight, her father, Stephen, left the family home. But as Max’s conviction that she’s in the wrong body intensifies, her distress escalates, and Stephen seizes the opportunity to return to live at the family home and support his daughter.', 'From a young age, 11-year-old, Max, has identified as a girl and as puberty looms, she begins to present increasing signs of gender variance. When Max was eight, her father, Stephen, left the family home. But as Max’s conviction that she’s in the wrong body intensifies, her distress escalates, and Stephen seizes the opportunity to return to live at the family home and support his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ib11vnb6oVgHOgZb8R9HEVxaouI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83244'),
  ('990499128441004311', 'Butterfly', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Steph Cha, Ken Woodruff', 'Ashley Darnall, Mason Hsieh, Aaron Lam', 'Daniel Dae Kim, Reina Hardesty, Kim Ji-hoon, Piper Perabo, Louis Landau, Kim Tae-hee, Sean Dulake, Charles Parnell', 'TV-MA', 'David Jung, a mysterious former US intelligence operative living in hiding in South Korea, has his life blown to pieces when the consequences of an impossible decision from his past come back to haunt him, and he finds himself hunted by Rebecca, a deadly young assassin, and Caddis, the sinister spy organization she works for.', 'David Jung, a mysterious former US intelligence operative living in hiding in South Korea, has his life blown to pieces when the consequences of an impossible decision from his past come back to haunt him, and he finds himself hunted by Rebecca, a deadly young assassin, and Caddis, the sinister spy organization she works for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8x1W0TR2VIe7ORaRI9zwDqeJn9q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:227114'),
  ('19051440164924001', 'Button Moon', 1980, 'Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ian Allen', null, null, null, 'Button Moon is a quirky, popular children''s television programme broadcast in the United Kingdom in the 1980s on the ITV Network. Thames Television produced each episode, which lasted ten minutes and featured the adventures of Mr. Spoon who, in each episode, travels to Button Moon in his homemade rocket-ship. All of the characters within the show are based on kitchen utensils, as well as many of the props. Once on Button Moon, which hangs in "blanket sky", they have an adventure, and look through Mr. Spoon''s telescope at someone else such as the Hare and the Tortoise, before heading back to their home on ''Junk Planet''. Episodes also include Mr. Spoon''s wife, "Mrs. Spoon", their daughter, "Tina Tea-Spoon" and her friend "Eggbert". The series ended in 1988 after 91 episodes.', 'Button Moon is a quirky, popular children''s television programme broadcast in the United Kingdom in the 1980s on the ITV Network. Thames Television produced each episode, which lasted ten minutes and featured the adventures of Mr. Spoon who, in each episode, travels to Button Moon in his homemade rocket-ship. All of the characters within the show are based on kitchen utensils, as well as many of the props. Once on Button Moon, which hangs in "blanket sky", they have an adventure, and look through Mr. Spoon''s telescope at someone else such as the Hare and the Tortoise, before heading back to their home on ''Junk Planet''. Episodes also include Mr. Spoon''s wife, "Mrs. Spoon", their daughter, "Tina Tea-Spoon" and her friend "Eggbert". The series ended in 1988 after 91 episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWqE6vxODJqvWWPQKgwb4cyK9hc.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:1206'),
  ('1020465223123019645', 'Buying Beverly Hills', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Mauricio Umansky, Alexia Umansky, Farrah Aldjufrie, Ben Belack, Joey Ben-Zvi, Melissa Platt, Jon Grauman, Brandon Graves', null, 'Mauricio Umansky''s family-run firm The Agency represents some of the most lavish properties in Beverly Hills. But there''s drama around every corner.', 'Mauricio Umansky''s family-run firm The Agency represents some of the most lavish properties in Beverly Hills. But there''s drama around every corner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8LmR7E020KAKNPJr1mXnuUKZQUK.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:212060'),
  ('879171410741058338', 'Buzz Lightyear of Star Command', 2000, 'Kids, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Mark McCorkle, Bob Schooley', null, 'Patrick Warburton, Nicole Sullivan, Stephen Furst', 'TV-Y7', 'Buzz Lightyear’s adventures as he patrols the galaxy with his team of Space Rangers, battling evildoers “to infinity and beyond.”', 'Buzz Lightyear’s adventures as he patrols the galaxy with his team of Space Rangers, battling evildoers “to infinity and beyond.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jxxwtAbfG4es0rWOUQ5NFJ354nH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3744'),
  ('68049472000772951', 'Buzzer Beat', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Tomohisa Yamashita, Keiko Kitagawa, Saki Aibu, Nobuaki Kaneko, Hideaki Ito, Shihori Kanjiya, Junpei Mizobata, Miki Maya', null, 'Buzzer Beat is a Fuji TV Japanese television drama, which stars Yamashita Tomohisa, Keiko Kitagawa, and Aibu Saki. The series primarily focuses on two characters, Naoki Kamiya, a professional basketball player, and Riko Shirakawa, an aspiring violinist. Over the course of the series Naoki faces difficulties trying to succeed in the world of basketball, and Riko struggles to become a successful violinist. Eventually the two meet and the series chronicles their relationship and struggles, as well as those of their friends.', 'Buzzer Beat is a Fuji TV Japanese television drama, which stars Yamashita Tomohisa, Keiko Kitagawa, and Aibu Saki. The series primarily focuses on two characters, Naoki Kamiya, a professional basketball player, and Riko Shirakawa, an aspiring violinist. Over the course of the series Naoki faces difficulties trying to succeed in the world of basketball, and Riko struggles to become a successful violinist. Eventually the two meet and the series chronicles their relationship and struggles, as well as those of their friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tN4g0Y4AnrJlkWKfU65acMhkszn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21674'),
  ('744978555171283930', 'Buzzfeed Unsolved: Supernatural', 2016, 'Documentary, Mystery, Talk', 'Ryan Bergara', null, 'Shane Madej, Ryan Bergara', null, 'Ryan Bergara (a believer in the supernatural) and Shane Madej (a skeptic) travel to alleged haunted locations to investigate paranormal activity.', 'Ryan Bergara (a believer in the supernatural) and Shane Madej (a skeptic) travel to alleged haunted locations to investigate paranormal activity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtlllYYarRVkUSd8tkBwfMDyGUe.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:80044'),
