  ('835002352057495479', 'C.H.U.E.C.O', 2023, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Pato Alvarado Loza, María Eugenia Rigón', 'TV-PG', 'A widower and father of three is on the verge of ruin, but he inherits an unexpected fortune from his uncle. But the money comes with one condition: that his family takes care of Chueco, an adult chimpanzee who has a huge secret: he can talk. Hiding this won''t be easy, because the chimpanzee never shuts up and will get the family in all sorts of trouble.', 'A widower and father of three is on the verge of ruin, but he inherits an unexpected fortune from his uncle. But the money comes with one condition: that his family takes care of Chueco, an adult chimpanzee who has a huge secret: he can talk. Hiding this won''t be easy, because the chimpanzee never shuts up and will get the family in all sorts of trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gWTd0ustqZ8Wp4EpuAM1pmCvG4b.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:155683'),
  ('318975044369677240', 'C.I.D.', 1998, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Brijendra Pal Singh', null, 'Shivaji Satham, Aditya Srivastava, Dayanand Shetty, Narendra Gupta, Ansha Sayed, Hrishikesh Pandey, Ajay Nagrath, Parul Rai', 'TV-14', 'A team of dedicated men and women in the Crime Investigation Department will risk everything to solve Mumbai''s toughest, most complicated crimes.', 'A team of dedicated men and women in the Crime Investigation Department will risk everything to solve Mumbai''s toughest, most complicated crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UymnlLfLMKxG8OcFhSnAlnhQfZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:15226'),
  ('541340951566342602', 'C.O.P.S.', 1988, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Ken Ryan, John Stocker, Mary Long, Len Carlson, Ron Rubin, Marvin Goldhar, Michael Fantini, Dan Hennessey', 'NR', 'C.O.P.S. is an American animated television series released by DIC Entertainment and Celebrity Home Entertainment. This cartoon, which ran from 1988–1989, used the tag line: "Fighting crime in a future time, protecting Empire City from Big Boss and his gang of crooks". In 1993, the series was shown in reruns on CBS Saturday mornings as CyberCOPS, the name change due to the 1989 debut of the unrelated primetime reality show of the same name. The show was based on Hasbro''s 1988 line of action figures called C.O.P.S ''N'' Crooks.', 'C.O.P.S. is an American animated television series released by DIC Entertainment and Celebrity Home Entertainment. This cartoon, which ran from 1988–1989, used the tag line: "Fighting crime in a future time, protecting Empire City from Big Boss and his gang of crooks". In 1993, the series was shown in reruns on CBS Saturday mornings as CyberCOPS, the name change due to the 1989 debut of the unrelated primetime reality show of the same name. The show was based on Hasbro''s 1988 line of action figures called C.O.P.S ''N'' Crooks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ddJaAFQCHGxj8cIyhVcJMDiMROm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4265'),
  ('489420301960287959', 'C*A*U*G*H*T', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Kick Gurry', null, 'Ben O''Toole, Lincoln Younes, Alexander England, Bryan Brown, Kick Gurry, Mel Jarnson, Dorian Nkono, Fayssal Bazzi', null, 'Four Australian soldiers are sent on a secret mission to a war-torn country. Mistaken for Americans, they are captured by freedom fighters and produce a hostage video that goes viral. When the soldiers reach celebrity status, they realise that being caught might just be the best thing that could’ve happened to them.', 'Four Australian soldiers are sent on a secret mission to a war-torn country. Mistaken for Americans, they are captured by freedom fighters and produce a hostage video that goes viral. When the soldiers reach celebrity status, they realise that being caught might just be the best thing that could’ve happened to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3XoxZ6PhqsHTD3HbGNVhnGGMlZq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211465'),
  ('304941224286582554', 'C/o Segemyhr', 1998, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Johan Ulveson, Olle Sarri, Lennart Jähkel, Sussie Eriksson', null, 'c/o Segemyhr was a Swedish sitcom that premiered on TV4 Sweden on 4 September 1998. The series took place in and around an apartment in an exclusive neighbourhood in Stockholm, Artillerigatan 35 and later Styrmansgatan 52 in the same area. The series began with three seasons from fall 1998 to fall 1999, thereafter additionally two seasons were added in 2003–2004. All seasons have been released on DVD. Script writers were Fredrik Lindström och Erik Haag.', 'c/o Segemyhr was a Swedish sitcom that premiered on TV4 Sweden on 4 September 1998. The series took place in and around an apartment in an exclusive neighbourhood in Stockholm, Artillerigatan 35 and later Styrmansgatan 52 in the same area. The series began with three seasons from fall 1998 to fall 1999, thereafter additionally two seasons were added in 2003–2004. All seasons have been released on DVD. Script writers were Fredrik Lindström och Erik Haag.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTCLXxg0slj9DPYz9gku17S2V5e.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:34034'),
  ('1012903553486448680', 'C³ - CubexCursedxCurious', 2011, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Hazuki Minase', null, 'Yukari Tamura, Minori Chihara, Eri Kitamura, Yuki Kaji, Takuma Terashima, Kana Asumi, MAKO, Yui Ogura', 'TV-MA', 'A high school student named Yachi Haruaki receives a mysterious, super-heavy black cube from his father overseas. That night, Haruaki wakes up to a suspicious noise in the kitchen, and he discovers a fully naked female thief of rice crackers. The girl, Fear, is the first of several surprises that Haruaki receives.', 'A high school student named Yachi Haruaki receives a mysterious, super-heavy black cube from his father overseas. That night, Haruaki wakes up to a suspicious noise in the kitchen, and he discovers a fully naked female thief of rice crackers. The girl, Fear, is the first of several surprises that Haruaki receives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykN5y5EMM35cXMTg4noiWIvK0ML.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45954'),
  ('623706700797694006', 'Cabbage Your Life', 2026, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Song Jung-rim, Wang Hye-ji', 'Wang Hye-ji', 'Park Sung-woong, Lee Soo-kyung, Lee Jin-woo, Choi Gyu-ri, Lee Seo-hwan, Nam Mi-jung, Seo Yun-hyuk, Yang Woo-hyeok', null, 'When executive Seong Tae Hun is abruptly reassigned to the remote village of Yeonri‑ri, his family is thrown into rural chaos. Mi Ryeo struggles with farm life, Ji Cheon begins to rethink his future, and the wary village chief keeps his distance. As homesickness grows and tensions rise, the family must decide whether to endure—or find their way back home.', 'When executive Seong Tae Hun is abruptly reassigned to the remote village of Yeonri‑ri, his family is thrown into rural chaos. Mi Ryeo struggles with farm life, Ji Cheon begins to rethink his future, and the wary village chief keeps his distance. As homesickness grows and tensions rise, the family must decide whether to endure—or find their way back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kfqIu9HUbhbgNV2HDFdvGCce3VE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:311650'),
  ('1148090830365437113', 'Cable Girls', 2017, 'Drama', 'Gema R. Neira, Ramón Campos, Teresa Fernández-Valdés', null, 'Blanca Suárez, Yon González, Ana Fernández, Nadia de Santiago, Martiño Rivas, Ana Polvorosa, Nico Romero, Denisse Peña', 'TV-MA', 'In 1920s Madrid, four women at the National Telephone Company ring in revolution as they deal with romance, envy and the modern workplace.', 'In 1920s Madrid, four women at the National Telephone Company ring in revolution as they deal with romance, envy and the modern workplace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lAwLmgq1zy0xJnusszmvWTLjFlO.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:71225'),
  ('900241664051044817', 'Cabo', 2022, 'Soap, Drama', 'José Alberto Castro, Vanesa Varela', null, 'Bárbara de Regil, Matías Novoa, Eva Cedeño, María Chacón, Fabiola Campomanes, Rafael Inclán, Arlette Pacheco, Bárbara Torres', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fcZWtnEBvoP6BignOTCPuAPHp0t.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213049'),
  ('1112783129166191758', 'Cabocla', 2004, 'Soap, Drama, Comedy', 'Benedito Ruy Barbosa', 'Edmara Barbosa, Edilene Barbosa', 'Vanessa Giácomo, Daniel de Oliveira, Regiane Alves, Danton Mello, Patricia Pillar, Tony Ramos, Maria Flor, Eriberto Leão', null, 'Brasil República, 1918. Luís Jerônimo is a rich young man. Womanizer, spends all night on the street drinking and having fun with prostitutes, the boy finds out that he has an injury to his right lung. Advised by Edmundo Esteves, his doctor, he decides to spend a season at a cousin''s farm in the small town of Vila da Mata in Espírito Santo, in search of fresh air, to prevent the disease from developing into tuberculosis.', 'Brasil República, 1918. Luís Jerônimo is a rich young man. Womanizer, spends all night on the street drinking and having fun with prostitutes, the boy finds out that he has an injury to his right lung. Advised by Edmundo Esteves, his doctor, he decides to spend a season at a cousin''s farm in the small town of Vila da Mata in Espírito Santo, in search of fresh air, to prevent the disease from developing into tuberculosis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j7yfb5Rhxa702h434m8ppR7KlE6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42928'),
  ('56486837618935167', 'Cacau', 2024, 'Soap', 'Maria João Costa', null, 'Matilde Reymão, José Condessa, Alexandra Lencastre, António Capelo, Paulo Pires, Inês Castel-Branco, Fernanda Serrano, Diogo Amaral', null, 'Cacau is an engaging saga of family secrets, clandestine loves and sacrifices, all sweetened by the irresistible taste of chocolate and the magic of cocoa plantations.', 'Cacau is an engaging saga of family secrets, clandestine loves and sacrifices, all sweetened by the irresistible taste of chocolate and the magic of cocoa plantations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNCFBKZ68fmr008moWSzLdu2mUP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:242101'),
  ('149111613213278075', 'Cachito de Cielo', 2012, 'Drama', 'Mario Schajris', null, 'Pedro Fernández, Maite Perroni, Jorge Poza, Rafael Inclán, Esmeralda Pimentel, Azela Robinson, Cynthia Klitbo, Cecilia Gabriela', 'NR', 'The Argentine author Mario Schajris wrote Cachito de Cielo, a Mexican telenovela produced by Roberto Gomez Fernandez and Giselle Gonzalez for Televisa. The start of the story is based on the movies "Here Comes Mr. Jordan" and Heaven Can Wait, produced in 1941 and 1978. Maite Perroni and Pedro Fernández star as the protagonists, while Rafael Inclán, Jorge Poza, and Esmeralda Pimentel are antagonists.', 'The Argentine author Mario Schajris wrote Cachito de Cielo, a Mexican telenovela produced by Roberto Gomez Fernandez and Giselle Gonzalez for Televisa. The start of the story is based on the movies "Here Comes Mr. Jordan" and Heaven Can Wait, produced in 1941 and 1978. Maite Perroni and Pedro Fernández star as the protagonists, while Rafael Inclán, Jorge Poza, and Esmeralda Pimentel are antagonists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3n6DvphrJhpptwVf6ah4h8nErb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:54613'),
  ('351311194984324976', 'Cackling Kitarou', 1968, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Shigeru Mizuki', null, 'Masako Nozawa, Kosei Tomita, Isamu Tanonaka, Nana Yamaguchi, Chikao Ohtsuka, Keiko Yamamoto, Youko Ohkushi, Ichiro Nagai', null, 'Kitarou, a ghost, spends his afterlife helping humans in need of his skills. He thwarts the plans of evil spirits who live to torment humanity.', 'Kitarou, a ghost, spends his afterlife helping humans in need of his skills. He thwarts the plans of evil spirits who live to torment humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGPp9T881oULGpQHVjtKFmgGvzi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68236'),
  ('413334787777291964', 'Cackling Kitarou', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Shigeru Mizuki', null, 'Minami Takayama, Ai Nonaka, Bin Shimada, Chikao Ohtsuka, Daisuke Gori, Daisuke Kishio, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Eiji Takemoto', null, 'The classic tale of Gegege no Kitaro told yet again. The story is the usual in the Gegege no Kitaro series. Kitaro is a boy living in the Gegege Forest/Cemetery (lands where many Yokai roam) with his mostly dead father (who survives only in his eye), Sunakake Babaa, NekoMusume, and Konaki Jiji. One difference between this Kitaro and all of the others that came before him, is that this one has brown hair instead of the standard grayish silver.', 'The classic tale of Gegege no Kitaro told yet again. The story is the usual in the Gegege no Kitaro series. Kitaro is a boy living in the Gegege Forest/Cemetery (lands where many Yokai roam) with his mostly dead father (who survives only in his eye), Sunakake Babaa, NekoMusume, and Konaki Jiji. One difference between this Kitaro and all of the others that came before him, is that this one has brown hair instead of the standard grayish silver.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1oQI6xLEQbqJRrNcyFB0MxWKLuY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62068'),
  ('110175213862540620', 'Cadenas de amargura', 1991, 'Drama', 'Cuauhtémoc Blanco, María del Carmen Peña', null, 'Daniela Castro, Raúl Araiza, Diana Bracho, Delia Casanova, Fernando Luján, Cynthia Klitbo, Jorge Salinas, Tina Romero', 'NR', 'After her parents death, the little Cecilia is under the care of her aunts: Natalia and Evangelina. Evangelina is a cruel woman who doesn''t love the child and she treats her bad. Unlike Evangelina, Natalia is good and will help Cecilia because she is her real mother. She was seduced and got pregnant by Padre Julio. Evangelina hates Padre Julio because in the past he preferred Natalia to her. Many years later, there is a problem, because Evangelina doesn''t want to give Cecilia money to attend the University. But Cecilia wins a grant and she can study now. She is engaged and wants to marry Giovanni, but Evangelina is against. She will poison him with a drink. Then Cecilia meets and falls in love with Gerardo, who is engaged to Sofia. Sofia''s parents are Marta and Armando. Armando returns home after abandoning his family for many years. Marta has a romance with Manuel, but Sofia and Armando are opposed. Ines and Renato, who are Gerardo''s parents, also are opposed to his romance with Cecilia. She breaks up the romance and goes to sor Angelina''s nunnery to become a nun. Sonia and Roberto try to separate Gerardo from Cecilia. Then Cecilia finds out the truth about her birth and meets padre Julio. Natalia discovers that Evangelina tries to appropriate the whole patrimony of Cecilia and Evangelina kills her.', 'After her parents death, the little Cecilia is under the care of her aunts: Natalia and Evangelina. Evangelina is a cruel woman who doesn''t love the child and she treats her bad. Unlike Evangelina, Natalia is good and will help Cecilia because she is her real mother. She was seduced and got pregnant by Padre Julio. Evangelina hates Padre Julio because in the past he preferred Natalia to her. Many years later, there is a problem, because Evangelina doesn''t want to give Cecilia money to attend the University. But Cecilia wins a grant and she can study now. She is engaged and wants to marry Giovanni, but Evangelina is against. She will poison him with a drink. Then Cecilia meets and falls in love with Gerardo, who is engaged to Sofia. Sofia''s parents are Marta and Armando. Armando returns home after abandoning his family for many years. Marta has a romance with Manuel, but Sofia and Armando are opposed. Ines and Renato, who are Gerardo''s parents, also are opposed to his romance with Cecilia. She breaks up the romance and goes to sor Angelina''s nunnery to become a nun. Sonia and Roberto try to separate Gerardo from Cecilia. Then Cecilia finds out the truth about her birth and meets padre Julio. Natalia discovers that Evangelina tries to appropriate the whole patrimony of Cecilia and Evangelina kills her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2F4aojsspbSmRn4HvazL4XvMzK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60638'),
  ('851491030639161071', 'Cadetship', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Vyacheslav Murugov', 'Artem Loginov, Vyacheslav Murugov, Leonid Kuprido', 'Aleksandr Golovin, Boris Korchevnikov, Artur Sopelnik, Aristarkh Venes, Kirill Emelyanov, Vadim Andreyev, Vladimir Steklov, Sergey Jolobov', null, 'Boys of fourteen years old find themselves in the Suvorov school – someone thanks to family tradition, someone for the sake of high ideals, and someone not even of their own free will. Having entered Suvorovskoye, the guys at first do not represent the full extent of the load, and most importantly, the responsibility that will have a profound impact on their subsequent life.', 'Boys of fourteen years old find themselves in the Suvorov school – someone thanks to family tradition, someone for the sake of high ideals, and someone not even of their own free will. Having entered Suvorovskoye, the guys at first do not represent the full extent of the load, and most importantly, the responsibility that will have a profound impact on their subsequent life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/CNQ7c5btvWHBxMqlKD7fepximH.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:86745'),
  ('366346085879182216', 'Cadfael', 1994, 'Drama, Crime', 'Edith Pargeter', null, 'Derek Jacobi, Terrence Hardiman, Michael Culver, Julian Firth, Anthony Green', null, 'Brother Cadfael is a twelfth-century Anglo-Welsh monk. A retired crusader disappointed in love, and now a herbalist in charge of the gardens of Shrewsbury Abbey, Brother Cadfael is often called on to solve murders and other crimes in and around Shrewsbury, Shropshire, in the border country where England meets Wales.', 'Brother Cadfael is a twelfth-century Anglo-Welsh monk. A retired crusader disappointed in love, and now a herbalist in charge of the gardens of Shrewsbury Abbey, Brother Cadfael is often called on to solve murders and other crimes in and around Shrewsbury, Shropshire, in the border country where England meets Wales.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZUCGw4DOJZXMVcPnoUQi7cfY3n.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:35942'),
  ('174683461302670919', 'Cadillacs and Dinosaurs', 1993, 'Family, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Steven E. de Souza', null, 'Susan Roman, David Keeley, Colin O''Meara, David Fox, Dawn Greenhalgh, Don Dickinson, Don Francks, Frank Pellegrino', 'TV-Y', 'The adventures of the human survivors in a future dinosaur dominated world.', 'The adventures of the human survivors in a future dinosaur dominated world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/drY1NOlI4LEa8tCTBcYRyuOfXwx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16814'),
  ('237046125099695658', 'Café com Aroma de Mulher', 1994, 'Drama, Family, Reality', 'Fernando Gaitán', 'Fernando Gaitán', 'Silvia de Dios, Cristóbal Errazúriz, Alejandra Borrero, Margarita Rosa de Francisco, Guy Ecker, Danna García', 'NR', 'Café con aroma de mujer is a 1994 Colombian telenovela, produced by then programming company RCN TV on state-owned Canal A. It was written and created by Fernando Gaitán. It was broadcast in several countries throughout Latin America, North America and Europe.', 'Café con aroma de mujer is a 1994 Colombian telenovela, produced by then programming company RCN TV on state-owned Canal A. It was written and created by Fernando Gaitán. It was broadcast in several countries throughout Latin America, North America and Europe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/51sT2YMf3lmJpFLcYUfpFA0prgc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16961'),
  ('193118234610557800', 'Café De Mol', 2018, 'Reality, Talk', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPjMEXzRrsucwEp9e5W1PKvdy3S.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:195010'),
  ('632866474745139938', 'Café Minamdang', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery, Comedy', 'Ko Jae-hyun', 'Park Hye-jin', 'Seo In-guk, Oh Yeon-seo, Kwak Si-yang, Kang Mi-na, Kwon Soo-hyun, Jeong Man-sik, Baek Seo-hoo, Jung Eun-pyo', null, 'A suspicious business that offers the services of a purportedly all-knowing shaman catches the attention of a tenacious police inspector.', 'A suspicious business that offers the services of a purportedly all-knowing shaman catches the attention of a tenacious police inspector.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZNH25kfQZiznN6xmogrdwHnzss.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138663'),
  ('810756415786242899', 'Cagaster of an Insect Cage', 2020, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Yoshimasa Hosoya, Kana Hanazawa, Natsuki Hanae, Takahiro Sakurai, Daisuke Namikawa, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Kazuyuki Okitsu, Junichi Suwabe', 'TV-14', 'At the end of the 21st century, a rare disease called “Cagaster” broke out, turning humans into huge insects. Two-thirds of the earth‘s population was devoured by these insects before humanity made a decision: they must exterminate the infected people. In the year 2125 – thirty years after the discovery of Cagaster – at the edge of the desert close to the “cage” of the insects, a young pest exterminator named Kidou finds a man close to death due to the wounds by insects. The man entrusts his daughter Ilie to Kidou and asks him to search for the girl‘s mother…', 'At the end of the 21st century, a rare disease called “Cagaster” broke out, turning humans into huge insects. Two-thirds of the earth‘s population was devoured by these insects before humanity made a decision: they must exterminate the infected people. In the year 2125 – thirty years after the discovery of Cagaster – at the edge of the desert close to the “cage” of the insects, a young pest exterminator named Kidou finds a man close to death due to the wounds by insects. The man entrusts his daughter Ilie to Kidou and asks him to search for the girl‘s mother…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yOIixxFPbfcGytrcYdRrC9Y1bT5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94795'),
  ('59092753545714439', 'Caged Again', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Benjamin Greenwell, Sorathon Chaloemlapsombut, Jiraphat Sodjam, Chinnawat Phattharathanachot, Chotipat Suthadsanasoung, Rasika Saisang, Sappanyoo Panatkool, Apiwat Apiwatsayree', null, 'Trapped in a mysterious school, a runaway penguin forms a dangerous bond with a panther whose primal hunger awakens every time they''re close.', 'Trapped in a mysterious school, a runaway penguin forms a dangerous bond with a panther whose primal hunger awakens every time they''re close.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9p4JiqLbiu4Zuwb7UOWnmwwMKx9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:242682'),
  ('1048082471044723308', 'Cagney & Lacey', 1982, 'Crime, Drama', 'Barbara Corday, Barbara Avedon', null, 'Tyne Daly, Sharon Gless, John Karlen, Al Waxman, Martin Kove, Harvey Atkin', null, 'Mary Beth Lacey and Chris Cagney are teamed up as NYPD police detectives. Their opposing personalities (one is tough and the other sensitive) mesh to make this one of the great crime-fighting duos of all time.', 'Mary Beth Lacey and Chris Cagney are teamed up as NYPD police detectives. Their opposing personalities (one is tough and the other sensitive) mesh to make this one of the great crime-fighting duos of all time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bAdrchPABFuHK44G3dKXXRIIRiH.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:4223'),
  ('548247025040617373', 'Caillou', 1997, 'Animation, Family, Kids', 'Christine L''Heureux, Hélène Desputeaux', null, 'Claudia-Laurie Corbeil, Violette Chauveau, Nathalie Coupal, Gilbert Lachance, Mario Desmarais, Johanne Garneau, Hugolin Chevrette, Ellen David', 'TV-Y', 'Follow Caillou, the lovable 4-year-old with a big imagination, as he and his friends go on adventures and experience all the wonders of being a child.', 'Follow Caillou, the lovable 4-year-old with a big imagination, as he and his friends go on adventures and experience all the wonders of being a child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/86fn0dy8u6vVa2KahZEkc31msm4.jpg', 23, 'tmdb:tv:3218'),
  ('418307508675447982', 'Cain', 2012, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Alexis Le Sec, Bertrand Arthuys', null, 'Davy Sanna, Julie Delarme, Frédéric Pellegeay, Smadi Wolfman, Mourad Boudaoud, Anne Suarez, Sara Martins, Natacha Krief', 'TV-14', 'A cynical experienced homicide detective based in Marseilles, France is crippled in the line of duty and depends on a wheelchair to get around. He is accompanied by a young ,vivacious female detective who''s been forced on him to train as a condition of his ability to continue to work as a field detective.', 'A cynical experienced homicide detective based in Marseilles, France is crippled in the line of duty and depends on a wheelchair to get around. He is accompanied by a young ,vivacious female detective who''s been forced on him to train as a condition of his ability to continue to work as a field detective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sR57VPV9FiHjXKkuAnZTbRHo25Z.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:61794'),
  ('573416586328308708', 'Cain and Abel', 2009, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, 'Park Kye-ok', 'So Ji-sub, Shin Hyun-jun, Han Ji-min, Chae Jung-an, Song Jong-ho, Kim Yoo-jung, Ahn Nae-sang, Park Sung-woong', null, 'Gifted doctor Cho-in leads a charmed life while his older brother Seon-woo seethes with jealousy in this series inspired by Biblical characters.', 'Gifted doctor Cho-in leads a charmed life while his older brother Seon-woo seethes with jealousy in this series inspired by Biblical characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQvqyjzAxr1keTgMLjIYBEjBAnn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38971'),
  ('513603733158340133', 'Cain''s Father', 2016, 'Drama, Crime', 'Salvador Calvo', 'Rafael Vera', 'Quim Gutiérrez, Patxi Freytez, Aura Garrido, Luis Bermejo, Cristina Plazas, Mariano Venancio, Oona Chaplin, Luis Zahera', null, 'The Basque Country, Spain, 1980s. In an atmosphere of tension and fear, where the harassment of separatist nationalism and the violence of ETA terrorist gang are a constant in life, Eloy, a young civil guard from Madrid, arrives at the Intxaurrondo base, in San Sebastián, as a volunteer; a hostile environment that causes havoc among his companions: alcoholism, depression and suicides reign. The so-called “Northern Syndrome” kills as much as bombs do.', 'The Basque Country, Spain, 1980s. In an atmosphere of tension and fear, where the harassment of separatist nationalism and the violence of ETA terrorist gang are a constant in life, Eloy, a young civil guard from Madrid, arrives at the Intxaurrondo base, in San Sebastián, as a volunteer; a hostile environment that causes havoc among his companions: alcoholism, depression and suicides reign. The so-called “Northern Syndrome” kills as much as bombs do.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgcd66DVp27XCLoset2lSfHPFhO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69057'),
  ('166563311762565587', 'Cain''s Hundred', 1961, 'Drama', 'Paul Monash', null, 'Peter Mark Richman', null, 'A former underworld lawyer goes to work for the Federal Government, determined to bring 100 top criminals to justice.', 'A former underworld lawyer goes to work for the Federal Government, determined to bring 100 top criminals to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gF52PA0wga7Cl5VWcjZ3wVVYTg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:383'),
  ('119410316539102948', 'Cake', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'A handcrafted assortment of bite-sized content served up to viewers as a tasty treat for the mind. Featuring a diverse array of narratives from storytellers both new and established, this carefully curated half-hour weekly showcase features both live-action and animated comedy programs of varied length that are equal parts thought-provoking, laugh-inducing, artistic, authentic and raw. (Not to mention, totally gif-able!)', 'A handcrafted assortment of bite-sized content served up to viewers as a tasty treat for the mind. Featuring a diverse array of narratives from storytellers both new and established, this carefully curated half-hour weekly showcase features both live-action and animated comedy programs of varied length that are equal parts thought-provoking, laugh-inducing, artistic, authentic and raw. (Not to mention, totally gif-able!)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQKFnUT8olc2HQLO6pmuLpCMyd1.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:93035'),
  ('117983341420395909', 'Cake Boss', 2009, 'Reality, Family', null, null, 'Buddy Valastro', 'TV-PG', 'Follows the operations of Carlo''s Bakery, a family-owned business in Hoboken, New Jersey owned and operated by siblings Buddy Valastro, Lisa Valastro, Maddalena Castano, Grace Faugno and Mary Sciarrone. The show focuses on how they make their cakes, and the interpersonal relationships among the various family members and other employees who work at the shop.', 'Follows the operations of Carlo''s Bakery, a family-owned business in Hoboken, New Jersey owned and operated by siblings Buddy Valastro, Lisa Valastro, Maddalena Castano, Grace Faugno and Mary Sciarrone. The show focuses on how they make their cakes, and the interpersonal relationships among the various family members and other employees who work at the shop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9OkrZDHC23Q8xc2dKX0yVJDjnLt.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:18664'),
  ('1039224772677234512', 'Calabash Brothers', 1986, 'Animation, Kids', 'Zhongli Yao, 墨犊, 杨玉良', null, 'Yu Ding, Zhan Che, Fan Jie, Ni Yilin, Zhu Sha, 戴欣', 'TV-PG', 'Calabash Brothers is a Chinese animation TV series produced by Shanghai Animation Film Studio. It is also referred to as Bottle Gourd Brothers, Hulu Brothers, Seven Brothers and Pumpkin Brothers. In China, the series is popularly known as Huluwa.', 'Calabash Brothers is a Chinese animation TV series produced by Shanghai Animation Film Studio. It is also referred to as Bottle Gourd Brothers, Hulu Brothers, Seven Brothers and Pumpkin Brothers. In China, the series is popularly known as Huluwa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvcazlLfe8jg27chKzISdCP0KWB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1319'),
  ('405101135860689044', 'California Dreams', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Brett Dewey, Ronald B. Solomon', null, 'Kelly Packard, Jay Anthony Franke, William James Jones, Michael Cade, Jennie Kwan, Aaron Jackson, Diana Uribe', 'TV-Y7', 'A bunch of cool teenagers who are friends living in California form a rock band, The Dreams. Between gigs, they must deal with all kinds of big and small real-life issues such as school, family life, friends, romance, ambition, ego, jealousy, and big decisions.', 'A bunch of cool teenagers who are friends living in California form a rock band, The Dreams. Between gigs, they must deal with all kinds of big and small real-life issues such as school, family life, friends, romance, ambition, ego, jealousy, and big decisions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m2pFSd4HkkTOwVoBj6ticBCwOLJ.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:257'),
  ('837045617448931464', 'Californication', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tom Kapinos', null, 'David Duchovny, Natascha McElhone, Evan Handler, Pamela Adlon', 'TV-MA', 'A self-loathing, alcoholic writer attempts to repair his damaged relationships with his daughter and her mother while combating sex addiction, a budding drug problem, and the seeming inability to avoid making bad decisions.', 'A self-loathing, alcoholic writer attempts to repair his damaged relationships with his daughter and her mother while combating sex addiction, a budding drug problem, and the seeming inability to avoid making bad decisions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPqOY8cq9KXQN4bD7zJGHCNvcb4.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:1215'),
  ('797379684965010184', 'Caligula', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Chiharu Sawashiro, Minami Tanaka, Rie Murakawa, Yuuichirou Umehara, Mai Fuchigami, Ari Ozawa, Reina Ueda, Shunsuke Takeuchi', null, 'Mobius is a perfect digital world for the imagined benefit of humanity by μ, a virtual idol program that attained sentience and self-awareness. Only humans who are suffering in the real world and strongly relate to μ''s songs are lured into Mobius. Once they enter, people often forget that the real world exists. Regardless of age or gender, they are turned into students and forced to experience school life over and over, which μ considers "the most radiant time in a person''s life."', 'Mobius is a perfect digital world for the imagined benefit of humanity by μ, a virtual idol program that attained sentience and self-awareness. Only humans who are suffering in the real world and strongly relate to μ''s songs are lured into Mobius. Once they enter, people often forget that the real world exists. Regardless of age or gender, they are turned into students and forced to experience school life over and over, which μ considers "the most radiant time in a person''s life."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epAhPqfiRoyIxeNpldQ6bZ1YZuO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77722'),
  ('1026610135750180097', 'Calimero', 1974, 'Animation, Family, Kids', 'Nino Pagot, Toni Pagot', null, 'Katsue Miwa, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Masako Nozawa, Sachiko Chijimatsu, Kenichi Ogata, Joji Yanami, Michiko Nomura', null, 'Calimero is an Italian/Japanese cartoon about a charming, but hapless anthropomorphized cartoon chicken; the only black one in a family of yellow chickens. He wears half of his egg shell still on his head. Calimero originally appeared on the Italian television show Carosello on July 14, 1963, and soon became a popular icon in Italy. The characters were later licensed in Japan as an anime series, twice. The first was made by Toei Animation and ran from October 15, 1974 to September 30, 1975, and the second, with new settings and characters, was made in 1992. Altogether, 99 Japanese episodes were made. The series mostly consists of the many adventures of Calimero and his friends as they solve mysteries and make documentaries. However, their adventures usually get them into quite a bit of trouble. The first series was also broadcast on European networks such as TROS, ZDF and RTL II or TVE.', 'Calimero is an Italian/Japanese cartoon about a charming, but hapless anthropomorphized cartoon chicken; the only black one in a family of yellow chickens. He wears half of his egg shell still on his head. Calimero originally appeared on the Italian television show Carosello on July 14, 1963, and soon became a popular icon in Italy. The characters were later licensed in Japan as an anime series, twice. The first was made by Toei Animation and ran from October 15, 1974 to September 30, 1975, and the second, with new settings and characters, was made in 1992. Altogether, 99 Japanese episodes were made. The series mostly consists of the many adventures of Calimero and his friends as they solve mysteries and make documentaries. However, their adventures usually get them into quite a bit of trouble. The first series was also broadcast on European networks such as TROS, ZDF and RTL II or TVE.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/arGrH3uEpW2DonslsBfyUzboyEP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:20959'),
  ('809314112775437344', 'Caliphate', 2020, 'War & Politics, Drama', 'Niklas Rockström, Wilhelm Berhman', 'Wilhelm Behrman, Niklas Rockström', 'Gizem Erdogan, Amed Bozan, Aliette Opheim, Arvin Kananian, Amanda Sohrabi, Lancelot Ncube, Albin Grenholm, Nora Rios', 'TV-MA', 'National Security agent Fatima receives a tip that a terrorist attack against Sweden is in the planning stage. Meanwhile Sulle, a teenage girl in Stockholm, gets interested in her student assistant who opens doors to a new and fascinating world - the true path. Kalifat is a thriller about the intermingled fates of five young women who get caught up in the seducing and destroying force of religious fundamentalism.', 'National Security agent Fatima receives a tip that a terrorist attack against Sweden is in the planning stage. Meanwhile Sulle, a teenage girl in Stockholm, gets interested in her student assistant who opens doors to a new and fascinating world - the true path. Kalifat is a thriller about the intermingled fates of five young women who get caught up in the seducing and destroying force of religious fundamentalism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HF7rBN0deZ9SjZks5YslH7ha5c.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92891'),
  ('422232133435240195', 'Call Center', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', 'Alexey Chupov, Natalya Merkulova', null, 'Vladimir Yaglych, Pavel Tabakov, Yuliya Khlynina, Anatoliy Belyy, Sabina Akhmedova, Nikita Tarasov, Madlen Dzhabrailova, Askar Nigamedzyanov', null, 'Moscow. High rise. Here, on the 12th floor, is the office of the call center "Online Store for Adults". One morning, twelve people who are in the office suddenly find out that there is a bomb in the room. The voices of the unknowns who introduced themselves as Dad and Mom threaten to blow it up at any time if the hostages do not follow their instructions. While the countdown is going on, they will have to experience the absolute power of invisible sadists and learn something about each other’s life that they did not even suspect.', 'Moscow. High rise. Here, on the 12th floor, is the office of the call center "Online Store for Adults". One morning, twelve people who are in the office suddenly find out that there is a bomb in the room. The voices of the unknowns who introduced themselves as Dad and Mom threaten to blow it up at any time if the hostages do not follow their instructions. While the countdown is going on, they will have to experience the absolute power of invisible sadists and learn something about each other’s life that they did not even suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDfbrxJlsYMtFkdBh01GFZhkOdY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100867'),
  ('236303605441780488', 'Call DiCaprio!', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Zhora Kryzhovnikov', 'Aleksey Karaulov, Petr Vnukov, Vladislava Amangeldyeva', 'Alexander Petrov, Andrey Burkovskiy, Yuliya Aleksandrova, Yuliya Khlynina, Aleksandra Revenko, Anna Nevskaya, Sergey Lavygin, Anna Khilkevich', null, 'The main character is the star of a popular TV series about doctors, actor Yegor Rumyantsev. Having achieved great success, he becomes an egoist and does not notice the feelings and experiences of those around him: he does not come to the shooting, leads a promiscuous sex life and deceives people. One day, Egor finds out that he has HIV. Rumyantsev''s brother Lev is a mediocre and unlucky actor who runs a program about useful handicrafts on the cable channel "Ant-TV". Leo has a pregnant wife with two young daughters. He has no prospects for making money and moving up the career ladder until he gets a chance to replace his brother Yegor in the series.', 'The main character is the star of a popular TV series about doctors, actor Yegor Rumyantsev. Having achieved great success, he becomes an egoist and does not notice the feelings and experiences of those around him: he does not come to the shooting, leads a promiscuous sex life and deceives people. One day, Egor finds out that he has HIV. Rumyantsev''s brother Lev is a mediocre and unlucky actor who runs a program about useful handicrafts on the cable channel "Ant-TV". Leo has a pregnant wife with two young daughters. He has no prospects for making money and moving up the career ladder until he gets a chance to replace his brother Yegor in the series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sLqNqAt9sLg3llcJ5YitKZDLlix.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83344'),
  ('984524342714668307', 'Call It Love', 2023, 'Drama', 'Lee Gwang-young, Kim Eun-ji', 'Kim Ga-eun', 'Kim Young-kwang, Lee Sung-kyung, Sung Joon, Hani, Kim Ye-won, Jang Seong-beom, Jun Suk-ho, Nam Kee-ae', null, 'When her family becomes suddenly homeless, Woojoo decides on revenge for all the injustices she has been put through. However, her supposed foe, Dongjin, is a heart-wrenchingly lonely and gentle soul.', 'When her family becomes suddenly homeless, Woojoo decides on revenge for all the injustices she has been put through. However, her supposed foe, Dongjin, is a heart-wrenchingly lonely and gentle soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m7xiLb8mLyHHgThJICIPCsSq1qR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215471'),
  ('241027499982601390', 'Call Me Bruna', 2016, 'Drama', 'Márcia Faria', null, 'Maria Bopp, Susanna Kruger, Luciana Paes, Carla Ribas, Jonathan Haagensen, Nash Laila', 'NR', 'Raquel is a girl, adopted by an upper-middle-class family, who rebelled at 17 and left her family and studies at a traditional college in São Paulo to become a prostitute.', 'Raquel is a girl, adopted by an upper-middle-class family, who rebelled at 17 and left her family and studies at a traditional college in São Paulo to become a prostitute.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2uk9ve1OEOsdrVN3JwNcKgXOa8I.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:68202'),
  ('252532560425169588', 'Call Me By Fire', 2021, 'Reality', null, null, 'Jordan Chan Siu-Chun, Julian Cheung Chi-Lam, Nathan Lee, Zhang Yuan, Jerry Lamb Hiu-Fung, Max Zhang, MC Hotdog, Pakho Chau', null, 'The male version of Sisters Who Make Waves. The show focuses on breaking the limit plus challenging oneself, and opening up the long-lost dream of being in a boy band for the brothers. Regarding the competition system, after three months of live-in training & subject assessment, the winning team will finally be born and make their debut in a group.', 'The male version of Sisters Who Make Waves. The show focuses on breaking the limit plus challenging oneself, and opening up the long-lost dream of being in a boy band for the brothers. Regarding the competition system, after three months of live-in training & subject assessment, the winning team will finally be born and make their debut in a group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hB5wJgHi7g04zcTTn92bshEKkQ4.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:131040'),
  ('172769270860053399', 'Call Me Fitz', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Sheri Elwood', 'Sheri Elwood', 'Jason Priestley, Peter MacNeill, Donavon Stinson, Ernie Grunwald, Tracy Dawson, Husein Madhavji, Shaun Shetty, Kathleen Munroe', 'TV-MA', 'A morally bankrupt car salesman is forced to become business partners with his inner conscience, an off-beat do gooder intent on healing Fitz''s mangled psyche, one hilarious disaster at a time.', 'A morally bankrupt car salesman is forced to become business partners with his inner conscience, an off-beat do gooder intent on healing Fitz''s mangled psyche, one hilarious disaster at a time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9TObLC8ePjudI3xW6g3YW2APvWF.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:33059'),
  ('1071364571731686139', 'Call Me Kat', 2021, 'Comedy', null, 'Cody Wilkins, Benedict Chiu, Allison Jackson', 'Mayim Bialik, Kyla Pratt, Cheyenne Jackson, Swoosie Kurtz, Julian Gant', 'TV-14', 'Kat is a woman who struggles every day against society and her mother to prove that she can still live a happy and fulfilling life despite still being single at 39. Which is why she recently spent her entire savings to open a cat café in Louisville, Kentucky.', 'Kat is a woman who struggles every day against society and her mother to prove that she can still live a happy and fulfilling life despite still being single at 39. Which is why she recently spent her entire savings to open a cat café in Louisville, Kentucky.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eEwTV4Z397UgMlbJN3FQDdTOMpO.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:113627'),
  ('1076021792970930105', 'Call My Agent: Italy', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Lisa Nur Sultan', null, 'Michele Di Mauro, Marzia Ubaldi, Maurizio Lastrico, Emanuela Fanelli, Francesco Russo, Sara Lazzaro, Paola Buratto, Paola Gioia Kaze Formisano', null, 'Welcome behind the scenes of Italian show business from the point of view of those in charge of managing the careers - and lives - of the stars: the agents. Lea, Gabriele, Vittorio and Elvira are the soul of CMA and they give their souls to it, ready for anything to make their stars shine. Managers, friends, confidants and psychologists: a good agent is all that and more. And they, each with their own style, are the best. Between hectic days and mundane nights, it''s their personal lives that lose out -- but deep down they have too much fun to notice. With the departure of founder Claudio Maiorana, however, things will get a little more complicated.', 'Welcome behind the scenes of Italian show business from the point of view of those in charge of managing the careers - and lives - of the stars: the agents. Lea, Gabriele, Vittorio and Elvira are the soul of CMA and they give their souls to it, ready for anything to make their stars shine. Managers, friends, confidants and psychologists: a good agent is all that and more. And they, each with their own style, are the best. Between hectic days and mundane nights, it''s their personal lives that lose out -- but deep down they have too much fun to notice. With the departure of founder Claudio Maiorana, however, things will get a little more complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dH4UW5bYjC1vKdOmbTxUgD31Xew.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:218532'),
  ('839535371559573100', 'Call My Agent!', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Dominique Besnehard, Fanny Herrero', null, 'Camille Cottin, Thibault de Montalembert, Grégory Montel, Liliane Rovère, Laure Calamy, Nicolas Maury, Fanny Sidney, Stéfi Celma', 'TV-MA', 'At a top Paris talent firm, agents scramble to keep their star clients happy—and their business afloat—after an unexpected crisis.', 'At a top Paris talent firm, agents scramble to keep their star clients happy—and their business afloat—after an unexpected crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3whFzxzeKuTIgPzm2c0pm5xAhEL.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:64165'),
  ('536521610866244903', 'Call of the Night', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Gen Sato, Sora Amamiya', 'TV-14', 'Ko''s new companion, Nazuna, could offer him dark gifts and a vampire''s immortality. But there are conditions that Ko must meet before he can sink his teeth into vampirism, and he''ll discover just how far he''s willing to go to satisfy his desires.', 'Ko''s new companion, Nazuna, could offer him dark gifts and a vampire''s immortality. But there are conditions that Ko must meet before he can sink his teeth into vampirism, and he''ll discover just how far he''s willing to go to satisfy his desires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rDhwDG2ii8c3nCcfUNp6mogGQ93.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:138357'),
  ('295510910132766816', 'Call the Midwife', 2012, 'Drama', 'Heidi Thomas', 'Heidi Thomas', 'Vanessa Redgrave, Helen George, Jenny Agutter, Judy Parfitt, Cliff Parisi, Stephen McGann', 'TV-PG', 'Drama following the lives of a group of midwives working in the poverty-stricken East End of London during the 1950s, based on the best-selling memoirs of Jennifer Worth.', 'Drama following the lives of a group of midwives working in the poverty-stricken East End of London during the 1950s, based on the best-selling memoirs of Jennifer Worth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b1p0nL00x563ACkcmGNIRP4ZnkA.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:39793'),
  ('293974249337460704', 'Call Your Mother', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Kari Lizer', null, 'Kyra Sedgwick, Rachel Sennott, Joey Bragg, Patrick Brammall, Emma Caymares, Austin Crute', null, 'An empty-nester mom wonders how she ended up alone while her children live their best lives thousands of miles away. She decides her place is with her family and as she reinserts herself into their lives, her kids realize they might actually need her more than they thought.', 'An empty-nester mom wonders how she ended up alone while her children live their best lives thousands of miles away. She decides her place is with her family and as she reinserts herself into their lives, her kids realize they might actually need her more than they thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdtYChabx06Skimt3tIeMvmQgNK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:111260'),
