  ('37513681449323371', 'Calls', 2021, 'Mystery, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Fede Álvarez', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Interconnected phone conversations chronicle the mysterious story of a group of strangers whose lives are thrown into disarray in the lead-up to an apocalyptic event.', 'Interconnected phone conversations chronicle the mysterious story of a group of strangers whose lives are thrown into disarray in the lead-up to an apocalyptic event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvp8wW6wm6LulWRtjjeBQcVXMBt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:119934'),
  ('1075882601781214600', 'Camaleones', 2009, 'Comedy, Soap, Drama', 'Gustavo Barrios, Diana Segovia', 'Diana Segovia, Gustavo Barrios', 'Belinda, Alfonso Herrera, Edith González, Guillermo García Cantú, Sherlyn, Pee Wee, Manuel ''Flaco'' Ibáñez, Grettell Valdéz', null, 'Camaleones is a 2009/2010 Mexican telenovela produced by Televisa. The soap opera premiered on Mexico''s Canal de las Estrellas, replacing the completed TV series Verano de Amor. Camaleones is produced by Rosy Ocampo, who has produced several popular telenovelas, such as Amor sin Maquillaje, Las Tontas No Van al Cielo and La Fea Mas Bella. Filming took place in Mexico City and Xochitepec in June 2009, and lasted approximately 7 months. The telenovela premiered on Univision in the United States on May 4, 2010.', 'Camaleones is a 2009/2010 Mexican telenovela produced by Televisa. The soap opera premiered on Mexico''s Canal de las Estrellas, replacing the completed TV series Verano de Amor. Camaleones is produced by Rosy Ocampo, who has produced several popular telenovelas, such as Amor sin Maquillaje, Las Tontas No Van al Cielo and La Fea Mas Bella. Filming took place in Mexico City and Xochitepec in June 2009, and lasted approximately 7 months. The telenovela premiered on Univision in the United States on May 4, 2010.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h4lbcCbRx81EJ9VvoPebRn12goj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:18689'),
  ('171249076164312934', 'Cambridge Spies', 2003, 'Drama', 'Peter Moffat', 'Peter Moffat', 'Tom Hollander, Toby Stephens, Rupert Penry-Jones, Samuel West', null, 'In 1934, four brilliant Cambridge students are recruited to spy for Russia. Fueled by youthful idealism, a passion for social justice and a talent for lying, they take huge personal risks to pass Britain''s biggest secrets to Moscow.', 'In 1934, four brilliant Cambridge students are recruited to spy for Russia. Fueled by youthful idealism, a passion for social justice and a talent for lying, they take huge personal risks to pass Britain''s biggest secrets to Moscow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQ7nKa7s8ba9WTFFQXzQUa6yBMu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6200'),
  ('444229012686769918', 'Camden', 2024, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'This music documentary reveals how some of the world''s most iconic artists were shaped by this corner of London.', 'This music documentary reveals how some of the world''s most iconic artists were shaped by this corner of London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uuU3zaqThvbTzsCKL6b9L6QCh5K.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:246072'),
  ('828472498898196443', 'Camelot', 2011, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Michael Hirst, Chris Chibnall', null, 'Joseph Fiennes, Jamie Campbell Bower, Tamsin Egerton, Peter Mooney, Philip Winchester, Eva Green, Diarmaid Murtagh, Clive Standen', 'TV-MA', 'With King Uther''s sudden death, chaos threatens to engulf Britain. The sorcerer Merlin has visions of a dark future and installs young and impetuous Arthur, Uther''s unknown son and heir raised as a commoner, as the new king. The two install themselves in Castle Camelot with their allies, which include Arthur''s biological mother, his foster brother, and a quartet of loyal warriors. From Camelot, Arthur tries to build a new and better Britain, where people can live in peace. Meanwhile, Arthur''s cold half-sister Morgan plots to take the crown from him. Banished by Uther, who was responsible for her mother''s murder to put Arthur''s mother on the throne, Morgan is responsible for Uther''s death and wants to rule as his successor. Aided by her loyal maid Vivian and the devious nun Sybil, Morgan takes up residence in Castle Pendragon, from where she schemes against Arthur.', 'With King Uther''s sudden death, chaos threatens to engulf Britain. The sorcerer Merlin has visions of a dark future and installs young and impetuous Arthur, Uther''s unknown son and heir raised as a commoner, as the new king. The two install themselves in Castle Camelot with their allies, which include Arthur''s biological mother, his foster brother, and a quartet of loyal warriors. From Camelot, Arthur tries to build a new and better Britain, where people can live in peace. Meanwhile, Arthur''s cold half-sister Morgan plots to take the crown from him. Banished by Uther, who was responsible for her mother''s murder to put Arthur''s mother on the throne, Morgan is responsible for Uther''s death and wants to rule as his successor. Aided by her loyal maid Vivian and the devious nun Sybil, Morgan takes up residence in Castle Pendragon, from where she schemes against Arthur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kT4yBlYjB0Cm6Qp9bwkjXrFPU1v.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:33958'),
  ('275062100043874583', 'Camera Café', 2003, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Luca Bizzarri, Paolo Kessisoglu, Alessandro Sampaoli, Renato Liprandi, Paolo Bufalino, Riccardo Magherini, Massimo Costa, Margherita Fumero', null, 'The adventures and mis-adventures of a group of co-workers are shown by a camera on top of the coffee-machine in the relax area.', 'The adventures and mis-adventures of a group of co-workers are shown by a camera on top of the coffee-machine in the relax area.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vmdCodGh2nUPRDBQbIVsxGaIMyK.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:63809'),
  ('708481363331655202', 'Camera Café', 2005, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Arturo Valls, Carlos Chamarro, César Saratxu, Esperanza Pedreño, Ana Milán, Carolina Cerezuela, Marta Belenguer, Ana Ruiz', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x054RVrUUIMxkNj1jg0WPS4EmpD.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:63980'),
  ('80962738902042067', 'Caméra Café', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Bruno Solo, Yvan Le Bolloc''h, Alain Kappauf', null, 'Noémie Elbaz, Jeanne Savary, Yvan Le Bolloc''h, Shirley Bousquet, Chantal Neuwirth, Sylvie Loeillet, Philippe Cura, Gérard Chaillou', 'NR', 'The coffee machine of a small company is the scene of discussions between employees. Private life, professional life, gossip, mockery, ... everything goes!', 'The coffee machine of a small company is the scene of discussions between employees. Private life, professional life, gossip, mockery, ... everything goes!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1kd7wM61z4qmmjiuN2ZzgTJp07.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:1533'),
  ('12697624867142747', 'Caminantes', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'José A. Pérez Ledo', null, 'Lucas Miramón, Alexandra Pino, Songa Park, Daniel Ibáñez, Carlos Suárez', null, 'In August 2019, five friends disappeared while walking the Camino de Santiago. Their trail was lost in the Irati Forest, very close to the border with France. Two weeks after their disappearance, the police found their mobile phones buried in the middle of the mountain, along with their backpacks and various personal belongings. Thanks to the recordings of the devices, it will be possible to see what happened to these five young people.', 'In August 2019, five friends disappeared while walking the Camino de Santiago. Their trail was lost in the Irati Forest, very close to the border with France. Two weeks after their disappearance, the police found their mobile phones buried in the middle of the mountain, along with their backpacks and various personal belongings. Thanks to the recordings of the devices, it will be possible to see what happened to these five young people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8WQlghDDIXs4FK26rA4j8snGx69.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105849'),
  ('487617354904535931', 'Camp', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Liz Heldens, Peter Elkoff', null, 'Rachel Griffiths, Rodger Corser, Thom Green, Dena Kaplan, Tim Pocock, Charles Grounds, Nikolai Nikolaeff, Lily Sullivan', 'TV-14', 'Off the grid and miles from civilization, Little Otter Family Camp has summer fun for everyone. Parents decompress over gin and tonics while their kids run wild, and teenage counselors fall in and out of love. Mackenzie Granger is the camp owner and director. Still reeling from her recent divorce, Mackenzie is ready for a fresh start. She is running things on her own for the first time and scrambling to keep the cash-strapped Little Otter from going under.', 'Off the grid and miles from civilization, Little Otter Family Camp has summer fun for everyone. Parents decompress over gin and tonics while their kids run wild, and teenage counselors fall in and out of love. Mackenzie Granger is the camp owner and director. Still reeling from her recent divorce, Mackenzie is ready for a fresh start. She is running things on her own for the first time and scrambling to keep the cash-strapped Little Otter from going under.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7qVXYI3k4TOOB5uGG4ZF0YA6Iqz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46993'),
  ('550787284118577281', 'Camp Camp', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Miles Luna', 'Leigh Lahav', 'Yotam Perel, Miles Luna, Elizabeth Maxwell, Yuri Lowenthal, Lee Eddy, Shannon McCormick, James Willems, Barbara Dunkelman', 'TV-MA', 'Three kids, Max, Neil and Nikki, spent the summer vacation at a dysfunctional campsite called ''Camp Campbell'' which is currently in the hands the camp counselors, the overly cheerful David and the less optimistic Gwen.', 'Three kids, Max, Neil and Nikki, spent the summer vacation at a dysfunctional campsite called ''Camp Campbell'' which is currently in the hands the camp counselors, the overly cheerful David and the less optimistic Gwen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uXvv9aCOCJL8U8Zf4eSoWU5MgRE.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:67053'),
  ('977010404610234013', 'Camp Lakebottom', 2013, 'Comedy, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Eric Jacobson, Betsy McGowen, Shelley Hoffman', null, 'Scott McCord, Melissa Altro, Darren Frost, Adrian Truss, Jonathan Wilson, Bryn McAuley, Carter Hayden, Cliff Saunders', 'TV-Y7', 'Three kids spend a fun summer at Camp Lakebottom, an old, run down and ridiculously spooky summer camp with monsters as counselors, french flies for lunch, and literal “killer” waves.', 'Three kids spend a fun summer at Camp Lakebottom, an old, run down and ridiculously spooky summer camp with monsters as counselors, french flies for lunch, and literal “killer” waves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fixiE7ewtHPVVkiOklP1OlVwX5c.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:55924'),
  ('852539633350553997', 'Camp Lazlo', 2005, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Joe Murray', null, 'Carlos Alazraqui, Jeff Bennett, Mr. Lawrence, Tom Kenny, Steve Little', 'TV-Y7', 'The series is set in a universe inhabited solely by anthropomorphic animals of many species and focuses on a trio of campers attending a poorly run summer camp known as Camp Kidney. The trio consists of Lazlo, the eccentric, optimistic spider monkey; Raj, the timid Indian elephant; and Clam, the quiet albino pygmy rhinoceros, and their multiple surreal misadventures.', 'The series is set in a universe inhabited solely by anthropomorphic animals of many species and focuses on a trio of campers attending a poorly run summer camp known as Camp Kidney. The trio consists of Lazlo, the eccentric, optimistic spider monkey; Raj, the timid Indian elephant; and Clam, the quiet albino pygmy rhinoceros, and their multiple surreal misadventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fZXdQbYeDMBTBtMNnsF2K2YWBh.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:557'),
  ('523043117152473109', 'Camp Snoopy', 2024, 'Animation, Kids, Family', 'Scott Montgomery, Rob Boutilier', null, 'Etienne Kellici, Terry McGurrin, Rob Tinkler, Caleb Bellavance, Molly Lewis, Cash Allen-Martin, Hattie Kragten, Isabella Leo', 'TV-G', 'After discovering their troop is in danger of disbanding, Snoopy and the Beagle Scouts set off to the great outdoors to earn their badges. Meanwhile, Charlie Brown and friends enjoy their summer at Camp Spring Lake.', 'After discovering their troop is in danger of disbanding, Snoopy and the Beagle Scouts set off to the great outdoors to earn their badges. Meanwhile, Charlie Brown and friends enjoy their summer at Camp Spring Lake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/faRUuhkOVlh47z46DNgZ7EaYu0f.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:226745'),
  ('890684237218036119', 'Camp WWE', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Seth Green', null, 'Ric Flair, Vince McMahon, Robert Remus, Evan Michael Lee, Ashley Bornancin, Xander Mobus', 'TV-MA', 'Imagine WWE Superstars, Legends and Divas when they were kids at their favorite summer camp owned by none other than Mr. McMahon! This all-new, in-your-face, adult animated comedy series will show fans a side of the WWE they have never seen before.', 'Imagine WWE Superstars, Legends and Divas when they were kids at their favorite summer camp owned by none other than Mr. McMahon! This all-new, in-your-face, adult animated comedy series will show fans a side of the WWE they have never seen before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qCdKjhjdv2AaQR0jMl1UmfNUbwd.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66281'),
  ('795032174861121861', 'Campfire Cooking in Another World with My Absurd Skill', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuma Uchida, Satoshi Hino, Hina Kino, Maaya Uchida, Yuhko Kaida, Saho Shirasu, You Taichi', 'TV-14', 'Tsuyoshi Mukohda, an ordinary salaryman, is suddenly transported to another world one day. The unique skill he gains upon arrival in this world is the seemingly useless "Online Grocery." Mukohda is discouraged at first, but the modern foods he''s able to bring to his new world using this skill prove to have some unbelievable effects!', 'Tsuyoshi Mukohda, an ordinary salaryman, is suddenly transported to another world one day. The unique skill he gains upon arrival in this world is the seemingly useless "Online Grocery." Mukohda is discouraged at first, but the modern foods he''s able to bring to his new world using this skill prove to have some unbelievable effects!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cXc3yiQ5RrimzfucovjO83RTrnq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213402'),
  ('674885706719641647', 'Camping', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Julia Davis', null, 'Elizabeth Berrington, Vicki Pepperdine, Julia Davis, Steve Pemberton, Jonathan Cake, Rufus Jones, Oaklee Pendergast, Shaun Aylward', null, 'Follow the events of a week’s holiday where a group of old friends meet to celebrate one of their landmark birthdays. But as the days unfold, tensions and emotions start to rise…', 'Follow the events of a week’s holiday where a group of old friends meet to celebrate one of their landmark birthdays. But as the days unfold, tensions and emotions start to rise…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yiYtYU5rqAppDyTGyHIBztvSVb7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66183'),
  ('572358099436403904', 'Camping', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Lena Dunham, Jenni Konner', null, 'Jennifer Garner, David Tennant, Arturo del Puerto, Juliette Lewis, Ione Skye, Chris Sullivan, Janicza Bravo, Brett Gelman', 'TV-MA', 'A not-so-happily married couple''s meticulously planned camping trip is derailed by uninvited guests and forces of nature, turning the weekend into a test of marriage and friendships.', 'A not-so-happily married couple''s meticulously planned camping trip is derailed by uninvited guests and forces of nature, turning the weekend into a test of marriage and friendships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ykZmmCVIlScUywQyqZKDBfkzX4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78101'),
  ('132627800388532881', 'Camping Paradis', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Michel Alexandre', null, 'Laurent Ournac, Patrick Guérineau, Thierry Heckendorn, Patrick Paroux, Delphine Braillon', 'NR', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ylBKsATDU1mZlPVi53zWcudayL.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:63601'),
  ('475372676268476189', 'Campion', 1989, 'Mystery, Drama, Comedy', 'Margery Allingham', null, 'Peter Davison, Brian Glover', null, 'Campion is a television show made by the BBC, adapting the Albert Campion mystery novels written by Margery Allingham. Two series were made, in 1989 and 1990, starring Peter Davison as Campion, Brian Glover as his manservant Magersfontein Lugg and Andrew Burt as his policeman friend Stanislaus Oates. A total of eight novels were adapted, four in each series, each of which was originally broadcast as two separate hour-long episodes. Peter Davison sang the title music for the first series himself; in the second series, it was replaced with an instrumental version.', 'Campion is a television show made by the BBC, adapting the Albert Campion mystery novels written by Margery Allingham. Two series were made, in 1989 and 1990, starring Peter Davison as Campion, Brian Glover as his manservant Magersfontein Lugg and Andrew Burt as his policeman friend Stanislaus Oates. A total of eight novels were adapted, four in each series, each of which was originally broadcast as two separate hour-long episodes. Peter Davison sang the title music for the first series himself; in the second series, it was replaced with an instrumental version.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9MYIg1ILo370tFRpc10MKTtq6Du.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:19824'),
  ('559857027794340253', 'Campione!', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Eri Kitamura, Sachika Misawa, Rina Hidaka, Yuka Saitou, Yui Ogura, Nobutoshi Canna, Junko Minagawa, Takuya Eguchi', 'TV-PG', 'Godo Kusanagi, a high school student that kills a god, claiming its power and title of Campione, to slay other gods.', 'Godo Kusanagi, a high school student that kills a god, claiming its power and title of Campione, to slay other gods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h46tgmaPjq7ojhgqlR7lE8VxVfm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46184');
insert into temp_tv_shows_seed (id, title, year, genre, creator, writers, cast_members, age_rating, overview, synopsis, poster_url, seasons, source_key)
values
  ('766305180156960814', 'Campus', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Robert Harley, James Henry, Oriane Messina', 'Christian Sandino-Taylor, Victoria Pile, Richard Preddy', 'Andy Nyman, Lisa Jackson, Sara Pascoe, Dolly Wells, Jonathan Bailey, Will Adamsdale, Joseph Millson, Alison Lintott', null, 'Campus is a semi-improvised British sitcom created by Robert Harley, James Henry, Oriane Messina, Gary Parker, Victoria Pile, Richard Preddy, Fay Rusling, and Christian Sandino-Taylor, with Pile acting as co-writer, producer, and director. At the fictitious Kirke University, the lives of the staff are explored, particularly the power-crazed and callous vice chancellor Jonty de Wolfe, lazy womanising English literature professor Matt Beer, and newly promoted senior mathematics lecturer Imogen Moffat. The series was initially broadcast as a pilot on Channel 4 on 6 November 2009, part of the Comedy Showcase season of comedy pilots. A full series commenced on 5 April 2011, with the first episode being a reshot and expanded pilot. Many critics claimed it was too similar to Green Wing and that much of the humour was offensive. However, others praised the dark humour and surrealism. It was ultimately cancelled after one series due to poor ratings.', 'Campus is a semi-improvised British sitcom created by Robert Harley, James Henry, Oriane Messina, Gary Parker, Victoria Pile, Richard Preddy, Fay Rusling, and Christian Sandino-Taylor, with Pile acting as co-writer, producer, and director. At the fictitious Kirke University, the lives of the staff are explored, particularly the power-crazed and callous vice chancellor Jonty de Wolfe, lazy womanising English literature professor Matt Beer, and newly promoted senior mathematics lecturer Imogen Moffat. The series was initially broadcast as a pilot on Channel 4 on 6 November 2009, part of the Comedy Showcase season of comedy pilots. A full series commenced on 5 April 2011, with the first episode being a reshot and expanded pilot. Many critics claimed it was too similar to Green Wing and that much of the humour was offensive. However, others praised the dark humour and surrealism. It was ultimately cancelled after one series due to poor ratings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecNdkTQh7tI86Ej8k7Z7LMW1EJ8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31411'),
  ('233654962566089269', 'Campus Diaries', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Abhishek Yadav, Prem Mistry', 'Prem Mistry, Abhishek Yadav', 'Harsh Beniwal, Ritwik Sahore, Srishti Ganguli Rindani, Saloni Khanna, Abhinav Sharma, Saloni Gaur, Ranjan Raj, Rajesh Yadav', null, 'Campus Diaries is a coming-of-age drama of six students at Excel University. But this one is so-not-your-regular-college-drama because it goes beyond the routine frolic and friendship plots that quintessential youth dramas portray and tackles relevant yet lesser discussed issues like ragging, discrimination based on societal biases, one sided love stories, rampant drug abuse and toxic relationships that mould your personality and ready you to face the real world.', 'Campus Diaries is a coming-of-age drama of six students at Excel University. But this one is so-not-your-regular-college-drama because it goes beyond the routine frolic and friendship plots that quintessential youth dramas portray and tackles relevant yet lesser discussed issues like ragging, discrimination based on societal biases, one sided love stories, rampant drug abuse and toxic relationships that mould your personality and ready you to face the real world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qqSKYXHI8lwgIBztBCZqgvw5u6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155056'),
  ('1058624381966829439', 'Can a Boy-Girl Friendship Survive?', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Kikunosuke Toya, Sayumi Suzushiro, Yuka Nukui, Ko Bonkobara, Masaaki Mizunaka, Hisako Kanemoto', 'TV-14', 'Childhood BFFs Himari and Yu’s vow of friendship hits turbulence when Yu reunites with his first crush in high school. Himari, who’s never known the fuzzy warmth of a crush, now must confront her feelings. Their shared dreams and peaceful days as a twosome gardening club are tested in this tale of love, flowers, and growing pains!', 'Childhood BFFs Himari and Yu’s vow of friendship hits turbulence when Yu reunites with his first crush in high school. Himari, who’s never known the fuzzy warmth of a crush, now must confront her feelings. Their shared dreams and peaceful days as a twosome gardening club are tested in this tale of love, flowers, and growing pains!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nAooVCW6PIfISHegaIwtQOZLBOC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217407'),
  ('567021863151031846', 'Can I Make Your Ears Happy in 180 Seconds?', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Shiori Mikami, Suzuko Mimori, Azumi Waki, Kanae Itou, Yu Serizawa, Aoi Koga, Show Hayami', 'TV-14', 'ASMR or Autonomous Sensory Meridian Response is the nerve-tingling or relaxing response and sensation one gets to stimuli such as certain sounds or sights. As the title indicates, the anime will let viewers experience ASMR in 180 seconds. In the story, the heroine challenges her classmates to share in her hobby of recording ASMR works.', 'ASMR or Autonomous Sensory Meridian Response is the nerve-tingling or relaxing response and sensation one gets to stimuli such as certain sounds or sights. As the title indicates, the anime will let viewers experience ASMR in 180 seconds. In the story, the heroine challenges her classmates to share in her hobby of recording ASMR works.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t2PMWSyGD3GEYaTHqMAFWAx6b6p.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:124576'),
  ('335482103379949251', 'Can I Tell You a Secret?', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Louis Theroux', null, 'Savannah Gracey', 'TV-MA', 'Three women''s lives are changed forever when a prolific stalker infiltrates their social media accounts. And they''re only a fraction of his many victims.', 'Three women''s lives are changed forever when a prolific stalker infiltrates their social media accounts. And they''re only a fraction of his many victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2FGjlE4b3FfbTFBl0vahPsxQTfC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:245551'),
  ('532047068317276684', 'Can This Love Be Translated?', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Hong Jeong-eun, Hong Mi-ran, Yoo Young-eun', 'Hong Jeong-eun, Hong Mi-ran', 'Kim Seon-ho, Go Youn-jung, Sota Fukushi, Lee E-dam, Choi Woo-sung', 'TV-MA', 'The emotions of a celebrity and her interpreter get lost in translation as they travel the world filming a TV show. Will love find its own language?', 'The emotions of a celebrity and her interpreter get lost in translation as they travel the world filming a TV show. Will love find its own language?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgUh4cgalSzBjbsT5P0qmU7Rjzk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:229891'),
  ('140219784420261406', 'Can We Get Married?', 2012, 'Comedy, Family', null, 'Ha Myung-hee', 'Sung Joon, Jung So-min, Kim Young-kwang, Han Geu-ru, Lee Mi-sook, Kim Sung-min, Jung Ae-yeun, Sunwoo Eun-Sook', null, 'Is the easiest part of a relationship planning for the wedding? Hye Yoon and Jung Hoon are engaged to be married in 100 days. Hye Yoon’s older sister, Hye Jin is nicely married to a doctor, so Hye Yoon’s mother, Deul Ja, was determined to find an equally suitable husband for Hye Yoon. Imagine her disappointment when she learned that Hye Yoon had already fallen in love with a simple salaryman. Can Hye Yoon and Jung Hoon maintain their faith in love as they face family pressures in their relationship?', 'Is the easiest part of a relationship planning for the wedding? Hye Yoon and Jung Hoon are engaged to be married in 100 days. Hye Yoon’s older sister, Hye Jin is nicely married to a doctor, so Hye Yoon’s mother, Deul Ja, was determined to find an equally suitable husband for Hye Yoon. Imagine her disappointment when she learned that Hye Yoon had already fallen in love with a simple salaryman. Can Hye Yoon and Jung Hoon maintain their faith in love as they face family pressures in their relationship?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wc7EjZZRjpWa3lBnROUi3rwj7D7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46538'),
  ('482119371021644519', 'Can You Hear Me?', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Florence Longpré, Mélissa Bédard, Ève Landry', 'TV-MA', 'Three friends in a low-income neighborhood find humor and hope in their lives as they grapple with bad boyfriends and their dysfunctional families.', 'Three friends in a low-income neighborhood find humor and hope in their lives as they grapple with bad boyfriends and their dysfunctional families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzxccD9DZ7olWlXN4912QxpZN4J.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:85789'),
  ('1113228174283158537', 'Can''t Get You Out of My Head', 2021, 'Documentary, War & Politics', 'Adam Curtis', null, 'Adam Curtis', null, 'In six films, Adam Curtis traces the different forces across the world that have led to now. It covers a wide range—including the strange roots of modern conspiracy theories, the history of China, opium and opioids, the history of Artificial Intelligence, melancholy over the loss of empire and, love and power. And explores whether modern culture, despite its radicalism, is really just part of the new system of power.', 'In six films, Adam Curtis traces the different forces across the world that have led to now. It covers a wide range—including the strange roots of modern conspiracy theories, the history of China, opium and opioids, the history of Artificial Intelligence, melancholy over the loss of empire and, love and power. And explores whether modern culture, despite its radicalism, is really just part of the new system of power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LP4c5SC4Yr9BDoDLJ4XJjgV2bN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117447'),
  ('452644731061506001', 'Can''t Pay? We''ll Take It Away!', 2014, 'Documentary, Drama, Reality', null, null, null, null, 'Camera follow teams of High Court Enforcement Agents, dealing with the execution of High Court Writs.', 'Camera follow teams of High Court Enforcement Agents, dealing with the execution of High Court Writs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fLQ5LEmDPnwFzTvHYwcgurKAi4.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:64091'),
  ('940126135336341325', 'Canaan', 2009, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Miyuki Sawashiro, Maaya Sakamoto, Yoshino Nanjo, Kenji Hamada, Akio Otsuka, Hiroaki Hirata, Rie Tanaka, Haruka Tomatsu', null, 'Two years ago, Shibuya was ravaged by a biological terrorist attack using the deadly Ua virus. Maria Osawa was saved when her father inoculated her against the virus, but is left with partial amnesia from the shock. She works as a cameraman when she reunites with a girl named Canaan in Shanghai, China. A gifted assassin with synesthesia, she is under orders from an unknown organization for a yet unspecified mission', 'Two years ago, Shibuya was ravaged by a biological terrorist attack using the deadly Ua virus. Maria Osawa was saved when her father inoculated her against the virus, but is left with partial amnesia from the shock. She works as a cameraman when she reunites with a girl named Canaan in Shanghai, China. A gifted assassin with synesthesia, she is under orders from an unknown organization for a yet unspecified mission', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pz6F0f9gmXOVH9IprXDm3XONad4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43418'),
  ('890225669796956259', 'Canada''s Drag Race', 2020, 'Reality', 'RuPaul, Fenton Bailey, Randy Barbato', null, 'Brooke Lynn Hytes, Traci Melchor', 'TV-MA', 'Drag queens showcase their Canadian charisma, uniqueness, nerve, and talent to become Canada''s Next Drag Superstar and to win the $100,000 grand prize.', 'Drag queens showcase their Canadian charisma, uniqueness, nerve, and talent to become Canada''s Next Drag Superstar and to win the $100,000 grand prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cYz6rYidxHjShL46bf960SBSRG0.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:94038'),
