  ('686193548838604352', 'Cancer: The Emperor of All Maladies', 2015, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Siddhartha Mukherjee, Edward Herrmann', null, 'The documentary series aims to reshape the way the public sees cancer and strip away some of the fear and misunderstanding that has long surrounded it. The story of cancer is a story of human ingenuity, resilience, and perseverance but also of hubris, paternalism and misperception.', 'The documentary series aims to reshape the way the public sees cancer and strip away some of the fear and misunderstanding that has long surrounded it. The story of cancer is a story of human ingenuity, resilience, and perseverance but also of hubris, paternalism and misperception.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wCibBsLRpLUwSMfYAjimn1HdULf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77144'),
  ('736553693173637272', 'Candice Renoir', 2013, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Solen Roy-Pagenault, Robin Barataud, Brigitte Peskine', null, 'Cécile Bois, Raphaël Lenglet, Yeelem Jappain, Ali Marhyar, Marie Vincent', 'TV-G', 'Candice Renoir had put her career on standby for 10 years. When she returns from Singapore to resume service in a port town in the south of France, she feels a bit “rusty”. Despite the obvious defiance of her unit and a cynical superior who doesn’t make her job any easier, she is determined to turn her so-called weaknesses into strengths, solving the most complex cases with her common sense, her acute observation and her practical nature seasoned by a busy daily routine. Only Candice can catch a killer because she knows the chemical composition of a window-cleaning product or determine the hour of a murder from the cooking-time of kebabs… Candice is only naive on the outside, and nobody can resist her!', 'Candice Renoir had put her career on standby for 10 years. When she returns from Singapore to resume service in a port town in the south of France, she feels a bit “rusty”. Despite the obvious defiance of her unit and a cynical superior who doesn’t make her job any easier, she is determined to turn her so-called weaknesses into strengths, solving the most complex cases with her common sense, her acute observation and her practical nature seasoned by a busy daily routine. Only Candice can catch a killer because she knows the chemical composition of a window-cleaning product or determine the hour of a murder from the cooking-time of kebabs… Candice is only naive on the outside, and nobody can resist her!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRMnzom4uxM2MOzO84LODaUrNUg.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:55866'),
  ('931819781397610081', 'Cândido On Tour', 2022, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Cândido Costa', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3oxgCzVp17nt4cYrYSVkHuNBcwV.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:197362'),
  ('38945663755068110', 'Candle in the Tomb', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Mystery', 'Zhang Muye', '袁源', 'Jin Dong, Joe Chen, Zhao Da, Yue Yang, Wang Yongquan, Yang Xinming, Feng Hui, Fu Mei', null, 'When archaeologist Shirley Yang learns of her father''s disappearance, she returns to China and enlists the help of tomb raiders to track him down.', 'When archaeologist Shirley Yang learns of her father''s disappearance, she returns to China and enlists the help of tomb raiders to track him down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewy3zhByRpM8fDDK2qu45LexOdJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69168'),
  ('478055331471223932', 'Candle in the Tomb: The Lost Caverns', 2020, 'Mystery, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Zhang Muye', 'Yang Zhe', 'Pan Yueming, Jiang Chao, Zhang Yuqi, Tong Lei, Gao Weiguang, Eddy Ko Hung, Zhou Xiaoou, Hu Ming', null, 'Hu Ba Yi, Shirley Yang and Wang Pang Zi explore a mysterious tomb in the Shaanxi region. Shirley Yang travels to the Longling Maze Grottos to investigate unusual patterns on fossil fragments. On the way, she crosses paths with Hu Ba Yi who along with Wang Pang Zi have just escaped from the ancient city. The trio become companions in another tomb-raiding adventure. ~~ Adapted from the 2nd volume in the novel series "Candle in the Tomb" (鬼吹灯) by Zhang Mu Ye (天下霸唱).', 'Hu Ba Yi, Shirley Yang and Wang Pang Zi explore a mysterious tomb in the Shaanxi region. Shirley Yang travels to the Longling Maze Grottos to investigate unusual patterns on fossil fragments. On the way, she crosses paths with Hu Ba Yi who along with Wang Pang Zi have just escaped from the ancient city. The trio become companions in another tomb-raiding adventure. ~~ Adapted from the 2nd volume in the novel series "Candle in the Tomb" (鬼吹灯) by Zhang Mu Ye (天下霸唱).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92u0j5LPz983VFtV2BMiwgH7dh0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:101306'),
  ('612760574982269584', 'Candle in the Tomb: The Worm Valley', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Mystery', 'Zhang Muye', null, 'Pan Yueming, Zhang Yuqi, Jiang Chao, Tong Lei, Wang Kuirong, Ji Dongran, Zheng Yiming, Zhao Yutong', null, 'Hu Bayi, Shirley Yang and Fatty Wang discover that the rumoured life-saving "dust bead" had become a burial object in the tomb of the King Xian of the ancient Dian Kingdom and set to find the traces of the mystic object. Following a human skin map, the three pass through the secret underground waterway of the ancient Dian Kingdom under the Zhalong Mountain.', 'Hu Bayi, Shirley Yang and Fatty Wang discover that the rumoured life-saving "dust bead" had become a burial object in the tomb of the King Xian of the ancient Dian Kingdom and set to find the traces of the mystic object. Following a human skin map, the three pass through the secret underground waterway of the ancient Dian Kingdom under the Zhalong Mountain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qND9IxQlaDmLfkZF7MnHyvAKcrD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:131932'),
  ('915372460900760241', 'Candle In The Tomb: The Wrath Of Time', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Mystery', 'Zhang Muye', null, 'Pan Yueming, Gao Weiguang, Xin Zhilei, Cao Weiyu, Aliyah, Zhang Cheng, Sheng Shao, Sang Mingsheng', null, 'A group of tomb raiders team up together to explore an ancient tomb of Yuan dynasty which is located in the Ping Shan mountain in West Hunan province.', 'A group of tomb raiders team up together to explore an ancient tomb of Yuan dynasty which is located in the Ping Shan mountain in West Hunan province.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fmFIWm9mWRWaqqrAKl9XZjtwuY8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86107'),
  ('422552082991355476', 'Candy', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Robin Veith, Nick Antosca', 'Elise Brown', 'Jessica Biel, Melanie Lynskey, Pablo Schreiber, Timothy Simons, Raúl Esparza, Jessie Mueller, Coley Campany, Sharon Conley', 'TV-MA', 'Candy Montgomery is a 1980s housewife and mother who did everything right — but when the pressure of conformity builds within her, her actions scream for just a bit of freedom. Until someone tells her to shush. With deadly results.', 'Candy Montgomery is a 1980s housewife and mother who did everything right — but when the pressure of conformity builds within her, her actions scream for just a bit of freedom. Until someone tells her to shush. With deadly results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8vlxmTkiF2rzpvrWoN4mOoeVg1z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105804'),
  ('182753151910474826', 'Candy Boy', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy, Romance', 'Takafumi Hoshikawa', null, 'Hitomi Nabatame, Ryoka Yuzuki, Emiri Kato, Yu Kobayashi', null, 'Yukino and Kanade Sakurai are twin sisters that live together in a high school dorm. Although they are twins, they tend to act romantic toward each other, holding hands and going on dates. One day, Kanade sees Yukino hanging out with a new girl, Sakuya Kamiyama. Realizing how much time these two spend together, Kanade assumes they are dating, and she begins to distance herself from her sister. Yukino promptly notices and pleads with Kanade not to leave. In reality, Sakuya has only been asking for advice about Kanade, revealing her obsessive love. How will this love triangle play out?', 'Yukino and Kanade Sakurai are twin sisters that live together in a high school dorm. Although they are twins, they tend to act romantic toward each other, holding hands and going on dates. One day, Kanade sees Yukino hanging out with a new girl, Sakuya Kamiyama. Realizing how much time these two spend together, Kanade assumes they are dating, and she begins to distance herself from her sister. Yukino promptly notices and pleads with Kanade not to leave. In reality, Sakuya has only been asking for advice about Kanade, revealing her obsessive love. How will this love triangle play out?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7O68ST950n9zDAs2IgH4brDfGU2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61439'),
  ('866457525387688615', 'Candy Candy', 1976, 'Animation, Drama, Kids', 'Kyoko Mizuki', 'Shunichi Yukimuro, Noboru Shiroyama, Kyoko Mizuki', 'Minori Matsushima, Makio Inoue, Kei Tomiyama, Kazuhiko Inoue, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Yuji Mitsuya, Mami Koyama, Chiyoko Kawashima', 'NR', 'This story is about a girl, Candy, who is a orphan. She is a nice and optimistic girl and she has a warm heart. When she was a child, she lived in an orphanage called Pony''s Home. She had a good friend called Ann. And she met the "handsome boy on the hill" who is a important person in her life, on the hill behind the orphanage. She was adopted by the Loka''s family. What''s awaiting her are the bad-hearted Leo and his sister, Eliza. One day, in the rose garden, she met a boy, who is identical to the "handsome boy on the hill" who she had met in her childhood. The boy is called Antony. Thereafter, a fantastic story that she has never expected begins.', 'This story is about a girl, Candy, who is a orphan. She is a nice and optimistic girl and she has a warm heart. When she was a child, she lived in an orphanage called Pony''s Home. She had a good friend called Ann. And she met the "handsome boy on the hill" who is a important person in her life, on the hill behind the orphanage. She was adopted by the Loka''s family. What''s awaiting her are the bad-hearted Leo and his sister, Eliza. One day, in the rose garden, she met a boy, who is identical to the "handsome boy on the hill" who she had met in her childhood. The boy is called Antony. Thereafter, a fantastic story that she has never expected begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uO9V1FkqLTJdAodHn9Sdg3Nwy1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9160'),
