  ('289648161511229935', 'Carlos', 2010, 'Drama, Crime, War & Politics', 'Daniel LeConte, Olivier Assayas', null, 'Edgar Ramírez, Alexander Scheer, Nora Waldstätten, Alejandro Arroyo, Ahmad Kaabour, Talal Jurdi, Juana Acosta, Christoph Bach', null, 'The story of the Venezuelan Ilich Ramirez Sanchez known as "Carlos", who was, for almost twenty years, one of the most wanted terrorists in the world.', 'The story of the Venezuelan Ilich Ramirez Sanchez known as "Carlos", who was, for almost twenty years, one of the most wanted terrorists in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xvKyxoAgPbytXZvAtZdKNZAoCEB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:41693'),
  ('869941554178209177', 'Carlos, rey emperador', 2015, 'Drama', 'Oriol Ferrer', null, 'Álvaro Cervantes, Alfonso Bassave, Félix Gómez, Marina Salas, Eric Balbàs, Ramón Barea, José Luis García Pérez, Blanca Suárez', null, 'As the life of Charles of Habsburg is told since his arrival to Spain, it can be seen how the heir to the crowns of Germany, Burgundy, the Netherlands, the Free County, Artois, Nevers and Rethel, of the territories of the Crown of Aragon and its related Italian territories, and of the territories of the Catholic Monarchs in Castile, North Africa and the Americas, matures as a statesman and gets stronger in face of menaces around him and good and bad advice from his counselors.', 'As the life of Charles of Habsburg is told since his arrival to Spain, it can be seen how the heir to the crowns of Germany, Burgundy, the Netherlands, the Free County, Artois, Nevers and Rethel, of the territories of the Crown of Aragon and its related Italian territories, and of the territories of the Catholic Monarchs in Castile, North Africa and the Americas, matures as a statesman and gets stronger in face of menaces around him and good and bad advice from his counselors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rAon5txhp59jlJ3HYhbxI4CDsFa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63756'),
  ('70965029058556443', 'Carmel: Who Killed Maria Marta?', 2020, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Alejandro Hartmann', 'Lucas Bucci, Alejandro Hartmann, Sofía Mora', 'María Marta García Belsunce, Carlos Carrascosa, Rolando Barbano, Pablo Duggan, Horacio García Belsunce, Irene Hurtig, Juan Carlos "John" Hurtig, Guillermo Bártoli', null, 'Documentary series on the circumstances surrounding the death of María Marta García Belsunce, one of the most controversial criminal cases in Argentina.', 'Documentary series on the circumstances surrounding the death of María Marta García Belsunce, one of the most controversial criminal cases in Argentina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snmVxrXyZ9DShBL5olPvcuWlCab.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:111495'),
  ('387845656641302340', 'Carmen Curlers', 2022, 'Drama', 'Mette Heeno', null, 'Morten Hee Andersen, Maria Rossing, Rosalinde Mynster, Nicolai Jørgensen, Fanny Leander Bornedal, Christian Tafdrup, Lars Ranthe, Mille Lehfeldt', null, 'In 1963, a business adventure begins in a basement in a small Danish town. Within a few years, the company has 3500 employees, many of them women who are experiencing for the first time the joys and challenges of earning their own money.', 'In 1963, a business adventure begins in a basement in a small Danish town. Within a few years, the company has 3500 employees, many of them women who are experiencing for the first time the joys and challenges of earning their own money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKbr7RaYNne5Muf1DifFowkj67F.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:211280'),
  ('1118862783987857797', 'Carmen Sandiego', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Crime, Kids', 'Brian Hulme', null, 'Gina Rodriguez, Finn Wolfhard, Kari Wahlgren, Rafael Petardi, Bernardo de Paula, Charlet Chung, Mary Elizabeth McGlynn, Michael Goldsmith', 'TV-Y7', 'A master thief who uses her skills for good, Carmen Sandiego travels the world foiling V.I.L.E.''s evil plans -- with help from her savvy sidekicks.', 'A master thief who uses her skills for good, Carmen Sandiego travels the world foiling V.I.L.E.''s evil plans -- with help from her savvy sidekicks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpis9X6awQ1X5MBm9eHRUc0N0pu.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:74728'),
  ('169340727854457397', 'Carmilla', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jordan Hall, Jay Bennett, Steph Ouaknine', null, 'Elise Bauman, Natasha Negovanlis, Annie Briggs, Kaitlyn Alexander, Sophia Walker', 'TV-PG', 'Laura Hollis, a newly enrolled college student at Silas University, shares a room with Betty, who mysteriously disappears all of a sudden. Little does Laura know that after this fateful night, nothing will be the same in her life, starting with meeting her new roommate from hell, Carmilla Karnstein. "Carmilla" is a single-camera, scripted transmedia series that puts a modern spin on the cult classic Gothic vampire novella by Joseph Sheridan Le Fanu. It''s a story of a young woman’s susceptibility to the attentions of a female vampire.', 'Laura Hollis, a newly enrolled college student at Silas University, shares a room with Betty, who mysteriously disappears all of a sudden. Little does Laura know that after this fateful night, nothing will be the same in her life, starting with meeting her new roommate from hell, Carmilla Karnstein. "Carmilla" is a single-camera, scripted transmedia series that puts a modern spin on the cult classic Gothic vampire novella by Joseph Sheridan Le Fanu. It''s a story of a young woman’s susceptibility to the attentions of a female vampire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8QtaDRC3a1EXvwQ56MLnOVmZ3Ou.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:65353'),
  ('347482349525162674', 'Carnival Phantasm', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kana Ueda, Ayako Kawasumi, Noriko Shitaya, Noriaki Sugiyama, Hitomi, Kenji Nojima, Jouji Nakata, Ryoka Yuzuki', null, 'Comedy OVA series based on the Type-Moon Gag manga, Take-Moon. It focuses on funny and absurd situations happening to the various characters of the Type-Moon franchises, mostly from Fate/stay night and Tsukihime.', 'Comedy OVA series based on the Type-Moon Gag manga, Take-Moon. It focuses on funny and absurd situations happening to the various characters of the Type-Moon franchises, mostly from Fate/stay night and Tsukihime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhFvh0gFRcIBEk4igTUeXHBLZ75.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43295'),
  ('626789378705973955', 'Carnival Row', 2019, 'Crime, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Travis Beacham, René Echevarria', null, 'Orlando Bloom, Cara Delevingne, Simon McBurney, Tamzin Merchant, David Gyasi, Andrew Gower, Karla Crome, Arty Froushan', 'TV-MA', 'In a mystical and dark city filled with humans, fairies and other creatures, a police detective investigates a series of gruesome murders leveled against the fairy population. During his investigation, the detective becomes the prime suspect and must find the real killer to clear his name.', 'In a mystical and dark city filled with humans, fairies and other creatures, a police detective investigates a series of gruesome murders leveled against the fairy population. During his investigation, the detective becomes the prime suspect and must find the real killer to clear his name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jyhxT10e2z9IDsKoIQDKhyxSQJt.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:90027'),
  ('251085001132141665', 'Carnivàle', 2003, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Drama', 'Daniel Knauf', null, 'Nick Stahl, Clancy Brown, Michael J. Anderson, Tim DeKay, Clea DuVall, Cynthia Ettinger, Carla Gallo, Adrienne Barbeau', 'TV-MA', 'Carnivàle is an American television series set in the United States during the Great Depression and Dust Bowl. In tracing the lives of two disparate groups of people, its overarching story depicts the battle between good and evil and the struggle between free will and destiny; the storyline mixes Christian theology with gnosticism and Masonic lore, particularly that of the Knights Templar.', 'Carnivàle is an American television series set in the United States during the Great Depression and Dust Bowl. In tracing the lives of two disparate groups of people, its overarching story depicts the battle between good and evil and the struggle between free will and destiny; the storyline mixes Christian theology with gnosticism and Masonic lore, particularly that of the Knights Templar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5pKvfZ3qLuKJd8PQfKcPxN9jTO9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:185'),
  ('329403880769412268', 'Carol & the End of the World', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Dan Guterman', 'Daniel McGraw', 'Martha Kelly', 'TV-MA', 'As a planetary apocalypse looms, a woman struggling to embrace end-times chaos searches for meaning in her last months on Earth.', 'As a planetary apocalypse looms, a woman struggling to embrace end-times chaos searches for meaning in her last months on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eqXQL8XGvL2tn2NfXKirBHQKo2d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:238151'),
  ('70646131019409862', 'Carol''s Second Act', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Sarah Haskins, Emily Halpern', null, 'Patricia Heaton, Kyle MacLachlan, Ito Aghayere, Lucas Neff, Jean-Luc Bilodeau, Sabrina Jalees, Ashley French, Cedric Yarbrough', null, 'After raising her two children, getting divorced and retiring from teaching, Carol Chambers embarks on a unique second act: she’s going to become a doctor.', 'After raising her two children, getting divorced and retiring from teaching, Carol Chambers embarks on a unique second act: she’s going to become a doctor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7XOT3uguMpkZoCWNmDOA6tPI8CB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92462'),
  ('556877792017609818', 'CAROLE & TUESDAY', 2019, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Miyuri Shimabukuro, Nai Br.XX, Kana Ichinose, Celeina Ann, Akio Otsuka, Sumire Uesaka, Alisa, Hiroshi Kamiya', 'TV-PG', 'Part-timer Carole meets rich girl Tuesday, and each realizes they''ve found the musical partner they need. Together, they just might make it.', 'Part-timer Carole meets rich girl Tuesday, and each realizes they''ve found the musical partner they need. Together, they just might make it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1NtxJItCNV9B36FpttUumGvdzSG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83962'),
  ('712591862946884523', 'Caroline in the City', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama, Animation', 'Fred Barron, Marco Pennette, Dottie Dartland Zicklin', null, 'Lea Thompson, Eric Lutes, Malcolm Gets, Amy Pietz', 'TV-PG', 'Caroline in the City is an American situation comedy that ran on the NBC television network. It stars Lea Thompson as cartoonist Caroline Duffy, who lives in Manhattan in New York City. The series premiered on September 21, 1995 in the "Must See TV" Thursday night block after Seinfeld. The show ran for 97 episodes over four seasons, before it was cancelled; its final episode was broadcast on April 26, 1999.', 'Caroline in the City is an American situation comedy that ran on the NBC television network. It stars Lea Thompson as cartoonist Caroline Duffy, who lives in Manhattan in New York City. The series premiered on September 21, 1995 in the "Must See TV" Thursday night block after Seinfeld. The show ran for 97 episodes over four seasons, before it was cancelled; its final episode was broadcast on April 26, 1999.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eI7GP4fL77x6zsn2d505GzzCTnK.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1850'),
  ('651097891259649603', 'Caronte', 2020, 'Drama', 'Verónica Fernández', null, 'Miriam Giovanelli, Carlos Hipólito, Roberto Álamo, Raúl Tejón, Álex Villazán', 'TV-MA', 'Caronte will make us think about justice, presumption of innocence and truth. It also talks about second chances and how a man is able to reinvent himself and get his life back together. The different cases will not only influence Caronte''s personal life, but, episode after episode, will make our protagonist evolve and grow.', 'Caronte will make us think about justice, presumption of innocence and truth. It also talks about second chances and how a man is able to reinvent himself and get his life back together. The different cases will not only influence Caronte''s personal life, but, episode after episode, will make our protagonist evolve and grow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/PWBQIkOlJzJolUDYHW0fp87NKC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99565'),
  ('209888176506314066', 'Carp Reborn', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Jing Yang, Tang Xiaoxi, Fei Ling, Kai Wang', null, 'Special forces operative Wang Sheng transmigrated into the world of Yuanhun (Origin Spirits). There, he was possessed by a useless spirit —a carp—, becoming infamous trash in the world of Origin Spirits! In this world filled with experts, Wang Sheng used the knowledge he acquires to surmount all difficulties, even finding a way to evolve his useless spirit carp! From a sparrow to a Phoenix, from a carp to a Dragon! In this sinister and vicious world full of disputes, he will make his own path towards success! Legends say that a carp who leaps over the Dragon’s Gate will become a dragon itself. Through effort and courage, even an insignificant carp can defy its own fate and become a legend.', 'Special forces operative Wang Sheng transmigrated into the world of Yuanhun (Origin Spirits). There, he was possessed by a useless spirit —a carp—, becoming infamous trash in the world of Origin Spirits! In this world filled with experts, Wang Sheng used the knowledge he acquires to surmount all difficulties, even finding a way to evolve his useless spirit carp! From a sparrow to a Phoenix, from a carp to a Dragon! In this sinister and vicious world full of disputes, he will make his own path towards success! Legends say that a carp who leaps over the Dragon’s Gate will become a dragon itself. Through effort and courage, even an insignificant carp can defy its own fate and become a legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hBTyb43yHBM0BZSPZRkBLTC9Svy.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:105869'),
  ('1106811556032874280', 'Carpool Karaoke: The Series', 2017, 'Comedy', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Celebrity pairings ride along in a car together as they sing tunes from their personal playlists and surprise fans who don''t expect to see big stars belting out tunes one lane over.', 'Celebrity pairings ride along in a car together as they sing tunes from their personal playlists and surprise fans who don''t expect to see big stars belting out tunes one lane over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bA6tpDMoyQO8fRmXC8sHh7LQoqW.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:72610'),
  ('974885471449037384', 'Carried by the Wind: Tsukikage Ran', 2000, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Akemi Okamura, Reiko Yasuhara, Koji Ishii, Azusa Nakao, Chinami Nishimura, Hiroshi Takahashi, Hochu Otsuka, Kaori Nazuka', null, 'Wandering the lands of Japan - Ran is a master swordsman with a strong sense of honor combined with the courage and strength to right wrongs and battle injustice.​ But that doesn''t stop her from having a good time! Stuck with an unwanted traveling companion,​ Myao,​ the two will bring law and order to the countryside.​.. if they don''t kill each other first.​ A comedic,​ action drama from start to finish - the way of the Samurai will never be the same!', 'Wandering the lands of Japan - Ran is a master swordsman with a strong sense of honor combined with the courage and strength to right wrongs and battle injustice.​ But that doesn''t stop her from having a good time! Stuck with an unwanted traveling companion,​ Myao,​ the two will bring law and order to the countryside.​.. if they don''t kill each other first.​ A comedic,​ action drama from start to finish - the way of the Samurai will never be the same!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eL7rnpy322XRT7aG1K56BddGwD5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21320'),
  ('289436450381112823', 'Carrossel', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Íris Abravanel', 'Íris Abravanel, Rita Valente, Fany Higuera', 'Rosanne Mulholland, Jean Paulo Campos, Larissa Manoela, Maisa Silva, Guilherme Seta, Stefany Vaz, Thomaz Costa, Nicholas Torres', null, 'Carrossel is a children''s telenovela created by Abel Santa Cruz and written by Íris Abravanel, originally transmitted on SBT from May 21, 2012 to present. It is a Brazilian remake of the Mexican telenovela Carrusel, which in turn had been inspired by the Argentinean telenovela Jacinta Pichimahuida, la Maestra que no se Olvida. In a short time the display was a telenovela phenomenon of hearing canal causing quite successful among the children public yielding several CDs, DVDs, toys and other products in less than a year. including we have made several spin-offs based on it, including a cartoon series and television sitcom.', 'Carrossel is a children''s telenovela created by Abel Santa Cruz and written by Íris Abravanel, originally transmitted on SBT from May 21, 2012 to present. It is a Brazilian remake of the Mexican telenovela Carrusel, which in turn had been inspired by the Argentinean telenovela Jacinta Pichimahuida, la Maestra que no se Olvida. In a short time the display was a telenovela phenomenon of hearing canal causing quite successful among the children public yielding several CDs, DVDs, toys and other products in less than a year. including we have made several spin-offs based on it, including a cartoon series and television sitcom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3OpTb80gvYF34LPJNpvDPtnzIcM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46150'),
  ('163609864068009827', 'Carrusel', 1989, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Kids, Soap', 'Abel Santacruz', null, 'Gabriela Rivero, Pedro Javier Viveros, Ludwika Paleta, Hilda Chávez, Christel Klitbo, Odiseo Bichir, Augusto Benedico', null, 'Carrusel is a Mexican telenovela, produced by and first broadcast on Televisa in 1989. It covers daily life in a Mexican elementary school and the children''s relationships with a charismatic teacher named Jimena. Among other plot devices, it deals with the differences between the upper and lower classes of Mexican society — specifically as seen in a romantic relationship between Cirilo, a poor black boy, and a spoiled rich girl, Maria Joaquina Villaseñor.', 'Carrusel is a Mexican telenovela, produced by and first broadcast on Televisa in 1989. It covers daily life in a Mexican elementary school and the children''s relationships with a charismatic teacher named Jimena. Among other plot devices, it deals with the differences between the upper and lower classes of Mexican society — specifically as seen in a romantic relationship between Cirilo, a poor black boy, and a spoiled rich girl, Maria Joaquina Villaseñor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zbGTiTiDvgEoBrj9AMihNa7DCsb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12994'),
