  ('127304931496643279', 'Casshan', 1973, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Ikuo Nishikawa, Emiko Tsukada, Osamu Kato, Reiko Mutoh, Ryuji Nakagi, Masato Yamanouchi, Kenji Utsumi, Kazuya Tatekabe', null, 'Dr. Azuma creates robots to benefit mankind, but they unexpectedly rebel and begin to destroy everything in their paths. To deal with the catastrophe, Dr. Azuma''s son volunteers to become a human robot, even though he knows he will never be able to return to human form again. He confronts this grave situation to ensure a bright future for all humans.', 'Dr. Azuma creates robots to benefit mankind, but they unexpectedly rebel and begin to destroy everything in their paths. To deal with the catastrophe, Dr. Azuma''s son volunteers to become a human robot, even though he knows he will never be able to return to human form again. He confronts this grave situation to ensure a bright future for all humans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5P7NFuAqGyh1ohKKCba008ZRB52.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:20046'),
  ('449911988430495069', 'Casshan: Robot Hunter', 1993, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Takeshi Kusao, Yumi Touma, Kenji Utsumi, Yuri Amano, Sanae Takagi, Toshiyuki Morikawa', null, 'Far in the future, ecological disaster on Earth led humans to create a race of androids called Neoroids to clean up the mess but they promptly turned on their human masters and enslaved them. Enter a lone fighter named Casshan with a mission to free humanity ... and restore his family''s honor.', 'Far in the future, ecological disaster on Earth led humans to create a race of androids called Neoroids to clean up the mess but they promptly turned on their human masters and enslaved them. Enter a lone fighter named Casshan with a mission to free humanity ... and restore his family''s honor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6F7VKm3Mftr0udMqRy9m9MRiy2M.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:20467'),
  ('73867261854704291', 'Casshern Sins', 2008, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Toru Furuya', 'TV-MA', 'After the murder of Luna, the robot society that rules the planet starts to rust and decay. Death and despair spread through the land like wildfire. The only one unaffected by the affliction that becomes known as "The Ruin" is Luna''s assassin, Casshern. Unable to remember if he really triggered this capital sin against the entire mechanized civilization, Casshern embarks on a journey to unravel the mystery that connects him, Luna, and the plague.', 'After the murder of Luna, the robot society that rules the planet starts to rust and decay. Death and despair spread through the land like wildfire. The only one unaffected by the affliction that becomes known as "The Ruin" is Luna''s assassin, Casshern. Unable to remember if he really triggered this capital sin against the entire mechanized civilization, Casshern embarks on a journey to unravel the mystery that connects him, Luna, and the plague.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2jzEQ6Yqhw1rHuNANeO0L741zf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31730'),
  ('412848144978860238', 'Castaway Diva', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Oh Choong-hwan, Park Hye-ryun', null, 'Park Eun-bin, Chae Jong-hyeop, Kim Hyo-jin, Cha Hak-yeon, Kim Ju-hun, Lee Re, Bae Gang-hee, Shin Joo-hyup', null, 'Fifteen years after being stranded on a remote island, an aspiring singer reenters society — stopping at nothing to pursue her dream of becoming a diva.', 'Fifteen years after being stranded on a remote island, an aspiring singer reenters society — stopping at nothing to pursue her dream of becoming a diva.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYOxdgfPogMoXPizBjKcZx7f9k2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:216310'),
  ('162802619870955827', 'Castelo Rá-Tim-Bum', 1994, 'Kids, Comedy, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Cao Hamburger, Flávio de Souza', null, 'Cássio Scapin, Cinthya Rachel, Luciano Amaral, Fredy Állan, Rosi Campos, Sérgio Mamberti, Fernando Gomes, Cláudio Chakmati', null, 'Nino is a 300-year-old boy who lives with his uncle, Dr. Victor, a sorcerer and scientist, and his great-aunt Morgana, a 6,000-year-old witch. The three of them live in a castle in the middle of the city of São Paulo. Apprentice sorcerer, Nino has never attended a school, because of the unusual age of 300 years. His parents left him living with Victor and Morgan, because they needed to travel on an expedition into outer space, taking their two younger brothers. In spite of having animal and supernatural friends in the Castle, Nino, feeling lack of friends like him, decides to do a spell he learned with his Uncle Victor, and ended up bringing to the Castle, three children who had just left school. Free of loneliness, Nino receives the visit of the three daily.', 'Nino is a 300-year-old boy who lives with his uncle, Dr. Victor, a sorcerer and scientist, and his great-aunt Morgana, a 6,000-year-old witch. The three of them live in a castle in the middle of the city of São Paulo. Apprentice sorcerer, Nino has never attended a school, because of the unusual age of 300 years. His parents left him living with Victor and Morgan, because they needed to travel on an expedition into outer space, taking their two younger brothers. In spite of having animal and supernatural friends in the Castle, Nino, feeling lack of friends like him, decides to do a spell he learned with his Uncle Victor, and ended up bringing to the Castle, three children who had just left school. Free of loneliness, Nino receives the visit of the three daily.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p9Yo9plrovUUl8sa3UFt3Q9bxpE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35254'),
  ('309510619691662453', 'Casting(s)', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Pierre Niney, Ali Marhyar', 'Pierre Niney, Igor Gotesman, Ali Marhyar', 'Pierre Niney, François Civil, Igor Gotesman, Antoine Gouy, Benjamin Lavernhe, Natasha Andrews, Ali Marhyar, Guillaume Compiano', null, 'Casting(s) was a French television shortcom created by Pierre Niney and Ali Marhyar, written by Ali Marhyar, Igor Gotesman and Pierre Niney, produced by Hugo Gélin for Zazi Films and broadcast on Canal+ from 2013 to 2015. The episodes revolved around actors rehearsing for different film projects for a casting director. The show also had famous guests such as Oscar winner Marion Cotillard and rappers Orelsan and Nekfeu.', 'Casting(s) was a French television shortcom created by Pierre Niney and Ali Marhyar, written by Ali Marhyar, Igor Gotesman and Pierre Niney, produced by Hugo Gélin for Zazi Films and broadcast on Canal+ from 2013 to 2015. The episodes revolved around actors rehearsing for different film projects for a casting director. The show also had famous guests such as Oscar winner Marion Cotillard and rappers Orelsan and Nekfeu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bldj5bUS82BFhi5jrHj0thUM5m3.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:94379'),
  ('451139497892848952', 'Castle', 2009, 'Drama, Crime', 'Andrew W. Marlowe', null, 'Nathan Fillion, Stana Katic, Molly C. Quinn, Jon Huertas, Seamus Dever, Susan Sullivan, Tamala Jones, Toks Olagundoye', 'TV-14', 'After a serial killer imitates the plots of his novels, successful mystery novelist Richard "Rick" Castle receives permission from the Mayor of New York City to tag along with an NYPD homicide investigation team for research purposes.', 'After a serial killer imitates the plots of his novels, successful mystery novelist Richard "Rick" Castle receives permission from the Mayor of New York City to tag along with an NYPD homicide investigation team for research purposes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/diXBeMzvfJb2iJg3G0kCUaMCzEc.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:1419'),
  ('182177754946625123', 'Castle Rock', 2018, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Dustin Thomason, Sam Shaw', null, 'Lizzy Caplan, Tim Robbins, Elsie Fisher, Yusra Warsama, Barkhad Abdi, Matthew Alan, Paul Sparks, J.D. Dorn', 'TV-MA', 'Based on the stories of Stephen King, the series intertwines characters and themes from the fictional town of Castle Rock.', 'Based on the stories of Stephen King, the series intertwines characters and themes from the fictional town of Castle Rock.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6dnUpv9ghx84pgxlMOb4uuJrWDs.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:71116'),
  ('328696076145843276', 'Castle Town Dandelion', 2015, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Kana Hanazawa, Ryohei Kimura, Kaori Ishihara, Ai Kayano, Ayumu Murase, Yui Ogura, Eriko Matsui, Aina Suzuki', 'TV-14', 'The everyday lives of the nine super-powered siblings of the royal family are monitored by more than 200 surveillance cameras and broadcast nationwide. The people of the nation who are watching the broadcast will have the ability to elect the next monarch. Akane is the third-oldest sister who can manipulate gravity. She is shy and desperately does not want to be caught on camera.', 'The everyday lives of the nine super-powered siblings of the royal family are monitored by more than 200 surveillance cameras and broadcast nationwide. The people of the nation who are watching the broadcast will have the ability to elect the next monarch. Akane is the third-oldest sister who can manipulate gravity. She is shy and desperately does not want to be caught on camera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/irFZJaitAup1wEZmad0kFDR73ye.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66083'),
  ('118699012104986008', 'Castlevania', 2017, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Warren Ellis', null, 'Richard Armitage, James Callis, Alejandra Reynoso, Malcolm McDowell, Bill Nighy, Marsha Thomason', 'TV-MA', 'A vampire hunter fights to save a besieged city from an army of otherworldly beasts controlled by Dracula himself.', 'A vampire hunter fights to save a besieged city from an army of otherworldly beasts controlled by Dracula himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WzFHnJY44uDERER0xi1jOdoafT.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:71024'),
  ('574848273077096741', 'Castlevania: Nocturne', 2023, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Clive Bradley', null, 'Edward Bluemel, Thuso Mbedu, Pixie Davies, Aaron Neil, Elarica Johnson', 'TV-MA', 'As revolution sweeps France, Richter Belmont fights to uphold his family''s legacy and prevent the rise of a ruthless, power-hungry vampire ruler.', 'As revolution sweeps France, Richter Belmont fights to uphold his family''s legacy and prevent the rise of a ruthless, power-hungry vampire ruler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4XJwo95ktJ7xupw1bCMuP91kyYr.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:123548'),
  ('712204846751093046', 'Casual', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Zander Lehmann, Jason Reitman', null, 'Michaela Watkins, Tommy Dewey, Tara Lynne Barr, Luke Samuels', 'TV-MA', 'A dysfunctional family tries to help each other navigate the modern dating scene. Recent divorcee Tara and her bachelor brother coach each other through the crazy world of dating (on-line and off), while living under the same roof again for the second time and raising her teenage daughter.', 'A dysfunctional family tries to help each other navigate the modern dating scene. Recent divorcee Tara and her bachelor brother coach each other through the crazy world of dating (on-line and off), while living under the same roof again for the second time and raising her teenage daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wWxTA0T98HRaIqP01iQtuY9QlOC.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:64043'),
  ('531170536282446618', 'Casualty', 1986, 'Drama, Soap', 'Jeremy Brock, Paul Unwin', null, 'William Beck, Elinor Lawless, Neet Mohan, Charles Venn, Di Botcher, Michael Stevenson, Anna Chell, Sarah Seggari', 'TV-PG', 'Drama series about the staff and patients at Holby City Hospital''s emergency department, charting the ups and downs in their personal and professional lives.', 'Drama series about the staff and patients at Holby City Hospital''s emergency department, charting the ups and downs in their personal and professional lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hjOtCY0X4BsovRK3nCphRvyo4b.jpg', 45, 'tmdb:tv:1021'),
  ('8567211694073620', 'CAT', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Balwinder Singh Janjua', 'Rupinder Chahal, Jimmy Singh, Anil Rodhan', 'Randeep Hooda, Abhishant Rana, Suvinder Vicky, Hasleen Kaur, Geeta Agrawal Sharma, Dakssh Ajit Singh, Danish Sood, Pramod Pathak', 'TV-MA', 'Living under an alias, a former police informant is summoned to infiltrate a major drug empire but uncovers a dangerous connection to his dark past.', 'Living under an alias, a former police informant is summoned to infiltrate a major drug empire but uncovers a dangerous connection to his dark past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aY9lY9v0zab2hn5ZWeKzLBE6Kme.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158345'),
  ('293674139203991601', 'Cat Planet Cuties', 2010, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Kikuko Inoue, Aki Toyosaki, Kana Hanazawa, Haruka Tomatsu, Ayahi Takagaki, Mutsumi Tamura, Kanae Itou, Minako Kotobuki', 'TV-MA', 'Nice guy Kio’s normal life gets turned upside down when he meets a friendly, sexy cat-alien named Eris. She’s on a peaceful mission—and she’s ready to play. Things get even friskier when her fellow felines set up base in Kio’s house. It’s not all fun and games, though. Danger is afoot, thanks to several secret agencies and enemy dog-aliens on Eris’s tail.', 'Nice guy Kio’s normal life gets turned upside down when he meets a friendly, sexy cat-alien named Eris. She’s on a peaceful mission—and she’s ready to play. Things get even friskier when her fellow felines set up base in Kio’s house. It’s not all fun and games, though. Danger is afoot, thanks to several secret agencies and enemy dog-aliens on Eris’s tail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UcEA982tNUli3U9hhlN0dd1emo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37806'),
  ('914947472440877452', 'Cat Tales', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yoshino Aoyama, Kanako Miyamoto, Kana Ueda, Hiro Shimono', null, 'The cute comedy manga and anime take children''s stories and folktales from all around the world and asks, "what if a cat appeared in this story?"', 'The cute comedy manga and anime take children''s stories and folktales from all around the world and asks, "what if a cat appeared in this story?"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7d63WcaIE4IuUgD5d3DsTa060iO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:297743'),
  ('483897896756218412', 'CAT. 8', 2013, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Donald Martin', null, 'Matthew Modine, Maxim Roy, Ted Whittall, Trevor Hayes, Kate Drummond, Kalinka Pétrie, Spiro Malandrakis, Alain Goulem', null, 'When a breakthrough in global defense malfunctions, the result is a fireball four times the size of Earth streaking toward the planet. As fires blaze and panic spreads, a renegade scientist comes to the world’s rescue.', 'When a breakthrough in global defense malfunctions, the result is a fireball four times the size of Earth streaking toward the planet. As fires blaze and panic spreads, a renegade scientist comes to the world’s rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/syWxP9YiXU4T2mPSQrfi1WD3wvG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64777'),
  ('566492889241646621', 'Cat''s Eye', 1983, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Mystery, Crime', null, null, 'Keiko Toda, Toshiko Fujita, Chika Sakamoto, Yoshito Yasuhara, Tamio Ohki', 'TV-14', 'Cat''s Eye is the most notorious group of art thieves in Japan. No one knows their identities, but for most of Tokyo, the mystery only heightens their allure.', 'Cat''s Eye is the most notorious group of art thieves in Japan. No one knows their identities, but for most of Tokyo, the mystery only heightens their allure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fF45IiKa8jFCI3coLdhLU8vlCX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:34114'),
  ('740853828636838026', 'Cat''s Eye', 2025, 'Animation, Mystery, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Mikako Komatsu, Ami Koshimizu, Yumiri Hanamori, Takuya Sato, Yoko Hikasa, Katsuyuki Konishi', 'TV-14', 'By day, sisters Hitomi, Rui and Ai run the popular Cat''s Eye Café; by night, they slip into the shadows, executing high-stakes art heists with precision and style.', 'By day, sisters Hitomi, Rui and Ai run the popular Cat''s Eye Café; by night, they slip into the shadows, executing high-stakes art heists with precision and style.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wg4LPYsGyEfQnCi9otmR41jRDRc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:286691'),
  ('566853303309741686', 'Cat''s Eyes', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Michel Catz', null, 'Constance Labbé, Camille Lou, Claire Romain, MB14, Cindy Bruna, Simon Ehrlacher, Carole Bouquet, Élodie Fontan', null, 'In 2023, Alexia, Tam and Sylia are reunited in the City of Light after many years apart. At the same time, a work of art that belonged to their father – who had died ten years earlier in a mysterious fire at his art gallery – reappears in a prestigious exhibition at the Eiffel Tower. The sisters decide to risk everything to steal the painting, in the hope that they will finally solve the mystery of what happened to their father.', 'In 2023, Alexia, Tam and Sylia are reunited in the City of Light after many years apart. At the same time, a work of art that belonged to their father – who had died ten years earlier in a mysterious fire at his art gallery – reappears in a prestigious exhibition at the Eiffel Tower. The sisters decide to risk everything to steal the painting, in the hope that they will finally solve the mystery of what happened to their father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sk2qhWP7EyhcvHjvdsCbjInqJGw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222176'),
  ('1113929598017935005', 'Cat''s Tea', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy', '糖人家', null, null, null, 'After a severe scolding from her mother, 15-year-old high school student Jasmine rushes to class in hopes of making it on time. But when a strange storm suddenly hits, lightning strikes down on Jasmine and renders her unconscious. Instead of waking up in the hospital, the girl opens her eyes to a cute, dog-eared boy named Longjing. What''s more, Jasmine realizes she now possesses a pair of fluffy cat ears! Figuring she simply has a case of amnesia, Longjing offers to help guide Jasmine around the Tea Continent. Little does he know, she is more than excited to explore this RPG-styled world and fulfill her apparent destiny as the main character.', 'After a severe scolding from her mother, 15-year-old high school student Jasmine rushes to class in hopes of making it on time. But when a strange storm suddenly hits, lightning strikes down on Jasmine and renders her unconscious. Instead of waking up in the hospital, the girl opens her eyes to a cute, dog-eared boy named Longjing. What''s more, Jasmine realizes she now possesses a pair of fluffy cat ears! Figuring she simply has a case of amnesia, Longjing offers to help guide Jasmine around the Tea Continent. Little does he know, she is more than excited to explore this RPG-styled world and fulfill her apparent destiny as the main character.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkGyAWuCGEoWmlkFtnmxPwOxjJm.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:134924'),
  ('841527598701678285', 'Catastrophe', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Rob Delaney, Sharon Horgan', 'Rob Delaney, Sharon Horgan', 'Sharon Horgan, Rob Delaney, Mark Bonnar, Ashley Jensen, Daniel Lapaine, Jonathan Forbes, Seeta Indrani', 'TV-MA', 'Rob Delaney and Sharon Horgan write and star in a comedy that follows an American man and an Irish woman who make a bloody mess as they struggle to fall in love in London.', 'Rob Delaney and Sharon Horgan write and star in a comedy that follows an American man and an Irish woman who make a bloody mess as they struggle to fall in love in London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2saxUzvXv2b0FgjuzAqItH5bH0x.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:61920'),
  ('448640345479231197', 'Catch and Kill: The Podcast Tapes', 2021, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Ronan Farrow', null, 'Ronan Farrow', 'TV-14', 'An expansion of the hit podcast and bestselling book, Catch and Kill: The Podcast Tapes brings to life the intimate interviews that broke Hollywood''s most infamous story.', 'An expansion of the hit podcast and bestselling book, Catch and Kill: The Podcast Tapes brings to life the intimate interviews that broke Hollywood''s most infamous story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xaCHlolr9OxvuPBD1z4iMxUVnIj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127632'),
  ('686241421123437384', 'Catch Me a Killer', 2024, 'Crime, Drama', 'Amy Jephta', 'Amy Jephta, Oliver Frampton, Jessica Ruston', 'Charlotte Hope, Steven John Ward, Lemogang Tsipa, Sean Cameron Michael, Waldemar Schultz, Donna Cormack Thomson, Ivan Zimmermann', 'TV-MA', 'Follow South Africa’s first forensic and investigative psychologist, Micki Pistorius (played by Charlotte Hope), as she studies the minds of South Africa''s serial killers. Catch Me A Killer is an adaptation of Micki''s autobiography that details her work as the first female criminal profiler in the country, which is brought to life as the events are depicted in the series.', 'Follow South Africa’s first forensic and investigative psychologist, Micki Pistorius (played by Charlotte Hope), as she studies the minds of South Africa''s serial killers. Catch Me A Killer is an adaptation of Micki''s autobiography that details her work as the first female criminal profiler in the country, which is brought to life as the events are depicted in the series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXSqArrcVD1ISb4esgpgwk711aC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:244596'),
  ('1049936923748791020', 'Catch Me at the Ballpark!', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Fairouz Ai, Satoshi Inomata', 'TV-14', 'To escape his tiring job, weary Murata finds escape at a nearby baseball stadium. While the games are thrilling, it’s Ruriko, the gyaru as cold as the beer she serves but secretly a sweetheart, who keeps him coming back. As her first regular, Murata discovers the warmth behind her frosty demeanor, and their hilarious, heartwarming encounters light up the ballpark and maybe even their hearts.', 'To escape his tiring job, weary Murata finds escape at a nearby baseball stadium. While the games are thrilling, it’s Ruriko, the gyaru as cold as the beer she serves but secretly a sweetheart, who keeps him coming back. As her first regular, Murata discovers the warmth behind her frosty demeanor, and their hilarious, heartwarming encounters light up the ballpark and maybe even their hearts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgfrsJiFJCOCRWD5OnKbKpTw92E.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:277222'),
  ('758864936099159827', 'Catch The Ghost', 2019, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'So Won, Lee Young-Joo', 'So Won, Lee Young-Joo', 'Moon Geun-young, Kim Seon-ho, Jung Yoo-jin, Jo Jae-yun, Ahn Seung-gyun, Han Ji-sang, Lee Jun-hyeok, Song Ok-suk', null, 'A romantic investigative drama about rookie detective Yoo-Ryung who solves cases with her overflowing sense of justice and exceptional spatial perception but always gets herself into trouble because of her rash actions. She meets the Wangsimni station constabulary chief, a man who avoids cases and seeks stability who always ends up cleaning up after the problems caused by Yoo Ryung and holds the key to solving the cases.', 'A romantic investigative drama about rookie detective Yoo-Ryung who solves cases with her overflowing sense of justice and exceptional spatial perception but always gets herself into trouble because of her rash actions. She meets the Wangsimni station constabulary chief, a man who avoids cases and seeks stability who always ends up cleaning up after the problems caused by Yoo Ryung and holds the key to solving the cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7CbhB19d9PlcxAW8YRzKSDBK1RG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94615'),
  ('265214723464316341', 'Catch-22', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama, War & Politics', 'Luke Davies, David Michôd', null, 'Christopher Abbott, Kyle Chandler, Daniel David Stewart, Tessa Ferrer, Lewis Pullman, Rafi Gavron, George Clooney, Graham Patrick Martin', 'TV-MA', 'Pianosa Island, Italy, World War II. Bombardier John Yossarian tries to fulfill his duty, maintain sanity and return home as soon as possible, but incompetence and bureaucracy constantly stand in his way.', 'Pianosa Island, Italy, World War II. Bombardier John Yossarian tries to fulfill his duty, maintain sanity and return home as soon as possible, but incompetence and bureaucracy constantly stand in his way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1huTLz8UaEeOLJNwqMKCQs76Bl5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82744'),
  ('888691713478427637', 'Catch! Teenieping', 2020, 'Animation, Kids', null, null, null, null, 'Set free on Earth, fairies with magical powers begin influencing people''s emotions. Now, it''s up to a princess from a faraway kingdom to stop them!', 'Set free on Earth, fairies with magical powers begin influencing people''s emotions. Now, it''s up to a princess from a faraway kingdom to stop them!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qa2qFufGnKdiu0UOkoTYsui953h.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:136915'),
  ('22589557761839192', 'Catching Killers', 2021, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Simon Dekker', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'The investigators behind infamous serial killer cases reveal the harrowing, chilling details of their extraordinary efforts in this true crime series.', 'The investigators behind infamous serial killer cases reveal the harrowing, chilling details of their extraordinary efforts in this true crime series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/628U5ybT3fV0gGbT41Lk3R15Ya0.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:137003'),
  ('343914789197563552', 'Catching Milat', 2015, 'Crime', null, null, 'Malcolm Kennard, Geoff Morrell, Richard Cawthorne, David Field', null, 'A psychological thriller based on the investigation into the 1990s backpacker murders leading to the arrest and conviction of serial killer Ivan Milat. NSW police are on the search for a murderer after the bodies of backpackers are found in Belanglo State Forest. Catching Milat is the story of the men who brought the killer to justice.', 'A psychological thriller based on the investigation into the 1990s backpacker murders leading to the arrest and conviction of serial killer Ivan Milat. NSW police are on the search for a murderer after the bodies of backpackers are found in Belanglo State Forest. Catching Milat is the story of the men who brought the killer to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJZEX6Pm4ygpamBlKdVfHi7hOjz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66823'),
  ('560059184966596132', 'Catching Up With the Royals', 2026, 'Talk, News', null, null, 'Richard Coles, Emily Andrews', null, 'Catching Up with the Royals is a weekly Royal show exploring the latest British Royal news and the stories behind the headlines. Join Reverend Richard Coles and Royal journalist Emily Andrews as they go beyond the pomp and pageantry to uncover what’s really happening inside the House of Windsor. Each week, Richard and Emily share expert insight and informed opinion on the biggest Royal stories - from King Charles and Prince William to Prince Harry and Meghan - alongside the quieter developments unfolding behind palace walls. Emily’s years travelling with King Charles, Prince William, and Harry and Meghan, paired with Richard’s passion for royal history and relationships, bring you insider whispers you won’t hear anywhere else. They’ll also take a deep dive into the defining moments of the royal family''s history. Whether it''s legendary scandals that shocked the world, or lesser-known royal protocols - Richard and Emily will discuss how the Royals'' past is still impactful today.', 'Catching Up with the Royals is a weekly Royal show exploring the latest British Royal news and the stories behind the headlines. Join Reverend Richard Coles and Royal journalist Emily Andrews as they go beyond the pomp and pageantry to uncover what’s really happening inside the House of Windsor. Each week, Richard and Emily share expert insight and informed opinion on the biggest Royal stories - from King Charles and Prince William to Prince Harry and Meghan - alongside the quieter developments unfolding behind palace walls. Emily’s years travelling with King Charles, Prince William, and Harry and Meghan, paired with Richard’s passion for royal history and relationships, bring you insider whispers you won’t hear anywhere else. They’ll also take a deep dive into the defining moments of the royal family''s history. Whether it''s legendary scandals that shocked the world, or lesser-known royal protocols - Richard and Emily will discuss how the Royals'' past is still impactful today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZWN8MazQl6X0WrysII1qY3dFrj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:312880'),
  ('133486675813607076', 'CatDog', 1998, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Peter Hannan', null, 'Jim Cummings, Tom Kenny, Dwight Schultz, Carlos Alazraqui, Maria Bamford, Billy West, Nika Futterman', 'TV-Y7', 'The life and times of a cat and a dog with a unique twist: they''re connected, literally. They share one body with a Dog''s head at one end and Cat''s head on the other. Adding to their dilemma is Cat''s annoyance with Dog, mainly caused by Dog''s stupidity and Cat''s up-tight personality. Characters: Cat - Cat is the smarter one of the two brothers, and is always hatching some kind of plot to get his brother to calm down, so that Cat doesn''t get beat around and hurt. Even though most of these plots involve messing with Dog''s feeble mind, they often backfire on Cat, much to his dismay. It may not show all the time but, he deeply loves, and cares for his brother Dog. Dog - Dog is the more lovable of the two brothers, Dog loves to play and party and play some more, he loves baseball and playing fetch with frisbees, balls, sticks, etc, He is very friendly, and happy, but does have a breaking point. He''s very sensitive, and if he fails at something he feels horrible, and worthless', 'The life and times of a cat and a dog with a unique twist: they''re connected, literally. They share one body with a Dog''s head at one end and Cat''s head on the other. Adding to their dilemma is Cat''s annoyance with Dog, mainly caused by Dog''s stupidity and Cat''s up-tight personality. Characters: Cat - Cat is the smarter one of the two brothers, and is always hatching some kind of plot to get his brother to calm down, so that Cat doesn''t get beat around and hurt. Even though most of these plots involve messing with Dog''s feeble mind, they often backfire on Cat, much to his dismay. It may not show all the time but, he deeply loves, and cares for his brother Dog. Dog - Dog is the more lovable of the two brothers, Dog loves to play and party and play some more, he loves baseball and playing fetch with frisbees, balls, sticks, etc, He is very friendly, and happy, but does have a breaking point. He''s very sensitive, and if he fails at something he feels horrible, and worthless', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fkSCg9negcHAVO3gXohqEidqrsX.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1567'),
  ('1104120800177088668', 'Catfish: The TV Show', 2012, 'Reality, Drama', 'Max Joseph, Nēv Schulman, Ariel Schulman', null, 'Nēv Schulman, Kamie Crawford', 'TV-14', 'Nev and his co-hosts -- from Max to Kamie to celebrity guests -- help people in dubious online relationships track down their baes IRL so they can sort out what''s fact and what''s fiction.', 'Nev and his co-hosts -- from Max to Kamie to celebrity guests -- help people in dubious online relationships track down their baes IRL so they can sort out what''s fact and what''s fiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gy6kqWfIWaVyjU7ifa3KkkTDSHd.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:46910'),
  ('367707171594184358', 'Cathedral of the Sea', 2018, 'Drama', 'Rodolf Sirera', 'Tyler Rhoads', 'Aitor Luna, Pablo Derqui, Michelle Jenner, Daniel Grao, Andrea Duro, Nora Navas, Jordi Aguilar, Silvia Abascal', null, 'In the 14th century, Barcelona is experiencing one of its most prosperous moments. The city has grown to La Ribera, a fishing district in which the largest Marian temple ever known is built: Santa María del Mar. But the construction runs parallel to Arnau Estanyol, a serf of the land who, fleeing the abuses of The feudal lords of the countryside take refuge in Barcelona.', 'In the 14th century, Barcelona is experiencing one of its most prosperous moments. The city has grown to La Ribera, a fishing district in which the largest Marian temple ever known is built: Santa María del Mar. But the construction runs parallel to Arnau Estanyol, a serf of the land who, fleeing the abuses of The feudal lords of the countryside take refuge in Barcelona.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nEO1n2PVuKhY9BGl8KKNvyj0K7n.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72613'),
  ('821462690595582324', 'Catherine the Great', 2015, 'Drama', 'Igor Zajcev', null, 'Pavel Trubiner, Yuliya Snigir, Pyotr Zhuravlyov, Pavel Derevyanko, Natalya Surkova, Sergey Shakurov, Roman Madyanov, Mark Bogatyrev', null, 'The history of the formation of the personality of the Catherine the Great from the moment of her arrival in Russia as the bride of Grand Duke Peter Fyodorovich to her ascension to the Russian throne. Almost 20 years of palace intrigues, conspiracies, power struggles and personal dramas.', 'The history of the formation of the personality of the Catherine the Great from the moment of her arrival in Russia as the bride of Grand Duke Peter Fyodorovich to her ascension to the Russian throne. Almost 20 years of palace intrigues, conspiracies, power struggles and personal dramas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evxBDvqzHyLNi0zS8d7wZjBtJLT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64507'),
  ('419454428382886935', 'Catherine the Great', 2019, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Nigel Williams', null, 'Helen Mirren, Jason Clarke, Rory Kinnear, Gina McKee, Kevin McNally, Richard Roxburgh, Joseph Quinn, Clive Russell', 'TV-MA', 'This four-part historical drama follows the end of Catherine the Great''s reign and her affair with Russian military leader Grigory Potemkin that helped shape the future of Russian politics.', 'This four-part historical drama follows the end of Catherine the Great''s reign and her affair with Russian military leader Grigory Potemkin that helped shape the future of Russian politics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s50flEj06i7HmZx0lVMTHD4p6MF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76692'),
  ('561801271004278849', 'Catscratch', 2005, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Doug TenNapel', null, 'Wayne Knight, Rob Paulsen, Kevin McDonald, Maurice LaMarche, Liliana Mumy', 'TV-Y7', 'When well-kept cat brothers Mr. Blik, Gordon and Waffle inherit their former owner''s fortune, they get the keys to a lavish mansion -- and access to the very best adventures money can buy.', 'When well-kept cat brothers Mr. Blik, Gordon and Waffle inherit their former owner''s fortune, they get the keys to a lavish mansion -- and access to the very best adventures money can buy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9OoaYeRxgzV530mKuPOx2N8AMSI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3805'),
