  ('1074324982502122171', 'CHAOS', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Freddy Rodríguez, Eric Close, Tim Blake Nelson, James Murray, Kurtwood Smith, Christina Cole, Carmen Ejogo, Matthew Harrison', 'NR', 'A comedic drama about a group of rogue CIA spies in the Office of Disruptive Services (ODS), who combat threats to national security amidst bureaucratic gridlock, rampant incompetence and political infighting.', 'A comedic drama about a group of rogue CIA spies in the Office of Disruptive Services (ODS), who combat threats to national security amidst bureaucratic gridlock, rampant incompetence and political infighting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDApqZ0txxHbhm3y93dAiHMznlL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34893'),
  ('1129638244194086782', 'Chaos Dragon: Sekiryuu Sen''eki', 2015, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ayaka Imamura, Haruka Terui, Haruka Watanabe, Hochu Otsuka, Miyuki Sawashiro, Aoi Yuuki, Marina Inoue, Haruo Satou', null, 'The story takes place in Huanli (the Year of Dazzling) 3015. Donatia and Kouran, two countries fighting for supremacy, are causing the world to be torn apart due to the constant war. Amidst the strife is the island country Nil Kamui, which has lost its independence. Red Dragon, the guardian god of Nil Kamui, goes out of control. Will the island country be able to regain its independence?', 'The story takes place in Huanli (the Year of Dazzling) 3015. Donatia and Kouran, two countries fighting for supremacy, are causing the world to be torn apart due to the constant war. Amidst the strife is the island country Nil Kamui, which has lost its independence. Red Dragon, the guardian god of Nil Kamui, goes out of control. Will the island country be able to regain its independence?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/43N8CQpjwTStpWyael57Xhs7nH1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63089'),
  ('310749898055642628', 'ChäoS;Child', 2017, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', null, 'Sikera chiyomaru', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Sumire Uesaka, Sarah Emi Bridcutt, Suzuko Mimori, Inori Minase, Sayaka Nakaya, Asami Sanada', null, 'ChäoS;Child takes place in October 2015, six years after the events of ChäoS;HEAd. Abnormal events begin to occur in Shibuya district, including mysterious deaths.', 'ChäoS;Child takes place in October 2015, six years after the events of ChäoS;HEAd. Abnormal events begin to occur in Shibuya district, including mysterious deaths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p726IZ7VFmUYvxoEEhqCTO3JngQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69239'),
  ('379133397405443894', 'ChäoS;HEAd', 2008, 'Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hitomi Nabatame, Ui Miyazaki, Chiaki Takahashi, Yui Sakakibara, Hiroyuki Yoshino, Ayumi Tsuji, Eri Kitamura', 'TV-14', 'Takumi Nishijou, a high school student at the Private Suimei Academy, one day hears about the ''New Gen'' murders that have been occurring around the city. Although dismissing the subject because it doesn''t involve him, Takumi begins to experience strange mishaps around him, from a horrific picture he received while on his PC, to a mysterious Pink-Haired girl standing at a murder scene. From there on Takumi struggles to cope with the events unfolding around him, and is soon unaware of what is real or a delusion. As his fate opens up before him, the perpetrator behind the ''New Gen'' events attempts to find him, leading him into a world where nothing is as it seems.', 'Takumi Nishijou, a high school student at the Private Suimei Academy, one day hears about the ''New Gen'' murders that have been occurring around the city. Although dismissing the subject because it doesn''t involve him, Takumi begins to experience strange mishaps around him, from a horrific picture he received while on his PC, to a mysterious Pink-Haired girl standing at a murder scene. From there on Takumi struggles to cope with the events unfolding around him, and is soon unaware of what is real or a delusion. As his fate opens up before him, the perpetrator behind the ''New Gen'' events attempts to find him, leading him into a world where nothing is as it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lewQtkay1zX2VeedVLAbOoSzzBp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:56996'),
  ('450344554242186756', 'Chaotic', 2006, 'Animation, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Martin Rauff', null, 'Joshua Briggs, J. David Brimmer, Shawn Curran, Booth Daniels, Booth Daniels, Max Woertendyke, Sean Schemmel, David Wills', 'TV-Y7', 'A teenager named Tom, whose friend Kaz constantly tells him of his adventures in Chaotic. Tom, who believes that Chaotic is only a card game, thinks that Kaz is making things up, until he entered a password he received from the game, transporting him to the world of Chaotic.', 'A teenager named Tom, whose friend Kaz constantly tells him of his adventures in Chaotic. Tom, who believes that Chaotic is only a card game, thinks that Kaz is making things up, until he entered a password he received from the game, transporting him to the world of Chaotic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j4RYuHTJhG4WiAfrvbLmglX0Nxd.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:3787'),
  ('490733984823537837', 'Chapelwaite', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Peter Filardi, Jason Filardi', null, 'Adrien Brody, Emily Hampshire, Jennifer Ens, Sirena Gulamgaus, Ian Ho', 'TV-MA', 'In the 1850s, Captain Charles Boone relocates his family of three children to his ancestral home in the small, seemingly sleepy town of Preacher’s Corners, Maine after his wife dies at sea. Charles will soon have to confront the secrets of his family’s sordid history, and fight to end the darkness that has plagued the Boones for generations.', 'In the 1850s, Captain Charles Boone relocates his family of three children to his ancestral home in the small, seemingly sleepy town of Preacher’s Corners, Maine after his wife dies at sea. Charles will soon have to confront the secrets of his family’s sordid history, and fight to end the darkness that has plagued the Boones for generations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7Oix3Zkhg3ftRxmLmyDBJc9ycp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:126118'),
  ('449489813959163989', 'Chappelle''s Show', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Neal Brennan, Dave Chappelle', null, 'Dave Chappelle', 'TV-14', 'Dave Chappelle''s singular point of view is unleashed through a combination of laidback stand-up and street-smart sketches.', 'Dave Chappelle''s singular point of view is unleashed through a combination of laidback stand-up and street-smart sketches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHpTmNU2wLHokoVpzcnh2VQBJOI.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:713'),
  ('820541608408530404', 'Chara''s Café', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Charis Romas, Anna Hatzisofia', 'Charis Romas, Anna Hatzisofia', 'Efi Rassia, Charis Romas, Joyce Evidi, Renia Louizidou, Gerasimos Skiadaresis, Vasilis Halakatevakis, Fotini Demiri, Maria Kanellopoulou', null, 'This series takes place at the isolated village of Kolokotronitsi, a place where life has stuck some decades ago. When Hara, a young woman from Athens comes to the village and opens a cafe, a conflict occurs between her and the totally conservative mayor, Periandros, who doesn''t want the ideals and ethic of his village to be destroyed.', 'This series takes place at the isolated village of Kolokotronitsi, a place where life has stuck some decades ago. When Hara, a young woman from Athens comes to the village and opens a cafe, a conflict occurs between her and the totally conservative mayor, Periandros, who doesn''t want the ideals and ethic of his village to be destroyed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3la7PtHUGOLNkGCRuSjrTiNSZv.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:15561'),
  ('1046974154747793183', 'Charge! Men''s Private School', 1988, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Ken Yamaguchi, Yusaku Yara, Minoru Inaba, Koji Totani, Banjo Ginga, Ikuya Sawaki, Katsuji Mori, Ikuya Sawaki', null, 'Otokojuku, a private school for juvenile delinquents that were previously expelled from normal schools. At this school, Japanese chivalry is taught through the feudal and military fundamentals. Similar to an action film, the classes are overwhelmed by violence. Only those who survive it become true men.', 'Otokojuku, a private school for juvenile delinquents that were previously expelled from normal schools. At this school, Japanese chivalry is taught through the feudal and military fundamentals. Similar to an action film, the classes are overwhelmed by violence. Only those who survive it become true men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPy8BHh6BjI3m5jzOon4ClhilZk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88796'),
  ('869926409844609156', 'Charité', 2017, 'Drama', null, 'Andreas Drost', 'Lara Chelinho', 'TV-MA', 'Berlin, 1888. After penniless Ida’s life is saved at the Charité Hospital she must work off the treatment costs. While she becomes acquainted with the most brilliant physicians of this era at the world-famous hospital, the self-determined young woman discovers her passion for medicine.', 'Berlin, 1888. After penniless Ida’s life is saved at the Charité Hospital she must work off the treatment costs. While she becomes acquainted with the most brilliant physicians of this era at the world-famous hospital, the self-determined young woman discovers her passion for medicine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxzbAZb4BbLt5AtYhvC0sn7ppBv.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:70837'),
  ('767374927376762860', 'Charles II: The Power and The Passion', 2003, 'Drama', 'Joe Wright', null, 'Rufus Sewell, Rupert Graves, Charlie Creed-Miles, Christian Coulson, Shirley Henderson, Martin Freeman, Helen McCrory', null, 'Charles II: The Power and the Passion is a four-part television miniseries, broadcast on BBC One from 16 November to 7 December 2003. The series depicts the reign of Charles II, covering the period just before his Restoration in 1660. It focuses on his conflicts with Parliament, his relationships with his mistresses—particularly Barbara Villiers—and his efforts to restore England after the Civil War. When shown in the United States, as The Last King: The Power and the Passion of King Charles II, nearly an hour was removed for broadcast by the A&E Network. The edits often make little regard for either the full product''s continuity or coherence.', 'Charles II: The Power and the Passion is a four-part television miniseries, broadcast on BBC One from 16 November to 7 December 2003. The series depicts the reign of Charles II, covering the period just before his Restoration in 1660. It focuses on his conflicts with Parliament, his relationships with his mistresses—particularly Barbara Villiers—and his efforts to restore England after the Civil War. When shown in the United States, as The Last King: The Power and the Passion of King Charles II, nearly an hour was removed for broadcast by the A&E Network. The edits often make little regard for either the full product''s continuity or coherence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ZeWc9b8ShRdbJSY2NR3XkI7zoX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19311'),
  ('623329769309904762', 'Charles in Charge', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Michael Jacobs', null, 'Scott Baio, Willie Aames, Nicole Eggert, Josie Davis, Alexander Polinsky, Ellen Travolta, James T. Callahan', null, 'Charles, a 19-year-old student at the fictional Copeland College in New Brunswick, New Jersey, works as a live-in babysitter in exchange for room and board.', 'Charles, a 19-year-old student at the fictional Copeland College in New Brunswick, New Jersey, works as a live-in babysitter in exchange for room and board.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sM3nBqh3iSjPTBMtIFyWnROVLIz.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:566'),
  ('1093738610678482552', 'Charlie and Lola', 2005, 'Kids, Animation, Family', 'Lauren Child', null, null, 'TV-Y', 'Charlie and Lola is a British animated television series based on the Charlie and Lola books written by Lauren Child. It aired from 2005–2008. The animation uses a collage style that emulates the style of the original books.', 'Charlie and Lola is a British animated television series based on the Charlie and Lola books written by Lauren Child. It aired from 2005–2008. The animation uses a collage style that emulates the style of the original books.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78XSc7oUweLLpmjCJ9q59y2Mi8e.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:30958'),
  ('997559357386207797', 'Charlie Brooker''s Screenwipe', 2006, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Charlie Brooker', null, 'Charlie Brooker', 'NR', 'Charlie Brooker''s acerbic take on recent TV contains reviews of current shows, as well as stories and commentary on how television is produced.', 'Charlie Brooker''s acerbic take on recent TV contains reviews of current shows, as well as stories and commentary on how television is produced.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4rA6TmVOMJ7GZfiCLRMswtHk6gy.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:717'),
  ('712678718677160510', 'Charlie Brooker''s Weekly Wipe', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Charlie Brooker', null, 'Charlie Brooker', null, 'Charlie Brooker and guests cast their collective eyes over all what the telly, cinema, news and computer games have to offer, in order to wring a little laughter from a hilariously troubled world.', 'Charlie Brooker and guests cast their collective eyes over all what the telly, cinema, news and computer games have to offer, in order to wring a little laughter from a hilariously troubled world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3vs0aEkf6AZpcmviK7zsvghV5k2.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:58658'),
  ('1102325944817796157', 'Charlie Grace', 1995, 'Crime, Drama', 'Robert Singer', null, 'Mark Harmon, Leelee Sobieski, Robert Costanzo, Cindy Katz', 'NR', 'Charlie Grace is a Los Angeles private eye with a daughter named Jenny, works along with other cops, including his partner, Crawford, to solve different multiple mystery cases.', 'Charlie Grace is a Los Angeles private eye with a daughter named Jenny, works along with other cops, including his partner, Crawford, to solve different multiple mystery cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lLKWU96PwC64FB0TbAcnOC43Hba.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:26256'),
  ('618654729452968101', 'Charlie Jade', 2005, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Chris Roland, Robert Wertheimer', null, 'Jeffrey Pierce, Michael Filipowich, Michele Burgers, Tyrone Benskin, Danny Keogh, Marie-Julie Rivest, Patricia McKenzie', null, 'Charlie Jade is a science fiction television program filmed mainly in Cape Town, South Africa. It stars Jeffrey Pierce in the title role, as a detective from a parallel universe who finds himself trapped in our universe. This is a Canadian and South African co-production filmed in conjunction with CHUM Television and the South African Industrial Development Corporation. The special effects were produced by the Montreal-based company Cinegroupe led by Michel Lemire. The show started in 2004 and was aired on the Canadian Space Channel. It premiered on the Space Channel April 16, 2005 and aired in Eastern Europe, France, Italy, on SABC 3 in South Africa, on Fox Japan, and on AXN in Hong Kong. The show began airing in the United Kingdom in October 2007, on FX. The Sci Fi Channel in the United States premiered the show on June 6, 2008, but after 2 episodes on Friday prime-time, moved it to overnight Mon/Tue.', 'Charlie Jade is a science fiction television program filmed mainly in Cape Town, South Africa. It stars Jeffrey Pierce in the title role, as a detective from a parallel universe who finds himself trapped in our universe. This is a Canadian and South African co-production filmed in conjunction with CHUM Television and the South African Industrial Development Corporation. The special effects were produced by the Montreal-based company Cinegroupe led by Michel Lemire. The show started in 2004 and was aired on the Canadian Space Channel. It premiered on the Space Channel April 16, 2005 and aired in Eastern Europe, France, Italy, on SABC 3 in South Africa, on Fox Japan, and on AXN in Hong Kong. The show began airing in the United Kingdom in October 2007, on FX. The Sci Fi Channel in the United States premiered the show on June 6, 2008, but after 2 episodes on Friday prime-time, moved it to overnight Mon/Tue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xzRXEcVks38MC98o8h4fwqeTkx0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2746'),
  ('124245055902086608', 'Charlie Rose', 1991, 'Talk', 'Charlie Rose', null, 'Charlie Rose', null, 'Acclaimed interviewer and Emmy-winning journalist Charlie Rose engages a wide range of guests, including philosophers, writers, politicians, athletes, entertainers, artists, business leaders, scientists, educators, and other newsmakers in one-on-one interviews and round-table discussions.', 'Acclaimed interviewer and Emmy-winning journalist Charlie Rose engages a wide range of guests, including philosophers, writers, politicians, athletes, entertainers, artists, business leaders, scientists, educators, and other newsmakers in one-on-one interviews and round-table discussions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/egWWT6ZCYgAZlDYpibmB8FZByNH.jpg', 25, 'tmdb:tv:919'),
  ('351623829069429806', 'Charlie''s Angels', 1976, 'Action & Adventure', 'Ivan Goff, Ben Roberts', null, 'Jaclyn Smith, Cheryl Ladd, Tanya Roberts, David Doyle, John Forsythe', 'TV-PG', 'Beautiful, intelligent, and ultra-sophisticated, Charlie''s Angels are everything a man could dream of... and way more than they could ever handle! Receiving their orders via speaker phone from their never seen boss, Charlie, the Angels employ their incomparable sleuthing and combat skills, as well as their lethal feminine charm, to crack even the most seemingly insurmountable of cases.', 'Beautiful, intelligent, and ultra-sophisticated, Charlie''s Angels are everything a man could dream of... and way more than they could ever handle! Receiving their orders via speaker phone from their never seen boss, Charlie, the Angels employ their incomparable sleuthing and combat skills, as well as their lethal feminine charm, to crack even the most seemingly insurmountable of cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jxyI5V4LZ5rHDrXv7NpPh4EBCAo.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:3382'),
  ('175387154923636103', 'Charlie''s Angels', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Ivan Goff, Ben Roberts', null, 'Annie Ilonzeh, Minka Kelly, Rachael Taylor, Ramón Rodríguez, Victor Garber', 'TV-14', 'Everyone deserves a second chance—even a thief, a street racer and a cop who got in a little too deep. After all, the three women who solve cases for their elusive boss, Charlie Townsend, are no saints. They''re angels... Charlie''s Angels.', 'Everyone deserves a second chance—even a thief, a street racer and a cop who got in a little too deep. After all, the three women who solve cases for their elusive boss, Charlie Townsend, are no saints. They''re angels... Charlie''s Angels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4UiQ46T777kvKJCx9F9DAI3HajP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35282'),
  ('78048000235796003', 'Charlotte', 2015, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Koki Uchiyama, Ayane Sakura, Takahiro Mizushima, Maaya Uchida, Momo Asakura', 'TV-14', 'All thanks to the special ability that he developed, Yuu was able to cheat his way into a very prestigious high school. With his power, he thought nothing was going to stand in his way, until he met a mysterious girl named Nao Tomori and other students with special abilities just like him. It was the beginning to a new life.', 'All thanks to the special ability that he developed, Yuu was able to cheat his way into a very prestigious high school. With his power, he thought nothing was going to stand in his way, until he met a mysterious girl named Nao Tomori and other students with special abilities just like him. It was the beginning to a new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udiCs1RBGfda1z52cBxu8j9JNmP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63145'),
  ('646831615635333016', 'Charmed', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Constance M. Burge', null, 'Holly Marie Combs, Alyssa Milano, Rose McGowan, Brian Krause, Kaley Cuoco', 'TV-14', 'Three sisters (Prue, Piper and Phoebe) reunite and unlock their powers to become the Charmed Ones, the most powerful good witches of all time, whose prophesied destiny is to protect innocent lives from evil beings such as demons and warlocks. Each sister possesses unique magical powers that grow and evolve, while they attempt to maintain normal lives in modern day San Francisco.', 'Three sisters (Prue, Piper and Phoebe) reunite and unlock their powers to become the Charmed Ones, the most powerful good witches of all time, whose prophesied destiny is to protect innocent lives from evil beings such as demons and warlocks. Each sister possesses unique magical powers that grow and evolve, while they attempt to maintain normal lives in modern day San Francisco.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4bPJ1BWU2EtV69NII2GVvsugQ2.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:1981'),
  ('565908540086571592', 'Charmed', 2018, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jennie Snyder Urman, Amy Rardin, Jessica O''Toole', 'Jessica O''Toole, Constance M. Burge', 'Melonie Díaz, Sarah Jeffery, Rupert Evans, Lucy Barrett', 'TV-14', 'Set in the fictional college town of Hilltowne, Charmed follows the lives of three sisters, Macy, Mel and Maggie Vera who, after the tragic death of their mother, discover they are three of the most powerful witches of all time.', 'Set in the fictional college town of Hilltowne, Charmed follows the lives of three sisters, Macy, Mel and Maggie Vera who, after the tragic death of their mother, discover they are three of the most powerful witches of all time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/doXHjfOtEmX8kEq1tsMnNqq9YLZ.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:79611'),
  ('537131790398901943', 'Charmsukh', 2019, 'Drama', 'YKO', null, null, null, 'Charmsukh is an erotic, drama web-series streamed on ULLU network with each episode having unique storyline.', 'Charmsukh is an erotic, drama web-series streamed on ULLU network with each episode having unique storyline.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Kt9zIsrtqs1x1XyNFxOeEjlkKB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97072'),
  ('952560220022710949', 'Chase', 2010, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Jennifer Johnson', null, 'Kelli Giddish, Cole Hauser, Jesse Metcalfe, Amaury Nolasco, Rose Rollins', 'TV-14', 'Chase is an American police procedural drama television series created by Jennifer Johnson for the NBC network. The series follows a U.S. Marshals fugitive-apprehension team, based out of Houston, Texas. Jerry Bruckheimer and Johnson serve as executive producers for the one-hour drama. The series originally aired on Mondays at 10:00 pm ET/9:00 pm CT and premiered on September 20, 2010. After the mid-season break, Chase returned on Wednesdays at 9:00 pm ET/8:00 pm CT On October 19, 2010, the network ordered a full season consisting of 22 episodes, but this order was cut to 18 in December. On February 3, 2011, the show was put on "a hiatus" with no plan regarding the remaining episodes. On April 6, 2011, NBC announced the remaining five episodes would be broadcast on Saturday nights beginning on April 23, 2011. Later the show was replaced by Harry''s Law.', 'Chase is an American police procedural drama television series created by Jennifer Johnson for the NBC network. The series follows a U.S. Marshals fugitive-apprehension team, based out of Houston, Texas. Jerry Bruckheimer and Johnson serve as executive producers for the one-hour drama. The series originally aired on Mondays at 10:00 pm ET/9:00 pm CT and premiered on September 20, 2010. After the mid-season break, Chase returned on Wednesdays at 9:00 pm ET/8:00 pm CT On October 19, 2010, the network ordered a full season consisting of 22 episodes, but this order was cut to 18 in December. On February 3, 2011, the show was put on "a hiatus" with no plan regarding the remaining episodes. On April 6, 2011, NBC announced the remaining five episodes would be broadcast on Saturday nights beginning on April 23, 2011. Later the show was replaced by Harry''s Law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lS54o187N6vxONMJtjBRaBTnICL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32800'),
  ('1031109961042858843', 'CHASER GAME W: My Evil Boss is My Ex-Girlfriend', 2024, 'Drama', null, null, 'Yuuka Sugai, Yurika Nakamura, Chise, Hina Kikuchi, Nozomi Hanayagi, Nao Hoshino, Tomoka Kurotani', null, 'The story of a game development company employee and her boss, who happens to be her ex-girlfriend.', 'The story of a game development company employee and her boss, who happens to be her ex-girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXT6Hm4CcmaEqJ51P4HeESf1g9F.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:241871'),
  ('1111757862911999728', 'Chasing Classic Cars', 2008, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Chasing Classic Cars follows master car restorer Wayne Carini as he embarks on a mission to uncover the world''s most rare and exotic cars. Get an insider''s look at the elite club of car collectors as Wayne buys, restores, and sells vintage rides.', 'Chasing Classic Cars follows master car restorer Wayne Carini as he embarks on a mission to uncover the world''s most rare and exotic cars. Get an insider''s look at the elite club of car collectors as Wayne buys, restores, and sells vintage rides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rheTqdipcnZTSlEf1SykDPflXBd.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:37129'),
  ('873221849731488407', 'Chasing Life', 2014, 'Drama, Family', 'Susanna Fogel, Joni Lefkowitz', null, 'Italia Ricci, Mary Page Keller, Haley Ramm, Richard Brancatisano, Aisha Dee', 'TV-14', 'April, an aspiring journalist, is balancing her ambitious career with her family and a new office romance. In an unexpected twist of fate, April learns that she has leukemia.', 'April, an aspiring journalist, is balancing her ambitious career with her family and a new office romance. In an unexpected twist of fate, April learns that she has leukemia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/divzwWoDznYdqn0FtwyPuQfacg6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:60803'),
