  ('252043780748051378', 'Chicken Nugget', 2024, 'Comedy, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Lee Byeong-heon', 'Lee Byeong-heon', 'Ahn Jae-hong, Ryu Seung-ryong, Kim Yoo-jung', 'TV-MA', 'A woman steps into an odd machine and becomes... a chicken nugget?! Now, it''s up to her father and admirer to embark on a zany quest to bring her back.', 'A woman steps into an odd machine and becomes... a chicken nugget?! Now, it''s up to her father and admirer to embark on a zany quest to bring her back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hefpkltcFLcZSKXr65l0mPMRKn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:206686'),
  ('1073529117951046564', 'Chicks', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Eduard Oganesyan', 'Irina Gorbacheva, Alyona Mikhaylova, Irina Nosova, Varvara Shmykova, Anton Lapenko, Vitaly Kishchenko, Viktoriya Tolstoganova, Mikhail Troynik', null, 'Sveta, Marina and Lyuba work as prostitutes in a small southern township. Their friend Zhanna, who got a chance for a better life, comes back from Moscow with a plan — she wants to open a local gym. Together girls decide to abandon prostitution and start legal business, but their dream to become free, happy and independent will come at a cost.', 'Sveta, Marina and Lyuba work as prostitutes in a small southern township. Their friend Zhanna, who got a chance for a better life, comes back from Moscow with a plan — she wants to open a local gym. Together girls decide to abandon prostitution and start legal business, but their dream to become free, happy and independent will come at a cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLRL66LykG3kWy7IAxCbbAfXDdj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103664'),
  ('946844857150084291', 'Chico and the Man', 1974, 'Comedy', 'James Komack', null, 'Freddie Prinze, Della Reese, Jack Albertson, Scatman Crothers, Charo', null, 'Chico and the Man is an American sitcom which ran on NBC for four seasons, from September 13, 1974, to July 21, 1978. It stars Jack Albertson as Ed Brown, the cantankerous owner of a run down garage in an East Los Angeles barrio, and Freddie Prinze as Chico Rodriguez, an upbeat, optimistic Chicano young man who comes in looking for a job. It was the first U.S. television series set in a Mexican-American neighborhood.', 'Chico and the Man is an American sitcom which ran on NBC for four seasons, from September 13, 1974, to July 21, 1978. It stars Jack Albertson as Ed Brown, the cantankerous owner of a run down garage in an East Los Angeles barrio, and Freddie Prinze as Chico Rodriguez, an upbeat, optimistic Chicano young man who comes in looking for a job. It was the first U.S. television series set in a Mexican-American neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qP5KgCttoSaR0lBOGNA7kY7UdGR.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1935'),
  ('535935819487805158', 'Chief Detective 1958', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Park Jae-beom', 'Kim Young-shin', 'Lee Je-hoon, Lee Dong-hwi, Seo Eun-soo, Choi Woo-sung, Yoon Hyun-soo, Chung Su-bin, Choi Deok-moon, Song Wook-kyung', null, 'In an era of violence and corruption, Park Yeong-han, a humble detective, joins forces with Sang-sun, Gyeong-hwan and Ho-jeong to uphold justice.', 'In an era of violence and corruption, Park Yeong-han, a humble detective, joins forces with Sang-sun, Gyeong-hwan and Ho-jeong to uphold justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3iJPQbGF9MzZQXb5HiUZP43LPz8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:216292'),
  ('999988139717618406', 'Chief Kim', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Park Jae-beom', 'Park Jae-beom', 'Namkoong Min, Nam Sang-mi, Lee Jun-ho, Jung Hye-sung, Kim Won-hae, Kim Kang-hyun, Jo Hyun-sik, Ryu Hye-rin', 'NR', 'An accountant who''s deft at embezzling funds becomes an unintentional hero to his colleagues when he gets a new corporate job.', 'An accountant who''s deft at embezzling funds becomes an unintentional hero to his colleagues when he gets a new corporate job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yOi3P2Wvu2qSJd04cR30YyxVyol.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68947'),
  ('183613753901375851', 'Chief of Staff', 2019, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Kwak Jung-hwan', null, 'Lee Jung-jae, Shin Min-a, Lee Elijah, Kim Dong-jun, Jung Jin-young, Kim Kap-soo, Jung Woong-in, Im Won-hee', null, 'As a chief of staff in the National Assembly, Jang Tae-jun influences power behind the scenes while pursuing his own ambitions to rise to the top.', 'As a chief of staff in the National Assembly, Jang Tae-jun influences power behind the scenes while pursuing his own ambitions to rise to the top.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95U7TJGxDP6OHeAF5HP78as7eff.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:89642'),
  ('1023101707135714607', 'Chief of War', 2025, 'Drama', 'Thomas Pa''a Sibbett, Jason Momoa', null, 'Jason Momoa, Luciane Buchanan, Te Ao o Hinepehinga, Cliff Curtis, Kaina Makua, Moses Goods, Siua Ikale‘o, Brandon Finn', 'TV-MA', 'With Hawaii''s four kingdoms divided by war, the ferocious warrior Kaʻiana embarks on an epic mission to unite his people—as an existential threat approaches their shores.', 'With Hawaii''s four kingdoms divided by war, the ferocious warrior Kaʻiana embarks on an epic mission to unite his people—as an existential threat approaches their shores.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Mckh3qJRTzXTQNZtpb133RHmO4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:196890'),
  ('298163017004623930', 'Chiefs', 1983, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', null, 'Robert W. Lenski, Stuart Woods', 'Charlton Heston, Keith Carradine, Stephen Collins, Brad Davis, Wayne Rogers, Billy Dee Williams, Paul Sorvino, Victoria Tennant', 'NR', 'Three different police chiefs in three different eras become involved in a growing mystery -- who is the mass murderer behind the killing of transient youths in and around the fictional southern town of Delano over a forty year period?', 'Three different police chiefs in three different eras become involved in a growing mystery -- who is the mass murderer behind the killing of transient youths in and around the fictional southern town of Delano over a forty year period?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/byKTs8ftNOp5SNy0HzXdd6QiBIT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34156'),
  ('696991871225775030', 'Chihayafuru', 2011, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Asami Seto, Mamoru Miyano, Yoshimasa Hosoya', 'TV-14', 'Chihaya Ayase has spent most of her life supporting her sister’s model career. When she meets a boy named Arata Wataya, he thinks Chihaya has potential to become a great karuta player. As Chihaya dreams of becoming Japan''s best karuta player, she is soon separated from her karuta playing friends. Now in high school, Chihaya still plays karuta in the hope that she will one day meet her friends again.', 'Chihaya Ayase has spent most of her life supporting her sister’s model career. When she meets a boy named Arata Wataya, he thinks Chihaya has potential to become a great karuta player. As Chihaya dreams of becoming Japan''s best karuta player, she is soon separated from her karuta playing friends. Now in high school, Chihaya still plays karuta in the hope that she will one day meet her friends again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1yYnCaK8gLnLgQSnd9IGoapHbx.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:45247'),
  ('107116849223872556', 'Chiikawa', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Haruka Aoki, Ari Ozawa, Makoto Tanaka, Yuka Iguchi, Tomokazu Sugita, Hiroki Touchi, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Yuma Uchida', null, 'The story follows the sometimes happy, sometimes sad, and a tad stressful daily life of "some sort of small, cute creature" (Nanka Chiisakute Kawaii Yatsu) known as Chiikawa. Chiikawa enjoys delicious food with bees and rabbits, toils hard every day for the rewards of work, and still maintains a smile.', 'The story follows the sometimes happy, sometimes sad, and a tad stressful daily life of "some sort of small, cute creature" (Nanka Chiisakute Kawaii Yatsu) known as Chiikawa. Chiikawa enjoys delicious food with bees and rabbits, toils hard every day for the rewards of work, and still maintains a smile.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cXm3mxmlOWJZAyn5fqFI9JpARa3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:194916'),
  ('95861536399705788', 'Chiisana Tabi', 1983, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5j8HLZzU1KY0ceoWvRAmeRUFMuU.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:130990'),
  ('694734792849466693', 'Chikatilo', 2021, 'Crime, Drama', 'Sarik Andreasyan', null, 'Fyodor Lavrov, Nikolay Kozak, Oleg Kamenshchikov, Dmitry Vlaskin, Yuliya Afanasyeva, Igor Tsaregorodtsev, Artem Kiselev, Yulia Ovcharenko', null, 'He killed and went unpunished for more than ten years, and more than fifty people died at his hands. An innocent man was convicted and shot instead. For a long time, the murders he committed could not be combined into one case. Maniacs of this caliber simply did not exist in the USSR, so law enforcement agencies were not ready to fight the "Rabid Beast", as journalists later dubbed it. Vigilantes, police officers, investigators from the prosecutor''s office, psychiatrists were involved in the capture of Chikatilo, and new investigative techniques were developed that will help save innocent people.', 'He killed and went unpunished for more than ten years, and more than fifty people died at his hands. An innocent man was convicted and shot instead. For a long time, the murders he committed could not be combined into one case. Maniacs of this caliber simply did not exist in the USSR, so law enforcement agencies were not ready to fight the "Rabid Beast", as journalists later dubbed it. Vigilantes, police officers, investigators from the prosecutor''s office, psychiatrists were involved in the capture of Chikatilo, and new investigative techniques were developed that will help save innocent people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qFDdmmvyGXu4mPW4MUDuhNrXKMB.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:109356'),
  ('404673347215223256', 'Chikyuu Sentai Fiveman', 1990, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Kids', null, null, 'Toshiya Fiji, Kei Shindachiya, Ryohei Kobayashi, Kazuko Miyata, Ryo Narushima, Motoko Watanabe, Rica Matsumoto, Takeshi Ishikawa', null, 'Twenty years after their planet was attacked by the brutal Zone Empire, the five Hoshikawa children, who escaped and were raised on Earth, must prepare for a brand-new war. This time, though, they''re ready ... having developed the powerful Fiveman technology that will help them defend Earth from the same empire that conquered their home world.', 'Twenty years after their planet was attacked by the brutal Zone Empire, the five Hoshikawa children, who escaped and were raised on Earth, must prepare for a brand-new war. This time, though, they''re ready ... having developed the powerful Fiveman technology that will help them defend Earth from the same empire that conquered their home world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZZTqkVoA5SmYoRvDPtuPHBIwLg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3124'),
  ('998653994603395439', 'Childhood''s End', 2015, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Matthew Graham', null, 'Colm Meaney, Mike Vogel, Julian McMahon, Charles Dance, Yael Stone, Daisy Betts, Ashley Zukerman, Charlotte Nicdao', 'TV-14', 'The peaceful alien invasion of Earth by the mysterious “Overlords,” whose arrival begins decades of apparent utopia under indirect alien rule, at the cost of human identity and culture.', 'The peaceful alien invasion of Earth by the mysterious “Overlords,” whose arrival begins decades of apparent utopia under indirect alien rule, at the cost of human identity and culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4P5d70GyynagnYq4Rk881UjQiD0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63647'),
  ('901607960368111789', 'Children of Change', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', 'Sergey Taramaev', null, 'Viktoriya Isakova, Slava Kopeykin, Makar Khlebnikov, Khetag Khinchagov, Kuzma Kotrelev, Sergey Gilev, Artem Koshman, Ruslan Bratov', null, 'Half-brothers Yura, Ruslan, and Pyotr form a close family with their mother Flora. In 1995 Russia, greed and violence threaten their bond as they navigate underground clubs, fights, and the collapse of their once-secure world.', 'Half-brothers Yura, Ruslan, and Pyotr form a close family with their mother Flora. In 1995 Russia, greed and violence threaten their bond as they navigate underground clubs, fights, and the collapse of their once-secure world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqSR7XxPFXvnhEGdsYOEnQi8hmn.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:277837'),
  ('256229001566456110', 'Children of Evil', 2023, 'Crime', null, 'Katarina Mitrović, Bojan Vuletić', 'Anica Dobra, Nikola Kojo, Radovan Vujović, Ljubomir Bandović, Jovana Stojiljković, Slaven Došlo, Miodrag Dragičević, Milica Janevski', null, 'A masked perpetrator murders a prominent politician and leaves an old, golden coin in his hand. Nikola Bobic, a defence attorney, reluctantly takes a case and plunges into a dangerous game that will change his life forever.', 'A masked perpetrator murders a prominent politician and leaves an old, golden coin in his hand. Nikola Bobic, a defence attorney, reluctantly takes a case and plunges into a dangerous game that will change his life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l25467sT2fd6tDh16ZaKHlgXCDU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:238648'),
  ('921744742630011445', 'Children of Nobody', 2018, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Kim Seon-a, Lee Yi-kyung, Nam Gyu-ri, Cha Hak-yeon, Na Young-hee, Oh Hye-won, Yeon Je-hyung, Kim Young-jae', null, 'Cha Woo Kyung is a child counselor who works at a children’s center. Her life seems perfect since he is married to a great husband and is pregnant. However, her perfect life doesn''t last long, when an accident changes her life. She then meets Kang Ji Hun, a detective who is hurt for hiding his troubling past but is strict toward criminals and believes they should be punished to the full extent.', 'Cha Woo Kyung is a child counselor who works at a children’s center. Her life seems perfect since he is married to a great husband and is pregnant. However, her perfect life doesn''t last long, when an accident changes her life. She then meets Kang Ji Hun, a detective who is hurt for hiding his troubling past but is strict toward criminals and believes they should be punished to the full extent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x5YVWkS6NfiGh8leVttQWnDHIN7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83940'),
  ('1029852283814810709', 'Children of Paradise', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', null, null, 'İsmail Hacıoğlu, Özgü Kaya, Yurdaer Okur, Melisa Şenolsun, Şebnem Doğruer, Evliya Aykan, Eda Akalın, Ali Gözüşirin', null, 'Iskender was a feared gangster in the dark alleys of Istanbul, known for his own rough code of honor—until betrayal left him bleeding and stripped of everything he had built. When he opens his eyes in a quiet Aegean town, he finds himself surrounded by warmth he has never known: a caring mother, a blind little sister, a home that feels like it was always his. The townspeople believe he is Kamil, a long-lost son returned; only he knows the truth. But the past never lets go—old enemies, blood feuds, and the ghosts of his choices haunt him still. As he uncovers a shocking secret—that this family is bound to him by blood—Iskender stands at a crossroads. Revenge or redemption? Will he remain the ruthless survivor the streets created, or dare to become the man he was meant to be? This is a story of love, betrayal, and the price of becoming truly human.', 'Iskender was a feared gangster in the dark alleys of Istanbul, known for his own rough code of honor—until betrayal left him bleeding and stripped of everything he had built. When he opens his eyes in a quiet Aegean town, he finds himself surrounded by warmth he has never known: a caring mother, a blind little sister, a home that feels like it was always his. The townspeople believe he is Kamil, a long-lost son returned; only he knows the truth. But the past never lets go—old enemies, blood feuds, and the ghosts of his choices haunt him still. As he uncovers a shocking secret—that this family is bound to him by blood—Iskender stands at a crossroads. Revenge or redemption? Will he remain the ruthless survivor the streets created, or dare to become the man he was meant to be? This is a story of love, betrayal, and the price of becoming truly human.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6QGAQBiAWXVPQvc9um8o9Q90jY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:299847'),
  ('1042923573059420548', 'Children of the Church Steps', 2024, 'Drama', 'Luis Lomenha', null, 'Samuel Silva, Patrick Congo, Andrei Marques, Wendy Queiroz, Bruno Gagliasso, Leandro Firmino, Maria Bopp, Stepan Nercessian', 'TV-MA', 'Inspired by the 1993 Candelária massacre in Rio de Janeiro, four homeless youths—Douglas, Sete, Jesus and Pipoca—navigate street life, dreams, and survival, blending their stories with dreamlike sequences in the 36 hours before the massacre unfolds.', 'Inspired by the 1993 Candelária massacre in Rio de Janeiro, four homeless youths—Douglas, Sete, Jesus and Pipoca—navigate street life, dreams, and survival, blending their stories with dreamlike sequences in the 36 hours before the massacre unfolds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Wnp1L4iy59hQDdJopcckVsFf08.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:272730'),
  ('686113148870671283', 'Children of the Stones', 1977, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids, Mystery', 'Jeremy Burnham, Trevor Ray', 'Trevor Ray, Jeremy Burnham', 'Gareth Thomas, Veronica Strong, Peter Demin, Ruth Dunning', null, 'In a sleepy English village surrounded by a megalithic stone circle, an astrophysicist and his teenage son arrive to research the standing stones, but end up delving into the past in ways they never expected.', 'In a sleepy English village surrounded by a megalithic stone circle, an astrophysicist and his teenage son arrive to research the standing stones, but end up delving into the past in ways they never expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxELRxZNmaxR4ls6n4PfHgt3vDK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6226'),
  ('6207014875785380', 'Children of the Whales', 2017, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuuichirou Umehara, Hiroshi Kamiya, Mikako Komatsu, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Manaka Iwami, Natsuki Hanae, Daiki Yamashita', 'TV-14', 'As a magic wielder, young archivist Chakuro knows his time is short, but everything changes when a girl from the outside appears on his island.', 'As a magic wielder, young archivist Chakuro knows his time is short, but everything changes when a girl from the outside appears on his island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/726IYhNnYkoCXCgqjUouqeixyfm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73017'),
  ('548897056918842230', 'Children Ruin Everything', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Kurt Smeaton', 'Melanie Orr, Renuka Jeyapalan', 'Meaghan Rath, Aaron Abrams, Mikayla SwamiNathan, Logan Nicholson, Ennis Esmer', 'TV-14', 'Astrid and James, who struggle to find a balance between being mom and dad to two kids and being who they were before offspring.', 'Astrid and James, who struggle to find a balance between being mom and dad to two kids and being who they were before offspring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4wlU3Eafo297qZo8o3KrFNIbPo9.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:154167'),
  ('297770583529732989', 'Childrens Hospital', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Rob Corddry, Jonathan Stern, David Wain', null, 'Ken Marino, Rob Huebel, Rob Corddry, Malin Åkerman, Lake Bell, Erinn Hayes, Megan Mullally, Henry Winkler', 'TV-14', 'A hospital isn''t a place for lazy people. It''s a place for smart people who take care of people who aren''t smart enough to keep themselves healthy. So begins Children''s Hospital, a parody series that follows the lives, loves and laughs of a hospital staff.', 'A hospital isn''t a place for lazy people. It''s a place for smart people who take care of people who aren''t smart enough to keep themselves healthy. So begins Children''s Hospital, a parody series that follows the lives, loves and laughs of a hospital staff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bbnXmarKkuxde9kkeyjAPzZY6Od.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:33056'),
  ('996697170477216061', 'Chillers', 1990, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Steven North', null, 'Anthony Perkins', null, 'A 1990 horror anthology series, with host Anthony Perkins presenting and screening tales based on Patricia Highsmith''s short stories that display a sinister atmosphere, and delve into the darkest depths of human nature.', 'A 1990 horror anthology series, with host Anthony Perkins presenting and screening tales based on Patricia Highsmith''s short stories that display a sinister atmosphere, and delve into the darkest depths of human nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3LvU6vvy3t9F166iSAx0ntNsMN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45173'),
  ('908578400407026266', 'Chillin'' in Another World with Level 2 Super Cheat Powers', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Satoshi Hino, Rie Kugimiya, Aya Yamane, Mari Hino, Yuuki Hirose, Nene Hieda, Taishi Murata', 'TV-14', 'The Magical Kingdom of Klyrode summons hundreds of heroes from other worlds every year to fight in their war against the Dark One and his army of powerful demons. Banaza is one of those heroes, summoned from the Royal Capital Paluma, but something’s not right—Banaza is only an average merchant. He has no magic, no fighting ability, and his stats are abysmal. Worse, a mishap leaves him unable to return home! Rejected as a hero and stranded in another world, abandoned to the far reaches of the kingdom by a cruel king who just wants him gone, Banaza’s fate looks pretty bleak. But what will happen once the failed hero candidate finds himself with super cheat powers once he hits level two?', 'The Magical Kingdom of Klyrode summons hundreds of heroes from other worlds every year to fight in their war against the Dark One and his army of powerful demons. Banaza is one of those heroes, summoned from the Royal Capital Paluma, but something’s not right—Banaza is only an average merchant. He has no magic, no fighting ability, and his stats are abysmal. Worse, a mishap leaves him unable to return home! Rejected as a hero and stranded in another world, abandoned to the far reaches of the kingdom by a cruel king who just wants him gone, Banaza’s fate looks pretty bleak. But what will happen once the failed hero candidate finds himself with super cheat powers once he hits level two?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3eBu6hYDRe72ZPUfLbhaHfF7EM9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:237233'),
  ('1139641475102598801', 'Chillin'' in My 30s After Getting Fired From the Demon King''s Army', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Hitomi Amamiya', 'Tomokazu Sugita, Akane Fujita', null, 'Dariel, a dark soldier in the demon king''s army who cannot use magic, has risen to the position of assistant to the Four Generals with his talent and energy, and has been wielding his skill. However, as soon as the Four Generals are replaced, Dariel is fired from the army. Dariel is devastated, but when he arrives in a human village, he finds that his adventuring skills, which are supposed to be useless to demons, have blossomed! "I was... human?" Dariel decides to spend his second life in this village, and the requests start pouring in! Trouble! False charge! Duel! With his natural skills and the adjusting power that he developed in his old place, the former dark soldier solves them all!', 'Dariel, a dark soldier in the demon king''s army who cannot use magic, has risen to the position of assistant to the Four Generals with his talent and energy, and has been wielding his skill. However, as soon as the Four Generals are replaced, Dariel is fired from the army. Dariel is devastated, but when he arrives in a human village, he finds that his adventuring skills, which are supposed to be useless to demons, have blossomed! "I was... human?" Dariel decides to spend his second life in this village, and the requests start pouring in! Trouble! False charge! Duel! With his natural skills and the adjusting power that he developed in his old place, the former dark soldier solves them all!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wt3y5uru1yaHRHl8KUZ68HqcaMv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:206324'),
  ('919579327314615438', 'Chilling Adventures of Sabrina', 2018, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Roberto Aguirre-Sacasa', null, 'Kiernan Shipka, Ross Lynch, Lucy Davis, Miranda Otto, Chance Perdomo, Michelle Gomez, Jaz Sinclair, Richard Coyle', 'TV-14', 'Magic and mischief collide as half-human, half-witch Sabrina navigates between two worlds: mortal teen life and her family''s legacy, the Church of Night.', 'Magic and mischief collide as half-human, half-witch Sabrina navigates between two worlds: mortal teen life and her family''s legacy, the Church of Night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yxMpoHO0CXP5o9gB7IfsciilQS4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:79242'),
  ('1022258470426165763', 'Chimera', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', null, 'Lee Jin-mae', 'Park Hae-soo, Claudia Kim, Lee Hee-jun, Cha Joo-young, Jung Young-ki, Yoon Ji-won, Woo Hyeon, Nam Kee-ae', 'TV-14', 'Chimera incident, a serial murder and explosion crime that shook the year of 1984, takes place exactly the same thirty five years later in 2019. Just like the terrible explosion in the past, the murder of the crime is called Chimera, a monster in the Greek myth with the head of a lion, body as a goat, and tail as a snake that shoots fire through its throat.', 'Chimera incident, a serial murder and explosion crime that shook the year of 1984, takes place exactly the same thirty five years later in 2019. Just like the terrible explosion in the past, the murder of the crime is called Chimera, a monster in the Greek myth with the head of a lion, body as a goat, and tail as a snake that shoots fire through its throat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v16Q8DFQeEZ2vxkylS731WHQNLh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96262'),
  ('131223687970119742', 'Chimera', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', null, 'Oleg Malovichko', 'Eldar Kalimulin, Aleksandr Kuznetsov, Lukerya Ilyashenko, Egor Koreshkov, Andrey Smirnov, Vasily Mikhailov, Angelina Zagrebina, Igor Mirkurbanov', null, 'In 2012, the security forces won a large-scale war against drug trafficking. The largest shipments were intercepted and supply corridors from Afghanistan and Europe were paralyzed. But in just one year, a new one was created on the ruins of the largest underground market in Europe. And now modern technology and young geniuses have come here, turning the drug trade into a high-tech industrial industry.', 'In 2012, the security forces won a large-scale war against drug trafficking. The largest shipments were intercepted and supply corridors from Afghanistan and Europe were paralyzed. But in just one year, a new one was created on the ruins of the largest underground market in Europe. And now modern technology and young geniuses have come here, turning the drug trade into a high-tech industrial industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cquynqVcywUIWGphwT4h3Dk6XZl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210297'),
  ('24941283728996564', 'Chimp Crazy', 2024, 'Documentary', null, 'Evan Wise', 'Tonia Haddix, Alan Cumming, Eric Goode, Pamela Rosaire-Zoppe, Dwayne Cunningham', null, 'Former nurse-turned-exotic animal broker Tonia Haddix, who refers to herself as the “Dolly Parton of chimps”, spends her days caring for animals in captivity. However, her limitless love for one chimpanzee in particular spins into a wild cat-and-mouse game with authorities and an animal rights group.', 'Former nurse-turned-exotic animal broker Tonia Haddix, who refers to herself as the “Dolly Parton of chimps”, spends her days caring for animals in captivity. However, her limitless love for one chimpanzee in particular spins into a wild cat-and-mouse game with authorities and an animal rights group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdiqhuYK7WDCSihybbBsXBII0Zq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259271'),
  ('909295048704239735', 'Chimp Empire', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Mahershala Ali', 'TV-PG', 'A vast community of chimpanzees thrives in a forest in Uganda, navigating complex social politics, family dynamics and dangerous territory disputes.', 'A vast community of chimpanzees thrives in a forest in Uganda, navigating complex social politics, family dynamics and dangerous territory disputes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fBs6Z1QOmZSOnm1PzMjE571tQBs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222792'),
  ('823004897226862642', 'Chimudondon', 2022, 'Family, Drama, Kids, Comedy', null, null, 'Yuina Kuroshima, Yukie Nakama, Haruna Kawaguchi, Moka Kamishiraishi, Nao Omori, Ryo Ryusei, Hio Miyazawa', null, 'Higa Nobuko was born and raised with her four siblings in a farmhouse in the "Yanbaru region" in the northern part of the main island of Okinawa. She aims to become a chef drawing inspiration from Okinawan cuisine. The four siblings follow very different paths, but the memories of their hometown connect their hearts and they''re able to overcome their hardships as a family.', 'Higa Nobuko was born and raised with her four siblings in a farmhouse in the "Yanbaru region" in the northern part of the main island of Okinawa. She aims to become a chef drawing inspiration from Okinawan cuisine. The four siblings follow very different paths, but the memories of their hometown connect their hearts and they''re able to overcome their hardships as a family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6h6JU2SfrUrKb1ukRqWAKlSCLwV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156120'),
  ('1129685428414585294', 'China Beach', 1988, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'John Wells, John Sacret Young', null, 'Dana Delany, Marg Helgenberger, Michael Boatman, Troy Evans, Nancy Giles, Jeff Kober, Robert Picardo, Concetta Tomei', null, 'Dateline: November 1967. Within klicks of Danang, Vietnam, sits a U.S. Army base, bar and hospital on China Beach filled with wounded soldiers and one very lovely but damaged Army Nurse Colleen McMurphy. Many heroes, dead and alive, try to make sense of life and death in between bourbon, bullets and battles.', 'Dateline: November 1967. Within klicks of Danang, Vietnam, sits a U.S. Army base, bar and hospital on China Beach filled with wounded soldiers and one very lovely but damaged Army Nurse Colleen McMurphy. Many heroes, dead and alive, try to make sense of life and death in between bourbon, bullets and battles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hAHjHqh9b31xljMxSc6PBet3a1X.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2294'),
  ('1047753964562627949', 'China in the classics', 2021, 'Reality', null, null, 'Sa Beining, 蒙曼', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/beQmPZh4Qst88KTm9FUiDEMhs01.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:118977'),
  ('1045050410997955553', 'China in the Story', 2019, 'Reality', 'Qinxin Tian', null, 'Sa Beining, Wang Jianing', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xvS2XTIgtBR7OLEay5Iw7u1bfzX.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:113146'),
  ('1827183637813068', 'China, IL', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Brad Neely', null, 'Brad Neely, Greta Gerwig, Hulk Hogan, Jason Walden, Jeffrey Tambor, Gary Anthony Williams, Chelsea Peretti, Hannibal Buress', 'TV-14', 'China, IL – meaning "China, Illinois" – is an animated television series for the cable network Adult Swim. The series is created by Brad Neely, and features Neely''s existing characters from the China, IL web series and special. Characters include Frank and Steve Smith, aka "The Professor Brothers," and Mark "Baby" Cakes. Neely provides the voice for all three characters. The series is produced by Williams Street and animated by Titmouse, Inc. China, IL has been renewed for a second season with the possibility of a new half-hour runtime. On May 25, 2008, Adult Swim ran The Funeral, an 11-minute special which was streamed on the now defunct Super Deluxe website. The special combined Brad Neely''s Professor Brothers and Baby Cakes webseries, which were also streamed at Super Deluxe, and established a larger environment for the characters. The special, as well as Brad Neely''s other videos, can be viewed at Neely''s YouTube page.', 'China, IL – meaning "China, Illinois" – is an animated television series for the cable network Adult Swim. The series is created by Brad Neely, and features Neely''s existing characters from the China, IL web series and special. Characters include Frank and Steve Smith, aka "The Professor Brothers," and Mark "Baby" Cakes. Neely provides the voice for all three characters. The series is produced by Williams Street and animated by Titmouse, Inc. China, IL has been renewed for a second season with the possibility of a new half-hour runtime. On May 25, 2008, Adult Swim ran The Funeral, an 11-minute special which was streamed on the now defunct Super Deluxe website. The special combined Brad Neely''s Professor Brothers and Baby Cakes webseries, which were also streamed at Super Deluxe, and established a larger environment for the characters. The special, as well as Brad Neely''s other videos, can be viewed at Neely''s YouTube page.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxzKGspzftXVmhIquL2tYdt9ZU5.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:39680'),
  ('436401027028349205', 'Chinese Folklore', 1974, null, null, null, 'Shek Sau, Mary Hon Ma-Lee, Sandra Lang, Susanna Kwan, Cheung Ying-Tsoi, Lee Tim-Sing, Chan Yau-Hau, Helena Law Lan', null, '《民間傳奇》adapted dozens of famous Chinese folk tales, dramas, and myth legends, such as "The Butterfly Lovers" and "Chang''e Flying to the Moon". These stories show the joys and sorrows of ancient Chinese people, and celebrate the righteous and kind while condemning evil. The endings are not always perfect, but justice eventually prevails and evil-doers get what they deserve. The show is a classic in Chinese TV history, often broadcasted during holidays, and remains unsurpassed to this day.', '《民間傳奇》adapted dozens of famous Chinese folk tales, dramas, and myth legends, such as "The Butterfly Lovers" and "Chang''e Flying to the Moon". These stories show the joys and sorrows of ancient Chinese people, and celebrate the righteous and kind while condemning evil. The endings are not always perfect, but justice eventually prevails and evil-doers get what they deserve. The show is a classic in Chinese TV history, often broadcasted during holidays, and remains unsurpassed to this day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yg6vIhkazFq1ac6993Taw1TQ3eI.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:109691'),
  ('646909926091275545', 'Chinese Paladin', 2005, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kwok-Lap Lee', 'Hai Tao, 阎虹宇, Dang Chi-Saan', 'Hu Ge, Liu Yifei, Ady An, Eddie Peng Yu-Yan, Esther Liu, Limin Deng, Jiang Xin, Elvis Tsui Kam-Kong', null, 'Li Xiaoyao journeys to Dream Island to find a cure for his sick aunt, where he falls in love with Zhao Ling’er and marries her. After losing his memory in an attack, he forgets Ling’er and returns home with her. As she tries to win back his love, Xiaoyao embarks on a quest to find her when she mysteriously disappears, uncovering hidden secrets along the way.', 'Li Xiaoyao journeys to Dream Island to find a cure for his sick aunt, where he falls in love with Zhao Ling’er and marries her. After losing his memory in an attack, he forgets Ling’er and returns home with her. As she tries to win back his love, Xiaoyao embarks on a quest to find her when she mysteriously disappears, uncovering hidden secrets along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fdLDouYBTjlhr0Hdh3dOsJrdEQY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8757'),
  ('106309457364147209', 'Chinese Paladin 3', 2009, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kwok-Lap Lee', null, 'Hu Ge, Yang Mi, Wallace Huo, Liu Shishi, Tang Yan, Lam Tze-Chung, Guo Xiaoting, Gordon Liu Chia-Hui', null, 'Jing Tian dreams of becoming a paladin of the Mt. Shu Sect. To assist the Mt. Shu Sect in sealing off Shu Yao Pagoda, he and Tang Xuejian, Xu Changqing, and others set off to find the five mystical pearls.', 'Jing Tian dreams of becoming a paladin of the Mt. Shu Sect. To assist the Mt. Shu Sect in sealing off Shu Yao Pagoda, he and Tang Xuejian, Xu Changqing, and others set off to find the five mystical pearls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VXvuxgb5AdkpygNNcREhk7ibro.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:33823'),
  ('1126488864491317957', 'Chinpui', 1989, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Fujiko F. Fujio', 'Noboru Shiroyama', 'Megumi Hayashibara, Rumiko Ukai, Yuri Nashiwa, Sanae Miyuki', 'TV-G', 'TV anime show based on the manga by F. Fujio Fujiko.', 'TV anime show based on the manga by F. Fujio Fujiko.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rF6bWMZpibRguxRec5vzGPNP13p.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65719'),
  ('687130963429785241', 'Chio''s School Road', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Takayuki Inagaki', null, 'Naomi Ohzora, Chiaki Omigawa, Kaede Hondo, You Taichi, Rikiya Koyama, Hiroki Takahashi, Minori Suzuki, Minami Shinoda', null, 'Miyamo Chio, a first-year at the completely ordinary high school Samejima Academy. Chio just wants to get through her school life without standing out too much, but for some reason, all kinds of obstacles await her along the path she takes to school. Her long-time friend Nonomura Manana, who''s trying to quit being an otaku; the flawless Hosokawa Yuki, who occupies the top caste in the school; and lots of nameless people about town find themselves in Chio''s path as she employs the (useless) techniques she''s acquired from her Western video games in her daily efforts to get to school.', 'Miyamo Chio, a first-year at the completely ordinary high school Samejima Academy. Chio just wants to get through her school life without standing out too much, but for some reason, all kinds of obstacles await her along the path she takes to school. Her long-time friend Nonomura Manana, who''s trying to quit being an otaku; the flawless Hosokawa Yuki, who occupies the top caste in the school; and lots of nameless people about town find themselves in Chio''s path as she employs the (useless) techniques she''s acquired from her Western video games in her daily efforts to get to school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/taElEb8RT6CTTTlj1eYiGPzro9X.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80462'),
  ('993696476467273523', 'Chip ''n Dale''s Nutty Tales', 2017, 'Animation', null, null, 'Tress MacNeille, Bret Iwan, Daniel Ross, Bill Farmer, Russi Taylor, Corey Burton', null, 'Things are about to get a little nutty as Chip and Dale set off on adventures around Hot Dog Hills in these eight exciting shorts! The dynamic duo can’t seem to stay away from trouble as they bake up BIG muffin mayhem, set sail on a fishing trip and create a mail mishap along with other misadventures. But no matter where they end up, Chip and Dale will do whatever it takes to help their Roadster Racing friends and have a laugh along the way!', 'Things are about to get a little nutty as Chip and Dale set off on adventures around Hot Dog Hills in these eight exciting shorts! The dynamic duo can’t seem to stay away from trouble as they bake up BIG muffin mayhem, set sail on a fishing trip and create a mail mishap along with other misadventures. But no matter where they end up, Chip and Dale will do whatever it takes to help their Roadster Racing friends and have a laugh along the way!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6uH3IONWeYe0JEaHMIAF7HbUVj.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:82707'),
  ('996929415694346549', 'Chip ''n'' Dale Rescue Rangers', 1989, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Family, Action & Adventure', 'Tad Stones, Alan Zaslove', 'Dev Ross, Tad Stones, Kevin Hopps', 'Corey Burton, Tress MacNeille, Jim Cummings', 'TV-Y7', 'Chip and Dale head a small, eccentric group of animal characters who monitor not only the human world, but the animal community as well, solving mysteries wherever they may be. The "Rescue Rangers" take the cases that fall through the cracks.', 'Chip and Dale head a small, eccentric group of animal characters who monitor not only the human world, but the animal community as well, solving mysteries wherever they may be. The "Rescue Rangers" take the cases that fall through the cracks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/44VE1LaaZq4bZhMDo6Yi29NO4H.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1615'),
  ('49667468202482499', 'Chip ''n'' Dale: Park Life', 2021, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Matthew Géczy, Kaycie Chase, Bill Farmer, Sylvain Caruso, David Gasman, Lee Delong', 'TV-Y7', 'A non-verbal, classic style comedy, following the ups and downs of the much-loved chipmunk troublemakers living life in the big city.', 'A non-verbal, classic style comedy, following the ups and downs of the much-loved chipmunk troublemakers living life in the big city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3JPFgEWoiV6RAzD5o5why4xISDw.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:96715'),
  ('315169894600763811', 'Chip and Potato', 2018, 'Kids, Animation', null, null, 'Abigail Journey Oliver, Chance Hurstfield, Dominic Good, Briana Buckmaster, Emma Jayne Maas, Andrea Libman, Alessandro Juliani, Brian Dobson', 'TV-Y', 'Lovable pug Chip starts kindergarten, makes new friends and tries new things -- with a little help from Potato, her secret mouse pal.', 'Lovable pug Chip starts kindergarten, makes new friends and tries new things -- with a little help from Potato, her secret mouse pal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/df2OtvZdUgiNhxRoB9cvwTBttrm.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:89504'),
  ('47601317532443120', 'CHiPs', 1977, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Rick Rosner', null, 'Erik Estrada, Robert Pine, Tom Reilly, Paul Linke, Lou Wagner, Bruce Penhall, Tina Gayle, Clarence Gilyard Jr.', 'TV-G', 'Lighthearted look at the adventures of two Highway Patrol officers in Los Angeles. The main characters are Jon Baker and Frank Poncherello, two motorcycle officers always on the street to save lives.', 'Lighthearted look at the adventures of two Highway Patrol officers in Los Angeles. The main characters are Jon Baker and Frank Poncherello, two motorcycle officers always on the street to save lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1464ScbUZQ22RjFtRtGiv4i2Zrs.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:509'),
  ('70487571536003116', 'Chiquititas', 2013, 'Kids, Family, Soap', 'Cris Morena, Íris Abravanel', 'Íris Abravanel', 'Giovanna Grigio, Manuela do Monte, Raissa Chaddad, Gabriel Santana, Júlia Olliver, Filipe Cavalcante, Cinthia Cruz, Lívia Inhudes', null, 'Based on the original version of same name created by Cris Morena, the series tells the story of a group of orphans living in a manor, known as Raio de Luz, struggling and being guided by a young woman, Carol, that assumes a maternal figure for them. Their experiences such as discovering first love, deceptions, loneliness and friendship, as well as adventures in fantasy, are depicted throughout the series. The narrative is followed by musical themes and videoclips.', 'Based on the original version of same name created by Cris Morena, the series tells the story of a group of orphans living in a manor, known as Raio de Luz, struggling and being guided by a young woman, Carol, that assumes a maternal figure for them. Their experiences such as discovering first love, deceptions, loneliness and friendship, as well as adventures in fantasy, are depicted throughout the series. The narrative is followed by musical themes and videoclips.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b23MVqShzKA6JcRYuFqTRc7MmRB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:58566'),
  ('208355374549414692', 'Chispita', 1982, 'Drama', 'Abel Santacruz', null, 'Lucero, Angélica Aragón, Enrique Lizalde, Gastón Tuset, Alma Delfina, Leonardo Daniel, Elsa Cárdenas, Manuel López Ochoa', null, 'Chispita is a telenovela made by Mexican TV network Televisa. It is a familiar telenovela, set in Mexico. This telenovela was broadcast in 1983. This was the first telenovela that Lucero starred as a main character.', 'Chispita is a telenovela made by Mexican TV network Televisa. It is a familiar telenovela, set in Mexico. This telenovela was broadcast in 1983. This was the first telenovela that Lucero starred as a main character.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1NYWffXQtdNoi6pQWbfqmD1r4Kt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:17483'),
  ('520766353687063623', 'Chitose Is in the Ramune Bottle', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Shogo Sakata, Manaka Iwami, Hina Youmiya, Rumi Okubo, Ikumi Hasegawa, Chika Anzai, Yohei Azakami, Masaya Miyazaki', null, 'Saku Chitose is a student at Fujishi High School, the most prestigious school in Fukui Prefecture. Outstanding in class, on the field, and in his social life, Saku attracts attention, good and bad. Naturally, he is surrounded by a circle of friends anyone would be happy to have. Now in the spring of his second year, with a new class, Saku is asked to help a shut-in classmate return to school life.', 'Saku Chitose is a student at Fujishi High School, the most prestigious school in Fukui Prefecture. Outstanding in class, on the field, and in his social life, Saku attracts attention, good and bad. Naturally, he is surrounded by a circle of friends anyone would be happy to have. Now in the spring of his second year, with a new class, Saku is asked to help a shut-in classmate return to school life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7tpcFkOpLcWkJU6mV5ooJyHA3DR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:261343'),
  ('445185892239128637', 'Chivalry', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Sarah Solemani', null, 'Steve Coogan, Sarah Solemani', 'TV-MA', 'A successful producer and a woke writer and director are brought closer by a creeping attraction and a feeling that they are just pawns in the studio''s agenda for a Saudi Arabian buyout.', 'A successful producer and a woke writer and director are brought closer by a creeping attraction and a feeling that they are just pawns in the studio''s agenda for a Saudi Arabian buyout.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQWAa4GYqyBNsbeut8b52FStdnj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156942');
insert into temp_tv_shows_seed (id, title, year, genre, creator, writers, cast_members, age_rating, overview, synopsis, poster_url, seasons, source_key)
values
  ('414386636598088850', 'Chivalry of a Failed Knight', 2015, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Ryota Osaka, Shizuka Ishigami, Nao Toyama, Shintaro Asanuma, Yu Kobayashi, Hisako Kanemoto, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Mao Ichimichi', 'TV-MA', 'Magic Knights are modern magic-users who fight with weapons converted from their souls. Ikki Kurogane goes to a school for these Magic Knights, but he is the "Failed Knight" or "Worst One" who is failing because he has no magical skills. However, one day, he is challenged to a duel by Stella, a foreign princess and the "Number One" student. In this duel, "the loser must be obedient for life."', 'Magic Knights are modern magic-users who fight with weapons converted from their souls. Ikki Kurogane goes to a school for these Magic Knights, but he is the "Failed Knight" or "Worst One" who is failing because he has no magical skills. However, one day, he is challenged to a duel by Stella, a foreign princess and the "Number One" student. In this duel, "the loser must be obedient for life."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g2DoS2AwOtaRlJStUNlcTsm3pmS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67154'),
  ('32072087923892050', 'CHIVAS: El Rebaño Sagrado', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Ricardo Peláez, Luis Fernando Tena, Antonio Briseño, Cristian Calderón, José Juan Macías, Gilberto Sepúlveda, Amaury Vergara, Jorge Vergara', null, 'This four-part docuseries chronicles one unforgettable season with one of Mexico''s most popular soccer club, the Chivas of Guadalajara, as they strive to resurrect their legendary franchise from a series of devastating losses.', 'This four-part docuseries chronicles one unforgettable season with one of Mexico''s most popular soccer club, the Chivas of Guadalajara, as they strive to resurrect their legendary franchise from a series of devastating losses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kDs0wVzNw0NMNsrfQEE6pIu5YE9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128009'),
  ('548011772700121977', 'Chloe', 2022, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Alice Seabright', null, 'Erin Doherty, Poppy Gilbert, Scott Rose-Marsh, Billy Howle, Jack Farthing, Pippa Bennett-Warner, Brandon Michael Hall, Lisa Palfrey', null, 'Outsider Becky obsesses over influencer Chloe – until tragedy pulls her in deeper than she ever dreamed possible.', 'Outsider Becky obsesses over influencer Chloe – until tragedy pulls her in deeper than she ever dreamed possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3sHAsDMik5CyJCwrfb0KS6EaBdR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156507'),
  ('370589694130987243', 'Chobits', 2002, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tomokazu Sugita, Rie Tanaka, Tomokazu Seki, Motoko Kumai, Houko Kuwashima, Fumiko Orikasa, Kikuko Inoue, Megumi Toyoguchi', 'TV-14', 'Tokyo is abuzz with persocoms – humanoid computers that are virtually perfect. The socially and technologically inept Hideki is dying to get his hands on one. When he finds Chii abandoned in the trash, she’s cuter than any current model he’s ever seen before. But when he gets her home and turns her on, she has no data and only a single learning program installed. While Hideki puts his whole heart into teaching Chii the ins and outs of humanity, a mystery unfolds as a dark secret within her awakens.', 'Tokyo is abuzz with persocoms – humanoid computers that are virtually perfect. The socially and technologically inept Hideki is dying to get his hands on one. When he finds Chii abandoned in the trash, she’s cuter than any current model he’s ever seen before. But when he gets her home and turns her on, she has no data and only a single learning program installed. While Hideki puts his whole heart into teaching Chii the ins and outs of humanity, a mystery unfolds as a dark secret within her awakens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9gjM4FgXyjzzvP6W6MckC48hK1R.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37527'),
  ('1050784966231646334', 'Choco Bank', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Kai, Park Eun-bin, Yeon Jun-seok, Lee Il-hwa, Lee Chae Won', null, 'Choco Bank is about a guy named Kim Eun Haeng, who is a college graduate entering the workforce. His father made sure he had a lucky start in life by giving him a name that meant money. Eun Haeng (meaning Bank in Korean) will deal with the concerns many in their 20s struggle with when they start working for the very first time.And a girl named Ha Cho Co who is getting ready to start a business. The story plays out as the two meet and finds out more about the financial service industry.', 'Choco Bank is about a guy named Kim Eun Haeng, who is a college graduate entering the workforce. His father made sure he had a lucky start in life by giving him a name that meant money. Eun Haeng (meaning Bank in Korean) will deal with the concerns many in their 20s struggle with when they start working for the very first time.And a girl named Ha Cho Co who is getting ready to start a business. The story plays out as the two meet and finds out more about the financial service industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5BZ4bjllGUqzMXrBhGNDXePwrE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65617'),
  ('429227702417124820', 'Choco Milk Shake', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Ko Ho-jung, Lee Jae-bin, Kim Seong-hyuk, Park Seung-bin', null, 'Jung-woo lives alone after losing his parents at the age of 20 and working part-time in his Uncle''s shop. One day, two strangers enter the house and claim they were Choco and Milk! The two were indeed the reincarnation of Choco and Milk whom he raised from childhood to high school and lost by an accident. The arrival of the two embarks on a new beginning and the quest to discover love.', 'Jung-woo lives alone after losing his parents at the age of 20 and working part-time in his Uncle''s shop. One day, two strangers enter the house and claim they were Choco and Milk! The two were indeed the reincarnation of Choco and Milk whom he raised from childhood to high school and lost by an accident. The arrival of the two embarks on a new beginning and the quest to discover love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7naq5erl8mlHNqf9u3GH38cmOCS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:213152'),
  ('1087317530146153253', 'Chocolate', 2019, 'Drama', 'Lee Kyoung-hee', 'Lee Kyoung-hee', 'Ha Ji-won, Yoon Kye-sang, Jang Seung-jo, Min Jin-woong, Teo Yoo, Kim Won-hae, Yeom Hye-ran, Lee Han-seo', null, 'Brought together by meaningful meals in the past and present, a doctor and a chef are reacquainted when they begin working at a hospice ward.', 'Brought together by meaningful meals in the past and present, a doctor and a chef are reacquainted when they begin working at a hospice ward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ugLwOOv9k6NG0XL2IX06RiqW9yt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95066'),
  ('426777293929835471', 'Chōjin Sentai Jetman', 1991, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Kids', null, null, 'Kotaro Tanaka, Rika Kishida, Tomihisa Naruse, Sayuri Uchida, Toshihide Wakamatsu, Mikiko Miki, Daisuke Tachi, Maho Maruyama', null, 'The Sky Force sends five highly trained operatives to participate in an experiment which will expose them to Birdonic Waves, resulting in superhuman abilities. But when the Earth Ship is attacked by Vyram, the majority of the Birdonic Waves are sent to Earth and find four unsuspecting civilians. Now, it''s up to these four accidental super humans – Raita, Kaori, Ako, and Gai – alongside Ryu, the only original operative to receive Birdonic Waves, to defend their dimension against Vyram.', 'The Sky Force sends five highly trained operatives to participate in an experiment which will expose them to Birdonic Waves, resulting in superhuman abilities. But when the Earth Ship is attacked by Vyram, the majority of the Birdonic Waves are sent to Earth and find four unsuspecting civilians. Now, it''s up to these four accidental super humans – Raita, Kaori, Ako, and Gai – alongside Ryu, the only original operative to receive Birdonic Waves, to defend their dimension against Vyram.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6UKmUHYTzSFZKoioIXQ2I4cFuzT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90024'),
  ('406349477702199552', 'Chop Socky Chooks', 2008, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Sergio Delfino', null, 'Paterson Joseph, Rob Rackstraw, Shelley Longworth, Paul Kaye, Rupert Degas', 'TV-Y7', 'A trio of kung fu fighting chickens live and work in a city-sized shopping mall owned by their archenemy, Dr. Wasabi.', 'A trio of kung fu fighting chickens live and work in a city-sized shopping mall owned by their archenemy, Dr. Wasabi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uak9fVEaXPffMSLtLCBZ8Po0EDJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6682'),
  ('160006345658674301', 'Chopped', 2009, 'Reality', 'Michael Krupat, Dave Noll, Linda Lea', null, 'Ted Allen', 'TV-G', 'A high energy, fast paced cooking competition that challenges four up-and-coming chefs to turn a selection of everyday ingredients into an extraordinary three-course meal. After each course, a contestant gets “chopped” by our panel of esteemed culinary luminaries until the last man or woman left standing claims victory.', 'A high energy, fast paced cooking competition that challenges four up-and-coming chefs to turn a selection of everyday ingredients into an extraordinary three-course meal. After each course, a contestant gets “chopped” by our panel of esteemed culinary luminaries until the last man or woman left standing claims victory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7g390tj73dtlGX3ajZrlQRcRpO.jpg', 64, 'tmdb:tv:17404'),
  ('958696816840680977', 'Chornobyl: Exclusion Zone', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Ilya Kulikov, Evgeniy Nikishov', 'Ilya Kulikov', 'Konstantin Davydov, Anvar Khalilulaev, Kristina Kazinskaya, Sergey Romanovich, Evgeniy Stychkin, Valeriya Dmitrieva, Aleksandr Yatsenko', null, '5 youths give chase after a man who has stolen 8 million rubles from them. The man reveals on his video blog his intention to travel to Chornobyl. With every kilometer the journey of the heroes becomes more dangerous and confusing.', '5 youths give chase after a man who has stolen 8 million rubles from them. The man reveals on his video blog his intention to travel to Chornobyl. With every kilometer the journey of the heroes becomes more dangerous and confusing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/91u0ITxwdfXSFGXnCFUmoGglmnn.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:64542'),
  ('488044934478371840', 'Chosen', 2013, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Ryan Lewis, Ben Ketai', null, 'Chad Michael Murray, Sarah Roemer, Rose McGowan, Brandon Routh, Caitlin Carmichael, Sammi Hanratty, Alexander Le Bas, Stacy Haiduk', null, 'Ian Mitchell is a lawyer and father who one day receives a box containing a gun and a picture of a stranger, along with instructions to kill the pictured person. He is subsequently attacked by another stranger, and discovers that he has been chosen by a mysterious organization known as The Watchers to participate in a lethal game.', 'Ian Mitchell is a lawyer and father who one day receives a box containing a gun and a picture of a stranger, along with instructions to kill the pictured person. He is subsequently attacked by another stranger, and discovers that he has been chosen by a mysterious organization known as The Watchers to participate in a lethal game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dy76pp1vNiYy7398UwHLkRTvlAf.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:26777'),
  ('963294361629992287', 'Chosen', 2022, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Jannik Tai Mosholt, Kaspar Munk, Christian Potalivo', null, 'Malaika Berenth Mosendane, Andrea Heick Gadeberg, Andreas Dittmer, Albert Rudbeck Lindhardt, Mohamed Djeziri, Magnus Juhl Andersen, Anders Heinrichsen, Line Kruse', 'TV-MA', 'A 17-year-old girl''s world is turned upside down when she and her friends make a disturbing discovery in their quiet Danish town.', 'A 17-year-old girl''s world is turned upside down when she and her friends make a disturbing discovery in their quiet Danish town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guIOd4hzYw7yoW1haJbj4u5iTs9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:51001'),
  ('803207168649713730', 'Choujuu Sentai Liveman', 1988, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Daisuke Shima, Nishimura Kazuhiko, Megumi Mori, Seiro Yamaguchi, Jin Kawamoto, Makoto Kousaka, Jouji Nakata, Yutaka Hirose', null, 'Yusuke, Jo, Megumi, Kenji, Gou and Rui are students at Academia but the latter three decide to turn bad and join forces with the evil army Volt. When the defectors return, their three friends are forced to combat them as Choujuu Sentai Liveman. With the help of an android ally named Colon and a few others along the way, the Liveman must save the world and their friends.', 'Yusuke, Jo, Megumi, Kenji, Gou and Rui are students at Academia but the latter three decide to turn bad and join forces with the evil army Volt. When the defectors return, their three friends are forced to combat them as Choujuu Sentai Liveman. With the help of an android ally named Colon and a few others along the way, the Liveman must save the world and their friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hbMV06yJ6nHWj0LweEQCDXWhXcq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5665'),
  ('369454660414733119', 'Chouriki Sentai Ohranger', 1995, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Kids', null, null, 'Masaru Shishido, Kunio Masaoka, Masashi Goda, Ayumi Asô, Tamao Sato, Shoji Yamaguchi, Hiroshi Miyauchi, Tōru Ōhira', 'TV-PG', 'It is the year 1999. The Machine Empire of Baranoia, led by Emperor Bacchus Wrath, has invaded Earth with the intention of wiping out all human life and bringing about machine rule. Chief Counselor Miura of the UAOH (United Airforce Overtech Hardware), in a desperate attempt to quell this invasion, has revived super energies born of the lost civilization of Pangaea. Enlisting an elite squad of the finest officers the UAOH has to offer, Miura has harnessed Tetrahedron Power, granting the team the power to transform into the Ohrangers… and save humanity from its darkest crisis yet!', 'It is the year 1999. The Machine Empire of Baranoia, led by Emperor Bacchus Wrath, has invaded Earth with the intention of wiping out all human life and bringing about machine rule. Chief Counselor Miura of the UAOH (United Airforce Overtech Hardware), in a desperate attempt to quell this invasion, has revived super energies born of the lost civilization of Pangaea. Enlisting an elite squad of the finest officers the UAOH has to offer, Miura has harnessed Tetrahedron Power, granting the team the power to transform into the Ohrangers… and save humanity from its darkest crisis yet!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wlCawP2gcUln7BjbwIRAkuj3KpZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5224'),
  ('378132203955959049', 'Chouseishin Series', 2003, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, null, 'TV-Y7', 'The Chou Sei Shin Series (Ultra Star God Series) is a trilogy of tokusatsu shows aired from 2003-2006. Created by Toho (who famously produced the Godzilla movies) and Konami, it was their attempt to break into the Henshin Hero market that was — at the time — dominated by Toei and their two major franchises, Super Sentai and Kamen Rider, with Tsuburaya''s Ultra Series for good measure. The shows revolve around the title Ultra Star Gods: Humongous Mecha that are used by the protagonists to protect the Earth from an extraterrestrial threat.', 'The Chou Sei Shin Series (Ultra Star God Series) is a trilogy of tokusatsu shows aired from 2003-2006. Created by Toho (who famously produced the Godzilla movies) and Konami, it was their attempt to break into the Henshin Hero market that was — at the time — dominated by Toei and their two major franchises, Super Sentai and Kamen Rider, with Tsuburaya''s Ultra Series for good measure. The shows revolve around the title Ultra Star Gods: Humongous Mecha that are used by the protagonists to protect the Earth from an extraterrestrial threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3JyHNDCz7IFisR3qC27G0GIu8jP.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:8882'),
  ('299708130425251913', 'Choushinsei Flashman', 1986, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Touta Tarumi, Kihachirō Uemura, Tsutomu Kitagawa, Mayumi Yoshida, Youko Nakamura, Akira Ishihama, Hiroko Maruyama, Eiichi Onoda', null, 'In 1966, five infant children were kidnapped by an alien group known as the Alien Hunters for the Reconstructive Experiment Empire Mess, who wanted samples of humans from Earth to experiment on. The children were rescued by Mess'' arch enemy, the Flash alien race, which took each one to a different planet of the Flash solar system for training. Each child was trained separately in a range of superpowers that will allow them to fight Mess, their bodies also adapted to the atmosphere of the Flash Solar System making them gain special abilities. When they finally return to Earth in 1986 to combat Mess, who is now trying to invade it, they use the opportunity to search for their birth parents.', 'In 1966, five infant children were kidnapped by an alien group known as the Alien Hunters for the Reconstructive Experiment Empire Mess, who wanted samples of humans from Earth to experiment on. The children were rescued by Mess'' arch enemy, the Flash alien race, which took each one to a different planet of the Flash solar system for training. Each child was trained separately in a range of superpowers that will allow them to fight Mess, their bodies also adapted to the atmosphere of the Flash Solar System making them gain special abilities. When they finally return to Earth in 1986 to combat Mess, who is now trying to invade it, they use the opportunity to search for their birth parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKoZUWBPMRa7sFBWMPuusTBBmS1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70787'),
  ('247266762553050757', 'Chowder', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'C.H. Greenblatt', 'William Reiss', 'Nicky Jones, Dwight Schultz, Tara Strong, John DiMaggio, Liliana Mumy, Mindy Sterling, Dana Snyder, C.H. Greenblatt', 'TV-Y7', 'An aspiring young chef named Chowder has adventures as an apprentice in Mung Daal''s catering company. Although he means well, Chowder often finds himself in predicaments due to his perpetual appetite and his nature as a scatterbrain. He is also pestered by Panini, the apprentice of Mung''s rival Endive, who wants Chowder to be her boyfriend, which he abhors.', 'An aspiring young chef named Chowder has adventures as an apprentice in Mung Daal''s catering company. Although he means well, Chowder often finds himself in predicaments due to his perpetual appetite and his nature as a scatterbrain. He is also pestered by Panini, the apprentice of Mung''s rival Endive, who wants Chowder to be her boyfriend, which he abhors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4H5diUE5bKp9dxcisJ3wbZzvAg7.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:9907'),
  ('959555849586206054', 'Chozen', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Grant DeKernion', null, 'Bobby Moynihan, Michael Peña, Hannibal Buress, Nick Swardson, Kathryn Hahn', 'TV-MA', 'An animated comedy about its title character, "Chozen," a gay white rapper fresh out of prison. Armed with a new message, Chozen is on a quest for redemption and to claim his rightful position as the world''s top rap artist. His music and lyrics take aim at the stereotypes of machismo and misogyny that is synonymous with rap music. And his new world view has been shaped by his time in prison.', 'An animated comedy about its title character, "Chozen," a gay white rapper fresh out of prison. Armed with a new message, Chozen is on a quest for redemption and to claim his rightful position as the world''s top rap artist. His music and lyrics take aim at the stereotypes of machismo and misogyny that is synonymous with rap music. And his new world view has been shaped by his time in prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aT5ZfaKJUx9gSTF4ygSZYNlsuqW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60697'),
  ('606359514361030187', 'Chrisley Knows Best', 2014, 'Reality, Comedy', null, null, 'Chase Chrisley, Julie Chrisley, Todd Chrisley, Savannah Chrisley, Grayson Chrisley', 'TV-14', 'Follows Atlanta-based self-made multimillionaire Todd Chrisley, his devoted wife Julie and their five children who live a seemingly picture-perfect Southern life with everything money can buy.', 'Follows Atlanta-based self-made multimillionaire Todd Chrisley, his devoted wife Julie and their five children who live a seemingly picture-perfect Southern life with everything money can buy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sefZZ5595xNl8o0QTRaNLrlbkdo.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:62807'),
  ('141456932301343661', 'Christian', 2022, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Valerio Cilio, Roberto Saku Cinardi, Enrico Audenino', null, 'Edoardo Pesce, Claudio Santamaria, Silvia D''Amico, Gabriel Montesi, Antonio Bannò, Francesco Colella, Giulio Beranek, Romana Maggiora Vergano', null, 'Christian lives in a "city-palace" where he earns his living doing dirty work for LINO, the criminal boss of neighborhood. When stigmata appear on his hands, Christian finds physically impossible to carry out his work, but also discovers he has gained mysterious healing powers to fight against Lino. But MATTEO, a mysterious Vatican postulator in search of signs and confirmations, is tracking him down bringing too close to a truth that could upset his life and that of the whole world.', 'Christian lives in a "city-palace" where he earns his living doing dirty work for LINO, the criminal boss of neighborhood. When stigmata appear on his hands, Christian finds physically impossible to carry out his work, but also discovers he has gained mysterious healing powers to fight against Lino. But MATTEO, a mysterious Vatican postulator in search of signs and confirmations, is tracking him down bringing too close to a truth that could upset his life and that of the whole world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6LsADzNnCQE6IusbRYnNyX0CYaX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:155724'),
  ('548932251845226020', 'Christiane Amanpour: Sex & Love Around the World', 2018, 'Reality, Documentary', 'Christiane Amanpour', null, 'Christiane Amanpour', null, 'Amanpour gets personal with women she meets in various corners of the globe by inquiring about their intimate lives. In the process, she shines a light on what sex and love look like around the world.', 'Amanpour gets personal with women she meets in various corners of the globe by inquiring about their intimate lives. In the process, she shines a light on what sex and love look like around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3uEwdABHqEL7GvOnvnqqmTtgsvz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78112'),
  ('945041768315240874', 'Christmas Flow', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Henri Debeurme, Victor Rodenbach, Marianne Levy', null, 'Shirine Boutella, Tayc, Marion Séclin, Camille Lou, Aloïse Sauvage, Walid Ben Mabrouk', null, 'An unlikely Christmas romance blossoms between a famous rapper and a tenacious journalist. But can they make it work despite their differences?', 'An unlikely Christmas romance blossoms between a famous rapper and a tenacious journalist. But can they make it work despite their differences?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n35vysDI3z4wsHSpElErNXKsAMX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135799'),
  ('86607808983498933', 'Christmas on Vesterbro', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Anders Matthesen, Thomas Hartmann', 'Thomas Hartmann, Anders Matthesen', 'Anders Matthesen, Sune Svanekier', 'TV-14', 'Christmas has brought blessings - just not to Stewart Stardust. Someone has sabotaged the engine of his hot dog cart, and it''s at the worst possible time. Danny has just been released on parole, and the social worker Arne demands that someone can provide for him - otherwise he will go back to the trap. As if that wasn''t enough, the caretaker Greta threatens to put Stewart on the street if he doesn''t pay his rent promptly. Fortunately, Kefir the Arab shows up and he wants to fix the hot dog cart for free. It is immediately a good offer, but what interest would he have in a sausage van standing in front of Christiansborg? And can you really repair an engine with the warhead from a Russian SS-20 nuclear missile?', 'Christmas has brought blessings - just not to Stewart Stardust. Someone has sabotaged the engine of his hot dog cart, and it''s at the worst possible time. Danny has just been released on parole, and the social worker Arne demands that someone can provide for him - otherwise he will go back to the trap. As if that wasn''t enough, the caretaker Greta threatens to put Stewart on the street if he doesn''t pay his rent promptly. Fortunately, Kefir the Arab shows up and he wants to fix the hot dog cart for free. It is immediately a good offer, but what interest would he have in a sausage van standing in front of Christiansborg? And can you really repair an engine with the warhead from a Russian SS-20 nuclear missile?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/au9TrruTJNi7k4bus2hHOsGUigT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45380'),
  ('579487078191212095', 'Christopher Columbus', 1992, 'Animation', null, null, 'Marco Balzarotti, Gabriele Calindri, Diego Sabre, Maurizio Scattorin, Paolo Marchese', null, 'The marvelous adventures and dramatic life of Christopher Columbus in the 15th century.', 'The marvelous adventures and dramatic life of Christopher Columbus in the 15th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6lyhoMOUutANBVUgZ51fg6onG3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86930'),
  ('209540100759996463', 'Chrome Shelled Regios', 2009, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Nobuhiko Okamoto, Ayahi Takagaki, Mai Nakahara, Kisho Taniyama, Takehito Koyasu, Daisuke Sakaguchi', 'TV-MA', 'The world of tomorrow is an arid wasteland. Humans must live in domed cities to escape the threat of mutant Contaminoid monsters. In this future, mysterious Layfon struggles to keep his violent past hidden from his fellow student soldiers at the military academy. Unfortunately, his former life might be impossible to keep secret – and the truth could tear his team apart.', 'The world of tomorrow is an arid wasteland. Humans must live in domed cities to escape the threat of mutant Contaminoid monsters. In this future, mysterious Layfon struggles to keep his violent past hidden from his fellow student soldiers at the military academy. Unfortunately, his former life might be impossible to keep secret – and the truth could tear his team apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/np0kBS99x9jejKCfRvnSXzOAcOd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43318'),
  ('451790648417567974', 'Chromosome 21', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Matías Venables', null, 'Valentina Muhr, Mario Horton, Sebastián Solorza, Gastón Salgado, Claudia di Girólamo, Pía Urrutia, Daniel Muñoz, Alejandro Trejo', 'TV-MA', 'When the police discover a man with Down syndrome hiding at a crime scene, they launch an investigation to determine whether he''s a witness or a suspect.', 'When the police discover a man with Down syndrome hiding at a crime scene, they launch an investigation to determine whether he''s a witness or a suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVmSSrW4djhwf5Eo3qS6xSJNog3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210411'),
  ('616272227036363209', 'Chronicles of the Sun', 2018, 'Soap', 'Olivier Szulzynger, Eline Le Fur, Cristina Arellano', null, 'Mélanie Maudran, Moïse Santamaria, Yvon Back, Benjamin Bourgois, Chrystelle Labaude', 'NR', 'Claire is surprised when she gets arrested for the murder of her childhood friend after she returns to Montpellier.', 'Claire is surprised when she gets arrested for the murder of her childhood friend after she returns to Montpellier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t6jVlbPMtZOJoAOfeoR4yQmnjXM.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:81329'),
  ('985592976799693954', 'Chrono Crusade', 2003, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Yuu Kou, Hisao Muramatsu, Atsuhiro Tomioka', null, 'Junko Minagawa, Norio Wakamoto, Michiko Neya, Akira Ishida, Tomomichi Nishimura, Kazuhiko Inoue, Natsuko Kuwatani, Saeko Chiba', 'TV-14', 'Set in New York during the 1920s, Chrono Crusade follows the story of Rosette Christopher, and her demon partner Chrono. As members of the Magdalene Order, they travel around the country eliminating demonic threats to society, while Rosette searches for her lost brother Joshua.', 'Set in New York during the 1920s, Chrono Crusade follows the story of Rosette Christopher, and her demon partner Chrono. As members of the Magdalene Order, they travel around the country eliminating demonic threats to society, while Rosette searches for her lost brother Joshua.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEmUOPRBvhtZG9v8jh5XuyYjmk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34061'),
  ('286386323418400429', 'Chronos Ruler', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jea Pon', null, 'Jun Fukuyama, Kaito Ishikawa, Rie Kugimiya, Kenji Akabane, Shizuka Itoh, Tomokazu Sugita', null, 'The story centers on "Chronos Rulers," those who fight the time-eating demons that appear when people wish they could turn back time. The Chronos Rulers fight a time-manipulation battle against these demons.', 'The story centers on "Chronos Rulers," those who fight the time-eating demons that appear when people wish they could turn back time. The Chronos Rulers fight a time-manipulation battle against these demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eU0CaUJk4q1Ms81SrF90EP9bbEK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72528'),
