  ('588763621480178611', 'Churchill''s People', 1974, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Gerald Savory, Brian Rawlinson', null, null, null, 'Churchill''s People is a British anthology series based on A History of the English-Speaking Peoples, Winston Churchill''s four-volume history of Britain and its former colonies. 26 episodes were produced by the BBC and initially broadcast from 30 December 1974 to 23 June 1975.', 'Churchill''s People is a British anthology series based on A History of the English-Speaking Peoples, Winston Churchill''s four-volume history of Britain and its former colonies. 26 episodes were produced by the BBC and initially broadcast from 30 December 1974 to 23 June 1975.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPEqAOyP6VCRkAAEUCfqTmmJhj0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19750'),
