  ('656878293721107702', 'Cigarette Girl', 2023, 'Drama', 'Shanty Harmayn, Tanya Yuson, Kamila Andini', 'Tanya Yuson, Kanya Priyanti, Ratih Kumala', 'Dian Sastrowardoyo, Ario Bayu, Putri Marino, Arya Saloka, Tissa Biani, Sheila Dara Aisha, Ibnu Jamil, Rukman Rosadi', 'TV-14', 'A gifted artisan''s journey of love and self-discovery unfolds as she defies tradition within Indonesia''s clove cigarette industry in the 1960s.', 'A gifted artisan''s journey of love and self-discovery unfolds as she defies tradition within Indonesia''s clove cigarette industry in the 1960s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/694BgfPfUAGBsZn9l9eiiumwXt7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:228957'),
