  ('287573774462492877', 'Cilla', 2014, 'Drama', null, 'Jeff Pope', 'Sheridan Smith, Aneurin Barnard, Ed Stoppard, John Henshaw, Melanie Hill, Ceri Dupree, Tom Dunlea, Jack Farthing', null, 'Three-part biopic of the Liverpudlian songbird who would later find fame and fortune. It tells of her rocky road to fame and captures the essence of 1960s Liverpool.', 'Three-part biopic of the Liverpudlian songbird who would later find fame and fortune. It tells of her rocky road to fame and captures the essence of 1960s Liverpool.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bxxkZIW1o2OUXZmnUWdP69MIz3O.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61428'),
  ('952509571285903160', 'Cimarron Strip', 1967, 'Western', 'Christopher Knopf', null, 'Stuart Whitman, Randy Boone, Percy Herbert, Jill Townsend', null, 'Cimarron Strip is an American Western television series that aired on CBS from September 1967 to March 1968. Starring Stuart Whitman as Marshal Jim Crown, the series was produced by the creators of Gunsmoke. Reruns of the original show were aired in the summer of 1971. Cimarron Strip was one of only three 90-minute weekly Western series that aired during the 1960s, and the only 90-minute series of any kind to be centered primarily around one lead character. Cimarron Strip was set in the Oklahoma Panhandle, which comprises, east to west, Beaver, Texas, and Cimarron counties in Oklahoma. The show is set in 1888, just as the continuous frontier of the West, which once ran from the Canadian to the Mexican border, was closing. In less than five years there would no longer be that "continuous frontier," only pockets of undeveloped land. This was the late "Wild West" that Marshall Jim Crown was called to defend.', 'Cimarron Strip is an American Western television series that aired on CBS from September 1967 to March 1968. Starring Stuart Whitman as Marshal Jim Crown, the series was produced by the creators of Gunsmoke. Reruns of the original show were aired in the summer of 1971. Cimarron Strip was one of only three 90-minute weekly Western series that aired during the 1960s, and the only 90-minute series of any kind to be centered primarily around one lead character. Cimarron Strip was set in the Oklahoma Panhandle, which comprises, east to west, Beaver, Texas, and Cimarron counties in Oklahoma. The show is set in 1888, just as the continuous frontier of the West, which once ran from the Canadian to the Mexican border, was closing. In less than five years there would no longer be that "continuous frontier," only pockets of undeveloped land. This was the late "Wild West" that Marshall Jim Crown was called to defend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUoY0LW5VGsX9ZjvjMGqGpPWkVZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11988'),
  ('111560412083553950', 'Cinderella and Four Knights', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kwon Hyuk-chan, Lee Min-woo', null, 'Jung Il-woo, Park So-dam, Ahn Jae-hyun, Lee Jung-shin, Hye-ri Kim, Choi Eun-kyeong, Son Na-eun, Choi Shang', 'TV-14', 'Catching the eye of a wealthy gentleman, spunky Ha-won gets hired to live with his three immature grandsons so she can whip them into shape.', 'Catching the eye of a wealthy gentleman, spunky Ha-won gets hired to live with his three immature grandsons so she can whip them into shape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgE63Z609gr10IoFu4pe4OdliBr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67084'),
  ('974729770639702940', 'Cinderella at 2AM', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Park Joon-hwa', '오은지', 'Shin Hyun-been, Moon Sang-min, Yoon Park, Park So-jin, Jin Hee-kyung, Kim Tae-jeong, Lee Kyu-sung, Kim Gyu-nam', null, 'Ha Yoon-seo has worked hard her whole life: after raising her younger brother alone, she is now a marketing manager at a credit card company. Her life takes a dramatic turn when she discovers that her boyfriend, Seo Ju-won, is the heir to the family that owns the company! Upon learning of their relationship, Ju-won''s mother offers Yoon-seo money to break up with him, and Yoon-seo accepts. However, Ju-won is determined to win her back and will stop at nothing to reclaim her heart. Can Yoon-seo and Ju-won overcome obstacles and find their fairytale ending, or will reality tear them apart?', 'Ha Yoon-seo has worked hard her whole life: after raising her younger brother alone, she is now a marketing manager at a credit card company. Her life takes a dramatic turn when she discovers that her boyfriend, Seo Ju-won, is the heir to the family that owns the company! Upon learning of their relationship, Ju-won''s mother offers Yoon-seo money to break up with him, and Yoon-seo accepts. However, Ju-won is determined to win her back and will stop at nothing to reclaim her heart. Can Yoon-seo and Ju-won overcome obstacles and find their fairytale ending, or will reality tear them apart?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gAhH3lFWb1kS0RjAhFkgG79BoTr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233349'),
  ('556255308371710685', 'Cinderella Chef', 2018, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Ziyi 281', null, 'Liu Shisi, Sun Ye, Shen Dawei', null, 'Ye Jiayao finds herself back in time in the body of Ye Jinxuan. After many twists, she thought that she would finally be able to lead a simple life and achieve her dream of opening the best restaurant in Huai Song. However, there are villains constantly trying to bring her down.', 'Ye Jiayao finds herself back in time in the body of Ye Jinxuan. After many twists, she thought that she would finally be able to lead a simple life and achieve her dream of opening the best restaurant in Huai Song. However, there are villains constantly trying to bring her down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3uKI0bZuzYOb5SGsc9g1flr3xsq.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:87978'),
  ('904392832413090886', 'Cinderella Closet', 2025, 'Drama', 'Wakana Yanai', null, 'Ichika Osaki, Leo Matsumoto, Karuma, Yuna Mito, Rintaro Hachimura, Kei Yamazaki', null, 'A small-town college student and a cross-dressing beauty school student team up to explore fashion, self-discovery, and love in the city.', 'A small-town college student and a cross-dressing beauty school student team up to explore fashion, self-discovery, and love in the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vgI1sXvM8idd15SdaozQsEEieaL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:293431'),
  ('722339382232519972', 'Cinderella''s Sister', 2010, 'Drama', null, 'Kim Gyu-wan', 'Moon Geun-young, Seo Woo, Chun Jung-myung, Ok Taec-yeon, Lee Mi-sook, Kim Kap-soo, Choi Il-hwa, Yeon Woo-jin', null, 'A modern twist on Cinderella follows warm-hearted Hyo-sun, adored by everyone, and her guarded stepsister Eun-jo, whose painful past fuels a growing resentment as their mother begins to favor Hyo-sun.', 'A modern twist on Cinderella follows warm-hearted Hyo-sun, adored by everyone, and her guarded stepsister Eun-jo, whose painful past fuels a growing resentment as their mother begins to favor Hyo-sun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bDN7frh31IpcePWiqNxevlF2G3B.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32828'),
  ('644781942728016141', 'Cindy la Regia: The High School Years', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ricardo Cucamonga', null, 'Michelle Pellicer, Vincent Michael Webb, Nahuel Escobar, Carola Cuarón, Luciana Vale, Anxel García, Janneth Villarreal, Mario Loría', null, 'Cindy, a sharp and restless teenager, grows up happily in the high society of San Pedro Garza García in Nuevo León. When she and her longtime friends enter coeducational high school for the first time, Cindy questions the role of "princess" and the search for "prince charming" she''s always been taught. In her freshman adventures, Cindy learns that pleasing others doesn''t matter as much as finding herself.', 'Cindy, a sharp and restless teenager, grows up happily in the high society of San Pedro Garza García in Nuevo León. When she and her longtime friends enter coeducational high school for the first time, Cindy questions the role of "princess" and the search for "prince charming" she''s always been taught. In her freshman adventures, Cindy learns that pleasing others doesn''t matter as much as finding herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rPuUEKsNZE2GcYUEVlzxPZCUjX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:240105'),
  ('1004515023474497352', 'Circeo', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Flaminia Gressi, Viola Rispoli', 'Kim Gualino', 'Greta Scarano, Ambrosia Caldarelli, Angelo Spagnoletti, Francesca Antonelli, Benedetta Cimatti, Guglielmo Poggi, Giacomo Colavito, Leonardo Mazzarotto', null, 'Based on Circeo massacre that took place in 1970s Italy, when two teenage girls were found in the trunk of a car in Rome, naked, wrapped in blankets and drenched in blood.', 'Based on Circeo massacre that took place in 1970s Italy, when two teenage girls were found in the trunk of a car in Rome, naked, wrapped in blankets and drenched in blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1PQaXqPRURA5HfkUGl0AkubOAUv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210413'),
  ('132948605819286347', 'Circle', 2017, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Min Jin-gi, Sang-yeon Park', 'Kim Jin-hee, Park Eun-mi, Ryu Moon-sang', 'Yeo Jin-goo, Kim Kang-woo, Gong Seung-yeon, Lee Gi-kwang, Kwon Hyuk-soo, An Woo-yeon, Kim Joong-ki, Min Sung-wook', null, 'After Aliens arrive, the story takes place in two time streams: 2017 and 2037. In twenty years, and by 2037, the world has been divided into a “Smart Earth” where artificial intelligence has created a utopian environment in which no diseases or crimes exist, and an “Ordinary Earth” where people still suffer from rampant plague and lawlessness.', 'After Aliens arrive, the story takes place in two time streams: 2017 and 2037. In twenty years, and by 2037, the world has been divided into a “Smart Earth” where artificial intelligence has created a utopian environment in which no diseases or crimes exist, and an “Ordinary Earth” where people still suffer from rampant plague and lawlessness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1sINEbJKM2p47VIvZkNvK6APAzH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70581'),
