  ('443261741409261584', 'Code 404', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Crime', null, null, 'Daniel Mays, Stephen Graham, Anna Maxwell Martin, Rosie Cavaliero', null, 'In the near future, an undercover Detective Inspector gunned down and killed during a botched sting is brought back via an experimental Artificial Intelligence project. Full of glitches, he’s got to track down the person who shot him, prove himself as a cop so as not to get shut down, and save his marriage and his friendship, all with his partner Carver to boot.', 'In the near future, an undercover Detective Inspector gunned down and killed during a botched sting is brought back via an experimental Artificial Intelligence project. Full of glitches, he’s got to track down the person who shot him, prove himself as a cop so as not to get shut down, and save his marriage and his friendship, all with his partner Carver to boot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4mxnGq5ysyqSDF1UyBj9wAI3TwF.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:102272'),
  ('509094903097175390', 'Code Black', 2015, 'Drama', 'Michael Seitzman', null, 'Marcia Gay Harden, Luis Guzmán, Benjamin Hollingsworth, Harry M. Ford, William Allen Young, Emily Alyn Lind, Boris Kodjoe, Noah Gray-Cabey', 'TV-14', 'Inspired by the award-winning documentary, this medical drama is set in the busiest and most notorious ER in the nation where the extraordinary staff confront a challenged system in order to protect their ideals and the patients who need them the most.', 'Inspired by the award-winning documentary, this medical drama is set in the busiest and most notorious ER in the nation where the extraordinary staff confront a challenged system in order to protect their ideals and the patients who need them the most.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3T1b6YK6vLrZoLZC5hd65ZuRLq8.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:63418'),
  ('338709505373146502', 'Code Blue', 2008, 'Drama', null, null, 'Tomohisa Yamashita, Yui Aragaki, Erika Toda, Manami Higa, Yōsuke Asari, Daiki Arioka, Yuko Araki, Ryo Narita', null, 'Four young physicians are assigned to the “Doctor Helicopter” system, the latest medical system where a medical team is dispatched to the patients via helicopter to provide medical care in the field as soon as possible. The doctors experience traumatic medical situations, deal with personal ambitions, and witness the fragility of life, all while growing personally and professionally.', 'Four young physicians are assigned to the “Doctor Helicopter” system, the latest medical system where a medical team is dispatched to the patients via helicopter to provide medical care in the field as soon as possible. The doctors experience traumatic medical situations, deal with personal ambitions, and witness the fragility of life, all while growing personally and professionally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rBzW9ugeSJ0PvfqD1jkSkNaeKQh.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:21021'),
  ('914224563371830585', 'Code Geass: Lelouch of the Rebellion', 2006, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Jun Fukuyama, Takahiro Sakurai, Yukana, Ami Koshimizu', 'TV-14', 'Japan has been invaded and conquered by the Britannian Empire. Japan is now known as Area 11 and its citizens known as Elevens. The Britannian Empire takes away Japan''s autonomous power and imposes its rule through the use of Knightmares. The Empire''s rule has never faltered, but cracks have begun to show...', 'Japan has been invaded and conquered by the Britannian Empire. Japan is now known as Area 11 and its citizens known as Elevens. The Britannian Empire takes away Japan''s autonomous power and imposes its rule through the use of Knightmares. The Empire''s rule has never faltered, but cracks have begun to show...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x316WCogkeIwNY4JR8zTCHbI2nQ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:31724'),
  ('141635756734699840', 'Code Geass: Rozé of the Recapture', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kohei Amasaki, Makoto Furukawa, Reina Ueda, Kana Ichinose, Hiroki Yasumoto, Nao Toyama, Yumi Uchiyama, Daisuke Hirakawa', null, 'Year Seven of the Kowa Period, in the former Hokkaido Block, live brothers known as the Nameless Mercenaries. The Emperor, Callis al Britannia, tries to plunge the world into chaos with the help of his servant, Norland, and his Einberg Knights. Rozé and Ash take action from the Northern lands.', 'Year Seven of the Kowa Period, in the former Hokkaido Block, live brothers known as the Nameless Mercenaries. The Emperor, Callis al Britannia, tries to plunge the world into chaos with the help of his servant, Norland, and his Einberg Knights. Rozé and Ash take action from the Northern lands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQRG3lI42IaJNr23jFeO6FSXmoE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:255107'),
  ('237334457009874917', 'Code Lyoko', 2003, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Tania Palumbo, Thomas Romain', 'Sophie Decroisette', 'Raphaëlle Lubansu, Géraldine Frippiat, Marie-Line Landerwijn, Sophie Landresse, Mathieu Moreau, Carole Baillien', 'TV-Y7', 'Four children travel to the virtual world of Lyoko to battle against a sentient artificial intelligence named XANA, with a virtual human called Aelita.', 'Four children travel to the virtual world of Lyoko to battle against a sentient artificial intelligence named XANA, with a virtual human called Aelita.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/86LdmxBCP9ghdtATP4WjN29vSqP.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:4622'),
  ('659252937903767107', 'Code Lyoko: Evolution', 2013, 'Animation, Family, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Florian Ferrier, Luccio Di Rosa', null, 'Léonie Berthonnaud, Quentin Merabet, Mélanie Tran, Marin Lafitte, Gulliver Bevernaege-Benhadj, Diego Mestanza', 'NR', 'Jérémie, Aelita, Yumi, Ulrich, Odd and William return to their daily lives as students of Kadic College. But XANA, the multi-agent program that had become their mortal enemy and that they had managed to destroy in their previous adventures, reappears. The Lyoko Warriors reactivate the supercomputer in order to return to Lyoko, discover the reasons for this reappearance and put an end to it before the Earth is threatened again.', 'Jérémie, Aelita, Yumi, Ulrich, Odd and William return to their daily lives as students of Kadic College. But XANA, the multi-agent program that had become their mortal enemy and that they had managed to destroy in their previous adventures, reappears. The Lyoko Warriors reactivate the supercomputer in order to return to Lyoko, discover the reasons for this reappearance and put an end to it before the Earth is threatened again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2kxTUpAQ42RN7yYak7lyf1oLZUv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68794'),
  ('962857479720918945', 'Code Monkeys', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Adam de la Peña', null, 'Matt Mariska, Adam de la Peña, Gretchen McNeil, Dana Snyder, Lionel Tubbins, Suzanne Keilly, Andy Sipes', 'TV-14', 'Set in the early 1980s, Code Monkeys follows the adventures of fictional video game company GameAVision.', 'Set in the early 1980s, Code Monkeys follows the adventures of fictional video game company GameAVision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/meSp7BdlrDmDqrRI280CybLWf5r.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:13120'),
  ('785123921584944943', 'Code of a Killer', 2015, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', null, 'Michael Crompton', 'David Threlfall, John Simm, Anna Madeley, Andrew Tiernan, Lorcan Cranitch, Dorothy Atkinson, Neil Edmond, Hannah Walters', null, 'Based on the extraordinary true story of Alec Jeffreys'' discovery of DNA fingerprinting and its first use by Detective Chief Superintendent David Baker in catching a double murderer.', 'Based on the extraordinary true story of Alec Jeffreys'' discovery of DNA fingerprinting and its first use by Detective Chief Superintendent David Baker in catching a double murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wC5fcvb50bq82zhho09qWuxTz7S.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62208'),
  ('1071957751600331886', 'Code of Silence', 2025, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Catherine Moulton', null, 'Rose Ayling-Ellis, Kieron Moore, Charlotte Ritchie, Andrew Buchan, Joe Absolom, Nathan Armarkwei-Laryea, Rolf Choutan, Fifi Garfield', null, 'A deaf catering worker who is struggling to make ends meet is called upon by a police detective superintendent to lip-read the conversations of criminals.', 'A deaf catering worker who is struggling to make ends meet is called upon by a police detective superintendent to lip-read the conversations of criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6IR1HJeu301r01DbYLthuhXZ4j9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:287355'),
  ('387723035704466079', 'Code:Breaker', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yoko Hikasa, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Kenichi Suzumura, Shin-ichiro Miki, Toshiyuki Toyonaga', 'TV-MA', 'Sakurakouji Sakura is a girl who appears modest and graceful but in reality is skilled in martial arts. After witnessing a boy burning people with his blue flame, she is startled to see that the same boy is a transfer student, Oogami Rei. Oogami is a Code Breaker, one who does not exist. He is a seemingly cold-blooded killer who follows the principle of an eye for an eye, to use evil against evil. Convinced that killing is not right, Sakurakouji sets out to stop him and penetrate his icy heart.', 'Sakurakouji Sakura is a girl who appears modest and graceful but in reality is skilled in martial arts. After witnessing a boy burning people with his blue flame, she is startled to see that the same boy is a transfer student, Oogami Rei. Oogami is a Code Breaker, one who does not exist. He is a seemingly cold-blooded killer who follows the principle of an eye for an eye, to use evil against evil. Convinced that killing is not right, Sakurakouji sets out to stop him and penetrate his icy heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iwUWYgItga8EdVkqgS5R1q0V5md.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:57287'),
  ('13300340140150286', 'Code:Realize', 2017, 'Drama, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Saori Hayami, Tomoaki Maeno, Junichi Suwabe, Tetsuya Kakihara, Showtaro Morikubo, Daisuke Hirakawa, Miho Ishigami', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qoQQ1jnCNBzcIl1VO0XgC4yhL3N.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74084'),
  ('143042795815618040', 'Codename: Annika', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Mia Ylönen, Aleksi Bardy', null, 'Sannah Nedergård, Ardalan Esmaili, Eva Melander, Helena Bergström, Pekka Strang, Miro Lopperi, Clarisse Lhoni-Botte, Charles Martins', null, 'Finnish art fraud investigator, Emma, goes undercover to infiltrate an auction house in Stockholm to investigate the firm’s connection to a notorious money launderer known as Blanko. To go undetected, Emma chooses the cover identity Annika, a hot-headed socialite who lives for wild parties, drugs and alcohol and is the opposite of the cool, calm, and collected Emma. By adopting this wild persona, doors begin to open to the hidden world of high-class art fraud. However, becoming Annika means Emma must confront memories from her past that she has tried to forget.', 'Finnish art fraud investigator, Emma, goes undercover to infiltrate an auction house in Stockholm to investigate the firm’s connection to a notorious money launderer known as Blanko. To go undetected, Emma chooses the cover identity Annika, a hot-headed socialite who lives for wild parties, drugs and alcohol and is the opposite of the cool, calm, and collected Emma. By adopting this wild persona, doors begin to open to the hidden world of high-class art fraud. However, becoming Annika means Emma must confront memories from her past that she has tried to forget.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yt12AdvzGrjYc6S6ayPOyAEaTNp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218030'),
  ('222611299946623963', 'Codename: Kids Next Door', 2002, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids, Family', 'Tom Warburton', null, 'Ben Diskin, Lauren Tom, Dee Bradley Baker, Cree Summer', 'TV-Y7', 'Taking numbers instead of names, five extraordinary 10-year-olds form a covert team called the Kids Next Door with one dedicated mission: to free all children from the tyrannical rule of adults.', 'Taking numbers instead of names, five extraordinary 10-year-olds form a covert team called the Kids Next Door with one dedicated mission: to free all children from the tyrannical rule of adults.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ppM8Pl6e8JIr39HPLRFgqDH3Vf1.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:2660'),
  ('279623982935287807', 'Coffee & Vanilla', 2019, 'Drama', null, 'Yūko Shimoda', 'Dori Sakurada, Haruka Fukuhara, Shogo Hama, Yuuki Ogoe, Mario Kuroba, Noa Kita', null, 'A love story between Risa Shiroki and Hiroto Fukami. Twenty year old Risa Shiroki comes to Tokyo from her hometown in the countryside to attend university. Pretty and popular with male students, she has never had a boyfriend and dreams of having a sweet love. One day, thirty year old Hiroto Fukami appears in front of her. He is business man who appears to be gentle and looks perfect. As romance blossoms between them, Risa discovers Hiroto''s dark past.', 'A love story between Risa Shiroki and Hiroto Fukami. Twenty year old Risa Shiroki comes to Tokyo from her hometown in the countryside to attend university. Pretty and popular with male students, she has never had a boyfriend and dreams of having a sweet love. One day, thirty year old Hiroto Fukami appears in front of her. He is business man who appears to be gentle and looks perfect. As romance blossoms between them, Risa discovers Hiroto''s dark past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofzfbEVT7ayFjoWU31kRPMgeomK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91284'),
  ('684636232873747467', 'Coffee Prince', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Gong Yoo, Yoon Eun-hye, Lee Sun-kyun, Chae Jung-an, Kim Chang-wan, Kim Dong-wook, Kim Jae-uck, Lee Eon', 'TV-Y7', 'Han Kyul gives his family''s café a new spin, hiring only good-looking men to work there -- plus an androgynous-looking girl he mistakes for a man.', 'Han Kyul gives his family''s café a new spin, hiring only good-looking men to work there -- plus an androgynous-looking girl he mistakes for a man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tKNlAXwKfRzLeuBOomr1N9gRsU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3215'),
  ('517051970641538460', 'CoinCoin and the Extra-Humans', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Bruno Dumont', null, 'Bernard Pruvost, Philippe Jore, Lucy Caron, Alane Delhaye, Alexia Depret, Priscilla Benoist, Christophe Verheecke, Marie-Josée Wlodarczak', null, 'In this sequel to “Li’l Quinquin,” a strange magma is found near CoinCoin’s home town, causing the inhabitants to behave strangely. Goofy detective Captain Van Der Weyden and his loyal assistant Carpentier set about investigating these alien attacks, discovering that an extra-terrestrial invasion has begun.', 'In this sequel to “Li’l Quinquin,” a strange magma is found near CoinCoin’s home town, causing the inhabitants to behave strangely. Goofy detective Captain Van Der Weyden and his loyal assistant Carpentier set about investigating these alien attacks, discovering that an extra-terrestrial invasion has begun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3eZh1fU4ewvnDCtqKeS2OPRYFbb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82441'),
  ('401989106116609618', 'Çok Güzel Hareketler 2', 2019, 'Family, Comedy, Talk', 'Necati Akpınar', null, 'Cemile Canyurt, Ezgi Özyürekoğlu, Fatma Tezcan, Atakan Çelik, Safa Sarı, Ahmet Hilmi Deler, Cenan Adıgüzel, Tuğba Yılmaz', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5AsAnZWVQ6clW8IM4cL9XgnoFY6.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:86725'),
  ('1078815935988726404', 'Çok Güzel Hareketler Bunlar', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Yılmaz Erdoğan', null, 'Yılmaz Erdoğan, Eser Yenenler, Oğuzhan Koç, İbrahim Büyükak, Ayça Erturan, Aydan Taş, Ayşegül Akdemir, Deniz Erdoğan', null, 'Çok Güzel Hareketler Bunlar, which''s first episode published in 7 May 2008 on Kanal D, is an entertainment program. In Yilmaz Erdogan''s management, BKM Mutfak players takes the stage and to give an active role to the audience, they let audience to rate the games.Yilmaz Erdogan''s brother Deniz Erdogan wrote lyrics for a very familiar American folk song "Camptown Race" and that production became the generic music of the program.', 'Çok Güzel Hareketler Bunlar, which''s first episode published in 7 May 2008 on Kanal D, is an entertainment program. In Yilmaz Erdogan''s management, BKM Mutfak players takes the stage and to give an active role to the audience, they let audience to rate the games.Yilmaz Erdogan''s brother Deniz Erdogan wrote lyrics for a very familiar American folk song "Camptown Race" and that production became the generic music of the program.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tqvyMqzqp8L6CXx2m6JQ6O69EaZ.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:48846'),
  ('586972930787088967', 'Cold Blood Warm Heart', 1996, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jonathan Ki-Yee Chik', null, 'Adam Cheng Siu-Chow, Louis Koo, Jessica Hsuan, Julian Cheung Chi-Lam, Nadia Chan Chung-Ling, Gallen Lo Ka-Leung, Christine Ng Wing-Mei, Cheung Fung-Lei', 'TV-G', 'Bong (Adam Cheng) blamed Sing (Kwan Hoi San) for abandoning his mother and refused to acknowledge him as his father even he was one of the richest men in town. He loved and admired his foster father Kin (Bow Fong), who was a retired cop. He and his brother Lap (Gallen Lo) followed Kin’s footsteps and joined the force. Bong’s half-brother Kei (Poon Chi Man) was involved in a murder case and Bong in turn got suspended since his superior Kin (Julian Cheung) suspected he was Kei’s conspirator. Fortunately, he was proved innocent by Hang (Eddie Cheung)......', 'Bong (Adam Cheng) blamed Sing (Kwan Hoi San) for abandoning his mother and refused to acknowledge him as his father even he was one of the richest men in town. He loved and admired his foster father Kin (Bow Fong), who was a retired cop. He and his brother Lap (Gallen Lo) followed Kin’s footsteps and joined the force. Bong’s half-brother Kei (Poon Chi Man) was involved in a murder case and Bong in turn got suspended since his superior Kin (Julian Cheung) suspected he was Kei’s conspirator. Fortunately, he was proved innocent by Hang (Eddie Cheung)......', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lbwQe7kuWYbggDklgjC2NC8ChXN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87641'),
  ('1040363505481200615', 'Cold Blooded Intern', 2023, 'Drama, Family, Comedy', 'Park Yeon-gyeong, Han Sang-jae', 'Park Yeon-gyeong', 'Ra Mi-ran, Uhm Ji-won, Lee Jong-hyuk, Kim Min-seo, Kim In-kwon, Kim Hye-hwa, Lee Chae-eun, Gyeongree', null, 'A woman in her 40s returns to work as an intern after seven years of being disconnected from work, and starts to endure and survive in a jungle-like society again.', 'A woman in her 40s returns to work as an intern after seven years of being disconnected from work, and starts to endure and survive in a jungle-like society again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtKT9FiapZqcJLFflisIVvqWqXo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157847'),
  ('1138396414856795952', 'Cold Case', 2003, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Meredith Stiehm', null, 'Kathryn Morris, Danny Pino, Jeremy Ratchford, Thom Barry, Tracie Thoms, John Finn', 'TV-14', 'The Philadelphia homicide squad''s lone female detective finds her calling when she is assigned cases that have never been solved. Detective Lilly Rush combines her natural instincts with the updated technology available today to bring about justice for all the victims she can.', 'The Philadelphia homicide squad''s lone female detective finds her calling when she is assigned cases that have never been solved. Detective Lilly Rush combines her natural instincts with the updated technology available today to bring about justice for all the victims she can.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5dmiNE8UdAqIyjjwZZWsjMhhV0b.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:2171'),
  ('904743287069960687', 'Cold Case ~Shinjitsu no Tobira~', 2016, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Yoh Yoshida, Kento Nagayama, Kenichi Takitoh, Ken Mitsuishi, Tomokazu Miura', null, 'Yuri Ishikawa and her team try to crack unresolved cold cases in Kanagawa Prefecture, Japan.', 'Yuri Ishikawa and her team try to crack unresolved cold cases in Kanagawa Prefecture, Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ecALrD5NqtIZyjO53H0mUXumZV.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:69463'),
  ('1131178266368069266', 'Cold Case Files', 1999, 'Crime, Mystery, Documentary', null, null, 'Bill Kurtis', 'TV-PG', 'Explore compelling cases that have gone cold for years, chronicling the journeys of the detectives who reopened them. The detectives relive the events of the crimes, reveal new twists and startling revelations, relying on breakthroughs in forensic technology and the influence of social media to help crack these cases.', 'Explore compelling cases that have gone cold for years, chronicling the journeys of the detectives who reopened them. The detectives relive the events of the crimes, reveal new twists and startling revelations, relying on breakthroughs in forensic technology and the influence of social media to help crack these cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMVyuelqutkIntNBqjzZSCqS12k.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:12258'),
  ('885936979112967494', 'Cold Case Files', 2017, 'Crime, Mystery, Documentary', null, null, 'Bill Kurtis', 'TV-14', 'There are over 100,000 cold cases in America, and only about 1% are ever solved. With recent advancements in technology and the methods used to solve these cases, as well as the unwavering dedication of victims’ families, law enforcement and the public, “Cold Case Files” explores the cases that defied the odds. Each episode of the Emmy-nominated series examines the twists and turns of one murder case that remained unsolved for years, and the critical element that heated it up, leading to the evidence that finally solved it. Featuring interviews with family members, friends, detectives, and others close to the cases, the refreshed classic series examines all facets of the crime and shines a light on a range of voices and victims.', 'There are over 100,000 cold cases in America, and only about 1% are ever solved. With recent advancements in technology and the methods used to solve these cases, as well as the unwavering dedication of victims’ families, law enforcement and the public, “Cold Case Files” explores the cases that defied the odds. Each episode of the Emmy-nominated series examines the twists and turns of one murder case that remained unsolved for years, and the critical element that heated it up, leading to the evidence that finally solved it. Featuring interviews with family members, friends, detectives, and others close to the cases, the refreshed classic series examines all facets of the crime and shines a light on a range of voices and victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ehmyF13Wre9bLcOR11BrmNakfc8.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:90686'),
  ('1055541817844815934', 'Cold Case: The Tylenol Murders', 2025, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Yotam Guendelman, Ari Pines', null, 'Jeff Flock, James Lewis, Michelle Rosen, Tyrone Fahner', 'TV-14', 'Who really laced Tylenol with cyanide? This true-crime series examines alarming theories behind the unsolved killings — and tracks down a key suspect.', 'Who really laced Tylenol with cyanide? This true-crime series examines alarming theories behind the unsolved killings — and tracks down a key suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eWYQAsM0o9MONQXMKaUmI8AEsn5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:289486'),
  ('1056110259065652113', 'Cold Case: Who Killed JonBenét Ramsey', 2024, 'Documentary, Mystery, Crime', null, null, 'JonBenét Ramsey, John Bennett Ramsey, John Andrew Ramsey, Patsy Ramsey, Burke Ramsey', 'TV-MA', 'Police missteps and a media circus derailed the JonBenét Ramsey murder case. This definitive docuseries chronicles the decades-long quest for justice.', 'Police missteps and a media circus derailed the JonBenét Ramsey murder case. This definitive docuseries chronicles the decades-long quest for justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/liKrPPwkZFE4EZPVoVKzXWDNG6R.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:274820'),
  ('196700136452547542', 'Cold Feet', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mike Bullen', null, 'James Nesbitt, John Thomson, Fay Ripley, Hermione Norris, Robert Bathurst, Daisy Edgar-Jones, Ceallach Spellman', null, 'Follow the lives and loves of a group of thirtysomethings in a heart-warming comic drama as they try to find true love - or at least keep their relationships on track. In this wry and funny look at a generation which is as confused as it is liberated by the choices it faces, will the chill in their feet put out the passion that burns in their hearts?', 'Follow the lives and loves of a group of thirtysomethings in a heart-warming comic drama as they try to find true love - or at least keep their relationships on track. In this wry and funny look at a generation which is as confused as it is liberated by the choices it faces, will the chill in their feet put out the passion that burns in their hearts?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mSPjuYGUpxr3bwP2VB97Ry0oJA0.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:749'),
  ('252813220897638312', 'Cold Justice', 2013, 'Crime, Documentary', 'Dick Wolf', null, 'Kelly Siegler', 'TV-14', 'From Executive Producer Dick Wolf, this true crime investigative series follows veteran prosecutor Kelly Siegler, and her rotating team of seasoned detectives, as they travel to small towns across the country and help local law-enforcement agencies dig into unsolved homicide cases that have lingered for years without answers or justice for the victims due to lack of funding and proper forensic technology.', 'From Executive Producer Dick Wolf, this true crime investigative series follows veteran prosecutor Kelly Siegler, and her rotating team of seasoned detectives, as they travel to small towns across the country and help local law-enforcement agencies dig into unsolved homicide cases that have lingered for years without answers or justice for the victims due to lack of funding and proper forensic technology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gfJL3QtpHvHtxkLA9WBzkYhzAGA.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:58818'),
  ('490923630403990897', 'Cold Justice: Sex Crimes', 2015, 'Reality, Crime', null, null, 'Alicia O''Neill, Casey Garrett', 'TV-14', 'To combat the number of sex crimes and bring justice to the survivors of sexual assault, former Harris County, Texas, prosecutors Casey Garrett and Alicia O''Neill are travelling to small towns around the country to help local law enforcement close cases that have sat dormant for years.', 'To combat the number of sex crimes and bring justice to the survivors of sexual assault, former Harris County, Texas, prosecutors Casey Garrett and Alicia O''Neill are travelling to small towns around the country to help local law enforcement close cases that have sat dormant for years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s49XDKDZuDELIsNWogcxeFk4uF1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63017'),
  ('542820733147763458', 'Cold Lazarus', 1996, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Dennis Potter', null, 'Albert Finney, Ciarán Hinds, Grant Masters, Frances de la Tour, Ganiat Kasumu, Henry Goodman, Carmen Ejogo, Saffron Burrows', null, 'Cold Lazarus is a four-part British television drama written by Dennis Potter with the knowledge that he was dying of pancreatic cancer. Forming the second half of a pair with the television serial Karaoke, it is Potter''s sole science fiction work. In a bleak, synthetic 24th-century dystopian Britain, scientists work on reviving the mind of 20th-century writer Daniel Feeld, whose head was frozen after Feeld''s death shortly after the events of ''Karaoke''. Progress has not been made, so discontinuation is considered, but media mogul David Siltz, who has been spying on the project, envisages a fortune from broadcasting Feeld''s memories on TV.', 'Cold Lazarus is a four-part British television drama written by Dennis Potter with the knowledge that he was dying of pancreatic cancer. Forming the second half of a pair with the television serial Karaoke, it is Potter''s sole science fiction work. In a bleak, synthetic 24th-century dystopian Britain, scientists work on reviving the mind of 20th-century writer Daniel Feeld, whose head was frozen after Feeld''s death shortly after the events of ''Karaoke''. Progress has not been made, so discontinuation is considered, but media mogul David Siltz, who has been spying on the project, envisages a fortune from broadcasting Feeld''s memories on TV.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uP0fFypE9ElGVciFSbbaF2afpfm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3349'),
  ('636793812069230461', 'Cold Squad', 1998, 'Drama', null, null, 'Garry Chalk, Julie Stewart, Matthew Bennett, Tahmoh Penikett, Jerry Wasserman, Joely Collins, Richard Ian Cox, Jay Brazeau', 'TV-14', 'Cold Squad is a Canadian police procedural television series first broadcast in 1998 that followed the investigations of a part of the Vancouver Police Department Homicide Division tasked with solving cold cases, the titular Cold Squad, as led by Sergeant Ali McCormick. The cast of Cold Squad was diverse and changing, McCormick being the only character to appear in all 7 seasons. Some notable series regulars include Detective Tony Logozzo in seasons 1-2, Sgt. Frank Coscarella in seasons 3-4, Sgt. Len Harper in seasons 5-7, Insp. Vince Schneider season 1, Insp. Simon Ross season 2, Insp. Andrew Pawlachuk seasons 3-7, Det. Mickey Kollander seasons 3-6, Det. Nicco Sevallis seasons 3-6, Christine Wren seasons 4-7, as well as Det. Samantha Walters and Const. Ray Chase in season 7. Between the second and third seasons, almost the entire on-screen cast other than Julie Stewart were replaced. This along with the new sets, a significant revamp of the credits and theme music, and even having McCormick''s hair change from auburn to dirty-blonde all contributed to a considerable reworking of the series.', 'Cold Squad is a Canadian police procedural television series first broadcast in 1998 that followed the investigations of a part of the Vancouver Police Department Homicide Division tasked with solving cold cases, the titular Cold Squad, as led by Sergeant Ali McCormick. The cast of Cold Squad was diverse and changing, McCormick being the only character to appear in all 7 seasons. Some notable series regulars include Detective Tony Logozzo in seasons 1-2, Sgt. Frank Coscarella in seasons 3-4, Sgt. Len Harper in seasons 5-7, Insp. Vince Schneider season 1, Insp. Simon Ross season 2, Insp. Andrew Pawlachuk seasons 3-7, Det. Mickey Kollander seasons 3-6, Det. Nicco Sevallis seasons 3-6, Christine Wren seasons 4-7, as well as Det. Samantha Walters and Const. Ray Chase in season 7. Between the second and third seasons, almost the entire on-screen cast other than Julie Stewart were replaced. This along with the new sets, a significant revamp of the credits and theme music, and even having McCormick''s hair change from auburn to dirty-blonde all contributed to a considerable reworking of the series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4JC7VvbplEXMGw2jW15QzHqqoN6.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:597'),
  ('717484756693456134', 'Cold War', 1998, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Kenneth Branagh', null, 'A 24-part series which deals with the relations between the United States, the Soviet Union and their respective allies between the end of World War II to the collapse of the Soviet Union in 1991.', 'A 24-part series which deals with the relations between the United States, the Soviet Union and their respective allies between the end of World War II to the collapse of the Soviet Union in 1991.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14IgYtsAEbzdYwXFiNCItIH0epc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13505'),
  ('685416386033552467', 'Colditz', 1972, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Gerard Glaister', null, 'David McCallum, Bernard Hepton, Christopher Neame, Edward Hardwicke, Peter Penry-Jones, Jack Hedley', null, 'Colditz is a British television series co-produced by the BBC and Universal Studios and screened between 1972 and 1974. The series deals with Allied prisoners of war imprisoned at the supposedly escape-proof Colditz Castle when designated Oflag IV-C during World War II, and their many attempts to escape captivity, as well as the relationships formed between the various nationalities and their German captors.', 'Colditz is a British television series co-produced by the BBC and Universal Studios and screened between 1972 and 1974. The series deals with Allied prisoners of war imprisoned at the supposedly escape-proof Colditz Castle when designated Oflag IV-C during World War II, and their many attempts to escape captivity, as well as the relationships formed between the various nationalities and their German captors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6wjnO0DpbUmvdQSLNt1nkbXYazV.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:546'),
  ('753069651117164426', 'Colditz', 2005, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Damian Lewis, Sophia Myles, Tom Hardy, Laurence Fox, James Fox, Timothy West, Jason Priestley, Guy Henry', 'TV-MA', 'During World War II, the Germans convert the castle of Colditz into an escape-proof prison where recidivist escapees are imprisoned under one roof. The most accomplished escape artists are gathered there, brave soldiers who view escape not only as a challenge but as a duty, in order to harass and irritate German forces as much as they can.', 'During World War II, the Germans convert the castle of Colditz into an escape-proof prison where recidivist escapees are imprisoned under one roof. The most accomplished escape artists are gathered there, brave soldiers who view escape not only as a challenge but as a duty, in order to harass and irritate German forces as much as they can.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6EOJnZ5rLHourOK9v56yHJwLbbD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21009'),
  ('8078137724604335', 'Coldwater', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'David Ireland', null, 'Andrew Lincoln, Ewen Bremner, Eve Myles, Indira Varma, Samuel Bottomley, Lois Chimimba, Amara Atwal, Dhilan Miller', null, 'A man in the midst of a mid-life crisis moves his family to a remote Scottish village, only to find himself entangled in a dangerous friendship with a sinister neighbour.', 'A man in the midst of a mid-life crisis moves his family to a remote Scottish village, only to find himself entangled in a dangerous friendship with a sinister neighbour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oguBhjxw7hwwCyq2G4ujFRy6kbX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:258190'),
  ('16773768972309107', 'Colin from Accounts', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Harriet Dyer, Patrick Brammall', null, 'Harriet Dyer, Patrick Brammall', null, 'Ashley and Gordon are two single(ish), complex humans who are brought together by a car accident and an injured dog. Flawed, funny people choosing each other and being brave enough to show their true self, scars and all, as they navigate life together.', 'Ashley and Gordon are two single(ish), complex humans who are brought together by a car accident and an injured dog. Flawed, funny people choosing each other and being brave enough to show their true self, scars and all, as they navigate life together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYPRXAImgarNSKrwd4kXobjXQNQ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:203614'),
  ('978106209673916915', 'Colin in Black and White', 2021, 'Drama', 'Ava DuVernay, Michael Starrbury', null, 'Jaden Michael, Mary-Louise Parker, Nick Offerman, Colin Kaepernick', 'TV-14', 'The life of athlete Colin Kaepernick and his adoptive parents as they navigate the challenges of raising a black son in a white family and community.', 'The life of athlete Colin Kaepernick and his adoptive parents as they navigate the challenges of raising a black son in a white family and community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q1qnSWuSRG8OxRnn7c5We2bwNoQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:118169'),
  ('225068099386377284', 'Collateral', 2018, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'David Hare', null, 'Carey Mulligan, Vineeta Rishi, Rob Jarvis, Nathaniel Martello-White, Ben Miles, John Simm, Billie Piper, Hayley Squires', 'TV-PG', 'When a pizza delivery driver is shot dead in south London, a tenacious detective goes after the people traffickers behind his murder and unravels a conspiracy that goes to the top.', 'When a pizza delivery driver is shot dead in south London, a tenacious detective goes after the people traffickers behind his murder and unravels a conspiracy that goes to the top.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ekqFDb0IbY7pJbL772TEs2GifX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76796'),
  ('851947533638573181', 'College Romance', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Simarpreet Singh', 'Ashutosh Pankaj', 'Keshav Sadhna, Shreya Mehta, Gagan Arora, Apoorva Arora, Nupur Nagpal, Eklavey Kashyap, Jhanvi Rawat', null, 'College Romance is a story of three BFF''s : Karan, Trippy and Naira ; who fall in love and their ridiculous romantic stories take off.', 'College Romance is a story of three BFF''s : Karan, Trippy and Naira ; who fall in love and their ridiculous romantic stories take off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCvYGef9G5aj3jeoLW79f79O5I4.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:84150'),
  ('595737679941988289', 'CollegeHumor Shorts', 2007, null, null, null, null, null, 'Original sketches, music videos, and pop culture parodies spanning the last CollegeHumor decade.', 'Original sketches, music videos, and pop culture parodies spanning the last CollegeHumor decade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/37oVOAmZhuClHUZKC9r6yLlD88R.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:49531'),
  ('12069064213512820', 'Collision', 2009, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Anthony Horowitz', 'Michael A. Walker', 'Paul McGann, Douglas Henshall, Matt Ryan, Phil Davis, Sylvia Syms, Dean Lennox Kelly, Lucy Griffiths, Jocelyn Jee Esien', 'TV-PG', 'The story of a major road accident and a group of people who have never met, but who all share one single defining moment that will change their lives.', 'The story of a major road accident and a group of people who have never met, but who all share one single defining moment that will change their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXuLNDG9UICDXqG0ciyQpjuW4SX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8344'),
  ('715765271043272249', 'Colony', 2016, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Carlton Cuse, Ryan Condal, Wes Tooke', null, 'Josh Holloway, Sarah Wayne Callies, Tory Kittles, Peter Jacobson, Alex Neustaedter, Isabella Crovetti, Jacob Buster', 'TV-14', 'In the near future a family must make difficult decisions as they balance staying together with trying to survive. They live in Los Angeles, which has been occupied by a force of outside intruders. While some people have chosen to collaborate with the authorities and benefit from the new order, others have rebelled — and suffer the consequences.', 'In the near future a family must make difficult decisions as they balance staying together with trying to survive. They live in Los Angeles, which has been occupied by a force of outside intruders. While some people have chosen to collaborate with the authorities and benefit from the new order, others have rebelled — and suffer the consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qfS0mp22XfTig2EK3jWKiyx7kNy.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:62858'),
  ('592845061150418313', 'Color Rush', 2020, 'Mystery, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Se Sang', null, 'Yoo Jun, Han Sang-hyuk, Yeon Min-ji, Oh Yu-jin, Baek Seo-hoo, Min Hyo-gi, Yoo Jang-young, Ryu Ye-ri', 'TV-14', 'Yeon-woo, neurologically colorblind, sees colors through Yoo-han in a "color rush." Their connection intertwines with the mystery of his missing mother.', 'Yeon-woo, neurologically colorblind, sees colors through Yoo-han in a "color rush." Their connection intertwines with the mystery of his missing mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ieePfhScQdToCEWzMuaskwYru0d.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:115538'),
  ('1095211128579520760', 'Colorful', 1999, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Torajirou Kishi', null, 'Nobutoshi Canna, Daiki Nakamura, Fumihiko Tachiki, Miho Yamada, Nina Kumagaya, Sayaka Ohara, Urara Takano, Yasuhiko Kawazu', null, 'The adventures (and mis-adventures) of Men, staring, peeking, glancing, looking, glaring at women and their efforts to get that extra eyeful of harmlessly exposed panties, bra, and occasional cleavage. Following at most, a few regular males and the outrageous consequences of their actions.', 'The adventures (and mis-adventures) of Men, staring, peeking, glancing, looking, glaring at women and their efforts to get that extra eyeful of harmlessly exposed panties, bra, and occasional cleavage. Following at most, a few regular males and the outrageous consequences of their actions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wlzH3HvDFI19xRR54VasQDubqFc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11147'),
  ('189142065060704765', 'Colorina', 1980, 'Drama, Soap', 'Arturo Moya Grau, Valentín Pimstein', 'Arturo Moya Grau', 'Lucía Méndez, Enrique Álvarez Félix, Armando Calvo, Héctor Ortega, Julissa, José Alonso, Alma Delfina, Liliana Abud', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ntjqGjhg6BS4gJplDM33gWV6mNz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82734'),
  ('664832165140642582', 'Colourful Life', 2001, 'Drama', null, 'Jingrong Zhao', 'Frankie Lam, Annie Man Chung-Han, Ronald Cheng Chung-Kei, Cutie Mui Siu-Wai, Louis Yuen Siu-Cheung, Florence Kwok Siu-Wan, Gigi Wong, Angelina Lo', null, 'The Ching family is an affluent family that produces textiles for the royal family, the govt officials and the army during the Tang Dynasty. Circumstances force the Ching''s 4th son, Ching Chi Hin to marry Dun Ju, the daughter of a Tibetan general. However, their relationship is marred by misunderstandings and hatred for each other. The two remain in a loveless marriage, with Dun Ju wanting to return to Tibet and Chi Hin nicknaming her "stupid pig" because her name Dun Ju pronunciation sounds the same as "stupid pig" in Chinese. One day she runs into Luk Dung Jaun, a Tibetan govt official on the streets of the Tang capital. He tells her he is on a secret mission and asks for her help, promising that he will take her back to Tibet once they have finished their mission. Their mission is to find the long-lost illegitimate son of the Tibetan Emperor. The clues to finding this person is a gold butterfly pendant, a piece of jade and a birthmark on the person''s chest.', 'The Ching family is an affluent family that produces textiles for the royal family, the govt officials and the army during the Tang Dynasty. Circumstances force the Ching''s 4th son, Ching Chi Hin to marry Dun Ju, the daughter of a Tibetan general. However, their relationship is marred by misunderstandings and hatred for each other. The two remain in a loveless marriage, with Dun Ju wanting to return to Tibet and Chi Hin nicknaming her "stupid pig" because her name Dun Ju pronunciation sounds the same as "stupid pig" in Chinese. One day she runs into Luk Dung Jaun, a Tibetan govt official on the streets of the Tang capital. He tells her he is on a secret mission and asks for her help, promising that he will take her back to Tibet once they have finished their mission. Their mission is to find the long-lost illegitimate son of the Tibetan Emperor. The clues to finding this person is a gold butterfly pendant, a piece of jade and a birthmark on the person''s chest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8PJrvAUYm9Mp31mPOR7Ss7mmUW9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109545'),
  ('483337684261801690', 'Columbo', 1971, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'William Link, Richard Levinson', null, 'Peter Falk', 'TV-PG', 'Columbo is a friendly, verbose, disheveled-looking police detective who is consistently underestimated by his suspects. Despite his unprepossessing appearance and apparent absentmindedness, he shrewdly solves all of his cases and secures all evidence needed for indictment. His formidable eye for detail and meticulously dedicated approach often become clear to the killer only late in the storyline.', 'Columbo is a friendly, verbose, disheveled-looking police detective who is consistently underestimated by his suspects. Despite his unprepossessing appearance and apparent absentmindedness, he shrewdly solves all of his cases and secures all evidence needed for indictment. His formidable eye for detail and meticulously dedicated approach often become clear to the killer only late in the storyline.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2JCD8vab3fircOU8cM2HJCxfv4I.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:873'),
  ('764336044051324519', 'Com si fos ahir', 2017, 'Drama, Soap', null, null, null, null, 'A group of high school friends meet again after 25 years to attend the funeral of a mutual friend, and from that point on they try to recover their friendship.', 'A group of high school friends meet again after 25 years to attend the funeral of a mutual friend, and from that point on they try to recover their friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCc6tIeV0yOCZq1DoWmFGQX2tOM.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:260609'),
  ('482993987443990482', 'Coma', 2012, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Robin Cook', 'John McLaughlin, Robin Cook', 'Lauren Ambrose, Steven Pasquale, Geena Davis, Ellen Burstyn, James Woods, Richard Dreyfuss, James Rebhorn, Joe Morton', 'TV-14', 'A young medical student discovers that something sinister is going on in her hospital after routine procedures send more than a few seemingly healthy patients into comas on the operating table.', 'A young medical student discovers that something sinister is going on in her hospital after routine procedures send more than a few seemingly healthy patients into comas on the operating table.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sYzdFLCXOtJDZuMcdjR2SSwpYZA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37092'),
  ('1030471567343776501', 'Comanche Moon', 2008, 'Drama, Western', null, 'Larry McMurtry', 'Steve Zahn, Linda Cardellini, Val Kilmer, Elizabeth Banks, Melanie Lynskey, Karl Urban, Adam Beach, Keith D. Robinson', null, 'Set in the rugged American frontier, Texas Rangers Woodrow Call and Gus McCrae confront Comanche warriors, ruthless outlaws, and the brutal realities of a lawless land, forging fierce friendships and enduring tragic romances as survival comes at a heavy personal cost.', 'Set in the rugged American frontier, Texas Rangers Woodrow Call and Gus McCrae confront Comanche warriors, ruthless outlaws, and the brutal realities of a lawless land, forging fierce friendships and enduring tragic romances as survival comes at a heavy personal cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/buj4sa2H7KyiI7bXbccKZYm438Z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:18240'),
