  ('936473298073034156', 'Comando Elite', 2013, null, null, null, 'Salvador del Solar, Diana Hoyos, Julieth Restrepo, Carolina Acevedo, Adriana Arango', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ZpedFEYfeDPN8RhPNoiNcOZUoB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87535'),
  ('252415585348003213', 'Combat Hospital', 2011, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Elias Koteas, Michelle Borth, Luke Mably, Deborah Kara Unger, Terry Chen, Arnold Pinnock', 'TV-14', 'The frantic lives of the resident doctors and nurses working at the only military hospital providing advanced surgical care in all of Southern Afghanistan. They navigate through the relentless life-and-death battles on the operating table as well as the never-ending conflicts that arise from working in a war zone military hospital.', 'The frantic lives of the resident doctors and nurses working at the only military hospital providing advanced surgical care in all of Southern Afghanistan. They navigate through the relentless life-and-death battles on the operating table as well as the never-ending conflicts that arise from working in a war zone military hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gdsjYtMBiHLIajWrqyQPO0x4mWl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39112'),
  ('1055443591915108273', 'Combat!', 1962, 'War & Politics, Drama', null, null, 'Rick Jason, Vic Morrow, Jack Hogan, Pierre Jalbert, Conlan Carter, Dick Peabody, Tom Lowell, Steven Rogers', 'TV-PG', 'Combat! is an American television program that originally aired on ABC from 1962 until 1967. The show covered the grim lives of a squad of American soldiers fighting the Germans in France during World War II. The program starred Rick Jason as platoon leader Second Lieutenant Gil Hanley and Vic Morrow as Sergeant "Chip" Saunders.', 'Combat! is an American television program that originally aired on ABC from 1962 until 1967. The show covered the grim lives of a squad of American soldiers fighting the Germans in France during World War II. The program starred Rick Jason as platoon leader Second Lieutenant Gil Hanley and Vic Morrow as Sergeant "Chip" Saunders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Xk9VQ5Xa6jkRHBINkHiRzRNgde.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:4316'),
  ('385474547839898048', 'Combatants Will Be Dispatched!', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yusuke Shirai, Miyu Tomita, Sayaka Kikuchi, Natsumi Murakami, Minami Takahashi, Sayumi Watabe, Rina Hidaka, Kaori Ishihara', 'TV-14', 'Turns out, evil takes initiative! With world domination close at hand, the Kisaragi Corporation turns its sights on interstellar conquest, and who better to take over a magical world than two randomly assigned minions—Combatant Agent Six and his android partner Alice? But Six’s path up the evil corporate ladder won’t be easy—a Demon Lord’s army is hatching its own nefarious plan!', 'Turns out, evil takes initiative! With world domination close at hand, the Kisaragi Corporation turns its sights on interstellar conquest, and who better to take over a magical world than two randomly assigned minions—Combatant Agent Six and his android partner Alice? But Six’s path up the evil corporate ladder won’t be easy—a Demon Lord’s army is hatching its own nefarious plan!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tk0LqlgKzc79nWtTmgGz41yu6p3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100567'),
  ('975788718372262426', 'Come and Hug Me', 2018, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Jang Ki-yong, Jin Ki-joo, Huh Joon-ho, Kim Kyung-nam, Seo Jeong-yeon, Choi Ri, Yoon Jong-hoon, Kim Seo-hyung', null, 'When they were children, Yoon Na Moo and Gil Nak Won were each others first love. They are forced to break apart when Na Moo''s father Yoon Hee Jae, a psychopath serial killer, murders Nak Won''s parents. 9 years later Yoon Na Moo is known as Chae Do Jin, a passionate and kind rookie detective wishing to atone for his father''s sins. And Gil Nak Won is now Han Jae Yi, an aspiring actress following in the footsteps of her mother. She suffers from a panic disorder but still has a good outlook on life. However, the sadness of their past comes to light again and their short-lived encounter is over before it began. Another three years on, Jae Yi has become a popular actress and Do Jin is now an experienced detective. When their fate becomes connected once more, will their love prove to be stronger than their past?', 'When they were children, Yoon Na Moo and Gil Nak Won were each others first love. They are forced to break apart when Na Moo''s father Yoon Hee Jae, a psychopath serial killer, murders Nak Won''s parents. 9 years later Yoon Na Moo is known as Chae Do Jin, a passionate and kind rookie detective wishing to atone for his father''s sins. And Gil Nak Won is now Han Jae Yi, an aspiring actress following in the footsteps of her mother. She suffers from a panic disorder but still has a good outlook on life. However, the sadness of their past comes to light again and their short-lived encounter is over before it began. Another three years on, Jae Yi has become a popular actress and Do Jin is now an experienced detective. When their fate becomes connected once more, will their love prove to be stronger than their past?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ph5aNGwzi2ktTcCKBUtr4SIAcTy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79238'),
  ('998841370972744608', 'Come Come Everybody', 2021, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Mone Kamishiraishi, Eri Fukatsu, Rina Kawaei, Masahiro Komoto, Naomi Nishida, Gaku Hamada, Shin''ya Ohwada, Machiko Washio', null, 'Come Come Everybody is a Japanese television drama series and the 105th NHK Asadora series, following Okaeri Mone.. It depicts the lives of three generations of women who have close links to the English lessons on radio which began in 1925.', 'Come Come Everybody is a Japanese television drama series and the 105th NHK Asadora series, following Okaeri Mone.. It depicts the lives of three generations of women who have close links to the English lessons on radio which began in 1925.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJ5xZoqCZNaummrtiVBGkZZiEgq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137265'),
  ('680742988531764753', 'Come Dine with Me', 2005, 'Reality', null, null, 'Dave Lamb', 'TV-14', 'Amateur chefs compete against each other by hosting a dinner party for the other contestants. Each competitor then rates the host''s performance with the winner winning a £1,000 cash prize. An element of comedy is added to the show through comedian Dave Lamb, who provides a dry and "bitingly sarcastic" narration.', 'Amateur chefs compete against each other by hosting a dinner party for the other contestants. Each competitor then rates the host''s performance with the winner winning a £1,000 cash prize. An element of comedy is added to the show through comedian Dave Lamb, who provides a dry and "bitingly sarcastic" narration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/enFfviWZwnIKn9DhyMa7cXqKx6Q.jpg', 51, 'tmdb:tv:2637'),
  ('791275363177017446', 'Come Dine with Me Mexico', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Isabel Fernández', null, 'Sixteen Mexican celebrities open their homes and prepare a dinner in which they will show who is the best host.', 'Sixteen Mexican celebrities open their homes and prepare a dinner in which they will show who is the best host.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uAhwKdHnkA7aHkY7x3YWOnvKnly.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:203326'),
  ('151747906372081233', 'Come Fly with Me', 2010, 'Comedy', 'David Walliams, Matt Lucas', null, 'David Walliams, Matt Lucas, Sally Rogers', 'TV-MA', 'Come Fly with Me is a comedy sketch series starring David Walliams and Matt Lucas. The series is a spoof docu-soap set in a busy airport featuring check-in staff to cabin crew, from pilots to paparazzi with all the principal characters played by the two stars.', 'Come Fly with Me is a comedy sketch series starring David Walliams and Matt Lucas. The series is a spoof docu-soap set in a busy airport featuring check-in staff to cabin crew, from pilots to paparazzi with all the principal characters played by the two stars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aahFPE0nKdQ1GZGlTQoiSdHvcZ8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34604'),
  ('199332729464428285', 'Come Home Love', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', null, null, 'Quinn Ho, Louis Cheung, Priscilla Wong, Owen Cheung, James Ng Yip-Kwan, Katy Kung, Evergreen Mak Cheung-Ching, Teresa Lee Fung', 'NR', 'MA FU, a retired employee of the HK Correctional Services Department, moved back to live with his son after retirement. MA FU treats and disciplines everyone in his family as if they were the offenders he works with in his job. His youngest son MA CHONG feels like he''s in jail when he gets home, and his father is even often involved with his job as a paralegal. The father and son get into disputes daily and his elder brother MA KEUNG and his wife LO LAI SEUNG are often stuck in between and have to settle the disputes. The couple also holds the heavy responsibility of raising their kids. Three generations in the MA family all live together and encounter different situations, experiences and system of values.', 'MA FU, a retired employee of the HK Correctional Services Department, moved back to live with his son after retirement. MA FU treats and disciplines everyone in his family as if they were the offenders he works with in his job. His youngest son MA CHONG feels like he''s in jail when he gets home, and his father is even often involved with his job as a paralegal. The father and son get into disputes daily and his elder brother MA KEUNG and his wife LO LAI SEUNG are often stuck in between and have to settle the disputes. The couple also holds the heavy responsibility of raising their kids. Three generations in the MA family all live together and encounter different situations, experiences and system of values.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQwKCmgbpjb3wIf816t4WNgxzcR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:84791'),
  ('998553887258732345', 'Come Home Love: Dinner at 8', 2016, 'Family, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Wayne Lai Yiu-Cheung, Power Chan Kwok-Pong, Teresa Mo Shun-Kwan, Angela Tong Ying-Ying, Florence Kwok Siu-Wan, Lee Tin-Cheung, Chung King-Fai', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tVfZs2s1zciGUsV6eZIsiTzQsy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93983'),
  ('96670466322921508', 'Come Home Love: Lo and Behold', 2017, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', null, 'Anna Lee, Yuan Bao Hui, Ma Jun Ying', 'Danny Lau Dan, Pal Sinn Lap-Man, Joyce Tang Lai-Ming, Koni Lui, Stanley Cheung, Angela Tong Ying-Ying, Kalok Chow, Gu Pui Ling', null, 'Hung Sue Gan starting from the bottom, established his own logistics company, which is now running smoothly. His only concern now are his three daughters. His eldest daughter has immigrated overseas. His second daughter Hung Yeuk Shui has reached the marriageable age, but has no hopes for marriage anytime soon. She is constantly bickering with her younger sister Hung Sum Yue, who is an honour student, over trivial matters, causing their father to not know whether to laugh or cry. Hung Sue Yan, Hung Sue Gan''s brother, moves in with the family, temporarily ending his life as a nomadic photographer. He joins Hung Yeuk Shui''s company and encounters Ko Pak Fei, the director of an online shop. The two appear to be former lovers, making for lots of laughter. Since Hung Sue Yan moved in, a series of strange events have occurred in the family. Upon investigation, the source is traced to Lung Ging Fung, a promising young man who is the son of department store mogul Lung Gam Wai.', 'Hung Sue Gan starting from the bottom, established his own logistics company, which is now running smoothly. His only concern now are his three daughters. His eldest daughter has immigrated overseas. His second daughter Hung Yeuk Shui has reached the marriageable age, but has no hopes for marriage anytime soon. She is constantly bickering with her younger sister Hung Sum Yue, who is an honour student, over trivial matters, causing their father to not know whether to laugh or cry. Hung Sue Yan, Hung Sue Gan''s brother, moves in with the family, temporarily ending his life as a nomadic photographer. He joins Hung Yeuk Shui''s company and encounters Ko Pak Fei, the director of an online shop. The two appear to be former lovers, making for lots of laughter. Since Hung Sue Yan moved in, a series of strange events have occurred in the family. Upon investigation, the source is traced to Lung Ging Fung, a promising young man who is the son of department store mogul Lung Gam Wai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lgD4j9gUGmMckZpWWRJjorWqGVT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91759'),
  ('723966095387646377', 'Come On, Cousin', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Wong Wai-Sing', null, 'Roger Kwok Chun-On, Wong Cho-Lam, Joey Man Yee-Man, Ivana Wong Yuen-Chi, Louis Cheung, Chung King-Fai, Tommy Wong, Mimi Chu Mai-Mai', null, 'When lazy second-generation heir Yau Tin, takes over the grocery store inside the building, he overhauls it and hires all the residents in the building to work there. But soon environmentalist and stock boy, Lam Joi-yeh, leads a revolt against Yau Tin when he puts up a huge poster against the building that affects the residents'' quality of life.', 'When lazy second-generation heir Yau Tin, takes over the grocery store inside the building, he overhauls it and hires all the residents in the building to work there. But soon environmentalist and stock boy, Lam Joi-yeh, leads a revolt against Yau Tin when he puts up a huge poster against the building that affects the residents'' quality of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r7TB97uuGZX9hSOuviuiEvyHDTf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94739'),
  ('84603521204584977', 'Come What May', 2023, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Ayşegül Çiçekoğlu', null, 'Enes Koçak, Eylül Tumbar, Hakan Yılmaz, Selen Soyder, Hivda Zizan Alp, Yonca Şahinbaş, Berat Yenilmez, Sait Genay', null, 'Alize, who lost her mother the day she was born, is a beautiful but very selfish young girl who was spoiled and raised by her father. Alize, who goes crazy when she learns that her father is getting remarried, decides to fake a marriage with a man he would never allow her to marry in order to take revenge. However, things will not go as planned', 'Alize, who lost her mother the day she was born, is a beautiful but very selfish young girl who was spoiled and raised by her father. Alize, who goes crazy when she learns that her father is getting remarried, decides to fake a marriage with a man he would never allow her to marry in order to take revenge. However, things will not go as planned', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dOPMs6LgjVkZyTOd1mlFgxLOIhY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:228980'),
  ('284244117802371590', 'Comeback', 2008, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Tomáš Matonoha, Martin Dejdar, Matouš Ruml, Kristýna Leichtová, Marie Doležalová, Dana Batulková, Simona Babčáková, Jakub Žáček', null, 'Comeback is a Czech television sitcom which premiered on TV Nova on September 4, 2008.', 'Comeback is a Czech television sitcom which premiered on TV Nova on September 4, 2008.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hvmnwbWIOc25GXsjh6AGVZXfiiX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:19384'),
  ('836887140487018254', 'Comedians in Cars Getting Coffee', 2012, 'Comedy, Talk', 'Jerry Seinfeld', null, 'Jerry Seinfeld', 'TV-14', 'Jerry takes his comedy pals out for coffee in a selection of his classic automobiles. Larry David sums it up best when he says, ''You''ve finally made a show about nothing.''', 'Jerry takes his comedy pals out for coffee in a selection of his classic automobiles. Larry David sums it up best when he says, ''You''ve finally made a show about nothing.''', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hpK5MsFa7k7RQdClvRglBo0wAoT.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:59717'),
  ('127414393025037995', 'COMEDIANS of the world', 2019, 'Comedy', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Global stand-up comedy series features a diverse set of comics from 13 regions bringing their perspectives on what''s funny around the world.', 'Global stand-up comedy series features a diverse set of comics from 13 regions bringing their perspectives on what''s funny around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/stqF0UyUVhN4g6mqKGoPxMJP6c4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85418'),
  ('665537747254476794', 'Comedy Bang! Bang!', 2012, 'Comedy, Talk', 'Scott Aukerman', null, 'Scott Aukerman, ''Weird Al'' Yankovic', 'TV-14', 'Based on Scott Aukerman’s popular podcast of the same name, COMEDY BANG! BANG! cleverly riffs on the well-known format of the late night talk show, infusing celebrity appearances and comedy sketches with a tinge of the surreal. In each episode, Aukerman engages his guests with unfiltered and improvisational lines of questioning, punctuated by banter and beats provided by bandleader, one-man musical mastermind Reggie Watts, to reinvent the traditional celebrity interview. Packed with character cameos, filmic shorts, sketches and games set amongst an off-beat world, COMEDY BANG! BANG! delivers thirty minutes of absurd laugh-loaded fun featuring some of the biggest names in comedy.', 'Based on Scott Aukerman’s popular podcast of the same name, COMEDY BANG! BANG! cleverly riffs on the well-known format of the late night talk show, infusing celebrity appearances and comedy sketches with a tinge of the surreal. In each episode, Aukerman engages his guests with unfiltered and improvisational lines of questioning, punctuated by banter and beats provided by bandleader, one-man musical mastermind Reggie Watts, to reinvent the traditional celebrity interview. Packed with character cameos, filmic shorts, sketches and games set amongst an off-beat world, COMEDY BANG! BANG! delivers thirty minutes of absurd laugh-loaded fun featuring some of the biggest names in comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5undCFoglpvKYFmu404ve9mh6on.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:43323'),
  ('187356845961863107', 'Comedy Big League', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Park Seong-jae, 남경모', null, 'Lee Gook-ju, Hwang Je-sung, Lee Sang-jun, Shin Young-il, Heo Young-ji, Moon Se-yoon, Kang Jae-jun, Seo Tae-hoon', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cDVfraJA0rh7fHEQmkvg3ZvrBlJ.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:77290'),
  ('622021279309033059', 'Comedy Blaps', 2011, null, null, null, null, null, 'Comedy Blaps is Channel 4''s vehicle for piloting comedy online. Some pilots consist of a single short, whereas others consist of a few shorts.', 'Comedy Blaps is Channel 4''s vehicle for piloting comedy online. Some pilots consist of a single short, whereas others consist of a few shorts.', null, 10, 'tmdb:tv:298388'),
  ('388469073766386599', 'Comedy Central Presents', 1998, 'Comedy, Talk', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'These half-hour specials showcased some of the best up-and-coming comedians of the moment. The show was a pivotal stepping stone for many of today''s stand-up stars.', 'These half-hour specials showcased some of the best up-and-coming comedians of the moment. The show was a pivotal stepping stone for many of today''s stand-up stars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/223LsiI29uOQpdN32QdeMTfmB5R.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:4787'),
  ('681034598527508818', 'Comedy Club', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Artashes Sarkisyan', null, null, null, 'Comedy Club is a Russian stand-up comedy TV show broadcast by the Russian TNT channel since April 23, 2005. Long-time residents of the club are Garik Martirosyan, Timur Batrutdinov, Garik Kharlamov, Pavel Volya, Alexandr Revva, Alexander Nezlobin and others. The show host is Garik Martirosyan. Comedy Club headquarters are located in Moscow.', 'Comedy Club is a Russian stand-up comedy TV show broadcast by the Russian TNT channel since April 23, 2005. Long-time residents of the club are Garik Martirosyan, Timur Batrutdinov, Garik Kharlamov, Pavel Volya, Alexandr Revva, Alexander Nezlobin and others. The show host is Garik Martirosyan. Comedy Club headquarters are located in Moscow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPIbd7JZVxSWNjcJQYEvPu3qo5z.jpg', 22, 'tmdb:tv:16870'),
  ('308993406433104290', 'Comedy Nights with Kapil', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Kapil Sharma', null, 'Kapil Sharma, Navjot Singh Sidhu, Ali Asgar, Sunil Grover, Naseem Vicky, Kiku Sharda, Upasna Singh, Chandan Prabhakar', null, 'Comedy Nights with Kapil is a comedy show which provides a distinctive take on the everyday life of a common man as the show explores the story of every household and how our common man Kapil is affected by the simplest issues in life around him.', 'Comedy Nights with Kapil is a comedy show which provides a distinctive take on the everyday life of a common man as the show explores the story of every household and how our common man Kapil is affected by the simplest issues in life around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9rScFaEadiT3r46LuT9wWOkh3fo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60698'),
  ('84630085701429124', 'Comedy Woman', 2009, 'Talk, Comedy', 'Natalya Eprikyan', null, 'Natalya Eprikyan, Yekaterina Varnava, Natalya Medvedeva, Mariya Kravchenko, Ekaterina Skulkina, Tatyana Morozova, Polina Sibagatullina', null, 'Women celebrities entertain the audience with their comical acts and satirical comments on various topics like relationships, fashion and lifestyle.', 'Women celebrities entertain the audience with their comical acts and satirical comments on various topics like relationships, fashion and lifestyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lXm2EGP64F4M2CBoiHvuL3ykLJM.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:46088'),
  ('777554979404930905', 'Comet Lucifer', 2015, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ayaka Ohashi, Yusuke Kobayashi, Junji Majima, Kenta Miyake, Show Hayami, Rie Takahashi, Tomo Muranaka, Suzuko Mimori', null, 'On the planet Gift there are precious crystals called Giftjium buried in the earth. A young man named Sougo Amagi lives in Garden Indigo, a prosperous mining town. Sougo, whose hobby is collecting rare crystals, one day becomes involved in a dispute between classmates Kaon, Roman and Otto. He wanders deep into the ruins of a mine and discovers an underground lake. There, he meets a mysterious girl named Felia with blue hair and red eyes. Who is this girl, and what will their meeting bring?', 'On the planet Gift there are precious crystals called Giftjium buried in the earth. A young man named Sougo Amagi lives in Garden Indigo, a prosperous mining town. Sougo, whose hobby is collecting rare crystals, one day becomes involved in a dispute between classmates Kaon, Roman and Otto. He wanders deep into the ruins of a mine and discovers an underground lake. There, he meets a mysterious girl named Felia with blue hair and red eyes. Who is this girl, and what will their meeting bring?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Ts4fCTVnGPkd5KNdga3srZk8oG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68256'),
  ('449277699303480944', 'Comfort Zone', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Mikhail Shulaev', null, 'Garik Kharlamov, Ekaterina Molokhovskaya, Stepan Devonin, Zhargal Badmatsirenov, Amadu Mamadakov', null, 'Yaroslav Kostrov, the boorish and quirky owner of a small transport company in Murmansk, by coincidence ends up in a Norwegian prison, where the comfort level resembles good hotels with all amenities and the Internet. But the only thing that connects Yarik with home is the Skype window, through which he will have to somehow get out of the circumstances, as well as resist the mafia, control his business, try not to lose his wife and raise children who refuse to be brought up by video.', 'Yaroslav Kostrov, the boorish and quirky owner of a small transport company in Murmansk, by coincidence ends up in a Norwegian prison, where the comfort level resembles good hotels with all amenities and the Internet. But the only thing that connects Yarik with home is the Skype window, through which he will have to somehow get out of the circumstances, as well as resist the mafia, control his business, try not to lose his wife and raise children who refuse to be brought up by video.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hFyhd9u1udljfQUnjz6OCrlabLx.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:113147'),
  ('95279360573860945', 'Comic Book Men', 2012, 'Reality, Comedy', 'Kevin Smith', null, 'Kevin Smith, Walt Flanagan, Ming Chen, Mike Zapcic, Bryan Johnson', 'TV-PG', 'A show for Fanboys by Fanboys. Set in uber-geek Kevin Smith''s iconic comic shop Jay and Silent Bob''s Secret Stash, the show explores every nook and cranny of Fanboy culture from A to Z. Endless circular debates about the technical accuracy of the USS Enterprise''s warp-core schematics? Snarky comic aficionados with an encyclopedic knowledge of every Marvel back issue? You bet.', 'A show for Fanboys by Fanboys. Set in uber-geek Kevin Smith''s iconic comic shop Jay and Silent Bob''s Secret Stash, the show explores every nook and cranny of Fanboy culture from A to Z. Endless circular debates about the technical accuracy of the USS Enterprise''s warp-core schematics? Snarky comic aficionados with an encyclopedic knowledge of every Marvel back issue? You bet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z9F78WN0li22U5G2unZ7eJ2jmIK.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:42004'),
  ('41557925052136817', 'Comic Girls', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Hikaru Akao, Kaede Hondo, Saori Onishi, Rie Takahashi, Aya Endo, Minami Tsuda, Ayaka Nanase, Reina Ueda', null, 'Kaoruko Moeta is a 15-year-old high school student and 4-panel manga artist. After moving to a dorm especially for female manga artists, she meets shoujo manga artist Koyume, teen romance manga artist Ruki, and shounen manga artist Tsubasa. Every day, they''ll work all through the night trying to ink and finish their work!', 'Kaoruko Moeta is a 15-year-old high school student and 4-panel manga artist. After moving to a dorm especially for female manga artists, she meets shoujo manga artist Koyume, teen romance manga artist Ruki, and shounen manga artist Tsubasa. Every day, they''ll work all through the night trying to ink and finish their work!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7HHXZ1xfos9MrWdx5o3AwJGAiXy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77698'),
  ('330563102558834605', 'Comicstaan', 2018, 'Comedy, Reality', null, null, 'Abish Mathew, Kusha Kapila, Kenny Sebastian, Zakir Khan, Sumukhi Suresh, Neeti Palta', null, 'Ten budding stand-up comedians shortlisted through a nationwide hunt compete to become India''s next big comic sensation.', 'Ten budding stand-up comedians shortlisted through a nationwide hunt compete to become India''s next big comic sensation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k1dkA9b1BS2yOuMj2XAiVU7Ldig.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:80813'),
  ('958192621704803272', 'Coming Out Colton', 2021, 'Reality', null, null, 'Colton Underwood', 'TV-MA', 'Former NFL player and "Bachelor" star Colton Underwood embarks on a journey to embrace his new life as an out member of the LGBTQ community.', 'Former NFL player and "Bachelor" star Colton Underwood embarks on a journey to embrace his new life as an out member of the LGBTQ community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uUO2TS0Yf9oy4dzWctBws5TW4fL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:139401'),
  ('291434201389767788', 'Command Z', 2023, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kurt Andersen, Steven Soderbergh, Larry Doyle', 'Sabrina Brier', 'Michael Cera, Roy Wood Jr., JJ Maley, Chloe Radcliffe, Claire Kenny', null, 'A scientist tasks his employees with a "historic" mission to travel back in time to revise history and save the world.', 'A scientist tasks his employees with a "historic" mission to travel back in time to revise history and save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/UcceEjd9safxW7sxHpaAqcflrz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:231031'),
  ('1119295233377752112', 'Commander in Chief', 2005, 'Drama', 'Rod Lurie', null, 'Geena Davis, Donald Sutherland, Harry Lennix, Kyle Secor, Ever Carradine, Matt Lanter, Caitlin Wachs, Jasmine Jessica Anthony', 'TV-PG', 'Mackenzie Allen has a lot on her plate -- she has twin teenagers, a 6-year-old at home and an ambitious husband at the office, and she is about to become the first female president of the United States. Before that happens, however; Mackenzie, who serves as vice president, has to decide whether or not to go against the dying wishes of the current president, who has asked her to step down and let someone "more appropriate" fill his shoes in the Oval Office. Not only does the president want her to resign, so does the entire party that elected her in the first place. But when the moment of truth arrives, Mackenzie isn''t willing to be a mere footnote in history. Instead of allowing her detractors to keep her down, she decides to trust her instincts and accept the most powerful job in the world.', 'Mackenzie Allen has a lot on her plate -- she has twin teenagers, a 6-year-old at home and an ambitious husband at the office, and she is about to become the first female president of the United States. Before that happens, however; Mackenzie, who serves as vice president, has to decide whether or not to go against the dying wishes of the current president, who has asked her to step down and let someone "more appropriate" fill his shoes in the Oval Office. Not only does the president want her to resign, so does the entire party that elected her in the first place. But when the moment of truth arrives, Mackenzie isn''t willing to be a mere footnote in history. Instead of allowing her detractors to keep her down, she decides to trust her instincts and accept the most powerful job in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2WMS3a43ppLxqDTHyGYmOsqOBbr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4015'),
  ('713615481280552815', 'Common Law', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Marianne Wibberley, Cormac Wibberley', null, 'Michael Ealy, Warren Kole, Jack McGee, Sonya Walger', 'TV-PG', 'Travis Marks and Wes Mitchell are two partners who – apart from their polarity and odd couple behavior – have a seven-year track record as the Los Angeles Police Department''s best detectives in the Robbery-Homicide Division. Since their constant bickering is interfering with work, their new-age captain – who found counseling changed his life – sends them to couples'' therapy.', 'Travis Marks and Wes Mitchell are two partners who – apart from their polarity and odd couple behavior – have a seven-year track record as the Los Angeles Police Department''s best detectives in the Robbery-Homicide Division. Since their constant bickering is interfering with work, their new-age captain – who found counseling changed his life – sends them to couples'' therapy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vZMcWgDn6Q3XyLv3dk8NbPxTxFt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37702'),
  ('649046849025316138', 'Common Side Effects', 2025, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Joseph Bennett, Steve Hely', 'Jon Foor', 'Dave King, Emily Pendergast, Mike Judge, Martha Kelly, Joseph Lee Anderson', 'TV-MA', 'Former high school lab partners Marshall and Frances begin to unravel a conspiracy involving big pharma and the federal government to suppress knowledge of a rare mushroom that may hold the key to curing all the world’s diseases.', 'Former high school lab partners Marshall and Frances begin to unravel a conspiracy involving big pharma and the federal government to suppress knowledge of a rare mushroom that may hold the key to curing all the world’s diseases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8X5XXP49DHrySTXJMUIN5HI1Wz.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:228878'),
  ('66833232909485433', 'Community', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Dan Harmon', null, 'Joel McHale, Gillian Jacobs, Alison Brie, Jim Rash, Danny Pudi, Ken Jeong, Paget Brewster, Keith David', 'TV-14', 'Follow the lives of a group of students at what is possibly the world’s worst community college in the fictional locale of Greendale, Colorado.', 'Follow the lives of a group of students at what is possibly the world’s worst community college in the fictional locale of Greendale, Colorado.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KUjDt8XY7w2Ku70UE0SECmv1zP.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:18347'),
  ('103896508731569287', 'Community Squad', 2023, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Santiago Korovsky', null, 'Santiago Korovsky, Daniel Hendler, Pilar Gamboa, Hernán Cuevas, Valeria Licciardi, Facundo Bogarín, Renato Condori, Santiago Demarco', 'TV-MA', 'The members of a diverse vigilante group formed to boost the police''s image are put in jeopardy when they stumble upon an unexpected drug deal.', 'The members of a diverse vigilante group formed to boost the police''s image are put in jeopardy when they stumble upon an unexpected drug deal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKZmQMP6NLrxO1quNkKGDqwg49r.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:219066'),
