  ('323259126292963409', 'Conviction', 2016, 'Drama', 'Liz Friedman, Liz Friedlander', null, 'Hayley Atwell, Shawn Ashmore, Eddie Cahill, Emily Kinney, Merrin Dungey, Manny Montana', 'TV-14', 'A brilliant young attorney, who is also the daughter of a former U.S. president, is blackmailed to head up LA''s new Conviction Integrity Unit. She and her team investigate cases where people may have been wrongly convicted.', 'A brilliant young attorney, who is also the daughter of a former U.S. president, is blackmailed to head up LA''s new Conviction Integrity Unit. She and her team investigate cases where people may have been wrongly convicted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GZAKNbm4e1ljnTuDNhdYNPzdyx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67118'),
  ('753596843714585663', 'Cook''s Country', 2008, null, null, null, 'Christopher Kimball, Bridget Lancaster, Julia Collin Davison, Adam Ried, Jack Bishop', 'TV-G', 'A team of cooks travel the country and scour the history books to find the very best traditional and contemporary American dishes, then bring them back to the test kitchen and develop practical, approachable recipes.', 'A team of cooks travel the country and scour the history books to find the very best traditional and contemporary American dishes, then bring them back to the test kitchen and develop practical, approachable recipes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTT2t9CEx6uOq8yfLvGVyOUkTMB.jpg', 18, 'tmdb:tv:18940'),
  ('396484153608296402', 'Cooked', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Michael Pollan, Alex Gibney', null, 'Michael Pollan', 'TV-PG', 'Explored through the lenses of the four natural elements – fire, water, air and earth – COOKED is an enlightening and compelling look at the evolution of what food means to us through the history of food preparation and its universal ability to connect us. Highlighting our primal human need to cook, the series urges a return to the kitchen to reclaim our lost traditions and to forge a deeper, more meaningful connection to the ingredients and cooking techniques that we use to nourish ourselves.', 'Explored through the lenses of the four natural elements – fire, water, air and earth – COOKED is an enlightening and compelling look at the evolution of what food means to us through the history of food preparation and its universal ability to connect us. Highlighting our primal human need to cook, the series urges a return to the kitchen to reclaim our lost traditions and to forge a deeper, more meaningful connection to the ingredients and cooking techniques that we use to nourish ourselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvldYM2RUEvK3w2M0YXlrJWblkf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65517'),
  ('229417819022395263', 'Cooking Crush', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Jumpol Adulkittiporn, Atthaphan Phunsawat, Ochiris Suwanacheep, Trai Nimtawat, Jaruwat Cheawaram, Warawut Poyim, Chatchawit Techarukpong, Bhasidi Petchsutee', null, 'Prem, struggling with a failing restaurant, meets stressed med student Ten, teaching him cooking as a scam—until romance unexpectedly heats up.', 'Prem, struggling with a failing restaurant, meets stressed med student Ten, teaching him cooking as a scam—until romance unexpectedly heats up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6eOGr4TBEGFY6JOlqqVBSy0stTk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:231699'),
  ('602830858354864921', 'Cooking Master Boy', 1997, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy', null, null, 'Nobutoshi Canna, Maya Okamoto, Mayumi Tanaka, Houko Kuwashima, Yuri Amano, Satsuki Yukino, Yumi Touma', null, 'After the death of his mother, a young boy travels to China and become a master chef, in his attempt to become head chef of his late mother''s restaurant', 'After the death of his mother, a young boy travels to China and become a master chef, in his attempt to become head chef of his late mother''s restaurant', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WUngFmcOcGKMeyTSuhxr00sUbs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:25080'),
  ('369765504297124688', 'Cooking Up Murder: Uncovering the Story of César Román', 2024, 'Documentary', null, null, 'César Román, Ana Isabel Peña, Gloria Frances Bulnes, Miguel Méndez', 'TV-MA', 'This docuseries analyzes a murder case implicating a Spanish chef, who built a career in the spotlight through a web of secrets and false identities.', 'This docuseries analyzes a murder case implicating a Spanish chef, who built a career in the spotlight through a web of secrets and false identities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggp3qKDmwm93BJgCc4J53wKDN3L.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:253485'),
  ('635025002921298682', 'Cooking with Bill', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Neill Blomkamp', null, 'Alec Gillis, Carly Pope', null, 'Bill and Karen try out the latest kitchen appliances.', 'Bill and Karen try out the latest kitchen appliances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3t2sP7g5HCfmXPZMSJiQUxNlEB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73041'),
  ('357988804847910500', 'Cooking with Paris', 2021, 'Reality', null, null, 'Paris Hilton', 'TV-MA', 'Paris Hilton can cook...kind of. And she’s turning the traditional cooking show upside down. She’s not a trained chef and she’s not trying to be. With the help of her celebrity friends, she navigates new ingredients, new recipes and exotic kitchen appliances.', 'Paris Hilton can cook...kind of. And she’s turning the traditional cooking show upside down. She’s not a trained chef and she’s not trying to be. With the help of her celebrity friends, she navigates new ingredients, new recipes and exotic kitchen appliances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDIXKLKDCGDLum19WrkNwZT60a0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129024'),
  ('746769721205548909', 'Cooku with Comali', 2019, 'Reality, Comedy', 'Parthiv Mani', null, 'Chef Damodharan, Madhampatty Rangaraj, Koushik S, Roja Selvamani, Ma Ka Pa Anand, Shaalin Zoya, Pugazh, KPY Ramar', null, 'Cooku with Comali, also known by the acronym CWC, is an Indian Tamil-language comedy-based cooking competition show aired on Star Vijay and streams on Disney+ Hotstar where the contestants are paired each week with comedians (comalis) who are amateur cooks. The first season premiered on 16 November 2019 and ended on 23 February 2020. The second season was premiered on 14 November 2020 and ended on 14 April 2021. The third season was premiered on 22 January 2022 and ended on 24 July 2022. The contestants along with their comalis are challenged every week and judged by Chef Damu and Chef Venkatesh Bhat.', 'Cooku with Comali, also known by the acronym CWC, is an Indian Tamil-language comedy-based cooking competition show aired on Star Vijay and streams on Disney+ Hotstar where the contestants are paired each week with comedians (comalis) who are amateur cooks. The first season premiered on 16 November 2019 and ended on 23 February 2020. The second season was premiered on 14 November 2020 and ended on 14 April 2021. The third season was premiered on 22 January 2022 and ended on 24 July 2022. The contestants along with their comalis are challenged every week and judged by Chef Damu and Chef Venkatesh Bhat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iuPhRaSQNj1K6fo1g1dVEQx1Q5d.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:114574'),
  ('492337252191247207', 'Coop & Cami Ask the World', 2018, 'Family, Comedy', 'Boyce Bugliari, Jamie McLaughlin', null, 'Dakota Lotus, Ruby Rose Turner, Olivia Sanabia, Rebecca Metz, Paxton Booth', 'TV-G', 'A pair of middle-school siblings make nearly all of their decisions by crowdsourcing the opinions of their millions of online followers.', 'A pair of middle-school siblings make nearly all of their decisions by crowdsourcing the opinions of their millions of online followers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kjognbnGtCQLDVz8XRdp06RmSOn.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:79787'),
  ('293871278184868535', 'Cooper & Fry', 2025, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Caroline Ip, Ben Court', null, 'Robert James-Collier, Mandip Gill, Charlotte Bradley, Lorcan Cranitch, Barry O''Connor, Niamh McCann, Clara Simpson', null, 'Set in the mystery-shrouded Peak District, the series follows two mismatched young detectives: affable local Ben Cooper and guarded newcomer Diane Fry. Thrown together to investigate a string of mysterious deaths they must learn to work together to get results. As their personal lives begin to intertwine, a unique friendship begins to form... but it won''t always be easy.', 'Set in the mystery-shrouded Peak District, the series follows two mismatched young detectives: affable local Ben Cooper and guarded newcomer Diane Fry. Thrown together to investigate a string of mysterious deaths they must learn to work together to get results. As their personal lives begin to intertwine, a unique friendship begins to form... but it won''t always be easy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/frDntanA2DMcNppQYBY5NfHmMM2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:296520'),
  ('530666348185973329', 'Cooper Barrett''s Guide to Surviving Life', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Jay Lacopo', null, 'Jack Cutmore-Scott, Meaghan Rath, James Earl, Charlie Saxton, Liza Lapira, Justin Bartha', 'TV-14', 'As Cooper Barrett struggles to survive each of life’s many challenges, he guides us through the often-messy, always-hilarious ordeal, so that our lives don’t have to be nearly the entertaining disaster that Cooper’s is turning out to be.', 'As Cooper Barrett struggles to survive each of life’s many challenges, he guides us through the often-messy, always-hilarious ordeal, so that our lives don’t have to be nearly the entertaining disaster that Cooper’s is turning out to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5lCN5MNJHepHSpBmvdk5wd1l7Fv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63260'),
  ('590669029131978727', 'Cooper''s Treasure', 2017, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Darrell Miklos, Roger Miklos', 'TV-14', 'The incredible story of 1960''s legendary astronaut Gordon Cooper and the secret treasure map he began from space.', 'The incredible story of 1960''s legendary astronaut Gordon Cooper and the secret treasure map he began from space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/12ae8KreaZDuBGX5YPhG7Xh5sg6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:71124'),
  ('689152512060547541', 'Cop Craft', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Shin Itagaki', null, 'Kenjiro Tsuda, Mayu Yoshioka, Satoshi Tsuruoka, Wataru Takagi, Marina Inoue, Fumiko Orikasa, Masaya Matsukaze, Kenji Hamada', 'TV-MA', '15 years ago, an unknown hyperspace gate opened over the Pacific. Beyond this gate lies Reto Semaani, a strange alternate world where fairies and monsters live. San Teresa City—a city where over two million immigrants live from both worlds. As a result, there are the haves and the have-nots. Here is the world''s newest "city of dreams." But in the shadow of the chaos, crime is rampant: drugs, prostitution, and weapon trafficking. The detectives who stand up to these heinous crimes are in the San Teresa City Police. When the detective Kei Matoba and the alternate-world knight Tirana—two individuals who differ in gender, personality, and even world of origin—meet, an incident erupts. Two worlds. Two justices. From this, the curtain rises on a buddy police action story!', '15 years ago, an unknown hyperspace gate opened over the Pacific. Beyond this gate lies Reto Semaani, a strange alternate world where fairies and monsters live. San Teresa City—a city where over two million immigrants live from both worlds. As a result, there are the haves and the have-nots. Here is the world''s newest "city of dreams." But in the shadow of the chaos, crime is rampant: drugs, prostitution, and weapon trafficking. The detectives who stand up to these heinous crimes are in the San Teresa City Police. When the detective Kei Matoba and the alternate-world knight Tirana—two individuals who differ in gender, personality, and even world of origin—meet, an incident erupts. Two worlds. Two justices. From this, the curtain rises on a buddy police action story!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7oWFujqWhPOGdUg4zseZfnAsNXv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88050'),
  ('1002288478244338537', 'Copenhagen Cowboy', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', 'Nicolas Winding Refn', null, 'Angela Bundalovic, Andreas Lykke Jørgensen, Lili Zhang', 'TV-MA', 'After a lifetime of being sold as a human good luck charm, a woman with mysterious supernatural abilities seeks revenge against those who wronged her.', 'After a lifetime of being sold as a human good luck charm, a woman with mysterious supernatural abilities seeks revenge against those who wronged her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jspobwn8SDeDC00CTfWAv4fjZmb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:206510'),
  ('1054752667041504684', 'Coppelion', 2013, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Shingo Suzuki', null, 'Haruka Tomatsu, Kana Hanazawa, Satomi Akesaka', null, 'Many years after a great tragedy killed 90% of the people in Japan, three girls arrive in the ruins of Tokyo. In the devastated capital, their unusually clean clothes set them apart. But that''s not the only strange thing about them - they also each wield supernatural powers. They call themselves “Coppelion,” and are on a mission to save the people of Tokyo.', 'Many years after a great tragedy killed 90% of the people in Japan, three girls arrive in the ruins of Tokyo. In the devastated capital, their unusually clean clothes set them apart. But that''s not the only strange thing about them - they also each wield supernatural powers. They call themselves “Coppelion,” and are on a mission to save the people of Tokyo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mPQuea0bhoh4oV9nRmJpisHUiZ0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60659'),
  ('662373193638134645', 'Copper', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Tom Fontana, Will Rokos', null, 'Tom Weston-Jones, Anastasia Griffith, Franka Potente, Kyle Schmid, Rayisa Kondracki, Ato Essandoh, Brad Austin, Dylan Taylor', null, 'Kevin Corcoran is a rugged young Irish immigrant policeman trying to keep the peace in the historical Five Points neighborhood in 1860s New York City while searching for information on the disappearance of his wife and death of his daughter.', 'Kevin Corcoran is a rugged young Irish immigrant policeman trying to keep the peace in the historical Five Points neighborhood in 1860s New York City while searching for information on the disappearance of his wife and death of his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2oQu8SipXvlnlrJrt6gZ47D408.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:44983'),
