  ('953436991996765309', 'Crash', 2018, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Ali Aydın', 'Ali Aydın', 'Kıvanç Tatlıtuğ, Elçin Sangu, Melisa Aslı Pamuk, Alperen Duymaz, Onur Saylak, Furkan Kalabalık, Gonca Cilasun, Hakan Kurtaş', null, 'After losing his wife and daughter in a terrorist act, Kadir Adalı decides to attempt suicide via car accident, unwittingly changing the course of his life and the three others involved in the accident.', 'After losing his wife and daughter in a terrorist act, Kadir Adalı decides to attempt suicide via car accident, unwittingly changing the course of his life and the three others involved in the accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nnC6rX59DdIRxOq5fnvAX8xJP6V.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83584'),
  ('1094454645351408135', 'Crash', 2024, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'Park Joon-woo', null, 'Lee Min-ki, Kwak Sun-young, Heo Sung-tae, Lee Ho-cheol, Choi Moon-hee, Bek Hyun-jin, Kim Kwang-shik, Oh Dae-seok', null, 'A drama about Cha Yeon-ho, a reasonable individualist from KAIST, and Min So-hee, a traffic investigation ace with cool judgment and warm sensitivity at the Traffic Crime Investigation (TCI).', 'A drama about Cha Yeon-ho, a reasonable individualist from KAIST, and Min So-hee, a traffic investigation ace with cool judgment and warm sensitivity at the Traffic Crime Investigation (TCI).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZfEkKi3yn8epQpukKrCtLOv7fc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:226102'),
  ('1149225648117866845', 'Crash & Bernstein', 2012, 'Comedy, Kids, Family', 'Eric Friedman', null, 'Cole Jensen, Oana Gregory, Tim Lagasse, Aaron R Landon, Landry Bender', 'TV-PG', 'Wyatt Bernstein is a typical boy who lives n a household full of females. Wyatt desperately wishes for a brother he could do fun guy stuff with. When he is reluctantly taken to a Build-A-Bestie store by his family for his birthday, he creates a boy-filled version of a Bestie. Wyatt''s dream finally comes true when his creation, Crash, comes to life.', 'Wyatt Bernstein is a typical boy who lives n a household full of females. Wyatt desperately wishes for a brother he could do fun guy stuff with. When he is reluctantly taken to a Build-A-Bestie store by his family for his birthday, he creates a boy-filled version of a Bestie. Wyatt''s dream finally comes true when his creation, Crash, comes to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jE1R5A10reo6T4Qmb6YuGrxyFFn.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:46697'),
  ('252122188673113642', 'Crash Course in Romance', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Yang Hee-seung, Yeo Eun-ho', 'Jeon Do-yeon, Jung Kyung-ho, Shin Jae-ha, Lee Bong-ryeon, Oh Eui-sik, Roh Yoon-seo, Jang Young-nam, Kim Sun-young', null, 'The series follows the bittersweet relationship between a banchan shop owner whose daughter enters the war of Korea''s college entrance exams, and a top hagwon instructor.', 'The series follows the bittersweet relationship between a banchan shop owner whose daughter enters the war of Korea''s college entrance exams, and a top hagwon instructor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88rQREli2xtoDV6HToJysp71ZL7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:202318'),
  ('1029640918672561011', 'Crash Landing on You', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Park Ji-eun, Lee Jung-hyo', null, 'Hyun Bin, Son Ye-jin, Seo Ji-hye, Kim Jung-hyun, Yang Kyung-won, Yoo Su-bin, Lee Sin-young, Tang Joon-sang', 'TV-MA', 'A paragliding mishap drops a South Korean heiress in North Korea -- and into the life of an army officer, who decides he will help her hide.', 'A paragliding mishap drops a South Korean heiress in North Korea -- and into the life of an army officer, who decides he will help her hide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgBNLPr6mC8pxuR79ENAJY4nBmj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94796'),
  ('1024929700889653001', 'Crashing', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Phoebe Waller-Bridge', null, 'Phoebe Waller-Bridge, Jonathan Bailey, Julie Dray, Louise Ford, Damien Molony, Adrian Scarborough, Amit Shah', 'TV-MA', 'A comedy drama that crashes straight into the lives and loves of six twenty-something adults living together as Property Guardians in a disused hospital.', 'A comedy drama that crashes straight into the lives and loves of six twenty-something adults living together as Property Guardians in a disused hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXgTnJXZ5KtJhEEuwiTRTRUejCt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65251'),
  ('7809449645689594', 'Crashing', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Pete Holmes', null, 'Pete Holmes, Artie Lange, Lauren Lapkus, George Basil', 'TV-MA', 'A standup comic discovers that his wife is unfaithful, leading him to reevaluate his life amidst the New York City comedy scene.', 'A standup comic discovers that his wife is unfaithful, leading him to reevaluate his life amidst the New York City comedy scene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iImLsPrc45QjbyFxqEY3Yk21JFr.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:68898'),
  ('818481130169996407', 'Crashing Eid', 2023, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Summer Shesha, Bateel Qamlo, Hamza Haq, Yassir Al-Saggaf, Khalid Alharbi, Hind Al-Saigh', 'TV-14', 'When Razan''s British Pakistani fiance crashes her Saudi family''s Eid celebrations, she attempts to convince them that he is a suitable match.', 'When Razan''s British Pakistani fiance crashes her Saudi family''s Eid celebrations, she attempts to convince them that he is a suitable match.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5mTAzzXtNL96vXKswbul6tYXYD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:235914'),
  ('537758574026974201', 'Crashing Into the Future', 2018, 'Soap, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Mário Teixeira', 'Bíbi da Pieve, Mário Teixeira, Marcos Lazarini', 'Juliana Paiva, Edson Celulari, Christiane Torloni, Rosi Campos, Nicolas Prattes, Cleo, Carol Castro, Regiane Alves', 'TV-PG', 'The Sabino Machado family, their slaves and entourage spend years frozen in the ocean after a shipwreck in 1886. They wake up gradually, one by one, and must learn to deal with the technology and the human idiosyncrasies of the present times. Among cultural and temporal shocks, "the frozen ones" encounter improbable friendships, romances and greedy people, while fighting prejudices that not even time was able to eradicate.', 'The Sabino Machado family, their slaves and entourage spend years frozen in the ocean after a shipwreck in 1886. They wake up gradually, one by one, and must learn to deal with the technology and the human idiosyncrasies of the present times. Among cultural and temporal shocks, "the frozen ones" encounter improbable friendships, romances and greedy people, while fighting prejudices that not even time was able to eradicate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3CMGRvCZ4fAv8l90p5WFwQuoG34.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81372'),
  ('335615015909596202', 'Crayon Shin-chan Spin-off', 2016, 'Kids, Animation, Comedy', 'Michio Mihara', null, 'Akiko Yajima, Miki Narahashi, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Satomi Korogi, Mari Mashiba, Etsuko Kozakura', null, 'Unlike the main television anime series which is mostly set in modern-day Japan, the new series will be a "sealed room" suspense comedy set 100 years in the future. The story begins when Shinnosuke and the entire Nohara family wake up from cold sleep to find themselves aboard a space ship drifting in space. The anime will depict the various events that take place inside the ship.', 'Unlike the main television anime series which is mostly set in modern-day Japan, the new series will be a "sealed room" suspense comedy set 100 years in the future. The story begins when Shinnosuke and the entire Nohara family wake up from cold sleep to find themselves aboard a space ship drifting in space. The anime will depict the various events that take place inside the ship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zL7zV68jIpq2IBOtlK38mlwfgI9.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:67324'),
  ('350085051474667570', 'Crazy about you', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Carlos Fernández de Soto, Ana Fernanda Martínez', null, 'Variel Sánchez, Mariana Gómez, Sebastián Carvajal, María Camila Giraldo, Linda Lucía Callejas, Danielle Arciniegas, Luces Velásquez, Carla Giraldo', null, 'The series revolves around the life of Camilo and Juancho, two friends who work in the maestro Guzmán''s orchestra, both share the dream of one day becoming the most recognized musicians in the tropical genre. In this long journey to fulfill their dream, they meet Daniela, a woman of good economic position who wants to be famous and live music as they do. Daniela will have to hide from her family that she is part of a musical orchestra, and Camilo and Juancho that she is from a family of high social class. But everything gets complicated when Camilo and Juancho fall in love with Daniela, that''s when their friendship and dreams of being famous will be truncated by the love of a woman.', 'The series revolves around the life of Camilo and Juancho, two friends who work in the maestro Guzmán''s orchestra, both share the dream of one day becoming the most recognized musicians in the tropical genre. In this long journey to fulfill their dream, they meet Daniela, a woman of good economic position who wants to be famous and live music as they do. Daniela will have to hide from her family that she is part of a musical orchestra, and Camilo and Juancho that she is from a family of high social class. But everything gets complicated when Camilo and Juancho fall in love with Daniela, that''s when their friendship and dreams of being famous will be truncated by the love of a woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vh40gJ4JLNEbqOT6lILjS1cwzgr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85045'),
  ('700138406772469194', 'Crazy About You', 2024, 'Soap, Drama, Mystery', 'João Emanuel Carneiro', 'Márcia Prates, Marina Luisa, João Emanuel Carneiro', 'Gabz, Agatha Moreira, Chay Suede, Nicolas Prattes, Adriana Esteves, Leonardo Bittencourt, Jaffar Bambirra, Mariana Ximenes', 'TV-14', 'The story begins with the ambiguous relationship between friends Viola and Luma, who seem predestined to literally enter each other''s lives. Born on the same day, in very different situations, they meet years later, united by coincidences that go beyond their birthday. From humble origins, Viola moves with her boyfriend Mavi to Angra dos Reis, where Luma lives a luxurious life and dates Rudá, who ends up meeting Viola by chance. Thus begins the duo''s journey, which goes from a passion for recipes to an obsession with the same man, from the immediate connection to the point of starting to live their friend’s reality, 10 years later. A journey divided between complicity and rivalry, which includes them in a love quadrangle and is impacted by a series of circumstances, twists and surprises, such as the secret surrounding a murder.', 'The story begins with the ambiguous relationship between friends Viola and Luma, who seem predestined to literally enter each other''s lives. Born on the same day, in very different situations, they meet years later, united by coincidences that go beyond their birthday. From humble origins, Viola moves with her boyfriend Mavi to Angra dos Reis, where Luma lives a luxurious life and dates Rudá, who ends up meeting Viola by chance. Thus begins the duo''s journey, which goes from a passion for recipes to an obsession with the same man, from the immediate connection to the point of starting to live their friend’s reality, 10 years later. A journey divided between complicity and rivalry, which includes them in a love quadrangle and is impacted by a series of circumstances, twists and surprises, such as the secret surrounding a murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xq1X6H8pupwx0jeZpu4Piq0V5uL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:237478'),
  ('240973550905346845', 'Crazy Delicious', 2020, 'Reality', 'Niall Downing, James Morgan, Ivan Youlden', 'Craig Hazell', 'Jayde Adams, Carla Hall, Niklas Ekstedt, Heston Blumenthal', null, 'Everyday meals are turned into extraordinary culinary creations in a magical food competition on an edible set. The UK''s most talented food lovers are challenged to produce meals that must impress with originality, visuals and extraordinary flavours.', 'Everyday meals are turned into extraordinary culinary creations in a magical food competition on an edible set. The UK''s most talented food lovers are challenged to produce meals that must impress with originality, visuals and extraordinary flavours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/altQjpJCcwGpiW453jWoAPZMj15.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105125'),
  ('8848858437223818', 'Crazy Ex-Girlfriend', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rachel Bloom, Aline Brosh McKenna', null, 'Rachel Bloom, Donna Lynne Champlin, Vincent Rodriguez III, Pete Gardner, Vella Lovell, Gabrielle Ruiz, Scott Michael Foster', 'TV-14', 'Rebecca Bunch is a successful, driven, and possibly crazy young woman who impulsively gives up everything - her partnership at a prestigious law firm and her upscale apartment in Manhattan - in a desperate attempt to find love and happiness in that exotic hotbed of romance and adventure: suburban West Covina, California.', 'Rebecca Bunch is a successful, driven, and possibly crazy young woman who impulsively gives up everything - her partnership at a prestigious law firm and her upscale apartment in Manhattan - in a desperate attempt to find love and happiness in that exotic hotbed of romance and adventure: suburban West Covina, California.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pvYh3fdrRvreWmqw4onWJJmRXf5.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:63161'),
  ('325039150386377344', 'Crazy Heart', 1999, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Osman Sınav', 'Bahadır Özdener, Ömer Lütfi Mete, Raci Şaşmaz', 'Kenan İmirzalıoğlu, Kürşat Alnıaçık, Mehtap Bayri, Atilla Karagöz, Elif İnci, Emin Gürsoy, Ahmet Yenilmez, Demir Karahan', null, 'Crazy Heart is a Turkish action, drama and political television series directed by Osman Sinav. The series, which started on Show TV on October 5, 1998, was released on the fourth season, the last season of the ATV. Crazy Heart , composed of 113 episodes published in 4 seasons, ended on June 24, 2002.', 'Crazy Heart is a Turkish action, drama and political television series directed by Osman Sinav. The series, which started on Show TV on October 5, 1998, was released on the fourth season, the last season of the ATV. Crazy Heart , composed of 113 episodes published in 4 seasons, ended on June 24, 2002.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uEcXEQy3TJKGQXbeK0PlrqfBVgm.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:49422'),
  ('771280711569996259', 'Crazy like a Fox', 1984, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Frank Cardea, Roger Shulman, John Baskin', null, 'Jack Warden, John Rubinstein, Penny Peyser, Robby Kiger', null, 'Crazy Like a Fox is an American television series set in San Francisco, California, that aired on CBS from December 30, 1984 to May 3, 1986.', 'Crazy Like a Fox is an American television series set in San Francisco, California, that aired on CBS from December 30, 1984 to May 3, 1986.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ycG9CVoJhvFqlD1q0Kh2monyBP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:7208'),
  ('240226587035787193', 'Crazy Love', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kim Jung-hyun', null, 'Kim Jae-uck, Krystal Jung, Yoo In-young, Ha Jun, Yoon San-ha, Park Han-sol, Im Won-hee, Kim Hak-seon', null, 'No Go Jin is the most popular mathematics instructor in the private education field and the CEO of GOTOP Education. Even though he has only a high school level education, he has achieved all of his success due to his extreme intelligence. He seems like a perfect man with a handsome appearance, high IQ, and wealth. He is also narcissistic. One day, he is suddenly warned that he will be murdered. Lee Shin A works as No Go Jin’s secretary. She is a diligent and responsible employee. Due to her quiet and introverted personality, she has little presence with her boss No Go Jin and her colleagues at work. Her colleagues begin to recognize her, because she has worked for the notorious No Go Jin for more than 1 year. She then learns that she does not have much time left to live.', 'No Go Jin is the most popular mathematics instructor in the private education field and the CEO of GOTOP Education. Even though he has only a high school level education, he has achieved all of his success due to his extreme intelligence. He seems like a perfect man with a handsome appearance, high IQ, and wealth. He is also narcissistic. One day, he is suddenly warned that he will be murdered. Lee Shin A works as No Go Jin’s secretary. She is a diligent and responsible employee. Due to her quiet and introverted personality, she has little presence with her boss No Go Jin and her colleagues at work. Her colleagues begin to recognize her, because she has worked for the notorious No Go Jin for more than 1 year. She then learns that she does not have much time left to live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wQmABWWAGsifRGn2nltTJRLEF3Y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:134465'),
  ('577625003056570594', 'Crazy Over His Fingers: Just the Two of Us in a Salon After Closing', 2020, 'Animation, Soap', 'Neco', null, 'Yuri Yamaoka, Wataru Komada, Masatomo Nakazawa, Takuma Nagatsuka, Sakura Ice Shishimaru', 'TV-MA', 'Fumi works as an assistant at a popular salon in the city and is aiming to become a hairdresser. She receives strict guidance from Sousuke, the salon''s charismatic hairdresser and manager. Every time he touches Fumi, she becomes agitated. One day after the salon closed, Fumi stands in as Sousuke''s practice partner at the shampoo station. As he touches her and sprinkles her with water, she becomes angry again! Or so the thought...could she actually be attracted to him? Sousuke flashes an evil smile as he senses Fumi''s heart, and his fingertips start to stroke every corner of her body...Fumi cannot refuse his fingers anymore.', 'Fumi works as an assistant at a popular salon in the city and is aiming to become a hairdresser. She receives strict guidance from Sousuke, the salon''s charismatic hairdresser and manager. Every time he touches Fumi, she becomes agitated. One day after the salon closed, Fumi stands in as Sousuke''s practice partner at the shampoo station. As he touches her and sprinkles her with water, she becomes angry again! Or so the thought...could she actually be attracted to him? Sousuke flashes an evil smile as he senses Fumi''s heart, and his fingertips start to stroke every corner of her body...Fumi cannot refuse his fingers anymore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlk5xhZw5uSBJvpJD3xbX2k6BhA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100937'),
  ('476965106995418414', 'Crazyhead', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Howard Overman', null, 'Cara Theobold, Susan Wokoma, Arinzé Kene, Lewis Reeves, Riann Steele, Tony Curran, Luke Allen-Gale', null, 'Amy and Raquel attempt to navigate their way through the choppy waters of their early twenties whilst simultaneously kicking the ass of some seriously gnarly demons. What could possibly go wrong?', 'Amy and Raquel attempt to navigate their way through the choppy waters of their early twenties whilst simultaneously kicking the ass of some seriously gnarly demons. What could possibly go wrong?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d8TDqUEuMJwGQ38HrUgJcDadP1V.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68302'),
  ('439425280857452267', 'Creamerie', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Roseanne Liang, Perlina Lau, Ally Xue', null, 'Ally Xue, J.J. Fong, Perlina Lau, Jay Ryan, Tandi Wright, Kimberley Crossman, Yoson An', 'TV-14', 'Creamerie is set in a post-apocalyptic future where a viral plague has wiped out 99% of men, and Earth has become a planet run by and for women. There’ll be plenty to laugh at when three Kiwi-Asian women running a dairy farm encounter – shock, horror – a man!', 'Creamerie is set in a post-apocalyptic future where a viral plague has wiped out 99% of men, and Earth has become a planet run by and for women. There’ll be plenty to laugh at when three Kiwi-Asian women running a dairy farm encounter – shock, horror – a man!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vUJ3zb24i2iAbzL8lJcdMYaEqEk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:118522'),
  ('1058305196079142795', 'Created in China', 2025, 'Drama', 'A Nai', null, 'Zhang Xincheng, Song Zuer, Wang Yanlin, Ren Chengwei, Zhang Yue, He Yuhong, Liu Yitie, Wang Yinglu', null, 'In the late 1990s, Liu Jun returned to Donghai after studying in Germany. He aimed to transform his father''s old machinery factory into a modern, technologically advanced facility. Despite facing challenges in technology, funding, and connections, Liu Jun, with the support of local industry leaders, successfully upgraded the factory and established it as a prominent player in China''s manufacturing sector.', 'In the late 1990s, Liu Jun returned to Donghai after studying in Germany. He aimed to transform his father''s old machinery factory into a modern, technologically advanced facility. Despite facing challenges in technology, funding, and connections, Liu Jun, with the support of local industry leaders, successfully upgraded the factory and established it as a prominent player in China''s manufacturing sector.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6UBQRdfsXmygtAn4l9NC93bVrN6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233969'),
  ('50689643371876493', 'Creature', 1998, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Peter Benchley', null, 'Craig T. Nelson, Kim Cattrall, Colm Feore, Cress Williams, Michael Reilly Burke, Michael Michele, Matthew Carey, Megalyn Echikunwoke', null, 'An amphibious shark-like monster attacks an abandoned secret military base and the people who live on the island.', 'An amphibious shark-like monster attacks an abandoned secret military base and the people who live on the island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRpqGwjMAU65rkA8XUsBB4z7v5a.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:47096'),
  ('107148799498158649', 'Creature', 2023, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Çağan Irmak', 'Çağan Irmak', 'Taner Ölmez, Erkan Kolçak Köstendil, Şifanur Gül, Bülent Şakrak, Devrim Yakut, Durul Bazan, Engin Benli, Ekremcan Arslandağ', 'TV-MA', 'When tragedy befalls a reckless scientist in Ottoman-era Istanbul, his student uses untested methods to finish his work — with devastating consequences.', 'When tragedy befalls a reckless scientist in Ottoman-era Istanbul, his student uses untested methods to finish his work — with devastating consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7rAH06i8bX88GkQWLfxkownyJMe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214081'),
  ('298689081822720519', 'Creature Comforts', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Nick Park, Peter Lord, David Sproxton', null, 'The Great British Public', null, 'Stop-motion animated series with a cast of animals, sound-biting on a specific topic each episode, such as creatures'' sporting adventures, Christmas, and visits to veterinarians. The show satirizes modern man on the street and documentary interviews, responding to unseen questioners. The voices of the characters, such as recurring dog and cat duo Trixie and Captain Cuddlepuss, are supplied by everyday people speaking varied regional accents, credited as The Great British Public. The creatures are portrayed in their own habitats. Creature Comforts was originally a short film, then a series of highly popular commercials, later a U.S. series.', 'Stop-motion animated series with a cast of animals, sound-biting on a specific topic each episode, such as creatures'' sporting adventures, Christmas, and visits to veterinarians. The show satirizes modern man on the street and documentary interviews, responding to unseen questioners. The voices of the characters, such as recurring dog and cat duo Trixie and Captain Cuddlepuss, are supplied by everyday people speaking varied regional accents, credited as The Great British Public. The creatures are portrayed in their own habitats. Creature Comforts was originally a short film, then a series of highly popular commercials, later a U.S. series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lf8rJiMiOhc4Ay9bjkhguFchrz3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:34867'),
  ('197012693685571290', 'Creature Comforts', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, null, null, 'Based on the original Academy Award-winning short film of the same name, the stop-motion animated series employs a unique format that culls excerpts from real person interviews and places them in the mouths of a wide variety of animated animals to produce humorous, charming and insightful commentaries on everyday life.', 'Based on the original Academy Award-winning short film of the same name, the stop-motion animated series employs a unique format that culls excerpts from real person interviews and places them in the mouths of a wide variety of animated animals to produce humorous, charming and insightful commentaries on everyday life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVUfc1aFAIkNsW8r5nkzoe5yTke.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46788'),
  ('761891614397028302', 'Creature Commandos', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'James Gunn', null, 'Indira Varma, Sean Gunn, Alan Tudyk, Zoë Chao, David Harbour, Frank Grillo', 'TV-MA', 'Follow the exploits of the Creature Commandos, a secret team of incarcerated monsters recruited for missions deemed too dangerous for humans. When all else fails... they''re your last, worst option.', 'Follow the exploits of the Creature Commandos, a secret team of incarcerated monsters recruited for missions deemed too dangerous for humans. When all else fails... they''re your last, worst option.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bB3G6Ug1jfsOUptb0RJsqrgMVta.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:219543'),
  ('270711232749584084', 'Creature Features', 2016, null, null, null, 'Jeff Bodean, Räven Green, Ali Noel', null, '"Creature Features" see a has-been rock star Vincent Van Dahl hosts horror films in his haunted mansion with the help of his stalwart butler Mr. Livingston and quixotic housemate Tangella.', '"Creature Features" see a has-been rock star Vincent Van Dahl hosts horror films in his haunted mansion with the help of his stalwart butler Mr. Livingston and quixotic housemate Tangella.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lozp58jld0gYeImWKE7v0aTHZWX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:221536'),
  ('231584566691439368', 'Creeped Out', 2017, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Bede Blake, Robert Butler', null, 'Aurora Aksnes', 'TV-PG', 'A masked figure known as "The Curious" collects tales of dark magic, otherworldly encounters and twisted technology in this kids anthology series.', 'A masked figure known as "The Curious" collects tales of dark magic, otherworldly encounters and twisted technology in this kids anthology series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5TFYkGC8eSUlIz2TMqL4IKPUbBK.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:78036'),
  ('510982916589990022', 'Creepshow', 2019, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Greg Nicotero', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'A young boy''s horror comic book comes to life in this anthology series of terrifying tales.', 'A young boy''s horror comic book comes to life in this anthology series of terrifying tales.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fassm77VqtSDHv9x17eJ3DkGVml.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:86686'),
  ('867757005583948255', 'Crematorium', 2011, 'Drama', 'Jorge Sánchez-Cabezudo, Alberto Sánchez-Cabezudo', null, 'Pau Durà, Jorge Suquet, Montserrat Carulla, Aura Garrido, Alfonso Bassave, Juana Acosta, José Sancho, Alicia Borrachero', null, 'In the 1990s, an unscrupulous builder, who has amassed a large fortune with agricultural companies, goes into business on the Spanish coast. After the death of his brother, he creates a large business and urban development network that makes him the most powerful man in Misent, an imaginary city in the Spanish Levant.', 'In the 1990s, an unscrupulous builder, who has amassed a large fortune with agricultural companies, goes into business on the Spanish coast. After the death of his brother, he creates a large business and urban development network that makes him the most powerful man in Misent, an imaginary city in the Spanish Levant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0GRJkA52dpMZGLJ853mDwXesQf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38312'),
  ('145039955161130280', 'Crest of the Stars', 1999, 'Animation, Drama', null, 'Hiroyuki Morioka', 'Ayako Kawasumi, Yuka Imai, Haruhiko Jo', null, 'Jinto Lin''s life changes forever when the Humankind Empire Abh takes over his home planet of Martine without firing a single shot. He is soon sent off to study the Abh language and culture and to prepare himself for his future as a nobleman - a future he never dreamed of. Or wanted. Now, Jinto is entering the next phase of his training, and he is about to meet his first Abh, the lovely Lafiel. But Jinto is about to learn that she is more than she appears to be. And together they will have to fight for their very lives.', 'Jinto Lin''s life changes forever when the Humankind Empire Abh takes over his home planet of Martine without firing a single shot. He is soon sent off to study the Abh language and culture and to prepare himself for his future as a nobleman - a future he never dreamed of. Or wanted. Now, Jinto is entering the next phase of his training, and he is about to meet his first Abh, the lovely Lafiel. But Jinto is about to learn that she is more than she appears to be. And together they will have to fight for their very lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bimOHbtqCjwpB2Dy6EXbcueg2td.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:26209'),
  ('306571014108099387', 'Crew 314', 2021, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Stepan Abramov, Andrey Kharybin, Maxim Kovalevski', null, 'In a small town where everyone knows each other, three patrol officers Valera, Sanych and Lenya work. Their attitude to work cannot be called conscientious. Often, when faced with the criminal world, they have to act outside the box, sometimes even paradoxically and stupidly, violating the law. Each day on duty is a separate dangerous adventure with a series of ridiculous situations, shootings, random murders and, of course, sparkling dialogues. They often create problems for themselves out of the blue, from which they then have to get out.', 'In a small town where everyone knows each other, three patrol officers Valera, Sanych and Lenya work. Their attitude to work cannot be called conscientious. Often, when faced with the criminal world, they have to act outside the box, sometimes even paradoxically and stupidly, violating the law. Each day on duty is a separate dangerous adventure with a series of ridiculous situations, shootings, random murders and, of course, sparkling dialogues. They often create problems for themselves out of the blue, from which they then have to get out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xJNLDetXoIT4mCbA6Ygnl0uqrX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:153192'),
  ('441114353344875190', 'Crikey! It''s the Irwins', 2018, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Chandler Powell, Bindi Irwin, Terri Irwin, Robert Irwin', 'TV-PG', 'Follow Terri, Bindi and Robert Irwin as they run the extraordinary Australia Zoo in the bushlands of northern Australia. Caring for over 1,200 animals, overseeing a world-class wildlife hospital, and conducting high-octane global conservation expeditions, the Irwins’ lives are full of adventure, fueled by their love of animals and passion for protecting them.', 'Follow Terri, Bindi and Robert Irwin as they run the extraordinary Australia Zoo in the bushlands of northern Australia. Caring for over 1,200 animals, overseeing a world-class wildlife hospital, and conducting high-octane global conservation expeditions, the Irwins’ lives are full of adventure, fueled by their love of animals and passion for protecting them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GilRQl4TU6qXcmSpi3yLG1ZLvi.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:83542'),
