  ('895043819522903161', 'Cubicles', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sameer Saxena, Amit Golani', 'Vijay Ve, Vijay Narayan Verma, Avinash Singh', 'Abhishek Chauhan, Niketan Sharma, Ayushi Gupta, Nimit Kapoor, Khushbu Baid, Shivankit Singh Parihar, Ketaki Kulkarni, Zayn Marie Khan', null, 'This world is actually run by people sitting and working in their cubicles. This is a story of Piyush Prajapati, a 22 year old, fresh out of college and recruited like most of his batch-mates into an Indian IT company. From the time he gets his first salary, working weekends, work-life balance, a little bit of heart to all kinds of highs and lows, the show follows many firsts and chronicles the life of Piyush, a typical Indian first jobber and the people around him.', 'This world is actually run by people sitting and working in their cubicles. This is a story of Piyush Prajapati, a 22 year old, fresh out of college and recruited like most of his batch-mates into an Indian IT company. From the time he gets his first salary, working weekends, work-life balance, a little bit of heart to all kinds of highs and lows, the show follows many firsts and chronicles the life of Piyush, a typical Indian first jobber and the people around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfjIBMXJK8rmvJ3SrAInlhM7v5e.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:96312'),
  ('893251517782837223', 'Cubix: Robots for Everyone', 2001, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Kids', null, null, 'Veronica Taylor, Andrew Rannells, Amy Birnbaum, Eric Stuart, Gregory Abbey, Scott Rayow, Ted Lewis, James Carter Cathcart', null, 'In the year 2040, robots outnumber humans in Bubble Town. This show centers on the Botties, a special club for people who know how to fix robots, along with the evil Dr. K., who has evil plans up his sleeve.', 'In the year 2040, robots outnumber humans in Bubble Town. This show centers on the Botties, a special club for people who know how to fix robots, along with the evil Dr. K., who has evil plans up his sleeve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gA1KElDEEZ9RDNPRON9rrpMjAbV.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:4914'),
  ('795507742005341990', 'Cuckoo', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kieron Quirke, Robin French', null, 'Greg Davies, Helen Baxendale, Esther Smith, Tyger Drew-Honey, Andie MacDowell', 'TV-MA', 'Cuckoo is every parent''s worst nightmare - a slacker full of outlandish, New Age ideas. Ken is the over-protective father of a girl who''s impulsively married an American hippie on her gap year.', 'Cuckoo is every parent''s worst nightmare - a slacker full of outlandish, New Age ideas. Ken is the over-protective father of a girl who''s impulsively married an American hippie on her gap year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eFBfQIouobewXiw5g1fWwwNt7t0.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:47813'),
  ('1011510042467272691', 'Cucumber', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Russell T Davies', 'Russell T Davies', 'Vincent Franklin, Cyril Nri, Ceallach Spellman, James Murray, Julie Hesmondhalgh, Fisayo Akinade, Con O''Neill', null, 'Original drama series from Russell T Davies exploring the passions and pitfalls of 21st century gay life, beginning with the most disastrous date night in history.', 'Original drama series from Russell T Davies exploring the passions and pitfalls of 21st century gay life, beginning with the most disastrous date night in history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/baCOB8P4yeOtqubCNFdNVtVBhHP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61932'),
  ('112260975281215575', 'CUE!', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yurina Uchiyama, Ayaka Takamura, Satsuki Miyahara, Manatsu Murakami, Ami Komine, Yukari Anzai, Megumi Yamaguchi, Saki Matsuda', 'TV-14', 'The trials and tribulations of a group of sixteen young women who follow their dreams of becoming voice actors. But the voice acting world is highly competitive, and no matter how much someone practices, not everyone will make it past the audition process. Despite frustrations and setbacks, the story of a new generation of voice actors is about to begin.', 'The trials and tribulations of a group of sixteen young women who follow their dreams of becoming voice actors. But the voice acting world is highly competitive, and no matter how much someone practices, not everyone will make it past the audition process. Despite frustrations and setbacks, the story of a new generation of voice actors is about to begin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yyCYwzb4keFcNPCQtqj2nh6URHj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112463'),
  ('836871667202795281', 'Cuéntame cómo pasó', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Miguel Ángel Bernardeau', null, 'Imanol Arias, Ana Duato, María Galiana, Pablo Rivero, Irene Visedo, Paloma Bloyd, Carmen Climent, Carlos Hipólito', 'TV-G', 'Recounts the experiences of a middle-class family, the Alcántaras, during the last years of the rule of Francisco Franco and the beginning of the Spanish Transition to democracy.', 'Recounts the experiences of a middle-class family, the Alcántaras, during the last years of the rule of Francisco Franco and the beginning of the Spanish Transition to democracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lF0ip8ZAvweDTuhMaUD1dH3SYhs.jpg', 23, 'tmdb:tv:7897'),
