  ('935243150355783723', 'Cuerpo de élite', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Adolfo Valor, Cristóbal Garrido', 'Adolfo Valor, Cristóbal Garrido', 'Cristina Castaño, Canco Rodríguez, Adriana Torrebejano, Octavi Pujades, Álvaro Fontalba, Antonio Garrido, Ana Morgade, Ismael Martínez', 'TV-PG', 'Since the Transition, the Government approved the creation of a unit of special operations. The quarrels between different autonomies forced the selection of a representative of each community. Since then, they have been protecting the country in the shadows.', 'Since the Transition, the Government approved the creation of a unit of special operations. The quarrels between different autonomies forced the selection of a representative of each community. Since then, they have been protecting the country in the shadows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tMCar5ntb8nkag3gnDVclAAAG0P.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76903'),
  ('331526039327462800', 'Cuffs', 2015, 'Drama, Crime', 'Julie Gearey', null, 'Ashley Walters, Jacob Ifan, Peter Sullivan, Amanda Abbington, Shaun Dooley, Paul Ready, Eleanor Matsuura, Alex Carter', null, 'Explores the day-to-day work of police officers, from high-stakes situations like drug busts and kidnappings to mundane incidents like shoplifting and public disturbances, while also delving into their personal lives and internal conflicts.', 'Explores the day-to-day work of police officers, from high-stakes situations like drug busts and kidnappings to mundane incidents like shoplifting and public disturbances, while also delving into their personal lives and internal conflicts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zR2NV5jfDmMbSVGuyh531dfAhT0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64291'),
  ('40188371095371049', 'Culinary Class Wars', 2024, 'Reality', 'Kim Hak-min, Kim Eun-ji', 'Mo Eun-seol', 'Paik Jong-won, Sung Anh, Nam Doh-hyeong, Roi Choi, Raymon Kim, Song Hoon, Jung Ho-young, Jennie Walldén', null, 'Eighty "Black Spoon" underdog cooks with a knack for flavor face 20 elite "White Spoon" chefs in a fierce cooking showdown among 100 contenders.', 'Eighty "Black Spoon" underdog cooks with a knack for flavor face 20 elite "White Spoon" chefs in a fierce cooking showdown among 100 contenders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dYMFQfzIJwCYAHwf3ZjiL2iVFIy.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:245684'),
  ('891652890567085807', 'Culprits', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', 'J Blakeson', null, 'Nathan Stewart-Jarrett, Kirby Howell-Baptiste, Kevin Vidal, Gemma Arterton, Ned Dennehy, Niamh Algar, Tara Abboud', 'TV-MA', 'Family man Joe Petrus is living the American dream with his fiancé and step-kids. However, unbeknownst to them, Joe was involved in a mysterious crime three years ago and now his dangerous past is about to catch up with him. When a killer starts targeting the crew behind the crime, Joe realizes it''s only a matter of time before his family is targeted. He returns to London to track down his old gang and find out who is coming after them.', 'Family man Joe Petrus is living the American dream with his fiancé and step-kids. However, unbeknownst to them, Joe was involved in a mysterious crime three years ago and now his dangerous past is about to catch up with him. When a killer starts targeting the crew behind the crime, Joe realizes it''s only a matter of time before his family is targeted. He returns to London to track down his old gang and find out who is coming after them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gOo5KW8NAvtZdX5jdwnCTYTTpjB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:201076'),
  ('669727096236547980', 'Cult', 2013, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Rockne S. O''Bannon', null, 'Alona Tal, Robert Knepper, Jessica Lucas, Matthew Davis, Jeffrey Pierce, Kadeem Hardison, James Pizzinato, Christian Michael Cooper', 'TV-14', 'After a rash of disappearances and a likely murder, an inquisitive, young female production assistant on a wildly popular television show called Cult joins a journalist blogger in investigating the rabid fans of the series who might be re-creating crimes seen on the program, in real life.', 'After a rash of disappearances and a likely murder, an inquisitive, young female production assistant on a wildly popular television show called Cult joins a journalist blogger in investigating the rabid fans of the series who might be re-creating crimes seen on the program, in real life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qSnfv0tRUnWGOgVGebpZRGjQRG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44636'),
  ('127484349542726472', 'Cult Massacre: One Day in Jonestown', 2024, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Jim Jones', 'TV-14', 'Survivors and eyewitnesses tell the immersive story of Jim Jones'' idealistic organization''s final hours that spiraled into a mass casualty event.', 'Survivors and eyewitnesses tell the immersive story of Jim Jones'' idealistic organization''s final hours that spiraled into a mass casualty event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kmWwsTDwxgRp1iRBwTKoWnb0ivj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:255293'),
  ('767606916545489277', 'Culte', 2024, 'Drama', 'Matthieu Rumani, Nicolas Slomka, Yaël Langmann', 'Yaël Langmann', 'Antoine Simony, Marin Judas, Namory Bakayoko, Daphné Bürki, Cécile Cassel, Gladys Gambie, Marc Robert, Grégory Montel', null, 'In 2001, Isabelle, Raphaël, Karim, and their teams had less than four months to get a new show on the air: Loft Story, a French remake of the Big Brother format. In France, they are the first ones to produce a ‘reality TV’ show and have to invent everything from scratch.', 'In 2001, Isabelle, Raphaël, Karim, and their teams had less than four months to get a new show on the air: Loft Story, a French remake of the Big Brother format. In France, they are the first ones to produce a ‘reality TV’ show and have to invent everything from scratch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4An2PE44HxXth3ezAipIZYgjyf1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:235974'),
  ('927222246106354950', 'Cultura en Decadencia', 2012, null, null, null, null, null, 'A satirical yet serious expression that challenges various cultural phenomena existing today which most of society seem to take for granted. Nothing is considered sacred in this Series except for a detached benchmark of fundamental logic and reason - forcing the viewer to step out of the box of "Normality" and to consider our societal practices without traditional baggage and biases. Common themes include Politics, Economics, Education, Security, Religion, Vanity, Governance, Media, Labor, Technology and other issues centric to our daily lives.', 'A satirical yet serious expression that challenges various cultural phenomena existing today which most of society seem to take for granted. Nothing is considered sacred in this Series except for a detached benchmark of fundamental logic and reason - forcing the viewer to step out of the box of "Normality" and to consider our societal practices without traditional baggage and biases. Common themes include Politics, Economics, Education, Security, Religion, Vanity, Governance, Media, Labor, Technology and other issues centric to our daily lives.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:62799'),
  ('1005478858020457699', 'Cultural Exchange with a Game Centre Girl', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Sally Amaki, Shoya Chiba', 'TV-14', 'Kusakabe Renji, a young man working at a game centre, sees an English girl named Lily Baker playing a crane game on Valentine''s Day. Seeing her fail repeatedly to win a prize, Renji can''t help but take action. The day after Lily finally gets her plushie, Renji receives an unexpected message from her that reads, "Be my valentine!" What started as a misunderstanding leads to cultural exchange!', 'Kusakabe Renji, a young man working at a game centre, sees an English girl named Lily Baker playing a crane game on Valentine''s Day. Seeing her fail repeatedly to win a prize, Renji can''t help but take action. The day after Lily finally gets her plushie, Renji receives an unexpected message from her that reads, "Be my valentine!" What started as a misunderstanding leads to cultural exchange!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWg9mzTx4XtOVI2T5ScZj3RPCOn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:279220'),
  ('191726447704718259', 'Cumbia Ninja', 2013, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Crime', 'Andrés Gelós', 'Andrés Gelós, Natacha Caravia, Luis E. Langlemey', 'Ricardo Abarca, Brenda Asnicar, Nicolás Rincón, Julio Nava, Natalia Reyes, Sergio Borrero, Albi De Abreu, Kristina Lilley', null, 'In a major slum called La Colina, young idealist Hache and his friends will confront the drug dealers who control the neighborhood. They will succeed with the help of music, an old Chinese ninja master and a mythical character who also lives in La Colina. Simultaneously, Juana will find shelter there as she runs away from her family''s assassins.', 'In a major slum called La Colina, young idealist Hache and his friends will confront the drug dealers who control the neighborhood. They will succeed with the help of music, an old Chinese ninja master and a mythical character who also lives in La Colina. Simultaneously, Juana will find shelter there as she runs away from her family''s assassins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6SDqqVnWnVrOM6tQp1VGPpYNDl0.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:61602'),
  ('557748611868159656', 'Cunk & Other Humans on 2019', 2019, 'Comedy', null, 'Charlie Brooker, Ben Caudell, Charlie George', 'Diane Morgan, Hammed Animashaun, Emily Lloyd-Saini, Al Campbell', null, 'Philomena Cunk and friends take a look back at the major events of our 2019th year.', 'Philomena Cunk and friends take a look back at the major events of our 2019th year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7vjeqzPRCMXUM6lcsNnf757D33.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97033'),
