  ('920357473724966511', 'Cupcake & Dino - General Services', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Pedro Eboli, Mark Satterthwaite', null, 'Justin Collette, Julie Sype, Mark Forward, Kyle Dooley, Joris Jarsky, Julie Lemieux, Kayla Lorette, Mark Little', 'TV-Y7', 'An enterprising cupcake and his cheerful dinosaur brother take on jobs of all sorts as they work to help friends and strangers in their eccentric city.', 'An enterprising cupcake and his cheerful dinosaur brother take on jobs of all sorts as they work to help friends and strangers in their eccentric city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uoO5CFx4U72rNih8owCLM4iQhX5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:81145'),
  ('713308305262751179', 'Cupcake Wars', 2010, 'Reality', null, null, 'Justin Willman, Florian Bellanger, Candace Nelson', 'TV-G', 'The best cupcake bakers in the country are competing to see who has the best cupcakes. In this war of frosting and sugar, there is only one winner.', 'The best cupcake bakers in the country are competing to see who has the best cupcakes. In this war of frosting and sugar, there is only one winner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4bWIjjTvtnAc8UX4Iv8dZtXE5FE.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:32994'),
  ('568890656244151844', 'Cupid', 1998, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Rob Thomas', null, 'Jeremy Piven, Paula Marshall, Jeffrey D. Sams, Paul Adelstein', null, 'Trevor Hale is an attractive, sarcastic and irreverent man who claims to be Cupid, the Roman god of love, and has descended from Mount Olympus to work on Earth.', 'Trevor Hale is an attractive, sarcastic and irreverent man who claims to be Cupid, the Roman god of love, and has descended from Mount Olympus to work on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vz2ZfJniosx4iGlRYVY1nWNpfZC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4631'),
  ('257833243879653866', 'Cupid', 2009, 'Drama', 'Rob Thomas', null, 'Bobby Cannavale, Sarah Paulson, Camille Guaty, Rick Gomez', null, 'Trevor Pierce may or may not be the Roman god of love, Cupid, sent to earth to bring 100 couples together before he is allowed to return to Mt. Olympus. As fate would have it, Trevor is under the care of psychiatrist and self-help author Dr. Claire McCrae, who is also dedicated to helping lonely hearts find their soul mates. When it comes to true love, Claire believes it''s all about friendship and compatibility, but for Trevor, heat and passion conquer all. Only time will tell who will win the battle for love.', 'Trevor Pierce may or may not be the Roman god of love, Cupid, sent to earth to bring 100 couples together before he is allowed to return to Mt. Olympus. As fate would have it, Trevor is under the care of psychiatrist and self-help author Dr. Claire McCrae, who is also dedicated to helping lonely hearts find their soul mates. When it comes to true love, Claire believes it''s all about friendship and compatibility, but for Trevor, heat and passion conquer all. Only time will tell who will win the battle for love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gC6Q0P9HBvpIfk6Nttsk8JAaYKQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8509'),
  ('1023201835935521779', 'Cupid''s Chocolates', 2015, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Shen Dawei, Feng Junhua, Yang Ou, Du Qingqing, Yixiao Wen, Jackwin, Zhu Jun', null, 'Jiang Hao Yi, a normal, high school student who is extremely scared of getting into trouble suddenly becomes the Harem King of his school and gets confessed to by a bunch of beautiful girls! The worst thing is, Jiang hao doesn''t know any of the girls who confessed to him! What on earth is happening?', 'Jiang Hao Yi, a normal, high school student who is extremely scared of getting into trouble suddenly becomes the Harem King of his school and gets confessed to by a bunch of beautiful girls! The worst thing is, Jiang hao doesn''t know any of the girls who confessed to him! What on earth is happening?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hk19cU59e2sp6wtmL0eNIrzIyhs.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69203'),
  ('376447913788307', 'Cupid''s Kitchen', 2022, 'Comedy', null, 'Meng Yao', 'Ethan Juan, Song Zuer, Liu Dongqin, Wang Ruizi, Augusta Xu-Holland, Wang Zhuocheng, Zhang Junming, Chen Yang', null, 'Lin Kesong has an acute sense of taste. To pursue the guy that she likes, she came to America. There, she meets renowned Michelin-certified chef Jiang Qianfan, who takes her in as a disciple and teaches her cooking skills. Together, they prepare for the cooking competition three months later. However, despite having an acute sense of taste, Lin Kesong does not have any talent in cooking.', 'Lin Kesong has an acute sense of taste. To pursue the guy that she likes, she came to America. There, she meets renowned Michelin-certified chef Jiang Qianfan, who takes her in as a disciple and teaches her cooking skills. Together, they prepare for the cooking competition three months later. However, despite having an acute sense of taste, Lin Kesong does not have any talent in cooking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVgzytsLEPy2UBGJcCEFTloyed0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113756'),
  ('922382752989081535', 'Cupid''s Last Wish', 2022, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Pirapat Watthanasetsiri, Sahaphap Wongratch, Ployshompoo Supasap, Nipawan Taveepornsawan, Nawat Phumphothingam, Chanagun Arpornsutina, Nattharat Kornkaew, Chayajee Krittayapongsakorn', null, 'Childhood friends Korn and Win reconnect after 22 years of conflict when Win''s soul ends up in his sister''s body, sparking a life-changing journey.', 'Childhood friends Korn and Win reconnect after 22 years of conflict when Win''s soul ends up in his sister''s body, sparking a life-changing journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gaa914W4ylWGItKSey2GebR1vj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158150'),
  ('959911923983794561', 'Curb Your Enthusiasm', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Larry David', null, 'Larry David, Jeff Garlin, Susie Essman, Cheryl Hines, JB Smoove', 'TV-MA', 'The off-kilter, unscripted comic vision of Larry David, who plays himself in a parallel universe in which he can''t seem to do anything right, and, by his standards, neither can anyone else.', 'The off-kilter, unscripted comic vision of Larry David, who plays himself in a parallel universe in which he can''t seem to do anything right, and, by his standards, neither can anyone else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZqWmSq1M61Jlre3furVDSXvdrN.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:4546'),
  ('827600039981518918', 'Curfew', 2019, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Matthew Read', null, 'Sean Bean, Billy Zane, Phoebe Fox, Adrian Lester, Malachi Kirby, Ike Bennett, Miranda Richardson, Andi Osho', null, 'When day becomes night, a strict curfew forces ordinary people to go pedal to the metal in a deadly race for freedom. During this contest, alliances and friendships are both made and lost.', 'When day becomes night, a strict curfew forces ordinary people to go pedal to the metal in a deadly race for freedom. During this contest, alliances and friendships are both made and lost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qM3mGK7Z2HVRRfofUqecnjmWHqV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79323'),
  ('1039390113349981741', 'Curfew', 2024, 'Crime, Drama', 'Colm McCarthy', null, 'Sarah Parish, Mandip Gill, Mitchell Robertson, Alexandra Burke, Lucy Benjamin, Larry Lamb, Anita Dobson, Oliver Alvin-Wilson', null, 'Set in a society where all men live under ''The Women’s Safety Act'', meaning they are bound by a strict curfew from 7PM to 7AM every night, with their movements tracked by an ankle tag 24 hours a day. When a woman''s body is discovered, brutally murdered during curfew hours and left on the steps of the Women''s Safety Center, veteran Police officer Pamela Green believes that a man is responsible. But in a world where men are bound by the curfew system, her theory is rejected.', 'Set in a society where all men live under ''The Women’s Safety Act'', meaning they are bound by a strict curfew from 7PM to 7AM every night, with their movements tracked by an ankle tag 24 hours a day. When a woman''s body is discovered, brutally murdered during curfew hours and left on the steps of the Women''s Safety Center, veteran Police officer Pamela Green believes that a man is responsible. But in a world where men are bound by the curfew system, her theory is rejected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4AUbCdE6TtIeuqVEk1LVFxH5tKY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:247614'),
  ('96762107010027567', 'Curiosity', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Graham Booth, Richard Dale', null, 'Josh Charles, Morgan Freeman', 'TV-MA', 'Curiosity is an American documentary television series that premiered on August 7, 2011, on the Discovery Channel. Each episode focuses on one question in science, technology, and society and features a different celebrity host. Stephen Hawking hosted the premiere episode titled "Did God Create the Universe?", which aired simultaneously on seven Discovery Communications networks: Discovery Channel, TLC, Discovery Fit and Health, Animal Planet, Science, Investigation Discovery, and Planet Green. Season one consists of 16 episodes.', 'Curiosity is an American documentary television series that premiered on August 7, 2011, on the Discovery Channel. Each episode focuses on one question in science, technology, and society and features a different celebrity host. Stephen Hawking hosted the premiere episode titled "Did God Create the Universe?", which aired simultaneously on seven Discovery Communications networks: Discovery Channel, TLC, Discovery Fit and Health, Animal Planet, Science, Investigation Discovery, and Planet Green. Season one consists of 16 episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q1b2FglqfSQi3FvtOOaB7ToGERQ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:40268'),
  ('1086716426345174877', 'Curious George', 2006, 'Animation, Family, Kids', 'Margret Rey, H.A. Rey', null, 'Frank Welker, Jeff Bennett, Rino Romano, Jim Cummings, Rob Paulsen, Kath Soucie, E. G. Daily, Annie Mumolo', 'TV-Y', 'With the help of his friend “The Man in the Yellow Hat,” a curious little monkey named George sets out on adventures to learn about the world around him.', 'With the help of his friend “The Man in the Yellow Hat,” a curious little monkey named George sets out on adventures to learn about the world around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AWQF9ZP7X5GqGUoXnyj1NSQjKo.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:656'),
  ('319912391271214065', 'Curon', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ezio Abbate, Ivano Fachin', null, 'Margherita Morchio, Federico Russo, Juju Di Domenico, Giulio Brizzi, Luca Castellano, Salvatore De Santis, Filippo Marsili, Valeria Bilello', 'TV-MA', 'When their mother mysteriously vanishes shortly after they all arrive in her hometown, teen twins discover secrets behind the village’s tranquil facade.', 'When their mother mysteriously vanishes shortly after they all arrive in her hometown, teen twins discover secrets behind the village’s tranquil facade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7jcZ7GYv5KjIqN0qBNvwPO8LBQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103849'),
  ('541749135083288165', 'Curse by the Sea', 2009, 'Drama, Soap', 'Delia Fiallo, Alberto Gómez', 'Delia Fiallo, Alberto Gómez, María Antonieta Gutiérrez', 'Zuria Vega, Mario Cimarro, Mariana Seoane, Manuel Landeta, Marcelo Córdoba, Ninel Conde, Erika Buenfil, Juan Ferrara', null, 'Mar de Amor is a Spanish-language telenovela produced by Nathalie Lartilleux with protagonists Zuria Vega, Mario Cimarro and Mariana Seoane and antagonists Ninel Conde, Marcelo Córdoba and Manuel Landeta. This is a remake of the 1978 Venezuelan telenovela María del Mar.', 'Mar de Amor is a Spanish-language telenovela produced by Nathalie Lartilleux with protagonists Zuria Vega, Mario Cimarro and Mariana Seoane and antagonists Ninel Conde, Marcelo Córdoba and Manuel Landeta. This is a remake of the 1978 Venezuelan telenovela María del Mar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3idQ09RG8ZVxntG3p4yWG74sGqr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31418'),
  ('546507442951680620', 'Cursed', 2020, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Frank Miller, Tom Wheeler', null, 'Katherine Langford, Devon Terrell, Gustaf Skarsgård, Daniel Sharman, Sebastian Armesto, Lily Newmark, Peter Mullan, Matt Stokoe', 'TV-MA', 'In this fresh take on the Arthurian legend, teenager Nimue joins forces with mercenary Arthur on a quest to find Merlin and deliver an ancient sword.', 'In this fresh take on the Arthurian legend, teenager Nimue joins forces with mercenary Arthur on a quest to find Merlin and deliver an ancient sword.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrLC5kx0nEq9U0MyJD7dnOT6m5F.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83125'),
  ('423788048955568826', 'Cursed Films', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Jay Cheel', 'Jay Cheel', null, 'TV-MA', 'A documentary series exploring the myths and legends behind some of Hollywood’s notoriously “cursed” horror film productions. From plane accidents and bombings during the making of The Omen, to the rumored use of real human skeletons on the set of Poltergeist, these stories are legendary amongst film fans and filmmakers alike. But where does the truth lie?', 'A documentary series exploring the myths and legends behind some of Hollywood’s notoriously “cursed” horror film productions. From plane accidents and bombings during the making of The Omen, to the rumored use of real human skeletons on the set of Poltergeist, these stories are legendary amongst film fans and filmmakers alike. But where does the truth lie?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrdhQ2jVx8Ewu33ahp7HbhT1hHn.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:101137'),
  ('701661251688119609', 'Cursed in Love', 2020, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'Minami Hamabe, Ryusei Yokohama, Mahiro Takasugi, Yukino Kishii, Soko Wada, Shiro Sano, Arisa Mizuki, Takashi Okabe', null, 'Nao spent her formative years living at Kogetsuan, a well-established Japanese confectionery shop, where her single mother worked as a pastry chef. She is the same age as Tsubaki, heir to the store, and they become each other''s first love. One morning, Tsubaki''s father and head of Kogetsuan is stabbed and found covered in blood. Nao''s mother is arrested based on the six-year-old Tsubaki''s testimony and the little girl is kicked out of the shop. Nao''s mother died while the investigation was going on, preventing the truth to emerge. Fifteen years later, the case is still shrouded in mystery. Is she really the culprit?', 'Nao spent her formative years living at Kogetsuan, a well-established Japanese confectionery shop, where her single mother worked as a pastry chef. She is the same age as Tsubaki, heir to the store, and they become each other''s first love. One morning, Tsubaki''s father and head of Kogetsuan is stabbed and found covered in blood. Nao''s mother is arrested based on the six-year-old Tsubaki''s testimony and the little girl is kicked out of the shop. Nao''s mother died while the investigation was going on, preventing the truth to emerge. Fifteen years later, the case is still shrouded in mystery. Is she really the culprit?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qDP7bwx7i9zesqPmarsyy0C5Qep.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106128'),
  ('68170143086303772', 'Curses!', 2023, 'Animation, Kids, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family', 'Jim Cooper, Jeff Dixon', null, 'Andre Robinson, Gabrielle Nevaeh, Lyric Lewis, Reid Scott, Rhys Darby, James Marsters', 'TV-G', 'The Vanderhouvens are a typical family...except a curse recently turned Alex—their loving husband and father—to stone. In order to save him, his wife and kids set out on spine-tingling adventures to return ancient artifacts stolen by an ancestor.', 'The Vanderhouvens are a typical family...except a curse recently turned Alex—their loving husband and father—to stone. In order to save him, his wife and kids set out on spine-tingling adventures to return ancient artifacts stolen by an ancestor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sB0pjty0yMjCXJG0X2I8zu8fM57.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:234800'),
  ('579768843245267078', 'Curtain Call', 2022, 'Drama, Family', 'Jo Seong Geol', 'Jo Seong-geol', 'Ha Ji-won, Kang Ha-neul, Goh Doo-shim, Sung Dong-il, Kwon Sang-woo, Steve Sanghyun Noh, Ji Seung-hyun, Choi Dae-hoon', null, 'A drama about an elderly woman from North Korea who doesn’t have much time left to live and a theatre actor who acts as her grandson in order to fulfill her final wish.', 'A drama about an elderly woman from North Korea who doesn’t have much time left to live and a theatre actor who acts as her grandson in order to fulfill her final wish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/76meAyF9VzQzOPu4nQ4Mq89dHF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:194736'),
  ('1097477468183488482', 'Curtain Up, Class!', 2026, 'Reality', '박지예, Hwang Seul-woo', null, 'Kim Tae-ri, Choi Hyun-wook, Kangnam, Code Kunst', null, 'Actress Kim Tae-ri, a first-time teacher, starts a theatre club at a rural school on the verge of closure. Together with the students, she builds a unique after-school theatre club, capturing real, unscripted lessons and growth. As the stage comes to life, small changes begin to ripple beyond the classroom.', 'Actress Kim Tae-ri, a first-time teacher, starts a theatre club at a rural school on the verge of closure. Together with the students, she builds a unique after-school theatre club, capturing real, unscripted lessons and growth. As the stage comes to life, small changes begin to ripple beyond the classroom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3XSIABxyxo0HTK5dk4L548tTk5g.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:313484'),
  ('434717197467107364', 'Cute Little Chicken Squad', 2017, 'Animation, Kids', '林君怡, 何德华', null, 'Qiantong Zhang, Deng Yuting, Shiman Tang, Junchao Jiang, Yuxuan Zhan', 'TV-Y', 'Educational series about four baby chicks growing up in the nature under their mom’s tender love. On each adventure, Mother Flora encourages kids to help each other, to raise awareness of the environment, their curiosity, and imagination. The little chicks explore how to live with other animals and how to provide them with some help.', 'Educational series about four baby chicks growing up in the nature under their mom’s tender love. On each adventure, Mother Flora encourages kids to help each other, to raise awareness of the environment, their curiosity, and imagination. The little chicks explore how to live with other animals and how to provide them with some help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sGYZka0Pp936xDuiUJCrLq9Dsd9.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:85087'),
  ('994371962596983428', 'Cute Programmer', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Peng Yi Ying, Han Yu Ting', 'Xing Zhaolin, Zhu Xudan, Yi Daqian, Tian Yitong, Guan Xin, Joy Sheng, Hong Siyang, Yu Cong', null, 'Lu Li admires genius programmer Jiang Yicheng and follows his path, excelling in school. After graduation, she disguises herself as a man to join his company, which doesn’t hire women. Balancing work and her secret, she strikes a deal with Jiang Yicheng to become a "contract couple" for a year.', 'Lu Li admires genius programmer Jiang Yicheng and follows his path, excelling in school. After graduation, she disguises herself as a man to join his company, which doesn’t hire women. Balancing work and her secret, she strikes a deal with Jiang Yicheng to become a "contract couple" for a year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g7Crp1NOdTMgD5Bx6Q2Y9mi4aiE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:133060'),
  ('71209542534590241', 'Cutie Honey', 1973, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Eiko Masuyama, Kosei Tomita, Katsuji Mori', 'TV-14', 'One day, Honey Kisaragi''s a trendy, class-cutting Catholic schoolgirl. The next, her father''s been murdered by demonic divas from a dastardly organization called Panther Claw. When his dying message reveals that she''s an android, Honey uses the transformative power of the Atmospheric Element Solidifier - the very thing Panther Claw wanted to steal - to seek revenge against the shadowy clan.', 'One day, Honey Kisaragi''s a trendy, class-cutting Catholic schoolgirl. The next, her father''s been murdered by demonic divas from a dastardly organization called Panther Claw. When his dying message reveals that she''s an android, Honey uses the transformative power of the Atmospheric Element Solidifier - the very thing Panther Claw wanted to steal - to seek revenge against the shadowy clan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/waJoeBMcoteO6lBdvR1vMR1c6w6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68411'),
  ('535608878404616258', 'Cutie Honey Flash', 1997, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation', 'Go Nagai', null, 'Ai Nagano, Akira Kamiya, Akiko Hiramatsu, Chiho Ohkawa, Makiko Ohmoto, Rumi Watanabe, Show Hayami, Susumu Chiba', null, 'Honey Kisaragi is a high school student at Sainte Chapelle Girls'' School. On her 16th birthday, when she returns home, she discovers that her father Takeshi Kisaragi has been kidnapped by the Panther Claw gang because he had discovered a device that could allow the transformation of the human body. That same evening, Honey Kisaragi meets a man with long white hair who gives her the said device. She thus becomes Cutie Honey and fights Panther Claw to save her father. But a new transfer student, Seira Hazuki, will not make her task easy...', 'Honey Kisaragi is a high school student at Sainte Chapelle Girls'' School. On her 16th birthday, when she returns home, she discovers that her father Takeshi Kisaragi has been kidnapped by the Panther Claw gang because he had discovered a device that could allow the transformation of the human body. That same evening, Honey Kisaragi meets a man with long white hair who gives her the said device. She thus becomes Cutie Honey and fights Panther Claw to save her father. But a new transfer student, Seira Hazuki, will not make her task easy...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUm6R8zm0qqlC6070TnZkNCzZSM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:36001'),
  ('975867754050842542', 'Cutie Honey Universe', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Go Nagai', null, 'Maaya Sakamoto, Atsuko Tanaka, Tomoyo Kurosawa, Suzuko Mimori, Yui Horie, Yukari Tamura, Maaya Uchida, Kana Hanazawa', null, 'Honey Kisaragi is an amazingly humanlike and fashion conscious android with the unique ability to transform her body into a wide range of outrageous yet stylish disguises, each of which comes with its own dazzling super ability. After a run-in with a sinister secret criminal cabal organization, Panther Claw, the luscious and law-abiding Honey makes it her mission to bring them down.', 'Honey Kisaragi is an amazingly humanlike and fashion conscious android with the unique ability to transform her body into a wide range of outrageous yet stylish disguises, each of which comes with its own dazzling super ability. After a run-in with a sinister secret criminal cabal organization, Panther Claw, the luscious and law-abiding Honey makes it her mission to bring them down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vs2vejPLKVpbbHcUmfqIMuA0Wj2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77729'),
  ('557136248643521862', 'Cutie Honey: The Live', 2007, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Go Nagai', null, 'Mikie Hara, Makoto Takeda, Ayame Misaki, Shouma Yamamoto, Megumi Komatsu, Ken''ichi Nagira, Kohei Murakami, Mark Musashi', null, 'The Panther Claw organization is driven by a relentless pursuit of wealth, using any means necessary to achieve their goals. However, their plans start to unravel thanks to the unexpected interference of a seemingly ordinary girl. This girl, who initially encounters Panther Claw by chance, turns out to be Kisaragi Honey, the ‘daughter’ of the brilliant cyberneticist Dr. Kisaragi Koshirou. Recognizing her value, Panther Claw’s four members race to capture Cutie Honey. Kisaragi Honey, also known as Cutie Honey, is not alone in her fight. She is joined by two allies, Saotome Miki (Sister Miki) and Kenmochi Yuki (Sister Yuki). Together, they work to thwart Panther Claw’s schemes and protect Honey from being exploited.', 'The Panther Claw organization is driven by a relentless pursuit of wealth, using any means necessary to achieve their goals. However, their plans start to unravel thanks to the unexpected interference of a seemingly ordinary girl. This girl, who initially encounters Panther Claw by chance, turns out to be Kisaragi Honey, the ‘daughter’ of the brilliant cyberneticist Dr. Kisaragi Koshirou. Recognizing her value, Panther Claw’s four members race to capture Cutie Honey. Kisaragi Honey, also known as Cutie Honey, is not alone in her fight. She is joined by two allies, Saotome Miki (Sister Miki) and Kenmochi Yuki (Sister Yuki). Together, they work to thwart Panther Claw’s schemes and protect Honey from being exploited.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nK6smRKjzhzfQS6SN2PfKBk2uUq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6726'),
  ('115786556957821283', 'Cutie Pie', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Pruk Panich, Chawarin Perdpiriyawong, Kornthas Rujeerattanavorapan, Natasit Uareksit, Koraphat Lamnoi, Pharinyakorn Khansawa, Ratchapong Anomakiti, Piamchon Damrongsunthornchai', null, 'Arranged to marry, a young tycoon and a free-spirited student face a test when one reveals that only duty, not love, keeps them together.', 'Arranged to marry, a young tycoon and a free-spirited student face a test when one reveals that only duty, not love, keeps them together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wErkJHHVjxezm6unGOSXYwIInQm.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:139353'),
  ('502501856648297918', 'Cutthroat Kitchen', 2013, 'Reality', null, null, 'Alton Brown', 'TV-G', 'Just how far is a chef willing to go to win a cooking competition? Cutthroat Kitchen hands four chefs each $25,000 and the opportunity to spend that money on helping themselves or sabotaging their competitors. Ingredients will be thieved, utensils destroyed and valuable time on the clock lost when the chefs compete to cook delicious dishes while also having to outplot the competition. With Alton Brown as the devilish provocateur, nothing is out of bounds when money changes hands and we see just how far chefs will go to ensure they have the winning dish.', 'Just how far is a chef willing to go to win a cooking competition? Cutthroat Kitchen hands four chefs each $25,000 and the opportunity to spend that money on helping themselves or sabotaging their competitors. Ingredients will be thieved, utensils destroyed and valuable time on the clock lost when the chefs compete to cook delicious dishes while also having to outplot the competition. With Alton Brown as the devilish provocateur, nothing is out of bounds when money changes hands and we see just how far chefs will go to ensure they have the winning dish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/huKbyh21JtJZq1gzcA7RvdZmDUI.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:57022'),
  ('1140048756718201281', 'Cutting It', 2002, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Debbie Horsfield', null, 'Sarah Parish, Sian Reeves, Angela Griffin, Jason Merrells, James Murray, Annette Badland, David Leon, Bill Thomas', null, 'Allie Henshall and Gavin Ferraday are partners in love and business. They own Henshall Ferraday hair salon, where Allie''s sisters Darcey and Sydney work alongside them. As Allie and Gavin consider taking over a vacant property across the road, they are rocked by the news that a rival hairdresser has bought it. To make matters worse, Allie discovers that the new salon, Blade Runner, is run by her ex, Finn, and his wife, Mia Bevan. Finn fathered the child Allie claimed to have aborted. He left her when he found out she was pregnant, but he''s back in town to try and woo Allie.', 'Allie Henshall and Gavin Ferraday are partners in love and business. They own Henshall Ferraday hair salon, where Allie''s sisters Darcey and Sydney work alongside them. As Allie and Gavin consider taking over a vacant property across the road, they are rocked by the news that a rival hairdresser has bought it. To make matters worse, Allie discovers that the new salon, Blade Runner, is run by her ex, Finn, and his wife, Mia Bevan. Finn fathered the child Allie claimed to have aborted. He left her when he found out she was pregnant, but he''s back in town to try and woo Allie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xR4assVSi2JeEgWBkcFipksFG4E.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2571'),
  ('571088991055437356', 'Cyber City Oedo 808', 1990, 'Animation, Crime', 'Yoshiaki Kawajiri', null, 'Hiroya Ishimaru, Tessyo Genda, Kaneto Shiozawa, Norio Wakamoto, Mitsuko Horie, Kyousei Tsukui', 'TV-14', 'In the city of Oedo 2808 A.D., three Cyber criminals are given two choices, to either rot in jail or to join a special force of the Cyber Police to possibly get one more chance at freedom. For each criminal apprehended, and for each successful mission done, the state will agree to reduce their sentences. Lead by Hasegawa, the new recruits: Sengoku, Gogul, and Benton will bring some hard justice to Oedo, and possibly taste freedom once again.', 'In the city of Oedo 2808 A.D., three Cyber criminals are given two choices, to either rot in jail or to join a special force of the Cyber Police to possibly get one more chance at freedom. For each criminal apprehended, and for each successful mission done, the state will agree to reduce their sentences. Lead by Hasegawa, the new recruits: Sengoku, Gogul, and Benton will bring some hard justice to Oedo, and possibly taste freedom once again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9TaiOqFMxVPEBGwpdRZbskRgCtY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64210'),
  ('958440743766892355', 'Cyberchase', 2002, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Sandra Sheppard', null, 'Christopher Lloyd, Novie Edwards, Jacqueline Pillon, Annick Obonsawin, Bianca DeGroat, Kristina Nicoll, Rob Tinkler, Ron Pardo', 'TV-Y', 'The series takes place in Cyberspace, a virtual world, and chronicles the adventures of three children, Jackie, Inez, and Matt, as they use math and problem solving skills to save Cyberspace and its leader, Motherboard, from The Hacker, the villain.', 'The series takes place in Cyberspace, a virtual world, and chronicles the adventures of three children, Jackie, Inez, and Matt, as they use math and problem solving skills to save Cyberspace and its leader, Motherboard, from The Hacker, the villain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rNBxZw1GqLkt8FB9TL9p9jSEBl8.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:2979'),
  ('100619765234286775', 'Cyberpunk: Edgerunners', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Rafał Jaki', null, 'KENN', 'TV-MA', 'In a dystopia riddled with corruption and cybernetic implants, a talented but reckless street kid strives to become a mercenary outlaw — an edgerunner.', 'In a dystopia riddled with corruption and cybernetic implants, a talented but reckless street kid strives to become a mercenary outlaw — an edgerunner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqcDVZ8pyk08AVftMBildDR3QUK.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:105248'),
  ('519430921559492589', 'Cybersix', 1999, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Kids', 'Carlos Trillo, Carlos Meglia', null, 'Cathy Weseluck, Michael Dobson, Terry Klassen, Andrew Francis, Alex Doduk, Janyse Jaud', 'TV-Y7', 'In the dark megalopolis of Méridiana, the silhouette of a mysterious character named Cybersix emerges, having escaped her creator, Doctor Von Reichter. By day, Cybersix, who adopted the male identity of Adrian Seidelman, is a literature teacher in a local high school and, by night, she ''transforms'' back into Cybersix to fight Von Reichter''s abominable creations and foil his plans. Soon, she''s aided by her surviving brother, now named Data 7, a black bioroid panther.', 'In the dark megalopolis of Méridiana, the silhouette of a mysterious character named Cybersix emerges, having escaped her creator, Doctor Von Reichter. By day, Cybersix, who adopted the male identity of Adrian Seidelman, is a literature teacher in a local high school and, by night, she ''transforms'' back into Cybersix to fight Von Reichter''s abominable creations and foil his plans. Soon, she''s aided by her surviving brother, now named Data 7, a black bioroid panther.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwA0TNjfGRZwQffHtm1WjQ1XWwG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:22784'),
  ('310468611972396438', 'Cyberwar', 2016, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Ben Makuch', 'TV-14', 'Ben Makuch travels the world to meet with hackers, government officials, and dissidents to investigate the ecosystem of cyberwarfare.', 'Ben Makuch travels the world to meet with hackers, government officials, and dissidents to investigate the ecosystem of cyberwarfare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hr0NfxrdaWRv0pmyhSfy6ZWcVc7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67004'),
  ('227008492381556896', 'Cybill', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Chuck Lorre', null, 'Cybill Shepherd, Christine Baranski, Alicia Witt, Alan Rosenberg', null, 'Cybill is an American television sitcom created by Chuck Lorre, which aired on CBS from January 2, 1995, to July 13, 1998. Starring, Cybill Shepherd, the show revolves around the life of Cybill Sheridan, a twice-divorced single mother of two and struggling actress in her 40s, who has never gotten her big show business break.', 'Cybill is an American television sitcom created by Chuck Lorre, which aired on CBS from January 2, 1995, to July 13, 1998. Starring, Cybill Shepherd, the show revolves around the life of Cybill Sheridan, a twice-divorced single mother of two and struggling actress in her 40s, who has never gotten her big show business break.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xN3eCrHdRWY3loR5IxCJ613sGyq.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2702'),
  ('1044178459157278439', 'Cyborg 009', 2001, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Takahiro Sakurai, Kana Ueda, Showtaro Morikubo, Satsuki Yukino, Nobuo Tobita, Akio Otsuka, Chafurin, Cho', 'TV-14', 'Nine super-powered cyborg soldiers join forces to combat Black Ghost, the terrorist organization which they were originally created to serve.', 'Nine super-powered cyborg soldiers join forces to combat Black Ghost, the terrorist organization which they were originally created to serve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iFr5M9gQsQOVCByh7fiHR17RZSd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69113'),
  ('469491648954947096', 'Cyborg Kuro-chan', 1999, 'Animation, Kids, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Chika Sakamoto, Chiharu Tezuka, Yuuko Sasamoto, Rika Komatsu, Sayuri Yoshida, Toru Furusawa, Makiko Ohmoto', null, 'Kuro is just an ordinary cat who only wants to protect his owners who are an old couple that can''t fend for themselves. One day while on a date with his girlfriend Pooly who is a dog, he is kidnapped by an evil scientist and turned into a robot. Kuro somehow removes the chip that controlled him and notices that people get scared with his new robotic appearance and that he can now talk like a human. He decides to disguise himself with the skin of a stuffed toy and to continue living as a pet.', 'Kuro is just an ordinary cat who only wants to protect his owners who are an old couple that can''t fend for themselves. One day while on a date with his girlfriend Pooly who is a dog, he is kidnapped by an evil scientist and turned into a robot. Kuro somehow removes the chip that controlled him and notices that people get scared with his new robotic appearance and that he can now talk like a human. He decides to disguise himself with the skin of a stuffed toy and to continue living as a pet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rjTuVZBLV7DCNN7R0CtPziVFPb4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86389'),
  ('883167497906146100', 'Cyclops Girl Cypu', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Yasu Tora', null, 'Kaoru Sasajima, Kengo Takanashi, Saki Fujita, Mai Nakahara', 'TV-14', 'When Fuuka hit her second year of middle school, puberty kicked in. Now she''s really tall and has huge boobs. Due to her hairstyle, her classmates call her "Saipu", after the cyclops. Her affection for her older brother was cute when she was a little girl and said she wanted to marry him. Now it just freaks him out, since she''s decided she''s adult enough to follow through on her childish promises.', 'When Fuuka hit her second year of middle school, puberty kicked in. Now she''s really tall and has huge boobs. Due to her hairstyle, her classmates call her "Saipu", after the cyclops. Her affection for her older brother was cute when she was a little girl and said she wanted to marry him. Now it just freaks him out, since she''s decided she''s adult enough to follow through on her childish promises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9h1MKl8G2D88sX67xNoVaJe2e6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:49307'),
  ('747321046053990135', 'Cypher', 2021, 'Crime, Action & Adventure', 'Majdi Smiri, Mohamed Sayed Bisheer', null, 'Martin Dingle Wall, John J. Jordan, Jaclyn Hales, Lauren Gravitt, Brian Krause, Eve Mauro, Mary Helen Schmidt', 'TV-14', 'Will Scott, one of the FBI''s leading crypto-analysts is hired to crack a heavily coded document. He soon discovers it''s a hit list, putting him in the cross-hairs of the bad guys who want it back. Will must navigate the murky waters of loyalty and betrayal amongst an underground ring of hackers, hit men, and FBI agents - all as the clock ticks in pursuit of the latest targets.', 'Will Scott, one of the FBI''s leading crypto-analysts is hired to crack a heavily coded document. He soon discovers it''s a hit list, putting him in the cross-hairs of the bad guys who want it back. Will must navigate the murky waters of loyalty and betrayal amongst an underground ring of hackers, hit men, and FBI agents - all as the clock ticks in pursuit of the latest targets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVe5Z0CIfQcBvAv8se4NekAYtCg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110829'),
  ('372851201087406850', 'Cyril et la famille', 2025, null, null, null, 'Cyril Hanouna', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLQggAmsdUiF8QoZ57DB1Bhm5Cg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:299092'),
  ('111220317415347341', 'Czterdziestolatek', 1975, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Andrzej Kopiczyński, Anna Seniuk, Roman Kłosowski, Irena Kwiatkowska, Grażyna Woźniak, Piotr Kąkolewski, Leonard Pietraszak', null, 'Czterdziestolatek or 40-latek was a Polish television comedy series broadcast between 1974 and 1977. The first series enjoyed so much popularity that it has successfully continued and led to the release of a feature film I''m a Butterfly, a 40-year-old Love Affair and a New Year''s Eve television program in 1975. The series was written by Jerzy Gruza and Krzysztof Teodor Toeplitz and was broadcast on Telewizja Polska. In total, 21 episodes were produced. The series followed the fate of a Warsaw family and explored topics related to midlife crisis, such as extra-marital affairs, attempts to quit smoking, obsession with hair loss, efforts to maintain physical fitness, pride in achievements and professional life, the desire to seek self-fulfillment through social activities, etc.', 'Czterdziestolatek or 40-latek was a Polish television comedy series broadcast between 1974 and 1977. The first series enjoyed so much popularity that it has successfully continued and led to the release of a feature film I''m a Butterfly, a 40-year-old Love Affair and a New Year''s Eve television program in 1975. The series was written by Jerzy Gruza and Krzysztof Teodor Toeplitz and was broadcast on Telewizja Polska. In total, 21 episodes were produced. The series followed the fate of a Warsaw family and explored topics related to midlife crisis, such as extra-marital affairs, attempts to quit smoking, obsession with hair loss, efforts to maintain physical fitness, pride in achievements and professional life, the desire to seek self-fulfillment through social activities, etc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aAIICMUpdIZe8a3NK2kYgOqcNnp.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:30860'),
  ('736168939579362347', 'D_Cide Traumerei the Animation', 2021, 'Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Yohei Azakami, Ayasa Ito, Marika Kouno, Shun Horie, Aoi Yuuki, Haruna Momono, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Akio Suyama', 'TV-14', 'The story takes place in Shibuya. Ryuhei had always looked up to his older brother as a child. Even after witnessing his mysterious death, Ryuhei grows up to be a cheerful high school student. One day after his daily kickboxing practice, he is bitten by a strange creature calling itself Tris. That night, an unusual dream bothers his sleep. As the rumored "Drops" circulate around the city, Ryuhei is confronted with a force of twisted desire. What is it that awaits him beyond that?', 'The story takes place in Shibuya. Ryuhei had always looked up to his older brother as a child. Even after witnessing his mysterious death, Ryuhei grows up to be a cheerful high school student. One day after his daily kickboxing practice, he is bitten by a strange creature calling itself Tris. That night, an unusual dream bothers his sleep. As the rumored "Drops" circulate around the city, Ryuhei is confronted with a force of twisted desire. What is it that awaits him beyond that?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qLRVeEZrjd966Vxh7W7mXwgXp5u.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:120968'),
  ('693992728740025298', 'D-Day', 2015, 'Drama', null, null, 'Kim Young-kwang, Jung So-min, Ha Seok-jin, Kim Jung-hwa, Kim Sang-ho, Kim Hye-eun, Yoon Joo-hee, Lee Kyung-young', null, 'When a natural disaster strikes Seoul, a team of medical doctors and emergency personnel struggle to deal with its aftermath.', 'When a natural disaster strikes Seoul, a team of medical doctors and emergency personnel struggle to deal with its aftermath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjbxBWHSujFRH5iyQuiDea1aaEt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63910'),
  ('6208907411073082', 'D-Day Sacrifice', 2014, 'Documentary, War & Politics', 'Frederic Lumiere, Daniel Costelle, Isabelle Clarke', null, 'Lambert Wilson, Kristin Scott Thomas, Winston Churchill, Dwight D. Eisenhower, Bernard Montgomery, Adolf Hitler, Erwin Rommel', null, 'Comprised entirely of re-mastered and colorised archive footage from World War II, much of it never before seen, Sacrifice recounts the story of D-Day through the testimonies of those who lived it. These important historical days are seen through the eyes of French civilians and members of the military fighting on both sides. The testimonies of famous individuals like Dwight D. Eisenhower and Erwin Rommel are intertwined with those of anonymous soldiers and citizens, such as film director Samuel Fuller and Eisenhower''s chauffeur, Kay Summersby. From the preparations for D-Day all the way through to the liberation of Paris, the accounts of these men and women provide a moving and invaluable retelling of this pivotal time in history.', 'Comprised entirely of re-mastered and colorised archive footage from World War II, much of it never before seen, Sacrifice recounts the story of D-Day through the testimonies of those who lived it. These important historical days are seen through the eyes of French civilians and members of the military fighting on both sides. The testimonies of famous individuals like Dwight D. Eisenhower and Erwin Rommel are intertwined with those of anonymous soldiers and citizens, such as film director Samuel Fuller and Eisenhower''s chauffeur, Kay Summersby. From the preparations for D-Day all the way through to the liberation of Paris, the accounts of these men and women provide a moving and invaluable retelling of this pivotal time in history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2EjUTEnnoC0sK5j5FS7dC3vOZcl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63296'),
  ('463093491793160208', 'D-Frag!', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Chiwa Saito, Katsuyuki Konishi, Kana Hanazawa, Ami Koshimizu, Shizuka Itoh, Mikako Takahashi', 'TV-14', 'Kazama Kenji likes to believe he is something of a delinquent. Moreover, others seem to like to agree that he is. Of course, Kenji''s gang finds their way to a group of four not-so-normal girls—Chitose, Sakura, Minami and Roka—and all at once, whatever reputation he may have is nothing compared to the outrageous behavior of the girls. Shanghaied into joining their club, what will happen to his everyday life from that point on?', 'Kazama Kenji likes to believe he is something of a delinquent. Moreover, others seem to like to agree that he is. Of course, Kenji''s gang finds their way to a group of four not-so-normal girls—Chitose, Sakura, Minami and Roka—and all at once, whatever reputation he may have is nothing compared to the outrageous behavior of the girls. Shanghaied into joining their club, what will happen to his everyday life from that point on?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLk0HqJw43bke7ImcaYNQjoUeEP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68634'),
  ('692671591678874639', 'D.B. Cooper: Where Are You?!', 2022, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'In 1971, a skyjacker parachutes off a plane with a bag of stolen cash — and gets away with it. Decades later, his identity remains a compelling mystery.', 'In 1971, a skyjacker parachutes off a plane with a bag of stolen cash — and gets away with it. Decades later, his identity remains a compelling mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQhCGiY5CNAbksQEDpsVDMPUOpl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204302'),
  ('355187946207624738', 'D.Gray-man', 2006, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Toshiyuki Morikawa, Katsuyuki Konishi, Sanae Kobayashi, Kenichi Suzumura, Takeshi Aono, Junpei Takiguchi, Kenta Miyake, Megumi Toyoguchi', 'TV-14', 'Darkness is moving in, and young exorcist Allen Walker is humanity''s greatest hope against the wicked forces conspiring to bring civilization to its knees. Akuma – cruel spirits born of tragedy and lost souls – lurk in every shadow, willing and eager to do the bidding of their leader, the dread Millennium Earl. With an eye cursed to see evil in its truest form and blessed with an arm to slay soul-devouring demons, Allen stands ready to confront the gathering evil. Should he fail, Innocence will be lost forever. The war to decide the fate of mankind has begun – and the carnage will be endless.', 'Darkness is moving in, and young exorcist Allen Walker is humanity''s greatest hope against the wicked forces conspiring to bring civilization to its knees. Akuma – cruel spirits born of tragedy and lost souls – lurk in every shadow, willing and eager to do the bidding of their leader, the dread Millennium Earl. With an eye cursed to see evil in its truest form and blessed with an arm to slay soul-devouring demons, Allen stands ready to confront the gathering evil. Should he fail, Innocence will be lost forever. The war to decide the fate of mankind has begun – and the carnage will be endless.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/txCtE7ToSLuG8sy8tAIh9q5JAYS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:34141'),
  ('88234764406938495', 'D.Gray-man Hallow', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Katsura Hoshino', null, 'Ayumu Murase, Takuya Sato, Ai Kakuma, Kenichi Suzumura, Noriaki Sugiyama, Ami Koshimizu, Hochu Otsuka, Yasuhiro Mamiya', 'TV-14', 'Allen Walker is an exorcist working for the Black Order whose mission is to protect mankind from the evil Millennium Earl and his deadly Akuma. Allen and his comrades must recover lost Innocence while defending against the Earl’s terrifying army. But if they fail, Innocence will be lost forever.', 'Allen Walker is an exorcist working for the Black Order whose mission is to protect mankind from the evil Millennium Earl and his deadly Akuma. Allen and his comrades must recover lost Innocence while defending against the Earl’s terrifying army. But if they fail, Innocence will be lost forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/daVfwwmryLzqH3xfCI2WtX9t2qf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67145'),
  ('80655006817335496', 'D.I.E.', 2008, 'Comedy', null, null, null, null, 'In the police force, "Death Investigation Extension" or "D.I.E." was established to accommodate those who have been sent away by their supervisors. As everybody knows, members of the Extension are to investigate unsolved cold cases. Yue Chi-Long (Roger Kwok), who has cracked a large number of difficult cases by extrasensory means, is assigned to the D.I.E. because his superiors find him strange for falling asleep constantly on the job. New appointee Ying Jing-Jing (Sonija Kwok) is a good-looking girl but she takes an uncompromising stand over every case she deals with. Initially unaccepting of a division made of incompetent detectives, she is tricked into staying by her former supervisor, who claims that she was placed there to eventually replace the head and whip the team into shape. Chi-Long proves himself a capable detective but has a laidback attitude. The relationship between Jing-Jing and Chi-Long is deteriorating day by day, but also improving in a way...', 'In the police force, "Death Investigation Extension" or "D.I.E." was established to accommodate those who have been sent away by their supervisors. As everybody knows, members of the Extension are to investigate unsolved cold cases. Yue Chi-Long (Roger Kwok), who has cracked a large number of difficult cases by extrasensory means, is assigned to the D.I.E. because his superiors find him strange for falling asleep constantly on the job. New appointee Ying Jing-Jing (Sonija Kwok) is a good-looking girl but she takes an uncompromising stand over every case she deals with. Initially unaccepting of a division made of incompetent detectives, she is tricked into staying by her former supervisor, who claims that she was placed there to eventually replace the head and whip the team into shape. Chi-Long proves himself a capable detective but has a laidback attitude. The relationship between Jing-Jing and Chi-Long is deteriorating day by day, but also improving in a way...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2jlZCCFoLm8u0Qf0dZn4Mx6c3q.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:7153'),
  ('137893706837886396', 'D.I.E. Again', 2009, null, null, null, 'Roger Kwok Chun-On, Sonija Kwok Sin-Nae, Nancy Wu, Derek Kwok Jing-Hung, Mimi Lo, Thomas Sin Ho-Ying, Samuel Kwok Fung, Zac Koo Hau-Zheng', null, 'Although D.I.E had been dissolved and the officers returned to their previous departments, their odd habits continue to follow them, resulting in many troubles for the police force. The senior staff decide to bring the D.I.E back, this time headed by Lo Sir, Yue Sir''s former supervisor. Yue Sir and Jing Jing have a baby boy and Jing jing returns to work after trying to be a housewife to no avail. Initially working with the homicide unit again, she is still always chasing Dai-Hau-Ying, and after several incidents is sent back to D.I.E. Ying seems to have become less evil than before, but Jing jing continues to attempt arrest, much to the chagrin of her supervisors.', 'Although D.I.E had been dissolved and the officers returned to their previous departments, their odd habits continue to follow them, resulting in many troubles for the police force. The senior staff decide to bring the D.I.E back, this time headed by Lo Sir, Yue Sir''s former supervisor. Yue Sir and Jing Jing have a baby boy and Jing jing returns to work after trying to be a housewife to no avail. Initially working with the homicide unit again, she is still always chasing Dai-Hau-Ying, and after several incidents is sent back to D.I.E. Ying seems to have become less evil than before, but Jing jing continues to attempt arrest, much to the chagrin of her supervisors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJm6NBodVWybdjUpCHJy7jqeXH7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:7694'),
  ('265984306453200109', 'D.N.Angel', 2003, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Miyu Irino, Ryotaro Okiayu, Sara Nakayama, Masumi Asano, Akira Ishida, Takeshi Kusao', 'TV-PG', 'Niwa Daisuke is your average teenager, until his fourteenth birthday. He tries to declare his love to the girl of his dreams, but fails. Suddenly, whenever he thinks about this girl he turns into the legendary phantom thief known as Dark Mousy. Daisuke''s mother, very much aware of this, makes him turn into Dark and steal valuable works of art for a purpose unknown to Daisuke. As the story unfolds, he learns why, and about his classmate who seems to have the same ability.', 'Niwa Daisuke is your average teenager, until his fourteenth birthday. He tries to declare his love to the girl of his dreams, but fails. Suddenly, whenever he thinks about this girl he turns into the legendary phantom thief known as Dark Mousy. Daisuke''s mother, very much aware of this, makes him turn into Dark and steal valuable works of art for a purpose unknown to Daisuke. As the story unfolds, he learns why, and about his classmate who seems to have the same ability.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3etrMwiRXgGLTrQeDv55Rps5Ryv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:25676'),
  ('351290906861252223', 'D.P.', 2021, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Kim Bo-tong, Han Jun-hee', 'Han Jun-hee, Kim Bo-tong', 'Jung Hae-in, Koo Kyo-hwan, Kim Sung-kyun, Son Suk-ku, Jeong Seok-yong, Kim Ji-hyun, Ji Jin-hee, Bae Na-ra', 'TV-MA', 'A young private''s assignment to capture army deserters reveals the painful reality endured by each enlistee during his compulsory call of duty.', 'A young private''s assignment to capture army deserters reveals the painful reality endured by each enlistee during his compulsory call of duty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/akvPsqe1u1NpIQ8Ln2Vt06uhOv9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:110534'),
  ('73982376434558207', 'D''Artagnan and Three Musketeers', 1979, 'Action & Adventure', 'Georgi Yungvald-Khilkevich', null, 'Mikhail Boyarskiy, Venyamin Smekhov, Igor Starygin, Valentin Smirnitskiy, Irina Alfyorova, Alisa Freyndlikh, Margarita Terekhova, Oleg Tabakov', null, 'The musketeers battle against the all-powerful Cardinal Richelieu and the treacherous Milady.', 'The musketeers battle against the all-powerful Cardinal Richelieu and the treacherous Milady.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/suMh5FvfImCMN3RjWNEUttpFOJ4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76829'),
  ('856913492988539223', 'Da Ali G Show', 2000, 'Comedy, Talk', 'Sacha Baron Cohen', 'Sacha Baron Cohen, Anthony Hines, Dan Mazer', 'Sacha Baron Cohen, Sacha Baron Cohen, Sacha Baron Cohen, Daniel DiCriscio', null, 'Da Ali G Show is a British satirical television series created by and starring English comedian Sacha Baron Cohen. In the series, Baron Cohen plays three unorthodox journalists: faux-streetwise poseur Ali G, Kazakh reporter Borat Sagdiyev, and gay Austrian fashion enthusiast Brüno Gehard. These characters conduct real interviews with unsuspecting people, many of whom are celebrities, high-ranking government officials, and other well-known figures, during which they are asked absurd and ridiculous questions.', 'Da Ali G Show is a British satirical television series created by and starring English comedian Sacha Baron Cohen. In the series, Baron Cohen plays three unorthodox journalists: faux-streetwise poseur Ali G, Kazakh reporter Borat Sagdiyev, and gay Austrian fashion enthusiast Brüno Gehard. These characters conduct real interviews with unsuspecting people, many of whom are celebrities, high-ranking government officials, and other well-known figures, during which they are asked absurd and ridiculous questions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCWE7bwyqjSrwjPd3HeyrrpJNlQ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:4417'),
  ('663827045954735189', 'Da Capo', 2003, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Haruko Momoi, Daisuke Kishio, Ōsaki Chiyo, Yuki Ono, Emi Nitta, Ui Miyazaki, Mikoi Sasaki, Hitomi', null, 'Junichi Asakura lives with his adoptive sister Nemu in the crescent-shaped island of Hatsune Jima, a place where cherry blossoms bloom throughout the year. In this island, people have mysterious powers and attributes. For example, Junichi has the power to see other people''s dreams, and he was also taught by his grandmother to magically create sweets. One day, Junichi''s cousin and childhood friend, Sakura Yoshino came back from America all of a sudden. To Junichi''s surprise, she looks exactly the same as the girl that moved away six years ago, and hasn''t aged one bit. And she came back to remind Junichi of their childhood promise... It is a bittersweet tale of magic, love, hidden desires, and unattainable dreams.', 'Junichi Asakura lives with his adoptive sister Nemu in the crescent-shaped island of Hatsune Jima, a place where cherry blossoms bloom throughout the year. In this island, people have mysterious powers and attributes. For example, Junichi has the power to see other people''s dreams, and he was also taught by his grandmother to magically create sweets. One day, Junichi''s cousin and childhood friend, Sakura Yoshino came back from America all of a sudden. To Junichi''s surprise, she looks exactly the same as the girl that moved away six years ago, and hasn''t aged one bit. And she came back to remind Junichi of their childhood promise... It is a bittersweet tale of magic, love, hidden desires, and unattainable dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yaDB7CTZA8PatqVmPnfwBynA9SI.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:26444'),
  ('1111478485750709339', 'Da Vinci''s Demons', 2013, 'Drama', 'David S. Goyer', null, 'Tom Riley, Laura Haddock, Elliot Cowan, Hera Hilmar, Gregg Chillin, Eros Vlahos, Blake Ritson, Akin Gazi', 'TV-MA', 'The series follows the "untold" story of Leonardo Da Vinci: the genius during his early years in Renaissance Florence. As a 25-year old artist, inventor, swordsman, lover, dreamer and idealist, he struggles to live within the confines of his own reality and time as he begins to not only see the future, but invent it.', 'The series follows the "untold" story of Leonardo Da Vinci: the genius during his early years in Renaissance Florence. As a 25-year old artist, inventor, swordsman, lover, dreamer and idealist, he struggles to live within the confines of his own reality and time as he begins to not only see the future, but invent it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sR8m3EUxmRJi4S9u5sfBDRLce1Z.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:40293'),
  ('253748404537403801', 'Da Vinci''s Inquest', 1998, 'Crime, Drama', 'Chris Haddock', null, 'Sarah-Jane Redmond, Suleka Mathew, Venus Terzo, Donnelly Rhodes, Gwynyth Walsh, Nicholas Campbell, Ian Tracey, Alex Diakun', 'TV-PG', 'Da Vinci''s Inquest is a Canadian dramatic television series that aired on CBC Television from 1998 to 2005. While never a ratings blockbuster, seven seasons of thirteen episodes each were filmed for a total of ninety-one episodes. The show, set and filmed in Vancouver, stars Nicholas Campbell as Dominic Da Vinci, once an undercover officer for the Royal Canadian Mounted Police, but now a crusading coroner who seeks justice in the cases he investigates. The cast also includes Gwynyth Walsh as Da Vinci''s ex-wife and chief pathologist Patricia Da Vinci, Donnelly Rhodes as detective Leo Shannon, and Ian Tracey as detective Mick Leary.', 'Da Vinci''s Inquest is a Canadian dramatic television series that aired on CBC Television from 1998 to 2005. While never a ratings blockbuster, seven seasons of thirteen episodes each were filmed for a total of ninety-one episodes. The show, set and filmed in Vancouver, stars Nicholas Campbell as Dominic Da Vinci, once an undercover officer for the Royal Canadian Mounted Police, but now a crusading coroner who seeks justice in the cases he investigates. The cast also includes Gwynyth Walsh as Da Vinci''s ex-wife and chief pathologist Patricia Da Vinci, Donnelly Rhodes as detective Leo Shannon, and Ian Tracey as detective Mick Leary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yTiI8j1ykKYtn0fYNedE9eju4Fr.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:3810'),
