  ('1126608446610018307', 'Dalgliesh', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Jill Robertson', null, 'Bertie Carvel', null, 'A recent widower and acclaimed poet, enigmatic Inspector Adam Dalgliesh employs his exceptional empathy and insight to plumb the darker depths of the human psyche while investigating complex crimes in 1970s England.', 'A recent widower and acclaimed poet, enigmatic Inspector Adam Dalgliesh employs his exceptional empathy and insight to plumb the darker depths of the human psyche while investigating complex crimes in 1970s England.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8pqCanIwJFehhZdP00gXE0qc9xc.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:137127'),
