  ('96872081219104136', 'Daria', 1997, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Glenn Eichler, Susie Lewis', null, 'Tracy Grandstaff, Wendy Hoopes, Julián Rebolledo, Marc Thompson, Alvaro J. Gonzalez, Jessica Cydnee Jackson, Janie Mertz, Geoffrey Arend', 'TV-PG', 'After moving to a new town with her stressed-out parents and relentlessly popular little sister, Daria uses her acerbic wit and keen powers of observation to contend with the mind-numbingly ridiculous world of Lawndale High.', 'After moving to a new town with her stressed-out parents and relentlessly popular little sister, Daria uses her acerbic wit and keen powers of observation to contend with the mind-numbingly ridiculous world of Lawndale High.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1Z3VI1aunE4yy88USAhGGVdazo.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:2131'),
  ('849601282133223353', 'Daring', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Artyom Bystrov, Egor Kenzhametov, Saveliy Kudryashov, Evgeniy Tkachuk, Elena Nikolaeva, Maxim Karushev, Anna Zavtur, Alexandra Babaskina', null, 'Khabarovsk region. Taiga. Pavel Likhovtsev, a senior ranger and bear hunter, keeps an apiary in the taiga and brings up his eldest son Zhenya as a real peasant. However, with the advent of the nineties, the apiary is ruined. Pavel and his family are forced to go to Khabarovsk in search of a better life. At this time, in Khabarovsk, there is a redistribution of spheres of influence - all power and all resources are transferred to the OCG "Obshchak" - a gang that will soon become the largest criminal group in the world.', 'Khabarovsk region. Taiga. Pavel Likhovtsev, a senior ranger and bear hunter, keeps an apiary in the taiga and brings up his eldest son Zhenya as a real peasant. However, with the advent of the nineties, the apiary is ruined. Pavel and his family are forced to go to Khabarovsk in search of a better life. At this time, in Khabarovsk, there is a redistribution of spheres of influence - all power and all resources are transferred to the OCG "Obshchak" - a gang that will soon become the largest criminal group in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/otiquk8nNWkSyTsrrl7sHMnw68U.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:244197'),
