  ('1094754935711609710', 'Dave Gorman''s Modern Life is Goodish', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Dave Gorman', null, 'Dave Gorman', null, 'Dave Gorman points out things he finds strange about modern life.', 'Dave Gorman points out things he finds strange about modern life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k1jmijqXTxbnUyD2AUtTbS2IJhV.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:59815'),
  ('668909169452893305', 'Dave the Barbarian', 2004, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Doug Langdale', null, 'Danny Cooksey, Estelle Harris, Erica Luttrell, Tress MacNeille, Jeff Bennett, Kevin Michael Richardson, Frank Welker, Paul Rugg', 'TV-G', 'This animated comedy series is set in the Middle Ages and follows the title character, Dave, in his comedic adventures with his family (his sisters, Candy and Fang) as they protect themselves and their family from a world of oddball foes. Dave himself combines strength with an appreciation of the finer things in life, including origami, bird watching, and even gourmet cooking.', 'This animated comedy series is set in the Middle Ages and follows the title character, Dave, in his comedic adventures with his family (his sisters, Candy and Fang) as they protect themselves and their family from a world of oddball foes. Dave himself combines strength with an appreciation of the finer things in life, including origami, bird watching, and even gourmet cooking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipzGJybXsUyqP78Wn6zC1XXbyRy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1960'),
  ('474964693715110943', 'Dave''s World', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Fred Barron', 'Dave Barry', 'Harry Anderson, Delane Matthews, Meshach Taylor, Shadoe Stevens, J.C. Wendel, Patrick Warburton, Zane Carney, Andrew Ducote', null, 'Dave''s World is an American sitcom that aired on CBS from 1993 to 1997. The series is based on the writing of Miami Herald columnist Dave Barry.', 'Dave''s World is an American sitcom that aired on CBS from 1993 to 1997. The series is based on the writing of Miami Herald columnist Dave Barry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAv15TI2wRZiS07D2z5rgdPtdKv.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:10463'),
  ('321817904966136607', 'David Attenborough''s Conquest of the Skies', 2015, 'Documentary', null, null, 'David Attenborough', null, 'Evolutionary story of flight from the very first insects to the incredible array of creatures which rule the skies today.', 'Evolutionary story of flight from the very first insects to the incredible array of creatures which rule the skies today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gqfOqWo74NTwRUj0Tu2GvVapQ55.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62800'),
  ('1133067704333910908', 'David Attenborough''s Natural Curiosities', 2013, 'Documentary', null, null, 'David Attenborough', null, 'Sir David shines the spotlight on some of nature’s evolutionary anomalies and reveals how these curious animals continue to baffle and fascinate.', 'Sir David shines the spotlight on some of nature’s evolutionary anomalies and reveals how these curious animals continue to baffle and fascinate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzQAFloohsMyhNyuOgiProDKoOK.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:58703'),
  ('334839264547780091', 'David Attenborough''s Rise of Animals: Triumph of the Vertebrates', 2013, 'Documentary', null, null, 'David Attenborough', null, 'David Attenborough embarks on a remarkable 500 million-year journey revealing the extraordinary group of animals that dominate our world, and how their evolution defines our human bodies.', 'David Attenborough embarks on a remarkable 500 million-year journey revealing the extraordinary group of animals that dominate our world, and how their evolution defines our human bodies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvxrgyuVuwOhJR66OEqcyYJ9zQL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60018'),
  ('86182147794702816', 'David Copperfield', 1999, 'Drama', 'Simon Curtis', 'Adrian Hodges', 'Tom Wilkinson, Daniel Radcliffe, Ciarán McMenamin, Emilia Fox, Pauline Quirke, Maggie Smith, Trevor Eve, Michael Elphick', null, 'A young man journeys from a difficult childhood to maturity, exploring social injustice, personal development, and the complexities of human relationships.', 'A young man journeys from a difficult childhood to maturity, exploring social injustice, personal development, and the complexities of human relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/73lKcw5bFmSD8lL0XuMbfYO29rO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:17836'),
  ('405104268228761725', 'David Makes Man', 2019, 'Drama', 'Tarell Alvin McCraney', null, 'Akili McDowell, Trinity Cidel, Alana Arenas, Travis Coles, Kwame Patterson, Arlen Escarpeta, Zsané Jhé, Brandi Huzzie', null, 'A 14-year-old prodigy''s mother relies on him to find a way out of poverty, but he is haunted by the death of his friend; he must choose between the streets that raised him or the higher education that may offer him a way out.', 'A 14-year-old prodigy''s mother relies on him to find a way out of poverty, but he is haunted by the death of his friend; he must choose between the streets that raised him or the higher education that may offer him a way out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a0FZ44UENaQ4aqtCq4zCTjiqe8H.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:90489'),
  ('557642796311860885', 'Davos 1917', 2023, 'War & Politics, Drama, Mystery', 'Adrian Illien, Thomas Hess, Michael Sauter', 'Adrian Illien, Julia Penner, Thomas Hess', 'Dominique Devenport, Jeanette Hain, David Kross, Anna Schinz, Hanspeter Müller, Welket Bungué, Sunnyi Melles, Max Herbrechter', null, 'More determined than ever to live her life in accordance with her deepest desires, nurse Johanna Gabathuler finds herself embroiled in a spy conspiracy with international implications. There’s a high price to pay and it’s risky to say the least, but she will do anything it takes to find her daughter and, ultimately, secure her freedom.', 'More determined than ever to live her life in accordance with her deepest desires, nurse Johanna Gabathuler finds herself embroiled in a spy conspiracy with international implications. There’s a high price to pay and it’s risky to say the least, but she will do anything it takes to find her daughter and, ultimately, secure her freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qKxK78LUlCCc9hvZPRVDtKNXSY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:237108'),
  ('483361327669233863', 'Dawn of the Croods', 2015, 'Animation, Family, Kids, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Brendan Hay', null, 'Dan Milano, Cree Summer, Stephanie Lemelin, A.J. LoCascio, Laraine Newman, Grey DeLisle', 'TV-Y7', 'The world''s first family is back for more laughs as they discover sports, sleepovers and other wonders in a world of exotic creatures and adventures. This 2D animated cartoon is based on the 3D animated feature film, "The Croods".', 'The world''s first family is back for more laughs as they discover sports, sleepovers and other wonders in a world of exotic creatures and adventures. This 2D animated cartoon is based on the 3D animated feature film, "The Croods".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cyCAsMLGECvEAFDfKcxcWy7YTOW.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:64783'),
  ('342408355978264240', 'Dawson''s Creek', 1998, 'Drama, Soap', 'Kevin Williamson', null, 'James Van Der Beek, Katie Holmes, Michelle Williams, Joshua Jackson, Kerr Smith, Busy Philipps, Mary Beth Peil', 'TV-14', 'Dawson''s Creek is an American teen drama that portrays the fictional lives of a close-knit group of teenagers through high school and college.', 'Dawson''s Creek is an American teen drama that portrays the fictional lives of a close-knit group of teenagers through high school and college.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/arT93dBemanftfWTcf9I0JRIlxU.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:2327'),
  ('738416973523686792', 'Day 5', 2016, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Matt Hullum, Josh Flanagan', null, 'Stephanie Drapeau, Jesse C. Boyd, Walker Satterwhite, Davi Jay, Katie Folger', 'TV-MA', 'After a fortuitous drug bender saves his life, addict Jake ventures out into the quiet streets… unaware that most of the world already died in their beds. Now, battling sleepless fatigue and encroaching delirium, Jake teams with a scrappy teenager, overnight doctor and red-eye pilot to search for answers… and just maybe find a way to sleep again.', 'After a fortuitous drug bender saves his life, addict Jake ventures out into the quiet streets… unaware that most of the world already died in their beds. Now, battling sleepless fatigue and encroaching delirium, Jake teams with a scrappy teenager, overnight doctor and red-eye pilot to search for answers… and just maybe find a way to sleep again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ryWurYwkk3I6c3cD1asbhb8O53.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66819'),
  ('552478670030294929', 'Day and Night', 2017, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Zhi Wen', 'Zhi Wen', 'Pan Yueming, Wang Longzheng, Liang Yuan, Yin Shuyi, Hou Xuelong, William Wu, Han Yezhou, 刘柏希', null, 'Twin brothers Guan Hongfeng and Guan Hongyu find themselves caught up in a brutal massacre that destroyed their family. As they face off against a shadowy criminal organization, they join forces with others to uncover the truth behind the 213 massacre.', 'Twin brothers Guan Hongfeng and Guan Hongyu find themselves caught up in a brutal massacre that destroyed their family. As they face off against a shadowy criminal organization, they join forces with others to uncover the truth behind the 213 massacre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uuKmigg4WuduZMJKIzJ8UP02pRg.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:73982'),
  ('1127770036144190036', 'Day Break', 2006, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Paul Zbyszewski', null, 'Taye Diggs, Victoria Pratt, Moon Bloodgood, Adam Baldwin, Meta Golding, Ramón Rodríguez, Joe Nieves, Michael McGrady', null, 'Today Detective Brett Hopper will be accused of shooting state attorney Alberto Garza. He will offer his rock solid alibi. He will realize he''s been framed. And he will run. Then, he will wake up and start the day over again.', 'Today Detective Brett Hopper will be accused of shooting state attorney Alberto Garza. He will offer his rock solid alibi. He will realize he''s been framed. And he will run. Then, he will wake up and start the day over again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDc53otK2vRtpVPRrpDbgggOCpt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4618'),
  ('785727381195577310', 'Day of the Dead', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jed Elinoff, Scott Thomas', null, 'Keenan Tracey, Daniel Doheny, Natalie Malaika, Kristy Dawn Dinsmore, Morgan Holmstrom', 'TV-MA', 'A group of strangers try to survive the first 24 hours of an undead invasion. This ode to George A. Romero’s famous flesh-eaters reminds us that sometimes all it takes to bring people together is a horde of hungry zombies trying to rip them apart.', 'A group of strangers try to survive the first 24 hours of an undead invasion. This ode to George A. Romero’s famous flesh-eaters reminds us that sometimes all it takes to bring people together is a horde of hungry zombies trying to rip them apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iBeWa2Ds2uCjTOlMikiBqETsS2X.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129897'),
  ('407765399473291715', 'Day One', 2026, 'Drama, Mystery', null, 'Luis Arranz, Juan Salvador López, Luis Moreno', 'Álex González, Asier Etxeandia, Alba Planas, Jordi Mollà, Renata Notni, Ivan Massagué, Mireia Oriol, Melina Matthews', null, 'Barcelona, 2026. During Mobile World Congress week, Ulises Albet, a former tech prodigy turned anti-tech activist, becomes the prime suspect in a murder. As he escapes through a city under lockdown, he uncovers the imminent launch of a groundbreaking technology that could put humanity''s ethical future at risk. To stop it, he must confront his past.', 'Barcelona, 2026. During Mobile World Congress week, Ulises Albet, a former tech prodigy turned anti-tech activist, becomes the prime suspect in a murder. As he escapes through a city under lockdown, he uncovers the imminent launch of a groundbreaking technology that could put humanity''s ethical future at risk. To stop it, he must confront his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/T6t1N2Z3sZ3vKTn5hKCrhWeeyT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:285386'),
  ('708949171656966216', 'Daybreak', 2019, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Aron Eli Coleite, Brad Peyton', null, 'Colin Ford, Alyvia Alyn Lind, Austin Crute, Krysta Rodriguez, Gregory Kasyan, Sophie Simnett, Matthew Broderick, Cody Kearsley', 'TV-MA', 'Living his best life in post-apocalyptic LA, a slacker strives to find the girl of his dreams while outwitting mindless ghouls and cliquish gangs.', 'Living his best life in post-apocalyptic LA, a slacker strives to find the girl of his dreams while outwitting mindless ghouls and cliquish gangs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AbnOGmAe7harXNwRAz7XywpHr8F.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83478'),
  ('1056531594636416821', 'Daydreamer', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy, Soap', null, null, 'Demet Özdemir, Can Yaman, Birand Tunca, Öznur Serçeler, Ceren Taşçı, Sevcan Yaşar, Anıl Çelik, Tuan Tunalı', null, 'Sanem, a young girl with aspirations of becoming a writer, is forced by her parents to choose between an arranged marriage and finding a proper job. Rushing into a new job at an advertising company, she soon falls for her boss, Can, and so he falls her. And the most beautiful love story begins with all its ups and downs.', 'Sanem, a young girl with aspirations of becoming a writer, is forced by her parents to choose between an arranged marriage and finding a proper job. Rushing into a new job at an advertising company, she soon falls for her boss, Can, and so he falls her. And the most beautiful love story begins with all its ups and downs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6OKMA1gxATeO6JmKB1JOs6wEfqY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80411'),
  ('669540135908184385', 'Daydreamers', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Nükhet Bıçakçı', 'Ekin Atalar, Yılmaz Sahin, Nükhet Bıçakçı', 'Pelin Karahan, Aslı Enver, İbrahim Kendirci, Sarp Apak, Ferit Aktuğ, Mehmet Yer, Ege Aydan, Nurcan Eren', null, '“Daydreamers” is the story of four red-hot teenagers that are eager to grow up. Deniz, Aslı, Efe and Mine live in a beach town that is full of colorful people in the summer but deserted in the winter. Deniz wants to detach himself from his happy and dependable family and find his own way. Aslı tries to act tough but is very sensitive inside. Efe tries to hide his pain with his breezy and jokey attitude. And the couch grass, rebellious Mine… Intimate friendships, first loves, pressure of exams, school and family problems that are hard to overcome… Everything we went through as teenagers are all part of this series.', '“Daydreamers” is the story of four red-hot teenagers that are eager to grow up. Deniz, Aslı, Efe and Mine live in a beach town that is full of colorful people in the summer but deserted in the winter. Deniz wants to detach himself from his happy and dependable family and find his own way. Aslı tries to act tough but is very sensitive inside. Efe tries to hide his pain with his breezy and jokey attitude. And the couch grass, rebellious Mine… Intimate friendships, first loves, pressure of exams, school and family problems that are hard to overcome… Everything we went through as teenagers are all part of this series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7wKfCT3CSqpRgNmhi3OGqZGeW5I.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:39322'),
  ('52605950764460909', 'Days', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Takuto Yoshinaga, Daisuke Namikawa, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Kaito Ishikawa, Daisuke Ono, Ayane Sakura, Katsuyuki Konishi, Takahiro Sakurai', 'TV-14', 'With no skills or outstanding features, one boy hides a passionate heart, Tsukushi Tsukamoto. The other is a lonely soccer genius, Jin Kazama. The winds of change begin to blow in the world of high school soccer as these two boys with nothing in common come together. The curtain on this hot-blooded, touching story is rising...', 'With no skills or outstanding features, one boy hides a passionate heart, Tsukushi Tsukamoto. The other is a lonely soccer genius, Jin Kazama. The winds of change begin to blow in the world of high school soccer as these two boys with nothing in common come together. The curtain on this hot-blooded, touching story is rising...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/usqHOY0QdFgRETQIzqXwTaJ5WVN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66979'),
  ('4090451520479913', 'Days of Honor', 2008, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, War & Politics', null, null, 'Jan Wieczorkowski, Jakub Wesołowski, Maciej Zakościelny, Katarzyna Gniewkowska, Ewa Wencel, Magdalena Różczka, Agnieszka Więdłocha, Piotr Adamczyk', null, 'Days of honor is a Polish World War II television drama series, broadcast on TVP2 since September 7, 2008.', 'Days of honor is a Polish World War II television drama series, broadcast on TVP2 since September 7, 2008.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0NvzjtIOf5u5dfifH6IpIJllhv.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:42381'),
  ('720827424533123807', 'Days of Our Lives', 1965, 'Soap, Drama', 'Irna Phillips, Ted Corday, Betty Corday', null, null, 'TV-14', 'The Horton and Brady broods endure the romantic trials of life in Salem, a Midwestern hamlet filled with evil geniuses, star-crossed lovers and a rich family history.', 'The Horton and Brady broods endure the romantic trials of life in Salem, a Midwestern hamlet filled with evil geniuses, star-crossed lovers and a rich family history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Zm7epVFEovMEVLpM6FvrjhaNXn.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:881'),
  ('509912155275721450', 'Days that Shocked the World: Chernobyl', 2026, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'The Chernobyl meltdown remains the world’s worst nuclear accident. Today, the disaster still haunts survivors, while the clean-up operation will continue for another 40 years.', 'The Chernobyl meltdown remains the world’s worst nuclear accident. Today, the disaster still haunts survivors, while the clean-up operation will continue for another 40 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQx92muB7X8oDv2ZIS12qBrg30T.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:313437'),
  ('754229501982103038', 'Days with My Stepsister', 2024, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Kohei Amasaki, Yuki Nakashima, Minori Suzuki, Ayu Suzuki, Daiki Hamano, Chikahiro Kobayashi, Reina Ueda, Atsumi Tanezaki', 'TV-14', 'When his father remarries, Yuta Asamura winds up sharing a roof with his new stepsister, Saki Ayase, the hottest girl in his grade. Carrying the scars of their parents’ troubled divorces, they vow to maintain a respectful distance. But what starts as cautious camaraderie blossoms into something deeper from shared experiences. Is it admiration, familial love, or something more?', 'When his father remarries, Yuta Asamura winds up sharing a roof with his new stepsister, Saki Ayase, the hottest girl in his grade. Carrying the scars of their parents’ troubled divorces, they vow to maintain a respectful distance. But what starts as cautious camaraderie blossoms into something deeper from shared experiences. Is it admiration, familial love, or something more?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xzbatUmI1qlcLHqMmawGduqHh1X.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:206629'),
  ('660085754505991689', 'DC Metal Force', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids', null, null, null, 'NR', 'A mysterious entity has brought the powers of good and evil together to participate in the ultimate super-powered showdown!', 'A mysterious entity has brought the powers of good and evil together to participate in the ultimate super-powered showdown!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9S2CtfSartZUFc0MX4h7aOPm1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:277587'),
  ('322126415175646117', 'DC Super Hero Girls', 2015, 'Animation, Family', null, null, 'Yvette Nicole Brown, Anais Fairweather, Tara Strong, Mae Whitman, Grey DeLisle, Stephanie Sheh, Teala Dunn', null, 'At Super Hero High, iconic Super Heroes like Wonder Woman, Supergirl, Batgirl, Harley Quinn, Bumblebee, Poison Ivy, and Katana navigate all the twists and turns of high school. United by friendship, the DC Super Hero Girls empower kids to shine with confidence and courage, especially while they combat those overwhelming, exciting, and awesomely awkward moments of growing up (sometimes super powers can be super stressful!).', 'At Super Hero High, iconic Super Heroes like Wonder Woman, Supergirl, Batgirl, Harley Quinn, Bumblebee, Poison Ivy, and Katana navigate all the twists and turns of high school. United by friendship, the DC Super Hero Girls empower kids to shine with confidence and courage, especially while they combat those overwhelming, exciting, and awesomely awkward moments of growing up (sometimes super powers can be super stressful!).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6BIHNmQHktFWkprlKPv7Q5h7Nb7.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:64365'),
  ('226323560327420594', 'DC Super Hero Girls', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids, Comedy', 'Lauren Faust', null, 'Grey DeLisle, Nicole Sullivan, Kimberly Brooks, Tara Strong, Myrna Velasco, Kari Wahlgren', 'TV-PG', 'The world may know them as Wonder Woman, Supergirl and Batgirl, but not-so-typical teenagers Diana, Kara and Barbara, alongside their Super Hero friends have much more to deal with than just protecting Metropolis from some of the most sinister school-aged Super-Villains. After all, being teens is tough enough, what with school, friends, family and the chaos that comes with managing a social life. But add super powers and a secret identity to the mix, and things can get a lot more complicated.', 'The world may know them as Wonder Woman, Supergirl and Batgirl, but not-so-typical teenagers Diana, Kara and Barbara, alongside their Super Hero friends have much more to deal with than just protecting Metropolis from some of the most sinister school-aged Super-Villains. After all, being teens is tough enough, what with school, friends, family and the chaos that comes with managing a social life. But add super powers and a secret identity to the mix, and things can get a lot more complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sjjyQ0OKUnUTzJpLi5CDOzZCE88.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:87491'),
  ('369966640937497639', 'DC''s Legends of Tomorrow', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Greg Berlanti, Andrew Kreisberg, Marc Guggenheim', 'Emily Cheever, Leah Poulliot', 'Caity Lotz, Tala Ashe, Jes Macallan, Olivia Swann, Adam Tsekhman, Nick Zano, Shayan Sobhian, Lisseth Chavez', 'TV-14', 'When heroes alone are not enough ... the world needs legends. Having seen the future, one he will desperately try to prevent from happening, time-traveling rogue Rip Hunter is tasked with assembling a disparate group of both heroes and villains to confront an unstoppable threat — one in which not only is the planet at stake, but all of time itself. Can this ragtag team defeat an immortal threat unlike anything they have ever known?', 'When heroes alone are not enough ... the world needs legends. Having seen the future, one he will desperately try to prevent from happening, time-traveling rogue Rip Hunter is tasked with assembling a disparate group of both heroes and villains to confront an unstoppable threat — one in which not only is the planet at stake, but all of time itself. Can this ragtag team defeat an immortal threat unlike anything they have ever known?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AcEFDh272YVTR6B6zrrusk8BjJG.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:62643'),
  ('179190987478574026', 'DC''s Stargirl', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Geoff Johns', 'Charlotte Balogh', 'Brec Bassinger, Yvette Monreal, Anjelika Washington, Cameron Gellman, Trae Romano, Meg DeLacy, Alkoya Brunson, Neil Hopkins', 'TV-14', 'Courtney Whitmore, a smart, athletic and above all else kind girl, discovers her step-father has a secret: he used to be the sidekick to a superhero. "Borrowing" the long-lost hero’s cosmic staff, she becomes the unlikely inspiration for an entirely new generation of superheroes.', 'Courtney Whitmore, a smart, athletic and above all else kind girl, discovers her step-father has a secret: he used to be the sidekick to a superhero. "Borrowing" the long-lost hero’s cosmic staff, she becomes the unlikely inspiration for an entirely new generation of superheroes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/JJxVsQPPiuLcArALotMHsCubeo.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:80986'),
  ('1110931131802224758', 'DCI Banks', 2011, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Stephen Tompkinson, Andrea Lowe, Caroline Catz, Jack Deam, Samuel Anderson', 'TV-14', 'A thrilling drama based on the novels by Peter Robinson. Stephen Tompkinson and Andrea Lowe star as the tenacious and stubborn Chief Inspector Alan Banks and the feisty and headstrong Detective Sergeant Annie Cabbot.', 'A thrilling drama based on the novels by Peter Robinson. Stephen Tompkinson and Andrea Lowe star as the tenacious and stubborn Chief Inspector Alan Banks and the feisty and headstrong Detective Sergeant Annie Cabbot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rTcjTVsWRqR4LgkreycxRirFzsT.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:40675'),
  ('1002464115173997229', 'De Bachelorette', 2020, 'Reality', null, null, 'Beate van der Weide, Diva Brons, Monica Geuze, Kashin Aziz', null, 'Dutch version of the reality show in which a single bachelorette dates multiple men over several weeks, narrowing them down to hopefully find her true love.', 'Dutch version of the reality show in which a single bachelorette dates multiple men over several weeks, narrowing them down to hopefully find her true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5PZvsyfQ3zXMamBGroQxtUjgRx5.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:103709'),
  ('357032155142423602', 'De brutas nada', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Isabella Santodomingo', 'Tessa Ía, Alejandro Montero, Carolina Ramírez, Marimar Vega, Lukas Urkijo', null, 'In a contemporary Mexico City, a group of six sophisticated close friends navigate through every life experience imaginable together: love, lies, heartbreak, marriage, divorce, kids, career, job loss, fights, break-ups, and unbreakable friendships.', 'In a contemporary Mexico City, a group of six sophisticated close friends navigate through every life experience imaginable together: love, lies, heartbreak, marriage, divorce, kids, career, job loss, fights, break-ups, and unbreakable friendships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j2z4qiYmHLelSdnqSAMkDB7jk7F.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:111499'),
