  ('864926931381105667', 'De Fabeltjeskrant', 1968, 'Kids', 'Thijs Chanowski, Leen Valkenier', null, 'Frans van Dusschoten, Ger Smit, Elsje Scherjon', null, 'Fabeltjeskrant [ ''faːbəɫcəskrɑnt] is a Dutch children''s television series featuring puppetry and stop motion. Created in 1968 by Leen Valkenier and produced by Thijs Chanowski and Loek de Levita, it ended in 1989 and was broadcast on the Dutch channels NOS, RTL 4 and RTL 8 and on Belgian channel VRT. From 1973 to 1975 it was broadcast also in the United Kingdom, on ITV, with the title The Daily Fable.', 'Fabeltjeskrant [ ''faːbəɫcəskrɑnt] is a Dutch children''s television series featuring puppetry and stop motion. Created in 1968 by Leen Valkenier and produced by Thijs Chanowski and Loek de Levita, it ended in 1989 and was broadcast on the Dutch channels NOS, RTL 4 and RTL 8 and on Belgian channel VRT. From 1973 to 1975 it was broadcast also in the United Kingdom, on ITV, with the title The Daily Fable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h2HFhwgU7xcIEpgDuuPHfh5NOVZ.jpg', 25, 'tmdb:tv:35007'),
  ('638337681785281809', 'De Fiksers', 2026, 'Comedy, Reality', null, null, null, null, 'The Netherlands (and the world) is reeling from unresolved problems such as nitrogen emissions, housing shortages, and unstable Wi-Fi. Fortunately, there is a solution: De Fiksers solves everything. In this satirical program, ten comedians get to work from a secret location, with a 100% success rate.', 'The Netherlands (and the world) is reeling from unresolved problems such as nitrogen emissions, housing shortages, and unstable Wi-Fi. Fortunately, there is a solution: De Fiksers solves everything. In this satirical program, ten comedians get to work from a secret location, with a 100% success rate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23pInprGqlTIf6mAwf5syhs9nZG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:318000'),
