  ('454483921916356229', 'De viaje con los Derbez', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Eugenio Derbez, Aislinn Derbez, Vadhir Derbez, José Eduardo Derbez, Alessandra Rosaldo, Aitana Derbez', null, 'The series follows the fun and endearing Derbez family as they discover new cultures in foreign lands and for the first time – all together and unfiltered.', 'The series follows the fun and endearing Derbez family as they discover new cultures in foreign lands and for the first time – all together and unfiltered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uRGtSHP3tSQ2XsHhguCREWt7dXA.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:94667'),
  ('899112807544129254', 'De Vuelta al Barrio', 2017, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Gigio Aranda', null, null, 'NR', 'It is the story of Pichón, a father of a family who has just been widowed, seeing the way to get their children forward, and Malena, who returns to his childhood home with his four children. During their youth they lived a romance and they arrived at the altar, but she decided to leave it moments before marrying and after twenty-five years, they meet again', 'It is the story of Pichón, a father of a family who has just been widowed, seeing the way to get their children forward, and Malena, who returns to his childhood home with his four children. During their youth they lived a romance and they arrived at the altar, but she decided to leave it moments before marrying and after twenty-five years, they meet again', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/po1FbSe2OtVz1w6r4vU8a3Tf6z6.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:73340'),
  ('239655075796630372', 'De Wereld Draait Door', 2005, 'Talk', null, null, 'Matthijs van Nieuwkerk', null, 'Talk show hosted by Matthijs van Nieuwkerk containing a mixture of news, information, television bloopers and general entertainment.', 'Talk show hosted by Matthijs van Nieuwkerk containing a mixture of news, information, television bloopers and general entertainment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/usDvOyAmTaLXV25hL5zoCUS0Rz4.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:29082'),
  ('846554968058333272', 'Dead Account', 2026, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Nobuhiko Okamoto, Koki Uchiyama, Fairouz Ai', null, 'When people die, their social media can sometimes become "ghost accounts," manifesting their owners as digital specters. While trying to pay for his sister''s medical bills, Soji Enishiro awakens cyberkinesis and is dragged to Miden Academy, a secret school where spirit mediums train to fight digitized ghosts. Now Soji must master his powers before the online afterlife spills into the real world!', 'When people die, their social media can sometimes become "ghost accounts," manifesting their owners as digital specters. While trying to pay for his sister''s medical bills, Soji Enishiro awakens cyberkinesis and is dragged to Miden Academy, a secret school where spirit mediums train to fight digitized ghosts. Now Soji must master his powers before the online afterlife spills into the real world!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7BrOHENj6pPRvYw3EpHZ8JzbKGW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:286291'),
  ('611058083918446499', 'Dead Boss', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Sharon Horgan', null, 'Sharon Horgan, Aisling Bea, Jennifer Saunders', null, 'Helen Stephens is wrongly sentenced to 12 years in prison for murdering her boss Eric Bridges, the managing director of Entirely Tiles. Although she is sure that it will only be a matter of time before this mistake is rectified, everyone around her seems to be conspiring to keep her behind bars. Lawyer Tony is incompetent, sister Laura wants her flat, and fiancé Justin - her alibi - has disappeared. Colleague Henry seems to be the only one willing to help, but he has an ulterior motive.', 'Helen Stephens is wrongly sentenced to 12 years in prison for murdering her boss Eric Bridges, the managing director of Entirely Tiles. Although she is sure that it will only be a matter of time before this mistake is rectified, everyone around her seems to be conspiring to keep her behind bars. Lawyer Tony is incompetent, sister Laura wants her flat, and fiancé Justin - her alibi - has disappeared. Colleague Henry seems to be the only one willing to help, but he has an ulterior motive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHpb6dPAohmFFNBhU2h0o5htd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61884'),
  ('227826295358000218', 'Dead Boy Detectives', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Steve Yockey', null, 'George Rexstrew, Jayden Revri, Kassius Nelson, Yuyu Kitamura, Briana Cuoco, Ruth Connell, Jenn Lyon', 'TV-MA', 'Two teen ghosts work alongside a clairvoyant to solve mysteries for their supernatural clientele — until a powerful witch complicates their plans.', 'Two teen ghosts work alongside a clairvoyant to solve mysteries for their supernatural clientele — until a powerful witch complicates their plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qGEjCjfBSUzaYNzOqUTx3XRniHH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132750'),
  ('455042590379259205', 'DEAD DEAD DEMONS DEDEDEDE DESTRUCTION', 2024, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Lilas Ikuta, ano, Atsumi Tanezaki, Miyuri Shimabukuro, Saeko Oki, Azumi Waki, Ryoko Shiraishi, Miyu Irino', 'TV-14', 'As the world is threatened by the sudden appearance of a mysterious alien mothership, best friends Koyama Kadode and Nakagawa “Ontan” Oran carry on about their high school life. But as they grow up, they face existential questions, learning adulthood’s complexities and that the true threat may not be from above.', 'As the world is threatened by the sudden appearance of a mysterious alien mothership, best friends Koyama Kadode and Nakagawa “Ontan” Oran carry on about their high school life. But as they grow up, they face existential questions, learning adulthood’s complexities and that the true threat may not be from above.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45XAw7d5aTu6CK6OC4XQ3ji8s89.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:254987'),
  ('404158435936502808', 'Dead End', 2019, 'Crime', null, null, 'Antje Traue, Michael Gwisdek, Victoria Schulz, Lars Rudolph, Fabian Busch, Nikolai Kinski', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8GypeIQ6rYeqhoQEAZ82gkmwgV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85054'),
  ('63766751956234591', 'Dead End', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Juliusz Chrząstowski, Łukasz Garlicki, Anna Ilczuk, Jaśmina Polak, Michał Sikorski, Maja Wolska', 'TV-MA', 'A group of people sharing a ride accidentally switches cars with a bank robber, who then pursues them to retrieve the stolen money he left in the trunk.', 'A group of people sharing a ride accidentally switches cars with a bank robber, who then pursues them to retrieve the stolen money he left in the trunk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j4yasPJg4bZLKv18lYZNc30xZM3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214258'),
  ('507363797117859901', 'Dead End: Paranormal Park', 2022, 'Animation, Kids', 'Hamish Steele', null, 'Zach Barack, Kody Kavitha, Alex Brightman, Emily Osment, Kathreen Khavari, Miss Coco Peru, Kenny Tran', 'TV-Y7', 'Two teens and a talking pug team up to battle demons at a haunted theme park — and maybe even save the world from a supernatural apocalypse.', 'Two teens and a talking pug team up to battle demons at a haunted theme park — and maybe even save the world from a supernatural apocalypse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iB9h1cBIFFjnufhZF4lNGQmt3c5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:158139'),
  ('415779492845952081', 'Dead Like Me', 2003, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Bryan Fuller', null, 'Ellen Muth, Mandy Patinkin, Callum Blue, Jasmine Guy, Cynthia Stevenson, Laura Harris', 'TV-14', 'When her life comes to an abrupt end, George discovers that death is nothing like she thought it would be. Recruited to collect the souls of others as they die, she suddenly finds herself an unwilling participant in a line of work she never knew existed: Grim Reaping!', 'When her life comes to an abrupt end, George discovers that death is nothing like she thought it would be. Recruited to collect the souls of others as they die, she suddenly finds herself an unwilling participant in a line of work she never knew existed: Grim Reaping!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92pJimSg6exk0Dt5u5XB1O5DZtz.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2566'),
  ('44773861281884359', 'Dead Lucky', 2018, 'Crime', 'Ellie Beaumont, Drew Proffitt', null, 'Rachel Griffiths, Yoson An, Mojean Aria, Ian Meadows, Rhys Muldoon, Anna Samson, Xana Tang, Matt Nable', 'TV-14', 'Two feuding detectives hunt down a cop-killer who leaves a trail of broken lives across Sydney.', 'Two feuding detectives hunt down a cop-killer who leaves a trail of broken lives across Sydney.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9010TqKgZGRQkaBgs6GbVbvegc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81005'),
  ('365188669545105884', 'Dead Man''s Gun', 1997, 'Western', null, null, 'Kris Kristofferson, Sarah Chalke, Brian Austin Green, Henry Winkler', null, 'Dead Man''s Gun was a western anthology series that ran on Showtime from 1997 to 1999. The series followed the travels of a gun as it passed to a new character in each episode. The gun would change the life of whomever possessed it. Each episode was narrated by Kris Kristofferson. The executive producer was Henry Winkler.', 'Dead Man''s Gun was a western anthology series that ran on Showtime from 1997 to 1999. The series followed the travels of a gun as it passed to a new character in each episode. The gun would change the life of whomever possessed it. Each episode was narrated by Kris Kristofferson. The executive producer was Henry Winkler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fC3tSTAx5BXNW4Z2NkfVEAIF4YO.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:21031'),
  ('233368906136070358', 'Dead Man''s Walk', 1996, 'Western', null, null, 'David Arquette, Jonny Lee Miller, F. Murray Abraham, Keith Carradine, Patricia Childress, Edward James Olmos, Eric Schweig, Harry Dean Stanton', 'TV-14', 'The final chapter of Larry McMurty''s popular and critically acclaimed mini-series, ''Lonesome Dove'', recounting the thrilling first adventure of Gus McCrae and Woodrow Call. Great Cast!', 'The final chapter of Larry McMurty''s popular and critically acclaimed mini-series, ''Lonesome Dove'', recounting the thrilling first adventure of Gus McCrae and Woodrow Call. Great Cast!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1A9TGDKmuvHoPyCY5vmaWtWOLnp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:47193'),
  ('984155101448805941', 'Dead Mount Death Play', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuki Sakakihara, Inori Minase, Yuma Uchida', 'TV-14', 'As a legendary hero nears victory against a necromancer known as The Corpse God, things take an unexpected turn with the dark sorcerer’s final gambit—reincarnation magic. This last-ditch effort catches the brave fighter off guard, and now he’s a boy named Polka Shinoyama in a whole new world! The showdown between good and evil just got epic.', 'As a legendary hero nears victory against a necromancer known as The Corpse God, things take an unexpected turn with the dark sorcerer’s final gambit—reincarnation magic. This last-ditch effort catches the brave fighter off guard, and now he’s a boy named Polka Shinoyama in a whole new world! The showdown between good and evil just got epic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOlg3bPWOKBgy5kgOTVe8pJz4HI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214540'),
  ('1062584382038861162', 'Dead Mountain: The Dyatlov Pass Incident', 2020, 'Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Ilya Kulikov', null, 'Ivan Mulin, Pyotr Fyodorov, Mariya Lugovaya, Andrey Dobrovolsky, Aleksey Kirsanov, Egor Beroev, Aleksandr Metelkin, Maria Matsel', null, 'Russia, 1959. A KGB major investigates the mysterious deaths of a group of nine student hikers in the Ural Mountains. Troubled by his past as a WWII veteran, he has a sixth sense and death seems to follow him around as he digs deeper into the mysterious incident. The more he learns, the more it becomes clear: the reason the students died will never see the light of day.', 'Russia, 1959. A KGB major investigates the mysterious deaths of a group of nine student hikers in the Ural Mountains. Troubled by his past as a WWII veteran, he has a sixth sense and death seems to follow him around as he digs deeper into the mysterious incident. The more he learns, the more it becomes clear: the reason the students died will never see the light of day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xYIkMlNLlZOm0cj9GdUDoLQn7Jv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:111088'),
  ('596827152671698711', 'Dead of Summer', 2016, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Edward Kitsis, Adam Horowitz, Ian B. Goldberg', null, 'Elizabeth Lail, Ronen Rubinstein, Zelda Williams, Mark Indelicato, Paulina Singer, Eli Goree, Elizabeth Mitchell, Alberto Frezza', 'TV-14', 'Set in the late 1980s, school is out for the summer, and a sun-drenched season of firsts beckons the counselors at Camp Clearwater, a seemingly idyllic Midwestern summer camp, including first loves, first kisses – and first kills. Clearwater’s dark, ancient mythology awakens, and what was supposed to be a summer of fun soon turns into one of unforgettable scares and evil at every turn.', 'Set in the late 1980s, school is out for the summer, and a sun-drenched season of firsts beckons the counselors at Camp Clearwater, a seemingly idyllic Midwestern summer camp, including first loves, first kisses – and first kills. Clearwater’s dark, ancient mythology awakens, and what was supposed to be a summer of fun soon turns into one of unforgettable scares and evil at every turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aYnBbx6VA9soKqFZcj0iEwGM47B.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66489'),
  ('760595862799333135', 'Dead Pixels', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Jon Brown', 'Jon Brown', 'Alexa Davies, Will Merrick, Sargon Yelda, David Mumeni, Charlotte Ritchie', null, 'Meg, Nicky and Usman''s lives all revolve around their obsession for the massively popular fantasy game "Kingdom Scrolls" – a mystical, magical and most importantly virtual world of wizards and wyverns. But when gaming n00b Russell bumbles into their team, the group find themselves increasingly forced to deal with the real world.', 'Meg, Nicky and Usman''s lives all revolve around their obsession for the massively popular fantasy game "Kingdom Scrolls" – a mystical, magical and most importantly virtual world of wizards and wyverns. But when gaming n00b Russell bumbles into their team, the group find themselves increasingly forced to deal with the real world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5oLCCg8g0hmfFuOtiwEQ9SDiDY.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:88028'),
  ('788028508334777783', 'Dead Places', 2021, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Gareth Crocker', null, 'Zondwa Mditshwa, Altovise Lawrence, Shamilla Miller, Anthony Oseyemi, Rea Rangaka, Shalom Nyandiko, David Butler, Gregg Viljoen', null, 'An author who has dedicated his career to solving paranormal cases, returns home to South Africa to investigate the biggest mystery of his life: His sister''s death in a water canal 20 years ago.', 'An author who has dedicated his career to solving paranormal cases, returns home to South Africa to investigate the biggest mystery of his life: His sister''s death in a water canal 20 years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oL6vUA4UKfXCz3b25fljILYhyln.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:122694'),
  ('1000993150761641428', 'Dead Ringers', 2023, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Alice Birch', null, 'Rachel Weisz, Britne Oldford, Poppy Liu, Jennifer Ehle, Michael Chernus', 'TV-MA', 'Elliot and Beverly Mantle are twins who share everything: drugs, lovers, and an unapologetic desire to do whatever it takes — including pushing the boundaries on medical ethics — in an effort to challenge antiquated practices and bring women’s healthcare to the forefront.', 'Elliot and Beverly Mantle are twins who share everything: drugs, lovers, and an unapologetic desire to do whatever it takes — including pushing the boundaries on medical ethics — in an effort to challenge antiquated practices and bring women’s healthcare to the forefront.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GZB7pnyAw6QV053TwxiqvRyOw3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130987'),
  ('318035309053253633', 'Dead Set', 2008, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Charlie Brooker', 'Charlie Brooker', 'Kevin Eldon, Beth Cordingly, Warren Brown, Riz Ahmed, Davina McCall, Liz May Brice, Adam Deacon, Kathleen McDermott', 'TV-MA', 'Zombies are rampaging throughout Britain. Blissfully unaware of gory events outside, the Big Brother housemates are in for the ultimate eviction night...', 'Zombies are rampaging throughout Britain. Blissfully unaware of gory events outside, the Big Brother housemates are in for the ultimate eviction night...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wks5MzDsW5zg5KrQz0JCcefDNeM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:7831'),
  ('1095029924503971056', 'Dead Silent', 2016, 'Crime, Documentary, Reality', null, null, 'Dude Walker', 'TV-14', 'A snap of a twig. A rustling leaf. In the woods, myth, urban legend, and horror collide with real-life killers. Transporting viewers into a vortex of dark mystery and psychological terror, each episode tells the true story of a crime set in a desolate location.', 'A snap of a twig. A rustling leaf. In the woods, myth, urban legend, and horror collide with real-life killers. Transporting viewers into a vortex of dark mystery and psychological terror, each episode tells the true story of a crime set in a desolate location.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4MBIJJqNjja541GudeCFkF8MB9p.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:68401'),
  ('422058258319649726', 'Dead Still', 2020, 'Mystery, Comedy, Crime', null, null, 'Michael Smiley, Rhys Dunlop, Eileen O''Higgins, Kerr Logan, Jimmy Smallhorne, Aidan O''Hare', 'TV-14', 'Memorial photographer Brock Blennerhasset makes a living out of photographing the dead in Victorian Ireland. When a series of murders threatens to sully Blennerhasset''s reputation, a tenacious detective drags him into an investigation of Dublin''s criminal underbelly.', 'Memorial photographer Brock Blennerhasset makes a living out of photographing the dead in Victorian Ireland. When a series of murders threatens to sully Blennerhasset''s reputation, a tenacious detective drags him into an investigation of Dublin''s criminal underbelly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y0hCyEGB0X5ULB0paAidp0YQ9In.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95888'),
  ('696115891725038415', 'Dead to Me', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Liz Feldman', null, 'Christina Applegate, Linda Cardellini, James Marsden, Luke Roessler, Sam McCarthy', 'TV-MA', 'A hotheaded widow searching for the hit-and-run driver who mowed down her husband befriends an eccentric optimist who isn''t quite what she seems.', 'A hotheaded widow searching for the hit-and-run driver who mowed down her husband befriends an eccentric optimist who isn''t quite what she seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mAj18PHeACxqcrEus4pD8pksRmB.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:81357'),
  ('398381645708192612', 'Deadbeat', 2014, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Brett Konner, Cody Heller', null, 'Tyler Labine, Kal Penn', 'TV-14', 'Kevin Pacalioglu may have no money and no clue, but he can see dead people, so that’s pretty cool. Faced with a constant stream of stubborn spirits, Pac goes to whatever lengths require the least amount of effort to help New York City’s most frivolous ghosts finish their unfinished business, occasionally with the help of his best friend and drug dealer, Roofie.', 'Kevin Pacalioglu may have no money and no clue, but he can see dead people, so that’s pretty cool. Faced with a constant stream of stubborn spirits, Pac goes to whatever lengths require the least amount of effort to help New York City’s most frivolous ghosts finish their unfinished business, occasionally with the help of his best friend and drug dealer, Roofie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vdotAhDqr7jR3tuxc7jTw7kCgjz.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:62234'),
  ('1078695573910775304', 'Deadhouse Dark', 2021, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Enzo Tedeschi', null, null, 'NR', 'In six interconnected short tales of terror, a woman receives a ‘mystery box’ from the dark web. Each item within will gradually reveal a dark and troubling truth.', 'In six interconnected short tales of terror, a woman receives a ‘mystery box’ from the dark web. Each item within will gradually reveal a dark and troubling truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yxuGE15uds6w0J8Q2knJjQ2O589.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:124518'),
  ('66052041135701967', 'Deadliest Catch', 2005, 'Reality', 'Thom Beers', null, 'Keith Colburn, Sig Hansen', 'TV-14', 'Forty-foot waves, 700 pound crab pots, freezing temperatures and your mortality staring you in the face…it''s all in a day''s work for these modern day prospectors. During each episode we will watch crews race to meet their quota and make it home safely.', 'Forty-foot waves, 700 pound crab pots, freezing temperatures and your mortality staring you in the face…it''s all in a day''s work for these modern day prospectors. During each episode we will watch crews race to meet their quota and make it home safely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqF7wHfA2n89zbBqG6DLuDjrHut.jpg', 21, 'tmdb:tv:2612'),
  ('186888418734992182', 'Deadliest Warrior', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Gary Tarpinian, Tim Prokop', null, 'Max Geiger, Armand Dorian, Max Geiger, David Wenham', null, 'Deadliest Warrior was a television program in which information on historical or modern warriors and their weapons are used to determine which of them is the "deadliest" based upon tests performed during each episode. The show was characterized by its use of data compiled in creating a dramatization of the warriors'' battle to the death. The show ran for three seasons.', 'Deadliest Warrior was a television program in which information on historical or modern warriors and their weapons are used to determine which of them is the "deadliest" based upon tests performed during each episode. The show was characterized by its use of data compiled in creating a dramatization of the warriors'' battle to the death. The show ran for three seasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJt4Hj9Y33szDxkmPzfurnnvkQB.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:18545'),
  ('586071497054138716', 'Deadline Gallipoli', 2015, 'War & Politics, Drama', null, 'Cate Shortland, Jacquelin Perske, Stuart Beattie', 'Sam Worthington, Hugh Dancy, Joel Jackson, Charles Dance, Rachel Griffiths, Anna Torv, Jessica De Gouw, Bryan Brown', null, 'Three journalists, Charles Bean, Ellis Ashmead Bartlett and Phillip Schuler, arrive at Gallipoli with the invading British and Allied troops in 1915. They will report the war but are prevented from getting out the true story of an unfolding disaster. From encampment in Cairo to Anzac Cove to the evacuation, this is the story of journalists who will not accept that truth be the first casualty. This is the story of the men who will not shut up. The actions of these men will help change the course of the campaign, ensure that a strategic disaster becomes a legend of human heroism, and leave an impregnable mark on each of their lives.', 'Three journalists, Charles Bean, Ellis Ashmead Bartlett and Phillip Schuler, arrive at Gallipoli with the invading British and Allied troops in 1915. They will report the war but are prevented from getting out the true story of an unfolding disaster. From encampment in Cairo to Anzac Cove to the evacuation, this is the story of journalists who will not accept that truth be the first casualty. This is the story of the men who will not shut up. The actions of these men will help change the course of the campaign, ensure that a strategic disaster becomes a legend of human heroism, and leave an impregnable mark on each of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dW70WHKiutfzKMhRdmVUIarQIe8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66430'),
  ('767978615560105707', 'Deadline: Crime with Tamron Hall', 2013, 'Documentary, Crime, Reality, Talk', null, null, 'Tamron Hall', 'TV-14', 'In each one-hour episode, Tamron Hall is joined by a core team of correspondents with extensive knowledge of law enforcement and a passion for storytelling. Series goes beyond the headlines to explore not only what happened, but why it happened, and how it was investigated.', 'In each one-hour episode, Tamron Hall is joined by a core team of correspondents with extensive knowledge of law enforcement and a passion for storytelling. Series goes beyond the headlines to explore not only what happened, but why it happened, and how it was investigated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8XD9I26J0DgSHRqCGQBAh2LNMj.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:74532'),
  ('1141661756929483863', 'Deadloch', 2023, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Kate McCartney, Kate McLennan', null, 'Kate Box, Madeleine Sami, Nina Oyama, Alicia Gardiner, Brian Coll', 'TV-MA', 'Two vastly different female detectives are thrown together to solve the murder of a local man in the sleepy seaside hamlet of Deadloch.', 'Two vastly different female detectives are thrown together to solve the murder of a local man in the sleepy seaside hamlet of Deadloch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7rI7T4AfSzOx0Rqw73AusyIpeXf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:225780'),
  ('1005710245340908837', 'Deadly 60', 2009, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Wildlife presenter Steve Backshall tracks down 60 of the world''s deadliest animals.', 'Wildlife presenter Steve Backshall tracks down 60 of the world''s deadliest animals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9OhUIi351RejCO4ddjsIbtDu6Ke.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:24400'),
  ('721555580554735800', 'Deadly Class', 2019, 'Drama, Crime, Action & Adventure', 'Miles Orion Feldsott, Rick Remender', null, 'Benjamin Wadsworth, Benedict Wong, Lana Condor, María Gabriela de Faría, Luke Tennie, Liam James, Michel Duval', 'TV-MA', 'Follow a disillusioned teen recruited into a storied high school for assassins. Maintaining his moral code while surviving a ruthless curriculum, vicious social cliques, and his own adolescent uncertainties may prove fatal.', 'Follow a disillusioned teen recruited into a storied high school for assassins. Maintaining his moral code while surviving a ruthless curriculum, vicious social cliques, and his own adolescent uncertainties may prove fatal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u2GSiPazSXpyNQz0yymOUCUm944.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75663'),
  ('730507004001421629', 'Deadly Hunters', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'The Earth, our planet, is a magnificent and diverse world, filled to the brim with life. But life, in all its forms, cannot exist except within a very specific set of rules – among many, to be alive means to breathe, to breed, to sense one’s environment, and importantly – to and nourishment, in whatever form fits. Out in the wild, it’s eat or be eaten, and few escape this one law that governs all. The epic and eternal battle of predator vs. prey has moulded and shaped all life on Earth and resulted in a fierce array of weaponry and masterful set of skills. Deadliest Hunters takes a closer look at some of the animals that have led the way in refining their skills as masterful huntsmen.', 'The Earth, our planet, is a magnificent and diverse world, filled to the brim with life. But life, in all its forms, cannot exist except within a very specific set of rules – among many, to be alive means to breathe, to breed, to sense one’s environment, and importantly – to and nourishment, in whatever form fits. Out in the wild, it’s eat or be eaten, and few escape this one law that governs all. The epic and eternal battle of predator vs. prey has moulded and shaped all life on Earth and resulted in a fierce array of weaponry and masterful set of skills. Deadliest Hunters takes a closer look at some of the animals that have led the way in refining their skills as masterful huntsmen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i3bzykWjeAmIorgsOQ78a2ZqbhR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:123435'),
  ('73174238666360659', 'Deadly Possessions', 2016, 'Reality', 'Zak Bagans', null, 'Zak Bagans, Aaron Goodwin', 'TV-PG', 'Zak Bagans is fulfilling a lifelong dream of opening a museum in downtown Las Vegas, full of the haunted, cursed objects he has been collecting through the years. Each episode features haunted, iconic items and their owners. They share stories of how these objects have terrorized them and, in some cases, even killed people. Bagans interviews the owners and works with them to get to the root of their “attachment,” so they can free themselves…or at least escape harm from these “deadly possessions.”', 'Zak Bagans is fulfilling a lifelong dream of opening a museum in downtown Las Vegas, full of the haunted, cursed objects he has been collecting through the years. Each episode features haunted, iconic items and their owners. They share stories of how these objects have terrorized them and, in some cases, even killed people. Bagans interviews the owners and works with them to get to the root of their “attachment,” so they can free themselves…or at least escape harm from these “deadly possessions.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nyeC0RH8SAS8XUu8VzyyL9PJXET.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65843'),
  ('424805785154609316', 'Deadly Secret', 1989, null, null, null, 'Roger Kwok Chun-On, Kitty Lai Mei-Han, Tse Ning, Kenneth Tsang, Maggie Chan Mei-Kei, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Kwan Ching, Andy Tai Chi-Wai', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKKCU2xVXe09IkGqufwEJMJj8o2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97761'),
  ('866318535132519406', 'Deadly Sins', 2002, 'Soap', 'Miriam de Florez Salamanca & García', null, 'Frank Ramírez', null, 'A multimillionaire fakes his death and forces his relatives to live together in his mansion for one year to see who''s worthy of inheriting his fortune.', 'A multimillionaire fakes his death and forces his relatives to live together in his mansion for one year to see who''s worthy of inheriting his fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eSIdXo9HFDCw65ZBA6SPzxGEfNF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113531'),
  ('297349510016099266', 'Deadly Ties', 2024, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Maria Dębska, Maciej Musiał, Piotr Pacek, Magdalena Lamparska, Helena Englert, Jan Englert, Joanna Balasz, Józef Pawłowski', null, 'Anka Serafin, a young anthropologist from Krakow, who escapes to the mountains in search of herself and accidentally discovers a corpse. Anka quickly becomes entangled in solving a murder mystery, and her fate is inextricably intertwined with Sebastian, a journalist looking for sensations, and Jędrek, a local policeman with whom she was close as a teenager.', 'Anka Serafin, a young anthropologist from Krakow, who escapes to the mountains in search of herself and accidentally discovers a corpse. Anka quickly becomes entangled in solving a murder mystery, and her fate is inextricably intertwined with Sebastian, a journalist looking for sensations, and Jędrek, a local policeman with whom she was close as a teenager.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aIrtJMuUfp4sbUJwrtOtOK1ZrMt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:246358'),
  ('807860813745716827', 'Deadly Tropics', 2019, 'Crime, Drama', 'Eric Eider, Ivan Piettre, Thierry Sorel', null, 'Sonia Rolland, Béatrice de la Boulaye, Julien Béramis, Valentin Papoudof, Stéphan Wojtowicz, Benjamin Douba Paris, Antoinette Giret', null, 'On the Caribbean island of Martinique, in the middle of the tropics, several mysterious murders occur. Now it is up to the two investigators Mélissa Sainte-Rose and Gaëlle Crivelli to solve the case - even if the two women have very different views of law.', 'On the Caribbean island of Martinique, in the middle of the tropics, several mysterious murders occur. Now it is up to the two investigators Mélissa Sainte-Rose and Gaëlle Crivelli to solve the case - even if the two women have very different views of law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4x2AABez2NLO3XgPaYHdJbq7nnZ.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:95705'),
  ('42796273599628039', 'Deadly Women', 2005, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'This compelling series investigates the motives and m.o. of female murderers. While males are often driven by anger, impulse and destruction, women usually have more complex, long-term reasons to kill.', 'This compelling series investigates the motives and m.o. of female murderers. While males are often driven by anger, impulse and destruction, women usually have more complex, long-term reasons to kill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ne1Juoh8EBRELP5TnhasNRFxovJ.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:15948'),
  ('604354657082353024', 'Deadman Wonderland', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Romi Park, Kana Hanazawa', 'TV-MA', 'Ganta is the only survivor after a mysterious man in red slaughters a classroom full of teenagers. He''s framed for the carnage, sentenced to die, and locked away in the most twisted prison ever built: Deadman Wonderland. And then it gets worse.', 'Ganta is the only survivor after a mysterious man in red slaughters a classroom full of teenagers. He''s framed for the carnage, sentenced to die, and locked away in the most twisted prison ever built: Deadman Wonderland. And then it gets worse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHgs3UJx5nKi7deizomDrumPxrw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42503'),
  ('527872973223755101', 'Deadtime Stories', 2012, 'Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Annette Cascone, Gina Cascone, David Hillenbrand', null, 'Jennifer Stone', 'NR', 'A baby-sitter tells a different ''Deadtime Story'' to the kids she is babysitting. The stories are scary and chilling.', 'A baby-sitter tells a different ''Deadtime Story'' to the kids she is babysitting. The stories are scary and chilling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/DiSWSRKf4x6aWVfYbewdj4dkpk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65002'),
  ('102616766231410695', 'Deadwater Fell', 2020, 'Crime, Drama', 'Daisy Coulam', null, 'David Tennant, Cush Jumbo, Anna Madeley, Matthew McNulty, Stuart Bowman, Lisa McGrillis, Laurie Brett, Selin Hizli', 'TV-14', 'When a seemingly perfect and happy family is murdered by someone they knew and trusted, cracks appear on the surface of a supposedly idyllic community.', 'When a seemingly perfect and happy family is murdered by someone they knew and trusted, cracks appear on the surface of a supposedly idyllic community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zyLTCQHh0nd5PEOPyEFUomz68BF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95442'),
  ('596810775738238929', 'Deadwind', 2018, 'Drama, Crime', 'Rike Jokela', 'Jari Rantala, Kirsi Porkka, Rike Jokela', 'Pihla Viitala, Lauri Tilkanen, Mimosa Willamo, Noa Tola, Ville Myllyrinne, Vera Kiiskinen, Saara Kotkaniemi, Sanna Stellan', 'TV-MA', 'When Sofia Karppi, a detective in her 30''s who is trying to get over her husband''s death, discovers the body of a young woman on a construction site, she triggers a chain of events that threatens to destroy her life again.', 'When Sofia Karppi, a detective in her 30''s who is trying to get over her husband''s death, discovers the body of a young woman on a construction site, she triggers a chain of events that threatens to destroy her life again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUKqWS2v7D6DVKQze2Iz2netwRH.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:74802'),
  ('508122382174724034', 'Deadwood', 2004, 'Western, Crime, Drama', 'David Milch', null, 'Timothy Olyphant, Ian McShane, Molly Parker, Jim Beaver, W. Earl Brown, Dayton Callie, Brad Dourif, Anna Gunn', 'TV-MA', 'The story of the early days of Deadwood, South Dakota; woven around actual historic events with most of the main characters based on real people. Deadwood starts as a gold mining camp and gradually turns from a lawless wild-west community into an organized wild-west civilized town. The story focuses on the real-life characters Seth Bullock and Al Swearengen.', 'The story of the early days of Deadwood, South Dakota; woven around actual historic events with most of the main characters based on real people. Deadwood starts as a gold mining camp and gradually turns from a lawless wild-west community into an organized wild-west civilized town. The story focuses on the real-life characters Seth Bullock and Al Swearengen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fWwxYAuqY4Na7fKI3Qq2nFWCwG8.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1406'),
  ('1084433389126282666', 'Deaimon: Recipe for Happiness', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Nobunaga Shimazaki, Kozue Yuuki', 'TV-14', 'Nagomu Irino returns to his Kyoto home for the first time in ten years when his father is hospitalized. Nagomu is eager to take over Ryokushou, the family''s Japanese sweet shop, but he''s instead asked to be a father figure to Itsuka Yukihira, the girl everyone calls the successor.', 'Nagomu Irino returns to his Kyoto home for the first time in ten years when his father is hospitalized. Nagomu is eager to take over Ryokushou, the family''s Japanese sweet shop, but he''s instead asked to be a father figure to Itsuka Yukihira, the girl everyone calls the successor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zXMoC8VKGGyhEtOomOndH2tmife.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:123818'),
  ('813757480977388231', 'Deal or No Deal', 2005, 'Comedy, Family, Reality', 'John de Mol', null, 'Howie Mandel, Leyla Milani', 'TV-PG', 'A contestant must choose from 26 sealed briefcases containing a marker for various amounts of cash from one penny to $1 million. The player then eliminates the remaining 25 cases one by one. The chosen ones are opened and the amount of money inside revealed. After several cases are opened, the player is tempted by the Banker to accept an offer of cash in exchange for not continuing the game and possibly winning a larger sum of money.', 'A contestant must choose from 26 sealed briefcases containing a marker for various amounts of cash from one penny to $1 million. The player then eliminates the remaining 25 cases one by one. The chosen ones are opened and the amount of money inside revealed. After several cases are opened, the player is tempted by the Banker to accept an offer of cash in exchange for not continuing the game and possibly winning a larger sum of money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bWi2Lw8adsHbYsVj09a1IYOkqP1.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:4946'),
  ('213585847519657652', 'Dealer', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Ange Basterga, Nicolas Lopez', null, 'Abdramane Diakité, Mohamed Boudouh, Sébastien Houbani', 'TV-MA', 'Tensions erupt when two filmmakers infiltrate an area ruled by gangs to shoot a music video for a rapper in this gritty found-footage series.', 'Tensions erupt when two filmmakers infiltrate an area ruled by gangs to shoot a music video for a rapper in this gritty found-footage series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQstisZnYgpZc8FhpnpxH3Xs1KZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:118241'),
  ('1004263873987980927', 'Dealing with Mikadono Sisters Is a Breeze', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Minami Hinata, Yurina Amami, Aoi Koga, Yoshino Aoyama, Masaya Matsukaze, Ai Kayano', 'TV-14', 'Yu Ayase, son of a late legendary actress, is overwhelmingly mediocre. When he’s invited to stay with his mother’s friend, Yu is shocked to find out that he’ll be living with three prodigy sisters who possess both beauty and talent…and who rule his new school as the Three Emperors. Can Yu manage to melt the sisters’ cold hearts and fulfill his mother’s last wish for him to build a happy family?', 'Yu Ayase, son of a late legendary actress, is overwhelmingly mediocre. When he’s invited to stay with his mother’s friend, Yu is shocked to find out that he’ll be living with three prodigy sisters who possess both beauty and talent…and who rule his new school as the Three Emperors. Can Yu manage to melt the sisters’ cold hearts and fulfill his mother’s last wish for him to build a happy family?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7JMW8B6JqARUxc01h6mctKp1TFv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:272556'),
  ('194124253243995905', 'Dear Brother', 1991, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Hiroko Kasahara, Keiko Toda, Kenyu Horiuchi, Mami Koyama, Masako Katsuki, Sakiko Tamagawa, Sumi Shimamoto, Tessyo Genda', 'TV-Y', 'It’s Nanako’s first day at Seiran Academy, a prestigious all-girl’s high school famous for its exclusive and elegant “Sorority.” Only ten members will be accepted this year, and competition is fierce! Despite seeming fairly unremarkable on the surface, Nanako is selected as a member – instantly making her a target for her jealous and angry classmates. But the bullying doesn’t stop Nanako from forming friendships with the three most popular students, and even falling in love.', 'It’s Nanako’s first day at Seiran Academy, a prestigious all-girl’s high school famous for its exclusive and elegant “Sorority.” Only ten members will be accepted this year, and competition is fierce! Despite seeming fairly unremarkable on the surface, Nanako is selected as a member – instantly making her a target for her jealous and angry classmates. But the bullying doesn’t stop Nanako from forming friendships with the three most popular students, and even falling in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LctqDMyuDfWyQFh3KriMX2eev9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:36588'),
  ('942532658335669332', 'Dear Child', 2023, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Isabel Kleefeld, Julian Pörksen', 'Isabel Kleefeld, Julian Pörksen', 'Kim Riedle, Naila Schuberth, Sammy Schrein, Hans Löw, Haley Louise Jones, Justus von Dohnányi, Julika Jenkins, Nagmeh Alaei', 'TV-MA', 'A mysterious woman''s escape from her harrowing captivity points investigators toward the dark truth behind an unsolved disappearance 13 years earlier.', 'A mysterious woman''s escape from her harrowing captivity points investigators toward the dark truth behind an unsolved disappearance 13 years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBj5EsnoClhEhnspe4YTV6Gs624.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:229221'),
  ('966964676837261537', 'Dear Doctor, I''m Coming For Soul', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Nirattisai Ratphithak', null, 'Nutchapon Rattanamongkol, Kasidej Hongladaromp, Pavadee Komchokpaisan, Patsit Permpoonsavat, Weerapat Termmaneerat, Pat Chatburirak, Numchok Thanatram, Surasak Chaiaat', null, 'Dr. Prakam, a dedicated surgeon, faces an unexpected visitor—Death itself. As they clash daily, an unlikely love begins to blossom between them, defying fate.', 'Dr. Prakam, a dedicated surgeon, faces an unexpected visitor—Death itself. As they clash daily, an unlikely love begins to blossom between them, defying fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wBDBpvEa7UwstYC7uZqhgnSPvxv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:195267'),
  ('141286041780973532', 'Dear Edward', 2023, 'Drama', 'Jason Katims', null, 'Colin O''Brien, Taylor Schilling, Anna Uzele, Idris Debrand, Carter Hudson, Amy Forsyth, Maxwell Jenkins, Connie Britton', 'TV-MA', 'A 12-year-old boy becomes the lone survivor of a plane crash. As he and others affected by the tragedy try to make sense of what happened, unexpected friendships, romances, and communities are formed.', 'A 12-year-old boy becomes the lone survivor of a plane crash. As he and others affected by the tragedy try to make sense of what happened, unexpected friendships, romances, and communities are formed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cB0g6TZaMo88ZHS9hQyLpYbbD0C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156820'),
  ('675880780695086561', 'Dear Enemy', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Gao Ye, Michelle Chen Yan-Hsi, Wan Peng, Yuan Hong, Lu Fangsheng, Lu Dongxu', null, 'Luo Man, a struggling screenwriter, reunites with her wealthy former classmate, Chen Kaixi. As their lives have taken different paths, Luo Man seeks to improve her life through marriage, while Chen Kaixi battles her own marital challenges. The rivalry between them intensifies with the arrival of the young and beautiful Zhong Qingcheng, who becomes a key figure in their evolving dynamic.', 'Luo Man, a struggling screenwriter, reunites with her wealthy former classmate, Chen Kaixi. As their lives have taken different paths, Luo Man seeks to improve her life through marriage, while Chen Kaixi battles her own marital challenges. The rivalry between them intensifies with the arrival of the young and beautiful Zhong Qingcheng, who becomes a key figure in their evolving dynamic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/erB8Jdq7cKEXU2w56TZz9ohovyg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:256888'),
  ('618735018363605501', 'Dear Hongrang', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Kim Hong-sun, Kim Jin-a', null, 'Lee Jae-wook, Cho Bo-ah, Jung Ga-ram, Uhm Ji-won, Park Byung-eun, Kim Jae-uck, Park Myung-hoon, Jo Jae-yun', 'TV-MA', 'When a long-missing heir returns with lost memories, love and suspicion entwine. Is he truly Hongrang, or a stranger disturbing hearts and family ties?', 'When a long-missing heir returns with lost memories, love and suspicion entwine. Is he truly Hongrang, or a stranger disturbing hearts and family ties?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mWGil4jL1jaCoZkZuaNThh0aoVC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:224819'),
  ('292611302273164120', 'Dear Hyeri', 2024, 'Drama', 'Han Ga-ram, Jung Jee-hyun', 'Han Ga-ram', 'Shin Hye-sun, Lee Jin-uk, Kang Hoon, Jo Hye-joo, Kang Sang-jun, Fila Lee, Jeon Bae-soo, Yoon Ju-man', null, 'Ju Eun-ho is an unknown announcer with 14 years of experience. She struggles to get the chance to have her name recognized by the public. She also has another personality, Ju Hae-ri, due to a deep wound in her heart. Her alter-ego, Ju Hae-ri, is super positive and works as a parking attendant. Jeong Hyun-oh is Ju Eun-ho''s ex-boyfriend; they dated for a long time but broke up. He became a star announcer as soon as he joined the broadcasting station and is the most-liked announcer by the public, but Jeong Hyun-oh also carries a hidden wound in his mind that he has never shown to anyone. Somehow, Ju Eun-ho and Jeong Hyun-oh reunite and help cure each other''s wounds.', 'Ju Eun-ho is an unknown announcer with 14 years of experience. She struggles to get the chance to have her name recognized by the public. She also has another personality, Ju Hae-ri, due to a deep wound in her heart. Her alter-ego, Ju Hae-ri, is super positive and works as a parking attendant. Jeong Hyun-oh is Ju Eun-ho''s ex-boyfriend; they dated for a long time but broke up. He became a star announcer as soon as he joined the broadcasting station and is the most-liked announcer by the public, but Jeong Hyun-oh also carries a hidden wound in his mind that he has never shown to anyone. Somehow, Ju Eun-ho and Jeong Hyun-oh reunite and help cure each other''s wounds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x4RhXu2mu3PxiqxdWLaUQU81Qz1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:246808'),
  ('1034046930545716844', 'Dear John', 1988, 'Comedy', 'John Sullivan', null, 'Judd Hirsch, Jere Burns, Jane Carr, Isabella Hofmann, Billie Bird, Susan Walters, Tom Willett, William O''Leary', null, 'Dear John starred Judd Hirsch as easygoing Drake Prep high school teacher John Lacey who is dumped by his wife, Wendy, via a Dear John letter. Wendy ends up with everything in the divorce settlement, including custody of the couple''s son, forcing John to move into an apartment in Ozone Park, Queens. John soon joins the One-2-One Club, a self help group for divorced, widowed or lonely people. The group is led by Louise (Jane Carr), a sex-obsessed British woman. Other members of the group include Kate McCarron (Isabella Hofmann), a sweet divorcée; Kirk Morris (Jere Burns), a cocky ladies'' man; Ralph Drang (Harry Groener), a shy and neurotic tollbooth collector; Bonnie Philbert (Billie Bird), a feisty senior citizen; and Tom, Mrs. Philbert''s quiet boyfriend (Tom Willett).', 'Dear John starred Judd Hirsch as easygoing Drake Prep high school teacher John Lacey who is dumped by his wife, Wendy, via a Dear John letter. Wendy ends up with everything in the divorce settlement, including custody of the couple''s son, forcing John to move into an apartment in Ozone Park, Queens. John soon joins the One-2-One Club, a self help group for divorced, widowed or lonely people. The group is led by Louise (Jane Carr), a sex-obsessed British woman. Other members of the group include Kate McCarron (Isabella Hofmann), a sweet divorcée; Kirk Morris (Jere Burns), a cocky ladies'' man; Ralph Drang (Harry Groener), a shy and neurotic tollbooth collector; Bonnie Philbert (Billie Bird), a feisty senior citizen; and Tom, Mrs. Philbert''s quiet boyfriend (Tom Willett).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4P8x0k5O7SOFkZB6e9y3IJHR7p.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:10838'),
  ('278678295151645078', 'Dear Killer Nannies', 2026, 'Drama, Crime', 'Sebastian Marroquin, Pablo Farina, Sebastián Ortega', null, 'Janer Villareal, Miguel Tamayo, Miguel Ángel García, Sebastian Marroquin, John Leguizamo', 'TV-MA', 'Juan Pablo, Pablo Escobar''s son, has an atypical childhood and lives surrounded by hitmen who work as his nannies. He idealizes his father, considering him a benefactor, but as he grows up, he learns that his father is, in fact, a criminal.', 'Juan Pablo, Pablo Escobar''s son, has an atypical childhood and lives surrounded by hitmen who work as his nannies. He idealizes his father, considering him a benefactor, but as he grows up, he learns that his father is, in fact, a criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGRezoCqNtiKwNDB9hszImOs6ut.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:313721'),
  ('405465151133182812', 'Dear Mama', 2023, 'Documentary', null, 'Allen Hughes, Lasse Järvi', 'Tupac Shakur, Afeni Shakur, Gloria Cox, Eminem, Mike Tyson, Dr. Dre, Snoop Dogg', 'TV-MA', 'Explore the history of activist Afeni Shakur and hip-hop icon Tupac Shakur, two voices that could not be silenced. Told through the eyes of the people who knew them best, this series is an intimate wide-angle portrait of the most inspiring and dangerous mother-son duo in American history, whose unified message of freedom, equality, persecution and justice are more relevant today than ever.', 'Explore the history of activist Afeni Shakur and hip-hop icon Tupac Shakur, two voices that could not be silenced. Told through the eyes of the people who knew them best, this series is an intimate wide-angle portrait of the most inspiring and dangerous mother-son duo in American history, whose unified message of freedom, equality, persecution and justice are more relevant today than ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2XFAe9VqjJ9F7QozukQtFdnARQP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:201581'),
  ('798736223355629194', 'Dear Missy', 2020, 'Drama', null, 'Jieru Ding, Yan Sun', 'Li Yitong, Jin Chen, Zhang Chao, Sunny Sun, Chen Haolan, Ji Li, Li Huan, Zhai Guanhua', null, 'Story of two best friends Lu Ke and Shen Si Yi, who has contrasting personalities but are each other''s closest friends. Their relationship broke down during graduation but nine years later they meet and reconcile. The two encouraged each other, faced difficulties, and overcome the setbacks in work and life together.', 'Story of two best friends Lu Ke and Shen Si Yi, who has contrasting personalities but are each other''s closest friends. Their relationship broke down during graduation but nine years later they meet and reconcile. The two encouraged each other, faced difficulties, and overcome the setbacks in work and life together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLn5Rjxao8R9ZlUC7QBnU1oypCp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:115013'),
  ('22155098276360391', 'Dear My Friends', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Noh Hee-kyung', 'Noh Hee-kyung', 'Ko Hyun-jung, Youn Yuh-jung, Na Moon-hee, Goh Doo-shim, Kim Hye-ja, Park Won-sook, Kim Yeong-ok, Joo Hyun', 'TV-MA', 'Life is ever-delightful — and ever-challenging — for a group of friends in their twilight years as they rediscover themselves through love and family.', 'Life is ever-delightful — and ever-challenging — for a group of friends in their twilight years as they rediscover themselves through love and family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bTQk4YZMESbHs3NlhBPBpcQp1Tn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66434'),
  ('1046005442612893416', 'Dear Radiance', 2024, 'Drama', 'Oishi Suzuka', 'Shizuka Oishi', 'Yuriko Yoshitaka, Tasuku Emoto, Goro Kishitani, Ryoko Kuninaka, Mahiro Takasugi, Yasunori Danta, Kotono Mitsuishi, Arata Iura', null, 'Murasaki Shikibu (Yoshitaka Yuriko), the heroine of this story, wrote the bestseller ''The Tale of Genji,'' transcending a thousand years during the Heian period. She weaves the story of Hikaru Genji, fueled by her love for Fujiwara no Michinaga (Emoto Tasuku), with her hidden passion and incomparable imagination. It is a tale of a woman who lived with unchanging love in an ever-changing world. (From TV JAPAN)', 'Murasaki Shikibu (Yoshitaka Yuriko), the heroine of this story, wrote the bestseller ''The Tale of Genji,'' transcending a thousand years during the Heian period. She weaves the story of Hikaru Genji, fueled by her love for Fujiwara no Michinaga (Emoto Tasuku), with her hidden passion and incomparable imagination. It is a tale of a woman who lived with unchanging love in an ever-changing world. (From TV JAPAN)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qmp4cH94zbQsjj5bCXlgQT20uYY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:239790'),
  ('1149540193510174830', 'Dear Sister', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', null, null, 'Satomi Ishihara, Nao Matsushita, Takanori Iwata, Kanna Mori, Seiichi Tanabe, Nagisa Katahira, Hiroyuki Hirayama, Sato Ayagi', 'NR', 'Growing up, sisters Misaki and Hazuki couldn''t have been more different. Misaki''s charming personality and popularity stood in sharp contrast to the older, more responsible yet timid Hazuki. After high school, the two lose touch once Misaki leaves their home, only to be reunited many years later, when Misaki returns, harboring a secret.', 'Growing up, sisters Misaki and Hazuki couldn''t have been more different. Misaki''s charming personality and popularity stood in sharp contrast to the older, more responsible yet timid Hazuki. After high school, the two lose touch once Misaki leaves their home, only to be reunited many years later, when Misaki returns, harboring a secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/edpOGTAcMjJm9IupI6xZ6S0Mf9t.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61669'),
  ('340051012540807855', 'Dear Utol', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, null, null, '"Dear Utol" is a Filipino series where a charismatic older male figure offers advice and entertainment, tackling everyday dilemmas with wisdom and humor', '"Dear Utol" is a Filipino series where a charismatic older male figure offers advice and entertainment, tackling everyday dilemmas with wisdom and humor', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uUA7MnIXM0CJODR5x4RiscyPBQ6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:290039'),
  ('951143705516472723', 'Dear White People', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Justin Simien', null, 'Logan Browning, Brandon P Bell, DeRon Horton, Antoinette Robertson, John Patrick Amedori, Ashley Blaine Featherson, Marque Richardson, Giancarlo Esposito', 'TV-MA', 'At a predominantly white Ivy League college, a diverse group of students navigate various forms of racial and other types of discrimination.', 'At a predominantly white Ivy League college, a diverse group of students navigate various forms of racial and other types of discrimination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thHk9AncE8g2Hsb1iK1xHnlq23j.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:70767'),
  ('968867854860003259', 'Dear X', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Ban Ji-woon', 'Choi Ja-won', 'Kim Yoo-jung, Kim Young-dae, Kim Do-hoon, Lee Yul-eum', null, 'Behind a beautiful face hides a cruel nature—Baek Ah-jin, who sees through and manipulates others'' hearts. After stepping on the sacrifices of many to reach the top, everything begins to change the moment she arrives there. A woman wearing a mask to escape hell and climb to the highest place. And the story of the Xs being brutally crushed by her.', 'Behind a beautiful face hides a cruel nature—Baek Ah-jin, who sees through and manipulates others'' hearts. After stepping on the sacrifices of many to reach the top, everything begins to change the moment she arrives there. A woman wearing a mask to escape hell and climb to the highest place. And the story of the Xs being brutally crushed by her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j2w2PZ5JHEv0HUXwrhsToYiTP4r.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:256226'),
  ('1060640856203572900', 'Dear X Who Doesn''t Love Me', 2022, 'Drama', 'Ko Jae-hong, Wang Hye-ji', 'Ko Jae-hong, Wang Hye-ji', 'Han Ji-hyo, Doyoung, Kwon Ah-reum, Bang Jae-min, Son Hyun-woo, Kim Ji-hoon', null, 'Hee-soo finds out that her crush is dating a freshman. After drinking her sorrows away with her best friend Si-ho, a lyrics note that Hee-soo has never seen before catches her eyes. She opens it and writes down a love lyric inspired by her crush. The next day, Hee-soo finds out that the lyrics she wrote on how and when she wants to be asked out become true in a real life. Despite some drawbacks of the note, will Hee-soo use the note till the end enjoying the joy of dating her lovers or will Si-ho, the only one to know about the note, stop her?', 'Hee-soo finds out that her crush is dating a freshman. After drinking her sorrows away with her best friend Si-ho, a lyrics note that Hee-soo has never seen before catches her eyes. She opens it and writes down a love lyric inspired by her crush. The next day, Hee-soo finds out that the lyrics she wrote on how and when she wants to be asked out become true in a real life. Despite some drawbacks of the note, will Hee-soo use the note till the end enjoying the joy of dating her lovers or will Si-ho, the only one to know about the note, stop her?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDkpyUchwXXorc7ins9TiFBpce8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204590'),
  ('1074199072036437092', 'Dear.M', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Lee Seul', 'Park Hye-su, Jaehyun, Roh Jeong-eui, Bae Hyeon-seong, Lee Jin-hyuk, Woo Da-vi, Kwon Eun-bin, Hwang Bo-reum-byeol', 'TV-14', 'Campus life at Seoyeon University has always been relatively peaceful, but when an anonymous post pops up on the school’s online community, the entire campus is flipped upside down.', 'Campus life at Seoyeon University has always been relatively peaceful, but when an anonymous post pops up on the school’s online community, the entire campus is flipped upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ikfRBUtlq5Zf38Qseyk4VxkLNsg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:116377'),
  ('175883419937033969', 'Dearest', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Ayuko Tsukahara', null, 'Yuriko Yoshitaka, Kouhei Matsushita, Arata Iura, Mitsuhiro Oikawa, Hiroko Yakushimaru, Minami Tanaka, Yui Sakuma, Fumiya Takahashi', 'TV-14', 'Rio Sanada is the president of "Sanada Wellness" and an up-and-coming businesswoman who is selected as one of the "100 people in their 30s who will change the world". She is reunited with her former love interest Daiki Miyazaki, who is now a detective, after 15 years as an important witness to a murder case. In Gifu Prefecture in 2006, Rio is a third-year high-school student who wants to go to the University of Tokyo. She took good care of her younger brother in lieu of their busy father. Before Daiki could confess to her, an incident occurs at the dormitory.', 'Rio Sanada is the president of "Sanada Wellness" and an up-and-coming businesswoman who is selected as one of the "100 people in their 30s who will change the world". She is reunited with her former love interest Daiki Miyazaki, who is now a detective, after 15 years as an important witness to a murder case. In Gifu Prefecture in 2006, Rio is a third-year high-school student who wants to go to the University of Tokyo. She took good care of her younger brother in lieu of their busy father. Before Daiki could confess to her, an incident occurs at the dormitory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5VyZAGbzKYM4XFaytRE0o8SWB0l.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135730'),
  ('112973777341085406', 'DearS', 2004, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kisho Taniyama, Ai Shimizu, Chiwa Saito, Mai Nakahara, Kikuko Inoue, Kappei Yamaguchi, Miyuki Sawashiro, Ryoko Shintani', null, 'One year ago, a UFO containing 150 aliens crash-landed off the shores of Kasai. Because no one could fix their ship, the Japanese Government decided to bestow upon them the designation "DearS" and make them into Japanese citizens. One morning, a truck carrying a capsule that housed one of the aliens ends up dropping it into the riverbank, releasing her from her confinement. She is eventually found by a high school student named Takeya Ikuhara, who saves her, despite being extremely distrustful of their race and wanting nothing to do with them. Upon being named Ren, she imprints upon him as her "Master" and serves as his personal "Slave," leaving him with a "DearS" who wants to remain with him no matter what.', 'One year ago, a UFO containing 150 aliens crash-landed off the shores of Kasai. Because no one could fix their ship, the Japanese Government decided to bestow upon them the designation "DearS" and make them into Japanese citizens. One morning, a truck carrying a capsule that housed one of the aliens ends up dropping it into the riverbank, releasing her from her confinement. She is eventually found by a high school student named Takeya Ikuhara, who saves her, despite being extremely distrustful of their race and wanting nothing to do with them. Upon being named Ren, she imprints upon him as her "Master" and serves as his personal "Slave," leaving him with a "DearS" who wants to remain with him no matter what.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqquMDIzWC1oAQ6XvKKF8OzBx8K.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:30180'),
  ('1048580441018321636', 'Death and Nightingales', 2018, 'Drama', 'Allan Cubitt', null, 'Matthew Rhys, Ann Skelly, Jamie Dornan, Valene Kane, Charlene McKenna, Francis Magee, Sean McGinley, Martin McCann', 'TV-MA', 'Fermanagh, Irish countryside, 1885. On her 23rd birthday, Beth, who lives on a remote farm with Billy Winters, her tyrannical stepfather, whom she can barely stand, prepares to flee from such a suffocating life with the help of the seductive Liam Ward, without being aware that her decision will unearth deeply buried secrets a long time ago.', 'Fermanagh, Irish countryside, 1885. On her 23rd birthday, Beth, who lives on a remote farm with Billy Winters, her tyrannical stepfather, whom she can barely stand, prepares to flee from such a suffocating life with the help of the seductive Liam Ward, without being aware that her decision will unearth deeply buried secrets a long time ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZ2uK5oe5AEmCbNplUmX76pWWg6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84534'),
  ('273164747143026887', 'Death and Other Details', 2024, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Mike Weiss, Heidi Cole McAdams', null, 'Violett Beane, Lauren Patten, Rahul Kohli, Angela Zhou, Hugo Diego Garcia, Pardis Saremi, Linda Emond, Mandy Patinkin', 'TV-MA', 'How do you solve a murder in a post-fact world? Especially when sailing the Mediterranean on an ocean liner filled with the wealthy and powerful. Everyone on board is hiding something… but is one of them a killer? That’s what the world’s once greatest detective, Rufus Cotesworth, and his protégée, Imogene, aim to discover.', 'How do you solve a murder in a post-fact world? Especially when sailing the Mediterranean on an ocean liner filled with the wealthy and powerful. Everyone on board is hiding something… but is one of them a killer? That’s what the world’s once greatest detective, Rufus Cotesworth, and his protégée, Imogene, aim to discover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2DEa0Bz3j9ZhPRdBmNyco38OR6p.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:133813'),
  ('742580052908969209', 'Death by Lightning', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Mike Makowsky', 'Mike Makowsky', 'Michael Shannon, Matthew Macfadyen, Nick Offerman, Shea Whigham, Bradley Whitford, Betty Gilpin, Alfie Tempest, Anders Grundberg', 'TV-MA', 'The story of James Garfield, who rose from obscurity to become America''s 20th President — and Charles Guiteau, the man who assassinated him.', 'The story of James Garfield, who rose from obscurity to become America''s 20th President — and Charles Guiteau, the man who assassinated him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/KyUrz3GA1FML3XnKkY795XxDxN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:245219'),
  ('940859834092391477', 'Death by Magic', 2018, 'Reality', 'Drummond Money-Coutts', null, 'Drummond Money-Coutts', 'TV-MA', 'Magician Drummond Money-Coutts travels the globe, sharing his infectious love of his craft and attempting feats that proved fatal to other magicians.', 'Magician Drummond Money-Coutts travels the globe, sharing his infectious love of his craft and attempting feats that proved fatal to other magicians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ic8ANhZGZt04X8uB1pt3rTjVOZ1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84552'),
  ('1115191586773531837', 'Death Comes to Pemberley', 2013, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Juliette Towhidi', null, 'Matthew Rhys, Anna Maxwell Martin, Matthew Goode, Trevor Eve, Jenna Coleman, Oliver Rix, Tom Ward, Eleanor Tomlinson', 'TV-14', 'A British television drama based on P. D. James'' novel of the same name, a murder mystery sequel to Jane Austen''s Pride and Prejudice. Six years after the union of Elizabeth Bennet and Mr. Darcy, Lydia Wickham barges into Pemberley screaming that her husband has been murdered.', 'A British television drama based on P. D. James'' novel of the same name, a murder mystery sequel to Jane Austen''s Pride and Prejudice. Six years after the union of Elizabeth Bennet and Mr. Darcy, Lydia Wickham barges into Pemberley screaming that her husband has been murdered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2oNFYBQ4kkW5XNalWWxOvmDmnTY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:56484'),
  ('1025595260709533829', 'Death in Paradise', 2011, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Robert Thorogood', null, 'Don Warrington, Élisabeth Bourgine, Shantol Jackson, Don Gilet, Shaquille Ali-Yebuah, Catherine Garton', 'TV-14', 'A brilliant but idiosyncratic British detective and his resourceful local team solve baffling murder mysteries on the fictional Caribbean island of Saint Marie.', 'A brilliant but idiosyncratic British detective and his resourceful local team solve baffling murder mysteries on the fictional Caribbean island of Saint Marie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7t6vCyqAdD5hE4eEfTrZmVljDi.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:41956'),
  ('928187705153844131', 'Death in the Dorms', 2023, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'These are the stories of the kind of danger that no college student is ever prepared for: a life cut short just when it was getting started, not by accident but by foul play. Each procedural episode of “Death in the Dorms” will examine a different murder of a college student in the U.S.', 'These are the stories of the kind of danger that no college student is ever prepared for: a life cut short just when it was getting started, not by accident but by foul play. Each procedural episode of “Death in the Dorms” will examine a different murder of a college student in the U.S.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwNn6YDaGsoX9QYyeKqAXqIGtsz.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:206816'),
  ('180299113360327850', 'Death Inc.', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Julián Sastre, Nando Abad, Alberto Caballero', null, 'Carlos Areces, Gerald B. Fillmore, Aitziber Garmendia, Ascen López, Diego Martín, Salva Reina, Roque Ruiz, Amaia Salamanca', 'TV-PG', 'When the founder of Torregrosa Funeral Home dies, his scheming right-hand man is poised to take over the business. But the owner''s widow has other plans.', 'When the founder of Torregrosa Funeral Home dies, his scheming right-hand man is poised to take over the business. But the owner''s widow has other plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g6vptk7afH3OHOKSjdjJJtEoOMh.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:237964'),
  ('1108973116698266470', 'Death March to the Parallel World Rhapsody', 2018, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Rie Takahashi, Shun Horie, Hiyori Kouno, Kaya Okuno, Minami Tsuda, Kiyono Yasuno, Airi Eino, Aoi Yuuki', 'TV-PG', '29-year-old programmer Suzuki Ichirou finds himself transported into a fantasy RPG. Within the game, he''s a 15-year-old named Satou. At first he thinks he''s dreaming, but his experiences seem very real. Due to a powerful ability he possesses with limited use, he ends up wiping out an army of lizard men and becomes a high leveled adventurer. Satou decides to hide his level, and plans to live peacefully and meet new people. However, developments in the game''s story, such as the return of a demon king, may cause a nuisance to Satou''s plans.', '29-year-old programmer Suzuki Ichirou finds himself transported into a fantasy RPG. Within the game, he''s a 15-year-old named Satou. At first he thinks he''s dreaming, but his experiences seem very real. Due to a powerful ability he possesses with limited use, he ends up wiping out an army of lizard men and becomes a high leveled adventurer. Satou decides to hide his level, and plans to live peacefully and meet new people. However, developments in the game''s story, such as the return of a demon king, may cause a nuisance to Satou''s plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVJUCmI7s22BtolCd0QoAztaGU1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:76122'),
  ('576235021437661186', 'Death Note', 2006, 'Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mamoru Miyano, Shido Nakamura, Aya Hirano, Kappei Yamaguchi, Kimiko Saito, Naoya Uchida, Ryou Naitou, Keiji Fujiwara', 'TV-14', 'Light Yagami is an ace student with great prospects—and he’s bored out of his mind. But all that changes when he finds the Death Note, a notebook dropped by a rogue Shinigami death god. Any human whose name is written in the notebook dies, and Light has vowed to use the power of the Death Note to rid the world of evil. But will Light succeed in his noble goal, or will the Death Note turn him into the very thing he fights against?', 'Light Yagami is an ace student with great prospects—and he’s bored out of his mind. But all that changes when he finds the Death Note, a notebook dropped by a rogue Shinigami death god. Any human whose name is written in the notebook dies, and Light has vowed to use the power of the Death Note to rid the world of evil. But will Light succeed in his noble goal, or will the Death Note turn him into the very thing he fights against?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCZFfYTIwrR7n94J6G14Y4hAFU6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13916'),
  ('513346329245702928', 'Death Note', 2015, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Masataka Kubota, Kento Yamazaki, Mio Yuki, Hinako Sano, Reiko Fujiwara, Megumi Seki, Tomohisa Yuge, Shugo Oshinari', 'TV-14', 'Light Yagami is an ordinary university student. One day, he receives a "Death Note", which changes his life. The Death Note awakens his warped sense of justice and genius. He becomes murderer Kira and punishes criminals. L is a well known private detective. L appears in front of Light Yagami. L defines Kira as evil and decides to catch Kira. Then N, who has a beautiful appearance but dangerous existence, appears.', 'Light Yagami is an ordinary university student. One day, he receives a "Death Note", which changes his life. The Death Note awakens his warped sense of justice and genius. He becomes murderer Kira and punishes criminals. L is a well known private detective. L appears in front of Light Yagami. L defines Kira as evil and decides to catch Kira. Then N, who has a beautiful appearance but dangerous existence, appears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4hA8qcsmwgVpSCRmDGeW3WsCxol.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63648'),
  ('31149614730973977', 'Death Note: New Generation', 2016, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Sosuke Ikematsu, Masaki Suda, Masahiro Higashide, Rina Kawaei, Shido Nakamura, Mina Fujii, Sota Aoyama', null, 'The miniseries focuses on the three new lead characters of the film Death Note: Light Up the NEW World: Tsukuru Mishima, Ryuzaki, and Yuki Shien. Each episode provides backstory for one of the characters and bridges the 10-year gap between the previous films, which canonically took place in 2005-2006, and the new film taking place in 2016.', 'The miniseries focuses on the three new lead characters of the film Death Note: Light Up the NEW World: Tsukuru Mishima, Ryuzaki, and Yuki Shien. Each episode provides backstory for one of the characters and bridges the 10-year gap between the previous films, which canonically took place in 2005-2006, and the new film taking place in 2016.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pBmyiClgT5PJv4W58av4JMOnPyA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78004'),
  ('128256615898959534', 'Death of a Pilgrim', 2013, 'Drama, Crime', null, 'Sara Heldt, Johan Widerberg', 'Rolf Lassgård, Helena af Sandeberg, Kjell Bergqvist, Jonas Karlsson, Claes Malmberg, Ellen Jelinek, Johannes Brost, Henrik Norlén', null, 'A newly put-together police force tries to solve the old mystery of the murder of Swedish Prime Minister Olof Palme in 1986.', 'A newly put-together police force tries to solve the old mystery of the murder of Swedish Prime Minister Olof Palme in 1986.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6j9HLyfhueTj25ekgEQFNfaYjoi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:52158'),
  ('802016096456191590', 'Death Parade', 2015, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery', null, 'Yuzuru Tachikawa', 'Asami Seto, Tomoaki Maeno, Misa Kato, Yuna Taniguchi, Atsumi Tanezaki, Koki Uchiyama, Shota Yamamoto, Rumi Okubo', 'TV-MA', 'There is a place after death that’s neither heaven nor hell. A bar that serves you one chance to win. You cannot leave until the game is over, and when it is, your life may be too.', 'There is a place after death that’s neither heaven nor hell. A bar that serves you one chance to win. You cannot leave until the game is over, and when it is, your life may be too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q95PaZEpjfNzmz3c0TFFAG6lc7S.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61901'),
  ('666177806830252480', 'Death to Spies', 2019, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, null, null, null, '1941. Georgy Volkov, Captain of the State Security Service, is delivering to the Soviet Union a consignment of emeralds under a trade agreement between the USSR and Germany.', '1941. Georgy Volkov, Captain of the State Security Service, is delivering to the Soviet Union a consignment of emeralds under a trade agreement between the USSR and Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66vXEMs2McaMzLQO8hL1xiUHeY7.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:105550'),
  ('84806345161414283', 'Death Valley', 2011, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Eric Weinberg, Curtis Gwinn', null, 'Tania Raymonde, Texas Battle, Bryce Johnson, Charlie Sanders, Caity Lotz, Bryan Callen, Jason Varge', 'TV-14', 'A year ago, vampires, werewolves and zombies mysteriously descended upon the streets of California''s San Fernando Valley. The Undead Task Force (UTF) was created to combat the emergence of monsters.', 'A year ago, vampires, werewolves and zombies mysteriously descended upon the streets of California''s San Fernando Valley. The Undead Task Force (UTF) was created to combat the emergence of monsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fPKQ4dWFMfjLOBQsHyebaWkfWyh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40245'),
  ('84563417253748552', 'Death Valley', 2025, 'Mystery, Drama, Comedy', 'Paul Doolan', null, 'Timothy Spall, Gwyneth Keyworth, Steffan Rhodri, Alexandria Riley, Melanie Walters, Remy Beasley, Mike Bubbins, Rithvik Andugula', null, 'Thrown together by the murder of John''s neighbour, John and Janie are an odd, yet hilarious duo with opposing instincts. Every week, they get to the bottom of gripping murders, with various stunning Welsh locations providing a backdrop to their investigations.', 'Thrown together by the murder of John''s neighbour, John and Janie are an odd, yet hilarious duo with opposing instincts. Every week, they get to the bottom of gripping murders, with various stunning Welsh locations providing a backdrop to their investigations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i27oab0wG0b9z41TidHhLVcAmji.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:254897'),
  ('502025697353258832', 'Death''s Game', 2023, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ha Byung-hoon', null, 'Seo In-guk, Park So-dam, Kim Ji-hoon, Kim Jae-uck, Kim Mi-kyeong, Jung Yong-ju', 'TV-MA', 'At the brink of going to hell, Yee-jae must cycle through twelve separate lives and twelve separate deaths in this reincarnation drama.', 'At the brink of going to hell, Yee-jae must cycle through twelve separate lives and twelve separate deaths in this reincarnation drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecM5MY9g2mF6x5SrB2QWOYkcH98.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218230'),
  ('495386922727428643', 'Deathstroke: Knights & Dragons', 2020, 'Animation', null, null, 'Michael Chiklis, Sasha Alexander', null, 'Ten years ago, Slade Wilson-aka the super-assassin called Deathstroke-made a tragic mistake and his wife and son paid a terrible price. Now, a decade later, Wilson''s family is threatened once again by the murderous Jackal and the terrorists of H.IV.E. Can Deathstroke atone for the sins of the past-or will his family pay the ultimate price?', 'Ten years ago, Slade Wilson-aka the super-assassin called Deathstroke-made a tragic mistake and his wife and son paid a terrible price. Now, a decade later, Wilson''s family is threatened once again by the murderous Jackal and the terrorists of H.IV.E. Can Deathstroke atone for the sins of the past-or will his family pay the ultimate price?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WCsBrznq1RLteXUTsiqP3AYKXt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97456'),
  ('945999640162296388', 'Debris', 2021, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'J. H. Wyman', null, 'Jonathan Tucker, Riann Steele, Norbert Leo Butz, Scroobius Pip', 'TV-14', 'Two federal agents from two different continents, and two different mindsets, must work together to investigate when wreckage from a destroyed alien spacecraft has mysterious effects on humankind.', 'Two federal agents from two different continents, and two different mindsets, must work together to investigate when wreckage from a destroyed alien spacecraft has mysterious effects on humankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cILrZGHgsIEpZ6VKEB3VwC2CadB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106159'),
  ('403381188187588060', 'Debts Of A Life Time', 1995, 'Drama', null, null, 'Jackie Lui Chung-Yin, Hilary Tsui Ho-Ying, Gigi Fu Ming-Hin, Law Lok-Lam, Gordon Lam Ka-Tung, Marco Ngai Chun-Git, Benz Hui Siu-Hung, Mary Hon Ma-Lee', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sB1PtPvNazovMpRPzvOf9Q6mIal.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109832'),
  ('7413431185409535', 'Deca-Dence', 2020, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mei Shibata, Tomori Kusunoki, Katsuyuki Konishi, Eiji Takeuchi, Yoshino Aoyama, Kohsuke Toriumi, Eri Kitamura, Takehito Koyasu', 'TV-14', 'Many years have passed since humanity was driven to the brink of extinction by the sudden emergence of the unknown life forms Gadoll. Those humans that survived now dwell in a 3000m-high mobile fortress Deca-dence built to protect themselves from the Gadoll threat. Denizens of Deca-dence fall into two categories: Gears, warriors who fight the Gadoll daily, and Tankers, those without the skills to fight. One day, Natsume, a Tanker girl who dreams of becoming a Gear meets surly Kaburagi, an armor repairman of Deca-dence. This chance meeting between the seemingly two opposites, the girl with a positive attitude who never gives up on her dreams and the realist who has given up on his, will eventually shake the future course of this world.', 'Many years have passed since humanity was driven to the brink of extinction by the sudden emergence of the unknown life forms Gadoll. Those humans that survived now dwell in a 3000m-high mobile fortress Deca-dence built to protect themselves from the Gadoll threat. Denizens of Deca-dence fall into two categories: Gears, warriors who fight the Gadoll daily, and Tankers, those without the skills to fight. One day, Natsume, a Tanker girl who dreams of becoming a Gear meets surly Kaburagi, an armor repairman of Deca-dence. This chance meeting between the seemingly two opposites, the girl with a positive attitude who never gives up on her dreams and the realist who has given up on his, will eventually shake the future course of this world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3bM1PBQRH7r8vIMBEXSGx41OAi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92588'),
  ('227975559235172694', 'Deceit', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', 'Emilia di Girolamo', 'Emilia di Girolamo', 'Niamh Algar, Sion Daniel Young, Harry Treadaway, Eddie Marsan, Rochenda Sandall, Nathaniel Martello-White, Charlie Carter', null, 'The true story of a controversial honeytrap at the heart of the 1992 police investigation into the murder of a young mother in London. Examining the complicated and toxic sexual politics of the early ‘90s and the police’s obsession with the wrong man, Deceit enters a dysfunctional world, where a female undercover officer, codename ‘Lizzie James’, is asked to become sexual bait for a suspected killer.', 'The true story of a controversial honeytrap at the heart of the 1992 police investigation into the murder of a young mother in London. Examining the complicated and toxic sexual politics of the early ‘90s and the police’s obsession with the wrong man, Deceit enters a dysfunctional world, where a female undercover officer, codename ‘Lizzie James’, is asked to become sexual bait for a suspected killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/peIkWRJNnufq5n8al7Ngzmk9ujZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130738'),
  ('250769215223423468', 'Deceitful Love', 2024, 'Drama', 'Pappi Corsicato', null, 'Giacomo Gianniotti, Monica Guerritore, Denise Capezza, Emanuel Caserio', 'TV-MA', 'After turning 60, a wealthy woman suddenly falls in love with an attractive and much younger man, but her family raises doubts about his intentions.', 'After turning 60, a wealthy woman suddenly falls in love with an attractive and much younger man, but her family raises doubts about his intentions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AgKGqINmSEkZExekGCMH68KMSmE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:265156'),
  ('240718003667257612', 'Deception', 2013, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Liz Heldens', null, 'Meagan Good, Laz Alonso, Marin Hinkle, Ella Rae Peck, Victor Garber, Tate Donovan, Katherine LaNasa, Wes Brown', null, 'A detective goes undercover to investigate the murder of her best friend.', 'A detective goes undercover to investigate the murder of her best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnJBeMJdIw9umj958VRCyz7PWrI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44194'),
  ('484621333950587991', 'Deception', 2018, 'Drama, Crime', 'Chris Fedak', null, 'Jack Cutmore-Scott, Ilfenesh Hadera, Lenora Crichlow, Amaury Nolasco, Justin Chon, Laila Robins, Vinnie Jones', 'TV-PG', 'Cameron Black is the world''s greatest illusionist. At least, that''s what people used to call him—before his greatest secret was exposed and his career destroyed. Even worse, Cameron has good reason to believe this was no accident.', 'Cameron Black is the world''s greatest illusionist. At least, that''s what people used to call him—before his greatest secret was exposed and his career destroyed. Even worse, Cameron has good reason to believe this was no accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRQ3JV67ADyTrRNyXqefqJkJsD4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71722'),
  ('176850301209961358', 'Deceptions', 1998, 'Drama, Soap', 'Inés Rodena', 'Carlos Romero', 'Gabriela Spanic, Fernando Colunga, Libertad Lamarque, Chantal Andere, Juan Pablo Gamboa, Magda Guzmán, Dominika Paleta, Marcelo Buquet', 'TV-14', 'The show''s premise revolves around a pair of twin sisters who were separated when they were young, and as adults the younger sister is forced to act as a "replacement" for her wealthy twin who wants to temporarily leave her husband and his family to enjoy a life of luxury with multiple lovers.', 'The show''s premise revolves around a pair of twin sisters who were separated when they were young, and as adults the younger sister is forced to act as a "replacement" for her wealthy twin who wants to temporarily leave her husband and his family to enjoy a life of luxury with multiple lovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cYjGxCWJvh8aKqCnVE8jffvHpuW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4184'),
