  ('672904538834778644', 'Desafío', 2004, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Desafío is a reality show in which a number of participants should survive, live together, and compete in 4 different stages, for a big price in money. These contestants are grouped into three teams according to the theme chosen in each season. Social classes, generations, regions of the country and the degree of popularity are the elements used to give identity to these groups. Another one of the characteristics of the Challenge and which encloses the success of this format is that the conditions of life in this competition are not fair. While a group spends its day in a beach house with servants, exquisite delicacies (High Beach), the other group suffers the complete lack of accommodation and food (Low Beach). In this reality, as in real life, the teams would be able to exceed or fall on their comfort levels, depending on the performance in the territorial Challenges.', 'Desafío is a reality show in which a number of participants should survive, live together, and compete in 4 different stages, for a big price in money. These contestants are grouped into three teams according to the theme chosen in each season. Social classes, generations, regions of the country and the degree of popularity are the elements used to give identity to these groups. Another one of the characteristics of the Challenge and which encloses the success of this format is that the conditions of life in this competition are not fair. While a group spends its day in a beach house with servants, exquisite delicacies (High Beach), the other group suffers the complete lack of accommodation and food (Low Beach). In this reality, as in real life, the teams would be able to exceed or fall on their comfort levels, depending on the performance in the territorial Challenges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nGG0HGGTKXeSpeC4BJVzvXMJJSW.jpg', 21, 'tmdb:tv:33257'),
  ('458755342265055966', 'Desafío Champions Sendokai', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Family', 'Kotoc TVE', null, 'Alex de Porrata, Carme Calvell, David Jenner, Ariadna Jiménez', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dBMIQ2r8FdLABrZeGklAUAUYCH.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:80040'),
  ('195182917122625684', 'Desafio: Aventura', 2026, 'Reality', null, null, 'Daniel Pavel', null, 'Romanian reality adventure competition TV show based on the international Desafío format. It features 24 contestants divided into three teams who compete in physical and strategic challenges while living in a remote, exotic location.', 'Romanian reality adventure competition TV show based on the international Desafío format. It features 24 contestants divided into three teams who compete in physical and strategic challenges while living in a remote, exotic location.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3gSXBWRdlGVpVGHQE2DpSftegvN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:310052'),
  ('139889882657544607', 'Descendants of Darkness', 2000, 'Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mayumi Asano, Show Hayami, Tomomichi Nishimura, Toshihiko Seki, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Shin-ichiro Miki, Yumiko Nakanishi, Wasabi Mizuta', null, 'Asato Tsuzuki, a powerful yet troubled Shinigami, guides souls to the afterlife while solving strange cases—and wrestling with emotions both dark and tender.', 'Asato Tsuzuki, a powerful yet troubled Shinigami, guides souls to the afterlife while solving strange cases—and wrestling with emotions both dark and tender.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6JfFZ59IafP1Yu7KISrxwGbARBq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12483'),
  ('130327443461168604', 'Descendants of the Sun', 2016, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Baek Sang-Hoon, Lee Eung-bok', 'Kim Eun-sook, Kim Won-suk', 'Song Hye-kyo, Song Joong-ki, Kim Ji-won, Jin Goo, Onew, Kang Shin-il, Cho Tae-kwan, Jo Jae-yun', null, 'After a chance meeting in a hospital, an ardent soldier falls for a gifted surgeon. Opposing philosophies tear them apart, but fate has other plans.', 'After a chance meeting in a hospital, an ardent soldier falls for a gifted surgeon. Opposing philosophies tear them apart, but fate has other plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1zXuYyMMrgpet6BBrMqGlHnvc8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65143'),
  ('1078976613638244447', 'Descendants: Wicked World', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Scott D. Peterson', 'Dove Cameron, Sofia Carson', 'TV-G', 'After Ben''s coronation in Descendants, the villain kids Mal, Evie, Carlos and Jay settle in at being good while their villainous parents are still roaming the Isle of the Lost. The story goes deeper at the arrival of new villain kids, Freddie (Dr. Facilier''s daughter), CJ (Captain Hook''s daughter) and Zevon (Yzma''s son).', 'After Ben''s coronation in Descendants, the villain kids Mal, Evie, Carlos and Jay settle in at being good while their villainous parents are still roaming the Isle of the Lost. The story goes deeper at the arrival of new villain kids, Freddie (Dr. Facilier''s daughter), CJ (Captain Hook''s daughter) and Zevon (Yzma''s son).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vml7aVIX68nfK4PIn2BlUqNqgJ9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:65016'),
  ('30571910851210749', 'Desert Punk', 2004, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Chihiro Suzuki, Tamio Ohki, Chiwa Saito, Tomoko Kotani, Norio Wakamoto', 'TV-MA', 'In the future, Japan is a wasteland. In the Great Kanto Desert, scattered humans eke out a living in the hot sand. Among them, a short-statured man they call "Sunabozu" makes a living as a bounty hunter. Like a demon of the sand, he seems unbeatable. Yet, like all men, he has a particular weakness for the opposite sex...', 'In the future, Japan is a wasteland. In the Great Kanto Desert, scattered humans eke out a living in the hot sand. Among them, a short-statured man they call "Sunabozu" makes a living as a bounty hunter. Like a demon of the sand, he seems unbeatable. Yet, like all men, he has a particular weakness for the opposite sex...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mJ22FZbnULTrfohVbm0JEcYTTRo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:29616'),
  ('1034238254090722824', 'Designated Survivor', 2016, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'David Guggenheim', null, 'Kiefer Sutherland, Maggie Q, Kal Penn, Adan Canto, Italia Ricci, Emiliano Díez', 'TV-14', 'Tom Kirkman, a low-level cabinet member is suddenly appointed President of the United States after a catastrophic attack during the State of the Union kills everyone above him in the Presidential line of succession.', 'Tom Kirkman, a low-level cabinet member is suddenly appointed President of the United States after a catastrophic attack during the State of the Union kills everyone above him in the Presidential line of succession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5R125JAIh1N38pzHp2dRsBpOVNY.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:67026'),
  ('600588729730135825', 'Designated Survivor: 60 Days', 2019, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery, War & Politics', 'Tae-heui Kim', 'Kim Tae-hee', 'Ji Jin-hee, Huh Joon-ho, Lee Jun-hyuk, Kang Hanna, Bae Jong-ok, Kim Gyu-ri, Choi Jae-sung, Choi Yoon-young', null, 'An explosion at the National Assembly kills everyone in the cabinet, leaving Park Mu-jin, the Minister of Environment, to become the next president. Park Mu-jin is a scientist-turned-politician who has no ambitions in politics, but as the acting president for 60 days, he is compelled to investigate the truth behind the attack. Based on the popular American series, Designated Survivor.', 'An explosion at the National Assembly kills everyone in the cabinet, leaving Park Mu-jin, the Minister of Environment, to become the next president. Park Mu-jin is a scientist-turned-politician who has no ambitions in politics, but as the acting president for 60 days, he is compelled to investigate the truth behind the attack. Based on the popular American series, Designated Survivor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6DItPd14SE1PAujgGLGn4zoJLo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86824'),
  ('833131306718228126', 'Designing Women', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Linda Bloodworth-Thomason', null, 'Dixie Carter, Annie Potts, Jan Hooks, Judith Ivey, Meshach Taylor', 'TV-PG', 'Julia Sugarbaker, Mary Jo Shively, Charlene Frazier-Stillfield and Suzanne Sugarbaker are associates at their design firm, Sugarbaker and Associates. Julia is the owner and is very outspoken and strong-willed. Mary Jo is a divorced single-parent whom is just as strong-willed as Julia, but isn''t as self-confident. Charlene is the naive and trusting farm girl from Poplar Bluff, Missouri. Suzanne is the self-centered ex-beauty queen whom has a number of wealthy ex-husbands.', 'Julia Sugarbaker, Mary Jo Shively, Charlene Frazier-Stillfield and Suzanne Sugarbaker are associates at their design firm, Sugarbaker and Associates. Julia is the owner and is very outspoken and strong-willed. Mary Jo is a divorced single-parent whom is just as strong-willed as Julia, but isn''t as self-confident. Charlene is the naive and trusting farm girl from Poplar Bluff, Missouri. Suzanne is the self-centered ex-beauty queen whom has a number of wealthy ex-husbands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqhes4TGTDj9zMg9agrADKo8RnL.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:712'),
  ('162402743932592235', 'Desmond''s', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Trix Worrell', null, 'Carmen Munroe, Norman Beaton, Dominic Keating, Robbie Gee, Ram John Holder, Geff Francis, Justin Pickett, Lisa Geoghan', 'TV-14', 'Desmond''s was a British television situation comedy broadcast by Channel 4 from 1989 to 1994. With 71 episodes, Desmond''s became Channel 4''s longest-running sitcom. The first series was shot in 1988, with the first episode broadcast in January 1989. The show was made in and set in Peckham, London, England and featured a predominantly Black British Guyanese cast. Conceived and co-written by Trix Worrell, and produced by Charlie Hanson and Humphrey Barclay, this series starred Norman Beaton as barber Desmond Ambrose. Desmond''s shop was a gathering place for an assortment of local characters.', 'Desmond''s was a British television situation comedy broadcast by Channel 4 from 1989 to 1994. With 71 episodes, Desmond''s became Channel 4''s longest-running sitcom. The first series was shot in 1988, with the first episode broadcast in January 1989. The show was made in and set in Peckham, London, England and featured a predominantly Black British Guyanese cast. Conceived and co-written by Trix Worrell, and produced by Charlie Hanson and Humphrey Barclay, this series starred Norman Beaton as barber Desmond Ambrose. Desmond''s shop was a gathering place for an assortment of local characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/71xiYCQTmeBQrtVtnODK0TeEeiv.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:12453'),
  ('77626688419824640', 'Desperate Housewives', 2004, 'Mystery, Drama, Comedy', 'Marc Cherry', null, 'Teri Hatcher, Felicity Huffman, Marcia Cross, Eva Longoria, Ricardo Chavira, Doug Savant, James Denton, Brenda Strong', 'TV-14', 'Looking down on her friends and family isn''t a way of life for Mary Alice Young... it''s a way of death. One day, in her perfect house, in the loveliest of suburbs, Mary Alice ended it all. Now she''s taking us into the lives of her family, friends and neighbors, commenting from her elevated P.O.V.', 'Looking down on her friends and family isn''t a way of life for Mary Alice Young... it''s a way of death. One day, in her perfect house, in the loveliest of suburbs, Mary Alice ended it all. Now she''s taking us into the lives of her family, friends and neighbors, commenting from her elevated P.O.V.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4qeI51jDzH81PpUUNaJCBrfm7f6.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:693'),
  ('1012102695963678417', 'Desperate Lies', 2024, 'Drama', 'Angela Chaves', 'Angela Chaves', 'Juliana Paes, Vladimir Brichta, Felipe Abib, Palomma Duarte, João Vitti, Martha Nowill, Yohama Eshima', 'TV-MA', 'Due to a rare phenomenon, a woman finds herself pregnant with twins by two men. Over time, she strives to keep her family united — and her secrets hidden.', 'Due to a rare phenomenon, a woman finds herself pregnant with twins by two men. Over time, she strives to keep her family united — and her secrets hidden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uEhFtmjDbaSsYBNEjckJoUrYt61.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:224633'),
  ('551350092569432449', 'Desperate Romantics', 2009, 'Drama', null, 'Peter Bowker', 'Aidan Turner, Rafe Spall, Tom Hollander, Samuel Barnett, Sam Crane, Zoë Tapper, Amy Manson, Jennie Jacques', null, 'Six-part drama series set in and among the alleys, galleries and flesh-houses of 19th-century industrial London, following the Pre-Raphaelite Brotherhood, a vagabond group of English painters, poets and critics.', 'Six-part drama series set in and among the alleys, galleries and flesh-houses of 19th-century industrial London, following the Pre-Raphaelite Brotherhood, a vagabond group of English painters, poets and critics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jdKV1oqBW8ApFvjJQOGHJQ1qs6X.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21699'),
  ('62774683996694709', 'Despertar Contigo', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'Pedro Damián', null, 'Daniel Arenas, Ela Velden, Aura Cristina Geithner, Enoc Leaño, Sara Corrales, Gonzalo Peña', 'TV-14', 'Destiny brings two youngsters together in the middle of a flower show whose love story begins as soon as they meet. Maia and Pablo come from different social classes: Maia is Othón’s daughter, one of the most important entrepreneurs in the flower growing industry, while Pablo belongs to the bodyguard squad escorting Antonia, Othón’s biggest opponent… two people holding a lot of grudge. Antonia and Othón met at a young age and they don’t miss any chance to hurt each other, so when the confusing encounter between Maia and Pablo takes place, Antonia uses that ‘holy gift’ to fool the girl by telling her Pablo is one of the most important flower-growers in the country... a lie that is not intended to hurt Maia, to whom is irrelevant whether Pablo has money or not, but Othón instead, a nouveau riche with no class who wants his daughter to marry a wealthy man and would be ov', 'Destiny brings two youngsters together in the middle of a flower show whose love story begins as soon as they meet. Maia and Pablo come from different social classes: Maia is Othón’s daughter, one of the most important entrepreneurs in the flower growing industry, while Pablo belongs to the bodyguard squad escorting Antonia, Othón’s biggest opponent… two people holding a lot of grudge. Antonia and Othón met at a young age and they don’t miss any chance to hurt each other, so when the confusing encounter between Maia and Pablo takes place, Antonia uses that ‘holy gift’ to fool the girl by telling her Pablo is one of the most important flower-growers in the country... a lie that is not intended to hurt Maia, to whom is irrelevant whether Pablo has money or not, but Othón instead, a nouveau riche with no class who wants his daughter to marry a wealthy man and would be ov', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5Ay9IrwxrrLPuNY2ko97kx5SBF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67490'),
  ('1053550902948096385', 'Destination Fear', 2019, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, 'Dakota Laden, Chelsea Laden, Tanner Wiseman, Alex Schroeder', 'TV-PG', 'You saw him on Ghost Adventures, now, Dakota Laden takes his sister and best friend on a cross-country road trip to visit the most haunted locations in America.', 'You saw him on Ghost Adventures, now, Dakota Laden takes his sister and best friend on a cross-country road trip to visit the most haunted locations in America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8jpJTYwqiKGMZNpLll8kjWnydqz.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:58777'),
  ('1152870205718975986', 'Destination Truth', 2007, 'Documentary, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Reality', 'Michael Mandt, Neil Mandt', 'Michael Mandt', 'Josh Gates, Jael de Pardo, Jarrod Tomassi, Casey Brumels, Erin Ryder, Gabriel Copeland', null, 'Destination Truth is a weekly American paranormal reality television series that premiered on June 6, 2007, on Syfy. Produced by Mandt Bros. Productions and Ping Pong Productions, the program follows paranormal researcher Josh Gates around the world to investigate claims of the supernatural, mainly in the field of cryptozoology.', 'Destination Truth is a weekly American paranormal reality television series that premiered on June 6, 2007, on Syfy. Produced by Mandt Bros. Productions and Ping Pong Productions, the program follows paranormal researcher Josh Gates around the world to investigate claims of the supernatural, mainly in the field of cryptozoology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g2B4baz9yDX8vNC9dk5NlUSeg3j.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:4706'),
  ('746729289693049715', 'Destination X', 2025, 'Reality', null, null, 'Jeffrey Dean Morgan', null, 'A group of contestants embark on mysterious road trip. Aboard a blacked-out bus, they face challenges offering location-clues while being misled, turning journey into real-life game to deduce their destination.', 'A group of contestants embark on mysterious road trip. Aboard a blacked-out bus, they face challenges offering location-clues while being misled, turning journey into real-life game to deduce their destination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/srKrtD3BWCYDar3IEZlXbQh5YEl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:289980'),
