  ('1029625230422680547', 'Die Harald Schmidt Show', 1995, 'Reality', null, null, 'Harald Schmidt, Manuel Andrack, Helmut Zerlett', null, 'The Harald Schmidt Show is a German late night talk show hosted on Sky Deutschland by comedian Harald Schmidt. The show first aired from 5 December 1995 to 23 December 2003 on Sat.1. Schmidt then moved his show to Das Erste as Harald Schmidt and Schmidt & Pocher, but he returned to Sat.1 on 13 September 2011. After cancellation on Sat.1, the show continued on Sky Deutschland in September 2012.', 'The Harald Schmidt Show is a German late night talk show hosted on Sky Deutschland by comedian Harald Schmidt. The show first aired from 5 December 1995 to 23 December 2003 on Sat.1. Schmidt then moved his show to Das Erste as Harald Schmidt and Schmidt & Pocher, but he returned to Sat.1 on 13 September 2011. After cancellation on Sat.1, the show continued on Sky Deutschland in September 2012.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQcE1AzjDP5zJRUW76PMRn7ai9W.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:40605'),
  ('159500894220445648', 'Die Hart', 2020, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Tripper Clancy, Derek Kolstad', null, 'Kevin Hart, Nathalie Emmanuel, Kathryn Hahn, J.K. Simmons, Tony Cavalero, Anna Garcia', 'TV-MA', 'Tired of being the comedic sidekick, Kevin Hart gets his wish when a famous director offers him his dream – to be a leading man action star – but there’s a catch: Kevin must first train at the world’s greatest action star school, run by a lunatic.', 'Tired of being the comedic sidekick, Kevin Hart gets his wish when a famous director offers him his dream – to be a leading man action star – but there’s a catch: Kevin must first train at the world’s greatest action star school, run by a lunatic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1vct3vbSYpsQonrbvhaLCA8jVgt.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:99072'),
