  ('315686326859728516', 'Die Toring', 2026, 'Drama', 'Igna Botha, Meesha Aboo', 'Igna Botha, Meesha Aboo', 'Franka Kirby, Jan Combrink, Nichola Viviers, Cantona James, Marguerite van Eeden, Adrian Steyn, Deon Lotz, Jolene Martin', null, 'In an elite Cape Town firm, a group of ambitious junior analysts must navigate power, desire and dangerous ambition as they compete for success and struggle for self-preservation.', 'In an elite Cape Town firm, a group of ambitious junior analysts must navigate power, desire and dangerous ambition as they compete for success and struggle for self-preservation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rw8wqhxssRyHaOgT1YiHmdxH0gD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:319138'),
