  ('273580270388444543', 'Dip', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, 'Başar Başaran, Emre Özdür', 'Neslihan Atagül, İlker Kaleli, Feridun Düzağaç, Defne Kayalar, Can Gox, Lale Mansur, Olgun Toker, Berrak Tüzünataç', null, 'Sahir, who is in charge of abandoning the people who attempt to commit suicide due to Istanbul Security, finds Bilge who is a scientist woman with a notice coming to the phone one day.', 'Sahir, who is in charge of abandoning the people who attempt to commit suicide due to Istanbul Security, finds Bilge who is a scientist woman with a notice coming to the phone one day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rybfoCnSY09h8aJSU9cE79zqvIX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78152'),
