  ('1011862991539496860', 'Early Doors', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Craig Cash', 'Phil Mealey, Craig Cash', 'John Henshaw, Craig Cash, Phil Mealey, Rita May, Christine Bottomley, Peter Wight, James Quinn, Mark Benton', null, 'A sitcom set in a small pub in Manchester, “The Grapes”, where daily life is bound up in the issues of love, loneliness, and blocked urinals. Regular drinkers Joe and Duffy pass the time with landlord Ken and his police officer cronies.', 'A sitcom set in a small pub in Manchester, “The Grapes”, where daily life is bound up in the issues of love, loneliness, and blocked urinals. Regular drinkers Joe and Duffy pass the time with landlord Ken and his police officer cronies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g9qbBr9W08hHB3pj5QMFv05NuEV.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1865'),
  ('776395156488088955', 'Early Edition', 1996, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Ian Abrams, Patrick Q. Page, Vik Rubenfeld', null, 'Kyle Chandler, Shanésia Davis', 'TV-PG', 'Gary Hobson thinks he may even be losing his mind when tomorrow''s newspaper mysteriously arrives today giving him a disconcerting look into the future. What will he do with tomorrow''s news?', 'Gary Hobson thinks he may even be losing his mind when tomorrow''s newspaper mysteriously arrives today giving him a disconcerting look into the future. What will he do with tomorrow''s news?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uycL5H5ir0ckyyt17FXZAuSQU4p.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1716'),
  ('916031994297768117', 'Early Swallows', 2019, 'Drama', 'Yevhen Tunik', null, 'Viktoriia Lytvynenko, Oleksandr Rudynskyi, Oleh Hotsuliak, Taisiya Shchuruk, Oleksandr Begma, Anastasiia Pustovit, Serhii Kyiashko, Maksym Devizorov', null, 'Revolves around the lives of Ukrainian teenagers in a secondary school class. The teenagers struggle with bullying, including the Blue Whale Challenge, lack of parental support, suicidal behavior, LGBT identity crises-a subject that is rarely portrayed on Ukrainian television-alcoholic parents, and speech disabilities. In one of the show''s main plot lines, the main characters are stalked on the Internet by an anonymous person who pretends to be their friend.', 'Revolves around the lives of Ukrainian teenagers in a secondary school class. The teenagers struggle with bullying, including the Blue Whale Challenge, lack of parental support, suicidal behavior, LGBT identity crises-a subject that is rarely portrayed on Ukrainian television-alcoholic parents, and speech disabilities. In one of the show''s main plot lines, the main characters are stalked on the Internet by an anonymous person who pretends to be their friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZsrygJrcD9OhvbjdGM3CeYXvRp.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:96256'),
  ('539829313355181439', 'Earth', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Chris Packham', null, 'There''s nothing else like it. Chris Packham reveals the epic, four-billion-year story of our home - from its dramatic creation to the arrival of human life... and whatever''s next.', 'There''s nothing else like it. Chris Packham reveals the epic, four-billion-year story of our home - from its dramatic creation to the arrival of human life... and whatever''s next.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GSn1jeR1qhDDjs14l5ub4Y4TDQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:230803'),
  ('477839795953735192', 'Earth 2', 1994, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Carol Flint, Billy Ray, Michael Duggan', null, 'Rebecca Gayheart, Debrah Farentino, Sullivan Walker, Clancy Brown, Joey Zimmerman, Antonio Sabàto, Jr., Jessica Steen, Rockmond Dunbar', null, 'Two centuries in the future, when pollution has forced humans to abandon Earth in favor of cramped space stations, scientist Devon Adair hijacks a spacecraft and sets out with a band of followers in search of another planet that will offer a brighter, more normal future to children like her son, Ulysses. Joining Devon and Ulysses are mechanic John Danziger and his daughter, True; team physician Julia Heller, who has her own secret agenda; Alonzo Solace, a pilot; Yale, a cyborg; and Morgan, a craven government agent, and his wife, Bess. The voyagers find their planet, but their ship crash-lands on the wrong side of the globe, forcing them to attempt an arduous and dangerous trek to their ultimate destination, New Pacifica.', 'Two centuries in the future, when pollution has forced humans to abandon Earth in favor of cramped space stations, scientist Devon Adair hijacks a spacecraft and sets out with a band of followers in search of another planet that will offer a brighter, more normal future to children like her son, Ulysses. Joining Devon and Ulysses are mechanic John Danziger and his daughter, True; team physician Julia Heller, who has her own secret agenda; Alonzo Solace, a pilot; Yale, a cyborg; and Morgan, a craven government agent, and his wife, Bess. The voyagers find their planet, but their ship crash-lands on the wrong side of the globe, forcing them to attempt an arduous and dangerous trek to their ultimate destination, New Pacifica.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJLHPptrbYimwuk8e7Q54LqVT0y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1473'),
  ('662070083456120699', 'Earth Abides', 2024, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Todd Komarnicki', null, 'Alexander Ludwig, Jessica Frances Dukes', 'TV-MA', 'When a plague of unprecedented virulence sweeps the globe, the human race is all but wiped out. In the aftermath, as the great machine of civilization slowly and inexorably breaks down, only a few shattered survivors remain to struggle against the slide into extinction.', 'When a plague of unprecedented virulence sweeps the globe, the human race is all but wiped out. In the aftermath, as the great machine of civilization slowly and inexorably breaks down, only a few shattered survivors remain to struggle against the slide into extinction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8huM0hQ5fCjGFDyUmpQW9x0xmR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:250308'),
  ('460586152552149880', 'Earth Arcade', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Reality', 'Na Yeong-seok', null, 'ANYUJIN, Mimi, Lee Young-ji, Lee Eun-ji', null, 'Four warriors who gathered to catch the moon rabbit who fled to Earth! A new concept hybrid multiverse action adventure variety that unfolds across time and space begins!', 'Four warriors who gathered to catch the moon rabbit who fled to Earth! A new concept hybrid multiverse action adventure variety that unfolds across time and space begins!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBJ0uF0WlFcjr9obZZqE6GSsKoL.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:203508'),
  ('224100598782640353', 'Earth at Night in Colour', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Tom Hiddleston', 'TV-PG', 'Filmed across six continents, this docuseries uses cutting-edge camera technology to capture animals'' nocturnal lives, revealing new behaviours filmed in full color like never before.', 'Filmed across six continents, this docuseries uses cutting-edge camera technology to capture animals'' nocturnal lives, revealing new behaviours filmed in full color like never before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guk68CC6hiDKtHm8LUB9tnHXCHc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:110818'),
  ('750347066995698574', 'Earth from Space', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Chiwetel Ejiofor, Laurent Lafitte', 'NR', 'Cameras in space tell stories of life on our planet from a brand new perspective, revealing new discoveries, incredible colours and patterns, and just how fast it is changing.', 'Cameras in space tell stories of life on our planet from a brand new perspective, revealing new discoveries, incredible colours and patterns, and just how fast it is changing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssfWm8t3URLRJCkRGMgOjPB3iMe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88307'),
  ('219438661256705621', 'Earth Maiden Arjuna', 2001, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Shoji Kawamori', null, 'Mami Higashiyama, Tomokazu Seki, Aya Hisakawa, Yoko Soumi, Chiharu Suzuka, Emi Uwagawa, Hochu Otsuka, Junko Hagimori', null, 'When a girl named Ariyoshi Juna has a severe accident, her spirit turns to light and rises up out of her body into the night sky where she gets a glimpse of Earth a few months into the future. What she sees is the Earth on the brink of total destruction, ruled by the merciless demon forces called the Raajas. Then, a person named Chris Hawken gives Juna a "power stone" and tells her to use it to save the Earth. The power stone gives her the ability to call up an "aura suit", which activates and enhances a person''s dormant special powers.', 'When a girl named Ariyoshi Juna has a severe accident, her spirit turns to light and rises up out of her body into the night sky where she gets a glimpse of Earth a few months into the future. What she sees is the Earth on the brink of total destruction, ruled by the merciless demon forces called the Raajas. Then, a person named Chris Hawken gives Juna a "power stone" and tells her to use it to save the Earth. The power stone gives her the ability to call up an "aura suit", which activates and enhances a person''s dormant special powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d0YVzBZythvGrrSQlgDxFqWvR3t.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42698'),
  ('761335249218323216', 'Earth to Ned', 2020, 'Comedy, Talk', null, null, 'Paul Rugg, Colleen Smith, Michael Oosterom, Morgana Ignis', null, 'Ned, a blue-skinned alien, and his lieutenant Cornelius, were sent to scout Earth for an eventual invasion — but instead became obsessed with popular culture. Now they host a talk show, broadcast from the bridge of their spaceship hidden deep underground, where they interview our most precious commodity — celebrities — to talk about Ned’s current pop culture obsessions.', 'Ned, a blue-skinned alien, and his lieutenant Cornelius, were sent to scout Earth for an eventual invasion — but instead became obsessed with popular culture. Now they host a talk show, broadcast from the bridge of their spaceship hidden deep underground, where they interview our most precious commodity — celebrities — to talk about Ned’s current pop culture obsessions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnyhfnDvaeJNY6LZbU75mzxL0lK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94883'),
  ('778969994551776309', 'Earth: Final Conflict', 1997, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Action & Adventure, Mystery', 'Gene Roddenberry', null, 'Jayne Heitmeyer, Von Flores, Alan van Sprang, Melinda Deines, Guylaine St-Onge', null, 'Years ago, the Taelons came to Earth, offering friendship and technology to humanity. But there are those who believe the Taelons have more sinister motives.', 'Years ago, the Taelons came to Earth, offering friendship and technology to humanity. But there are those who believe the Taelons have more sinister motives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xOcw7r57ppfPHdaTIauMnE64Npz.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:2840'),
  ('143217907633485149', 'Earth: The Power of the Planet', 2007, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Iain Stewart', null, 'In each episode, geologist Dr. Iain Stewart explains the effects and importance of a specific force of nature, such as wind or volcanism. He also examines the various ways in which it shapes planet earth itself and influences life on it, often in conjunction with other natural forces, and sometimes with lifeforms, as in the ''apocalyptically'' grave case of global warming.', 'In each episode, geologist Dr. Iain Stewart explains the effects and importance of a specific force of nature, such as wind or volcanism. He also examines the various ways in which it shapes planet earth itself and influences life on it, often in conjunction with other natural forces, and sometimes with lifeforms, as in the ''apocalyptically'' grave case of global warming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/enMvfrzoC2JkuCI38PhJSOg6GT6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:28877'),
  ('1132072721892536604', 'Earth''s Great Rivers', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Mark Flowers', null, 'David Oyelowo', null, 'Revealing the extraordinary animals, astonishing landscapes and remarkable people who live alongside the Amazon, Mississippi and Nile.', 'Revealing the extraordinary animals, astonishing landscapes and remarkable people who live alongside the Amazon, Mississippi and Nile.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3zRDUqXNZiDtRAbskg5W0kXrXEX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85428'),
