  ('300585114047517003', 'Einstein', 2017, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Tom Beck, Rolf Kanies, Annika Ernst, Haley Louise Jones', null, 'Felix Winterberg is the great-great-grandson of the famous Albert Einstein and himself a recognized physics genius. Because of a deadly hereditary disease, the brilliant researcher only has a few years left - which he wants to make as labor-intensive as possible thanks to various illegal stimulants.', 'Felix Winterberg is the great-great-grandson of the famous Albert Einstein and himself a recognized physics genius. Because of a deadly hereditary disease, the brilliant researcher only has a few years left - which he wants to make as labor-intensive as possible thanks to various illegal stimulants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f9ynvnKq1LACJaaUgT26VCmOtOu.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:69513'),
  ('487429516573751211', 'Eisai To Tairi Mou', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Lefteris Papapetrou, Antonis Angelopoulos', null, 'Vicky Stavropoulou, Vassilis Haralambopoulos, Alekos Syssovitis, Katerina Lehou, Alexis Georgoulis, Aris Servetalis, Dafni Labroyanni, Maria Katsoulidi', null, 'Pre-marital cold feet makes Vicky, a beautiful Greek woman that lived in Australia for years, come up with a plan to switch sides with a friend of hers (Stella, an obese but kind-hearted and streetwise Greek woman), while on board the flight taking her to Athens to meet her future in-laws.', 'Pre-marital cold feet makes Vicky, a beautiful Greek woman that lived in Australia for years, come up with a plan to switch sides with a friend of hers (Stella, an obese but kind-hearted and streetwise Greek woman), while on board the flight taking her to Athens to meet her future in-laws.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6befyqfyCbr7UQuxyzccl0bDNu4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34363'),
  ('13856144436633784', 'Eisenbahn-Romantik', 1991, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'Railway-related documentary covering modern railway systems, museum railways and their facilities as well as items on model railway layouts. Politics and criticism is not left out; the series reports on closures, controversial model ideas, delays to reconstruction plans or smart commuter transport concepts.', 'Railway-related documentary covering modern railway systems, museum railways and their facilities as well as items on model railway layouts. Politics and criticism is not left out; the series reports on closures, controversial model ideas, delays to reconstruction plans or smart commuter transport concepts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ckzpcx0jeDyGdgo0UXuInl3vaiu.jpg', 36, 'tmdb:tv:19871'),
  ('424546954521160671', 'Ekaterina', 2014, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Marina Aleksandrova, Vladimir Yaglych, Pavel Tabakov, Nadezhda Lumpova, Nikolay Ivanov, Mikhail Gorevoy, Anna Kovalchuk, Igor Ivanov', 'NR', '1745. The reigning Empress Elizabeth Petrovna is infertile. The only heir is her feeble-minded nephew Peter III. Elizabeth cannot allow Peter to ascend to the throne, so she decides to marry the tsarevich, wait for the birth of her son, and then take the boy and raise him as a real Russian emperor herself. Brides are coming to St. Petersburg. Among them is the lovely Fike - the young Princess Sofia Frederica from the impoverished branch of the Prussian kings.', '1745. The reigning Empress Elizabeth Petrovna is infertile. The only heir is her feeble-minded nephew Peter III. Elizabeth cannot allow Peter to ascend to the throne, so she decides to marry the tsarevich, wait for the birth of her son, and then take the boy and raise him as a real Russian emperor herself. Brides are coming to St. Petersburg. Among them is the lovely Fike - the young Princess Sofia Frederica from the impoverished branch of the Prussian kings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cEFDuWZ32UqAL9AU15g04xmw3jY.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:71152'),
