  ('212889059455180471', 'El Centro', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'David Moreno', null, 'Juan Diego Botto, Tristán Ulloa, Elena Martín Gimeno, Clara Segura, Elisabet Casanovas, David Lorente, Israel Elejalde, Kimberley Tell', null, 'Set in the present day, but with echoes of the Cold War, this spy thriller delves into the unknown world of "El Centro" - National Intelligence Center of the Spain (CNI). The plot begins with a murder that uncovers an international operation by the Russian intelligence services and leads the CNI members into a race against time to dismantle it, while also trying to uncover a traitor within their ranks.', 'Set in the present day, but with echoes of the Cold War, this spy thriller delves into the unknown world of "El Centro" - National Intelligence Center of the Spain (CNI). The plot begins with a murder that uncovers an international operation by the Russian intelligence services and leads the CNI members into a race against time to dismantle it, while also trying to uncover a traitor within their ranks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3spUSc7d0eNUkG9PE7BB0Sv3uv0.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:273914'),
