  ('82678733279007791', 'El Kebeer Awi', 2010, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Ahmed Mekky', null, 'Ahmed Mekky, Mohamed Sallam, Mostafa Ghareb, Rahma Ahmed Farag, Hatim Salah, Bayoumi Fouad, Husain Abu-Haggag, عبدالرحمن طه', 'TV-14', 'Al Kabeer seeks to find love again after his wife was gone, unaware that what he is looking for is closer than he imagines.', 'Al Kabeer seeks to find love again after his wife was gone, unaware that what he is looking for is closer than he imagines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oj4XM6wpGRIcx3QoQx1PF1fx5E5.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:52698'),
