  ('38115075102111411', 'El Mochaorejas', 2026, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Damián Alcázar, Paulina Gaitán, Enoc Leaño, Giovanna Zacarías, Julio Bracho, Gustavo Sánchez Parra, María Antonieta Hidalgo, Alfredo Herrera', 'TV-MA', 'The story of Daniel Arizmendi''s rise, the corruption and fear that allowed his gang to terrorize Mexico in the 1990s, where he became known as "el mochaorejas" for his shady crimes', 'The story of Daniel Arizmendi''s rise, the corruption and fear that allowed his gang to terrorize Mexico in the 1990s, where he became known as "el mochaorejas" for his shady crimes', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYZ5gWX0wgqQQojoGK9d482qI5f.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:312182'),
  ('128634310088504710', 'El Noveno mandamiento', 2001, 'Soap, Drama', 'René Allouis', null, 'Daniela Castro, Francisco Gattorno, Armando Araiza, Alma Muriel, Chantal Andere, Ana Patricia Rojo, Alejandro Ibarra, Salvador Sánchez', null, 'El Noveno Mandamiento is a Mexican soap opera produced by Lucero Suárez in 2001. As of June 24th, 2013, Unimas is broadcasting 2 hour episodes of this soap opera.', 'El Noveno Mandamiento is a Mexican soap opera produced by Lucero Suárez in 2001. As of June 24th, 2013, Unimas is broadcasting 2 hour episodes of this soap opera.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:20918'),
  ('1065817404613359676', 'El nudo', 2019, 'Soap, Drama, Mystery', 'Nuria Bueno', null, 'Cristina Plazas, Oriol Tarrasón, Miquel Fernández, Natalia Verbeke', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/TU2ZuGEIk9LYAfVXpvb1I5lrC3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93428'),
  ('908100528587820038', 'El Palmar de Troya', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Israel del Santo', null, null, null, 'In March 1968, four girls affirmed that they had appeared the Virgin Mary on the Alcaparrosa estate, one kilometer from the village of El Palmar de Troya, in the province of Seville. Weeks later, several neighbors affirmed that they had had other appearances and in the summer of that same year an altar was built that would be the first stone of the Palmarian Christian church. Those first appearances gave rise to a religious empire that expanded throughout the world, broke with the Vatican and appointed its own popes. In June 2018, Ginés, the last Pope of El Palmar de Troya, and his wife stormed the congregation''s facilities. It was the penultimate episode of an extraordinary story that navigates between tragedy and surrealism. Scandals, the shadow of sexual abuse, improbable anecdotes and all kinds of accusations have marked the more than fifty years of this religious order to which some consider church and many others a great sect.', 'In March 1968, four girls affirmed that they had appeared the Virgin Mary on the Alcaparrosa estate, one kilometer from the village of El Palmar de Troya, in the province of Seville. Weeks later, several neighbors affirmed that they had had other appearances and in the summer of that same year an altar was built that would be the first stone of the Palmarian Christian church. Those first appearances gave rise to a religious empire that expanded throughout the world, broke with the Vatican and appointed its own popes. In June 2018, Ginés, the last Pope of El Palmar de Troya, and his wife stormed the congregation''s facilities. It was the penultimate episode of an extraordinary story that navigates between tragedy and surrealism. Scandals, the shadow of sexual abuse, improbable anecdotes and all kinds of accusations have marked the more than fifty years of this religious order to which some consider church and many others a great sect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w9LtR4BjAJIXJqytrxk32aNLT27.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99064'),
  ('315485423798907977', 'El Pantera', 2007, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Alicia Machado, Luis Roberto Guzmán', 'TV-PG', 'El Pantera is a Mexican television series released by Canal 5. It is based on a comic book of the same name. It narrates the life of Gervasio, a young man who fights crime in Mexico City. The title role is performed by Luis Roberto Guzmán. The series started airing on May 2007, and is filmed in Mexico City under the direction of producers Rodolfo de Anda and Alexis Ayala. It currently airs its third season Mondays on Canal 5 at 10:00pm and on cable TV channel Galavisión Tuesdays at 21:30pm. The character of El Pantera was created in the 70''s by the writer Daniel Muñoz and artist Juan Alba for Mundo Vid. A novel called El Pantera, or La Noche del Pantera was written by Muñoz in the 90''s, followed by El Misterio de la Amenaza Negra.', 'El Pantera is a Mexican television series released by Canal 5. It is based on a comic book of the same name. It narrates the life of Gervasio, a young man who fights crime in Mexico City. The title role is performed by Luis Roberto Guzmán. The series started airing on May 2007, and is filmed in Mexico City under the direction of producers Rodolfo de Anda and Alexis Ayala. It currently airs its third season Mondays on Canal 5 at 10:00pm and on cable TV channel Galavisión Tuesdays at 21:30pm. The character of El Pantera was created in the 70''s by the writer Daniel Muñoz and artist Juan Alba for Mundo Vid. A novel called El Pantera, or La Noche del Pantera was written by Muñoz in the 90''s, followed by El Misterio de la Amenaza Negra.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhD7HAC5xH8OZkjMjwtglSrjikt.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:3897'),
  ('592296346768011266', 'El pecado de Oyuki', 1988, 'Drama, Soap', 'Yolanda Vargas Dulché', null, 'Ana Martín, Salvador Sánchez, Boy Olmi, Martha Roth, Jorge Martínez de Hoyos, Rafael Sánchez Navarro, Anna Silvetti, Yoshio', null, 'El Pecado de Oyuki is a Mexican telenovela produced by Televisa in 1988. It was based on an original story by Yolanda Vargas Dulché, who also adapted the screenplay for television. The original comic book series was in the style of the foto-novela. For the role of Oyuki, the photographer selected the Mexican Japanese Sachiko Tsuchiya. Born in Tepic, Nayarit, she became the most recognizable Asian Mexican of her time. The telenovela was shown in the United States in 1988 through Univision. Dulché''s story was also adapted for Brazilian television in 1967 and as a comic published starting April 11, 1975 by Grupo Editorial Vid. The Brazilian version was called "Yoshiko, um poema de amor" and starred actors Luis Gustavo and Rosa Miake.', 'El Pecado de Oyuki is a Mexican telenovela produced by Televisa in 1988. It was based on an original story by Yolanda Vargas Dulché, who also adapted the screenplay for television. The original comic book series was in the style of the foto-novela. For the role of Oyuki, the photographer selected the Mexican Japanese Sachiko Tsuchiya. Born in Tepic, Nayarit, she became the most recognizable Asian Mexican of her time. The telenovela was shown in the United States in 1988 through Univision. Dulché''s story was also adapted for Brazilian television in 1967 and as a comic published starting April 11, 1975 by Grupo Editorial Vid. The Brazilian version was called "Yoshiko, um poema de amor" and starred actors Luis Gustavo and Rosa Miake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dR7vSG4by9qOgtzjv3dXIu8lUeq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12930'),
  ('1005282267162406636', 'El precio de amarte', 2024, 'Drama, Soap', 'Carmen Armendáriz', null, 'Scarlet Gruber, Marcus Ornellas, Alejandra Barros, Jorge Poza, Alejandra Ambrosi, Verónica Jaspeado, Raquel Garza, Juan Carlos Barreto', null, 'El precio de amarte revolves around a man who abandoned his family as a child. Upon returning, several years later, he wants to discover why he was forced away. However, the search for the truth is derailed by a passionate love story. Full of action, intrigue and unexpected twists, El Precio de Amarte promises an exciting journey through generations, marked by love and tragedy.', 'El precio de amarte revolves around a man who abandoned his family as a child. Upon returning, several years later, he wants to discover why he was forced away. However, the search for the truth is derailed by a passionate love story. Full of action, intrigue and unexpected twists, El Precio de Amarte promises an exciting journey through generations, marked by love and tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dOYSdHwgFShNyob4wawrVHuVwsv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:263267'),
  ('570824803358738554', 'El premio mayor', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Claudio Báez, Carlos Bonavides, Laura León, Marcelo Buquet', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9KPVEDZ68X7cHKj7RCo2NmHvUwa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106835'),
  ('833318538245382040', 'El Presidente', 2020, 'Drama', 'Pablo Larraín', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Sergio Jadue, a lowly director of a small-town soccer club in Chile, unexpectedly finds himself at the head of the Chilean soccer association. Drunk with power, he becomes the protégé of soccer godfather Julio Grondona, as well as the FBI’s key to undoing the largest corruption scheme in the world of soccer.', 'Sergio Jadue, a lowly director of a small-town soccer club in Chile, unexpectedly finds himself at the head of the Chilean soccer association. Drunk with power, he becomes the protégé of soccer godfather Julio Grondona, as well as the FBI’s key to undoing the largest corruption scheme in the world of soccer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vo6YFs7rdrm9vGHWYKzbXwGLZ5W.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:101881'),
  ('606470891097408548', 'El Principe', 2014, 'Crime, Drama', 'Aitor Gabilondo, César Benítez', null, 'Álex González, Hiba Abouk, Jose Coronado, Rubén Cortada, Jesús Castro, Nerea Barros, Thaïs Blume, Fernando Gil', null, 'An Intelligence Agent is sent to El Principe, on the border with Morocco, to investigate a possible police collaboration with a terrorist cell but finds unexpected love in the least suitable person: a drug baron''s sister.', 'An Intelligence Agent is sent to El Principe, on the border with Morocco, to investigate a possible police collaboration with a terrorist cell but finds unexpected love in the least suitable person: a drug baron''s sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9edkwqws2gstULZDzDMBJEBulkA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:60621'),
