  ('202524377455648871', 'El Señor de los Cielos', 2013, 'Crime, Drama, Soap', 'Mariano Calasso, Luis Zelkowicz', 'Juan Manuel Andrade, Mariano Calasso, Laura Sosa', 'Rafael Amaya, Isabella Castillo, Carmen Aub, Itatí Cantoral, Iván Arana, Robinson Díaz, África Zavala, Jason Romo', 'TV-14', 'Set in the 1990s, these are the life and times of Amado Carrillo Fuentes, a man who became the head of the Juárez cartel. Nicknamed “El Señor de los Cielos” (Lord of the Skies) because of the large fleet of airplanes he used to transport drugs, he was also known for washing more than $200 million through Colombia to finance his huge fleet. He is described as the most powerful drug trafficker of his time.', 'Set in the 1990s, these are the life and times of Amado Carrillo Fuentes, a man who became the head of the Juárez cartel. Nicknamed “El Señor de los Cielos” (Lord of the Skies) because of the large fleet of airplanes he used to transport drugs, he was also known for washing more than $200 million through Colombia to finance his huge fleet. He is described as the most powerful drug trafficker of his time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ag7VUdnrRz5Qpq3Yn3E5OCvFnu0.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:44953'),
