  ('1014120560550853471', 'El show: crónica de un asesinato', 2023, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Diego Enrique Osorno', null, 'Paco Stanley, Mario Bezares, Benito Castro, Emilio Azcarraga Jean, Ricardo Salinas Pliego, Eduardo Salazar, Cuauhtémoc Cárdenas Solórzano, Lilly Téllez', 'TV-14', 'The murder of Paco Stanley, the most popular comedian on television in Mexico, unleashes a series of intrigues in the world of politics and entertainment. Through an in-depth investigation, the use of archival material of the time and the direct testimony of the main people involved in the case, this documentary series delves into the culture of show business and exposes the lies and tragedies that unexpectedly marked the arrival of democracy in Mexico in the year 2000.', 'The murder of Paco Stanley, the most popular comedian on television in Mexico, unleashes a series of intrigues in the world of politics and entertainment. Through an in-depth investigation, the use of archival material of the time and the direct testimony of the main people involved in the case, this documentary series delves into the culture of show business and exposes the lies and tragedies that unexpectedly marked the arrival of democracy in Mexico in the year 2000.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uAadZi5QRjWINE64bqX1oQxVuD8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:228303'),
  ('427095481959834712', 'El Tigre: The Adventures of Manny Rivera', 2007, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Kids', 'Sandra Equihua, Jorge R. Gutierrez', null, 'Alanna Ubach, Grey DeLisle, Eric Bauza, Carlos Alazraqui, April Stewart', 'TV-Y7', 'The daily adventures of a 12 year old Mexican superhero dealing with bizarre enemies, as well as his own superhero father and villain grandfather.', 'The daily adventures of a 12 year old Mexican superhero dealing with bizarre enemies, as well as his own superhero father and villain grandfather.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHnqmtAoEN8vaA6O8fd0n95Qcru.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6046'),
  ('473912629092288091', 'El Turco', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, 'Kerem Deren, Çisil Hazal Tenim', 'Can Yaman, Greta Ferro, Will Kemp, Magnus Samuelsson, Slavko Sobin, Haluk Piyes, Madalena Aragão, David Streames', null, 'Balaban, a soldier in the Janissary army, settles in Moena in northern Italy after the Battle of Vienna in 1683 and fights for the rights of the local people.', 'Balaban, a soldier in the Janissary army, settles in Moena in northern Italy after the Battle of Vienna in 1683 and fights for the rights of the local people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUJ6hzDvznBJDrfHMuQm8Qm183F.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:220377'),
