  ('219783814803074305', 'El-Hazard: The Magnificent World', 1995, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Tetsuya Iwanaga, Koji Ishii, Ryotaro Okiayu, Rio Natsuki, Tomo Sakurai, Miho Yoshida, Saeko Shimazu, Etsuko Kozakura', null, 'When Makoto Mizuhara discovers an old monument in his school and awakens a beautiful woman he, his teacher, his worst enemy and one of his female friends is transported to the magnificent world of El Hazard. There they discovers that they have received special powers.', 'When Makoto Mizuhara discovers an old monument in his school and awakens a beautiful woman he, his teacher, his worst enemy and one of his female friends is transported to the magnificent world of El Hazard. There they discovers that they have received special powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5rLMnEwY0nkLvY2td12KmZ03AfL.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:44775'),
  ('641798438476124347', 'El-Hazard: The Wanderers', 1995, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Saeko Shimazu, Etsuko Kozakura, Kikuko Inoue, Tetsuya Iwanaga, Tomo Sakurai, Rio Natsuki, Koji Ishii', null, 'Makoto Mizuhara is working on his latest experiment in the school science lab, but when he takes a break his lifelong rival Katsuhiko Jinnai shows up and attempts to destroy the device and discredit Makoto. This overloads the experiment and transports Makoto, Jinnai, his sister Nanami, and their teacher Mr. Fujisawa to the strange and magnificent world El Hazard. Makoto and Fujisawa land squarely in the Kingdom of Roshtaria, and quickly befriend the princess Rune Venus. Jinnai allies himself with the Bugrom, a race of giant insects bent on taking over El Hazard, while his sister tries to eke out her own living in the desert. Makoto searches desperately for a way to return home, all the while fighting off the Bugrom, enlisting the help of the Holy Priestesses, and stopping the demon god Ifurita from destroying everything.', 'Makoto Mizuhara is working on his latest experiment in the school science lab, but when he takes a break his lifelong rival Katsuhiko Jinnai shows up and attempts to destroy the device and discredit Makoto. This overloads the experiment and transports Makoto, Jinnai, his sister Nanami, and their teacher Mr. Fujisawa to the strange and magnificent world El Hazard. Makoto and Fujisawa land squarely in the Kingdom of Roshtaria, and quickly befriend the princess Rune Venus. Jinnai allies himself with the Bugrom, a race of giant insects bent on taking over El Hazard, while his sister tries to eke out her own living in the desert. Makoto searches desperately for a way to return home, all the while fighting off the Bugrom, enlisting the help of the Holy Priestesses, and stopping the demon god Ifurita from destroying everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1HpjsoNmLdQRzZX3F3PLSES0JKk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:22098'),
  ('563880213493415027', 'Ela sti thesi mou', 2016, 'Comedy, Soap', 'Giorgos Kritikos', null, 'Giannis Tsimitselis, Athina Oikonomakou, Evagelia Siriopoulou, Natalia Kyrikou, Haris Grigoropoulos, Michalis Marinos, Andri Theodotou, Marinos Konsolos', null, 'A closeted young man goes home for the holidays and struggles to reveal his dire circumstances to his conservative family.', 'A closeted young man goes home for the holidays and struggles to reveal his dire circumstances to his conservative family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNS9txJaBEa8YWVj6g5kI70rlRD.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:87215'),
  ('1013348428707374284', 'Elas por Elas', 2023, 'Soap, Drama, Comedy, Mystery', 'Thereza Falcão, Alessandro Marson', 'Alessandro Marson, Thereza Falcão, Wendell Bendelack', 'Deborah Secco, Isabel Teixeira, Thalita Carauta, Karine Teles, Késia Estácio, Maria Clara Spinelli, Mariana Santos, Lázaro Ramos', 'NR', 'Seven friends who met in their youth at an English course meet again 25 years later; Lara, Taís, Helena, Adriana, Renée, Natália and Carol, each of them has a different personality and origin, but they share a deep affection.', 'Seven friends who met in their youth at an English course meet again 25 years later; Lara, Taís, Helena, Adriana, Renée, Natália and Carol, each of them has a different personality and origin, but they share a deep affection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hCSH5KvSqShWXhFiXr88wtJXwlO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:219109'),
  ('82806126115616326', 'ēlDLIVE', 2017, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ayumu Murase, Rie Kugimiya, Saori Hayami, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Daiki Kobayashi, Hiroshi Kamiya, Lynn, NEEKO', null, 'Chuuta Kokonose is an orphan who lives with his aunt. For as long as he can remember, he''s had a voice in his head, but other than that he''s a normal boy—right until the day when a strange-looking thing follows him home and teleports him to a place filled with more fantastic creatures. It''s a space police station, and Rein Brickke, the Chief of Solar System Department, tells him that he''s been chosen by the computer as a possible candidate to join the police force. Misuzu Sonokata, a girl from Chuuta''s school with an angelic face and ill temper who turns out to be one of Rein Brickke''s subordinates, doesn''t think him suitable for such a job. Chuuta, who was shocked at first, decides to take the aptitude test after being urged by the voice in his head and to prove Misuzu wrong.', 'Chuuta Kokonose is an orphan who lives with his aunt. For as long as he can remember, he''s had a voice in his head, but other than that he''s a normal boy—right until the day when a strange-looking thing follows him home and teleports him to a place filled with more fantastic creatures. It''s a space police station, and Rein Brickke, the Chief of Solar System Department, tells him that he''s been chosen by the computer as a possible candidate to join the police force. Misuzu Sonokata, a girl from Chuuta''s school with an angelic face and ill temper who turns out to be one of Rein Brickke''s subordinates, doesn''t think him suitable for such a job. Chuuta, who was shocked at first, decides to take the aptitude test after being urged by the voice in his head and to prove Misuzu wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jUIlqhaCfrvsz6gzAFgFOattK0k.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69283'),
  ('522519958761555916', 'Electra Woman & Dyna Girl', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Chris Marrs Piliero', null, 'Grace Helbig, Hannah Hart, Christopher Coutts, Trevor Lerner, Andy Buckley, Matreya Fedor', 'NR', 'Two superheroes, Electra Woman and Dyna Girl, move from Akron to Los Angeles in hopes of making it big in the crime fighting world, only to find competition with other vigilantes and infighting amongst themselves.', 'Two superheroes, Electra Woman and Dyna Girl, move from Akron to Los Angeles in hopes of making it big in the crime fighting world, only to find competition with other vigilantes and infighting amongst themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKaKadCNs4Eb94vmJWHJnRHgFOt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77221'),
  ('706711596041323439', 'Electromagnetic Girlfriend', 2009, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Yoshimasa Hosoya, Ryo Hirohashi, Mai Nakahara, Mitsuki Saiga, Kozue Yoshizumi', null, 'Delinquent Juu Juuzawa is a lone wolf who does not see much use in befriending people. So when a girl named Ame Ochibana claims they are linked together from their previous lives, he is highly skeptical and doesn''t want anything to do with her. Even stranger is that her fondest wish is to be his servant. Thinking that Ame must be delusional, he tries to distance himself from her. But when a classmate is murdered, Juu instead decides to keep her close, believing the strange girl to be the culprit. However, her intelligence and skill begin to prove invaluable as the two begin working together to solve the murder.', 'Delinquent Juu Juuzawa is a lone wolf who does not see much use in befriending people. So when a girl named Ame Ochibana claims they are linked together from their previous lives, he is highly skeptical and doesn''t want anything to do with her. Even stranger is that her fondest wish is to be his servant. Thinking that Ame must be delusional, he tries to distance himself from her. But when a classmate is murdered, Juu instead decides to keep her close, believing the strange girl to be the culprit. However, her intelligence and skill begin to prove invaluable as the two begin working together to solve the murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99yUV7h1A0WsAmCIKH0ZPOfbiCO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:57036'),
  ('751367148926055909', 'Elegant Yokai Apartment Life', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuichi Nakamura, Atsushi Abe, Miyuki Sawashiro', null, 'The high school freshman Yūshi Inaba has to look for new place to live after his high school dormitory burnt down. Having no parents and wanting to live independently from his uncle, he eventually finds a cheap apartment for 25,000 yen called Kotobuki-sō, only to find out that the place has human and supernatural creatures such as ghosts, yōkai, and mononoke living together. There, Yūshi''s new daily life begins.', 'The high school freshman Yūshi Inaba has to look for new place to live after his high school dormitory burnt down. Having no parents and wanting to live independently from his uncle, he eventually finds a cheap apartment for 25,000 yen called Kotobuki-sō, only to find out that the place has human and supernatural creatures such as ghosts, yōkai, and mononoke living together. There, Yūshi''s new daily life begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/burzxb0f8wwDAL9nzPa4BMlX7Id.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72514'),
  ('334802561222656609', 'Elemental Gelade', 2005, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Akira Ishida, Mikako Takahashi, Naoko Suzuki, Nana Mizuki, Rie Kugimiya, Ryotaro Okiayu, Yukie Maeda, Kimiko Saito', 'TV-14', 'Cou, the bumbling rookie of the "Red Lynx" pirate squadron has just discovered the treasure of a lifetime! A Mighty member of the ancient race of Edel Raids. Ren, at first glance, seems to be a shy and defenseless girl, but she holds withing her a power that many are willing to kill for. When Cou takes it upon himself to protect Ren on her journey to a mysterious place called Edel Garden, He immediately makes new friends and dangerous enemies.', 'Cou, the bumbling rookie of the "Red Lynx" pirate squadron has just discovered the treasure of a lifetime! A Mighty member of the ancient race of Edel Raids. Ren, at first glance, seems to be a shy and defenseless girl, but she holds withing her a power that many are willing to kill for. When Cou takes it upon himself to protect Ren on her journey to a mysterious place called Edel Garden, He immediately makes new friends and dangerous enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNbRsvCXFCBKpdz6YI7gwut1sXM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34711'),
  ('435002580533130164', 'Elementary', 2012, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Robert Doherty', null, 'Jonny Lee Miller, Lucy Liu, Jon Michael Hill, Aidan Quinn', 'TV-14', 'A modern-day drama about a crime-solving duo that cracks the NYPD''s most impossible cases. Following his fall from grace in London and a stint in rehab, eccentric Sherlock escapes to Manhattan where his wealthy father forces him to live with his worst nightmare - a sober companion, Dr. Watson.', 'A modern-day drama about a crime-solving duo that cracks the NYPD''s most impossible cases. Following his fall from grace in London and a stint in rehab, eccentric Sherlock escapes to Manhattan where his wealthy father forces him to live with his worst nightmare - a sober companion, Dr. Watson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q9dObe29W4bDpgzUfOOH3ZnzDbR.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:1415'),
  ('447747212843693620', 'Elena of Avalor', 2016, 'Animation, Kids', 'Craig Gerber', null, 'Aimee Carrero, Jenna Ortega, Chris Parnell, Yvette Nicole Brown, Carlos Alazraqui, Emiliano Díez, Julia Vera, Christian Lanz', 'TV-Y', 'The story of a brave teenager who has saved her kingdom from an evil sorceress and must now learn to rule as a crown princess until she’s old enough to be queen.', 'The story of a brave teenager who has saved her kingdom from an evil sorceress and must now learn to rule as a crown princess until she’s old enough to be queen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/se8bejjwLz56qm1gOCLpVjK8iVk.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:67175'),
  ('397291537011315486', 'Elena''s Ghost', 2010, 'Mystery, Soap, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Humberto ''Kiko'' Olivieri', null, 'Elizabeth Gutiérrez, Segundo Cernadas, Ana Layevska, Fabián Ríos, Maritza Bustamante, Carlos Montilla, Elluz Peraza, Katie Barberi', null, 'El fantasma de Elena is a Spanish-language telenovela produced by the United States-based television network Telemundo. The first season comprised 117 episodes transmitted in the USA from July 20, 2010 to January 7, 2011. As with most of its other soap operas, the network broadcast English subtitles as closed captions on CC3. It stars Elizabeth Gutiérrez and Segundo Cernadas as protagonists and Ana Layevska as the main antagonist in a double role. It has had different titles. When the original story was changed after just 30 episodes, the novela was renamed "Elena contra Elena". Two weeks later, the script was taken to a new direction again and its title was changed to "La venganza de Elena". Finally, the novela was named "El desafío de Elena" just after 20 episodes. After the 60th episode, the novela was renamed back to its original name "El fantasma de Elena".', 'El fantasma de Elena is a Spanish-language telenovela produced by the United States-based television network Telemundo. The first season comprised 117 episodes transmitted in the USA from July 20, 2010 to January 7, 2011. As with most of its other soap operas, the network broadcast English subtitles as closed captions on CC3. It stars Elizabeth Gutiérrez and Segundo Cernadas as protagonists and Ana Layevska as the main antagonist in a double role. It has had different titles. When the original story was changed after just 30 episodes, the novela was renamed "Elena contra Elena". Two weeks later, the script was taken to a new direction again and its title was changed to "La venganza de Elena". Finally, the novela was named "El desafío de Elena" just after 20 episodes. After the 60th episode, the novela was renamed back to its original name "El fantasma de Elena".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yz4W14jAX3aXlEVNtAFcyZu5Zdh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32786'),
  ('408117428283129212', 'Eleventh Hour', 2008, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Stephen Gallagher', null, 'Rufus Sewell, Marley Shelton', null, 'Dr. Jacob Hood is a brilliant biophysicist and special science advisor to the government who investigates scientific crises and oddities. His crusade is to protect the substance of science against those who would abuse and misuse scientific discoveries for their own gain.', 'Dr. Jacob Hood is a brilliant biophysicist and special science advisor to the government who investigates scientific crises and oddities. His crusade is to protect the substance of science against those who would abuse and misuse scientific discoveries for their own gain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHZc6yDZsKrgD1feCMNnARez8Pu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:7525'),
  ('918606905508741376', 'Elfen Lied', 2004, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Chihiro Suzuki, Sanae Kobayashi, Emiko Hagiwara, Hiroaki Hirata, Hitomi Nabatame, Jouji Nakata, Kinryu Arimoto, Maria Yamamoto', 'TV-MA', 'The Diclonius, a mutated homo sapien that is said to be selected by God and will eventually become the destruction of mankind, possesses two horns in their heads, and has a "sixth sense" which gives it telekinetic abilities. Due to this dangerous power, they have been captured and isolated in laboratories by the government. Lucy, a young and psychotic Diclonius, manages to break free of her confines and brutally murder most of the guards in the laboratory, only to get shot in the head as she makes her escape. She survives and manages to drift along to a beach, where two teenagers named Kouta and Yuka discovers her. Having lost her memories, she was named after the only thing that she can now say, "Nyuu," and the two allow her to stay at Kouta''s home. However, it appears that the evil "Lucy" is not dead just yet...', 'The Diclonius, a mutated homo sapien that is said to be selected by God and will eventually become the destruction of mankind, possesses two horns in their heads, and has a "sixth sense" which gives it telekinetic abilities. Due to this dangerous power, they have been captured and isolated in laboratories by the government. Lucy, a young and psychotic Diclonius, manages to break free of her confines and brutally murder most of the guards in the laboratory, only to get shot in the head as she makes her escape. She survives and manages to drift along to a beach, where two teenagers named Kouta and Yuka discovers her. Having lost her memories, she was named after the only thing that she can now say, "Nyuu," and the two allow her to stay at Kouta''s home. However, it appears that the evil "Lucy" is not dead just yet...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gadB0EHZehVHy4dBGKYmjvuvPDz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42671'),
  ('1046177530094007870', 'Eli Roth''s History of Horror', 2018, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Eli Roth', 'TV-MA', 'An in-depth look at the history and pop cultural significance of horror films.', 'An in-depth look at the history and pop cultural significance of horror films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/15ZXGHIk3nFBqCRCEKVHMO7oINI.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:83181'),
  ('1053221272269415346', 'Eli Stone', 2008, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Marc Guggenheim, Greg Berlanti', null, 'Jonny Lee Miller, Loretta Devine, Natasha Henstridge, Matt Letscher, Victor Garber, James Saito, Sam Jaeger, Jason George', null, 'Many lawyers consider themselves prophets, but Eli Stone may be the real deal. Eli has built a successful career at a top law firm in San Francisco representing only the biggest and richest corporations that make a habit of screwing over the little guy. But after experiencing a series of odd hallucinations, Eli seeks to find a deeper meaning to life while trying not to lose his job and destroy his relationship with the bosses'' daughter. When Eli discovers an aneurysm in his brain, he wonders if his condition is truly medical or if perhaps he now has a higher calling.', 'Many lawyers consider themselves prophets, but Eli Stone may be the real deal. Eli has built a successful career at a top law firm in San Francisco representing only the biggest and richest corporations that make a habit of screwing over the little guy. But after experiencing a series of odd hallucinations, Eli seeks to find a deeper meaning to life while trying not to lose his job and destroy his relationship with the bosses'' daughter. When Eli discovers an aneurysm in his brain, he wonders if his condition is truly medical or if perhaps he now has a higher calling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hWVuLjx3QPhpfTCePbB9nunIJt0.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1365'),
