  ('384086898801886563', 'En Terapia', 2012, 'Drama', 'Hagai Levi, Nir Bergman, Ori Sivan', 'Hagai Levi, Ari Folman, Alejandro Maci', 'Diego Peretti, Cecilia Roth, Julieta Díaz, Darío Grandinetti, Santiago Magariños', null, 'En Terapia is a 2012 Argentine remake of In Treatment. The main actors of the 2012 season are Diego Peretti, Julieta Cardinali, Germán Palacios, Ailín Salas, Dolores Fonzi, Leonardo Sbaraglia and Norma Aleandro. The second season added Carla Peterson, Gonzalo Slipak, Roberto Carnaghi and Luisana Lopilato.', 'En Terapia is a 2012 Argentine remake of In Treatment. The main actors of the 2012 season are Diego Peretti, Julieta Cardinali, Germán Palacios, Ailín Salas, Dolores Fonzi, Leonardo Sbaraglia and Norma Aleandro. The second season added Carla Peterson, Gonzalo Slipak, Roberto Carnaghi and Luisana Lopilato.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDuxKzou9AUKfth41DF2radfEAe.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:56430'),
