  ('952041849600009560', 'Entrepreneurial Age', 2018, 'Drama', null, null, 'Huang Xuan, AngelaBaby, Zhou Yiwei, Song Yi, David Wang, Dai Xu, Zhang Xiaoqian, Fan Jinwei', null, 'Programmer Guo Xin Nian suddenly has a light bulb moment and becomes determined to create a mobile app that converts text messages into voice recordings before they are delivered. With the help of angel investors, loyal friends and investment analyst Na Lan, the new app soon becomes a hit with mobile users. However, Guo Xin Nian is ill-prepared for the competitive app development market and suffers several setbacks at the hands of competitors. With the help of friend-turned-lover Na Lan, Guo Xin Nian is eventually able to learn from his mistakes and start afresh as a true entrepreneur.', 'Programmer Guo Xin Nian suddenly has a light bulb moment and becomes determined to create a mobile app that converts text messages into voice recordings before they are delivered. With the help of angel investors, loyal friends and investment analyst Na Lan, the new app soon becomes a hit with mobile users. However, Guo Xin Nian is ill-prepared for the competitive app development market and suffers several setbacks at the hands of competitors. With the help of friend-turned-lover Na Lan, Guo Xin Nian is eventually able to learn from his mistakes and start afresh as a true entrepreneur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Afg2YFbv6Vx06qjOpXcGyiIZB8B.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82660'),
  ('144929229631330671', 'Entrepreneurs', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Rober Bodegas, Alberto Casado', null, 'Rober Bodegas, Alberto Casado, Aura Garrido, Gonzalo de Castro, Victoria Martín, Luis Bermejo, Aníbal Gómez, Lalo Tenorio', null, 'Gonzalo, a bar owner''s son, keeps failing at nightlife ventures funded by his father. Given one last chance with a new space, he partners with a self-proclaimed guru to open a coworking space, supervised by his sister Julia.', 'Gonzalo, a bar owner''s son, keeps failing at nightlife ventures funded by his father. Given one last chance with a new space, he partners with a self-proclaimed guru to open a coworking space, supervised by his sister Julia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dk0cSgzkceAyNKtgfhAbKULlnps.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278274'),
  ('648840487213945331', 'Envious', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Griselda Siciliani, Esteban Lamothe, Pilar Gamboa, Violeta Urtizberea, Marina Bellati, Bárbara Lombardo, Lorena Vega, Susana Pampín', 'TV-MA', 'After a devastating breakup, Vicky, almost 40, embarks on a quest for new love, unaware it will lead her to a profound—and hilarious—self-discovery.', 'After a devastating breakup, Vicky, almost 40, embarks on a quest for new love, unaware it will lead her to a profound—and hilarious—self-discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qYw979lIT163wN2z2P6DHoVEftj.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:261615'),
  ('110443208128555903', 'Envy', 2025, 'Drama, Soap', 'Yılmaz Sahin', 'Yılmaz Sahin', 'Özgü Namal, Selahattin Paşalı, Mehmet Günsür, Ayda Aksel, Beril Pozam, Hafsanur Sancaktutan, Hande Doğandemir, Dilara Aksüyek', null, 'Deprived of her mother''s attention and love throughout her life, Seniha grows up with a deep sense of jealousy towards her older brother, Halit. For her beauty-obsessed mother, Seniha is the ugly duckling, completely unfit for her noble and wealthy family. Her older brother, Halit, is the opposite. He is her mother''s pride in every sense. Halit attends the best schools and takes advantage of the family''s resources. He becomes both the country''s most successful lawyer and its most promiscuous bachelor. Seniha, however, sinks deeper and deeper into the depths of her sense of worthlessness. She never finished school, never married, and has practically become a servant in her own home. She has become, as her older brother calls her, "Miss Nobody.', 'Deprived of her mother''s attention and love throughout her life, Seniha grows up with a deep sense of jealousy towards her older brother, Halit. For her beauty-obsessed mother, Seniha is the ugly duckling, completely unfit for her noble and wealthy family. Her older brother, Halit, is the opposite. He is her mother''s pride in every sense. Halit attends the best schools and takes advantage of the family''s resources. He becomes both the country''s most successful lawyer and its most promiscuous bachelor. Seniha, however, sinks deeper and deeper into the depths of her sense of worthlessness. She never finished school, never married, and has practically become a servant in her own home. She has become, as her older brother calls her, "Miss Nobody.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/herjCgzFTKF3tCN8bW9cNfrvKjW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:300030'),
  ('918325818278192312', 'Epic Rap Battles of History', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Lloyd Ahlquist, Peter Shukoff', 'Dante Cimadamore', null, 'NR', 'Pitting notable historical and pop culture figures, real and fictional, against one another in a rap battle format.', 'Pitting notable historical and pop culture figures, real and fictional, against one another in a rap battle format.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4qXok4hvDCdzyp4JoJ82WByHToh.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:66774'),
  ('881472469887675599', 'Episodes', 2011, 'Comedy', 'David Crane, Jeffrey Klarik', null, 'Matt LeBlanc, Tamsin Greig, Stephen Mangan, John Pankow, Kathleen Rose Perkins, Mircea Monroe, Callum Adams', 'TV-MA', 'A British husband-and-wife comedy writing team travel to Hollywood to remake their successful British TV series, with disastrous results.', 'A British husband-and-wife comedy writing team travel to Hollywood to remake their successful British TV series, with disastrous results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yyaU6cayJQCr555VgYYETbDHu1E.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:31841'),
  ('196210292261261273', 'Epitaphs', 2004, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Adrián Suar', 'Marcelo Slavich', 'Cecilia Roth, Leonardo Sbaraglia, Villanueva Cosse, Alejandro Awada, Natalia Lobo, Antonella Costa, Roberto Monzo, Nahuel Pérez Biscayart', 'TV-MA', 'Epitafios is a 2004 13-episode, Argentinian crime fiction TV mini-series with the tagline: El Final Está Escrito ... The End Is Written. The series, which takes place in an unnamed South American city, was shot in Buenos Aires. The series was produced by HBO Latin America and Argentinian TV/film company Pol-Ka Producciones. It was written by Marcelo Slavich and Walter Slavich and directed by Alberto Lecchi and Jorge Nisco. Although all of the actors were Argentinian, a neutral Spanish was used instead of the local Rioplatense Spanish, avoiding colloquialisms such as the local vos in favor of the more common tú. The series debuted in Australia on SBS in May 2007 under the title If The Dead Could Speak. It premiered in Poland on Cinemax on November 6, 2008. In Germany, it premiered on November 6, 2009 on pay TV channel FOX under the title Epitafios - Tod Ist Die Antwort.', 'Epitafios is a 2004 13-episode, Argentinian crime fiction TV mini-series with the tagline: El Final Está Escrito ... The End Is Written. The series, which takes place in an unnamed South American city, was shot in Buenos Aires. The series was produced by HBO Latin America and Argentinian TV/film company Pol-Ka Producciones. It was written by Marcelo Slavich and Walter Slavich and directed by Alberto Lecchi and Jorge Nisco. Although all of the actors were Argentinian, a neutral Spanish was used instead of the local Rioplatense Spanish, avoiding colloquialisms such as the local vos in favor of the more common tú. The series debuted in Australia on SBS in May 2007 under the title If The Dead Could Speak. It premiered in Poland on Cinemax on November 6, 2008. In Germany, it premiered on November 6, 2009 on pay TV channel FOX under the title Epitafios - Tod Ist Die Antwort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rlg3fLGmCMgeOrCE69mFRsMtRG3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:12838'),
  ('810050025847389655', 'Epstein''s Shadow: Ghislaine Maxwell', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Ghislaine Maxwell, Jeffrey Epstein', 'TV-14', 'An investigation into British socialite Ghislaine Maxwell, who is known for her association with convicted sex offender Jeffrey Epstein.', 'An investigation into British socialite Ghislaine Maxwell, who is known for her association with convicted sex offender Jeffrey Epstein.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Vth4xfQX8bqAQLFQ94aZ0MkUxZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127562'),
