values
  ('13586366582705536', 'Ergo Proxy', 2006, 'Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Shukou Murase', null, 'Rie Saitou, Koji Yusa, Akiko Yajima', 'TV-MA', 'Thousands of years after Earth’s atmosphere was destroyed, adventure blooms in the strangest of places. The domed city of Romdo is supposed to be perfect, but Re-l Mayer, a young female inspector from the Civilian Intelligence Office, knows better. In this place where humans and robots coexist, she receives a strange message: something is awakening!', 'Thousands of years after Earth’s atmosphere was destroyed, adventure blooms in the strangest of places. The domed city of Romdo is supposed to be perfect, but Re-l Mayer, a young female inspector from the Civilian Intelligence Office, knows better. In this place where humans and robots coexist, she receives a strange message: something is awakening!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tHcce6PKnhNBneSMbadI4jynHpY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1097'),
  ('240928706977906053', 'Eric', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Abi Morgan', null, 'Benedict Cumberbatch, Gaby Hoffmann, McKinley Belcher III, Dan Fogler, Clarke Peters, Adepero Oduye', 'TV-MA', 'A desperate father, alongside a tenacious cop, battles his own demons on the streets of 1980s New York as he searches for his missing nine-year-old son.', 'A desperate father, alongside a tenacious cop, battles his own demons on the streets of 1980s New York as he searches for his missing nine-year-old son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9OV6McrRh1BAnrak3yVP9xYuUId.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217667'),
  ('100552567628947229', 'Erikoisjoukot', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Janne Lehtonen, Jan Knutti, Robin Hendry, Matias Petäistö', null, 'Fourteen celebrity contestants are put to test by trying to survive Finnish Special Forces training.', 'Fourteen celebrity contestants are put to test by trying to survive Finnish Special Forces training.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m162oMTJ3rHI46fGQYQPdO6STcl.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:223279'),
  ('7373639324617481', 'Erin & Aaron', 2023, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', null, null, 'Ava Ro, Jensen Gering, Celia Méndez, David S. Jung, Pyper Braun, Larisa Oleynik, Luca Diaz', 'TV-G', 'A newly blended family and two polar opposite stepsiblings named Erin and Aaron who come together through music.', 'A newly blended family and two polar opposite stepsiblings named Erin and Aaron who come together through music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQ73bNBqci7qUJNVjlVFXsglFFx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222024'),
  ('865641741584882473', 'Erinyes', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', null, 'Igor Brejdygant, Borys Lankosz, Magdalena Lankosz', 'Marcin Dorociński, Wiktoria Gorodecka', null, 'Edward Popielski, a Polish detective, who suffers from photogenic epilepsy, which helps him track down criminals.', 'Edward Popielski, a Polish detective, who suffers from photogenic epilepsy, which helps him track down criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itDfBShHgUg8jPaJFivczFSK4Xw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213146'),
  ('269916856975500750', 'Errands', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Caner Özyurtlu, Volkan Öge', 'Caner Özyurtlu, Volkan Öge', 'Çağlar Çorumlu, Güven Murat Akpınar', null, 'Vedat, a veteran missionary, and Evren, a political corrector who has studied philosophy, are the duo assigned for the ''extremely important'' errands of a wealthy businessman. This mismatched duo, one of whom closes his eyes and does his duty, and the other questions every step he takes, sets out on a different adventure in each episode. But they clash within themselves, more than they do due to duty.', 'Vedat, a veteran missionary, and Evren, a political corrector who has studied philosophy, are the duo assigned for the ''extremely important'' errands of a wealthy businessman. This mismatched duo, one of whom closes his eyes and does his duty, and the other questions every step he takes, sets out on a different adventure in each episode. But they clash within themselves, more than they do due to duty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXu11FiEED5CYwf78A8WCqa2kmh.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:125412'),
  ('374440528873129011', 'ERROR', 1980, null, null, null, null, 'TV-Y7', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ftKarhxw86BwQR1gYKdhTB8REAz.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:25895'),
  ('764366673304407848', 'ERROR', 2026, 'Drama', null, 'Sakiko Yae', 'Mei Hata, Mirai Shida, Ryusei Fujii, Ikue Sakakibara, Yoshinori Okada, Chiaki Kuriyama, Manato Sakamoto, Kitazato Ruu', null, 'Haunted by guilt over a woman’s accidental death, Yume Nakata forms an unexpected and fragile bond with Mio Osako, the woman’s grieving daughter, as they navigate loss, remorse, and the beginnings of an unusual friendship.', 'Haunted by guilt over a woman’s accidental death, Yume Nakata forms an unexpected and fragile bond with Mio Osako, the woman’s grieving daughter, as they navigate loss, remorse, and the beginnings of an unusual friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrh2udUtdaaSFoV3l5yfuQdAfc0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:313730'),
  ('804661322590678423', 'Escalona', 1991, 'Drama', 'Bernardo Romero Pereiro', 'Bernardo Romero Pereiro', 'Carlos Vives, Florina Lemaitre, Rodrigo Obregón, Juan Carlos Arango, Nelly Moreno, Alejandra Borrero', null, 'The improbable real life of Rafael Escalona, who had no music education and became Colombia''s king of vallenato music, chronicling everyday life.', 'The improbable real life of Rafael Escalona, who had no music education and became Colombia''s king of vallenato music, chronicling everyday life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10AfopJHOWHC2Vd27UTUNR9vAzy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98470'),
  ('760847800330476304', 'Escape at Dannemora', 2018, 'Drama, Crime', 'Brett Johnson, Michael Tolkin', null, 'Benicio del Toro, Paul Dano, Patricia Arquette, Eric Lange, David Morse, Bonnie Hunt, Gregory Dann', 'TV-MA', 'The stranger-than-fiction account of a prison break in upstate New York in the summer of 2015, which spawned a massive manhunt for two convicted murderers who were aided in their escape by a married female prison employee with whom they both became sexually entangled.', 'The stranger-than-fiction account of a prison break in upstate New York in the summer of 2015, which spawned a massive manhunt for two convicted murderers who were aided in their escape by a married female prison employee with whom they both became sexually entangled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odk6ccUtUJlGTzPApKS6s4CTTrK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72039'),
  ('611002778424228061', 'Escape from the Trilateral Slopes', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', 'Shen Xingxing', 'Passsee Mu', 'Guo Qilin, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, You Yongzhi, Wang Xun, Qi Xi, Wang Yuwen, Jiang Peiyao, Jiang Qilin', null, 'Trilateral Slopes, a tropical exotic melting pot teeming with all kinds of people, a place where prosperity and decay coexist. Shen Xing, a laborer who unexpectedly ends up here, crosses paths with Mr. Cai, a local wheeler-dealer navigating through the various forces at play. Together, they embark on an adventure, guided by a glimmer of kindness, as they face the struggle between staying and escaping. How will their story unfold in the midst of the disarray?', 'Trilateral Slopes, a tropical exotic melting pot teeming with all kinds of people, a place where prosperity and decay coexist. Shen Xing, a laborer who unexpectedly ends up here, crosses paths with Mr. Cai, a local wheeler-dealer navigating through the various forces at play. Together, they embark on an adventure, guided by a glimmer of kindness, as they face the struggle between staying and escaping. How will their story unfold in the midst of the disarray?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/89VKjiQxlSAYHZHX8U5e6D9WzRp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:252636'),
  ('554482516976944903', 'Escape the Night', 2016, 'Mystery, Reality', 'Joey Graceffa', 'Joey Graceffa, Mike Ferry, John Ferry', 'Joey Graceffa', 'TV-14', 'Welcome to "Escape the Night." In this surreality competition series, hosted by Joey Graceffa, 10 guests are invited from the modern world to attend a dinner at his newly acquired mansion estate, which has been locked in the 1920''s; when America was roaring... roaring with madness. This is a dinner party to die for. No one is safe.', 'Welcome to "Escape the Night." In this surreality competition series, hosted by Joey Graceffa, 10 guests are invited from the modern world to attend a dinner at his newly acquired mansion estate, which has been locked in the 1920''s; when America was roaring... roaring with madness. This is a dinner party to die for. No one is safe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qN1cNNdbfy2LsjJp32FqNyfCfDB.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:67235'),
  ('734765249476915249', 'Escape to the Country', 2002, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'The property show that helps prospective buyers find their dream home in the country.', 'The property show that helps prospective buyers find their dream home in the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykSfW3rU7Th0VvrgB85nHvQZCAN.jpg', 26, 'tmdb:tv:6390'),
  ('246440354193455505', 'Escaping Twin Flames', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Shaleia Divine, Jeff Divine, Janja Lalich', 'TV-MA', 'A couple built a spiritual business to help people find true love. Now, former followers are sharing their disturbing practices in this docuseries.', 'A couple built a spiritual business to help people find true love. Now, former followers are sharing their disturbing practices in this docuseries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oeRTHlxw3Xh1wd6owQNpvXP68vl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:236406'),
  ('592316994199576299', 'Escobar by Escobar', 2021, 'Documentary, Crime', null, 'Stéphane Osmont', 'Pablo Escobar, Sebastian Marroquin, Angeles Sarmiento, Maria Isabel Santos, Oscar Ritore, Diana Ortiz, James Thornton', null, 'The true story of Colombian drug lord Pablo Escobar through the eyes of his son, Juan Pablo, whose life changed astronomically the day his father died.', 'The true story of Colombian drug lord Pablo Escobar through the eyes of his son, Juan Pablo, whose life changed astronomically the day his father died.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKZuFmavKuxiNVTzBT7OfSN4EzD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130911'),
  ('396462344490709434', 'Escolinha do Professor Raimundo: Nova Geração', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Bruno Mazzeo, Nizo Neto', 'Nizo Neto', 'Bruno Mazzeo, Betty Gofman, Marcelo Adnet, Marcelo Serrado, Maria Clara Gueiros, Fernanda de Freitas, Otávio Müller, Dani Calabresa', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBfmraIAe96evK5dOy8Mdf8JXcR.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:83828'),
  ('250959799759343460', 'Escort Boys', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ruben Alves', null, 'Guillaume Labbé, Thibaut Évrard, Corentin Fila, Simon Ehrlacher, Marysole Fertard, Nadia Roz', null, 'In Camargue, four guys in dire straits turn to escorting to save their childhood beekeeping estate. Coached by the group''s little sister who manages this unique ''business'' in the region, they will have to service women and, through their desires... learn to be men of today.', 'In Camargue, four guys in dire straits turn to escorting to save their childhood beekeeping estate. Coached by the group''s little sister who manages this unique ''business'' in the region, they will have to service women and, through their desires... learn to be men of today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGJFRIpTU8jwarl6fN85BA7blkJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:241063'),
  ('606691843251227215', 'Escrava Isaura', 1976, 'Soap, Drama', 'Gilberto Braga', 'Gilberto Braga', 'Lucélia Santos, Rubens de Falco, Edwin Luisi, Roberto Pirillo, Norma Blum, Gilberto Martinho, Beatriz Lyra, Átila Iório', null, 'Set in 19th-century Brazil during the waning years of slavery, Escrava Isaura tells the story of Isaura, a white-skinned enslaved woman raised with the manners and education of a noble lady. Though treated with affection by her mistress, Isaura remains legally enslaved and becomes the object of obsessive desire by Leôncio Almeida, the cruel heir to the plantation. After the death of her protector, Isaura falls under Leôncio’s control. Despite his attempts to seduce and dominate her, she resists, determined to preserve her dignity and freedom. Her father, Miguel, helps her escape to Recife, where she adopts a new identity and meets Álvaro, a wealthy and principled abolitionist who falls in love with her. Leôncio eventually tracks her down, leading to dramatic confrontations. In the end, Álvaro rescues Isaura by purchasing Leôncio’s debts, securing her freedom and affirming the story’s central themes of justice, love, and resistance against oppression.', 'Set in 19th-century Brazil during the waning years of slavery, Escrava Isaura tells the story of Isaura, a white-skinned enslaved woman raised with the manners and education of a noble lady. Though treated with affection by her mistress, Isaura remains legally enslaved and becomes the object of obsessive desire by Leôncio Almeida, the cruel heir to the plantation. After the death of her protector, Isaura falls under Leôncio’s control. Despite his attempts to seduce and dominate her, she resists, determined to preserve her dignity and freedom. Her father, Miguel, helps her escape to Recife, where she adopts a new identity and meets Álvaro, a wealthy and principled abolitionist who falls in love with her. Leôncio eventually tracks her down, leading to dramatic confrontations. In the end, Álvaro rescues Isaura by purchasing Leôncio’s debts, securing her freedom and affirming the story’s central themes of justice, love, and resistance against oppression.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPSCKSxfqm1lW3JRENXtKg856H4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5618'),
  ('173906711808332360', 'Esenin', 2005, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Igor Zaytsev, Vladimir Valutskiy', null, 'Sergei Bezrukov, Aleksandr Mikhaylov, Oleg Tabakov, Pavel Derevyanko, Gosha Kutsenko, Sean Young, Konstantin Khabenskiy, Kseniya Rappoport', null, 'MOORE''s investigator, Colonel Alexander Khlystov, receives an old photograph in the mail: it shows Yesenin, who has just been taken out of the loop. According to the rules, the investigator must give the case a legal course.', 'MOORE''s investigator, Colonel Alexander Khlystov, receives an old photograph in the mail: it shows Yesenin, who has just been taken out of the loop. According to the rules, the investigator must give the case a legal course.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qBWfEjw9lgDZcIKWDPqqtH8Z26Z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85688'),
  ('94418584846845296', 'Esmeralda', 1996, 'Drama, Soap', 'Delia Fiallo', null, 'Leticia Calderón, Fernando Colunga, Raquel Morell, Enrique Lizalde, Dina de Marco, Ana Patricia Rojo, Alejandro Ruiz, Dolores Salomón', 'TV-PG', 'Esmeralda is a telenovela that was released by Televisa in 1997. It is a remake of a 1970 Venezuelan telenovela of that same name, and was itself remade in Brazil in 2004. Another version is Topacio from Venezuela in 1984. One of the most famous telenovela all the time.', 'Esmeralda is a telenovela that was released by Televisa in 1997. It is a remake of a 1970 Venezuelan telenovela of that same name, and was itself remade in Brazil in 2004. Another version is Topacio from Venezuela in 1984. One of the most famous telenovela all the time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vsW9cQo4XL50zCz00groza5EmW0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16169'),
  ('627789652537561106', 'España dividida: la Guerra Civil en color', 2016, 'Documentary', null, 'Manel Lucas', null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2uKRiAh7oDaPbVT7nHpNJkiTRie.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70333'),
  ('362017698369896354', 'Espelho', 2013, 'Talk', null, null, 'Lázaro Ramos', null, 'Bahian actor Lázaro Ramos hosts a program showcasing Brazilian thought themes, featuring guests from drama, music, and humor, and narrating an article from the Universal Declaration of Human Rights.', 'Bahian actor Lázaro Ramos hosts a program showcasing Brazilian thought themes, featuring guests from drama, music, and humor, and narrating an article from the Universal Declaration of Human Rights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWv87NAzS1HqrmYElevqwt0bDYT.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:210162'),
  ('742456189494864592', 'Espelho da Vida', 2018, 'Soap, Drama, Family', 'Elizabeth Jhin', 'Maria Clara Mattos, Elizabeth Jhin, Wagner de Assis', 'Vitória Strada, Rafael Cardoso, Alinne Moraes, João Vicente de Castro, Irene Ravache, Júlia Lemmertz, Ângelo Antônio, Felipe Camargo', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jjH3aemiwXZa7VVlI9jC7t3shH1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98728'),
  ('954359314457304694', 'Esperanza mía', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Claudio Lacelli, Lily Ann Martin, Marta Betoldi', 'Mariano Martínez, Lali Espósito, Ana María Picchio, Rita Cortese, Ángela Torres, Tomás Fonzi, Gabriela Toscano, Federico D''Elía', 'NR', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hiN2JlvKQkooXCbfdVac9KcS83c.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63055'),
  ('243436846917456447', 'Esref''s Dream', 2025, 'Drama', 'Ethem Özışık', 'Ethem Özışık', 'Çağatay Ulusoy, Demet Özdemir, Büşra Develi, Necip Memili, Ahmet Rıfat Şungar, Tolga Tekin, Görkem Sevindik, Ceren Benderlioğlu', null, 'As a child, Eşref fell in love from afar with a girl he called “Rüya” and spent years searching for her, only to become a powerful mafia figure along the way. Meanwhile, Nisan, an idealistic musician, finds herself in grave danger after performing at a wedding held at Eşref’s hotel. Eşref falls for Nisan, unaware that she is both the long-lost Rüya he has been chasing for years and a police informant. Trapped in a whirlwind of love, betrayal, and power struggles, Eşref is forced into a brutal reckoning—both with his criminal empire and his own emotions.', 'As a child, Eşref fell in love from afar with a girl he called “Rüya” and spent years searching for her, only to become a powerful mafia figure along the way. Meanwhile, Nisan, an idealistic musician, finds herself in grave danger after performing at a wedding held at Eşref’s hotel. Eşref falls for Nisan, unaware that she is both the long-lost Rüya he has been chasing for years and a police informant. Trapped in a whirlwind of love, betrayal, and power struggles, Eşref is forced into a brutal reckoning—both with his criminal empire and his own emotions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eeFYLgiRFaG3bKx1qLyC7YOdHJz.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:283123'),
  ('468607407007391642', 'Estab-Life: Great Escape', 2022, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Goro Taniguchi', null, 'Tomomi Mineuchi, Rie Takahashi, Maria Naganawa, Show Hayami, Shin-ichiro Miki, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wataru Takagi, Takeshi Kusao', null, 'The distant future. After reaching its peak, Earth''s population fell into decline. AI was developed to help preserve the species and manage the ecosystem; a grand experiment in human diversity. Through genetic engineering, a diverse array of peoples, including beastfolk, magical beings, and more, was created to live in a diverse city separated into walled "clusters". Each cluster developed a unique culture, befitting of the people that lived there. Their lives, and the system, is continually maintained by the AI to ensure survival.', 'The distant future. After reaching its peak, Earth''s population fell into decline. AI was developed to help preserve the species and manage the ecosystem; a grand experiment in human diversity. Through genetic engineering, a diverse array of peoples, including beastfolk, magical beings, and more, was created to live in a diverse city separated into walled "clusters". Each cluster developed a unique culture, befitting of the people that lived there. Their lives, and the system, is continually maintained by the AI to ensure survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2gYUsPnzcY8caQGWoTUrpQYypu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:134580'),
  ('1067948040847523157', 'Estonia', 2023, 'Drama', 'Miikko Oikkonen', 'Andris Feldmanis, Livia Ulman, Miikko Oikkonen', 'Jussi Nikkilä, Claes Hartelius', null, 'Estonia tells the story of the tragic accident of the car-ferry MS Estonia, which deeply shocked the world in the autumn of 1994. Through the moving personal stories of victims, survivors, loved ones and investigators, the eight-part series explores how it is possible that 852 people lost their lives and no one is held accountable.', 'Estonia tells the story of the tragic accident of the car-ferry MS Estonia, which deeply shocked the world in the autumn of 1994. Through the moving personal stories of victims, survivors, loved ones and investigators, the eight-part series explores how it is possible that 852 people lost their lives and no one is held accountable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gC9AfdIkKkCBRMaHwDF7bvHkv6V.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218711'),
  ('526477633892502502', 'Estonia - fyndet som ändrar allt', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Henrik Evertsson', null, 'Lars Borgnäs', null, 'In 1994, M/S Estonia sinks during its route from Tallinn to Stockholm. 852 people sink with the ship. For 26 years, survivors and relatives to the victims have asked one question: what truly happened to Estonia?', 'In 1994, M/S Estonia sinks during its route from Tallinn to Stockholm. 852 people sink with the ship. For 26 years, survivors and relatives to the victims have asked one question: what truly happened to Estonia?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lvEldJ40ndNR87sVr3nswOWHUad.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:110170'),
  ('82891518766095316', 'Estoy vivo', 2017, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Crime', 'Daniel Écija', null, 'Javier Gutiérrez, Alejo Sauras, Jesús Castejón, Fele Martínez, Alfonso Bassave, Anna Castillo, Cristina Plazas, Lucía Caraballo', 'TV-PG', 'A policeman dies chasing a serial killer and is reincarnated in another policeman five years later, granted immortality in exchange of never revealing his true identity.', 'A policeman dies chasing a serial killer and is reincarnated in another policeman five years later, granted immortality in exchange of never revealing his true identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHUJlJxBYQIgqS8rMeqgLPFR4sy.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:73778'),
  ('624108486301578164', 'Eta Amaderi Golpo', 2025, 'Family, Reality', 'Mohammad Mostafa Kamal Raz', null, 'Khairul Basar, Deepa Khandakar, Irfan Sajjad, Keya Payel', null, 'Eta Amaderi Golpo” (This Is Our Story) is a Bangladeshi drama series that portrays the real-life struggles, emotions, and relationships of ordinary people. The story mainly focuses on friendship, love, family bonds, and social challenges faced by young adults in modern society. The series shows how different characters deal with dreams, failures, misunderstandings, and personal growth. Through their journeys, it highlights themes such as honesty, sacrifice, trust, and the importance of standing by loved ones during difficult times. Each episode reflects relatable situations from everyday life, making the audience emotionally connected to the characters.', 'Eta Amaderi Golpo” (This Is Our Story) is a Bangladeshi drama series that portrays the real-life struggles, emotions, and relationships of ordinary people. The story mainly focuses on friendship, love, family bonds, and social challenges faced by young adults in modern society. The series shows how different characters deal with dreams, failures, misunderstandings, and personal growth. Through their journeys, it highlights themes such as honesty, sacrifice, trust, and the importance of standing by loved ones during difficult times. Each episode reflects relatable situations from everyday life, making the audience emotionally connected to the characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mfm7sw4nzUodmDSFH0hI0QOFPt.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:312658'),
  ('971189981225959255', 'Eternal Boys', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yuko Noichi, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Daisuke Namikawa, Daisuke Hirakawa, Katsuyuki Konishi, Jun Fukuyama, Nozomu Sasaki, Haruka Chisuga', 'TV-14', '“The Mature Idol Project” - The latest project proposed by Manpuku Entertainment Productions, in a bid to revive the company. Experienced in the successes and failures of the business world, 6 middle-aged men now face the many hurdles of age and physical ability, whilst pursuing their goal to become idols. In an effort to prove that old dogs can learn new tricks, and that you can still learn to shine no matter your age, these middle-aged men, at the end of their ropes, are taking a stand!', '“The Mature Idol Project” - The latest project proposed by Manpuku Entertainment Productions, in a bid to revive the company. Experienced in the successes and failures of the business world, 6 middle-aged men now face the many hurdles of age and physical ability, whilst pursuing their goal to become idols. In an effort to prove that old dogs can learn new tricks, and that you can still learn to shine no matter your age, these middle-aged men, at the end of their ropes, are taking a stand!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFYOFJEacvGTrAPH34QqxOHHYi8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:195288'),
  ('881564417070914385', 'Eternal Brotherhood', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, War & Politics, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Tian Liangliang', 'Yang Xuwen, Liu Yuning, Zhang Ming''en, Li Mozhi, Joyin Cai, Ma Shaohua, Huang Haoyue, Li Guo', null, 'In the war-ravaged land of Zichuan, a heroic general and his sworn brothers battle internal rebellion and an invading enemy. As they fight to protect their homeland and loved ones, they forge a powerful tale of loyalty, sacrifice, and the pursuit of peace.', 'In the war-ravaged land of Zichuan, a heroic general and his sworn brothers battle internal rebellion and an invading enemy. As they fight to protect their homeland and loved ones, they forge a powerful tale of loyalty, sacrifice, and the pursuit of peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qkeNsHn8DBjkfuL5EzMNPwP0qbW.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:247590'),
  ('250988474530745218', 'Eternal Butler', 2024, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Joe Tsai', 'Kevin Chang, Eden Chen, Lawrence Lo, Sing Hom', null, 'Ever 4, an AI butler, and Luo Bu Shi, a spoiled heir, form an unlikely bond that challenges what it means to connect.', 'Ever 4, an AI butler, and Luo Bu Shi, a spoiled heir, form an unlikely bond that challenges what it means to connect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWbnk48MqSrvIFCwBqgAh2xH1aW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:258963'),
  ('132329497973154714', 'Eternal Call', 1976, 'Drama', 'Vladimir Krasnopolskiy, Valeriy Uskov', 'Anatoliy Ivanov', 'Yuri Smirnov, Ivan Lapikov, Andrey Martynov, Nikolay Ivanov, Tamara Syomina, Efim Kopelyan, Valeri Khlevinsky, Pyotr Velyaminov', null, 'A saga about the life of the Siberian Savelyev family during the period 1902 through the 1960s as they survive through three wars, a revolution, and Soviet government approval.', 'A saga about the life of the Siberian Savelyev family during the period 1902 through the 1960s as they survive through three wars, a revolution, and Soviet government approval.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWFbh63Mrw5OYHsPjeR4ijRH6HB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:54454'),
  ('38746911230256031', 'Eternal Faith', null, 'Mystery, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Mo Xiang Tong Xiu', null, 'Zhai Xiaowen, Zhang Linghe, Xiao Kaizhong, Cai Yao, Li Fancheng, Zheng Yibin, Chang Huasen, Tian Xuning', null, 'Xie Lian, the crown prince of Xian Le Kingdom, successfully ascends to Heaven during his third trial in spite of successive demotions. However, he accidentally breaks the Gold Palace of heavenly officials. With no human worshiping him, Xie Lian has to descend to the secular world to exorcise ghosts, which may help him sustain his divinity.', 'Xie Lian, the crown prince of Xian Le Kingdom, successfully ascends to Heaven during his third trial in spite of successive demotions. However, he accidentally breaks the Gold Palace of heavenly officials. With no human worshiping him, Xie Lian has to descend to the secular world to exorcise ghosts, which may help him sustain his divinity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q9TOQQt4ZNEdKvgkBCOQ8bcC36C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130019'),
  ('1004735127355640627', 'Eternal Love', 2017, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Hong Qiu', 'Yang Mi, Mark Chao You-Ting, Ken Chang Tzu-Yao, Dilraba Dilmurat, Gao Weiguang, Lian Yiming, Maggie Huang, Vin Zhang', null, 'Three hundred years ago, Bai Qian stood on the Zhu Xian Terrace, turned around and jumped off without regret. Ye Hua stood by the bronze mirror to witness with his own eyes her death. Three hundred years later, in the East Sea Dragon Palace, the two meet unexpectedly. Another lifetime another world, after suffering betrayal Bai Qian no longer feels anything, yet she can''t seem to comprehend Ye Hua''s actions. Three lives three worlds, her and him, are they fated to love again?', 'Three hundred years ago, Bai Qian stood on the Zhu Xian Terrace, turned around and jumped off without regret. Ye Hua stood by the bronze mirror to witness with his own eyes her death. Three hundred years later, in the East Sea Dragon Palace, the two meet unexpectedly. Another lifetime another world, after suffering betrayal Bai Qian no longer feels anything, yet she can''t seem to comprehend Ye Hua''s actions. Three lives three worlds, her and him, are they fated to love again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/paeDktO7Bx2lmv9mEDiHtneoYrF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69316'),
  ('207107508188535277', 'Eternal Love of Dream', 2020, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Liang Zhenhua', 'Dilraba Dilmurat, Gao Weiguang, Liu Ruilin, Liu Yuefei, Wang Xiao, Li Dongheng, Yuan Yuxuan, Huang Junjie', null, 'Having been saved by Emperor Dong Hua from a vicious monster attack, Princess of Qingqiu, Bai Fengjiu becomes immensely indebted to him. To repay him, Fengjiu follows Donghua around on his adventures to eliminate evil but unwittingly realizes that her feelings of gratitude towards him has turned to romantic. However, after a hundred thousand years of fighting evil, Donghua has long forgotten the meaning of “love". To protect Fengjiu, Dong Hua sends her to the human world but accidentally causes the death of Fengjiu’s friend. Fengjiu enters the dream of Ah Lan Ruo to search for the fruit that will be able to resurrect her friend. However, Fengjiu ends up getting trapped in the dream. Dong Hua comes to rescue, and realizes he has fallen in love with Fengjiu…', 'Having been saved by Emperor Dong Hua from a vicious monster attack, Princess of Qingqiu, Bai Fengjiu becomes immensely indebted to him. To repay him, Fengjiu follows Donghua around on his adventures to eliminate evil but unwittingly realizes that her feelings of gratitude towards him has turned to romantic. However, after a hundred thousand years of fighting evil, Donghua has long forgotten the meaning of “love". To protect Fengjiu, Dong Hua sends her to the human world but accidentally causes the death of Fengjiu’s friend. Fengjiu enters the dream of Ah Lan Ruo to search for the fruit that will be able to resurrect her friend. However, Fengjiu ends up getting trapped in the dream. Dong Hua comes to rescue, and realizes he has fallen in love with Fengjiu…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kS1Q6FFKTs7rxcAYjskJEnfK7SC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81141'),
  ('374986144892564940', 'Eternal Yesterday', 2022, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Eda Yuuri', null, 'Rio Komiya, Inoue Sora, Karen Otomo, Taisuke Niihara, Yui Narumi, Yuichi Nakamura, Daichi Asai, Rie Kitahara', null, 'After an accident, no one can see the once-popular Koichi — except for loner Mitsuru, whose fondness for his classmate blooms into a haunting romance.', 'After an accident, no one can see the once-popular Koichi — except for loner Mitsuru, whose fondness for his classmate blooms into a haunting romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fKAV4lHxhmYZUsjkP6enXnBz4op.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209881'),
  ('929040999030763495', 'Eternally Confused and Eager for Love', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Rahul Nair', 'Rahul Nair', 'Vihaan Samat, Jim Sarbh, Rahul Bose, Suchitra Pillai, Dalai, Ankur Rathee', 'TV-MA', 'Often (mis)guided by a cheeky imaginary wizard, an awkward and lonely 20-something struggles to get out of his own way in his quest for a girlfriend.', 'Often (mis)guided by a cheeky imaginary wizard, an awkward and lonely 20-something struggles to get out of his own way in his quest for a girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ae73rDfVc8gKLXybi68roaZK9Hz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157932'),
