  ('421426163856097783', 'Expedition Bigfoot', 2019, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, 'Mireya Mayor, Bryce Johnson, Russell Acord, Biko Wright', 'TV-14', 'An elite team of Sasquatch specialists journey into the unforgiving Oregon wilderness in search of Bigfoot. The three-week expedition, based on science and expertise, may finally pull the elusive beast out of the pages of legend and lore and into reality.', 'An elite team of Sasquatch specialists journey into the unforgiving Oregon wilderness in search of Bigfoot. The three-week expedition, based on science and expertise, may finally pull the elusive beast out of the pages of legend and lore and into reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3d4c9ApFnN4fjst6ZtyYg8vfkJo.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:95157'),
