  ('528949839267228205', 'Express', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Iván Escobar', null, 'Maggie Civantos, Vicente Romero Sánchez, Esteban Meloni, Alba Planas, Bernardo Flores, Omar Banana, Laura Laprida, Carmen Daza', 'TV-MA', 'Barbara is a criminal psychologist who becomes the victim of an express kidnapping. After her abduction, she works as a negotiator in cases like hers to find the people who almost took her life.', 'Barbara is a criminal psychologist who becomes the victim of an express kidnapping. After her abduction, she works as a negotiator in cases like hers to find the people who almost took her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6d4dqELxuj4QUuDpb3sqWl8HD2c.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:136998'),
  ('983204454941507927', 'Extant', 2014, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Mickey Fisher', null, 'Halle Berry, Pierce Gagnon, Grace Gummer, Tyler Hilton, Jeffrey Dean Morgan', 'TV-14', 'An astronaut returns home from a year long solo mission in space. She tries to reconnect with her husband and son in their everyday life. Her experiences in space and home lead to events that ultimately will change the course of human history.', 'An astronaut returns home from a year long solo mission in space. She tries to reconnect with her husband and son in their everyday life. Her experiences in space and home lead to events that ultimately will change the course of human history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFwqHXoP1FxFbd8G8dY13y9bfAX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:58111'),
  ('942658985501436541', 'Extended Family', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Mike O''Malley', 'Laura Kightlinger', 'Jon Cryer, Abigail Spencer, Donald Faison, Sofia Capanna, Finn Sweeney', 'TV-PG', 'Jim and Julia are happily divorced, co-raising their kids while staying best friends and close confidants. But the situation gets hilariously more complicated when the owner of Jim''s favorite sports team enters the picture... and wins Julia''s heart.', 'Jim and Julia are happily divorced, co-raising their kids while staying best friends and close confidants. But the situation gets hilariously more complicated when the owner of Jim''s favorite sports team enters the picture... and wins Julia''s heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kp5JD06aKWMnWYTs9a3kHty0pDC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:232423'),
  ('168013466647259261', 'Exterior Night', 2022, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Marco Bellocchio, Giovanni Bianconi, Nicola Lusuardi', null, 'Fabrizio Gifuni, Margherita Buy, Toni Servillo, Fausto Russo Alesi, Daniela Marra, Gabriel Montesi, Fabrizio Contri, Gigio Alberti', null, 'Italy, March 16, 1978. Aldo Moro, president of Christian Democracy, the ruling party, is kidnapped by the extreme left-wing terrorist gang Red Brigades. While the criminals put him on trial and condemn him, the Italian government and Pope Paul VI pull their twisted strings to save his life.', 'Italy, March 16, 1978. Aldo Moro, president of Christian Democracy, the ruling party, is kidnapped by the extreme left-wing terrorist gang Red Brigades. While the criminals put him on trial and condemn him, the Italian government and Pope Paul VI pull their twisted strings to save his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kc9Y2cswHuCOE8PkRytEoOLwOwA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222108'),
  ('736425142486709656', 'Exterminate All the Brutes', 2021, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Raoul Peck', null, 'Raoul Peck, Josh Hartnett', 'TV-MA', 'Hybrid docuseries offering an expansive exploration of the exploitative and genocidal aspects of European colonialism, from America to Africa, and its impact on society today.', 'Hybrid docuseries offering an expansive exploration of the exploitative and genocidal aspects of European colonialism, from America to Africa, and its impact on society today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQc3n9iBPql56Hk56IQ0AlyaujP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117909'),
  ('1019862165452914994', 'Extinct', 2017, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Orson Scott Card', 'Orson Scott Card, Aaron Johnston', 'Victoria Atkin, Chad Michael Collins, Matthew Bellows, Yorke Fryer', null, '400 years after the extinction of the human race, a small group of humans are revived by an alien civilization. The colony of revived humans encounter struggles with the aliens who extinguished humankind centuries before, while trying to understand and get along with the mysterious aliens who revived them.', '400 years after the extinction of the human race, a small group of humans are revived by an alien civilization. The colony of revived humans encounter struggles with the aliens who extinguished humankind centuries before, while trying to understand and get along with the mysterious aliens who revived them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5lOTSc3HECtH1smrzfOsCSyzY17.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71994'),
  ('404487797063385707', 'Extra', 1994, 'News', null, null, 'Matthew Hoffman', 'TV-PG', 'Extra is an American entertainment television news program covering events and celebrities which debuted on September 5, 1994 in syndication. It was initially produced at Victory Studios in Glendale, California by Telepictures Productions in association with Warner Bros. Television Distribution. From 1995-2003 it was distributed by Time-Telepictures Television a joint merger between Time Magazine and Telepictures. Extra also had a spinoff show called Celebrity Justice, which ran for only three seasons from 2002–2005. Extra is one of two Warner Bros. Television shows to be syndicated to NBCUniversal television stations, the other being The Ellen DeGeneres Show. Extra is also one of two WBTV entertainment programs, the other being TMZ on TV.', 'Extra is an American entertainment television news program covering events and celebrities which debuted on September 5, 1994 in syndication. It was initially produced at Victory Studios in Glendale, California by Telepictures Productions in association with Warner Bros. Television Distribution. From 1995-2003 it was distributed by Time-Telepictures Television a joint merger between Time Magazine and Telepictures. Extra also had a spinoff show called Celebrity Justice, which ran for only three seasons from 2002–2005. Extra is one of two Warner Bros. Television shows to be syndicated to NBCUniversal television stations, the other being The Ellen DeGeneres Show. Extra is also one of two WBTV entertainment programs, the other being TMZ on TV.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7N2cJicxK8kss71bLLrq5HA4IB5.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:5129'),
  ('135069702489636396', 'Extra 3', 2004, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Peter Merseburger', null, null, null, 'Extra 3 is a political satirical magazine from Norddeutscher Rundfunk (NDR).', 'Extra 3 is a political satirical magazine from Norddeutscher Rundfunk (NDR).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xuJffmaJ4sbJDsK4rXInAU1huSo.jpg', 23, 'tmdb:tv:62102'),
  ('487481870492289229', 'Extracted', 2025, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-14', '12 untrained competitors attempt to survive extremely grueling conditions, perilous terrain, and the threat of fearsome predators in the unforgiving Canadian wilderness. Meanwhile, some miles away, their family members are locked down at a secluded headquarters watching them navigate their dangerous surroundings alone via a 24/7 live feed.', '12 untrained competitors attempt to survive extremely grueling conditions, perilous terrain, and the threat of fearsome predators in the unforgiving Canadian wilderness. Meanwhile, some miles away, their family members are locked down at a secluded headquarters watching them navigate their dangerous surroundings alone via a 24/7 live feed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u1ueclY9XgEn4nDBCfNhXVei7Ur.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:278639'),
  ('199130296567248803', 'Extracurricular', 2020, 'Crime, Drama', 'Gin Han-sai, Kim Jin-min', 'Gin Han-sai', 'Kim Dong-hee, Park Ju-hyun, Jung Da-bin, Nam Yoon-su, Kim Yeo-jin, Choi Min-soo, Park Hyuk-kwon, Seo Ye-hwa', 'TV-MA', 'Determined to escape a dead-end life, a gifted high school student turns to a world of serious crime to ensure he can pay for college.', 'Determined to escape a dead-end life, a gifted high school student turns to a world of serious crime to ensure he can pay for college.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sgzV6RNvc3e7LyRdht11NTS6tVv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90814'),
  ('844285304987209520', 'Extraordinary', 2023, 'Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Emma Moran', null, 'Mairéad Tyers, Sofia Oxenham, Bilal Hasna, Luke Rollason', 'TV-MA', 'In a world where everyone develops a power on their 18th birthday, Jen didn''t. She''s turning 25 and is still waiting to get hers. Adrift in a big, confusing world and armed with nothing but a bit of hope and a lot of desperation, Jen begins her journey to find her maybe-superpower. But in doing so, she might discover the joy of being just kind of ok.', 'In a world where everyone develops a power on their 18th birthday, Jen didn''t. She''s turning 25 and is still waiting to get hers. Adrift in a big, confusing world and armed with nothing but a bit of hope and a lot of desperation, Jen begins her journey to find her maybe-superpower. But in doing so, she might discover the joy of being just kind of ok.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uyDIWMAwfLqiIz0QQm0MPDE0085.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:47907'),
  ('310510014475910326', 'Extraordinary Attorney Woo', 2022, 'Drama', 'Moon Ji-won, Yoo In-sik', null, 'Park Eun-bin, Kang Tae-oh, Joo Jong-hyuk, Jeon Bae-soo, Baek Ji-won, Jin Kyung, Joo Hyun-young, Ha Yoon-kyung', 'TV-14', 'With a genius-level IQ, Woo Young-woo learns to embrace her extraordinary self while forming a tight-knit community of friends and allies.', 'With a genius-level IQ, Woo Young-woo learns to embrace her extraordinary self while forming a tight-knit community of friends and allies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zuNOQVI4rEaqwknrfQUVKtlKE2C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197067'),
  ('55092584876692341', 'Extraordinary Portraits', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Bill Bailey', null, 'Musician and passionate art collector Tinie Tempah hopes to shine the light on everyday heroes within society by painting portraits of them. These everyday heroes have extraordinary stories and the artists hope to turn these stories into amazing portraits. Portraiture has traditionally been a method of commemorating powerful or wealthy figures in society, however, Tinie hopes to shine a light on the everyday heroes within out society. Famous artists include street artist Dale Grimshaw and hyper-realist Kelvin Okafor.', 'Musician and passionate art collector Tinie Tempah hopes to shine the light on everyday heroes within society by painting portraits of them. These everyday heroes have extraordinary stories and the artists hope to turn these stories into amazing portraits. Portraiture has traditionally been a method of commemorating powerful or wealthy figures in society, however, Tinie hopes to shine a light on the everyday heroes within out society. Famous artists include street artist Dale Grimshaw and hyper-realist Kelvin Okafor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aMXkaqoyylA1eIw4QXbQsah4VKY.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:204065'),
  ('1076953055698530300', 'Extraordinary You', 2019, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Kim Dong-rae, Moon Joo-hee', 'In Ji-hye, Song Ha-young', 'Kim Hye-yoon, Rowoon, Lee Jae-wook, Lee Na-eun, Jung Gun-joo, Kim Young-dae, Lee Tae-ri, Kim Ji-in', null, 'When a high-school girl finds that she is merely a character from a comic book whose destiny is decided by the writer, she decides to change the plot to suit her desires and find the love of her life.', 'When a high-school girl finds that she is merely a character from a comic book whose destiny is decided by the writer, she decides to change the plot to suit her desires and find the love of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vse6Aq2BGz1CI2pa1JbOmyjXM37.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93657'),
  ('889328314336783446', 'Extrapolations', 2023, 'Drama', 'Scott Z. Burns', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Eight interconnected stories told over 33 years explore how our planet’s changing climate will affect family, work, faith—and survival.', 'Eight interconnected stories told over 33 years explore how our planet’s changing climate will affect family, work, faith—and survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cBUS1OijCX2jzirgajIWt4TOgTK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138169'),
  ('60359965138811260', 'Extras', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Ricky Gervais, Stephen Merchant', null, 'Ricky Gervais, Ashley Jensen, Stephen Merchant, Shaun Williamson, Shaun Pye', 'TV-MA', 'Andy Millman gave up his day job five years ago in the hope of achieving the big time, but he’s yet to land a speaking part, let alone saunter down the red carpet to pick up an Oscar. He remains optimistic however, as rubbing shoulders with the A-list on-set only serves to reinforce his belief that the big time is just a job or two away.', 'Andy Millman gave up his day job five years ago in the hope of achieving the big time, but he’s yet to land a speaking part, let alone saunter down the red carpet to pick up an Oscar. He remains optimistic however, as rubbing shoulders with the A-list on-set only serves to reinforce his belief that the big time is just a job or two away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oxiA2O4wRBCOzvfxYjNKZQuitQc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2693'),
  ('518836442376025426', 'Extreme Animals: One Wild Day', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'This stunning, modern natural history series embarks on a 24-hour journey with the most extraordinary animals on our planet, revealing the surprising and ingenious ways they thrive at different moments throughout the day.', 'This stunning, modern natural history series embarks on a 24-hour journey with the most extraordinary animals on our planet, revealing the surprising and ingenious ways they thrive at different moments throughout the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2NSrTSM9bZCADxn4A56VV83S6h.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97855'),
  ('740836726563130503', 'Extreme Cheapskates', 2012, 'Reality, Family', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Follow some of the most peculiar self-proclaimed frugalistas as they go to radical lengths to save money. These extreme penny pinchers share their best money saving tips, from dumpster diving to excessive recycling to strict budgeting.', 'Follow some of the most peculiar self-proclaimed frugalistas as they go to radical lengths to save money. These extreme penny pinchers share their best money saving tips, from dumpster diving to excessive recycling to strict budgeting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bdfv6JnbMWBvolFYS8kTq7pn1W.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:59271'),
  ('1118579925729973854', 'Extreme Couponing', 2011, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Extreme Couponing is a scripted American reality television series produced by Sharp Media and currently airing on cable network TLC in the United States and Canada.', 'Extreme Couponing is a scripted American reality television series produced by Sharp Media and currently airing on cable network TLC in the United States and Canada.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hjuBoNc4hZuSiCmPTjZj0hc9pBv.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:39424'),
  ('985465067536626541', 'Extreme Dinosaurs', 1997, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Kids', null, null, 'Blu Mankuma, Terry Klassen, Lee Tockar, Jason Gray-Stanford, Andrew Francis, Scott McNeil, Garry Chalk, Jacques Bourassa', 'TV-Y7', 'In the present a team of four anthropomorphic dinosaurs, created by aliens, must stop three anthropomorphic velociraptors who want to cause a cataclysm that would speed up global warming and make Earth''s climate pleasant for dinosaurs again.', 'In the present a team of four anthropomorphic dinosaurs, created by aliens, must stop three anthropomorphic velociraptors who want to cause a cataclysm that would speed up global warming and make Earth''s climate pleasant for dinosaurs again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yFJnXxFei4aEJlpnk0CbXMdGQzH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15182'),
  ('182108192910426027', 'Extreme Engineering', 2003, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-G', 'Extreme Engineering covers major construction projects from all around the world. Some are futuristic projects that may never be done, others are projects that are on there way to completion.', 'Extreme Engineering covers major construction projects from all around the world. Some are futuristic projects that may never be done, others are projects that are on there way to completion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2Ojs6gFwVhJvGA3MsPgVJOYT0U.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:6193'),
  ('973590230196389228', 'Extreme Ghostbusters', 1997, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Jeff Kline, Richard Raynis', null, 'Jason Marsden, Alfonso Ribeiro, Rino Romano, Tara Strong, Maurice LaMarche, Pat Musick, Billy West', 'TV-G', 'Based on the blockbuster films, this action-packed animated series starts a decade after the original Ghostbusters saved New York City from ghosts, goblins and ghouls. All the guys have left town, except Egon, now teaching a Paranormal Studies class at the local university. But Zuul, the all-powerful demon, has awakened from hibernation to wreak havoc on the unsuspecting masses. Desperate to recruit a new team, Egon and the plucky Janine turn to four of his teenage students: Kylie, a genius with an encyclopedic knowledge of the occult; Eduardo, a hip slacker with a crush on Kylie; Garrett, a wheelchair-bound athlete with a hot temper; and Roland, a “gentle giant” mechanical whiz. It''s only a matter of time before Egon, Janine, old pal Slimer and the “kids” band together to rid the city of the evildoers.', 'Based on the blockbuster films, this action-packed animated series starts a decade after the original Ghostbusters saved New York City from ghosts, goblins and ghouls. All the guys have left town, except Egon, now teaching a Paranormal Studies class at the local university. But Zuul, the all-powerful demon, has awakened from hibernation to wreak havoc on the unsuspecting masses. Desperate to recruit a new team, Egon and the plucky Janine turn to four of his teenage students: Kylie, a genius with an encyclopedic knowledge of the occult; Eduardo, a hip slacker with a crush on Kylie; Garrett, a wheelchair-bound athlete with a hot temper; and Roland, a “gentle giant” mechanical whiz. It''s only a matter of time before Egon, Janine, old pal Slimer and the “kids” band together to rid the city of the evildoers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqpfrbnrC9j4R0e5JK3dxTNj33Y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4793'),
  ('490900904468273100', 'Extreme Hearts', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ruriko Noguchi, Miho Okasaki, Kana Yuuki, Kana Ichinose, Asami Seto, Ayaka Fukuhara, Ari Ozawa, Chinami Hashimoto', 'TV-14', 'The story is set in the future, not long after the present day. Hyper Sports, which use extreme gear as support items, have become popular hobby competitions among both children and adults. Hiyori Hayama is a high school singer who has nothing to do with Hyper Sports, but a certain incident sets the story in motion.', 'The story is set in the future, not long after the present day. Hyper Sports, which use extreme gear as support items, have become popular hobby competitions among both children and adults. Hiyori Hayama is a high school singer who has nothing to do with Hyper Sports, but a certain incident sets the story in motion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZu9MeaBSzgXAaHaNWZiUovSpQu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157345'),
  ('182676071008766271', 'Extreme Makeover: Home Edition', 2003, 'Reality', null, null, 'Ty Pennington', 'TV-PG', 'Extreme Makeover: Home Edition is an American reality television series providing home improvements for less fortunate families and community schools. The show is hosted by carpenter and veteran television personality Ty Pennington. Each episode features a family that has faced some sort of recent or ongoing hardship such as a natural disaster or a family member with a life-threatening illness, in need of new hope. The show''s producers coordinate with a local construction contractor, which then coordinates with various companies in the building trades for a makeover of the family''s home. This includes interior, exterior and landscaping, performed in seven days while the family is on vacation and documented in the episode. If the house is beyond repair, they replace it entirely.', 'Extreme Makeover: Home Edition is an American reality television series providing home improvements for less fortunate families and community schools. The show is hosted by carpenter and veteran television personality Ty Pennington. Each episode features a family that has faced some sort of recent or ongoing hardship such as a natural disaster or a family member with a life-threatening illness, in need of new hope. The show''s producers coordinate with a local construction contractor, which then coordinates with various companies in the building trades for a makeover of the family''s home. This includes interior, exterior and landscaping, performed in seven days while the family is on vacation and documented in the episode. If the house is beyond repair, they replace it entirely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nM43UpAWF3Tleshq16N8vLsMhGr.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:721'),
  ('705520005832344147', 'Extremely Inappropriate!', 2024, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Kankuro Kudo, Fuminori Kaneko', null, 'Sadao Abe, Riisa Naka, Hayato Isomura, Yuumi Kawai, Yoh Yoshida, Koji Yamamoto, Arata Furuta, Ayumu Nakajima', null, 'Ichiro is a PE teacher in 1986 feared by his students for a "tough love" approach, harsh tongue and frequently “inappropriate” behavior. He’s also a dad trying to raise a rebellious daughter after having lost his wife to illness. When he gets transported in time to 2024, he encounters modern sensibilities that teach him about empathy but also gives people of today a reason to rethink their own political correctness in this time traversing comedy about change.', 'Ichiro is a PE teacher in 1986 feared by his students for a "tough love" approach, harsh tongue and frequently “inappropriate” behavior. He’s also a dad trying to raise a rebellious daughter after having lost his wife to illness. When he gets transported in time to 2024, he encounters modern sensibilities that teach him about empathy but also gives people of today a reason to rethink their own political correctness in this time traversing comedy about change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1AKZJpLZGXnTpC80hzR2IOdavq4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241795'),
  ('97688942956725987', 'Eye Candy', 2015, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Christian Taylor', null, 'Victoria Justice, Casey Deidrick, Kiersey Clemons, John Garet Stoker, Harvey Guillén', 'TV-14', 'Tech genius Lindy, convinced by her roommate to begin online dating, begins to suspect that one of her mysterious suitors may be a deadly cyber stalker. When her friends at the elusive cyber-police uncover a potential serial killer in Manhattan, all signs point to one of Lindy’s dates. Teaming up with this band of hackers Lindy works to solve the murders while unleashing her own style of justice on the streets of New York City.', 'Tech genius Lindy, convinced by her roommate to begin online dating, begins to suspect that one of her mysterious suitors may be a deadly cyber stalker. When her friends at the elusive cyber-police uncover a potential serial killer in Manhattan, all signs point to one of Lindy’s dates. Teaming up with this band of hackers Lindy works to solve the murders while unleashing her own style of justice on the streets of New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWC1JvKDReUpcMxupTwn4cCuB55.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61863'),
  ('726438168099838671', 'Eye Love You', 2024, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, 'Kisa Miura, Subaru Yamashita', 'Fumi Nikaido, Chae Jong-hyeop, Taishi Nakagawa, Mizuki Yamashita, Tetta Sugimoto, Shiraku Tatekawa, Hiroya Shimizu, Yui Narumi', 'TV-14', 'Sparks begin to fly when a telepathic woman who''d given up on love meets a kindhearted Korean student who thinks in a language she can''t understand.', 'Sparks begin to fly when a telepathic woman who''d given up on love meets a kindhearted Korean student who thinks in a language she can''t understand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1PR848wIktHORTpGgvnQZiCMxBF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:240581'),
  ('724369727040597717', 'Eyes of Wakanda', 2025, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Follow the adventures of brave Wakandan warriors throughout history in this globe-trotting adventure, where they must carry out dangerous missions to retrieve Vibranium artifacts from the enemies of Wakanda. They are the Hatut Zaraze and this is their story.', 'Follow the adventures of brave Wakandan warriors throughout history in this globe-trotting adventure, where they must carry out dangerous missions to retrieve Vibranium artifacts from the enemies of Wakanda. They are the Hatut Zaraze and this is their story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bG23nZW96LxmWkJjsagRZI9hF6t.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241388'),
  ('873789461290627809', 'Eyeshield 21', 2005, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Miyu Irino, Atsushi Tamura, Aya Hirano, Mamoru Miyano, Kappei Yamaguchi, Kouichi Nagano, Daisuke Hirakawa, Daisuke Ono', null, 'In Tokyo, a weak, unassertive boy named Sena Kobayakawa enters the high school of his choice, Deimon Private Senior High School. Sena''s only remarkable physical abilities are his running speed and agility, which are noted by the school''s American football team captain Yoichi Hiruma. Hiruma forces Sena to join the Deimon Devil Bats football team as its running back. To protect his identity from other teams who want to recruit him, Sena is forced to publicly assume the role of the team secretary and enter the field under the pseudonym of "Eyeshield 21" wearing a helmet with an eyeshield to hide his features.', 'In Tokyo, a weak, unassertive boy named Sena Kobayakawa enters the high school of his choice, Deimon Private Senior High School. Sena''s only remarkable physical abilities are his running speed and agility, which are noted by the school''s American football team captain Yoichi Hiruma. Hiruma forces Sena to join the Deimon Devil Bats football team as its running back. To protect his identity from other teams who want to recruit him, Sena is forced to publicly assume the role of the team secretary and enter the field under the pseudonym of "Eyeshield 21" wearing a helmet with an eyeshield to hide his features.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yp29cySITMuZF3Exw8gnRomupz8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31736'),
  ('429190513695832320', 'Eyewitness', 2014, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jarl Emsell Larsen', 'Jarl Emsell Larsen, Kathrine Valen Zeiner', 'Kim Sørensen, Yngve Berven, Ingjerd Egeberg, Reidar Sørensen, Bjørn Skagestad, Tobias Santelmann, Fridtjov Såheim, Anderz Eide', null, 'Two 15-year-olds secretly meet up in the forest, only to witness a blood bath. They are seen, but escape trying to keep this as a secret, both in fear of the perpetrator and that their secret is revealed.', 'Two 15-year-olds secretly meet up in the forest, only to witness a blood bath. They are seen, but escape trying to keep this as a secret, both in fear of the perpetrator and that their secret is revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mb1XGcoivqzhFQzDGdsfuwbn4FT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68373'),
  ('1134523547900430909', 'Eyewitness', 2016, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Adi Hasak', 'Adi Hasak, Samir Mehta, Angel Dean Lopez', 'Julianne Nicholson, Tyler Young, James Paxton, Gil Bellows, Warren Christie, Tattiawna Jones, Paul Fauteux', 'NR', 'Two teenage boys secretly meet up in a cabin, bear witness to a shooting and barely escape with their lives. Desperate to keep their relationship a secret and in fear of being found by the perpetrator, they remain silent but soon learn that what has been seen cannot be unseen -- and when you witness a horrible event, it changes everything.', 'Two teenage boys secretly meet up in a cabin, bear witness to a shooting and barely escape with their lives. Desperate to keep their relationship a secret and in fear of being found by the perpetrator, they remain silent but soon learn that what has been seen cannot be unseen -- and when you witness a horrible event, it changes everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wF1IwXyKsdViyEQdkxtIOyMz3Dt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67429'),
  ('809283448875722429', 'Eyewitness', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', null, 'Didier Le Pêcheur', 'Laura Renoncourt, Odile Vuillemin, Tomer Sisley, Stéphan Guérin-Tillié, Charlotte Valandrey, Barbara Cabrita, Arnaud Binard, Jules Houplain', null, 'Two teenagers secretly meet up in the forest, only to witness a blood bath. They are seen, but escape trying to keep this as a secret, both in fear of the perpetrator and that their secret is revealed.', 'Two teenagers secretly meet up in the forest, only to witness a blood bath. They are seen, but escape trying to keep this as a secret, both in fear of the perpetrator and that their secret is revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZfWthbZFBfzZdlKxkBpmuG16Bx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76209'),
  ('736129527162386761', 'Ezel', 2009, 'Crime, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Pınar Bulut, Kerem Deren', 'Kerem Deren, Pınar Bulut', 'Kenan İmirzalıoğlu, Cansu Dere, Yiğit Özşener, Barış Falay, Sarp Akkaya, Tuncel Kurtiz, Güray Kip, Bade Işcil', 'NR', 'Ömer, a young man returning from military service, is set up by his friends and fiancé and ends up in prison for ten years. He fakes his own death and manages to escape. He re-creates himself as ‘Ezel’, a high-end gambler who is outwardly a successful man, but inwardly driven by one thing - his determination to understand why the people he loved betrayed him, and take his revenge.', 'Ömer, a young man returning from military service, is set up by his friends and fiancé and ends up in prison for ten years. He fakes his own death and manages to escape. He re-creates himself as ‘Ezel’, a high-end gambler who is outwardly a successful man, but inwardly driven by one thing - his determination to understand why the people he loved betrayed him, and take his revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pHSjh4MINU2JnK7qQvjogQaX3wr.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:32519'),
  ('290408636149486631', 'F is for Family', 2015, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Michael Price, Bill Burr', null, 'Bill Burr, Laura Dern, Justin Long, Haley Reinhart, Debi Derryberry, Sam Rockwell, David Koechner, Kevin Michael Richardson', 'TV-MA', 'Follow the Murphy family back to the 1970s, when kids roamed wild, beer flowed freely and nothing came between a man and his TV.', 'Follow the Murphy family back to the 1970s, when kids roamed wild, beer flowed freely and nothing came between a man and his TV.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3gkdyR58Hm0gMkItqvyNz7zSTWH.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:63522'),
  ('825066950231625172', 'F Troop', 1965, 'Comedy, Western', 'James Barnett, Ed James, Seaman Jacobs', null, 'Forrest Tucker, Larry Storch, Ken Berry, Melody Patterson, James Hampton, Frank De Kova, Bob Steele, Don Diamond', 'TV-PG', 'F Troop is a satirical American television sitcom that originally aired for two seasons on ABC-TV. It debuted in the United States on September 14, 1965 and concluded its run on April 6, 1967 with a total of 65 episodes. The first season of 34 episodes was filmed in black-and-white, but the show switched to color for its second season.', 'F Troop is a satirical American television sitcom that originally aired for two seasons on ABC-TV. It debuted in the United States on September 14, 1965 and concluded its run on April 6, 1967 with a total of 65 episodes. The first season of 34 episodes was filmed in black-and-white, but the show switched to color for its second season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pwrqRLkkpizrF9baXw7MVVzgri.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1062'),
  ('995782338432378370', 'F.C. De Kampioenen', 1990, 'Comedy, Soap', 'Bruno Raes, Willy Vanduren, Luc Beerten', null, 'Danni Heylen, Marijn Devalck, Johny Voners, Loes van den Heuvel, Ann Tuts, An Swartenbroekx, Herman Verbruggen, Ben Rottiers', null, 'F.C. De Kampioenen, was a long-running Flemish sitcom chronicling the adventures of a fictional local football team. It aired on the Belgian-Flemish channel één between 1990 and 2011, for 21 seasons with 273 half-hour long episodes, making it one of the most successful comedy programs ever on Belgian television. In 2009 a film had been planned, but has since been cancelled following complaints by the actors about the script. In 2012 the crew announced a new script was written and a movie will be produced. The movie is to be released in December 2013. The series relies heavily on stereotypical characters and farce for its humour. The story is mainly set around a few members of the football club who regularly visit the club canteen before or after a soccer training or match. The canteen is run by Pascale, who is in a relationship with Maurice. The football club is sponsored by the owner of a sausage factory, Balthazar Boma. Next to the field is an antiques shop, owned by the fraudulent Fernand. Most of the episodes are based on misunderstandings or dirty tricks from Fernand.', 'F.C. De Kampioenen, was a long-running Flemish sitcom chronicling the adventures of a fictional local football team. It aired on the Belgian-Flemish channel één between 1990 and 2011, for 21 seasons with 273 half-hour long episodes, making it one of the most successful comedy programs ever on Belgian television. In 2009 a film had been planned, but has since been cancelled following complaints by the actors about the script. In 2012 the crew announced a new script was written and a movie will be produced. The movie is to be released in December 2013. The series relies heavily on stereotypical characters and farce for its humour. The story is mainly set around a few members of the football club who regularly visit the club canteen before or after a soccer training or match. The canteen is run by Pascale, who is in a relationship with Maurice. The football club is sponsored by the owner of a sausage factory, Balthazar Boma. Next to the field is an antiques shop, owned by the fraudulent Fernand. Most of the episodes are based on misunderstandings or dirty tricks from Fernand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uTeYZROkyHI9aZaoSTrisq6ZMgy.jpg', 21, 'tmdb:tv:16148'),
  ('1098909124374649686', 'F#Ck1Ng Social Media', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jorge Ulloa, Nataly Valencia', 'Jorge Ulloa, Nataly Valencia', 'Paulina Gaitán, Azul Guaita, Hernán Mendoza, Jesús Zavala, Hugo Catalán, Bárbara Torres', null, 'Amanda, a declining children''s content YouTuber, has just turned 30, making her an elder of the internet. After realizing she is not good at anything else, and that attention from strangers is the closest thing she has to love, she will go to great lengths to regain relevance on social media, no matter the cost, and taking down whoever is in her way.', 'Amanda, a declining children''s content YouTuber, has just turned 30, making her an elder of the internet. After realizing she is not good at anything else, and that attention from strangers is the closest thing she has to love, she will go to great lengths to regain relevance on social media, no matter the cost, and taking down whoever is in her way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ioWmZBW9QNLMZcdivCqIRSwDVw6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233531'),
  ('637632327177181399', 'F1: The Academy', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Abbi Jo Pulling, Reese Witherspoon', 'TV-14', 'Fifteen young women break barriers in one of the world''s most demanding sports as they race to get a female driver back on the Formula 1 grid.', 'Fifteen young women break barriers in one of the world''s most demanding sports as they race to get a female driver back on the Formula 1 grid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxV9DnfxuX9LsQjVrh9ZF0RBueQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:289742'),
  ('552957042622724763', 'F4 Thailand: Boys Over Flowers', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Tontawan Tantivejakul, Vachirawit Chivaaree, Jirawat Sutivanichsak, Metawin Opas-iamkajorn, Hirunkit Changkham, Chanikarn Tangkabodee, Nattawat Jirochtikul, Yongwaree Ngamkasem', null, 'Gorya, a girl from a poor family, is happy to enter an elite high school. However, things take a turn when she is bullied by a group of rich spoiled boys called F4.', 'Gorya, a girl from a poor family, is happy to enter an elite high school. However, things take a turn when she is bullied by a group of rich spoiled boys called F4.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mRpG6gLdLMGHRUriG4uCLs6WzLQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:153378'),
  ('176151269906752981', 'Fabulous Beasts', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Xuexia Mao Yaozi', null, 'Ajie, Yang Ning, Shuai Guan, Shuang Zhao, Liu Cong', null, '"Fabulous Beasts" shares the same world view as other works in the "Non-human" series. The characters are inspired by Pixiu and other Chinese traditional mythical beasts, with modern elements added to make the characters different from other humanoid animation. The cute and lively "beasts" design plus casual comedy let the audience in this high-strung society relax and warm their hearts.', '"Fabulous Beasts" shares the same world view as other works in the "Non-human" series. The characters are inspired by Pixiu and other Chinese traditional mythical beasts, with modern elements added to make the characters different from other humanoid animation. The cute and lively "beasts" design plus casual comedy let the audience in this high-strung society relax and warm their hearts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jrMBgiD0Om2sgo8jGmlDmKG0oDZ.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:139168'),
  ('300186282958400866', 'Fabulous Lives of Bollywood Wives', 2020, 'Reality', null, null, 'Neelam Kothari, Seema Sajdeh, Maheep Kapoor, Bhavana Pandey, Riddhima Kapoor Sahni, Kalyani Saha Chawla, Shalini Passi', 'TV-MA', 'Cameras follow the banter and bonding between four fun-loving women from Bollywood''s inner circle as they juggle professions, family and friendship.', 'Cameras follow the banter and bonding between four fun-loving women from Bollywood''s inner circle as they juggle professions, family and friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fHruG2RrrUxdtpRVmCP5JzsfcQ0.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:113877'),
  ('30004002487500028', 'Face à face', 2022, 'Crime', 'Anne-Charlotte Kassab, Nassim Ben Allal, Yann Le Gal', null, null, 'NR', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vndTAkC2Nhh4eNrTM9BBjhUsV1.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:131672'),
  ('838227817424206409', 'Face Me', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', null, 'Hwang Ye-jin', 'Lee Min-ki, Han Ji-hyeon, Lee Yi-kyung, Jeon Bae-soo, Ahn Ha-young, Kang Da-hyeon, Yang So-min, Yoon Jeong-il', null, 'A medical mystery thriller that traces the truth of the incident of a famous plastic surgeon, who had a reputation as a righteous man, who fell into the abyss after being caught up in an unexpected incident and underwent reconstructive plastic surgery for crime victims.', 'A medical mystery thriller that traces the truth of the incident of a famous plastic surgeon, who had a reputation as a righteous man, who fell into the abyss after being caught up in an unexpected incident and underwent reconstructive plastic surgery for crime victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vnvhY5bxjsE0ciSkH5KExXrhD3d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218538'),
  ('591969400237315602', 'Face Off', 2011, 'Reality', null, null, 'Glenn Hetrick, Michael Westmore, McKenzie Westmore, Neville Page, Ve Neill', 'TV-14', 'In this competition/elimination series, special effects make-up artists participate in elaborate challenges for a grand prize and the honor of being Hollywood''s next great effects artist.', 'In this competition/elimination series, special effects make-up artists participate in elaborate challenges for a grand prize and the honor of being Hollywood''s next great effects artist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rlEzwvdlBJ0PvUVr4nzZbau9yKX.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:35370'),
  ('1057576920987304967', 'Face to Face', 2019, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Christoffer Boe, Anna Juul', 'Anna Juul, Christoffer Boe', 'Lars Mikkelsen', null, 'Bjørn investigates the killing of his daughter. People around him believe she might have committed suicide, but he doesn''t accept that. Both the stakes and the suspense rise relentlessly as Bjørn inches closer to the truth.', 'Bjørn investigates the killing of his daughter. People around him believe she might have committed suicide, but he doesn''t accept that. Both the stakes and the suspense rise relentlessly as Bjørn inches closer to the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCylJzYGEgCROR4p08NFJCEIhjj.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:94597'),
  ('211696582110474138', 'Facejacker', 2010, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Kayvan Novak', null, 'Facejacker is a Channel 4 comedy series which started on 16 April 2010. It follows the similar show Fonejacker. Kayvan Novak adopts various disguises, including several characters heard in Fonejacker. To promote the show, Novak appeared at Channel 4''s Comedy Gala as Terry Tibbs on April 5. Series 2 finished filming in July 2011 and premiered on 27 March 2012. The series concluded on 1 May 2012. Novak plans to create a film based on the show''s characters, and is currently in talks with Film4 and Hat Trick Productions.', 'Facejacker is a Channel 4 comedy series which started on 16 April 2010. It follows the similar show Fonejacker. Kayvan Novak adopts various disguises, including several characters heard in Fonejacker. To promote the show, Novak appeared at Channel 4''s Comedy Gala as Terry Tibbs on April 5. Series 2 finished filming in July 2011 and premiered on 27 March 2012. The series concluded on 1 May 2012. Novak plans to create a film based on the show''s characters, and is currently in talks with Film4 and Hat Trick Productions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qWjIyrLkDipZnMXRqoPb96GpVm.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:32495'),
  ('459628857966097325', 'Facing Destiny', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Sebastian Arrau', null, 'David Chocarro, Saúl Lisazo, Marlene Favela, Sarah Mintz, Elizabeth Gutiérrez, Jonathan Islas, Wanda D''Isidoro, Felicia Mercado', null, 'A youth named Diego (David Chocarro) was released from prison, 20 years after being incarcerated. He was unjustly accused of a school massacre. Soon after his release, he finds himself entangled in a series of conspiracies and intrigues. With the help of his psychiatrist, Antonia(Maritza Rodriguez), he begins to uncover the mysteries surrounding the massacre.', 'A youth named Diego (David Chocarro) was released from prison, 20 years after being incarcerated. He was unjustly accused of a school massacre. Soon after his release, he finds himself entangled in a series of conspiracies and intrigues. With the help of his psychiatrist, Antonia(Maritza Rodriguez), he begins to uncover the mysteries surrounding the massacre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f3KmuDL2Ng32tI1P1J0767hAnJo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84278'),
  ('283377460277428706', 'Fact or Faked: Paranormal Files', 2010, 'Reality, Documentary, Mystery', null, null, 'Jael de Pardo, Chi-Lan Lieu, Lanisha Cole', 'TV-PG', 'Fact or Faked: Paranormal Files is a paranormal investigation series produced by Base Productions that began airing July 15, 2010, on SyFy. The show follows a team of investigators, led by former FBI agent Ben Hansen, who review various photographs and viral videos of alleged paranormal activity. If a particular piece of evidence is deemed intriguing enough to warrant further investigation, they set out to recreate and explain the sighting. Beginning episode #207 in first-half of season two, the show began to feature a "You Decide" segment in the middle of the program where a video is shown of something strange and then asks the viewing audience if they think the footage is fact or faked. After a commercial break the truth behind the video is revealed.', 'Fact or Faked: Paranormal Files is a paranormal investigation series produced by Base Productions that began airing July 15, 2010, on SyFy. The show follows a team of investigators, led by former FBI agent Ben Hansen, who review various photographs and viral videos of alleged paranormal activity. If a particular piece of evidence is deemed intriguing enough to warrant further investigation, they set out to recreate and explain the sighting. Beginning episode #207 in first-half of season two, the show began to feature a "You Decide" segment in the middle of the program where a video is shown of something strange and then asks the viewing audience if they think the footage is fact or faked. After a commercial break the truth behind the video is revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lYNYf4rMcWhu7v2O6qdnaOkhLYN.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:33168'),
  ('477193389405056206', 'Fading Gigolo', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Daniela Delle Foglie, Tommaso Renzoni', null, 'Christian De Sica, Pietro Sermonti, Ambra Angiolini, Frank Matano, Francesco Bruni, Sabrina Ferilli', null, 'When his father Giacomo comes back into his life after a heart attack, Alfonso has to cope with a life-changing truth: his father is a gigolo. After a series of unfortunate events, Alfonso is forced to follow in his father''s footsteps.', 'When his father Giacomo comes back into his life after a heart attack, Alfonso has to cope with a life-changing truth: his father is a gigolo. After a series of unfortunate events, Alfonso is forced to follow in his father''s footsteps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8SkdF5LfnLqbrdkxryD2ScRxEab.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:241918'),
  ('991017025471130037', 'Faerie Tale Theatre', 1982, 'Drama, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Shelley Duvall', 'NR', 'A live-action children''s television anthology series retelling popular fairy tales.', 'A live-action children''s television anthology series retelling popular fairy tales.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5pKkikAvKfyiAmxwkw1HHb2z2Za.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:4603'),
  ('245205393912958945', 'Fafner', 2004, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, War & Politics, Drama', null, null, 'Marika Matsumoto, Kohei Kiyasu, Satomi Arai, Sanae Kobayashi, Minoru Shiraishi, Misato Fukuen, Miyu Matsuki, Makoto Ishii', null, 'Tatsumiyajima is the central island in the middle of a small cluster of islands, in a sleepy backwater of the Japanese isles. Not much happens there, and the island''s young people go to school knowing that their lives are likely to remain peaceful and undisturbed. Or so they have been taught...but the truth is different. The fate of mankind is on the line, and Tatsumiyajima is the last line of defense against a hostile and incomprehensible enemy. At the center of it all, fighting for Humanity''s continued existence, is the giant robot Fafner, the dragon that guards this final treasure of mankind.', 'Tatsumiyajima is the central island in the middle of a small cluster of islands, in a sleepy backwater of the Japanese isles. Not much happens there, and the island''s young people go to school knowing that their lives are likely to remain peaceful and undisturbed. Or so they have been taught...but the truth is different. The fate of mankind is on the line, and Tatsumiyajima is the last line of defense against a hostile and incomprehensible enemy. At the center of it all, fighting for Humanity''s continued existence, is the giant robot Fafner, the dragon that guards this final treasure of mankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMqhqNYCp3MZ9kJKK5xg7pwqtjE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42836'),
  ('678973571405153186', 'Fafner Exodus', 2015, 'Animation', null, null, 'Kohei Kiyasu, Makoto Ishii, Azumi Asakura, Marika Matsumoto, Ryoko Shiraishi, Tamaki Nakanishi, Sumire Morohoshi, Yui Ishikawa', 'TV-14', '2150 A.D. The battle with the Festum, the silicon life-forms from distant outer space, had reached a new dimension. The North Polar Meir that was crushed during the First Azure Operation had dispersed its fragments all over the world. They all started activity on their own as independent Meirs. Most of the Meirs harbored hatred towards humanity and challenged a fight, however, a portion of the Festum chose coexistence with mankind. Amongst the crossfire, the Ryugujima island alone disappeared from the forefront of battle and continued its silence. The island had gained a means to converse with the Meir since their encounter with Misao Kurusu two years ago. The children of ALVISS had been searching for a way to understand the enemy as they prepared for battle. And now, once again, further evolution was about to befall the island. A girl that understands the language of the Festum, and a girl protected by a Festum. When the two meet, the doors to a new universe opens.', '2150 A.D. The battle with the Festum, the silicon life-forms from distant outer space, had reached a new dimension. The North Polar Meir that was crushed during the First Azure Operation had dispersed its fragments all over the world. They all started activity on their own as independent Meirs. Most of the Meirs harbored hatred towards humanity and challenged a fight, however, a portion of the Festum chose coexistence with mankind. Amongst the crossfire, the Ryugujima island alone disappeared from the forefront of battle and continued its silence. The island had gained a means to converse with the Meir since their encounter with Misao Kurusu two years ago. The children of ALVISS had been searching for a way to understand the enemy as they prepared for battle. And now, once again, further evolution was about to befall the island. A girl that understands the language of the Festum, and a girl protected by a Festum. When the two meet, the doors to a new universe opens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jqE5UkBE5an0xFWoffyPN1qpoAH.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:25891'),
  ('474128037055155345', 'Fahlanruk', 2022, 'Drama', 'BamBam', null, 'James Thanaboon Wisrungroj, Tonkhao Chayuth Nitichakorn, Ryu Danudol Suranapornchai, Kao Siravit Suwannarat, Piroonwat Wannasorn, Win Kittiphon Chotijiranan, Wari Atiarnon, Sirikorn Kunapinan', null, 'What began as a simple physical connection between two classmates spirals into an intense attraction that neither can easily walk away from.', 'What began as a simple physical connection between two classmates spirals into an intense attraction that neither can easily walk away from.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRfsUMudSg7goyC1RDkbT75FBUv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129685'),
  ('1107175872465501161', 'Failure Frame: I Became the Strongest and Annihilated Everything with Low-Level Spells', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Ryota Suzuki, Saki Miyashita, Misaki Watada, Hitomi Ueda, Ayami Tsukui, Ami Koshimizu, Karin Nanami, KENN', 'TV-14', 'Touka always faded into the background at school. And when he’s summoned to another world with his classmates, that still doesn’t change! They all acquire top-rank skills, except Touka, who’s deemed a failure and cast to ancient ruins by the goddess Vicius. Turns out, his low-rank skills may not be so useless after all. Now, he seeks revenge against the goddess, and his true nature is revealed.', 'Touka always faded into the background at school. And when he’s summoned to another world with his classmates, that still doesn’t change! They all acquire top-rank skills, except Touka, who’s deemed a failure and cast to ancient ruins by the goddess Vicius. Turns out, his low-rank skills may not be so useless after all. Now, he seeks revenge against the goddess, and his true nature is revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jjpkWZ9LUXoUnh4F65qp7FuFawO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:245285'),
  ('966832631474833387', 'Fair City', 1989, 'Drama', null, null, 'Indah O''Reilly, Colleen Keogh', 'NR', 'The day-to-day dramas of the community who live and work in the fictional north Dublin suburb of Carrigstown.', 'The day-to-day dramas of the community who live and work in the fictional north Dublin suburb of Carrigstown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9t0NRUngEKPa36vrXowjorWrAH.jpg', 36, 'tmdb:tv:3339'),
  ('395849363080176357', 'Fair Trade', 2021, 'Crime', 'Mark Punt', 'Mark Punt', 'Ella-June Henrard, Peter van den Begin, Axel Daeseleire, Kseniia Mishyna, Daphne Wellens, Manou Kersting, Peter Thyssen, Lynn Van Royen', null, 'Walter Wilson (Kevin Janssens) and Robin De Rover (Ella-June Henrard) once started their careers in the police force with great dedication and noble ideals, but too often saw months of intensive and dangerous detective work lost due to what they considered irrelevant procedural errors, dexterity of expensive lawyers and dubious decisions of foreign judges. They are increasingly colouring outside the lines during their patrols: for example, they tip criminals off about future police actions and get heavily paid for them. Wilson is also addicted (women, booze, drugs...) and that makes him incalculable. When he is suspended from the police force after repeated conflicts, he looks for even more rapprochement with the criminal environment, but in the meantime is tipsy game.', 'Walter Wilson (Kevin Janssens) and Robin De Rover (Ella-June Henrard) once started their careers in the police force with great dedication and noble ideals, but too often saw months of intensive and dangerous detective work lost due to what they considered irrelevant procedural errors, dexterity of expensive lawyers and dubious decisions of foreign judges. They are increasingly colouring outside the lines during their patrols: for example, they tip criminals off about future police actions and get heavily paid for them. Wilson is also addicted (women, booze, drugs...) and that makes him incalculable. When he is suspended from the police force after repeated conflicts, he looks for even more rapprochement with the criminal environment, but in the meantime is tipsy game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gk2NHtvnPuCPHWCkT49HxSOLktA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:109804'),
  ('404237845281650477', 'Fairfax', 2021, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Matt Hausfater, Aaron Buchsbaum, Teddy Riley', null, null, null, 'Follow four middle school best friends on their never-ending quest for clout in Fairfax Avenue in Los Angeles — the pulsing heart of hypebeast culture.', 'Follow four middle school best friends on their never-ending quest for clout in Fairfax Avenue in Los Angeles — the pulsing heart of hypebeast culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOEFB2yTmaDOoYsybgxJw7lz8UW.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:135597'),
  ('504003572853397284', 'Fairies Albums', 2020, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Sha Luo Shuang Shu', null, 'Shuang Zhao, Chang Rongshan', null, 'To casual observers, Tao Yao appears to be nothing more than an ordinary young girl. In fact, she is anything but. Tao Yao is actually a spirit healer. And her goal is not to treat people, but animals, monsters, and spirits who have found themselves in precarious situations. But she is not alone in her quest. She has also been joined by a diminutive monk named Mo Ya and Liu Gon Zi, a snake demon who has taken control of a man’s body. Will this motley crew help rescue the spirits and monsters who need Tao Yao’s help?', 'To casual observers, Tao Yao appears to be nothing more than an ordinary young girl. In fact, she is anything but. Tao Yao is actually a spirit healer. And her goal is not to treat people, but animals, monsters, and spirits who have found themselves in precarious situations. But she is not alone in her quest. She has also been joined by a diminutive monk named Mo Ya and Liu Gon Zi, a snake demon who has taken control of a man’s body. Will this motley crew help rescue the spirits and monsters who need Tao Yao’s help?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYUoMOep9Gb7vxpJbFDG9PyjWHA.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:101099'),
  ('1043758545600838678', 'Fairly Legal', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Michael Sardo', null, 'Sarah Shahi, Michael Trucco, Virginia Williams, Ryan Johnson, Baron Vaughn', 'TV-PG', 'Kate Reed is a firm believer that justice can always be found – even if it''s not always in the courtroom. Once a lawyer at her family''s esteemed San Francisco firm, Kate''s frustration with the legal system led her to a new career as a mediator. Thanks to her innate understanding of human nature, thorough legal knowledge, and wry sense of humor, Kate is a natural when it comes to dispute resolution. Except, it seems, when it comes to conflicts in her own life.', 'Kate Reed is a firm believer that justice can always be found – even if it''s not always in the courtroom. Once a lawyer at her family''s esteemed San Francisco firm, Kate''s frustration with the legal system led her to a new career as a mediator. Thanks to her innate understanding of human nature, thorough legal knowledge, and wry sense of humor, Kate is a natural when it comes to dispute resolution. Except, it seems, when it comes to conflicts in her own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jf5y1BMpINEay9zy6omhqx2Kfc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:32549'),
  ('1110054396257698523', 'Fairy Gone', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tomoaki Maeno, Kana Ichinose, Ayaka Fukuhara, Yoshimasa Hosoya', null, 'Able to summon fairies as alter-ego weapons, former soldiers become government dogs, mafia members, and even terrorists in search of purpose beyond the battlefield. Who will maintain the peace they all fought for nine years ago?', 'Able to summon fairies as alter-ego weapons, former soldiers become government dogs, mafia members, and even terrorists in search of purpose beyond the battlefield. Who will maintain the peace they all fought for nine years ago?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rTgHQcJW6Coq997kfHatwrzd7Vm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86835'),
  ('404928612514865353', 'Fairy Musketeers', 2006, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Animation, Action & Adventure', null, 'Mitsutaka Hirota, Toshimitsu Takeuchi, Yuko Kakihara', 'Yukari Tamura, Kanako Tateno, Miyuki Sawashiro, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Rie Kugimiya', null, 'Long, long ago, there existed a world of magic and science. But having both powers was making people conceited and lazy. So God split the world in to the world of science, Erde (German for Earth), and the world of magic, Phandavale. One day in Phandavale, a terrible witch named Cendrillon revives. Cendrillon plots to rule both worlds, and searches for the "key of Erde" and the "key of Phandavale" which holds tremendous power. A young boy from Erde by the name of Sōta meets a mysterious girl from Phandavale, Akazukin (Red Riding Hood), and her talking wolf companion, Val. Sōta learns that he is the key of Erde. Now it is up to Akazukin, Val, and the other Musketeers, Shirayukihime (Snow White) and Ibara (Sleeping Beauty) to protect Sōta from Cendrillon and her Nightmarians who wish to obtain the power he mysteriously possesses.', 'Long, long ago, there existed a world of magic and science. But having both powers was making people conceited and lazy. So God split the world in to the world of science, Erde (German for Earth), and the world of magic, Phandavale. One day in Phandavale, a terrible witch named Cendrillon revives. Cendrillon plots to rule both worlds, and searches for the "key of Erde" and the "key of Phandavale" which holds tremendous power. A young boy from Erde by the name of Sōta meets a mysterious girl from Phandavale, Akazukin (Red Riding Hood), and her talking wolf companion, Val. Sōta learns that he is the key of Erde. Now it is up to Akazukin, Val, and the other Musketeers, Shirayukihime (Snow White) and Ibara (Sleeping Beauty) to protect Sōta from Cendrillon and her Nightmarians who wish to obtain the power he mysteriously possesses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQE6iyoamWNNvyu4rngwt1GsyBZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34212'),
  ('824157121791903976', 'Fairy Tail', 2009, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tetsuya Kakihara, Aya Hirano, Rie Kugimiya, Yuichi Nakamura, Sayaka Ohara, Satomi Sato, Yui Horie, Hiroki Yasumoto', 'TV-14', 'Lucy is a 17-year-old girl, who wants to be a full-fledged mage. One day when visiting Harujion Town, she meets Natsu, a young man who gets sick easily by any type of transportation. But Natsu isn''t just any ordinary kid, he''s a member of one of the world''s most infamous mage guilds: Fairy Tail.', 'Lucy is a 17-year-old girl, who wants to be a full-fledged mage. One day when visiting Harujion Town, she meets Natsu, a young man who gets sick easily by any type of transportation. But Natsu isn''t just any ordinary kid, he''s a member of one of the world''s most infamous mage guilds: Fairy Tail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h50lj7xO65qafNYZCrfQ7ztkMBD.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:46261'),
  ('283393585551969545', 'FAIRY TAIL 100 YEARS QUEST', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tetsuya Kakihara, Aya Hirano, Rie Kugimiya, Yuichi Nakamura, Sayaka Ohara, Satomi Sato, Yui Horie', 'TV-14', 'The rowdiest guild in Fiore Kingdom is back! Natsu, Lucy, Gray, Erza, and the whole Fairy Tail guild tackle the legendary "100 Years Quest," tougher than any S-Class quest. Their goal: find the first wizard guild ever, located in the far north of Guiltina. Facing new gods, mysterious towns, and ominous foes, they’ll have their work cut out for them. Will they succeed where no wizard has before?', 'The rowdiest guild in Fiore Kingdom is back! Natsu, Lucy, Gray, Erza, and the whole Fairy Tail guild tackle the legendary "100 Years Quest," tougher than any S-Class quest. Their goal: find the first wizard guild ever, located in the far north of Guiltina. Facing new gods, mysterious towns, and ominous foes, they’ll have their work cut out for them. Will they succeed where no wizard has before?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wj5i6YgZj7LltRE3yE6VTgfdbK0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:248947'),
  ('2782918346960749', 'Fais pas ci, fais pas ça', 2007, 'Comedy, Family', 'Thierry Bizot, Anne Giafferi', null, 'Isabelle Gélinas, Bruno Salomone, Valérie Bonneton, Guillaume de Tonquédec, Cannelle Carré-Cassaigne, Yaniss Lespert, Tiphaine Haas, Alexandra Gentil', 'NR', 'The daily life of two neighboring families, the Bouley and the Lepic, with literally opposite educational methods. Despite their social and cultural differences, they are friends and do not hesitate to face worries...', 'The daily life of two neighboring families, the Bouley and the Lepic, with literally opposite educational methods. Despite their social and cultural differences, they are friends and do not hesitate to face worries...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbhDlWULVibcsiNLYDBVXnpINfW.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:35690'),
  ('615583861446334625', 'Faith', 2012, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kim Jong-hak, Song Ji-na', null, 'Lee Min-ho, Kim Hee-seon, Yu Oh-seong, Sung Hoon, Ryu Deok-hwan, Park Se-young, Yoon Kyun-sang, Lee Byung-joon', null, 'After being found in 918, the kingdom of Goryeo faced a critical existential crisis when the powerful Yuan dynasty tried to subjugate them. In the fictional setting of this drama, a warrior living in the timeline of Goryeo meets a plastic surgeon living in the present day. The plastic surgeon gets kidnapped by the warrior who got an order from the king to find a doctor who can cure the fatally injured queen. The two individuals who were not meant to coexist are brought together to fight their way through the ordeals on the land of Goryeo. The warrior makes a promise that he will return her to her world, but a scheming royal advisor persuades the king to force the surgeon to stay as she can be useful to him. There, the surgeon falls in love with the warrior who is the leader of the royal guard. In this era of change and chaos, love that transcends time and space blooms.', 'After being found in 918, the kingdom of Goryeo faced a critical existential crisis when the powerful Yuan dynasty tried to subjugate them. In the fictional setting of this drama, a warrior living in the timeline of Goryeo meets a plastic surgeon living in the present day. The plastic surgeon gets kidnapped by the warrior who got an order from the king to find a doctor who can cure the fatally injured queen. The two individuals who were not meant to coexist are brought together to fight their way through the ordeals on the land of Goryeo. The warrior makes a promise that he will return her to her world, but a scheming royal advisor persuades the king to force the surgeon to stay as she can be useful to him. There, the surgeon falls in love with the warrior who is the leader of the royal guard. In this era of change and chaos, love that transcends time and space blooms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1nxxnVUdcoLcijdMNdcYwk4T5cX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44821'),
  ('437408029810128356', 'Faith Makes Great', 2021, 'Drama', 'Dongyu Fu, Liang Zhenhua', 'Yating Hu, Zhou Difei', null, null, 'One hundred years since the founding of the Communist Party of China, Faith Makes Great tells stories from different times in history that chronicle the people''s endless struggle to realize their dream of rejuvenating the nation.', 'One hundred years since the founding of the Communist Party of China, Faith Makes Great tells stories from different times in history that chronicle the people''s endless struggle to realize their dream of rejuvenating the nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/buxtlVnspf69B23lRzY8RDsSTgR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:124817'),
  ('676123046087391567', 'Fake', 2024, 'Drama', 'Anya Beyersdorf', null, 'Asher Keddie, David Wenham, Heather Mitchell, Nicholas Brown, Spencer McLaren, Ming-Zhu Hii, Anne Charleston, Jack Sandle', null, 'Magazine features writer Birdie Bell meets successful grazier Joe Burt on a dating app and believes she''s found her perfect match, but as the relationship intensifies she begins to feel her boyfriend isn''t all he has led her to believe.', 'Magazine features writer Birdie Bell meets successful grazier Joe Burt on a dating app and believes she''s found her perfect match, but as the relationship intensifies she begins to feel her boyfriend isn''t all he has led her to believe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Teai3m70U4kDTLkZKPlTN2COh6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:258446'),
  ('542778106265060757', 'Fake or Fortune?', 2011, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, 'Fiona Bruce, Philip Mould', 'TV-PG', 'Journalist Fiona Bruce teams up with art expert Philip Mould to investigate the provenance or attribution of notable artworks.', 'Journalist Fiona Bruce teams up with art expert Philip Mould to investigate the provenance or attribution of notable artworks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GrRXdSPsLtmzLXa0uJ8NV1YBUt.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:40289'),
  ('863911017611222310', 'Fake Profile', 2023, 'Drama', 'Pablo Illanes', null, 'Carolina Miranda, Rodolfo Salas, Manuela González', 'TV-MA', 'Camila meets her Prince Charming through a dating app. After an idyllic romance, she plans to surprise him — only to end up trapped in a false paradise.', 'Camila meets her Prince Charming through a dating app. After an idyllic romance, she plans to surprise him — only to end up trapped in a false paradise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KyyfuG5VxUmpJFnw0pa1SkTsuL.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:227371'),
  ('664919154161066567', 'Fakes', 2022, 'Crime, Comedy', 'David Turko', null, 'Emilija Baranac, Jennifer Tong, Richard Harmon', null, 'Teenage best friends Zoe and Becca set out to build their own fake ID empire, but when business starts booming, their life of crime gets way too real.', 'Teenage best friends Zoe and Becca set out to build their own fake ID empire, but when business starts booming, their life of crime gets way too real.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yNeS9JvRynUQfwy8DtsWtNEIkQa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207841'),
  ('10954749178317444', 'Faking Hitler', 2021, 'Drama', 'Thomas Vass', null, 'Lars Eidinger, Moritz Bleibtreu, Sinje Irslinger, Daniel Donskoy, Ulrich Tukur, Hans-Jochen Wagner, Tristan Seith, Richard Sammel', null, 'Journalist Gerd Heidemann always gets his story. When he hears of a diary written by Hitler, he can’t resist the scoop of the century. Except the diary is the creation of charismatic art dealer, petty criminal and prolific forger.', 'Journalist Gerd Heidemann always gets his story. When he hears of a diary written by Hitler, he can’t resist the scoop of the century. Except the diary is the creation of charismatic art dealer, petty criminal and prolific forger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yqUDmy7Vcg5c5yQYA8k5vKGm0oP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:146128'),
  ('1035056819154661768', 'Faking It', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Dana Goodman, Julia Lea Wolov', null, 'Rita Volk, Katie Stevens, Gregg Sulkin, Bailey De Young, Michael J. Willett', 'TV-14', 'A romantic comedy about two best friends who love each other -- in slightly different ways. After numerous failed attempts to become popular, the girls are mistakenly outed as lesbians, which launches them to instant celebrity status. Seduced by their newfound fame, Karma and Amy decide to keep up their romantic ruse.', 'A romantic comedy about two best friends who love each other -- in slightly different ways. After numerous failed attempts to become popular, the girls are mistakenly outed as lesbians, which launches them to instant celebrity status. Seduced by their newfound fame, Karma and Amy decide to keep up their romantic ruse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vb9J7q977HB3AmvLETpmWIyIyTP.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:60705'),
  ('732608409523723194', 'Fakt oder Fake', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, 'Clemens Maria Schreiner', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 7, 'tmdb:tv:206705'),
  ('599317243936441732', 'Falco', 2013, 'Crime', null, null, 'Sagamore Stévenin, Clément Manuel, Mathilde Lebrequier, Alexia Barlier, Franck Monsigny, Marie Béraud, Anne Caillon', null, 'In 1991, 24-year-old Detective Alexandre Falco has it all, a loving wife, a new-born daughter and his dream job. But one day out in the field, he is shot in the head. Falco opens his eyes again 22 years later to a changed world, where everything he once had is no longer as it was.', 'In 1991, 24-year-old Detective Alexandre Falco has it all, a loving wife, a new-born daughter and his dream job. But one day out in the field, he is shot in the head. Falco opens his eyes again 22 years later to a changed world, where everything he once had is no longer as it was.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bDKzdz2HzWCysKyEgVBDiof59No.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:61352'),
  ('495051101029340652', 'Falcón', 2012, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Marton Csokas, Hayley Atwell, Charlie Creed-Miles, Santiago Cabrera, Emilia Fox, Kerry Fox, James Floyd, Natalia Tena', null, 'Falcón is a brilliant detective whose personal and professional life is compromised by dark secrets from the past.', 'Falcón is a brilliant detective whose personal and professional life is compromised by dark secrets from the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h2SX6Ggl9V4gUjH0kBjzWhZFjcM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64143'),
  ('508992371848772453', 'Falcon Crest', 1981, 'Soap, Drama', 'Earl Hamner, Jr.', null, 'Jane Wyman, David Selby, Lorenzo Lamas, Gregory Harrison, Kristian Alfonso, Chao-Li Chi, Wendy Phillips, Andrea Thompson', 'NR', 'Falcon Crest is an American primetime television soap opera which aired on the CBS network for nine seasons, from December 4, 1981 to May 17, 1990. A total of 227 episodes were produced. The series revolves around the feuding factions of the wealthy Gioberti/Channing family in the Californian wine industry. Jane Wyman starred as Angela Channing, the tyrannical matriarch of the Falcon Crest Winery, alongside Robert Foxworth as Chase Gioberti, Angela''s nephew who returns to Falcon Crest following the death of his father. The series was set in the fictitious Tuscany Valley northeast of San Francisco.', 'Falcon Crest is an American primetime television soap opera which aired on the CBS network for nine seasons, from December 4, 1981 to May 17, 1990. A total of 227 episodes were produced. The series revolves around the feuding factions of the wealthy Gioberti/Channing family in the Californian wine industry. Jane Wyman starred as Angela Channing, the tyrannical matriarch of the Falcon Crest Winery, alongside Robert Foxworth as Chase Gioberti, Angela''s nephew who returns to Falcon Crest following the death of his father. The series was set in the fictitious Tuscany Valley northeast of San Francisco.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgcKhBsHwAlPpeJG9yKip5oWVo9.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:93'),
  ('115891175694638971', 'Fall For You', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Shin So Young', 'Nana, Yoon Hyun-suk, Kim Jae-won, Geum Dong-hyun, Ha Sun-ho, Won Young-wook, Kim Bo-ah, 최민규', null, 'Pop star Yoo Je-bi struggles with negative fan comments until she unexpectedly enters the world of a romance novel and starts a new life.', 'Pop star Yoo Je-bi struggles with negative fan comments until she unexpectedly enters the world of a romance novel and starts a new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/77ggppfQexsYryAlz9pnjLFuZHu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203954'),
  ('593136409418661499', 'Fall Into Temptation', 2017, 'Drama, Soap', 'Leonardo Bechini, Erika Halvorsen', 'Leonardo Bechini', 'Silvia Navarro, Gabriel Soto, Adriana Louvier, Carlos Ferro, Arath de la Torre, Julieta Egurrola, Beatriz Moreno, Ela Velden', 'NR', 'Raquel and Damián are happily married with two children. Destiny leads Damián to meet Carolina and feels an undeniable attraction towards her. Damián did not know that Carolina was already married to Santiago Álvarado, a construction architect with whom she has two children. When Raquel drops off her son Fede at school, she accidentally backs her car to Santiago''s truck, and they realize that their sons know each other. Raquel volunteers to pay for the damages but Santiago refuses. Raquel insists and goes to the Álvarado home with Damián. The two couples become great friends. But the desire between Damián and Carolina is stronger than their marriage commitment and both decide to deceive to their spouses. Damián and Carolina have a terrible car accident. Rescuers only find a seriously injured Damián, and Carolina has mysteriously disappeared from the scene. During the investigation by the police, Raquel and Santiago learn that their spouses are lovers.', 'Raquel and Damián are happily married with two children. Destiny leads Damián to meet Carolina and feels an undeniable attraction towards her. Damián did not know that Carolina was already married to Santiago Álvarado, a construction architect with whom she has two children. When Raquel drops off her son Fede at school, she accidentally backs her car to Santiago''s truck, and they realize that their sons know each other. Raquel volunteers to pay for the damages but Santiago refuses. Raquel insists and goes to the Álvarado home with Damián. The two couples become great friends. But the desire between Damián and Carolina is stronger than their marriage commitment and both decide to deceive to their spouses. Damián and Carolina have a terrible car accident. Rescuers only find a seriously injured Damián, and Carolina has mysteriously disappeared from the scene. During the investigation by the police, Raquel and Santiago learn that their spouses are lovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2E8bvsc30vIglIAWuK3TW0hqdJ3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82515'),
  ('479144043317309377', 'Fall of Eagles', 1974, 'Drama', 'John Elliot', null, 'Barry Foster, Michael Hordern', null, '"Fall of Eagles" is a 13-part British television drama aired by the BBC in 1974. The series portrays historical events from 1848 to 1918, dealing with the collapse of the ruling dynasties of Austria-Hungary (the Habsburgs), Germany (the Hohenzollerns) and Russia (the Romanovs).', '"Fall of Eagles" is a 13-part British television drama aired by the BBC in 1974. The series portrays historical events from 1848 to 1918, dealing with the collapse of the ruling dynasties of Austria-Hungary (the Habsburgs), Germany (the Hohenzollerns) and Russia (the Romanovs).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPb1TDtnomsdKLJ4L5NfXXeMGm1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13872'),
  ('434705640940641744', 'Fall River', 2021, 'Documentary', 'James Buddy Day', null, 'Murray Farnell', 'TV-MA', 'In 1979, three young women were killed in a streak of brutal murders in Fall River, MA, allegedly by a satanic cult practicing human sacrifice. Twenty years later, new evidence has surfaced and shed light on murders that were thought to have been solved.', 'In 1979, three young women were killed in a streak of brutal murders in Fall River, MA, allegedly by a satanic cult practicing human sacrifice. Twenty years later, new evidence has surfaced and shed light on murders that were thought to have been solved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/toydARbqycQsHl98sy5BA5nDwEZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:119950'),
  ('88330779778406682', 'Fallen', 2007, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Kevin Kerslake, Mikael Salomon', null, 'Paul Wesley, Rick Worthy, Hal Ozsan, Will Yun Lee, Ivana Miličević, Fernanda Andrade, Bryan Cranston', null, 'The phenomenal journey of Aaron Corbett, an 18-year-old Nephilim (half-angel/half human), as he struggles to come to terms with his role as The Redeemer and is drawn into a world where angels walk among us.', 'The phenomenal journey of Aaron Corbett, an 18-year-old Nephilim (half-angel/half human), as he struggles to come to terms with his role as The Redeemer and is drawn into a world where angels walk among us.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f2I0lwI5c7WVwZOhYgK4QSgWo4E.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:25126'),
  ('1109845141370504397', 'Fallen', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', 'Camilla Ahlgren, Martin Asphaug, Alex Haridi', null, 'Sofia Helin, Inez Andersson', null, 'A cold case turns topical again and turns everything upside down, intertwining the lives of several people.', 'A cold case turns topical again and turns everything upside down, intertwining the lives of several people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fD1xVJU9VFZFzrtwEu6p18fKqmL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:241585'),
  ('694842524145098537', 'Fallen', 2024, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Lauren Kate, Claudia Bluemhuber', null, 'Jessica Alexander, Gijs Blom, Timothy Innes, Alexander Siddig, Josefine Koenig, Sarah Niles, Lawrence Walker, Esmé Kingdom', null, 'A young woman is sent to a cult-like rehab facility called Sword & Cross to serve time for a crime she can''t remember committing. Among the other residents, she encounters the enigmatic Daniel and exasperating but irresistible Cam, all of whom are under the watchful eye of the sinister chief doctor Howson, and devout twin sisters Miriam and Sophia. Luce must untangle the mystery of who she is and why she has a connection to Daniel that goes far back beyond their time in the institution', 'A young woman is sent to a cult-like rehab facility called Sword & Cross to serve time for a crime she can''t remember committing. Among the other residents, she encounters the enigmatic Daniel and exasperating but irresistible Cam, all of whom are under the watchful eye of the sinister chief doctor Howson, and devout twin sisters Miriam and Sophia. Luce must untangle the mystery of who she is and why she has a connection to Daniel that goes far back beyond their time in the institution', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7bDBqaLuWVqB3zN1p5OWnw7tB4f.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214945'),
  ('919523743025149011', 'Fallen Angels', 1993, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'William Horberg', null, null, null, 'A neo-noir anthology television series, set in somber Los Angeles right after World War II and before the election of American President John F. Kennedy. The episodes, although filmed in color, mimicked what had been done by Hollywood filmmakers during the film noir era of the 1940s and 1950s in terms of tone, look, and story content.', 'A neo-noir anthology television series, set in somber Los Angeles right after World War II and before the election of American President John F. Kennedy. The episodes, although filmed in color, mimicked what had been done by Hollywood filmmakers during the film noir era of the 1940s and 1950s in terms of tone, look, and story content.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fnbdv4uSFUGJ2jp9Gf99fYtlIu3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:4981'),
  ('978381924065818666', 'Fallet', 2017, 'Drama, Crime, Comedy', 'Rikard Ulvshammar, Erik Hultkvist', 'Tapio Leopold', 'Adam Godley, Lisa Henni, Lia Boysen, Björn Granath, Erik Madsen, Christoffer Nordenrot, Stina Rautelin, Tomas von Brömssen', 'TV-MA', 'A Swedish detective and her timid British colleague''s attempt to solve a gruesome murder case nets mixed results and miscommunication.', 'A Swedish detective and her timid British colleague''s attempt to solve a gruesome murder case nets mixed results and miscommunication.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCxN3gdR8jop196Z1qqNaZEPCDY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71624'),
  ('603131746728431827', 'Falling Angel', 2009, 'Drama, Soap', 'David Posada, Jimena Romero', null, 'Jencarlos Canela, Gaby Espino, Miguel Varoni, Karla Monroig, Jorge Luis Pila, Roberto Mateos, Carlos Camacho, Christian Carabías', null, 'Set in New York, the serial features the street-wise Ángel, who treats life as a game he plays to win. He tangles with the power-hungry Martín, who is engaged to a stunning, feisty lawyer named Manuela. She decides to defend Ángel, even though Martín wants to destroy him. Neither of the men know that Ángel is Martín''s own son. Our hero learns that love is the only key to survival.', 'Set in New York, the serial features the street-wise Ángel, who treats life as a game he plays to win. He tangles with the power-hungry Martín, who is engaged to a stunning, feisty lawyer named Manuela. She decides to defend Ángel, even though Martín wants to destroy him. Neither of the men know that Ángel is Martín''s own son. Our hero learns that love is the only key to survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/468xWS1crK1AKkvHXQtoIPxNNTq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:17638'),
  ('127955216027917326', 'Falling for Challenge', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Kim So-eun, Xiumin, Jang He-ryung, Jang Yoo-sang', null, 'Na Do Jeon works as a clown part-time due to his love of making others happy with laughter. Ban Ha Na is the female lead that aspires to start her own food truck business. The two meet at a common interest club called "One Plus" where the story will unfold.', 'Na Do Jeon works as a clown part-time due to his love of making others happy with laughter. Ban Ha Na is the female lead that aspires to start her own food truck business. The two meet at a common interest club called "One Plus" where the story will unfold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mhH4d0D08EICgvC3WJiNHHyQekA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64292'),
  ('1046149909047684468', 'Falling High School Girl and Irresponsible Teacher', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'sora', null, 'Ryō Hashimoto, Akari Takaishi, Tamura Kairu, Raiku', null, 'Following a failed confession to her first love, female high school student Mikoto Ochiai contemplates jumping off the roof of the school building. However, her thoughts are interrupted by the arrival of Jin Haiba, the physics teacher known for being a slacker and the butt of students'' jokes. Calmly, he lights a cigarette and asks for an explanation of the events that led her to this precipice. Rather than dissuade her from killing herself, he makes a request—will she enter into a romance with him before she dies? Together, the two gradually ponder why they should keep living and why they should not love each other in earnest.', 'Following a failed confession to her first love, female high school student Mikoto Ochiai contemplates jumping off the roof of the school building. However, her thoughts are interrupted by the arrival of Jin Haiba, the physics teacher known for being a slacker and the butt of students'' jokes. Calmly, he lights a cigarette and asks for an explanation of the events that led her to this precipice. Rather than dissuade her from killing herself, he makes a request—will she enter into a romance with him before she dies? Together, the two gradually ponder why they should keep living and why they should not love each other in earnest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5hUCvoTgC0XLgH6FrWDAhDXSl10.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:222368'),
  ('749064329836134686', 'Falling in love with Ramón', 2017, 'Drama', 'Doris Segui', null, 'José Ron, Esmeralda Pimentel', null, 'Fabiola''s parents are killed in a plane crash leaving her and her younger sister, Andrea, orphans. Their parents estate is divided equally among the girls. But at the reading of the will, the family is surprised to learn of the existence of a life insurance policy for one million dollars. They''re even more surprised when they learn who the sole beneficiary of that policy is. While the family squabbles over what to do about the policy, Fabiola decides she''s going to take over the administration of her family''s business: a successful garage, where she finds more than she bargained for when she meets a mechanic named Ramon who just happens to be the son of her long-time nanny, Juana. It is based on the Venezuelan telenovela written by Doris Seguí, "Tomasa Tequiero" produced in 2009.', 'Fabiola''s parents are killed in a plane crash leaving her and her younger sister, Andrea, orphans. Their parents estate is divided equally among the girls. But at the reading of the will, the family is surprised to learn of the existence of a life insurance policy for one million dollars. They''re even more surprised when they learn who the sole beneficiary of that policy is. While the family squabbles over what to do about the policy, Fabiola decides she''s going to take over the administration of her family''s business: a successful garage, where she finds more than she bargained for when she meets a mechanic named Ramon who just happens to be the son of her long-time nanny, Juana. It is based on the Venezuelan telenovela written by Doris Seguí, "Tomasa Tequiero" produced in 2009.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGeEhjXq6bdYZ4tXIHwuMU1nRrP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77570'),
  ('352143650388684122', 'Falling Into Your Smile', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Qing Mei', null, 'Xu Kai, Cheng Xiao, Zhai Xiaowen, Yao Chi, Zhou Yiran, Rachel Wang, Li Deng Rui, Sun Kai', null, 'After joining an all-male e-sports team, an amateur gamer tests her skills and leads her team to the world championships.', 'After joining an all-male e-sports team, an amateur gamer tests her skills and leads her team to the world championships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ka19734c2ENU74uykVqt1tVTjJI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95486'),
  ('523398207977716601', 'Falling Leaves', 2006, 'Family, Drama', 'Reşat Nuri Güntekin', 'Ece Yörenç, Melek Gençoğlu', 'Halil Ergün, Güven Hokna, Bennu Yıldırımlar, Deniz Çakır, Tolga Karel, Gökçe Bahadır, Fahriye Evcen, Hasan Küçükçetin', 'NR', 'Yaprak Dökümü is an award-winning Turkish television series based on the novel of the same name by Reşat Nuri Güntekin. The series premiered on 13 September 2005 on Kanal D, and endеd its fifth and final season on 29 December 2010, comprising 174 episodes overall. The show is set in Istanbul, Turkey, and it revolves around the fictional family Tekin, which their arrival in Istanbul tears their family apart, and transforms them in a way they can''t imagine.', 'Yaprak Dökümü is an award-winning Turkish television series based on the novel of the same name by Reşat Nuri Güntekin. The series premiered on 13 September 2005 on Kanal D, and endеd its fifth and final season on 29 December 2010, comprising 174 episodes overall. The show is set in Istanbul, Turkey, and it revolves around the fictional family Tekin, which their arrival in Istanbul tears their family apart, and transforms them in a way they can''t imagine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/saWjY37nt2eLWWGoG6w40C5u6Vk.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:39014'),
  ('664012740940896107', 'Falling Skies', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Robert Rodat', null, 'Noah Wyle, Moon Bloodgood, Will Patton, Drew Roy, Connor Jessup, Maxim Knight, Colin Cunningham, Sarah Carter', 'TV-14', 'Falling Skies opens in the chaotic aftermath of an alien attack that has left most of the world completely incapacitated. In the six months since the initial invasion, the few survivors have banded together outside major cities to begin the difficult task of fighting back. Each day is a test of survival as citizen soldiers work to protect the people in their care while also engaging in an insurgency campaign against the occupying alien force.', 'Falling Skies opens in the chaotic aftermath of an alien attack that has left most of the world completely incapacitated. In the six months since the initial invasion, the few survivors have banded together outside major cities to begin the difficult task of fighting back. Each day is a test of survival as citizen soldiers work to protect the people in their care while also engaging in an insurgency campaign against the occupying alien force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uP6p0aWcIpYwA0HjY4bYR4naz5g.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:34967'),
  ('299294536800898868', 'Falling Water', 2016, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Blake Masters, Henry Bromell', null, 'Lizzie Brocheré, David Ajala, Will Yun Lee, Sepideh Moafi, Zak Orth, Kai Lennox, Brittany Allen', 'TV-14', 'The story of three unrelated people, who slowly realize that they are dreaming separate parts of a single common dream.', 'The story of three unrelated people, who slowly realize that they are dreaming separate parts of a single common dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Zvcv8cehygUawphBcAk7N5kVoi.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66803'),
  ('670401681059531608', 'Fallout', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Graham Wagner, Geneva Robertson-Dworet', null, 'Ella Purnell, Aaron Moten, Moisés Arias, Frances Turner, Kyle MacLachlan, Walton Goggins', 'TV-MA', 'The story of haves and have-nots in a world in which there''s almost nothing left to have. 200 years after the apocalypse, the gentle denizens of luxury fallout shelters are forced to return to the irradiated hellscape their ancestors left behind — and are shocked to discover an incredibly complex, gleefully weird, and highly violent universe waiting for them.', 'The story of haves and have-nots in a world in which there''s almost nothing left to have. 200 years after the apocalypse, the gentle denizens of luxury fallout shelters are forced to return to the irradiated hellscape their ancestors left behind — and are shocked to discover an incredibly complex, gleefully weird, and highly violent universe waiting for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c15BtJxCXMrISLVmysdsnZUPQft.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:106379'),
  ('971914307084069803', 'Fallout: Nuka Break', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Western', null, null, 'Zack Finfrock, Tybee Diskin, Aaron Giles, Steven Dengler, David Castro', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A583RiAMHQmZvf40Q6QMG2dFkXi.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:156213'),
  ('942017921470285360', 'Falsch, aber lustig', 2022, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Moritz Neumeier, Till Reiners, Filiz Tasdan', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 8, 'tmdb:tv:298017'),
  ('607729859408584252', 'False Flag', 2015, 'Drama', 'Amit Cohen, Maria Feldman, Leora Kamenetzky', 'Leora Kamenetzky, Maria Feldman, Amit Cohen', 'Mickey Leon, Romi Aboulafia, Ohad Knoller, Tali Sharon, Yossi Marshak', 'TV-MA', 'The series, loosely based on the true story of the assassination in Dubai of a senior Hamas official Mahmoud al-Mabhouh - the co-founder of military wing of the Islamist Palestinian group Hamas on 19 January 2010, revolves around five ordinary Israeli citizens who discover one morning via the media that they are the principal suspects of a high-profile kidnapping and are implicated as culprits in the kidnapping.', 'The series, loosely based on the true story of the assassination in Dubai of a senior Hamas official Mahmoud al-Mabhouh - the co-founder of military wing of the Islamist Palestinian group Hamas on 19 January 2010, revolves around five ordinary Israeli citizens who discover one morning via the media that they are the principal suspects of a high-profile kidnapping and are implicated as culprits in the kidnapping.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRndlrQYKoBsYFc3c0ixtKOElNY.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:65312'),
  ('408753604926359805', 'False Identity', 2018, 'Crime, Action & Adventure', 'Perla Farías', null, 'Luis Ernesto Franco, Camila Sodi, Dulce María, Samadhi Zendejas, Eduardo Yáñez, Sonya Smith, Barbie Casillas, Pepe Gámez', 'TV-14', 'Isabel and Diego, two complete strangers, must assume the identity of a married couple in order to flee the state of Sonora.', 'Isabel and Diego, two complete strangers, must assume the identity of a married couple in order to flee the state of Sonora.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGIVID9KFrE6oMOtqost2Ccd9Co.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:82809'),
  ('736354090707770128', 'Faltu', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Niharika Chouksey, Aakash Ahuja, Rajat Verma, Drishti Thakur, Mahesh Thakur, Vibhavari Pradhan, Rakhee Tandon, Myra Singh', null, 'What''s in a name? Amidst the arid landscape of Rajasthan, a young woman with dreamy eyes struggles to prove her worth.', 'What''s in a name? Amidst the arid landscape of Rajasthan, a young woman with dreamy eyes struggles to prove her worth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lgyFuoXs7GvKJN0mNm7z7OMOFuZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213713'),
  ('1087354555049144867', 'Fam', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Corinne Kingsbury', null, 'Nina Dobrev, Tone Bell, Odessa A''zion, Sheryl Lee Ralph, Brian Stokes Mitchell', 'TV-14', 'Fed up with her father, a woman moves in with her older half-sister, and her fiancé.', 'Fed up with her father, a woman moves in with her older half-sister, and her fiancé.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vYUCvlFMNmEHGcfOdqP6ikvwisl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83376'),
  ('316771413940811399', 'Fame', 1982, 'Drama', 'Christopher Gore', null, 'Debbie Allen, Gene Anthony Ray, Carlo Imperato, Nia Peeples, Jesse Borrego, Billy Hufsey, Ann Nelson, Carrie Hamilton', null, 'An American television series originally produced between 1982 and 1987. The show is based on the 1980 motion picture of the same name. With a mixture of drama and music, it followed the lives of the students and faculty at the New York City High School for the Performing Arts. Although fictional, it was based heavily on the actual Fiorello H. LaGuardia High School of Music & Art and Performing Arts in New York. Most interior scenes were filmed in Hollywood, California, and in all seasons but the third, several exterior scenes were shot on location in New York City. The popularity of the series, particularly in the UK, led to several hit records and live concert tours by the cast. Despite its success, very few of the actors maintained high-profile careers after the series was cancelled. A number of the cast members were seen again briefly in Bring Back...Fame, a reunion special made for British television in 2008.', 'An American television series originally produced between 1982 and 1987. The show is based on the 1980 motion picture of the same name. With a mixture of drama and music, it followed the lives of the students and faculty at the New York City High School for the Performing Arts. Although fictional, it was based heavily on the actual Fiorello H. LaGuardia High School of Music & Art and Performing Arts in New York. Most interior scenes were filmed in Hollywood, California, and in all seasons but the third, several exterior scenes were shot on location in New York City. The popularity of the series, particularly in the UK, led to several hit records and live concert tours by the cast. Despite its success, very few of the actors maintained high-profile careers after the series was cancelled. A number of the cast members were seen again briefly in Bring Back...Fame, a reunion special made for British television in 2008.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wed91CGCdmtBLbo82o0cF2QNRUw.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:1798'),
  ('935238893521339445', 'Família é Tudo', 2024, 'Soap, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Daniel Ortiz', 'Daniel Ortiz', 'Arlete Salles, Nathalia Dill, Renato Góes, Juliana Paiva, Thiago Martins, Ramille, Raphael Logam, Isacque Lopes', null, 'Five half-siblings – Venus, Andromeda, Jupiter, Electra, and Plutao – share the same father, Pedro. Separated by their respective mothers after Pedro''s death, the quintet have had few social and intimate interactions since. Years later, now adults, they reunite when their millionaire grandmother disappears on a cruise and is presumed dead. To earn their inheritance, they will have to live and work together for a year in an attempt to bring the family business back to its peak. If they don''t succeed, the inheritance will go to their cousin, Hans, who will do anything to get the money from his aunt.', 'Five half-siblings – Venus, Andromeda, Jupiter, Electra, and Plutao – share the same father, Pedro. Separated by their respective mothers after Pedro''s death, the quintet have had few social and intimate interactions since. Years later, now adults, they reunite when their millionaire grandmother disappears on a cruise and is presumed dead. To earn their inheritance, they will have to live and work together for a year in an attempt to bring the family business back to its peak. If they don''t succeed, the inheritance will go to their cousin, Hans, who will do anything to get the money from his aunt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tDbJuSfVhf3ZnxiJrXlXEALyAz5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222289'),
  ('283322343537088215', 'Familiar Wife', 2018, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Lee Sang-yeob, Yang Hui-seung', 'Yang Hui-seung', 'Ji Sung, Han Ji-min, Kang Hanna, Jang Seung-jo, Cha Hak-yeon, Son Jong-hak, Park Won-sang, Kim So-ra', 'TV-MA', 'After receiving a bizarre chance to go back in time, a man wakes up to find that his whole life — including the person he married — is different.', 'After receiving a bizarre chance to go back in time, a man wakes up to find that his whole life — including the person he married — is different.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ds84fVavAJX872qh4kUHAfqjp3b.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80741'),
  ('834545532406662093', 'Familie', 1991, 'Soap', 'Herman Verbaet', null, 'Jools Jatta Janssens, Maarten Cop, Bjarne Devolder, Tine Roggeman, Sandrine André, Annie Geeraerts, Ray Verhaeghe, Jasmijn Van Hoof', null, '''Familie'' is the longest running Belgian soap opera. The Van den Bossches originally had an electronics company, later a holding company that included a clothing chain and a sandwich shop. In the meantime, we closely follow the personal lives of the Van den Bossches and their entourage. Grandma Anna and all her children and grandchildren have been through a lot over time and it doesn''t look like their lives will become calmer any time soon.', '''Familie'' is the longest running Belgian soap opera. The Van den Bossches originally had an electronics company, later a holding company that included a clothing chain and a sandwich shop. In the meantime, we closely follow the personal lives of the Van den Bossches and their entourage. Grandma Anna and all her children and grandchildren have been through a lot over time and it doesn''t look like their lives will become calmer any time soon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bPBeBzhhfbF0aYZaHd7ESe0TVwK.jpg', 36, 'tmdb:tv:25778'),
