  ('348366973325310342', 'Family Feud (HK)', 2021, 'Reality, Comedy', null, null, 'Johnson Lee Sze-Chit, Derek Wong', null, 'Based off of American game show Family Feud, hosted by Johnson Lee.', 'Based off of American game show Family Feud, hosted by Johnson Lee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PAr5cnKgZ5w03y8RuxlTo6BE3Y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213159'),
  ('90510704163031762', 'Family Fortune', 2024, 'Drama', 'Sergey Minaev', null, 'Aleksey Guskov, Yuliya Snigir, Pavel Popov, Alexandr Novin, Angelina Pakhomova, Valery Karpov, Nataliya Vdovina, Viktoriya Maslova', null, 'After the death of Alexey Gradov, the owner of a large construction holding company, his heirs enter into a struggle for a billion-dollar fortune with a former official and business partner of the deceased. On the family side, the war is led by Gradov Sr., the patriarch of the family, who founded the family business in the 90s, but retired. As an ally, he takes the financier and strategist of the company Nadezhda, who was not only a colleague, but also his son''s mistress. In addition to the redistribution of assets, the Gradovs — wives, children, grandchildren — are busy identifying old grievances and accumulated claims against each other. They have everything—money, power, connections, status. But that''s not enough for them. In the pursuit of inheritance, they are ready to tear apart not only the enemies of the family, but also each other.', 'After the death of Alexey Gradov, the owner of a large construction holding company, his heirs enter into a struggle for a billion-dollar fortune with a former official and business partner of the deceased. On the family side, the war is led by Gradov Sr., the patriarch of the family, who founded the family business in the 90s, but retired. As an ally, he takes the financier and strategist of the company Nadezhda, who was not only a colleague, but also his son''s mistress. In addition to the redistribution of assets, the Gradovs — wives, children, grandchildren — are busy identifying old grievances and accumulated claims against each other. They have everything—money, power, connections, status. But that''s not enough for them. In the pursuit of inheritance, they are ready to tear apart not only the enemies of the family, but also each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqmVlW3kTl4H3a7pT7CxrwBZleZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:243924'),
  ('374677442802812885', 'Family Guy', 1999, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Seth MacFarlane', null, 'Seth MacFarlane, Alex Borstein, Mila Kunis, Seth Green, Patrick Warburton, Arif Zahir', 'TV-14', 'Sick, twisted, politically incorrect and Freakin'' Sweet animated series featuring the adventures of the dysfunctional Griffin family. Bumbling Peter and long-suffering Lois have three kids. Stewie (a brilliant but sadistic baby bent on killing his mother and taking over the world), Meg (the oldest, and is the most unpopular girl in town) and Chris (the middle kid, he''s not very bright but has a passion for movies). The final member of the family is Brian - a talking dog and much more than a pet, he keeps Stewie in check whilst sipping Martinis and sorting through his own life issues.', 'Sick, twisted, politically incorrect and Freakin'' Sweet animated series featuring the adventures of the dysfunctional Griffin family. Bumbling Peter and long-suffering Lois have three kids. Stewie (a brilliant but sadistic baby bent on killing his mother and taking over the world), Meg (the oldest, and is the most unpopular girl in town) and Chris (the middle kid, he''s not very bright but has a passion for movies). The final member of the family is Brian - a talking dog and much more than a pet, he keeps Stewie in check whilst sipping Martinis and sorting through his own life issues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3PFsEuAiyLkWsP4GG6dIV37Q6gu.jpg', 24, 'tmdb:tv:1434'),
  ('814040608019714800', 'Family Law', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Anne Kenney, Paul Haggis', null, 'Kathleen Quinlan, Christopher McDonald, Dixie Carter, Tony Danza, Salli Richardson-Whitfield, Meredith Eaton, Orla Brady, Merrilee McCommas', null, 'Family attorney and mom, Lynn Holt, has had to scramble to keep her family and her law firm together, since her husband left her and took most of their joint law practice with him. Although the attorneys are carting plenty of life''s baggage, they''re all determined to make the most of this unexpected second chance—and make each month''s mortgage payment.', 'Family attorney and mom, Lynn Holt, has had to scramble to keep her family and her law firm together, since her husband left her and took most of their joint law practice with him. Although the attorneys are carting plenty of life''s baggage, they''re all determined to make the most of this unexpected second chance—and make each month''s mortgage payment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5JeRg8YGj4EjaQU6QwetJG22RIY.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:9877'),
  ('856091062690502183', 'Family Law', 2021, 'Drama', 'Susin Nielsen', null, 'Jewel Staite, Zach Smadu, Genelle Williams, Lauren Holly, Victor Garber, Bobbi Charlton, Brett Kelly, Ryan Lino', 'TV-14', 'Lawyer and recovering alcoholic Abigail Bianchi is struggling to put her career and family back together after hitting rock bottom. As a condition of her probation, Abby is forced to work at her estranged father’s firm, Svensson and Associates, and practice in family law for the first time while forging new relationships with the half-brother and half-sister whom she’s never met. The result is a dysfunctional family law firm operating to help other families with their own dysfunctions.', 'Lawyer and recovering alcoholic Abigail Bianchi is struggling to put her career and family back together after hitting rock bottom. As a condition of her probation, Abby is forced to work at her estranged father’s firm, Svensson and Associates, and practice in family law for the first time while forging new relationships with the half-brother and half-sister whom she’s never met. The result is a dysfunctional family law firm operating to help other families with their own dysfunctions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/amxRi4RUIGuV0qaKiJPJpROruYR.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:124643'),
  ('1065359795598177119', 'Family Matter', 2021, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Ahmed El Gendy, Karim Youssef, Mohamed Ezz El Din', 'Ahmed El Gendy, Karim Youssef, Mohamed Ezz El Din', 'Maged El Kedwany, Rana Raeis, Taha Desouky, Samaa Ibrahem, Mohamed Radwan, Mohamed Shaheen, Mohammad Alqass, Nour', null, 'Ibrahim reluctantly accepts becoming the legal guardian of his estranged daughter for six months, setting himself up for hilarious and lifechanging experiences.', 'Ibrahim reluctantly accepts becoming the legal guardian of his estranged daughter for six months, setting himself up for hilarious and lifechanging experiences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWCMBOMviVt3lzVQekdhsUfF4Vc.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:139471'),
  ('387036306204730885', 'Family Matters', 1989, 'Comedy, Family', 'Michael Warren, William Bickley', null, 'Reginald VelJohnson, Darius McCrary, Kellie Shanygne Williams, Jaleel White', 'TV-G', 'A long-running dramedy centering on the Winslow family, a middle-class African American family living in Chicago, and their pesky next-door neighbor, ultra-nerd Steve Urkel. A spin-off of Perfect Strangers.', 'A long-running dramedy centering on the Winslow family, a middle-class African American family living in Chicago, and their pesky next-door neighbor, ultra-nerd Steve Urkel. A spin-off of Perfect Strangers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lIIPV3te2mxBQBHw2rfhwkUYsHf.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:2685'),
  ('545893181303314876', 'Family Matters', 2024, 'Drama, Crime, Comedy, Mystery', 'Kim Jung-min', 'Kim Jung-min', 'Bae Doona, Ryoo Seung-bum, Baek Yoon-sik, Lomon, Lee Soo-hyun, Jin Seo-yeon, Kim Jeong-hyeon, Nam Yoon-ho', null, 'A group of people possessing special abilities disguise themselves as a family to survive against heinous criminals.', 'A group of people possessing special abilities disguise themselves as a family to survive against heinous criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQt92o4IOZis7rFRNpo15sflZde.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:236356'),
  ('87099714093271231', 'Family on the Go', 2012, 'Drama, Family', null, null, 'Lee Li-Chun, Chi Peng, Zhang Yi, Yin Tao, Karlina Zhang, Jin Dong, Ren Shuai, Liu Mintao', null, 'The drama begins during China’s Reform and Opening Up era in the 1980s in Wenzhou, south China, an area renown for the emergence of many successful businesses. It charts the progress of a certain family headed by Zhou Wanshun, that lived in Rui’an village. The family had the opportunity for one of their two children to go to Italy to study. Wanshun (quite extraordinary at the time, and even today) chose to let his 13-year old daughter, Ayu, go to study rather than his 16-year-old son, son Maigou. Unbeknownst to his wife, Zhao Yinhua and son he sold their ancestral home cum cottage industry and spent all the proceeds in funding the Italy study trip. Although he had no business plan, he set out with his wife and son to Wenzhou City to “make money”, any which way. Together, they make it to Wenzhou City, while the daughter goes to Italy, each forging different paths, especially the children each persevering through challenges and hardship, achieving individual success.', 'The drama begins during China’s Reform and Opening Up era in the 1980s in Wenzhou, south China, an area renown for the emergence of many successful businesses. It charts the progress of a certain family headed by Zhou Wanshun, that lived in Rui’an village. The family had the opportunity for one of their two children to go to Italy to study. Wanshun (quite extraordinary at the time, and even today) chose to let his 13-year old daughter, Ayu, go to study rather than his 16-year-old son, son Maigou. Unbeknownst to his wife, Zhao Yinhua and son he sold their ancestral home cum cottage industry and spent all the proceeds in funding the Italy study trip. Although he had no business plan, he set out with his wife and son to Wenzhou City to “make money”, any which way. Together, they make it to Wenzhou City, while the daughter goes to Italy, each forging different paths, especially the children each persevering through challenges and hardship, achieving individual success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jjJkPcLJkXpQLWIkcQz7cH9guqR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75930'),
  ('1143383074391455909', 'Family Reunion', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Meg DeLoatch', null, 'Tia Mowry, Anthony Alabi, Talia Jackson, Cameron J. Wright, Jordyn Raya James, Loretta Devine, Rodney Damon Collins', 'TV-PG', 'Family Reunion follows a family of six who travel from Seattle, Washington to Columbus, Georgia for the McKellan Family Reunion and decide to stay to be closer to their family.', 'Family Reunion follows a family of six who travel from Seattle, Washington to Columbus, Georgia for the McKellan Family Reunion and decide to stay to be closer to their family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1FOJNlszjqBk5S1CDjnGvFTP2e4.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:87093'),
  ('490768134582379729', 'Family Secrets', 2021, 'Family, Drama, Crime', 'Sema Ergenekon', 'Sema Ergenekon', 'Kaan Urgancıoğlu, Pınar Deniz, Uğur Polat, Zeyno Eracar, Uğur Aslan, Arda Anarat, Zeynep Atılgan, Pınar Çağlar Gençtürk', 'NR', 'A lawyer and a prosecutor, whose paths cross with a murder case, will have to work together to find the murderer, and this will create an irreversible breaking point in their lives.', 'A lawyer and a prosecutor, whose paths cross with a murder case, will have to work together to find the murderer, and this will create an irreversible breaking point in their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c2WubXZ2npBH14uTqirRREzFY0h.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:133490'),
  ('412483985787809709', 'Family Secrets', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Agnieszka Pilaszewska', 'Eliza Rycembel, Izabela Kuna, Małgorzata Mikołajczak, Piotr Pacek, Bartosz Gelner, Edyta Olszówka, Paweł Deląg, Adrian Zaremba', null, 'On the day of the wedding of a medical student with a wealthy plastic surgeon, the families of the young couple realize that the only thing they have in common are secrets and lies. The secrets of both sides will be revealed during the wedding ceremony.', 'On the day of the wedding of a medical student with a wealthy plastic surgeon, the families of the young couple realize that the only thing they have in common are secrets and lies. The secrets of both sides will be revealed during the wedding ceremony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNfMqQniQ23sW8rICfcrCt6ZotZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207642'),
  ('694336886016474512', 'Family Squad', 1991, 'Comedy, Family', 'Poon Ka-Tak, Tommy Leung Ga-Shu', null, 'Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Anita Lee Yuen-Wah, Chor Yuen, Angelina Lo, Chun Wong, Perrie Lai Hoi-San, Joseph Cheng King-Kei, Bobby Au-Yeung Tsan-Wah', null, 'The Huang family has served in the police force for generations. The patriarch, Huang Jiajing, is modest and talkative, but lacking in confidence and self-esteem. After making mistakes in his job as a police officer, he was transferred and then resigned. His wife, Liao Zhonghao, is a contented housewife devoted to her children. Their eldest daughter, Huang Di, is a senior police inspector who is authoritative and diligent. Their second daughter, Huang Fei is impulsive, lazy, and gluttonous, but unexpectedly clever. Their son, Huang Fa, is a university student who is playful and vain, but spoiled by his family. Jiajing''s godson, Liao Tong-tai, is Huang family''s mischievous relative who loves to prank, and Huang family''s sworn enemy...', 'The Huang family has served in the police force for generations. The patriarch, Huang Jiajing, is modest and talkative, but lacking in confidence and self-esteem. After making mistakes in his job as a police officer, he was transferred and then resigned. His wife, Liao Zhonghao, is a contented housewife devoted to her children. Their eldest daughter, Huang Di, is a senior police inspector who is authoritative and diligent. Their second daughter, Huang Fei is impulsive, lazy, and gluttonous, but unexpectedly clever. Their son, Huang Fa, is a university student who is playful and vain, but spoiled by his family. Jiajing''s godson, Liao Tong-tai, is Huang family''s mischievous relative who loves to prank, and Huang family''s sworn enemy...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88ZnMthVfhitDygxZWRMSYPAHFJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109698'),
  ('3712724765473797', 'Family Ties', 1982, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Gary David Goldberg', 'Gary David Goldberg, Alan Uger', 'Meredith Baxter, Michael Gross, Michael J. Fox, Justine Bateman, Tina Yothers, Brian Bonsall', 'TV-PG', 'Former 1960s flower children Steven and Elyse Keaton raise their conservative son Alex, daughters Mallory and Jennifer, and later, youngest child Andrew.', 'Former 1960s flower children Steven and Elyse Keaton raise their conservative son Alex, daughters Mallory and Jennifer, and later, youngest child Andrew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vxERANdozlMKgl7VqGxbAvZ6u1O.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:496'),
  ('1143959478629952559', 'Family Ties', 2000, 'Soap, Drama', 'Manoel Carlos', 'Manoel Carlos, Maria Carolina, Flávia Lins e Silva', 'Vera Fischer, Tony Ramos, Carolina Dieckmmann, Reynaldo Gianecchini, Marieta Severo, José Mayer, Deborah Secco, Giovanna Antonelli', null, 'A mature and successful woman, Helena becomes involved with Edu, who is twenty years her junior. She battles prejudice in order to live her love, but their romance fizzles out when she realizes that her daughter Camila has also fallen in love with him. Her dilemma grows even worse when she discovers that the girl has leukemia. Helena must disclose the real identity of Camila‘s father in order to try and find a compatible bone marrow donor. In order to save her, she decides to give up her new love and have another baby with her daughter‘s father.', 'A mature and successful woman, Helena becomes involved with Edu, who is twenty years her junior. She battles prejudice in order to live her love, but their romance fizzles out when she realizes that her daughter Camila has also fallen in love with him. Her dilemma grows even worse when she discovers that the girl has leukemia. Helena must disclose the real identity of Camila‘s father in order to try and find a compatible bone marrow donor. In order to save her, she decides to give up her new love and have another baby with her daughter‘s father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tx2oX3AZ5UMXLsOH7TtLjRVeO7f.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34957'),
  ('154993869972683461', 'Family Tree', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Christopher Guest, Jim Piddock', null, 'Chris O''Dowd, Tom Bennett, Nina Conti', null, 'Having recently lost his job and his girlfriend, 30-year-old Tom Chadwick has a rather unsure sense of his own identity. But when he inherits a mysterious box of belongings from a great aunt he never met, Tom starts investigating his lineage and uncovers a whole world of unusual stories and characters, acquiring a growing sense of who he and his real family are.', 'Having recently lost his job and his girlfriend, 30-year-old Tom Chadwick has a rather unsure sense of his own identity. But when he inherits a mysterious box of belongings from a great aunt he never met, Tom starts investigating his lineage and uncovers a whole world of unusual stories and characters, acquiring a growing sense of who he and his real family are.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aR1QlhiZVPxey4Hb5WxjJI8bpue.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46406'),
  ('97806027639159315', 'Family: The Unbreakable Bond', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Jang Jung-do, Jung Yoo-sun', 'Jung Yoo-sun', 'Jang Hyuk, Jang Na-ra, Chae Jung-an, Kim Nam-hee, Lee Soon-jae, Kim Kang-min, Yun Sang-jeong, Gabee', null, 'Kwon Do-hun is an expert sniper and a secret agent working for the National Intelligence Service. To conceal his true identity, he lives a double life as a regular trading company employee, keeping even his wife Kang Yu-ra in the dark. Though he is occupied with his work, Do-hun cherishes his wife deeply. Meanwhile, Yu-ra, a dedicated homemaker, harbors a secret. Their tranquil existence is thrown into turmoil when Jo Tae-gu emerges, posing a threat to their carefully crafted façade.', 'Kwon Do-hun is an expert sniper and a secret agent working for the National Intelligence Service. To conceal his true identity, he lives a double life as a regular trading company employee, keeping even his wife Kang Yu-ra in the dark. Though he is occupied with his work, Do-hun cherishes his wife deeply. Meanwhile, Yu-ra, a dedicated homemaker, harbors a secret. Their tranquil existence is thrown into turmoil when Jo Tae-gu emerges, posing a threat to their carefully crafted façade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7NpD7m91PZcStQPRk70AluZkVd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214529'),
  ('1076512592804500146', 'Famous in Love', 2017, 'Soap, Drama', 'I. Marlene King, Rebecca Serle', null, 'Bella Thorne, Charlie DePew, Carter Jenkins, Niki Koss, Pepi Sonuga, Georgie Flores, Keith Powers, Perrey Reeves', 'TV-14', 'Ordinary college student Paige gets her big break after auditioning for the starring role in a Hollywood blockbuster. She must now navigate her new star-studded life and the highs and lows that come with being the new It Girl in town as well as balancing her college workload.', 'Ordinary college student Paige gets her big break after auditioning for the starring role in a Hollywood blockbuster. She must now navigate her new star-studded life and the highs and lows that come with being the new It Girl in town as well as balancing her college workload.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ae4z2yBQr5htmHyfh89XdHlyQn2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67725'),
  ('375266138047248197', 'Fan School', 1977, 'Talk, Kids', 'Jacques Martin', null, 'Jacques Martin', null, 'Host Jacques Martin invites different talented children from various backgrounds to showcase their beautiful voices. The participants entertain and wow the audience with their lovely performances.', 'Host Jacques Martin invites different talented children from various backgrounds to showcase their beautiful voices. The participants entertain and wow the audience with their lovely performances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lavhdK5loEnuCSJIRYHi2yAXlXV.jpg', 21, 'tmdb:tv:110898'),
  ('415071489374202644', 'Fanboy and Chum Chum', 2009, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Eric Robles', null, 'Nika Futterman, Jamie Kennedy, Jeff Bennett, David Hornsby, Wyatt Cenac', 'TV-Y7', 'Fanboy and Chum Chum are fans of all things science fiction and fantasy, and wear wild superhero costumes with their underwear on the outside. Their lives are filled with adventure, from Fanboy''s teacher turning into a zombie to an ice monster operating the Frosty Freezy Freeze machine. Their pal Kyle usually tags along on their escapades. Kyle is a real wizard, but Fanboy and Chum Chum are oblivious to his mystical powers, although they live in a world of fantasy.', 'Fanboy and Chum Chum are fans of all things science fiction and fantasy, and wear wild superhero costumes with their underwear on the outside. Their lives are filled with adventure, from Fanboy''s teacher turning into a zombie to an ice monster operating the Frosty Freezy Freeze machine. Their pal Kyle usually tags along on their escapades. Kyle is a real wizard, but Fanboy and Chum Chum are oblivious to his mystical powers, although they live in a world of fantasy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fyxTvqnpNbp2crlWUn2064kXd7Q.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:18686'),
  ('820560090964670780', 'Fancy Lala', 1998, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shinobu Adachi, Kappei Yamaguchi, Omi Minami, Michiko Neya, Reiko Ōmori, Ryusuke Ohbayashi, Hideo Ishikawa, Atsuko Tanaka', null, 'One day, a 9-year-old elementary schoolgirl named Miho Shinohara is given two stuffed dinosaurs by an unnamed stranger. The stuffed dinosaurs come to life and they present her with a magic sketchbook and pen. Within limits, and subject to varying degrees of control, she can draw in the sketchbook and bring the drawings to life. Miho can also transform into a teenage girl, whom she names Fancy Lala. One day, Lala is scouted by Yumi Haneishi, the president of the talent agency Lyrical Productions, and begins the long road to stardom.', 'One day, a 9-year-old elementary schoolgirl named Miho Shinohara is given two stuffed dinosaurs by an unnamed stranger. The stuffed dinosaurs come to life and they present her with a magic sketchbook and pen. Within limits, and subject to varying degrees of control, she can draw in the sketchbook and bring the drawings to life. Miho can also transform into a teenage girl, whom she names Fancy Lala. One day, Lala is scouted by Yumi Haneishi, the president of the talent agency Lyrical Productions, and begins the long road to stardom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7oxkqC4e1vgm50dTEeK6pVzBIR4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9428'),
  ('939127920178455680', 'Fancy Nancy', 2018, 'Animation, Kids', 'Anne Smith', null, 'Mia Sinclair Jenness, Alyson Hannigan, Rob Riggle, Christine Baranski, George Wendt, Dana Heath, Tatyana Ali, Ian Chen', 'TV-Y', 'Meet Nancy Clancy, a high-spirited young girl whose imagination and enthusiasm for all that is exquisite transforms the ordinary into the extraordinary – from her vast vocabulary to her creative and elaborate attire.', 'Meet Nancy Clancy, a high-spirited young girl whose imagination and enthusiasm for all that is exquisite transforms the ordinary into the extraordinary – from her vast vocabulary to her creative and elaborate attire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2iNKvpHmh5IWlkycIGmY6yr1q7H.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:80056'),
  ('263729491781231855', 'Fandorin. Azazello', 2023, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Vladislav Tiron, Mila Ershova, Maksim Matveev, Aleksandr Semchev, Evgeniy Serzin, Sergey Goroshko, Milena Radulović, Urszula Malka', null, 'The October Revolution hadn''t happened, and the Bolsheviks had never risen to power. The year is 2023, and the rule over the Russian Empire is divided between tzar Nikolai III and a forward-thinking PM, Dmitry Orlov. Erast Fandorin, a 20-year-old police servant, has just been hired in the criminal investigations unit at the Petrograd Metro. His job is not that exciting, but the latest news is: right at the heart of the capital, a young and wealthy oil company tycoon has just shot himself in front of dozens of men. His suicide was captured on the patrol robot cameras. Fandorin can''t help but suspect that this case is far more complicated than it looks and takes on his very first major investigation', 'The October Revolution hadn''t happened, and the Bolsheviks had never risen to power. The year is 2023, and the rule over the Russian Empire is divided between tzar Nikolai III and a forward-thinking PM, Dmitry Orlov. Erast Fandorin, a 20-year-old police servant, has just been hired in the criminal investigations unit at the Petrograd Metro. His job is not that exciting, but the latest news is: right at the heart of the capital, a young and wealthy oil company tycoon has just shot himself in front of dozens of men. His suicide was captured on the patrol robot cameras. Fandorin can''t help but suspect that this case is far more complicated than it looks and takes on his very first major investigation', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YRuFvIFFsdWh5K2rJGKX4K1ebp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218634'),
  ('1134581635313602736', 'Fanfare of Adolescence', 2022, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Yojiro Itokawa, Shogo Yano, Shimba Tsuchiya, Natsuki Hanae, Tatsumaru Tachibana, Inori Minase, Toshiyuki Toyonaga, Chiaki Kobayashi', 'TV-14', 'The jockey curriculum at the Horse Racing School... A school with incredibly difficult entrance requirements, where only one out of every ten to twenty applicants is accepted, and students need not just book smarts, but also physical and athletic abilities. There, a boy who is a popular idol meets his real dream for the first time. A boy who grew up on an island dreams of spending his days racing with horses. A boy from England is unsure of the path his parents have chosen for him, but still chooses to follow his dreams. This is a story about boys who pursue their dream of becoming a jockey.', 'The jockey curriculum at the Horse Racing School... A school with incredibly difficult entrance requirements, where only one out of every ten to twenty applicants is accepted, and students need not just book smarts, but also physical and athletic abilities. There, a boy who is a popular idol meets his real dream for the first time. A boy who grew up on an island dreams of spending his days racing with horses. A boy from England is unsure of the path his parents have chosen for him, but still chooses to follow his dreams. This is a story about boys who pursue their dream of becoming a jockey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m6K4FQC09AM8ut5L4ag1ONFswGt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:131681'),
  ('110982723722859543', 'Fang of the Sun Dougram', 1981, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kazuhiko Inoue, Ryoichi Tanaka, Eiko Yamada, Banjo Ginga, Kiyonobu Suzuki, Yuri Nashiwa, Kenichi Ogata, Kiyoshi Komiyama', null, 'Fang of the Sun Dougram is a 75-episode anime television series, created by Ryosuke Takahashi and Sunrise, and aired in Japan from October 23, 1981 to March 25, 1983 on TV Tokyo. A 1983 full-length feature film, Dougram: Documentary of the Fang of the Sun, summarized the series.', 'Fang of the Sun Dougram is a 75-episode anime television series, created by Ryosuke Takahashi and Sunrise, and aired in Japan from October 23, 1981 to March 25, 1983 on TV Tokyo. A 1983 full-length feature film, Dougram: Documentary of the Fang of the Sun, summarized the series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3VsRMpdnhoFWwTo9AAZQtuBlsap.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8909'),
  ('742252987878449653', 'Fångat på polisens kamera', 2024, 'Reality, Crime', null, null, null, null, 'Through authentic material captured by police cameras we are invited to the harsh everyday life of the Swedish police.', 'Through authentic material captured by police cameras we are invited to the harsh everyday life of the Swedish police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w6jUnlY6zRl50bEqffCgejZ4XgJ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:263373'),
  ('649713308454614655', 'Fangbone!', 2016, 'Animation, Kids', 'Richard Elliott, Simon Racioppa, Michael Rex', null, 'Taylor Abrahamse, Colin Doyle, Juan Chioran, Kathleen Laskey, Stacey DePass', 'TV-Y7', 'A 9-year-old barbarian warrior from another world enters third grade and learns about the modern world, while trying to save his native land from a vile villain.', 'A 9-year-old barbarian warrior from another world enters third grade and learns about the modern world, while trying to save his native land from a vile villain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRLPVSISu4gyl8Wofi07TARRyD6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66988'),
  ('810379567849535042', 'Fangface', 1978, 'Animation, Comedy, Mystery, Kids', null, null, 'Bart Braverman, Jerry Dexter, Susan Blu, Frank Welker', null, 'Fangface is a 30-minute Saturday morning cartoon produced by Ruby-Spears Productions for ABC which aired from September 9, 1978 to September 8, 1979. The executive producers were Joe Ruby and Ken Spears.', 'Fangface is a 30-minute Saturday morning cartoon produced by Ruby-Spears Productions for ABC which aired from September 9, 1978 to September 8, 1979. The executive producers were Joe Ruby and Ken Spears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/al6tfY3lXtLDosDvfY6Tv6mb4E0.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:12826'),
  ('703959435435407694', 'Fangs of Fortune', 2024, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', null, 'Alice.L, Edward Guo', 'Hou Minghao, Chen Duling, Tian Jiarui, Cheng Xiao, Lin Ziye, Xu Zhenxuan, Yan An, Lai Weiming', null, 'During the Zhenyuan era, the accidental death of the Bai Ze goddess, who governed both human and demon realms, leads to chaos as demon beasts run rampant. Disguised as Zhao Yuanzhou, the demon leader Zhu Yan offers to form a demon-hunting bureau to help restore order. Wen Xiao, suspicious of Zhao Yuanzhou, joins the bureau along with her childhood friend Zhuo Yichen, skilled archer Pei Sijing, and the talented but timid doctor Bai Jiu. Together, they confront the creatures from "The Classic of Mountains and Seas" and uncover the darker truths behind the chaos.', 'During the Zhenyuan era, the accidental death of the Bai Ze goddess, who governed both human and demon realms, leads to chaos as demon beasts run rampant. Disguised as Zhao Yuanzhou, the demon leader Zhu Yan offers to form a demon-hunting bureau to help restore order. Wen Xiao, suspicious of Zhao Yuanzhou, joins the bureau along with her childhood friend Zhuo Yichen, skilled archer Pei Sijing, and the talented but timid doctor Bai Jiu. Together, they confront the creatures from "The Classic of Mountains and Seas" and uncover the darker truths behind the chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifugPKhZOjmTwj9y1nNGhOSfPmi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:239389'),
  ('869361344038689717', 'Fanletter, Please', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Park Tae-yang', 'Sooyoung Choi, Yoon Park, Kwon Hyuk, Shin Yeon-woo, Jeong In-ji, Kang Da-hyeon, Kim Sang-woo, Kim Mi-ryeo', null, 'A top star actress in deep crisis and a man who makes a fake reply to a fanletter start their romance story.', 'A top star actress in deep crisis and a man who makes a fake reply to a fanletter start their romance story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yk9LSExlvtP6uWODe0aOHaC0DuJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210273'),
  ('1042227709520718209', 'Fanny and Alexander', 1984, 'Drama', 'Ingmar Bergman', null, 'Pernilla Allwin, Bertil Guve, Ewa Fröling, Jarl Kulle, Börje Ahlstedt, Gunn Wållgren, Ernst Günther, Sune Mangs', 'TV-MA', 'Through the eyes of ten-year-old Alexander, we witness the delights and conflicts of the Ekdahl family, a sprawling bourgeois clan in turn-of-the-twentieth-century Sweden.', 'Through the eyes of ten-year-old Alexander, we witness the delights and conflicts of the Ekdahl family, a sprawling bourgeois clan in turn-of-the-twentieth-century Sweden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1UxljgTyJ5amss39ycSM7fQIkt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:33153'),
  ('395334908992074128', 'Fanta G Spot', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lee yoon-ha, Lee Do-yeon', 'Lee Do-yeon', 'Hani, Bae Woo-hee, Park Sun-ho, Choi Gwang-rok, Hong Seok-cheon, Lee Hye-ji, Choi Woong, Kim Pub-lae', null, 'A warm, friendly, considerate person, Hee Jae is surrounded by people who claim to know and love her. The problem for Hee Jae is that she isn’t really sure if she really understands herself. On the other hand, Mi Na is Hee Jae''s confident and energetic best friend and colleague at Play Books, a supplier of books and related products centered around sex and romance. While an expert in how to achieve physical pleasure, her understanding falls short on romantic relationships. When they find themselves told to take over hosting a sex and romance advice podcast, the two feel more than a little lost...', 'A warm, friendly, considerate person, Hee Jae is surrounded by people who claim to know and love her. The problem for Hee Jae is that she isn’t really sure if she really understands herself. On the other hand, Mi Na is Hee Jae''s confident and energetic best friend and colleague at Play Books, a supplier of books and related products centered around sex and romance. While an expert in how to achieve physical pleasure, her understanding falls short on romantic relationships. When they find themselves told to take over hosting a sex and romance advice podcast, the two feel more than a little lost...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3o9ovaVPYyJiRfDZw20iOQTh8d0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211260'),
  ('51404959237919000', 'Fantasia Sango – Realm of Legends', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kensho Ono, Hisako Kanemoto, Mai Nakahara, Makoto Furukawa', 'TV-14', 'When the Three Kingdoms are ravaged by demons and monsters, four heroes with little in common must unite to fight the realm’s most vicious enemies. Together the heroes unveil an insidious conspiracy while sharing the joys and sorrows of battling a mysterious organization intent on tearing them and the kingdoms apart.', 'When the Three Kingdoms are ravaged by demons and monsters, four heroes with little in common must unite to fight the realm’s most vicious enemies. Together the heroes unveil an insidious conspiracy while sharing the joys and sorrows of battling a mysterious organization intent on tearing them and the kingdoms apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2s8yKCqFk6CSGWznH99FP4wIVy3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130206'),
  ('83545814108446787', 'Fantasmagorias', 2017, 'Animation', null, null, null, null, 'Using the most advanced animation techniques, by blending traditional 2-D and computer animation, this collection of animated short films brings to life some of Latin America''s most hair-raising supernatural legends that were passed down from generation to generation through word of mouth, making them an important addition to the horror genre.', 'Using the most advanced animation techniques, by blending traditional 2-D and computer animation, this collection of animated short films brings to life some of Latin America''s most hair-raising supernatural legends that were passed down from generation to generation through word of mouth, making them an important addition to the horror genre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ts6L8FGYuu9HB8UN8En0cl9ID9F.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:85658'),
  ('418482761442971659', 'Fantasmas', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Julio Torres', null, 'Julio Torres, Martine Gutierrez, Tómas Matos, Joe Rumrill', 'TV-MA', 'Julio Torres spins a fantastical tale of when he lost a gold oyster earring. In his search to find the precious object, Julio reflects on the offbeat characters he encounters in introspective, often eerie, and always comedic vignettes set in a dreamy, alternate version of New York City.', 'Julio Torres spins a fantastical tale of when he lost a gold oyster earring. In his search to find the precious object, Julio reflects on the offbeat characters he encounters in introspective, often eerie, and always comedic vignettes set in a dreamy, alternate version of New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aGkoKJLA0URkJHU7XDXB58C02G.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:253254'),
  ('253307315830993341', 'Fantastic', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Lee Sung Eun', 'Kim Dong-gyun, Kim Hyun-joo, Ju Sang-uk, Park Si-yeon, Kim Tae-hun, Kim Ji-soo, Jo Jae-yun, Kim Young-min', 'TV-MA', 'It tells the story of a successful drama writer whose life turns upside down after she discovers that she has a terminal illness and a famous actor who can''t act.', 'It tells the story of a successful drama writer whose life turns upside down after she discovers that she has a terminal illness and a famous actor who can''t act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pRruFYxTtywm1J5u7SOTwPs3omN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67273'),
  ('582378925723910996', 'Fantastic Four', 1994, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Beau Weaver, Lori Alan, Chuck McCann, Quinton Flynn', 'TV-Y7', 'When Reed Richards, Sue and Johnny Storm and pilot Ben Grimm take a premature space flight on a new shuttle, they find themselves massively bombarded with cosmic radiation. Barely managing to re-enter and land safely, the quartet find themselves forever transformed with superpowers. Deciding to use these new powers to help people, they form the Fantastic Four, a superhero team dedicated to the protection of Earth from menaces like the Latverian King Dr. Doom and Galactus, the planet consumer.', 'When Reed Richards, Sue and Johnny Storm and pilot Ben Grimm take a premature space flight on a new shuttle, they find themselves massively bombarded with cosmic radiation. Barely managing to re-enter and land safely, the quartet find themselves forever transformed with superpowers. Deciding to use these new powers to help people, they form the Fantastic Four, a superhero team dedicated to the protection of Earth from menaces like the Latverian King Dr. Doom and Galactus, the planet consumer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPVGruDYZtImosRkNv7eZhqxT1p.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2901'),
  ('811877991198868850', 'Fantastic Four: World''s Greatest Heroes', 2006, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Craig Kyle, Christopher L. Yost', null, 'Hiro Kanagawa, Lara Gilchrist, Christopher Jacot, Brian Dobson', 'TV-Y7', 'Mr. Fantastic, the Invisible Woman, the Human Torch, and the Thing battle some of their greatest foes, including Doctor Doom, Ronan the Accuser, the Multiple Man, and Mole Man.', 'Mr. Fantastic, the Invisible Woman, the Human Torch, and the Thing battle some of their greatest foes, including Doctor Doom, Ronan the Accuser, the Multiple Man, and Mole Man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCtCW0JlbMpzfQDAX1bO1o1KLi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132'),
  ('587122880798714071', 'Fantastic Max', 1988, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Mike Young', null, 'Ben Ryan Ganger, Nancy Cartwright, Gregg Berger, Elisabeth Harnois, Benji Gregory, Paul Eiding, Gail Matthius, Don Messick', 'TV-G', 'A diaper-wearing toddler with a mohawk named Maxwell "Fantastic Max" Young has adventures in outer space with two of his toys: FX, a pull string alien doll from a planet called Twinkle-Twinkle, and A.B. Sitter, a C-3PO-like android made of blocks.', 'A diaper-wearing toddler with a mohawk named Maxwell "Fantastic Max" Young has adventures in outer space with two of his toys: FX, a pull string alien doll from a planet called Twinkle-Twinkle, and A.B. Sitter, a C-3PO-like android made of blocks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1uLJEISERP3RdvH5fg77Kzkfbf4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:12298'),
  ('934945525586012953', 'Fantasy Hotel', 2005, null, null, null, 'Michael Tao Tai-Yu, Melissa Ng Mei-Heng, Wayne Lai Yiu-Cheung, Woo Fung, Angela Tong Ying-Ying, Michael Tong Man-Lung, Ben Wong Chi-Yin, Suet Nei', null, 'Fantasy Hotel is a TVB modern drama series broadcast in July 2005. There are three tour guides, Kam Ji-Kit (Michael Tao), Yung Ka-Man (Melissa Ng), and Hon Shan (Wayne Lai) lead tours from mainland China. One day, unexpectedly, a friend Kam Kong-Hoi (Wu Fung), gives them his hotel to take care of. Suddenly, the three are bosses and need to improve the hotel for the sake of their friend. Along the way, Ka-Man develops feelings for Ji-Kit, but because of a misunderstanding, she tries to stop her growing feelings for him. When Ji-Kit eventually finds out how Ka-Man feels towards him, he tries to court her but Ka-Man is too afraid of getting hurt.', 'Fantasy Hotel is a TVB modern drama series broadcast in July 2005. There are three tour guides, Kam Ji-Kit (Michael Tao), Yung Ka-Man (Melissa Ng), and Hon Shan (Wayne Lai) lead tours from mainland China. One day, unexpectedly, a friend Kam Kong-Hoi (Wu Fung), gives them his hotel to take care of. Suddenly, the three are bosses and need to improve the hotel for the sake of their friend. Along the way, Ka-Man develops feelings for Ji-Kit, but because of a misunderstanding, she tries to stop her growing feelings for him. When Ji-Kit eventually finds out how Ka-Man feels towards him, he tries to court her but Ka-Man is too afraid of getting hurt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0jXSmMtx5Y3Ojmw5LJb57Khker.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109347'),
  ('125136822861918808', 'Fantasy Island', 1978, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Gene Levitt', null, 'Ricardo Montalban, Christopher Hewett', 'TV-14', 'A magical island hosted by Mr Roarke and Tattoo where weekly guests learn valuable life lessons in their pursuit of fulfilling their dreams. Not all dreams are fulfilled as expected.', 'A magical island hosted by Mr Roarke and Tattoo where weekly guests learn valuable life lessons in their pursuit of fulfilling their dreams. Not all dreams are fulfilled as expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ppxhytiPrgojE4eb6Tw0EonDzeP.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:39775'),
  ('65903560100137392', 'Fantasy Island', 1998, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Gene Levitt', null, 'Malcolm McDowell, Mädchen Amick, Edward Hibbert, Fyvush Finkel, Louis Lombardi, Sylvia Sidney', null, 'Mr. Roarke and his three assistants run a tropical paradise where guests come in to have their wildest dreams and fantasies come true.', 'Mr. Roarke and his three assistants run a tropical paradise where guests come in to have their wildest dreams and fantasies come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6KqXJr6J2bDBCwvMkRpsZxKYQiB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:180'),
  ('212636891913542465', 'Fantasy Island', 2021, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Gene Levitt', null, 'Roselyn Sánchez, Kiara Barnes, John Gabriel Rodriquez, Devika Bhise', 'TV-14', 'This contemporary version of the classic drama series delves into the “what if” questions that keep us awake at night. Each episode tells emotional, provocative stories about people who walk in with a desire, but end up reborn to themselves through the magical realism of Fantasy Island.', 'This contemporary version of the classic drama series delves into the “what if” questions that keep us awake at night. Each episode tells emotional, provocative stories about people who walk in with a desire, but end up reborn to themselves through the magical realism of Fantasy Island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bl6qV6nO0Cd4N9boVJo08pJUoB2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:125116'),
  ('80154865593991087', 'Fanzone', 2026, 'Talk, Comedy', null, 'Sergi Pi, Pepe Tienda', 'Gerard Romero', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tyWx28AqCCKzZAQ3XywLTsbvltB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:297128'),
  ('422262477724987944', 'Far Away', 2024, 'Drama, Family, Action & Adventure', 'Gülizar Irmak', 'Gülizar Irmak', 'Ozan Akbaba, Sinem Ünsal, Gonca Cilasun, Müfit Kayacan, Alper Çankaya, Ferit Kaya, Atakan Özkaya, Sahra Şaş', null, 'Alya Albora arrives in Mardin with her late husband’s funeral and their five-year-old son to fulfill her husband’s last will. However, this arrival marks a point of no return, and there is no way out of Albora. The head of the Albora tribe, Cihan Albora, is not indifferent to Alya’s struggles, but he refuses to let her take her child and leave. Confronting the darkness of the past, hidden secrets, and the harsh realities of the region, Alya Albora finds herself caught in a fierce struggle with her late husband’s family.', 'Alya Albora arrives in Mardin with her late husband’s funeral and their five-year-old son to fulfill her husband’s last will. However, this arrival marks a point of no return, and there is no way out of Albora. The head of the Albora tribe, Cihan Albora, is not indifferent to Alya’s struggles, but he refuses to let her take her child and leave. Confronting the darkness of the past, hidden secrets, and the harsh realities of the region, Alya Albora finds herself caught in a fierce struggle with her late husband’s family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPvxzUFy4CYEAThOQim8wuyCqHt.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:274556'),
  ('328412830731558566', 'Far from Home', 2022, 'Drama', 'Chinaza Onuzo, Dami Elebe', null, 'Funke Akindele, Richard Mofe-Damijo, Mike Afolarin, Elma Mbadiwe, Gbubemi Ejeye', 'TV-MA', 'Through a scholarship to a top school, Ishaya ends up in the luxurious world of the happy few in Nigeria, but a secret threatens not only to put an end to this.', 'Through a scholarship to a top school, Ishaya ends up in the luxurious world of the happy few in Nigeria, but a secret threatens not only to put an end to this.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svGLFlbjDKx67CVUEFtPGooW25F.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215874'),
  ('125748600942441439', 'Far from Las Vegas', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Casper Christensen, Frank Hvam', 'Lars Kjeldgård, Thomas Hartmann, Jacob Tingleff', 'Casper Christensen, Frank Hvam, Iben Hjejle, Lars Hjortshøj, Sofie Stougaard, Klaus Bondam, Sussi La Cour', null, 'Langt fra Las Vegas is a Danish sit-com, which was first aired on the Danish TV channel TV2 Zulu. It revolved around life at a newly started TV morning show, Jump Start, and focused on the life of the main character, Casper. Langt fra Las Vegas consisted of 53 episodes, aired over 5 seasons with each episode lasting 25 minutes. It ran from 2001-2003.', 'Langt fra Las Vegas is a Danish sit-com, which was first aired on the Danish TV channel TV2 Zulu. It revolved around life at a newly started TV morning show, Jump Start, and focused on the life of the main character, Casper. Langt fra Las Vegas consisted of 53 episodes, aired over 5 seasons with each episode lasting 25 minutes. It ran from 2001-2003.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bCuC3kb0lDz807OHbnKR6nba5UB.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1633'),
  ('1040003515877764016', 'Far North', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'David White', 'Michael White, David White', 'Robyn Malcolm, Temuera Morrison, Villa Junior Lemanu, Maaka Pohatu, John Paul Foliaki, Albert Mateni', null, 'The (mostly) true story of how the most comically inept gang to ever join forces got half a billion dollars'' worth of meth to New Zealand shores - and nearly to market. And they would have got away with it too, if it wasn''t for a pesky 70-year-old Māori diesel mechanic and his aqua-aerobics instructing wife!', 'The (mostly) true story of how the most comically inept gang to ever join forces got half a billion dollars'' worth of meth to New Zealand shores - and nearly to market. And they would have got away with it too, if it wasn''t for a pesky 70-year-old Māori diesel mechanic and his aqua-aerobics instructing wife!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovPLLeF79NfPwfoULfwkbM9GMzh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:232319'),
  ('967605858007168395', 'Farang', 2017, 'Drama, Crime', 'Stefan Thunberg, Malin Lind Lagerlöf', null, 'Ola Rapace, Louise Nyvall', null, 'Former criminal Rickard has vanished. Fleeing Sweden and the old friends he has testified against, he abandons his name, his life, and his family to start over in Thailand. Ten years later and still with a price on his head, Rickard knows that a return home would be a death sentence. And so he ekes out his existence as a small-time crook in the back alleys of Phuket. Life’s tough and dirty, but at least it won’t kill him.', 'Former criminal Rickard has vanished. Fleeing Sweden and the old friends he has testified against, he abandons his name, his life, and his family to start over in Thailand. Ten years later and still with a price on his head, Rickard knows that a return home would be a death sentence. And so he ekes out his existence as a small-time crook in the back alleys of Phuket. Life’s tough and dirty, but at least it won’t kill him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AiPVdYTnBV7GMR9pspzBQAuPuRh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70769'),
  ('237206777177211873', 'Faraway Downs', 2023, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Western', null, null, 'Nicole Kidman, Hugh Jackman, David Wenham, Bryan Brown, Jack Thompson, David Gulpilil, Brandon Walters, David Ngoombujarra', 'TV-14', 'The story of an English aristocrat, Lady Sarah Ashley, who inherits a large cattle ranch in Australia after her husband dies. When Australian cattle barons plot to take her land, she joins forces with a cattle drover to protect her ranch.', 'The story of an English aristocrat, Lady Sarah Ashley, who inherits a large cattle ranch in Australia after her husband dies. When Australian cattle barons plot to take her land, she joins forces with a cattle drover to protect her ranch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pk26xg01tf6UiVUO04Az428Ihip.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204999'),
  ('274188724238192239', 'Fargo', 2014, 'Crime, Drama', 'Noah Hawley', null, 'Juno Temple, Jennifer Jason Leigh, David Rysdahl, Joe Keery, Lamorne Morris, Richa Shukla Moorjani, Sam Spruell, Sienna King', 'TV-MA', 'A close-knit anthology series dealing with stories involving malice, violence and murder based in and around Minnesota.', 'A close-knit anthology series dealing with stories involving malice, violence and murder based in and around Minnesota.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6U9CPeD8obHzweikFhiLhpc7YBT.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:60622'),
  ('1126009658536614245', 'Farmacia de guardia', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Antonio Mercero', null, 'Concha Cuetos, Carlos Larrañaga, Julián González, Miguel Ángel Garzón, Pepe Soriano, Emma Ozores, Cesáreo Estébanez, María Garralón', null, 'A pharmacist attends to her colorful neighbors with the help — or distraction — of her eccentric assistants, restless children and flirty ex-husband.', 'A pharmacist attends to her colorful neighbors with the help — or distraction — of her eccentric assistants, restless children and flirty ex-husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9eq3NflCfH96omBwajeuTaiHdIY.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:70217'),
  ('268139952259907414', 'Farmagia', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Takuya Sato, Ayane Sakura, Inori Minase, Hiro Shimono, Yuki Ishikari, Reiou Tsuchida, Kohei Amasaki, Hiromichi Tezuka', null, 'In Felicidad, farmers known as the Farmagia raise monsters under the peaceful rule of the Magus Diluculum. After the Magus passes, a power struggle erupts among forces using monsters to seize control. In the town of Centvelt, Farmagia Ten and his friends band together against the despotic new ruler, Glaza. Ten, his friends, and their home-grown monsters must stay strong to defend their freedom.', 'In Felicidad, farmers known as the Farmagia raise monsters under the peaceful rule of the Magus Diluculum. After the Magus passes, a power struggle erupts among forces using monsters to seize control. In the town of Centvelt, Farmagia Ten and his friends band together against the despotic new ruler, Glaza. Ten, his friends, and their home-grown monsters must stay strong to defend their freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iSIwGUp5E1T4nCEHu5qi11kVpxd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:257609'),
