  ('643784313643721864', 'Farzi', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Raj Nidimoru, Krishna D.K.', 'Krishna D.K., Sita Menon, Raj Nidimoru', 'Shahid Kapoor, Vijay Sethupathi, Kay Kay Menon, Bhuvan Arora, Raashii Khanna, Chittaranjan Giri, Amol Palekar, Zakir Hussain', 'TV-MA', 'Sunny, a brilliant small-time artist is catapulted into the high-stakes world of counterfeiting when he creates the perfect fake currency note, even as Michael, a fiery, unorthodox task force officer wants to rid the country of the counterfeiting menace. In this thrilling cat-and-mouse race, losing is not an option!', 'Sunny, a brilliant small-time artist is catapulted into the high-stakes world of counterfeiting when he creates the perfect fake currency note, even as Michael, a fiery, unorthodox task force officer wants to rid the country of the counterfeiting menace. In this thrilling cat-and-mouse race, losing is not an option!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cTS86RwEBIDgCgUmjWQTSoPsK6p.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:132117'),
