  ('848567168801042671', 'Fast & Furious Spy Racers', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids, Family', null, null, 'Tyler Posey, Camille Ramsey, Luke Youngblood, Jorge Diaz, Renée Elise Goldsberry, Charlet Chung, India de Beaufort', 'TV-Y7', 'A government agency recruits teen driver Tony Toretto and his thrill-seeking friends to infiltrate a criminal street racing circuit as undercover spies.', 'A government agency recruits teen driver Tony Toretto and his thrill-seeking friends to infiltrate a criminal street racing circuit as undercover spies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cI7zYWuYTmKEdXITcUKPzjc2EW5.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:95594'),
  ('325792674070384542', 'Fast Layne', 2019, 'Comedy, Family, Action & Adventure', 'Travis Braun', null, 'Sophie Pollono, Sofia Rosinsky, Brandon Rossel, Winslow Fegley, Enid-Raye Adams, Nate Torrence, David Milchard', 'TV-G', 'Twelve-year-old overachiever Layne finds her orderly life thrown into a tailspin when she discovers a sophisticated talking car named “V.I.N.” hidden in an abandoned shed. With the help of her eccentric neighbor Zora, Layne embarks on a high-speed adventure filled with bad guys, secret agents and other surprises to unlock the mystery behind V.I.N.’s creation.', 'Twelve-year-old overachiever Layne finds her orderly life thrown into a tailspin when she discovers a sophisticated talking car named “V.I.N.” hidden in an abandoned shed. With the help of her eccentric neighbor Zora, Layne embarks on a high-speed adventure filled with bad guys, secret agents and other surprises to unlock the mystery behind V.I.N.’s creation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNPgNu3xMMLbzXdg8N9SgKwwykF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81918'),
  ('98344903825614914', 'Fast N'' Loud', 2012, 'Reality', null, null, 'Richard Rawlings', 'TV-14', 'Motor mastermind Richard Rawlings and mechanical prodigy Aaron Kaufman search for forgotten and neglected vintage cars. They need big projects and big profits to keep the doors open at Gas Monkey Garage in Dallas, TX.', 'Motor mastermind Richard Rawlings and mechanical prodigy Aaron Kaufman search for forgotten and neglected vintage cars. They need big projects and big profits to keep the doors open at Gas Monkey Garage in Dallas, TX.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/976AyeDT1isz2uAnYuQrjRkS05D.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:46874'),
  ('665023499684482224', 'Faster Than Fear', 2021, 'Crime', 'Klaus Arriens, Thomas Wilke', null, 'Friederike Becht, Felix Klare, Christoph Letkowski, Golo Euler, Thomas Loibl, Stephanie Japp, Carina Wiese, Samir Fuchs', null, 'After being raped, young police detective Sunny Becker returns to work and tries to catch the fugitive killer André Haffner before he strikes again. In a race against time, the biggest thing holding Sunny back are her own demons.', 'After being raped, young police detective Sunny Becker returns to work and tries to catch the fugitive killer André Haffner before he strikes again. In a race against time, the biggest thing holding Sunny back are her own demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gzGZonGExDIOAcY0luVkFiMTkQV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:154456'),
  ('306343273417666613', 'Fastest Car', 2018, 'Reality, Action & Adventure', 'Scott Weintrob', null, null, null, 'The drivers of exotic supercars put their street cred on the line against deceptively fast sleeper cars built and modified by true gearheads.', 'The drivers of exotic supercars put their street cred on the line against deceptively fast sleeper cars built and modified by true gearheads.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6nDW5jb7G1TN4S7zviZDvhbyx0f.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:78412'),
  ('761535543521501025', 'Fastlane', 2002, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Comedy, Drama', 'McG, John McNamara', null, 'Peter Facinelli, Bill Bellamy, Tiffani-Amber Thiessen', 'TV-14', 'Fastlane is an American action/crime drama series that was broadcast on Fox from September 18, 2002 to April 25, 2003.', 'Fastlane is an American action/crime drama series that was broadcast on Fox from September 18, 2002 to April 25, 2003.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ifuFAUqRrD8AwfQYy3yprqtzgf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2142'),
  ('462780840953762144', 'Fat Albert and the Cosby Kids', 1972, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Bill Cosby, Ken Mundie', null, 'Bill Cosby, Bill Cosby, Erika Scheimer, Lou Scheimer, Eric Suter, Jan Crawford, Bill Cosby, Jan Crawford', 'TV-PG', 'Fat Albert and the Cosby Kids is an animated series created, produced, and hosted by comedian Bill Cosby, who also lent his voice to a number of characters, including Fat Albert himself. Filmation was the production company for the series. The show premiered in 1972 and ran until 1985. The show, based on Cosby''s remembrances of his childhood gang, centered on Albert, and his friends. The show always had an educational lesson emphasized by Cosby''s live-action segments, and in early episodes the gang would usually gather in their North Philadelphia junkyard to play a rock song on their cobbled-together instruments at the end of the show.', 'Fat Albert and the Cosby Kids is an animated series created, produced, and hosted by comedian Bill Cosby, who also lent his voice to a number of characters, including Fat Albert himself. Filmation was the production company for the series. The show premiered in 1972 and ran until 1985. The show, based on Cosby''s remembrances of his childhood gang, centered on Albert, and his friends. The show always had an educational lesson emphasized by Cosby''s live-action segments, and in early episodes the gang would usually gather in their North Philadelphia junkyard to play a rock song on their cobbled-together instruments at the end of the show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owANftMFzlTuYV0prpVuX21r241.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:13914'),
  ('1050884767054514633', 'Fatal Attraction', 2023, 'Drama', 'Alexandra Cunningham', 'James Dearden', 'Lizzy Caplan, Joshua Jackson, Amanda Peet, Alyssa Jirrels, Toby Huss, Reno Wilson, Brian Goodman', 'TV-MA', 'An affair threatens the lives of Dan Gallagher and his wife, Beth, in this deep-dive reimagining of the classic psychosexual thriller which explores fatal attraction and the timeless themes of marriage and infidelity through the lens of modern attitudes toward strong women, personality disorders and coercive control.', 'An affair threatens the lives of Dan Gallagher and his wife, Beth, in this deep-dive reimagining of the classic psychosexual thriller which explores fatal attraction and the timeless themes of marriage and infidelity through the lens of modern attitudes toward strong women, personality disorders and coercive control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXxY9JQOXFBmedggz2fu5YKjIm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138455'),
  ('67148411880138449', 'Fatal Crossing', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Arne Berggren, Kristine Berg', 'Kristine Berg, Arne Berggren', null, null, 'Nora Sand a journalist working as a foreign correspondent for a Danish newspaper, at the peak of her career she''s accused of having had an affair with one of her sources in a big case. Nora gets suspended, travels home to Denmark.', 'Nora Sand a journalist working as a foreign correspondent for a Danish newspaper, at the peak of her career she''s accused of having had an affair with one of her sources in a big case. Nora gets suspended, travels home to Denmark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnBHMfRu0fYe7sK55A1WFNOSmGr.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:240805'),
  ('729341720874187914', 'Fatal Seduction', 2023, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Steven Pillemer', null, 'Kgomotso Christopher, Nathaniel Ramabulana, Prince Grootboom, Thapelo Mokoena, Ngele Ramulondi, Frances Sholto-Douglas, Thando Thabethe, Lorcia Cooper Khumalo', 'TV-MA', 'A married professor is pulled into a passionate affair with a younger man that uncovers a path of tragedy and betrayal from those closest to her.', 'A married professor is pulled into a passionate affair with a younger man that uncovers a path of tragedy and betrayal from those closest to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qV9DjDIMUu7ieCQTQkEe9R83Ooa.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:227975'),
  ('882509125587769747', 'Fatal Vision', 1984, 'Drama', null, null, 'Karl Malden, Eva Marie Saint, Barry Newman, Gary Cole, Andy Griffith, Gary Grubbs, Joel Polis, Mitchell Ryan', null, 'A retiree spends nine years relentlessly seeking to prove that his son-in-law, a former Green Beret Army doctor, murdered his pregnant wife and two daughters. Based on the Fatal Vision controversy, and the book of the same name, about the murders of the wife and daughters of U.S. Army officer Jeffrey R. MacDonald at Fort Bragg in 1970.', 'A retiree spends nine years relentlessly seeking to prove that his son-in-law, a former Green Beret Army doctor, murdered his pregnant wife and two daughters. Based on the Fatal Vision controversy, and the book of the same name, about the murders of the wife and daughters of U.S. Army officer Jeffrey R. MacDonald at Fort Bragg in 1970.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/onIdEH2sm4L1T04eZxpjjQr33Lo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:29004'),
  ('175185237590614390', 'Fate', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Paco Plaza, Pablo Guerrero, Borja González Santaolalla', null, 'Ricardo Gómez, Óscar Jaenada, Óscar Higares, Carlos Bernardino, Pedro Bachura, Jason Fernández, Óscar Reyes, Almudena Cid', null, 'Taxi driver David becomes the chauffeur for a famous bullfighter known as El Maestro, who is attempting a comeback after years away from the ring. El Maestro''s perspective changes, and he starts seeing David as a good luck charm.', 'Taxi driver David becomes the chauffeur for a famous bullfighter known as El Maestro, who is attempting a comeback after years away from the ring. El Maestro''s perspective changes, and he starts seeing David as a good luck charm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9ibdbWVF0qptcQQN6nqz4NlRhC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:242907'),
  ('695872438424858754', 'Fate: The Winx Saga', 2021, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Brian Young', null, 'Abigail Cowen, Hannah van der Westhuysen, Precious Mustapha, Eliot Salt, Elisha Applebaum, Danny Griffin, Sadie Soverall, Robert James-Collier', 'TV-MA', 'The coming-of-age journey of five fairies attending Alfea, a magical boarding school in the Otherworld where they must learn to master their powers while navigating love, rivalries, and the monsters that threaten their very existence.', 'The coming-of-age journey of five fairies attending Alfea, a magical boarding school in the Otherworld where they must learn to master their powers while navigating love, rivalries, and the monsters that threaten their very existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oHj6guMrLfQcBzo3uxwBJc8Y736.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:97175'),
  ('816490611420358636', 'Fate/Apocrypha', 2017, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Maaya Sakamoto, Natsuki Hanae, Junichi Suwabe, Shunsuke Takeuchi, Ryotaro Okiayu, Rumi Okubo, Mitsuru Miyamoto, Ai Nonaka', 'TV-MA', 'There was once a Holy Grail War waged by Mages and Heroic Spirits in a town of Fuyuki. However, one Mage took advantage of the chaos of World War II to steal a Holy Grail. Several decades have passed, and the Yggdmillennia family, who took upon the Holy Grail as its symbol, defected from the Mages'' Association. Furious, the Association sent forces to deal with the Yggdmillennia, but were defeated. With the Holy Grail system changed, war at an unprecedented scale breaks out.', 'There was once a Holy Grail War waged by Mages and Heroic Spirits in a town of Fuyuki. However, one Mage took advantage of the chaos of World War II to steal a Holy Grail. Several decades have passed, and the Yggdmillennia family, who took upon the Holy Grail as its symbol, defected from the Mages'' Association. Furious, the Association sent forces to deal with the Yggdmillennia, but were defeated. With the Holy Grail system changed, war at an unprecedented scale breaks out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQvABf8fwwHSdYbMk1Ir3NnvcSp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72304'),
  ('1089768920703548827', 'Fate/Extra Last Encore', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Atsushi Abe, Sakura Tange, Hiroshi Kamiya, Noriko Shitaya, Mugihito, Kana Ueda, Urara Takano, Ai Nonaka', null, 'Waking up in a strange virtual world with no recollection of the past, Hakuno finds himself forced to fight for survival in a war he does not understand for a prize beyond value; the opportunity to have one''s wish granted. With only an enigmatic "Servant" by his side, Hakuno Kishinami will have to face both friends and foes in battles to the death in order to not only gain possession of a mysterious object known as the "Holy Grail," but also to find the answer to the most important question of all: "Who am I?"', 'Waking up in a strange virtual world with no recollection of the past, Hakuno finds himself forced to fight for survival in a war he does not understand for a prize beyond value; the opportunity to have one''s wish granted. With only an enigmatic "Servant" by his side, Hakuno Kishinami will have to face both friends and foes in battles to the death in order to not only gain possession of a mysterious object known as the "Holy Grail," but also to find the answer to the most important question of all: "Who am I?"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5qveZHKo8RatUbZDzgGG9QEj558.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76123'),
  ('58319473153019504', 'Fate/Grand Order Absolute Demonic Front: Babylonia', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Rie Takahashi, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Tetsu Inada, Ayako Kawasumi, Yu Kobayashi, Shin-ichiro Miki, Tomokazu Seki, Maaya Sakamoto', null, 'Following the success in the Camelot Singularity, Ritsuka Fujimaru and Mash Kyrielight are assigned to the last Singularity in the Grand Order initiative. In Ancient Babylonia, 2500 BCE, they embark on a mission to secure humanity''s survival. Upon arrival, they learn that three gods have threatened Uruk, the Babylonian city ruled by King Gilgamesh. Ritsuka and Mash must work together to fend off the invasion of mysterious beasts in Uruk under Gilgamesh''s orders while investigating the true nature of the three gods'' actions against humanity; but unknown to Ritsuka, an ancient entity is slowly rising from its slumber.', 'Following the success in the Camelot Singularity, Ritsuka Fujimaru and Mash Kyrielight are assigned to the last Singularity in the Grand Order initiative. In Ancient Babylonia, 2500 BCE, they embark on a mission to secure humanity''s survival. Upon arrival, they learn that three gods have threatened Uruk, the Babylonian city ruled by King Gilgamesh. Ritsuka and Mash must work together to fend off the invasion of mysterious beasts in Uruk under Gilgamesh''s orders while investigating the true nature of the three gods'' actions against humanity; but unknown to Ritsuka, an ancient entity is slowly rising from its slumber.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pVVANmkpHBwDPRwn4ymprF56Yjr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90677'),
  ('339070574948137116', 'Fate/kaleid liner Prisma Illya', 2013, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Shizuka Itoh, Naoko Takano, Kaori Nazuka, Mai Kadowaki, Noriaki Sugiyama, Kana Ueda, Miyu Matsuki', null, 'Illyasviel von Einzbern is an ordinary elementary school student who becomes a magical girl when the magical Kaleidostick Ruby deems her a more suitable master than the sorceress, Rin Tohsaka. Rin, who had been tasked by the wizard Zelretch to collect the seven Class Cards containing the spirits of Heroic Spirits from legend, finds that she is unable to change Ruby''s mind and must supervise Illya in completing the task of collecting the Class Cards. During Illya''s adventures, she receives a friend and rival in a girl named Miyu, the contracted master of the Kaleidostick Sapphire, which similarly abandoned its original master and Rin''s rival, Luvia Edelfelt.', 'Illyasviel von Einzbern is an ordinary elementary school student who becomes a magical girl when the magical Kaleidostick Ruby deems her a more suitable master than the sorceress, Rin Tohsaka. Rin, who had been tasked by the wizard Zelretch to collect the seven Class Cards containing the spirits of Heroic Spirits from legend, finds that she is unable to change Ruby''s mind and must supervise Illya in completing the task of collecting the Class Cards. During Illya''s adventures, she receives a friend and rival in a girl named Miyu, the contracted master of the Kaleidostick Sapphire, which similarly abandoned its original master and Rin''s rival, Luvia Edelfelt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fivwHxH3xddSkSyqonXtuydBpIY.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:63576'),
  ('1065693689309259876', 'Fate/stay night', 2006, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Noriaki Sugiyama, Ayako Kawasumi, Kana Ueda', 'TV-14', 'Shirou Emiya lost his parents in a fire when he was young and was later adopted by the sorcerer Kiritsugu Emiya. Shirou is drawn into the Holy Grail War summons a female "Servant" known as Saber to protect him and obtain the Holy Grail.', 'Shirou Emiya lost his parents in a fire when he was young and was later adopted by the sorcerer Kiritsugu Emiya. Shirou is drawn into the Holy Grail War summons a female "Servant" known as Saber to protect him and obtain the Holy Grail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7nYPOveHhINREhTtwBHot9ersB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37858'),
  ('791700827043611722', 'Fate/stay night [Unlimited Blade Works]', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Noriaki Sugiyama, Kana Ueda, Junichi Suwabe, Ayako Kawasumi', 'TV-14', 'This story focuses primarily on the heroine Rin Tohsaka. After her father’s death, Rin enters the Holy Grail War as the sole heir to the prestigious Tohsaka Household, with her servant Archer. But, she soon finds out that Shirou Emiya, a boy from her high school has gotten himself involved in the battles and unexpectedly saves him when he is fatally injured. Before long, Rin sets out to strike down the conspiracies surrounding the Holy Grail War along with Shirou and his summoned servant Saber. And so, the story begins to explore the truth behind Shirou’s powers and the nature behind his unyielding will to become a “hero.” © TYPE-MOON, ufotable, FSNPC', 'This story focuses primarily on the heroine Rin Tohsaka. After her father’s death, Rin enters the Holy Grail War as the sole heir to the prestigious Tohsaka Household, with her servant Archer. But, she soon finds out that Shirou Emiya, a boy from her high school has gotten himself involved in the battles and unexpectedly saves him when he is fatally injured. Before long, Rin sets out to strike down the conspiracies surrounding the Holy Grail War along with Shirou and his summoned servant Saber. And so, the story begins to explore the truth behind Shirou’s powers and the nature behind his unyielding will to become a “hero.” © TYPE-MOON, ufotable, FSNPC', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jyqi5BkDoKKIA2WAoz3HBtRHld3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61415'),
  ('252113771317339921', 'Fate/strange Fake', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Atsuhiro Iwakami, Takashi Takeuchi, Maki Sato', null, 'Kana Hanazawa, Yuki Ono, Wataru Hatano, Showtaro Morikubo, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Lynn, Maaya Uchida, Junya Enoki', 'TV-14', 'In a Holy Grail War, Mages (Masters) and their Heroic Spirits (Servants) fight for the control of the Holy Grail—an omnipotent wish-granting device said to fulfill any desire. Years have passed since the end of the Fifth Holy Grail War in Japan. Now, signs portend the emergence of a new Holy Grail in the western American city of Snowfield. Sure enough, Masters and Servants begin to gather... A missing Servant class... Impossible Servant summonings... A nation shrouded in secrecy... And a city created as a battleground. In the face of such irregularities, the Holy Grail War is twisted and driven into the depth of madness. Let the curtain rise on a masquerade of humans and heroes, made to dance upon the stage of a false Holy Grail.', 'In a Holy Grail War, Mages (Masters) and their Heroic Spirits (Servants) fight for the control of the Holy Grail—an omnipotent wish-granting device said to fulfill any desire. Years have passed since the end of the Fifth Holy Grail War in Japan. Now, signs portend the emergence of a new Holy Grail in the western American city of Snowfield. Sure enough, Masters and Servants begin to gather... A missing Servant class... Impossible Servant summonings... A nation shrouded in secrecy... And a city created as a battleground. In the face of such irregularities, the Holy Grail War is twisted and driven into the depth of madness. Let the curtain rise on a masquerade of humans and heroes, made to dance upon the stage of a false Holy Grail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2r5MEaLYl5lZxzgfSmrDybipngl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:229858'),
  ('302619559056894072', 'Fate/Zero', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Gen Urobuchi', null, 'Rikiya Koyama, Ayako Kawasumi, Akio Otsuka, Akira Ishida, Ayumi Tsunematsu, Daisuke Namikawa, Hikaru Midorikawa, Jouji Nakata', 'TV-MA', 'The Fourth Holy Grail War has begun, and seven mages must summon heroes from history to battle each other to the death. Only one mage-and-hero pair will remain to claim the Grail and have their wishes granted! Kiritsugu Emiya was once an assassin but now fights in this war to save the world from those who would destroy it with the Grail’s power.', 'The Fourth Holy Grail War has begun, and seven mages must summon heroes from history to battle each other to the death. Only one mage-and-hero pair will remain to claim the Grail and have their wishes granted! Kiritsugu Emiya was once an assassin but now fights in this war to save the world from those who would destroy it with the Grail’s power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/chUbHBiMX7buj8TzOEIjHHPCJfF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:45845'),
  ('410481763791512331', 'Fated Hearts', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Xiao Yi', null, 'Li Qin, Chen Zheyuan, Xia Meng, Chen Heyi, Zuo Ye, Qin Tianyu, Wang Ziteng, Tian Guangyu', null, 'After losing her memory in battle, skilled archer Fu Yixiao is taken in by a noble family and unexpectedly reunited with her former enemy, Prince Feng Suige—the man she once struck with an arrow. As they face the dangers of Yujing together, trust replaces suspicion and a deep bond begins to form. Caught in a web of past betrayals and political intrigue, the two must confront their shared history while fighting for survival, freedom, and each other.', 'After losing her memory in battle, skilled archer Fu Yixiao is taken in by a noble family and unexpectedly reunited with her former enemy, Prince Feng Suige—the man she once struck with an arrow. As they face the dangers of Yujing together, trust replaces suspicion and a deep bond begins to form. Caught in a web of past betrayals and political intrigue, the two must confront their shared history while fighting for survival, freedom, and each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9yKpGzf83t02GRWYRmyLj2VXy96.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:272484'),
  ('497344637356527637', 'Fated to Love You', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Joe Chen, Ethan Juan, Baron Chen, Bianca Bai, Lin Mei-shiu, Tan Ai-chen, Chung Hsin-ling, Chen Wei-min', 'TV-G', 'A timid legal assistant and a wealthy heir accidentally spend the night together on a cruise after mistaking each other for their partners. Their unexpected encounter leads to scandal and complications when it''s used as leverage in a corporate blackmail scheme.', 'A timid legal assistant and a wealthy heir accidentally spend the night together on a cruise after mistaking each other for their partners. Their unexpected encounter leads to scandal and complications when it''s used as leverage in a corporate blackmail scheme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7iKvdw98pIFSPetDwuN0NspyUd0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:7173'),
  ('756022917426509869', 'Fated to Love You', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Jo Jin-kuk', 'Jang Hyuk, Jang Na-ra, Choi Jin-hyuk, Wang Ji-won, Park Won-sook, Choi Dae-chul, Choi Woo-shik, Na Young-hee', 'NR', 'A wealthy business heir marries an ordinary office worker after they have a one-night stand that leads to her unexpectedly becoming pregnant.', 'A wealthy business heir marries an ordinary office worker after they have a one-night stand that leads to her unexpectedly becoming pregnant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5JqmQ3EbQ6B3tQoMx1SFIbbhVuJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61192'),
  ('854324790033866367', 'Fateful Dawn', 2026, null, 'Miguel Sousa Tavares', 'Diogo S. Figueira, Isabel Pestana, Filipa Sousa', 'Rafael Morais, Victoria Guerra, Gonçalo Waddington, Iris Cayatte, José Pimentão, Adriano Carvalho, José Medeiros, Sandra Faleiro', null, 'Filipe, a municipal architect known for his idealism and commitment to environmental causes, is the only person who can stop the construction of a luxury real estate development in a protected area. Maria Rodrigues, a young prosecutor, is pursuing a lead in a high-level financial corruption case. At the same time, the reopening of a closed case, in which she was the victim, forces her to confront the deep and painful trauma of a night that took place 15 years before. As she takes the investigation into her own hands, she struggles with the hazy memories of the rape and hit-and-run. Filipe is one of the main suspects, but was it really him?', 'Filipe, a municipal architect known for his idealism and commitment to environmental causes, is the only person who can stop the construction of a luxury real estate development in a protected area. Maria Rodrigues, a young prosecutor, is pursuing a lead in a high-level financial corruption case. At the same time, the reopening of a closed case, in which she was the victim, forces her to confront the deep and painful trauma of a night that took place 15 years before. As she takes the investigation into her own hands, she struggles with the hazy memories of the rape and hit-and-run. Filipe is one of the main suspects, but was it really him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6IQTvrIzG0LZbi9GEKAn6Su4JC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:126918'),
  ('887103137157563328', 'Father Brown', 2013, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Tahsin Guner, Rachel Flowerday', null, 'Mark Williams, John Burton, Tom Chambers, Claudie Blakley, Ruby-May Martinwood', 'TV-PG', 'Father Brown is based on G. K. Chesterton''s detective stories about a Catholic priest who doubles as an amateur detective in order to try and solve mysteries.', 'Father Brown is based on G. K. Chesterton''s detective stories about a Catholic priest who doubles as an amateur detective in order to try and solve mysteries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u8LUC3O1hiEDKP2SFZK68iYqMzl.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:61511'),
  ('1006855277104543431', 'Father Dowling Mysteries', 1989, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Dean Hargrove, Joel Steiger', null, 'Tom Bosley, Tracy Nelson, James Stephens, Mary Wickes', null, 'Father Dowling is a sleuthing parish priest from Chicago who investigates baffling crimes', 'Father Dowling is a sleuthing parish priest from Chicago who investigates baffling crimes', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2i5jIo5pt0bdjZh2CbJk2YpWP0M.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1270'),
  ('657639297988651012', 'Father Knows Best', 1954, 'Comedy, Family', 'Ed James', null, 'Robert Young, Jane Wyatt, Elinor Donahue, Billy Gray, Lauren Chapin', 'TV-G', 'Family man Jim Anderson copes with the everyday problems among his wife Margaret and their three children as they experience day-to-day changes.', 'Family man Jim Anderson copes with the everyday problems among his wife Margaret and their three children as they experience day-to-day changes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5uvDdhz7Fq2OceIbmmOVpk2cSwx.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:10118'),
  ('1113830925490385849', 'Father Matteo', 2000, 'Drama, Comedy, Mystery, Crime, Family', 'Enrico Oldoini', null, 'Terence Hill, Nino Frassica, Nathalie Guetta, Francesco Scali', 'TV-PG', 'Don Matteo is a thoroughly ordinary Catholic priest with an extraordinary ability to read people and solve crimes. He’s a parish priest who never met an unjustly accused person he didn’t want to help.', 'Don Matteo is a thoroughly ordinary Catholic priest with an extraordinary ability to read people and solve crimes. He’s a parish priest who never met an unjustly accused person he didn’t want to help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eh5ldhghLRmwkkWyuJZDXJiptcP.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:21220'),
  ('821377815838752447', 'Father of the Pride', 2004, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jeffrey Katzenberg, Jonathan Groff', 'David R. Goodman, Jean Yu, Jon Ross', 'Danielle Harris, Carl Reiner, Orlando Jones, Cheryl Hines, John Goodman, David Herman, Julian Holloway, Don Stark', 'TV-14', 'Father of the Pride is an American animated television series that began broadcasting on NBC on August 31, 2004 and was part of a short-lived trend of CGI series in prime-time network TV. The show, which was produced by Jeffrey Katzenberg and his company DreamWorks Animation, revolves around a family of white lions, the patriarch of which stars in a Siegfried & Roy show in Las Vegas. Despite heavy promotion, the show was unsuccessful and was canceled after one season. Transmission and production were also delayed by the real-life on-stage injury of Roy Horn.', 'Father of the Pride is an American animated television series that began broadcasting on NBC on August 31, 2004 and was part of a short-lived trend of CGI series in prime-time network TV. The show, which was produced by Jeffrey Katzenberg and his company DreamWorks Animation, revolves around a family of white lions, the patriarch of which stars in a Siegfried & Roy show in Las Vegas. Despite heavy promotion, the show was unsuccessful and was canceled after one season. Transmission and production were also delayed by the real-life on-stage injury of Roy Horn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJ8kqnWfgeYb1XyKmRXCBs599pa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:441'),
