  ('425089794225333032', 'FEUD', 2017, 'Drama', 'Ryan Murphy, Jaffe Cohen, Michael Zam', null, 'Tom Hollander, Naomi Watts, Diane Lane, Chloë Sevigny, Calista Flockhart, Demi Moore, Molly Ringwald, Treat Williams', 'TV-MA', 'Anthology series of famous feuds with the first season based on the legendary rivalry between Bette Davis and Joan Crawford which began early on their careers, climaxed on the set of "Whatever Happened to Baby Jane?" and evolved into an Oscar vendetta.', 'Anthology series of famous feuds with the first season based on the legendary rivalry between Bette Davis and Joan Crawford which began early on their careers, climaxed on the set of "Whatever Happened to Baby Jane?" and evolved into an Oscar vendetta.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c5wn2eLRN3naOB1JxEbDIApRN2T.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69851'),
  ('174522347886923274', 'FEUD', 2025, 'Drama', 'Zhao Na', null, 'Bai Lu, Joseph Zeng, He Ruixian, Chen Xinhai, Liang Yongqi, Zheng Kai, Crystal Huang Yi', null, 'Li Qingyue, the Four Spirit Immortal, and Bai Jiusi, the powerful Dacheng Lord, are caught in a turbulent love-hate relationship. As hidden truths come to light, they overcome their misunderstandings and join forces to protect the world from impending danger.', 'Li Qingyue, the Four Spirit Immortal, and Bai Jiusi, the powerful Dacheng Lord, are caught in a turbulent love-hate relationship. As hidden truths come to light, they overcome their misunderstandings and join forces to protect the world from impending danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fx7KQNaFUx5DaXMRm0pznHoLe04.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:252320'),
  ('406374372683011688', 'Feuer & Flamme', 2017, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, null, null, 'This documentary series follows emergency services from various fire stations in the Ruhr area up close and portrays the people in their grueling everyday working life.', 'This documentary series follows emergency services from various fire stations in the Ruhr area up close and portrays the people in their grueling everyday working life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kURevdhdZoZOjtM47uKKoeKvhqs.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:72926'),
  ('270410135031257211', 'FIA WEC', 2012, null, null, null, null, null, 'Established in 2012, the FIA World Endurance Championship (FIA WEC) represents the international pinnacle of the long-distance discipline, in which races last anything from six hours up to 24.', 'Established in 2012, the FIA World Endurance Championship (FIA WEC) represents the international pinnacle of the long-distance discipline, in which races last anything from six hours up to 24.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qW6oSzfAMvjvmIokQcKCrfvqFVw.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:305251'),
  ('760951840985776777', 'Fiasco', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Igor Gotesman, Pierre Niney', null, 'Pierre Niney, François Civil, Géraldine Nakache, Pascal Demolon, Leslie Medina, Louise Coldefy, Djimo Salim, Juliette Gasquet', 'TV-PG', 'When disaster strikes the set of a first-time director, a behind-the-scenes film crew captures everything as mishaps, blackmail and sabotage ensue.', 'When disaster strikes the set of a first-time director, a behind-the-scenes film crew captures everything as mishaps, blackmail and sabotage ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxzF3PMICswCoPxHmkQVYV7XRkU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:221120'),
  ('622382657915921686', 'Fievel''s American Tails', 1992, 'Western, Animation, Family', 'David Kirschner', null, 'Phillip Glasser, Lloyd Battista, Gerrit Graham, Dom DeLuise, Kenneth Mars', 'NR', 'Fievel''s American Tails is an American/Canadian animated television series, produced by Steven Spielberg''s Amblimation animation studio, Nelvana, and Universal Cartoon Studios. It aired for one season in 1992, and continued Fievel''s adventures from the film An American Tail: Fievel Goes West. In 1993 and 1994, MCA/Universal Home Video released twelve episodes on six VHS video-cassettes, two Laserdisc volumes. These have been the only home video releases of the cartoon, at least in the United States. In the United Kingdom, 12 episodes were released on six video-cassettes in 1995, but were in a different episode order to the United States and Vol.4 features the only episode that hasn''t been released in the United States. Episodes have been released on DVD in France, Germany, and Italy. Universal currently has no plans to release the show on DVD in the United States, as of November 19, 2009.', 'Fievel''s American Tails is an American/Canadian animated television series, produced by Steven Spielberg''s Amblimation animation studio, Nelvana, and Universal Cartoon Studios. It aired for one season in 1992, and continued Fievel''s adventures from the film An American Tail: Fievel Goes West. In 1993 and 1994, MCA/Universal Home Video released twelve episodes on six VHS video-cassettes, two Laserdisc volumes. These have been the only home video releases of the cartoon, at least in the United States. In the United Kingdom, 12 episodes were released on six video-cassettes in 1995, but were in a different episode order to the United States and Vol.4 features the only episode that hasn''t been released in the United States. Episodes have been released on DVD in France, Germany, and Italy. Universal currently has no plans to release the show on DVD in the United States, as of November 19, 2009.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/msWEkhcsqi0gfrIIpOonKumOkkT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74'),
  ('58577434974399012', 'FIFA Uncovered', 2022, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Sepp Blatter, Michel Platini, Gianni Infantino, Juca Kfouri, Jérôme Valcke, Ricardo Teixeira', 'TV-14', 'From power struggles to global politics, an exploration of FIFA reveals the organization''s checkered history — and what it takes to host a World Cup.', 'From power struggles to global politics, an exploration of FIFA reveals the organization''s checkered history — and what it takes to host a World Cup.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ajJl0eZfZCxeWiPoudfu4PgCAO4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213193'),
  ('182619752959189356', 'Fifteen-Love', 2023, 'Drama', 'Hania Elkington', 'Hania Elkington', 'Ella Lily Hyland, Aidan Turner, Harmony Rose Bremner, Tom Varey, Lorenzo Richelmy, Manon Azem, Jess Darrow, Steffan Rhodri', 'TV-PG', 'A former tennis prodigy makes an explosive allegation against her former coach. After the allegation, everyone is forced to reconsider what they thought they knew about their past success.', 'A former tennis prodigy makes an explosive allegation against her former coach. After the allegation, everyone is forced to reconsider what they thought they knew about their past success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cB97X0ZspRUyiU0ZBkAtjmDITq6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:219993'),
  ('339203719078292360', 'Fifth Gear', 2002, 'Documentary', 'Mark McQueen', null, 'Vicki Butler-Henderson, Jason Plato, Rory Reid, Grace Webb, Jimmy de Ville', null, 'Getting viewers up to speed on all the latest automotive information, with new car reviews, second hand bargains and industry tidbits being the focus of this magazine show.', 'Getting viewers up to speed on all the latest automotive information, with new car reviews, second hand bargains and industry tidbits being the focus of this magazine show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAxMzWGCuQI1adyPOGNefZHLOIy.jpg', 29, 'tmdb:tv:1592'),
  ('86220121234446971', 'Fifty Fifty (50-50)', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Elena Solomou, Vassilis Risvas, Dimitra Sakali', 'Vassilis Risvas, Elena Solomou, Dimitra Sakali', 'Petros Filippidis, Pavlos Haikalis, Sakis Boulas, Ava Galanopoulou, Maria Androutsou, Vana Rambota, Pigmalion Dadakaridis, Thanos Tokakis', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6oAAjh2SS4ZsTY4cF3f52K3VxVJ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:51773'),
  ('455068824439903823', 'Fight for Love', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Victoria Song, Ding Yuxi, Fu Xinbo, Joe Chen, Liang Xuefeng, Cao Jun, Zhou Jieqiong, Zhou Dawei', null, 'After her father''s death in battle and a mysterious warning from her injured brother, Chu Yu vows to uncover the truth. She marries into the defeated Wei family as Wei Jun’s widow to investigate, where she meets the sole survivor, Wei Yun. Though initially guarded, Wei Yun grows fond of Chu Yu, and mutual feelings emerge. Despite the obstacle of their "in-law" relationship, they face dangers together, uncover secrets, and protect their homeland side by side.', 'After her father''s death in battle and a mysterious warning from her injured brother, Chu Yu vows to uncover the truth. She marries into the defeated Wei family as Wei Jun’s widow to investigate, where she meets the sole survivor, Wei Yun. Though initially guarded, Wei Yun grows fond of Chu Yu, and mutual feelings emerge. Despite the obstacle of their "in-law" relationship, they face dangers together, uncover secrets, and protect their homeland side by side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7iCkfB9SGJbfmUmuoJDxcb9BnLC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:263044'),
  ('758880458015853502', 'Fight for My Way', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lim Sang-choon', null, 'Park Seo-jun, Kim Ji-won, Ahn Jae-hong, Song Ha-yoon, Kim Seung-o, Jin Hee-kyung, Lee Elijah, Kim Gun-woo', 'TV-14', 'A former taekwondo champion and an information desk worker aspire to chase their dreams in a world that isn''t kind to those with mediocre credentials.', 'A former taekwondo champion and an information desk worker aspire to chase their dreams in a world that isn''t kind to those with mediocre credentials.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/55w33JzFKBkz1evjBjqeF0enDd1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70813'),
  ('263788801369529159', 'Fight Like a Girl', 2020, 'Reality', null, null, 'Stephanie McMahon Levesque', null, 'Ten women. Paired with WWE Superstars. Together they find the strength, courage, and ability to transform themselves both on the inside and out.', 'Ten women. Paired with WWE Superstars. Together they find the strength, courage, and ability to transform themselves both on the inside and out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hEbT1ust07jlWnVpcXtnZCHkWO4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99300'),
  ('37213120110611338', 'Fight Night: The Million Dollar Heist', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', 'Shaye Ogbonna', null, 'Kevin Hart, Samuel L. Jackson, Taraji P. Henson, Don Cheadle', 'TV-MA', 'The story of how on the night of Ali’s defeat of Jerry Quarry, which came after he was banned from boxing for refusing to enter the military draft, hundreds of guests at an after-party were robbed at gunpoint, becoming one of the largest armed robberies the country has ever seen.', 'The story of how on the night of Ali’s defeat of Jerry Quarry, which came after he was banned from boxing for refusing to enter the military draft, hundreds of guests at an after-party were robbed at gunpoint, becoming one of the largest armed robberies the country has ever seen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ucxvu9kRykTd23m1omktBJZG2Q1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241485'),
  ('965884072648133832', 'Fight or Love?', 2012, 'Soap, Comedy', 'Silvio de Abreu', 'Silvio de Abreu, Daniel Ortiz', 'Irene Ravache, Tony Ramos, Mariana Ximenes, Reynaldo Gianecchini, Glória Pires, Edson Celulari, Bianca Bin, Luana Piovani', null, 'An inheritance of millions brings the fun-loving Charlô (Irene Raveche) and her bad-tempered cousin Otávio (Tony Ramos) closer than they ever expected. The inheritance, which includes a mansion and a chain of clothing stores, stipulates that the assets remain in the family. And since no one is willing to give up their part they decide to share the mansion and the business, despite the mortal hatred they harbor for each other. Charlô’s adopted son Felipe (Edson Celulari) also becomes caught up in the situation. However, he turns against his mother and becomes Otávio’s right-hand man at the company.', 'An inheritance of millions brings the fun-loving Charlô (Irene Raveche) and her bad-tempered cousin Otávio (Tony Ramos) closer than they ever expected. The inheritance, which includes a mansion and a chain of clothing stores, stipulates that the assets remain in the family. And since no one is willing to give up their part they decide to share the mansion and the business, despite the mortal hatred they harbor for each other. Charlô’s adopted son Felipe (Edson Celulari) also becomes caught up in the situation. However, he turns against his mother and becomes Otávio’s right-hand man at the company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6i4O50PaSEyAP7abxUPbAFGq58q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:48892'),
  ('314144029898064651', 'Fight! Kickers', 1986, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Tomiko Suzuki, Kazue Ikura, Noriko Tsukase, Masako Watanabe, Ikue Otani, Shinobu Adachi, Urara Takano, Kyoko Tongu', 'TV-Y7', 'The Kitahara Kickers are a soccer who struggle to win a game, with a run of 22 consecutive losses. But then a newcomer joins the team whose attitude brings back the passion for soccer that his teammates have forgotten.', 'The Kitahara Kickers are a soccer who struggle to win a game, with a run of 22 consecutive losses. But then a newcomer joins the team whose attitude brings back the passion for soccer that his teammates have forgotten.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NjsEwjdP2TiScGDr2vDujC2F8T.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64049'),
  ('145692785304519855', 'Fighter of the Destiny', 2017, 'Drama', null, null, 'Lu Han, Gulnezer Bextiyar, Janice Wu, Joseph Zeng, Gao Hanyu, Amelie Xu, Johnny Zhang, Zhai Tianlin', null, 'Chun Changsheng was abandoned in a flowing river and plucked up by a Taoist monk. He’s actually the fourth Prince of the Chen’s Royal bloodline. He’s plagued with an incurable illness, fated not to live past the age of 20. To find a cure, he leaves his temple, armed with a promise of marriage scroll, to become a student at a famous academy. He meets Xu Yourong and they slowly fall in love after hopping through the trials and tribulations of his journey.', 'Chun Changsheng was abandoned in a flowing river and plucked up by a Taoist monk. He’s actually the fourth Prince of the Chen’s Royal bloodline. He’s plagued with an incurable illness, fated not to live past the age of 20. To find a cure, he leaves his temple, armed with a promise of marriage scroll, to become a student at a famous academy. He meets Xu Yourong and they slowly fall in love after hopping through the trials and tribulations of his journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qkXwxhiDTfx4AV8zwp02SZ6EufZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71419'),
  ('191129455271763347', 'Fighting Foodons', 2001, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Chika Sakamoto, Chisa Yokoyama, Hidenobu Kiuchi, Hikaru Tokita, Jin Nishimura, Masami Iwasaki, Megumi Nasu, Shintaro Ohata', null, 'In the land of Fighting Foodons, regular recipes turn in to meal monsters when the art of culinary combat''s concocted. King Gorgeous Gorge and his Fatties have cooked up a devious plan to rule the world and they sprinkled an extra dash of destruction. They plan to rule the world by kidnapping the best chefs & forcing them to make powerful Foodons. A boy named Chase, a young apprentice chef with an appetite for action, thinks he has what it takes to become an Elite Master Chef like his dad, Chef Jack. Chase believes that he, his friends, family, and Foodons can change the world, even if it involves going into battle against the Glutton Gormandizers, King Gorgeous Gorge''s Big 4, and King Gorgeous Gorge''s female cat-like servant, Clawdia.', 'In the land of Fighting Foodons, regular recipes turn in to meal monsters when the art of culinary combat''s concocted. King Gorgeous Gorge and his Fatties have cooked up a devious plan to rule the world and they sprinkled an extra dash of destruction. They plan to rule the world by kidnapping the best chefs & forcing them to make powerful Foodons. A boy named Chase, a young apprentice chef with an appetite for action, thinks he has what it takes to become an Elite Master Chef like his dad, Chef Jack. Chase believes that he, his friends, family, and Foodons can change the world, even if it involves going into battle against the Glutton Gormandizers, King Gorgeous Gorge''s Big 4, and King Gorgeous Gorge''s female cat-like servant, Clawdia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0i2GdnRajfTONevOHAViBzHpwL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16098'),
  ('616518867845117621', 'Fighting General Daimos', 1978, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Tadao Nagahama', null, 'Kazuyuki Sogabe, Tamio Ohki, Akira Kamiya, Shozo Iizuka, Yo Inoue, Tessyo Genda, Osamu Ichikawa, Miyuki Ueda', null, 'The survivors of Planet Baam and the Earth people want to sign a peace treaty, so General Lion and the renowned scientist Dr. Ryūzaki head out to have a reunion. But Lion dies in odd circumstances, his vengeful son Richter kills Dr. Ryūzaki—and war starts. Dr. Ryūzaki''s son, young martial artist Kazuya, decides to defend Earth with Dr. Izumi''s powerful robot: Tōshō Daimos...', 'The survivors of Planet Baam and the Earth people want to sign a peace treaty, so General Lion and the renowned scientist Dr. Ryūzaki head out to have a reunion. But Lion dies in odd circumstances, his vengeful son Richter kills Dr. Ryūzaki—and war starts. Dr. Ryūzaki''s son, young martial artist Kazuya, decides to defend Earth with Dr. Izumi''s powerful robot: Tōshō Daimos...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zBSFAORAhKYbcK6g5R8yPZaKCN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8996'),
  ('722134511671728151', 'Fighting Spirit', 2000, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, 'Tatsuhiko Urahata', 'Kohei Kiyasu, Rikiya Koyama, Wataru Takagi, Keiji Fujiwara, Jurota Kosugi, Hidenobu Kiuchi, Hisao Egawa, Shin-ichiro Miki', 'TV-PG', 'Makunouchi Ippo is an ordinary high school student in Japan. Since he spends most of his time away from school helping his mother run the family business, he doesn''t get to enjoy his younger years like most teenagers. Always a target for bullying at school (the family fishing business grants him a distinct odor), Ippo''s life is one of hardship. One of these after-school bullying sessions turns Ippo''s life around for the better, as he is saved by a boxer named Takamura. He decides to follow in Takamura''s footsteps and train to become a boxer, giving his life direction and purpose. Ippo''s path to perfecting his pugilistic prowess is just beginning...', 'Makunouchi Ippo is an ordinary high school student in Japan. Since he spends most of his time away from school helping his mother run the family business, he doesn''t get to enjoy his younger years like most teenagers. Always a target for bullying at school (the family fishing business grants him a distinct odor), Ippo''s life is one of hardship. One of these after-school bullying sessions turns Ippo''s life around for the better, as he is saved by a boxer named Takamura. He decides to follow in Takamura''s footsteps and train to become a boxer, giving his life direction and purpose. Ippo''s path to perfecting his pugilistic prowess is just beginning...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LApB9C9kEkh2ZU2vzAhurNDipl.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:42705'),
  ('588618931666330509', 'Fighting Youth', 2021, 'Drama', null, 'Chen Lan', 'Wu Jinyan, Yin Tao, Zuo Xiaoqing, Liu Mintao, Peter Ho, Hong Yao, Zhang Tao, Zhang Nan', null, 'Zhang Xiaoyu, a rookie in the corporate world, becomes the secretary of Lin Rui, a top sales director at a renowned cosmetics company. As Lin Rui faces a power struggle against her rival, Fang Jing, Zhang Xiaoyu gets entangled in office politics. Despite the challenges, she proves her talent, grows in her career, and finds love.', 'Zhang Xiaoyu, a rookie in the corporate world, becomes the secretary of Lin Rui, a top sales director at a renowned cosmetics company. As Lin Rui faces a power struggle against her rival, Fang Jing, Zhang Xiaoyu gets entangled in office politics. Despite the challenges, she proves her talent, grows in her career, and finds love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6YLW2jiBuWfCxrswlqyDwGkoffw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117476'),
  ('816966484721051895', 'Fights Break Sphere', 2017, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Liu Sanmu, Liu Yuxuan, Wan Suwan, Zhu Jun, Chen Yiwen, Yang Menglu, Meme Yan, Xia Lei', 'TV-14', 'In a land where no magic is present. A land where the strong make the rules and weak have to obey. A land filled with alluring treasures and beauty, yet also filled with unforeseen danger. Three years ago, Xiao Yan, who had shown talents none had seen in decades, suddenly lost everything. His powers, his reputation, and his promise to his mother. What sorcery has caused him to lose all of his powers? And why has his fiancee suddenly shown up?', 'In a land where no magic is present. A land where the strong make the rules and weak have to obey. A land filled with alluring treasures and beauty, yet also filled with unforeseen danger. Three years ago, Xiao Yan, who had shown talents none had seen in decades, suddenly lost everything. His powers, his reputation, and his promise to his mother. What sorcery has caused him to lose all of his powers? And why has his fiancee suddenly shown up?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9bJPlezCXF6u0siDxf7cZaSXaJ.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:79481'),
  ('793229973399400626', 'Fights Break Sphere', 2018, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, 'Liu An Qi', null, null, 'Once a prodigy, Xiao Yan loses all his powers and becomes the shame of his family—until he awakens a master from his mother’s ring, unlocking his true potential and setting out on a journey of revenge and redemption in the martial world.', 'Once a prodigy, Xiao Yan loses all his powers and becomes the shame of his family—until he awakens a master from his mother’s ring, unlocking his true potential and setting out on a journey of revenge and redemption in the martial world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/quF64x6cR0dk38v2Y2kTJKJWU1H.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:81500'),
  ('912818662285700069', 'Fightworld', 2018, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Frank Grillo', 'TV-MA', 'Actor and fight enthusiast Frank Grillo travels the world, immersing himself in different fight cultures to understand their traditions and motivations.', 'Actor and fight enthusiast Frank Grillo travels the world, immersing himself in different fight cultures to understand their traditions and motivations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vokgs8npB47yjZmdEhQ4te9BC2y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83061'),
  ('776023898621794799', 'Figure It Out', 1997, 'Comedy, Family', 'Magda Liolis, Kevin Kay', null, 'Jeff Sutphen', null, 'A group of four different panelists popular on Nickelodeon programs try to figure out the talents of different guests. They are given clues that they can feel, see, taste, and also given to them through charades.', 'A group of four different panelists popular on Nickelodeon programs try to figure out the talents of different guests. They are given clues that they can feel, see, taste, and also given to them through charades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kiBRp0EIOgTT7i0F2SNz6UO5z8u.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:4244'),
  ('195472512065979423', 'Files of the Unexplained', 2024, 'Documentary, Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'Tijuana Ricks', 'TV-14', 'Eerie encounters, bizarre disappearances, haunting events and more perplexing phenomena are explored in this chilling investigative docuseries.', 'Eerie encounters, bizarre disappearances, haunting events and more perplexing phenomena are explored in this chilling investigative docuseries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bVj14gwU0bDGTnBC7rA91l60AKh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:248795'),
  ('933611188007229303', 'Filinta: An Ottoman Policeman', 2014, 'Crime, Action & Adventure', 'Altuğ Küçük', null, 'Onur Tuna, Cem Uçan, Kamil Güler, Berrak Tüzünataç, Asena Tuğal, Bülent Alkış, Hakan Yufkacıgil, Suavi Eren', null, '"Carbine" The first Ottoman crime show of television history, -Filinta- is a show that presents notions of rights, justice, camaraderie, fellowship and love. Mustafa is a very smart, skillful, handsome young man. He serves as a policeman with his best friend Ali, who is also an orphan like Mustafa. Kadı Gıyaseddin is a -kadı- (judge) who belongs to a well-established family, and was trained in Damascus, Bukhara, Cairo and Konya from an early age. He is of an easy-going and coolheaded temperament. He shows us his refined wisdom in every scene. He also has trained sultans sons at the palace. He is a former mentor of the Sultan. Our story begins with a conspiracy against Mustafa and Ali.', '"Carbine" The first Ottoman crime show of television history, -Filinta- is a show that presents notions of rights, justice, camaraderie, fellowship and love. Mustafa is a very smart, skillful, handsome young man. He serves as a policeman with his best friend Ali, who is also an orphan like Mustafa. Kadı Gıyaseddin is a -kadı- (judge) who belongs to a well-established family, and was trained in Damascus, Bukhara, Cairo and Konya from an early age. He is of an easy-going and coolheaded temperament. He shows us his refined wisdom in every scene. He also has trained sultans sons at the palace. He is a former mentor of the Sultan. Our story begins with a conspiracy against Mustafa and Ali.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2WXNBzsXcL21s5V76cBI0uKKlp.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:63030'),
  ('929037346644525219', 'Filled With Love', 2010, 'Comedy, Soap', 'Angelli Nesma Medina', null, 'Valentino Lanús, Ariadne Díaz, Gabriela Goldsmith, Diego Amozurrutia, Eduardo Liñán, Raúl Magaña, Michelle Renaud', 'TV-14', 'Llena de amor is a Mexican Spanish-language soap opera, produced by Televisa, that began airing in 2010. It is a remake of the 2002–2003 Venezuelan telenovela Mi Gorda Bella, which itself was inspired by the 1999–2001 Colombian telenovela Yo soy Betty, la fea. Llena de amor is about Marianela, an overweight girl, played by Ariadne Díaz, who is caught up in a set of family intrigues when she moves in with her aunt and uncle after becoming an orphan. The show premiered on May 3, 2010 in Mexico. It is produced by Angelli Nesma Medina. It formally aired in the United States on Univision at 7pm/6pm central from August 9, 2010 to April 19, 2011, replacing Mi Pecado.', 'Llena de amor is a Mexican Spanish-language soap opera, produced by Televisa, that began airing in 2010. It is a remake of the 2002–2003 Venezuelan telenovela Mi Gorda Bella, which itself was inspired by the 1999–2001 Colombian telenovela Yo soy Betty, la fea. Llena de amor is about Marianela, an overweight girl, played by Ariadne Díaz, who is caught up in a set of family intrigues when she moves in with her aunt and uncle after becoming an orphan. The show premiered on May 3, 2010 in Mexico. It is produced by Angelli Nesma Medina. It formally aired in the United States on Univision at 7pm/6pm central from August 9, 2010 to April 19, 2011, replacing Mi Pecado.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/znqgav7dkAOxs4OpEz6PedaWxEd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32213'),
  ('919669075895346079', 'Fillmore!', 2002, 'Animation, Mystery, Kids, Comedy', 'Scott M. Gimple', null, 'Orlando Brown, Tara Strong, Horatio Sanz, Wendie Malick, Danny Tamberelli, Kyle Sullivan, Lauren Tom, Jeff Probst', 'TV-Y7', 'Former delinquent Cornelius Fillmore saw the light, and now fights on the side of justice at X Middle School. Joining him is Ingrid Third, who has a photographic memory. Together, Fillmore and Third fight all those who attempt to break the rules at X, all while keeping Jr. Commissioner Vallejo off their backs and trying to please the school''s overly-image-conscious Principal Folsom. Fillmore! is an American animated television series which was produced by Walt Disney Television Animation. The series was created by Scott M. Gimple and directed by Christian Roman. It was the last series produced by Walt Disney Television Animation alone, without association with Disney Channel.', 'Former delinquent Cornelius Fillmore saw the light, and now fights on the side of justice at X Middle School. Joining him is Ingrid Third, who has a photographic memory. Together, Fillmore and Third fight all those who attempt to break the rules at X, all while keeping Jr. Commissioner Vallejo off their backs and trying to please the school''s overly-image-conscious Principal Folsom. Fillmore! is an American animated television series which was produced by Walt Disney Television Animation. The series was created by Scott M. Gimple and directed by Christian Roman. It was the last series produced by Walt Disney Television Animation alone, without association with Disney Channel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Vl2aYjQ1QlrT5QkfbR1aaDZPtf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1547'),
  ('142895344157656154', 'Film Club', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Aimee Lou Wood, Ralph Davis', null, 'Aimee Lou Wood, Nabhaan Rizwan, Suranne Jones, Adam Long, Liv Hill, Ralph Davis', null, 'Friday night. 7pm. Film Club Week 198. Evie hasn''t left the house in six months after a ''wobble'', and Film Club is her escape. A weekly chance to create a world of wonder, deck the garage out in whatever the movie calls for and spend a few uninterrupted hours with Noa - her best friend and one of the few mates who still shows up. But tonight, things are different. Noa''s got big news. A dream job is taking him across the other side of the country, which means that all of this is ending.', 'Friday night. 7pm. Film Club Week 198. Evie hasn''t left the house in six months after a ''wobble'', and Film Club is her escape. A weekly chance to create a world of wonder, deck the garage out in whatever the movie calls for and spend a few uninterrupted hours with Noa - her best friend and one of the few mates who still shows up. But tonight, things are different. Noa''s got big news. A dream job is taking him across the other side of the country, which means that all of this is ending.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5koeXuj7klU2vfVEbLqYUfd0gqK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:276643'),
  ('289806963297932947', 'Film Theory', null, 'Talk, Comedy', 'Matthew Patrick, Tommy Cook', null, null, null, 'Hello Internet! Welcome to FILM THEORY! If you want to learn the secrets of your favorite movies and tv shows, then grab your popcorn because it’s about to get epic! Our blockbuster theories include finding how to survive the scariest film monsters, exploring iconic superhero lore, and diving into the creepiest indie-horror series. Whether it’s streaming on Netflix, straight out of YouTube, or playing in a theater near you, we’re covering the nerdy world of film theories.', 'Hello Internet! Welcome to FILM THEORY! If you want to learn the secrets of your favorite movies and tv shows, then grab your popcorn because it’s about to get epic! Our blockbuster theories include finding how to survive the scariest film monsters, exploring iconic superhero lore, and diving into the creepiest indie-horror series. Whether it’s streaming on Netflix, straight out of YouTube, or playing in a theater near you, we’re covering the nerdy world of film theories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eACzJr2wbR8xB57tPRnHGnxwlTH.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:118234'),
  ('366320956201834215', 'Filter', 2025, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, 'Tong Hua', 'Tan Jianci, Li Landi, Gao Hanyu, Huang Sirui, Chang Long, Jia Ze', null, 'The "Filter Bracelet" allows Su Chengcheng to transform her appearance and use her new identities to help others. As she navigates these changes, she and Tang Qi work together to develop a unique Chinese beauty brand, promoting "natural, confident, real beauty." Through their journey, Su Chengcheng learns that true beauty lies in authenticity and facing challenges with determination.', 'The "Filter Bracelet" allows Su Chengcheng to transform her appearance and use her new identities to help others. As she navigates these changes, she and Tang Qi work together to develop a unique Chinese beauty brand, promoting "natural, confident, real beauty." Through their journey, Su Chengcheng learns that true beauty lies in authenticity and facing challenges with determination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewcBphUcNqzl5TLJJk4kowMFm35.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:243081'),
  ('1109156080604139897', 'Filthy Envy', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Carolina Cuervo', null, 'Carolina Cuervo, Ana María Orozco, Cecilia Navia, Yeimy Paola Vargas, Santiago Alarcón, Jacques Toukhmanian, Víctor Mallarino, Claudio Cataño', 'TV-14', 'Four great friends turn a celebration dinner into a complete nightmare; things turn toxic when friendship and envy sit together at the table.', 'Four great friends turn a celebration dinner into a complete nightmare; things turn toxic when friendship and envy sit together at the table.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZ4YjPaYkv57PpwtU8u1EsSkQHV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210793'),
  ('457010899663499159', 'Filthy Rich', 2020, 'Drama', 'Tate Taylor', null, 'Kim Cattrall, Melia Kreiling, Aubrey Dollar, Corey Cott, Benjamin Levy Aguilar, Mark L. Young, Olivia Macklin, Steve Harris', null, 'When the patriarch of a mega-rich Southern family, famed for creating a wildly successful Christian television network, dies in a plane crash, his wife and family are stunned to learn that he fathered three illegitimate children, all of whom are written into his will, threatening their family name and fortune.', 'When the patriarch of a mega-rich Southern family, famed for creating a wildly successful Christian television network, dies in a plane crash, his wife and family are stunned to learn that he fathered three illegitimate children, all of whom are written into his will, threatening their family name and fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/df999yXdxdX5IOeUoEORoLwJrqY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89499'),
  ('55368909617878295', 'Filthy Rich & Catflap', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Ben Elton', null, 'Nigel Planer, Rik Mayall, Adrian Edmondson', null, 'Richie causes trouble in his pursuit of TV fame with Eddie, his alcoholic minder, and Filthy, his sponging agent.', 'Richie causes trouble in his pursuit of TV fame with Eddie, his alcoholic minder, and Filthy, his sponging agent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQiMn7gq2QQJmCxT4lKPJK1DH50.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4451'),
  ('511343089165541748', 'Final Approach', 2004, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Daisuke Kishio, Sakura Nogawa, Yukari Tamura, Miyu Matsuki, Yuko Minaguchi, Chiaki Takahashi', null, 'Ryou Mizuhara is a normal high school student, living alone with his younger sister Akane. They were very happy together, at least until a mysterious girl crashes into their lives who introduces herself as Ryou''s new fiancée.', 'Ryou Mizuhara is a normal high school student, living alone with his younger sister Akane. They were very happy together, at least until a mysterious girl crashes into their lives who introduces herself as Ryou''s new fiancée.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdOVk6FhLdxB8SZ8BEl1ndhVgvC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:25917'),
  ('521185202797159703', 'Final Draft', 2025, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'Twenty-five athletes, most retired, compete to win 30M yen to launch their second career. Can they overcome tough physical and psychological challenges?', 'Twenty-five athletes, most retired, compete to win 30M yen to launch their second career. Can they overcome tough physical and psychological challenges?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umOuqHcG94ZLanTYryUx3ZutIzq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:288908'),
  ('1101130306770518150', 'Final Fantasy XIV: Dad of Light', 2017, 'Drama, Family', null, 'Kota Fukihara', 'Yudai Chiba, Ren Osugi, Fumika Baba, Hatsunori Hasegawa, Mako Ishino, Yoshihiko Hakamada, Nao, Masayuki Shida', 'TV-PG', 'A father and son rekindle their bond through the online role-playing game Final Fantasy XIV in this live-action series based on a true story.', 'A father and son rekindle their bond through the online role-playing game Final Fantasy XIV in this live-action series based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZwg6SaMtUqPjKmeoJmlNh1axfq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73659'),
  ('1136573628117963114', 'Final Fantasy: Legend of the Crystals', 1994, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Satoru Akahori, Mayori Sekijima', 'Rica Matsumoto, Yuko Minaguchi, Shigeru Chiba, Fumi Hirano, Kenichi Ogata, Hiroko Kasahara, Etsuko Kozakura, Hiroshi Naka', 'TV-14', '200 years after Bartz and his friends saved two worlds from Exdeath, a threat arises and seeks to take the Crystals for itself. Linaly, a descendant of Bartz, and her friend/protector Prettz journey to the Temple of Wind to seek the source of this new danger.', '200 years after Bartz and his friends saved two worlds from Exdeath, a threat arises and seeks to take the Crystals for itself. Linaly, a descendant of Bartz, and her friend/protector Prettz journey to the Temple of Wind to seek the source of this new danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMNcK4LogNwJBE5ceTwt6i3uzL1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67037'),
  ('242695889550118732', 'Final Fantasy: Unlimited', 2001, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Nobutoshi Canna, Haruko Momoi, Akira Ishida, Kana Ueda, Kyoko Hikami, Kikuko Inoue, Yuka Imai, Brian Jepson', 'TV-PG', 'Twins Ai and Yu Hayakawa decide to set forth in search of their parents and the mysterious dimension they studied.', 'Twins Ai and Yu Hayakawa decide to set forth in search of their parents and the mysterious dimension they studied.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dc46WJVwhSEcJ7AWDT0gNw1yq70.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11316'),
  ('1033623408444142050', 'Final Space', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Olan Rogers, David Sacks', null, 'Fred Armisen, Tom Kenny, Olan Rogers, Coty Galloway, Tika Sumpter, Steven Yeun', 'TV-14', 'An astronaut named Gary and his planet-destroying sidekick Mooncake embark on serialized journeys through space in order to unlock the mystery of “Final Space,” the last point in the universe, if it actually does exist.', 'An astronaut named Gary and his planet-destroying sidekick Mooncake embark on serialized journeys through space in order to unlock the mystery of “Final Space,” the last point in the universe, if it actually does exist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cf4chvwB40cEpsagSrRaEIqBFoG.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:74387'),
  ('942783599975928584', 'Find Me in Paris', 2018, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Jill Girling, Lori Mather-Welch', null, 'Jessica Lord, Eubha Akilade, Castle Rock, Terique Jarrett, Christy O''Donnell, Rik Young, Isabelle Allen, Jake Swift', 'TV-PG', 'When Lena Grisky, a Russian Princess and student at the Paris Opera Ballet School accidentally time travels to present day, she must quickly adapt if she hopes to keep her secret and hide from the dangerous Time Collectors.', 'When Lena Grisky, a Russian Princess and student at the Paris Opera Ballet School accidentally time travels to present day, she must quickly adapt if she hopes to keep her secret and hide from the dangerous Time Collectors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uOTYMzTlXFbWDZCxxc0vX9CvBsl.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:82199'),
  ('283705366685318813', 'Find Me in Your Memory', 2020, 'Drama', null, 'Kim Yoon-joo', 'Kim Dong-wook, Mun Ka-young, Jang Young-nam, Yoon Jong-hoon, Lee Seung-joon, Kim Seul-gi, Shin Joo-hyup, Lee Ju-bin', null, 'A deep connection forms between a news anchor who remembers every moment he''s ever lived and an actress who''s lost the memories of her past.', 'A deep connection forms between a news anchor who remembers every moment he''s ever lived and an actress who''s lost the memories of her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7bCi8AoLID1ykXogzL5a4mAL0o.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99477'),
  ('465304098190723621', 'Find Yourself', 2020, 'Drama', 'Ding Zi Guang, Zhang Zhuo', null, 'Victoria Song, Song Weilong, David Wang, Zhang Yujian, Yu Shuxin, Yang Zhiying, Zhou Qiqi, Elaine Cai', null, 'A love story between an accomplished career woman and a younger man... He Fan Xing''s company is at risk of being acquired, while her relationship with Yuan Song faces societal pressures due to their age difference. The consecutive blows in her work and love life push her to an emotional quagmire, and it is during this time that Ye Lu Ming enters her life. Being older in age, he is mature, stable and knowledgeable. He becomes He Fan Xing''s life coach and the source of conflict between the couple. For He Fan Xing, it''s not merely a matter of choosing the man that she loves, but considering the contradictions of adopting the traditional mindset on marriage.', 'A love story between an accomplished career woman and a younger man... He Fan Xing''s company is at risk of being acquired, while her relationship with Yuan Song faces societal pressures due to their age difference. The consecutive blows in her work and love life push her to an emotional quagmire, and it is during this time that Ye Lu Ming enters her life. Being older in age, he is mature, stable and knowledgeable. He becomes He Fan Xing''s life coach and the source of conflict between the couple. For He Fan Xing, it''s not merely a matter of choosing the man that she loves, but considering the contradictions of adopting the traditional mindset on marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twvQYgYdJZf9shuQBgM1wWxVy10.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98830'),
  ('1046281631273523085', 'Finder of Lost Loves', 1984, 'Drama', 'Gail Parent', null, 'Anthony Franciosa, Deborah Adair, Anne Jeffreys, Richard Kantor', null, 'The Finder of Lost Loves TV show was a 60 minute drama series on ABC about a private investigator who specialized in finding lost loves from the past for his heartbroken clients.', 'The Finder of Lost Loves TV show was a 60 minute drama series on ABC about a private investigator who specialized in finding lost loves from the past for his heartbroken clients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fij5ZsGiWfu5bQcfJ8w5v1RrJt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13566'),
  ('939852993389935046', 'Finding Alice', 2021, 'Drama', 'Roger Goldby, Simon Nye', null, 'Keeley Hawes, Jason Merrells, George Webster, Shannon Murray, Isabella Pappas, Nigel Havers, Dominique Moore, Joanna Lumley', null, 'Alice''s partner of 20 years, Harry, falls down the stairs and dies soon after the couple move into the dream home he designed. Alice discovers that some men, including her late ex, hide stuff that they don''t want to deal with.', 'Alice''s partner of 20 years, Harry, falls down the stairs and dies soon after the couple move into the dream home he designed. Alice discovers that some men, including her late ex, hide stuff that they don''t want to deal with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTozw89IFsgV0osRyC8a411FbfM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:116620'),
  ('1055313378268487348', 'Finding Bigfoot', 2011, 'Reality, Drama', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'From small towns in the South to remote areas of the Pacific Northwest and Alaska, four eccentric but passionate members of the Bigfoot Field Research Organization (BFRO) embark on one single-minded mission - to find the elusive "creature" known as Bigfoot or the Sasquatch.', 'From small towns in the South to remote areas of the Pacific Northwest and Alaska, four eccentric but passionate members of the Bigfoot Field Research Organization (BFRO) embark on one single-minded mission - to find the elusive "creature" known as Bigfoot or the Sasquatch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Lgc4MnuTv16ISNTWoAb95KA61f.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:39882'),
  ('404836043947116853', 'Finding Carter', 2014, 'Drama', 'Emily Silver', null, 'Kathryn Prescott, Cynthia Watros, Alexis Denisof, Anna Jacoby-Heron, Zac Pullam, Alex Saxon', 'TV-14', 'A teenager finds out she was abducted as a toddler and returns to her biological family.', 'A teenager finds out she was abducted as a toddler and returns to her biological family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hylkiBaQFVrJuSRZDpeOrVxlQ4Z.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61135'),
  ('1003005489829459724', 'Finding Closure', 2022, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Dmitry Nelidov, Aleksandra Remizova', null, 'Denis Vlasenko, Vlad Prokhorov, Mariya Lugovaya, Ilya Borisov, Sergey Epishev, Viktoriya Maslova, Igor Vernik, Aleksandr Ustyugov', null, 'Fyodor is an ordinary guy who discovers a mysterious gift. He is being followed by people in desperate need to find closure from their past. One little inconvenience- they are ghosts. And the only way to get rid of them is for Fyodor to help them find what is holding them off on Earth and help them make a final departure. Things get even more complicated when Fyodor''s own father appears on his doorstep. He was only nineteen when he died, and his closure is the fact that he left behind a son that he didn''t really get to know.', 'Fyodor is an ordinary guy who discovers a mysterious gift. He is being followed by people in desperate need to find closure from their past. One little inconvenience- they are ghosts. And the only way to get rid of them is for Fyodor to help them find what is holding them off on Earth and help them make a final departure. Things get even more complicated when Fyodor''s own father appears on his doorstep. He was only nineteen when he died, and his closure is the fact that he left behind a son that he didn''t really get to know.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5cOuqLlLxXgWCqgvrK01r3oEtTv.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:207967'),
  ('322219332205249724', 'Finding Her Edge', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Madelyn Keys, Alice Malakhov, Alexandra Beaton, Harmon Walsh, Cale Ambrozic, Olly Atkins, Meredith Forlenza, Niko Ceci', 'TV-PG', 'A former ice dancer returns to the rink with an exciting new partner while holding onto feelings for her old one — her first love.', 'A former ice dancer returns to the rink with an exciting new partner while holding onto feelings for her old one — her first love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7t6iXlbfoBSfVyINLRHms5kqfze.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:281401'),
  ('131443121600158714', 'Finding Ola', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ghada Abdel Aal, Maha El Wazir', null, null, 'TV-14', 'After a life-altering event, Ola embarks on a journey of self-discovery while dealing with the challenges of raising two children and making ends meet.', 'After a life-altering event, Ola embarks on a journey of self-discovery while dealing with the challenges of raising two children and making ends meet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/esnwUFZ2mKHNm0TAQXGwxdDwwZ4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:154810'),
  ('1109744266383184690', 'Finding the Last Note', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Amika Sedsirirat, Ratchapol Koomkongsuwan, Pavarit Mongkolpisit, Sarocha Watittapan, Chotipat Suthadsanasoung, Praesun, Nirut Sirijanya, Sarawut Phumthong', null, 'This is the story of the “Uea Sastraporn” family, once bound together by music; the very thing that later drove them apart. Saeng, a struggling musician, fights to raise his two children after the sudden death of his wife, Thip. Khim, his autistic daughter, uses strict routines to navigate her world, while Kheng, his troubled teenage son, harbors anger toward his father, his sister, and fate itself.', 'This is the story of the “Uea Sastraporn” family, once bound together by music; the very thing that later drove them apart. Saeng, a struggling musician, fights to raise his two children after the sudden death of his wife, Thip. Khim, his autistic daughter, uses strict routines to navigate her world, while Kheng, his troubled teenage son, harbors anger toward his father, his sister, and fate itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2DhY276D2aglP7MxhN9DJ288bJm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317767'),
  ('949726766788476383', 'Finding Your Roots', 2012, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Henry Louis Gates, Jr.', 'TV-PG', 'Noted Harvard scholar Henry Louis Gates, Jr. has been helping people discover long-lost relatives hidden for generations within the branches of their family trees. Professor Gates utilizes a team of genealogists to reconstruct the paper trail left behind by our ancestors and the world’s leading geneticists to decode our DNA and help us travel thousands of years into the past to discover the origins of our earliest forebears.', 'Noted Harvard scholar Henry Louis Gates, Jr. has been helping people discover long-lost relatives hidden for generations within the branches of their family trees. Professor Gates utilizes a team of genealogists to reconstruct the paper trail left behind by our ancestors and the world’s leading geneticists to decode our DNA and help us travel thousands of years into the past to discover the origins of our earliest forebears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h9JX8nX12nl2AfUdO3aqg2IwmGu.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:43221'),
  ('484260835424054867', 'Fingersmith', 2005, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Aisling Walsh', null, 'Sally Hawkins, Elaine Cassidy, Rupert Evans, Charles Dance, Imelda Staunton, Polly Hemingway, David Troughton, Sarah Badel', 'NR', 'A young woman is hired as a maid to an heiress who lives a secluded life on a large countryside estate with her domineering uncle. But, the maid has a secret: she is a pickpocket recruited by a swindler posing as a gentleman to help him seduce the heiress to elope with him, rob her of her fortune, and lock her up in a madhouse. The plan seems to proceed according to plan until the women discover some unexpected emotions.', 'A young woman is hired as a maid to an heiress who lives a secluded life on a large countryside estate with her domineering uncle. But, the maid has a secret: she is a pickpocket recruited by a swindler posing as a gentleman to help him seduce the heiress to elope with him, rob her of her fortune, and lock her up in a madhouse. The plan seems to proceed according to plan until the women discover some unexpected emotions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9shwDTGQuMx3yQZXVEzYwoq6vRu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13812'),
  ('390128301944010004', 'Fire Chasers', 2017, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'As California''s 2016 fire season rages, brave backcountry firefighters race to put out the flames, protect homes and save lives in this docuseries.', 'As California''s 2016 fire season rages, brave backcountry firefighters race to put out the flames, protect homes and save lives in this docuseries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dgdrKsKNBtjpkeSL5jLjZLr8aPV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73807'),
  ('376937758072766898', 'Fire Country', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Joan Rater, Max Thieriot, Tony Phelan', null, 'Max Thieriot, Kevin Alejandro, Jordan Calloway, Jules Latimer, Diane Farr', 'TV-14', 'Seeking redemption and a shortened prison sentence, young convict Bode Donovan joins a firefighting program that returns him to his small Northern California hometown, where he and other inmates work alongside elite firefighters to extinguish massive blazes across the region.', 'Seeking redemption and a shortened prison sentence, young convict Bode Donovan joins a firefighting program that returns him to his small Northern California hometown, where he and other inmates work alongside elite firefighters to extinguish massive blazes across the region.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6XnA02VRG4dhBpTZWGZuXQdYGDW.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:202297'),
  ('755020068229562176', 'Fire Force', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Gakuto Kajiwara, Yusuke Kobayashi, Saeko Kamijo, Mao Ichimichi, Kazuya Nakai, Kenichi Suzumura, Aoi Yuuki, Daisuke Sakaguchi', 'TV-14', 'Year 198 of the Solar Era in Tokyo, special fire brigades are fighting against a phenomenon called spontaneous human combustion where humans beings are turned into living infernos called "Infernals". While the Infernals are first generation cases of spontaneous human combustion, later generations possess the ability to manipulate flames while retaining human form. Shinra Kusakabe, a youth who gained the nickname Devil''s Footprints for his ability to ignite his feet at will, joins the Special Fire Force Company 8 which composes of other flames users as they work to extinguish any Infernals they encounter. As a faction that is creating Infernals appears, Shira begins to uncover the truth behind a mysterious fire that caused the death of his family twelve years ago.', 'Year 198 of the Solar Era in Tokyo, special fire brigades are fighting against a phenomenon called spontaneous human combustion where humans beings are turned into living infernos called "Infernals". While the Infernals are first generation cases of spontaneous human combustion, later generations possess the ability to manipulate flames while retaining human form. Shinra Kusakabe, a youth who gained the nickname Devil''s Footprints for his ability to ignite his feet at will, joins the Special Fire Force Company 8 which composes of other flames users as they work to extinguish any Infernals they encounter. As a faction that is creating Infernals appears, Shira begins to uncover the truth behind a mysterious fire that caused the death of his family twelve years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sC4sTJnI0rLakinXMgBHv3Ynl9D.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:88046'),
  ('559968256456838531', 'Fire in His Fingertips', 2019, 'Comedy, Animation', null, null, 'Natsumi Takamori, Kent Ito, Kiiro Tsukino, Shiu Kase', 'TV-MA', 'Office worker Ryou Fujihashi is trapped inside her apartment which has set ablaze. The firefighters arrive in time to save her, and one of them happens to be Souma Mizuno, Fujihashi''s childhood friend who she had a crush on. As the apartment fire gets put out, an old love gets rekindled.', 'Office worker Ryou Fujihashi is trapped inside her apartment which has set ablaze. The firefighters arrive in time to save her, and one of them happens to be Souma Mizuno, Fujihashi''s childhood friend who she had a crush on. As the apartment fire gets put out, an old love gets rekindled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHUDRf2e9FGeWXPsT5lVF3iCUwc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:90388'),
  ('40577773181302975', 'Fireball XL5', 1962, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Sylvia Anderson, Gerry Anderson', null, 'Gerry Anderson, David Graham, Sylvia Anderson, Paul Maxwell, John Bluthal', null, 'Fireball XL5 is a science fiction-themed children''s television show following the missions of spaceship Fireball XL5, commanded by Colonel Steve Zodiac of the World Space Patrol. The show was produced in 1962 by husband and wife team Gerry and Sylvia Anderson through their company APF, in association with ATV for ITC Entertainment. While developing his new show, Anderson thought a brand of motor oil—Castrol XL—had an interesting sound. A phonetic change created the name "Fireball XL", with the "-5" added as the title seemed a bit flat without the numeral. The show featured the Andersons'' Supermarionation, a form of puppetry first introduced in Four Feather Falls and Supercar and used again in their subsequent productions such as Stingray and Captain Scarlet. Thirty-nine black and white half-hour episodes of Fireball XL5 were made on 35mm film: all future Anderson series were produced in colour. Several Anderson series have been shown in syndication in the US, but Fireball XL5 is the only Anderson series to have run on a US network. NBC ran the series in its Saturday morning children''s block from 1963 through to September 1965. A similar programme often confused with Fireball XL5 is Space Patrol, produced by Gerry Anderson''s ex business partner and co-founder of AP Films, Arthur Provis due to a number of similarities and settings.', 'Fireball XL5 is a science fiction-themed children''s television show following the missions of spaceship Fireball XL5, commanded by Colonel Steve Zodiac of the World Space Patrol. The show was produced in 1962 by husband and wife team Gerry and Sylvia Anderson through their company APF, in association with ATV for ITC Entertainment. While developing his new show, Anderson thought a brand of motor oil—Castrol XL—had an interesting sound. A phonetic change created the name "Fireball XL", with the "-5" added as the title seemed a bit flat without the numeral. The show featured the Andersons'' Supermarionation, a form of puppetry first introduced in Four Feather Falls and Supercar and used again in their subsequent productions such as Stingray and Captain Scarlet. Thirty-nine black and white half-hour episodes of Fireball XL5 were made on 35mm film: all future Anderson series were produced in colour. Several Anderson series have been shown in syndication in the US, but Fireball XL5 is the only Anderson series to have run on a US network. NBC ran the series in its Saturday morning children''s block from 1963 through to September 1965. A similar programme often confused with Fireball XL5 is Space Patrol, produced by Gerry Anderson''s ex business partner and co-founder of AP Films, Arthur Provis due to a number of similarities and settings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rBv16DzgKuzvx13KweU2nltONXU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4378'),
  ('678328257793211282', 'Firebite', 2021, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Warwick Thornton, Brendan Fletcher', 'Warwick Thornton', 'Rob Collins, Shantae Barnes-Cowan, Callan Mulvey, Yael Stone', 'TV-MA', 'In a remote South-Australian desert mining town — a hive for the last vampire stronghold — two Indigenous Australian hunters embark on a quest to battle the last colony of vampires.', 'In a remote South-Australian desert mining town — a hive for the last vampire stronghold — two Indigenous Australian hunters embark on a quest to battle the last colony of vampires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wMFLGQ6dQ5V4pPp62hN2FCbpe0E.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138525'),
  ('633498908242118861', 'Fired on Mars', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Nate Sherman, Nick Vokey', 'Alexandra Johnstone, Nick Fernandes', 'Luke Wilson', 'TV-MA', 'After taking a one-way trip to the Red Planet, graphic designer Jeff Cooper finds himself adrift when his bosses unceremoniously eliminate his role.', 'After taking a one-way trip to the Red Planet, graphic designer Jeff Cooper finds himself adrift when his bosses unceremoniously eliminate his role.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7x4EO1UOvat2V78WuC2CpAqxjH8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:126726'),
  ('594225363031244040', 'Fired Up', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Arleen Sorkin', null, 'Sharon Lawrence, Leah Remini, Mark Feuerstein, Jonathan Banks', null, 'Fired Up is a short-lived 1997–1998 situation comedy airing on NBC. It lasted for two seasons and 28 episodes. The series, the first from Grammnet Productions, starred Sharon Lawrence and Leah Remini. The series was about a self-centered promotions executive and her mouthy assistant. The pair got fired from their jobs, and instead of getting other jobs, they teamed up to create a business as equal partners.', 'Fired Up is a short-lived 1997–1998 situation comedy airing on NBC. It lasted for two seasons and 28 episodes. The series, the first from Grammnet Productions, starred Sharon Lawrence and Leah Remini. The series was about a self-centered promotions executive and her mouthy assistant. The pair got fired from their jobs, and instead of getting other jobs, they teamed up to create a business as equal partners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2zxTqI8BajdsjT64vnr7uVAwARS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:10325'),
  ('166677210508031041', 'Firefighter Daigo: Rescuer in Orange', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Junya Enoki, Taku Yashiro, Ayane Sakura, Yuichi Nakamura, Tetsu Inada, Yohei Azakami, Ryota Iwasaki, Kenjiro Tsuda', 'TV-14', 'Daigo Toake burns with remarkable talent and unparalleled determination. Shun Onoda struggles against the walls blocking his own path. Yuki Nakamura hopes to become one of the few female members of the special rescue corps known as "Orange." When these three young firefighters who share the goal of becoming members of Orange come together, the story of how Japan will one day be saved begins... and what looms before them is a crisis that endangers the entire country!', 'Daigo Toake burns with remarkable talent and unparalleled determination. Shun Onoda struggles against the walls blocking his own path. Yuki Nakamura hopes to become one of the few female members of the special rescue corps known as "Orange." When these three young firefighters who share the goal of becoming members of Orange come together, the story of how Japan will one day be saved begins... and what looms before them is a crisis that endangers the entire country!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3gdaJacLTvi48ZoDsu7YSKb86mj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223780'),
  ('778672823021050754', 'Firefly', 2002, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Joss Whedon', null, 'Nathan Fillion, Gina Torres, Alan Tudyk, Morena Baccarin, Adam Baldwin, Jewel Staite, Sean Maher, Summer Glau', 'TV-14', 'In the year 2517, the universe is a vast frontier where lawlessness reigns and adventure awaits! Join Captain Malcolm Reynolds and his ragtag crew aboard the spaceship Serenity as they navigate the fringes of society, battling the oppressive Alliance and facing off against ruthless bounty hunters.', 'In the year 2517, the universe is a vast frontier where lawlessness reigns and adventure awaits! Join Captain Malcolm Reynolds and his ragtag crew aboard the spaceship Serenity as they navigate the fringes of society, battling the oppressive Alliance and facing off against ruthless bounty hunters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vZcKsy4sGAvWMVqLluwYuoi11Kj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1437'),
  ('766734270081166647', 'Firefly Lane', 2021, 'Drama', 'Maggie Friedman', null, 'Katherine Heigl, Sarah Chalke, Ben Lawson, Beau Garrett, Roan Curtis, Alissa Skovbye, Yael Yurman, Ignacio Serricchio', 'TV-MA', 'For decades, childhood best friends Kate and Tully have weathered life''s storms together -- until a betrayal threatens to break them apart for good.', 'For decades, childhood best friends Kate and Tully have weathered life''s storms together -- until a betrayal threatens to break them apart for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2AavbPEEXzyy7Smyusozyz48T1n.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:87049'),
  ('960955787530097827', 'Fireman Sam', 1987, 'Kids, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Dave Jones, Dave Gingell', null, null, 'TV-Y', 'Follow the adventures of fireman Sam and his colleagues as they protect the citizens of the Welsh town of Pontypandy. Whenever the alarm sounds, brave Sam and his co-workers can be counted on to jump into a fire engine, hop onto a helicopter, or even launch an inflatable lifeboat to battle blazes, mount rescue missions, or provide medical attention to those in need.', 'Follow the adventures of fireman Sam and his colleagues as they protect the citizens of the Welsh town of Pontypandy. Whenever the alarm sounds, brave Sam and his co-workers can be counted on to jump into a fire engine, hop onto a helicopter, or even launch an inflatable lifeboat to battle blazes, mount rescue missions, or provide medical attention to those in need.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXsqaIOjemMuHxGu3XukIyVM7jN.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:5200'),
  ('188402723887420478', 'Fires', 2021, 'Drama', 'Tony Ayres, Belinda Chayko', null, null, 'NR', 'Inspired by true events, the story of everyday Australians at the front line of the devastating fires of the 2019-2020 Australian summer.', 'Inspired by true events, the story of everyday Australians at the front line of the devastating fires of the 2019-2020 Australian summer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/QE851qjGKdtBCIAXszyGPnkYl4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:126038'),
  ('769442695780077581', 'Firestarter: Rekindled', 2002, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Jeffrey Morton, Philip Eisner', 'Philip Eisner', 'Marguerite Moreau, Malcolm McDowell, Dennis Hopper, Danny Nucci, Skye McCole Bartusiak, John Dennis Johnston, Darnell Williams, Ron Perkins', 'NR', 'A young woman who has the ability to start fires with her mind, must now face the trauma of her childhood by battling with a group of very talented children and their cruel leader, John Rainbird.', 'A young woman who has the ability to start fires with her mind, must now face the trauma of her childhood by battling with a group of very talented children and their cruel leader, John Rainbird.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUXpdGgUhQhDR6vzbhnBOJVpFk1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:41327'),
  ('498252236410030673', 'Fireworks of My Heart', 2023, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Jiu Yuexi', 'Xu Su', 'Yang Yang, Wang Churan, Wang Yanlin, Wei Daxun, Vin Zhang, Yang Chaoyue, Zhang Yue, Chen Jin', null, 'Fire chief Song Yan and emergency doctor Xu Qin were separated by family opposition when they were younger. Now ten years later, they meet again due to their professions. After experiencing life and death together, they manage to find their way back, working together and encouraging each other. They acknowledge each other''s individual growth after years apart, but will they be able to overcome the obstacles in their path this time to stay together?', 'Fire chief Song Yan and emergency doctor Xu Qin were separated by family opposition when they were younger. Now ten years later, they meet again due to their professions. After experiencing life and death together, they manage to find their way back, working together and encouraging each other. They acknowledge each other''s individual growth after years apart, but will they be able to overcome the obstacles in their path this time to stay together?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecF1kGP2tlCpoWXVsaeYP3W6dZb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:216445'),
  ('902675766683832325', 'Firing Line with Margaret Hoover', 2018, 'Talk, War & Politics', null, null, 'Margaret Hoover', 'TV-PG', 'Join author, activist and commentator Margaret Hoover for a public affairs talk show that delivers a civil and engaging contest of ideas among the brightest minds and voices from across the ideological spectrum.', 'Join author, activist and commentator Margaret Hoover for a public affairs talk show that delivers a civil and engaging contest of ideas among the brightest minds and voices from across the ideological spectrum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lIyK5ZRvZui0uLCHJnjL2oIZENn.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:80715'),
  ('1093471942874382700', 'First and Last', 2021, 'Drama', 'Hakan Bonomo', 'Hakan Bonomo', 'Timuçin Esen, Bergüzar Korel, Cemal Toktas, Gizem Erdem, Durukan Çelikkaya, Mustafa Enis Bilir, Aydan Taş', null, 'The ups and downs of Barış and Deniz, two very different people who meet in their mid-20s and fall in love with each other before their childhood traumas leave their traces, and a 10-year odyssey of psychological observation that is often sunny, cloudy, stormy, possible, and impossible.', 'The ups and downs of Barış and Deniz, two very different people who meet in their mid-20s and fall in love with each other before their childhood traumas leave their traces, and a 10-year odyssey of psychological observation that is often sunny, cloudy, stormy, possible, and impossible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2SvB6QxuTY6otIyYYzedHKUA6vX.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:131906'),
  ('446141306608535017', 'First Dates', 2013, 'Reality', 'Ana de Moraes', null, 'Fred Sirieix, Merlin Griffiths, Cici Coleman, Sam Conrad', 'TV-14', 'Interactive dating experiment in which real dates are filmed, and then viewers get the chance to apply to date the unsuccessful participants the following week.', 'Interactive dating experiment in which real dates are filmed, and then viewers get the chance to apply to date the unsuccessful participants the following week.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/luVPGegg2oxQoMqyx9g82vlwLF7.jpg', 25, 'tmdb:tv:62470'),
  ('1092092408296321067', 'First Dates Ireland', 2016, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, 'Mateo Saina, Alice Marr, Art Campion', 'NR', 'The hit Channel 4 series First Dates, has come to Ireland and RTÉ2. In First Dates, single people from across Ireland come to the First Dates restaurant where they have a real blind date. Joining maître D'' Mateo Saina, are barman Ethan Miles, and waiters Alice, Pete and Libby, who help set the scene and give romance the best possible chance to flourish.', 'The hit Channel 4 series First Dates, has come to Ireland and RTÉ2. In First Dates, single people from across Ireland come to the First Dates restaurant where they have a real blind date. Joining maître D'' Mateo Saina, are barman Ethan Miles, and waiters Alice, Pete and Libby, who help set the scene and give romance the best possible chance to flourish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hOmhPSVelvrjvPvRPROjLgSn6RR.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:99102'),
  ('1132685279882460202', 'First Department', 2020, 'Mystery', null, null, 'Ivan Kolesnikov, Sergey Zharkov, Elena Vozhakina, Aleksander Dudenkov, Sergey Komarov, Vladimir Litvinov, Evgeniy Bakalov, Evgeniia Shakhnovich', null, 'Yuri Bragin, after a year-long business trip, where he, as part of an investigation team, was investigating a high-profile case, returns to St. Petersburg. When he returns, he learns that the current head of the First Investigation Department of the First Directorate of the State Investigation Department, Vadim Maltsev, is retiring. With a high degree of probability, it is Bragin who will be offered his place. But Yuri is not a careerist and the position of the boss is not the goal of his life. A talented investigator likes to do "live work" more. And now he is again sent on a business trip. This time in one of the cities of the Leningrad region, where two girls were killed with a difference of a week. Here, in a small town, everyone knows each other, and this complicates the search for the criminal.', 'Yuri Bragin, after a year-long business trip, where he, as part of an investigation team, was investigating a high-profile case, returns to St. Petersburg. When he returns, he learns that the current head of the First Investigation Department of the First Directorate of the State Investigation Department, Vadim Maltsev, is retiring. With a high degree of probability, it is Bragin who will be offered his place. But Yuri is not a careerist and the position of the boss is not the goal of his life. A talented investigator likes to do "live work" more. And now he is again sent on a business trip. This time in one of the cities of the Leningrad region, where two girls were killed with a difference of a week. Here, in a small town, everyone knows each other, and this complicates the search for the criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WiRkM86AnaWaET9ddhooM4REvG.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:114097'),
  ('104406917245675134', 'First Kill', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery', 'V. E. Schwab', null, 'Sarah Catherine Hook, Imani Lewis, Elizabeth Mitchell, Aubin Wise, Gracie Dzienny, Dominic Goodman, Phillip Mullings Jr., Jason R. Moore', 'TV-MA', 'Falling in love is tricky for teens Juliette and Calliope: One''s a vampire, the other''s a vampire hunter — and both are ready to make their first kill.', 'Falling in love is tricky for teens Juliette and Calliope: One''s a vampire, the other''s a vampire hunter — and both are ready to make their first kill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hwSy1vVaRzV70ZvAEsl6FGOHNlH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:111616'),
  ('2576082163603348', 'First Life', 2010, 'Documentary, Reality', null, 'David Attenborough', 'David Attenborough', null, 'Sir David Attenborough goes back in time to the roots of the tree of life, in search of the very first animals, telling their story with stunning photography, state of the art visual effects and the captivating charm of the world’s favorite naturalist.', 'Sir David Attenborough goes back in time to the roots of the tree of life, in search of the very first animals, telling their story with stunning photography, state of the art visual effects and the captivating charm of the world’s favorite naturalist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uiGTOjevSRd8vsszkKGxTCE3mlo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44082'),
  ('913518068946661751', 'First Love', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Hikari Mitsushima, Takeru Satoh, Rikako Yagi, Taisei Kido, Kaho, Minami, Akiyoshi Nakao, Towa Araki', 'TV-MA', 'Young, free and madly in love. As teenagers, the world was their oyster—but, as adults, their lives seem dimmer, like a very important piece is missing.', 'Young, free and madly in love. As teenagers, the world was their oyster—but, as adults, their lives seem dimmer, like a very important piece is missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yYCefcDMt5A5OJe8Q6iiU866Oxr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210955'),
  ('124602917561370888', 'First Love Monster', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Ai Yamamoto, Takahiro Sakurai, Yui Horie, Showtaro Morikubo, Tomokazu Sugita, Ayumu Murase, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Kaito Ishikawa', null, 'When fifteen-year-old Kaho Nikaidou leaves her sheltered home to start life anew in a Tokyo high school dormitory, the last thing she expects is to nearly get hit by a truck! Saved in the nick of time by a handsome stranger, Kaho falls head over heels for him and, after finally tracking him down, boldly confesses her feelings. Turns out Kaho''s mystery savior, Kanade, is the son of Kaho''s new landlord! The handsome object of Kaho''s affection agrees to go out with her, but her newfound bliss is short-lived when it turns out that her new boyfriend...is a fifth-grader?!', 'When fifteen-year-old Kaho Nikaidou leaves her sheltered home to start life anew in a Tokyo high school dormitory, the last thing she expects is to nearly get hit by a truck! Saved in the nick of time by a handsome stranger, Kaho falls head over heels for him and, after finally tracking him down, boldly confesses her feelings. Turns out Kaho''s mystery savior, Kanade, is the son of Kaho''s new landlord! The handsome object of Kaho''s affection agrees to go out with her, but her newfound bliss is short-lived when it turns out that her new boyfriend...is a fifth-grader?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4yXU5I8ZtYh7aNE6mZBGT4BLsiH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66949'),
  ('153202917859740590', 'First Love, Again', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Do Yoon', 'Jin Gun, Jeon Chang-ha, Kim Jeong-seok, Jung Hyun-ji, Song Han-hee, Aoora, Kim Soo-yeon', null, 'Yeon Seok, a novelist secretly living for 300 years, reunites with his reborn first love Ha Yeon. Their bond deepens as Ha Yeon becomes his editor.', 'Yeon Seok, a novelist secretly living for 300 years, reunites with his reborn first love Ha Yeon. Their bond deepens as Ha Yeon becomes his editor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wsNntK20QZXkWykAVXiJzsWPG7q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157313'),
  ('741928452150945400', 'First Note of Love', 2024, 'Drama', null, 'Ke Ying-an, Szu-Mi Huang, Zou Wan-zhen', 'Charles Tu, Michael Chang, Liu Min-ting, Lee Ying-hung, Amanda Liu', null, 'Sea finally meets his idol, Neil, only to find a broken man behind the legend. Music may be what saves them both.', 'Sea finally meets his idol, Neil, only to find a broken man behind the legend. Music may be what saves them both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4aqT5ob4r7L1nhTYHZZc0Wx2PLD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222059'),
  ('547353021944177272', 'First Romance', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Wan Peng, Riley Wang, Zheng Shuhuan, Lesley Lin, Lu Yangyang, Wu Hankun', null, 'Many years ago, Yan Ke and Xiong Yi Fan were schoolmates. But back in her younger days, she never discovered that she had a secret admirer in Yan Ke, who kept his crush a secret and loved her from afar. Now things are very different for both of them, and Yan Ke is at college, where he is one of the most popular and well-loved students on campus.', 'Many years ago, Yan Ke and Xiong Yi Fan were schoolmates. But back in her younger days, she never discovered that she had a secret admirer in Yan Ke, who kept his crush a secret and loved her from afar. Now things are very different for both of them, and Yan Ke is at college, where he is one of the most popular and well-loved students on campus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3O32Z95A86pyfCKlooNFhIEzAoR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110493'),
  ('851633988890339490', 'First Team: Juventus', 2018, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-G', 'Follow renowned soccer club Juventus on and off the pitch as they attempt to win a seventh straight Italian title and achieve Champions League glory.', 'Follow renowned soccer club Juventus on and off the pitch as they attempt to win a seventh straight Italian title and achieve Champions League glory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/asq4TGwhGvnBri8vpX55CXFlYBJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:77134'),
  ('996709673072886658', 'First Wave', 1998, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Chris Brancato', null, 'Rob LaBelle, Sebastian Spence', null, 'Framed for murder and on the run, a former thief struggles to expose the vanguard of an alien invasion with the help of a conspiracy theorist and newly discovered prophecies of Nostradamus.', 'Framed for murder and on the run, a former thief struggles to expose the vanguard of an alien invasion with the help of a conspiracy theorist and newly discovered prophecies of Nostradamus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/os8qvB3iGLbOGgmHacDLaf1QrHx.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2203'),
  ('1125119083596229237', 'First Wives Club', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Tracy Oliver', null, 'Michelle Buteau, Jill Scott, Mark Tallman, RonReaco Lee, Michelle Mitchenor', null, 'Three women band together after their first marriages fall apart, and find strength in their sisterhood - and of course a little revenge. Based on the 1996 film.', 'Three women band together after their first marriages fall apart, and find strength in their sisterhood - and of course a little revenge. Based on the 1996 film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPuRZBGvrMBbjweAFZ420T6BRwl.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:79085'),
  ('185044965764424206', 'Fish Hooks', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Noah Z. Jones', null, 'Kyle Massey, Chelsea Kane, Justin Roiland, Dana Snyder, Alex Hirsch, Tommy Lister Jr., John DiMaggio, Rachel Dratch', 'TV-G', 'This inventive animated comedy series, set inside a giant fish tank in Bud''s Pet Shop, presents high school life as seen through the eyes of three BFFs (best fish friends), Bea, Milo and Oscar. Together they experience the typical life challenges and triumphs, including friendship, dating and sports, along with more atypical situations such as giant lobster attacks and, with the use of special land suits, school field trips to the hamster cages. The series was created by children''s book illustrator Noah Z. Jones and features a notable voice cast. It''s produced using an innovative mixture of digital animation and photo collage', 'This inventive animated comedy series, set inside a giant fish tank in Bud''s Pet Shop, presents high school life as seen through the eyes of three BFFs (best fish friends), Bea, Milo and Oscar. Together they experience the typical life challenges and triumphs, including friendship, dating and sports, along with more atypical situations such as giant lobster attacks and, with the use of special land suits, school field trips to the hamster cages. The series was created by children''s book illustrator Noah Z. Jones and features a notable voice cast. It''s produced using an innovative mixture of digital animation and photo collage', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sejbZwyIgotzTRH9BdYqMKgtgIp.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:31499'),
  ('795911764428771554', 'Fish Upon The Sky', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'JittiRain', null, 'Phuwin Tangsakyuen, Naravit Lertratkosum, Sahaphap Wongratch, Thanawin Teeraphosukarn, Trai Nimtawat, Chayapol Jutamas, Thanaset Suriyapornchaikul, Kittiphop Sereevichayasawat', null, 'Total opposites Pi and Mork are love rivals and compete endlessly for the attention of their crush, Nan. Because of this, they get along like water and oil. But what if Nan was never Mork''s real target to begin with?', 'Total opposites Pi and Mork are love rivals and compete endlessly for the attention of their crush, Nan. Because of this, they get along like water and oil. But what if Nan was never Mork''s real target to begin with?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gbrZuf9SUGxGjDnUOcePykblRtv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:122017'),
  ('390902113221035516', 'Fishbowl Wives', 2022, 'Drama', 'Ryô Kurosawa', null, 'Ryoko Shinohara, Takanori Iwata, Masanobu Ando, Kyoko Hasegawa, Wakana Matsumoto, Shizuka Nakamura, Saori Seto, Anna Ishii', 'TV-MA', 'Due to an accident, Sakura Hiraga gave up on her dream. She is now married and her husband runs a hair salon. They live in a luxurious penthouse apartment. Her life seems glamorous and she is envied by everyone. What everyone does not know is that Sakura Hiraga is abused physically and verbally by her husband. She is unable to leave her situation. Sakura Hiraga considers herself a goldfish in a fishbowl. One day, due to a goldfish, she meets a man.', 'Due to an accident, Sakura Hiraga gave up on her dream. She is now married and her husband runs a hair salon. They live in a luxurious penthouse apartment. Her life seems glamorous and she is envied by everyone. What everyone does not know is that Sakura Hiraga is abused physically and verbally by her husband. She is unable to leave her situation. Sakura Hiraga considers herself a goldfish in a fishbowl. One day, due to a goldfish, she meets a man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wt5obMk1u0McCiRSL7exFsPmYL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:154861'),
  ('456578468507436068', 'Fisher', 2023, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', null, 'Natalia Kapustina, Sergey Kalvarsky', 'Ivan Yankovsky, Aleksandr Yatsenko, Irina Starshenbaum, Aleksandra Rebenok, Alexey Agranovich, Stepan Devonin, Boris Kamorzin, Dasha Vereshchagina', null, '1986. Teenagers are killed one by one in the area of the government dachas on Rublevskoye Shosse. Intelligent investigator Valery Kozyrev, his audacious partner from Rostov Evgeny Bokov and very young investigator Natalia Dobrovolskaya begin the investigation, not even knowing how much it will change the fate of each of them. The only witness capable of identifying the maniac - schoolboy Igor, whose parents are not at all happy about his son''s contact with the police.', '1986. Teenagers are killed one by one in the area of the government dachas on Rublevskoye Shosse. Intelligent investigator Valery Kozyrev, his audacious partner from Rostov Evgeny Bokov and very young investigator Natalia Dobrovolskaya begin the investigation, not even knowing how much it will change the fate of each of them. The only witness capable of identifying the maniac - schoolboy Igor, whose parents are not at all happy about his son''s contact with the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hhiiKNjUofYdcVbukYYgT5itnn.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:220018'),
  ('887166106322435247', 'Fisherman Sanpei', 1980, 'Animation', null, null, 'Masako Nozawa, Nachi Nozawa, Keiko Yamamoto, Kohei Miyauchi, Fuyumi Shiraishi', null, 'Mihira Sanpei talks with a Tohou accent and is a down-to-earth boy with a cheerful and optimistic personality. However, when it comes to fishing, he becomes very serious and is a youth who enjoys fishing more than anything else. The village where he lives in is a natural environment which provides different kinds of fishing challenges. Despite his lack of experience, Sanpei has a first-rate sense with regards to fishing and decides to maxmise his potential by entering into different fishing contests. As he faces various challenges, he learns to solve difficult problems and learn from his mistakes to the extent that he is able to fish anything out of the waters. Along the way, he encounters all kinds of rivals and companions who increase his experience points and help him in his growth.', 'Mihira Sanpei talks with a Tohou accent and is a down-to-earth boy with a cheerful and optimistic personality. However, when it comes to fishing, he becomes very serious and is a youth who enjoys fishing more than anything else. The village where he lives in is a natural environment which provides different kinds of fishing challenges. Despite his lack of experience, Sanpei has a first-rate sense with regards to fishing and decides to maxmise his potential by entering into different fishing contests. As he faces various challenges, he learns to solve difficult problems and learn from his mistakes to the extent that he is able to fish anything out of the waters. Along the way, he encounters all kinds of rivals and companions who increase his experience points and help him in his growth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eUyLQczJ1MwAPB1dRbtdguYaFV0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44033'),
  ('277662584223876544', 'Fishing with John', 1991, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'John Lurie', null, 'John Lurie, Robb Webb', null, 'Musician John Lurie knows nothing about fishing, but that doesn''t stop him from embarking on fishing in exotic locations with friends.', 'Musician John Lurie knows nothing about fishing, but that doesn''t stop him from embarking on fishing in exotic locations with friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4OwogHlnDsBe2FztirmWIhVHOb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61820'),
  ('931612453081776948', 'Fisk', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kitty Flanagan, Vincent Sheehan', null, 'Kitty Flanagan, Colette Mann, Miki Oikawa', null, 'When Helen Tudor-Fisk''s life falls apart, she takes a job in a small suburban firm specialising in wills and probate assuming that, because the clients are dead she won''t have to deal with people.', 'When Helen Tudor-Fisk''s life falls apart, she takes a job in a small suburban firm specialising in wills and probate assuming that, because the clients are dead she won''t have to deal with people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6KM6EDVSjqABv1xN6NGtUBrRN6C.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:121040'),
  ('743705014379233437', 'Fist of Fury', 1995, 'Action & Adventure', 'Lung Shiu-Kee', null, 'Donnie Yen, Joey Man Yee-Man, Eddy Ko Hung, Berg Ng Ting-Yip, Eric Wan Tin-Chiu, David Lau Chi-Wing, Yeung Chak-Lam, Philip Keung Ho-Man', null, 'Fist of Fury is a 1995 Hong Kong television series adapted from the 1972 film of the same title. Produced by ATV and STAR TV, the series starred Donnie Yen as Chen Zhen, a role previously played by Bruce Lee in Fist of Fury and Jet Li in Fist of Legend. The series is also related to the 2010 film Legend of the Fist: The Return of Chen Zhen, in which Yen reprises his role. This series was edited into a 225 minute movie titled Sworn Revenge for the US market in 2002.', 'Fist of Fury is a 1995 Hong Kong television series adapted from the 1972 film of the same title. Produced by ATV and STAR TV, the series starred Donnie Yen as Chen Zhen, a role previously played by Bruce Lee in Fist of Fury and Jet Li in Fist of Legend. The series is also related to the 2010 film Legend of the Fist: The Return of Chen Zhen, in which Yen reprises his role. This series was edited into a 225 minute movie titled Sworn Revenge for the US market in 2002.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekvTjXxMVT9oSW6VkkmSnt58bwk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21643'),
  ('458312525639633559', 'Fist of the Blue Sky', 2006, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Koichi Yamadera, Yumi Touma, Sumire Uesaka, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Akeno Watanabe, Tomohisa Aso', 'TV-MA', 'Shanghai in the 1930s is a dangerous place. Foreign governments and Chinese factions have carved the city into different quarters, each with its own laws and government, and all rife with corruption. As the major powers vie for political control, the streets are left to local gangs. Life is cheap, and death is always near. In days past, one man walked these mean streets battling the forces of evil. He was known only as Yan Wang, "the King of Death." Few knew who he really was, but many knew that he was a master of Hokuto Shinken - Fist of the North Star - a lethal martial art. He disappeared years ago after dispatching the city''s worst gangsters, and is now rumored to be in Japan. Various people have come to Japan in search of him, but who will find him first?', 'Shanghai in the 1930s is a dangerous place. Foreign governments and Chinese factions have carved the city into different quarters, each with its own laws and government, and all rife with corruption. As the major powers vie for political control, the streets are left to local gangs. Life is cheap, and death is always near. In days past, one man walked these mean streets battling the forces of evil. He was known only as Yan Wang, "the King of Death." Few knew who he really was, but many knew that he was a master of Hokuto Shinken - Fist of the North Star - a lethal martial art. He disappeared years ago after dispatching the city''s worst gangsters, and is now rumored to be in Japan. Various people have come to Japan in search of him, but who will find him first?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/60cBEHTmtRZATniXenBV3rHS6x3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:68203'),
  ('400600798564828243', 'Fist of the North Star', 1984, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Akira Kamiya, Takeshi Aono, Koji Totani, Kaneto Shiozawa, Yusaku Yara, Banjo Ginga, Takaya Hashi, Yuriko Yamamoto', 'TV-MA', 'In the year 199X, human civilization has been all but destroyed by a nuclear holocaust.', 'In the year 199X, human civilization has been all but destroyed by a nuclear holocaust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yypGXmBPvyJiD7pOeD2R3q84FlA.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:56387'),
  ('797246569176614730', 'Fist of the North Star: HOKUTO NO KEN', 2026, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', null, null, 'Shunsuke Takeuchi, Daiki Yamashita, Mao Ichimichi, Wataru Takagi, Tsuguo Mogami, Taiten Kusunoki', null, 'In the year 199X, the world was engulfed in nuclear fire!! Yet...humanity somehow survived!! A lone man with seven scars on his chest emerges. His name is Kenshiro, heir to Hokuto Shinken. In a world where only the strong survive, Kenshiro forges a path with his iron fists!', 'In the year 199X, the world was engulfed in nuclear fire!! Yet...humanity somehow survived!! A lone man with seven scars on his chest emerges. His name is Kenshiro, heir to Hokuto Shinken. In a world where only the strong survive, Kenshiro forges a path with his iron fists!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/volCKl2AP5v9oEVOLwQ8pSbF7fA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:295357'),
  ('591980592861622313', 'Fit for TV: The Reality of the Biggest Loser', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Skye Borgman', null, 'Bob Harper, Alison Sweeney, Rob Huizenga, J.D. Roth, Caroline Rhea, Jillian Michaels, Aubrey Gordon', null, 'Takes an inside look at the making of the hit reality TV competition, exploring the good, the bad, and the complicated. Featuring interviews with former contestants, trainers, producers, and health professionals, the documentary examines the show''s approach to transformation, the support systems in place, and the unique challenges of filming reality television.', 'Takes an inside look at the making of the hit reality TV competition, exploring the good, the bad, and the complicated. Featuring interviews with former contestants, trainers, producers, and health professionals, the documentary examines the show''s approach to transformation, the support systems in place, and the unique challenges of filming reality television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bxf5rfk5f0qYf3aH7vgh5zwh5Y7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:296549'),
  ('1070290437073881948', 'Five Bedrooms', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Nathan Mayfield, Christine Bartlett, Michael Lucas', null, 'Stephen Peacocke, Kat Stewart, Roy Joseph, Katie Robertson, Doris Younane', 'TV-14', 'Five different people at different times of their lives bond at a wedding after being seated together at the singles table. After a few too many drinks, the solution to all of their problems seems to be buying a five-bedroom house together.', 'Five different people at different times of their lives bond at a wedding after being seated together at the singles table. After a few too many drinks, the solution to all of their problems seems to be buying a five-bedroom house together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dY5EXIKFBvB61zaYWvZOIm8up0A.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:89602'),
  ('155210091445121022', 'Five Came Back', 2017, 'Documentary, War & Politics', null, 'Mark Harris', 'Meryl Streep, Steven Spielberg, Lawrence Kasdan, Francis Ford Coppola, Paul Greengrass, Guillermo del Toro', 'TV-MA', 'Five acclaimed contemporary directors tell the story of five legendary Hollywood filmmakers who enlisted in the armed forces to document World War II.', 'Five acclaimed contemporary directors tell the story of five legendary Hollywood filmmakers who enlisted in the armed forces to document World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQI1J0MvFmB6pREOyyBaAQpuSAE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70508'),
  ('124469877784537395', 'Five Days', 2007, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Hugh Bonneville, Patrick Malahide, Penelope Wilton, Edward Woodward, David Oyelowo, Sarah Smart, Richard Harrington, Charlie Creed-Miles', 'TV-MA', 'Thriller series which tracks five 24-hour periods in a police investigation.', 'Thriller series which tracks five 24-hour periods in a police investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mnRh1Jcn6KAhgVyfVPDLJwgaOSu.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:4170'),
  ('755430342814156063', 'Five Days at Memorial', 2022, 'Drama', 'Carlton Cuse, John Ridley', null, 'Vera Farmiga, Cherry Jones, Cornelius Smith, Jr., Robert Pine, Adepero Oduye, Julie Ann Emery, Michael Gaston, Molly Hager', 'TV-MA', 'When the floodwaters rose, power failed, and heat soared, exhausted caregivers at a New Orleans hospital were forced to make profound, heart-wrenching decisions.', 'When the floodwaters rose, power failed, and heat soared, exhausted caregivers at a New Orleans hospital were forced to make profound, heart-wrenching decisions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yLx44hdSpt9GhP67JafP5sMEoMB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108664'),
  ('455678529719188484', 'Fix You', 2020, 'Drama', 'Ki Min-soo', null, 'Shin Ha-kyun, Jung So-min, Park Ye-jin, Jang Yoo-sang, Jung Hae-kyun, Joo Min-kyung, Choi Jung-woo, Park Soo-young', null, 'A psychiatrist who is passionate about helping his patients does everything he can to help them heal their emotional wounds and find happiness.', 'A psychiatrist who is passionate about helping his patients does everything he can to help them heal their emotional wounds and find happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pMI6EzXTEElLJOd6xBeXCdbghYM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:101906'),
  ('824046458064427926', 'Fixer', 2008, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Ben Richards, Neil Cross', null, 'Peter Mullan, Tamzin Outhwaite, Jody Latham, Andrew Buchan', 'TV-PG', 'The Fixer is a British drama television series, produced by Kudos for ITV. Set in modern Britain, it follows the life of John Mercer, an ex-British Special Forces soldier, arrested by police for killing his aunt and uncle following his discovery of their abuse of his sister, Jess Mercer. John Mercer is released early from prison to serve in a covert state security squad as a government-backed assassin responsible for eliminating criminals and renegade police officers that the law cannot apprehend.', 'The Fixer is a British drama television series, produced by Kudos for ITV. Set in modern Britain, it follows the life of John Mercer, an ex-British Special Forces soldier, arrested by police for killing his aunt and uncle following his discovery of their abuse of his sister, Jess Mercer. John Mercer is released early from prison to serve in a covert state security squad as a government-backed assassin responsible for eliminating criminals and renegade police officers that the law cannot apprehend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQFGiQHmbYgeHLDnvq57uDUqFW9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:7151'),
  ('679383761996876064', 'Fixer Upper', 2013, 'Reality', null, null, 'Chip Gaines, Joanna Gaines', 'TV-G', 'Renovation, design and real estate pros Chip and Joanna Gaines are paired with Waco/Dallas, Texas-area buyers to renovate the wrong house that''s in the right location.', 'Renovation, design and real estate pros Chip and Joanna Gaines are paired with Waco/Dallas, Texas-area buyers to renovate the wrong house that''s in the right location.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mpxlr6yMBBA9VlzMcJTP2KZZBN1.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:60911'),
  ('326470190265023517', 'Flack', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Oliver Lansley', null, 'Anna Paquin, Sophie Okonedo, Rufus Jones, Rebecca Benson, Lydia Wilson, Genevieve Angelson, Meghan Treadway', 'TV-MA', 'Robyn, the sharp and witty publicity maven, is an expert at her craft but a complete self-saboteur when it comes to her personal life. Robyn’s work as a crisis PR strategist is fast-paced and unpredictable, as she counsels high-profile personalities in entertainment, fashion and sports.', 'Robyn, the sharp and witty publicity maven, is an expert at her craft but a complete self-saboteur when it comes to her personal life. Robyn’s work as a crisis PR strategist is fast-paced and unpredictable, as she counsels high-profile personalities in entertainment, fashion and sports.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2bW3nZE8iThEgqNYjaxAz3qZoo.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:86632'),
  ('613448377156081053', 'Flaked', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Will Arnett, Mark Chappell', null, 'Will Arnett, David Sullivan, Ruth Kearney, George Basil', 'TV-MA', 'In his funky California beach enclave, Chip''s the go-to guy for personal insights. But he isn''t quite as enlightened when it comes to his own baggage.', 'In his funky California beach enclave, Chip''s the go-to guy for personal insights. But he isn''t quite as enlightened when it comes to his own baggage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8zzGClqvkpPUc2wxZLrA89sSjB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:65315'),
  ('297775487943671832', 'Flame of Recca', 1997, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Nobuyuki Anzai', 'Kousuke Okano, Yuki Masuda, Akiko Hiramatsu, Hikaru Midorikawa, Nobuo Tobita, Motoko Kumai, Ryotaro Okiayu, Kotono Mitsuishi', null, 'Recca was an average ordinary boy, who happened to like ninjas. One day as an dark and mysterious women enters his life, Recca finds that he has some extraordinary powers. Now he must use these powers to protect his friends and himself from a long lost brother, who holds a hatred against him.', 'Recca was an average ordinary boy, who happened to like ninjas. One day as an dark and mysterious women enters his life, Recca finds that he has some extraordinary powers. Now he must use these powers to protect his friends and himself from a long lost brother, who holds a hatred against him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vywtHxLB4CnB2hVrevZ9eEqh33s.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42692'),
  ('1104804768965619209', 'FLAMES', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kunal Aneja, Apoorv Singh Karki', 'Swarnadeep Biswas, Saket sharma', 'Ritwik Sahore, Tanya Maniktala, Sunakshi Grover, Shivam Kakar, Deepesh Sumitra Jagdish', null, 'The story of a young romance unfolding as a chemical reaction. There is no such love as ''First Love''.', 'The story of a young romance unfolding as a chemical reaction. There is no such love as ''First Love''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i8Nq7YiYcgbLdcBMbxUmHfcYBwM.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:76369'),
  ('831290259845518157', 'Flaming Brothers', 1999, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Michael Tao Tai-Yu, Kristy Yang Rongru, Kathy Chow Hoi-Mei, Patrick Tam Yiu-Man, Deanie Ip, Shek Sau, Nina Paw Hei-Ching, Lawrence Lau Sek-Yin', null, 'Lai Siu Tin is the spoilt son of a very rich woman who is not his real mother. Ming Chi Git is the son of Ming Sing, a poor, uneducated woman who came from China. Both of this men would never have known each other if not for the fact that they both share the same mother and father. Set in modern Hong Kong, it is a tale of rivalry, jealousy, bitter hatred of two brothers and their mother who is caught between her love for two sons.', 'Lai Siu Tin is the spoilt son of a very rich woman who is not his real mother. Ming Chi Git is the son of Ming Sing, a poor, uneducated woman who came from China. Both of this men would never have known each other if not for the fact that they both share the same mother and father. Set in modern Hong Kong, it is a tale of rivalry, jealousy, bitter hatred of two brothers and their mother who is caught between her love for two sons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4VcbDfb0CzX0UzNEg6QEUruXXnK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:48173'),
  ('1102893198944182560', 'Flaming Feasts', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'Set your appetite ablaze as Chris ‘Flamebaster’ Roberts cooks his way across Wales. From top restaurants to local takeaways, it''s all about fire, food and fusion.', 'Set your appetite ablaze as Chris ‘Flamebaster’ Roberts cooks his way across Wales. From top restaurants to local takeaways, it''s all about fire, food and fusion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lw2tSb4jUrcQTqWfI6NWhXS8NQ6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:316976'),
  ('1051645502929806948', 'Flaming Rugby Boy: Dodge Danpei', 1991, 'Animation, Kids, Action & Adventure', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXi2AzHsWuxN6Wf6FzPM8HrVIoS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37450'),
  ('722534303829105962', 'Flamingo Road', 1981, 'Soap, Drama', 'Rita Lakin, Robert Wilder', null, 'John Beck, Woody Brown, Howard Duff, Morgan Fairchild, Mark Harmon, Kevin McCarthy, Cristina Raines, Barbara Rush', null, 'Flamingo Road is an American prime time soap opera that aired on NBC. It was first seen as a TV movie on May 12, 1980, and as a series on January 6, 1981, after a rebroadcast of the pilot on December 30, 1980. The show is based on the 1949 movie starring Joan Crawford, which is, in turn, based on the novel by Robert Wilder. Flamingo Road was created to compete against CBS''s Dallas and Knots Landing, nighttime dramas that were inspired by the daily afternoon soap operas that had been a staple of TV for years. The character of Constance Weldon ranked at #16 on E!''s list of The 50 Most Wicked Women in Primetime.', 'Flamingo Road is an American prime time soap opera that aired on NBC. It was first seen as a TV movie on May 12, 1980, and as a series on January 6, 1981, after a rebroadcast of the pilot on December 30, 1980. The show is based on the 1949 movie starring Joan Crawford, which is, in turn, based on the novel by Robert Wilder. Flamingo Road was created to compete against CBS''s Dallas and Knots Landing, nighttime dramas that were inspired by the daily afternoon soap operas that had been a staple of TV for years. The character of Constance Weldon ranked at #16 on E!''s list of The 50 Most Wicked Women in Primetime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSwMFcAmzHAj6WX45GBwLE2SncG.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2006'),
  ('1078441251722190072', 'Flash Gordon', 1979, 'Animation', null, null, 'Robert Ridgely, Vic Perrin, Bob Holt, Alan Oppenheimer, Diane Pershing, Melendy Britt', null, 'The New Adventures of Flash Gordon, also known as The Adventures of Flash Gordon, is an animated television series. The series is actually called Flash Gordon but the expanded title is used in official records to distinguish it from previous versions. Filmation produced the series in 1979, partly as a reaction to the mammoth success of Star Wars Episode IV: A New Hope in 1977. The series was a homage to the original Flash Gordon comic strip and featured most of the original characters, including Flash''s girlfriend Dale Arden, and the scientist Hans Zarkov. The series is still regarded as one of the most faithful adaptations, and one of Filmation''s finest overall efforts. The basic story follows Flash and his companions as they travel to Mongo, where they are forced into battle by its ruler, Ming the Merciless, his daughter Princess Aura, and his army of Metal Men. To help their cause the heroes lead the formation of an alliance beginning with King Thun, leader of the Lion People; Prince Barin, ruler of Arboria; and King Vultan, leader of the Hawkmen. The original project was produced as a made-for-television feature film. When NBC saw the finished work, it was decided to turn the work into an animated TV series. The change in format resulted in the story being significantly expanded with a subplot of Ming secretly giving military technology to Hitler being dropped, as well as being set in the present day rather during World War II. When the series was cancelled after its 2nd season, the original footage was reassembled with the original soundtrack, including the final role of Ted Cassidy, and aired on primetime in 1982 as a TV movie, Flash Gordon: The Greatest Adventure of All.', 'The New Adventures of Flash Gordon, also known as The Adventures of Flash Gordon, is an animated television series. The series is actually called Flash Gordon but the expanded title is used in official records to distinguish it from previous versions. Filmation produced the series in 1979, partly as a reaction to the mammoth success of Star Wars Episode IV: A New Hope in 1977. The series was a homage to the original Flash Gordon comic strip and featured most of the original characters, including Flash''s girlfriend Dale Arden, and the scientist Hans Zarkov. The series is still regarded as one of the most faithful adaptations, and one of Filmation''s finest overall efforts. The basic story follows Flash and his companions as they travel to Mongo, where they are forced into battle by its ruler, Ming the Merciless, his daughter Princess Aura, and his army of Metal Men. To help their cause the heroes lead the formation of an alliance beginning with King Thun, leader of the Lion People; Prince Barin, ruler of Arboria; and King Vultan, leader of the Hawkmen. The original project was produced as a made-for-television feature film. When NBC saw the finished work, it was decided to turn the work into an animated TV series. The change in format resulted in the story being significantly expanded with a subplot of Ming secretly giving military technology to Hitler being dropped, as well as being set in the present day rather during World War II. When the series was cancelled after its 2nd season, the original footage was reassembled with the original soundtrack, including the final role of Ted Cassidy, and aired on primetime in 1982 as a TV movie, Flash Gordon: The Greatest Adventure of All.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/phFEsFPIT5DCQGdOSrtgJrLsSxK.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:11844'),
  ('264154370529394276', 'Flash Gordon', 2007, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Peter Hume', null, 'Eric Johnson, Gina Holden, Karen Cliche, Jody Racicot, John Ralston', null, 'Flash Gordon is an American science fiction television series that debuted on Sci Fi in the United States on August 10, 2007 and continued airing new episodes through February 8, 2008. It has also appeared on the United Kingdom Sci Fi Channel and SPACE in Canada. The series was developed by Peter Hume, who served as executive producer/show runner and wrote the first and last episodes, among others.', 'Flash Gordon is an American science fiction television series that debuted on Sci Fi in the United States on August 10, 2007 and continued airing new episodes through February 8, 2008. It has also appeared on the United Kingdom Sci Fi Channel and SPACE in Canada. The series was developed by Peter Hume, who served as executive producer/show runner and wrote the first and last episodes, among others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kKqbxsXSzW1H6Se46mOcZm7Rhy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1225'),
  ('808463914850646517', 'FlashForward', 2009, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'David S. Goyer, Brannon Braga', 'Jacob Cooney', 'Joseph Fiennes, John Cho, Courtney B. Vance, Dominic Monaghan, Sonya Walger, Jack Davenport, Brían F. O''Byrne, Zachary Knighton', 'TV-14', 'When the entire world blacks out for two minutes and seventeen seconds, everyone sees a flash of their own future 6 months from the present. For some, the future is hopeful, while for others, it is unexpected. For a few, it doesn''t seem to exist. Knowing their fate will alter each person''s life, destinies will be changed.', 'When the entire world blacks out for two minutes and seventeen seconds, everyone sees a flash of their own future 6 months from the present. For some, the future is hopeful, while for others, it is unexpected. For a few, it doesn''t seem to exist. Knowing their fate will alter each person''s life, destinies will be changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7iu2HJ8ZSNbBgFLi42JNcuPjBax.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19092'),
  ('485283271904841990', 'Flashpoint', 2008, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Stephanie Morgenstern, Mark Ellis', null, 'David Paetkau, Enrico Colantoni, Amy Jo Johnson, Hugh Dillon, Sergio Di Zio, Tattiawna Jones, Jack Knight, Oluniké Adeliyi', 'TV-14', 'The Strategic Response Unit (SRU) is an elite team of cops who specialize in high-risk critical incidents. Trained in tactics and psychology, they deal with extreme situations, where split-second decisions could save a life...or cost one.', 'The Strategic Response Unit (SRU) is an elite team of cops who specialize in high-risk critical incidents. Trained in tactics and psychology, they deal with extreme situations, where split-second decisions could save a life...or cost one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Bp3vJrPxnrN8iRDaclsVUPwgWa.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:5829'),
  ('651678537743870874', 'Flatbush Misdemeanors', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kevin Iso, Dan Perlman', null, 'Kevin Iso, Dan Perlman, Hassan Johnson, Kristin Dodson, Kareem Green', 'TV-MA', 'Neighborhood best friends and urban millennials Dan and Kevin hilariously climb the ladder to nowhere in Flatbush, Brooklyn. But even inside the losing, they find there are little wins that come from tackling hipsters, mental health issues and the rising tide of gentrification.', 'Neighborhood best friends and urban millennials Dan and Kevin hilariously climb the ladder to nowhere in Flatbush, Brooklyn. But even inside the losing, they find there are little wins that come from tackling hipsters, mental health issues and the rising tide of gentrification.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxvxx9NjQbl3nPCIP1v6uu2xx6T.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:111500'),
  ('583210812391584677', 'Flavor of Love', 2006, 'Reality', 'Mark Cronin, Cris Abrego', null, 'Flavor Flav', null, 'Twenty single women move into a mansion in Los Angeles and compete for the affections of Flavor Flav, who decides who is his one true love.', 'Twenty single women move into a mansion in Los Angeles and compete for the affections of Flavor Flav, who decides who is his one true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3MuUDvrjkgyl6bUODTslZMgl32.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1776'),
  ('291952785972150142', 'Flavorful Origins', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Yang Chen', 'TV-G', 'Embark on a delightful journey through the culinary traditions of China and uncover the stories of the people who create and cherish its dishes.', 'Embark on a delightful journey through the culinary traditions of China and uncover the stories of the people who create and cherish its dishes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xgoiOgmQ0zi3Eq5q3FxxGy8gBbF.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:86742'),
  ('261191914708012224', 'FLCL', 2000, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Jun Mizuki, Mayumi Shintani, Izumi Kasagi', 'TV-14', 'Naota is a normal boy who kills some time with a normal girl by a stream that flows underneath a bridge. Nothing unusual happens in this town. The fact that Haruhara Haruko crashes into the main character with her Vespa a short while later and subsequently hits him over the head with her Rickenbacker 4003 bass guitar doesn’t really make any difference to any other day here. The at first glance unconnected, bizarre events that don’t seem to follow any pattern whatsoever don’t change anything about Naota’s boring life, either – because nothing incredible ever happens in this town.', 'Naota is a normal boy who kills some time with a normal girl by a stream that flows underneath a bridge. Nothing unusual happens in this town. The fact that Haruhara Haruko crashes into the main character with her Vespa a short while later and subsequently hits him over the head with her Rickenbacker 4003 bass guitar doesn’t really make any difference to any other day here. The at first glance unconnected, bizarre events that don’t seem to follow any pattern whatsoever don’t change anything about Naota’s boring life, either – because nothing incredible ever happens in this town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/FkgA8CcmiLJGVCRYRQ2g2UfVtF.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:5895'),
  ('90475101679521416', 'Fleabag', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Phoebe Waller-Bridge', null, 'Phoebe Waller-Bridge, Sian Clifford, Andrew Scott', 'TV-MA', 'A portrait into the mind of a dry-witted, sexual, angry, porn-watching, grief-riddled woman, trying to make sense of the world. As she hurls herself headlong at modern living, Fleabag is thrown roughly up against the walls of contemporary London, with all its frenetic energy, late nights, and bright lights.', 'A portrait into the mind of a dry-witted, sexual, angry, porn-watching, grief-riddled woman, trying to make sense of the world. As she hurls herself headlong at modern living, Fleabag is thrown roughly up against the walls of contemporary London, with all its frenetic energy, late nights, and bright lights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/27vEYsRKa3eAniwmoccOoluEXQ1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67070'),
  ('335693071250212510', 'Fleeting Lies', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nerea Castro', null, 'Elena Anaya, Pilar Castro, Hugo Silva, Quim Gutiérrez, Susi Sánchez, María Botto, Pedro Casablanc, Estefanía de los Santos', null, 'It follows Lucía an executive of a high-tech company who has fought to get as far away from her humble origins as possible. On the day of her promotion, she is accused of espionage and fired.', 'It follows Lucía an executive of a high-tech company who has fought to get as far away from her humble origins as possible. On the day of her promotion, she is accused of espionage and fired.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etkB5WuxoVuZPs7FSHxfSUAP7lU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:224673'),
  ('185845909369765364', 'Fleishman Is in Trouble', 2022, 'Drama', 'Taffy Brodesser-Akner', null, 'Jesse Eisenberg, Claire Danes, Lizzy Caplan, Adam Brody, Meara Mahoney Gross, Maxim Swinton', 'TV-MA', 'Recently separated forty-something Toby Fleishman dives into the brave new world of app-based dating with the kind of success he never had dating in his youth. But just at the start of his first summer of sexual freedom, his ex-wife disappears, leaving him with the kids and no hint of where she is or whether she plans to return.', 'Recently separated forty-something Toby Fleishman dives into the brave new world of app-based dating with the kind of success he never had dating in his youth. But just at the start of his first summer of sexual freedom, his ex-wife disappears, leaving him with the kids and no hint of where she is or whether she plans to return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxDaeEiH3JeACOTQdiZys8tse7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156401'),
  ('42853798611815816', 'Fleming', 2014, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Dominic Cooper, Lara Pulver, Samuel West, Anna Chancellor, Rupert Evans, Lesley Manville, Pip Torrens, Camilla Rutherford', 'TV-MA', 'Set at the outbreak of WWII – mischievous playboy Ian Fleming is untroubled by the specter of impending war – chasing women, collecting rare books and living off his family fortune. Forever in the shadow of his brother Peter, and an eternal disappointment to his formidable mother Eve, Fleming dreams of becoming the ‘ultimate’ man – a hero, a lover, a brute and the one who always gets the girl. He is finally given some direction in his life when he’s recruited by the Director of Naval Intelligence to help in the effort against the Nazis. Suddenly, Fleming finds his chance to shine and prove his worth.', 'Set at the outbreak of WWII – mischievous playboy Ian Fleming is untroubled by the specter of impending war – chasing women, collecting rare books and living off his family fortune. Forever in the shadow of his brother Peter, and an eternal disappointment to his formidable mother Eve, Fleming dreams of becoming the ‘ultimate’ man – a hero, a lover, a brute and the one who always gets the girl. He is finally given some direction in his life when he’s recruited by the Director of Naval Intelligence to help in the effort against the Nazis. Suddenly, Fleming finds his chance to shine and prove his worth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ap2RdhXi8mEGsGrgfPpsVF01mSZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60602'),
  ('275700862322510124', 'Flesh and Blood', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Sarah Williams', 'Sarah Williams', 'Imelda Staunton, Francesca Annis, Claudie Blakley, Russell Tovey, Lydia Leonard, Stephen Rea, Sharon Small, Keir Charles', 'TV-14', 'Three adult siblings find their family thrown into disarray when their recently widowed mother, Vivien, declares she is in love with a new man. The tension his presence creates threatens to drag the whole family towards tragedy, and perhaps crime.', 'Three adult siblings find their family thrown into disarray when their recently widowed mother, Vivien, declares she is in love with a new man. The tension his presence creates threatens to drag the whole family towards tragedy, and perhaps crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MZv8kEMPWkpjECLbg5S1dQzYnE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31035'),
  ('394297989208029257', 'Flesh and Bone', 2015, 'Drama', 'Moira Walley-Beckett', 'Moira Walley-Beckett, Jami O''Brien, Bronwyn Garrity', 'Sarah Hay, Irina Dvorovenko, Raychel Diane Weiner, Emily Tyra, Ben Daniels, Damon Herriman, Tina Benko, Clifton Duncan', 'TV-MA', 'Claire, a talented but emotionally troubled dancer, joins a company in New York City, and soon finds herself immersed in the tough and often cutthroat world of professional ballet. The dark and gritty series will unflinchingly explore the dysfunction and glamour of the ballet world.', 'Claire, a talented but emotionally troubled dancer, joins a company in New York City, and soon finds herself immersed in the tough and often cutthroat world of professional ballet. The dark and gritty series will unflinchingly explore the dysfunction and glamour of the ballet world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yP4vPgb7Inpmhxgy9iTEsy1faSy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62516'),
  ('475458747577522348', 'Fletchers'' Family Farm', 2023, 'Reality', null, null, 'Kelvin Fletcher', null, 'Kelvin Fletcher and his family share an intimate insight into rural life.', 'Kelvin Fletcher and his family share an intimate insight into rural life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Ifc1eZqBtVlgZN16RZblkWggzj.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:237758'),
  ('387598198008210034', 'Flex x Cop', 2024, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Lee Ok-gyu', 'Kim Ba-da', 'Ahn Bo-hyun, Park Ji-hyun, Kang Sang-jun, Kim Shin-bi, Kwak Si-yang, Choi Dong-goo, Jeon Hye-jin, Lee Shi-a', null, 'A chaebol cop joins forces with a gritty detective to take down criminals with a touch of wealth and a whole lot of wit.', 'A chaebol cop joins forces with a gritty detective to take down criminals with a touch of wealth and a whole lot of wit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEuuCZb7PsVzRYJ1DiWJZ7QYFqn.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:220074'),
  ('1064756627822534358', 'Flight 29 Down', 2005, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Stan Rogow, D.J. MacHale', null, 'Allen Alvarado, Corbin Bleu, Hallee Hirsh, Jeremy Kissner, Johnny Pacar, Kristy Wu, Lauren Storm', 'TV-Y7', 'Some teenagers are stranded on a desert island in Micronesia. Their plane crashed and led them into a one-in-a-lifetime eco-adventure. They will have to learn to navigate the challenges that come before them in the tropical paradise in Hawaii using intelligence, wit, and instincts. They also have to learn to live with each other.', 'Some teenagers are stranded on a desert island in Micronesia. Their plane crashed and led them into a one-in-a-lifetime eco-adventure. They will have to learn to navigate the challenges that come before them in the tropical paradise in Hawaii using intelligence, wit, and instincts. They also have to learn to live with each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gNI4PCGldy4kzi0nD5FQrLBuL5d.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1732'),
  ('1010867962787447267', 'Flight HS13', 2016, 'Drama', null, 'Elle van Rijn', 'Katja Schuurman, Daniël Boissevain, Jeroen Spitzenberger, Annelies Appelhof, Reinout Bussemaker, Roos Ouwehand, Ali Ben Horsting, Sachli Gholamalizad', null, 'Mourning the death of her husband Simon, supposedly killed in a plane crash, Liv is shocked to discover that Simon lied to her and was not a passenger on the tragic flight. Seeking the truth surrounding her husband’s mysterious disappearance, Liv uncovers secrets that threaten to destroy her entire family…', 'Mourning the death of her husband Simon, supposedly killed in a plane crash, Liv is shocked to discover that Simon lied to her and was not a passenger on the tragic flight. Seeking the truth surrounding her husband’s mysterious disappearance, Liv uncovers secrets that threaten to destroy her entire family…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8mD9Aao94K4AkGfqbIw9odk5PWd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67729'),
  ('177481304360564353', 'Flight of the Conchords', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Jemaine Clement, Bret McKenzie, James Bobin', null, 'Bret McKenzie, Jemaine Clement, Rhys Darby, Kristen Schaal', 'TV-MA', 'The trials and tribulations of a two man, digi-folk band who have moved from New Zealand to New York City in the hope of forging a successful music career. So far they''ve managed to find a manager (whose "other" job is at the New Zealand Consulate), one fan (a married obsessive) and one friend (who owns the local pawn shop) -- but not much else.', 'The trials and tribulations of a two man, digi-folk band who have moved from New Zealand to New York City in the hope of forging a successful music career. So far they''ve managed to find a manager (whose "other" job is at the New Zealand Consulate), one fan (a married obsessive) and one friend (who owns the local pawn shop) -- but not much else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ynboK8qiOTz0X44r59LpfF8jBP5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2742'),
  ('663437184940928019', 'Flikken', 1999, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Pierre De Clercq, Erwin Provoost', null, 'Mark Tijsmans, Jo De Meyere, Ludo Hellinx, Ianka Fleerackers, Pascale Michiels, Roel Vanderstukken', null, 'Flikken was a popular Flemish-Belgian TV series about a police-department located in Ghent. The show started in 1999 and ended recently on 19 April 2009. In the series, a team of six police officers solved various crimes, petty crimes as well as organised crime. The series always aimed at showing the policework in a realistic way - though a little personal drama was never far off. Of all the actors that came along during the ten seasons, only Mark Tijsmans and Ludo Hellinx appeared throughout the entire series. Flikken was produced by the VRT and broadcast on Belgian public channel Eén and TROS in the Netherlands. Flikken is very popular in Belgium and the Netherlands. The show has had very high ratings of up to 1.8 million viewers during the last season. Every year the VRT organises the Flikkendag, a family day where the public can meet the actors of the show. There are many games, demonstrations of the real police and other safety organisations and performances of singers. On 18 April 2009, a special farewell party was organised in Ghent, in which the actors and crew said goodbye to their fans - thousands had assembled to watch the show on stage.', 'Flikken was a popular Flemish-Belgian TV series about a police-department located in Ghent. The show started in 1999 and ended recently on 19 April 2009. In the series, a team of six police officers solved various crimes, petty crimes as well as organised crime. The series always aimed at showing the policework in a realistic way - though a little personal drama was never far off. Of all the actors that came along during the ten seasons, only Mark Tijsmans and Ludo Hellinx appeared throughout the entire series. Flikken was produced by the VRT and broadcast on Belgian public channel Eén and TROS in the Netherlands. Flikken is very popular in Belgium and the Netherlands. The show has had very high ratings of up to 1.8 million viewers during the last season. Every year the VRT organises the Flikkendag, a family day where the public can meet the actors of the show. There are many games, demonstrations of the real police and other safety organisations and performances of singers. On 18 April 2009, a special farewell party was organised in Ghent, in which the actors and crew said goodbye to their fans - thousands had assembled to watch the show on stage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2PX8TBybnWPajHER2qU7zX56ctV.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:12908'),
  ('394089312267831628', 'Flikken Maastricht', 2007, 'Crime, Action & Adventure', 'Reinout Oerlemans', null, 'Angela Schijf, Oda Spelbos, Sergio Romero IJssel, Irma Hartog', 'NR', 'Former Amsterdam police detective Floris Wolfs has been transferred to the police department of the south-Dutch country town Maastricht. His metropolitan experience nicely complements the local expertise of his new country colleagues, who know the folks. Slowly he fits in, while solving countless crimes together with his female partner Eva van Dongen.', 'Former Amsterdam police detective Floris Wolfs has been transferred to the police department of the south-Dutch country town Maastricht. His metropolitan experience nicely complements the local expertise of his new country colleagues, who know the folks. Slowly he fits in, while solving countless crimes together with his female partner Eva van Dongen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lUoL2MxJJJlV8O35bwfUANdrsb6.jpg', 20, 'tmdb:tv:26324'),
  ('608009170310794762', 'Flikken Rotterdam', 2016, 'Crime', null, null, 'Mark van Eeuwen, Cees Geel, Huub Stapel, Ortál Vriend, Anneke Sluiters', null, 'Flikken Rotterdam takes place in Rotterdam, and is after Flikken Maastricht the second Dutch spin-off of the Flemish show Flikken.', 'Flikken Rotterdam takes place in Rotterdam, and is after Flikken Maastricht the second Dutch spin-off of the Flemish show Flikken.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jFvhgG7je9LwQQ7YkevnipXbyhL.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:64175'),
  ('652546314677589732', 'Flinch', 2019, 'Reality, Comedy', null, null, 'Lloyd Griffith, Seann Walsh', 'TV-PG', 'Harrowing and hilarious tests await the brave and foolhardy, as well as the judges, in this comedy game show. If they flinch, they feel the pain.', 'Harrowing and hilarious tests await the brave and foolhardy, as well as the judges, in this comedy game show. If they flinch, they feel the pain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x4XmsoAY91wEyPH1DhEc1bAXLjb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89005'),
  ('1032795909300013068', 'Flinderella', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Soap', 'Cris Morena', 'Walter Ferreyra Ramos, Gabriela Fiore, Solange Keoleyan', 'Florencia Bertotti, Benjamín Rojas, Fabio Di Tomaso, Isabel Macedo, Stéfano de Gregorio, Lali Espósito, Henny Trayles, Agustín Sierra', 'NR', 'Florencia is a singer and orphan, who falls in love with Federico, a businessman. They will be able to overcome all obstacles, but their love will take an unexpected turn.', 'Florencia is a singer and orphan, who falls in love with Federico, a businessman. They will be able to overcome all obstacles, but their love will take an unexpected turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHpGf342KoTemqxiGCtZw0pejqm.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1446'),
  ('463446690554759093', 'Flint Town', 2018, 'Documentary, Crime, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Timothy Johnson, Bridgette Balasko, Devon Bernritter, John Boismier, Esther Campbell, Robert Frost, Dion Reed, Maria Reed', 'TV-MA', 'Over a two-year period, filmmakers embedded with cops in Flint, Michigan, reveal a department grappling with volatile issues in untenable conditions.', 'Over a two-year period, filmmakers embedded with cops in Flint, Michigan, reveal a department grappling with volatile issues in untenable conditions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkQja9qgd4GB0ZdZBk7uYp9SlLI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77591'),
  ('644447883695007469', 'Flip Flappers', 2016, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Minami Takahashi, Mao Ichimichi, Ayaka Ohashi, Airi Toshino, Sayaka Inoue, Jun Fukushima, Kenjiro Tsuda, Yoko Hikasa', 'TV-14', 'How does the world look in your eyes? Papika and Cocona, the heroines of the story, hold the keys to open the door. When the two girls meet, their adventures in a different time and different overlapping dimension called "Pure Illusion" begin. Many things in Pure Illusion will stand in the girls'' way on their search for the mysterious crystal called the "Shard of Mimi," an item that is said to grant any wish. However, when the girls find themselves in danger, the Shard of Mimi shines, and they are able to transform.', 'How does the world look in your eyes? Papika and Cocona, the heroines of the story, hold the keys to open the door. When the two girls meet, their adventures in a different time and different overlapping dimension called "Pure Illusion" begin. Many things in Pure Illusion will stand in the girls'' way on their search for the mysterious crystal called the "Shard of Mimi," an item that is said to grant any wish. However, when the girls find themselves in danger, the Shard of Mimi shines, and they are able to transform.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMtCTs0ZRA4rRGne5PPO2iZm4SP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68272'),
  ('413078697537102635', 'Flip or Flop', 2013, 'Reality', null, null, 'Tarek El Moussa, Christina Hall', 'TV-G', 'Tarek and Christina El Moussa buy distressed properties -- foreclosures, short sales and bank-owned homes -- remodel them and sell them at a profit. At least, that''s the way it''s supposed to work. Track the El Moussas'' roller-coaster journey in each episode, beginning with a cash purchase at auction of a home -- often sight unseen -- and the fix-it-up process, to the nail-biting wait to find a buyer.', 'Tarek and Christina El Moussa buy distressed properties -- foreclosures, short sales and bank-owned homes -- remodel them and sell them at a profit. At least, that''s the way it''s supposed to work. Track the El Moussas'' roller-coaster journey in each episode, beginning with a cash purchase at auction of a home -- often sight unseen -- and the fix-it-up process, to the nail-biting wait to find a buyer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hgbymM0HJrXZVFHPCSXD6XmKkUo.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:62618'),
  ('652648863956624759', 'Flipped', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Steve Mallory, Damon Jones', null, 'Will Forte, Kaitlin Olson, Arturo Castro, Andy Garcia, Eva Longoria', 'TV-MA', 'Chronically underemployed couple Jann and Cricket Melfi are self-proclaimed home renovation “experts” who are more than confident they are television’s next great home design celebrity duo. The clueless pair''s dreams of basic cable fame and glory are derailed when they get themselves kidnapped by members of a drug cartel and are forced to renovate their sprawling homes.', 'Chronically underemployed couple Jann and Cricket Melfi are self-proclaimed home renovation “experts” who are more than confident they are television’s next great home design celebrity duo. The clueless pair''s dreams of basic cable fame and glory are derailed when they get themselves kidnapped by members of a drug cartel and are forced to renovate their sprawling homes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vdak857enxBFq19mlNYsNx04SiQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98923'),
  ('128266005550282599', 'Flipper', 1964, 'Action & Adventure, Family, Drama', 'Ricou Browning, Jack Cowden', null, 'Luke Halpin, Brian Kelly, Tommy Norden, Andy Devine', 'TV-G', 'Flipper, from Ivan Tors Films in association with Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer Television, is an American television program first broadcast on NBC from September 19, 1964, until April 15, 1967. Flipper, a bottlenose dolphin, is the companion animal of Porter Ricks, Chief Warden at fictional Coral Key Park and Marine Preserve in southern Florida, and his two young sons, Sandy and Bud. The show has been dubbed an "aquatic Lassie", and a considerable amount of juvenile merchandise inspired by the show was produced during its first-run.', 'Flipper, from Ivan Tors Films in association with Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer Television, is an American television program first broadcast on NBC from September 19, 1964, until April 15, 1967. Flipper, a bottlenose dolphin, is the companion animal of Porter Ricks, Chief Warden at fictional Coral Key Park and Marine Preserve in southern Florida, and his two young sons, Sandy and Bud. The show has been dubbed an "aquatic Lassie", and a considerable amount of juvenile merchandise inspired by the show was produced during its first-run.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/20EltUp6f3dqY3YQBcVY8T2scuH.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2886'),
  ('222586842094804418', 'Flipper', 1995, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Ernie Wallengren, Michael Nankin, Reuben Leder', null, 'Whip Hubley, Anja Coleby, Gus Mercurio, Darrin Klimek, Tiffany Lamb, Craig Marriott, Laura Donaldson, Skye Patch', 'TV-G', 'Flipper is a 1995–2000 American family adventure drama series developed by E.F. Wallengren, Michael Nankin and Reuben Leder, a sequel to Jack Cowden''s 1964–67 NBC series of the same name. In and around the Bal Harbor Institute, a marine mammal research facility in beautiful Florida Keys, groundbreaking studies are being conducted on dolphin behavior and everyone''s favorite dolphin finds adventure.', 'Flipper is a 1995–2000 American family adventure drama series developed by E.F. Wallengren, Michael Nankin and Reuben Leder, a sequel to Jack Cowden''s 1964–67 NBC series of the same name. In and around the Bal Harbor Institute, a marine mammal research facility in beautiful Florida Keys, groundbreaking studies are being conducted on dolphin behavior and everyone''s favorite dolphin finds adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xqlE8PFHg7trmNoN02pmGre87iK.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:6223'),
  ('820169645669152523', 'Flipper and Lopaka', 1999, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Family, Comedy', null, null, 'Keith Scott', null, 'Flipper and Lopaka follows the adventures of Lopaka, a boy granted the ability to speak with marine animals, on his tribe''s island home and the undersea city of Quetzo.', 'Flipper and Lopaka follows the adventures of Lopaka, a boy granted the ability to speak with marine animals, on his tribe''s island home and the undersea city of Quetzo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRtWbh8xXEvzwnvQvdYQDpcTZLs.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:16614'),
  ('510016279602301506', 'Flipping Out', 2007, 'Reality, Family', null, null, 'Jeff Lewis, Jenni Pulos', null, 'Flipping Out is an American reality television series centered on designer Jeff Lewis in Los Angeles, California, and his entourage that consists of his project manager Jenni, housekeeper Zoila, business manager and boyfriend Gage and his other assistant and helper.', 'Flipping Out is an American reality television series centered on designer Jeff Lewis in Los Angeles, California, and his entourage that consists of his project manager Jenni, housekeeper Zoila, business manager and boyfriend Gage and his other assistant and helper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lk9XTcvn4oymQxgtdi3ktKmPXmE.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:13050'),
  ('733152282175330874', 'Flodder', 1993, 'Comedy, Crime, Family', 'Dick Maas', null, 'Nelly Frijda, Coen van Vrijberghe de Coningh, Stefan de Walle, Tatjana Simić, Herman Passchier, Lou Landré', null, 'The misadventures of the anti-social Flodder family living in a upscale suburban neighborhood.', 'The misadventures of the anti-social Flodder family living in a upscale suburban neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5nisBeDOlsH1MOzCcE0iqRP12l.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:22657'),
  ('665019556130084155', 'Floor Is Lava', 2020, 'Reality, Family, Kids', 'Megan McGrath, Irad Eyal', null, 'Rutledge Wood', 'TV-PG', 'Teams compete to navigate rooms flooded with lava by leaping from chairs, hanging from curtains and swinging from chandeliers.', 'Teams compete to navigate rooms flooded with lava by leaping from chairs, hanging from curtains and swinging from chandeliers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wvEISymvZ9qc2cgQuhQAifYPilU.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:104999'),
  ('520055240132277639', 'Florentina', 2026, 'Soap, Family', null, 'Daphne Agten', 'Joke Emmers, Inge Paulussen, Britt Hellinx, Frederik Brom, Yannick Jozefzoon, Eva Kamanda, Manou Kersting, Rob van der Auwera', null, 'Florentina: a charming woman with a lot to offer, but who has never really felt accepted. It doesn''t help that she works in her mother''s wellness and fitness empire - where a slim figure is always central - but does not meet the classic beauty ideals herself. Her life is turned upside down when her fiancé leaves her and she unexpectedly inherits a secret nightclub. But the latter turns out to be a gift from heaven. She makes new friends, she is surrounded by colorful outsiders who inspire her. She learns to love herself and a new world opens up for her. But can Florentina now also resist the expectations of her mother and the toxic family business? And will she ultimately find true love?', 'Florentina: a charming woman with a lot to offer, but who has never really felt accepted. It doesn''t help that she works in her mother''s wellness and fitness empire - where a slim figure is always central - but does not meet the classic beauty ideals herself. Her life is turned upside down when her fiancé leaves her and she unexpectedly inherits a secret nightclub. But the latter turns out to be a gift from heaven. She makes new friends, she is surrounded by colorful outsiders who inspire her. She learns to love herself and a new world opens up for her. But can Florentina now also resist the expectations of her mother and the toxic family business? And will she ultimately find true love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8siha2TPIPm9XwvzxAk12etrxY6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:290211'),
  ('1013815163058727292', 'Floribella', 2005, 'Comedy, Kids', 'Jaqueline Vargas, Patrícia Moretzsohn', null, 'Juliana Silveira, Maria Carolina Ribeiro, Suzy Rêgo, Gustavo Leão, Johnny Massaro, Letícia Colin, João Vithor Oliveira, Bruno Padilha', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9u6dFJLOhWQ9SKMRqc6O2AEU1YN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:195859'),
  ('469486319090582611', 'Florida Man', 2023, 'Mystery, Comedy, Drama', 'Donald Todd', null, 'Edgar Ramírez, Abbey Lee, Otmara Marrero, Lex Scott Davis, Emory Cohen, Isaiah Johnson, Anthony LaPaglia, Lauren Buglioli', 'TV-MA', 'A disgraced cop in debt is forced to return to his home state of Florida for a shady mission only to get swept up in a wild — and deadly — treasure hunt.', 'A disgraced cop in debt is forced to return to his home state of Florida for a shady mission only to get swept up in a wild — and deadly — treasure hunt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bn4qHIxbmZOC4AqlDUbgcKYld7r.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:123856'),
  ('889289874955129498', 'Floris', 1969, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Paul Verhoeven, Gerard Soeteman', 'Gerard Soeteman', 'Rutger Hauer, Jos Bergman', null, 'A Dutch television series about an exiled knight and his Indian friend. Together they try to get his birthright papers back from an evil Lord. During their quest, they get help from a nobleman who offers them a place in his castle. Written by Gerard Soeteman starring Rutger Hauer and Jos Bergman and directed by Paul Verhoeven.', 'A Dutch television series about an exiled knight and his Indian friend. Together they try to get his birthright papers back from an evil Lord. During their quest, they get help from a nobleman who offers them a place in his castle. Written by Gerard Soeteman starring Rutger Hauer and Jos Bergman and directed by Paul Verhoeven.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUUhRBBxF3fYZEaSMvTqpt5Z4md.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1560'),
  ('743947262904414515', 'Flourished Peony', 2025, 'Drama', 'Zhang Yuan''ang, Ma Yu Xin, Jia Binbin', 'Ma Yu Xin', 'Yang Zi, Li Xian, Miles Wei, Zhang Yaqin, Tu Songyan, Guan Yue, Amelie Xu, Shen Mengchen', null, 'He Weifang, the daughter of a merchant, partners with the infamous Jiang Changyang to run a flower business, empowering women and challenging societal norms. As their bond deepens, He Weifang uncovers Jiang Changyang''s true identity and is inspired to focus on ventures that benefit the greater good.', 'He Weifang, the daughter of a merchant, partners with the infamous Jiang Changyang to run a flower business, empowering women and challenging societal norms. As their bond deepens, He Weifang uncovers Jiang Changyang''s true identity and is inspired to focus on ventures that benefit the greater good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Kuw2vKrYaw6hBAL2IE3LNtvEzU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:243083'),
  ('86392708203816751', 'Flower and Asura', 2025, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Minori Fujidera, Miyuri Shimabukuro', null, 'The story is set in Tonakishima, a small island with a population of 600. Hana, a high school girl who lives on the island, loves recitals, and holds regular reading sessions for the island''s children. Mizuki, the president of the Broadcasting Club, senses Hana''s power to attract people through her reading and invites her to join the club. Hana joins the Broadcasting Club and experiences many firsts with the other members.', 'The story is set in Tonakishima, a small island with a population of 600. Hana, a high school girl who lives on the island, loves recitals, and holds regular reading sessions for the island''s children. Mizuki, the president of the Broadcasting Club, senses Hana''s power to attract people through her reading and invites her to join the club. Hana joins the Broadcasting Club and experiences many firsts with the other members.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WUfHP1VrHKFBXbKuCDoB6hSUa9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:256744'),
  ('159196228466935745', 'Flower Angel', 1979, 'Animation, Drama, Kids', null, null, 'Reiko Suzuki, Keaton Yamada, Natsuko Kawaji, Fuyumi Shiraishi, Mari Okamoto, Michie Kita, Takuzō Kamiyama, Toru Furuya', null, 'The King of the Flower Planet is dying, but his heir can''t take up the throne until the legendary Seven Color Flower, symbol of the King''s power, is found. The Angels Cateau and Noveau are sent to Earth to find the Flower Girl, a young female who descends from both humans and Flower Angels (who once inhabited Earth, long ago) - and they find Lunlun in France. They convince her to go in a long journey to find the Flower - she''ll know the good and bad sides of humans and Flower Angels (incarnated in the ambitious Togenishia and her sidekick Boris), and will fall in love with Serge Flora, a man who holds a great secret.', 'The King of the Flower Planet is dying, but his heir can''t take up the throne until the legendary Seven Color Flower, symbol of the King''s power, is found. The Angels Cateau and Noveau are sent to Earth to find the Flower Girl, a young female who descends from both humans and Flower Angels (who once inhabited Earth, long ago) - and they find Lunlun in France. They convince her to go in a long journey to find the Flower - she''ll know the good and bad sides of humans and Flower Angels (incarnated in the ambitious Togenishia and her sidekick Boris), and will fall in love with Serge Flora, a man who holds a great secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5nISfuXfMTC0XTzUWdx5auLCipI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68343'),
  ('671664896772895014', 'Flower Boy Next Door', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Park Shin-hye, Yoon Shi-yoon, Kim Ji-hoon, Park Soo-jin, Kim Yoon-hye, Go Kyung-pyo, Kouki Mizuta, Kim Jung-san', 'NR', 'Go Dok Mi doesn''t spend all day dreaming about her knight in shining armor — she’s too busy spying on her neighbors who all happen to be hot, "flower-boy" types, including cartoon artist Oh Jin Rak. But when Enrique Geum, the new pretty boy next door, catches her, Dok Mi is finally forced to face the consequences - without the safety of binoculars and curtains. Will he be able to convince this “urban Rapunzel” to let her hair down? Whether you’re a lover or a fighter, this sensitive man will captivate your sensibilities.', 'Go Dok Mi doesn''t spend all day dreaming about her knight in shining armor — she’s too busy spying on her neighbors who all happen to be hot, "flower-boy" types, including cartoon artist Oh Jin Rak. But when Enrique Geum, the new pretty boy next door, catches her, Dok Mi is finally forced to face the consequences - without the safety of binoculars and curtains. Will he be able to convince this “urban Rapunzel” to let her hair down? Whether you’re a lover or a fighter, this sensitive man will captivate your sensibilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qk6EWrC0vsW8umHikq33sBDFfst.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46550'),
  ('566299447905589370', 'Flower Boy Ramen Shop', 2011, 'Comedy', null, 'Yoon Nan-joong', 'Jung Il-woo, Lee Chung-ah, Lee Ki-woo, Park Min-woo, Soo-Ho, Joo Hyun, Seo Bum-suk, Jo Yoon-woo', null, 'Yang Eun-bi is a college student preparing for her civil service exam with the dream of being a high school teacher. She accidentally encounters Cha Chi-soo, the arrogant son of the biggest food conglomerate in Korea. Both of them end up working at a ramen shop run by the lazy Choi Kang-hyuk.', 'Yang Eun-bi is a college student preparing for her civil service exam with the dream of being a high school teacher. She accidentally encounters Cha Chi-soo, the arrogant son of the biggest food conglomerate in Korea. Both of them end up working at a ramen shop run by the lazy Choi Kang-hyuk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99d5gnU6CxC2JsNeTqfUtXOm8WI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44550'),
  ('949718736323524405', 'Flower Crew: Joseon Marriage Agency', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kim Yi Rang', 'Kim Yi Rang', 'Kim Min-jae, Gong Seung-yeon, Seo Ji-hoon, Park Ji-hoon, Byeon Woo-seok, Go Won-hee, Park Ho-san, Jeong Jae-seong', 'TV-14', 'When he becomes king, Lee Soo hires the Flower Crew matchmaking agency to make a noble woman out of his first love, Gae-Ddong. Ma Hoon, Young-soo and Do Joon try to fulfill their client''s request.', 'When he becomes king, Lee Soo hires the Flower Crew matchmaking agency to make a noble woman out of his first love, Gae-Ddong. Ma Hoon, Young-soo and Do Joon try to fulfill their client''s request.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLGLRySmfI8Us6IFOfziT1cQeJF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92732'),
