  ('495419396694196433', 'Footballers'' Wives', 2002, 'Drama, Soap', null, null, null, null, 'Footballers'' Wives is a British television drama surrounding the fictional Premier League Association football club Earls Park F.C., its players, and their wives. It was broadcast on the ITV network from 8 January 2002 to 14 April 2006. The show began with a multi-lateral focus on a variety of different types of relationships explored; however, from the third series onward, the primary focus was on a complex love triangle between Tanya Turner, Amber Gates and Conrad Gates.', 'Footballers'' Wives is a British television drama surrounding the fictional Premier League Association football club Earls Park F.C., its players, and their wives. It was broadcast on the ITV network from 8 January 2002 to 14 April 2006. The show began with a multi-lateral focus on a variety of different types of relationships explored; however, from the third series onward, the primary focus was on a complex love triangle between Tanya Turner, Amber Gates and Conrad Gates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWlLridFURu88WeII6Pe1BCRgYS.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:772'),
  ('756442644308551737', 'For All Mankind', 2019, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics', 'Ronald D. Moore, Ben Nedivi, Matt Wolpert', null, 'Joel Kinnaman, Toby Kebbell, Mireille Enos, Edi Gathegi, Cynthy Wu, Coral Peña, Costa Ronin, Sean Kaufman', 'TV-MA', 'Explore an aspirational world where NASA and the space program remained a priority and a focal point of our hopes and dreams as told through the lives of NASA astronauts, engineers, and their families.', 'Explore an aspirational world where NASA and the space program remained a priority and a focal point of our hopes and dreams as told through the lives of NASA astronauts, engineers, and their families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/JP3DItWMbrrLiKR5AYUfpsNf2b.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:87917'),
  ('138493787065109403', 'For Eagle Brothers', 2025, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Ahn Jae-wook, Uhm Ji-won, Lee Pil-mo, Choi Dae-chul, Kim Dong-wan, Yoon Park, Lee Seok-gi, Yoo In-young', null, 'After her husband''s sudden death just ten days into their marriage, the eldest sister-in-law must step up as the head of the family, navigating the complex relationships with her five unique brothers-in-law.', 'After her husband''s sudden death just ten days into their marriage, the eldest sister-in-law must step up as the head of the family, navigating the complex relationships with her five unique brothers-in-law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wtoqI5ZPp0PVHYHcrf1BHIJ4ma.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:271890'),
  ('618659626566972248', 'For Heaven''s Sake', 2002, 'Comedy, Family, Drama, Crime, Documentary', null, null, 'Fritz Wepper, Andrea Sihler, Andrea Wildner, Lars Weström, Emanuela von Frankenberg, Janina Hartwig, Karin Gregorek, Wolfgang Müller', 'NR', 'Sister Hanna is a spirited, witty, resolute, warm-hearted, and - attractive nun. With her wit and street cred, she takes charge of Kaltenthal Cloister, transforming it into a popular refuge for all those seeking help of one kind or another. She also brings new life to the sleepy provincial community, proving herself quite a match for her great rival and opponent, the mayor Wolfgang Wöller.', 'Sister Hanna is a spirited, witty, resolute, warm-hearted, and - attractive nun. With her wit and street cred, she takes charge of Kaltenthal Cloister, transforming it into a popular refuge for all those seeking help of one kind or another. She also brings new life to the sleepy provincial community, proving herself quite a match for her great rival and opponent, the mayor Wolfgang Wöller.', null, 20, 'tmdb:tv:40891'),
  ('868880857003656101', 'For Him', 2023, 'Drama', 'newaccount', null, 'Nitikorn Pankram, Atagorn Sonyot, Supanut Sudjinda, Suchanon Chueluecha, Punnisa Sirisang, Areeya Pholphutrakul, Ryan Panya Mcshane, Panisara Prinyarux', null, 'After a messy breakup, Nail starts a casual fling with a charming stranger named Him, only to realize his new lover hides a dark secret.', 'After a messy breakup, Nail starts a casual fling with a charming stranger named Him, only to realize his new lover hides a dark secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2xsNYHpTZIUknzXbarJYaMAgucp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:227098'),
  ('1082953773014167987', 'For Life', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', 'Helena Nielsen, Gjermund Stenberg Eriksen', null, 'Tone Beate Mostraum, Iselin Shumba Skjævesland, Ingar Helge Gimle, Bjarte Hjelmeland, Hallvard Holmen, Alfred Ekker Strande, Mattis Herman Nyquist, Judy Simone Nyambura Karanja', 'TV-14', 'A tough police investigator and her team are currently solving murder cases. 15 years later she''s at a completely different and more dangerous place.', 'A tough police investigator and her team are currently solving murder cases. 15 years later she''s at a completely different and more dangerous place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pwEdUZxFI4VBSApxk3Jlbf9mTYA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108673'),
  ('138373860657717107', 'For the People', 2018, 'Drama', 'Paul William Davies', null, 'Hope Davis, Ben Shenkman, Jasmin Savoy Brown, Susannah Flood, Wesam Keesh, Regé-Jean Page, Ben Rappaport, Britt Robertson', 'TV-PG', 'Brand new lawyers work for both the defense and the prosecution as they handle the most high profile and high stakes cases in the country – all as their personal lives intersect.', 'Brand new lawyers work for both the defense and the prosecution as they handle the most high profile and high stakes cases in the country – all as their personal lives intersect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8QtXdn8d6yyoaCH2m5ZVrlJczk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:71766'),
  ('207219838714405814', 'For the Sake of the Republic', 2003, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Zhang Li', 'Sheng Heyu, Zhang Jianwei', 'Lü Zhong, Wang Bing, Sun Chun, Ma Shaohua, Li Guangjie, Liao Bingyan, Xu Min, Ge Zhijun', null, 'Towards the Republic, also known as For the Sake of the Republic and Zou Xiang Gong He, is a Chinese historical television series first broadcast on CCTV in China from April to May 2003. The series is based on events that occurred in China between the late 19th century and early 20th century that led to the collapse of the Qing Dynasty and the founding of the Republic of China. Owing to its portrayal of historical issues deemed politically sensitive by the Chinese government, the series has been subject to censorship in mainland China.', 'Towards the Republic, also known as For the Sake of the Republic and Zou Xiang Gong He, is a Chinese historical television series first broadcast on CCTV in China from April to May 2003. The series is based on events that occurred in China between the late 19th century and early 20th century that led to the collapse of the Qing Dynasty and the founding of the Republic of China. Owing to its portrayal of historical issues deemed politically sensitive by the Chinese government, the series has been subject to censorship in mainland China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7D9DVvIgAllcwWPK0FHneL8jaFf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66498'),
  ('204387808325721185', 'For You', 2016, 'Drama', null, null, 'Puttichai Kasetsin, Esther Supreeleela, Nut Devahastin Na Ayutthaya, Keerati Mahapreukpong, Cee Hataipat Smathvithayavech, Santisuk Promsiri, Ornanong Panyawong, Sattawat Doonwichit', null, 'Chanon is a responsible, enthusiastic and hardworking young man. He is at his milestone of life, facing a career promotion and becoming the head of a factory. However, Atibed is jealous of his career growth and is determined to get back what he deserves. One day, Chanon meets Antika and their relationship is blessed by her father. Threatened by Chanon’s success, Atibed frames him and he is sent to prison. When Chanon is released, everything has changed except the love between him and Antika. With all these difficulties and obstacles, what will be their destiny?', 'Chanon is a responsible, enthusiastic and hardworking young man. He is at his milestone of life, facing a career promotion and becoming the head of a factory. However, Atibed is jealous of his career growth and is determined to get back what he deserves. One day, Chanon meets Antika and their relationship is blessed by her father. Threatened by Chanon’s success, Atibed frames him and he is sent to prison. When Chanon is released, everything has changed except the love between him and Antika. With all these difficulties and obstacles, what will be their destiny?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b8fvcI0O5OVi3i0Sjoou8BChA2q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69561'),
  ('183867033165467635', 'For You', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Artur Ribeiro', null, 'Filipa Areosa, Lourenço Ortigão, Rita Blanco, Diogo Martins, Dalila Carmo, Matilde Reymão, Beatriz Frazão, Duarte Gomes', null, 'In the parish of Rio Meandro, two villages are at war over the construction of a dam that will submerge one of them: either Aldeia Velha or Aldeia Nova.', 'In the parish of Rio Meandro, two villages are at war over the construction of a dam that will submerge one of them: either Aldeia Velha or Aldeia Nova.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQOWJmidfsn2rm7fGnPqqqT2SwB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157936'),
  ('368339131044773264', 'Forbidden Fruit', 2018, 'Family, Drama, Comedy', 'Melis Civelek', 'Melis Civelek, Zeynep Gür', 'Şevval Sam, Eda Ece, Sevda Erginci, Barış Aytaç, Vildan Vatansever, Bekir Aksoy, Biran Damla Yılmaz, Murat Aygen', null, 'Three things in life can not be hidden "love, smoke and lack of money". The social society and the events behind the business world are told.', 'Three things in life can not be hidden "love, smoke and lack of money". The social society and the events behind the business world are told.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fnado0qpXLohbeHxaXzL2x7FPc.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:52645'),
  ('465927943064911599', 'Forbidden Love', 1999, 'Drama', null, 'Kazuhiko Yukawa', 'Nanako Matsushima, Hideaki Takizawa, Naomi Nishida, Hitomi Kuroki, Kenichi Yajima, Yoichi Nukumizu, Yumi Shirakawa, Ryosei Tayama', null, 'Michi, a 26 year old high school math teacher, tentatively accepts her boyfriend’s proposal of marriage, uncertain of her love for him but feeling pressure from her father and society to do what is expected of her. Hikaru, a 17 year old boy frustrated by his home life with his single mother and having been expelled from many high schools for bad behavior, enters Michi’s class as a new transfer student. As their relationship grows they realize that they both feel that they have lost themselves to the pressures of those around them, and it is this common bond that draws them dangerously close. What follows is a heart-wrenching story of forbidden love where Michi must face society’s judgement for corrupting a minor, abandoning her fiance, and disappointing her parents and co-workers.', 'Michi, a 26 year old high school math teacher, tentatively accepts her boyfriend’s proposal of marriage, uncertain of her love for him but feeling pressure from her father and society to do what is expected of her. Hikaru, a 17 year old boy frustrated by his home life with his single mother and having been expelled from many high schools for bad behavior, enters Michi’s class as a new transfer student. As their relationship grows they realize that they both feel that they have lost themselves to the pressures of those around them, and it is this common bond that draws them dangerously close. What follows is a heart-wrenching story of forbidden love where Michi must face society’s judgement for corrupting a minor, abandoning her fiance, and disappointing her parents and co-workers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2bqDZD8INxRH6jaXroChRIdAJtF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4054'),
  ('605943098505501761', 'Forbidden Love', 2008, 'Family, Drama', 'Halid Ziya Uşaklıgil', 'Burcu Gürgün, Melek Gençoğlu, Ece Yörenç', 'Beren Saat, Selçuk Yöntem, Kıvanç Tatlıtuğ, Nebahat Çehre, Zerrin Tekindor, Hazal Kaya, Batuhan Karacakaya, Rana Cabbar', 'TV-PG', 'Having lost his wife eleven years ago, Adnan devoted all his attention to his daughter Nihal and his son Bülent. Adnan, who lives in one of the most prominent mansions along the Bosporus in Istanbul with a relative''s son Behlül, and his children''s nanny, meets Bihter who is also a socialite couple''s daughter she is very elegant and beautiful, everyone who meets her get stunned and jealous of her, and he falls in love with her. While searching for peace, safety and happiness in Adnan''s mansion, Bihter meets passion. Behlül and Bihter fall completely into each other and become drowned by their infatuation with each other. Their secret love affair will soon affect every member of the family.', 'Having lost his wife eleven years ago, Adnan devoted all his attention to his daughter Nihal and his son Bülent. Adnan, who lives in one of the most prominent mansions along the Bosporus in Istanbul with a relative''s son Behlül, and his children''s nanny, meets Bihter who is also a socialite couple''s daughter she is very elegant and beautiful, everyone who meets her get stunned and jealous of her, and he falls in love with her. While searching for peace, safety and happiness in Adnan''s mansion, Bihter meets passion. Behlül and Bihter fall completely into each other and become drowned by their infatuation with each other. Their secret love affair will soon affect every member of the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHulNzEqtgkTuwrRorBRXdGzHML.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:17635'),
  ('7881435516934085', 'Forbidden Science', 2009, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Doug Miller', null, 'Noelle DuBois, Joanne Alderson, Austin Ball, Colin Sommers, Ester Radday, Vanessa Broze, Richard Roy Sutton', 'TV-MA', 'Set in the near future, the story revolve around an elite corporation, 4Ever Innovations, whose brilliant young scientists download and sell memories. They replace those we''ve lost with clones and devise technology that helps us live out our greatest fantasies, from saving a failed relationship, to creating the perfect lover, to being irresistible to the opposite sex. But sometimes our deepest desires come at a terrible price. There are secrets within 4Ever Innovations that could cost you your life.', 'Set in the near future, the story revolve around an elite corporation, 4Ever Innovations, whose brilliant young scientists download and sell memories. They replace those we''ve lost with clones and devise technology that helps us live out our greatest fantasies, from saving a failed relationship, to creating the perfect lover, to being irresistible to the opposite sex. But sometimes our deepest desires come at a terrible price. There are secrets within 4Ever Innovations that could cost you your life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YvCctKjSRf3mUrqLjBWcv53jNP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19488'),
  ('596691901752056633', 'Forces of Nature with Brian Cox', 2016, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Professor Brian Cox', 'TV-PG', 'Professor Brian Cox goes on a grand tour of the planet to explain how the Earth''s beauty is created by just a handful of forces.', 'Professor Brian Cox goes on a grand tour of the planet to explain how the Earth''s beauty is created by just a handful of forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9w32RQWnnuoDRsdPg8th7WwYaiG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66914'),
  ('340796295197732160', 'Forecasting Love and Weather', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kang Eun-kyung', null, 'Park Min-young, Song Kang, Yoon Park, Yura, Lee Sung-wook, Moon Tae-yu, Yoon Sa-bong, Chae Seo-eun', 'TV-14', 'Inside a national weather service, love proves just as difficult to predict as rain or shine for a diligent forecaster and her free-spirited co-worker.', 'Inside a national weather service, love proves just as difficult to predict as rain or shine for a diligent forecaster and her free-spirited co-worker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Qfh99m0jShWrqlFRsnWY7HeHNX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:152511'),
  ('1077596216927647270', 'Forensic Files', 1996, 'Crime, Documentary', null, null, 'Peter Thomas', 'TV-14', 'Real crimes, disease outbreaks and accidents around the world are solved by experts using scientific laboratory analysis which helps them find previously undetectable evidence. Brilliant scientific work helps convict the guilty and free the innocent.', 'Real crimes, disease outbreaks and accidents around the world are solved by experts using scientific laboratory analysis which helps them find previously undetectable evidence. Brilliant scientific work helps convict the guilty and free the innocent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7zrsnodHEe3UUdwHG207rjdbrB.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:11105'),
  ('569345835621771794', 'Forensic Files II', 2020, 'Crime, Documentary', null, null, 'Bill Camp', 'TV-14', 'Forensic experts and investigators piece together strange clues and microscopic evidence to solve the most puzzling criminal cases... proving there is no such thing as a perfect crime.', 'Forensic experts and investigators piece together strange clues and microscopic evidence to solve the most puzzling criminal cases... proving there is no such thing as a perfect crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cfuaCZzRcoWxQGwbUWsFUux7LGu.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:99751'),
  ('791128599604122173', 'Forensic Heroes', 2006, 'Drama, Crime', 'Mui Siu-Ching', null, 'Bosco Wong Chung-Chak, Jacky Cai, Benjamin Yuen Wai-Ho, Mandy Yuen, Joey Thye, Juliana Kwok, Kelly Fu, Kelvin Kwan', null, 'Forensic Heroes is a series of TVB police procedural television dramas. The series follows a group of Hong Kong forensic scientists working together with the Hong Kong police to solve murders through physical evidence left over from crime scenes. Currently, two serials and three reboot installment were produced.', 'Forensic Heroes is a series of TVB police procedural television dramas. The series follows a group of Hong Kong forensic scientists working together with the Hong Kong police to solve murders through physical evidence left over from crime scenes. Currently, two serials and three reboot installment were produced.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mI2IpGSvN2HD0leizY6HZgyTjIJ.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:254090'),
  ('504436335536105373', 'Forensic Heroes VI', 2024, 'Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'Bosco Wong Chung-Chak, Benjamin Yuen Wai-Ho, Jacky Cai, Niklas Lam, Mandy Yuen, Joey Thye', null, 'Forensic Senior Chemist Yu Sing-pak, Crime Unit Inspector Tseng Ho-yin, and Pathology Doctor Fan Pui-ching form the elite Crime-busting Trio. Together, they investigate bizarre homicides, using forensic science and pathology to uncover the truth and deliver justice.', 'Forensic Senior Chemist Yu Sing-pak, Crime Unit Inspector Tseng Ho-yin, and Pathology Doctor Fan Pui-ching form the elite Crime-busting Trio. Together, they investigate bizarre homicides, using forensic science and pathology to uncover the truth and deliver justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/DhbOAcxMCpg8F1M5HS3BuqXTa2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:260725'),
  ('745641643616538447', 'Forensics: The Real CSI', 2019, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Siobhan Finneran', null, 'Multiple cameras follow serious crime investigations in real time, revealing the crucial role cutting-edge forensic science now plays in bringing criminals to justice.', 'Multiple cameras follow serious crime investigations in real time, revealing the crucial role cutting-edge forensic science now plays in bringing criminals to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7KmMBsopUAYqx2UcfLPO5CPG5hP.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:89138'),
  ('180943066412551065', 'Forest', 2020, 'Drama', null, null, 'Park Hae-jin, Cho Bo-ah, Jeong Yeon-joo, No Gwang-Sik, Ryu Seung-su, Lee Do-gyeong, Lee Si-hoon, Woo Jung-kook', null, 'Kang San-Hyeok is a member of the 119 special rescue team. He is handsome and smart, but he does not remember his childhood. Jung Young-Jae is an enthusiastic surgical resident. Kang San-Hyeok and Jung Young-Jae meet at a mysterious forest. Even though they do not want to, they must live together in the mysterious forest. Living there, they discover small pleasures. Kang San-Hyeok and Jung Young-Jae soon uncover a secret about themselves and the forest.', 'Kang San-Hyeok is a member of the 119 special rescue team. He is handsome and smart, but he does not remember his childhood. Jung Young-Jae is an enthusiastic surgical resident. Kang San-Hyeok and Jung Young-Jae meet at a mysterious forest. Even though they do not want to, they must live together in the mysterious forest. Living there, they discover small pleasures. Kang San-Hyeok and Jung Young-Jae soon uncover a secret about themselves and the forest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxj3HQe4LP0sPJP1qNGFa5lS0Sz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97565'),
  ('778471732379546093', 'Forest of the Missing', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Julien Vanlerenberghe, Stéphane Pannetier', null, 'Hélène de Fougerolles, Grégory Fitoussi, Tchéky Karyo, Daniel Njo Lobé, Thierry Godard, Astrid Whettnall, Laëtitia Eïdo, Victoria Eber', null, 'Near the Franco-German border, in the heart of the Black Forest and the binational military base; 12 bodies are found in a mass grave. All the victims are men, both French and German.', 'Near the Franco-German border, in the heart of the Black Forest and the binational military base; 12 bodies are found in a mass grave. All the victims are men, both French and German.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jabfaK4MIOLWIi2Uwqp5XNnfyU4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215229'),
  ('780058063057012397', 'Forever', 2014, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Matthew Miller', null, 'Ioan Gruffudd, Judd Hirsch, Alana de la Garza, Lorraine Toussaint, Donnie Keshawarz, Joel David Moore, Betsey Brown', 'TV-PG', 'Doctor Henry Morgan, New York City’s star medical examiner, has a secret. He doesn''t just study the dead to solve criminal cases, he does it to solve the mystery that has eluded him for 200 years—the answer to his own inexplicable immortality. This long life has given Henry remarkable observation skills which impresses his new partner, Detective Jo Martinez. Each week, a new case and their budding friendship will reveal layers of Henry’s long and colorful past. Only his best friend and confidant, Abe knows Henry’s secret.', 'Doctor Henry Morgan, New York City’s star medical examiner, has a secret. He doesn''t just study the dead to solve criminal cases, he does it to solve the mystery that has eluded him for 200 years—the answer to his own inexplicable immortality. This long life has given Henry remarkable observation skills which impresses his new partner, Detective Jo Martinez. Each week, a new case and their budding friendship will reveal layers of Henry’s long and colorful past. Only his best friend and confidant, Abe knows Henry’s secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4OnnU4j2tQEOnsPnRZswW91v9vr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60726'),
  ('184946228423933047', 'Forever', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alan Yang, Matt Hubbard', null, 'Maya Rudolph, Fred Armisen', 'TV-MA', 'June and Oscar live a comfortable but very predictable wedded life when suddenly they find themselves in a completely unexpected situation, raising questions about love and marriage.', 'June and Oscar live a comfortable but very predictable wedded life when suddenly they find themselves in a completely unexpected situation, raising questions about love and marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNKmZ96oGAAIHGB9KppVtLKOsdo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81317'),
  ('816236123071566942', 'FOREVER', 2025, 'Drama', 'Mara Brock Akil', null, 'Lovie Simone, Michael Cooper Jr., Wood Harris, Karen Pittman, Xosha Roquemore', 'TV-14', 'Reunited as teens, two childhood friends fall deeply in love, experiencing the joy and heartache of a first romance that will change their lives forever.', 'Reunited as teens, two childhood friends fall deeply in love, experiencing the joy and heartache of a first romance that will change their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/98UiKiaQV5paB1EpZa3XDUxmGki.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:248394'),
  ('180683541107697649', 'Forever and Ever', 2014, 'Soap, Drama', 'Daniel Ortiz, Andréa Maltarolli', 'Daniel Ortiz, Silvio de Abreu, Claudia Souto', 'Sérgio Guizé, Nathalia Dill, Thiago Lacerda, Cláudia Raia, Débora Nascimento, Christiane Torloni, Edson Celulari, Sílvia Pfeifer', null, 'Revolves around Caíque, a doctor who can see and speak to spirits, and his passion for Laura, a journalist who seeks to discover her mother.', 'Revolves around Caíque, a doctor who can see and speak to spirits, and his passion for Laura, a journalist who seeks to discover her mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZ7k4C7Tb8r0LhmwD06hmJaxBnx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86198'),
  ('47167875513753556', 'Forever and Ever', 2021, 'Drama', 'Mobao Feibao', 'Mobao Feibao', 'Ren Jialun, Bai Lu, Ci Sha, Luo Mingjie, Wang Ruixin, Jin Liting, Gao Xuyang, Liu Ruogu', null, 'This story is about Shi Yi, a gentle pleasant and low-key but industry''s top voice actress, who ran into the elegant returnee chemistry professor Zhousheng Chen at the airport one day. They gradually develop a mutual understanding in getting along with each other, and join hands to preserve traditional craftsmanship and overcome many storms as they decide to accompany each other for the rest of their lives...', 'This story is about Shi Yi, a gentle pleasant and low-key but industry''s top voice actress, who ran into the elegant returnee chemistry professor Zhousheng Chen at the airport one day. They gradually develop a mutual understanding in getting along with each other, and join hands to preserve traditional craftsmanship and overcome many storms as they decide to accompany each other for the rest of their lives...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6csX8pU1p3Hj8DWknw1IJm0c18i.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130107'),
  ('710174777041198656', 'Forever Knight', 1992, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Crime', 'James D. Parriott, Barney Cohen', null, 'Geraint Wyn Davies, Nigel Bennett, Catherine Disher, Ben Bass, John Kapelos, Blu Mankuma, Gary Farmer, Natsuko Ohama', null, 'Forever Knight is a Canadian television series about Nick Knight, an 800-year-old vampire working as a police detective in modern day Toronto. Wracked with guilt for centuries of killing others, he seeks redemption by working as a homicide detective on the night shift while struggling to find a way to become human again. The series premiered on May 5, 1992 and concluded with the third season finale on May 17, 1996.', 'Forever Knight is a Canadian television series about Nick Knight, an 800-year-old vampire working as a police detective in modern day Toronto. Wracked with guilt for centuries of killing others, he seeks redemption by working as a homicide detective on the night shift while struggling to find a way to become human again. The series premiered on May 5, 1992 and concluded with the third season finale on May 17, 1996.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aXlJjgxsorDOCl4cDoWpwN7x0JN.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:3743'),
  ('83057867506389495', 'Forever Love', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Wen Deguang', 'Gao Xiaoxian', 'Wang Anyu, Xiang Hanzhi, Lin Lu, Pan Meiye, Yuan Hao, Zhao Haohong, Yang Yue, Fan Zhen', null, 'A story that follows two people''s brave pursuit of love from their campus days to their humble beginnings as they enter the workplace to chase after their dreams together. Xia Linxi''s senior year is full of radiance while Jiang Zhenghan''s is in peril. Jiang Zhenghan is doing everything he can to earn money and ends up becoming the tutor of a very unwilling Xia Linxi who still hasn''t forgotten their terrible first meeting. When the two felt love for the first time, it was sweet and pure. It''s the kind of love that you want to profess to the world but it wasn''t until after their exams that their feelings became more clear. Just as they wished, Xia Linxi and Jiang Zhenghan are admitted to the same university. From their youth to adulthood, from the school to the workplace, from a school uniform to a wedding dress, they have each other as a lifelong companion.', 'A story that follows two people''s brave pursuit of love from their campus days to their humble beginnings as they enter the workplace to chase after their dreams together. Xia Linxi''s senior year is full of radiance while Jiang Zhenghan''s is in peril. Jiang Zhenghan is doing everything he can to earn money and ends up becoming the tutor of a very unwilling Xia Linxi who still hasn''t forgotten their terrible first meeting. When the two felt love for the first time, it was sweet and pure. It''s the kind of love that you want to profess to the world but it wasn''t until after their exams that their feelings became more clear. Just as they wished, Xia Linxi and Jiang Zhenghan are admitted to the same university. From their youth to adulthood, from the school to the workplace, from a school uniform to a wedding dress, they have each other as a lifelong companion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5pL9XtTPe9qQZdDXS7gAslbMMKI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114670'),
  ('118871818683932800', 'Forever Love', 2023, 'Drama', null, 'Zhang Fen', 'Chen Fangtong, Dai Gaozheng, Hou Dong, Ma Xinyu, Hu Xifan, Liu Xiaolei, Li Chengyang, Chen Yuan', null, 'Lin Zi Tong is the rich young heiress of the Li group: she is beautiful, cheerful, smart and straightforward. She has everything for her, including a devoted boyfriend, Chi Shan. But when she goes through family changes, this innocent young miss has to become stronger to not only face adversity but also the betrayal of her boyfriend, Chi Shan, and her so-called best friend, Xia Yu Wei, a deceitful hypocrite who on the surface treats Lin Zi Tong like a sister but is actually very jealous and wants to steal everything from her. Sheng Mo Yao is a brilliant medical student who succeeds in everything he does. He is handsome, appears sharp, cold and mysterious and is willing to do everything to protect Lin Zi Tong and help her in the shadows.', 'Lin Zi Tong is the rich young heiress of the Li group: she is beautiful, cheerful, smart and straightforward. She has everything for her, including a devoted boyfriend, Chi Shan. But when she goes through family changes, this innocent young miss has to become stronger to not only face adversity but also the betrayal of her boyfriend, Chi Shan, and her so-called best friend, Xia Yu Wei, a deceitful hypocrite who on the surface treats Lin Zi Tong like a sister but is actually very jealous and wants to steal everything from her. Sheng Mo Yao is a brilliant medical student who succeeds in everything he does. He is handsome, appears sharp, cold and mysterious and is willing to do everything to protect Lin Zi Tong and help her in the shadows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7Y8FTAIjcZ5WsRn8u0fb3h4gYB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233753'),
  ('26290135175979700', 'Forged in Fire', 2015, 'Reality', null, null, 'David Lain Baker, Doug Marcaida', 'TV-PG', 'Competitors re-create weapons from historical periods ranging from Japanese katanas to medieval broadswords to ancient throwing blades. Each entry is judged on its artistry as well as its functionality and accuracy.', 'Competitors re-create weapons from historical periods ranging from Japanese katanas to medieval broadswords to ancient throwing blades. Each entry is judged on its artistry as well as its functionality and accuracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTeChgTbGdrxRy6X3TFRW83e1U2.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:62884'),
