  ('524770894918643502', 'Fortitude', 2015, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Simon Donald', 'Simon Donald', 'Richard Dormer, Sienna Guillory, Mia Jexen, Sofie Gråbøl, Luke Treadaway, Darren Boyd, Björn Hlynur Haraldsson, Alexandra Moen', 'TV-MA', 'Fortitude is a place like nowhere else. Although surrounded by the savage beauty of the Arctic landscape, Fortitude is one of the safest towns on earth. There has never been a violent crime here. Until now. In such a close-knit community a murder touches everyone and the unsettling, mysterious horror of this crime threatens the future of the town itself.', 'Fortitude is a place like nowhere else. Although surrounded by the savage beauty of the Arctic landscape, Fortitude is one of the safest towns on earth. There has never been a violent crime here. Until now. In such a close-knit community a murder touches everyone and the unsettling, mysterious horror of this crime threatens the future of the town itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6vKMeFEfz9sJun65EZgp4ltr9r.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:61335'),
  ('758033413857541270', 'Fortnite x The Simpsons', 2025, 'Comedy, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Dan Castellaneta', 'TV-PG', 'Springfield and Fortnite universes converge. Chaos ensues as Homer sets out to transform the world, wielding a powerful alien energy.', 'Springfield and Fortnite universes converge. Chaos ensues as Homer sets out to transform the world, wielding a powerful alien energy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lr3gn5BN80kc2vkmTOlPuHZlLP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:304530'),
  ('1034666332850432507', 'Fortune Arterial: Red Promise', 2010, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Daisuke Ono, Rie Kanda, Yukari Minegishi, Erika Narumi, Hitomi Nabatame, Hiroko Taguchi, Junichi Suwabe, Tomohiro Tsuboi', null, 'Fortune Arterial''s story revolves around the male protagonist Kohei Hasekura, who transfers into a prestigious public school in the style of an English six-year school encompassing junior-high and high school students. The school is on an island named Tamatsu Island off-shore from mainland Japan, and the only way to get there is by boat. Soon after transferring, he discovers that one of the student in the class next door to his, Sendo Erika, is in fact a type of vampire.', 'Fortune Arterial''s story revolves around the male protagonist Kohei Hasekura, who transfers into a prestigious public school in the style of an English six-year school encompassing junior-high and high school students. The school is on an island named Tamatsu Island off-shore from mainland Japan, and the only way to get there is by boat. Soon after transferring, he discovers that one of the student in the class next door to his, Sendo Erika, is in fact a type of vampire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7wxnGW0X6tgPSprYUi61axveZAh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:36873'),
  ('1073436046191104150', 'Fortune Seller: A TV Scam', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Alessandro Garramone', 'Alessandro Garramone, Davide Bandiera', 'Wanna Marchi, Stefania Nobile, Stefano Zurlo, Roberto Da Crema, Joe Denti', null, 'Follow controversial slimming cream sellers turned con artists Wanna Marchi and Stefania Nobile, from their TV success to their scam and jail time.', 'Follow controversial slimming cream sellers turned con artists Wanna Marchi and Stefania Nobile, from their TV success to their scam and jail time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHU4sXB5DKqCfopd6pwMyeRGtNs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:205657'),
  ('698354702420288640', 'Fortunes of War', 1987, 'Drama', 'James Cellan Jones', null, 'Kenneth Branagh, Emma Thompson, Charles Kay', null, 'English literature lecturer Guy Pringle and his wife Harriet navigate the early years of WWII in Bucharest. They become involved in anti-fascist politics and are forced to flee as the war escalates, crossing paths with various characters along the way.', 'English literature lecturer Guy Pringle and his wife Harriet navigate the early years of WWII in Bucharest. They become involved in anti-fascist politics and are forced to flee as the war escalates, crossing paths with various characters along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bvp2iqXbiKAVa8RnIRoJKAYlosH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14665'),
  ('435441320882210490', 'Forty Something', 1995, 'Drama, Family', 'Kwok-Lap Lee, Ella Chan Bo-wa', null, 'Adam Cheng Siu-Chow, Amy Chan, Bowie Lam Bo-Yee, Astrid Chan Chi-Ching, Benz Hui Siu-Hung, Joel Chan, Angie Cheung Wai-Yee, Hilary Tsui Ho-Ying', null, 'The story revolves around Yeung Chung-tak, who has dedicated twenty years of his life to the household electronics division of the family business, Yip Fook Trading. Unfortunately, as the business evolves, he realizes that his position as vice-manager is the furthest he can go, as outsiders cannot become part of the family business. Still, Chung-tak is content with his life, as his true focus has always been on his family. Chung-tak''s happy marriage to his wife, Wong Oi-lin, is challenged when a switch of apartments and changes in the company bring unexpected crises into their lives. They have two daughters, and together, they strive to overcome the challenges and rescue their peaceful life. The story explores how Chung-tak confronts these trials and their outcome.', 'The story revolves around Yeung Chung-tak, who has dedicated twenty years of his life to the household electronics division of the family business, Yip Fook Trading. Unfortunately, as the business evolves, he realizes that his position as vice-manager is the furthest he can go, as outsiders cannot become part of the family business. Still, Chung-tak is content with his life, as his true focus has always been on his family. Chung-tak''s happy marriage to his wife, Wong Oi-lin, is challenged when a switch of apartments and changes in the company bring unexpected crises into their lives. They have two daughters, and together, they strive to overcome the challenges and rescue their peaceful life. The story explores how Chung-tak confronts these trials and their outcome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVSr43T2sFxvRTLMWwsSR4FIWV1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109745'),
  ('123062638931585924', 'Fortysomething', 2003, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Hugh Laurie, Anna Chancellor, Benedict Cumberbatch, Joe Van Moyland, Neil Henry, Peter Capaldi, Lolita Chakrabarti, Sheila Hancock', null, 'A middle-aged doctor in Putney juggles family issues and mid-life woes when he suddenly develops the ability to hear others'' thoughts.', 'A middle-aged doctor in Putney juggles family issues and mid-life woes when he suddenly develops the ability to hear others'' thoughts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LrOLyW3IS3BfsFFfTHs1Z1dm4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21007'),
  ('1138696941624793578', 'Fosse/Verdon', 2019, 'Drama', 'Steven Levenson, Thomas Kail', null, 'Sam Rockwell, Michelle Williams', 'TV-MA', 'The story of the romantic and creative partnership between Bob Fosse and Gwen Verdon. He was a filmmaker and one of theater''s most influential choreographers and directors; she was the greatest Broadway dancer of all time. Together, they changed the face of American entertainment — at a perilous cost.', 'The story of the romantic and creative partnership between Bob Fosse and Gwen Verdon. He was a filmmaker and one of theater''s most influential choreographers and directors; she was the greatest Broadway dancer of all time. Together, they changed the face of American entertainment — at a perilous cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbHkfnaFBcMx90GRBzjCL8MPozo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81131'),
  ('173260365896743406', 'Foster''s Home for Imaginary Friends', 2004, 'Kids, Animation, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Craig McCracken', null, 'Sean Marquette, Keith Ferguson, Tom Kenny, Phil LaMarr, Grey DeLisle, Tom Kane, Candi Milo', 'TV-Y7', 'Children who create imaginary friends usually take care of them until they are 7-8 years old. Imaginary friends, left on their own after this event, continue to live in this home founded by old Madam Foster.', 'Children who create imaginary friends usually take care of them until they are 7-8 years old. Imaginary friends, left on their own after this event, continue to live in this home founded by old Madam Foster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kj6oGL4qqFDY8PGmTloqGQ2TblS.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:1720'),
  ('302501983886518920', 'Found', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Nkechi Okoro Carroll', null, 'Shanola Hampton, Kelli Williams, Brett Dalton, Gabrielle Walsh, Arlen Escarpeta, Karan Oberoi, Mark-Paul Gosselaar', 'TV-14', 'In any given year, more than 600,000 people are reported missing in the U.S. Of these reported cases, more than half of the missing people are people of color, too easily neglected by the system. Gabi Mosely, a former missing person herself, now specializes in PR and leads a crisis management team that seeks out these missing people. But unbeknownst to anyone, Mosely is hiding a dark secret of her own.', 'In any given year, more than 600,000 people are reported missing in the U.S. Of these reported cases, more than half of the missing people are people of color, too easily neglected by the system. Gabi Mosely, a former missing person herself, now specializes in PR and leads a crisis management team that seeks out these missing people. But unbeknownst to anyone, Mosely is hiding a dark secret of her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6Uo0Tkjhqlze7R7DgGmP9Fq4Ce.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:214160'),
  ('73967148642735778', 'Foundation', 2021, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'David S. Goyer, Josh Friedman', null, 'Jared Harris, Lee Pace, Lou Llobell, Laura Birn, Cassian Bilton, Terrence Mann', 'TV-MA', 'Follow a band of exiles on their monumental journey to save humanity and rebuild civilization amid the fall of the Galactic Empire.', 'Follow a band of exiles on their monumental journey to save humanity and rebuild civilization amid the fall of the Galactic Empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tg9I5pOY4M9CKj8U0cxVBTsm5eh.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:93740'),
  ('629895299545906738', 'Founder: Orhan', 2025, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, War & Politics', null, null, 'Mert Yazıcıoğlu, Mahassine Merabet, Barış Falay, Burak Sergen, Bennu Yıldırımlar, Şükrü Özyıldız, İpek Arkan, Çağrı Şensoy', null, 'Kuruluş: Orhan is a Turkish historical drama that follows the life of Orhan Bey, the son of Osman I and the second ruler of the Ottoman Empire. Set in the 14th century, the series portrays Orhan’s transformation from a young warrior into a visionary leader who expands his father''s legacy by conquering key Byzantine cities like Bursa and establishing the foundations of a powerful empire. With political intrigue, epic battles, and complex relationships, the show explores Orhan’s rise amidst internal strife and external threats, continuing the legacy of Kuruluş: Osman with a new generation of characters and high-stakes storytelling.', 'Kuruluş: Orhan is a Turkish historical drama that follows the life of Orhan Bey, the son of Osman I and the second ruler of the Ottoman Empire. Set in the 14th century, the series portrays Orhan’s transformation from a young warrior into a visionary leader who expands his father''s legacy by conquering key Byzantine cities like Bursa and establishing the foundations of a powerful empire. With political intrigue, epic battles, and complex relationships, the show explores Orhan’s rise amidst internal strife and external threats, continuing the legacy of Kuruluş: Osman with a new generation of characters and high-stakes storytelling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1kEgzEvhJmw5eSxuGwn0o1cgHlK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:302658'),
  ('94931532488224144', 'Founding Emperor of Ming Dynasty', 2006, 'Drama', 'Hu Jun, Ju Xue, Feng Xiaoning', null, 'Hu Jun, Ju Xue, Zheng Xiaoning, Chen Changhai, Ebusi', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3gqYnUUXryQ8aSnmzY6tBWjqiJR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108380'),
  ('828188219176917486', 'Four Corners', 1961, 'News, Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'Four Corners is Australia''s longest-running investigative journalism/current affairs television program. Broadcast on ABC1 in Australia, it premiered on 19 August 1961 and celebrated its 60th anniversary in 2021. Founding producer Robert Raymond and his successor Allan Ashbolt did much to set the ongoing tone of the program. Based on the Panorama concept, the program addresses a single issue in depth each week, showing either a locally produced program or a relevant documentary from overseas. The program has won many awards for investigative journalism, and broken many high-profile stories. A notable early example of this was the show''s epoch-making 1962 exposé on the appalling living conditions endured by many Aboriginal Australians living in rural New South Wales.', 'Four Corners is Australia''s longest-running investigative journalism/current affairs television program. Broadcast on ABC1 in Australia, it premiered on 19 August 1961 and celebrated its 60th anniversary in 2021. Founding producer Robert Raymond and his successor Allan Ashbolt did much to set the ongoing tone of the program. Based on the Panorama concept, the program addresses a single issue in depth each week, showing either a locally produced program or a relevant documentary from overseas. The program has won many awards for investigative journalism, and broken many high-profile stories. A notable early example of this was the show''s epoch-making 1962 exposé on the appalling living conditions endured by many Aboriginal Australians living in rural New South Wales.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wM8eEHXuqL5xeXyeH4NL16b0E7Q.jpg', 22, 'tmdb:tv:1384'),
  ('1060425575864343945', 'Four in a Bed', 2010, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'Four pairs of B&B owners from across Britain take it in turns as hosts to decide which of their establishments provides the best value for money.', 'Four pairs of B&B owners from across Britain take it in turns as hosts to decide which of their establishments provides the best value for money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFzW9V9rjKQcsunNrjw1yPc2zT8.jpg', 30, 'tmdb:tv:60780'),
  ('715716365738831561', 'Four Lives', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'David Blair', null, 'Stephen Merchant, Sheridan Smith, Leanne Best, Samuel Barnett, Kris Hitchen, Robert Emms, Michael Jibson, Ben Cartwright', null, 'The true story of the courageous families of four young gay men who lost their lives to killer Stephen Port. Facing police failings, they fought for justice for their loved ones.', 'The true story of the courageous families of four young gay men who lost their lives to killer Stephen Port. Facing police failings, they fought for justice for their loved ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZK3uB5btwimbgJVFzVo4BOLibX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:153936'),
  ('491690341518294471', 'Four More Shots Please!', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Rangita Pritish Nandy, Ishita Pritish Nandy', 'Devika Bhagat', 'Sayani Gupta, Kirti Kulhari, Maanvi Gagroo, Gurbani Judge, Rajeev Siddhartha, Dino Morea, Kunaal Roy Kapur', 'TV-MA', 'Four unapologetically flawed women live, love, blunder and discover what really makes them tick through friendship and tequila in millennial Mumbai.', 'Four unapologetically flawed women live, love, blunder and discover what really makes them tick through friendship and tequila in millennial Mumbai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a4UNvDfbgk3AY7452dr9uGhulzB.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:86165'),
  ('706996473501138547', 'Four Real', 2024, null, null, null, 'Liandra Sadzo, Jaël Ost, Natasha Zelenka, Claudia De Greef', null, 'Hey besties! We love taking you along in episodes filled with honest conversations, spicy advice, but also “haha” & “omg!” moments. We are your digital big sisters and have answers to all the small and big questions we receive from our community!', 'Hey besties! We love taking you along in episodes filled with honest conversations, spicy advice, but also “haha” & “omg!” moments. We are your digital big sisters and have answers to all the small and big questions we receive from our community!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pi1FMeUNRENviXQHKBY17pCm8DD.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:316684'),
  ('162734608689169762', 'Four Seasons in Havana', 2016, 'Drama, Crime', 'Leonardo Padura', null, 'Jorge Perugorría, Juana Acosta, Enrique Molina, Carlos Enrique Almirante, Luis Alberto García, Mario Guerra, Héctor Medina, Laura Ramos', 'TV-MA', 'As Havana slowly revolves through the year, wistful detective Mario Conde probes the sultry heart of the city to investigate dark and deadly crimes.', 'As Havana slowly revolves through the year, wistful detective Mario Conde probes the sultry heart of the city to investigate dark and deadly crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pMnH9849w1Ivz4AtJ8uiqe9Zbfl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69063'),
  ('215428662598115316', 'Four Star Playhouse', 1952, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, null, 'TV-G', 'Four Star Playhouse is an American television anthology series that ran from 1952 to 1956, sponsored in its first bi-weekly season by The Singer Company; Bristol-Myers became an alternate sponsor when it became a weekly series in the fall of 1953. The original premise was that Charles Boyer, Ida Lupino, David Niven, and Dick Powell would take turns starring in episodes. However, several other performers took the lead from time to time, including Ronald Colman and Joan Fontaine. Blake Edwards was among the writers and directors who contributed to the series. Edwards created the recurring character of illegal gambling house operator Willie Dante for Dick Powell to play on this series. The character was later revamped and spun off in his own series starring Howard Duff, then-husband of Lupino. The pilot for Meet McGraw, starring Frank Lovejoy, aired here, as did another episode in which Lovejoy recreated his role of Chicago newspaper reporter Randy Stone, from the radio drama Nightbeat.', 'Four Star Playhouse is an American television anthology series that ran from 1952 to 1956, sponsored in its first bi-weekly season by The Singer Company; Bristol-Myers became an alternate sponsor when it became a weekly series in the fall of 1953. The original premise was that Charles Boyer, Ida Lupino, David Niven, and Dick Powell would take turns starring in episodes. However, several other performers took the lead from time to time, including Ronald Colman and Joan Fontaine. Blake Edwards was among the writers and directors who contributed to the series. Edwards created the recurring character of illegal gambling house operator Willie Dante for Dick Powell to play on this series. The character was later revamped and spun off in his own series starring Howard Duff, then-husband of Lupino. The pilot for Meet McGraw, starring Frank Lovejoy, aired here, as did another episode in which Lovejoy recreated his role of Chicago newspaper reporter Randy Stone, from the radio drama Nightbeat.', null, 4, 'tmdb:tv:1737'),
  ('471144438365293129', 'Four Tank-Men and a Dog', 1966, 'Action & Adventure, War & Politics', null, null, 'Janusz Gajos, Franciszek Pieczka, Włodzimierz Press, Wiesław Gołas', null, 'Czterej pancerni i pies was a Polish black and white TV series based on the book by Janusz Przymanowski. Made between 1966 and 1970, the series is composed of 21 episodes of 55 minutes each, divided into three seasons. It is set in 1944 and 1945, during World War II, and follows the adventures of a tank crew and their T-34 tank in the 1st Polish Army. Although both the book and the TV series contain elements of pro-Soviet propaganda, they have achieved and retain a cult series status in Poland, Soviet Union and other Eastern Bloc countries. The T-34 tank Rudy with the identifying number "102", a German Shepherd dog from Siberia Szarik and to a lesser extent the crew Jan Kos, Gustaw Jeleń, Grigorij Saakaszwili, Tomasz Czereśniak, and their commander and mentor Olgierd Jarosz, as well as other heroes of the series, have become icons in Polish popular culture.', 'Czterej pancerni i pies was a Polish black and white TV series based on the book by Janusz Przymanowski. Made between 1966 and 1970, the series is composed of 21 episodes of 55 minutes each, divided into three seasons. It is set in 1944 and 1945, during World War II, and follows the adventures of a tank crew and their T-34 tank in the 1st Polish Army. Although both the book and the TV series contain elements of pro-Soviet propaganda, they have achieved and retain a cult series status in Poland, Soviet Union and other Eastern Bloc countries. The T-34 tank Rudy with the identifying number "102", a German Shepherd dog from Siberia Szarik and to a lesser extent the crew Jan Kos, Gustaw Jeleń, Grigorij Saakaszwili, Tomasz Czereśniak, and their commander and mentor Olgierd Jarosz, as well as other heroes of the series, have become icons in Polish popular culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5S3nokzCXfB1E6thWQRGEZx1O8J.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1574'),
  ('105269629492481464', 'Four Weddings and a Funeral', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Mindy Kaling, Matt Warburton', null, 'Nathalie Emmanuel, Nikesh Patel, Rebecca Rittenhouse, John Reynolds, Brandon Mychal Smith, Zoe Boyle, Sophia La Porta, Rakhee Thakrar', 'TV-MA', 'Maya, the young communications director for a New York senatorial campaign, receives a wedding invitation from her college schoolmate now living in London. She leaves her professional and personal life behind, in favor of traveling to England and reconnecting with old friends and ends up in the midst of their personal crises. Relationships are forged and broken, political scandals exposed, London social life lampooned, love affairs ignited and doused, and of course, there are four weddings…and a funeral.', 'Maya, the young communications director for a New York senatorial campaign, receives a wedding invitation from her college schoolmate now living in London. She leaves her professional and personal life behind, in favor of traveling to England and reconnecting with old friends and ends up in the midst of their personal crises. Relationships are forged and broken, political scandals exposed, London social life lampooned, love affairs ignited and doused, and of course, there are four weddings…and a funeral.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/12kJ01sCBVcR1Z4AgOa5Q2Beq44.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84282'),
  ('733895375609710203', 'Fourever You', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, null, null, 'Four friends navigate college life and chaotic romances as they each find their hearts entangled with medical students across four unique stories.', 'Four friends navigate college life and chaotic romances as they each find their hearts entangled with medical students across four unique stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pXVftluKQpsG2QhjBKQJAkVlAUR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:240150'),
  ('107705578927701533', 'Foursome', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Marissa Read, Selyna Warren', null, 'Jenn McAllister, Rickey Thompson, Brooke Markham, Meghan Falcone, Logan Paul, Cameron Moulène', null, 'Andie is undateable– thanks to her older brother Alec, the most popular guy in high school, who makes sure no guy comes near her. Fortunately, Andie has her three best friends to help her shake the little sister stigma: Dakota, the gay best friend who is more than confident in his own sexuality; Imogen the innocent, fresh-out-of-home-school wallflower; and Courtney, Alec’s girlfriend and last year’s homecoming queen, who can’t let go of her high school days. These four very different personalities help each other navigate the hormone-induced, angst-filled sea of high school.', 'Andie is undateable– thanks to her older brother Alec, the most popular guy in high school, who makes sure no guy comes near her. Fortunately, Andie has her three best friends to help her shake the little sister stigma: Dakota, the gay best friend who is more than confident in his own sexuality; Imogen the innocent, fresh-out-of-home-school wallflower; and Courtney, Alec’s girlfriend and last year’s homecoming queen, who can’t let go of her high school days. These four very different personalities help each other navigate the hormone-induced, angst-filled sea of high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xR7xxfTJQYYKAitwRRSyvLAIAeG.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:67493'),
