  ('198911572281737705', 'Fox & Friends', null, 'News, Talk', null, null, 'Steve Doocy', 'NR', 'Fox & Friends is an early-morning opinion talk show that begins at 6:00 a.m. Eastern Time with the latest Fox News Live headlines and news of the morning. It continues with a variety of segments including interviews, updates of news stories with correspondents, analysis from the hosts, and entertainment segments. The show has a list of regular contributors, including Dr. Manny Alvarez, presenting his health segments "Ask Dr. Manny" and "Dr. Manny''s Healthbeat."', 'Fox & Friends is an early-morning opinion talk show that begins at 6:00 a.m. Eastern Time with the latest Fox News Live headlines and news of the morning. It continues with a variety of segments including interviews, updates of news stories with correspondents, analysis from the hosts, and entertainment segments. The show has a list of regular contributors, including Dr. Manny Alvarez, presenting his health segments "Ask Dr. Manny" and "Dr. Manny''s Healthbeat."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSEboiUkH9RpLJpy7paHlxZS32v.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:715'),
  ('129661175079544271', 'Fox News Sunday', 1996, 'News', 'Roger Ailes', null, 'Juan Williams, Brit Hume, William Kristol, Tony Snow, Chris Wallace, Mara Liasson, Charles Krauthammer, Fred Barnes', null, 'Fox News Sunday with Chris Wallace is a Sunday morning news/talk show on the Fox Broadcasting Company; since 2003, Fox News Sunday has been hosted by Chris Wallace.', 'Fox News Sunday with Chris Wallace is a Sunday morning news/talk show on the Fox Broadcasting Company; since 2003, Fox News Sunday has been hosted by Chris Wallace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgiFyrcFRbmQalpWA56OhpYiqTN.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:2092'),
  ('168446011093101394', 'Fox Spirit Matchmaker', 2015, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Tuo Xiaoxin', null, 'Yang Tianxiang, Wei Chao, Qiao Shiyu, Li Xiaomeng, Titus Jin, Liu Xiaoyu, Zhang Kai, Tang Xiaoxi', null, 'As Bai Yue-Chu searches for a bride to foil his family''s plans, a fox youkai falls through the roof.', 'As Bai Yue-Chu searches for a bride to foil his family''s plans, a fox youkai falls through the roof.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/65AXZbM2h3r1blS93Jbk4YD401w.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75787'),
  ('784475015146483583', 'Fox Spirit Matchmaker', 2017, 'Comedy, Animation', null, null, 'Asami Imai, Daisuke Kirii, Hisako Kanemoto, Wataru Hatano, Madoka Yonezawa, Shinnosuke Tachibana, Kana Asumi', null, 'In a world where Spirits and Humans coexist and can fall in love with each other, the Spirits’s life expectancy being far superior to the Human’s one can only see their loved one dying before them. Even when that human is reborn, the previous memories of his past life is erased from his memory. However, it is said among Spirits that a certain “service” is spreading. This“service” is provided by the “Fox Spirit Matchmakers” who can revive the lost memories of their former lover. When the Spirits lose their lover, they can purchase the “service” of the “Fox Spirit Matchmakers” so that they could attempt to regain their former lover memories and start over a new love story. This story follows a young Fox Spirit Matchmaker who tries her best to restore lost memories and spread love.', 'In a world where Spirits and Humans coexist and can fall in love with each other, the Spirits’s life expectancy being far superior to the Human’s one can only see their loved one dying before them. Even when that human is reborn, the previous memories of his past life is erased from his memory. However, it is said among Spirits that a certain “service” is spreading. This“service” is provided by the “Fox Spirit Matchmakers” who can revive the lost memories of their former lover. When the Spirits lose their lover, they can purchase the “service” of the “Fox Spirit Matchmakers” so that they could attempt to regain their former lover memories and start over a new love story. This story follows a young Fox Spirit Matchmaker who tries her best to restore lost memories and spread love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x47eoppdComtCOMrM4RickCwhy4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72632'),
  ('837414248978400795', 'Foyle''s War', 2002, 'Mystery, Drama, War & Politics, Crime', 'Anthony Horowitz', 'Anthony Horowitz', 'Michael Kitchen, Honeysuckle Weeks', null, 'As WW2 rages around the world, DCS Foyle fights his own war on the home-front as he investigates crimes on the south coast of England. Foyle''s War opens in southern England in the year 1940. Later series sees the retired detective working as an MI5 agent operating in the aftermath of the war.', 'As WW2 rages around the world, DCS Foyle fights his own war on the home-front as he investigates crimes on the south coast of England. Foyle''s War opens in southern England in the year 1940. Later series sees the retired detective working as an MI5 agent operating in the aftermath of the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNqHn5UCoa2vodPv5g1nfQE89R4.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:3163'),
  ('7145422319391211', 'Fractale', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kana Hanazawa, Shintaro Asanuma, Yu Kobayashi, Yuka Iguchi, Minami Tsuda', 'TV-14', 'Clain lives quietly amongst doppels—holograms that replace his parents and friends. Alone on a typical day, he saves a shrine maiden from pursuers and treats her wounds. He’s mystified by her worldly charms, but she disappears—leaving only a pendant behind. When a curious girl emerges from the amulet, Clain’s life takes a chaotic turn as he seeks to unlock the secrets his new friend holds.', 'Clain lives quietly amongst doppels—holograms that replace his parents and friends. Alone on a typical day, he saves a shrine maiden from pursuers and treats her wounds. He’s mystified by her worldly charms, but she disappears—leaving only a pendant behind. When a curious girl emerges from the amulet, Clain’s life takes a chaotic turn as he seeks to unlock the secrets his new friend holds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mCP1WkiHSJCagxspLrMjI6xz4Y0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38270'),
  ('158125790505315456', 'Fraggle Rock', 1983, 'Kids, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Jim Henson', null, 'Gerard Parkes, Jerry Nelson, Steve Whitmire, Karen Prell, Dave Goelz, Kathryn Mullen, Bob Stutt, Richard Hunt', 'TV-G', 'The Fraggles are a fun-loving community of creatures who live in a subterranean fantasy land where they love to play, sing and dance their cares away, sharing their world with the tiny Doozers and the giant Gorgs. The series teaches empathy and tolerance and encourages children to understand people different from themselves.', 'The Fraggles are a fun-loving community of creatures who live in a subterranean fantasy land where they love to play, sing and dance their cares away, sharing their world with the tiny Doozers and the giant Gorgs. The series teaches empathy and tolerance and encourages children to understand people different from themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nyvNej9aHC2wydFflPMrASS6MF7.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:2957'),
  ('823986541137245891', 'Fraggle Rock: Back to the Rock', 2022, 'Kids, Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Lilli Cooper, John Tartaglia, Dave Goelz, Jordan Lockhart', 'TV-G', 'Join Gobo, Red, Wembley, Mokey, Boober, and new Fraggle friends on hilarious, epic adventures about the magic that happens when we celebrate and care for our interconnected world.', 'Join Gobo, Red, Wembley, Mokey, Boober, and new Fraggle friends on hilarious, epic adventures about the magic that happens when we celebrate and care for our interconnected world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p8gN7DQMUTRXj9tnkhoCpOXu7vH.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:104002'),
  ('160365015919334944', 'Fraggle Rock: Rock On!', 2020, 'Kids', null, null, 'Karen Prell, John Tartaglia, Donna Kimball, Dave Goelz, Frankie Cordero', 'TV-G', 'The Fraggles might be apart in separate caves, but they can still find ways to have fun together! Join Gobo, Red, Boober, Mokey, Wembley, and Uncle Travelling Matt for stories and songs that show everyone how we''re all connected.', 'The Fraggles might be apart in separate caves, but they can still find ways to have fun together! Join Gobo, Red, Boober, Mokey, Wembley, and Uncle Travelling Matt for stories and songs that show everyone how we''re all connected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vIRbAm9oZTCUpKUIGo9yc5SO15B.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:102318'),
  ('496984475332355881', 'Fraggle Rock: The Animated Series', 1987, 'Family, Animation', 'Jim Henson', null, 'Bob Bergen, Townsend Coleman, Barbara Goodson, Mona Marshall, Rob Paulsen, Patrick Pinney, Michael Laskin, Patty Parris', null, 'Fraggle Rock: The Animated Series is an American animated television series based on the original live action version of the same name created by Jim Henson. NBC aired this spin-off program on Saturday mornings for one season during 1987.', 'Fraggle Rock: The Animated Series is an American animated television series based on the original live action version of the same name created by Jim Henson. NBC aired this spin-off program on Saturday mornings for one season during 1987.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Atisvr4630sLFs1Iy9Lx1kPNmAd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2844'),
  ('837225987439262859', 'Framed! A Sicilian Murder Mystery', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Maddalena Ravagli, Leonardo Fasoli', null, 'Salvatore Ficarra, Valentino Picone, Anna Favella, Marianna Di Martino, Tony Sperandeo', 'TV-MA', 'After two hapless TV technicians stumble upon a murder scene, every step they take to avoid becoming suspects lands them in deeper trouble.', 'After two hapless TV technicians stumble upon a murder scene, every step they take to avoid becoming suspects lands them in deeper trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/16pqJMSwW9R0V35DZoXSUsi7Kjc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:154535'),
  ('445207176644409263', 'Francisco el Matemático: Clase 2017', 2017, 'Drama', null, 'Fernán Rivera, Juan Carlos Troncoso, Jorge Elkim Ospina', 'Carlos Torres, Marcela Bustamante, Katherine Escobar, Kevin Bury, Victoria Ortiz, Ana María Aguilera, Mauricio Figueroa, María Irene Toro', 'NR', 'The Jimmy Carter School receives Francisco a mathematics teacher that not only teaches to his students mathematics topics, he teaches to themes about lessons of life too.', 'The Jimmy Carter School receives Francisco a mathematics teacher that not only teaches to his students mathematics topics, he teaches to themes about lessons of life too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgUwzjbW1uWcDFqt5xr5OyFEe3G.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107155'),
