  ('1063438229396375798', 'Frank Herbert''s Children of Dune', 2003, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'John Harrison', 'John Harrison', 'Alec Newman, James McAvoy, Jessica Brooks, Daniela Amavia, Julie Cox, Edward Atterton, Alice Krige, Susan Sarandon', 'TV-14', 'Frank Herbert''s Children of Dune is a three-part miniseries written by John Harrison and directed by Greg Yaitanes, based on Frank Herbert''s novels Dune Messiah and Children of Dune. First broadcast in the United States on March 16, 2003, Children of Dune is the sequel to the 2000 miniseries Frank Herbert''s Dune and produced by the Sci Fi Channel. As of 2004, this miniseries and its predecessor were two of the three highest-rated programs ever to be broadcast on the Sci-Fi Channel.', 'Frank Herbert''s Children of Dune is a three-part miniseries written by John Harrison and directed by Greg Yaitanes, based on Frank Herbert''s novels Dune Messiah and Children of Dune. First broadcast in the United States on March 16, 2003, Children of Dune is the sequel to the 2000 miniseries Frank Herbert''s Dune and produced by the Sci Fi Channel. As of 2004, this miniseries and its predecessor were two of the three highest-rated programs ever to be broadcast on the Sci-Fi Channel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yCP8lKXBMtcG1CU9K3NsWlu1RgF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9156'),
  ('156443114706236749', 'Frank Herbert''s Dune', 2000, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'John Harrison', null, 'Alec Newman, Barbora Kodetová, Saskia Reeves, William Hurt, P.H. Moriarty, Matt Keeslar, Ian McNeice, Uwe Ochsenknecht', 'TV-14', 'Frank Herbert''s Dune is a three-part miniseries written and directed by John Harrison and based on Frank Herbert''s 1965 novel Dune.', 'Frank Herbert''s Dune is a three-part miniseries written and directed by John Harrison and based on Frank Herbert''s 1965 novel Dune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iIf5XeuuBKPtG6H7MfWLirbJGrQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19566'),
  ('1121335314375444488', 'Frank Lloyd Wright', 1998, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Edward Herrmann', null, 'Frank Lloyd Wright tells the story of the greatest of all American architects. Wright was an authentic American genius, a man who believed he was destined to redesign the world, creating everything anew. Over the course of his long career, he designed over eight hundred buildings, including such revolutionary structures as the Guggenheim Museum, the Johnson Wax Building, Fallingwater, Unity Temple and Taliesin. His buildings and his ideas changed the way we live, work and see the world around us. Frank Lloyd Wright’s architectural achievements were often overshadowed by the turbulence of his melodramatic life. In ninety-two tempestuous years, he fathered seven children, married three times, and was almost constantly embroiled in scandal. Some hated him, some loved him, and in the end, few could deny that he was the one of the most important architects in the world.', 'Frank Lloyd Wright tells the story of the greatest of all American architects. Wright was an authentic American genius, a man who believed he was destined to redesign the world, creating everything anew. Over the course of his long career, he designed over eight hundred buildings, including such revolutionary structures as the Guggenheim Museum, the Johnson Wax Building, Fallingwater, Unity Temple and Taliesin. His buildings and his ideas changed the way we live, work and see the world around us. Frank Lloyd Wright’s architectural achievements were often overshadowed by the turbulence of his melodramatic life. In ninety-two tempestuous years, he fathered seven children, married three times, and was almost constantly embroiled in scandal. Some hated him, some loved him, and in the end, few could deny that he was the one of the most important architects in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gj97RMShjbIBspp7znVHkU5YRXd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77074'),
  ('796940339079236344', 'Frank of Ireland', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Michael Moloney, Domhnall Gleeson, Brian Gleeson', null, 'Brian Gleeson, Domhnall Gleeson, Sarah Greene, Pom Boyd, Tom Vaughan-Lawlor, Liz Fitzgibbon, Pat Shortt', 'TV-MA', 'Frank is a 33-year-old catastrophe; a misanthropic fantasist in arrested development who’s convinced that the world owes him. He''s also our hero. He has a tenuous hold on reality, a single room in his mother’s home, an ex he can’t get over and a loyal best friend, Doofus. This is the hilarious story of a man’s hapless search for respect. We don’t want him to succeed, but it’s fun to watch him try.', 'Frank is a 33-year-old catastrophe; a misanthropic fantasist in arrested development who’s convinced that the world owes him. He''s also our hero. He has a tenuous hold on reality, a single room in his mother’s home, an ex he can’t get over and a loyal best friend, Doofus. This is the hilarious story of a man’s hapless search for respect. We don’t want him to succeed, but it’s fun to watch him try.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wTH3JcFFGK6WRjHRTSZpZ51IMij.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121806'),
  ('173577426687966593', 'Frankelda''s Book of Spooks', 2021, 'Animation', 'Arturo Ambriz, Roy Ambriz', null, 'Mireya Mendoza, Arturo Mercado Jr., Luis Leonardo Suarez', 'NR', 'Frankelda, a mysterious phantom writer, with the help of her grumpy enchanted book, tells terrifying stories in which girls and boys have encounters with monsters that will make them face their deepest fears.', 'Frankelda, a mysterious phantom writer, with the help of her grumpy enchanted book, tells terrifying stories in which girls and boys have encounters with monsters that will make them face their deepest fears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l7joGj61QSDC2jsIOgnUVftoiu2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137720'),
  ('511146490568576862', 'Frankenstein', 2004, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Kevin Connor, Mark Kruger', null, 'Alec Newman, William Hurt, Julie Delpy, Donald Sutherland, Nicole Lewis, Monika Hilmerová, Tomáš Maštalír, Luke Goss', null, 'A scientist brings life to a creature fashioned from corpses and various body parts.', 'A scientist brings life to a creature fashioned from corpses and various body parts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u53pUFpA78iluxsxKNq7ptughuS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40165'),
  ('259426079859094058', 'Frankenstein, Jr. and The Impossibles', 1966, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'John Stephenson, Don Messick, Paul Frees, Ted Cassidy, Hal Smith, Dick Beals', 'TV-G', 'Boy genius Buzz Conroy’s powerful robot, Frankenstein Jr. cranks into action along with a group of crime fighting superheroes disguised as a beatnik rock group, The Impossibles, making hot-rockin’ musical justice!', 'Boy genius Buzz Conroy’s powerful robot, Frankenstein Jr. cranks into action along with a group of crime fighting superheroes disguised as a beatnik rock group, The Impossibles, making hot-rockin’ musical justice!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjlAE8mRwEIpgCC5i6PH1YASQQT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2579'),
  ('815219765972008957', 'Frankie Boyle''s New World Order', 2017, 'News, Comedy', 'Frankie Boyle', 'Frankie Boyle', 'Frankie Boyle', null, 'In an attempt to make sense of the bewildering world we live in, Frankie Boyle dissects the week''s news using stand-up, review, discussion and audience interaction.', 'In an attempt to make sense of the bewildering world we live in, Frankie Boyle dissects the week''s news using stand-up, review, discussion and audience interaction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5fuPFo7YSJH0AT5hqyO3ATXAQ6.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:72140'),
  ('755282107278548894', 'Frankie Drake Mysteries', 2017, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Carol Hay, Michelle Ricci', null, 'Lauren Lee Smith, Chantel Riley, Rebecca Liddiard, Sharron Matthews, Johnathan Sousa', 'TV-PG', 'Toronto’s only female private detective in the 1920s takes on the cases the police don’t want or can’t handle. From airplanes and booze running to American G-men, Communists and union busters, Frankie’s fearless sense of adventure gets her into all kinds of trouble, but she always manages to find her way out.', 'Toronto’s only female private detective in the 1920s takes on the cases the police don’t want or can’t handle. From airplanes and booze running to American G-men, Communists and union busters, Frankie’s fearless sense of adventure gets her into all kinds of trouble, but she always manages to find her way out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/saTRepmDwP3df0f0E8tJNX4BnrS.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:72736'),
  ('527417390923316970', 'Franklin', 1997, 'Animation, Kids, Family', 'Paulette Bourgeois', null, 'Richard Newman, Cole Caplan, Marc McMulkin, Elizabeth Saunders, Leah Renee, Bryn McAuley, Janet-Laine Green, Vivien Endicott Douglas', 'TV-Y', 'Franklin is an Canadian educational animated television series, based on the Franklin the Turtle books by Brenda Clark and Paulette Bourgeois. The television series was named after its main character, Franklin the Turtle. It was produced by PolyGram Television, Alphanim, LuxAnimation, Nelvana, Neurones Enterprises, Reader''s Digest for Young Families, TF1, Funbag Animation Studios, Europool, Mini TFO, and Family Channel, and syndicated by Summit Entertainment.', 'Franklin is an Canadian educational animated television series, based on the Franklin the Turtle books by Brenda Clark and Paulette Bourgeois. The television series was named after its main character, Franklin the Turtle. It was produced by PolyGram Television, Alphanim, LuxAnimation, Nelvana, Neurones Enterprises, Reader''s Digest for Young Families, TF1, Funbag Animation Studios, Europool, Mini TFO, and Family Channel, and syndicated by Summit Entertainment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ep0ol2okz8IB8T0LxhfJMXvJ3Mk.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:1458'),
  ('679396022284943946', 'Franklin', 2024, 'Drama', null, null, 'Michael Douglas, Noah Jupe, Daniel Mays, Ludivine Sagnier, Thibault de Montalembert, Assaad Bouab, Théodore Pellerin', 'TV-MA', 'In December 1776, Benjamin Franklin is world-famous for his electrical experiments. But his passion and power are put to the test when he embarks on a secret mission to France—with the fate of American independence hanging in the balance.', 'In December 1776, Benjamin Franklin is world-famous for his electrical experiments. But his passion and power are put to the test when he embarks on a secret mission to France—with the fate of American independence hanging in the balance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9YV5QCdg95Zp02rKzkVxLxDtUC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197591'),
  ('770956714598370358', 'Franklin & Bash', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kevin Falls, Bill Chais', null, 'Mark-Paul Gosselaar, Breckin Meyer, Malcolm McDowell, Reed Diamond, Toni Trucks, Anthony Ordonez', 'TV-14', 'When they''re not hanging out at their favorite hot dog stand pontificating on what they''d go through to enjoy a night with their favorite female celebrities, Jared Franklin and Peter Bash are chasing down their latest clients...sometimes literally. With business cards in hand, they''re ready to nab a client within seconds after a car accident, arrest for solicitation or any other incident where their legal services may be needed. Once in the courtroom, they show their flair for the dramatic and the shocking.', 'When they''re not hanging out at their favorite hot dog stand pontificating on what they''d go through to enjoy a night with their favorite female celebrities, Jared Franklin and Peter Bash are chasing down their latest clients...sometimes literally. With business cards in hand, they''re ready to nab a client within seconds after a car accident, arrest for solicitation or any other incident where their legal services may be needed. Once in the courtroom, they show their flair for the dramatic and the shocking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/so3xbOsAcG5lkxgfRjHbTFkXxM0.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:33301'),
  ('404715636256373232', 'Frankly Speaking', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jang Ji-yeon', 'Choi Gyeong-seon', 'Go Kyung-pyo, Kang Hanna, Joo Jong-hyuk, Lee Bom-so-ri, Shin Jung-keun, Kang Ae-sim, Hwang Sung-bin, Lee Jin-hyuk', null, 'A well-respected announcer suddenly loses his ability to self-censor on air, catching the attention of a TV writer who invites him on her variety show.', 'A well-respected announcer suddenly loses his ability to self-censor on air, catching the attention of a TV writer who invites him on her variety show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6SBFzYpcg7JTvJoGe11E2TaGjr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211705'),
  ('1078373932331637198', 'Frasier', 1993, 'Comedy, Family', 'David Angell, Peter Casey, David Clark Lee', null, 'Kelsey Grammer, Jane Leeves, David Hyde Pierce, Peri Gilpin, John Mahoney', 'TV-PG', 'After many years spent at the “Cheers” bar, Frasier moves back home to Seattle to work as a radio psychiatrist after his policeman father gets shot in the hip on duty.', 'After many years spent at the “Cheers” bar, Frasier moves back home to Seattle to work as a radio psychiatrist after his policeman father gets shot in the hip on duty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gYAb6GCVEFsU9hzMCG5rxaxoIv3.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:3452'),
  ('610692894942498731', 'Frasier', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Joe Cristalli, Chris Harris', null, 'Kelsey Grammer, Jack Cutmore-Scott, Nicholas Lyndhurst, Toks Olagundoye, Jess Salgueiro, Anders Keith', 'TV-14', 'Follow Frasier Crane in the next chapter of his life as he returns to Boston, Mass., with new challenges to face, new relationships to forge and an old dream or two to finally fulfill.', 'Follow Frasier Crane in the next chapter of his life as he returns to Boston, Mass., with new challenges to face, new relationships to forge and an old dream or two to finally fulfill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQAjtgjgb5VAQXJog1bZgY5cjL2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:195241'),
  ('107796596403157248', 'Fratelli di Crozza', 2017, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Maurizio Crozza, Andrea Zalone', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kUqnCG9eR3zTARTKQLNmVMnT6p0.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:70624'),
  ('215597665780597708', 'Frauds', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Anne Marie O''Connor, Suranne Jones', null, 'Suranne Jones, Jodie Whittaker, Thais Martin, Elizabeth Berrington, Javier Taboada, Lee Boardman', null, 'Bert and Sam have been living in Spain for the last few years, Sam in the rolling hills and Bert in the slightly less idyllic setting of a prison cell. After a decade behind bars, a cancer diagnosis allows Bert to walk free on compassionate discharge. With only a few weeks to live, she resolves to take on a multi-million-pound art heist that will test her mettle, and prove her worth. Sam reluctantly lets Bert back into her life, and quickly finds herself returning to the life of crime she''s tried to leave behind.', 'Bert and Sam have been living in Spain for the last few years, Sam in the rolling hills and Bert in the slightly less idyllic setting of a prison cell. After a decade behind bars, a cancer diagnosis allows Bert to walk free on compassionate discharge. With only a few weeks to live, she resolves to take on a multi-million-pound art heist that will test her mettle, and prove her worth. Sam reluctantly lets Bert back into her life, and quickly finds herself returning to the life of crime she''s tried to leave behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBf5b5ZmgiER20XsEpVCPRdYO83.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:285368'),
  ('479270132693259278', 'Frayed', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sarah Kendall', null, 'Sarah Kendall, Kerry Armstrong, Ben Mingay, Frazer Hadfield, Maggie Ireland-Jones', null, 'Fabulously wealthy London housewife Sammy, is forced to return to the town in Australia she grew up in. But in coming home, Sammy must revisit her past and the events that led her to flee as a teenager years ago.', 'Fabulously wealthy London housewife Sammy, is forced to return to the town in Australia she grew up in. But in coming home, Sammy must revisit her past and the events that led her to flee as a teenager years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g4cdvm4RGeIs3n5NwIYroFoaum3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:93479'),
