  ('266439258127133582', 'Fried', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Harry Williams, Jack Williams', null, 'Katy Wix, Imran Yusuf, Matthew Cottle, Mandeep Dhillon, Sutara Gayle, William Melling', null, 'Fried follows the staff in the struggling Croydon branch of a low rent fast food chain, "Seriously Fried Chicken". We follow the group as they navigate the greasy world of nugget vending under the watchful gaze of Mary, their eternally optimistic but desperately ineffectual branch manager. Her job is coveted by bitter assistant manager Derek, who''s been working at the restaurant "since it were a Wimpy". Then there''s geeky teenager Joe, who only has eyes for Amara; and the man who''s decided they''re best friends - foul-mouthed and relentlessly self-absorbed Ed; and the older, always riled Shontal. Every week the team have to deal with the customers, each other and the indelible smell of oil.', 'Fried follows the staff in the struggling Croydon branch of a low rent fast food chain, "Seriously Fried Chicken". We follow the group as they navigate the greasy world of nugget vending under the watchful gaze of Mary, their eternally optimistic but desperately ineffectual branch manager. Her job is coveted by bitter assistant manager Derek, who''s been working at the restaurant "since it were a Wimpy". Then there''s geeky teenager Joe, who only has eyes for Amara; and the man who''s decided they''re best friends - foul-mouthed and relentlessly self-absorbed Ed; and the older, always riled Shontal. Every week the team have to deal with the customers, each other and the indelible smell of oil.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:63810'),
  ('664551832558301829', 'Friend', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Nasser Akabab, Mansour Badri, Fatima Zahra Qanboua, Nada Haddaoui, Mouhcine Malzi, Noufissa Benchehida, Naima Ilyas', null, 'The series chronicles the life of a young man with autism spectrum disorder, as he faces societal challenges after leaving the overprotective care of his family and entering the world of work, searching for identity and connection.', 'The series chronicles the life of a young man with autism spectrum disorder, as he faces societal challenges after leaving the overprotective care of his family and entering the world of work, searching for identity and connection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YoUKwVeAi5rhGvffy2pOhFejwl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:313107'),
  ('524078144562339764', 'Friendly Rivalry', 2025, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Song Chae-yun', null, 'Lee Hye-ri, Chung Su-bin, Kang Hye-won, Oh Woo-ri, Kim Tae-hun, Chae Seo-eun, Choi Young-jae, Kim Sang-ji', null, 'A high-teen mystery thriller about a close relationship between teenage girls in a harsher survival competition than entrance examinations.', 'A high-teen mystery thriller about a close relationship between teenage girls in a harsher survival competition than entrance examinations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRwNhjpizV7up8KrCmiI94is1bl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259288'),
  ('550928948028718492', 'Friends', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Marta Kauffman, David Crane', null, 'Jennifer Aniston, Courteney Cox, Lisa Kudrow, Matt LeBlanc, Matthew Perry, David Schwimmer', 'TV-14', 'Six young people from New York City, on their own and struggling to survive in the real world, find the companionship, comfort and support they get from each other to be the perfect antidote to the pressures of life.', 'Six young people from New York City, on their own and struggling to survive in the real world, find the companionship, comfort and support they get from each other to be the perfect antidote to the pressures of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2koX1xLkpTQM4IZebYvKysFW1Nh.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:1668'),
  ('232145563934479897', 'Friends', 2002, 'Drama', 'Yoshikazu Okada, Hwang Sun-young', null, 'Won Bin, Han Hye-jin, Lee Dong-gun, Kyoko Fukada, Lee Ho-jae, Sunwoo Eun-Sook, Yukiyoshi Ozawa, Keiko Takeshita', null, 'In the first coproduction of a TV drama between Japan and South Korea, a Japanese tourist and a South Korean film student become good friends after a chance meeting in Hong Kong.', 'In the first coproduction of a TV drama between Japan and South Korea, a Japanese tourist and a South Korean film student become good friends after a chance meeting in Hong Kong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKT9nkFq904WCYRFXpOPoFB4UgX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4581'),
  ('920768305590672814', 'Friends from College', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Francesca Delbanco, Nicholas Stoller', null, 'Keegan-Michael Key, Cobie Smulders, Annie Parisse, Nat Faxon, Fred Savage, Jae Suh Park', 'TV-MA', 'Twenty years after graduation, a tight-knit group of college friends reconnects and discovers that love hasn''t gotten easier with age.', 'Twenty years after graduation, a tight-knit group of college friends reconnects and discovers that love hasn''t gotten easier with age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38HzAmLPNALw0fSdZ7rMH0EymqC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:71890'),
  ('135842842416792717', 'Friends with Benefits', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Michael H. Weber, Scott Neustadter', null, 'Ryan Hansen, Danneel Ackles, Zach Cregger, André Holland, Jessica Lucas', 'TV-14', 'Revolving around a group of twentysomething singles as they navigate the difficult, sometimes rewarding, often confusing world of dating. Loyal and devoted to one another, these friends are never too busy to help a member of the group who might be in need. In fact, their companionship often extends into a more intimate setting - the bedroom.', 'Revolving around a group of twentysomething singles as they navigate the difficult, sometimes rewarding, often confusing world of dating. Loyal and devoted to one another, these friends are never too busy to help a member of the group who might be in need. In fact, their companionship often extends into a more intimate setting - the bedroom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1VWVTX4NRsfpo5MUdVVGMpU0XYl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9777'),
  ('463567029081838017', 'Friends with Better Lives', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Dana Klein', null, 'James Van Der Beek, Kevin Connolly, Majandra Delfino, Zoe Lister-Jones, Brooklyn Decker, Rick Donald', 'TV-14', 'A comedy about six friends at different stages in their lives – married, divorced, newly engaged and single – who are outwardly happy, but secretly questioning if their friends have it better. Andi and Bobby are happily married with two kids but at times long for the days they had less responsibility and more fun; Will is newly single and preaching the bachelor lifestyle, but still pining for his ex-wife; Jules and Lowell are high on their passionate new relationship; and Kate has a successful career but may take a swan dive into the L.A. River when she finds out her last remaining single friend, Jules, just got engaged. When it comes to relationships, these six friends are finding it a challenge to look at each other without wondering… who really has the better life?', 'A comedy about six friends at different stages in their lives – married, divorced, newly engaged and single – who are outwardly happy, but secretly questioning if their friends have it better. Andi and Bobby are happily married with two kids but at times long for the days they had less responsibility and more fun; Will is newly single and preaching the bachelor lifestyle, but still pining for his ex-wife; Jules and Lowell are high on their passionate new relationship; and Kate has a successful career but may take a swan dive into the L.A. River when she finds out her last remaining single friend, Jules, just got engaged. When it comes to relationships, these six friends are finding it a challenge to look at each other without wondering… who really has the better life?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/amSUQrW7siuXgjINMajG3klqV1h.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:58823'),
  ('779752526870948563', 'Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Atsumi Tanezaki, Kana Ichinose, Chiaki Kobayashi, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Hiroki Touchi, Yoji Ueda', 'TV-14', 'Decades after her party defeated the Demon King, an old friend''s funeral launches the elf wizard Frieren on a journey of self-discovery.', 'Decades after her party defeated the Demon King, an old friend''s funeral launches the elf wizard Frieren on a journey of self-discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqZENchTd7lp5zht7BdlqM7RBhD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209867'),
  ('270340026194036514', 'Friesland', 2014, 'Crime', null, null, 'Sophie Dal, Theresa Underberg, Holger Stockhaus, Maxim Mehmet, Felix Vörtler', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pl9YwvmV3iqdV0reIl4YrWvdUCC.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:100942'),
  ('349821803013722061', 'Fright Krewe', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Eli Roth, James Frey', null, 'Sydney Mikayla, Tim Johnson Jr., Terrence Little Gardenhigh, Grace Lu, Chester Rushing, Jacques Colimon', 'TV-PG', 'An ancient prophecy and a Voodoo Queen put misfit teens in charge of saving New Orleans from the biggest demonic threat it’s faced in almost two centuries. But, honestly? Saving the world might be easier than becoming friends.', 'An ancient prophecy and a Voodoo Queen put misfit teens in charge of saving New Orleans from the biggest demonic threat it’s faced in almost two centuries. But, honestly? Saving the world might be easier than becoming friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/63S6OLbrdLTi1fCh7SelF0qieAu.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:228308'),
  ('761126232115424267', 'Fringe', 2008, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Mystery', 'Alex Kurtzman, Roberto Orci, J.J. Abrams', null, 'Anna Torv, Joshua Jackson, Jasika Nicole, John Noble', 'TV-14', 'FBI Special Agent Olivia Dunham, brilliant but formerly institutionalized scientist Walter Bishop and his scheming, reluctant son Peter uncover a deadly mystery involving a series of unbelievable events and realize they may be a part of a larger, more disturbing pattern that blurs the line between science fiction and technology.', 'FBI Special Agent Olivia Dunham, brilliant but formerly institutionalized scientist Walter Bishop and his scheming, reluctant son Peter uncover a deadly mystery involving a series of unbelievable events and realize they may be a part of a larger, more disturbing pattern that blurs the line between science fiction and technology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sY9hg5dLJ93RJOyKEiu1nAtBRND.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1705'),
  ('443160177666092241', 'Frisky Dingo', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Matt Thompson, Adam Reed', null, 'Adam Reed, Christian Danley, Kate Miller, Stuart Culpepper, Killer Mike, Kelly Jenrette, Scott Lipe, Amber Nash', 'TV-MA', 'Alien supervillain Killface wants to destroy Earth. Billionaire playboy Xander Crews realizes he can make more money if he stops him. Who will win?', 'Alien supervillain Killface wants to destroy Earth. Billionaire playboy Xander Crews realizes he can make more money if he stops him. Who will win?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/htOTzAqXEuf5rmqmmcHJG6avqde.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1542'),
  ('281439457981403896', 'Frog and Toad', 2023, 'Kids, Animation, Family', 'Rob Hoegee', null, 'Nat Faxon, Kevin Michael Richardson', 'TV-Y', 'Frog and Toad are not at all alike. Frog likes new adventures. Toad likes the comforts of home. Yet despite their differences, Frog and Toad are always there for each other—as best friends should be.', 'Frog and Toad are not at all alike. Frog likes new adventures. Toad likes the comforts of home. Yet despite their differences, Frog and Toad are always there for each other—as best friends should be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDWTTWNzieMiqNBVfXmTZG18J18.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:219056'),
  ('855078400915934539', 'FROM', 2022, 'Mystery, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'John Griffin', null, 'Harold Perrineau, Catalina Sandino Moreno, Eion Bailey, Pegah Ghafoori, Hannah Cheramy, Simon Webster, Elizabeth Moy', 'TV-MA', 'Unravel the mystery of a nightmarish town in middle America that traps all those who enter. As the unwilling residents fight to keep a sense of normalcy and search for a way out, they must also survive the threats of the surrounding forest – including the terrifying creatures that come out when the sun goes down.', 'Unravel the mystery of a nightmarish town in middle America that traps all those who enter. As the unwilling residents fight to keep a sense of normalcy and search for a way out, they must also survive the threats of the surrounding forest – including the terrifying creatures that come out when the sun goes down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cjXLrg4R7FRPFafvuQ3SSznQOd9.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:124364'),
