  ('765375223577554987', 'Gemini Man', 1976, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Leslie Stevens, Harve Bennett, Steven Bochco', null, 'Ben Murphy, William Sylvester', null, 'Sam Casey is an agent for INTERSECT, a government think-tank and operations center specializing in secret missions. While on a diving assignment, Sam was affected by the radiation from an underwater explosion. The radiation rendered him invisible, but INTERSECT devised a way to control his invisibility, by fitting him with a computerized watch that kept him visible. He could, however, shut it off, and become invisible again, for short periods of time. If he did this for more than 15 minutes in any 24 hour period he would die. This ability to become invisible made him a very effective agent.', 'Sam Casey is an agent for INTERSECT, a government think-tank and operations center specializing in secret missions. While on a diving assignment, Sam was affected by the radiation from an underwater explosion. The radiation rendered him invisible, but INTERSECT devised a way to control his invisibility, by fitting him with a computerized watch that kept him visible. He could, however, shut it off, and become invisible again, for short periods of time. If he did this for more than 15 minutes in any 24 hour period he would die. This ability to become invisible made him a very effective agent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wbtpayQg5kBN4CSUElheyJNqG4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13831'),
  ('660938683752793849', 'Gen V', 2023, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Craig Rosenberg, Evan Goldberg, Eric Kripke', null, 'Jaz Sinclair, Lizze Broadway, Maddie Phillips, London Thor, Derek Luh, Asa Germann, Sean Patrick Thomas, Hamish Linklater', 'TV-MA', 'At America''s only college for superheroes, gifted students put their moral boundaries to the test, competing for the university''s top ranking, and a chance to join The Seven, Vought International''s elite superhero team. When the school''s dark secrets come to light, they must decide what kind of heroes they want to become.', 'At America''s only college for superheroes, gifted students put their moral boundaries to the test, competing for the university''s top ranking, and a chance to join The Seven, Vought International''s elite superhero team. When the school''s dark secrets come to light, they must decide what kind of heroes they want to become.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tEv842Nd5uMSavURG4aQO1pNtst.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:205715'),
  ('73243216963826941', 'Gen Z', 2023, 'Drama', 'Xiaojun Han', null, 'Wu Gang, Zhao Lusi, Luo Yizhou, Zhang Meng, Jiang Shan, Zhou Chengao, Zhu Junlin, Li Baihui', null, 'Professor Ren Xinzheng resigns to start a mentoring class for traditional Chinese medicine, hoping to train true successors. His students—Sun Toutou, his son Ren Tianzhen, lawyer-turned-student Yang Xiaohong, pediatrician Peng Shiyan, and aspiring doctor Zhao Liquan—struggle to get along, but must work through their differences to preserve the legacy of Chinese medicine.', 'Professor Ren Xinzheng resigns to start a mentoring class for traditional Chinese medicine, hoping to train true successors. His students—Sun Toutou, his son Ren Tianzhen, lawyer-turned-student Yang Xiaohong, pediatrician Peng Shiyan, and aspiring doctor Zhao Liquan—struggle to get along, but must work through their differences to preserve the legacy of Chinese medicine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2C8LwBBCnU3uyKppMxIruEr7Zjp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:226002'),
  ('361326126985664585', 'gen:LOCK', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Gray Haddock', 'Gray Haddock', 'Michael B. Jordan, Dakota Fanning, Maisie Williams, Koichi Yamadera, Lindsay Jones, Miles Luna, Chad James, Blaine Gibson', 'TV-14', 'Fifty years in the future, an oppressive authoritarian force threatens to conquer the world. A daring team is recruited to pilot a new form of weaponized neuroscience that powers devastating mecha, but they must be willing to sacrifice everything to save the world.', 'Fifty years in the future, an oppressive authoritarian force threatens to conquer the world. A daring team is recruited to pilot a new form of weaponized neuroscience that powers devastating mecha, but they must be willing to sacrifice everything to save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wRhHlUMNMBCTOfbT8zP7CsWCB83.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:86233'),
  ('96306601445174836', 'Gene Simmons: Family Jewels', 2006, null, 'Gene Simmons', null, 'Shannon Tweed, Gene Simmons, Sophie Simmons, Nick Simmons, Tracy Tweed', null, 'Welcome to the unconventional family life of KISS front man Gene Simmons. Simmons and actress Shannon Tweed have been happily unmarried for twenty years and have two children, Nick and Sophie. Gene Simmons Family Jewels reveals a side of Gene that has remained hidden until now. See the softer side of this metal manic as he balances his rock star life with his role as a dad.', 'Welcome to the unconventional family life of KISS front man Gene Simmons. Simmons and actress Shannon Tweed have been happily unmarried for twenty years and have two children, Nick and Sophie. Gene Simmons Family Jewels reveals a side of Gene that has remained hidden until now. See the softer side of this metal manic as he balances his rock star life with his role as a dad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7L5SG57CeojwqldJqRAGldILAsv.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:3195'),
