  ('41081536540291266', 'Genesis', 2021, 'Soap, Drama', 'Camilo Pellegrini, Raphaela Castro, Stephanie Ribeiro', null, 'Juliano Laham, Ingra Lyberato, Daniela Escobar, Letícia Almeida, Petrônio Gontijo, Thiago Rodrigues, Paulo Dalagnoli, Patrícia França', null, 'The story of the first 2,300 years of humanity and recounts events exclusively from that period. The plot begins by giving us a greater understanding of why we exist and how we turned from perfection to imperfection. The origin of all social and racial problems is there at the beginning of everything, when via one decision a human being who only knew good and enjoyed it so much also chose to know evil.', 'The story of the first 2,300 years of humanity and recounts events exclusively from that period. The plot begins by giving us a greater understanding of why we exist and how we turned from perfection to imperfection. The origin of all social and racial problems is there at the beginning of everything, when via one decision a human being who only knew good and enjoyed it so much also chose to know evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZJt1XlRVbQhGV7MtZnbiR6vxPh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:115645'),
