  ('365739653995673947', 'George Harrison: Living in the Material World', 2011, 'Documentary', null, null, 'George Harrison, Paul McCartney, Klaus Voormann, Ringo Starr, John Lennon, Astrid Kirchherr, Pattie Boyd, Dhani Harrison', null, 'He was part of the most famous rock-''n''-roll quartet in history. But George Harrison was much more than just a member of The Beatles.', 'He was part of the most famous rock-''n''-roll quartet in history. But George Harrison was much more than just a member of The Beatles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tA16kVP6zyiPeUK0ZmkPieujVqI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43107'),
  ('490639614677234479', 'George Lopez', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Bruce Helford, George López, Bob Borden', null, 'George López, Constance Marie, Luis Armand Garcia, Valente Rodriguez, Belita Moreno, Aimee Garcia, Emiliano Díez', 'TV-PG', 'George raises daughter Carmen and dyslexic son Max with his wife Angie, after surviving a miserable, dysfunctional childhood at the hands of his neglectful alcoholic mother Benny.', 'George raises daughter Carmen and dyslexic son Max with his wife Angie, after surviving a miserable, dysfunctional childhood at the hands of his neglectful alcoholic mother Benny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jV28WAGIqAKf4uoRK4IqJz4KMY0.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:3308'),
  ('969381565097236086', 'George of the Jungle', 1967, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', null, null, 'Daws Butler, Bill Scott, Paul Frees, June Foray', null, 'George of the Jungle is an American animated series produced by Jay Ward and Bill Scott, who created The Rocky and Bullwinkle Show. The character George was inspired by the legend of Tarzan. It ran for 17 episodes on Saturday mornings from September 9 to December 30, 1967, on the American TV network ABC. The half-hour program was distributed for many years by Worldvision Enterprises, currently part of CBS Television Distribution. Each Full Episode was a compilation of 3 mini episodes from 3 different shows: George of the Jungle; Tom Slick; Super Chicken -Each voiced by the same actors.', 'George of the Jungle is an American animated series produced by Jay Ward and Bill Scott, who created The Rocky and Bullwinkle Show. The character George was inspired by the legend of Tarzan. It ran for 17 episodes on Saturday mornings from September 9 to December 30, 1967, on the American TV network ABC. The half-hour program was distributed for many years by Worldvision Enterprises, currently part of CBS Television Distribution. Each Full Episode was a compilation of 3 mini episodes from 3 different shows: George of the Jungle; Tom Slick; Super Chicken -Each voiced by the same actors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1kofQBKSoHII65Z0ZX4oCdERxXy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5154'),
  ('560888429087971177', 'George of the Jungle', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', null, null, 'Cory Doran, Rob Tinkler, Linda Ballantyne, Bridget Wareham, Mark Oliver, Brian Drummond, Jeff Lumby', 'NR', 'This series is a reboot of Jay Ward and Bill Scott’s 1967 American animated television series of the same name, which in turn is a spoof of the fictional character Tarzan, created by Edgar Rice Burroughs.', 'This series is a reboot of Jay Ward and Bill Scott’s 1967 American animated television series of the same name, which in turn is a spoof of the fictional character Tarzan, created by Edgar Rice Burroughs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j8Bh9getcnUEDVkBquTZLJ6VYhH.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:14076'),
  ('291323313893342837', 'George Shrinks', 2000, 'Kids, Animation, Family', null, null, 'Tracey Moore, Bryn McAuley, Kathleen Laskey, Robbi Jay Thuet, Paul O''Sullivan', 'TV-Y', 'George Shrinks is a French-Canadian/American/Chinese animated television series. It is based on the children''s book by William Joyce, produced in China by Jade Animation and in Canada by Nelvana, in association with Public Broadcasting Service. It tells the story of a ten-year-old boy named George who, one night dreams that he is three inches tall, only to wake up and discover that it is true. The show details his adventures with his friends and family going all through his adventures on his mini machine''s that George and his musical father have created.', 'George Shrinks is a French-Canadian/American/Chinese animated television series. It is based on the children''s book by William Joyce, produced in China by Jade Animation and in Canada by Nelvana, in association with Public Broadcasting Service. It tells the story of a ten-year-old boy named George who, one night dreams that he is three inches tall, only to wake up and discover that it is true. The show details his adventures with his friends and family going all through his adventures on his mini machine''s that George and his musical father have created.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/st1JkW4fxsu1aAJguhRRzUL1u8v.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:11127'),
  ('292623298824797324', 'Georgie & Mandy''s First Marriage', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Chuck Lorre, Steve Holland, Steven Molaro', null, 'Montana Jordan, Emily Osment, Rachel Bay Jones, Will Sasso, Dougie Baldwin, Jessie Prez', 'TV-PG', 'Georgie and Mandy raise their young family in Texas while navigating the challenges of adulthood, parenting, and marriage.', 'Georgie and Mandy raise their young family in Texas while navigating the challenges of adulthood, parenting, and marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3z2mYFxUkzanb2eeIcVyfJq0G3q.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:243875'),
  ('234535562737929186', 'German Crime Story: Gefesselt', 2023, 'Crime', null, 'Michael Proehl', 'Oliver Masucci, Angelina Häntsch, Sylvester Groth, Wolf Danny Homann, Valentina Sauca, Thomas Lawinky, Nikola Kastner, Ulrike Willenbacher', null, 'Nela Langenbeck is a commissioner with the Hamburg police and not only fights against crime, but also against the misogynist structures of the police apparatus of the 1990s. She and her colleagues are not really taken seriously and are often treated more like secretaries. You can make coffee and sort files. Langenbeck is investigating the case of the acid barrel murderer Raik Doormann, who absolutely needs to be under lock and key because she is the only one who takes an escaped victim seriously. Doorman abducts, tortures and kills women in his own nuclear bunker and throws body parts into acid barrels. His goal is to extort money to make his dream of living in Costa Rica possible. The commissioner gets on the trail of the woman killer and uncovers incredibly brutal machinations that keep the whole country in suspense...', 'Nela Langenbeck is a commissioner with the Hamburg police and not only fights against crime, but also against the misogynist structures of the police apparatus of the 1990s. She and her colleagues are not really taken seriously and are often treated more like secretaries. You can make coffee and sort files. Langenbeck is investigating the case of the acid barrel murderer Raik Doormann, who absolutely needs to be under lock and key because she is the only one who takes an escaped victim seriously. Doorman abducts, tortures and kills women in his own nuclear bunker and throws body parts into acid barrels. His goal is to extort money to make his dream of living in Costa Rica possible. The commissioner gets on the trail of the woman killer and uncovers incredibly brutal machinations that keep the whole country in suspense...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGMfDx1XUJBuH35on0tEO2v7p6g.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218069'),
