  ('319825352245320033', 'Germany''s Next Topmodel', 2006, 'Reality', null, null, 'Heidi Klum', 'NR', 'Germany''s Next Topmodel is a German reality television show, based on a concept that was introduced by Tyra Banks with America''s Next Top Model. The competition is hosted by Heidi Klum. She also serves as the lead judge and executive producer of the show.', 'Germany''s Next Topmodel is a German reality television show, based on a concept that was introduced by Tyra Banks with America''s Next Top Model. The competition is hosted by Heidi Klum. She also serves as the lead judge and executive producer of the show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wkQuRYdYJMOKO4F5qpQ6DV2ySuY.jpg', 21, 'tmdb:tv:4781'),
