  ('490156409134916061', 'Grahan', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', 'Shailendra Kumar Jha', 'Vibha Singh, Navjot Gulati, Ranjan Chandel', 'Zoya Hussain, Pavan Malhotra, Anshumaan Pushkar, Wamiqa Gabbi', 'TV-MA', 'It''s 1984 - a tender love story succumbs to the anti-Sikh riots. It''s 2016 - IPS officer Amrita Singh uncovers a secret connecting that past to her present.', 'It''s 1984 - a tender love story succumbs to the anti-Sikh riots. It''s 2016 - IPS officer Amrita Singh uncovers a secret connecting that past to her present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lw1WQw4kAE28k5e9Sx2RbcB4uR1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127862'),
