  ('1053178055067659397', 'Greek', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Patrick Sean Smith', null, 'Amber Stevens West, Spencer Grammer, Clark Duke, Dilshad Vadsaria, Jacob Zachar, Paul James, Scott Michael Foster, Jake McDorman', 'TV-14', 'Casey Cartwright is poised to become the most powerful girl in the Greek system. Rusty, her little brother, is new on campus and he''s the geek. But he sees Cyprus-Rhodes University as an opportunity to create a whole new identity.', 'Casey Cartwright is poised to become the most powerful girl in the Greek system. Rusty, her little brother, is new on campus and he''s the geek. But he sees Cyprus-Rhodes University as an opportunity to create a whole new identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rACiWmSFI4Js0ZGI4Q0P5LJ895R.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1242'),
  ('681365871612294443', 'Greek Salad', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Cédric Klapisch', null, 'Aliocha Schneider, Megan Northam, Aggy K. Adams, Dimitris Kitsos, Fotinì Peluso, Reham Al-Kassar, Amir Baylly, Davide Iachini', 'TV-MA', 'Takes place twenty years after the events of “L’Auberge Espanole,” and follows Tom and Mia, the children of the film’s protagonists Xavier and Wendy, as they spend time in Athens.', 'Takes place twenty years after the events of “L’Auberge Espanole,” and follows Tom and Mia, the children of the film’s protagonists Xavier and Wendy, as they spend time in Athens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jYWqzYQIl4aGuDOciSp8g2H3eWF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121459'),
  ('102373839304480457', 'Green Acres', 1965, 'Comedy', 'Paul Henning, Jay Sommers', null, 'Eddie Albert, Eva Gabor, Pat Buttram, Tom Lester, Alvy Moore, Frank Cady', 'TV-G', 'Green Acres is an American sitcom starring Eddie Albert and Eva Gabor as a couple who move from New York City to a rural country farm. Produced by Filmways as a sister show to Petticoat Junction, the series was first broadcast on CBS, from September 15, 1965 to April 27, 1971. Receiving solid ratings during its six-year run, Green Acres was cancelled in 1971 as part of the "rural purge" by CBS. The sitcom has been in syndication and is available in DVD and VHS releases. In 1997, the two-part episode "A Star Named Arnold is Born" was ranked #59 on TV Guide''s 100 Greatest Episodes of All Time.', 'Green Acres is an American sitcom starring Eddie Albert and Eva Gabor as a couple who move from New York City to a rural country farm. Produced by Filmways as a sister show to Petticoat Junction, the series was first broadcast on CBS, from September 15, 1965 to April 27, 1971. Receiving solid ratings during its six-year run, Green Acres was cancelled in 1971 as part of the "rural purge" by CBS. The sitcom has been in syndication and is available in DVD and VHS releases. In 1997, the two-part episode "A Star Named Arnold is Born" was ranked #59 on TV Guide''s 100 Greatest Episodes of All Time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1tCh5D0dyPw8tiknprgbljAAEPw.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:609'),
  ('308975766806137768', 'Green Eggs and Ham', 2019, 'Kids, Family, Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Jared Stern', null, 'Adam Devine, Michael Douglas, Ilana Glazer, Diane Keaton, Keegan-Michael Key, Patricia Clarkson, Jillian Bell', 'TV-Y7', 'Guy-Am-I, an inventor, and his friend Sam-I-Am go on a cross-country trip that would test the limits of their friendship. As they learn to try new things, they find out what adventure brings.', 'Guy-Am-I, an inventor, and his friend Sam-I-Am go on a cross-country trip that would test the limits of their friendship. As they learn to try new things, they find out what adventure brings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPbNUuCOD2ilcVWf5yjjkMqyoxs.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:86957'),
  ('943745172624651727', 'Green Frontier', 2019, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Diego Ramírez Schrempp, Mauricio Leiva-Cock, Jenny Ceballos', null, 'Juana del Río, Miguel Dionisio Ramos, Ángela Cano, Nelson Camayo', null, 'When a young Bogotá-based detective gets drawn into the jungle to investigate four femicides, she uncovers magic, an evil plot and her own true origins.', 'When a young Bogotá-based detective gets drawn into the jungle to investigate four femicides, she uncovers magic, an evil plot and her own true origins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yyR96MYj2fPtPQBOyfR8v9JcMQr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91699'),
  ('1097301007268073236', 'Green Green', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Hiroshi Kamiya, Kana Ueda, Jin Domon, Sara Nakayama, Eriko Fujimaki, Ken Takeuchi, Kenji Hamada, Saori Sugimoto', 'TV-MA', 'At the isolated all-male boarding school of Kanenone Gakuen there are no females for miles but the school board has begun talks to merge with an all-girl boarding school, in hopes of becoming a co-ed boarding school.', 'At the isolated all-male boarding school of Kanenone Gakuen there are no females for miles but the school board has begun talks to merge with an all-girl boarding school, in hopes of becoming a co-ed boarding school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kooX3WmmitM1EtrBMj7uz9dUr1Y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21897'),
  ('283141599808090885', 'Green Green Grass By The River', 1992, 'Drama', null, null, 'Jin Ming, Liu Fang, Ma Jingtao, Gua Ah-leh, Leanne Liu, Yue Ling, He Qing, Yue Yueli', null, 'Xiao Cao is a young orphan living with her cruel aunt and uncle. She has a sisterly bond with her neighbour, Qing Qing, who is being forced into a marriage with a much older man by her older brother. Desperate to escape their unfortunate circumstances, the two girls manage to run away together on the day of Qing Qing''s wedding. During their escape they coincidentally meet He Shiwei, a young university student who is also running away from his family due to an arranged marriage. After a few initial misunderstandings the three decide to travel together. However, things become complicated when they encounter the Fu family, and the family matriarch mistakes He Shiwei for her son, Fu Yuankai, who died 10 years ago.', 'Xiao Cao is a young orphan living with her cruel aunt and uncle. She has a sisterly bond with her neighbour, Qing Qing, who is being forced into a marriage with a much older man by her older brother. Desperate to escape their unfortunate circumstances, the two girls manage to run away together on the day of Qing Qing''s wedding. During their escape they coincidentally meet He Shiwei, a young university student who is also running away from his family due to an arranged marriage. After a few initial misunderstandings the three decide to travel together. However, things become complicated when they encounter the Fu family, and the family matriarch mistakes He Shiwei for her son, Fu Yuankai, who died 10 years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHXJkCzrsnxNeq0K980854Jb8Xd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107100'),
  ('815391983308687977', 'Green Lantern: The Animated Series', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Bruce Timm', null, 'Josh Keaton, Kevin Michael Richardson, Jason Spisak, Grey DeLisle', 'TV-PG', 'The Green Lanterns Hal and his partner Kilowog fight against the forces of the Red Lanterns.', 'The Green Lanterns Hal and his partner Kilowog fight against the forces of the Red Lanterns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJwEpFAoedQ6POM9dD83ijFk5ME.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40351'),
