  ('521586013255667034', 'Green Wing', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Victoria Pile', null, 'Sally Bretton, Oliver Chris, Olivia Colman, Michelle Gomez, Tamsin Greig, Pippa Haywood, Mark Heap, Katie Lyons', null, 'Follow new surgical registrar Dr Caroline Todd through her first day at work and beyond, starting out as she means to go on - dishevelled and under-deodorised! Along the way she meets an assortment of bizarre and demented characters. Be prepared for one of the most surreal journeys you''re ever likely to take as you dive into the anarchic world of Green Wing Hospital!', 'Follow new surgical registrar Dr Caroline Todd through her first day at work and beyond, starting out as she means to go on - dishevelled and under-deodorised! Along the way she meets an assortment of bizarre and demented characters. Be prepared for one of the most surreal journeys you''re ever likely to take as you dive into the anarchic world of Green Wing Hospital!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eMGFMe8m3y58R4N45oLySzdyTpv.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1456'),
  ('1125168504792287078', 'Greenhouse Academy', 2017, 'Drama', 'Giora Chamizer', null, 'Ariel Mortman, Finn Roberts, Christopher O''Neal, Dallas Hart, Cinthya Carmona, Benjamin Papac, B.J. Mitchell, Parker Stevenson', 'TV-PG', 'When teen siblings Hayley and Alex enter an elite boarding school, they find rivalry, romance and a mystery related to the recent loss of their mom.', 'When teen siblings Hayley and Alex enter an elite boarding school, they find rivalry, romance and a mystery related to the recent loss of their mom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pwKPvq66nevyaj4OvBFFVK23fo8.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:73602'),
  ('761751985203552778', 'Greenleaf', 2016, 'Drama', 'Craig Wright', null, 'Lynn Whitfield, Keith David, Lamman Rucker, Merle Dandridge, Kim Hawthorne, Desiree Ross, Lovie Simone, Deborah Joy Winans', 'TV-14', 'The unscrupulous world of the Greenleaf family and their sprawling Memphis megachurch, where scandalous secrets and lies are as numerous as the faithful. Born of the church, the Greenleaf family love and care for each other, but beneath the surface lies a den of iniquity—greed, adultery, sibling rivalry and conflicting values—that threatens to tear apart the very core of their faith that holds them together.', 'The unscrupulous world of the Greenleaf family and their sprawling Memphis megachurch, where scandalous secrets and lies are as numerous as the faithful. Born of the church, the Greenleaf family love and care for each other, but beneath the surface lies a den of iniquity—greed, adultery, sibling rivalry and conflicting values—that threatens to tear apart the very core of their faith that holds them together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnKwzDle0E7tHnddW9gbFf44GzH.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:66830'),
