  ('929602945189644762', 'Grotesco', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Per Andersson, Michael Lindgren, Rikard Ulvshammar', null, 'Henrik Dorsin, Linus Eklund Adolphson, Michael Lindgren, Per Andersson, Rikard Ulvshammar, Emma Molin, Emma Peters', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cA0cfAFcJ4mGuXY45cFU9CkpxbY.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:38375'),
  ('738084605477828357', 'Grotesquerie', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Ryan Murphy, Jon Robin Baitz, Joe Baken', null, 'Niecy Nash, Courtney B. Vance, Nicholas Alexander Chavez, Micaela Diamond, Raven Goodwin, Lesley Manville', 'TV-MA', 'A series of heinous crimes have unsettled a small community, and Detective Lois Tryon feels they are eerily personal, as if someone—or something—is taunting her.', 'A series of heinous crimes have unsettled a small community, and Detective Lois Tryon feels they are eerily personal, as if someone—or something—is taunting her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vu7X19nHIJ9HOXhES3DIhO9N99c.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:247518'),
  ('579273478440801650', 'Ground Control to Psychoelectric Girl', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Yuniko Ayana', 'Miyu Irino, Asuka Ohgame, Ai Nonaka, Emiri Kato, Mai Fuchigami, Yuka Iguchi', 'TV-14', 'The story revolves around a highschool boy named Niwa Makoto. He lives with his aunt''s family since his parents are away on business. It is there where he meets his mysterious cousin of the same age Touwa Erio — who happens to tie a futon mattress around her upper body and is a self-proclaimed alien. Her staple food is pizza. Erio had been missing for half a year and was found floating in the sea. She doesn''t remember anything about what happened during that period of time, but she began to think that it was the act of an alien and wanders the neighbourhood wrapped in the futon.', 'The story revolves around a highschool boy named Niwa Makoto. He lives with his aunt''s family since his parents are away on business. It is there where he meets his mysterious cousin of the same age Touwa Erio — who happens to tie a futon mattress around her upper body and is a self-proclaimed alien. Her staple food is pizza. Erio had been missing for half a year and was found floating in the sea. She doesn''t remember anything about what happened during that period of time, but she began to think that it was the act of an alien and wanders the neighbourhood wrapped in the futon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2gh4SOBjRkMe1fTnKIP9viM3jZB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65356'),
  ('76395317813660558', 'Ground Floor', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Bill Lawrence, Greg Malins', null, 'Skylar Astin, Briga Heelan, John C. McGinley, Rory Scovel, Rene Gube, James Earl, Emily Heller', 'TV-14', 'Brody, a young hot-shot banker at Whitestone Trust, thought he was just having a one-night stand with Jennifer, a beautiful woman he met at a bar. But when he discovers that she works in maintenance for the building where he works, their worlds begin to collide in the most unexpected way. Facing Brody’s critical boss, Mr. Mansfield, as well as annoyed colleagues, the pair must find a way to deal with their growing feelings for each other in this modern take on Romeo & Juliet.', 'Brody, a young hot-shot banker at Whitestone Trust, thought he was just having a one-night stand with Jennifer, a beautiful woman he met at a bar. But when he discovers that she works in maintenance for the building where he works, their worlds begin to collide in the most unexpected way. Facing Brody’s critical boss, Mr. Mansfield, as well as annoyed colleagues, the pair must find a way to deal with their growing feelings for each other in this modern take on Romeo & Juliet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQ95bGk8da1xbD6f6p7AyBI9Rng.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:57815'),
  ('1065336791802199654', 'Grounded for Life', 2001, 'Family, Comedy', 'Mike Schiff, Bill Martin', null, 'Donal Logue, Megyn Price, Kevin Corrigan, Lynsey Bartilson, Griffin Frazen', 'TV-PG', 'Right out of high school, Sean Finnerty got his girlfriend Claudia pregnant. Now she’s his wife, and at just 32, he’s somehow found himself with 14-year-old daughter Lily, two little boys, and a constant struggle between his need to be responsible and his desperate desire to be irresponsible. His judgmental father Walt and devil-may-care brother Eddie are no help at all. When they all get together, stories always start to fly. Of course, Sean’s family will never let him finish a story; they interrupt, they debate, they derail, they defend themselves; just like any good family would.', 'Right out of high school, Sean Finnerty got his girlfriend Claudia pregnant. Now she’s his wife, and at just 32, he’s somehow found himself with 14-year-old daughter Lily, two little boys, and a constant struggle between his need to be responsible and his desperate desire to be irresponsible. His judgmental father Walt and devil-may-care brother Eddie are no help at all. When they all get together, stories always start to fly. Of course, Sean’s family will never let him finish a story; they interrupt, they debate, they derail, they defend themselves; just like any good family would.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbcNGnpZsvZUuyHlGZ5LBbaEH6m.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:4731'),
  ('310203300007660173', 'Grow Up', 2015, 'Drama', null, null, 'Lu Yi, Bai Baihe, Liu Lu, Feng Jiayi, Bai Yu, Maggie Jiang, Shen Lei', null, 'Ye Chunmeng, a determined medical intern from a small town, struggles with feelings of inferiority due to her humble background. Despite facing temptations and navigating a complicated relationship with her tough mentor, Zhou Ming, she finds guidance through her patients. As she grows, Chunming discovers the true fulfillment of being a doctor and uncovers the real meaning of happiness.', 'Ye Chunmeng, a determined medical intern from a small town, struggles with feelings of inferiority due to her humble background. Despite facing temptations and navigating a complicated relationship with her tough mentor, Zhou Ming, she finds guidance through her patients. As she grows, Chunming discovers the true fulfillment of being a doctor and uncovers the real meaning of happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LcrBlJS5aj9WlSTs4N1lMzk02j.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75067'),
  ('1100055850270539178', 'Growing Pains', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Neal Marlens', null, 'Alan Thicke, Joanna Kerns, Kirk Cameron, Tracey Gold, Jeremy Miller, Ashley Johnson, Leonardo DiCaprio', 'TV-G', 'Fatherhood has taken on a whole new meaning for Jason Seaver, who has assumed the chores of cooking, cleaning and minding the kids so that his wife, Maggie, can pursue a career in journalism after spending 15 years as a housewife.', 'Fatherhood has taken on a whole new meaning for Jason Seaver, who has assumed the chores of cooking, cleaning and minding the kids so that his wife, Maggie, can pursue a career in journalism after spending 15 years as a housewife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhzttMAkFTFAax2CTBAql1CaaXB.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:54'),
  ('571572159026025007', 'Growing Season', 2020, 'Drama', null, null, 'Han Su-ah, Park Ji-won, Kim Chae-eun, Kim Kang-min, Choi Yoon-je, Kang You-seok', null, 'Three friends have different thoughts about sex, which brings about conflicts. This is a romance story of youth (and sex) that they find their turning point in a relationship through understanding.', 'Three friends have different thoughts about sex, which brings about conflicts. This is a romance story of youth (and sex) that they find their turning point in a relationship through understanding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iAp1Pg0NuLTKjd1quvHrXhGa7mT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:115609'),
  ('645365898067116844', 'Growing Together', 2024, 'Family', 'Li Ya Fei', null, 'Zhang Jiayi, Chen Hao, Wang Xiaochen, Zhao Da, Ling Zi, Liu Ruilin, Li Chuanying, Lennon Sun', null, 'Screenwriter Liu Xiangshang has a relatively free schedule in his daily schedule. He is responsible for the education and care of his son Guoning and daughter Guobao at home, while his wife Dai Jing chooses to work in an out-of-town company with a higher salary.', 'Screenwriter Liu Xiangshang has a relatively free schedule in his daily schedule. He is responsible for the education and care of his son Guoning and daughter Guobao at home, while his wife Dai Jing chooses to work in an out-of-town company with a higher salary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJ6mwgXxTi73pqSRTRGBdNxWAPA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:245194'),
  ('949559995440897159', 'Growing Up Chrisley', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, 'Savannah Chrisley, Chase Chrisley', 'TV-14', 'Chase and Savannah Chrisley embark on a cross-country move to prove they''re independent grown-ups.', 'Chase and Savannah Chrisley embark on a cross-country move to prove they''re independent grown-ups.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/trU7ML8szOy703018x1BhjMGmbf.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:88145'),
  ('977250994684255915', 'Growing Up Fisher', 2014, 'Comedy', 'D.J. Nash', null, 'J.K. Simmons, Jenna Elfman, Eli Baker, Ava Deluca-Verley, Lance Lim', 'TV-PG', 'It''s not every family that''s brought closer together by divorce, but then again, the Fishers are anything but typical.', 'It''s not every family that''s brought closer together by divorce, but then again, the Fishers are anything but typical.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/at9EVvRIzeOPt6F4mTidOiquiT9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:58838'),
  ('979360401458316169', 'Growing Up Hip Hop: Atlanta', 2017, 'Reality', null, null, 'Shad Moss, Shaniah Mauldin, Reginae Carter, Ayana Fite, Brandon Barnes, Zonnique Pullins', 'TV-14', 'Chronicling the perks and perils of being born into Hip Hop royalty in the city that the New York Times called “Hip Hop’s center of gravity” - Atlanta.', 'Chronicling the perks and perils of being born into Hip Hop royalty in the city that the New York Times called “Hip Hop’s center of gravity” - Atlanta.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZA7FGe5NK4aaIIkYH9gtOmCKcM.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:71888'),
  ('43153065199960514', 'grown-ish', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Kenya Barris, Larry Wilmore', 'Lance Holloway', 'Trevor Jackson, Marcus Scribner, Daniella Taylor, Diggy Simmons, Justine Skye, Tara Raani', 'TV-14', 'Zoey Johnson heads to college and begins her hilarious journey to adulthood but quickly discovers that not everything goes her way once she leaves the nest.', 'Zoey Johnson heads to college and begins her hilarious journey to adulthood but quickly discovers that not everything goes her way once she leaves the nest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nq09OaG43ZESp8uwdkFEBC7iFbk.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:71885'),
  ('347433614515128451', 'Gruvan', 2025, 'Reality', null, null, 'Bengt Magnusson', null, 'Go beneath the surface to witness the massive machinery and human grit powering Sweden''s industrial engine. A 24/7 look at the high-tech, subterranean world that never sleeps.', 'Go beneath the surface to witness the massive machinery and human grit powering Sweden''s industrial engine. A 24/7 look at the high-tech, subterranean world that never sleeps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ht0Xcxl5GatDRLytfRpQh9VzOXX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:303515'),
  ('469488491348662502', 'GTO', 2012, 'Drama', 'Masaki Fukasawa', null, 'Ryohei Kurosawa, Yusuke Yamamoto, Manami Higa, Tsubasa Honda, Yu Shirota, Miori Takimoto, Hitomi Kuroki, Haruna Kawaguchi', null, 'Through the introduction of his friend Danma Ryuji, Onizuka Eikichi, the former legendary bike gang member, visits Meishu Academy to tend to the trees in the garden as a part-time gardener. Learning that Yoshikawa Noboru, a student in teacher Fuyutsuki Azusa’s class is being bullied by Uehara Kyoko and other classmates, Onizuka befriends and saves Yoshikawa. Seeing Onizuka’s unprecedented but visceral, powerful response to problem solving, the school’s president and principal, Sakurai Yoshiko, overrides resistance from her vice principal Uchiyamada Hiroshi and makes Onizuka a teacher. Onizuka goes on to tackle many issues as the teacher in charge of the most problematic class, Class 2-4.', 'Through the introduction of his friend Danma Ryuji, Onizuka Eikichi, the former legendary bike gang member, visits Meishu Academy to tend to the trees in the garden as a part-time gardener. Learning that Yoshikawa Noboru, a student in teacher Fuyutsuki Azusa’s class is being bullied by Uehara Kyoko and other classmates, Onizuka befriends and saves Yoshikawa. Seeing Onizuka’s unprecedented but visceral, powerful response to problem solving, the school’s president and principal, Sakurai Yoshiko, overrides resistance from her vice principal Uchiyamada Hiroshi and makes Onizuka a teacher. Onizuka goes on to tackle many issues as the teacher in charge of the most problematic class, Class 2-4.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/11ePCkT31mxYPlJxe2xgc0pZiXZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:46127'),
  ('903912407901053265', 'GTO: Great Teacher Onizuka', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Takashi Sorimachi, Nanako Matsushima, Baku Numata, Aya Enjoji, Kirari, Naohito Fujiki, Yosuke Kubozuka, Aimi Nakamura', null, 'Eikichi Onizuka, former gang leader, becomes a teacher of a class of students who torment their teachers and fellow students. Of course they do not do this out of whim, they have their reasons. Onizuka is charged by the chairlady to help these troubled students into a more healthy adulthood, and help rehabilitate the teachers in the process as well.', 'Eikichi Onizuka, former gang leader, becomes a teacher of a class of students who torment their teachers and fellow students. Of course they do not do this out of whim, they have their reasons. Onizuka is charged by the chairlady to help these troubled students into a more healthy adulthood, and help rehabilitate the teachers in the process as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6wKiR4tZKWhVDymeB0A00bYvlX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62057'),
  ('592175608283073369', 'Gu Family Book', 2013, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Kang Eun-kyung', 'Kang Eun-kyung', 'Lee Seung-gi, Suzy, Lee Sung-jae, Sung Joon, Yoo Yeon-seok, Lee Yu-bi, Cho Seong-ha, Choi Jin-hyuk', 'TV-14', 'Choi Kang Chi is a half-beast and half-human and was adopted by a merchant Park Mu Sol when he was a infant. Kang Chi has a kind of unusual power. Dam Yeo Wool is the daughter of Dam Pyeong Joon who is the owner of the Invisible Knife Moo Kwan and also a patriotic warrior. Kang Chi and Yeo Wool meet and fall in love with each other. However, there is hatred between their fathers. Jo Gwan Woong is a traitor. He uses his power to frame faithful and upright individuals and obtain profit for himself. His criminal plots are destroyed by Kang Chi time and again. Therefore, he is determined to kill Kang Chi through different ways. Kang Chi is troubled by his identity but stands up for justice.', 'Choi Kang Chi is a half-beast and half-human and was adopted by a merchant Park Mu Sol when he was a infant. Kang Chi has a kind of unusual power. Dam Yeo Wool is the daughter of Dam Pyeong Joon who is the owner of the Invisible Knife Moo Kwan and also a patriotic warrior. Kang Chi and Yeo Wool meet and fall in love with each other. However, there is hatred between their fathers. Jo Gwan Woong is a traitor. He uses his power to frame faithful and upright individuals and obtain profit for himself. His criminal plots are destroyed by Kang Chi time and again. Therefore, he is determined to kill Kang Chi through different ways. Kang Chi is troubled by his identity but stands up for justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dCOWi2mioPOaTVxRRx2PgRns5bN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:47179'),
