  ('123071706105991187', 'Gumus', 2005, 'Drama, Family', 'Eylem Canpolat, Sema Ergenekon', null, 'Kıvanç Tatlıtuğ, Songül Öden, Güngör Bayrak, Tarık Ünlüoğlu, Laçin Ceylan, Cüneyt Çalışkur, Serdar Orçin, Ayça Varlıer', 'NR', 'After the apparent death of his girlfriend, Mehmet Sadoglu is encouraged by his parents to marry Gümüs, a simple girl...', 'After the apparent death of his girlfriend, Mehmet Sadoglu is encouraged by his parents to marry Gümüs, a simple girl...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8H67dhPgLTtExo1K3neuWUZUHT.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:70926'),
  ('1013545695934236430', 'Gun Frontier', 2002, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Western', 'Leiji Matsumoto', null, 'Kappei Yamaguchi, Eiji Takemoto, Rica Matsumoto, Chisa Yokoyama, Kiyoyuki Yanada', null, 'Sea Pirate Captain Harlock and the errant samurai, Tochiro arrive in the United States on the Western Frontier. Along with a mysterious woman they meet along the way, the two friends challenge sex rings, bandits, and a corrupt sheriff. They are searching for a lost clan of Japanese immigrants, and they will tear Gun Frontier from end to end until they find it.', 'Sea Pirate Captain Harlock and the errant samurai, Tochiro arrive in the United States on the Western Frontier. Along with a mysterious woman they meet along the way, the two friends challenge sex rings, bandits, and a corrupt sheriff. They are searching for a lost clan of Japanese immigrants, and they will tear Gun Frontier from end to end until they find it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5XULSmXXK9DMbN07E9h1FjYJTg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:25015'),
  ('637800817873861767', 'Gun x Sword', 2005, 'Animation, Western, Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kikuko Inoue, Takanori Hoshino, Houko Kuwashima, Takahiro Sakurai, Junko Noda, Saeko Chiba, Satsuki Yukino, Kenyu Horiuchi', 'TV-14', 'There’s a claw-fisted, genocidal maniac terrorizing the planet of endless illusion, and only Van, a tight-lipped loner in a jet black tuxedo, can bring the scoundrel to justice. Armed with his shape-shifting sword and a mechanized suit of armor, Van hunts the villain who murdered his one true love. With any luck, he’ll find the man he seeks before the sun sets on civilization.', 'There’s a claw-fisted, genocidal maniac terrorizing the planet of endless illusion, and only Van, a tight-lipped loner in a jet black tuxedo, can bring the scoundrel to justice. Armed with his shape-shifting sword and a mechanized suit of armor, Van hunts the villain who murdered his one true love. With any luck, he’ll find the man he seeks before the sun sets on civilization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHTw06fSEBXFOXSILep4KIKEY9a.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31706'),
  ('823245633308929772', 'Gunbuster', 1988, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, War & Politics', null, null, 'Maaya Sakamoto, Mitsuo Iwata, Miyuki Sawashiro, Yukari Fukui, Hiroki Touchi, Kiyoshi Kawakubo, Sanae Kobayashi, Takumi Yamazaki', null, 'In the near future, humanity has taken its first steps towards journeying into the far reaches of the galaxy. Upon doing so they discover a huge race of insectoid aliens known as "Space Monsters." These aliens seem dedicated to the eradication of mankind as they near closer and closer to discovering Earth. In response, humanity develops giant fighting robots piloted by hand-picked youth from around the world. Shortly after the discovery of the aliens, Noriko Takaya, the daughter of a famous deceased space captain, enters a training school despite her questionable talents as a pilot. There, she meets her polar opposite, the beautiful and talented Kazumi Amano, and is unexpectedly made to work together with her as they attempt to overcome the trauma of war as well as their own emotions.', 'In the near future, humanity has taken its first steps towards journeying into the far reaches of the galaxy. Upon doing so they discover a huge race of insectoid aliens known as "Space Monsters." These aliens seem dedicated to the eradication of mankind as they near closer and closer to discovering Earth. In response, humanity develops giant fighting robots piloted by hand-picked youth from around the world. Shortly after the discovery of the aliens, Noriko Takaya, the daughter of a famous deceased space captain, enters a training school despite her questionable talents as a pilot. There, she meets her polar opposite, the beautiful and talented Kazumi Amano, and is unexpectedly made to work together with her as they attempt to overcome the trauma of war as well as their own emotions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4WzCDZT7G2QMvF8JxxlYTG85hSp.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66931'),
  ('786018185867371463', 'Gundam Build Divers', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, 'Chiaki Kobayashi, Mayu Minami, Mai Fuchigami, Masaaki Mizunaka', 'TV-PG', 'Gunpla Battle Nexus Online (GBN) is a network game that lets people have adventures with their Gunpla in a virtual cyberspace dimension. Middle-school students Riku Mikami and Yukio Hidaka recruit their classmate Momoka Yashiro and dive together into this vast world. Becoming "Divers," or inhabitants of GBN, they meet a mysterious girl named Sarah who has an amazing sensitivity to Gunpla. As they meet new friends and allies, the force known as Build Divers is born!', 'Gunpla Battle Nexus Online (GBN) is a network game that lets people have adventures with their Gunpla in a virtual cyberspace dimension. Middle-school students Riku Mikami and Yukio Hidaka recruit their classmate Momoka Yashiro and dive together into this vast world. Becoming "Divers," or inhabitants of GBN, they meet a mysterious girl named Sarah who has an amazing sensitivity to Gunpla. As they meet new friends and allies, the force known as Build Divers is born!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xncxq5xi391TNVdo9wMRWruY0C.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:76821'),
  ('859255371179648166', 'Gundam Build Fighters', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids, Family', null, null, 'Kazumi Togashi, Yuma Uchida, Yui Makino, Ryo Hirohashi, Aya Endo', null, 'Sei Iori is a Gunpla builder whose family runs a hobby shop in a small town. He aspires to be a Gunpla Battle champion like his father, but despite his exceptional building skills, he lacks the combat abilities to compete with other contestants. Then one day, he meets a mysterious boy named Reiji, who helps him improve his confidence in participating in Gunpla Battles. Together, Sei and Reiji battle their way to the 7th Gunpla Battle World Tournament.', 'Sei Iori is a Gunpla builder whose family runs a hobby shop in a small town. He aspires to be a Gunpla Battle champion like his father, but despite his exceptional building skills, he lacks the combat abilities to compete with other contestants. Then one day, he meets a mysterious boy named Reiji, who helps him improve his confidence in participating in Gunpla Battles. Together, Sei and Reiji battle their way to the 7th Gunpla Battle World Tournament.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k8EBZ63k2fOfQNRJWpyqFxcQTZI.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:60667'),
  ('429789532879895259', 'Gundam Reconguista in G', 2014, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama, War & Politics', 'Yoshiyuki Tomino', null, 'Mark Ishii, Yu Shimamura, Yukari Fukui, Minako Kotobuki, Ryota Osaka, Takuya Sato, Ayahi Takagaki, Keiji Himeno', null, 'The Universal Century, a history marked by space colonization and space warfare, has passed. Humanity''s prosperity, which ushered in a new era known as the Regild Century (R.C.), was believed to endure alongside global peace. In RC 1014, Bellri Zenam, a pilot in training of the Capitol Guard is somehow chosen by the G-Self - a highly maneuverable Mobile Suit of unknown origin - to lead to uncover hidden truths that will shake the peace of the Regild Century era.', 'The Universal Century, a history marked by space colonization and space warfare, has passed. Humanity''s prosperity, which ushered in a new era known as the Regild Century (R.C.), was believed to endure alongside global peace. In RC 1014, Bellri Zenam, a pilot in training of the Capitol Guard is somehow chosen by the G-Self - a highly maneuverable Mobile Suit of unknown origin - to lead to uncover hidden truths that will shake the peace of the Regild Century era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zcjOBN1b7IlgCs6G3n6MPyvo6Uk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61414'),
  ('64792724789557878', 'Gundam: Requiem for Vengeance', 2024, 'War & Politics, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation', null, null, 'Celia Massingham, James Watts, Lavance, Daniel Wishes, Andrew Woolner, Maxwell Powers, Jessica Spies, Maurice Shelton', 'TV-MA', 'Eleven months into the One Year War in U.C.0079, top Zaku II pilot Captain Solari faces the Earth Federation''s new lethal weapon: the mobile suit Gundam.', 'Eleven months into the One Year War in U.C.0079, top Zaku II pilot Captain Solari faces the Earth Federation''s new lethal weapon: the mobile suit Gundam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ybJkwgv63Ht3bZNOrKsbTwYmaFC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:229906'),
  ('769824571519904258', 'Gungrave', 2003, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Masahiko Tanaka, Motomu Kiyokawa, Michiko Neya, Tomokazu Seki, Kikuko Inoue, Iemasa Kayumi, Takehito Koyasu, Chafurin', null, 'For Brandon Heat, death doesn''t matter. Driven by his need for revenge, he returns from beyond the grave to cripple Milleneon, the huge mafia organization which uses undead monsters as its enforcers. His ultimate goal is to destroy Harry MacDowel, the leader of Milleneon and, at one time, Brandon''s best friend...', 'For Brandon Heat, death doesn''t matter. Driven by his need for revenge, he returns from beyond the grave to cripple Milleneon, the huge mafia organization which uses undead monsters as its enforcers. His ultimate goal is to destroy Harry MacDowel, the leader of Milleneon and, at one time, Brandon''s best friend...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oUVTXxaPBdzrdX3nDq15urEpyQO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5894'),
  ('2550604496867675', 'Gunpowder', 2017, 'War & Politics, Drama', 'Ronan Bennett, Daniel West', null, 'Kit Harington, Mark Gatiss, Edward Holcroft, Tom Cullen, Peter Mullan, Liv Tyler, Derek Riddell, Shaun Dooley', 'TV-MA', 'London, 1605. Robert Catesby, a 33-year old Warwickshire gentleman, devises a plot to blow up Parliament and kill the King.', 'London, 1605. Robert Catesby, a 33-year old Warwickshire gentleman, devises a plot to blow up Parliament and kill the King.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3eHeKVmm08g8LDoXobBioyti7id.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73550'),
  ('997226553119172054', 'Gunpowder, Treason & Plot', 2004, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Clémence Poésy, Robert Carlyle, Catherine McCormack, Michael Fassbender, Richard Coyle, Paul Nicholls, Gary Lewis, Tim McInnerny', 'TV-MA', 'Mini series depicting the turbulent and bloody reigns of Scottish monarchs Mary, Queen of Scots and her son King James VI of Scotland who became King James I of England and foiled the Gunpowder Plot.', 'Mini series depicting the turbulent and bloody reigns of Scottish monarchs Mary, Queen of Scots and her son King James VI of Scotland who became King James I of England and foiled the Gunpowder Plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xQjQ8oDdLGCZaWna0R5dW2s1sw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13406'),
  ('58852406711392122', 'Guns & Gulaabs', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Krishna D.K., Raj Nidimoru', 'Suman Kumar, Raj Nidimoru, Krishna D.K.', 'Dulquer Salmaan, Rajkummar Rao, Adarsh Gourav, Gulshan Devaiah, Satish Kaushik, TJ Bhanu, Pooja Gor, Vipin Sharma', 'TV-MA', 'In the cartel-run town of Gulaabgunj, an unprecedented opium deal pulls a big-city cop and a lovesick mechanic into its chaotic clutches.', 'In the cartel-run town of Gulaabgunj, an unprecedented opium deal pulls a big-city cop and a lovesick mechanic into its chaotic clutches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yRSvwppi9u77UWGPrRgJoTfv5DR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156714'),
  ('511591014591611236', 'Guns Germs & Steel', 2005, 'Documentary, War & Politics', 'Jared Diamond', null, 'Jared Diamond, Peter Coyote', 'NR', 'A PBS documentary concerning Jared Diamond''s theory on why there is such disparity between those who have advanced technology and those who still live primitively. He argues it is due to the acquisition of guns and steel and the changes brought about by germs.', 'A PBS documentary concerning Jared Diamond''s theory on why there is such disparity between those who have advanced technology and those who still live primitively. He argues it is due to the acquisition of guns and steel and the changes brought about by germs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7FzLKZ41E6TDOD1mPveuCEhbQVW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70456'),
  ('671382238348546530', 'Gunslinger Girl', 2003, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Yuuka Nanri, Kanako Mitsuhashi, Eri Sendai, Ami Koshimizu', 'TV-14', 'The Social Welfare Agency saves the lives of terminal patients using cybernetic implants. Then it teaches them to kill. After surviving the slaughter of her family, young Henrietta awakens to her new life at the Agency with a rebuilt body and no memory. Teamed with Jose, who is responsible for turning her into the perfect assassin, Henrietta’s been given a second chance—but at what cost?', 'The Social Welfare Agency saves the lives of terminal patients using cybernetic implants. Then it teaches them to kill. After surviving the slaughter of her family, young Henrietta awakens to her new life at the Agency with a rebuilt body and no memory. Teamed with Jose, who is responsible for turning her into the perfect assassin, Henrietta’s been given a second chance—but at what cost?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZrhtwcSydWh3rxQSB6we1KSql7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:31731'),
  ('1034905987585191308', 'Gunslinger Stratos: The Animation', 2015, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Animation', null, null, 'Atsushi Abe, Hisako Kanemoto, Masakazu Nishida, Miyuki Sawashiro, Kana Ueda, Soichiro Hoshi, Rikiya Koyama, Sayaka Ohara', null, 'A.D. 2115—the island nation once called Japan is now known as the "17th Far East Imperial City Management District." The citizens were promised a life of peace in exchange for some of the comfort they were used to having. People believed their lives would never change and tomorrow will be the same as today. No one suspected the impending doom which their society was about to face. "Degradation"—a rare disease which led to the total disintegration of the human body to a mere pile of sand was slowly but surely spreading throughout the world. Tohru Kazasumi, an ordinary student becomes embroiled in a multi universal battle between his world and the parallel world of "Frontier S (Stratos)." This meant that Tohru must fight himself from an alternate world. Their futures collide as their paths cross. Will both worlds ever find peace?', 'A.D. 2115—the island nation once called Japan is now known as the "17th Far East Imperial City Management District." The citizens were promised a life of peace in exchange for some of the comfort they were used to having. People believed their lives would never change and tomorrow will be the same as today. No one suspected the impending doom which their society was about to face. "Degradation"—a rare disease which led to the total disintegration of the human body to a mere pile of sand was slowly but surely spreading throughout the world. Tohru Kazasumi, an ordinary student becomes embroiled in a multi universal battle between his world and the parallel world of "Frontier S (Stratos)." This meant that Tohru must fight himself from an alternate world. Their futures collide as their paths cross. Will both worlds ever find peace?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fiiEdn5QId58LBuGOguI6cs3Rg6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62323'),
  ('226122528953196335', 'Gunsmith Cats', 1995, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Kenichi Sonoda', null, 'Kae Araki, Michiko Neya, Aya Hisakawa, Hochu Otsuka, Michihiro Ikemizu', null, 'Rally Vincent knows her weapons well, while her partner Minne May Hopkins loves to play with explosives. The pair run a gun-shop illegally and one day Bill Collins of the ATF, blackmails Rally and Minnie May into working for the ATF. Little do they know, that they are getting involved in a mission larger than they could imagine.', 'Rally Vincent knows her weapons well, while her partner Minne May Hopkins loves to play with explosives. The pair run a gun-shop illegally and one day Bill Collins of the ATF, blackmails Rally and Minnie May into working for the ATF. Little do they know, that they are getting involved in a mission larger than they could imagine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nl0JH0b5JfJDaN1KuS0YbSfOxPX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:22831'),
  ('1066382793216620322', 'Gunsmoke', 1955, 'Western, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'John Meston', null, 'James Arness, Amanda Blake, Ken Curtis, Milburn Stone, Woody Chambliss', 'TV-G', 'Gunsmoke is an American radio and television Western drama series created by director Norman MacDonnell and writer John Meston. The stories take place in and around Dodge City, Kansas, during the settlement of the American West. The central character is lawman Marshal Matt Dillon, played by William Conrad on radio and James Arness on television.', 'Gunsmoke is an American radio and television Western drama series created by director Norman MacDonnell and writer John Meston. The stories take place in and around Dodge City, Kansas, during the settlement of the American West. The central character is lawman Marshal Matt Dillon, played by William Conrad on radio and James Arness on television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7WjYizqcrA64xi9XLqUWCz5DNk.jpg', 20, 'tmdb:tv:3713'),
  ('990107844984281633', 'Gunther''s Millions', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Aurelien Leturgie, Maurizio Miani, Alex Hyde-White, Lee Dahlberg, Leah Allers, Ed Arenas, Fabrizio Corona, Garren James', 'TV-MA', 'A dog with a trust fund isn''t the strangest part of this story. Gunther''s eccentric handler also lived a luxe life — with a cult-like entourage.', 'A dog with a trust fund isn''t the strangest part of this story. Gunther''s eccentric handler also lived a luxe life — with a cult-like entourage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fcsb2D2fA4xQfRvllQ1yQdIZqEz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217662'),
  ('735501768128803044', 'Gurlz', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Sergey Koryagin, Olga Frenkel', null, 'Galina Bob, Anastasiya Denisova, Polina Maksimova, Taisiya Vilkova, Alex Sparrow, Alyona Chekhova, Konstantin Fedorov, Anastasiya Ukolova', null, 'Four young women, Mary, Lola, Katya and Vasilisa, arrive in Moscow from a town to live together in an apartment. They deal with various hilarious situations on a daily basis.', 'Four young women, Mary, Lola, Katya and Vasilisa, arrive in Moscow from a town to live together in an apartment. They deal with various hilarious situations on a daily basis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fbnrVZIDMd4HEq10LKx8ax3MEPg.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:76826'),
  ('307008630921963634', 'Gurren Lagann', 2007, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tetsuya Kakihara, Katsuyuki Konishi, Marina Inoue, Kiyoyuki Yanada, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Mitsuki Saiga, Yukari Fukui, Michiko Neya', 'TV-14', 'When a young laborer escapes to the world aboveground, he discovers a violent land in which humans battle robots controlled by a power-hungry noble.', 'When a young laborer escapes to the world aboveground, he discovers a violent land in which humans battle robots controlled by a power-hungry noble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xL6HsYsk5N9PKwk6jFwMNQq3K3M.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21729'),
  ('46105525950260310', 'Gus the Itsy-Bitsy Knight', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Kids', 'Matthieu Cordier', null, 'Emmylou Homs, Alice Orsat, Bernard Alane, Fanny Bloc, Fily Keita, Martial Le Minoux, Thomas Sagols, Nathalie Homs', 'TV-G', 'Once upon a time, there was a little boy, Gus, who wanted to become a great knight. Sorry, not a great knight… The Greatest knight in the whole kingdom of Karamel. Wielding with his laser sword, mounted on his electric pony, Gus never misses an opportunity to go on an adventure to accomplish all his missions. The problem is, Gus is… ITSY BITSY! He stands three apples high, to be precise, but has a heart the size of a house! Gus will prove to one and all that a brave heart can overcome everything, and that there’s no greater cavalier than Gus, the itsy bitsy knight!', 'Once upon a time, there was a little boy, Gus, who wanted to become a great knight. Sorry, not a great knight… The Greatest knight in the whole kingdom of Karamel. Wielding with his laser sword, mounted on his electric pony, Gus never misses an opportunity to go on an adventure to accomplish all his missions. The problem is, Gus is… ITSY BITSY! He stands three apples high, to be precise, but has a heart the size of a house! Gus will prove to one and all that a brave heart can overcome everything, and that there’s no greater cavalier than Gus, the itsy bitsy knight!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ahB6ENxCgZTHUXMspuk1Q8YHLnA.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:128718'),
  ('1122372702948509222', 'Gushing Over Magical Girls', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Fuka Izumi, Misato Fukuen, Aoi Koga, Shiori Sugiura, Kaori Maeda, Mayuko Kazama, Misaki Ikeda, Kana Asumi', 'TV-MA', 'Hiragi Utena is a major fangirl of the magical girls protecting her city and leaps at the chance to join their ranks. But once she transforms, she learns she''s a villain who enjoys being a magical-girl-tormenting sadist instead!', 'Hiragi Utena is a major fangirl of the magical girls protecting her city and leaps at the chance to join their ranks. But once she transforms, she learns she''s a villain who enjoys being a magical-girl-tormenting sadist instead!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p7vWZL5HhbscGf7OjnprT2977Lt.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:236338'),
  ('1040914489103986451', 'Gute Nacht Österreich', 2019, 'Talk', null, null, 'Peter Klien', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sgFJeldLkPxYs9oBLJO1KG0E6B2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218614'),
  ('495362901133641552', 'Gute Zeiten, schlechte Zeiten', 1992, 'Drama, Soap', null, null, null, null, 'Gute Zeiten, schlechte Zeiten is a long-running German television soap opera, first broadcast on RTL in 1992. The programme concerns the lives of a fictional neighborhood in Germany''s capital city Berlin. Over the years the soap opera tends to have an overhaul of young people in their late teens and early twenties; targeting a young viewership.', 'Gute Zeiten, schlechte Zeiten is a long-running German television soap opera, first broadcast on RTL in 1992. The programme concerns the lives of a fictional neighborhood in Germany''s capital city Berlin. Over the years the soap opera tends to have an overhaul of young people in their late teens and early twenties; targeting a young viewership.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qujVFLAlBnPU9mZElV4NZgL8iXT.jpg', 35, 'tmdb:tv:13945'),
  ('1113497080447844393', 'Gutfeld!', 2021, 'Comedy, Talk', null, null, 'Greg Gutfeld', 'TV-14', 'Greg Gutfeld provides some insights into the latest events through parodies, panel discussions, and signature monologues. He also conducts interviews with newsmakers and media personalities.', 'Greg Gutfeld provides some insights into the latest events through parodies, panel discussions, and signature monologues. He also conducts interviews with newsmakers and media personalities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9zLuN3MfvTcABYYNJq5PkIG81S5.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:122653'),
  ('785471282045405325', 'Guy''s Grocery Games', 2013, 'Reality', 'Guy Fieri', null, 'Guy Fieri', 'TV-PG', 'Guy Fieri sends four talented chefs running through the aisles in a high stakes, high skills, grocery store cooking competition. The chefs are hit by real-world challenges like finding workarounds when all the essential ingredients are suddenly "out-of-stock" or having to create a masterpiece when you can only cook with "5 items or less" or on a $10 budget. In the end, the food does the talking, as the last chef standing has the chance to make some serious dough!', 'Guy Fieri sends four talented chefs running through the aisles in a high stakes, high skills, grocery store cooking competition. The chefs are hit by real-world challenges like finding workarounds when all the essential ingredients are suddenly "out-of-stock" or having to create a masterpiece when you can only cook with "5 items or less" or on a $10 budget. In the end, the food does the talking, as the last chef standing has the chance to make some serious dough!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNg2v7SQLOOYn23rc5dJLgSDgYh.jpg', 41, 'tmdb:tv:62595'),
  ('919696955668233316', 'Guyana Tragedy: The Story of Jim Jones', 1980, 'Drama, Crime', 'Ernest Tidyman', null, 'Powers Boothe, Ned Beatty, Irene Cara, Veronica Cartwright, Rosalind Cash, Brad Dourif, Meg Foster, Michael C. Gwynne', null, 'In the 1960s, Reverend Jim Jones began as an idealist helping minorities and working against racism. After a move to San Francisco and increased power and attention, Jones became focused on his belief in nuclear holocaust, declared himself a prophet, and founded the Peoples Temple. With a loyal following of over 1,000, who donated their entire life savings to him and to join his commune, he moves them to Guyana. When possible crimes come to the attention of the authorities, and once notified that some individuals are being held against their will, an investigation begins. Rather than face the charges, Jones commits suicide, and roughly 900 of his followers do the same.', 'In the 1960s, Reverend Jim Jones began as an idealist helping minorities and working against racism. After a move to San Francisco and increased power and attention, Jones became focused on his belief in nuclear holocaust, declared himself a prophet, and founded the Peoples Temple. With a loyal following of over 1,000, who donated their entire life savings to him and to join his commune, he moves them to Guyana. When possible crimes come to the attention of the authorities, and once notified that some individuals are being held against their will, an investigation begins. Rather than face the charges, Jones commits suicide, and roughly 900 of his followers do the same.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7HNKsCEKILrT0MiX3Uh3R05EHZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:48557'),
  ('1073072494355999127', 'Guyane', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Fabien Nury', null, 'Anne Suarez, Mathieu Spinosi, Olivier Rabourdin', null, 'Vincent, a 20-year old geology student from Paris, goes to French Guyana to do an internship at a gold mining company. Taken under the wing of local gold lord Antoine Serra, Vincent quickly falls into the much more lucrative and dangerous world of gold trafficking. From Serra, who acts like a father to him, Vincent learns everything there is to know about the business. Newcomers aren''t welcome - Louis, Serra''s right hand, makes it clear that he does not trust him. Vincent and Serra start building a camp to explore a gold mine, but tensions rise to a full-fledged war between them and their Brazilian competitors. And things get even more complicated when Vincent discovers that the mythical Sarah Bernhard mine is not a legend. The Guyanese jungle is a world where businessmen, gangsters, geologists and soldiers collide, and men kill and are killed for a few grams of the precious metal.', 'Vincent, a 20-year old geology student from Paris, goes to French Guyana to do an internship at a gold mining company. Taken under the wing of local gold lord Antoine Serra, Vincent quickly falls into the much more lucrative and dangerous world of gold trafficking. From Serra, who acts like a father to him, Vincent learns everything there is to know about the business. Newcomers aren''t welcome - Louis, Serra''s right hand, makes it clear that he does not trust him. Vincent and Serra start building a camp to explore a gold mine, but tensions rise to a full-fledged war between them and their Brazilian competitors. And things get even more complicated when Vincent discovers that the mythical Sarah Bernhard mine is not a legend. The Guyanese jungle is a world where businessmen, gangsters, geologists and soldiers collide, and men kill and are killed for a few grams of the precious metal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wG2JjoSD1VIrODrIgq3tQF31P3F.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69121'),
  ('668365660055165608', 'Guys with Kids', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Jimmy Fallon, Amy Ozols, Charlie Grandy', null, 'Anthony Anderson, Jesse Bradford, Zach Cregger, Tempestt Bledsoe, Erinn Hayes, Jamie-Lynn Sigler', 'TV-PG', 'Three 30-something dads try to hold on to their youth as they face the responsibilities of having kids. Thankfully, Gary, Chris and Nick have each other to help navigate the highs and lows of fatherhood - while still trying desperately to remain dudes.', 'Three 30-something dads try to hold on to their youth as they face the responsibilities of having kids. Thankfully, Gary, Chris and Nick have each other to help navigate the highs and lows of fatherhood - while still trying desperately to remain dudes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uSHWvVrgXbmmR8iV2UpLSWLtqs7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43227'),
  ('706994024320336794', 'Guyver: The Bioboosted Armor', 2005, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Kenji Nojima, Nana Mizuki, Kosuke Takaguchi, Katsuyuki Konishi, Michiko Neya, Tetsu Inada, Takeharu Oonishi, Mitsuaki Madono', 'NR', 'Guyver: The Bioboosted Armor is a Japanese anime series based on the long-running manga series, Bio Booster Armor Guyver, written by Yoshiki Takaya, adapting chapters 1 - 59 of the manga. The production was in association with ADV Films and Kadokawa Shoten. The series first episode aired in Japan on August 6, 2005 and the last episode aired on February 18, 2006. The series aired in North America on December 20, 2010, on the FUNimation Channel.', 'Guyver: The Bioboosted Armor is a Japanese anime series based on the long-running manga series, Bio Booster Armor Guyver, written by Yoshiki Takaya, adapting chapters 1 - 59 of the manga. The production was in association with ADV Films and Kadokawa Shoten. The series first episode aired in Japan on August 6, 2005 and the last episode aired on February 18, 2006. The series aired in North America on December 20, 2010, on the FUNimation Channel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmyqGLfgUWcszAVPIzqAythRIhe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35583'),
  ('619625455250868180', 'Gye Baek, Warrior’s Fate', 2011, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, 'Jung Hae-ri, Jung Hyung-soo', 'Lee Seo-jin, Lee Hyun-woo, Cho Jae-hyun, Choi Won-hong, Noh Young-hak, Oh Yeon-soo, Song Ji-hyo, Jeon Min-seo', 'TV-14', 'Set in the Baekje kingdom in the mid-7th century, the drama chronicles the life and times of the storied warrior General Gyebaek who is remembered in history for leading Baekje''s last stand against the Silla in the Battle of Hwangsanbeol.', 'Set in the Baekje kingdom in the mid-7th century, the drama chronicles the life and times of the storied warrior General Gyebaek who is remembered in history for leading Baekje''s last stand against the Silla in the Battle of Hwangsanbeol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/urN0D7QJLx6vGs0sdDFRXm0vPl6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:41526'),
  ('285301683589921333', 'Gyeongseong Creature', 2023, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Kang Eun-kyung', 'Kang Eun-kyung', 'Park Seo-jun, Han So-hee', 'TV-MA', 'Gyeongseong, 1945. In Seoul''s grim era under colonial rule, an entrepreneur and a sleuth fight for survival and face a monster born out of human greed.', 'Gyeongseong, 1945. In Seoul''s grim era under colonial rule, an entrepreneur and a sleuth fight for survival and face a monster born out of human greed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5wliFAD8Pjjj0YYSmupqjOldnWt.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:135238'),
  ('518613750329798893', 'Gymnastics Academy: A Second Chance', 2022, 'Drama', 'Clay Glen', null, 'Emily Morris, Jada-Lee Henry, Stella Shute, Zoe Rae Burns, Luciana Valdez Tirado', null, 'Kyra Berry, a 14 year old USA gymnast arrives in Australia to try and win a scholarship at an elite Gymnastics Academy. It''s a second chance but also her last.', 'Kyra Berry, a 14 year old USA gymnast arrives in Australia to try and win a scholarship at an elite Gymnastics Academy. It''s a second chance but also her last.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1X7jR1gF5JSlcBAdNIofgoxezbZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208527'),
  ('1133350107779407478', 'Gypsy', 2017, 'Drama', 'Lisa Rubin', null, 'Naomi Watts, Billy Crudup, Sophie Cookson, Karl Glusman, Lucy Boynton, Poorna Jagannathan, Melanie Liburd, Brenda Vaccaro', 'TV-MA', 'The journey of Jean Holloway – a therapist who begins to develop dangerous and intimate relationships with the people in her patients'' lives.', 'The journey of Jean Holloway – a therapist who begins to develop dangerous and intimate relationships with the people in her patients'' lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9dtm1ExRh6ihPGYIaAxEygOnl6G.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66939'),
  ('899251283272758225', 'H', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Éric Judor, Kader Aoun, Xavier Matthieu', 'Éric Judor, Xavier Matthieu, Frédéric Proust', 'Éric Judor, Ramzy Bedia, Sophie Mounicot, Jamel Debbouze, Jean-Luc Bideau', 'TV-MA', 'At a dysfunctional hospital in Paris, three bumbling, eccentric medical employees embark on zany misadventures with surgical imprecision.', 'At a dysfunctional hospital in Paris, three bumbling, eccentric medical employees embark on zany misadventures with surgical imprecision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhEHOWwwnz01HFlSNreMkLG5MVX.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:20169'),
  ('54568151106790714', 'H.R. Pufnstuf', 1969, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Marty Krofft, Sid Krofft', null, 'Jack Wild, Billie Hayes, Lennie Weinrib, Sharon Baird, Walker Edmiston, Joan Gerber, Angelo Rossitto, Felix Silla', 'NR', 'H.R. Pufnstuf is a children''s television series produced by Sid and Marty Krofft in the United States. It was the first Krofft live-action, life-size puppet program. The seventeen episodes were originally broadcast from September 6, 1969 to December 27, 1969. The broadcasts were successful enough that NBC kept it on the Saturday morning schedule until August 1972. The show was shot in Paramount Studios and its opening was shot in Big Bear Lake, California. Reruns of the show aired on ABC Saturday morning from September 2, 1972 to September 8, 1973 and on Sunday mornings in some markets from September 16, 1973 to September 8, 1974. It was syndicated by itself from 1974 to 1978 and in a package with six other Kroft series under the banner Kroft Superstars from 1978 to 1985. In 2004 and 2007, H.R. Pufnstuf was ranked #22 and #27 on TV Guide''s Top Cult Shows Ever.', 'H.R. Pufnstuf is a children''s television series produced by Sid and Marty Krofft in the United States. It was the first Krofft live-action, life-size puppet program. The seventeen episodes were originally broadcast from September 6, 1969 to December 27, 1969. The broadcasts were successful enough that NBC kept it on the Saturday morning schedule until August 1972. The show was shot in Paramount Studios and its opening was shot in Big Bear Lake, California. Reruns of the show aired on ABC Saturday morning from September 2, 1972 to September 8, 1973 and on Sunday mornings in some markets from September 16, 1973 to September 8, 1974. It was syndicated by itself from 1974 to 1978 and in a package with six other Kroft series under the banner Kroft Superstars from 1978 to 1985. In 2004 and 2007, H.R. Pufnstuf was ranked #22 and #27 on TV Guide''s Top Cult Shows Ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6C8gOxW1xzBFiYOZCtxptN3icqZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4284'),
  ('803343014860100940', 'H.U.S.H.', 2020, 'Drama', null, 'Kim Jung-min', 'Hwang Jung-min, Yoona, Son Byung-ho, Yu Seon, Kim Won-hae, Park Ho-san, Lee Seung-joon, Gyeong Su-jin', null, 'Lee Ji Su is a bold intern reporter who isn’t afraid to say what needs to be said, even during a job interview. When she meets Han Jun Hyeok as her mentor, she begins to dream of becoming a true journalist.', 'Lee Ji Su is a bold intern reporter who isn’t afraid to say what needs to be said, even during a job interview. When she meets Han Jun Hyeok as her mentor, she begins to dream of becoming a true journalist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/go7X8AUn8zUiMpZN7VQ0TmuiNO1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113252'),
  ('508680167525097358', 'H+: The Digital Series', 2012, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Amir Arison, Caitríona Balfe, Nikki Crawford, Alexis Denisof, Hannah Simone', null, 'H+: The Digital Series is a web series produced by Bryan Singer and created by John Cabrera and Cosimo De Tommaso. The series, which touches on the subject of transhumanism, premiered on August 8, 2012 on YouTube with two episodes. Two new episodes were then released every week on Wednesdays until the season finale on January 16, 2013.', 'H+: The Digital Series is a web series produced by Bryan Singer and created by John Cabrera and Cosimo De Tommaso. The series, which touches on the subject of transhumanism, premiered on August 8, 2012 on YouTube with two episodes. Two new episodes were then released every week on Wednesdays until the season finale on January 16, 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6JOlFNNVXprII3fSX0t330GHkau.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46332'),
  ('678085868948132156', 'H2O: Footprints in the Sand', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Ami Koshimizu, Harumi Sakurai, Yasuda Mio, Mia Naruse, Youko Honda, Yui Sakakibara, Hikaru Isshiki', null, 'Takuma Hirose, an emotionally wounded boy becomes blind after his mother died in his childhood. For medical treatment, he moves to his mother’s home village where he enters a new school.', 'Takuma Hirose, an emotionally wounded boy becomes blind after his mother died in his childhood. For medical treatment, he moves to his mother’s home village where he enters a new school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tlAhXf8ZctUQvobvH4mo4jR365B.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:30631'),
  ('354002524594617521', 'H2O: Just Add Water', 2006, 'Drama, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jonathan M. Shiff', null, 'Phoebe Tonkin, Cariba Heine, Indiana Evans, Luke Mitchell, Burgess Abernethy', 'TV-PG', 'H2O: Just Add Water revolves around three teenage girls facing everyday teen problems with an added twist: they cope with the burden of growing a giant fin and transforming into mermaids whenever they come in contact with water.', 'H2O: Just Add Water revolves around three teenage girls facing everyday teen problems with an added twist: they cope with the burden of growing a giant fin and transforming into mermaids whenever they come in contact with water.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kHWkoxEarJjIXUenEnJFr0i2Drp.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2260'),
  ('928452175720227498', 'H2O: Mermaid Adventures', 2015, 'Animation, Family, Kids, Comedy', null, null, 'Katharina von Keller, Patrick Bach, Sonja Stein, Robert Missler, Céline Fontanges', 'TV-Y7', 'The lives of teenagers Emma, Cleo and Rikki are forever changed when a magical, forbidden island gives them the power to turn into mermaids.', 'The lives of teenagers Emma, Cleo and Rikki are forever changed when a magical, forbidden island gives them the power to turn into mermaids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nl7gKdxdAHP6YGVH4zshxz121iu.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:77020'),
