values
  ('451796710261652605', 'Happy Tree Friends', 1999, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kenn Navarro, Rhode Montijo, Aubrey Ankrum', 'Warren Graff, David Winn, Aubrey Ankrum', 'Kenn Navarro, Ellen Connell, Aubrey Ankrum, David Winn, Warren Graff, Michael ''Lippy'' Lipman, Francis Carr, Wes Spencer', 'TV-MA', 'This action and adventure comedy is drawn in simple appearance and combines cute forest animals with extreme graphic violence. Each episode revolves around the characters enduring accidental events of bloodshed, pain, dismemberment and/or death.', 'This action and adventure comedy is drawn in simple appearance and combines cute forest animals with extreme graphic violence. Each episode revolves around the characters enduring accidental events of bloodshed, pain, dismemberment and/or death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2rYqJg1OzaDlc5kiBK4IdgrELMf.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:1126'),
  ('707515004726943116', 'Happy Valley', 2014, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Sally Wainwright', null, 'Sarah Lancashire, Siobhan Finneran, James Norton, Rhys Connah, Charlie Murphy, Shane Zaza, George Costigan, Rick Warden', 'TV-MA', 'Happy Valley is a dark, funny, multi-layered thriller revolving around the personal and professional life of Catherine, a dedicated, experienced, hard-working copper. She is also a bereaved mother who looks after her orphaned grandchild.', 'Happy Valley is a dark, funny, multi-layered thriller revolving around the personal and professional life of Catherine, a dedicated, experienced, hard-working copper. She is also a bereaved mother who looks after her orphaned grandchild.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZK5iQSrn2mouZEk2PwyLPCwa4u.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:61244'),
  ('608746615298285065', 'HAPPY!', 2017, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Grant Morrison, Darick Robertson', null, 'Christopher Meloni, Ritchie Coster, Lili Mirojnick, Medina Senghore, Patrick Fischler, Christopher Fitzgerald, Bryce Lorenzo, Patton Oswalt', 'TV-MA', 'Corrupt ex-cop turned hitman Nick Sax''s life is changed forever by a relentlessly positive, imaginary blue winged horse named Happy.', 'Corrupt ex-cop turned hitman Nick Sax''s life is changed forever by a relentlessly positive, imaginary blue winged horse named Happy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t17TmixmWhJeIC4ytLfis6frLYf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:72339'),
  ('400780190486857958', 'Happy''s Place', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Kevin Abbott', null, 'Reba McEntire, Belissa Escobedo, Melissa Peterman, Rex Linn, Pablo Castelblanco, Tokala Black Elk', 'TV-PG', 'Bobbie inherits her father''s restaurant and is less than thrilled to discover that she has a new business partner in the half-sister she never knew she had.', 'Bobbie inherits her father''s restaurant and is less than thrilled to discover that she has a new business partner in the half-sister she never knew she had.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3dehoKPCwLwKTWATfzGqoJ2Psdl.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:253896'),
  ('305610842419297115', 'HAPPYish', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Shalom Auslander', null, 'Steve Coogan, Kathryn Hahn, Bradley Whitford, Ellen Barkin, Carrie Preston', 'TV-MA', 'Thom Payne is a 44 year-old man whose world is thrown into disarray when his 25 year-old "wunderkind" boss arrives, saying things like "digital," "social" and "viral." Is he in need of a "rebranding," or does he just have a "low joy ceiling?" Maybe pursuing happiness is a fool''s errand? Happiness after all is pretty high bar. In a world as absurd as ours, maybe the best anyone can hope for is happyish.', 'Thom Payne is a 44 year-old man whose world is thrown into disarray when his 25 year-old "wunderkind" boss arrives, saying things like "digital," "social" and "viral." Is he in need of a "rebranding," or does he just have a "low joy ceiling?" Maybe pursuing happiness is a fool''s errand? Happiness after all is pretty high bar. In a world as absurd as ours, maybe the best anyone can hope for is happyish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emjm7JDQMrZ8YWGmLLw9pe6vnNQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:57391'),
  ('22058144922208007', 'Happyland', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ben Epstein', null, 'Bianca A. Santos, Camille Guaty, Shane Harper, Katherine McNamara, Cameron Moulène, Ryan Rottman', 'TV-14', 'Having grown up in a world of manufactured happiness, Lucy, the cynical teenage daughter of a idealistic theme park princess mom, wants to get out and experience something real. When Ian, the new park owner''s son, arrives and sweeps her off her feet, Lucy is left wondering if fairy tale endings do exist after all. But when a scandalous secret turns her life upside down, she learns Happyland is far from a walk in the park.', 'Having grown up in a world of manufactured happiness, Lucy, the cynical teenage daughter of a idealistic theme park princess mom, wants to get out and experience something real. When Ian, the new park owner''s son, arrives and sweeps her off her feet, Lucy is left wondering if fairy tale endings do exist after all. But when a scandalous secret turns her life upside down, she learns Happyland is far from a walk in the park.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3riy0k37YQv7PK71W3gb8DYri6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61551'),
  ('862014206471741939', 'Harassment', 2018, 'Drama', 'Maria Camargo, Amora Mautner', 'Maria Camargo, Pedro de Barros, Fernando Rabelo', 'Antonio Calloni, Elisa Volpatto, Adriana Esteves, Mariana Lima, Paolla Oliveira, Paula Possani, Pedro Nercessian, Felipe Camargo', null, 'A group of women gets together on social media to expose the sexual harassment they all suffered from a renowned specialist in reproductive medicine. The saga of perseverance and courage of these women begins when one of them decides to talk and reveal what was until then confined by the doctor’s office walls.', 'A group of women gets together on social media to expose the sexual harassment they all suffered from a renowned specialist in reproductive medicine. The saga of perseverance and courage of these women begins when one of them decides to talk and reveal what was until then confined by the doctor’s office walls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wBvAUGXFe1ZtZbOyFk3m6t5v4OI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82529'),
  ('1002699685577126245', 'Hard', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Kauê Zilli, Luiza Campos, Júlia Pacheco Jordão', null, 'Natália Lage, Júlio Machado, Martha Nowill, Fernando Alves Pinto, Denise Del Vecchio', 'TV-MA', 'A recent widow learns her deceased husband was in the porn production business and faces the challenge of saving the company she''s inherited.', 'A recent widow learns her deceased husband was in the porn production business and faces the challenge of saving the company she''s inherited.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j1cGmHM12wAJcDLYclrOFWFmRPx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:102290'),
  ('836856425951353144', 'Hard Cell', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Catherine Tate', null, 'Catherine Tate, Christian Brassington, Niky Wardley, Lorna Brown, Caroline Harding, Jola Olajide, Duncan Wisbey, Cheryl Fergison', 'TV-MA', 'Events planner-turned-women''s prison governor Laura Willis documents the thrills and spills of life behind bars in this delightfully dry comedy series.', 'Events planner-turned-women''s prison governor Laura Willis documents the thrills and spills of life behind bars in this delightfully dry comedy series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/22cjCaUikOW14dr1htuhCVaUbzk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156407'),
  ('111630175741302117', 'Hard Fate', 2004, 'Family', 'Sum-Wai Wong', 'Tessa Choy Ting-Ting, Wai-Keung Wong', 'Flora Chan Wai-Shan, Damian Lau Chung-Yan, Kevin Cheng Ka-Wing, Niki Chow Lai-Kei, Maggie Shiu, Teresa Ha Ping, Ha Yue, Hawick Lau Hau-Wai', null, 'YEE (CHAN WAI SHAN, FLORA) learns from her aunt TSAU that a pair of special jades – Cold Mountain and Virtue, which form the ‘Gods of Harmony’, will bring happy marriage to the bearer. She therefore hopes to find the missing half, Virtue. Amazingly, YEE’s fiance YIN (LAU CHUNG YAN, DAMIAN) locates it for her. The night when the stones are brought together, she has a nightmare. Shortly after that, Cold Mountain goes missing, which bothers her immensely. Meanwhile, YEE learns about the real identity of her good friend MING’s (CHENG, KEVIN) girlfriend SZ (CHOW LAI KI, NIKI). This leaves her no choice but to break up with YIN, however he refuses. Soon, he has a terrible accident and she has to stay for him..', 'YEE (CHAN WAI SHAN, FLORA) learns from her aunt TSAU that a pair of special jades – Cold Mountain and Virtue, which form the ‘Gods of Harmony’, will bring happy marriage to the bearer. She therefore hopes to find the missing half, Virtue. Amazingly, YEE’s fiance YIN (LAU CHUNG YAN, DAMIAN) locates it for her. The night when the stones are brought together, she has a nightmare. Shortly after that, Cold Mountain goes missing, which bothers her immensely. Meanwhile, YEE learns about the real identity of her good friend MING’s (CHENG, KEVIN) girlfriend SZ (CHOW LAI KI, NIKI). This leaves her no choice but to break up with YIN, however he refuses. Soon, he has a terrible accident and she has to stay for him..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pl51vjdYRYn5FoVPaltFYFTLT8y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109266'),
  ('163580598101719169', 'Hard Knocks', 2001, 'Documentary, Reality', 'Marty Callner', null, 'Liev Schreiber', 'TV-MA', 'An inside look at NFL training camps. From the top coaches to the rookies trying to make the team, Hard Knocks showcases what it takes to be in the NFL.', 'An inside look at NFL training camps. From the top coaches to the rookies trying to make the team, Hard Knocks showcases what it takes to be in the NFL.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lS7wY5j0CT1wyPjaSwSP9YUk3Rr.jpg', 21, 'tmdb:tv:12940'),
  ('1042359676258386529', 'Hard Sun', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', 'Neil Cross', null, 'Jim Sturgess, Agyness Deyn, Nikki Amuka-Bird, Derek Riddell, Aisling Bea, Varada Sethu, Jojo Macari, Owain Arthur', 'TV-MA', 'Two detectives with opposing viewpoints are partnered together five years before the Apocalypse.', 'Two detectives with opposing viewpoints are partnered together five years before the Apocalypse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eROfMhluF1kxDHFS5wbPmjN2KvU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72749'),
  ('297961123505799013', 'Hard Time on Planet Earth', 1989, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jim Thomas', null, 'Martin Kove', null, 'Hard Time on Planet Earth is an American science fiction series that aired on CBS as a midseason replacement in 1989. Airing for 13 episodes, the series starred Martin Kove and was created by Jim and John Thomas. Scheduled opposite NBC''s Unsolved Mysteries and ABC''s Growing Pains on Wednesdays, Hard Time on Planet Earth ranked 65th out of 81 programs upon its premiere. Ratings for the series never improved and the series was canceled by CBS in May 1989. The last episode aired on June 21, 1989.', 'Hard Time on Planet Earth is an American science fiction series that aired on CBS as a midseason replacement in 1989. Airing for 13 episodes, the series starred Martin Kove and was created by Jim and John Thomas. Scheduled opposite NBC''s Unsolved Mysteries and ABC''s Growing Pains on Wednesdays, Hard Time on Planet Earth ranked 65th out of 81 programs upon its premiere. Ratings for the series never improved and the series was canceled by CBS in May 1989. The last episode aired on June 21, 1989.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjT89xJZ8SAAhR0FobciczwBhEw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15723'),
  ('1064023158387505164', 'Hardball with Chris Matthews', null, 'News, Talk', null, null, 'Chris Matthews', 'TV-PG', 'Hardball with Chris Matthews is an American television talk show on MSNBC, broadcast weekdays at 7 PM ET hosted by Chris Matthews. It originally aired on now-defunct America''s Talking and later CNBC. The current title was derived from a book Matthews wrote in 1988, Hardball: How Politics Is Played Told by One Who Knows the Game. Hardball is a talking-head style cable news show where the moderator advances opinions on a wide range of topics, focusing primarily on current political issues. These issues are discussed with a panel of guests that usually consists of political analysts and sometimes include politicians. It also runs in a "Best of" format Saturday mornings at 5 AM.', 'Hardball with Chris Matthews is an American television talk show on MSNBC, broadcast weekdays at 7 PM ET hosted by Chris Matthews. It originally aired on now-defunct America''s Talking and later CNBC. The current title was derived from a book Matthews wrote in 1988, Hardball: How Politics Is Played Told by One Who Knows the Game. Hardball is a talking-head style cable news show where the moderator advances opinions on a wide range of topics, focusing primarily on current political issues. These issues are discussed with a panel of guests that usually consists of political analysts and sometimes include politicians. It also runs in a "Best of" format Saturday mornings at 5 AM.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kEoxG0jgaMd5gDWxzfIgK3lmWE9.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:60'),
  ('343573156036201652', 'Hardcastle and McCormick', 1983, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Stephen J. Cannell', null, 'Brian Keith, Daniel Hugh Kelly, Joe Santos', 'TV-PG', 'Hardcastle and McCormick is an American action/drama television series from Stephen J. Cannell Productions, shown on ABC from 1983 through 1986. The series stars Brian Keith as Judge Milton C. Hardcastle and Daniel Hugh Kelly as ex-con and race car driver Mark "Skid" McCormick. The series premise was somewhat recycled from a previous Cannell series, Tenspeed and Brown Shoe.', 'Hardcastle and McCormick is an American action/drama television series from Stephen J. Cannell Productions, shown on ABC from 1983 through 1986. The series stars Brian Keith as Judge Milton C. Hardcastle and Daniel Hugh Kelly as ex-con and race car driver Mark "Skid" McCormick. The series premise was somewhat recycled from a previous Cannell series, Tenspeed and Brown Shoe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d3ZWBPAlcmYwvA183aI5z1mosv7.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1271'),
  ('488809837362802986', 'Hardcore Pawn', 2010, 'Reality, Documentary', 'Richard Dominick', null, 'Les Gold, Seth Gold, Ashley Broad, Karen Mitchel', 'TV-14', 'Meet the Gold family. As owners of Detroit''s biggest pawn shop, they''ve bought and sold things you can''t begin to imagine. Every day brings new danger as the Golds operate in the heart of one of America''s most troubled cities. With 50,000 sq ft of cash and goods surrounding them, there are millions to be made, but their profits come with huge risk.', 'Meet the Gold family. As owners of Detroit''s biggest pawn shop, they''ve bought and sold things you can''t begin to imagine. Every day brings new danger as the Golds operate in the heart of one of America''s most troubled cities. With 50,000 sq ft of cash and goods surrounding them, there are millions to be made, but their profits come with huge risk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8EHKPtd2NoZ8Z25cU3pbzAot96.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:33478'),
  ('1123912923469893771', 'Haré+Guu', 2001, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Daisuke Kishio, Naoko Watanabe, Rikako Aikawa, Yuki Matsuoka, Kaoru Morota, Akira Ishida, Ayumi Furuyama, Chie Koujiro', 'TV-PG', 'Haré was a happy boy living in the jungle with his mother, but then one day Guu showed up.', 'Haré was a happy boy living in the jungle with his mother, but then one day Guu showed up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtO541BFRT6jp7MShlZNIOAnX9g.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:34812'),
  ('699270176673577481', 'Harem Camp!', 2022, 'Animation', null, null, 'Masahito Nomura, Yuka Hinata, Miu Yuzuhara, Mashiro Kazahana, Yumi Yumiya', null, 'The story follows teacher and veteran solo camper Kensuke, who forms a camping group with four girls.', 'The story follows teacher and veteran solo camper Kensuke, who forms a camping group with four girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dsaYRfBviInhrulwtHOyg1KB4ct.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207840'),
  ('642174567108865745', 'Harem in the Labyrinth of Another World', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Taku Yashiro, Shiori Mikami, Kenta Miyake', 'TV-MA', 'High school student Michio Kaga was wandering aimlessly through life and the Internet, when he finds himself transported from a shady website to a fantasy world — reborn as a strong man who can use "cheat" powers. He uses his powers to become an adventurer, earn money, and get the right to claim girls that have idol-level beauty to form his very own harem.', 'High school student Michio Kaga was wandering aimlessly through life and the Internet, when he finds himself transported from a shady website to a fantasy world — reborn as a strong man who can use "cheat" powers. He uses his powers to become an adventurer, earn money, and get the right to claim girls that have idol-level beauty to form his very own harem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/drAnsk5w2PX5x3ooPv7I2xr3ksq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114477'),
  ('849700027795258691', 'Harina', 2022, 'Comedy, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Julio Berthely, Carlos Daniel Reichel, Pedro Esteves', null, 'Memo Villegas, Verónica Bravo, Luis Fernando Peña, Dagoberto Gama', 'TV-MA', 'The misadventures of Lieutenant Harina and his partner, Officer Ramírez, a very special police couple, who find themselves with the opportunity of a lifetime', 'The misadventures of Lieutenant Harina and his partner, Officer Ramírez, a very special police couple, who find themselves with the opportunity of a lifetime', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqW5UWQ2M13lQWVrGNrUzs3hn2x.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:158793'),
  ('11604404313896884', 'Harlan Coben''s Lazarus', 2025, 'Mystery', 'Harlan Coben, Daniel Brocklehurst', null, 'Sam Claflin, Bill Nighy, Alexandra Roach, David Fynn, Karla Crome, Eloise Little, Curtis Tennant, Kate Ashfield', null, 'Forensic psychiatrist Dr Joel ''Laz'' Lazarus is forced to confront long-buried demons after his father Dr L dies in suspicious circumstances. At first assured his dad''s death is a suicide, Laz is soon sucked into a world of murderous conspiracy, and a race to find the killer, by strange visions of people he knows to be dead.', 'Forensic psychiatrist Dr Joel ''Laz'' Lazarus is forced to confront long-buried demons after his father Dr L dies in suspicious circumstances. At first assured his dad''s death is a suicide, Laz is soon sucked into a world of murderous conspiracy, and a race to find the killer, by strange visions of people he knows to be dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxUlUBGnYJNxqOwc3baBdLpa3Lx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:245827'),
  ('1029681985824117196', 'Harlan Coben''s Shelter', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Harlan Coben, Charlotte Coben', null, 'Jaden Michael, Constance Zimmer, Adrian Greensmith, Abby Corrigan, Sage Linder, Brian Altemus', 'TV-14', 'Follow Mickey Bolitar after the death of his father leads him to start a new life in suburban New Jersey. When another new student disappears, Mickey finds himself tangled in a web of secrets. With the help of two new friends, Spoon and Ema, they reveal a dark underground that may hold the answers to decades of disappearances.', 'Follow Mickey Bolitar after the death of his father leads him to start a new life in suburban New Jersey. When another new student disappears, Mickey finds himself tangled in a web of secrets. With the help of two new friends, Spoon and Ema, they reveal a dark underground that may hold the answers to decades of disappearances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEDJ0L9xY2SblTsPhghUHTa1VnX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210787'),
  ('859483398546338258', 'Harlem', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Tracy Oliver', null, 'Meagan Good, Jerrie Johnson, Grace Byers, Shoniqua Shandai, Tyler Lepley', 'TV-MA', 'Four stylish and ambitious best girlfriends in Harlem, New York City: a rising star professor struggling to make space for her love life; a savvy tech entrepreneur always dating someone new; a no-filter singer; and a hopeless romantic fashion designer. Together, they level up into the next phase of their careers, relationships, and big city dreams.', 'Four stylish and ambitious best girlfriends in Harlem, New York City: a rising star professor struggling to make space for her love life; a savvy tech entrepreneur always dating someone new; a no-filter singer; and a hopeless romantic fashion designer. Together, they level up into the next phase of their careers, relationships, and big city dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQP2zAm5L52vs7fp3JzOI5LZ4uB.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:138089'),
  ('1148335295300227596', 'Harley and the Davidsons', 2016, 'Drama', null, 'Nick Schenk, Seth Fisher', 'Bug Hall, Annie Read, Tommy Bastow, Hera Hilmar, Mitchell Mullen, Michiel Huisman, Daniel Coonan, Essa O''Shea', 'TV-14', 'Based on a true story, "Harley and the Davidsons" charts the birth of this iconic bike during a time of great social and technological change beginning at the turn of the 20th century.', 'Based on a true story, "Harley and the Davidsons" charts the birth of this iconic bike during a time of great social and technological change beginning at the turn of the 20th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oGO6qvzxkDw7azTTbu7Qlucnjwe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67673'),
  ('75608043895401180', 'Harley Quinn', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Patrick Schumacker, Justin Halpern, Dean Lorey', null, 'Kaley Cuoco, Lake Bell', 'TV-MA', 'Harley Quinn has finally broken things off once and for all with the Joker. Now, she''s trying to make it on her own as the criminal Queenpin of Gotham City, with help from Poison Ivy and a ragtag crew of DC castoffs.', 'Harley Quinn has finally broken things off once and for all with the Joker. Now, she''s trying to make it on her own as the criminal Queenpin of Gotham City, with help from Poison Ivy and a ragtag crew of DC castoffs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Dm1SEh8Wxt8LNNg02exHQ595zg.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:74440'),
  ('1132381142996157921', 'Harlots', 2017, 'Drama', 'Moira Buffini', null, 'Alfie Allen, Danny Sapani, Bronwyn James, Ben Lambert, Rosalind Eleazar, Holli Dempsey, Ash Hunter, Pippa Bennett-Warner', 'TV-MA', 'Brothel owner, Margaret Wells, struggles to raise her daughters in London during the 18th century.', 'Brothel owner, Margaret Wells, struggles to raise her daughters in London during the 18th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w6F93B2ZUCEUhRpgCS1cU82htqz.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:69541'),
  ('266248382005399879', 'HarmonQuest', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Spencer Crittenden, Dan Harmon', null, 'Spencer Crittenden, Dan Harmon, Erin McGathy, Jeff Bryan Davis', 'TV-PG', 'A comedic journey into the hilarious world of fantasy roleplaying with Dan Harmon and his Comedian Companions.', 'A comedic journey into the hilarious world of fantasy roleplaying with Dan Harmon and his Comedian Companions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jeBr5TZoh3uZNqHqve12jKzkRUd.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:67111'),
  ('295203233850440108', 'Harmony of Mille-Feuille', 2025, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Mirai Ayase, Yuko Natsuyoshi, Kanoko Sudo, Misato Matsuoka, Miharu Hanai, Haruka Aikawa', null, 'The a cappella club is filled with unique individuals some might say they''re a bit odd. Even if they''re not flashy or popular, there''s a special kind of youth that connects through their voices, creating something truly unique.', 'The a cappella club is filled with unique individuals some might say they''re a bit odd. Even if they''re not flashy or popular, there''s a special kind of youth that connects through their voices, creating something truly unique.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2vhYCGOSFDzJmqwovAYajSOUrfy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:260848'),
  ('266913044055200843', 'Harmony Secret', 2025, 'Drama', null, 'Ticha Aphaiwongs', 'Punyapat Wangpongsathaporn, Saranphat Pedersen, Ladapa Thongkham, Jiratchaya Kittavornsakul, Akalavut Mankalasut, Nithi Smuthkochorn, Nuttanan Khunwat', null, 'Two business heiresses—Aiwarin and Maevika—from a hotel empire and from a department store dynasty, respectively, compete for a national Duty-Free bid. From the moment they meet, an undeniable attraction sparks.', 'Two business heiresses—Aiwarin and Maevika—from a hotel empire and from a department store dynasty, respectively, compete for a national Duty-Free bid. From the moment they meet, an undeniable attraction sparks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jstn8gZWCd5jcxosC2lnZ5nebcu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:284488'),
  ('564515486952741352', 'Harper''s Island', 2009, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Ari Schlossberg', null, 'Elaine Cassidy, Christopher Gorham, Katie Cassidy, Cameron Richardson, Jim Beaver, C.J. Thomason, Adam Campbell, Matt Barr', 'TV-14', 'A group of family and friends travels to a secluded island for a destination wedding. They''ve come to laugh... to love... and, though they don''t know it... to die. As the wedding festivities begin, friendships are tested and secrets exposed as a murderer claims victims, one by one, transforming the wedding week of fun and celebration into a terrifying struggle for survival.', 'A group of family and friends travels to a secluded island for a destination wedding. They''ve come to laugh... to love... and, though they don''t know it... to die. As the wedding festivities begin, friendships are tested and secrets exposed as a murderer claims victims, one by one, transforming the wedding week of fun and celebration into a terrifying struggle for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihpf4yvi9GWATXj7IApblIHRMP4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:7354'),
  ('874026108574786063', 'Harriet the Spy', 2021, 'Animation, Kids', null, null, 'Beanie Feldstein, Jane Lynch, Lacey Chabert, Kimberly Brooks, Crispin Freeman, Grey DeLisle, Bumper Robinson, Charlie Schlatter', 'TV-G', 'Outspoken and perpetually curious. That''s 11-year-old Harriet in a nutshell. But if she’s going to be Harriet M. Welsch, future writer, she''ll need to know everything. And to know everything means she''ll need to spy...on everyone.', 'Outspoken and perpetually curious. That''s 11-year-old Harriet in a nutshell. But if she’s going to be Harriet M. Welsch, future writer, she''ll need to know everything. And to know everything means she''ll need to spy...on everyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wlH2YAt8JxOoKgkF3HlDGt9d734.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:136300'),
  ('691976706957163751', 'Harrow', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Stephen M. Irwin, Leigh McGrath', null, 'Ioan Gruffudd, Jolene Anderson, Darren Gilshenan, Damien Garvey, Ella Newton, Hunter Page-Lochard, Faustina Agolley, Miriama Smith', null, 'When a dark secret from this past threatens to be exposed, unorthodox and brilliant medical examiner, Doctor Daniel Harrow, must use all his forensic skills to keep it buried forever.', 'When a dark secret from this past threatens to be exposed, unorthodox and brilliant medical examiner, Doctor Daniel Harrow, must use all his forensic skills to keep it buried forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z0H4iQBe1YL9I8pZF5jRifcF369.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:77947'),
