  ('369920204632434836', 'Heels', 2021, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Michael Waldron', null, 'Stephen Amell, Alexander Ludwig, Alison Luff, Mary McCormack, Kelli Berglund, Chris Bauer, Allen Maldonado, James Harrison Jr.', 'TV-MA', 'In a close-knit Georgia community, a family-owned wrestling promotion finds two brothers and rivals war over their late father’s legacy. In the ring, somebody must play the good guy and somebody must play their nemesis, the heel. But in the real world, those characters can be hard to live up to (and just as hard to leave behind).', 'In a close-knit Georgia community, a family-owned wrestling promotion finds two brothers and rivals war over their late father’s legacy. In the ring, somebody must play the good guy and somebody must play their nemesis, the heel. But in the real world, those characters can be hard to live up to (and just as hard to leave behind).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/69kPJaCFMXuZfbCrbDaYfMZbtJt.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:92553'),
  ('956943879327871853', 'Heels in the Hay', 2025, 'Reality, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Robbert Rodenburg', null, 'Twelve city influencers trade their luxurious urban lives for the harsh reality of the Dutch countryside. No filters and no oat milk cappuccinos - just early mornings, dirty hands, and fierce competition. They discover that farm life holds more hidden challenges than they ever imagined. Which city dweller will hold their ground? One thing is certain: it won’t be a picture-perfect scene...', 'Twelve city influencers trade their luxurious urban lives for the harsh reality of the Dutch countryside. No filters and no oat milk cappuccinos - just early mornings, dirty hands, and fierce competition. They discover that farm life holds more hidden challenges than they ever imagined. Which city dweller will hold their ground? One thing is certain: it won’t be a picture-perfect scene...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aw4xuvdBECeQJuRoT5tDPKvGfit.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:286231'),
  ('238440574606252856', 'Heeramandi', 2024, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Sanjay Leela Bhansali', null, 'Manisha Koirala, Sonakshi Sinha, Aditi Rao Hydari, Sharmin Segal, Sanjeeda Sheikh, Richa Chadha, Taha Shah Badussha, Farida Jalal', 'TV-MA', 'The scheming Mallikajaan rules over an elite house of courtesans — but a new rival threatens her reign as rebellion brews in British-ruled India.', 'The scheming Mallikajaan rules over an elite house of courtesans — but a new rival threatens her reign as rebellion brews in British-ruled India.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRhzhaWlFyypV12APz8EcMPRKa9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:156716'),
  ('464868216948831833', 'Heesu in Class 2', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lily Zuzu', 'Park Sang-Ah', 'Ahn Ji-ho, Lee Sang-jun, Cho Jun-young, Kim Do-yeon, Jeon Young-in, Park Yoo-Hyun, Yang Jung-ah, Oh Tae-eun', null, 'Hee-su hides his love for his best friend—until that friend falls for someone else, and silence starts to hurt.', 'Hee-su hides his love for his best friend—until that friend falls for someone else, and silence starts to hurt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCjB943DiwohayuxmLffHEc4DmP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:220041'),
  ('923051735683122009', 'Hei$t: The Great Robbery of Brazil''s Central Bank', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Daniel Billio, Nikolas Fonseca, Rodrigo Astiz', 'Daniel Billio', null, 'TV-14', 'In August 2005, through a tunnel almost 80 meter long, thiefs invaded the bank vault of Brazil''s Central Bank in Fortaleza and stole over 160 milions reais, ou or nealy 3,5 tons of cash. This documenty explores that spectacular and historic heist.', 'In August 2005, through a tunnel almost 80 meter long, thiefs invaded the bank vault of Brazil''s Central Bank in Fortaleza and stole over 160 milions reais, ou or nealy 3,5 tons of cash. This documenty explores that spectacular and historic heist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9rkkPK433u5A2N7lEorqxgkGLi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158762'),
  ('322460806942876220', 'Heidi', 1993, 'Drama, Family', null, 'Jeanne Rosenberg', 'Noley Thornton, Jason Robards, Ben Brazier, Lexi Randall, Jane Seymour, Patricia Neal, Siân Phillips, Jane Hazlegrove', null, 'After charming her reclusive grandfather and falling in love with the beautiful mountain he calls home, Heidi is uprooted and sent to Frankfurt where she befriends Klara, a young girl confined to a wheelchair.', 'After charming her reclusive grandfather and falling in love with the beautiful mountain he calls home, Heidi is uprooted and sent to Frankfurt where she befriends Klara, a young girl confined to a wheelchair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8AgGpuktVJamxvjHnRmCGmjURu7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74902'),
  ('260682538461063767', 'Heidi', 2015, 'Animation, Family, Kids, Drama', 'Christel Gonnard', 'Christel Gonnard', null, 'TV-Y', 'A plucky young orphan sent to live with her grandfather in the mountains discovers wonder and adventure around every corner.', 'A plucky young orphan sent to live with her grandfather in the mountains discovers wonder and adventure around every corner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gw0dxuL9roVp2rCYx3y5jFHE7Cf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62475'),
  ('967861984228483921', 'Heidi: Girl of the Alps', 1974, 'Animation, Drama, Family', null, null, 'Kazuko Sugiyama, Kohei Miyauchi, Noriko Ohara, Rihoko Yoshida, Miyoko Aso, Natsuko Kawaji, Miyako Shima, Taeko Nakanishi', null, 'After becoming an orphan, Heidi is forced to live with her grandfather, who lives in the Alps. She learns he''s a very bitter man who only accepted by force to take her in. But Heidi''s kindness may be able to open his heart. Together with her friends Peter and Clara, she goes on lots of adventures.', 'After becoming an orphan, Heidi is forced to live with her grandfather, who lives in the Alps. She learns he''s a very bitter man who only accepted by force to take her in. But Heidi''s kindness may be able to open his heart. Together with her friends Peter and Clara, she goes on lots of adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfay7acSjC8loo0y8PPft8aYaW0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:29452'),
