  ('344114903972340277', 'Helden van Zuid-Afrika', 2026, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:318456'),
  ('477486342378850815', 'Helen of Troy', 2003, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, 'Ronni Kern', 'Sienna Guillory, James Callis, Rufus Sewell, Matthew Marsden, John Rhys-Davies, Maryam D''Abo, Daniel Lapaine, Emilia Fox', null, 'Paris of Troy goes to Sparta on a diplomatic mission and falls in love with Helen, the wife of King Menelaus. When lovers flee to Troy, the bloody seeds of a long war, sown by King Agamemnon of Mycenae, finally sprout, so an old prophecy is fulfilled.', 'Paris of Troy goes to Sparta on a diplomatic mission and falls in love with Helen, the wife of King Menelaus. When lovers flee to Troy, the bloody seeds of a long war, sown by King Agamemnon of Mycenae, finally sprout, so an old prophecy is fulfilled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jhs5B2aD00TmvWkUkd9ImcYwurw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5905'),
  ('505492007182846178', 'Helena''s Shadow', 2014, 'Soap, Drama', 'Manoel Carlos', 'Juliana Peres, Angela Chaves, Maria Carolina', 'Júlia Lemmertz, Gabriel Braga Nunes, Bruna Marquezine, Humberto Martins, Vivianne Pasmanter, Giovanna Antonelli, Tainá Müller, Helena Ranaldi', 'NR', 'Laerte’s obsessive jealousy brings his relationship with Helena to an end on their wedding day. Twenty years later, he meets Luiza, the daughter of his long lost love. The two fall in love and stir up dormant feelings that profoundly affect Helena’s marriage and her relationship with her daughter. Defying everyone, Laerte and Luiza decide to follow their love to the highest bounds, leaving a trail of conflicts and pain along the way.', 'Laerte’s obsessive jealousy brings his relationship with Helena to an end on their wedding day. Twenty years later, he meets Luiza, the daughter of his long lost love. The two fall in love and stir up dormant feelings that profoundly affect Helena’s marriage and her relationship with her daughter. Defying everyone, Laerte and Luiza decide to follow their love to the highest bounds, leaving a trail of conflicts and pain along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBTLagYYPXxXHiJPqkG8o21craM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79006'),
  ('165251510142922753', 'Hélène et les Garçons', 1992, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jean-Luc Azoulay', null, 'Hélène Rollès, Sébastien Roch, Laure Guibert, Sébastien Courivaud, Karine Lollichon, Patrick Puydebat', null, 'The sitcom follows Hélène Girard and her friends in their life as students.', 'The sitcom follows Hélène Girard and her friends in their life as students.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zOiXZAZGQq34PGlU6yOUly4HpOz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:33620'),
  ('288522283987751425', 'Helgoland 513', 2024, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Robert Schwentke', null, 'Alexander Fehling, Martina Gedeck, Samuel Finzi, Kathrin Angerer, Maja Schöne, Antje Traue, Martin Brambach, Wolfram Koch', null, 'Helgoland. Here, on Germany''s only offshore island, a small community of survivors of an apocalypse that has overrun the rest of the world and plunged it into chaos is holed up. But the price of their survival is high. The resources on the rocky island are scarce, so that an inhumane "social ranking" system determines the lives of the 513 inhabitants: each islander is evaluated according to his usefulness. The only doctor is high on the list, others are far behind, and they have to fight for their place on the list and their survival. Meanwhile, people from the mainland are trying to get to Helgoland and the Helgolanders have to defend their island.', 'Helgoland. Here, on Germany''s only offshore island, a small community of survivors of an apocalypse that has overrun the rest of the world and plunged it into chaos is holed up. But the price of their survival is high. The resources on the rocky island are scarce, so that an inhumane "social ranking" system determines the lives of the 513 inhabitants: each islander is evaluated according to his usefulness. The only doctor is high on the list, others are far behind, and they have to fight for their place on the list and their survival. Meanwhile, people from the mainland are trying to get to Helgoland and the Helgolanders have to defend their island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ih82j3tpl4h1xsL6NELMywS2Ulf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:227689'),
  ('524747412366930377', 'Helix', 2014, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ronald D. Moore, Cameron Porsandeh', null, 'Billy Campbell, Meegwun Fairbrother, Jordan Hayes, Mark Ghanimé, Neil Napier, Kyra Zagorsky, Steven Weber, Matt Long', 'TV-MA', 'Helix is an intense thriller about a team of scientists from the Centers for Disease Control who travel to a high-tech research facility in the Arctic to investigate a possible disease outbreak, only to find themselves pulled into a terrifying life-and-death struggle that holds the key to mankind''s salvation...or total annihilation.', 'Helix is an intense thriller about a team of scientists from the Centers for Disease Control who travel to a high-tech research facility in the Arctic to investigate a possible disease outbreak, only to find themselves pulled into a terrifying life-and-death struggle that holds the key to mankind''s salvation...or total annihilation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7goT0IcsXjRo9fdMlWKr6ZRmaNP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:58811'),
  ('217644836737660118', 'Hell Girl', 2005, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Hiroshi Watanabe', 'Masaya Matsukaze, Mamiko Noto, Takayuki Sugo, Takako Honda, Kanako Sakai, Hekiru Shiina, Nana Mizuki, Misaki Watada', 'TV-MA', 'A supernatural system allows people to take revenge by having other people sent to Hell via the services of a mysterious entity and her assistants who implement this system. Revenge, injustice, hatred, and the nature of human emotions are common themes throughout the series.', 'A supernatural system allows people to take revenge by having other people sent to Hell via the services of a mysterious entity and her assistants who implement this system. Revenge, injustice, hatred, and the nature of human emotions are common themes throughout the series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l50Wjrt2m362DjsKZVTpU2sp5L5.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:8974'),
  ('1084122037254798095', 'Hell Girl', 2006, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Sayuri Iwata, Aya Sugimoto, Kazuki Kato, Hisahiro Ogura, Nishimura Kazuhiko, Saaya', null, 'Have you ever felt great hatred towards some person? Was it as if you can visit hell for eternity to punish him? The rumor tells of a site, opened only at midnight, called the Jigoku Tsushin. You can write the name of your grudge there and that person will be sent to hell by the Jigoku Shoujo. This rumor is apparently true. Live-action adaptation of the manga of the same name.', 'Have you ever felt great hatred towards some person? Was it as if you can visit hell for eternity to punish him? The rumor tells of a site, opened only at midnight, called the Jigoku Tsushin. You can write the name of your grudge there and that person will be sent to hell by the Jigoku Shoujo. This rumor is apparently true. Live-action adaptation of the manga of the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8EceqLvcVdXzoatf5bcwOgLOLKu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91539'),
  ('215850684491891409', 'Hell Mode: The Hardcore Gamer Dominates in Another World with Garbage Balancing', 2026, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mutsumi Tamura, Mayu Iizuka, Tasuku Hatanaka, Sayaka Senbongi, Hideo Ishikawa, Sayaka Ohara, Makoto Koichi, Tomokazu Sugita', 'TV-14', 'Kenichi Yamada, a single, 35-year-old businessman, has spent the majority of his adult life playing every MMORPG to hit the market. Tired of the constant cycle of repetitive, newbie-centric gameplay, he is immediately drawn in by the promise of a new game that, on top of being never-ending, offers up a "Hell Mode"—a difficulty level that makes it nigh impossible to level up but also promises uncapped growth potential. Upon selecting the newly released Summoner class, Kenichi finds himself reborn as Allen, an infant in a serf family, with nothing but his wits and old memories to guide him.', 'Kenichi Yamada, a single, 35-year-old businessman, has spent the majority of his adult life playing every MMORPG to hit the market. Tired of the constant cycle of repetitive, newbie-centric gameplay, he is immediately drawn in by the promise of a new game that, on top of being never-ending, offers up a "Hell Mode"—a difficulty level that makes it nigh impossible to level up but also promises uncapped growth potential. Upon selecting the newly released Summoner class, Kenichi finds himself reborn as Allen, an infant in a serf family, with nothing but his wits and old memories to guide him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kjeeFHqhEtv1HsRLlV4bQRpDzsU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:280049'),
  ('223878883194423024', 'Hell Motel', 2025, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Aaron Martin, Ian Carpenter', null, 'Eric McCormack, Paula Brancati, Shaun Benson, Atticus Mitchell, Genevieve DeGraves, Emmanuel Kabongo, Jim Watson, Yanna McIntosh', 'TV-MA', 'A group of 10 true crime obsessives are invited to the opening weekend of the newly renovated Cold River Motel, the site of a 30-year-old unsolved satanic mass murder. History repeats itself when the guests get stranded and start getting knocked off one by one during a murder spree that grows exponentially more gruesome than the original with each kill.', 'A group of 10 true crime obsessives are invited to the opening weekend of the newly renovated Cold River Motel, the site of a 30-year-old unsolved satanic mass murder. History repeats itself when the guests get stranded and start getting knocked off one by one during a murder spree that grows exponentially more gruesome than the original with each kill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRfT9XffHqBxvkrW4izh3gd7L4S.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:290511'),
  ('231454416566862246', 'Hell on Wheels', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Western', 'Tony Gayton, Joe Gayton', null, 'Anson Mount, Colm Meaney, Robin McLeavy, Christopher Heyerdahl, Phil Burke, Tim Guinee, Angela Zhou, Byron Mann', 'TV-14', 'The epic story of post-Civil War America, focusing on Cullen Bohannon, a Confederate soldier who sets out to exact revenge on the Union soldiers who killed his wife. His journey takes him west to Hell on Wheels, a dangerous, raucous, lawless melting pot of a town that travels with and services the construction of the first transcontinental railroad, an engineering feat unprecedented for its time.', 'The epic story of post-Civil War America, focusing on Cullen Bohannon, a Confederate soldier who sets out to exact revenge on the Union soldiers who killed his wife. His journey takes him west to Hell on Wheels, a dangerous, raucous, lawless melting pot of a town that travels with and services the construction of the first transcontinental railroad, an engineering feat unprecedented for its time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ckC9pL9yeYpOoK5aJ7GbYYWheK7.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1401'),
  ('143817149209728449', 'Hell Teacher Nube', 1996, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Ryotaro Okiayu, Toshiko Fujita, Michiko Neya, Megumi Urawa, Chieko Honda, Rumi Kasahara, Kazunari Tanaka', null, 'Nueno Mesuke, better known as Nube, is a school teacher who does more than just teach. You see, Nube''s left hand is a huge, nasty-looking demon''s claw. He uses it to get rid of malicious demons, ghosts, spirits and other supernatural beings that are giving his students a hard time. Nube''s left hand was normal, until one fateful day when he exorcised an extremely powerful demon from a child. He was outmatched and lost his left hand. The only way to fight it was to let it enter his body. As a result, Nube has a demonic left hand where his own hand used to be. To educate and protect — that is what Jigoku Sensei Nube does.', 'Nueno Mesuke, better known as Nube, is a school teacher who does more than just teach. You see, Nube''s left hand is a huge, nasty-looking demon''s claw. He uses it to get rid of malicious demons, ghosts, spirits and other supernatural beings that are giving his students a hard time. Nube''s left hand was normal, until one fateful day when he exorcised an extremely powerful demon from a child. He was outmatched and lost his left hand. The only way to fight it was to let it enter his body. As a result, Nube has a demonic left hand where his own hand used to be. To educate and protect — that is what Jigoku Sensei Nube does.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6NkKPwyJKE8aFWt7uGLglVVKiEp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:23787'),
  ('684381018569276583', 'Hell Teacher: Jigoku Sensei Nube', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ryotaro Okiayu, Ryoko Shiraishi, Aya Suzaki, Aya Endo, Ryota Iwasaki, Shiho Kokido, Tomoyo Kurosawa', 'TV-MA', 'A number of inexplicable phenomena have been plaguing the town of Domori. In order to protect the town''s children, a new homeroom teacher known as “Nube” arrives. Normally gentle and a bit outgoing, Nube has a secret side: he is, in fact, the only psychic teacher in Japan. Rumor also has it his left hand is possessed by a demon! Hell''s messenger of justice is here to take on the school''s seven mysteries, ghosts, and evil spirits attacking his students.', 'A number of inexplicable phenomena have been plaguing the town of Domori. In order to protect the town''s children, a new homeroom teacher known as “Nube” arrives. Normally gentle and a bit outgoing, Nube has a secret side: he is, in fact, the only psychic teacher in Japan. Rumor also has it his left hand is possessed by a demon! Hell''s messenger of justice is here to take on the school''s seven mysteries, ghosts, and evil spirits attacking his students.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rsytua5oKGyqzX2sdCZcq5Cck2l.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259544'),
  ('902781792598833970', 'Hell University', 2026, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Heart Ryan, Zeke Polina, Andre Yllana, Lance Carr, Aubrey Caraan, Gabbi Ejercito, Derick Ong, Jastine Lim', null, 'After discovering Hell University, a group of friends is forced into a lawless school where murder is allowed every night. As fear threatens to break them apart, Zein fights to keep her friends alive while uncovering a system designed to make no one leave.', 'After discovering Hell University, a group of friends is forced into a lawless school where murder is allowed every night. As fear threatens to break them apart, Zein fights to keep her friends alive while uncovering a system designed to make no one leave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4X2POwtjmRZYDGcAtXdWqvr5oaJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:312172'),
  ('943062251888854519', 'Hell''s Kitchen', 2004, 'Reality', 'Gordon Ramsay', null, 'Claudia Winkleman, Marco Pierre White', null, 'Hell''s Kitchen was a British cookery reality show aired on ITV which featured prospective chefs competing with each other for a final prize. Four series were aired from 2004 to 2009, three presented by Angus Deayton and the latest by Claudia Winkleman.', 'Hell''s Kitchen was a British cookery reality show aired on ITV which featured prospective chefs competing with each other for a final prize. Four series were aired from 2004 to 2009, three presented by Angus Deayton and the latest by Claudia Winkleman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tXC13Lkw4o1S6QiUxlmsVepiBnV.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:813'),
  ('1431823816969727', 'Hell''s Kitchen', 2005, 'Reality', null, null, 'Gordon Ramsay, James Avery, Michelle Tribble, Marino Monferrato', 'TV-14', 'Aspiring restaurateurs brave Ramsay and his fiery command of the kitchen as he puts the competitors through an intense culinary academy to prove they possess the right combination of ingredients to win a life-changing grand prize.', 'Aspiring restaurateurs brave Ramsay and his fiery command of the kitchen as he puts the competitors through an intense culinary academy to prove they possess the right combination of ingredients to win a life-changing grand prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shOVFku8daIGRpgjTdMZBxUAvsV.jpg', 24, 'tmdb:tv:2370'),
  ('379071335337373771', 'Hell''s Paradise', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Yuji Kaku', null, 'Chiaki Kobayashi, Yumiri Hanamori, Ryohei Kimura, Rie Takahashi, Tetsu Inada, Aoi Ichikawa, Makoto Koichi, Daiki Yamashita', 'TV-14', 'For a chance at a pardon, a ninja assassin joins other condemned criminals on a journey to a mysterious island to retrieve an elixir of immortality.', 'For a chance at a pardon, a ninja assassin joins other condemned criminals on a journey to a mysterious island to retrieve an elixir of immortality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1V9I7SvZbYoMbSvdtnlkkq9SB1k.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117465'),
  ('134772689360465481', 'Hellbound', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Yeon Sang-ho, Choi Gyu-seok', 'Yeon Sang-ho', 'Kim Sung-cheol, Kim Hyun-joo, Kim Shin-rock, Choi Jung-hwa', 'TV-MA', 'Unearthly beings deliver bloody condemnations, sending individuals to hell and giving rise to a religious group founded on the idea of divine justice.', 'Unearthly beings deliver bloody condemnations, sending individuals to hell and giving rise to a religious group founded on the idea of divine justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NYdSAnDVIXePrSG2dznHdiibMk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:106651'),
  ('322249984433315806', 'Hellcats', 2010, 'Drama', 'Kevin Murphy', null, 'Aly Michalka, Ashley French, Heather Hemmens, Robbie Jones, Matt Barr, Gail O''Grady, Sharon Leal', 'TV-PG', 'Pre-law student Marti Perkins'' world is flipped upside down when she loses her scholarship, and realizes the only way she can stay in school is by reigniting her dormant teen gymnastic skills to win a place on Lancer University''s legendary cheerleading team.', 'Pre-law student Marti Perkins'' world is flipped upside down when she loses her scholarship, and realizes the only way she can stay in school is by reigniting her dormant teen gymnastic skills to win a place on Lancer University''s legendary cheerleading team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j52TnaTJ0yHN1m98NKkNj4bvku1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32504'),
  ('873735090439909665', 'Hellenius Hörna', 2010, 'Talk, Comedy', null, null, 'David Hellenius', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w2jJkRSB006rug5oNzaWmPjJP3P.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:51666'),
  ('714618979508113456', 'Hellfjord', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Tommy Wirkola', 'Zahid Ali, Stig Frode Henriksen, Tommy Wirkola', 'Zahid Ali, Stig Frode Henriksen, Ingrid Bolsø Berdal, Thomas Hanzon, Pihla Viitala, Maria Bock', null, '"Hellfjord" is the story of the urban police officer Salmander - second generation Pakistani immigrant - who, after somewhat accidentally killing his police horse in front of thousands of children, gets relocated to the location farthest north in Norway: Hellfjord. Hellfjord is archetypical small Norwegian hick village, populated by simple-minded people keenly interested in keeping to themselves. But when Salmander scratches the surface, he discovers a secret that will turn Hellfjord upside down. Maybe even inside out.', '"Hellfjord" is the story of the urban police officer Salmander - second generation Pakistani immigrant - who, after somewhat accidentally killing his police horse in front of thousands of children, gets relocated to the location farthest north in Norway: Hellfjord. Hellfjord is archetypical small Norwegian hick village, populated by simple-minded people keenly interested in keeping to themselves. But when Salmander scratches the surface, he discovers a secret that will turn Hellfjord upside down. Maybe even inside out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rz4NrM5FpevXYgpRKHmNJvkgfub.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46829'),
  ('4497852079792257', 'Hellier', 2019, 'Mystery, Documentary, Reality', 'Karl Pfeiffer, Greg Newkirk', null, 'Greg Newkirk, Dana Newkirk, Connor Randall, Karl Pfeiffer, Tyler Strand', null, 'Driven by a plea for help from a man in Appalachia under supernatural assault, a small crew of paranormal researchers find themselves in a dying coal town, where a series of strange coincidences leads them to a decades-old mystery with far-reaching implications.', 'Driven by a plea for help from a man in Appalachia under supernatural assault, a small crew of paranormal researchers find themselves in a dying coal town, where a series of strange coincidences leads them to a decades-old mystery with far-reaching implications.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mLYFvGCbH1mVOBnKW4tZDxFcWNL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:86259'),
  ('203360088023335431', 'Hello Again!', 2022, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Egor Chichkanov', 'Egor Chichkanov', 'Andrey Merzlikin, Denis Vlasenko, Pavel Chinaryov, Kirill Zhandarov, Lyubov Tolkalina, Dmitriy Zhuravlyov, Sergey Godin, Tatyana Struzhenkova', null, 'Animated comedy with Andrei Merzlikin about the adventures of the bandit Boris who rose from the dead. He awakens in the morgue and decides to reveal the secret of his own death, enlisting the help of a young medical trainee Artem. What is the avenger capable of, who has been in the other world and is eager to punish the killers? Boris is capable of a lot.', 'Animated comedy with Andrei Merzlikin about the adventures of the bandit Boris who rose from the dead. He awakens in the morgue and decides to reveal the secret of his own death, enlisting the help of a young medical trainee Artem. What is the avenger capable of, who has been in the other world and is eager to punish the killers? Boris is capable of a lot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h44AoZWEO6xenzNBQ4dJWMeGKsn.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:153581'),
  ('91365892942216448', 'Hello Anne: Before Green Gables', 2009, 'Animation, Drama, Family, Kids', null, null, 'Rina Hidaka, Seiko Tamura, Setsuji Sato, Lica Wakusawa, Masako Ikeda, Yumiko Kobayashi, Chiaki Shimogama, Taeko Kawata', 'NR', 'Anne Shirley goes through many adventures before she ends up in Green Gables. After losing her parents, little Anne is taken in by the Thomas family, with whom she moves in and helps look after the children and do the housework. In the meantime, she discovers more about herself, including that her name is “Anne”, not “Ann”. She is simply adorable and her creativity brings joy to difficult days.', 'Anne Shirley goes through many adventures before she ends up in Green Gables. After losing her parents, little Anne is taken in by the Thomas family, with whom she moves in and helps look after the children and do the housework. In the meantime, she discovers more about herself, including that her name is “Anne”, not “Ann”. She is simply adorable and her creativity brings joy to difficult days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lv5Wvw316Nh2PJr2tvbuoIcBnWv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:26815'),
  ('1040386829399432441', 'Hello Beautiful Life', 2023, 'Drama', null, 'Su Peng', 'Mao Xiaotong, Zhang Li, Li Zefeng, Boogie Wang, Zhang Kaili, Ning Xin, Zhao Shuzhen, Sun Song', null, 'The Sun sisters are two siblings with vastly different personalities and life paths. One of them, Sun Xin, is a brave and independent woman who values freedom and isn''t afraid to fight for what she believes in. She is also known for her beauty and generosity. Sun Xin''s career is flourishing, as she works in the internet industry and has a bright future ahead. On the other hand, Sun Xiang is a sweet and affectionate woman who loves to socialize and laugh. Despite her innocent and kind nature, she is also exploring her own strengths as a food blogger. Her life may seem plain, but it is full of flavorful experiences and happiness, despite the struggles she may face. Both sisters are hardworking and determined to achieve their dreams, contributing to a society that is full of vitality and prosperity.', 'The Sun sisters are two siblings with vastly different personalities and life paths. One of them, Sun Xin, is a brave and independent woman who values freedom and isn''t afraid to fight for what she believes in. She is also known for her beauty and generosity. Sun Xin''s career is flourishing, as she works in the internet industry and has a bright future ahead. On the other hand, Sun Xiang is a sweet and affectionate woman who loves to socialize and laugh. Despite her innocent and kind nature, she is also exploring her own strengths as a food blogger. Her life may seem plain, but it is full of flavorful experiences and happiness, despite the struggles she may face. Both sisters are hardworking and determined to achieve their dreams, contributing to a society that is full of vitality and prosperity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/74lw51ZNypUT71Efej3fAixTw6h.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:221708'),
  ('291629718280753594', 'Hello Carbot', 2014, 'Kids, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, null, null, 'An unexpected package is delivered to a school boy, Chatan. Chatan opens the box, but there is only an ordinary toy cube inside. However, as soon as Chatan touches the cube, a car-transformation robot appears.', 'An unexpected package is delivered to a school boy, Chatan. Chatan opens the box, but there is only an ordinary toy cube inside. However, as soon as Chatan touches the cube, a car-transformation robot appears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mRyfvMzwBplfiL9C2ItG5RYViLr.jpg', 17, 'tmdb:tv:96121'),
