  ('66028780524400938', 'HELLO HELLO HELLO', 2025, 'Talk', null, null, 'Onya Nurve', 'TV-14', 'Join us as we say “Hello! Hello! Hello!” to the queens of the latest season of RuPaul’s Drag Race! Get an in-depth look at the queen''s audition tapes and find out what the cast really thinks about each other when the library is opened.', 'Join us as we say “Hello! Hello! Hello!” to the queens of the latest season of RuPaul’s Drag Race! Get an in-depth look at the queen''s audition tapes and find out what the cast really thinks about each other when the library is opened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/89K2TNCWPsEBIJhME8oBuvr1I4m.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:283160'),
