  ('894403209556757631', 'Hello Saturday', 2022, 'Reality', '湖南卫视', null, 'He Jiong, Li Xueqin, Yang Di, Ding Chengxin, Wu Ze Lin', null, '"Hello, Saturday" is the rebranding of the popular Chinese show "Happy Camp", hosted by He Jiong and with a fixed group of regular celebrity members. The program showcases the talent of various stars as well as social topics through creative and diverse content and games. It aims to spread positive energy while keeping up with the current trends and leading youth culture.', '"Hello, Saturday" is the rebranding of the popular Chinese show "Happy Camp", hosted by He Jiong and with a fixed group of regular celebrity members. The program showcases the talent of various stars as well as social topics through creative and diverse content and games. It aims to spread positive energy while keeping up with the current trends and leading youth culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wsTjWy6NE2s3h0neChr0D92ddwI.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:154770'),
  ('289845846099136729', 'Hello Tomorrow!', 2023, 'Drama', 'Lucas Jansen, Amit Bhalla', null, 'Billy Crudup, Haneefah Wood, Hank Azaria, Alison Pill, Nicholas Podany, Dewshane Williams', 'TV-MA', 'In a retro-futuristic world, charismatic salesman Jack Billings leads a team of fellow sales associates determined to revitalize their customers'' lives by hawking timeshares on the moon.', 'In a retro-futuristic world, charismatic salesman Jack Billings leads a team of fellow sales associates determined to revitalize their customers'' lives by hawking timeshares on the moon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AaJ5R5xCOsPjCdU3tGbCG9qP2lT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:125000'),
  ('505897002768491120', 'Hello, Detective Hedgehog', 2017, 'Drama, Mystery', null, 'Hitoshi One', 'Eita Nagayama, Kyoko Fukada, Go Morita, Tomoko Yamaguchi, Sōichi Nakaoka, Moemi Katayama, Kenichi Yajima, Yu Aoi', null, 'Detective Goro Nanase and his colleagues of "Akatsuka Detective Office" are based in Shimo-Akazuka of Itabashi-ku, Tokyo. The detectives take on a string of challenging cases that no one else wants to take on.', 'Detective Goro Nanase and his colleagues of "Akatsuka Detective Office" are based in Shimo-Akazuka of Itabashi-ku, Tokyo. The detectives take on a string of challenging cases that no one else wants to take on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hc0roKXYCpc0YRQ9FmqjG3GirjC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72218'),
  ('985521631367648651', 'Hello, Larry', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Perry Grant, Dick Bensfield', null, 'McLean Stevenson, Joanna Gleason, Kim Richards, Krista Errickson, Meadowlark Lemon, Fred Stuthman, John Femia, Ruth Brown', null, 'Radio host Larry Alder has to cope with being a single father to his two daughters, Diane and Ruthie.', 'Radio host Larry Alder has to cope with being a single father to his two daughters, Diane and Ruthie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g7xV1bo5j1qgJtMegNiPxwZk1HJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:9751'),
  ('975911955383721397', 'Hello, Me!', 2021, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Choi Kang-hee, Kim Young-kwang, Lee Re, Moon Seong-hyun, Um Mun-suk, Kim Yu-mi, Ji Seung-hyun, Yun Ju-sang', null, 'Miserable and unsuccessful, a woman thinks she''s lost all her spark — until one day, her spunky younger self appears in front of her demanding change.', 'Miserable and unsuccessful, a woman thinks she''s lost all her spark — until one day, her spunky younger self appears in front of her demanding change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHqHL1x6y8gyzuPWljpfKe4YakC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:116045'),
  ('365709572609778604', 'Hello, My Twenties!', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Park Yeon-seon', null, 'Han Ye-ri, Han Seung-yeon, Park Eun-bin, Ji Woo, Choi A-ra, Kim Min-seok, An Woo-yeon, Shin Hyun-soo', 'TV-14', 'With different personalities, life goals and taste in men, five female college students become housemates in a shared residence called Belle Epoque.', 'With different personalities, life goals and taste in men, five female college students become housemates in a shared residence called Belle Epoque.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4MdSbKFGAzgFhF407e9fcZreqvm.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67014'),
  ('696523120703581485', 'Hello! Sandybell', 1981, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Yuriko Yamamoto, Mami Koyama, Ai Sakuma, Kaneto Shiozawa, Yoshio Kaneuchi, Ichirô Murakoshi, Minori Matsushima, Kaku Suganuma', null, 'Hello! Sandybell is an anime series made by Toei Animation in 1981. It was aired in Japan by TV Asahi. In the original title when it is made in Japan, her name is the spelling to which "E" is attached to an end by "Sandybelle". Similarly to Silver Fang, the show is relatively unknown in the U.S. but was quite popular in Asia, Latin America, Arab countries and Europe, particularly Scandinavia.', 'Hello! Sandybell is an anime series made by Toei Animation in 1981. It was aired in Japan by TV Asahi. In the original title when it is made in Japan, her name is the spelling to which "E" is attached to an end by "Sandybelle". Similarly to Silver Fang, the show is relatively unknown in the U.S. but was quite popular in Asia, Latin America, Arab countries and Europe, particularly Scandinavia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y57X49iIctPzGbSq4Lpbx5FcYWj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9723'),
  ('374442482763683973', 'Hello! Spank', 1981, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Kei Tomiyama, Mari Okamoto, Noriko Tsukase', null, 'Morimura Aiko is a junior high school student who is short for her age. Her father went on a yacht ten years ago and his whereabouts remained in obscurity. Her mother, a designer for hats, left for Paris, leaving Aiko in the care of her uncle, Mr Fujinami. Aiko had a pet dog, Papi, but it died in a car accident. Around the same time, another dog, Spank, appears before her. Having gone through so many unfortunate events in her life, Spank''s presence begins to brighten up Aiko''s life and put a smile on her face.', 'Morimura Aiko is a junior high school student who is short for her age. Her father went on a yacht ten years ago and his whereabouts remained in obscurity. Her mother, a designer for hats, left for Paris, leaving Aiko in the care of her uncle, Mr Fujinami. Aiko had a pet dog, Papi, but it died in a car accident. Around the same time, another dog, Spank, appears before her. Having gone through so many unfortunate events in her life, Spank''s presence begins to brighten up Aiko''s life and put a smile on her face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6kCb4A4UUaVEzysdcjFoCa9ecm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45318'),
  ('1012289144324259199', 'Hellsing', 2001, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Jouji Nakata, Fumiko Orikasa, Yoshiko Sakakibara, Motomu Kiyokawa', 'TV-MA', 'Vampires exist. It is the duty of Hellsing, an organization sponsored by the British government, to hide that frightening fact and protect the blissfully unaware populace. Along with its own personal army, Hellsing also has a few secret weapons. Alucard, an incredibly powerful vampire, has been controlled by Hellsing for years. Although he dislikes being a servant to the Hellsing family, he certainly enjoys his job as Hellsing’s vampire exterminator. Seras is a fledgling vampire and a former police woman. Although reluctant to embrace her new self, she is still a valuable member of the organization. Integra Hellsing, the current leader, is usually fully capable of fulfilling her duty, but lately, vampire activity has been on the rise. Unfortunately, the cause is more alarming than anything she could have imagined...', 'Vampires exist. It is the duty of Hellsing, an organization sponsored by the British government, to hide that frightening fact and protect the blissfully unaware populace. Along with its own personal army, Hellsing also has a few secret weapons. Alucard, an incredibly powerful vampire, has been controlled by Hellsing for years. Although he dislikes being a servant to the Hellsing family, he certainly enjoys his job as Hellsing’s vampire exterminator. Seras is a fledgling vampire and a former police woman. Although reluctant to embrace her new self, she is still a valuable member of the organization. Integra Hellsing, the current leader, is usually fully capable of fulfilling her duty, but lately, vampire activity has been on the rise. Unfortunately, the cause is more alarming than anything she could have imagined...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xA3wsLJzj6XnvuryerPBPwoQodH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16830'),
  ('679196531911056560', 'Hellsing Ultimate', 2006, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Jouji Nakata, Fumiko Orikasa, Yoshiko Sakakibara, Nobuo Tobita', 'TV-MA', 'For over a century, the mysterious Hellsing Organization has been secretly protecting the British Empire from the undead. When Sir Integra Hellsing succeeded as the head of the organization, she also inherited the ultimate weapon against these supernatural enemies: Alucard, a rogue vampire possessing mysterious and frightening powers. Now, Hellsing must deal with a more dangerous threat than vampires.', 'For over a century, the mysterious Hellsing Organization has been secretly protecting the British Empire from the undead. When Sir Integra Hellsing succeeded as the head of the organization, she also inherited the ultimate weapon against these supernatural enemies: Alucard, a rogue vampire possessing mysterious and frightening powers. Now, Hellsing must deal with a more dangerous threat than vampires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fum0tvBuVVeofFoHI0IXHgrzKEa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61752'),
  ('218342900666401421', 'Hellsing: The Dawn', 2011, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Romi Park, Daisuke Namikawa, Hiroshi Naka, Jouji Nakata, Junichi Suwabe, Nobuo Tobita', null, 'Hellsing agents Alucard and young Walter, the resourceful Hellsing family butler, are sent to Nazi-occupied Europe in 1944 to stop the Nazis'' attempt to create a vampire army.', 'Hellsing agents Alucard and young Walter, the resourceful Hellsing family butler, are sent to Nazi-occupied Europe in 1944 to stop the Nazis'' attempt to create a vampire army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uaDTdKXV9PGyqcZMpmf6D8VtLO8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:115176'),
  ('1008200785145884574', 'Helluva Boss', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Vivienne Medrano', null, 'Brandon Rogers, Richard Steven Horvitz, Vivian Nixon, Erica Lindbeck, Bryce Pinkham', 'TV-MA', 'In Hell, imp Blitzø (the ''o'' is silent) runs an assassin business targeting the world of the living, using a spell book borrowed from a prince of the underworld. With employees Moxxie, Millie, and Loona, they attempt to survive each other while keeping business afloat.', 'In Hell, imp Blitzø (the ''o'' is silent) runs an assassin business targeting the world of the living, using a spell book borrowed from a prince of the underworld. With employees Moxxie, Millie, and Loona, they attempt to survive each other while keeping business afloat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fhM8qhAWaqtLj56UZIZrBAKNBoB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:289892'),
  ('763233671964477111', 'Help! I Bought It at Auction with Sarah Beeny', 2026, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, 'Sarah Beeny', null, 'Every year, thousands of properties are sold at auction, ranging from modest two-up, two-downs to multi-million-pound, waterfront mansions. But they often have some nasty surprises hidden beneath the floorboards and need a bit of love and affection to turn them into a dream home. Cue Sarah Beeny. She’s been buying, building and transforming properties for thirty-five years and she’s fascinated by the world of auctions. In this series she’ll be offering a dose of realism as brave new owners try and take their auction buys from derelict to diamond.', 'Every year, thousands of properties are sold at auction, ranging from modest two-up, two-downs to multi-million-pound, waterfront mansions. But they often have some nasty surprises hidden beneath the floorboards and need a bit of love and affection to turn them into a dream home. Cue Sarah Beeny. She’s been buying, building and transforming properties for thirty-five years and she’s fascinated by the world of auctions. In this series she’ll be offering a dose of realism as brave new owners try and take their auction buys from derelict to diamond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kvrVyMcfDGFEDcq7SVfpCCGxXqI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317209'),
  ('503546065109246763', 'Help!... It''s the Hair Bear Bunch!', 1971, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Animation', 'Ken Spears, Joe Ruby', null, 'John Stephenson, Joe E. Ross, Paul Winchell, Daws Butler, Joan Gerber, Lennie Weinrib, Vic Perrin, Hal Smith', null, 'The adventures of three fun-loving hippie bears, who always find a way to escape the Wonderland Zoo.', 'The adventures of three fun-loving hippie bears, who always find a way to escape the Wonderland Zoo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hA9sPll82j1gkGZp2SNZgOSuDJq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11136'),
  ('130356057928240602', 'Helsinki Syndrome', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Miikko Oikkonen', 'Miikko Oikkonen', 'Peter Franzén, Oona Airola, Taneli Mäkelä, Laura Malmivaara, Antti Luusuaniemi, Tuulia Eloranta, Marketta Tikkanen, Tuomas Nilsson', null, 'Family man Elias Karo takes four journalist hostage at their newspaper’s headquarters, in a desperate attempt to get them to reveal the wrongdoing wreaked on his family during the 90''s recession.', 'Family man Elias Karo takes four journalist hostage at their newspaper’s headquarters, in a desperate attempt to get them to reveal the wrongdoing wreaked on his family during the 90''s recession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5oV0Zc06Tw97uT2sc7IDI4MDOBQ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:118307'),
  ('865961949500056453', 'Helstrom', 2020, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Paul Zbyszewski', null, 'Tom Austen, Sydney Lemmon, Elizabeth Marvel, Robert Wisdom, June Carryl, Ariana Guerra, Alain Uy', 'TV-MA', 'Daimon and Ana Helstrom are the son and daughter of a mysterious and powerful serial killer. The siblings have a complicated dynamic as they track down the terrorizing worst of humanity — each with their attitude and skills.', 'Daimon and Ana Helstrom are the son and daughter of a mysterious and powerful serial killer. The siblings have a complicated dynamic as they track down the terrorizing worst of humanity — each with their attitude and skills.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5QmcKsepYpO9XYsWNLwsiULoaAu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88987'),
  ('732699642185726926', 'Helter Skelter: An American Myth', 2020, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Charles Manson', 'TV-MA', 'The untold story behind cult leader Charles Manson and his followers'' heinous crimes as told through interviews with former members, archival footage, and newly-unearthed images.', 'The untold story behind cult leader Charles Manson and his followers'' heinous crimes as told through interviews with former members, archival footage, and newly-unearthed images.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Fg6DyYNSFGekbDboZK9a2soLO3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105147'),
  ('783034997121760005', 'Helvetesuka', 2026, 'Reality', null, null, 'Olaf Tufte, Frank Løke, John Arne Riise, Emilie Voe Nereng, Anders Aukland, Charlotta Hedlund, Grunde Myhrer, Kai Robin Havnaa', null, 'In Helvetesuka, 13 high-profile Norwegian (ex)-athletes voluntarily put themselves through an extreme military simulation inspired by special forces selection.', 'In Helvetesuka, 13 high-profile Norwegian (ex)-athletes voluntarily put themselves through an extreme military simulation inspired by special forces selection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6PGjOCDd0yeaSzemexJY6CLFgb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:307502'),
  ('698163428641791606', 'Hem till Midgård', 2003, 'Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Per Simonsson, Stefan Roos, Fredde Granberg', 'Johan Petersson, Fredde Granberg, Stefan Roos', 'Fredde Granberg, Marko Lehtosalo, Sara Sommerfeld, Johan Petersson, Stefan Roos, Rolf Skoglund, Per Morberg, Gert Fylking', null, 'A Swedish show concerning the fates of some dorky Swedish Vikings. The show is mainly about a viking called Lill-Snorre and his friends, including Tyke Mörbult who has a below average IQ, to put it mildly. How will they survive? A small group of friends, in a small village called Midgård.', 'A Swedish show concerning the fates of some dorky Swedish Vikings. The show is mainly about a viking called Lill-Snorre and his friends, including Tyke Mörbult who has a below average IQ, to put it mildly. How will they survive? A small group of friends, in a small village called Midgård.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7qT0kd1U4ZAbPpweJQGyRYtEB3j.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:34071'),
  ('869988708444702022', 'Hemingway', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Peter Coyote, Jeff Daniels, Michael Kitakis, Edna O''Brien, Tobias Wolff, Mary Dearborn, Abraham Verghese, Mary Karr', 'TV-14', 'The visionary work and the turbulent life of Ernest Hemingway, one of the greatest and most influential writers America has ever produced. Interweaving his eventful biography with carefully selected excerpts from his iconic short stories, novels, and non-fiction, the series reveals the brilliant, ambitious, charismatic, and complicated man behind the myth, and the art he created.', 'The visionary work and the turbulent life of Ernest Hemingway, one of the greatest and most influential writers America has ever produced. Interweaving his eventful biography with carefully selected excerpts from his iconic short stories, novels, and non-fiction, the series reveals the brilliant, ambitious, charismatic, and complicated man behind the myth, and the art he created.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2eSfQxylM9EmgaRatBUOHsJXz5I.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:111592'),
  ('678407036345241768', 'Hemlock Grove', 2013, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Brian McGreevy', null, 'Landon Liboiron, Bill Skarsgård, Famke Janssen, Madeleine Martin, Camille De Pazzis', 'TV-MA', 'One cannot quench his all-consuming thirst. The other cannot tame the beast clawing its way out. In the sleepy Pennsylvania village of Hemlock Grove, two young men struggle to accept painful truths: about family, themselves, the mystery of the White Tower - and a terrifying new threat so powerful it will turn them from predators into prey.', 'One cannot quench his all-consuming thirst. The other cannot tame the beast clawing its way out. In the sleepy Pennsylvania village of Hemlock Grove, two young men struggle to accept painful truths: about family, themselves, the mystery of the White Tower - and a terrifying new threat so powerful it will turn them from predators into prey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sjGOYM7GTG03aWUZIFOUiFDTeoL.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:42295'),
  ('638300284180301066', 'Henry Danger', 2014, 'Comedy, Family, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Dan Schneider, Dana Olsen', null, 'Jace Norman, Cooper Barnes, Riele Downs, Sean Ryan Fox, Ella Anderson, Michael D. Cohen', 'TV-Y7', 'When 13-year-old Henry Hart lands a job as Danger, the sidekick-in-training to superhero Captain Man, he must learn to navigate a double life balancing the challenges of 8th grade with the crazy adventures of a real-life crime fighter!', 'When 13-year-old Henry Hart lands a job as Danger, the sidekick-in-training to superhero Captain Man, he must learn to navigate a double life balancing the challenges of 8th grade with the crazy adventures of a real-life crime fighter!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f3TEP5SROTpL6e520ohhSNbUv1E.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:61852'),
  ('1007315677791042072', 'Henry Hugglemonster', 2013, 'Kids, Animation, Family', null, null, null, 'TV-Y', 'Henry Hugglemonster is the story of a mischievous 5-year-old monster named Henry who loves adventures, discoveries, and being with his family. Each day brings new opportunities for Henry to explore his feelings and learn important life lessons about working with others, showing kindness, and getting along with siblings. Henry finds love and support from his parents, Daddo and Momma; and his brothers and sisters, Cobby , Summer, and Ivor.', 'Henry Hugglemonster is the story of a mischievous 5-year-old monster named Henry who loves adventures, discoveries, and being with his family. Each day brings new opportunities for Henry to explore his feelings and learn important life lessons about working with others, showing kindness, and getting along with siblings. Henry finds love and support from his parents, Daddo and Momma; and his brothers and sisters, Cobby , Summer, and Ivor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kX46kPCAXScko5SVYM7k1uDdgzu.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:57748'),
  ('825360507662228548', 'Henry VIII', 2003, 'Drama', null, null, 'Ray Winstone, Assumpta Serna, Helena Bonham Carter, Emilia Fox, Pia Girard, Charles Dance, Mark Strong, Danny Webb', null, 'The life of Henry VIII of England from the disintegration of his first marriage to an aging Spanish princess until his death following a stroke in 1547, by which time he had married for the sixth time.', 'The life of Henry VIII of England from the disintegration of his first marriage to an aging Spanish princess until his death following a stroke in 1547, by which time he had married for the sixth time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZ03GPW8Rei19bzV36JsYvMp1Zh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77961'),
  ('1014624682764369254', 'Hensuki: Are You Willing to Fall in Love With a Pervert, As Long As She''s a Cutie?', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy, Mystery', null, null, 'Hiro Shimono, Ayana Taketatsu, Rina Hidaka, Iori Nomizu, Kaede Hondo, Ayaka Ohashi, Anzu Haruno, Keisuke Komoto', 'TV-14', 'A high school student whose years of not having a girlfriend is his age, Keiki Kiryuu, suddenly receives a love letter. He is happy he can finally have a girlfriend, but is also surprised because not only is there no sender name but also included is white underwear…??? The cute girls who gather around him are all weird and with reasons!? Who is the Cinderella who sent the underwear?', 'A high school student whose years of not having a girlfriend is his age, Keiki Kiryuu, suddenly receives a love letter. He is happy he can finally have a girlfriend, but is also surprised because not only is there no sender name but also included is white underwear…??? The cute girls who gather around him are all weird and with reasons!? Who is the Cinderella who sent the underwear?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9pSKwAec9Z5cJQTBihg9BfbsDCe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88061'),
  ('551879319545626380', 'Heo''s Diner', 2025, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Xiumin, Exy, Lee Sae-on, Lee Soo-min, Oh Ji-ho, Woo Hyeon, Kim Hee-jung, Lin Da-jeon', null, 'The story follows a character from the Joseon Dynasty who travel 400 years into the future to the modern era and unwittingly open a restaurant, leading to a series of comedic and chaotic events.', 'The story follows a character from the Joseon Dynasty who travel 400 years into the future to the modern era and unwittingly open a restaurant, leading to a series of comedic and chaotic events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFTJOw6DnT2oNM78CsmF7vsmp9E.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:285872'),
  ('554980821915187174', 'Her Blaze', 2026, 'Drama', null, 'Li Xiwei', 'Ma Sichun, Ning Li, Yuan Shanshan, Zhai Zilu, Fan Tiantian, Zhang Tao', null, 'Three years ago, math prodigy Rao Yuci was framed by her best friend, Bai Liangliang, and sent to a treatment center. While Rao Yuci lost everything, Bai Liangliang climbed the corporate ladder. Now, fully recovered, Rao Yuci is determined to expose Bai Liangliang''s deceit and make her pay for the betrayal.', 'Three years ago, math prodigy Rao Yuci was framed by her best friend, Bai Liangliang, and sent to a treatment center. While Rao Yuci lost everything, Bai Liangliang climbed the corporate ladder. Now, fully recovered, Rao Yuci is determined to expose Bai Liangliang''s deceit and make her pay for the betrayal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6XnYAVzHUw5eMQFkJ7pz2nIEHGz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:282904'),
  ('249055850573312741', 'Her Majesty', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Borja Cobeaga, Diego San José', null, 'Anna Castillo, Ernesto Alterio, Pablo Vázquez, Pablo Derqui, Ramón Barea, Lucía Díez, Belén Ponce de León, Ana María Vidal', null, 'Spain, 2024. After a scandal involving Alfonso XVI damages the monarchy''s reputation, the king temporarily takes a backseat and his daughter and heir to the throne of Spain, the irresponsible Princess Pilar, takes over the monarchical institution to show that she is up to the task.', 'Spain, 2024. After a scandal involving Alfonso XVI damages the monarchy''s reputation, the king temporarily takes a backseat and his daughter and heir to the throne of Spain, the irresponsible Princess Pilar, takes over the monarchical institution to show that she is up to the task.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYz66iyll5q5yImMnzVkvUOxBho.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:246929'),
  ('708115951330193043', 'Her Mother''s Killer', 2020, 'Drama', 'Clara María Ochoa, Lucho Sierra, Camila Vega', null, 'Carolina Gómez, George Slebi, Marlon Moreno, Juan A. Baptista, Kristina Lilley, José Sospedra, Carlos Camacho, John Ceballos', 'TV-MA', 'Nearly 30 years after her mom''s murder, a political strategist launches a calculated plan to ruin the Colombian presidential candidate who killed her.', 'Nearly 30 years after her mom''s murder, a political strategist launches a calculated plan to ruin the Colombian presidential candidate who killed her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/imkU3fNak8NkXyCD0RJpAtP9jeK.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:102712'),
  ('301776916331723967', 'Her Own Destiny', 2004, 'Soap', 'Aguinaldo Silva', 'Glória Barreto, Aguinaldo Silva, Maria Elisa Berredo', 'Susana Vieira, Renata Sorrah, José Wilker, José Mayer, Carolina Dieckmmann, Eduardo Moscovis, Leticia Spiller, Leandra Leal', 'NR', 'A story about people who succeed in life thanks to nothing but their own efforts. Maria do Carmo is the main character of the telenovela; a mother of five who struggle to be successful in life, but whose most important will be recovering the love of her daughter who was kidnapped when she was just months old.', 'A story about people who succeed in life thanks to nothing but their own efforts. Maria do Carmo is the main character of the telenovela; a mother of five who struggle to be successful in life, but whose most important will be recovering the love of her daughter who was kidnapped when she was just months old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iq3foxxYyd271ZFvXXFYFOLqXYo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46101'),
  ('301702754815625953', 'Her Private Life', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kim Hye-young, hong jong-chan', 'Kim Hye-young', 'Park Min-young, Kim Jae-uck, Ahn Bo-hyun, Jung Jae-won, Kim Bo-ra, Park Jin-joo, Kim Mi-kyeong, Maeng Sang-hun', null, 'An art curator''s life unravels, as she tries to keep her pastime as a die-hard K-pop fan secret from her gallery''s new director.', 'An art curator''s life unravels, as she tries to keep her pastime as a die-hard K-pop fan secret from her gallery''s new director.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nr4BB5JoTyxrtaNVMECinuMzTMA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87553'),
  ('730562891107375766', 'Her Story', 2016, 'Drama', null, 'Jen Richards, Laura Zak', 'Angelica Ross, Jen Richards, Laura Zak', null, 'Her Story is about two trans women in Los Angeles who have given up on love, when suddenly chance encounters give them hope. Violet is drawn to Allie, a reporter who approaches her for an interview, while career-driven Paige meets James, the first man she’s considered opening up to in years. Will they risk letting what they are stand in the way of being loved for who they are? Trans women in the media have long been punchlines, killers, indications of urban grit, pathetic tragedies, and dangerous sirens. Rarely have they been complex characters who laugh, struggle, and grow, who share strength in sisterhood, who seek and find love. Her Story depicts the unique, complicated, and very human women we see in queer communities, and explores how these women navigate the intersections of label identity and love.', 'Her Story is about two trans women in Los Angeles who have given up on love, when suddenly chance encounters give them hope. Violet is drawn to Allie, a reporter who approaches her for an interview, while career-driven Paige meets James, the first man she’s considered opening up to in years. Will they risk letting what they are stand in the way of being loved for who they are? Trans women in the media have long been punchlines, killers, indications of urban grit, pathetic tragedies, and dangerous sirens. Rarely have they been complex characters who laugh, struggle, and grow, who share strength in sisterhood, who seek and find love. Her Story depicts the unique, complicated, and very human women we see in queer communities, and explores how these women navigate the intersections of label identity and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45TX9caon7L05h0mfTaKVbBPmHH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67282'),
  ('1126657213773517704', 'Hercai', 2019, 'Drama', 'Banu Akdeniz, Sümeyye Ezel, Cem Karcı', null, 'Ebru Şahin, Akin Akinözü, Ayda Aksel, Macit Sonkan, Gülçin Santırcıoğlu, Serhat Tutumluer, Oya Unustası, Ahmet Tansu Taşanlar', 'NR', 'Miran is seeking revenge for his parents death so he plans to marry daughter Reyyan from the family who were responsible for that. Unexpectedly he falls in love with Reyyan. Will this change the plan?', 'Miran is seeking revenge for his parents death so he plans to marry daughter Reyyan from the family who were responsible for that. Unexpectedly he falls in love with Reyyan. Will this change the plan?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6VGJ281Lk2gbrTqZlegKqevzG7D.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:87623'),
  ('549050219742885518', 'Hercules', 1998, 'Comedy, Kids, Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Tate Donovan, French Stewart, Sandra Bernhard, James Woods, Robert Costanzo, Robert Stack, Diedrich Bader, Matt Frewer', 'TV-Y', 'Follow Herc''s many labors during the years he spent training on how to be a hero under the tutelage of satyr Phil. Many of the Olympian Gods and Goddesses pay visit to the young hero-to-be and help or hinder him in his new adventures.', 'Follow Herc''s many labors during the years he spent training on how to be a hero under the tutelage of satyr Phil. Many of the Olympian Gods and Goddesses pay visit to the young hero-to-be and help or hinder him in his new adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/beKLNtsDRR6EmNCKp7KOTdztL4j.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2567'),
