  ('725319364767142103', 'Hero Corp', 2008, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Simon Astier, Sébastien Lalanne', null, 'François Podetti, Étienne Fague, Aurore Pourteyron, Sébastien Lalanne, Arnaud Joyet, Simon Astier, Philippe Noël, Alban Lenoir', null, 'Hero Corp is a French comedic science fiction TV show that has aired 92 episodes over 5 seasons, beginning in October 2008 on the cable channel Comédie!. In July 2009 it began broadcasting on France 4. The show was created by and stars Simon Astier, previously seen in the Kaamelott TV show.', 'Hero Corp is a French comedic science fiction TV show that has aired 92 episodes over 5 seasons, beginning in October 2008 on the cable channel Comédie!. In July 2009 it began broadcasting on France 4. The show was created by and stars Simon Astier, previously seen in the Kaamelott TV show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kntWwFhs7m4ldDI2pI5IAb1d1PO.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:21766'),
