  ('800952451625726977', 'Hi Bye, Mama!', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Drama', null, 'Kwon Hye-ju', 'Kim Tae-hee, Lee Kyoo-hyung, Go Bo-gyeol, Shin Dong-mi, Seo Woo-jin, Lee Si-woo, Oh Eui-sik, Ahn Nae-sang', null, 'Cha Yu-ri died in an accident five years ago, leaving her husband Cho Gang-hwa to raise their daughter by himself. She becomes a ghost and watches over them until one fateful day she is brought back to life by the deities and told she can become human again if she returns to her place in 49 days. Though her husband has remarried, so she must decide between her or his happiness as she slowly re-integrates back into her old lifestyle.', 'Cha Yu-ri died in an accident five years ago, leaving her husband Cho Gang-hwa to raise their daughter by himself. She becomes a ghost and watches over them until one fateful day she is brought back to life by the deities and told she can become human again if she returns to her place in 49 days. Though her husband has remarried, so she must decide between her or his happiness as she slowly re-integrates back into her old lifestyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mc5nLj2EM480d6tlxKsj2GRfsDC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97219'),
  ('1013467119408480156', 'Hi Hi Puffy AmiYumi', 2004, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Sam Register', null, 'Janice Kawaye, Grey DeLisle, Keone Young, Ami Onuki, Yumi Yoshimura', 'TV-Y7', 'Hi Hi Puffy AmiYumi follows the adventures of two very cool, but very different pop stars as they travel from gig to gig or just hang out in their tour bus. Being famous rock stars, Ami and Yumi tour the globe in their customized Puffy bus, a veritable condo on wheels with all the major amenities and an ever-changing interior. Ami is the peppy, positive, and resourceful one. Yumi is the hard-rocking, no-nonsense cynic with an absolutely infallible sense of cool. Together, these superstars take the world by storm with musical talent, trend-setting style and humor, despite occasional misjudgments from their well-meaning but tragically square manager, Kaz.', 'Hi Hi Puffy AmiYumi follows the adventures of two very cool, but very different pop stars as they travel from gig to gig or just hang out in their tour bus. Being famous rock stars, Ami and Yumi tour the globe in their customized Puffy bus, a veritable condo on wheels with all the major amenities and an ever-changing interior. Ami is the peppy, positive, and resourceful one. Yumi is the hard-rocking, no-nonsense cynic with an absolutely infallible sense of cool. Together, these superstars take the world by storm with musical talent, trend-setting style and humor, despite occasional misjudgments from their well-meaning but tragically square manager, Kaz.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVlsQzfxewEdHpu7SiVUpRAVNyU.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:255'),
  ('86063647333482530', 'Hi Score Girl', 2018, 'Comedy, Animation', null, null, 'Sayumi Suzushiro, Daiki Yamashita, Satomi Arai, Cho, Chinatsu Akasaki, Hochu Otsuka, Yuuki Hirose, Kohei Amasaki', 'TV-PG', 'The year is 1991 and 6th grader Yaguchi Haruo only has video games to live for. He''s not popular in school and he''s neither handsome, funny, nice nor even friendly. The only thing he has going for him is that he is good at video games. One day at the local arcade, he plays Oono Akira, a fellow classmate but who''s popular, smart, pretty and a rich girl that absolutely destroys him at Street Fighter II. Not only does he lose to her 30 times in a row, he can’t beat her at any game. Haruo can’t seem to shake Akira off as she follows him from arcade to arcade everyday after school and beats him every time. As weird as it sounds, the odd couple begins a strange bond and friendship.', 'The year is 1991 and 6th grader Yaguchi Haruo only has video games to live for. He''s not popular in school and he''s neither handsome, funny, nice nor even friendly. The only thing he has going for him is that he is good at video games. One day at the local arcade, he plays Oono Akira, a fellow classmate but who''s popular, smart, pretty and a rich girl that absolutely destroys him at Street Fighter II. Not only does he lose to her 30 times in a row, he can’t beat her at any game. Haruo can’t seem to shake Akira off as she follows him from arcade to arcade everyday after school and beats him every time. As weird as it sounds, the odd couple begins a strange bond and friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oGHR5DXFHIWc9xGwvTmxo2dHwr2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:80665'),
  ('1016188401186147971', 'Hi Venus', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Wang Xiongcheng', null, 'Joseph Zeng, Liang Jie, Zhou Zihan, Li Linfei, Si Yutong, Gao Kai, Zhou Pu, Jiang Feng', null, 'Ye Shilan, a pediatrician at Taoyuan Village Clinic, starts off on the wrong foot with the new director Lu Zhaoxi due to a misunderstanding. By chance, she becomes his assistant. In solving many problems around running the place and patient treatment, the two fall in love. As they grow together, they come to have a deeper understanding for the mission of doctors to save lives and heal the wounded.', 'Ye Shilan, a pediatrician at Taoyuan Village Clinic, starts off on the wrong foot with the new director Lu Zhaoxi due to a misunderstanding. By chance, she becomes his assistant. In solving many problems around running the place and patient treatment, the two fall in love. As they grow together, they come to have a deeper understanding for the mission of doctors to save lives and heal the wounded.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kU3HwhFCKgCDOD505R9zNvU4vc8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:216405'),
  ('239469935497945978', 'Hi-de-Hi!', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Jimmy Perry, David Croft', null, 'Ruth Madoc, Paul Shane, Su Pollard, Jeffrey Holland, Felix Bowness, Nikki Kelly, Diane Holland, David Griffin', null, 'Hi-de-Hi! is a British sitcom set in Maplins, a fictional holiday camp, during 1959 and 1960, and was written by Jimmy Perry and David Croft, who also wrote Dad''s Army and It Ain''t Half Hot Mum amongst others. It aired on the BBC from 1980 to 1988. The series revolved around the lives of the camp''s management and entertainers, most of them struggling actors or has-beens. The inspiration was the experience of writers Perry and Croft: after being demobilised from the army, Perry was a Redcoat at Butlin''s, Pwllheli during the holiday season. The series gained large audiences and won a BAFTA as Best Comedy Series in 1984. In 2004, it came 40th in Britain''s Best Sitcom and in a 2008 poll on Channel 4, ''Hi-de-Hi!" was voted the 35th most popular comedy catchphrase.', 'Hi-de-Hi! is a British sitcom set in Maplins, a fictional holiday camp, during 1959 and 1960, and was written by Jimmy Perry and David Croft, who also wrote Dad''s Army and It Ain''t Half Hot Mum amongst others. It aired on the BBC from 1980 to 1988. The series revolved around the lives of the camp''s management and entertainers, most of them struggling actors or has-beens. The inspiration was the experience of writers Perry and Croft: after being demobilised from the army, Perry was a Redcoat at Butlin''s, Pwllheli during the holiday season. The series gained large audiences and won a BAFTA as Best Comedy Series in 1984. In 2004, it came 40th in Britain''s Best Sitcom and in a 2008 poll on Channel 4, ''Hi-de-Hi!" was voted the 35th most popular comedy catchphrase.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aXzCWbwDBCMnKcDvoI0JJ8Qf0L6.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:2695'),
  ('368273168308279340', 'Hi! School - Love On', 2014, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Kim Sae-ron, Nam Woo-hyun, Lee Sung-yeol, Kim Min-seok, Baek Seung-Heon, Han Soo-yeon, Jo Yeon-woo, Kim Kwang-shik', null, 'High school may be tough, but Woo Hyun has a guardian angel looking over him — literally. Disguised as a naive high schooler, Lee Seul Bi descends from the heavens to protect Woo Hyun''s life, but discovers she''s got a thing or two to learn about life as a teenager, including the pains of falling in love. Can this cherubic guardian protect the apple of her eye and also manage to survive high school?', 'High school may be tough, but Woo Hyun has a guardian angel looking over him — literally. Disguised as a naive high schooler, Lee Seul Bi descends from the heavens to protect Woo Hyun''s life, but discovers she''s got a thing or two to learn about life as a teenager, including the pains of falling in love. Can this cherubic guardian protect the apple of her eye and also manage to survive high school?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9XUMRNRxK89fWZ4DMtpdlJwKeNP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61738'),
  ('2747834512811930', 'Hibana: Spark', 2016, 'Drama', 'Shuichi Okita, Kazuya Shiraishi, Yasunori Mouri', null, 'Kento Hayashi, Kazuki Namioka, Masao Yoshii, Mugi Kadowaki, Shota Sometani, Nahana, Maryjun Takahashi, Eri Tokunaga', 'TV-MA', 'Tokunaga, a comedian who is down on his luck, has a shock encounter with Kamiya, an older comedian when he visits a fireworks event in Atami on a job. Tokunaga is deeply touched by Kamiya and asks if he can become his apprentice. Kamiya is a genius type of comedian who is full of human kindness. He accepts Tokunaga’s proposition on the condition that he will write his biography.', 'Tokunaga, a comedian who is down on his luck, has a shock encounter with Kamiya, an older comedian when he visits a fireworks event in Atami on a job. Tokunaga is deeply touched by Kamiya and asks if he can become his apprentice. Kamiya is a genius type of comedian who is full of human kindness. He accepts Tokunaga’s proposition on the condition that he will write his biography.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tO8DN0VK82Zu5DS8drllzJlZOQK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66660'),
  ('688199933539184133', 'Hidamari Sketch', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Kana Asumi, Yuko Goto, Kaori Mizuhashi, Ryoko Shintani, Ume Aoki, Miyu Matsuki, Misato Fukuen, Rie Kugimiya', 'TV-PG', 'For years, Yuno has dreamed of attending Yamabuki Arts High School, but now that she''s been accepted, it means the scary prospect of moving away from her home and family for the first time! Fortunately, Yuno quickly learns that if her new neighbors at the eclectic Hidamari (Sunshine) Apartments aren''t technically family, at least the majority share the bond of being fellow art students. From second year students like Hiro and Sae, who try to behave like helpful older sisters (mostly successfully) to her hyperactive new neighbor, classmate and best friend Miyako (who has the scariest apartment ever) Yuno begins to build the support network she''ll need for dealing with strange characters like her oddly masculine landlady, her cosplay obsessed home room teacher, her tooth-chattering principal and all of the other odd denizens who inhabit her chosen world of art.', 'For years, Yuno has dreamed of attending Yamabuki Arts High School, but now that she''s been accepted, it means the scary prospect of moving away from her home and family for the first time! Fortunately, Yuno quickly learns that if her new neighbors at the eclectic Hidamari (Sunshine) Apartments aren''t technically family, at least the majority share the bond of being fellow art students. From second year students like Hiro and Sae, who try to behave like helpful older sisters (mostly successfully) to her hyperactive new neighbor, classmate and best friend Miyako (who has the scariest apartment ever) Yuno begins to build the support network she''ll need for dealing with strange characters like her oddly masculine landlady, her cosplay obsessed home room teacher, her tooth-chattering principal and all of the other odd denizens who inhabit her chosen world of art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5WcsCnVyJ9TFemUxNTJaD6SxW4D.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:45893'),
  ('681096552120627656', 'Hidden', 2011, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ronan Bennett, Walter Bernstein', 'Ronan Bennett', 'Philip Glenister, Thekla Reuten, David Suchet, Anna Chancellor, Matthew Marsh, Bertie Carvel, Peter Guinness, Mark Flitton', null, 'When lawyer Gina Hawkes hires Harry to find a witness, he unexpectedly revisits his brother''s decades-old death, embroiling him in a political conspiracy at the highest levels of British government.', 'When lawyer Gina Hawkes hires Harry to find a witness, he unexpectedly revisits his brother''s decades-old death, embroiling him in a political conspiracy at the highest levels of British government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8BIIQ0DzyoYXGW3IuZbnXYtV3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:41481'),
  ('983303921231173746', 'Hidden', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Ed Talfan, Mark Andrew', null, 'Sian Reese-Williams, Sion Alun Davies, Victoria Pugh', null, 'DI Cadi John and DC Owen Vaughan try to solve a case involving Mali Pryce, a young woman whose body was discovered in a stream in the woods.', 'DI Cadi John and DC Owen Vaughan try to solve a case involving Mali Pryce, a young woman whose body was discovered in a stream in the woods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yXvjqGMlQuJ5sQEPIsWEeA0n1ql.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:76566'),
  ('1030056255415127480', 'Hidden Agenda', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Dezair', null, 'Natachai Boonprasert, Archen Aydin, Thanaboon Kiatniran, Tharatorn Jantharaworakarn, Chayapol Jutamas, Thanawin Teeraphosukarn, Suphakorn Sriphotong, Juthapich Indrajundra', null, 'University student Zo finally decides to pursue his longtime crush, Nita. To win her over, he seeks help from her ex, Joke, who has his own secret motives.', 'University student Zo finally decides to pursue his longtime crush, Nita. To win her over, he seeks help from her ex, Joke, who has his own secret motives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30ZApQjC28XNAGGiqgHvFp4PyUT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217804'),
  ('705655884580294440', 'Hidden Assets', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', 'Thaddeus O''Sullivan, Kadir Bolki', null, 'Simone Kirby, Wouter Hendrickx, Cathy Belton, Aaron Monaghan, Charlie Carrick, Gilles De Schryver, Kwaku Fortune, Jane Brennan', null, 'A routine raid led by Emer Berry, a detective in the Irish Criminal Assets Bureau, reveals that a small-time drug dealer has been receiving substantial funding from a seemingly untraceable source – not in cash, but in rough diamonds. When these diamonds are linked to a series of bombings in Belgium, Emer is forced to work with Police Commissioner Christian De Jong.', 'A routine raid led by Emer Berry, a detective in the Irish Criminal Assets Bureau, reveals that a small-time drug dealer has been receiving substantial funding from a seemingly untraceable source – not in cash, but in rough diamonds. When these diamonds are linked to a series of bombings in Belgium, Emer is forced to work with Police Commissioner Christian De Jong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p3NIjKPD8sJiy3Q7zQJchobrpYX.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:138108'),
  ('588838597376784399', 'Hidden Kingdoms', 2014, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Stephen Fry', 'TV-PG', 'Immerse yourself in the lives of extraordinary characters that stand a few inches tall. From chipmunks to mice, be entertained and spellbound by the creatures that call the Hidden Kingdoms home.', 'Immerse yourself in the lives of extraordinary characters that stand a few inches tall. From chipmunks to mice, be entertained and spellbound by the creatures that call the Hidden Kingdoms home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wv66suBOcfJabjLqriiJxIStEF6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64664'),
  ('654678155396517647', 'Hidden Love', 2023, 'Drama', 'Zhu Yi', null, 'Zhao Lusi, Chen Zheyuan, Victor Ma, Zeng Li, Qiu Xinzhi, Guan Zijing, Wang Yang, Zhang Haolun', null, 'Since high school, Sang Zhi has had a crush on Duan Jiaxu. When fate brings them together again, they find a chance to embark on a sweet relationship.', 'Since high school, Sang Zhi has had a crush on Duan Jiaxu. When fate brings them together again, they find a chance to embark on a sweet relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/riGzESa9N9toumP9OhMmg0QvFPD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210733'),
  ('170414411304330789', 'Hidden Palms', 2007, 'Drama', 'Kevin Williamson', null, 'Michael Cassidy, Taylor Handley, Amber Heard, Sharon Lawrence, D.W. Moffett, Gail O''Grady, Ellary Porterfield, Tessa Thompson', 'TV-14', 'Johnny Miller was a typical 15-year-old until his father committed suicide. Now Johnny lives in Palm Springs with his mother and her new husband. On the outside, Palm Springs is a paradise - but as Johnny learns the secrets that lie just beneath the surface of this seemingly typical neighborhood, he and his family wonder how well they really know the people who live right next door.', 'Johnny Miller was a typical 15-year-old until his father committed suicide. Now Johnny lives in Palm Springs with his mother and her new husband. On the outside, Palm Springs is a paradise - but as Johnny learns the secrets that lie just beneath the surface of this seemingly typical neighborhood, he and his family wonder how well they really know the people who live right next door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ShEWZ8yaePvHknK9iPbzBUyyzx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5225'),
  ('538541639726990414', 'Hidden Singer', 2012, 'Reality', '조승욱', null, 'Jeon Hyun-moo', null, 'Pop stars and impersonators face off to be the last one standing as the audience tries to determine the real singer by listening to their voices only.', 'Pop stars and impersonators face off to be the last one standing as the audience tries to determine the real singer by listening to their voices only.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUvwI7ejeVVJMJPcc4kjpWZjoLI.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:72993'),
  ('714448324186835400', 'Hidden Truths', 2015, 'Soap, Drama', 'Walcyr Carrasco', 'Bruno Lima Penido, Walcyr Carrasco, Maria Elisa Berredo', 'Camila Queiroz, Rodrigo Lombardi, Drica Moraes, Marieta Severo, Reynaldo Gianecchini, Ana Lúcia Torre, Agatha Moreira, Gabriel Leone', null, 'A teenager who dreams with a career as a top model becomes part of a prostitution scheme and meets a powerful and obsessive businessman. As a last resort, he marries the girl''s mother just to be near her. This series explores the limits of obsession, wealth and pleasure, using the fashion world as backdrop.', 'A teenager who dreams with a career as a top model becomes part of a prostitution scheme and meets a powerful and obsessive businessman. As a last resort, he marries the girl''s mother just to be near her. This series explores the limits of obsession, wealth and pleasure, using the fashion world as backdrop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rw1bnxgPhfzg9EvBlgbtjLkWBzy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62917'),
  ('724877048409766492', 'Hidden Truths 2', 2021, 'Soap, Drama', 'Walcyr Carrasco', 'Walcyr Carrasco, Nelson Nadotti, Vinícius Vianna', 'Camila Queiroz, Agatha Moreira, Romulo Estrela, Gabriel Braga Nunes, Maria de Medeiros, Sérgio Guizé, Rainer Cadete, Deborah Evelyn', null, 'With no money and a sick young son, Angel returns to the underworld of fashion and luxury. Giovanna believes that Angel killed her father and will do anything to put her in jail. As a result, they start a personal war, which involves Cristiano, a private investigator.', 'With no money and a sick young son, Angel returns to the underworld of fashion and luxury. Giovanna believes that Angel killed her father and will do anything to put her in jail. As a result, they start a personal war, which involves Cristiano, a private investigator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/59qR62h1gkXNZv1zKLkWzk5SO2j.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:136295'),
  ('1085858039440702501', 'Hidden Worlds', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'Ramy Imam', 'Mahmoud Hemdan, Amin Gamal, Mohamed Mehriz', 'Adel Emam, Salah Abdallah, Fathy Abdel Wahab, Bushra, Rania Farid Shawqi, Heba Magdi, Ahmad Wafiq, Tarek Sabri', null, 'When a prominent writer finds confidential documents incriminating government officials, he decided to publish them, risking his own life and his family''s.', 'When a prominent writer finds confidential documents incriminating government officials, he decided to publish them, risking his own life and his family''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tzpdhmCIxrK16fkkCEU8ZDPGW64.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79640'),
  ('571993883305018211', 'Hidden: First Born', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jonathan Sjöberg', 'Bjørn Paqualin, Jonathan Sjöberg', 'August Wittgenstein, Izabella Scorupco, Anders Mossling, Josefin Ljungman, Eric Ericson, Gizem Erdogan, Filip Alexandersson', null, 'Jonas''s life is turned upside down after a difficult accident. He begins to explore his true self, unaware that someone, or something, is looking for him. Slowly he is drawn into a tangle of mystery and ritual murder against the captivating backdrop of modern day Stockholm.', 'Jonas''s life is turned upside down after a difficult accident. He begins to explore his true self, unaware that someone, or something, is looking for him. Slowly he is drawn into a tangle of mystery and ritual murder against the captivating backdrop of modern day Stockholm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gfp2vgwy1zCt33LXt8i5jRRUPYJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86470'),
  ('364975909020968190', 'Hide and Seek', 2018, 'Drama', null, 'Seol Kyung-Eun', 'Lee Yu-ri, Song Chang-eui, Uhm Hyun-kyung, Kim Young-min, Jo Mi-ryung, Jeong Hye-seon, Lee Jong-won, Son Ji-na', null, 'A secret exits surrounding two women. One woman is the successor to a cosmetics company and the other woman lives her life for the female succors.', 'A secret exits surrounding two women. One woman is the successor to a cosmetics company and the other woman lives her life for the female succors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9gtm0gCYlysKhax6z5tz4nx3y4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81745'),
