  ('756190666514643744', 'Hideyoshi', 1996, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Naoto Takenaka, Yasuko Sawaguchi, Tetsuya Watari, Masanobu Takashima, Etsuko Ichihara, Tohru Watanabe, Hiroaki Murakami, Hidekazu Akai', 'TV-G', 'A dramatized biography of the second of Japan''s three legendary leaders. Rising from obscurity, Hideyoshi served under the command of Oda Nobunaga. With an extraordinary combination of intelligence, bravery and military skill, Hideyoshi rose to near-absolute power and greatly expanded upon Nobunaga''s unification of Japan''s warlords. This series also focused on Hideyoshi''s personal life, particularly his relationships with his mother and his wife, and the pair''s rivalry for influence over him.', 'A dramatized biography of the second of Japan''s three legendary leaders. Rising from obscurity, Hideyoshi served under the command of Oda Nobunaga. With an extraordinary combination of intelligence, bravery and military skill, Hideyoshi rose to near-absolute power and greatly expanded upon Nobunaga''s unification of Japan''s warlords. This series also focused on Hideyoshi''s personal life, particularly his relationships with his mother and his wife, and the pair''s rivalry for influence over him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1uifOXTQqMUwZepg4C67voHI3Qq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95495'),
  ('133478697685262877', 'Hier Sit Die Manne', 2023, 'Talk', null, null, 'Frank Rautenbach', null, 'In this talk show, the actor Frank Rautenbach invites guests to talk about things that interest and inspire him. From cars, fishing, hunting, investments, travel and rugby - everything that is close to the men''s hearts.', 'In this talk show, the actor Frank Rautenbach invites guests to talk about things that interest and inspire him. From cars, fishing, hunting, investments, travel and rugby - everything that is close to the men''s hearts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ArOUMpp5m8SILXyLm2v46PRqj6m.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:271134'),
  ('279365917860975327', 'Hierarchy', 2024, 'Drama', 'Choo Hye-mi, Bae Hyun-jin', 'Choo Hye-mi', 'Roh Jeong-eui, Lee Chae-min, Kim Jae-won, Ji Hye-won, Lee Won-jeong, Kwon Eun-bin, Choi Won-young, Bae Hae-seon', null, 'The top 0.01% of students control law and order at Jooshin High School, but a secretive transfer student chips a crack in their indomitable world.', 'The top 0.01% of students control law and order at Jooshin High School, but a secretive transfer student chips a crack in their indomitable world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/szr7QFNnuspcyhW0rsoDMDN73pP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:226527'),
  ('773551650503011770', 'Hierro', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Pepe Coira', null, 'Candela Peña, Darío Grandinetti, Matias Varela', 'NR', 'In El Hierro, the most remote island of the Canary Archipelago, a murder has occurred. Candela, an experienced judge with a strong character, must instruct the case as she takes up her position in a destination where she doesn''t fit in. The island, an abrupt and changing landscape, is the home of a small community with singular traditions, where nobody enters or leaves unnoticed and where secrets are hard to keep. The murderer is surely one of the islanders. Everybody believes it is Diaz, a shady local businessman, who seems to fit the bill. But nothing is that easy, neither with Candela, nor with Diaz. They are both out to find the murderer. She is out to do her job to the best of her ability; he is out to prove his innocence.', 'In El Hierro, the most remote island of the Canary Archipelago, a murder has occurred. Candela, an experienced judge with a strong character, must instruct the case as she takes up her position in a destination where she doesn''t fit in. The island, an abrupt and changing landscape, is the home of a small community with singular traditions, where nobody enters or leaves unnoticed and where secrets are hard to keep. The murderer is surely one of the islanders. Everybody believes it is Diaz, a shady local businessman, who seems to fit the bill. But nothing is that easy, neither with Candela, nor with Diaz. They are both out to find the murderer. She is out to do her job to the best of her ability; he is out to prove his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mPCtR4myjwWtrlEoKDn3eOZ2yDf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:89586'),
  ('1056221643674328317', 'Higehiro: After Being Rejected, I Shaved and Took in a High School Runaway', 2021, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Kazuyuki Okitsu, Kana Ichinose, Hisako Kanemoto, Kaori Ishihara, Yusuke Kobayashi, Natsumi Kawaida', 'TV-14', 'On his way home from drinking his sorrows away after being rejected by his crush, 26 year old salaryman Yoshida finds a high school girl named Sayu sitting on the side of the road and ends up letting her stay at his place overnight. Not having the heart to put the runaway out on the streets, Yoshida allows her to stay at his place... And so began the awkward, irritable, and slightly heartwarming relationship between a runaway high school girl and a salaryman living together.', 'On his way home from drinking his sorrows away after being rejected by his crush, 26 year old salaryman Yoshida finds a high school girl named Sayu sitting on the side of the road and ends up letting her stay at his place overnight. Not having the heart to put the runaway out on the streets, Yoshida allows her to stay at his place... And so began the awkward, irritable, and slightly heartwarming relationship between a runaway high school girl and a salaryman living together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5k20SVsi0sAMZI9p9g1HaUUHgeA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106519'),
  ('1141133306952678774', 'Higglytown Heroes', 2004, 'Kids, Family', 'Kent Redeker', null, 'Frankie Ryan Manríquez, Liliana Mumy, Rory Thost, Edie McClurg, Jim Wise, Dee Bradley Baker, Taylor Masamitsu', 'TV-Y', 'In the colorful world of Higglytown, four kids and their squirrelly friend learn about the heroes that inhabit their city, from mail carriers and bus drivers to police officers and firefighters.', 'In the colorful world of Higglytown, four kids and their squirrelly friend learn about the heroes that inhabit their city, from mail carriers and bus drivers to police officers and firefighters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l33m47jc4oFmcHhHsNicTR6TBec.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:552'),
  ('105410063526804504', 'High (School) On Sex', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Angelica Hart, Apple Dy, Clifford Pusing, Van Allen Ong, Audrey Avila, Jamilla Obispo, Cess Garcia, Aila Cruz', 'TV-MA', 'Wilbert Ross and Denise Esteban. Vivamax brings lots of laughs and loads of sexy time in its new series, “High (School) on Sex”, pronounced as High On Sex,', 'Wilbert Ross and Denise Esteban. Vivamax brings lots of laughs and loads of sexy time in its new series, “High (School) on Sex”, pronounced as High On Sex,', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBOQVr2XfNKjUnB7O4tOM3olomr.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:203906'),
  ('542543465895278929', 'HIGH CARD', 2023, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Miyuki Sawashiro', 'TV-14', 'Fourland Kingdom is an island nation in the North Atlantic. In this country, there are 52 X-Playing Cards, considered the origin of playing cards. A card with a unique supernatural ability can gift its abilities to a qualified person: the player. One day, the X-Playing Cards in government''s custody were spread all over Fourland leading to troubles caused by the supernatural abilities of the players with cards across the country. The king secretly assigns Pinochle, one of the top corporations of the nation, to a mission, to collect the cards that are causing all the chaos in the country.', 'Fourland Kingdom is an island nation in the North Atlantic. In this country, there are 52 X-Playing Cards, considered the origin of playing cards. A card with a unique supernatural ability can gift its abilities to a qualified person: the player. One day, the X-Playing Cards in government''s custody were spread all over Fourland leading to troubles caused by the supernatural abilities of the players with cards across the country. The king secretly assigns Pinochle, one of the top corporations of the nation, to a mission, to collect the cards that are causing all the chaos in the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGyV4sV4P0y4NXuguucNOo3eolp.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:194665'),
  ('807949139504705788', 'High Class', 2021, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Cho Yeo-jeong, Kim Ji-soo, Ha Jun, Park Se-jin, Kong Hyun-joo, Kim Nam-hee, Woo Hyun-ju, Lee Ka-eun', null, 'Song Yeo-wool, a widow who has been falsely accused of her husband’s murder, goes on a dangerous path to discover the truth about her husband’s death, while facing great judgement from the society. With this charge and allegation on her, she gets near about losing everything and becomes devastated. Meanwhile, the parents of students of international school where Yeo-wool’s son studies, starts to spread rumors about Yeo-wool.', 'Song Yeo-wool, a widow who has been falsely accused of her husband’s murder, goes on a dangerous path to discover the truth about her husband’s death, while facing great judgement from the society. With this charge and allegation on her, she gets near about losing everything and becomes devastated. Meanwhile, the parents of students of international school where Yeo-wool’s son studies, starts to spread rumors about Yeo-wool.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y12jFvgntlxyit2KMd94LmCQO1d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130655'),
  ('660149886656977868', 'High Cookie', 2023, 'Drama, Crime, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Song Min-yeop', 'Kang Han', 'Nam Ji-hyun, Jung Da-bin, Choi Hyun-wook, Kim Moo-yul, Seo Bum-june, Chae Seo-eun, Song Si-an, Kim Jung', null, 'With just one bite, a mysterious homemade cookie turns dreams into reality, but it takes over the elite high school, and deadly consequences await.', 'With just one bite, a mysterious homemade cookie turns dreams into reality, but it takes over the elite high school, and deadly consequences await.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/maXlHKlAkXc7PoYHvfE035sBUMQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223489'),
  ('373894259731142531', 'High Country', 2024, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Marcia Gardner, John Ridley', null, 'Leah Purcell, Henry Nixon, Sara Wiseman, Aaron Pedersen, Ian McElhinney, Luke McKenzie, Matt Domingo, Geoff Morrell', null, 'When detective Andrea ''Andie'' Whitford is transferred to the Victorian High Country, she is thrust into a baffling mystery of five missing persons who have vanished into the wilderness. Through an edge-of-the-seat, high-stakes investigation, Andie uncovers a complex web involving murder, deceit and revenge.', 'When detective Andrea ''Andie'' Whitford is transferred to the Victorian High Country, she is thrust into a baffling mystery of five missing persons who have vanished into the wilderness. Through an edge-of-the-seat, high-stakes investigation, Andie uncovers a complex web involving murder, deceit and revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/E4LT4GOrFWgU3wAptvpqsQU2sH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:239909'),
  ('98374825038636047', 'High Desert', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Katie Ford, Nancy Fichman, Jennifer Hoppe', null, 'Patricia Arquette, Matt Dillon, Brad Garrett, Weruche Opia, Bernadette Peters, Rupert Friend, Christine Taylor, Liza Fernandez', 'TV-MA', 'Peggy Newman, a woman with a checkered past, makes the life-changing decision to become a private investigator following the death of her beloved mother, who she lived with in the small desert town of Yucca Valley, California.', 'Peggy Newman, a woman with a checkered past, makes the life-changing decision to become a private investigator following the death of her beloved mother, who she lived with in the small desert town of Yucca Valley, California.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kj4XQzhszyu4YFQ9HgN3iQOCp4A.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:116793'),
  ('503550671072357900', 'High Fidelity', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Veronica West, Sarah Kucserka', null, 'Zoë Kravitz, David H. Holmes, Da''Vine Joy Randolph', 'TV-MA', 'Rob Brooks, a female record store owner in the rapidly gentrified neighborhood of Crown Heights, Brooklyn revisit past relationships through music and pop culture, while trying to get over her one true love.', 'Rob Brooks, a female record store owner in the rapidly gentrified neighborhood of Crown Heights, Brooklyn revisit past relationships through music and pop culture, while trying to get over her one true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6OTZ66ZlJvOVb5A8ALiPzTD0n3H.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96734'),
  ('581925094755073980', 'High Guardian Spice', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Raye Rodriguez', null, 'Briana León, Lauren White, Amber Romeo, Katie McVay, Raye Rodriguez', 'TV-14', 'Four fierce girls train to become great heroes at High Guardian Academy, where they form allegiances, uncover betrayals, and discover their true identities, while preparing to protect the world from an ominous unknown threat.', 'Four fierce girls train to become great heroes at High Guardian Academy, where they form allegiances, uncover betrayals, and discover their true identities, while preparing to protect the world from an ominous unknown threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvoh9WP3DXEV7xlwF7VGaoTgKeM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99789'),
  ('82619393125280191', 'High Heat', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'José Ignacio Valenzuela', null, 'Eduardo Capetillo, Itatí Cantoral, Esmeralda Pimentel, Iván Amozurrutia, Polo Morín, Antonio Sotillo, Daniel Gama, Ana Jimena Villanueva', null, 'When clues to his brother''s murder lead Poncho to a fire brigade, he joins it to investigate further and finds romance, family... and a serial killer.', 'When clues to his brother''s murder lead Poncho to a fire brigade, he joins it to investigate further and finds romance, family... and a serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8mcDchpcds0u3yhpkkOtFXP4qb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:206087'),
  ('221943549773708477', 'High Kick', 2006, 'Reality, Talk', 'Kim Young-ki, Kim Byeong-wook, Kim Chang-dong', null, 'Park Hae-mi, Jeong Jun-ha, Kim Hye-seong, Jung Il-woo, Lee Soon-jae, Choi Min-yong, Park Min-young, Kim Bum', null, 'High Kick! was a popular South Korean situation comedy revolving around the life of the Lee family, taking place in Seoul at the same time as the broadcast. The title of the show "High Kick!" has several implications, one of which is the oft-depicted high kicks of Yoon-ho, one of the main characters. The show aired in South Korea from Monday to Friday in sitcom format. Due to its popularity, the show filmed more episodes than were initially planned. Many of the characters starred in commercials and advertisements in Korea. The show''s popularity also led to High Kick Through the Roof, which aired in 2009-2010, and High Kick 3: The Counterattack of the Short Leg, which aired in 2011-2012.', 'High Kick! was a popular South Korean situation comedy revolving around the life of the Lee family, taking place in Seoul at the same time as the broadcast. The title of the show "High Kick!" has several implications, one of which is the oft-depicted high kicks of Yoon-ho, one of the main characters. The show aired in South Korea from Monday to Friday in sitcom format. Due to its popularity, the show filmed more episodes than were initially planned. Many of the characters starred in commercials and advertisements in Korea. The show''s popularity also led to High Kick Through the Roof, which aired in 2009-2010, and High Kick 3: The Counterattack of the Short Leg, which aired in 2011-2012.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2p9ZBFn6TJGN2bci4DymhngEaeS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3729'),
  ('572069326088889903', 'High Kick Through The Roof', 2009, 'Comedy', null, 'Jo Sung-hee, Lee So-jung, Lee Young-chul', 'Lee Soon-jae, Lee Kwang-soo, Seo Shin-ae, Julien Kang, Kim Ja-ok, Hwang Jung-eum, Shin Sae-kyeong, Jung Bo-seog', 'NR', 'Two sisters, twenty-two and nine in age, lived all their lives with their father, deep in the country where even electricity is an unaffordable luxury. One day, after a bizarre turn of events, they end up in Seoul. The two sisters encounter a severe case of cultural shock as soon as they hit the city. Building forests, computers, department stores, subways, cell phone To 9-year old Shin-ae, who had never seen these before, Seoul is like a fantasy that can sometimes be difficult to fathom. Meanwhile, a peculiar family lives at a corner of a residential area in Seongbuk-dong. Sun-jae is the president of a small food company. At 72, Sun-jae falls head over heels in love just as his life is slowly winding down. His granddaughter Hae-ri shrieks every morning in the bathroom over her constipation. All the other members of this family have some sort of defect. The most invisible son-in-law in Seongbuk-dong, the EQ-deficient doctor, the perverted female teacher Come to think of it, every man living in this day and age harbors some kind of unique defect. This is why they shout confidently, "Only those of you who are perfect may throw stones at us!" is a sitcom portraying the uplifting comedic story of two sisters who begin to work at Sun-jae''s house as maids and their episodes with members of this family. At the same time, it is a drama of these two girls blossoming into young women as they fall in love.', 'Two sisters, twenty-two and nine in age, lived all their lives with their father, deep in the country where even electricity is an unaffordable luxury. One day, after a bizarre turn of events, they end up in Seoul. The two sisters encounter a severe case of cultural shock as soon as they hit the city. Building forests, computers, department stores, subways, cell phone To 9-year old Shin-ae, who had never seen these before, Seoul is like a fantasy that can sometimes be difficult to fathom. Meanwhile, a peculiar family lives at a corner of a residential area in Seongbuk-dong. Sun-jae is the president of a small food company. At 72, Sun-jae falls head over heels in love just as his life is slowly winding down. His granddaughter Hae-ri shrieks every morning in the bathroom over her constipation. All the other members of this family have some sort of defect. The most invisible son-in-law in Seongbuk-dong, the EQ-deficient doctor, the perverted female teacher Come to think of it, every man living in this day and age harbors some kind of unique defect. This is why they shout confidently, "Only those of you who are perfect may throw stones at us!" is a sitcom portraying the uplifting comedic story of two sisters who begin to work at Sun-jae''s house as maids and their episodes with members of this family. At the same time, it is a drama of these two girls blossoming into young women as they fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p27YL1Ubuc9Y31Q4rGgFvYhymel.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83518'),
  ('767410593958606498', 'High Kick: Revenge of the Short Legged', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Lee Young-chul, Hong Bo-hee, Jang Jin-Ah', 'Jo Sung-hee', 'Ahn Nae-sang, Yun Yoo-sun, Yoon Kye-sang, Park Ha-seon, Seo Ji-seok, Lee Jong-suk, Krystal Jung, Go Young-wook', 'TV-Y', 'Ahn Nae Sang and Yoon Yoo Sun are middle aged husband and wife. When his business goes bankrupt, this couple moves in to her brother''s house and the conflict starts.', 'Ahn Nae Sang and Yoon Yoo Sun are middle aged husband and wife. When his business goes bankrupt, this couple moves in to her brother''s house and the conflict starts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/29IyBGkje3h8Tqj590MOoccT9re.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88131'),
  ('187136901220017798', 'High Maintenance', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Ben Sinclair, Katja Blichfeld', null, 'Ben Sinclair', 'TV-14', 'A nameless cannabis delivery guy delivers his much-needed medication to stressed-out New Yorkers.', 'A nameless cannabis delivery guy delivers his much-needed medication to stressed-out New Yorkers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yCcozhFKIecvP3JxzRk70CGEg6s.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:106014'),
  ('428106508719298261', 'High Maintenance', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Katja Blichfeld, Ben Sinclair', 'Katja Blichfeld', 'Ben Sinclair, Katja Blichfeld, Katja Blichfeld', 'TV-MA', 'Jump into the daily routines of a diverse group of New Yorkers and how they light things up. “The Guy” is a nameless pot deliveryman whose client base includes an eccentric group of characters with neuroses as diverse as the city.', 'Jump into the daily routines of a diverse group of New Yorkers and how they light things up. “The Guy” is a nameless pot deliveryman whose client base includes an eccentric group of characters with neuroses as diverse as the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qmYqwOW0QTkJy1UGUsM2t0Kowpu.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:67243'),
  ('186007500436186550', 'High Potential', 2024, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Drew Goddard', null, 'Kaitlin Olson, Daniel Sunjata, Judy Reyes, Javicia Leslie, Deniz Akdeniz, Amirah J, Matthew Lamb', 'TV-14', 'Morgan is a single mom with an exceptional mind, whose unconventional knack for solving crimes leads to an unusual and unstoppable partnership with a by-the-book seasoned detective.', 'Morgan is a single mom with an exceptional mind, whose unconventional knack for solving crimes leads to an unusual and unstoppable partnership with a by-the-book seasoned detective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xCtaUDBUP1iKqtoqpHfeH1T2pWF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:226637'),
  ('772616764875131175', 'High Rollers', 2013, 'Drama, Soap', 'Joshua Rous, Luke Rous', null, 'Antony Coleman, Carmel Fisher, Rolanda Marais, Vilje Maritz, Fezile Mpela, Justin Strydom, Carine Rous, Muzi Mthembu', null, 'High Rollers is a South African television drama series-turned-telenovela created by Joshua Rous and Luke Rous and produced by Rous House Productions which is an inter-generational family drama set against the backdrop of the glamorous and backstabbing world of gambling.', 'High Rollers is a South African television drama series-turned-telenovela created by Joshua Rous and Luke Rous and produced by Rous House Productions which is an inter-generational family drama set against the backdrop of the glamorous and backstabbing world of gambling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7UxU6f8hViLuFJR13YnirAGNfi.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:239396'),
  ('478869065078624929', 'High School', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Clea DuVall', null, 'Railey Gilliland, Seazynn Gilliland, Cobie Smulders, Amanda Fix', null, 'A story about finding your own identity—a journey made even more complicated when you have a twin whose own struggle and self-discovery so closely mimics your own. Told through a backdrop of ‘90s grunge and rave culture, the series weaves between parallel and discordant memories of sisters growing up down the hall from one another. Based on the autobiographical book High School by musicians Tegan and Sara.', 'A story about finding your own identity—a journey made even more complicated when you have a twin whose own struggle and self-discovery so closely mimics your own. Told through a backdrop of ‘90s grunge and rave culture, the series weaves between parallel and discordant memories of sisters growing up down the hall from one another. Based on the autobiographical book High School by musicians Tegan and Sara.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cKasVe3wYtZpfQamxZlRCWYeqgX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208061'),
  ('34401306954739861', 'High School DxD', 2012, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuki Kaji, Yoko Hikasa, Azumi Asakura, Shizuka Itoh, Ayana Taketatsu, Fumihiko Tachiki, Saori Seto, Risa Taneda', 'TV-MA', 'Issei Hyodo is your average perverted high school student whose one wish in life is to have his own harem, but he''s got to be one of the unluckiest guys around. He goes on his first date with a girl only to get brutally attacked and killed when it turns out the girl is really a vicious fallen angel. To top it all off, he''s later reincarnated as a devil by his gorgeous senpai who tells him that she is also a devil and now his master! One thing''s for sure, his peaceful days are over. In a battle between devils and angels, who will win?', 'Issei Hyodo is your average perverted high school student whose one wish in life is to have his own harem, but he''s got to be one of the unluckiest guys around. He goes on his first date with a girl only to get brutally attacked and killed when it turns out the girl is really a vicious fallen angel. To top it all off, he''s later reincarnated as a devil by his gorgeous senpai who tells him that she is also a devil and now his master! One thing''s for sure, his peaceful days are over. In a battle between devils and angels, who will win?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5a9vaaLDAZTYjgfWIw7ZYhL1m1A.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:45950'),
  ('472933435407148453', 'High School Fleet', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy, War & Politics', null, null, 'Shiina Natsukawa, Lynn, Nozomi Furuki, Atsumi Tanezaki, Yuuko Kurose, Yurika Kubo, Ayuru Ohashi, Sora Amamiya', null, 'Living by the sea, protecting the sea, and journeying across the sea... They''re the Blue Mermaids! Because of a shift in tectonic plates around 100 years ago, Japan lost much of its area to submergence. To preserve Japan''s territories, coastal cities sprung up, one after the other. Eventually, they became marine cities, and along with the expansion of sea-lanes to connect them, the need arose for a sizable staff to protect the seas. At the same time, maritime jobs were becoming more popular among women. Hence, the Blue Mermaids, tasked with keeping the seas safe, had become every female student''s dream job. This is when childhood friends Akeno Misaki and Moeka China enroll in a marine high school in Yokosuka, along with other girls who share their goal of becoming a Blue Mermaid.', 'Living by the sea, protecting the sea, and journeying across the sea... They''re the Blue Mermaids! Because of a shift in tectonic plates around 100 years ago, Japan lost much of its area to submergence. To preserve Japan''s territories, coastal cities sprung up, one after the other. Eventually, they became marine cities, and along with the expansion of sea-lanes to connect them, the need arose for a sizable staff to protect the seas. At the same time, maritime jobs were becoming more popular among women. Hence, the Blue Mermaids, tasked with keeping the seas safe, had become every female student''s dream job. This is when childhood friends Akeno Misaki and Moeka China enroll in a marine high school in Yokosuka, along with other girls who share their goal of becoming a Blue Mermaid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZsbaElqwnxlJdNPKbB6beCmcup.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66105'),
  ('460000618498352682', 'High School King of Savvy', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', null, 'Yang Hui-seung, Jo Sung-hee', 'Seo In-guk, Lee Ha-na, Lee Soo-hyuk, Lee Tae-hwan, Kang Ki-young, Lee Yul-eum, Oh Kwang-rok, Kwon Seong-deok', null, 'Lee Min Suk is just a normal high school hockey player - until he''s forced to take his brother''s place as the director for a major company. Now he''s forced to balance school work, hockey practice, and making multi-million dollar decisions. No big deal?', 'Lee Min Suk is just a normal high school hockey player - until he''s forced to take his brother''s place as the director for a major company. Now he''s forced to balance school work, hockey practice, and making multi-million dollar decisions. No big deal?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uK1IWTfxRCupgJL3Nn3g5G4plr4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61543'),
  ('204831383813417292', 'High School Musical: The Musical: The Series', 2019, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Tim Federle', null, 'Joshua Bassett, Sofia Wylie, Julia Lester, Dara Reneé, Frankie A. Rodriguez, Liamani Segura, Kate Reinders', 'TV-PG', 'A group of East High students countdown to the opening night of their school’s first-ever production of “High School Musical.” Showmances blossom; friendships are tested while new ones are made; rivalries flare and lives are changed forever as these young people discover the transformative power that only a high school drama club can provide.', 'A group of East High students countdown to the opening night of their school’s first-ever production of “High School Musical.” Showmances blossom; friendships are tested while new ones are made; rivalries flare and lives are changed forever as these young people discover the transformative power that only a high school drama club can provide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2KmbFkZD42I8Q7IZy4WxmZm9W6O.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:85801'),
  ('1005350884085606630', 'High School Mystery Club', 2021, 'Reality, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Jeong Jong-yeon', '윤이나, 허소영, 고아해', 'Park Ji-yoon, Jang Do-yeon, JAEJAE, BIBI, Choi Ye-na', null, 'A text message arrives from a dead friend. Since then, mysterious cases take place in a high school, which are intricately tangled with each other. Five mystery club members get together to reveal the truth of the mysterious incident at school.', 'A text message arrives from a dead friend. Since then, mysterious cases take place in a high school, which are intricately tangled with each other. Five mystery club members get together to reveal the truth of the mysterious incident at school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h87xLfMcihZE5Fhw7IcfET2Leaw.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:116013'),
  ('424335396755115415', 'High School of the Dead', 2010, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Junichi Suwabe, Marina Inoue, Miyuki Sawashiro, Eri Kitamura, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Yukari Fukui, Ayana Taketatsu, Jouji Nakata', 'TV-MA', 'A small group of students at Fujimi High are fighting for their lives after surviving a zombie outbreak. It is up to Takashi to unite the survivors and escape the horrors that surround them. In this new world of the living dead...will they escape?', 'A small group of students at Fujimi High are fighting for their lives after surviving a zombie outbreak. It is up to Takashi to unite the survivors and escape the horrors that surround them. In this new world of the living dead...will they escape?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jaGpsfRddhzkZIlqxDnDqT3XBhr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:56998'),
  ('342759348061988040', 'High School Prodigies Have It Easy Even in Another World!', 2019, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Yusuke Kobayashi, Yuuki Kuwahara, Rina Hidaka, Natsumi Hioka, Hisako Kanemoto, Sayaka Kaneko, Shizuka Ishigami, Junji Majima', 'TV-14', 'Seven high school students are involved in an airplane crash. When they woke up, they found themselves in a parallel world where magic and beastmen exist. Of course, they panicked at their sudden unexpected predicament... or not? Instead, they create a power plant in a world that doesn''t have electricity, they did a little extra work and managed to take economic control over a metropolis, they managed to repay their gratitude to some oppressed citizens by upending a corrupt government, and basically do whatever they feel like?!', 'Seven high school students are involved in an airplane crash. When they woke up, they found themselves in a parallel world where magic and beastmen exist. Of course, they panicked at their sudden unexpected predicament... or not? Instead, they create a power plant in a world that doesn''t have electricity, they did a little extra work and managed to take economic control over a metropolis, they managed to repay their gratitude to some oppressed citizens by upending a corrupt government, and basically do whatever they feel like?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8uapInBBn7otCQRAbjkUJxniIp7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91269'),
  ('951438126365212439', 'High School Return of a Gangster', 2024, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Lee Seong Taek, Ho Rol', null, 'Yoon Chan-young, Bong Jae-hyun, Won Tae-min, Lee Seo-jin, Seo Tae-hwa, Kim Se-won, Joo Yoon-chan, Lee Kyung-young', null, 'A spirit of a middle school dropout gangster who accidentally possesses an 18-year-old boy’s body who killed himself, goes back to high school to take a revenge against the bullies with his gangster skills and encounters unexpected relationship.', 'A spirit of a middle school dropout gangster who accidentally possesses an 18-year-old boy’s body who killed himself, goes back to high school to take a revenge against the bullies with his gangster skills and encounters unexpected relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bK5kGsWq9vGALbDgPmNiLFNFVI1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:224030'),
  ('553776853947367956', 'High School Teacher', 1993, 'Drama', 'Ken Yoshida', null, 'Hiroyuki Sanada, Sachiko Sakurai, Masaki Kyomoto, Maki Mochida, Hidekazu Akai, Noriko Watanabe, Akio Kaneda, Yorie Yamashita', null, 'Hamura entered a high school as a biology teacher. Unexpectedly, one of his students, Mayu, fell in love with him. The forbidden love between the teacher and the student began to sprout. Hamura was worried that his relationship with Mayu would be misunderstood, so he tried to escape. However, he later understood Mayu’s tragic life and that the two could not be separated…', 'Hamura entered a high school as a biology teacher. Unexpectedly, one of his students, Mayu, fell in love with him. The forbidden love between the teacher and the student began to sprout. Hamura was worried that his relationship with Mayu would be misunderstood, so he tried to escape. However, he later understood Mayu’s tragic life and that the two could not be separated…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGrzAVXHFG6abm1UEYipltsN9in.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83535'),
  ('75535750470145671', 'High School USA!', 2013, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Dino Stamatopoulos', null, 'Moon Unit Zappa, Nathan Barnatt, Vincent Kartheiser, T.J. Miller, Mandy Moore, Zosia Mamet, Jake Johnson, Dino Stamatopoulos', 'TV-MA', 'The super positive, millennial students of High School USA! confront all the unique challenges of growing up in this modern world. Our gang of kids confronts everything from cyber-bullying to sexting to national Adderall shortages. And that’s all before they get home from school where they have to deal with their crazy parents. Just regular kids, doing regular things.', 'The super positive, millennial students of High School USA! confront all the unique challenges of growing up in this modern world. Our gang of kids confronts everything from cyber-bullying to sexting to national Adderall shortages. And that’s all before they get home from school where they have to deal with their crazy parents. Just regular kids, doing regular things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ppkgtuKV5C3C7zDwLZS34e3h18.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:56210'),
  ('436349635231501034', 'High Score', 2020, 'Documentary', 'France Costrel', null, 'Charles Martinet', 'TV-14', 'This docuseries traces the history of classic video games, featuring insights from the innovators who brought these worlds and characters to life.', 'This docuseries traces the history of classic video games, featuring insights from the innovators who brought these worlds and characters to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ooN2RcOSi2tpfL1P6wCRI7LGq8I.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106754'),
  ('648509932776536825', 'High Seas', 2019, 'Crime, Drama', 'Gema R. Neira, Ramón Campos', null, 'Ivana Baquero, Alejandra Onieva, Jon Kortajarena, Diana Tobar', 'TV-MA', 'Two sisters discover disturbing family secrets after a string of mysterious deaths occur on a luxury ship traveling from Spain to Brazil in the 1940s.', 'Two sisters discover disturbing family secrets after a string of mysterious deaths occur on a luxury ship traveling from Spain to Brazil in the 1940s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lzrnCDxQDvciVPWH9idxKRNaLKk.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:88239'),
  ('436718048198868287', 'High Society', 2015, 'Romance, Drama', null, 'Ha Myung-hee', 'Uee, Sung Joon, Lim Ji-yeon, Park Hyung-sik, Yoon Ji-hye, Goh Doo-shim, Yun Ju-sang, Yang Hee-kyung', null, 'Jang Yoon-Ha is the youngest daughter of a chaebol. Even though her family is extremely wealthy, she holds a part-time job at a food market. She hides her background as an heiress and attempts to find a man that loves her for herself.', 'Jang Yoon-Ha is the youngest daughter of a chaebol. Even though her family is extremely wealthy, she holds a part-time job at a food market. She hides her background as an heiress and attempts to find a man that loves her for herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgQm6Afr15JPVQ5n1cXGLA5QkoV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62863'),
  ('463028304634327910', 'High Tides', 2023, 'Drama', 'Anthony Van Biervliet', null, 'Pommelien Thijs, Willem De Schryver, Eliyha Altena, Anna Drijver, Manouk Pluis, Ayana Doucouré, Kes Bakker, Jef Hellemans', null, 'Over a tense summer on the Belgian coast, a wealthy friend group faces adulthood''s harsh realities while grappling with love and societal expectations.', 'Over a tense summer on the Belgian coast, a wealthy friend group faces adulthood''s harsh realities while grappling with love and societal expectations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aH4pbrLQJbjWytHOFhHlAi97zcu.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:203616'),
  ('969008561776341629', 'High Water', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Agnieszka Żulewska, Tomasz Schuchardt, Ireneusz Czop, Anna Dymna, Jerzy Trela, Blanka Kot', null, 'In 1997, scientists and local government officials in Wrocław face life-and-death decisions when a destructive flood wave threatens the city.', 'In 1997, scientists and local government officials in Wrocław face life-and-death decisions when a destructive flood wave threatens the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YTkbm95KNSlfgRfwA9MnJnBE9e.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130477'),
  ('585712414191470453', 'High-End Crush', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Shin Yoo-dam', 'Jung Il-woo, Jin Se-yeon, Lee Si-eon, Yoon Bo-ra, Lee Joo-heon, HYUNGWON, Lee Min-hyuk, WONHO', null, 'Romantic comedy depicting the heartfelt and pure love story by a man, a successful CEO with everything in his hands, who falls in love for the first time in his life with a woman, who has been living in completely opposite circumstances from his and is a rising artist in his own company.', 'Romantic comedy depicting the heartfelt and pure love story by a man, a successful CEO with everything in his hands, who falls in love for the first time in his life with a woman, who has been living in completely opposite circumstances from his and is a rising artist in his own company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/izcSfNInntMVwBSZX9oRs0EPwz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64529'),
  ('916909723185949002', 'High-Rise Invasion', 2021, 'Animation, Mystery, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Shiki Aoki, Junya Enoki, Akira Sekine, Yuuichirou Umehara, Haruka Shiraishi, Jun Fukuyama, Yoko Hikasa, Megumi Ogata', 'TV-MA', 'High-school girl Yuri suddenly finds herself on the rooftop of a high-rise building. She''s trapped in a bizarre world surrounded by skyscrapers, where a masked man cracked open a man''s head with an axe before her eyes. Finding a way to survive this bizarre world, find her beloved brother, and escape becomes her top priority, but she is beset by danger not just from the mysterious Masks, which possess both inhuman strength and cruelty, but other survivors turned cruel or desparate by the insanity of the high-rise world.', 'High-school girl Yuri suddenly finds herself on the rooftop of a high-rise building. She''s trapped in a bizarre world surrounded by skyscrapers, where a masked man cracked open a man''s head with an axe before her eyes. Finding a way to survive this bizarre world, find her beloved brother, and escape becomes her top priority, but she is beset by danger not just from the mysterious Masks, which possess both inhuman strength and cruelty, but other survivors turned cruel or desparate by the insanity of the high-rise world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5uXaWe0LXTpBQVBBXL1ynae1DED.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112163'),
  ('777767015100373712', 'High: Confessions of an Ibiza Drug Mule', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Tatiana Penfold, Sade Giliberti, Michaella McCollum, Alexandra Constantinidi', null, 'In 2013, Michaella McCollum from Northern Ireland and Melissa Reid from Scotland were caught at the Jorge Chavez International Airport in Peru trying to smuggle £1.5 million of cocaine into Spain. The pair, also known as the `Peru Two,'' were sentenced to almost seven years in one of the most notorious prisons in the world. The series provides a first-hand account from Michaella, a former club hostess in the Spanish nightlife, as she traces her journey from arriving in the foreign country for her first holiday to her downward spiral into the illicit world of drugs and excess.', 'In 2013, Michaella McCollum from Northern Ireland and Melissa Reid from Scotland were caught at the Jorge Chavez International Airport in Peru trying to smuggle £1.5 million of cocaine into Spain. The pair, also known as the `Peru Two,'' were sentenced to almost seven years in one of the most notorious prisons in the world. The series provides a first-hand account from Michaella, a former club hostess in the Spanish nightlife, as she traces her journey from arriving in the foreign country for her first holiday to her downward spiral into the illicit world of drugs and excess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJ6At2fJA6Uy1uP50EsKtURBWoy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128641'),
  ('520307661912654294', 'Higher Ground', 2000, 'Drama', 'Matthew Hastings, Michael Braverman', null, 'Hayden Christensen, Meghan Ory, A. J. Cook, Jewel Staite, Kandyse McClure, Kyle Downes, Jorge Vargas, Joe Lando', 'NR', 'Higher Ground told the story of Mount Horizon High School, a therapeutic boarding school for troubled teens, where the students learned to face their personal struggles with addiction, abuse, or disorders. [Higher Ground is an American-Canadian drama action television show shot outside Vancouver, British Columbia. The series ran from January 14, 2000 - June 16, 2000 and aired on Fox Family. It stars Joe Lando, Hayden Christensen, A.J. Cook, Meghan Ory, Kandyse McClure, and Jewel Staite.]', 'Higher Ground told the story of Mount Horizon High School, a therapeutic boarding school for troubled teens, where the students learned to face their personal struggles with addiction, abuse, or disorders. [Higher Ground is an American-Canadian drama action television show shot outside Vancouver, British Columbia. The series ran from January 14, 2000 - June 16, 2000 and aired on Fox Family. It stars Joe Lando, Hayden Christensen, A.J. Cook, Meghan Ory, Kandyse McClure, and Jewel Staite.]', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6sDziyxR3RDirGVVrGP1nSXxbtE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:594'),
  ('1025738842645857495', 'Highlander: The Animated Series', 1994, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Gregory Widen, Serge Rosenzweig', 'Florian Ferrier, Patrick Galliano, Frédéric Lenoir', 'Miklos Perlus, Benedict Campbell, Katie Zegers, Lawrence Bayne, Lorne Kennedy, Tracey Moore, Hrant Alianak, Stuart Stone', null, 'Seven centuries have passed since the Earth plunged into darkness, seven centuries since the Jettator swore to regain from man his lost knowledge and freedom, all the Immortals took the oath, all except one. Who dominates the world, but soon an Immortal will come to confront him, his name is Quentin MacLeod, he is the Highlander. This animated series followed the adventures of Quentin MacLeod, the Last of the MacLeods. Set in a post apocalyptic world almost barren of technology and civilization. The Jettator''s or Immmortals oath was to lay down their swords and when Kortan decided not to swear the oath so began the wait for the Highlander.', 'Seven centuries have passed since the Earth plunged into darkness, seven centuries since the Jettator swore to regain from man his lost knowledge and freedom, all the Immortals took the oath, all except one. Who dominates the world, but soon an Immortal will come to confront him, his name is Quentin MacLeod, he is the Highlander. This animated series followed the adventures of Quentin MacLeod, the Last of the MacLeods. Set in a post apocalyptic world almost barren of technology and civilization. The Jettator''s or Immmortals oath was to lay down their swords and when Kortan decided not to swear the oath so began the wait for the Highlander.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qSBVGwPl9A5sWoipesXPpaGFKDH.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:12304'),
  ('538048997093566435', 'Highlander: The Raven', 1998, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Elizabeth Gracen, Paul Johansson', null, 'Highlander: The Raven was a short-lived spin-off from the television series Highlander, continuing the saga of a female Immortal. The series followed the character of Amanda, an Immortal who had a recurring role in Highlander: The Series. The series was filmed in Toronto, Ontario, Canada and Paris, France and was produced by Gaumont Télévision and Fireworks Media in association with Davis-Panzer Productions.', 'Highlander: The Raven was a short-lived spin-off from the television series Highlander, continuing the saga of a female Immortal. The series followed the character of Amanda, an Immortal who had a recurring role in Highlander: The Series. The series was filmed in Toronto, Ontario, Canada and Paris, France and was produced by Gaumont Télévision and Fireworks Media in association with Davis-Panzer Productions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mEEGGIoxt9igWDhKqrHT6gPNIfc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4377'),
  ('143689475531853378', 'Highlander: The Series', 1992, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Gregory Widen', null, 'Adrian Paul, Jim Byrnes, Peter Wingfield', 'TV-14', 'Duncan MacLeod cannot die -- he is a 400-year-old immortal, who has seen his share of humanity''s history. Still, he risks his life in battle against other immortals and tries to save people from harm.', 'Duncan MacLeod cannot die -- he is a 400-year-old immortal, who has seen his share of humanity''s history. Still, he risks his life in battle against other immortals and tries to save people from harm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rpeEOxxgfw5Ds54jWcNtkb9KvSh.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:4414'),
  ('558838849789474386', 'Highs and Lows', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Chi Wah Lam', 'Yip Tin-Shing, Leung Yan Tung', 'Raymond Lam Fung, Michael Miu Kiu-Wai, Ben Wong Chi-Yin, Ella Koon, Kate Tsui Tsz-Shan, Elaine Ng Yee-Lei, Derek Kwok Jing-Hung, Law Lok-Lam', null, 'Gordon Heung and Wai Sai-Lok have been long-time collaborators in the police force, frequently working with each other to solve drug trafficking cases in the city. During an operation, Sai-Lok discovers clues that point to Gordon being a corrupt cop in a collusion conspiracy with drug dealers. Suspicious about Gordon''s true intentions, Sai-Lok launches a secret investigation on him.', 'Gordon Heung and Wai Sai-Lok have been long-time collaborators in the police force, frequently working with each other to solve drug trafficking cases in the city. During an operation, Sai-Lok discovers clues that point to Gordon being a corrupt cop in a collusion conspiracy with drug dealers. Suspicious about Gordon''s true intentions, Sai-Lok launches a secret investigation on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tYRdwwx5Z6W25iE2dUndTiUXI2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44442'),
  ('191496085933286783', 'Hightown', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', 'Rebecca Perry Cutter', null, 'Monica Raymund, Riley Voelkel, Atkins Estimond, Amaury Nolasco, Dohn Norwood, James Badge Dale', 'TV-MA', 'Amid the drug trade on Cape Cod, a body washes ashore and is discovered by an irreverent National Marine Fisheries Service officer, Jackie Quinones, who is determined to help solve the murder even if the state cops want her nowhere near the case.', 'Amid the drug trade on Cape Cod, a body washes ashore and is discovered by an irreverent National Marine Fisheries Service officer, Jackie Quinones, who is determined to help solve the murder even if the state cops want her nowhere near the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/69hornrvpKWIzBMCNzsVTZOggOw.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:86588'),
  ('203554952394327229', 'Highway Patrol', 1955, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Broderick Crawford, Art Gilmore', 'TV-G', 'Highway Patrol was a syndicated, fictional police action series produced from 1955 to 1959, concerning the activities of the highway patrol and their leader, Dan Matthews (who held no rank). Although filmed in and around the Los Angeles area, the state setting for the stories was never identified, and city and street names were fictionalized.', 'Highway Patrol was a syndicated, fictional police action series produced from 1955 to 1959, concerning the activities of the highway patrol and their leader, Dan Matthews (who held no rank). Although filmed in and around the Los Angeles area, the state setting for the stories was never identified, and city and street names were fictionalized.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oc0Z6yqZzMdHS35Ran8Zpg2rrBy.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:11920'),
  ('149642069083212977', 'Highway Thru Hell', 2012, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, 'Jamie Davis, Al Quiring, Dave Pettitt', 'TV-14', 'Follow the operations of Jamie Davis Motor Truck, a heavy vehicle rescue and recovery towing company based in Hope, British Columbia focusing on the hardships of operating along the highways of the BC Interior, especially the Coquihalla Highway, which is notorious for rapidly changing weather.', 'Follow the operations of Jamie Davis Motor Truck, a heavy vehicle rescue and recovery towing company based in Hope, British Columbia focusing on the hardships of operating along the highways of the BC Interior, especially the Coquihalla Highway, which is notorious for rapidly changing weather.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45mrc5BtsFUrU5DjCb5DQNGGwTV.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:59097'),
  ('1091659838157427165', 'Highway to Heaven', 1984, 'Family, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'William F. Claxton, Michael Landon', null, 'Michael Landon, Victor French', 'TV-PG', 'A probationary angel is sent back to Earth to team up with an ex-cop and help people.', 'A probationary angel is sent back to Earth to team up with an ex-cop and help people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fR7BcK3UzQqpX7Earp10nPHitZF.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:2440'),
  ('465906576797760020', 'Higurashi: When They Cry', 2006, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Soichiro Hoshi, Mai Nakahara, Satsuki Yukino, Mika Kanai, Yukari Tamura, Yui Horie', 'TV-MA', 'After moving into the quiet town of Hinamizawa, Maebara Keiichi spends his days blissfully in school often playing games with his local friends. However, appearances can be deceiving. One fateful day, Keiichi stumbles upon news of a murder that had occurred in Hinamizawa. From this point on, horrific events unfold in front of Keiichi, as he soon learns his close friends may not be all that they seem.', 'After moving into the quiet town of Hinamizawa, Maebara Keiichi spends his days blissfully in school often playing games with his local friends. However, appearances can be deceiving. One fateful day, Keiichi stumbles upon news of a murder that had occurred in Hinamizawa. From this point on, horrific events unfold in front of Keiichi, as he soon learns his close friends may not be all that they seem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z6GrUoKte5lzPxR7HWyiSLVieUC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:25760'),
  ('1142970040797654367', 'Higurashi: When They Cry - NEW', 2020, 'Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Soichiro Hoshi, Mai Nakahara, Satsuki Yukino, Mika Kanai, Yukari Tamura, Chafurin, Toru Okawa, Miki Ito', 'TV-MA', 'New kid Keiichi Maebara is settling into his new home of peaceful Hinamizawa village. Making quick friends with the girls from his school, he''s arrived in time for the big festival of the year. But something about this isolated town seems "off," and his feelings of dread continue to grow. With a gnawing fear that he''s right, what dark secrets could this small community be hiding?', 'New kid Keiichi Maebara is settling into his new home of peaceful Hinamizawa village. Making quick friends with the girls from his school, he''s arrived in time for the big festival of the year. But something about this isolated town seems "off," and his feelings of dread continue to grow. With a gnawing fear that he''s right, what dark secrets could this small community be hiding?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZocpkrc1qrntJXR2gbVPLWPAlk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:100988'),
  ('693646145306487997', 'Hijack', 2023, 'Drama', 'George Kay, Jim Field Smith', null, 'Idris Elba, Christine Adams, Albrecht Schuch, Christian Näthe, Clare-Hope Ashitey, Lisa Vicari, Dejan Bućin, Karima McAdams', 'TV-MA', 'Expert negotiator Sam Nelson is in for the ride of his life—and so is everyone on board with him—after a group of hijackers take control. Sam will try every move in his playbook to take them down...as the stakes grow higher by the second.', 'Expert negotiator Sam Nelson is in for the ride of his life—and so is everyone on board with him—after a group of hijackers take control. Sam will try every move in his playbook to take them down...as the stakes grow higher by the second.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2C51clnxQdiqPDeqQlXcUx70hse.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:198102'),
  ('250937445580064526', 'Hijas de la luna... y la familia cambió', 2018, 'Soap, Comedy, Drama', 'Alejandro Pohlenz, Nicandro Díaz González', null, 'Michelle Renaud, Danilo Carrera, Jade Fraser, Geraldine Galvan, Lorena Graniewicz, Omar Fierro, Alexis Ayala, Mario Morán', 'NR', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aDdAtBuiiL8S51qNezEcURcPooI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79251'),
  ('620617737701333132', 'Hijrah Jannah', 2023, 'Drama, Family', null, null, 'Remy Ishak, Daniella Sya, Puteri Sarah Liyana', null, 'Janet converted to Islam as soon as she married her lover; Syawal Fitri. However, their marriage was allegedly opposed by Syawal''s mother - Puan Sri Rafidah - who also forced Syawal to accept her chosen daughter-in-law - Munirah - as second wife to Janet.', 'Janet converted to Islam as soon as she married her lover; Syawal Fitri. However, their marriage was allegedly opposed by Syawal''s mother - Puan Sri Rafidah - who also forced Syawal to accept her chosen daughter-in-law - Munirah - as second wife to Janet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dumuLQuZXc4Mspnyf1u4nrCdDAO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:228001'),
  ('982628494288768749', 'Hikaru no Go', 2001, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tomoko Kawakami, Susumu Chiba, Sanae Kobayashi, Yumi Kakazu, Makoto Tsumura, Kentaro Ito, Yuu Asakawa, Mayumi Asano', 'TV-G', 'Hikaru Shindo is like any sixth-grader in Japan: a pretty normal kid with a two-tone head of hair and a penchant for antics. His life completely changes when he finds an old bloodstained go board in his grandfather''s attic. The ghost of an ancient go master named Fujiwara-no-Sai was trapped in the board and soon becomes a part of Hikaru''s consciousness. Together Hikaru and Sai make an unstoppable go-playing team!', 'Hikaru Shindo is like any sixth-grader in Japan: a pretty normal kid with a two-tone head of hair and a penchant for antics. His life completely changes when he finds an old bloodstained go board in his grandfather''s attic. The ghost of an ancient go master named Fujiwara-no-Sai was trapped in the board and soon becomes a part of Hikaru''s consciousness. Together Hikaru and Sai make an unstoppable go-playing team!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/siC9EWjJG9VGU0l9ifuraQs0T8C.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:30982'),
  ('892709918135873448', 'Hikaru no Go', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', null, '卓越泡沫, 徐一天', 'Hu Xianxu, Zhang Chao, Hao Fushen, Zhao Haohong, Han Mubo, Zhai Guanhua, Sun Can, Wu Qianying', null, 'The drama tells the story of Shi Guang who discovered an ancient go board by coincidence and thus got to know Chu Ying, a go player who has been entrenched in the go board as a "soul" and who has experienced thousands of years. Under his influence, he gradually confronted the story of interest in go and inspiring to become a professional go player.', 'The drama tells the story of Shi Guang who discovered an ancient go board by coincidence and thus got to know Chu Ying, a go player who has been entrenched in the go board as a "soul" and who has experienced thousands of years. Under his influence, he gradually confronted the story of interest in go and inspiring to become a professional go player.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7cETtbpWu1Q3PpdDzoGk5ZthvQD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112217'),
  ('411624964446872311', 'Hikonin Sentai Akibaranger', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Masato Wada, Shione Sawada, Karin Ogino, Maaya Uchida, Kozue Aikawa, Honoka, Ryo Horikawa', null, 'A beautiful-yet-awkward genius recruits three otaku to protect Akihabara. Powered only by their own delusions, and aiming to be acknowledged as a true Sentai team, they become the Unofficial Sentai, Akibaranger!', 'A beautiful-yet-awkward genius recruits three otaku to protect Akihabara. Powered only by their own delusions, and aiming to be acknowledged as a true Sentai team, they become the Unofficial Sentai, Akibaranger!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/16qA0kgIXKSYwtGWdANZRUXkqpR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:78591'),
  ('103074246353300530', 'Hilda', 2018, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family, Action & Adventure', 'Luke Pearson', 'Luke Pearson', 'Bella Ramsey, Daisy Haggard, Ameerah Falzon-Ojo, Rasmus Hardiker, Oliver Nelson', 'TV-Y7', 'Fearless, free-spirited Hilda finds new friends, adventure and magical creatures when she leaves her enchanted forest home and journeys to the city.', 'Fearless, free-spirited Hilda finds new friends, adventure and magical creatures when she leaves her enchanted forest home and journeys to the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/giWufGBC7uxrmK9ZESdk9D1cyGm.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:82456'),
  ('847343428420183958', 'Hilda Hurricane', 1998, 'Drama, War & Politics, Soap', 'Glória Perez', 'Glória Perez', 'Ana Paula Arósio, Rodrigo Santoro, Danton Mello, Thiago Lacerda, Rosi Campos, Débora Duarte, Eva Todor, Carlos Vereza', null, 'After breaking off her engagement on her wedding day and going directly to a prostitution house, a young model becomes the city''s most famous harlot, known as "Hilda Hurricane", in the 50''s Brazil. She could do fine if it wasn''t for Malthus, a young novice said to be a saint, for whom she falls in love. However, the boy is kept under the strict, severe doctrine of Father Nelson, a conservative priest intolerant even to every minor sin. Things start getting harder when Roberto, Malthus'' old friend and a communist reporter (the actual author of the story), tries to interview Hilda and disclosure the real reasons behind her radical change of mind. In the meantime, the middle-classes are terrified by the "leftist threat" in Brazilian politics.', 'After breaking off her engagement on her wedding day and going directly to a prostitution house, a young model becomes the city''s most famous harlot, known as "Hilda Hurricane", in the 50''s Brazil. She could do fine if it wasn''t for Malthus, a young novice said to be a saint, for whom she falls in love. However, the boy is kept under the strict, severe doctrine of Father Nelson, a conservative priest intolerant even to every minor sin. Things start getting harder when Roberto, Malthus'' old friend and a communist reporter (the actual author of the story), tries to interview Hilda and disclosure the real reasons behind her radical change of mind. In the meantime, the middle-classes are terrified by the "leftist threat" in Brazilian politics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJgDZQDscZpQ5JJ2Ms9QOYoIEk9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72351'),
  ('827722418309264206', 'Hill Street Blues', 1981, 'Drama, Crime', 'Steven Bochco', 'Michael Kozoll, Peter Silverman, Jacob Epstein', 'Daniel J. Travanti, Michael Warren, Bruce Weitz, Robert Prosky, James B. Sikking, Joe Spano, Taurean Blacque, Kiel Martin', 'TV-14', 'A realistic glimpse into the daily lives of the officers and detectives at an urban police station.', 'A realistic glimpse into the daily lives of the officers and detectives at an urban police station.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/elvCmYxmwVzv2va3rLKponOJOfm.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:3828'),
  ('449338828829142827', 'Hillary', 2020, 'War & Politics, Documentary', null, null, 'Hillary Clinton, Bill Clinton, Barack Obama, Bernie Sanders, Marian Wright Edelman, Andrea Mitchell, Gloria Steinem, Kate McKinnon', 'TV-PG', 'A portrait of a public woman, interweaving moments from never-before-seen 2016 campaign footage with biographical chapters of Hillary Rodham Clinton''s life. Featuring exclusive interviews with Hillary herself, Bill Clinton, friends, and journalists, an examination of how she became simultaneously one of the most admired and vilified women in the world.', 'A portrait of a public woman, interweaving moments from never-before-seen 2016 campaign footage with biographical chapters of Hillary Rodham Clinton''s life. Featuring exclusive interviews with Hillary herself, Bill Clinton, friends, and journalists, an examination of how she became simultaneously one of the most admired and vilified women in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5ktnrny1shM3QHwBulnOiA4DuN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96391'),
  ('425105995333540036', 'Hillsong: A Megachurch Exposed', 2022, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Carl Lentz, Brian Houston', null, 'Featuring interviews with Hillsong insiders, megachurch experts, and Ranin Karim – the woman whose five-month affair with celebrity senior pastor Carl Lentz led to his downfall – the series explores the high-profile, star-studded church’s alleged exploitation, abuse, and cover-ups.', 'Featuring interviews with Hillsong insiders, megachurch experts, and Ranin Karim – the woman whose five-month affair with celebrity senior pastor Carl Lentz led to his downfall – the series explores the high-profile, star-studded church’s alleged exploitation, abuse, and cover-ups.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xGcEAKGCjmSKiMLJBn2a5qSpioF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157829'),
  ('1104013287757696325', 'HIM', 2016, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Drama', 'Andy de Emmony, Paula Milne', 'Paula Milne', 'Fionn Whitehead, Katherine Kelly, James Murray, Alec Newman, Lucy Liemann, Bobby Smalldridge, Angela Bruce, Simona Brown', null, 'HIM is a British three-part miniseries created by Andy de Emmony and Paula Milne for ITV. A supernatural drama, it stars Fionn Whitehead as the titular character, with supporting roles by Katherine Kelly and James Murray. A 17-year-old boy, known only as HIM, caught in the limbo between childhood and adulthood is also trapped in a limbo between the two homes of his divorced parents, each now remarried with new families. Like most boys, he finds it hard to process his feelings so tends to ''act out''. But his behaviour is also triggered by something else — his primal struggle to contain the terrifying secret of a supernatural power he inherited from his grandfather. A power that only his ageing grandmother understands, who urges him to use his gift only for ‘good’ for she knows if he doesn’t it could end in tragedy.', 'HIM is a British three-part miniseries created by Andy de Emmony and Paula Milne for ITV. A supernatural drama, it stars Fionn Whitehead as the titular character, with supporting roles by Katherine Kelly and James Murray. A 17-year-old boy, known only as HIM, caught in the limbo between childhood and adulthood is also trapped in a limbo between the two homes of his divorced parents, each now remarried with new families. Like most boys, he finds it hard to process his feelings so tends to ''act out''. But his behaviour is also triggered by something else — his primal struggle to contain the terrifying secret of a supernatural power he inherited from his grandfather. A power that only his ageing grandmother understands, who urges him to use his gift only for ‘good’ for she knows if he doesn’t it could end in tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8VaMw9b9uMFJvUxemxxr6bqmdKZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68058');
