  ('568497855636449250', 'Holidays', 2023, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Mariya Aronova, Vitaliy Khaev, Yana Enzhaeva, Nikita Pavlenko, Anastasia Kalashnikova, Сергей Канаев', null, 'May holidays with traditional kebabs at the cottage, where two daughters come with their grooms. They will have a quarrel during the preparation for the feast, unexpected confessions, a conflict of mentalities and even shooting, but still the Pyzhovs got together, which means that they are really dear to each other.', 'May holidays with traditional kebabs at the cottage, where two daughters come with their grooms. They will have a quarrel during the preparation for the feast, unexpected confessions, a conflict of mentalities and even shooting, but still the Pyzhovs got together, which means that they are really dear to each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkNGz9Gaq9rAEqI88WqYV9NkHF6.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:239827'),
