  ('101485201586471878', 'Home Movies', 1999, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Brendon Small, Loren Bouchard', null, 'Brendon Small, H. Jon Benjamin, Melissa Bardin Galsky, Janine Ditullio, Loren Bouchard, Ron Lynch', 'TV-PG', 'TV series about the life of Brendon Small, an eight-year-old visionary who, using his friends Jason and Melissa as actors, have managed to direct over a thousand homemade films. His parents are divorced, but it doesn''t feel strange since so many other kids'' parents are divorced. His friend Jason actually feels upset because his parents are still together. At school, he is taught soccer by his coach John McGuirk, or as he calls him, "that weird Irish guy".', 'TV series about the life of Brendon Small, an eight-year-old visionary who, using his friends Jason and Melissa as actors, have managed to direct over a thousand homemade films. His parents are divorced, but it doesn''t feel strange since so many other kids'' parents are divorced. His friend Jason actually feels upset because his parents are still together. At school, he is taught soccer by his coach John McGuirk, or as he calls him, "that weird Irish guy".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3yC4oIdb6vMxgoghXGPbGQNxu7.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2274'),
  ('495387364787820867', 'Home of the Year', 2015, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'Home of the Year features people who have built their dream home, just the way they like it. The series showcases homes all over the country and included; a surprising Semi D, a small terraced homes with a clever interior, a converted church, an architecturally distinct flood proof home, and a family home with clever storage solutions, to name just a few.Making the tough decisions as to who goes through to the final are our three expert judges; interior design legend Hugh Wallace, award winning architect Declan O’Donnell and textiles and homewares designer Helen James.Looking for individuality, functionality and clever design, the judges individually score the homes out of 10, the home with the highest combined score, goes through to the final where the ultimate winner will be crowned.', 'Home of the Year features people who have built their dream home, just the way they like it. The series showcases homes all over the country and included; a surprising Semi D, a small terraced homes with a clever interior, a converted church, an architecturally distinct flood proof home, and a family home with clever storage solutions, to name just a few.Making the tough decisions as to who goes through to the final are our three expert judges; interior design legend Hugh Wallace, award winning architect Declan O’Donnell and textiles and homewares designer Helen James.Looking for individuality, functionality and clever design, the judges individually score the homes out of 10, the home with the highest combined score, goes through to the final where the ultimate winner will be crowned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hL9H6RF3UDDZacF2qAsKB8TPg8n.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:126017'),
  ('355965818139629450', 'Home School', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Kay Lertsittichai, Hirunkit Changkham, Chayapol Jutamas, Chayakorn Jutamas, Atthaphan Phunsawat, Jirawat Sutivanichsak, Rachanun Mahawan, Methika Jiranorraphat', null, 'When children are unwanted by their parents, they are sent to the best boarding school in the country: Home School. However, Home School seems more like a prison than a school with its strict rules and regulations. Its curriculum is unique.', 'When children are unwanted by their parents, they are sent to the best boarding school in the country: Home School. However, Home School seems more like a prison than a school with its strict rules and regulations. Its curriculum is unique.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4hiuOqoOZXwD8o6V8FDLXOuiXGG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223824'),
  ('489560260892947470', 'Home Town', 2016, 'Reality', null, null, 'Erin Napier, Ben Napier', 'TV-G', 'Erin and Ben Napier, a small town Mississippi couple, renovate neighborhood historical houses giving them modern and affordable updates. From Erin''s imaginative hand sketches to Ben''s custom handiwork, this couple is bringing homes back to life and making sure their small town''s future is as bright as its past.', 'Erin and Ben Napier, a small town Mississippi couple, renovate neighborhood historical houses giving them modern and affordable updates. From Erin''s imaginative hand sketches to Ben''s custom handiwork, this couple is bringing homes back to life and making sure their small town''s future is as bright as its past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rabygYi2gxILpxDksguEgDoGHr8.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:71359'),
  ('725145583140539288', 'Home with Kids', 2005, 'Comedy, Family', null, 'Zang Li, Zang Xi', 'Zhang Yishan, Gao Yalin, Song Dandan, You Haoran, Ning Danlin', null, 'Xia Donghai returns to China with his son to reunite with his daughter and marries Liu Mei, a nurse with her own son. The blended family navigates different parenting styles and the mischievous behavior of their children, leading to both humorous and challenging situations.', 'Xia Donghai returns to China with his son to reunite with his daughter and marries Liu Mei, a nurse with her own son. The blended family navigates different parenting styles and the mischievous behavior of their children, leading to both humorous and challenging situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knQh5E3YazUwkupxvfSyy11VqW0.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:40521'),
  ('448804190014388267', 'Home: Adventures with Tip & Oh', 2016, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Thurop Van Orman, Ryan Crego', null, 'Rachel Crow, Mark Whitten, Matt Jones, Ana Ortiz, Ron Funches, Marcus Scribner', 'TV-Y7', 'Picking up where the 2015 film left off, this coming-of-age buddy comedy follows fearless Tip and overenthusiastic Oh, as they navigate the crazily combined human and alien culture they live in, finding adventure everywhere they go.', 'Picking up where the 2015 film left off, this coming-of-age buddy comedy follows fearless Tip and overenthusiastic Oh, as they navigate the crazily combined human and alien culture they live in, finding adventure everywhere they go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2z8SFDZxFllkTgUJZs2R4glVSl.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:67242'),
  ('183906554693227340', 'Homecoming', 2018, 'Drama', 'Sam Esmail, Micah Bloomberg, Eli Horowitz', null, 'Janelle Monáe, Stephan James, Chris Cooper, Hong Chau', 'TV-MA', 'Heidi Bergman is a caseworker at Homecoming, a Geist Group facility helping soldiers transition to civilian life. Years later she has started a new life, living with her mother and working as a waitress, when a Department of Defense auditor questions why she left the Homecoming facility. Heidi quickly realizes that there''s a whole other story behind the story she''s been telling herself.', 'Heidi Bergman is a caseworker at Homecoming, a Geist Group facility helping soldiers transition to civilian life. Years later she has started a new life, living with her mother and working as a waitress, when a Department of Defense auditor questions why she left the Homecoming facility. Heidi quickly realizes that there''s a whole other story behind the story she''s been telling herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6GTzd7ZeivgBOrIn45720nsq0TU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:80335'),
  ('116151361179891736', 'Homefront', 1991, 'Drama, Family, Soap', 'Lynn Marie Latham, Bernard Lechowick', null, 'David Newsom, Kyle Chandler, Mimi Kennedy, Wendy Phillips, Alexandra Wilson, Hattie Winston, Tammy Lauren, Ken Jenkins', null, 'Homefront is an American television drama series created and produced by Lynn Marie Latham and Bernard Lechowick in association with Warner Bros. Television for ABC. The show was set in the fictional city of River Run, Ohio in 1945, 1946, and 1947. The show''s theme song, "Accentuate the Positive", was written by Johnny Mercer and performed by Jack Sheldon. Forty-two episodes were broadcast in the United States over two seasons from 1991 to 1993. TV Guide, Abigail Van Buren, and fans showed determination in getting ABC to continue the show for a third season before it was cancelled.', 'Homefront is an American television drama series created and produced by Lynn Marie Latham and Bernard Lechowick in association with Warner Bros. Television for ABC. The show was set in the fictional city of River Run, Ohio in 1945, 1946, and 1947. The show''s theme song, "Accentuate the Positive", was written by Johnny Mercer and performed by Jack Sheldon. Forty-two episodes were broadcast in the United States over two seasons from 1991 to 1993. TV Guide, Abigail Van Buren, and fans showed determination in getting ABC to continue the show for a third season before it was cancelled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xiM4k9BhDuIz2bFtBOQQeP6YgUF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2722'),
  ('220710006702764769', 'Homeland', 2011, 'Drama, War & Politics, Crime', 'Alex Gansa, Howard Gordon', 'Jonathan Redding, Nick Leith Baker', 'Claire Danes, Mandy Patinkin, Maury Sterling, Numan Acar, Nimrat Kaur, Linus Roache, Costa Ronin', 'TV-MA', 'CIA officer Carrie Mathison is tops in her field despite being bipolar, which makes her volatile and unpredictable. With the help of her long-time mentor Saul Berenson, Carrie fearlessly risks everything, including her personal well-being and even sanity, at every turn.', 'CIA officer Carrie Mathison is tops in her field despite being bipolar, which makes her volatile and unpredictable. With the help of her long-time mentor Saul Berenson, Carrie fearlessly risks everything, including her personal well-being and even sanity, at every turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6GAvS2e6VIRsms9FpVt33PsCoEW.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:1407'),
  ('20637910773048831', 'Homeland Guardian', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', null, 'Chan Man-Keung, Ma Yan', 'Jordan Chan Siu-Chun, Aarif Rahman, Cecilia Han, Simon Yam, Lynn Hung Doi-Lam, Loletta Lee Lai-Chun, Wong Ka-Lok, Cheung Kwok-Keung', null, 'Legendary Hong Kong police officer Ho Ho-fai, known for his role as one of the Three Tigers, faces a dramatic fall from grace after a failed mission. Joining the Special Duties Unit, he and his team, including young officer Siu Tzu-tsun, fight to uncover and thwart a plot against Hong Kong’s financial system.', 'Legendary Hong Kong police officer Ho Ho-fai, known for his role as one of the Three Tigers, faces a dramatic fall from grace after a failed mission. Joining the Special Duties Unit, he and his team, including young officer Siu Tzu-tsun, fight to uncover and thwart a plot against Hong Kong’s financial system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wiHqv6PfBn5W1apAVbRVp2MTSsd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:263161'),
  ('1032644845252075403', 'Homemade', 2020, 'Drama, Documentary, Family', 'Lorenzo Mieli, Juan de Dios Larraín, Pablo Larraín', 'Pablo Larraín', null, null, 'Acclaimed filmmakers from around the world channel their creativity during COVID-19 isolation with this diverse, genre-spanning collection of short films.', 'Acclaimed filmmakers from around the world channel their creativity during COVID-19 isolation with this diverse, genre-spanning collection of short films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26GU1SxoQ70jTdLxje0spWjRo0V.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105465'),
  ('671213917843791397', 'Homes in Beautiful China', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Sa Beining', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4SUbscWaZUOqOg7MzpycyQly7UY.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:209588'),
  ('563745567085789683', 'Homes Under the Hammer', 2003, 'Reality', null, null, 'Martin Roberts, Dion Dublin, Martel Maxwell, Jacqui Joseph', 'TV-G', 'Homes Under the Hammer is a British renovation and auction series that originally screened on BBC One as part of the BBC''s morning television schedule, the series has been running since 2003. Its main presenters are Lucy Alexander and Martin Roberts, although in series three Marc Woodward and Jasmine Birtles alternated presenting duties with Alexander and Roberts. The series is the BBC''s most successful show in the 10:00am slot, regularly attaining a 30% market share for new episodes.', 'Homes Under the Hammer is a British renovation and auction series that originally screened on BBC One as part of the BBC''s morning television schedule, the series has been running since 2003. Its main presenters are Lucy Alexander and Martin Roberts, although in series three Marc Woodward and Jasmine Birtles alternated presenting duties with Alexander and Roberts. The series is the BBC''s most successful show in the 10:00am slot, regularly attaining a 30% market share for new episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fjIQyXPTmPnMsI8FGk9JSOcaZtb.jpg', 29, 'tmdb:tv:8106'),
  ('795416215244641829', 'Homestead Rescue', 2016, 'Reality, Drama, Family', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Expert homesteader, Marty Raney, along with his daughter Misty and son Matt, give struggling families a second chance at surviving off-the-grid. The stakes are high, but the Raney family is determined to prepare these families for nature’s worst and set them up for success.', 'Expert homesteader, Marty Raney, along with his daughter Misty and son Matt, give struggling families a second chance at surviving off-the-grid. The stakes are high, but the Raney family is determined to prepare these families for nature’s worst and set them up for success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8PnKfxI2KKuAT9Se3OI0DphusQe.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:68975'),
  ('681003670677480600', 'Homestead: The Series', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ross Kasica, Ben Kasica', null, 'Jill Wagner, Dawn Olivieri, Charles Esten, Bailey Chase, Sam Page, Kearran Giovanni, Tyler Lofton', 'TV-14', 'After a nuclear bomb detonates off the coast of Los Angeles, a once-pampered nation devolves into brutal chaos. Picking up where the film ends, the Homestead series follows the survivors within the Homestead as they clash against one another and the violent world outside.', 'After a nuclear bomb detonates off the coast of Los Angeles, a once-pampered nation devolves into brutal chaos. Picking up where the film ends, the Homestead series follows the survivors within the Homestead as they clash against one another and the violent world outside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ani2DqDFLqKC4zPqvsPdfft13Fk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:256106'),
  ('113999063805680003', 'Hometown', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, 'Cho Hyun-hoon', 'You Chea-myung, Han Ye-ri, Um Tae-goo, Kim Sae-byuk, Choi Gwang-il, Lee Re, Park Mi-hyeon, Kim Yae-eun', 'TV-MA', 'A mystery evil thriller which finds the truth of a recording tape containing mysterious serial killings and unidentified sounds in a small city.', 'A mystery evil thriller which finds the truth of a recording tape containing mysterious serial killings and unidentified sounds in a small city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/on01rDIOO7uV4wyaOEf8nktma40.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128184'),
  ('777971558872443783', 'Hometown Cha-Cha-Cha', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yu Je-won, Shin Ha-eun', null, 'Shin Min-a, Kim Seon-ho, Lee Sang-yi, Gong Min-jeung, Kim Yeong-ok, Cho Han-cheul, In Gyo-jin, Lee Bong-ryeon', 'TV-14', 'A big-city dentist opens up a practice in a close-knit seaside village, home to a charming jack-of-all-trades who is her polar opposite in every way.', 'A big-city dentist opens up a practice in a close-knit seaside village, home to a charming jack-of-all-trades who is her polar opposite in every way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/en6lrlJ1DhyvkeZEqrk3R6EJz1p.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128883'),
  ('946518882580384337', 'Hometown Over the Hill', 2007, 'Drama, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Woo Hee-jin, Kim Chang-sook, Seo Tae-hwa, Lee Yoon-jeong, Lee Hye-ri', null, 'By depicting the dreams of people living in farming villages, this drama also reveals problems that today’s residents of rural areas face, such as a growing number of biracial children from international marriages and the cutthroat competition to survive.', 'By depicting the dreams of people living in farming villages, this drama also reveals problems that today’s residents of rural areas face, such as a growing number of biracial children from international marriages and the cutthroat competition to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKwEQ2sfHCGLGKTVneau5wGfEmX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62915'),
  ('843075631636824452', 'Hometown Romance', 2026, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Punyapat Wangpongsathaporn, Saranphat Pedersen, Thanyares Chamnan, Pisanu Chutanimsakul, Supakson Ruengsomboon, Narupornkamol Chaisang, Supanut Satpan', null, 'Si, a high-society heiress, dreams of becoming the president of her family’s company. However, her parents give the position to her younger sister instead, believing Si is too spoiled and irresponsible, spending millions without a second thought. When the family business faces a crisis involving a crucial land lease renewal, negotiations fail—until Klaokavee, the landowner, makes an unusual proposal: she will renew the lease only if Si agrees to marry her. Despite their completely opposite lifestyles, this strange arrangement brings the two into an unexpected and complicated relationship.', 'Si, a high-society heiress, dreams of becoming the president of her family’s company. However, her parents give the position to her younger sister instead, believing Si is too spoiled and irresponsible, spending millions without a second thought. When the family business faces a crisis involving a crucial land lease renewal, negotiations fail—until Klaokavee, the landowner, makes an unusual proposal: she will renew the lease only if Si agrees to marry her. Despite their completely opposite lifestyles, this strange arrangement brings the two into an unexpected and complicated relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c09fgysDXjEqzNRPlXuQKIm5n5y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:312583'),
  ('1095842282112730758', 'Homicide', 1964, 'Drama, Crime, Action & Adventure', 'Hector Crawford, Dorothy Crawford', null, 'Charles Tingwell, Don Barker, Gary Day, Dennis Grosvenor', null, 'Homicide was an Australian television police drama series The series dealt with the homicide squad of the Victorian Police force and the various crimes and cases the detectives are called upon to investigate. Many episodes were based on real life crime cases.', 'Homicide was an Australian television police drama series The series dealt with the homicide squad of the Victorian Police force and the various crimes and cases the detectives are called upon to investigate. Many episodes were based on real life crime cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vL44ejhfQ7xmEDXwvugeNdM4E0b.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:5291'),
  ('495085862627775338', 'Homicide', 2024, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Detectives and prosecutors revisit their most challenging homicide cases in this chilling true-crime docuseries.', 'Detectives and prosecutors revisit their most challenging homicide cases in this chilling true-crime docuseries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/byh0uHyYoGjkPL9ULhLyAbnfTPX.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:248126'),
  ('742660760878769996', 'Homicide Hills', 2008, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Marie Reiners', null, 'Katharina Wackernagel, Sebastian Schwarz, Eva Bühnen, Petra Kleinert, Michael Hanemann', null, 'Mord mit Aussicht is a German satirical crime comedy television series, produced by ARD, following the adventures of Sophie Haas, a detective from the city that takes a job in the fictional country village of Hengasch. Much of the humour of the series derives from the clichés of both city and provincial lives, in a similar manner to the English comedy crime series Midsomer Murders.', 'Mord mit Aussicht is a German satirical crime comedy television series, produced by ARD, following the adventures of Sophie Haas, a detective from the city that takes a job in the fictional country village of Hengasch. Much of the humour of the series derives from the clichés of both city and provincial lives, in a similar manner to the English comedy crime series Midsomer Murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFTMFU2T9OpI9WsNJnJFjT9CAPl.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:41132'),
  ('1065433939237090399', 'Homicide Hunter: American Detective', 2021, 'Crime, Documentary', null, null, 'Joe Kenda', 'TV-14', 'Joe Kenda trades in his own case files to bring viewers astounding investigations from across the country, with each episode featuring a different homicide detective whose tireless efforts helped put a killer behind bars and bring justice for the victim.', 'Joe Kenda trades in his own case files to bring viewers astounding investigations from across the country, with each episode featuring a different homicide detective whose tireless efforts helped put a killer behind bars and bring justice for the victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mqqyNjcC2FNHyEKQYhk636fX6YR.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:116106'),
  ('352021947766246721', 'Homicide Hunter: Lt Joe Kenda', 2011, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Joe Kenda', null, 'Joe Kenda, Carl Marino, Josh Casaubon', 'TV-14', 'A non-fiction investigative series of murder cases told through the personal experience of retired detective, Lieutenant Joe Kenda. Through re-enactments, discussions with investigation teams, and interviews with victims'' families and other involved persons, the show highlights Kenda''s successes with his 400 homicide case history and 92 percent solution rate.', 'A non-fiction investigative series of murder cases told through the personal experience of retired detective, Lieutenant Joe Kenda. Through re-enactments, discussions with investigation teams, and interviews with victims'' families and other involved persons, the show highlights Kenda''s successes with his 400 homicide case history and 92 percent solution rate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6QDuvq9GDGpau3lksoedlfNV4OZ.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:62168'),
  ('429585330884246899', 'Homicide: Life on the Street', 1993, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Paul Attanasio', null, 'Richard Belzer, Peter Gerety, Giancarlo Esposito, Clark Johnson, Yaphet Kotto, Kyle Secor, Jon Seda, Callie Thorne', 'TV-14', 'An American police procedural chronicling the work of a fictional version of the Baltimore Police Department''s Homicide Unit.', 'An American police procedural chronicling the work of a fictional version of the Baltimore Police Department''s Homicide Unit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nb5310xlFjx5r9TnpKoaOTQsAlP.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:4464'),
  ('726252072185088741', 'Hondo', 1967, 'Western', null, null, 'Ralph Taeger, Kathie Browne, Noah Beery Jr., Gary Clarke, Michael Pate, William Bryant, Buddy Foster, Spike', null, 'Hondo is a 17-episode Western television series starring Ralph Taeger that aired in the United States on ABC during the 1967 fall season. The series was produced by Batjac Productions, Inc., Fenady Associates, Inc., and Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer Television.', 'Hondo is a 17-episode Western television series starring Ralph Taeger that aired in the United States on ABC during the 1967 fall season. The series was produced by Batjac Productions, Inc., Fenady Associates, Inc., and Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer Television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6QemSOG9GTimkAzICjB2LXind9p.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13294'),
  ('490619693440471580', 'Honey and Clover', 2005, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Hiroshi Kamiya, Haruka Kudou, Mikako Takahashi, Tomokazu Sugita, Keiji Fujiwara', null, 'Takemoto Yuuta, Mayama Takumi, and Morita Shinobu are college students who share the small apartment. Even though they live in poverty, the three of them are able to obtain pleasure through small things in life. The story follows these characters'' life stories as poor college students, as well as their love lives when a short but talented 18 year old girl called Hanamoto Hagumi appears.', 'Takemoto Yuuta, Mayama Takumi, and Morita Shinobu are college students who share the small apartment. Even though they live in poverty, the three of them are able to obtain pleasure through small things in life. The story follows these characters'' life stories as poor college students, as well as their love lives when a short but talented 18 year old girl called Hanamoto Hagumi appears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uBYTLOXojpbNZ7jaL65dUoKbfko.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:35415'),
  ('210267866852141697', 'Honey Girls', 2017, 'Drama', 'Nathalie Scharf, Christopher Silber, Andreas Drost', 'Natalie Scharf, Chris Silber', 'Cornelia Gröschel, Sonja Gerhardt, Anja Kling, Götz Schubert, Franz Dinda, Peter Jordan, Stipe Erceg, Alice Dwyer', null, 'The summer of 1986 begins on a promising note for Erfurt sisters Catrin and Maja Streesemann – they’ve finally received a travel permit for their first holiday at Lake Balaton. The only thing is, they have no idea that they’re being watched by the Stasi as the spies in swimming trunks of the Balaton Brigade have been watching out for East Germans attempting to escape to the West, with the holiday resort as a starting point. Catrin is quick to make new friends at the campsite, especially winsome Rudi from Mühlhausen, whose overtures clearly aim for more than just friendship; younger Maja is magically attracted to the glamour of the elegant Balaton-Residenz luxury hotel where only Western tourists are allowed to stay. Fate leads them not only into the Balaton-Residenz, but also to Tamás, the Hungarian hotel boss. Catrin immediately falls for the charming Hungarian, but Maja is the one to steal a kiss from him at the first opportunity, casting a shadow on the sisters’ otherwise close relationship. And the next disaster comes along, as their mother Kirsten has every reason to believe that her daughters’ trip to Hungary could wreak havoc on the family after an ominous phone call from Hungary. Using a pretext, she persuades her husband Karl to start the Trabant and drive after Maja and Catrin.', 'The summer of 1986 begins on a promising note for Erfurt sisters Catrin and Maja Streesemann – they’ve finally received a travel permit for their first holiday at Lake Balaton. The only thing is, they have no idea that they’re being watched by the Stasi as the spies in swimming trunks of the Balaton Brigade have been watching out for East Germans attempting to escape to the West, with the holiday resort as a starting point. Catrin is quick to make new friends at the campsite, especially winsome Rudi from Mühlhausen, whose overtures clearly aim for more than just friendship; younger Maja is magically attracted to the glamour of the elegant Balaton-Residenz luxury hotel where only Western tourists are allowed to stay. Fate leads them not only into the Balaton-Residenz, but also to Tamás, the Hungarian hotel boss. Catrin immediately falls for the charming Hungarian, but Maja is the one to steal a kiss from him at the first opportunity, casting a shadow on the sisters’ otherwise close relationship. And the next disaster comes along, as their mother Kirsten has every reason to believe that her daughters’ trip to Hungary could wreak havoc on the family after an ominous phone call from Hungary. Using a pretext, she persuades her husband Karl to start the Trabant and drive after Maja and Catrin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qQ13mO8faMcSt3culHQiUR5EwhN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71424'),
  ('840847105670256741', 'Honey Lemon Soda', 2025, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Kana Ichinose, Shogo Yano, Rie Takahashi, Miyari Nemoto, Shunichi Toki, Taku Yashiro', null, 'After middle school, with its bullying and nicknames, Uka Ishimori is excited for a fresh start at Hachimitsu High School. Kai Miura, a cool and uninhibited boy, sits next to her in class. Uka remembers she met Kai in middle school and with a single word, he had convinced her to attend Hachimitsu. Though he’s popular, Kai supports Uka in her efforts to fit in with her new classmates.', 'After middle school, with its bullying and nicknames, Uka Ishimori is excited for a fresh start at Hachimitsu High School. Kai Miura, a cool and uninhibited boy, sits next to her in class. Uka remembers she met Kai in middle school and with a single word, he had convinced her to attend Hachimitsu. Though he’s popular, Kai supports Uka in her efforts to fit in with her new classmates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mDFrr4qkA6RebrA1QzlaYFrZUF3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:247859'),
  ('901779240825500498', 'Honey West', 1965, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Gloria Fickling, Skip Fickling', null, 'Anne Francis, John Ericson', 'NR', 'After her father''s death, Honey West takes over his high-tech private-detective firm, assisted by rugged Sam Bolt--and her pet ocelot Bruce.', 'After her father''s death, Honey West takes over his high-tech private-detective firm, assisted by rugged Sam Bolt--and her pet ocelot Bruce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQSZkTRaDOAtYPFqVd6qay1Vsab.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14404'),
  ('334831612850231846', 'Honey, I Shrunk the Kids: The TV Show', 1997, 'Comedy, Action & Adventure, Family', 'Ed Ferrara, Kevin Murphy', null, 'Peter Scolari, Barbara Alyn Woods, Hillary Tuck, Thomas Dekker, George Buza', 'TV-PG', 'The adventures of brilliant but befuddled scientist Wayne Szalinski, whose often-misguided projects wreak havoc on his family and friends.', 'The adventures of brilliant but befuddled scientist Wayne Szalinski, whose often-misguided projects wreak havoc on his family and friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g1NWIdQxYGlXC9SA8wkMSYvywJQ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1797'),
  ('874603828676980916', 'Hong Kong Phooey', 1974, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', null, null, 'Scatman Crothers, Joe E. Ross, Kathy Gori, Frank Welker, Paul Winchell, Daws Butler, Don Messick, Ed Peck', 'NR', 'Penrod Pooch leaps into action as Hong Kong Phooey to fight villains.', 'Penrod Pooch leaps into action as Hong Kong Phooey to fight villains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozPPRJZu1BkoMyu3ffpHsgdTfUe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10106'),
  ('740382084232675621', 'Hongmao and Lantu: Martial Arts Series', 2006, 'Kids, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Yan Ting, Rong Liu, Juan Liu, Huaiwu Zhang, Huaiwu Zhang, 梁实之', null, 'An animation series produced by Hongmeng Cartoon Communication Co., Ltd. There are two branches: martial arts series and preschool education series. And the martial arts series is China''s first animation series on the theme of traditional Chinese martial arts.', 'An animation series produced by Hongmeng Cartoon Communication Co., Ltd. There are two branches: martial arts series and preschool education series. And the martial arts series is China''s first animation series on the theme of traditional Chinese martial arts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/czRpQI9KSIQ385oyQftsLsw9iJE.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:103270'),
  ('198023915963168503', 'Honkai Impact 3rd Animation', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', '米哈游miHoYo', null, 'Tao Dian, Juhuahua, Hanser, Mace, Yan Ning, Lin Su, 蔡书瑾, Zhang Anqi', null, 'Animated Shorts by MiHoYo that are found in-game and on YouTube. Follow the adventures of Kiana Kaslana, Raiden Mei, and Bronya Zaychik along with their friends and foes as they confront the calamitous forces of evil called the Honkai and the Herrschers that lead its Will to unleash terrible destruction upon the Earth. The trio are a group of Schicksal Valkyries from Saint Freya Academy who must work with their allies leading the charge against Honkai such as Anti-Entropy along with their enemies the World Serpent to put an end to the everlasting power of the Honkai. Come fight for all that is beautiful in the world!', 'Animated Shorts by MiHoYo that are found in-game and on YouTube. Follow the adventures of Kiana Kaslana, Raiden Mei, and Bronya Zaychik along with their friends and foes as they confront the calamitous forces of evil called the Honkai and the Herrschers that lead its Will to unleash terrible destruction upon the Earth. The trio are a group of Schicksal Valkyries from Saint Freya Academy who must work with their allies leading the charge against Honkai such as Anti-Entropy along with their enemies the World Serpent to put an end to the everlasting power of the Honkai. Come fight for all that is beautiful in the world!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zZV8joBQAeSQ6YacMTyigz63jQg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128963'),
  ('1130076490826444700', 'Honobono Log', 2016, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Miyu Irino, Asami Seto', null, 'Based on an illustration book by Naka Fukamachi. The anime offers heartwarming peeks at the lives of close couples and families.', 'Based on an illustration book by Naka Fukamachi. The anime offers heartwarming peeks at the lives of close couples and families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhjAjkQibM2HhBEKiUgYWsENKux.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68405'),
  ('678779059831321026', 'Honor of Kings: Chapter of Glory', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Jing Xiang Shei Yi, Yun Hezhui, Xuan Xiaoming, Cai Na, Wei Zhai, Zhou Shuai', null, 'On the vast continent, heroes break through obstacles and chase their dreams. What are heroes like? They go beyond themselves and try to be perfect; They carry burdens forward and understand the true meaning of love; They advocate power and never give up. We write biographies of heroes and start a new chapter of love and courage. -WETV', 'On the vast continent, heroes break through obstacles and chase their dreams. What are heroes like? They go beyond themselves and try to be perfect; They carry burdens forward and understand the true meaning of love; They advocate power and never give up. We write biographies of heroes and start a new chapter of love and courage. -WETV', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/clau3P6P6MEljsngIZBsydaQfy8.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:243327'),
