  ('570481193931000751', 'Hu Tong', 2022, 'Drama', 'Fu Ning', 'Fu Ning', null, null, 'Spanning three generations, the story follows a family of women dedicated to serving their Beijing neighborhood, showcasing the evolution of Hutong culture. From the early days of liberation to the present, Tian Zao devotes her life to grassroots work, inspiring her daughter and granddaughter to carry on her legacy, reflecting the changing spirit of youth and community over time.', 'Spanning three generations, the story follows a family of women dedicated to serving their Beijing neighborhood, showcasing the evolution of Hutong culture. From the early days of liberation to the present, Tian Zao devotes her life to grassroots work, inspiring her daughter and granddaughter to carry on her legacy, reflecting the changing spirit of youth and community over time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ccLTprUzbKssgjA9rKlPMD0rcPz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210966'),
