  ('249485866315691634', 'Hubert ohne Staller', 2011, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Oliver Mielke, Philip Kaetner', null, 'Christian Tramitz, Michael Brandner, Katharina Müller-Elmau, Mitsou Jung, Paul Sedlmeir, Hannes Ringlstetter, Susu Padotzke', null, 'A show about two Bavarian police officers, Franz Hubert and Johannes Staller, who sometimes work a bit differently. Where Franz wants to follow regulations, Johannes likes to do things his own way.', 'A show about two Bavarian police officers, Franz Hubert and Johannes Staller, who sometimes work a bit differently. Where Franz wants to follow regulations, Johannes likes to do things his own way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zMLHamR1vQivmZvGwmGwwjzns0.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:53193'),
  ('1067520721875459864', 'Hububb', 1997, null, null, 'Ford Kiernan, Judi Dench', 'Elaine C. Smith', null, 'Hububb was a Children''s Television program broadcast on BBC One in the United Kingdom, it was named after Les Bubb who also played the title character with the same name. The Show ran from 1997 until 2001. Five series of the show were made. The Show was about a delivery man who lives in a tower in the center Edinburgh who kept getting into all sorts of bother, he is also known for using his trusty mountain bike which he uses for his work. The show was filmed and set in the Scottish Capital City, Edinburgh and the tower featured in the show was Melville Monument in St Andrew Square. Hububb was made by Nole Gay productions for BBC Scotland.', 'Hububb was a Children''s Television program broadcast on BBC One in the United Kingdom, it was named after Les Bubb who also played the title character with the same name. The Show ran from 1997 until 2001. Five series of the show were made. The Show was about a delivery man who lives in a tower in the center Edinburgh who kept getting into all sorts of bother, he is also known for using his trusty mountain bike which he uses for his work. The show was filmed and set in the Scottish Capital City, Edinburgh and the tower featured in the show was Melville Monument in St Andrew Square. Hububb was made by Nole Gay productions for BBC Scotland.', null, 5, 'tmdb:tv:24138'),
  ('267884281542235157', 'Huckleberry Finn and His Friends', 1980, 'Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Ian Tracey, Sammy Snyders, Brigitte Horney, Bernie Coulson, Blu Mankuma, Walter Marsh', null, 'Huckleberry Finn and His Friends was a 1979 television series documenting the exploits of Huckleberry Finn and Tom Sawyer, based on the novels The Adventures of Tom Sawyer and Adventures of Huckleberry Finn by American writer Mark Twain. The series was made up of 26 episodes and was a Canadian/German coproduction. Huckleberry Finn is played by Ian Tracey who is also the narrator. Tom Sawyer is played by Sammy Snyders. Directed by Jack B. Hively and Ken Jubenvill, this mini-series was broadcast in many countries such as Germany, UK, Australia, Canada, South Africa, Venezuela and many other Latin American nations. The series was re-shown many times during the 1980s to early 1990s and has grown somewhat of a cult following. Even though Mark Twain originally wrote the books The Adventures of Tom Sawyer and The Adventures of Huckleberry Finn as separate units, this mini-series conjures up both literary works as only one story. Therefore, it places greater importance on Huckleberry''s character without putting aside Tom Sawyer''s. In 2007, the complete series was released as a 4 DVD box set by Fabulous Films in the UK. It contains many extras including a 12 page color booklet and a 30 minute ''making of'' documentary featuring interviews with many stars of the series including Sammy Snyders, Ian Tracey, and Blu Mankuma.', 'Huckleberry Finn and His Friends was a 1979 television series documenting the exploits of Huckleberry Finn and Tom Sawyer, based on the novels The Adventures of Tom Sawyer and Adventures of Huckleberry Finn by American writer Mark Twain. The series was made up of 26 episodes and was a Canadian/German coproduction. Huckleberry Finn is played by Ian Tracey who is also the narrator. Tom Sawyer is played by Sammy Snyders. Directed by Jack B. Hively and Ken Jubenvill, this mini-series was broadcast in many countries such as Germany, UK, Australia, Canada, South Africa, Venezuela and many other Latin American nations. The series was re-shown many times during the 1980s to early 1990s and has grown somewhat of a cult following. Even though Mark Twain originally wrote the books The Adventures of Tom Sawyer and The Adventures of Huckleberry Finn as separate units, this mini-series conjures up both literary works as only one story. Therefore, it places greater importance on Huckleberry''s character without putting aside Tom Sawyer''s. In 2007, the complete series was released as a 4 DVD box set by Fabulous Films in the UK. It contains many extras including a 12 page color booklet and a 30 minute ''making of'' documentary featuring interviews with many stars of the series including Sammy Snyders, Ian Tracey, and Blu Mankuma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lvhrlLy8blTYaouivzhQQWTTnuw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3312'),
  ('1131357139470393512', 'Hudson & Rex', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Ken Cuperus', null, 'John Reardon, Mayko Nguyen, Kevin Hanchard, Justin Kelly, Luke Roberts', 'TV-PG', 'Detective Charlie Hudson teams up with what he calls his "highly trained law enforcement animal" German Shepherd dog named Rex who he prefers to team up with because he doesn''t talk his ear off.', 'Detective Charlie Hudson teams up with what he calls his "highly trained law enforcement animal" German Shepherd dog named Rex who he prefers to team up with because he doesn''t talk his ear off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5N985pVvDC41QwEprORSoGz3Q5.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:87940'),
  ('697052418940782437', 'Huff', 2004, 'Drama', 'Bob Lowry', null, 'Hank Azaria, Paget Brewster, Oliver Platt, Anton Yelchin, Andy Comeau, Blythe Danner, Faith Prince, Liza Lapira', 'TV-MA', 'Dr. Craig Huffstodt, a family man and a successful psychiatrist, gets a wake-up call after a tragedy occurs with one of his patients.', 'Dr. Craig Huffstodt, a family man and a successful psychiatrist, gets a wake-up call after a tragedy occurs with one of his patients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4SlzMxpiXHN7k0UhHx3h0128eVO.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2302'),
  ('276775942451695422', 'HUG! Pretty Cure', 2018, 'Comedy, Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family, Kids', null, null, 'Rie Hikisaka, Rina Honnizumi, Yui Ogura, Nao Tamura, Yukari Tamura, Konomi Tada, Junko Noda, Jun Fukushima', null, 'Nono Hana is a middle school student who encounters a baby named Hug-tan and her guardian, Harry, who fell from the sky. Hana learns that they have been pursued by the evil Criasu Corporation, who wants Hug-tan''s Mirai Crystal and change the present. Protecting Hug-tan causes Hana to gain her own Mirai Crystal and transform into the Pretty Cure of High Spirits, Cure Yell.', 'Nono Hana is a middle school student who encounters a baby named Hug-tan and her guardian, Harry, who fell from the sky. Hana learns that they have been pursued by the evil Criasu Corporation, who wants Hug-tan''s Mirai Crystal and change the present. Protecting Hug-tan causes Hana to gain her own Mirai Crystal and transform into the Pretty Cure of High Spirits, Cure Yell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xY8RG5C7X28g9v8l8mBK137L2ER.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76866'),
  ('394858672068102709', 'Huge in France', 2019, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Gad Elmaleh, Jordan Ver Hoeve, Matthew Del Negro, Erinn Hayes', null, 'Famous comedian Gad Elmaleh moves to LA to reconnect with his son and must learn to live without the celebrity perks he''s accustomed to in France.', 'Famous comedian Gad Elmaleh moves to LA to reconnect with his son and must learn to live without the celebrity perks he''s accustomed to in France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vj2tyu2SY0pIzToqWpiXbht4NBE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87799'),
  ('284017654539559536', 'Hugo Chávez, El Comandante', 2017, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Moisés Naím', null, 'Andrés Parra, Julián Román, José Narvaez, Stephanie Cayo, César Manzano, Sheila Monterola, Albi De Abreu, Kristina Lilley', 'NR', 'The life of Hugo Chavez; from childhood, his arrival to power, confrontations, and loves to his last days as president.', 'The life of Hugo Chavez; from childhood, his arrival to power, confrontations, and loves to his last days as president.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sEThDZHGrhD6UPDVnP7skTAa6mF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69998'),
  ('773763154357300254', 'Hui Gumm Yaadein - Ek Doctor Do Zindagiyaan', 2026, 'Drama, Soap', 'Smruti Sushilkumar Shinde, Harvinder Arora', null, 'Mohammed Iqbal Khan, Gulki Joshi, Shrishti Singh, Devish Ahuja', null, 'Hui Gumm Yaadein - Ek Doctor, Do Zindagiyaan brings to Indian television a deeply moving story of a brilliant doctor whose life is turned upside down after a traumatic incident wipes away years of his memory. Based on a real-life story, this drama follows Dr. Dev Mehta a once-brilliant head physician who, after being shot, wakes up with no recollection of the past 8 years. He is forced to relearn medicine, reconnect with estranged loved ones, and rediscover his identity. Dr. Dev is sharp, instinctive, and exceptionally skilled but what truly defines him is his humanity. He heals people not just through medicine, but through presence and empathy. At its heart, Hui Gumm Yaadein is about second chances at life, relationships, and purpose', 'Hui Gumm Yaadein - Ek Doctor, Do Zindagiyaan brings to Indian television a deeply moving story of a brilliant doctor whose life is turned upside down after a traumatic incident wipes away years of his memory. Based on a real-life story, this drama follows Dr. Dev Mehta a once-brilliant head physician who, after being shot, wakes up with no recollection of the past 8 years. He is forced to relearn medicine, reconnect with estranged loved ones, and rediscover his identity. Dr. Dev is sharp, instinctive, and exceptionally skilled but what truly defines him is his humanity. He heals people not just through medicine, but through presence and empathy. At its heart, Hui Gumm Yaadein is about second chances at life, relationships, and purpose', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9XfZgKBY4JiKqV1MbCnryNNOgla.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:318842'),
  ('397916963479505053', 'Hulk Hogan''s Rock ''n'' Wrestling', 1985, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Brad Garrett, James Avery, Charlie Adler, Pat Fraley, Neil Ross, George DiCenzo, Aron Kincaid, Ron Gans', null, 'Hulk Hogan''s Rock ''n'' Wrestling is an American animated television series that originally aired on CBS Saturday mornings from September 14, 1985 to December 6, 1986, with reruns airing until June 27, 1987.', 'Hulk Hogan''s Rock ''n'' Wrestling is an American animated television series that originally aired on CBS Saturday mornings from September 14, 1985 to December 6, 1986, with reruns airing until June 27, 1987.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eAeXX4GX9JZd3AFlVFec94aPqP4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:11016'),
  ('333564700522724100', 'Hullraisers', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Lucy Beaumont, Anne Marie O''Connor, Caroline Moran', null, 'Leah Brotherhead, Sinéad Matthews, Taj Atwal', null, 'British sitcom adapted from the Israeli sitcom Little Mom. It follows the ups and downs of life, friendship and family for three women living in Hull - self-described actress Toni, her sister Paula and best friend Rana.', 'British sitcom adapted from the Israeli sitcom Little Mom. It follows the ups and downs of life, friendship and family for three women living in Hull - self-described actress Toni, her sister Paula and best friend Rana.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48Nnzpq5GFCtmkAeS4Hanp0qSlN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:196845'),
  ('841478083859419944', 'Hum Paanch', 1995, 'Comedy, Family', 'Ekta Kapoor', null, 'Ashok Saraf, Shoma Anand, Vandana Pathak, Rakhee Tandon, Bhairavi Raichura, Sharad Sharma, Pushtii Shakti, Suchitra Bandekar', 'TV-PG', 'Hum Paanch is the story of a middle-class white-collar worker, Anand Mathur, who always finds himself in trouble because of his five daughters — Meenakshi, Radhika, Sweety, Kajal, and Chhoti. The three elder daughters are Anand and his first wife''s children. The last two are Anand and Bina''s daughters. To make matters worse, his first wife is deceased but "haunts" him by speaking to him through her large wall-mounted portrait—usually to nag him or offer sarcastic advice. Living in a chaotic household with his second wife, Bina, Anand tries to maintain order while his daughters hatch various schemes, leading to hilarious misunderstandings and situational comedy.', 'Hum Paanch is the story of a middle-class white-collar worker, Anand Mathur, who always finds himself in trouble because of his five daughters — Meenakshi, Radhika, Sweety, Kajal, and Chhoti. The three elder daughters are Anand and his first wife''s children. The last two are Anand and Bina''s daughters. To make matters worse, his first wife is deceased but "haunts" him by speaking to him through her large wall-mounted portrait—usually to nag him or offer sarcastic advice. Living in a chaotic household with his second wife, Bina, Anand tries to maintain order while his daughters hatch various schemes, leading to hilarious misunderstandings and situational comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xvtC5WFrVtrJgasoVlTjyCtDM2S.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1146'),
  ('59668713423565467', 'Human', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Vipul Amrutlal Shah, Mozez Singh', 'Ishani Banerjee, Mozez Singh', 'Shefali Shah, Kirti Kulhari, Vikas Kumar, Ram Kapoor, Seema Biswas, Vishal Jethwa, Riddhi Kumar', 'TV-MA', 'In the race to make the next money-spinning drug, saving lives takes a backseat and people become less than human.', 'In the race to make the next money-spinning drug, saving lives takes a backseat and people become less than human.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/we2R9gUr8DEsLnllmvu6Xho1fX5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:154247'),
  ('143795773735670815', 'Human', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Ella Al-Shamahi, Melissa Massyn', null, 'Paleoanthropologist Ella Al-Shamahi reveals humanity''s incredible story across 300,000 years of human evolution – and how the story is stranger and more surprising than ever imagined.', 'Paleoanthropologist Ella Al-Shamahi reveals humanity''s incredible story across 300,000 years of human evolution – and how the story is stranger and more surprising than ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUbJv4IMynM14IMCYKb20ImqATl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:295261'),
  ('507081440646575440', 'Human Discoveries', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Anna Kendrick, Zac Efron, Jillian Bell, Lamorne Morris, James Adomian, Stephanie Beatriz, Ed Begley Jr., Sam Richardson', 'TV-14', 'A group of friends living at the dawn of human civilization are the first to discover necessities like fire and the wheel. We''ll watch as they stumble onto humanity''s best, and worst, innovations. Art. Alcohol. Fashion. Racism. Small talk. And, much to their confusion, monogamy.', 'A group of friends living at the dawn of human civilization are the first to discover necessities like fire and the wheel. We''ll watch as they stumble onto humanity''s best, and worst, innovations. Art. Alcohol. Fashion. Racism. Small talk. And, much to their confusion, monogamy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/177boqKzyy6DPay1sOYQfbmmMCH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90834'),
  ('332275297830917916', 'Human Giant', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Rob Huebel, Aziz Ansari, Paul Scheer', null, 'Paul Scheer, Rob Huebel, Aziz Ansari', null, 'Human Giant is a sketch comedy show on MTV, starring writer/performers Aziz Ansari, Rob Huebel, Paul Scheer and directed primarily by Jason Woliner. The show ran for two seasons. In interviews, the group has mentioned that they were offered a third season by MTV but were unable to complete it due to Ansari''s commitments to the hit NBC show Parks and Recreation. However, the group has stated that MTV has left the door open for the group to complete a third season at a later date or to produce a special for the network. In 2010, Ansari, Huebel and Scheer reunited to do a skit for the 2010 MTV Movie Awards. In November 2008, The Hollywood Reporter noted the group is currently developing a feature film with Red Hour Productions, the production company run by Ben Stiller and producer Stuart Cornfeld.', 'Human Giant is a sketch comedy show on MTV, starring writer/performers Aziz Ansari, Rob Huebel, Paul Scheer and directed primarily by Jason Woliner. The show ran for two seasons. In interviews, the group has mentioned that they were offered a third season by MTV but were unable to complete it due to Ansari''s commitments to the hit NBC show Parks and Recreation. However, the group has stated that MTV has left the door open for the group to complete a third season at a later date or to produce a special for the network. In 2010, Ansari, Huebel and Scheer reunited to do a skit for the 2010 MTV Movie Awards. In November 2008, The Hollywood Reporter noted the group is currently developing a feature film with Red Hour Productions, the production company run by Ben Stiller and producer Stuart Cornfeld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEuSf6Ur9EobO1i2vW5VJJJHQyr.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:4714'),
  ('823841608290101090', 'Human Planet', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Dale Templar, Brian Leith', null, 'John Hurt', null, 'A cinematic experience bringing you the most amazing human stories in the world. Humans and wildlife surviving in the most extreme environments on Earth.', 'A cinematic experience bringing you the most amazing human stories in the world. Humans and wildlife surviving in the most extreme environments on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bjhP5yIeyWMRMxJdLjBuiIf255X.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32062'),
