  ('860753303785604436', 'I Love You 2', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Clément Michel', 'Olivier Joyard, Jérôme Larcher', 'Catherine Salée, Camille Chamoux, Julia Faure, Olivier Barthélémy, François Vincentelli', null, 'At the age of 35, Hector happens to meet his childhood love Louise and falls in love with her all over again. But there''s a big problem. He''s gay and has been in a loving relationship with a man for several years. His life is turned upside down. He soon realizes that he doesn''t want to have to choose between his two loves, Louise and Jérémie. How long can he keep the secret of his double life, the cause of both suffering and joy?', 'At the age of 35, Hector happens to meet his childhood love Louise and falls in love with her all over again. But there''s a big problem. He''s gay and has been in a loving relationship with a man for several years. His life is turned upside down. He soon realizes that he doesn''t want to have to choose between his two loves, Louise and Jérémie. How long can he keep the secret of his double life, the cause of both suffering and joy?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gBkRyCu1ThfroJM8Zb1sRdB4EVa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78247'),
