  ('157244653431901988', 'I Love You, America', 2017, 'Talk, Comedy', null, null, 'Sarah Silverman', 'TV-MA', 'Follow Sarah Silverman as she looks to connect with people who may not agree with her personal opinions through honesty, humor, genuine interest in others and not taking herself too seriously. She feels that now more than ever it''s crucial to connect with un-like-minded people.', 'Follow Sarah Silverman as she looks to connect with people who may not agree with her personal opinions through honesty, humor, genuine interest in others and not taking herself too seriously. She feels that now more than ever it''s crucial to connect with un-like-minded people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJdaEBcceRq1g9Xo5zSjtNaoy4M.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74359'),
  ('518323845279966260', 'I Love You, and It Hurts', 2023, 'Drama', 'Cris Morena', null, 'Jorge Salinas, Marco de la O, Erika de la Rosa, Roberto Aguilar, Mar Sordo, César Díaz, Heider Moreno, María José Vargas', null, 'The story of Juan Gris and Lola Robles, two young people from parallel universes who will find themselves on the way to give rise to a world and a new version of themselves, and who, together with their friends, will pursue their dreams while seeking to discover who they are.', 'The story of Juan Gris and Lola Robles, two young people from parallel universes who will find themselves on the way to give rise to a world and a new version of themselves, and who, together with their friends, will pursue their dreams while seeking to discover who they are.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3vkLoub7HsZZj9e6YOlgQrxyITS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:231505'),
  ('220609596489077845', 'I love you, Güero', 2020, 'Family, Comedy, Soap, Drama', 'Kary Fajer', null, 'Itatí Cantoral, Juan Soler, Luis Roberto Guzmán, Jacqueline Andere, Gala Montes, Sian Chiong, Irán Castillo, Rodrigo Abed', 'TV-PG', '“La mexicana y el güero” is the story of some scammers who try to deceive a millionaire who is looking for his biological mother through a plan that is funny about what is complicated. Itatí Cantoral, Gala Montes, Juan Soler, Luis Roberto Guzmán, Montserrat Marañón, Jacqueline Andere, Rodrigo Abed and Laura Vignatti, among many other stars.', '“La mexicana y el güero” is the story of some scammers who try to deceive a millionaire who is looking for his biological mother through a plan that is funny about what is complicated. Itatí Cantoral, Gala Montes, Juan Soler, Luis Roberto Guzmán, Montserrat Marañón, Jacqueline Andere, Rodrigo Abed and Laura Vignatti, among many other stars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfedqxwVh2s7GVWQMM7QEnUs0Jb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107775'),
  ('1116481501314286098', 'I Love You, Now Die: The Commonwealth v. Michelle Carter', 2019, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Erin Lee Carr', null, 'Conrad Roy, Michelle Carter', 'TV-MA', 'Teen Michelle Carter’s actions shocked a nation — but what really happened behind closed doors?', 'Teen Michelle Carter’s actions shocked a nation — but what really happened behind closed doors?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5393uxK9aqVUNbrjyZgeqTlDTmD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87518'),
  ('30656076767689732', 'I Love You, You Hate Me', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Bob West, David Joyner, Dean Wendt, Carey Stinson, Steve Burns, Bill Nye, Pia Manalo Hamilton, Sheryl Leach', 'TV-14', 'A thought-provoking exploration of the spectacular rise and fall of Barney the Dinosaur’s furious backlash — and what it says about the human need to hate. From Barney-bashing to frat parties to homicidal video games, something in American society broke into a million pieces, and it’s never been put together again… or is this just who we were all along?', 'A thought-provoking exploration of the spectacular rise and fall of Barney the Dinosaur’s furious backlash — and what it says about the human need to hate. From Barney-bashing to frat parties to homicidal video games, something in American society broke into a million pieces, and it’s never been put together again… or is this just who we were all along?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u2vhKXPOLqlVT3lcmqHvyrb1HFf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211188'),
  ('735088005101364540', 'I Made Friends with the Second Prettiest Girl in My Class', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Haruki Ishiya, Manaka Iwami, Sayumi Suzushiro, Ikumi Hasegawa, Yuhko Kaida, Shizuka Itoh, Minami Tsuda', null, 'Maki Maehara, the class outcast, finally makes his first friend: Umi Asanagi, the second-prettiest girl in class and the center of everyone’s attention. He’s convinced she’s out of his league, but as their unlikely friendship grows, Maki starts to wonder…could there be more than just friendship between them?', 'Maki Maehara, the class outcast, finally makes his first friend: Umi Asanagi, the second-prettiest girl in class and the center of everyone’s attention. He’s convinced she’s out of his league, but as their unlikely friendship grows, Maki starts to wonder…could there be more than just friendship between them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJRG85Va7Vz0t0AM1TLiM3PN6tC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:290019'),
  ('673306503187303580', 'I Made It at Market', 2026, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Dominic Chinea', null, 'Dom Chinea revisits amazing makers who have turned their talents into life-changing businesses and finds out how much money they are earning from their skills.', 'Dom Chinea revisits amazing makers who have turned their talents into life-changing businesses and finds out how much money they are earning from their skills.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kuFDfR9cY2OW2wMbvGluj6W8ATP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317552'),
  ('937559261376469160', 'I manegen med Glenn Killing', 1992, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Robert Gustafsson, Jonas Inde, Henrik Schyffert, Johan Rheborg', null, 'I manegen med Glenn Killing was a Swedish television show broadcast by SVT in 1992. It marked the television debut of Swedish comedy group Killinggänget. The show''s basic formula is borrowed from Vic Reeves Big Night Out, with some sketches stolen almost verbatim, but mostly different content and a set of original characters including Percy Nilegård.', 'I manegen med Glenn Killing was a Swedish television show broadcast by SVT in 1992. It marked the television debut of Swedish comedy group Killinggänget. The show''s basic formula is borrowed from Vic Reeves Big Night Out, with some sketches stolen almost verbatim, but mostly different content and a set of original characters including Percy Nilegård.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9N0aoC302Xwzkg66kVQuXSefGWm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5828'),
  ('153054073331674024', 'I May Be a Guild Receptionist, but I''ll Solo Any Boss to Clock Out on Time', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Rie Takahashi, Kentaro Kumagai, Aoi Koga, Rikuya Yasuda, Yu Serizawa', 'TV-14', 'Alina thought she had found the perfect job as a guild receptionist. It’s stable, safe, and has a super cute uniform. But this dream gig turns into an overtime nightmare whenever adventurers get stuck clearing a dungeon. Tired of the long nights, Alina starts taking down the bosses herself! She even earns the name Executioner for her impressive skills. Can she keep her identity a secret?', 'Alina thought she had found the perfect job as a guild receptionist. It’s stable, safe, and has a super cute uniform. But this dream gig turns into an overtime nightmare whenever adventurers get stuck clearing a dungeon. Tired of the long nights, Alina starts taking down the bosses herself! She even earns the name Executioner for her impressive skills. Can she keep her identity a secret?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9WZ97NUkT0Gc7ro6kVw1qe4ItR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:249964'),
  ('972866129223380331', 'I May Destroy You', 2020, 'Drama', 'Michaela Coel', null, 'Michaela Coel, Weruche Opia, Paapa Essiedu', 'TV-MA', 'Set in London, where gratification is only an app away, the story centers on Arabella, a carefree, self-assured Londoner with a group of great friends, a boyfriend in Italy, and a burgeoning writing career. But when her drink is spiked, she must question and rebuild every element of her life.', 'Set in London, where gratification is only an app away, the story centers on Arabella, a carefree, self-assured Londoner with a group of great friends, a boyfriend in Italy, and a burgeoning writing career. But when her drink is spiked, she must question and rebuild every element of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9awmdcJsukBEY5Er8t4Vi1Ji7YX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:102619'),
  ('228604310613947111', 'I Need Romance', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Sung Joon, Ricky Kim, Kim So-yeon, Namkoong Min, Wang Ji-won, Park Hyo-ju, Park Yu-hwan, Yoon Seung-ah', null, 'Revolves around three thirty-something career women and their complicated love lives.', 'Revolves around three thirty-something career women and their complicated love lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrzOhySHUnOzFOcWcDCSvqOkbVS.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:43236'),
  ('1071903788213662536', 'I Parry Everything', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', null, null, 'Daiki Hamano, Ryoko Maekawa, Nanako Mori, Jin Yamanoi, Junta Terashima, Shin-ichiro Miki, Kenta Miyake, Megumi Toyoguchi', 'TV-14', 'Noor''s dead set on becoming an adventurer, even if the only skills he possesses are useless ones. Sure, he can [Parry] thousands of swords in the span of a single breath, but you need more than that if you want to be an adventurer! Right?', 'Noor''s dead set on becoming an adventurer, even if the only skills he possesses are useless ones. Sure, he can [Parry] thousands of swords in the span of a single breath, but you need more than that if you want to be an adventurer! Right?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nVmc8K5J7SGMlE6tA5lVzVzAzQ9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:238892'),
  ('879977114955719744', 'I Picked Up a Celebrity On the Street', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Kim Ga-eun, Sung Hoon, Kim Jong-hoon, Kang Seong-jin, Ji Ho-Sung, Park Soo-young, Han Eun-seon, Heo Joon-seok', null, 'Contract worker Lee Yeon Seo daydreams about teaching her manager a lesson, but accidentally acts out her fantasy on none other than top Hallyu star Kang Joon Hyuk. Thinking she killed him but afraid to be labeled a murderer, she takes him home and prepares to get rid of the body. But Joon Hyuk wakes up and seeing her preparations thinks he has been kidnapped by a murderous psychopath. Seeing no other option, she keeps him hostage so he doesn''t turn her in to the police. How long can she keep him hidden and can she ever convince him she''s not an evil person?', 'Contract worker Lee Yeon Seo daydreams about teaching her manager a lesson, but accidentally acts out her fantasy on none other than top Hallyu star Kang Joon Hyuk. Thinking she killed him but afraid to be labeled a murderer, she takes him home and prepares to get rid of the body. But Joon Hyuk wakes up and seeing her preparations thinks he has been kidnapped by a murderous psychopath. Seeing no other option, she keeps him hostage so he doesn''t turn her in to the police. How long can she keep him hidden and can she ever convince him she''s not an evil person?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rW4L7o4tfWQhthhnuimPteP51AX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84772'),
  ('697900407014060928', 'I Polykatoikia', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Vicky Alexopoulou, Constantine Ganosis', 'Vasilis Spiliopoulos, Vicky Alexopoulou, Angelos Hasapoglou', 'Martha Vourtsi, Antigoni Glykofridi, Dimitris Kouroubalis, Pavlos Haikalis, Vilma Tsakiri, Vasiliki Andritsou, Giannis Tsimitselis, Nikos Poursanidis', null, 'Comedy series in a building that people from different appartments always in trouble', 'Comedy series in a building that people from different appartments always in trouble', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5AGEvSbvsZoAuNasm7PE8EYzpyP.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:94198'),
