  ('254931350174961297', 'I Remember You', 2015, 'Mystery, Drama', null, 'Kwon Ki-young', 'Seo In-guk, Jang Na-ra, Park Bo-gum, Lee Chun-hee, Choi Won-young, Im Ji-eun, Min Sung-wook, Kim Jae-young', null, 'This drama is a romantic thriller that centers around a criminal profiler, Lee Hyun who previously work as a consultant at the police department in New York. After he returns to south Korea, he’s in charge of a special criminal investigation team. Due to his special insight, he can analyze the crime scene and the suspect at one glance. He works together with an elite detective, Cha Ji An to solve the crimes and they develop a romantic relationship.', 'This drama is a romantic thriller that centers around a criminal profiler, Lee Hyun who previously work as a consultant at the police department in New York. After he returns to south Korea, he’s in charge of a special criminal investigation team. Due to his special insight, he can analyze the crime scene and the suspect at one glance. He works together with an elite detective, Cha Ji An to solve the crimes and they develop a romantic relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1f0EKjQGCd5ip8TLJzDFOEDDdK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62933'),
  ('786427718448957365', 'I Saw You In My Dream', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Pitchaya Sukphat', null, 'Phubase Pratumrat, Ingkarat Damrongsakkul, Patchara Silapasoonthorn, Game Orarig Tanoi, Supranee Charoenpol', null, 'When his romantic dreams about his childhood rival start coming true, a stunned boy must face the fact that his sworn enemy is his soulmate.', 'When his romantic dreams about his childhood rival start coming true, a stunned boy must face the fact that his sworn enemy is his soulmate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ky7ZNXiP3TylHoxu6woV5b0KVV6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:242325'),
  ('191493523741525512', 'I Shall Survive Using Potions!', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Rin Kusumi, Tomoyo Takayanagi, Moeka Koizumi, Haruki Iwata, Natsuki Kitagawa', 'TV-14', 'A fatal mistake leads to the ultimate deal for this clever office lady. After her accidental demise by the gods, Kaoru is offered to be reborn into a new world. She agrees, but with a few demands to help her survive, including a younger body and the ability to create insanely overpowered potions! Now, she’s ready to make the most out of her next life.', 'A fatal mistake leads to the ultimate deal for this clever office lady. After her accidental demise by the gods, Kaoru is offered to be reborn into a new world. She agrees, but with a few demands to help her survive, including a younger body and the ability to create insanely overpowered potions! Now, she’s ready to make the most out of her next life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXejTl7hZEqHEUvPFI9WBZ9B0uQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:221148'),
  ('653437019617266084', 'I Shouldn''t Be Alive', 2005, 'Documentary, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, 'Nick Copus', null, null, 'The show features accounts of individuals and groups caught in dangerous scenarios, presented both through interviews and dramatic reenactments. The main focus is how the survivors survived and the decisions they made that kept them alive.', 'The show features accounts of individuals and groups caught in dangerous scenarios, presented both through interviews and dramatic reenactments. The main focus is how the survivors survived and the decisions they made that kept them alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5YZ3ksV26Ki6pwprVT0nVaPCwP.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:11882'),
  ('384744502170405148', 'I Spy', 1965, 'Action & Adventure', 'Morton S. Fine, David Friedkin', 'Morton S. Fine', 'Robert Culp, Bill Cosby', null, 'A pair of intelligence agents posing as a tennis pro and his coach go on secret missions around the world.', 'A pair of intelligence agents posing as a tennis pro and his coach go on secret missions around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJBy1DabmJriKJ0a3Xzl79IAvus.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:4899'),
  ('491032155732303392', 'I Survived a Zombie Apocalypse', 2015, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'I Survived a Zombie Apocalypse is a horror-themed game show set in the future after a nationwide epidemic has transformed most of the country''s population into ravenous zombies. The contestants have to survive in the Monroe Shopping Village and need to work together to secure their makeshift base as they try and avoid any contact with the flesh-eaters. Anybody still “alive” after seven days is then rescued and sent to a tropical quarantine zone as a reward.', 'I Survived a Zombie Apocalypse is a horror-themed game show set in the future after a nationwide epidemic has transformed most of the country''s population into ravenous zombies. The contestants have to survive in the Monroe Shopping Village and need to work together to secure their makeshift base as they try and avoid any contact with the flesh-eaters. Anybody still “alive” after seven days is then rescued and sent to a tropical quarantine zone as a reward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Gmv2GoWUMzlo9z8CQHhHKsafnV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62049'),
  ('495408534224344272', 'I Think You Should Leave with Tim Robinson', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Zach Kanin, Tim Robinson', null, 'Tim Robinson', 'TV-MA', 'There is no such thing as an ordinary interaction in this offbeat sketch comedy series that features a deep roster of guest stars.', 'There is no such thing as an ordinary interaction in this offbeat sketch comedy series that features a deep roster of guest stars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26fMaTPRczCrTUOQ5svA1Db7l4h.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:88728'),
  ('999565329230059151', 'I Told Sunset About You', 2020, 'Drama', 'Naruebet Kuno', null, 'Putthipong Assaratanakul, Krit Amnuaydechkorn, Oabnithi Wiwattanawarang, Arachaporn Pokinpakorn, Naphat Vikairungroj, Taninrat Wadsriwat, Sarit Trilertvichien, Kamolpipat Bunnag', null, 'Tender emotions and new yearnings awaken in childhood friends Teh and Oh-aew when they cross paths in a Chinese language class during senior year.', 'Tender emotions and new yearnings awaken in childhood friends Teh and Oh-aew when they cross paths in a Chinese language class during senior year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXaGaIntp84sNemeqHjm3Ua0W7e.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:106840'),
  ('257037946743853594', 'I Want to Be His Prey!', 2020, 'Animation', null, null, 'You Suzushiro, Marie Miyake, Daiki Abe', null, 'Having a run in with the "skirt bandit," Ookami almost has her skirt stolen. Her teacher, Akagashira, passes by and becomes her hero after stopping the theft. As thanks, Ookami invites Akagashira to her home, but she has another reason for bringing him over.', 'Having a run in with the "skirt bandit," Ookami almost has her skirt stolen. Her teacher, Akagashira, passes by and becomes her hero after stopping the theft. As thanks, Ookami invites Akagashira to her home, but she has another reason for bringing him over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRwRV4CzpC6KyW7WbE9OsjICIlD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106342'),
  ('938224498599662710', 'I Want to End This Love Game', 2026, 'Comedy, Animation', null, null, null, null, 'Childhood friends Yukiya and Miku share everything…except their feelings. Ever since sixth grade, they''ve played a "love game": they take turns saying "I love you" and whoever gets flustered first loses. Now in high school, their hearts are closer than ever—but will they finally find the courage to confess?', 'Childhood friends Yukiya and Miku share everything…except their feelings. Ever since sixth grade, they''ve played a "love game": they take turns saying "I love you" and whoever gets flustered first loses. Now in high school, their hearts are closer than ever—but will they finally find the courage to confess?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kK7T8DcXKWcYfR6Kvy0ouCBjMnU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:293697'),
  ('105162696329758359', 'I Want to Escape from Princess Lessons', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Haruka Shiraishi, Jun Fukuyama, Yuka Saitou, Wataru Hatano, Mie Sonozaki, Shun Horie, Rie Suegara, Shunichi Toki', 'TV-14', 'Leticia Dorman, daughter of a duke, is less than thrilled to be engaged to a crown prince. Betrothed since childhood and trained to be queen, she always hoped Prince Clarke would fall for someone else one day. So when he shows up at a ball with another woman, Lettie excitedly retreats to the countryside to start her new life—only for Clarke to appear, determined to win her heart.', 'Leticia Dorman, daughter of a duke, is less than thrilled to be engaged to a crown prince. Betrothed since childhood and trained to be queen, she always hoped Prince Clarke would fall for someone else one day. So when he shows up at a ball with another woman, Lettie excitedly retreats to the countryside to start her new life—only for Clarke to appear, determined to win her heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9i9V4kmO2jN6vRnnqQB4LpDHltD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:261311'),
  ('1036479870453048397', 'I Want to Get Married', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ghada Abdel Aal', null, 'Hend Sabry, Ahmed Fouad Selim, Sawsan Badr, Tarek El Ebiary, Ragaa Hussein, Caroline Khalil, Nadia Al Iraqiya, Gehan Anwar', 'TV-PG', 'The story of a pharmacist who wants to settle down and get married before reaching the age of thirty, and her family''s insistence that she accepts the first groom who proposes, as well as her hilarious stories and experience with the men who propose to her.', 'The story of a pharmacist who wants to settle down and get married before reaching the age of thirty, and her family''s insistence that she accepts the first groom who proposes, as well as her hilarious stories and experience with the men who propose to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1aXNDhFYoyvW1nNE1BMuiVU8YO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:53979'),
  ('273510220611877805', 'I Want You To Make a Disgusted Face and Show Me Your Underwear', 2018, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Shizuka Ishigami, Chinatsu Akasaki, Haruka Yoshimura, Sawako Hata, Aoi Koga, Yuki Nagano', 'TV-MA', 'A project where a number of women in different costumes show their panties while they make a disgusted face.', 'A project where a number of women in different costumes show their panties while they make a disgusted face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ljmg6AiM56PlV9aGLtIqfGOamUA.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:80867'),
  ('626788094221630075', 'I wanted to be a rock star', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Matteo Oleotto', null, 'Valentina Bellè, Sara Lazzaro, Fabrizio Costella, Giuseppe Battiston, Angela Finocchiaro, Anna Ferzetti, Riccardo Maria Manera, Francesco Di Raimondo', null, 'Olivia is a 27-year-old girl in an existential crisis who finds herself quickly becoming an adult and responsible to raise her twin girls alone and keep a slacker brother out of trouble. An accident opens her eyes to the fact that she has only one life and that, perhaps, it is worth trying to change it to realize some of the dreams that she has put aside.', 'Olivia is a 27-year-old girl in an existential crisis who finds herself quickly becoming an adult and responsible to raise her twin girls alone and keep a slacker brother out of trouble. An accident opens her eyes to the fact that she has only one life and that, perhaps, it is worth trying to change it to realize some of the dreams that she has put aside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qBVjZn2JoBgpd2AWTmVFlPpaTav.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:100576'),
  ('476564874073116349', 'I Was Reincarnated as the 7th Prince so I Can Take My Time Perfecting My Magical Ability', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Makoto Koichi, Fairouz Ai, Lynn, Akira Sekine, Rie Takahashi, Shun Horie, Yuya Hirose, Akane Kumada', null, 'Prince Lloyd wasn''t always a prince...in fact, his previous life is one he remembers perfectly: he was a sorcerer, of sorts. So when he was forced to reincarnate, he decided to continue his studies, prince of the realm or no! But his new life has its own sets of challenges...including being a 10-year-old! What''s the 7th prince/sorcerer to do?!', 'Prince Lloyd wasn''t always a prince...in fact, his previous life is one he remembers perfectly: he was a sorcerer, of sorts. So when he was forced to reincarnate, he decided to continue his studies, prince of the realm or no! But his new life has its own sets of challenges...including being a 10-year-old! What''s the 7th prince/sorcerer to do?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ruLkQB8i1yazHgO0QCWpyJRRTs9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213830'),
  ('872769779785743310', 'I Will Be Your Bloom', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Tsubasa Honda, Fumiya Takahashi, Ryubi Miyase, Keito Tsuna, Shoot Mori, Rintaro Hachimura, Haruka Kinami, Sara Shida', 'TV-PG', 'Asuka had once realized her goal to become a teacher, but after a gutting failure, she gives up her dream profession and becomes extremely withdrawn. After a series of events, she finds herself becoming a live-in housemother for a dorm… where the boy-band septet 8LOOM live together! At the dorm, she is reunited with her former student Dan—as a teacher, Asuka used to encourage him to go for his dreams. Inspired by Dan''s leadership in the band and his passion for making his dream come true, Asuka, too, regains the passion she had in her teaching days and comes to terms with her own failure.', 'Asuka had once realized her goal to become a teacher, but after a gutting failure, she gives up her dream profession and becomes extremely withdrawn. After a series of events, she finds herself becoming a live-in housemother for a dorm… where the boy-band septet 8LOOM live together! At the dorm, she is reunited with her former student Dan—as a teacher, Asuka used to encourage him to go for his dreams. Inspired by Dan''s leadership in the band and his passion for making his dream come true, Asuka, too, regains the passion she had in her teaching days and comes to terms with her own failure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kOpSamiDMfZLOiaGsh6OIIfIpPu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209459'),
  ('884226533854727710', 'I Will Find You a Better Home', 2020, 'Drama', null, 'Zhang Xin', 'Sun Li, Luo Jin, Zhang Meng, Tian Lei, Yang Haoyu, Sun Jiayu, Yan Xuejing, Hai Qing', null, '28-year old Fang Si Jin loves herself. She is a woman who sells houses, the regional manager of a famous real estate company. In a turn of events, she is sent to deal with one of their chain stores, which has been suffering from declining sales. The manager of that store is Xu Wen Dao, a "nobleman" who is kind and can''t bear to fire his underperforming employees. Fang Si Jin sees such benevolence as weak and useless. She manages to save the store using her cold, ruthless methods, but it loses its warm, inviting atmosphere. Fang Si Jin and Xu Wen Dao constantly butt heads over their different philosophies', '28-year old Fang Si Jin loves herself. She is a woman who sells houses, the regional manager of a famous real estate company. In a turn of events, she is sent to deal with one of their chain stores, which has been suffering from declining sales. The manager of that store is Xu Wen Dao, a "nobleman" who is kind and can''t bear to fire his underperforming employees. Fang Si Jin sees such benevolence as weak and useless. She manages to save the store using her cold, ruthless methods, but it loses its warm, inviting atmosphere. Fang Si Jin and Xu Wen Dao constantly butt heads over their different philosophies', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZTSaMWrzuqb4dck2NNRfqdyZbm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99693'),
  ('639361110133347375', 'I Will Knock You', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'KoreanRabbit', null, 'Atiwat Saengtien, Thanawat Uthaikitwanit, Arisara Wongchalee, Tanapak Jongjaiphar, Satita Sinsamnao, Sura Raphisirirat, Natcha Tohsuwanvanich, Chayapat Wiratyosin', null, 'Thi just wanted to tutor in peace. Instead, he angers a retro-styled gang leader and ends up face to face with Noey again—as his new student.', 'Thi just wanted to tutor in peace. Instead, he angers a retro-styled gang leader and ends up face to face with Noey again—as his new student.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kfilBJyNSiOST4QYjgZFD5IFU4M.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213785'),
  ('1121941037816678233', 'I Will Never Let You Go', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Ariel Lin, Vin Zhang, Austin Lin, Viann Zhang Xinyu, Tiara Huang, Sun Zujun, Hu Caihong, Gao Kaiyuan', null, 'A young wanderer with an extraordinary business sense and a masked hero saves her resulting in them falling in love. When the wanderer is revealed to be the Divine Maiden who will obtain a legendary treasure, various enemies hunt her down. She then lives life on the run and meets her savior who turns out to be the ambitious prince that wants to take the throne.', 'A young wanderer with an extraordinary business sense and a masked hero saves her resulting in them falling in love. When the wanderer is revealed to be the Divine Maiden who will obtain a legendary treasure, various enemies hunt her down. She then lives life on the run and meets her savior who turns out to be the ambitious prince that wants to take the throne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iK6y1zOMDh8YWUs0Rs4dsltDFv0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85593'),
  ('912468892101967653', 'I Will Not Live in the Shadow of My Father', 1996, 'Drama', null, null, null, null, 'The son of a big-time,self-made merchant revolts against his rich father and tries to break away from him to prove that he can be equally successful in his own way.', 'The son of a big-time,self-made merchant revolts against his rich father and tries to break away from him to prove that he can be equally successful in his own way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hN6TAz3WOYFbWQ1Qa6kVFcDw81.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:52697'),
  ('369861716217557735', 'I Will Not Work Overtime, Period!', 2019, 'Drama', null, 'Satoko Okudera', 'Yuriko Yoshitaka, Osamu Mukai, Yusuke Santamaria, Yuki Uchida, Dori Sakurada, Yuichi Nakamaru, Yuki Izumisawa, Tokio Emoto', null, 'Higashiyama Yui works as a director at Net Heroes, a web production company. Due to her workaholic father and bad experiences in the past, she loathes working overtime. Even 2 years ago, she broke off her engagement to Taneda Kotaro because he was a workaholic. At her job, Higashiyama Yui always leaves at the end of the regular working day and never works overtime. She tries to be as efficient as possible and productive during her normal working hours. After she leaves her office, Higashiyama Yui normally drinks beer at her regular Chinese restaurant. Her peaceful days begin to change after a new department head arrives at work.', 'Higashiyama Yui works as a director at Net Heroes, a web production company. Due to her workaholic father and bad experiences in the past, she loathes working overtime. Even 2 years ago, she broke off her engagement to Taneda Kotaro because he was a workaholic. At her job, Higashiyama Yui always leaves at the end of the regular working day and never works overtime. She tries to be as efficient as possible and productive during her normal working hours. After she leaves her office, Higashiyama Yui normally drinks beer at her regular Chinese restaurant. Her peaceful days begin to change after a new department head arrives at work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eC5qmcIGe6USkJ5v7KdcA1HqTyZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88646'),
  ('535875064664879201', 'I Woke Up a Vampire', 2023, 'Comedy, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Thomas W. Lynch', null, 'Kaileen Angelic Chang, Niko Ceci, Zebastin Borjeau, Aaliyah Cinello, Ipsita Paul, Rainbow Sun Francks, Jayd Deroché, Kris Siddiqi', 'TV-G', 'On her 13th birthday, Carmie discovers that she''s actually half human, half vampire — and that mythical powers make middle school way more complicated.', 'On her 13th birthday, Carmie discovers that she''s actually half human, half vampire — and that mythical powers make middle school way more complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUIYzEqMkcQeQIDGU86t2NPRH3E.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:235228'),
  ('323472571918614991', 'I-LAND', 2020, 'Reality', 'Bang Si-hyuk', null, 'Song Kang, Sung Hanbin, TAEYANG, Monika, Leejung Lee, VVN, 24', null, 'I-LAND (아이랜드) is a South Korean boy group reality survival show produced by Mnet and organized by Belift Lab, which at the time of airing was a joint venture between entertainment companies CJ ENM and HYBE. It premiered on June 26, 2020 and broadcasted every Friday at 11 p.m. KST on Mnet. A second season, I-Land 2, was expected to premiere in the first half of 2022 featuring female trainees; however, on July 15, 2022, it was announced that it would be postponed. Instead in 2023, HYBE partnered with JTBC to produce R U Next? featuring trainees who would debut in Illit, signing with Belift Lab, becoming labelmates with Enhypen. On July 24, 2023, Mnet announced the second season titled I-Land 2: N/⍺, not in affiliation with Hybe or Belift Lab, featuring female trainees. The show started airing in April 2024, and is collaborating with The Black Label, with the final lineup debuting in WakeOne.', 'I-LAND (아이랜드) is a South Korean boy group reality survival show produced by Mnet and organized by Belift Lab, which at the time of airing was a joint venture between entertainment companies CJ ENM and HYBE. It premiered on June 26, 2020 and broadcasted every Friday at 11 p.m. KST on Mnet. A second season, I-Land 2, was expected to premiere in the first half of 2022 featuring female trainees; however, on July 15, 2022, it was announced that it would be postponed. Instead in 2023, HYBE partnered with JTBC to produce R U Next? featuring trainees who would debut in Illit, signing with Belift Lab, becoming labelmates with Enhypen. On July 24, 2023, Mnet announced the second season titled I-Land 2: N/⍺, not in affiliation with Hybe or Belift Lab, featuring female trainees. The show started airing in April 2024, and is collaborating with The Black Label, with the final lineup debuting in WakeOne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUFsaPjU5ovAvobWjRic94LEVf6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:105301'),
  ('794348390415144508', 'I, Addict', 2024, 'Drama', 'Javier Giner, Aitor Gabilondo', null, 'Oriol Pla, Nora Navas, Ramón Barea, Marina Salas, Itziar Lazkano, Bernabé Fernández, Catalina Sopelana, Victoria Luengo', null, 'Javier Giner, a thirty-year-old audiovisual professional, voluntarily checks himself into a rehabilitation center due to his alcohol and cocaine use. Armed with his personal journal and complete determination to reverse the path he''s going down, Javier faces what is undoubtedly the key moment of his life. The months of recovery in the rehab center, surrounded by nature and a cast of memorable characters, completely change Javier Giner''s life.', 'Javier Giner, a thirty-year-old audiovisual professional, voluntarily checks himself into a rehabilitation center due to his alcohol and cocaine use. Armed with his personal journal and complete determination to reverse the path he''s going down, Javier faces what is undoubtedly the key moment of his life. The months of recovery in the rehab center, surrounded by nature and a cast of memorable characters, completely change Javier Giner''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uoyfyNdelsw7svi2WLZx8Cb0R0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:226071'),
  ('34188261422660039', 'I, Claudius', 1976, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Martin Lisemore, Herbert Wise, Jack Pulman', null, 'Derek Jacobi', 'TV-14', 'Acclaimed blackly comic historical drama series. Set amidst a web of power, corruption and lies, it chronicles the reigns of the Roman emperors - Augustus, Tiberius, Caligula and finally Claudius.', 'Acclaimed blackly comic historical drama series. Set amidst a web of power, corruption and lies, it chronicles the reigns of the Roman emperors - Augustus, Tiberius, Caligula and finally Claudius.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oztxNqan7wKvFuCDS55WyUmKNMU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5487'),
  ('339223557290838974', 'I, Jack Wright', 2025, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Chris Lang', 'Chris Lang', 'Nikki Amuka-Bird, Daniel Rigby, Gemma Jones, John Simm, Zoë Tapper, Ruby Ashbourne Serkis, Harry Lloyd, Liz Kingsman', null, 'Explosive events unfold after Wright family patriarch Jack is discovered dead from a supposed suicide, leaving his immediate family utterly devastated.', 'Explosive events unfold after Wright family patriarch Jack is discovered dead from a supposed suicide, leaving his immediate family utterly devastated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWo8QNGADcVRFiWFn0vDE8u9BQS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:262899'),
  ('1133771400887456503', 'I''ll Be Gone in the Dark', 2020, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Liz Garbus', null, 'Amy Ryan', 'TV-MA', 'An exploration of the case of the Golden State Killer who terrorized California in the 1970s and 1980s, committing 50 sexual assaults and 10 murders, and true crime author Michelle McNamara''s obsessive quest to find justice on behalf of his victims.', 'An exploration of the case of the Golden State Killer who terrorized California in the 1970s and 1980s, committing 50 sexual assaults and 10 murders, and true crime author Michelle McNamara''s obsessive quest to find justice on behalf of his victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wP8ypum7Jpy1UBfR6HLxdvMkqX6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103023'),
  ('904821370392054205', 'I''ll Become a Villainess Who Goes Down in History', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Kanna Nakamura, Kaito Ishikawa, Manaka Iwami, Hiroshi Yanaka, Rumi Okubo, Haruki Ishiya, Kaede Hondo, Rie Takahashi', 'TV-14', 'This young girl hates all those goodie-two-shoes heroines. So when she’s reincarnated as Alicia, the villain in her favorite fantasy dating sim, it’s like a dream come true! There’s just one problem: the more she tries to be evil, the more the prince seems to fall for her. Alicia will have to work much harder if she ever wants to become the world’s greatest villainess.', 'This young girl hates all those goodie-two-shoes heroines. So when she’s reincarnated as Alicia, the villain in her favorite fantasy dating sim, it’s like a dream come true! There’s just one problem: the more she tries to be evil, the more the prince seems to fall for her. Alicia will have to work much harder if she ever wants to become the world’s greatest villainess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lTDWs3IjKwiBz00c8bzVmrgLa3A.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:248817'),
  ('697437155326678808', 'I''ll come sleep at your house', 2005, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Antoine de Maximy', null, 'J''irai dormir chez vous (meaning "I''ll come sleep at your house") is a French travel documentary series aired on French TV channels Canal+, France 5 and Voyage. It is hosted by Antoine de Maximy. Each episode features self-recorded videos from the solo trip of the host in a country. The aim of the host is to try to dine and stay the night with the locals, to discover the local trends and way of life.', 'J''irai dormir chez vous (meaning "I''ll come sleep at your house") is a French travel documentary series aired on French TV channels Canal+, France 5 and Voyage. It is hosted by Antoine de Maximy. Each episode features self-recorded videos from the solo trip of the host in a country. The aim of the host is to try to dine and stay the night with the locals, to discover the local trends and way of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVLXGinI1TYsfCy0bk8r65E7EVz.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:64981'),
  ('117727515061718685', 'I''ll Do Better Next Life', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Rio Uchida, Yuta Koseki, Rina Ohta, Takenori Goto, Tsubasa Tobinaga', null, 'Omori Momoe is twenty-seven-years-old, single and works at Studio Delta. She is thin and attractive. She should be courting suitors and taking her pick of the crop. Well, actually she does. She is having sex despite being single. In fact, she is making herself available sexually to five different men. to her it is just a disposable and habitual object of pleasure. She is sensual, sexy and adds the pleasure of sex toys to her repertoire of pleasures.', 'Omori Momoe is twenty-seven-years-old, single and works at Studio Delta. She is thin and attractive. She should be courting suitors and taking her pick of the crop. Well, actually she does. She is having sex despite being single. In fact, she is making herself available sexually to five different men. to her it is just a disposable and habitual object of pleasure. She is sensual, sexy and adds the pleasure of sex toys to her repertoire of pleasures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9O0hJHaVUzu0r7Z3Q7zpyVfVl7B.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:98971'),
  ('1103089427981850751', 'I''ll Get You!', 1969, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Arkadiy Khayt, Aleksandr Kurlyandskiy, Felix Kandel', 'Aleksandr Kurlyandskiy, Felix Kandel, Arkadiy Khayt', 'Anatoliy Papanov, Klara Rumyanova', null, 'Follows the comical adventures of a mischievous yet artistic wolf [Volk], trying to catch a hare [Zayats]. The series has additional characters that usually either help the hare or interfere with the wolf''s plans', 'Follows the comical adventures of a mischievous yet artistic wolf [Volk], trying to catch a hare [Zayats]. The series has additional characters that usually either help the hare or interfere with the wolf''s plans', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evPwhhd8nnlLEaKlj35HtWDPOLk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6138'),
  ('254565354283529073', 'I''ll Make a Habit of It', 1994, 'Animation, Comedy', null, 'Takeshi Shudo', 'Chinami Nishimura, Nobutoshi Canna, Koji Tsujitani, Chieko Honda, Akira Ishida, Nobuo Tobita, Takuma Suzuki, Akio Suyama', null, 'Idol Shiratori Nagisa misses combat and martial arts, so she dresses up as a schoolboy and enrolls in the most roughed-up school she can find. She develops a crush on one guy, who...thinks she''s a boy... But it works out. Now she has to juggle life as an Idol and a schoolboy. All the while, wannabe Idols try to steal Nagisa''s spotlight. And in Nagisa''s wild world, there''s nothing that can''t happen.', 'Idol Shiratori Nagisa misses combat and martial arts, so she dresses up as a schoolboy and enrolls in the most roughed-up school she can find. She develops a crush on one guy, who...thinks she''s a boy... But it works out. Now she has to juggle life as an Idol and a schoolboy. All the while, wannabe Idols try to steal Nagisa''s spotlight. And in Nagisa''s wild world, there''s nothing that can''t happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHCRSCrdNeeVGHgD2d16TgO0xFp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:235799'),
  ('977504071605505794', 'I''m a Celebrity: Get Me Out of Here!', 2015, 'Reality', null, null, 'Julia Morris, Robert Irwin', null, 'Australian celebrities are dropped into the African jungle with little more than their wits, strength and willpower to survive the competition. How will they cope with African wildlife, a constant series of challenges and tests, basic rations and their fellow campmates? Who will survive the infamous Bush Tucker Trials? Who will win the hearts of viewers and be crowned King or Queen of the Jungle?', 'Australian celebrities are dropped into the African jungle with little more than their wits, strength and willpower to survive the competition. How will they cope with African wildlife, a constant series of challenges and tests, basic rations and their fellow campmates? Who will survive the infamous Bush Tucker Trials? Who will win the hearts of viewers and be crowned King or Queen of the Jungle?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s7yga8ko1vSDMAettulQjHQp6cz.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:61913'),
  ('440644234673541047', 'I''m a Celebrity... South Africa', 2023, 'Reality', null, null, 'Anthony McPartlin, Declan Donnelly', null, 'Fifteen former I’m a Celebrity campmates return to take on South Africa, an even harder proposition that will push them to their limits and test them like never before in bigger and tougher challenges, and a harsher and more unforgiving environment as they compete against each other to become the first ever ''I''m A Celebrity Legend''.', 'Fifteen former I’m a Celebrity campmates return to take on South Africa, an even harder proposition that will push them to their limits and test them like never before in bigger and tougher challenges, and a harsher and more unforgiving environment as they compete against each other to become the first ever ''I''m A Celebrity Legend''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yws62BFSjP0drVDslfprLMQj7Th.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:223603'),
  ('542983936732814247', 'I''m a Celebrity...Get Me Out of Here!', 2002, 'Comedy, Reality', null, null, 'Anthony McPartlin, Declan Donnelly', 'NR', 'Twelve celebrities are abandoned in the Australian jungle. In order to earn food, they must perform Bushtucker Trials which challenge them physically and mentally.', 'Twelve celebrities are abandoned in the Australian jungle. In order to earn food, they must perform Bushtucker Trials which challenge them physically and mentally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qR0TzFssByXEeLE6Qtg5bjhwAfq.jpg', 25, 'tmdb:tv:30901'),
  ('364821552608371116', 'I''m a Noble on the Brink of Ruin, So I Might as Well Try Mastering Magic', 2025, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, 'Tatsuya Takahashi', 'Ayumu Murase, Tomokazu Sugita, Haruka Tomatsu, Saori Hayami, Shizuka Itoh, Takehito Koyasu, Rie Kugimiya', 'TV-14', 'While innocently enjoying himself after work, one man’s life changes forever. He wakes in the body of Liam Hamilton, the youngest son of a noble house on the brink of collapse. Amid the chaos, Liam realizes he finally has time to learn and practice magic. Once he begins, it takes his life for an even bigger turn. Can Liam master magic and save his noble family? The aristocratic fantasy begins!', 'While innocently enjoying himself after work, one man’s life changes forever. He wakes in the body of Liam Hamilton, the youngest son of a noble house on the brink of collapse. Amid the chaos, Liam realizes he finally has time to learn and practice magic. Once he begins, it takes his life for an even bigger turn. Can Liam master magic and save his noble family? The aristocratic fantasy begins!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7yYvOotNSvM8Q9le7uDfzX2h9fb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:261301'),
  ('745083659597995163', 'I''m a Virgo', 2023, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Boots Riley, Tze Chun', 'Whitney White', 'Jharrel Jerome, Brett Gray, Kara Young, Allius Barnes, Olivia Washington, Mike Epps, Carmen Ejogo, Walton Goggins', 'TV-14', 'A coming-of-age joyride about Cootie, a 13ft tall young Black man in Oakland, CA. Having grown up hidden away, Cootie soon experiences the beauty and contradictions of the world for the first time. He forms friendships, finds love, navigates awkward situations, and encounters his idol, a real life superhero named The Hero.', 'A coming-of-age joyride about Cootie, a 13ft tall young Black man in Oakland, CA. Having grown up hidden away, Cootie soon experiences the beauty and contradictions of the world for the first time. He forms friendships, finds love, navigates awkward situations, and encounters his idol, a real life superhero named The Hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avyEl0afo2u5Q8305Eq27nL5LYu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105169'),
  ('261099982204801601', 'I''m Alan Partridge', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Armando Iannucci, Peter Baynham, Steve Coogan', 'Peter Baynham, Armando Iannucci, Steve Coogan', 'Steve Coogan, Amelia Bullmore, Felicity Montagu, Simon Greenall, Phil Cornwell', null, 'The fortunes of a former chat show host who is reduced to a lowly slot on Radio Norwich. Alan Partridge is divorced, living in a travel tavern, and desperate for a return to television.', 'The fortunes of a former chat show host who is reduced to a lowly slot on Radio Norwich. Alan Partridge is divorced, living in a travel tavern, and desperate for a return to television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/koh80SEzUnqVt9p7rkyNN4eB7pz.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1073'),
  ('978593880830285979', 'I''m Dying Up Here', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jim Carrey', null, 'Melissa Leo, Ari Graynor, Clark Duke, Michael Angarano, RJ Cyler, Erik Griffin, Andrew Santino, Al Madrigal', 'TV-MA', 'Set in LA’s celebrated, infamous stand-up comedy scene of the 1970s, this series delves into the inspired and damaged psyches that inhabit the hilarious, but complex business of making an audience laugh.', 'Set in LA’s celebrated, infamous stand-up comedy scene of the 1970s, this series delves into the inspired and damaged psyches that inhabit the hilarious, but complex business of making an audience laugh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v9gzn1Jk3R18PH48RTGSQfWhpAj.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66620'),
  ('642193366942435152', 'I''m Getting Married to a Girl I Hate in My Class', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Shogo Sakata, Hinaki Yano, Sayumi Suzushiro, Nene Hieda, Kaori Maeda, Hochu Otsuka, Fumi Hirano, Asaki Yuikawa', null, 'High school student Saito Hojo is set to inherit his grandfather’s major corporation. First, he must marry Akane Sakuramori, the girl he despises the most, and who hates him just as much. The two are determined to keep their unexpected marriage a secret from their classmates. But as they begin their newlywed life, the distance between them starts to close.', 'High school student Saito Hojo is set to inherit his grandfather’s major corporation. First, he must marry Akane Sakuramori, the girl he despises the most, and who hates him just as much. The two are determined to keep their unexpected marriage a secret from their classmates. But as they begin their newlywed life, the distance between them starts to close.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0Yb8KjspVjNlmvHNgqRRbhZ6LA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:257790'),
  ('343758619990405997', 'I''m Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tomokazu Sugita, Saori Hayami, Lynn, Naomi Ohzora, Ryotaro Okiayu, Atsumi Tanezaki, Kaori Maeda, Rika Nagae', 'TV-14', 'What does a young noblewoman freshly betrayed by her betrothed need most? A crash course in everything naughty! And who better to teach her than the feared hermit sorcerer who for some reason can’t help but pamper her to no end?', 'What does a young noblewoman freshly betrayed by her betrothed need most? A crash course in everything naughty! And who better to teach her than the feared hermit sorcerer who for some reason can’t help but pamper her to no end?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFr8Edx1Txms9EDiyLPEC6oiDDr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217405'),
  ('933812842096743281', 'I''m Gonna Be An Angel!', 1999, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Hiroshi Nishikiori', null, 'Ayako Kawasumi, Akira Ishida, Issei Miyazaki, Tomoko Kawakami, Yukana, Jurota Kosugi, Noriko Hidaka, Tomoko Naka', null, 'Yuusuke was just a normal kid going to high school. Then one day, the cute and behaloed Noelle fell, quite literally, into his life, naked as a baby and every bit as innocent. Before he can even fathom what''s just happened, Yuusuke is inducted into a rather odd family of otherworldly beings. Papa is a Frankenstein monster with a taste for calisthenics. Mama is a gorgeous lady with a penchant for "round objects" -- really! The eldest sister, Sara, is literally invisible; the brother, Gabriel, is a teenage vampire with an attitude problem; and the youngest sister, Ruka, loves inventing things. There''s a disapproving Grandma, who''s a witch to the nth degree, and her vulture familiar. All Yuusuke wanted was for the beautiful Natsumi to even notice his attention, but now he has an angel-in-training to follow him wherever he goes. And Noelle, too, has a guide on her path to being an angel, the mysterious Michael.', 'Yuusuke was just a normal kid going to high school. Then one day, the cute and behaloed Noelle fell, quite literally, into his life, naked as a baby and every bit as innocent. Before he can even fathom what''s just happened, Yuusuke is inducted into a rather odd family of otherworldly beings. Papa is a Frankenstein monster with a taste for calisthenics. Mama is a gorgeous lady with a penchant for "round objects" -- really! The eldest sister, Sara, is literally invisible; the brother, Gabriel, is a teenage vampire with an attitude problem; and the youngest sister, Ruka, loves inventing things. There''s a disapproving Grandma, who''s a witch to the nth degree, and her vulture familiar. All Yuusuke wanted was for the beautiful Natsumi to even notice his attention, but now he has an angel-in-training to follow him wherever he goes. And Noelle, too, has a guide on her path to being an angel, the mysterious Michael.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NjAjLNvLJHzk8WgRObPVChfsLJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37829'),
  ('779338468528084834', 'I''m Home', 2015, 'Family, Drama, Mystery', 'Kei Ishizaka', null, 'Takuya Kimura, Aya Ueto, Miki Mizuno, Kei Tanaka, Kosuke Suzuki, Miyu Yoshimoto, Manabu Ino, Atsuko Anami', null, 'Ieji Hisashi, a salaryman who works for a securities company, has a fuzzy memory of the recent five years because of an accident at his job posting. His wife of five years, Megumi and their 4-year-old son seem to wear masks. He can neither tell their facial expressions nor their emotions. He also struggles about his love for them. On the other hand, Ieji feels an attachment to his ex-wife, whom he divorced five years ago, and their daughter. What sort of days did he have in those five years which are a blank to him? Ieji sets out on a journey to find his past self with a mysterious bunch of 10 keys that he has. He becomes aware that he was a cold, career-minded man before the accident, and the persona that is gradually revealed is beyond the imagination of his present kindhearted self.', 'Ieji Hisashi, a salaryman who works for a securities company, has a fuzzy memory of the recent five years because of an accident at his job posting. His wife of five years, Megumi and their 4-year-old son seem to wear masks. He can neither tell their facial expressions nor their emotions. He also struggles about his love for them. On the other hand, Ieji feels an attachment to his ex-wife, whom he divorced five years ago, and their daughter. What sort of days did he have in those five years which are a blank to him? Ieji sets out on a journey to find his past self with a mysterious bunch of 10 keys that he has. He becomes aware that he was a cold, career-minded man before the accident, and the persona that is gradually revealed is beyond the imagination of his present kindhearted self.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hSbtPqYJYZnmJlyOqPomaS5PL0z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63226'),
  ('696367140342071476', 'I''m in Love with the Villainess', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yu Serizawa, Karin Nanami, Daisuke Namikawa, Yoko Hikasa, Ikumi Hasegawa, Aimi', null, 'The world turns upside down when a corporate drone wakes up as Rae Taylor, the heroine in her favorite otome game, Revolution. Rae is elated at the opportunity to court Claire François, the game’s villainess and the object of her affection. Armed with her knowledge of the game and events to come, Rae sets out to make Claire fall for her. But how will the villainess take Rae’s romantic advances?', 'The world turns upside down when a corporate drone wakes up as Rae Taylor, the heroine in her favorite otome game, Revolution. Rae is elated at the opportunity to court Claire François, the game’s villainess and the object of her affection. Armed with her knowledge of the game and events to come, Rae sets out to make Claire fall for her. But how will the villainess take Rae’s romantic advances?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/29jtBbv4eSk0QHdVMLwl8P4p6NX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:216269'),
  ('629057502659508736', 'I''m in the Band', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Michael B. Kaplan, Ron Rappaport', null, 'Logan Miller, Steve Valentine, Caitlyn Taylor Love, Greg Baker, Stephen Full', 'TV-Y7', 'Tripp Campbell is the new lead guitarist for Iron Weasel, a band that once ruled the world of 80s pop metal. Can he push the washed-up rockers out of his parents'' guest room and back in the limelight?', 'Tripp Campbell is the new lead guitarist for Iron Weasel, a band that once ruled the world of 80s pop metal. Can he push the washed-up rockers out of his parents'' guest room and back in the limelight?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHTj9R311yylFlszfpQ0tk7Gpkh.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:21650'),
  ('740088779442090077', 'I''m Living with an Otaku NEET Kunoichi!?', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Hinaki Yano, Shoya Ishige, Shigeru Chiba, Fairouz Ai, Saya Aizawa, Hina Kino, Sho Nogami, Yui Horie', 'TV-14', 'In order to protect an ordinary businessman, Tsukasa Atsumi, from demons, a genius kunoichi, Shizuri Ideura, signs a master-servant contract with him on the condition that she stays with him. Despite her cool appearance of defeating demons, Shizuri is an otaku NEET who spends all her time playing video games. While Shizuri is spoiled by Tsukasa and leads a lazy cohabitation life, the quirky Kunoichi gather together.', 'In order to protect an ordinary businessman, Tsukasa Atsumi, from demons, a genius kunoichi, Shizuri Ideura, signs a master-servant contract with him on the condition that she stays with him. Despite her cool appearance of defeating demons, Shizuri is an otaku NEET who spends all her time playing video games. While Shizuri is spoiled by Tsukasa and leads a lazy cohabitation life, the quirky Kunoichi gather together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jzgixTaVH9SfeOv6bMtNbETyaCZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:273048'),
  ('514732974768798816', 'I''m Mita, Your Housekeeper', 2011, 'Drama', 'Kazuhiko Yukawa', 'Kazuhiko Yukawa', 'Nanako Matsushima, Saki Aibu, Hiroki Hasegawa, Shioli Kutsuna, Taishi Nakagawa, Miyu Honda, Shūto Ayabe, Yuko Daike', null, 'A family is grieving their mother''s recent suicide. They hire Mita as a housekeeper to upkeep the house, which has been thrown into disarray. Mita will do anything that her employer orders her to do, except smiling or revealing her past.', 'A family is grieving their mother''s recent suicide. They hire Mita as a housekeeper to upkeep the house, which has been thrown into disarray. Mita will do anything that her employer orders her to do, except smiling or revealing her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/186abs0w1P1ZXEOnAuEHbergHdV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:41733'),
  ('1063492611629914807', 'I''M Possible', 2021, 'Drama, Animation', 'MANISH MISHRA', null, null, null, 'The struggle of every student wants to get into his dream college. Life turns around when he starts going through the journey rigidly and experiences all the mental pressure from society and family which influence his future becoming.', 'The struggle of every student wants to get into his dream college. Life turns around when he starts going through the journey rigidly and experiences all the mental pressure from society and family which influence his future becoming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tR9m26bwDeoSm52ohtgqKOpccZf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:139609'),
  ('732387891496690875', 'I''m Quitting Heroing', 2022, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kensho Ono, Kaede Hondo, Shizuka Itoh, Hitomi Ohwada, Yumi Uchiyama, Tetsu Inada, Minori Suzuki, Misato Matsuoka', 'TV-14', 'After saving humanity from the despicable Demon King, Leo Demonhart does not earn a hero’s standing. Instead, he is regarded with suspicion and hostility by those he fought to protect. Treated as a pariah with nowhere else to turn, exiled Leo seeks a position in the army of his former nemesis! But the army is not what it once was before its defeat at Leo’s hands, so to maintain his new position, Leo must whip the forces back into fighting shape.', 'After saving humanity from the despicable Demon King, Leo Demonhart does not earn a hero’s standing. Instead, he is regarded with suspicion and hostility by those he fought to protect. Treated as a pariah with nowhere else to turn, exiled Leo seeks a position in the army of his former nemesis! But the army is not what it once was before its defeat at Leo’s hands, so to maintain his new position, Leo must whip the forces back into fighting shape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oflTB7Ddzw2lCBEADGQCkjp17OW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:136763'),
  ('198831268427189811', 'I''m Sorry', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Andrea Savage', null, 'Andrea Savage, Tom Everett Scott, Jason Mantzoukas, Kathy Baker, Olive Petrucci', 'TV-MA', 'Andrea is a seemingly confident comedy writer, wife and mom, who comically exposes her inner immaturity and neuroses through unexpected life situations.', 'Andrea is a seemingly confident comedy writer, wife and mom, who comically exposes her inner immaturity and neuroses through unexpected life situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHxvMuaDk5rbswQlt2BaKVzvsxf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:72820'),
  ('1098707820684592450', 'I''m Sorry, I Love You', 2004, 'Drama, Soap', 'Lee Kyoung-hee', 'Lee Kyoung-hee', 'Lim Soo-jung, So Ji-sub, Jung Kyung-ho, Choi Yeo-jin, Seo Ji-young, Jeon Hye-jin, Kim Hye-ok, Lee Hye-young', 'TV-14', 'Cha Moo Hyuk is a man who was adopted by an Australian family but treated cruelly and then abandoned at a young age. By chance, he meets Song Eun Chae, a fashion coordinator dedicated to her employer, singer Choi Yune. Their meeting will have implications for the rest of Cha Moo Hyuk''s life as a devastating turn of events leads him to delve into his past, and ultimately find happiness.', 'Cha Moo Hyuk is a man who was adopted by an Australian family but treated cruelly and then abandoned at a young age. By chance, he meets Song Eun Chae, a fashion coordinator dedicated to her employer, singer Choi Yune. Their meeting will have implications for the rest of Cha Moo Hyuk''s life as a devastating turn of events leads him to delve into his past, and ultimately find happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hw6Ju7DDwXwqSekLLCdGBEWGfVu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2265'),
  ('487998275562036992', 'I''m Standing on a Million Lives', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuto Uemura, Risa Kubota, Azumi Waki, Makoto Koichi, Toshiyuki Toyonaga, Saori Hayami', 'TV-14', 'Ninth grader Yotsuya Yuusuke is practical, friendless, and not active in any clubs. Then one day, he and two female classmates are suddenly sent to another world where they must work together to battle for their lives. Yotsuya is a lone wolf and has always lived his life according to his wants, but how will that work out now that he’s supposed to be a hero?!', 'Ninth grader Yotsuya Yuusuke is practical, friendless, and not active in any clubs. Then one day, he and two female classmates are suddenly sent to another world where they must work together to battle for their lives. Yotsuya is a lone wolf and has always lived his life according to his wants, but how will that work out now that he’s supposed to be a hero?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vdUva7C2B1wZI2D4vjBSWJIc8IG.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:99995'),
  ('256615131261208168', 'I''m Tee, Me Too', 2020, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Perawat Sangpotirat, Prachaya Ruangroj, Jumpol Adulkittiporn, Atthaphan Phunsawat, Thitipoom Techa-apaikhun, Tawan Vihokratana', null, 'Six guys — all whose name is Tee, and each with their own qualities — find themselves cohabiting under the same roof, in the process learning more about not only one other but also themselves, every day.', 'Six guys — all whose name is Tee, and each with their own qualities — find themselves cohabiting under the same roof, in the process learning more about not only one other but also themselves, every day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCnbRp6ZYi0XMdu7hL5XXxvv0qA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106820'),
  ('39970074016040275', 'I''m the Evil Lord of an Intergalactic Empire!', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Natsuki Hanae, Reina Ueda, Takehito Koyasu, Mikako Komatsu, Ayana Taketatsu', 'TV-14', 'After a life of honesty left him betrayed, Liam is reborn into a vast interstellar empire with one goal: be the galaxy’s worst evil lord. But no matter how hard he tries to be a tyrant, his “wicked” plans keep backfiring into peace, prosperity, and adoring fans. Galactic chaos, magic, and mecha await in this hilariously misconstructed tale of a villain who can’t help but to impress.', 'After a life of honesty left him betrayed, Liam is reborn into a vast interstellar empire with one goal: be the galaxy’s worst evil lord. But no matter how hard he tries to be a tyrant, his “wicked” plans keep backfiring into peace, prosperity, and adoring fans. Galactic chaos, magic, and mecha await in this hilariously misconstructed tale of a villain who can’t help but to impress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lSXLjmpTKRqKfjzCz0YXdvm7o4z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:274737'),
  ('108065981107716076', 'I''m the Villainess, So I''m Taming the Final Boss', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Sarasa Nagase', null, 'Rie Takahashi, Yuuichirou Umehara, Toshiki Masuda, Jun Fukuyama, Yuki Ono, Kana Hanazawa, Tomokazu Sugita, Yuma Uchida', 'TV-14', 'When her engagement to the prince ends unceremoniously, details of the young noblewoman Aileen''s past life come rushing back and help her realize she''s living inside the world of one of her favorite otome games—as the heroine''s greatest rival! However, her memory has more plot holes than bad fan fiction…and the only certainty is that if she doesn''t do something quick, her death is all but assured. The hero/main-love-interest can''t be relied on, so why not see what the last boss has to say?', 'When her engagement to the prince ends unceremoniously, details of the young noblewoman Aileen''s past life come rushing back and help her realize she''s living inside the world of one of her favorite otome games—as the heroine''s greatest rival! However, her memory has more plot holes than bad fan fiction…and the only certainty is that if she doesn''t do something quick, her death is all but assured. The hero/main-love-interest can''t be relied on, so why not see what the last boss has to say?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dI52sNRWyrskfnM67ssqCHgLvoD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135334'),
  ('422897869162600910', 'I''m with Her', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Marco Pennette, Chris Henchy', null, 'Teri Polo, David Sutcliffe, Danny Comden, Rhea Seehorn', 'TV-PG', 'When everyman Patrick Owen is bitten by the easily-excited puppy of movie star Alexandra Young, he becomes an overnight sensation. His anonymity and privacy go up in the flash of a hundred paparazzi cameras.', 'When everyman Patrick Owen is bitten by the easily-excited puppy of movie star Alexandra Young, he becomes an overnight sensation. His anonymity and privacy go up in the flash of a hundred paparazzi cameras.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xq6Lu2Y8C9U6xWcl91fdAEKA9ZE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4506'),
  ('84034523056167140', 'I''m with the Band: Nasty Cherry', 2019, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, 'Charli xcx, Gabbriette, Deborah Knox-Hewson, Chloé Chaidez, Georgia Somary', 'TV-MA', 'In an unfiltered, intimate docuseries, pop star mentor Charli XCX finds out what it takes to build -- and break -- a real, badass all-girl punk band.', 'In an unfiltered, intimate docuseries, pop star mentor Charli XCX finds out what it takes to build -- and break -- a real, badass all-girl punk band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lrntygsnkgAhKi5RBR4qW8XpOOx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95284'),
  ('795485545797702282', 'I''m Your Destiny', 2017, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Kazuya Kamenashi, Fumino Kimura, Tomohisa Yamashita, Shinnosuke Mitsushima, Nanao, Yu Sawabe, Eri Watanabe, Maya Okano', null, 'Makoto Masaki and Haruko Kogetsu are both 29 years old and single. Since they were children, they have passed each other at various places like on the beach and shrines. Yet, the two are not aware of each other at all. One day, a man appears in front of Makoto Masaki and introduces himself as God. He tells Makoto Masaki about his destined soul mate and that she works next door. When he faces Haruko Kogetsu, he tells her "I''m your destiny."', 'Makoto Masaki and Haruko Kogetsu are both 29 years old and single. Since they were children, they have passed each other at various places like on the beach and shrines. Yet, the two are not aware of each other at all. One day, a man appears in front of Makoto Masaki and introduces himself as God. He tells Makoto Masaki about his destined soul mate and that she works next door. When he faces Haruko Kogetsu, he tells her "I''m your destiny."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sLqJCYvWmPZWO2SWsxJRVpVjjGB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70873'),
  ('1150293632312537475', 'I''ve Been Killing Slimes for 300 Years and Maxed Out My Level', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Aoi Yuuki, Kaede Hondo, Sayaka Senbongi, Minami Tanaka, Sayaka Harada, Manami Numakura, Riho Sugiyama, Azumi Waki', 'TV-14', 'After dying of overwork in the real world, I’m reincarnated as an immortal witch, and I spend 300 years enjoying a relaxing life. At some point, though, I end up at level 99! All those years spent killing slimes to make the money to pay the bills gave me a ton of experience points. Rumors of the level 99 witch spread, and soon I’m up to my ears in curious adventurers, duelist dragons, and even a monster girl calling me her mom! I’ve never been on an adventure, but I’m the strongest in the world… What’s going to happen to my relaxing life?!', 'After dying of overwork in the real world, I’m reincarnated as an immortal witch, and I spend 300 years enjoying a relaxing life. At some point, though, I end up at level 99! All those years spent killing slimes to make the money to pay the bills gave me a ton of experience points. Rumors of the level 99 witch spread, and soon I’m up to my ears in curious adventurers, duelist dragons, and even a monster girl calling me her mom! I’ve never been on an adventure, but I’m the strongest in the world… What’s going to happen to my relaxing life?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iyTiJqrAs2YItyTYGI18PdqX65c.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:99073'),
  ('384687435202671387', 'I''ve Got a Secret', 1952, 'Reality', 'Allan Sherman', null, 'Steve Allen, Bill Cullen, Henry Morgan, Betsy Palmer, Bess Myerson', null, 'A panel tries to determine a contestant''s secret: something that is unusual, amazing, embarrassing, or humorous about that person.', 'A panel tries to determine a contestant''s secret: something that is unusual, amazing, embarrassing, or humorous about that person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yMGxV37D6Jt3Len7q8QocLJJ5E3.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:4862'),
  ('393483512705502932', 'I''ve Somehow Gotten Stronger When I Improved My Farm-Related Skills.', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Junya Enoki, Minami Tanaka, Rumi Okubo, Ayaka Suwa, Yukari Tamura, Masahiro Ito, Mai Nakahara, Kenji Hamada', 'TV-14', 'Al Wayne loves farming — and we don’t mean the video game sim. He wants to be a literal farmer, but in the process of improving his agriculture skills, he somehow winds up maxing out his overall character stats! He’s superpowered in the most unexpected of ways with abilities even the strongest of heroes would envy. Alas, all he wants is an idyllic farmer''s life, but with demons and monsters invading the realm, Al may have to take up the mantle of hero just to keep his dreams from withering away!', 'Al Wayne loves farming — and we don’t mean the video game sim. He wants to be a literal farmer, but in the process of improving his agriculture skills, he somehow winds up maxing out his overall character stats! He’s superpowered in the most unexpected of ways with abilities even the strongest of heroes would envy. Alas, all he wants is an idyllic farmer''s life, but with demons and monsters invading the realm, Al may have to take up the mantle of hero just to keep his dreams from withering away!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8TTveKSNr23SRib4Q4C3yy9dszz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158522'),
  ('1033313575216894791', 'IC 814: The Kandahar Hijack', 2024, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Anubhav Sinha, Trishant Srivastava', 'Trishant Srivastava, Nikhil Ravi, Anubhav Sinha', 'Vijay Varma, Naseeruddin Shah, Pankaj Kapur, Arvind Swamy, Dia Mirza, Patralekhaa, Manoj Pahwa, Kumud Mishra', 'TV-MA', 'When IC 814 gets hijacked on its way to Delhi, hundreds of lives are at stake as the country faces its longest and most alarming aviation crisis.', 'When IC 814 gets hijacked on its way to Delhi, hundreds of lives are at stake as the country faces its longest and most alarming aviation crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u8b8sdWzzvAIKjTBGh9aCio6hU6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:247829'),
  ('1131437865148880399', 'ICAC Investigators', 1992, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Sammul Chan, Maggie Shiu, Bowie Lam Bo-Yee, Jessica Hsuan, Sonija Kwok Sin-Nae, Yoyo Mung Ka-Wai, Raymond Ho-Yin Wong, Miriam Yeung Chin-Wah', null, 'ICAC Investigators is a long running family of Hong Kong television miniseries about the work of Hong Kong''s Independent Commission Against Corruption (ICAC). The series are public awareness films produced by Radio Television Hong Kong, an independent department of the government, with the full co-operation of the ICAC itself. Each series dramatises real cases of the Commission and serves both to educate the populace against corrupt practises and as a public relations tool for the ICAC.', 'ICAC Investigators is a long running family of Hong Kong television miniseries about the work of Hong Kong''s Independent Commission Against Corruption (ICAC). The series are public awareness films produced by Radio Television Hong Kong, an independent department of the government, with the full co-operation of the ICAC itself. Each series dramatises real cases of the Commission and serves both to educate the populace against corrupt practises and as a public relations tool for the ICAC.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ox1BRrYfLhtLEhJr1xrc5bcW23V.jpg', 18, 'tmdb:tv:80137'),
  ('663202260679385366', 'ICAC Investigators 1996', null, 'Drama', null, null, 'Ben Wong Chi-Yin, Ti Lung, Monica Chan Fat-Yung, Joe Ma Tak-Chung, Elvis Tsui Kam-Kong, Joseph Lee Kwok-Lun, Edward Mok, Doi Siu-man', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vuFlJdfp2nKMTBQ24rxwrRfkXSl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:282173'),
  ('41535486205769236', 'iCarly', 2007, 'Comedy, Kids, Family, Drama', 'Dan Schneider', null, 'Miranda Cosgrove, Jennette McCurdy, Nathan Kress, Jerry Trainor, Noah Munck', 'TV-G', 'Watch Carly, Sam, and Freddie, as they try to balance their everyday 8th grade lives with their newfound fame managing and starring in the most awesome show on the web.', 'Watch Carly, Sam, and Freddie, as they try to balance their everyday 8th grade lives with their newfound fame managing and starring in the most awesome show on the web.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zswxst53aM8g2LysdVbtQNJAiKM.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:5371'),
  ('427238792595216548', 'iCarly', 2021, 'Comedy, Family', 'Dan Schneider', 'Korama Danquah', 'Miranda Cosgrove, Jerry Trainor, Nathan Kress, Laci Mosley, Jaidyn Triplett', 'TV-PG', 'Ten years after signing off of one of TV''s most iconic shows, Carly, Spencer, and Freddie are back, navigating the next chapter of their lives, facing the uncertainties of life in their twenties.', 'Ten years after signing off of one of TV''s most iconic shows, Carly, Spencer, and Freddie are back, navigating the next chapter of their lives, facing the uncertainties of life in their twenties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tM4P2RNIIFzFJi7UngNVB80sRCp.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:119243'),
  ('145897585135114649', 'Ice', 2016, 'Drama, Crime', 'Robert Munic', null, 'Cam Gigandet, Jeremy Sisto, Audrey Marie Anderson, Judi Shekoni, Jocelyn Hudon, Ray Winstone', 'TV-MA', 'A diamond dealer navigates the culturally diverse and treacherous world of the diamond business.', 'A diamond dealer navigates the culturally diverse and treacherous world of the diamond business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lLmHKFEWnbzIVHay54VLF8FwiJM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:68735'),
  ('913981644028698791', 'Ice Age: Scrat Tales', 2022, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Kids', null, null, 'Chris Wedge, Kari Wahlgren', 'TV-PG', 'Scrat experiences the ups and downs of fatherhood, as he and the adorable, mischievous Baby Scrat, alternately bond with each other and battle for ownership of the highly treasured Acorn.', 'Scrat experiences the ups and downs of fatherhood, as he and the adorable, mischievous Baby Scrat, alternately bond with each other and battle for ownership of the highly treasured Acorn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mTfYwY7DELH08SeO8LyUMe9Tvfr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158307'),
  ('180345239853364092', 'Ice Fantasy', 2016, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics', 'Edward Guo', null, 'William Feng, Victoria Song, Ma Tianyu, Zhang Meng, Madina Memet, Shao Bing, Hu Bing, Xu Ke', 'NR', 'A century after the war between the Ice and Fire Tribes, Prince Ka Suo of the Ice Tribe becomes king, searching for his missing lover and brother. He uncovers a dark conspiracy within his tribe, unaware that his brother, now the Fire Prince with no memory of his past, is leading the Fire Tribe. As tensions rise, the brothers are forced into a new conflict, this time against each other.', 'A century after the war between the Ice and Fire Tribes, Prince Ka Suo of the Ice Tribe becomes king, searching for his missing lover and brother. He uncovers a dark conspiracy within his tribe, unaware that his brother, now the Fire Prince with no memory of his past, is leading the Fire Tribe. As tensions rise, the brothers are forced into a new conflict, this time against each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kmXMaUqlyzOQ0zN5e7zPwd8kawa.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67015'),
  ('121689528580340059', 'Ice Road Rescue', 2015, 'Documentary, Reality, Drama', 'Mads Iversen, Kåre Sponberg, Andreas Lange', null, 'Thord Paulsen, Bjørn Lægreid, Jo Roger Blengsli, Ole Henrik Blengsli', 'TV-14', 'Reality series following a group of truck drivers in the mountain passes of Norway, some of the most dangerous roads in all of Europe.', 'Reality series following a group of truck drivers in the mountain passes of Norway, some of the most dangerous roads in all of Europe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/KUVaycctfjs1qKMkujHjIZEWwH.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:72482'),
  ('406240242308362246', 'Ice Road Truckers', 2007, 'Reality', 'Léo Matthès', null, 'Alex Debogorski, Thom Beers', 'TV-PG', 'Take a trip to Yellowknife, Canada to experience one of the most dangerous careers around. In unfathomably cold conditions, truck drivers haul equipment and supplies to miners in the Canadian tundra in the dead of winter on a 350-mile highway of ice.', 'Take a trip to Yellowknife, Canada to experience one of the most dangerous careers around. In unfathomably cold conditions, truck drivers haul equipment and supplies to miners in the Canadian tundra in the dead of winter on a 350-mile highway of ice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOx32HHvqmPAStnbM51TbjxcHKr.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:3780'),
  ('1030438455244270740', 'Ice World', 1999, 'Mystery', 'Hisashi Nozawa, 喜多丽子, Michio Mitsuno', null, 'Yutaka Takenouchi, Nanako Matsushima, Yuki Uchida, Ken Kaneko, Nana Katase, Reiko Matsuo, Toru Nakamura, Tomoko Nakajima', null, 'Investigations on a mysterious woman Toko started when Sonoe, a teacher and Toko''s fellow faculty member, was found dead as a result of what seemed to be an unfortunate accident. Eiki, an insurance investigator, and Takeshi, an ambitious police detective, find links between this case and the deaths of Toko''s 3 fiances, and are determined to uncover the truth.', 'Investigations on a mysterious woman Toko started when Sonoe, a teacher and Toko''s fellow faculty member, was found dead as a result of what seemed to be an unfortunate accident. Eiki, an insurance investigator, and Takeshi, an ambitious police detective, find links between this case and the deaths of Toko''s 3 fiances, and are determined to uncover the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u37VHkvsyNaQaKHJRXopKXCPbky.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42709'),
  ('222444685373731523', 'Icebreaker', 2025, 'Drama', 'Mia Ylönen', 'Mia Ylönen, Nuutti Sihvonen, Tuuli Kanervakallio', 'Eero Milonoff, Mikko Leppilampi, Seidi Haarla, Jessica Grabowsky, Johannes Holopainen, Mona Kortelampi, Roderick Kabanga, Riitta Havukainen', null, 'An icebreaker is stranded in a winter storm during the longest, darkest Solstice night. Coast Guard Sanna Tanner leads the rescue team, haunted by disturbing events. Sanna races to solve the mystery before she becomes the next target.', 'An icebreaker is stranded in a winter storm during the longest, darkest Solstice night. Coast Guard Sanna Tanner leads the rescue team, haunted by disturbing events. Sanna races to solve the mystery before she becomes the next target.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nySEqv3h40rugocnZT0SIe238T0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:284146'),
  ('1118022939993742984', 'Ich bin ein Star – Holt mich hier raus!', 2004, 'Reality', null, null, 'Sonja Zietlow, Jan Köppen, Bob McCarron, Gil Ofarim, Hubert Fella, Simone Mecky-Ballack, Patrick Romer, Hardy Krüger Jr.', 'NR', 'A batch of more or less known celebrities, ready to expose themselves to a large amount of viewers, have to spend about two weeks in an Australian jungle camp. Each day, the viewers vote for the celebrity they would like to face a difficult task and later vote for their favorite to become the “Queen” or “King of the Jungle”. Based on the British reality television show I''m a Celebrity...Get Me Out of Here!', 'A batch of more or less known celebrities, ready to expose themselves to a large amount of viewers, have to spend about two weeks in an Australian jungle camp. Each day, the viewers vote for the celebrity they would like to face a difficult task and later vote for their favorite to become the “Queen” or “King of the Jungle”. Based on the British reality television show I''m a Celebrity...Get Me Out of Here!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f35oKPpozEP35ga8nKAujLjKkEK.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:13964'),
  ('111170426086346533', 'Ich dich auch!', 2022, 'Comedy', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uU5iJ0tBGSKIgONNj7tSgnbYRcb.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:157907'),
  ('246326531323128536', 'Ichigo Aika: Strawberry Elegy', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Hana Yurimoto, Momosuke, Iroha Haruno, Yūta Igarashi', 'TV-MA', 'The story centers on a pair of stepsiblings. When Kōta''s father gets remarried, Kōta''s first impression of his new stepsister Aika is that she is beautiful, but that image is shattered pretty quickly. His new stepsister is a super sassy and foul-mouthed gyaru who behaves uncontrollably while their parents are away, making Kōta''s life a living hell. However, their relationship begins to change when Aika gradually warms up to Kōta''s caring older-brother nature.', 'The story centers on a pair of stepsiblings. When Kōta''s father gets remarried, Kōta''s first impression of his new stepsister Aika is that she is beautiful, but that image is shattered pretty quickly. His new stepsister is a super sassy and foul-mouthed gyaru who behaves uncontrollably while their parents are away, making Kōta''s life a living hell. However, their relationship begins to change when Aika gradually warms up to Kōta''s caring older-brother nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fjKOO6PBLwLG3ViyvrIL9oZUmbU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:300015'),
  ('359629906756504175', 'Ichijyoma Mankitsu Gurashi!', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Hana Hishikawa, Saho Shirasu, Chiharu, Miyari Nemoto, Momoka Terasawa, Natsumi Murakami, Kaori Maeda, Chiwa Saito', null, 'Girl''s new life begins in… Manga cafe!? Meiko Morita, a high schooler living in Akita, is suddenly selected as a special transfer student to the prestigious girls'' school Amamiya Girls'' Academy. With both excitement and nerves, she heads to Tokyo to begin her new life. But what awaits her isn''t a typical student dorm, it''s a manga café called "Hedgehog", which also functions as a shared dormitory! Living in a tiny one-tatami room and working at the café as part of her daily duties, Meiko finds herself surrounded by quirky fellow residents, and so begins her slightly strange, manga-filled Tokyo life!', 'Girl''s new life begins in… Manga cafe!? Meiko Morita, a high schooler living in Akita, is suddenly selected as a special transfer student to the prestigious girls'' school Amamiya Girls'' Academy. With both excitement and nerves, she heads to Tokyo to begin her new life. But what awaits her isn''t a typical student dorm, it''s a manga café called "Hedgehog", which also functions as a shared dormitory! Living in a tiny one-tatami room and working at the café as part of her daily duties, Meiko finds herself surrounded by quirky fellow residents, and so begins her slightly strange, manga-filled Tokyo life!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bG0etHcKsp2J1znAr2ipNmbeUF0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:295751'),
  ('677050996404971115', 'Ici tout commence', 2020, 'Soap, Drama', 'Othman Mahfoud, Eric Fuhrer, Coline Assous', null, 'Pierre Hurel, Sabine Perraud, Mikael Mittelstadt', 'NR', 'This television drama series is centered around the prestigious culinary school of renowned chef Auguste Armand. The show follows the lives of students and staff as they navigate the challenges and pressures of the culinary world—delving into their personal and professional lives, revealing secrets, rivalries, and complex relationships.', 'This television drama series is centered around the prestigious culinary school of renowned chef Auguste Armand. The show follows the lives of students and staff as they navigate the challenges and pressures of the culinary world—delving into their personal and professional lives, revealing secrets, rivalries, and complex relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7nXPo2zdaIOfeIaERiOuTEt89N.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:112470'),
  ('985751182183641665', 'Icons', 2002, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-G', 'Icons was a documentary TV show on G4 that originally focused on significant people, companies, products, history, and milestones in world of video games. It was relaunched in 2006 and focused entirely on pop culture. It was cancelled soon afterwards. On May 10, 2006, it was announced that Icons was relaunching on June 3 with an episode focusing on J.J. Abrams. The show will feature a broader scope on things and people "men 18–34 care about, admire and emulate." Future episodes would focus on Marc Ecko, The Onion, and Family Guy. This change in format had been suspected, due to the recent episodes about George A. Romero, Frank Miller and the history of the King Kong franchise. The classic video game themed episodes continued to air on the network sporadically until 2008, under the new name of Game Makers.', 'Icons was a documentary TV show on G4 that originally focused on significant people, companies, products, history, and milestones in world of video games. It was relaunched in 2006 and focused entirely on pop culture. It was cancelled soon afterwards. On May 10, 2006, it was announced that Icons was relaunching on June 3 with an episode focusing on J.J. Abrams. The show will feature a broader scope on things and people "men 18–34 care about, admire and emulate." Future episodes would focus on Marc Ecko, The Onion, and Family Guy. This change in format had been suspected, due to the recent episodes about George A. Romero, Frank Miller and the history of the King Kong franchise. The classic video game themed episodes continued to air on the network sporadically until 2008, under the new name of Game Makers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tfk5d5uhUtGNBJkzmC1zjeaPTlU.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:3208'),
  ('234716640230084512', 'ID-0', 2017, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kazuyuki Okitsu, Minami Tsuda, Hisako Kanemoto, Reina Ueda, Masaya Matsukaze, Sayaka Ohara, Rikiya Koyama, Ari Ozawa', null, 'I-Machines are the general term for robots that operate in extreme environments. While Alliance Academy student Maya Mikuri is in the middle of operating an I-Machine, she gets involved in an incident with pirates, and ends up serving as a crew member on an excavation company''s spaceship.', 'I-Machines are the general term for robots that operate in extreme environments. While Alliance Academy student Maya Mikuri is in the middle of operating an I-Machine, she gets involved in an incident with pirates, and ends up serving as a crew member on an excavation company''s spaceship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUKVdmHb99Bhefuh80XXUsRbmCI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71007'),
  ('591436696980018022', 'ID: INVADED', 2020, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kenjiro Tsuda, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Ryota Takeuchi, Mao Ichimichi, Sarah Emi Bridcutt, Manabu Muraji, Takashi Kondo, Shuhei Iwase', 'TV-MA', 'Sakaido is a genius detective who can track down any criminal. But when his daughter is murdered, revenge lands him on the other side of the law. Now in prison, he helps the police solve mysteries using a system that invades a person’s identity. Little by little, a trail of blood forms, and it all leads back to his daughter’s murderer.', 'Sakaido is a genius detective who can track down any criminal. But when his daughter is murdered, revenge lands him on the other side of the law. Now in prison, he helps the police solve mysteries using a system that invades a person’s identity. Little by little, a trail of blood forms, and it all leads back to his daughter’s murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42mieA29Dtw1dBL5mNgZvvLmK8n.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92602'),
  ('20822624710245484', 'Idaten: Tokyo Olympics Story', 2019, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, 'Kankuro Kudo', 'Kantarô Nakamura, Sadao Abe, Haruka Ayase, Toma Ikuta, Hana Sugisaki, Kento Nagayama, Ryo Katsuji, Yutaka Takenouchi', null, 'Traces Japan’s history with the Olympic games and the 1964 Tokyo Olympics for viewers before Tokyo hosts the event again in 2020. The first half tells the story of marathon runner Kanakuri Shiso, who became one of the first Japanese nationals to participate in the Olympics in Stockholm in 1912. The second half features Tabata Masaji, the coach who laid the foundations of Japanese swimming and helped bring the games to Tokyo for the first time in 1964.', 'Traces Japan’s history with the Olympic games and the 1964 Tokyo Olympics for viewers before Tokyo hosts the event again in 2020. The first half tells the story of marathon runner Kanakuri Shiso, who became one of the first Japanese nationals to participate in the Olympics in Stockholm in 1912. The second half features Tabata Masaji, the coach who laid the foundations of Japanese swimming and helped bring the games to Tokyo for the first time in 1964.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/484KuSBKc2PzFq81tq2KMotjlcx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86014'),
  ('181455956482593541', 'Ideal', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Graham Duff', 'Graham Duff', 'Johnny Vegas, Graham Duff, Tom Goodman-Hill, Nicola Reynolds, Ben Crompton, Sinéad Matthews, Ryan Pope, Jo Neary', null, 'Sitcom about a small-time dope dealer and his strange collection of acquaintances.', 'Sitcom about a small-time dope dealer and his strange collection of acquaintances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1zGJEm7KTWPfa3YUagBBrRZIS7A.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:1467'),
  ('882181371022883789', 'Identity', 2010, 'Drama', null, null, 'Aidan Gillen, Keeley Hawes, Holly Aird, Elyes Gabel, Shaun Parkes', null, 'Identity is a British police procedural drama television series starring Aidan Gillen and Keeley Hawes, airing in the UK during July–August 2010. Concerning identity theft, the series was created and written by Ed Whitmore, a writer most noted for his work on the BBC''s Waking The Dead and the acclaimed ITV mini-series He Kills Coppers. The remake rights have been sold to the ABC Network in America who are developing their own version of the show. ITV confirmed that the show had been cancelled on 19 October 2010, after a single series.', 'Identity is a British police procedural drama television series starring Aidan Gillen and Keeley Hawes, airing in the UK during July–August 2010. Concerning identity theft, the series was created and written by Ed Whitmore, a writer most noted for his work on the BBC''s Waking The Dead and the acclaimed ITV mini-series He Kills Coppers. The remake rights have been sold to the ABC Network in America who are developing their own version of the show. ITV confirmed that the show had been cancelled on 19 October 2010, after a single series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t81iSuAy0aHJ1H1s2hSqZSmFyv6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:33144'),
  ('1034351925874256360', 'Idiotsitter', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Jillian Bell, Charlotte Newhouse', null, 'Jillian Bell, Charlotte Newhouse, Stephen Root', 'TV-14', 'When wild child Gene is put under house arrest in her family''s mansion, her parents hire buttoned-up nanny Billie to look after her. Trapped in each other’s company, the two strike up an unlikely friendship and cause all sorts of trouble. It''s an odd-couple story that reaches new depths of depravity.', 'When wild child Gene is put under house arrest in her family''s mansion, her parents hire buttoned-up nanny Billie to look after her. Trapped in each other’s company, the two strike up an unlikely friendship and cause all sorts of trouble. It''s an odd-couple story that reaches new depths of depravity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eYkfVLTFISg0wfra27H0R5YvpW8.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:65704'),
  ('1071678532654625801', 'Idle Mermaid', 2014, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Cho Bo-ah, Song Jae-rim, On Ju-wan, An Kil-kang, Kim Seul-gi, Nam Joo-hyuk, Park Ji-soo, Moon Hee-kyung', null, 'Can a woman do anything for the sake of love? Ha Ni is a mermaid princess in the underwater empire but she longs for the human world when she sees and falls in love with a man. She transforms into a human and follows Hyun Myung to live in a temporary house for people who are preparing for employment. The pragmatic Hyun Myung is trying to find a good-paying job to provide him with a comfortable life. But will he be distracted by Ha Ni, who has just 100 days to make Hyun Myung fall in love with her so that she can remain a human?', 'Can a woman do anything for the sake of love? Ha Ni is a mermaid princess in the underwater empire but she longs for the human world when she sees and falls in love with a man. She transforms into a human and follows Hyun Myung to live in a temporary house for people who are preparing for employment. The pragmatic Hyun Myung is trying to find a good-paying job to provide him with a comfortable life. But will he be distracted by Ha Ni, who has just 100 days to make Hyun Myung fall in love with her so that she can remain a human?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5aBvzys61Hq5meLmV7pONIW5Kug.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61170'),
  ('74598762404798987', 'Idler: Sister Ma', 2000, 'Comedy, Family, Soap, Drama', null, 'Yu Man, Liang Huan, Liang Zuo', 'Cai Ming, Li Jianhua, Meng Yu, Xiaopin Lü, Li Ye Ping, Ma Ling, Liu Jinshan, Zhao Jin', null, 'Chinese sitcom set in a residential neighborhood in Beijing, centered on Ma Xiao Yan, a middle aged woman known as Sister Ma, her relatives and friends.', 'Chinese sitcom set in a residential neighborhood in Beijing, centered on Ma Xiao Yan, a middle aged woman known as Sister Ma, her relatives and friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZaDKlJbEXs6pmhNdzGWHhSr3zP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128318'),
  ('500006025084934313', 'Idol', 2004, 'Reality, Family', 'Simon Fuller', null, 'Anders Bagge, Katia Mosally, Ash Pournouri, Peg Parnevik, Pär Lernström, Tuva Råwall, Love Hedlund Stenmarck', null, 'The first season of Sweden''s Idol premiered in August 2004 and continued until its grand finale on 26 November. It is a spin off of Britain''s Pop Idol.', 'The first season of Sweden''s Idol premiered in August 2004 and continued until its grand finale on 26 November. It is a spin off of Britain''s Pop Idol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p5yJ0bBXZU03kEAm65j8rqwMFbN.jpg', 21, 'tmdb:tv:57589'),
  ('588435818169494734', 'IDOL 1N2D', 2022, 'Reality, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, null, null, 'IDOL Spin-off Version of Famous Variety Show "1 Night 2 Days"', 'IDOL Spin-off Version of Famous Variety Show "1 Night 2 Days"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2qij6ZaV3esGOiEPCTBIJwn456.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208960'),
  ('276753283023265108', 'Idol I', 2025, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime, Comedy', 'Kwan-Young Lee, Kim Da-rim', '김다린', 'Sooyoung Choi, Kim Jae-young, Choi Hee-jin, Kim Hyun-jin, Jeong Jae-kwang, Park Jeong-woo', null, 'Maeng Se-na, a top star criminal lawyer who has been a fangirl for fifteen years, tries to prove her favorite idol’s innocence, who is suspected of murder.', 'Maeng Se-na, a top star criminal lawyer who has been a fangirl for fifteen years, tries to prove her favorite idol’s innocence, who is suspected of murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pKJLNbUh4uO2jwGsMfP4B37pamS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:285278'),
  ('366568228980626757', 'Idol Radio', 2018, null, null, null, 'Sunwoo, Eric', null, 'A South Korean radio show created by MBC Radio specially for idols.', 'A South Korean radio show created by MBC Radio specially for idols.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4lmwjHqJBtLRhSn51wIWNTtEQd.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:244984'),
  ('855563348780622379', 'Idol Room', 2018, 'Talk', null, null, 'Defconn, Jeong Hyeong-don', null, 'Find out all about your favorite K-pop idol groups! Hosted by the “idol experts”, Jeong Hyeong-don and Defconn!', 'Find out all about your favorite K-pop idol groups! Hosted by the “idol experts”, Jeong Hyeong-don and Defconn!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVTXZH80hnXVgFmeRQQGtE4m5hZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79449'),
  ('327748449742780525', 'IDOL: The Coup', 2021, 'Drama', 'Jung Yoon-jung', 'Jung Yoon-jung', 'Hani, Ahn Sol-bin, Exy, Han So-eun, Green, Kwak Si-yang, Kim Min-kyu, Cho Jun-young', null, 'Portrays the last story of “doomed idols” who need a single “success” in order to “disband.” The story of young people who confidently let go of their dreams as they grow through their failures and take courageous steps towards their new goals.', 'Portrays the last story of “doomed idols” who need a single “success” in order to “disband.” The story of young people who confidently let go of their dreams as they grow through their failures and take courageous steps towards their new goals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r7wfG1EjFVl57xM9MgqcRxBzuYN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137215'),
  ('187543788856204564', 'IDOLiSH7', 2018, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Toshiki Masuda, Yusuke Shirai, Tsubasa Yonaga, KENN, Atsushi Abe, Takuya Eguchi, Kensho Ono', null, 'Working at an agency owned by your father, seven new idols await. They are all part of an idol unit IDOLiSH7, and each of them have unique personalities. It is your task to manage them. In order to achieve the same goals, as manager and idols together, you gather the seven ununified hearts and aim for the top.', 'Working at an agency owned by your father, seven new idols await. They are all part of an idol unit IDOLiSH7, and each of them have unique personalities. It is your task to manage them. In order to achieve the same goals, as manager and idols together, you gather the seven ununified hearts and aim for the top.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6SjRbdGaNQYBC47J0gprbq1vve1.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:76128'),
  ('87549087365307455', 'iDOLM@STER Xenoglossia', 2007, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuka Iguchi, Yui Horie, Yukari Tamura, Ami Koshimizu, Eri Kitamura, Mai Nakahara, Tomo Sakurai, Kaori Shimizu', 'TV-14', '107 years ago, the Moon was destroyed in a massive cataclysm that shattered Earth''s former satellite into 81 quintillion tons of orbital debris. However, thanks to super-science, the Earth itself was saved and today no one really thinks much about that century-past disaster. Which is why when teenage Haruka Amami auditions for something called the Idolmaster Project, she THINKS she''s trying out to be a singing idol. Instead, Haruka finds herself at a secret school run by the Mondenkind Agency, living with a group of other girls who have also been selected as candidates to pilot an iDOL - an advanced robot specifically designed to intercept falling chunks of moon rock. Except, the people who run the Mondenkind Agency aren''t exactly knights in shining armor. And then there''s the question of whether the iDOLs are really JUST robots. Because from almost the first moment, Haruka starts to feel emotions resonating from within the iDOL called Imber.', '107 years ago, the Moon was destroyed in a massive cataclysm that shattered Earth''s former satellite into 81 quintillion tons of orbital debris. However, thanks to super-science, the Earth itself was saved and today no one really thinks much about that century-past disaster. Which is why when teenage Haruka Amami auditions for something called the Idolmaster Project, she THINKS she''s trying out to be a singing idol. Instead, Haruka finds herself at a secret school run by the Mondenkind Agency, living with a group of other girls who have also been selected as candidates to pilot an iDOL - an advanced robot specifically designed to intercept falling chunks of moon rock. Except, the people who run the Mondenkind Agency aren''t exactly knights in shining armor. And then there''s the question of whether the iDOLs are really JUST robots. Because from almost the first moment, Haruka starts to feel emotions resonating from within the iDOL called Imber.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r18Dg3XQnmkCq1xDNCns4bG1Vjb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34215'),
  ('321299857969680382', 'Idoly Pride', 2021, 'Animation', null, null, 'Sayaka Kanda, Haruki Ishiya, Mirai Tachibana, Mai Sugano, Moeko Yuki, Kokona Natsume, Nao Sasaki, Koharu Miyazawa', 'TV-14', 'After a successful audition, high school student Kotono Nagase and her best friend move into a dorm with eight other aspiring idols. They quickly realize it takes more than cute choreography and cute outfits to reach the top—it will take blood, sweat, and tears to advance in the idol-ranking VENUS program, where the top spot is held by superstar Mana Nagase... who happens to be Kotono’s older sister.', 'After a successful audition, high school student Kotono Nagase and her best friend move into a dorm with eight other aspiring idols. They quickly realize it takes more than cute choreography and cute outfits to reach the top—it will take blood, sweat, and tears to advance in the idol-ranking VENUS program, where the top spot is held by superstar Mana Nagase... who happens to be Kotono’s older sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kL7qWjUimxUiZkdmzKjcXepVd4r.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100935'),
  ('391447866416149192', 'If God Is Willing and da Creek Don''t Rise', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Spike Lee', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Spike Lee returns to New Orleans five years after Katrina to see how the ambitious plans to reinvent the Crescent City are playing out.', 'Spike Lee returns to New Orleans five years after Katrina to see how the ambitious plans to reinvent the Crescent City are playing out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/58ylI2Q8sZcQjtVy5Ya2Rfv3e36.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37306'),
  ('1023816894105693258', 'If Her Flag Breaks', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Ryota Osaka, Ibuki Kido, Ai Kayano, Kana Hanazawa, Yoko Hikasa, Kana Asumi', 'TV-14', 'Sota Hatate is a boy who has the unique ability to see "Flags" above the heads of other people. The "Flags" mark critical crossroads in people''s lives — when the choices they make will determine love, friendship, victory, and even death. He transfers into Tokyo''s elite Hatagaya Academy, but instead of living by himself in the boys'' dormitory, he ends up living with many beautiful girls under one roof.', 'Sota Hatate is a boy who has the unique ability to see "Flags" above the heads of other people. The "Flags" mark critical crossroads in people''s lives — when the choices they make will determine love, friendship, victory, and even death. He transfers into Tokyo''s elite Hatagaya Academy, but instead of living by himself in the boys'' dormitory, he ends up living with many beautiful girls under one roof.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i79igYeMCZ6UZsNFNBe3w2ms7sp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60835'),
  ('946565456155677007', 'If I Close My Eyes Now', 2019, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ricardo Linhares', 'Ricardo Linhares', 'Antônio Fagundes, João Gabriel D''Aleluia, Xande Valois, Débora Falabella, Murilo Benício, Mariana Ximenes, Gabriel Braga Nunes, Enzo Romani', null, 'In a quiet town, two boys find a woman''s mutilated body. After becoming suspects at first and realizing there is a mystery behind that murder, they decide to investigate the case with the help of an enigmatic old man. When a vertiginous spiral of violence is triggered, conspiracy begins to emerge and the boys must discover the truth as soon as possible in order not to become the next victims.', 'In a quiet town, two boys find a woman''s mutilated body. After becoming suspects at first and realizing there is a mystery behind that murder, they decide to investigate the case with the help of an enigmatic old man. When a vertiginous spiral of violence is triggered, conspiracy begins to emerge and the boys must discover the truth as soon as possible in order not to become the next victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oq8py5JOhdwXX9srl10jU63AQ4u.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88340'),
  ('1113754861376495116', 'If I Hadn''t Met You', 2018, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', null, null, 'Pablo Derqui, Andrea Ros, Javier Beltrán, Montse Guallar, Mercedes Sampietro, David Vert', 'TV-MA', 'Eduard, a husband and father who loses his family in a tragic accident, travels to parallel universes to seek a better fate for his beloved wife.', 'Eduard, a husband and father who loses his family in a tragic accident, travels to parallel universes to seek a better fate for his beloved wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w6zj5IJpoeCQTZG9zx39vbAh7wJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87611'),
  ('57698820618255545', 'If I See You in my Dreams', 1998, 'Animation', null, null, 'Hiro Yuuki, Rica Matsumoto, Mami Kingetsu, Hiroko Konishi, Masaru Hachinohe', 'TV-14', 'Virgin 24 year-old Fuguno Masuo is desperately in love with Shiozaki Nagisa, a 22 year-old kindergarten teacher. He is popular among the women, but he truly only has eyes for Nagisa. However, he is a clumsy, thickheaded and gentle man and gets into trouble a lot. He ends up in situations where it is easy for poor Nagisa to misinterpret what really happened.', 'Virgin 24 year-old Fuguno Masuo is desperately in love with Shiozaki Nagisa, a 22 year-old kindergarten teacher. He is popular among the women, but he truly only has eyes for Nagisa. However, he is a clumsy, thickheaded and gentle man and gets into trouble a lot. He ends up in situations where it is easy for poor Nagisa to misinterpret what really happened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3lIh4SoN1aKN1Sl4Oy7fLTUZ3Z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:22824'),
  ('1151003201086751197', 'If I Were Luísa Sonza', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Luísa Sonza', 'TV-MA', 'Brazil''s most polarizing pop singer opens up in this docuseries about her love life, career, controversies and the creation of a new album.', 'Brazil''s most polarizing pop singer opens up in this docuseries about her love life, career, controversies and the creation of a new album.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gs891va2DcZRgJmQhDgVl3EdpyC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:234255'),
  ('903597554631391288', 'If It''s for My Daughter, I''d Even Defeat a Demon Lord', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Nobuhiko Okamoto, Kanon Takao, Katsumi Fukuhara, Yuuki Kuwahara, Tsuyoshi Koyama, Yuuki Hirose, Manami Numakura, Mutsumi Tamura', 'TV-14', 'Dale is a cool, composed, and highly skilled adventurer who''s made quite a name for himself despite his youth. One day on a job deep in the forest, he comes across a little devil girl who''s almost wasted away. Unable to just leave her there to die, Dale takes her home and becomes her adoptive father. Devil or not, Latina is beyond adorable, and the adventurer soon finds himself head over heels with being a parent. But why was she out in the forest to begin with, and why does she carry the mark of a criminal?', 'Dale is a cool, composed, and highly skilled adventurer who''s made quite a name for himself despite his youth. One day on a job deep in the forest, he comes across a little devil girl who''s almost wasted away. Unable to just leave her there to die, Dale takes her home and becomes her adoptive father. Devil or not, Latina is beyond adorable, and the adventurer soon finds himself head over heels with being a parent. But why was she out in the forest to begin with, and why does she carry the mark of a criminal?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jv37TjutT1zXSWLmDgTF9BbBOcp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88804'),
  ('739141533299973873', 'If It''s Tuesday, It''s Murder', 2026, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Carlos Vila', null, 'Álex García, Inma Cuesta, Ana Wagener, Biel Montoro, Carmen Ruiz, Adriano Carvalho, Mia Zafra, Xavi Lite', 'TV-MA', 'A diverse group of tourists on an organized trip to Lisbon find themselves investigating a murder after one of them is killed on the first morning.', 'A diverse group of tourists on an organized trip to Lisbon find themselves investigating a murder after one of them is killed on the first morning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abWa2F4O0WNAh6xVVwWID7BIDd1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:255522'),
  ('18626446463252678', 'If It''s with You', 2023, 'Drama', 'Kubota Maru', null, 'Wataru Hyuga, Takato Okura, Ryota Aoyama, Kaito Sora, Sakimoto Sae, Minami Ruwa, Shinsuke Kato, Mika Hijii', null, 'When high school student Amane transfers to a school in Enoshima, he meets Ryuji, a kind-hearted classmate, and the two begin to grow closer and more attracted to each other. Will Amane, who has a hard time falling in love, change because of Ryuji?', 'When high school student Amane transfers to a school in Enoshima, he meets Ryuji, a kind-hearted classmate, and the two begin to grow closer and more attracted to each other. Will Amane, who has a hard time falling in love, change because of Ryuji?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bRhSYWqzlPJE0WvNxADMo0pNkms.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:234967'),
  ('348088159883981071', 'If My Favorite Pop Idol Made It to the Budokan, I Would Die', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Fairouz Ai, Hina Tachibana, Manami Itou, Maya Enoyoshi, Yoshitaka Yamaya, Kana Ichinose, Misaki Watada, Tomoaki Maeno', 'TV-14', 'Passionate music-lover Eripiyo only wants to see her favorite underground pop group, ChamJam, make it to the big stage at Budokan. Because they''ve enriched her life by their very existence, Eri is willing to dedicate everything she has to see this dream fulfilled—even her health. At their last performance she got a crazy nosebleed. Hey, no one said being a super-fan was easy!', 'Passionate music-lover Eripiyo only wants to see her favorite underground pop group, ChamJam, make it to the big stage at Budokan. Because they''ve enriched her life by their very existence, Eri is willing to dedicate everything she has to see this dream fulfilled—even her health. At their last performance she got a crazy nosebleed. Hey, no one said being a super-fan was easy!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n8tBDlRzWOA8ywyQNv3t9EokHVx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91024'),
  ('639321211656322843', 'If My Wife Becomes an Elementary School Student', 2022, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Nono Maida, Shinichi Tsutsumi, Aju Makita, Yuriko Ishida, Yoh Yoshida, Misato Morita, Shunsuke Tanaka, Satoshi Iizuka', null, 'A story that begins when a husband, who lost his beloved wife ten years ago and lost the meaning of life, and his daughter are unexpectedly reunited with their wife/mother. As his wife is reborn as a ten-year-old elementary school student, the family is reborn.', 'A story that begins when a husband, who lost his beloved wife ten years ago and lost the meaning of life, and his daughter are unexpectedly reunited with their wife/mother. As his wife is reborn as a ten-year-old elementary school student, the family is reborn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sCTZVrsjslUzNIHHFdK3oKkb4Bh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155019'),
  ('127715353481499420', 'If Only', 2022, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Irma Correa', null, 'Megan Montaner, Miquel Fernández, Salva Reina, Michel Noher, Jael Pascual, Eduardo Lloveras, Boré Buika', null, 'Follow the story of a 30-year-old woman who, when feeling dissatisfied with her marriage and family life, finds herself sent back in time 10 years following a lunar eclipse.', 'Follow the story of a 30-year-old woman who, when feeling dissatisfied with her marriage and family life, finds herself sent back in time 10 years following a lunar eclipse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jxJofiJUE9v8gBBmgVZKITHpLRC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:123531'),
  ('103516567616608586', 'If There Is No Tomorrow', 2020, 'Drama, Family', null, 'Wang Sanmao, Wang Lei', 'Guo Jingfei, Miao Miao, Gao Lu, Yue Yang, Gao Ye, Feng Hui, Zhao Da, Ning Wentong', null, 'A man who tolerates as much as he can, yet things change when he discovers that he is terminally ill.', 'A man who tolerates as much as he can, yet things change when he discovers that he is terminally ill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFmIIoOluqvv60BV3QAaDDKHh3z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:101588'),
  ('144950757036788265', 'If Tomorrow Comes', 1986, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Sidney Sheldon, Carmen Culver', null, 'Madolyn Smith Osborne, Tom Berenger, Richard Kiley, David Keith, Jack Weston, Liam Neeson', 'NR', 'Tracy Whitney was in love, pregnant and engaged to marry into one of America''s best family. And then, with one phone call, she lost everything. After 5 years of unjust imprisonment, Tracy emerges from prison a new woman. Cunning. Ruthless. Determined to survive. But there is one man as formidable as she is. As their paths crisscross, they eventually become daredevil partners in an adventure that climaxes their criminal careers.', 'Tracy Whitney was in love, pregnant and engaged to marry into one of America''s best family. And then, with one phone call, she lost everything. After 5 years of unjust imprisonment, Tracy emerges from prison a new woman. Cunning. Ruthless. Determined to survive. But there is one man as formidable as she is. As their paths crisscross, they eventually become daredevil partners in an adventure that climaxes their criminal careers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qS6oiLmTVNvCAvMqppUS6gMBb5G.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:26725'),
  ('600702146178064646', 'If You Love', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ali Bilgin', null, 'Kerem Bürsin, Hafsanur Sancaktutan, Hatice Aslan, Şerif Erol, Nazmi Kırık, Mine Kılıç, Aziz Caner İnan, Oğulcan Arman Uslu', null, 'Leyla is a resilient orphan with an intense spirit who joins a team of con men to fund the search for her long-lost parents. When she first meets Ateş, the brooding and cynical scion of a wealthy family, things don’t go well. Leyla is turned off by Ateş’s playboy charms, seeing him as just another privileged snob. But when fate reunites them, Leyla''s radiant personality gradually breaks through his defenses, and Ateş discovers a new, more mature side of himself. Amidst a backdrop of mystery and emotional turmoil, the two opposites find themselves drawn together.', 'Leyla is a resilient orphan with an intense spirit who joins a team of con men to fund the search for her long-lost parents. When she first meets Ateş, the brooding and cynical scion of a wealthy family, things don’t go well. Leyla is turned off by Ateş’s playboy charms, seeing him as just another privileged snob. But when fate reunites them, Leyla''s radiant personality gradually breaks through his defenses, and Ateş discovers a new, more mature side of himself. Amidst a backdrop of mystery and emotional turmoil, the two opposites find themselves drawn together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wSTocsRoodFpSURHvLr6rljlOZL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:228979'),
  ('976884442867779777', 'If You Wish Upon Me', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Jo Ryeong-soo', 'Ji Chang-wook, Sooyoung Choi, Sung Dong-il, Won Ji-an, Nam Tae-hun, Yang Hee-kyung, Kil Hae-yeon, Yoo Soon-woong', null, 'The story of patients and the caregivers of a hospice department. It is the story of people who dream of ''well-dying''.', 'The story of patients and the caregivers of a hospice department. It is the story of people who dream of ''well-dying''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzUhKgNO3QvWaIeiUgLumTfaZbX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135154'),
  ('325615944106164998', 'IGPX: Immortal Grand Prix', 2005, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Ryoko Ono, Kozo Mito, Akeno Watanabe, Vanilla Yamazaki, Kazuya Nakai, Emi Shinohara, Masahiko Tanaka, Jin Horikawa', 'TV-PG', 'In the year 2048, people are raving about a fighting race called “Immortal Grand Prix”, or IGPX in short, which is faster and more exciting than any of the existing motor sports. The phenomenon is so big that an entire city was built for the racing industry where competitions take place on a huge track. In the “Immortal Grand Prix,” two teams of three IG machines, high-tech humanoid mechs driven by humans, race at speeds greater than 400km/h. The teams make three laps of a 60 km course while intercepting the opponent as they vie for a first place finish. The best machine performance, the best pilots and the best teamwork are the only factors that can make them the winners.', 'In the year 2048, people are raving about a fighting race called “Immortal Grand Prix”, or IGPX in short, which is faster and more exciting than any of the existing motor sports. The phenomenon is so big that an entire city was built for the racing industry where competitions take place on a huge track. In the “Immortal Grand Prix,” two teams of three IG machines, high-tech humanoid mechs driven by humans, race at speeds greater than 400km/h. The teams make three laps of a 60 km course while intercepting the opponent as they vie for a first place finish. The best machine performance, the best pilots and the best teamwork are the only factors that can make them the winners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVjBbM1TUkq3r1Bq0wlo3ZG5xfC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:23475'),
  ('748281663857439118', 'Igra chefova', 2026, null, null, null, 'Toni Boban, Stiven Vunić, Tibor Valinčić', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31Zv8clyhn1eE8fpOUjsIHolHrJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317728'),
