  ('418668290227227732', 'Imaginary Mary', 2017, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'David Katzenberg, Shawn Levy', null, 'Jenna Elfman, Stephen Schneider, Rachel Dratch, Nicholas Coombe, Matreya Scarrwener, Erica Tremblay', 'TV-PG', 'A workaholic adult woman''s imaginary friend from childhood comes back to her, but ends up being more of a troublemaker than a great companion.', 'A workaholic adult woman''s imaginary friend from childhood comes back to her, but ends up being more of a troublemaker than a great companion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64V9f9THcBv5vS9MtEnShQqzSgP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70307'),
  ('930721460284368541', 'Imagination Movers', 2008, 'Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Kath Soucie, Dave Poche, Rich Collins, Scott "Smitty" Smith, Scott Durbin', 'TV-Y', 'Imagination Movers is a Live-action Pre-school television series that premiered on September 6, 2008 on Disney Channel. The program was originally part of the Playhouse Disney daily block intended for preschoolers. On February 14, 2011, it was moved to the Disney Junior block, serving as Playhouse Disney''s replacement. The Imagination Movers TV series is based on the format and music of the New Orleans based music group Imagination Movers who both act and are co-executive-producers of the show. On May 30, 2011, it was announced that the series will end after the remaining episodes of the third season have aired, though the band itself will continue and is open to doing other projects. On November 28, 2011 the Movers ran an announcement on official Facebook page implying that they have been given the green light to air more new episodes of the show in 2012.', 'Imagination Movers is a Live-action Pre-school television series that premiered on September 6, 2008 on Disney Channel. The program was originally part of the Playhouse Disney daily block intended for preschoolers. On February 14, 2011, it was moved to the Disney Junior block, serving as Playhouse Disney''s replacement. The Imagination Movers TV series is based on the format and music of the New Orleans based music group Imagination Movers who both act and are co-executive-producers of the show. On May 30, 2011, it was announced that the series will end after the remaining episodes of the third season have aired, though the band itself will continue and is open to doing other projects. On November 28, 2011 the Movers ran an announcement on official Facebook page implying that they have been given the green light to air more new episodes of the show in 2012.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2OKskLXccICv71IKAom0w5aWoUP.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:30916'),
  ('586813902071058586', 'Imitation', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Han Hyun-hee, Kim Min-jung', '최선영, Kim Min-jung', 'Lee Jun-young, Park Ji-yeon, Jung Zi-so, Yunho, Lim Na-young, Min-seo, Hwi Young, Kang Chan-hee', null, 'Ma-Ha, a member of the struggling girl group Teaparty, faces anger and backlash after injuring popular idol Kwon Ryeok during a reality TV program, leading to tense encounters as their paths continue to cross.', 'Ma-Ha, a member of the struggling girl group Teaparty, faces anger and backlash after injuring popular idol Kwon Ryeok during a reality TV program, leading to tense encounters as their paths continue to cross.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e5NL31hoK4EG8HvKlnTwkWpok8m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:116708'),
  ('903436499160336163', 'Imlie', 2020, 'Drama, Soap, Family', null, null, null, null, 'All Imlie wanted was to create a name for herself in the city. But upon her arrival, she finds herself caught in the middle of Aditya and Malini''s love story.', 'All Imlie wanted was to create a name for herself in the city. But upon her arrival, she finds herself caught in the middle of Aditya and Malini''s love story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sltUDXvpDZK3aVIdtkbImhcJv8t.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:113218'),
  ('330369021158354936', 'Imma Tataranni', 2019, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Francesco Amato, kiko Rosati, Mariolina Venezia', null, 'Vanessa Scalera, Massimiliano Gallo, Alessio Lapice, Carlo Buccirosso, Barbara Ronchi, Carlo Luca De Ruggieri, Monica Dugo, Lucia Zotti', null, 'Imma Tataranni is a rather abrasive deputy prosecutor of the Matera Public Prosecutor''s Office. She has the fashion sense of a rodeo clown, is gifted with a prodigious memory and used to solving cases with rather unorthodox methods.', 'Imma Tataranni is a rather abrasive deputy prosecutor of the Matera Public Prosecutor''s Office. She has the fashion sense of a rodeo clown, is gifted with a prodigious memory and used to solving cases with rather unorthodox methods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2vehPvmmOKBj343T8FT0pEgKO64.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:94931'),
  ('279784093873744375', 'ImMATURE', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sameer Saxena', 'Anant Singh', 'Omkar Kulkarni, Chinmay Chandraunshuh, Naman Jain, Kanikka Kapur, Daisy Khatri', null, 'A coming-of-age story about the many first adventures in a young man''s life. Dhruv is 16, and in a hurry to grow up. With a little help from his school friends, the wannabe bad-boy Kabir, and the color-blind but doesn''t know it Susu, Dhruv sets out to woo the first crush of his life, the feisty, out-of-his-league class topper, Chhavi. Venturing out of their childhood, in their last years of school, the trio find their first drink, pick their first fight and mend their first broken hearts.', 'A coming-of-age story about the many first adventures in a young man''s life. Dhruv is 16, and in a hurry to grow up. With a little help from his school friends, the wannabe bad-boy Kabir, and the color-blind but doesn''t know it Susu, Dhruv sets out to woo the first crush of his life, the feisty, out-of-his-league class topper, Chhavi. Venturing out of their childhood, in their last years of school, the trio find their first drink, pick their first fight and mend their first broken hearts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q9Gs8Pz7kmGb4KWIk9l0YIpd3lh.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:87030'),
  ('234600475686706361', 'Immigration Nation', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'With unprecedented access to ICE operations, as well as moving portraits of immigrants, this docuseries takes a deep look at U.S. immigration today.', 'With unprecedented access to ICE operations, as well as moving portraits of immigrants, this docuseries takes a deep look at U.S. immigration today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqMU6yRjho7w6advYliIK2Od4n4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106359'),
  ('457077819194969709', 'Immoral Guild', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Katsumi Fukuhara, Karin Isobe, Ayano Shibuya, You Taichi, Yuna Kamakura, Saho Shirasu, Rumi Okubo, Yuyu Shoji', 'TV-MA', 'The skilled hunter Kikuru Madan has decided to retire out of fear of wasting his youth. One day, a guild staff member suggests that he go on a quest with a new female martial artist named Hitamu Kyan. However, she keeps getting hit by monsters one after another.', 'The skilled hunter Kikuru Madan has decided to retire out of fear of wasting his youth. One day, a guild staff member suggests that he go on a quest with a new female martial artist named Hitamu Kyan. However, she keeps getting hit by monsters one after another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDqRJgunhvkHLJaH7BZjVtA1GzA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:194831'),
  ('105050533341912300', 'Immortal Doctor In Modern City', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, '冷调, 萧篙, 陈新玥', null, 'Ye Bufan, a junior student, tries to cheat a car to raise his mother''s medical expenses. Unexpectedly, he met a female driver who didn''t play by the rules. After being hit, Ye Bufan accidentally traveled to a fantasy world and obtained the inheritance of ancient medicine. Since then, he mastered medical skills, practiced martial arts, and won the hearts of many beautiful women.', 'Ye Bufan, a junior student, tries to cheat a car to raise his mother''s medical expenses. Unexpectedly, he met a female driver who didn''t play by the rules. After being hit, Ye Bufan accidentally traveled to a fantasy world and obtained the inheritance of ancient medicine. Since then, he mastered medical skills, practiced martial arts, and won the hearts of many beautiful women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4QKWb7xSlGECw2a9Hi8bhTwnNy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:273263'),
  ('133240206768018984', 'Immortal Samsara', 2022, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, 'Zhang Yuan''ang, Ma Yu Xin, Jia Binbin', 'Yang Zi, Cheng Yi, Zhang Rui, Meng Ziyi, Zhu Yongteng, Xu Kaining, Li Xinze, Han Chengyu', null, 'Yan Dan is the only descendant of an ancient tribe, the four-leaf scorpion. Since ancient times, her whole body has been a treasure of medicine. She and her twin sister Zhixi were able to cultivate into human form at the Queen Mother''s Feast a hundred years in advance and encountered the biggest trial in her life - the love trial. She fell in love with Lord Ying Yuan but had to spend the next 800 years forgetting him. However, at this time, Yu Mo suddenly entered her life, and become her great support. Every day, Yu Mo takes Yan Dan out to do good deeds. One day while they were punishing evil, they meet Lord Ying Yuan''s current reincarnation, Tang Zhou, who is currently a demon hunter. They help Tang Zhou search for the four ancient artifacts, and also discover a mysterious secret.', 'Yan Dan is the only descendant of an ancient tribe, the four-leaf scorpion. Since ancient times, her whole body has been a treasure of medicine. She and her twin sister Zhixi were able to cultivate into human form at the Queen Mother''s Feast a hundred years in advance and encountered the biggest trial in her life - the love trial. She fell in love with Lord Ying Yuan but had to spend the next 800 years forgetting him. However, at this time, Yu Mo suddenly entered her life, and become her great support. Every day, Yu Mo takes Yan Dan out to do good deeds. One day while they were punishing evil, they meet Lord Ying Yuan''s current reincarnation, Tang Zhou, who is currently a demon hunter. They help Tang Zhou search for the four ancient artifacts, and also discover a mysterious secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guScvEfq9QpnRwCjzYwQFbSSIr7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130147'),
  ('686183458382576519', 'Immortality', null, 'Mystery, Action & Adventure', null, 'He Fang', 'Arthur Chen, Luo Yunxi, Chen Yao, Zhou Qi, Gardner Tse Kwan-Ho, Wang Yan, Patrick Quan, Cui Peng', null, 'Mo Ran is the young disciple of the most powerful cultivator in the world, Chu Wan Ning. Due to misunderstandings and general differences, the two have been at odds with each other. Chu Wan Ning finds himself helpless in the face of Mo Ran''s teenage rebellion and the two keep on drawing further apart. Unbeknownst to Chu Wan Ning, in a past life, Mo Ran and Chu Wan Ning''s animosity ended in great bloodshed and misery when Mo Ran turned to the dark cultivating techniques. After the past life ends, sixteen-year-old Mo Ran wakes up with knowledge regarding the events of that past life. Believing he can change his tragic end this time around, Mo Ran sets out to change the course of events as he knows them but soon finds out things are not as they seemed to him.', 'Mo Ran is the young disciple of the most powerful cultivator in the world, Chu Wan Ning. Due to misunderstandings and general differences, the two have been at odds with each other. Chu Wan Ning finds himself helpless in the face of Mo Ran''s teenage rebellion and the two keep on drawing further apart. Unbeknownst to Chu Wan Ning, in a past life, Mo Ran and Chu Wan Ning''s animosity ended in great bloodshed and misery when Mo Ran turned to the dark cultivating techniques. After the past life ends, sixteen-year-old Mo Ran wakes up with knowledge regarding the events of that past life. Believing he can change his tragic end this time around, Mo Ran sets out to change the course of events as he knows them but soon finds out things are not as they seemed to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yOOsvOrlf6BLPQZvKYGDSRRKMHt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:122429'),
  ('877908441920871997', 'Immortality', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Meng Ru Shen Ji', null, 'Liu Sicen, He Wenxiao, Yumeng Zhang, Lin Zhaoyan, Liu Cong, Wang Jinger, Qing Liu', null, 'IMMORTALITY Fang Han, a humble family slave, always held the belief that "I would rather be a beggar than a slave", traversing the world only by himself. With an unyielding stubbornness, he cracked the mystery of supernatural powers and forged his body into an immortal body. He worked hard to step into the fairyland, and eventually became the peak king.', 'IMMORTALITY Fang Han, a humble family slave, always held the belief that "I would rather be a beggar than a slave", traversing the world only by himself. With an unyielding stubbornness, he cracked the mystery of supernatural powers and forged his body into an immortal body. He worked hard to step into the fairyland, and eventually became the peak king.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lMxWgt0r92s30MajKj6mmA1UwLQ.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:156571'),
  ('342658868205943662', 'Immortals', 2018, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Alphan Eşeli', null, 'Elçin Sangu, Selma Ergeç, Kerem Bürsin, Birkan Sokullu, Hazal Türesan, Nilperi Şahinkaya, Elit İşcan, İpek Tenolcay', 'TV-MA', 'Driven by revenge, human-turned-vampire Mia sets out to vanquish Dmitry, a ruthless vampire leader who seeks an artifact that grants immortality.', 'Driven by revenge, human-turned-vampire Mia sets out to vanquish Dmitry, a ruthless vampire leader who seeks an artifact that grants immortality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAViNgHIK9XwZU1afnomgp9vfh2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82007'),
  ('259020269599244247', 'Imo Tako Nankin', 2006, 'Family, Drama', null, null, 'Naomi Fujiyama, Jun Kunimura, Kyōko Kagawa, Tomoko Tabata, Ittoku Kishibe, Ayumi Ishida, Chikage Awashima', null, 'The series takes place in 1962 Osaka. Hanaoka Machiko, 37, is single and works at a hardware store in Osaka City while doing literary work. One day, she falls ill due to overwork and falls in love with Tokunaga Kenjiro, the doctor who examines her. Kenjiro and Machiko marry. But Kenjiro, who lost his first wife to illness, lives not just with his five children, but his brother, sister, and parents. In a comical and heart-warming way, the drama depicts Machiko''s struggle with the new family while pursuing her career as a novelist.', 'The series takes place in 1962 Osaka. Hanaoka Machiko, 37, is single and works at a hardware store in Osaka City while doing literary work. One day, she falls ill due to overwork and falls in love with Tokunaga Kenjiro, the doctor who examines her. Kenjiro and Machiko marry. But Kenjiro, who lost his first wife to illness, lives not just with his five children, but his brother, sister, and parents. In a comical and heart-warming way, the drama depicts Machiko''s struggle with the new family while pursuing her career as a novelist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cc188m7QyKFGfiNIh3zEgFIJV4Q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:196839'),
  ('260577249262104171', 'Impact', 2009, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'David James Elliott, Natasha Henstridge, Benjamin Sadler, Florentine Lahme, James Cromwell, Steven Culp, Natasha Calis, Owen Best', null, 'Impact is a mini-series about a meteor shower which eventually sends the moon on a collision course with Earth. The two-part mini-series premiered February 14 and 15, 2009 on the Canadian premium television channel Super Channel and was also shown on ABC on June 21 and 28, 2009 and on Alpha TV on September 2011 .', 'Impact is a mini-series about a meteor shower which eventually sends the moon on a collision course with Earth. The two-part mini-series premiered February 14 and 15, 2009 on the Canadian premium television channel Super Channel and was also shown on ABC on June 21 and 28, 2009 and on Alpha TV on September 2011 .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXPMbXRcuTQe8T8iwpWa1bxZt62.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31756'),
  ('842954369554343788', 'Impastor', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Christopher Vane', null, 'Michael Rosenbaum, Sara Rue, David Rasche, Mircea Monroe, Mike Kosinski', 'TV-MA', 'Buddy Dobbs, a slacker on the run from a loan shark, steals a man''s identity and ends up posing as a small town''s new gay pastor.', 'Buddy Dobbs, a slacker on the run from a loan shark, steals a man''s identity and ends up posing as a small town''s new gay pastor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4TFkZz3nsbnPSOOekrbT7S04PRV.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62263'),
  ('899841274363283904', 'Imperfect Us', 2024, 'Drama', 'Mag Hsu', null, 'Ariel Lin, Hsu Wei-ning, Mike He, Kai Ko, Lu Yi-ching, Hsieh Ying-shiuan, Johnny Lu, Lawrence Ko Yu-Luen', null, 'Chien Ching-fen, having attained all her life goals, begins to question the true nature of happiness. Realizing that achieving happiness often involves suffering, she seeks out new challenges. Her curiosity about her former rival, Rebecca, leads her to explore whether suffering is the path to lasting fulfillment.', 'Chien Ching-fen, having attained all her life goals, begins to question the true nature of happiness. Realizing that achieving happiness often involves suffering, she seeks out new challenges. Her curiosity about her former rival, Rebecca, leads her to explore whether suffering is the path to lasting fulfillment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9SoCF2GWahJtb7zHjwASNcb0j6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:235081'),
  ('230844334274786318', 'Imperfect Victim', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Zhou Xun, Liu Yijun, Lin Yun, Zhou Chengao, Hei Ze, Guan Yunpeng, Zhong Chuxi, Chen Shu', null, 'Lin Kan is a lawyer hired to represent a woman who accuses her boss of workplace assault. As the case becomes more complex, Lin Kan is forced to confront her own ethical dilemmas.', 'Lin Kan is a lawyer hired to represent a woman who accuses her boss of workplace assault. As the case becomes more complex, Lin Kan is forced to confront her own ethical dilemmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1iYWbce22F0zGY58n3NWH7sBhAZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:230685'),
  ('60281129930955463', 'Imperfect Women', 2026, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Annie Weisman', 'Rance Ward', 'Elisabeth Moss, Kerry Washington, Kate Mara, Joel Kinnaman, Corey Stoll', 'TV-MA', 'After a murder shatters the lives of three best friends, their decades-long bond is tested when an investigation reveals betrayals and shocking truths.', 'After a murder shatters the lives of three best friends, their decades-long bond is tested when an investigation reveals betrayals and shocking truths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wW7rimhnokiQ8V6ha6VKIwHg8IV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108181'),
  ('698224404098934331', 'Imperio De Mentiras', 2020, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Soap', 'Giselle González', null, 'Angelique Boyer, Andrés Palacios, Leticia Calderón, Susana González, Alejandro Camacho, Patricia Reyes Spíndola, Hernán Mendoza, Cecilia Toussaint', 'NR', 'Elisa Cantú never imagined that, upon returning to Mexico from New York, where she resides, she would encounter an unexpected tragedy that changes her life. The night Elisa would celebrate her birthday, fate leads her to meet Leonardo Velasco, a policeman in love with Julia, a teacher, to whom he was to marry. At the end of the evening, Leonardo receives an emergency call, in which the discovery of two bodies is reported, one of them is that of his fiancée, who lies next to the body of Augusto Cantú, millionaire businessman and father of Elisa. Elisa and Leonardo will come together to search for the truth of what happened.', 'Elisa Cantú never imagined that, upon returning to Mexico from New York, where she resides, she would encounter an unexpected tragedy that changes her life. The night Elisa would celebrate her birthday, fate leads her to meet Leonardo Velasco, a policeman in love with Julia, a teacher, to whom he was to marry. At the end of the evening, Leonardo receives an emergency call, in which the discovery of two bodies is reported, one of them is that of his fiancée, who lies next to the body of Augusto Cantú, millionaire businessman and father of Elisa. Elisa and Leonardo will come together to search for the truth of what happened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5adCPn5cthQcTN1q1e45gYD6v3Z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109470'),
  ('1051949188379105335', 'Important Things with Demetri Martin', 2009, 'Comedy', null, 'Megan Ganz', 'Demetri Martin, H. Jon Benjamin, Brian Berrebbi, John Oliver, H. Jon Benjamin, H. Jon Benjamin, David Cross, Amanda Peet', null, 'Important Things with Demetri Martin is a sketch-variety show that aired on Comedy Central starring comedian Demetri Martin. Each episode examined a single theme, the "important thing", such as timing, power, control and money. All sketches, short vignettes, animated segments and stand-up comedy were loosely related to the theme of the episode. The show was produced by Jon Stewart''s Busboy Productions, and contains stand-up, prop comedy and musical comedy by Martin, as well as taped sketches. Jon Stewart took an active role in editing the first few episodes.', 'Important Things with Demetri Martin is a sketch-variety show that aired on Comedy Central starring comedian Demetri Martin. Each episode examined a single theme, the "important thing", such as timing, power, control and money. All sketches, short vignettes, animated segments and stand-up comedy were loosely related to the theme of the episode. The show was produced by Jon Stewart''s Busboy Productions, and contains stand-up, prop comedy and musical comedy by Martin, as well as taped sketches. Jon Stewart took an active role in editing the first few episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oCq8YkCw5kwOexDPQC2UAa9JOCI.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:7141'),
  ('82422328239915113', 'Impossible Engineering', 2015, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Mike Bratton, Susie Sheehy', 'TV-PG', 'Behind every seemingly impossible marvel of modern engineering is a cast of historic trailblazers who designed new building techniques, took risks on untested materials and revolutionised their field. Each episode details how giant structures, record-beating buildings, war ships and spacecraft are built and work. As the show revels in these modern day creations, it also leaps back in time to recount the stories of the exceptional engineers whose technological advances made it all possible.', 'Behind every seemingly impossible marvel of modern engineering is a cast of historic trailblazers who designed new building techniques, took risks on untested materials and revolutionised their field. Each episode details how giant structures, record-beating buildings, war ships and spacecraft are built and work. As the show revels in these modern day creations, it also leaps back in time to recount the stories of the exceptional engineers whose technological advances made it all possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u1yhsnr0k1o6WcZBXnYQfZTHJbK.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:67080'),
  ('397968518422482852', 'Imposters', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy, Mystery, Crime', 'Adam Brooks, Paul Adelstein', null, 'Rob Heaps, Inbar Lavi, Parker Young, Marianne Rendón, Stephen Bishop, Brian Benben, Katherine LaNasa', 'TV-14', 'Maddie, a persona shifting con-artist who is as beautiful as she is dangerous, leaves her unwitting victims tormented when they realize they have been used and robbed of everything – including their hearts. But things get complicated when her former targets, Ezra, Richard, and Jules team up to track her down.', 'Maddie, a persona shifting con-artist who is as beautiful as she is dangerous, leaves her unwitting victims tormented when they realize they have been used and robbed of everything – including their hearts. But things get complicated when her former targets, Ezra, Richard, and Jules team up to track her down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1nezOc66ykPbbUbZGlfjuJaJH2d.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69889'),
  ('1060615904167663065', 'Impractical Jokers', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Joe Gatto, Sal Vulcano, Brian Quinn', null, 'Brian Quinn, James Murray, Sal Vulcano', 'TV-14', 'This hidden-camera series follows four lifelong friends -- Brian "Q"'' Quinn, James "Murr"'' Murray, Joe Gatto and Sal Vulcano -- who take dares to an outrageous level. To find out who is best under pressure, the guys compete in awkward and outrageous hidden-camera hijinks with the loser performing what is deemed to be the most-mortifying challenge yet.', 'This hidden-camera series follows four lifelong friends -- Brian "Q"'' Quinn, James "Murr"'' Murray, Joe Gatto and Sal Vulcano -- who take dares to an outrageous level. To find out who is best under pressure, the guys compete in awkward and outrageous hidden-camera hijinks with the loser performing what is deemed to be the most-mortifying challenge yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tRLj19YXH9GPiaqlU7GwWyd6G5K.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:59186'),
  ('201416057428873463', 'Impractical Jokers: Inside Jokes', 2016, 'Comedy, Reality', null, null, 'Joe Gatto, Brian Quinn, Sal Vulcano, James Murray', 'TV-14', 'Impractical Jokers: Inside Jokes packs classic, fan-favorite episodes of the show with shareable pop-up facts directly from the Jokers themselves, giving viewers a unique and unprecedented look behind the curtain.', 'Impractical Jokers: Inside Jokes packs classic, fan-favorite episodes of the show with shareable pop-up facts directly from the Jokers themselves, giving viewers a unique and unprecedented look behind the curtain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wUBFRTevrHTV2VJsAycxYHytJpA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67334'),
  ('664774641349072093', 'Impulse', 2018, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Jeffrey Lieber', 'Candice Philpot, Nikole Beckwith', 'Maddie Hasson, Missi Pyle, Sarah Desjardins, Enuka Okuma, Craig Arnold, Daniel Maslany, Callum Keith Rennie', null, '16-year-old Henry Coles is an outsider in her new town of Reston, New York. With a major chip on her shoulder and no friends, she remains withdrawn and isolated, but everything changes when a traumatic encounter with a classmate triggers something deep within Henry— unleashing a power she cannot control.', '16-year-old Henry Coles is an outsider in her new town of Reston, New York. With a major chip on her shoulder and no friends, she remains withdrawn and isolated, but everything changes when a traumatic encounter with a classmate triggers something deep within Henry— unleashing a power she cannot control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMZMj1gCDZA9eZzHpEmDMpQ0Iur.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:78670'),
  ('305992238893491199', 'Impure', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Alexandre Fraga', null, 'Raphael Logam, Rui Ricardo Diaz, Cyria Coentro, Leandro Firmino, Sergio Malheiros, Lorena Comparato, Rocco Pitanga, Karize Brum', 'TV-MA', 'Rio de Janeiro, during the 90''s. Evandro dreams about becoming a great businessman, but ends up entering the world of crime and making an empire out of his criminal organization. His business skills and leadership abilities draw the attention of Morello, a federal police officer with a self-destructive behavior who sees in Evandro a worthy enemy. Two strategists that share the love for danger. The hunt down begins.', 'Rio de Janeiro, during the 90''s. Evandro dreams about becoming a great businessman, but ends up entering the world of crime and making an empire out of his criminal organization. His business skills and leadership abilities draw the attention of Morello, a federal police officer with a self-destructive behavior who sees in Evandro a worthy enemy. Two strategists that share the love for danger. The hunt down begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l0T7D0LcDVoqWD3PViHX3wYXff.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:83295'),
  ('330906147057093857', 'In a Class of Her Own', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Zhi Lei', 'Ni Jun', 'Ju Jingyi, Song Weilong, Bi Wenjun, Wang Ruichang, Chen Yilong, Zhu Shengyi, Apollo Yu', null, 'Xue Wenxi comes from an impoverished family, and disguises as a guy to make ends meet by helping to transcript and copywrite books. She meets Feng Chengjun, the son of the Prime Minister, during a business transaction. Coming to admire her talent, Feng Chengjun secretly sets a plan in motion that leaves her with no choice but to enroll in the the Yun Shang Academy. As the school only accepts male students, Xue Wenxi disguises herself as a boy (renaming herself as Xue Wenbin), and lives everyday on thin ice to guard her secret. Fortunately, she has Feng Chengjun to come to her aid, allowing her to focus on her studies.', 'Xue Wenxi comes from an impoverished family, and disguises as a guy to make ends meet by helping to transcript and copywrite books. She meets Feng Chengjun, the son of the Prime Minister, during a business transaction. Coming to admire her talent, Feng Chengjun secretly sets a plan in motion that leaves her with no choice but to enroll in the the Yun Shang Academy. As the school only accepts male students, Xue Wenxi disguises herself as a boy (renaming herself as Xue Wenbin), and lives everyday on thin ice to guard her secret. Fortunately, she has Feng Chengjun to come to her aid, allowing her to focus on her studies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7sgfy2zDXD1YQsKmJnXWneR2FFU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106424'),
  ('1152465358254893620', 'In aller Freundschaft', 1998, 'Soap', null, null, 'Thomas Rühmann, Ursula Karusseit, Andrea-Kathrin Loewig, Alexa Maria Surholt, Uta Schorn, Thomas Koch, Cheryl Shepard, Rolf Becker', null, 'German soap opera about the staff of the fictional hospital "Sachsenklinik" in the city of Leipzig.', 'German soap opera about the staff of the fictional hospital "Sachsenklinik" in the city of Leipzig.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f8ZHSXNs5jyjMz3qg7mB2fqnTjP.jpg', 29, 'tmdb:tv:14509'),
  ('429788910666588455', 'In aller Freundschaft - Die jungen Ärzte', 2015, 'Drama', null, null, 'Marijam Agischewa, Sanam Afrashteh, Horst-Günter Marx, Stefan Ruppe, Philipp Danne, Mirka Pigulla, Christian Beermann', null, 'The spin-off to the original series ''In aller Freundschaft'' focuses on the young doctors in a fictional clinic in Erfurt. In this emotional drama series, hospital staffers and patients navigate life''s challenges.', 'The spin-off to the original series ''In aller Freundschaft'' focuses on the young doctors in a fictional clinic in Erfurt. In this emotional drama series, hospital staffers and patients navigate life''s challenges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNGHuwsxs6KlwymfgOdPKisfBBe.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:63613'),
  ('164129545360422969', 'In Another World with My Smartphone', 2017, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Katsumi Fukuhara, Marika Kouno, Chinatsu Akasaki, Nanami Yamashita, Yui Fukuo, Sumire Uesaka, Miyu Takagi, Maaya Uchida', 'TV-14', 'Touya Mochizuki was accidentally killed, and as an apology, God allows him to be reborn in a fantasy world and will grant him any one wish he desires. And so, Touya chooses to keep his smartphone in the next world. In his second chance at life, he befriends many important figures and comes across the world''s secret. He inherits the legacy of an ancient civilization and travels around nonchalantly while possessing powers that rival this world''s kings.', 'Touya Mochizuki was accidentally killed, and as an apology, God allows him to be reborn in a fantasy world and will grant him any one wish he desires. And so, Touya chooses to keep his smartphone in the next world. In his second chance at life, he befriends many important figures and comes across the world''s secret. He inherits the legacy of an ancient civilization and travels around nonchalantly while possessing powers that rival this world''s kings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3DboKiicC4ZbJe50sjG1fGdMGX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:72505'),
  ('822812169620186700', 'In Between', 2024, 'Drama', null, null, 'Tian Xiwei, Xin Yunlai, Zhang Zhehua, Zeng Mengxue, Yuan Wenkang, Hou Wenyuan, Dong Jie, Edward Chen', null, 'This is a story of growth of three girls, He Zhi Nan, Han Su, and Sun Han Han, and their journey through different emotional experiences. After bidding farewell to her long-distance boyfriend, He Zhi Nan discovers the preciousness of herself in love and being loved. As a role model for He Zhi Nan, Han Su is also on the road to success. She sees the hardworking nature of her heart in friendship and love and decides to go higher. Sun Han Han who gives her heart out pays the most painful price, but the setbacks make her braver and stronger. The three girls continue to grow through trial and error and are not afraid to explore their true selves.', 'This is a story of growth of three girls, He Zhi Nan, Han Su, and Sun Han Han, and their journey through different emotional experiences. After bidding farewell to her long-distance boyfriend, He Zhi Nan discovers the preciousness of herself in love and being loved. As a role model for He Zhi Nan, Han Su is also on the road to success. She sees the hardworking nature of her heart in friendship and love and decides to go higher. Sun Han Han who gives her heart out pays the most painful price, but the setbacks make her braver and stronger. The three girls continue to grow through trial and error and are not afraid to explore their true selves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZht1GpBtMcfOeu3IOgJYGS7jsp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:228414'),
  ('351116981844715914', 'In Blossom', 2024, 'Drama', null, null, 'Ju Jingyi, Liu Xueyi, Wu Jiayi, Li Geyang, Zheng Hehuizi, Zhang Rui, Qi Peixin, Ding Jie', null, 'In the sinful city of Heyang, very well-liked Pan Yue married Yang Caiwei, who was despised by everyone. However, Yang Caiwei was murdered on their wedding day. The suspected culprit was none other than Pan Yue. Reborn from death, Yang Caiwei was under the guise of the "wicked woman" Shangguan Zhi. She returned with a fierce demeanor, intending to expose Pan Yue''s true colors. As they bravely confronted the Four Major Clans and uncovered the old cases, their hearts drew closer once more. Yang Caiwei discovered that the true culprit was not Pan Yue, who had loved her deeply all along. Just as things seemed to be falling into place, the mastermind behind the scenes set another trap, pushing them into the abyss of despair.', 'In the sinful city of Heyang, very well-liked Pan Yue married Yang Caiwei, who was despised by everyone. However, Yang Caiwei was murdered on their wedding day. The suspected culprit was none other than Pan Yue. Reborn from death, Yang Caiwei was under the guise of the "wicked woman" Shangguan Zhi. She returned with a fierce demeanor, intending to expose Pan Yue''s true colors. As they bravely confronted the Four Major Clans and uncovered the old cases, their hearts drew closer once more. Yang Caiwei discovered that the true culprit was not Pan Yue, who had loved her deeply all along. Just as things seemed to be falling into place, the mastermind behind the scenes set another trap, pushing them into the abyss of despair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZtxx3g90JL7m7eoIfNFeIJyCf9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:235619'),
  ('568109934779129333', 'In Cold Blood', 1996, 'Drama', null, null, 'Sam Neill, Anthony Edwards, Eric Roberts, Don S. Davis, Margot Finley, Kevin Tighe, L.Q. Jones, Troy Evans', null, 'At the end of the 1950s, in a more innocent America, the brutal, meaningless slaying of a Midwestern family horrified the nation. This film is based on Truman Capote''s hauntingly detailed, psychologically penetrating nonfiction novel. While in prison, Dick Hickock, 20, hears a cell-mate''s story about $10,000 in cash kept in a home safe by a prosperous rancher. When he''s paroled, Dick persuades ex-con Perry Smith, also 20, to join him in going after the stash. On a November night in 1959, Dick and Perry break into the Holcomb, Kansas, house of Herb Clutter. Enraged at finding no safe, they wake the sleeping family and brutally kill them all. The bodies are found by two friends who come by before Sunday church. The murders shock the small Great Plains town, where doors are routinely left unlocked. Detective Alvin Dewey of the Kansas Bureau of Investigation heads the case, but there are no clues, no apparent motive and no suspects...', 'At the end of the 1950s, in a more innocent America, the brutal, meaningless slaying of a Midwestern family horrified the nation. This film is based on Truman Capote''s hauntingly detailed, psychologically penetrating nonfiction novel. While in prison, Dick Hickock, 20, hears a cell-mate''s story about $10,000 in cash kept in a home safe by a prosperous rancher. When he''s paroled, Dick persuades ex-con Perry Smith, also 20, to join him in going after the stash. On a November night in 1959, Dick and Perry break into the Holcomb, Kansas, house of Herb Clutter. Enraged at finding no safe, they wake the sleeping family and brutally kill them all. The bodies are found by two friends who come by before Sunday church. The murders shock the small Great Plains town, where doors are routinely left unlocked. Detective Alvin Dewey of the Kansas Bureau of Investigation heads the case, but there are no clues, no apparent motive and no suspects...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zMWoPZ1o3aKHiNj2mCGRt8o8fUM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:29853'),
  ('828557325434449370', 'In De Gloria', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Jan Eelen', null, 'Wim Opbrouck, Sien Eggers, Frank Focketyn, Kris Focketyn, An Miller, Lucas Van den Eynde, Tania Van der Sanden, Tom van Dyck', null, 'In de gloria was a Flemish sketch comedy show by Jan Eelen that ran on the Canvas television station in the period 2000–2002. It ran for 2 seasons, each containing 10 episodes. The show featured fictitious television reports presented as if they were real. In De Gloria was a satire on reality television and human interest programs featuring ordinary people, portrayed by the cast. The title translates to "in the glory".', 'In de gloria was a Flemish sketch comedy show by Jan Eelen that ran on the Canvas television station in the period 2000–2002. It ran for 2 seasons, each containing 10 episodes. The show featured fictitious television reports presented as if they were real. In De Gloria was a satire on reality television and human interest programs featuring ordinary people, portrayed by the cast. The title translates to "in the glory".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9oJeFdigTaI2yp67bbSjqMlYPj.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:12983'),
  ('251179243631927527', 'In de Vlaamsche pot', 1990, 'Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Adriaan Olree, Josephine van der Meer, Dorine Niezing, Serge-Henri Valcke, Frans van Deursen', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66FGRYZ3PGzfVSCPVR7MYnH9jqL.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:82303'),
  ('690542300083656376', 'In Family We Trust', 2018, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Noppol Gomarachun, Patravadi Mejudhon, Songsit Rungnopakunsi, Saksit Tangthong, Kathaleeya McIntosh, Sopitnapa Chumpanee, Apasiri Nitibhon, Phollawat Manuprasert', null, 'The story revolves around an extended Thai Chinese family whose members'' seemingly happy relationships devolve into conflict following murder of the eldest son and head of the family business.', 'The story revolves around an extended Thai Chinese family whose members'' seemingly happy relationships devolve into conflict following murder of the eldest son and head of the family business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Iap8oJ4nZTlj82YBcYeJlYh1lK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83792'),
  ('781097300344297909', 'In Flight', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Mike Walden, Adam Randall', 'Mike Walden', 'Katherine Kelly, Stuart Martin, Ashley Thomas, Bronagh Waugh, Harry Cadby, Corinna Brown, Ambreen Razia', null, 'When her teenage son is jailed for murder in Bulgaria, flight attendant Jo enters a murky world of drug smuggling and will stop at nothing to save him.', 'When her teenage son is jailed for murder in Bulgaria, flight attendant Jo enters a murky world of drug smuggling and will stop at nothing to save him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ZGTCe5Jl01JQ4zdfjhnXy4WBgo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:276563'),
  ('71604114924735580', 'In From the Cold', 2022, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Adam Glass', null, 'Margarita Levieva, Cillian O''Sullivan, Lydia Fleming, Charles Brice, Alyona Khmelnitskaya, Amanda Bright, Stasya Miloslavskaya, Pablo Capuz', 'TV-MA', 'Exposed as an ex-Russian spy, an American single mom must juggle family life and unique shape-shifting skills in a battle against an insidious enemy.', 'Exposed as an ex-Russian spy, an American single mom must juggle family life and unique shape-shifting skills in a battle against an insidious enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1eL0iQiLx141MSVbDoY4B24Oqo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:146173'),
  ('258736399749651981', 'In Justice', 2006, 'Crime, Drama', 'Michelle King, Robert King', null, 'Kyle MacLachlan, Jason O''Mara, Constance Zimmer, Daniel Cosgrove', 'TV-14', 'In Justice is an American television legal drama created by Michelle King and Robert King, and stars Kyle MacLachlan as David Swain, a wealthy and successful lawyer who heads a high-profile organization called the National Justice Project in the San Francisco Bay Area, along with his lead investigator, ex–police detective Charles Conti. Members of the National Justice Project work pro-bono to overturn wrongful convictions, liberate the falsely accused and discover the identity of those who are really at fault. The series began airing on Sunday, January 1, 2006 on ABC as a midseason replacement and assumed its regular night and time on Friday, January 6, 2006 at 9 p.m. EST. It was canceled after 13 episodes on March 31, 2006.', 'In Justice is an American television legal drama created by Michelle King and Robert King, and stars Kyle MacLachlan as David Swain, a wealthy and successful lawyer who heads a high-profile organization called the National Justice Project in the San Francisco Bay Area, along with his lead investigator, ex–police detective Charles Conti. Members of the National Justice Project work pro-bono to overturn wrongful convictions, liberate the falsely accused and discover the identity of those who are really at fault. The series began airing on Sunday, January 1, 2006 on ABC as a midseason replacement and assumed its regular night and time on Friday, January 6, 2006 at 9 p.m. EST. It was canceled after 13 episodes on March 31, 2006.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6zL3cDoaRrKrxxVzyMtZIC5ckit.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2466'),
  ('662075138881166641', 'In Living Color', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Damon Wayans, Keenen Ivory Wayans', null, 'Jim Carrey, Tommy Davidson, David Alan Grier, T''Keyah Crystal Keymáh, Jamie Foxx, Ali Wentworth, Jay Leggett, Reggie McFadden', 'TV-14', 'Created by stars Keenen Ivory Wayans and Damon Wayans, this Emmy-winning sketch series offers cutting-edge satire and features a host of talent, including Jamie Foxx, Jim Carrey, David Alan Grier and Tommy Davidson.', 'Created by stars Keenen Ivory Wayans and Damon Wayans, this Emmy-winning sketch series offers cutting-edge satire and features a host of talent, including Jamie Foxx, Jim Carrey, David Alan Grier and Tommy Davidson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u5BZEJ9X6L24a1MUAun1SdkOFTn.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:4415'),
  ('499670591029736444', 'In Love All Over Again', 2023, 'Drama', 'Carlos Montero', null, 'Georgina Amorós, Franco Masini, Carlos González, Blanca Martínez, Albert Salazar, Roser Vilajosana, Kyle Scudder', 'TV-MA', 'Ever since they met, Irene and Julio have been falling in love, splitting up, and then trying again. Will they ever find their happy ending?', 'Ever since they met, Irene and Julio have been falling in love, splitting up, and then trying again. Will they ever find their happy ending?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8HteBmTyI9yN0Mava1Cu7D6FIW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218428'),
  ('1065579769812949208', 'In My Skin', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Kayleigh Llewellyn', null, 'Gabrielle Creevy, Poppy Lee Friar, James Wilbraham, Jo Hartley, Rhodri Meilir', null, 'Coming-of-age story of 16-year-old Bethan, who we follow as she deals with the comical but painfully real anxieties and insecurities of teenage life, along with the stark reality of a home life that is far removed from what she projects to her friends.', 'Coming-of-age story of 16-year-old Bethan, who we follow as she deals with the comical but painfully real anxieties and insecurities of teenage life, along with the stark reality of a home life that is far removed from what she projects to her friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zOLx19TxskkCPObaNv890Zuy2yl.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:101797'),
  ('362238118876523931', 'In Plain Sight', 2008, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'David Maples', null, 'Mary McCormack, Frederick Weller, Paul Ben-Victor, Tangie Ambrose, Rachel Boston', 'TV-14', 'U.S. Marshal Mary Shannon must hunt down witnesses for federal cases in the witness protection program while also managing a rather dysfunctional family and her own personal life.', 'U.S. Marshal Mary Shannon must hunt down witnesses for federal cases in the witness protection program while also managing a rather dysfunctional family and her own personal life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/utJdDq3c9uRCdvYHlF5qptWLZfh.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:7235'),
  ('650448929083855516', 'In Plain Sight', 2016, 'Crime, Drama', 'John Strickland', 'Nick Stevens', 'Martin Compston, Douglas Henshall, Joanne Thompson, Shauna Macdonald, Joanna Roth, Jenny Hulse, Bobby Rainsbury, Michael Nardone', null, 'Based on the true story of Lanarkshire detective William Muncie’s quest to bring to justice notorious Scottish killer Peter Manuel.', 'Based on the true story of Lanarkshire detective William Muncie’s quest to bring to justice notorious Scottish killer Peter Manuel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/980hwMFK5eWqC3aNd5vEGxdDskt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68761'),
  ('811226363089776544', 'In Search of Aliens', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Giorgio A. Tsoukalos', null, 'Giorgio A. Tsoukalos', 'TV-PG', 'From the lost city of Atlantis to the Loch Ness Monster to the mystery of the Nazca Lines, the world is filled with tales of mysterious locations, mythical creatures and strange occurrences. But could these extraordinary stories and theories turn out to be stranger-than-fiction truths? If so, might there be an extraterrestrial explanation for these phenomena? IN SEARCH OF ALIENS follows Giorgio Tsoukalos, an Ancient Astronaut theorist and leading contributor to Ancient Aliens, as he explores the fascinating evidence behind some of the Earth’s most famous mysteries. Through Giorgio’s research of various sites around the world and meetings with scientists, witnesses and experts; this one-hour non-fiction series delves into the unknown and examines clues that could prove a possible extraterrestrial connection within some of the world’s greatest unsolved mysteries.', 'From the lost city of Atlantis to the Loch Ness Monster to the mystery of the Nazca Lines, the world is filled with tales of mysterious locations, mythical creatures and strange occurrences. But could these extraordinary stories and theories turn out to be stranger-than-fiction truths? If so, might there be an extraterrestrial explanation for these phenomena? IN SEARCH OF ALIENS follows Giorgio Tsoukalos, an Ancient Astronaut theorist and leading contributor to Ancient Aliens, as he explores the fascinating evidence behind some of the Earth’s most famous mysteries. Through Giorgio’s research of various sites around the world and meetings with scientists, witnesses and experts; this one-hour non-fiction series delves into the unknown and examines clues that could prove a possible extraterrestrial connection within some of the world’s greatest unsolved mysteries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dlh4wthAJImpoOi4UNXq9KDF1M4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99032'),
  ('74007403359002685', 'In Search of Gods', 2026, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Su Shangqing, Shi Zekun, Zhang Huilin, Yumeng Zhang, Chang Wentao, Li Lu, Qiu Qiu, Lu Yang', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ul8F0xT9IGr81lWfq99HLmiH76k.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233291'),
  ('369970174533135676', 'In Search of...', 1977, 'Documentary, Mystery', 'Alan Landsburg', null, 'Leonard Nimoy', null, 'In Search of... is a TV series that was broadcast weekly from 1977 to 1982, devoted to mysterious phenomena. It was created after the success of three one-hour TV documentaries produced by creator Alan Landsburg: In Search of Ancient Astronauts in 1973, In Search of Ancient Mysteries and The Outer Space Connection, both in 1975. All three featured narration by Rod Serling, who was the initial choice to host the spin-off show. After Serling''s death, Leonard Nimoy was selected to be the host.', 'In Search of... is a TV series that was broadcast weekly from 1977 to 1982, devoted to mysterious phenomena. It was created after the success of three one-hour TV documentaries produced by creator Alan Landsburg: In Search of Ancient Astronauts in 1973, In Search of Ancient Mysteries and The Outer Space Connection, both in 1975. All three featured narration by Rod Serling, who was the initial choice to host the spin-off show. After Serling''s death, Leonard Nimoy was selected to be the host.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJunFmZZ3WiUv0ZIR5tXVXwd6Hu.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:3574'),
  ('926390701421162451', 'In Sickness and in Health', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Johnny Speight', 'Johnny Speight', 'Warren Mitchell, Carmel McSharry, James Ellis', null, 'This final follow-up to ''Till Death Us Do Part'' follows an aged Alf Garnett, now dealing with his wife Else''s declining health and mobility, as well as the challenges of navigating the social security system and other everyday situations.', 'This final follow-up to ''Till Death Us Do Part'' follows an aged Alf Garnett, now dealing with his wife Else''s declining health and mobility, as well as the challenges of navigating the social security system and other everyday situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9akKTcT5K1O7FGQbZVvB0Ni1Pal.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:3316'),
  ('207054672276283939', 'In Spite of the Strong Wind', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Jin Dong, Song Jia, Tian Yu, Yang Le, Ni Dahong, Liang Jing, Sha Baoliang, Xin Zhilei', null, 'When Tang Chen''s career was booming, he had to declare bankruptcy when he was "sold out" by his girlfriend Shuo Bing. But soon he withdrew from the swamp of failure and actively devoted himself to a second venture. Sha Zhou, a good friend for many years, has an excellent writing style, but he has always been a depressed little reporter. With the persuasion of Tang Chen and the support of his wife, he was the first to join the entrepreneurial team. According to the division of labor within the team, Tang Chen and Sha Zhou worked together to find Hou Zhi, Zhu Ran, and Bai Ying, and set up a gray whale public relations company. Tang Chen used his industry acumen for many years to actively search for customers, lead his partners to overcome difficulties, help pig feed magnate Xie Liqiang to build a public image, push the furious divine comedy, and win Feida''s public relations contract.', 'When Tang Chen''s career was booming, he had to declare bankruptcy when he was "sold out" by his girlfriend Shuo Bing. But soon he withdrew from the swamp of failure and actively devoted himself to a second venture. Sha Zhou, a good friend for many years, has an excellent writing style, but he has always been a depressed little reporter. With the persuasion of Tang Chen and the support of his wife, he was the first to join the entrepreneurial team. According to the division of labor within the team, Tang Chen and Sha Zhou worked together to find Hou Zhi, Zhu Ran, and Bai Ying, and set up a gray whale public relations company. Tang Chen used his industry acumen for many years to actively search for customers, lead his partners to overcome difficulties, help pig feed magnate Xie Liqiang to build a public image, push the furious divine comedy, and win Feida''s public relations contract.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6pHZkbEglScyg9UoFXPWr0F5MR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217431'),
  ('940956999669849268', 'In Tandem', 2016, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Jérémie Marcus', null, 'Titouan Laporte, Stéphane Blancafort, Piérick Tournier, Astrid Veillon, François-Dominique Blin, Mélanie Guth', null, 'Commander Léa Soler and Captain Paul Marchal are divorced, but they''ll have to team up. Not to mention their teenage children, Alice and Thomas, who are also forced to see each other outside of work.', 'Commander Léa Soler and Captain Paul Marchal are divorced, but they''ll have to team up. Not to mention their teenage children, Alice and Thomas, who are also forced to see each other outside of work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5EgTZSyK5mvFwkz1nRfgkiu5SGQ.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:72598'),
  ('1149892487516726861', 'In the Clear Moonlit Dusk', 2026, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Rei Ichinomiya, Ryota Suzuki, Aya Yamane, Momoko Seto, Shota Hayama, Kentaro Kumagai', null, 'Yoi Takiguchi is a first-year high school student, admired for her handsome looks and honest heart, which earned her the nickname “Prince.” One day, she bumps into Kohaku Ichimura, an upperclassman and another “Prince.” As the two grow closer, is what blossoms between them friendship or love? A youthful love story about a boy and a girl who are both called “Princes” begins.', 'Yoi Takiguchi is a first-year high school student, admired for her handsome looks and honest heart, which earned her the nickname “Prince.” One day, she bumps into Kohaku Ichimura, an upperclassman and another “Prince.” As the two grow closer, is what blossoms between them friendship or love? A youthful love story about a boy and a girl who are both called “Princes” begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qetD01amQRFX5ibXQ7rWLe6togE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:287591'),
  ('583244350503660765', 'In the Dark', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Daniel Brocklehurst', null, 'MyAnna Buring, Ben Batt, David Leon, Jamie Sives, Georgia Tennant, Matt King', 'TV-MA', 'DI Helen Weeks grapples with pregnancy as she undertakes a very personal abduction case.', 'DI Helen Weeks grapples with pregnancy as she undertakes a very personal abduction case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecUKYm6Pf8dEHk2IZiNaLtbprRQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72785'),
  ('819752614640194587', 'In the Dark', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Corinne Kingsbury', null, 'Perry Mattfeld, Morgan Krantz, Casey Deidrick, Keston John, Theodore Bhat, Matt Murray, Marianne Rendón', 'TV-14', 'Murphy is a flawed and irreverent woman who just happens to be blind and is the only “witness” to the murder of her drug-dealing friend, Tyson. When the police dismiss her story, she sets out with her dog, Pretzel, to find the killer while also managing her colorful dating life and the job she hates at Guiding Hope, the guide-dog school owned by her overprotective parents.', 'Murphy is a flawed and irreverent woman who just happens to be blind and is the only “witness” to the murder of her drug-dealing friend, Tyson. When the police dismiss her story, she sets out with her dog, Pretzel, to find the killer while also managing her colorful dating life and the job she hates at Guiding Hope, the guide-dog school owned by her overprotective parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dvfuQNUItkbQ8e2o80i6HgySLI8.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:85727'),
  ('622083088548792374', 'In the Eye of the Storm', 2024, 'Documentary, Drama', null, null, 'Reed Timmer', null, 'This series reveals recent natural disasters as they happened in real-time through footage captured by eyewitnesses who found themselves in the wrong place at the right time and boldly held up their camera phones to capture the eye of the storm.', 'This series reveals recent natural disasters as they happened in real-time through footage captured by eyewitnesses who found themselves in the wrong place at the right time and boldly held up their camera phones to capture the eye of the storm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bp4qbjvLwIB0wIW3nUXyb8VDbgI.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:258731'),
  ('363585454694245243', 'In the Face of Crime', 2010, 'Crime, Drama', 'Rolf Basedow', null, 'Max Riemelt, Ronald Zehrfeld, Marie Bäumer, Mišel Matičević, Alina Levshin, Arved Birnbaum, Uwe Preuss, Ulrike C. Tscharre', 'NR', 'Im Angesicht des Verbrechens is a German television series about the Russian mafia in Berlin. It received high critical acclaim, but the viewer figures were disappointing. It was broadcast by ARTE and Das Erste.', 'Im Angesicht des Verbrechens is a German television series about the Russian mafia in Berlin. It received high critical acclaim, but the viewer figures were disappointing. It was broadcast by ARTE and Das Erste.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4YMGmvKPTFA6b2DMvvXYocPokFE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37131'),
  ('174971957371700362', 'In the Flesh', 2013, 'Drama', 'Dominic Mitchell', null, 'Luke Newberry, Marie Critchley, Steve Cooper, Harriet Cains, Emily Bevan, Sandra Huggett, Wunmi Mosaku, Emmett J. Scanlan', 'TV-14', 'Thousands of dead people have risen from their graves and nearly destroyed Britain. A cure has been found - but can the treated zombies be rehabilitated back into living society?', 'Thousands of dead people have risen from their graves and nearly destroyed Britain. A cure has been found - but can the treated zombies be rehabilitated back into living society?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4tZDFurNMf1nWzBamhz1hOEsFZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:46746'),
  ('226376689004772811', 'In the Heart of Kunoichi Tsubaki', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yuko Natsuyoshi, Miyari Nemoto, Sayumi Suzushiro, Yumi Uchiyama, Mao Ichimichi, Aya Yamane, Manaka Iwami, Miyu Tomita', 'TV-14', 'The isolationist Akane Clan, composed of an all-girls body mainly consisting of young kunoichi in training, has a code to which they all must adhere: "As men are dangerous beings, interacting with them is forbidden." Kunoichi Tsubaki, the leader of the Dog Squad, is an excellent trainee with a promising future, but she has started to experience a strange feeling in her heart... whenever the subject of boys is brought up.', 'The isolationist Akane Clan, composed of an all-girls body mainly consisting of young kunoichi in training, has a code to which they all must adhere: "As men are dangerous beings, interacting with them is forbidden." Kunoichi Tsubaki, the leader of the Dog Squad, is an excellent trainee with a promising future, but she has started to experience a strange feeling in her heart... whenever the subject of boys is brought up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2tuEq6N6Y5soicGzN3V7mz3L32.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138180'),
  ('173316799726804764', 'In the Heat of the Night', 1988, 'Crime, Drama', 'James Lee Barrett', null, 'Carroll O''Connor, Alan Autry, David Hart, Hugh O''Connor, Crystal R. Fox, Denise Nicholas, Carl Weathers', null, 'In the Heat of the Night is an American television series based on the motion picture and novel of the same name starring Carroll O''Connor as the white police chief William Gillespie, and Howard Rollins as the African-American police detective Virgil Tibbs. It was broadcast on NBC from 1988 until 1992, and then on CBS until 1995. Its executive producers were Fred Silverman, Juanita Bartlett and Carroll O''Connor. TGG Direct released the first season of the series to DVD on August 28, 2012.', 'In the Heat of the Night is an American television series based on the motion picture and novel of the same name starring Carroll O''Connor as the white police chief William Gillespie, and Howard Rollins as the African-American police detective Virgil Tibbs. It was broadcast on NBC from 1988 until 1992, and then on CBS until 1995. Its executive producers were Fred Silverman, Juanita Bartlett and Carroll O''Connor. TGG Direct released the first season of the series to DVD on August 28, 2012.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZ1EH5HiMclbP6DWgIl8D7qETv2.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:862'),
  ('641090268173982310', 'In the House', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Quincy Jones, Winifred Hervey', null, 'LL Cool J, Maia Campbell, Alfonso Ribeiro, Lark Voorhies', null, 'A once-famous football player must rent part of his house to support himself. A single mother and her two kids are the latest tenants. He also owns a sports clinic that he barely manages to run with help from his friends', 'A once-famous football player must rent part of his house to support himself. A single mother and her two kids are the latest tenants. He also owns a sports clinic that he barely manages to run with help from his friends', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i207RSpEkIqyV5hU7xRAM8doygg.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:81'),
  ('717158244560646876', 'In the Know', 2024, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Mike Judge, Brandon Gardner, Zach Woods', null, 'Zach Woods, Mike Judge, J. Smith-Cameron, Charlie Bushnell, Carl Tart, Caitlin Reilly', 'TV-MA', 'Lauren Caspian is public radio''s third most popular host. He''s a well-meaning, hypocritical nimrod, just like you and me. He''s also a stop motion puppet. Each episode follows the making of an episode of Lauren''s show In the Know, in which Lauren conducts in-depth interviews with real world human guests. Lauren collaborates with a diverse crew of NPR staff. They are also puppets and nimrods.', 'Lauren Caspian is public radio''s third most popular host. He''s a well-meaning, hypocritical nimrod, just like you and me. He''s also a stop motion puppet. Each episode follows the making of an episode of Lauren''s show In the Know, in which Lauren conducts in-depth interviews with real world human guests. Lauren collaborates with a diverse crew of NPR staff. They are also puppets and nimrods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gDZwEThWQDSpMz6mVAizer14yLc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210684'),
  ('810735467191366571', 'In the Land of Leadale', 2022, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Eri Yukimura, Daisuke Ono, Kaori Nazuka, Tomokazu Sugita, Yui Otagiri, Kanako Yanagihara, Sakura Nakamura, Yuuki Hirose', 'TV-14', 'Due to a terrible accident, Keina Kagami is forced to live on life support in order to survive. The only way for her to be free is within the VRMMORPG "Leadale." One day, her life support stops functioning, and Keina loses her life. But when she wakes up, she finds herself in the world of Leadale 200 years in the future. She is now the half-elf Cayna, who possesses lost skills and OP statuses and becomes closer to the other inhabitants of this world. But among those inhabitants happen to be the "children" she made in character creation?!', 'Due to a terrible accident, Keina Kagami is forced to live on life support in order to survive. The only way for her to be free is within the VRMMORPG "Leadale." One day, her life support stops functioning, and Keina loses her life. But when she wakes up, she finds herself in the world of Leadale 200 years in the future. She is now the half-elf Cayna, who possesses lost skills and OP statuses and becomes closer to the other inhabitants of this world. But among those inhabitants happen to be the "children" she made in character creation?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/GQVw5PC4385SMuKuuSIqzTLKof.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:119335'),
  ('166950600724981421', 'In the Long Run', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Idris Elba', null, 'Jimmy Akingbola, Idris Elba, Madeline Appiah, Bill Bailey, Kellie Shirley, Sammy Kamara, Robert Ryan, Rachel Sophia-Anthony', null, 'Set in 1980s London, this comedy series follows the Easmon family, which has settled in England after having arrived from Sierra Leone a decade earlier. The Easmons’ son, Akuna, hangs out in the housing project where the family lives, playing soccer and dodging the local thugs. The family’s life is turned upside down when Walter’s brother Valentine arrives in the U.K., bringing chaos in his wake and igniting a passion for music in Akuna.', 'Set in 1980s London, this comedy series follows the Easmon family, which has settled in England after having arrived from Sierra Leone a decade earlier. The Easmons’ son, Akuna, hangs out in the housing project where the family lives, playing soccer and dodging the local thugs. The family’s life is turned upside down when Walter’s brother Valentine arrives in the U.K., bringing chaos in his wake and igniting a passion for music in Akuna.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qLnuYtoiJUDQYM5BeuyNmx3YQmo.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:74316'),
  ('43102237998374377', 'In the Mud', 2025, 'Crime, Drama', 'Sebastián Ortega', null, 'China Suárez, Eugenia Suárez', 'TV-MA', 'Five female prisoners forge a unique bond after a deadly accident... until corruption and turf wars within a ruthless prison threaten to destroy them.', 'Five female prisoners forge a unique bond after a deadly accident... until corruption and turf wars within a ruthless prison threaten to destroy them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9JWQYB7FkGtg47wFO7GOrUDgYrx.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:258462'),
  ('345225998375940403', 'In the Name of God: A Holy Betrayal', 2023, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Jo Seong-hyeon', 'Ko Hye-rim', null, 'TV-MA', 'This docuseries examining the chilling true stories of four Korean leaders claiming to be prophets exposes the dark side of unquestioning belief.', 'This docuseries examining the chilling true stories of four Korean leaders claiming to be prophets exposes the dark side of unquestioning belief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/srGzplt2VmQqpLSRytAqkPr8pVI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218476'),
  ('17023487030893072', 'In the Name of People', 2017, 'Drama', 'Li Lu, 周梅森', null, 'Lu Yi, Zhang Fengyi, Wu Gang, Xu Yajun, Ke Lan, Zhang Zhijian, Hu Jing, Zhang Kaili', null, 'In the fictional city of Jingzhou, prosecutor Tian Guofu and anti-corruption officer Sha Ruijin investigate high-level corruption, uncovering a complex web of political intrigue and power struggles. As they pursue justice, they face immense challenges, navigating a dangerous landscape where loyalty, ambition, and morality collide.', 'In the fictional city of Jingzhou, prosecutor Tian Guofu and anti-corruption officer Sha Ruijin investigate high-level corruption, uncovering a complex web of political intrigue and power struggles. As they pursue justice, they face immense challenges, navigating a dangerous landscape where loyalty, ambition, and morality collide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0kZJmHpQTms264js0YHYMLV7Oy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71100'),
  ('433021627000968963', 'In the Name of the Brother', 2024, 'Mystery, War & Politics, Drama', 'Zhang Li', 'Wang Xiaoqiang', 'Qin Hao, Yang Mi, Zhang Zixian, Luan Yuanhui, Wang Herun, Liu Yuxuan, Lin Jiachuan, Jiang Qiming', null, 'In 1945, Harbin has come under the rule of Japan''s puppet state known as Manchukuo. Communist agent Song Zhuo Wen successfully infiltrates Harbin Secret Service where Guan Xue holds a post as the chief of special police.', 'In 1945, Harbin has come under the rule of Japan''s puppet state known as Manchukuo. Communist agent Song Zhuo Wen successfully infiltrates Harbin Secret Service where Guan Xue holds a post as the chief of special police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fcXHT8ySzIDzY0BbdIyWxcQJFbH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:235586'),
  ('1132278669580152113', 'In the Nick of Time', 2005, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Giorgos Kapoutzidis', null, 'Smaragda Karydi, Elisavet Konstantinidou, Giorgos Kapoutzidis, Argyris Angelou, Angeliki Lampri, Eirini Koumarianou, Pavlos Orkopoulos, Eleni Krita', 'NR', 'Five people, strangers to each other, are in the wrong place at the wrong time. They witness a murder and from then on an endless tangle of adventures begins for them. Dalia, Zoumboulia, Spyros, Fotis, Angela... unite in a group, draw strength from each other and aim to deliver justice in an old and dark case... Through dangers and upheavals they will manage to reach in the truth of the case but also their own, personal truth.', 'Five people, strangers to each other, are in the wrong place at the wrong time. They witness a murder and from then on an endless tangle of adventures begins for them. Dalia, Zoumboulia, Spyros, Fotis, Angela... unite in a group, draw strength from each other and aim to deliver justice in an old and dark case... Through dangers and upheavals they will manage to reach in the truth of the case but also their own, personal truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shSmGTs6JfZjKYnCLBEh9g6iR0p.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2386'),
  ('1018306143105106697', 'In the Night Garden', 2007, 'Kids', 'Andrew Davenport', null, 'Derek Jacobi, Nick Kellington, Andy Wareham, Rebecca Hyland', 'TV-Y', 'In the Night Garden is a magical place that exists between the waking and sleeping imagination of children close to the representation of a nursery rhyme.', 'In the Night Garden is a magical place that exists between the waking and sleeping imagination of children close to the representation of a nursery rhyme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qD5xsX8aPNYHATq6f28WVQslpqq.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:3048'),
  ('707164667922036311', 'In The Realm Of Fancy', 2003, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Chui Jing-Hong', null, 'Kwong Wa, Shirley Yeung Sze-Kei, Louis Fan Siu-Wong, Marco Ngai Chun-Git, Mark Kwok, Winnie Yeung Yuen-Yee, Lo Hoi-Pang, Chen Hung-Lieh', null, 'YUEN (KWONG WA) was born in a royal family and he rejects black magic. In contrast, KAM (FAN SUI WONG, TERRY), who is from a poor family, is obsessed with it. When the power of black magic is proven again and again, YUEN slowly changes from doubting to believing in it. WAN (YEUNG SZE KI, SHIRLEY) is YUEN’s promised wife before he was born. She is willing to live a simple life in a quiet town with YUEN. Before they get married, YUEN succeeds in releasing his spirit from his body and makes a journey to the world of the gods. However, one day in the world of the gods is equivalent to seven years in the human world. KAM and WAN keep his body intact. Meanwhile, they start falling in love with each other...', 'YUEN (KWONG WA) was born in a royal family and he rejects black magic. In contrast, KAM (FAN SUI WONG, TERRY), who is from a poor family, is obsessed with it. When the power of black magic is proven again and again, YUEN slowly changes from doubting to believing in it. WAN (YEUNG SZE KI, SHIRLEY) is YUEN’s promised wife before he was born. She is willing to live a simple life in a quiet town with YUEN. Before they get married, YUEN succeeds in releasing his spirit from his body and makes a journey to the world of the gods. However, one day in the world of the gods is equivalent to seven years in the human world. KAM and WAN keep his body intact. Meanwhile, they start falling in love with each other...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNgANztD1xxzWf4ibNiNNeYKKB5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97087'),
  ('1054984991065889457', 'In the SOOP: Friendcation', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'V, Park Seo-jun, Choi Woo-shik, Park Hyung-sik, Peakboy', null, 'In their first public travel record, five friends, Park Seo-joon, Peakboy, Choi Woo-shik, Park Hyung-sik, and V are sent on a four-day friendcation to Goseong.', 'In their first public travel record, five friends, Park Seo-joon, Peakboy, Choi Woo-shik, Park Hyung-sik, and V are sent on a four-day friendcation to Goseong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxnOaMHvOHcts1ec89dmdSjjHqx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204591'),
  ('1134543040486259196', 'In Time with You', 2011, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Ariel Lin, Chen Bolin, Sunny Wang, Andrea Chen, Lin Mei-shiu, Lo Pei-an, Ying Wei-min, Ma Nan', 'TV-14', 'A sharp-tongued shoe executive makes a bet with her longtime best friend to see who can get married first before turning 35—only to realize that love might have been right beside her all along.', 'A sharp-tongued shoe executive makes a bet with her longtime best friend to see who can get married first before turning 35—only to realize that love might have been right beside her all along.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b8S3VDUiTJEePr8m5v8qjw1etnj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40444'),
  ('612201929902191818', 'In Treatment', 2008, 'Drama', 'Rodrigo García', null, 'Uzo Aduba', 'TV-MA', 'The intimate confines of psychotherapy sessions are seen from the perspective of a therapist and individual patients.', 'The intimate confines of psychotherapy sessions are seen from the perspective of a therapist and individual patients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gytzjthKWMji7olvAnBGohbGmWS.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:14069'),
  ('16228442981003327', 'In Treatment', 2021, 'Drama', 'Éric Toledano, Laetitia Gonzalez, Olivier Nakache', null, 'Frédéric Pierrot, Pio Marmaï, Clémence Poésy, Aliocha Delmotte, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Jacques Weber, Suzanne Lindon, Eye Haïdara', null, 'Paris, autumn 2015. In Philippe Dayan''s analysis office, a surgeon in disarray in love, a couple in crisis, a suicidal teenager follow one another day after day. On a November evening, killers enter Paris.', 'Paris, autumn 2015. In Philippe Dayan''s analysis office, a surgeon in disarray in love, a couple in crisis, a suicidal teenager follow one another day after day. On a November evening, killers enter Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n5HvEy7LZ2fOWR0eINluWWu7kuH.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:95428'),
  ('243042208010111600', 'In Wahrheit', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Thomas Roth', null, 'Christina Hecke, Robin Sondermann, Rudolf Kowalski', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47HHwnMKntacd8FjHu8xEhTzS5O.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:101984'),
  ('601783951372390408', 'In Your Place', 2021, 'Soap, Drama', 'Lícia Manzo', 'Lícia Manzo, Carla Madeira, Cecília Giannetti', 'Cauã Reymond, Alinne Moraes, Andréia Horta, Andréa Beltrão, Marieta Severo, Juan Paiva, Daniel Dantas, José de Abreu', null, 'Christian and Renato are identical twins who have opposite lives: Christian grew up in an orphanage and is underemployed, struggling to survive. Renato was adopted by a rich family and had everything that money can buy. When they meet again as adults, a tragedy happens: Renato is murdered and identified as Christian who, in turn, takes the place of his brother. However, to this end, he must leave behind his identity and his great love.', 'Christian and Renato are identical twins who have opposite lives: Christian grew up in an orphanage and is underemployed, struggling to survive. Renato was adopted by a rich family and had everything that money can buy. When they meet again as adults, a tragedy happens: Renato is murdered and identified as Christian who, in turn, takes the place of his brother. However, to this end, he must leave behind his identity and his great love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4lKsGoq51dSq7oR8BIOJ6HHP74U.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132375'),
  ('569645253448557048', 'In Your Radiant Season', 2026, 'Mystery, Drama, Family', 'Jo Sung-hee', null, 'Lee Sung-kyung, Chae Jong-hyeop, Han Ji-hyeon, Kwon Hyuk, Oh Ye-ju, Kim Tae-Young, Lee Mi-sook, Kang Seok-woo', null, 'Chan lives every day like it is summer vacation. Haran is trapped in a lonely winter. When their forgotten past reunites them, Chan is determined to gift her another spring. Through laughter and tears, they face winter together and reach their spring in this heartwarming romance.', 'Chan lives every day like it is summer vacation. Haran is trapped in a lonely winter. When their forgotten past reunites them, Chan is determined to gift her another spring. Through laughter and tears, they face winter together and reach their spring in this heartwarming romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/35UAIEtQQsjVl38GVPvbqc00pcJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233833'),
  ('103493301137270289', 'In-House Marriage Honey', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Ayumi Shimo', 'Mizuki Itagaki, Airi Matsui, Hayate Wada, Gaku Oshida, Toshiki Tateishi, Riho Nakamura, Himeka Asami, Katsumi Hyodo', null, 'A young couple got married almost immediately after meeting each other through a dating app and did not realised that they were working for the same company. They decided to keep their marriage a secret from their company and friends. At first, both parties thought it''s okay to get married without love but they gradually got attracted to each other.', 'A young couple got married almost immediately after meeting each other through a dating app and did not realised that they were working for the same company. They decided to keep their marriage a secret from their company and friends. At first, both parties thought it''s okay to get married without love but they gradually got attracted to each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWGitnVtOCXKTE2lPxLkaCH8nTQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112403'),
  ('638320973078048806', 'In/Spectre', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Akari Kito, Mamoru Miyano', 'TV-14', 'Kotoko Iwanaga became the god of wisdom to the supernatural beings and spends her days solving problems for them. However, the boy who she fell head over heels for, Kuro Sakuragawa, is someone that is feared by all supernatural creatures. The two of them face various mysterious incidents involving the supernatural in this love x romance x mystery series. Where will these fantastical incidents lead them and what will happen with Kotoko’s crush?', 'Kotoko Iwanaga became the god of wisdom to the supernatural beings and spends her days solving problems for them. However, the boy who she fell head over heels for, Kuro Sakuragawa, is someone that is feared by all supernatural creatures. The two of them face various mysterious incidents involving the supernatural in this love x romance x mystery series. Where will these fantastical incidents lead them and what will happen with Kotoko’s crush?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g97dzLKEtx9yFsOZcpAlXgYQCMY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93653'),
  ('1091247648757188428', 'İnadına Aşk', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Osman Sınav, Yusuf Omer Sinav, Raşit Çelikezer', null, 'Açelya Topaloğlu, Can Yaman, Nilay Duru, Eren Vurdem, Cevahir Turan, Cem Belevi, Yeşim Dalgıçer, Taner Rumeli', null, 'In this story, you will watch the funny stories of Defne and Yalin who work in the same firm but do not get along with each other very well. Will Defne and Yalin start to fall in love with each other? Will Defne handle all the problems in her first job?', 'In this story, you will watch the funny stories of Defne and Yalin who work in the same firm but do not get along with each other very well. Will Defne and Yalin start to fall in love with each other? Will Defne handle all the problems in her first job?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnsNXjv4GLpuTaWsr0Rpp2xF0VO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73766'),
  ('483826920644140399', 'Inari Kon Kon', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Naomi Ohzora, Houko Kuwashima, Hiroshi Okamoto, Yoji Ueda, Iori Nomizu, Kumiko Ikebe, Kaori Sadohara, Takehito Koyasu', 'TV-PG', 'Fushimi Inari is a shy, not-so-bright middle school girl living in Kyoto''s Fushimi ward. She has a crush on her classmate Tanbabashi, but cannot express her feelings. One day, as thanks for helping a fox pup, the deity Uka no Mitama no Kami grants her the ability to change her form.', 'Fushimi Inari is a shy, not-so-bright middle school girl living in Kyoto''s Fushimi ward. She has a crush on her classmate Tanbabashi, but cannot express her feelings. One day, as thanks for helping a fox pup, the deity Uka no Mitama no Kami grants her the ability to change her form.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kloAe3nAy7BbXAKOv30vKDhyDZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67143'),
  ('943849007645067313', 'Inazuma Eleven', 2008, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Akihiro Hino', 'Yuka Terasaki, Takashi Ohara, Mitsuki Saiga, Yu Kobayashi, Aya Endo', 'TV-Y7', 'Mamoru Endou is a cheerful goalkeeper in Raimon Jr High, with six other players in the team. But there was a day when the team was almost lead to disbandment by Natsumi unless they are able to win the match against the Teikoku Gakuen, currently the best team in Japan. He tried to save the club by gathering four more players to join the team.', 'Mamoru Endou is a cheerful goalkeeper in Raimon Jr High, with six other players in the team. But there was a day when the team was almost lead to disbandment by Natsumi unless they are able to win the match against the Teikoku Gakuen, currently the best team in Japan. He tried to save the club by gathering four more players to join the team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kQWvBMPWz1gykKLXuX6JBjC9uQ.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:42912'),
  ('936535681011244998', 'Inazuma Eleven: Ares', 2018, 'Animation', null, null, 'Ayumu Murase, Junko Takeuchi', 'TV-Y7', 'Ares depicts an alternative canon following the events of the first season of the original Inazuma Eleven anime after their victory in the Football Frontier, with the alien attack from the second season never occurring. When Japanese soccer has been deemed weak compared to international competition, the Raimon Eleven disbanded with its members transferring into different soccer teams across the country to strengthen Japan''s soccer at a national level. Furthermore, sponsorship has become a vital aspect in a Japanese youth soccer team''s survival as it prevents a team''s disbandment while being essential to partake in matches. The series focuses on the forward Asuto Inamori and his team, Inakuni Raimon, which is made up of players from the remote Inakunijima Island. Needing to maintain their club, they have replaced the original Raimon Eleven as Raimon Junior High''s soccer team and compete as underdogs in the annual Football Frontier youth tournament.', 'Ares depicts an alternative canon following the events of the first season of the original Inazuma Eleven anime after their victory in the Football Frontier, with the alien attack from the second season never occurring. When Japanese soccer has been deemed weak compared to international competition, the Raimon Eleven disbanded with its members transferring into different soccer teams across the country to strengthen Japan''s soccer at a national level. Furthermore, sponsorship has become a vital aspect in a Japanese youth soccer team''s survival as it prevents a team''s disbandment while being essential to partake in matches. The series focuses on the forward Asuto Inamori and his team, Inakuni Raimon, which is made up of players from the remote Inakunijima Island. Needing to maintain their club, they have replaced the original Raimon Eleven as Raimon Junior High''s soccer team and compete as underdogs in the annual Football Frontier youth tournament.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3g5Ne3rtp35HmrHaZ1Xu4v3mIYq.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:78484'),
  ('858741195114352290', 'Inch High, Private Eye', 1973, 'Animation, Kids', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'Don Messick, John Stephenson, Jean Vander Pyl, Lennie Weinrib', null, 'Inch High, Private Eye is a 1973 Saturday morning cartoon produced by Hanna-Barbera Productions. The show originally ran from September 8, 1973, to August 31, 1974, on NBC Saturday morning for 13 episodes. Since the 1980s it has enjoyed resurgence on cable television, in repeats on USA Cartoon Express, Cartoon Network and Boomerang.', 'Inch High, Private Eye is a 1973 Saturday morning cartoon produced by Hanna-Barbera Productions. The show originally ran from September 8, 1973, to August 31, 1974, on NBC Saturday morning for 13 episodes. Since the 1980s it has enjoyed resurgence on cable television, in repeats on USA Cartoon Express, Cartoon Network and Boomerang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKvNmnbtKAhqaQBjbAIfXwyFsNo.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:10475'),
  ('596528543848991765', 'Incomplete Life', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kim Won-suk, Yoon Tae-ho', null, 'Yim Si-wan, Lee Sung-min, Kang So-ra, Kang Ha-neul, Byun Yo-han, Kim Dae-myung, Park Hae-joon, Lee Kyung-young', 'TV-MA', 'Since he was a child, the board game baduk has been everything to Jang Geu-rae. But when he fails at achieving his dream of becoming a professional baduk player, Geu-rae must leave his isolated existence and enter the real world armed with nothing but a high school equivalency exam on his resume.', 'Since he was a child, the board game baduk has been everything to Jang Geu-rae. But when he fails at achieving his dream of becoming a professional baduk player, Geu-rae must leave his isolated existence and enter the real world armed with nothing but a high school equivalency exam on his resume.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ZAquQpSHOBWZNjPM0jmqqKv8X8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61678'),
