  ('1006253912895155714', 'Infieles', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rodrigo Gijón', null, null, 'TV-14', 'Erotic comedy series about infidelity in couples and the different situations that lead people to commit it. The episodes use as reasons, among others, serious sexual disagreement, simple use of a favorable moment without thinking about the consequences, habits or deteriorating or unpleasant attitudes, etc. Without ever losing humor and mischief.', 'Erotic comedy series about infidelity in couples and the different situations that lead people to commit it. The episodes use as reasons, among others, serious sexual disagreement, simple use of a favorable moment without thinking about the consequences, habits or deteriorating or unpleasant attitudes, etc. Without ever losing humor and mischief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8SXWRQQoRGd7deGGKd3icrpDB8.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:98430'),
  ('993934439376357694', 'Infieles', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, null, 'NR', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bfrbM6r7zXZt4NV0LsPNKPyWVWP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109184'),
  ('37278197751488024', 'Infinite Challenge', 2005, 'Reality, Comedy', 'Kim Tae-ho, Kwon Seok', 'Lee Eon-joo', 'Yoo Jae-suk, Park Myung-soo, Jeong Jun-ha, Haha, Yang Se-hyung, Jeong Hyeong-don, Noh Hong-chul, Gil', 'TV-PG', 'Infinite Challenge has been reported as the first "Real-Variety" show in Korean television history. The program is largely unscripted, and follows a similar format of challenge-based Reality Television programs, familiar to the audiences in the West, but the challenges are often silly, absurd, or impossible to achieve, so the program takes on the aspect of a satirical comedy variety show, rather than a more standard reality or contest program. In order to achieve its comedic purposes its 6 hosts and staff continuously proclaim, the elements of this show are the 3-Ds, Dirty, Dangerous, and Difficult.', 'Infinite Challenge has been reported as the first "Real-Variety" show in Korean television history. The program is largely unscripted, and follows a similar format of challenge-based Reality Television programs, familiar to the audiences in the West, but the challenges are often silly, absurd, or impossible to achieve, so the program takes on the aspect of a satirical comedy variety show, rather than a more standard reality or contest program. In order to achieve its comedic purposes its 6 hosts and staff continuously proclaim, the elements of this show are the 3-Ds, Dirty, Dangerous, and Difficult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZIPTvMnzI5ThmdGeEYQFxJV5Sg.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:5092'),
  ('986058658397665445', 'Infinite Dendrogram', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Yuko Ono, Soma Saito, Yuuki Takada, Yui Ogura, Yoko Hikasa, Makoto Koichi, Ayumu Murase, Satoshi Hino', null, 'In the year 2043, Infinite Dendrogram, the world''s first successful full-dive VRMMO was released. In addition to its ability to perfectly simulate the five senses, along with its many other amazing features, the game promised to offer players a world full of infinite possibilities. Nearly two years later, soon-to-be college freshman, Reiji Mukudori, is finally able to buy a copy of the game and start playing. With some help from his experienced older brother, Shuu, and his partner Embryo, Reiji embarks on an adventure into the world of Infinite Dendrogram.', 'In the year 2043, Infinite Dendrogram, the world''s first successful full-dive VRMMO was released. In addition to its ability to perfectly simulate the five senses, along with its many other amazing features, the game promised to offer players a world full of infinite possibilities. Nearly two years later, soon-to-be college freshman, Reiji Mukudori, is finally able to buy a copy of the game and start playing. With some help from his experienced older brother, Shuu, and his partner Embryo, Reiji embarks on an adventure into the world of Infinite Dendrogram.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIhhZsNwP9eVINc7WNOYmBo2Q4P.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94649'),
  ('545130336056034825', 'Infinite Ryvius', 1999, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Yosuke Kuroda', 'Tetsu Shiratori, Houko Kuwashima, Soichiro Hoshi, Tomokazu Seki, Sakura Tange, Rikako Aikawa, Rei Sakuma, Nobuyuki Hiyama', null, 'An act of sabotage has sent a space station plummeting towards a dangerous phenomena known as the Sea of Geduld. With only hours to spare before the collapse of the entire station, a group of teens, training on-board the ship will seek safety aboard the Ryvius, an interstellar spacecraft hidden deep inside the station. With the adult crew and instructors dead, these young astronauts must rely on their training, courage and most importantly each other to prepare for the journey home.', 'An act of sabotage has sent a space station plummeting towards a dangerous phenomena known as the Sea of Geduld. With only hours to spare before the collapse of the entire station, a group of teens, training on-board the ship will seek safety aboard the Ryvius, an interstellar spacecraft hidden deep inside the station. With the adult crew and instructors dead, these young astronauts must rely on their training, courage and most importantly each other to prepare for the journey home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ylYb74MNy49fdcvY7s3X0seEhWE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42982'),
  ('34806525887916770', 'Infinite Stratos', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Koki Uchiyama, Yoko Hikasa, Yukana, Asami Shimoda, Kana Hanazawa, Marina Inoue, Chiwa Saito, Suzuko Mimori', 'TV-14', 'Girls from all over the world gather at IS Academy to learn how to become IS pilots. However, since Ichika can somehow pilot the IS even though he is male, he was forced to attend IS Academy as the only male in this school.', 'Girls from all over the world gather at IS Academy to learn how to become IS pilots. However, since Ichika can somehow pilot the IS even though he is male, he was forced to attend IS Academy as the only male in this school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zTJyPMaPvSBDsEZYOQ93zA8PzU8.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:46025'),
  ('704882657109432233', 'Infiniti', 2022, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Drama', 'Julien Vanlerenberghe, Stéphane Pannetier', null, 'Céline Sallette, Daniyar Alshinov, Vlad Ivanov, Lex Shrapnel, Karina Arutyunyan, Ellora Torchia, Anatolii Panchenko, Jarreth J. Merz', 'TV-14', 'The ISS, the International Space Station has gone silent. The crew is in distress. Simultaneously, a decapitated and waxed body is found on a roof in Kazakhstan. Positive identification leaves no room for doubt: the body belongs to an American astronaut currently on a mission on the ISS. A French astronaut, dismissed from the space program, and a Kazakh cop, disowned by his ranking hierarchy, set out to solve this mysterious paradox.', 'The ISS, the International Space Station has gone silent. The crew is in distress. Simultaneously, a decapitated and waxed body is found on a roof in Kazakhstan. Positive identification leaves no room for doubt: the body belongs to an American astronaut currently on a mission on the ISS. A French astronaut, dismissed from the space program, and a Kazakh cop, disowned by his ranking hierarchy, set out to solve this mysterious paradox.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eUSTwLfug2sHveJyanvINJ2hkcA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128798'),
  ('975640241842531491', 'Infinity and Beyond', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'He Jiong, Li Shaminzi, Silence Wang, Shen Mengchen, Harlem Yu, Alec Su, Eric Chou, A-Lin', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GvV2cuf6RhYAloJixMVlvkPNZc.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:197906'),
  ('995060728583688872', 'Infinity Nado', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Huang Hal Qing, Liao Guang Zu', null, 'Xuqiao Li, Hongyun Liu, Qing Zu, Ji Ying, 邓红, Bai Wenxian, Li Sixian, Yi Chen', 'TV-PG', 'Dawn and Athas find a mysterious sleeping boy, Pandora, who suffers from amnesia after he comes around. When Pandora just arrives at Freewheel Town, he becomes the chasing target of an organization called Ancient Hunter Group, which demands of him to carry out the "Great Mission". Under the attack of Jin and his friends, Ancient Hunter Group is temporarily repelled. With the assistance of Jin and his friends, Pandora gradually gets used to life in this world and his skill on top is much improved.Can Pandora regain his memories? What is his "Great Mission"? The story will tell you......', 'Dawn and Athas find a mysterious sleeping boy, Pandora, who suffers from amnesia after he comes around. When Pandora just arrives at Freewheel Town, he becomes the chasing target of an organization called Ancient Hunter Group, which demands of him to carry out the "Great Mission". Under the attack of Jin and his friends, Ancient Hunter Group is temporarily repelled. With the assistance of Jin and his friends, Pandora gradually gets used to life in this world and his skill on top is much improved.Can Pandora regain his memories? What is his "Great Mission"? The story will tell you......', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3XzeK6Y3ESvn2JO5zLbWnUcRSMj.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:108184'),
  ('228310249016441528', 'Infinity Train', 2019, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Owen Dennis', null, 'Johnny Young, Sekai Murashige', 'TV-PG', 'Passengers on board the mysterious Infinity Train must explore a series of endless cars that each contain unique worlds and puzzles to solve in order to unravel the mysteries of the train - and within themselves - to open the doorway home.', 'Passengers on board the mysterious Infinity Train must explore a series of endless cars that each contain unique worlds and puzzles to solve in order to unravel the mysteries of the train - and within themselves - to open the doorway home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEhc48kGjoWw8qcHu2Lar7NFrgG.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:91425'),
