  ('409852363502774569', 'Inside the NFL', 1977, 'Talk', null, null, 'Ryan Clark, Chad Johnson, Chris Long, Bill Belichick', 'TV-PG', 'The hardest-hitting team of analysts in sports delivers expert insight, exclusive commentary and special on and off the field features you won''t find anywhere else. Inside the NFL brings you the sights, sounds and spectacle of the NFL in all its glory, including exciting player profiles, interviews, and intense, moment-by-moment game footage. Every team. Every game. Every week.', 'The hardest-hitting team of analysts in sports delivers expert insight, exclusive commentary and special on and off the field features you won''t find anywhere else. Inside the NFL brings you the sights, sounds and spectacle of the NFL in all its glory, including exciting player profiles, interviews, and intense, moment-by-moment game footage. Every team. Every game. Every week.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ew88PQcGNpQw801yA7JpZjSplb2.jpg', 48, 'tmdb:tv:10047'),
  ('1079451094340416788', 'Inside the World''s Toughest Prisons', 2016, 'Crime, Documentary', null, null, 'Raphael Rowe', 'TV-MA', 'Crime journalist Raphael Rowe goes behind the bars of some of the world’s most notorious and toughest prisons. Immersing himself in maximum security facilities around the world to live as a prisoner, he encounters the inmates locked up for their crimes and meets the men and women on the right side of law tasked with keeping the criminals behind bars.', 'Crime journalist Raphael Rowe goes behind the bars of some of the world’s most notorious and toughest prisons. Immersing himself in maximum security facilities around the world to live as a prisoner, he encounters the inmates locked up for their crimes and meets the men and women on the right side of law tasked with keeping the criminals behind bars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebp1dNueJth2aLXRitU4decZY6D.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:72541'),
  ('344913452307444098', 'Inside West Coast Customs', 2011, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'Inside the world famous "west coast customs" Ryan Friedlinghaus presents some of the dopest transformations on some of the dopest vehicles, with some high end clientele, Ryan and the west coast customs team don''t disappoint!', 'Inside the world famous "west coast customs" Ryan Friedlinghaus presents some of the dopest transformations on some of the dopest vehicles, with some high end clientele, Ryan and the west coast customs team don''t disappoint!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w3FfkAg6WIFUksBh3iUUxHOAtwA.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:58559'),
  ('717264514172558684', 'Insider', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Toprak Karaoglu', 'Ertan Kurtulan, Toprak Karaoglu, Volkan Sümbül', 'Çağatay Ulusoy, Aras Bulut Iynemli, Çetin Tekindor, Nihal Koldaş, Damla Colbay, Bensu Soral, Yıldıray Şahinler, Mustafa Uğurlu', null, 'Even though two brothers are completely separated from each other after the imprisoning of their father and the kidnapping of their twin brother, they meet by coincidence years after when both choose to enter the police academy.', 'Even though two brothers are completely separated from each other after the imprisoning of their father and the kidnapping of their twin brother, they meet by coincidence years after when both choose to enter the police academy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWoQNqdxkx1QnYbzPI2SikUdPzc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68388'),
  ('295012078711730615', 'Insider', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, 'Moon Man Se', 'Kang Ha-neul, Lee You-young, Heo Sung-tae, Kim Sang-ho, Kang Young-suk, Park Seong-geun, Kang Shin-hyo, Jeong Man-sik', null, 'When a judicial apprentice goes behind bars while on an undercover job, he plays the hand he’s dealt to survive prison and get his payback.', 'When a judicial apprentice goes behind bars while on an undercover job, he plays the hand he’s dealt to survive prison and get his payback.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4AYdYcNAdhymrMpFMe6MK6r1d8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135655'),
