  ('1015128054929639064', 'Intelligence', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Nick Mohammed', null, 'David Schwimmer, Nick Mohammed', 'TV-MA', 'When an arrogant, maverick National Security Agent comes over from the US to join a newly-formed team tackling cybercrime at Britain''s security headquarters, he enlists an inept and tactless computer analyst Joseph in a power grab that threatens to disrupt the team’s ability to combat cyber terrorism.', 'When an arrogant, maverick National Security Agent comes over from the US to join a newly-formed team tackling cybercrime at Britain''s security headquarters, he enlists an inept and tactless computer analyst Joseph in a power grab that threatens to disrupt the team’s ability to combat cyber terrorism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xOTbJN5xHXNpxZknnJUKHK6EGK4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:88110'),
