  ('122300801947060400', 'Into the Unknown: Making Frozen II', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Kristen Bell, Idina Menzel, Josh Gad, Jennifer Lee, Jonathan Groff, Chris Buck, Sterling K. Brown, Evan Rachel Wood', 'TV-PG', 'The team behind Frozen II open their doors to cameras for a six-part documentary series to reveal the hard work, heart, and collaboration it takes to create one of the most highly-anticipated films in Walt Disney Animation Studios’ near-century of moviemaking. Cameras were there to capture an eye-opening - and at times jaw-dropping - view of the challenges and the breakthroughs, the artistry, creativity and the complexity of creating the #1 animated feature of all time.', 'The team behind Frozen II open their doors to cameras for a six-part documentary series to reveal the hard work, heart, and collaboration it takes to create one of the most highly-anticipated films in Walt Disney Animation Studios’ near-century of moviemaking. Cameras were there to capture an eye-opening - and at times jaw-dropping - view of the challenges and the breakthroughs, the artistry, creativity and the complexity of creating the #1 animated feature of all time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/UcbjmltlDTxoZvTSPbQtUBeZEo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103465'),
  ('925986661933000975', 'Into the West', 2005, 'Western, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Steven Spielberg', null, 'Will Patton, Jessica Capshaw, Josh Brolin, Matthew Modine, Lance Henriksen, Irene Bedard, Garrett Wang, Skeet Ulrich', 'TV-14', 'The lives of two families, one white American, one native American, become mingled through the momentous events of American expansion, between 1825 and 1890.', 'The lives of two families, one white American, one native American, become mingled through the momentous events of American expansion, between 1825 and 1890.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvpCsCJZWafuaU7myH9CabV0BgH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11099'),
  ('826768111252083653', 'Into the White Night', 2006, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Takayuki Yamada, Haruka Ayase, Atsuro Watabe, Takashi Kashiwabara, Kotaro Tanaka, Keisuke Koide, Kei Tanaka, Kaoru Yachigusa', null, 'What happens with two children commit two different muders in order to protect each other? Does salvation exist for them? In order to walk beneath the sun once more, Ryouji and Yukiho find themselves in a twisted web from which neither can escape without abandoning the other. Having no one but each other, this drama follows the events the follow that fateful day… 14 years ago.', 'What happens with two children commit two different muders in order to protect each other? Does salvation exist for them? In order to walk beneath the sun once more, Ryouji and Yukiho find themselves in a twisted web from which neither can escape without abandoning the other. Having no one but each other, this drama follows the events the follow that fateful day… 14 years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPQN7ry6qiDZF5aoaKPfC7IP1Oz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19458'),
  ('270313206012863043', 'Intruder', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', 'Gareth Tunley, Mike Benson', null, 'Elaine Cassidy, Tom Meeten, Helen Behan, Sally Lindsay', null, 'An affluent couple living in a small seaside town are targeted by two local teenagers looking to make a quick buck. However, the break-in takes a dark turn when one of the youths winds up dead and an elaborate cover-up is staged to make the killing appear to be self-defence.', 'An affluent couple living in a small seaside town are targeted by two local teenagers looking to make a quick buck. However, the break-in takes a dark turn when one of the youths winds up dead and an elaborate cover-up is staged to make the killing appear to be self-defence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tllvID5ssVD2wPj0p6h024nUNLK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:122519'),
  ('1126218045489704283', 'Intruders', 1992, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Richard Crenna, Mare Winningham, Susan Blakely, Daphne Ashbrook, Alan Autry, Ben Vereen, Steven Berkoff, Jason Beghe', null, 'When psychiatrist Dr. Neil Chase encounters two women suffering from the same symptoms with similar nightmarish stories, rational explanations just don''t seem to fit.', 'When psychiatrist Dr. Neil Chase encounters two women suffering from the same symptoms with similar nightmarish stories, rational explanations just don''t seem to fit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h9LeBY34WRtCjbJiqbO1njt6QTU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:47220'),
  ('1063637047469173820', 'Intruders', 2014, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Crime', 'Glen Morgan', 'Darin Morgan', 'Mira Sorvino, John Simm, Sonya Salomaa, James Frain, Millie Bobby Brown, Tory Kittles', 'TV-MA', 'Members of a secret society chase immortality by seeking refuge in the bodies of others.', 'Members of a secret society chase immortality by seeking refuge in the bodies of others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ixwvt8zgkvRFHpR5g5nNpn1M15.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61231'),
  ('1115582939750327219', 'Inu X Boku Secret Service', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kana Hanazawa, Mamoru Miyano, Tomokazu Sugita, Yuichi Nakamura, Rina Hidaka, Yoko Hikasa, Takuya Eguchi, Yoshimasa Hosoya', 'TV-14', 'Protected by the highest security, the Maison de Ayakashi is rumored to be haunted, where only eccentrics could live. In reality, it is a place for humans with non-human ancestors to live. The socially-inept Ririchiyo has come here to improve herself. She meets secret service bodyguard Soushi, who is assigned to protect residents. He has a request of her: "Please make me your dog."', 'Protected by the highest security, the Maison de Ayakashi is rumored to be haunted, where only eccentrics could live. In reality, it is a place for humans with non-human ancestors to live. The socially-inept Ririchiyo has come here to improve herself. She meets secret service bodyguard Soushi, who is assigned to protect residents. He has a request of her: "Please make me your dog."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qKAvOUHGOKQ0sVoNMWEaDTrzukJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45282'),
  ('304255886109851251', 'Inugami-san and Nekoyama-san', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Romance', null, null, 'Nao Toyama, Sumire Uesaka, Yuka Otsubo, Sayaka Horino, Erii Yamazaki, Shoko Nagahiro, Aoi Fujimoto', 'TV-14', 'The story revolves around Nekoyama Suzu, a timid, shy tsundere girl loves dogs, and Inugami Yachiyo, a super masochistic, air-headed, friendly girl who loves cats. One day, after a fateful meeting, the two find themselves attracted to each other. In response to Inugami''s instinctive approaches, Nekoyama is always bashful. Their friend Aki has to work hard to make jabs at some of the situations of the two, and also to stop Inugami from going berserk.', 'The story revolves around Nekoyama Suzu, a timid, shy tsundere girl loves dogs, and Inugami Yachiyo, a super masochistic, air-headed, friendly girl who loves cats. One day, after a fateful meeting, the two find themselves attracted to each other. In response to Inugami''s instinctive approaches, Nekoyama is always bashful. Their friend Aki has to work hard to make jabs at some of the situations of the two, and also to stop Inugami from going berserk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xEGAqvlfJwkkrp7KHR01P6nzWs4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61530'),
  ('679748472214572090', 'InuYasha', 2000, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kappei Yamaguchi, Satsuki Yukino, Izumi Ōgami, Houko Kuwashima, Noriko Hidaka, Takeshi Kusao', 'TV-14', 'Kagome Higurashi is a modern day young girl who lives with her family by the old Higure shrine. Unbeknownst to Kagome, she is the reincarnation of priestess Kikyo and posseses the "Jewel of Four Souls" (the Shikon jewel). One ill-fated day, Kagome locates an ancient well near her home and is abruptly transported through the well and into a feudal Japan, inhabited by demons. There, she encounters Inuyasha, son of a powerful demon father and a human mother, who is pinned to a tree by an enchanted arrow.', 'Kagome Higurashi is a modern day young girl who lives with her family by the old Higure shrine. Unbeknownst to Kagome, she is the reincarnation of priestess Kikyo and posseses the "Jewel of Four Souls" (the Shikon jewel). One ill-fated day, Kagome locates an ancient well near her home and is abruptly transported through the well and into a feudal Japan, inhabited by demons. There, she encounters Inuyasha, son of a powerful demon father and a human mother, who is pinned to a tree by an enchanted arrow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgvW9n0EwKtq9nbztWhyTvvoqjS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:35610'),
  ('326464944397097228', 'INUYASHIKI LAST HERO', 2017, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Fumiyo Kohinata, Nijiro Murakami, Kanata Hongo, Sumire Uesaka, Sumire Morohoshi', null, 'Aliens replace middle-aged Inuyashiki''s body with a combat robot. He uses it to fight high schooler Shishigami, who''s using the same power selfishly.', 'Aliens replace middle-aged Inuyashiki''s body with a combat robot. He uses it to fight high schooler Shishigami, who''s using the same power selfishly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/53cafnW5gwzrSUagSCwippMlfDa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73946'),
  ('296151677528043419', 'Invader ZIM', 2001, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Kids', 'Jhonen Vasquez', null, 'Richard Steven Horvitz, Andy Berman, Rosearik Rikki Simons, Melissa Fahn, Lucille Bliss, Rodger Bumpass, Kevin McDonald', 'TV-Y7', 'Zim dreams of greatness. Unfortunately, though, he''s hopelessly inept as a space invader. Desperate to be rid of the annoying Zim, his planet''s leaders send him on a mission to infiltrate Earth, providing him with leftover, cobbled-together equipment. To their consternation, Zim succeeds in setting up a base on Earth and infiltrating human culture, posing as a human child as he plots the planet''s downfall. Only Zim''s archnemesis, Dib, recognizes that Zim is an alien, and of course, nobody believes Dib''s claims.', 'Zim dreams of greatness. Unfortunately, though, he''s hopelessly inept as a space invader. Desperate to be rid of the annoying Zim, his planet''s leaders send him on a mission to infiltrate Earth, providing him with leftover, cobbled-together equipment. To their consternation, Zim succeeds in setting up a base on Earth and infiltrating human culture, posing as a human child as he plots the planet''s downfall. Only Zim''s archnemesis, Dib, recognizes that Zim is an alien, and of course, nobody believes Dib''s claims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nbphRMU1yjDjcMC5RCPyCxc4Yff.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:3793'),
  ('811751725689139996', 'Invaders of the Rokujouma!?', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy', null, 'Shogo Yasukawa', 'Yuichi Nakamura, Eri Suzuki, Nichika Omori, Masumi Tazawa, Maria Naganawa, Saori Hayami, Megumi Takamoto, Yukari Tamura', 'TV-14', 'Kōtarō Satomi decided to live on his own when he began high school, and chose Room 106 of Corona House because it was cheap. Unfortunately, Kōtarō soon discovers that numerous otherworldly and supernatural girls also want his room for various reasons of their own, and aren''t about to back down. As a result, Kōtarō and the girls find themselves forced to live together as they try to settle just who ends up with the room.', 'Kōtarō Satomi decided to live on his own when he began high school, and chose Room 106 of Corona House because it was cheap. Unfortunately, Kōtarō soon discovers that numerous otherworldly and supernatural girls also want his room for various reasons of their own, and aren''t about to back down. As a result, Kōtarō and the girls find themselves forced to live together as they try to settle just who ends up with the room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8i6QjMLZPPUVv8XGWyelGCCBBmS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70805'),
  ('761067934595956392', 'Invasion', 1997, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Armand Mastroianni', 'Rockne S. O''Bannon', 'Luke Perry, Kim Cattrall, Rebecca Gayheart, Christopher Orr, Jon Polito, Neal McDonough, Rosanna DeSoto, Castulo Guerra', null, 'Small rocks fall from the sky which, when touched, trigger a latent virus that has always existed in humans and begins mutating them into an alien species. Taking advantage of its hive mentality, the aliens are absolutely dedicated to transforming every human on Earth and do so with alarming swiftness. Only a small group of humans remain who have the medical knowledge to devise antibodies to reverse the effects of the virus.', 'Small rocks fall from the sky which, when touched, trigger a latent virus that has always existed in humans and begins mutating them into an alien species. Taking advantage of its hive mentality, the aliens are absolutely dedicated to transforming every human on Earth and do so with alarming swiftness. Only a small group of humans remain who have the medical knowledge to devise antibodies to reverse the effects of the virus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dyoohpYI6jremCvfAXehByacppu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72642'),
  ('317516141541228044', 'Invasion', 2005, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Drama', 'Thomas Schlamme, Michael Dinner', null, 'Eddie Cibrian, Lisa Sheridan, Alexis Dziena, Evan Peters, William Fichtner, Ariel Gade, Tyler Labine, Kari Matchett', 'TV-MA', 'In the aftermath of a hurricane the Florida Park Ranger and his family deal with strange occurrences, including luminescent creatures in the water. People in the town start to act different, who can you trust?', 'In the aftermath of a hurricane the Florida Park Ranger and his family deal with strange occurrences, including luminescent creatures in the water. People in the town start to act different, who can you trust?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5s7o05wcsUJv3Vilz2MGIhbgts.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2940'),
  ('843344576568966248', 'Invasion', 2021, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Simon Kinberg, David Weil', null, 'Golshifteh Farahani, Shioli Kutsuna, Shamier Anderson, India Brown, Enver Gjokaj, Shane Zaza, Erika Alexander', 'TV-MA', 'Earth is visited by an alien species that threatens humanity''s existence. Events unfold in real time through the eyes of five ordinary people across the globe as they struggle to make sense of the chaos unraveling around them.', 'Earth is visited by an alien species that threatens humanity''s existence. Events unfold in real time through the eyes of five ordinary people across the globe as they struggle to make sense of the chaos unraveling around them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1PdNB3rYTcf8VXc8rcmZ0SeYxSq.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:127235'),
  ('282513632295799201', 'Invasion: Earth', 1998, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jed Mercurio', 'Jed Mercurio', 'Vincent Regan, Maggie O''Neill, Fred Ward, Phyllis Logan, Nicola Buckingham, Paul J. Medford, Jo Dow, Gerard Rooney', 'NR', 'Scientists and the military join forces as the Scottish Highlands become the battleground for a struggle against alien invaders... Invasion: Earth is a BBC science fiction mini-series. It was made in collaboration with the Sci Fi Channel, and released in 1998 as six fifty minute episodes.', 'Scientists and the military join forces as the Scottish Highlands become the battleground for a struggle against alien invaders... Invasion: Earth is a BBC science fiction mini-series. It was made in collaboration with the Sci Fi Channel, and released in 1998 as six fifty minute episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/U7hAd7RBPWoxknXDlE0Ryux4gP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13388'),
  ('206386273522235812', 'Inventing Anna', 2022, 'Drama', 'Shonda Rhimes', null, 'Anna Chlumsky, Julia Garner, Arian Moayed, Katie Lowes, Alexis Floyd, Anders Holm, Anna Deavere Smith, Jeff Perry', 'TV-MA', 'Audacious entrepreneur or con artist? A journalist chases down the story of Anna Delvey, who convinced New York''s elite she was a German heiress.', 'Audacious entrepreneur or con artist? A journalist chases down the story of Anna Delvey, who convinced New York''s elite she was a German heiress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aZraQSnS9Dbvipv4WLJQ5xrhG3g.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95665'),
  ('401422162597834616', 'Investigation Alien', 2024, 'Documentary', null, null, 'George Knapp', 'TV-14', 'In this gripping docuseries, legendary reporter George Knapp travels the globe to uncover new evidence about UFOs and investigate their presence on Earth.', 'In this gripping docuseries, legendary reporter George Knapp travels the globe to uncover new evidence about UFOs and investigate their presence on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t2dShYTM1heqVXv4Pjk3mbBqFy2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:274023'),
  ('750058852430550239', 'Investigation Held by ZnaToKi', 1971, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Olga Lavrova, Aleksandr Lavrov', null, 'Georgiy Martynyuk, Leonid Kanevsky, Lydia Velezheva, Igor Bochkin, Andrey Smolyakov, Vera Vasileva, Boris Shcherbakov, Nikolay Chindyaykin', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGT7RYoLi2BsNzcgbeW1BWSVSQ7.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:67367'),
  ('561239388646045792', 'Investigator Tikhonov', 2016, 'Mystery, Crime', null, null, 'Mikhail Efremov, Yuriy Itskov, Sergey Shakurov', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/piCTT3z4uTxCor3PY2bMTj8WP3N.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92006'),
  ('811757880772801178', 'Invincible', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Steven Yeun, Sandra Oh, J.K. Simmons', 'TV-MA', 'Mark Grayson is a normal teenager except for the fact that his father is the most powerful superhero on the planet. Shortly after his seventeenth birthday, Mark begins to develop powers of his own and enters into his father''s tutelage.', 'Mark Grayson is a normal teenager except for the fact that his father is the most powerful superhero on the planet. Shortly after his seventeenth birthday, Mark begins to develop powers of his own and enters into his father''s tutelage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tblBrslcKSifMVZ3TmtT2ukMor.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:95557'),
  ('1083245548382366514', 'Invincible (2021)', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Thriller, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Robert Kirkman, Simon Racioppa, Helen Leigh, Ross Stracke, Vivian Lee', 'Robert Kirkman, Simon Racioppa, Helen Leigh, Ross Stracke, Vivian Lee, Ryan Ridley, Christine Lavaf, Tania Lotia, Helen Shang, Jay Faerber, Matt Lambert, Adria Lang, Chris Black, Curtis Gwinn', 'Steven Yeun, Sandra Oh, J.K. Simmons, Gillian Jacobs, Grey DeLisle', 'TV-MA', 'The son of Earth''s most powerful superhero is about to become something greater than himself: something bold, something universal, something - Invincible. From the comics to the screen, Invincible follows Mark Grayson''s journey of becoming Earth''s next great defender after his father, Nolan Grayson: also known as Omni-Man.', 'The son of Earth''s most powerful superhero is about to become something greater than himself: something bold, something universal, something - Invincible. From the comics to the screen, Invincible follows Mark Grayson''s journey of becoming Earth''s next great defender after his father, Nolan Grayson: also known as Omni-Man.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F4tblBrslcKSifMVZ3TmtT2ukMor.jpg', 5, 'plex:tv:invincible-2021'),
  ('973944461740825693', 'Invincible Fight Girl', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, 'Shaene Siders, Ben Joseph', 'Sydney Mikayla', 'TV-PG', 'Andy dreams of becoming the greatest pro wrestler of all time. Assuming the wrestler alias: "Fight Girl", Andy sets out into the bizarre and colorful Wrestling World, determined to make a name for herself.', 'Andy dreams of becoming the greatest pro wrestler of all time. Assuming the wrestler alias: "Fight Girl", Andy sets out into the bizarre and colorful Wrestling World, determined to make a name for herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t9lcNmzb5XMksUfUq3rtxYVbQnv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:201643'),
  ('796306150722026359', 'Invincible Steel Man Daitarn 3', 1978, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, 'Noboru Tateya, Soji Yoshikawa, Yoshiyuki Tomino', 'Hirotaka Suzuoki, Fuyumi Shiraishi, Koichi Kitamura, Mieko Nobusawa, Masato Yamanouchi, Kako Mizuno, Noriko Ohara, Kei Tomiyama', null, 'Brilliant scientist Sōzō Haran was conducting research on Mars when he created the Meganoids, a new form of cyborg life capable of metacognition. Suddenly Dr. Haran lost control of his creation as the Meganoids slaughtered him and his entire family, save his youngest son, the 16-year-old Banjō Haran. Banjō escaped from Mars on a rocket ship with Daitarn 3, a solar-powered super robot. Now 18 years old and living on Earth, Banjō fights against the Meganoids and their leader, Don Zauser. Banjō must gather allies to help him stop the Meganoid threat, which aspires to turn all humans into cyborgs and "improve" the human race.', 'Brilliant scientist Sōzō Haran was conducting research on Mars when he created the Meganoids, a new form of cyborg life capable of metacognition. Suddenly Dr. Haran lost control of his creation as the Meganoids slaughtered him and his entire family, save his youngest son, the 16-year-old Banjō Haran. Banjō escaped from Mars on a rocket ship with Daitarn 3, a solar-powered super robot. Now 18 years old and living on Earth, Banjō fights against the Meganoids and their leader, Don Zauser. Banjō must gather allies to help him stop the Meganoid threat, which aspires to turn all humans into cyborgs and "improve" the human race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jEr2olEf7ypfKafHrAM9HMYMDHL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71922'),
  ('342507397225855862', 'Invisible', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Issey Takahashi, Ko Shibasaki, Kenta Kiritani, Taizo Harada, Daiki Arioka, Akane Hotta, Rihito Itagaki, Tani Kyosuke', 'TV-14', 'A detective obsessed with justice receives a surprising offer of help from a mysterious figure in the criminal underworld known as "Invisible."', 'A detective obsessed with justice receives a surprising offer of help from a mysterious figure in the criminal underworld known as "Invisible."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJZde79j2o7Q0q1RIwDL80ufGT7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:195636'),
  ('202661856035905709', 'Invisible', 2024, 'Drama', 'Paco Caballero', null, 'Eric Seijo, Liv Dobner, Diego Montejo, Izan Fernández, Aura Garrido', 'TV-14', 'Capi, a twelve-year-old boy with a normal life, has suffered a terrible accident that has left him with severe post-traumatic stress disorder. Neither the school, nor his friends, nor his family can explain what has happened. However, the psychologist who treats him is determined to delve into his story and discover the reasons that led him to this situation.', 'Capi, a twelve-year-old boy with a normal life, has suffered a terrible accident that has left him with severe post-traumatic stress disorder. Neither the school, nor his friends, nor his family can explain what has happened. However, the psychologist who treats him is determined to delve into his story and discover the reasons that led him to this situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ww4pfCaHONwPpdSTrP4cZU1pfBL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:220513'),
  ('69969214150590561', 'Invisible Boys', 2025, 'Drama', 'Nicholas Verso', null, 'Joseph Zada, Joe Klocek, Aydan Calafiore, Zach Blampied, Pia Miranda, David Lyons, Shareena Clanton, Mercy Cornwall', null, 'Everyone in a small town assumes they know you, but when a closeted gay adolescent hooks up with a married guy, it has far-reaching effects for a group of teens who were previously invisible.', 'Everyone in a small town assumes they know you, but when a closeted gay adolescent hooks up with a married guy, it has far-reaching effects for a group of teens who were previously invisible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7nUl0qtoz3AOF7kim2aO8iDqz5h.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:274677'),
  ('1020067294412915954', 'Invisible City', 2021, 'Mystery, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Carlos Saldanha, Mirna Nogueira, Rodrigo Nogueira', null, 'Marco Pigossi, Alessandra Negrini, Julia Konrad, Manuela Dieguez, Leticia Spiller, Simone Spoladore, Zahy Guajajara, Kay Sara', 'TV-MA', 'An environmental police officer uncovers a hidden world of mythological entities from Brazilian folklore when he finds a connection between the mysterious appearance of a dead river dolphin on a Rio de Janeiro beach and the death of his beloved wife.', 'An environmental police officer uncovers a hidden world of mythological entities from Brazilian folklore when he finds a connection between the mysterious appearance of a dead river dolphin on a Rio de Janeiro beach and the death of his beloved wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i6v77Rcez8BEbsQ2FbUVfzs3yT2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:110529'),
