  ('143103878341031434', 'INXS : Never Tear Us Apart', 2014, 'Drama', null, 'Justin Monjo, Dave Warner', 'Damon Herriman, Luke Arnold, Hugh Sheridan, Andrew Ryan, Alex Williams, Ido Drent, Nick Masters, Jane Allsop', null, 'The uncensored story of one of Australia''s most successful bands, INXS. A story of mateship, a story of success and excess, talent and sheer bloody will, set to a pulsating soundtrack including all of INXSs greatest hits.', 'The uncensored story of one of Australia''s most successful bands, INXS. A story of mateship, a story of success and excess, talent and sheer bloody will, set to a pulsating soundtrack including all of INXSs greatest hits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kpxsFT4GKW12za7WlSugoyI1lBs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66824'),
  ('802918341863162772', 'Inye', 2024, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Vladimir Raksha', null, 'Irina Martynenko, Ilya Malanin, Wolfgang Cerny, Aleksey Serebryakov, Linda Lapinsh, Nikolay Fomenko, Yevgeniya Simonova, Kirill Nagiev', null, 'Their abilities can give the world a chance - or destroy it. Historical fantasy about the power of love and destruction', 'Their abilities can give the world a chance - or destroy it. Historical fantasy about the power of love and destruction', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIAggjrbEQV6qUGI4fNQHx9DjaU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:242779'),
  ('46709400938935995', 'Ip Man', 2013, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Fan Xiaotian, Zhu Yili, Ren Sha', 'Charcoal Tan', 'Kevin Cheng Ka-Wing, Liu Xiaofeng, Cecilia Han, Chrissie Chau Sau-Na, Yu Rongguang, Ka-Yan Leung, Yuen Wah, Bruce Leung Siu-Lung', 'TV-PG', 'Grandmaster Ip Man was born in a time of turbulence. He spends his life chasing after the realm of martial arts. His upbringing and experiences would transform him into a legend. From Foshan to Guangzhou to Hong Kong, he meets, one-by-one, the people who will have the most influence on his life, including a revolutionist, his first teacher, and his Wing Chun master.', 'Grandmaster Ip Man was born in a time of turbulence. He spends his life chasing after the realm of martial arts. His upbringing and experiences would transform him into a legend. From Foshan to Guangzhou to Hong Kong, he meets, one-by-one, the people who will have the most influence on his life, including a revolutionist, his first teacher, and his Wing Chun master.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8HvMKgOOONpGW5HCDZKlvoTa2jS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:53135'),
  ('1115934053053800064', 'iPartment', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Wang Yuan', 'Chen He, Lou Yixiao, Zhao Wenqi, Li Jiahang, Sun Yizhou, Li Jinming, Cheng Guo, Zhang Yiduo', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jLMUydug1jJxAZdAuT5Y2JnjvQI.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:68809'),
  ('81188961334078869', 'Irabazi arte!', 2022, null, null, null, 'Joan Bailador, Ugaitz Amundarain, Dorleta Urretabizkaia, Ibai Ugarte, Ander Rovira, Joana Garitano, José Ramón Soroiz', null, 'Arene is a teenager who, along with her family, has to move from Barcelona to the town of Learo. From that moment on, she will have to get used to a new life, living with her grandfather and make new friends. But, above all, Arene will have to fight against the prejudices she finds in her new environment to create the first women''s football team in the town.', 'Arene is a teenager who, along with her family, has to move from Barcelona to the town of Learo. From that moment on, she will have to get used to a new life, living with her grandfather and make new friends. But, above all, Arene will have to fight against the prejudices she finds in her new environment to create the first women''s football team in the town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oIDoJB3IImWg8cytHgepD6ccXJ.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:157437'),
  ('554552496787493540', 'Iria: Zeiram the Animation', 1994, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Aya Hisakawa, Wataru Takagi, Masaru Ikeda, Mika Kanai, Shigeru Chiba, Jurota Kosugi, Satomi Korogi, Yuzuru Fujimoto', null, 'Iria is the story of a girl and the Alien being she loves to hate. The series begins with her brother, Gren, taking a job. He is a bounty hunter, and one well known for his incredible skill. Iria, being a skilled apprentice bounty hunter herself, tags along. What is the job, one might ask. It is to find out what has happened to the crew and cargo of a Space Station. Needless to say, nothing is as it seems, and the war between Iria and Zeiram begins in earnest.', 'Iria is the story of a girl and the Alien being she loves to hate. The series begins with her brother, Gren, taking a job. He is a bounty hunter, and one well known for his incredible skill. Iria, being a skilled apprentice bounty hunter herself, tags along. What is the job, one might ask. It is to find out what has happened to the crew and cargo of a Space Station. Needless to say, nothing is as it seems, and the war between Iria and Zeiram begins in earnest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j2qNFUKu6CjOnHakPlH4Ffq4UoZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43341'),
  ('788247145957833431', 'Irina: The Vampire Cosmonaut', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Megumi Hayashibara, Koki Uchiyama, Hina Kino, Satoshi Hino, Mikako Komatsu, Takaya Hashi, Masaki Terasoma, Kikuko Inoue', 'TV-14', 'The first astronaut in human history was a vampire girl. Following the end of World War II, the world-dividing superpowers, Federal Republic of Zirnitra in the East and United Kingdom of Arnack in the West, turned their territorial ambitions toward space. Both countries have been competing fiercely for development. East history 1960. Gergiev, the chief leader of the Republic, announces the manned space flight program Project Mechtat (Dream), which, if successful, would be the first feat for humankind. At that time, Lev Leps, a substitute astronaut candidate, is ordered to perform a top secret mission. The "Nosferatu Project"—a program that experiments with vampires prior to manned missions—will use Irina Luminesk as a test subject, and Lev is to monitor and train her. Even while trifled by the walls of the race and ego of the nations, Lev and Irina share a genuine sentiment as they aim for the universe.', 'The first astronaut in human history was a vampire girl. Following the end of World War II, the world-dividing superpowers, Federal Republic of Zirnitra in the East and United Kingdom of Arnack in the West, turned their territorial ambitions toward space. Both countries have been competing fiercely for development. East history 1960. Gergiev, the chief leader of the Republic, announces the manned space flight program Project Mechtat (Dream), which, if successful, would be the first feat for humankind. At that time, Lev Leps, a substitute astronaut candidate, is ordered to perform a top secret mission. The "Nosferatu Project"—a program that experiments with vampires prior to manned missions—will use Irina Luminesk as a test subject, and Lev is to monitor and train her. Even while trifled by the walls of the race and ego of the nations, Lev and Irina share a genuine sentiment as they aim for the universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a5SstgQQ9XmIRrYR0HL95sPpGAQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121017'),
  ('445722443598951036', 'Iris', 2009, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, 'Kim Hyeon-jun', 'Kim Yeong-cheol, Im Soo-hyang, Lee Joon, Yoon So-Yi, Baek Sung-hyun, David Lee McInnis, Jang Hyuk, Lee Da-hae', 'TV-14', 'Two friends, members of the South Korean military, are recruited by a secret black ops agency.', 'Two friends, members of the South Korean military, are recruited by a secret black ops agency.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qYogQkaGz7ejphzCf8EeylUuAKP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:31505'),
  ('434050147876055305', 'Iris II', 2013, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Chung Tae-won', 'Jo Gyu-won', 'Jang Hyuk, Lee Beom-soo, Lee Jeong-kil, Lee Da-hae, Kim Yeong-cheol, Yoon Doo-joon, Kim Seung-woo, Lee Joon', null, 'IRIS II: New Generation explores the aftermath events of IRIS as well as Athena: Goddess of War. The story explores the origins of the former Director of the NSS and IRIS agent, Baek San, and the protagonist Jung Yoo-gun.', 'IRIS II: New Generation explores the aftermath events of IRIS as well as Athena: Goddess of War. The story explores the origins of the former Director of the NSS and IRIS agent, Baek San, and the protagonist Jung Yoo-gun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lsyou5v2diVLNWY2ldDxYkR6095.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68177'),
  ('1038640109707771074', 'Irish Blood', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Molly McGlynn', null, 'Alicia Silverstone, Wendy Crewson, Jason O''Mara, Dearbhla Molloy, Simone Kirby, Ruth Codd, Leonardo Taiwo', null, 'Hot-shot Los Angeles divorce lawyer Fiona Fox receives a letter from her estranged father and sets out to uncover the mystery of his disappearance.', 'Hot-shot Los Angeles divorce lawyer Fiona Fox receives a letter from her estranged father and sets out to uncover the mystery of his disappearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMYNSLST7xZX51pknSFg0oyLhoZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:274642'),
  ('132651623278404313', 'Irma Vep', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Olivier Assayas', null, 'Alicia Vikander, Vincent Macaigne, Lars Eidinger, Devon Ross, Nora Hamzawi, Jeanne Balibar, Adria Arjona, Byron Bowers', 'TV-MA', 'Mira is an American movie star disillusioned by her career and a recent breakup, who comes to France to star as “Irma Vep” in a remake of the French silent film classic, “Les Vampires.” Set against the backdrop of a lurid crime thriller, Mira struggles as the distinctions between herself and the character she plays begin to blur and merge.', 'Mira is an American movie star disillusioned by her career and a recent breakup, who comes to France to star as “Irma Vep” in a remake of the French silent film classic, “Les Vampires.” Set against the backdrop of a lurid crime thriller, Mira struggles as the distinctions between herself and the character she plays begin to blur and merge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gVST8KoYxV8A0ZtlitzEaKeE5L2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:115626'),
  ('411147661786915647', 'IRODUKU: The World in Colors', 2018, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kaori Ishihara, Kaede Hondo, Nao Toyama, Sayaka Ohara, Kana Ichinose, Seiji Maeda, Keiko Han, Toshiyuki Morikawa', 'NR', 'Set in the city of Nagasaki, the story takes place in a world where a miniscule amount of magic remains in everyday life. Hitomi Tsukishiro is a 17-year-old descendant of a witch family who grew up with stale emotions, as she lost her sense of color at a very young age. Feeling sorry for her granddaughter''s future, Kohaku, a great witch, sends Hitomi to past, the year 2018. Through exchanges with her 17-year-old grandmother and her club members, the story follows Hitomi''s growth as a person.', 'Set in the city of Nagasaki, the story takes place in a world where a miniscule amount of magic remains in everyday life. Hitomi Tsukishiro is a 17-year-old descendant of a witch family who grew up with stale emotions, as she lost her sense of color at a very young age. Feeling sorry for her granddaughter''s future, Kohaku, a great witch, sends Hitomi to past, the year 2018. Through exchanges with her 17-year-old grandmother and her club members, the story follows Hitomi''s growth as a person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/YEjHpHcyPZzboTXFoOobdwmFwQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82738'),
  ('1020625136440799354', 'Iron Chef', 1993, 'Reality', 'Fuji Creative Corporation, Keiichi Tanaka', 'Kundo Koyama', 'Hiroyuki Sakai, Takeshi Kata, Kenji Fukui, Yukio Hattori, Shinichirō Ōta', 'TV-G', 'Iron Chef is a Japanese television cooking show produced by Fuji Television. The series, which premiered on October 10, 1993, is a stylized cook-off featuring guest chefs challenging one of the show''s resident "Iron Chefs" in a timed cooking battle built around a specific theme ingredient. The series ended on September 24, 1999, although occasional specials were produced until 2002. The series aired 309 episodes. Repeats are regularly aired on the Cooking Channel in the United States and on Special Broadcasting Service in Australia. Fuji TV will air a new version of the show, titled Iron Chef, beginning in October 26, 2012.', 'Iron Chef is a Japanese television cooking show produced by Fuji Television. The series, which premiered on October 10, 1993, is a stylized cook-off featuring guest chefs challenging one of the show''s resident "Iron Chefs" in a timed cooking battle built around a specific theme ingredient. The series ended on September 24, 1999, although occasional specials were produced until 2002. The series aired 309 episodes. Repeats are regularly aired on the Cooking Channel in the United States and on Special Broadcasting Service in Australia. Fuji TV will air a new version of the show, titled Iron Chef, beginning in October 26, 2012.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQup2R8XqIVQxFDv4CfcZXazJe0.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:4594'),
  ('529325902227214317', 'Iron Chef America', 2005, 'Reality', 'Alton Brown', null, null, 'TV-G', 'Iron Chef America: The Series is an American cooking show based on Fuji Television''s Iron Chef, and is the second American adaptation of the series, following the failed Iron Chef USA. The show is produced by Food Network, which also carried a dubbed version of the original Iron Chef. Like the original Japanese program, the program is a culinary game show. In each episode, a new challenger chef competes against one of the resident "Iron Chefs" in a one-hour cooking competition based on a secret ingredient or ingredients, and sometimes theme. The show is presented as a successor to the original Iron Chef, as opposed to being a remake. The Chairman is portrayed by actor and martial artist Mark Dacascos, who is introduced as the nephew of the original Japanese chairman Takeshi Kaga. The commentary is provided solely by Alton Brown, & Kevin Brauch is the floor reporter. The music is written by composer Craig Marks, who released the soundtrack titled "Iron Chef America & The Next Iron Chef" by the end of 2010. In addition, regular ICA judge and Chopped host Ted Allen provided additional floor commentary for two special battles: Battle First Thanksgiving and Battle White House Produce.', 'Iron Chef America: The Series is an American cooking show based on Fuji Television''s Iron Chef, and is the second American adaptation of the series, following the failed Iron Chef USA. The show is produced by Food Network, which also carried a dubbed version of the original Iron Chef. Like the original Japanese program, the program is a culinary game show. In each episode, a new challenger chef competes against one of the resident "Iron Chefs" in a one-hour cooking competition based on a secret ingredient or ingredients, and sometimes theme. The show is presented as a successor to the original Iron Chef, as opposed to being a remake. The Chairman is portrayed by actor and martial artist Mark Dacascos, who is introduced as the nephew of the original Japanese chairman Takeshi Kaga. The commentary is provided solely by Alton Brown, & Kevin Brauch is the floor reporter. The music is written by composer Craig Marks, who released the soundtrack titled "Iron Chef America & The Next Iron Chef" by the end of 2010. In addition, regular ICA judge and Chopped host Ted Allen provided additional floor commentary for two special battles: Battle First Thanksgiving and Battle White House Produce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHTuJ9LvGlLImr7n8Rg0KaTxG9L.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:4360'),
  ('533508468555868816', 'Iron Chef: Quest for an Iron Legend', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Alton Brown, Kristen Kish, Mark Dacascos, Andrew Zimmern, Nilou Motamed', 'TV-G', 'The legendary Iron Chef series is reborn with a supersized approach to the ground-breaking culinary competition that started it all. It’s been called the toughest culinary challenge a chef will ever experience. This is where world-class cuisine meets high-octane sports. Five new trailblazing Iron Chefs will welcome brave Challenger Chefs to the reimagined Kitchen Stadium, where they''ll face off and be pushed to the limits of endurance and creativity, as they cook up extraordinary culinary creations. The competition’s most successful Challenger will return to battle in a grand finale for the chance to be named the first ever "Iron Legend."', 'The legendary Iron Chef series is reborn with a supersized approach to the ground-breaking culinary competition that started it all. It’s been called the toughest culinary challenge a chef will ever experience. This is where world-class cuisine meets high-octane sports. Five new trailblazing Iron Chefs will welcome brave Challenger Chefs to the reimagined Kitchen Stadium, where they''ll face off and be pushed to the limits of endurance and creativity, as they cook up extraordinary culinary creations. The competition’s most successful Challenger will return to battle in a grand finale for the chance to be named the first ever "Iron Legend."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n95twdiuLG8nZpCENhpcbvPIx2e.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:201105'),
  ('373152960382295552', 'Iron Island', 2018, 'Drama', 'Adriana Lunardi, Max Mallmann', null, 'Cauã Reymond, Maria Casadevall, Romulo Estrela, Mariana Ximenes, Eriberto Leão, Taumaturgo Ferreira, Osmar Prado, Erom Cordeiro', null, 'On an offshore oil rig, "Iron Island" showcases the duality of people who have their lives torn apart: wherever they are, they feel incomplete. In this scenario, Dante, the oil rig''s production coordinator, is an irascible man who sees his life collapsing between the turmoil in the high seas and family dilemmas on solid ground.', 'On an offshore oil rig, "Iron Island" showcases the duality of people who have their lives torn apart: wherever they are, they feel incomplete. In this scenario, Dante, the oil rig''s production coordinator, is an irascible man who sees his life collapsing between the turmoil in the high seas and family dilemmas on solid ground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jN03YxeJ4eylVbUuavYUdL84N4T.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:84104'),
  ('1121073098774311058', 'Iron Man', 1994, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Robert Hays, Dorian Harewood, Jennifer Hale, Robert Ito, Tom Kane', 'TV-Y7', 'Industrialist Tony Stark leads a private team of superheroes as Iron Man against the forces of evil.', 'Industrialist Tony Stark leads a private team of superheroes as Iron Man against the forces of evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTQWWH6CFtl37x1nPx8HRwbwvGn.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:3097'),
  ('116811501348384695', 'Iron Man', 2010, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Keiji Fujiwara, Takako Honda, Shizuka Itoh, Jin Yamanoi, Unsho Ishizuka, Hiroe Oka', 'TV-14', 'When Tony Stark branches his company into Japan, he is opposed by the nefarious Zodiac organization. It''s up to Stark''s Iron Man to defeat the Zodiac, and defend Japan.', 'When Tony Stark branches his company into Japan, he is opposed by the nefarious Zodiac organization. It''s up to Stark''s Iron Man to defeat the Zodiac, and defend Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zOTJT7JbzSrMBX2OCGPqUnkQA4y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45418'),
  ('545120284175442883', 'Iron Man and His Awesome Friends', 2025, 'Animation, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mason Blomberg, Kapri Ladd, Aidyn James Ahn, Tony Hale, Fred Tatasciore, David Kaye, Talon Warburton, Vanessa Bayer', 'TV-Y', 'Follow the adventures (and misadventures) of best friends and super geniuses, Tony Stark, Riri Williams and Amadeus Cho as they work together to solve problems both big and small and protect their city.', 'Follow the adventures (and misadventures) of best friends and super geniuses, Tony Stark, Riri Williams and Amadeus Cho as they work together to solve problems both big and small and protect their city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NlFaIdOkBg2VC3Imi1kbeeGynw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:274388'),
  ('757708297828528480', 'Iron Man: Armored Adventures', 2009, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family', 'Christopher L. Yost, Romain Van Liemt, Alexandre de La Patellière', null, 'Adrian Petriw, Anna Cummer, Daniel Bacon', 'TV-Y7', 'As Iron Man, teenage child prodigy Tony Stark uses his technological inventions to fight various similarly technologically advanced threats. His friends, James "Rhodey" Rhodes and Pepper Potts, help him on his courageous and dangerous adventures.', 'As Iron Man, teenage child prodigy Tony Stark uses his technological inventions to fight various similarly technologically advanced threats. His friends, James "Rhodey" Rhodes and Pepper Potts, help him on his courageous and dangerous adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kIJGgBwh37V2nfgnJFaN7zDIjdv.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:7330'),
  ('155175935471091316', 'Iron Man: Extremis', 2010, 'Animation', null, null, 'Jason Griffith, Therese Spurrier, Ted Lewis', 'TV-14', 'An experimental serum called Extremis gets stolen, and Iron Man rockets into action. The ensuing battles test Stark''s spirit and Iron Man''s power.', 'An experimental serum called Extremis gets stolen, and Iron Man rockets into action. The ensuing battles test Stark''s spirit and Iron Man''s power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w10ClxT6uqnyxJZiMAx2ty9GkWu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77362'),
  ('112140557005322659', 'Iron Reign', 2024, 'Crime, Drama', 'Lluís Quílez', null, 'Chino Darín, Jaime Lorente, Natalia de Molina, Raúl Briones, Giannina Fruttero, Salva Reina, Eduard Fernández, Sergi López', 'TV-MA', 'Joaquín Manchado rules his drug empire from Barcelona''s seaport with an iron fist — until a new shipment sends business and family spiraling.', 'Joaquín Manchado rules his drug empire from Barcelona''s seaport with an iron fist — until a new shipment sends business and family spiraling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fc1oDqW2Gi1vzzloMwcRFXgtjdM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:242875'),
  ('962110604405657974', 'Ironheart', 2025, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Crime, Action & Adventure', 'Chinaka Hodge', null, 'Dominique Thorne, Lyric Ross, Manny Montana, Matthew Elam, Anji White, Eric André, Sonia Denis, Shea Couleé', 'TV-14', 'After the events of Black Panther: Wakanda Forever, technology is pitted against magic when Riri Williams, a young, genius inventor determined to make her mark on the world, returns to her hometown of Chicago. Her unique take on building iron suits is brilliant, but in pursuit of her ambitions, she finds herself wrapped up with the mysterious yet charming Parker Robbins aka "The Hood."', 'After the events of Black Panther: Wakanda Forever, technology is pitted against magic when Riri Williams, a young, genius inventor determined to make her mark on the world, returns to her hometown of Chicago. Her unique take on building iron suits is brilliant, but in pursuit of her ambitions, she finds herself wrapped up with the mysterious yet charming Parker Robbins aka "The Hood."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dOh6MJpdlQhYpLBhzhNQeYGKTZ5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114471'),
  ('932631927036138605', 'Ironside', 1967, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Collier Young', null, 'Raymond Burr, Don Galloway, Don Mitchell, Barbara Anderson, Elizabeth Baur', 'TV-PG', 'When an assassin''s bullet confines him to a wheelchair for life ending his career as Chief of Detectives, Robert T. Ironside becomes a consultant to the police department. Detective Sergeant Ed Brown and policewoman Eve Whitfield join with him to crack varied and fascinating cases. Ex-con Mark Sanger is employed by the chief as home help but eventually becomes a fully fledged member of the team also. Officer Whitfield leaves after 4 years service, and is replaced by Officer Fran Belding.', 'When an assassin''s bullet confines him to a wheelchair for life ending his career as Chief of Detectives, Robert T. Ironside becomes a consultant to the police department. Detective Sergeant Ed Brown and policewoman Eve Whitfield join with him to crack varied and fascinating cases. Ex-con Mark Sanger is employed by the chief as home help but eventually becomes a fully fledged member of the team also. Officer Whitfield leaves after 4 years service, and is replaced by Officer Fran Belding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Fu9Sv0pQ0s89uWwwXcaG0kiNW7.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:4582'),
  ('23373208144235914', 'Ironside', 2013, 'Drama, Crime', 'Michael Caleo, Collier Young', null, 'Blair Underwood, Kenneth Choi, Brent Sexton, Pablo Schreiber, Spencer Grammer, Neal Bledsoe', null, 'In the gritty world of the NYPD, no one''s tougher than Detective Robert Ironside. He and his trusted, handpicked team of specialists will do whatever it takes to solve New York''s most difficult and notorious crimes - even if it means breaking the rules. As a detective, his instincts are second to none, and those around him have to stay on their toes if they want to keep up...because when his spine was shattered by a bullet two years ago, Ironside swore he''d never let a damn wheelchair slow him down.', 'In the gritty world of the NYPD, no one''s tougher than Detective Robert Ironside. He and his trusted, handpicked team of specialists will do whatever it takes to solve New York''s most difficult and notorious crimes - even if it means breaking the rules. As a detective, his instincts are second to none, and those around him have to stay on their toes if they want to keep up...because when his spine was shattered by a bullet two years ago, Ironside swore he''d never let a damn wheelchair slow him down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f14yvzQg1xEpK3rQGdlApltJki4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46694'),
  ('130787491451797227', 'Irreplaceable Love', 2020, 'Drama', null, null, 'Sun Yi, Bai Jingting, Zhu Jiaqi, Xia Yang, He Lei, Xue Haojing, Yang Yue, Zhong Weilun', null, 'After losing her younger brother in a devastating fire, Li Chuyao’s life unravels when her grief-stricken mother mistakes his best friend, Li Luoshu, for her deceased son. Stepping into the role to stabilize the family, Li Luoshu becomes Chuyao’s quiet source of strength as she faces betrayal, mounting debt, and heartbreak.', 'After losing her younger brother in a devastating fire, Li Chuyao’s life unravels when her grief-stricken mother mistakes his best friend, Li Luoshu, for her deceased son. Stepping into the role to stabilize the family, Li Luoshu becomes Chuyao’s quiet source of strength as she faces betrayal, mounting debt, and heartbreak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4DD9guV8Phu1yNlMSWXu2Csu4QO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113784'),
  ('737564886107599024', 'Irresistible She', 2021, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Huang Xing', null, 'Love you thousands of times and be abused thousands of miles.', 'Love you thousands of times and be abused thousands of miles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lmF1A39vabBs9Y1NIt4HHbTSmIu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:248996'),
  ('1123782764576666906', 'Irreverent', 2022, 'Drama', 'Paddy Macrae', null, 'Colin Donnell, P.J. Byrne, Kylie Bracknell, Wayne Blair, Tegan Stimson, Ed Oxenbould, Jason Wilder, Briallen Clarke', 'TV-14', 'A criminal from Chicago who bungles a heist is forced to hideout in a small Australian reef town in Far North Queensland posing as the new church Reverend.', 'A criminal from Chicago who bungles a heist is forced to hideout in a small Australian reef town in Far North Queensland posing as the new church Reverend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kczUA9Sbcjx2bIJoZqMFQLXl705.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156989'),
  ('232076882733480782', 'IRT Deadliest Roads', 2010, 'Documentary, Reality', 'Thom Beers', null, 'Hugh Rowland, Lisa Kelly, G.W. Boles, Timothy Zickuhr, Agustin Rodriguez, Thom Beers', null, 'Truckers on the worlds most deadliest roads.', 'Truckers on the worlds most deadliest roads.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wlCtnnB9T35YhFaMrQmjs6wmZWd.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:35729'),
  ('129470073263112770', 'Iryu: Team Medical Dragon', 2006, 'Drama', null, 'Kayo Hikawa, Koji Hayashi, Tarô Nogizaka', 'Kenji Sakaguchi, Teppei Koike, Izumi Inamori, Kuranosuke Sasaki, Sadao Abe, Mari Natsuki, Ittoku Kishibe, Tetsuhiro Ikeda', 'TV-14', 'Ryutaro Asada was the chief surgeon of Team Medical Dragon, a globally active emergency medical care team that worked in refugee camps. After his return to Japan, this amazingly talented surgeon starts work at a university hospital, where he uncovers one case of corruption after another and takes on a lot of powerful contenders in this heroic drama. The struggles between the hospital and the patients, the infighting among the hospital staff, and the patients who get involved in those struggles are all depicted in a realistic manner in a drama that has an overwhelming feeling of speed. Here’s a human drama depicting a thrilling battle between life and death, a totally new, outstanding form of entertainment.', 'Ryutaro Asada was the chief surgeon of Team Medical Dragon, a globally active emergency medical care team that worked in refugee camps. After his return to Japan, this amazingly talented surgeon starts work at a university hospital, where he uncovers one case of corruption after another and takes on a lot of powerful contenders in this heroic drama. The struggles between the hospital and the patients, the infighting among the hospital staff, and the patients who get involved in those struggles are all depicted in a realistic manner in a drama that has an overwhelming feeling of speed. Here’s a human drama depicting a thrilling battle between life and death, a totally new, outstanding form of entertainment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aO20nHmTSXMwuQqFWVFlpPt3YiK.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:19416'),
  ('894964501883883090', 'Is It Cake?', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Mikey Day', 'TV-PG', 'Skilled cake artists create mouthwatering replicas of handbags, sewing machines and more in a mind-bending baking contest inspired by a popular meme.', 'Skilled cake artists create mouthwatering replicas of handbags, sewing machines and more in a mind-bending baking contest inspired by a popular meme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nDohKinqCX0EudNNstxYWI730jI.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:158646'),
  ('909102098631093474', 'Is It Cake? Holiday', 2024, 'Reality', null, null, 'Mikey Day', 'TV-PG', 'Cake artists from past seasons return to craft tasty replicas of ice skates, nutcrackers and more in this holiday spin on the mind-bending baking contest.', 'Cake artists from past seasons return to craft tasty replicas of ice skates, nutcrackers and more in this holiday spin on the mind-bending baking contest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5y6anTg9PUjsSVDfNmIHWntb2Z6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:275144'),
  ('152394112056738656', 'Is It Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon?', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Inori Minase, Maaya Uchida, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Saori Onishi, Chinatsu Akasaki, Haruka Chisuga, Saori Hayami', 'TV-MA', 'In Orario, fearless adventurers band together in search of fame and fortune within the underground labyrinth known as the Dungeon. But Bell Cranel, novice adventurer, has bigger plans than riches and glory; he fights monsters in the hope of having a fateful encounter with a girl. When this happens, it doesn''t go exactly as he planned. Thus begins the story of an unlikely pair, a boy and a goddess, both trying to prove themselves, both eager to reach their goals.', 'In Orario, fearless adventurers band together in search of fame and fortune within the underground labyrinth known as the Dungeon. But Bell Cranel, novice adventurer, has bigger plans than riches and glory; he fights monsters in the hope of having a fateful encounter with a girl. When this happens, it doesn''t go exactly as he planned. Thus begins the story of an unlikely pair, a boy and a goddess, both trying to prove themselves, both eager to reach their goals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hR4zYTRJZiSYooocDRPW7P3PCTF.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:62745'),
  ('834659231192299771', 'Is It Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon? On the Side: Sword Oratoria', 2017, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, 'Hideki Shirane', 'Saori Onishi, Juri Kimura, Rie Murakawa, Minami Takahashi, Yurika Kubo, Mutsumi Tamura, Ayako Kawasumi, Kenji Nomura', 'TV-14', 'Contrary to what the adventures of Bell and the Goddess Hestia might imply, not everyone goes into the dungeon of Orario to pick up girls. The veterans of the Goddess Loki’s Familia have lots of reasons for risking life and limb facing the monsters and mayhem lurking within the deadly labyrinth’s multiple levels, but new member and mage Lefiya just wants to prove that she’s worthy to be on the same team as her hero, the famed sword princess Ais Wallenstein. As for Ais herself, she’s seeking something that no one else even suspects, and she may find it when trouble comes after her from the previously unreached 59th level!', 'Contrary to what the adventures of Bell and the Goddess Hestia might imply, not everyone goes into the dungeon of Orario to pick up girls. The veterans of the Goddess Loki’s Familia have lots of reasons for risking life and limb facing the monsters and mayhem lurking within the deadly labyrinth’s multiple levels, but new member and mage Lefiya just wants to prove that she’s worthy to be on the same team as her hero, the famed sword princess Ais Wallenstein. As for Ais herself, she’s seeking something that no one else even suspects, and she may find it when trouble comes after her from the previously unreached 59th level!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mLRmZ83ab7EPDY0mdUVuDCk3USU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70590'),
  ('850415737365873014', 'Is the Order a Rabbit?', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Ayane Sakura, Inori Minase, Risa Taneda, Satomi Sato, Maaya Uchida, Sora Tokui, Rie Murakawa, Saori Hayami', 'TV-PG', 'Cocoa Hoto is a positive and energetic girl who becomes friends with anyone in just three seconds. After moving in with the Kafuu family in order to attend high school away from home, she immediately befriends the shy and precocious granddaughter of Rabbit House cafe''s founder, Chino Kafuu, who is often seen with the talking rabbit, Tippy, on her head. After beginning to work as a waitress in return for room and board, Cocoa also befriends another part-timer, Rize Tedeza, who has unusual behavior and significant physical capabilities due to her military upbringing; Chiya Ujimatsu, a waitress from a rival cafe who does everything at her own pace; and Sharo Kirima, another waitress at a different cafe who has the air of a noblewoman despite being impoverished. With fluffy silliness and caffeinated fun.', 'Cocoa Hoto is a positive and energetic girl who becomes friends with anyone in just three seconds. After moving in with the Kafuu family in order to attend high school away from home, she immediately befriends the shy and precocious granddaughter of Rabbit House cafe''s founder, Chino Kafuu, who is often seen with the talking rabbit, Tippy, on her head. After beginning to work as a waitress in return for room and board, Cocoa also befriends another part-timer, Rize Tedeza, who has unusual behavior and significant physical capabilities due to her military upbringing; Chiya Ujimatsu, a waitress from a rival cafe who does everything at her own pace; and Sharo Kirima, another waitress at a different cafe who has the air of a noblewoman despite being impoverished. With fluffy silliness and caffeinated fun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUlQ6mNGMzQi7fJ1Uo7FCMdlxF7.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:60843'),
  ('331245198403114495', 'Is This a Zombie?', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Junji Majima, Midori Tsukimiya, Iori Nomizu, Yoko Hikasa, Hisako Kanemoto, Chiharu Kitaoka, Hitomi Nabatame, Hiroyuki Yoshino', 'TV-MA', 'Some guys have no luck; he’s got no pulse. That’s life for poor unfortunate, undead Ayumu. First, he was murdered by a serial killer. Total bummer. Then he was resurrected as a zombie by a cute little Necromancer. That seemed pretty cool until she moved into his house, refused to speak, and forced his rotting carcass to do all the cooking. After that, a magical girl in a pretty pink dress used her matching chainsaw to chop his corpse in half. Luckily, the Necromancer’s powers of resurrection trumped those of the chainsaw chick, so instead of dying (again), Ayumu became the world’s first magical girl zombie. There’s also a voluptuous vampire ninja who thinks zombie boy’s a pervert – and a hideous crayfish demon who wants to devour him. Confused? All you gotta know is this: zombies, frilly dresses, demons, and moe chainsaws. Pink. It’s the new dead.', 'Some guys have no luck; he’s got no pulse. That’s life for poor unfortunate, undead Ayumu. First, he was murdered by a serial killer. Total bummer. Then he was resurrected as a zombie by a cute little Necromancer. That seemed pretty cool until she moved into his house, refused to speak, and forced his rotting carcass to do all the cooking. After that, a magical girl in a pretty pink dress used her matching chainsaw to chop his corpse in half. Luckily, the Necromancer’s powers of resurrection trumped those of the chainsaw chick, so instead of dying (again), Ayumu became the world’s first magical girl zombie. There’s also a voluptuous vampire ninja who thinks zombie boy’s a pervert – and a hideous crayfish demon who wants to devour him. Confused? All you gotta know is this: zombies, frilly dresses, demons, and moe chainsaws. Pink. It’s the new dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRCtFHNKL5d41Uxr1UvM6wytPQc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:38420'),
  ('741904107900403355', 'Is this Love Checkmate!?', 2018, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Yuki Kashiwagi, Kentaro Ito, Mao, Makoto Tanaka, Shuhei Abe, Yuma Yamoto, Shinsuke Kato, Takumi Saitoh', null, 'A love story between a 24-year-old office worker who has neither love experience nor communication skills and a 32-year-old female shōgi player he meets on his daily commute.', 'A love story between a 24-year-old office worker who has neither love experience nor communication skills and a 32-year-old female shōgi player he meets on his daily commute.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6Xc64QmbQb6stsA6Thjqk8NQTO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84919'),
  ('19517248297946262', 'Isabel', 2012, 'Drama', 'Javier Ródenas, Isla de Babel', null, 'Michelle Jenner, Rodolfo Sancho, Irene Escolar, Raúl Mérida, Álvaro Monje, Héctor Carballo, Borja Luna, Jorge Bosch', null, 'Charting the life of Isabella I of Castile, one of the most important women in Spain’s history, Isabel follows her passionate story from childhood to being crowned Queen. From her political struggles within King Henry IV''s court to her wedding to Ferdinand of Aragon, the drama encapsulates the passions, emotions and sacrifices of a woman who refused to just be a figurehead and whose outlook was ahead of her time.', 'Charting the life of Isabella I of Castile, one of the most important women in Spain’s history, Isabel follows her passionate story from childhood to being crowned Queen. From her political struggles within King Henry IV''s court to her wedding to Ferdinand of Aragon, the drama encapsulates the passions, emotions and sacrifices of a woman who refused to just be a figurehead and whose outlook was ahead of her time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hbKcDyqtyuqsU3aGxmTPV92rWXQ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:42276'),
  ('406777745689290371', 'Isabel', 2021, 'Drama', 'Jonathan Cuchacovich', null, 'Daniela Ramírez, Néstor Cantillana, Rodolfo Pulgar', 'TV-MA', 'From a young age, Isabel was willing to break all the socially accepted standards of her time to pursue happiness and blaze her own path. Then, at the peak of her career, she receives the devastating news that her daughter is on the verge of dying. The pain may have bent her, but it never broke her.', 'From a young age, Isabel was willing to break all the socially accepted standards of her time to pursue happiness and blaze her own path. Then, at the peak of her career, she receives the devastating news that her daughter is on the verge of dying. The pain may have bent her, but it never broke her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifewkQ4QAEGzxPJsAlEmtsQHBj4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98518'),
  ('200479252454635901', 'Isekai Cheat Magician', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kohei Amasaki, Rie Takahashi, Minami Tanaka, Sayaka Ohara, Yurika Kubo, Hiro Shimono, Yoko Hikasa', null, 'Taichi Nishimura is a typical, average high schooler, and Azuma Rin is a beautiful woman with the build of a model and excellent reflexes. The two live an ordinary high school life until one day, they''re suddenly enveloped in a mysterious magic circle and transported to an unknown land. That world is full of terrifying monsters, beastmen, dwarves, elves, and many other races right out of fantasy. To survive in this new world, Taichi and Rin decide to become adventurers, but when they take the aptitude test, they discover they both possess cheat-level magic.', 'Taichi Nishimura is a typical, average high schooler, and Azuma Rin is a beautiful woman with the build of a model and excellent reflexes. The two live an ordinary high school life until one day, they''re suddenly enveloped in a mysterious magic circle and transported to an unknown land. That world is full of terrifying monsters, beastmen, dwarves, elves, and many other races right out of fantasy. To survive in this new world, Taichi and Rin decide to become adventurers, but when they take the aptitude test, they discover they both possess cheat-level magic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vtAJAku94Fm3OVsHx9w04XhsTk3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90215'),
  ('320074278801276017', 'Isekai Izakaya: Japanese Food from Another World', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Suzuko Mimori, Tomokazu Sugita, Katsuyuki Konishi, Atsushi Abe, Showtaro Morikubo, Maaya Uchida, Misaki Kuno', null, 'Experienced head chef Nobuyuki Yazawa and friendly waitress Shinobu Senke run a traditional Japanese izakaya called Nobu—a bar known for serving a tasty array of food and drink. Welcoming any and all customers, the pair strive to showcase Nobu''s exclusive menu and provide the best possible experience. However, despite its ordinary appearance, the establishment opens to the heart of Aitheria, a city from a parallel universe. As news of the restaurant''s exquisite dishes spreads throughout the lands, Aitherian citizens from various social backgrounds travel to Nobu in search of new and delicious cuisine, bringing with them an empty stomach and riveting stories to tell.', 'Experienced head chef Nobuyuki Yazawa and friendly waitress Shinobu Senke run a traditional Japanese izakaya called Nobu—a bar known for serving a tasty array of food and drink. Welcoming any and all customers, the pair strive to showcase Nobu''s exclusive menu and provide the best possible experience. However, despite its ordinary appearance, the establishment opens to the heart of Aitheria, a city from a parallel universe. As news of the restaurant''s exquisite dishes spreads throughout the lands, Aitherian citizens from various social backgrounds travel to Nobu in search of new and delicious cuisine, bringing with them an empty stomach and riveting stories to tell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4u74TSB2hInsoNBAeTovAOUrRo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78485'),
  ('803785474199059173', 'Isekai Office Worker: The Other World''s Books Depend on the Bean Counter', 2026, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kent Ito, Tomoaki Maeno, Seiichiro Yamashita, Hiroki Touchi, Tomohiro Yamaguchi, Yuna Kamakura, Takaaki Torashima, Win Morisaki', null, 'Seiichirou Kondou gets caught up in a summoning ritual and is transported to a parallel world called Romany Kingdom. Having worked day and night, he demands a job and joins the Royal Accounting Department. After narrowly surviving a tonic’s deadly side effects with the aid of magic, Seiichirou entrusts himself to Aresh, captain of the Third Royal Order, known as the Ice Prince.', 'Seiichirou Kondou gets caught up in a summoning ritual and is transported to a parallel world called Romany Kingdom. Having worked day and night, he demands a job and joins the Royal Accounting Department. After narrowly surviving a tonic’s deadly side effects with the aid of magic, Seiichirou entrusts himself to Aresh, captain of the Third Royal Order, known as the Ice Prince.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/73Eu18rpNrKErJjSaibJhee5Nnb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:284495'),
  ('1050857962026844255', 'Isekai Onsen Paradise', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Konao Menrui', null, 'Shouhei Tokiwa, Marie Miyake, Ria Koito, Kyōko Kuramochi, Akari Miyazaki, Mariko Miyase', 'TV-MA', 'The story centers around Yoshizou Yukawa, a major hot spring fan who finds hidden springs to revitalize the economy of the local area. However, he dies after falling off a cliff and is transported to an alternate world, thanks to an inari deity of harvest at a small shrine nestled in the rocks. Together with the inari''s attendant princess Mayudama, he continues searching for storied hot springs, only this time in the alternate world. Along the way, he ends up naked in hot springs with furry-eared girls and elven girls.', 'The story centers around Yoshizou Yukawa, a major hot spring fan who finds hidden springs to revitalize the economy of the local area. However, he dies after falling off a cliff and is transported to an alternate world, thanks to an inari deity of harvest at a small shrine nestled in the rocks. Together with the inari''s attendant princess Mayudama, he continues searching for storied hot springs, only this time in the alternate world. Along the way, he ends up naked in hot springs with furry-eared girls and elven girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5f0yh62qbcNyhETZgoaihqRIgdR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241021'),
  ('470482099681112842', 'Isekai Quartet', 2019, 'Comedy, Animation', null, null, 'Aoi Yuuki, Jun Fukushima, Rie Takahashi, Saori Hayami, Satoshi Hino, Sora Amamiya, Yumi Hara, Emiri Kato', 'TV-14', 'A mysterious switch appeared one day. Upon pressing it, they were sent to a different alternative world!! There are also characters from other alternative worlds gathered together...!?', 'A mysterious switch appeared one day. Upon pressing it, they were sent to a different alternative world!! There are also characters from other alternative worlds gathered together...!?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/clts5tTaabf4KebibgFQwcyLSkx.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:87478'),
  ('528551800796571648', 'ISHIKO and HANEO: You''re Suing Me?', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ayuko Tsukahara', 'Masafumi Nishida', 'Kasumi Arimura, Tomoya Nakamura, Eiji Akaso, Masashi Sada', null, 'A paralegal who graduated from a big-name school teams up with an offbeat lawyer, taking on oddball little cases out of a small, neighborhood law office.', 'A paralegal who graduated from a big-name school teams up with an offbeat lawyer, taking on oddball little cases out of a small, neighborhood law office.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ciLYcchidUbxDi4n8Sxix11uVLo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204367'),
  ('836020673185996067', 'Ishq Mein Marjawan', 2017, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Yash A. Patnaik', null, 'Zain Imam, Reem Shaikh, Akshit Sukhija', null, 'She had the perfect life, the perfect man but little did she know that she was walking into the perfect trap. What happens when the man you love turns out to be a genius manipulator?', 'She had the perfect life, the perfect man but little did she know that she was walking into the perfect trap. What happens when the man you love turns out to be a genius manipulator?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6GxRfPAGIq1qVFVo55rQp39klfV.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:75439'),
