  ('147372083356489670', 'Isis', 1975, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Marc Richards', null, 'JoAnna Cameron, Brian Cutler, Ronalda Douglas, Albert Reed Jr.', 'TV-Y7', 'The Secrets of Isis is the syndicated title of a live action CBS television series produced by Filmation in the 1970s originally titled Isis that appeared during the Saturday morning cartoon lineup. The show was also aired in various countries around the world. As indicated on commentary in the 2007 DVD release of the series, and supported by examining broadcast premiere dates, The Secrets of Isis was the first weekly American live-action television series whose lead character was a female superhero, debuting September 6, 1975 and predating the weekly debuts of both The Bionic Woman and Wonder Woman.', 'The Secrets of Isis is the syndicated title of a live action CBS television series produced by Filmation in the 1970s originally titled Isis that appeared during the Saturday morning cartoon lineup. The show was also aired in various countries around the world. As indicated on commentary in the 2007 DVD release of the series, and supported by examining broadcast premiere dates, The Secrets of Isis was the first weekly American live-action television series whose lead character was a female superhero, debuting September 6, 1975 and predating the weekly debuts of both The Bionic Woman and Wonder Woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lIc5LUIoshHlFXrC40e229Bu6IU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:12072'),
  ('606218961367584306', 'Iskander', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', 'Aurélien Molas', null, 'Stéphane Caillard', null, 'Rookie cop Chloé, a new arrival to French Guiana, investigates the ritualistic double murder of a French couple and their missing son.', 'Rookie cop Chloé, a new arrival to French Guiana, investigates the ritualistic double murder of a French couple and their missing son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDG1as6RzCB8s7CN7aLCmw49WDJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:76643'),
  ('991895793689834095', 'Isla Brava', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Esther Feldman', null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5j1NL8512boOikoOUxG90A12HUv.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:226807'),
  ('359336288220424445', 'Island', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery, Animation', null, null, 'Yukari Tamura, Kana Asumi, Hibiku Yamamura, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Rina Sato, Takamasa Mogi, Yui Nakajima, Tomoyo Takayanagi', 'TV-14', 'Urashima, an island far from the mainland. The people who live there lead carefree lives. But five years ago, the island''s three great families suffered a series of misfortunes, and succumbed to suspicion. The people of the island cut off all contact with the mainland, and began a slow decline. The key to saving the island lies in three girls who belong to the three families. But they are bound by old traditions, and are conflicted. On that island, a lone man washes ashore. The man claims to be from the future, and he begins a solitary struggle to change the island''s fate.', 'Urashima, an island far from the mainland. The people who live there lead carefree lives. But five years ago, the island''s three great families suffered a series of misfortunes, and succumbed to suspicion. The people of the island cut off all contact with the mainland, and began a slow decline. The key to saving the island lies in three girls who belong to the three families. But they are bound by old traditions, and are conflicted. On that island, a lone man washes ashore. The man claims to be from the future, and he begins a solitary struggle to change the island''s fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jgcZ0GiHdxgokWY0GAA4PnFzrb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80535'),
  ('1118204069241394691', 'Island', 2022, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, 'Jang Yoon-mi', 'Kim Nam-gil, Lee Da-hee, Cha Eun-woo, Sung Joon, Hur Jung-hee, Goh Doo-shim, Oh Kwang-rok, Chung Su-bin', 'TV-14', 'Jeju Island is taken over by evil spirits. An exorcist, priest, and chaebol heiress are fated to fight against evil spirits attempting to end the world. “They are stirring at last.”', 'Jeju Island is taken over by evil spirits. An exorcist, priest, and chaebol heiress are fated to fight against evil spirits attempting to end the world. “They are stirring at last.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bpoDjjcj6vE7k9xH14wb13UMYqi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211747'),
  ('446923771610175196', 'Island at War', 2004, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Laurence Fox, Philip Glenister, Saskia Reeves, Clare Holman, James Wilby, Owen Teale, Julia Ford, Sam Heughan', null, 'Island at War is a British television series that tells the story of the German Occupation of the Channel Islands. It primarily focuses on three local families: the upper class Dorrs, the middle class Mahys and the working class Jonases, and four German officers. The fictional island of St. Gregory serves as a stand-in for the real-life islands Jersey and Guernsey, and the story is compiled from the events on both islands. Produced by Granada Television in Manchester, Island at War had an estimated budget of £9,000,000 and was filmed on location in the Isle of Man from August 2003 to October 2003. When the series was shown in the UK, it appeared in six 70-minute episodes.', 'Island at War is a British television series that tells the story of the German Occupation of the Channel Islands. It primarily focuses on three local families: the upper class Dorrs, the middle class Mahys and the working class Jonases, and four German officers. The fictional island of St. Gregory serves as a stand-in for the real-life islands Jersey and Guernsey, and the story is compiled from the events on both islands. Produced by Granada Television in Manchester, Island at War had an estimated budget of £9,000,000 and was filmed on location in the Isle of Man from August 2003 to October 2003. When the series was shown in the UK, it appeared in six 70-minute episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3oUF4FPo6R87bw9xOdKLSBBNgV6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:450'),
  ('854477475974990540', 'Island of the Sea Wolves', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Will Arnett', 'TV-PG', 'Explore wild, wondrous Vancouver Island, where the ocean nurtures all life, from bald eagles who go fishing to sea wolves who swim in frigid waters.', 'Explore wild, wondrous Vancouver Island, where the ocean nurtures all life, from bald eagles who go fishing to sea wolves who swim in frigid waters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/czorJe5tld7NUBwZubwxDZksxrL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211694'),
  ('859828558975086574', 'Islands', 2024, 'Drama, Family', null, null, 'Xu Fan, Ma Sichun, Liang Jing, Li Xiaoran, Song Chunli, Li Chengru, Liu Jun, Sun Qian', null, 'The vigorous head, Qiao Haiyun, ever set rules that every New Year all family members must go home. No one had broken rules all the time, until the most honest third-generation Li Yijin suddenly broke the tradition to go to her boyfriend’s home for the New Year, causing family contradiction. Qiao Haiyun has three daughters. The three generations of women in the Meng family were like a flock of birds. Although they watched each other from the distance, they supported each other and coexisted.', 'The vigorous head, Qiao Haiyun, ever set rules that every New Year all family members must go home. No one had broken rules all the time, until the most honest third-generation Li Yijin suddenly broke the tradition to go to her boyfriend’s home for the New Year, causing family contradiction. Qiao Haiyun has three daughters. The three generations of women in the Meng family were like a flock of birds. Although they watched each other from the distance, they supported each other and coexisted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5dnTsJhTGRtEKNWqzs1BpxVnZJ6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:245652'),
  ('792489653801443955', 'İşler Güçler', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Selçuk Aydemir', null, 'Ahmet Kural, Murat Cemcir, Sadi Celil Cengiz, Melike Emiroğlu, Yeliz Şar, Ceren Moray, Nazlı Tosunoğlu, Şinasi Yurtsever', null, 'İşler Güçler, is a Turkish comedy series which first aired on 28 June 2012 on Star TV and tells the story of 3 actors, with the motto, Modern Muzip Yalanlar. Ahmet Kural, Murat Cemcir and Sadi Celil Cengiz shares the leading roles. Although rumour had it that it was going to be over at the end of the summer, the board of Star TV made an explanation that they would go on issuing it in the 2012−13 publication season, due to the interest their fans had shown', 'İşler Güçler, is a Turkish comedy series which first aired on 28 June 2012 on Star TV and tells the story of 3 actors, with the motto, Modern Muzip Yalanlar. Ahmet Kural, Murat Cemcir and Sadi Celil Cengiz shares the leading roles. Although rumour had it that it was going to be over at the end of the summer, the board of Star TV made an explanation that they would go on issuing it in the 2012−13 publication season, due to the interest their fans had shown', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEi5NmfKiCPL3Yx4U6TLrys1GDZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:48162'),
  ('895553370934355620', 'Iss Pyaar Ko Kya Naam Doon?', 2011, 'Drama, Family, Soap', 'Aakash Pandey, ved raj, Hitesh Kewalya', null, 'Sanaya Irani, Barun Sobti, Dalljiet Kaur, Abhaas Mehta, Akshay Dogra, Deepali Pansare, Utkarsha Naik, Jayshree Talpade', null, 'Khushi and Arnav have diametrically opposite ideologies. If Khushi believes in means, Arnav believes only in ends. Khushi''s relationships are the most important to her, whereas Arnav believes all people come with a price and can be manipulated for one''s benefit.', 'Khushi and Arnav have diametrically opposite ideologies. If Khushi believes in means, Arnav believes only in ends. Khushi''s relationships are the most important to her, whereas Arnav believes all people come with a price and can be manipulated for one''s benefit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bAHnfeAz4yF3SpZdVSOVMUEjMSP.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:39390'),
  ('533328163323013221', 'Istanbul Encyclopedia', 2025, 'Drama', 'Selman Nacar', 'Selman Nacar', 'Helin Kandemir, Canan Ergüder, Kaan Mirac Sezen, Müjde Ar, Nezaket Erden, Tolga Tekin, Grégory Montel, Ecem Sena Bayır', null, 'A young student moves in with an estranged family friend in Istanbul, trading her humble hometown for a city that tests her identity — and convictions.', 'A young student moves in with an estranged family friend in Istanbul, trading her humble hometown for a city that tests her identity — and convictions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qWH4U6fTwMOK9tC3W9qBdBrP8hj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278004'),
  ('936725493065782998', 'Istanbullu Gelin', 2017, 'Drama, Family, Comedy', 'Gülseren Budayıcıoğlu', 'Deniz Akçay', 'Aslı Enver, Özcan Deniz, Salih Bademci, Dilara Aksüyek, İpek Bilgin, Fırat Tanış, Neslihan Yeldan, Tamer Levent', null, 'Faruk is the owner of a bus company and the leader of a powerful family in Bursa which is a metropol in Turkey. Faruk meets a violonist girl and falls in love with her. But the dominant mother of Faruk isn''t happy with her son''s relationship.', 'Faruk is the owner of a bus company and the leader of a powerful family in Bursa which is a metropol in Turkey. Faruk meets a violonist girl and falls in love with her. But the dominant mother of Faruk isn''t happy with her son''s relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/alVrRNxDGOlULYdXgnOpPrVP7KL.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:70798'),
