  ('244707252254126024', 'It Started With a Kiss', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Ariel Lin, Joe Cheng, Jiro Wang, Hsu Wei-ning, Aaron Yan, Bianca Bai, Cyndi Chao, Tang Tsung-sheng', null, 'A live-action television adaptation of the Japanese manga series Itazura na Kiss written by Kaoru Tada.', 'A live-action television adaptation of the Japanese manga series Itazura na Kiss written by Kaoru Tada.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hdYeaNSPE6Z3DgG8YUlRRh33fIz.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:15242'),
  ('236643785380224480', 'It Takes a Thief', 1968, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Roland Kibbee', null, 'Robert Wagner, Malachi Throne, Edward Binns, Fred Astaire', 'NR', 'Convicted cat burglar Alexander Mundy gets an offer he can''t refuse from the United States government: If he puts his formidable thieving skills to work for them, he''ll be released from prison. Alexander''s dad, Alister, sometimes comes out of retirement as a thief to help his son on special jobs.', 'Convicted cat burglar Alexander Mundy gets an offer he can''t refuse from the United States government: If he puts his formidable thieving skills to work for them, he''ll be released from prison. Alexander''s dad, Alister, sometimes comes out of retirement as a thief to help his son on special jobs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/17OV310dMUvJXN0YAgwtDUwYM5b.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:10496'),
  ('981566869022927202', 'It Was Always Me', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Alejandro Stoessel', null, 'Karol Sevilla, Pipe Bueno, Christian Tapppan, Juan David Penagos, Simón Savi, Melanie Dell’Olmo, Duban Prado, Alejandro Gutiérrez', 'TV-PG', 'When Lupe is 22 years old, her life suddenly changes after she learns that her father, a famous Colombian singer-songwriter, has died. Upon arriving in Colombia, Lupe meets Noah, a mysterious character who turns out to be her father''s assistant. Instead of returning to Mexico, Lupe decides to stay as she suspects that the musician''s death was not an accident. Together with Noah, she will embark on a musical adventure full of danger, mystery and romance, in the Caribbean region of Colombia.', 'When Lupe is 22 years old, her life suddenly changes after she learns that her father, a famous Colombian singer-songwriter, has died. Upon arriving in Colombia, Lupe meets Noah, a mysterious character who turns out to be her father''s assistant. Instead of returning to Mexico, Lupe decides to stay as she suspects that the musician''s death was not an accident. Together with Noah, she will embark on a musical adventure full of danger, mystery and romance, in the Caribbean region of Colombia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AchvCCDRTAkU7h1J0XRY8Cf0Qu7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:122053'),
  ('793957419800456632', 'IT: Welcome to Derry', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Andy Muschietti, Barbara Muschietti, Jason Fuchs', null, 'Taylour Paige, Jovan Adepo, Matilda Lawler, Amanda Christine, Clara Stack, Chris Chalk, James Remar, Stephen Rider', 'TV-MA', 'In 1962, amid a spate of unexplained disappearances of local children, a group of misfit friends begin to suspect a long-buried ancient evil lurking. As the kids set out to determine what''s really going on, a rising unease prompts several townspeople to work together to restore peace – all while a U.S. military operation seeks to exploit Derry for its own objectives.', 'In 1962, amid a spate of unexplained disappearances of local children, a group of misfit friends begin to suspect a long-buried ancient evil lurking. As the kids set out to determine what''s really going on, a rising unease prompts several townspeople to work together to restore peace – all while a U.S. military operation seeks to exploit Derry for its own objectives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nyy3BITeIjviv6PFIXtqvc8i6xi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:200875'),
  ('907695167689766583', 'It''s a Living', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Dick Clair, Jenna McMahon, Stu Silver', null, 'Barrie Youngfellow, Marian Mercer, Gail Edwards, Crystal Bernard, Sheryl Lee Ralph, Paul Kreppel, Richard Stahl', null, 'It''s a Living is an American sitcom set in a restaurant at the top of the Bonaventure Hotel in Los Angeles. The show aired on ABC from October 30, 1980 until June 11, 1982. After the series was cancelled, new episodes aired in first-run syndication from September 28, 1985 to April 8, 1989. The series was created by Stu Silver, Dick Clair and Jenna McMahon, and produced by Witt/Thomas Productions, later in association with Golden West Television and Lorimar-Telepictures.', 'It''s a Living is an American sitcom set in a restaurant at the top of the Bonaventure Hotel in Los Angeles. The show aired on ABC from October 30, 1980 until June 11, 1982. After the series was cancelled, new episodes aired in first-run syndication from September 28, 1985 to April 8, 1989. The series was created by Stu Silver, Dick Clair and Jenna McMahon, and produced by Witt/Thomas Productions, later in association with Golden West Television and Lorimar-Telepictures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uYQA0SJun2KIWE10HwSg5gF03nn.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:10122'),
  ('959126496381907063', 'It''s a Sin', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Russell T Davies', 'Russell T Davies', 'Olly Alexander, Omari Douglas, Callum Scott Howells, Lydia West, Nathaniel Curtis', 'TV-MA', 'A chronicle of five friends during a decade in which everything changed, including the rise of AIDS.', 'A chronicle of five friends during a decade in which everything changed, including the rise of AIDS.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUaNS4b5TIiP1SwpHCYCbUoGpHG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:116174'),
  ('1071845978498850047', 'It''s Always Sunny in Philadelphia', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Rob Mac', null, 'Charlie Day, Glenn Howerton, Rob Mac, Kaitlin Olson, Danny DeVito', 'TV-MA', 'Four egocentric friends run a neighborhood Irish pub in Philadelphia and try to find their way through the adult world of work and relationships. Unfortunately, their warped views and precarious judgments often lead them to trouble, creating a myriad of uncomfortable situations that usually only get worse before they get better.', 'Four egocentric friends run a neighborhood Irish pub in Philadelphia and try to find their way through the adult world of work and relationships. Unfortunately, their warped views and precarious judgments often lead them to trouble, creating a myriad of uncomfortable situations that usually only get worse before they get better.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0tMMK33JqmtpcWw0H41cEr9xQB.jpg', 17, 'tmdb:tv:2710'),
  ('1009906603616398761', 'It''s Bruno!', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Solvan Naim', 'Solvan Naim', 'Solvan Naim, Rob Morgan, Shakira Barrera, Donnell Rawlings, Jade Eshete, Johnnie Mae, Eden Marryshow, Omar Scroggins', null, 'An old-school Brooklyn native devotes his days to caring for his adorable dog, Bruno -- and making sure the neighbors show his pooch the proper respect.', 'An old-school Brooklyn native devotes his days to caring for his adorable dog, Bruno -- and making sure the neighbors show his pooch the proper respect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYHY9KtMh9i5w7GwKg8C4lHN689.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89490'),
  ('342224494637725853', 'It''s Florida, Man.', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mark Herwick, Jeff Tomsic', null, 'Stephen Root', 'TV-MA', 'This irreverent late-night comedy series brings to life unbelievable, ripped-from-the-headlines tales of the Sunshine State. Featuring interviews with everyday Floridians and playful recreations starring a rotating cast of actors and comedians, this hilarious and outrageous series sheds light on the viral, wacky, and weird.', 'This irreverent late-night comedy series brings to life unbelievable, ripped-from-the-headlines tales of the Sunshine State. Featuring interviews with everyday Floridians and playful recreations starring a rotating cast of actors and comedians, this hilarious and outrageous series sheds light on the viral, wacky, and weird.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yrGQwoY9XUglAlCDzsIlr3ws4pM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:273801'),
  ('945292424429803679', 'It''s Garry Shandling''s Show', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Garry Shandling, Alan Zweibel', null, 'Garry Shandling, Molly Cheek, Jessica Harper, Scott Nemes, Michael Tucci', null, 'Garry Shandling stars as himself, a neurotic, sardonic stand-up comedian who just happens to be aware he is a sitcom character. Garry spends just as much time interacting with the studio audience as he does the regular cast members, performing monologues and show-closing summations of the episode''s events. However, everyone knows they''re on TV, not just Garry; and the audience (itself a character) is often involved in the storyline.', 'Garry Shandling stars as himself, a neurotic, sardonic stand-up comedian who just happens to be aware he is a sitcom character. Garry spends just as much time interacting with the studio audience as he does the regular cast members, performing monologues and show-closing summations of the episode''s events. However, everyone knows they''re on TV, not just Garry; and the audience (itself a character) is often involved in the storyline.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ySzC5soonzoa5m7XthfUIi1OMc.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:9841'),
  ('1143516998143644257', 'It''s Okay to Not Be Okay', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Park Shin-woo, Jo Yong', null, 'Kim Soo-hyun, Seo Yea-ji, Park Gyu-young, Oh Jung-se, Kim Ju-hun, Kim Chang-wan, Jang Young-nam, Kim Mi-kyeong', 'TV-MA', 'Desperate to escape from his emotional baggage and the heavy responsibility he’s had all his life, a psychiatric ward worker begins to heal with help from the unexpected – a woman who writes fairy tales but doesn’t believe in them.', 'Desperate to escape from his emotional baggage and the heavy responsibility he’s had all his life, a psychiatric ward worker begins to heal with help from the unexpected – a woman who writes fairy tales but doesn’t believe in them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8XSJfLeImX8NszDUFnK1lbseCi8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96462'),
