  ('848236433560894436', 'Iwa Kakeru! Sport Climbing Girls', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Sumire Uesaka, Yui Ishikawa, Aina Suzuki, Miyu Tomita, Mikako Komatsu, Sachi Kokuryu, Chihiro Ueda, Daria Midou', 'TV-14', 'Sport climbing is a sport that makes use of both the body and the brain to climb walls. Kasahara Konomi, a master at puzzles, just happens to discover her school’s climbing wall, and it looks almost like a colorful sort of puzzle in her eyes. This fateful encounter brings big changes to Konomi’s life! With her teammates in the Hanamiya Girls’ High School Climbing Club, Konomi races for the top in this passionate climbing story!', 'Sport climbing is a sport that makes use of both the body and the brain to climb walls. Kasahara Konomi, a master at puzzles, just happens to discover her school’s climbing wall, and it looks almost like a colorful sort of puzzle in her eyes. This fateful encounter brings big changes to Konomi’s life! With her teammates in the Hanamiya Girls’ High School Climbing Club, Konomi races for the top in this passionate climbing story!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/afeKKe8KPYDg7DyVtbfqSzh63NY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:102518'),
  ('461529240755278898', 'Iwájú', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family', null, null, 'Simisola Gbadamosi, Dayo Okeniyi, Femi Branch, Siji Soetan, Weruche Opia', 'TV-PG', 'Two friends in a futuristic Nigeria discover secrets and dangers hidden in their different worlds.', 'Two friends in a futuristic Nigeria discover secrets and dangers hidden in their different worlds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pu1J9Fn8gQW0JvTVB8CheQ0Tw3p.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114481'),
  ('249428433946999934', 'Ixion Saga: Dimension Transfer', 2012, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Animation', null, null, 'Takuya Eguchi, Shiori Mikami, Jun Fukuyama, Kazuya Nakai, Ryoko Shintani, Hiroshi Kamiya, Yuki Kaji, Mitsuki Saiga', null, 'Hokaze Kon is an otherwise normal boy who, one day, receives an inter-dimensional summons to the world of Mirror. He appears just in time to save the life of Princess Ecarlate, whose enemies are trying to prevent her political marriage. Kon, who knows nothing about Mirror nor the way home, attaches himself to Ecarlate''s entourage.', 'Hokaze Kon is an otherwise normal boy who, one day, receives an inter-dimensional summons to the world of Mirror. He appears just in time to save the life of Princess Ecarlate, whose enemies are trying to prevent her political marriage. Kon, who knows nothing about Mirror nor the way home, attaches himself to Ecarlate''s entourage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bsFlrXSTdgJ8IFxqUxTM3G4PIZV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45822'),
  ('529098710542074169', 'Iyanu', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Roye Okupe, Brandon Easton', null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Set in the magical kingdom of Yorubaland, follow teenage orphan girl, Iyanu, a heroine who must uncover the mystery behind her newfound powers to save her people from an ancient curse threatening to destroy humanity.', 'Set in the magical kingdom of Yorubaland, follow teenage orphan girl, Iyanu, a heroine who must uncover the mystery behind her newfound powers to save her people from an ancient curse threatening to destroy humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tiiEuCEaxE5FfkB3Dt42BWhodak.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:205796'),
  ('165433436064328153', 'Izetta: The Last Witch', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Himika Akaneya, Saori Hayami, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Kana Hanazawa, Junichi Suwabe, Aya Uchida, Daisuke Hirakawa, Koji Yusa', null, 'If I am promised to the princess, then I will fight for her sake. In 1939 C.E., the imperialist nation of Germania invaded a neighboring country. All at once, that war spread throughout Europe, and the era was dragged into a spiral of a great war. Then, in 1940, Germania''s attack turned towards the Principality of Eylstadt, a small Alps country abundant with beautiful water and greenery.', 'If I am promised to the princess, then I will fight for her sake. In 1939 C.E., the imperialist nation of Germania invaded a neighboring country. All at once, that war spread throughout Europe, and the era was dragged into a spiral of a great war. Then, in 1940, Germania''s attack turned towards the Principality of Eylstadt, a small Alps country abundant with beautiful water and greenery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odwgkywwzbl9fC0moPCbnvTw6iz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68080'),
  ('825225930249012464', 'iZombie', 2015, 'Drama, Crime, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Diane Ruggiero, Rob Thomas', null, 'Rose McIver, David Anders, Robert Buckley, Malcolm Goodwin, Rahul Kohli, Aly Michalka, Bryce Hodgson', 'TV-14', 'A medical student who becomes a zombie joins a Coroner''s Office in order to gain access to the brains she must reluctantly eat so that she can maintain her humanity. But every brain she eats, she also inherits their memories and must now solve their deaths with help from the Medical examiner and a police detective.', 'A medical student who becomes a zombie joins a Coroner''s Office in order to gain access to the brains she must reluctantly eat so that she can maintain her humanity. But every brain she eats, she also inherits their memories and must now solve their deaths with help from the Medical examiner and a police detective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q4nqNwAhzVR7JuYctrWJvUWz3xR.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:60866'),
