  ('692546419648953127', 'Ja''mie: Private School Girl', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Chris Lilley', null, 'Chris Lilley, Georgia Treu, Georgia Treu, Phoebe Roberts', 'TV-14', 'Ja''mie King, the self-promoting "queen bee" of Summer Heights High, returns from an exchange semester at that public school for her last three months at Hillford Girls Grammar, where she''s the unchallenged diva among the school''s most popular girls, as well as the school captain. Clothes, cars, boys, parties ... Ja''mie has it all, and her overriding goal is to win the Hillford Medal', 'Ja''mie King, the self-promoting "queen bee" of Summer Heights High, returns from an exchange semester at that public school for her last three months at Hillford Girls Grammar, where she''s the unchallenged diva among the school''s most popular girls, as well as the school captain. Clothes, cars, boys, parties ... Ja''mie has it all, and her overriding goal is to win the Hillford Medal', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNs19AeshY70d5cTN4xUedrAnAq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:58557'),
  ('234272716274997692', 'Jabberjaw', 1976, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Frank Welker, Patricia Parris, Barry Gordon, Julie McWhirter, Tommy Cook', 'TV-G', 'Jabberjaw (a 15-foot air-breathing great white shark) and The Neptunes (a rock group made up of four teenagers — Biff, Shelly, Bubbles and Clamhead) travel to various underwater cities where they encounter and deal with assorted megalomaniacs and supervillains who want to conquer the undersea world.', 'Jabberjaw (a 15-foot air-breathing great white shark) and The Neptunes (a rock group made up of four teenagers — Biff, Shelly, Bubbles and Clamhead) travel to various underwater cities where they encounter and deal with assorted megalomaniacs and supervillains who want to conquer the undersea world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67fu3uo0ZYeKuYlPs12WCte78g6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2936'),
  ('506375188075096974', 'Jack & Bobby', 2004, 'Drama', 'Brad Meltzer, Vanessa Taylor, Greg Berlanti', null, 'Christine Lahti, Matt Long, Logan Lerman, Jessica Paré, Edwin Hodge, John Slattery, Bradley Cooper, Keri Lynn Pratt', null, 'If "greatness is thrust upon us," as Winston Churchill once said, then it stands to reason that those who are destined for greatness are rarely aware of it. Take Jack and Bobby McCallister for example: two bright young brothers growing up under the watchful eye of their eccentric single mother Grace McCallister. Grace''s personality is a force of nature destined to shape both of these young men''s lives and secure one a place in the history books - as President of the United States.', 'If "greatness is thrust upon us," as Winston Churchill once said, then it stands to reason that those who are destined for greatness are rarely aware of it. Take Jack and Bobby McCallister for example: two bright young brothers growing up under the watchful eye of their eccentric single mother Grace McCallister. Grace''s personality is a force of nature destined to shape both of these young men''s lives and secure one a place in the history books - as President of the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uU0hUMElMHOPOOqArG4TTUYxs0n.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1859'),
  ('1109327859138216513', 'Jack & Jill', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Randi Mayem Singer', null, 'Ivan Sergei, Amanda Peet, Justin Kirk, Sarah Paulson, Jaime Pressly, Simon Rex', null, 'A lighthearted romantic comedy about post-collegiate life, love and career in New York City.', 'A lighthearted romantic comedy about post-collegiate life, love and career in New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oFOyqoy8BP4OByKJGxe9mG7anlB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1085'),
  ('847792223042861153', 'Jack & Joker: U Steal My Heart!', 2024, 'Drama, Crime, Action & Adventure', 'Anan Wong, Wanarat Ratsameerat', null, 'Anan Wong, Wanarat Ratsameerat, Ratchapat Worrasarn, Nadol Lamprasert, Siwat Jumlongkul, Nathanan Akkharakitwattanakul, Sarunyoo Prachakit, Netipat Luksanavisis', null, 'To pay off his family''s debt, a gifted taekwondo prodigy becomes the unwitting accomplice of a charismatic, legendary thief.', 'To pay off his family''s debt, a gifted taekwondo prodigy becomes the unwitting accomplice of a charismatic, legendary thief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/X3bmROVCGZUI2HFCwOWySS6ji1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:240692'),
  ('195417591949986284', 'Jack and the Beanstalk: The Real Story', 2001, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Brian Henson', null, 'Matthew Modine, Vanessa Redgrave, Mia Sara, Daryl Hannah, Jon Voight, Richard Attenborough, Bill Barretta, Honor Blackman', 'TV-PG', 'Wealthy developer Jack Robinson is stunned when a gigantic human skeleton is discovered on his building site. According to a mysterious woman, it is part of a curse that has dogged his family for years. To lift the jinx placed upon him, Jack will need to visit the land in the sky - by climbing up a very tall beanstalk.', 'Wealthy developer Jack Robinson is stunned when a gigantic human skeleton is discovered on his building site. According to a mysterious woman, it is part of a curse that has dogged his family for years. To lift the jinx placed upon him, Jack will need to visit the land in the sky - by climbing up a very tall beanstalk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mc6QDvw7hExEILHJ1zCjZ3MkUya.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16433'),
  ('512999963692385890', 'Jack Holborn', 1982, 'Family, Action & Adventure', 'Leon Garfield', null, 'Patrick Bach, Matthias Habich, Andreas Mannkopff, Monte Markham, Terence Cooper, David Weatherley', null, 'Jack Holborn was a 1982 ZDF Adventure TV mini-series. The story is based on the book by Leon Garfield. It was shown in the United Kingdom by ITV.', 'Jack Holborn was a 1982 ZDF Adventure TV mini-series. The story is based on the book by Leon Garfield. It was shown in the United Kingdom by ITV.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s02EHKJuaQJY8redsfjiT9iHo7z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6902'),
  ('986693252792089982', 'Jack Irish', 2016, 'Drama, Crime', 'Andrew Knight, Andrew Anastasios, Matt Cameron', null, 'Guy Pearce, Roy Billing, Aaron Pedersen, Damien Richardson, Damien Garvey, Kate Gorman, Ellen Grimshaw, Geneviève Picot', 'NR', 'Jack Irish is a man getting his life back together again. A former criminal lawyer whose world imploded, he now spends his days as a part-time investigator, debt collector, apprentice cabinet maker, punter and sometime lover – the complete man really. An expert in finding those who don’t want to be found – dead or alive, Jack helps out his mates while avoiding the past. That is until the past finds him.', 'Jack Irish is a man getting his life back together again. A former criminal lawyer whose world imploded, he now spends his days as a part-time investigator, debt collector, apprentice cabinet maker, punter and sometime lover – the complete man really. An expert in finding those who don’t want to be found – dead or alive, Jack helps out his mates while avoiding the past. That is until the past finds him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9f66kq0vLHztRL44FcGCqyaqUJo.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:58057'),
  ('123803079342296631', 'Jack o'' Frost', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Kyoya Honda, Kosuke Suzuki, Shoot Mori, Kilala Inori, Leo Matsumoto', null, 'With their tumultuous relationship wiped from his ex-boyfriend''s memory after an accident, Fumiya capitalizes on Okusawa''s amnesia to start anew.', 'With their tumultuous relationship wiped from his ex-boyfriend''s memory after an accident, Fumiya capitalizes on Okusawa''s amnesia to start anew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u97z2yOuCn13nL88jJPOGU2vrzF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:219586'),
  ('1058202249219353315', 'Jack of All Trades', 2000, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Bruce Campbell, Angela Marie Dotchin, Stuart Devenie, Stephen Papps', null, 'American spy Jack Stiles teams with British agent Emilia Rothschild to thwart Napoleon''s advances in the East Indies.', 'American spy Jack Stiles teams with British agent Emilia Rothschild to thwart Napoleon''s advances in the East Indies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVzAKWY9qqfukr7zhTZ0cWfKt9g.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:4162'),
  ('993079723829076135', 'Jack Taylor', 2010, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Sighle Ni Chonail, Midie Corcoran, Iain Glen, Killian Scott, Tara Breathnach, Paraic Breathnach, Siobhán O''Kelly', 'TV-MA', 'Jack Taylor is an Irish television drama based on a series of novels by Ken Bruen. Set in Galway, the series stars Iain Glen in the eponymous role of Jack Taylor, a former officer with the Garda Síochána who becomes a "finder" after leaving the service. Taylor is a man who goes looking for clues where others have not bothered to. He also knows the streets of his hometown like the back of his hand.', 'Jack Taylor is an Irish television drama based on a series of novels by Ken Bruen. Set in Galway, the series stars Iain Glen in the eponymous role of Jack Taylor, a former officer with the Garda Síochána who becomes a "finder" after leaving the service. Taylor is a man who goes looking for clues where others have not bothered to. He also knows the streets of his hometown like the back of his hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slQ1Ub79XQwlyZeEej4LH8COWGN.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:46705'),
  ('26838714429079336', 'Jack the Ripper', 1988, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Derek Marlowe, David Wickes', null, 'Michael Caine, Jane Seymour, Lewis Collins, Armand Assante, Lysette Anthony, Michael Gothard, T. P. McKenna, Richard Morant', 'NR', 'Jack the Ripper is a 1988 two-part television film/miniseries portraying a fictionalized account of the hunt for Jack the Ripper, the unidentified serial killer responsible for the Whitechapel murders of 1888. The series coincided with the 100th anniversary of the murders.', 'Jack the Ripper is a 1988 two-part television film/miniseries portraying a fictionalized account of the hunt for Jack the Ripper, the unidentified serial killer responsible for the Whitechapel murders of 1888. The series coincided with the 100th anniversary of the murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ltuc0ebhS2zl22R2YQdinSlFjW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:47510'),
  ('108349795959267922', 'Jack Whitehall: Travels with My Father', 2017, 'Comedy, Reality', 'Jack Whitehall', null, 'Jack Whitehall, Michael Whitehall, Hilary Whitehall', 'TV-MA', 'Comic Jack Whitehall invites his stodgy, unadventurous father to travel with him to odd locations and events in an attempt to strengthen their bond.', 'Comic Jack Whitehall invites his stodgy, unadventurous father to travel with him to odd locations and events in an attempt to strengthen their bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4YmLWIECW3OE7NiP9uwUK35i2uH.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:74100'),
  ('518427467123606779', 'Jack-of-All-Trades, Party of None', 2026, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Takeo Otsuka, Hina Tachibana, Saori Onishi, You Taichi, Manaka Iwami, Yoshiki Nakajima', 'TV-14', 'Betrayed by his childhood friend and cast out of the Hero Party, Orhun Dura—once their loyal Enchanter—is branded by his former comrades as “a jack-of-all-trades but a master of none.” Alone, he sets out to forge a new path as a solo adventurer. His journey sparks explosive battles, deadly rivals, and unexpected allies—and he’ll rise to shatter every expectation. The ultimate solo comeback begins!', 'Betrayed by his childhood friend and cast out of the Hero Party, Orhun Dura—once their loyal Enchanter—is branded by his former comrades as “a jack-of-all-trades but a master of none.” Alone, he sets out to forge a new path as a solo adventurer. His journey sparks explosive battles, deadly rivals, and unexpected allies—and he’ll rise to shatter every expectation. The ultimate solo comeback begins!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qRvICaz6LJXz96DaYcpTjQf6QN8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:285166'),
  ('973336647408707245', 'Jackass', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Jeff Tremaine, Johnny Knoxville, Spike Jonze', null, 'Johnny Knoxville, Bam Margera, Chris Pontius, Dave England, Steve-O, Ehren McGhehey, Jason ''Wee Man'' Acuña, Ryan Dunn', 'TV-MA', 'Join sadomasochistic superheroes Johnny Knoxville, Bam Margera, and the rest of the Jackass crew as they terrorize your TV screens and everyone that gets in their way (especially themselves) with their own sick and twisted interpretation of physical entertainment. Their brand of pranks, goofball antics, and unabashed brutal comedy are sure to bring new meaning to the phrase "Don''t Try This At Home!"', 'Join sadomasochistic superheroes Johnny Knoxville, Bam Margera, and the rest of the Jackass crew as they terrorize your TV screens and everyone that gets in their way (especially themselves) with their own sick and twisted interpretation of physical entertainment. Their brand of pranks, goofball antics, and unabashed brutal comedy are sure to bring new meaning to the phrase "Don''t Try This At Home!"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8O8ElquAya9SugLNH6N5TWNE4h.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1795'),
  ('460678446159178401', 'Jackie Chan Adventures', 2000, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'John Rogers', null, 'Jackie Chan, James Sie, Stacie Chan, Sab Shimono, Noah Nelson', 'TV-Y7', 'Jackie Chan teams up with his 11-year-old fictive-niece, Jade, traveling the globe to locate a dozen magical talismans before the sinister Dark Hand. Helping Jackie and Jade is Uncle, a cantankerous but wise antiquities expert.', 'Jackie Chan teams up with his 11-year-old fictive-niece, Jade, traveling the globe to locate a dozen magical talismans before the sinister Dark Hand. Helping Jackie and Jade is Uncle, a cantankerous but wise antiquities expert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/by2GTFpd2BQ5uJxWPlfcmfrNrfB.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:240'),
  ('434504167847406340', 'Jackpot', 2016, 'Drama', null, null, 'Jang Keun-suk, Yeo Jin-goo, Lim Ji-yeon, Jun Kwang-ryul, Choi Min-soo, Yoon Jin-seo, Hyun Woo, Yoon Ji-hye', null, 'Dae-Gil and King Yeongjo enter a match. Dae-Gil bets his life and King Yeongjo bets the entire Kingdom of Joseon on the outcome. Dae-Gil is the best gambler in the Joseon era. He holds deep resentment inside, but is also cool on the exterior. King Yeongjo is a man who never lower his head without a convincing reason. Meanwhile, Dam-Seo exists solely to take revenge upon king.', 'Dae-Gil and King Yeongjo enter a match. Dae-Gil bets his life and King Yeongjo bets the entire Kingdom of Joseon on the outcome. Dae-Gil is the best gambler in the Joseon era. He holds deep resentment inside, but is also cool on the exterior. King Yeongjo is a man who never lower his head without a convincing reason. Meanwhile, Dam-Seo exists solely to take revenge upon king.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifXG7WQpYfh0eJ07zxR66NAMxUc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65860'),
  ('843873584110246917', 'Jacob Two-Two', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Family', 'Mordecai Richler', 'Gary Wheeler', 'Bret Hart, Janet-Laine Green, Fiona Reid, Harvey Atkin, Kaitlin Howell, Marc McMulkin, Billy Rosemberg, James Rankin', 'TV-G', 'Jacob Two-Two is a Canadian animated TV series based on a trilogy of books written by Mordecai Richler that first aired on Canadian children''s channel YTV and aired on the French Canadian VRAK.TV as Jacob Jacob, in Spanish on Telemundo as Jacobo Dos Dos and in Portuguese on Canal Panda from Portugal as Jacob Dois Dois It also aired on ZigZap in the Poland and on Canal Futura from Brazil as ''Jacó Dois Dois''. It was produced by Nelvana; before being put on hiatus in 2005, it has 61 episodes. In the United States, the show aired on qubo, a 24 hour children''s television channel in 2006. It also aired on Jetix UK from April 14, 2007 and on CITV in the UK from Spring 2006. The series is set in the Canadian city of Montreal and follows Jacob Two-Two and his friends on their wild adventures, most of which are one-shots that are resolved in a single episode.', 'Jacob Two-Two is a Canadian animated TV series based on a trilogy of books written by Mordecai Richler that first aired on Canadian children''s channel YTV and aired on the French Canadian VRAK.TV as Jacob Jacob, in Spanish on Telemundo as Jacobo Dos Dos and in Portuguese on Canal Panda from Portugal as Jacob Dois Dois It also aired on ZigZap in the Poland and on Canal Futura from Brazil as ''Jacó Dois Dois''. It was produced by Nelvana; before being put on hiatus in 2005, it has 61 episodes. In the United States, the show aired on qubo, a 24 hour children''s television channel in 2006. It also aired on Jetix UK from April 14, 2007 and on CITV in the UK from Spring 2006. The series is set in the Canadian city of Montreal and follows Jacob Two-Two and his friends on their wild adventures, most of which are one-shots that are resolved in a single episode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sh0RNDedpE4sgo5JEromOPlF2ax.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:13350'),
  ('110958741227841172', 'Jade Dynasty', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Xiao Ding', null, 'Jiang Bian, Zeng Rong, Duan Yixuan, Bai Xuecen, Wang Jinger, Ba He, Zhang Siwangzhi, Jinwen Chen', null, 'Zhang Xiaofan, who turned into an orphan overnight, becomes a disciple of the Qingyun Sect. After five years of training, he performs well in the Seven Peak Martial Arts Competition. He''s sent to the Kongsang Mountain to defeat the evil. During the journey, he and his senior, Lu Xueqi, met with an accident, and got to know and save the lady of the cult, Bi Yao. At the same time, new danger is ahead of him.', 'Zhang Xiaofan, who turned into an orphan overnight, becomes a disciple of the Qingyun Sect. After five years of training, he performs well in the Seven Peak Martial Arts Competition. He''s sent to the Kongsang Mountain to defeat the evil. During the journey, he and his senior, Lu Xueqi, met with an accident, and got to know and save the lady of the cult, Bi Yao. At the same time, new danger is ahead of him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOy0PskfCQyWwsQVdHyM2PoN9H4.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:206484'),
  ('1107254018232753265', 'Jae Joong and Friends', 2023, 'Comedy, Reality, Talk', null, null, 'HERO Jaejoong', null, 'Kim Jaejoong hosts numerous stars who wants to be friends with him. With the goal of making 100 friends through the show, he will cook for his guests, get to know them, and hopefully forge new friendships.', 'Kim Jaejoong hosts numerous stars who wants to be friends with him. With the goal of making 100 friends through the show, he will cook for his guests, get to know them, and hopefully forge new friendships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xfmWa1fInPYYMoK6vvLIy4B4ens.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:249745'),
  ('454477243815994194', 'JAG', 1995, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Donald P. Bellisario', null, 'David James Elliott, Catherine Bell, Patrick Labyorteaux', 'TV-PG', 'Harmon "Harm" Rabb Jr. is a former pilot turned lawyer working for the military''s JAG (Judge Advocate General) division, the elite legal wing of officers that prosecutes and defends those accused of military-related crimes. He works closely with Lt. Col. Sarah Mackenzie, and together they do what needs to be done to find the truth.', 'Harmon "Harm" Rabb Jr. is a former pilot turned lawyer working for the military''s JAG (Judge Advocate General) division, the elite legal wing of officers that prosecutes and defends those accused of military-related crimes. He works closely with Lt. Col. Sarah Mackenzie, and together they do what needs to be done to find the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zPyHpkJZ5O08lbgrQQIROXtb3xz.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:4376'),
  ('472688681774952304', 'Jagad - kändisar på rymmen', 2026, 'Reality', null, null, 'Robert Aschberg', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1kY2D4yAMNmSg1jlBbVNMZuyIaJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:315616'),
  ('665246877209795918', 'Jaguar', 2021, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Gema R. Neira, Ramón Campos, Carlos Sedes', 'Gema R. Neira, David Orea', 'Blanca Suárez, Iván Marcos, Francesc Garrido, Adrián Lastra, Óscar Casas, Stefan Weinert', 'TV-MA', 'In 1960s Spain, a Holocaust survivor joins a group of agents seeking justice against the hundreds of Nazis who fled to the nation to hide after WWII.', 'In 1960s Spain, a Holocaust survivor joins a group of agents seeking justice against the hundreds of Nazis who fled to the nation to hide after WWII.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10tPBGrg1tM0Gck4db6NPwT6NfF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127425'),
  ('384559796659370406', 'Jahuta', 2025, 'Drama, Soap, Mystery, Crime', null, null, 'Dusheni Miurangi Silva, Akhila Dhanuddhara, Chathuranga Kodithuwakku, Dinithi Walgamage, Sampath Jayaweera', null, 'Jahuta is a gripping Sri Lankan drama series that explores the intricate layers of human relationships, psychological struggles, and the unpredictable nature of modern life. The story centers around Samadhi, a young woman navigating intense emotional pressure and the complexities of a challenging romantic relationship. As lives intertwine and secrets surface, the series delves into themes of loyalty, betrayal, and the fragile line between love and indifference. Directed by the renowned Jayaprakash Sivagurunathan, the drama captures the raw essence of societal changes in Sri Lanka with a blend of suspense and deep emotional resonance.', 'Jahuta is a gripping Sri Lankan drama series that explores the intricate layers of human relationships, psychological struggles, and the unpredictable nature of modern life. The story centers around Samadhi, a young woman navigating intense emotional pressure and the complexities of a challenging romantic relationship. As lives intertwine and secrets surface, the series delves into themes of loyalty, betrayal, and the fragile line between love and indifference. Directed by the renowned Jayaprakash Sivagurunathan, the drama captures the raw essence of societal changes in Sri Lanka with a blend of suspense and deep emotional resonance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNidmSU5PbwTv714LSRAu38KgLF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:316401'),
  ('879911944757675173', 'Jail', null, 'Documentary', 'John Langley', null, null, 'TV-14', 'Shot on location in cities across the US, Jail follows prison inmates from their initial booking through their first moments behind bars. Each episode captures the harsh and sometimes humorous reality of what happens to criminals after they''re caught.', 'Shot on location in cities across the US, Jail follows prison inmates from their initial booking through their first moments behind bars. Each episode captures the harsh and sometimes humorous reality of what happens to criminals after they''re caught.', null, 6, 'tmdb:tv:12775'),
  ('216409468508766330', 'Jailbirds', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'At the Sacramento County Jail, incarcerated women fight the power and one another as they try to make the best of life -- and love -- on the inside.', 'At the Sacramento County Jail, incarcerated women fight the power and one another as they try to make the best of life -- and love -- on the inside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cymY9UQs6PoAhHQ5sLYIV9JzSz0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89295'),
  ('318723730012164152', 'Jake 2.0', 2003, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Silvio Horta', null, 'Christopher Gorham, Philip Anthony-Rodriguez, Judith Scott, Keegan Connor Tracy', null, 'Jake 2.0 is an American science fiction television series originally broadcast on UPN in 2003. The series was canceled on January 14, 2004 due to low ratings, leaving four episodes unaired in the United States. In the United Kingdom, all the episodes aired on Sky1. The series later aired in syndication on HDNet and the Sci Fi Channel. The series revolves around a computer expert, Jake Foley, who works for the U.S. government''s National Security Agency and was accidentally infected by nanobots which give him superhuman powers. He is able to control technology with his brain, making him "the ultimate human upgrade" according to the show''s introduction.', 'Jake 2.0 is an American science fiction television series originally broadcast on UPN in 2003. The series was canceled on January 14, 2004 due to low ratings, leaving four episodes unaired in the United States. In the United Kingdom, all the episodes aired on Sky1. The series later aired in syndication on HDNet and the Sci Fi Channel. The series revolves around a computer expert, Jake Foley, who works for the U.S. government''s National Security Agency and was accidentally infected by nanobots which give him superhuman powers. He is able to control technology with his brain, making him "the ultimate human upgrade" according to the show''s introduction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5v1ztY9py8pPgeMPYn606zsgjRI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4569'),
  ('1096526279738940041', 'Jake and Amir', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Jake Hurwitz, Amir Blumenfeld', null, 'Jake Hurwitz, Amir Blumenfeld', null, 'Jake and Amir is an American comedy web series created by and starring CollegeHumor writers Jake Hurwitz and Amir Blumenfeld, and set in New York City. The two play humorous versions of themselves: Jake is usually depicted as a sensible "regular guy", and Amir as his annoying, obsessive and odd co-worker, the pair acting as a comic double act.', 'Jake and Amir is an American comedy web series created by and starring CollegeHumor writers Jake Hurwitz and Amir Blumenfeld, and set in New York City. The two play humorous versions of themselves: Jake is usually depicted as a sensible "regular guy", and Amir as his annoying, obsessive and odd co-worker, the pair acting as a comic double act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5RsRMSMlw9rOQkYzju5gqAaWiMy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5539'),
  ('35981893065779808', 'Jake and the Fatman', 1987, 'Drama, Crime, Action & Adventure', 'Dean Hargrove, David Angell, Joel Steiger', null, 'William Conrad, Joe Penny, Alan Campbell', 'NR', 'Jake and the Fatman is a television crime drama starring William Conrad as prosecutor J. L. "Fatman" McCabe and Joe Penny as investigator Jake Styles. The series ran on CBS for five seasons from 1987 to 1992. Diagnosis: Murder was a spin-off of this series.', 'Jake and the Fatman is a television crime drama starring William Conrad as prosecutor J. L. "Fatman" McCabe and Joe Penny as investigator Jake Styles. The series ran on CBS for five seasons from 1987 to 1992. Diagnosis: Murder was a spin-off of this series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3WBkepiTwgemGDZadyJTV5SmS4l.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:4521'),
  ('729922185115150859', 'Jake and the Never Land Pirates', 2011, 'Family, Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'David Arquette, Jeff Bennett, Corey Burton, Gabe Eggerling, Megan Richie, Jadon Sand', 'TV-Y', 'A crew of kid pirates - leader Jake and pals Izzy and Cubby - and their Never Land adventures as they work to outwit two infamous characters, the one and only Captain Hook and Smee.', 'A crew of kid pirates - leader Jake and pals Izzy and Cubby - and their Never Land adventures as they work to outwit two infamous characters, the one and only Captain Hook and Smee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uet64gptwR7iDGc0laIRmYNtNH0.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:34891'),
  ('535145781627365475', 'Jakers! The Adventures of Piggley Winks', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', null, null, 'Maile Flanagan, Russi Taylor, Tara Strong, Mel Brooks, Peadar Lamb, Nika Futterman, Melissa Disney, Charlie Adler', 'TV-Y', 'The adventures of Piggley, a spunky eight-year-old pig, and his friends Dannan the Duck and Ferny the Bull on Raloo Farm in Ireland.', 'The adventures of Piggley, a spunky eight-year-old pig, and his friends Dannan the Duck and Ferny the Bull on Raloo Farm in Ireland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJmdj1yZ5MY3repUubHK39cqUbt.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:13605'),
  ('796176176019204841', 'Jam', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Chris Morris', null, 'Chris Morris, Kevin Eldon, Mark Heap, David Cann, Julia Davis, Amelia Bullmore', null, 'Adapted from Blue Jam, a late night radio show, Jam consists of six shows featuring dark humour and unsettling sketches unfolding over an ambient soundtrack. From the mind of Chris Morris.', 'Adapted from Blue Jam, a late night radio show, Jam consists of six shows featuring dark humour and unsettling sketches unfolding over an ambient soundtrack. From the mind of Chris Morris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/poMt4TM7YOcbQavRQgPt5UAtAhO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2197'),
  ('1027583574916766728', 'Jam and Jerusalem', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Jennifer Saunders, Dawn French', 'Jennifer Saunders, Abigail Wilson', 'Jennifer Saunders, Dawn French, Maggie Steed, Sue Johnston, Sally Phillips', 'TV-14', 'The Women''s Guild is an organisation in the small town of Clatterford St. Mary that aims to promote truth, justice, tolerance and fellowship. Or maybe it''s just an excuse for good, old-fashioned gossip. Regardless, meetings feature discussions and visiting speakers. The Guild is the center of life in Clatterford, which has a good cross-section of people, local shops and a late-night convenience store.', 'The Women''s Guild is an organisation in the small town of Clatterford St. Mary that aims to promote truth, justice, tolerance and fellowship. Or maybe it''s just an excuse for good, old-fashioned gossip. Regardless, meetings feature discussions and visiting speakers. The Guild is the center of life in Clatterford, which has a good cross-section of people, local shops and a late-night convenience store.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5Uzx0EOAYU4NczJuTRBml66FUg.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:621'),
  ('981454604684691614', 'Jamai Raja', 2014, 'Drama, Soap', 'Niraj Kumar Mishra', null, 'Ravi Dubey, Nia Sharma, Achint Kaur', null, 'Siddharth, a hotelier, takes up the responsibility of repairing the relationship between his independent wife, Roshni, and his enterprising mother-in-law, Durga Devi.', 'Siddharth, a hotelier, takes up the responsibility of repairing the relationship between his independent wife, Roshni, and his enterprising mother-in-law, Durga Devi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7TDfSot51AFRK8aFs2kO3snM4um.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100780'),
  ('174761858903452173', 'Jamaica Inn', 2014, 'Drama', 'Philippa Lowthorpe', 'Emma Frost', 'Jessica Brown Findlay, Matthew McNulty, Sean Harris, Joanne Whalley, Ben Daniels, Shirley Henderson', 'NR', 'Set in 1820 against the forbidding backdrop of windswept Cornish moors, the story follows the journey of young and spirited Mary who is forced to live with her Aunt Patience after the death of her mother. Mary arrives at the isolated Jamaica Inn to discover her Aunt is a shell of the carefree woman she remembers from her childhood, and instead finds a drudge who is firmly under the spell of her domineering husband Joss. The Inn has no guests - the rooms are locked and kept for storage - but it soon becomes clear that it’s a cover, as Joss is the leader of a smuggling ring, and Jamaica Inn the hub of his ‘free’ trade.', 'Set in 1820 against the forbidding backdrop of windswept Cornish moors, the story follows the journey of young and spirited Mary who is forced to live with her Aunt Patience after the death of her mother. Mary arrives at the isolated Jamaica Inn to discover her Aunt is a shell of the carefree woman she remembers from her childhood, and instead finds a drudge who is firmly under the spell of her domineering husband Joss. The Inn has no guests - the rooms are locked and kept for storage - but it soon becomes clear that it’s a cover, as Joss is the leader of a smuggling ring, and Jamaica Inn the hub of his ‘free’ trade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3SZ2TSpaVIRJG8FNDsX7HLZlE5q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61245'),
  ('78917677473287198', 'James & Mike Mondays', 2012, 'Comedy, Talk', 'James D. Rolfe, Mike Matei', null, 'Brendan Castner, Pat Contri, Mike Matei, James D. Rolfe', null, 'Buddies James and Mike kill time by playing and reviewing video games, old and new.', 'Buddies James and Mike kill time by playing and reviewing video games, old and new.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bbYPa8QAErjNHmBhFzRQEDoQhG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:57409'),
  ('1119312496789466192', 'James Acaster: Repertoire', 2018, 'Comedy, Talk', 'James Acaster', 'James Acaster', 'James Acaster', 'TV-14', 'Offbeat comic James Acaster covers the strange, the mundane and everything in between in this collection of four wide-ranging stand-up specials.', 'Offbeat comic James Acaster covers the strange, the mundane and everything in between in this collection of four wide-ranging stand-up specials.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYmfMa9yaMZID0q4gPIsmJw9cEF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78319'),
  ('116290769526695387', 'James Bond Jr.', 1991, 'Animation', 'Andy Heyward, Robby London, Michael G. Wilson', null, 'Brian Stokes Mitchell, Simon Templeman, Corey Burton, Jeff Bennett, Julian Holloway, Mona Marshall, Bobbie Block, Pat Musick', null, 'While attending prep school at Warfield Academy, James Bond Jr. with the help of his friends I.Q. (supposedly the grandson of Q) and Gordo Leiter (supposedly the son of Felix Leiter), fights against the evil terrorist organization SCUM (Saboteurs and Criminals United in Mayhem). Expanding on his uncle''s famous line, James Bond Jr.''s catch phrase was "Bond, James Bond. Junior."', 'While attending prep school at Warfield Academy, James Bond Jr. with the help of his friends I.Q. (supposedly the grandson of Q) and Gordo Leiter (supposedly the son of Felix Leiter), fights against the evil terrorist organization SCUM (Saboteurs and Criminals United in Mayhem). Expanding on his uncle''s famous line, James Bond Jr.''s catch phrase was "Bond, James Bond. Junior."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cwUnbz31k7K5fV0zximhN2nPM14.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42245'),
  ('158803878411044910', 'James Cameron''s Story of Science Fiction', 2018, 'Documentary, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'James Cameron', null, 'James Cameron, Keanu Reeves', 'TV-14', 'Explore the evolution of sci-fi from its origins as a small genre with a cult following to the blockbuster pop-cultural phenomenon we know today. In each episode, James Cameron introduces one of the “Big Questions” that humankind has contemplated throughout the ages and reaches back into sci-fi’s past to better understand how our favorite films, TV shows, books, and video games were born.', 'Explore the evolution of sci-fi from its origins as a small genre with a cult following to the blockbuster pop-cultural phenomenon we know today. In each episode, James Cameron introduces one of the “Big Questions” that humankind has contemplated throughout the ages and reaches back into sci-fi’s past to better understand how our favorite films, TV shows, books, and video games were born.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhanotOZnOdgmCZonug5anT0mFo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79003'),
  ('189289721917146856', 'James May: Oh Cook!', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Nikki Morgan, James May', null, 'James May is not a chef. But that’s the whole point: you don’t need to be a brilliant cook to make delicious food. Transporting us to the Far East, the Med, and the local pub – all from the comfort of a home economist’s kitchen – he’ll knock up delicious recipes that you can actually make yourself, with ingredients you can actually buy. And all without the usual television cooking format trickery.', 'James May is not a chef. But that’s the whole point: you don’t need to be a brilliant cook to make delicious food. Transporting us to the Far East, the Med, and the local pub – all from the comfort of a home economist’s kitchen – he’ll knock up delicious recipes that you can actually make yourself, with ingredients you can actually buy. And all without the usual television cooking format trickery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5cFF3uuSfvoy6s7cVP0sX5EwHX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:106694'),
  ('358457228086172248', 'James May: Our Man in…', 2020, 'Documentary, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Tom Whitter, James May, Henry Dalton', null, 'James May', 'TV-14', 'James May embarks on a remarkable journey across Japan, from its icy north to its balmy south. He’ll see the sights, meet the locals, and eat the noodles in a bid to truly understand the Land of the Rising Sun.', 'James May embarks on a remarkable journey across Japan, from its icy north to its balmy south. He’ll see the sights, meet the locals, and eat the noodles in a bid to truly understand the Land of the Rising Sun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qIoGE9kSuBE5NiaLclNDfHTpwhu.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:96723'),
  ('336747146317524413', 'James May: The Reassembler', 2016, 'Documentary', null, null, 'James May', null, 'When we look around our homes, sheds and garages we see an array of household objects that with one click of a button or twist of a knob will spring to life, and - most of the time - do exactly what we want them to. But how on earth do these objects work? To find out, James May (fuelled by endless cups of tea) heads into his workshop with thousands of little pieces to assemble some of our most beloved and recognisable objects from scratch to see what it actually takes to get them to work.', 'When we look around our homes, sheds and garages we see an array of household objects that with one click of a button or twist of a knob will spring to life, and - most of the time - do exactly what we want them to. But how on earth do these objects work? To find out, James May (fuelled by endless cups of tea) heads into his workshop with thousands of little pieces to assemble some of our most beloved and recognisable objects from scratch to see what it actually takes to get them to work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5yTK1WbKNNMiD0TNVB0em3O9X8.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69340'),
  ('761545794445356899', 'James May''s Cars of the People', 2014, 'Documentary', null, null, 'James May', null, 'James May takes a look at the ''peoples car''. Covering every form of cars for the masses - from the Beetle to the Kei Car, May looks at the many forms of people''s car, their origins and their effect on history. Each episode covers a particular theme; these being cars from dictatorships, microcars and the dream cars we aspire to.', 'James May takes a look at the ''peoples car''. Covering every form of cars for the masses - from the Beetle to the Kei Car, May looks at the many forms of people''s car, their origins and their effect on history. Each episode covers a particular theme; these being cars from dictatorships, microcars and the dream cars we aspire to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnpgKyje1iO85MDSD2Ao4dId51z.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61285'),
  ('917900409334143925', 'James May''s Man Lab', 2010, 'Documentary', null, null, 'James May', 'TV-PG', 'James May''s Man Lab sees James attempting redeem the reputation of the modern man by teaching them skills that were cherished by their forefathers.', 'James May''s Man Lab sees James attempting redeem the reputation of the modern man by teaching them skills that were cherished by their forefathers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kjsPkb3djMGE2K4OWFKkwQglXR.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:34362'),
  ('129673919349601209', 'James May''s Toy Stories', 2009, 'Documentary', null, null, 'James May', 'TV-PG', 'James May is out to prove why traditional, old fashioned toys are still relevant today when he pushes them to the limit in spectacular, supersize challenges.', 'James May is out to prove why traditional, old fashioned toys are still relevant today when he pushes them to the limit in spectacular, supersize challenges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NAkQP0ADRdP521C6ggYHxLuS5q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31107'),
  ('800054782317825441', 'Jamestown', 2017, 'Drama', 'Bill Gallagher', null, 'Sophie Rundle, Niamh Walsh, Naomi Battrick, Gwilym Lee, Stuart Martin, Matt Stokoe, Burn Gorman, Jason Flemyng', 'TV-14', 'The early 17th Century story of three courageous, dynamic women who leave their dark pasts behind in England, and make the journey of a lifetime across the ocean for a new life in America.', 'The early 17th Century story of three courageous, dynamic women who leave their dark pasts behind in England, and make the journey of a lifetime across the ocean for a new life in America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7heJBp8sjGEt8wFwpo2c1w4LLhi.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:71391'),
  ('805360964146116834', 'Jamtara – Sabka Number Ayega', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', 'Soumendra Padhi', 'Nishank Verma', 'Amit Sial, Dibyendu Bhattacharya, Aksha Pardasany, Sparsh Shrivastava, Monika Panwar, Seema Pahwa', 'TV-MA', 'A group of small-town young men run a lucrative phishing operation, until a corrupt politician wants in on their scheme -- and a cop wants to fight it.', 'A group of small-town young men run a lucrative phishing operation, until a corrupt politician wants in on their scheme -- and a cop wants to fight it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHHDIN5UmgCuQTCAfAKaPChTPzq.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:96870'),
  ('193484072350085925', 'Jane', 2023, 'Kids, Family, Animation', 'J.J. Johnson', null, 'Ava Louise Murchison, Mason Blomberg, Dan Abramovici', 'TV-G', 'Budding environmentalist Jane is a 9-year-old on a quest to save endangered animals. Using her powerful imagination, Jane takes her best friends David and Greybeard the chimpanzee on epic adventures to help protect wild animals all around the world.', 'Budding environmentalist Jane is a 9-year-old on a quest to save endangered animals. Using her powerful imagination, Jane takes her best friends David and Greybeard the chimpanzee on epic adventures to help protect wild animals all around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9EuDaqFRui2nVqE4CixB7Umx9AO.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:118534'),
  ('1023982197547021242', 'Jane and the Dragon', 2006, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids, Family, Action & Adventure', 'Martin Baynton', null, 'Noah Reid, Tajja Isen, Cameron Ansell, Mark Rendall, Alex House, Will Bowes, Aron Tager, Adrian Truss', 'TV-G', 'As an only child, Jane was brought up in the Royal Court as a medieval middle-class girl and raised to be a lady-in-waiting. A combination of determination and good fortune changes Jane''s life and she becomes a knight in training. Accompanied by her best friend, a giant green Dragon, Jane demonstrates her bravery and kindness in a series of adventures set in feudal times.', 'As an only child, Jane was brought up in the Royal Court as a medieval middle-class girl and raised to be a lady-in-waiting. A combination of determination and good fortune changes Jane''s life and she becomes a knight in training. Accompanied by her best friend, a giant green Dragon, Jane demonstrates her bravery and kindness in a series of adventures set in feudal times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2kJHUrNUwWaQCRcUjLLfbMWEqvx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1816'),
  ('938351858567437111', 'Jane by Design', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'April Blair', null, 'Erica Dasher, Andie MacDowell, India de Beaufort, Rowly Dennis, Matthew Atkinson, Nick Roux, Meagan Tandy, David Clayton Rogers', 'TV-14', 'Teenage Jane lands a job at Donovan Decker, a hip fashion house, when they mistake her for an adult. Jane soon finds herself juggling life both as a regular high school student and as an assistant to a high powered executive in the cutthroat world of fashion... all while trying to keep her true identity a secret.', 'Teenage Jane lands a job at Donovan Decker, a hip fashion house, when they mistake her for an adult. Jane soon finds herself juggling life both as a regular high school student and as an assistant to a high powered executive in the cutthroat world of fashion... all while trying to keep her true identity a secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0t6EzLG2p0u1ugxYmZ9YMsxbNW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39048'),
  ('625780534016936248', 'Jane Eyre', 1983, 'Drama', 'Barry Letts', 'Alexander Baron', null, null, 'After a bleak childhood, Jane Eyre goes out into the world to become a governess. As she lives happily in her new position at Thornfield Hall, she meets the dark, cold, and abrupt master of the house, Edward Rochester. Jane and her employer grow close in friendship and she soon finds herself falling in love with him. Happiness seems to have found Jane at last, but could Rochester''s terrible secret be about to destroy it forever?', 'After a bleak childhood, Jane Eyre goes out into the world to become a governess. As she lives happily in her new position at Thornfield Hall, she meets the dark, cold, and abrupt master of the house, Edward Rochester. Jane and her employer grow close in friendship and she soon finds herself falling in love with him. Happiness seems to have found Jane at last, but could Rochester''s terrible secret be about to destroy it forever?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nPl4tm54apPRIwkBda1pogWprAv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13269'),
  ('752256340616119370', 'Jane Eyre', 2006, 'Drama', null, null, 'Ruth Wilson, Toby Stephens, Tara Fitzgerald, Lorraine Ashbourne, Pam Ferris, Christina Cole, Jeanne Golding, Ned Irish', 'TV-PG', 'Charlotte Bronte''s classic about an orphan girl who grows up to become a governess in a gloomy manor in Yorkshire, where she falls in love with the mysterious Edward Rochester.', 'Charlotte Bronte''s classic about an orphan girl who grows up to become a governess in a gloomy manor in Yorkshire, where she falls in love with the mysterious Edward Rochester.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rj6SOvMzH1KOILZBR8bkIqXztRO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13851'),
  ('887231990609183842', 'Jane McDonald In Nashville', 2026, null, null, null, 'Jane McDonald', null, 'The two-part series follows beloved television personality and seasoned traveller, Jane McDonald as she embarks on a once in a lifetime dream trip to Music City.', 'The two-part series follows beloved television personality and seasoned traveller, Jane McDonald as she embarks on a once in a lifetime dream trip to Music City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bnrFlTsfSDk6U5nVxbFTOFRpgPd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317876'),
  ('95328157767978825', 'Jane the Virgin', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jennie Snyder Urman', null, 'Gina Rodriguez, Andrea Navedo, Yael Grobglas, Justin Baldoni, Ivonne Coll, Jaime Camil', 'TV-14', 'A comedy-drama following a chaste young woman who is accidentally impregnated via artificial insemination as she struggles to inform her devoutly religious family and make the right choices concerning the child. Based on the telenovela "Juana la virgen."', 'A comedy-drama following a chaste young woman who is accidentally impregnated via artificial insemination as she struggles to inform her devoutly religious family and make the right choices concerning the child. Based on the telenovela "Juana la virgen."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/DRRHgvsNEfBloMgIP8bBw4zi4E.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:61418'),
  ('300460621222597919', 'JANET JACKSON.', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Janet Jackson', null, 'The documentary takes viewers through Janet Jackson''s life and career, contain never-before-seen footage, and feature home videos from the legendary artist. Jackson discusses her controversial 2004 Super Bowl halftime show performance with Justin Timberlake, her father Joe Jackson, the death of her brother Michael Jackson, and more.', 'The documentary takes viewers through Janet Jackson''s life and career, contain never-before-seen footage, and feature home videos from the legendary artist. Jackson discusses her controversial 2004 Super Bowl halftime show performance with Justin Timberlake, her father Joe Jackson, the death of her brother Michael Jackson, and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQniNP1XSYvSk2qTU8PGe9kL4Lm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:122296'),
  ('420111946808137135', 'Janet King', 2014, 'Drama', 'Des Monaghan, Greg Haddrick', null, 'Marta Dusseldorp, Damian Walshe-Howling, Christopher Morris, Hamish Michael, Andrea Demetriades, Peter Kowitz, Anita Hegh, Geraldine Viswanathan', null, 'Senior Prosecutor Janet King returns from maternity leave to confront a high-profile murder, and a conspiracy which will have shocking ramifications throughout the judicial system.', 'Senior Prosecutor Janet King returns from maternity leave to confront a high-profile murder, and a conspiracy which will have shocking ramifications throughout the judicial system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7DlYZguIh5DBn9RVIbcFtpBKeHN.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:46621'),
  ('530770655574413527', 'Jang Ok Jung, Living in Love', 2013, 'Drama', null, null, 'Kim Tae-hee, Yoo Ah-in, Hong Soo-hyun, Jae Hee, Lee Sang-yeob, Han Seung-yeon, Sung Dong-il, Kim Sun-kyung', null, 'Haute couture meets the high court in this drama based on Lady Jang Hui Bin, or Jang Ok Jung, one of the most celebrated royal concubines of the Joseon Dynasty. Lady Jang establishes herself as a coveted fashion designer who quickly finds herself sought after not only by fashionable noblewomen, but by the king himself. Political drama and the catwalk collide in this tale of fashioning dreams into reality!', 'Haute couture meets the high court in this drama based on Lady Jang Hui Bin, or Jang Ok Jung, one of the most celebrated royal concubines of the Joseon Dynasty. Lady Jang establishes herself as a coveted fashion designer who quickly finds herself sought after not only by fashionable noblewomen, but by the king himself. Political drama and the catwalk collide in this tale of fashioning dreams into reality!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t6l4j4CSkiFPVXUoKSDT8ODRoZ2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:47322'),
  ('991110803612623450', 'Jang Yeong Sil', 2016, 'Drama', null, 'Lee Myung-hee', 'Song Il-gook, Park Sun-young, Kim Sang-kyung, Kim Yeong-cheol, Kim Ki-hyeon, Son Byung-ho, Jung Han-yong, Jang Kwang', null, 'Drama series follows the life Jang Yeong-Sil: a scientist, technician and inventor during the Joseon period. Jang Yeong-Sil was born in the lower class nobi. King Sejong notices his abilities and brings him to the palace. King Sejong grants him a chance to display his abilities. He invents tools like astronomical instruments, iron printing press and a water clock.', 'Drama series follows the life Jang Yeong-Sil: a scientist, technician and inventor during the Joseon period. Jang Yeong-Sil was born in the lower class nobi. King Sejong notices his abilities and brings him to the palace. King Sejong grants him a chance to display his abilities. He invents tools like astronomical instruments, iron printing press and a water clock.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fzw7f3dCWnsDr6jZTb6dahmgEFC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64811'),
  ('897528521261242104', 'Janosik', 1974, 'Action & Adventure', null, 'Tadeusz Kwiatkowski', 'Marek Perepeczko, Bogusz Bilewski, Witold Pyrkosz, Ewa Lemańska, Marian Kociniak, Mieczysław Czechowicz, Janusz Bukowski, Jerzy Cnota', null, 'Janosik was a television series that aired in Poland in 1974. It is about a famous Polish highlander outlaw who in folk legends steals money and goods from the rich and helps out the poor. The series was directed by Jerzy Passendorfer. There are 13 1-hour episodes.', 'Janosik was a television series that aired in Poland in 1974. It is about a famous Polish highlander outlaw who in folk legends steals money and goods from the rich and helps out the poor. The series was directed by Jerzy Passendorfer. There are 13 1-hour episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aPvPkM1VGBPGiPCJYoEAYbTawAc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:48421'),
  ('314690117031794636', 'Janus', 1994, 'Drama, Crime', 'Tony McDonald, Alison Nisselle', null, 'Simon Westaway, Jennifer Jarman-Walker, Chris Haywood, Jeremy Kewley, Brett Swain, Leon Teague, Louise Siversen, Sean Scully', 'NR', 'Janus is an Australian drama television series screened on the Australian Broadcasting Corporation in 1994 and 1995. Two series were produced, with a total of 26 episodes. Janus was a spin-off series from the earlier ABC-TV crime series Phoenix. Loosely based on the true story of Melbourne''s Pettingill family and the Walsh Street police shootings, Janus follows the bitterly-fought prosecutions of a notorious criminal family, the Hennesseys, from the viewpoints of the family, the police and, in particular, the lawyers, prosecutors, barristers and judges involved in all aspects of the story. When the series begins, four members of the infamous Hennessey clan are acquitted of the shooting of two young policemen in a bungled bank heist. The city of Melbourne is shocked as brothers Mal and Steve, along with brother-in-law Darren Mack and friend Ken Hardy, walk free. The prosecutors, judges, magistrates and police—many modelled heavily on real-life legal figures—are determined to put the Hennessey members behind bars if they can. But corruption, legal loopholes, delays, and stretched resources combine to make the quest to jail the group far from straightforward.', 'Janus is an Australian drama television series screened on the Australian Broadcasting Corporation in 1994 and 1995. Two series were produced, with a total of 26 episodes. Janus was a spin-off series from the earlier ABC-TV crime series Phoenix. Loosely based on the true story of Melbourne''s Pettingill family and the Walsh Street police shootings, Janus follows the bitterly-fought prosecutions of a notorious criminal family, the Hennesseys, from the viewpoints of the family, the police and, in particular, the lawyers, prosecutors, barristers and judges involved in all aspects of the story. When the series begins, four members of the infamous Hennessey clan are acquitted of the shooting of two young policemen in a bungled bank heist. The city of Melbourne is shocked as brothers Mal and Steve, along with brother-in-law Darren Mack and friend Ken Hardy, walk free. The prosecutors, judges, magistrates and police—many modelled heavily on real-life legal figures—are determined to put the Hennessey members behind bars if they can. But corruption, legal loopholes, delays, and stretched resources combine to make the quest to jail the group far from straightforward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uOVsNtECSWbRFgYw1Nzb9Bxy7zs.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:10561'),
  ('641608426828977317', 'Japan Animator Expo', 2014, 'Animation', null, null, 'Koichi Yamadera, Megumi Hayashibara', null, 'The short film series "Japan Anima(tor)''s Exhibition" presented by Studio Khara and Dwango Original projects, spin-off projects, promotional films, Music PV, and VJ Films etc... Various omnibus animations produced with love and energy, regardless of any genres. The digital distribution anime series bring opportunities for project development, R&D, human resources development, and free production under limited period and budget, to explore the possibilities of future film production.', 'The short film series "Japan Anima(tor)''s Exhibition" presented by Studio Khara and Dwango Original projects, spin-off projects, promotional films, Music PV, and VJ Films etc... Various omnibus animations produced with love and energy, regardless of any genres. The digital distribution anime series bring opportunities for project development, R&D, human resources development, and free production under limited period and budget, to explore the possibilities of future film production.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0hdu4gPQPiyK6y2N6mQONHUecM.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:103927'),
  ('617096653492967905', 'Japan Sinks: 2020', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Taichi Takeda, Reina Ueda, Tomo Muranaka, Yuko Sasaki, Masaki Terasoma, Hiroyuki Yoshino, Nanako Mori, Kensho Ono', 'TV-MA', 'After catastrophic earthquakes devastate Japan, one family''s resolve is tested on a journey of survival through the sinking archipelago.', 'After catastrophic earthquakes devastate Japan, one family''s resolve is tested on a journey of survival through the sinking archipelago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guWqteZJ16ABGGtXIKFyDBAo8Ik.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94423'),
  ('150388368372342226', 'JAPAN SINKS: People of Hope', 2021, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Shun Oguri, Kenichi Matsuyama, Anne Watanabe, Eiji Wentz, Anne Nakamura, Toru Nakamura, Teruyuki Kagawa, Manabu Hamada', null, 'In 2023 in Tokyo, Prime Minister Eiichi Higashiyama pushes for COMS at the World Environment Conference. COMS is a method to liquify pollutants and store it in the crack of the sea floor. Prime Minister Eiichi Higashiyama gathers young and talented bureaucrats and launches Japan Future Promotion Conference, which is to benefit the future of Japan. Keishi Amami of the Ministry of the Environment and Kōichi Tokiwa of the Ministry of Economy, Trade, and Industry are members of that conference.', 'In 2023 in Tokyo, Prime Minister Eiichi Higashiyama pushes for COMS at the World Environment Conference. COMS is a method to liquify pollutants and store it in the crack of the sea floor. Prime Minister Eiichi Higashiyama gathers young and talented bureaucrats and launches Japan Future Promotion Conference, which is to benefit the future of Japan. Keishi Amami of the Ministry of the Environment and Kōichi Tokiwa of the Ministry of Economy, Trade, and Industry are members of that conference.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d002IaCQ55rcA7mXZzl4Y5Pq5nV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135144'),
  ('700217713128594130', 'Japan: Earth''s Enchanted Islands', 2015, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Michelle Dockery', 'TV-PG', 'Japan''s landscapes range from snowy mountains to subtropical warmth. They are full of wildlife - and animals'' and people''s lives often cross as they adapt to these extremes.', 'Japan''s landscapes range from snowy mountains to subtropical warmth. They are full of wildlife - and animals'' and people''s lives often cross as they adapt to these extremes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2NkmwK2Tvr4m1YICeZhsotRsmH1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78615'),
  ('833756359809197782', 'Japanese Spiderman', 1978, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Shozo Uehara, Susumu Takaku', null, 'Shinji Tôdô, Mitsuo Andō, Yukie Kagawa, Rie Rinehart, Tina Margo, Tōru Ōhira, Rika Miura, Izumi Oyama', 'NR', 'Follow the exploits of motorcycle racer turned super hero Takuya Yamashiro, as he slings and swings, battling the evil Iron Cross Army along the way.', 'Follow the exploits of motorcycle racer turned super hero Takuya Yamashiro, as he slings and swings, battling the evil Iron Cross Army along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w5pTlusOFWrOib6XX3iCMjHSzB1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2640'),
  ('215781434561784106', 'Japanology Plus', 2014, 'Documentary, Talk', null, null, 'Peter Barakan', 'NR', 'Host Peter Barakan delves into various aspects of Japanese culture; exploring practices, history, and modern innovations in such areas as ramen, rice, sushi, geisha, bonsai, and so much more. Local experts discuss their passions at fascinating length, and American Japanophile Matt Alt experiences the food, practices, and cultures in each episode in depth. Viewers will finish each half hour episode with a new understanding of an area of Japanese life through demonstrative videos and explanations, all delivered respectfully and true to the Japanese way of life.', 'Host Peter Barakan delves into various aspects of Japanese culture; exploring practices, history, and modern innovations in such areas as ramen, rice, sushi, geisha, bonsai, and so much more. Local experts discuss their passions at fascinating length, and American Japanophile Matt Alt experiences the food, practices, and cultures in each episode in depth. Viewers will finish each half hour episode with a new understanding of an area of Japanese life through demonstrative videos and explanations, all delivered respectfully and true to the Japanese way of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4yFTp3MvggIFLwTPxEQIvOprVI.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:73679'),
  ('387072084760879613', 'Jared from Subway: Catching a Monster', 2023, 'Crime, Documentary', null, null, 'Rochelle Herman, Sean ''Ozzie'' Osborne, Max Winitz, Steven Debrota, Jared Fogle, Kirsten Stiff-Walker', 'TV-14', 'Jared Fogle, aka The Subway Guy, was a pop culture icon and an inspiration to millions of Americans -- but behind his loveable public persona lurks a monster. This three part docu-series reveals the untold story of the investigation that exposed the monster insidiously lurking behind his persona, how his true nature as a child sex predator was finally revealed, and how he was brought to justice.', 'Jared Fogle, aka The Subway Guy, was a pop culture icon and an inspiration to millions of Americans -- but behind his loveable public persona lurks a monster. This three part docu-series reveals the untold story of the investigation that exposed the monster insidiously lurking behind his persona, how his true nature as a child sex predator was finally revealed, and how he was brought to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bWnl5IzyKR90zhZmYpqgG8WugZS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:221181'),
  ('696964585497046800', 'Jason and the Argonauts', 2000, 'Family, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Nick Willing', null, 'Ciarán Hinds, Jason London, Brian Thompson, David Calder, Jolene Blalock, Derek Jacobi, Olivia Williams, Dennis Hopper', null, 'At a young age, Jason witnesses the brutal deposement and murder of his father at the hands of his uncle Pelias. Twenty years later, Jason returns home to claim his rightful place as king, but Pelias orders him to be executed, and in order to save himself Jason is forced to go on a dangerous quest to find the legendary Golden Fleece. So Jason gathers a motley crew of men and sets sail on the Argos.', 'At a young age, Jason witnesses the brutal deposement and murder of his father at the hands of his uncle Pelias. Twenty years later, Jason returns home to claim his rightful place as king, but Pelias orders him to be executed, and in order to save himself Jason is forced to go on a dangerous quest to find the legendary Golden Fleece. So Jason gathers a motley crew of men and sets sail on the Argos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pYXkdXyqnmKFf01Yi6MkbfMczhv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:25406'),
  ('518967921547587463', 'Jason King', 1971, 'Action & Adventure', 'Dennis Spooner, Monty Berman', null, 'Peter Wyngarde', 'NR', 'Jason King - a suavely sophisticated former secret agent turned novelist - travels the world searching for material to fill his books, encountering an endless parade of glamorous women, exotic locales, menacing villains and daring intrigue! Before Austin Powers swung into action, Jason King set the standard for the hip crime-fighting international playboy!', 'Jason King - a suavely sophisticated former secret agent turned novelist - travels the world searching for material to fill his books, encountering an endless parade of glamorous women, exotic locales, menacing villains and daring intrigue! Before Austin Powers swung into action, Jason King set the standard for the hip crime-fighting international playboy!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wTSMq9q69gq6T3YZXGNpMXgMFp8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2853'),
  ('757768948553731162', 'Jason of Star Command', 1978, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Arthur H. Nadel', 'Samuel A. Peeples, Chuck Menville', 'Sid Haig, Susan Pratt, Tamara Dobson, Charlie Dell, Craig Littler, Julie Newmar', null, 'Jason of Star Command is a live action television series by Filmation which ran between 1978 and 1981. The show revolved around the exploits of space adventurer Jason and his colleagues, including Professor E.J. Parsafoot and the pocket robot "Wiki". The show also starred Sid Haig as the evil Dragos, and, in the first season, James Doohan of Star Trek fame. Jason was a spin-off of another Filmation live action show called Space Academy, which starred another sci-fi luminary, Jonathan Harris of Lost in Space fame.', 'Jason of Star Command is a live action television series by Filmation which ran between 1978 and 1981. The show revolved around the exploits of space adventurer Jason and his colleagues, including Professor E.J. Parsafoot and the pocket robot "Wiki". The show also starred Sid Haig as the evil Dragos, and, in the first season, James Doohan of Star Trek fame. Jason was a spin-off of another Filmation live action show called Space Academy, which starred another sci-fi luminary, Jonathan Harris of Lost in Space fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZUmjLKSwKnYM6EMkN7rLq31Fa.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:12142'),
  ('555878192206923055', 'Jassi Jaissi Koi Nahin', 2003, 'Drama', 'DJ''s Creative Unit, Deeya Singh', null, 'Mona Singh, Samir Soni, Apurva Agnihotri, Neena Gupta, Rajesh Khera, Parmeet Sethi, Manini Mishra, Rakshanda Khan', null, 'Jassi Jaisi Koi Nahin is a story of the lovable ugly duckling Jassi''s journey to becoming a beautiful swan and finding her prince charming. It is the story of Jasmeet Walia - Jassi - who is an unattractive, bespectacled girl with braces and an odd style of dressing. She is naive but intelligent. Jassi faces a lot of criticism from prettier colleagues - both men and women. The show chronicles her at her workplace where she wins the hearts of her colleagues and her boss due to her warm nature. Over time she falls in love with her boss, Armaan Suri. It is the story of Jassi whose life unfolds as she struggles to make a place for herself in the vain world and unite with the man she loves.', 'Jassi Jaisi Koi Nahin is a story of the lovable ugly duckling Jassi''s journey to becoming a beautiful swan and finding her prince charming. It is the story of Jasmeet Walia - Jassi - who is an unattractive, bespectacled girl with braces and an odd style of dressing. She is naive but intelligent. Jassi faces a lot of criticism from prettier colleagues - both men and women. The show chronicles her at her workplace where she wins the hearts of her colleagues and her boss due to her warm nature. Over time she falls in love with her boss, Armaan Suri. It is the story of Jassi whose life unfolds as she struggles to make a place for herself in the vain world and unite with the man she loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/59tC9uxuthrLOsQDJILU1pjkxFf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15246'),
  ('803669424572559430', 'Jay Leno''s Garage', 2015, 'Reality, Documentary, Comedy, Talk', null, null, 'Jay Leno', 'TV-PG', 'Comedian and former Tonight Show host Jay Leno shares his passion for motor vehicles. Jay and guests drive cars, motorbikes and anything that moves all while meeting new people and exploring the rich motoring history of America and beyond.', 'Comedian and former Tonight Show host Jay Leno shares his passion for motor vehicles. Jay and guests drive cars, motorbikes and anything that moves all while meeting new people and exploring the rich motoring history of America and beyond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h4T23oAVxLky9YDpV3wp6qdnkjz.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:64229'),
  ('444883957801254036', 'Jayce and the Wheeled Warriors', 1985, 'Kids, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'J. Michael Straczynski, Jean Chalopin', null, 'Darrin Baker, Charles Jolliffe, Valerie Politis, Len Carlson, Gilles Tamiz, Giulio Kukurugya, John Stocker, Dan Hennessey', 'TV-Y7', 'The Lightning League drives white and silver vehicles with assorted weaponry, and are led by a teenager named Jayce. The villains are organic green vegetable-based creatures called the Monster Minds, who tend to take the shape of black and green vehicles. They travel via large green organic vines which can grow in and across interstellar space, and sprout seeds that rapidly grow into further Monster Minds. They are led by Saw Boss.', 'The Lightning League drives white and silver vehicles with assorted weaponry, and are led by a teenager named Jayce. The villains are organic green vegetable-based creatures called the Monster Minds, who tend to take the shape of black and green vehicles. They travel via large green organic vines which can grow in and across interstellar space, and sprout seeds that rapidly grow into further Monster Minds. They are led by Saw Boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cWiAykgUuINyRcPwEgUMmJbDhN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:592'),
  ('107430895086827048', 'Jazz', 2001, 'Documentary', null, 'Geoffrey C. Ward', 'Keith David, Sidney Bechet, Louis Armstrong, Duke Ellington, Benny Goodman, Artie Shaw, Billie Holiday, Glenn Miller', null, 'Jazz is a ten part series that explores the evolution – and the genius – of America’s greatest original art form, focusing on the extraordinary men and women who could do something remarkable – create art on the spot. Jazz celebrates their profoundly enduring, endlessly varied, and infinitely alluring music in the context of the complicated country that gave birth to and influenced it, and was in turn transformed by it.', 'Jazz is a ten part series that explores the evolution – and the genius – of America’s greatest original art form, focusing on the extraordinary men and women who could do something remarkable – create art on the spot. Jazz celebrates their profoundly enduring, endlessly varied, and infinitely alluring music in the context of the complicated country that gave birth to and influenced it, and was in turn transformed by it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40S5JFf0pH9Ojk47B0nvy3eUrP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:20861'),
  ('216161849608452548', 'Jazz For Two', 2024, 'Drama', 'Clarju', null, 'Ji Ho-geun, Kim Jin-kwon, Song Han-gyeom, Kim Jeong-ha, Byun Sung-tae, Go Jae-hyun, Kim Min-ah', null, 'After his jazz prodigy brother''s death, Tae-yi loses interest in life. Se-heon, a passionate new student, rekindles memories of his brother through his music. Se-heon suspects a connection. But his return stirs tensions.', 'After his jazz prodigy brother''s death, Tae-yi loses interest in life. Se-heon, a passionate new student, rekindles memories of his brother through his music. Se-heon suspects a connection. But his return stirs tensions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4cdwZfNRf20TVGOvxVmxOObvDcm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:247760'),
  ('779432103044269706', 'Je Zal Het Maar Hebben Junior', 2024, null, null, null, 'Raïsha Zeegelaar', null, 'In ''Je Zal Het Maar Hebben Junior'', presenter Raïsha Zeegelaar meets sixteen children with a special condition or illness. This includes Mads (11) who was born without eyes, Amelie (13) who has butterfly disease which makes her skin like crepe paper and Alice (8) who is now completely bald due to alopecia. How do they deal with their illness or condition? What do they do when they get strange looks on the schoolyard? And how do they ensure that their condition or illness does not completely dominate their life?', 'In ''Je Zal Het Maar Hebben Junior'', presenter Raïsha Zeegelaar meets sixteen children with a special condition or illness. This includes Mads (11) who was born without eyes, Amelie (13) who has butterfly disease which makes her skin like crepe paper and Alice (8) who is now completely bald due to alopecia. How do they deal with their illness or condition? What do they do when they get strange looks on the schoolyard? And how do they ensure that their condition or illness does not completely dominate their life?', null, 3, 'tmdb:tv:282444'),
  ('1018299733451522429', 'Jealousy Incarnate', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Gong Hyo-jin, Cho Jung-seok, Go Kyung-pyo, Lee Mi-sook, Lee Sung-jae, Park Ji-young, Seo Ji-hye, Mun Ka-young', null, 'A weather girl reunites with her old crush, a haughty reporter at her TV station. But this time, she has her eyes on someone else -- his best friend.', 'A weather girl reunites with her old crush, a haughty reporter at her TV station. But this time, she has her eyes on someone else -- his best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1HbFVRZFWNcglKhY7caExczrCN6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66560'),
  ('302619750961236104', 'Jean-Claude Van Johnson', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'David Callaham', null, 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Kat Foster, Bar Paly, Phylicia Rashād, Moisés Arias, Shanynn Samiyah Covington', 'TV-MA', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme is a global martial arts &amp; film sensation, also operating under the simple alias of "Johnson" as the world''s best undercover private contractor. Retired for years, a chance encounter with a lost love brings him back to the game. This time, he''ll be deadlier than ever. Probably.', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme is a global martial arts &amp; film sensation, also operating under the simple alias of "Johnson" as the world''s best undercover private contractor. Retired for years, a chance encounter with a lost love brings him back to the game. This time, he''ll be deadlier than ever. Probably.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0fsYMwAMJoNGZsxfI1OHuDY0K7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67497'),
  ('1134786773394258297', 'jeen-yuhs: A Kanye Trilogy', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Ye, Coodie Simmons', 'TV-MA', 'The lives of an emerging superstar and a filmmaker intertwine in this intense, intimate docuseries charting Kanye West''s career, filmed over two decades.', 'The lives of an emerging superstar and a filmmaker intertwine in this intense, intimate docuseries charting Kanye West''s career, filmed over two decades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDrZvecNSRHGU8Wma6KsBi4DdAX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155094'),
  ('730092526247424209', 'Jeena Isi Ka Naam Hai', 2002, 'Talk', 'Sucharita Ghosh Stephenson', null, 'Roshan Abbas', null, 'Host Farooq Shaikh interviews many well-known Bollywood faces as well as television celebrities and gives a peek into their private and professional lives.', 'Host Farooq Shaikh interviews many well-known Bollywood faces as well as television celebrities and gives a peek into their private and professional lives.', null, 2, 'tmdb:tv:5979'),
  ('755826196526412884', 'Jeeves and Wooster', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Clive Exton', null, 'Hugh Laurie, Stephen Fry', 'TV-PG', 'Jeeves and Wooster is a British comedy-drama series adapted by Clive Exton from P.G. Wodehouse''s "Jeeves" stories. It aired on the ITV network from 1990 to 1993, starring Hugh Laurie as Bertie Wooster, a young gentleman with a "distinctive blend of airy nonchalance and refined gormlessness", and Stephen Fry as Jeeves, his improbably well-informed and talented valet. Wooster is a bachelor, a minor aristocrat and member of the idle rich. He and his friends, who are mainly members of The Drones Club, are extricated from all manner of societal misadventures by the indispensable valet, Jeeves. The stories are set in the United Kingdom and the United States in the 1930s.', 'Jeeves and Wooster is a British comedy-drama series adapted by Clive Exton from P.G. Wodehouse''s "Jeeves" stories. It aired on the ITV network from 1990 to 1993, starring Hugh Laurie as Bertie Wooster, a young gentleman with a "distinctive blend of airy nonchalance and refined gormlessness", and Stephen Fry as Jeeves, his improbably well-informed and talented valet. Wooster is a bachelor, a minor aristocrat and member of the idle rich. He and his friends, who are mainly members of The Drones Club, are extricated from all manner of societal misadventures by the indispensable valet, Jeeves. The stories are set in the United Kingdom and the United States in the 1930s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upV2JYUcg9tlVmEpicdKrSoIXup.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1060'),
  ('238216624553839042', 'Jeff and Some Aliens', 2017, 'Animation', 'Alessandro Minoli, Sean Donnelly', null, 'Brett Gelman, Alicia Silverstone, Helena Mattsson, Katie Crown, Alessandro Minoli', 'TV-MA', 'Based on the recurring TripTank sketches, Jeff And Some Aliens follows Jeff, the world’s most average guy, and the three aliens sent to study him to determine whether or not humanity should be destroyed. Jeff’s mundane life is constantly thrown into chaos by his extraterrestrial guests – it isn’t always easy having roommates who force you to participate in grueling intergalatic decathalons or perform Azurian honor killings to restore interstellar balance', 'Based on the recurring TripTank sketches, Jeff And Some Aliens follows Jeff, the world’s most average guy, and the three aliens sent to study him to determine whether or not humanity should be destroyed. Jeff’s mundane life is constantly thrown into chaos by his extraterrestrial guests – it isn’t always easy having roommates who force you to participate in grueling intergalatic decathalons or perform Azurian honor killings to restore interstellar balance', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5oh09hT70NmkA2tEo6EUzteMWhI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69776'),
  ('954926783605680399', 'Jefferson Anderson', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Atte Järvinen', 'Atte Järvinen', 'Jani Volanen, Kari Hietalahti, Juho Milonoff, Mari Lehtonen', null, 'Jefferson Anderson is a Finnish animated sitcom. The computer-animated series portrays a satirical view of daily events in Helsinki at a police precinct in the suburb of Pasila. The series is made by members of the same team that made the award-winning series The Autocrats, a political animated satire. In 2007, the Finnish Broadcasting Company sent Pasila to compete for the Rose d''Or.', 'Jefferson Anderson is a Finnish animated sitcom. The computer-animated series portrays a satirical view of daily events in Helsinki at a police precinct in the suburb of Pasila. The series is made by members of the same team that made the award-winning series The Autocrats, a political animated satire. In 2007, the Finnish Broadcasting Company sent Pasila to compete for the Rose d''Or.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1TwieAaqKPpA0X2Mn18Tt0V7Az3.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:20445'),
  ('838002031108305844', 'Jeffrey Epstein: Filthy Rich', 2020, 'Crime, Documentary', null, null, 'Jeffrey Epstein, Ghislaine Maxwell', 'TV-MA', 'Stories from survivors fuel this docuseries examining how convicted sex offender Jeffrey Epstein used his wealth and power to carry out his abuses.', 'Stories from survivors fuel this docuseries examining how convicted sex offender Jeffrey Epstein used his wealth and power to carry out his abuses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vV72HIa2a1nnqb5nCHUf5Dn2Y5d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103506'),
  ('1093154099236886636', 'Jekyll', 2007, 'Drama, Crime', 'Steven Moffat', 'Steven Moffat', 'James Nesbitt, Gina Bellman, Michelle Ryan, Meera Syal, Denis Lawson, Mark Gatiss, Fenella Woolgar, Paterson Joseph', null, 'Tom Jackman is learning to cope with his alter ego, the dark and mysterious Hyde, who threatens his life and family. They also have to live in the same body while on the run from a mysterious organization that is hunting them.', 'Tom Jackman is learning to cope with his alter ego, the dark and mysterious Hyde, who threatens his life and family. They also have to live in the same body while on the run from a mysterious organization that is hunting them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ZFjQbziDY9zyt03mIcE0Ydz8xq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:744'),
  ('88380350462565787', 'Jekyll and Hyde', 2015, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Charlie Higson', 'Robert Louis', 'Michael Karim, Stephanie Hyam, Natalie Gumede, Tom Bateman, Richard E. Grant, Enzo Cilenti, Christian McKay, Donald Sumpter', 'NR', 'Inspired by the original novella by Robert Louis Stevenson, Jekyll and Hyde is set in 1930s London and follows Robert Jekyll, the grandson of Henry Jekyll, on his quest to discover his real identity, his true family history and the nature of his ‘curse’ – which his foster father, Dr Vishal Najaran, is controlling with medication. His journey takes him into a dark and unforgiving place, as his alter ego seems capable of anything. At the same time there are shadowy forces trying to find Jekyll and the source of his powers.', 'Inspired by the original novella by Robert Louis Stevenson, Jekyll and Hyde is set in 1930s London and follows Robert Jekyll, the grandson of Henry Jekyll, on his quest to discover his real identity, his true family history and the nature of his ‘curse’ – which his foster father, Dr Vishal Najaran, is controlling with medication. His journey takes him into a dark and unforgiving place, as his alter ego seems capable of anything. At the same time there are shadowy forces trying to find Jekyll and the source of his powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aZxe642qnGUvHCNHvr10vrWjx3b.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:47224'),
  ('860137948057775642', 'Jelies & Gnodde: Grote Gezinnen Emigreren', 2025, 'Reality', null, null, 'Janneke Jelies, Johan Jelies, Albertine Jelies, Harry Jelies, Harry Gnodde, Gré Gnodde, Jacob Gnodde', null, 'In the new reality series, viewers get a glimpse into the daily lives of the two famous families. Because what does emigrating, raising children and doing business abroad involve? The series shows how the families deal with these challenges.', 'In the new reality series, viewers get a glimpse into the daily lives of the two famous families. Because what does emigrating, raising children and doing business abroad involve? The series shows how the families deal with these challenges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yn8AgHttkzrQxlolwMYhGWN810a.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:289047'),
  ('834476295489712791', 'Jellyfish Can''t Swim in the Night', 2024, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Miku Ito, Rie Takahashi, Miyu Tomita, Miyuri Shimabukuro, Sumire Uesaka, Miho Okasaki, Yukina Shuto, Sally Amaki', 'TV-14', 'In the bustling heart of Shibuya, four young women—an artist, a retired idol, a V-tuber, and a composer—form JELEE, an anonymous artist group. United in their quest for self-expression, they journey towards self-discovery and finding their voice.', 'In the bustling heart of Shibuya, four young women—an artist, a retired idol, a V-tuber, and a composer—form JELEE, an anonymous artist group. United in their quest for self-expression, they journey towards self-discovery and finding their voice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8JSoCOP0OlnlCpLXBgL7HOH77R.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222923'),
  ('125625660759394706', 'Jellystone!', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'C.H. Greenblatt', null, 'Jeff Bergman, C.H. Greenblatt, Jim Conroy, Georgie Kidder, Grace Helbig, Niccole Thurman, Thomas Lennon, Ron Funches', 'TV-G', 'Welcome to Jellystone! Travel to a magical town where you’ll meet new and old friends, including Yogi Bear, Cindy Bear, Boo Boo, and Huckleberry Hound…and Jabberjaw and Top Cat and Snagglepuss and El Kabong and Wally Gator and Johnny Quest and Hadji and Shag Rugg and Captain Caveman and a whole lot more.', 'Welcome to Jellystone! Travel to a magical town where you’ll meet new and old friends, including Yogi Bear, Cindy Bear, Boo Boo, and Huckleberry Hound…and Jabberjaw and Top Cat and Snagglepuss and El Kabong and Wally Gator and Johnny Quest and Hadji and Shag Rugg and Captain Caveman and a whole lot more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7SwSAG48QvvMy8jlAgm3LGt3VGq.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:128071'),
  ('146167477081330597', 'Jem', 1985, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Christy Marx', null, 'Samantha Newark, Townsend Coleman, Cathianne Blore, Britta Phillips, Cindy McGee, Michael Sheehan, Patricia Alice Albrecht, Susan Blu', 'TV-Y7', 'Using a holographic computer she inherited from her father, Jerrica Benton turns herself and her pals into pop-music group Jem and the Holograms.', 'Using a holographic computer she inherited from her father, Jerrica Benton turns herself and her pals into pop-music group Jem and the Holograms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ytMf6ZQF67urGv9LYYXzgdpqfvv.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:3127'),
  ('751635206485142001', 'Jenni Rivera: Mariposa de Barrio', 2017, 'Drama', null, null, 'Rosalinda Rodríguez, Adrian Carvajal, Emannuel Morales, Tony Garza, Angélica Celaya, Gabriel Porras, Uriel del Toro, Stephanie Arcila', 'TV-MA', 'This drama reveals the difficult rise to fame of the Mexican-American singer Jenni Rivera, from her past of abuse to success as a band leader.', 'This drama reveals the difficult rise to fame of the Mexican-American singer Jenni Rivera, from her past of abuse to success as a band leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vIHwoZF3YjLkoFKJGJMIiIO4HsF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77454'),
  ('34816073617050016', 'Jennifer Falls', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Matthew Carlson', null, 'Jaime Pressly, Missi Pyle, Ethan Suplee, Nora Kirkpatrick, Dylan Gelula, Jessica Walter', 'TV-PG', 'Jennifer Doyle who must move back in with her own mom after being let go from her high-powered, six-figure salary job. With her teenage daughter in tow, Jennifer has to face her new life and figure out what the next steps are to rebuild.', 'Jennifer Doyle who must move back in with her own mom after being let go from her high-powered, six-figure salary job. With her teenage daughter in tow, Jennifer has to face her new life and figure out what the next steps are to rebuild.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6IttEAmBO5AOPpG7LCxv1KzyLcQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64884'),
