  ('154590919228683111', 'Jeremiah', 2002, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'J. Michael Straczynski', null, 'Luke Perry, Malcolm-Jamal Warner, Peter Stebbings, Sean Astin, Ingrid Kavelaars, Byron Lawson, Joanne Kelly', null, 'Jeremiah is an American television series starring Luke Perry and Malcolm-Jamal Warner that ran on the Showtime network from 2002 to 2004. The series takes place in a post-apocalyptic future where most of the adult population has been wiped out by a deadly virus.', 'Jeremiah is an American television series starring Luke Perry and Malcolm-Jamal Warner that ran on the Showtime network from 2002 to 2004. The series takes place in a post-apocalyptic future where most of the adult population has been wiped out by a deadly virus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yBaq79cbv8Lmhaa7ej3z6GOp9zK.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:184'),
