  ('1037461773717135356', 'John of God: The Crimes of a Spiritual Healer', 2021, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Andrea Mannelli, Rejane Araújo, Jardel Wagner, Norberto Kist, Angela Homercher, Luciano Miranda Meireles, Gabriela Manssur, Maria Helena Machado', 'TV-MA', 'Idolized medium João Teixeira de Faria rises to international fame before horrifying abuse is revealed by survivors, prosecutors and the press.', 'Idolized medium João Teixeira de Faria rises to international fame before horrifying abuse is revealed by survivors, prosecutors and the press.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pKZevLim2UYaWuvMuPnLtBfgEJq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130119'),
  ('425680419337087635', 'John Wayne Gacy: Devil in Disguise', 2021, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Terry Sullivan', 'TV-14', 'The chilling story of one of the world’s most notorious serial killers told through the words of Gacy himself, those who were forever changed by his unspeakable deeds and those who believe that the full truth remains concealed to this day.', 'The chilling story of one of the world’s most notorious serial killers told through the words of Gacy himself, those who were forever changed by his unspeakable deeds and those who believe that the full truth remains concealed to this day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LZHmVND6WyY0bhoLlyWPRl5Pa1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121718'),
  ('766556536791810800', 'Johnny Bravo', 1997, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Van Partible', null, 'Jeff Bennett, Brenda Vaccaro, Mae Whitman, Tom Kenny', 'TV-Y7', 'Johnny Bravo tells the story of a biceps-bulging, karate-chopping free spirit who believes he is a gift from God to the women of the earth. Unfortunately for Johnny, everyone else sees him as a narcissistic Mama''s boy with big muscles and even bigger hair. In short, he is the quintessential guy who ''just doesn''t get it.'' No matter what he does, or where he finds himself, he always winds up being his own worst enemy.', 'Johnny Bravo tells the story of a biceps-bulging, karate-chopping free spirit who believes he is a gift from God to the women of the earth. Unfortunately for Johnny, everyone else sees him as a narcissistic Mama''s boy with big muscles and even bigger hair. In short, he is the quintessential guy who ''just doesn''t get it.'' No matter what he does, or where he finds himself, he always winds up being his own worst enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obbdeoOk8XSXzJrWGiBbaeMMSMl.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2405'),
  ('796238979375475743', 'Johnny Test', 2005, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Scott Fellows', null, 'James Arnold Taylor, Maryke Hendrikse, Ashleigh Ball, Lee Tockar, Ian James Corlett, Trevor Devall, Kathleen Barr, Scott McNeil', 'TV-Y7', 'Young Johnny is gung-ho and full of courage. Johnny''s brainiac twin sisters, Susan and Mary, use Johnny as their guinea pig for their outrageous scientific experiments. If they can dream it up, Johnny will do it; as long as his genetically engineered super dog, Dukey, can come along.', 'Young Johnny is gung-ho and full of courage. Johnny''s brainiac twin sisters, Susan and Mary, use Johnny as their guinea pig for their outrageous scientific experiments. If they can dream it up, Johnny will do it; as long as his genetically engineered super dog, Dukey, can come along.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cGceNrHpUl3utUzE502xSY8l9ST.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:1769'),
  ('769535439694612941', 'Johnny Test', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Scott Fellows', null, 'James Arnold Taylor, Trevor Devall, Ashleigh Ball, Maryke Hendrikse', 'TV-Y', 'How much trouble could one imaginative boy, his faithful dog and two science-loving sisters possibly get into? Hmm, that sounds like a challenge!', 'How much trouble could one imaginative boy, his faithful dog and two science-loving sisters possibly get into? Hmm, that sounds like a challenge!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wSCaL6EF1QU5mVVc4IHAll0ROex.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:127753'),
  ('225871829264150162', 'Johnny vs Amber', 2021, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, 'Johnny Depp, Amber Heard', null, 'The tumultuous marriage and subsequent legal battle between Johnny Depp and Amber Heard will have both sides of the story told in Johnny vs Amber.', 'The tumultuous marriage and subsequent legal battle between Johnny Depp and Amber Heard will have both sides of the story told in Johnny vs Amber.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j3iMp21pdMVkDM1eQeu8jF95Lx3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:153170'),
  ('42218384525536674', 'Johnny vs Amber: The US Trial', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Johnny Depp, Amber Heard, Sasha Wass, Patrick Johnson, Vanessa Paradis, Traci Lords, Kate Moss, Pamela Romanowsky', null, 'Get the inside story on the trial that fascinated audiences across the globe. With intimate access to Depp''s lawyers as well as legal experts close to the case, Johnny vs Amber gives a forensic account of the bitter legal battle from both sides.', 'Get the inside story on the trial that fascinated audiences across the globe. With intimate access to Depp''s lawyers as well as legal experts close to the case, Johnny vs Amber gives a forensic account of the bitter legal battle from both sides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2j2ydvrI42sjZ501RTt3QAMrC0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210475'),
  ('34022911203340244', 'Join or Die with Craig Ferguson', 2016, 'Comedy, Talk', null, null, 'Craig Ferguson', 'TV-PG', 'Featuring comedian Craig Ferguson debating provocative and timely topics in his unorthodox and iconoclastic manner. Each episode features a panel of guests which will include celebrities, comedians and experts, as well as the American public through social media. History is back on the History Channel.', 'Featuring comedian Craig Ferguson debating provocative and timely topics in his unorthodox and iconoclastic manner. Each episode features a panel of guests which will include celebrities, comedians and experts, as well as the American public through social media. History is back on the History Channel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NZBqM4G73GQrTSj5czGxnH0wMH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65330'),
  ('1057126178003066012', 'Joint Venture', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Cauê Laratta, Marcelo Starobinas, Chico Mattoso', null, 'Luis Navarro, Daniel Furlan, Leilah Moreno, Gabriel Salazar, Jorge Neto, Maxx Oliveira, Gabriel Milane', 'TV-MA', 'Set in a fictional modern-day Sao Paulo, where marijuana has been legalized, this series follows 29-year-old Biriba, a drug dealer who decides to give up his criminal life and enter the legal drug sales industry. Unfortunately for Biriba, going straight is more difficult than he could have imagined.', 'Set in a fictional modern-day Sao Paulo, where marijuana has been legalized, this series follows 29-year-old Biriba, a drug dealer who decides to give up his criminal life and enter the legal drug sales industry. Unfortunately for Biriba, going straight is more difficult than he could have imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCLY9HHbqPesoElsQsABK2VwCau.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:91907'),
  ('567621682206739988', 'JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure', 1993, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Jurota Kosugi, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Chikao Ohtsuka, Katsuji Mori, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Nobuo Tanaka', 'TV-14', 'Jotaro Kujo is a popular high school student – at least until that day when he thinks he is possessed by a ghost, which is why he locks himself up. During a fight between his grandfather and his grandfather’s friend Muhammad Abdul, he notices that the ghost is his “Stand”, named "Star Platinium", his fighting aura. Later, his mother also gets such a “Stand” and thus falls ill. Jotaro learns that a man named Dio Brando, who was defeated by Jotaro’s great-great-grandfather a hundred years ago, is to blame. He joins his grandfather and Abdul to destroy Dio once and for all.', 'Jotaro Kujo is a popular high school student – at least until that day when he thinks he is possessed by a ghost, which is why he locks himself up. During a fight between his grandfather and his grandfather’s friend Muhammad Abdul, he notices that the ghost is his “Stand”, named "Star Platinium", his fighting aura. Later, his mother also gets such a “Stand” and thus falls ill. Jotaro learns that a man named Dio Brando, who was defeated by Jotaro’s great-great-grandfather a hundred years ago, is to blame. He joins his grandfather and Abdul to destroy Dio once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8PO6QwTuCQKucMAx72gREkWYwiF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:60862'),
  ('832364798274976462', 'JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure', 2012, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shogo Sakata, Yohei Azakami, Kaito Ishikawa, Rie Takahashi, Kenta Miyake', 'TV-MA', 'Follow the intergenerational feud between the Joestar Family and various forces of evil, the most prominent of which is Dio Brando and his followers.', 'Follow the intergenerational feud between the Joestar Family and various forces of evil, the most prominent of which is Dio Brando and his followers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogAWwbh3frWtiTyyXrZaVFtqCgp.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:45790'),
  ('256881500915994876', 'JOKER GAME', 2016, 'Drama, Animation, Mystery', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Taking place in the year 1937 on the eve of World War II, the story involves a mysterious spy training organization known as the "D Agency." The organization is established by Lieutenant Colonel Yuuki from the Imperial Japanese Army. His ideals lead him to recruit people beyond military academy graduates and personnel, while training them to become skilled agents in arts of manipulation. These agents would become a specialized team to conduct operations. One such antihero agent, under the name Jirou Gamou, goes on a harrowing mission to uncover secret documents titled "Black Notes," while battling forces from within and without his own ranks.', 'Taking place in the year 1937 on the eve of World War II, the story involves a mysterious spy training organization known as the "D Agency." The organization is established by Lieutenant Colonel Yuuki from the Imperial Japanese Army. His ideals lead him to recruit people beyond military academy graduates and personnel, while training them to become skilled agents in arts of manipulation. These agents would become a specialized team to conduct operations. One such antihero agent, under the name Jirou Gamou, goes on a harrowing mission to uncover secret documents titled "Black Notes," while battling forces from within and without his own ranks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mvFLm2y4N6Et5JOFsSb9nhKPcd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65949'),
  ('799615443751812589', 'Joko & Klaas gegen ProSieben', 2019, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Joko Winterscheidt, Klaas Heufer-Umlauf, Steven Gätjen', null, 'Joko and Klaas are teaming up against ProSieben. In this game show, the duo must duel against various team-ProSieben celebrities to gain an advantage in the final round. If Joko & Klaas emerge victorious, they can do whatever they want the following day for 15 minutes at 8:15pm, during prime time. If they lose the finale, their channel can decide on an adequate punishment - funny, embarrassing, or annoying.', 'Joko and Klaas are teaming up against ProSieben. In this game show, the duo must duel against various team-ProSieben celebrities to gain an advantage in the final round. If Joko & Klaas emerge victorious, they can do whatever they want the following day for 15 minutes at 8:15pm, during prime time. If they lose the finale, their channel can decide on an adequate punishment - funny, embarrassing, or annoying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/au4sRREFREWY5ltRkbCesGckbGV.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:89719'),
  ('579160783348625671', 'Joko Anwar''s Nightmares and Daydreams', 2024, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Joko Anwar', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Tales of supernatural sci-fi phenomena unfold in this collection of seven mind-bending, interconnected stories imagined by writer-director Joko Anwar.', 'Tales of supernatural sci-fi phenomena unfold in this collection of seven mind-bending, interconnected stories imagined by writer-director Joko Anwar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lEn6tQQzUPzXw0Jn2foySOaBM6F.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:228958'),
  ('547277878499942922', 'Joko Winterscheidt Presents: The World''s Most Dangerous Show', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Joko Winterscheidt', null, 'Joko Winterscheidt takes on one of humanity''s biggest challenges: the climate crisis. Joko reaches his limits on this journey, driven to despair by the state of the world. But he also meets people who are fighting for a better, more sustainable world and who give Joko hope.', 'Joko Winterscheidt takes on one of humanity''s biggest challenges: the climate crisis. Joko reaches his limits on this journey, driven to despair by the state of the world. But he also meets people who are fighting for a better, more sustainable world and who give Joko hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRfmw4aYhVd4x8GGxfbbuRubZ2s.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:227684'),
  ('27886334916525329', 'Jon & Kate Plus 8', 2007, 'Reality', 'Bill Hayes', null, 'Jon Gosselin, Kate Gosselin', 'TV-PG', 'With a set of twins AND a set of sextuplets, the Gosselins are hardly your typical American family! Jon and Kate are the parents of this adorable bunch, and they are battling all odds to make sure their brood has a normal, happy childhood.', 'With a set of twins AND a set of sextuplets, the Gosselins are hardly your typical American family! Jon and Kate are the parents of this adorable bunch, and they are battling all odds to make sure their brood has a normal, happy childhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c4nHUhKUxE41jTeyuSYYBhxKMkV.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:12551'),
  ('717884517772034221', 'Jon Benjamin Has a Van', 2011, 'Comedy', 'H. Jon Benjamin', null, 'H. Jon Benjamin, Leo Allen', null, 'Jon Benjamin Has a Van is a live-action television comedy series that aired in the summer of 2011 on Comedy Central. The series stars Jon Benjamin as a reporter who tours around in a van to deliver uninteresting news to the viewers and to unsuspecting people while utilizing scripted scenes for narrative reasons. The series'' cancellation was announced in April 2012. Special guests include Patton Oswalt, David Cross, Jon Glaser, Eric Wareheim, Tim Heidecker, Matt Walsh, Ian Roberts, Jay Johnston, Bob Odenkirk, Chloé Dumas, Jerry Minor, Andy Richter, Larry Murphy, Rich Fulcher, Chris Parnell, Brendon Small, and Metallica guitarist Kirk Hammett.', 'Jon Benjamin Has a Van is a live-action television comedy series that aired in the summer of 2011 on Comedy Central. The series stars Jon Benjamin as a reporter who tours around in a van to deliver uninteresting news to the viewers and to unsuspecting people while utilizing scripted scenes for narrative reasons. The series'' cancellation was announced in April 2012. Special guests include Patton Oswalt, David Cross, Jon Glaser, Eric Wareheim, Tim Heidecker, Matt Walsh, Ian Roberts, Jay Johnston, Bob Odenkirk, Chloé Dumas, Jerry Minor, Andy Richter, Larry Murphy, Rich Fulcher, Chris Parnell, Brendon Small, and Metallica guitarist Kirk Hammett.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3epRDwLQZxF2CB8PTRuTaprtTZx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39522'),
  ('131331333734968205', 'Jon blir bonde', 2025, 'Reality', null, null, 'Jon Almaas, Ellen Christin Heider', null, 'Jon Almaas and his wife Ellen''s dream of moving to a farm becomes reality, but life as a farmer becomes tougher than Jon had expected.', 'Jon Almaas and his wife Ellen''s dream of moving to a farm becomes reality, but life as a farmer becomes tougher than Jon had expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jax2VagatQd3XcRXPIBG0WnYUcS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:282483'),
  ('412289680507707664', 'Jonah From Tonga', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Chris Lilley', 'Chris Lilley', 'Chris Lilley, Tama Tauali''i, Jason Moleli, Lafaele Tauali''i, Tana Laasia, Eigaiwe Hunt, Doug Bowles', 'TV-14', 'Fourteen year old breakdancer and mischievous delinquent, Jonah Takalua, returns from Tonga to start a new life at Holy Cross High School. Dominating the playground with his gang Fobba-licious, amusing himself with endless filfthy jokes and a schoolyard rivalry with the Rangas, Jonah challenges the school system, getting himself into more trouble than ever before.', 'Fourteen year old breakdancer and mischievous delinquent, Jonah Takalua, returns from Tonga to start a new life at Holy Cross High School. Dominating the playground with his gang Fobba-licious, amusing himself with endless filfthy jokes and a schoolyard rivalry with the Rangas, Jonah challenges the school system, getting himself into more trouble than ever before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jj2kHoKOoLqwPkspckHo5EvdJi0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61011'),
  ('160162836814263013', 'JONAS L.A.', 2009, 'Comedy, Family, Kids', 'Roger S.H. Schulman', null, 'Kevin Jonas, Joe Jonas, Nick Jonas, Chelsea Kane, Nicole Gale Anderson', 'TV-G', 'Brothers Kevin, Joe and Nick Lucas are global rock stars — the band JONAS! When the trio aren''t on tour, the guys live in New Jersey on Jonas Street (the inspiration for the band''s name) with their parents, Tom and Sandy, and little brother Frankie. They attend Horace Mantis Academy with their childhood friend Stella Malone, who offers the boys endless style tips, and her best friend, star athlete Macy Misa.', 'Brothers Kevin, Joe and Nick Lucas are global rock stars — the band JONAS! When the trio aren''t on tour, the guys live in New Jersey on Jonas Street (the inspiration for the band''s name) with their parents, Tom and Sandy, and little brother Frankie. They attend Horace Mantis Academy with their childhood friend Stella Malone, who offers the boys endless style tips, and her best friend, star athlete Macy Misa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEsIQerKBbhFq8XIfktCv6EsDgm.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:12712'),
  ('103409024048594187', 'Jonathan Creek', 1997, 'Mystery, Comedy, Drama', 'David Renwick', null, 'Alan Davies, Sarah Alexander', null, 'Working from his home in a converted windmill, Jonathan Creek is a magician with a natural ability for solving puzzles. He soon puts this ability to the use of solving impossible crimes and mysterious murders.', 'Working from his home in a converted windmill, Jonathan Creek is a magician with a natural ability for solving puzzles. He soon puts this ability to the use of solving impossible crimes and mysterious murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yvBej2dWaOBTVVJkdnPxoMX75aD.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1895'),
  ('102238966107675718', 'Jonathan Strange & Mr Norrell', 2015, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Peter Harness', null, 'Bertie Carvel, Eddie Marsan, Marc Warren, Charlotte Riley, Alice Englert, Samuel West, Enzo Cilenti, Paul Kaye', 'TV-14', 'With magic long since lost to England, two men are destined to bring it back; the reclusive Mr. Norrell and daring novice Jonathan Strange. So begins a dangerous battle between two great minds.', 'With magic long since lost to England, two men are destined to bring it back; the reclusive Mr. Norrell and daring novice Jonathan Strange. So begins a dangerous battle between two great minds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aq6aqgHo3nzRTT84kV7DrJ8Ifyc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62717'),
  ('915050001537924763', 'Jonestown: Terror in the Jungle', 2018, 'Documentary, Crime, News', null, null, 'Jim Jones', 'TV-14', 'Documentary series that examines the Jonestown Massacre 40 years later.', 'Documentary series that examines the Jonestown Massacre 40 years later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/65AgYe3PH28vfodfdxNX7ihvmhd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83737'),
  ('643270013446268863', 'Jonny Quest', 1964, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', 'Doug Wildey, Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'Tim Matheson, Mike Road, Danny Bravo, Don Messick', null, 'The adventures of the 10-year-old son of a government scientist.', 'The adventures of the 10-year-old son of a government scientist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2KUXlkfGdUz8wKir0gznnXymsh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:962'),
  ('654105096896396331', 'Joran: The Princess of Snow and Blood', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Suzuko Mimori, Shouta Aoi, Raychell, Ayasa Ito, Chikahiro Kobayashi', 'TV-MA', 'The year is 1931. Prince Tokugawa Yoshinobu holds absolute control over Japan. Remnants of the Meiji era’s culture can be seen around the city, but scientific technology and Japanese esoteric cosmology Onmyodo are also developing. Yet lurking behind the glitz is Kuchinawa, a dissident group planning the assassination of the prince. Tasked to extinguish these dissidents is Nue, the government’s secret executioner group. Sawa Yukimura, who works for this organization, suffered at the hands of the Kuchinawa boss. Her entire family was murdered and she dedicated her life to avenging their death.', 'The year is 1931. Prince Tokugawa Yoshinobu holds absolute control over Japan. Remnants of the Meiji era’s culture can be seen around the city, but scientific technology and Japanese esoteric cosmology Onmyodo are also developing. Yet lurking behind the glitz is Kuchinawa, a dissident group planning the assassination of the prince. Tasked to extinguish these dissidents is Nue, the government’s secret executioner group. Sawa Yukimura, who works for this organization, suffered at the hands of the Kuchinawa boss. Her entire family was murdered and she dedicated her life to avenging their death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvM2DRD7QXMb15VM5HTcPj81o2C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117945'),
  ('1023517031303568834', 'Jordskott', 2015, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Henrik Björn', 'Henrik Björn', 'Moa Gammel, Göran Ragnerstam, Ann Petrén, Hans Mosesson, Elina Du Rietz', null, 'Detective Inspector Eva Thörnblad returns to Silver Height seven years after her daughter Josefine disappeared by a lake in the woods. The body was never found and the girl was believed to have drowned. Now a boy has vanished without a trace and Thörnblad wants to find out if there is a link to her daughter''s disappearance. At the same time , she will take care of the legacy of her father, the great entrepreneur Johan Thörnblad, who built an empire of timber and timber processing on the large forest owned by his ancestors. As the plot deepens more children are kidnapped and what initially seems like a police drama takes a more sinister and stranger twist with each episode.', 'Detective Inspector Eva Thörnblad returns to Silver Height seven years after her daughter Josefine disappeared by a lake in the woods. The body was never found and the girl was believed to have drowned. Now a boy has vanished without a trace and Thörnblad wants to find out if there is a link to her daughter''s disappearance. At the same time , she will take care of the legacy of her father, the great entrepreneur Johan Thörnblad, who built an empire of timber and timber processing on the large forest owned by his ancestors. As the plot deepens more children are kidnapped and what initially seems like a police drama takes a more sinister and stranger twist with each episode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Qg4FsXXJSA9tyyjAJNRJeypF51.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62097'),
  ('563502505677367324', 'Jorel''s Brother', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Drama', 'Juliano Enrico', null, 'Andrei Duarte, Juliano Enrico, Hugo Picchi Neto, César Marchetti, Tânia Gaidarji, Melissa Garcia, Cecília Lemes', 'NR', 'This Brazilian TV show tells the story of young Jorel''s Brother daily life, including dealing with his family, school and friends.', 'This Brazilian TV show tells the story of young Jorel''s Brother daily life, including dealing with his family, school and friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkH0kJj4qTCKV2gH2lrDH6AHW03.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:74606'),
  ('497504668506696044', 'Jormungand', 2012, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Shizuka Itoh, Mutsumi Tamura, Sayaka Ohara, Unsho Ishizuka, Ami Koshimizu, Hitoshi Yanai, Go Shinomiya', 'TV-MA', 'Jonah is a child soldier and the newest bodyguard for Koko, an international arms dealer with an entourage of hired guns. The cold-blooded kid hates Koko’s line of work, but following her into the darkest corners of the black market might be the only way he can find those responsible for his family’s slaughter. Besides, his employer isn’t like most merchants of death. She uses guile and cutthroat tactics to keep her clients armed to the teeth—all while cultivating her own warped plan for the future of world peace. With the CIA desperate for her capture, assassins eager to collect her head, and the potential for every contract to end in ultra-violence, Koko and her comrades in arms bring the boom to every corner of the world.', 'Jonah is a child soldier and the newest bodyguard for Koko, an international arms dealer with an entourage of hired guns. The cold-blooded kid hates Koko’s line of work, but following her into the darkest corners of the black market might be the only way he can find those responsible for his family’s slaughter. Besides, his employer isn’t like most merchants of death. She uses guile and cutthroat tactics to keep her clients armed to the teeth—all while cultivating her own warped plan for the future of world peace. With the CIA desperate for her capture, assassins eager to collect her head, and the potential for every contract to end in ultra-violence, Koko and her comrades in arms bring the boom to every corner of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2v886zu4uziTmmtjRWXaWjf1QeU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:46279'),
  ('680961952386603826', 'Jose Jose: The Prince of Song', 2018, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Jorge Jimenez', null, 'Alejandro de la Madrid, Axel Arenas, Rosa María Bianchi, Saúl Hernández, Adriana Parra, Itatí Cantoral, Pedro de Tavira, María Fernanda Yepes', 'TV-14', 'This is the fictionalized life story of the international singing legend "José José", the man known in the entertainment world as El Príncipe de la Canción (The Prince of Song). Featuring his stunning vocals, turbulent past, and world-wide popularity, this drama series is a homage to a true icon of Latin pop music. During his 40-year love affair with the music industry, José gained international fame, sold millions of records, received several Grammy nominations, and even sold out Madison Square Garden and the Radio City Music Hall. His musical notes have become the melody of the romantics in Spanish speaking countries around the world.', 'This is the fictionalized life story of the international singing legend "José José", the man known in the entertainment world as El Príncipe de la Canción (The Prince of Song). Featuring his stunning vocals, turbulent past, and world-wide popularity, this drama series is a homage to a true icon of Latin pop music. During his 40-year love affair with the music industry, José gained international fame, sold millions of records, received several Grammy nominations, and even sold out Madison Square Garden and the Radio City Music Hall. His musical notes have become the melody of the romantics in Spanish speaking countries around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSq9jBmQFF5CyrCycG9kMXppATn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76541'),
  ('581023445432303346', 'Joseon Attorney: A Morality', 2023, 'Drama', null, 'Choi Jin-young', 'Woo Do-hwan, Bona, Cha Hak-yeon, Cheon Ho-jin, Song Geon-hee, Lee Doo-seok, Choi Hyeon-jin, Lee Go-eun', null, 'Set in the Joseon era, an exhilarating legal revenge of a lawyer who avenges the death of his parents by trial begins.', 'Set in the Joseon era, an exhilarating legal revenge of a lawyer who avenges the death of his parents by trial begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r9s6F4IgFyPyjSh7n7wGMRO6Mp0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:206715'),
  ('766383240376131719', 'Joseon Exorcist', 2021, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Park Kye-ok', 'Kam Woo-sung, Jang Dong-yoon, Park Sung-hoon, Jung Hye-sung, Lee Yu-bi, Keum Sae-rok, Kim Dong-jun, Seo Young-hee', null, 'A fantasy-action sageuk that takes place after the establishment of the Joseon dynasty and tells the story of the undead who come back to life after being killed by the royal family. ~~ The series was cancelled after two episodes.', 'A fantasy-action sageuk that takes place after the establishment of the Joseon dynasty and tells the story of the undead who come back to life after being killed by the royal family. ~~ The series was cancelled after two episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z9Q1ldFc1OpCq3G5LulYmnvnFYd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113624'),
