  ('769967970586866138', 'Kazama Kimichika: Kyojo Zero', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Isamu Nakae, Kazuhiro Nishioka', 'Ryôichi Kimizuka, Nonji Nemoto', 'Takuya Kimura, Mayu Hotta, Takahiro Hamada, Kousei Yuki', null, 'The mystery of how Kazama Kimichika became so ruthless and unmatched will be revealed. Kyojo Zero depicts the time before he was assigned to the police academy, when he was working as an instructor in charge of training new detectives...', 'The mystery of how Kazama Kimichika became so ruthless and unmatched will be revealed. Kyojo Zero depicts the time before he was assigned to the police academy, when he was working as an instructor in charge of training new detectives...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dizt74h55byxyWIW2LRAGzOVGW3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:224260'),
