  ('609305794925154312', 'Killjoys', 2015, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'M. A. Lovretta', null, 'Hannah John-Kamen, Aaron Ashmore, Luke Macfarlane, Rob Stewart, Tamsen McDonough', 'TV-MA', 'An action-packed adventure series following a fun-loving, hard living trio of interplanetary bounty hunters (a.k.a. Killjoys) sworn to remain impartial as they chase deadly warrants around the Quad, a system of planets on the brink of revolution.', 'An action-packed adventure series following a fun-loving, hard living trio of interplanetary bounty hunters (a.k.a. Killjoys) sworn to remain impartial as they chase deadly warrants around the Quad, a system of planets on the brink of revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xnQ7WVAxlk9UAVWDLDeYGTKRaOf.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:62413'),
