  ('1040840377997521857', 'Kong: King of the Apes', 2016, 'Animation, Kids', 'Avi Arad, Allen Bohbot', null, 'Shannon Chan-Kent, Lee Tockar, Kathleen Barr, Alessandro Juliani, Sam Vincent', 'TV-Y7', 'Set in 2050, Kong becomes a wanted fugitive after wrecking havoc at Alcatraz Island’s Natural History and Marine Preserve. What most humans on the hunt for the formidable animal don’t realize, though, is that Kong was framed by an evil genius who plans to terrorize the world with an army of enormous robotic dinosaurs. As the only beast strong enough to save humanity from the mechanical dinos, Kong must rely on the help of three kids who know the truth about him.', 'Set in 2050, Kong becomes a wanted fugitive after wrecking havoc at Alcatraz Island’s Natural History and Marine Preserve. What most humans on the hunt for the formidable animal don’t realize, though, is that Kong was framed by an evil genius who plans to terrorize the world with an army of enormous robotic dinosaurs. As the only beast strong enough to save humanity from the mechanical dinos, Kong must rely on the help of three kids who know the truth about him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38jPKCkM9tc363W2kT8SOzC4lfL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66248'),
  ('925284233663196090', 'Kono Oto Tomare!: Sounds of Life', 2019, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Yuma Uchida, Junya Enoki, Atsumi Tanezaki, Haruki Ishiya, Yuichi Iguchi, Makoto Furukawa, Sara Matsumoto, Daisuke Namikawa', 'TV-PG', 'Since the graduation of the senior members of the club, Takezou ends up being the sole member of the "Koto" (traditional Japanese string instrument) club. Now that the new school year has begun, Takezou will have to seek out new members into the club, or the club will become terminated. Out of nowhere, a new member barges into the near-abandoned club room, demanding to join the club. How will Takezou be able to keep his club alive and deal with this rascal of a new member?', 'Since the graduation of the senior members of the club, Takezou ends up being the sole member of the "Koto" (traditional Japanese string instrument) club. Now that the new school year has begun, Takezou will have to seek out new members into the club, or the club will become terminated. Out of nowhere, a new member barges into the near-abandoned club room, demanding to join the club. How will Takezou be able to keep his club alive and deal with this rascal of a new member?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Iro3QEDkPsqPNrA9UWhFUAgNOM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85843'),
  ('533735013278998713', 'Konohana Kitan', 2017, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuko Ono, Risa Kubota, Manami Numakura, Ai Kakuma, Sawako Hata, Ayaka Suwa', 'TV-14', 'Konohana Kitan is the heartwarming story of a new apprentice named Yuzu, and the other fox girls who work at a hot spring hotel called Konohatei. The staff at Konohatei live by one belief: no matter who one may truly be, no matter what, anyone who is a guest is a god. Of course, that includes you. Let the hospitality of Yuzu and the Konohatei heal your tired soul.', 'Konohana Kitan is the heartwarming story of a new apprentice named Yuzu, and the other fox girls who work at a hot spring hotel called Konohatei. The staff at Konohatei live by one belief: no matter who one may truly be, no matter what, anyone who is a guest is a god. Of course, that includes you. Let the hospitality of Yuzu and the Konohatei heal your tired soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpsPIS6vUJ9GfebwJHMIAcGz2B3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74098'),
  ('182643064092907645', 'KONOSUBA - God''s blessing on this wonderful world!', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Jun Fukushima, Sora Amamiya, Rie Takahashi, Ai Kayano', 'TV-14', 'After a traffic accident, Kazuma Sato’s disappointingly brief life was supposed to be over, but he wakes up to see a beautiful girl before him. She claims to be a goddess, Aqua, and asks if he would like to go to another world and bring only one thing with him. Kazuma decides to bring the goddess herself, and they are transported to a fantasy world filled with adventure, ruled by a demon king. Now Kazuma only wants to live in peace, but Aqua wants to solve many of this world’s problems, and the demon king will only turn a blind eye for so long…', 'After a traffic accident, Kazuma Sato’s disappointingly brief life was supposed to be over, but he wakes up to see a beautiful girl before him. She claims to be a goddess, Aqua, and asks if he would like to go to another world and bring only one thing with him. Kazuma decides to bring the goddess herself, and they are transported to a fantasy world filled with adventure, ruled by a demon king. Now Kazuma only wants to live in peace, but Aqua wants to solve many of this world’s problems, and the demon king will only turn a blind eye for so long…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oRaOeQlwktbGSd2T31FYAcgHZlh.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:65844'),
  ('23194203413139008', 'KONOSUBA – An Explosion on This Wonderful World!', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Rie Takahashi, Aki Toyosaki, Maria Naganawa, Kaori Nazuka, Miyu Tomita, Sayumi Suzushiro, Shizuka Ishigami, Hitomi Nabatame', 'TV-14', 'This feisty young wizard will stop at nothing to master the spell that saved her life: Explosion! Megumin, the “Greatest Genius of the Crimson Magic Clan,” has chosen to devote her studies to the powerful offensive magic used by her mysterious savior. Then one day, her little sister finds a black kitten in the woods. But this cat isn’t just a new furry friend—she’s the key to awakening a Dark God!', 'This feisty young wizard will stop at nothing to master the spell that saved her life: Explosion! Megumin, the “Greatest Genius of the Crimson Magic Clan,” has chosen to devote her studies to the powerful offensive magic used by her mysterious savior. Then one day, her little sister finds a black kitten in the woods. But this cat isn’t just a new furry friend—she’s the key to awakening a Dark God!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/68rh8l8RaGujTDF6k87yykxixIy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203040'),
  ('78818779504487125', 'Konstantinos and Helen', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Charis Romas, Anna Hatzisofia', 'Anna Hatzisofia, Charis Romas', 'Eleni Randou, Charis Romas, Maria Lekaki, Kallirroi Miriagkou, Stergios Nenes, Vasilis Koukouras', null, 'Eleni and Konstantinos are two totally different people who are forced to live under the same roof, because they are in the middle of the proceedings of a trial, regarding the ownership of the house. Konstantinos is a strict university professor, while Eleni is a crazy girl who works at a bar. Their different characters put them in constant conflict, but does this mean that they really hate each other?', 'Eleni and Konstantinos are two totally different people who are forced to live under the same roof, because they are in the middle of the proceedings of a trial, regarding the ownership of the house. Konstantinos is a strict university professor, while Eleni is a crazy girl who works at a bar. Their different characters put them in constant conflict, but does this mean that they really hate each other?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4mVrM70wTHEST7UmucdZBgoO6J8.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:15247'),
  ('123630731390087079', 'Konuşanlar', 2020, 'Comedy, Talk', 'Hasan Can Kaya', null, 'Hasan Can Kaya', null, 'This chat show is very different from what you have seen in the past. Every person has a different story, every story has a different side. Hasan Can Kaya first chooses the speakers and then the fun increases with interesting questions.', 'This chat show is very different from what you have seen in the past. Every person has a different story, every story has a different side. Hasan Can Kaya first chooses the speakers and then the fun increases with interesting questions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hIedtfjRs8XByRl9Tnur6WkoLuw.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:115641'),
