  ('1118683143469261592', 'La CQ', 2012, 'Comedy, Family', 'Pedro Ortiz de Pinedo', 'Juanba Berasategi', 'Emiliano Flores, Alejandra Müller, Harold Azuara, Benny Emmanuel, Fernanda Urdapilleta, Ferny Graciano, Jocelin Zuckerman, Luis Fernando Ceballos', 'TV-PG', 'La CQ is about 8 students named Angel, Monche, Beto, Clara, Adri, Roque, Jenny and, Danny. They are in secondary and our going through ups and downs which include bullies, love, assignments and it shows how the kids are like in secondary school', 'La CQ is about 8 students named Angel, Monche, Beto, Clara, Adri, Roque, Jenny and, Danny. They are in secondary and our going through ups and downs which include bullies, love, assignments and it shows how the kids are like in secondary school', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3R3sTrIMOp6hOGlRUprEfXhP8X.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:107171'),
  ('945772617009898194', 'La CQ: Nuevo ingreso', 2024, 'Family, Kids, Comedy', 'Pedro Ortiz de Pinedo', null, 'Nicolás Pindas, Tania Nicole, Nico Villagrana, José María Nieto, Mayte Fernández, Sammy Schoulund, Leo Pérez Torreblanca, Abril Tayabas Vela', null, 'After twelve years, Constantino Quijano High School opens its doors to new students; a new generation is ready to start classes. What adventures will this new school year bring us?', 'After twelve years, Constantino Quijano High School opens its doors to new students; a new generation is ready to start classes. What adventures will this new school year bring us?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qxkHlqZ9gslwyeBrk6c1xLyIVuW.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:278631'),
  ('1016987885195385258', 'La Dernière Vague', 2019, 'Drama', 'Alexis Le Sec, Raphaëlle Roudaut', 'Raphaëlle Roudaut, Alexis Le Sec, Sophie Hiet', 'David Kammenos, Marie Dompnier, Lola Dewaere, Arnaud Binard, Isabel Otero, Guillaume Cramoisan, Roberto Calvet, Théo Christine', 'TV-14', 'In Brizan, a peaceful seaside resort in the Landes, everything changes with the arrival of a first Wave : a surge of clouds which will cause the disappearance of surfers. The first in a series of phenomena that the inhabitants of this small community will be confronted with, disrupting their intimate lives.', 'In Brizan, a peaceful seaside resort in the Landes, everything changes with the arrival of a first Wave : a surge of clouds which will cause the disappearance of surfers. The first in a series of phenomena that the inhabitants of this small community will be confronted with, disrupting their intimate lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rotEG9byDndTY52Wz6dLF7hGWyk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87776'),
  ('34146501825185324', 'La desalmada', 2021, 'Soap, Drama', 'Ximena Suárez, José Alberto Castro, Julián Aguilar', null, 'Livia Brito Pestana, José Ron, Kimberly Dos Ramos, Marjorie de Sousa, Marlene Favela, Eduardo Santamarina, Macarena Miguel, Gaby Mellado', 'TV-14', 'Fernanda Linares (Livia Brito) is a woman thirsty for revenge after the murder of her husband on their wedding night, where in addition, Fernanda was a victim of rape after the event occurred. However, Fernanda''s life will change when she meets Rafael Toscano (José Ron), a handsome young man who recently just received his university degree with whom she will empathize and return to Fernanda the opportunity to love again.', 'Fernanda Linares (Livia Brito) is a woman thirsty for revenge after the murder of her husband on their wedding night, where in addition, Fernanda was a victim of rape after the event occurred. However, Fernanda''s life will change when she meets Rafael Toscano (José Ron), a handsome young man who recently just received his university degree with whom she will empathize and return to Fernanda the opportunity to love again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f7s3EsUtq0ZBH2pEhqxLa446IkQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128794'),
  ('1028096098661192027', 'La Diosa Coronada', null, 'Drama', null, null, null, null, 'Raquel Santamaría is a beautiful woman who gets ahead through her looks, ambition and strong personality. Raquel manages to enter a beauty contest - and win. While there, she meets Genaro, who introduces her to the drug trafficking business. Raquel becomes a powerful narco, and in no time, Raquel´s wealth is such that people call her “La Diosa Coronada” (The Crowned Goddess).', 'Raquel Santamaría is a beautiful woman who gets ahead through her looks, ambition and strong personality. Raquel manages to enter a beauty contest - and win. While there, she meets Genaro, who introduces her to the drug trafficking business. Raquel becomes a powerful narco, and in no time, Raquel´s wealth is such that people call her “La Diosa Coronada” (The Crowned Goddess).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVCDpRVPSt8punqOHpasZv6ewTc.jpg', 0, 'tmdb:tv:33219'),
  ('782433345410726433', 'La divina comida', 2016, 'Reality', null, null, 'Jani Dueñas', 'NR', 'Four celebrities invite each other to their homes and compete to be the best host, where night after night they must cook for the other guests, who in turn will be both the judges and their rivals.', 'Four celebrities invite each other to their homes and compete to be the best host, where night after night they must cook for the other guests, who in turn will be both the judges and their rivals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zjIflWNpZESUu2Bpx0op1Ogj7KI.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:96317'),
  ('963575700780590408', 'La doble vida de Estela Carrillo', 2017, 'Soap, Drama', 'Rosy Ocampo, Rodrigo Hernandez, Florencio Zavala', null, 'Ariadne Díaz, David Zepeda, África Zavala, Danilo Carrera, Erika Buenfil, Alejandro Tommasi, Zaide Silvia Gutiérrez, Vanessa Bauche', 'NR', 'After witnessing a murder, single mother Estela Carrillo must hide the fact that she is an undocumented immigrant escaping a dark past. While hiding her secret, romantic interests and her dream of becoming a singer complicate her plans.', 'After witnessing a murder, single mother Estela Carrillo must hide the fact that she is an undocumented immigrant escaping a dark past. While hiding her secret, romantic interests and her dream of becoming a singer complicate her plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lzPPH7s0szdPOt7mqycLbLs8yyf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77568'),
  ('26615085948884440', 'La Doña', 2016, 'Drama, Soap', 'Carlos Villegas Rosales', 'Perla Farías', 'Aracely Arámbula, Andrea Martí, Carlos Ponce, David Zepeda, Marisela González, Claudio Roca, Jose Maria Galeano, Leo Deluglio', 'TV-14', 'A story of revenge and ambition, seduction and betrayal; all told from the perspective of an offended and abused woman named Altagracia. Altagracia represents the hundreds of thousands of Mexican women who have been victims of the violence by faceless men who are protected by impunity. But Altagracia, transformed into a strong-willed, ruthless man-eater known as La Doña, will seek out each and every one of these men to bring them to justice.', 'A story of revenge and ambition, seduction and betrayal; all told from the perspective of an offended and abused woman named Altagracia. Altagracia represents the hundreds of thousands of Mexican women who have been victims of the violence by faceless men who are protected by impunity. But Altagracia, transformed into a strong-willed, ruthless man-eater known as La Doña, will seek out each and every one of these men to bring them to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPe11sREBZIPUB1SnwckuElru1h.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:68878'),
