  ('1110989284463388497', 'LA Ink', 2007, 'Reality', null, null, 'Kat Von D', 'TV-PG', 'LA Ink is an American reality show on TLC that followed the events of the High Voltage Tattoo tattoo studios in Los Angeles, California. The spin-off of TLC''s Miami Ink, it premiered on August 7, 2007. In August 2011, TLC announced that the show will end production, with Season 4 being its last and that the series is cancelled.', 'LA Ink is an American reality show on TLC that followed the events of the High Voltage Tattoo tattoo studios in Los Angeles, California. The spin-off of TLC''s Miami Ink, it premiered on August 7, 2007. In August 2011, TLC announced that the show will end production, with Season 4 being its last and that the series is cancelled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UZyb4QznF5l9e5HRonArfNTGrR.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:13162'),
  ('909392949750282983', 'La Isla de las Tentaciones', 2020, 'Reality', 'Meritxell Estruch', null, null, null, 'Five couples at a critical moment in their relationship search for the answer to the big question: Are they made for each other? The participants will live apart but they will not be alone. They will live with ten single men and ten single women who want to find love. When this experience is over, they will have to decide how they want to return home: with their partner, alone or with their new love.', 'Five couples at a critical moment in their relationship search for the answer to the big question: Are they made for each other? The participants will live apart but they will not be alone. They will live with ten single men and ten single women who want to find love. When this experience is over, they will have to decide how they want to return home: with their partner, alone or with their new love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5UNSRQc1ZCVmkDxi9llNqrUudYt.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:95676'),
  ('561617307686699941', 'La isla de las tentaciones: Argentina & Chile', 2024, 'Reality', null, null, 'Florencia Peña, Benjamín Vicuña', null, 'Dive into the thrilling journey of "Temptation Island: Argentina & Chile". Four couples embark on an island in the Gulf of Mexico to challenge the limits of their love. With Florencia Peña and Benjamín Vicuña as hosts, they''ll confront doubts, jealousy, and infidelities. Can the couples flirt with temptation without succumbing to it or will they be swayed by the exhilarating call of the forbidden?', 'Dive into the thrilling journey of "Temptation Island: Argentina & Chile". Four couples embark on an island in the Gulf of Mexico to challenge the limits of their love. With Florencia Peña and Benjamín Vicuña as hosts, they''ll confront doubts, jealousy, and infidelities. Can the couples flirt with temptation without succumbing to it or will they be swayed by the exhilarating call of the forbidden?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qVm318VCBSNxoMLJgEnyr8mdZYj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:258976'),
  ('89247877311855210', 'La Jauría', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', 'Sergio Castro San Martín, Enrique Videla', null, 'María Gracia Omegna, Antonia Zegers, Daniela Vega, Paula Luchsinger, Luis Gnecco, Claudia di Girólamo, Clemente Rodríguez, Marcela Salinas', 'TV-MA', 'Blanca, student leader of the feminist movement in an occupied school, goes missing: hours later, a video of a group raping the girl goes viral. In their aim to find her, a police squad formed by three women puts their lives and that of their families at risk. As they look for Blanca and investigate, they will find out that behind this gender crime there is much more than just one offender.', 'Blanca, student leader of the feminist movement in an occupied school, goes missing: hours later, a video of a group raping the girl goes viral. In their aim to find her, a police squad formed by three women puts their lives and that of their families at risk. As they look for Blanca and investigate, they will find out that behind this gender crime there is much more than just one offender.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRZX9p0miSsBVV7eBgH0HSjnmE2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:104819'),
  ('1003416420613181237', 'La Jefa', 2025, 'Crime, Drama, Soap', 'José Vicente Spataro', null, 'Fabiola Guajardo, Iván Arana, Dante Aguiar, Cristián de la Fuente, Andrés Almeida, Azela Robinson, Verónica Merchant, Jose Maria Galeano', null, 'Gloria''s perfect life shatters when hitmen kill her fiancé at their wedding. Abandoned by family, pursued by enemies, and stripped of assets, she must enter the money laundering world to protect her son.', 'Gloria''s perfect life shatters when hitmen kill her fiancé at their wedding. Abandoned by family, pursued by enemies, and stripped of assets, she must enter the money laundering world to protect her son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5PpqPl6OPonNNet7dxCOxXCxkst.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:284219'),
  ('828743375942940958', 'La jefa del Campeón', 2018, 'Drama', 'Héctor Rodríguez, Alejandro Torres', null, 'África Zavala, Carlos Ferro, Enrique Arrizon, Vanessa Bauche, Dagoberto Gama, José Carlos Rodríguez, Claudia Ramírez, Marisol del Olmo', 'TV-14', 'A spirited, humble woman named Tita vows to do everything she can to make her son Rey''s dream of becoming a professional soccer player come true.', 'A spirited, humble woman named Tita vows to do everything she can to make her son Rey''s dream of becoming a professional soccer player come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZnuNln2lWUZjZ4nXBwUS3G3cqO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97064'),
  ('832565237146921192', 'La Job', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Stephen Merchant, Ricky Gervais, Anne-Marie Losique', null, 'Sophie Cadieux, Paul Ahmarani, Antoine Vézina, Sébastien Huberdeau', null, 'La Job is a French Canadian comedy television series set in Montreal. It is an adaptation of the British show The Office of the BBC. Produced by Anne-Marie Losique''s Image Diffusion International, it has been broadcast for a limited number of viewers on Bell TV satellite television, beginning on October 9, 2006. It was later seen by a wider audience on the public broadcaster Radio-Canada and specialty channel ARTV. It is the third official foreign adaptation of the concept, and the second in a language other than English.', 'La Job is a French Canadian comedy television series set in Montreal. It is an adaptation of the British show The Office of the BBC. Produced by Anne-Marie Losique''s Image Diffusion International, it has been broadcast for a limited number of viewers on Bell TV satellite television, beginning on October 9, 2006. It was later seen by a wider audience on the public broadcaster Radio-Canada and specialty channel ARTV. It is the third official foreign adaptation of the concept, and the second in a language other than English.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/heOhqAyj2L64R2HuFZmEay7zqoj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5'),
  ('221015231249259626', 'La Linea', 1978, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Osvaldo Cavandoli', null, 'Carlo Bonomi, Osvaldo Cavandoli', null, 'Features a man known as "Mr. Linea" drawn as a single outline of an infinite line, which encounters various obstacles during his walking, and often turns to the cartoonist, represented as a live-action hand holding a pencil, to draw him a solution. All episodes are short subjects, ranging from 2:30 to 6:40 in runtime.', 'Features a man known as "Mr. Linea" drawn as a single outline of an infinite line, which encounters various obstacles during his walking, and often turns to the cartoonist, represented as a live-action hand holding a pencil, to draw him a solution. All episodes are short subjects, ranging from 2:30 to 6:40 in runtime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzIBm3qZvWY9jomjR7Qt8pPewOH.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:12516'),
  ('208714800362504818', 'La Línea: Shadow of Narco', 2020, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Juan Franco', 'TV-MA', 'Go inside La Línea, the Spanish beach town turned into Europe''s drug trafficking hub, and meet the law enforcement officials determined to change that.', 'Go inside La Línea, the Spanish beach town turned into Europe''s drug trafficking hub, and meet the law enforcement officials determined to change that.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dcIe7ec0NnFARQVsQhfV6BHhab0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107904'),
  ('370832474920193670', 'La Loba', 2010, 'Drama, Soap, Documentary', 'Bethel Flores', null, 'Mauricio Islas, Ivonne Montero, Regina Torné, Omar Fierro, Gabriela Roel, Anna Ciocchetti, Patricia Bernal, Rossana Najera', 'TV-PG', 'La Loba is a Mexican telenovela by TV Azteca. It premiered on 2010. The protagonists are the international stars Ivonne Montero and Mauricio Islas. Grand actors such as Regina Torne, Omar Fierro, Ana Ciochetti, Fernando Becerril and Marta Aura also included as cast members. In the final 2 weeks, episodes are halved to give way to Maricarmen''s new telenovela, Entre el Amor y el Deseo', 'La Loba is a Mexican telenovela by TV Azteca. It premiered on 2010. The protagonists are the international stars Ivonne Montero and Mauricio Islas. Grand actors such as Regina Torne, Omar Fierro, Ana Ciochetti, Fernando Becerril and Marta Aura also included as cast members. In the final 2 weeks, episodes are halved to give way to Maricarmen''s new telenovela, Entre el Amor y el Deseo', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hEUPEiF5tgrhApSAVW8Bw9voF4F.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32762'),
  ('805077431220120352', 'La lunga notte - La caduta del Duce', 2024, 'War & Politics, Drama', null, null, 'Alessio Boni, Duccio Camerini, Marco Foschi, Lucrezia Guidone, Ana Caterina Morariu, Flavio Parenti, Aurora Ruffino, Martina Stella', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o9nmQPClDjwnCfbJ90VSWzaM2rf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:244985'),
  ('1007837535592104817', 'La Madrastra', 2005, 'Soap', 'Liliana Abud, Arturo Moya Grau, Salvador Mejía', null, 'Victoria Ruffo, César Évora Díaz, Eduardo Capetillo, Jacqueline Andere, Margarita Isabel, Sabine Moussier, René Casados, Cecilia Gabriela', 'TV-PG', 'La Madrastra is a Mexican telenovela. It was produced by Televisa and broadcast on Canal de las Estrellas in Mexico from 7 February 2005 through 29 July 2005. The program became an unexpected success, garnering ratings in excess of 30 points. Starring Victoria Ruffo and César Évora, who last appeared together in 2000''s Abrázame muy fuerte, La madrastra tells the story of María, a woman who lost twenty years of her life after being falsely accused of murder and who returns to Mexico to exact revenge on her husband and friends who abandoned her and to see her beloved children once more. La Madrastra is fourth in a series of remakes of the 1981 Chilean production of the same name. The program aired five nights a week, Monday through Friday, at 9 pm for 25 weeks. A follow-up special, La madrastra: años después, aired shortly after the finale on 30 July 2005.', 'La Madrastra is a Mexican telenovela. It was produced by Televisa and broadcast on Canal de las Estrellas in Mexico from 7 February 2005 through 29 July 2005. The program became an unexpected success, garnering ratings in excess of 30 points. Starring Victoria Ruffo and César Évora, who last appeared together in 2000''s Abrázame muy fuerte, La madrastra tells the story of María, a woman who lost twenty years of her life after being falsely accused of murder and who returns to Mexico to exact revenge on her husband and friends who abandoned her and to see her beloved children once more. La Madrastra is fourth in a series of remakes of the 1981 Chilean production of the same name. The program aired five nights a week, Monday through Friday, at 9 pm for 25 weeks. A follow-up special, La madrastra: años después, aired shortly after the finale on 30 July 2005.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kt8bb1jcMlcYObzPpoQYV8Adf9p.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13093'),
  ('281185038035619047', 'La Madrastra', 2022, 'Drama, Soap', 'Carmen Armendáriz', null, 'Aracely Arámbula, Andrés Palacios, Marisol del Olmo, Marco Antonio Treviño, David Caro Levy, Ana Tena, Denia Agalianou, Martha Julia', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nsu7XUjBEphG0Vr4JdFE8QyrnHp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208076'),
  ('423272313055239504', 'La Maison', 2024, 'Drama', 'José Caltagirone, Valentine Milville', null, 'Zita Hanrot, Lambert Wilson, Carole Bouquet, Amira Casar, Pierre Deladonchamps, Antoine Reinartz, Anne Consigny, Florence Loiret Caille', 'TV-14', 'High fashion meets high drama in this behind-the-curtain look at an iconic French haute couture house. When the family dynasty behind the house falls into scandal, they must find a way to reinvent themselves—or be destroyed by their rivals.', 'High fashion meets high drama in this behind-the-curtain look at an iconic French haute couture house. When the family dynasty behind the house falls into scandal, they must find a way to reinvent themselves—or be destroyed by their rivals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2pZVYs4UQIpCFRLoO8mgZXVr5Yj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:231000'),
  ('539747492013618019', 'La Malquerida', 2014, 'Drama', 'Jacinto Benavente', null, 'Victoria Ruffo, Ariadne Díaz, Christian Meier, África Zavala, Guillermo García Cantú, Alberto Estrella, Mané de la Parra, Osvaldo de León', 'NR', 'La malquerida is a Mexican telenovela produced by José Alberto Castro for Televisa. It is an adaptation of the play "La malquerida", written by Spanish playwright Jacinto Benavente. Victoria Ruffo and Christian Meier will star as the adult protagonist, Ariadne Díaz and Mane de la Parra will star as the young protagonists, while Brandon Peniche will star as the main antagonist.', 'La malquerida is a Mexican telenovela produced by José Alberto Castro for Televisa. It is an adaptation of the play "La malquerida", written by Spanish playwright Jacinto Benavente. Victoria Ruffo and Christian Meier will star as the adult protagonist, Ariadne Díaz and Mane de la Parra will star as the young protagonists, while Brandon Peniche will star as the main antagonist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/irIdM3ZKxVjCJosscYULsV7DjWR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60644'),
  ('174441702086776107', 'La Mante', 2017, 'Drama, Crime', 'Alice Chegaray-Breugnot, Nicolas Jean, Grégoire Demaison', 'Alice Chegaray-Breugnot, Grégoire Demaison, Nicolas Jean', 'Frédérique Bel, Carole Bouquet, Fred Testot, Pascal Demolon, Robinson Stévenin, Jacques Weber, Serge Riaboukine, Manon Azem', 'TV-14', 'Jeanne Deber, known as "La Mante", the famous serial murderer who terrorized France more than 20 years ago, is forced by the police to come out of isolation to track down her copycat. She agrees to collaborate on one condition: to have only one interlocutor, Damien Carrot, her son, who became a cop because of the crimes of his mother, and who refuses all contact with her since her arrest.', 'Jeanne Deber, known as "La Mante", the famous serial murderer who terrorized France more than 20 years ago, is forced by the police to come out of isolation to track down her copycat. She agrees to collaborate on one condition: to have only one interlocutor, Damien Carrot, her son, who became a cop because of the crimes of his mother, and who refuses all contact with her since her arrest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qyZtFzKozN6oiIhCwctdrJwO50b.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73613'),
  ('176806611321070884', 'La Máquina', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Marco Ramirez, Fernanda Coppel', null, 'Gael García Bernal, Diego Luna, Eiza González, Jorge Perugorría, Karina Gidi, Lucía Méndez', 'TV-MA', 'After a devastating loss, Esteban “La Máquina” Osuna is at a low point in his boxing career. Lucky for him, his manager and best friend Andy Lujan is determined to get him back on top. But when a nefarious organization rears its head, the stakes of this rematch become life or death. Esteban must juggle his own personal demons and protect his family.', 'After a devastating loss, Esteban “La Máquina” Osuna is at a low point in his boxing career. Lucky for him, his manager and best friend Andy Lujan is determined to get him back on top. But when a nefarious organization rears its head, the stakes of this rematch become life or death. Esteban must juggle his own personal demons and protect his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDsIZmWVr4kTJFjgZ8Gwzx6nDJD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:206925'),
