  ('1066634125927565967', 'La Révolution', 2020, 'Drama', 'Aurélien Molas', null, 'Amir el Kacem, Marilou Aussilloux, Lionel Erdogan, Isabel Aimé González Sola, Julien Frison, Doudou Masta, Dimitri Storoge, Amélia Lacquemant', 'TV-MA', '1787, France. While investigating a series of mysterious murders, Joseph Guillotin - the future inventor of the world famous ‘Guillotine’ - uncovers an unknown virus: the Blue Blood. The disease quickly spreads amongst the French aristocracy, driving them to murder ordinary people and soon leads to a rebellion.', '1787, France. While investigating a series of mysterious murders, Joseph Guillotin - the future inventor of the world famous ‘Guillotine’ - uncovers an unknown virus: the Blue Blood. The disease quickly spreads amongst the French aristocracy, driving them to murder ordinary people and soon leads to a rebellion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSj4x6ZTTc8evF9NwE5pBjXclW4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99807'),
