  ('434466641104842488', 'Laguna Beach', 2004, 'Drama, Reality', 'Liz Gateley, Gary Auerbach, Adam DiVello', null, 'Raquel Donatell, Kelan Hurley, Chase Johnson, Kyndra Mayo, Lexie Contursi, Cameron Brinkman, Breanna Conrad, Cami Edwards', 'TV-MA', 'Like other teens in California, the lives of the Laguna Beach teenagers are filled with sandy beaches, beautiful friends and love triangles. But unlike other teens, they had cameras following them around. It may look like fantasyland, but they''re not acting: they really are this rich and beautiful. For them, life really is a day at the beach.', 'Like other teens in California, the lives of the Laguna Beach teenagers are filled with sandy beaches, beautiful friends and love triangles. But unlike other teens, they had cameras following them around. It may look like fantasyland, but they''re not acting: they really are this rich and beautiful. For them, life really is a day at the beach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40SJwdcrq4AQb5EWMRSbfb23SKI.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:3605'),
  ('294029683764245123', 'Laid', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Marieke Hardy, Kirsty Fisher', null, 'Alison Bell, Celia Pacquola, Toby Truslove, Abe Forsythe, Damon Herriman, Graeme Blundell', null, 'Roo McVie is placed in an uncomfortable situation when her former lovers start dying in strange circumstances. With her best friend EJ, Roo sets out to find a pattern and stop any more deaths.', 'Roo McVie is placed in an uncomfortable situation when her former lovers start dying in strange circumstances. With her best friend EJ, Roo sets out to find a pattern and stop any more deaths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fqH7BJB3BbkAWlwC6BrfQYe8mRi.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:37720'),
  ('811955871441091492', 'Laid', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sally Bradford McKenna, Nahnatchka Khan', null, 'Stephanie Hsu, Zosia Mamet, Michael Angarano, Tommy Martinez', 'TV-MA', 'A woman finds out her former lovers are dying in unusual ways and must go back through her sex timeline to confront her past in order to move forward.', 'A woman finds out her former lovers are dying in unusual ways and must go back through her sex timeline to confront her past in order to move forward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3I7Hi6cZFgQqxmq4KipRBzvmay9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:246575'),
  ('176039165091681432', 'Laid-Back Camp', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yumiri Hanamori, Nao Toyama, Sayuri Hara, Aki Toyosaki, Rie Takahashi', 'TV-PG', 'Nadeshiko, a high school student who had moved from Shizuoka to Yamanashi, decides to see the famous, 1000 yen-bill-featured Mount Fuji. Even though she manages to bike all the way to Motosu, she''s forced to turn back because of worsening weather. Unable to set her eyes on her goal, she faints partway to her destination. When she wakes up, it''s night, in a place she''s never been before, with no way of knowing how to get home. Nadeshiko is saved when she encounters Rin, a girl who is out camping by herself. This outdoorsy girls story begins with this first encounter between Nadeshiko and Rin.', 'Nadeshiko, a high school student who had moved from Shizuoka to Yamanashi, decides to see the famous, 1000 yen-bill-featured Mount Fuji. Even though she manages to bike all the way to Motosu, she''s forced to turn back because of worsening weather. Unable to set her eyes on her goal, she faints partway to her destination. When she wakes up, it''s night, in a place she''s never been before, with no way of knowing how to get home. Nadeshiko is saved when she encounters Rin, a girl who is out camping by herself. This outdoorsy girls story begins with this first encounter between Nadeshiko and Rin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1c5xBDBQQwa1bvX5fibAeymReGg.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:76075'),
