  ('381956462003775903', 'Las Vegas', 2003, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Gary Scott Thompson', null, 'Josh Duhamel, Vanessa Marcil, Molly Sims, James Lesure, Tom Selleck', 'TV-14', 'Ed Deline is a strict ex-CIA officer who went from being Head of Security to becoming President of Operations of the Montecito, whose job is to run the day-to-day operations of the casino. Following his departure, former Marine Danny McCoy, Ed''s former protégé, becomes the Montecito''s new President of Operations.', 'Ed Deline is a strict ex-CIA officer who went from being Head of Security to becoming President of Operations of the Montecito, whose job is to run the day-to-day operations of the casino. Following his departure, former Marine Danny McCoy, Ed''s former protégé, becomes the Montecito''s new President of Operations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AknZ6uDYvswlIrUKDm2Nte32xge.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:2389'),
