  ('778917816995413919', 'Legacies', 2018, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Julie Plec', null, 'Danielle Rose Russell, Aria Shahghasemi, Matthew Davis, Jenny Boyd, Quincy Fouse, Chris Lee, Ben Levin, Leo Howard', 'TV-14', 'In a place where young witches, vampires, and werewolves are nurtured to be their best selves in spite of their worst impulses, Klaus Mikaelson’s daughter, 17-year-old Hope Mikaelson, Alaric Saltzman’s twins, Lizzie and Josie Saltzman, among others, come of age into heroes and villains at The Salvatore School for the Young and Gifted.', 'In a place where young witches, vampires, and werewolves are nurtured to be their best selves in spite of their worst impulses, Klaus Mikaelson’s daughter, 17-year-old Hope Mikaelson, Alaric Saltzman’s twins, Lizzie and Josie Saltzman, among others, come of age into heroes and villains at The Salvatore School for the Young and Gifted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTZIgXrBKURBK1KrsT7fe3qwtl9.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:79460'),
  ('512295062510285810', 'Legacy', 2020, 'Drama, Family, Soap', null, null, 'Halil İbrahim Ceyhan, Berat Rüzgar Özkan, Binnaz Ekren, Ömer Gecü, Adnan Mehmet Ali Aslan, Oğuz Yağcı, Volkan Yildirim, Özge Agyar', null, 'The story of Yaman, a successful businessman who is incapable of love because of his traumatic childhood. There is only one person that he feels something for, his young nephew Yusuf. When Yusuf''s mother dies unexpectedly, his aunt Seher, a beautiful, courageous young woman, moves into the family mansion to take care of him.', 'The story of Yaman, a successful businessman who is incapable of love because of his traumatic childhood. There is only one person that he feels something for, his young nephew Yusuf. When Yusuf''s mother dies unexpectedly, his aunt Seher, a beautiful, courageous young woman, moves into the family mansion to take care of him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wmyqaUTyfEuOBi6uy0Wvw9i3dVH.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:100868'),
  ('700350602507264182', 'Legacy of the Divine', 2026, 'Animation', '尹衡, 王旭阳', null, 'Su Shangqing, Shi Zekun, Zhang Huilin, Yumeng Zhang', null, 'The story takes place in the untamed era of Yandi and Huangdi. As various powers vie for control of the Central Plains, the universally recognized leader of the world, Shennong the Great, passes away. The chieftains of the five tribes—Metal, Wood, Water, Fire, and Earth—begin to stir with ambition. In these turbulent times, a young man named Tuoba Ye emerges like a comet. By a stroke of chance, he inherits Shennong’s dying legacy and embarks on a thrilling, legendary journey.', 'The story takes place in the untamed era of Yandi and Huangdi. As various powers vie for control of the Central Plains, the universally recognized leader of the world, Shennong the Great, passes away. The chieftains of the five tribes—Metal, Wood, Water, Fire, and Earth—begin to stir with ambition. In these turbulent times, a young man named Tuoba Ye emerges like a comet. By a stroke of chance, he inherits Shennong’s dying legacy and embarks on a thrilling, legendary journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zV7JWi9d9h0Q3ghbBy0vzU6N3RX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317329'),
  ('523667095532762458', 'Legacy: The True Story of the LA Lakers', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Jeanie Buss, Magic Johnson, Kareem Abdul-Jabbar, Michael Cooper, Jerry West, Mitch Kupchak, Pat Riley, Gary Vitti', null, 'This docuseries captures the remarkable rise and unprecedented success of one of the most dominant and iconic franchises in professional sports. Featuring exclusive access to the Buss Family and probing, revealing interviews with players, coaches, and front office execs, this series chronicles this extraordinary story from the inside – told only by the people who lived it.', 'This docuseries captures the remarkable rise and unprecedented success of one of the most dominant and iconic franchises in professional sports. Featuring exclusive access to the Buss Family and probing, revealing interviews with players, coaches, and front office execs, this series chronicles this extraordinary story from the inside – told only by the people who lived it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9lVAFg0q2b7wi5npAUnl0YtfV7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204554');
insert into temp_tv_shows_seed (id, title, year, genre, creator, writers, cast_members, age_rating, overview, synopsis, poster_url, seasons, source_key)
values
  ('321894461284511724', 'Legal High', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hideki Inada, Junichi Ishikawa', 'Ryota Kosawa', 'Masato Sakai, Yui Aragaki, Masaki Okada, Junnosuke Taguchi, Koyuki, Haru Kuroki, Kanji Furutachi, Kōtarō Satomi', null, 'A lawyer with a big personality works with an straightlaced recent law graduate on various law cases in Japan.', 'A lawyer with a big personality works with an straightlaced recent law graduate on various law cases in Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2fmB1XXHiQCgnk8R0QLP8FoBVwF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:46234'),
  ('139668824439170066', 'Legal High', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', null, 'Park Seong-jin', 'Jin Goo, Seo Eun-soo, Yoon Park, Lee Soon-jae, Jang Yoo-sang, Kim Byeong-ok, Chae Jung-an, Jung Sang-hoon', null, 'A money-hungry lawyer and a righteous rookie become an unlikely courtroom duo in this remake of the Japanese series of the same name.', 'A money-hungry lawyer and a righteous rookie become an unlikely courtroom duo in this remake of the Japanese series of the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sK4wNZZH8NB6bQhoTXlstE9QDg4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85701'),
  ('1071567486321109246', 'Legal Mavericks', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', null, null, 'Vincent Wong Ho-Shun, Sisley Choi Si-Pui, Owen Cheung, Kelly Cheung, Lesley Chiang, Hugo Wong, Cheung Kwok-Keung, Pat Poon', null, 'Since losing his eyesight in an accident, Man Sun-Hop has been continually harassed and despised. But instead, his determination and perseverance are so reinforced that he has qualified as a barrister. He has also developed an acute sense beyond sight which helps him to gain the status of Blind Legal Knight in the legal profession. However, nobody really knows his true character. Fortunately, Kuk Yat-Ha, his flatmate and private detective, and ChiuChing-Mui, female legal executive with mob connections, are two buddies he can always rely on. The trio are known as Three Sword Fighters who never submit to power and are always ready to seek justice for the underprivileged. Sun-Hop’s provocative style has aroused the fancy of female judge Wong Lai-Fan, who cannot control her amorous feelings for him. Expanded to a quartet, their fate encounters turbulent changes while handling challenging legal cases. Reappearance of Sun-Hop’s father and Tai Tin-Yan, fellow sister from college, further complicates the situation, which Sun-Hop may not be able to unravel with his legal mastery.', 'Since losing his eyesight in an accident, Man Sun-Hop has been continually harassed and despised. But instead, his determination and perseverance are so reinforced that he has qualified as a barrister. He has also developed an acute sense beyond sight which helps him to gain the status of Blind Legal Knight in the legal profession. However, nobody really knows his true character. Fortunately, Kuk Yat-Ha, his flatmate and private detective, and ChiuChing-Mui, female legal executive with mob connections, are two buddies he can always rely on. The trio are known as Three Sword Fighters who never submit to power and are always ready to seek justice for the underprivileged. Sun-Hop’s provocative style has aroused the fancy of female judge Wong Lai-Fan, who cannot control her amorous feelings for him. Expanded to a quartet, their fate encounters turbulent changes while handling challenging legal cases. Reappearance of Sun-Hop’s father and Tai Tin-Yan, fellow sister from college, further complicates the situation, which Sun-Hop may not be able to unravel with his legal mastery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wOUQPkBEtdyHe8FFs5JvZivQHNE.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:73112'),
  ('428074497813046887', 'Legally Dad', 2020, 'Drama', null, null, 'Lee Hyun-joo, Choi Kyung-hoon, Lee A-ra, Min Se Woong, Kwon Hae Woo', null, 'Orphan Ah Young is a financially struggling 23-year-old who takes care of her 8-year-old sister Dan Bi while juggling part-time jobs. One day a 28-year-old man Yoo Sang appears in front of Ah Young offering to be her dad through a signed agreement.', 'Orphan Ah Young is a financially struggling 23-year-old who takes care of her 8-year-old sister Dan Bi while juggling part-time jobs. One day a 28-year-old man Yoo Sang appears in front of Ah Young offering to be her dad through a signed agreement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k40wLPZT4gvxfRNa5JtR6u6jV6u.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112876'),
  ('72451885378229487', 'Legend of Dagger Lee', 1999, 'Drama', 'Gu Long', null, 'Vincent Chiao En-chun, Zhang Yan, Xiu Qing, Niu Li, Jin Qiaoqiao, Liu Yuanyuan, Yuan Wenkang, Lu Xingyu', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yPyNvAvzjjb3qnKcnBKWMa19uwv.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:81413'),
  ('609123446111455746', 'Legend of Earthsea', 2004, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ursula K. Le Guin, Gavin Scott, Robert H. Lieberman', null, 'Shawn Ashmore, Danny Glover, Kristin Kreuk, Emily Hampshire, Isabella Rossellini, Mark Acheson, Chris Gauthier, Jennifer Calvert', null, 'A reckless young man is destined to become the greatest sorcerer the mystical land of Earthsea has ever known.', 'A reckless young man is destined to become the greatest sorcerer the mystical land of Earthsea has ever known.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lPUNXBVgM8p3ePfgQWHUuJfnnou.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13278'),
  ('944900876798530375', 'Legend of Fei', 2020, 'Action & Adventure, Mystery, Drama', 'Priest', 'Wang Hong, Key Jin', 'Zhao Liying, Wang Yibo, Zhang Huiwen, Chen Ruoxuan, Zhou Jieqiong, Sun Jian, Wang Huilai, Yuan Ziyi', null, 'After growing up in a mountain stronghold created to oversee the martial arts world, Zhou Fei finally sets out to explore life beyond its walls. On her journey, she reunites with the enigmatic Xie Yun, and together they navigate a world of danger, secrets, and adventure across the martial arts realm.', 'After growing up in a mountain stronghold created to oversee the martial arts world, Zhou Fei finally sets out to explore life beyond its walls. On her journey, she reunites with the enigmatic Xie Yun, and together they navigate a world of danger, secrets, and adventure across the martial arts realm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rngqWUuZ53l8XIMRey2ivhJ2Lhx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95834'),
  ('592728360873238950', 'Legend of Fuyao', 2018, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Xie Yanyan, 李祯', 'Yang Mi, Ethan Juan, Gao Weiguang, Liu Yijun, Lai Yi, Zhang Yaqin, Wang Jinsong, Gao Hanyu', null, 'Meng Fuyao, a woman born from a divine lotus petal. She journeys through the five continents towards the heavens in search of a secret order and to reveal a conspiracy originating from the heavens. In the process, she falls in love with the crown prince Zhangsun Wuji.', 'Meng Fuyao, a woman born from a divine lotus petal. She journeys through the five continents towards the heavens in search of a secret order and to reveal a conspiracy originating from the heavens. In the process, she falls in love with the crown prince Zhangsun Wuji.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3gv7muCZUxQEJJLVmj1dHhm2ROr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76814'),
  ('317951748694292744', 'Legend of Himiko', 1999, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, 'Masumi Hirayanagi', 'Etsuko Kozakura, Omi Minami, Akiko Hiramatsu, Tomokazu Seki, Chiyako Shibahara, Atsuko Tanaka, Tsubasa Otomiya, Koji Ishii', null, 'In a world where the dead walk, where good and evil exist as palpable forces, a darkness is stirring. The undead march against the cities of light, to capture the sacred fire that is the source of their power. But one hope remains. Called into this world by the magical flame, a young girl named Himiko is thrust into the maelstrom of danger, betrayal, and war. For she is heir to the sacred fire, and holds a power that could save its Guardians... if she survives!', 'In a world where the dead walk, where good and evil exist as palpable forces, a darkness is stirring. The undead march against the cities of light, to capture the sacred fire that is the source of their power. But one hope remains. Called into this world by the magical flame, a young girl named Himiko is thrust into the maelstrom of danger, betrayal, and war. For she is heir to the sacred fire, and holds a power that could save its Guardians... if she survives!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cE7wkaXk0zCARHR7ewcU2IJWBKY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34207'),
  ('716832925457319424', 'Legend of Princess Chang-Ge', 2025, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama, War & Politics', 'Xia Da', null, 'Chang Rongshan, Xue Cheng, Ma Zhengyang, Jinwen Chen, Zhao Mingzhou, 葉保華, Fan Zhechen, Gao Feng', 'TV-PG', 'Shortly after astrology predicts destruction to befall the Tang Dynasty, a coup d''état led by the crown prince Li''s very own brother kills him and his wife and sons. Li''s daughter, princess Yongning, manages to escape, but is soon declared dead alongside her family. Full of wrath, the princess swears to avenge them as she takes on the identity of a young man, Li Chang Ge, and moves to the Shou province to advance her goals. Li Chang Ge uses her wits to gain the trust of the Shou emperor and swiftly climbs the military ranks as a brilliant strategist. Captivatingly drawn, Song of the Long March portrays the feisty girl''s adolescent journey toward countless unknown adventures, faithful comradeship, as well as formidable enmity awaiting her along the way.', 'Shortly after astrology predicts destruction to befall the Tang Dynasty, a coup d''état led by the crown prince Li''s very own brother kills him and his wife and sons. Li''s daughter, princess Yongning, manages to escape, but is soon declared dead alongside her family. Full of wrath, the princess swears to avenge them as she takes on the identity of a young man, Li Chang Ge, and moves to the Shou province to advance her goals. Li Chang Ge uses her wits to gain the trust of the Shou emperor and swiftly climbs the military ranks as a brilliant strategist. Captivatingly drawn, Song of the Long March portrays the feisty girl''s adolescent journey toward countless unknown adventures, faithful comradeship, as well as formidable enmity awaiting her along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tRNkmdQT9YJOptirmupMtoNp9d4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:281199'),
  ('406986853659880256', 'Legend of the Female General', 2025, 'Drama', 'Qian Shan Cha Ke', null, 'Zhou Ye, Ryan Cheng, Zhang Kangle, Zhang Miaoyi, Li Qing, Bai Shu, Rao Jiadi', null, 'A female general with a gentle appearance but a strong inner spirit, and a male general with a cold exterior and internal but with stronger martial prowess. The two join forces to combat deceit, assist the weak, and eliminate external threats.', 'A female general with a gentle appearance but a strong inner spirit, and a male general with a cold exterior and internal but with stronger martial prowess. The two join forces to combat deceit, assist the weak, and eliminate external threats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1EMXYnqFDk9tzkkoxFwFjxCEvC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:240686'),
  ('19022766204288128', 'Legend of the Galactic Heroes', 1988, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics', null, null, 'Kei Tomiyama, Ryo Horikawa, Kazuhiko Inoue, Yoshiko Sakakibara, Masashi Hironaka, Nozomu Sasaki, Katsuji Mori, Masako Katsuki', null, 'War rages between the Galactic Empire and the Free Planets Alliance. With two new brilliant young leaders at the helm, anything can happen in this military space opera.', 'War rages between the Galactic Empire and the Free Planets Alliance. With two new brilliant young leaders at the helm, anything can happen in this military space opera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j6amUPH88lc7cJf54MKZCf4a9NA.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:27660'),
  ('1084290764490895993', 'Legend of the Seeker', 2008, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Sam Raimi, Terry Goodkind', null, 'Craig Horner, Bridget Regan, Bruce Spence, Tabrett Bethell', 'TV-14', 'The adventures of woodsman Richard Cypher, who discovers that he was born to fulfill a prophecy of becoming a guardian hero to oppressed people. With the help of a mysterious woman named Kahlan and a wise old wizard named Zedd, he must stop a ruthless and bloodthirsty tyrant from unleashing an ancient evil and enslaving the world.', 'The adventures of woodsman Richard Cypher, who discovers that he was born to fulfill a prophecy of becoming a guardian hero to oppressed people. With the help of a mysterious woman named Kahlan and a wise old wizard named Zedd, he must stop a ruthless and bloodthirsty tyrant from unleashing an ancient evil and enslaving the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ibclBUwEjsvfi8hpdO2i9jdOMUI.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:7704'),
  ('66436787766692212', 'Legend of the Three Caballeros', 2018, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', null, null, 'Tony Anselmo, Jaime Camil, Eric Bauza, Grey DeLisle, Wayne Knight, Jessica DiCicco, Tress MacNeille, Dee Bradley Baker', null, 'When Donald Duck inherits a cabana from his great-grandfather Clinton Coot in the New Quackmore Institute alongside Brazilian parrot José Carioca and Mexican rooster Panchito Gonzalez, they discover a magical book that when opened releases a goddess named Xandra. The goddess explains that Donald, José, and Panchito are the descendants of a trio of adventurers known as The Three Caballeros, who long ago traveled to stop the evil sorcerer Lord Felldrake from taking over the world and ultimately sealed him in a magical staff. Meanwhile, the staff containing Felldrake is discovered by his descendant Baron Von Sheldgoose, the corrupt President of the New Quackmore Institute. As Sheldgoose sets out to revive Felldrake, the new Three Caballeros must learn to become heroes to save the world from disaster.', 'When Donald Duck inherits a cabana from his great-grandfather Clinton Coot in the New Quackmore Institute alongside Brazilian parrot José Carioca and Mexican rooster Panchito Gonzalez, they discover a magical book that when opened releases a goddess named Xandra. The goddess explains that Donald, José, and Panchito are the descendants of a trio of adventurers known as The Three Caballeros, who long ago traveled to stop the evil sorcerer Lord Felldrake from taking over the world and ultimately sealed him in a magical staff. Meanwhile, the staff containing Felldrake is discovered by his descendant Baron Von Sheldgoose, the corrupt President of the New Quackmore Institute. As Sheldgoose sets out to revive Felldrake, the new Three Caballeros must learn to become heroes to save the world from disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/289sp4yd303R477Ji9MoWgVOFQD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80402'),
  ('671337360019138703', 'Legend of the Undercover Chef', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Zhao Benshan, Song Xiaofeng, Wen Song, Cheng Ye, Song Xiaobao, Ge Shan Shan, Li Xiaohe, Tang Jianjun', null, 'This drama tells the story of Ximen Changhai, head of the Magpie Saber Sect, who is determined to eradicate the wokou pirates and joins a secret plan to do so. To prevent his plans from leaking out, Ximen Changhai brought his brother, Ximen Changzai, a cook, to the Magpie Saber Sect to become the acting sect head, and as affairs within the Sect changed, an amusing martial arts story started within the sect.', 'This drama tells the story of Ximen Changhai, head of the Magpie Saber Sect, who is determined to eradicate the wokou pirates and joins a secret plan to do so. To prevent his plans from leaking out, Ximen Changhai brought his brother, Ximen Changzai, a cook, to the Magpie Saber Sect to become the acting sect head, and as affairs within the Sect changed, an amusing martial arts story started within the sect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t8zIqdV2hwqLwHh8WvOoV0uQFSv.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:204610'),
  ('572807913162277785', 'Legend of Xianwu', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Gu Jiangshan, Li Shimeng, Nie Xiying, Titus Jin, Qiao Shiyu, Liu Cong, Zhang Yutong, Lan Taoyi', null, 'As a loyal disciple, Ye Chen dedicated himself to guard the spiritual medicine field for his sect. But, during a fight with enemies, the spiritual field was destroyed. His loyalty and dedication to the sect could not save him. The loyalty he thought he had obtained from his peers and lover, could not save him from betrayal. Thus, he was shamelessly banished from the sect. With the help of a flame falling from heaven, Ye Chen began to develop himself into a stronger cultivator. Battled against his opponents, unfolded his legendary life and rewrote his own story…', 'As a loyal disciple, Ye Chen dedicated himself to guard the spiritual medicine field for his sect. But, during a fight with enemies, the spiritual field was destroyed. His loyalty and dedication to the sect could not save him. The loyalty he thought he had obtained from his peers and lover, could not save him from betrayal. Thus, he was shamelessly banished from the sect. With the help of a flame falling from heaven, Ye Chen began to develop himself into a stronger cultivator. Battled against his opponents, unfolded his legendary life and rewrote his own story…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3hSKTQ3o6UO88y8l7GS1MuMvTK8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222608'),
  ('617024642796707325', 'Legend of Yun Xi', 2018, 'Drama', null, 'Ju Fang Fang, Jin Yuanyuan', 'Ju Jingyi, Zhang Zhehan, Merxat, Hu Bing, Lin Siyi, Xu Jiaqi, Wang Youshuo, Chen Jiayi', null, 'Han Yun Xi is the daughter of an imperial physician who lost her mother when young, but maintains a cheerful and optimistic disposition. Yun Xi is naturally talented in medical science and proficient in traditional medicine, but suffers from the jealousy and avoidance of others. By a stroke of fate, she marries the Duke of Qin, Long Fei Ye, and becomes embroiled in the changing politics of the imperial court. Yun Xi relies on her high-level medical skills, wisdom, far-sighted brain, and compassionate heart to expel the poisons of a great official, get rid of secret agents for the Duke of Qin, eliminate the plague for the common citizens, and cure the crown prince’s strange illness.', 'Han Yun Xi is the daughter of an imperial physician who lost her mother when young, but maintains a cheerful and optimistic disposition. Yun Xi is naturally talented in medical science and proficient in traditional medicine, but suffers from the jealousy and avoidance of others. By a stroke of fate, she marries the Duke of Qin, Long Fei Ye, and becomes embroiled in the changing politics of the imperial court. Yun Xi relies on her high-level medical skills, wisdom, far-sighted brain, and compassionate heart to expel the poisons of a great official, get rid of secret agents for the Duke of Qin, eliminate the plague for the common citizens, and cure the crown prince’s strange illness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6n14aCvU7GRA9DTp84hjcGUgwnV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80455'),
  ('645196518758945657', 'Legend of Zang Hai', 2025, 'Drama', 'Kennedy Xu', 'Zhao Liuyi', 'Xiao Zhan, Zhang Jingyi, Zhou Qi, Huang Jue, Yu Nan, Michelle Chen Yan-Hsi, Zhang Guoqiang, Qiao Zhenyu', 'TV-14', '"Legend of Zang Hai" follows the son of Imperial Astronomer Kuai Duo. Consumed by vengeance, he spends a decade honing his skills. Assuming the name Zang Hai, he ventures into the capital to uncover the truth, avenge his family, and restore justice.', '"Legend of Zang Hai" follows the son of Imperial Astronomer Kuai Duo. Consumed by vengeance, he spends a decade honing his skills. Assuming the name Zang Hai, he ventures into the capital to uncover the truth, avenge his family, and restore justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Nn2qwv2GrQ1cHkrgwCeSdEbbw8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:252640'),
  ('1131095212144571354', 'Legend Quest', 2017, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy', 'Jim Krieg, Jose C. Garcia de Letona, Ernie Altbacker', null, 'Roly Gutiérrez, Benny Emmanuel, Mayte Cordeiro, Andrés Couturier, Ricardo O''Farrill, Alondra Hidalgo', 'TV-PG', 'When an evil force threatens his village, a gifted teen who can talk to ghosts puts his skills to good use, one legend at a time.', 'When an evil force threatens his village, a gifted teen who can talk to ghosts puts his skills to good use, one legend at a time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bvX36FEbeA9WTSk6H60sXLmb4hS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70420'),
  ('954645460539731613', 'Legendary', 2020, 'Reality', null, null, 'Leiomy Maldonado, Law Roach, Dashaun Wesley Williams, Jameela Jamil, Keke Palmer', 'TV-MA', 'Pulling directly from the underground ballroom community, voguing teams (aka "houses") must compete in unbelievable balls and showcase sickening fashion in order to achieve "legendary" status.', 'Pulling directly from the underground ballroom community, voguing teams (aka "houses") must compete in unbelievable balls and showcase sickening fashion in order to achieve "legendary" status.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZIPELWwcKnR6cG11a6mbn7lc4J.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:99595'),
  ('82092367315239004', 'Legendary Brave Swordsman Yaiba', 1993, 'Animation, Kids, Action & Adventure, Drama, Comedy', 'Gosho Aoyama', null, 'Minami Takayama, Kotono Mitsuishi, Ryo Horikawa, Masaharu Sato, Jurota Kosugi, Takaya Hashi, Rica Fukami, Daiki Nakamura', null, 'Kurogane Yaiba is a boy who doesn''t want to become what any regular kid would: A samurai. That''s why he undergoes a hard training with his father, knowing only the forest as his world. Then, one day, he is sent to Japan, where he has to deal with a whole new civilized reality, meeting the Mine family, the evil Onimaru and even the legendary Musashi, having lots of dangerous adventures, becoming stronger everyday.', 'Kurogane Yaiba is a boy who doesn''t want to become what any regular kid would: A samurai. That''s why he undergoes a hard training with his father, knowing only the forest as his world. Then, one day, he is sent to Japan, where he has to deal with a whole new civilized reality, meeting the Mine family, the evil Onimaru and even the legendary Musashi, having lots of dangerous adventures, becoming stronger everyday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCLKqBwbqX2MOyV1FIFlWOyuuf9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:23451'),
  ('650897750097282265', 'Legendary Fighter: Yang''s Heroine', 2001, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Wai-Ming Wong, Peter Yang Kwan', 'Lei Chi Wong', 'Carman Lee Yeuk-Tung, Theresa Lee Yee-Hung, Cheng Pei-Pei, Ken Chang Tzu-Yao, Andrew Lin Hoi, Ning Jing, Power Chan Kwok-Pong, Jing Cai', null, 'Legendary Fighter: Yang''s Heroine is a 2001 Chinese costume drama produced by Chinese Entertainment Shanghai Limited in conjunction with Taiwan Television, Singapore Press Holdings and China Film Group Corporation. The plot is based on the Generals of the Yang Family legends, focusing on the women in the stories.', 'Legendary Fighter: Yang''s Heroine is a 2001 Chinese costume drama produced by Chinese Entertainment Shanghai Limited in conjunction with Taiwan Television, Singapore Press Holdings and China Film Group Corporation. The plot is based on the Generals of the Yang Family legends, focusing on the women in the stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUJpL3hlMgUKeNipLUPK7veQqNe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80174'),
  ('805010219323439954', 'Legendary Locations', 2017, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Josh Gates', 'TV-G', 'Josh Gates goes on an awe-inspiring journey to the most storied places on the planet.', 'Josh Gates goes on an awe-inspiring journey to the most storied places on the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9o3tsmjfnwwL9UyVbtdePqHWfVu.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:79129'),
  ('224714622370718690', 'Legends', 2006, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'The story of the big names that have shaped the musical genres, plus an occasional stopgap for the new rock ''n'' roll - comedy.', 'The story of the big names that have shaped the musical genres, plus an occasional stopgap for the new rock ''n'' roll - comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3YtSBasjhGHOIHAZnjAU0X0U7J3.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:109536'),
  ('759519594747162681', 'Legends', 2014, 'Crime, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Howard Gordon', null, 'Sean Bean, Steve Kazee, Winter Ave Zoli, Klára Issová, Aisling Franciosi, Kelly Overton, Ralph Brown', 'TV-14', 'Working for the FBI''s Deep Cover Operations division, Martin Odum can transform himself into a different person -- whether it''s an assignment as a Serbian extremist, a corrupt Chicago police officer, a British special forces colonel, or a legendary computer hacker. But when he learns that his life, itself, may be a lie, he faces the demands of his job and a desire to solve the mystery of his identity. And given the choice between the two, Odum doesn''t always make the right decision.', 'Working for the FBI''s Deep Cover Operations division, Martin Odum can transform himself into a different person -- whether it''s an assignment as a Serbian extremist, a corrupt Chicago police officer, a British special forces colonel, or a legendary computer hacker. But when he learns that his life, itself, may be a lie, he faces the demands of his job and a desire to solve the mystery of his identity. And given the choice between the two, Odum doesn''t always make the right decision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXZbSYN3i2DjHKJORZiBf8P9LDF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:60855'),
  ('917689771924332313', 'Legends of Chamberlain Heights', 2016, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Brad Ableson, Mike Clements, Quinn Hawking', null, 'Josiah Johnson, Tiffany Haddish, Jay Pharoah, Michael Starrbury, Quinn Hawking, Lavell Crawford', 'TV-MA', 'An urban animated series mixing raucous comedy and social commentary that centers on three high school freshman basketball benchwarmers: Jamal, Grover, and Milk. The three friends tackle life with some wins and some losses, but failure doesn’t faze them since they''re legends...even if it’s just in their own minds.', 'An urban animated series mixing raucous comedy and social commentary that centers on three high school freshman basketball benchwarmers: Jamal, Grover, and Milk. The three friends tackle life with some wins and some losses, but failure doesn’t faze them since they''re legends...even if it’s just in their own minds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oA9l1kHyvMGRPxmnXYWudeOeNeE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67761'),
  ('989796315366231252', 'Legends of Cinema', 2016, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zyVSHctJ0WfMGAkddyp4M3NDzC7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:134685'),
  ('526202319353210903', 'Legends of the Dark King: A Fist of the North Star Story', 2008, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Tetsuo Hara, Yūkō Osada, Yoshiyuki Okamura', null, 'Akiko Kimura, Mai Nakahara, Takashi Ukaji, Masaya Matsukaze', null, 'In the wastelands following the great nuclear war, a legend grew of a man. “Hokuto No Ken.” The Fist of the North Star. Master of a legendary fighting technique. A man of impossible strength and endurance. Yet before Ken claimed the title of the Fist, there was another master, trained in the art of Hokuto Shinken, the King of the Fist, the Divine Fist of Heaven. Raoh: the ultimate assassin, the ultimate warrior. This is the story of the world before Fist of the North Star, and how one man took the future of a savage world into his deadly hands and reshaped its destiny. Not as a hero but as a conqueror. For in the mind of the man called Raoh, the only way to save Mankind is to grind it under his giant heel! The greatest battle is about to begin in Legends of the Dark King ~ Fist of the North Star!', 'In the wastelands following the great nuclear war, a legend grew of a man. “Hokuto No Ken.” The Fist of the North Star. Master of a legendary fighting technique. A man of impossible strength and endurance. Yet before Ken claimed the title of the Fist, there was another master, trained in the art of Hokuto Shinken, the King of the Fist, the Divine Fist of Heaven. Raoh: the ultimate assassin, the ultimate warrior. This is the story of the world before Fist of the North Star, and how one man took the future of a savage world into his deadly hands and reshaped its destiny. Not as a hero but as a conqueror. For in the mind of the man called Raoh, the only way to save Mankind is to grind it under his giant heel! The greatest battle is about to begin in Legends of the Dark King ~ Fist of the North Star!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qdMuK4tcJ3iKbYS3THyqtFh0fxC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:23436'),
  ('889553339449974772', 'Legends of the Hidden Temple', 1993, 'Reality, Family, Kids', null, null, 'Kirk Fogg, Dee Bradley Baker', 'TV-Y', 'In a Temple filled with lost treasures and protected by mysterious Mayan temple guards, six teams of two children compete to retrieve one of the historical artifacts in the Temple by performing physical stunts and answering questions based on history, mythology, and geography. After three elimination rounds, only one team remains, who then earns the right to go through the Temple to retrieve the artifact within three minutes and win a grand prize.', 'In a Temple filled with lost treasures and protected by mysterious Mayan temple guards, six teams of two children compete to retrieve one of the historical artifacts in the Temple by performing physical stunts and answering questions based on history, mythology, and geography. After three elimination rounds, only one team remains, who then earns the right to go through the Temple to retrieve the artifact within three minutes and win a grand prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jsUpyxfYgatd4UKZKfS6WZlkEhI.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:363'),
  ('734753845522810335', 'Legends of the Lost with Megan Fox', 2018, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, 'Megan Fox', 'NR', 'Actress Megan Fox has peeked behind the curtain of some of these ancient sites, igniting an insatiable curiosity to learn more about these lost worlds. She embarks on an epic international journey to investigate and find answers to these enduring mysteries.', 'Actress Megan Fox has peeked behind the curtain of some of these ancient sites, igniting an insatiable curiosity to learn more about these lost worlds. She embarks on an epic international journey to investigate and find answers to these enduring mysteries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvLi5f3QVkKj3ICNiH6rk2uld9M.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85036'),
  ('207944352751340045', 'Legends of Tomorrow', 2016, 'Drama, Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Marc Guggenheim, Phil Klemmer, Ray Utarnachitt, Grainne Godfree, Mark Bruner', 'Marc Guggenheim, Phil Klemmer, Ray Utarnachitt, Grainne Godfree, Mark Bruner, Matthew Maala, James Eagan, Leah Poulliot, Mercedes Valle, Morgan Faust, Tyron Carter, Chris Fedak, Ubah Mohamed, Greg Berlanti, Sarah Nicole Jones, Andrew Kreisberg, Anderson MacKenzie, Beth Schwartz, Paiman Kalayeh, Jackie Canino, Daphne Miles, Cortney Norris, Sarah Hernandez, Keto Shimizu, Marcelena Mayhorn, Emily Cheever', 'Amy Louise Pemberton, Dominic Purcell, Nick Zano, Tala Ashe, Brandon Routh', 'TV-14', 'When heroes alone are not enough - the world needs legends. Having seen the future, one he will desperately try to prevent from happening, time-traveling rogue Rip Hunter is tasked with assembling a disparate group of both heroes and villains to confront an unstoppable threat - one in which not only is the planet at stake, but all of time itself. Can this ragtag team defeat an immortal threat unlike anything they have ever known?', 'When heroes alone are not enough - the world needs legends. Having seen the future, one he will desperately try to prevent from happening, time-traveling rogue Rip Hunter is tasked with assembling a disparate group of both heroes and villains to confront an unstoppable threat - one in which not only is the planet at stake, but all of time itself. Can this ragtag team defeat an immortal threat unlike anything they have ever known?', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FAcEFDh272YVTR6B6zrrusk8BjJG.jpg', 7, 'plex:tv:legends-of-tomorrow'),
  ('136859578148653761', 'Legion', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Noah Hawley', null, 'Dan Stevens, Rachel Keller, Aubrey Plaza, Jeremie Harris, Amber Midthunder, Bill Irwin, Hamish Linklater, Lauren Tsai', 'TV-MA', 'David Haller, AKA Legion, is a troubled young man who may be more than human. Diagnosed as schizophrenic, David has been in and out of psychiatric hospitals for years. But after a strange encounter with a fellow patient, he’s confronted with the possibility that the voices he hears and the visions he sees might be real.', 'David Haller, AKA Legion, is a troubled young man who may be more than human. Diagnosed as schizophrenic, David has been in and out of psychiatric hospitals for years. But after a strange encounter with a fellow patient, he’s confronted with the possibility that the voices he hears and the visions he sees might be real.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xhJtYVTsdXQCIlB5hAXkMCPUG9y.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:67195'),
  ('83479031099936261', 'Legion of Super Heroes', 2006, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, 'Yuri Lowenthal, Kari Wahlgren, Adam Wylie, Andy Milder, Shawn Harrison, Michael Cornacchia, Alexander Polinsky', 'TV-Y7', 'The series centers on a young Superman''s adventures in the 31st century, fighting alongside a group of futuristic superheroes known as the Legion of Super-Heroes.', 'The series centers on a young Superman''s adventures in the 31st century, fighting alongside a group of futuristic superheroes known as the Legion of Super-Heroes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bz92ox9DKUTJr1Or1CqJ8zWffi2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:4028'),
  ('32495832567474631', 'Legit', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Jim Jefferies, Peter O''Fallon', null, 'Jim Jefferies, Dan Bakkedahl, DJ Qualls, Mindy Sterling, Sonya Eddy, John Ratzenberger, Denzel Whitaker', 'TV-MA', 'Jim Jefferies, an edgy, foul-mouthed stand-up comedian from Australia, in his mid-30s and living in LA, is endeavoring to make his life and career more “legit,” only to find it a difficult, uncomfortable uphill struggle every step of the way. Jim is encouraged in his quest by Steve, his neurotic best friend and roommate, a cyber-law library salesman who struggles to stay on his feet in the wake of a divorce, and Steve’s brother Billy, who suffers from advanced staged Muscular Dystrophy and is confined to a wheelchair.', 'Jim Jefferies, an edgy, foul-mouthed stand-up comedian from Australia, in his mid-30s and living in LA, is endeavoring to make his life and career more “legit,” only to find it a difficult, uncomfortable uphill struggle every step of the way. Jim is encouraged in his quest by Steve, his neurotic best friend and roommate, a cyber-law library salesman who struggles to stay on his feet in the wake of a divorce, and Steve’s brother Billy, who suffers from advanced staged Muscular Dystrophy and is confined to a wheelchair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4wKawZKCcWpQYJXDB5XBSMRCWDm.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:46405'),
  ('299175460414179513', 'LEGO Bionicle: The Journey to One', 2016, 'Animation, Kids', null, null, null, 'TV-Y7', 'Six legendary heroes find themselves on an epic quest as they harness the power of nature''s elements to defeat the forces of evil.', 'Six legendary heroes find themselves on an epic quest as they harness the power of nature''s elements to defeat the forces of evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDbl0lYteEKQ4ySjHTMsYczBMz9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:74153'),
  ('1020536785154009352', 'LEGO City Adventures', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Family, Comedy, Kids', null, null, null, 'TV-Y7', 'Welcome to LEGO City, a modern metropolis filled with the fiercest firefighters, the cream of the crop cops, and so many Blockheads. Every citizen will assemble together for the most awesomely awesome adventures.', 'Welcome to LEGO City, a modern metropolis filled with the fiercest firefighters, the cream of the crop cops, and so many Blockheads. Every citizen will assemble together for the most awesomely awesome adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6fBhyepVUkIxka9vLGtb3kH6QGf.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:94107'),
  ('97179471864094646', 'LEGO DREAMZzz', 2023, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Kids', 'Tommy Andreasen', null, null, 'TV-Y7', 'A group of kids join a secret agency where they learn to use the power of imagination to journey into the Dream World and create fantastic creations in order to help sleeping children being terrorized by the evil Nightmare King who is bent on conquering the Dream World and invading the Waking World.', 'A group of kids join a secret agency where they learn to use the power of imagination to journey into the Dream World and create fantastic creations in order to help sleeping children being terrorized by the evil Nightmare King who is bent on conquering the Dream World and invading the Waking World.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bksnhr6slfT2mIcCTglGYD3pI9A.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:225320'),
  ('370486631486436004', 'LEGO Elves: Secrets of Elvendale', 2017, 'Animation, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family', null, null, 'Riley Murdock, Scott McNeil, Rebecca Husain, Ashleigh Ball, Erin Mathews, Kyle Rideout, Vincent Tong, Kathleen Barr', 'TV-Y7', 'Armed with a powerful amulet, a teenage guardian is tasked with protecting her little sister -- and all of Elvendale. Based on the popular web series.', 'Armed with a powerful amulet, a teenage guardian is tasked with protecting her little sister -- and all of Elvendale. Based on the popular web series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yvq2hsm66dvDs4qTevZiDd3ij0t.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73673'),
  ('92117153333577860', 'LEGO Friends: Girls on a Mission', 2018, 'Animation, Kids, Family', null, null, 'Jasmine Elcock, Amaya Harrow, Jasmine St.Clair, Allegra Clark, Faye Mata, Kira Buckland', 'TV-Y', 'Meet Andrea, Mia, Emma, Olivia and Stephanie. They''re five best friends. And they''re on a heroic mission: to save Heartlake City from wily swindlers.', 'Meet Andrea, Mia, Emma, Olivia and Stephanie. They''re five best friends. And they''re on a heroic mission: to save Heartlake City from wily swindlers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ucWzrdR7Ac4WVzx6FMFRNukNUqe.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:87547'),
  ('323590943874200709', 'LEGO Friends: The Next Chapter', 2023, 'Family, Animation', 'Samuel Tourneux, Scott Stewart, Julie Stewart', null, 'Annie Chen, Gemma Findlay, Cole Howard, Kamantha Naidoo, Odessa Rojen, Andrea Libman, Valin Shinyei, Zion Simpson', 'TV-Y', 'Take a look inside the walls of Heartlake International High School with a brand-new group of friends.', 'Take a look inside the walls of Heartlake International High School with a brand-new group of friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ZmO5NoszmfKP6ZFQrxNWIdgUqD.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:218695'),
  ('1044808377897486902', 'LEGO Friends: The Power of Friendship', 2016, 'Animation, Kids, Family', null, 'Trylle Vilstrup', 'Sara Ekander Poulsen, Maja Iven Ulstrup, Katrine Falkenberg', 'TV-Y', 'Five best friends face adventures side by side in their hometown. Zany antics, love and missteps are better with friends!', 'Five best friends face adventures side by side in their hometown. Zany antics, love and missteps are better with friends!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mPXjhIwh4bWm5eOxTfPZOkGPC35.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70779'),
  ('548798108225317393', 'LEGO Hero Factory', 2010, 'Animation', null, null, null, 'TV-Y7', 'Based around the LEGO toy line of the same name, Hero Factory is set in a place known as Makuhero City. Here, Heroes are built in the Hero Factory and sent on missions around the universe, dealing with a variety of galactic problems such as alien infestations, natural disasters, and criminals.', 'Based around the LEGO toy line of the same name, Hero Factory is set in a place known as Makuhero City. Here, Heroes are built in the Hero Factory and sent on missions around the universe, dealing with a variety of galactic problems such as alien infestations, natural disasters, and criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9R9dIsuCpUM8fNsHFx0ZYSbzdlq.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:35188'),
  ('346085716053771134', 'LEGO Jurassic World: The Secret Exhibit', 2018, 'Family, Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Alex Zahara, Bethany Brown, Sabrina Pitre', null, 'Ian Hanlin, Dhirendra, Britt McKillip, Alex Zahara, Vincent Tong, Bethany Brown, Adrian Petriw, Sabrina Pitre', null, 'It''s 2012, and Simon Masrani has an idea for a new attraction that is guaranteed to keep Jurassic World at the forefront of theme park entertainment. It''s the greatest thing since the discovery of dinosaurs, but in order for it to succeed, he needs his right-hand, can-do problem solver, Claire Dearing, to get a trio of dinosaurs across the park to the new, super-secret exhibit. Reluctantly teaming up with newcomer Owen Grady, the animal behaviorist she hired sight unseen to deliver the dinosaurs, the duo sets out on a fun-filled adventure across the island. Unfortunately, delivering the dinosaurs to the new attraction is not as easy as they thought.', 'It''s 2012, and Simon Masrani has an idea for a new attraction that is guaranteed to keep Jurassic World at the forefront of theme park entertainment. It''s the greatest thing since the discovery of dinosaurs, but in order for it to succeed, he needs his right-hand, can-do problem solver, Claire Dearing, to get a trio of dinosaurs across the park to the new, super-secret exhibit. Reluctantly teaming up with newcomer Owen Grady, the animal behaviorist she hired sight unseen to deliver the dinosaurs, the duo sets out on a fun-filled adventure across the island. Unfortunately, delivering the dinosaurs to the new attraction is not as easy as they thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/28FJsMFGpWB8EZsM7uON3wUhefs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99127'),
  ('43499885940998100', 'LEGO Legends of Chima', 2013, 'Animation', 'John Derevlany, Peder Pedersen', 'John Derevlany', 'David Attar, Bethany Brown, Bill Courage, Scott Shantz, Jeff Evans-Todd, Michael Patric, Jesse Inocalla, Meghan Kinsley', 'TV-Y7', 'Laval the Lion and Cragger the Crocodile are best friends who live in the mystical land of Chima. This all changes after an innocent escapade when Cragger gets his first experience with chi, a sacred resource important to Chima''s delicate balance which gives its user awesome power.', 'Laval the Lion and Cragger the Crocodile are best friends who live in the mystical land of Chima. This all changes after an innocent escapade when Cragger gets his first experience with chi, a sacred resource important to Chima''s delicate balance which gives its user awesome power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkq3jXxyXVIojL0oxvLUGUEz9y1.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:57780'),
  ('1036371905683399812', 'LEGO Marvel Avengers: Strange Tails', 2025, 'Family, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Troy Baker, Alia Shawkat, James C. Mathis III, Mick Wingert, Roger Craig Smith, Laura Bailey, Travis Willingham, Ogie Banks', 'TV-Y7', 'Hawkeye and The Avengers have made saving the world look easy. But now they face their wildest threat yet: SOCIAL MEDIA. To save the world, a new team must be recruited to help our heroes contend with an influencer bent on cataclysmic destruction.', 'Hawkeye and The Avengers have made saving the world look easy. But now they face their wildest threat yet: SOCIAL MEDIA. To save the world, a new team must be recruited to help our heroes contend with an influencer bent on cataclysmic destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6MhzH93izyEvVO15qgM8UJNvY4z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:305165'),
  ('595675770980984609', 'LEGO MARVEL Super Heroes: Maximum Overload', 2013, 'Animation, Kids', null, 'Matt Wayne', 'Laura Bailey, Dee Bradley Baker, Troy Baker, Drake Bell, Greg Cipes, Grey DeLisle, Robin Atkin Downes, Tom Kenny', null, 'Spider-Man and Marvel''s Super Heroes take on a mischievous Loki and a team of super villains in an all-new LEGO adventure.', 'Spider-Man and Marvel''s Super Heroes take on a mischievous Loki and a team of super villains in an all-new LEGO adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6JaUKywvJyq7g7qDTRYW6s3ZRm9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62576'),
  ('678938597175918438', 'LEGO Masters', 2017, 'Reality, Family', null, null, 'Melvin Odoom, Matthew Ashton, Fran Scott', null, 'British version of the reality contest where some of the most skilled brick fanatics do battle to be crowned LEGO Master.', 'British version of the reality contest where some of the most skilled brick fanatics do battle to be crowned LEGO Master.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yOXuSIcboLvDWGjfFmr9vTDZaTH.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:84379'),
  ('286296418123517401', 'LEGO Masters', 2019, 'Family, Comedy', null, null, 'Hamish Blake, Ryan McNaught', null, 'Eight pairs of Brick heads are pitted against each other in a quest to impress with their creativity, design and flair, driven by their unparalleled passion for the possibilities that will start with a single LEGO brick.', 'Eight pairs of Brick heads are pitted against each other in a quest to impress with their creativity, design and flair, driven by their unparalleled passion for the possibilities that will start with a single LEGO brick.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ocdD7DRYNmBXS8wOVAkFPKhXFL.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:88754'),
  ('630406813003580989', 'LEGO Masters', 2020, 'Family, Reality', null, null, 'Will Arnett, Jamie Berard, Amy Corbett', 'TV-PG', 'Teams of LEGO enthusiasts go head-to-head, with infinite possibilities and an unlimited supply of LEGO bricks. Teams of two will compete against each other in ambitious brick-building challenges to be crowned the country''s most talented amateur LEGO builders. Based on the hit British reality-competition series of the same name.', 'Teams of LEGO enthusiasts go head-to-head, with infinite possibilities and an unlimited supply of LEGO bricks. Teams of two will compete against each other in ambitious brick-building challenges to be crowned the country''s most talented amateur LEGO builders. Based on the hit British reality-competition series of the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cuRaXy34MGIxKa8VzG5QQcQUXp6.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:94064'),
  ('790905057827067223', 'LEGO Monkie Kid', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Family', null, null, null, 'TV-Y7', 'Centuries ago, the beloved Chinese Monkey King used his magical staff to capture and trap the evil Demon Bull King deep inside a mountain. Flash-forward to modern-day China, when fate leads MK (aka Monkie Kid), a young noodle shop delivery boy, to find the long-lost staff. Soon, MK and his best friends find themselves entangled in adventures packed full of action, mystery, imagination and magic.', 'Centuries ago, the beloved Chinese Monkey King used his magical staff to capture and trap the evil Demon Bull King deep inside a mountain. Flash-forward to modern-day China, when fate leads MK (aka Monkie Kid), a young noodle shop delivery boy, to find the long-lost staff. Soon, MK and his best friends find themselves entangled in adventures packed full of action, mystery, imagination and magic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mwkdJncS60B1QMjK2BdyDG4Bs8L.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:106251'),
  ('607554991741788768', 'LEGO Nexo Knights', 2015, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Kids, Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Alessandro Juliani, Vincent Tong, Giles Panton, Nicole Oliver, Brian Drummond, Maryke Hendrikse, Ian Hanlin, Erin Matthews', null, 'The adventure takes place in the futuristic Kingdom of Knighton. It focuses on the Nexo Knights as they journey to defeat Jestro the evil jester, the Book of Monsters, and their lava monster army. Clay leads the Nexo Knights, which include Macy, Lance, Aaron, and Axl. Together, under their mentor Merlok 2.0, they band together to defeat Jestro.', 'The adventure takes place in the futuristic Kingdom of Knighton. It focuses on the Nexo Knights as they journey to defeat Jestro the evil jester, the Book of Monsters, and their lava monster army. Clay leads the Nexo Knights, which include Macy, Lance, Aaron, and Axl. Together, under their mentor Merlok 2.0, they band together to defeat Jestro.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d0e5dJ2FQhlwEhFX4cB0ijp5SMd.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:65858'),
  ('658433282885110225', 'LEGO Ninjago: Dragons Rising', 2023, 'Animation, Kids, Action & Adventure', 'Chris Wyatt, Kevin Burke', null, null, 'TV-Y7', 'A phenomenon known as the Merge has caused many legendary realms to suddenly combine into one, but their union is unstable. A Spinjitzu Ninja Master must train a new generation of heroes to help find Elemental Dragons who can save the planet before the forces of evil use the same dragon energy to destroy this new world.', 'A phenomenon known as the Merge has caused many legendary realms to suddenly combine into one, but their union is unstable. A Spinjitzu Ninja Master must train a new generation of heroes to help find Elemental Dragons who can save the planet before the forces of evil use the same dragon energy to destroy this new world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5q3tfPVAcL9AlFcb8HXsOdHEtJR.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:212989'),
  ('377867320845973456', 'LEGO Pixar: BrickToons', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', null, null, null, 'TV-G', 'Join some of your favorite Pixar characters for adventures set in the world of LEGO! Each of the 5 BrickToon stories deliver familiar faces and places, with heart, humor and a LEGO twist.', 'Join some of your favorite Pixar characters for adventures set in the world of LEGO! Each of the 5 BrickToon stories deliver familiar faces and places, with heart, humor and a LEGO twist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yFswYZNprs9CgzkhaqPpBQuwGya.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:262153'),
  ('663619304961331384', 'LEGO Scooby-Doo Shorts', 2015, 'Animation, Kids, Family, Comedy, Mystery', 'Joseph Barbera', null, null, 'TV-Y7', 'A series of CGI animated shorts based on the LEGO Scooby-Doo! licensed products.', 'A series of CGI animated shorts based on the LEGO Scooby-Doo! licensed products.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a7V6RC2rIxm8O4WrywBRUNQQcL2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103464'),
  ('942405336527846890', 'LEGO Star Wars: All-Stars', 2018, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Bill Motz, Bob Roth', null, null, 'TV-Y7', 'An adventure series that spans all Star Wars eras featuring LEGO versions of the fresh faces of the Star Wars galaxy alongside iconic heroes including Kylo Ren, R2-D2, Young Han, Chewie, Young Lando, BB-8 and General Leia.', 'An adventure series that spans all Star Wars eras featuring LEGO versions of the fresh faces of the Star Wars galaxy alongside iconic heroes including Kylo Ren, R2-D2, Young Han, Chewie, Young Lando, BB-8 and General Leia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/97dmYYI7TACdGvXWQd2sIyMq16n.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83558'),
  ('188337872816201393', 'LEGO Star Wars: Droid Tales', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tom Kane, Anthony Daniels', 'TV-Y7', 'Luke Skywalker and the Rebel Alliance have defeated the Empire by destroying the Second Death Star, but celebrations are cut short when a mysterious hooded figure steals Admiral Ackbar''s ship with R2-D2 inside as an unwitting hostage! As C-3PO and the rest of the Rebels give chase across the galaxy, he recounts the many tales of the Rebels and their great adventures that led to the conflict between the Jedi and the Sith, the formation of the Empire, and their search for a new hope.', 'Luke Skywalker and the Rebel Alliance have defeated the Empire by destroying the Second Death Star, but celebrations are cut short when a mysterious hooded figure steals Admiral Ackbar''s ship with R2-D2 inside as an unwitting hostage! As C-3PO and the rest of the Rebels give chase across the galaxy, he recounts the many tales of the Rebels and their great adventures that led to the conflict between the Jedi and the Sith, the formation of the Empire, and their search for a new hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kwEtB6toMVkmoqEoG5Hl63KP9NL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63722'),
  ('558343327082368876', 'LEGO Star Wars: Rebuild the Galaxy', 2024, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Dan Hernandez, Benji Samit, James Waugh', 'Sophie Jones-Kellett', 'Gaten Matarazzo, Tony Revolori, Marsai Martin, Bobby Moynihan', 'TV-Y7', 'The entire Star Wars galaxy gets completely mixed up when an ordinary nerf-herder, Sig Greebling, unearths a powerful artifact from a hidden Jedi temple. He finds himself thrust into adventure in a new, wondrously wild and twisted version of the galaxy where good guys are bad, bad guys are good, and the fate of all depends on Sig becoming the hero who can put all the pieces back together.', 'The entire Star Wars galaxy gets completely mixed up when an ordinary nerf-herder, Sig Greebling, unearths a powerful artifact from a hidden Jedi temple. He finds himself thrust into adventure in a new, wondrously wild and twisted version of the galaxy where good guys are bad, bad guys are good, and the fate of all depends on Sig becoming the hero who can put all the pieces back together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2X2gEEAOFfGlRSmv5QvFU8h5xrV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:253760'),
  ('640390761861199183', 'LEGO Star Wars: Rebuild the Galaxy - Pieces of the Past', 2025, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Animation, Family', null, null, 'Gaten Matarazzo, Tony Revolori, Marsai Martin, Bobby Moynihan, Dan Stevens', 'TV-Y7', 'A new threat rises in the galaxy, and Sig Greebling and Darth Dev must combine their powers of Force Building and Sith Breaking to stop it. Alongside Jedi Bob, Yesi Scala and Servo, they will journey into the deepest corners of Lego Star Wars lore, uncovering pieces of all the galaxies that have come before.', 'A new threat rises in the galaxy, and Sig Greebling and Darth Dev must combine their powers of Force Building and Sith Breaking to stop it. Alongside Jedi Bob, Yesi Scala and Servo, they will journey into the deepest corners of Lego Star Wars lore, uncovering pieces of all the galaxies that have come before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ld6K4sIuTAlgAsIPYwW2yAvSz2m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:289411'),
  ('700164764076126929', 'LEGO Star Wars: The Freemaker Adventures', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Bill Motz, Bob Roth', 'Bob Roth, Bill Motz, James W. Bates', 'Nicolas Cantu, Vanessa Lengies, Eugene Byrd, Matthew Wood', 'TV-Y', 'Set between The Empire Strikes Back and Return of the Jedi, The Freemaker Adventures centers on a family of three young siblings—young boy Rowan, his sister Kordi, and their brother Zander—known as the Freemakers, who salvage parts from destroyed or damaged ships which they use to build new ones, which they sell in order to make their living. They are accompanied by their salvaged battle droid Roger.', 'Set between The Empire Strikes Back and Return of the Jedi, The Freemaker Adventures centers on a family of three young siblings—young boy Rowan, his sister Kordi, and their brother Zander—known as the Freemakers, who salvage parts from destroyed or damaged ships which they use to build new ones, which they sell in order to make their living. They are accompanied by their salvaged battle droid Roger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wmY6axhpMkZJhLY4agymOlZ2xHx.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66837'),
  ('576437823275874283', 'LEGO Star Wars: The Resistance Rises', 2016, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Kids', null, null, 'Tom Kane', 'TV-Y7', 'A series of animated shorts that take place prior to the First Order''s attack on Jakku and tell never-before-told stories including Kylo Ren, Han Solo, Finn, Rey, BB-8, Maz Kanata and more.', 'A series of animated shorts that take place prior to the First Order''s attack on Jakku and tell never-before-told stories including Kylo Ren, Han Solo, Finn, Rey, BB-8, Maz Kanata and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xvYc0QGTC1rMuONe6PWBnWnpfuv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66487'),
  ('1116969100008518041', 'LEGO Star Wars: The Yoda Chronicles', 2013, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Animation', null, null, 'Tom Kane, Anthony Daniels, Brian Dobson, Eric Bauza, Trevor Devall, Michael Daingerfield, Heather Doerksen, Matt Sloan', null, 'Yoda begins by training Padawans at the Jedi Temple Academy, but then he feels a disturbance in the Force and rushes off to fight the Dark Side.', 'Yoda begins by training Padawans at the Jedi Temple Academy, but then he feels a disturbance in the Force and rushes off to fight the Dark Side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zu4iwlKYljRA9ejccFjY5266grZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61513'),
  ('709760118303828184', 'LEGO: Jurassic World - Legend of Isla Nublar', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Family, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Britt McKillip, Ian Hanlin, Nicholas Holmes, Dhirendra', 'TV-Y', 'Set in 2012, three years before the Jurassic World movie, Owen Grady and Claire Dearing team up on Isla Nublar to deal with everything the Jurassic World park throws their way, including a mysterious saboteur who wants to destroy the park forever!', 'Set in 2012, three years before the Jurassic World movie, Owen Grady and Claire Dearing team up on Isla Nublar to deal with everything the Jurassic World park throws their way, including a mysterious saboteur who wants to destroy the park forever!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wMoL1JuARTsAPxf8b85rQfT6Opp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93895'),
  ('446634923584592931', 'Leila', 2019, 'War & Politics, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Urmi Juvekar', null, 'Huma Qureshi, Siddharth, Rahul Khanna, Adarsh Gourav, Sanjay Suri, Vidhi Chitalia, Arif Zakaria, Akash Khurana', 'TV-MA', 'In the forgotten margins of the segregated communities of a dystopian future, a woman searches for the daughter that she lost upon her arrest years ago.', 'In the forgotten margins of the segregated communities of a dystopian future, a woman searches for the daughter that she lost upon her arrest years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fNp0B9slDgBWOcJJjyv7Bf2fPQI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89545'),
