  ('64149411615604362', 'Les Cordier, juge et flic', 1994, 'Crime', 'Alain Page', null, 'Julien Chatelet, Antonella Lualdi, Bruno Madinier, Pierre Mondy, Charlotte Valandrey, Manuela Servais, André Penvern', null, 'The Cordier fight in family against the crime: the father is police captain, the son, investigating judge and the girl, a journalist.', 'The Cordier fight in family against the crime: the father is police captain, the son, investigating judge and the girl, a journalist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4UUiBZP40YXYuJMTu4t1rOd1Ph.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:63637'),
