  ('47486441136532818', 'Les Invincibles', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'François Létourneau, Jean-François Rivard', null, 'Pierre-François Legendre, Rémi-Pierre Paquin, Patrice Robitaille, François Létourneau', null, 'Les Invincibles is a comedy/drama television series from Radio-Canada produced by Casablanca Productions and Alliance Atlantis Vivafilm. The story is about four twenty-something men signing a pact ordaining the simultaneous break-up of their current relationships, and the subsequent adoption of a common responsibility-free life. In 2006, the show won an "Olivier" for best drama series. The third and last season ended on March 25, 2009. A remake of the series was made in France. Filming began in Strasbourg in August 2008 and the show was broadcast on the Franco-German Arte network in Fall 2009.', 'Les Invincibles is a comedy/drama television series from Radio-Canada produced by Casablanca Productions and Alliance Atlantis Vivafilm. The story is about four twenty-something men signing a pact ordaining the simultaneous break-up of their current relationships, and the subsequent adoption of a common responsibility-free life. In 2006, the show won an "Olivier" for best drama series. The third and last season ended on March 25, 2009. A remake of the series was made in France. Filming began in Strasbourg in August 2008 and the show was broadcast on the Franco-German Arte network in Fall 2009.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jVe7Jtx6fcowLpDXt49u5vdzoLl.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:4748'),
  ('1106576367477224058', 'Les Misérables', 2000, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Josée Dayan', null, 'Gérard Depardieu, John Malkovich, Christian Clavier, Asia Argento, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Jeanne Moreau, Veronica Ferres, Virginie Ledoyen', null, 'Set against the background of the French Revolution and based on Victor Hugo''s classic novel this is the story of Jean Valjean who is sent to prison for stealing a loaf of bread and is released after nineteen years. He meets and cares for a beautiful but poverty-stricken young girl named Fantine who has daughter Cosette. After Fantine''s death Valjean brings Cosette up but he is haunted by Javert - a policeman whose search for Valjean has become an obsession.', 'Set against the background of the French Revolution and based on Victor Hugo''s classic novel this is the story of Jean Valjean who is sent to prison for stealing a loaf of bread and is released after nineteen years. He meets and cares for a beautiful but poverty-stricken young girl named Fantine who has daughter Cosette. After Fantine''s death Valjean brings Cosette up but he is haunted by Javert - a policeman whose search for Valjean has become an obsession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qQU0VgFE9kzGXdZbVcPPwah39CU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43512'),
  ('690449931411204353', 'Les Misérables', 2018, 'Drama', null, null, 'Dominic West, David Oyelowo, Adeel Akhtar', 'TV-14', 'France, 1815. Jean Valjean, a common thief, is released from prison after having lived a hell in life for 19 years, but a small mistake puts the law again on his trail. Ruthless Inspector Javert pursues him thorough years, driven by a twisted sense of justice, while Valjean reforms himself, thrives and dedicates his life to good deeds. In 1832, while the revolution ravages the streets of Paris, Valjean and Javert cross their paths for the last time.', 'France, 1815. Jean Valjean, a common thief, is released from prison after having lived a hell in life for 19 years, but a small mistake puts the law again on his trail. Ruthless Inspector Javert pursues him thorough years, driven by a twisted sense of justice, while Valjean reforms himself, thrives and dedicates his life to good deeds. In 1832, while the revolution ravages the streets of Paris, Valjean and Javert cross their paths for the last time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vD5gUfFYEuYXwfOVJQjLIQTGs0s.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81224'),
  ('762171303971949707', 'Les Mystères de l''amour', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jean-Luc Azoulay', null, 'Hélène Rollès, Patrick Puydebat, Laly Meignan, Sébastien Roch, Laure Guibert, Philippe Vasseur, Elsa Esnoult, Macha Polikarpova', null, 'Direct sequel to the cult French TV series “Hélène et les Garçons”.', 'Direct sequel to the cult French TV series “Hélène et les Garçons”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hpyedombn2pZ8SHMDFwxEtyutoI.jpg', 37, 'tmdb:tv:63935'),
  ('982535214956410288', 'Les Rendez-vous du dimanche', 1975, 'Talk', 'Françoise Coquet, Michel Drucker', null, 'Michel Drucker', null, 'A talk show presented by Michel Drucker', 'A talk show presented by Michel Drucker', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/csEN53LOtSMucpBohRi8YKY27WU.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:136450'),
  ('511419183072654140', 'Les Shadoks', 1968, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jacques Rouxel', 'Jacques Rouxel', 'Claude Piéplu', null, 'Les Shadoks is an animated television series created by French cartoonist Jacques Rouxel which caused a sensation in France when it was first broadcast in 1968-1974. The Shadoks were bird-like in appearance, were characterised by ruthlessness and stupidity and inhabited a two dimensional planet. Another set of creatures in the Shadok canon are the Gibis, who are the opposite to the Shadoks in that they are intelligent but vulnerable and also inhabit a two-dimensional planet. Rouxel claims that the term Shadok obtains some derivation from Captain Haddock of Hergé''s The Adventures of Tintin and the Gibis are essentially GBs. The Shadoks were a significant literary, cultural and philosophical phenomenon in France. Even today, the French occasionally use satirical comparisons with the Shadoks for policies and attitudes that they consider absurd. The Shadoks were noted for mottos such as: ⁕"Why do it the easy way when you can do it the hard way?" ⁕"When one tries continuously, one ends up succeeding. Thus, the more one fails, the greater the chance that it will work."', 'Les Shadoks is an animated television series created by French cartoonist Jacques Rouxel which caused a sensation in France when it was first broadcast in 1968-1974. The Shadoks were bird-like in appearance, were characterised by ruthlessness and stupidity and inhabited a two dimensional planet. Another set of creatures in the Shadok canon are the Gibis, who are the opposite to the Shadoks in that they are intelligent but vulnerable and also inhabit a two-dimensional planet. Rouxel claims that the term Shadok obtains some derivation from Captain Haddock of Hergé''s The Adventures of Tintin and the Gibis are essentially GBs. The Shadoks were a significant literary, cultural and philosophical phenomenon in France. Even today, the French occasionally use satirical comparisons with the Shadoks for policies and attitudes that they consider absurd. The Shadoks were noted for mottos such as: ⁕"Why do it the easy way when you can do it the hard way?" ⁕"When one tries continuously, one ends up succeeding. Thus, the more one fails, the greater the chance that it will work."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcQILQmn8HWVfB0HSxkwc14kWEh.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:14710'),
  ('291502003477705484', 'Les Traîtres', 2024, 'Reality', null, 'Mathieu Bouillon', 'Karine Vanasse', null, 'Karine Vanasse invites 20 guests to her mysterious mansion for a new reality TV thriller. Among them are traitors who will kill a member of the faithful each night in order to be the only ones to get their hands on the loot worth up to $100,000. Will the traitors be unmasked in time?', 'Karine Vanasse invites 20 guests to her mysterious mansion for a new reality TV thriller. Among them are traitors who will kill a member of the faithful each night in order to be the only ones to get their hands on the loot worth up to $100,000. Will the traitors be unmasked in time?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhze16I2nk1wUNimq7KUnFOGAPz.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:244999'),
  ('960873720225926607', 'Les traîtres : Révélations sur la suite...', 2024, 'Reality, Family', null, null, 'Justine Becattini, Elodie Mielczareck', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iuOufIt6eUNLP0hdvo0VxTFCmH4.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:261325'),
  ('846228034679280465', 'Less than Evil', 2018, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Shin Ha-kyun, Lee Sul, Park Ho-san, Kim Gun-woo, Cha Sun-woo, Bae Da-bin, Bae Yu-ram, Yang Jae-young', null, 'Woo Tae Suk is an experienced and well-established detective with a long professional career, but in spite of everything he is a lonely and bitter human being. It all has to do with him only focusing on solving cases, while his actions are completely controversial because it crosses the line between good and evil. Woo Tae Suk crosses paths with a psychopath, but he cannot arrest her because of lack of evidence. The woman eventually decides to help Woo Tae Suk solve other cases.', 'Woo Tae Suk is an experienced and well-established detective with a long professional career, but in spite of everything he is a lonely and bitter human being. It all has to do with him only focusing on solving cases, while his actions are completely controversial because it crosses the line between good and evil. Woo Tae Suk crosses paths with a psychopath, but he cannot arrest her because of lack of evidence. The woman eventually decides to help Woo Tae Suk solve other cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1nqKh4icqoFR4Wo5q9ULcyaDxDr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84448'),
  ('861278879445240586', 'Less than Perfect', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Terri Minsky', null, 'Sara Rue, Sherri Shepherd, Andrea Parker, Zachary Levi, Patrick Warburton, Andy Dick, Will Sasso', 'TV-PG', 'Claude Casey moved up in the secretarial world of television news, from temp to the anchor''s desk. After her boss hires her full time, Claude realizes she may be in over her head in this world of assistants fighting to get ahead. But Claude is determined to prove that though she may not be perfect, she''s not going down without a fight.', 'Claude Casey moved up in the secretarial world of television news, from temp to the anchor''s desk. After her boss hires her full time, Claude realizes she may be in over her head in this world of assistants fighting to get ahead. But Claude is determined to prove that though she may not be perfect, she''s not going down without a fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKKV8RNURtXipLmxa26PfazWuYy.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:110'),
  ('419912999770668287', 'Lessons in Chemistry', 2023, 'Drama', 'Lee Eisenberg', null, 'Brie Larson, Lewis Pullman, Aja Naomi King, Stephanie Koenig, Patrick Walker', 'TV-MA', 'In the 1950s, Elizabeth Zott''s dream of being a scientist is challenged by a society that says women belong in the domestic sphere. She accepts a job on a TV cooking show and sets out to teach a nation of overlooked housewives way more than recipes.', 'In the 1950s, Elizabeth Zott''s dream of being a scientist is challenged by a society that says women belong in the domestic sphere. She accepts a job on a TV cooking show and sets out to teach a nation of overlooked housewives way more than recipes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCPIf5f6jUIr8KDMWsfaXwXW0kl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117303'),
  ('455920258349839362', 'Lessons of Life', 2015, 'Drama', null, null, null, null, 'Discover dramatic stories about people facing trials, betrayals, and hidden passions. "Lessons of Life" brings suspense, emotion, and real lessons.', 'Discover dramatic stories about people facing trials, betrayals, and hidden passions. "Lessons of Life" brings suspense, emotion, and real lessons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qp3LlYyHmAQrpuegrCEajDFS7N.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:298485'),
  ('905150505238100893', 'Let Free the Curse of Taekwondo', 2024, 'Drama', 'Hwang Da-seul', null, 'Kim Nu-rim, Lee Sun, Jang Yeon-woo, Yoo Ha-bok, Kim Gyeong-ryong, Han So-hyun, Yoon Ji-won, Ham Sang-hyeok', null, 'Do-hoe, a high schooler disillusioned by his father''s violent Taekwondo gym, forms a bond with Ju-young, but their connection is strained by family pressure. Ten years later, they reunite.', 'Do-hoe, a high schooler disillusioned by his father''s violent Taekwondo gym, forms a bond with Ju-young, but their connection is strained by family pressure. Ten years later, they reunite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4n0P8wp75kitDY3b1SeWgvSUMvQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:240831'),
  ('249885088221547497', 'Let Me Be Your Knight', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Seo Jeong-eun, Yoo So-Won', 'Jung In-sun, Lee Jun-young, Jang Dong-ju, JR, Yoon Ji-sung, Kim Dong-hyun, Seo Hye-won, Ahn Ha-young', null, 'A story of romance and healing between one of the world’s greatest idols who is suffering from somnambulism and the doctor who is secretly treating him. Jun’s character Yoon Tae In is an untouchable idol star who is loved all around the world, and a musical genius who believes he is the center of the universe.', 'A story of romance and healing between one of the world’s greatest idols who is suffering from somnambulism and the doctor who is secretly treating him. Jun’s character Yoon Tae In is an untouchable idol star who is loved all around the world, and a musical genius who believes he is the center of the universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8p1kRlCIPKYMDhnwwa9YE8SlFkO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:134071'),
  ('375845451960645457', 'Let the Right One In', 2022, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Andrew Hinderaker', null, 'Madison Taylor Baez, Ian Foreman, Demián Bichir, Anika Noni Rose, Grace Gummer, Jacob Buster, Kevin Carroll', 'TV-MA', 'Mark and his 12-year-old daughter’s lives were changed forever 10 years earlier when she was turned into a vampire. Locked in at age 12, perhaps forever, Eleanor lives a closed-in life, able to go out only at night, while her father does his best to provide her with the minimal amount of human blood she needs to stay alive.', 'Mark and his 12-year-old daughter’s lives were changed forever 10 years earlier when she was turned into a vampire. Locked in at age 12, perhaps forever, Eleanor lives a closed-in life, able to go out only at night, while her father does his best to provide her with the minimal amount of human blood she needs to stay alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRsmGF1AVuMY26ArRxMpKJ8S8NL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:136735'),
  ('538834643959345658', 'Let This Grieving Soul Retire', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kensho Ono, Miyu Kubota, Fairouz Ai, Konomi Kohara, Kohei Amasaki, Tomokazu Sugita, Aoi Koga, You Taichi', 'TV-14', 'Six childhood friends make a vow one day to become treasure hunters, and eventually grow to be the strongest heroes in the world. During his first quest, Krai Andrey realizes he isn’t cut out for the job. Even so, his friends make him their leader. Underpowered in the face of great expectations, Krai embarks on a reluctant hero’s tale of glory, headaches, and wanting to retire early.', 'Six childhood friends make a vow one day to become treasure hunters, and eventually grow to be the strongest heroes in the world. During his first quest, Krai Andrey realizes he isn’t cut out for the job. Even so, his friends make him their leader. Underpowered in the face of great expectations, Krai embarks on a reluctant hero’s tale of glory, headaches, and wanting to retire early.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/egViTAdBqUyUFI2sIBsGbnH5Sun.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:258579'),
  ('347558055791334261', 'Let''s Dance', 2006, 'Reality', 'Fenia Vardanis', null, 'Victoria Swarovski, Daniel Hartwich, Jorge González, Motsi Mabuse, Joachim Llambi', null, 'German version of Dancing with the Stars, the reality competition in which celebrities perform choreographed dance routines which are judged by a panel of renowned ballroom experts and voted on by viewers.', 'German version of Dancing with the Stars, the reality competition in which celebrities perform choreographed dance routines which are judged by a panel of renowned ballroom experts and voted on by viewers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mc8Ax0rFNFJpALylHCDCaKG2D96.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:22021'),
  ('499348979537708632', 'Let''s Eat', 2013, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Lim Soo Mi', 'Lim Soo Mi', 'Yoon Doo-joon, Baek Jin-hee, An Woo-yeon, Lee Ju-woo, Kim Dong-young, Lee Ji-hyeon, Park Han-sol, Jang Won-young', null, 'What do a group of foodies and a murder have in common? Lee Soo Kyung is a 33-year-old divorcee who is a composed, confident woman who is happy to be living alone after marrying way too early in life. But the only thing that can make her lose her cool composure is great food. Living next door is another foodie, Goo Dae Young, a single man who loves surrounding himself with gourmet food but hates being asked if he is dining alone at great restaurants. When a strange murder occurs in their neighborhood, how will their lives be intertwined?', 'What do a group of foodies and a murder have in common? Lee Soo Kyung is a 33-year-old divorcee who is a composed, confident woman who is happy to be living alone after marrying way too early in life. But the only thing that can make her lose her cool composure is great food. Living next door is another foodie, Goo Dae Young, a single man who loves surrounding himself with gourmet food but hates being asked if he is dining alone at great restaurants. When a strange murder occurs in their neighborhood, how will their lives be intertwined?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/63PsUTkJ2FnDYzJGFNKPLYFDQpO.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:62411'),
  ('406335686886076012', 'Let''s Eat Dinner Together', 2016, 'Reality', null, 'Ha Gyeong-hwa', 'Lee Kyung-kyu, Kang Ho-dong', null, 'As more and more people are getting used to eating dinner alone, Kang Ho-dong and Lee Kyung-kyu visit ordinary Korean families at dinner time and share their lives as they eat dinner together.', 'As more and more people are getting used to eating dinner alone, Kang Ho-dong and Lee Kyung-kyu visit ordinary Korean families at dinner time and share their lives as they eat dinner together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssSlNCa17L8ZD7KvGICE3bXURql.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71963'),
  ('868446444680769856', 'Let''s Fall in Love', 2016, 'Drama, Family', null, null, 'Ming Dao, Yuan Hong, Qin Lan, Zhang Xinyi, Zhang Jingchu, Yang Qing, Gu Yuhan, Ma Chengcheng', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oK1N0z6fQ9wJJltUdpKikLV2aha.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112492'),
  ('959459973712536469', 'Let''s Fight Ghost', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Suppapong Udomkaewkanjana, Patchanan Jiajirachote, Kornrawich Sungkibool, Thanidaphat Tinsutthinanon, Thongpoom Siripipat, Apiwich Reardon, Supranee Charoenpol', null, 'A cohabitation comedy about a ghost of a high school girl who has been dead for 5 years and an exorcist college boy with the ability to see and hear ghosts. What he’s discovered over the years is that he can touch them and fight them off, so when he’s in need of a part-time job and can’t find one that pays well enough, he starts putting ads online as an exorcist for hire. His ad: “Will face off with your ghosts. Chances of winning: virgin ghosts 80%, bachelor ghosts 40%, child ghosts 97%, the rest 50%.” One night he goes out on the job and faces off with a schoolgirl ghost, and during the fight, they accidentally kiss and sparks fly."', 'A cohabitation comedy about a ghost of a high school girl who has been dead for 5 years and an exorcist college boy with the ability to see and hear ghosts. What he’s discovered over the years is that he can touch them and fight them off, so when he’s in need of a part-time job and can’t find one that pays well enough, he starts putting ads online as an exorcist for hire. His ad: “Will face off with your ghosts. Chances of winning: virgin ghosts 80%, bachelor ghosts 40%, child ghosts 97%, the rest 50%.” One night he goes out on the job and faces off with a schoolgirl ghost, and during the fight, they accidentally kiss and sparks fly."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHKxpDheZPV44KjwPCG9bjWmqI8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:119917'),
  ('251269512389830715', 'Let''s Get Divorced', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Fuminori Kaneko, Ryôsuke Fukuda, Takuya Sakagami', null, 'Tori Matsuzaka, Riisa Naka, Ryo Nishikido, Yuka Itaya, Koji Yamamoto, Arata Furuta, Fuju Kamio, Reiko Takashima', 'TV-14', 'A mediatised married couple who no longer love each other is highly optimistic about getting a divorce. However, external circumstances will get in their way and they will have no other choice but to work hand in hand to reach their ultimate goal: getting a divorce.', 'A mediatised married couple who no longer love each other is highly optimistic about getting a divorce. However, external circumstances will get in their way and they will have no other choice but to work hand in hand to reach their ultimate goal: getting a divorce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u42D2SlB7HKtA0H0QRsvXc3l0Zj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:216223'),
  ('156550614364692414', 'Let''s Go Quintuplets!', 2001, 'Animation', null, null, 'Chie Koujiro, Fujiko Takimoto, Hiro Yuuki, Kae Araki, Yuko Mizutani, Kenichi Ogata', null, 'Go! Go! Itsutsugo Land is a Japanese anime series that originally aired in Japan during 2001 and 2002 on TBS. The series has been dubbed into English and aired in New Zealand as Let''s Go Quintuplets!. In the Netherlands the series has been broadcast Jetix starting from 2005, under the title Bende van Vijf. In the Netherlands the show is more popular than in Japan and the United States. The series is about five quintuplets, Kabuto, Hinoki, Arashi, Kinoko and Kodama Morino, who have all kinds of adventures together. The series totals 50 episodes, each one consisting of 1 to 2 parts. The name Go! Go! Itsutsugo has a double meaning. Go is, apart from the English word, also Japanese for "five". Itsutsugo means quintuplet.', 'Go! Go! Itsutsugo Land is a Japanese anime series that originally aired in Japan during 2001 and 2002 on TBS. The series has been dubbed into English and aired in New Zealand as Let''s Go Quintuplets!. In the Netherlands the series has been broadcast Jetix starting from 2005, under the title Bende van Vijf. In the Netherlands the show is more popular than in Japan and the United States. The series is about five quintuplets, Kabuto, Hinoki, Arashi, Kinoko and Kodama Morino, who have all kinds of adventures together. The series totals 50 episodes, each one consisting of 1 to 2 parts. The name Go! Go! Itsutsugo has a double meaning. Go is, apart from the English word, also Japanese for "five". Itsutsugo means quintuplet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8G4MwaOQYdeHzpuDJEPPcII5uoa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16821'),
  ('454857026210773049', 'Let''s Make a Deal', 2009, 'Reality', null, null, 'Wayne Brady, Jonathan Mangum, Tiffany Coyne', null, 'Audience members dress up in outlandish costumes to get host Wayne Brady''s attention in an attempt to make deals for trips, prizes, cars or cash, while trying to avoid the dreaded Zonks.', 'Audience members dress up in outlandish costumes to get host Wayne Brady''s attention in an attempt to make deals for trips, prizes, cars or cash, while trying to avoid the dreaded Zonks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9e2zBDDJNzwKymAWDuLhgViPc06.jpg', 17, 'tmdb:tv:114439'),
  ('771763534159673248', 'Let''s Make a Mug Too', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Minami Tanaka, Yu Serizawa, Yuuki Wakai, Rina Honnizumi, Aya Uchida, Sally Amaki, Ari Ozawa', 'TV-PG', 'Together with her father, who had quit his salaryman job, Toyokawa Himeno moves to Gifu prefecture''s Tajimi city. That''s the city where her mother is from, whom she had lost when she was still young. Himeno is now attending her mother''s alma mater, where her classmate Kukuri Mika invites her to tag along to a special place. That place turns out to be the pottery club! There, she learns for the first time that her mother was a legendary potter, and is consequently pulled into the world of pottery.', 'Together with her father, who had quit his salaryman job, Toyokawa Himeno moves to Gifu prefecture''s Tajimi city. That''s the city where her mother is from, whom she had lost when she was still young. Himeno is now attending her mother''s alma mater, where her classmate Kukuri Mika invites her to tag along to a special place. That place turns out to be the pottery club! There, she learns for the first time that her mother was a legendary potter, and is consequently pulled into the world of pottery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNnyQoWgTPlKfAFLEjIci9ug1z7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:106611'),
  ('859645270661429915', 'Let''s Meet at Hinatazaka', 2019, 'Reality', 'Yasushi Akimoto', null, 'Masayasu Wakabayashi, Kasuga Toshiaki', null, 'Hinatazaka46''s variety show following the format of the prequel Hiragana Oshi after the group changed their name from Hiragana Keyakizaka46 to Hinatazaka46. The show started on 7th April 2019 and is aired every Sunday late night 1:05 am JST.', 'Hinatazaka46''s variety show following the format of the prequel Hiragana Oshi after the group changed their name from Hiragana Keyakizaka46 to Hinatazaka46. The show started on 7th April 2019 and is aired every Sunday late night 1:05 am JST.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10JBHKcQkhO9upveCfrClhMEbeF.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:99748'),
  ('529300051691311649', 'Let''s Play', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Kana Hanazawa, Shimba Tsuchiya, Yuichi Nakamura, Tomokazu Sugita', null, 'Samara “Sam” Young is a developer in Los Angeles who’s about to achieve her dreams with her first video game, Ruminate. That is, until a popular streamer gives the game a scathing review. Even worse, Sam finds out the troublesome critic is now her new neighbor! Get lost in a comedic, romantic, and all-too-real story about gaming, memes, and social anxiety. Come for the plot, stay for the doggo.', 'Samara “Sam” Young is a developer in Los Angeles who’s about to achieve her dreams with her first video game, Ruminate. That is, until a popular streamer gives the game a scathing review. Even worse, Sam finds out the troublesome critic is now her new neighbor! Get lost in a comedic, romantic, and all-too-real story about gaming, memes, and social anxiety. Come for the plot, stay for the doggo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJbyOYE4befDE7SgV03aJzxt8Ja.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:293010'),
  ('645775748360262811', 'Let''s Play Minecraft', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Gavin Free, Geoff Ramsey', null, 'Michael Jones, Jack Pattillo, Gavin Free, Geoff Ramsey, Ray Narvaez Jr., Jeremy Dooley, Matt Bragg, Alfredo Díaz', null, 'Achievement Hunter takes on the hardest tests in the search for power, fame, and the coveted Tower of Pimps: a gold monolith that grants the winner special powers like arrogance and hatred from coworkers. Welcome to...Achievement City.', 'Achievement Hunter takes on the hardest tests in the search for power, fame, and the coveted Tower of Pimps: a gold monolith that grants the winner special powers like arrogance and hatred from coworkers. Welcome to...Achievement City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFWVnhvbnE1BhK2QR5fIHiXrOoU.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:207655'),
  ('856305590415360782', 'Let''s Talk About CHU', 2024, 'Family, Drama, Comedy', 'Wu Mei-chih', 'Wu Mei-chih, Remii Huang, Milia Luo', 'Chan Tzu-hsuan, Kai Ko, JC Lin, Wu Chien-ho, Hsia Yu-chiao, Umin Boya, Miao Ke-li, Honduras', 'TV-MA', 'Part-time vlogger Chu Ai uses her channel to speak candidly about sex. But in real life, she finds that subject to be so much trickier.', 'Part-time vlogger Chu Ai uses her channel to speak candidly about sex. But in real life, she finds that subject to be so much trickier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWrZf7EWOCifxbMcM2j9Nc2SjQA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209226'),
  ('16486524822334843', 'Lethal Weapon', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Matthew Miller', null, 'Damon Wayans, Seann William Scott, Keesha Sharp, Kevin Rahm, Johnathan Fernandez, Michelle Mitchenor', 'TV-14', 'A slightly unhinged former Navy SEAL lands a job as a police officer in Los Angeles where he''s partnered with a veteran detective trying to keep maintain a low stress level in his life.', 'A slightly unhinged former Navy SEAL lands a job as a police officer in Los Angeles where he''s partnered with a veteran detective trying to keep maintain a low stress level in his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/grGOtTZ0OfNQoWnNtdJOiY1LB8e.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:67116'),
  ('158127695229509280', 'Letterkenny', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Jared Keeso', 'Jacob Tierney', 'Jared Keeso, Nathan Dales, Michelle Mylett, K. Trevor Wilson, Andrew Herr, Tyler Johnston, Dylan Playfair, Kim Cloutier', 'TV-MA', 'Letterkenny follows Wayne, a good-ol’ country boy in Letterkenny, Ontario trying to protect his homegrown way of life on the farm, against a world that is constantly evolving around him. The residents of Letterkenny belong to one of three groups: Hicks, Skids, and Hockey Players. The three groups are constantly feuding with each other over seemingly trivial matters; often ending with someone getting their ass kicked.', 'Letterkenny follows Wayne, a good-ol’ country boy in Letterkenny, Ontario trying to protect his homegrown way of life on the farm, against a world that is constantly evolving around him. The residents of Letterkenny belong to one of three groups: Hicks, Skids, and Hockey Players. The three groups are constantly feuding with each other over seemingly trivial matters; often ending with someone getting their ass kicked.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zrB0Viy72GYKiLrtSs7SQVz5QWl.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:65798'),
  ('744439826941825534', 'Letters from the Past', 2025, 'Drama', 'Rana Denizer', 'Rana Denizer', 'Gökçe Bahadır, Onur Tuna, Selin Yeninci, Erdem Şenocak, Güneş Nezihe Şensoy, Kerem Alp Kabul, Saygın Soysal, Can Bartu Arslan', 'TV-MA', 'When a young woman discovers a long-buried secret about her past, she must trace back a collection of letters to their writers to uncover the truth.', 'When a young woman discovers a long-buried secret about her past, she must trace back a collection of letters to their writers to uncover the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Qf3RfNU2uwxkIdKnCkBmZcfRK8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278006'),
  ('788292830050173861', 'Letzte Spur Berlin', 2012, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Hans-Werner Meyer, Jasmin Tabatabai', 'NR', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zPNBkX3afuYN1jK5acGX9DBwsmi.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:62488'),
  ('519358267560755167', 'Leute heute', 1997, 'News', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 27, 'tmdb:tv:111979'),
  ('1150760989789415540', 'Level 1 Demon Lord & One Room Hero', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuichi Nakamura, Naomi Ohzora, Yoko Hikasa, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Hiro Shimono, Ami Koshimizu', 'TV-14', 'Ten years ago, the hero Max defeated the Demon Lord. In order to regain his power, the Demon Lord went into a deep slumber...but when he awakens, his body is only a chibi version of its fearsome form. Now curious to see what his enemy is up to, the Demon Lord visits Max, only to discover the mighty hero living in a dirty one-room apartment. The Demon Lord decides to move in with Max and help his old enemy become a formidable opponent once more!', 'Ten years ago, the hero Max defeated the Demon Lord. In order to regain his power, the Demon Lord went into a deep slumber...but when he awakens, his body is only a chibi version of its fearsome form. Now curious to see what his enemy is up to, the Demon Lord visits Max, only to discover the mighty hero living in a dirty one-room apartment. The Demon Lord decides to move in with Max and help his old enemy become a formidable opponent once more!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6YOhBnWSgvsr3iS8asoeAJwlnb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:196220'),
  ('871883535591466953', 'Level E', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Daisuke Namikawa, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Satomi Akesaka, Takehito Koyasu, Masaya Takatsuka, Takumi Asahina', 'TV-MA', 'Earth has been populated by thousands of aliens from all over the galaxy. While all the other aliens are aware of their presence, it is a secret only from the Earthlings. Baka, the prince of the planet Dogra, crash lands on Earth and loses his memory. He forcibly moves in with Yukitaka Tsutsui, a first year high school student who had just moved out on his own. The normal life he once knew is quickly pulled away as he becomes the target of the prince''s torment.', 'Earth has been populated by thousands of aliens from all over the galaxy. While all the other aliens are aware of their presence, it is a secret only from the Earthlings. Baka, the prince of the planet Dogra, crash lands on Earth and loses his memory. He forcibly moves in with Yukitaka Tsutsui, a first year high school student who had just moved out on his own. The normal life he once knew is quickly pulled away as he becomes the target of the prince''s torment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tdhOYnrkZhSr6wiLDWOKIozRhEI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38559'),
  ('1050874237941848032', 'Level Up', 2019, 'Comedy', null, 'Kim Dong gyu', 'Sung Hoon, Han Bo-reum, Cha Sun-woo, Kang Byul, Danny Ahn, Ryu Seung-su, Lee Byung-joon, Kim Ji-in', null, 'Cold and precise, An Dan-Te is the no-nonsense director of Yoo Seong CRC, a company which specializes in the restructuring and resurrecting of companies on the brink of failure. Sent to Joybuster, a game company on the brink of bankruptcy, Dan-Te takes on the role of CEO and wastes no time in trying to get this company back on its feet. As head of game development at Joybuster, Shin Yeon-Hwa teams up with her new CEO, in an attempt to save their dying company. Tasked with developing a new game which satisfies all of Dan-Te’s demands, Yeon-Hwa soon finds herself wavering somewhere between having a nervous breakdown and committing murder. Completely at odds with each other, Yeon-Hwa and Dan-Te never seem to stop fighting; but everyone knows opposites always find a way to attract. Can the poker-faced boss with zero emotions and the hot-tempered game developer really find love when they can’t even agree on a way to save their dying company?', 'Cold and precise, An Dan-Te is the no-nonsense director of Yoo Seong CRC, a company which specializes in the restructuring and resurrecting of companies on the brink of failure. Sent to Joybuster, a game company on the brink of bankruptcy, Dan-Te takes on the role of CEO and wastes no time in trying to get this company back on its feet. As head of game development at Joybuster, Shin Yeon-Hwa teams up with her new CEO, in an attempt to save their dying company. Tasked with developing a new game which satisfies all of Dan-Te’s demands, Yeon-Hwa soon finds herself wavering somewhere between having a nervous breakdown and committing murder. Completely at odds with each other, Yeon-Hwa and Dan-Te never seem to stop fighting; but everyone knows opposites always find a way to attract. Can the poker-faced boss with zero emotions and the hot-tempered game developer really find love when they can’t even agree on a way to save their dying company?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1dSIcLMIZFT0XnkoGOSDhcbj89.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90638'),
  ('506101840175760933', 'Leverage', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'John Rogers, Chris Downey', null, 'Timothy Hutton, Gina Bellman, Christian Kane, Beth Riesgraf, Aldis Hodge', 'TV-14', 'A five-person team comprised of a thief, a grifter, a hacker, and a retrieval specialist, led by former insurance investigator Nathan Ford, use their skills to fight corporate and governmental injustices inflicted on ordinary citizens.', 'A five-person team comprised of a thief, a grifter, a hacker, and a retrieval specialist, led by former insurance investigator Nathan Ford, use their skills to fight corporate and governmental injustices inflicted on ordinary citizens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5KJXooBqJLKUClpvYuSKNrcYGy.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:7482'),
  ('245128697490775005', 'Leverage', 2019, 'Crime', null, 'Min Ji hyeong', 'Lee Dong-gun, Jeon Hye-bin, Kim Sae-ron, Kim Kwon, Yeo Hoi-hyeon, Choi Ja-hye, Kim Kwang-shik', null, 'There are countless incidents happening in one day. The corruption of the upper class discourages the common people who are living their lives diligently. From immorality to financial fraud, and they even commit a highly developed type of expedient. The victims of corruption are us, the common people. However, we have no choice but to be relieved that the victim is not me at least for this time. To turn the table, the best experts in each field have gathered! The former insurance investigator, Tae Joon, has a son who is terminally ill. To save his son, he accepts the deal which is extremely dangerous. And his life completely changes after that day. He organizes a team to get back at those corrupted rich people. With Su Kyung, Na Byeol, Roy, and Eui Sung, Tae Joon approaches to the conspiracy. Self-interest is rampant in our society, but through their journey to exposing the corruption, they begin to understand each other at the end.', 'There are countless incidents happening in one day. The corruption of the upper class discourages the common people who are living their lives diligently. From immorality to financial fraud, and they even commit a highly developed type of expedient. The victims of corruption are us, the common people. However, we have no choice but to be relieved that the victim is not me at least for this time. To turn the table, the best experts in each field have gathered! The former insurance investigator, Tae Joon, has a son who is terminally ill. To save his son, he accepts the deal which is extremely dangerous. And his life completely changes after that day. He organizes a team to get back at those corrupted rich people. With Su Kyung, Na Byeol, Roy, and Eui Sung, Tae Joon approaches to the conspiracy. Self-interest is rampant in our society, but through their journey to exposing the corruption, they begin to understand each other at the end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xBnKqQUy5NJdJ6fCD0dmiNNFSU6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94510'),
  ('934273119985744880', 'Leverage: Redemption', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Chris Downey, John Rogers', null, 'Gina Bellman, Christian Kane, Beth Riesgraf, Aleyse Shannon', 'TV-14', 'The Hitter, the Hacker, the Grifter and the Thief are together again, this time with help from a new tech genius and corporate fixer, to take on a new kind of villain. From the man who created an opioid crisis from the comfort of his boardroom to the shadowy security firm that helps hide dangerous secrets for a price - when someone needs help, they provide... Leverage.', 'The Hitter, the Hacker, the Grifter and the Thief are together again, this time with help from a new tech genius and corporate fixer, to take on a new kind of villain. From the man who created an opioid crisis from the comfort of his boardroom to the shadowy security firm that helps hide dangerous secrets for a price - when someone needs help, they provide... Leverage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i3Evib4bHONndY7pZ9gbznYUcGj.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:106502'),
  ('348604982758070035', 'Leviathan', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ayumu Murase, Natsumi Fujiwara, Shunsuke Sakuya, Yasuhiro Mamiya, Mie Sonozaki, Ivan Shibata, Fairouz Ai, Hiroki Touchi', 'TV-14', 'Set in an alternate steampunk past, an Austrian fugitive prince and a Scottish airman in disguise embark on an unexpected quest to prevent a world war.', 'Set in an alternate steampunk past, an Austrian fugitive prince and a Scottish airman in disguise embark on an unexpected quest to prevent a world war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIu0KWF2g2gWO482HXUQRM5ioOr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:256323'),
  ('983180499215041889', 'Leviathan: The Last Defense', 2013, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, 'Go Zappa, Yasunori Ide', 'Saori Hayami, Eri Kitamura, Ayana Taketatsu, Kana Hanazawa', null, 'The fantasy world of Aquafall is abound with water and greenery, and populated by dragons and fairies. Meteorites of evil creatures threaten all living things on the planet. The fairy Syrup assembles the Aquafall Defense Force, with three girls of the dragon clans as recruits. The story follows Syrup and the dragon girls Leviathan, Bahamut, and Jörmungandr as they work together to battle enemies and grow up.', 'The fantasy world of Aquafall is abound with water and greenery, and populated by dragons and fairies. Meteorites of evil creatures threaten all living things on the planet. The fairy Syrup assembles the Aquafall Defense Force, with three girls of the dragon clans as recruits. The story follows Syrup and the dragon girls Leviathan, Bahamut, and Jörmungandr as they work together to battle enemies and grow up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1kNKmSR9BJUpjrGMcgG3coIGwkp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:51476'),
  ('492082550957624841', 'Levius', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Saori Hayami, Ayane Sakura, Daisuke Ono, Junichi Suwabe, Mamoru Miyano, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Takahiro Sakurai, Hochu Otsuka', null, 'With the casualties of war still haunting him, young Levius uses his prosthetic arm to take his fight into the brutal world of Mecha Boxing.', 'With the casualties of war still haunting him, young Levius uses his prosthetic arm to take his fight into the brutal world of Mecha Boxing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dO7FDQmQhNvCrPdjqj5peMx1ZWQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93899'),
  ('100355260256726042', 'Lewis', 2007, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Colin Dexter', null, 'Kevin Whately, Laurence Fox, Clare Holman, Rebecca Front, Alex Macqueen', 'TV-PG', 'Inspector Robert Lewis and Sergeant James Hathaway solve the tough cases that the learned inhabitants of Oxford throw at them.', 'Inspector Robert Lewis and Sergeant James Hathaway solve the tough cases that the learned inhabitants of Oxford throw at them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etyCA64joFB2jGJFWZPUYczVbvf.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:2343'),
  ('637530787268263776', 'Lewis & Clark - The Journey of the Corps of Discovery', 1997, 'Documentary, Western', null, 'Dayton Duncan', 'John Logan Allen, Stephen E. Ambrose, Gerard Baker, Kevin Conway, Erica Funkhouser, William Least Heat-Moon, Gene Jones, Mylie Lawyer', 'TV-G', 'Lewis & Clark: The Journey of the Corps of Discovery tells the remarkable story of the entire Corps of Discovery – not just of the two Captains, but the young army men, French-Canadian boatmen, Clark’s African-American slave, and the Shoshone woman named Sacajawea, who brought along her infant son. As important to the story as these many characters, however, was the spectacular land itself, and the promises it held.', 'Lewis & Clark: The Journey of the Corps of Discovery tells the remarkable story of the entire Corps of Discovery – not just of the two Captains, but the young army men, French-Canadian boatmen, Clark’s African-American slave, and the Shoshone woman named Sacajawea, who brought along her infant son. As important to the story as these many characters, however, was the spectacular land itself, and the promises it held.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hjiMdLSUgv6U97hCVKyKX4HxCut.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43397'),
  ('1087105219638979645', 'Lexx', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Paul Donovan, Jeffrey Hirschfield, Lex Gigeroff', null, 'Brian Downey, Jeffrey Hirschfield, Xenia Seeberg, Michael McManus, Tom Gallant', 'TV-MA', 'A Time Prophet predicted that Kai would be the one to destroy the divine order in the league of the 20,000 planets, someday that will happen, but not today. Today a cowardly security guard, an undead assassin, a female with a body designed for sex and a robot head madly in love with her all make up the crew of the spaceship Lexx, the most powerful weapon in the two universes.', 'A Time Prophet predicted that Kai would be the one to destroy the divine order in the league of the 20,000 planets, someday that will happen, but not today. Today a cowardly security guard, an undead assassin, a female with a body designed for sex and a robot head madly in love with her all make up the crew of the spaceship Lexx, the most powerful weapon in the two universes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSDZ9YpDvAbXxzbC3YdknfyBR3W.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1818'),
  ('312132431189022465', 'Leyla', 2024, 'Drama', 'Yılmaz Sahin', 'Yılmaz Sahin', 'Cemre Baysel, Gonca Vuslateri, Alperen Duymaz, Yiğit Kirazcı, Halil İbrahim Ceyhan, Melisa Duru Ünal, Gamze Karaduman, Dilara Aksüyek', null, 'As a child, Leyla suffers a blow from her stepmother and sees her world turned upside down. She loses everything - except the thirst for revenge. In search of justice, Leyla transforms into someone else and returns determined to settle accounts with the woman who destroyed her life and left her in a garbage dump. However, her revenge falters when she discovers the relationship between her ex-stepmother and the man, with whom she shared an innocent and unforgettable love affair', 'As a child, Leyla suffers a blow from her stepmother and sees her world turned upside down. She loses everything - except the thirst for revenge. In search of justice, Leyla transforms into someone else and returns determined to settle accounts with the woman who destroyed her life and left her in a garbage dump. However, her revenge falters when she discovers the relationship between her ex-stepmother and the man, with whom she shared an innocent and unforgettable love affair', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/or7YWXNJdmjIisff11ynSzocafz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259812'),
  ('943399093773116925', 'Leyla and Mecnun', 2011, 'Family, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Burak Aksak', 'Burak Aksak', 'Ali Atay, Serkan Keskin, Ahmet Mümtaz Taylan, Cengiz Bozkurt, Osman Sonant, Köksal Engür, Nalan Kuruçim, İştar Gökseven', null, 'Leyla ile Mecnun is a Turkish television comedy series. The show is set in Istanbul, Turkey and premiered in 2011 on TRT. The series is a surreal and absurd comedy that revolves around the fictional love story between Leyla and Mecnun.', 'Leyla ile Mecnun is a Turkish television comedy series. The show is set in Istanbul, Turkey and premiered in 2011 on TRT. The series is a surreal and absurd comedy that revolves around the fictional love story between Leyla and Mecnun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3jPLJJXbFabb29mOxZOK0xctcy6.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:40417'),
  ('251311391561071305', 'Li San Qiang', 2017, 'Drama', null, null, 'Liu Enyou, Zhan Jingyi, Gao Ye, Wang Liying, Su Guotao, Liu Bo, Li Jianyi, Song Kexin', null, 'During the War of Resistance, underground party member Li Sanqiang becomes the county magistrate of Wuze to complete a secret mission. He must outsmart both the Japanese forces and Chinese traitors in a high-stakes battle of wits.', 'During the War of Resistance, underground party member Li Sanqiang becomes the county magistrate of Wuze to complete a secret mission. He must outsmart both the Japanese forces and Chinese traitors in a high-stakes battle of wits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/SHQQasLUUIdwz2FNSQ0nNXfmdj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96782'),
  ('681369625383381363', 'Li Wei the Magistrate', 2002, 'Comedy, Crime', null, null, 'Apollo Yu, Zhao Liying, Xu Zheng', null, 'Li Wei, a low-born but clever man who, with the help of his confidante Yue Siying, uses his wit to win the emperor’s favor.', 'Li Wei, a low-born but clever man who, with the help of his confidante Yue Siying, uses his wit to win the emperor’s favor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jaq0j77bl3YgsYRBYmMuqWKICFQ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:87590'),
  ('559765399029519316', 'Li''l Miss Vampire Can''t Suck Right', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Minami Tanaka, Kensho Ono, Mao Ichimichi, Ikumi Hasegawa, Katsumi Fukuhara, Yuya Hirose, Shion Wakayama, Konomi Inagaki', 'TV-14', 'With her cool, mysterious aura, transfer student Ishikawa Luna is already the most popular girl in class. Ohtori, on the other hand, is so average he''s practically a background character. The thought of ever speaking with Luna never even crossed his mind—until he accidentally discovers her secret: She’s a vampire…who''s absolutely terrible at sucking blood!', 'With her cool, mysterious aura, transfer student Ishikawa Luna is already the most popular girl in class. Ohtori, on the other hand, is so average he''s practically a background character. The thought of ever speaking with Luna never even crossed his mind—until he accidentally discovers her secret: She’s a vampire…who''s absolutely terrible at sucking blood!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHaKZabCWuDppqS7P5zWchykFzS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:283689'),
  ('956127014941675868', 'Li''l Quinquin', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Bruno Dumont', null, 'Bernard Pruvost, Philippe Jore, Lucy Caron, Alane Delhaye, Lisa Hartmann, Julien Bodard, Corentin Carpentier, Jason Cirot', null, 'A murder mystery that opens with the discovery of human body parts stuffed inside a cow on the outskirts of a small channel town in northern France.', 'A murder mystery that opens with the discovery of human body parts stuffed inside a cow on the outskirts of a small channel town in northern France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vt4seWy3jl4KbI0Um490jUSsMs2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63953'),
  ('338697722034088539', 'Liaison', 2023, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Virginie Brac, Oliver Butcher', null, 'Eva Green, Vincent Cassel, Peter Mullan, Gérard Lanvin, Daniel Francis, Stanislas Merhar, Irène Jacob, Laëtitia Eïdo', 'TV-MA', 'Two agents—and former lovers—must work together to combat international cyberattacks threatening the UK while also confronting the buried secrets of their destructive relationship.', 'Two agents—and former lovers—must work together to combat international cyberattacks threatening the UK while also confronting the buried secrets of their destructive relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jwxlxMJxHW0TElgK6xnIOIwe9rb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128066'),
  ('414260915747955813', 'Liar', 2017, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Jack Williams, Harry Williams', null, 'Joanne Froggatt, Ioan Gruffudd, Zoë Tapper, Shelley Conn, Danny Webb, Richie Campbell, Katherine Kelly, Amy Nuttall', 'TV-14', 'A teacher and a surgeon are rocked by scandalous accusations after they enjoy a seemingly innocent date.', 'A teacher and a surgeon are rocked by scandalous accusations after they enjoy a seemingly innocent date.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQFQok8j8vErenASWIUtBEsbTVY.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:73554'),
  ('874720601208454723', 'Liar Game', 2007, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Erika Toda, Shota Matsuda, Michiko Kichise, Rinko Kikuchi, Kosuke Suzuki, Ikkei Watanabe, MEGUMI, Yoshiyuki Morishita', null, 'Nao Kanzaki is a college student who is known for her honesty and naivete. One day, she receives a black postcard indicating that she has been selected to participate in the "Liar Game Tournament". Along with the postcard is a box with 100 million yen. The goal of the first round of the game is to trick the other player out of their hundred million yen. At the end, the winner would get to keep the hundred million earned, and the loser owes the LGT 100 million yen, which "will be collected by any means and at all costs".', 'Nao Kanzaki is a college student who is known for her honesty and naivete. One day, she receives a black postcard indicating that she has been selected to participate in the "Liar Game Tournament". Along with the postcard is a box with 100 million yen. The goal of the first round of the game is to trick the other player out of their hundred million yen. At the end, the winner would get to keep the hundred million earned, and the loser owes the LGT 100 million yen, which "will be collected by any means and at all costs".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSaZVSF5exQKXHIDotbTqA8ZntJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:13967'),
  ('544065580083416093', 'Liar Game', 2014, 'Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Kim So-eun, Lee Sang-yun, Lee El, Shin Sung-rok, Uhm Hyo-seop, Jang Seung-jo, Kim Young-ae, Jo Jae-yun', null, 'Various contestants take part in a game show with a prize of 10 billion won wherein contestants are encouraged to cheat and lie. The contestants who are able to cheat the others win the prizes but be in debt if he/she loses the game. Contestants include genius swindler Cha Woo-jin and naive college student Nam Da-jung. Meanwhile, Kang Do-young will play the MC and planner of this game show.', 'Various contestants take part in a game show with a prize of 10 billion won wherein contestants are encouraged to cheat and lie. The contestants who are able to cheat the others win the prizes but be in debt if he/she loses the game. Contestants include genius swindler Cha Woo-jin and naive college student Nam Da-jung. Meanwhile, Kang Do-young will play the MC and planner of this game show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v29vqIeeKlPfIFYQeDbLJlHkUH7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61618'),
  ('437584422240412712', 'LIAR GAME', 2026, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Saya Hitomi, Takeo Otsuka, Kazuhiro Nakaya, Nobuo Tobita, Yoji Ueda, Yasutaka Tomioka, Shoya Ishige, Ryosuke Asano', null, 'When Nao Kanzaki receives a strange letter and a suitcase containing 100 million yen, she learns that she has been selected to participate in the LIAR GAME. In this high-stakes psychological battle, lies, deception, and betrayal reign supreme. Naïve and honest, Nao turns to Shinichi Akiyama, a brilliant former con artist, to survive the twisted game. In a game built on lies, can honesty prevail?', 'When Nao Kanzaki receives a strange letter and a suitcase containing 100 million yen, she learns that she has been selected to participate in the LIAR GAME. In this high-stakes psychological battle, lies, deception, and betrayal reign supreme. Naïve and honest, Nao turns to Shinichi Akiyama, a brilliant former con artist, to survive the twisted game. In a game built on lies, can honesty prevail?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gbZmmfrAPhKw7buPq2IInJQRxPb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:300126'),
  ('459403290633158753', 'Liar, Liar', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Genta Nakamura, Yukina Shuto, Wakana Kuramochi, Rika Tachibana', 'TV-14', 'Students battle to determine their rankings, with one student having to keep up the ultimate lie!', 'Students battle to determine their rankings, with one student having to keep up the ultimate lie!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/91KYB3ylsQIALQWh7D7hoIetAYp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:122204'),
  ('1106157115729258516', 'Liberation', 1994, 'Documentary, War & Politics', null, null, 'Rutkay Aziz, Savaş Dinçel, Ayda Aksel, Mehmet Aslantuğ, Mahmut Cevher, T. P. McKenna, Ege Aydan, Aytaç Arman', null, 'Epic independence fight in 21st century. Turkish independence war against occupying forces (Greece, England, France, Italy) in her land.', 'Epic independence fight in 21st century. Turkish independence war against occupying forces (Greece, England, France, Italy) in her land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7k6ptprJ3HKiLzYyz00G9vsixfs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:49003'),
  ('1111752473855221858', 'Liberdade, Liberdade', 2016, 'Soap, Drama', 'Mário Teixeira', 'Sérgio Marques, Tarcísio Puiati', 'Andréia Horta, Bruno Ferrari, Mateus Solano, Nathalia Dill, Dalton Vigh, Lília Cabral, Marco Ricca, Maitê Proença', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkayUMR7Spt2xOdU0Oi7Ahdlw9d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66873'),
  ('598602104700810805', 'Libertad', 2021, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Miguel Barros, Michel Gaztambide', null, 'Bebe, Isak Férriz, Xavier Deive, Jorge Suquet, Sofía Oria, Jason Fernández, Pedro Casablanc, Luis Callejo', null, 'Set in the 19th century, the series tracks a mother and her son following their release after spending the first seventeen years of the boy’s life in prison together. Having been granted their freedom, the two just want to live in peace. Unfortunately, they find themselves between conflicting interests of two bandit clans and the local governor, fighting over trade routes.', 'Set in the 19th century, the series tracks a mother and her son following their release after spending the first seventeen years of the boy’s life in prison together. Having been granted their freedom, the two just want to live in peace. Unfortunately, they find themselves between conflicting interests of two bandit clans and the local governor, fighting over trade routes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/58GKS7YlyDVz1Lms01ZjRizb1tW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:101977'),
  ('228159841610989209', 'Liberty''s Kids', 2002, 'Animation, Kids, Family, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics', 'Andy Heyward, Michael Maliani, Kevin O''Donnell', null, 'Whoopi Goldberg, Andrew Rannells, Ben Beck, Billy Crystal, Charles Shaughnessy, Chris Lundquist, Dustin Hoffman, Kathleen Barr', 'TV-Y7', 'Liberty''s Kids is an animated educational historical fiction television series produced by DIC Entertainment, originally broadcast on PBS Kids from September 2, 2002 to April 4, 2003, although PBS continued to air reruns until August 2004. The show has since been syndicated by DiC to affiliates of smaller television networks such as The CW and MyNetworkTV and some independent stations so that those stations can fulfill FCC educational and informational requirements. Since September 16, 2006, the series aired on CBS''s new block called KOL Secret Slumber Party on CBS, then it was aired on KEWLopolis, which taking September 12, 2009. In 2008 it ran on The History Channel. The series is currently on the Cookie Jar Toons block on This TV and CBS''s Cookie Jar TV. In 2012, Qubo announced the channel will air Liberty''s Kids in fall 2012. The series was based on an idea by Kevin O''Donnell and developed for television by Kevin O''Donnell, Robby London, Mike Maliani, and Andy Heyward.', 'Liberty''s Kids is an animated educational historical fiction television series produced by DIC Entertainment, originally broadcast on PBS Kids from September 2, 2002 to April 4, 2003, although PBS continued to air reruns until August 2004. The show has since been syndicated by DiC to affiliates of smaller television networks such as The CW and MyNetworkTV and some independent stations so that those stations can fulfill FCC educational and informational requirements. Since September 16, 2006, the series aired on CBS''s new block called KOL Secret Slumber Party on CBS, then it was aired on KEWLopolis, which taking September 12, 2009. In 2008 it ran on The History Channel. The series is currently on the Cookie Jar Toons block on This TV and CBS''s Cookie Jar TV. In 2012, Qubo announced the channel will air Liberty''s Kids in fall 2012. The series was based on an idea by Kevin O''Donnell and developed for television by Kevin O''Donnell, Robby London, Mike Maliani, and Andy Heyward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uAJYUum6922FcIlLiOLbJGRqQTP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11110'),
  ('731457641788195172', 'Libra of Nil Admirari', 2018, 'Animation', null, null, 'Yuki Kaji, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Juri Kimura, Ryota Osaka, Kenichi Suzumura, Takahiro Sakurai, Ryohei Kimura', null, 'It''s the 25th year of the Taisho Era in Imperial Tokyo. Kuze Tsugumi, daughter of aristocrats, agrees to be married to save her family from decline. But before she goes through with it, her younger brother Hitaki gets her involved in an incident caused by a "maremono," a type of book that casts a great influence on whoever reads it. As a result, Tsugumi gains the power to see "aura," a light that represents the emotions that dwell within a maremono. This is the story of a woman whose destiny seems to sway up and down, as if on the delicate balance of a scale.', 'It''s the 25th year of the Taisho Era in Imperial Tokyo. Kuze Tsugumi, daughter of aristocrats, agrees to be married to save her family from decline. But before she goes through with it, her younger brother Hitaki gets her involved in an incident caused by a "maremono," a type of book that casts a great influence on whoever reads it. As a result, Tsugumi gains the power to see "aura," a light that represents the emotions that dwell within a maremono. This is the story of a woman whose destiny seems to sway up and down, as if on the delicate balance of a scale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3TbESt7LvCmLlb1dGb5Coo6avu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78475'),
  ('337289549608305828', 'Librarian', 2023, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Igor Tverdokhlebov', 'Alexander Gryazin, Ilya Tilkin', 'Nikita Efremov, Evgeniya Dmitrieva, Andrey Merzlikin, Mikhail Trukhin, Igor Zolotovitsky, Marina Vorozhischeva, Sergey Epishev, Mikhail Troynik', null, 'Unsuccessful actor Alexey Vyazintsev learns that his father was killed under mysterious circumstances. Alexey travels to Shironino, his father''s hometown, to sell his apartment, but instead finds himself embroiled in a series of dangerous events. Locals believe that the books of the long-forgotten Soviet writer Gromov have magical properties. Each of these books gives a specific effect: Rage, Patience, Power, Joy, Strength or Memory. The secret world of readers of Gromov''s books is divided into Libraries that hunt for books all over the country and are ready to kill competitors for the sake of their strength. Vyazintsev will have to become a part of one of the Libraries, reveal the secrets of his own family and go in search of the rarest of magical books — the book of Meaning.', 'Unsuccessful actor Alexey Vyazintsev learns that his father was killed under mysterious circumstances. Alexey travels to Shironino, his father''s hometown, to sell his apartment, but instead finds himself embroiled in a series of dangerous events. Locals believe that the books of the long-forgotten Soviet writer Gromov have magical properties. Each of these books gives a specific effect: Rage, Patience, Power, Joy, Strength or Memory. The secret world of readers of Gromov''s books is divided into Libraries that hunt for books all over the country and are ready to kill competitors for the sake of their strength. Vyazintsev will have to become a part of one of the Libraries, reveal the secrets of his own family and go in search of the rarest of magical books — the book of Meaning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVqHruhxEFTg1ZJ05ICcGtbvBaX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222648'),
  ('918241329439569107', 'Library War', 2008, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Marina Inoue, Tomoaki Maeno, Akira Ishida, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Miyuki Sawashiro', null, 'Iku Kasahara wants more than anything to be an ally of justice--just like her prince. In the current age, the Media Betterment Act has allowed the Japanese government to impose heavy censorship on the expression of ideas, particularly those from books. When her favorite childhood book was marked for censorship, Iku felt that oppression firsthand, but she (and the book) was saved by a man from the Kanto Library Defense Force... her prince! Inspired by his example, Iku joined the Kanto library to safeguard expression of freedom, all while searching for the man she idolizes.', 'Iku Kasahara wants more than anything to be an ally of justice--just like her prince. In the current age, the Media Betterment Act has allowed the Japanese government to impose heavy censorship on the expression of ideas, particularly those from books. When her favorite childhood book was marked for censorship, Iku felt that oppression firsthand, but she (and the book) was saved by a man from the Kanto Library Defense Force... her prince! Inspired by his example, Iku joined the Kanto library to safeguard expression of freedom, all while searching for the man she idolizes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9CXYp5s5nJMlHF03bJlQlhkvxb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89742'),
  ('1016488238650776085', 'Lie', 2024, 'Drama, Family', 'Cem Akyoldaş, Murat Boyacioglu', 'Murat Boyacioglu, Cem Akyoldaş', 'Aslıhan Güner, Feyyaz Duman, Eylül Tumbar, Yeşim Ceren Bozoğlu, Özge Borak, Serra Pirinç, Emir Benderlioğlu, Atakan Hoşgören', null, 'Melike, who survived in prison for 20 years for the sake of her daughter, fell into the middle of a big lie when she was released. All the injustices and evil done to her unravel in the face of Melike, who draws her strength from goodness and light.', 'Melike, who survived in prison for 20 years for the sake of her daughter, fell into the middle of a big lie when she was released. All the injustices and evil done to her unravel in the face of Melike, who draws her strength from goodness and light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23kyHMDJDMyzPIrdqKje055Ol4O.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:252791'),
  ('844012556887690627', 'Lie After Lie', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', null, 'Kim Ji-eun', 'Lee Yu-ri, Yeon Jeong-hun, Lee Il-hwa, Kwon Hwa-woon, Im Joo-eun, Kim Seung-hwan, Lee Won-jong, Choi Dae-sung', null, 'Ji Eun-Soo is a daughter-in-law of a powerful chaebol family. She suddenly she becomes a murderer, who killed her husband. After she is released from prison, she tries to get her daughter back. She approaches Kang Ji-Min, who has adopted her daughter. He is a cool as ice reporter. Ji Eun-Soo pretends to fall in love with him and attempts to marry him to become the stepmother of her daughter.', 'Ji Eun-Soo is a daughter-in-law of a powerful chaebol family. She suddenly she becomes a murderer, who killed her husband. After she is released from prison, she tries to get her daughter back. She approaches Kang Ji-Min, who has adopted her daughter. He is a cool as ice reporter. Ji Eun-Soo pretends to fall in love with him and attempts to marry him to become the stepmother of her daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/RfWfTECbvLLLNWaAyTFIGNYAOM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106535'),
  ('775134596797797174', 'Lie to Love', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy, Mystery', 'Mu Fusheng', 'Hu Xiao Shuai', 'Luo Yunxi, Cheng Xiao, Ji Xiaobing, Tian Yitong, Li Jiajie, Guan Zijing, Tang Jingmei, Gao Han', null, 'Li Zeiliang, the sunny and carefree heir to a conglomerate, meets the bright and bubbly Su Xieyi. They are swept into a passionate romance to spend the most unforgettable moments of their lives together. With so many entanglements, are they destined to be together or are they destined to part? An unexpected development has left the life that Su Xieyi has come to know in shambles and has destroyed her family. All clues point to her lover Li Zeliang as the instigator. In order to investigate the truth, Su Xieyi pretends to have amnesia to return to Li Zeliang''s arms. In the dangerous game of love, she treads every step carefully while Li Zeliang hits rock bottom. As the truth is revealed little by little, Su Xieyi is surprised to learn that she has wrongfully blamed Li Zeliang all this time and tries desperately to save their relationship.', 'Li Zeiliang, the sunny and carefree heir to a conglomerate, meets the bright and bubbly Su Xieyi. They are swept into a passionate romance to spend the most unforgettable moments of their lives together. With so many entanglements, are they destined to be together or are they destined to part? An unexpected development has left the life that Su Xieyi has come to know in shambles and has destroyed her family. All clues point to her lover Li Zeliang as the instigator. In order to investigate the truth, Su Xieyi pretends to have amnesia to return to Li Zeliang''s arms. In the dangerous game of love, she treads every step carefully while Li Zeliang hits rock bottom. As the truth is revealed little by little, Su Xieyi is surprised to learn that she has wrongfully blamed Li Zeliang all this time and tries desperately to save their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sogyrB1s0xQVs9GDkIe8xa1MITK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132317'),
  ('283795635128435739', 'Lie to Me', 2009, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Sam Baum', null, 'Tim Roth, Kelli Williams, Monica Raymund, Brendan Hines, Hayley McFarland', 'TV-14', 'The world''s leading deception researcher, Dr. Cal Lightman, studies facial expression, body language and tone of voice to determine when a person is lying and why, which helps law enforcement and government agencies uncover the truth. But his skills also make it easier for him to deceive others.', 'The world''s leading deception researcher, Dr. Cal Lightman, studies facial expression, body language and tone of voice to determine when a person is lying and why, which helps law enforcement and government agencies uncover the truth. But his skills also make it easier for him to deceive others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2xpQxwsGYtdGDrmLvCosTZ0I54R.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:8358'),
  ('742726371815556926', 'Lie to Me', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Kim Ye-Ri, Hwang Ju-ha, Choi Yun-jeong', 'Yoon Eun-hye, Kang Ji-hwan, Sung Joon, Jo Yoon-hee, Hong Soo-hyun, Ryu Seung-su, Kang Shin-il, Kwon Hae-hyo', 'TV-14', 'Gong Ah-jung, a level 5 Ministry of Culture official, gets entangled in a web of lies when she mistakenly lies that she''s married to Hyun Ki-joon, a hotel manager from an affluent family. Their relationship is further complicated when Ki-joon''s ex-fiancée and a close friend of his brother''s, Oh Yoon-joo, reappears in his life.', 'Gong Ah-jung, a level 5 Ministry of Culture official, gets entangled in a web of lies when she mistakenly lies that she''s married to Hyun Ki-joon, a hotel manager from an affluent family. Their relationship is further complicated when Ki-joon''s ex-fiancée and a close friend of his brother''s, Oh Yoon-joo, reappears in his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhWv7L7Oq40fWJ2TYbluko0HXDA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39261'),
  ('631510953564475769', 'Lie with Me', 2021, 'Drama', 'Jason Herbison', null, 'Charlie Brooks, Brett Tucker, Phoebe Roberts, Alba Nicholls, Nadine Garner, Neil Melville', null, 'A British woman and her husband seek a fresh start in Australia after infidelity in their marriage. The couple hire a young nanny, but she isn''t the innocent stranger she pretends to be.', 'A British woman and her husband seek a fresh start in Australia after infidelity in their marriage. The couple hire a young nanny, but she isn''t the innocent stranger she pretends to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lK34ugXXc5hxlRvFBEpyixuJEGU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129019'),
  ('375859954111956436', 'Lies and Deceit', 2020, 'Mystery', 'Curro Novallas', null, 'Ricardo Martín, Ana Gamberi, Ángela Cremonte, Manuela Velasco, Sofía Oria, Óscar Ortuño, Víctor Duplá, Paco Tous', null, 'A literature teacher suspects that a well-respected surgeon has drugged her and begins a legal case against him.', 'A literature teacher suspects that a well-respected surgeon has drugged her and begins a legal case against him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Twciy6LkLmvidw33MBKvgPEZfv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:102192'),
  ('210149714349525610', 'Lies Hidden in My Garden', 2023, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Jung Jee-hyun', 'Ji A-ni', 'Kim Tae-hee, Lim Ji-yeon, Kim Seung-o, Choi Jae-rim, Cha Sung-je, Baek Hyun-joo, Jung Woon-sun, Cha Mi-kyeong', null, 'An ordinary housewife''s life goes in an unexpected direction after noticing a strange smell in her backyard.', 'An ordinary housewife''s life goes in an unexpected direction after noticing a strange smell in her backyard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9MMqq7sUyG5JnLbNJ7U7nP3UaY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211748'),
  ('876053958669695364', 'Life', 2007, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Rand Ravich', null, 'Damian Lewis, Sarah Shahi, Brent Sexton, Donal Logue, Adam Arkin', 'TV-14', 'Complex, offbeat Detective Charlie Crews returns to the force after serving time in prison for a crime he didn''t commit. Crews'' new lease on life has provided him with a Zen-like outlook, peace of mind and no need for vengeance, an attitude which can be challenging to maintain when someone he cares about is threatened — or when he is investigating the mystery surrounding the murder he was falsely accused of.', 'Complex, offbeat Detective Charlie Crews returns to the force after serving time in prison for a crime he didn''t commit. Crews'' new lease on life has provided him with a Zen-like outlook, peace of mind and no need for vengeance, an attitude which can be challenging to maintain when someone he cares about is threatened — or when he is investigating the mystery surrounding the murder he was falsely accused of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zTDeRJxdMqH3Si2fIZjQi44k17.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:3797'),
  ('616878618995170937', 'Life', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Martha Holmes', 'Paul Spillenger', 'David Attenborough, Oprah Winfrey', 'TV-G', 'David Attenborough looks at the extraordinary ends to which animals and plants go in order to survive. Featuring epic spectacles, amazing TV firsts and examples of new wildlife behaviour.', 'David Attenborough looks at the extraordinary ends to which animals and plants go in order to survive. Featuring epic spectacles, amazing TV firsts and examples of new wildlife behaviour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9dVHGMYfI6T6p07UHfYVUk1Wzit.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16946'),
  ('271153177280714163', 'Life', 2018, 'Drama', 'Lee Su-yeon', null, 'Lee Dong-wook, Cho Seung-woo, Won Jin-ah, Lee Kyoo-hyung, You Chea-myung, Moon So-ri, Moon Sung-keun, Cheon Ho-jin', null, 'At Korea''s top university medical center, ideals and interests collide between a patient-centered ER doctor and the hospital''s newly-appointed CEO.', 'At Korea''s top university medical center, ideals and interests collide between a patient-centered ER doctor and the hospital''s newly-appointed CEO.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bnZ84kmXw9OlnAaVJlEYKOMlJmt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79991'),
  ('287146910547186592', 'Life', 2020, 'Drama', 'Mike Bartlett', null, 'Alison Steadman, Adrian Lester, Victoria Hamilton, Saira Choudhry, Peter Davison, Calvin Demba, Erin Kellyman, Rachael Stirling', null, 'Follow the lives and woes of the residents of a Manchester house divided into four different flats. Gemma Foster''s neighbour, Emma, now goes by the name of Belle, looking to start a new life. Three other interconnected stories tell a tale of love, loss, birth, death, the ordinary, the extraordinary, and everything in between.', 'Follow the lives and woes of the residents of a Manchester house divided into four different flats. Gemma Foster''s neighbour, Emma, now goes by the name of Belle, looking to start a new life. Three other interconnected stories tell a tale of love, loss, birth, death, the ordinary, the extraordinary, and everything in between.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o4aAlzVXFCO13JdYHyQJ4sGjWME.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110833'),
  ('288083031487882086', 'Life & Beth', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Amy Schumer', null, 'Amy Schumer, Yamaneika Saunders', 'TV-MA', 'A trip down memory lane is a strong source of trauma, comedy and moving forward.', 'A trip down memory lane is a strong source of trauma, comedy and moving forward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6PuIZmC5NBvUskjV4i24gdXr8AM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:156812'),
  ('974593320989065835', 'Life After Death with Tyler Henry', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Tyler Henry, Theresa Koelewyn, Clint Godwin, Heather Denehy', 'TV-MA', 'Clairvoyant medium Tyler Henry offers clarity and closure from the beyond while searching through his own family''s past in an intimate reality series.', 'Clairvoyant medium Tyler Henry offers clarity and closure from the beyond while searching through his own family''s past in an intimate reality series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6BSuTI1Xe2HmbIxS6c1uKQHsQmU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157514'),
  ('331719171850745214', 'Life After Life', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Bathsheba Doran', 'Thomasin McKenzie, Sian Clifford, Jessica Brown Findlay, James McArdle, Jessica Hynes, Sean Delaney, Lesley Manville, Isla Johnston', null, 'If you could live your life time and again, would you ever get it right? Ursula dies and is reborn, living through turbulent times - but what is it she needs to stay alive for?', 'If you could live your life time and again, would you ever get it right? Ursula dies and is reborn, living through turbulent times - but what is it she needs to stay alive for?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s4b6C3B8M4JVGNvugs0jR7E1ywd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197406'),
  ('284645115518107060', 'Life After People: The Series', 2009, 'Documentary', 'David De Vries', 'David De Vries, Sam Dolan, Douglas Cohen', 'James Lurie, Hakeem Muata Oluseyi, Don Wildman, Andrew Patrick Nelson, Dan Riskin', null, 'Life After People is a television series on which scientists, structural engineers, and other experts speculate about what might become of Earth should humanity instantly disappear. The featured experts also talk about the impact of human extinction on the environment, and the vestiges of civilization thus left behind.', 'Life After People is a television series on which scientists, structural engineers, and other experts speculate about what might become of Earth should humanity instantly disappear. The featured experts also talk about the impact of human extinction on the environment, and the vestiges of civilization thus left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2I7qpI6LSgNPWvhAXgN79jZgMwD.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:18408'),
  ('124832328616256687', 'Life as a Girl', 2018, 'Drama', null, null, 'Keita Machida, Shiori Tamai, Jun Shison, Hyunri, Kaoru Kusumi, Keiichi Suzuki, Yuichi Haba, Fuka Koshiba', null, 'Miki Ogawa (Jun Shison) yearned to live the life of a lovely girl and moved to the city from the countryside because of this. She holds a job at a fashion mail order company. Miki Ogawa also has a secret. She is transgender. Although, she has a pretty woman''s appearance, her gender is male. One day, Tadaomi Goto (Keita Machida) appears in front of Miki Ogawa. They graduated from the same school. Tadaomi Goto is flustered by Miki''s different appearance, but they happen to live together.', 'Miki Ogawa (Jun Shison) yearned to live the life of a lovely girl and moved to the city from the countryside because of this. She holds a job at a fashion mail order company. Miki Ogawa also has a secret. She is transgender. Although, she has a pretty woman''s appearance, her gender is male. One day, Tadaomi Goto (Keita Machida) appears in front of Miki Ogawa. They graduated from the same school. Tadaomi Goto is flustered by Miki''s different appearance, but they happen to live together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6taJShj1KpiSW6CgACoLNKpvYRS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77716'),
  ('261450034932037788', 'Life as Carlo', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Verdone, Nicola Guaglianone, Menotti', null, 'Carlo Verdone, Max Tortora, Alessandro Haber, Monica Guerritore, Andrea Pennacchi, Anita Caprioli, Antonio Bannò, Caterina De Angelis', null, 'Carlo Verdone plays himself by portraying the drama and the comedy of his private life and his relationship with a loving and oppressive mother: Rome.', 'Carlo Verdone plays himself by portraying the drama and the comedy of his private life and his relationship with a loving and oppressive mother: Rome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pVoAM7TxsrLsnPrlktlDOv4X27i.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:135794'),
  ('610946340160887897', 'Life As We Know It', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jeff Judah, Gabe Sachs', null, 'Sean Faris, Jon Foster, Chris Lowell, Missy Peregrym, Kelly Osbourne, Jessica Lucas, Lisa Darr, D. B. Sweeney', 'TV-PG', 'See life through the eyes of Dino, Ben, and Jonathan -- three teens experiencing the joys and pains of growing up. Although different in many ways, these guys have one main thing in common -- women. Together, their attitudes about women are challenged, and they discover there''s more to life than meets the eye.', 'See life through the eyes of Dino, Ben, and Jonathan -- three teens experiencing the joys and pains of growing up. Although different in many ways, these guys have one main thing in common -- women. Together, their attitudes about women are challenged, and they discover there''s more to life than meets the eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zAcvZvHXlvJabsrzkBPR2drp7iL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4503'),
  ('788953794548719641', 'Life Below Zero', 2013, 'Reality, Documentary', null, 'Claire Allesse', 'Sue Aikens, Erik Salitan, Andy Bassich, Kate Rorke-Bassich, Chip Hailstone, Agnes Hailstone', 'TV-14', 'Viewers go deep into an Alaskan winter to meet six tough and resilient residents as they try to stay one step ahead of storms and man-eating beasts to make it through to spring. The closest neighbor to Sue Aikens is more than 300 miles away. Eric Salitan subsists solely on what he hunts and forages. Chip and Agnes Hailstone catch fish for currency in bartering for supplies, and Andy and Kate Bassich use their pack of sled dogs for transportation.', 'Viewers go deep into an Alaskan winter to meet six tough and resilient residents as they try to stay one step ahead of storms and man-eating beasts to make it through to spring. The closest neighbor to Sue Aikens is more than 300 miles away. Eric Salitan subsists solely on what he hunts and forages. Chip and Agnes Hailstone catch fish for currency in bartering for supplies, and Andy and Kate Bassich use their pack of sled dogs for transportation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a1pZCA3nmZvQGI1L21Riuglfw6f.jpg', 23, 'tmdb:tv:60910'),
  ('151427483740619647', 'Life by Ella', 2022, 'Family, Drama, Comedy', 'Tim Pollock, Jeff Hodsden', null, 'Lily Brooks O''Briant, Vanessa Carrasco, Artyon Celestine, Aidan Wallace, Mary Faber, Kevin Rahm', 'TV-G', 'After a life-changing experience, 13-year-old Ella is eager to seize the day. As she learns to appreciate each moment, she faces the fears that once defined her—and encourages others to do the same.', 'After a life-changing experience, 13-year-old Ella is eager to seize the day. As she learns to appreciate each moment, she faces the fears that once defined her—and encourages others to do the same.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A0Nuu9G2p5oQgwRDAPBl7pQOoyp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207639'),
  ('382547933800671084', 'Life Goes On', 1989, 'Drama, Family', 'Michael Braverman', null, 'Bill Smitrovich, Patti LuPone, Chris Burke, Kellie Martin, Chad Lowe, Tracey Needham, Monique Lanier, Elizabeth Berkley', 'NR', 'Life Goes On is a television series that aired on ABC from September 12, 1989, to May 23, 1993. The show centers on the Thatcher family living in suburban Chicago: Drew, his wife Elizabeth, and their children Paige, Rebecca, and Charles, who is known as Corky. Life Goes On was the first television series to have a major character with Down syndrome.', 'Life Goes On is a television series that aired on ABC from September 12, 1989, to May 23, 1993. The show centers on the Thatcher family living in suburban Chicago: Drew, his wife Elizabeth, and their children Paige, Rebecca, and Charles, who is known as Corky. Life Goes On was the first television series to have a major character with Down syndrome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6a27QlSY2oC87OGX48lUp0J9SiK.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:5299'),
  ('157649955794446799', 'Life in Cold Blood', 2008, 'Documentary', null, null, 'David Attenborough', 'TV-G', 'David Attenborough reveals the surprising truth about the cold-blooded lives of reptiles and amphibians. These animals are as dramatic, as colourful and as tender as any other animals.', 'David Attenborough reveals the surprising truth about the cold-blooded lives of reptiles and amphibians. These animals are as dramatic, as colourful and as tender as any other animals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6t1xCtwfHwLHu3801auuEy1lFkc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1236'),
  ('1046704256691780655', 'Life in Pieces', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Justin Adler', null, 'Thomas Sadoski, Dianne Wiest, James Brolin, Zoe Lister-Jones, Colin Hanks, Betsy Brandt, Dan Bakkedahl, Angelique Cabral', 'TV-14', 'Comedy about one big happy family and their sometimes awkward, often hilarious and ultimately beautiful milestone moments as told by its various members. Of the three siblings, middle child Matt may have just found his true love, his co-worker, Colleen; his coddled youngest brother, Greg, and his wife, Jen, are overwhelmed by the birth of their first child; and the eldest, Heather, and her husband, Tim, are dreading their impending empty nest so much, they''re considering having another baby. Their parents are Joan the family''s adoring matriarch who would do anything for her kids - as long as she agrees with it - and John, the gregarious patriarch who''s searching for ways to soften the blow of turning 70. As the family''s lives unfold in four short stories each week, they try to savor these little pieces of time that flash by but stay with you forever, because these moments add up to what life''s all about.', 'Comedy about one big happy family and their sometimes awkward, often hilarious and ultimately beautiful milestone moments as told by its various members. Of the three siblings, middle child Matt may have just found his true love, his co-worker, Colleen; his coddled youngest brother, Greg, and his wife, Jen, are overwhelmed by the birth of their first child; and the eldest, Heather, and her husband, Tim, are dreading their impending empty nest so much, they''re considering having another baby. Their parents are Joan the family''s adoring matriarch who would do anything for her kids - as long as she agrees with it - and John, the gregarious patriarch who''s searching for ways to soften the blow of turning 70. As the family''s lives unfold in four short stories each week, they try to savor these little pieces of time that flash by but stay with you forever, because these moments add up to what life''s all about.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vac76nqALSJfy9AN0D9sSh1fQFE.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:63398'),
  ('863551028296030278', 'Life in Smokey Blue', 2026, 'Drama', null, 'Hiraki Mari, 青木江梨花', 'Kouhei Takeda, Kento Shibuya, Takeshi Masu, Mayumi Asaka, Ryuto Yamamoto, Mayu Sakuma, Kotaro Tanaka, Haruna Iikubo', null, 'Struggling salesman Sakutaro reunites with his sharp-tongued former rival Kuji, reigniting a buried one-night spark from eight years ago.', 'Struggling salesman Sakutaro reunites with his sharp-tongued former rival Kuji, reigniting a buried one-night spark from eight years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iTA1WdsUguCjiBmvppWAPN1y7JE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:316461'),
  ('624140748151881506', 'Life In Squares', 2015, 'Drama', null, 'Amanda Coe', 'Eve Best, Phoebe Fox, Lydia Leonard, James Norton, Ed Birch, Christian Brassington, Al Weaver, Jack Davenport', null, 'The three-part series centres on the close and often fraught relationship between sisters Vanessa Bell and Virginia Woolf, and Vanessa’s sexually complicated alliance with gay artist Duncan Grant as they, and their group of like-minded friends, navigate their way through love, sex and artistic life through the first half of the 20th century.', 'The three-part series centres on the close and often fraught relationship between sisters Vanessa Bell and Virginia Woolf, and Vanessa’s sexually complicated alliance with gay artist Duncan Grant as they, and their group of like-minded friends, navigate their way through love, sex and artistic life through the first half of the 20th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/toTwaj08brqs4LvJA2GxLsNPuhj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63527'),
  ('1035850521535605762', 'Life in the Freezer', 1993, 'Documentary', null, null, 'David Attenborough', null, 'Sir David Attenborough looks at the natural history of the Antarctic continent', 'Sir David Attenborough looks at the natural history of the Antarctic continent', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uifURheY5aog05uqkL2ct6FUbpd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9553'),
  ('560928881630304284', 'Life in the Undergrowth', 2005, 'Documentary', null, 'David Attenborough', 'David Attenborough', 'TV-PG', 'David Attenborough reveals the amazing stories behind the tiny lives of invertebrates, exploring their incredible miniature world with ground-breaking camerawork and technology.', 'David Attenborough reveals the amazing stories behind the tiny lives of invertebrates, exploring their incredible miniature world with ground-breaking camerawork and technology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6kPzgTTsV7bnIRPRiIb576hnuB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8650'),
  ('680387621333448307', 'Life is a Bicycle', 2006, 'Comedy, Family', 'Dimitris Tokaris', 'Dimitris Tokaris, Litsa Mitella', 'Elena Efstathiou, Sofia Kalli, Mikaella Koutoumanou, Eirini Konstantinou, Michalis Moustakas, Charis Pisias, Maria Fiaka, Giannis Tsimitselis', null, 'Lefteris Vlachos is an advertiser, but the only thing he successfully advertises is himself. When Lefteris could no longer pay the rent, he and his wife, who teaches psychology at a college, and their son, Markos, moved at the home of his mother-in-law, Daphne. Daphne never misses an opportunity to undermine her son-in-law, who, in addition to Markos, has two daughters with his ex-wife Charoulla, a police officer with Team Z. Daphne also has a brother, Giasemakis Triantafillidis, who, according to himself, is the best lawyer in Cyprus. At his law firm, which shares premises with the advertising agency, works Maria who is being pursued by her colleague, Lakis. The cast is completed by the gang from the "Love TV" channel, with Margarita, her cheekiness, her charming naivety, and above all her famous linguistic "gems.", the beautiful Eleni and her jealous boyfriend Paris, Aggelos, Aphroditi, Mr. Pouros, Antzi, Koullis, and Vasos.', 'Lefteris Vlachos is an advertiser, but the only thing he successfully advertises is himself. When Lefteris could no longer pay the rent, he and his wife, who teaches psychology at a college, and their son, Markos, moved at the home of his mother-in-law, Daphne. Daphne never misses an opportunity to undermine her son-in-law, who, in addition to Markos, has two daughters with his ex-wife Charoulla, a police officer with Team Z. Daphne also has a brother, Giasemakis Triantafillidis, who, according to himself, is the best lawyer in Cyprus. At his law firm, which shares premises with the advertising agency, works Maria who is being pursued by her colleague, Lakis. The cast is completed by the gang from the "Love TV" channel, with Margarita, her cheekiness, her charming naivety, and above all her famous linguistic "gems.", the beautiful Eleni and her jealous boyfriend Paris, Aggelos, Aphroditi, Mr. Pouros, Antzi, Koullis, and Vasos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xIqJ52F5VAK3S4mxJwmpVNCYyKZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:116154'),
  ('962523611825737873', 'Life Lessons with Uramichi Oniisan', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Hiroshi Kamiya, Tomokazu Sugita, Yuichi Nakamura, Mamoru Miyano, Nana Mizuki, Ryohei Kimura, Kenichi Suzumura, Daisuke Ono', 'TV-14', 'Being an adult is hard, and for Uramichi Omota, that truth weighs on him. While on TV, he’s the upbeat exercise instructor for a children’s show, but he and his coworkers keep revealing the plight of adulthood on air. At least they’re working through it.', 'Being an adult is hard, and for Uramichi Omota, that truth weighs on him. While on TV, he’s the upbeat exercise instructor for a children’s show, but he and his coworkers keep revealing the plight of adulthood on air. At least they’re working through it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8D7QUo2w4TwfLXsC6Riy7TMhyje.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96442'),
  ('676470945010007375', 'Life of Crime', 2013, 'Crime, Drama', 'Declan Croghan, Oliver Frampton', 'Declan Croghan', 'Hayley Atwell, Richard Coyle, Julian Lewis Jones, Amanda Drew, Alex Hassell, Con O''Neill, Ruth McCabe, Joel Beckett', 'TV-MA', 'Set against the backdrop of iconic moments in British history, Hayley Atwell stars as an impulsive rookie cop who becomes obsessed with tracking down the killer of a teenage girl.', 'Set against the backdrop of iconic moments in British history, Hayley Atwell stars as an impulsive rookie cop who becomes obsessed with tracking down the killer of a teenage girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Omo5PBhK9uFdtZlva1zEehxOac.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35169'),
  ('558239005423832365', 'Life of Kylie', 2017, 'Reality', null, null, 'Kylie Jenner, Jordyn Woods, Victoria Villarroel', 'TV-14', 'Kylie Jenner welcomes viewers to her unfiltered world of fame, fortune, relationships and empire.', 'Kylie Jenner welcomes viewers to her unfiltered world of fame, fortune, relationships and empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h4NhWMBshGxp11m9uYob4KJU81y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71427'),
  ('294375843350898519', 'Life on Call', 2022, 'Drama', 'Sarik Andreasyan', null, 'Pavel Priluchnyy, Yanina Studilina, Mikhail Gorevoy, Liza Moryak, Anna Churina, Aleksandr Yatsko, Anna Glaube, Aleksandr Dyachenko', null, 'The story of an unusual businessman Alexander Schmidt, nicknamed Magic, who is ready to fulfill the most daring and explicit sex fantasies of his clients.', 'The story of an unusual businessman Alexander Schmidt, nicknamed Magic, who is ready to fulfill the most daring and explicit sex fantasies of his clients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g2QMkEUPj9nYT7kHvpT5IaDZ7tq.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:155710'),
  ('175165753183962905', 'Life on Earth', 1979, 'Documentary', null, null, 'David Attenborough', null, 'The story of life, from the first primitive cells to the plants and animals that now live around us.', 'The story of life, from the first primitive cells to the plants and animals that now live around us.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i5j8GxqjxA5kEc0gSP0z9bFpzjC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15117'),
  ('834846901982701346', 'Life on Mars', 2006, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Matthew Graham, Ashley Pharoah, Tony Jordan', null, 'John Simm, Philip Glenister, Liz White, Dean Andrews, Marshall Lancaster, Noreen Kershaw', 'TV-14', 'A detective chief inspector from 2006 is investigating a serial killer when he is knocked over by a speeding car. Waking up, he finds himself mysteriously transported back in time to 1973. Initially struggling to come to terms with his situation, he has to come to terms with the old-fashioned technology and attitude of the day, while figuring out how he came to be trapped in the past.', 'A detective chief inspector from 2006 is investigating a serial killer when he is knocked over by a speeding car. Waking up, he finds himself mysteriously transported back in time to 1973. Initially struggling to come to terms with his situation, he has to come to terms with the old-fashioned technology and attitude of the day, while figuring out how he came to be trapped in the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kFmhMpfyCVsu8AdJmz0xzULUduZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2973'),
  ('197620836144389700', 'Life on Mars', 2008, 'Mystery, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Matthew Graham, Tony Jordan, Ashley Pharoah', null, 'Jason O''Mara, Harvey Keitel, Gretchen Mol, Michael Imperioli, Jonathan Murphy, Greg D''Agostino, Chris Miskiewicz', null, 'After a car crash, police detective Sam Tyler mysteriously finds himself transported back to 1973 and still working as a detective.', 'After a car crash, police detective Sam Tyler mysteriously finds himself transported back to 1973 and still working as a detective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/opP6O99cWRZ9tfdPaLsWefbcPRs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3725'),
  ('626020986002879860', 'Life on Mars', 2018, 'Comedy, Crime, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, 'Lee Dae-il', 'Jung Kyung-ho, Park Sung-woong, Ko A-sung, Oh Dae-hwan, Ro Jong-hyun, Choi Seung-yoon, Kim Jae-kyung, Kim Ki-cheon', null, 'While investigating a serial murder case, Detective Han Tae Joo gets into a catastrophic incident. When he wakes up, he finds himself transported back to 1988, appointed to work at a police station in a small city. Believing he is there for a reason, he tries to solve the case from the past in hopes of finding a way back to his life in 2018.', 'While investigating a serial murder case, Detective Han Tae Joo gets into a catastrophic incident. When he wakes up, he finds himself transported back to 1988, appointed to work at a police station in a small city. Believing he is there for a reason, he tries to solve the case from the past in hopes of finding a way back to his life in 2018.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/561HlBWLiSePTtxaAWqExEc1kQ6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79407'),
  ('846034479539232774', 'Life on Our Planet', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Morgan Freeman', 'TV-PG', 'Life''s extraordinary journey to conquer, adapt and survive on Earth across billions of years comes alive in this groundbreaking nature docuseries.', 'Life''s extraordinary journey to conquer, adapt and survive on Earth across billions of years comes alive in this groundbreaking nature docuseries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xli64UUAmxX1ZAQGvBjEDrcBc3k.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213609'),
  ('357985055784531588', 'Life on Seacrow Island', 1964, 'Family, Drama, Kids', 'Astrid Lindgren', null, 'Torsten Lilliecrona, Louise Edlind, Björn Söderbäck, Urban Strand, Stephen Lindholm, Bengt Eklund, Eva Stiberg, Lillemor Österlund', null, 'Vi på Saltkråkan is a Swedish TV series in 13 25-minute episodes from 1964. The script for the series was written by Astrid Lindgren, who later re-wrote it as a book, also titled Vi på Saltkråkan. Astrid Lindgren was closely involved in the filming and editing of the series, which took place on Norröra in the Stockholm archipelago. The series was produced and directed by Olle Hellbom.', 'Vi på Saltkråkan is a Swedish TV series in 13 25-minute episodes from 1964. The script for the series was written by Astrid Lindgren, who later re-wrote it as a book, also titled Vi på Saltkråkan. Astrid Lindgren was closely involved in the filming and editing of the series, which took place on Norröra in the Stockholm archipelago. The series was produced and directed by Olle Hellbom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/17TcVEirTld1FQpfB6QzAV2EVXX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13268'),
  ('716995517250248370', 'Life on Top', 2009, 'Drama', null, null, 'Heather Vandeven, Mary LeGault, Brandin Rackley, Daniel Messier', 'TV-MA', 'Based on a novel by Clara Darling, about a college grad who heads to a big city looking for work and discovers her older sister, who''s been living there for years, is a model.', 'Based on a novel by Clara Darling, about a college grad who heads to a big city looking for work and discovers her older sister, who''s been living there for years, is a model.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pkl24FjCH9o2THRLebDA0GRD7Dy.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:51537'),
  ('20386621445239813', 'Life Science', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gani Müjde', 'Gani Müjde', 'Perran Kutman, Tarık Papuççuoğlu, Kerem Kupacı, Belma Canciğer, Atilla Olgaç, Akrep Nalan, Ulvi Alacakaptan, Nükhet Akkaya', null, 'Centered around a life science class teacher, "Afet Hoca", the humorous and genuine story of high-school students in Ridvan Kanat High School.', 'Centered around a life science class teacher, "Afet Hoca", the humorous and genuine story of high-school students in Ridvan Kanat High School.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jKOQ2offOH9dSQ1gRjSC8GUTQXB.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:49177'),
  ('1062592928057892591', 'Life Sentence', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Richard Keith, Erin Cardillo', null, 'Lucy Hale, Elliot Knight, Brooke Lyons, Jayson Blair, Dylan Walsh, Gillian Vigman, Carlos PenaVega, Dominique Lucky Martell', 'TV-14', 'When Stella finds out her terminal cancer is cured, she''s going to have to learn to live with all the choices she''s made when she decided to "live like she was dying".', 'When Stella finds out her terminal cancer is cured, she''s going to have to learn to live with all the choices she''s made when she decided to "live like she was dying".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRB6eHvWQ3O3kuTUEH6hE2TZde1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72001'),
  ('981084586769805823', 'Life Story', 2014, 'Documentary', null, null, 'David Attenborough', 'TV-PG', 'The remarkable and often perilous story of the journey through life. It is a story that unites each of us with every animal on the planet, because we all set out on this journey from the moment we are born. For animals there is just one goal in life – to continue their bloodline in the form of offspring. This series follows that journey through its six crucial stages: first steps, growing up, finding a home, gaining power, winning a mate and succeeding as a parent.', 'The remarkable and often perilous story of the journey through life. It is a story that unites each of us with every animal on the planet, because we all set out on this journey from the moment we are born. For animals there is just one goal in life – to continue their bloodline in the form of offspring. This series follows that journey through its six crucial stages: first steps, growing up, finding a home, gaining power, winning a mate and succeeding as a parent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGRcVjmgc9AQ3jxG367p8xSQrHa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61894'),
  ('1148077975526161105', 'Life Unexpected', 2010, 'Drama', 'Liz Tigelaar', null, 'Britt Robertson, Shiri Appleby, Kristoffer Polaha, Austin Basis, Kerr Smith', 'TV-PG', '16-year-old Lux was given up for adoption at birth but never adopted. When she is put back into the custody of her estranged-since-high-school birth parents, Cate and Baze, the three form an unlikely family.', '16-year-old Lux was given up for adoption at birth but never adopted. When she is put back into the custody of her estranged-since-high-school birth parents, Cate and Baze, the three form an unlikely family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/riHJXZovS7QjhRyiwnm2ULpx5JN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:20021'),
  ('141306605081209442', 'Life with an Ordinary Guy Who Reincarnated into a Total Fantasy Knockout', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mao Ichimichi, Satoshi Hino, Kent Ito, Rie Kugimiya, Yukiyo Fujii, Masashi Ebara', 'TV-14', 'Childhood friends Tachibana Hinata and Jinguji Tsukasa were living the everyday life of office workers. Then, on the way home from a mixer, they were sent flying into another world by a mysterious being. Once there, Jinguji sees his best friend has been turned into a beautiful blonde-haired, blue-eyed girl...?! The adorableness of Tachibana’s female form completely flummoxes Tachibana. But these two are each others’ best friends. To keep their relationship from being destroyed, they must defeat the Demon Lord as quickly as possible and return to their original forms.', 'Childhood friends Tachibana Hinata and Jinguji Tsukasa were living the everyday life of office workers. Then, on the way home from a mixer, they were sent flying into another world by a mysterious being. Once there, Jinguji sees his best friend has been turned into a beautiful blonde-haired, blue-eyed girl...?! The adorableness of Tachibana’s female form completely flummoxes Tachibana. But these two are each others’ best friends. To keep their relationship from being destroyed, they must defeat the Demon Lord as quickly as possible and return to their original forms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2vWP0vUgUC8NVMwOUPrTj2nQr7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:125712'),
  ('1041422101060997939', 'Life with Bonnie', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Bonnie Hunt, Don Lake', null, 'Bonnie Hunt, Mark Derwin, David Alan Grier, Charlie Stewart, Holly Wortell, Chris Barnes, Marianne Muellerleile, Anthony Russell', null, 'The host of the local morning talk show Morning Chicago creatively balances family commitment—to her husband John, a hard-working family practice doctor, and their three young children— and career obligations.', 'The host of the local morning talk show Morning Chicago creatively balances family commitment—to her husband John, a hard-working family practice doctor, and their three young children— and career obligations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4VG2dtEL6X3v1Ad3pyzsm8Er0hN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2103'),
  ('416421966148806251', 'Life with Derek', 2005, 'Family, Comedy', null, 'Jeff Biederman, Daphne Ballon', 'Michael Seater, Ashley Leggat, Jordan Todosey, Ariel Waller, Joy Tanner, John Ralston, Daniel Magder', 'TV-G', 'Life with Derek is a Canadian television sitcom that aired on Family and VRAK.TV in Canada and on Disney Channel in the United States. The series premiered on Family on September 18, 2005, and ran for four seasons, ending its run on March 25, 2009. The series starred Michael Seater and Ashley Leggat as the two oldest children in a stepfamily. It ended with 70 episodes and one spin-off television film, entitled Vacation with Derek.', 'Life with Derek is a Canadian television sitcom that aired on Family and VRAK.TV in Canada and on Disney Channel in the United States. The series premiered on Family on September 18, 2005, and ran for four seasons, ending its run on March 25, 2009. The series starred Michael Seater and Ashley Leggat as the two oldest children in a stepfamily. It ended with 70 episodes and one spin-off television film, entitled Vacation with Derek.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3dmfYIJ3RxFkhPJCW5jbBjHBinH.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:4635'),
  ('402382517499973333', 'Life with Judy Garland: Me and My Shadows', 2001, 'Drama', null, 'Robert L. Freedman', 'Judy Davis, Victor Garber, Hugh Laurie, Tammy Blanchard, John Benjamin Hickey, Marsha Mason, Dwayne Adams, Sonja Smits', null, 'Chronicles the life of Judy Garland, from her first public performance in 1924 until her death.', 'Chronicles the life of Judy Garland, from her first public performance in 1924 until her death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNh6PCOJIuG0ErqFFvukuodrStw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75577'),
  ('443843151544413429', 'Life with Louie', 1994, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Family', 'Louie Anderson, Matthew O''Callaghan', null, 'Louie Anderson, Edie McClurg, Debi Derryberry, Miko Hughes, Justin Shenkarow', 'TV-Y', 'The 8-year-old Louie is doing his best to grow up and cope with a large family, a doting mother, a pesky little brother, and a by-the-book, military veteran dad. Add to that a slew of holiday family squabbles, a flood, an old Rambler and a huge goldfish, and you have the background for Life with Louie. Each episode is a portrait of humor and warmth drawn from Louie Anderson''s real-life experience as a child in the Midwest.', 'The 8-year-old Louie is doing his best to grow up and cope with a large family, a doting mother, a pesky little brother, and a by-the-book, military veteran dad. Add to that a slew of holiday family squabbles, a flood, an old Rambler and a huge goldfish, and you have the background for Life with Louie. Each episode is a portrait of humor and warmth drawn from Louie Anderson''s real-life experience as a child in the Midwest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/myyLrufbm0iDF0kOwpgWbw3G8pQ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:4251'),
  ('70325616953797708', 'Life: Love on the Line', 2020, 'Drama', 'Tokokura Miya', 'Tokokura Miya', 'Jin Shirasu, Raiku, Fujiko Kojima, Shiori Doi, Nao Osada, Meguri Hiroo', null, 'Two boys meet by chance when both attempt to walk along the white line on the sidewalk. As they become drawn together and choose to walk side by side, how will their unchanging feelings co-exist within a world of changing realities?', 'Two boys meet by chance when both attempt to walk along the white line on the sidewalk. As they become drawn together and choose to walk side by side, how will their unchanging feelings co-exist within a world of changing realities?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFe7pqihbHo3U83vVIuL3kn06bR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:104976'),
  ('647789538396086778', 'Life''s Punchline', 2021, 'Drama', null, 'Shigeki Kaneko', 'Masaki Suda, Kasumi Arimura, Taiga Nakano, Ryunosuke Kamiki, Kotone Furukawa, Kyoko Yoshine, Rio Asumi, Tomoya Nakamura', null, 'A comedy trio who gave up on their dreams and disbanded. An older sister who quit working in a company and became a shell of her former self. A younger sister who works in the city at night without a goal. 5 people who can''t come back from their failures. In their 20s. But these failures are just a "lead up" to success later in life!? It is an ensemble drama that opens with laughter and connects failure to hope! Takaiwa Haruto (Suda Masaki), Minowa Junpei (Nakano Taiga), and Asabuki Shunta (Kamiki Ryunosuke) are members of the unpopular comedy trio, "Macbeth". Nakahama Rihoko (Arimura Kasumi) is a waitress at the family restaurant where the trio always meet to create stories. Tsumugi (Furukawa Kotone) is her younger sister. Every episode begins with the skit of the comedy trio "Macbeth" and as the title suggests, the opening conte* is connected as an important hint to the rest of the episode''s story. (Source: @kamikidays)', 'A comedy trio who gave up on their dreams and disbanded. An older sister who quit working in a company and became a shell of her former self. A younger sister who works in the city at night without a goal. 5 people who can''t come back from their failures. In their 20s. But these failures are just a "lead up" to success later in life!? It is an ensemble drama that opens with laughter and connects failure to hope! Takaiwa Haruto (Suda Masaki), Minowa Junpei (Nakano Taiga), and Asabuki Shunta (Kamiki Ryunosuke) are members of the unpopular comedy trio, "Macbeth". Nakahama Rihoko (Arimura Kasumi) is a waitress at the family restaurant where the trio always meet to create stories. Tsumugi (Furukawa Kotone) is her younger sister. Every episode begins with the skit of the comedy trio "Macbeth" and as the title suggests, the opening conte* is connected as an important hint to the rest of the episode''s story. (Source: @kamikidays)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2xp9gt2KNcRvPlfcXvA9Juf1yyo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121854'),
  ('459591440718939293', 'Life''s Too Short', 2011, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Ricky Gervais, Stephen Merchant, Warwick Davis', null, 'Warwick Davis, Ricky Gervais, Stephen Merchant, Shaun Williamson', 'TV-MA', 'Life''s Too Short is a British sitcom mockumentary created and written by Ricky Gervais and Stephen Merchant from an idea by Warwick Davis, and is as described by Gervais, about "the life of a showbiz dwarf".', 'Life''s Too Short is a British sitcom mockumentary created and written by Ricky Gervais and Stephen Merchant from an idea by Warwick Davis, and is as described by Gervais, about "the life of a showbiz dwarf".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJQnuGaXML31QyjxwMXuu39Tye1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38294'),
  ('722158118251793282', 'Lifeline', 2017, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Benjamin Freiburger', 'Ben Freiburger', 'Zach Gilford, Ali Yuman, Sydney Park, Usman Ally', null, 'What if you could use time travel to save your life? Welcome to "LIFELINE," the new YouTube Red Original Series about the Lifeline insurance agency, whose specially trained agents jump forward in time to prevent the deaths of their clients.', 'What if you could use time travel to save your life? Welcome to "LIFELINE," the new YouTube Red Original Series about the Lifeline insurance agency, whose specially trained agents jump forward in time to prevent the deaths of their clients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hSOGzV7NBKxcg6WxmzKVZmCApvf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74547'),
  ('768374284458705887', 'Ligaen', 2026, 'Reality', null, null, 'Morten Ramm, Jenny Skavlan, Truls Svendsen, Tete Lidbom, Helene Olafsen, Jon Martin Henriksen', null, 'Ligaen is a comedy competition series where winning alone does not cut it you have to step up perform and impress with personality creativity and humor.', 'Ligaen is a comedy competition series where winning alone does not cut it you have to step up perform and impress with personality creativity and humor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zoNF21FaFwjUQDHQOuqjgIRLHgi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:307689'),
  ('532600884247149324', 'Ligas', 2026, 'Drama', 'Federico Baccomo', null, 'Luca Argentero, Sergio Romano, Flavio Furno, Matteo Bassi, Matteo Caremoli, Eugenio di Fraia, Valeria De Michele, Marina Occhionero', null, 'Brilliant but controversial, lawyer Lorenzo Ligas fights for AC Milan''s desperate cases alongside idealistic intern Marta, seeking justice and confronting his own shortcomings.', 'Brilliant but controversial, lawyer Lorenzo Ligas fights for AC Milan''s desperate cases alongside idealistic intern Marta, seeking justice and confronting his own shortcomings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vZJsHSCcS42IK1SA9sR0Un10coE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:314658'),
  ('676829889118141504', 'LIGHT & MAGIC', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'When George Lucas set out to make Star Wars, little did he know he would end up revolutionizing an industry. This is the story of a team of creative geniuses who put the magic in the movies we love.', 'When George Lucas set out to make Star Wars, little did he know he would end up revolutionizing an industry. This is the story of a team of creative geniuses who put the magic in the movies we love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/91yE4Uo1ZthoLyek6V4uF5crXmy.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:201285'),
  ('143375922991273226', 'Light as a Feather', 2018, 'Drama', 'R. Lee Fleming Jr.', null, 'Liana Liberato, Haley Ramm, Brianne Tju, Jordan Rodrigues, Katelyn Nacon, Adriyan Rae', 'TV-14', 'Five teen girls deal with the supernatural fallout stemming from an innocent game of “Light as a Feather, Stiff as a Board.” When the girls start dying off in the exact way that was predicted, the survivors must figure out why they’re being targeted — and whether the evil force hunting them down is one of their own.', 'Five teen girls deal with the supernatural fallout stemming from an innocent game of “Light as a Feather, Stiff as a Board.” When the girls start dying off in the exact way that was predicted, the survivors must figure out why they’re being targeted — and whether the evil force hunting them down is one of their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwX3TLo5eVHKAhX8pysq4cMQgi4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:81829'),
  ('508615677359100325', 'Light Beyond the Reed', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Vin Zhang, Mao Xiaotong, Liu Dan, Shao Feng, Simon Shi, Yang Yuxi, Yu Bin, Lu Zhong', null, 'Ye Sibei has always endured her parents'' favoritism toward her brother, choosing to avoid conflict. Her husband, Qin Nan, deeply loves her but grows frustrated with her reluctance to stand up for herself and files for divorce. However, after Sibei faces a traumatic experience, Qin Nan returns to support her, encouraging her to seek justice.', 'Ye Sibei has always endured her parents'' favoritism toward her brother, choosing to avoid conflict. Her husband, Qin Nan, deeply loves her but grows frustrated with her reluctance to stand up for herself and files for divorce. However, after Sibei faces a traumatic experience, Qin Nan returns to support her, encouraging her to seek justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMphdEm2epPIsDdguQ2llqiIPNT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:273125'),
  ('547619864453534466', 'Light of My Lion', 2024, 'Drama, Family, Mystery', 'Koji Tokuo', 'Koji Tokuo, Yoshino Ichinohe', 'Yuya Yagira, Ryota Bando, Tasuku Sato, Asuka Saito, Taiiku Okazaki, Yusaku Mori, Amane Okayama, Denden', null, 'The appearance of a mysterious little boy interrupts the quiet, predictable life shared by an artist with autism and his caring older brother.', 'The appearance of a mysterious little boy interrupts the quiet, predictable life shared by an artist with autism and his caring older brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyB8p0kImkNhszQo4r4pS7Qrg6w.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:271336'),
  ('1092723234793157321', 'Light on Me', 2021, 'Drama', 'Lee Ji Eum', null, 'Lee Sae-on, Kang You-seok, Choe Chan-yi, Go Woo-jin, Lee Ki-hyun, Yang Seo-hyun', null, 'A high school loner who has difficulty making new friends joins the school''s student council to meet new people — but discovers that making friends may be harder than it seems.', 'A high school loner who has difficulty making new friends joins the school''s student council to meet new people — but discovers that making friends may be harder than it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zw92fuZuyfXJdiqyIZFpCIABRVJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:128002'),
  ('895859300678777809', 'Light Shop', 2024, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Kang Full, Kim Hie-won', null, 'Ju Ji-hoon, Park Bo-young, Um Tae-goo, Kim Seol-hyun, Lee Jung-eun, Bae Sung-woo, Kim Min-ha, Park Hyuk-kwon', 'TV-MA', 'In a mysterious shop that sells lamps, the dead may return to the world of the living, while the living may not walk out alive.', 'In a mysterious shop that sells lamps, the dead may return to the world of the living, while the living may not walk out alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRgH73xibpeNZ8zzPDkIpxuoKgC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:226529'),
  ('834773963739976806', 'Light the Night', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Lin Shao-chien, Hong Li-yen, Du Zheng-zhe', null, 'Ruby Lin, Tony Yang, Cheryl Yang, Rhydian Vaughan, Derek Chang, Puff Kuo, Esther Liu, Cherry Hsieh', 'TV-MA', 'In the red light district of 1980s Taipei, women at a popular Japanese night club navigate jealousy, heartbreak, friendship and love.', 'In the red light district of 1980s Taipei, women at a popular Japanese night club navigate jealousy, heartbreak, friendship and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBAQqvCtDLe6d2GbwDfcYBNJuVR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130330'),
  ('557221181956672831', 'Lighter and Princess', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Liu Yu Chang, 刘紫薇', 'Arthur Chen, Zhang Jingyi, Zhao Zhiwei, Jenny Zeng, Cui Yuxin, Qian Didi, Zhang Xilin, Jill Hsu', null, 'As soon as Zhu Yun started college life, the world was completely turned upside down by the intrusion of "bad boy" Li Xun. He was regarded by Zhu Yun as a rich, ignorant and incompetent son, but his real identity was actually a special admissions student who was admitted by the school, and a rare programming genius. After several confrontations, the two have some appreciation for each other. The senior Fang Zhijing made things difficult for Zhu Yun many times, Li Xun took action to protect Zhu Yun, and invited her to join the preparation team he set up to win a major programming competition on behalf of the school.', 'As soon as Zhu Yun started college life, the world was completely turned upside down by the intrusion of "bad boy" Li Xun. He was regarded by Zhu Yun as a rich, ignorant and incompetent son, but his real identity was actually a special admissions student who was admitted by the school, and a rare programming genius. After several confrontations, the two have some appreciation for each other. The senior Fang Zhijing made things difficult for Zhu Yun many times, Li Xun took action to protect Zhu Yun, and invited her to join the preparation team he set up to win a major programming competition on behalf of the school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oFFlFjiMQrOns39k9VbWcrfvbLX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:134331'),
  ('197144938592517780', 'Lightfields', 2013, 'Drama', 'David Schulner', 'Simon Tyrrell', 'Karla Crome, Dakota Blue Richards, Sam Hazeldine, Jill Halfpenny, Kris Marshall, Antonia Clarke, Lucy Cohu, Neil Jackson', null, 'The story follows three families that each lived in Lightfields farmhouse at different time periods (1944, 1975 and 2012) but who are linked by a spine-chilling presence: the ghost of a teenage girl who died in mysterious and tragic circumstances.', 'The story follows three families that each lived in Lightfields farmhouse at different time periods (1944, 1975 and 2012) but who are linked by a spine-chilling presence: the ghost of a teenage girl who died in mysterious and tragic circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtdDA4SQLrYorhDfBea9COJfOZs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46941'),
  ('745261594139984311', 'Lightning Point', 2012, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Jonathan M. Shiff', null, 'Philippa Coulthard, Jessica Green, Lucy Fry, Andrew James Morley, Kenji Fitzgerald, Paige Victoria Leigh', 'TV-G', 'When a spaceship carrying pretty, teen aliens Zoey and Kiki lands in the quiet Australian surf town of Lightning Point, the girls have to befriend local surfiegirl Amber and let her in on their secret. But while the duo learns about Earth, surf and falling in love, the girls soon realize that they aren''t the first extraterrestrial visitors.', 'When a spaceship carrying pretty, teen aliens Zoey and Kiki lands in the quiet Australian surf town of Lightning Point, the girls have to befriend local surfiegirl Amber and let her in on their secret. But while the duo learns about Earth, surf and falling in love, the girls soon realize that they aren''t the first extraterrestrial visitors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/puaByn0VUDO5tMtPYqcfYPXLapp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40243'),
  ('710225664404972614', 'Lights Out', 1949, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Crime, Drama, Reality', null, null, 'Jack La Rue', 'TV-PG', 'Lights Out was an extremely popular American old-time radio program, an early example of a network series devoted mostly to horror and the supernatural, predating Suspense and Inner Sanctum. Versions of Lights Out aired on different networks, at various times, from January 1934 to the summer of 1947 and the series eventually made the transition to television. In 1946, NBC Television brought Lights Out to TV in a series of four specials, broadcast live and produced by Fred Coe, who also contributed three of the scripts. NBC asked Cooper to write the script for the premiere, "First Person Singular", which is told entirely from the point of view of an unseen murderer who kills his obnoxious wife and winds up being executed. Variety gave this first episode a rave review ("undoubtedly one of the best dramatic shows yet seen on a television screen"), but Lights Out did not become a regular NBC-TV series until 1949.', 'Lights Out was an extremely popular American old-time radio program, an early example of a network series devoted mostly to horror and the supernatural, predating Suspense and Inner Sanctum. Versions of Lights Out aired on different networks, at various times, from January 1934 to the summer of 1947 and the series eventually made the transition to television. In 1946, NBC Television brought Lights Out to TV in a series of four specials, broadcast live and produced by Fred Coe, who also contributed three of the scripts. NBC asked Cooper to write the script for the premiere, "First Person Singular", which is told entirely from the point of view of an unseen murderer who kills his obnoxious wife and winds up being executed. Variety gave this first episode a rave review ("undoubtedly one of the best dramatic shows yet seen on a television screen"), but Lights Out did not become a regular NBC-TV series until 1949.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUX5J7lS6FnCFvUOqXCYyQPp0f9.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:24684'),
  ('798214543110176561', 'Lights Out', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Justin Zackham', null, 'Holt McCallany, Stacy Keach, Pablo Schreiber, Catherine McCormack, Bill Irwin, Reg E. Cathey, Billy Brown, Meredith Hagner', 'TV-MA', 'Lights Out is an American television boxing drama series from the FX network in the United States. It stars Holt McCallany as Patrick "Lights" Leary, a New Jersey native, and former heavyweight champion boxer who is considering a comeback. The series premiered on January 11, 2011 at 10 pm ET/PT. On March 24, 2011, FX announced the cancellation of the show. The final episode aired on April 5.', 'Lights Out is an American television boxing drama series from the FX network in the United States. It stars Holt McCallany as Patrick "Lights" Leary, a New Jersey native, and former heavyweight champion boxer who is considering a comeback. The series premiered on January 11, 2011 at 10 pm ET/PT. On March 24, 2011, FX announced the cancellation of the show. The final episode aired on April 5.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxxollt0l4J7TlVgfO7n7vyDMRp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35092'),
  ('48699704917113293', 'Lights Out with David Spade', 2019, 'Talk, Comedy', null, 'Tom Brunelle, Keith Richards Carey, Lance Crouther', 'David Spade', 'TV-14', 'Specializing in celebrities, entertainment and all things apolitical, comedy legend David Spade and a panel of his comedian friends are at the roundtable and in the field to help break down the biggest headlines of the day.', 'Specializing in celebrities, entertainment and all things apolitical, comedy legend David Spade and a panel of his comedian friends are at the roundtable and in the field to help break down the biggest headlines of the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5AO1sWKOrwHo3Jh5ORcCgozjwng.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91174'),
  ('533738604702085404', 'Like a Dragon: Yakuza', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Ryoma Takeuchi, Kento Kaku, Yuumi Kawai, Hinano Nakayama', 'TV-14', 'Set in the fictional town of Kamurocho, the story unfolds across two intersecting timelines—1995 and 2005. In 1995, four friends eager to escape their restrictive lives in an orphanage dive into the yakuza-controlled underworld of 1995 Kamurocho. Meanwhile, in 2005, their friendship is deteriorated, as tensions between the Tojo Clan and the Omi Alliance are at a boiling point.', 'Set in the fictional town of Kamurocho, the story unfolds across two intersecting timelines—1995 and 2005. In 1995, four friends eager to escape their restrictive lives in an orphanage dive into the yakuza-controlled underworld of 1995 Kamurocho. Meanwhile, in 2005, their friendship is deteriorated, as tensions between the Tojo Clan and the Omi Alliance are at a boiling point.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4uFt0lyo2UrMkTKCXH2VgxWz2jE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:256116'),
  ('925051989468207999', 'Like a Flowing River', 2018, 'Drama', 'Kong Sheng, A Nai', null, 'Wang Kai, Yang Shuo, Dong Zijian, Yang Caiyu, Karlina Zhang, Lian Shumei, Fang Zibin, Ma Fanding', null, 'The story of Song Yunhui, Lei Dongbao, and Yang Xun as they take part in China’s economic reform from the 1980s to the 1990s.', 'The story of Song Yunhui, Lei Dongbao, and Yang Xun as they take part in China’s economic reform from the 1980s to the 1990s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aw8btWFsqzjrTbnxPVmJ2Jz6ai1.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:84856'),
  ('789702359583246915', 'Like Flowers in Sand', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy, Mystery', 'Won Yoo-jung', null, 'Jang Dong-yoon, Lee Ju-myoung, Lee Ju-seung, Yun Jong-seok, Kim Bo-ra, Lee Jae-joon, Choi Moo-seong, Jang Young-nam', 'TV-14', 'Struggling to find success, a former wrestling prodigy finds himself ready to quit until he reencounters an old friend who reignites his passion.', 'Struggling to find success, a former wrestling prodigy finds himself ready to quit until he reencounters an old friend who reignites his passion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lyeBjKdpv3HhtgCNBZ0Ekk7dZr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:224900'),
  ('982553753212905298', 'Like In The Movies', 2020, 'Soap, Comedy, Drama', 'Juan Miguel Severo', null, 'Ian Pangilinan, Paolo Pangilinan', null, 'Gaya sa Pelikula (Like in the Movies) is about Karl, a 19-year old architecture student in the middle of an identity crisis and Vlad, a schoolmate on the run from his own family. As their lives become entwined by fate making them housemates over the semestral break, Karl and Vlad come to learn more about each other and themselves than they could have ever imagined.', 'Gaya sa Pelikula (Like in the Movies) is about Karl, a 19-year old architecture student in the middle of an identity crisis and Vlad, a schoolmate on the run from his own family. As their lives become entwined by fate making them housemates over the semestral break, Karl and Vlad come to learn more about each other and themselves than they could have ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/msWeIBpHs6hPEaCGHZfziKaZBeI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110370'),
  ('416574700067302122', 'Like There''s No Tomorrow', 2024, 'Drama', null, 'Ekin Atalar', 'Tuba Büyüküstün, Halit Ergenç', null, 'Sometimes people reveal their deepest secrets to complete strangers. They tell them without holding back, with complete sincerity. They tell them as if there were no tomorrow. Night ends, morning comes, and all that remains are words.', 'Sometimes people reveal their deepest secrets to complete strangers. They tell them without holding back, with complete sincerity. They tell them as if there were no tomorrow. Night ends, morning comes, and all that remains are words.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Aok6T1J315KQvegzjH9juiq9W3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:245238'),
  ('463393991500943945', 'Like Water for Chocolate', 2024, 'Drama', 'Sandra García Velten', null, 'Azul Guaita, Andres Baida, Irene Azuela, Ana Valeria Becerril', 'TV-MA', 'Tita de la Garza and Pedro Muzquiz are two souls in love who cannot be together due to deep-rooted family customs, which will force Tita to navigate with magical tints and flavors between the destiny dictated by her family and the fight for her love, while we accompany her in her greatest refuge: the kitchen.', 'Tita de la Garza and Pedro Muzquiz are two souls in love who cannot be together due to deep-rooted family customs, which will force Tita to navigate with magical tints and flavors between the destiny dictated by her family and the fight for her love, while we accompany her in her greatest refuge: the kitchen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pXNcd4z8eBihLO9I7bIVoK4mtQt.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:235635'),
  ('980044089984651411', 'Like, la Leyenda', 2018, 'Drama, Soap', 'Pedro Damián', null, 'Roberta Damián, Mauricio Abad, Macarena García, Santiago Achaga, Alejandra Müller, Carlos Said, Anna Iriyama, Víctor Varona', null, 'The experiences of a group of young people interned at the Life Institute of Knowledge and Evolution (LIKE), a prestigious and cosmopolitan educational institution, with a supposedly modern and open educational system, but in reality it is deeply traditional and schematic.', 'The experiences of a group of young people interned at the Life Institute of Knowledge and Evolution (LIKE), a prestigious and cosmopolitan educational institution, with a supposedly modern and open educational system, but in reality it is deeply traditional and schematic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62Jps0cBQnMoq7TgqmmNRfHiCsP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82282'),
  ('1098727364087645531', 'Lil'' Red Riding Hood Cha-Cha', 1994, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Masami Suzuki, Noriko Hidaka, Shingo Katori, Junko Ohtsubo, Mina Tominaga, Mayumi Akado, Tohru Senrui, Tomo Sakurai', null, 'Cha Cha is a cute little girl who is training to be a good magician. She was raised by her teacher Seravi, who is considered the world''s greatest magician. Cha Cha almost always gets strange or disastrous results whenever she uses her magic, so she practices a lot. Cha Cha then embarks on a quest with her friends to find out about her real identity and her real family.', 'Cha Cha is a cute little girl who is training to be a good magician. She was raised by her teacher Seravi, who is considered the world''s greatest magician. Cha Cha almost always gets strange or disastrous results whenever she uses her magic, so she practices a lot. Cha Cha then embarks on a quest with her friends to find out about her real identity and her real family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bWN4dJlPwuCghQUns13Mw0wGCsR.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:34179'),
  ('768489670942271271', 'Lilo & Stitch: The Series', 2003, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Chris Sanders, Dean DeBlois', null, 'Daveigh Chase, Chris Sanders, David Ogden Stiers, Kevin McDonald, Tia Carrere, Kevin Michael Richardson', 'TV-G', 'This animated series chronicles the further adventures of renegade scientist Dr. Jumba Jookiba''s beloved Experiment 626, who is now living happily as Lilo''s alien buddy Stitch. Jumba’s remaining experiments have landed all over Hawaii in the form of dehydrated pods. Lilo and Stitch’s mission is to catch Stitch’s "cousins" before they fall into the clutches of the evil Dr. Jacques von Hamsterviel!', 'This animated series chronicles the further adventures of renegade scientist Dr. Jumba Jookiba''s beloved Experiment 626, who is now living happily as Lilo''s alien buddy Stitch. Jumba’s remaining experiments have landed all over Hawaii in the form of dehydrated pods. Lilo and Stitch’s mission is to catch Stitch’s "cousins" before they fall into the clutches of the evil Dr. Jacques von Hamsterviel!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/997mXFpYV2zdXK4EOctN3hgciaT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2355'),
  ('228751566266790085', 'Lily Fever', 2015, 'Drama', null, null, 'Kim Hye-jun, Jeong Yeon-joo, Park Hee-von, Jei, Yoon Park', null, 'The story revolves around the budding relationship between Kim Kyung Ju and Jang Se Rang who meet when Kyung Ju can’t find her passport and has to go to her friend’s house to try and find it. When she arrives, the friend is leaving and tells Kyung Ju she can just go inside, but to be mindful of her houseguest, Se Rang.', 'The story revolves around the budding relationship between Kim Kyung Ju and Jang Se Rang who meet when Kyung Ju can’t find her passport and has to go to her friend’s house to try and find it. When she arrives, the friend is leaving and tells Kyung Ju she can just go inside, but to be mindful of her houseguest, Se Rang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s02Pi450iydTfil67DekDTlwglA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91798'),
  ('1096084943556130784', 'Lilyhammer', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Anne Bjørnstad, Eilif Skodvin', null, 'Steven Van Zandt, Paul Kaye, Nils Jørgen Kaalstad, Sven Nordin, Steinar Sagen, Trond Fausa Aurvåg, Marian Saastad Ottesen, Anne Krigsvoll', 'TV-MA', 'After Frank The Fixer Tagliano testifies against his Mafia boss in New York, he enters the Witness Protection Program and makes an unusual demand: he wants to be set up with a new life in the Norwegian small town of Lillehammer or as he calls it, Lilyhammer.', 'After Frank The Fixer Tagliano testifies against his Mafia boss in New York, he enters the Witness Protection Program and makes an unusual demand: he wants to be set up with a new life in the Norwegian small town of Lillehammer or as he calls it, Lilyhammer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o5I2D5oeIEafpyFw30v11AwkhnB.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:42368'),
  ('1018434880948936543', 'LIMBO... Until I Decide', 2022, 'Drama', 'Javier van de Couter', null, 'Clara Lago, Mike Amigorena, Esteban Pérez, Enrique Piñeyro, Mex Urtizberea, Andrés Gil, Andrea Frigerio, Claudio Da Passano', 'TV-MA', 'As an heiress to her family’s business empire, Sofía lives an opulent life free of responsibilities and commitments. But when her father passes away, Sofía is forced to return to her birthplace, Buenos Aires, to confront her rivalry with her two brothers and her father''s secrets. In facing her complicated family legacy, Sofía sets out to prove that she’s more than a spoiled party girl.', 'As an heiress to her family’s business empire, Sofía lives an opulent life free of responsibilities and commitments. But when her father passes away, Sofía is forced to return to her birthplace, Buenos Aires, to confront her rivalry with her two brothers and her father''s secrets. In facing her complicated family legacy, Sofía sets out to prove that she’s more than a spoiled party girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQWvLPD2UXTtayfzX3tWzlNppx0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:122045'),
  ('585292923025557240', 'Limetown', 2019, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Rebecca Thomas', null, 'Jessica Biel, Stanley Tucci, Sherri Saum, Omar Elba, Alessandro Juliani, Kelly Jenrette', 'TV-14', 'Lia Haddock, a journalist for American Public Radio, unravels the mystery behind the disappearance of over 300 people at a research community in Tennessee.', 'Lia Haddock, a journalist for American Public Radio, unravels the mystery behind the disappearance of over 300 people at a research community in Tennessee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVWHvcVxYmSA2fQYrXL4vEo8gM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90254'),
  ('1055633722799871209', 'Limitless', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Craig Sweeny', null, 'Jake McDorman, Jennifer Carpenter, Desmond Harrington, Mary Elizabeth Mastrantonio, Bradley Cooper, Hill Harper, Ron Rifkin, Blair Brown', 'TV-14', 'Brian Finch''s life takes an extraordinary turn when he uses NZT-48, a neuroenhancing drug whose mystery and chaos lead him to working for the FBI and a senator who is not what he seems.', 'Brian Finch''s life takes an extraordinary turn when he uses NZT-48, a neuroenhancing drug whose mystery and chaos lead him to working for the FBI and a senator who is not what he seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5BERaKn3ozRTLhoylIiNwMDvax.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62687'),
  ('429427243758146586', 'Limitless with Chris Hemsworth', 2022, 'Documentary, Action & Adventure', 'Darren Aronofsky', null, 'Chris Hemsworth', 'TV-14', 'Chris is on a mission to live better for longer. With the help of top scientists, he takes on six epic challenges to test mind and body to the max.', 'Chris is on a mission to live better for longer. With the help of top scientists, he takes on six epic challenges to test mind and body to the max.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rfxqHTHBOPl3Qus1OOKYMt06bx6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:115996'),
