  ('708434600368142479', 'Locomía', 2022, 'Documentary', null, 'Jorge Laplace, Pablo Aguinaga', 'Xavier Font, José Luis Font, Manuel Arjona, Fernandisco, Luis Balaguer', 'TV-MA', 'A three-part documentary that tells the story of one of the most emblematic groups of the nineties and of a time that marked the history of Spain. It is a unique story that goes beyond the famous fans of the group, it is also a story about success, betrayal, jealousy, anarchy, homophobia, and oblivion. Directed by Jorge Laplace, ‘Locomía’ features the participation of the original members of the group that revolutionized the Spanish music scene, such as its founder, Xavier Font, and the music producer who put them on stage, José Luis Gil.', 'A three-part documentary that tells the story of one of the most emblematic groups of the nineties and of a time that marked the history of Spain. It is a unique story that goes beyond the famous fans of the group, it is also a story about success, betrayal, jealousy, anarchy, homophobia, and oblivion. Directed by Jorge Laplace, ‘Locomía’ features the participation of the original members of the group that revolutionized the Spanish music scene, such as its founder, Xavier Font, and the music producer who put them on stage, José Luis Gil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lHywF0JloOpY9h8yuUsxMi5xBSL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203251'),
  ('383054960319701020', 'Lodge 49', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'Jim Gavin', null, 'Wyatt Russell, Brent Jennings, Sonya Cassidy, Linda Emond, David Pasquesi, Eric Allan Kramer', 'TV-14', 'Dud is a deadbeat but charming ex-surfer who joins a fraternal order hoping to reclaim the simple, happy lifestyle he lost when his father died. Through the Lodge and his newfound connection with the other members, Dud will come to find the missing sense of purpose in his life and confront his deepest fears and greatest hopes.', 'Dud is a deadbeat but charming ex-surfer who joins a fraternal order hoping to reclaim the simple, happy lifestyle he lost when his father died. Through the Lodge and his newfound connection with the other members, Dud will come to find the missing sense of purpose in his life and confront his deepest fears and greatest hopes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhkuWEgRqMEEyMlKcziFDEEXo9E.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:80925'),
  ('1145889760417969556', 'Lofty Waters Verdant Bow', 2002, 'Drama', null, null, 'Raymond Lam Fung, Michelle Ye Xuan, Rain Lee Choi-Wah, Power Chan Kwok-Pong, Mimi Lo, Eddy Ko Hung, Michelle Fung, Jimmy Au Shui-Wai', null, 'The story starts off with Gam Sai Wai when he embarks on his journey to find Lui Sei Leong to get rid of the poison that is passed on by his master into his body. Sai Wai''s master had died because of the poison and before his death, he had told Sai Wai to go find Lui Sei Leong because she can help him. During his journey, he makes friends with lots of people and meets two women who love him very much. The two women are Lai Shing Nam and Kuk Chi Wah. He also gets caught in the affairs of the martial arts world during his journey and keeps on helping the good people, especially Lai Shing Nam and Kuk Chi Wah to fight for justice until he becomes the hero without realizing it.', 'The story starts off with Gam Sai Wai when he embarks on his journey to find Lui Sei Leong to get rid of the poison that is passed on by his master into his body. Sai Wai''s master had died because of the poison and before his death, he had told Sai Wai to go find Lui Sei Leong because she can help him. During his journey, he makes friends with lots of people and meets two women who love him very much. The two women are Lai Shing Nam and Kuk Chi Wah. He also gets caught in the affairs of the martial arts world during his journey and keeps on helping the good people, especially Lai Shing Nam and Kuk Chi Wah to fight for justice until he becomes the hero without realizing it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uz3PX3sIPbHQfpJmqrkIMzJExSM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109207'),
  ('1057862479163469468', 'Log Horizon', 2013, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Takuma Terashima, Tomoaki Maeno, Emiri Kato, Jouji Nakata, Daiki Yamashita, Nao Tamura, Eriko Matsui', 'TV-PG', 'One day, while playing the online game Elder Tales, 30,000 players suddenly find themselves trapped in another world. There, eight-year veteran gamer Shiroe also gets left behind. The trapped players are still alive, but they remain in combat with the monsters. The players don''t understand what has happened to them, and they flee to Akiba, the largest city in Tokyo, where they are thrown into chaos. Once proud of his loner lifestyle, Shiroe forms a guild called Log Horizon with his old friend Naotsugu, female assassin Akatsuki and others.', 'One day, while playing the online game Elder Tales, 30,000 players suddenly find themselves trapped in another world. There, eight-year veteran gamer Shiroe also gets left behind. The trapped players are still alive, but they remain in combat with the monsters. The players don''t understand what has happened to them, and they flee to Akiba, the largest city in Tokyo, where they are thrown into chaos. Once proud of his loner lifestyle, Shiroe forms a guild called Log Horizon with his old friend Naotsugu, female assassin Akatsuki and others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLGdRuWCn2AlByL5Y9OLB3ZwItg.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:60846'),
  ('201896156729074435', 'Logan''s Run', 1977, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'William F. Nolan, George Clayton Johnson', null, 'Gregory Harrison, Heather Menzies, Donald Moffat, Randy Powell', 'NR', 'In a futuristic society where reaching the age of 30 is a death sentence, a rebellious law enforcement agent goes on the run in search of Sanctuary.', 'In a futuristic society where reaching the age of 30 is a death sentence, a rebellious law enforcement agent goes on the run in search of Sanctuary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sEwi68z1sP6iUxHYtIGWGfj21cc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:36626'),
  ('626791546670809154', 'Lois & Clark: The New Adventures of Superman', 1993, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Deborah Joy LeVine', null, 'Dean Cain, Teri Hatcher, Lane Smith, Justin Whalin, K Callan, Eddie Jones', 'TV-PG', 'A much more lavish version of the popular Superman television series which had first aired forty years earlier, Lois & Clark focused more on the Man of Steel''s early adult years in Metropolis. With the unknowing help of Lois Lane, Clark Kent created Superman there in Metropolis after finding work at the world-famous Daily Planet newspaper, where he meets fellow reporter Lois Lane.', 'A much more lavish version of the popular Superman television series which had first aired forty years earlier, Lois & Clark focused more on the Man of Steel''s early adult years in Metropolis. With the unknowing help of Lois Lane, Clark Kent created Superman there in Metropolis after finding work at the world-famous Daily Planet newspaper, where he meets fellow reporter Lois Lane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LbPs6i1h4BKjVUwK5S9GjPCydi.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:4515'),
  ('1011862629190891641', 'Loiter Squad', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Davon ''Jasper'' Wilson, Tyler, The Creator, Travis "Taco" Bennett', 'Earl Sweatshirt, Davon ''Jasper'' Wilson, Travis "Taco" Bennett', 'Travis "Taco" Bennett, Tyler, The Creator, Davon ''Jasper'' Wilson, Lionel Boyce, Earl Sweatshirt', 'TV-14', 'Loiter Squad is an American sketch comedy television series starring Tyler, The Creator, Jasper Dolphin, Taco Bennett, and Lionel Boyce from the Los Angeles hip hop group Odd Future. The show regularly features other members of the group as well. Jeff Tremaine, Shanna Zablow, Dimitry Elyashkevich, Lance Bangs, Nick Weidenfeld and Keith Crofford are the show''s executive producers. The show is produced by Dickhouse Entertainment for Cartoon Network''s Adult Swim programming block. The show''s second season made its debut on March 10, 2013.', 'Loiter Squad is an American sketch comedy television series starring Tyler, The Creator, Jasper Dolphin, Taco Bennett, and Lionel Boyce from the Los Angeles hip hop group Odd Future. The show regularly features other members of the group as well. Jeff Tremaine, Shanna Zablow, Dimitry Elyashkevich, Lance Bangs, Nick Weidenfeld and Keith Crofford are the show''s executive producers. The show is produced by Dickhouse Entertainment for Cartoon Network''s Adult Swim programming block. The show''s second season made its debut on March 10, 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/FFfCw6861Fy3LcrmbqkSLBymXO.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:40520'),
  ('853176842030843167', 'Loki', 2021, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Michael Waldron', 'Rachel Alter, Brett Maline, Kasra Farahani', 'Tom Hiddleston, Sophia Di Martino, Wunmi Mosaku, Eugene Cordero, Ke Huy Quan, Owen Wilson', 'TV-14', 'After stealing the Tesseract during the events of “Avengers: Endgame,” an alternate version of Loki is brought to the mysterious Time Variance Authority, a bureaucratic organization that exists outside of time and space and monitors the timeline. They give Loki a choice: face being erased from existence due to being a “time variant” or help fix the timeline and stop a greater threat.', 'After stealing the Tesseract during the events of “Avengers: Endgame,” an alternate version of Loki is brought to the mysterious Time Variance Authority, a bureaucratic organization that exists outside of time and space and monitors the timeline. They give Loki a choice: face being erased from existence due to being a “time variant” or help fix the timeline and stop a greater threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kEl2t3OhXc3Zb9FBh1AuYzRTgZp.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:84958'),
  ('862940528056781779', 'LOL - Last One Laughing Spain', 2021, 'Reality, Comedy', null, null, 'Yolanda Ramos, Silvia Abril, Carolina Iglesias, Patricia Conde, Anabel Alonso, Henar Álvarez, Juan Amodeo, Lorena Castell', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zpa6hsmcErWfEtrIseGkReAFB7G.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:112922'),
  ('1063900995782368531', 'LOL : Qui rit, sort !', 2021, 'Comedy, Reality', null, null, 'Philippe Lacheau', null, 'Philippe Lacheau has invited 10 actors and comedians to live a unique experience in a grandiose setting. There is only one rule to follow for the next 6 hours: if you laugh, you are eliminated. The 10 comedians will have to keep cool despite having to try and make each other laugh. The winner will get 50 000 euros for the charity he/she represents. Nothing is off limits!', 'Philippe Lacheau has invited 10 actors and comedians to live a unique experience in a grandiose setting. There is only one rule to follow for the next 6 hours: if you laugh, you are eliminated. The 10 comedians will have to keep cool despite having to try and make each other laugh. The winner will get 50 000 euros for the charity he/she represents. Nothing is off limits!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xRkKrghSXxysmBnAGMmo78xhhK9.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:122228'),
  ('645915449120702153', 'LOL Talent Show: Be Funny and You''re In!', 2024, 'Reality', null, null, 'Michele Foresta, Elio, Katia Follesa, Lillo Petrolo', null, 'Get ready for a barrage of aspiring comedians and an exciting contest hosted by Forest, the magician! Three judges: Elio, Katia Follesa, and Angelo Pintus. Their mission? To find the tenth contestant for LOL 4! They''ll travel through Italy and be assisted by a different guest judge on every episode.', 'Get ready for a barrage of aspiring comedians and an exciting contest hosted by Forest, the magician! Three judges: Elio, Katia Follesa, and Angelo Pintus. Their mission? To find the tenth contestant for LOL 4! They''ll travel through Italy and be assisted by a different guest judge on every episode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fIT9hVznY6je2olqmOb398ynqnf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:247171'),
  ('1116050518318266460', 'LOL: Australia', 2020, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Rebel Wilson, Anne Edmonds, Becky Lucas, Dilruk Jayasinha, Ed Kavalee, Joel Creasey, Frank Woodley, Nazeem Hussain', null, 'Hosted by Rebel Wilson, 10 of Australia’s finest comedians battle it out to see who can keep a straight face while simultaneously trying to make their opponents laugh. Comedians who laugh will be eliminated one-by-one, until a single comedian remains. With $100,000 on the line, who will Rebel crown the Last One Laughing?', 'Hosted by Rebel Wilson, 10 of Australia’s finest comedians battle it out to see who can keep a straight face while simultaneously trying to make their opponents laugh. Comedians who laugh will be eliminated one-by-one, until a single comedian remains. With $100,000 on the line, who will Rebel crown the Last One Laughing?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6zCUutlyslkgJ6VMWLfXb91mNyt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105041'),
  ('788754452214501029', 'LOL: Last One Laughing', 2018, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Eugenio Derbez', null, 'An unscripted variety series from Mexico in which ten professional comedians compete for a cash prize by trying to make each other laugh. The one who refrains from laughing the longest, while forcing other contestants to laugh first, is the winner.', 'An unscripted variety series from Mexico in which ten professional comedians compete for a cash prize by trying to make each other laugh. The one who refrains from laughing the longest, while forcing other contestants to laugh first, is the winner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/RHkYMwtfUuhddxZoXGDTq56rPT.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:84969'),
  ('739472078346383299', 'LOL: Last One Laughing', 2021, 'Comedy, Reality', null, null, 'Michael Herbig', null, 'Ten top stars of German comedy join in the ultimate battle to find out who laughs last! Who will be able to stay serious? Which performance won''t leave a dry eye in the house? And who will be the last one standing?', 'Ten top stars of German comedy join in the ultimate battle to find out who laughs last! Who will be able to stay serious? Which performance won''t leave a dry eye in the house? And who will be the last one standing?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZgYzhncs33DELxXXjfut6v0GJR.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:122241'),
  ('919332846439400261', 'LOL: Last One Laughing Argentina', 2023, 'Comedy', null, null, null, null, 'The social experiment, hosted by Susana Giménez, seeks to find the next "10" of comedy and crown the first winner of LOL ARGENTINA. The one who laughs loses, and the one who provokes more laughs from his rivals will be the winner.', 'The social experiment, hosted by Susana Giménez, seeks to find the next "10" of comedy and crown the first winner of LOL ARGENTINA. The one who laughs loses, and the one who provokes more laughs from his rivals will be the winner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMq6SAdD3wIjCsfzSvQU682sPk9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:222598'),
  ('331568333581883712', 'LOL: Last One Laughing Brazil', 2021, 'Reality, Comedy', 'Pedro Antônio', null, 'Fábio Porchat, Tom Cavalcante, Ed Gama, Estevam Nabote, Gregório Duvivier, Flávia Reis, Luciana Paes, Igor Guimarães', null, 'A comedy show where ten professional comedians face off for six hours in a row to keep a straight face, while they try to make their opponents laugh.', 'A comedy show where ten professional comedians face off for six hours in a row to keep a straight face, while they try to make their opponents laugh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubEJkfegbWR7iDmA33iDdseBI0C.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:137453'),
  ('116035260711694118', 'LOL: Last One Laughing Colombia', 2023, 'Reality, Comedy', null, null, null, null, 'For the first time in Colombia, LOL opens its doors to 10 of the best comedians to compete against each other to win the LOL trophy while they dare to make comedy free of censorship and limits. In this crazy extreme experiment, comedians will reveal much more than their repertoire of jokes. What will be their challenge? Make each of their opponents laugh while keeping a straight face.', 'For the first time in Colombia, LOL opens its doors to 10 of the best comedians to compete against each other to win the LOL trophy while they dare to make comedy free of censorship and limits. In this crazy extreme experiment, comedians will reveal much more than their repertoire of jokes. What will be their challenge? Make each of their opponents laugh while keeping a straight face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwj7EtBwCNn6EKqLdWS4Ey84QC6.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:231804'),
  ('639118622681954151', 'LOL: Last One Laughing Indonesia', 2024, 'Reality', 'Pandji Pragiwaksono', null, 'Pandji Pragiwaksono, Indra Jegel, Dicky Difie, Asri Welas, Rina Nose, Andre Taulany, Marshel Widianto, Ivan Gunawan', 'TV-MA', 'The hosts will lead top comedians in a chaotic battle of wits and endurance. A room devoid of laughter, where comedians armed with jokes and timing engage in a high-stakes battle to survive longer.', 'The hosts will lead top comedians in a chaotic battle of wits and endurance. A room devoid of laughter, where comedians armed with jokes and timing engage in a high-stakes battle to survive longer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjfLw8pZbjspmMAgWaPtw645LKq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:255974'),
  ('631527938366402693', 'LOL: Last One Laughing Italy', 2021, 'Reality, Comedy', 'Chiara Simeoni', null, null, null, 'Is a comedy show where ten professional comedians face off for six hours in a row to keep a straight face, while they try to make their opponents laugh. The first time someone laughs the contestant gets warned, the second time, they get eliminated from the game. Whoever manages to resist without laughing all the way through the six hours wins EUR100,000 to turn over to the charity of their choice.', 'Is a comedy show where ten professional comedians face off for six hours in a row to keep a straight face, while they try to make their opponents laugh. The first time someone laughs the contestant gets warned, the second time, they get eliminated from the game. Whoever manages to resist without laughing all the way through the six hours wins EUR100,000 to turn over to the charity of their choice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5Y0piW276vOcStW0s0uYXOf4Gw.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:120494'),
  ('927283350663461005', 'LOL: Last One Laughing Norway', 2023, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Sigrid Bonde Tusvik', null, 'Sigrid Bonde Tusvik gathers ten of Norway''s funniest people in the same room, with the following challenge: Don''t laugh for six hours, while you do whatever it takes to make the others laugh. The winner of LOL: Den som ler sist leaves the house with NOK 100,000 for their chosen charity.', 'Sigrid Bonde Tusvik gathers ten of Norway''s funniest people in the same room, with the following challenge: Don''t laugh for six hours, while you do whatever it takes to make the others laugh. The winner of LOL: Den som ler sist leaves the house with NOK 100,000 for their chosen charity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dBLPZ3mcOGsi3xzYgEWnvj9Mis8.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:241584'),
  ('1122314096140650600', 'LOL: Last One Laughing Thailand', 2024, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Siwat Chotchaicharin, Pramote Pathan, Pongsatorn Jongwilas, Kyutae Sim, Kanticha Chumma, Thongchai Thongkanthom, Boriboon Junreurng, Nipaporn Thititanakarn', null, 'Oat Pramote and C Siwat host 10 of the biggest Thai comedians in a community mall for 6 hours. To eliminate their fellow comedians, they can do anything to make each other laugh, except laugh themselves. With 1 million baht on the line for a charity of their choice, who will be the Last One Laughing?', 'Oat Pramote and C Siwat host 10 of the biggest Thai comedians in a community mall for 6 hours. To eliminate their fellow comedians, they can do anything to make each other laugh, except laugh themselves. With 1 million baht on the line for a charity of their choice, who will be the Last One Laughing?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iIvKYaoD49L8Fd72jcDgjNkTVIb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:258468'),
  ('622630580379046412', 'LOL: Last One Laughing UK', 2025, 'Comedy, Reality', null, null, 'Jimmy Carr', null, 'Famous for his dark humour, one liners and THAT laugh, Jimmy Carr challenges 10 of Britain’s funniest comics to spend the day together without so much as cracking a smile. The 10 comics use every ounce of their comedic talents to try and break their opponents without cracking up themselves.', 'Famous for his dark humour, one liners and THAT laugh, Jimmy Carr challenges 10 of Britain’s funniest comics to spend the day together without so much as cracking a smile. The 10 comics use every ounce of their comedic talents to try and break their opponents without cracking up themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ehddE5xt4kqpSLk5c374h94zfVd.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:262819'),
  ('511685922505248244', 'LOL: Last One Laughing... or Screaming France', 2023, 'Comedy, Reality', null, null, 'Philippe Lacheau, Gérard Darmon, Kyan Khojandi, Audrey Fleurot, Ahmed Sylla, Bérengère Krief, Camille Lellouche, Fadily Camara', null, 'They''re back! For Ahmed Sylla, Audrey Fleurot, Fadily Camara, Hakim Jemili, Kyan Khojandi, Camille Lellouche, Bérengère Krief & Gérard Darmon, the danger is everywhere: in this edition, screaming can sometimes be as fatal as laughing! The last person who holds out against their opponents'' attacks and the scare-themed, booby-trapped arena will get 150,000 euros donated to a charity of their choice.', 'They''re back! For Ahmed Sylla, Audrey Fleurot, Fadily Camara, Hakim Jemili, Kyan Khojandi, Camille Lellouche, Bérengère Krief & Gérard Darmon, the danger is everywhere: in this edition, screaming can sometimes be as fatal as laughing! The last person who holds out against their opponents'' attacks and the scare-themed, booby-trapped arena will get 150,000 euros donated to a charity of their choice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nI93MZf6n2OszaaueRSDuhxkF8C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:236767'),
  ('712405018921213036', 'Lola… Once Upon a Time', 2007, 'Soap, Drama', 'Cris Morena', 'Iván Cuevas', 'Eiza González, Aarón Díaz, Grettell Valdéz, Lorena Herrera, Zoraida Gómez, Tiaré Scanda, Natasha Dupeyrón, Eddy Vilard', 'TV-14', 'Lola... Érase Una Vez is a teen targeted Mexican melodrama telenovela produced by Televisa that is an adaptation of the Argentine global phenomenon and teenage telenovela Floricienta. The show tells the story of a modern Cinderella, Lola, a 20 year old girl, who works as a nanny and sings in a rock band and meets her so call Prince Charming. It debuted in Mexico on February 26, 2007, starring Aarón Díaz and Eiza González. The show had gained popularity among teens and children not only in Mexico but also internationally including Venezuela, Spain and the in United States. With concert performances filling major auditoriums and songs by the protagonist become radio hits. It debuted in the United States on Univision in March 2008 and ended on January 26, 2009. The series consisted of 224 episodes which aried Monday through Friday at 3 P.M, intentionally for teenagers to watch after school, as is typical for most teenage & children telenovelas in Spanish networks.', 'Lola... Érase Una Vez is a teen targeted Mexican melodrama telenovela produced by Televisa that is an adaptation of the Argentine global phenomenon and teenage telenovela Floricienta. The show tells the story of a modern Cinderella, Lola, a 20 year old girl, who works as a nanny and sings in a rock band and meets her so call Prince Charming. It debuted in Mexico on February 26, 2007, starring Aarón Díaz and Eiza González. The show had gained popularity among teens and children not only in Mexico but also internationally including Venezuela, Spain and the in United States. With concert performances filling major auditoriums and songs by the protagonist become radio hits. It debuted in the United States on Univision in March 2008 and ended on January 26, 2009. The series consisted of 224 episodes which aried Monday through Friday at 3 P.M, intentionally for teenagers to watch after school, as is typical for most teenage & children telenovelas in Spanish networks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nEThAMS4RVVq7BaTlGQD8PlHusB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1341'),
  ('657153268317679562', 'LoliRock', 2014, 'Animation, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'David Michel, Jean-Louis Vandestock', null, 'Lilly Caruso, Léopoldine Serre, Kelly Marot, Fanny Bloc, Marie Nonnenmacher, Karine Foviau', 'NR', 'When Iris joins the girl group LoliRock, her life is changed forever, as a new world of music, mysteries and magical powers is revealed.', 'When Iris joins the girl group LoliRock, her life is changed forever, as a new world of music, mysteries and magical powers is revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/DGuBvzXHsgPBCMlxzAGca74kqq.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66762'),
  ('476223500494990180', 'Lolita Lobosco', 2021, 'Crime, Drama', 'Luca Miniero', null, 'Luisa Ranieri, Giovanni Ludeno, Bianca Nappi, Filippo Scicchitano, Lunetta Savino, Giulia Maria Fiume, Maurizio Donadoni, Antonino Bruschetta', null, 'Deputy Chief Lolita Lobosco returns to her hometown, Bari, to direct a team of men only. In a world stubbornly ruled by males, she chooses to remain herself against all odds, and uses her skills and devotion to fight prejudices.', 'Deputy Chief Lolita Lobosco returns to her hometown, Bari, to direct a team of men only. In a world stubbornly ruled by males, she chooses to remain herself against all odds, and uses her skills and devotion to fight prejudices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pVhzkegwD88xtpCojN4YBjF1YbJ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:119374'),
  ('717737137170820833', 'London Irish', 2013, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Sinéad Keenan, Art Campion, Kat Reagan, Kerr Logan', null, 'Old enough to know better… Young enough to do it anyway. Conor, his older sister Bronagh, best friend Packy and Niamh have just moved from Ireland to London, ready to shake this drunken haze and start life afresh with a clear head. The days of forgotten nights out, regrettable bedfellows and alcohol fueled bad decisions are over. Cheers to the adult life! Which starts now… soon… just as soon as they shake this hangover.', 'Old enough to know better… Young enough to do it anyway. Conor, his older sister Bronagh, best friend Packy and Niamh have just moved from Ireland to London, ready to shake this drunken haze and start life afresh with a clear head. The days of forgotten nights out, regrettable bedfellows and alcohol fueled bad decisions are over. Cheers to the adult life! Which starts now… soon… just as soon as they shake this hangover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/191QgMNYwQ5TXbBMhOhmUC5SkrU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64591'),
  ('177893256936036354', 'London Kills', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Hugo Speer, Sharon Small, Bailey Patrick, Tori Allen-Martin', null, 'With a documentary style delivery, this drama tells the story of a team of top murder detectives with each episode featuring a different murder while also following a serialized story involving the lead detective’s missing wife.', 'With a documentary style delivery, this drama tells the story of a team of top murder detectives with each episode featuring a different murder while also following a serialized story involving the lead detective’s missing wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YqT6OWah3zQfFMFQGLzQHDObcq.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:85547'),
  ('366640403525453354', 'London Spy', 2015, 'Drama', 'Tom Rob Smith', 'Tom Rob Smith', 'Ben Whishaw, Edward Holcroft, Jim Broadbent', 'TV-MA', 'A chance romance between two men from very different worlds, one from the headquarters of the Secret Intelligence Service, the other from a world of clubbing and youthful excess, leads into mystery after one of them suddenly disappears.', 'A chance romance between two men from very different worlds, one from the headquarters of the Secret Intelligence Service, the other from a world of clubbing and youthful excess, leads into mystery after one of them suddenly disappears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whE6eWgDpmAP93mB6vGvIzu4SK5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64383'),
  ('43847492283461573', 'Londongrad', 2015, 'Drama, Crime, Comedy', 'Mikhail Idov, Andrew Ryvkin, Alexandr Kessel', 'Lily Idov, Mikhail Idov, Elena Vanina', 'Nikita Efremov, Ingrid Olerinskaya, Yevgeniy Morozov, Pavel Ilyin, Sergey Rost', null, 'Russian comedy detective series centres around a ‘fixing’ agency set up to troubleshoot problems for rich Russians in London.', 'Russian comedy detective series centres around a ‘fixing’ agency set up to troubleshoot problems for rich Russians in London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4q2CJf93Stxy8J2ILjVQx8XsMT9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92728'),
  ('797907001269101166', 'Lone Star', 2010, 'Drama', 'Kyle Killen', null, 'James Wolk, Adrianne Palicki, Eloise Mumford, David Keith, Bryce Johnson, Mark Deklin, Jon Voight', null, 'Lone Star is an American drama television series which originally ran on Fox from September 20, 2010 to September 27, 2010, airing Monday nights at 9 pm ET/PT. Fox announced Lone Star''s cancellation on September 28, 2010 after two low-rated episodes.', 'Lone Star is an American drama television series which originally ran on Fox from September 20, 2010 to September 27, 2010, airing Monday nights at 9 pm ET/PT. Fox announced Lone Star''s cancellation on September 28, 2010 after two low-rated episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iM6TGxPQLfLnU9l1O91Z5RfDI0q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32750'),
  ('108366318501249421', 'Loner Life in Another World', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shuichiro Umeda, Haruka Shiraishi, Rika Abe, Kanon Takao, Mari Takahashi, Hina Suguta, Mai Kanno, Yuki Nakashima', 'TV-14', 'Isekai''d into another world, Haruka makes use of seemingly underpowered skills to live as a lone wolf.', 'Isekai''d into another world, Haruka makes use of seemingly underpowered skills to live as a lone wolf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkWUPeyRTFMUD7aJBydTWjELBUG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259558'),
  ('123956047858879425', 'Lonesome Dove', 1989, 'Drama, Western', null, null, 'Robert Duvall, Tommy Lee Jones, Diane Lane, Robert Urich, D. B. Sweeney, Danny Glover, Rick Schroder, Glenne Headly', 'TV-14', 'A pair of longtime friends and former Texas Rangers crave one last adventure before hanging-up their spurs. After stealing over a thousand head of cattle from rustlers south of the border, they recruit an unlikely crew of hands to drive the herd 3,000 miles north to the grasslands of Montana.', 'A pair of longtime friends and former Texas Rangers crave one last adventure before hanging-up their spurs. After stealing over a thousand head of cattle from rustlers south of the border, they recruit an unlikely crew of hands to drive the herd 3,000 miles north to the grasslands of Montana.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qK4iseZGf0YhYx53ecawSGhL0sl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:41692'),
  ('1029149030126192902', 'Lonesome Dove: The Outlaw Years', 1995, 'Western', null, null, 'Tracy Scoggins, Paul Johansson, Kelly Rowan, Eric McCormack, Scott Bairstow, Bret Hart', null, '"Lonesome Dove: The Outlaw Years" begins two years after the end of "Lonesome Dove". After two years spent bounty hunting, womanizing, and drinking away the painful memories of his late wife, Hannah, Newt Call returns to town to find many things have changed. His brother-in-law, Austin, is now an alcoholic sheriff, who has never fully recovered from his beloved sister''s death, and blames Call for it. His father-in-law, Josiah, is the town mayor, but hasn''t been right in the head since Hannah died. The town is run under the iron fist of Clayton Mosby, who also cannot forget Hannah, who looked amazingly like his late wife, Mary. "The Lonesome Dove", the hotel opened in the mini-series by Ida Grayson, now belongs to Amanda Carpenter, a woman with a mysterious past and a determination on par with Clay Mosby''s. Curtis Wells also gets a new gunsmith, a mysterious and feisty woman named Mattie Shaw.', '"Lonesome Dove: The Outlaw Years" begins two years after the end of "Lonesome Dove". After two years spent bounty hunting, womanizing, and drinking away the painful memories of his late wife, Hannah, Newt Call returns to town to find many things have changed. His brother-in-law, Austin, is now an alcoholic sheriff, who has never fully recovered from his beloved sister''s death, and blames Call for it. His father-in-law, Josiah, is the town mayor, but hasn''t been right in the head since Hannah died. The town is run under the iron fist of Clayton Mosby, who also cannot forget Hannah, who looked amazingly like his late wife, Mary. "The Lonesome Dove", the hotel opened in the mini-series by Ida Grayson, now belongs to Amanda Carpenter, a woman with a mysterious past and a determination on par with Clay Mosby''s. Curtis Wells also gets a new gunsmith, a mysterious and feisty woman named Mattie Shaw.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ri8yI5fLYVIC0bb2b4QfC7PMmjl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:24974'),
  ('52975768655671953', 'Long Bright River', 2025, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Liz Moore, Nikki Toscano', null, 'Amanda Seyfried, Nicholas Pinnock, Ashleigh Cummings, Callum Vinson, John Doman', 'TV-MA', 'A police officer patrols a Philadelphia neighborhood hard-hit by the opioid crisis. When a series of murders begins in the neighborhood, Mickey realizes that her personal history might be related to the case.', 'A police officer patrols a Philadelphia neighborhood hard-hit by the opioid crisis. When a series of murders begins in the neighborhood, Mickey realizes that her personal history might be related to the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQHOmmDXtDSsmXn55GcdtSOLMAc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:244628'),
  ('930858606529751108', 'Long Island Medium', 2011, 'Reality', null, null, 'Theresa Caputo', 'TV-PG', 'Theresa Caputo is an average mom from Long Island in every way except one: she talks to the dead. Theresa spends her days with her loving family and helping individuals connect to the spirits of their departed loved ones. This is not her job…this is her life.', 'Theresa Caputo is an average mom from Long Island in every way except one: she talks to the dead. Theresa spends her days with her loving family and helping individuals connect to the spirits of their departed loved ones. This is not her job…this is her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jUv9DU6vglx0D7qmLYyEC9N1bY.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:45322'),
  ('99610180085410269', 'Long live Rai2!', 2022, 'Comedy, Talk', 'Fiorello', null, 'Fiorello, Fabrizio Biggio', null, 'Between infotainment and variety, a good morning with Fiorello and Biggio. At the center are the news, the events that happened and those that will happen, commented in an ironic and pungent style but always with lightness and good humor. A condensation of moments of variety, with a high rhythm: music, songs, ballets, duets, gags with guests and playmates, a cast in constant evolution that, day after day, will always see new protagonists. Unusual fifths of the show are via Asiago 10 (in the first season) and Foro Italico (in the second season) and the expected glass, a studio with transparent walls.', 'Between infotainment and variety, a good morning with Fiorello and Biggio. At the center are the news, the events that happened and those that will happen, commented in an ironic and pungent style but always with lightness and good humor. A condensation of moments of variety, with a high rhythm: music, songs, ballets, duets, gags with guests and playmates, a cast in constant evolution that, day after day, will always see new protagonists. Unusual fifths of the show are via Asiago 10 (in the first season) and Foro Italico (in the second season) and the expected glass, a studio with transparent walls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ML57iBxRzHzmr30nSv4Uey7dcs.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:215556'),
  ('1077088030989255523', 'Long Live the Royals', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Sean Szeles', null, 'Kieran Culkin, Nikki Rapp, Horatio Sanz, Peter Serafinowicz, Nonso Anozie, Fred Armisen, Julian Barratt, Jermaine Fowler', 'TV-PG', 'Long Live the Royals follows a fictional British Royal Family—King Rufus and Queen Eleanor and their children Peter, Rosalind, Eddy, and Alex—as they honor the annual Yule Hare Festival. The family must battle having to rule their kingdom while maintaining a normal family at the same time. Meanwhile, the festival continues with the parties and feasts that comprise it.', 'Long Live the Royals follows a fictional British Royal Family—King Rufus and Queen Eleanor and their children Peter, Rosalind, Eddy, and Alex—as they honor the annual Yule Hare Festival. The family must battle having to rule their kingdom while maintaining a normal family at the same time. Meanwhile, the festival continues with the parties and feasts that comprise it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gLjBshxxruc6Q02Xu7wUwZgij7C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64046'),
  ('392194583059165056', 'Long Story Short', 2025, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Raphael Bob-Waksberg', null, 'Lisa Edelstein, Paul Reiser, Ben Feldman, Abbi Jacobson, Max Greenfield, Angelique Cabral, Nicole Byer', 'TV-14', 'From the creator of "BoJack Horseman" comes this animated comedy about a family over time, following siblings from childhood to adulthood and back again.', 'From the creator of "BoJack Horseman" comes this animated comedy about a family over time, following siblings from childhood to adulthood and back again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/22nh2kTuFpitrqTxxixhWjxEqFa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:262375'),
  ('78202160006394753', 'Long Time No See', 2017, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', null, null, 'Tak Woo-suk, Yeon Seung-ho, Kim Myeong-hwan, Ra Sun Young, Won Tae-san, Lee Gang han, Kim Seong-u, Gwon Gi-ha', 'TV-MA', 'Hitmen Flying Dagger and Wild Dog fall for each other while hiding deadly secrets. When truths surface, love puts them on the run from their own bosses.', 'Hitmen Flying Dagger and Wild Dog fall for each other while hiding deadly secrets. When truths surface, love puts them on the run from their own bosses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujMDauJ2rpoLCpC7198TEhzntHc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76376'),
  ('492004909832458599', 'Long Time No Sex', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lim Dae-hyung, Jeon Go-woon', 'Jeon Go-woon, Lim Dae-hyung', 'Esom, Ahn Jae-hong', null, 'Woo Jin and Samuel, a sexless married couple, are utterly fed up with their lives. To improve their circumstances, they choose to earn money by blackmailing unfaithful couples. As they track down these couples, they find financial stability and rediscover their own connection. They start working on their own issues, but the more they delve into it, the hidden truth resurfaces, complicating their journey. What is the truth that they have been avoiding?', 'Woo Jin and Samuel, a sexless married couple, are utterly fed up with their lives. To improve their circumstances, they choose to earn money by blackmailing unfaithful couples. As they track down these couples, they find financial stability and rediscover their own connection. They start working on their own issues, but the more they delve into it, the hidden truth resurfaces, complicating their journey. What is the truth that they have been avoiding?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/acdGDhG75m37cbQrZrYHLAn8w9Z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222767'),
  ('611326217692096473', 'Long Vacation', 1996, 'Drama', null, 'Eriko Kitagawa', 'Takuya Kimura, Tomoko Yamaguchi, Yutaka Takenouchi, Izumi Inamori, Takako Matsu, Ryo', null, 'Minami who is dumped by her ex-boyfriend, Asakura, on their wedding day. She later meets Sena, Asakura''s ex-roommate and a pianist, and lives with him as she has no other place to stay. What will happen to her during this long vacation?', 'Minami who is dumped by her ex-boyfriend, Asakura, on their wedding day. She later meets Sena, Asakura''s ex-roommate and a pianist, and lives with him as she has no other place to stay. What will happen to her during this long vacation?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PkSuliqZ1QnPU8jBh6puFjyvQ2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6100'),
  ('49652704446099967', 'Long Way Down', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Ewan McGregor, Charley Boorman, David Alexanian', null, 'Ewan McGregor, Charley Boorman, David Alexanian, Russ Malkin, Jimmy Simak', null, 'Three years after Long Way Round, Ewan McGregor and Charley Boorman set off on a 15,000-mile journey from the northernmost tip of Scotland to the southernmost tip of South Africa, mixing their love of motorcycles with the lure of far-flung roads.', 'Three years after Long Way Round, Ewan McGregor and Charley Boorman set off on a 15,000-mile journey from the northernmost tip of Scotland to the southernmost tip of South Africa, mixing their love of motorcycles with the lure of far-flung roads.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fC4rinvsE7uYEq9hAE84tn8xxmK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1240'),
  ('887008676021580684', 'Long Way Home', 2025, 'Documentary', 'David Alexanian, Charley Boorman, Russ Malkin', null, 'Ewan McGregor, Charley Boorman', 'TV-14', 'Best friends Ewan McGregor and Charley Boorman gear up for their fourth Long Way series—this time going from Ewan''s home in Scotland to Charley''s in England. They''ll take the scenic route, of course, through 17 European countries on cranky old bikes.', 'Best friends Ewan McGregor and Charley Boorman gear up for their fourth Long Way series—this time going from Ewan''s home in Scotland to Charley''s in England. They''ll take the scenic route, of course, through 17 European countries on cranky old bikes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1RwUnfSIChKVfsrS69ZMN51RhRA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:262594'),
  ('549071693669076815', 'Long Way Round', 2004, 'Documentary, Reality', 'Ewan McGregor, Charley Boorman, David Alexanian', null, 'Ewan McGregor, Charley Boorman', 'TV-MA', 'In 2004 Ewan McGregor and Charley Boorman embarked on an epic challenge to bike 20,000-miles across 12 countries and 19 time zones in just 115 days. Watch as two friends ride around the world together and, against all the odds, realize their dream.', 'In 2004 Ewan McGregor and Charley Boorman embarked on an epic challenge to bike 20,000-miles across 12 countries and 19 time zones in just 115 days. Watch as two friends ride around the world together and, against all the odds, realize their dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uoAYNsbmjQXk0vs72R6ITZzYaYx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2899'),
  ('436022036766669372', 'Long Way Up', 2020, 'Documentary', 'David Alexanian, Charley Boorman, Russ Malkin', null, 'Ewan McGregor, Charley Boorman, Russ Malkin, David Alexanian, Claudio von Planta', 'TV-14', 'The epic motorcycle adventure continues in this third chapter of the Long Way series, as Ewan McGregor and Charley Boorman journey to glorious landscapes across South and Central America—on the backs of prototype electric Harley-Davidsons.', 'The epic motorcycle adventure continues in this third chapter of the Long Way series, as Ewan McGregor and Charley Boorman journey to glorious landscapes across South and Central America—on the backs of prototype electric Harley-Davidsons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/54abZr85RxwJxutOfKMaFwZ7xfh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106871'),
  ('595843738531128440', 'Longmen Express', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Guo Jingfei, Anita Yuen Wing-Yee, Li Qian, Qian Fang, Liu Guanlin, Zhang Ruihan, Yang Haoyu, Fu Jiayuan', null, 'The series follows a group of workers at a delivery/security guard agency, where the workday consists of ego clashes, inappropriate behavior and action-packed comedy.', 'The series follows a group of workers at a delivery/security guard agency, where the workday consists of ego clashes, inappropriate behavior and action-packed comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hSCowwp4uqlfF9u6x9tydsNigrY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:57476'),
  ('600848185757261914', 'Longmire', 2012, 'Western, Crime, Drama', 'John Coveny, Hunt Baldwin', null, 'Robert Taylor, Katee Sackhoff, Lou Diamond Phillips, Cassidy Freeman, Adam Bartley', 'TV-14', 'A Wyoming sheriff rebuilds his life and career following the death of his wife. Based on the “Walt Longmire” series of mystery novels written by best-selling author Craig Johnson.', 'A Wyoming sheriff rebuilds his life and career following the death of his wife. Based on the “Walt Longmire” series of mystery novels written by best-selling author Craig Johnson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yrdt5lscyJ5j5GSbhl99x3SRN66.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:43901'),
  ('335516380256681737', 'Longstreet', 1971, 'Drama', 'Stirling Silliphant', null, 'James Franciscus, Peter Mark Richman, Ann Doran, Marlyn Mason', null, 'Longstreet is an American crime drama series that was broadcast on the ABC in the 1971-1972 season. A 90-minute pilot movie of the same name aired prior to the debut of the series as an ABC Movie of the Week.', 'Longstreet is an American crime drama series that was broadcast on the ABC in the 1971-1972 season. A 90-minute pilot movie of the same name aired prior to the debut of the series as an ABC Movie of the Week.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDVSEeVUtsZoDuUz3DXgTl6bCFJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3923'),
  ('521464332622434717', 'Look Around You', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Peter Serafinowicz, Robert Popper', 'Peter Serafinowicz, Robert Popper', 'Peter Serafinowicz, Robert Popper, Olivia Colman, Josie D''Arby', null, 'LOOK AROUND YOU. Look around you. Just look around you. What do you see? A tree. A weather-vane. A discarded lollipop-wrapper. A traffic shop. All of these things, and any other things you may care to mention, have one thing in common. Can you work out what it is?', 'LOOK AROUND YOU. Look around you. Just look around you. What do you see? A tree. A weather-vane. A discarded lollipop-wrapper. A traffic shop. All of these things, and any other things you may care to mention, have one thing in common. Can you work out what it is?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQ8AYbYF8VmVaDZMu924SjbTgPe.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2494'),
  ('850765631735049651', 'Look at Life', 1959, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'Look at Life was a regular British series of short documentary films of which 507 were produced between 1959 and 1969 by the Special Features Division of the Rank Organisation for screening in their Odeon and Gaumont cinemas. The films always preceded the main feature film that was being shown in the cinema that week. It replaced the circuit''s newsreel, Universal News, which had become increasingly irrelevant in the face of more immediate news media, particularly on television with the launch of ITN on the Independent Television service, which began broadcasting in parts of the United Kingdom in 1955.', 'Look at Life was a regular British series of short documentary films of which 507 were produced between 1959 and 1969 by the Special Features Division of the Rank Organisation for screening in their Odeon and Gaumont cinemas. The films always preceded the main feature film that was being shown in the cinema that week. It replaced the circuit''s newsreel, Universal News, which had become increasingly irrelevant in the face of more immediate news media, particularly on television with the launch of ITN on the Independent Television service, which began broadcasting in parts of the United Kingdom in 1955.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/acDReySoAUDU3ou5XQlgCD4Lac9.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:135875'),
  ('891079244675559400', 'Look: The Series', 2010, 'Drama', 'Adam Rifkin', null, 'Ali Cobrin, Matt Bushell, Colton Haynes, Sharon Hinnendael, Lee Reherman, Trevor Torseth, Brendan Kelly', null, 'Shot entirely from the point of view of the security cameras. Following several interweaving, storylines over the course of a random week in a random city.', 'Shot entirely from the point of view of the security cameras. Following several interweaving, storylines over the course of a random week in a random city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/QrVB9kMvHIGzhTCST2ihc80fYr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34234'),
  ('129966075892645406', 'Looking', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Lannan', null, 'Jonathan Groff, Frankie J. Alvarez, Murray Bartlett, Russell Tovey, Lauren Weedman, Raúl Castillo', 'TV-MA', 'Three friends in San Francisco who explore the fun and sometimes overwhelming options available to a new generation of gay men.', 'Three friends in San Francisco who explore the fun and sometimes overwhelming options available to a new generation of gay men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cMIRpZUOXwZcDoGyRJnwrrZQYzW.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:57774'),
  ('568948200803909860', 'Looking Back in Anger', 1989, 'Drama', 'Wai Ka-Fai', null, 'Felix Wong Yat-Wah, Deric Wan, Carina Lau, Kathy Chow Hoi-Mei, Maggie Shiu, Kwan Hoi-San, Gallen Lo Ka-Leung, Kiki Sheung', null, 'Looking Back in Anger was a 1989 Hong Kong TV series and one of the most watched TVB series by Chinese people in Hong Kong and around the world. Many factors contributed to the success of this series. As well as its tragic but memorable storyline, this series featured a strong cast, with Felix Wong, Deric Wan, Carina Lau, Kathy Chow Hoi-Mei and Maggie Shiu. The popular theme song of the series "Yat sang ho kau" was sung by Danny Chan and later by Deric Wan himself.', 'Looking Back in Anger was a 1989 Hong Kong TV series and one of the most watched TVB series by Chinese people in Hong Kong and around the world. Many factors contributed to the success of this series. As well as its tragic but memorable storyline, this series featured a strong cast, with Felix Wong, Deric Wan, Carina Lau, Kathy Chow Hoi-Mei and Maggie Shiu. The popular theme song of the series "Yat sang ho kau" was sung by Danny Chan and later by Deric Wan himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mw5zQotcRdI7gisDKibPt93Ec37.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15860'),
  ('354181338901876379', 'Looking for Alaska', 2019, 'Drama', 'Josh Schwartz, Kendall Rogers', null, 'Charlie Plummer, Kristine Froseth, Denny Love, Jay Lee, Sofia Vassilieva, Ron Cephas Jones, Timothy Simons, Uriah Shelton', 'TV-MA', 'Miles enrolls in a new boarding school seeking adventure. There, he befriends a group of quirky students led by the captivating and troubled Alaska. As they pull pranks and explore dark secrets, a night of celebration takes a tragic turn, forcing the group to grapple with loss and the complexities of growing up.', 'Miles enrolls in a new boarding school seeking adventure. There, he befriends a group of quirky students led by the captivating and troubled Alaska. As they pull pranks and explore dark secrets, a night of celebration takes a tragic turn, forcing the group to grapple with loss and the complexities of growing up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Sf2xUDLU0gyJfwDvmXhIqIzgrj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88640'),
  ('854913186580076886', 'Lookism', 2019, 'Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Lomon, Dada Zhang, Wang Zixuan, Wang Mohan, Dino Lee, Eason Hung Chun-Ga', null, 'Tells the story of the school’s ugliest boy, Wen Shuai, who finally gets the courage to transfer after being bullied in his original school, discovers that he has two very different bodies. One is the original ugly body and the other is of a perfect male. Wen Shuai found out that he can switch between the two bodies. One body will appear when he''s awake, and the other body will appear when he''s sleeping. The secret of the two bodies completely changes Wen Shuai’s life He has never been welcomed, started a completely different life, and felt the beauty and convenience of the being popular. At the same time, this handsome body hides a huge secret that gradually emerges as the story progresses. The original owner of the handsome body, Kris, soon wakes up, and the layers of mystery gradually unravel.', 'Tells the story of the school’s ugliest boy, Wen Shuai, who finally gets the courage to transfer after being bullied in his original school, discovers that he has two very different bodies. One is the original ugly body and the other is of a perfect male. Wen Shuai found out that he can switch between the two bodies. One body will appear when he''s awake, and the other body will appear when he''s sleeping. The secret of the two bodies completely changes Wen Shuai’s life He has never been welcomed, started a completely different life, and felt the beauty and convenience of the being popular. At the same time, this handsome body hides a huge secret that gradually emerges as the story progresses. The original owner of the handsome body, Kris, soon wakes up, and the layers of mystery gradually unravel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRr79QmmJfWfuOMASL57cy5rJGD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95459'),
  ('95833228365315704', 'Lookism', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Animation', null, null, 'Shim Kyu-hyuck, Han Shin, Ryu Seung-gone, Jeong Jae-heon, Nam Doh-hyeong, Hwang Chang-yung, Sa Moon-young, Lee Kyung Tae', 'TV-MA', 'In a society that favors good looks, a high school outcast leads a double life switching between his two bodies that are polar opposites in appearance.', 'In a society that favors good looks, a high school outcast leads a double life switching between his two bodies that are polar opposites in appearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qkoM63HDuCOSwxGfb0pljrgns9I.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210942'),
  ('327987646657341823', 'Lookout', 2017, 'Action & Adventure', 'Son Hyung-Suk', null, 'Kim Young-kwang, Lee Si-young, Kim Tae-hun, Kim Seul-gi, Key, Choi Moo-seong, Kim Sang-ho, Seo Jae-hyung', null, 'People lose loved ones in crimes and the criminals are not punished. The daily lives of these people are completely broken. They form a group to realize justice.', 'People lose loved ones in crimes and the criminals are not punished. The daily lives of these people are completely broken. They form a group to realize justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYV0bkbRZIDM4WrZ4RwFtNEX530.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71746'),
  ('574738487928948629', 'Looks & Essence', 2011, 'Soap, Drama, Comedy', 'Aguinaldo Silva', 'Rodrigo Ribeiro, Aguinaldo Silva, Maria Elisa Berredo', 'Lília Cabral, Christiane Torloni, Dalton Vigh, Marcelo Serrado, José Mayer, Carolina Dieckmmann, Malvino Salvador, Caio Castro', null, 'Griselda is a tough, hard-working handywoman who managed to raise her three children on her own. She struggles to make ends meet but after winning the lottery tensions rise as people inevitably show their true value. With plenty of romance and intrigue this incredibly rich and fun telenovela brings together the true values of friendship, love, and family.', 'Griselda is a tough, hard-working handywoman who managed to raise her three children on her own. She struggles to make ends meet but after winning the lottery tensions rise as people inevitably show their true value. With plenty of romance and intrigue this incredibly rich and fun telenovela brings together the true values of friendship, love, and family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fPgb6EYQTTTLDPJs6netcoTnmEd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40858');
