  ('255879676599484038', 'Love Actually', 2021, 'Reality', null, null, 'Tang Yixin, Xie Nan, Chunye Zhang, Xu Yiyang, Yan An', null, 'This is a show that focuses on the brave and straightforward love of ordinary adults from late 20s to mid-40s. It concerns relationships, marriage, and a multitude of social interactions. The show will invite 12 men and women to stay under the same roof for 30 days. Some may become couples in the end while others might part ways. In the TV studio, the celebrities and the ordinary people will gather together to follow the series and share their opinions and experience about love.', 'This is a show that focuses on the brave and straightforward love of ordinary adults from late 20s to mid-40s. It concerns relationships, marriage, and a multitude of social interactions. The show will invite 12 men and women to stay under the same roof for 30 days. Some may become couples in the end while others might part ways. In the TV studio, the celebrities and the ordinary people will gather together to follow the series and share their opinions and experience about love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ghkFZxjGlst1TVjG6agyzc04r2H.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:154420'),
  ('995488802052930026', 'Love Affair In The Afternoon', 2019, 'Drama', null, null, 'Lee Sang-yeob, Park Ha-seon, Ye Ji-won, Cho Dong-hyuk, Jung Sang-hoon, Choi Byung-mo, Ryu Abel, Yoo Seo-jin', null, 'Son Ji Eun moves to a small city due to her husband''s new job as a civil servant. She works part-time at a mart. Son Ji Eun is quiet and sincere. Her life in the small city becomes boring. Son Ji Eun''s life is shaken by Yoon Jung Woo. Yoon Jung Woo is a biology teacher at a local school.', 'Son Ji Eun moves to a small city due to her husband''s new job as a civil servant. She works part-time at a mart. Son Ji Eun is quiet and sincere. Her life in the small city becomes boring. Son Ji Eun''s life is shaken by Yoon Jung Woo. Yoon Jung Woo is a biology teacher at a local school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9EIv7V8qPZPJ1j8skceO4RZgDg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90736'),
