  ('450604565493705423', 'Love After Lockup', 2018, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Couples finally meet their fiancé upon prison release. Once the bars are gone, will their love survive after lockup on the rocky road to the altar? Will the inmates ditch their mate as they face shocking "firsts", fights & family drama! Is it true love or just a con?', 'Couples finally meet their fiancé upon prison release. Once the bars are gone, will their love survive after lockup on the rocky road to the altar? Will the inmates ditch their mate as they face shocking "firsts", fights & family drama! Is it true love or just a con?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3OgnW4ov16XueR5FxVzaFy7d4U.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:76300'),
  ('393970941954938552', 'Love After Music', 2023, 'Drama', 'Juan Matias Carballo', null, 'Iván Hochman, Micaela Riera, Gaspar Offenhenden', null, 'No one can and should live without love. This biographical series chronicles the life and career of passionate, iconic Argentine rock star Fito Páez.', 'No one can and should live without love. This biographical series chronicles the life and career of passionate, iconic Argentine rock star Fito Páez.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwmPfyzvYvLaGK6KrA4omhrpYuU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223666'),
  ('479244945572904589', 'Love After World Domination', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yusuke Kobayashi, Ikumi Hasegawa, Fumihiko Tachiki, Kazuyuki Okitsu, Nene Hieda, Junji Majima, Rina Hidaka, Kana Hanazawa', 'TV-14', 'It’s love at first sight for Fudo and Desumi, except it was during a battle of life and death. Fudo, leader of the hero squad Gelato 5, and Desumi, the Death Queen of the evil society Gekko, have found themselves caught in a forbidden love—and it’s their first relationship! Moving in secrecy, they live holding hands with one weapon in the other, finding out what’s truly fair in love and war.', 'It’s love at first sight for Fudo and Desumi, except it was during a battle of life and death. Fudo, leader of the hero squad Gelato 5, and Desumi, the Death Queen of the evil society Gekko, have found themselves caught in a forbidden love—and it’s their first relationship! Moving in secrecy, they live holding hands with one weapon in the other, finding out what’s truly fair in love and war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHX5AFNNNNvkiZlxqS8WftUZOAH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:122287'),
  ('527733330341760094', 'Love Alarm', 2019, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Yu Bo-ra', 'Cha Yeon-su, Kim Seo-hee', 'Kim So-hyun, Jung Ga-ram, Song Kang, Go Min-si, Lee Jae-eung, Park Ji-hoon, Kim Si-eun, Ki Do-hun', null, 'Love Alarm is an app that tells you if someone within a 10-meter radius has a crush on you. It quickly becomes a social phenomenon. While everyone talks about it and uses it to test their love and popularity, Jojo is one of the few people who have yet to download the app. However, she soon faces a love triangle situation between Sun-oh whom she starts to have feelings for, and Hye-young, who has had a huge crush on her.', 'Love Alarm is an app that tells you if someone within a 10-meter radius has a crush on you. It quickly becomes a social phenomenon. While everyone talks about it and uses it to test their love and popularity, Jojo is one of the few people who have yet to download the app. However, she soon faces a love triangle situation between Sun-oh whom she starts to have feelings for, and Hye-young, who has had a huge crush on her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQ8Hobo1RpYuZVQJQOCycNMHAG.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:89641'),
  ('322653361118778003', 'Love Alert', 2018, 'Comedy', null, '김신혜', 'Chun Jung-myung, Yoon Eun-hye, Han Go-eun, Joo Woo-jae, Pyo Ji-hoon, Lee Hye-Ran, Kim Ye-ryeong, Choi Cheol-ho', null, 'Cha Woo-Hyun is a dermatologist. He is an attractive man who is popular with women. He meets Yoon Yoo-Jung who is a popular actress. They get involved in scandal and decide to make a contract. Their contract sets out that they act like they are in love.', 'Cha Woo-Hyun is a dermatologist. He is an attractive man who is popular with women. He meets Yoon Yoo-Jung who is a popular actress. They get involved in scandal and decide to make a contract. Their contract sets out that they act like they are in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5sT6SqS33tMzYjWwdzGGaDMIngT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83440'),
  ('190195611985687022', 'Love All Play', 2022, 'Drama', 'Heo Sung-hye', 'Heo Sung-hye', 'Park Ju-hyun, Chae Jong-hyeop, Park Ji-hyun, Kim Moo-joon, Seo Ji-hye, Cho Han-cheul, In Gyo-jin, Lee Seo-hwan', null, 'The hottest sports romance between Park Tae-yang, a passionate professional badminton player, and Park Tae-joon, who treats playing badminton as a job!', 'The hottest sports romance between Park Tae-yang, a passionate professional badminton player, and Park Tae-joon, who treats playing badminton as a job!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjLO7N8N9nudOCMwEGzGYEUHMYk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:152512'),
  ('462079236780968002', 'Love and Cruelty', 2006, 'Drama', 'Liliana Abud, Marissa Garrido', null, 'Gaby Espino, César Évora Díaz, Ernesto Laguardia, Laura Flores, Carmen Salinas, Azela Robinson, Edith González, Sara Maldonado', null, 'Mundo de Fieras is a Mexican telenovela produced by Salvador Mejia Alejandre. It was first broadcast in Mexico on July 31, 2006, and in the United States on October 3, 2006. The telenovela starred Gaby Espino, César Évora, and Edith González as the villain Jocelyn.', 'Mundo de Fieras is a Mexican telenovela produced by Salvador Mejia Alejandre. It was first broadcast in Mexico on July 31, 2006, and in the United States on October 3, 2006. The telenovela starred Gaby Espino, César Évora, and Edith González as the villain Jocelyn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fmGRIOhp97KQ4CRRXTUk3AdLUCQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6579'),
  ('704051633054467788', 'Love and Destiny', 2019, 'Drama', 'Lam Yuk Fan', null, 'Chang Chen, Ni Ni, Li Dongxue, Zhang Zhixi, Li Jiaming, Hai Ling, Liu Qianhan, Zhang Haiyu', null, 'A love story between the God of War and a young maiden whose very existence can bring harm to the world.', 'A love story between the God of War and a young maiden whose very existence can bring harm to the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uv2ol889LlaAuTy3md8ThLEy6Nq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90819'),
  ('114956485609786616', 'Love and Fortune', 2018, 'Drama', null, null, 'Eri Tokunaga, Enon Kawatani, Aina Yamada, Kitaro, Sairi Ito, Yuka Ogura, Yui Imaizumi, Noriko Eguchi', null, 'Wako Taira is 31 years old. She works part-time at a cinema close to her home. Her boyfriend is Fu-kun and they have lived together for three years. She has never thought of breaking up with her boyfriend, considering her age. One day, she meets high school student Yumeaki Iko. She can''t resist him. Wako Taira has an affair with Yumeaki Iko.', 'Wako Taira is 31 years old. She works part-time at a cinema close to her home. Her boyfriend is Fu-kun and they have lived together for three years. She has never thought of breaking up with her boyfriend, considering her age. One day, she meets high school student Yumeaki Iko. She can''t resist him. Wako Taira has an affair with Yumeaki Iko.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ffqtlausDiM3AXDpu3RdpNmaew1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87548'),
  ('198978330447872648', 'Love and Lies', 2017, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Kana Hanazawa, Yui Makino, Ryota Osaka, Shinnosuke Tachibana', 'TV-14', 'In a futuristic society, Japan has implemented a complex system referred to as "The Red Threads of Science" to encourage successful marriages and combat increasingly low birthrates. Based on a compatibility calculation, young people at the age of 16 are assigned marriage partners by the government, with severe repercussions awaiting those who disobey the arrangement. For Yukari Nejima, a teen that considers himself average in every way, this system might be his best shot at living a fulfilling life. However, spurred by his infatuation for his classmate and long-time crush, Misaki Takasaki, Yukari defies the system and confesses his love. After some initial reluctance, Misaki reciprocates his feelings in a moment of passion. Unfortunately, before the two can further their relationship, Yukari receives his marriage notice. He is then thrown into a confusing web of love and lies when his less-than-thrilled assigned partner, Ririna Sanada, becomes fascinated with his illicit romance.', 'In a futuristic society, Japan has implemented a complex system referred to as "The Red Threads of Science" to encourage successful marriages and combat increasingly low birthrates. Based on a compatibility calculation, young people at the age of 16 are assigned marriage partners by the government, with severe repercussions awaiting those who disobey the arrangement. For Yukari Nejima, a teen that considers himself average in every way, this system might be his best shot at living a fulfilling life. However, spurred by his infatuation for his classmate and long-time crush, Misaki Takasaki, Yukari defies the system and confesses his love. After some initial reluctance, Misaki reciprocates his feelings in a moment of passion. Unfortunately, before the two can further their relationship, Yukari receives his marriage notice. He is then thrown into a confusing web of love and lies when his less-than-thrilled assigned partner, Ririna Sanada, becomes fascinated with his illicit romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejqfETzpBBnR89btARDKrLsv8dp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72026'),
  ('1083396732230976178', 'Love and Punishment', 2010, 'Drama', 'Ayfer Tunç', 'Ayfer Tunç', 'Nurgül Yeşilçay, Murat Yildirim, Feride Çetin, Tomris İncer, Caner Kurtaran, Zeynep Beşerler, Erkan Bektaş, Emir Bozkurt', 'NR', 'Aşk ve Ceza is a Turkish television drama series that aired in 2010-2011. Nunu Yeşilçay, Murat Yildirim and Feride Çetin starring, the series were shot in Van, Bodrum and Istanbul. In 2011, this series were broadcast also in Croatia in Nova TV. In Serbia, this series is airing from January 8, 2013 in 1PRVA. In Georgia TV Maestro started broadcasting this series on 15 April 2013.', 'Aşk ve Ceza is a Turkish television drama series that aired in 2010-2011. Nunu Yeşilçay, Murat Yildirim and Feride Çetin starring, the series were shot in Van, Bodrum and Istanbul. In 2011, this series were broadcast also in Croatia in Nova TV. In Serbia, this series is airing from January 8, 2013 in 1PRVA. In Georgia TV Maestro started broadcasting this series on 15 April 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9bGPgAlTFdnXqahcm9NSTcKkuNg.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:49482'),
  ('136401313190095971', 'Love and Redemption', 2020, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Liu Fang', 'Cheng Yi, Yuan Bingyan, Liu Xueyi, Zhang Yuxi, Han Chengyu, Li Junyi, Bai Shu, Hou Mengyao', null, 'Legend has it that the god of battle saved heaven a 1000 years in the past in a deadly battle against the demon. Both fell from heaven and disappeared from the world. Chu Xuanji was born in the world without the six senses, making her quite clueless and inept. The Zanhua tournament is held within the Shaoyang sect, and leader Chu Lei has two daughters - his relied on eldest daughter Chu Linglong and youngest daughter Chu Xuanji, who is lazy and horrible in martial arts. When Yu Sifeng and Chu Xuanji happen to meet, they befriend each other. Yu Sifeng falls for Xuanji despite the harsh consequences he has to face, as students at Lize Palace are prohibited from falling in love. Four years later, Xuanji and Yu Sifeng meet again. Sifeng wears a mask because of a curse that can only be broken if he finds true love.', 'Legend has it that the god of battle saved heaven a 1000 years in the past in a deadly battle against the demon. Both fell from heaven and disappeared from the world. Chu Xuanji was born in the world without the six senses, making her quite clueless and inept. The Zanhua tournament is held within the Shaoyang sect, and leader Chu Lei has two daughters - his relied on eldest daughter Chu Linglong and youngest daughter Chu Xuanji, who is lazy and horrible in martial arts. When Yu Sifeng and Chu Xuanji happen to meet, they befriend each other. Yu Sifeng falls for Xuanji despite the harsh consequences he has to face, as students at Lize Palace are prohibited from falling in love. Four years later, Xuanji and Yu Sifeng meet again. Sifeng wears a mask because of a curse that can only be broken if he finds true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mIzTVwWhkFQ52OtELrxewtJwdz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96128'),
  ('516490888666453082', 'Love and Sword', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Shen Cangmei', null, 'Gao Weiguang, Xuan Lu, Ren Hao, Ganana, Yuan Yuxuan, Zhang Haocheng', null, 'Fang Yi, an ordinary city dweller, accidentally falls into a martial arts world, expecting adventure and heroism. Instead, she encounters Rong Shuang, a once-great swordsman now struggling with lost skills. Rescued by the ruthless bounty hunter Yan Shao, she is taken to the enigmatic Yuchi Manor, where she discovers a world filled with intrigue and hidden emotions.', 'Fang Yi, an ordinary city dweller, accidentally falls into a martial arts world, expecting adventure and heroism. Instead, she encounters Rong Shuang, a once-great swordsman now struggling with lost skills. Rescued by the ruthless bounty hunter Yan Shao, she is taken to the enigmatic Yuchi Manor, where she discovers a world filled with intrigue and hidden emotions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kF8HNiregCw8eeo3uW70SyxwzoD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233860'),
  ('84008858090735722', 'Love at First Night', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Arita', null, 'Prin Suparat, Urassaya Sperbund, Kummun Klomkaew, Pitchapa Phanthumchinda, Willie McIntosh, Phiravich Attachitsataporn, Maneerat Kam-Uan, Supachai Suwanon', null, 'Mueang, an outspoken eco-warrior geologist, and Apo, a distressed architect, share a passionate night. Later, Mueang learns she’s his father’s fiancée, leading to one big “it’s complicated” romance.', 'Mueang, an outspoken eco-warrior geologist, and Apo, a distressed architect, share a passionate night. Later, Mueang learns she’s his father’s fiancée, leading to one big “it’s complicated” romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1edguvE5NsNHkQrEQGZNtFXDqsx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:248821'),
  ('511821335072605767', 'Love Begins in the World of If', 2025, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Yuki Umino', null, 'Kotaro Daigo, Daisuke Nakagawa, Yuki Hayama, Sojiro Yoshimura, Mamoru Hagiwara, Kazunari Tosa, Motoki Kobayashi', null, 'After wishing to change his life, a quiet worker awakens in a parallel world where he’s confident—and loved by the colleague he admires.', 'After wishing to change his life, a quiet worker awakens in a parallel world where he’s confident—and loved by the colleague he admires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ha24j6SIdbIFrcbXV31Gjhz0f5b.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:304256'),
  ('553565990222459016', 'Love Better Than Immortality', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Shu Ke', 'Zhao Xuan', 'Zhao Lusi, Li Hongyi, June Wu, Jiang Yuan, Liu Yitong, Sheng Huizi, Li Xingchen', null, 'A woman from the future arrives at a fantasy-like universe to experience love for the first time. She goes by the name Chun Hua and falls into a complicated romance with two young men who are opposites like black and white.', 'A woman from the future arrives at a fantasy-like universe to experience love for the first time. She goes by the name Chun Hua and falls into a complicated romance with two young men who are opposites like black and white.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/enj2s0CNvp2oaf84j87H8Vsdbr0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91593'),
  ('416987965848687459', 'Love Between Fairy and Devil', 2022, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jiu Lu Fei Xiang', 'Bai Jinjin', 'Yu Shuxin, Dylan Wang, Joe Xu, Guo Xiaoting, Zhang Linghe, Charles Lin, Zhang Chenxiao, Zhao Bin', 'TV-PG', 'When a low-ranked fairy accidentally resurrects a powerful demon, their fates become cosmically entangled as the world is thrown into turmoil.', 'When a low-ranked fairy accidentally resurrects a powerful demon, their fates become cosmically entangled as the world is thrown into turmoil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9iigsYwHsBlU1As6ChDHHTJmVKd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130368'),
  ('316709065915872894', 'Love Between Lines', 2026, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Zu Le', null, 'Chen Xingxu, Lu Yuxiao', null, 'Xiao Zhiyu and Hu Xiu are brought together by a Republic of China-themed murder mystery game. In the scripted NPC game filled with falling snow and spies in the shadows, the two ignite a fateful spark. An unexpected reunion in the real world reveals the mystery of each other''s identities. The two shuttle between the misaligned time-spaces of reality and the script, and finally achieve two-way growth in the cross-dimensional bond, completing the transformation of love and self.', 'Xiao Zhiyu and Hu Xiu are brought together by a Republic of China-themed murder mystery game. In the scripted NPC game filled with falling snow and spies in the shadows, the two ignite a fateful spark. An unexpected reunion in the real world reveals the mystery of each other''s identities. The two shuttle between the misaligned time-spaces of reality and the script, and finally achieve two-way growth in the cross-dimensional bond, completing the transformation of love and self.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xda6V8R2DKoRKWmnofeJFHII3ia.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:279136'),
  ('1133905436818266802', 'Love Beyond the Grave', 2026, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Dilraba Dilmurat, Arthur Chen, Miles Wei, Zhang Li, Gao Han, Yang Xizi', null, 'The exceptionally gifted Ghost King, He Simu, unexpectedly encounters the young general, Duan Xu, while out on a break, searching for food. This young general, who carries an item belonging to someone from He Simu''s past, seems not to be the real Duan Xu. As they test each other through subtle exchanges, He Simu gradually uncovers the dark past and aspirations hidden within Duan Xu’s heart. In turn, Duan Xu discovers the steadfastness and loneliness that He Simu has endured. Despite the fleeting lifespan of a mortal, no more than a hundred years, and the four-hundred-year-old ghost who still retains the appearance of a young girl, they resist the relentless passage of time through their love.', 'The exceptionally gifted Ghost King, He Simu, unexpectedly encounters the young general, Duan Xu, while out on a break, searching for food. This young general, who carries an item belonging to someone from He Simu''s past, seems not to be the real Duan Xu. As they test each other through subtle exchanges, He Simu gradually uncovers the dark past and aspirations hidden within Duan Xu’s heart. In turn, Duan Xu discovers the steadfastness and loneliness that He Simu has endured. Despite the fleeting lifespan of a mortal, no more than a hundred years, and the four-hundred-year-old ghost who still retains the appearance of a young girl, they resist the relentless passage of time through their love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wI89MinPHLm3v2d3gB3J9DwpdDu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:258865'),
  ('234489621073736436', 'Love Bites', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Cindy Chupack', null, 'Becki Newton, Constance Zimmer, Greg Grunberg', 'TV-14', 'This romantic-comedy anthology series features three loosely connected, modern stories of love and dating. The series is anchored by the stories of Annie and Colleen, the last two single women remaining after all of their friends get married. Other romantically challenged characters come and go each week.', 'This romantic-comedy anthology series features three loosely connected, modern stories of love and dating. The series is anchored by the stories of Annie and Colleen, the last two single women remaining after all of their friends get married. Other romantically challenged characters come and go each week.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/HFIutOGJgr5LtUn89ltq3iZbTi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32719'),
  ('483157577039338907', 'Love Bugs', 2004, 'Comedy', null, 'Manuela D''Angelo, Massimo Martelli, Maurizio Sangalli', 'Emilio Solfrizzi, Giorgia Surina', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ug2RTZtpcgiQinA8cJblMPWeH3h.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:23337'),
  ('1063550701787362195', 'Love Bully', 2024, 'Drama', null, 'Siwarat Harnpanich', 'Engfa Waraha, Charlotte Austin, Sirinart Sugandharat, Meenay Jutai, Thanapat Phiukham', null, 'In the era of social media, everyone can freely express their opinions about others. They can use harsh words without much consideration, not thinking about the consequences or verifying the truth. In a relationship between two women, one becomes overly concerned with the opinions of others, making her vulnerable to someone she doesn''t know who ends up hurting her. The second woman has never cared much, firmly believing in the adage "to each their own." However, at times, she can be remarkably oblivious to the feelings of those around her. With their love in the spotlight, eyes across the nation scrutinise their every move, passing judgement on ever action.', 'In the era of social media, everyone can freely express their opinions about others. They can use harsh words without much consideration, not thinking about the consequences or verifying the truth. In a relationship between two women, one becomes overly concerned with the opinions of others, making her vulnerable to someone she doesn''t know who ends up hurting her. The second woman has never cared much, firmly believing in the adage "to each their own." However, at times, she can be remarkably oblivious to the feelings of those around her. With their love in the spotlight, eyes across the nation scrutinise their every move, passing judgement on ever action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LT9mPPYuZt97ZsHHFTiwqAlTYZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:255825'),
  ('28135120880214445', 'Love By Chance', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'MAME', null, 'Rathavit Kijworalak, Phiravich Attachitsataporn, Tanapon Sukumpantanasan, Napat Na Ranong, Siwat Jumlongkul, Kirati Puangmalee, Katsamonnat Namwirote, Samantha Melanie Coates', 'TV-14', 'Bullied for being gay, Pete finds unexpected comfort in Ae—but loving someone who can’t love him back is its own quiet pain.', 'Bullied for being gay, Pete finds unexpected comfort in Ae—but loving someone who can’t love him back is its own quiet pain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l0XfcjaQJTzdTQMP8SGWl66vxYB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:81318'),
  ('520840873811350635', 'Love Cells', 2014, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Park Sun-ho, Kim Yoo-jung, Nam Ji-hyun, Baek Sung-hyun, Oh Kwang-rok, Im Seul-ong, Cho Bo-ah, Jang Hyuk', null, 'A fantasy, romantic comedy about a ′love cell′ cat that looks like a human, Navi teaching love to Ma Dae Choong, who is determined to revive his dying love cells with an extraordinary romance, particularly with top star, Seo Rin.', 'A fantasy, romantic comedy about a ′love cell′ cat that looks like a human, Navi teaching love to Ma Dae Choong, who is determined to revive his dying love cells with an extraordinary romance, particularly with top star, Seo Rin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l0aVsdLR3wsD9sZMhjsMpq4D6R1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:63785'),
  ('361882179063102976', 'Love Child', 2014, 'Drama', 'Sarah Lambert', null, 'Jessica Marais, Mandy McElhinney, Darcie Irwin-Simpson, Miranda Tapsell, Andrew Ryan', null, 'The lives of staff at the fictional Kings Cross Hospital and the wild streets of Darlinghurst in the 1960s. Joan Miller is a smart and sophisticated midwife who returns home from London to take a job at the Kings Cross Hospital. Dr Patrick McNaughton is a charismatic head of obstetrics at Kings Cross Hospital. Frances Bolton is the tough matron who also controls the running of Stanton House, a home for unwed pregnant young women.', 'The lives of staff at the fictional Kings Cross Hospital and the wild streets of Darlinghurst in the 1960s. Joan Miller is a smart and sophisticated midwife who returns home from London to take a job at the Kings Cross Hospital. Dr Patrick McNaughton is a charismatic head of obstetrics at Kings Cross Hospital. Frances Bolton is the tough matron who also controls the running of Stanton House, a home for unwed pregnant young women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zPpFBAGrPhixkJEm8OszY396xOE.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:54864'),
  ('925240807187554877', 'Love Class', 2022, 'Drama', 'Kim Kyung-hwan, Jang Young Seon', 'Jang Young Seon, Kim Kyung-hwan', 'Jeon Min-wook, Lee Gwang-hee, Ahn Jeong-gyun, Kim Yong-seok, Woo Hyo-won, Jung Woo-jae', 'TV-PG', 'In a college class where students are paired up and sent on dates, a sophomore is partnered with an upperclassman whose gentle kindness steals his heart.', 'In a college class where students are paired up and sent on dates, a sophomore is partnered with an upperclassman whose gentle kindness steals his heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yoUP5L763UM7iM7CHTzXAuQNXHh.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:201859'),
  ('667888204882154028', 'Love Crossed', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Wu Zhong Quan, Li Tian', 'He Luoluo, Dai Luwa, Zhang Linghe, Fan Shuaiqi, Chang Bin, Huang Zien, Li Baihui, Yan An', null, 'A series of romantic encounters between two heroines and four "virtual" idols. It''s a call to return to reality, cherish life and reap a beautiful love. Lu Xiao is warm as spring in the virtual world but sensitive and lonely in real life. Jiang Kele may lead a difficult life, but she still dreams of meeting the perfect prince.', 'A series of romantic encounters between two heroines and four "virtual" idols. It''s a call to return to reality, cherish life and reap a beautiful love. Lu Xiao is warm as spring in the virtual world but sensitive and lonely in real life. Jiang Kele may lead a difficult life, but she still dreams of meeting the perfect prince.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oz49Vra3sIvpTWRFI1cDuTBAg0L.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:125305'),
  ('986378483293872648', 'Love Daily', 2018, 'Drama', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Romantic anthology web series revolving around 12 stories of 12 months of young people on their paths to love.', 'Romantic anthology web series revolving around 12 stories of 12 months of young people on their paths to love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/klKEx4WJMIjmKMEfgh7xEV3l4rt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89377'),
  ('549278699185251979', 'Love Design', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Supassara Thanachart, Methika Jiranorraphat, Matira Tantiprasut, Paramee Luengnaruemitchai, Torfan Taweema, Nalinthip Phoemphattharasakun, Ratchapong Anomakiti, Elisha Triwiwatkul', null, 'Two former lovers turned rival architects clash professionally after a betrayal involving stolen work. Their competitive relationship grows more complex when a new romantic interest emerges.', 'Two former lovers turned rival architects clash professionally after a betrayal involving stolen work. Their competitive relationship grows more complex when a new romantic interest emerges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/reK7lUsIFp9hqVem94rUR5lAGi7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:287376'),
  ('6140451626220875', 'Love Designer', 2020, 'Drama', null, 'Ranning LI', 'Dilraba Dilmurat, Johnny Huang, Viann Zhang Xinyu, Yi Daqian, Hu Bing, Zhou Yidan, Wang Ruixin, Wang Jiaqi', 'TV-14', 'A fashion designer and an e-commerce executive are brought together by a lawsuit and forced to collaborate. Despite their differences, they gradually fall in love while pursuing personal growth and success in their careers.', 'A fashion designer and an e-commerce executive are brought together by a lawsuit and forced to collaborate. Despite their differences, they gradually fall in love while pursuing personal growth and success in their careers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLQFN0rwwmVCWDi8NAfshEiOnNX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:103741'),
  ('115736659112635668', 'Love Destiny', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Thanawat Wattanaputi, Ranee Campen, Prama Imanothai, Kannarun Wongkhajornkai, Louis Scott, ตฤณณภพ ทองฉาย, Susira Angelina Naenna, Jirayu Thantrakul', null, 'In the past, the cruel and selfish Karakade was betrothed to Date, a man who despises her wickedness and prefers a kinder woman. In a fit of jealousy, Karakade tries to kill her rival, but a servant dies instead. While Karakade is suspected, her murderous intentions can’t be confirmed. So Date and his dad perform a sacred ritual to punish the killer. At this pivotal moment, Karakade dies and her spirit is replaced by Kadesurang''s.', 'In the past, the cruel and selfish Karakade was betrothed to Date, a man who despises her wickedness and prefers a kinder woman. In a fit of jealousy, Karakade tries to kill her rival, but a servant dies instead. While Karakade is suspected, her murderous intentions can’t be confirmed. So Date and his dad perform a sacred ritual to punish the killer. At this pivotal moment, Karakade dies and her spirit is replaced by Kadesurang''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9u22LZwsevRmxBe10S3LqBfqHLX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78561'),
  ('687155756080053470', 'Love Doesn''t Understand Words', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Müge Uğurlar', null, 'Hande Erçel, Burak Deniz, Özcan Tekdemir, Merve Çağıran, Oğuzhan Karbi, Demet Gül, Süleyman Felek, Betül Çobanoğlu', null, 'Hayat is a country girl with strict parents. She is in a love hate relationship with her boss Murat. Hayat is full of secrets that can ruin her career and relationship.', 'Hayat is a country girl with strict parents. She is in a love hate relationship with her boss Murat. Hayat is full of secrets that can ruin her career and relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/krSdiuUrsqka7FFtaqjxEqC0bE9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67570'),
  ('125202681979487525', 'Love Endures', 2024, 'Drama', null, null, 'Yang Zi, Adam Fan, Zhu Yanmanzi, Jin Shijia, Wang Qianyue, Fang Yueqiao, Zhao Rui, Feng Hui', null, 'In an aerospace city in the north, seven children who were born an only child became closer than siblings and called themselves "The Big Dipper." They all promised to conquer the college entrance examinations so they can go to Beijing together but seventeen came and went and only Huang Yingzi made it. "The Big Dipper" was no more as everyone parted ways. Huang Yingzi went to Beijing for school and Jiang Yi left for the States. "Who do you like at the age of seventeen" has become a mystery lingering in the hearts of the seven people. As newcomers in the workplace, they were bruised and battered from the skirmishes between their ideals and reality. Their once pure emotions are like shining stars in the night sky. Huang Yingzi wants to reunite the group only to realize that there a question remains. Meanwhile, Jiang Yi and the others have already been presented their answer.', 'In an aerospace city in the north, seven children who were born an only child became closer than siblings and called themselves "The Big Dipper." They all promised to conquer the college entrance examinations so they can go to Beijing together but seventeen came and went and only Huang Yingzi made it. "The Big Dipper" was no more as everyone parted ways. Huang Yingzi went to Beijing for school and Jiang Yi left for the States. "Who do you like at the age of seventeen" has become a mystery lingering in the hearts of the seven people. As newcomers in the workplace, they were bruised and battered from the skirmishes between their ideals and reality. Their once pure emotions are like shining stars in the night sky. Huang Yingzi wants to reunite the group only to realize that there a question remains. Meanwhile, Jiang Yi and the others have already been presented their answer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q1ryxOH0JsPG0rYFdOiAg47m4NM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:225930'),
  ('832420003965557855', 'Love Flops', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ryota Osaka, Miku Ito, Ayana Taketatsu, Rie Takahashi, Hisako Kanemoto, Marika Kouno, Jun Fukuyama, Shiori Izawa', 'TV-MA', 'Asahi Kashiwagi lives the typical life of an average high school student — until the day a TV fortune teller’s predictions come true one after another, culminating in a series of risqué encounters! Destiny seemingly draws five beautiful girls into Asahi’s path, and soon he finds himself fielding not one, not two, but five love confessions. Asahi will need to follow his heart to find the perfect love for him, or else his love fortunes may end in one epic flail and flop.', 'Asahi Kashiwagi lives the typical life of an average high school student — until the day a TV fortune teller’s predictions come true one after another, culminating in a series of risqué encounters! Destiny seemingly draws five beautiful girls into Asahi’s path, and soon he finds himself fielding not one, not two, but five love confessions. Asahi will need to follow his heart to find the perfect love for him, or else his love fortunes may end in one epic flail and flop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oDdaWg2ROrXrpvixAN06MBiaYj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:195990'),
  ('1058128245089572035', 'Love For Love''s Sake', 2024, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Hwacha, Aquram', null, 'Lee Tae-vin, Cha Joo-wan, Oh Min-soo, Cha Woong-ki, Ko Gun-han, Joo Boo-jin, Park Sung-kyu, 주종범', null, 'A man winds up inside a video game where he plays a teen character who must make a tragic athlete happy — or risk dying. Can their love survive?', 'A man winds up inside a video game where he plays a teen character who must make a tragic athlete happy — or risk dying. Can their love survive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Ahpm5hjQFpsYL5hib5kqfVkswT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:240591'),
  ('842985381372917302', 'Love for Rent', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Melda Perahya Yalçın, Müge Turalı Pak, Mehmetcan Yüksel', 'Meriç Acemi', 'Elçin Sangu, Barış Arduç, Salih Bademci, Nergis Kumbasar, Levent Ülgen, Kerem Fırtına, Sanem Yeles, Onur Büyüktopçu', null, 'When Defne''s brother gets into debt and is held captive, Defne is forced to accept an offer in exchange for the money. She has to make Ömer, a wealthy shoe designer who owns a company, fall in love with her and marry her.', 'When Defne''s brother gets into debt and is held captive, Defne is forced to accept an offer in exchange for the money. She has to make Ömer, a wealthy shoe designer who owns a company, fall in love with her and marry her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xuarVMbyxXFRpuVScZadhjNtkBn.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:63549'),
  ('708123185077074965', 'Love from 9 to 5', 2026, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Diego Klein, Ana Gonzalez Bello, Martha Reyes Arias, Paola Fernández', null, 'Two colleagues from vastly different backgrounds initially despise each other. He is a privileged "nepo baby," while she is a determined worker who has earned everything through her efforts. Their competitive spirit leads to unexpected sparks and, eventually, deeper affection.', 'Two colleagues from vastly different backgrounds initially despise each other. He is a privileged "nepo baby," while she is a determined worker who has earned everything through her efforts. Their competitive spirit leads to unexpected sparks and, eventually, deeper affection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNSFDLDaMhEvDTzOr1FOYeXopQz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:290231'),
  ('722834941362027872', 'Love From Time Space', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Li Feng', 'Xu Zheng, Zhang Ting, Wan Hongjie, Li Qian, Ke Shi, Lili Liu, Baoguang Sun, Zhichao Zhang', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVCcG8VMtaCBQOKeVT4NTrQIiIB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92778'),
  ('809791782666550379', 'Love Game in Eastern Fantasy', 2024, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Bai Yu Zhai Diao Gong', null, 'Yu Shuxin, Ding Yuxi, Zhu Xudan, Yang Shize', null, 'Pulled into the pages of a fantasy novel, a woman is shocked to find herself stuck in the role of a villain. Now, she must battle to rewrite her destiny.', 'Pulled into the pages of a fantasy novel, a woman is shocked to find herself stuck in the role of a villain. Now, she must battle to rewrite her destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvbYjugS8OPtgPu9J7A9VjKjnsA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:243084'),
  ('467658406810439374', 'Love Generation', 1997, 'Drama', null, null, 'Takuya Kimura, Takako Matsu, Seiyo Uchino, Risa Junna, Norika Fujiwara, Yōko Moriguchi, Ryūta Kawabata, Mitsuru Hirata', null, 'Love Generation revolves around the relationship of the two leading protagonists, Katagiri Teppei and Uesugi Riko, who begin their relationship as squabbling colleagues before falling in love.', 'Love Generation revolves around the relationship of the two leading protagonists, Katagiri Teppei and Uesugi Riko, who begin their relationship as squabbling colleagues before falling in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zEaChIvfj2uED7Z2tvRY3bS0cH8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4319'),
  ('930756233318799813', 'Love Has Won: The Cult of Mother God', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Amy Carlson, Mary Lowers, Ashley Peluso, Lauryn Suarez, Linda Haythorne, Tara Flores, Ryan Kramer, Gabriel Gomez', 'TV-MA', 'Chronicles the life and death of Amy Carlson, also known as Mother God, a self-proclaimed spiritual savior who built a cult through her online manifestos and live-streaming sessions. As Amy''s health declined, her followers believed her death would lead to her evacuation by UFO and salvation for humanity. Told through the eyes of Amy''s devotees and constructed from the cult''s archival footage, the three-part docuseries captures the perils of internet proselytizing and a conspiracy-driven faith.', 'Chronicles the life and death of Amy Carlson, also known as Mother God, a self-proclaimed spiritual savior who built a cult through her online manifestos and live-streaming sessions. As Amy''s health declined, her followers believed her death would lead to her evacuation by UFO and salvation for humanity. Told through the eyes of Amy''s devotees and constructed from the cult''s archival footage, the three-part docuseries captures the perils of internet proselytizing and a conspiracy-driven faith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i5yPnJJ7tOzswWQSlZK83VYaVNV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:238179'),
  ('1150753426783633804', 'Love Hina', 2000, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Yuji Ueda, Yui Horie, Masayo Kurata, Yuu Asakawa, Reiko Takagi, Junko Noda, Megumi Hayashibara', 'TV-14', 'Keitaro and his childhood sweetheart make a promise to be accepted at and to meet each other at the prestigous Toudai University before she moved out of his life. About a decade later, Keitaro has become an artist and a daydreamer, having ranked 27th from the last in the national practice exam. When his grandmother leaves the all-girls dormitory, he becomes the residential manager and soon meets up with two Todai applicants who may have been that sweetheart, since he`s forgotten her name. Then there the other tenants like young Shinobu who was in despair until Keitaro helped her, Motoko the swordsmaster who sees men as evil distractions, Su Kaolo the genius child inventor and the sneaky Kitsune.', 'Keitaro and his childhood sweetheart make a promise to be accepted at and to meet each other at the prestigous Toudai University before she moved out of his life. About a decade later, Keitaro has become an artist and a daydreamer, having ranked 27th from the last in the national practice exam. When his grandmother leaves the all-girls dormitory, he becomes the residential manager and soon meets up with two Todai applicants who may have been that sweetheart, since he`s forgotten her name. Then there the other tenants like young Shinobu who was in despair until Keitaro helped her, Motoko the swordsmaster who sees men as evil distractions, Su Kaolo the genius child inventor and the sneaky Kitsune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3td66l71KKDS1iaV0EHbaB1wHI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:30992'),
  ('243990815661836022', 'Love in a Cold Climate', 2001, 'Drama', null, null, 'Megan Dodds, Anna Popplewell, Elisabeth Dermot Walsh, Rosamund Pike, Javier Alcina, Alan Bates, Frances Barber, John Light', null, 'Dramatization of Nancy Mitford''s novel about three aristocratic young girls'' adventures in love.', 'Dramatization of Nancy Mitford''s novel about three aristocratic young girls'' adventures in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ia0JBAssRQhBvSDdX31XAKeCsC5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44812'),
  ('381490823079588654', 'Love in Chains', 2019, 'Drama', null, null, 'Sonia Priss, Serhiy Strelnykov, Maxim Radugin, Mikhail Gavrilov, Kseniia Mishyna, Aliaksiej Jaravienka, Stanislav Boklan, Olha Sumska', null, 'Kateryna is beautiful, clever and by the will of her godmother was raised as a lady of noble blood. But for the whole world, she is only someone else’s property, a bondmaid of the richest landowner in Nizhyn – Chervinskyi. Struggling for her freedom and the right to be happy, she will have to endure the deaths of her closest people, become the property of a woman who hates and dreams to kill her, survive the popular uprising, escape while being chased by a maniac and flee from the one who wants to get her above all. What awaits Kateryna at the end of such a terrible and exhausting path to freedom?', 'Kateryna is beautiful, clever and by the will of her godmother was raised as a lady of noble blood. But for the whole world, she is only someone else’s property, a bondmaid of the richest landowner in Nizhyn – Chervinskyi. Struggling for her freedom and the right to be happy, she will have to endure the deaths of her closest people, become the property of a woman who hates and dreams to kill her, survive the popular uprising, escape while being chased by a maniac and flee from the one who wants to get her above all. What awaits Kateryna at the end of such a terrible and exhausting path to freedom?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5cLKmC9OPUByCZdNOu5Drr9J28g.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:110180'),
  ('646105953196206790', 'Love in Contract', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'nam seong-woo, Jung Yeo-jin, ha goo-dam', 'Ha Gu-dam', 'Park Min-young, Go Kyung-pyo, Kim Jae-young, Jin Kyung, Kang Hyung-suk, Lee Ju-bin, Park Cheol-min, Park Kyung-hye', null, 'Contract marriage master Choi Sang-eun''s alternate day romance with a long-term mystery client on Monday, Wednesday and Friday and a new superstar client on Tuesday, Thursday and Saturday.', 'Contract marriage master Choi Sang-eun''s alternate day romance with a long-term mystery client on Monday, Wednesday and Friday and a new superstar client on Tuesday, Thursday and Saturday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tMIhH0T5JYJwypWy2K7zTJiboZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:201146'),
  ('308359071701634470', 'Love in Difficult Times', 2005, 'Soap, Drama', 'Josep Maria Benet i Jornet, Antonio Onetti, Rodolf Sirera', null, 'Ana Otero, Ana Turpin, Bárbara Santa-Cruz, Nadia de Santiago, Jorge Calvo, Gonzalo Ramos, Lola Baldrich, Héctor Tomás', 'TV-Y7', 'Amar en tiempos revueltos is a Spanish soap opera set in the times of the Spanish civil war and the early Francoism. The serial has been aired from 2005 and has won prizes in Spain and a Silver Medal in the «New York Festivals». In January 2013 will air on Antena 3 with new name, Amar es para siempre', 'Amar en tiempos revueltos is a Spanish soap opera set in the times of the Spanish civil war and the early Francoism. The serial has been aired from 2005 and has won prizes in Spain and a Silver Medal in the «New York Festivals». In January 2013 will air on Antena 3 with new name, Amar es para siempre', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z9ws8sxV59rv7eQFKo46CEjFOPR.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:8125'),
  ('893432301242076094', 'Love in Flames of War', 2022, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, 'Ye Yang', 'Chen Duling, Shawn Dou, Yuan Hao, Zhao Yingzi, Lai Yi, Dong Xuan, Guan Xin, Ran Xu', null, 'During the period of the Republic of China, the cardamom talented girl Lin Hangjing was imprisoned because of her father’s murder. She went to her father’s friend Xiao Dashuai. Although she was under the fence, she was not humble or overbearing. Xiao Beichen, the overbearing three young master of the Xiao family, had bullied her from the very beginning to gradually attracted by her strong independence.', 'During the period of the Republic of China, the cardamom talented girl Lin Hangjing was imprisoned because of her father’s murder. She went to her father’s friend Xiao Dashuai. Although she was under the fence, she was not humble or overbearing. Xiao Beichen, the overbearing three young master of the Xiao family, had bullied her from the very beginning to gradually attracted by her strong independence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9TYheN8TEHZTJaK4dzApQEjaSiW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:200961'),
  ('883329871429325961', 'Love in Her Bag', 2013, 'Drama, Family, Romance', null, 'Kim Jung Ah', 'Choi Jung-won, Kim Jeong-hoon, Son Eun-seo, Park Yoon-jae, Choi Su-rin, Park So-young, Kim Bo-ra, Park Si-woo', null, 'Despite her poverty and lack of education or connections, bright and plucky Eun Jung-soo works her way up in the luxury handbag industry based on sheer talent alone. She encounters Do Jin-hoo, the smart and handsome chaebol heir of a fashion company, and Kim Seo-hyun who has to hide her true identity in order to achieve her dreams.', 'Despite her poverty and lack of education or connections, bright and plucky Eun Jung-soo works her way up in the luxury handbag industry based on sheer talent alone. She encounters Do Jin-hoo, the smart and handsome chaebol heir of a fashion company, and Kim Seo-hyun who has to hide her true identity in order to achieve her dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gq8j27c1UfKlN2VfbX9oHJZyvJM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64826'),
  ('553572420683475343', 'Love in Ordinary', 2024, 'Drama', null, null, 'Zuo Xiaoqing, Xia Dejun, He Saifei, Yang Kun', null, 'Wan Jiaming, a community police officer with a scholarly background from Jiangnan, and Qu Xiaohe, a retired athlete assigned to work in a grassroots community, navigate the challenges of their new roles as they help transform a children''s clothing town from a chaotic industrial hub into a harmonious, modern city where people live in peace.', 'Wan Jiaming, a community police officer with a scholarly background from Jiangnan, and Qu Xiaohe, a retired athlete assigned to work in a grassroots community, navigate the challenges of their new roles as they help transform a children''s clothing town from a chaotic industrial hub into a harmonious, modern city where people live in peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AhvMhX51pH3roKt8l2TmMLYPECo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:261362'),
  ('1061229687383772041', 'Love in Pavilion', 2025, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Tuo Xiaoxin', 'Ding Ya, Miu Wenjing', 'Liu Shishi, Leon Zhang, Wu Xuanyi, Zhai Xiaowen, Shen Yue, Ding Yuxi, Zhang Ruonan, Meng Ziyi', null, 'It tells the story of Dongfang Huaizhu and Wangquan Hongye, the leaders of two major families, the Dongfangs and the Wangquans. In a time when humans and demons are in conflict, they work together to stabilize the situation in order to revive the Unity Alliance. On the seventh day of the seventh month, at the Bamboo Pavilion by the Huai River, their fates intertwine like the sheaths of two swords, never to be separated. They pick up the most heartwarming promise and tell a story that has endured for generations.', 'It tells the story of Dongfang Huaizhu and Wangquan Hongye, the leaders of two major families, the Dongfangs and the Wangquans. In a time when humans and demons are in conflict, they work together to stabilize the situation in order to revive the Unity Alliance. On the seventh day of the seventh month, at the Bamboo Pavilion by the Huai River, their fates intertwine like the sheaths of two swords, never to be separated. They pick up the most heartwarming promise and tell a story that has endured for generations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rz9njPrgpOWKlXeU3e3lvMChjnD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:226270'),
  ('304620484218533484', 'Love In The Air', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'MAME', 'MAME', 'Chaikamon Sermsongwittaya, Nuttarat Tangwai, Thitipong Sangngey, Wasuthorn Chaijindar, Piamchon Damrongsunthornchai, Chalermsak Yamchamang', 'TV-PG', 'Rain plots to make Phayu fall for him to ruin his reputation, while Sky grapples with his feelings for Prapai, in this whirlwind of emotions and growing love.', 'Rain plots to make Phayu fall for him to ruin his reputation, while Sky grapples with his feelings for Prapai, in this whirlwind of emotions and growing love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPL95QpwujQnPlY7ZATqMYgZn1j.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207371'),
  ('950466530768981105', 'Love in the Air -Premonition of Love-', 2024, 'Drama', 'MAME', 'Atsuo Akari', 'Shoma Nagumo, Takuto Hamaya, Suzuki Asahi, Reo Nagatsuma, Higuchi Hina, Ayumu Mochizuki, Ai Tsubakihara, Ryo Tajima', null, 'After a mysterious biker helps him on a stormy night, Rei can’t forget him—until fate brings them back together and sparks something more.', 'After a mysterious biker helps him on a stormy night, Rei can’t forget him—until fate brings them back together and sparks something more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHYb0ho2uHaFaw67KS4wFpREF9O.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:262155'),
  ('397492967711180527', 'Love In The Big City', 2024, 'Drama', 'Park Sang-young', null, 'Nam Yoon-su', null, 'A young gay man and his spirited roommate help each other navigate love, mortality and sexuality in the bustling city of Seoul.', 'A young gay man and his spirited roommate help each other navigate love, mortality and sexuality in the bustling city of Seoul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yvcZz6J1VyFqg8cboktxZDGdOsI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:236956'),
  ('380815289588959616', 'Love in the Clouds', 2025, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Bai Lu Cheng Shuang', null, 'Hou Minghao, Lu Yuxiao, Yu Chengen, Quan Yilun, He Nan, Zhu Lilan, Pan Junya, Hu Yunhao', null, 'At the annual Qingyun Conference in the Hexu Six Realms, Ji Bozai, a warrior from the Jixing Abyss with a past as a convict, defeated Ming Yi, the cold warrior goddess who had reigned supreme for seven consecutive years. Overnight, Ji Bozai became the hottest new star in Jixing Abyss. Meanwhile, Ming Yi, hiding her true identity, disguised herself as a dancer to get close to Ji Bozai. Under their carefully crafted personas, the two engaged in a thrilling dance of deception and attraction, fighting for justice and fairness, and ultimately found a deep and moving love.', 'At the annual Qingyun Conference in the Hexu Six Realms, Ji Bozai, a warrior from the Jixing Abyss with a past as a convict, defeated Ming Yi, the cold warrior goddess who had reigned supreme for seven consecutive years. Overnight, Ji Bozai became the hottest new star in Jixing Abyss. Meanwhile, Ming Yi, hiding her true identity, disguised herself as a dancer to get close to Ji Bozai. Under their carefully crafted personas, the two engaged in a thrilling dance of deception and attraction, fighting for justice and fairness, and ultimately found a deep and moving love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/alXAb26apN2tbRM91QjeZ0KzHlj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:262928'),
  ('767508769503008425', 'Love in the Edge of Divorce', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Ren Shihao, Li Xingyao, Shi Ruiyi, Zhuang Jinghan, Zhou Peichen', null, 'In a loveless arranged marriage, Fu Yancheng and Sheng Mian plan to divorce. However, an unexpected intimate encounter leads to deeper misunderstandings when Fu Yancheng discovers that Sheng Mian is actually Penny. Regretting his actions, Fu Yancheng works to win her back', 'In a loveless arranged marriage, Fu Yancheng and Sheng Mian plan to divorce. However, an unexpected intimate encounter leads to deeper misunderstandings when Fu Yancheng discovers that Sheng Mian is actually Penny. Regretting his actions, Fu Yancheng works to win her back', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ndArPPZTvqrpwvZHhC8o1xYRFgF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278969'),
  ('873592168583287088', 'Love in the Moonlight', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama, War & Politics', 'Yoon Yi-soo', 'Im Ye-jin, Kim Min-jung', 'Park Bo-gum, Kim Yoo-jung, Jung Jin-young, Chae Soo-bin, Kwak Dong-yeon, Kim Seung-su, Jeon Mi-seon, Heo Jung-eun', 'NR', 'A young Joseon woman who''s lived her whole life as a man ends up as a eunuch in the royal palace, where she begins to bond with the crown prince.', 'A young Joseon woman who''s lived her whole life as a man ends up as a eunuch in the royal palace, where she begins to bond with the crown prince.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qKir5S1ka8UkWVo8aGW9T19IIHC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66256'),
