  ('88507380678777439', 'Love Is Blind: UK', 2024, 'Reality', null, null, 'Emma Willis, Matt Willis', 'TV-MA', 'Emma and Matt Willis host a social experiment where British singles look for love and get engaged before meeting in person. But who will say "I do"?', 'Emma and Matt Willis host a social experiment where British singles look for love and get engaged before meeting in person. But who will say "I do"?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGeMqJbsKBvt7YoAgeNcpnC75ge.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:237316'),
  ('14666453687649950', 'Love is for Suckers', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Kim Sol-ji', 'Lee Da-hee, Choi Si-won, Cho Soo-hyang, Park Yeon-woo, Lee Ju-yeon, Lee Dae-hwi, Im Ha-ryong, Yang Hee-kyung', null, 'A romantic comedy-drama depicting the sweet and salty reality romance between 20-year-old best friends in their 30s who have no romance or flirting.', 'A romantic comedy-drama depicting the sweet and salty reality romance between 20-year-old best friends in their 30s who have no romance or flirting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hpxsdQ50CBnJ1j7KbCWEDBefTQV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197073'),
  ('659228285251602983', 'Love Is in the Air', 2010, 'Drama', 'Eylem Canpolat, Sema Ergenekon', 'Berfu Soner, Sema Ergenekon, Eylem Canpolat', 'Murat Ünalmış, Birce Akalay, Kanbolat Görkem Arslan, Erman Okay, Levend Yılmaz, Ayşegül Günay, Tuvana Türkay, Burak Hakkı', null, 'A wealthy Hancioglu family owns vast estates in Cappadocia, Turkey. Yusuf (Murat Unalmis) is the oldest son of this family, therefore, he manages the family business and bears all the responsibility of the family. Yusuf is very handsome, rich and hardworking man. Thus, there are lots of women who want to be his bride but, Yusuf wants to get married with a woman whom he loves.', 'A wealthy Hancioglu family owns vast estates in Cappadocia, Turkey. Yusuf (Murat Unalmis) is the oldest son of this family, therefore, he manages the family business and bears all the responsibility of the family. Yusuf is very handsome, rich and hardworking man. Thus, there are lots of women who want to be his bride but, Yusuf wants to get married with a woman whom he loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ueEPdHewIjJ0P3k11KRXbRHXbIm.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:47923'),
  ('877761518560369984', 'Love Is in the Air', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ayse Uber Kutlu', null, 'Hande Erçel, Kerem Bürsin, Evrim Doğan, Anıl İlter, Elçin Afacan, Başak Gümülcinelioğlu, Alican Aytekin, Sarp Bozkurt', 'NR', 'Eda, who ties all her hopes to her education, confronts Serkan Bolat, who cuts off her international education scholarship and leaves her with high school diploma. Serkan Bolat offers Eda to give her scholarship back if she pretends to be his fiance for two months. Although Eda rejects the offer of this man as she hates him, she has to accept it when the conditions change. While pretending to be engaged, Serkan and Eda begin to experience a passionate, challenging relationship that will make them forget all they know right. Because love is difficult. And that''s why it''s amazing.', 'Eda, who ties all her hopes to her education, confronts Serkan Bolat, who cuts off her international education scholarship and leaves her with high school diploma. Serkan Bolat offers Eda to give her scholarship back if she pretends to be his fiance for two months. Although Eda rejects the offer of this man as she hates him, she has to accept it when the conditions change. While pretending to be engaged, Serkan and Eda begin to experience a passionate, challenging relationship that will make them forget all they know right. Because love is difficult. And that''s why it''s amazing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bE71f9A3eztjcd5JT3MmHB8MbzA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:104877'),
  ('67776147248650689', 'Love Is Indivisible by Twins', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Shogo Sakata, Moeha Nochimoto, Maaya Uchida, Katsumi Fukuhara, Misaki Ikeda, Yuko Ono, Kaori Ishihara', null, 'Jun Shirosaki’s love life takes a wild turn when he finds himself caught between the Jinguji twins—his childhood friends who are as different as night and day. Rumi, the older sister, pairs a boyish charm with a maiden’s heart, while Naori combines girlish looks with her deep love for otaku culture. As feelings grow and confusion mounts, Jun must navigate this unexpected love triangle next door.', 'Jun Shirosaki’s love life takes a wild turn when he finds himself caught between the Jinguji twins—his childhood friends who are as different as night and day. Rumi, the older sister, pairs a boyish charm with a maiden’s heart, while Naori combines girlish looks with her deep love for otaku culture. As feelings grow and confusion mounts, Jun must navigate this unexpected love triangle next door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Q8w7vkPG3byxJk8eUX5fnRtgTo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:230697'),
  ('624470159790494556', 'Love Is Like a Cocktail', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Eri Kitamura, Mitsuhiro Ichiki, Ayaka Asai, Arisa Nakada, Kenji Akabane', 'TV-PG', 'Chisato Mizusawa is a reserved but excellent and pretty assistant manager in her company. She has a secret that only her husband Sora knows, which is that she likes drinking alcohol, and she can become very cute when she is drunk! Even tonight, she gets relaxed (with the phrase "Shifuku~") and drunk with the cocktail Sora makes♥. It''s a "Yoidere (Drunken Dere)" cocktail comedy of Japan''s closest husband and wife.', 'Chisato Mizusawa is a reserved but excellent and pretty assistant manager in her company. She has a secret that only her husband Sora knows, which is that she likes drinking alcohol, and she can become very cute when she is drunk! Even tonight, she gets relaxed (with the phrase "Shifuku~") and drunk with the cocktail Sora makes♥. It''s a "Yoidere (Drunken Dere)" cocktail comedy of Japan''s closest husband and wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKou5JGxvVY5fdHbVNbhjyhUG97.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74182'),
  ('215198312529382830', 'Love is Sweet', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yu Chung-chung, Wu Jian Xin', 'Wu Xiang', 'Luo Yunxi, Bai Lu, Gao Hanyu, Xiao Yan, Riley Wang, Zhao Yuanyuan, Guan Zijing, Hu Chunyang', null, 'Jiang Jun, a driven woman with a background in economics and psychology, leaves philanthropy to fulfill her late father’s wish by joining a top investment firm. There, she faces intense competition and reunites with her childhood friend-turned-rival, Yuan Shuai. With her intelligence and resilience, she navigates workplace challenges, uncovering hidden schemes while finding success in both her career and love.', 'Jiang Jun, a driven woman with a background in economics and psychology, leaves philanthropy to fulfill her late father’s wish by joining a top investment firm. There, she faces intense competition and reunites with her childhood friend-turned-rival, Yuan Shuai. With her intelligence and resilience, she navigates workplace challenges, uncovering hidden schemes while finding success in both her career and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k52mSqO1sXLhuRjNoSMsj1qJ7kD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110632'),
  ('88678631460506291', 'Love Island', 2015, 'Reality', 'Andy Cadman, Mike Spencer, Laura Woolf', null, 'Maya Jama, Iain Stirling', 'TV-MA', 'A stunning cast engages in the ultimate game of love, as they land in a sunshine paradise in search of passion and romance. Each of the glamorous members of the public will live like celebrities in a luxury villa, but in order to stay there, they will not only have to win over the hearts of each other, but also the hearts of the public.', 'A stunning cast engages in the ultimate game of love, as they land in a sunshine paradise in search of passion and romance. Each of the glamorous members of the public will live like celebrities in a luxury villa, but in order to stay there, they will not only have to win over the hearts of each other, but also the hearts of the public.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lkytocF9AzcCQlCq58sK4ogP0X.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:66636'),
  ('788901952927482642', 'Love Island', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, 'Holly Mae Brood, Viktor Verhulst, Jeroen Verdick', null, 'The Dutch/Flemish version of Love Island will see a stunning cast engage in the ultimate game of love, as they land in a sunshine paradise in search of passion and romance. Each of the glamorous contestants will live like celebrities in a luxury villa, but in order to stay there they will not only have to win over the hearts of each other, but also the hearts of the viewers. Can true love win out on Love Island or is it all a game?', 'The Dutch/Flemish version of Love Island will see a stunning cast engage in the ultimate game of love, as they land in a sunshine paradise in search of passion and romance. Each of the glamorous contestants will live like celebrities in a luxury villa, but in order to stay there they will not only have to win over the hearts of each other, but also the hearts of the viewers. Can true love win out on Love Island or is it all a game?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46gYkk7qMmmacyrYRPesonseQqx.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:90522'),
  ('593303124907471231', 'Love Island', 2021, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'The search for love in paradise, the fight for a fairytale win, a beautiful villa by the sea, fine sand on the beach, a refreshing pool, the scorching sun, or evening barbecues - all in the most exciting dating reality show Love Island.', 'The search for love in paradise, the fight for a fairytale win, a beautiful villa by the sea, fine sand on the beach, a refreshing pool, the scorching sun, or evening barbecues - all in the most exciting dating reality show Love Island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wUaTL1XL94sIyRef3loviWtT3tc.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:134156'),
  ('798338422182580227', 'Love Island Australia', 2018, 'Reality', 'Brent Baker, Tom Gould, Joe Scarrat', null, 'Sophie Monk, Eoghan McDermott', 'TV-MA', 'The Australian version of the hit UK''s reality show, Love Island. In Mallorca, Spain, 10 Aussie singles will play the ultimate game of love. After finding their match, they must stay together while surviving temptations as new singles enter the villa.', 'The Australian version of the hit UK''s reality show, Love Island. In Mallorca, Spain, 10 Aussie singles will play the ultimate game of love. After finding their match, they must stay together while surviving temptations as new singles enter the villa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogkVvAeQT65FtEdKwu7JzB7RX35.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:79792'),
  ('130732412620783166', 'Love Island Games', 2023, 'Reality', 'Mike Spencer', null, 'Ariana Madix, Iain Stirling', 'TV-MA', 'Set in Fiji, fan-favorite Islanders from various Love Island series across the globe – USA, UK, Australia and beyond – are brought together for a second shot at love as they compete in a brand-new format to be crowned champions. In this cheeky new iteration, romance will meet reality as fan-favorite Islanders are faced with both team and couples’ challenges, all while navigating dating, eliminations, recoupling, dramatic arrivals and new competition twists and turns like never before.', 'Set in Fiji, fan-favorite Islanders from various Love Island series across the globe – USA, UK, Australia and beyond – are brought together for a second shot at love as they compete in a brand-new format to be crowned champions. In this cheeky new iteration, romance will meet reality as fan-favorite Islanders are faced with both team and couples’ challenges, all while navigating dating, eliminations, recoupling, dramatic arrivals and new competition twists and turns like never before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ACzNV3c4alBW7rUyo51n8uGoJw.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:233816'),
  ('281722225520750167', 'Love Island USA', 2019, 'Reality', 'Brent Baker, Mark Busk-Cowley, Tom Gould', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'The matchmaking begins as a group of single "Islanders" come together in a stunning villa on a beautiful tropical island, ready to embark on a summer of dating, romance, and ultimately, relationships. Every few days the Islanders pair up and those who are not coupled are at risk of being dumped from the island. Islanders are on the lookout for romance, but the road to love doesn''t always run smoothly.', 'The matchmaking begins as a group of single "Islanders" come together in a stunning villa on a beautiful tropical island, ready to embark on a summer of dating, romance, and ultimately, relationships. Every few days the Islanders pair up and those who are not coupled are at risk of being dumped from the island. Islanders are on the lookout for romance, but the road to love doesn''t always run smoothly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kU2y21cls8WargMaX7KI47URMjD.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:90521'),
  ('197696423265683915', 'Love Island: All Stars', 2024, 'Reality', 'Mike Spencer', null, 'Maya Jama, Iain Stirling', null, 'Some of your favourite Islanders from across the years heading back to the stunning South African villa to once again ''graft'' as their search for love continues.', 'Some of your favourite Islanders from across the years heading back to the stunning South African villa to once again ''graft'' as their search for love continues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eMQYbtPpoGUcRJtYus7jJcvXKY5.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:243754'),
  ('1096831563535006220', 'Love Island: Beyond the Villa', 2025, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'Following everyone’s favorite Season 6 Islanders around Los Angeles as they navigate new careers, evolving friendships, newfound fame, and complex relationships outside of the Love Island villa.', 'Following everyone’s favorite Season 6 Islanders around Los Angeles as they navigate new careers, evolving friendships, newfound fame, and complex relationships outside of the Love Island villa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1yZOYAbLOxUUzlfvC6Yt6y0NmPY.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:293088'),
  ('138466679147908779', 'Love Island: Hot Flirts & True Love', 2017, 'Reality', null, null, 'Sylvie Meis, Simon Beeck', null, 'On Love Island, a group of candidates called "Islander" live isolated from the outside world in a villa on Mallorca (Tenerife in spring 2021), under constant observation by video cameras. In order to stay in the villa, one must be linked to another "Islander", whether it is for love, friendship is the basis or for calculation (the couple remaining at the end receives 50,000 euros in prize money).', 'On Love Island, a group of candidates called "Islander" live isolated from the outside world in a villa on Mallorca (Tenerife in spring 2021), under constant observation by video cameras. In order to stay in the villa, one must be linked to another "Islander", whether it is for love, friendship is the basis or for calculation (the couple remaining at the end receives 50,000 euros in prize money).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pikK9vQBS5Lt9ttxmYPaQ1KMVxA.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:77550'),
  ('879312148119879195', 'Love It or List It', 2008, 'Reality', 'Catherine Fogarty, Maria Armstrong', null, 'David Visentin, Page Turner', 'TV-G', 'When a house no longer feels like home, homeowners are left with a big financial and emotional question: renovate or sell it? Love It or List It helps fed-up homeowners decide. In each hour-long episode Realtor David Visentin and designer Hilary Farr compete for the homeowners'' final decision to stay or go.', 'When a house no longer feels like home, homeowners are left with a big financial and emotional question: renovate or sell it? Love It or List It helps fed-up homeowners decide. In each hour-long episode Realtor David Visentin and designer Hilary Farr compete for the homeowners'' final decision to stay or go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itU2jGOa5ZxidqZEsHyKgI95Mvd.jpg', 20, 'tmdb:tv:33927'),
  ('757017660490421753', 'Love Lab', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Manami Numakura, Chinatsu Akasaki, Inori Minase, Ayane Sakura, You Taichi', null, 'Love Lab is set in Fujisaki Girls Academy, which is known for their school body being composed of very proper students. The most prominent one of them is Natsuo Maki, the student president who is admired by her classmates for her calm and polite demeanor. On the other hand, Riko Kurahashi is also admired but for having a very forward and boyish personality. Riko accidentally walks into Maki when she is kissing a body pillow with a picture of a guy for practice, and learns that she is not as collected as everyone thinks she is. Riko is forced into keeping Maki''s secret and joins her in practicing romance activities such as holding hands and more.', 'Love Lab is set in Fujisaki Girls Academy, which is known for their school body being composed of very proper students. The most prominent one of them is Natsuo Maki, the student president who is admired by her classmates for her calm and polite demeanor. On the other hand, Riko Kurahashi is also admired but for having a very forward and boyish personality. Riko accidentally walks into Maki when she is kissing a body pillow with a picture of a guy for practice, and learns that she is not as collected as everyone thinks she is. Riko is forced into keeping Maki''s secret and joins her in practicing romance activities such as holding hands and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDGK0HJl9dmCb80mQwidKhUiy4r.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65602'),
  ('92532685878220748', 'Love Life', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sam Boyd', null, 'William Jackson Harper, Jessica Williams, Chris Powell, Punkie Johnson, Keith David', 'TV-MA', 'A romantic comedy anthology series which follows a different protagonist each season on the journey from first love to last love, with each half-hour episode chronicling one of their relationships.', 'A romantic comedy anthology series which follows a different protagonist each season on the journey from first love to last love, with each half-hour episode chronicling one of their relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yIlbPxb7KC4k112v8vattKwLsN7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:102316'),
  ('547865098598249426', 'Love Like a Bike', 2026, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Thanapon Jarujitranon, Masu Junyangdikul, Nannakun Pakapatpornpob, Nititorn Akkarachotsopon, Thanat Wanattapong, Danny Luciano, Nathanon Thananonchotikul, Teachin Paksa', null, 'Three brothers running a bike cafe embark on a cycling journey to heal past traumas and find love in the sun-drenched streets of Pattaya.', 'Three brothers running a bike cafe embark on a cycling journey to heal past traumas and find love in the sun-drenched streets of Pattaya.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9rOVTr82lppG50UX5DzNuogO5m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:276582'),
  ('176910501779179361', 'Love Like a K-Drama', 2023, 'Reality', null, null, 'Yuko Fueki, Haruna Kondo, Ayaka Nishiwaki, Shusuke Fukutoku, Komori Hayato, Maria Tani, Rio Yamashita, Ayano Kudo', 'TV-PG', 'Four actresses from Japan move to South Korea to audition and act alongside Korean actors for roles in a series of love stories. Will true romance follow?', 'Four actresses from Japan move to South Korea to audition and act alongside Korean actors for roles in a series of love stories. Will true romance follow?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4P3DcNfAcBQdA8a9UyUB9Oe9gr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:232433'),
  ('829974919201219631', 'Love Like the Galaxy', 2022, 'Drama', 'Zheng Yi', null, 'Leo Wu, Zhao Lusi, Guo Tao, Zeng Li, Josie Xu Jiao, Li Yunrui, Yu Chengen, Estelle Chen', null, 'Cheng Shaoshang, left behind by her parents who went off to war, faces challenges from a scheming aunt and struggles with estrangement from her family. Lacking love and security, she is cautious in choosing a marriage partner and meets three suitors: Ling Buyi, the emperor''s adopted son; Yuan Shen, a talented figure from Bailu Mountain; and Lou Yao, an aristocrat. Despite a rocky path to love, Shaoshang remains steadfast. Her involvement with Ling Buyi leads them into a mystery surrounding his family and identity and together they confront a national crisis, growing through their experiences and upholding their ideals.', 'Cheng Shaoshang, left behind by her parents who went off to war, faces challenges from a scheming aunt and struggles with estrangement from her family. Lacking love and security, she is cautious in choosing a marriage partner and meets three suitors: Ling Buyi, the emperor''s adopted son; Yuan Shen, a talented figure from Bailu Mountain; and Lou Yao, an aristocrat. Despite a rocky path to love, Shaoshang remains steadfast. Her involvement with Ling Buyi leads them into a mystery surrounding his family and identity and together they confront a national crisis, growing through their experiences and upholding their ideals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yrFtRnriHMa4qOkAuXzo7jcXQmp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137870'),
  ('797644465657066840', 'Love Like White Jade', 2021, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'wangyo, pangwoo', null, 'Wan Peng, Zhang Yao, Liu Yuhan, Yu Ting''er, Ye Ke''er, Yun Xiang, Zhu Tingchen, Wang Jiayu', null, 'Shui Wuxia, a spirited maid, and Jiang Baiyu, a carefree heir, are brought together by fate as they each pursue answers to personal mysteries. Her search for a lost brother and his investigation into his father’s death lead them to uncover a dangerous conspiracy threatening their homeland, forcing them to unite against a common enemy to restore peace.', 'Shui Wuxia, a spirited maid, and Jiang Baiyu, a carefree heir, are brought together by fate as they each pursue answers to personal mysteries. Her search for a lost brother and his investigation into his father’s death lead them to uncover a dangerous conspiracy threatening their homeland, forcing them to unite against a common enemy to restore peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wjZ80sfVNXlJiykeJZ4QIVfErCc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:123128'),
  ('1019075869329662827', 'Love Live! Nijigasaki High School Idol Club', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Hinaki Yano, Aguri Oonishi, Mayu Sagara, Kaori Maeda, Miyu Kubota, Natsumi Murakami, Akari Kito, Tomori Kusunoki', 'TV-14', 'Nijigasaki High School is located in Odaiba, Tokyo. The school is popular due to its free school style and diverse majors. The story centers on the members of school idol club in Nijigasaki, and their attempt to prevent the club from being abolished.', 'Nijigasaki High School is located in Odaiba, Tokyo. The school is popular due to its free school style and diverse majors. The story centers on the members of school idol club in Nijigasaki, and their attempt to prevent the club from being abolished.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eMQbS9A6ly7y3VkbxgRKIXuO3jc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:103511'),
  ('607862039812103524', 'Love Live! School Idol Project', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Emi Nitta, Suzuko Mimori, Aya Uchida, Pile, Yurika Kubo, Riho Iida, Yoshino Nanjo, Aina Kusuda', 'TV-14', 'Otonokizaka High School is planning to close within three years. However, nine female students come together with one thing in mind—form a pop idol group to revive the school’s popularity and keep it from shutting down. ''In order to protect our beloved school, there’s only one thing we can do...become pop stars!''', 'Otonokizaka High School is planning to close within three years. However, nine female students come together with one thing in mind—form a pop idol group to revive the school’s popularity and keep it from shutting down. ''In order to protect our beloved school, there’s only one thing we can do...become pop stars!''', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xEAZIGmMuBVR3japyKHz9QgxEmr.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:53721'),
  ('1083764244566063437', 'Love Live! Sunshine!!', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Anju Inami, Rikako Aida, Nanaka Suwa, Arisa Komiya, Shuka Saito, Aika Kobayashi, Kanako Takatsuki, Aina Suzuki', null, 'Uranohoshi Girls’ High School, a private school in the seaside neighborhood of Uchiura at Numazu city, Shizuoka prefecture. A small high school in a corner of Suruga Bay, it is home to nine teens, led by second-year student Chika Takami, driven by one seriously big dream: To become the next generation of bright, sparkling “school idols”! As long as we don’t give up, any dream can come true... All we have to do now is keep pushing hard for fame and glory! Now their “School Idol Project” begins to make their dreams come true!', 'Uranohoshi Girls’ High School, a private school in the seaside neighborhood of Uchiura at Numazu city, Shizuoka prefecture. A small high school in a corner of Suruga Bay, it is home to nine teens, led by second-year student Chika Takami, driven by one seriously big dream: To become the next generation of bright, sparkling “school idols”! As long as we don’t give up, any dream can come true... All we have to do now is keep pushing hard for fame and glory! Now their “School Idol Project” begins to make their dreams come true!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bur79VHvAZKFzeDGeEfpoPtTQFi.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:65383'),
  ('255327896075538174', 'Love Makes Us Cry', 2019, 'Drama', 'Yelda Eroğlu, Yeşim Çıtak', 'Yelda Eroğlu', 'Deniz Can Aktaş, Hafsanur Sancaktutan, Yağız Can Konyalı, Pelin Öztekin, Eda Şölenci, Oktay Çubuk, Sezin Bozacı, Durul Bazan', null, 'Young people who migrated from the provinces to Istanbul and tried to survive alone; it is the story of the conflict between their conscience and their love.', 'Young people who migrated from the provinces to Istanbul and tried to survive alone; it is the story of the conflict between their conscience and their love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oUZTOftDBESb4jAKwe1PUVVhojA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93409'),
  ('187858282897806001', 'Love Mate', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Cho Han-gyeol, Cho Hyun-min, Lee Sae-bom, Lee Chan-woo, Im So Young', null, 'Ha-ram, a new hire at a production company, falls in love with his team leader Yi-joon, at first sight. Ha-ram, who is used to getting all the attention, is surprised to find out that Yi-joon is not easily swayed.', 'Ha-ram, a new hire at a production company, falls in love with his team leader Yi-joon, at first sight. Ha-ram, who is used to getting all the attention, is surprised to find out that Yi-joon is not easily swayed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eUATlIF2zlmj28zH5jkag20e0sX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:225492'),
  ('669655335789668744', 'Love Me', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Josephine Bornebusch', null, 'Josephine Bornebusch, Johan Ulveson, Gustav Lindh, Sverrir Gudnason, Görel Crona, Sofia Karemyr, Ia Langhammer, Dilan Gwyn', null, 'Friendship, grief and romance intersect with love in the lives of three generations of people living in Stockholm.', 'Friendship, grief and romance intersect with love in the lives of three generations of people living in Stockholm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oklEEbpd6uKshdpk4aWO9SnGziH.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:94490'),
  ('793665633659503388', 'Love Me', 2021, 'Drama', 'Josephine Bornebusch', null, 'Bojana Novaković, Hugo Weaving, William Lodder, Bob Morley, Heather Mitchell, Mitzi Ruhlmann, Shalom Brune-Franklin, Celia Pacquola', 'TV-MA', 'The Mathiesons, Clara (30s), Glen (60s) and Aaron (20s), find themselves at an emotional crossroads following an unexpected event that changes their lives forever.', 'The Mathiesons, Clara (30s), Glen (60s) and Aaron (20s), find themselves at an emotional crossroads following an unexpected event that changes their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHeLDWexDAjxRALv4Yi0oaT0UCB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:139628'),
  ('429445717430204560', 'Love Me', 2025, 'Drama', null, 'Park Eun-young, Park Hee-kwon', 'Seo Hyun-jin, You Chea-myung, Lee Si-woo, Yoon Se-a, DAHYUN, Chang Ryul, Jang Hye-jin, Oh Dong-min', null, 'An OB-GYN who seems to have it all hides the pain of running away from her family after a tragic accident, until a man who sees through her loneliness enters her life and changes everything.', 'An OB-GYN who seems to have it all hides the pain of running away from her family after a tragic accident, until a man who sees through her loneliness enters her life and changes everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shWlvBzpGEAX6Sn2a3btqztOqXG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:275989'),
  ('348066600742550985', 'Love Me If You Dare', 2015, 'Mystery, Comedy, Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Wallace Huo, Ma Sichun, Zhang Luyi, Wang Kai, Zhang Lingzhi, Liu Yijun, Matt William Knowles', null, 'Getting inside the head of a violent criminal is not easy. But Simon Bo, a brilliant criminal psychologist, has the ability to get into the minds of even the most mysterious and violent criminals. He’s a professor at The University of Maryland and works as an analyst and advisor on the police department’s most violent or difficult cases. With the help of his young assistant, Jenny Jian, Simon delves into the thoughts and intentions of the criminal mind. As the daughter of a veteran police investigator with a deep sense of justice, can Jenny help Simon open up emotionally as they work together to solve crimes?', 'Getting inside the head of a violent criminal is not easy. But Simon Bo, a brilliant criminal psychologist, has the ability to get into the minds of even the most mysterious and violent criminals. He’s a professor at The University of Maryland and works as an analyst and advisor on the police department’s most violent or difficult cases. With the help of his young assistant, Jenny Jian, Simon delves into the thoughts and intentions of the criminal mind. As the daughter of a veteran police investigator with a deep sense of justice, can Jenny help Simon open up emotionally as they work together to solve crimes?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xfHBGNSTDxIfW7XaOpWkbzml8Ql.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64174'),
  ('608003425160677004', 'Love Me Or Leave Me', 2012, 'Drama', 'Fang Xiao Ren, Rung Jiun Yi', '葉鳳英', 'Esther Huang, Lee Kang-i, Hsu Wei-ning, Alan Kuo, Chris Wang, Jessica C.N. Hung', null, 'When a marriage-phobic woman hires a seductress to test how faithful her eager-to-wed boyfriend is, her plan takes an unexpected turn.', 'When a marriage-phobic woman hires a seductress to test how faithful her eager-to-wed boyfriend is, her plan takes an unexpected turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/woaWJffZc0QzUr28L6RJPGiC9pK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46591'),
  ('924680401381082303', 'Love Me, Love My Voice', 2023, 'Drama', 'Mobao Feibao', null, 'Tan Jianci, Zhou Ye, Hou Wenyuan, Yang Xizi, Vincent Cao, Chen Haolan, Liu Zhehui, Xia Ningjun', null, 'The story revolves around Gu Sheng, a music-loving senior college student who perseveres in pursuing her dreams while silently maintaining another hidden identity as a low-profile figure in the traditional music circle known as "Sheng Sheng Man". She yearns for an opportunity to collaborate with her crush, a renowned figure in the voice-acting community called "Qiang Qing Ci". By a stroke of serendipity, she crosses paths with Mo Qingcheng, who is actually "Qiang Qing Ci", during an event. With the help of Gu''s best friend, their distance gradually closes. Subsequently, Mo Qingcheng uses delectable cuisine and his captivating voice, slowly initiating a plan to win her heart. By the time Gu Sheng realizes it, she has already fallen into the sweet trap set by Mo Qingcheng.', 'The story revolves around Gu Sheng, a music-loving senior college student who perseveres in pursuing her dreams while silently maintaining another hidden identity as a low-profile figure in the traditional music circle known as "Sheng Sheng Man". She yearns for an opportunity to collaborate with her crush, a renowned figure in the voice-acting community called "Qiang Qing Ci". By a stroke of serendipity, she crosses paths with Mo Qingcheng, who is actually "Qiang Qing Ci", during an event. With the help of Gu''s best friend, their distance gradually closes. Subsequently, Mo Qingcheng uses delectable cuisine and his captivating voice, slowly initiating a plan to win her heart. By the time Gu Sheng realizes it, she has already fallen into the sweet trap set by Mo Qingcheng.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xhL22LrmlKQXUvBH7dTEAghcDbI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:230250'),
  ('1085686357857428813', 'Love Mechanics', 2022, 'Drama, Soap', 'Faddist', null, 'Anan Wong, Wanarat Ratsameerat, Ratchapat Worrasarn, Veerinsara Tangkitsuvanich, Kanidsorn Laiwrakoran, Nathadej Pititranun, Supitcha Limsommut, Thamrong Cunpisut', null, 'Vee has a girlfriend. Mark has feelings. One moment changes everything, and now they must face what love really means.', 'Vee has a girlfriend. Mark has feelings. One moment changes everything, and now they must face what love really means.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ahCX6yRk5rtk2r1rmJt3C8z5Ijb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204236'),
  ('569115594747936888', 'Love Naggers', 2018, 'Talk, Reality', null, '고민정, 김아영', 'Kwak Jung-eun, Joo Woo-jae, Seo Jang-hoon, Han Hye-jin, Kim Sook', null, 'From the quirky to the scandalous, any relationship is fair game for a panel of love experts who comb over text messages and revel in reenactments.', 'From the quirky to the scandalous, any relationship is fair game for a panel of love experts who comb over text messages and revel in reenactments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5CxwFNv9YVk1YyAkzbyXAMplbfX.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:100064'),
  ('1046169023785900707', 'Love Never Fails', 2025, 'Drama', 'Shu Ke', null, 'Liu Xueyi, Hu Yixuan, Ao Ruipeng, Xu Xiaonuo, Yang Lin, Jing Yanjun, Wang Shimeng, Pan Feiyang', null, 'High deity Jin Xiu sets out to help the camellia spirit Hong Ning achieve immortality, but their journey forges a bond that spans a thousand years—until, in a twist of fate, Hong Ning leads Jin Xiu to embrace life as a mortal.', 'High deity Jin Xiu sets out to help the camellia spirit Hong Ning achieve immortality, but their journey forges a bond that spans a thousand years—until, in a twist of fate, Hong Ning leads Jin Xiu to embrace life as a mortal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5NuazyT2UPHBc02B7yIKL0Ll9z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204160'),
  ('904831762247364367', 'Love Never Lies', 2021, 'Reality', null, null, 'Mónica Naranjo', null, 'Six couples are subjected to an eye-scanning lie detector in this reality show where lies cost money, and truth and trust come with a juicy cash prize.', 'Six couples are subjected to an eye-scanning lie detector in this reality show where lies cost money, and truth and trust come with a juicy cash prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7a8NTZcTiEgImlHg4haGan3rIuD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138400'),
  ('917726436399938037', 'Love Never Lies: Destination Sardinia', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'A new group of supposedly solid couples put their relationships to the test. In their pursuit of love and money, will the truth hurt or heal?', 'A new group of supposedly solid couples put their relationships to the test. In their pursuit of love and money, will the truth hurt or heal?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nyJJSdRH1NOqGBN5odRRvTZoF2B.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214302'),
