  ('495091131760988007', 'Love Next Door', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yu Je-won', null, 'Jung Hae-in, Jung So-min, Kim Ji-eun, Yun Ji-on, Park Ji-young, Cho Han-cheul, Jang Young-nam, Lee Seung-joon', 'TV-14', 'A woman attempting to reboot her life returns to Korea and becomes entangled with her childhood friend — with whom she shares a complicated history.', 'A woman attempting to reboot her life returns to Korea and becomes entangled with her childhood friend — with whom she shares a complicated history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hikbLeofw2epfaEJptSkQ6b22IV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241454'),
  ('355316527016106215', 'Love O2O', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Gu Man', 'Ou Si Jia', 'Zheng Shuang, Yang Yang, Mao Xiaotong, Bai Yu, Zheng Yecheng, Niu Junfeng, Cui Hang, Ryan Zhang', 'TV-14', 'When campus heartthrob and gaming genius Xiao Nai spots Bei Weiwei dominating a guild battle with unmatched skill and calm, he’s smitten. Determined to win her heart, Xiao Nai pursues her both online and offline, leading to a charming, slow-burn romance between two brilliant minds.', 'When campus heartthrob and gaming genius Xiao Nai spots Bei Weiwei dominating a guild battle with unmatched skill and calm, he’s smitten. Determined to win her heart, Xiao Nai pursues her both online and offline, leading to a charming, slow-burn romance between two brilliant minds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqXrBP6CRAX5FkAszdTWWHOb2bY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66776'),
  ('155673011605729249', 'Love of Kill', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Saori Onishi, Hiro Shimono, Kenyu Horiuchi, Kohei Amasaki, Tomoaki Maeno, Ayumu Murase, Masakazu Morita, Yoko Hikasa', 'TV-14', 'Two assassins face off at a certain "workplace." The cool bounty hunter Chateau and the mysterious and powerful Ryang-Ha. Chateau and Ryang-Ha become enemies after this fight—at least, they should have, but for some reason Ryang-Ha takes a liking to Chateau and begins following her around. Little by little, Chateau develops a cooperative partnership with Ryang-Ha, which gets her caught up in the struggle against the organizations hunting him down. Furthermore, that battle is related to her past as well. Why did Ryang-Ha approach Chateau? What is Chateau''s secret past?', 'Two assassins face off at a certain "workplace." The cool bounty hunter Chateau and the mysterious and powerful Ryang-Ha. Chateau and Ryang-Ha become enemies after this fight—at least, they should have, but for some reason Ryang-Ha takes a liking to Chateau and begins following her around. Little by little, Chateau develops a cooperative partnership with Ryang-Ha, which gets her caught up in the struggle against the organizations hunting him down. Furthermore, that battle is related to her past as well. Why did Ryang-Ha approach Chateau? What is Chateau''s secret past?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7xxa9SSdH9pWkysGyQ9FomEsyZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114396'),
  ('829003542135526095', 'Love of Life', 1951, 'Soap', 'Roy Winsor', 'Don Ettlinger', 'Bonnie Bartlett, Ron Tomme, Audrey Peters, Hugh Franklin, Jocelyn Brando, Jerry Lacy, Roy Scheider, Bert Convy', null, 'Love of Life is an American soap opera which aired on CBS from September 24, 1951, to February 1, 1980. It was created by Roy Winsor, whose previous creation Search for Tomorrow had premiered three weeks before Love of Life, and who would go on to create The Secret Storm two and a half years later.', 'Love of Life is an American soap opera which aired on CBS from September 24, 1951, to February 1, 1980. It was created by Roy Winsor, whose previous creation Search for Tomorrow had premiered three weeks before Love of Life, and who would go on to create The Secret Storm two and a half years later.', null, 3, 'tmdb:tv:2872'),
  ('916493048871524528', 'Love of Nirvana', 2024, 'Drama', null, 'Xiao Lou', 'Ren Jialun, Li Landi, Xu Zhengxi, Gao Han, Zhang Yaqin', null, 'Xiao Wuxia, the young lord of Yueluo City, has been living in hiding in Liang Kingdom under the alias Wei Zhao, bearing the shame of being labeled a traitor. His mission is to uncover the truth behind his family’s downfall and capture the sole survivor of Prince Qi’s case. However, his plans are derailed by the unexpected arrival of Jiang Ci. Pei Yan takes the injured Jiang Ci into his home, aiming to discover who’s behind the disruption. As they spend time together, Jiang Ci’s innocence and Wei Zhao’s tragic past and sense of national duty spark mutual affection. In the end, Wei Zhao, Jiang Ci, and Pei Yan set aside their personal grievances to unite against the Liang Emperor, achieving their goal of protecting Yueluo City and establishing a just world.', 'Xiao Wuxia, the young lord of Yueluo City, has been living in hiding in Liang Kingdom under the alias Wei Zhao, bearing the shame of being labeled a traitor. His mission is to uncover the truth behind his family’s downfall and capture the sole survivor of Prince Qi’s case. However, his plans are derailed by the unexpected arrival of Jiang Ci. Pei Yan takes the injured Jiang Ci into his home, aiming to discover who’s behind the disruption. As they spend time together, Jiang Ci’s innocence and Wei Zhao’s tragic past and sense of national duty spark mutual affection. In the end, Wei Zhao, Jiang Ci, and Pei Yan set aside their personal grievances to unite against the Liang Emperor, achieving their goal of protecting Yueluo City and establishing a just world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2upnYbrDNb6BUNG46AN28EvcoYb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:243086'),
  ('335906208491523702', 'Love of Sage', 2016, 'Drama', null, null, 'Miho Nakayama, Saki Takaoka, Ryo Ryusei, Yōsuke Asari, Reiko Kusamura, Mayumi Asaka, Himeka Asami, Miku Uehara', null, 'A woman has trained her ex-best friend''s son to be her sexual slave for 20 years because her best friend stole her first love. What was meant to be revenge. Ending will come with great impact.', 'A woman has trained her ex-best friend''s son to be her sexual slave for 20 years because her best friend stole her first love. What was meant to be revenge. Ending will come with great impact.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qzXSqcAEf3oEBlDPOqOnROR9hNj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68785'),
  ('719699290554268277', 'Love of the Divine Tree', 2025, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kuang Shang Jia Kuang', 'Liu Fang', 'Deng Wei, Xiang Hanzhi, Chen Xinhai, Zhang Weina, Deng Kai, Cheng Zi, Cao Yuchen, Ai Mi', null, 'Su Yishui, a talented young cultivator, had his destiny changed by his master Mu Qingge eighteen years ago. Mu Qingge, known as the "female demon," was also branded with a bad reputation and presumed dead. Eighteen years later, Mu Qingge transforms into Xue Ranran, and Su Yishui, now the head of the West Mountain Sect, takes the critically ill Ranran as his disciple, vowing to protect her for life. Thus, the roles of master and disciple are swapped, and various amusing and unusual stories unfold between them.', 'Su Yishui, a talented young cultivator, had his destiny changed by his master Mu Qingge eighteen years ago. Mu Qingge, known as the "female demon," was also branded with a bad reputation and presumed dead. Eighteen years later, Mu Qingge transforms into Xue Ranran, and Su Yishui, now the head of the West Mountain Sect, takes the critically ill Ranran as his disciple, vowing to protect her for life. Thus, the roles of master and disciple are swapped, and various amusing and unusual stories unfold between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XRiwCvZPlx8iWGy1BWOCHRgY0a.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:238618'),
  ('46733317296967707', 'Love on the Spectrum', 2019, 'Documentary, Reality', 'Cian O''Clery, Karina Holden', null, 'Brooke Satchwell', null, 'Seven singles take their first steps into the world of dating; this uplifting four-part documentary follows young adults on the autism spectrum as they explore the unpredictable world of love and relationships.', 'Seven singles take their first steps into the world of dating; this uplifting four-part documentary follows young adults on the autism spectrum as they explore the unpredictable world of love and relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zMsuBnjsKDMUrAZ0Ey6Ux3bVtn7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:95730'),
  ('1051997432889307524', 'Love on the Spectrum', 2022, 'Documentary, Reality', 'Karina Holden, Cian O''Clery', null, null, 'TV-14', 'In this romantic docuseries, people on the autism spectrum look for love and navigate the changing world of dating and relationships.', 'In this romantic docuseries, people on the autism spectrum look for love and navigate the changing world of dating and relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7QnZq8yGLCHk4gFSsPRjAsAa4m1.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:200731'),
  ('1042468316102773596', 'Love Once Again', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ersoy Güler', null, 'Özge Özpirinçci, Buğra Gülsoy, Tamer Levent, Lale Başar, Orhan Alkaya, Nazlı Tosunoğlu, Mert Öcal, Didem Soydan', null, 'Zeynep gets married to a man whom her family does not approve and goes to the U.S.A to live there. She gives a birth to a baby boy but when her marriage does not go well she decides to return to Turkey as devastated. Fatih, on the other hand, comes from a rich family and goes to the U.S.A. to study. But, he does not find what he has expected and decides to go back to Turkey. These two people from different backgrounds come across to each other at the same flight to Turkey. They make a marriage agreement on the flight. Fatih wants Zeynep to pretend his wife because his family forces him to get married to Irem. He wants his freedom back. Zeynep, on the other hand, does not want to ask help from her family so, she accepts Fatih’s offer.', 'Zeynep gets married to a man whom her family does not approve and goes to the U.S.A to live there. She gives a birth to a baby boy but when her marriage does not go well she decides to return to Turkey as devastated. Fatih, on the other hand, comes from a rich family and goes to the U.S.A. to study. But, he does not find what he has expected and decides to go back to Turkey. These two people from different backgrounds come across to each other at the same flight to Turkey. They make a marriage agreement on the flight. Fatih wants Zeynep to pretend his wife because his family forces him to get married to Irem. He wants his freedom back. Zeynep, on the other hand, does not want to ask help from her family so, she accepts Fatih’s offer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqpRmfYwGaSzkqfmweFZoKAC0F2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62630'),
  ('516922664461846140', 'Love Once Again', 2021, 'Drama', null, null, 'Una You, Ryan Zhao, Ariel Ann, Hong Yike, Xu Xiaohan, Liu Xu', null, 'After a failed relationship, Lin Nuannuan focuses on her career, pushing love aside. Her childhood friend, Shi Guang, supports her dream, but he must choose his own path, even if it means leaving her. Along with two friends facing their own struggles with love and identity, they navigate heartbreak, ambition, and self-discovery, finding strength in each other as they chase their dreams.', 'After a failed relationship, Lin Nuannuan focuses on her career, pushing love aside. Her childhood friend, Shi Guang, supports her dream, but he must choose his own path, even if it means leaving her. Along with two friends facing their own struggles with love and identity, they navigate heartbreak, ambition, and self-discovery, finding strength in each other as they chase their dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78zcll2KVUELv19HVHRVF3owvQx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:153205'),
  ('459702092255613973', 'Love Phobia', 2026, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', '이세령', '이세령', 'Yeon Woo, Kim Hyun-jin, Jo Yoon-seo, Choi Byung-chan, Im Ji-eun, Han Gyu-min, Lee Ji-hae, Kim Ki-nam', null, 'A VR dating CEO who hates love meets a romance-clueless writer. As they clash between AI-driven passion and analog emotions, a sweet yet messy story of healing and unexpected connection unfolds.', 'A VR dating CEO who hates love meets a romance-clueless writer. As they clash between AI-driven passion and analog emotions, a sweet yet messy story of healing and unexpected connection unfolds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3hsCoGDAceyh1FnFHHLkozPNlSS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:289690'),
  ('1145035101932741100', 'Love Playlist', 2017, 'Drama', null, 'Choi Yo Ji', 'Lee Yoo-jin, Park Jung-woo, Kim Sae-ron, Bae Hyeon-seong, Park Si-an, Kim Hyung-suk, Jeong Sin-hye, Im Hwi-jin', null, 'A web-drama about young love on a university campus.', 'A web-drama about young love on a university campus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1cQuhmZfRn9jgmfFKiFEsSofqpM.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:91829'),
  ('881284465256311058', 'Love Rain', 2012, 'Drama', null, null, 'Jang Keun-suk, Yoona, Son Eun-seo, Seo In-guk, Hwang Bo-ra, Kim Si-hoo, Lee Mi-sook, Kim Young-kwang', null, 'A story of two couples'' journey of new love, loss and unexpected reunion spans decades, from the 1970s through present day.', 'A story of two couples'' journey of new love, loss and unexpected reunion spans decades, from the 1970s through present day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2L4StRHeRyqbjxTUSYPpCkzX08I.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42039'),
  ('460803765680387754', 'Love Revolution', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kwak Kyeong-yoon', 'Kwak Kyeong-yoon', 'Park Ji-hoon, Lee Ruby, Younghoon, Jeong Da-eun, Dayoung, Ko Chan-bin, Ahn Do-gyu, Kim Jung-don', null, 'Gong Ju Young is a 17-year-old high school student who thinks he has found love at school when he falls in for Wang Ja Rim at first sight. But winning her heart won’t be easy. Wang Ja Rim has earned a reputation for being cold and aloof – and, at first, seems totally unimpressed by Gong Ju Young’s garish displays of affection. But Gong Ju Young won’t be deterred so easily. Persistence is the key, he thinks – and, over time, Wang Ja Rim starts to open up to her classmate. Gong Ju Young’s best buddy since elementary school is Lee Kyung Woo. Will he prove to be a help to Gong Ju Young in his quest for Wang Ja Rim’s heart – or a hindrance?', 'Gong Ju Young is a 17-year-old high school student who thinks he has found love at school when he falls in for Wang Ja Rim at first sight. But winning her heart won’t be easy. Wang Ja Rim has earned a reputation for being cold and aloof – and, at first, seems totally unimpressed by Gong Ju Young’s garish displays of affection. But Gong Ju Young won’t be deterred so easily. Persistence is the key, he thinks – and, over time, Wang Ja Rim starts to open up to her classmate. Gong Ju Young’s best buddy since elementary school is Lee Kyung Woo. Will he prove to be a help to Gong Ju Young in his quest for Wang Ja Rim’s heart – or a hindrance?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4rgpfZWUD6hWNyObxuf1Anu88K.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108290'),
  ('913208292066119480', 'Love Scene Number', 2021, 'Drama', null, null, null, null, 'Four women each come to a crossroads in life and love. Du Ah is a 23-year-old university student involved in a polyamorous relationship. An elementary school teacher, Ha Ram is in her late twenties and feeling a change of heart right before her wedding day. At 35, Ban Ya, an adjunct instructor, questions whether her ‘pretend relationship’ is transforming into something real. Chung Kyung, a furniture designer in her forties, discovers her husband is having an affair. The four women, each going through a different turning point in their lives, contemplate what they truly want from dating and love. What does ‘love’ mean to each of them?', 'Four women each come to a crossroads in life and love. Du Ah is a 23-year-old university student involved in a polyamorous relationship. An elementary school teacher, Ha Ram is in her late twenties and feeling a change of heart right before her wedding day. At 35, Ban Ya, an adjunct instructor, questions whether her ‘pretend relationship’ is transforming into something real. Chung Kyung, a furniture designer in her forties, discovers her husband is having an affair. The four women, each going through a different turning point in their lives, contemplate what they truly want from dating and love. What does ‘love’ mean to each of them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/czyWbfNCjmj2Drbj11rXuCdijzQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117783'),
  ('1140456784073565505', 'Love Scenery', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Xu Lu, Lin Yi, Hu Bing, Hu Yunhao, Danni Chong', null, 'The story revolves around a professional gamer who falls in love with a singer five years older than him.', 'The story revolves around a professional gamer who falls in love with a singer five years older than him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9MQkYTrF5mWm1oxUzUNXFxJjziq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100962'),
  ('960196267389915284', 'Love Scout', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', '함준호, 지은', '지은, Kim Ji-eun', 'Han Ji-min, Lee Jun-hyuk, Kim Do-hoon, Kim Yoon-hye, Park Bo-kyung, Gi So-you, Lee Sang-hee, Heo Dong-won', null, 'Yoo Eun-ho, a single dad armed with perfection, becomes the secretary of Kang Ji-yun, the CEO of a popular headhunter company, who doesn''t do anything except work.', 'Yoo Eun-ho, a single dad armed with perfection, becomes the secretary of Kang Ji-yun, the CEO of a popular headhunter company, who doesn''t do anything except work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aP1jTGlKmlUpx21pQPYGYagEKA8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233100'),
  ('701543436190661844', 'Love Sea', 2024, 'Drama', 'MAME', null, 'Wasuthorn Chaijindar, Thitipong Sangngey, Chanya Amarit Duval, Orapan Phongmaykin', null, 'Tongrak, a romance novelist, meets Mahasamut, a quirky southern man, during his travels. Their unexpected encounter leaves Tongrak captivated.', 'Tongrak, a romance novelist, meets Mahasamut, a quirky southern man, during his travels. Their unexpected encounter leaves Tongrak captivated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nV6AWBI0aCN41rx6vFdwaAmmoPl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:236300'),
  ('239322412055879847', 'Love Shuffle', 2009, 'Drama', 'Daisuke Yamamuro, Nobuhiro Doi, Toshio Tsuboi', null, 'Karina, Hiroshi Tamaki, Yuriko Yoshitaka, Shota Matsuda, Shosuke Tanihara, Hijiri Kojima, Shihori Kanjiya', null, 'Love Shuffle is a Japanese television drama series that aired on TBS from 16 January to 20 March 2009. The theme song of the series is Fantasy by Earth, Wind &amp; Fire. Usami Kei is a salaryman who has risen in status due to his engagement with Mei, the wealthy daughter of his company''s president. Shortly after she breaks off the engagement, a power failure leaves him stuck in the elevator of his apartment building. Trapped with him are three others living on the same floor - Airu, a trilingual interpreter, Ojiro, a model photographer, and Masato, a psychiatrist. While waiting, their conversation hits upon their love lives and the question of whether there is truly only one fated partner for everyone. As a result, they decide to try "shuffling" their relationships with each other. --Tokyograph', 'Love Shuffle is a Japanese television drama series that aired on TBS from 16 January to 20 March 2009. The theme song of the series is Fantasy by Earth, Wind &amp; Fire. Usami Kei is a salaryman who has risen in status due to his engagement with Mei, the wealthy daughter of his company''s president. Shortly after she breaks off the engagement, a power failure leaves him stuck in the elevator of his apartment building. Trapped with him are three others living on the same floor - Airu, a trilingual interpreter, Ojiro, a model photographer, and Masato, a psychiatrist. While waiting, their conversation hits upon their love lives and the question of whether there is truly only one fated partner for everyone. As a result, they decide to try "shuffling" their relationships with each other. --Tokyograph', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djaqvL4MkLiOXgcnhWUAjeprhDw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:41756'),
  ('950908958690051168', 'Love Sick', 2014, 'Drama', 'Latika Chumpoo', null, 'Nawat Phumphothingam, Chonlathorn Kongyingyong , Anupart Luangsodsai, Veerakarn Puvapiromquan, Nontapan Chuenwarin, Primrose Chindavanich, Pannin Charnmanoon, Nungira Hanwutinanon', null, 'Punn has a girlfriend, but his father wants him to date his friend''s daughter. Punn''s little sister, Pang, is obsessed with boys'' love. Punn''s father doesn''t listen to Punn well but adores his little sister Pang. So Punn needs to convince Pang that he has a boyfriend so that she can help talk their father out of the idea of dating his friend''s daughter. Noh is in need of a higher school budget for his school club, or he will be in huge trouble. Punn knowing he is able to help Noh out with his problem, decides to ask Noh to become his fake boyfriend in exchange for helping Noh raise funds for his Music Club. However, the two 17-year-old high school boys eventually fall in love after the deal brings them closer together.', 'Punn has a girlfriend, but his father wants him to date his friend''s daughter. Punn''s little sister, Pang, is obsessed with boys'' love. Punn''s father doesn''t listen to Punn well but adores his little sister Pang. So Punn needs to convince Pang that he has a boyfriend so that she can help talk their father out of the idea of dating his friend''s daughter. Noh is in need of a higher school budget for his school club, or he will be in huge trouble. Punn knowing he is able to help Noh out with his problem, decides to ask Noh to become his fake boyfriend in exchange for helping Noh raise funds for his Music Club. However, the two 17-year-old high school boys eventually fall in love after the deal brings them closer together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4E8rtgH5SvRQ3aekKyOh2rqJO5b.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:72903'),
  ('389548468846882210', 'Love Song for Illusion', 2024, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Vanziun', 'Yun Gyeong-a', 'Park Ji-hoon, Hong Ye-ji, Hwang Hee, Ji Woo, Kim Dong-won, Shin Gi-hwan, Woo Hee-jin, Han Eun-seong', null, 'The heart-fluttering love story and the fierce obsession between a man with two conflicting personalities and a woman who loves him.', 'The heart-fluttering love story and the fierce obsession between a man with two conflicting personalities and a woman who loves him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rf7TJ5RPRogtgvossPLFhVsdgQ8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:226107'),
  ('981173369669310656', 'Love Song in Winter', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Johnny Huang, Sun Qian, Guan Zijing, Xiao Kaizhong, Shi Shi, Wang Tianchen', null, 'Since the anesthesiologist Lu Yan “runs into” her dead college friend Deng Man during a night shift, strange things around her occur successively. As the investigation proceeds, the detective Jiang Chengyi, Lu Yan’s ex-boyfriend from many years ago, is embroiled in it, and the long-hidden truth of eight years is gradually revealed.', 'Since the anesthesiologist Lu Yan “runs into” her dead college friend Deng Man during a night shift, strange things around her occur successively. As the investigation proceeds, the detective Jiang Chengyi, Lu Yan’s ex-boyfriend from many years ago, is embroiled in it, and the long-hidden truth of eight years is gradually revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/73FWssGQ7eKrWIrPMJ0MBoQ0T45.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:243028'),
  ('867620271643583384', 'Love Spells', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Fernanda Eguiarte', null, 'Gabriela de la Garza, Nicole de Albornoz, Hugo Catalán, Alicia Jaziz Zapién, Juan Pablo Medina, Regina Flores Ribot, Martín Saracho', 'TV-MA', 'Faced with mounting financial issues, Ana finally decides to tap into her magical ancestry to keep her family together only to discover that meddling in the love affairs of others makes life even more complicated.', 'Faced with mounting financial issues, Ana finally decides to tap into her magical ancestry to keep her family together only to discover that meddling in the love affairs of others makes life even more complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/inkdLEQJepgncq4KuALnWH6JHNz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129490'),
  ('930691658931503917', 'Love Stage!!', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'DAIGO, Tsubasa Yonaga, Daisuke Hirakawa, Takuya Eguchi', 'TV-MA', 'Izumi was born in a family of celebrities. His father is a singer, his mother an artist, his older brother the lead vocalist for the popular band Crashers. Izumi himself, however, is just a nerdy college student. He loves the manga "Magical Girl Lala Lulu" and dreams of becoming a manga writer himself. One day he is roped into filming a commercial where he wears a dress. Another actor on the set, Ryoma Ichijo, mistakes him for a woman and falls in love at first sight. As it turns out, though, they met ten years in the past. And Ryoma feelings don''t change when he finds out Izumi is a boy.', 'Izumi was born in a family of celebrities. His father is a singer, his mother an artist, his older brother the lead vocalist for the popular band Crashers. Izumi himself, however, is just a nerdy college student. He loves the manga "Magical Girl Lala Lulu" and dreams of becoming a manga writer himself. One day he is roped into filming a commercial where he wears a dress. Another actor on the set, Ryoma Ichijo, mistakes him for a woman and falls in love at first sight. As it turns out, though, they met ten years in the past. And Ryoma feelings don''t change when he finds out Izumi is a boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/drudqRieOKYqv66EISTSpT1v1t4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61534'),
  ('709030531871671635', 'Love Starts With Marriage', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Jiao Keran, Han Jihui', null, 'Gu Chengze and Xia Qiange were once total strangers. But, after an unexpected encounter, they embark on a journey of stereotying each other at first, then dropping prejudices and getting to know each other, and finally becoming the other''s choice of heart. Xia Qiange was once reluctant to pursue a new personal life due to a deep sense of responsibility and duty. However, her inner self has been awakened by his expressive nature and pursuit of a better life and career. After repeated setbacks, she''s kept on fighting and is finally on the verge of breaking the shackles of an imposed fate.', 'Gu Chengze and Xia Qiange were once total strangers. But, after an unexpected encounter, they embark on a journey of stereotying each other at first, then dropping prejudices and getting to know each other, and finally becoming the other''s choice of heart. Xia Qiange was once reluctant to pursue a new personal life due to a deep sense of responsibility and duty. However, her inner self has been awakened by his expressive nature and pursuit of a better life and career. After repeated setbacks, she''s kept on fighting and is finally on the verge of breaking the shackles of an imposed fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jcdUgTDJMtfRCHjQohHZZ0rYVcz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:205119'),
  ('495734749575699597', 'Love Stories in the Countryside', 2006, 'Family, Comedy', null, null, 'Tang Jianjun, Wang Xiaoli, Liu Xiaoguang, Cai Weili, He Shufeng, Zhao Haiyan, Jiang Yishan, Wu Yunfei', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2XlU2bzsESbc6x9lBKe0gyk90oO.jpg', 18, 'tmdb:tv:49036'),
  ('781968438028467403', 'Love Story', 2026, 'Drama', 'Connor Hines', null, 'Sarah Pidgeon, Paul Anthony Kelly, Grace Gummer', 'TV-MA', 'An anthology of sweeping true love stories that captured the world’s attention.', 'An anthology of sweeping true love stories that captured the world’s attention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WU3cXD0rip5ONc7owI2dBWAVjW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:131142'),
  ('888239407610228', 'Love Story in the 1970s', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Arthur Chen, Sun Qian, Guo Xiaoting, Wang Tianchen, Simon Shi, Xia Haoran, Li Shuman, Guo Weijie', null, 'In 1970s China, Fei Ni, a hardworking factory girl, enters a fake marriage with Fang Muyang to secure housing and chase her dream of attending college. Through shared struggles and quiet moments, their bond deepens into real love as they pursue a brighter future together.', 'In 1970s China, Fei Ni, a hardworking factory girl, enters a fake marriage with Fang Muyang to secure housing and chase her dream of attending college. Through shared struggles and quiet moments, their bond deepens into real love as they pursue a brighter future together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oHJEOqCThfhyLthWV9NldZketwU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:287760'),
  ('38846684501832848', 'Love Strikes!', 2010, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Lily Franky, Hikari Mitsushima, Mirai Moriyama, Maho Nonami, Rio Matsumoto, Rinko Kikuchi, Hirofumi Arai, Lily Franky', null, 'Moriyama plays a temp worker who has never had any luck with women. One day, he suddenly starts getting invitations from several beautiful women, and he finds himself confused about how to deal with this new experience of having a "moteki" (a period when one is very popular and attractive to others).', 'Moriyama plays a temp worker who has never had any luck with women. One day, he suddenly starts getting invitations from several beautiful women, and he finds himself confused about how to deal with this new experience of having a "moteki" (a period when one is very popular and attractive to others).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oL7AlbzjNbXHVOwU9gV0Pcht92X.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45384'),
  ('1017988087804803122', 'Love Syndrome III', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Lee Long Shi, Thanatsaran Samthonglai, Nonthakorn Chatchue, Tinwiphat Khueankaew, Parinya Angsanan, Thotsawat Singuppo, Chindanai Dechawaleekul, Puinitas Thomrong', null, 'An unexpected accident left Day with serious injuries, making Itt blame himself for what happened to him. What will Itt do when Day wakes up with no memory at all? The person who used to be so caring and so loving has become so ruthless? Itt tells himself, "I must be patient with Day".', 'An unexpected accident left Day with serious injuries, making Itt blame himself for what happened to him. What will Itt do when Day wakes up with no memory at all? The person who used to be so caring and so loving has become so ruthless? Itt tells himself, "I must be patient with Day".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6uA0IEbCr6YScufcAGAaOBmmiwx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:216927'),
  ('991368291250123136', 'Love The Way You Are', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Li Jing Ling, Shinning Wu', 'AngelaBaby, Lai Guan-lin, Tian Yitong, Liu Yitong, Ling Meishi, Guan Zijing, Qiao Zhenyu, Zhang Tao', null, 'The sweet love story of Yin Yike and her childhood partner Xu Guangxi. Seemingly having a perfect life, Yin Yike has lived her 35-year-old life as a matter of course. Whether in the company or at home, she is thoughtful all around. Like a never-tired Wonder Woman, she takes care of everyone around her except herself. Everything changes when she meets Xu Guangxi, the young man who used to often visit her place for meals during their youth. Returning from his studies abroad, Xu Guangxi, the boy who used to just feel a sense of dependence on Yike, is now attracted to her. But chasing Yike is nothing short of a difficult feat. It entails a fast-moving life and ultra-realistic pressure.', 'The sweet love story of Yin Yike and her childhood partner Xu Guangxi. Seemingly having a perfect life, Yin Yike has lived her 35-year-old life as a matter of course. Whether in the company or at home, she is thoughtful all around. Like a never-tired Wonder Woman, she takes care of everyone around her except herself. Everything changes when she meets Xu Guangxi, the young man who used to often visit her place for meals during their youth. Returning from his studies abroad, Xu Guangxi, the boy who used to just feel a sense of dependence on Yike, is now attracted to her. But chasing Yike is nothing short of a difficult feat. It entails a fast-moving life and ultra-realistic pressure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WWAvAHc0ZS0XyHQ7vIoowi3TnG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204254'),
  ('553440907165703354', 'Love the Way You Lie', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Jacqueline Muench, Thakrit Tawanpong, Phusanu Wongsavanischakorn, Kajbhunditt Jaidee, Supoj Janjareonborn, Phatrakorn Boosarakumwadi, Apinun Prasertwattanakul, Ramida Prapasanobon', null, 'the story of Sa-ing or Ung-ing, 18 Mongkut, a beautiful girl who repented of being caught by her silly stepfather, selling her to pay off the debt of the casino owner. So she fled to Bangkok. to find a father who has never met But then fate brought her to know and was helped in the journey by Pae, a good young man before they were separated. Sa-ing therefore did not know that in fact Pae was the owner. cheating drill page A page that deals with scammers all over Thailand. until he was nicknamed crook buster Father must find this work. The enemy had to flee. Love must be resolved How will Sing get out of this crisis?', 'the story of Sa-ing or Ung-ing, 18 Mongkut, a beautiful girl who repented of being caught by her silly stepfather, selling her to pay off the debt of the casino owner. So she fled to Bangkok. to find a father who has never met But then fate brought her to know and was helped in the journey by Pae, a good young man before they were separated. Sa-ing therefore did not know that in fact Pae was the owner. cheating drill page A page that deals with scammers all over Thailand. until he was nicknamed crook buster Father must find this work. The enemy had to flee. Love must be resolved How will Sing get out of this crisis?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/npKFQxsLK3OlGjV7SVb2kLBrLlz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:206731'),
  ('812173749017942375', 'Love Through a Prism', 2026, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Atsumi Tanezaki, Koki Uchiyama, Yuki Kaji, Megumi Han, Yohei Azakami, Shogo Sakata, Sumire Uesaka, Akari Kito', 'TV-PG', 'In early 1900s London, a young Japanese woman enrolls in a famous art school, only to be surprised when rivalry with a gifted classmate becomes romance.', 'In early 1900s London, a young Japanese woman enrolls in a famous art school, only to be surprised when rivalry with a gifted classmate becomes romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rB3RQpjQAnzl9NH3r8HzPkofgH8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:306762'),
  ('962600837092784926', 'Love Thy Neighbor', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Tyler Perry', null, 'Patrice Lovely, Andre Hall, Kendra C. Johnson, Palmer Williams Jr., Darmirra Brunson, Jonathan Chase, Tyler Perry, Tony Grant', 'TV-PG', 'Gun-toting Grandma Hattie has been given her own sitcom. Managing the Love Train Diner with her brother-in-law Floyd, she dishes out justice in the best way; with love.', 'Gun-toting Grandma Hattie has been given her own sitcom. Managing the Love Train Diner with her brother-in-law Floyd, she dishes out justice in the best way; with love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6tG9AQBgBT2mBDxKJVdLbQchdy.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:46431'),
  ('620313273943931708', 'Love Thy Neighbour', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Vince Powell, Harry Driver', null, 'Jack Smethurst, Kate Williams, Rudolph Walker, Nina Baden-Semper, Tommy Godfrey, Keith Marsh, Paul Luty, Harry Littlewood', null, 'Love Thy Neighbour is a British sitcom, which was transmitted from 13 April 1972 until 22 January 1976, spanning seven series. The sitcom was produced by Thames Television for the ITV network. The principal cast included Jack Smethurst, Rudolph Walker, Nina Baden-Semper and Kate Williams. In 1973, the series was adapted into a film of the same name, and a later sequel series was set in Australia.', 'Love Thy Neighbour is a British sitcom, which was transmitted from 13 April 1972 until 22 January 1976, spanning seven series. The sitcom was produced by Thames Television for the ITV network. The principal cast included Jack Smethurst, Rudolph Walker, Nina Baden-Semper and Kate Williams. In 1973, the series was adapted into a film of the same name, and a later sequel series was set in Australia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3DhWdSkq2aJAQEsBryLUHhRHPtX.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:5300'),
  ('1079371635137140562', 'Love to Hate You', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kim Jeong-kwon, Choi Soo-young', null, 'Kim Ok-bin, Teo Yoo, Kim Ji-hoon, Go Won-hee, Kim Sung-ryung', 'TV-MA', 'For an attorney who despises losing to men and an A-list actor who distrusts women, love means nothing — until they''re forced to date each other.', 'For an attorney who despises losing to men and an A-list actor who distrusts women, love means nothing — until they''re forced to date each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifOXQyDvpVnZvKq7pR8fujtbeQk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137094'),
  ('358771224155166108', 'Love To-LIE-Angle', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Amisa Sakuragi, Arisa Nakada, Minami Tsuda, Rei Matsuzaki, Mikako Komatsu, Eri Kitamura', 'TV-MA', 'When Natsuno Hanabi went back to her hometown to study in high school, she thought that she will have a new wonderful life. But Tachibanakan, the dormitory she was going to live in, was not what she expected.', 'When Natsuno Hanabi went back to her hometown to study in high school, she thought that she will have a new wonderful life. But Tachibanakan, the dormitory she was going to live in, was not what she expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9wRyJibE3SqqQUuw2o044Y3kaJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77724'),
  ('586575831177165559', 'Love Tractor', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yang Kyeong-hui', null, 'Do Won, Yoon Do-jin, Kim Do-yeon, Mike Yantzi', null, 'Rebel law student Yul escapes to a quiet village and butts heads with farmer Yechan—whose secret crush blooms despite Yul''s indifference.', 'Rebel law student Yul escapes to a quiet village and butts heads with farmer Yechan—whose secret crush blooms despite Yul''s indifference.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ukCVZdit4e3ShbDClPBwgkHoKWJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:227443'),
  ('919593281767651945', 'Love Tyrant', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Manami Numakura, Yoshino Aoyama, Kensho Ono, Yuki Nagano, Yumi Hara, Rie Takahashi, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Hochu Otsuka', null, 'A Kiss Note is a powerful notebook that makes anyone who has their name written together will instantly fall in love if they kiss each other regardless of any circumstances. This magical and very familiar item belongs to an angel named Guri whose job as cupid is to create couples. However, she accidentally writes down Aino Seiji, a regular high school student, and unless he kisses someone, Guri will die. She convinces Seiji to go kiss his crush, Hiyama Akane, the school''s popular girl who turns out has even stronger feelings for him, bordering on obsessive and psychotic. Eventually Akane and Seiji come together but not before Guri decides that she likes Seiji as well. What seems awesome to most guys becomes hell for Seiji who just wants a normal relationship with girls.', 'A Kiss Note is a powerful notebook that makes anyone who has their name written together will instantly fall in love if they kiss each other regardless of any circumstances. This magical and very familiar item belongs to an angel named Guri whose job as cupid is to create couples. However, she accidentally writes down Aino Seiji, a regular high school student, and unless he kisses someone, Guri will die. She convinces Seiji to go kiss his crush, Hiyama Akane, the school''s popular girl who turns out has even stronger feelings for him, bordering on obsessive and psychotic. Eventually Akane and Seiji come together but not before Guri decides that she likes Seiji as well. What seems awesome to most guys becomes hell for Seiji who just wants a normal relationship with girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgIoscnDeI0FZ2w360KmKEle4Rg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70883'),
  ('14716875095620307', 'Love Under the Full Moon', 2021, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ju Jingyi, Zheng Yecheng, Merxat, Zheng Fanxing, Shen Yao, Sun Yining, Jiang Shan, Zhao Xiaosu', null, 'During the "super moon" in 2011, Lei Chu Xia escaped from her murderer and travelled into the future to the year 2021. She appears in front of Xu Xiao Dong, and somehow, her existence seems to depend on Xu Xiao Dong’s presence in which they have to stay close to each other. Having no choice but to stay together, Xu Xiao Dong decides to help Lei Chu Xia recover her memory and find out the truth from 10 years ago.', 'During the "super moon" in 2011, Lei Chu Xia escaped from her murderer and travelled into the future to the year 2021. She appears in front of Xu Xiao Dong, and somehow, her existence seems to depend on Xu Xiao Dong’s presence in which they have to stay close to each other. Having no choice but to stay together, Xu Xiao Dong decides to help Lei Chu Xia recover her memory and find out the truth from 10 years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iaoi1rOtSljTiDL4jrhNCf2dqVp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129129'),
  ('485021866803283366', 'Love Undercover', 2023, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Burcu Özberk, Şükrü Özyıldız, Tuğrul Tülek, Aslı Sümen, Funda Kadıoğlu, Gürsu Gür, Mert Öner, Ilgaz Kaya', null, 'Onur Karasu is a successful intelligence agent who was promoted to head of the department at a young age and has been after Civan Koral, the owner of Turkey''s largest jewelry company. Onur, who thinks that Civan keeps the documents related to his illegal business in the safe in his house, becomes lovers with Civan''s sister Hilal in order to get in and out of the house. When he learns that Civan will move abroad, Onur makes a sudden decision to propose to Hilal in order to get the documents without letting her get away. He plans to open the safe on their engagement day and arrest Civan, who is there for his sister''s engagement. What he doesn''t take into account is Hilal''s close friend Ece. While Ece is trying to figure out what Onur is up to, her plans are upset when Onur catches her. Onur and Ece, two poles as opposite as day and night, will have to work together in a way they never wanted to.', 'Onur Karasu is a successful intelligence agent who was promoted to head of the department at a young age and has been after Civan Koral, the owner of Turkey''s largest jewelry company. Onur, who thinks that Civan keeps the documents related to his illegal business in the safe in his house, becomes lovers with Civan''s sister Hilal in order to get in and out of the house. When he learns that Civan will move abroad, Onur makes a sudden decision to propose to Hilal in order to get the documents without letting her get away. He plans to open the safe on their engagement day and arrest Civan, who is there for his sister''s engagement. What he doesn''t take into account is Hilal''s close friend Ece. While Ece is trying to figure out what Onur is up to, her plans are upset when Onur catches her. Onur and Ece, two poles as opposite as day and night, will have to work together in a way they never wanted to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8yztVe81RN9rsHU4dW0ZxX4bKgU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:49933'),
  ('114549290613955353', 'Love Upon a Time', 2026, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'littlebbear96', null, 'Radchapon Phornpinit, Siraphop Manithikhun, Thanutchon Chankaewarmon, Pongsaton Sittipan, Piamchon Damrongsunthornchai, Sueangsuda Lawanprasert, Athiwad Sanidwong Na Ayoodthayaa', null, 'A modern man is transported 400 years into the past, where he must pose as a missing criminal’s son while falling for a suspicious noble.', 'A modern man is transported 400 years into the past, where he must pose as a missing criminal’s son while falling for a suspicious noble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qoP77KkdwqrmWzRniKSXfInLfVP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217838'),
  ('843953795666023487', 'Love with Flaws', 2019, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Ahn Jae-hyun, Kim Tae-hyung, Oh Yeon-seo, Kim Seul-gi, Heo Jung-min, Min Woo-hyuk, Cha In-Ha, Kim Jae-yong', null, 'A romantic comedy about a woman that hates men with pretty face, a man that is obsessed with his looks, and how the people with flaws get over their prejudice! Lee Kang-Woo has strikingly good looks and thinks the world revolves around him. He is obsessed with his looks and enjoys it when people stare at him. He was dumped because he was ugly and gets mysophobia with appearance ever since. On the other hand, Joo Seo-Yeon grew up with three good-looking brothers and hates men with pretty face. The man of her dreams is “A man that isn’t handsome”. This TV series depicts in a pleasant way of how a woman who fought against the irrationality of lookism changes when she meets a man obsessed with his looks.', 'A romantic comedy about a woman that hates men with pretty face, a man that is obsessed with his looks, and how the people with flaws get over their prejudice! Lee Kang-Woo has strikingly good looks and thinks the world revolves around him. He is obsessed with his looks and enjoys it when people stare at him. He was dumped because he was ugly and gets mysophobia with appearance ever since. On the other hand, Joo Seo-Yeon grew up with three good-looking brothers and hates men with pretty face. The man of her dreams is “A man that isn’t handsome”. This TV series depicts in a pleasant way of how a woman who fought against the irrationality of lookism changes when she meets a man obsessed with his looks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eq4ITUNT2SJTGuUkxO2aHyGyO96.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95212'),
  ('332450215145522447', 'Love You as the World Ends', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery, Action & Adventure', null, 'Natsuko Ikeda', 'Ryoma Takeuchi, Marie Iitoyo', null, '26-year-old car mechanic Hibiki Mamiya lives with his high school sweetheart of the same age, Kurumi Ogasawara. Life together feels so natural and filled with the warmth of each other''s love. It was a happiness they expected would last a lifetime. Hibiki is secretly preparing his proposal to Kurumi when misfortune strikes. A tunnel collapses, trapping him for four days. Barely making it out alive, he discovers a world completely changed. There is absolutely no one around, communication signals are dead, the transportation network is a wreck, and the only information available is the emergency evacuation order being repeated on the radio. Everywhere Hibiki goes, he sees bloodstains. Just what happened to this town?!', '26-year-old car mechanic Hibiki Mamiya lives with his high school sweetheart of the same age, Kurumi Ogasawara. Life together feels so natural and filled with the warmth of each other''s love. It was a happiness they expected would last a lifetime. Hibiki is secretly preparing his proposal to Kurumi when misfortune strikes. A tunnel collapses, trapping him for four days. Barely making it out alive, he discovers a world completely changed. There is absolutely no one around, communication signals are dead, the transportation network is a wreck, and the only information available is the emergency evacuation order being repeated on the radio. Everywhere Hibiki goes, he sees bloodstains. Just what happened to this town?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Apui0mKGLrR1jSF4jzgEUBS4fnV.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:114905'),
  ('1003519191224743046', 'Love You Babe', 2015, 'Animation, Family, Drama, Kids', null, null, 'Qing Zu, Deng Yuting, Ying Liang, Hongyun Liu, Quansheng Gao, Lin Zhang, Na Zhao', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9MXqCBCkSJScjVhVGitcE7SEyT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121086'),
  ('958010844603763904', 'Love You Seven Times', 2023, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jiu Lu Fei Xiang', 'Miu Wenjing', 'Yang Chaoyue, Ding Yuxi, Xing Ze, Zhang Xuehan, Charles Lin, Lu Yuxiao, Zhai Xiangyang, Zhang Xiaochen', null, 'Xiang Yun was originally a cloud, but was turned into a fairy by Yue Laodian, and started working in Yue Lao Pavilion. Chu Kong is a disciple of the Uri Xingjun constellation. He strayed into Yue Lao Pavilion and was treated as a villain. Chu Kong accidentally broke Xiang Yun''s fan, so the two quarreled and accidentally messed up the red string, which led to the marriage of the three worlds. The Jade Emperor knew about the chaos, and his punishment to them was that they could not go back to heaven until after the seven lives of love, and so their story began.', 'Xiang Yun was originally a cloud, but was turned into a fairy by Yue Laodian, and started working in Yue Lao Pavilion. Chu Kong is a disciple of the Uri Xingjun constellation. He strayed into Yue Lao Pavilion and was treated as a villain. Chu Kong accidentally broke Xiang Yun''s fan, so the two quarreled and accidentally messed up the red string, which led to the marriage of the three worlds. The Jade Emperor knew about the chaos, and his punishment to them was that they could not go back to heaven until after the seven lives of love, and so their story began.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hbxq1gs6QpOoQ5o2LWJczgbot1J.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:169593'),
  ('707789451490421682', 'Love You Teacher', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Tanapon Sukumpantanasan, Pongsapak Udomphoch, Samantha Melanie Coates, Kay Lertsittichai, Ploynira Hiruntaveesin', null, 'A stern teacher who hates kids must now parent his own boyfriend after an accident leaves him with the mind of a seven-year-old.', 'A stern teacher who hates kids must now parent his own boyfriend after an accident leaves him with the mind of a seven-year-old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NEZmleIbrL7krMmZtWpl6ReuOn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278143'),
  ('283608647897693203', 'Love You to Death', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Dani de la Orden', null, 'Verónica Echegui, Joan Amargós Rubert, Cristian Valencia, Paula Malia, Claudia Melo, Julián Villagrán', 'TV-MA', 'Raúl''s world is unraveling. Marta''s unexpectedly pregnant. After a funeral meet-cute brings them together, they stumble through the chaos of life and love.', 'Raúl''s world is unraveling. Marta''s unexpectedly pregnant. After a funeral meet-cute brings them together, they stumble through the chaos of life and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/idX16kMNpuT8KZortTGwTh7SkFQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:230365'),
  ('472385499148733109', 'Love Your Enemy', 2024, 'Drama', 'Park Joon-hwa, Im Ye-jin', 'Im Ye-jin', 'Ju Ji-hoon, Jung Yu-mi, Lee Si-woo, Kim Ye-won, Kim Kap-soo, Lee Byung-joon, Kim Jung-young, Jeon Hye-jin', null, 'Born on the same day and with the same name, Seok Ji-won and Yoon Ji-won have been enemies for generations, and reunite after 18 years.', 'Born on the same day and with the same name, Seok Ji-won and Yoon Ji-won have been enemies for generations, and reunite after 18 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wCy1FYgjAXHHs1H1yKFmFib5XW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:244463'),
  ('516801577720643860', 'Love Yunge from the Desert', 2015, 'Drama', 'Tong Hua', 'Shen Zhi Ning', 'AngelaBaby, Yang Rong, Chen Xiao, Du Chun, Lu Yi, Mao Xiaotong, Su Qing, Qu Gaowei', null, 'During the Western Han Dynasty, Huo Yunge rescues a young Emperor Zhao and never forgets him. Years later, she mistakenly falls for another man, believing he is the boy she saved, only to face heartbreak. As she finds solace in Meng Jue, she becomes entangled in the treacherous power struggles of the imperial palace.', 'During the Western Han Dynasty, Huo Yunge rescues a young Emperor Zhao and never forgets him. Years later, she mistakenly falls for another man, believing he is the boy she saved, only to face heartbreak. As she finds solace in Meng Jue, she becomes entangled in the treacherous power struggles of the imperial palace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2v48DAzJ1eHos44ydufFf0XzlV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64048'),
  ('987694502316460228', 'Love, American Style', 1969, 'Comedy', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'An anthology comedy series featuring a line up of different celebrity guest stars appearing in anywhere from one, two, three, and four short stories or vignettes within an hour about versions of love and romance.', 'An anthology comedy series featuring a line up of different celebrity guest stars appearing in anywhere from one, two, three, and four short stories or vignettes within an hour about versions of love and romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSL7chmSyz6aqTebDd8qxTFlwbW.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1825'),
  ('537577328728884245', 'Love, Chunibyo & Other Delusions!', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Jun Fukuyama, Maaya Uchida, Azumi Asakura, Chinatsu Akasaki, Juri Nagatsuma, Kikuko Inoue, Soichiro Hoshi, Sumire Uesaka', 'TV-14', 'As one of the thousands of Japanese students afflicted with "chunibyo," a state where they''re so desperate to stand out that they''ve convinced themselves that they have secret knowledge and hidden powers, Yuta spent most of his middle school years living in a complete fantasy world. He''s finally managing to overcome his delusions but his chunibyo have attracted the attentions of another sufferer, and she''s decided that this makes him her soul mate.', 'As one of the thousands of Japanese students afflicted with "chunibyo," a state where they''re so desperate to stand out that they''ve convinced themselves that they have secret knowledge and hidden powers, Yuta spent most of his middle school years living in a complete fantasy world. He''s finally managing to overcome his delusions but his chunibyo have attracted the attentions of another sufferer, and she''s decided that this makes him her soul mate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1IapEqydEiGO0gCgBPVexTFbUCS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:45501'),
  ('240188698439507628', 'Love, Death & Robots', 2019, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Tim Miller', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Terrifying creatures, wicked surprises and dark comedy converge in this NSFW anthology of animated stories presented by Tim Miller and David Fincher.', 'Terrifying creatures, wicked surprises and dark comedy converge in this NSFW anthology of animated stories presented by Tim Miller and David Fincher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vL5BQvXH96cJzmNK5n7QliQxy90.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:86831'),
  ('1026821204856108869', 'Love, Election, & Chocolate', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Tooru Kitahata', 'Katsuhiko Takayama', 'Yuichi Nakamura, Eriko Nakamura, Mai Kadowaki, Asami Imai, Kaori Mizuhashi, Yuu Asakawa, Yuko Gibu, Megumi Ogata', 'TV-14', 'Love, Elections & Chocolate, is a Japanese adult visual novel developed by Sprite, and it was released in Japan on October 29, 2010 for Windows PCs. The gameplay in Love, Elections & Chocolate follows a branching plot line, which offers pre-determined scenarios with courses of interaction, and focuses on the appeal of the five female main characters by the player character. There have been two manga adaptations based on the game: one each serialized in ASCII Media Works'' Dengeki G''s Magazine and Dengeki Daioh. A 12-episode anime TV series adaptation produced by AIC Build and directed by Tōru Kitahata aired between July and September 2012. An additional episode was released on the series'' final Blu-ray Disc and DVD volume in March 2013.', 'Love, Elections & Chocolate, is a Japanese adult visual novel developed by Sprite, and it was released in Japan on October 29, 2010 for Windows PCs. The gameplay in Love, Elections & Chocolate follows a branching plot line, which offers pre-determined scenarios with courses of interaction, and focuses on the appeal of the five female main characters by the player character. There have been two manga adaptations based on the game: one each serialized in ASCII Media Works'' Dengeki G''s Magazine and Dengeki Daioh. A 12-episode anime TV series adaptation produced by AIC Build and directed by Tōru Kitahata aired between July and September 2012. An additional episode was released on the series'' final Blu-ray Disc and DVD volume in March 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1NGD9z9Zhq9wfOUF4pSOq0Blf5z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46093'),
  ('645341469140951282', 'Love, Nina', 2016, 'Drama', null, 'Nick Hornby', 'Faye Marsay, Helena Bonham Carter, Ethan Rouse, Joshua McGuire, Jason Watkins, Sam Frears, Harry Webster', null, 'Twenty years old and from Leicester, Nina moves to North London in 1982, to care for the two young boys of a working single mother, George, the editor of a London literary review.', 'Twenty years old and from Leicester, Nina moves to North London in 1982, to care for the two young boys of a working single mother, George, the editor of a London literary review.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78BKagsl5IShu5UJ7ZWBajf3SZ6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66368'),
  ('390863182813531470', 'Love, Reason, Get Even', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Murat Öztürk', null, 'Burcu Özberk, İlhan Şen, Mehmet Korhan Fırat, Günay Karacaoğlu, Zeynep Kankonde, Ceren Koç, Mehmet Yilmaz, Suleyman Atanisev', null, 'A couple gets divorced after several years of marriage. After that, the man suddenly gets rich, and life changes again when his ex-wife starts working with him.', 'A couple gets divorced after several years of marriage. After that, the man suddenly gets rich, and life changes again when his ex-wife starts working with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yL6PorZ5VuOlg5RK0SFzayem52V.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127588'),
  ('41776732869237465', 'Love, Take Two', 2025, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Yu Je-won', null, 'Yum Jung-ah, Park Hae-joon, Choi Yoon-ji, Kim Min-kyu, Kim Sun-young, Yang Kyung-won, Jo Beom-gyu, Kim Mi-kyeong', null, 'A single mom and her medical student daughter have entered an unexpected second act in their lives. A story of love that is not an end but a beginning that comes to them as they decide to live happily today instead of tomorrow.', 'A single mom and her medical student daughter have entered an unexpected second act in their lives. A story of love that is not an end but a beginning that comes to them as they decide to live happily today instead of tomorrow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a96ihrij1gaDX9J7JLsG5lFbXjM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278658'),
  ('1028787888939391436', 'Love, Victor', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Elizabeth Berger, Isaac Aptaker', null, 'Michael Cimino, George Sear, Rachel Hilson, Anthony Turpel, Bebe Wood, Mason Gooding, Isabella Ferreira, Mateo Fernandez', 'TV-14', 'Victor is a new student at Creekwood High School on his own journey of self-discovery, facing challenges at home, adjusting to a new city, and struggling with his sexual orientation. When it all seems too much, he reaches out to Simon to help him navigate the ups and downs of high school.', 'Victor is a new student at Creekwood High School on his own journey of self-discovery, facing challenges at home, adjusting to a new city, and struggling with his sexual orientation. When it all seems too much, he reaches out to Simon to help him navigate the ups and downs of high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcT1vivabBnBk0tZgVBO1I8aK75.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:97186'),
  ('605734993095381518', 'Love''s Ambition', 2025, 'Drama', 'Zhang Yueran', null, 'Zhao Lusi, William Chan, Wan Peng, Guan Zijing, Wang Yiyao, Zhong Yating, Tang Xiaotian', null, 'Renowned anchor Xu Yan and urban elite Shen Haoming appear to be the perfect couple but struggle to fit into each other’s social circles due to their differing backgrounds. When conflict arises, Xu Yan leaves, prompting Shen Haoming to realize his deep love for her and attempt to win her back. On their journey, they face challenges, shed their facades, and rediscover their true selves.', 'Renowned anchor Xu Yan and urban elite Shen Haoming appear to be the perfect couple but struggle to fit into each other’s social circles due to their differing backgrounds. When conflict arises, Xu Yan leaves, prompting Shen Haoming to realize his deep love for her and attempt to win her back. On their journey, they face challenges, shed their facades, and rediscover their true selves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iH8J36LMEYdvOlYvbBcYCK0ckpp.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:256920'),
  ('1145660866554020646', 'Love''s Rebellion', 2024, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Jing Tian, Zhang Linghe, Darren Chen, Chang Long, Qiao Zhenyu, Fan Ming, Gao Lu, Huang Haibing', null, 'Nan Yan, a skilled doctor who is forced to embark on a journey in the world of immortals to save her mother. Through a series of coincidences, she forms a mystical connection called the "Spiritual Connection Seal" with the enigmatic Emperor Ji Yang, who conceals his true identity. Nan Yan is practical and down-to-earth, while Ji Yang is aloof and mysterious, embodying the essence of a true immortal. Initially, the two dislike each other, but as they investigate Nan Yan''s mother''s illness, they become entangled in a conspiracy within the world of immortals.', 'Nan Yan, a skilled doctor who is forced to embark on a journey in the world of immortals to save her mother. Through a series of coincidences, she forms a mystical connection called the "Spiritual Connection Seal" with the enigmatic Emperor Ji Yang, who conceals his true identity. Nan Yan is practical and down-to-earth, while Ji Yang is aloof and mysterious, embodying the essence of a true immortal. Initially, the two dislike each other, but as they investigate Nan Yan''s mother''s illness, they become entangled in a conspiracy within the world of immortals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d7AiTLk8VtnzVxwAgn0z9cs5Ltg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:235505'),
  ('567707434709252203', 'Love''s Shattered Reflections', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Naphat Siangsomboon, Ranchrawee Uakoolwarawat, Tarkoon Karntip, Marilyn Kate Gardner, Louis Scott, Phulita Supinchompoo, Ekkaphong Jongkesakorn, Supachai Suwanon', null, 'Forced to take on the role of a villain, a once-good man watches his loved ones betray him and his promising future collapse into a living nightmare. Driven by injustice, he sets out to confront those responsible and reclaim what was taken—no matter the cost.', 'Forced to take on the role of a villain, a once-good man watches his loved ones betray him and his promising future collapse into a living nightmare. Driven by injustice, he sets out to confront those responsible and reclaim what was taken—no matter the cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1SXVhXOmQgx8uEIDZ6i7EvN7uqX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:318006'),
  ('839055901815898706', 'Love/Hate', 2010, 'Crime, Drama', 'Stuart Carolan', null, 'Tom Vaughan-Lawlor, Laurence Kinlan, Aoibhinn McGinnity, Peter Coonan, Charlie Murphy, Brían F. O''Byrne, Mary Murray, Nigel Mercier', 'TV-MA', 'Modern-day underworld characters Nidge and John Boy wrestle for control of Dublin''s illicit drug trade in this forceful crime drama.', 'Modern-day underworld characters Nidge and John Boy wrestle for control of Dublin''s illicit drug trade in this forceful crime drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oLnOU5wYp7I6egnI6lzAIWOqS1D.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:33273'),
  ('1052726770544697997', 'Lovebird', 2013, 'Family, Drama, Romance', 'Reşat Nuri Güntekin, Sevgi Yılmaz', 'Sevgi Yılmaz', 'Fahriye Evcen, Burak Özçivit, Begüm Kütük, Elif İskender, Mehmet Özgür, Deniz Celiloğlu, Ebru Helvacıoğlu, Pınar Çağlar Gençtürk', null, 'Tells the story of Feride, an orphaned young girl who is forced to attend a boarding school. While she visits her aunt during holidays, she falls in love with her cousin Kamran. Soon, their love grows to be mutual and intensifies.', 'Tells the story of Feride, an orphaned young girl who is forced to attend a boarding school. While she visits her aunt during holidays, she falls in love with her cousin Kamran. Soon, their love grows to be mutual and intensifies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4BjPVn2E4mG8ayaf03hrCl6p0F.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65556'),
  ('352728711901047999', 'Lovecraft Country', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Misha Green', null, 'Jonathan Majors, Jurnee Smollett, Wunmi Mosaku, Abbey Lee, Michael Kenneth Williams, Aunjanue Ellis-Taylor, Jamie Chung', 'TV-MA', 'The anthology horror series follows 25-year-old Atticus Freeman, who joins up with his friend Letitia and his Uncle George to embark on a road trip across 1950s Jim Crow America to find his missing father. They must survive and overcome both the racist terrors of white America and the malevolent spirits that could be ripped from a Lovecraft paperback.', 'The anthology horror series follows 25-year-old Atticus Freeman, who joins up with his friend Letitia and his Uncle George to embark on a road trip across 1950s Jim Crow America to find his missing father. They must survive and overcome both the racist terrors of white America and the malevolent spirits that could be ripped from a Lovecraft paperback.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fz7bdjxPColvEWCGr5Kiclzc86d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82816'),
  ('1019969490409398114', 'LOVED ONE', 2026, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Dean Fujioka, Kumi Takiuchi, Yusei Yagi, Keito Tsuna, Seira Anzai, Asuka Kawatoko, Takuya Kusakawa, Sayaka Yamaguchi', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5HTYaVD7UGo2YAvDOnsFgfqQX4i.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:315438'),
  ('538367151767781088', 'Loveez', 2026, 'Animation, Kids', null, null, null, null, 'Lonely Sumoppi and tsundere Pyonchi. This short animation, which gently depicts the slightly bittersweet and hilarious, loving daily lives of these two, has become hugely popular, especially on social media!', 'Lonely Sumoppi and tsundere Pyonchi. This short animation, which gently depicts the slightly bittersweet and hilarious, loving daily lives of these two, has become hugely popular, especially on social media!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e0zHS6ge3ZdgNCA09WsxY8ZfsHZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:318963'),
  ('691304313914221698', 'Lovejoy', 1986, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'Ian La Frenais, Jonathan Gash', null, 'Ian McShane, Dudley Sutton, Caroline Langrishe, Diane Parish', 'TV-PG', 'The adventures of the eponymous Lovejoy, a likeable but roguish antiques dealer based in East Anglia. Within the trade, he has a reputation as a “divvie”, a person with an almost supernatural powers for recognising exceptional items as well as distinguishing genuine antique from clever fakes or forgeries.', 'The adventures of the eponymous Lovejoy, a likeable but roguish antiques dealer based in East Anglia. Within the trade, he has a reputation as a “divvie”, a person with an almost supernatural powers for recognising exceptional items as well as distinguishing genuine antique from clever fakes or forgeries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d433J9jLaOI3T99mPIudkW6b9RO.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:4557'),
  ('428425530516389377', 'Loveless', 2005, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Katsuyuki Konishi, Junko Minagawa, Jun Fukuyama, Hiroki Takahashi', null, 'Twelve-year old Aoyagi Ritsuka is left with his insane mother as his only family when his brother, Seimei, is killed suddenly. After moving to a new school, he meets Agatsuma Soubi, who claims to have known his brother. Ritsuka eventually discovers that Soubi and Seimei used to be a fighting pair, whereby Soubi was the "Fighter" and Seimei was the "Sacrifice". Now that Seimei is gone, Ritsuka has inherited Soubi, who will become his "Fighter". After learning that Seimei was killed by an organisation known as the "Seven Moons", Ritsuka decides to investigate into his brother''s death, with the sometimes useless help of Soubi, along the way.', 'Twelve-year old Aoyagi Ritsuka is left with his insane mother as his only family when his brother, Seimei, is killed suddenly. After moving to a new school, he meets Agatsuma Soubi, who claims to have known his brother. Ritsuka eventually discovers that Soubi and Seimei used to be a fighting pair, whereby Soubi was the "Fighter" and Seimei was the "Sacrifice". Now that Seimei is gone, Ritsuka has inherited Soubi, who will become his "Fighter". After learning that Seimei was killed by an organisation known as the "Seven Moons", Ritsuka decides to investigate into his brother''s death, with the sometimes useless help of Soubi, along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tyVjSxK1DNJcartGLY0pbiPtBtN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21998'),
  ('325868409639942318', 'LoveLive! Superstar!!', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Sayuri Date, Liyuu, Nako Misaki, Naomi Payton, Nagisa Aoyama, Nozomi Suzuhara, Akane Yabushima, Wakana Ookuma', 'TV-14', 'Yuigaoka Girls High School is a newly established school that lies between the Omotesando, Harajuku, and Aoyama neighborhoods of Tokyo. The story centers on its first batch of students. With no history, no upperclassmen or alumni, and no reputation, it is a school full of unknowns. Five girls, among them Kanon Shibuya, have a fateful encounter with school idols. Kanon decides, "I love singing. I want to make something come true with song!" Many feelings converge upon a star that has only started to grow. The future is blank and full of possibility for these girls, and their story that everyone will make possible has only just begun. Soar with your wings, our Love Live!', 'Yuigaoka Girls High School is a newly established school that lies between the Omotesando, Harajuku, and Aoyama neighborhoods of Tokyo. The story centers on its first batch of students. With no history, no upperclassmen or alumni, and no reputation, it is a school full of unknowns. Five girls, among them Kanon Shibuya, have a fateful encounter with school idols. Kanon decides, "I love singing. I want to make something come true with song!" Many feelings converge upon a star that has only started to grow. The future is blank and full of possibility for these girls, and their story that everyone will make possible has only just begun. Soar with your wings, our Love Live!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFs2oxAjyzMu7Bx9mUJKeW3K4ym.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:106055'),
  ('541021236892817507', 'Lovely Horribly', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Park Si-hoo, Song Ji-hyo, Lee Gi-kwang, Ham Eun-jung, Choi Yeo-jin, Jang Hyuk-jin, Hwang Sun-hee, Jang Young-nam', 'TV-14', 'Philip and Eul Soon are bound by an unusual fate: one’s happiness always results in the other’s misfortune. The two start writing a drama together, and the events in the screenplay mysteriously begin occurring in real life.', 'Philip and Eul Soon are bound by an unusual fate: one’s happiness always results in the other’s misfortune. The two start writing a drama together, and the events in the screenplay mysteriously begin occurring in real life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4H7HDScnXW270yFqjk7aGquNml.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81332'),
  ('608214396417333651', 'Lovely Ladies Dormitory', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Andrea Garcia, Alma Moreno, Hershie de Leon, Tiffany Grey, Yen Renee Durano, Julia Victoria, Millen Gal, Alona Navarro', null, 'Five modern women live together in one roof as they deal with their families, career, and men and explore their colorful sex lives.', 'Five modern women live together in one roof as they deal with their families, career, and men and explore their colorful sex lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slKiK8swApBMwq9LNI2tG7nXYAw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214080'),
  ('772915666262865848', 'Lovely Little Farm', 2022, 'Family, Kids', 'Maddy Darrall, Billy Macqueen, Catherine Williams', null, 'Levi Howden, Kassidi Roberts, Barry McCarthy, Micah Balfour, Cicely Giddings, Dominique Moore', 'TV-Y', 'Nestled in lavender fields is a lovely little farm where sisters Jill and Jacky nurture and love all their animals—including the talking ones. Being a young farmer isn''t easy, but every day brings adventure and a chance to grow.', 'Nestled in lavender fields is a lovely little farm where sisters Jill and Jacky nurture and love all their animals—including the talking ones. Being a young farmer isn''t easy, but every day brings adventure and a chance to grow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nd05n4FDxU4tPU4HNAd7GPbbuSa.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:201710'),
  ('535333142129007449', 'Lovely Runner', 2024, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Mystery', 'Kim Bbang', 'Lee Si-eun', 'Byeon Woo-seok, Kim Hye-yoon, Song Geon-hee, Lee Seung-hyub, Jeong Young-ju, Seong Byeong-suk, Song Ji-ho, Seo Hye-won', null, 'Right after Ryu Sun-jae, a top star, ends his life, Im Sol, his top fan, somehow ends up at a time when they were in high school and tries to protect him. A fantasy romance unfolds where people who missed each other in time finally meet.', 'Right after Ryu Sun-jae, a top star, ends his life, Im Sol, his top fan, somehow ends up at a time when they were in high school and tries to protect him. A fantasy romance unfolds where people who missed each other in time finally meet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJQyrif5M4UMoVBrBlwUabtaRxB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:230923'),
  ('256240932300976693', 'Lovely Us', 2020, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Shuang Yuan', 'Liu Yang', 'Li Mingde, Tian Xiwei, Li Mingyuan, Yingying Li, You Haoran, Ma Shuliang, Zhang Lei, Zhao Yansong', null, 'A coming-of-age story of a group of youths who grew up together. The story takes place in 2007; four children from Shu De Faculty and Staff Family Hospital entered high school together, welcoming their sixteenth year of life. They form their own clique named "No. 1992", and embark on a journey filled with dreams, growth and warmth.', 'A coming-of-age story of a group of youths who grew up together. The story takes place in 2007; four children from Shu De Faculty and Staff Family Hospital entered high school together, welcoming their sixteenth year of life. They form their own clique named "No. 1992", and embark on a journey filled with dreams, growth and warmth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h2A55gLx99zWOpFBUZ9atLODVwG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106740'),
  ('811133514279165324', 'Lovely Writer', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bundit Sintanaparadee', null, 'Noppakao Dechaphatthanakun, Poompat Iam-samang, Sirikorn Kananurak, Prarunyu Sooksamran, Wasin Panunaporn, Suppacheep Chanapai, Nirodha Ruencharoen, Nathanan Akkharakitwattanakul', null, 'Gene, a successful BL novelist, meets Nubsib, a deceptive actor auditioning for the lead role in the drama adaptation of his book. Chaos unfolds.', 'Gene, a successful BL novelist, meets Nubsib, a deceptive actor auditioning for the lead role in the drama adaptation of his book. Chaos unfolds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3BhNxkie8WGuF3909sciZPgqZG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:118285'),
  ('658681047078742602', 'Lovely★Complex', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Aya Nakahara', null, 'Akemi Okamura, Akira Nagata, Saori Higashi, Yasuhiko Tokuyama, Masaya Onosaka, Fujiko Takimoto, Yuki Matsuoka, Kazuko Kojima', 'TV-PG', 'Love is unusual for Koizumi Risa and Ootani Atsushi, who are both striving to find their ideal partner in high school—172 cm tall Koizumi is much taller than the average girl, and Ootani is much shorter than the average guy at 156 cm.', 'Love is unusual for Koizumi Risa and Ootani Atsushi, who are both striving to find their ideal partner in high school—172 cm tall Koizumi is much taller than the average girl, and Ootani is much shorter than the average guy at 156 cm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhadiTPPbM1m6eyBKwMr10CYLut.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:27167'),
  ('628273567209736284', 'Lovers & Liars', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Sema Ergenekon', 'Sema Ergenekon', 'Burak Deniz, Hilal Altınbilek, Tamer Levent, Perihan Savaş, Uğur Aslan, Can Bartu Arslan, Mustafa Avkıran, Ersin Arıcı', null, 'Ertan Aydin is one of Istanbul’s top lawyers, confident, calculating, and trained by his father to win at any cost. When his father dies suddenly, Ertan learns he was hiding a secret that could upend everything he thought he knew about himself. To protect that secret, Ertan enlists Asya, a street-smart con artist struggling to keep her family afloat. Together, they stage a dangerous deception inside one of the country’s most powerful families. Asya thinks she’s using Ertan to escape her debts. Ertan thinks he’s using her to protect his name. But the game quickly turns personal, as lies become leverage, alliances shift, and emotions cloud the plan. In a world where truth is just another trick, Ertan and Asya will learn that the biggest con may be the one they’re playing on themselves.', 'Ertan Aydin is one of Istanbul’s top lawyers, confident, calculating, and trained by his father to win at any cost. When his father dies suddenly, Ertan learns he was hiding a secret that could upend everything he thought he knew about himself. To protect that secret, Ertan enlists Asya, a street-smart con artist struggling to keep her family afloat. Together, they stage a dangerous deception inside one of the country’s most powerful families. Asya thinks she’s using Ertan to escape her debts. Ertan thinks he’s using her to protect his name. But the game quickly turns personal, as lies become leverage, alliances shift, and emotions cloud the plan. In a world where truth is just another trick, Ertan and Asya will learn that the biggest con may be the one they’re playing on themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgVgcthDQ8pYgBkKzi1AaXmmeFO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:301693'),
  ('1147062551455506238', 'Lovers Anonymous', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Başar Başaran', 'Başar Başaran', 'Halit Ergenç, Funda Eryiğit', 'TV-MA', 'Cem, scarred by a childhood that crushed his trust in love, runs the "Love Hospital" — until Hazal, a believer in the power of love, disrupts his life.', 'Cem, scarred by a childhood that crushed his trust in love, runs the "Love Hospital" — until Hazal, a believer in the power of love, disrupts his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fpZrwu2PQJMxrXvLx1C3G2hrjqw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278404'),
  ('167833090593625844', 'Lovers of the Red Sky', 2021, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jang Tae-yoo', 'Kim Yeong-young', 'Kim Yoo-jung, Ahn Hyo-seop, Gong Myoung, Kwak Si-yang, Lee Bo-hee, Ko Kyu-pil, Yoon Sa-bong, Lee Sang-un', 'TV-PG', 'Set during the Joseon era, Hong Cheon Ki is a female painter with a genius like painting talent. She is picked as the first female painter of the Dohwaseo. Hong Cheon Ki also has a beautiful appearance and a bright personality. For her, painting is everything. One day, she meets Ha Ram.', 'Set during the Joseon era, Hong Cheon Ki is a female painter with a genius like painting talent. She is picked as the first female painter of the Dohwaseo. Hong Cheon Ki also has a beautiful appearance and a bright personality. For her, painting is everything. One day, she meets Ha Ram.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lzKiEoVUTdhGDOuqNoYoL0Q1FYA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117896'),
  ('322990180762509000', 'Loves with Trap', 2015, 'Soap, Drama, Family', null, null, 'Aldo Guerra, Boris Duflos, Lorena Graniewicz, Flor Martino Bibolini, Kristel Moesgen, Ceci Flores, Jocelín Zuckerman, Itatí Cantoral', 'TV-PG', 'Los Carmona viven en el campo y su vida cambiará radicalmente cuando el gobierno les expropia su terreno y se mudan a la ciudad. En su nueva casa se encontrarán con la adinerada familia Velasco con quienes tendrán muchas aventuras. "The Carmona live in the countryside and their life will change radically when the government expropriates their land and they move to the city. In their new home they will meet the wealthy Velasco family with whom they will have many adventures."', 'Los Carmona viven en el campo y su vida cambiará radicalmente cuando el gobierno les expropia su terreno y se mudan a la ciudad. En su nueva casa se encontrarán con la adinerada familia Velasco con quienes tendrán muchas aventuras. "The Carmona live in the countryside and their life will change radically when the government expropriates their land and they move to the city. In their new home they will meet the wealthy Velasco family with whom they will have many adventures."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Gg6JYujNnHYaMz6lIKeYCejmVW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82574'),
  ('305330520311397750', 'Lovesick', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Tom Edge', null, 'Johnny Flynn, Antonia Thomas, Daniel Ings', 'TV-MA', 'After finding out he has an STI, Dylan must get back in touch with every girl he has ever had sex with to let them know the bad news.', 'After finding out he has an STI, Dylan must get back in touch with every girl he has ever had sex with to let them know the bad news.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWXx3zHzIX91VWM0oJGJtisce0Q.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:62668'),
  ('525654762232955508', 'Lovestruck in the City', 2020, 'Drama', 'Jung Hyun-jung', 'Jung Hyun-jung', 'Ji Chang-wook, Kim Ji-won, Kim Min-seok, So Joo-yeon, Ryu Kyung-soo, Han Ji-eun', null, 'Heart stolen by a free-spirited woman after a beachside romance, a passionate architect sets out to reunite with her on the streets of Seoul.', 'Heart stolen by a free-spirited woman after a beachside romance, a passionate architect sets out to reunite with her on the streets of Seoul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ylSkgVyStX0DwSF8irjQVAf2P4H.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113710'),
  ('190813627082756130', 'Lovey Dovey', 2016, null, null, null, 'Sheranut Yusananda, Nichaphat Chatchaipholrat, Thassapak Hsu, Methika Jiranorraphat, Rutricha Phapakithi, Praeploy Oree, Ingkarat Damrongsakkul, Tawan Vihokratana', null, 'When two brothers fall for two sisters, they quickly realize the age differences between them are too big to ignore.', 'When two brothers fall for two sisters, they quickly realize the age differences between them are too big to ignore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Jou8vTRZUl1AXGjxjtXKO6T8YA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69562'),
  ('779942151279381158', 'Low Life', 2025, 'Crime, Drama', 'Kang Yun-sung', null, 'Ryu Seung-ryong, Yang Se-jong, Lim Soo-jung, Kim Eui-sung, Kim Seung-o, Kim Jong-soo, Lee Dong-hwi, U-KNOW Yunho', null, 'A dangerous story of rough people obsessed with shameless greed who gather together with their own greed and logic to find underwater artifacts off the coast of Shinan.', 'A dangerous story of rough people obsessed with shameless greed who gather together with their own greed and logic to find underwater artifacts off the coast of Shinan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Gyy14N4Tdv44OtxPRADcuIIEfJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:231462'),
  ('795280048500316690', 'Low Winter Sun', 2013, 'Crime, Drama', 'Chris Mundy', null, 'Mark Strong, Lennie James, James Ransone, Sprague Grayden, Athena Karkanis, Ruben Santiago-Hudson, David Costabile, Billy Lush', 'TV-14', 'Seemingly the perfect crime, the murder of a cop by a fellow Detroit detective activates forces that will forever alter the detective''s life, and pull him into the heart of the Detroit underworld.', 'Seemingly the perfect crime, the murder of a cop by a fellow Detroit detective activates forces that will forever alter the detective''s life, and pull him into the heart of the Detroit underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x8tTZpyHY2sTmITWxjLfsYs4Ydj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:47323'),
  ('940124286594608238', 'Löwenzahn', 1981, 'Family', 'Peter Lustig', null, null, 'NR', 'Each 30 minute episode is dedicated to a separate issue or theme and consists mainly of related short featurettes, which explain, explore and educate how things of everyday life and even complex systems work. It spans a wide variety of topics from technology and industry to something as mundane as how the postal service works.', 'Each 30 minute episode is dedicated to a separate issue or theme and consists mainly of related short featurettes, which explain, explore and educate how things of everyday life and even complex systems work. It spans a wide variety of topics from technology and industry to something as mundane as how the postal service works.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qS4TNPkZycFHXQO1SpqISe6irV.jpg', 45, 'tmdb:tv:46129'),
  ('1115141453172422422', 'Lubach', 2025, 'Comedy, Talk, News', 'Arjen Lubach, Peter van der Vorst, Janine Abbring', null, null, null, 'Basically, LUBACH will probably be very similar to De Avondshow with Arjen Lubach. The presenter also discusses current affairs in his characteristic, humorous way in this satirical late night show. With sharp monologues, in-depth stories and playful sketches, he and his team examine politics, media and society. All this is interspersed with changing guests, music and of course a good dose of comedy.', 'Basically, LUBACH will probably be very similar to De Avondshow with Arjen Lubach. The presenter also discusses current affairs in his characteristic, humorous way in this satirical late night show. With sharp monologues, in-depth stories and playful sketches, he and his team examine politics, media and society. All this is interspersed with changing guests, music and of course a good dose of comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCmQM8nXdp2an1CQLcYRoaQ3rZM.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:282229'),
  ('760477295658413054', 'Lucan', 2013, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jeff Pope', null, 'Rory Kinnear, Catherine McCormack, Christopher Eccleston, Jane Lapotaire, Gemma Jones, Paul Freeman, Rupert Evans, Annabel Mullion', 'NR', 'Belgravia, London, November 7th, 1974. Sandra Rivett, nanny of the aristocratic Lucan family, is found beaten to death. Shortly thereafter, the prime suspect, John Bingham, 7th Earl of Lucan, mysteriously disappears. When the manhunt begins, the subsequent scandal shakes the foundations of the British ruling class like never before.', 'Belgravia, London, November 7th, 1974. Sandra Rivett, nanny of the aristocratic Lucan family, is found beaten to death. Shortly thereafter, the prime suspect, John Bingham, 7th Earl of Lucan, mysteriously disappears. When the manhunt begins, the subsequent scandal shakes the foundations of the British ruling class like never before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NUyxKOoaaZqGjy2D6lm1LtyEiU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61246'),
  ('127229966323089370', 'Lucha Underground', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Mark Burnett, Robert Rodriguez', 'Christopher DeJoseph', 'Matthew Kaye, Melissa Santos, Ian Hodgkinson', null, 'Lucha Underground introduces U.S. audiences to the high-flying, explosive moves of lucha libre. An ancient combat tradition, watch as good and evil wage war in a gritty battleground called “The Temple.”', 'Lucha Underground introduces U.S. audiences to the high-flying, explosive moves of lucha libre. An ancient combat tradition, watch as good and evil wage war in a gritty battleground called “The Temple.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/by1AztJ9I1gjWKPL3XdYxiFOU5T.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:61928'),
  ('664871665006163706', 'Lucifer', 2016, 'Crime, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Tom Kapinos', null, 'Tom Ellis, Lauren German, Kevin Alejandro, D. B. Woodside, Lesley-Ann Brandt, Aimee Garcia, Rachael Harris, Brianna Hildebrand', 'TV-14', 'Bored and unhappy as the Lord of Hell, Lucifer Morningstar abandoned his throne and retired to Los Angeles, where he has teamed up with LAPD detective Chloe Decker to take down criminals. But the longer he''s away from the underworld, the greater the threat that the worst of humanity could escape.', 'Bored and unhappy as the Lord of Hell, Lucifer Morningstar abandoned his throne and retired to Los Angeles, where he has teamed up with LAPD detective Chloe Decker to take down criminals. But the longer he''s away from the underworld, the greater the threat that the worst of humanity could escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekZobS8isE6mA53RAiGDG93hBxL.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:63174'),
  ('1003043394633360507', 'Lucifer and the Biscuit Hammer', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Junya Enoki, Naomi Ohzora, Kenjiro Tsuda, Azusa Tadokoro, Moeha Nochimoto, Mao Ichimichi, Tatsumaru Tachibana, Shuhei Iwase', 'TV-14', 'Everything about college student Amamiya Yuuhi is average: grades, looks and his blasé outlook on life. So what happens when he awakens one day to a talking lizard, who informs him that there is a gigantic hammer in outer space, poised to split the Earth into pieces, and requests his allegiance in the fight against the forces of evil? Pretend it never happened! Unfortunately for Yuuhi, a little bit of coercion in the form of a super-powered princess prevents him from returning to his mediocre life-as-usual. In the adventure of his lifetime, Yuuhi will join forces with the unpredictable princess and seek out a motley crew of companions to fight back against an evil mage and his horrifyingly powerful homunculus before the Biscuit Hammer destroys the planet!', 'Everything about college student Amamiya Yuuhi is average: grades, looks and his blasé outlook on life. So what happens when he awakens one day to a talking lizard, who informs him that there is a gigantic hammer in outer space, poised to split the Earth into pieces, and requests his allegiance in the fight against the forces of evil? Pretend it never happened! Unfortunately for Yuuhi, a little bit of coercion in the form of a super-powered princess prevents him from returning to his mediocre life-as-usual. In the adventure of his lifetime, Yuuhi will join forces with the unpredictable princess and seek out a motley crew of companions to fight back against an evil mage and his horrifyingly powerful homunculus before the Biscuit Hammer destroys the planet!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQP5nyfO0qNAX03rS1BDXlcXbx3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156218'),
  ('629093374551156882', 'Luck', 2012, 'Drama', 'David Milch', null, 'Dustin Hoffman, Dennis Farina, John Ortiz, Richard Kind, Jill Hennessy, Nick Nolte, Kevin Dunn, Ian Hart', 'TV-MA', 'A drama set in the world of horse racing focusing on lives of owners, jockeys, trainers and gamblers who are all tied to the same horse track.', 'A drama set in the world of horse racing focusing on lives of owners, jockeys, trainers and gamblers who are all tied to the same horse track.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ngiaLLLpGeRjww6ZagjZrg9elcg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32727'),
  ('219675474098307472', 'Luck & Logic', 2016, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Sumire Uesaka, Inori Minase, Fumiko Orikasa, Sora Tokui, Aimi, Kensho Ono, Kohsuke Toriumi, Izumi Kitta', 'TV-14', 'In the year L.C. 922, people faced a sudden crisis. In Tetra Heaven, the land of legend, a hundred years of war had come to a close. The gods who lost the war searched for a new place to live, and found it in Septpia, the human world, which they proceeded to attack. The Logicalists attached to ALCA, a special police agency whose duty it was to protect cities from assaults by foreigners (angels), were compelled to act in defense of cities, whether they wished to or not. Depending on their ability, Logicalists could initiate trance with goddesses from the other world, and stand a fighting chance on the battlefield. A civilian named Yoshichika Tsurugi, who lacked "Logic" and lived happily with his family, was caught up in an attack, and took shelter along with many people. He meets a beautiful goddess named Athena. In her hands, she had the "Logic" that Yoshichika lacked. Now both Yoshichika and Athena head to their destiny.', 'In the year L.C. 922, people faced a sudden crisis. In Tetra Heaven, the land of legend, a hundred years of war had come to a close. The gods who lost the war searched for a new place to live, and found it in Septpia, the human world, which they proceeded to attack. The Logicalists attached to ALCA, a special police agency whose duty it was to protect cities from assaults by foreigners (angels), were compelled to act in defense of cities, whether they wished to or not. Depending on their ability, Logicalists could initiate trance with goddesses from the other world, and stand a fighting chance on the battlefield. A civilian named Yoshichika Tsurugi, who lacked "Logic" and lived happily with his family, was caught up in an attack, and took shelter along with many people. He meets a beautiful goddess named Athena. In her hands, she had the "Logic" that Yoshichika lacked. Now both Yoshichika and Athena head to their destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gm4DP629PHLDVZl9X7lysAw4QdQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65211'),
  ('397625085826758405', 'Lucky 7', 2013, 'Drama', 'Jason Richman, David Zabel', null, 'Summer Bishil, Lorraine Bruce, Matt Long, Anastasia Phillips, Christine Evangelista, Stephen Louis Grush, Luis Antonio Ramos, Isiah Whitlock Jr.', 'TV-PG', 'What would you do if you won the lottery? How would it change your life? Follow a group of seven gas station employees in Queens, New York, who have been chipping into a lottery pool for years, never thinking they''d actually win. They need to be careful what they wish for, because while the money could solve problems for each of them, it will forever change the close-knit bonds these friends have formed.', 'What would you do if you won the lottery? How would it change your life? Follow a group of seven gas station employees in Queens, New York, who have been chipping into a lottery pool for years, never thinking they''d actually win. They need to be careful what they wish for, because while the money could solve problems for each of them, it will forever change the close-knit bonds these friends have formed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ryrY2yV7y1RnWpFTsNnc0dMLpCr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:51239'),
  ('853942323213960235', 'Lucky Hank', 2023, 'Drama', 'Paul Lieberstein, Aaron Zelman', null, 'Bob Odenkirk, Mireille Enos, Cedric Yarbrough, Diedrich Bader, Olivia Scott Welch, Sara Amini, Suzanne Cryer', 'TV-14', 'A mid-life crisis tale about the unlikely chairman of the English department in a badly underfunded college in the Pennsylvania rust belt.', 'A mid-life crisis tale about the unlikely chairman of the English department in a badly underfunded college in the Pennsylvania rust belt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKYPaXerPYUhmCsGlk8KlGkrIc9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210239'),
  ('22414134303667686', 'Lucky Louie', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Louis C.K.', null, 'Louis C.K., Pamela Adlon, Jim Norton, Mike Hagerty, Jerry Minor, Kim Hawthorne, Rick Shapiro, Laura Kightlinger', 'TV-MA', 'A blue-collar family man grapples with life''s challenges while trying to maintain his marriage, raise his young daughter, and deal with the eccentricities of his friends and neighbors.', 'A blue-collar family man grapples with life''s challenges while trying to maintain his marriage, raise his young daughter, and deal with the eccentricities of his friends and neighbors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f9YSKUw3rlw2AU4N3FCzrJR4bCM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4540'),
  ('413374584335758070', 'Lucky Luke', 1984, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Western, Kids', null, 'René Goscinny', 'Jacques Thébault, Bernard Demory, Gilles Biot, Jean Tolzaque, Pierre Tornade, Patrice Baudrier, Olivier Hémon, Michel Tugot-Doris', 'NR', 'Lucky Luke, with his horse Double Six, travels the Old West to right wrongs and bring evildoers (usually his traditional enemies the Dalton Brothers) to justice. "The man who shoots faster than his shadow."', 'Lucky Luke, with his horse Double Six, travels the Old West to right wrongs and bring evildoers (usually his traditional enemies the Dalton Brothers) to justice. "The man who shoots faster than his shadow."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UtiRPf8K4Y2SC36qjhKLz9qCUB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:65392'),
  ('118155827134729063', 'Lucky Luke', 1992, 'Western, Comedy', 'Terence Hill', null, 'Terence Hill, Nancy Morgan, Roger Miller, Ron Carey, Dominic Barto, Bo Greigh, Fritz Sperberg, Neil Summers', null, 'Lucky Luke is the sheriff of a merry and unruly frontier settlement. Jolly Jumper is not only Lucky’s trusty horse, but also the brains of Daisy Town. The four Dalton Brothers are the sworn enemies of Lucky Luke, who is constantly trying to thwart their devilish plans and their spectacularly clumsy escapes from the Daisy Town Jail. This fractious band finds itself caught up in a series of misadventures, crossing paths with hordes of wacky friends and fiendish enemies.', 'Lucky Luke is the sheriff of a merry and unruly frontier settlement. Jolly Jumper is not only Lucky’s trusty horse, but also the brains of Daisy Town. The four Dalton Brothers are the sworn enemies of Lucky Luke, who is constantly trying to thwart their devilish plans and their spectacularly clumsy escapes from the Daisy Town Jail. This fractious band finds itself caught up in a series of misadventures, crossing paths with hordes of wacky friends and fiendish enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xpR7HpqSyKBis2E24V2tOz4yVLO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19597'),
  ('869710988180059294', 'Lucky Luke', 2026, 'Comedy, Western', 'Thomas Mansuy, Mathieu Leblanc', null, 'Alban Lenoir, Billie Blain, Alice Taglioni, Jérôme Niel, Sébastien Lalanne, Matthieu Lemeunier, Benoît Moret, Marie-Christine Orry', null, 'Lucky Luke, the legendary lone cowboy, must team up with Louise, a fearless young woman searching for her missing mother. Together, they face the dangers of the Wild West, ally with old enemies like the Daltons or Billy the Kid - and learn to get along. This quest may reveal a far greater threat and lead Luke back to the origins of his legend.', 'Lucky Luke, the legendary lone cowboy, must team up with Louise, a fearless young woman searching for her missing mother. Together, they face the dangers of the Wild West, ally with old enemies like the Daltons or Billy the Kid - and learn to get along. This quest may reveal a far greater threat and lead Luke back to the origins of his legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bmJkUhtQ3kkHZK7nucm1JZHW9nC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259405'),
  ('299664234650726360', 'Lucky Romance', 2016, 'Comedy', null, 'Choi Yoon-Kyo', 'Hwang Jung-eum, Ryu Jun-yeol, Lee Soo-hyuk, Lee Chung-ah, Kim Sang-ho, Lee Cho-hee, Ki Joo-bong, Na Young-hee', null, 'Relying on the words of a shaman, a superstitious woman tries to sleep with a man born in the Year of the Tiger in order to save her sister''s life.', 'Relying on the words of a shaman, a superstitious woman tries to sleep with a man born in the Year of the Tiger in order to save her sister''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hH8nO4YuXMlNBJBYJ6iEmzwQqwD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66271'),
  ('39380151104182320', 'Lucky Seven', 2012, 'Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Jun Matsumoto, Eita Nagayama, Yo Oizumi, Riisa Naka, Nanako Matsushima, Kazue Fukiishi, Takuzo Kadono, Mari Iriki', null, 'Lucky Seven Rakkīsebun is a 2012 Japanese television drama broadcast by Fuji Television from January 16 to March 19, 2012. It stars Jun Matsumoto and Eita.', 'Lucky Seven Rakkīsebun is a 2012 Japanese television drama broadcast by Fuji Television from January 16 to March 19, 2012. It stars Jun Matsumoto and Eita.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mPnBkzmndJRsSz9LxTJaxifoaCU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44727'),
  ('497512322767436247', 'Lucky Star', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Aya Hirano, Emiri Kato, Kaori Fukuhara, Aya Endo', 'TV-14', 'Having fun in school, doing homework together, cooking and eating, playing video games, watching anime. All those little things make up the daily life of the anime-and chocolate-loving-Izumi Konata and her friends.', 'Having fun in school, doing homework together, cooking and eating, playing video games, watching anime. All those little things make up the daily life of the anime-and chocolate-loving-Izumi Konata and her friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s51vTFtS1kB227bj9PF9FYalMCv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42500'),
  ('469276621462674474', 'Lucky With You', 2021, 'Drama', 'Xuesong Liu, Meng Yao', 'Meng Yao', 'Wang Likun, Johnny Huang, Cheng Cheng, Wang Ce, Jiang Long, Qian Jie, Qi Jie, Jiang Qinyun', null, 'Someone has broken into Hou Jue''s house. In the face of inexplicable death threats, Hou Zhirong who worries for his son''s safety decides to hire security. While delivering some documents, Wu Shiyi accidentally saves Hou Zhirong and gets handpicked by him to become Hou Jue''s personal bodyguard. Hou Jue is immediately resistant to the idea of a female bodyguard intruding into his life. He makes things difficult for Wu Shiyi on purpose, yet she is not the type to easily back down. Over time, their relationship takes a turn for the better. Hou Jue''s father becoming more controlling leads Hou Jue to finally leave and stand on his own. Now penniless, Hou Jue sinks into depression at the drastic change in his lifestyle. Yet to find the right person in a vast crowd is a fortune of three lifetimes.', 'Someone has broken into Hou Jue''s house. In the face of inexplicable death threats, Hou Zhirong who worries for his son''s safety decides to hire security. While delivering some documents, Wu Shiyi accidentally saves Hou Zhirong and gets handpicked by him to become Hou Jue''s personal bodyguard. Hou Jue is immediately resistant to the idea of a female bodyguard intruding into his life. He makes things difficult for Wu Shiyi on purpose, yet she is not the type to easily back down. Over time, their relationship takes a turn for the better. Hou Jue''s father becoming more controlling leads Hou Jue to finally leave and stand on his own. Now penniless, Hou Jue sinks into depression at the drastic change in his lifestyle. Yet to find the right person in a vast crowd is a fortune of three lifetimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5R7dlZ6Lr5r5djqhynGF5Nu0PST.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:154105'),
  ('364741507802136679', 'Lucky!', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Manish Pandey', 'Manish Pandey', 'Bernie Ecclestone', null, 'The extraordinary story of Bernie Ecclestone''s meteoric rise from post-war car dealer to the creation and 50-year reign over the cutthroat world of Formula One.', 'The extraordinary story of Bernie Ecclestone''s meteoric rise from post-war car dealer to the creation and 50-year reign over the cutthroat world of Formula One.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z7xckuNoJowAqnWDXIeXfmL5XaA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211787'),
  ('1110826839891197681', 'Lucky''s First Love', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Xing Zhaolin, Bai Lu, Zhai Zilu, Chen Haolan, Liu Ruoyan, Huang Jidong', null, 'A story about first love and romances from the perspective of three couples in the workplace. Because of the prosperous meaning behind her name, Xing Yun is recruited by Xia Ke to work at his gaming company. In her journey from a sketch artist to a gaming designer, she experiences many extremes and jumps many hurdles in dealing with her black-bellied boss. Their continuous bickering brings them closer and the girl who has never been in love before finds that the last hurdle is love.', 'A story about first love and romances from the perspective of three couples in the workplace. Because of the prosperous meaning behind her name, Xing Yun is recruited by Xia Ke to work at his gaming company. In her journey from a sketch artist to a gaming designer, she experiences many extremes and jumps many hurdles in dealing with her black-bellied boss. Their continuous bickering brings them closer and the girl who has never been in love before finds that the last hurdle is love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wA8ARy0QWJZWLGQyURNjzDL8u2T.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94218'),
  ('603226516705575652', 'Lucy Worsley Investigates', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Lucy Worsley', 'TV-14', 'Lucy Worsley re-investigates some of the most dramatic chapters in British history. She uncovers forgotten witnesses, re-examines old evidence and follows new clues.', 'Lucy Worsley re-investigates some of the most dramatic chapters in British history. She uncovers forgotten witnesses, re-examines old evidence and follows new clues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5oP5TnB3CWb8lAg0Di5YujMPHiA.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:201857'),
  ('84427553157348652', 'Lucy, the Daughter of the Devil', 2005, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Loren Bouchard', 'H. Jon Benjamin, Holly Schlesinger, Loren Bouchard', 'Melissa Bardin Galsky, H. Jon Benjamin, Sam Seder, Eugene Mirman, Jon Glaser', 'TV-MA', 'Lucy is the 21 year old daughter of Satan in this dark comedy.', 'Lucy is the 21 year old daughter of Satan in this dark comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lb5bkQpWRJsuDxboGBVM81u5s8j.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2980'),
  ('1087924254092198372', 'Luden', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Aaron Hilmer, Jeanette Hain, Lena Urzendowsky, Noah Tinwa, Henning Flüsloh, Karsten Mielke, Stefan Konarske, Lara Feith', 'TV-MA', 'Inspired by true events, the gangster epic LUDEN tells the rise of the Nutella Gang, the most famous pimp cartel in Hamburg''s legendary Reeperbahn during the 1980s. The unusual cartel turns the rough red-light district in St. Pauli into a glamourous place, but it is also the beginning of a power struggle with the established pimps of the GMBH.', 'Inspired by true events, the gangster epic LUDEN tells the rise of the Nutella Gang, the most famous pimp cartel in Hamburg''s legendary Reeperbahn during the 1980s. The unusual cartel turns the rough red-light district in St. Pauli into a glamourous place, but it is also the beginning of a power struggle with the established pimps of the GMBH.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mGpnSPcWVa7ynIwdNmuwdGWseRh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:221483'),
  ('953758021680872585', 'Ludik', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Paul Buys, Annemarie van Basten', 'Paul Buys', 'Arnold Vosloo, Lea Vivier, Sean Cameron Michael, Rob van Vuuren, Jandre le Roux, Diaan Lawrenson, Zane Meas, Inge Beckmann', 'TV-MA', 'To save a kidnapped family member, an enterprising furniture tycoon must use his secret diamond smuggling operation to transport guns across the border.', 'To save a kidnapped family member, an enterprising furniture tycoon must use his secret diamond smuggling operation to transport guns across the border.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNdYJdE1sSACnjgWjnIJAm7lfiV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:206910'),
  ('706400951659826426', 'Ludwig', 2024, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Mark Brotherhood', null, 'David Mitchell, Anna Maxwell Martin, Dipo Ola, Gerran Howell, Izuka Hoyle, Dorothy Atkinson, Sophie Willan, Dylan Hughes', null, 'John Taylor lives in quiet solitude, designing puzzles for a living, under the nom-de-plume of ''Ludwig''. When his identical twin, James, disappears off the face of the earth, John takes over his brother''s identity in a quest to discover his whereabouts.', 'John Taylor lives in quiet solitude, designing puzzles for a living, under the nom-de-plume of ''Ludwig''. When his identical twin, James, disappears off the face of the earth, John takes over his brother''s identity in a quest to discover his whereabouts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pzLfjlJHXGsEqtaCwBLFekRSH0q.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:243360'),
  ('827445998360255908', 'Luis Miguel: The Series', 2018, 'Drama', null, 'Daniel Krauze', 'Diego Boneta, Albi De Abreu, Carlos Ponce, Juan Ignacio Cane', 'TV-14', 'The series dramatizes the life story of Mexican superstar singer Luis Miguel, who has captivated audiences in Latin America and beyond for decades.', 'The series dramatizes the life story of Mexican superstar singer Luis Miguel, who has captivated audiences in Latin America and beyond for decades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zs9nMZdCy0EzWe6ZQoVYWZJpVcm.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:79008'),
  ('434006574165848108', 'LuLaRich', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'DeAnne Stidham, Mark Stidham, Stella Lemberg, Lauren Covey Carson, Derryl Trujillo, Roberta Blevins, Iliana Estarellas, Courtney Harwood', null, 'A four-part docuseries that chronicles the unraveling of LuLaRoe, the billion dollar clothing empire accused of misleading thousands of women with their multi-level marketing platform.', 'A four-part docuseries that chronicles the unraveling of LuLaRoe, the billion dollar clothing empire accused of misleading thousands of women with their multi-level marketing platform.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nbhM0W05yLRVXu3wyhtPNwVfTyF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:131295'),
  ('1017742678075651231', 'Luna Nera', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Laura Paolucci, Tiziana Triana, Francesca Manieri', null, 'Antonia Fotaras, Manuela Mandracchia, Federica Fracassi, Lucrezia Guidone, Nathan Macchioni, Astrid Meloni, Paolo Bernardini, Filippo Scotti', 'TV-MA', 'In 17th-century Italy, a teenager learns about her destiny among a family of witches, just as her boyfriend''s father hunts her down for witchcraft.', 'In 17th-century Italy, a teenager learns about her destiny among a family of witches, just as her boyfriend''s father hunts her down for witchcraft.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ukAWA52fqoNSfkbbNB3XkKqsycz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96346'),
  ('906562818522361537', 'Luna Park', 2021, 'Drama', 'Isabella Aguilar', null, 'Edoardo Coen, Giulio Corso, Simona Tabasco, Tommaso Ragno, Milvia Marigliano, Mario Sgueglia, Ludovica Martino, Lia Grieco', 'TV-MA', 'In 1960s Rome, a meeting between a free-spirited young woman who grew up in her family''s circus and a girl of wealthy descent leads to secrets, intrigue, and unexpected loves.', 'In 1960s Rome, a meeting between a free-spirited young woman who grew up in her family''s circus and a girl of wealthy descent leads to secrets, intrigue, and unexpected loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fGABVcpMTfnvjZQ2s50DvTrCqxQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:131808'),
  ('630119385819448322', 'Lunar Jim', 2016, 'Animation', 'Alexander Bar', null, 'Bill Kopp, Joanne Vannicola, Rob Paulsen, Rob Tinkler, Ian James Corlett, Michael Cera', null, 'Lunar Jim is an animated preschool-oriented stop-motion television show produced in Canada by Halifax Film and Alliance Atlantis, and aired in the USA as well on Discovery Channel and V-Me from 2005-2012. The show is based on an original concept created by Alexander Bar. Season 1 was Executive Produced by Jeff Rosen. It was script-edited in Season one by Peter Sauder. Season two was helmed by award-winning veteran producer/writer Jed MacKay. Ben Zelkowizc provided the voice of Jim. Jim and his team; Rover the Robot Dog, Ripple the Super Space Mechanic, Eco the Farmer, and TED, the Technical Equipment Device, live on Blue Moon L22, the second-to-last moon on the edge of the Milky Way. Focusing on exploration and inquiry, Lunar Jim intends to promote such life skills as problem-solving, persistence, creativity, and cooperation, with an emphasis on "pre-science skills". His rallying cry is "Let''s get lunar!"', 'Lunar Jim is an animated preschool-oriented stop-motion television show produced in Canada by Halifax Film and Alliance Atlantis, and aired in the USA as well on Discovery Channel and V-Me from 2005-2012. The show is based on an original concept created by Alexander Bar. Season 1 was Executive Produced by Jeff Rosen. It was script-edited in Season one by Peter Sauder. Season two was helmed by award-winning veteran producer/writer Jed MacKay. Ben Zelkowizc provided the voice of Jim. Jim and his team; Rover the Robot Dog, Ripple the Super Space Mechanic, Eco the Farmer, and TED, the Technical Equipment Device, live on Blue Moon L22, the second-to-last moon on the edge of the Milky Way. Focusing on exploration and inquiry, Lunar Jim intends to promote such life skills as problem-solving, persistence, creativity, and cooperation, with an emphasis on "pre-science skills". His rallying cry is "Let''s get lunar!"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpnDP93vhqHOf8J4ISPartX5Mu7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:11960'),
  ('837962415386092434', 'Lunar Legend Tsukihime', 2003, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Mystery', null, null, 'Kenta Miyake, Akiko Kimura, Takahiro Sakurai, Kana Ueda, Kenichi Suzumura, Shizuka Itoh, Hitomi Nabatame, Fumiko Orikasa', null, 'As the result of a childhood injury, Shiki Tohno can see the lines of energy that bind all things together and by severing those lines he can destroy almost anything! Only a special pair of glasses that mute his extraordinary perceptions have kept him sane, but his attempts at living a “normal” life come to a shocking end when he is approached by a strange and dangerous woman. Now, Shiki is fighting both for his life and to unravel the secrets of his own past.', 'As the result of a childhood injury, Shiki Tohno can see the lines of energy that bind all things together and by severing those lines he can destroy almost anything! Only a special pair of glasses that mute his extraordinary perceptions have kept him sane, but his attempts at living a “normal” life come to a shocking end when he is approached by a strange and dangerous woman. Now, Shiki is fighting both for his life and to unravel the secrets of his own past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUCAzXjLXg4Zr2NP03fYtxmCYsR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13915'),
  ('117890575472535640', 'Lunatics', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Chris Lilley', null, 'Chris Lilley', null, 'This mockumentary series follows the peculiar lives of six eccentric -- and sometimes obscene -- misfits who march to their own beat.', 'This mockumentary series follows the peculiar lives of six eccentric -- and sometimes obscene -- misfits who march to their own beat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b1XdwJT0oB13MnJWaoailWuvB3Q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88366'),
  ('610127921707671133', 'Luoyang', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Ze Xie, Ma Boyong', 'Qing Mei, Qing Mei', 'Huang Xuan, Wang Yibo, Victoria Song, Song Yi, Liu Duanduan, Yong Mei, Zhang Duo, Zhang Li', null, 'Set in the ancient capital Luoyang during the era of 13 dynasties, it revolves around three people who come together to investigate a series of mysterious incidents involving the conspiracy to overthrow Empress Wu Ze Tian. Adapted from the novel Luoyang by Ma Bo Yong.', 'Set in the ancient capital Luoyang during the era of 13 dynasties, it revolves around three people who come together to investigate a series of mysterious incidents involving the conspiracy to overthrow Empress Wu Ze Tian. Adapted from the novel Luoyang by Ma Bo Yong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gvDUgJM9Jjjufa5FPJEPyffKYRD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129127'),
  ('543310409966043649', 'Lupin', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'George Kay, François Uzan, Marie Roussin', null, 'Omar Sy', 'TV-MA', 'Inspired by the adventures of Arsène Lupin, gentleman thief Assane Diop sets out to avenge his father for an injustice inflicted by a wealthy family.', 'Inspired by the adventures of Arsène Lupin, gentleman thief Assane Diop sets out to avenge his father for an injustice inflicted by a wealthy family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6Z2oogE4mJk2uffdtIlLhb0EHx.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:96677'),
  ('1109462261330774707', 'Lupin the 3rd', 1971, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kanichi Kurita, Akio Otsuka, Miyuki Sawashiro, Daisuke Namikawa, Koichi Yamadera', 'TV-14', 'Follow the exciting adventures of Arsene Lupin III, the grandson of the world''s greatest thief, Arsene Lupin. Together with Daisuke Jigen, Goemon Ishikawa and his love interest Fujiko Mine, he carries out the greatest robberies of all time, all the while evading the control of Inspector Koichi Zenigata.', 'Follow the exciting adventures of Arsene Lupin III, the grandson of the world''s greatest thief, Arsene Lupin. Together with Daisuke Jigen, Goemon Ishikawa and his love interest Fujiko Mine, he carries out the greatest robberies of all time, all the while evading the control of Inspector Koichi Zenigata.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/khfsxY7EyQsdEHzlnkn42CIjZI.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:31572'),
  ('1066483721599059985', 'Lupin the Third: The Woman Called Fujiko Mine', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Miyuki Sawashiro, Kanichi Kurita, Koichi Yamadera, Yuki Kaji, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Daisuke Namikawa, Katsumi Cho, Kanji Kodate', 'TV-MA', 'She''s a thief. A killer. A saint and a scandal. She''s whatever you need her to be to get the job done. She takes your breath away to get what she wants. She takes everything else just because she can. It''s all in a night''s work for the woman called Fujiko Mine. She''s the slinky, sultry thread that holds Lupin III''s crew together—and this is the heist that started it all.', 'She''s a thief. A killer. A saint and a scandal. She''s whatever you need her to be to get the job done. She takes your breath away to get what she wants. She takes everything else just because she can. It''s all in a night''s work for the woman called Fujiko Mine. She''s the slinky, sultry thread that holds Lupin III''s crew together—and this is the heist that started it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bavzsyxPRaR8zOXQiF1aRVNuw5k.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45860'),
  ('284020661152516304', 'LUPIN ZERO', 2022, 'Animation, Mystery, Crime, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Tasuku Hatanaka, Shunsuke Takeuchi, Yoshito Yasuhara, Toshio Furukawa, Toa Yukinari, Saori Hayami, Yu Kobayashi', 'TV-MA', 'Lupin III, a bored junior high schooler in Tokyo, takes an interest in a young Daisuke Jigen, a mysterious and impressive marksman. After striking up a conversation with Jigen at a nightclub, the latter concludes that Lupin is simply a privileged and naïve boy from a well-to-do family and doesn’t want anything to do with him. However, while helping the nightclub singer Yoko, who is being pursued by the yakuza, Jigen learns that Lupin is the grandson of a legendary thief…', 'Lupin III, a bored junior high schooler in Tokyo, takes an interest in a young Daisuke Jigen, a mysterious and impressive marksman. After striking up a conversation with Jigen at a nightclub, the latter concludes that Lupin is simply a privileged and naïve boy from a well-to-do family and doesn’t want anything to do with him. However, while helping the nightclub singer Yoko, who is being pursued by the yakuza, Jigen learns that Lupin is the grandson of a legendary thief…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zbUyE5Lc70yi88LHalRM7KFj89a.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213044'),
  ('898318891309234225', 'Lurk', 2009, 'Drama', 'Jiang Wei', null, 'Sun Honglei, Yao Chen, Shen Aojun, Zu Feng, Feng Enhe, Wu Gang, Zhu Jie, Cao Bingkun', null, 'Lurk is a 2009 Chinese television series based on a spy novel. The series is directed by Jiang Wei.', 'Lurk is a 2009 Chinese television series based on a spy novel. The series is directed by Jiang Wei.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yoCSVd0InCOTTWZNfJCw0VtErzR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21712'),
  ('173475167063650981', 'Lush Life', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Yvette Lee Bowser, Lori Petty', null, 'Lori Petty, Karyn Parsons, Fab Filippo, Sullivan Walker, John Ortiz, Khalil Kain', null, 'Lush Life is an American sitcom that aired in September 1996 on Fox. The series stars Lori Petty and Karyn Parsons as roommates who shared a studio apartment for financial reasons.', 'Lush Life is an American sitcom that aired in September 1996 on Fox. The series stars Lori Petty and Karyn Parsons as roommates who shared a studio apartment for financial reasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pLxaeQS7V7DX23HO9EdntDpCqLg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9856'),
  ('24483057958041417', 'Lust', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Frans Milisic Wiklund', 'Frans Wiklund, Sofia Helin, Åsa Kalmér', 'Sofia Helin, Anja Lundqvist, Julia Dufvenius, Elin Klinga, Amy Deasismont, Jacob Ericksson, Björn Bengtsson, Anton Forsdik', 'TV-MA', 'After her nationwide study suggests that sex is the highway to health, Anette and her three lifelong friends begin to question how to keep their own sex lives from being sidelined by careers, kids, partners, and the realities of life.', 'After her nationwide study suggests that sex is the highway to health, Anette and her three lifelong friends begin to question how to keep their own sex lives from being sidelined by careers, kids, partners, and the realities of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u5L1S1Fy0V5ilpPGTWnDiqHgHrJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155648'),
  ('1121197687178304308', 'Luther', 2010, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Neil Cross', null, 'Idris Elba, Dermot Crowley, Hermione Norris, Michael Smiley, Ruth Wilson, Patrick Malahide, Wunmi Mosaku, Enzo Cilenti', 'TV-14', 'A dark psychological crime drama starring Idris Elba as Luther, a man struggling with his own terrible demons, who might be as dangerous as the depraved murderers he hunts.', 'A dark psychological crime drama starring Idris Elba as Luther, a man struggling with his own terrible demons, who might be as dangerous as the depraved murderers he hunts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDxOMX8zzH1FiqKWVBzNaYGBkle.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1426'),
