  ('952416629046624964', 'Ma Xiangyang Went to the Countryside', 2014, 'Drama', null, 'Kai Gu', 'Wu Xiubo, Li Hongtao, Zhu Huaixu, Li Haozhen, Han Long Xuan, Yiying Liu, Gao Yuqing, Zhe Sheng', null, 'The drama depicts the life and learnings of a countryside man.', 'The drama depicts the life and learnings of a countryside man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9NLTJwtIs8XzOfbaRr20FEMGrH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93363'),
  ('546499224109240482', 'Maalaala Mo Kaya', 1991, 'Drama', 'Charo Santos', null, 'Charo Santos', 'TV-14', 'Recognized as the longest and most award-winning drama anthology in the country, Charo Santos-Concio narrates real-life stories of people with well-crafted storylines, excellent performances by its actors, and topnotch production details.', 'Recognized as the longest and most award-winning drama anthology in the country, Charo Santos-Concio narrates real-life stories of people with well-crafted storylines, excellent performances by its actors, and topnotch production details.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aXDUxPkMswvgmwWuNjkTe4UgzfL.jpg', 31, 'tmdb:tv:4405'),
  ('837914547260307234', 'Maamla Legal Hai', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sameer Saxena', null, 'Ravi Kishan, Naila Grrewal, Nidhi Bisht, Anant Joshi, Kusha Kapila', 'TV-MA', 'Chaos collides with the letter of the law at District Court Patparganj, where quirky employees work to uphold justice — but not without a few objections.', 'Chaos collides with the letter of the law at District Court Patparganj, where quirky employees work to uphold justice — but not without a few objections.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tDP5vC5wxSpHKx88RdyRpdaSo2u.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:246483'),
  ('1045238577007347795', 'Maburaho', 2003, 'Drama, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Mai Nakahara, Koji Ishii, Junko Noda, Yuka Inokuchi, Yuki Matsuoka, Emi Shinohara, Hitomi Nabatame, Daisuke Sakaguchi', null, 'High school student Kazuki Shikimori comes from a line of powerful magicians with extraordinary DNA and he attends the most prestigious school for wizards in all of Japan. It would seem that life is good for Kazuki. Unfortunately, that couldn’t be further from the truth. He’s not the most smooth when it comes to the ladies, his grades are poor, his athletic skill is next to none, and to top it all off, he can only use his magic eight times before he turns into dust! However, three magical hotties have learned of his genetic secret and are all after him! Suddenly he has become the most “popular” kid in class. Are all these girls out to romance him, or are they only after his DNA?', 'High school student Kazuki Shikimori comes from a line of powerful magicians with extraordinary DNA and he attends the most prestigious school for wizards in all of Japan. It would seem that life is good for Kazuki. Unfortunately, that couldn’t be further from the truth. He’s not the most smooth when it comes to the ladies, his grades are poor, his athletic skill is next to none, and to top it all off, he can only use his magic eight times before he turns into dust! However, three magical hotties have learned of his genetic secret and are all after him! Suddenly he has become the most “popular” kid in class. Are all these girls out to romance him, or are they only after his DNA?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDV2FsIjNrKgAXe7GKis1eqKp6Z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42442'),
  ('908330661363562032', 'MacGruber', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'John Solomon, Jorma Taccone, Will Forte', null, 'Will Forte, Kristen Wiig, Ryan Phillippe, Laurence Fishburne, Billy Zane, Timothy V. Murphy', 'TV-MA', 'After rotting in prison for over a decade, America''s ultimate hero and uber patriot MacGruber is finally released. His mission: to take down a mysterious villain from his past—Brigadier Commander Enos Queeth. With the entire world in the crosshairs, MacGruber must reassemble his old team in order to defeat the forces of evil.', 'After rotting in prison for over a decade, America''s ultimate hero and uber patriot MacGruber is finally released. His mission: to take down a mysterious villain from his past—Brigadier Commander Enos Queeth. With the entire world in the crosshairs, MacGruber must reassemble his old team in order to defeat the forces of evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4k4weoS5xQsUiEfsEPWlfhtmZKW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107314'),
  ('772221719366739993', 'MacGyver', 1985, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Lee David Zlotoff', null, 'Richard Dean Anderson, Dana Elcar', 'TV-PG', 'He''s everyone''s favorite action hero... but he''s a hero with a difference. Angus MacGyver is a secret agent whose wits are his deadliest weapon. Armed with only a knapsack filled with everyday items he picks up along the way, he improvises his way out of every peril the bad guys throw at him. Making a bomb out of chewing gum? Fixing a speeding car''s breaks... while he''s riding in it? Using soda pop to cook up tear gas? That''s all in a day''s adventures for MacGyver. He''s part Boy Scout, part genius. And all hero.', 'He''s everyone''s favorite action hero... but he''s a hero with a difference. Angus MacGyver is a secret agent whose wits are his deadliest weapon. Armed with only a knapsack filled with everyday items he picks up along the way, he improvises his way out of every peril the bad guys throw at him. Making a bomb out of chewing gum? Fixing a speeding car''s breaks... while he''s riding in it? Using soda pop to cook up tear gas? That''s all in a day''s adventures for MacGyver. He''s part Boy Scout, part genius. And all hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhgJNHbFxGkqdsKdkZLBrDWagOv.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:2875'),
  ('52696998402190982', 'MacGyver', 2016, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Peter M. Lenkov', null, 'Lucas Till, Tristin Mays, Henry Ian Cusick, Meredith Eaton, Justin Hires, Levy Tran', 'TV-14', '20-something Angus MacGyver creates a clandestine organization where he uses his knack for solving problems in unconventional ways to help prevent disasters from happening.', '20-something Angus MacGyver creates a clandestine organization where he uses his knack for solving problems in unconventional ways to help prevent disasters from happening.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2zAogx9dmSAu2HYxbWzHe4ZaNY5.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:67133'),
  ('1028005846858551771', 'Machine', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Thomas Bidegain, Fred Grivois', 'Valentine Monteil, Thomas Bidegain, Fred Grivois', 'Margot Bancilhon, JoeyStarr, Alysson Paradis, Sébastien Lalanne, Michaël Abiteboul, Guillaume Labbé, Solène Rigot, Hubert Delattre', null, 'An action show mixing kung-fu and class war.', 'An action show mixing kung-fu and class war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y60GpQoakoVXFKJDH6lbLOiVanv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211172'),
  ('747079778961634576', 'Macken', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Claes Eriksson', null, 'Anders Eriksson, Jan Rippe, Knut Agnred, Claes Eriksson, Per Fritzell, Kerstin Granlund, Peter Rangmar', null, 'Macken is a Swedish 6-part musical sit-com that ran on SVT in 1986. The local authority wants to close down Roy and Roger''s gas station and instead build a motorway where it is positioned. Roy and Roger try to stop it, of course. Will they succeed? Will they find the mysteriously lost white Opel?', 'Macken is a Swedish 6-part musical sit-com that ran on SVT in 1986. The local authority wants to close down Roy and Roger''s gas station and instead build a motorway where it is positioned. Roy and Roger try to stop it, of course. Will they succeed? Will they find the mysteriously lost white Opel?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LuXbMcfmc6ZL0l9bpncnm9L9nc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16893'),
  ('335849196430767094', 'Macross 7', 1994, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Shoji Kawamori', null, 'Yo Inoue, Urara Takano, Tomo Sakurai, Takehito Koyasu, Rio Natsuki, Nobutoshi Canna, Ryusuke Ohbayashi, Masashi Sugawara', null, '35 years have passed since Lynn Minmay had brought peace between the Zentradi and the humans. Nekki Basara is a guitarist and a singer of the band Fire Bomber. Living in the flying colony City 7 , he composes and sings songs in the belief that music holds a greater power. However, an unknown alien race appeared and started laying siege upon City 7.', '35 years have passed since Lynn Minmay had brought peace between the Zentradi and the humans. Nekki Basara is a guitarist and a singer of the band Fire Bomber. Living in the flying colony City 7 , he composes and sings songs in the belief that music holds a greater power. However, an unknown alien race appeared and started laying siege upon City 7.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBWL8ws3iRxrFTTR7TAQw2B5aiV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21735'),
  ('47930332400386032', 'Macross Frontier', 2008, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Kenta Miyake, Katsuyuki Konishi, Sanae Kobayashi, Tomomichi Nishimura, Hiroshi Kamiya, Rie Tanaka, Megumi Nakajima, Houko Kuwashima', 'TV-14', 'A human space colony fleet is trying to find a habitable planet near the center of the Milky Way Galaxy. The story focuses on three young adults and the events that occur around them as the fleet faces a crisis of alien origin.', 'A human space colony fleet is trying to find a habitable planet near the center of the Milky Way Galaxy. The story focuses on three young adults and the events that occur around them as the fleet faces a crisis of alien origin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tV4FhGyWbkGQO0zV8arsrgnYXyT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5857'),
  ('1121794809062263561', 'Macross II: Lovers Again', 1992, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics', 'Kenichi Matsuzaki, Shoji Kawamori, Kazumi Fujita', 'Sukehiro Tomita', 'Hiroko Kasahara, Yumi Touma, Tsutomu Takayama, Mariko Kouda, Takeshi Watabe, Junko Mashina, Yoshisada Sakaguchi, Toru Furuya', 'TV-PG', 'A.D. 2089 - 80 years have passed since Space War I changed the lives of both human and Zentraedi races. Both races are at peace on Earth when a new alien race called the "Marduk" appear within the Solar System. While covering the first battle between the U.N. Spacy and the Marduk fleet, SNN rookie reporter Hibiki Kanzaki discovers Ishtar, an "Emulator" that enhances the Marduk''s combat abilities through singing. Hibiki brings Ishtar to Earth to teach her the values of life and culture. Together with ace Valkyrie pilot Silvie Gena, Hibiki and Ishtar must find a way to save Earth from total destruction at the hands of the Marduk leader Ingues.', 'A.D. 2089 - 80 years have passed since Space War I changed the lives of both human and Zentraedi races. Both races are at peace on Earth when a new alien race called the "Marduk" appear within the Solar System. While covering the first battle between the U.N. Spacy and the Marduk fleet, SNN rookie reporter Hibiki Kanzaki discovers Ishtar, an "Emulator" that enhances the Marduk''s combat abilities through singing. Hibiki brings Ishtar to Earth to teach her the values of life and culture. Together with ace Valkyrie pilot Silvie Gena, Hibiki and Ishtar must find a way to save Earth from total destruction at the hands of the Marduk leader Ingues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66K2y79lk9joxDMSXsJyOuaGBlE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82247'),
  ('1021810743817129704', 'Macross Plus', 1994, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Shoji Kawamori', 'Keiko Nobumoto', 'Takumi Yamazaki, Rica Fukami, Unsho Ishizuka', null, 'The year is 2040 and the galaxy is flourishing with several colonies and advanced technology. AI is near perfection and the current top idol is the near-completed Virturoid Idol Sharon Apple. All that is missing are her actual feelings, which instead are supplied by Myung Fang Lone. Sharon''s debut concert is on planet Eden, where at the same time, fighter pilots Isamu Dyson and Guld Bowman battle over air superiority for the Supernova Project. Isamu, Guld and Myung were once childhood friends, but after an accident seven years ago, they went their own separate ways. With Myung back in the picture, the old disputes are once again awakened. And when an unstable and illegal AI technique is installed in Sharon, the situation is worsened.', 'The year is 2040 and the galaxy is flourishing with several colonies and advanced technology. AI is near perfection and the current top idol is the near-completed Virturoid Idol Sharon Apple. All that is missing are her actual feelings, which instead are supplied by Myung Fang Lone. Sharon''s debut concert is on planet Eden, where at the same time, fighter pilots Isamu Dyson and Guld Bowman battle over air superiority for the Supernova Project. Isamu, Guld and Myung were once childhood friends, but after an accident seven years ago, they went their own separate ways. With Myung back in the picture, the old disputes are once again awakened. And when an unstable and illegal AI technique is installed in Sharon, the situation is worsened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Rf4IQzzpkaoS94Dho9t1bpJJ4Q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21733'),
  ('308490924624528109', 'Macross Zero', 2002, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics', 'Shoji Kawamori', 'Shoji Kawamori', 'Kenichi Suzumura, Sanae Kobayashi, Yuuka Nanri, Akira Kamiya, Sôsuke Komori, Ryuuzaburou Ootomo, Minami Takayama, Naomi Shindo', null, 'Taking place one year before the events of the original Macross series, Macross Zero chronicles the final days of the war between the U.N. Spacy and anti-U.N. factions. After being shot down by the anti-U.N.''s newest fighter plane, ace pilot Shin Kudo finds himself on the remote island of Mayan, where technology is almost non-existent. While Shin stays on the island to heal his wounds, the tranquility of the island is shattered by a battle that involves the UN''s newest fighter - the VF-0.', 'Taking place one year before the events of the original Macross series, Macross Zero chronicles the final days of the war between the U.N. Spacy and anti-U.N. factions. After being shot down by the anti-U.N.''s newest fighter plane, ace pilot Shin Kudo finds himself on the remote island of Mayan, where technology is almost non-existent. While Shin stays on the island to heal his wounds, the tranquility of the island is shattered by a battle that involves the UN''s newest fighter - the VF-0.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGEIhZSwpy7nqQTIJu5nmGD66pc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60682'),
  ('288248787038635649', 'Macross Δ', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuma Uchida, Minori Suzuki, Asami Seto, Ami Koshimizu, Kiyono Yasuno, Nozomi Nishida, Nao Toyama, Koki Uchiyama', 'TV-14', 'Macross Delta is set in the year 2067, 8 years after the events of the latest Macross TV series, Macross Frontier. The story focuses on Walküre, a team of talented idols and the Delta Squadron, a team of experienced Valkyrie pilots as they battle against the Var Syndrome, a mysterious phenomena that is consuming the galaxy and there is also the mysterious Aerial Knights Valkyrie fighter team of the Kingdom of Wind.', 'Macross Delta is set in the year 2067, 8 years after the events of the latest Macross TV series, Macross Frontier. The story focuses on Walküre, a team of talented idols and the Delta Squadron, a team of experienced Valkyrie pilots as they battle against the Var Syndrome, a mysterious phenomena that is consuming the galaxy and there is also the mysterious Aerial Knights Valkyrie fighter team of the Kingdom of Wind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkhrKOtd6FqG37xGgOhZPTiohBS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66111'),
  ('988863957146463877', 'MAD', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Gaines, Kevin Shinick', 'Steve Borst, Aaron Blitzstein, Greg White', 'Kevin Shinick', 'TV-PG', 'Mad is an American animated sketch comedy series created by Kevin Shinick and produced by Warner Bros. Animation. Based upon the magazine of the same name, each episode is a collection of short animated parodies of television shows, movies, games, celebrities, and other media using various types of animation instead of the usual animation style that Warner Bros. Animation is known for. The series premiered on the evening of September 6, 2010 on Cartoon Network. It has been described as a "kid-friendly version of Robot Chicken".', 'Mad is an American animated sketch comedy series created by Kevin Shinick and produced by Warner Bros. Animation. Based upon the magazine of the same name, each episode is a collection of short animated parodies of television shows, movies, games, celebrities, and other media using various types of animation instead of the usual animation style that Warner Bros. Animation is known for. The series premiered on the evening of September 6, 2010 on Cartoon Network. It has been described as a "kid-friendly version of Robot Chicken".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lpMdJzQUD0gXafoFo5L92DNg9QU.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:33428'),
  ('502382790917671049', 'Mad About You', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Paul Reiser, Danny Jacobson', null, 'Paul Reiser, Helen Hunt, John Pankow, Cynthia Harris, Louis Zorich', 'TV-PG', 'Young, urban newlyweds Paul and Jamie Buchman try to sustain their marital bliss while sidestepping the hurdles of love in the ''90s.', 'Young, urban newlyweds Paul and Jamie Buchman try to sustain their marital bliss while sidestepping the hurdles of love in the ''90s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vvnslQjc1LnERuroGVh8bPdBi2r.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:500'),
  ('521705387095956612', 'Mad Bull 34', 1990, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Crime', null, null, 'Akio Otsuka, Yasunori Matsumoto, Gara Takashima, Shin Aomori, Mitsuo Senda, Masako Katsuki, Takkô Ishimori, Chafurin', null, 'Rookie Police Officer Daizaburo "Eddie" Ban joins New York''s 34th precinct where he is partnered up with John Estes, also known as Sleepy to his friends and Mad Bull to everyone else. Mad Bull usually solves crimes using extreme violence and very unpoliceman-like behaviour which always gets him in trouble with the 34th precinct and his partner Daizaburo. Despite Mad Bulls questionable methods for solving crime he always has a good reason for what he did and together him and Daizaburo try to make New York a safer place for everyone.', 'Rookie Police Officer Daizaburo "Eddie" Ban joins New York''s 34th precinct where he is partnered up with John Estes, also known as Sleepy to his friends and Mad Bull to everyone else. Mad Bull usually solves crimes using extreme violence and very unpoliceman-like behaviour which always gets him in trouble with the 34th precinct and his partner Daizaburo. Despite Mad Bulls questionable methods for solving crime he always has a good reason for what he did and together him and Daizaburo try to make New York a safer place for everyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jTPqEKJDnv2yPIRt4tUHcuV3mcU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45287'),
  ('1048989008070091219', 'Mad Concrete Dreams', 2026, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Ha Jung-woo, Lim Soo-jung, Kim Jun-han, Krystal Jung, Shim Eun-kyung, Lee Shin-ki, Park Seo-kyung, Kim Keum-soon', null, 'A debt-ridden building owner agrees to stage a fake kidnapping to save his family and property, only for the plan to spiral into a real abduction and a dangerously escalating situation.', 'A debt-ridden building owner agrees to stage a fake kidnapping to save his family and property, only for the plan to spiral into a real abduction and a dangerously escalating situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vX5dzW0qmFvrhTsTQj4IPZHnbpt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:281965'),
  ('1024425341092849052', 'Mad Doctor', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Janel Tsai, Berant Zhu, Tong Chih-wei, Toyoda Katsunari, Du Yan, Livion Lee, Helena Hsu, Chang Tsai-hsing', null, 'To run away from the dark past, Dr. Liu works at a countryside hospital. She assumes the job would be nice and easy there, but instead she witnesses and deals with various bizarre medical cases.', 'To run away from the dark past, Dr. Liu works at a countryside hospital. She assumes the job would be nice and easy there, but instead she witnesses and deals with various bizarre medical cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Qole67s5qDOeqT2topUEGzIJAJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135360'),
  ('734089127259699263', 'Mad Dog', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Hwang Eui-kyung, Kim Soo-jin', 'Kim Soo-jin', 'Yoo Ji-tae, Woo Do-hwan, Ryu Hwa-young, Jo Jae-yun, Kim Hye-seong, Hong Soo-hyun, Choi Won-young, Jang Hyuk-jin', 'NR', 'Choi Kang-Woo is a former detective, but he now works as a veteran insurance investigator. He leads a team that attempts to reveal insurance fraud cases.', 'Choi Kang-Woo is a former detective, but he now works as a veteran insurance investigator. He leads a team that attempts to reveal insurance fraud cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFgYTNvzvPUpHrK92GRP9xZlZSi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74076'),
  ('753541647077325594', 'Mad Dogs', 2011, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Cris Cole', null, 'John Simm, Max Beesley, Ben Chaplin, Philip Glenister, Marc Warren', 'NR', 'Mad Dogs is a British black comedy and psychological thriller television series created by Cris Cole that began airing on Sky1 on 10 February 2011. It is produced by Left Bank Pictures, and co-produced by Palma Pictures. The series stars John Simm, Marc Warren, Max Beesley, and Philip Glenister as four long-time and middle-aged friends getting together in a villa in Majorca to celebrate the early retirement of their friend Alvo. However, after Alvo is murdered, the group find themselves caught up in the world of crime and police corruption.', 'Mad Dogs is a British black comedy and psychological thriller television series created by Cris Cole that began airing on Sky1 on 10 February 2011. It is produced by Left Bank Pictures, and co-produced by Palma Pictures. The series stars John Simm, Marc Warren, Max Beesley, and Philip Glenister as four long-time and middle-aged friends getting together in a villa in Majorca to celebrate the early retirement of their friend Alvo. However, after Alvo is murdered, the group find themselves caught up in the world of crime and police corruption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odGWpRfd8q3PvQ6EWNvYIEz5JC9.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:37737'),
  ('481594906222728485', 'Mad Dogs', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Cris Cole, Shawn Ryan', null, 'Steve Zahn, María Botto, Billy Zane, Romany Malco, Michael Imperioli, Ben Chaplin, Athena Karkanis', 'TV-MA', 'When a group of underachieving 40-something friends gather in Belize to celebrate the early retirement of an old friend, a series of wild, comedic events unfold, exposing dark secrets and a web of lies, deception and murder.', 'When a group of underachieving 40-something friends gather in Belize to celebrate the early retirement of an old friend, a series of wild, comedic events unfold, exposing dark secrets and a web of lies, deception and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vrsOiz0IhykIITjSIvChr2PZlOw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61922'),
  ('664758509201167468', 'Mad for Each Other', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Ah Kyung', 'Jung Woo, Oh Yeon-seo, Baek Ji-won, Lee Hae-eun, Lee Yeon-doo, Lee Soo-hyun, An Woo-yeon, Kim Nam-hee', null, 'Bothered to realize they are next-door neighbors and share a psychiatrist, a man and a woman find it''s impossible to stay out of each other''s way.', 'Bothered to realize they are next-door neighbors and share a psychiatrist, a man and a woman find it''s impossible to stay out of each other''s way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sav9luRrij21rBQfhUcbiI0e5XQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:125350'),
  ('333615574974318454', 'Mad Jack the Pirate', 1998, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Bill Kopp, Jeff DeGrandis', null, 'Jess Harnell, Bill Kopp, Billy West, Cam Clarke, Brad Garrett, April Winchell, Charlie Adler, Tom Kenny', 'NR', 'The adventures of the rather unsuccessful and cowardly Pirate Jack who despite his failures never doubts his own excellence and his dim-witted anthropomorphic rat sidekick Snuk as they sail the seas on their ship the Sea Chicken.', 'The adventures of the rather unsuccessful and cowardly Pirate Jack who despite his failures never doubts his own excellence and his dim-witted anthropomorphic rat sidekick Snuk as they sail the seas on their ship the Sea Chicken.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Cq9tmamf37gEKiMR1hXeKkOia2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16953'),
  ('499363915200833155', 'Mad Love', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Matt Tarses', null, 'Jason Biggs, Sarah Chalke, Judy Greer, Tyler Labine', 'TV-PG', 'Kate, Connie, Larry, and Ben are New Yorker thirty somethings searching for love in the city. When Kate and Ben meet and fall for each other, their friends remain cynical about the relationship.', 'Kate, Connie, Larry, and Ben are New Yorker thirty somethings searching for love in the city. When Kate and Ben meet and fall for each other, their friends remain cynical about the relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQ9geWjtZ9gE7V9eeU2xqRA9w00.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:33099'),
  ('51345786259312669', 'Mad Men', 2007, 'Drama', 'Matthew Weiner', null, 'Jon Hamm, Elisabeth Moss, Vincent Kartheiser, January Jones, Christina Hendricks, Aaron Staton, Rich Sommer, Kiernan Shipka', 'TV-14', 'Set in 1960-1970 New York, this sexy, stylized and provocative drama follows the lives of the ruthlessly competitive men and women of Madison Avenue advertising.', 'Set in 1960-1970 New York, this sexy, stylized and provocative drama follows the lives of the ruthlessly competitive men and women of Madison Avenue advertising.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7v8iCNzKFpdlrCMcqCoJyn74Nsa.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:1104'),
  ('122274830718726864', 'Mad Unicorn', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Natara Nopparatayapon, Methika Jiranorraphat, Palang Rocksilp, Thaneth Warakulnukroh, Pachara Chirathivat, Thassapak Hsu, Anongnart Yusananda, Sira Simmee', 'TV-MA', 'An aspiring entrepreneur breaks new ground with the launch of a startup courier service that brings new opportunities — and powerful enemies.', 'An aspiring entrepreneur breaks new ground with the launch of a startup courier service that brings new opportunities — and powerful enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pKHgfFTsviq9C6NZmkQKciFH4Qc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:283776'),
  ('421233244373160972', 'Madagascar', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Mike Gurton, James Honeyborne', null, 'David Attenborough, John Brown, Pam Fogg, Tim Fogg, Ian Gray', 'TV-G', 'Over 80 per cent of Madagascar''s animals and plants are found nowhere else on Earth. Discover what made Madagascar so different from the rest of the world, and how evolution ran wild here.', 'Over 80 per cent of Madagascar''s animals and plants are found nowhere else on Earth. Discover what made Madagascar so different from the rest of the world, and how evolution ran wild here.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1xF6XXPY8WK2Dee721l6gijrgpi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37687'),
  ('339951850778729407', 'Madagascar: A Little Wild', 2020, 'Animation, Kids', 'Dana Starfield', 'Sam Bissonnette, Laura Zak, Roxy Simons', 'Tucker Chandler, Amir O''Neil, Luke Lowe, Shaylin Becton, Charlie Adler, Jasmine Gatewood, Candace Kozak, Eric Petersen', 'TV-Y', 'The early years of the Madagascar heroes Alex the Lion, Marty the Zebra, Melman the Giraffe and Gloria the Hippo, as they grow up in a rescue habitat at the Central Park Zoo.', 'The early years of the Madagascar heroes Alex the Lion, Marty the Zebra, Melman the Giraffe and Gloria the Hippo, as they grow up in a rescue habitat at the Central Park Zoo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9d59YbGDlg15tNOQ18oqRmf09t.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:109330'),
  ('884386642993987923', 'Madam Beja', 2026, 'Drama, Soap', 'António Barreira, Daniel Berlinsky', 'Cecília Giannetti, Maria Clara Mattos, Clara Anástacia', 'Grazi Massafera, David Junior, André Luiz Miranda, Pedro Fasanaro, Bianca Bin, Deborah Evelyn, Indira Nascimento, Bukassa Kabengele', 'TV-MA', 'In imperial Brazil, a young woman stripped of her reputation is forced into exile from polite society. Recasting herself as Madam Beja, she builds an elite pleasure house that becomes a hub of political intrigue, economic power, and forbidden desire, using charm, intelligence, and ruthless strategy to bend the same men and institutions that once destroyed her.', 'In imperial Brazil, a young woman stripped of her reputation is forced into exile from polite society. Recasting herself as Madam Beja, she builds an elite pleasure house that becomes a hub of political intrigue, economic power, and forbidden desire, using charm, intelligence, and ruthless strategy to bend the same men and institutions that once destroyed her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fB8khOzVqpQWhVfIXUQgCokP9XR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:152401'),
  ('188115063353489474', 'Madam Secretary', 2014, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Barbara Hall', null, 'Téa Leoni, Tim Daly, Željko Ivanek, Patina Miller, Erich Bergen, Wallis Currie-Wood, Kevin Rahm', 'TV-14', 'After years away from the CIA, Elizabeth McCord is pulled back into the political arena. The newly appointed Secretary of State is tough, fair, and smart, driving international diplomacy, wrangling office politics, and circumventing protocol as she negotiates global and domestic issues, both at the White House and at home.', 'After years away from the CIA, Elizabeth McCord is pulled back into the political arena. The newly appointed Secretary of State is tough, fair, and smart, driving international diplomacy, wrangling office politics, and circumventing protocol as she negotiates global and domestic issues, both at the White House and at home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Nl1ablo4DNTLb4ZH7Mycz81AEt.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:61378'),
  ('1021845669828254463', 'Madame Antoine: The Love Therapist', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Kim Yun-cheol, Hong Jin-Ah', 'Hong Jin-Ah', 'Han Ye-seul, Sung Joon, Hwang Seung-eon, Byun Hee-bong, Jeong Jin-woon, Lee Joo-hyung, Lee Sun-bin, Hwang Se-on', null, 'A famous fortune teller who claims to be spiritually linked to Marie Antoinette and calls herself ''Madame Antoine'' goes head-to-head with a cold psychotherapist who runs a clinic also by the name ''Madame Antoine'' and aims to prove that true love doesn''t exist.', 'A famous fortune teller who claims to be spiritually linked to Marie Antoinette and calls herself ''Madame Antoine'' goes head-to-head with a cold psychotherapist who runs a clinic also by the name ''Madame Antoine'' and aims to prove that true love doesn''t exist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vArW0WiXx0Rdf5pzVxuISR2led6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64448'),
  ('291873678221884356', 'Madan Senki Ryukendo', 2006, 'Action & Adventure, Family, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Oji Hiroi, Takeshi Yoshida, Yuichiro Hira', null, 'Shôgo Yamaguchi, Gen, Kouhei Kuroda, Kumi Imura, Kentaro Miyagi, Hiroko Satoh, Fumie Hosokawa, Kei Shimizu', null, 'Akebono City is a peaceful community overflowing with humanity. Since there was a Power Spot that released the magical power in the community, the people were distressed by the threat of the demon army Jamanga who are gathering Minus Energy from the frightened masses for a sinister purpose. The secret organization S.H.O.T. was formed to protect the people of the community from the Jamanga, concealing their existence as ordinary members of the Akebono Police Station, which considers demons beyond their jurisdiction. Kenji Narukami, a student of the Narukami Dragon God Style for fighting demons, arrives at Akebono to fight the demons, eventually getting his wish when he is transformed to RyuKenDo and faces off against Jamanga''s forces together with his friends to restore peace in the community.', 'Akebono City is a peaceful community overflowing with humanity. Since there was a Power Spot that released the magical power in the community, the people were distressed by the threat of the demon army Jamanga who are gathering Minus Energy from the frightened masses for a sinister purpose. The secret organization S.H.O.T. was formed to protect the people of the community from the Jamanga, concealing their existence as ordinary members of the Akebono Police Station, which considers demons beyond their jurisdiction. Kenji Narukami, a student of the Narukami Dragon God Style for fighting demons, arrives at Akebono to fight the demons, eventually getting his wish when he is transformed to RyuKenDo and faces off against Jamanga''s forces together with his friends to restore peace in the community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2Zu19nKv7bT2TBw8mpYaqhUEYy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2044'),
  ('325004496590415234', 'Maddigan''s Quest', 2006, 'Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Margaret Mahy', 'Rachel Lang', 'Timothy Balme, Michael Hurst, Danielle Cormack, Olivia Tennet, Peter Daube, Rose McIver, Rachel House, Hori Ahipene', null, 'Maddigan''s Quest was a fantasy-based television series set in a post-apocalyptic future. It was based on an original concept by Margaret Mahy and was developed for television by Gavin Strawhan and Rachel Lang. The show originally screened on CBBC in the UK, and was also aired on TV3 in New Zealand, Family Room HD from Voom Networks HD and Nine Network in early 2006.', 'Maddigan''s Quest was a fantasy-based television series set in a post-apocalyptic future. It was based on an original concept by Margaret Mahy and was developed for television by Gavin Strawhan and Rachel Lang. The show originally screened on CBBC in the UK, and was also aired on TV3 in New Zealand, Family Room HD from Voom Networks HD and Nine Network in early 2006.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPpoHboPZk4qPvT5jjp0yuVq8n.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1733'),
  ('1006948895417889451', 'Made for Love', 2021, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Patrick Somerville, Alissa Nutting, Christina Lee', null, 'Cristin Milioti, Billy Magnussen, Dan Bakkedahl, Noma Dumezweni, Caleb Foote, Sarunas J. Jackson, Ray Romano', 'TV-MA', 'Thirty-something Hazel Green tries to escape a suffocating marriage — until she realizes her tech billionaire husband has implanted a revolutionary tracking device, the Made for Love, in her brain.', 'Thirty-something Hazel Green tries to escape a suffocating marriage — until she realizes her tech billionaire husband has implanted a revolutionary tracking device, the Made for Love, in her brain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4FsrPwd2umUjl2T5BExVPTlI85u.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:90970'),
  ('994197252247256818', 'Made in Abyss', 2017, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Miyu Tomita, Mariya Ise', 'TV-MA', 'Located in the center of a remote island, the Abyss is the last unexplored region, a huge and treacherous fathomless hole inhabited by strange creatures where only the bravest adventurers descend in search of ancient relics. In the upper levels of the Abyss, Riko, a girl who dreams of becoming an explorer, stumbles upon a mysterious little boy.', 'Located in the center of a remote island, the Abyss is the last unexplored region, a huge and treacherous fathomless hole inhabited by strange creatures where only the bravest adventurers descend in search of ancient relics. In the upper levels of the Abyss, Riko, a girl who dreams of becoming an explorer, stumbles upon a mysterious little boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6U3odfIb3pCXMGKRTQGGF9o1Qg.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:72636'),
  ('1013697508434336112', 'Made in Britain', null, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, null, null, 'Made in Britain is a 1983 British television play written by David Leland, and directed by Alan Clarke, about a 16-year-old racist skinhead named Trevor, and his constant confrontations with authority figures. It was originally broadcast on ITV on 10 July 1983 as the fourth in an untitled series of works by Leland, all loosely based around the British educational system, which subsequently acquired the overall title of Tales Out of School. As with many Alan Clarke works, the director attempts to depict English working-class life, realistically without moralising or complex plots. The play features strong language, violence, racism and an anti-establishment feeling. Cinematographer Chris Menges''s use of the Steadicam contributed to the fluid and gritty atmosphere of the play.', 'Made in Britain is a 1983 British television play written by David Leland, and directed by Alan Clarke, about a 16-year-old racist skinhead named Trevor, and his constant confrontations with authority figures. It was originally broadcast on ITV on 10 July 1983 as the fourth in an untitled series of works by Leland, all loosely based around the British educational system, which subsequently acquired the overall title of Tales Out of School. As with many Alan Clarke works, the director attempts to depict English working-class life, realistically without moralising or complex plots. The play features strong language, violence, racism and an anti-establishment feeling. Cinematographer Chris Menges''s use of the Steadicam contributed to the fluid and gritty atmosphere of the play.', null, 0, 'tmdb:tv:32654'),
  ('266760026334447821', 'Made in Cartagena', 2013, null, 'Clara María Ochoa', null, 'Carmen Villalobos, Miguel de Miguel, Sergio Borrero, Fernando Solórzano, Édgar Vittorino, Tatiana De los Rios, Matilde Lemaitre, Khris Cifuentes', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttP8t3ix1bSoCoPL6DtBiW5dAUv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138165'),
  ('934879265684154823', 'Made in Chelsea', 2011, 'Reality, Drama', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Reality series following the lives, loves and awks of SW3''s bright young things.', 'Reality series following the lives, loves and awks of SW3''s bright young things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99xPXLPqKHcNRYq3fCU7GkHQyQI.jpg', 31, 'tmdb:tv:39148'),
  ('555208744752043080', 'Made in Heaven', 2019, 'Drama', 'Reema Kagti, Zoya Akhtar', null, 'Sobhita Dhulipala, Arjun Mathur, Jim Sarbh, Kalki Koechlin, Shashank Arora, Shivani Raghuvanshi, Mona Singh, Trinetra Haldar Gummaraju', null, 'The story of two wedding planners in Delhi, where tradition jostles with modern aspirations against the backdrop of big fat Indian weddings revealing many secrets and lies.', 'The story of two wedding planners in Delhi, where tradition jostles with modern aspirations against the backdrop of big fat Indian weddings revealing many secrets and lies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/leBOnbO2aLyfhMEdgO9tMlwcCY.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:87407'),
  ('713096936626146544', 'Made in Hollywood', 2005, 'Talk', 'Cleveland O''Neal III', null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Made in Hollywood is a talk show hosted by Kylie Erica Mar and Julie L. Harkness airing in syndication since September 30, 2005. The series is currently in its seventh season. The series is filmed in two studios in Los Angeles, California and New York City. Made in Hollywood also airs a spinoff series, Made in Hollywood: Teen Edition.', 'Made in Hollywood is a talk show hosted by Kylie Erica Mar and Julie L. Harkness airing in syndication since September 30, 2005. The series is currently in its seventh season. The series is filmed in two studios in Los Angeles, California and New York City. Made in Hollywood also airs a spinoff series, Made in Hollywood: Teen Edition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qmnydngb6MWvrTAe09x61SiXcC.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:41559'),
  ('502393136543247510', 'Made in Italy', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Camilla Nesbitt', null, 'Greta Ferro, Fiammetta Cicogna, Maurizio Lastrico, Valentina Carnelutti, Sergio Albelli, Giuseppe Cederna, Marco Bocci, Margherita Buy', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a26IspZznIu11D7cb37m0mJ8Jg5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94115'),
  ('1151376680353283029', 'Made in Jersey', 2012, 'Drama', 'Dana Calvo', null, 'Janet Montgomery, Kyle MacLachlan, Kristoffer Polaha, Megalyn Echikunwoke, Toni Trucks, Felix Solis, Erin Cummings', 'TV-PG', 'A young working-class woman who uses her street smarts to compete among her pedigreed Manhattan colleagues at a prestigious New York law firm.', 'A young working-class woman who uses her street smarts to compete among her pedigreed Manhattan colleagues at a prestigious New York law firm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jEaUXRm6yjrEMLsG5IAlL5L2pcw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43390'),
  ('549048925285638804', 'Made in Korea', 2025, 'Crime, Drama', 'Woo Min-ho', null, 'Hyun Bin, Jung Woo-sung, Woo Do-hwan, Cho Yeo-jeong, Seo Eun-soo, Won Ji-an, Jung Sung-il, Kang Gil-woo', null, 'In 1970s South Korea, follow two men on opposite sides of power — one driven by ambition, the other by justice. As their worlds collide, greed, loyalty, and survival intertwine in a battle that will shape a nation.', 'In 1970s South Korea, follow two men on opposite sides of power — one driven by ambition, the other by justice. As their worlds collide, greed, loyalty, and survival intertwine in a battle that will shape a nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cyBg9FJ2AmTWEGktA43gMo4t0Vj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:246473'),
  ('825478615104635283', 'Made in Oslo', 2022, 'Drama', 'Kathrine Valen Zeiner', 'Kathrine Valen Zeiner', 'Pia Tjelta, Jakob Cedergren, Ola G. Furuseth, Mariann Hole, Sara Khorami, Ane Skumsvoll, Erle Østraat, Tobias Menzies', null, 'At her Norwegian fertility clinic, doctor Elin offers patients a chance to become parents. Elin is always empathetic and professional - yet more than anything, she longs for the same opportunity herself. And as her frustration grows, Elin becomes prepared to risk her relationships and career in order to start a family of her own.', 'At her Norwegian fertility clinic, doctor Elin offers patients a chance to become parents. Elin is always empathetic and professional - yet more than anything, she longs for the same opportunity herself. And as her frustration grows, Elin becomes prepared to risk her relationships and career in order to start a family of her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMw49plI0LXTs7Y1ix0R6DauxJ2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:196822'),
  ('863426435522098885', 'Madeline', 1988, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy', 'Ludwig Bemelmans', null, 'Andrea Libman, Stevie Vallance, French Tickner, Christopher Gaze, Michael Monroe Heyward, Kyle Labine', 'TV-G', 'A young girl embarks on a series of misadventures, causing her friends and teachers to be worrisome. Based on the children''s books by Ludwig Bemelmans.', 'A young girl embarks on a series of misadventures, causing her friends and teachers to be worrisome. Based on the children''s books by Ludwig Bemelmans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kh1xdNqCYj4plWOyYjSIrPzzUvI.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:17194'),
  ('541569401737905001', 'Mademoiselle Holmes', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Mystery', 'Victoria Spennato', null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Shy cop Charlie, descendant of Sherlock Holmes, lives with grandfather until a car accident changes her. Her newfound energy and brilliance as a cop lets her embrace life and solve crimes with Watson-like partner Samy.', 'Shy cop Charlie, descendant of Sherlock Holmes, lives with grandfather until a car accident changes her. Her newfound energy and brilliance as a cop lets her embrace life and solve crimes with Watson-like partner Samy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/51Vqf3EcCap1zZtZCiKEOOMDGCV.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:222076'),
  ('145105552093822874', 'Madicken', 1979, 'Kids, Family, Comedy', 'Göran Graffman', 'Astrid Lindgren', 'Jonna Liljendahl, Sebastian Håkansson, Allan Edwall, Monica Nordquist, Liv Alsterlund, Björn Granath, Lis Nilheim, Sif Ruud', null, 'Madicken''s life on Junibacken is filled with ups and down.', 'Madicken''s life on Junibacken is filled with ups and down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FGA8O9XqTpZrR4huItebsUrqOZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:73102'),
  ('200812899883050251', 'Madison', 1993, 'Drama', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zsngZlWNXgkQZRXsVKs7MFNOXUm.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:12755'),
  ('866653769359848623', 'MADLAX', 2004, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery', 'Koichi Mashimo, Shigeru Kitayama', null, 'Satsuki Yukino, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Houko Kuwashima, Sanae Kobayashi, Masashi Ebara, Aya Hisakawa, Tomoko Kaneda, Miyu Irino', null, 'In the country of Gazth-Sonika, civil war rages. There, a mercenary called Madlax plies her trade, with almost supernatural skill. In the seemingly peaceful country of Nafrece, Margaret Burton lives a tranquil life. As separate as their lives may seem, the two are connected by ties of mystery, and by a holy book that is also sought by the shadowy organisation, Enfant. As Margaret and Madlax follow the path of their destiny, they come ever closer to uncovering the truth - with no guarantee that it is a truth they can bear to learn.', 'In the country of Gazth-Sonika, civil war rages. There, a mercenary called Madlax plies her trade, with almost supernatural skill. In the seemingly peaceful country of Nafrece, Margaret Burton lives a tranquil life. As separate as their lives may seem, the two are connected by ties of mystery, and by a holy book that is also sought by the shadowy organisation, Enfant. As Margaret and Madlax follow the path of their destiny, they come ever closer to uncovering the truth - with no guarantee that it is a truth they can bear to learn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ddte9YjjrZzxAg3T6mnEgrMtQdG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11284'),
  ('418184153514622450', 'Madö King Granzört', 1989, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Oji Hiroi', null, 'Shinobu Adachi, Tatsuya Matsuda, Yoko Matsuoka, Megumi Hayashibara, Reiko Suzuki, Michihiro Ikemizu, Yuri Shiratori, Kenichi Ogata', null, 'Madö King Granzört is a Japanese young children''s animated television series that aired from 1989-1990. It was produced by Bandai Visual and animated by animation studio Sunrise. It also spawned 3 special direct-to-video episodes and two movies. A boy named Daichi Haruka takes on a journey to the moon, where he gets involved in a fight between the Takamimi, Miminaga and evil tribes. Daichi gets in Granzort, one of the machines of the Malevolent Deity Ruling Light, to fight in the world of magic.', 'Madö King Granzört is a Japanese young children''s animated television series that aired from 1989-1990. It was produced by Bandai Visual and animated by animation studio Sunrise. It also spawned 3 special direct-to-video episodes and two movies. A boy named Daichi Haruka takes on a journey to the moon, where he gets involved in a fight between the Takamimi, Miminaga and evil tribes. Daichi gets in Granzort, one of the machines of the Malevolent Deity Ruling Light, to fight in the world of magic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFg0AGd1OS5bjHG3N4b8Neg2ftl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34766'),
  ('750101846425889894', 'Madoff', 2016, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ben Robbins', 'Ben Robbins', 'Richard Dreyfuss, Blythe Danner, Peter Scolari, Frank Whaley, Erin Cummings, Danny Defarrari, Tom Lipinski, Lyne Renee', 'TV-PG', 'The rise and fall of Bernie Madoff, who''s Ponzi scheme bilked $65 billion from unsuspecting victims.', 'The rise and fall of Bernie Madoff, who''s Ponzi scheme bilked $65 billion from unsuspecting victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y8Z3wc2ZdIoPFuk8swSPcJvcvA5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67307');
