  ('1047775021607542119', 'Mammals', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'James Richardson, Jez Butterworth', null, 'James Corden, Colin Morgan, Melia Kreiling, Sally Hawkins', null, 'The story of Jamie, a Michelin-starred chef whose world implodes when he discovers shocking secrets about his pregnant wife, Amandine. Jamie finds himself hunting for answers with the help of his brother-in-law Jeff. Through this hunt, the cracks in Jeff’s marriage to Jamie’s sister Lue also widen.', 'The story of Jamie, a Michelin-starred chef whose world implodes when he discovers shocking secrets about his pregnant wife, Amandine. Jamie finds himself hunting for answers with the help of his brother-in-law Jeff. Through this hunt, the cracks in Jeff’s marriage to Jamie’s sister Lue also widen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/poSN0H5RWqQBZJxPUGyPY1JqppN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:212512'),
  ('831239137216814825', 'Mammals', 2024, 'Documentary', null, null, 'David Attenborough', null, 'The series offers fascinating insights into the most successful animal group in the world. From the tiny Etruscan shrew to the giant blue whale, Mammals will reveal the secrets of their success, and how their winning design, incredible adaptability, unrivaled intelligence, and unique sociability have all contributed to their remarkable rise.', 'The series offers fascinating insights into the most successful animal group in the world. From the tiny Etruscan shrew to the giant blue whale, Mammals will reveal the secrets of their success, and how their winning design, incredible adaptability, unrivaled intelligence, and unique sociability have all contributed to their remarkable rise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5JJUuiJwcitSFzKG71YzchmUqy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:247293'),
  ('967654587896992180', 'Mammon', 2014, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Vegard Stenberg Eriksen, Gjermund Stenberg Eriksen', null, 'Jon Øigarden, Laura Christensen, Nils Ole Oftebro, Trond Espen Seim, Ingar Helge Gimle, Anna Bache-Wiig, Ingjerd Egeberg, Anders Danielsen Lie', null, 'Peter Verås is an uncompromising journalist in the most respected newspaper in Norway. He makes his life’s biggest mistake when he gets hold of evidence of a financial fraud from an anonymous source. It turns out the evidence points to his own brother. As he still pursues and the story breaks, the brother commits suicide. Peter tries to track down the anonymous source, only to discover that the source was the brother himself. A search for the truth has commenced that involves media, high – ranked politicians as well as the financial elite. The closer he gets to the truth, the more dangerous it becomes for him and his brother’s family.', 'Peter Verås is an uncompromising journalist in the most respected newspaper in Norway. He makes his life’s biggest mistake when he gets hold of evidence of a financial fraud from an anonymous source. It turns out the evidence points to his own brother. As he still pursues and the story breaks, the brother commits suicide. Peter tries to track down the anonymous source, only to discover that the source was the brother himself. A search for the truth has commenced that involves media, high – ranked politicians as well as the financial elite. The closer he gets to the truth, the more dangerous it becomes for him and his brother’s family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jj3VF9QvBu58zkLQVYastB1Oyor.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:60563'),
  ('75363740452415771', 'Mammoths', 2024, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Yuriy Stoyanov, Elizaveta Ischenko, Maryana Spivak, Lev Malishava, Egor Pavlychev, Natalya Pavlenkova', null, 'Pensioner Nikolai Nikolaevich sells his apartment and moves to his daughter in New Moscow. Temporarily, of course, until he finds his own place. But there is nothing more permanent than temporary, especially since the funds to buy a new apartment have disappeared. A naive pensioner was robbed by an Internet fraudster who took all the money from the sale of real estate from his card.', 'Pensioner Nikolai Nikolaevich sells his apartment and moves to his daughter in New Moscow. Temporarily, of course, until he finds his own place. But there is nothing more permanent than temporary, especially since the funds to buy a new apartment have disappeared. A naive pensioner was robbed by an Internet fraudster who took all the money from the sale of real estate from his card.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8672yPW3NTf8gXefcoqJj4LBoMr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:242830'),
  ('228232203570970386', 'Man About the House', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Brian Cooke, Johnnie Mortimer', 'Johnnie Mortimer, Brian Cooke', 'Paula Wilcox, Sally Thomsett, Richard O''Sullivan, Brian Murphy, Yootha Joyce', 'TV-14', 'Man About the House is a British sitcom created and written by Brian Cooke and Johnnie Mortimer, and starring Paula Wilcox, Sally Thomsett, Richard O''Sullivan, Brian Murphy, and Yootha Joyce. Six series were broadcast on ITV from 15 August 1973 to 7 April 1976. It was considered daring at the time because it featured a man sharing a London flat with two single women. Single roommates Chrissy and Jo search for a third tenant to help pay the rent, they intend on finding another female. But then they encounter Robin Tripp... who''s looking for a place to stay. Two spin-offs were produced: George and Mildred (1976–79) and Robin''s Nest (1977–81). A film adaptation was released in 1974 and, in 1977, the series was remade for American audiences as Three''s Company.', 'Man About the House is a British sitcom created and written by Brian Cooke and Johnnie Mortimer, and starring Paula Wilcox, Sally Thomsett, Richard O''Sullivan, Brian Murphy, and Yootha Joyce. Six series were broadcast on ITV from 15 August 1973 to 7 April 1976. It was considered daring at the time because it featured a man sharing a London flat with two single women. Single roommates Chrissy and Jo search for a third tenant to help pay the rent, they intend on finding another female. But then they encounter Robin Tripp... who''s looking for a place to stay. Two spin-offs were produced: George and Mildred (1976–79) and Robin''s Nest (1977–81). A film adaptation was released in 1974 and, in 1977, the series was remade for American audiences as Three''s Company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t8xmkAPqC1KbGTXT219dKpsGMRP.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:1006'),
  ('226957306097708901', 'Man and the Earth', 1974, 'Documentary', 'Félix Rodríguez de la Fuente', null, 'Félix Rodríguez de la Fuente', null, 'El hombre y la Tierra is a 1974 television series produced by Radio Televisión Española.', 'El hombre y la Tierra is a 1974 television series produced by Radio Televisión Española.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/57yc0WRhboS36PJ9PehlqRdjS7A.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:35354'),
  ('307139716427791049', 'Man Down', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Greg Davies', null, 'Greg Davies, Roisin Conaty, Mike Wozniak, Jeany Spark, Gwyneth Powell, Stephanie Cole, Ashley McGuire', 'TV-MA', 'Dan is a childish idiot trapped in an adult’s life, whose world is at near collapse. His girlfriend Naomi is fast running out of patience with his inability to navigate the simplest of life tasks. He has two uniquely dysfunctional friends and a listless teaching career that sees him begrudgingly teach a version of the same lesson every day, inexplicably popular with all but one of the pupils, with his only highlight coming in the form of Miss Lipsey, a head mistress who views Dan with a mixture of pity and despair. To make matters worse, he is tormented daily by his willfully insane father, whose driving motivation in life seems to be to ensure his son is humiliated at every turn.', 'Dan is a childish idiot trapped in an adult’s life, whose world is at near collapse. His girlfriend Naomi is fast running out of patience with his inability to navigate the simplest of life tasks. He has two uniquely dysfunctional friends and a listless teaching career that sees him begrudgingly teach a version of the same lesson every day, inexplicably popular with all but one of the pupils, with his only highlight coming in the form of Miss Lipsey, a head mistress who views Dan with a mixture of pity and despair. To make matters worse, he is tormented daily by his willfully insane father, whose driving motivation in life seems to be to ensure his son is humiliated at every turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s00xvEkk6cTuZdHPvxght2ZR3JJ.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:52268'),
  ('199611657832310908', 'Man from Atlantis', 1977, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Mayo Simon', null, 'Patrick Duffy, Belinda Montgomery, Alan Fudge', null, 'Atlantis survivor Mark Harris breathes underwater, withstands extreme depth pressures and wields superhuman strength.', 'Atlantis survivor Mark Harris breathes underwater, withstands extreme depth pressures and wields superhuman strength.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Gs6U8s0wTcf4DpS2nK4kM4q17W.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3575'),
  ('1088463746071746175', 'Man in an Orange Shirt', 2017, 'Drama', 'Patrick Gale', null, 'Julian Morris, Oliver Jackson-Cohen, Vanessa Redgrave', 'TV-14', 'A love story in two films charts the very different challenges to happiness for Michael and Thomas in the aftermath of World War 2, and to Adam and Steve in the present day.', 'A love story in two films charts the very different challenges to happiness for Michael and Thomas in the aftermath of World War 2, and to Adam and Steve in the present day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/quEsOLHDRfceciUaHbjU3k25OJN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73099'),
  ('220300978272762844', 'Man in Room 301', 2019, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Kate Ashfield', 'Kate Ashfield', 'Antti Virmavirta, Jussi Vatanen, Kaija Pakarinen, Leena Pöysti, Andrei Alén, Kreeta Salminen, Jarkko Lahti, Vilho Rönkkönen', null, 'Summer 2007, Finland. While the Kurtti are spending their annual holidays in their cabins in the land of a thousand lakes, the family is struck by a tragedy: Tommi, 2 years old, is killed by a gunshot. Elias, a 12-year-old neighbour, is blamed for the death of the child. 12 years later, the family receives a threatening anonymous letter and the secrets start to unravel, and show how far each of them are willing to go for their loved ones.', 'Summer 2007, Finland. While the Kurtti are spending their annual holidays in their cabins in the land of a thousand lakes, the family is struck by a tragedy: Tommi, 2 years old, is killed by a gunshot. Elias, a 12-year-old neighbour, is blamed for the death of the child. 12 years later, the family receives a threatening anonymous letter and the secrets start to unravel, and show how far each of them are willing to go for their loved ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dsk9tLmKdal9nrp5gthA4Yk12W2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99612'),
  ('547591938209762731', 'Man in the Arena: Tom Brady', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Tom Brady', 'TV-14', 'Tom Brady shares a personal account of his 10 Super Bowl appearances, deconstructing the milestones of his career by exploring each victory and defeat.', 'Tom Brady shares a personal account of his 10 Super Bowl appearances, deconstructing the milestones of his career by exploring each victory and defeat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yIBsjhweVmcMhVZYfNdDfk1NLDs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128210'),
  ('350032703462101745', 'Man Like Mobeen', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Guz Khan, Andy Milligan', 'Dúaa Karim, Guz Khan, Tolu Ogunmefun, Salman Akhtar, Perry Fitzpatrick', 'TV-MA', 'Man Like Mobeen is a four-part series that welcomes you into the life of Mobeen Deen, a 28 year-old from Small Heath in Birmingham. All Mobeen wants to do is follow his faith, lead a good life, and make sure his younger sister fulfils her potential. But can he juggle these when his criminal past and reputation is always chasing him?', 'Man Like Mobeen is a four-part series that welcomes you into the life of Mobeen Deen, a 28 year-old from Small Heath in Birmingham. All Mobeen wants to do is follow his faith, lead a good life, and make sure his younger sister fulfils her potential. But can he juggle these when his criminal past and reputation is always chasing him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eldYxHJQDGrOGi0NHoEURzAWcUS.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:86704'),
  ('619758675935790467', 'Man on Pause', 2022, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Engin Günaydın', null, 'Engin Günaydın, Tamer Karadağlı, Derya Karadaş, Turgut Tunçalp, Gülçin Santırcıoğlu, Şebnem Hassanisoughi, Yuliia Sobol, Doğa Zeynep Doğuşlu', 'TV-MA', 'Amid the onset of andropause, a 50-something family man becomes obsessed with change and decides to pursue happiness. Then he bungles it up completely.', 'Amid the onset of andropause, a 50-something family man becomes obsessed with change and decides to pursue happiness. Then he bungles it up completely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XQAYmlJdCyi7SPo9ygprrbjEE5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209793'),
  ('782158955051672168', 'Man Seeking Woman', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Simon Rich', null, 'Jay Baruchel, Eric André, Britt Lower, Katie Findlay', 'TV-MA', 'Josh Greenberg is a naive romantic on a desperate quest for love. When his longtime girlfriend dumps him, Josh enters the dating scene, a nightmarish hellscape of untold horror. Despite the agony, Josh continues his search in the hopes of finding someone who will make all the misery worth it.', 'Josh Greenberg is a naive romantic on a desperate quest for love. When his longtime girlfriend dumps him, Josh enters the dating scene, a nightmarish hellscape of untold horror. Despite the agony, Josh continues his search in the hopes of finding someone who will make all the misery worth it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXsJOBQm8zuYe89iItzIOeA0YTX.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:61871'),
  ('1084714429730906632', 'Man to Man', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Kim Won-Seok, Lee Chang-min', 'Kim Won-suk', 'Park Hae-jin, Park Sung-woong, Jang Hyun-sung, Jeong Man-sik, Lee Si-eon, Oh Na-ra, Yeon Jeong-hun, Tae In-ho', 'TV-14', 'From Kim Won Seok, the writer of Descendants of the Sun, a drama about a special bodyguard with a background in special investigations and the Hallyu star he is supposed to protect.', 'From Kim Won Seok, the writer of Descendants of the Sun, a drama about a special bodyguard with a background in special investigations and the Hallyu star he is supposed to protect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iH7TlkTfhPesQdDsPSTqdagm15y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70595'),
  ('719929947229882965', 'Man to Man with Dean Learner', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Richard Ayoade, Matthew Holness', null, 'Richard Ayoade, Satu Suominen', null, 'Man to Man with Dean Learner is a British comedy chat show that was first broadcast on Channel 4 on 20 October 2006 and released on DVD on 3 September 2007. It features comedians Richard Ayoade and Matthew Holness. Originally called Deano''s After Dark, the show features Dean Learner chatting to a range of guests including Merriman Weir and Garth Marenghi.', 'Man to Man with Dean Learner is a British comedy chat show that was first broadcast on Channel 4 on 20 October 2006 and released on DVD on 3 September 2007. It features comedians Richard Ayoade and Matthew Holness. Originally called Deano''s After Dark, the show features Dean Learner chatting to a range of guests including Merriman Weir and Garth Marenghi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9jXZuc6geM7rd5dFbsEnbksznvK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2471'),
  ('490476535138020503', 'Man Up!', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Christopher Moynihan', null, 'Mather Zickel, Dan Fogler, Christopher Moynihan, Teri Polo, Amanda Detmer, Henry Simmons, Charlotte Labadie, Jake Johnson', 'TV-PG', 'Three modern men try to get in touch with their inner tough guys and redefine what it means to be a ''real man.''', 'Three modern men try to get in touch with their inner tough guys and redefine what it means to be a ''real man.''', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dwuxKqzkcWzyjUMlzuP1AWC7L2e.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39341'),
  ('779768906377132650', 'Man v. Food', 2008, 'Reality', null, null, 'Adam Richman', 'TV-G', 'Food fanatic Adam Richman has held nearly every job in the restaurant biz, and now he''s on a journey to explore the biggest and best eats this nation has to offer, including some of the craziest eating challenges around.', 'Food fanatic Adam Richman has held nearly every job in the restaurant biz, and now he''s on a journey to explore the biggest and best eats this nation has to offer, including some of the craziest eating challenges around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bIozzC2YvZPJMe7yTbyFr9Kbz74.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:8519'),
  ('887794341759092737', 'Man vs Baby', 2025, 'Comedy, Family', 'Rowan Atkinson, William Davies', null, 'Rowan Atkinson', 'TV-PG', 'As Christmas approaches, a blundering-all-the-way dad juggles housesitting a posh London penthouse with an unexpected pickle: caring for a lost baby.', 'As Christmas approaches, a blundering-all-the-way dad juggles housesitting a posh London penthouse with an unexpected pickle: caring for a lost baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7UZVTEr26H5yCSVQoKTeBdvUvg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:279601'),
  ('304281898454448550', 'Man vs Bee', 2022, 'Family, Comedy', 'Rowan Atkinson, William Davies', null, 'Rowan Atkinson', 'TV-PG', 'Bumbling dad Trevor tries to get the best of a cunning bee while house-sitting a posh mansion — but only unleashes more chaos in this comedy series.', 'Bumbling dad Trevor tries to get the best of a cunning bee while house-sitting a posh mansion — but only unleashes more chaos in this comedy series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c80mxgOPvSWJBcgWoI5bf3et5Ws.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197588'),
  ('418634673509250922', 'Man vs. Wild', 2006, 'Action & Adventure, Documentary', 'Steve Rankin', null, 'Bear Grylls', 'TV-PG', 'Bear strands himself in popular wilderness destinations where tourists often find themselves lost or in danger.', 'Bear strands himself in popular wilderness destinations where tourists often find themselves lost or in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9M4xXcz9m1aUlRsASv7vsx776do.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:4709'),
  ('258646890896753679', 'Man with a Plan', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Jackie Filgo, Jeff Filgo', null, 'Matt LeBlanc, Liza Snyder, Stacy Keach, Matt Cook, Kali Rocha, Grace Kaufman, Matthew McCann, Hala Finley', 'TV-PG', 'A dad finds out that parenting is harder than he thought after his wife goes back to work and he''s left at home to take care of the kids.', 'A dad finds out that parenting is harder than he thought after his wife goes back to work and he''s left at home to take care of the kids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCJMHR0GmR4layd4KQXC1HUPMlf.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:67156'),
  ('281007104113900498', 'Man, Woman, Wild', 2010, 'Reality, Action & Adventure, Documentary', null, null, 'Ruth England, Mykel Hawke', null, 'Mykel Hawke is a former Special Forces survival expert. His wife Ruth is a television journalist. Together, they take on some of the most forbidding and remote locations around the world. Dropped into each spot, they must survive as a team for four days and nights, with only a knife and the clothes on their backs. As they test their will and their marriage, the two find common ground standing up to nature as husband and wife in the wildest places on Earth.', 'Mykel Hawke is a former Special Forces survival expert. His wife Ruth is a television journalist. Together, they take on some of the most forbidding and remote locations around the world. Dropped into each spot, they must survive as a team for four days and nights, with only a knife and the clothes on their backs. As they test their will and their marriage, the two find common ground standing up to nature as husband and wife in the wildest places on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6NtuaE0DtnysUcqrsr2A5uE8nOM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:33175'),
  ('186836908334051900', 'Management of a Novice Alchemist', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kanon Takao, Hina Kino, Saori Onishi, Nanaka Suwa, Mitsuki Saiga, Ami Koshimizu', 'TV-14', 'For a lonely orphan, there is almost only one career path to success. That is to get a national qualification as an alchemist. After graduating from the Royal Alchemist Training Academy, which requires nothing but ability, Sarasa is presented with the rights to a store by her master. After being sent off by her generous mentor, Sarasa sets off on her journey, dreaming of a slightly elegant life as an alchemist, but upon arrival, she is shocked to find that the countryside is even more rural than she had imagined. However, even in such a place, she has to manage a store somehow to make a living.', 'For a lonely orphan, there is almost only one career path to success. That is to get a national qualification as an alchemist. After graduating from the Royal Alchemist Training Academy, which requires nothing but ability, Sarasa is presented with the rights to a store by her master. After being sent off by her generous mentor, Sarasa sets off on her journey, dreaming of a slightly elegant life as an alchemist, but upon arrival, she is shocked to find that the countryside is even more rural than she had imagined. However, even in such a place, she has to manage a store somehow to make a living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hFnddzz8MJMrrrCEQGbY1aSCG7M.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:133938'),
  ('96234154716812190', 'Manasaare', 2020, 'Drama, Soap', 'B.G. Manohar', null, 'Priyanka Chincholi, Sagar Gowda, Yamuna Srinidhi, Suneel Puranik', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ibfRtZKnqijIcaCgXNowwBWRSDU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317512'),
  ('544672222798588171', 'Manayek', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', 'Roi Idan, Yoav Gross', 'Roi Idan', 'Shalom Assayag, Amos Tamam, Liraz Chamami, Sasi Samucha, Mouna Hawa, Doron Ben-David, Haim Zanati, Yair Raufman', null, 'Izzy Bachar, a police internal affairs investigator, discovers just before retirement that his long time friend Barak, a senior police officer, is accused to be corrupt. Life as he knows it breaks into pieces.', 'Izzy Bachar, a police internal affairs investigator, discovers just before retirement that his long time friend Barak, a senior police officer, is accused to be corrupt. Life as he knows it breaks into pieces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAAuwezjWffJ1jBaB9xJ4klUi7e.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:107013'),
  ('164791480982297738', 'Mandala Murders', 2025, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Gopi Puthran', null, 'Vaani Kapoor, Vaibhav Raj Gupta, Surveen Chawla', 'TV-MA', 'When a series of ritualistic murders shakes a small town, a detective and an ex-cop must investigate a mystery with deep ties to their pasts.', 'When a series of ritualistic murders shakes a small town, a detective and an ex-cop must investigate a mystery with deep ties to their pasts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tg16aWs58I5PleUQDmvsXPV7zfQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:247831'),
  ('767849023201552213', 'Mandrake', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Rubem Fonseca', null, 'Marcos Palmeira, Luis Carlos Miele, Virginia Cavendish, Marcelo Serrado, Andreza Anizio, Marcelo Adnet', 'TV-MA', 'Meet Paulo Mandrake, a charismatic defense attorney who finds himself sidetracked by his vices--especially beautiful Brazilian women--while serving as a liaison between his high-end clients and the Rio de Janeiro subculture. Marcos Palmeira stars in this HBO Latino drama series.', 'Meet Paulo Mandrake, a charismatic defense attorney who finds himself sidetracked by his vices--especially beautiful Brazilian women--while serving as a liaison between his high-end clients and the Rio de Janeiro subculture. Marcos Palmeira stars in this HBO Latino drama series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/szjVgn1gjiFHNESvISh5j5D4LVG.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1589'),
  ('673824945095513932', 'Mandy', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Diane Morgan', 'Ben Caudell', 'Diane Morgan, Michelle Greenidge, Tom Basden', null, 'Mandy is a woman with dreams. Big dreams. Most of all she dreams of breeding Doberman Pinchers. But there are hurdles to overcome before that dream can become a reality. In the series we''ll see her go on a health kick, rent out her small back bedroom on Airbnb and attempt a series of short-lived jobs in the modern gig economy.', 'Mandy is a woman with dreams. Big dreams. Most of all she dreams of breeding Doberman Pinchers. But there are hurdles to overcome before that dream can become a reality. In the series we''ll see her go on a health kick, rent out her small back bedroom on Airbnb and attempt a series of short-lived jobs in the modern gig economy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lOCSeiNbZzCUKUL3RtAmyWY5ZcQ.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:107484'),
  ('934319554198454357', 'Manhattan', 2014, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Sam Shaw', null, 'John Benjamin Hickey, Olivia Williams, Ashley Zukerman, Rachel Brosnahan, Harry Lloyd, Katja Herbers, Michael Chernus, Christopher Denham', 'TV-14', 'Set against the backdrop of the greatest clandestine race against time in the history of science with the mission to build the world''s first atomic bomb in Los Alamos, New Mexico. Flawed scientists and their families attempt to co-exist in a world where secrets and lies infiltrate every aspect of their lives.', 'Set against the backdrop of the greatest clandestine race against time in the history of science with the mission to build the world''s first atomic bomb in Los Alamos, New Mexico. Flawed scientists and their families attempt to co-exist in a world where secrets and lies infiltrate every aspect of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZeMzP3mNC9JbufbSmZYT0Z7rpj.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61112'),
  ('326224691288489737', 'Manhattan Love Story', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Jeff Lowell', null, 'Lio Tipton, Jake McDorman, Nicolas Wright, Jade Catta-Preta, Chloé Wepper, Kurt Fuller, Nico Evers-Swindell', 'TV-PG', 'The unfiltered internal monologues of a young man and a young woman are exposed as they begin a new relationship together.', 'The unfiltered internal monologues of a young man and a young woman are exposed as they begin a new relationship together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bazJO9disPJruhyqMhljEwWXqK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:57031'),
  ('232430607168836006', 'Manhole', 2017, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'HERO Jaejoong, Uee, Cha Sun-woo, Jung Hye-sung, Ju Jin-mo, Kim Hye-ok, Seo Hyun-chul, Lee Yeon-kyung', null, 'This time-slip drama centers around Bong Pil and his five friends who travel between the past and present through a manhole in order to stop a wedding scheduled a week later.', 'This time-slip drama centers around Bong Pil and his five friends who travel between the past and present through a manhole in order to stop a wedding scheduled a week later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5QTHC5B4ccsAFAvxpSeXdoXwkFq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72547'),
  ('1151051790313728853', 'Manhunt', 2017, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Andrew Sodroski, Jim Clemente, Tony Gittelson', null, 'Cameron Britton, Carla Gugino, Jack Huston, Arliss Howard, Ness Bautista, Gethin Anthony, Kelly Jenrette, Judith Light', 'TV-MA', 'Inspired by actual events, this true crime anthology series takes a deep dive into the dark, twisted minds of terrorists and follows the brave souls who hunt them down.', 'Inspired by actual events, this true crime anthology series takes a deep dive into the dark, twisted minds of terrorists and follows the brave souls who hunt them down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ukZcwaqcObmmxxfcIXTgVMvalJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:72597'),
  ('794550924290181524', 'Manhunt', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Ed Whitmore, Colin Sutton', null, 'Martin Clunes, Claudie Blakley, Sule Rimi, Steve Nicolson, Matthew Gravelle, Beth Goddard, David Witts, Diveen Henry', 'TV-PG', 'The true story of London Metropolitan police detective Colin Sutton''s manhunt for serial criminals.', 'The true story of London Metropolitan police detective Colin Sutton''s manhunt for serial criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLjUC3ze3WxCFhg4GDbcwLRSgvJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:85052'),
  ('724131368968019533', 'Manhunt', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', 'Monica Beletsky', 'Tim Brittain', 'Tobias Menzies, Anthony Boyle, Lovie Simone, Will Harrison, Brandon Flynn, Damian O''Hare, Glenn Morshower, Matt Walsh', 'TV-MA', 'A conspiracy thriller about one of the best known but least understood crimes in history. This is the astonishing story of the hunt for John Wilkes Booth in the aftermath of Abraham Lincoln''s assassination—as the fate of the country hangs in the balance.', 'A conspiracy thriller about one of the best known but least understood crimes in history. This is the astonishing story of the hunt for John Wilkes Booth in the aftermath of Abraham Lincoln''s assassination—as the fate of the country hangs in the balance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pN5qeqDgCG1Pij7KaEBKLkyjn4A.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155533'),
  ('541985878617669782', 'Maniac', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Espen Lervaag, Håkon Bast Mossige', 'Espen Lervaag, Ole Marius Araldsen, Håkon Bast Mossige', 'Espen Lervaag, Håkon Bast Mossige, Ingeborg Raustøl, Arif Salum, Mats Mogeland', 'TV-PG', 'The story of Espen, a man in his thirties who is loved by everyone. Every day is a party and there''s no limit to what he experiences. We meet Espen in various situations where everything is amazing and whatever happens, Espen knows how to handle it. It is simply too good to be true. Espen has escaped into his own head and where his life is a fantastic fantasy world. In real life he is a patient at the psychiatric ward. What would you choose if you were in Espens situation - to be a fantasy hero or an everyday loser?', 'The story of Espen, a man in his thirties who is loved by everyone. Every day is a party and there''s no limit to what he experiences. We meet Espen in various situations where everything is amazing and whatever happens, Espen knows how to handle it. It is simply too good to be true. Espen has escaped into his own head and where his life is a fantastic fantasy world. In real life he is a patient at the psychiatric ward. What would you choose if you were in Espens situation - to be a fantasy hero or an everyday loser?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gxNQMT9n8osEg4qgzlGgJ6JMYv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65918'),
  ('15227257681179365', 'Maniac', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Patrick Somerville, Cary Joji Fukunaga', null, 'Emma Stone, Jonah Hill, Sonoya Mizuno, Justin Theroux, Sally Field', 'TV-MA', 'Two strangers are drawn to a mysterious pharmaceutical trial that will, they''re assured, with no complications or side-effects whatsoever, solve all of their problems, permanently. Things do not go as planned.', 'Two strangers are drawn to a mysterious pharmaceutical trial that will, they''re assured, with no complications or side-effects whatsoever, solve all of their problems, permanently. Things do not go as planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kCNl4QPstAqChFD0NnLpbDFG8ul.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73411'),
  ('900941664569991141', 'Manifest', 2018, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Drama', 'Jeff Rake', null, 'Melissa Roxburgh, Josh Dallas, J.R. Ramirez, Luna Blaise, Parveen Kaur, Matt Long, Holly Taylor, Daryl Edwards', 'TV-14', 'After landing from a turbulent but routine flight, the crew and passengers of Montego Air Flight 828 discover five years have passed in what seemed like a few hours. As their new realities become clear, a deeper mystery unfolds and some of the returned passengers soon realize they may be meant for something greater than they ever thought possible.', 'After landing from a turbulent but routine flight, the crew and passengers of Montego Air Flight 828 discover five years have passed in what seemed like a few hours. As their new realities become clear, a deeper mystery unfolds and some of the returned passengers soon realize they may be meant for something greater than they ever thought possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eTemCphrglLKrXOsNRhYezHA7H9.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:79696'),
  ('487128505136155100', 'Manimal', 1983, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Glen A. Larson', null, 'Simon MacCorkindale, Melody Anderson, Michael D. Roberts, Reni Santoni', null, 'Jonathan Chase was a British college professor at New York University who had the unusual ability to transform into any kind of animal. He used his powers to battle crime alongside pretty policewoman Brooke and Vietnam-war pal Ty.', 'Jonathan Chase was a British college professor at New York University who had the unusual ability to transform into any kind of animal. He used his powers to battle crime alongside pretty policewoman Brooke and Vietnam-war pal Ty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/deTedoQduoqW9Kduktf9eVfiY3V.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3291'),
  ('1017588897498619839', 'Mankind: The Story of All of Us', 2012, 'Documentary', null, 'Sam Sheridan, Judith Lindbergh, Hugh Ballantyne', 'Josh Brolin, Richard Machowicz, Jim Meigs, Mehmet Oz', null, 'Mankind The Story of All of Us is an epic 12-hour television event about the greatest adventure of all time—the history of the human race. It takes 10 billion years for the ideal planet to form and 3 billion more for the right conditions to emerge before it finally happens: mankind begins. From there unfolds a fast-paced story told here through key turning points—stepping stones in our journey from hunter-gatherer to global citizen. It’s a tale of connections—why some ideas take hold and spread around the globe, and how the lives of people in one part of the world are shaped by events in another.', 'Mankind The Story of All of Us is an epic 12-hour television event about the greatest adventure of all time—the history of the human race. It takes 10 billion years for the ideal planet to form and 3 billion more for the right conditions to emerge before it finally happens: mankind begins. From there unfolds a fast-paced story told here through key turning points—stepping stones in our journey from hunter-gatherer to global citizen. It’s a tale of connections—why some ideas take hold and spread around the globe, and how the lives of people in one part of the world are shaped by events in another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1ZBbL7JfFHHuKegbvwFheyKO5m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62006'),
  ('867112149150144203', 'Mannen Som Log', 2003, 'Drama, Crime', 'Leif Lindblom', null, 'Rolf Lassgård, Marie Richardson, Christer Fant, Lars Melin, Kerstin Andersson, Claes Månsson, Melinda Kinnaman, Anna-Lena Hemström', null, 'In this adaption of a Henning Mankell novel, Inspector Kurt Wallander investigates a case of murder and trade of human organs.', 'In this adaption of a Henning Mankell novel, Inspector Kurt Wallander investigates a case of murder and trade of human organs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dAG71dfluAl7IMEuIzEBPYvHZGn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73828'),
  ('341988739016687389', 'Manner of Death', 2020, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Sammon', null, 'Nattapol Diloknawarit, Pakorn Thanasrivanitchai, Sapol Assawamunkong, Patara Eksangkul, Nutwara Vongvasana, Chonnikan Netjui, Nutthapong Phibunthanakiet, Bhudis Viseshchitra', null, 'A forensic doctor uncovers a murder disguised as suicide. When threats follow, he joins forces with a mysterious suspect to expose the truth—and stay alive.', 'A forensic doctor uncovers a murder disguised as suicide. When threats follow, he joins forces with a mysterious suspect to expose the truth—and stay alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3vRJ8QNK7lNidPZL8CKOPW908EO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113330'),
  ('567457856595362520', 'Mannix', 1967, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Richard Levinson, William Link, Bruce Geller', null, 'Mike Connors, Gail Fisher, Larry Storch, Robyn Millan', 'TV-PG', 'Mannix is an American television detective series that ran from 1967 through 1975 on CBS. Created by Richard Levinson and William Link and developed by executive producer Bruce Geller, the title character, Joe Mannix, is a private investigator. He is played by Mike Connors. Mannix was the last series produced by Desilu Productions.', 'Mannix is an American television detective series that ran from 1967 through 1975 on CBS. Created by Richard Levinson and William Link and developed by executive producer Bruce Geller, the title character, Joe Mannix, is a private investigator. He is played by Mike Connors. Mannix was the last series produced by Desilu Productions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Nh2D2dHKJnUbRHqLS5QsKWJuPb.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:2813'),
  ('808071061976143313', 'Manos a la obra', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Vicente Escrivá, Ramón de Diego', null, 'Ángel de Andrés López, Carlos Iglesias, Nuria González, Carmen Rossi, Fernando Cayo, Kim Manning, Jorge Calvo', 'TV-PG', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n5f1VtkrDvyMKBJH0YFB1D4ObTQ.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:61776'),
  ('287975447339951387', 'Mansfield Park', 1983, 'Drama', 'Ken Taylor', null, 'Sylvestra Le Touzel, Angela Pleasence, Anna Massey, Nicholas Farrell, Gorden Kaye, Susan Edmonstone, Jackie Smith-Wood, Robert Burbage', null, 'Mansfield Park is a British six-part television drama serial based on Jane Austen''s 1814 novel of the same name. Produced by the BBC and adapted by Kenneth Taylor, it stars Sylvestra Le Touzel as Fanny Price, who is sent to live with her wealthy relatives, the Bertrams, where she is treated poorly by most except her cousin Edmund. Her life is complicated by the arrival of the worldly Mary and Henry Crawford.', 'Mansfield Park is a British six-part television drama serial based on Jane Austen''s 1814 novel of the same name. Produced by the BBC and adapted by Kenneth Taylor, it stars Sylvestra Le Touzel as Fanny Price, who is sent to live with her wealthy relatives, the Bertrams, where she is treated poorly by most except her cousin Edmund. Her life is complicated by the arrival of the worldly Mary and Henry Crawford.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iyvW0051xgxdutwaFntuuHKvKUV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14433'),
  ('947930890290296268', 'Manten', 2002, 'Drama', null, null, 'Nobuko Miyamoto, Kiyoshi Hikawa, Katsuhisa Namase, Jun Kaname, Atsuko Asano, Takashi Fujii, Mao Miyaji', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0aol47WfFYLaLF3GjqVpNd5FBu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37230'),
  ('283039580711725240', 'Manuel on the Island of Wonders', 1984, 'Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Drama', 'Raúl Ruiz', null, null, null, 'This three part French TV serial for children (alternate versions exist as a feature, Manoel’s Destinies, and a 4 part Portuguese TV serial, Adventure in Madeira) is the favourite of many devotees of Raúl Ruiz. This is because it ties the enchantment and mystery of Lewis Carroll, Carlo Collodi and the Brothers Grimm to the filmmaker’s experiments with narrative strategies and what he calls the pentaludic model of storytelling (where characters are thrown dice-like into combinations and situations governed by the play of Chance and Destiny).', 'This three part French TV serial for children (alternate versions exist as a feature, Manoel’s Destinies, and a 4 part Portuguese TV serial, Adventure in Madeira) is the favourite of many devotees of Raúl Ruiz. This is because it ties the enchantment and mystery of Lewis Carroll, Carlo Collodi and the Brothers Grimm to the filmmaker’s experiments with narrative strategies and what he calls the pentaludic model of storytelling (where characters are thrown dice-like into combinations and situations governed by the play of Chance and Destiny).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSWTUcT46N3AVKtzRpvxNUUPtl4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62159'),
  ('890257362324633044', 'Manyu Scroll', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Minako Kotobuki, Aki Toyosaki, Kaoru Mizuhara, Misato Fukuen, Kenji Hamada, Mamiko Noto, Toru Okawa, Atsushi Ono', 'TV-MA', 'It is currently the Taiheimeji era, during the rule of the Tokugawa shogunate. In this era, breasts mean everything. If you have breasts, you are guaranteed wealth and popularity, but if you lack them, you are rarely considered human. Inside the shogunate, there is a group of warriors that support the government—the Manyuu Clan, which helps raise the future big breasts. Written on a secret scroll possessed by the clan, there are said to be various techniques on how to grow big and beautiful breasts. Chifusa is the heir of the clan. However, she takes the secret scroll and runs away with it, hoping to fight against the cruel world that the Manyuu Clan has created…', 'It is currently the Taiheimeji era, during the rule of the Tokugawa shogunate. In this era, breasts mean everything. If you have breasts, you are guaranteed wealth and popularity, but if you lack them, you are rarely considered human. Inside the shogunate, there is a group of warriors that support the government—the Manyuu Clan, which helps raise the future big breasts. Written on a secret scroll possessed by the clan, there are said to be various techniques on how to grow big and beautiful breasts. Chifusa is the heir of the clan. However, she takes the secret scroll and runs away with it, hoping to fight against the cruel world that the Manyuu Clan has created…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4L6CqXL1NZwX9ZZ1drYzl0qyShG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71834'),
  ('25223202271102413', 'Manyunya', 2021, 'Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Ekaterina Temnova, Karina Kagramanyan, Karine Mnatsakanyan, Julietta Stepanyan, Arman Navasardyan, Mariam Mano, Armen Margaryan, Elena Podkaminskaya', null, 'Armenia, 1979. Mountains, sun, beautiful green meadows and a sense of celebration. After a funny episode at school, the girls Narine and Manyunya become best friends. Narine was very afraid of strict granny Manyuni, but during their acquaintance it turned out that Ba bakes cookies melting in her mouth and a delicious apple pie. There are a lot of adventures waiting for the fidget girls.', 'Armenia, 1979. Mountains, sun, beautiful green meadows and a sense of celebration. After a funny episode at school, the girls Narine and Manyunya become best friends. Narine was very afraid of strict granny Manyuni, but during their acquaintance it turned out that Ba bakes cookies melting in her mouth and a delicious apple pie. There are a lot of adventures waiting for the fidget girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mPo9lSD1i772mfAa6bdehQfB7kJ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:154148'),
  ('570334883653120478', 'MAO', 2026, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation', null, null, 'Yuki Kaji, Natsumi Kawaida, Hiro Shimono, Toshiyuki Toyonaga, Momoka Terasawa, Kazuyuki Okitsu, Motoko Kumai, Yoko Hikasa', 'TV-14', 'Eight years ago, Nanoka Kiba was saved from the wreckage of a fatal accident at Gogyō Town Shopping Center. Drawn to the abandoned passage of storefronts on her walk home from school in present day, she becomes inexplicably transported to Japan''s Taishō period where she meets the mysterious Mao, a fellow traveler whose arrival at a ghost-inhabited village is simultaneous with hers. Together, they investigate the bizarre events that begin to occur around them, and Nanoka soon pieces together her broken memories of the accident and how she and Mao may have something more sinister in common.', 'Eight years ago, Nanoka Kiba was saved from the wreckage of a fatal accident at Gogyō Town Shopping Center. Drawn to the abandoned passage of storefronts on her walk home from school in present day, she becomes inexplicably transported to Japan''s Taishō period where she meets the mysterious Mao, a fellow traveler whose arrival at a ghost-inhabited village is simultaneous with hers. Together, they investigate the bizarre events that begin to occur around them, and Nanoka soon pieces together her broken memories of the accident and how she and Mao may have something more sinister in common.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdti4Dm7XPV0Os2Jjzd188AWTQ3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:295999'),
  ('243099888774185779', 'Mao Mao: Heroes of Pure Heart', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Parker Simmons', null, 'Parker Simmons, Griffith Kimmins, Lika Leong, Christopher McCulloch, Tommy Blacha, Debra Wilson', 'TV-Y7', 'Mao Mao, Badgerclops and Adorabat are fearless warriors who protect the people of Pure Heart Valley from monsters, villains and all kinds of bad stuff. Led by King Snugglemagne, the Sweety Pies of Pure Heart are cute, cuddly and pretty much helpless. Luckily, they have valiant heroes like Mao Mao, Adorabat and Badgerclops to watch over them. He’ll battle baddies like the Sky Pirates: Orangusnake, Ramaraffe, Boss Hosstrich and Rat-A-Rang, while learning to become a legend in his own time.', 'Mao Mao, Badgerclops and Adorabat are fearless warriors who protect the people of Pure Heart Valley from monsters, villains and all kinds of bad stuff. Led by King Snugglemagne, the Sweety Pies of Pure Heart are cute, cuddly and pretty much helpless. Luckily, they have valiant heroes like Mao Mao, Adorabat and Badgerclops to watch over them. He’ll battle baddies like the Sky Pirates: Orangusnake, Ramaraffe, Boss Hosstrich and Rat-A-Rang, while learning to become a legend in his own time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iEieLEh3gzKd0RtMlH52jFOCCGo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91246'),
  ('1120575753033796266', 'Mao Xue Woof', 2021, 'Reality', null, null, 'Mao Buyi, Li Xueqin', null, 'Mao Xue Woof is a scene-based reality show variety show with the relationship of original friends as the starting point. The program takes friendship as the link, and takes "Mao Xue Woof''s Home" as the main shooting scene, telling the real and interesting stories of Mao Bu, Li Xueqin and their friends who meet here every week, tearing apart the status quo of daily life in laughter, showing the rich youth life and spiritual world of young people and recording the real growth. The program is broadcast every week all the year round, bringing companionship and emotional health healing to the hard-working young people in the city.', 'Mao Xue Woof is a scene-based reality show variety show with the relationship of original friends as the starting point. The program takes friendship as the link, and takes "Mao Xue Woof''s Home" as the main shooting scene, telling the real and interesting stories of Mao Bu, Li Xueqin and their friends who meet here every week, tearing apart the status quo of daily life in laughter, showing the rich youth life and spiritual world of young people and recording the real growth. The program is broadcast every week all the year round, bringing companionship and emotional health healing to the hard-working young people in the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYBvEOxNhD3IfzapT6x1uPnTEFa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137726'),
  ('162841557446243782', 'Maoyu: Archenemy & Hero', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Jun Fukuyama, Ami Koshimizu, Chiwa Saito, Haruka Tomatsu, Nao Toyama, Miyuki Sawashiro, Banjo Ginga, Misato Fukuen', 'TV-14', 'The story is set in a world embroiled by war between Humans and Demons. The Humans’ greatest hero invades the Demon Queen’s castle determined to vanquish her. However, instead of fighting back, the Queen proposes an alliance with the Hero. She explains how a sudden end to the war can bring further chaos to the world as the Humans once united to stand against their common enemies would eventually begin fighting among themselves, with similar issues already occurring at the Demon Realm. Convinced by her words, the Hero joins forces with the Queen and together they execute a plan to bring prosperity and a lasting peace to both Humans and Demons alike.', 'The story is set in a world embroiled by war between Humans and Demons. The Humans’ greatest hero invades the Demon Queen’s castle determined to vanquish her. However, instead of fighting back, the Queen proposes an alliance with the Hero. She explains how a sudden end to the war can bring further chaos to the world as the Humans once united to stand against their common enemies would eventually begin fighting among themselves, with similar issues already occurring at the Demon Realm. Convinced by her words, the Hero joins forces with the Queen and together they execute a plan to bring prosperity and a lasting peace to both Humans and Demons alike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrYpyvYhfOD4DT58BvYGIhP4Ezv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46302'),
  ('660850528884935600', 'MaPa', 2020, 'Drama', 'Alexander Lindh', 'Alexander Lindh', 'Max Mauff, Pola Friedrichs, Lia von Blarer, Maryam Zaree, Bastian Reiber, Christin Nichols', null, 'Metin is a young man who has lost his girlfriend and the mother of his baby daughter. A couple of month later at his 30th birthday he struggles more badly than tough everyday life as a single parent.', 'Metin is a young man who has lost his girlfriend and the mother of his baby daughter. A couple of month later at his 30th birthday he struggles more badly than tough everyday life as a single parent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sK5pUecPzaKkX3q00t43Eo2DJWW.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:105702'),
