  ('202098694025786082', 'Masada', 1981, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Joel Oliansky', null, 'Peter O''Toole, Peter Strauss, Barbara Carrera, Alan Feinstein, Giulia Pagano, Anthony Quayle, Paul L. Smith, David Warner', null, 'Masada is a 1981 American historical drama television miniseries aired on ABC under the tentpole ABC Novel for Television. The screenplay by Joel Oliansky is based on Ernest Gann''s 1971 novel The Antagonists. A dramatization of the historical siege of the Masada citadel in Roman Palestine by legions of the Roman Empire in AD 73. A siege that ended when the Roman armies entered the fortress, only to discover the mass suicide by the Jewish defenders when defeat became imminent.', 'Masada is a 1981 American historical drama television miniseries aired on ABC under the tentpole ABC Novel for Television. The screenplay by Joel Oliansky is based on Ernest Gann''s 1971 novel The Antagonists. A dramatization of the historical siege of the Masada citadel in Roman Palestine by legions of the Roman Empire in AD 73. A siege that ended when the Roman armies entered the fortress, only to discover the mass suicide by the Jewish defenders when defeat became imminent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kakVJ2TT4gCfRGGgRTL2FJOvbRB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13397'),
  ('745446849034196200', 'Masameer County', 2021, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Abdulaziz Almuzaini, Malik Nejer', null, 'Malik Nejer, Abdulaziz Alshehri, Mazroa Al-Mazroa, Malik Nejer, Abdulaziz Almuzaini', null, 'A humorous view of a changing Saudi Arabia, as the Masameer gang venture into a global media war, a long-standing tribal feud, and a health craze gone too far.', 'A humorous view of a changing Saudi Arabia, as the Masameer gang venture into a global media war, a long-standing tribal feud, and a health craze gone too far.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xgmvdo5lfdyXiGlMZ2edLPgkY2n.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:128240'),
  ('438114164715205267', 'Masamune Shogun', 1987, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Ken Watanabe, Junko Sakurada, Tomokazu Miura, Teruhiko Saigō, Kinya Kitaoji, Keiko Takeshita, Junko Sakurada, Tomokazu Miura', null, 'Broadcast TV drama NHK broadcast on January 4 to December 13, 1987 (Showa 62). In the questionnaire survey conducted by NHK, it is shining in the most favorite river drama. The original is Yamaka Sosaichi''s novel "Date Masamune", the biggest drama on the theme of the Date house was the first time in 17 years since the "Shinnogi remained" (1970), which painted Datejo in the Edo period. It depicts the life of Matsudo Date of Sengoku warrior · Date Masamune who built the foundation of Sendai clan 620,000 stones in his generation as a result of my own wisdom and talent.', 'Broadcast TV drama NHK broadcast on January 4 to December 13, 1987 (Showa 62). In the questionnaire survey conducted by NHK, it is shining in the most favorite river drama. The original is Yamaka Sosaichi''s novel "Date Masamune", the biggest drama on the theme of the Date house was the first time in 17 years since the "Shinnogi remained" (1970), which painted Datejo in the Edo period. It depicts the life of Matsudo Date of Sengoku warrior · Date Masamune who built the foundation of Sendai clan 620,000 stones in his generation as a result of my own wisdom and talent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nugtOtKlyIcZ8o3rhHEmImk5aFr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75535'),
  ('622518141341200707', 'Masamune-kun''s Revenge', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Natsuki Hanae, Ayaka Ohashi, Inori Minase, Suzuko Mimori, Azusa Tadokoro, Saori Hayami', 'TV-14', '"I''ve returned to this town for revenge!" Eight years ago, Makabe Masamune, a weak and chubby boy, was harshly rejected by the beautiful Adagaki Aki. Now, he''s lost a ton of weight, changed his name, and returned as a handsome teenage boy... all to make the "Brutal Princess" Aki fall in love with him so that he can reject her just as harshly as she did.', '"I''ve returned to this town for revenge!" Eight years ago, Makabe Masamune, a weak and chubby boy, was harshly rejected by the beautiful Adagaki Aki. Now, he''s lost a ton of weight, changed his name, and returned as a handsome teenage boy... all to make the "Brutal Princess" Aki fall in love with him so that he can reject her just as harshly as she did.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lOkjPZ2EO0K1H0CgRAd8SLBTOav.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69295'),
  ('774914597989797727', 'Masha and the Bear', 2009, 'Animation, Family, Kids, Comedy', 'Oleg Kuzovkov', null, 'Boris Kutnevich', 'TV-Y', 'Masha is an energetic three-year-old who can’t seem to keep herself out of trouble. Bear is a warm, fatherly figure that does his best to guide his friend and keep her from harm, often ending up the unintended victim of her misadventures.', 'Masha is an energetic three-year-old who can’t seem to keep herself out of trouble. Bear is a warm, fatherly figure that does his best to guide his friend and keep her from harm, often ending up the unintended victim of her misadventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wPkeRunw71Mm10xQYKAwGG0NLgt.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:46080'),
  ('555873426528426627', 'Masha''s Nursery Rhymes', 2024, null, null, null, 'Elsie Fisher, Tang Xiaoxi', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uFFYFVi1p7pBRGw5XHEGooQm1yG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317591'),
  ('755662958516699032', 'Masha''s Spooky Stories', 2014, 'Kids, Animation', null, 'Ilya Trusov, Denis Chervyakov', 'Alina Kukushkina', 'TV-Y', 'Masha explains why there''s no need to be scared of things like monsters, the dark, going to a new school, thunder and other common childhood fears.', 'Masha explains why there''s no need to be scared of things like monsters, the dark, going to a new school, thunder and other common childhood fears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8d9wrsPAO7FQxwX0YsToWiUPJWs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74157'),
  ('870293290209693548', 'Masha''s tales', 2012, 'Animation, Kids, Family, Comedy', 'Oleg Kuzovkov, Lisa Judson', null, 'Alina Kukushkina', 'TV-G', 'Masha, it turns out, loves to tell stories! And she tells them, as would any child with creativity, a little in her own way - because children see the world, not as we, adults.', 'Masha, it turns out, loves to tell stories! And she tells them, as would any child with creativity, a little in her own way - because children see the world, not as we, adults.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hmij2KZAm5QlmYmkctMbuEXbjuE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:55397'),
  ('733602103276129562', 'Mashin Creator Wataru', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids, Comedy', null, null, 'Mutsumi Tamura, Tomokazu Sugita, Atsumi Tanezaki, Katsuyuki Konishi, Megu Umezawa, Rie Kugimiya, Aoi Ichikawa, Shunichi Toki', null, 'Wataru Hoshibe, an elementary school student in fourth grade, is a RyuTuber who wants to become a superstar. His adventure begins in the Chubukai parallel world alongside Ryujinmaru, a Mashin that Wataru created out of blocks to defeat the final boss, Enjoda!', 'Wataru Hoshibe, an elementary school student in fourth grade, is a RyuTuber who wants to become a superstar. His adventure begins in the Chubukai parallel world alongside Ryujinmaru, a Mashin that Wataru created out of blocks to defeat the final boss, Enjoda!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oeRcjRVXLDUe2gq8niQztrQh5zN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:271264'),
  ('174611785810513181', 'Mashin Hero Wataru', 1988, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mayumi Tanaka, Tessyo Genda, Megumi Hayashibara, Tomomichi Nishimura, Kenichi Ogata, Kazue Ikura, Konami Yoshida, Yumiko Shibata', null, 'Mashin Hero Wataru is a comedy/adventure Super Robot multimedia franchise originally consisting of 45 episode anime series created by Sunrise first aired on April 15, 1988. Sunrise credited "Hajime Yatate" for the storyline and Shuji Iuchi directed the series. The series employs a kinetic visual gag style, often employing characters running with their feet over their shoulders derived from Sunrise''s previous Super Robot anime series Choriki Robo Galatt.', 'Mashin Hero Wataru is a comedy/adventure Super Robot multimedia franchise originally consisting of 45 episode anime series created by Sunrise first aired on April 15, 1988. Sunrise credited "Hajime Yatate" for the storyline and Shuji Iuchi directed the series. The series employs a kinetic visual gag style, often employing characters running with their feet over their shoulders derived from Sunrise''s previous Super Robot anime series Choriki Robo Galatt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBFGjSWGyIwtQ80sDXFXNFmwVaP.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:19612'),
  ('164056200240869353', 'Mashin Sentai Kiramager', 2020, 'Action & Adventure, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Rio Komiya, Rui Kihara, Yume Shinjo, Atomu Mizuishi, Mio Kudo, Kohei Shoji, Inori Minase, Kenichi Suzumura', null, 'After the kingdom of Crystalia is plunged into a deep darkness by Yodonheim, the army of darkness. Princess Mabushina, comes to Earth with the Kiramai Stones to find individuals with strong "shining spirits" to become the Kiramagers and fight against the Yodonheim Army.', 'After the kingdom of Crystalia is plunged into a deep darkness by Yodonheim, the army of darkness. Princess Mabushina, comes to Earth with the Kiramai Stones to find individuals with strong "shining spirits" to become the Kiramagers and fight against the Yodonheim Army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dpi2guo9nxIkpBiV2I5IUjjV8n4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106803'),
  ('862475439963445459', 'Mashiroiro Symphony: The Color of Lovers', 2011, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Takahiro Mizushima, Mai Gotou, Oma Ichimura, Mayumi Yoshida, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Harumi Sakurai, Michiru Yuimoto, Harumi Sakurai', null, 'When boys suddenly get into places where they''ve never been allowed before, some girls tend to get upset. So when the decision is made to merge the elite Yuihime Girls'' Private Academy and the coeducational Kagamidai Private Academy, everyone wants to take extra care in avoiding trouble while bringing the two Privates together. Therefore, rather than just bringing the Kagamidai boys into the Yuihime girls'' school all at once, a plan is concocted in which a group of test males will be inserted into the Girls'' Private Academy first. Thus, poor young Shingo finds himself being thrown as a sacrificial lamb to the lionesses of Yuihime, who aren''t exactly waiting for him with open arms. Will Shingo manage to survive the estrogen soaked death pit that is Yuihime? Can the girls learn to be more receptive to the boys? And just how long until something involving panties will cause emotions to flare, sparks to fly and the battle of the sexes to explode?', 'When boys suddenly get into places where they''ve never been allowed before, some girls tend to get upset. So when the decision is made to merge the elite Yuihime Girls'' Private Academy and the coeducational Kagamidai Private Academy, everyone wants to take extra care in avoiding trouble while bringing the two Privates together. Therefore, rather than just bringing the Kagamidai boys into the Yuihime girls'' school all at once, a plan is concocted in which a group of test males will be inserted into the Girls'' Private Academy first. Thus, poor young Shingo finds himself being thrown as a sacrificial lamb to the lionesses of Yuihime, who aren''t exactly waiting for him with open arms. Will Shingo manage to survive the estrogen soaked death pit that is Yuihime? Can the girls learn to be more receptive to the boys? And just how long until something involving panties will cause emotions to flare, sparks to fly and the battle of the sexes to explode?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hWCJ6cfEglN7elvABd52WnCu7o6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:53726'),
  ('842311163812378724', 'MASHLE: MAGIC AND MUSCLES', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Chiaki Kobayashi, Reiji Kawashima, Kaito Ishikawa, Takuya Eguchi, Reina Ueda, Hiroaki Hirata, Hiroshi Watanabe', 'TV-14', 'This is a world of magic where magic is used for everything. But deep in the forest exists a young man who spends his time training and bulking up. He can''t use magic, but he enjoys a peaceful life with his father. But one day, his life is put in danger! Will his muscular body protect him from the magic users who are out to get him? Powerfully trained muscles crush magic as this abnormal magical fantasy begins!', 'This is a world of magic where magic is used for everything. But deep in the forest exists a young man who spends his time training and bulking up. He can''t use magic, but he enjoys a peaceful life with his father. But one day, his life is put in danger! Will his muscular body protect him from the magic users who are out to get him? Powerfully trained muscles crush magic as this abnormal magical fantasy begins!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yORTvQOQTZzZ9JRIpRH4QaIaQBm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204832'),
  ('746823284968434156', 'Mask', 2015, 'Drama, Crime', null, 'Choi Ho-chul', 'Soo Ae, Ju Ji-hoon, Yeon Jeong-hun, Yoo In-young, Jeong Dong-hwan, Yang Mi-kyung, Lee Ho-won, Jeon Kuk-hwan', null, 'Ji-Sook goes through a difficult period, due to her father''s private loan. She begins living as Eun-Ha. Eun-Ha is from a wealthy family and looks like Ji-Sook. When Min-Woo was only seven years old, he became the successor of a large corporation which his family ran. Due to his position, he cannot reveal his feelings. Through his family, he meets Eun-Ha. He notices she is different from other wealthy woman that he has met. Min-Woo has feelings for her.', 'Ji-Sook goes through a difficult period, due to her father''s private loan. She begins living as Eun-Ha. Eun-Ha is from a wealthy family and looks like Ji-Sook. When Min-Woo was only seven years old, he became the successor of a large corporation which his family ran. Due to his position, he cannot reveal his feelings. Through his family, he meets Eun-Ha. He notices she is different from other wealthy woman that he has met. Min-Woo has feelings for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5cS9hm4c7ZGz3JbtOv0B6D3SDm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62806'),
  ('813994150511366550', 'Mask Girl', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy, Mystery, Crime', 'Kim Yong-hoon', 'Kim Yong-hoon', 'Ko Hyun-jung, Nana, Lee Han-byeol, Ahn Jae-hong, Yeom Hye-ran, Kim Ga-hee, Shin Ye-seo, Moon Sook', 'TV-MA', 'An office worker who is insecure about her looks becomes a masked internet personality by night — until a chain of ill-fated events overtakes her life.', 'An office worker who is insecure about her looks becomes a masked internet personality by night — until a chain of ill-fated events overtakes her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3O8uTUpt76ShtEtNNrOJpcwQROH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156888'),
