  ('635051243503764302', 'Master Devil Do Not Kiss Me', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Shang Tao', null, 'Li Hongyi, Xing Fei, Zhang Jiongmin, Jason Fu, Qie Lutong, Yang Zhiying, Li Cenyi, Li You Tong', null, 'After her mother''s death, An Chuxia is taken in by a wealthy socialite and starts a new life at a prestigious school. As the fiancée of Han Qilu, she faces challenges in a world of privilege, striving to make a difference while navigating complex relationships.', 'After her mother''s death, An Chuxia is taken in by a wealthy socialite and starts a new life at a prestigious school. As the fiancée of Han Qilu, she faces challenges in a world of privilege, striving to make a difference while navigating complex relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kBATllqQEqbh1H0iTAoCwATHp7R.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69568'),
  ('795042432106386547', 'Master Eder and his Pumuckl', 1982, 'Kids, Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Ulrich König, Ellis Kaut', 'Johannes Kai, Ellis Kaut', 'Gustl Bayrhammer, Hans Clarin, Erni Singerl, Toni Berger', 'NR', 'Pumuckl is a Kobold from a German radio play series for children. He is a descendant of the Klabautermänner. He is invisible to people around him except for the master carpenter Eder with whom Pumuckl lives. Pumuckl was invented by Ellis Kaut for a radio play series of the Bavarian Radio in 1961. Later on it was turned into a very successful TV series. Three movies and a musical also deal with the adventures of the little kobold. Pumuckl is one of the most popular characters in children''s entertainment in Germany and several generations have now grown up with the cheeky but funny little Kobold.', 'Pumuckl is a Kobold from a German radio play series for children. He is a descendant of the Klabautermänner. He is invisible to people around him except for the master carpenter Eder with whom Pumuckl lives. Pumuckl was invented by Ellis Kaut for a radio play series of the Bavarian Radio in 1961. Later on it was turned into a very successful TV series. Three movies and a musical also deal with the adventures of the little kobold. Pumuckl is one of the most popular characters in children''s entertainment in Germany and several generations have now grown up with the cheeky but funny little Kobold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/utrSWOMSeKuwdI0B3YA2wpsUp4B.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:30688'),
  ('484467203856085539', 'Master Keaton', 1998, 'Mystery, Animation, Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Ichiro Nagai, Houko Kuwashima, Norihiro Inoue', null, 'The amazing Taichi Keaton works on cases around the globe that always lead to adventure! He combines his arsenal of multidisciplinary expertise in investigation, archeology, and survival with his experience as a professor, a Falklands Conflict veteran and a SAS agent to unravel the often dangerous challenges in each riveting episode.', 'The amazing Taichi Keaton works on cases around the globe that always lead to adventure! He combines his arsenal of multidisciplinary expertise in investigation, archeology, and survival with his experience as a professor, a Falklands Conflict veteran and a SAS agent to unravel the often dangerous challenges in each riveting episode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5oMdGZa54VbeLVMed4CioWTVjQJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34674'),
