  ('54491504690735557', 'Master of Destiny', 2015, 'Drama', null, null, 'Liza Wong Ming-Chuen, Wayne Lai Yiu-Cheung, Hawick Lau Hau-Wai, Edwin Siu, Kenny Wong Tak-Ban, Natalie Wong Kei-Ying, Kimmy Tong Fei, Angie Chiu Nga-Chi', null, 'Kwan Yeuk-nam is a powerful woman. After her husband committed suicide due to a business failure, she single-handedly raised her three sons to adulthood, all whilst establishing her business empire, Sun Hon Lik. Now ready to retire, she is prepared to pass down her empire to her three sons.', 'Kwan Yeuk-nam is a powerful woman. After her husband committed suicide due to a business failure, she single-handedly raised her three sons to adulthood, all whilst establishing her business empire, Sun Hon Lik. Now ready to retire, she is prepared to pass down her empire to her three sons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbo447n5Gv80W4qAVsbDSLqwicP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95511'),
  ('936279881993036341', 'Master of Mosquiton ''99', 1997, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Satoru Akahori, Hiroshi Negishi', null, 'Takehito Koyasu, Yuka Imai, Atsuko Tanaka, Yuji Ueda, Michiko Neya, Banjo Ginga', null, 'Catholic schoolgirl Inaho discovers that a vampire, Mosquiton, is feeding off of her classmates. So she stakes him, but he is revived after her blood comes in contact with the his remains. Mosquiton becomes her slave and also a history teacher. Together, along with Yuuki and Honou, the unlikely duo have many escapades and adventures. One of Inaho''s main goals is to find the mythical O-Part to make some money!', 'Catholic schoolgirl Inaho discovers that a vampire, Mosquiton, is feeding off of her classmates. So she stakes him, but he is revived after her blood comes in contact with the his remains. Mosquiton becomes her slave and also a history teacher. Together, along with Yuuki and Honou, the unlikely duo have many escapades and adventures. One of Inaho''s main goals is to find the mythical O-Part to make some money!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1D5fT2W9P3tJaq6uhjbxGNz3q7T.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37532'),
  ('773385831461487465', 'Master of My Own', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Hong Jiu', 'Lin Gengxin, Tan Songyun, Liu Chang, Su Xin, Wang Xiuzhu, Bing Liu, Gong Beibi, Qu Gaowei', 'TV-PG', 'A story about one subduing the other follows the "T-Rex" boss and his "animal trainer." Ning Meng has always dreamed of moving up the corporate ladder to become a director, but her boss doesn''t think that she has what it takes to succeed in the investing world.', 'A story about one subduing the other follows the "T-Rex" boss and his "animal trainer." Ning Meng has always dreamed of moving up the corporate ladder to become a director, but her boss doesn''t think that she has what it takes to succeed in the investing world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDBEgk9s9EvHcpTaYlR6XlRQfL5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:199925'),
  ('522842484491531796', 'Master of None', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alan Yang, Aziz Ansari', null, 'Lena Waithe, Naomi Ackie', 'TV-MA', '30-year-old New York actor Dev takes on such pillars of maturity as the first big job, a serious relationship, and busting sex offenders on the subway.', '30-year-old New York actor Dev takes on such pillars of maturity as the first big job, a serious relationship, and busting sex offenders on the subway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AcJM86PhgHAfbrF4dMKBaqO3cHV.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:64254'),
  ('123717547390325302', 'Master of Study', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Norifusa Mita', 'Yun Gyeong-a', 'Kim Soo-ro, Bae Doona, Oh Yoon-ah, Yoo Seung-ho, Park Ji-yeon, Ko A-sung, Lee Hyun-woo, Im Ji-eun', null, 'Master of Study is about a determined lawyer who takes up a teaching position at a failing high school. To save the school from the ax, he comes up with the unconventional plan of starting a special class curriculum devoted to getting the school''s five worst students into the country''s top university.', 'Master of Study is about a determined lawyer who takes up a teaching position at a failing high school. To save the school from the ax, he comes up with the unconventional plan of starting a special class curriculum devoted to getting the school''s five worst students into the country''s top university.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jcuMbR8X2AbKNPne0HYGCrxqlBj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31794'),
  ('539065120124728668', 'Master of the House', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Narilya Gulmongkolpech, Teerapong Liaorakwong, Chartayodom Hiranyatithi, Nussaba Punnakan, Thanavate Siriwattanakul, Claudia Chakrabandhu Na Ayudya, Narupornkamol Chaisang, Thitinan Rattanathitinan', 'TV-MA', 'A family enters a power struggle following the death of their patriarch, who leaves behind his diamond empire — and the housekeeper he recently married.', 'A family enters a power struggle following the death of their patriarch, who leaves behind his diamond empire — and the housekeeper he recently married.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJnrzJWTFXUN64EUiFzHCMj9SfW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:250850'),
  ('13558184289169541', 'Master''s Sun', 2013, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Drama', 'Hong Mi-ran, Hong Jeong-eun', 'Hong Mi-ran, Hong Jeong-eun', 'So Ji-sub, Gong Hyo-jin, Seo In-guk, Kim Yoo-ri, Hwang Sun-hee, Han Bo-reum, Park Hee-von, Kim Mi-kyeong', 'TV-14', 'Joo Joong-won is the arrogant, greedy CEO of Kingdom, a conglomerate that includes a supermall and a hotel. "Ghost whisperer” Tae Gong-shil, is a misunderstood outcast who can''t keep a boyfriend or a job since a near death experience left her seeing needy ghosts. She feels compelled to help them resolve their earthly issues so they can move on to the afterlife... and he feels compelled to think she''s crazy. Soon their lives merge into a complicated web of hijinx, misunderstandings, and... yes, love.', 'Joo Joong-won is the arrogant, greedy CEO of Kingdom, a conglomerate that includes a supermall and a hotel. "Ghost whisperer” Tae Gong-shil, is a misunderstood outcast who can''t keep a boyfriend or a job since a near death experience left her seeing needy ghosts. She feels compelled to help them resolve their earthly issues so they can move on to the afterlife... and he feels compelled to think she''s crazy. Soon their lives merge into a complicated web of hijinx, misunderstandings, and... yes, love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dNQTTHAirWwCpQM85amONPcZSA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:57646'),
  ('984640933898150790', 'MasterChef', 2005, 'Reality', null, null, 'Anna Haugh, Grace Dent', null, 'Into the kitchen and under the spotlight. Amateur cooks duel it out for the right to be called the MasterChef UK Champion. Initially named Masterchef Goes Large, the series changed its name to Masterchef in 2008.', 'Into the kitchen and under the spotlight. Amateur cooks duel it out for the right to be called the MasterChef UK Champion. Initially named Masterchef Goes Large, the series changed its name to Masterchef in 2008.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aMDr01WW5nG4tF4VYjn3Mbzfx6x.jpg', 22, 'tmdb:tv:25992'),
