  ('786702468656374733', 'McDonald & Dodds', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime, Comedy', 'Robert Murphy', null, 'Tala Gouveia, Jason Watkins, Claire Skinner, Bhavik C. Pankhania', null, 'Two detectives, DCI McDonald and DS Dodds, who seemingly have nothing in common, are thrown together and forge a rumbustious friendship and entertaining partnership.', 'Two detectives, DCI McDonald and DS Dodds, who seemingly have nothing in common, are thrown together and forge a rumbustious friendship and entertaining partnership.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yR9oUsGFsGOBcygzjF0cA2c45bx.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:99962'),
  ('31996346132736803', 'McGREGOR FOREVER', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Conor McGregor', 'TV-MA', 'Conor McGregor''s brutal strikes and trash-talking swagger made him the UFC''s biggest draw. This rousing documentary series follows his dynamic career.', 'Conor McGregor''s brutal strikes and trash-talking swagger made him the UFC''s biggest draw. This rousing documentary series follows his dynamic career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8vjMXey1TDjtXMTzxxG8c0GHvgr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:225292'),
  ('319453348665396856', 'McHale''s Navy', 1962, 'Comedy, War & Politics', null, null, 'Ernest Borgnine, Joe Flynn, Tim Conway, Carl Ballantine, Gary Vinson, Billy Sands, Edson Stroll, John Wright', 'TV-G', 'An experienced South Pacific Sea Dog by the name of Quinton McHale, was commissioned as a Lieutenant Commander into the U.S. Navy Reserve at the start of World War II. McHale was made the Skipper of the Torpedo Patrol (PT) Boat #73 stationed at the U.S. Naval Installation on the island of Taratupa in the Southwest Pacific. The 73 ''Family'' included, among others, a con man and amateur Magician, a womanizing hunk, a dedicated Family man, a guitar-playing, moonshine-making Tennessee good ol'' boy, and even a deserter from the Japanese Navy, who was an excellent cook.', 'An experienced South Pacific Sea Dog by the name of Quinton McHale, was commissioned as a Lieutenant Commander into the U.S. Navy Reserve at the start of World War II. McHale was made the Skipper of the Torpedo Patrol (PT) Boat #73 stationed at the U.S. Naval Installation on the island of Taratupa in the Southwest Pacific. The 73 ''Family'' included, among others, a con man and amateur Magician, a womanizing hunk, a dedicated Family man, a guitar-playing, moonshine-making Tennessee good ol'' boy, and even a deserter from the Japanese Navy, who was an excellent cook.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fTbprFBTt4lZb9CQpHZ4FR4BAHk.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:11258'),
  ('670855571553751113', 'McLeod''s Daughters', 2001, 'Drama', 'Posie Graeme-Evans, Caroline Stanton', null, 'Simmone Mackinnon, Doris Younane, Luke Jacobz, Abi Tucker, Matt Passmore, Gillian Alexy', null, 'When Jack McLeod passes away, his two daughters inherit Drovers Run, a vast cattle ranch in the Australian outback. Ultimately, Tess and Claire decide to run the ranch together, with their housekeeper, Meg, her teenage daughter, Jodi, and a local girl, Becky. Their lives are hard and the obstacles many, but the rewards are every bit as grand as the wild open land they''ve inherited.', 'When Jack McLeod passes away, his two daughters inherit Drovers Run, a vast cattle ranch in the Australian outback. Ultimately, Tess and Claire decide to run the ranch together, with their housekeeper, Meg, her teenage daughter, Jodi, and a local girl, Becky. Their lives are hard and the obstacles many, but the rewards are every bit as grand as the wild open land they''ve inherited.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twQwGmxL6XFdpSBikzINOdVm17M.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:2041'),
  ('264513121432204114', 'McMafia', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', 'James Watkins, Hossein Amini', null, 'James Norton, Juliet Rylance, Faye Marsay, Kirill Pirogov', 'TV-14', 'Alex Godman, the English-raised son of Russian mafia exiles, has spent his life trying to escape the shadow of their past, building his own legitimate business and forging a life with his girlfriend Rebecca. But when a murder forces his family''s past to return to threaten them, Alex is drawn into the criminal underworld and must confront his values to protect those he loves.', 'Alex Godman, the English-raised son of Russian mafia exiles, has spent his life trying to escape the shadow of their past, building his own legitimate business and forging a life with his girlfriend Rebecca. But when a murder forces his family''s past to return to threaten them, Alex is drawn into the criminal underworld and must confront his values to protect those he loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jdt7RFfVCGWrNnrxeQ0Us9kGhJu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75666'),
  ('306982757264319481', 'McMillan & Wife', 1971, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Leonard B. Stern', null, 'Rock Hudson, John Schuck, Martha Raye, Richard Gilliland', 'TV-PG', 'McMillan & Wife is a lighthearted American police procedural that aired on NBC from September 17, 1971 to April 24, 1977. Starring Rock Hudson and Susan Saint James in the title roles, the series premiered in 90-minute episodes as part of the wheel series NBC Mystery Movie, in rotation with Columbo and McCloud. Initially airing on Wednesday night, the original line-up was shifted to Sundays in the second season, where it aired for the rest of its run. This was the first element to be created specially for the Mystery Movie strand.', 'McMillan & Wife is a lighthearted American police procedural that aired on NBC from September 17, 1971 to April 24, 1977. Starring Rock Hudson and Susan Saint James in the title roles, the series premiered in 90-minute episodes as part of the wheel series NBC Mystery Movie, in rotation with Columbo and McCloud. Initially airing on Wednesday night, the original line-up was shifted to Sundays in the second season, where it aired for the rest of its run. This was the first element to be created specially for the Mystery Movie strand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AfR5azFdmuEJ3V89mYRDSUpd7ul.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:10848'),
  ('783473039363060099', 'McMillion$', 2020, 'Documentary, Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Michael C. Pizzuto, Pelé Kizy, Cristal Bubblin, Doug Mathews, Mark Devereux, Rob Holm, Tom Kneir, Robin Colombo', 'TV-14', 'A detailed account of the McDonald''s Monopoly game scam during the 1990s as told by the participants in the case, including the prizewinners and the FBI agents who caught the security officer who orchestrated the entire scheme.', 'A detailed account of the McDonald''s Monopoly game scam during the 1990s as told by the participants in the case, including the prizewinners and the FBI agents who caught the security officer who orchestrated the entire scheme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xyUciqZC5hGYJqefmbGbTy5fxYh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96213'),
