  ('86379410228628271', 'Me', 2024, 'Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Barry Levy', null, 'Lucian-River Chauhan, Abigail Pniowsky, Dilshad Vadsaria, Amanda Reid, Jessy Yates', 'TV-G', 'New school. New family. New superpower. It''s a season of change for 12-year-old Ben Vasani when he discovers that he can transform into anyone he meets. As a shapeshifter, Ben must figure out who he is and who he wants to be.', 'New school. New family. New superpower. It''s a season of change for 12-year-old Ben Vasani when he discovers that he can transform into anyone he meets. As a shapeshifter, Ben must figure out who he is and who he wants to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYE9357q2thkuiRAsMA60H0eKiB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:256693'),
  ('675100677579149024', 'Me and Thee', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'laWila', null, 'Naravit Lertratkosum, Phuwin Tangsakyuen, Supha Sangaworawong, Pongsapak Udomphoch, Tanapon Sukumpantanasan, Pattraphus Borattasuwan, Teeradech Vitheepanich, Chayakorn Jutamas', null, 'An introverted photographer''s life changes when a former mafia boss hires him for love advice, only to end up falling for him instead.', 'An introverted photographer''s life changes when a former mafia boss hires him for love advice, only to end up falling for him instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vq13Nvh0mMUAWGVA9TB9JnvoO5M.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278165'),
