  ('754343040802015834', 'Melrose Place', 1992, 'Drama, Soap', 'Darren Star', null, 'Thomas Calabro, Heather Locklear, Josie Bissett, Rob Estes, Kelly Rutherford, Jack Wagner, Jamie Luner', 'TV-14', 'Follow the lives of a group of young adults living in a brownstone apartment complex on Melrose Place, in Los Angeles, California.', 'Follow the lives of a group of young adults living in a brownstone apartment complex on Melrose Place, in Los Angeles, California.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kIc03DwT3DPd48lKlbpyPxx3O1S.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:4349'),
  ('434786674402583820', 'Melrose Place', 2009, 'Drama', 'Darren Star, Todd Slavkin, Darren Swimmer', null, 'Katie Cassidy, Ashlee Simpson, Jessica Lucas, Stephanie Jacobsen, Michael Rady, Shaun Sipos, Colin Egglesfield', 'TV-14', 'In an elegant Spanish-style apartment building in the trendy Melrose neighborhood of Los Angeles, a diverse group of 20-somethings have formed a close-knit surrogate family. However, when a bloody body is found floating in the courtyard pool, the police soon discover that almost everyone had a reason to want the deceased out of the way.', 'In an elegant Spanish-style apartment building in the trendy Melrose neighborhood of Los Angeles, a diverse group of 20-somethings have formed a close-knit surrogate family. However, when a bloody body is found floating in the courtyard pool, the police soon discover that almost everyone had a reason to want the deceased out of the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90KR19Cqhgl61PwN4O4N6cURAi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:18109'),
  ('1068415805772011899', 'Meltdown: Three Mile Island', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Insiders recount the events, controversies and lingering effects of the accident at the Three Mile Island nuclear power plant in Pennsylvania.', 'Insiders recount the events, controversies and lingering effects of the accident at the Three Mile Island nuclear power plant in Pennsylvania.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6JGixD9P7hOhHBfiTpAdzWcpCxV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:198200'),
  ('1089517856708628906', 'Melting Me Softly', 2019, 'Mystery, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Shin Woo-chul', 'Baek Mi-kyoung', 'Ji Chang-wook, Won Jin-ah, Yoon Se-a, Im Won-hee, Kim Won-hae, Kil Hae-yeon, Shim Hyung-tak, Seo Jeong-yeon', null, 'Ma Dong-chan and Go Mi-ran are both frozen during an experiment. They wake up 20 years later instead of 24 hours later and must keep their body temperature above 30°C in order to survive.', 'Ma Dong-chan and Go Mi-ran are both frozen during an experiment. They wake up 20 years later instead of 24 hours later and must keep their body temperature above 30°C in order to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tci1NuarDuRJqCVKYzsX4FVUL91.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92911'),
  ('917318023080234306', 'Melur Untuk Firdaus', 2022, 'Drama, Family', 'Cik Nor Cinta', 'Wan Mahani Wan Hasan', 'Anna Jobling, Meerqeen, Fimie Don, Haleeda Mazlin, Zainol Ismail, Kuza, Azhar Amir, Hairi Safwan', null, 'Melur Untuk Firdaus is a 2022 Malaysian television drama series directed by Zamri Zakaria with a script by Wan Mahani Wan Hasan. Starring Anna Jobling, Meerqeen, Nesa Idrus, Fimie Don and many others, this series is an adaptation of the novel My Rude Wife by Cik Nor Cinta and started airing on Slot Lestary, TV3 from 27 May 2022 until 15 July 2022 replacing Do You Love Me Captain..', 'Melur Untuk Firdaus is a 2022 Malaysian television drama series directed by Zamri Zakaria with a script by Wan Mahani Wan Hasan. Starring Anna Jobling, Meerqeen, Nesa Idrus, Fimie Don and many others, this series is an adaptation of the novel My Rude Wife by Cik Nor Cinta and started airing on Slot Lestary, TV3 from 27 May 2022 until 15 July 2022 replacing Do You Love Me Captain..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVxQxsY3bQWTabHUi2Qr3aoOafk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:203057'),
  ('1059216185419999448', 'Memento Mori', 2023, 'Crime', null, null, 'Yon González, Francisco Ortiz, Olivia Baglivi', null, 'A police thriller, exploring the relationship between a murderer and the police officer, who pursues him in a life-or-death duel.', 'A police thriller, exploring the relationship between a murderer and the police officer, who pursues him in a life-or-death duel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubJLcy2JjU0g2AIYPcpAgChgGQo.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:234921'),
  ('510905176762747222', 'Memories Beyond Horizon', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, '“Memories Beyond Horizon” is a Chinese reality TV show , created to spotlight emerging domestic talent in film and TV. Produced in collaboration with Zhejiang Television, Alibaba’s Youku video service, and Hong Kong’s TVB, the show features veteran film and television figures mentoring a group of 18 artists from both the mainland and Hong Kong. Each episode focuses on reinterpreting iconic scenes from classic Hong Kong films such as “Infernal Affairs” and “New Dragon Gate Inn” for their acting challenges. Among the mentors are renowned Hong Kong directors and actors, including Yee Tung-sing and Francis Ng Chun-yu, while participants include graduates from professional acting schools, industry veterans, and individuals known for modeling, singing, or high-profile relationships.', '“Memories Beyond Horizon” is a Chinese reality TV show , created to spotlight emerging domestic talent in film and TV. Produced in collaboration with Zhejiang Television, Alibaba’s Youku video service, and Hong Kong’s TVB, the show features veteran film and television figures mentoring a group of 18 artists from both the mainland and Hong Kong. Each episode focuses on reinterpreting iconic scenes from classic Hong Kong films such as “Infernal Affairs” and “New Dragon Gate Inn” for their acting challenges. Among the mentors are renowned Hong Kong directors and actors, including Yee Tung-sing and Francis Ng Chun-yu, while participants include graduates from professional acting schools, industry veterans, and individuals known for modeling, singing, or high-profile relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bc1MoKzS7UvNKZyPHVQEQwFnbP0.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:216487'),
  ('760901993201738966', 'Memories of Sherlock Holmes', 2000, 'Mystery, Crime', null, 'Yuriy Veksler', 'Vasiliy Livanov, Aleksey Petrenko, Vitali Solomin, Sergey Bekhterev, Rina Zelyonaya, Marina Levtova, Gennadiy Bogachyov, Larisa Udovichenko', null, 'Detective television series based on the works of Arthur Conan Doyle. Five films about Sherlock Holmes, shot by Igor Maslennikov earlier, were remounted in 2000, a connecting story about Conan Doyle''s literary secretary, Mr. Wood, who is preparing an anniversary collection of stories about Holmes for the beginning of the coming XX century. Sir Arthur receives huge mail every day, addressed not to him, but to Sherlock Holmes. And then one day a letter arrives with a plea for help, and Doyle begins an investigation...', 'Detective television series based on the works of Arthur Conan Doyle. Five films about Sherlock Holmes, shot by Igor Maslennikov earlier, were remounted in 2000, a connecting story about Conan Doyle''s literary secretary, Mr. Wood, who is preparing an anniversary collection of stories about Holmes for the beginning of the coming XX century. Sir Arthur receives huge mail every day, addressed not to him, but to Sherlock Holmes. And then one day a letter arrives with a plea for help, and Doyle begins an investigation...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Ow63fjWYlTZmsWWRATQb19Exoz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103758'),
  ('98887318719522478', 'Memories of the Alhambra', 2018, 'Action & Adventure, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Hyun Bin, Park Shin-hye, Chanyeol, Han Bo-reum, Park Hoon, Lee Hak-ju, Cho Hyun-chul, Min Jin-woong', 'TV-MA', 'While looking for the cryptic creator of an innovative augmented-reality game, an investment firm executive meets a woman who runs a hostel in Spain.', 'While looking for the cryptic creator of an innovative augmented-reality game, an investment firm executive meets a woman who runs a hostel in Spain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18UuytTxcPSrhptyW7hHDenN70C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83634'),
  ('508577774739284306', 'Memorist', 2020, 'Mystery, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Kim whee', '황하나, 안도하', 'Yoo Seung-ho, Lee Se-young, Cho Seong-ha, Jun Hyo-seong, Yun Ji-on, Ko Chang-seok, Lim Se-joo, Cho Han-cheul', null, 'A high school student suddenly gains supernatural powers that allow him to read people''s memories with just one touch. When he reveals his gift, he becomes a detective that solves crime.', 'A high school student suddenly gains supernatural powers that allow him to read people''s memories with just one touch. When he reveals his gift, he becomes a detective that solves crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eC5lQovhFgJma2lqkKvM1XItiZB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99478'),
  ('336988094248818272', 'Memory', 2016, 'Drama', null, 'Kim Ji-woo', 'Lee Sung-min, Kim Ji-soo, Lee Jun-ho, Yoon So-hee, Park Jin-hee, Jeon No-min, Ban Hyo-jung, Jang Kwang', null, 'This drama is about a lawyer, Park Tae Suk who finds out that he has Alzheimer’s and puts his life on the line to fight one last case. The drama depicts his vigorous efforts trying to protect the precious value of the life and family love, while his memory starts fading away.', 'This drama is about a lawyer, Park Tae Suk who finds out that he has Alzheimer’s and puts his life on the line to fight one last case. The drama depicts his vigorous efforts trying to protect the precious value of the life and family love, while his memory starts fading away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mv5MfeTbYk2uWd29p3uOzbHgbQW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65747'),
  ('799800866146520171', 'Memory In The Letter', 2024, 'Drama', 'Hungrybird', null, 'Napavit Tewaphankul, Pichayutt Chatchawansombut, Atirut Kittipattana', null, 'After moving into a new dorm, Aksorn discovers a mirror that shows Songjam, a boy from a parallel world, after a meteor shower alters its reflection.', 'After moving into a new dorm, Aksorn discovers a mirror that shows Songjam, a boy from a parallel world, after a meteor shower alters its reflection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kz34n2x0EnfcFcXpVON1STqJ4Ip.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:250721'),
  ('484344214194744757', 'Memory of a Killer', 2026, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ed Whitmore, Tracey Malone', 'Carl Joos, Erik Van Looy', 'Patrick Dempsey, Richard Harmon, Odeya Rush, Peter Gadiot, Daniel David Stewart, Michael Imperioli', 'TV-14', 'Angelo Doyle lives two totally separate lives — fearsome NYC hitman and sleepy upstate Cooperstown photocopier salesman and father. Both of them are threatened when he is diagnosed with Alzheimer''s, a disease he already lost his older brother to.', 'Angelo Doyle lives two totally separate lives — fearsome NYC hitman and sleepy upstate Cooperstown photocopier salesman and father. Both of them are threatened when he is diagnosed with Alzheimer''s, a disease he already lost his older brother to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kpXrWW6gmlngwgSa52IhBpjPuz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:291339'),
  ('1113715410504500520', 'Memory of Encaustic Tile', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Chen Yuqi, Lin Yi, Tian Ai, Sun Kai, Yan Zidong, Tang Xu, Ma Li, Fang Zibin', null, 'Amid Beijing’s hutongs, three childhood friends bound by love, loss, and legacy grow up to follow diverging paths - one chasing freedom, one preserving history, and one burying unspoken love.', 'Amid Beijing’s hutongs, three childhood friends bound by love, loss, and legacy grow up to follow diverging paths - one chasing freedom, one preserving history, and one burying unspoken love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMAg7hzKklQlhuOuIdOXlf1c9WC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156001'),
