  ('198752216700224228', 'Men of Anjolos', 1997, 'Drama, Reality', 'Farajollah Salahshoor', null, 'Jafar Dehghan, Jahanbakhsh Soltani, Mahtab Keramati, Hossein Yari', null, 'The story of six nobles and one sheepman who become Christian, run away from Romans to a cave where they will sleep 309 years, from Islamic view', 'The story of six nobles and one sheepman who become Christian, run away from Romans to a cave where they will sleep 309 years, from Islamic view', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5mOYtS8q60IgtowsxsNCpaxZwGp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60332'),
  ('736788912638925056', 'Men on a Mission', 2015, 'Reality, Comedy', null, 'Yoo Ji-hee, Choi Mi-yeon, Lee Ji-young', 'Kim Young-cheol, Min Kyung-hoon, Kang Ho-dong, Lee Su-geun, Kim Hee-chul, Seo Jang-hoon, Lee Sang-min', 'TV-14', 'Male celebs play make-believe as high schoolers, welcoming star transfer students every week and engaging in battles of witty humor and slapstick.', 'Male celebs play make-believe as high schoolers, welcoming star transfer students every week and engaging in battles of witty humor and slapstick.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2jIi55JtYKJTL1km8qHMuUilOWo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70672'),
  ('116010802532449761', 'Menace imminente', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Mystery', 'Leora Kamenetsky, David Dusa', 'Négar Djavadi, David Dusa, Bruno Fay', 'Patrick Bruel, Natacha Lindinger, Cyril Gueï, Christiane Millet, Gaia Weiss, Rascha Bucvik, Agathe Mougin, Théau Courtès', null, 'A legend of Israeli intelligence, Zeev Abadi, is urgently called back to track down the traitor who stole extremely dangerous software developed in the utmost secrecy by Unit 8200, a branch of the Israeli Army, and used for the first time in Paris. This mission leads him to collaborate with a French anti-terrorism cop, Fleur Giroud, who is tasked with solving a strange disappearance that occurred in broad daylight at Charles de Gaulle Airport...', 'A legend of Israeli intelligence, Zeev Abadi, is urgently called back to track down the traitor who stole extremely dangerous software developed in the utmost secrecy by Unit 8200, a branch of the Israeli Army, and used for the first time in Paris. This mission leads him to collaborate with a French anti-terrorism cop, Fleur Giroud, who is tasked with solving a strange disappearance that occurred in broad daylight at Charles de Gaulle Airport...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AydsFj77pYjiAuptQYlyIwvWQT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:228179'),
  ('66174538192611029', 'Menem: The President Show', 2025, 'Drama', 'Mariano Varela', null, 'Leonardo Sbaraglia, Sergio Gabriel D''Angelo, Juan Minujín, Griselda Siciliani, Jorgelina Aruzzi, Marco Antonio Caponi, Cumelén Sanz, Alberto Ajaka', null, 'Menem, an extravagant and charismatic politician, becomes president of a troubled nation. His term, marked by privatization of public enterprises, dollarization of the economy, and consulting fortunetellers, is overshadowed by terrorist attacks and the death of his son. His photographer, Olegario Salas, witnesses his life change along with Argentine society amid economic recovery and corruption.', 'Menem, an extravagant and charismatic politician, becomes president of a troubled nation. His term, marked by privatization of public enterprises, dollarization of the economy, and consulting fortunetellers, is overshadowed by terrorist attacks and the death of his son. His photographer, Olegario Salas, witnesses his life change along with Argentine society amid economic recovery and corruption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQAfWpbme4JJzczx3Ys9DaENtby.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:292073'),
