  ('705843408634164205', 'Message from Space: Galactic Wars', 1978, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Ryō Nishida, Hiroyuki Sanada, Akira Oda, Yōko Akitani, Shinzō Hotta, Jiro Shirai, Ritsuko Fujiyama, Iwao Tabuchi', 'NR', 'The 15th solar system is invaded by the Stressos. Two men, Ryû and Ayato, and a man-ape, Baru, organize the resistance. They are helped by Eolia, a mysterious woman traveling on a three masted space ship.', 'The 15th solar system is invaded by the Stressos. Two men, Ryû and Ayato, and a man-ape, Baru, organize the resistance. They are helped by Eolia, a mysterious woman traveling on a three masted space ship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/idPi7ekFM7jPQDDc2ZYOxqVBXSo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65958'),
  ('199529415873335801', 'Messi''s World Cup: The Rise of a Legend', 2024, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Lionel Messi, Mariana van Zeller, Lionel Scaloni, Gary Lineker, Roger Bennett, Gastón Edul, Enzo Fernández, Rodrigo De Paul', 'TV-14', 'Follow the legend''s epic journey through five World Cups, culminating in 2022''s triumph. As the championship run unfolds, Messi shares some of his most personal reflections—on his national team career and the challenges he''s faced.', 'Follow the legend''s epic journey through five World Cups, culminating in 2022''s triumph. As the championship run unfolds, Messi shares some of his most personal reflections—on his national team career and the challenges he''s faced.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVYu4CooA9vSEpbJPiqV9wSJll.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:237890'),
  ('1071790575776286527', 'Messiah', 2001, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Marc Warren, Marsha Thomason, Daniel Ryan', null, 'Crime drama series following the investigations of DCI Red Metcalfe.', 'Crime drama series following the investigations of DCI Red Metcalfe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPUUeDTrCj2RF0z5prSPjKkBLi6.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:13210'),
  ('785747349674442963', 'Messiah', 2020, 'Drama', 'Michael Petroni', null, 'Mehdi Dehbi, Michelle Monaghan, John Ortiz, Tomer Sisley, Stefania LaVie Owen, Sayyid El Alami, Wil Traval, Jane Adams', 'TV-MA', 'A wary CIA officer investigates a charismatic man who sparks a spiritual movement and stirs political unrest. Who exactly is he? And what does he want?', 'A wary CIA officer investigates a charismatic man who sparks a spiritual movement and stirs political unrest. Who exactly is he? And what does he want?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXWSlaizMJ1czYUiVxhgUixVdgJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81292'),
  ('439797208031791572', 'Messy Lola', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kevin Douglas, Blake Martin', 'Kevin Douglas', 'Cynthia Kaye McWilliams, Glenn Davis, Anthony Fleming III, Tracey Bonner, Jacqueline Williams, Heidi Johanningmeier, Charles Andrew Gardner, Charence Higgins', null, 'Lola is an expert at managing the mess—just not her own. She''s a reluctant mother, a flighty romantic partner, and perpetually annoyed by her insufferable coworkers. Her carefully controlled chaos is upended by the arrival of Kayla, a beacon of millennial optimism, who represents everything Lola is not. When Kayla moves in next door and then into her office, Lola''s defenses are breached. Her unwavering kindness and success holds up a mirror, forcing Lola to ask a terrifying question: at what point do we stop blaming the world for our unhappiness and start untangling the mess we''ve made of ourselves?', 'Lola is an expert at managing the mess—just not her own. She''s a reluctant mother, a flighty romantic partner, and perpetually annoyed by her insufferable coworkers. Her carefully controlled chaos is upended by the arrival of Kayla, a beacon of millennial optimism, who represents everything Lola is not. When Kayla moves in next door and then into her office, Lola''s defenses are breached. Her unwavering kindness and success holds up a mirror, forcing Lola to ask a terrifying question: at what point do we stop blaming the world for our unhappiness and start untangling the mess we''ve made of ourselves?', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:309979'),
  ('798980310374353858', 'Metal Cardbot', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, 'Jang Ye-na, Kwak Yoon-sang, Kim Eun-ah, Kim Ga-ryung, Lee Hyun', null, 'There are Metal Cardbots on Earth that are living by transforming them into vehicles, hiding stagnation. The protagonist Jun accidentally gets the Metal Breath in his hands, and gets caught up in numerous events with Blue Cop... Can Jun seal the Metal Cardbots scattered on Earth?', 'There are Metal Cardbots on Earth that are living by transforming them into vehicles, hiding stagnation. The protagonist Jun accidentally gets the Metal Breath in his hands, and gets caught up in numerous events with Blue Cop... Can Jun seal the Metal Cardbots scattered on Earth?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zkp9IJTp7LgtHg8tYEGFTjEsgKF.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:223409'),
  ('148767305041909889', 'Metal Evolution', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Sam Dunn', null, 'Sam Dunn', null, 'Metal Evolution is a 2011 documentary series directed by anthropologist and film-maker Sam Dunn and director, producer and music supervisor Scot McFadyen about heavy metal subgenres, with new episodes airing every Friday at 10pm EST on MuchMore and Saturday at 10pm EST on VH1 Classic. Its origins come from Dunn''s first documentary Metal: A Headbanger''s Journey, which included the acclaimed "Heavy Metal Family Tree."', 'Metal Evolution is a 2011 documentary series directed by anthropologist and film-maker Sam Dunn and director, producer and music supervisor Scot McFadyen about heavy metal subgenres, with new episodes airing every Friday at 10pm EST on MuchMore and Saturday at 10pm EST on VH1 Classic. Its origins come from Dunn''s first documentary Metal: A Headbanger''s Journey, which included the acclaimed "Heavy Metal Family Tree."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oqSTVJBnXkYEiZaKEqpw3yJcSfu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42277'),
  ('332688991870270396', 'Metal Hurlant Chronicles', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Michelle Ryan, Joe Flanigan, Rutger Hauer', 'TV-14', 'Metal Hurlant Chronicles is inspired by the popular comics anthology Métal Hurlant, which in turn inspired the well known fantasy magazine Heavy Metal. Each episode takes place on a different planet - fantastical in its own way - with the common thread between stories being a traveling asteroid that impacts the lives of all it encounters.', 'Metal Hurlant Chronicles is inspired by the popular comics anthology Métal Hurlant, which in turn inspired the well known fantasy magazine Heavy Metal. Each episode takes place on a different planet - fantastical in its own way - with the common thread between stories being a traveling asteroid that impacts the lives of all it encounters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m5GXXqXemWtinkIllv23Uia1VTM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:45658'),
  ('100404053564883380', 'Metal Shop Masters', 2021, 'Reality', null, null, 'Jo Koy, Rae Ripple', null, 'A group of metal artists torch, cut and weld epic, badass creations from hardened steel. Only one will win a $50,000 prize.', 'A group of metal artists torch, cut and weld epic, badass creations from hardened steel. Only one will win a $50,000 prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZWZxoeTYWEweD2nzUHs75axdLO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130969'),
  ('244576258483832147', 'Metallic Rouge', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Yume Miyamoto, Tomoyo Kurosawa, Shunsuke Takeuchi, Hiroyuki Yoshino, Yui Ogura, Kazuyuki Okitsu, Atsushi Miyauchi', 'TV-14', 'In a world where humans coexist with androids called Neans, a group known as the Immortal Nine rises up against society. Tasked with disposing of the revolters, a Nean named Rouge Redstar (aka Metal Rouge) and investigator Naomi Orthmann head to Mars to track them down…but first, Rouge wants some chocolate.', 'In a world where humans coexist with androids called Neans, a group known as the Immortal Nine rises up against society. Tasked with disposing of the revolters, a Nean named Rouge Redstar (aka Metal Rouge) and investigator Naomi Orthmann head to Mars to track them down…but first, Rouge wants some chocolate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dcUWxOeCiEM7n7KdIYk1O8Xzgzp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222787'),
  ('1035630706035408568', 'Metalocalypse', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Brendon Small', null, 'Mark Hamill, Victor Brandt, Malcolm McDowell, Brendon Small, Tommy Blacha', 'TV-MA', 'Part-American, part-Scandinavian death-metal band Dethklok has a lingering effect on its fans, who take the words seriously and do anything Dethklok lyrics say. The government fears the band''s influence and sets out to destroy it by covert means; for example, by sending military pharmaceutical psychotropic drug manufacturers. Deemed sociopaths for tossing hot coffee at their concert attendees, two of the band members are alcoholics, and they all have self-esteem issues.', 'Part-American, part-Scandinavian death-metal band Dethklok has a lingering effect on its fans, who take the words seriously and do anything Dethklok lyrics say. The government fears the band''s influence and sets out to destroy it by covert means; for example, by sending military pharmaceutical psychotropic drug manufacturers. Deemed sociopaths for tossing hot coffee at their concert attendees, two of the band members are alcoholics, and they all have self-esteem issues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJ8e3EjggpnnGOPjLRUka6lt1Ly.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:653'),
  ('314315695396729682', 'Metástasis', 2014, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Diego Trujillo, Roberto Urbina, Luis Eduardo Arango, Julián Arango, Edgardo Román, Damián Alcázar, Julio Sanchez Coccaro, Diana Ángel', 'TV-MA', 'A Colombian remake of the U.S. TV show Breaking Bad. After he is diagnosed with cancer, Walter Blanco teams up with José Miguel Rosas in order to sell crystal meth.', 'A Colombian remake of the U.S. TV show Breaking Bad. After he is diagnosed with cancer, Walter Blanco teams up with José Miguel Rosas in order to sell crystal meth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pZh2WhyOwvqmfLHs9U6sxfSJTNB.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:72812'),
  ('902023166107966326', 'Meteor', 2009, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ernie Barbarash', null, 'Marla Sokoloff, Christopher Lloyd, Ernie Hudson, Stacy Keach, Michael Rooker, Billy Campbell, Mimi Michaels, Kenneth Mitchell', 'TV-14', 'Following an unparalleled series of meteor fireballs plummeting toward Earth, a renowned scientist, his assistant, and an on-target conspiracy theorist race against time to expose a government cover-up, reveal the truth, and prevent a massive meteor from destroying the planet.', 'Following an unparalleled series of meteor fireballs plummeting toward Earth, a renowned scientist, his assistant, and an on-target conspiracy theorist race against time to expose a government cover-up, reveal the truth, and prevent a massive meteor from destroying the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOAHAb1FIAvSX30th3OHlYAUn4i.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31757'),
  ('1029799251160193880', 'Meteor Garden', 2001, 'Drama, Comedy, Soap', 'Angie Chai', null, 'Barbie Hsu, Jerry Yan, Vic Chou, Ken Chu, Vanness Wu, Michelle Saram, Hsu Hsiao-Shun, Winnie Chien', null, 'Shan Cai, whose parents are far from wealthy, attends Ying De University, the private school established exclusively for rich students. Besides being looked down by rich classmates, she has angered the leader of F4, Dao Ming Si.', 'Shan Cai, whose parents are far from wealthy, attends Ying De University, the private school established exclusively for rich students. Besides being looked down by rich classmates, she has angered the leader of F4, Dao Ming Si.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88ucpY4QXb8E80Q1QoIlUoKE1Ct.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:8082'),
  ('241087015680466748', 'Meteor Garden', 2018, 'Drama, Family', 'Angie Chai, Lin He Long, Yoko Kamio', 'Sharon Mao', 'Shen Yue, Dylan Wang, Darren Chen, Liang Jingkang, Caesar Wu, Sun Yihan, Sun Qian, Li Jiaqi', 'TV-14', 'An ordinary girl is admitted to the most prestigious school in the country where she encounters F4, an exclusive group comprised of the four wealthiest and handsomest boys in the school - Dao Mingsi, Hua Zelei, Xi Men and Mei Zuo.', 'An ordinary girl is admitted to the most prestigious school in the country where she encounters F4, an exclusive group comprised of the four wealthiest and handsomest boys in the school - Dao Mingsi, Hua Zelei, Xi Men and Mei Zuo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8yhIaFcLHBPppaeY1iu9GzHtaqf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79818'),
  ('903785685137234421', 'Method', 2015, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Konstantin Khabenskiy, Anna Savranskaya, Nikita Kologrivyy, Egor Kenzhametov, Eldar Kalimulin, Anna Banshchikova, Snezhana Samokhina, Lev Zulkarnaev', null, 'After graduation our main character Yesenia dreams about work- ing with Rodion Meglin. He is a mysterious, secretive man, a lone investigator with little known about his methods. When Yesenia turns into his trainee she begins to realize that the essence of his method is that Meglin himself – that of a maniac. He feels them instinctively. He is allowed to eliminate some of them, look after others and save their lives. Our heroine who was never meant to work alone will go alone, facing the most horrible crimes of the last decade.', 'After graduation our main character Yesenia dreams about work- ing with Rodion Meglin. He is a mysterious, secretive man, a lone investigator with little known about his methods. When Yesenia turns into his trainee she begins to realize that the essence of his method is that Meglin himself – that of a maniac. He feels them instinctively. He is allowed to eliminate some of them, look after others and save their lives. Our heroine who was never meant to work alone will go alone, facing the most horrible crimes of the last decade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mlgSXHwOpKRAvdtYysyHLWBIXaa.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:64446'),
  ('246566746684629969', 'Metoda Markovič: Hojer', 2024, 'Crime', null, null, 'Petr Lněnička, Petr Uhlík, Václav Neužil, Daniel Heriban, Vojtěch Kotek, Adam Mišík, Sarah Haváčová', null, 'The Markovič Method: Hojer is a six-part series about the capture and conviction of one of the most horrific serial killers in the era of normalization in Czechoslovakia, Ladislav Hojer, by the legendary detective Jiří Markovič.', 'The Markovič Method: Hojer is a six-part series about the capture and conviction of one of the most horrific serial killers in the era of normalization in Czechoslovakia, Ladislav Hojer, by the legendary detective Jiří Markovič.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yYLWiWB62kLND931wURLuQsZGgn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:244510'),
