  ('1076431891869724077', 'Mi lista de exes', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Sigal Avin', null, 'Adriana Montes de Oca, Christopher Aguilasocho, Marcos Radosh', 'NR', 'After a tarot reader tells her that the love of her life is not in the future, but in the past, and that she must find him before her 30th birthday, young and impulsive María undertakes a desperate search to find love, with the help of her best friends: Pedro, Ana and Lolo, and thus create her list of exes.', 'After a tarot reader tells her that the love of her life is not in the future, but in the past, and that she must find him before her 30th birthday, young and impulsive María undertakes a desperate search to find love, with the help of her best friends: Pedro, Ana and Lolo, and thus create her list of exes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gaQCylD3DQTmkQi5bGddfJeoLwX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82360'),
