  ('101661487732218888', 'Milo', 2024, 'Soap, Drama', 'Hugo Van Laere, Geert Verbanck', 'Geert Verbanck', 'Camille Dhont, Mathias Mesmans, Emanoel Nascimento Borges, Laetitia Janssens, Karlijn Sileghem, Antje De Rop, Luka De Baets, Evelyne Chen', null, 'The telenovella ''Milo'' is a modern musical fairy tale. The series tells the story of Milo, a very talented baker''s daughter with a golden voice, who is forced to hide her talent from the outside world. No matter how hard she dreams of a life full of singing and music.', 'The telenovella ''Milo'' is a modern musical fairy tale. The series tells the story of Milo, a very talented baker''s daughter with a golden voice, who is forced to hide her talent from the outside world. No matter how hard she dreams of a life full of singing and music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x5B0Y2yvMmLFNcj08V724oMu9am.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:228272'),
  ('303851314275250308', 'Milo Murphy''s Law', 2016, 'Animation, Kids, Family, Comedy', 'Jeff ''Swampy'' Marsh, Dan Povenmire', null, '''Weird Al'' Yankovic, Sabrina Carpenter, Mekai Curtis, Dan Povenmire, Jeff ''Swampy'' Marsh, Dee Bradley Baker', 'TV-Y7', 'Milo Murphy is the personification of Murphy’s Law where anything that can go wrong will go wrong. Suffering from Extreme Hereditary Murphy’s Law condition (EHML), Milo always looks to make the best of the cards he’s been dealt and his endless optimism and enthusiasm can turn any catastrophe into a wild adventure. Together, he and his friends will learn that it’s all about a positive attitude and not to sweat the big stuff… and it’s all big stuff.', 'Milo Murphy is the personification of Murphy’s Law where anything that can go wrong will go wrong. Suffering from Extreme Hereditary Murphy’s Law condition (EHML), Milo always looks to make the best of the cards he’s been dealt and his endless optimism and enthusiasm can turn any catastrophe into a wild adventure. Together, he and his friends will learn that it’s all about a positive attitude and not to sweat the big stuff… and it’s all big stuff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUoMoeOm2ALLtPrbP4WwEzj4lO3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67549'),
