  ('854266335693947947', 'Momoiro tanbo ~densetsu no fuzoku ~', 2020, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Kendo Kobayashi', null, 'This is the story of Kajiyama Tsuneo, a struggling salaryman who relies on his own intuition and experience to pursue the finest sex industry, saying, " This month, I''m going to take my chances! "', 'This is the story of Kajiyama Tsuneo, a struggling salaryman who relies on his own intuition and experience to pursue the finest sex industry, saying, " This month, I''m going to take my chances! "', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dccdkW9FmRCxUNeRMwBEyKkI7O5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233017'),
  ('1147769553138016009', 'Momokuri', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Ai Kakuma, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Reina Takeshita, Kensho Ono, Naomi Ohzora, Rena Maeda, Sayaka Nakaya, Takuma Nagatsuka', null, 'The story revolves around Yuki Kurihara, a girl who has finally been granted her wish of dating her crush Momo. At first glance, she just looks like a normal but very cute girl. However, she is in fact a maniac over Momo, taking notes of his activities and never missing the chance to see him in a cute moment. Momo, on the other hand, is inexperienced in love, and just wants to make Yuki happy.', 'The story revolves around Yuki Kurihara, a girl who has finally been granted her wish of dating her crush Momo. At first glance, she just looks like a normal but very cute girl. However, she is in fact a maniac over Momo, taking notes of his activities and never missing the chance to see him in a cute moment. Momo, on the other hand, is inexperienced in love, and just wants to make Yuki happy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tEFAAlXtwL9a8UzCSG37LmwpU91.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67034'),
  ('1110452891566781471', 'Momokyun Sword', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Wataru Hatano, Shiori Mikami, Rumi Okubo, Hisayoshi Suganuma, Ayana Taketatsu, Suzuko Mimori, Asami Imai, Emiri Kato', 'TV-14', 'Momoko is a beautiful young sword fighter who was born inside a peach. She lives with her constant companions—the dog god Inugami, the monkey god Sarugami, and the pheasant god Kijigami—in a peaceful paradise. However, a demon army led by devil king invades the paradise and steals the precious treasure that protects Momoko''s land. To retrieve the treasure and save the people, Momoko embarks on a great adventure with her three companions.', 'Momoko is a beautiful young sword fighter who was born inside a peach. She lives with her constant companions—the dog god Inugami, the monkey god Sarugami, and the pheasant god Kijigami—in a peaceful paradise. However, a demon army led by devil king invades the paradise and steals the precious treasure that protects Momoko''s land. To retrieve the treasure and save the people, Momoko embarks on a great adventure with her three companions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tg6HZ5SKGv7ezXxjwXn24MHYlnr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70722'),
  ('97542985680628945', 'Mon Colle Knights', 2000, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Kids', null, 'Katsumi Hasegawa', 'Tomo Saeki, Yui Horie, Shigeru Chiba, Yuko Mizutani, Kazuhiko Inoue, Yuka Imai, Maria Yamamoto, Yumi Kakazu', 'NR', 'Scientist Ichiroubei Hiiragi discovers the existence of Six Gates, an otherdimensional world full of monsters and powerful hidden treasures known as Mon Mon Items. Ichiroubei embarks with his daughter, Rokuna, and her classmate, Mondo. However, they''re foiled at every turn by Count Collection and his assistants, who want the Mon Mon Items in order to conquer both worlds. Becoming the heroes known as Mon Colle Knights, Mondo and Rokuna join forces with the monsters, striking back against Count Collection while searching for the Mon Mon Items in the name of friendship between their worlds.', 'Scientist Ichiroubei Hiiragi discovers the existence of Six Gates, an otherdimensional world full of monsters and powerful hidden treasures known as Mon Mon Items. Ichiroubei embarks with his daughter, Rokuna, and her classmate, Mondo. However, they''re foiled at every turn by Count Collection and his assistants, who want the Mon Mon Items in order to conquer both worlds. Becoming the heroes known as Mon Colle Knights, Mondo and Rokuna join forces with the monsters, striking back against Count Collection while searching for the Mon Mon Items in the name of friendship between their worlds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1HZGKL0nOzrMlJOvvJvg22Qr4Nq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19260'),
  ('163144503626397003', 'Mona the Vampire', 1999, 'Family, Animation', 'Sonia Holleyman', null, 'Emma Taylor-Isherwood, Justin Bradley, Jessica Kardos, Holly Gauthier-Frankel, Carrie Finlay, Oliver Grainger, Jennifer Seguin, Carole Jeghers', 'TV-Y7', 'Follows the adventures of Mona Parker ("Mona the Vampire"), as well as her two best friends, and her pet cat, Fang, as they imagine themselves confronting a new supernatural foe, or solving a supernatural mystery, in every episode.', 'Follows the adventures of Mona Parker ("Mona the Vampire"), as well as her two best friends, and her pet cat, Fang, as they imagine themselves confronting a new supernatural foe, or solving a supernatural mystery, in every episode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijBRu72KJ9JRTGYjyJT6yzEbaj7.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:536'),
  ('674794886848554192', 'Monaco Franze', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Helmut Dietl', 'Patrick Süskind', 'Helmut Fischer, Ruth-Maria Kubitschek, Karl Obermayr, Christine Kaufmann, Erni Singerl', 'NR', 'A Munich detective falls into various misadventures as he pursues criminals and tries to evade women across the city.', 'A Munich detective falls into various misadventures as he pursues criminals and tries to evade women across the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fq0SDC8P7GUw4MALG4kwFx0wzNo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:41003'),
  ('50854088952598623', 'Monarca', 2019, 'Drama', 'Diego Gutierrez', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'After 20 years, Ana María returns to Mexico and vies for control of her family''s tequila empire as it threatens to crumble under corruption and secrets.', 'After 20 years, Ana María returns to Mexico and vies for control of her family''s tequila empire as it threatens to crumble under corruption and secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oXiTq8dm9ugYjLCKFDnLE4pRMGT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:93297'),
  ('456906324861945282', 'Monarch', 2022, 'Drama', 'Melissa London Hilfers', null, 'Susan Sarandon, Anna Friel, Trace Adkins, Beth Ditto', 'TV-14', 'The Romans, America’s first family of country music, are fiercely talented, but while their name is synonymous with honesty, the very foundation of their success is a lie. When their reign as country royalty is put in jeopardy, Nicky Roman, the heir to the crown, already battling an industry stacked against her, will stop at nothing to protect her family’s legacy.', 'The Romans, America’s first family of country music, are fiercely talented, but while their name is synonymous with honesty, the very foundation of their success is a lie. When their reign as country royalty is put in jeopardy, Nicky Roman, the heir to the crown, already battling an industry stacked against her, will stop at nothing to protect her family’s legacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwF3jnxoRhnp0D1alh5UgopnlW2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:125713'),
  ('174027100972550356', 'Monarch of the Glen', 2000, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Michael Chaplin', null, 'Richard Briers, Susan Hampshire, Alexander Morton, Hamish Clark, Julian Fellowes, Lloyd Owen, Martin Compston, Rae Hendrie', 'TV-PG', 'Archie MacDonald, a young restaurateur is called back to his childhood home of Glenbogle where he is told he is the new Laird of Glenbogle.', 'Archie MacDonald, a young restaurateur is called back to his childhood home of Glenbogle where he is told he is the new Laird of Glenbogle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jeMhROvJWKTQuwSip5z5RsNPyfU.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:2215'),
  ('913217140547561716', 'Monarch: Legacy of Monsters', 2023, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Matt Fraction, Chris Black', 'Tanner Hansinger', 'Anna Sawai, Kiersey Clemons, Ren Watabe, Mari Yamamoto, Anders Holm, Joe Tippett, Wyatt Russell, Kurt Russell', 'TV-14', 'After surviving Godzilla''s attack on San Francisco, Cate is shaken yet again by a shocking secret. Amid monstrous threats, she embarks on a globetrotting adventure to learn the truth about her family—and the mysterious organization known as Monarch.', 'After surviving Godzilla''s attack on San Francisco, Cate is shaken yet again by a shocking secret. Amid monstrous threats, she embarks on a globetrotting adventure to learn the truth about her family—and the mysterious organization known as Monarch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7LBbaEaLSbqdviBYaSS1rRPMnrs.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:202411'),
  ('97862215088813913', 'Monarch: The Big Bear of Tallac', 1977, 'Animation, Kids', null, 'Ryuzo Nakanishi, Yukiko Takayama, Michio Satou', 'Noriko Tsukase, Keiko Yokozawa, Haru Endō, Hitoshi Takagi, Ichiro Nagai, Yoshiko Matsuo, Yo Inoue', null, 'Monarch: The Big Bear of Tallac is a Japanese anime TV series consisting in 26 episodes. It was directed by Yoshio Kuroda and was first broadcast on Asahi Broadcasting Corporation in 1977.', 'Monarch: The Big Bear of Tallac is a Japanese anime TV series consisting in 26 episodes. It was directed by Yoshio Kuroda and was first broadcast on Asahi Broadcasting Corporation in 1977.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tV86q906ujvJNH3e1Fca1WGfH3I.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:52270'),
  ('625054444407150996', 'Monarchy', 2004, 'Documentary', null, null, 'David Starkey', 'NR', 'Monarchy is a Channel 4 British TV series, 2004-2006, by British academic David Starkey, charting the political and ideological history of the English monarchy from the Saxon period to modern times. The show also aired on PBS stations throughout the United States, courtesy of PBS-member station WNET. In Australia, all four seasons were broadcast on ABC1 from May 2005 onwards.', 'Monarchy is a Channel 4 British TV series, 2004-2006, by British academic David Starkey, charting the political and ideological history of the English monarchy from the Saxon period to modern times. The show also aired on PBS stations throughout the United States, courtesy of PBS-member station WNET. In Australia, all four seasons were broadcast on ABC1 from May 2005 onwards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vM7fICn3GlE9carVIx45EWkhdrp.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:9484'),
  ('232178561677506147', 'Monday Late Show', 2012, 'Reality', null, null, 'Matsuko Deluxe, Shingo Murakami', null, 'Hosts Matsuko Deluxe and Murakami Shingo review street interviews based on current trends/topics in Japan.', 'Hosts Matsuko Deluxe and Murakami Shingo review street interviews based on current trends/topics in Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zj9rb86Ai3EXoDriCRlBDwzPDuC.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:103810'),
  ('278677223199405296', 'Monday Mornings', 2013, 'Drama', 'David E. Kelley', null, 'Ving Rhames, Jamie Bamber, Jennifer Finnigan, Bill Irwin, Keong Sim, Sarayu Blue, Emily Swallow, Alfred Molina', null, 'Set at the Chelsea General Hospital in Portland, Oregon, the show follows the lives of doctors as they push the limits of their abilities and confront their personal and professional failings. Based on a novel by Sanjay Gupta.', 'Set at the Chelsea General Hospital in Portland, Oregon, the show follows the lives of doctors as they push the limits of their abilities and confront their personal and professional failings. Based on a novel by Sanjay Gupta.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wwleMzF1coegmnieJiMvsOgYTQ9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43721'),
  ('486744644200692467', 'Money Flower', 2017, 'Drama', null, 'Lee Myung-hee', 'Jang Hyuk, Park Se-young, Jang Seung-jo, Lee Mi-sook, Lee Soon-jae, Han So-hee, Sunwoo Jae-duk, Park Ji-il', null, 'The story of people driven by greed. Kang Pil-Joo grew up at an orphanage, but he now works as a managing director of a legal team at a corporation. He is acknowledged for his intelligence and his exemplary job performance. Some of those that work around him are jealous of him. Na Mo-Hyun is an environmental activist and a science teacher at a middle school. She is a good listener and laughs a lot. She dreams of a love driven by fate.', 'The story of people driven by greed. Kang Pil-Joo grew up at an orphanage, but he now works as a managing director of a legal team at a corporation. He is acknowledged for his intelligence and his exemplary job performance. Some of those that work around him are jealous of him. Na Mo-Hyun is an environmental activist and a science teacher at a middle school. She is a good listener and laughs a lot. She dreams of a love driven by fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Ep2HCbLX7wm1zGt9LJO5rFrNqk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74887'),
  ('587949949182399703', 'Money Heist', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Álex Pina', null, 'Úrsula Corberó, Itziar Ituño, Álvaro Morte, Pedro Alonso, Miguel Herrán, Jaime Lorente, Esther Acebo, Najwa Nimri', 'TV-MA', 'To carry out the biggest heist in history, a mysterious man called The Professor recruits a band of eight robbers who have a single characteristic: none of them has anything to lose. Five months of seclusion - memorizing every step, every detail, every probability - culminate in eleven days locked up in the National Coinage and Stamp Factory of Spain, surrounded by police forces and with dozens of hostages in their power, to find out whether their suicide wager will lead to everything or nothing.', 'To carry out the biggest heist in history, a mysterious man called The Professor recruits a band of eight robbers who have a single characteristic: none of them has anything to lose. Five months of seclusion - memorizing every step, every detail, every probability - culminate in eleven days locked up in the National Coinage and Stamp Factory of Spain, surrounded by police forces and with dozens of hostages in their power, to find out whether their suicide wager will lead to everything or nothing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/reEMJA1uzscCbkpeRJeTT2bjqUp.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:71446'),
  ('410166672409328007', 'Money Heist: From Tokyo to Berlin', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Úrsula Corberó, Álvaro Morte, Itziar Ituño, Pedro Alonso, Jesús Colmenar, Javier Gómez Santander, Esther Martínez Lobato, Alba Flores', 'TV-MA', 'The filmmakers and actors behind "Money Heist" characters like Tokyo and the Professor talk about the emotional and artistic process of filming Money Heist.', 'The filmmakers and actors behind "Money Heist" characters like Tokyo and the Professor talk about the emotional and artistic process of filming Money Heist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7YuQcbPXgk6CP75TOeCY4VGkJgt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132719'),
  ('1151993886883369546', 'Money Heist: Korea - Joint Economic Area', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Ryu Yong-jae, Kim Hong-sun, Kim Hwan-chae', null, 'Yoo Ji-tae, Park Hae-soo, Jeon Jong-seo, Lee Won-jong, Kim Ji-hoon, Jang Yoon-ju, Lee Hyun-woo, Kim Ji-hoon', 'TV-MA', 'Disguised under the shadows of a mask, a crew of desperados band together under the leadership of a criminal mastermind known only as “The Professor” to pull off the biggest heist Korea has ever seen.', 'Disguised under the shadows of a mask, a crew of desperados band together under the leadership of a criminal mastermind known only as “The Professor” to pull off the biggest heist Korea has ever seen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bnfTPTTytrZZ9Aw6hoOQdojiaKo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112836'),
  ('261142079528716554', 'Money, Explained', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'We spend it, we borrow it, and save it. Now let''s talk about money and its many minefields, from credit cards to casino, scammers to student loans.', 'We spend it, we borrow it, and save it. Now let''s talk about money and its many minefields, from credit cards to casino, scammers to student loans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dEQ9YB4GBWXuCoZNrn5nvJWko7u.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:124337'),
  ('340559724615517508', 'Mongrels', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Jon Brown, Daniel Peak, Adam Miller', null, 'Rufus Jones, Tony Way, Paul Kaye, Lucy Montgomery, Katy Brand, Warrick Brownlow-Pike, Dan Tetsell', 'TV-MA', 'Mongrels, formerly known under the working titles of We Are Mongrels and The Un-Natural World, is a British puppet-based situation comedy series first broadcast on BBC Three between 22 June and 10 August 2010, with a making-of documentary entitled "Mongrels Uncovered" broadcast on 11 August 2010. A second series of Mongrels began airing on 7 November 2011. The series revolves around the lives of five anthropomorphic animals who hang around the back of a pub in Millwall, the Isle of Dogs, London. The characters are Nelson, a metrosexual fox; Destiny, an Afghan hound; Marion, a "borderline-retarded" cat; Kali, a grudge-bearing pigeon; and Vince, Nelson''s friend, a sociopathic foul-mouthed fox.', 'Mongrels, formerly known under the working titles of We Are Mongrels and The Un-Natural World, is a British puppet-based situation comedy series first broadcast on BBC Three between 22 June and 10 August 2010, with a making-of documentary entitled "Mongrels Uncovered" broadcast on 11 August 2010. A second series of Mongrels began airing on 7 November 2011. The series revolves around the lives of five anthropomorphic animals who hang around the back of a pub in Millwall, the Isle of Dogs, London. The characters are Nelson, a metrosexual fox; Destiny, an Afghan hound; Marion, a "borderline-retarded" cat; Kali, a grudge-bearing pigeon; and Vince, Nelson''s friend, a sociopathic foul-mouthed fox.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42uzy4tRF3CHhqkE56zo9rcMBTk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:33002'),
  ('420579212551438025', 'Monica and Friends', 1976, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Kids', 'Mauricio de Sousa', null, 'Marli Bortoletto, Angélica Santos, Elza Gonçalves, Paulo Cavalcante', 'TV-Y7', 'Monica, the leader of the crew and ''ruler of the street,'' is a little girl with a strong personality, not one to overlook any insult. She absolutely loves her stuffed bunny, Samson, and takes him with her everywhere. Jimmy Five, one of her best friends, is a smart kid, but he''s always provoking her. Maggy is Monica''s best friend and a super cute girl, who is always eating watermelons. To complete the show''s main quartet, enter Smudge, a skillful boy who is terrified of water.', 'Monica, the leader of the crew and ''ruler of the street,'' is a little girl with a strong personality, not one to overlook any insult. She absolutely loves her stuffed bunny, Samson, and takes him with her everywhere. Jimmy Five, one of her best friends, is a smart kid, but he''s always provoking her. Maggy is Monica''s best friend and a super cute girl, who is always eating watermelons. To complete the show''s main quartet, enter Smudge, a skillful boy who is terrified of water.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/V57onWsHdZUMOao3uixaUBbO4o.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:67431'),
  ('562504205978670392', 'Monica and Friends', 2022, 'Family, Kids, Drama, Mystery, Comedy', 'Daniel Rezende', 'Mauro D''Addio, Marina Maria Iorio, Mariana Zatz', 'Giulia Benite, Kevin Vechiatto, Laura Rauseo, Gabriel Moreira, Emilly Nayara, Luiza Gattai, Becca Guerra, Mariana Ximenes', null, 'When popular Carminha Frufru''s party is mysteriously sabotaged, Mônica and her friends become the main suspects, and they will need to overcome their insecurities and reveal their secrets to decipher the mystery.', 'When popular Carminha Frufru''s party is mysteriously sabotaged, Mônica and her friends become the main suspects, and they will need to overcome their insecurities and reveal their secrets to decipher the mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lux4yKOkXZo8dXrsFyAky1tA8x.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157485'),
  ('771106301814990449', 'Monique Olivier: Accessory to Evil', 2023, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Francis Nachbar, Gérard Chemla, Richard Delgenes, Cédric Visart De Bogarmé, Jean-Luc Ployé, Didier Seban, Sandra Laville, Gauthier Pirson', 'TV-MA', 'From 1987 to 2003, Michel Fourniret cemented his legacy as France’s most infamous murderer. But his wife was an enigma: Was she a pawn or a participant?', 'From 1987 to 2003, Michel Fourniret cemented his legacy as France’s most infamous murderer. But his wife was an enigma: Was she a pawn or a participant?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0OA8rCcn9WHuryBrpNEtfWdx1o.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:221048'),
  ('96621002410239688', 'Monk', 2002, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Andy Breckman', null, 'Tony Shalhoub, Ted Levine, Jason Gray-Stanford, Traylor Howard', 'TV-14', 'Adrian Monk was once a rising star with the San Francisco Police Department, legendary for using unconventional means to solve the department''s most baffling cases. But after the tragic (and still unsolved) murder of his wife Trudy, he developed an extreme case of obsessive-compulsive disorder. Now working as a private consultant, Monk continues to investigate cases in the most unconventional ways.', 'Adrian Monk was once a rising star with the San Francisco Police Department, legendary for using unconventional means to solve the department''s most baffling cases. But after the tragic (and still unsolved) murder of his wife Trudy, he developed an extreme case of obsessive-compulsive disorder. Now working as a private consultant, Monk continues to investigate cases in the most unconventional ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3axGMbUecXXOPSeG47v2i9wK5y5.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:1695'),
  ('437048875213265140', 'Monkey', 1978, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Masaaki Sakai, Masako Natsume, Shiro Kishibe, Tonpei Hidari, Shunji Fujimura, Takayuki Akutagawa, David Collings, Gareth Armstrong', 'TV-PG', 'Buddhist priest Tripitaka and his three disciples Monkey, Pigsy, and Sandy, travel from China to India to fetch the Buddhist scriptures. They have been sent by Buddha, and getting these scriptures will bring peace to the people of the world.', 'Buddhist priest Tripitaka and his three disciples Monkey, Pigsy, and Sandy, travel from China to India to fetch the Buddhist scriptures. They have been sent by Buddha, and getting these scriptures will bring peace to the people of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTD4srwd55a6zMAR56uwWqXVcgT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:13826'),
  ('728509525352599403', 'Monkey Dust', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Shaun Pye, Harry Thompson', null, 'Morwenna Banks, Frances Barber, Enn Reitel, Rebecca Front, Simon Greenall, Shaun Pye, Kate Robbins, Sharon Horgan', null, 'Monkey Dust is a British satirical cartoon, notorious for its dark humour and handling of taboo topics such as bestiality, murder, suicide and paedophilia. There were three series broadcast on BBC Three between 2003 and 2005. Following co-creator Harry Thompson''s death, no further series were made.', 'Monkey Dust is a British satirical cartoon, notorious for its dark humour and handling of taboo topics such as bestiality, murder, suicide and paedophilia. There were three series broadcast on BBC Three between 2003 and 2005. Following co-creator Harry Thompson''s death, no further series were made.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWxkoZMcfZkIyGJSfegRrucn55I.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2055'),
  ('437052860040271506', 'Monkey Typhoon', 2002, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', 'Shin Kibayashi', 'Shin Kibayashi', 'Kappei Yamaguchi, Tomokazu Seki, Mayumi Izuka, Nozomu Sasaki, Takeharu Kunimoto, Minami Takayama, Atsuko Enomoto, Shin-ichiro Miki', null, 'Monkey Typhoon tells the story of three asobots —a form of robots whose general title is a portmanteau of the words association and robot— Goku, Tongo, and Joe. They are assisted in their journeys by Sanzo, a human, the son of the creator of the asobots, and Suzie, who joined them after her father was cured from the Destruction Virus. Later on they are joined by their former rivals Miyon and Shiyon. Their quest is to stop their world''s destruction by collecting the legendary 49 keys to unlock Tokyo Metropolitan Government. Along the way, the asobots gain the ability to evolve further. Together, in their many voyages, they come across several foes and enemies such as Loki, Ryutaro Demon, the Quartet, King Doberman Pinscher, and many more, as well as grow united in their friendship.', 'Monkey Typhoon tells the story of three asobots —a form of robots whose general title is a portmanteau of the words association and robot— Goku, Tongo, and Joe. They are assisted in their journeys by Sanzo, a human, the son of the creator of the asobots, and Suzie, who joined them after her father was cured from the Destruction Virus. Later on they are joined by their former rivals Miyon and Shiyon. Their quest is to stop their world''s destruction by collecting the legendary 49 keys to unlock Tokyo Metropolitan Government. Along the way, the asobots gain the ability to evolve further. Together, in their many voyages, they come across several foes and enemies such as Loki, Ryutaro Demon, the Quartet, King Doberman Pinscher, and many more, as well as grow united in their friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bayoU8Qk7aocQDpyhfqIFCvmas.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107838'),
  ('1145132583632343366', 'mono', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Haruna Mikawa, Aoi Koga, Hikaru Tono, Reina Ueda', null, 'Satsuki Amamiya was feeling down due to the graduation of the high school Photography Club’s president. However, her best friend and fellow member An Kiriyama encourages Satsuki to dedicate herself to the newly merged Cinephoto Club. Join Satsuki and An as they set out to track down a missing camera, meet new faces, and capture stunning photos and videos along the way.', 'Satsuki Amamiya was feeling down due to the graduation of the high school Photography Club’s president. However, her best friend and fellow member An Kiriyama encourages Satsuki to dedicate herself to the newly merged Cinephoto Club. Join Satsuki and An as they set out to track down a missing camera, meet new faces, and capture stunning photos and videos along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ukRfoQFqxDVttCGbyUg4ol3Nv6f.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:249854'),
  ('90322554842718112', 'Monogatari', 2009, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Hiroshi Kamiya, Chiwa Saito, Yui Horie, Maaya Sakamoto, Satsuki Yukino, Miyuki Sawashiro', 'TV-14', 'Koyomi Araragi, a high school student, finds himself constantly encountering girls afflicted by supernatural "oddities." He dedicates himself to helping them, often with the aid of the eccentric specialist Meme Oshino. Each arc talks about a different girl''s unique struggle and the mysterious cause of their affliction. The series explores themes of adolescence, personal growth, and the complexities of human relationships. It''s known for its witty dialogue, stylistic animation, and unique narrative structure.', 'Koyomi Araragi, a high school student, finds himself constantly encountering girls afflicted by supernatural "oddities." He dedicates himself to helping them, often with the aid of the eccentric specialist Meme Oshino. Each arc talks about a different girl''s unique struggle and the mysterious cause of their affliction. The series explores themes of adolescence, personal growth, and the complexities of human relationships. It''s known for its witty dialogue, stylistic animation, and unique narrative structure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCEjjb1NH3LLsWeZx47wOeqkezf.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:46195'),
  ('280724487669917419', 'Mononoke', 2007, 'Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Takahiro Sakurai, Daisuke Namikawa, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Eiji Takemoto, Aiko Hibi, Fumiko Orikasa, Hikaru Midorikawa, Hiroshi Iwasaki', 'TV-MA', 'The Medicine Seller is a deadly and mysterious master of the occult who travels across feudal Japan in search of malevolent spirits called mononoke to slay. When he locates one of these spirits, he cannot simply kill it; he must first learn its Form, its Truth, and its Reason in order to wield the mighty Exorcism Sword and fight against it. He must begin his strange exorcisms with intense psychological analysis and careful investigative work—an extremely dangerous step, as he must first confront and learn about the mononoke before he even has the means to defeat it.', 'The Medicine Seller is a deadly and mysterious master of the occult who travels across feudal Japan in search of malevolent spirits called mononoke to slay. When he locates one of these spirits, he cannot simply kill it; he must first learn its Form, its Truth, and its Reason in order to wield the mighty Exorcism Sword and fight against it. He must begin his strange exorcisms with intense psychological analysis and careful investigative work—an extremely dangerous step, as he must first confront and learn about the mononoke before he even has the means to defeat it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3S04UDFVaDRC6fOSjLfvrDhpvd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16660'),
  ('834464453491486140', 'Monroe', 2011, 'Drama', 'Peter Bowker', null, 'James Nesbitt, Sarah Parish, Tom Riley, Susan Lynch, Phoebe Dynevor', 'TV-14', 'Monroe is a brilliant and unusual neurosurgeon. A flawed genius who never lets anyone forget his flaws or his genius. Each episode will feature one compelling story of the week about life or death situations. The drama will focus on the way in which a serious injury or disease cuts across the lives of everyone involved, from hospital staff to patients to relatives. And how that group become, in an intense few days, a reluctant dysfunctional family united by hopes, fears and grief. At the centre of this stands Monroe, his trainees, his anaesthetist and his poker school - and his female colleague, heart surgeon, Jenny Bremner, who has contempt for his cockiness. The series will tell heightened emotional stories and be shot through with dark humour and portray the pressures and pleasures of high-end surgery in a modern urban hospital.', 'Monroe is a brilliant and unusual neurosurgeon. A flawed genius who never lets anyone forget his flaws or his genius. Each episode will feature one compelling story of the week about life or death situations. The drama will focus on the way in which a serious injury or disease cuts across the lives of everyone involved, from hospital staff to patients to relatives. And how that group become, in an intense few days, a reluctant dysfunctional family united by hopes, fears and grief. At the centre of this stands Monroe, his trainees, his anaesthetist and his poker school - and his female colleague, heart surgeon, Jenny Bremner, who has contempt for his cockiness. The series will tell heightened emotional stories and be shot through with dark humour and portray the pressures and pleasures of high-end surgery in a modern urban hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eM9PDGPp4VKwZGvZkm8P4qWdAkP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:34029'),
  ('410306975680385279', 'Monsen og nasjonalparkene', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Lars Monsen', null, 'Lars Monsen', null, 'Legendary Norwegian adventurer Lars Monsen treks through Norway''s national parks, exploring their wildlife, landscapes, and history.', 'Legendary Norwegian adventurer Lars Monsen treks through Norway''s national parks, exploring their wildlife, landscapes, and history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OcfJUvgXV1eTwM53KXBYrfanHo.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:279844'),
  ('151747851139008554', 'Monsieur Spade', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Tom Fontana, Scott Frank', null, 'Clive Owen, Cara Bossom, Denis Ménochet, Louise Bourgoin, Chiara Mastroianni, Stanley Weber, Matthew Beard, Jonathan Zaccaï', 'TV-MA', 'Detective Sam Spade is pulled out of his tranquil retirement in France to investigate a series of brutal murders.', 'Detective Sam Spade is pulled out of his tranquil retirement in France to investigate a series of brutal murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5B0fvoxRPT7mhZMgMSAM27j6QZb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209479'),
  ('367909594789576156', 'Monstar', 2013, 'Drama', null, null, 'Yong Jun-hyung, Ha Yeon-soo, Kang Ha-neul, Yoon Chan-young, Nat Thewphaingam, Dahee, Ahn Nae-sang, Kim Young-ho', 'NR', '"Monstar" depicts the lives of ordinary teens who are injured psychologically and heal themselves through the power of music. Yoon Sul-Chan is the vocalist for the group "Man in Black". He carries deep wounds within his mind, but doesn''t express his feelings. Because of his hot temper, he causes trouble. His management company then orders him to carry himself as an ideal student. He joins a music band at school, while facing unexpected events.', '"Monstar" depicts the lives of ordinary teens who are injured psychologically and heal themselves through the power of music. Yoon Sul-Chan is the vocalist for the group "Man in Black". He carries deep wounds within his mind, but doesn''t express his feelings. Because of his hot temper, he causes trouble. His management company then orders him to carry himself as an ideal student. He joins a music band at school, while facing unexpected events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lALxgajDhLpqHVm56CT4PhlbDvX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:50720'),
  ('629746525658412485', 'Monster', 2004, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery, Crime', null, null, 'Hidenobu Kiuchi, Nozomu Sasaki, Mamiko Noto, Tsutomu Isobe', 'TV-14', 'Kenzou Tenma, a Japanese brain surgeon in Germany, finds his life in utter turmoil after getting involved with a psychopath that was once a former patient.', 'Kenzou Tenma, a Japanese brain surgeon in Germany, finds his life in utter turmoil after getting involved with a psychopath that was once a former patient.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n5XNKXnoXpoXyfiCtXHOf8q8PFM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:30981'),
  ('850643479667919636', 'Monster', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Hans Christian Storrøsten', 'Hans Christian Storrøsten', 'Ingvild Holthe Bygdnes, Jakob Oftebro, Bjørn Sundquist, Gørild Mauseth, Agnes Born, Martin Furulund, Reidar Sørensen, Niklas Gundersen', 'TV-MA', 'In the dark and remote landscape of northern Norway, a brutal murder reveals a mass grave which links old cases to missing people. Local police officer Hedda is put on the case with special investigator Joel Dreyer, who comes from the metropolitan south. Their different backgrounds, personalities, and methods immediately set them against each other. But when the investigation begins to spiral out of control, both detectives resort to questionable moves in order to stay on the case and protect their secrets.', 'In the dark and remote landscape of northern Norway, a brutal murder reveals a mass grave which links old cases to missing people. Local police officer Hedda is put on the case with special investigator Joel Dreyer, who comes from the metropolitan south. Their different backgrounds, personalities, and methods immediately set them against each other. But when the investigation begins to spiral out of control, both detectives resort to questionable moves in order to stay on the case and protect their secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2JZrlh8kSnZFUzf6MVXbZoOZZBw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73315'),
  ('420337898354228661', 'Monster Allergy', 2006, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Kids, Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Iginio Straffi', null, 'Monica Ward, Oliviero Dinelli, Ambrogio Colombo, Andrea Ward, Alessandra Korompay, Annie Bovaird', null, 'Monster Allergy is a 2005 animated television series, jointly produced by Rainbow S.p.A., Futurikon, RAI Fiction and ZDF.', 'Monster Allergy is a 2005 animated television series, jointly produced by Rainbow S.p.A., Futurikon, RAI Fiction and ZDF.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mM9dfhCxdxPNXH3blfx4hzNa8vo.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:17506'),
  ('348578787605627430', 'Monster Buster Club', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy', 'David Michel, Vincent Chalvon-Demersay', null, 'Tabitha St. Germain, Matt Hill, Anna Cummer, Sam Vincent, Ian James Corlett, Andrea Libman, Michael Yarmush, Rick Jones', 'TV-Y7', 'This action-comedy follows the adventures of four 10 year-olds protecting their town against alien invasion. Juggling school and top-secret monster busting can be tough, especially when your science teacher turns out to be an alien! Monster Buster Club, or ''MBC'' as it is known, follows the exploits of Cathy and her friends on their mission to protect Singletown from troublesome aliens.', 'This action-comedy follows the adventures of four 10 year-olds protecting their town against alien invasion. Juggling school and top-secret monster busting can be tough, especially when your science teacher turns out to be an alien! Monster Buster Club, or ''MBC'' as it is known, follows the exploits of Cathy and her friends on their mission to protect Singletown from troublesome aliens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cf9Q6tPvJOtYSukoAXN5XhAu09M.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:5444'),
  ('356842940782607323', 'Monster Eater', 2026, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Makoto Furukawa, Yuki Nakashima', null, 'Rude, an E-rank adventurer.His only skill, "Status Ailment Nullification," is a niche ability considered useful only for gathering medicinal herbs in miasma-choked dungeons. With virtually zero combat prowess, his fellow adventurers mock him with the nickname "Miasma Scavenger." In a desperate bid to change his life, Rude ventures into a new dungeon—only to be betrayed by his party and left for dead. With his supplies gone and his life fading, he makes a forbidden choice: to consume the flesh of a monster. So begins the tale of Rude’s "Monster Devouring" adventure, where he gains new skills by simply consuming his foes!', 'Rude, an E-rank adventurer.His only skill, "Status Ailment Nullification," is a niche ability considered useful only for gathering medicinal herbs in miasma-choked dungeons. With virtually zero combat prowess, his fellow adventurers mock him with the nickname "Miasma Scavenger." In a desperate bid to change his life, Rude ventures into a new dungeon—only to be betrayed by his party and left for dead. With his supplies gone and his life fading, he makes a forbidden choice: to consume the flesh of a monster. So begins the tale of Rude’s "Monster Devouring" adventure, where he gains new skills by simply consuming his foes!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9sfqKo6Xh7vOqYqmjoKPvSgVLCC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:310921'),
  ('349779209388377649', 'Monster Farm', 1999, 'Animation, Family, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, 'Chisa Yokoyama, Mariko Kouda, Yuri Shiratori, Wataru Takagi, Naoya Uchida, Kazuki Yao, Nozomu Sasaki, Jurota Kosugi', 'TV-G', 'Genki is a boy who loves playing the Monster Rancher games and one day he''s somehow transported into the world of the video game where he meets the girl Holly and the monsters Mochi, Suezo, Golem, Tiger and Hare. Together, they are searching for a way to revive the Phoenix, which is the only monster capable of stopping the evil Moo.', 'Genki is a boy who loves playing the Monster Rancher games and one day he''s somehow transported into the world of the video game where he meets the girl Holly and the monsters Mochi, Suezo, Golem, Tiger and Hare. Together, they are searching for a way to revive the Phoenix, which is the only monster capable of stopping the evil Moo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lzh49cRWKSjNm98Cov0bBDvBww7.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:15130'),
  ('278162888432765183', 'Monster Garage', 2002, 'Reality', 'Thom Beers', null, 'Jesse James', 'TV-MA', 'A team of professionals headed by expert mechanic Jesse James specialize in transform cars. The clock is ticking as they attempt to turn ordinary vehicles into ''monster machines'' in just a week.', 'A team of professionals headed by expert mechanic Jesse James specialize in transform cars. The clock is ticking as they attempt to turn ordinary vehicles into ''monster machines'' in just a week.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jiVq7N0khQdCZdnp9AjcPwxCKkb.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:174'),
  ('679065863241768377', 'Monster Girl Doctor', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shunichi Toki, Saori Onishi, Sarah Emi Bridcutt, Yu Shimamura, Yukiyo Fujii', 'TV-14', 'In the town of Lindworm where monsters and humans coexist, Dr. Glenn runs an exemplary medical clinic for monster girls with his lamia assistant, Sapphee. Whether receiving a marriage proposal by a centaur injured in battle, palpating the injury of a mermaid, or suturing the delicate wounds of a flesh golem, Dr. Glenn performs his job with grace and confidence. But when an unsavory character seeks to steal a harpy egg, how will the unflappable Dr. Glenn respond...?', 'In the town of Lindworm where monsters and humans coexist, Dr. Glenn runs an exemplary medical clinic for monster girls with his lamia assistant, Sapphee. Whether receiving a marriage proposal by a centaur injured in battle, palpating the injury of a mermaid, or suturing the delicate wounds of a flesh golem, Dr. Glenn performs his job with grace and confidence. But when an unsavory character seeks to steal a harpy egg, how will the unflappable Dr. Glenn respond...?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w0RJVdb1BdEjHAUX1LmzGyUvLaS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98685'),
  ('15459558747801802', 'Monster High', 2010, 'Comedy, Animation', null, null, 'Kate Higgins, Debi Derryberry, Salli Saffioti, Laura Bailey, Salli Saffioti, Audu Paden', 'TV-Y7', 'In the town of New Salem, the teenage children of famous monsters, such as Frankie Stein, Clawdeen Wolf, Draculaura, Lagoona Blue, Cleo de Nile, Ghoulia Yelps, and Abbey Bominable, attend a school for monsters called Monster High.', 'In the town of New Salem, the teenage children of famous monsters, such as Frankie Stein, Clawdeen Wolf, Draculaura, Lagoona Blue, Cleo de Nile, Ghoulia Yelps, and Abbey Bominable, attend a school for monsters called Monster High.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qq9jwjFk8QYz55uy9MiTC1FcfEf.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:41974'),
  ('1001196620474696193', 'Monster High', 2022, 'Animation, Family, Kids, Comedy', 'Shea Fontana', null, 'Gabrielle Nevaeh, iris menas, Courtney Lin, Tony Revolori, Kausar Mohammed, Alexa Kahn, Alexander Polinsky, Jonathan Melo', 'TV-Y7', 'Based on the Monster High franchise, Clawdeen Wolf arrives at Monster High with a dark secret. With the help of her friends Draculaura and Frankie Stein, she is able to embrace her true monster heart and save the school from total destruction.', 'Based on the Monster High franchise, Clawdeen Wolf arrives at Monster High with a dark secret. With the help of her friends Draculaura and Frankie Stein, she is able to embrace her true monster heart and save the school from total destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t6M7K3YnUcbEeYHNIGeTjWo3LWz.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:131532'),
  ('646384431949981357', 'Monster Hunter Stories: Ride On', 2016, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids', null, null, 'Tomokazu Sugita, Tetsuo Goto, Mutsumi Tamura, Ryota Osaka, Nana Mizuki, Junichi Yanagita, Yui Makino, Michiyo Murase', 'TV-14', 'In a world where both men and monsters exist. Those who hunt the monsters are called Hunters. But in a small corner of the Hunter''s world, there are those called Riders who bond with and coexist with monsters. With their Kizuna Ishi (Bonding Stones) that allow them to awaken the hidden power inside monsters, Riders live in secrecy together with their Otomon, the monsters they formed a connection with. Ryuto, a young boy living in the Rider village of Hakum, dreams of becoming the world''s best Rider. Having just turned 12, he sets out to find his own Otomon for himself before the ceremony where he is given his own Kizuna Ishi. Together with his kind-hearted childhood friend Cheval, his inquisitive childhood friend Lilia, and his partner Naville, he sets out deep into the forest, and has a miraculous encounter with a Rathalos.', 'In a world where both men and monsters exist. Those who hunt the monsters are called Hunters. But in a small corner of the Hunter''s world, there are those called Riders who bond with and coexist with monsters. With their Kizuna Ishi (Bonding Stones) that allow them to awaken the hidden power inside monsters, Riders live in secrecy together with their Otomon, the monsters they formed a connection with. Ryuto, a young boy living in the Rider village of Hakum, dreams of becoming the world''s best Rider. Having just turned 12, he sets out to find his own Otomon for himself before the ceremony where he is given his own Kizuna Ishi. Together with his kind-hearted childhood friend Cheval, his inquisitive childhood friend Lilia, and his partner Naville, he sets out deep into the forest, and has a miraculous encounter with a Rathalos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8WVq0KdNn6IT5Z6mgttKL5ja9JG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68098'),
  ('468074683630542007', 'Monster Musume: Everyday Life with Monster Girls', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Junji Majima, Ari Ozawa, Sora Amamiya, Natsuki Aikawa, Yu Kobayashi, Mayuka Nomura, Sakura Nakamura, Haruka Yamazaki', 'TV-MA', 'Three years ago, the world learned that harpies, centaurs, catgirls, and all manners of fabulous creatures are not merely fiction; they are flesh and blood - not to mention scale, feather, horn, and fang. Thanks to the "Cultural Exchange Between Species Act," these once-mythical creatures have assimilated into society, or at least, they''re trying. When a hapless human teenager named Kurusu Kimihito is inducted as a "volunteer" into the government exchange program, his world is turned upside down. A snake-like lamia named Miia comes to live with him, and it is Kurusu''s job to take care of her and make sure she integrates into his everyday life.', 'Three years ago, the world learned that harpies, centaurs, catgirls, and all manners of fabulous creatures are not merely fiction; they are flesh and blood - not to mention scale, feather, horn, and fang. Thanks to the "Cultural Exchange Between Species Act," these once-mythical creatures have assimilated into society, or at least, they''re trying. When a hapless human teenager named Kurusu Kimihito is inducted as a "volunteer" into the government exchange program, his world is turned upside down. A snake-like lamia named Miia comes to live with him, and it is Kurusu''s job to take care of her and make sure she integrates into his everyday life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8leXiwIwPRPQqHXKDhqgf4OIwBU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63187'),
  ('646773545221104137', 'Monster Next Door', 2024, 'Drama', 'Jiwinil', null, 'Thanakorn Kuljarassombat, Anantadej Sodsee, Thanakorn Sangwan, Thanawat Sutthijaroen, Tanapon Hathaidachadusadee, Urucha Sirichaiwongsakul, Pik Supawit Vichitrananda, Charat Fuengarom', null, 'Introvert Diew cherishes his quiet life with his turtle until loud extrovert God moves in. Their balcony chats spark a friendship—without meeting face-to-face.', 'Introvert Diew cherishes his quiet life with his turtle until loud extrovert God moves in. Their balcony chats spark a friendship—without meeting face-to-face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gryQmz8EiGGQLfxnGZKEfS0VHB3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:240892'),
  ('877347265370057396', 'Monster Strike', 2015, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yusuke Kobayashi, Jun Fukushima, Lynn, Yoko Hikasa, Taishi Murata, Eri Suzuki, Daisuke Ono, Ikumi Hayama', 'TV-PG', 'Ren Homura returns to his former residence, yet he feels very uncomfortable: he possesses no memory of having lived there. Without warning or his permission, a game called "Monster Strike" installs itself into Ren''s smartphone; monsters of the game then literally fly out from his smartphone and start fighting on streets. Watching the fighting in amazement, Ren starts picking up his lost memories.', 'Ren Homura returns to his former residence, yet he feels very uncomfortable: he possesses no memory of having lived there. Without warning or his permission, a game called "Monster Strike" installs itself into Ren''s smartphone; monsters of the game then literally fly out from his smartphone and start fighting on streets. Watching the fighting in amazement, Ren starts picking up his lost memories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPdZtK8gdjxsyPouNmFKR4cGapo.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:69084'),
  ('324260421374175377', 'Monster: The Ed Gein Story', 2025, 'Crime', 'Ian Brennan', null, 'Charlie Hunnam, Suzanna Son, Vicky Krieps, Laurie Metcalf', 'TV-MA', 'The shocking true-life tale of Ed Gein, the infamous murderer and grave robber who inspired many of Hollywood''s most iconic on-screen killers.', 'The shocking true-life tale of Ed Gein, the infamous murderer and grave robber who inspired many of Hollywood''s most iconic on-screen killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDHzRALtZCzHVmx7uyjTTKvMAPB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:286801'),
  ('980401110169245894', 'Monsterland', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Mystery', 'Mary Laws', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'In this fantasy anthology series, encounters with mermaids, fallen angels and other strange beasts drive broken people to desperate acts in an attempt to repair their lives, ultimately showing there is a thin line between man and beast.', 'In this fantasy anthology series, encounters with mermaids, fallen angels and other strange beasts drive broken people to desperate acts in an attempt to repair their lives, ultimately showing there is a thin line between man and beast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/trfjxF8LN8NuXxSsmGToRCFMdoH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107119'),
  ('792054457403957306', 'MonsterQuest', 2007, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Stan Bernard', 'TV-PG', 'Follows the search for various cryptozoological creatures and paranormal entities reportedly witnessed around the world.', 'Follows the search for various cryptozoological creatures and paranormal entities reportedly witnessed around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJOE7IftYDhIYo9j9eOboASzG7o.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:15427'),
  ('920293809509718459', 'Monsters', 1988, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Richard P. Rubinstein, Mitchell Galin', null, null, 'TV-14', 'Monsters is a syndicated horror anthology series which originally ran from 1988 to 1991 and reran on the Sci-Fi Channel during the 1990s. As of 2011, Monsters airs on NBC Universal''s horror/suspense-themed cable channel Chiller in sporadic weekday marathons. In a similar vein to Tales from the Darkside, Monsters shared the same producer, and in some ways succeeded the show. It differed in some respects nonetheless. While Tales sometimes dabbled in stories of science fiction and fantasy, this series was more strictly horror. As the name implies, each episode of Monsters featured a different monster which the story concerned, from the animatronic puppet of a fictional children''s television program to mutated, weapon-wielding lab rats. Similar to Tales, however, the stories in Monsters were rarely very straightforward action plots and often contained some ironic twist in which a character''s conceit or greed would do him in, often with gruesome results. Adding to this was a sense of comedy often lost on horror productions which might in some instances lighten the audience''s mood but in many cases added to the overall eeriness of the production.', 'Monsters is a syndicated horror anthology series which originally ran from 1988 to 1991 and reran on the Sci-Fi Channel during the 1990s. As of 2011, Monsters airs on NBC Universal''s horror/suspense-themed cable channel Chiller in sporadic weekday marathons. In a similar vein to Tales from the Darkside, Monsters shared the same producer, and in some ways succeeded the show. It differed in some respects nonetheless. While Tales sometimes dabbled in stories of science fiction and fantasy, this series was more strictly horror. As the name implies, each episode of Monsters featured a different monster which the story concerned, from the animatronic puppet of a fictional children''s television program to mutated, weapon-wielding lab rats. Similar to Tales, however, the stories in Monsters were rarely very straightforward action plots and often contained some ironic twist in which a character''s conceit or greed would do him in, often with gruesome results. Adding to this was a sense of comedy often lost on horror productions which might in some instances lighten the audience''s mood but in many cases added to the overall eeriness of the production.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fnBz19xGCKc7mfEo9NOeRWIe4iX.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:6323'),
  ('887946669541311522', 'Monsters at Work', 2021, 'Family, Comedy, Animation', 'Bobs Gannaway', 'Deepak Sethi, Hilary Helding, Joy Regullano', null, 'TV-G', 'Ever since he was a kid, Tylor Tuskmon has dreamed of becoming a Scarer just like his idol James P. Sullivan, and now that dream is about to come true... or not. The day he arrives at Monsters Incorporated to begin his dream job as a Scarer, he learns that scaring is out and laughter is in! After being reassigned to the Monsters, Inc. Facilities Team, Tylor sets his sights on a new goal: figuring out how to be funny and becoming a Jokester.', 'Ever since he was a kid, Tylor Tuskmon has dreamed of becoming a Scarer just like his idol James P. Sullivan, and now that dream is about to come true... or not. The day he arrives at Monsters Incorporated to begin his dream job as a Scarer, he learns that scaring is out and laughter is in! After being reassigned to the Monsters, Inc. Facilities Team, Tylor sets his sights on a new goal: figuring out how to be funny and becoming a Jokester.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2gxgwhcuSmI5xtexb0t9zGj43FS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:90461'),
  ('1114454863235027062', 'Monsters Inside Me', 2009, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Cindy Chase, Nastasha Strang, Esin Varan, Tony Dadika, Justin Peed, Dan Riskin', 'TV-PG', 'Part horror movie, part medical detective story, find out what happens when people fall prey to an infection from a parasite, those nasty microscopic creatures found in water, soil and even in the air. Victims'' stories are retold, including how doctors and scientists attempt to unravel each case before it''s too late. Biologist Dan Riskin, assisted by doctors and experts who witnessed each case, leads the scientific discussion about each parasite.', 'Part horror movie, part medical detective story, find out what happens when people fall prey to an infection from a parasite, those nasty microscopic creatures found in water, soil and even in the air. Victims'' stories are retold, including how doctors and scientists attempt to unravel each case before it''s too late. Biologist Dan Riskin, assisted by doctors and experts who witnessed each case, leads the scientific discussion about each parasite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l4CGuHCqbpN45D1OeBOAr2I612i.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:21665'),
  ('198765989089783531', 'Monsters Inside: The 24 Faces of Billy Milligan', 2021, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Olivier Megaton, Brice Lambert', 'Brice Lambert, Olivier Megaton', 'Kathy Preston, Jim Morrison, George Harding, Jim Murray, Sheila Porter, Sharon Lansing, Pam Flynn, Terry Sherman', null, 'In the late 1970s, an accused serial rapist claims multiple personalities control his behavior, setting off a legal odyssey that captivates America.', 'In the late 1970s, an accused serial rapist claims multiple personalities control his behavior, setting off a legal odyssey that captivates America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4BvMx1wNVYFLeXHuGm66OENZEh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132105'),
  ('470968450830129528', 'Monsters vs. Aliens', 2013, 'Animation, Family, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Mark McCorkle', null, 'Eric Edelstein, Chris O''Dowd, Riki Lindhome, Diedrich Bader, Diedrich Bader', 'TV-Y7', 'Inspired by DreamWorks Animation''s 2009 blockbuster feature film, this new series follows the further adventures of the beloved monsters- B.O.B., the gelatinous blob without a brain; Link, the prehistoric fish-man; Dr. Cockroach, the half-man/half-insect mad scientist; and Susan (aka Ginormica), the incredible growing woman-as they defend Earth from various alien and supernatural threats.', 'Inspired by DreamWorks Animation''s 2009 blockbuster feature film, this new series follows the further adventures of the beloved monsters- B.O.B., the gelatinous blob without a brain; Link, the prehistoric fish-man; Dr. Cockroach, the half-man/half-insect mad scientist; and Susan (aka Ginormica), the incredible growing woman-as they defend Earth from various alien and supernatural threats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ktmwzcWou5vCyqDnRJXih812XGI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60789'),
  ('1138632170380896833', 'Monsters: The Lyle and Erik Menendez Story', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', 'Ryan Murphy, Ian Brennan', 'Tom Kent', 'Javier Bardem, Chloë Sevigny, Cooper Koch, Nicholas Alexander Chavez', 'TV-MA', 'The story of the Menéndez brothers, who were convicted in 1996 of murdering their parents José and Mary Louise “Kitty” Menéndez.', 'The story of the Menéndez brothers, who were convicted in 1996 of murdering their parents José and Mary Louise “Kitty” Menéndez.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9YC2rpXHUFMqI1hCekKDm9UE4w.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:225634'),
  ('624359586049289807', 'Monstrous', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Jang Kun-jae, Yeon Sang-ho', 'Yeon Sang-ho, Ryu Yong-jae', 'Koo Kyo-hwan, Shin Hyun-been, Kim Ji-young, Park Ho-san, Kwak Dong-yeon, Nam Da-reum, Park Soi, Dong Hyun-bae', null, 'A giant Buddha statue is unearthed in a small rural town. The mayor believes that it will change the town into a major tourist attraction. However, a catastrophe starts to grow. A centuries-old curse is unleashed from the statue, and it starts to eat up people''s souls and make them non-human. Jung Ki-hoon, as archaeologist tries to seek the truth behind the paranormal phenomenon.', 'A giant Buddha statue is unearthed in a small rural town. The mayor believes that it will change the town into a major tourist attraction. However, a catastrophe starts to grow. A centuries-old curse is unleashed from the statue, and it starts to eat up people''s souls and make them non-human. Jung Ki-hoon, as archaeologist tries to seek the truth behind the paranormal phenomenon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fuHREsrbmBejFXREu5DgmzQaYm8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135786'),
  ('856734167329598535', 'Monsuno', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jeremy Padawer, Jared Wolfson', null, 'Cam Clarke, Cam Clarke, Keith Silverstein, Kirk Thornton, Cam Clarke, Karen Strassman, Christopher Corey Smith', 'TV-Y7', 'Monsuno hurtled through space before man existed. Upon burning through the planet''s atmosphere and crashing to Earth, they brought chaos and the extinction of the dinosaurs. Over millions of years, the Monsuno essence slowly disappeared as it dropped deeper and deeper below the planet’s surface, until a scientist named Jeredy Suno at the secret government agency found a way to bring them back and control. He took his research and vanished, but not before he left his only son a special gift.', 'Monsuno hurtled through space before man existed. Upon burning through the planet''s atmosphere and crashing to Earth, they brought chaos and the extinction of the dinosaurs. Over millions of years, the Monsuno essence slowly disappeared as it dropped deeper and deeper below the planet’s surface, until a scientist named Jeredy Suno at the secret government agency found a way to bring them back and control. He took his research and vanished, but not before he left his only son a special gift.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pjzubEF1aG0lUDEacek8NUh2IFw.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:56402'),
  ('549340881094255572', 'Montecristo', 2023, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Jacobo Díaz, Lidia Fraga', null, 'William Levy, Roberto Enríquez, Juan Fernández, Esmeralda Pimentel, Silvia Abascal, Guiomar Puerta, Franky Martínez', 'TV-14', 'Alejandro Montecristo is a mysterious figure who bursts into the public eye and raises concerns amongst the world’s elite because the origin of his fortune and his past are unknown.', 'Alejandro Montecristo is a mysterious figure who bursts into the public eye and raises concerns amongst the world’s elite because the origin of his fortune and his past are unknown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lXXc7XywZT2PkCfLSFbqxEYHKeQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223035'),
  ('219091116585336776', 'Monterossi - La serie', 2022, 'Comedy, Crime', null, null, 'Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Diego Ribon, Martina Sammarco, Luca Nucera, Tommaso Ragno, Beatrice Schiros, Marina Occhionero, Carla Signoris', null, 'Detective by chance, out of anger and human curiosity, always poised between ironic indolence and blues yearning, in his search for the truth Carlo Monterossi will have to confront a couple of cultured and professional killers, two gypsies looking for revenge, collectors and smugglers of Nazi-fascist souvenirs, incredible personal exchanges, a woman who seems to have lived several times and a cruel past that returns and leaves indecipherable clues behind. A comedic twist based on Alessandro Robecchi''s successful crime novels.', 'Detective by chance, out of anger and human curiosity, always poised between ironic indolence and blues yearning, in his search for the truth Carlo Monterossi will have to confront a couple of cultured and professional killers, two gypsies looking for revenge, collectors and smugglers of Nazi-fascist souvenirs, incredible personal exchanges, a woman who seems to have lived several times and a cruel past that returns and leaves indecipherable clues behind. A comedic twist based on Alessandro Robecchi''s successful crime novels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9zpbEvj9FYtUL4VMvGtNk143Dsm.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:155781'),
  ('90766428394012538', 'Monthly Girls'' Nozaki-kun', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Ari Ozawa, Yuichi Nakamura, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Yuki Ono, Ryohei Kimura, Mai Nakahara, Miyuki Sawashiro, Kenta Miyake', 'TV-14', 'High school student Chiyo Sakura has a crush on schoolmate Umetarō Nozaki, but when she confesses her love to him, he mistakes her for a fan and gives her an autograph. When she says that she always wants to be with him, he invites her to his house and has her help on some drawings. Chiyo discovers that Nozaki is actually a renowned shōjo manga artist named Sakiko Yumeno. She then agrees to be his assistant in order to get closer to him. As they work on his manga Let''s Fall in Love (恋しよっ), they encounter other schoolmates who assist them or serve as inspirations for characters in the stories.', 'High school student Chiyo Sakura has a crush on schoolmate Umetarō Nozaki, but when she confesses her love to him, he mistakes her for a fan and gives her an autograph. When she says that she always wants to be with him, he invites her to his house and has her help on some drawings. Chiyo discovers that Nozaki is actually a renowned shōjo manga artist named Sakiko Yumeno. She then agrees to be his assistant in order to get closer to him. As they work on his manga Let''s Fall in Love (恋しよっ), they encounter other schoolmates who assist them or serve as inspirations for characters in the stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/maPv22inKIcyfOCil3wrWiyJ7gC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61379'),
  ('1110422966119697058', 'Monthly Magazine Home', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Myung Soo-Hyun', 'Myung Soo-Hyun', 'Kim Ji-seok, Jung So-min, Jung Gun-joo, Chae Jung-an, Kim Won-hae, Yun Ji-on, Lee Hwa-Kyum, Ahn Hyun-ho', null, 'A home-searching romance story about a man who buys houses and a woman who lives in one. It follows the diverse stories of the editors of a home magazine.', 'A home-searching romance story about a man who buys houses and a woman who lives in one. It follows the diverse stories of the editors of a home magazine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qoJLJhbQqlrXNTjwm8FcTHwnR39.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:120057'),
  ('919780874173339173', 'Monty Python: Almost the Truth (The Lawyer''s Cut)', 2009, 'Documentary, Comedy', null, null, 'Graham Chapman, John Cleese, Michael Palin, Eric Idle, Terry Gilliam, Terry Jones, Carol Cleveland, Neil Innes', null, 'A 2009 television documentary series in six parts that covers 40 years of the surreal comedy group Monty Python, from Flying Circus to present day projects such as the musical Spamalot. The series highlights their childhood, schooling and university life, and pre-Python work. The series featured new interviews with surviving members John Cleese, Terry Gilliam, Eric Idle, Terry Jones and Michael Palin, alongside archive interview footage of Graham Chapman and interviews with several associates of the Pythons, including Carol Cleveland, Neil Innes and Chapman''s partner David Sherlock, along with commentary from modern comedians.', 'A 2009 television documentary series in six parts that covers 40 years of the surreal comedy group Monty Python, from Flying Circus to present day projects such as the musical Spamalot. The series highlights their childhood, schooling and university life, and pre-Python work. The series featured new interviews with surviving members John Cleese, Terry Gilliam, Eric Idle, Terry Jones and Michael Palin, alongside archive interview footage of Graham Chapman and interviews with several associates of the Pythons, including Carol Cleveland, Neil Innes and Chapman''s partner David Sherlock, along with commentary from modern comedians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uInSp6YyYS41nL3Imlzh5Jyvqn9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31752'),
  ('801596021893700846', 'Monty Python''s Fliegender Zirkus', 1972, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Graham Chapman, John Cleese, Eric Idle, Terry Jones, Michael Palin', null, 'Monty Python''s Fliegender Zirkus consisted of two 45-minute Monty Python German television comedy specials produced by WDR for West German television. The two episodes were first broadcast in January and December 1972 and were shot entirely on film and mostly on location in Bavaria, with the first episode recorded in German and the second recorded in English and then dubbed into German.', 'Monty Python''s Fliegender Zirkus consisted of two 45-minute Monty Python German television comedy specials produced by WDR for West German television. The two episodes were first broadcast in January and December 1972 and were shot entirely on film and mostly on location in Bavaria, with the first episode recorded in German and the second recorded in English and then dubbed into German.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yvOzluWxBnyjA0LcZXZcDbK7BxH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16382'),
  ('698564560233638600', 'Monty Python''s Flying Circus', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Ian MacNaughton, John Howard Davies', null, 'Graham Chapman, Michael Palin, Terry Jones, Eric Idle, Terry Gilliam', 'TV-14', 'A British sketch comedy series with the shows being composed of surreality, risqué or innuendo-laden humour, sight gags and observational sketches without punchlines.', 'A British sketch comedy series with the shows being composed of surreality, risqué or innuendo-laden humour, sight gags and observational sketches without punchlines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZtMtL8Pqv9FAMljN9911U4qBhI.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:849'),
  ('207965092972160851', 'Monzón: A Knockout Blow', 2019, 'Crime, Drama', 'Pablo E. Bossi', 'Francisco Varone, Gabriela Larralde, Leandro Custo', 'Jorge Román, Mauricio Paniagua, Diego Cremonesi, Carla Quevedo, Belén Chavanne, Mariano Chiesa, Paloma Ker, Rodrigo Pedreira', 'TV-MA', 'The story about Argentinian boxer Carlos Monzón in his career and life in prison.', 'The story about Argentinian boxer Carlos Monzón in his career and life in prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pe7UoaPBmhoZUZHu5wa1s5OV11N.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90614'),
  ('517424366021778360', 'Mood', 2022, 'Drama', 'Nicôle Lecky', 'Nicôle Lecky', 'Nicôle Lecky, Lara Peake, Ebony Aboagye, Jordan Duvigneau', null, 'Sasha, a 25-year-old wannabe singer and rapper thrown out of home, but right now she’s a bedroom artist spending her days smoking weed, stalking her ex-boyfriend on social media and avoiding her family.', 'Sasha, a 25-year-old wannabe singer and rapper thrown out of home, but right now she’s a bedroom artist spending her days smoking weed, stalking her ex-boyfriend on social media and avoiding her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iK5JKGeC46cIyDzCDKsdZOH4Xt3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155500'),
  ('159630846789371311', 'Mood Indigo', 2019, 'Drama', 'Maki Marukido', 'Koichiro Miki', 'Terunosuke Takezai, Munehiro Yoshida', null, 'A broke novelist ghostwrites erotica to survive—but when a dying legend makes a twisted demand, he and his editor must face what they’ll sacrifice.', 'A broke novelist ghostwrites erotica to survive—but when a dying legend makes a twisted demand, he and his editor must face what they’ll sacrifice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/enBgpSuFdzaiXc3AMm7hP6JWUS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:104480'),
  ('57634516699070573', 'Mooi Praatjies', 2025, 'Talk', null, null, 'Cindy Nell-Roberts', null, 'Cindy Nell-Roberts and her friend Denise Zimba explore the world of beauty together. They talk about everything from aesthetic procedures to the more accessible and affordable ways you can pursue beauty.', 'Cindy Nell-Roberts and her friend Denise Zimba explore the world of beauty together. They talk about everything from aesthetic procedures to the more accessible and affordable ways you can pursue beauty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eYn9okDmQTncgXcssWTHWHpIfG6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:281612'),
  ('527789549309116355', 'Moomin', 1990, 'Animation, Family, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Minami Takayama, Rei Sakuma, Ryusei Nakao, Takehito Koyasu, Mika Kanai, Akio Otsuka, Ikuko Tani, Emiko Shiratori', 'TV-Y', 'In the remote and mysterious Moominvalley live the Moomins, gentle and peaceful creatures. Young Moomintroll and his family experience many strange adventures, both magical and mundane.', 'In the remote and mysterious Moominvalley live the Moomins, gentle and peaceful creatures. Young Moomintroll and his family experience many strange adventures, both magical and mundane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNwa7eEqZpnPaNGkFrvvd3mSKeJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67575'),
  ('1090398465706941023', 'Moominvalley', 2019, 'Animation, Kids, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Marika Makaroff', null, 'Jack Rowan, Bel Powley, Rosamund Pike, Matt Berry, Edvin Endre, Warwick Davis, Akiya Henry', 'TV-Y', 'Follow the life and adventures of curious, kind and idealistic Moomintroll. A typical hero in a coming-of-age story, Moomintroll tries to tackle the puzzle of growing up to his true, individualistic self while remaining a beloved part of the family.', 'Follow the life and adventures of curious, kind and idealistic Moomintroll. A typical hero in a coming-of-age story, Moomintroll tries to tackle the puzzle of growing up to his true, individualistic self while remaining a beloved part of the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhA4pHwPUDSR77xSOXgwj7smUoD.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:70617'),
  ('972746051641504081', 'Moon in the Day', 2023, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Pyo Min-soo', 'Kim Hye-won, Jung Sung-eun', 'Kim Young-dae, Pyo Ye-jin, On Ju-wan, Jung Woong-in, Lee Kyung-young, Moon Ye-won, Jeong Sin-hye, Kim Dong-young', null, 'A famous South Korean celebrity Han Joon Oh suffers a car accident and wakes up possessed by a vengeful ancient nobleman Do Ha, seeking revenge for his past life', 'A famous South Korean celebrity Han Joon Oh suffers a car accident and wakes up possessed by a vengeful ancient nobleman Do Ha, seeking revenge for his past life', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebYVdmgjBgcLHu6r5L9iuUjNMVN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:230924'),
  ('735212676337874611', 'Moon Knight', 2022, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Jeremy Slater', 'Danielle Iman, JB Ballard, Chase Kroll', 'Oscar Isaac, Ethan Hawke, May Calamawy, Ann Akinjirin, David Ganly, Karim El Hakim, F. Murray Abraham', 'TV-14', 'When Steven Grant, a mild-mannered gift-shop employee, becomes plagued with blackouts and memories of another life, he discovers he has dissociative identity disorder and shares a body with mercenary Marc Spector. As Steven/Marc’s enemies converge upon them, they must navigate their complex identities while thrust into a deadly mystery among the powerful gods of Egypt.', 'When Steven Grant, a mild-mannered gift-shop employee, becomes plagued with blackouts and memories of another life, he discovers he has dissociative identity disorder and shares a body with mercenary Marc Spector. As Steven/Marc’s enemies converge upon them, they must navigate their complex identities while thrust into a deadly mystery among the powerful gods of Egypt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/YksR65as1ppF2N48TJAh2PLamX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92749'),
  ('520026474885098855', 'Moon River', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery, Comedy', 'Cho Seung-hee', 'Cho Seung-hee', 'Kang Tae-oh, Kim Se-jeong, Lee Sin-young, Hong Su-zu, Jin Goo, Kim Nam-hee, Park Ah-in, Im Gi-hong', null, 'In Joseon, a vengeful crown prince and a memory-lost merchant mysteriously swap bodies, unraveling a web of chaos, secrets, and unexpected fate.', 'In Joseon, a vengeful crown prince and a memory-lost merchant mysteriously swap bodies, unraveling a web of chaos, secrets, and unexpected fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nVl892J7boHDS5blMi97wQK7BUt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:274570'),
  ('494652367945907276', 'Moonbase 8', 2020, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jonathan Krisel, Fred Armisen, Tim Heidecker', null, 'Fred Armisen, John C. Reilly, Tim Heidecker, Travis Kelce, Tina Landon', 'TV-14', 'In the isolated desert of Winslow, Arizona at NASA’s Moon Base Simulator, three eager astronauts—Skip, Rook and their leader Cap—attempt to qualify for their first lunar mission. They encounter many obstacles including loneliness, self-doubt and their own incompetence. In spite of it all, they remain determined to prove they have the right stuff to reach the moon.', 'In the isolated desert of Winslow, Arizona at NASA’s Moon Base Simulator, three eager astronauts—Skip, Rook and their leader Cap—attempt to qualify for their first lunar mission. They encounter many obstacles including loneliness, self-doubt and their own incompetence. In spite of it all, they remain determined to prove they have the right stuff to reach the moon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3hk8mDe3FxEYdn4rrFXzlCTITjM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80750'),
  ('77453321002947118', 'Moonbeam City', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Rob Lowe, Elizabeth Banks, Will Forte, Kate Mara', 'TV-14', 'An absurdist, retro-futuristic 80s cop extravaganza. The series follows undercover detective Dazzle Novak, a handsome idiot who commits more crimes than most criminals. His tyrannical chief, Pizzaz Miller, won''t get off his back, and hotshot rookie Rad Cunningham is dying to see him fail. With the world against him, Dazzle is thrust into a living nightmare: having to do actual police work.', 'An absurdist, retro-futuristic 80s cop extravaganza. The series follows undercover detective Dazzle Novak, a handsome idiot who commits more crimes than most criminals. His tyrannical chief, Pizzaz Miller, won''t get off his back, and hotshot rookie Rad Cunningham is dying to see him fail. With the world against him, Dazzle is thrust into a living nightmare: having to do actual police work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tnwhhJC5DmWspDxRAoCKD6rk4XK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63777'),
  ('511289370479302569', 'Moone Boy', 2012, 'Comedy, Family', 'Chris O''Dowd', null, 'Chris O''Dowd, David Rawle, Deirdre O''Kane, Clare Monnelly, Aoife Duffin, Ian O''Reilly, Sarah White, Peter McDonald', 'TV-14', 'Martin Moone is a young boy who relies on the help of his imaginary friend Sean to deal with the quandaries of life in a wacky small-town Irish family in the 1980''s.', 'Martin Moone is a young boy who relies on the help of his imaginary friend Sean to deal with the quandaries of life in a wacky small-town Irish family in the 1980''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xTjUsevqYd3lYRpbDHk4ZOezTN.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:56817'),
  ('1000393684438774536', 'Moonfleet', 2013, 'Drama', null, null, 'Ben Chaplin, Lorcan Cranitch, Lesley Vickerage, Anthony Ofoegbu, Sophie Cookson, Phil Daniels, Ray Winstone, Aneurin Barnard', 'TV-14', 'Ray Winstone leads a gang of smugglers in our brand new family drama, Moonfleet. Written by Ashley Pharoah (Life on Mars, Ashes to Ashes), this two-part adaptation of the much-loved John Meade Falkner novel is set in the small Dorset village of Moonfleet. In the story, young John Trenchard (Aneurin Barnard - The Truth About Emanuel, The White Queen) is desperate to join the local band of smugglers led by Elzevir Block (Winstone - The Departed, Hugo, Snow White And The Huntsman). Together they embark on an adventure full of action, friendship, and humour, and hunt for a fabled lost diamond. Their journey takes them from 18th Century Dorset, to the jewellery quarter of The Hague, and on to a gripping, final sea voyage. Newcomer Sophie Cookson joins the cast as John''s first love, Grace, who is also the daughter of Moonfleet''s anti-smuggling magistrate, Mohune, played by Ben Chaplin', 'Ray Winstone leads a gang of smugglers in our brand new family drama, Moonfleet. Written by Ashley Pharoah (Life on Mars, Ashes to Ashes), this two-part adaptation of the much-loved John Meade Falkner novel is set in the small Dorset village of Moonfleet. In the story, young John Trenchard (Aneurin Barnard - The Truth About Emanuel, The White Queen) is desperate to join the local band of smugglers led by Elzevir Block (Winstone - The Departed, Hugo, Snow White And The Huntsman). Together they embark on an adventure full of action, friendship, and humour, and hunt for a fabled lost diamond. Their journey takes them from 18th Century Dorset, to the jewellery quarter of The Hague, and on to a gripping, final sea voyage. Newcomer Sophie Cookson joins the cast as John''s first love, Grace, who is also the daughter of Moonfleet''s anti-smuggling magistrate, Mohune, played by Ben Chaplin', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5JtU390kjRVRIWJIvaNq3vcMh2t.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:28156'),
  ('574028819865175509', 'Moonflower Murders', 2024, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Anthony Horowitz', 'Anthony Horowitz', 'Lesley Manville, Tim McMullan, Alexandros Logothetis, Daniel Mays, Conleth Hill, Mark Gatiss, Rosalie Craig, Pippa Bennett-Warner', null, 'Susan has left publishing and is living in Crete with her long-time boyfriend, Andreas. But her idyll is disturbed by the shadow of a murder committed at a British country hotel eight years ago. Alan Conway visited the hotel and wrote a novel based on what happened there. Cecily MacNeil, the young woman who helps run the hotel, read the book and believed the wrong man had been arrested. Now she has disappeared. Can Susan uncover the secret hidden in the book and find Cecily before it is too late?', 'Susan has left publishing and is living in Crete with her long-time boyfriend, Andreas. But her idyll is disturbed by the shadow of a murder committed at a British country hotel eight years ago. Alan Conway visited the hotel and wrote a novel based on what happened there. Cecily MacNeil, the young woman who helps run the hotel, read the book and believed the wrong man had been arrested. Now she has disappeared. Can Susan uncover the secret hidden in the book and find Cecily before it is too late?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Nvf4U5dba5Un1RlYemhD2sxZBN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241548'),
  ('370228253849227084', 'Moonhaven', 2022, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Peter Ocko', null, 'Emma McDonald, Dominic Monaghan, Joe Manganiello, Ayelet Zurer, Kadeem Hardison, Amara Karan, Yazzmin Newell', 'TV-14', 'Bella Sway, a lunar cargo pilot and smuggler 100 years in the future, finds herself accused of a crime and marooned on Moonhaven, a utopian community set on a 500 square mile Garden of Eden built on the Moon to find solutions to the problems that will soon end civilization on Mother Earth.', 'Bella Sway, a lunar cargo pilot and smuggler 100 years in the future, finds herself accused of a crime and marooned on Moonhaven, a utopian community set on a 500 square mile Garden of Eden built on the Moon to find solutions to the problems that will soon end civilization on Mother Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvEkr0zhe4DKdgf2ylcwFxyEFok.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:125398'),
  ('1140824387427896693', 'Moonlight', 2007, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ron Koslow, Trevor Munson', null, 'Alex O''Loughlin, Sophia Myles, Jason Dohring, Shannyn Sossamon', 'TV-14', 'Mick St. John is a captivating, charming and immortal private investigator from Los Angeles, who defies the traditional blood-sucking norms of his vampire tendencies by using his wit and powerful supernatural abilities to help the living.', 'Mick St. John is a captivating, charming and immortal private investigator from Los Angeles, who defies the traditional blood-sucking norms of his vampire tendencies by using his wit and powerful supernatural abilities to help the living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rWk9g0Oup5WHcrpjvw5zW1WhLc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5690'),
  ('649256337028110640', 'Moonlight Mystique', 2025, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Xing Ling', null, 'Bai Lu, Ao Ruipeng, Dai Luwa, Chang Huasen, Zhang Xin, Cheng Tao, Quan Yilun', 'NR', 'Bai Shuo, the youngest daughter of the General''s Mansion, aspires to cultivate immortality in order to repay a favor. On her journey to seek immortality, she accidentally rescues the great demon god Fan Yue. As the saying goes, healthy fights strengthen relationships, and they go from mutual manipulation to mutual affection as they fall in love with each other, navigating a love affair intertwined with sweetness and cruelty. Even though they face countless difficulties, their love is strong enough to overcome all limitations, allowing them to truly embrace each other.', 'Bai Shuo, the youngest daughter of the General''s Mansion, aspires to cultivate immortality in order to repay a favor. On her journey to seek immortality, she accidentally rescues the great demon god Fan Yue. As the saying goes, healthy fights strengthen relationships, and they go from mutual manipulation to mutual affection as they fall in love with each other, navigating a love affair intertwined with sweetness and cruelty. Even though they face countless difficulties, their love is strong enough to overcome all limitations, allowing them to truly embrace each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tqNdo1e3dwxPUGGidcuT9IMfJ1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:238680'),
  ('951477942913147954', 'Moonlighting', 1985, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Glenn Gordon Caron', 'Roger Director', 'Cybill Shepherd, Bruce Willis, Allyce Beasley, Curtis Armstrong', 'TV-PG', 'After being duped and going bankrupt, model Maddie is convinced by David to become a partner in a detective agency. Together they solve various cases, while getting comfortable with each other.', 'After being duped and going bankrupt, model Maddie is convinced by David to become a partner in a detective agency. Together they solve various cases, while getting comfortable with each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yOetTNRQLPmlfO0k5377yhHZyC3.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1998'),
  ('345010609907728985', 'Moonlit Reunion', 2025, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Fu Hua', 'Liu Yue, Sun Lin', 'Xu Kai, Tian Xiwei, Wang Jiayi, Wu Junting, Yi Daqian, Fan Shiran, Lai Weiming, Shan Jingyao', null, 'Mei Zhuyu, a calm and reserved nobleman from a lesser branch of the Mei family, arrives in Chang''an as an official at the Bureau of Mystic Investigations. During a banquet, he meets Wu Zhen, the bold and unruly younger sister of the Empress and secret Guardian of the Demon Underworld. Both hide their true identities. Wu, a half-demon striving to keep peace, and Mei, a skilled demon slayer, seek the truth behind the fire 18 years ago. As bone demons rise and unrest grows, they fight side by side, forming a bond that deepens into love until the Changxi Palace launches a purge, forcing them to face each other''s secrets and the past they share.', 'Mei Zhuyu, a calm and reserved nobleman from a lesser branch of the Mei family, arrives in Chang''an as an official at the Bureau of Mystic Investigations. During a banquet, he meets Wu Zhen, the bold and unruly younger sister of the Empress and secret Guardian of the Demon Underworld. Both hide their true identities. Wu, a half-demon striving to keep peace, and Mei, a skilled demon slayer, seek the truth behind the fire 18 years ago. As bone demons rise and unrest grows, they fight side by side, forming a bond that deepens into love until the Changxi Palace launches a purge, forcing them to face each other''s secrets and the past they share.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pOy5ysYxiHth3ZfW9NjrtJuauxF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:242762'),
  ('918923631682946931', 'MoonPhase', 2004, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Chiwa Saito, Hiroshi Kamiya', 'TV-14', 'Paranormal photographer Kouhei stumbles into the arms of Hazuki, a vampire beauty who has waited for years to be freed from a forgotten castle. Unwilling to part with her unwitting hero, the petite vamp follows Kouhei home and starts causing trouble. But domestic disorder is the least of Kouhei’s problems. With dark forces gathering, he’s about to enter a world he can’t begin to comprehend!', 'Paranormal photographer Kouhei stumbles into the arms of Hazuki, a vampire beauty who has waited for years to be freed from a forgotten castle. Unwilling to part with her unwitting hero, the petite vamp follows Kouhei home and starts causing trouble. But domestic disorder is the least of Kouhei’s problems. With dark forces gathering, he’s about to enter a world he can’t begin to comprehend!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qmrmOwgYje9lwViRTcjM5Ocu2h1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:27813'),
  ('412051799213454641', 'MoonQuest', 2013, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Lewis Brindley', null, 'Lewis Brindley, Simon Lane, Duncan Jones', null, 'Welcome to MoonQuest, where our heroes embark on an epic adventure to fire Simon into space and reach the moon!', 'Welcome to MoonQuest, where our heroes embark on an epic adventure to fire Simon into space and reach the moon!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b8LDdZRMyApCGIWCJjF1Xf2WyfX.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:305463'),
  ('656963241221123724', 'Moonrise', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Chiaki Kobayashi, Yuto Uemura, Kosuke Takaguchi, Satoshi Yamaguchi, Arisa Kori, Yuka Terasaki, Yu Kobayashi, Katsunori Okai', 'TV-MA', 'After rebel forces attack Earth, a carefree heir becomes the prime suspect and joins a special military unit to find the true mastermind on the Moon.', 'After rebel forces attack Earth, a carefree heir becomes the prime suspect and joins a special military unit to find the true mastermind on the Moon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mqok8du6LvnaigAJo5omAq1BPye.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203740'),
  ('434458822839572104', 'Moonshine', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kim Ah-rok', 'Kim Ah-rok', 'Yoo Seung-ho, Lee Hye-ri, Byeon Woo-seok, Kang Mi-na, Jang Kwang, Choi Won-young, Im Won-hee, Moon You-kang', null, 'About human love against the backdrop of the most powerful alcohol prohibition period in the Joseon. The private prosecutor who comes to Seoul to raise the family, a poor man and his wife who start to make drinks to pay off their debts, and the prince who keeps going over the wall to drink; the drama is about three people who can end each other''s lives fatefully encountering in front of a secret liquor warehouse.', 'About human love against the backdrop of the most powerful alcohol prohibition period in the Joseon. The private prosecutor who comes to Seoul to raise the family, a poor man and his wife who start to make drinks to pay off their debts, and the prince who keeps going over the wall to drink; the drama is about three people who can end each other''s lives fatefully encountering in front of a secret liquor warehouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJAlUCdFWAso5cowfv3vhI2QtZY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129889'),
  ('31641586841161209', 'Moonshine and Valentine', 2018, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Freddie Shen, Yang Shen, Gao Xiaoxian', 'Victoria Song, Johnny Huang, Li Jiaming, Li Junxian, Zhang Bojia, Jiang Qilin, Liu Yongxi', null, 'Guan Pipi''s quiet life is interrupted by the mysterious Helan Jingting, a blind man in the daylight with perfect night vision, a vegetarian, and an expert in ancient jade. As they grow closer, they realize their lives are intertwined by fate and an ancient curse. Jingting is determined to change their destined path, but the question remains: can they escape the fate that binds them?', 'Guan Pipi''s quiet life is interrupted by the mysterious Helan Jingting, a blind man in the daylight with perfect night vision, a vegetarian, and an expert in ancient jade. As they grow closer, they realize their lives are intertwined by fate and an ancient curse. Jingting is determined to change their destined path, but the question remains: can they escape the fate that binds them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vf0Mb2ec5GLr5dxYEYyURlmTh8J.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79484'),
  ('139778690512563283', 'Moonshiners', 2011, 'Reality', null, null, 'Tim Smith', 'TV-14', 'Think the days of bootleggers, backwoods stills and "white lightning" are over? Not a chance! It''s a multi-million dollar industry. But perhaps more importantly to the moonshiners, it''s a tradition dating back hundreds of years, passed down to them from their forefathers. It''s part of their history and culture. While this practice is surprisingly alive and well, it''s not always legal. Moonshiners tells the story of those who brew their shine - often in the woods near their homes using camouflaged equipment - and the local authorities who try to keep them honest. Viewers will witness practices rarely, if ever, seen on television including the sacred rite of passage for a moonshiner - firing up the still for the first time. They will also meet legends, including notorious moonshiner Marvin "Popcorn" Sutton.', 'Think the days of bootleggers, backwoods stills and "white lightning" are over? Not a chance! It''s a multi-million dollar industry. But perhaps more importantly to the moonshiners, it''s a tradition dating back hundreds of years, passed down to them from their forefathers. It''s part of their history and culture. While this practice is surprisingly alive and well, it''s not always legal. Moonshiners tells the story of those who brew their shine - often in the woods near their homes using camouflaged equipment - and the local authorities who try to keep them honest. Viewers will witness practices rarely, if ever, seen on television including the sacred rite of passage for a moonshiner - firing up the still for the first time. They will also meet legends, including notorious moonshiner Marvin "Popcorn" Sutton.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/brgOpuQs3nhqRKQWomMv0jpHqxM.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:46268'),
  ('1046495446859467027', 'Moonzy', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Aleksandr Boyarsky', 'Darina Shmidt, Elena Galdobina, Sarra Anson', 'Yekaterina Gorokhovskaya, Mikhail Chernyak, Yuliya Rudina, Yekaterina Gorokhovskaya, Elena Shulman, Oleg Kulikovich, Anatoli Petrov, Elena Shulman', null, '"The Adventures of Luntik" or simply "Luntik" is a Russian animated series for children of preschool age. It is the story of a small fluffy creature, Luntik, who was born on the Moon and fell from it, on to the Earth. Luntik is the main character and each episode features a story about him and his friends. Luntik is new to the Earth and in each episode he learns something about this new world. He meets new friends, learns how to be polite and even gets a family. The majority of the characters in the series are small animals: insects, fish, frogs, bees, grasshoppers, ladybugs etc. The show features both adult and children characters. The series are shown from the child''s perspective and the stories are very kind and warm. Even the "villains" of the series - two caterpillars - are just a couple of mischievous kids. Each episode is only 6 minutes long and has a finished story line.', '"The Adventures of Luntik" or simply "Luntik" is a Russian animated series for children of preschool age. It is the story of a small fluffy creature, Luntik, who was born on the Moon and fell from it, on to the Earth. Luntik is the main character and each episode features a story about him and his friends. Luntik is new to the Earth and in each episode he learns something about this new world. He meets new friends, learns how to be polite and even gets a family. The majority of the characters in the series are small animals: insects, fish, frogs, bees, grasshoppers, ladybugs etc. The show features both adult and children characters. The series are shown from the child''s perspective and the stories are very kind and warm. Even the "villains" of the series - two caterpillars - are just a couple of mischievous kids. Each episode is only 6 minutes long and has a finished story line.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ikDr9Ua8dglQczEDqzNvnOVyIBL.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:46938'),
  ('305608520048349555', 'Moorim School', 2016, 'Drama', 'Lee So-yeong, Hyun-hee Kim', 'Hyun-hee Kim', 'Lee Hyun-woo, Seo Yea-ji, Lee Hong-bin, Jung Yoo-jin, Alexander, Shannon, Shin Hyun-jun, Kan Mi-youn', null, 'The Moorim School isn''t focused solely on high academic scores. The school teaches its students virtues including honesty, faith, sacrifice and communication. The teachers and students at the school come from different countries and each have their own stories.', 'The Moorim School isn''t focused solely on high academic scores. The school teaches its students virtues including honesty, faith, sacrifice and communication. The teachers and students at the school come from different countries and each have their own stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xAhwHPZKZ1ql4QZ2ig0ZDSa68oc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64812'),
  ('270994544648816803', 'Moral Orel', 2005, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Dino Stamatopoulos', null, 'Carolyn Lawrence, Scott Adsit, Britta Phillips, Jay Johnston, Dino Stamatopoulos, David Herman, Tigger Stamatopoulos, William Salyers', 'TV-MA', 'Orel is an 11-year-old boy who loves church. His unbridled enthusiasm for piousness and his misinterpretation of religious morals often lead to disastrous results, including self-mutilation and crack addiction. No matter how much trouble he gets into, his reverence always keeps him cheery.', 'Orel is an 11-year-old boy who loves church. His unbridled enthusiasm for piousness and his misinterpretation of religious morals often lead to disastrous results, including self-mutilation and crack addiction. No matter how much trouble he gets into, his reverence always keeps him cheery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OSdgNEIYzCDYDmvJcGGBXgsAnR.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:292'),
  ('1077728045776594362', 'Moral Peanuts', 2010, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Hongchou Li', null, 'Xing Dongdong, Li Wei, An Ning, Yang Yu, Shao Zhuang', null, 'Scammers on the street are organized and disciplined. They are scattered across the fringes of the city. Five years ago, Zhao Ning''s father committed suicide after he was defrauded of all his property. In order to avenge her father, Zhao Ning gathers elites from all walks of life to strike back. They are comprised of scammers, noble thieves and criminals. They do not have a strict moral code, but they adhere to professional ethics and they are motivated not just by money. They are artists with high IQ, meticulously planning every step to lure the corrupt and the greedy into their nets. This is a mirror that reflects another aspect of society. Some things may not be visible to us, but we''ve all heard of it. This is a story in the present and the legend of the future.', 'Scammers on the street are organized and disciplined. They are scattered across the fringes of the city. Five years ago, Zhao Ning''s father committed suicide after he was defrauded of all his property. In order to avenge her father, Zhao Ning gathers elites from all walks of life to strike back. They are comprised of scammers, noble thieves and criminals. They do not have a strict moral code, but they adhere to professional ethics and they are motivated not just by money. They are artists with high IQ, meticulously planning every step to lure the corrupt and the greedy into their nets. This is a mirror that reflects another aspect of society. Some things may not be visible to us, but we''ve all heard of it. This is a story in the present and the legend of the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhOrOQroYR6aUrYrGUX8wu8szL0.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:78013'),
  ('949268559586122473', 'More Tales of the City', 1998, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Nicholas Wright, Armistead Maupin', null, 'Olympia Dukakis, Laura Linney, Colin Ferguson, Barbara Garrick, Paul Hopkins, Nina Siemaszko, Jackie Burroughs, Whip Hubley', 'TV-MA', 'Lonely inhabitants at 28 Barbary Lane search for love and identity, turning to each other in the hope of finding happiness in San Francisco.', 'Lonely inhabitants at 28 Barbary Lane search for love and identity, turning to each other in the hope of finding happiness in San Francisco.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/igEajYkalSvxkchKzc0h1IDGb2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46502'),
  ('544925045635955875', 'More than a Married Couple, but Not Lovers', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Seiichiro Yamashita, Saori Onishi, Saki Miyashita, Toshiki Masuda, Sho Nogami, Minami Takahashi, Azumi Waki, Yui Ogura', 'TV-14', 'The story centers on third-year high school student Jiro Yakuin, who gets saddled with his gyaru classmate Akari Watanabe for the class''s "marriage training" project about practicing to be a married couple. Jiro is the complete opposite of Akari, but the two know that if they do well they will be able to switch partners to end up with their respective crushes, and so they force themselves to act like the perfect married couple.', 'The story centers on third-year high school student Jiro Yakuin, who gets saddled with his gyaru classmate Akari Watanabe for the class''s "marriage training" project about practicing to be a married couple. Jiro is the complete opposite of Akari, but the two know that if they do well they will be able to switch partners to end up with their respective crushes, and so they force themselves to act like the perfect married couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tEdCclmak7CHR5OzbusD94zdhUW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:139287'),
  ('913802348892551788', 'More than Blue: The Series', 2021, 'Drama', null, null, 'Gingle Wang, Fandy Fan, Edison Wang, Ivy Shao, Eleven Yao, Figaro Tseng', null, 'The series revolves around the journey of music producer Wang Po Han and his assistant An Yi Qi to find the copyright owner of the mysterious song for their artist, A-Lin. They also came across a diary belonging to K who is the producer of the mysterious song and traveled into the life story of K through the diary. The diary tells the story of K and Cream, two orphans who journey through life and share experiences in sadness and joy together. However, K is diagnosed with fatal leukemia cancer. Knowing that Cream''s biggest fear is to be left alone, K keeps the fact that he has terminal cancer a secret.', 'The series revolves around the journey of music producer Wang Po Han and his assistant An Yi Qi to find the copyright owner of the mysterious song for their artist, A-Lin. They also came across a diary belonging to K who is the producer of the mysterious song and traveled into the life story of K through the diary. The diary tells the story of K and Cream, two orphans who journey through life and share experiences in sadness and joy together. However, K is diagnosed with fatal leukemia cancer. Knowing that Cream''s biggest fear is to be left alone, K keeps the fact that he has terminal cancer a secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxRVfOEPSDikkBIugO76CSVDxc0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:124578'),
  ('375054029815906446', 'More Than Friends', 2020, 'Drama', null, 'Cho Seung-hee', 'Ong Seong-wu, Shin Ye-eun, Kim Dong-jun, Pyo Ji-hoon, Ahn Eun-jin, Choi Chan-ho, Baek Soo-min, Kim Hee-jung', null, 'Due to a misunderstanding, Lee Soo and Kyung Woo Yeon have held a crush on each other for over 10 years. Lee Soo works as a photographer and he is attractive. He is also mistaken for a model many times. Kyung Woo Yeon works as a calligrapher. She has had a crush on Lee Soo for the past 10 years, since she was 18 years old.', 'Due to a misunderstanding, Lee Soo and Kyung Woo Yeon have held a crush on each other for over 10 years. Lee Soo works as a photographer and he is attractive. He is also mistaken for a model many times. Kyung Woo Yeon works as a calligrapher. She has had a crush on Lee Soo for the past 10 years, since she was 18 years old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zAqAfATMs3C9wsrZiEVzypwgXYJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108146'),
  ('817391674453399815', 'More Than Life At Stake', 1968, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, War & Politics', 'Andrzej Zbych', 'Andrzej Szypulski, Zbigniew Safjan', 'Stanisław Mikulski', null, 'A series about the adventures of a Polish secret agent, Hans Kloss, who acts as a double agent in the Abwehr during Second World War in occupied Poland.', 'A series about the adventures of a Polish secret agent, Hans Kloss, who acts as a double agent in the Abwehr during Second World War in occupied Poland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8u4pMkQZHg8N17cngL0ah8qVZOG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6526'),
  ('682345809090325323', 'More Than Words', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Ryoko Fujino, Yuzu Aoki, Daisuke Nakagawa, Daiki Kanechika, Kuranosuke Sasaki, Rie Tomosaka, Hirona Yamazaki, Ai Mikami', 'TV-MA', 'Mieko and Makio''s youthful friendship with Eiji evolves into love, parenthood, and reunions, painting a bittersweet portrait of growing up.', 'Mieko and Makio''s youthful friendship with Eiji evolves into love, parenthood, and reunions, painting a bittersweet portrait of growing up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cfDPJLZjlKOdaXsJD4S8HYZgFgE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210374'),
  ('11924223462840210', 'Morecambe & Wise', 1961, 'Comedy', null, 'Ernie Wise, Eric Morecambe', 'Eric Morecambe, Ernie Wise', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zzC0AF58dd0Mk9IRUlIKyuWRshq.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:14788'),
  ('1043136857434768910', 'Morgen hör ich auf', 2016, 'Drama, Crime', 'Sönke Lars Neuwöhner, Martin Eigler, Sven S. Poser', null, 'Bastian Pastewka, Susanne Wolff, Janina Fautz, Moritz Jahn, André Jung, Margarita Broich, Wolfgang Rüter, Georg Friedrich', null, 'An overwhelmed family man (Bastian Pastewka) starts to produce counterfeit money in his own run down print shop.', 'An overwhelmed family man (Bastian Pastewka) starts to produce counterfeit money in his own run down print shop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kokBaSCQLSBSUb62m1xLBpPvBR2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65134'),
  ('310735376525241281', 'Morgenmagazin', 1992, 'News, Talk', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJlCBcmAE4xvLGR1xFMMB3rd1GI.jpg', 34, 'tmdb:tv:37288'),
  ('359459965871542932', 'Moriarty the Patriot', 2020, 'Animation, Mystery', null, null, 'Soma Saito, Takuya Sato, Chiaki Kobayashi, Makoto Furukawa, Yuki Ono, Satoshi Hino, Yuto Uemura', 'TV-14', 'In the late 19th century, the British Empire nobility reigns while its working class suffers at their hands. Sympathetic to their plight, William James Moriarty wants to topple it all. Frustrated by the systemic inequity, Moriarty strategizes to fix the entire nation. Not even consulting detective Sherlock Holmes can stand in his way. It’s time for crime to revolutionize the world!', 'In the late 19th century, the British Empire nobility reigns while its working class suffers at their hands. Sympathetic to their plight, William James Moriarty wants to topple it all. Frustrated by the systemic inequity, Moriarty strategizes to fix the entire nation. Not even consulting detective Sherlock Holmes can stand in his way. It’s time for crime to revolutionize the world!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lLcmshfrLg7JUMwMCnp5fuNqtoQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100281'),
  ('933543466828695527', 'Moribito: Guardian of the Spirit', 2007, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Nahoko Uehashi', 'Kenji Kamiyama, Shoutarou Suga', 'Mabuki Ando, Naoto Adachi, Koji Tsujitani, Ako Mayama, Mayumi Asano, Yoshinari Kobayashi, Takkô Ishimori, Hirofumi Nojima', 'TV-PG', 'Balsa the spearwoman is a wandering warrior, who takes on the task of saving lives, in atonement for a past sin. On her journey, she happens to save a prince, and is tasked with becoming his bodyguard. And he is going to need one, for his own father, the emperor, wants him dead. Throughout the story, Balsa''s past will come to light and they will uncover mysteries about Chagum''s condition while developing a family-like relationship with each other and others.', 'Balsa the spearwoman is a wandering warrior, who takes on the task of saving lives, in atonement for a past sin. On her journey, she happens to save a prince, and is tasked with becoming his bodyguard. And he is going to need one, for his own father, the emperor, wants him dead. Throughout the story, Balsa''s past will come to light and they will uncover mysteries about Chagum''s condition while developing a family-like relationship with each other and others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1pJJbeDPqQ0XcOO3wLJr2ioXCln.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42830'),
  ('1003663480666511475', 'Moribito: Guardian of the Spirit', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Haruka Ayase, Mizuki Itagaki, Masahiro Higashide, Fumino Kimura, Kento Hayashi, Mitsuru Fukikoshi, Reiko Takashima, Tatsuya Fujiwara', null, 'The heroine Balsa is a skilled bodyguard and a masterful spear-wielder. One day she rescues Prince Chagum who has fallen into a river. The prince is carrying a mysterious spirit egg in his body, and is in danger of being assassinated by his father, the Mikado, who fears this will damage his imperial prestige. Balsa embarks upon a perilous journey when she accepts the queen’s plead to protect her son from her husband.', 'The heroine Balsa is a skilled bodyguard and a masterful spear-wielder. One day she rescues Prince Chagum who has fallen into a river. The prince is carrying a mysterious spirit egg in his body, and is in danger of being assassinated by his father, the Mikado, who fears this will damage his imperial prestige. Balsa embarks upon a perilous journey when she accepts the queen’s plead to protect her son from her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hKwuo8NhBwIvDyYRfFH09OMeJP.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:70934'),
  ('592865735104851128', 'Mork & Mindy', 1978, 'Comedy, Family', 'Garry Marshall', null, 'Robin Williams, Pam Dawber, Conrad Janis, Ralph James', 'TV-PG', 'A wacky alien comes to Earth to study its residents and the life of the human woman he boards with is never the same.', 'A wacky alien comes to Earth to study its residents and the life of the human woman he boards with is never the same.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzWJikslTFFeRloUNQmbAWbdU28.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2552'),
  ('493510463813005366', 'Morning Report', 1998, null, null, null, 'Millie Clode', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 13, 'tmdb:tv:35822'),
  ('489466726723674607', 'Morocco: Love in Times of War', 2017, 'Drama', null, null, 'Amaia Salamanca, Álex García, Verónica Sánchez, Álex Gadea, Vicente Romero Sánchez, Alicia Rubio, Anna Moliner, Cristóbal Suárez', 'TV-MA', 'Oblivious to the strife that awaits them, a group of young nurses from Spain''s upper class head to war-torn Marocco in 1921 to help where help is needed. Many lessons in love and life are learned before they overcome deepest conflicts, grow as human beings and find out what they really want from life and whom they truly love.', 'Oblivious to the strife that awaits them, a group of young nurses from Spain''s upper class head to war-torn Marocco in 1921 to help where help is needed. Many lessons in love and life are learned before they overcome deepest conflicts, grow as human beings and find out what they really want from life and whom they truly love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7oXwd9gm6126tawe0Rqz4cDTQL0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74013'),
  ('412043690728069666', 'Morran and Tobias', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Johan Rheborg, Robert Gustafsson', null, 'Johan Rheborg, Robert Gustafsson', null, 'Morran and her son Tobias is two people at the fringes of society. For 34 years, croft 9: 4 had been their home and security, but now the property expropriated by the municipality of Trosa and stands gaping empty. When we meet Morran and Tobias again, they have sold a small piece of land to the municipality and had the opportunity to move back in a month''s time. There are many emotions that torn up when the household goods will be extracted to the meeting with the old life in the house. Yet we encounter a profound warmth and love of these two unusual that have chosen to survive. With Johan Rheborg and Robert Gustafsson.', 'Morran and her son Tobias is two people at the fringes of society. For 34 years, croft 9: 4 had been their home and security, but now the property expropriated by the municipality of Trosa and stands gaping empty. When we meet Morran and Tobias again, they have sold a small piece of land to the municipality and had the opportunity to move back in a month''s time. There are many emotions that torn up when the household goods will be extracted to the meeting with the old life in the house. Yet we encounter a profound warmth and love of these two unusual that have chosen to survive. With Johan Rheborg and Robert Gustafsson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0mzgxumtdMAC4pN6Ga3MbvRvPK.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:62735'),
