  ('478413586030004246', 'Mortal Glitch', 2020, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Christian Moya', 'Jaime Zambrano, Nataly Valencia, Juan Aguilar', 'Antonella Valeriano, Erika Toa Russo, Antonio Harris, María Elena Mexia, Sebastian Ordoñez, Pablo Balseca, Cristian Cobos, Orlando Herrera', null, 'Mortal Glitch tells the story of a girl who feels that her destiny is much more of what she does now, but has to fight with the status quo in order to save the world. Through unique humor, and surprising storytelling the creators of enchufe.tv take the hero''s journey and give it a contemporary approach.', 'Mortal Glitch tells the story of a girl who feels that her destiny is much more of what she does now, but has to fight with the status quo in order to save the world. Through unique humor, and surprising storytelling the creators of enchufe.tv take the hero''s journey and give it a contemporary approach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yyL04v08CEm94Qb3IAaS1elcRhc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:108857'),
  ('708662399793545727', 'Mortal Kombat: Conquest', 1998, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Paolo Montalbán, Daniel Bernhardt, Kristanna Loken, Jeffrey Meek, Bruce Locke, Tracy Douglas, Kyle Wyatt', 'TV-PG', 'Kung Lao has triumphed in the Mortal Kombat tournament, defeating Shang Tsung and saving Earth Realm. Now, he must train a new generation of warriors for the next tournament. Meanwhile, an exiled Shang Tsung attempts to thwart Lao''s efforts with the aid of supernatural warriors such as Scorpion and Sub-Zero.', 'Kung Lao has triumphed in the Mortal Kombat tournament, defeating Shang Tsung and saving Earth Realm. Now, he must train a new generation of warriors for the next tournament. Meanwhile, an exiled Shang Tsung attempts to thwart Lao''s efforts with the aid of supernatural warriors such as Scorpion and Sub-Zero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4NvMgESPMT1Tl1qLP2TnNP4pcvX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:237'),
  ('169274181572863781', 'Mortal Kombat: Defenders of the Realm', 1996, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Clancy Brown, Olivia D''Abo, Dorian Harewood, Ron Perlman, Luke Perry, Cree Summer, Tod Thawley, Brian Tochi', 'TV-Y7', 'A group of warriors come together to defend Earthrealm from invaders who entered through portals from various other dimensions.', 'A group of warriors come together to defend Earthrealm from invaders who entered through portals from various other dimensions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mCOYi9wUyve3xbeEpYzvw9CF0N.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6212'),
  ('132286761413351234', 'Mortal Kombat: Legacy', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kevin Tancharoen, John Tobias, Oren Uziel', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'The first season of Mortal Kombat Legacy is a prequel to the original game, explaining the background stories of several characters from the series and demonstrating their reasons for participating in the upcoming tenth Mortal Kombat tournament on which the first game was based.', 'The first season of Mortal Kombat Legacy is a prequel to the original game, explaining the background stories of several characters from the series and demonstrating their reasons for participating in the upcoming tenth Mortal Kombat tournament on which the first game was based.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qeEg8XOPWp5V4v1zlcdbnFNl7n.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61579'),
  ('1028035322692334581', 'Mortel', 2019, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Crime, Drama', 'Frédéric Bélier-Garcia', null, 'Sami Outalbali, Manon Bresch, Némo Schiffman, Carl Malapa, Corentin Fila', 'TV-MA', 'Sofiane, Victor and Luisa, three seemingly incompatible teenagers find themselves bound together by a supernatural force.', 'Sofiane, Victor and Luisa, three seemingly incompatible teenagers find themselves bound together by a supernatural force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pl17VxY5BPKlWIGlUhFIGTKCKZ1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:94801'),
  ('349521737548051822', 'Mortified', 2006, 'Comedy, Kids, Family', 'Angela Webber', null, 'Marny Kennedy, Nicolas Dunn, Maia Mitchell, Luke Erceg, Dajana Cahill, Andrew Blackman, Rachel Blakely, Sally McKenzie', 'TV-Y7', 'Mortified was an Australian children''s television series, co-produced by the Australian Children''s Television Foundation and Enjoy Entertainment for the Nine Network Australia, Disney Australia and the BBC. The series premiered on 30 June 2006 and ended on 11 April 2007 with two seasons and a total of 26 episodes. Currently, re-runs air on both ABC and the Disney Channel, in the U.S. on Starz Kids and Family, and in the UK on Pop Girl.', 'Mortified was an Australian children''s television series, co-produced by the Australian Children''s Television Foundation and Enjoy Entertainment for the Nine Network Australia, Disney Australia and the BBC. The series premiered on 30 June 2006 and ended on 11 April 2007 with two seasons and a total of 26 episodes. Currently, re-runs air on both ABC and the Disney Channel, in the U.S. on Starz Kids and Family, and in the UK on Pop Girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w92ZGOCDqy5LAbxoXMFIVpIhJj1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:5257'),
  ('753931839922399041', 'Mortimer & Whitehouse: Gone Fishing', 2018, 'Comedy, Reality', null, null, 'Bob Mortimer, Paul Whitehouse', null, 'Comedians and lifelong friends Bob Mortimer and Paul Whitehouse share their personal and hilarious life experiences while travelling around the UK fishing for elusive species.', 'Comedians and lifelong friends Bob Mortimer and Paul Whitehouse share their personal and hilarious life experiences while travelling around the UK fishing for elusive species.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bRR3jfgOiwH01oQBY5MTMgHjRNn.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:80328'),
  ('609379049120998153', 'Mortina', 2025, 'Comedy, Animation', null, null, 'Emanuela Pacotto, Simone Marzola, Martina Tamburello, Matteo Liofredi, Richard Benitez, Daniela D''Angelo, Paolo Buglioni, Marcello Moronesi', null, 'Follow nine-year-old zombie girl Mortina and her "alive-alive" friends Nora and Leo, as well as her loyal dog Tragedy and cousin Dilbert. Set in the delightfully decaying Crumbling Manor, the self-proclaimed Mystery Squad solves strange and comical cases such as recovering books hidden by a mischievous tongue or searching for BroccoGloomy, a weird vegetable that makes you sprout dragonfly wings.', 'Follow nine-year-old zombie girl Mortina and her "alive-alive" friends Nora and Leo, as well as her loyal dog Tragedy and cousin Dilbert. Set in the delightfully decaying Crumbling Manor, the self-proclaimed Mystery Squad solves strange and comical cases such as recovering books hidden by a mischievous tongue or searching for BroccoGloomy, a weird vegetable that makes you sprout dragonfly wings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k204bUb40cBh52J41cPJvxU4pjG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:292621'),
  ('906735233121972913', 'Mosaic', 2018, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'Jennifer Ferrin, Frederick Weller, Paul Reubens, Sharon Stone, Garrett Hedlund, Jeremy Bobb, Maya Kazan, Beau Bridges', 'TV-MA', 'Explore the psychological underpinnings of love and murder in a small mountain resort town while following popular children’s book author and illustrator Olivia Lake, whose literary success makes her a local celebrity in the tight-knit community.', 'Explore the psychological underpinnings of love and murder in a small mountain resort town while following popular children’s book author and illustrator Olivia Lake, whose literary success makes her a local celebrity in the tight-knit community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kTmUn0TS1TW1hFB7IGwZDpwFWaS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75944'),
  ('811227699970211748', 'Moscow Noir', 2018, 'Drama, Crime', 'Piodor Gustafsson', null, 'Gediminas Storpirštis, Linda Zilliacus, Adam Pålsson, Brian McCardie, Karolina Gruszka, Christopher Wagelin, Georg Nikoloff', null, 'In turn-of-the-21st-century Moscow, an innocent trade plunges Swedish investment banker, Tom Blixen, into a battle with millionaires, politicians, oligarchs and their private armies.', 'In turn-of-the-21st-century Moscow, an innocent trade plunges Swedish investment banker, Tom Blixen, into a battle with millionaires, politicians, oligarchs and their private armies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cburCDD5cOmuPyltO8LsZT5Exwk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85192'),
  ('904970210330376610', 'Moses and the Ten Commandments', 2015, 'Drama, Soap, Mystery', 'Vivian de Oliveira', 'Alexandre Teixeira, Vivian de Oliveira, Joaquim Assis', 'Guilherme Winter, Giselle Itié, Dudu Azevedo, Daniel Alvim, Francisca Queiroz, Leonardo Vieira, Marcela Barrozo, Denise Del Vecchio', 'NR', 'The story begins in the city of Pi-Ramesses, in Egypt, at approximately 1300 B.C, when the powerful pharaoh Seti, orders the death of every male newborn in his hatred of the Hebrew people. Amidst the horrors of mass infanticide, one brave Hebrew family defies Pharaoh`s command and hides their child in a basket set afloat on the river Nile, trusting that God would carry him to safety.', 'The story begins in the city of Pi-Ramesses, in Egypt, at approximately 1300 B.C, when the powerful pharaoh Seti, orders the death of every male newborn in his hatred of the Hebrew people. Amidst the horrors of mass infanticide, one brave Hebrew family defies Pharaoh`s command and hides their child in a basket set afloat on the river Nile, trusting that God would carry him to safety.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQRLMWx39G3SBZSq8kVZ18bezBs.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:63109'),
  ('495235668429728608', 'Most Dangerous Game', 2020, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Nick Santora, Scott Elder, Josh Harmon', null, 'David Castañeda, Christoph Waltz', 'TV-MA', 'Desperate to take care of his pregnant wife before a terminal illness can take his life, Dodge Maynard accepts an offer to participate in a deadly game where he soon discovers that he’s not the hunter but the prey.', 'Desperate to take care of his pregnant wife before a terminal illness can take his life, Dodge Maynard accepts an offer to participate in a deadly game where he soon discovers that he’s not the hunter but the prey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/begeAFRPkHzrW05ZQXHrB9pqugt.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:90795'),
  ('502097142402030481', 'Most Haunted', 2002, 'Documentary, Mystery, Reality', 'Yvette Fielding, Karl Beattie', null, 'David Wells, Yvette Fielding, Derek Acorah, Jason Karnuth, Stuart Torevell, Jon Gilbert, Ciarán O''Keeffe, Iain Cash', null, 'Most Haunted is a British paranormal mystery documentary reality television series. The series was first shown on 25 May, 2002 and ended on 21 July, 2010. Led by Yvette Fielding, the programme investigated purported paranormal activity in many locations in the United Kingdom, Republic of Ireland and other countries. It was produced by Antix Productions and broadcast on the satellite and cable channels Living TV, Livingit, and Channel One. In the United States it was broadcast on the Travel Channel. It is now on Pluto TV with new episodes.', 'Most Haunted is a British paranormal mystery documentary reality television series. The series was first shown on 25 May, 2002 and ended on 21 July, 2010. Led by Yvette Fielding, the programme investigated purported paranormal activity in many locations in the United Kingdom, Republic of Ireland and other countries. It was produced by Antix Productions and broadcast on the satellite and cable channels Living TV, Livingit, and Channel One. In the United States it was broadcast on the Travel Channel. It is now on Pluto TV with new episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x5GYZMx8QM5y5ca6EdUIsCpyRJm.jpg', 24, 'tmdb:tv:462'),
  ('905097200794955990', 'Most Wanted – Wer entkommt?', 2025, 'Reality', null, null, 'Mirja du Mont, Janine Kunze, Markus Babbel, Tina Babbel, Jürgen Milski, René Casselly, Marc Eggers, Robert Brosowski', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jI0Q46TpeNaAHgDsO8NTbQduYte.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:290303'),
  ('202769351440785920', 'MOST!', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Jan Prušinovský, Petr Kolečko', null, 'Martin Hofmann, Michal Isteník, Zdeněk Godla, Cyril Drozda, Filip František Červenka, Magdalena Kozáková, Erika Stárková, Jitka Čvančarová', null, 'Divorced man Ludek is surprised when he reconnects with his brother after several years.', 'Divorced man Ludek is surprised when he reconnects with his brother after several years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQZX4bdLEpXIBJYmSxE1IKJWthj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85328'),
  ('353342782167744286', 'Mot i brøstet', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Tore Ryen', null, 'Arve Opsahl, Nils Vogt, Sven Nordin, Hilde Lyrån, Siw Anita Andersen', null, 'Follows Karl (Nils Vogt), economist and accountant, after he is fired from his job and subsequently divorced by his greedy wife. After being helped out by his former colleague, Nils (Sven Nordin) and a travelling salesman, Henry (Arve Opsahl), the three become roommates.', 'Follows Karl (Nils Vogt), economist and accountant, after he is fired from his job and subsequently divorced by his greedy wife. After being helped out by his former colleague, Nils (Sven Nordin) and a travelling salesman, Henry (Arve Opsahl), the three become roommates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWjJYWpxhvKcZQsX4trgw4tKxQx.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:12868'),
  ('242306003285368486', 'Motel California', 2025, 'Drama, Family', null, 'Lee Seo-youn', 'Na In-woo, Lee Se-young, Kim Tae-hyung, Choi Min-soo, Choi Hee-jin, Koo Ja-sung, Ji Soo-won, Woo Mi-hwa', null, 'A woman with a unique upbringing in a motel in the countryside leaves her hometown at 20 to pursue her career in Seoul. Twelve years later though, she returns home to heal her heart and experiences twists and turns as she reunites with her first love, a now eligible bachelor and veterinarian.', 'A woman with a unique upbringing in a motel in the countryside leaves her hometown at 20 to pursue her career in Seoul. Twelve years later though, she returns home to heal her heart and experiences twists and turns as she reunites with her first love, a now eligible bachelor and veterinarian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aFEIz6IuRc1aJTms22YKxx6548w.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:256725'),
  ('242815254090963134', 'Moterys meluoja geriau', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rolandas Skaisgirys', 'Aleksandras Makejevas, Evaldas Priudokas', null, null, 'Moterys meluoja geriau is a Lithuanian TV series produced by TV3. It is the most watched Lithuanian drama of all time. It is based on a novel by Daiva Vaitkevičiūtė. The series follows four young women and their love interests.', 'Moterys meluoja geriau is a Lithuanian TV series produced by TV3. It is the most watched Lithuanian drama of all time. It is based on a novel by Daiva Vaitkevičiūtė. The series follows four young women and their love interests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXv3Fv7TQE0UC7goU587M9CiMkt.jpg', 17, 'tmdb:tv:59804'),
  ('361914208800614343', 'Moteur de recherche', 2026, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1hZilMtDHDhpimW5vapjvngLtVK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317370'),
  ('706952639255629424', 'Mother', 2010, 'Drama, Family', null, 'Yuji Sakamoto', 'Yasuko Matsuyuki, Mana Ashida, Koji Yamamoto, Wakana Sakai, Kana Kurashina, Machiko Ono, Yôsuke Kawamura, Miwako Ichikawa', null, 'Yasuko Matsuyuki plays the part of Nao Suzuhara, an elementary school teacher. When she realizes that one of the female students is receiving abuse from her mother, Nao''s maternal instincts kick in, and she impulsively decides to bring the girl into her own care. Serving as a substitute mother, Nao takes the child on a trip from Hokkaido to Tokyo, and the two experience various events together along the way.', 'Yasuko Matsuyuki plays the part of Nao Suzuhara, an elementary school teacher. When she realizes that one of the female students is receiving abuse from her mother, Nao''s maternal instincts kick in, and she impulsively decides to bring the girl into her own care. Serving as a substitute mother, Nao takes the child on a trip from Hokkaido to Tokyo, and the two experience various events together along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJzMl1jW1WC8WOPTpiFc9KDGgcE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34633'),
  ('571757677799283397', 'Mother', 2016, 'Family, Drama', 'Fatih Aksoy', 'Deniz Gürlek, Melih Özyılmaz, Melek Seven', 'Cansu Dere, Vahide Perçin, Beren Gökyıldız, Gonca Vuslateri, Berkay Ateş, Gülenay Kalkan, Can Nergis, Alize Gördüm', null, 'A child being scolded rescued by her teacher after falsifying her death', 'A child being scolded rescued by her teacher after falsifying her death', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p5SrEMWe1UiETqy5QkwRrBFcyna.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68569'),
  ('932018465330618235', 'Mother', 2018, 'Drama', 'Chung Seo-kyung', 'Chung Seo-kyung', 'Lee Bo-young, Heo Yool, Ko Sung-hee, Son Suk-ku, Lee Jae-yoon, Lee Hye-young, Lee Jeong-yeol, Nam Kee-ae', null, 'A young girl named Hye-Na is abused by her mother, Ja-Young. Although she is not okay, she tells other people she is alright. Soo-Jin is a temporary teacher at the elementary school where Hye-Na attends. Soo-Jin is aware of her situation and decides to become her mother.', 'A young girl named Hye-Na is abused by her mother, Ja-Young. Although she is not okay, she tells other people she is alright. Soo-Jin is a temporary teacher at the elementary school where Hye-Na attends. Soo-Jin is aware of her situation and decides to become her mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjjZWS23ZawJ8OgpR3DbzfaWcI1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76092'),
  ('1047642150797665519', 'Mother Goose', 2015, 'Crime, Drama', 'Richard Holm', null, 'Alexandra Rapaport, Clara Christiansson Drake, Edvin Ryding, Joel Lützow, Ulf Friberg, Grynet Molvig, Shebly Niavarani, Christian Svensson', null, 'Sonja lives a rather carefree life with her beloved family. The husband Frederick''s marijuana business providing family finances a silver lining. But life is shattered and Sonja forced to play a dangerous game with both organized crime and police to protect their children. She can no longer be sure which ones are her friends and who she can trust.', 'Sonja lives a rather carefree life with her beloved family. The husband Frederick''s marijuana business providing family finances a silver lining. But life is shattered and Sonja forced to play a dangerous game with both organized crime and police to protect their children. She can no longer be sure which ones are her friends and who she can trust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gARM9OBR6AO9Ggxs5v5WCGfkzYs.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:64518'),
  ('698001549166657573', 'Mother Is Wrong', 2018, 'Drama', 'François Velle, Véronique Lecharpy', null, 'Camille Lou, Sophie Quinton, Emmanuel Bonami, Anne Charrier, Samuel Theis, Pascal Elbé, Sébastien Libessart, Gil Alma', null, 'Captain Marianne Aubrais is a detective with the Le Havre Police Department. Should she believe a child who tells her that his mother is not his mother? After all, she is busy investigating a robbery that happened months ago. Stolen goods worth hundreds of thousands of euros have not been recovered and two fugitives are still at large. But if the kid’s story is not pure fantasy, it would be truly criminal to ignore it. The little boy’s memories are fading. If he is telling the truth, will he never grow up to be the adult he should have become? Will he finally be forced to accept the unthinkable and allow himself to be raised by a woman who may have abducted him?', 'Captain Marianne Aubrais is a detective with the Le Havre Police Department. Should she believe a child who tells her that his mother is not his mother? After all, she is busy investigating a robbery that happened months ago. Stolen goods worth hundreds of thousands of euros have not been recovered and two fugitives are still at large. But if the kid’s story is not pure fantasy, it would be truly criminal to ignore it. The little boy’s memories are fading. If he is telling the truth, will he never grow up to be the adult he should have become? Will he finally be forced to accept the unthinkable and allow himself to be raised by a woman who may have abducted him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cP8XR2rfyTUwF78PENafJT2NbsC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79789'),
  ('851096852617608201', 'Mother of Mine', 2019, 'Family, Drama', 'Jo Jung-seon', 'Jo Jung-seon', 'Kim Hae-sook, Kim So-yeon, Hong Jong-hyun, Yu Seon, Kim Ha-kyung, Ki Tae-young, Choi Myung-gil, Lee Won-jae', null, 'Story of a mother and three daughters living in modern day Korean society. The drama conveys a message about the low fertility rate, divorce rate, and the problems of the younger generation who are avoiding marriage.', 'Story of a mother and three daughters living in modern day Korean society. The drama conveys a message about the low fertility rate, divorce rate, and the problems of the younger generation who are avoiding marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHedQeHh9B3owkAr78USZpK4POK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87615'),
  ('1118101881922614652', 'Mother of the Goddess'' Dormitory', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Misuzu Yamada, Asaki Fukuyama, Hikaru Nanjo, Ayaka Nanase, Chiaki Takahashi, Risako Murai, Yuki Yomichi', 'TV-MA', 'Down-on-his-luck Koushi Nagumo wanders the streets unemployed, homeless and in search of his next meal. His fortunes improve after a chance meeting with a vivacious young woman whose proposition seemingly solves nearly all his problems. Thanks to her, Koushi enters the welcoming halls of a dormitory at a women’s college… only this particular assignment is no stuffy, sleepy affair. The Goddess’ Dormitory is known for housing the college’s most unruly students! If he wants to keep a roof over his head, Koushi must become the “Dormitory Mother” charged with maintaining order and good discipline. But doing his job and keeping his sanity are no small feat with characters as endearingly eccentric and untamable as these!', 'Down-on-his-luck Koushi Nagumo wanders the streets unemployed, homeless and in search of his next meal. His fortunes improve after a chance meeting with a vivacious young woman whose proposition seemingly solves nearly all his problems. Thanks to her, Koushi enters the welcoming halls of a dormitory at a women’s college… only this particular assignment is no stuffy, sleepy affair. The Goddess’ Dormitory is known for housing the college’s most unruly students! If he wants to keep a roof over his head, Koushi must become the “Dormitory Mother” charged with maintaining order and good discipline. But doing his job and keeping his sanity are no small feat with characters as endearingly eccentric and untamable as these!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xT7qlkEjWBAyScZRp6ElGXccPJG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103962'),
  ('117450396719404055', 'MotherFatherSon', 2019, 'Drama', 'Tom Rob Smith', null, 'Richard Gere, Billy Howle, Helen McCrory, Niamh Algar, Rachel Sophia-Anthony', null, 'Max is a charismatic self-made American businessman with media outlets in London and around the world. When the self-destructive lifestyle of his 30 year-old son, Caden, spirals out of control, the devastating consequences threaten the future of the family, its empire, and a country on the brink of change.', 'Max is a charismatic self-made American businessman with media outlets in London and around the world. When the self-destructive lifestyle of his 30 year-old son, Caden, spirals out of control, the devastating consequences threaten the future of the family, its empire, and a country on the brink of change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wsWSrTKK913hMatfmDqgFrsHlxJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80058'),
  ('985348867279701097', 'Motherland', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Sharon Horgan, Graham Linehan, Holly Walsh', null, 'Anna Maxwell Martin, Diane Morgan, Paul Ready, Lucy Punch, Phillipa Dunne, Tanya Moodie', 'TV-MA', 'Sitcom about navigating the trials and traumas of middle-class motherhood, looking at the competitive and unromantic side of parenting.', 'Sitcom about navigating the trials and traumas of middle-class motherhood, looking at the competitive and unromantic side of parenting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7usotT9Vc3is9Hw3dLsnTzLDxP.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:67804'),
  ('856124831198450618', 'Motherland: Fort Salem', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Eliot Laurence', null, 'Taylor Hickson, Amalia Holm Bjelke, Ashley Nicole Williams, Lyne Renee, Jessica Sutton, Demetria McKinney, Tony Giroux, Catherine Lough Haggquist', 'TV-14', 'Set in an alternate America where witches ended their persecution over 300 years ago by cutting a deal with the government to fight for their country, the series follows three young women from basic training in combat magic into early deployment.', 'Set in an alternate America where witches ended their persecution over 300 years ago by cutting a deal with the government to fight for their country, the series follows three young women from basic training in combat magic into early deployment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s2dBDw3ns9rss51ikDtcINehMQM.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:91977'),
  ('407788760094612991', 'Motive', 2013, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Daniel Cerone', null, 'Kristin Lehman, Louis Ferreira, Brendan Penny, Lauren Holly', 'TV-14', 'A team of Vancouver investigators, led by homicide detective Angie Flynn, sets out to uncover the motive of each puzzling murder by discovering the killer''s connection to the victim. Viewers get a glimpse of the killer before and after the crime is committed.', 'A team of Vancouver investigators, led by homicide detective Angie Flynn, sets out to uncover the motive of each puzzling murder by discovering the killer''s connection to the victim. Viewers get a glimpse of the killer before and after the crime is committed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gA5mK6VO1tJ4DCGhmXEcsYetvqH.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:46316'),
  ('184134850145290334', 'MotoGP Unlimited', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Fabio Quartararo, Francesco Bagnaia, Joan Mir, Jack Miller, Marc Márquez, Maverick Viñales, Aleix Espargaró, Valentino Rossi', 'TV-Y7', 'The eight-episode series, filmed by The Mediapro Studio during the 2021 MotoGP™ season, followed the riders on and off the track. It features the stars during some spectacular highs, as well as some of the more difficult moments a MotoGP™ rider faces when dedicating your life to such a demanding sport.', 'The eight-episode series, filmed by The Mediapro Studio during the 2021 MotoGP™ season, followed the riders on and off the track. It features the stars during some spectacular highs, as well as some of the more difficult moments a MotoGP™ rider faces when dedicating your life to such a demanding sport.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZ5xcMGnyPXGVW1OLZnL3vp8dU4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157731'),
  ('486230815103992827', 'Motorheads', 2025, 'Drama', 'John A. Norris', null, 'Michael Cimino, Ryan Phillippe, Nathalie Kelley, Deacon Phillippe, Melissa Collazo, Nicolas Cantu, Uriah Shelton, Mia Healey', null, 'After moving to Ironwood, siblings Caitlyn and Zac Torres are drawn into a thrilling car culture where street racing reigns and high school status is all about your ride. Haunted by their father''s dark past, they join forces with loner Curtis and outcast Marcel to rebuild his legendary car.', 'After moving to Ironwood, siblings Caitlyn and Zac Torres are drawn into a thrilling car culture where street racing reigns and high school status is all about your ride. Haunted by their father''s dark past, they join forces with loner Curtis and outcast Marcel to rebuild his legendary car.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jglGmYMPEiHD7tVncvif7WtCOBJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:243954'),
