  ('396678480783158841', 'Mouse', 2021, 'Crime, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Lee Seung-gi, Lee Hee-jun, Park Ju-hyun, Kwon Hwa-woon, Gyeong Su-jin, Woo Ji-hyun, Jo Jae-yun, Kim Young-jae', 'TV-14', 'A psychopath''s ruthless serial murders have left the entire nation gripped with fear and chaos. A honest and justice-seeking rookie police officer and a veteran detective with tragic past, face against the killer. After the encounter with the psychopath, their lives totally change.', 'A psychopath''s ruthless serial murders have left the entire nation gripped with fear and chaos. A honest and justice-seeking rookie police officer and a veteran detective with tragic past, face against the killer. After the encounter with the psychopath, their lives totally change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qz0axqEwwIa5uaMsUYKGs9u29ut.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117378'),
