  ('535966960153695931', 'Mr Bates vs The Post Office', 2024, 'Drama', 'James Strong', null, 'Toby Jones, Julie Hesmondhalgh, Monica Dolan, Shaun Dooley, Ian Hart, Lia Williams, Will Mellor, Amy Nuttall', null, 'The story of one of the greatest miscarriages of justice in British legal history, where hundreds of innocent sub-postmasters and postmistresses were wrongly accused of theft, fraud and false accounting due to a defective IT system.', 'The story of one of the greatest miscarriages of justice in British legal history, where hundreds of innocent sub-postmasters and postmistresses were wrongly accused of theft, fraud and false accounting due to a defective IT system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQWIaSoMbuPxDBiAcCeQIn3NLZx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241100'),
