  ('74845856694040630', 'Mr Inbetween', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', 'Scott Ryan', null, 'Scott Ryan, Chika Yasumura, Brooke Satchwell, Jeremy Sims, Damon Herriman, Justin Rosniak', 'TV-MA', 'Ray Shoesmith is a father, ex-husband, boyfriend and best friend: tough roles to juggle in the modern age. Even harder when you’re a criminal for hire.', 'Ray Shoesmith is a father, ex-husband, boyfriend and best friend: tough roles to juggle in the modern age. Even harder when you’re a criminal for hire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1FkONly4j7hxi6Pz5CmuhRN1Ops.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:81358'),
  ('934288776082445567', 'Mr Love: Queen''s Choice', 2020, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Daisuke Hirakawa, Yuki Ono, Tomokazu Sugita, Tetsuya Kakihara, Hisako Kanemoto', 'TV-14', 'A girl inherits a company that is almost bankrupt from her late father. Lacking the funds, she must now become the producer herself in order to save the company from collapse. During her work, she meets four boys—financial expert Zen, the idol Kira, police officer Haku, and leading neuroscientist Simon—and is suddenly involved with the conspiracies and mysteries over the existence of special powers known as "Evol."', 'A girl inherits a company that is almost bankrupt from her late father. Lacking the funds, she must now become the producer herself in order to save the company from collapse. During her work, she meets four boys—financial expert Zen, the idol Kira, police officer Haku, and leading neuroscientist Simon—and is suddenly involved with the conspiracies and mysteries over the existence of special powers known as "Evol."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yD5qZROewqdFDD38y9wJrLbJjYU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:102285'),
  ('38900917360159471', 'Mr Loverman', 2024, 'Drama', null, null, 'Lennie James, Sharon D. Clarke', null, 'Londoner Barrington Jedidiah Walker, Barry to his mates, is a seventy-four-year-old, Antiguan-born, exuberant Hackney personality, renowned for his dapper taste and fondness for retro suits. Carmel, his wife of 50 years, senses that Barry has been cheating on her with other women. Little does she know what’s happening: a secret, passionate affair with his male best friend and soulmate, Morris. Now facing the final chapter of his life, Barry has big choices that will force his whole family to question their futures.', 'Londoner Barrington Jedidiah Walker, Barry to his mates, is a seventy-four-year-old, Antiguan-born, exuberant Hackney personality, renowned for his dapper taste and fondness for retro suits. Carmel, his wife of 50 years, senses that Barry has been cheating on her with other women. Little does she know what’s happening: a secret, passionate affair with his male best friend and soulmate, Morris. Now facing the final chapter of his life, Barry has big choices that will force his whole family to question their futures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6UuxprhNsGCD4ai7JSD81gD8EgN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:252133'),
  ('1087381571605178174', 'Mr Selfridge', 2013, 'Drama', 'Andrew Davies', null, 'Jeremy Piven, Ron Cook, Tom Goodman-Hill, Samuel West, Katherine Kelly, Trystan Gravelle, Amanda Abbington, Amy Beth Hayes', 'TV-14', 'Mr. Selfridge recounts the real life story of the flamboyant and visionary American founder of Selfridge''s, London''s lavish department store. Set in 1909 London, when women were reveling in a new sense of freedom and modernity, it follows Harry Gordon Selfridge (''Mile a Minute Harry''), a man with a mission to make shopping as thrilling as sex. Pioneering and reckless, with an almost manic energy, Harry created a theater of retail where any topic or trend that was new, exciting, entertaining - or just eccentric - was showcased.', 'Mr. Selfridge recounts the real life story of the flamboyant and visionary American founder of Selfridge''s, London''s lavish department store. Set in 1909 London, when women were reveling in a new sense of freedom and modernity, it follows Harry Gordon Selfridge (''Mile a Minute Harry''), a man with a mission to make shopping as thrilling as sex. Pioneering and reckless, with an almost manic energy, Harry created a theater of retail where any topic or trend that was new, exciting, entertaining - or just eccentric - was showcased.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pm4wMixNf5QPYQbdt0tnkbhmQvW.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:46643'),
  ('843308364189592218', 'Mr. & Mrs. Smith', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Donald Glover, Francesca Sloane', null, 'Donald Glover, Maya Erskine', 'TV-MA', 'Meet the Smiths: two lonely strangers, John and Jane, who have given up their lives and identities to be thrown together as partners – both in espionage and in marriage.', 'Meet the Smiths: two lonely strangers, John and Jane, who have given up their lives and identities to be thrown together as partners – both in espionage and in marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kvJvGxsDLi3MmHzc9nregyJtOWY.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:118642'),
  ('708686072724984329', 'Mr. Bad', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Chen Zheyuan, Shen Yue, Luo Mingjie, Qu Jingjing, Dong Xuan, Shao Feng, Zhao Simei', null, 'A young girl, Nan Xing, who loves to write, accidentally summons the villain Xiao Wud from the novel she wrote when she makes a wish. The clever and cunning Xiao Wudi, who just came to this world, threatened Nan Xing to allow him to stay in the apartment next to hers. They then start on their love-hate relationship and daily lives that one would never find mundane.', 'A young girl, Nan Xing, who loves to write, accidentally summons the villain Xiao Wud from the novel she wrote when she makes a wish. The clever and cunning Xiao Wudi, who just came to this world, threatened Nan Xing to allow him to stay in the apartment next to hers. They then start on their love-hate relationship and daily lives that one would never find mundane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yyIzL3aZ8SqGIrzAeySYqyxIMSq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210732'),
  ('63488350242908299', 'Mr. Bean', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Richard Curtis, Rowan Atkinson', null, 'Rowan Atkinson', 'TV-PG', 'Mr Bean turns simple everyday tasks into chaotic situations and will leave you in stitches as he creates havoc wherever he goes.', 'Mr Bean turns simple everyday tasks into chaotic situations and will leave you in stitches as he creates havoc wherever he goes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pUNQV35kDaKuejnXGNiUeEBurNE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4327'),
  ('687980379735192261', 'Mr. Bean: The Animated Series', 2002, 'Kids, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Richard Curtis, Rowan Atkinson', null, 'Rowan Atkinson, Sally Grace, Matilda Ziegler', 'TV-G', 'The animated daily trials and tribulations of clueless yet clever loner Mr Bean (aided by his best friend Teddy of course!) as he stumbles from one mishap to the next, always finding complex solutions to the simplest of problems.', 'The animated daily trials and tribulations of clueless yet clever loner Mr Bean (aided by his best friend Teddy of course!) as he stumbles from one mishap to the next, always finding complex solutions to the simplest of problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1V2PSez4pNZ9a4Bbomm7KZiQJ44.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:2530'),
  ('553609080086780852', 'Mr. Belvedere', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Gwen Davenport', null, 'Christopher Hewett, Bob Uecker, Ilene Graff, Rob Stone, Tracy Wells, Brice Beckham', null, 'Mr. Belvedere takes a job as a housekeeper with an American family headed by George Owens.', 'Mr. Belvedere takes a job as a housekeeper with an American family headed by George Owens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vcEBQK5HgkWShxIluKt00nZKfA3.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:437'),
  ('788029575287578878', 'Mr. Benn', 1971, 'Kids, Animation', 'David McKee', 'David McKee', 'Ray Brooks', null, 'Popular British children''s animation series. Mr Benn is the ordinary, bowler-hatted office worker who lives in the ordinary suburban street of Festive Road. However, when he tries on a costume in a mysterious shop, he steps out of the changing room into a different time and place, appropriate to his apparel. His adventures include him being a spaceman, a pirate and a cowboy.', 'Popular British children''s animation series. Mr Benn is the ordinary, bowler-hatted office worker who lives in the ordinary suburban street of Festive Road. However, when he tries on a costume in a mysterious shop, he steps out of the changing room into a different time and place, appropriate to his apparel. His adventures include him being a spaceman, a pirate and a cowboy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nANWXSZ5KHXsTHhJbvNbGpnVo8B.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34870'),
  ('505925781663790664', 'Mr. Bigstuff', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Ryan Sampson', null, 'Ryan Sampson, Danny Dyer', null, 'Glen and his fiancée share a perfect, perfectly mundane life together. Sure, Glen''s got crippling erectile dysfunction and Kirsty has a secret shoplifting habit, but they''re happy. That is until his brother Lee comes crashing into their lives, whilst on the run from a past that''s quickly catching up with him. The trio are forced together: a perfectionist, a fantasist and an anarchist all living under the same roof in an Essex cul-de-sac. It''s not long before their ''perfect'' lives start to unravel faster than a cheap carpet.', 'Glen and his fiancée share a perfect, perfectly mundane life together. Sure, Glen''s got crippling erectile dysfunction and Kirsty has a secret shoplifting habit, but they''re happy. That is until his brother Lee comes crashing into their lives, whilst on the run from a past that''s quickly catching up with him. The trio are forced together: a perfectionist, a fantasist and an anarchist all living under the same roof in an Essex cul-de-sac. It''s not long before their ''perfect'' lives start to unravel faster than a cheap carpet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nOoOiQbIIdSbUpj6wvs7E85ZyVT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:241268'),
  ('113251505361407525', 'Mr. Birchum', 2024, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Adam Carolla', null, 'Adam Carolla, Megyn Kelly, Tyler Fischer, Alonzo Bodden, Brett Cooper, Candace Owens, Kyle Dunnigan, Danny Trejo', null, 'Mr. Birchum attempts to navigate a world he doesn''t comprehend. He''s confused by his gaming streamer son, Eddie, annoyed at his selfie-taking, students and is constantly at war with the school district''s appointed "J.E.D.I." Mr. Karponzi.', 'Mr. Birchum attempts to navigate a world he doesn''t comprehend. He''s confused by his gaming streamer son, Eddie, annoyed at his selfie-taking, students and is constantly at war with the school district''s appointed "J.E.D.I." Mr. Karponzi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aXxQ0VEUXkz8VuAGzRarhAq4pm5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:240689'),
  ('534592114514041882', 'Mr. Cinderella', 2021, 'Drama', 'Hồ Sĩ Hậu', null, 'Nguyễn Bá Vinh, Trương Minh Thảo, Mai Vũ Luân, Tuấn Việt, Kan Vũ', null, 'Mr. Cinderella tells the story of Dung and Khoa. When Dung was a child, he used to be close and liked a little girl, he often called her "his cinderella" but then the girl moved house and Dung lost contact since then. Later, as an adult, Dung became a chef for a small restaurant, but then lost his job and was chased by a gang, and was fortunately saved by Doctor Khoa in a blood-soaked state. At this time, Dung accidentally discovered that Khoa was the "Cinderella" that he liked in his childhood. Will Dung overcome the thought barrier to come to Khoa''s side? And did the appearance of Huynh - Khoa''s ex-lover cause this relationship to fall apart?', 'Mr. Cinderella tells the story of Dung and Khoa. When Dung was a child, he used to be close and liked a little girl, he often called her "his cinderella" but then the girl moved house and Dung lost contact since then. Later, as an adult, Dung became a chef for a small restaurant, but then lost his job and was chased by a gang, and was fortunately saved by Doctor Khoa in a blood-soaked state. At this time, Dung accidentally discovered that Khoa was the "Cinderella" that he liked in his childhood. Will Dung overcome the thought barrier to come to Khoa''s side? And did the appearance of Huynh - Khoa''s ex-lover cause this relationship to fall apart?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9y0dtGLAEUeaNh81nonzAdJ3YVf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:139660'),
  ('695449331144565896', 'Mr. Corman', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Joseph Gordon-Levitt', null, 'Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Arturo Castro', 'TV-MA', 'With better luck, better choices, better posture... Josh Corman could’ve been a rock star. Now he teaches fifth grade, and though he loves his students, he still struggles to find happiness and meaning in a world that sometimes feels short on both.', 'With better luck, better choices, better posture... Josh Corman could’ve been a rock star. Now he teaches fifth grade, and though he loves his students, he still struggles to find happiness and meaning in a world that sometimes feels short on both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iF1Pcvb65NscURXjjEQEDxvYysM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:124897'),
  ('969211526942406496', 'Mr. D', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Gerry Dee, Michael Volpe', null, 'Gerry Dee, Jonathan Torrens, Darrin Rose, Lauren Hammersley, Bette MacDonald, Naomi Snieckus, Suresh John, Mark Little', 'TV-PG', 'Based on Gerry Dee''s real-life experiences as a high school teacher before he switched to comedy full-time, MR. D is a story about a charming, under-qualified teacher trying to fake his way through a teaching job, just like he often fakes his way through life.', 'Based on Gerry Dee''s real-life experiences as a high school teacher before he switched to comedy full-time, MR. D is a story about a charming, under-qualified teacher trying to fake his way through a teaching job, just like he often fakes his way through life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/XhBWi3V3Hi0Mwu3ctXVXQgv2OX.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:42382'),
  ('249004836887702065', 'Mr. Frank Visser doet Uitspraak', 2016, 'Reality', null, null, 'Viktor Brand, Frank Visser', 'NR', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJQuJgH5Rj8NJXd78C3jziecFt1.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:68711'),
  ('414703142481148957', 'Mr. Good: Cop or Crook?', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Eirik Jensen', null, 'In this riveting docuseries, when Norway''s top cop is suspected of drug trafficking, investigators must ask: Is he a good officer or a major criminal?', 'In this riveting docuseries, when Norway''s top cop is suspected of drug trafficking, investigators must ask: Is he a good officer or a major criminal?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7OYbHyrJymDL8DutHCuSj2pFFv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:202065'),
  ('505029271604119021', 'Mr. Heart', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Cheon Seung-ho, Han Se-jin, Lara, Yoo Jang-young, Park Geon-Rak', null, 'Jin-won cares about one thing only: running. When he finds himself in a slump, his coach suggests Sang-ha as a pacemaker. Though Sang-ha''s efforts are initially ignored, they find themselves growing closer and closer over time.', 'Jin-won cares about one thing only: running. When he finds himself in a slump, his coach suggests Sang-ha as a pacemaker. Though Sang-ha''s efforts are initially ignored, they find themselves growing closer and closer over time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQGWjLclOYq6L1Gp1UNkMBT0DoW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107692'),
  ('824062746460236941', 'Mr. Hiiragi''s Homeroom', 2019, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Masaki Suda, Mei Nagano, Mio Imada, Ryota Katayose, Moka Kamishiraishi, Nana Mori, Seiichi Tanabe, Rina Kawaei', null, 'With graduation 10 days away, homeroom teacher Hiiragi gathered all 29 students of class 3-A and proclaims them his hostages. His last lesson regards the death of a student that passed away a few months before. Nobody will be able to graduate until the truth is known.', 'With graduation 10 days away, homeroom teacher Hiiragi gathered all 29 students of class 3-A and proclaims them his hostages. His last lesson regards the death of a student that passed away a few months before. Nobody will be able to graduate until the truth is known.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nzEJMNAWj1HO8yM62tlZD5pmeiV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85529'),
  ('254384424164873113', 'Mr. Housework', 2019, 'Comedy, Family, Reality', null, null, 'Wei Daxun, Li Dan, Du Chun, Li Wenhan, Tang Jiuzhou, Wu Dajing, Ba Tu, 魏绍林', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dF6H1FmvxEcuUdgJ2QKSd3nWCh9.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:108897'),
  ('1006289407706185190', 'Mr. Iglesias', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Kevin Hench', null, 'Gabriel Iglesias, Jacob Vargas, Sherri Shepherd, Richard Gant, Cree Cicchino, Maggie Geha, Gloria Aung, Tucker Albrizzi', 'TV-14', 'Hilarious high school teacher Gabriel Iglesias tries to make a difference in the lives of some smart but underperforming students at his alma mater.', 'Hilarious high school teacher Gabriel Iglesias tries to make a difference in the lives of some smart but underperforming students at his alma mater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRLuPKk3hKD5fiZGi5WGNdssox8.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:88378'),
  ('27634757635348234', 'Mr. Kinpachi in Class 3B', 1979, 'Drama', null, null, 'Tetsuya Takeda, Mari Hoshino, Yasuomi Sano, Masayuki Suzuki, Junpei Morita, Akio Kaneda, Atsuko Takahata, Ginnojo Yamazaki', null, 'A legendary television series and cultural asset, Mr. Kinpachi in Class 3B is famous for putting many social issues on the front burner of the public conscious over its long run, as filtered through the emotionally volatile lives of third year middle school students. The heartfelt relations between a devoted schoolteacher, Kinpachi Sakamoto, and his unique students have won the show high praise for several decades. Whether due to the pressures of exams, family relations, teachers and friends, graduating middle school students navigate a turbulent hormonal sea of “hope” and “frustration”, constantly shaped by the social environment of the times. Standing as a beacon in the storm and emitting messages of hope for each generation is one Japanese teacher, Kinpachi Sakamoto, who has come to be adored and admired by a nation through the adventures of Class 3B.', 'A legendary television series and cultural asset, Mr. Kinpachi in Class 3B is famous for putting many social issues on the front burner of the public conscious over its long run, as filtered through the emotionally volatile lives of third year middle school students. The heartfelt relations between a devoted schoolteacher, Kinpachi Sakamoto, and his unique students have won the show high praise for several decades. Whether due to the pressures of exams, family relations, teachers and friends, graduating middle school students navigate a turbulent hormonal sea of “hope” and “frustration”, constantly shaped by the social environment of the times. Standing as a beacon in the storm and emitting messages of hope for each generation is one Japanese teacher, Kinpachi Sakamoto, who has come to be adored and admired by a nation through the adventures of Class 3B.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/llq3XNHOtNrv5QbBsCVRRLncwWf.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:13285'),
  ('1058542457358087124', 'Mr. Lucky', 1959, 'Drama', 'Blake Edwards', null, 'Ross Martin, John Vivyan, Tom Brown', null, 'Mr. Lucky is a CBS adventure/drama television series that aired from October 24, 1959, to June 18, 1960, with repeats until September 3. Blake Edwards developed the program as a retooling of his Willie Dante character from Four Star Playhouse, where the role was played by studio boss Dick Powell. In the 1960–1961 season, Howard Duff assumed the role of Willie Dante in the NBC adventure/drama series Dante. Mr. Edwards directed and co-wrote the first episode of Mr. Lucky, and the credits of the first eighteen episodes included "Entire production supervised by Blake Edwards." Jack Arnold produced the show and directed fifteen of the thirty-four episodes. Henry Mancini''s smooth theme music for the show reached Number 21 in the US singles charts. He released two successful LP''s based on the show, Mr. Lucky and Mr. Lucky Goes Latin.', 'Mr. Lucky is a CBS adventure/drama television series that aired from October 24, 1959, to June 18, 1960, with repeats until September 3. Blake Edwards developed the program as a retooling of his Willie Dante character from Four Star Playhouse, where the role was played by studio boss Dick Powell. In the 1960–1961 season, Howard Duff assumed the role of Willie Dante in the NBC adventure/drama series Dante. Mr. Edwards directed and co-wrote the first episode of Mr. Lucky, and the credits of the first eighteen episodes included "Entire production supervised by Blake Edwards." Jack Arnold produced the show and directed fifteen of the thirty-four episodes. Henry Mancini''s smooth theme music for the show reached Number 21 in the US singles charts. He released two successful LP''s based on the show, Mr. Lucky and Mr. Lucky Goes Latin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4JkOtbbap3wFsX7l4GEjeOlJiXW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1829'),
  ('738863551086242281', 'Mr. Mayor', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Tina Fey, Robert Carlock', null, 'Ted Danson, Holly Hunter, Vella Lovell, Mike Cabellon, Kyla Kenedy, Bobby Moynihan', 'TV-14', 'A retired businessman runs for mayor of Los Angeles to prove he''s "still got it." Once he wins, he has to figure out what he stands for, gain the respect of his biggest critic and connect with his teenage daughter, all while trying to get anything right for America''s second weirdest city.', 'A retired businessman runs for mayor of Los Angeles to prove he''s "still got it." Once he wins, he has to figure out what he stands for, gain the respect of his biggest critic and connect with his teenage daughter, all while trying to get anything right for America''s second weirdest city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPAaoNJWbRkF7s0f3tPbVehiBgT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:113477'),
  ('97422174411877542', 'Mr. McMahon', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Chris Smith', null, 'Vince McMahon, Dwayne Johnson, John Cena, Hulk Hogan, Steve Austin, Paul Levesque, Eric Bischoff, Bret Hart', 'TV-MA', 'WWE experienced record-breaking highs and crushing lows under Vince McMahon''s leadership. This docuseries delves into the mogul''s controversial reign.', 'WWE experienced record-breaking highs and crushing lows under Vince McMahon''s leadership. This docuseries delves into the mogul''s controversial reign.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtLYsALvuHlnw7PHg0frCCwSRVy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:263089'),
  ('4530438989687167', 'Mr. Meaty', 2006, 'Kids, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jamie Shannon, Jason Hopley', null, null, 'TV-Y7', 'Mr. Meaty is an American/Canadian television series, airing on CBC Television in Canada and the Nicktoons Network in the United States. It originally began in 2004, as a series of interstitial shorts that aired on Nickelodeon. It features the voices of Jamie Shannon, Jason Hopley, Marty Stelnick, and Todd Doldersum. The show is about two lazy teenage boys named Josh and Parker working at a fast food restaurant called Mr. Meaty located inside the Scaunchboro Mall. The program ran from September 22, 2006 until May 23, 2009 when production was subsequently cancelled due to poor reviews and low ratings and is now officially out of sydnication.', 'Mr. Meaty is an American/Canadian television series, airing on CBC Television in Canada and the Nicktoons Network in the United States. It originally began in 2004, as a series of interstitial shorts that aired on Nickelodeon. It features the voices of Jamie Shannon, Jason Hopley, Marty Stelnick, and Todd Doldersum. The show is about two lazy teenage boys named Josh and Parker working at a fast food restaurant called Mr. Meaty located inside the Scaunchboro Mall. The program ran from September 22, 2006 until May 23, 2009 when production was subsequently cancelled due to poor reviews and low ratings and is now officially out of sydnication.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ZnEvkwmcFBxStWVnpzp764RVox.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:682'),
  ('467140015833275298', 'Mr. Mercedes', 2017, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'David E. Kelley', null, 'Brendan Gleeson, Jharrel Jerome, Holland Taylor, Breeda Wool, Justine Lupe, Maximiliano Hernández, Gabriel Ebert, Rarmian Newton', 'TV-MA', 'A demented serial killer taunts a retired police detective with a series of lurid letters and emails, forcing the ex-cop to undertake a private, and potentially felonious, crusade to bring the killer to justice before he can strike again.', 'A demented serial killer taunts a retired police detective with a series of lurid letters and emails, forcing the ex-cop to undertake a private, and potentially felonious, crusade to bring the killer to justice before he can strike again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zZm3LidCf6Edv6yX3WMKo6KwICg.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:70485'),
  ('1078443483268428203', 'Mr. Midnight: Beware the Monsters', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Idan Aedan, Chen Yixin, Caleb Monk, Nikki Dekker, Lim Yu-Beng, Maxime Bouttier', 'TV-PG', 'A once-average teen and his friends become paranormal detective and document their adventures in an online blog under the pseudonym “Mr. Midnight.”', 'A once-average teen and his friends become paranormal detective and document their adventures in an online blog under the pseudonym “Mr. Midnight.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88Qguo88OKruv5REalqQAyf0jLS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:212284'),
  ('409446827316314444', 'Mr. Mikami''s Classroom', 2025, 'Drama', 'Yohei Miyazaki, Sakura Komaki', null, 'Tori Matsuzaka, Riho Yoshioka, Masaki Okada, Aju Makita, Daiken Okudaira, Airu Kubozuka, Sakura Kiryu, Yudai Toyoda', null, 'Takashi Mikami, a University of Tokyo graduate, joins the Ministry of Education to reform Japan''s education but is disillusioned by its reality. Transferred to a private high school, he takes a stand against the authorities, using his role as a teacher to push for change.', 'Takashi Mikami, a University of Tokyo graduate, joins the Ministry of Education to reform Japan''s education but is disillusioned by its reality. Transferred to a private high school, he takes a stand against the authorities, using his role as a teacher to push for change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4DL1npho9wGUQV2EsISW7GufaN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:279044'),
  ('93691084228244225', 'Mr. Nobunaga''s Young Bride', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Koudai Sakai, Akari Uehara, Ari Ozawa, Konomi Yuzaki, Marika Tanaka, Moe Toyota, Suzuna Kinoshita', 'TV-MA', 'Nobunaga was a teacher who was waiting for that kind of dating sim event to happen in real life. One day, a 14 year old girl named Kicho appears in front of him, saying that she''s his wife?! Apparently she came from the Warring States era and seems to have mistaken Nobunaga for the Oda Nobunaga and tells him that she wants to have his children. An age-gap love comedy featuring a teacher with a dating sims brain and a princess with a warring states era brain!!', 'Nobunaga was a teacher who was waiting for that kind of dating sim event to happen in real life. One day, a 14 year old girl named Kicho appears in front of him, saying that she''s his wife?! Apparently she came from the Warring States era and seems to have mistaken Nobunaga for the Oda Nobunaga and tells him that she wants to have his children. An age-gap love comedy featuring a teacher with a dating sims brain and a princess with a warring states era brain!!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOLj9HLvk11RZ80tHIB8XHkWnXX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87476'),
  ('907547029986563438', 'Mr. Novak', 1963, 'Drama', 'E. Jack Neuman, Boris Sagal', null, 'James Franciscus, Dean Jagger, Bill Zuckert, Peter Hansen, Sandy Millar, Phyllis Avery, Vince Howard', null, 'Mr. Novak is an American dramatic series starring James Franciscus in the title role, which aired on NBC for two seasons, from 1963 to 1965.', 'Mr. Novak is an American dramatic series starring James Franciscus in the title role, which aired on NBC for two seasons, from 1963 to 1965.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/70JM7KslaQEuR82eAbiykGgtjDH.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:14086'),
