  ('814160472133784524', 'Mrs. Fazilet and Her Daughters', 2017, 'Drama, Family', 'Gökçen Usta, Günay Günaydın', 'Sırma Yanık', 'Nazan Kesal, Deniz Baysal, Çağlar Ertuğrul, Mahir Günşiray, Tolga Güleç, Hazal Türesan, Afra Saraçoğlu, İdris Nebi Taşkan', 'NR', 'The story of Fazilet, mother of Hazan and Ece, eager to make money using the modeling skills of her younger daughter, Ece. While Hazan pursues a career as a coach in sports, far from her mother''s wishes and falls in love with a rich spoiled man.', 'The story of Fazilet, mother of Hazan and Ece, eager to make money using the modeling skills of her younger daughter, Ece. While Hazan pursues a career as a coach in sports, far from her mother''s wishes and falls in love with a rich spoiled man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJe1m8eKqb14xE0ers6dAZm1QrS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:76560'),
  ('444935062763432858', 'Mrs. Fletcher', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tom Perrotta', null, 'Kathryn Hahn, Jackson White, Owen Teague, Cameron Boyce, Domenick Lombardozzi, Casey Wilson, Jen Richards, April Schutte', 'TV-MA', 'Empty nest divorcée Eve Fletcher reinvents her life to find the happiness and sexual fulfillment that’s eluded her, and her college freshman son Brendan.', 'Empty nest divorcée Eve Fletcher reinvents her life to find the happiness and sexual fulfillment that’s eluded her, and her college freshman son Brendan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8FVRHydZgQ09S4ANvhy1dQyI7A4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81879'),
  ('74569033631175502', 'Mrs. Pepper Pot', 1983, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Alf Prøysen', 'Reiko Seno, Sumi Shimamoto, Yo Inoue, Joji Yanami, Daisuke Gori, Eiko Taira, Hiroko Maruyama, Kazuhiko Inoue', null, 'Mrs. Pepper Pot lives in a small village with her husband, and enjoys a unique life because she has a small magic spoon that helps her reduce her size, and during that, Mrs. Pepper Pot embarks on a series of adventures during which she communicates with animals easily.', 'Mrs. Pepper Pot lives in a small village with her husband, and enjoys a unique life because she has a small magic spoon that helps her reduce her size, and during that, Mrs. Pepper Pot embarks on a series of adventures during which she communicates with animals easily.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iNriQC7e0MPUjwlBRjkQ1nOubNk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37798'),
  ('904752313113199009', 'Ms Fisher''s Modern Murder Mysteries', 2019, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Deb Cox, Fiona Eagger', null, 'Geraldine Hakewill, Joel Jackson, Catherine McClements, Toby Truslove, Louisa Mignone, Greg Stone, Katie Robertson', null, 'In swinging 60’s Melbourne, gorgeously reckless Peregrine Fisher inherits a windfall when the famous aunt she never knew goes missing over the highlands of New Guinea. Peregrine must prove herself brilliant enough to become a world class private detective in her own right.', 'In swinging 60’s Melbourne, gorgeously reckless Peregrine Fisher inherits a windfall when the famous aunt she never knew goes missing over the highlands of New Guinea. Peregrine must prove herself brilliant enough to become a world class private detective in her own right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o7iLddzdaTdCjTRz72qSvVQ5Djj.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:86847'),
  ('84255748010956045', 'Ms. Incognito', 2025, 'Crime, Drama', 'Park Yoo-young, Hyun Gyu-ri', 'Hyun Gyu-ri', 'Jeon Yeo-been, Jung Jin-young, Seo Hyun-woo, Jang Yoon-ju, Joo Hyun-young, Moon Sung-keun, Seo Jae-hee, Kim Jae-hwa', null, 'A bodyguard hides in a village as a kindergarten teacher to avoid her boss'' enemies – but faces a new challenge in a skeptical strawberry farmer!', 'A bodyguard hides in a village as a kindergarten teacher to avoid her boss'' enemies – but faces a new challenge in a skeptical strawberry farmer!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jG0hr4bvJM1iOEcScgav7zmMF5P.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:275593'),
  ('748981730417779373', 'Ms. Koizumi Loves Ramen Noodles', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Ayana Taketatsu, Ayane Sakura, Akari Kito, Yumi Hara', null, 'Koizumi is a mysterious and attractive high school student. But what most people don''t know about her is that she''s a ramen master who is always on the lookout for great ramen restaurants. Everyday, she goes hunting for real-life places serving the best ramen dishes and delightfully eats the delicious noodles. The way Koizumi downs a giant bowl of ramen–more adeptly than any large man–will amaze and delight you!', 'Koizumi is a mysterious and attractive high school student. But what most people don''t know about her is that she''s a ramen master who is always on the lookout for great ramen restaurants. Everyday, she goes hunting for real-life places serving the best ramen dishes and delightfully eats the delicious noodles. The way Koizumi downs a giant bowl of ramen–more adeptly than any large man–will amaze and delight you!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sg1vYwdCLBrBrcwwQIWwFD52qlX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75793'),
  ('461262710882691171', 'Ms. Marvel', 2022, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Bisha K. Ali', 'Aisha Bhoori, Kate Gritmon', 'Iman Vellani, Matt Lintz, Yasmeen Fletcher, Zenobia Shroff, Mohan Kapur, Saagar Shaikh, Rish Shah', 'TV-14', 'A great student, avid gamer, and voracious fan-fic scribe, Kamala Khan has a special affinity for superheroes, particularly Captain Marvel. However, she struggles to fit in at home and at school — that is, until she gets superpowers like the heroes she’s always looked up to. Life is easier with superpowers, right?', 'A great student, avid gamer, and voracious fan-fic scribe, Kamala Khan has a special affinity for superheroes, particularly Captain Marvel. However, she struggles to fit in at home and at school — that is, until she gets superpowers like the heroes she’s always looked up to. Life is easier with superpowers, right?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3HWWh92kZbD7odwJX7nKmXNZsYo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92782'),
  ('503679123918491339', 'Ms. Sweet', 2019, 'Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Elena Podkaminskaya, Vasilina Yuskovets, Aleksandr Pankratov-Chyornyy, Dmitry Lysenkov, Kseniya Teplova, Danila Dunaev, Aleksandr Konstantinov, Elena Valyushkina', null, 'Vera''s life was like a fairy tale with a loving husband, smart and beautiful daughter, caring father, and her favorite hobby, baking desserts. When her husband cheats on her with her young neighbor, she decides to leave him and turn her baking hobby into a business.', 'Vera''s life was like a fairy tale with a loving husband, smart and beautiful daughter, caring father, and her favorite hobby, baking desserts. When her husband cheats on her with her young neighbor, she decides to leave him and turn her baking hobby into a business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dBqlrehZmfmR2imjoYXGYBtKnou.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:86936'),
  ('239224534637127787', 'Ms. Temper & Nam Jung Gi', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kang Eun-kyung', 'Joo Hyun, Lim Hye-min', 'Lee Yo-won, Yoon Sang-hyun, Hwang Chan-sung, Im Ha-ryong, Son Jong-hak, Song Jae-hee, You Chea-myung, Kim Sun-young', null, 'Ok Da-Jung is the youngest team leader in the cosmetics industry. She has divorced three times so far. She doesn''t care what others think about her and she also has quite a temper. Nam Jung-Gi works as a section chief at the same cosmetics company as Ok Da-Jung. Unlike her, Nam Jung-Gi has a timid and nice personality. He can''t say anything that makes others uncomfortable. He is able to make Ok Da-Jung''s blood boil.', 'Ok Da-Jung is the youngest team leader in the cosmetics industry. She has divorced three times so far. She doesn''t care what others think about her and she also has quite a temper. Nam Jung-Gi works as a section chief at the same cosmetics company as Ok Da-Jung. Unlike her, Nam Jung-Gi has a timid and nice personality. He can''t say anything that makes others uncomfortable. He is able to make Ok Da-Jung''s blood boil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/muBaNgGA4UpYB7c7kf3mMOd4PHB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65831'),
  ('1086564013963484332', 'Ms. Vampire Who Lives in My Neighborhood.', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Miyu Tomita, Rina Hidaka, Yu Sasahara, Lynn, Aya Uchida', 'TV-14', 'The modern-day vampire comedy centers on high school girl Amano, who was saved from a strange incident by a vampire girl named Sophie Twilight, and has been interested in her ever since. Akari arrives at her house uninvited and the two start to live together. Although a vampire, Sophie never attacks humans, but purchases blood and anime goods via mail and lives a modern life.', 'The modern-day vampire comedy centers on high school girl Amano, who was saved from a strange incident by a vampire girl named Sophie Twilight, and has been interested in her ever since. Akari arrives at her house uninvited and the two start to live together. Although a vampire, Sophie never attacks humans, but purchases blood and anime goods via mail and lives a modern life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/An76xFiqgurA6rYDU5j0bvQZxyH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82736'),
