  ('120057973260230785', 'Multifaceted', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ahmed Wael, Amr El Daly', 'Ahmed Wael, Amr El-Dali', 'Nelly Karim, Asser Yassin, Islam Ibrahim, Zeinab Ghareeb, Donia Maher, Sherif Desouqy, Ola Roshdy, Mostafa Darwish', 'TV-PG', 'Sokkar is a professional swindler who gets outdone by Omar, another swindler. As she enters into a series of conflicts to get her money back from him, she eventually decides to unite with him to carry out bigger defrauding operations.', 'Sokkar is a professional swindler who gets outdone by Omar, another swindler. As she enters into a series of conflicts to get her money back from him, she eventually decides to unite with him to carry out bigger defrauding operations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8b71MXGLxXhr5ddUI76fH9A3Y1m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:102376'),
  ('829884064174816065', 'Mum', 2016, 'Comedy', null, 'Stefan Golaszewski', 'Lesley Manville, Peter Mullan, Sam Swainsbury, Lisa McGrillis, Dorothy Atkinson, Karl Johnson, Ross Boatman, Marlene Sidaway', 'TV-PG', 'A comedy about a mother at a milestone in her life. We follow her and her family through a year of new beginnings as she rebuilds her life following the death of her husband. Mum is joined by her supportive life-long friend Michael. Through a year of new beginnings she rebuilds her life surrounded by her family: son Jason and his girlfriend Kelly; her brother Derek and his new partner, Pauline; and her in-laws.', 'A comedy about a mother at a milestone in her life. We follow her and her family through a year of new beginnings as she rebuilds her life following the death of her husband. Mum is joined by her supportive life-long friend Michael. Through a year of new beginnings she rebuilds her life surrounded by her family: son Jason and his girlfriend Kelly; her brother Derek and his new partner, Pauline; and her in-laws.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRaRhHi7pwPJkiNkVhwRK7RKA9n.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:66372'),
  ('271469742494834066', 'Mumbai Diaries', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Nikkhil Advani', null, 'Mohit Raina, Konkona Sen Sharma, Shreya Dhanwanthary, Satyajeet Dubey, Natasha Bharadwaj, Mrunmayee Deshpande, Tina Desai, Prakash Belawadi', null, 'A medical thriller set in the Emergency Room of a government hospital. The series explores the challenges faced by the medical staff at the hospital as well as other first responders across the city of Mumbai in dealing with a crisis of immense magnitude. In this battle to save lives and heal others, the ones doing the fixing are the most broken.', 'A medical thriller set in the Emergency Room of a government hospital. The series explores the challenges faced by the medical staff at the hospital as well as other first responders across the city of Mumbai in dealing with a crisis of immense magnitude. In this battle to save lives and heal others, the ones doing the fixing are the most broken.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDZXjtO3i1WpePWmg7paVKNpdfz.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:115466'),
  ('105248884559618353', 'Mummies Alive!', 1997, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Seth Kearsley', null, 'Bill Switzer, Dale Wilson, Scott McNeil, Cree Summer, Pauline Newstone, David Kaye, Ian James Corlett, Matt Hill', 'TV-Y7', 'Mummies Alive follows the exploits of four Egyptian warriors brought back to life to protect and serve the reborn spirit of a young Pharaoh, but fitting into our modern world proves to be just as challenging!', 'Mummies Alive follows the exploits of four Egyptian warriors brought back to life to protect and serve the reborn spirit of a young Pharaoh, but fitting into our modern world proves to be just as challenging!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g1Vaitb2Z5Lxwg4EjM1OV77TqT9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6279'),
  ('219228206669578890', 'Mundo da Lua', 1991, 'Comedy, Kids', 'Flávio de Souza', null, 'Luciano Amaral, Antônio Fagundes, Mira Haar, Mayana Blum, Gianfrancesco Guarnieri, Anna D''Lira, Teodoro Haar de Souza, Lucinha Lins', null, 'The show features Lucas Silva e Silva, a boy who earns a recorder from his paternal grandfather, Orlando, at the age of 10. Amid the typical problems of moving from childhood to adolescence, Lucas creates stories on the tape recorder from how he would like things to be. He lives at his grandfather''s house with his parents, Rogerio, a teacher who works out for three jobs and Carolina, who works in a boutique; the older sister, Juliana; and maid Rosa, who dates Marcelo and talks to broadcaster Ney Nunes on her radio.', 'The show features Lucas Silva e Silva, a boy who earns a recorder from his paternal grandfather, Orlando, at the age of 10. Amid the typical problems of moving from childhood to adolescence, Lucas creates stories on the tape recorder from how he would like things to be. He lives at his grandfather''s house with his parents, Rogerio, a teacher who works out for three jobs and Carolina, who works in a boutique; the older sister, Juliana; and maid Rosa, who dates Marcelo and talks to broadcaster Ney Nunes on her radio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9XMXjb6LglmiarHI6D99bnmDuI3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65302'),
  ('622336535995013268', 'Mundo de Juguete', 1974, 'Soap, Drama', 'Abel Santacruz', null, 'Ricardo Blume, Sara García, Evita Muñoz ''Chachita'', Irán Eory, Irma Lozano, Graciela Mauri, Gloria Marín, Enrique Rocha', null, 'Mundo de Juguete is a telenovela produced in Mexico by Televisa in 1974. It is a remake of telenovela Papá Corazón. This telenovela holds the record for having the second longest run ever for a Latin American telenovela, with a total of 605 episodes. Most telenovelas run for an average of six to eight months; the shortest ones run about four months, and the longest up to a year. Many "Mundo de Juguete" fans believe that either all or some of the tapes and film from the telenovela were lost when Televisa collapsed during the 1985 earthquake. Televisa has been secretive regarding which tapes were lost during that earthquake, so there is no way of confirming this. However, such claims can be disputed, considering that the Telenovela has been repeated on television several times after 1985. During the nineties, it was repeated on Mexico City Canal 9. For a period of time, it was also shown on Unicable or on Telenovelas Televisa remade the telenovela in 2000, and called it "Carita de Angel".', 'Mundo de Juguete is a telenovela produced in Mexico by Televisa in 1974. It is a remake of telenovela Papá Corazón. This telenovela holds the record for having the second longest run ever for a Latin American telenovela, with a total of 605 episodes. Most telenovelas run for an average of six to eight months; the shortest ones run about four months, and the longest up to a year. Many "Mundo de Juguete" fans believe that either all or some of the tapes and film from the telenovela were lost when Televisa collapsed during the 1985 earthquake. Televisa has been secretive regarding which tapes were lost during that earthquake, so there is no way of confirming this. However, such claims can be disputed, considering that the Telenovela has been repeated on television several times after 1985. During the nineties, it was repeated on Mexico City Canal 9. For a period of time, it was also shown on Unicable or on Telenovelas Televisa remade the telenovela in 2000, and called it "Carita de Angel".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d6NYldLmO1sSzZMeRrOLsF3v3Oj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12800'),
  ('1039642428594424081', 'Mundo Pocoyó', 2010, 'Animation', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fmVirx3fksEGZRPSRLJtgjuWRzR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:54896'),
  ('729344176566288421', 'Munich Games', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Michal Aviram', 'Michal Aviram, Martin Behnke', 'Seyneb Saleh, Yousef Sweid, Sebastian Rudolph, Doval''e Glickman, Roger Azar', null, '50 years after the Munich Massacre, Munich is hosting a soccer game between an Israeli and a German football club. When things start to fall apart, it seems history might be repeating all over again.', '50 years after the Munich Massacre, Munich is hosting a soccer game between an Israeli and a German football club. When things start to fall apart, it seems history might be repeating all over again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a5YoYR5OJ5tDS2FggwEgo2DsHl8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156315'),
  ('498585032281381998', 'Munkkivuori', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Jani Volanen', null, 'Vilho Rönkkönen, Hugo Komaro, Krista Kosonen, Hannu-Pekka Björkman', null, 'In early 1980s a young child disappears. The lack of police support pushes the concerned parents to take justice into their own hands and launch a desperate manhunt that is seen from the perspective of the local children.', 'In early 1980s a young child disappears. The lack of police support pushes the concerned parents to take justice into their own hands and launch a desperate manhunt that is seen from the perspective of the local children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hjh6BQK0Xj79RyKGjClvMRclbFR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:213076'),
  ('193047883967372408', 'Muppet Babies', 1984, 'Animation, Kids', 'Jim Henson, Jeffrey Scott', null, 'Frank Welker, Laurie O''Brien, Russi Taylor, Greg Berg, Dave Coulier, Katie Leigh, Barbara Billingsley', 'TV-Y', 'The Muppet Babies (Kermit, Piggy, Gonzo, Fozzy and company) live in a large nursery watched over by Nanny. The babies have active imaginations, and often embark upon adventures into imaginary worlds.', 'The Muppet Babies (Kermit, Piggy, Gonzo, Fozzy and company) live in a large nursery watched over by Nanny. The babies have active imaginations, and often embark upon adventures into imaginary worlds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJc14qy42hABKKWlQwEguFdeTdU.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:565'),
  ('434300230960543318', 'Muppet Babies', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Kids', null, null, 'Jenny Slate, Dee Bradley Baker, Eric Bauza, Matt Danner, Jessica DiCicco, Ben Diskin, Melanie Harrison', 'TV-Y', 'The reimagined playroom antics and wacky adventures of the young Kermit the Frog, Piggy, Fozzie Bear, Gonzo, Animal, Summer Penguin, and Miss Nanny.', 'The reimagined playroom antics and wacky adventures of the young Kermit the Frog, Piggy, Fozzie Bear, Gonzo, Animal, Summer Penguin, and Miss Nanny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKO39v4anUjh73s9NIIRp8HKlqm.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:77410'),
  ('600923000347585518', 'Muppets Now', 2020, 'Comedy, Family', 'Jim Henson', null, 'Julianne Buescher, Mike Quinn, Dave Goelz, Eric Jacobson, David Rudman, Bill Barretta, Peter Linz, Matt Vogel', 'TV-PG', 'Scooter rushes to make his delivery deadlines and upload the brand-new Muppets series for streaming. They are due now, and he’ll need to navigate whatever obstacles, distractions, and complications the rest of the Muppet gang throw at him.', 'Scooter rushes to make his delivery deadlines and upload the brand-new Muppets series for streaming. They are due now, and he’ll need to navigate whatever obstacles, distractions, and complications the rest of the Muppet gang throw at him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vLVG99uRkETkMQkh5tN82S1CByI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92824'),
  ('778436129440563989', 'Muppets Tonight', 1996, 'Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Kevin Clash, Steve Whitmire, Frank Oz, Dave Goelz, Brian Henson, Bill Barretta, Leslie Carrara-Rudolph, Jerry Nelson', null, 'Muppets Tonight is a live-action/puppet television series created by Jim Henson Productions and featuring The Muppets. Much like the "MuppeTelevision" segment of The Jim Henson Hour, Muppets Tonight was a continuation of The Muppet Show, set in a television studio, rather than a theater. It ran on ABC from 1996 to 1998 and reruns ran on Disney Channel from 1997 to 2002. As of 2013, it is the last television series to star The Muppets characters.', 'Muppets Tonight is a live-action/puppet television series created by Jim Henson Productions and featuring The Muppets. Much like the "MuppeTelevision" segment of The Jim Henson Hour, Muppets Tonight was a continuation of The Muppet Show, set in a television studio, rather than a theater. It ran on ABC from 1996 to 1998 and reruns ran on Disney Channel from 1997 to 2002. As of 2013, it is the last television series to star The Muppets characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bm9R1dRm6PBZGIsfZupVAPSXOyG.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:6575'),
  ('558252124453709341', 'Murdaugh Murders: A Southern Scandal', 2023, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Shocking tragedies shatter a tight-knit South Carolina community and expose the horrifying secrets of its most powerful family.', 'Shocking tragedies shatter a tight-knit South Carolina community and expose the horrifying secrets of its most powerful family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/so8k0YprvHS2eFT3lMqB1PokjAS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:218530'),
  ('1060388389361492741', 'Murdaugh Murders: Deadly Dynasty', 2022, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', null, null, null, null, 'The powerful Murdaugh family has held sway over the South Carolina “low country” for a century—until now. Alleged murder, corruption, and deception are revealed. Meanwhile Alex Murdaugh, 4th generation of the legal dynasty, stands accused of enough financial crimes to sentence him to more than 700 years in prison…and the saga continues.', 'The powerful Murdaugh family has held sway over the South Carolina “low country” for a century—until now. Alleged murder, corruption, and deception are revealed. Meanwhile Alex Murdaugh, 4th generation of the legal dynasty, stands accused of enough financial crimes to sentence him to more than 700 years in prison…and the saga continues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gNoW1zrSB7Jp2Kh0hvxrnlGDKF0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:202884'),
  ('1059909335050295833', 'Murdaugh: Death in the Family', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Michael D. Fuller, Erin Lee Carr', null, 'Patricia Arquette, Jason Clarke, J. Smith-Cameron, Will Harrison, Johnny Berchtold, Brittany Snow, Noah Emmerich, Kathleen Wilhoite', 'TV-MA', 'Maggie and Alex enjoy a lavish life of privilege as members of one of South Carolina''s most powerful legal dynasties. But when their son Paul is involved in a deadly boat crash, the family is faced with a test unlike any they''ve ever encountered. As details come to light and new challenges emerge, the family''s connections to several mysterious deaths raise questions which threaten everything Maggie and Alex hold dear.', 'Maggie and Alex enjoy a lavish life of privilege as members of one of South Carolina''s most powerful legal dynasties. But when their son Paul is involved in a deadly boat crash, the family is faced with a test unlike any they''ve ever encountered. As details come to light and new challenges emerge, the family''s connections to several mysterious deaths raise questions which threaten everything Maggie and Alex hold dear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fqNT4hsPdA0999NEMuLVeja4Cm2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:270734'),
  ('40148296198711906', 'Murder Among the Mormons', 2021, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Jared Hess, Tyler Measom', null, 'Richard E. Turley Jr., Dorie Hofmann Olds, Brent Metcalfe, Rod Decker, Al Rust, Michael George, Gerry D''Elia, Brent Ashworth', 'TV-14', 'High-stakes exploits turn deadly — and shake a global church to its core — in this extraordinary true crime story.', 'High-stakes exploits turn deadly — and shake a global church to its core — in this extraordinary true crime story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l38W4H1oeuJiAi5ZCVokjwMAdyh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:119337'),
  ('408904985282962768', 'Murder at the Cottage: The Search for Justice for Sophie', 2021, 'Crime, Documentary', 'Jim Sheridan, Michael Sheridan', 'Michael Sheridan, Jim Sheridan', 'Jim Sheridan, Sophie Toscan du Plantier', null, 'A five part Sky Original documentary series that will look into the unsolved case of Sophie Toscan du Plantier who was brutally murdered in West Cork in 1996. Using original evidence, never-before-seen footage and interviews with those closest to the case, including Sophie’s family and key suspect Ian Bailey, the series aims to unravel the unsolved case that has haunted West Cork for decades.', 'A five part Sky Original documentary series that will look into the unsolved case of Sophie Toscan du Plantier who was brutally murdered in West Cork in 1996. Using original evidence, never-before-seen footage and interviews with those closest to the case, including Sophie’s family and key suspect Ian Bailey, the series aims to unravel the unsolved case that has haunted West Cork for decades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQALUVBqCCndu4wkO0ha6LCWKZo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127914'),
  ('762921457514122328', 'Murder Before Evensong', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery', 'David Moore', null, 'Matthew Lewis, Amanda Redman, Amit Shah, Adam James, Meghan Treadway, Alexander Delamain, Marion Bailey, Amanda Hadingue', null, 'In 1980s England, Canon Daniel Clement, the Rector of Champton, finds himself unexpectedly entangled in a murder case when a dead body turns up in the church. When Daniel announces a plan to modernize the church, the parish is suddenly divided. And then a body is found dead at the back of the church. As the police move in and the bodies start piling up, Daniel is the only one who can try and keep his fractured community together... and catch a killer.', 'In 1980s England, Canon Daniel Clement, the Rector of Champton, finds himself unexpectedly entangled in a murder case when a dead body turns up in the church. When Daniel announces a plan to modernize the church, the parish is suddenly divided. And then a body is found dead at the back of the church. As the police move in and the bodies start piling up, Daniel is the only one who can try and keep his fractured community together... and catch a killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xn7TFZnR9U2KpJovIg5F1WZ1qs2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:280571'),
  ('107285601716662535', 'Murder by the Lake', 2014, 'Crime', null, null, 'Matthias Koeberlin, Hary Prinz, Stefan Pohl', 'TV-PG', 'Murder by the Lake is a German-Austrian TV crime series that has been produced since 2014 by Rowboat Film- und Fernsehproduktion and Graf Filmproduktion in cooperation with the German television broadcaster ZDF and the Austrian television broadcaster ORF. The series is filmed and set in the adjacent towns of Bregenz, Austria, and Lindau, Germany, which are both located on the southeastern shore of Lake Constance.', 'Murder by the Lake is a German-Austrian TV crime series that has been produced since 2014 by Rowboat Film- und Fernsehproduktion and Graf Filmproduktion in cooperation with the German television broadcaster ZDF and the Austrian television broadcaster ORF. The series is filmed and set in the adjacent towns of Bregenz, Austria, and Lindau, Germany, which are both located on the southeastern shore of Lake Constance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jlpWx4vqnu4wI0wONU6YnZm0naT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81238'),
  ('1010173656163613797', 'Murder Calls', 2017, 'Crime, Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Base line reenactments of people being murdered while being on the phone with 911 services.', 'Base line reenactments of people being murdered while being on the phone with 911 services.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9cjNmdufrN06Z6HtpftZ6uf5Pkb.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:69888'),
  ('926342519157728223', 'Murder Comes To Town', 2014, 'Crime, Documentary', null, null, 'Anthony D. Call', 'TV-14', 'A world of true crime with an authentic Americana tone, style and attitude. Each episode brings a gripping tale of betrayal and murder, told by friends, family and neighbors. It''s stories of crime from America''s heartland.', 'A world of true crime with an authentic Americana tone, style and attitude. Each episode brings a gripping tale of betrayal and murder, told by friends, family and neighbors. It''s stories of crime from America''s heartland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sDnMDxgsy0a5MxX1Ck9uU9HO3et.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:70582'),
  ('884004263244730268', 'Murder Drones', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Liam Vickers', 'Liam Vickers', 'Elsie Lovelock, Michael Kovach, Nola Klop, Shara Kirby, Allanah Fitzgerald, David J. Dixon, Sean Chiplock, Emma Breezy', null, 'A heart warming story of "destroy all humans." Uzi, a sardonic teen worker robot gone rogue befriends N, an excitable optimistic disassembly drone sent to destroy her, creating what we can assume is a very bad relationship for mankind.', 'A heart warming story of "destroy all humans." Uzi, a sardonic teen worker robot gone rogue befriends N, an excitable optimistic disassembly drone sent to destroy her, creating what we can assume is a very bad relationship for mankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z6fAKaN2F9jogQIdcHUHNVsiFNV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:291212'),
  ('500604517895909184', 'Murder in a Small Town', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', 'Ian Weir', null, 'Rossif Sutherland, Kristin Kreuk, Aaron Douglas, Savonna Spracklin, Bethany Brown', 'TV-14', 'Karl Alberg moves to a quiet coastal town to soothe a psyche that has been battered by big-city police work but finds himself needing to call upon all his skills to solve the murders that continue to wash up on his shore.', 'Karl Alberg moves to a quiet coastal town to soothe a psyche that has been battered by big-city police work but finds himself needing to call upon all his skills to solve the murders that continue to wash up on his shore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8rdmK4vSIhNDQAtbamEFL2kLhG.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:241549');
