  ('661531533517240131', 'My Engineer', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Patpasit Na Songkhla, Kritsanapong Soonthornchatchawet, Talay Sanguandikul, Nakhun Screaigh, Naphat Chalermphonphakdee, Ryan Peng, Nutchapol Cheevapanyaroj, Nutthapong Phibunthanakiet', null, 'Bon, a popular engineering student, begins a revenge plan involving Duen, a naive medical freshman, but their growing connection blooms alongside daily rose exchanges.', 'Bon, a popular engineering student, begins a revenge plan involving Duen, a naive medical freshman, but their growing connection blooms alongside daily rose exchanges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dozoAf1s02ydSQZjJIwHmIqScJW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96478'),
  ('653732327856236042', 'My Fair Lady', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Yoon Eun-kyung, Kim Seon-soo', 'Yoon Eun-hye, Yoon Sang-hyun, Jung Il-woo, Moon Chae-won, Kim Young-kwang, Jang Ah-young, Lee Jeong-kil, Kwon Yul', null, 'Of the high-rolling top ''hot celebrities'' of the wealthy upper class in Korea''s high society, Kang Hye Na is the one desired by the men, feared and hated by the women. Being the only successor to the largest conglomerate company, Kang San Group, Kang Hye Na has both the looks and the background. She is the owner of the ''Lady Castle'' and lives a ''princess-like'' life with her servants.', 'Of the high-rolling top ''hot celebrities'' of the wealthy upper class in Korea''s high society, Kang Hye Na is the one desired by the men, feared and hated by the women. Being the only successor to the largest conglomerate company, Kang San Group, Kang Hye Na has both the looks and the background. She is the owner of the ''Lady Castle'' and lives a ''princess-like'' life with her servants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtXVWcLZAwyjvytlzdfw1bbgBQa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21544'),
  ('438761163517548658', 'My Fair Nanny', 2004, 'Comedy, Family', 'Peter Marc Jacobson, Fran Drescher', 'Fran Drescher, Peter Marc Jacobson, Richard Vaczy', 'Anastasiya Zavorotnyuk, Sergey Zhigunov, Boris Smolkin, Olga Prokofeva, Irina Andreeva, Pavel Serdyuk, Ekaterina Dubakina, Aleksandr Filippenko', 'NR', 'My Fair Nanny is a Russian comedy television series based on the American television sitcom, The Nanny.', 'My Fair Nanny is a Russian comedy television series based on the American television sitcom, The Nanny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMqoJeUrhB1AfJne6c5X83kRMri.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:33123'),
