  ('549999403465071857', 'Nadia: The Secret of Blue Water', 1990, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Family', null, null, 'Noriko Hidaka, Yoshino Takamori, Toshiharu Sakurai, Yuko Mizutani, Kumiko Takizawa, Kenyu Horiuchi, Akio Otsuka, Motomu Kiyokawa', 'TV-14', 'In mankind''s grasp for the future, a sinister foe known only as Gargoyle begins his plans to take over the world. Nadia, with the help of a young inventor, Jean Ratlique, and Captain Nemo of the submarine Nautilus, must fight to save the world from Gargoyle and Neo-Atlantis.', 'In mankind''s grasp for the future, a sinister foe known only as Gargoyle begins his plans to take over the world. Nadia, with the help of a young inventor, Jean Ratlique, and Captain Nemo of the submarine Nautilus, must fight to save the world from Gargoyle and Neo-Atlantis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRucHR87gd3ZwvIP0V1IlEiLMzM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:24710'),
