  ('142915074586051739', 'Najica Blitz Tactics', 2001, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yumi Touma, Rei Sakuma, Natsuko Kuwatani, Sanae Kobayashi, Unsho Ishizuka, Ai Orikasa, Iemasa Kayumi, Juri Ihata', null, 'Najica, perfumer and secret agent, is sent out on a number of recovery missions to round up rogue androids with combat abilities. Najica is assigned an android partner, Lila, whom Najica is to groom as an agent and receive assistance from along the way.', 'Najica, perfumer and secret agent, is sent out on a number of recovery missions to round up rogue androids with combat abilities. Najica is assigned an android partner, Lila, whom Najica is to groom as an agent and receive assistance from along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwYQv2nqVbAbs9lpsgDV9SU2kCq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34768'),
  ('468946099653729772', 'Nak', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Atitaya Tribudarak, Jirayu La-ongmanee, Rudklao Amratisha, Chawinroj Likitchareonsakul, Panupan Jantanawong, Thongchai Thongkanthom, Thitinan Khlangphet, Dechathon Wasurat', null, 'Based on a Thai legend, it tells the unearthly love story between Mak and his wife Nak who died in childbirth while her husband was at war and nevertheless remained around with her child both as ghosts. When Mak returns home, he finds his wife and child seemingly well.', 'Based on a Thai legend, it tells the unearthly love story between Mak and his wife Nak who died in childbirth while her husband was at war and nevertheless remained around with her child both as ghosts. When Mak returns home, he finds his wife and child seemingly well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ySkUsK3znbofE2lbz3ePTqfxiwp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218446'),
  ('366134733658116574', 'Nakaimo: My Little Sister Is Among Them!', 2012, 'Drama, Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Arisa Noto, Rikiya Koyama, Aya Hisakawa, Takahiro Sakurai, Rina Hidaka, Kaori Ishihara, Asuka Ohgame, Ayako Kawasumi', 'TV-MA', 'Is insanity hereditary? Shougo Mikadono''s beginning to think so, because the terms of his late father''s will seem crazy and following them may drive Shougo bonkers as well. Oh, it sounds simple at first: before Shougo can claim his VERY large inheritance, he just has to start attending a certain new school and find a nice girl to marry. It''s a little unromantic, but perfectly do-able, right? After all, all the girls seem quite friendly, so all Shougo has to do is find one he has something in common with. Except, and here''s the kicker, it turns out that Shougo has WAY too much in common with one of them, because she''s actually his long-lost sister! And he has no idea which one she is! Will Shougo meet and court his Miss Right without committing something very morally wrong? Can he find his future bride without slipping into the wrong set of genes? And if his little sister does reveal herself, just how much will be revealed and under what circumstances?', 'Is insanity hereditary? Shougo Mikadono''s beginning to think so, because the terms of his late father''s will seem crazy and following them may drive Shougo bonkers as well. Oh, it sounds simple at first: before Shougo can claim his VERY large inheritance, he just has to start attending a certain new school and find a nice girl to marry. It''s a little unromantic, but perfectly do-able, right? After all, all the girls seem quite friendly, so all Shougo has to do is find one he has something in common with. Except, and here''s the kicker, it turns out that Shougo has WAY too much in common with one of them, because she''s actually his long-lost sister! And he has no idea which one she is! Will Shougo meet and court his Miss Right without committing something very morally wrong? Can he find his future bride without slipping into the wrong set of genes? And if his little sister does reveal herself, just how much will be revealed and under what circumstances?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7U5YwTl88pUb5lr9xecPfPIc1S.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45277'),
  ('374554793463061409', 'Naked', 2020, 'Drama', 'Merve Göntem, Can Evrenol', 'Merve Göntem, Can Evrenol, Merve Göntem', 'Müge Bayramoğlu, Taro Emir Tekin, İpek Erdem, Selin Dumlugöl, Berçem Koç, Bora Ecer, Dila Yağcı, Umut Kurt', null, 'Eylül lives with her grandmother and earns her living by escort. All she wants is to save enough money, move to Wales and create a new life there. One night she is summoned to a bachelor party of a group...', 'Eylül lives with her grandmother and earns her living by escort. All she wants is to save enough money, move to Wales and create a new life there. One night she is summoned to a bachelor party of a group...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Yq5dXQFheq1iH8uIPjc2kb3qxc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:104690'),
  ('165004485251205894', 'Naked and Afraid', 2013, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'What happens when you put two complete strangers - sans clothes - in some of the most extreme environments on Earth? Each male-female duo is left with no food, no water, no clothes, and only one survival item each as they attempt to survive on their own.', 'What happens when you put two complete strangers - sans clothes - in some of the most extreme environments on Earth? Each male-female duo is left with no food, no water, no clothes, and only one survival item each as they attempt to survive on their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nDXJn6wEIQ6AfaWbt1APNQmyswU.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:58832'),
  ('34783668519598712', 'Naked and Afraid of Love', 2021, 'Reality', null, null, 'Candice Xiao Liang, Bennett Murphy, Lauren Bonner, Brittany Whitmire, Nelson Dashing Monroig, Michael Dietrich, Rachel Strohl', null, '8 single women and 8 single men -- attempt to find true love while working together to survive the elements and each other, in an unforgettable island paradise.', '8 single women and 8 single men -- attempt to find true love while working together to survive the elements and each other, in an unforgettable island paradise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h28Dth11vc1iyeXdjTuRYhd0nfg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130385'),
  ('215737426051016079', 'Naked and Afraid XL', 2015, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'A group of the best survival experts in the world take on an un-survivable situation: 40 days. 40 nights. No food, water or clothes. To survive they''ll need to master the environment, pushing far beyond the breaking point. Will even one be able to finish?', 'A group of the best survival experts in the world take on an un-survivable situation: 40 days. 40 nights. No food, water or clothes. To survive they''ll need to master the environment, pushing far beyond the breaking point. Will even one be able to finish?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6vQ5dHyFPq3rfJnVC45fQO0JhPb.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:63451'),
  ('40591620654523', 'Naked and Marooned with Ed Stafford', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Ed Stafford', null, 'Ed Stafford', 'TV-14', 'Ed Stafford undertakes an extreme survival challenge as he washes up naked and alone on a desert island, Olorua, south east of Fiji. He has only his brain, bare hands and a camera to keep him alive. He''ll take no food, water, clothes, knife or tools, so from the moment he arrives he is on a race to stay alive. As man can only last three days without water and three weeks without food, Ed will attempt to survive on the island physically and mentally, for 60 days.', 'Ed Stafford undertakes an extreme survival challenge as he washes up naked and alone on a desert island, Olorua, south east of Fiji. He has only his brain, bare hands and a camera to keep him alive. He''ll take no food, water, clothes, knife or tools, so from the moment he arrives he is on a race to stay alive. As man can only last three days without water and three weeks without food, Ed will attempt to survive on the island physically and mentally, for 60 days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4bGanbS0wnWaFLIaskymAczvMQy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46837'),
  ('1110000740737818539', 'Naked Attraction', 2016, 'Reality', null, null, 'Anna Richardson', 'TV-MA', 'The show looks at whether a partner can be found based solely on the naked body and animal magnetism. Two singletons join host Anna Richardson as they seek to choose a date from a selection of six naked people, who will be revealed to them one body part at a time. They then get dressed and head off on a date, to see if there is any chemistry when the clothes come on.', 'The show looks at whether a partner can be found based solely on the naked body and animal magnetism. Two singletons join host Anna Richardson as they seek to choose a date from a selection of six naked people, who will be revealed to them one body part at a time. They then get dressed and head off on a date, to see if there is any chemistry when the clothes come on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqrgb2CvBcaUD9UsTGynOBHmwqh.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:67385'),
