  ('586908244599792970', 'Narcos: Mexico', 2018, 'Drama, Crime', 'Doug Miro, Carlo Bernard, Chris Brancato', 'Alec Ziff, Isaac Gómez', 'Scoot McNairy, José María Yázpik, Alejandro Edda, Luis Gerardo Méndez, Matt Letscher, Gorka Lasaosa, Alfonso Dosal, Mayra Hermosillo', 'TV-MA', 'See the rise of the Guadalajara Cartel as an American DEA agent learns the danger of targeting narcos in 1980s Mexico.', 'See the rise of the Guadalajara Cartel as an American DEA agent learns the danger of targeting narcos in 1980s Mexico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aXwMx8OvRFMfI1RmkbJm6Bq1jVg.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:80968'),
