  ('901627198048600817', 'Narenare -Cheer for You!-', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Rika Nakagawa, Yuki Nakashima, Larissa Tago Takeda, Manaka Iwami, Moe Kahara, Miku Ito', null, 'Misora Kanata is a first-year student on the Takanosaki High School cheerleading team. She won a national championship in middle school, but can’t jump after a mistake in a competition. She befriends Suzuha, Shion, Anna, Onka, and Megumi to form the PoMPoMs. Their new team goes beyond cheerleading to reach the hearts of the people they cheer on. They might just change the world!', 'Misora Kanata is a first-year student on the Takanosaki High School cheerleading team. She won a national championship in middle school, but can’t jump after a mistake in a competition. She befriends Suzuha, Shion, Anna, Onka, and Megumi to form the PoMPoMs. Their new team goes beyond cheerleading to reach the hearts of the people they cheer on. They might just change the world!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b0kHEAx7Na9Bv1Mu0pP5Ql5PVwU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:239158'),
  ('190006652681475075', 'Naruto', 2002, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Junko Takeuchi, Noriaki Sugiyama, Chie Nakamura, Kazuhiko Inoue, Hidekatsu Shibata, Koichi Tochika, Masashi Ebara, Yōichi Masukawa', 'TV-PG', 'Naruto Uzumaki, a mischievous adolescent ninja, struggles as he searches for recognition and dreams of becoming the Hokage, the village''s leader and strongest ninja.', 'Naruto Uzumaki, a mischievous adolescent ninja, struggles as he searches for recognition and dreams of becoming the Hokage, the village''s leader and strongest ninja.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xppeysfvDKVx775MFuH8Z9BlpMk.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:46260'),
  ('114048006879404283', 'Naruto Shippūden', 2007, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Junko Takeuchi, Noriaki Sugiyama, Chie Nakamura, Kazuhiko Inoue, Showtaro Morikubo, Satoshi Hino, Akira Ishida, Hideo Ishikawa', 'TV-PG', 'After 2 and a half years Naruto finally returns to his village of Konoha, and sets about putting his ambitions to work. It will not be easy though as he has amassed a few more dangerous enemies, in the likes of the shinobi organization; Akatsuki.', 'After 2 and a half years Naruto finally returns to his village of Konoha, and sets about putting his ambitions to work. It will not be easy though as he has amassed a few more dangerous enemies, in the likes of the shinobi organization; Akatsuki.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/71mASgFgSiPl9QUexVH8BubU0lD.jpg', 20, 'tmdb:tv:31910'),
  ('345915109871161471', 'NARUTO Spin-Off: Rock Lee & His Ninja Pals', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yōichi Masukawa, Koichi Tochika, Yukari Tamura, Masashi Ebara, Junko Takeuchi, Chie Nakamura', 'TV-Y7', 'Welcome to the Hidden Leaf Village. The village where Uzumaki Naruto, star of the TV show "Naruto" makes his home. Every day, countless powerful ninjas carry out missions and train to hone their skills. Our main character is one of these powerful ninjas... but it''s not Naruto! It''s the ninja who can''t use ninjutsu, Rock Lee!', 'Welcome to the Hidden Leaf Village. The village where Uzumaki Naruto, star of the TV show "Naruto" makes his home. Every day, countless powerful ninjas carry out missions and train to hone their skills. Our main character is one of these powerful ninjas... but it''s not Naruto! It''s the ninja who can''t use ninjutsu, Rock Lee!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2OTMpFejspg3fYnRbiuVuLsZtaq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43168'),
  ('19975254636041426', 'NASA''s Unexplained Files', 2012, 'Documentary, Talk, Mystery', null, null, null, 'TV-G', 'Dive into the mysteries of some of NASA’s most curious missions and explore stories of engineering achievement and human endurance. Each episode offers first hand testimony from astronauts, NASA mission footage, plus beautifully rendered CGI to bring to life these voyages that reveal unexplained sightings that have dogged many of NASA’s most famous missions.', 'Dive into the mysteries of some of NASA’s most curious missions and explore stories of engineering achievement and human endurance. Each episode offers first hand testimony from astronauts, NASA mission footage, plus beautifully rendered CGI to bring to life these voyages that reveal unexplained sightings that have dogged many of NASA’s most famous missions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6w5zVDc6YyiSQZPtJXnboZ2lKfq.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:57478'),
  ('793880969081413339', 'NASCAR Racers', 1999, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids', 'Steve Cuden', null, 'Ian James Corlett, Scott McNeil, Roger Cross, Kirby Morrow, Rino Romano, Paul Dobson, Andrew Francis, Ron Halder', 'TV-Y7', 'NASCAR Racers is an animated television series about two rival NASCAR racing teams, Team Fastex and Team Rexcor, competing against each other in the futuristic NASCAR Unlimited Division.', 'NASCAR Racers is an animated television series about two rival NASCAR racing teams, Team Fastex and Team Rexcor, competing against each other in the futuristic NASCAR Unlimited Division.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xi3XaKx0v4gpaQcWp6Rf0yA20wm.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:281'),
  ('813263983152349999', 'Nasdrovia', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Sergio Sarria, Miguel Esteban, Luismi Pérez', null, 'Leonor Watling, Hugo Silva, Luis Bermejo, Anton Yakovlev, Michael John Treanor, Mark Ivanir, Yan Tual, Kevin Brand', 'TV-MA', 'Edurne and Julián are two successful lawyers. They decided to quit their careers and open a Russian restaurant: the Nasdrovia. Unfortunately, it''s so great that it becomes a favorite of the Russian mafia.', 'Edurne and Julián are two successful lawyers. They decided to quit their careers and open a Russian restaurant: the Nasdrovia. Unfortunately, it''s so great that it becomes a favorite of the Russian mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AcaCW0cMUUwQEeows8Q6o0DbCJC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:105775'),
  ('65055458694721978', 'Nash Bridges', 1996, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Carlton Cuse', null, 'Don Johnson, Cheech Marin, Jodi Lyn O''Keefe, Jeff Perry, Cress Williams, Wendy Moniz, James Gammon', null, 'Fun-loving San Francisco Police Department investigator Nash Bridges is part of the elite Special Investigations Unit. He tackles crime using his keen sense of humor and charm. Joe Dominguez comes out of retirement to become Bridges'' wisecracking yet more rule-abiding partner.', 'Fun-loving San Francisco Police Department investigator Nash Bridges is part of the elite Special Investigations Unit. He tackles crime using his keen sense of humor and charm. Joe Dominguez comes out of retirement to become Bridges'' wisecracking yet more rule-abiding partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJeHSCFoxWN2Pt2lg56CKOi9g87.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:474'),
  ('841849192339579203', 'Nashville', 2012, 'Drama', 'Callie Khouri', null, 'Hayden Panettiere, Clare Bowen, Charles Esten, Jonathan Jackson, Lennon Stella, Maisy Stella, Sam Palladio', 'TV-14', 'Rayna Jaymes and Juliette Barnes face personal and professional challenges as they navigate their paths as artists and individuals. Surrounding them, and often complicating their lives, are their family, friends and, in some cases, lovers, as well as the up-and-coming performers and songwriters trying to get ahead in the business.', 'Rayna Jaymes and Juliette Barnes face personal and professional challenges as they navigate their paths as artists and individuals. Surrounding them, and often complicating their lives, are their family, friends and, in some cases, lovers, as well as the up-and-coming performers and songwriters trying to get ahead in the business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZ2K2cPeWURnQjCxrvSEnaEcIST.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:44549'),
  ('45128064154114358', 'Nassiryia - Per non dimenticare', 2007, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Raoul Bova, Claudia Pandolfi, Libero De Rienzo, Andrea Tidona, Santo Bellina, Raffaele Vannoli, Massimo De Rossi, Gioia Spaziani', null, 'November 12, 2003. A terrorist attack kills 24 Italian soldiers deployed in Nasiriyah, Iraq for a peace-keeping mission as part of "Operation Ancient Babylon".', 'November 12, 2003. A terrorist attack kills 24 Italian soldiers deployed in Nasiriyah, Iraq for a peace-keeping mission as part of "Operation Ancient Babylon".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7D9IfgFYdBNpOqCjHQCHG3AbNCd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86713'),
  ('503322220253289535', 'Nasz nowy dom', 2013, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqUtcdmc2JPLZc4tmPAxmX5Gc8g.jpg', 26, 'tmdb:tv:132713'),
  ('866589892004292949', 'Nate Is Late', 2018, 'Kids, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Sylvain Huchet, Peter Saisselin', null, 'Sarah Aubrey, Jane Ubrien, Kaycie Chase, Emmylou Homs, Fily Keita, Claire Baradat, Marie Chevalot, Thomas Sagols', null, 'Every morning, Nate and Malika leave home 30 minutes early to go to school, and yet every morning they arrive late! That’s because every morning, something AMAZING happens on the way. But even though their stories are always true, Principal Prudence never believes them…', 'Every morning, Nate and Malika leave home 30 minutes early to go to school, and yet every morning they arrive late! That’s because every morning, something AMAZING happens on the way. But even though their stories are always true, Principal Prudence never believes them…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSaKt3B72LzT2WvKOzC3bGKCGzD.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:95775'),
  ('400695821032929834', 'Nathan Barley', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Charlie Brooker, Chris Morris', 'Charlie Brooker, Chris Morris', 'Nicholas Burns, Julian Barratt, Claire Keelan, Richard Ayoade, Spencer Brown', null, 'Nathan Barley is a Channel 4 sitcom written by Charlie Brooker and Chris Morris, starring Nicholas Burns, Julian Barratt, Charlie Condou and Claire Keelan. The series of six weekly episodes began broadcasting on 11 February 2005 on Channel 4. Described by his creator as a "meaningless strutting cadaver-in-waiting", the character originated on Brooker''s TVGoHome – a website parodying television listings – as the focus of a fly-on-the-wall documentary called Cunt.', 'Nathan Barley is a Channel 4 sitcom written by Charlie Brooker and Chris Morris, starring Nicholas Burns, Julian Barratt, Charlie Condou and Claire Keelan. The series of six weekly episodes began broadcasting on 11 February 2005 on Channel 4. Described by his creator as a "meaningless strutting cadaver-in-waiting", the character originated on Brooker''s TVGoHome – a website parodying television listings – as the focus of a fly-on-the-wall documentary called Cunt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jAd2zeYyWv89L6VRMAtPsssAZ7r.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114'),
  ('641773904834048684', 'Nathan for You', 2013, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Nathan Fielder, Michael Koman', null, 'Nathan Fielder', 'TV-14', 'Self-proclaimed business expert, writer, director and comedian Nathan Fielder helps real small businesses turn a profit with marketing tactics that no ordinary consultant would dare to attempt. From driving foot traffic to an off-the-strip souvenir shop by using Hollywood flair and a Johnny Depp impersonator, to creating a rebate that can only be redeemed by climbing a mountain, to founding a coffee shop called "Dumb Starbucks,” Nathan has always gone to the limit to make his ideas come to life. With his unorthodox approach to problem solving, Nathan’s genuine efforts to do good often draw the real people he encounters into an experience far beyond what they signed up for.', 'Self-proclaimed business expert, writer, director and comedian Nathan Fielder helps real small businesses turn a profit with marketing tactics that no ordinary consultant would dare to attempt. From driving foot traffic to an off-the-strip souvenir shop by using Hollywood flair and a Johnny Depp impersonator, to creating a rebate that can only be redeemed by climbing a mountain, to founding a coffee shop called "Dumb Starbucks,” Nathan has always gone to the limit to make his ideas come to life. With his unorthodox approach to problem solving, Nathan’s genuine efforts to do good often draw the real people he encounters into an experience far beyond what they signed up for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tGXlz61c44onUg6EdRkbhjcaPA.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:58957'),
  ('934526266158878979', 'National Defence Student', 2013, 'Drama', '段连民', '段连民', '张雅蓓, Zhou Tingwei, Gao Ziqi, Liu Chao, Lam Song, Yi Chunde, Yin Ye Zi, Zhang Kejia', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/adqzsaExTQrW78C6ggNiPCG9vFl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:126392'),
  ('977283582116423705', 'National Geographic: Situation Critical', 2007, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Rufus Jones, John Benjamin Hickey', null, 'In Situation Critical, we explore the unfolding action and the real people thrust into survivor mode by some of the most dramatic events in modern history. This fast-paced series takes you inside the seemingly stable events that became headline disasters in a matter of minutes. Each hour-long episode combines archival footage, accurate re-enactments, advanced CGI and firsthand accounts from those at the centre of the action. Building suspense with each heart-pounding movement, we vividly break down the terrifying moments — outlining the life-threatening risks, daring decisions, frantic communications, evolving tactics and last-ditch efforts developing with each decisive tick of the clock.', 'In Situation Critical, we explore the unfolding action and the real people thrust into survivor mode by some of the most dramatic events in modern history. This fast-paced series takes you inside the seemingly stable events that became headline disasters in a matter of minutes. Each hour-long episode combines archival footage, accurate re-enactments, advanced CGI and firsthand accounts from those at the centre of the action. Building suspense with each heart-pounding movement, we vividly break down the terrifying moments — outlining the life-threatening risks, daring decisions, frantic communications, evolving tactics and last-ditch efforts developing with each decisive tick of the clock.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MhwTrzTQirYeh5eI5rK5vE597l.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15929'),
  ('931419911514284413', 'National Security Agent', 1999, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Mystery, Comedy', null, null, 'Mikhail Porechenkov, Andrey Krasko, Andrei Tolubeyev, Vadim Yakovlev', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9PtbM3l3weH4yK2meTBNokACC1U.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:88060'),
  ('413586708630844185', 'National Treasure', 2016, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jack Thorne', 'Jack Thorne', 'Robbie Coltrane, Julie Walters, Mark Lewis Jones, Andrea Riseborough, Tim McInnerny, Kate Hardie, Nadine Marshall, Babou Ceesay', 'TV-MA', 'Paul Finchley is a bona fide "national treasure", one half of a popular, long-running comedy double act. The famous comedian''s world is thrown into chaos when he is accused of historic sexual abuse.', 'Paul Finchley is a bona fide "national treasure", one half of a popular, long-running comedy double act. The famous comedian''s world is thrown into chaos when he is accused of historic sexual abuse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hIlXvv5sn7TFOGRQOnPWJ2HxMZS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67716'),
  ('849944930667114314', 'National Treasure', 2017, 'Reality', 'Yu Lei, Zhang Guoli', null, 'Zhang Guoli', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q9Xj4FQ85ATmOJQnDillcnY3yph.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:77191'),
  ('550735569322311323', 'National Treasure: Edge of History', 2022, 'Action & Adventure', 'Marianne Wibberley, Cormac Wibberley', null, 'Lisette Olivera, Catherine Zeta-Jones, Zuri Reed, Antonio Cipriano, Jordan Rodrigues, Jake Austin Walker, Lyndon Smith', 'TV-14', 'While searching for history''s greatest treasure, Jess Valenzuela unburies her family''s secret past.', 'While searching for history''s greatest treasure, Jess Valenzuela unburies her family''s secret past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VW8wF6KpG01fMY4erZ9bw7A4Er.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137437'),
  ('607390501553668439', 'Natsuko Kira', 2016, 'Drama', 'DAIGO, Nanako Matsushima, Ryuhei Matsuda', 'Yumiko Inoue', 'Nanako Matsushima, Ryuhei Matsuda, DAIGO, Yoshinori Okada, Anne Nakamura, Rika Adachi, Taizo Harada, Jin Shirasu', null, 'Natsuko is going back to the advertising agency she worked for before taking maternity leave and is shocked to learn that she is not the creative director any more but instead, she is put in charge of the Sales Development. Unmotivated, Natsuko finds she has her work cut out for her, and she has trouble balancing her job responsibilities with her home life, so she hires Miyuki, a babysitter. Unfortunately, Miyuki’s presence eventually works to tear her marriage apart.', 'Natsuko is going back to the advertising agency she worked for before taking maternity leave and is shocked to learn that she is not the creative director any more but instead, she is put in charge of the Sales Development. Unmotivated, Natsuko finds she has her work cut out for her, and she has trouble balancing her job responsibilities with her home life, so she hires Miyuki, a babysitter. Unfortunately, Miyuki’s presence eventually works to tear her marriage apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rcq8H8Vj3gF1zuJkTWkrnssKx2L.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70186'),
  ('535966986901731740', 'Natsume''s Book of Friends', 2008, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hiroshi Kamiya, Kazuhiko Inoue, Eiji Itoh, Miki Ito, Hisayoshi Suganuma, Akira Ishida, Sanae Kobayashi, Ryohei Kimura', 'TV-14', 'Natsume Takashi has the ability to see spirits, which he has long kept secret. However, once he inherits a strange book that belonged to his deceased grandmother, Reiko, he discovers the reason why spirits surround him.', 'Natsume Takashi has the ability to see spirits, which he has long kept secret. However, once he inherits a strange book that belonged to his deceased grandmother, Reiko, he discovers the reason why spirits surround him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4IAX5fgsyj9SnV2sqEh5JfuOvUo.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:69500'),
  ('228478008525613952', 'Natsuyuki Rendezvous', 2012, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Yuichi Nakamura, Jun Fukuyama, Sayaka Ohara, Yumi Touma, Marie Miyake, Chie Nakamura', null, 'Ryousuke Hazuki is a young man whose heart has been stolen away, stopping by the local floral shop daily in order to catch a glimpse of the beautiful Rokka Shimao, the shop''s owner. In hopes of getting close to her, he decides to get a part-time job at the shop, but before he is able to make his move, he runs into a major roadblock: in her apartment dwells a ghost who claims to be Rokka''s deceased husband. Atsushi Shimao has quietly watched over his widowed wife ever since he passed three years ago. However, Hazuki is the first person to ever notice him, and the two quickly find themselves at odds: the jealous Shimao attempts to thwart the suitor''s advances and possess his body, while Hazuki simply wants the ghost to pass on for good, allowing Rokka to move on from the past and him to be with the one he loves. As both men refuse to let go of their desires, an unusual relationship forms between a troubled woman, an unrelenting ghost, and a stubborn man in love.', 'Ryousuke Hazuki is a young man whose heart has been stolen away, stopping by the local floral shop daily in order to catch a glimpse of the beautiful Rokka Shimao, the shop''s owner. In hopes of getting close to her, he decides to get a part-time job at the shop, but before he is able to make his move, he runs into a major roadblock: in her apartment dwells a ghost who claims to be Rokka''s deceased husband. Atsushi Shimao has quietly watched over his widowed wife ever since he passed three years ago. However, Hazuki is the first person to ever notice him, and the two quickly find themselves at odds: the jealous Shimao attempts to thwart the suitor''s advances and possess his body, while Hazuki simply wants the ghost to pass on for good, allowing Rokka to move on from the past and him to be with the one he loves. As both men refuse to let go of their desires, an unusual relationship forms between a troubled woman, an unrelenting ghost, and a stubborn man in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxMdyZGTifTpG61ib4TTiL2xRvP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45278'),
  ('251065814597530798', 'Nattering with Nah', 2023, 'Talk', 'Na Yeong-seok', 'Kim Dae-joo, Lee Woo-jung', 'Na Yeong-seok, Lee Woo-jung, Kim Dae-joo', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iwehjBTwCBrF0fnQr5QKvN1xvm1.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:228540'),
  ('924084827742192472', 'Natural High', 2023, 'Reality, Comedy', 'Teng Shen', null, 'Teng Shen, Adam Fan, Wang Anyu, Johnny Huang', null, 'Come and join Shen Teng and his friends as they step away from the bustling crowded cities and reconnect with the beautiful wild nature.', 'Come and join Shen Teng and his friends as they step away from the bustling crowded cities and reconnect with the beautiful wild nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mmvlxQ5AXuHLfKvyqkgCDZfVzxM.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:231620'),
  ('808501490798398496', 'Natural Six', 2024, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Harry McEntire, Aoife Wilson, Alex Jordan, Doug Cockle, Hollie Bennett, Ben Starr', null, 'In the world of Reliquiae, a group of five heroes, bound by fate and The Web''s influence, embarks on a mission that unravels hidden truths about the world and ancient powers.', 'In the world of Reliquiae, a group of five heroes, bound by fate and The Web''s influence, embarks on a mission that unravels hidden truths about the world and ancient powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4iyRiRNXQszMdWYERRpP2g64JBc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:305947'),
  ('461379356260904420', 'Natural World', 1983, 'Documentary', null, 'Brian Jackman', 'David Attenborough, John Hannah, Juliet Stevenson', 'TV-PG', 'Natural World is a nature documentary television series broadcast annually on BBC Two and regarded by the BBC as its flagship natural history brand. It is currently the longest-running series in its genre on British television, with more than 400 episodes broadcast since its inception in 1983. Natural World is produced by the BBC Natural History Unit in Bristol, but individual programmes can be in-house productions, collaborative productions with other broadcasters or films made and distributed by independent production companies and purchased by the BBC. Natural World programmes are often broadcast as PBS Nature episodes in the USA. Since 2008, most Natural World programmes have been shot and broadcast in high definition.', 'Natural World is a nature documentary television series broadcast annually on BBC Two and regarded by the BBC as its flagship natural history brand. It is currently the longest-running series in its genre on British television, with more than 400 episodes broadcast since its inception in 1983. Natural World is produced by the BBC Natural History Unit in Bristol, but individual programmes can be in-house productions, collaborative productions with other broadcasters or films made and distributed by independent production companies and purchased by the BBC. Natural World programmes are often broadcast as PBS Nature episodes in the USA. Since 2008, most Natural World programmes have been shot and broadcast in high definition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lM2O6k77POzauRNR6iAcOFZKwqY.jpg', 39, 'tmdb:tv:21145'),
  ('488211225093056693', 'Nature', 1982, 'Documentary, Family', 'Thomas Lovejoy, George Page', null, null, 'TV-G', 'Consistently stunning documentaries transport viewers to far-flung locations ranging from the torrid African plains to the chilly splendours of icy Antarctica. The show''s primary focus is on animals and ecosystems around the world. A comic book based on the show, meant to be used an as educational tool for kids, was briefly distributed to museums and schools at no cost in the mid-2000s.', 'Consistently stunning documentaries transport viewers to far-flung locations ranging from the torrid African plains to the chilly splendours of icy Antarctica. The show''s primary focus is on animals and ecosystems around the world. A comic book based on the show, meant to be used an as educational tool for kids, was briefly distributed to museums and schools at no cost in the mid-2000s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qRg5boKJdJhJKoGJdchVqPGQTEl.jpg', 44, 'tmdb:tv:14951'),
  ('850280253581362531', 'Nature''s Great Events', 2009, 'Documentary', null, null, 'David Attenborough', 'TV-G', 'Documentary series looking at the most dramatic wildlife spectacles on our planet, showing how life responds to natural events which can dramatically transform entire landscapes.', 'Documentary series looking at the most dramatic wildlife spectacles on our planet, showing how life responds to natural events which can dramatically transform entire landscapes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cbzbvNe8ht9jSHKsNPXfx5I9BWi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19744'),
  ('835321014296208687', 'Naughty Babe', 2023, 'Drama', null, 'Piangpaitoon Satrawaha, Preechaya Prayongsap', 'Natasit Uareksit, Kornthas Rujeerattanavorapan, Chawarin Perdpiriyawong, Pruk Panich, Supha Sangaworawong, Penpetch Benyakul, Teerapong Liaorakwong', null, 'Left alone before the wedding, Khondiao flees—only for Yi to chase him, crash, and wake up blaming Khondiao for everything.', 'Left alone before the wedding, Khondiao flees—only for Yi to chase him, crash, and wake up blaming Khondiao for everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/20c4ZGTF8nL3JmxyCASW8W5EgvG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223906'),
  ('329305749319669953', 'Nautilus', 2024, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'James Dormer', null, 'Shazad Latif, Georgia Flood, Céline Menville, Thierry Frémont, Luke Arnold, Jacob Collins-Levy, Damien Garvey, Cameron Cuffe', 'TV-PG', 'The origin story of the iconic Captain Nemo: an Indian Prince robbed of his birthright and family, a prisoner of the East India Mercantile Company and a man bent on revenge against the forces that have taken everything from him.', 'The origin story of the iconic Captain Nemo: an Indian Prince robbed of his birthright and family, a prisoner of the East India Mercantile Company and a man bent on revenge against the forces that have taken everything from him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBHzItKQNfPdt2GL4LcHJy8P1sH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:131835'),
  ('749536944762992805', 'Navarasa', 2021, 'Drama', 'Mani Ratnam', null, null, null, 'From amusement to awe, the nine human emotions of Indian aesthetic theory are explored in this anthology series.', 'From amusement to awe, the nine human emotions of Indian aesthetic theory are explored in this anthology series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xOZbqK6xR2JkRBPFgENUHb6r6Qd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:120395'),
  ('358095101078978003', 'Navarro', 1989, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Tito Topin, Pierre Grimblat', 'Philippe Amar, Serge Adam, Pierre-Yves Pruvost', 'Roger Hanin, Maurice Vaudaux, Emmanuelle Boidron, Catherine Allégret, Christian Rauth, Daniel Rialet, Jean-Marie Mistral, Bernard Larmande', null, 'Out of the norm police officer Navarro and his team investigate the most troubling, serious and heart rendering cases in the city of Paris.', 'Out of the norm police officer Navarro and his team investigate the most troubling, serious and heart rendering cases in the city of Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g8RNyYCCcFTciIZM4FVNPPnFqB0.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:42456'),
  ('509458732924906358', 'Navidad sin Fin', 2001, 'Drama', null, null, 'Macaria, Jan, Alejandra Barros, Ignacio López Tarso, Nancy Patiño, Andrés Garzas, Sara Cobo, Fernando Colunga', 'NR', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u0OE0yPz0gIiyOO2xrENHIN3ELg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:136031'),
  ('998052715442845366', 'Navillera', 2021, 'Drama', null, null, 'Park In-hwan, Song Kang, Na Moon-hee, Hong Seung-hee, Kim Tae-hun, Kim Soo-jin, Yoon Ji-hye, Lee So-yeong', null, 'A 70-year-old with a dream and a 23-year-old with a gift lift each other out of harsh realities and rise to the challenge of becoming ballerinos.', 'A 70-year-old with a dream and a 23-year-old with a gift lift each other out of harsh realities and rise to the challenge of becoming ballerinos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pBd6pEhszsWk95TrUqo4bdXhH8T.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:119464'),
  ('439975641611196701', 'Navy Log', 1955, 'War & Politics, Drama', 'Samuel Gallu', null, 'Clint Eastwood', null, 'Navy Log is an American drama anthology series that initially aired for one season on CBS. It relates the greatest survival war stories in the history of the United States Navy. This series premiered on September 20, 1955, but the following year, it was moved to ABC, where it aired until September 25, 1958. The program aired for a total of three seasons and 102 episodes.', 'Navy Log is an American drama anthology series that initially aired for one season on CBS. It relates the greatest survival war stories in the history of the United States Navy. This series premiered on September 20, 1955, but the following year, it was moved to ABC, where it aired until September 25, 1958. The program aired for a total of three seasons and 102 episodes.', null, 3, 'tmdb:tv:13813'),
  ('1069770879636461854', 'Nazaré', 2019, 'Drama', 'Sandra Santos', null, 'Pedro Luzindro, João Maria Maneira, Carolina Loureiro, Afonso Pimentel, José Mata, Pedro Rovisco, Inês Fouto, Ana Lopes', null, '“Nazaré” is a contemporary love story in a reality that plagues the country every summer. It is a narrative about the struggle of those who are defeated by flames, rebirth and hope.', '“Nazaré” is a contemporary love story in a reality that plagues the country every summer. It is a narrative about the struggle of those who are defeated by flames, rebirth and hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/azv4RaJ8sz6T8OS0pJ8k3QV2PDL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:93641'),
  ('826496367469936480', 'Nazi Megastructures', 2013, 'Documentary, War & Politics', null, null, 'Richard Lintern', 'TV-PG', 'In a quest for world domination, the Nazis built some of the biggest and deadliest pieces of military hardware and malevolent technology in history. This is the stories of the engineers who designed them and how these structures sparked a technological revolution that changed warfare forever.', 'In a quest for world domination, the Nazis built some of the biggest and deadliest pieces of military hardware and malevolent technology in history. This is the stories of the engineers who designed them and how these structures sparked a technological revolution that changed warfare forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Df34LNjP0hTMAnED6DifnPFfeg.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:56556');
