  ('802451094646885616', 'Nestor Burma', 1991, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime, Comedy', null, null, 'Guy Marchand, Pierre Tornade, Jeanne Savary, Elisa Servier, Patrick Guillemin, Michel Fortin, Cerise, Fanny Gilles', 'TV-14', 'Cynical private detective Nestor Burma investigating murders, missing persons, kidnapping and extortion cases in every arrondissement of Paris.', 'Cynical private detective Nestor Burma investigating murders, missing persons, kidnapping and extortion cases in every arrondissement of Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1TgOUA99FFdXJn1z5i7ifcZJ2L.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:70977'),
  ('957020609467428348', 'Netflix and Chills with Dr. Elvira', 2021, null, null, null, 'Cassandra Peterson', null, 'Dr. Elvira, is here to guide you through another horror-filled Halloween season consisting of weekly sessions every Sunday throughout October with Netflix & Chills as she takes over Netflix’s social channels to prescribe new series and films to check out. "Frightening features are good for relieving anxiety as they induce all those happy hormones such as serotonin and mood boosters like adrenaline. For those struggling with “anxiety, stress, and jitters,” Dr. Elvira recommends sitting down on the couch for a good scare"', 'Dr. Elvira, is here to guide you through another horror-filled Halloween season consisting of weekly sessions every Sunday throughout October with Netflix & Chills as she takes over Netflix’s social channels to prescribe new series and films to check out. "Frightening features are good for relieving anxiety as they induce all those happy hormones such as serotonin and mood boosters like adrenaline. For those struggling with “anxiety, stress, and jitters,” Dr. Elvira recommends sitting down on the couch for a good scare"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/li4zLRS1UYRc58PecyvjPc2tPHN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:227555'),
  ('1073408177816587103', 'Netflix Presents: The Characters', 2016, 'Comedy', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'No rules. No expectations. A half hour to make their mark. Eight different comedians each get an episode to show their skills in comedy.', 'No rules. No expectations. A half hour to make their mark. Eight different comedians each get an episode to show their skills in comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mFC8GeqIEl2EBqD86RHJohrmCn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65977'),
  ('417744017298046571', 'Netsuzou Trap -NTR-', 2017, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Ai Kakuma, Daisuke Ono, Hiromi Igarashi, Ryota Osaka', 'TV-MA', 'Yuma, a high school second-year, is enjoying every day now that she has her first boyfriend. After she asks for relationship advice from Hotaru, her beautiful long-time friend who has had many boyfriends, Hotaru teases her for her inexperience and playfully does things to her that even her boyfriend doesn''t do. Yuma and Hotaru''s secret relationship continues to escalate, and Yuma finds herself unable to deny how it makes her feel. This school drama tells the story of the interwoven lives of these two girls with boyfriends.', 'Yuma, a high school second-year, is enjoying every day now that she has her first boyfriend. After she asks for relationship advice from Hotaru, her beautiful long-time friend who has had many boyfriends, Hotaru teases her for her inexperience and playfully does things to her that even her boyfriend doesn''t do. Yuma and Hotaru''s secret relationship continues to escalate, and Yuma finds herself unable to deny how it makes her feel. This school drama tells the story of the interwoven lives of these two girls with boyfriends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lpz9856n8bkJ5kP24pyOhXeGqXN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72510'),
  ('180225664920464866', 'Neue Geschichten vom Pumuckl', 2023, 'Family, Comedy', null, null, null, null, 'In the carpenter shop of his uncle Master Eder, Florian Eder encounters the small goblin Pumuckl, who never leaves his side after that.', 'In the carpenter shop of his uncle Master Eder, Florian Eder encounters the small goblin Pumuckl, who never leaves his side after that.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubZLJs6DCFERj4yUbOx6gEL1vE1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:236817'),
  ('869793489753966398', 'Nevenka, Breaking the Silence', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Maribel Sánchez-Maroto', 'Marisa Lafuente', 'Nevenka Fernández', null, 'The story of the first sexual harassment case in Spain was a scandal. Nevenka Fernández, its protagonist, discusses it in this documentary.', 'The story of the first sexual harassment case in Spain was a scandal. Nevenka Fernández, its protagonist, discusses it in this documentary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHv4urLFAgKGELH5xZoL0krLhTt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:120040'),
  ('518464192355173039', 'Never Ever Do This at Home!', 2012, 'Comedy, Documentary, Reality', null, null, 'Mai Thi Nguyen-Kim, Fabian Köster, Lutz van der Horst', null, 'Tempting fate, fearless hosts Wigald Boning and Bernhard Hoecker ignore warnings and restrictions on various items to see what happens when they do.', 'Tempting fate, fearless hosts Wigald Boning and Bernhard Hoecker ignore warnings and restrictions on various items to see what happens when they do.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/of2bzTAeMI1LbT0hcNGS2BMr87D.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:67295'),
  ('668255026531614931', 'Never Forget Your Enemy', 2026, 'Drama', 'Hwacha', null, 'Hwang Jun-su, Lee Ja-woon, Oh Jae-hyeong', null, 'After a crash erases a decade of his memory, a man wakes up to find his former rival claiming they’re lovers—and must uncover the truth behind the relationship he can’t remember.', 'After a crash erases a decade of his memory, a man wakes up to find his former rival claiming they’re lovers—and must uncover the truth behind the relationship he can’t remember.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dAcbd7bQxOt8WeAAUzqbdiwF8GQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:314073'),
  ('582662590264959106', 'Never Give Up', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lee Hae-ri, Choi Do-hoon, Yuk Jeong-yong', 'Son Geun-joo', 'Kwak Do-won, Yoon Doo-joon, Han Go-eun, Park Won-sook, Jeong Dong-won, Kim Ji-young, Kim Young-woong, Jeong Jae-kwang', 'TV-14', 'A young entrepreneur finds an unlikely partner, and friend, in a middle-aged breadwinner as they live together in the home of an enigmatic loan shark.', 'A young entrepreneur finds an unlikely partner, and friend, in a middle-aged breadwinner as they live together in the home of an enigmatic loan shark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/db8kCoT9Leqcc5UcxCjbmakZCoM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197064'),
  ('434356663029237216', 'Never Give Up', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kwak Baek Soo', null, 'Ryan Zheng, Chen Yuqi, Dylan Wang, Shaogang Zhang, Liang Chao, Zhong Lili, Wu Yaheng, Cheng Zi', null, 'The third planning department of Gaofa Electronics Group is a brainstorming department responsible for innovation. It has successfully proposed the "Gaosi 3s" cross-generation model, which has become the main product of the group for ten years and has established Gaosi Electronics as a leader in the industry. It has become a highly prized department, but since then, they have been stagnant, and they ran out of ideas. Now it''s been rendered to a useless department!', 'The third planning department of Gaofa Electronics Group is a brainstorming department responsible for innovation. It has successfully proposed the "Gaosi 3s" cross-generation model, which has become the main product of the group for ten years and has established Gaosi Electronics as a leader in the industry. It has become a highly prized department, but since then, they have been stagnant, and they ran out of ideas. Now it''s been rendered to a useless department!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oxKrh5mXnorRPD88fWi9GqrCAUL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:220838'),
  ('538383408476908986', 'Never Have I Ever', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mindy Kaling, Lang Fisher', null, 'Maitreyi Ramakrishnan, Darren Barnet, Poorna Jagannathan, Jaren Lewison, Lee Rodriguez, Ramona Young, John McEnroe, Richa Shukla Moorjani', 'TV-14', 'After a traumatic year, all an Indian-American teen wants is to go from pariah to popular -- but friends, family and feeling won''t make it easy on her.', 'After a traumatic year, all an Indian-American teen wants is to go from pariah to popular -- but friends, family and feeling won''t make it easy on her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hd5fnBixab6IzfUwjC5wfdbX3eM.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:100883'),
  ('978193966972464410', 'Never Let Me Go', 2022, 'Drama', 'Kittisak Kongka', null, 'Naravit Lertratkosum, Phuwin Tangsakyuen, Rasee Wacharapolmek, Nat Sakdatorn, Wachirawit Ruangwiwat, Tanapon Sukumpantanasan, Pitisak Yaowananon, Panadda Ruangwut', null, 'Bound by duty and shadowed by violence, a young heir and his bodyguard find love—knowing danger may steal their chance at a future together.', 'Bound by duty and shadowed by violence, a young heir and his bodyguard find love—knowing danger may steal their chance at a future together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQzDBhdk0aRiExg5XrdbolfMl4m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215356'),
  ('63531276195966852', 'Never Mind the Buzzcocks', 1996, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Rhod Gilbert, Phill Jupitus, Noel Fielding', null, 'Never Mind the Buzzcocks is a comedy panel game show with a pop and rock music theme. The show is infamous for its dry, sarcastic humour and scathing, provocative attacks on the pop industry.', 'Never Mind the Buzzcocks is a comedy panel game show with a pop and rock music theme. The show is infamous for its dry, sarcastic humour and scathing, provocative attacks on the pop industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ez0fX5nA68BJWL8jfP6dYr5WrcL.jpg', 28, 'tmdb:tv:1847'),
  ('4920757595121290', 'Never Twice', 2019, null, 'Koo Hyun-sook', 'Koo Hyun-sook', 'Park Se-wan, Kwak Dong-yeon, Youn Yuh-jung, Oh Ji-ho, Ye Ji-won, Park Ah-in, Park Joon-geum, Hwang Young-hee', null, 'An old stately inn stands in the heart of Seoul. It may be old, discolored, and weathered, but Nakwon Inn exudes old-world charms. As the typical cold uneventful winter comes to an end at the inn, guests start to arrive one by one as if each had promised to be present. Strangely and coincidentally, each one of them repeats Never Twice as they enter. The truth is, they all have a fateful reason to be there. What could have brought these individuals together? And what do they all have in common considering their long-term stay, assigned room numbers, gender, age, and hometown? The real reason for coming to Nakwon Inn unfolds.', 'An old stately inn stands in the heart of Seoul. It may be old, discolored, and weathered, but Nakwon Inn exudes old-world charms. As the typical cold uneventful winter comes to an end at the inn, guests start to arrive one by one as if each had promised to be present. Strangely and coincidentally, each one of them repeats Never Twice as they enter. The truth is, they all have a fateful reason to be there. What could have brought these individuals together? And what do they all have in common considering their long-term stay, assigned room numbers, gender, age, and hometown? The real reason for coming to Nakwon Inn unfolds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnaF0rzytj8FeRNQRxumpFQgAu1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94940'),
  ('654766949691664370', 'Neverland', 2011, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, 'Nick Willing', 'Charlie Rowe, Anna Friel, Cas Anvar, Charles Dance, Rhys Ifans, Bob Hoskins, Q''orianka Kilcher, Raoul Max Trujillo', 'TV-PG', 'Raised on the streets of turn-of-the century London, orphaned Peter and his pals survive by their fearless wits as cunning young pickpockets. Now, they''ve been rounded up by their mentor Jimmy Hook to snatch a priceless—some believe, magical—treasure which transports them to Neverland.', 'Raised on the streets of turn-of-the century London, orphaned Peter and his pals survive by their fearless wits as cunning young pickpockets. Now, they''ve been rounded up by their mentor Jimmy Hook to snatch a priceless—some believe, magical—treasure which transports them to Neverland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iNfcvFaCjVZkPWBcpH4faYMdEhM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43720'),
  ('353397390051832420', 'Nevertheless,', 2021, 'Drama', 'Kim Ga-ram, Jung Seo', 'Jung Won', 'Han So-hee, Song Kang, Chae Jong-hyeop, Lee Yul-eum, Yang Hye-ji, Kim Kang-bin, Lee Ho-jung, Yoon Seo-ah', null, 'The intoxicating charm of a flirtatious art school classmate pulls a reluctant love cynic into a friends-with-benefits relationship.', 'The intoxicating charm of a flirtatious art school classmate pulls a reluctant love cynic into a friends-with-benefits relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWIcIhpQibR1eDU0As4HRZeb8EL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:126035'),
  ('398885682287722021', 'Nevertheless: The Shapes of Love', 2024, 'Drama', 'Ryutaro Nakagawa, Jung Seo', null, 'Ryusei Yokohama, Sara Minami, Reo Sano, Natsuko, Momoko Fukuchi, Yui Narumi, Shunya Asano, Aki Asakura', 'TV-14', 'After a painful breakup, Miu vows to focus on art and avoid love — until an encounter with an aloof, charming artist stirs her deepest instincts.', 'After a painful breakup, Miu vows to focus on art and avoid love — until an encounter with an aloof, charming artist stirs her deepest instincts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKSg4Q3z0H5BmHI3jAr9CKIJwVL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:275624'),
  ('208661154904390816', 'Neverwhere', 1996, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Neil Gaiman, Lenny Henry', 'Neil Gaiman', 'Gary Bakewell, Laura Fraser, Hywel Bennett, Clive Russell, Paterson Joseph', 'TV-PG', 'Richard Mayhew leads an ordinary life in London when one day a girl named Door falls, injured, across his path. The next thing he knows, his life is gone and he''s pulled into the fantastical world of London Below. Pursued by the murderous Messrs. Croup and Vandemar, Door and Richard with the help of Hunter and the Marquis de Carabas, attempt to find the Angel Islington, who knows the secret behind the murder of Door''s family, and possibly a way for Richard to go home.', 'Richard Mayhew leads an ordinary life in London when one day a girl named Door falls, injured, across his path. The next thing he knows, his life is gone and he''s pulled into the fantastical world of London Below. Pursued by the murderous Messrs. Croup and Vandemar, Door and Richard with the help of Hunter and the Marquis de Carabas, attempt to find the Angel Islington, who knows the secret behind the murder of Door''s family, and possibly a way for Richard to go home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQbTB9IhHQoqWrJs53iHI0f1c8F.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13418'),
  ('959492036604598164', 'Nevskiy', 2016, 'Crime', null, null, 'Anton Vasilyev, Andrey Gulnev, Dmitry Palamarchuk, Sergey Koshonin, Viktoriya Maslova, Aleksandr Sayutalin, Mikhail Karpenko, Anastasiya Zabirova', null, 'Police captain Pavel Semyonov serves in one of the residential areas of St. Petersburg. Pavel is used to breaking up drunken fights and entering drug dens alone to make another arrest. He knows that if he thinks and argues, he will simply be killed. And he is used to first acting, and then sorting it out, because he really wants to stay alive, because his wife Yulia and son Sasha are waiting for him at home. Risking his life, he saves the daughter of a businessman. In gratitude, Latyshev, the girl''s father, facilitates the transfer of Pavel to Nevsky Prospekt, to the very center of the big city, where it is prestigious and profitable to serve ... And soon Pavel begins to suspect that his transfer to the Central District was carried out by Latyshev with some far-reaching plans. And when Pavel goes on the trail of a mysterious killer named Rafael, everything is completely confused. But in a difficult situation, Pavel can always rely on his friends from the sleeping area', 'Police captain Pavel Semyonov serves in one of the residential areas of St. Petersburg. Pavel is used to breaking up drunken fights and entering drug dens alone to make another arrest. He knows that if he thinks and argues, he will simply be killed. And he is used to first acting, and then sorting it out, because he really wants to stay alive, because his wife Yulia and son Sasha are waiting for him at home. Risking his life, he saves the daughter of a businessman. In gratitude, Latyshev, the girl''s father, facilitates the transfer of Pavel to Nevsky Prospekt, to the very center of the big city, where it is prestigious and profitable to serve ... And soon Pavel begins to suspect that his transfer to the Central District was carried out by Latyshev with some far-reaching plans. And when Pavel goes on the trail of a mysterious killer named Rafael, everything is completely confused. But in a difficult situation, Pavel can always rely on his friends from the sleeping area', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWoawp3et5nMLmX9LDDckKNSOHo.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:99894'),
  ('821208152515221156', 'New Amsterdam', 2008, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Allan Loeb', null, 'Nikolaj Coster-Waldau, Zuleikha Robinson, Stephen McKinley Henderson, Alexie Gilmore, Jian Leonardo, Robert Clohessy', null, 'John Amsterdam is a New York homicide detective unlike any other. He is brilliant, mysterious, reckless, and immortal. In 1642 he saved a Native Indian girl during a massacre of her indigenous tribe. In return, the girl cast an ancient spell that conferred immortality upon him. Amsterdam will not age, she told him, until he finds his one true love.', 'John Amsterdam is a New York homicide detective unlike any other. He is brilliant, mysterious, reckless, and immortal. In 1642 he saved a Native Indian girl during a massacre of her indigenous tribe. In return, the girl cast an ancient spell that conferred immortality upon him. Amsterdam will not age, she told him, until he finds his one true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iyhUIAQbGA1BysXbZhJm45JY2oi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1144'),
  ('821877318428312076', 'New Amsterdam', 2018, 'Drama', 'David Schulner', null, 'Ryan Eggold, Janet Montgomery, Jocko Sims, Tyler Labine, Sandra Mae Frank', 'TV-14', 'The new medical director breaks the rules to heal the system at America''s oldest public hospital. Max Goodwin sets out to tear up the bureaucracy and provide exceptional care, but the doctors and staff are not so sure he can succeed. They''ve heard this before. Not taking "no" for an answer, Dr. Goodwin''s instinctive response to problems large and small is four simple words: "How can I help?" He has to disrupt the status quo and prove he''ll stop at nothing to breathe new life into this underfunded and underappreciated hospital, returning it to the glory that put it on the map.', 'The new medical director breaks the rules to heal the system at America''s oldest public hospital. Max Goodwin sets out to tear up the bureaucracy and provide exceptional care, but the doctors and staff are not so sure he can succeed. They''ve heard this before. Not taking "no" for an answer, Dr. Goodwin''s instinctive response to problems large and small is four simple words: "How can I help?" He has to disrupt the status quo and prove he''ll stop at nothing to breathe new life into this underfunded and underappreciated hospital, returning it to the glory that put it on the map.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jsH4AeGZn5Q6h314A3OTUHKxHhR.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:80350'),
  ('761069258067486754', 'New Bandits', 2023, 'Drama, Crime, Western', 'Eduardo Melo, Mariana Bardan', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Adrift and desperately needing money to pay for his ailing adoptive father''s care, Ubaldo, a bank clerk who''s unable to remember his childhood, receives an inheritance that will change his destiny for good. He goes to Cratará, in the heart of the northwest desert, where he''ll become the leader of a pack of ruthless bandits, fulfilling the legacy of his biological father - a mythical cangaceiro.', 'Adrift and desperately needing money to pay for his ailing adoptive father''s care, Ubaldo, a bank clerk who''s unable to remember his childhood, receives an inheritance that will change his destiny for good. He goes to Cratará, in the heart of the northwest desert, where he''ll become the leader of a pack of ruthless bandits, fulfilling the legacy of his biological father - a mythical cangaceiro.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rBiDQaJRWnQQABHKkxBdxPfmkyP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:137883'),
  ('1108808730778762121', 'New Blood', 2016, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Anthony Horowitz', 'Anthony Horowitz', 'Ben Tavassoli, Mark Strepan, Anna Chancellor, Mark Addy, Ariyon Bakare, Mark Bonnar, Matt Bardock, Aiysha Hart', 'TV-PG', 'Two junior investigators come together against a new breed of criminal, the uber rich and powerful corporations, individuals and governments who hide behind legitimate facades.', 'Two junior investigators come together against a new breed of criminal, the uber rich and powerful corporations, individuals and governments who hide behind legitimate facades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBD5YNIZTODl2E73ebe2Te7wD4k.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66604'),
  ('468751025044417792', 'New Bride', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Ersoy Güler', null, 'Jessica May, Tolga Mendi, Mustafa Avkıran, Sema Keçik, Dağhan Külegeç, Lale Başar, Renan Bilek, Yonca Şahinbaş', null, 'Bella, a Spanish Girl falls in love with a Turkish man, Hazar. They decide to marry against the wish of their families. Bella is a modern girl and Hazar''s family is very traditional, so their cultures clash.', 'Bella, a Spanish Girl falls in love with a Turkish man, Hazar. They decide to marry against the wish of their families. Bella is a modern girl and Hazar''s family is very traditional, so their cultures clash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eEK4UQB8q3O9pcSb1Gbzigv9ess.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:71591'),
  ('586479705515896023', 'New Cutey Honey', 1994, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Michiko Neya, Rica Matsumoto, Kosei Tomita, Wataru Takagi, Rica Fukami', 'TV-MA', 'The forces of evil were looking for trouble; they found Cutey! In a futuristic world were evil comes in all shapes and sizes, she is the ultimate weapon. She''s Cutey Honey, a one woman S.W.A.T. team whose android chassis is capable of changing at will into a dazzling array of hard-hitting, curvaceous bodies each with it''s own set of special skills, weapons and other impressive physical attributes. Go Nagai''s legendary android super-hero is back and hitting the bad guys where it hurts most.', 'The forces of evil were looking for trouble; they found Cutey! In a futuristic world were evil comes in all shapes and sizes, she is the ultimate weapon. She''s Cutey Honey, a one woman S.W.A.T. team whose android chassis is capable of changing at will into a dazzling array of hard-hitting, curvaceous bodies each with it''s own set of special skills, weapons and other impressive physical attributes. Go Nagai''s legendary android super-hero is back and hitting the bad guys where it hurts most.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/no75xbgrTcjScKiOLjDvynaCDSd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:23313'),
  ('154895645075386952', 'NEW GAME!', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yuuki Takada, Yoko Hikasa, Ai Kayano, Megumi Yamaguchi, Megumi Toda, Ayumi Takeo, Madoka Asahina, Chitose Morinaga', 'TV-14', 'After graduating high school, Suzukaze Aoba joins Eagle Jump, the game company that developed Fairies Story, the game she obsessed over as a kid. On her first day as a working member of society, Aoba heads to work swaying in a packed, morning rush hour train. She manages to get to the office building all right but hesitates, wondering if it was really okay for her to take that last step and go inside. That''s when a senior member of staff, Toyama Rin, shows up at work and safely leads Aoba inside the offices of Eagle Jump.', 'After graduating high school, Suzukaze Aoba joins Eagle Jump, the game company that developed Fairies Story, the game she obsessed over as a kid. On her first day as a working member of society, Aoba heads to work swaying in a packed, morning rush hour train. She manages to get to the office building all right but hesitates, wondering if it was really okay for her to take that last step and go inside. That''s when a senior member of staff, Toyama Rin, shows up at work and safely leads Aoba inside the offices of Eagle Jump.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbW8diS5ccg8sSL4OSXXmXbWL8L.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67012'),
  ('613038440299755855', 'New Girl', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Elizabeth Meriwether', null, 'Zooey Deschanel, Jake Johnson, Max Greenfield, Lamorne Morris, Hannah Simone', 'TV-14', 'Jessica Day is an offbeat and adorable girl in her late 20s who, after a bad breakup, moves in with three single guys. Goofy, positive, vulnerable and honest to a fault, Jess has faith in people, even when she shouldn''t. Although she''s dorky and awkward, she''s comfortable in her own skin. More prone to friendships with women, she''s not used to hanging with the boys—especially at home.', 'Jessica Day is an offbeat and adorable girl in her late 20s who, after a bad breakup, moves in with three single guys. Goofy, positive, vulnerable and honest to a fault, Jess has faith in people, even when she shouldn''t. Although she''s dorky and awkward, she''s comfortable in her own skin. More prone to friendships with women, she''s not used to hanging with the boys—especially at home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8oCqMlKKomCArVtyOjRzMN6g40Z.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:1420'),
  ('852268848121524453', 'New Golden Lotus', 1996, 'Drama, Crime', 'Wang Ming-tai', null, 'Asami Kanno, Pal Sinn Lap-Man, Cindy Yip Sin-Yi, Choi Mei-yau, Eddie Koo Koon Chung', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fV2Wd4Z9hBlmJ1tDEzU1rOGqfWk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100755'),
