  ('1093965343454700803', 'Notre-Dame', 2022, 'Drama', 'Hervé Hadmar, Olivier Bocquet', null, 'Roschdy Zem, Caroline Proust, Simon Abkarian, Alice Isaaz, Sandor Funtek, Frédéric Chau, Victor Belmondo, Megan Northam', null, 'As the Paris firefighters try to stop the flames from spreading in the Cathedral, the show also follows characters being put through the wringer - they will have to fight each other, love each other, come across each other, hate each other, smile at or help each other - so that, in the end, they may have a chance to start all over again.', 'As the Paris firefighters try to stop the flames from spreading in the Cathedral, the show also follows characters being put through the wringer - they will have to fight each other, love each other, come across each other, hate each other, smile at or help each other - so that, in the end, they may have a chance to start all over again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMtryUXNFfKwk8rddrjWYm0o5Zz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129057'),
