  ('705308029912318802', 'Nyaight of the Living Cat', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Masaaki Mizunaka, Reina Ueda, Hiroki Yasumoto, Ryota Takeuchi, Shigeru Chiba', null, 'A virus turns humanity into feral cats, leaving a few survivors to fight back. Kunagi, a man with no past but vast cat knowledge, struggles to survive. However, the virus spreads through cuddles—can he resist the adorable menace?', 'A virus turns humanity into feral cats, leaving a few survivors to fight back. Kunagi, a man with no past but vast cat knowledge, struggles to survive. However, the virus spreads through cuddles—can he resist the adorable menace?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8RK3ejKdkw5KrUNzcURiwGpi9xO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:247045'),
