  ('735678220760379828', 'Old Fashion Cupcake', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Takeshi Miyamoto', 'Kouhei Takeda, Tatsunari Kimura, Atomu Mizuishi, Momoka Ayukawa, Rei Yoshii, Sarara Saitou, Shun Bando', null, 'A workaholic bored with life discovers the rejuvenating power of new experiences — and yummy treats — from a junior employee with a secret crush on him.', 'A workaholic bored with life discovers the rejuvenating power of new experiences — and yummy treats — from a junior employee with a secret crush on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qn5tOHG3JinOS4QlPESMjN4qTcH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203990'),
  ('246433010474282870', 'Old Friends', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Carla Albuquerque, Beto Ribeiro', 'Beto Ribeiro', 'Marili Maria, Adriana Duque, Theo Pires, Aline Neves, Gabriela Gama, Bruno Soares, Emmilio Moreira, Luisa Lucchesi', null, 'Three women, three stories, one friendship. In “Old Friends”, we follow the conflicts of Lurdinha, Violeta and Maria Antonia. Their story take place in the present day and in the past, between 1970’s – 2018.', 'Three women, three stories, one friendship. In “Old Friends”, we follow the conflicts of Lurdinha, Violeta and Maria Antonia. Their story take place in the present day and in the past, between 1970’s – 2018.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9KICFURjyhaVHOfyDmnu4eDhV0c.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:123840'),
  ('710259983307206637', 'Old Money', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'David Schalko', 'David Schalko', 'Udo Kier, Sunnyi Melles, Nicholas Ofczarek, Manuel Rubey, Nora Waldstätten, Florian Teichtmeister, Yohanna Schwertfeger, Thomas Stipsits', 'TV-MA', 'A family, blessed with richness and power, is desperately seeking for a liver for their father, who wants to hand down his wealth to the one who gets the organ.', 'A family, blessed with richness and power, is desperately seeking for a liver for their father, who wants to hand down his wealth to the one who gets the organ.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1hZLTIuLqsjPFwnYSoHVaWmxqP1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62703'),
  ('502460191821883073', 'Old Money', 2025, 'Drama', 'Meriç Acemi', 'Meriç Acemi', 'Engin Akyürek, Aslı Enver, Dolunay Soysert, İsmail Demirci, Serkan Altunorak, Taro Emir Tekin, Zeynep Oymak, Ahmet Utlu', null, 'Nihal''s affluent life comes under threat when a self-made tycoon with an eye for money — and an even sharper one for love — shakes up Istanbul''s elite.', 'Nihal''s affluent life comes under threat when a self-made tycoon with an eye for money — and an even sharper one for love — shakes up Istanbul''s elite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eblsywmEMgaSLp9kVA1mnbCc6Sp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278009'),
  ('1135445735536091886', 'Old School', 2014, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Paul Oliver, Steve Wright', null, 'Bryan Brown, Sam Neill, Sarah Peirse, Hanna Mangan Lawrence, Mark Coles Smith, Peter Phelps, Kate Box', null, 'Ted McCabe, a retired cop, and Lennie Cahill a retired crim, get together to solve crimes, unravel scams and make some cash, while avoiding the wrath of the police and the underworld.', 'Ted McCabe, a retired cop, and Lennie Cahill a retired crim, get together to solve crimes, unravel scams and make some cash, while avoiding the wrath of the police and the underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfJ0UQZBZosM3NOjJ1Wh0x1gdjP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:50841'),
  ('595129463739154777', 'Olene Kadar', 2017, 'Drama', 'Umur Turagay, Feride Kaytan', 'Elif Usman, Sevgi Yılmaz', 'Engin Akyürek, Fahriye Evcen, Sarp Levendoğlu, Gülcan Arslan, Tansu Biçer, Cihat Süvarioğlu, Serpil Gül, Fatih Dokgöz', null, 'Dağhan is a doctor who tries to get his proficiency however, finds himself in jail. He loses his hope, his future, his lover and the most beautiful days of his lives due the crime that he has never committed. He is sentenced to life imprisonment.', 'Dağhan is a doctor who tries to get his proficiency however, finds himself in jail. He loses his hope, his future, his lover and the most beautiful days of his lives due the crime that he has never committed. He is sentenced to life imprisonment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/akBIMMsWkZP3a01a5jhrNL75BCr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69540'),
  ('309518410703008072', 'Olga', 2016, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Yana Troyanova, Vasily Kortukov, Alina Alekseeva, Kseniya Surkova, Yura Borisov, Muhammed Abu-Rizik, Maxim Kostromykin, Anastasia Matveeva', null, 'Olga brings up two children from different marriages, cares about her alcoholic father and tries to adjust her personal life. The eldest daughter Anya is studying in a vocational school, she thinks that she is the only adequate member of the family, and in her life everything will be different. The younger son Timofey, whose father returned to the first family in Azerbaijan, believes that he is already a man, although he is only 11 years old. Olga''s father, Yuri Gennadievich, a former football player, drinks hard and constantly lies, which often leads to scrape. And sister Lena is trying to live at the expense of men - mostly married. Eternally saving relatives from troubles, Olga lives a strange life and rarely thinks of herself until Grisha, a young and positive driver of the “Sable” hearse, falls in love with her.', 'Olga brings up two children from different marriages, cares about her alcoholic father and tries to adjust her personal life. The eldest daughter Anya is studying in a vocational school, she thinks that she is the only adequate member of the family, and in her life everything will be different. The younger son Timofey, whose father returned to the first family in Azerbaijan, believes that he is already a man, although he is only 11 years old. Olga''s father, Yuri Gennadievich, a former football player, drinks hard and constantly lies, which often leads to scrape. And sister Lena is trying to live at the expense of men - mostly married. Eternally saving relatives from troubles, Olga lives a strange life and rarely thinks of herself until Grisha, a young and positive driver of the “Sable” hearse, falls in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yT17ieMQPYF3g9FhluShgGJ4VRq.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:68133'),
