  ('838584680581821782', 'Olive Kitteridge', 2014, 'Drama', 'Jane Anderson', null, 'Frances McDormand, Richard Jenkins, Zoe Kazan, Rosemarie DeWitt, Martha Wainwright, John Gallagher Jr., John T. Mullen, Ann Dowd', 'TV-14', 'A look at a seemingly placid New England town that is actually wrought with illicit affairs, crime and tragedy, all told through the lens of Olive, whose wicked wit and harsh demeanor mask a warm but troubled heart and staunch moral center. The story spans 25 years and focuses on Olive''s relationships with her husband, Henry, the good-hearted and kindly town pharmacist; their son, Christopher, who resents his mother''s approach to parenting; and other members of their community.', 'A look at a seemingly placid New England town that is actually wrought with illicit affairs, crime and tragedy, all told through the lens of Olive, whose wicked wit and harsh demeanor mask a warm but troubled heart and staunch moral center. The story spans 25 years and focuses on Olive''s relationships with her husband, Henry, the good-hearted and kindly town pharmacist; their son, Christopher, who resents his mother''s approach to parenting; and other members of their community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tuB2kGd4is7tFMhcOTfEGB96lm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61585'),
  ('982782034369667747', 'Olive Land', 2021, 'Drama', 'Andreas Georgiou', 'Vana Dimitriou', 'Giorgos Partsalakis, Paschalis Tsarouchas, Antigone Kouloukakos, Angela Gerekou, Koullis Nikolaou, Lydia Koniordou, Stella Fyrogeni, Ifigeneia Tzola', null, 'Three powerful families of Mani are involved in a cycle of blood, hatred, and revenge. In the rugged land of olives, a revenge trap sets to love.', 'Three powerful families of Mani are involved in a cycle of blood, hatred, and revenge. In the rugged land of olives, a revenge trap sets to love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y8vue7CA7kS2z1mPDOILGh4uYeV.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:123644'),
