  ('503523754489954683', 'Our Interpreter', 2024, 'Drama', null, null, 'Victoria Song, Chen Xingxu, Fei Qiming, Lin Zilu, Yu Shasha', null, 'Lin Xi, a rising star in the translation world, reunites with her ex-boyfriend, tech executive Xiao Yicheng, eight years after their breakup. Forced to work together on a major business deal, old feelings resurface as they confront the past and rediscover their shared dream of serving their country on the global stage.', 'Lin Xi, a rising star in the translation world, reunites with her ex-boyfriend, tech executive Xiao Yicheng, eight years after their breakup. Forced to work together on a major business deal, old feelings resurface as they confront the past and rediscover their shared dream of serving their country on the global stage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jwimKU3lj8cyMcGWLMVCrStRkxy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:240439'),
  ('999748941532942016', 'Our Kind of People', 2021, 'Drama', null, null, 'Yaya DaCosta, Morris Chestnut, Alana Kay Bright, Nadine Ellis, Rhyon Nicole Brown, Joe Morton, Kyle Bary, Lance Gross', 'TV-14', 'A strong-willed single mom sets out to reclaim her family''s name and make an impact with her revolutionary haircare line but discovers a dark secret about her own mother''s past that will turn her world upside-down.', 'A strong-willed single mom sets out to reclaim her family''s name and make an impact with her revolutionary haircare line but discovers a dark secret about her own mother''s past that will turn her world upside-down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhXFRWEn8u24eYwujk9PfLLB7uS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128591'),
  ('173979209581696448', 'Our Last Crusade or the Rise of a New World', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics', null, null, 'Yusuke Kobayashi, Sora Amamiya, Kaori Ishihara, Nao Shiraki, Shunichi Toki, Yumiri Hanamori, Ayana Taketatsu, Jun Kasama', 'TV-14', 'For years, a great war has raged on between the scientifically advanced Empire and a paradise of witches known as the Nebulis Sovereignty. This age-old battle sets the scene for a fateful encounter between two young combatants: an imperial swordsman, Iska, and the witch princess, Aliceliese. As sworn enemies, they vow to cut each other down in order to unite their worlds, and yet Iska finds himself entranced by her beauty and righteousness, while Aliceliese is moved by his strength and resolve. In the midst of a never-ending war that forbids them from being together, they have no choice but to destroy each other-or find another way.', 'For years, a great war has raged on between the scientifically advanced Empire and a paradise of witches known as the Nebulis Sovereignty. This age-old battle sets the scene for a fateful encounter between two young combatants: an imperial swordsman, Iska, and the witch princess, Aliceliese. As sworn enemies, they vow to cut each other down in order to unite their worlds, and yet Iska finds himself entranced by her beauty and righteousness, while Aliceliese is moved by his strength and resolve. In the midst of a never-ending war that forbids them from being together, they have no choice but to destroy each other-or find another way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1VtaTXsHTRfh8m49OVJfMb4JVuh.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:101972'),
  ('411960604014389055', 'Our Living World', 2024, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Cate Blanchett', 'TV-PG', 'This stunning nature series narrated by Cate Blanchett explores the intelligence, resourcefulness and interconnectedness of life on our planet.', 'This stunning nature series narrated by Cate Blanchett explores the intelligence, resourcefulness and interconnectedness of life on our planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1xUhIpdJOna0vGmUohTC9hnWaRj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213612'),
  ('271038831749475703', 'Our Love Has Always Been 10 Centimeters Apart.', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama, Animation', null, null, 'Kenichi Suzumura, Aki Toyosaki, Hiroshi Kamiya, Haruka Tomatsu, Yuki Kaji, Kana Asumi, Hikaru Midorikawa', 'TV-14', 'The moment Miou Aida first met Haruki Serizawa at the Sakuragaoka High School Entrance Ceremony they both felt an unexplainable connection. Despite their completely different personalities, they found themselves walking home together after school every day. As they spend more time together, their feelings for each other grow stronger.', 'The moment Miou Aida first met Haruki Serizawa at the Sakuragaoka High School Entrance Ceremony they both felt an unexplainable connection. Despite their completely different personalities, they found themselves walking home together after school every day. As they spend more time together, their feelings for each other grow stronger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJ4DavCdbDx29tQQNlGkC56jeKV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74094'),
  ('1073071505366444676', 'Our Love Songs', 2021, 'Soap', 'Ana Casaca', null, 'Ricardo Pereira, Alexandre Martins, Joana Santos, Rosa Villa, Filipa Nascimento, Ivo Lucas, Joana Aguiar, Inês Pires Tavares', null, 'This is the story of a woman who fell in love and was betrayed. Her beloved was successful at the expense of a song that stole from her, while she was forced to fight for survival, far from her homeland. It is also the story of a girl forced to mature quickly, to raise her daughter, without knowing that, after all, it was not her daughter she was raising...', 'This is the story of a woman who fell in love and was betrayed. Her beloved was successful at the expense of a song that stole from her, while she was forced to fight for survival, far from her homeland. It is also the story of a girl forced to mature quickly, to raise her daughter, without knowing that, after all, it was not her daughter she was raising...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36fKOfOmAVwITWdBIUGLppIMRZ0.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:115810'),
  ('504589750552950248', 'Our Miracle Years', 2020, 'Drama', null, null, 'Thomas Sarbacher, Rafi Guessous, Piet Fuchs, Damian Hardung, Rocío Luz', 'TV-14', 'In a politically, morally and economically destroyed country, three sisters of an industrialist family in post-war Germany reinvent themselves and set the course for their future.', 'In a politically, morally and economically destroyed country, three sisters of an industrialist family in post-war Germany reinvent themselves and set the course for their future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2Lp7iXGfa1Qf1WVKyqmel9Gh2P.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:100622'),
