  ('679434141562297888', 'Our Universe', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jung Yeo Jin, Lee Hyeon Seok', null, 'Bae In-hyuk, Roh Jeong-eui, Park Seo-ham, Ku Sung-hwan, Choi Gyu-ri, Oh Hyun-joong, Park Yoo-ho', null, 'Two in-laws forced to raise their orphaned nephew together slowly overcome their misunderstandings, finding personal growth and an unexpected romance through co-parenting under one roof.', 'Two in-laws forced to raise their orphaned nephew together slowly overcome their misunderstandings, finding personal growth and an unexpected romance through co-parenting under one roof.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWyRkjNI9FUMpqJOIK3kSAbbRfQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:297424'),
  ('143152768762192959', 'Our Unwritten Seoul', 2025, 'Drama', null, 'Lee Kang', 'Park Bo-young, Jinyoung, Park Yoon-ho, Kim Sun-young, Jang Young-nam, Lim Cheol-soo, Ryu Kyung-soo, Cha Mi-kyeong', 'TV-MA', 'Twin sisters, whose similarities end with their looks, swap identities amid personal struggles — embarking on a journey to rediscover love and life.', 'Twin sisters, whose similarities end with their looks, swap identities amid personal struggles — embarking on a journey to rediscover love and life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4wnCkk4HmIzBuyyFGpcGxPKsyjI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:261980'),
  ('236205710489913517', 'Our Welsh Chapel Dream', 2024, 'Reality', null, null, 'Keith Brymer Jones, Marj Hogarth, Gruffudd Glyn', null, 'Keith Brymer Jones and his partner Marj throw themselves into the restoration of a derelict chapel in Wales. As they explore their new home, it seems they''re not alone...', 'Keith Brymer Jones and his partner Marj throw themselves into the restoration of a derelict chapel in Wales. As they explore their new home, it seems they''re not alone...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPe9KsZU5WwFxE23m49FMKUZsdC.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:253671'),
  ('545139757419240783', 'Our World War', 2014, 'Drama', null, null, 'Shaun Dooley, Gerard Kearns, John Hollingworth, Luke Norris, Danny Walters, Ryan Kiggell, Anna Bolton, Michael Socha', null, 'Our World War is a gripping factual drama series offering viewers first-hand experience of the extraordinary bravery of young soldiers fighting 100 years ago. Drawing on real stories of World War One soldiers it uses the visual techniques and imagery familiar from modern warfare – POV helmet camera footage, surveillance images and night vision – to immerse the BBC Three audience in life on the Western Front. Each episode is closely based on first-hand testimony, interviews and memoirs that reveal often hidden and sometimes disturbing aspects of the combat experience.', 'Our World War is a gripping factual drama series offering viewers first-hand experience of the extraordinary bravery of young soldiers fighting 100 years ago. Drawing on real stories of World War One soldiers it uses the visual techniques and imagery familiar from modern warfare – POV helmet camera footage, surveillance images and night vision – to immerse the BBC Three audience in life on the Western Front. Each episode is closely based on first-hand testimony, interviews and memoirs that reveal often hidden and sometimes disturbing aspects of the combat experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2IlaZm6UCbaXNDaEbo4YqcYObHb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61251'),
  ('731935389275329173', 'Our Youth', 2024, 'Drama', null, null, 'Junsei Motojima, Kamimura Kenshin, Yuki Imai, Miyaji Itsuki, Kazuki Horike, Koji Seki, Aki Nishihara, Shuji Okui', null, 'Jin Minase, a dedicated student, finds his routine disrupted when he repeatedly encounters Hirukawa, a classmate from a rough neighborhood. Their unexpected interactions make Jin question his own life choices.', 'Jin Minase, a dedicated student, finds his routine disrupted when he repeatedly encounters Hirukawa, a classmate from a rough neighborhood. Their unexpected interactions make Jin question his own life choices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g16xZN4PMqGOLje9tgDBTRpL48S.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:272512'),
  ('74756017444603291', 'Our Zoo', 2014, 'Drama, Family', 'Matt Charman', null, 'Lee Ingleby, Honor Kneafsey, Amelia Clarkson, Liz White, Anne Reid, Peter Wight, Ralf Little, Sophia Myles', 'TV-G', 'The story of George, who being frustrated by memories of fighting in the great war and living with his extended family, wants to bring more beauty into the world. When he comes across a camel and monkey that are about to be abandoned, he embarks on a plan to set up a zoo.', 'The story of George, who being frustrated by memories of fighting in the great war and living with his extended family, wants to bring more beauty into the world. When he comes across a camel and monkey that are about to be abandoned, he embarks on a plan to set up a zoo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Nz07tWxibDb44epJ7Aj6UoXGei.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61331'),
  ('336152362365311913', 'Ouran High School Host Club', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Maaya Sakamoto, Mamoru Miyano, Ayaka Saito, Kenichi Suzumura, Masaya Matsukaze, Daisuke Kirii, Keisuke Oda', 'TV-14', 'New student Haruhi stumbles on the Ouran High School Host Club, an all-male group that makes money by entertaining the girls of the school.', 'New student Haruhi stumbles on the Ouran High School Host Club, an all-male group that makes money by entertaining the girls of the school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2bO4wYNTYSC2mV0YvomZtaHRLMp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1043'),
  ('379204035919398556', 'Ouran High School Host Club', 2011, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Haruna Kawaguchi, Yusuke Yamamoto, Shunsuke Daitoh, Masaya Nakamura, Yudai Chiba, Ogawa Momoe, Nicola, Nana Seino', null, 'The story revolves around a highschool girl named Fujioka Haruhi at the prestigious Ouran Academy, who stumbles upon a group of male students who have formed their own club as hosts. Accidentally breaking an antique vase, Haruhi ends up owing the club a vast amount of money, and she ends up posing as a host in order to repay her debt.', 'The story revolves around a highschool girl named Fujioka Haruhi at the prestigious Ouran Academy, who stumbles upon a group of male students who have formed their own club as hosts. Accidentally breaking an antique vase, Haruhi ends up owing the club a vast amount of money, and she ends up posing as a host in order to repay her debt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/azovU0lypxYKWE7ifTXamRGmtxB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72158'),
  ('129357687959759546', 'Ouro Verde', 2017, 'Drama, Soap', 'Maria João Costa', null, 'Diogo Morgado, Manuela Couto, Ana Sofia Martins, Rodrigo Paganelli, Nuno Homem de Sá, Nuno Pardal, Úrsula Corona, Mafalda Marafusta', null, 'Zé Maria Magalhães is an innocent young man who, suddenly, sees his dreams and family destroyed by a man''s greed: Miguel Ferreira da Fonseca, a powerful banker. For 15 years, Zé Maria is forced to remain hidden, in a life of lies, in another country, imprisoned by the memories of the past, having to assume a new identity. Today, he is a great farmer, owner of the Ouro Verde empire, known as Jorge Monforte, and has become one of the richest men in Brazil. The course of time only fueled his desire for revenge, making him lose the sense of right and wrong and the ability to love. Fifteen years later, he returns to Portugal, ready to avenge the past and destroy Miguel Ferreira da Fonseca.', 'Zé Maria Magalhães is an innocent young man who, suddenly, sees his dreams and family destroyed by a man''s greed: Miguel Ferreira da Fonseca, a powerful banker. For 15 years, Zé Maria is forced to remain hidden, in a life of lies, in another country, imprisoned by the memories of the past, having to assume a new identity. Today, he is a great farmer, owner of the Ouro Verde empire, known as Jorge Monforte, and has become one of the richest men in Brazil. The course of time only fueled his desire for revenge, making him lose the sense of right and wrong and the ability to love. Fifteen years later, he returns to Portugal, ready to avenge the past and destroy Miguel Ferreira da Fonseca.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2hJN6OVo8FL0C9mXl3DJ3uM96Sj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69692'),
  ('145921896490329512', 'Ouroboros', 2015, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Toma Ikuta, Shun Oguri, Juri Ueno, Yoh Yoshida, Tsuyoshi Muro, Nana Seino, Ken Mitsuishi, Kenichi Takitoh', null, '"Ouroboros" is an ancient symbol that depicts a snake eating its own tail - meaning infinity. Based on a popular comic, a clumsy detective and a cool gang stand up to true evil. Ikuo and Tatsuya grew up in a children''s orphanage together. When their favorite teacher, Yuiko, is murdered, a policeman wearing a gold watch covers up the incident. Ikuo and Tatsuya promise each other to avenge their teacher someday. Twenty years later, Ikuo is a detective in Shinjuku second police station investigating various cases with elite detective - Mizuki, while smart and handsome Tatsuya has become one of the top members of a gang group.', '"Ouroboros" is an ancient symbol that depicts a snake eating its own tail - meaning infinity. Based on a popular comic, a clumsy detective and a cool gang stand up to true evil. Ikuo and Tatsuya grew up in a children''s orphanage together. When their favorite teacher, Yuiko, is murdered, a policeman wearing a gold watch covers up the incident. Ikuo and Tatsuya promise each other to avenge their teacher someday. Twenty years later, Ikuo is a detective in Shinjuku second police station investigating various cases with elite detective - Mizuki, while smart and handsome Tatsuya has become one of the top members of a gang group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agTVj7BTYf3jVqHceTEYKyFBm5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62036'),
  ('1103689008665019505', 'Ousama Game The Animation', 2017, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Mamoru Miyano, Mao Ichimichi, Sasaki Yusuke', null, 'Kanazawa Nobuaki has transferred to a high school far from where he used to live. Due to an incident at his old school, Nobuaki is afraid of getting close to his new classmates and keeps himself at a distance, but he starts opening up because of a sports day inter-class relay. Then a single text message from someone calling themselves the "King" is sent to everyone in class. Nobuaki''s classmates think it''s a simple prank and don''t take it seriously - but Nobuaki knows that a death game is about to begin, and struggles to oppose it...', 'Kanazawa Nobuaki has transferred to a high school far from where he used to live. Due to an incident at his old school, Nobuaki is afraid of getting close to his new classmates and keeps himself at a distance, but he starts opening up because of a sports day inter-class relay. Then a single text message from someone calling themselves the "King" is sent to everyone in class. Nobuaki''s classmates think it''s a simple prank and don''t take it seriously - but Nobuaki knows that a death game is about to begin, and struggles to oppose it...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dC5colSokrouEjhWUVbIJjwVEUC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74183'),
  ('632761772630905140', 'Oussekine', 2022, 'Drama', 'Antoine Chevrollier, Cédric Ido', 'Antoine Chevrollier, Faïza Guène, Cédric Ido', 'Kad Merad, Sayyid El Alami, Hiam Abbass, Olivier Gourmet, Laurent Stocker, Tewfik Jallab, Slimane Dazi, Malek Lamraoui', null, 'An examination of the terrible true events of December 5, 1986, that led to the death of a young student, Malik Oussekine. Centred on his family’s fight for justice, the series explores the enormous impact this high-profile case had on French society.', 'An examination of the terrible true events of December 5, 1986, that led to the death of a young student, Malik Oussekine. Centred on his family’s fight for justice, the series explores the enormous impact this high-profile case had on French society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5sE8o3CqYcYybSWG5AbWBIUIK8v.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:119060'),
  ('1060756312589761297', 'Out of Jimmy''s Head', 2007, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Adam Pava, Tim McKeon', null, 'Carlos Alazraqui, Tom Kenny, Brian Posehn, Ellen Greene, Dominic Janes, Matt Knudsen, Rachel Quaintance, Bil Dwyer', null, 'Teenager Jimmy Roberts had a brain transplant and ended up with famous cartoonist Milt Appleday''s frozen brain full of animated characters. Jimmy sees all the characters in his everyday life and his best friend Craig''s older sister Robin is a huge Appleday fan and the prettiest girl in school. There''s just one problem ... Milt''s son Sonny is trying to steal the brain back to pass the art off as his own.', 'Teenager Jimmy Roberts had a brain transplant and ended up with famous cartoonist Milt Appleday''s frozen brain full of animated characters. Jimmy sees all the characters in his everyday life and his best friend Craig''s older sister Robin is a huge Appleday fan and the prettiest girl in school. There''s just one problem ... Milt''s son Sonny is trying to steal the brain back to pass the art off as his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHoxt6fqmFoPkALte9MPtaboFC1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14241'),
  ('48653304047880926', 'Out of Practice', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Joe Keenan', null, 'Christopher Gorham, Paula Marshall, Ty Burrell, Henry Winkler, Stockard Channing, Jennifer Tilly', null, 'Out of Practice is an American situation comedy', 'Out of Practice is an American situation comedy', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jB6tMfbCmSN2Cl57XtOtlrXbufj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4474'),
  ('202298401630635815', 'Out of This World', 1987, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Kids', 'John Boni, Bob Booker', null, 'Maureen Flannigan, Donna Pescow, Doug McClure, Joe Alaskey, Steve Burton, Buzz Belmondo, Christina Nigra, Burt Reynolds', null, 'Out Of This World is an American fantasy sitcom about a teenage girl who is half alien, which gives her unique supernatural powers. It first aired in syndication from September 17, 1987 and ended on May 25, 1991. During its first season, the series was originally part of NBC''s Prime Time Begins at 7:30 campaign, in which the network''s owned-and-operated stations would run first-run sitcoms in the 7:30-8 pm time slot to counterprogram competing stations'' game shows, sitcom reruns and other offerings. Out of This World was rotated with the original series Marblehead Manor and She''s the Sheriff, a syndicated revival of the 1983 sitcom We Got It Made, and a television adaptation of the play You Can''t Take It With You. NBC ended the experiment after the 1987-88 season due to the low ratings put up by three of the series, with Out of This World being one of the two that was renewed. After its first season the series was largely moved to weekend time slots, where it remained until its cancellation following the fourth season.', 'Out Of This World is an American fantasy sitcom about a teenage girl who is half alien, which gives her unique supernatural powers. It first aired in syndication from September 17, 1987 and ended on May 25, 1991. During its first season, the series was originally part of NBC''s Prime Time Begins at 7:30 campaign, in which the network''s owned-and-operated stations would run first-run sitcoms in the 7:30-8 pm time slot to counterprogram competing stations'' game shows, sitcom reruns and other offerings. Out of This World was rotated with the original series Marblehead Manor and She''s the Sheriff, a syndicated revival of the 1983 sitcom We Got It Made, and a television adaptation of the play You Can''t Take It With You. NBC ended the experiment after the 1987-88 season due to the low ratings put up by three of the series, with Out of This World being one of the two that was renewed. After its first season the series was largely moved to weekend time slots, where it remained until its cancellation following the fourth season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bUT4VPKzb6qddIN9sc5ewsREKyq.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1578'),
  ('637855804835687391', 'Outback Truckers', 2012, 'Reality', null, null, 'Luke Hewitt', 'TV-14', 'Jump in the cab with some of the men and women behind the wheel of monster road trains and reveals what life is really like on the wide-open road. Highly dramatic, often humorous, Outback Truckers reveals the true blue heart and soul of Aussie trucking.', 'Jump in the cab with some of the men and women behind the wheel of monster road trains and reveals what life is really like on the wide-open road. Highly dramatic, often humorous, Outback Truckers reveals the true blue heart and soul of Aussie trucking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y9mvw5cdegmZT2rpadwcEu0ee2.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:59124'),
  ('487517478479269859', 'Outbreak', 2020, 'Drama', null, 'Bernard Dansereau, Annie Piérard', 'Julie Le Breton', 'TV-MA', 'A dangerous virus appears in a group of homeless people, causing a risk of outbreak. How long will it take Anne-Marie Leclerc, director of the Emergency Public Health Laboratory, to realize that an actual epidemic is starting to take shape?', 'A dangerous virus appears in a group of homeless people, causing a risk of outbreak. How long will it take Anne-Marie Leclerc, director of the Emergency Public Health Laboratory, to realize that an actual epidemic is starting to take shape?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dwfYZrGs898pSfMU3IxR4fim3Nu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95515'),
  ('377359679867968362', 'Outbreak Company', 2013, 'Drama, Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Natsuki Hanae, Suzuko Mimori, Mai Fuchigami, Maaya Uchida, Keiji Fujiwara, Sumire Uesaka, Shin-ichiro Miki, Kazuya Ichijo', 'TV-14', 'What starts out as a simple job soon becomes an adventure in an alternate world when otaku-expert Shinichi Kanou is unknowingly sent as an otaku-culture ambassador to the land of the Holy Eldant Empire.', 'What starts out as a simple job soon becomes an adventure in an alternate world when otaku-expert Shinichi Kanou is unknowingly sent as an otaku-culture ambassador to the land of the Holy Eldant Empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iiMG41ewNxmJGfL3yzbT9JpQ414.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62691'),
  ('850877094012020025', 'Outcast', 2016, 'Mystery, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Robert Kirkman', null, 'Patrick Fugit, Philip Glenister, Wrenn Schmidt, Reg E. Cathey, Brent Spiner, Madeleine McGraw', 'TV-MA', 'Kyle Barnes has been plagued by possession since he was a child. Now an adult, he embarks on a spiritual journey to find answers, but what he uncovers could mean the end of life on Earth as we know it.', 'Kyle Barnes has been plagued by possession since he was a child. Now an adult, he embarks on a spiritual journey to find answers, but what he uncovers could mean the end of life on Earth as we know it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6ZCpAPDTAHuNxBGq5nU4nqpfYA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:64394'),
  ('656242056909119999', 'Outcasts', 2011, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Bharat Nalluri, Omar Madha, Andy Goddard', null, 'Daniel Mays, Hermione Norris, Liam Cunningham, Ashley Walters, Amy Manson, Eric Mabius, Michael Legge, Langley Kirkwood', null, 'Seeking the chance to build a better future, a group of courageous pioneers departs Earth for Carpathia, a newly discovered planet in a distant galaxy. Led by President Richard Tate and his core team of Stella, Cass and Fleur, the pioneers settle in the town of Forthaven, creating a society there alongside expeditionaries Mitchell and Jack. Having embraced all the challenges that come with forging a new beginning, the townspeople work hard to preserve what they''ve built on Carpathia, and even as they long for those left behind, there is optimism about the future. But while they try to learn from mistakes made on Earth, there is no avoiding the human pitfalls of love, greed, lust and loss.', 'Seeking the chance to build a better future, a group of courageous pioneers departs Earth for Carpathia, a newly discovered planet in a distant galaxy. Led by President Richard Tate and his core team of Stella, Cass and Fleur, the pioneers settle in the town of Forthaven, creating a society there alongside expeditionaries Mitchell and Jack. Having embraced all the challenges that come with forging a new beginning, the townspeople work hard to preserve what they''ve built on Carpathia, and even as they long for those left behind, there is optimism about the future. But while they try to learn from mistakes made on Earth, there is no avoiding the human pitfalls of love, greed, lust and loss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QUfhOHzbLDhgOmedXH7gMC8ezK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34438'),
  ('621546833691709671', 'Outcry', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Greg Kelley', 'TV-MA', 'A five-part documentary series examining the gripping story of high school football star Greg Kelley who was convicted of sexual assault of a four-year-old boy, and sentenced to 25 years in prison with no possibility for parole. But a groundswell of support emerged for Kelley, calling into question the investigation, the prosecution''s tactics and ultimately, the validity of the conviction.', 'A five-part documentary series examining the gripping story of high school football star Greg Kelley who was convicted of sexual assault of a four-year-old boy, and sentenced to 25 years in prison with no possibility for parole. But a groundswell of support emerged for Kelley, calling into question the investigation, the prosecution''s tactics and ultimately, the validity of the conviction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d3ReaxwpkwkROl1BaK4rUeXqOyP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103050'),
  ('295901194459193461', 'OutDaughtered', 2016, 'Reality', null, null, 'Danielle Busby, Adam Busby', 'TV-PG', '40 bottles a day, 420 diapers a week and feedings every three hours became the new normal for Danielle and Adam Busby when they welcomed home the only all-female set of quintuplets in the country. The family of three became a family of eight overnight, and TLC follows that incredible journey in the new series "OUTDAUGHTERED". The series captures Danielle, Adam and their adorable 4-year-old daughter Blayke as they adjust to their new life, while trying to hold on to the identities and lives they had cultivated before the five new additions arrived. Following the hilarious and heartwarming antics of the entire family including Danielle''s zany mother, Michelle, and her older twin sisters and their families, it''s all hands on deck as the family relies on their tight-knit circle to make the most out of this incredible lifetime adventure.', '40 bottles a day, 420 diapers a week and feedings every three hours became the new normal for Danielle and Adam Busby when they welcomed home the only all-female set of quintuplets in the country. The family of three became a family of eight overnight, and TLC follows that incredible journey in the new series "OUTDAUGHTERED". The series captures Danielle, Adam and their adorable 4-year-old daughter Blayke as they adjust to their new life, while trying to hold on to the identities and lives they had cultivated before the five new additions arrived. Following the hilarious and heartwarming antics of the entire family including Danielle''s zany mother, Michelle, and her older twin sisters and their families, it''s all hands on deck as the family relies on their tight-knit circle to make the most out of this incredible lifetime adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7wOKP090VOcdDNdKcK0Hw76dxN1.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:66461'),
  ('316563856222251794', 'Outer Banks', 2020, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Mystery', 'Shannon Burke, Jonas Pate, Josh Pate', null, 'Chase Stokes, Madelyn Cline, Madison Bailey, Jonathan Daviss, Carlacia Grant, Rudy Pankow, Drew Starkey, J Anthony Crane', 'TV-MA', 'A tight-knit group of teens unearths a long-buried secret, setting off a chain of illicit events that takes them on an adventure they''ll never forget.', 'A tight-knit group of teens unearths a long-buried secret, setting off a chain of illicit events that takes them on an adventure they''ll never forget.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovDgO2LPfwdVRfvScAqo9aMiIW.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:100757'),
  ('255108478009347640', 'Outer Range', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Brian Watkins', null, 'Josh Brolin, Imogen Poots, Lili Taylor, Tom Pelphrey, Tamara Podemski, Lewis Pullman, Noah Reid, Shaun Sipos', 'TV-MA', 'A rancher fighting for his land and family stumbles upon an unfathomable mystery at the edge of Wyoming’s wilderness, forcing a confrontation with the Unknown in ways both intimate and cosmic in the untamable American West.', 'A rancher fighting for his land and family stumbles upon an unfathomable mystery at the edge of Wyoming’s wilderness, forcing a confrontation with the Unknown in ways both intimate and cosmic in the untamable American West.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9leGmIDamsWJELYz0pZkr2EXUFf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:113985'),
  ('814365063586905934', 'Outlander', 2014, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ronald D. Moore', 'Madeline Brestal, Evan McGahey', 'Caitríona Balfe, Sam Heughan, Sophie Skelton, Richard Rankin, John Bell, David Berry, César Domboy, Lauren Lyle', 'TV-MA', 'The story of Claire Randall, a married combat nurse from 1945 who is mysteriously swept back in time to 1743, where she is immediately thrown into an unknown world where her life is threatened. When she is forced to marry Jamie, a chivalrous and romantic young Scottish warrior, a passionate affair is ignited that tears Claire''s heart between two vastly different men in two irreconcilable lives.', 'The story of Claire Randall, a married combat nurse from 1945 who is mysteriously swept back in time to 1743, where she is immediately thrown into an unknown world where her life is threatened. When she is forced to marry Jamie, a chivalrous and romantic young Scottish warrior, a passionate affair is ignited that tears Claire''s heart between two vastly different men in two irreconcilable lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bxBmfyzK0ARF9hqf2pbFWsddH14.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:56570'),
  ('532757017761933306', 'Outlander: Blood of My Blood', 2025, 'Drama', 'Matthew B. Roberts', 'Macy Grace Smolsky', 'Harriet Slater, Jamie Roy, Hermione Corfield, Jeremy Irvine, Tony Curran, Séamus McLean Ross, Sam Retford, Rory Alexander', 'TV-MA', 'From the battlefields of World War I to the rugged Highlands of 18th century Scotland, two fated couples must defy the forces that seek to tear them apart, unfolding in surprising and unforeseen ways in this romantic saga that unfolds across time.', 'From the battlefields of World War I to the rugged Highlands of 18th century Scotland, two fated couples must defy the forces that seek to tear them apart, unfolding in surprising and unforeseen ways in this romantic saga that unfolds across time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5iW51VQe9GCGhMMeKdmQL3jgCg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207484'),
  ('932374815941579662', 'Outlast', 2023, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'In the extreme Alaskan wild, 16 survivalists compete for a chance to win a massive cash prize — but these lone wolves must be part of a team to win.', 'In the extreme Alaskan wild, 16 survivalists compete for a chance to win a massive cash prize — but these lone wolves must be part of a team to win.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPvFth5XCdF7TfpPOFvMUXYOpsQ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:220115'),
  ('196534620843859889', 'Outlaw Star', 1998, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Drama', 'Takehito Ito', null, 'Shigeru Shibuya, Rica Matsumoto, Ayako Kawasumi, Sayuri, Yuko Miyamura, Toshihiko Seki, Kazuhiro Nakata, Tsutomu Kashiwakura', 'TV-14', 'Gene Starwind is a jack-of-all-trades responsible for odd jobs and bounty hunting with his partner, Jim Hawking. Stuck on a rundown planet, he’s going nowhere fast. But when a bodyguard job goes sideways, he finds himself the proud owner of the Outlaw Star and on an adventure to find the mysterious Galactic Leyline. Facing pirates and dangers galore, can he survive the journey through space?', 'Gene Starwind is a jack-of-all-trades responsible for odd jobs and bounty hunting with his partner, Jim Hawking. Stuck on a rundown planet, he’s going nowhere fast. But when a bodyguard job goes sideways, he finds himself the proud owner of the Outlaw Star and on an adventure to find the mysterious Galactic Leyline. Facing pirates and dangers galore, can he survive the journey through space?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lSD3robi0EDLEucVoLFgaBuFRQt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35106'),
  ('907535848443985797', 'Outlaws', 1960, 'Western, Drama', null, null, 'Barton MacLane, Slim Pickens, Don Collier, Bruce Yarnell', null, 'Outlaws is an NBC Western television series, starring Barton MacLane as U.S. marshal Frank Caine, who operated in a lawless section of Oklahoma Territory about Stillwater. The program aired 50 one-hour episodes from September 29, 1960, to May 10, 1962. The first season was shot in black-and-white, the second in color. Co-starring with MacLane in the 1960–1961 season was Don Collier as deputy marshal Will Foreman. In the second season, MacLane left the program, and Collier was promoted to full marshal, with Bruce Yarnell joining the cast as deputy marshal Chalk Breeson. Jock Gaynor appeared in the first season as deputy Heck Martin, the on-screen nephew of Will Foreman. Slim Pickens appeared as "Slim" in the second season. Judy Lewis also appeared the second season as Connie Masters, an employee of the Wells Fargo office in Stillwater. The dog who appeared in Walt Disney''s Old Yeller was also cast in The Outlaws. Others who appeared on the program on at least three occasions were Vic Morrow, Cliff Robertson, Pippa Scott, and Harry Townes. In addition, John Anderson, Edgar Buchanan, Jackie Coogan, Bruce Gordon, Robert Harland, Robert Lansing Cloris Leachman, Robert Karnes, Brian Keith, Larry Pennell, Chris Robinson, William Shatner, Ray Walston, Jack Warden, and David Wayne each appeared twice in the series.', 'Outlaws is an NBC Western television series, starring Barton MacLane as U.S. marshal Frank Caine, who operated in a lawless section of Oklahoma Territory about Stillwater. The program aired 50 one-hour episodes from September 29, 1960, to May 10, 1962. The first season was shot in black-and-white, the second in color. Co-starring with MacLane in the 1960–1961 season was Don Collier as deputy marshal Will Foreman. In the second season, MacLane left the program, and Collier was promoted to full marshal, with Bruce Yarnell joining the cast as deputy marshal Chalk Breeson. Jock Gaynor appeared in the first season as deputy Heck Martin, the on-screen nephew of Will Foreman. Slim Pickens appeared as "Slim" in the second season. Judy Lewis also appeared the second season as Connie Masters, an employee of the Wells Fargo office in Stillwater. The dog who appeared in Walt Disney''s Old Yeller was also cast in The Outlaws. Others who appeared on the program on at least three occasions were Vic Morrow, Cliff Robertson, Pippa Scott, and Harry Townes. In addition, John Anderson, Edgar Buchanan, Jackie Coogan, Bruce Gordon, Robert Harland, Robert Lansing Cloris Leachman, Robert Karnes, Brian Keith, Larry Pennell, Chris Robinson, William Shatner, Ray Walston, Jack Warden, and David Wayne each appeared twice in the series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93BqkPyaI0nt7w4YSEbkSauKfUz.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:8270'),
  ('787103717815265137', 'Outmatched', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Lon Zimmet', null, 'Jason Biggs, Maggie Lawson, Ashley Boettcher, Connor Kalopsis, Jack Stanton, Oakley Bull', 'TV-14', 'A blue-collar couple in Atlantic City tries to raise four kids – three of whom just happen to be certified geniuses.', 'A blue-collar couple in Atlantic City tries to raise four kids – three of whom just happen to be certified geniuses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hdjUHBVibA5tS0o3ML5d2Bp0fVW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96652'),
  ('591587170169726881', 'Outnumbered', 2007, 'Comedy, Family', 'Andy Hamilton, Guy Jenkin', null, 'Claire Skinner, Hugh Dennis, Tyger Drew-Honey, Daniel Roche, Ramona Marquez', 'NR', 'Partly-improvised sitcom looking at the trials and tribulations of bringing up three young children - a regal five-year-old girl with a talent for interrogation, a seven-year-old boy who could fib for Britain and an 11-year-old who is gearing up for his scary first day at secondary school.', 'Partly-improvised sitcom looking at the trials and tribulations of bringing up three young children - a regal five-year-old girl with a talent for interrogation, a seven-year-old boy who could fib for Britain and an 11-year-old who is gearing up for his scary first day at secondary school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h8uJc3UALqeAEXzckKykoke0VoU.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:12784'),
  ('378270158517153649', 'Outrageous', 2025, 'Drama', 'Sarah Williams', null, 'Bessie Carter, Zoe Brough, Orla Hill, Isobel Jesper Jones, Joanna Vanderham, James Purefoy, Anna Chancellor, Joshua Sasse', null, 'Based on the story of the Mitford sisters, six sisters who refused to play by the rules and whose often-scandalous lives made headlines around the world. Set in the 1930s, it is a tale of betrayal, scandal, heartache and even imprisonment.', 'Based on the story of the Mitford sisters, six sisters who refused to play by the rules and whose often-scandalous lives made headlines around the world. Set in the 1930s, it is a tale of betrayal, scandal, heartache and even imprisonment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRIzK09lEfYFkmAEE1sUjFlnyoB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:261668'),
  ('361562420047890857', 'Outrageous Fortune', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'James Griffin, Rachel Lang', null, 'Antonia Prebble, Grant Bowler, Robyn Malcolm, Shane Cortese, Antony Starr, Siobhan Marshall, Frank Whitten, David Fane', null, 'After her husband is incarcerated, matriarch Cheryl decides that her career criminal family should go straight and abide by the law.', 'After her husband is incarcerated, matriarch Cheryl decides that her career criminal family should go straight and abide by the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sDhdfXiBZnIO9xhpjMaHG8kJ7yY.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:1799'),
  ('821843043484784301', 'Outsiders', 2016, 'Drama', 'Peter Mattei', null, 'David Morse, Ryan Hurst, Gillian Alexy, Kyle Gallner, Thomas M. Wright, Christina Jackson, Danielle Brickman, Laurie Klatscher', 'TV-MA', 'A struggle for power and control set in the rugged and mysterious hills of Appalachia, "Outsiders" tells the story of the Farrell clan, a family of outsiders who''ve been in these parts since before anyone can remember. Living off the grid and above the law on their mountaintop homestead, they''ll protect their world and defend their way of life using any means necessary.', 'A struggle for power and control set in the rugged and mysterious hills of Appalachia, "Outsiders" tells the story of the Farrell clan, a family of outsiders who''ve been in these parts since before anyone can remember. Living off the grid and above the law on their mountaintop homestead, they''ll protect their world and defend their way of life using any means necessary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPKJwmLmcTLwvJhpeKUhWIHlDp3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:64437'),
  ('704560433835960440', 'Outsource', 2025, 'Drama', null, 'Anna Kozlova', 'Ivan Yankovsky, Eldar Kalimulin, Danil Steklov, Dmitriy Sumin, Leonid Telezhinskiy, Vitaliy Kovalenko, Karina Aleksandrova, Daria Kotreleva', null, 'In the mid-90s, when the death penalty was still allowed, a new employee appeared in the special purpose prison. Like his colleagues, Kostya will have to carry out death sentences. But he has a special view of justice. After meeting with the father of one of the victims, Kostya realizes that it is close people who have the right to carry out punishment. Besides, you can make good money on it. For example, they never dreamed of the kind of money that a mother offered for the murder of her daughter''s rapist.', 'In the mid-90s, when the death penalty was still allowed, a new employee appeared in the special purpose prison. Like his colleagues, Kostya will have to carry out death sentences. But he has a special view of justice. After meeting with the father of one of the victims, Kostya realizes that it is close people who have the right to carry out punishment. Besides, you can make good money on it. For example, they never dreamed of the kind of money that a mother offered for the murder of her daughter''s rapist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/taPIBDUCWObeYVPUOdRCHlb1ady.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:250703'),
  ('229646812788763058', 'Outsourced', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Bob Borden', null, 'Ben Rappaport, Rebecca Hazlewood, Sacha Dhawan, Rizwan Manji, Parvesh Cheena, Anisha Nagarajan, Diedrich Bader, Pippa Black', 'TV-14', 'A lone American manages the new call center of an American novelties company in Bombay and must explain American popular culture to his employees as he tries to understand Indian culture.', 'A lone American manages the new call center of an American novelties company in Bombay and must explain American popular culture to his employees as he tries to understand Indian culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tE9lH8OpF8qExJYmz28tMLUlhjD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32694'),
  ('331920142615125230', 'Över Atlanten', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, 'Gunnar Krantz, Tess Merkel, Per Elofsson, Samir Badran, Rachel Mohlin, Rickard Olsson, Thomas Sjögren', null, 'Six famous Swedes embark on the greatest adventure of their lives - a voyage across the Atlantic. 500 miles on the high seas. Surrendered to the forces of the weather - and each other.', 'Six famous Swedes embark on the greatest adventure of their lives - a voyage across the Atlantic. 500 miles on the high seas. Surrendered to the forces of the weather - and each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rIsTnp4VSbKPbVHYQXBtyrcqBuU.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:133574'),
  ('751993602524669656', 'Over Christmas', 2020, 'Comedy', null, 'Dennis Eick, Tobi Baumann, Tanja Bubbel', 'Luke Mockridge, Seyneb Saleh, Cristina do Rego, Lucas Reiber, Johanna Gastdorf, Rudolf Kowalski, Carmen-Maja Antoni, Eugen Bauder', null, 'Down-and-out musician Bastian battles the blues as he returns home for Christmas and encounters a series of not-so-cheery surprises.', 'Down-and-out musician Bastian battles the blues as he returns home for Christmas and encounters a series of not-so-cheery surprises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yJYoviuSqnt3wH3djlg4Bd8qfzU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112538'),
  ('751548006641765350', 'Over the Divine Realms', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Jian Yi Si Jian', null, 'Shi Zekun, Zhang Huilin, Liu Xiaoyu, He Wenxiao, Tang Xiaoxi, Lu Lifeng', 'TV-PG', 'Six days and nights, a strange case, and a boy who returns to twelve years ago. Can he break the shackles of the land this time?', 'Six days and nights, a strange case, and a boy who returns to twelve years ago. Can he break the shackles of the land this time?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5WQowyFIqArbnLDI8z7Iirqsy95.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:292624'),
  ('950472220469345654', 'Over the Garden Wall', 2014, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Patrick McHale, Katie Krentz', null, 'Elijah Wood, Collin Dean, Melanie Lynskey', 'TV-PG', 'Two brothers, Wirt and Greg, find themselves lost in the Unknown; a strange forest adrift in time. With the help of a wise old Woodsman and a foul-tempered bluebird named Beatrice, Wirt and Greg must travel across this strange land, in hope of finding their way home. Join them as they encounter surprises and obstacles on their journey through the wood.', 'Two brothers, Wirt and Greg, find themselves lost in the Unknown; a strange forest adrift in time. With the help of a wise old Woodsman and a foul-tempered bluebird named Beatrice, Wirt and Greg must travel across this strange land, in hope of finding their way home. Join them as they encounter surprises and obstacles on their journey through the wood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3lU8n7WxzMecxKZcqhq5y5ESy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61617'),
  ('151425333509706392', 'Over There', 2005, 'War & Politics, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Steven Bochco, Chris Gerolmo', null, 'Josh Henderson, Luke Macfarlane, Erik Palladino, Keith D. Robinson, Sticky Fingaz, Omid Abtahi, Lizette Carrión, Sprague Grayden', 'TV-MA', 'Gritty, intense, evocative and emotional, "Over There" takes you to the front lines of battle and explores the effects of war on a U.S. Army unit sent to Iraq on their first tour of duty, as well as the equally powerful effects felt at home by their families and loved ones.', 'Gritty, intense, evocative and emotional, "Over There" takes you to the front lines of battle and explores the effects of war on a U.S. Army unit sent to Iraq on their first tour of duty, as well as the equally powerful effects felt at home by their families and loved ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9bB7TKDuBn9N0vZcmOqMuCOcjX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4564'),
  ('1062537650663048838', 'Over Water', 2018, 'Drama, Crime', 'Tom Lenaerts, Paul Baeten Gronda', null, 'Tom Dewispelaere, Natali Broods, Tom van Dyck, Ruth Becquart, Kevin Janssens, Jeroen Perceval, Violet Braeckman, Evgenia Brendes', null, 'John Beckers gains one last chance from his wife Marjan and their two children to get his life back on track. After a visit to rehab, John starts his new job at the freight company of his father-in-law. The port of Antwerp is a whole new world for the former TV star. It’s a harsh environment, but also one with its own rules and traditions. John fights his old demons as well as new temptations, but quickly enters a dangerous arena but also a very lucrative trade of the docks: cocaine. John Beckers came to work at the port, but finds increasingly extreme ways to make the port work for him.', 'John Beckers gains one last chance from his wife Marjan and their two children to get his life back on track. After a visit to rehab, John starts his new job at the freight company of his father-in-law. The port of Antwerp is a whole new world for the former TV star. It’s a harsh environment, but also one with its own rules and traditions. John fights his old demons as well as new temptations, but quickly enters a dangerous arena but also a very lucrative trade of the docks: cocaine. John Beckers came to work at the port, but finds increasingly extreme ways to make the port work for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dBwftNlRGHcCMEWzAbl8dg0APZ7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:79876'),
  ('96010245073284926', 'Overcoming heartbreak', 2020, 'Soap, Drama', 'Pedro Armando Rodríguez', null, 'Claudia Álvarez, Paulina Goto, Lourdes Reyes, Daniela Romo, Julia Urbini, Altaír Jarabo, Emmanuel Palomares, David Zepeda', 'NR', 'Four women of different ages and social strata are forced to live together under the same roof. At first, the coexistence between them is complicated and tense due to their different visions and ways of facing life, but little by little the sisterhood and solidarity prevail when realizing the peculiar bond that exists between them: each one has suffered, in one or otherwise, the absence and abandonment of their respective partners.', 'Four women of different ages and social strata are forced to live together under the same roof. At first, the coexistence between them is complicated and tense due to their different visions and ways of facing life, but little by little the sisterhood and solidarity prevail when realizing the peculiar bond that exists between them: each one has suffered, in one or otherwise, the absence and abandonment of their respective partners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ntVTYZ5dCbGEwuQoMredNKT8Neq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110637'),
  ('989075120029086489', 'Overcompensating', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Benito Skinner', null, 'Benito Skinner, Wally Baram, Mary Beth Barone, Adam DiMarco, Rish Shah', 'TV-MA', 'Closeted former football player and homecoming king Benny becomes fast friends with Carmen, a high school outsider on a mission to fit in at all costs. With guidance from Benny''s older sister and her campus-legend boyfriend, Benny and Carmen juggle horrible hookups, flavored vodka, and fake IDs.', 'Closeted former football player and homecoming king Benny becomes fast friends with Carmen, a high school outsider on a mission to fit in at all costs. With guidance from Benny''s older sister and her campus-legend boyfriend, Benny and Carmen juggle horrible hookups, flavored vodka, and fake IDs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9g5QRUSPBK4ABLzhO9D8ooir6tS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:247619'),
  ('172265095179870073', 'Overdo', null, 'Drama', null, null, 'Zhang Linghe, Wang Churan, Fu Xinbo, Xu Zhenxuan, He Qiu, Wang Zisu, Myolie Wu Hang-Yee, Sha Baoliang', null, 'In 1920s Shanghai, Ren Susu, a young woman sets out to uncover the truth behind her family’s tragic downfall. Years after saving Murong Qingyi, a mysterious boy who may be connected to her past, she reenters his life under a new identity. As they navigate love, betrayal, and long-buried secrets, their fates intertwine once again during a time of growing political unrest.', 'In 1920s Shanghai, Ren Susu, a young woman sets out to uncover the truth behind her family’s tragic downfall. Years after saving Murong Qingyi, a mysterious boy who may be connected to her past, she reenters his life under a new identity. As they navigate love, betrayal, and long-buried secrets, their fates intertwine once again during a time of growing political unrest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hg9fl45RQVR2yZ63DUWqy0hCZ1G.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:289139'),
  ('93111933079390899', 'Overhaulin''', 2004, 'Documentary, Reality', 'Bud Brutsman', null, 'Chris Jacobs, Chip Foose, Adrienne Janic', 'TV-PG', 'Overhaulin'' is an American automotive reality TV show that ran for five seasons on TLC between 2004–2009, and currently on Velocity and Discovery.', 'Overhaulin'' is an American automotive reality TV show that ran for five seasons on TLC between 2004–2009, and currently on Velocity and Discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjwvzy3u9V1nfhE0vEk2xtoVnwF.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:1754'),
  ('914848380065221400', 'Overheard in Rybinsk', 2025, 'Mystery, Comedy', 'Pyotr Todorovsky Jr.', 'Ivan Baranov, Pyotr Todorovsky Jr.', 'Timofey Tribuntsev, Anton Vasilyev, Ruzil Minekaev, Mikhail Kremer, Varvara Volodina, Yuliya Khlynina, Sergey Dyakov, Grigory Kalinin', null, 'A journalist of a small provincial newspaper Yura has been writing unremarkable news of his hometown all his life. But suddenly an event happens to Yura that turns his whole life upside down — visions come to him that predict murders secretly and unnoticeably taking place in Rybinsk. Soon the situation is complicated by the fact that in one of the cases Yura becomes the main suspect.', 'A journalist of a small provincial newspaper Yura has been writing unremarkable news of his hometown all his life. But suddenly an event happens to Yura that turns his whole life upside down — visions come to him that predict murders secretly and unnoticeably taking place in Rybinsk. Soon the situation is complicated by the fact that in one of the cases Yura becomes the main suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lwqZUV09i53lQ1l1IhNvrzmH8F.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:246357'),
  ('662654395089063148', 'Overlord', 2015, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Satoshi Hino, Yumi Hara, Sumire Uesaka, Manami Numakura, Akeno Watanabe, Aoi Yuuki, Ayumu Murase, Emiri Kato', 'TV-MA', 'In the year 2138, virtual reality gaming is booming. Yggdrasil, a popular online game is quietly shut down one day. However, one player named Momonga decides to not log out. Momonga is then transformed into the image of a skeleton as "the most powerful wizard." The world continues to change, with non-player characters (NPCs) beginning to feel emotion. Having no parents, friends, or place in society, this ordinary young man Momonga then strives to take over the new world the game has become.', 'In the year 2138, virtual reality gaming is booming. Yggdrasil, a popular online game is quietly shut down one day. However, one player named Momonga decides to not log out. Momonga is then transformed into the image of a skeleton as "the most powerful wizard." The world continues to change, with non-player characters (NPCs) beginning to feel emotion. Having no parents, friends, or place in society, this ordinary young man Momonga then strives to take over the new world the game has become.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/K8ZUjxaj9F0t3AwJDz8ypzBynM.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:64196'),
  ('1003392581875805677', 'Overprotected Kahoko', 2017, 'Family, Drama, Comedy', null, 'Kazuhiko Yukawa', 'Mitsuki Takahata, Hitomi Kuroki, Saburo Tokito, Ryoma Takeuchi, Tokuma Nishioka, Yoshiko Mita, Mari Nishio, Atom Shukugawa', null, 'College student Kahoko is the quintessential overprotected child born out of today''s Japanese society. Shielded by her parents, Kahoko grew up completely pampered and became somewhat of a miraculously naive "test tube human." She is 21 years old and about to start working for a company, but she has never slept away from home, had a part time job, chosen her own clothes, or even ridden a train alone. Kahoko has had her picture taken, but she has never taken a picture herself. Now, Kahoko is about to step out of her germ-free isolation pod and into the germ-infested world. It won''t be long until she realizes, "I''m different from everybody else!" She has been her mother''s best friend all her life and her father can''t live without her. As they become emotionally unstable from the changes that Kahoko goes through, their family begins to fall apart. That''s when Kahoko herself and the people around her begin to see the strength that hides deep within.', 'College student Kahoko is the quintessential overprotected child born out of today''s Japanese society. Shielded by her parents, Kahoko grew up completely pampered and became somewhat of a miraculously naive "test tube human." She is 21 years old and about to start working for a company, but she has never slept away from home, had a part time job, chosen her own clothes, or even ridden a train alone. Kahoko has had her picture taken, but she has never taken a picture herself. Now, Kahoko is about to step out of her germ-free isolation pod and into the germ-infested world. It won''t be long until she realizes, "I''m different from everybody else!" She has been her mother''s best friend all her life and her father can''t live without her. As they become emotionally unstable from the changes that Kahoko goes through, their family begins to fall apart. That''s when Kahoko herself and the people around her begin to see the strength that hides deep within.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dHagLH4c3QgXM810fcMUMX97sOm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74550'),
  ('563086114706795782', 'OVERTAKE!', 2023, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Anan Furuya, Katsuyuki Konishi, Tasuku Hatanaka, Kengo Kawanishi, Taku Yashiro, Reina Ueda', 'TV-14', 'Haruka Asahina is a high school teen racing in Formula 4. He crosses paths with a washed-up photographer, Kōya Madoka, who decides to help Haruka realize his dream and reach the podium. The heat is on, and competition is fierce. Racing for the family-run Komaki Motors team means Haruka must push the car, and himself, to the limits to catch the attention of top teams. Buckle up, it’s time to race!', 'Haruka Asahina is a high school teen racing in Formula 4. He crosses paths with a washed-up photographer, Kōya Madoka, who decides to help Haruka realize his dream and reach the podium. The heat is on, and competition is fierce. Racing for the family-run Komaki Motors team means Haruka must push the car, and himself, to the limits to catch the attention of top teams. Buckle up, it’s time to race!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fnv09j3fUnu4YM569E3nrn7SSjD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218684'),
  ('671309764807444584', 'Owen Marshall: Counselor at Law', 1971, 'Drama', 'Jerry McNeely', null, 'Lee Majors, Arthur Hill, Reni Santoni, Pat Harrington Jr., Russell Johnson, Christine Matchett, Joan Darling', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhYBy2ajSn3yPvvySk6GUAHawVP.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:10168'),
