  ('524587523812209606', 'Pád domu Kollerů', 2026, 'Comedy, Family', null, 'Natálie Kocábová', 'Tereza Volánková, David Matásek, Božidara Turzonovová, Petra Hřebíčková, Antonín Jan Abrhám, Klára Melíšková, Aleš Bílík, Ondřej Sokol', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqkkqR59aMJx0pjZ4ngUzkz3jlL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:274039'),
  ('884135600909659271', 'Paddington Bear', 1976, 'Animation', null, null, 'Michael Hordern', null, 'Paddington Bear is a series of British animated shorts based on the Paddington Bear book series by Michael Bond produced by FilmFair. This was the first television series based on the popular children''s book Paddington Bear. In the United States it was usually shown on pay television as filler in between programs. Its narrator was actor Michael Hordern. It was one of the few television programmes to combine a puppet show with cartoon - Paddington himself was a puppet, but other characters in the series were depicted as cartoon characters. The series has a very distinctive art style. Paddington himself is a stop-motion animated puppet who moves within a 3-dimensional space and interacts with 2-dimensional animated drawings of the human characters, buildings, etc. The series, along with all other FilmFair productions is currently owned by DHX Media of Canada.', 'Paddington Bear is a series of British animated shorts based on the Paddington Bear book series by Michael Bond produced by FilmFair. This was the first television series based on the popular children''s book Paddington Bear. In the United States it was usually shown on pay television as filler in between programs. Its narrator was actor Michael Hordern. It was one of the few television programmes to combine a puppet show with cartoon - Paddington himself was a puppet, but other characters in the series were depicted as cartoon characters. The series has a very distinctive art style. Paddington himself is a stop-motion animated puppet who moves within a 3-dimensional space and interacts with 2-dimensional animated drawings of the human characters, buildings, etc. The series, along with all other FilmFair productions is currently owned by DHX Media of Canada.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bagwjuYOdgoa4N7JYiAxFvBBxoH.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:7447'),
  ('693457555014347336', 'Paddington Bear', 1989, 'Animation', 'Michael Bond', null, 'Charlie Adler, Tim Curry, Cody Everett, R.J. Williams, John Standing, Hamilton Camp, B.J. Ward, Katie Johnston', 'TV-Y7', 'Paddington Bear was the second television adaptation of the children''s animated series and made by Hanna-Barbera. This series was traditional two-dimensional animated and featured veteran voice actor Charlie Adler as Paddington and Tim Curry as Mr. Curry. The character of an American boy named David, Jonathan and Judy Brown''s cousin was added to the stories in order to sell the concept to US networks.', 'Paddington Bear was the second television adaptation of the children''s animated series and made by Hanna-Barbera. This series was traditional two-dimensional animated and featured veteran voice actor Charlie Adler as Paddington and Tim Curry as Mr. Curry. The character of an American boy named David, Jonathan and Judy Brown''s cousin was added to the stories in order to sell the concept to US networks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/scQzyqKeCSZqICukb3HDDUcicFy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40792'),
  ('1044048518991617064', 'Padre no hay más que uno, la serie', 2026, 'Comedy, Family', 'Inés de León', null, 'Daniel Pérez Prada, Mariam Hernández, Claudio Gallego, Amanda Cárdenas, Alberto Salvador, Naia de las Heras, Olivia Guerrero, Miriam Díaz-Aroca', null, 'Helena lands the job of her dreams and the family relocates, while Mateo gives up his career to take care of their five children and discovers it’s much harder than he ever imagined.', 'Helena lands the job of her dreams and the family relocates, while Mateo gives up his career to take care of their five children and discovers it’s much harder than he ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g1T4RXeChi27cc2abUdz3ufzcGi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:301058'),
  ('945432169310540252', 'Padre Pio: Miracle Man', 2000, 'Drama', 'Renzo Allegri, Carlo Carlei, Massimo De Rita', 'Massimo De Rita, Mario Falcone', 'Sergio Castellitto, Jürgen Prochnow, Lorenza Indovina, Raffaele Castria, Flavio Insinna, Pierfrancesco Favino, Pietro Biondi, Andrea Buscemi', null, 'The amazing details and events in Padre Pio''s life as a boy and throughout his 50 years as a friar. Padre Pio was a man of great faith and devotion, deep spiritual concern for others, and great compassion for the sick and suffering, but he was persecuted by the church.', 'The amazing details and events in Padre Pio''s life as a boy and throughout his 50 years as a friar. Padre Pio was a man of great faith and devotion, deep spiritual concern for others, and great compassion for the sick and suffering, but he was persecuted by the church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tRVzB7IFd1L4ePjo7YfsPQIIosK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73648'),
  ('427690779949933659', 'Pagan Peak', 2019, 'Crime, Drama', 'Cyrill Boss, Philipp Stennert', 'Brian Percival', 'Julia Jentsch, Nicholas Ofczarek, Johannes Zirner, Claudia Kainberger', null, 'When a gruesomely staged body is found at the German-Austrian border, two detectives investigate. As the ritual-like murders continue, they enter the killer’s sinister world, set in the Alpine wilderness.', 'When a gruesomely staged body is found at the German-Austrian border, two detectives investigate. As the ritual-like murders continue, they enter the killer’s sinister world, set in the Alpine wilderness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e7BTJk4vAYqiTPiLt4rI2RhM7EA.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:85526'),
  ('900267209739862536', 'Page Turner', 2016, 'Drama', null, null, 'Kim So-hyun, Kim Ji-soo, Shin Jae-ha, Ye Ji-won, Hwang Young-hee, Kang Han-saem, Yoo Yeon-mi, Im Ho', null, 'Yoo-Seul is a student of an art high school. She is a talented pianist and who won various contests, but she is driven by her mother. Yoo-Seul''s mother wanted to become a pianist when she was younger. One day, Yoo-Seul has an accident. Yoo-Seul may never play the again because of the accident. With the help of her friend Cha-Sik and Yoo-Seul''s rival Jin-Mok, Yoo-Seul begins to live a new life.', 'Yoo-Seul is a student of an art high school. She is a talented pianist and who won various contests, but she is driven by her mother. Yoo-Seul''s mother wanted to become a pianist when she was younger. One day, Yoo-Seul has an accident. Yoo-Seul may never play the again because of the accident. With the help of her friend Cha-Sik and Yoo-Seul''s rival Jin-Mok, Yoo-Seul begins to live a new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7j6u2v3V8d769D5fO0J4I6SSNWo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65841'),
  ('1030178272029107565', 'Pages of Life', 2006, 'Soap, Drama, Family', 'Manoel Carlos', 'Leandra Pires, Maria Carolina, Gustavo Nogueira', 'Regina Duarte, Fernanda Vasconcellos, Lília Cabral, Marcos Caruso, Ana Paula Arósio, Thiago Rodrigues, Tarcísio Meira, Sonia Braga', null, 'Nanda must rethink her plansof studying in Amsterdam when she discovers she is pregnant. After losing the support of her boyfriend Léo, the young girl decides to return home, where she suffers a serious accident and dies.However, Helena, her doctor, is able to save her new-born twins: Francisco and Clara. Unfortunately, Clara suffers from Downs Syndrome. Helena feels a strong emotional tie to Clara and adopts her.Years later, the twins’father Léo, a young and wealthy businessman, returns to the scene, wanting to gain custody of the children.However, Helena and Alex fight to the end to retain guardianship of the twins, whom they have raised with such love.', 'Nanda must rethink her plansof studying in Amsterdam when she discovers she is pregnant. After losing the support of her boyfriend Léo, the young girl decides to return home, where she suffers a serious accident and dies.However, Helena, her doctor, is able to save her new-born twins: Francisco and Clara. Unfortunately, Clara suffers from Downs Syndrome. Helena feels a strong emotional tie to Clara and adopts her.Years later, the twins’father Léo, a young and wealthy businessman, returns to the scene, wanting to gain custody of the children.However, Helena and Alex fight to the end to retain guardianship of the twins, whom they have raised with such love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6sPlEV80z33xVjVbvu7BKPOkIQR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42789');
insert into temp_tv_shows_seed (id, title, year, genre, creator, writers, cast_members, age_rating, overview, synopsis, poster_url, seasons, source_key)
values
  ('400469054083332305', 'Páginas da Vida', 2026, 'Drama', 'Sandra Santos, Alexandre Castro', 'Alexandre Castro, Sandra Santos', 'Sofia Alves, Maria João Bastos, Filipe Vargas, Madalena Almeida, Lourenço Ortigão, Júlia Palha, João Reis, Margarida Vila-Nova', null, 'Nanda dies after giving birth to twins, Francisco and Clara. Marta, the maternal grandmother, agrees to keep the boy, but gives the girl, who has Down syndrome, up for adoption. Helena, the doctor who delivers the baby, becomes attached to the child and secretly adopts her. Years later, Leo returns to Portugal and discovers he is a father. In an attempt to regain custody of the children, he relies on Marta''s opportunistic support. But Helena is determined to fight him for Clara''s guardianship. Remake of the Brazilian telenovela of the same name.', 'Nanda dies after giving birth to twins, Francisco and Clara. Marta, the maternal grandmother, agrees to keep the boy, but gives the girl, who has Down syndrome, up for adoption. Helena, the doctor who delivers the baby, becomes attached to the child and secretly adopts her. Years later, Leo returns to Portugal and discovers he is a father. In an attempt to regain custody of the children, he relies on Marta''s opportunistic support. But Helena is determined to fight him for Clara''s guardianship. Remake of the Brazilian telenovela of the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3oUZgvok5DDQEjY92ckvS9mJ52K.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:301376'),
  ('997074826844232062', 'Painkiller', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Uzo Aduba, Matthew Broderick, Taylor Kitsch, Dina Shihabi, West Duchovny, John Rothman, Clark Gregg, Jack Mulhern', 'TV-MA', 'The causes and consequences of America''s opioid epidemic unfold in this drama following its perpetrators, victims and an investigator seeking the truth.', 'The causes and consequences of America''s opioid epidemic unfold in this drama following its perpetrators, victims and an investigator seeking the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zYtVymTxVEhgAOuMl4l2NoFCrO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158083'),
  ('437966243196957184', 'Painkiller Jane', 2007, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Gil Grant', null, 'Kristanna Loken, Rob Stewart, Noah Dalton Danby, Stephen Lobo, Sean Owen Roberts', 'TV-MA', 'Painkiller Jane is an American-Canadian science fiction and action television series based on the comic book character of the same name. Airing on the Sci Fi Channel in the US starting April 13, 2007 and Global in Canada, it starred Kristanna Loken as the titular character. On August 15, 2007, it was canceled after one season of 22 episodes.', 'Painkiller Jane is an American-Canadian science fiction and action television series based on the comic book character of the same name. Airing on the Sci Fi Channel in the US starting April 13, 2007 and Global in Canada, it starred Kristanna Loken as the titular character. On August 15, 2007, it was canceled after one season of 22 episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4fm2MBCpIqL3Be4TsFXNelIkbiw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6343'),
  ('1061960151854311352', 'Painter of the Wind', 2008, 'Drama', 'Jang Tae-yoo', null, 'Moon Geun-young, Moon Chae-won, Park Shin-yang, Han Jung-soo, Lee In, Bae Soo-bin, Im Ji-eun, Kim Yoo-jung', null, 'Painter of the Wind is a 2008 South Korean historical television series starring Moon Geun-young and Park Shin-yang. Based on the bestselling historical fiction novel by Lee Jung-myung that took artistic license with the premise that perhaps the Joseon painter Shin Yun-bok had really been a woman, it centers on Yun-bok, a talented young painter who disguises herself as a boy to search for her father''s murderer. She meets Kim Hong-do, a master painter who guides her into becoming a great artist, and they develop a strong friendship of mentor and disciple. The drama has won numerous awards, including the Asian TV Series Special Award at the 2010 Shanghai Television Festival and the silver award at the 2010 Houston International Film Festival, while actress Moon Geun-young received the grand prize at the 2008 SBS Drama Awards, as well as Best TV Actress at the 2009 Baeksang Arts Awards and 2008 Grimae Awards for her role.', 'Painter of the Wind is a 2008 South Korean historical television series starring Moon Geun-young and Park Shin-yang. Based on the bestselling historical fiction novel by Lee Jung-myung that took artistic license with the premise that perhaps the Joseon painter Shin Yun-bok had really been a woman, it centers on Yun-bok, a talented young painter who disguises herself as a boy to search for her father''s murderer. She meets Kim Hong-do, a master painter who guides her into becoming a great artist, and they develop a strong friendship of mentor and disciple. The drama has won numerous awards, including the Asian TV Series Special Award at the 2010 Shanghai Television Festival and the silver award at the 2010 Houston International Film Festival, while actress Moon Geun-young received the grand prize at the 2008 SBS Drama Awards, as well as Best TV Actress at the 2009 Baeksang Arts Awards and 2008 Grimae Awards for her role.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Ie7JRnTRs4vCgnwtPGzpu5qiSH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44573'),
  ('182049642367222981', 'Painting With John', 2021, 'Documentary, Comedy, Reality', 'John Lurie', 'John Lurie', 'John Lurie, Nesrin Wolf, Ann Mary Gludd James', 'TV-MA', 'Part meditative tutorial, part fireside chat, each episode finds artist John Lurie ensconced at his worktable, where he hones his intricate watercolor techniques and shares his reflections on what he’s learned about life.', 'Part meditative tutorial, part fireside chat, each episode finds artist John Lurie ensconced at his worktable, where he hones his intricate watercolor techniques and shares his reflections on what he’s learned about life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g142eT0rWlKw7NRMfS0zbBlorCm.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:114564'),
  ('879004466834019414', 'Pair of Kings', 2010, 'Family, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Dan Cross', null, 'Doc Shaw, Adam Hicks, Kelsey Asbille, Ryan Ochoa, Geno Segers', 'TV-Y7', 'Brady and Boomer, 16-year-old fraternal twins, are typical teens being raised by relatives in Chicago. But when the Royal Secretary to the Throne of the Island of Kinkou, arrives to inform the boys of their lineage, their lives change drastically. Now, Brady and Boomer must relocate and claim the throne as joint Kings of the island.', 'Brady and Boomer, 16-year-old fraternal twins, are typical teens being raised by relatives in Chicago. But when the Royal Secretary to the Throne of the Island of Kinkou, arrives to inform the boys of their lineage, their lives change drastically. Now, Brady and Boomer must relocate and claim the throne as joint Kings of the island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k8OQOO5DWtBTgTtc1xoXxYSCy5O.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:31628'),
  ('1009670914044840002', 'Palabra de Mujer', 2007, 'Drama, Family', 'Nené Cascallar', 'Alejandro Pohlenz, Janely Lee, Jesus Calzada', 'Edith González, Yadhira Carrillo, Ludwika Paleta, Lidia Ávila, Cynthia Klitbo, Juan Soler, Víctor Noriega, Lisardo Guarinos', null, 'Palabra De Mujer is a telenovela remake of El Amor Tiene Cara De Mujer was made by Televisa, starring Edith González, Yadhira Carrillo, Ludwika Paleta, and Lidia Ávila. The telenovela, a production of José Alberto Castro, premiered October 22, 2007 and ended on May 9, 2008 in El Canal de las Estrellas.', 'Palabra De Mujer is a telenovela remake of El Amor Tiene Cara De Mujer was made by Televisa, starring Edith González, Yadhira Carrillo, Ludwika Paleta, and Lidia Ávila. The telenovela, a production of José Alberto Castro, premiered October 22, 2007 and ended on May 9, 2008 in El Canal de las Estrellas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fyh9m7TGNqOMU4Ai5sXV1Ct5ani.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15150'),
  ('75678695457772581', 'Palace', 2011, 'Drama', null, 'Yu Zheng', 'Yuan Shanshan, Yang Rong, Lu Yi, Dai Jiaoqian, Gao Yunxiang, Wang Renjun', 'TV-PG', 'A series that follows different women and their stories during the Qing Dynasty', 'A series that follows different women and their stories during the Qing Dynasty', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mMllZpRiLRQ8Ds1ihygXiMNEj87.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:37709'),
  ('598533054017931174', 'Palace of Desire', 2000, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Zhong Zheng', null, 'Chen Hong, Gua Ah-leh, Zhou Xun, Winston Chao, Li Bingbing, Li Zhixing, Fu Biao, Shen Junyi', null, 'Palace of Desire, also known as Da Ming Gong Ci, is a Chinese television series based on the life story of Princess Taiping, a daughter of China''s only female emperor Wu Zetian. Directed by Li Shaohong and Zeng Nianping, the series starred Chen Hong, Zhou Xun, Gui Yalei and Winston Chao in the leading roles. It was first broadcast on CCTV-8 in mainland China on March 30, 2000.', 'Palace of Desire, also known as Da Ming Gong Ci, is a Chinese television series based on the life story of Princess Taiping, a daughter of China''s only female emperor Wu Zetian. Directed by Li Shaohong and Zeng Nianping, the series starred Chen Hong, Zhou Xun, Gui Yalei and Winston Chao in the leading roles. It was first broadcast on CCTV-8 in mainland China on March 30, 2000.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRQfFxoRRRS364SivAJw8w1mNh1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:52457'),
  ('491841309492183694', 'Pale Moon', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Kim Seo-hyung, Yu Seon, Seo Young-hee, Lee Si-woo, Kang Sung-Wook, Kong Jeong-hwan, Lee Chun-hee, Yoon Hee-seok', null, 'A thriller drama about Yoo I-hwa, a stay-at-home mom living her comfortable and contented life without desires, but to her husband''s indifference. While working as a bank contract employee, she unexpectedly touches money from VIP clients and gradually falls into an irreversible collapse.', 'A thriller drama about Yoo I-hwa, a stay-at-home mom living her comfortable and contented life without desires, but to her husband''s indifference. While working as a bank contract employee, she unexpectedly touches money from VIP clients and gradually falls into an irreversible collapse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wSP9hJ3tT4oDMRfJd7FoXxaD09Y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197063'),
  ('450401075339712957', 'Pale Mountains', 2024, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Giuseppe Bonito, Davide Marengo, Carlo Mazzotta', null, 'Elena Radonicich, Matteo Martari, Richard Sammel, Lavinia Longhi, Giovanni Carta, Paolo Briguglia, Lia Grieco, Laura Riccioli', null, 'Is the Monster - a serial killer - at work again in Bolzano? Discredited cop Paolo and inexperienced assistant prosecutor Eva must find out.', 'Is the Monster - a serial killer - at work again in Bolzano? Discredited cop Paolo and inexperienced assistant prosecutor Eva must find out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r66H52YD0d0LuGmW0FOqagXsVrz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:270577'),
  ('867338942034183988', 'Palm Royale', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Abe Sylvia', 'Isabella Jackson, Alessandra Jara Del Castillo', 'Kristen Wiig, Ricky Martin, Josh Lucas, Leslie Bibb, Amber Chardae Robinson, Laura Dern, Allison Janney, Kaia Gerber', 'TV-MA', 'In 1969, an ambitious woman aspires to cross the line between the haves and have-nots to secure her seat at America''s most exclusive, fashionable, and treacherous table: Palm Beach high society.', 'In 1969, an ambitious woman aspires to cross the line between the haves and have-nots to secure her seat at America''s most exclusive, fashionable, and treacherous table: Palm Beach high society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WcJLCS31BiVYgvnh19lOjZoiiZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:157367'),
  ('52065742309656260', 'Palomares', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2fxBc7GFMzYTcgyCm0ENeBzLrIz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:123984'),
  ('1068737318641412564', 'Pam & Tommy', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Robert D. Siegel', null, 'Lily James, Sebastian Stan, Seth Rogen, Nick Offerman, Taylor Schilling, Jason Mantzoukas', 'TV-MA', 'This comedic series takes on the true story behind the release of the first ever viral video in history — the sex tape of Pamela Anderson and Tommy Lee.', 'This comedic series takes on the true story behind the release of the first ever viral video in history — the sex tape of Pamela Anderson and Tommy Lee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6Hfb3EsnvlPChr01jErXDTsdan.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114925'),
  ('302012493132940216', 'Pamela Rose: The Series', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Kad Merad, Olivier Baroux, Julien Rappeneau', 'Olivier Baroux, Martin Darondeau, Kad Merad', 'Kad Merad, Olivier Baroux, Shirine Boutella, Lionel Abelanski, Mélanie Doutey, Claudia Tagbo, Ophélia Kolb, Panayotis Pascot', null, 'Agents Richard Bullit and Douglas Riper must hunt down a serial killer targeting high-profile YouTubers.', 'Agents Richard Bullit and Douglas Riper must hunt down a serial killer targeting high-profile YouTubers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHLpsOlbwFfaOh7JtVx0EpwQq7u.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:238193'),
  ('263001600698844372', 'Pan Am', 2011, 'Drama', 'Jack Orman, Nancy Hult Ganis', null, 'Christina Ricci, Margot Robbie, Karine Vanasse, Kelli Garner, Mike Vogel, Michael Mosley, Jeremy Davidson', 'TV-PG', 'In this modern world, air travel represents the height of luxury and Pan Am is the biggest name in the business. The planes are glamorous, the pilots are rock stars and the stewardesses are the most desirable women in the world. They''re trained to handle everything from in-air emergencies to unwanted advances—all without rumpling their pristine uniforms or mussing their hair.', 'In this modern world, air travel represents the height of luxury and Pan Am is the biggest name in the business. The planes are glamorous, the pilots are rock stars and the stewardesses are the most desirable women in the world. They''re trained to handle everything from in-air emergencies to unwanted advances—all without rumpling their pristine uniforms or mussing their hair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fmWRWH4CEXzxuMtImHzepWqqfkf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39259'),
  ('1093568463841613353', 'Pan de Peace!', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Ibuki Kido, Erii Yamazaki, Madoka Asahina, Moe Toyota, Nichika Omori, Natsuko Hara, Yu Shimamura', null, 'The "cute and soft bread four-panel manga" centers around Minami, an air-headed girl who is starting high school and who loves eating bread for breakfast. Baked goods bring happiness everyday to her and her classmates the reliable Yuu, the pastry-baking Fuyumi, and the independent Noa.', 'The "cute and soft bread four-panel manga" centers around Minami, an air-headed girl who is starting high school and who loves eating bread for breakfast. Baked goods bring happiness everyday to her and her classmates the reliable Yuu, the pastry-baking Fuyumi, and the independent Noa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eC5Uf6FvirpGZzbza1XUPbZh78z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66110'),
  ('61181538823824304', 'Pan Tau', 1970, 'Family', 'Ota Hofman, Jindřich Polák', null, null, null, 'Pan Tau always had a gentle expression and a friendly smile, he was elegantly dressed in a stroller, with an umbrella and a white carnation in the lapel. Foremost, he was famous for his magic bowler hat. By tapping on his hat, Pan Tau was able to change his appearance into a puppet, to conjure up miscellaneous objects or to do other magic. His most characteristically behavior is that he would help children who were experiencing some sort of difficulties in-between their dreams and reality, like finding a place for skiing, settling family problems on Christmas, and even give a boy a good time at a fair when he is supposed to have piano lessons. To adults, he usually remained invisible.', 'Pan Tau always had a gentle expression and a friendly smile, he was elegantly dressed in a stroller, with an umbrella and a white carnation in the lapel. Foremost, he was famous for his magic bowler hat. By tapping on his hat, Pan Tau was able to change his appearance into a puppet, to conjure up miscellaneous objects or to do other magic. His most characteristically behavior is that he would help children who were experiencing some sort of difficulties in-between their dreams and reality, like finding a place for skiing, settling family problems on Christmas, and even give a boy a good time at a fair when he is supposed to have piano lessons. To adults, he usually remained invisible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLYcRefMfWuZm1KqVfForigaHIG.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:54309'),
  ('636241211070514507', 'Panchayat', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Chandan Kumar, Deepak Kumar Mishra, Arunabh Kumar', 'Chandan Kumar', 'Jitendra Kumar, Raghubir Yadav, Neena Gupta, Chandan Roy, Faisal Malik, Sanvikaa, Durgesh Kumar, Ashok Pathak', 'TV-14', 'Panchayat is a comedy-drama, which captures the journey of an engineering graduate Abhishek, who for lack of a better job option joins as secretary of a panchayat office in a remote village of Uttar Pradesh. Stuck between crazy villagers and a difficult village lifestyle Abhishek starts his job with the sole motivation of getting out of there as soon as possible, for which he even prepares for CAT.', 'Panchayat is a comedy-drama, which captures the journey of an engineering graduate Abhishek, who for lack of a better job option joins as secretary of a panchayat office in a remote village of Uttar Pradesh. Stuck between crazy villagers and a difficult village lifestyle Abhishek starts his job with the sole motivation of getting out of there as soon as possible, for which he even prepares for CAT.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPPhduQk1eX0MAE2JDaQRh3UZB5.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:101352'),
  ('275912653358695973', 'Pancho Villa: The Centaur of the North', 2023, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Rafael Lara Ruiz', null, 'Jorge A. Jimenez, Juan Luis Medina, Leonardo Alonso, Pablo Abitia, Josue Guerra, Armando Hernández, Said Sandoval, Gabriela Cartol', null, 'This is the story of Doroteo Arango, of a life that began on the wrong side of the law, to becoming "Pancho Villa", the feared commander and key figure in the Mexican Revolution. Buried within the story is a man fixated on his own myth, a man whose efforts to become a larger-than-life figure would shape history, but also leave him with many vengeful and powerful enemies.', 'This is the story of Doroteo Arango, of a life that began on the wrong side of the law, to becoming "Pancho Villa", the feared commander and key figure in the Mexican Revolution. Buried within the story is a man fixated on his own myth, a man whose efforts to become a larger-than-life figure would shape history, but also leave him with many vengeful and powerful enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evmzCQZhU0sBXG8CDZIrjrrH5Di.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128329'),
  ('440055378129352713', 'Panda', 2023, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Mathieu Leblanc, Thomas Mansuy', null, 'Julien Doré, Ophélia Kolb, Gustave Kervern, Hélène Vincent, Maxence Lapérouse, Vincent Heneine, Mathis Bour', 'TV-MA', 'Relaxed pacifist, matcha addict, and convinced vegan, Panda runs a small shack in a remote corner of the Camargue. No phone, no computer, no car; he lives with his 16-year-old in this perfect cocoon of peace and serenity, avoiding anything resembling conflict. How to imagine that this wise man in flip-flops and a faded t-shirt was once a cop? And not just any cop. One of the best. Unfortunately, even in paradise, there''s no way to be completely peaceful. When his former life comes knocking at the door, Panda finds himself obliged to return to duty... But in his own way. Without weapons or violence and not too early in the morning. Zen, you know.', 'Relaxed pacifist, matcha addict, and convinced vegan, Panda runs a small shack in a remote corner of the Camargue. No phone, no computer, no car; he lives with his 16-year-old in this perfect cocoon of peace and serenity, avoiding anything resembling conflict. How to imagine that this wise man in flip-flops and a faded t-shirt was once a cop? And not just any cop. One of the best. Unfortunately, even in paradise, there''s no way to be completely peaceful. When his former life comes knocking at the door, Panda finds himself obliged to return to duty... But in his own way. Without weapons or violence and not too early in the morning. Zen, you know.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xCx9egLXjIck4qKS7YGJ4ShAUTU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:229641'),
  ('582813873552015767', 'Panda and Hedgehog', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', null, '한준영', 'Donghae, Yoon Seung-ah, Choi Jin-hyuk, Yoo So-young, Yang Hee-kyung, Park Keun-hyong, Hwang Byeong-gug, Park Ha-na', null, 'Ms Panda and Mr Hedgehog is a South Korean romantic comedy television series starring Lee Donghae of Super Junior and Yoon Seung-ah. It was broadcast on Channel A from August 18, 2012 to October 7, 2012. The story is about Go Seung-ji, a prickly patissier who teams up with Pan Da-yang, an easygoing pastry shop owner, to open a successful new cafe.', 'Ms Panda and Mr Hedgehog is a South Korean romantic comedy television series starring Lee Donghae of Super Junior and Yoon Seung-ah. It was broadcast on Channel A from August 18, 2012 to October 7, 2012. The story is about Go Seung-ji, a prickly patissier who teams up with Pan Da-yang, an easygoing pastry shop owner, to open a successful new cafe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2deFrwS2F9S1wr17EipAcR3C4Y3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:49934'),
  ('1014419442779579425', 'Pandemic', 2007, 'Drama', 'Armand Mastroianni', 'Jackie Zabel, Bryce Zabel', 'Tiffani-Amber Thiessen, Faye Dunaway, French Stewart, Eric Roberts, Renée Taylor, Vincent Spano, Bruce Boxleitner, Bob Gunton', null, 'The bird flu virus spreads through Los Angeles as a doctor from the CDC races to find a vaccine.', 'The bird flu virus spreads through Los Angeles as a doctor from the CDC races to find a vaccine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w5aUXmUAC82kqpImokPXkL11isW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:41322'),
