  ('627953469869233166', 'Par de ideotas', 2025, 'Reality, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Vadhir Derbez, José Eduardo Derbez', null, 'Vadhir and José Eduardo Derbez open a pop-up bar together, but opening a business for the first time, is anything but easy! With the pressure of trying to make it a success, the brothers work hard but not without crazy and unexpected issues!', 'Vadhir and José Eduardo Derbez open a pop-up bar together, but opening a business for the first time, is anything but easy! With the pressure of trying to make it a success, the brothers work hard but not without crazy and unexpected issues!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1y4KeJVMHOClbMFRfiPAd4x6cfj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:284416'),
  ('996565776406475695', 'Para - We Are King', 2021, 'Drama', 'Hanno Hackfort, Richard Kropf, Bob Konrad', null, 'Jeanne Goursaud, Dela Dabulamanzi, Jobel Mokonzi, Soma Pysall, Roxana Samadi, Anna Platen', 'TV-MA', 'Sometimes, disaster is just one decision away from delight: Para - We are King, follows four young women in Berlin-Wedding searching for happiness in a world, in which light and darkness lie close together.', 'Sometimes, disaster is just one decision away from delight: Para - We are King, follows four young women in Berlin-Wedding searching for happiness in a world, in which light and darkness lie close together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6DJmrTBz4GcfVDpl3o1642KgDYc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:123710'),
  ('616243929871275161', 'Para Volver a Amar', 2010, 'Drama', 'Pedro Miguel Rozo, Adriana Suárez', 'Aida Guajardo', 'Rebecca Jones, Alejandro Camacho, René Strickler, Alejandra Barros, Jesús Ochoa, Nailea Norvind, África Zavala, Mark Tacher', 'NR', 'Para Volver a Amar is a Televisa telenovela that aired on the Canal de las Estrellas channel in Mexico from July 12, 2010 to January 30, 2011. It stars Rebecca Jones, Rene Strickler, Alejandro Camacho, Alejandra Barros, and Africa Zavala. The Mexican version however is taken from the original Colombian soap opera series "El Último Matrimonio Feliz". The story is about six women who befriend each other and help each other deal with the pains of life, particularly in regards to marriage and relationships. They''ll realize that even amidst their problems, happiness is not impossible to attain. It won seven Premios TVyNovelas awards for Best Telenovela of the Year, Best Male Villain, Best First Actress, Best First Actor, Best Co-Star Actress, Best Co-Star Actor, and Best Young Lead Actor. Para Volver a Amar aired in the United States on Univision from March 8, 2011 to October 28, 2011 at 12am/11pm central.', 'Para Volver a Amar is a Televisa telenovela that aired on the Canal de las Estrellas channel in Mexico from July 12, 2010 to January 30, 2011. It stars Rebecca Jones, Rene Strickler, Alejandro Camacho, Alejandra Barros, and Africa Zavala. The Mexican version however is taken from the original Colombian soap opera series "El Último Matrimonio Feliz". The story is about six women who befriend each other and help each other deal with the pains of life, particularly in regards to marriage and relationships. They''ll realize that even amidst their problems, happiness is not impossible to attain. It won seven Premios TVyNovelas awards for Best Telenovela of the Year, Best Male Villain, Best First Actress, Best First Actor, Best Co-Star Actress, Best Co-Star Actor, and Best Young Lead Actor. Para Volver a Amar aired in the United States on Univision from March 8, 2011 to October 28, 2011 at 12am/11pm central.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1zygrGAI3tVuqaL0w32DtpjJw9n.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39056'),
  ('876729915330010930', 'Parade''s End', 2012, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, 'Tom Stoppard', 'Benedict Cumberbatch, Rebecca Hall, Adelaide Clemens, Miranda Richardson, Roger Allam, Rupert Everett, Janet McTeer, Tom Mison', 'TV-MA', 'The story of a love triangle between a conservative English aristocrat, his mean socialite wife and a young suffragette in the midst of World War I and a Europe on the brink of profound change.', 'The story of a love triangle between a conservative English aristocrat, his mean socialite wife and a young suffragette in the midst of World War I and a Europe on the brink of profound change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/te0SB1kyYlzHZEXL3jpcU6oHELy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39644'),
  ('153826103223286386', 'Paradise', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Fernando González Molina, Ruth García, David Oliva', null, 'Macarena García, Iñaki Ardanaz, Pau Gimeno, Cristian López, León Martínez, Héctor Gozalbo, María Romanillos, Patricia Iserte', 'TV-MA', 'At the end of the summer of 1992, three 15-year-old girls, Sandra, Eva and Malena disappear without a trace from a nightclub in a coastal town. When the police investigation appears to be taking the wrong direction, Javi, Sandra’s younger brother, takes the matter into his own hands. Along with the help of his friends, they discover something not of this world.', 'At the end of the summer of 1992, three 15-year-old girls, Sandra, Eva and Malena disappear without a trace from a nightclub in a coastal town. When the police investigation appears to be taking the wrong direction, Javi, Sandra’s younger brother, takes the matter into his own hands. Along with the help of his friends, they discover something not of this world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/afUgGf1ehS7GC9a2tCFUdU0T2Ua.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:58142'),
  ('1101919457897063313', 'Paradise', 2025, 'Crime, Drama', 'Dan Fogelman', null, 'Sterling K. Brown, Julianne Nicholson, Sarah Shahi, Nicole Brydon Bloom, Krys Marshall, Enuka Okuma, Aliyah Mastin, Percy Daggs IV', 'TV-MA', 'The tranquility in a serene, wealthy community inhabited by some of the world''s most prominent individuals explodes when a shocking murder occurs and a high stakes investigation unfolds.', 'The tranquility in a serene, wealthy community inhabited by some of the world''s most prominent individuals explodes when a shocking murder occurs and a high stakes investigation unfolds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l8RqfhqEk04W5sSOjQ9zeWU1DyM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:245927'),
  ('971155282025216476', 'Paradise Afterparty', 2026, 'Drama, Reality', null, null, null, null, 'The Paradisos are back in Denmark, and the after-party continues. In a summer house in Marielyst, old flirtations, drama and secrets are rekindled. With lots of drinks and confrontations, answers are revealed about who lied and who hid true feelings.', 'The Paradisos are back in Denmark, and the after-party continues. In a summer house in Marielyst, old flirtations, drama and secrets are rekindled. With lots of drinks and confrontations, answers are revealed about who lied and who hid true feelings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u0dtYkTof1I76AZH3ZX5Rs2XNmg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317531'),
  ('396686983971086698', 'Paradise City', 2021, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Ash Avildsen', 'Ash Avildsen', 'Andy Biersack, Drea De Matteo, Booboo Stewart, Bella Thorne, Rhys Coiro, Fairuza Balk, Perrey Reeves, Ben Bruce', null, 'A controversial rock band with ties to the occult and the maestros who work with them try to keep their west coast family dynamic together amidst the chaos of the industry as a haunting secret of the singer and a young groupie arrives on his doorstep. Their path intertwines with an east coast rookie kid who idolizes them and tries to make his way in the music business as the ultimate underdog.', 'A controversial rock band with ties to the occult and the maestros who work with them try to keep their west coast family dynamic together amidst the chaos of the industry as a haunting secret of the singer and a young groupie arrives on his doorstep. Their path intertwines with an east coast rookie kid who idolizes them and tries to make his way in the music business as the ultimate underdog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fSWXCeTS80yR1vHTLVRRagyQmjQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5768'),
  ('397378749405795805', 'Paradise Hotel', 2005, 'Reality', null, null, 'Rebecca Stella Dion', null, 'A group of hot singles check into a luxury hotel in Mexico. Prepare for love, partying, betrayal and tears. Half a million kronor is at stake and anything can happen in paradise.', 'A group of hot singles check into a luxury hotel in Mexico. Prepare for love, partying, betrayal and tears. Half a million kronor is at stake and anything can happen in paradise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aeU8fC5JaG2BkWqgMX7yPfX7dfW.jpg', 20, 'tmdb:tv:67707'),
  ('827136906915535356', 'Paradise Kiss', 2005, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', 'Ai Yazawa', null, 'Yu Yamada, Kenji Hamada, Marika Matsumoto, Shunsuke Mizutani, Chiharu Suzuka', 'TV-14', 'Yukari is a typical high-school student who listens to her parents and attends school everyday. As she starts to question her way of life, she encounters a group of fashion design students who has a clothing label known as "Paradise Kiss". The group needs to find a model to showcase their designs in an up-coming fashion show and decides to pick Yukari instead. Initially, Yukari was reluctant to be associated with this seemingly eccentric group, but eventually, she realises that they are really nice people. Furthermore, their passion and enthusiasm to follow their ideals and dreams make Yukari realise that she has not been enjoying her life and this motivated her to pursue her own dreams.', 'Yukari is a typical high-school student who listens to her parents and attends school everyday. As she starts to question her way of life, she encounters a group of fashion design students who has a clothing label known as "Paradise Kiss". The group needs to find a model to showcase their designs in an up-coming fashion show and decides to pick Yukari instead. Initially, Yukari was reluctant to be associated with this seemingly eccentric group, but eventually, she realises that they are really nice people. Furthermore, their passion and enthusiasm to follow their ideals and dreams make Yukari realise that she has not been enjoying her life and this motivated her to pursue her own dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o4c1e7mWp2MrsHGOytAWSRLx2tJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34208'),
  ('200849116706317923', 'Paradise PD', 2018, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Roger Black, Waco O''Guin', null, 'Kyle Kinane, Cedric Yarbrough, David Herman, Tom Kenny, Sarah Chalke, Dana Snyder', 'TV-MA', 'An eager young rookie joins the ragtag small-town police force led by his dad as they bumble, squabble and snort their way through a big drug case.', 'An eager young rookie joins the ragtag small-town police force led by his dad as they bumble, squabble and snort their way through a big drug case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/desSj4kx0y9p61vm9QBE3Wm8GxK.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:81983'),
  ('348735357167265452', 'Paradox', 2009, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tamzin Outhwaite, Emun Elliott, Mark Bonnar, Chiké Okonkwo, Lorcan Cranitch, Abigail Davies', 'TV-14', 'Mysterious images that show incidents 18 hours before they happen are transmitted from space. As a space scientist attempts to explain their source, detectives race against time to change the future.', 'Mysterious images that show incidents 18 hours before they happen are transmitted from space. As a space scientist attempts to explain their source, detectives race against time to change the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10VDY7BknsEYSa8ny3oCshfPjBs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:18588'),
  ('239750976248172151', 'Paradox', 2012, 'Crime, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Paweł Sulik', 'Igor Brejdygant', 'Bogusław Linda, Cezary Łukaszewicz, Gabriela Muskała, Sebastian Pawlak, Ewa Skibińska, Anna Grycewicz, Arkadiusz Jakubik, Andrzej Zieliński', null, 'A bright, young officer joins General Police Headquarters to investigate one of its lead inspectors and the criminal cases he''s working on.', 'A bright, young officer joins General Police Headquarters to investigate one of its lead inspectors and the criminal cases he''s working on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7R3q2u8ArtY7RQGlnXlhSLBcrd1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:48499'),
  ('81117334120322193', 'Paradys', 2026, 'Soap', null, null, 'Lorcia Cooper Khumalo, Elton Landrew, Ilse Klink, Zane Meas, Obed Baloyi, Roderick Jaftha, Vuyo Ngcukana, Sharné Coetzee', null, 'A multi-generational family story centered round a once-promised “Coloured paradise” that never materialized. It explores legacy, belonging and unresolved dreams.', 'A multi-generational family story centered round a once-promised “Coloured paradise” that never materialized. It explores legacy, belonging and unresolved dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/joE1WjCmczBlqTtiQ9yl9bt1ktj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:313582'),
  ('1101432175479483270', 'Paraíso blanco', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Ron Chepesiuk, Jörg Hiller', null, 'Sebastián Osorio, Michał Malinowski, Camila Bordón, Variel Sánchez, Bibiana Navas, César Alvarez', null, 'Lehder changed the drug trade forever when he decided to buy an island 340 km off the coast of Florida in the 1970s. He was the first major Colombian drug lord to be extradited and tried in the US in 1987: he served a 30-year prison sentence and is now a free man.', 'Lehder changed the drug trade forever when he decided to buy an island 340 km off the coast of Florida in the 1970s. He was the first major Colombian drug lord to be extradited and tried in the US in 1987: he served a 30-year prison sentence and is now a free man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4IeaR4ptf8pJZGpHcxvcUhgvPvu.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:231045'),
  ('783187600376884107', 'Paraíso Tropical', 2007, 'Soap, Drama, Comedy', 'Gilberto Braga, Ricardo Linhares', 'João Ximenes Braga, Nelson Nadotti, Sérgio Marques', 'Fábio Assunção, Alessandra Negrini, Wagner Moura, Camila Pitanga, Tony Ramos, Glória Pires, Bruno Gagliasso, Vera Holtz', 'NR', 'The search for a successor provokes the beginning of a clash between two young and talented executives of his group: Daniel Bastos, a lad of simple origins and excellent character, who is not only handsome and charming, but also intelligent and skilled, and Olavo Novaes, an ambitious and unscrupulous man who is ready to fight for the position, at any cost. To fight against Olavo‘s treacherous plans, Daniel will have the help of the sweet and sensitive Paula, a young lady raised as an only child who founds, on the eve of her mother‘s death, that she is adopted and has a family. What Paula does not know is that she has an identical twin sister, the wicked Taís, who is as ambitious and unscrupulous as the man who becomes her main ally, Olavo Novaes. Antenor, for his part, decides on having an heir when he meets the headstrong and honest Lúcia, a woman who will make this cold businessman find true love is and a real reason to live.', 'The search for a successor provokes the beginning of a clash between two young and talented executives of his group: Daniel Bastos, a lad of simple origins and excellent character, who is not only handsome and charming, but also intelligent and skilled, and Olavo Novaes, an ambitious and unscrupulous man who is ready to fight for the position, at any cost. To fight against Olavo‘s treacherous plans, Daniel will have the help of the sweet and sensitive Paula, a young lady raised as an only child who founds, on the eve of her mother‘s death, that she is adopted and has a family. What Paula does not know is that she has an identical twin sister, the wicked Taís, who is as ambitious and unscrupulous as the man who becomes her main ally, Olavo Novaes. Antenor, for his part, decides on having an heir when he meets the headstrong and honest Lúcia, a woman who will make this cold businessman find true love is and a real reason to live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eqstFEbqOvwffrRyFjeQg7mWbqj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42883'),
  ('1132476059524175541', 'Parallel World Pharmacy', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Aki Toyosaki, Reina Ueda, Kaede Hondo, Shizuka Itoh, Kenji Nomura, Maria Naganawa', 'TV-14', 'A young pharmacologist and researcher in Japan died from overworking, and was reincarnated in a Medieval Parallel Europe. He was reincarnated as a 10-year-old apprentice to a famous Royal Court pharmacist, had attained an inhuman skills of ability to see through disease, material creation, and material destruction. In a society in which dubious medical practice are rampant, price gouging thru the monopoly of the pharmacist guild, and good medicine aren''t available to the commoners. He was recognized by the Emperor at that time and opened a Pharmacy at the corner of the town. He will wipe out the fraud that has swept the world, and deliver to the commoners a truly effective medicine that was developed using present day pharmacology. Thus the boy pharmacist will cheat by using his previous knowledge to create innovative medicines while helping the people of the parallel world, a story about living his new life to the fullest this time.', 'A young pharmacologist and researcher in Japan died from overworking, and was reincarnated in a Medieval Parallel Europe. He was reincarnated as a 10-year-old apprentice to a famous Royal Court pharmacist, had attained an inhuman skills of ability to see through disease, material creation, and material destruction. In a society in which dubious medical practice are rampant, price gouging thru the monopoly of the pharmacist guild, and good medicine aren''t available to the commoners. He was recognized by the Emperor at that time and opened a Pharmacy at the corner of the town. He will wipe out the fraud that has swept the world, and deliver to the commoners a truly effective medicine that was developed using present day pharmacology. Thus the boy pharmacist will cheat by using his previous knowledge to create innovative medicines while helping the people of the parallel world, a story about living his new life to the fullest this time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/52PZhMEggFTd4YBsnpDZZLW44xQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129195'),
  ('442685772413075868', 'Parallels', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Quoc Dang Tran', 'Quoc Dang Tran, Anastasia Heinzl', 'Timoté Rigault, Thomas Chomel, Omar Mebrouk, Jules Houplain, Jade Pedri, Naidra Ayadi, Guillaume Labbé, Maxime Bergeron', 'TV-14', 'Four teenagers'' lives are turned upside down when a mysterious event propels them into parallel dimensions.', 'Four teenagers'' lives are turned upside down when a mysterious event propels them into parallel dimensions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o259EJfN0tQl7smNXs7Rpz4t8H0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:118906'),
  ('988668223539085266', 'Paramedics', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Sandra García Velten', null, 'Irene Azuela, Luis Arrieta, Marianna Burelli, Rocío Verdejo, Raúl Méndez, Marco Antonio Treviño, Rubén Zamora', 'TV-14', 'Three new paramedics face the challenge of work in the biggest city of the world, full of problems, different situations and a bunch of workmates that could make their life even worst.', 'Three new paramedics face the challenge of work in the biggest city of the world, full of problems, different situations and a bunch of workmates that could make their life even worst.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6OlzOCScyOC4dJBaq4ADPk32T6c.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:81519'),
  ('27637521133625535', 'Paranoia Agent', 2004, 'Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Satoshi Kon', null, 'Mamiko Noto, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Haruko Momoi, Shozo Iizuka, Toshihiko Seki, Hisako Kyoda, Ryuji Saikachi, Kenji Utsumi', 'TV-MA', 'Musashino, Tokyo. An elementary schooler repeatedly attacks people in the streets. Known only to the public as "Lil Slugger", none of the victims can recall the young boy''s face and only three distinct details are left in their memories: golden inline skates, a baseball cap, and the weapon: a bent golden baseball bat. Detectives Ikari and Maniwa set out to track down the perpetrator and put an end to his crimes.', 'Musashino, Tokyo. An elementary schooler repeatedly attacks people in the streets. Known only to the public as "Lil Slugger", none of the victims can recall the young boy''s face and only three distinct details are left in their memories: golden inline skates, a baseball cap, and the weapon: a bent golden baseball bat. Detectives Ikari and Maniwa set out to track down the perpetrator and put an end to his crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQ6YiBTUlsKGm2mWa7mE9eZnlS2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9343'),
  ('598131010665999342', 'Paranoid', 2016, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Bill Gallagher', 'Bill Gallagher', 'Indira Varma, Robert Glenister, Neil Stuke, Christiane Paul, Lesley Sharp, Anjli Mohindra, Dino Fetscher, Michael Maloney', null, 'The murder of a female GP in a rural playground in front of numerous witnesses draws a group of detectives into an ever-darkening mystery that takes them across Europe, aided by mysterious notes sent by the "Ghost Detective".', 'The murder of a female GP in a rural playground in front of numerous witnesses draws a group of detectives into an ever-darkening mystery that takes them across Europe, aided by mysterious notes sent by the "Ghost Detective".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Z9oxugoepHqkXYVvElvb3VYcnm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67960'),
  ('135492835683496217', 'Paranormal', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Amr Salama', 'Amr Salama, Mahmoud Ezzat, Dina Maher', 'Ahmed Amin, Razane Jammal, Aya Samaha, Reem Abdel Qader, Samaa Ibrahem, Rushdi Al-Shami, Ahmed Dash, Adam Wahdan', 'TV-14', 'Set in the 1960s; Paranormal follows the adventures of Dr. Refaat Ismail, a professor of hematology, as he comes up against various supernatural events with the help of his Scottish old flame, Maggie.', 'Set in the 1960s; Paranormal follows the adventures of Dr. Refaat Ismail, a professor of hematology, as he comes up against various supernatural events with the help of his Scottish old flame, Maggie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gH81qw0IcOVhRkPaWGU0cYUGDi3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106590'),
  ('684804225468043442', 'Paranormal 911', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'A shocking number of 911 emergencies end in paranormal encounters. Paranormal 911 explores these events through eye-witness accounts of the first responders who lived them. This gripping drama-doc takes viewers into the unexpected paranormal encounters of first responders.', 'A shocking number of 911 emergencies end in paranormal encounters. Paranormal 911 explores these events through eye-witness accounts of the first responders who lived them. This gripping drama-doc takes viewers into the unexpected paranormal encounters of first responders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/19HNUL0fdYAoj7maPGIrqWrlRyn.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:90178'),
  ('130962019443089380', 'Paranormal Caught on Camera', 2019, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, 'Brian J. Cano, Sapphire Sandalo', 'TV-PG', 'Some of the most amazing, eye-opening and downright scary paranormal videos from around the world are featured as a panel of experts break down the footage and analyze what exactly the eyewitnesses captured.', 'Some of the most amazing, eye-opening and downright scary paranormal videos from around the world are featured as a panel of experts break down the footage and analyze what exactly the eyewitnesses captured.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wymPX91jNHS52v1tPeDggpryyFu.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:86845'),
  ('216059456719359515', 'Paranormal Challenge', 2011, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'Paranormal Challenge is an American competitive paranormal reality television series that premiered on June 17, 2011, on the Travel Channel. A spinoff of Ghost Adventures, the series was created and is hosted by lead investigator Zak Bagans, who challenges ghost hunters from around the United States to go head-to-head in a weekly competition to gather paranormal evidence by spending a night in reportedly haunted locations in the United States. The first season of the show ended on September 16, 2011. Lead judge David Schrader announced on Darkness Radio that the show would not be renewed for a second season.', 'Paranormal Challenge is an American competitive paranormal reality television series that premiered on June 17, 2011, on the Travel Channel. A spinoff of Ghost Adventures, the series was created and is hosted by lead investigator Zak Bagans, who challenges ghost hunters from around the United States to go head-to-head in a weekly competition to gather paranormal evidence by spending a night in reportedly haunted locations in the United States. The first season of the show ended on September 16, 2011. Lead judge David Schrader announced on Darkness Radio that the show would not be renewed for a second season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xODcff6chAoYipadEMJs7De5mpv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39514'),
  ('714205371400660437', 'Paranormal Lockdown', 2016, 'Reality, Documentary', 'Nick Groff, Katrina Weidman', null, 'Nick Groff, Katrina Weidman', 'TV-14', 'Nick Groff, a paranormal investigator who''s "on a mission to discover something new in the paranormal field", and his paranormal researcher Katrina Weidman spend 72 hours together locked down in the most haunted locations in their quest to learn more about the unknown. They stay with the dead at these reportedly haunted places, many of which have never been filmed for a production and some will be investigated for the first time on television. Groff and Weidman believe, that "the longer they stay, the more the spirits will communicate with them and the more information they can gather about the unknown".', 'Nick Groff, a paranormal investigator who''s "on a mission to discover something new in the paranormal field", and his paranormal researcher Katrina Weidman spend 72 hours together locked down in the most haunted locations in their quest to learn more about the unknown. They stay with the dead at these reportedly haunted places, many of which have never been filmed for a production and some will be investigated for the first time on television. Groff and Weidman believe, that "the longer they stay, the more the spirits will communicate with them and the more information they can gather about the unknown".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOq6uNptoBSbv3vGMBCs3OiGJkw.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:65815'),
  ('851495208728880152', 'Paranormal State', 2007, 'Drama, Documentary, Reality', null, null, 'Ryan Buell, Heather Taddy, Chip Coffey, Chad Calek', null, 'Paranormal State is an American paranormal reality television series that premiered on the A&E Network on December 10, 2007. The program follows and stars the Pennsylvania State University Paranormal Research Society, a student-led college club. The show features the group''s investigations of alleged paranormal phenomena at reportedly haunted locations.', 'Paranormal State is an American paranormal reality television series that premiered on the A&E Network on December 10, 2007. The program follows and stars the Pennsylvania State University Paranormal Research Society, a student-led college club. The show features the group''s investigations of alleged paranormal phenomena at reportedly haunted locations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evCJJPkdsMamQCAriFuosqaVsBg.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:14124'),
  ('819849497945336521', 'Paranormal Survivor', 2015, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'A chilling series in which survivors of a paranormal experience relive their harrowing encounter.', 'A chilling series in which survivors of a paranormal experience relive their harrowing encounter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Fr8xQkrbf4gjAGDr0gK5NST0UB.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:65010'),
  ('758682153496529725', 'Paranormal Witness', 2011, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Documentary', 'Ty Unwin, Joel Beckerman', null, 'Kelaiah Guiel', 'TV-14', 'A tense, filmic and high-octane drama-documentary series that brings to life the stories of people who have lived through paranormal experiences that defy explanation. Using a mixture of intimate first-hand testimony and grittily realistic drama, the audience is transported into a world turned upside down by extraordinary and terrifying events.', 'A tense, filmic and high-octane drama-documentary series that brings to life the stories of people who have lived through paranormal experiences that defy explanation. Using a mixture of intimate first-hand testimony and grittily realistic drama, the audience is transported into a world turned upside down by extraordinary and terrifying events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/NKIoLkRkP8uygZrUJeglYEKyIV.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:40919'),
  ('822333311832113066', 'PaRappa the Rapper', 2001, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Kids, Comedy', 'Masaya Matsuura, Rodney Alan Greenblat', 'Akatsuki Yamatoya, Hiroshi Hashimoto, Hiro Masaki', 'Miyu Irino, Ryu Watabe, Masami Kikuchi, Kenichi Suzumura, Mika Kanai, Rina Nakayama, Akiko Kobayashi, Masashi Ebara', 'TV-Y7', 'The series focuses on PaRappa, a cute and happy dog who enjoys music and dancing and often spends time with his friends PJ Berri, Katy Kat, and the girl of his dreams, Sunny Funny. Along with various characters who make returning appearances from the video games, the anime introduces several new characters who are exclusive to the TV series. These include Matt Major, PJ''s friend from Club Fun, Paula Fox, Sunny''s friend who was rivals with Katy, Pinto, PaRappa''s little sister, and Gaster and Groober, a villainous duo who cause all sorts of mischief.', 'The series focuses on PaRappa, a cute and happy dog who enjoys music and dancing and often spends time with his friends PJ Berri, Katy Kat, and the girl of his dreams, Sunny Funny. Along with various characters who make returning appearances from the video games, the anime introduces several new characters who are exclusive to the TV series. These include Matt Major, PJ''s friend from Club Fun, Paula Fox, Sunny''s friend who was rivals with Katy, Pinto, PaRappa''s little sister, and Gaster and Groober, a villainous duo who cause all sorts of mischief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xssqLf8Tr0vSlTXk0bcLGvz6zR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5743'),
  ('544073741823087593', 'Parasite Dolls', 2003, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kazuhiko Inoue, Akemi Okamura, Somei Uchida, Masaru Ikeda, Kikuko Inoue, Toshio Furukawa, Ai Orikasa, Jouji Nakata', null, 'MegaTokyo 2034: Beauty is only skin deep, but when you can’t see beneath the skin, how can you know what you’re really dealing with? In a world where perfect androids called Boomers have infiltrated every aspect of society, it’s the job of Branch to maintain peace between the people and the plastic. Unfortunately, not all boomers are created perfect, and when boomers go bad, people die. The thin blue line that separates man from machine is about to meet its most horrifying test.', 'MegaTokyo 2034: Beauty is only skin deep, but when you can’t see beneath the skin, how can you know what you’re really dealing with? In a world where perfect androids called Boomers have infiltrated every aspect of society, it’s the job of Branch to maintain peace between the people and the plastic. Unfortunately, not all boomers are created perfect, and when boomers go bad, people die. The thin blue line that separates man from machine is about to meet its most horrifying test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/opXYjjZRfsExo4IyQElEg1R3Jdj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42507'),
  ('71274906265507868', 'Parasyte -the maxim-', 2014, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Nobunaga Shimazaki, Aya Hirano', 'TV-MA', 'A species of parasitic aliens descends on Earth and quickly infiltrates humanity by entering the brains of vulnerable targets; insatiable beings that gain total control of their host and are capable of transforming themselves to feed on unsuspecting prey. High school student Shinichi Izumi falls victim to one of these parasites, but the creature fails to take over his brain and ends up in his right hand.', 'A species of parasitic aliens descends on Earth and quickly infiltrates humanity by entering the brains of vulnerable targets; insatiable beings that gain total control of their host and are capable of transforming themselves to feed on unsuspecting prey. High school student Shinichi Izumi falls victim to one of these parasites, but the creature fails to take over his brain and ends up in his right hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cXBfjZSdJelu2r0wKD7qCxS71kb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61459'),
  ('358652377046109257', 'Parasyte: The Grey', 2024, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Yeon Sang-ho', null, 'Jeon So-nee, Koo Kyo-hwan, Lee Jung-hyun, Kwon Hae-hyo, Kim In-kwon', 'TV-MA', 'When unidentified parasites violently take over human hosts and gain power, humanity must rise to combat the growing threat.', 'When unidentified parasites violently take over human hosts and gain power, humanity must rise to combat the growing threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9UPneQ4NF7g6WDNSFE5qyt88wJn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208825'),
  ('176096872259811005', 'Pardon the Intrusion, I''m Home!', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Kana Hanazawa, Kaito Ishikawa, Haruki Ishiya, Chiaki Kobayashi, Riho Sugiyama, Miyu Tomita, Sumire Morohoshi', null, 'Rinko, a quiet office worker and secret otaku, just wants to enjoy her anime in peace. But when a neighbor keeps banging on the wall, she asks her other neighbor, Satsuki, for help. Their attempt to resolve the issue goes wrong, leaving a hole in the wall that reveals…Usaharu-sensei, the creator of Rinko’s favorite manga?! Now with nowhere to hide, their lives begin to overlap in surprising ways!', 'Rinko, a quiet office worker and secret otaku, just wants to enjoy her anime in peace. But when a neighbor keeps banging on the wall, she asks her other neighbor, Satsuki, for help. Their attempt to resolve the issue goes wrong, leaving a hole in the wall that reveals…Usaharu-sensei, the creator of Rinko’s favorite manga?! Now with nowhere to hide, their lives begin to overlap in surprising ways!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipc7ChnTAVAQWJm01UJFq3sjiOL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:306790'),
  ('226065121589408092', 'Parenthood', 2010, 'Drama', 'Jason Katims', null, 'Peter Krause, Lauren Graham, Dax Shepard, Erika Christensen, Monica Potter, Sam Jaeger, Joy Bryant, Mae Whitman', 'TV-14', 'The trials and tribulations of the very large, colorful and imperfect Braverman family.', 'The trials and tribulations of the very large, colorful and imperfect Braverman family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9KjKLJrrUI1sU9bNsQaQ5H8kTyY.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:21762'),
  ('741034168338349723', 'Parenthood', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, 'David Attenborough', null, 'A journey like no other, full of risk and reward. David Attenborough tells stories of dedication, ingenuity and sacrifice as animals embark on an epic challenge – being a parent.', 'A journey like no other, full of risk and reward. David Attenborough tells stories of dedication, ingenuity and sacrifice as animals embark on an epic challenge – being a parent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o9fvGhqyGRN3Jt9XxodGQJG7kHZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:246984'),
  ('1011902663082477425', 'Pariah Nexus', 2023, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Animation', null, null, 'Hannah Melbourn, Helen Keeley', 'TV-14', 'An Imperial Shrine World in the Pariah Nexus has been invaded by the Necrons. The invaders have emerged triumphant and only a few pockets of surviving imperials remain to resist the invading Xenos.', 'An Imperial Shrine World in the Pariah Nexus has been invaded by the Necrons. The invaders have emerged triumphant and only a few pockets of surviving imperials remain to resist the invading Xenos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cP2hSR4oouJMA6dyHAuVVAIifVn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:234897'),
  ('161889926250456945', 'Paris Has Fallen', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, War & Politics', 'Howard Overman', null, 'Tewfik Jallab, Ritu Arya, Emmanuelle Bercot, Ana Ularu, Sean Harris', 'TV-MA', 'A protection officer and an MI6 operative team up after a terrorist attack. They suspect a mole as they race to thwart a larger conspiracy threatening Paris.', 'A protection officer and an MI6 operative team up after a terrorist attack. They suspect a mole as they race to thwart a larger conspiracy threatening Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ei1jnjJ154XN1E4q9JKEpuEImup.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:232018'),
  ('125008958914405562', 'Paris Police 1900', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', 'Fabien Nury, Julien Despaux, Frédéric Balekdjian', 'Fabien Nury, Benjamin Adam, Thibault Valetoux', 'Evelyne Brochu, Jérémie Laheurte, Eugénie Derouand, Thibaut Évrard, Marc Barbé, Patrick d''Assumçao, Alexandre Trocki, Hubert Delattre', null, 'Paris, France, 1899. The corpse of an unknown woman is found in the river Seine. The investigation will push a young ambitious inspector to discover a heavy state secret.', 'Paris, France, 1899. The corpse of an unknown woman is found in the river Seine. The investigation will push a young ambitious inspector to discover a heavy state secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipgBsl4xnBOJETWd1C1maa6Jwou.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93911'),
  ('487421882134766485', 'Paris Police 1905', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Fabien Nury', null, 'Jérémie Laheurte, Evelyne Brochu, Thibaut Évrard, Marc Barbé, François Raison, Mathilde Weil, Christian Hecq, Alexandre Trocki', null, 'When the Paris police''s vice squad - on the orders of Police Chief Lépine - begin to clean prostitutes off the city''s streets, a man''s body is found in the Bois de Boulogne. Inspector Antoine Jouin is entrusted with the investigation.', 'When the Paris police''s vice squad - on the orders of Police Chief Lépine - begin to clean prostitutes off the city''s streets, a man''s body is found in the Bois de Boulogne. Inspector Antoine Jouin is entrusted with the investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZKtfoEseklBYLXhMQmL6uo6guT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:216234'),
  ('946171373860869199', 'Parish', 2024, 'Drama', null, null, 'Giancarlo Esposito, Zackary Momoh, Paula Malcomson, Skeet Ulrich, Ivan Mbakop, Bonnie Mbuli, Arica Himmel, Dax Rey', 'TV-14', 'Gray Parish is a good man with a troubled past who gave up his life of crime for life as a family man. But when his son is violently murdered, old habits return, sending him on a relentless quest with moral intentions and dangerous consequences.', 'Gray Parish is a good man with a troubled past who gave up his life of crime for life as a family man. But when his son is violently murdered, old habits return, sending him on a relentless quest with moral intentions and dangerous consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iV1YDLXuJHwhxF85zwaTxXyrzN6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:194741'),
  ('88423771885614527', 'Parker Lewis Can''t Lose', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Lon Diamond, Clyde Phillips', null, 'Corin Nemec, Billy Jayne, Troy Slaten, Melanie Chartoff, Maia Brewton, Abraham Benrubi, Timothy Stack, Mary Ellen Trainor', 'TV-PG', 'Parker Lewis is a teenager who apparently can''t lose. He''s cool, cute, popular, hip – and seems to get away with anything. That''s not to say he''s got no problems. His two primary nemeses are school principal Grace Musso, whose goal is getting Parker expelled; and his little sister Shelly, whose sole purpose seems to be tattling on Parker. However, with best friends Mikey and Jerry, Parker takes on the world and makes the best of high school.', 'Parker Lewis is a teenager who apparently can''t lose. He''s cool, cute, popular, hip – and seems to get away with anything. That''s not to say he''s got no problems. His two primary nemeses are school principal Grace Musso, whose goal is getting Parker expelled; and his little sister Shelly, whose sole purpose seems to be tattling on Parker. However, with best friends Mikey and Jerry, Parker takes on the world and makes the best of high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kVzjNtBDPy0rY5gXOx7nELDGKO.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:3089'),
