  ('270749188897467961', 'Partisan', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', 'Amir Chamdin', null, 'Anna Björk, Fares Fares, Sofia Karemyr, Ylvali Rurling, Johan Rheborg, Emelie Jonsson, Pelle Holmström, Nanna Blondell', null, 'A man gets a new job in the idyllic surroundings of Jordnära, a gated community that runs a successful organic farm. But he quickly realizes that their rules and routines are somewhat unorthodox.', 'A man gets a new job in the idyllic surroundings of Jordnära, a gated community that runs a successful organic farm. But he quickly realizes that their rules and routines are somewhat unorthodox.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cB5nWzWFrphVo7PF1rTWWLC6DG5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:107306'),
  ('107198166805850910', 'Partner Track', 2022, 'Drama', 'Georgia Lee', null, 'Arden Cho, Alexandra Turshen, Bradley Gibson, Dominic Sherwood, Nolan Gerard Funk, Matthew Rauch, Zane Phillips', 'TV-MA', 'At an elite NYC law firm, Ingrid Yun fights to make partner — and hold onto her principles — while balancing romance, friends and family expectations.', 'At an elite NYC law firm, Ingrid Yun fights to make partner — and hold onto her principles — while balancing romance, friends and family expectations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekb76bz68oSJrbYrDMCYsLI5I6E.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135035'),
  ('1150117876279493758', 'Partners', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Max Mutchnick, David Kohan', null, 'David Krumholtz, Michael Urie, Sophia Bush, Brandon Routh', 'TV-14', 'Two lifelong friends, who are both architects, form a business partnership. Partners is a comedy that is about a life long bromance between Joe and Louis, two architects who have been friends nearly their entire lives. They are now are business partners, owning their own small architecture firm. Joe is very rational and level headed, following his head over his heart, sometimes a detriment to his relationships. Joe is newly engaged to Ali, a beautiful jewelry designer who brings out the best in him. Louis, in contrast to Joe, is passionate, outspoken and tends to exaggerate in order to make his point. Louis'' partner''s name is Wyatt, and is a vegan male nurse who is soft spoken and overly understanding. As they live their lives they must find a way to adapt, redefining the bond between them both personally and professionally now that there is an addition of two other important relationships.', 'Two lifelong friends, who are both architects, form a business partnership. Partners is a comedy that is about a life long bromance between Joe and Louis, two architects who have been friends nearly their entire lives. They are now are business partners, owning their own small architecture firm. Joe is very rational and level headed, following his head over his heart, sometimes a detriment to his relationships. Joe is newly engaged to Ali, a beautiful jewelry designer who brings out the best in him. Louis, in contrast to Joe, is passionate, outspoken and tends to exaggerate in order to make his point. Louis'' partner''s name is Wyatt, and is a vegan male nurse who is soft spoken and overly understanding. As they live their lives they must find a way to adapt, redefining the bond between them both personally and professionally now that there is an addition of two other important relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hw9rJ6DsbyEa1cPijUfdroYOQtY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43755'),
  ('600503309813085447', 'Partners', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Robert L. Boyett, Robert Horn', null, 'Kelsey Grammer, Martin Lawrence, Telma Hopkins, Rory O''Malley, Edi Patterson, Danièle Watts, McKaley Miller', 'TV-14', 'Allen Braddock and Marcus Jackson are two attorneys with very different views on the law. After getting fired from his father''s prestigious firm for employing questionable tactics, Allen is forced to team up with Marcus, a self-made man always willing to fight for the people of his neighborhood, even if it doesn''t mean collecting a check. When the two partner up, they take on cases that challenge their moral, personal, and ethical boundaries, but always manage to find common ground.', 'Allen Braddock and Marcus Jackson are two attorneys with very different views on the law. After getting fired from his father''s prestigious firm for employing questionable tactics, Allen is forced to team up with Marcus, a self-made man always willing to fight for the people of his neighborhood, even if it doesn''t mean collecting a check. When the two partner up, they take on cases that challenge their moral, personal, and ethical boundaries, but always manage to find common ground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qdcPKb318gGUHwazSO94Tv5XinQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61211'),
  ('1009201353182645830', 'Partners for Justice', 2018, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Son Hyung-Suk', 'Jo Won-Ki, Min Ji-eun', 'Jung Jae-young, Jeong Yu-mi, No Min-woo, Kang Seung-hyun, Ahn Suk-hwan, Park Jun-gyu, Park Hee-jin, Ko Kyu-pil', null, 'Baek Beom has worked as a forensic doctor for 10 years. He has a bad personality, but he is excellent with his work. Baek Beom does not open his mind to other people. Eun Sol is a rookie prosecutor with a warm heart. She has a bright personality and she comes from wealth family background. The forensic doctor and prosecutor work together to solve cases.', 'Baek Beom has worked as a forensic doctor for 10 years. He has a bad personality, but he is excellent with his work. Baek Beom does not open his mind to other people. Eun Sol is a rookie prosecutor with a warm heart. She has a bright personality and she comes from wealth family background. The forensic doctor and prosecutor work together to solve cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lPU34PKrjJNISguneRdAB7zQfTj.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:79070'),
  ('856145642010623019', 'Partners in Crime', 2015, 'Mystery, Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Zinnie Harris, Claire Wilson', null, 'David Walliams, Jessica Raine, James Fleet, Matthew Steer, Paul Brennen, Jonny Phillips, Clarke Peters, Hannah Waddingham', 'TV-PG', 'Set in a 1950s Britain rising from the ashes of the Blitz into the grip of a new Cold War, our beekeeping duo stumble into a world of murder, undercover agents and cold war conspiracy. Tuppence is a woman who sees adventure round every corner, throwing herself head first into every mystery with passion and fervour, determined to get to the truth no matter what it takes, much to the dismay of her more cautious husband Tommy.', 'Set in a 1950s Britain rising from the ashes of the Blitz into the grip of a new Cold War, our beekeeping duo stumble into a world of murder, undercover agents and cold war conspiracy. Tuppence is a woman who sees adventure round every corner, throwing herself head first into every mystery with passion and fervour, determined to get to the truth no matter what it takes, much to the dismay of her more cautious husband Tommy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Zwurp836fMcLpOwMDciWiiak0X.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62478'),
  ('1063178526363259333', 'Party Down', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Paul Rudd, Rob Thomas, John Enbom', null, 'Adam Scott, Ken Marino, Jane Lynch, Ryan Hansen, Martin Starr, Megan Mullally, Jennifer Garner, Tyrel Jackson Williams', 'TV-MA', 'A group of struggling actors and dysfunctional dreamers wait for their big break while they are stuck serving hors d''oeurves for a Hollywood catering company ''Party Down.''', 'A group of struggling actors and dysfunctional dreamers wait for their big break while they are stuck serving hors d''oeurves for a Hollywood catering company ''Party Down.''', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hbsoFctJ1dDPp3KUIuUgd2E1U4r.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:17287'),
  ('1132465000285898490', 'Party of Five', 1994, 'Drama', 'Christopher Keyser, Amy Lippman', null, 'Matthew Fox, Neve Campbell, Lacey Chabert, Scott Wolf, Paula Devicq, Jeremy London, Jennifer Aspen, Scott Grimes', 'TV-PG', 'Five brothers and sisters are determined to stay together following the tragic loss of their parents.', 'Five brothers and sisters are determined to stay together following the tragic loss of their parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LZgFeMynMeeKX8Bn9s1RWe9n9S.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:4266'),
  ('13278732474739074', 'Party of Five', 2020, 'Drama, Family', 'Amy Lippman, Christopher Keyser', null, 'Elle Paris Legaspi, Brandon Larracuente, Emily Tosta, Niko Guardado', 'TV-14', 'The five Acosta children navigate daily life struggles to survive as a family unit after their parents are suddenly deported back to Mexico.', 'The five Acosta children navigate daily life struggles to survive as a family unit after their parents are suddenly deported back to Mexico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GhdzcEKitGNt3hhsSv3uOecsGf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87890'),
  ('401909162521993495', 'Pasadena', 2001, 'Drama, Soap', 'Mike White', null, 'Dana Delany, Martin Donovan, Balthazar Getty, Alison Lohman, Christopher Rodriguez Marquette, Nicole Paggi, Alan Simpson, Mark Valley', 'TV-14', 'Lily McAllister has lived a charmed life as part of the most powerful family in the upscale Southern California enclave of Pasadena. All that changes, however, when a murder and coverup in her own mansion thrusts Lily into a search to unlock her family''s long-buried secrets.', 'Lily McAllister has lived a charmed life as part of the most powerful family in the upscale Southern California enclave of Pasadena. All that changes, however, when a murder and coverup in her own mansion thrusts Lily into a search to unlock her family''s long-buried secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jY9NdQKNlUJswTycfN7yqhjpVKc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128'),
  ('434037109341134324', 'Pasapalabra', 2018, null, null, null, 'Julián Elfenbein', null, 'Game show in which every episode two contestants team with celebrities to play various games. A team''s correct responses in these games score seconds, extending their contestant''s time limit in the final game, known as ''el rosco''.', 'Game show in which every episode two contestants team with celebrities to play various games. A team''s correct responses in these games score seconds, extending their contestant''s time limit in the final game, known as ''el rosco''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lKyZRf3jiUSH9Iz6PS8g303tRFk.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:120263'),
  ('753881642544697407', 'Pasión de Gavilanes', 2003, 'Drama', 'Julio Jiménez', null, 'Mario Cimarro, Danna García, Juan A. Baptista, Paola Rey, Michel Brown, Natasha Klauss, Kristina Lilley, Zharick León', 'TV-14', 'The Reyes-Elizondo''s idyllic lives are shattered by a murder charge against Eric and León.', 'The Reyes-Elizondo''s idyllic lives are shattered by a murder charge against Eric and León.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/91UV7pNcDPhIzJl7EuK36sK5vRG.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:11250'),
  ('585153502969849704', 'Pasión prohibida', 2013, 'Drama', null, null, 'Jencarlos Canela, Mónica Spear, Roberto Vander, Rebecca Jones, Mercedes Molto, Carmen Aub, Pepe Gámez, Sharlene Taulé', 'NR', 'Pasión Prohibida is a Spanish-language telenovela produced by United States-based television network Telemundo Television Studios, Miami. It is a remake of the Turkish telenovela Aşk-ı Memnu by Ece Yörenç and Melek Gençoğlu. It has been adapted from Halit Ziya Uşaklıgil''s novel Aşk-ı Memnu, published in 1900, but takes place in the modern-day Miami, instead of the novel''s late 19th century setting. Jencarlos Canela and Mónica Spear starred as the protagonists.', 'Pasión Prohibida is a Spanish-language telenovela produced by United States-based television network Telemundo Television Studios, Miami. It is a remake of the Turkish telenovela Aşk-ı Memnu by Ece Yörenç and Melek Gençoğlu. It has been adapted from Halit Ziya Uşaklıgil''s novel Aşk-ı Memnu, published in 1900, but takes place in the modern-day Miami, instead of the novel''s late 19th century setting. Jencarlos Canela and Mónica Spear starred as the protagonists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uA5nvnaSBr6SIqPPgSeIPZMRKtC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44824'),
  ('806782071418879784', 'Pass the Monster Meat, Milady!', 2025, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Kanna Nakamura, Taito Ban, Takashi Kondo, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Ryohei Kimura, Hinata Tadokoro', 'TV-14', 'Any proper noble lady must cultivate refined tastes, and Lady Melphiera''s delicacy of choice is…monsters! Unfortunately, society frowns upon such unladylike cravings and brands her the "Voracious Villainess." At a banquet, she''s attacked by a monster, only to be saved by the feared "Blood-Mad Duke." He''s brutal, mysterious, and charming. Could he be the one to appreciate her monstrous appetite?', 'Any proper noble lady must cultivate refined tastes, and Lady Melphiera''s delicacy of choice is…monsters! Unfortunately, society frowns upon such unladylike cravings and brands her the "Voracious Villainess." At a banquet, she''s attacked by a monster, only to be saved by the feared "Blood-Mad Duke." He''s brutal, mysterious, and charming. Could he be the one to appreciate her monstrous appetite?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yab0QzxTOGgBK1WTkHfU4s7BhF9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:274814'),
  ('682793070452791997', 'Passenger', 2024, 'Mystery, Comedy, Crime', 'Andrew Buchan', 'Andrew Buchan', 'Wunmi Mosaku, Rowan Robinson, Barry Sloane, David Threlfall, Daniel Ryan, Natalie Gavin, Hubert Hanowicz, Jack James Ryan', null, 'A close-knit community is sent spinning on its axis following a series of strange and unnatural crimes.', 'A close-knit community is sent spinning on its axis following a series of strange and unnatural crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ulFminIHylwJaORyAf7IfHjvWCn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241099'),
  ('252023584630447040', 'Passengers', 2020, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Ruslan Sorokin, Ekaterina Sokolova, Anna Anosova', 'Sergey Gilev, Anna Chipovskaya, Nadezhda Markina, Irina Rakhmanova, Kirill Käro, Sergey Shakurov, Nataliya Vdovina, Nikita Kologrivyy', null, 'Andrey drives a cab, but he’s no ordinary Taxi driver. All his passengers are dead. His job is to deliver them to the Afterlife, but it’s never straightforward. Andrey’s passengers come from all walks of life and each has a story, they can’t reach their destined afterlife until they face-up to and atone for something from their past. But it’s a rare soul who wants to hold a mirror up to their faults, they need a guide, some encouragement, and so they turn to the only other presence in the taxi, Andrey. Andrey himself is an enigma, a taciturn driver who exists only in the present, and a reluctant guide for lost souls. Each time Andrey successfully delivers a lost soul from limbo, a mysterious number on the taxi-meter counts down one by one. And with each soul’s story a little bit more of Andrey’s past is revealed. Are the Passengers the only souls seeking redemption?', 'Andrey drives a cab, but he’s no ordinary Taxi driver. All his passengers are dead. His job is to deliver them to the Afterlife, but it’s never straightforward. Andrey’s passengers come from all walks of life and each has a story, they can’t reach their destined afterlife until they face-up to and atone for something from their past. But it’s a rare soul who wants to hold a mirror up to their faults, they need a guide, some encouragement, and so they turn to the only other presence in the taxi, Andrey. Andrey himself is an enigma, a taciturn driver who exists only in the present, and a reluctant guide for lost souls. Each time Andrey successfully delivers a lost soul from limbo, a mysterious number on the taxi-meter counts down one by one. And with each soul’s story a little bit more of Andrey’s past is revealed. Are the Passengers the only souls seeking redemption?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubb9A6kFd3685EexLtdKyJgNsnB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:111934'),
  ('108213937856666576', 'Passione', 2010, 'Soap', 'Silvio de Abreu', 'Silvio de Abreu, Daniel Ortiz, Mário Teixeira', 'Tony Ramos, Mariana Ximenes, Fernanda Montenegro, Reynaldo Gianecchini, Aracy Balabanian, Marcello Antony, Carolina Dieckmmann, Rodrigo Lombardi', null, 'An ambitious young woman with a traumatizing past targets an Italian man, the distant son of a wealthy Brazilian family.', 'An ambitious young woman with a traumatizing past targets an Italian man, the distant son of a wealthy Brazilian family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d3TjhYwBkrJwHlD9XWwCWbCkgf0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45817'),
  ('878384358147072744', 'Passions', 1999, 'Soap, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'James E. Reilly', null, 'Lindsay Hartley, Juliet Mills, Kim Johnston Ulrich, McKenzie Westmore, Galen Gering, Eva Tamargo, Ben Masters, James Hyde', null, 'Passions is an American television soap opera which aired on NBC from July 5, 1999 to September 7, 2007 and on The 101 Network from September 17, 2007 to August 7, 2008. Passions follows the lives and loves, and various romantic and paranormal adventures of the residents of Harmony. Story-lines center around the interactions among members of its multi-racial core families — the African American Russells, white Cranes and Bennetts, and half-Mexican half-Irish Lopez-Fitzgeralds — as well as the supernatural including town witch Tabitha Lenox. Created by writer James E. Reilly and produced by NBC Studios, the series was subsequently picked up by direct broadcast satellite service DirecTV, which broadcast new episodes airing on its exclusive channel The 101. In December 2007, DirecTV decided not to renew its contract for the series, and the studio was unable to sell the show elsewhere. The final episode aired on DirecTV on August 7, 2008.', 'Passions is an American television soap opera which aired on NBC from July 5, 1999 to September 7, 2007 and on The 101 Network from September 17, 2007 to August 7, 2008. Passions follows the lives and loves, and various romantic and paranormal adventures of the residents of Harmony. Story-lines center around the interactions among members of its multi-racial core families — the African American Russells, white Cranes and Bennetts, and half-Mexican half-Irish Lopez-Fitzgeralds — as well as the supernatural including town witch Tabitha Lenox. Created by writer James E. Reilly and produced by NBC Studios, the series was subsequently picked up by direct broadcast satellite service DirecTV, which broadcast new episodes airing on its exclusive channel The 101. In December 2007, DirecTV decided not to renew its contract for the series, and the studio was unable to sell the show elsewhere. The final episode aired on DirecTV on August 7, 2008.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSC2G5Git9MSPmiAOmE8cZwlR75.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:9912'),
  ('595637766773740551', 'Passport to Freedom', 2021, 'Drama', 'Mário Teixeira', 'Rachel Anthony', 'Sophie Charlotte, Rodrigo Lombardi, Tarcísio Filho, Stefan Weinert, Aryè Campos, Tomas Spencer, Peter Ketnath, Gabriela Petry', null, 'Aracy de Carvalho is a young clerk at the Brazilian Consulate. For two years, she has been secretly issuing passports to Jews without the dreaded "J" stamp, which not only won''t allow them to travel, but will doom them to the horrors of concentration camps. When newly appointed diplomat, João Guimarães Rosa, arrives in Hamburg, the two fall madly in love. Aracy would later be honored by the Yad Vashem with the Righteous Among the Nations Award. João would be known as the greatest Brazilian writer of the twentieth century.', 'Aracy de Carvalho is a young clerk at the Brazilian Consulate. For two years, she has been secretly issuing passports to Jews without the dreaded "J" stamp, which not only won''t allow them to travel, but will doom them to the horrors of concentration camps. When newly appointed diplomat, João Guimarães Rosa, arrives in Hamburg, the two fall madly in love. Aracy would later be honored by the Yad Vashem with the Righteous Among the Nations Award. João would be known as the greatest Brazilian writer of the twentieth century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/clQZ0vLPdQP5TzwOUELpJV5NcWN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:152360'),
  ('1062192268855432977', 'Past Lies', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', 'José Manuel Lorenzo', null, 'Elena Anaya, Belén Cuesta, Irene Escolar, Marta Etura, Itziar Atienza, Ana Rayo, Lorena López', null, 'A group of women''s lives are suddenly shaken by the appearance of a high school classmate who disappeared twenty-five years earlier on their senior trip.', 'A group of women''s lives are suddenly shaken by the appearance of a high school classmate who disappeared twenty-five years earlier on their senior trip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pVpw78YLUOqEbqmzDtkFKKAjKL5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:242904'),
  ('512876372304291588', 'Pasta', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Seo Sook-hyang', null, 'Gong Hyo-jin, Lee Sun-kyun, Alex Chu, Choi Shang, Jang Yong, Choi Jae-hwan, Jung Da-hye, Byeon Jung-su', 'TV-14', 'Pasta follows the dreams and successes of a young woman who aspires to become an elite chef at La Sfera Italian restaurant.', 'Pasta follows the dreams and successes of a young woman who aspires to become an elite chef at La Sfera Italian restaurant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mkeKDuZv7QmBWvnLNfsti3batMm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32220'),
  ('53839986900354533', 'Pastel Memories', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mariko Toribe, Hiyori Nitta, Yumi Uchiyama, Yukiyo Fujii, Rie Murakawa, Naomi Ohzora, Yui Ogura, Ai Yamamoto', null, 'Akihabara is known as a shining beacon for otaku culture everywhere. But in a not-to-distant future, that culture is on the decline due to a mysterious affliction causing widespread memory loss. As a result, Akihabara has lost its luster. However, in one of the few remaining otaku shops, Izumi and a handful of comrades hatch a plan to restore lost memories and return “Akiba” to its former glory.', 'Akihabara is known as a shining beacon for otaku culture everywhere. But in a not-to-distant future, that culture is on the decline due to a mysterious affliction causing widespread memory loss. As a result, Akihabara has lost its luster. However, in one of the few remaining otaku shops, Izumi and a handful of comrades hatch a plan to restore lost memories and return “Akiba” to its former glory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/380LiEEEbyqrVUFpUiperiYNP9S.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83120'),
  ('902822280779484718', 'Pastewka', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Chris Geletneky, Sascha Albrecht, Moritz Netenjakob', null, 'Bastian Pastewka, Sonsee Neu, Matthias Matschke, Bettina Lamprecht, Cristina do Rego, Dietrich Hollinderbäumer, Sabine Vitua', null, 'Pastewka is a German television sitcom that began airing on German TV channel Sat.1 in 2005. The series, currently in its sixth season, is set in Cologne, with German actor Bastian Pastewka starring as a fictionalized version of himself. It has been compared to Seinfeld and Larry David''s Curb Your Enthusiasm. The series was awarded, among others, the Rose d''Or and the German Television Prize. Series was directed by Joseph Orr and Jan Markus Linhof.', 'Pastewka is a German television sitcom that began airing on German TV channel Sat.1 in 2005. The series, currently in its sixth season, is set in Cologne, with German actor Bastian Pastewka starring as a fictionalized version of himself. It has been compared to Seinfeld and Larry David''s Curb Your Enthusiasm. The series was awarded, among others, the Rose d''Or and the German Television Prize. Series was directed by Joseph Orr and Jan Markus Linhof.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g0xxcia1LBiSTlzbpglbTXsyEHz.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:36846'),
  ('786210872178832353', 'Pat & Mat', 1979, 'Animation, Kids, Family, Comedy', 'Lubomír Beneš, Vladimír Jiránek', null, null, null, 'Pat & Mat is a Czech stop-motion animated series featuring two handymen, Pat and Mat. It was created by Lubomír Beneš and Vladimír Jiránek.', 'Pat & Mat is a Czech stop-motion animated series featuring two handymen, Pat and Mat. It was created by Lubomír Beneš and Vladimír Jiránek.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvVx4hpKnFcL5ZzQxWF5aIscO8z.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:20475'),
