  ('169109222630998032', 'Pie in the Sky', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Andrew Payne', null, 'Richard Griffiths, Nicholas Lamont, Marsha Thomason', null, 'Pie in the Sky is a British offbeat police comedy drama programme starring Richard Griffiths and Maggie Steed, created by Andrew Payne and first broadcast in five series on BBC1 between 13 March 1994 and 17 August 1997 as well as being syndicated on other channels in other countries, including the Australian Broadcasting Corporation. The series departs slightly from other police dramas in that the protagonist, Henry Crabbe, while still being an on-duty policeman, is also the head chef of the title restaurant set in the fictional town of Middleton and county of Westershire.', 'Pie in the Sky is a British offbeat police comedy drama programme starring Richard Griffiths and Maggie Steed, created by Andrew Payne and first broadcast in five series on BBC1 between 13 March 1994 and 17 August 1997 as well as being syndicated on other channels in other countries, including the Australian Broadcasting Corporation. The series departs slightly from other police dramas in that the protagonist, Henry Crabbe, while still being an on-duty policeman, is also the head chef of the title restaurant set in the fictional town of Middleton and county of Westershire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qlbRdPHnAK7d5eb5Jx5qVLyFN0D.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:2399'),
  ('302026534663926942', 'PIECES OF HER', 2022, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Charlotte Stoudt', null, 'Toni Collette, Bella Heathcote', 'TV-MA', 'A woman pieces together her mother''s dark past after a violent attack in their small town brings hidden threats and deadly secrets to light.', 'A woman pieces together her mother''s dark past after a violent attack in their small town brings hidden threats and deadly secrets to light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQXWrKb5x5O2T34ofvPnNwhxu7M.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99002'),
  ('98005023371407168', 'Pieces of Paradise', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Loisa Andalio, Alexa Ilacad, Charlie Dizon, Elisse Joson, Ronnie Alonte, KD Estrada, Joseph Marco, Argel Saycon', null, 'A con artist takes on the job of pretending to be one of the long-lost sisters of a young and rich woman. As she navigates a world of cunning and lies, she learns about right and wrong, love and family, and spectacular truths about herself.', 'A con artist takes on the job of pretending to be one of the long-lost sisters of a young and rich woman. As she navigates a world of cunning and lies, she learns about right and wrong, love and family, and spectacular truths about herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gELcO56G9EsUj6LSjaDq8VvI8De.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:225660'),
  ('1151456358887413055', 'Piedone - A Cop in Naples', 2024, 'Comedy, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Salvatore Esposito, Peppe Fiore', null, 'Salvatore Esposito, Silvia D''Amico, Fabio Balsamo, Susy Del Giudice, Massimiliano Rossi, Gaia Scodellaro, Antonio De Matteo', null, 'Back in the police force after being suspended, Vicenzo Palmieri, infamous for his rough charm, adopts creative ways to bring criminals to justice.', 'Back in the police force after being suspended, Vicenzo Palmieri, infamous for his rough charm, adopts creative ways to bring criminals to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uVwAwcyIh5NpeRjHROEkPb6yBJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:276021'),
  ('763882043983494344', 'Piel de otoño', 2005, 'Drama', 'Liliana Abud, Eric Vonn', 'Martha Oláiz, Antonio Abascal, Rossana Ruiz', 'Laura Flores, René Strickler, Sergio Goyri, Sabine Moussier, Raquel Olmedo, Gerardo Murguía, María Marcela, Manuel Landeta', null, 'Piel de otoño is a Mexican telenovela that was produced by Televisa and broadcast on El Canal de las Estrellas in Mexico from 9 May 2005 through 23 September 2005 in Mexico, and from October 10, 2005, through February 17, 2005, in the United States. Starring Laura Flores and René Strickler as the series'' protagonists, the show tells the story of Lucía Villarreal de Mendoza, a woman who seeks refuge from her husband and children''s abuses in the friendship of a stranger on the Internet, who signs his messages only as "wind". Piel de otoño is a remake of the 1986 Televisa telenovela Cicatrices del alma. The program aired weekdays at 5 pm for twenty weeks.', 'Piel de otoño is a Mexican telenovela that was produced by Televisa and broadcast on El Canal de las Estrellas in Mexico from 9 May 2005 through 23 September 2005 in Mexico, and from October 10, 2005, through February 17, 2005, in the United States. Starring Laura Flores and René Strickler as the series'' protagonists, the show tells the story of Lucía Villarreal de Mendoza, a woman who seeks refuge from her husband and children''s abuses in the friendship of a stranger on the Internet, who signs his messages only as "wind". Piel de otoño is a remake of the 1986 Televisa telenovela Cicatrices del alma. The program aired weekdays at 5 pm for twenty weeks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6LnpNsINdgUjw4LiIBL8BRlsnox.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16291'),
