  ('895336867989128744', 'Pili', 1988, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Chris Huang, Vincent Huang', null, null, null, 'Pili is a puppet show from Taiwan. It is made by Pili International Multimedia. The TV series started in 1985, and it still continues today. It is one of the most popular TV shows in Taiwan. Pili puppet show is performed by many kinds of puppets, some of them are cool, some are intelligent, and some are funny. Unlike traditional puppet shows, Pili puppet show uses state-of-the-art animation to help present its fighting art. The delicate design of the appearance and characteristics of each puppet has made Pili puppet show a well-known entertainment in Taiwan.', 'Pili is a puppet show from Taiwan. It is made by Pili International Multimedia. The TV series started in 1985, and it still continues today. It is one of the most popular TV shows in Taiwan. Pili puppet show is performed by many kinds of puppets, some of them are cool, some are intelligent, and some are funny. Unlike traditional puppet shows, Pili puppet show uses state-of-the-art animation to help present its fighting art. The delicate design of the appearance and characteristics of each puppet has made Pili puppet show a well-known entertainment in Taiwan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBVfyRYPmKSARRTodsTbwHqgcRA.jpg', 88, 'tmdb:tv:19530'),
  ('880316071633308718', 'Pimp My Ride', 2004, 'Reality', 'Bruce Beresford-Redman, Rick Hurvitz', 'Ari Shofet, Larry Hochberg', 'Xzibit, Beau Boeckmann, Michael Martin, Dave Aragon', null, 'Pimp My Ride is a TV show produced by MTV. Each episode consists of taking one car in poor condition and restoring it, as well as customizing it. The original American version was hosted by rapper Xzibit. Recently, MTV2 has begun airing episodes from Pimp My Ride UK hosted by DJ Tim Westwood, which features cars being customised in the UK, and Pimp My Ride International, featuring cars in central Europe, hosted by hip hop artists Fat Joe and Lil'' Jon, as well as the related CMT series Trick My Truck.', 'Pimp My Ride is a TV show produced by MTV. Each episode consists of taking one car in poor condition and restoring it, as well as customizing it. The original American version was hosted by rapper Xzibit. Recently, MTV2 has begun airing episodes from Pimp My Ride UK hosted by DJ Tim Westwood, which features cars being customised in the UK, and Pimp My Ride International, featuring cars in central Europe, hosted by hip hop artists Fat Joe and Lil'' Jon, as well as the related CMT series Trick My Truck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kF0DWjx3MfYRncPGSBoaL41StPe.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:1976'),
  ('29644307452868541', 'Pimville', 2026, 'Soap', null, null, 'Gail Mabalane, Matli Mohapeloa, Thapelo Mokoena, Keke Mphuthi, Mondli Makhoba, Michelle Mosalakae, Clementine Mosimane, Fulu Mugovhani', null, 'Pimville is a South African telenovela set in the heart of Soweto which follows the lives of various characters as they navigate complex relationships, secrets and power struggles. From reformed hustlers to strong matriarchs, each character brings their own story to the table. The series shines a light on the pulse of township life where dreams collide with reality, secrets unravel and family bonds are tested.', 'Pimville is a South African telenovela set in the heart of Soweto which follows the lives of various characters as they navigate complex relationships, secrets and power struggles. From reformed hustlers to strong matriarchs, each character brings their own story to the table. The series shines a light on the pulse of township life where dreams collide with reality, secrets unravel and family bonds are tested.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xzd8ib7tnc3npRZPd0mtjWYEA5d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:313584'),
  ('987950393227680966', 'Pinches Momias', 2023, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'José Miguel Nuñez, Santiago Limón', null, 'Rogério da Cruz, Xiunel González, Daniel Ábrego, Berenice Jonguitud, Vitter Leija, Saak, Laura Wedel, Natalia Solián', null, 'With roots in Mexican history and folklore, it is based on the mummies of Guanajuato, one of the most fascinating collections in the world. The series follows a group of teenagers from Guanajuato, who represent the only hope for their people to survive when the renowned mummies are resurrected during the Cervantino Festival, the busiest week of the year.', 'With roots in Mexican history and folklore, it is based on the mummies of Guanajuato, one of the most fascinating collections in the world. The series follows a group of teenagers from Guanajuato, who represent the only hope for their people to survive when the renowned mummies are resurrected during the Cervantino Festival, the busiest week of the year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LkqyZQf7GPlpwpIHbdzuVCXOUj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:234200'),
  ('677851745767109337', 'Pine Gap', 2018, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Felicity Packard, Greg Haddrick', null, 'Parker Sawyers, Jacqueline McKenzie, Steve Toussaint, Tess Haubrich, Stephen Curry, Lewis Fitz-Gerald, Mark Leonard Winter, Sachin Joab', null, 'A team of talented Australian and American intelligence analysts work together to ensure global stability in one of the world''s most important and secretive joint intelligence facilities... Pine Gap. But the relationship between the Australian and American intelligence analysts working at Pine Gap isn’t always rosy.', 'A team of talented Australian and American intelligence analysts work together to ensure global stability in one of the world''s most important and secretive joint intelligence facilities... Pine Gap. But the relationship between the Australian and American intelligence analysts working at Pine Gap isn’t always rosy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tVGnKORliwBh2ZEpGfvoclUe1O1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82469'),
  ('655767957378673787', 'Ping Pong Ball', 2018, 'Drama', null, null, 'You Chea-myung, Kim Ji-soo, Jung Young-ki, Na Hae-ryung, Choi Gwang-il, Seo Dong-gab, Lee Hyun-kyun', null, 'Kim Young Joon is a philosophy major at a university. He confesses his feelings to a female classmate, but she rejects him. He takes her rejection hard. Kim Young Joon then meets a mysterious homeless man, Kim Deuk Hwan who lives under a small bridge. Kim Deuk Hwan has also experienced rejection in love and they develop a friendship.', 'Kim Young Joon is a philosophy major at a university. He confesses his feelings to a female classmate, but she rejects him. He takes her rejection hard. Kim Young Joon then meets a mysterious homeless man, Kim Deuk Hwan who lives under a small bridge. Kim Deuk Hwan has also experienced rejection in love and they develop a friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6FHww5p1s9geRLNka6eAHGjzR2r.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82423'),
  ('1131033564707469070', 'Ping Pong the Animation', 2014, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Koki Uchiyama, Fukujuro Katayama, Yousei Bun, Shunsuke Sakuya, Subaru Kimura, Yusaku Yara, Masako Nozawa', 'TV-14', 'Makoto ''Smile'' Tsukimoto and his friend Yutaka ''Peco'' Hoshino have been playing table tennis together since they were kids, but as they enter high school, they find that the game, and how they see it, has changed. Peco, brimming with confidence and energy, wants to be the best in the world, but the reserved Smile has little fighting spirit and doesn''t want to sacrifice others'' happiness just to win, despite his innate talent. As the two grow, and experience the ups and downs of the sport – and life – they try to figure out exactly who they really are and what drives them to play.', 'Makoto ''Smile'' Tsukimoto and his friend Yutaka ''Peco'' Hoshino have been playing table tennis together since they were kids, but as they enter high school, they find that the game, and how they see it, has changed. Peco, brimming with confidence and energy, wants to be the best in the world, but the reserved Smile has little fighting spirit and doesn''t want to sacrifice others'' happiness just to win, despite his innate talent. As the two grow, and experience the ups and downs of the sport – and life – they try to figure out exactly who they really are and what drives them to play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/frgVn3ww547TVQH8vS2bWKZnEBu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60811'),
  ('822352100352625865', 'Pingu', 1986, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Otmar Gutmann, Erika Brueggemann', null, 'Marcello Magni, David Sant', 'TV-Y', 'Playful penguin Pingu lives with his family in Antarctica, where he often finds himself caught up in mischievous high jinks with his pal Robby.', 'Playful penguin Pingu lives with his family in Antarctica, where he often finds himself caught up in mischievous high jinks with his pal Robby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLE7NR3EsEbv2NfG0bLIaOEhGfY.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:9262'),
  ('770156749513554141', 'Pink Lie', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Kim Hee-chul, Lee Sun-bin, Go Wook, Han Na-yeon, RALRAL', null, 'Young men and women move into the Pink House, each carrying one lie about themselves, be it their occupation, age, or academic background. Whirlwinds of emotions break out in the face of unraveling truth. Identities reveal as the relationships walk the tight rope between love and reality.', 'Young men and women move into the Pink House, each carrying one lie about themselves, be it their occupation, age, or academic background. Whirlwinds of emotions break out in the face of unraveling truth. Identities reveal as the relationships walk the tight rope between love and reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jmLj39flUKMfS2s4ScOWZuMytjY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210229'),
  ('979396537259517547', 'Pink Panther and Pals', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Blake Edwards, David H. DePatie', null, 'Kel Mitchell, Eddie Garvar, Alex Nussbaum, John Over, Jeannie Elias, Bob Spang', 'TV-Y7', 'A teenage version of the iconic character shares adventures with old friends and some new cartoon pals.', 'A teenage version of the iconic character shares adventures with old friends and some new cartoon pals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/apVqDRuxv6f5ma2sb6IhIHWOKwv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5559'),
  ('211630019250032570', 'Pink Panther and Sons', 1984, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Frank Welker, B.J. Ward, Jeannie Elias, Sherry Lynn, Sonny Melendrez, Gregg Berger', 'NR', 'Pink Panther and Sons is an American animated Pink Panther television series produced by Hanna-Barbera Productions and MGM/UA Television. The series was originally broadcast on NBC from 1984 to 1985 and moved to ABC in 1986. The original Pink Panther cartoons were produced by DePatie-Freleng Enterprises, is in the TV animation industry, but in 1981, the studio was sold to Marvel Comics and renamed Marvel Productions. David DePatie and Friz Freleng served as producers for the series.', 'Pink Panther and Sons is an American animated Pink Panther television series produced by Hanna-Barbera Productions and MGM/UA Television. The series was originally broadcast on NBC from 1984 to 1985 and moved to ABC in 1986. The original Pink Panther cartoons were produced by DePatie-Freleng Enterprises, is in the TV animation industry, but in 1981, the studio was sold to Marvel Comics and renamed Marvel Productions. David DePatie and Friz Freleng served as producers for the series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4B2WKgIY1uNov3zLAgSeNIk5G0W.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12479'),
  ('881485570809033452', 'Pinky and the Brain', 1995, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, 'Rob Paulsen, Maurice LaMarche', 'TV-Y7', 'Pinky and Brain are genetically enhanced laboratory mice who reside in a cage in the Acme Labs research facility. Brain is self-centered and scheming; Pinky is good-natured but feebleminded. In each episode, Brain devises a new plan to take over the world, which ultimately ends in failure, usually due to Pinky''s idiocy, the impossibility of Brain''s plan, Brain''s own arrogance, or just circumstances beyond their control.', 'Pinky and Brain are genetically enhanced laboratory mice who reside in a cage in the Acme Labs research facility. Brain is self-centered and scheming; Pinky is good-natured but feebleminded. In each episode, Brain devises a new plan to take over the world, which ultimately ends in failure, usually due to Pinky''s idiocy, the impossibility of Brain''s plan, Brain''s own arrogance, or just circumstances beyond their control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/69Hrbgi2qcy8xjcwad94VNHpXLI.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2228'),
  ('293741860051438799', 'Pinky Malinky', 2019, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy', 'Chris Garbutt, Rikke Asbjoern', null, null, 'TV-Y7', 'Pinky Malinky sees the bright side of everything, including being born a hot dog. With his BFFs in tow, this little wiener takes a bite out of life.', 'Pinky Malinky sees the bright side of everything, including being born a hot dog. With his BFFs in tow, this little wiener takes a bite out of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXGRafqFfyja23kqY4jpZtWQPLZ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:76705'),
  ('131561125743819623', 'Pinky, Elmyra & The Brain', 1998, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Tom Ruegger', null, 'Cree Summer, Maurice LaMarche, Rob Paulsen, Nancy Cartwright', 'TV-Y7', 'The popular animated characters Pinky and the Brain continue to concoct schemes to rule the world while hiding out in the suburbs where they live with Elmyra, a hyperactive tot of Tiny Toon Adventures fame.', 'The popular animated characters Pinky and the Brain continue to concoct schemes to rule the world while hiding out in the suburbs where they live with Elmyra, a hyperactive tot of Tiny Toon Adventures fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1B0DN2ri7klVzbKuP8VVSGpCgMx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4190'),
  ('454626705831429444', 'Pino & Shinoby', 2026, 'Animation, Kids', null, null, null, null, '“Shinoby” and an Italian boy “Pino” make all kinds of discoveries through everyday adventures! Travel back and forth between Japan and Italy with them, and learn about the cultural differences in food, sports, arts, games, and more from both countries!', '“Shinoby” and an Italian boy “Pino” make all kinds of discoveries through everyday adventures! Travel back and forth between Japan and Italy with them, and learn about the cultural differences in food, sports, arts, games, and more from both countries!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5h98NHd3nwUS9K8LiVGUPQEelfi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:318460'),
  ('217709644309959278', 'Pinocchio', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy, Mystery', 'Jo Soo-won', null, 'Park Shin-hye, Lee Jong-suk, Kim Young-kwang, Lee Yu-bi, Jin Kyung, Lee Pil-mo, Min Sung-wook, Yoon Kyun-sang', 'TV-14', 'In-ha and Ha-myeong become reporters for different reasons: one aspires to follow in her mother''s footsteps and the other seeks to do honest news.', 'In-ha and Ha-myeong become reporters for different reasons: one aspires to follow in her mother''s footsteps and the other seeks to do honest news.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i97YOqvylMMkiNzi4l5yyEVbYQi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61611'),
  ('132775700126257400', 'Pinocchio: The Series', 1972, 'Animation, Drama, Kids', null, 'Jinzo Toriumi', 'Hiroko Maruyama, Minoru Yada, Masako Ikeda, Akira Kamiya, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Junpei Takiguchi, Keiko Tomochika, Kohei Miyauchi', 'NR', 'Mokku of the Oak Tree, also known as Mokku Woody the Oak Tree, or Saban''s Adventures of Pinocchio in the United States, is a 52 episode anime series by Tatsunoko Productions first aired on Fuji Television in 1972. The story is based on the novel The Adventures of Pinocchio by Italian author Carlo Collodi. Unlike the more cheerful lighter tones of the Disney Version and Nippon Animation''s version Piccolino no Bōken, this series has a distinctly sadistic darker theme and portrays the main character, Pinocchio, as suffering from constant physical and psychological abuse and freak accidents.', 'Mokku of the Oak Tree, also known as Mokku Woody the Oak Tree, or Saban''s Adventures of Pinocchio in the United States, is a 52 episode anime series by Tatsunoko Productions first aired on Fuji Television in 1972. The story is based on the novel The Adventures of Pinocchio by Italian author Carlo Collodi. Unlike the more cheerful lighter tones of the Disney Version and Nippon Animation''s version Piccolino no Bōken, this series has a distinctly sadistic darker theme and portrays the main character, Pinocchio, as suffering from constant physical and psychological abuse and freak accidents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lMFhoKUmC4hdrSjNpgBwXfsS8fz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11520'),
  ('594386135538526461', 'Pinoy Big Brother', 2005, 'Reality', 'John de Mol', null, null, null, 'The Philippine adaptation of the reality game show "Big Brother" features Filipino housemates live together, share their stories and build meaningful relationships as they do tasks and challenges supervised by Big Brother. Every week a nomination is done, and the public decides who gets evicted and eventually become the Big Winner of the program.', 'The Philippine adaptation of the reality game show "Big Brother" features Filipino housemates live together, share their stories and build meaningful relationships as they do tasks and challenges supervised by Big Brother. Every week a nomination is done, and the public decides who gets evicted and eventually become the Big Winner of the program.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUva0cs2SOjoxFPpwINbpevzoax.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:8892'),
  ('977605532092488665', 'Pioneer One', 2010, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics, Drama', 'Josh Bernhard', 'Josh Bernhard, Bracey Smith', 'Alexandra Blatt, Laura Graham, James Rich, Einar Gunn, Jack Haley', 'NR', 'A Cold War relic returns amid fears of terrorism but turns out to be a forgotten Soviet space mission. What it brings back will have implications for the entire world.', 'A Cold War relic returns amid fears of terrorism but turns out to be a forgotten Soviet space mission. What it brings back will have implications for the entire world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p53wbsukyhJ8TieisoeU1zZr9iA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:33050'),
  ('426131518697349228', 'Pippi Longstocking', 1969, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Kids', 'Astrid Lindgren, Olle Hellbom', 'Astrid Lindgren', 'Inger Nilsson, Maria Persson, Pär Sundberg, Margot Trooger, Gun Arvidsson, Hans Clarin, Gösta Prüzelius, Paul Esser', 'TV-Y7', 'The adventures of Pippi Longstocking, an eccentric, super-strong, redheaded moppet and her best friends Tommy and Annika.', 'The adventures of Pippi Longstocking, an eccentric, super-strong, redheaded moppet and her best friends Tommy and Annika.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bCMX9FK7fD6BncwsTFBhGAVvgTA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3714'),
  ('976307855172559434', 'Pippi Longstocking', 1997, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Astrid Lindgren', null, 'Melissa Altro', 'TV-Y7', 'With tons of optimism, and strength to match, fun-loving 9-year-old Pippi Longstocking resides at rustic Villa Villekulla with her pet monkey and horse, sailing into adventures with her friends Tommy and Annika. Based on the books by Astrid Lindgren.', 'With tons of optimism, and strength to match, fun-loving 9-year-old Pippi Longstocking resides at rustic Villa Villekulla with her pet monkey and horse, sailing into adventures with her friends Tommy and Annika. Based on the books by Astrid Lindgren.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9IWLJzhcxsAzjK7rOOXnUbKTZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:10748'),
  ('910449237083855672', 'Piquantes !', 2020, 'Comedy, Talk', 'Nicole Ferroni', null, 'Nicole Ferroni, Thaïs Vauquières, Laura Domenge, Christine Berrou, Antonia de Rendinger, Farah, Elise Larnicol, Marion Séclin', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBfT4AjxIByqNnXuSWRc8jzwceb.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:234372'),
  ('788312706297859335', 'Pirate Family', 1999, 'Animation, Family, Kids, Comedy', 'Fabrice Parme, Yves Coulon, Béatrice Marthouret', null, 'Laura Préjean, Patrick Préjean, Laurence Crouzet, Arthur Pestel, Serge Thiriet, Patrice Melennec, Christian Pelissier, Denise Roland', 'NR', 'Life as a Captain of a pirate ship is healthy and invigorating : looting other ships, searching for treasures... Things are a bit complicated, however, for our Captain Mac Bernik, who also leads up a family. It''s up to him to deal with his wife and kids, his neighbours, the supermarket, his mother in law, his crocodile, the children''s teacher... A hilarious sitcom with a mix of piracy.', 'Life as a Captain of a pirate ship is healthy and invigorating : looting other ships, searching for treasures... Things are a bit complicated, however, for our Captain Mac Bernik, who also leads up a family. It''s up to him to deal with his wife and kids, his neighbours, the supermarket, his mother in law, his crocodile, the children''s teacher... A hilarious sitcom with a mix of piracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7izYBNMra45JSWZ9ctNmiX6JKZx.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:74540'),
  ('858207640694097764', 'Pirate Gold of Adak Island', 2022, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, 'Dr M Jackson, Brian Weed, Jay Toomoth, Burke Mitchell, Thom Spitler, Jeff Wilburn', 'TV-14', 'Will this expert team unearth legendary pirate treasure? Follow the hunt for buried gold amid the harsh Alaskan wilderness in this documentary series.', 'Will this expert team unearth legendary pirate treasure? Follow the hunt for buried gold amid the harsh Alaskan wilderness in this documentary series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xaq3mnifkknC8cGA7I65W3bTmu0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204416'),
  ('374558078428635035', 'Pirate Treasure of the Knights Templar', 2015, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'Lost treasure is the foundation of legends and lore, and the greatest lost treasure of all belonged to the Knights Templar. Now, from the medieval fortified cities of Europe to the holy lands of the Middle East and from a secret pirate island in the Indian ocean to America’s first great cities, renowned underwater explorer Barry Clifford and historian Scott Wolter are unearthing new evidence in an attempt to find hidden links between two of history’s most legendary sects, separated by 500 years: the medieval Knights Templar and 17th century pirates. What they learn may very well alter the course of history and lead them to treasure that’s been buried for centuries.', 'Lost treasure is the foundation of legends and lore, and the greatest lost treasure of all belonged to the Knights Templar. Now, from the medieval fortified cities of Europe to the holy lands of the Middle East and from a secret pirate island in the Indian ocean to America’s first great cities, renowned underwater explorer Barry Clifford and historian Scott Wolter are unearthing new evidence in an attempt to find hidden links between two of history’s most legendary sects, separated by 500 years: the medieval Knights Templar and 17th century pirates. What they learn may very well alter the course of history and lead them to treasure that’s been buried for centuries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mpYkVFoReeuYcOLityEe9jGvK3w.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68160'),
  ('762861593405000651', 'Piste noire', 2023, 'Crime', null, 'Jennifer Have', 'Constance Labbé, Thibault de Montalembert, Hélène Seuzaret, Pierre-Yves Bon, Déborah Krey, Solène Rigot, Christiane Millet, Christian Rauth', null, 'In the Alps, a caravan burns, enclosing a seasonal worker in its flames. Emilie Karras, a young gendarme from Lyon, originally from Les Clairies, leads the investigation, forced to collaborate with Major Servoz, a disillusioned local gendarme.', 'In the Alps, a caravan burns, enclosing a seasonal worker in its flames. Emilie Karras, a young gendarme from Lyon, originally from Les Clairies, leads the investigation, forced to collaborate with Major Servoz, a disillusioned local gendarme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nzta29OwfQHMQHF8VQWieo5Nixb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218656'),
  ('520815494920947016', 'Pistol', 2022, 'Drama', 'Craig Pearce', null, 'Toby Wallace, Anson Boon, Christian Lees, Sydney Chandler, Talulah Riley, Maisie Williams, Emma Appleton, Thomas Brodie-Sangster', 'TV-MA', 'The story of a band of spotty, noisy, working-class kids with “no future,” who shook the boring, corrupt Establishment to its core, threatened to bring down the government and changed music and culture forever.', 'The story of a band of spotty, noisy, working-class kids with “no future,” who shook the boring, corrupt Establishment to its core, threatened to bring down the government and changed music and culture forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHswJ2FXpN9jJIqNlxgc5ZooFb4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132159'),
  ('399040952302070095', 'Pistorius', 2018, 'Documentary', null, 'Sean Richard, Matteo Bini, Vaughan Sivell', 'Oscar Pistorius', null, 'A four-part documentary about the South African Paralympic and Olympic sprinter Oscar Pistorius, who shot and killed his girlfriend in the early hours of Valentine''s Day 2013. The story of a man and a nation both born to great disadvantage, the film follows the challenges, hopes and triumphs of both and the demise of their dreams under the glare of the world media.', 'A four-part documentary about the South African Paralympic and Olympic sprinter Oscar Pistorius, who shot and killed his girlfriend in the early hours of Valentine''s Day 2013. The story of a man and a nation both born to great disadvantage, the film follows the challenges, hopes and triumphs of both and the demise of their dreams under the glare of the world media.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1low6vu0n8jFlN5ggbmVTDlUoe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82132'),
  ('667821495710885665', 'Pistvakt', 1998, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Lennart Jähkel, Jacob Nordenson, Tomas Norström, Barbro Oborg, Pierre Lindstedt', null, 'Pistvakt was a Swedish television series, produced and aired by SVT subdepartment SVT Drama. It is based on a play by Pistolteatern. It was followed by the film Pistvakt.', 'Pistvakt was a Swedish television series, produced and aired by SVT subdepartment SVT Drama. It is based on a play by Pistolteatern. It was followed by the film Pistvakt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTXQKi7Ft0WO1SSt2cUWdyakkvM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:21713'),
  ('483080371266317207', 'Pit Babe', 2023, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', '_alittlebitch', 'Kanokphan Ornrattanasakul, Issaraporn Kuntisuk', 'Naret Promphaopun, Krittin Kitjaruwannakul, Supanut Lourhaphanich, Obrnithi Leelavetchabutr, Atthanin Thaninphanuwiwat, Asre Wattanayakul, Thanapon Aiemkumchai, Hemmawich Kwanamphaiphan', null, 'Babe, a race car driver with unmatched talent, falls for newcomer Charlie, but hidden secrets threaten their passionate romance and racing dreams.', 'Babe, a race car driver with unmatched talent, falls for newcomer Charlie, but hidden secrets threaten their passionate romance and racing dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xuLSkVlXXf3OpTwoUWN5c9ubLVC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:235199'),
  ('671251035931688090', 'Pit Bulls and Parolees', 2009, 'Documentary, Reality, Drama', null, null, 'Tia Torres', 'TV-PG', 'Follow Tia Torres, founder of Villalobos Rescue Center, and her family as they rehabilitate both felons and ill-reputed pit bulls who come together to rescue one another from their dim pasts, and bring new meaning to life.', 'Follow Tia Torres, founder of Villalobos Rescue Center, and her family as they rehabilitate both felons and ill-reputed pit bulls who come together to rescue one another from their dim pasts, and bring new meaning to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lrgRiVK3GH0jxQLmUXrWIjFA9Jc.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:31537'),
  ('26245942647734529', 'Pita Ten', 2002, 'Animation, Kids', null, null, 'Miyuki Sawashiro, Rie Kugimiya, Mitsuki Saiga, Yumi Touma, Yukana, Motoko Kumai, Sakura Nogawa', 'TV-PG', 'Kotarou starts out as pretty much your usual kid although he lives alone with his father, which forces him to take over some of the chores at home, such as cooking and cleaning. But what starts out as a usual morning changes drastically as he opens his front door to be confronted by a girl named Misha dressed in a voluminous dress and a tendency to shout rather than speak. Kotarou attempts to escape, but this new next-door neighbour is quite persistent... this is the beginning of Misha''s stalking of Kotarou. Even though she is a Junior High School student she has chosen Kotarou as her victim and hounds him all day long.', 'Kotarou starts out as pretty much your usual kid although he lives alone with his father, which forces him to take over some of the chores at home, such as cooking and cleaning. But what starts out as a usual morning changes drastically as he opens his front door to be confronted by a girl named Misha dressed in a voluminous dress and a tendency to shout rather than speak. Kotarou attempts to escape, but this new next-door neighbour is quite persistent... this is the beginning of Misha''s stalking of Kotarou. Even though she is a Junior High School student she has chosen Kotarou as her victim and hounds him all day long.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQXU29cif6ZCIYCvDlSXUdPUZjp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:27952'),
  ('452413019260096561', 'Pitbull', 2005, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, 'Patryk Vega', 'Marcin Dorociński, Andrzej Grabowski, Paweł Królikowski, Roma Gąsiorowska, Michał Kula, Weronika Rosati, Michał Żurawski', null, 'The dark world of crime: murders, racketeering, drugs, kidnappings. There are no rules here. Working in this world makes cops cynical and ruthless. There is a fine line between them and criminals - will any of them cross it? The main characters are officers from the Department for Counteracting Criminal Terror and Homicides. The action of the series is an extension of the threads that appear in the feature film. It presents in a realistic way the brutal and dark world of crime that officers encounter on a daily basis. They''re not just tracking down murderers. They fight racketeering, kidnapping, drug trafficking while struggling with their own day to day life and problems.', 'The dark world of crime: murders, racketeering, drugs, kidnappings. There are no rules here. Working in this world makes cops cynical and ruthless. There is a fine line between them and criminals - will any of them cross it? The main characters are officers from the Department for Counteracting Criminal Terror and Homicides. The action of the series is an extension of the threads that appear in the feature film. It presents in a realistic way the brutal and dark world of crime that officers encounter on a daily basis. They''re not just tracking down murderers. They fight racketeering, kidnapping, drug trafficking while struggling with their own day to day life and problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vU0kLyAfdqynoYicwGuqXNkFewR.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:37337'),
  ('362450630095743547', 'Pitch', 2016, 'Drama', 'Dan Fogelman, Rick Singer', null, 'Kylie Bunbury, Mark-Paul Gosselaar, Ali Larter, Mo McRae, Meagan Holder, Mark Consuelos, Tim Jo, Dan Lauria', 'TV-14', 'The dramatic and inspirational story of a young pitcher who becomes the first woman to play Major League Baseball.', 'The dramatic and inspirational story of a young pitcher who becomes the first woman to play Major League Baseball.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTK0N1qLBWzwxuG0DH3cdYXghIT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67147'),
  ('1087350712096644211', 'Pitch Perfect: Bumper in Berlin', 2022, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Adam Devine, Sarah Hyland, Flula Borg, Lera Abova, Jameela Jamil', 'TV-MA', 'Several years after we last saw him in “Pitch Perfect,” Bumper Allen moves to Germany to revive his music career when one of his songs becomes big in Berlin.', 'Several years after we last saw him in “Pitch Perfect,” Bumper Allen moves to Germany to revive his music career when one of his songs becomes big in Berlin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/baM8owP74DXapHOc8awfZ5aw98z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156332'),
  ('763247516185925420', 'Pivoting', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Liz Astrof', null, 'Ginnifer Goodwin, Eliza Coupe, Maggie Q, Tommy Dewey, JT Neal, Marcello Julian Reyes', null, 'In a small, middle-class town in Long Island, NY, three women – and close-knit childhood friends – cope with the death of the fourth member of their group. When faced with the reality that life is short, these women pivot, and alter their current paths, by way of a series of impulsive, ill-advised and self-indulgent decisions. These pivots will strengthen their bond and prove it’s never too late to screw up your life in the pursuit of happiness.', 'In a small, middle-class town in Long Island, NY, three women – and close-knit childhood friends – cope with the death of the fourth member of their group. When faced with the reality that life is short, these women pivot, and alter their current paths, by way of a series of impulsive, ill-advised and self-indulgent decisions. These pivots will strengthen their bond and prove it’s never too late to screw up your life in the pursuit of happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQXja8mUGddQMfIpOOA0doLNdGu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129501'),
  ('63843571619486564', 'Pixar in Real Life', 2019, 'Reality, Family, Comedy', null, null, 'Erika J. Wood, Micaela Toomey, Erika Degraff, Zihan Zhao, Stephanie Linas, David Greenberg, Curtis Retherford', 'TV-G', 'This live action series brings iconic characters and moments from Pixar films into the real world. Filmed on location in and around New York City, the series surprises and delights real people in real locations when they least expect it.', 'This live action series brings iconic characters and moments from Pixar films into the real world. Filmed on location in and around New York City, the series surprises and delights real people in real locations when they least expect it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bgKwNs66dsEt3e0D7wJLmAxxgnz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95029'),
