  ('202001214070062793', 'Police Academy: The Series', 1997, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Joe Flaherty, Michael Winslow, Tony Longo, Matt Borlenghi, Rod Crawford, Toby Proctor, Jeremiah Birkett, Heather Campbell', null, 'Police Academy: The Series is a syndicated 1997 television series spin-off from the Police Academy series of films. Michael Winslow was the only actor from the Police Academy films to have a recurring role on the show, although several of the film''s cast made occasional guest appearances. The series was written by Paul Maslansky and produced by James Margellos and Gary M. Goodman. Music by Ari Wise and Jim Guttridge', 'Police Academy: The Series is a syndicated 1997 television series spin-off from the Police Academy series of films. Michael Winslow was the only actor from the Police Academy films to have a recurring role on the show, although several of the film''s cast made occasional guest appearances. The series was written by Paul Maslansky and produced by James Margellos and Gary M. Goodman. Music by Ari Wise and Jim Guttridge', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9KAPETuGQmuOI17h5rYWeABAICv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4719'),
  ('273428247101831965', 'Police and Prosecutor, Sometimes Judge', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', null, null, 'Kenta Kiritani, Manami Higa, Anne Nakamura, Yukiya Kitamura, Hayato Isomura, Sae Okazaki, Michiko Kichise, Mijika Nagai', null, 'In this sequel to Police and Prosecutor, Nakaido, the passionate gymnastic-teacher-turned-police-detective, is still eager to arrest criminals by all means and be appreciated by victims. He plunges into cases without any care for compliance issues.', 'In this sequel to Police and Prosecutor, Nakaido, the passionate gymnastic-teacher-turned-police-detective, is still eager to arrest criminals by all means and be appreciated by victims. He plunges into cases without any care for compliance issues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j1FpnXtVuKZ2Bb3yv8E6cDoY9ak.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:220615'),
  ('119937052106444061', 'Police Cadet', 1984, 'Drama', null, 'Wong Ho-Wa, Ng Wai-Sek, Wong Man-Yue', 'Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Margie Tsang Wah-Sin, Benz Hui Siu-Hung, Carina Lau, Sheren Tang Shui-Man, Lau Siu-Ming, Paul Chun Pui, Helena Law Lan', null, 'Police Cadet ''84 was a TV series which included such stars in TVB as Tony Leung, Maggie Cheung, and notably, Carina Lau. The story centered on a couple of young "cadets" in the Police Cadet School. Tragedy, romance, conflicts, and intrigues were featured. The series was immediately followed by a sequels titled "New Police Cadet ''85" and "New Police Cadet ''88". Both sequels stars Tony Leung.', 'Police Cadet ''84 was a TV series which included such stars in TVB as Tony Leung, Maggie Cheung, and notably, Carina Lau. The story centered on a couple of young "cadets" in the Police Cadet School. Tragedy, romance, conflicts, and intrigues were featured. The series was immediately followed by a sequels titled "New Police Cadet ''85" and "New Police Cadet ''88". Both sequels stars Tony Leung.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyCbaWqPZvwsb9VONdBgbFVDmhr.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:9140'),
  ('283988683979503974', 'Police Commissioner Moulin', 1976, 'Crime', 'Claude Boissol, Paul Andréota', null, 'Yves Rénier, Clément Michu, Nathalie Quenard, Régis Ander, Alice Béat, Bernard Rosselli', null, 'The series follows the adventures of lighthearted Jean-Paul Moulin, a police Commissaire, and his team as they solve crimes.', 'The series follows the adventures of lighthearted Jean-Paul Moulin, a police Commissaire, and his team as they solve crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7JLEY3IDUgAoAeZpZLnALSrCep5.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:7676'),
  ('45297215477752860', 'Police District', 2000, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Simone De Rita, Pietro Valsecchi', null, 'Simone Corrente, Marco Marzocca, Lucilla Agosti, Dino Abbrescia, Gianluca Bazzoli, Andrea Renzi, Paolo Calabresi, Maria Amelia Monti', null, 'The events of Police District unfold in the rooms of the 10th Tuscolano, a police station on the outskirts of Rome where current events intertwine with the private lives of the inspectors, officers and commissioners who, over the course of 11 intense seasons, have created one of the greatest successes on Italian TV.', 'The events of Police District unfold in the rooms of the 10th Tuscolano, a police station on the outskirts of Rome where current events intertwine with the private lives of the inspectors, officers and commissioners who, over the course of 11 intense seasons, have created one of the greatest successes on Italian TV.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yBgG7Mkx3IfpHhZep5K4o0ZDrpW.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:41551'),
  ('215962215256407074', 'Police in a Pod', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nonji Nemoto', null, 'Erika Toda, Mei Nagano, Shohei Miura, Yuki Yamada, Nanase Nishino, Tsuyoshi Muro, Yusuke Hirayama, Seiji Chihara', null, '20-year-old rookie police officer Kawai Mai works hard at a police box and feels both physically and mentally drained. She has never felt appreciated even though she supposedly works for the sake of the area’s residents. In addition, she does not find working at a police box rewarding. Mai is about to hand in her resignation when she meets 30-year-old Fuji Seiko, the former ace detective of the Criminal Investigations Division. Seiko is said to have been forced to transfer to the police box for harassing a subordinate at work but … … This encounter between Mai and Seiko will significantly change their lives as they are suddenly paired up. This odd pair struggle to help and support each other in cases, routine duties and romance?! And Seiko’s true reason for coming to the police box is revealed.', '20-year-old rookie police officer Kawai Mai works hard at a police box and feels both physically and mentally drained. She has never felt appreciated even though she supposedly works for the sake of the area’s residents. In addition, she does not find working at a police box rewarding. Mai is about to hand in her resignation when she meets 30-year-old Fuji Seiko, the former ace detective of the Criminal Investigations Division. Seiko is said to have been forced to transfer to the police box for harassing a subordinate at work but … … This encounter between Mai and Seiko will significantly change their lives as they are suddenly paired up. This odd pair struggle to help and support each other in cases, routine duties and romance?! And Seiko’s true reason for coming to the police box is revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gazzW01KQKuXar1XcmWjPFdo2vE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:126990'),
  ('765088219066941927', 'Police in a Pod', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Shion Wakayama, Yui Ishikawa, Ryota Suzuki, Shimba Tsuchiya, Kana Hanazawa, Kendo Kobayashi, Rikiya Koyama', 'TV-14', 'Officer Mai Kawai has had enough! She’s sick of being a police officer—but just when she’s about to hand in her resignation, the arrival of a brilliant (and beautiful) ace detective named Seiko Fuji changes her mind. Will Fuji reignite Mai’s passion for policing? And will Mai uncover the mystery of why Fuji was transferred to this ordinary police box?', 'Officer Mai Kawai has had enough! She’s sick of being a police officer—but just when she’s about to hand in her resignation, the arrival of a brilliant (and beautiful) ace detective named Seiko Fuji changes her mind. Will Fuji reignite Mai’s passion for policing? And will Mai uncover the mystery of why Fuji was transferred to this ordinary police box?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcTwjNfNdzNpsBqHbq9aaya9OOR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130266'),
  ('505553644613447055', 'Police in action', 2017, 'Reality, Crime', null, null, null, null, 'Real cops, real cases and calls for help. Four cases, four human destinies. Get to know the work of the police close! Some actors are real cops but this show is not supported by the real police! Some cases may be based on reality.', 'Real cops, real cases and calls for help. Four cases, four human destinies. Get to know the work of the police close! Some actors are real cops but this show is not supported by the real police! Some cases may be based on reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/65L1EOt1npkkaGHiSIGZfiuYl82.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:81094'),
