  ('323960303165139948', 'Ponos Ratkajevih', 2007, null, null, null, null, null, 'Pride of the Ratkajs is the historical telenovela produced by AVA. The show is taking place in the most turbulent period of the Croatian and Yugoslav history, in the period from 1938 to 1948, follows the life of a noble Croatian family of its pre-war ascent, until after World War II. World War II, which caused a change in governmental structure, decline of the nobility and radical change of all hitherto established social values.', 'Pride of the Ratkajs is the historical telenovela produced by AVA. The show is taking place in the most turbulent period of the Croatian and Yugoslav history, in the period from 1938 to 1948, follows the life of a noble Croatian family of its pre-war ascent, until after World War II. World War II, which caused a change in governmental structure, decline of the nobility and radical change of all hitherto established social values.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:314194'),
  ('718678697626377212', 'Ponysitters Club', 2018, 'Kids, Family', 'Nancy Yeaman, Elizabeth Turner', null, 'Khiyla Aynne, Cailan Laine Punnewaert, Zyon Allen, Morgan Neundorf, Madeline Leon, Diana Chrisman, Maya Franzoi', null, 'A young horse enthusiast teams up with her best friends to rescue and rehabilitate animals on her family''s beloved ranch.', 'A young horse enthusiast teams up with her best friends to rescue and rehabilitate animals on her family''s beloved ranch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wmxiMKMMBUa6HD27p1IqGrpNLYV.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:79892'),
  ('164082926362834979', 'Poong The Joseon Psychiatrist', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Yoo Won-Sang', 'Oh So-ho, Park Seul-gi, Lee Bom', 'Kim Min-jae, Kim Hyang-gi, Kim Sang-kyung, Kang Young-suk, Woo Da-vi', 'TV-PG', 'The successful doctor Yoo Sepoong becomes entangled in a conspiracy and is kicked out of the palace. He meets Jihan in Gyesu village and learns to treat those who suffer psychological illness. Finding the cause of their heartbroken feelings and writing a prescription for happiness with Eunwoo, Sepoong grows up as a true psychiatrist.', 'The successful doctor Yoo Sepoong becomes entangled in a conspiracy and is kicked out of the palace. He meets Jihan in Gyesu village and learns to treat those who suffer psychological illness. Finding the cause of their heartbroken feelings and writing a prescription for happiness with Eunwoo, Sepoong grows up as a true psychiatrist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pyrc2PpzvBGYh2ZDqFmn5OASds.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:139289'),
  ('539187329638216134', 'Poor Devil', 2023, 'Animation', 'Joaquín Reyes, Miguel Esteban, Ernesto Sevilla', null, 'Joaquín Reyes, Ernesto Sevilla, Ignatius Farray, Gakian, Stéphanie Magnin, Carlos Areces, Verónica Forqué, Manuel Huedo', 'TV-MA', 'Stan just turned 665 months old. One month remains for the prophecy to be fulfilled and he has to fulfill his destiny: plunge humanity into horror and chaos, and bring about Armageddon. But he is more interested in singing and dancing in a Broadway musical.', 'Stan just turned 665 months old. One month remains for the prophecy to be fulfilled and he has to fulfill his destiny: plunge humanity into horror and chaos, and bring about Armageddon. But he is more interested in singing and dancing in a Broadway musical.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7g8NHyB7b9Vlj6NqtXGoQkwbsS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:195237'),
  ('660228963010019641', 'Poor Nastya', 2003, 'Drama, Soap', 'Yelena Isayeva, Irina Pivovarova, Sergey Kaluzhanov', 'Yelena Isayeva, Linda Schreyer, Sergey Kaluzhanov', 'Elena Korikova, Daniil Strakhov, Pyotr Krasilov, Anna Tabanina, Dmitriy Isaev, Ekaterina Klimova, Anton Makarsky, Olga Ostroumova', null, 'Poor Nastya is a Russian telenovela originally aired from 31 October 2003 to 30 April 2004 on the STS. Based on the imperial setting of the 19th century, the series reached international success and was shown in Ukraine, China, Israel, Serbia, Georgia, Greece, Bulgaria and more than twenty countries worldwide. With the budget of $11,8million, it is the most expensive Russian television project of all time. The sequel was planned, but had not been made yet.', 'Poor Nastya is a Russian telenovela originally aired from 31 October 2003 to 30 April 2004 on the STS. Based on the imperial setting of the 19th century, the series reached international success and was shown in Ukraine, China, Israel, Serbia, Georgia, Greece, Bulgaria and more than twenty countries worldwide. With the budget of $11,8million, it is the most expensive Russian television project of all time. The sequel was planned, but had not been made yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emevvSYbd8m6dviEjmbW31irf94.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9379'),
  ('469656934248076405', 'Pop Out Boy!', 2020, 'Drama', null, null, 'Kim Do-yeon, Kim Min-kyu, Choi Hyun-wook, Han Ji-hyo, Im Bo Ra, Kim Min-ki', null, 'Han Sun Nyeo found out that she has the same name and the look of a character in a love story cartoon that has been over 10 years. She read that cartoon with curiosity and fell asleep. When she woke up, there is a pop out boy Cheon Nam Wook next to her on the bed. From the moment he popped out of the cartoon, Sun Nyeo''s school life goes complicated.', 'Han Sun Nyeo found out that she has the same name and the look of a character in a love story cartoon that has been over 10 years. She read that cartoon with curiosity and fell asleep. When she woke up, there is a pop out boy Cheon Nam Wook next to her on the bed. From the moment he popped out of the cartoon, Sun Nyeo''s school life goes complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aM4KGfNQ2Qxh5TQVzqtsxLSxOlP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105359'),
  ('825886216190291428', 'Pop Star Academy: KATSEYE', 2024, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Sophia Laforteza, Manon Bannerman, Daniela Avanzini, Lara Raj, Megan, Yoonchae Jeong, Adéla Jergova, Marquise Auramornrat', 'TV-MA', 'Twenty aspiring pop stars undergo a K-pop training program in this docuseries about the creation of HYBE x Geffen''s first global girl group, KATSEYE.', 'Twenty aspiring pop stars undergo a K-pop training program in this docuseries about the creation of HYBE x Geffen''s first global girl group, KATSEYE.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eWPe0nRouV0JHgld0aMXgNbuOV8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:260264'),
  ('880631735367061218', 'Pop Team Epic', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Megumi Ogata, Hidenari Ugaki, Romi Park, Hekiru Shiina, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Minori Chihara', 'TV-MA', 'Crude, rude, and a little…cute? Get ready for the larger-than-life attitude of Popuko and Pipimi, the small and tall stars of Pop Team Epic! Based off the bizarre four-panel webcomic by Bukubu Okawa comes a comedy that’ll throw you off with its out-there jokes and intense absurdity. You think you’re ready for these girls? Think again, F#%**er!', 'Crude, rude, and a little…cute? Get ready for the larger-than-life attitude of Popuko and Pipimi, the small and tall stars of Pop Team Epic! Based off the bizarre four-panel webcomic by Bukubu Okawa comes a comedy that’ll throw you off with its out-there jokes and intense absurdity. You think you’re ready for these girls? Think again, F#%**er!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rH30uGDhLW0rnzDgPf5gXpeU2Q1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:76139'),
  ('155748942117858589', 'Pope John Paul II', 2005, 'Drama', 'John Kent Harrison', null, 'Jon Voight, Cary Elwes, James Cromwell, Ben Gazzara, Christopher Lee, Giuliano Gemma, Daniele Pecci, Vittoria Belvedere', 'NR', 'The life of the remarkable man who passed away after an extraordinary 26 year reign, and whose papal odyssey encompassed more than 120 countries and earned him the reputation of an international fighter for freedom.', 'The life of the remarkable man who passed away after an extraordinary 26 year reign, and whose papal odyssey encompassed more than 120 countries and earned him the reputation of an international fighter for freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/psHJokG1pe7C23BvNsUF8j7REl4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:886'),
  ('502612494026056255', 'Popeye and Son', 1987, 'Animation, Kids', 'E. C. Segar', null, 'Maurice LaMarche, Josh Rodine, Marilyn Schreffler, Allan Melvin, David Markus, Nancy Cartwright, Don Messick, B.J. Ward', null, 'Popeye and Son is an animated television series produced by Hanna-Barbera Productions and King Features Entertainment, and aired for one season and thirteen episodes on CBS. Maurice LaMarche supplied the voice of Popeye in this series, succeeding Jack Mercer in that role. It is also the first set of Popeye cartoons that were produced since Mercer''s death in 1984.', 'Popeye and Son is an animated television series produced by Hanna-Barbera Productions and King Features Entertainment, and aired for one season and thirteen episodes on CBS. Maurice LaMarche supplied the voice of Popeye in this series, succeeding Jack Mercer in that role. It is also the first set of Popeye cartoons that were produced since Mercer''s death in 1984.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h47aY2rbSdzakrXEpG11w6xtmgm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10425'),
  ('147486231544224062', 'Popeye the Sailor', 1960, 'Animation, Kids', 'E. C. Segar', null, 'Jack Mercer, Mae Questel, Jackson Beck', 'TV-G', 'Follows the adventures of the famed spinach-eating sailor man. Popeye is one of the most popular cartoon characters of all time. This spunky but loveable spinach-eating sailor continues to delight young and old with his comic adventures, and the entire gang is around to provide plenty of rousing fun and action: Olive Oyl, Swee''Pea, Wimpy and Bluto.', 'Follows the adventures of the famed spinach-eating sailor man. Popeye is one of the most popular cartoon characters of all time. This spunky but loveable spinach-eating sailor continues to delight young and old with his comic adventures, and the entire gang is around to provide plenty of rousing fun and action: Olive Oyl, Swee''Pea, Wimpy and Bluto.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQPDl1S1pRg2jzCQWtVUuauZSqa.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:8392'),
  ('374816132948969131', 'Poppa''s House', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Damon Wayans, Kevin Hench', 'Michael Wayans, Adrian Colón Jr., Chris Lorey', 'Damon Wayans, Damon Wayans Jr., Essence Atkins, Tetona Jackson', 'TV-14', 'Legendary talk radio host and happily divorced Poppa has his point of view challenged at work when a new female co-host is hired, and at home where he finds himself still parenting his adult son, a brilliant dreamer who is trying to pursue his passion while being a responsible father and husband.', 'Legendary talk radio host and happily divorced Poppa has his point of view challenged at work when a new female co-host is hired, and at home where he finds himself still parenting his adult son, a brilliant dreamer who is trying to pursue his passion while being a responsible father and husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQnhk8bOFHlFI7KZ12NT24yW8iw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:251939'),
