  ('1020150948066839261', 'Pray, Obey, Kill', 2021, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Anton Berg, Martin Johnson, Henrik Georgsson', null, 'Anton Berg, Martin Johnson, Helge Fossmo, Sara Svensson', 'TV-14', 'Documentary series describing a religious group in a small town in Sweden, known for murder and attempted murder by and against members of the group. Later leaders of the group have been accused of psychic and physical violence against members.', 'Documentary series describing a religious group in a small town in Sweden, known for murder and attempted murder by and against members of the group. Later leaders of the group have been accused of psychic and physical violence against members.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZxOmxlAwchaOs9DUvmq2qJawrC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106666'),
  ('1022105754434028728', 'Preacher', 2016, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Drama', 'Sam Catlin, Seth Rogen, Evan Goldberg', null, 'Dominic Cooper, Ruth Negga, Joseph Gilgun, Ian Colletti, Graham McTavish, Pip Torrens, Tyson Ritter, Noah Taylor', 'TV-MA', 'A preacher sets out on a mission to make the almighty himself confess his sin of abandoning the world. With his best friend Cassidy, an alcoholic Irish vampire, his love Tulip, a red blooded gun towing Texan, and the power of genesis, an unholy child born from an angel and a devil, Jesse gives up everything to set the world straight with its creator.', 'A preacher sets out on a mission to make the almighty himself confess his sin of abandoning the world. With his best friend Cassidy, an alcoholic Irish vampire, his love Tulip, a red blooded gun towing Texan, and the power of genesis, an unholy child born from an angel and a devil, Jesse gives up everything to set the world straight with its creator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ey1WQajA25E5sFGHSApcqSWUSEc.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:64230'),
  ('765996465875015412', 'Precious Pearl', 2013, 'Soap, Drama, Comedy', 'Duca Rachid, Thelma Guedes', 'Thelma Guedes, Duca Rachid, Manuela Dias', 'Bruno Gagliasso, Bianca Bin, Mel Maia, José de Abreu, Carmo Dalla Vecchia, Nathalia Dill, Carolina Dieckmmann, Domingos Montagner', null, 'In 1934 two supposed brothers survived an avalanche in the Himalayas: the millionaire Franz Hauser (Bruno Gagliasso), who is saved by Buddhist monks, and Manfred (Carmo Dalla Vecchia), rescued by a team of climbers. Manfred returns to Brazil with a terrible secret: he sabotaged Franz’s equipment in order to take his place in the family business. After an exhaustive search, Ernest Hauser gives his son up for dead and appoints his bastard son as the director of the Hauser Group.', 'In 1934 two supposed brothers survived an avalanche in the Himalayas: the millionaire Franz Hauser (Bruno Gagliasso), who is saved by Buddhist monks, and Manfred (Carmo Dalla Vecchia), rescued by a team of climbers. Manfred returns to Brazil with a terrible secret: he sabotaged Franz’s equipment in order to take his place in the family business. After an exhaustive search, Ernest Hauser gives his son up for dead and appoints his bastard son as the director of the Hauser Group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f11hIedW6fd71vodB3v6hJYhz4R.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64499'),
  ('133132430096423517', 'PreCure Splash Star', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Kids, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Orie Kimoto, Atsuko Enomoto, Isshin Chiba, Kappei Yamaguchi, Miyu Matsuki, Yuriko Fuchizaki, Akemi Okamura, Takayuki Godai', null, 'During the summer festival five years ago, two girls met at a mysterious tree and saw two glowing spheres. Now, these two girls--Saki Hyuga, ace pitcher on the school softball team; and Mai Mishou, who prefers sketching over stargazing--are chosen by the spirits of flowers (Flappy) and birds (Choppy) to restore the Seven Fountains and save their worlds from Dark Autumn. Together, they are the NEW Pretty Cure.', 'During the summer festival five years ago, two girls met at a mysterious tree and saw two glowing spheres. Now, these two girls--Saki Hyuga, ace pitcher on the school softball team; and Mai Mishou, who prefers sketching over stargazing--are chosen by the spirits of flowers (Flappy) and birds (Choppy) to restore the Seven Fountains and save their worlds from Dark Autumn. Together, they are the NEW Pretty Cure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lA4ZYQ94omDOjyH6Oa775274yYR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:36324'),
  ('730408096024099529', 'Predator Hunters', 2026, 'Crime, Documentary', null, null, 'Tony Godwin', 'TV-14', 'Each episode follows three investigations from the first digital clue through undercover online conversations and coordinated law enforcement operations, culminating in dramatic takedowns and arrests. Featuring exclusive, never-before-seen chat logs, raw bodycam footage, and in-depth police interviews, the series reveals how predators operate and the relentless work required to stop them. A recognized expert in the field, Tony Godwin assists law enforcement agencies nationwide, leading to the removal of hundreds of predators from the streets and out of the shadows.', 'Each episode follows three investigations from the first digital clue through undercover online conversations and coordinated law enforcement operations, culminating in dramatic takedowns and arrests. Featuring exclusive, never-before-seen chat logs, raw bodycam footage, and in-depth police interviews, the series reveals how predators operate and the relentless work required to stop them. A recognized expert in the field, Tony Godwin assists law enforcement agencies nationwide, leading to the removal of hundreds of predators from the streets and out of the shadows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6D4zGGnc8DutXKzXQC6pLjr1wDZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:315092'),
  ('812427739964157958', 'Predators', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Tom Hardy', 'TV-PG', 'Tom Hardy narrates this thrilling natural history series following five apex predators facing the ultimate test of survival in drastically changing environments across the globe.', 'Tom Hardy narrates this thrilling natural history series following five apex predators facing the ultimate test of survival in drastically changing environments across the globe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8xCjuwOODzTK9bSAOsJT8YVlUg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215344'),
  ('1109701071393744833', 'Pregau', 2016, 'Drama, Crime', 'Nils Willbrandt', null, 'Maximilian Brückner, Ursula Strauss, Antonia Jung, Wolfgang Böck, Karl Fischer, Antoine Monot Jr., Armin Rohde, Robert Palfrader', null, 'A policeman gets into a spiral of events, in which assault, extortion and murder are proven means.', 'A policeman gets into a spiral of events, in which assault, extortion and murder are proven means.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1IF5jJQpVcviXHhdKVonjmVtfov.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68051'),
  ('170660489938204461', 'Prehistoric Park', 2006, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Family', 'Nigel Marven', null, 'Nigel Marven, David Jason, Saba Douglas-Hamilton, Suzanne McNabb, Rod Arthur', null, 'Using his knowledge of today’s animal kingdom and the latest research, wildlife adventurer Nigel Marven uses a time portal to take him into the past, on a quest to rescue long lost prehistoric creatures.', 'Using his knowledge of today’s animal kingdom and the latest research, wildlife adventurer Nigel Marven uses a time portal to take him into the past, on a quest to rescue long lost prehistoric creatures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKTzN99UMHCZIgH8otfSr5gzz9V.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:788'),
  ('850956855776276100', 'Prehistoric Planet', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Mike Gunton', null, 'Tom Hiddleston', 'TV-PG', 'Experience the wonders of our world like never before in this epic series from Jon Favreau and the producers of Planet Earth. Travel back 66 million years to when majestic dinosaurs and extraordinary creatures roamed the lands, seas, and skies.', 'Experience the wonders of our world like never before in this epic series from Jon Favreau and the producers of Planet Earth. Travel back 66 million years to when majestic dinosaurs and extraordinary creatures roamed the lands, seas, and skies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9yjWMmYWQSDY2eelHECQcwSL816.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:95171'),
  ('917437424512639384', 'Presença de Anita', 2001, 'Drama', 'Manoel Carlos', null, 'Mel Lisboa, José Mayer, Helena Ranaldi, Leonardo Miggiorin, Júlia Almeida, Vera Holtz, Carolina Kasting, Taiguara Nazareth', 'NR', 'Written by Manoel Carlos, “The Presence of Anita” is an amazing story about love, passion and the traps of destiny. Anita is an angel faced teenager who seduces a writer, destroying his family and his life. According to her, nothing is coincidence. Destiny is already written and she cannot change her fate.', 'Written by Manoel Carlos, “The Presence of Anita” is an amazing story about love, passion and the traps of destiny. Anita is an angel faced teenager who seduces a writer, destroying his family and his life. According to her, nothing is coincidence. Destiny is already written and she cannot change her fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/torz22jBAiFWRfc5DZOtCoNUe7e.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35519'),
  ('813523479386690867', 'Preso No. 1', 2019, 'Soap', null, null, 'Erik Hayser, Alejandra Ambrosi, Paulina Matos, Estefanía Coppola, Angélica Celaya, Arturo Peniche, Fernando Ciangherotti', 'TV-MA', 'The story of a humble farmer who becomes President of Mexico. When he is falsely accused of fraud and incarcerated, he must fight back against the corrupt system behind the scheme and clear his name for the sake of his country and family.', 'The story of a humble farmer who becomes President of Mexico. When he is falsely accused of fraud and incarcerated, he must fight back against the corrupt system behind the scheme and clear his name for the sake of his country and family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8tTpbFJzcjqLZSiPeoeINpaPG7d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91242'),
  ('319967771859094052', 'Press', 2018, 'Drama', 'Mike Bartlett', null, 'Charlotte Riley, Priyanga Burford, Ben Chaplin, Al Weaver, Paapa Essiedu, Brendan Cowell, Shane Zaza, Ellie Kendrick', 'TV-14', 'Follows the contrasting worlds of left-wing The Herald (broadsheet) and right-wing The Post (tabloid), highlighting the challenges of modern journalism, including hacking scandals and the rise of online media.', 'Follows the contrasting worlds of left-wing The Herald (broadsheet) and right-wing The Post (tabloid), highlighting the challenges of modern journalism, including hacking scandals and the rise of online media.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jRPFzHLNBlEIDF1m2kGpEb0WvJM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82143'),
  ('616217674068734264', 'Press Gang', 1989, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Steven Moffat, Bill Moffat', 'Steven Moffat', 'Lucy Benjamin, Julia Sawalha, Dexter Fletcher, Kelda Holmes, Mmoloki Chrystie, Paul Reynolds', null, 'The activities of the staff at The Junior Gazette, a children''s weekly newspaper produced by a group of school pupils.', 'The activities of the staff at The Junior Gazette, a children''s weekly newspaper produced by a group of school pupils.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jKLEJJZZTt3QQN863TJbIzlkdqT.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:2522'),
  ('974463426045655124', 'Press Your Luck', 1983, null, 'Bill Carruthers', null, 'Rod Roddy, Charlie O''Donnell, Peter Tomarken, Savage Steve Holland', 'TV-G', 'Contestants collect spins by answering trivia questions and then use the spins on an 18-space game board to win cash and prizes. The person who amass the most in cash and prizes at the end of the game wins.', 'Contestants collect spins by answering trivia questions and then use the spins on an 18-space game board to win cash and prizes. The person who amass the most in cash and prizes at the end of the game wins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5HVWYNUUKt8YfoVnDKaaXL8e6oq.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:3784'),
  ('474015128220814330', 'Pressure Cooker', 2023, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'Living under one roof, eleven chefs use culinary skills and strategic plays in a tense cooking contest where they vote on who among them will win $100,000.', 'Living under one roof, eleven chefs use culinary skills and strategic plays in a tense cooking contest where they vote on who among them will win $100,000.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Fwerl8ORkDTrwekLmaSKlriTWS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:216575'),
  ('454313389587830106', 'Presumed Guilty', 2018, 'Drama', 'Javier Holgado, Josep Cister Rubio, Aitor Montánchez', null, 'Miguel Ángel Muñoz, Susi Sánchez, Carlos Serrano, Alejandra Onieva', null, 'A terrible event leads an investigator in Paris to come back to his birth town ten years after leaving it, where he has to confront the ghosts of his past and an unsolved mystery.', 'A terrible event leads an investigator in Paris to come back to his birth town ten years after leaving it, where he has to confront the ghosts of his past and an unsolved mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7st0lvDszn4lQ4UpNGplPjpUKKY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82191'),
  ('25540154500503422', 'Presumed Innocent', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', 'David E. Kelley', null, 'Jake Gyllenhaal, Ruth Negga, Bill Camp, O-T Fagbenle, Chase Infiniti, Elizabeth Marvel, Nana Mensah, Renate Reinsve', 'TV-MA', 'A horrific murder upends the Chicago Prosecuting Attorney''s Office when one of its own is suspected of the crime—leaving the accused fighting to keep his family together.', 'A horrific murder upends the Chicago Prosecuting Attorney''s Office when one of its own is suspected of the crime—leaving the accused fighting to keep his family together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7MXg0BxuSRWz2yKc03M40du2mrc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156933'),
  ('1087897298985748382', 'Pretend It''s a City', 2021, 'Documentary, Comedy', null, null, 'Fran Lebowitz, Martin Scorsese, Spike Lee, Alec Baldwin', 'TV-14', 'Wander the New York City streets and fascinating mind of wry writer, humorist and raconteur Fran Lebowitz as she sits down with Martin Scorsese.', 'Wander the New York City streets and fascinating mind of wry writer, humorist and raconteur Fran Lebowitz as she sits down with Martin Scorsese.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qFGa1ranQSLPTrhwXi7tslOIb8D.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:115497'),
  ('66551960242076548', 'Pretty Baby: Brooke Shields', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Brooke Shields, Scaachi Koul, Isobel Coleman, Meenakshi Durham, Gavin de Becker, Gregory Butler, Deborah Tolman, Jean Kilbourne', null, 'Actor, model, and global superstar Brooke Shields’ journey from a sexualized young girl to a woman who embraces her identity and voice.', 'Actor, model, and global superstar Brooke Shields’ journey from a sexualized young girl to a woman who embraces her identity and voice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sgEzuz9UPdJz9Eu5fl6LMA1J2Gm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223768'),
  ('838667049986614656', 'Pretty Boy Detective Club', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Mystery', null, 'Akiyuki Shinbo', 'Maaya Sakamoto, Ayumu Murase, Taito Ban, Toshiki Masuda, Shogo Yano, Gen Sato, Hiroki Nanami, Kohsuke Toriumi', 'TV-14', 'Mayumi Dojima, a second-year student at the exclusive Yubiwa Academy middle school, has lost something—a star she glimpsed just once, ten long years ago. But help is on the way, in the form of the unofficial, secretive, and thoroughly mysterious Pretty Boy Detective Club! Rumored to solve problems within the school (most of which they themselves might as well created) for reasons aesthetic rather than financial, these five gorgeous boys sweep Mayumi into their world of excitement, danger, and overwhelming beauty.', 'Mayumi Dojima, a second-year student at the exclusive Yubiwa Academy middle school, has lost something—a star she glimpsed just once, ten long years ago. But help is on the way, in the form of the unofficial, secretive, and thoroughly mysterious Pretty Boy Detective Club! Rumored to solve problems within the school (most of which they themselves might as well created) for reasons aesthetic rather than financial, these five gorgeous boys sweep Mayumi into their world of excitement, danger, and overwhelming beauty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yriQ3nib4eJyHBviaw7nm5hzIpO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113042'),
  ('930677464896624040', 'Pretty Cure', 2004, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Kids, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yoko Honna, Yukana, Rie Tanaka, Tomokazu Seki, Akiko Yajima, Haruna Ikezawa, Kenichi Ono', 'TV-PG', 'Nagisa Misumi and Honoka Yukishiro couldn''t be more different. Nagisa is sporty and Honoka bookish, and while they attend the same school, they have very little in common - until one day, a shower of shooting stars brings two very unlikely visitors into their lives: Mepple and Mipple, refugees from the Garden of Light, which has been conquered by Darkness. Endowed with new and startling powers, Nagisa and Honoka become Cure Black and Cure White, the legendary warriors of light - together, they are Pretty Cure.', 'Nagisa Misumi and Honoka Yukishiro couldn''t be more different. Nagisa is sporty and Honoka bookish, and while they attend the same school, they have very little in common - until one day, a shower of shooting stars brings two very unlikely visitors into their lives: Mepple and Mipple, refugees from the Garden of Light, which has been conquered by Darkness. Endowed with new and startling powers, Nagisa and Honoka become Cure Black and Cure White, the legendary warriors of light - together, they are Pretty Cure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6mpebL9rM6Dobd0xy6Bwlhj9WYt.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:37508'),
  ('801723868108450876', 'Pretty Freekin Scary', 2023, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids, Family', 'Jason Hauser', null, 'Eliana Su''a, Kyan Samuels, Leah Mei Gold, Yonas Kibreab, Emma Shannon, Shawn Carter Peterson, Yuvi Hecht', 'TV-G', 'Fourteen-year-old Frankie Ripp had a perfect life — a great family, an annoying little brother, a popular boyfriend and a BFF she could always count on. However, her life took a surprising turn after an unfortunate incident. After some heated debate in the Underworld with the Grim Reaper herself, Frankie is forced to navigate life with her new Underworld guardians, Pretty and Scary, in the most challenging setting of all … middle school. Pretty freekin scary, huh?', 'Fourteen-year-old Frankie Ripp had a perfect life — a great family, an annoying little brother, a popular boyfriend and a BFF she could always count on. However, her life took a surprising turn after an unfortunate incident. After some heated debate in the Underworld with the Grim Reaper herself, Frankie is forced to navigate life with her new Underworld guardians, Pretty and Scary, in the most challenging setting of all … middle school. Pretty freekin scary, huh?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svhvIMrU1rcqjERnMB4PZZ8Xh5J.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:212250'),
  ('796797737242117657', 'Pretty Guardian Sailor Moon', 2003, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Naoko Takeuchi', null, 'Miyuu Sawai, Keiko Kitagawa, Rika Izumi, Ayaka Komatsu, Mew Azama, Rina Koike, Jouji Shibue, Aya Sugimoto', null, 'Usagi Tsukino is a clumsy teenage girl who becomes a Magical Girl named Sailor Moon after meeting a cat named Luna, who tells her she is a destined warrior who must find the reincarnated princess of a lost kingdom. Along the way, she meets other reincarnated warriors who join her group known as the Sailor Senshi who fight the forces of the evil mastermind behind the Dark Kingdom.', 'Usagi Tsukino is a clumsy teenage girl who becomes a Magical Girl named Sailor Moon after meeting a cat named Luna, who tells her she is a destined warrior who must find the reincarnated princess of a lost kingdom. Along the way, she meets other reincarnated warriors who join her group known as the Sailor Senshi who fight the forces of the evil mastermind behind the Dark Kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wzv6Rp3YxXgullNHbP5Vsz9iAFP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5405'),
  ('238596644880114644', 'Pretty Hard Cases', 2021, 'Comedy, Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Sherry White, Tassie Cameron', null, 'Meredith MacNeill, Adrienne C. Moore, Al Mukadam, Daren A. Herbert', 'TV-14', 'A fun and honest portrayal of two radically different female detectives in their early 40s following Guns and Gangs detective Sam and Narcotics detective Kelly, who by day are true action heroes in their own particular way: skilled, tough, determined, and ruthless. But by night, they’re both grappling with loneliness, dysfunctional families, screwed-up love lives, and a sense that their professional ambitions may not be totally in line with their personal needs.', 'A fun and honest portrayal of two radically different female detectives in their early 40s following Guns and Gangs detective Sam and Narcotics detective Kelly, who by day are true action heroes in their own particular way: skilled, tough, determined, and ruthless. But by night, they’re both grappling with loneliness, dysfunctional families, screwed-up love lives, and a sense that their professional ambitions may not be totally in line with their personal needs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/logy60poXm2R5RKPE0YaArgcZv1.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:117327'),
  ('238976073917404473', 'Pretty Li Hui Zhen', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Yang Qing, Lu Zhirou', null, 'Dilraba Dilmurat, Peter Sheng, Vin Zhang, Sierra Li, Wang Xiao, Wei Ren, Wang Yifei, Wang Yinan', null, 'Li Huizhen used to be gorgeous, but years of declining family fortune added much pain to her life, and her looks slowly drifted away. Her friend Bai Haoyu, on the other hand, was once an ordinary looking guy and grew up to be suave, successful, and immensely likable. So when she comes across him years later and witnesses their reversal of fortune, Li Huizhen is too embarrassed to even meet him and instead asks her stylish friend and roommate Xia Qiao to assume her identity. But when Huizhen lands an internship at a company that she has been trying to break into, she is shocked to find out that Haoyu is her new boss.', 'Li Huizhen used to be gorgeous, but years of declining family fortune added much pain to her life, and her looks slowly drifted away. Her friend Bai Haoyu, on the other hand, was once an ordinary looking guy and grew up to be suave, successful, and immensely likable. So when she comes across him years later and witnesses their reversal of fortune, Li Huizhen is too embarrassed to even meet him and instead asks her stylish friend and roommate Xia Qiao to assume her identity. But when Huizhen lands an internship at a company that she has been trying to break into, she is shocked to find out that Haoyu is her new boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o7HGxb7Ak5jpRUnHEn4pIdAXBwT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69386'),
  ('193962843296612524', 'Pretty Little Liars', 2010, 'Drama, Mystery', 'I. Marlene King', null, 'Lucy Hale, Troian Bellisario, Ashley Benson, Shay Mitchell, Sasha Pieterse, Ian Harding, Tyler Blackburn, Janel Parrish', 'TV-14', 'Based on the Pretty Little Liars series of young adult novels by Sara Shepard, the series follows the lives of four girls — Spencer, Hanna, Aria, and Emily — whose clique falls apart after the disappearance of their queen bee, Alison. One year later, they begin receiving messages from someone using the name "A" who threatens to expose their secrets — including long-hidden ones they thought only Alison knew.', 'Based on the Pretty Little Liars series of young adult novels by Sara Shepard, the series follows the lives of four girls — Spencer, Hanna, Aria, and Emily — whose clique falls apart after the disappearance of their queen bee, Alison. One year later, they begin receiving messages from someone using the name "A" who threatens to expose their secrets — including long-hidden ones they thought only Alison knew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUPbHiLS3hCHKjtLsncFa9g0viV.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:31917'),
  ('1139041088252717226', 'Pretty Little Liars', 2015, 'Mystery, Drama', null, 'Elif Usman', 'Şükrü Özyıldız, Bensu Soral, Büşra Develi, Melisa Şenolsun, Dilan Çiçek Deniz, Beste Kökdemir, Burak Deniz, Alperen Duymaz', null, 'Four friends band together against an anonymous foe who threatens to reveal their darkest secrets, while also investigating the disappearance of their best friend.', 'Four friends band together against an anonymous foe who threatens to reveal their darkest secrets, while also investigating the disappearance of their best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/euDiViLfAFygDMH4LTOQgwpBhvd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64000'),
  ('422692304280294865', 'Pretty Little Liars', 2020, 'Drama', 'Emil Heradi', null, 'Yuki Kato, Anya Geraldine, Eyka Farhana, Valerie Thomas, Shindy Huang, Wulan Guritno, Tarra Budiman, Naufal Samudra', null, 'In a fictional city named Amerta in Bali, four students'' friendship breaks up when Alissa, their popular and most influential friend, is declared mysteriously lost. One year later Hanna, Ema, Sabrina and Aria finally became reconnected when one by one they began to receive short messages from someone mysteriously named “A” , who threatened to open their dark secrets.', 'In a fictional city named Amerta in Bali, four students'' friendship breaks up when Alissa, their popular and most influential friend, is declared mysteriously lost. One year later Hanna, Ema, Sabrina and Aria finally became reconnected when one by one they began to receive short messages from someone mysteriously named “A” , who threatened to open their dark secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6wrUL1boBJIRlgwdmFKOlbhllDh.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:102567'),
  ('1093778627389803450', 'Pretty Little Liars: Original Sin', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Roberto Aguirre-Sacasa, Lindsay Calhoon Bring', null, 'Bailee Madison, Chandler Kinney, Maia Reficco, Zaria, Malia Pyles, Mallory Bechtel, Alex Aiono', 'TV-MA', 'Twenty years ago, a series of tragic events almost ripped the blue-collar town of Millwood apart. Now, in the present day, a group of disparate teen girls finds themselves tormented by an unknown Assailant and made to pay for the secret sin their parents committed two decades ago, as well as their own.', 'Twenty years ago, a series of tragic events almost ripped the blue-collar town of Millwood apart. Now, in the present day, a group of disparate teen girls finds themselves tormented by an unknown Assailant and made to pay for the secret sin their parents committed two decades ago, as well as their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/igmLgglembi9mZ2RYQRaGKigbvq.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:110531'),
  ('753861285147152263', 'Pretty Little Liars: The Perfectionists', 2019, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'I. Marlene King', null, 'Sasha Pieterse, Janel Parrish, Sofia Carson, Sydney Park, Eli Brown', 'TV-14', 'In Beacon Heights, a seemingly perfect town, a group of three college friends struggle with the stress of being overachievers. In the aftermath of the town’s first murder, each Perfectionist hides behind a secret, a lie and an alibi.', 'In Beacon Heights, a seemingly perfect town, a group of three college friends struggle with the stress of being overachievers. In the aftermath of the town’s first murder, each Perfectionist hides behind a secret, a lie and an alibi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xIpqBtVpu9bUq05dT3VTRYPjBP7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79863'),
  ('931082946373834920', 'Pretty Proofreader', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Satomi Ishihara, Masaki Suda, Tsubasa Honda, Munetaka Aoki, Goro Kishitani, Masato Wada, Noriko Eguchi, Hiromasa Taguchi', null, 'Etsuko Kono is a 28-year-old woman who loves fashion. Aspiring to become a fashion editor, she joins a publishing company, but is sent to work in copy editing. There, her job is to correct errors and inadequate parts of documents and copies.', 'Etsuko Kono is a 28-year-old woman who loves fashion. Aspiring to become a fashion editor, she joins a publishing company, but is sent to work in copy editing. There, her job is to correct errors and inadequate parts of documents and copies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1nfhCanO5ZUIJjhe47nNYYz6p6e.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68952'),
  ('26124396252197683', 'Pretty Smart', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jack Dolgen, Doug Mand', null, 'Emily Osment, Gregg Sulkin, Olivia Macklin, Cinthya Carmona, Michael Rosen', 'TV-14', 'A self-proclaimed intellectual, forced to move in with her carefree sister and her sister''s lovably eccentric friends.', 'A self-proclaimed intellectual, forced to move in with her carefree sister and her sister''s lovably eccentric friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nR1UP7VoF9D7OZLcBWCWuPVqjjM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:133537'),
