  ('311204279239534140', 'Produce 101', 2016, 'Reality', null, null, 'Kwon Hyun-bin, Park Sung-woo, Lee You-jin, Kwon BoA, Shin Yoo-mi, Lee Seok-hoon, Park Ka-hi, Kim Eun-young', null, 'Produce 101 (프로듀스 101) is a reality music group survival show on Mnet. It is a large-scale project in which the public "produces" a unit group by choosing members from a pool of 101 trainees from 46 entertainment companies as well as the group''s concept, debut song, and group name.', 'Produce 101 (프로듀스 101) is a reality music group survival show on Mnet. It is a large-scale project in which the public "produces" a unit group by choosing members from a pool of 101 trainees from 46 entertainment companies as well as the group''s concept, debut song, and group name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1hJwKUpkCXTy6EfsiVdvO7mcVHC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:65552'),
  ('313631901060442440', 'Produce 48', 2018, 'Reality', null, null, 'Lee Seung-gi, Lee Hong-gi, Soyou, Kim Eun-young, Bae Yoon-jung, Kwon Eun-bi, Kang Hye-won, Sakura', null, 'A survival reality television show in which the public "produces" a girl group by voting for members out of a pool of 96 trainees from Japan and South Korea, as well as voting for the group''s concept, debut single, and group name. Produce 48 is a 2018 reality competition show on Mnet. It was a large-scale project in which the public "produces" a girl group by voting for members, as well as voting for the group''s concept, name and debut single. The show brought together 96 girls from idol groups and entertainment companies in Japan and South Korea to form a 12-person Korean-Japanese group, IZ*ONE, that would promote for two and a half years.', 'A survival reality television show in which the public "produces" a girl group by voting for members out of a pool of 96 trainees from Japan and South Korea, as well as voting for the group''s concept, debut single, and group name. Produce 48 is a 2018 reality competition show on Mnet. It was a large-scale project in which the public "produces" a girl group by voting for members, as well as voting for the group''s concept, name and debut single. The show brought together 96 girls from idol groups and entertainment companies in Japan and South Korea to form a 12-person Korean-Japanese group, IZ*ONE, that would promote for two and a half years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJ7LBa817QEr7TBi5eA7t6QcsdQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80251'),
  ('1091736741201547365', 'Producing Nobuta', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Shiraiwa Gen', 'Tokiko Mega', 'Kazuya Kamenashi, Tomohisa Yamashita, Maki Horikita, Erika Toda, Takashi Ukaji, Kanako Fukaura, Yuto Nakajima, Yuichi Kimura', null, 'A popular high schooler and his oddball friend help a shy girl get rid of her bullies by attempting to make her the most popular girl in school.', 'A popular high schooler and his oddball friend help a shy girl get rid of her bullies by attempting to make her the most popular girl in school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uH5MWHpvrUqhDeQvfWV8RNJIk0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13493'),
  ('518315021723394916', 'Profe Infiltrado', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Anton Schukin', null, null, 'TV-14', 'The “sports teacher” Julián seeks to obtain as much evidence as possible to arrest the father of a student, who is a criminal. However, the story will take an important turn when Julián falls in love with Miss Sofia.', 'The “sports teacher” Julián seeks to obtain as much evidence as possible to arrest the father of a student, who is a criminal. However, the story will take an important turn when Julián falls in love with Miss Sofia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7X8gByFq0IuLUg1oicjvybm19BH.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:256580'),
  ('984984891601880839', 'Professional Killers', 1972, 'Drama, Crime, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Ken Ogata, Yoichi Hayashi, So Yamamura, Yumiko Nogawa, Tamao Nakamura, Taisaku Akino, Rumi Matsumoto, Hiroyuki Ôta', null, 'A shikakenin was an under-the-cover trade that undertook killing in Edo. Hanemon of Otowa, an agency that introduced laborers and maids, was also one of these. Katsugoro Iseya was a timber dealer who had come in as a client. His target was the constructions magistrate Hanno, and the Tatsumiya who sipped on the benefits. Hanemon who had a stong code towards killing, where he would only kill those who do no good to be in the world, accepts this request. Baian Fujieda, a needle doctor would carry out the killing. However, the professional killer Baian fails to bring down Tatsumiya. Hanemon then looks to another shikakenin, the ronin Sanai Nishimura for the role. Although Sanai''s ability with the sword is good, he lives poorly in a tenement, and accepts this commission on the condition that it is kept a secret from his wife and child. Here, they close in on Hanno and Tatsumiya again...', 'A shikakenin was an under-the-cover trade that undertook killing in Edo. Hanemon of Otowa, an agency that introduced laborers and maids, was also one of these. Katsugoro Iseya was a timber dealer who had come in as a client. His target was the constructions magistrate Hanno, and the Tatsumiya who sipped on the benefits. Hanemon who had a stong code towards killing, where he would only kill those who do no good to be in the world, accepts this request. Baian Fujieda, a needle doctor would carry out the killing. However, the professional killer Baian fails to bring down Tatsumiya. Hanemon then looks to another shikakenin, the ronin Sanai Nishimura for the role. Although Sanai''s ability with the sword is good, he lives poorly in a tenement, and accepts this commission on the condition that it is kept a secret from his wife and child. Here, they close in on Hanno and Tatsumiya again...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/skML7fjniBlKzoGjh0y7JXRbW6v.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217739'),
  ('561331486502244223', 'Professional Single', 2020, 'Soap, Drama, Comedy', null, 'Ai Xiao Tu', 'Ireine Song, Aaron Deng, He Zeyuan, Chen Kefan, Cui Liya', 'TV-14', 'Single since birth, Yuan Qian and Qin Shen are two people who will probably end up being single for life because they want to. Set against the backdrop of an art school, the story follows students who overcome many difficulties to pursue their artistic ideals. Qin Shen is a student who dreams of becoming a sculptor. A freshman in their department, he is like a god-level existence in their school - cold, disciplined and a perfectionist. However, girls mean nothing to him and he finds dating to be a complete waste of time. Yuan Qian has the appearance of the cute girl next door but has a headstrong personality. She is eloquent and determined such that no one can stop her once she sets her mind to something. However, she has a tendency to pick at other people''s shortcomings so much that no guy can impress her.', 'Single since birth, Yuan Qian and Qin Shen are two people who will probably end up being single for life because they want to. Set against the backdrop of an art school, the story follows students who overcome many difficulties to pursue their artistic ideals. Qin Shen is a student who dreams of becoming a sculptor. A freshman in their department, he is like a god-level existence in their school - cold, disciplined and a perfectionist. However, girls mean nothing to him and he finds dating to be a complete waste of time. Yuan Qian has the appearance of the cute girl next door but has a headstrong personality. She is eloquent and determined such that no one can stop her once she sets her mind to something. However, she has a tendency to pick at other people''s shortcomings so much that no guy can impress her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e1yVMFrVi4Qf8x5azafOf9LVJkP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:111739'),
  ('1096342903652468070', 'Professional: Shigoto no ryûgi', 2006, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'It is said that "the style of work reflects a person''s way of life." This documentary program closely follows top-notch professionals and thoroughly delves into their work. Since its premiere in January 2006, it has observed individuals at the forefront of their respective fields, such as Ichiro (Major League Baseball player), Sayuri Yoshinaga (film actor), Haruko Niitsu (janitor), Ken Takakura (film actor), Kasumi Ishikawa (table tennis player), Hikaru Utada (singer-songwriter), Kumamon (local government employee), and Yoshiharu Habu (professional shogi player).', 'It is said that "the style of work reflects a person''s way of life." This documentary program closely follows top-notch professionals and thoroughly delves into their work. Since its premiere in January 2006, it has observed individuals at the forefront of their respective fields, such as Ichiro (Major League Baseball player), Sayuri Yoshinaga (film actor), Haruko Niitsu (janitor), Ken Takakura (film actor), Kasumi Ishikawa (table tennis player), Hikaru Utada (singer-songwriter), Kumamon (local government employee), and Yoshiharu Habu (professional shogi player).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5sd9aqpuS1QFATMVYGbwYczX9YU.jpg', 21, 'tmdb:tv:111990'),
  ('726336747750149199', 'Professionals', 2020, 'Action & Adventure', 'Jeff Most', null, 'Tom Welling, Elena Anaya, Brendan Fraser, Ken Duken, Lisa Loven Kongsli, Stevel Marc, Tanya van Graan, Nic Rasenti', null, 'After their advanced medical satellite explodes on deployment, billionaire futurist Peter Swann, and his fiancée, medical visionary Dr. Graciela "Grace" Davila, turn to a hardened former counterintelligence officer.', 'After their advanced medical satellite explodes on deployment, billionaire futurist Peter Swann, and his fiancée, medical visionary Dr. Graciela "Grace" Davila, turn to a hardened former counterintelligence officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fEnU5MLsorGStlyGsaqZXq8gCHf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113452'),
  ('1024450914560314617', 'Professor T', 2021, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Malin-Sarah Gozin, Paul Piedfort', null, 'Ben Miller, Emma Naomi, Barney White, Sarah Woodward, Andy Gathergood, Douglas Reith, Juliet Stevenson, Frances de la Tour', 'NR', 'Professor Jasper Tempest, a genius Cambridge University criminologist with OCD and an overbearing mother, advises the police. British version of the Belgian crime drama of the same name.', 'Professor Jasper Tempest, a genius Cambridge University criminologist with OCD and an overbearing mother, advises the police. British version of the Belgian crime drama of the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJ9SjrX7tEAwHigRq20TeANhH1Q.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:126660'),
  ('41651980436073215', 'Professor T.', 2015, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Koen De Bouw, Tanja Oostvogels, Goele Derick, Carry Goossens, Herwig Ilegems, Viviane de Muynck, Steve Geerts', 'TV-MA', 'Eccentric criminal psychology Professor T is a successful police advisor but his unpredictable nature drives his colleagues crazy. He has a brilliant mind, but also several psychological and neurological disorders which make him a complex and often difficult individual. However, aided by the trusty and understanding Annelies and Daan they form a team of high-powered experts that Antwerp Homicide Department rely on. After Season Two, however, things change radically. This is a thinking person''s television series.', 'Eccentric criminal psychology Professor T is a successful police advisor but his unpredictable nature drives his colleagues crazy. He has a brilliant mind, but also several psychological and neurological disorders which make him a complex and often difficult individual. However, aided by the trusty and understanding Annelies and Daan they form a team of high-powered experts that Antwerp Homicide Department rely on. After Season Two, however, things change radically. This is a thinking person''s television series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b71FyxnxGO8hpx3J5AktkcXR14G.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:64011'),
  ('124149978803511968', 'Professor T.', 2017, 'Crime', 'Paul Piedfort', null, 'Matthias Matschke, Lucie Heinze, Helgi Schmid, Julia Bremermann, Alexandra von Schwerin, Simon Böer, Dietrich Hollinderbäumer, Hedi Kriegeskotte', null, 'Jasper Teerlinck, an eccentric professor, is an adviser to the police.', 'Jasper Teerlinck, an eccentric professor, is an adviser to the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iooWAjmpc8SBZeD1NtQpAa2pqIK.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:69511'),
  ('136472926925231840', 'Profiler', 1996, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Jamie Luner, Robert Davi, Julian McMahon, Roma Maffia, Peter Frechette', 'TV-14', 'Rachel Burke is a criminal profiler, one of the best, actually. She, along with a sophisticated team of specialists on the FBI''s Violent Crimes Task Force in Atlanta, investigates crimes throughout the country. Together, they solve the toughest of cases while trying to live their lives as best they can.', 'Rachel Burke is a criminal profiler, one of the best, actually. She, along with a sophisticated team of specialists on the FBI''s Violent Crimes Task Force in Atlanta, investigates crimes throughout the country. Together, they solve the toughest of cases while trying to live their lives as best they can.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZPFS2CRMZOy2LV4hE64KBxAbGg.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2651'),
  ('982202356315948126', 'Profiling Paris', 2009, 'Crime, Drama', 'Fanny Robert, Sophie Lebarbier', null, 'Raphaël Ferret, Diane Dassigny, Philippe Bas, Shy''m, Valérie Dashwood', 'NR', 'Chloé Saint-Laurent is a profiler and works with a police team to solve murders in Paris. She''s very sweet, she wears very colored clothes and a huge yellow bag. She looks like a little girl who need a doll, but she''s very smart and a very good profiler. Step by step, she fit in the team and her colleagues, very reserved at first, became her best friends.', 'Chloé Saint-Laurent is a profiler and works with a police team to solve murders in Paris. She''s very sweet, she wears very colored clothes and a huge yellow bag. She looks like a little girl who need a doll, but she''s very smart and a very good profiler. Step by step, she fit in the team and her colleagues, very reserved at first, became her best friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8IWWLIHhuUxMe2mmZ7n1wujp01f.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:64589'),
  ('890379910787561979', 'Profit', 1996, 'Drama', 'John McNamara, David Greenwalt', null, 'Adrian Pasdar, Lisa Darr, Lisa Blount, Jack Gwaltney, Allison Hossack, Keith Szarabajka, Lisa Zane', null, 'Jim Profit works for a multinational company, and isn''t above using any means necessary to get ahead, and that includes bribery, blackmail, intimidation, extortion, and even murder. Now everyone at the company, including the president, Charles Gracen are oblivious to his dark side, as a matter of fact, Gracen thinks of him as a golden boy. But when Joanne Meltzer, the company''s security chief looks into his eyes, she sees something sinister.', 'Jim Profit works for a multinational company, and isn''t above using any means necessary to get ahead, and that includes bribery, blackmail, intimidation, extortion, and even murder. Now everyone at the company, including the president, Charles Gracen are oblivious to his dark side, as a matter of fact, Gracen thinks of him as a golden boy. But when Joanne Meltzer, the company''s security chief looks into his eyes, she sees something sinister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bdVeDCo92oe09pbZ0e7IROhvil.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:623'),
  ('557433469589670731', 'Profugos', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Pablo Illanes', null, 'Néstor Cantillana, Benjamín Vicuña, Alfredo Castro, Luis Gnecco, Aline Küppenheim, Blanca Lewin, Antonia Zegers', 'TV-MA', 'Four men become fugitives after a failed drug deal, running from north to south of Chile.', 'Four men become fugitives after a failed drug deal, running from north to south of Chile.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qS5LiIab40soDhO2s8IrklVaiuP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:56733'),
  ('951510416035908229', 'Prohibition', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Ken Burns, Lynn Novick', null, 'Peter Coyote, Daniel Okrent, Pete Hamill, Noah Feldman, Adam Arkin, Philip Bosco, Patricia Clarkson, Kevin Conway', 'TV-14', 'The history of the rise, rule and fall of the Eighteenth Amendment to the United States Constitution and the entire era it encompassed (1920-33). After nearly a century of activism, Prohibition was intended to improve the lives of all citizens by protecting individuals, families and society at large from the devastating effects of alcohol abuse; but paradoxically it made millions of people rethink their definition of morality.', 'The history of the rise, rule and fall of the Eighteenth Amendment to the United States Constitution and the entire era it encompassed (1920-33). After nearly a century of activism, Prohibition was intended to improve the lives of all citizens by protecting individuals, families and society at large from the devastating effects of alcohol abuse; but paradoxically it made millions of people rethink their definition of morality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhZKY66U37aIJVxA6OsR95efTkI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39983'),
  ('963206264143640174', 'Project Arms', 2001, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Nobutoshi Canna, Shin-ichiro Miki, Minami Takayama, Yuji Ueda', null, 'Ryo Takatsuki learns that his missing right arm is actually an ARMS nanomachine implant from secret genetic experiments, and alongside fellow test subjects Kei Karuma, Takeshi Tomoe, and Hayato Shingu, he battles the creators of the technology, the Egrigori, to rescue his kidnapped girlfriend Katsumi Akagi.', 'Ryo Takatsuki learns that his missing right arm is actually an ARMS nanomachine implant from secret genetic experiments, and alongside fellow test subjects Kei Karuma, Takeshi Tomoe, and Hayato Shingu, he battles the creators of the technology, the Egrigori, to rescue his kidnapped girlfriend Katsumi Akagi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/SxEGeFM3ib9wcub5VXAhMErmMD.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:34857'),
  ('1108536246362926063', 'Project Blue Book', 2019, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Drama', 'David O''Leary', 'Linda Burstyn, Alec Wells, Emily Brochin', 'Aidan Gillen, Michael Malarkey, Laura Mennell, Ksenia Solo, Neal McDonough, Michael Harney', 'TV-14', 'A chronicle of the true top secret U.S. Air Force-sponsored investigations into UFO-related phenomena in the 1950s and ’60s, known as “Project Blue Book”.', 'A chronicle of the true top secret U.S. Air Force-sponsored investigations into UFO-related phenomena in the 1950s and ’60s, known as “Project Blue Book”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqrzjT5nc7mTD5IKVMLRhLeyzgD.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:79649'),
