  ('755719353313524004', 'Pui Pui Molcar', 2021, 'Animation, Kids', null, null, null, 'TV-Y7', 'The setting is a world where people drive sentient vehicles that are hybrids between guinea pigs and cars – "Molcars"! Molcars have round eyes, big soft butts, and short arms and legs as they trot along. They run around with a silly look on their face, and even when you''re stuck in traffic, you can be put at ease just by gazing at the guinea pig butt in front of you! Even if they cause a bit of trouble, it''s easy to forgive them because they''re so cute and fluffy! This is an animation focusing on various situations unique to cars, full of satisfaction, friendship, adventure, crazy action, and tons of guinea pigs!', 'The setting is a world where people drive sentient vehicles that are hybrids between guinea pigs and cars – "Molcars"! Molcars have round eyes, big soft butts, and short arms and legs as they trot along. They run around with a silly look on their face, and even when you''re stuck in traffic, you can be put at ease just by gazing at the guinea pig butt in front of you! Even if they cause a bit of trouble, it''s easy to forgive them because they''re so cute and fluffy! This is an animation focusing on various situations unique to cars, full of satisfaction, friendship, adventure, crazy action, and tons of guinea pigs!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twIb0T5no8v8t8KIt143L8FKPvQ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:117166'),
  ('278958705101949668', 'Pulang Araw', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, War & Politics, Family', 'Suzette Doctolero', null, 'Alden Richards, Sanya Lopez, Barbie Forteza, David Licauco, Dennis Trillo, Angelu de Leon, Epy Quizon, Rochelle Pangilinan', null, 'Red Sun is a family drama that tells stories of courage, sacrifice, and hardships that every Filipino family has. These stories were inspired by the tales of the unsung heroes who defied the odds of World War II and the Japanese occupation of the Philippines.', 'Red Sun is a family drama that tells stories of courage, sacrifice, and hardships that every Filipino family has. These stories were inspired by the tales of the unsung heroes who defied the odds of World War II and the Japanese occupation of the Philippines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2zbaRzgieKiHYkTGztQUzrAYbgb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:242931'),
  ('735684084038709456', 'Pulling', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Dennis Kelly', 'Dennis Kelly, Sharon Horgan', 'Sharon Horgan, Tanya Franks, Rebekah Staton, Cavan Clerkin', null, 'Donna narrowly escapes making a huge mistake by marrying Karl and instead opts for moving in with her friends Karen and Louise in South London. The three girls learn about life and love in this funny and modern comedy.', 'Donna narrowly escapes making a huge mistake by marrying Karl and instead opts for moving in with her friends Karen and Louise in South London. The three girls learn about life and love in this funny and modern comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ifJGXGlKv6amOjiE8Tq32jz4Ym.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:16295'),
  ('473788659086527523', 'Pulse', 2017, 'Drama', 'Kris Wyld, Mel Hill, Michael Miller', null, 'Claire van der Boom, Andrea Demetriades, Arka Das, Pallavi Sharda, Blessing Mokgohloa, Susie Porter, Dalip Sondhi, Penny Cook', 'TV-MA', 'When successful high-flier Frankie Bell is brought crashing to earth by chronic kidney failure she targets an alternate future. Eight years on she is in her second year as a practicing doctor starting her first day in a Renal rotation. Driven to use her second chance to save others, Frankie must confront an ailing health system, and face her toughest challenge - learning to let go.', 'When successful high-flier Frankie Bell is brought crashing to earth by chronic kidney failure she targets an alternate future. Eight years on she is in her second year as a practicing doctor starting her first day in a Renal rotation. Driven to use her second chance to save others, Frankie must confront an ailing health system, and face her toughest challenge - learning to let go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/apFmO4sqH5IaC5VwLQMehdNdBkx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72380'),
  ('858675024187364224', 'PULSE', 2025, 'Drama', 'Zoe Robyn', null, 'Willa Fitzgerald, Colin Woodell, Jack Bannon, Jessie T. Usher, Jessy Yates, Chelsea Muirhead', 'TV-MA', 'A group of ER residents navigate medical crises and personal drama amid a divisive allegation at their Miami hospital.', 'A group of ER residents navigate medical crises and personal drama amid a divisive allegation at their Miami hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uGKTDr8ruc4IHGsEZ8wSQZpy2eN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:247784'),
  ('543934060826545992', 'Pump Up the Healthy Love', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Park Jun Su', 'Kim Ji-soo', 'Lee Jun-young, Jung Eun-ji, Lee Mi-do, Lee Da-eun, Park Seong-yeon, Lee Seung-woo, Hong Yun-hwa, Jung Wook-jin', null, 'Do Hyeon-joong, a health-obsessed gym manager, helps his members transform their lives while balancing the struggles of self-employment, and forms a passionate connection with Lee Mi-ran, a travel agency manager who loves food.', 'Do Hyeon-joong, a health-obsessed gym manager, helps his members transform their lives while balancing the struggles of self-employment, and forms a passionate connection with Lee Mi-ran, a travel agency manager who loves food.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rzGKRiBSPVd5RsEhMB0GGWYd654.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:260555'),
  ('1031980817448833317', 'Pumpkin Scissors', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Ryotaro Iwanaga', null, 'Kenta Miyake, Shizuka Itoh, Cho, Chihiro Suzuki, Kohsuke Toriumi, Kana Ueda, Kazuki Ogawa, Akiko Hiramatsu', null, 'Pumpkin Scissors is a manga created and authored by Ryotaro Iwanaga. Originally serialized in Magazine GREAT in 2002 it was later moved to Monthly Shonen Magazine in October 2006. The manga has been licensed by Del Rey. An anime adaptation of Pumpkin Scissors has been released, produced by Gonzo and AIC, which began airing on October 2, 2006 across several Japanese television stations and ended with the 24th episode on March 19, 2007. The series was originally licensed to the North American market by ADV Films for $780,000. In 2008 it became one of over thirty titles transferred from ADV Films to FUNimation, the main distributor of anime in the English speaking world.', 'Pumpkin Scissors is a manga created and authored by Ryotaro Iwanaga. Originally serialized in Magazine GREAT in 2002 it was later moved to Monthly Shonen Magazine in October 2006. The manga has been licensed by Del Rey. An anime adaptation of Pumpkin Scissors has been released, produced by Gonzo and AIC, which began airing on October 2, 2006 across several Japanese television stations and ended with the 24th episode on March 19, 2007. The series was originally licensed to the North American market by ADV Films for $780,000. In 2008 it became one of over thirty titles transferred from ADV Films to FUNimation, the main distributor of anime in the English speaking world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/56MIZgVKGDMo25NNuVspQmDrF0D.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31712'),
  ('806656784576028517', 'Punch', 2014, 'Drama', 'Park Kyung-soo', 'Park Kyung-soo', 'Kim A-joong, Kim Rae-won, Cho Jae-hyun, Seo Ji-hye, On Ju-wan, Kim Ji-young, Lee Han-wi, Song Ok-suk', null, 'When Park Jung-hwan, the chief of the anti-corruption investigation team for the Supreme Prosecutors'' Office, learns that he has a malignant brain tumor that gives him only 6 months to live, he decides to throw his final punch at the criminal world before he says farewell to life.', 'When Park Jung-hwan, the chief of the anti-corruption investigation team for the Supreme Prosecutors'' Office, learns that he has a malignant brain tumor that gives him only 6 months to live, he decides to throw his final punch at the criminal world before he says farewell to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a5SpOFTF1EmQ4B6DCYfgPSUzUB5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61799'),
  ('854249504620028029', 'Punch Line', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Marina Inoue, Sora Amamiya, Minako Kotobuki, Rie Kugimiya, Haruka Tomatsu, Yu-ri Yoshida, Yui Shoji, Mariko Honda', 'TV-14', 'High schooler Yūta Iridatsu has experienced “astral projection” i.e. his spirit has been separated from his body. He woke up in a mansion named Koraikan and met a cat spirit named Chiranosuke, who told him “You must find the Sacred Tome of Koraikan in order to return to your physical body.” While searching through corridors of Koraikan, Yūta bumped into underpants of its female residents, and doing so would, eh, create some big trouble for planet Earth.', 'High schooler Yūta Iridatsu has experienced “astral projection” i.e. his spirit has been separated from his body. He woke up in a mansion named Koraikan and met a cat spirit named Chiranosuke, who told him “You must find the Sacred Tome of Koraikan in order to return to your physical body.” While searching through corridors of Koraikan, Yūta bumped into underpants of its female residents, and doing so would, eh, create some big trouble for planet Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wj2Gx45z3pdcn6JBnVDGdMHW0PP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62484'),
  ('230426701354129014', 'Punch-Drunk Woman', 2026, 'Crime', null, null, null, null, 'A strict female correctional officer’s disciplined life unravels when she encounters an inmate who is connected to her deepest secret.', 'A strict female correctional officer’s disciplined life unravels when she encounters an inmate who is connected to her deepest secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mkd2QWkO93qK9pJs4XkUIy0NdT3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:305812'),
  ('1124719249340912162', 'Puni Puni Poemy', 2001, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yumiko Kobayashi, Shinichi Watanabe, Satomi Korogi, Aya Hisakawa, Tomoko Kawakami, Kotono Mitsuishi, Omi Minami, Atsuko Enomoto', 'TV-MA', 'When evil aliens kill Poemi Watanabe’s parents, she doesn’t get mad, she gets even… but first she moves in with the seven crazy Aasu sisters, discovers the magic power of dead fish, develops a serious crush on a local octopus, experiences the bizarre and varied wonders and joys of fighting terrorists, S&M, giant robots and becoming a super hero… all while pursuing her REAL ambition of becoming a professional voice actress!', 'When evil aliens kill Poemi Watanabe’s parents, she doesn’t get mad, she gets even… but first she moves in with the seven crazy Aasu sisters, discovers the magic power of dead fish, develops a serious crush on a local octopus, experiences the bizarre and varied wonders and joys of fighting terrorists, S&M, giant robots and becoming a super hero… all while pursuing her REAL ambition of becoming a professional voice actress!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mesYCdvW0damFh38lYcD34T0BWW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34688'),
  ('233709985581962537', 'Puniru Is a Kawaii Slime', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yu Sasahara, Shuichiro Umeda', 'TV-14', 'The slime created by the boy Kotarou can transform into a super beautiful girl! Kotarou is constantly getting pushed around by Puniru''s freewheeling antics. It''s a joyful and exciting life every day!', 'The slime created by the boy Kotarou can transform into a super beautiful girl! Kotarou is constantly getting pushed around by Puniru''s freewheeling antics. It''s a joyful and exciting life every day!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zaUlTqv4OWyTmi0Z80g9XQ5LFbE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241811'),
  ('622499346091634720', 'Punk', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Featuring original interviews with America’s punk pioneers and the U.K.’s most notorious bands, alongside a seamless blend of rare and unseen photos, gritty archival film and video, a crackling soundtrack of punk hits and misses, this documentary series explores the music, the fashion, the art and the DIY attitude of a subculture of self-described misfits and outcasts.', 'Featuring original interviews with America’s punk pioneers and the U.K.’s most notorious bands, alongside a seamless blend of rare and unseen photos, gritty archival film and video, a crackling soundtrack of punk hits and misses, this documentary series explores the music, the fashion, the art and the DIY attitude of a subculture of self-described misfits and outcasts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXeHnCQUnjQ5QmfUwkruvSGImis.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84929'),
  ('7540374331137398', 'Punk''d', 2003, 'Comedy, Reality', 'Jason Goldberg, Ashton Kutcher', null, 'Andrew Santino, Daryl J. Johnson', 'TV-14', 'What happens when the biggest stars in the world get too high on the Hollywood hog? When their bank accounts start swelling bigger than their heads? Master prankster Ashton Kutcher is there to punk ''em down to earth.', 'What happens when the biggest stars in the world get too high on the Hollywood hog? When their bank accounts start swelling bigger than their heads? Master prankster Ashton Kutcher is there to punk ''em down to earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sqcaFHnnJU1nIbUikN3cpm9Mjn9.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:2396'),
  ('222606967062846676', 'PUNKS△TRIANGLE', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yuho Okita', null, 'Ryota Nagano, Yasunari Fujibayashi, Rinta, Louis Kurihara, Akiko Hinagata, Masaki Himekomatsu, Goshu Suzuki, Kiyotake Nakamura', null, 'A young designer dreams of creating a look for his favorite model and finally gets his chance–unless his class partner screws things up!', 'A young designer dreams of creating a look for his favorite model and finally gets his chance–unless his class partner screws things up!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rF6JSTmWTzrLtywrVGQozw8S63y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:299282'),
  ('537358591811429926', 'Punky Brewster', 1984, 'Comedy, Kids', 'David W. Duclon', null, 'Soleil Moon Frye, George Gaynes, Cherie Johnson, Susie Garrett, Ami Foster', 'TV-G', 'An abandoned waif and her dog are taken in by a cranky apartment manager who becomes her guardian in this family-friendly sitcom.', 'An abandoned waif and her dog are taken in by a cranky apartment manager who becomes her guardian in this family-friendly sitcom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ZVmXNThTccZ4rKUfe1C1QZDwTe.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2553'),
  ('475075096465056986', 'Punky Brewster', 2021, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Soleil Moon Frye, Freddie Prinze Jr., Quinn Copeland, Lauren Lindsey Donzis, Cherie Johnson, Oliver De Los Santos, Noah Cottrell', 'TV-PG', 'Punky is now a single mother of three trying to get her life back on track when she meets Izzy, a young girl in the foster system who reminds Punky a lot of her younger self.', 'Punky is now a single mother of three trying to get her life back on track when she meets Izzy, a young girl in the foster system who reminds Punky a lot of her younger self.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ap4hlAB5pZn7CSJAtSs8GjpOrpV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95192'),
  ('822888312764820474', 'Punto Nemo', 2025, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Daniel Martín Sáez de Parayuelo', null, null, null, 'Members of an oceanographic expedition made up of scientists and the Spanish Navy embark on the Pentonkontors ship to investigate and raise awareness of the problems of the plastic island located in the South Pacific. It''s time to get to grips with the situation and the freedom of the planet. It is important to know that your habitation for military personnel is good, so that you can prepare for your habitation and survival so that you can survive your daily life at Point Nemo. A place full of mysteries and lurking dangers.', 'Members of an oceanographic expedition made up of scientists and the Spanish Navy embark on the Pentonkontors ship to investigate and raise awareness of the problems of the plastic island located in the South Pacific. It''s time to get to grips with the situation and the freedom of the planet. It is important to know that your habitation for military personnel is good, so that you can prepare for your habitation and survival so that you can survive your daily life at Point Nemo. A place full of mysteries and lurking dangers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNFls7LsLpS7Dvyx4uFhoTWHWlF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:280893'),
  ('242470630301039266', 'Pup Academy', 2019, 'Kids, Comedy', 'Anna McRoberts', null, 'Christian Convery, Aria Birch, Don Lake, Chance Hurstfield, Travis Turner, Dylan Schombing, Riley O''Donnell, Islie Hirvonen', 'TV-Y7', 'Welcome to a secret world where pups learn to be a human''s best friend. Follow three unlikely puppies - and their human friends - as they work together to discover the power of friendship and create everlasting bonds between dogs and humans.', 'Welcome to a secret world where pups learn to be a human''s best friend. Follow three unlikely puppies - and their human friends - as they work together to discover the power of friendship and create everlasting bonds between dogs and humans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/idjldYg3bgxyzmfHMCOKdvDG1RM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:93265'),
  ('843816014065094268', 'Pupa', 2014, 'Animation', null, null, 'Nobunaga Shimazaki, Ibuki Kido', 'TV-MA', 'Growing up with an abusive father, Utsutsu is highly protective of his younger sister Yume. One day, she contracts the strange Pupa virus and begins to sprout grotesque wings and attack both animals and humans.', 'Growing up with an abusive father, Utsutsu is highly protective of his younger sister Yume. One day, she contracts the strange Pupa virus and begins to sprout grotesque wings and attack both animals and humans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c5NMLjaA3UrhXncV4v60APnLGXr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71307'),
  ('309047075448354467', 'Puppy Dog Pals', 2017, 'Animation, Kids, Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Harland Williams', null, 'Harland Williams, Jessica DiCicco, Elisha Williams, Gracen Newton, Tom Kenny', 'TV-Y', 'Fun-loving pug puppies, brothers Bingo and Rolly, have thrill-seeking appetites that take them on exhilarating adventures in their neighborhood and around the globe.', 'Fun-loving pug puppies, brothers Bingo and Rolly, have thrill-seeking appetites that take them on exhilarating adventures in their neighborhood and around the globe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aa6Bo1lcuFxT3D1twy7DVX7pY03.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:72089'),
  ('18457689340475572', 'Pupstruction', 2023, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy', 'Travis Braun', null, null, 'TV-Y', 'This imaginative and music-filled animated series that follows the adventures of the Pupstruction team – a doggone hard-working construction crew that ranges from some of the brawniest breeds to irresistibly cute and playful puppies. It centers on Phinny, an innovative young corgi, who might be the smallest pup on the crew but proves that you don’t need big paws to have big dreams or big ideas.', 'This imaginative and music-filled animated series that follows the adventures of the Pupstruction team – a doggone hard-working construction crew that ranges from some of the brawniest breeds to irresistibly cute and playful puppies. It centers on Phinny, an innovative young corgi, who might be the smallest pup on the crew but proves that you don’t need big paws to have big dreams or big ideas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ksylYWX0gMu88okjbDLfHZ2O4Km.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:156616'),
  ('455111732768838931', 'Pura Sangre (Col)', 2007, 'Family', 'Tania Cárdenas Paulsen, Mauricio Navas, Guillermo Restrepo', null, 'Marcela Mar, Rafael Novoa, Pepe Sánchez, Juan Pablo Gamboa, Silvia de Dios, Alejandra Borrero, Martina García, Juliana Galvis', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LfjdBuFhGqyOSxGO9KQ2fTLmJy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:115081'),
  ('931293461484825920', 'Pure', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Michael Amo', null, 'Dylan Everett, Victor Gomez, Alex Paxton-Beesley, Ryan Robbins, Jessica Clement, Christopher Heyerdahl, Zoie Palmer', 'TV-MA', 'A newly-elected Mennonite pastor, who is determined to rid his community of drug traffickers. But Noah''s actions trigger an ultimatum from "Menno mob" leader Eli Voss.', 'A newly-elected Mennonite pastor, who is determined to rid his community of drug traffickers. But Noah''s actions trigger an ultimatum from "Menno mob" leader Eli Voss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93yWBeueuEpIxDUYldlMjgUn90I.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69329'),
  ('700359963099149429', 'Pure', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kirstie Swain', 'Kirstie Swain', 'Charly Clive, Kiran Sonia Sawar, Niamh Algar, Joe Cole, Anthony Welsh', 'TV-MA', 'Marnie is not OK. She''s had x-rated thoughts for the last 3672 days and she doesn''t know why or what they mean. When she jumps on a coach to London, she doesn''t know a soul, not even herself, but in the city she will build a new life.', 'Marnie is not OK. She''s had x-rated thoughts for the last 3672 days and she doesn''t know why or what they mean. When she jumps on a coach to London, she doesn''t know a soul, not even herself, but in the city she will build a new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shA4f0fwkhoUwJkCR4QFxBPiC3M.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86401'),
  ('380834525567293153', 'Pure Genius', 2016, 'Drama', 'Jason Katims, Sarah Watson', null, 'Dermot Mulroney, Augustus Prew, Odette Annable, Reshma Shetty, Aaron Jennings, Ward Horton, Brenda Song', 'TV-14', 'A young Silicon Valley tech-titan enlists a veteran surgeon with a controversial past in starting a hospital with a cutting-edge, new school approach to medicine.', 'A young Silicon Valley tech-titan enlists a veteran surgeon with a controversial past in starting a hospital with a cutting-edge, new school approach to medicine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iMHokrKVOI7KDCQhXe6NyPkuPw8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66545'),
  ('508804290316639691', 'Pure Love Gang of Shonan', 1994, 'Animation', null, null, 'Issei Futamata, Hideyuki Hori, Hiromi Tsuru, Masako Katsuki, Junko Asami, Yumi Touma, Ikuya Sawaki', null, 'Follows the adventures of Eikichi Onizuka and Ryuji Danma together known as Oni-Baku, Shonan''s strongest fighting duo as they try to lose their virginities, while trying to survive through high-school. The series is considered the prequel to GTO showing Onizuka as a teenager before he became the world''s greatest teacher', 'Follows the adventures of Eikichi Onizuka and Ryuji Danma together known as Oni-Baku, Shonan''s strongest fighting duo as they try to lose their virginities, while trying to survive through high-school. The series is considered the prequel to GTO showing Onizuka as a teenager before he became the world''s greatest teacher', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oMfKwbeL5Qm1r0gqWEo3F0qbp8s.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45070'),
  ('742731052899647849', 'Pursuit of Jade', 2026, 'Drama', 'Tuan Zi Lai Xi', null, 'Tian Xiwei, Zhang Linghe, Kong Xue''er, Deng Kai', null, 'This drama follows Fan Changyu, a butcher’s daughter, and Xie Zheng, a fallen noble seeking revenge. Their fake marriage turns into true love, but war tears them apart. Determined, Fan Changyu wields her butcher’s knife on the battlefield, searching for justice and her husband. Meanwhile, Xie Zheng reclaims his title, fighting to protect his country and love. Reunited in battle, they stand together, defying fate, uncovering the truth, and returning home without forgetting their vows.', 'This drama follows Fan Changyu, a butcher’s daughter, and Xie Zheng, a fallen noble seeking revenge. Their fake marriage turns into true love, but war tears them apart. Determined, Fan Changyu wields her butcher’s knife on the battlefield, searching for justice and her husband. Meanwhile, Xie Zheng reclaims his title, fighting to protect his country and love. Reunited in battle, they stand together, defying fate, uncovering the truth, and returning home without forgetting their vows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQHum52XMS9Sw51x94vMLyRuTPL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:279388'),
  ('840195145393139754', 'Pushing Daisies', 2007, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Crime', 'Bryan Fuller', null, 'Lee Pace, Anna Friel, Chi McBride, Kristin Chenoweth, Swoosie Kurtz, Ellen Greene, Field Cate, Jim Dale', 'TV-PG', 'A pie-maker, with the power to bring dead people back to life, solves murder mysteries with his alive-again childhood sweetheart, a cynical private investigator, and a lovesick waitress.', 'A pie-maker, with the power to bring dead people back to life, solves murder mysteries with his alive-again childhood sweetheart, a cynical private investigator, and a lovesick waitress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSRO8cGvve0pggPK9gHGItfl4j5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:5639'),
  ('928283626189376355', 'Pushpa Impossible', 2022, 'Family, Drama, Comedy', 'JD Majethia', null, 'Karuna Pandey, Naveen Pandit, Garima Parihar, Bhakti Rathod, Sarita Joshi, Mansi Jain, Jayesh Barbhaya, Dhara Jani', null, 'Pushpa Impossible is the story about a feisty middle-aged woman having studied until grade 9 in a Gujarati medium school and going back to school at the age of 44! She is boisterous, uncouth, impulsive, hardworking and an endearingly loveable mother of three children. She is Pushpa Patel hailing from a small town Patan in Gujarat and now residing at Bapodra Chawl in Mumbai. The show is a peek into her day-to-day struggles, her small victories, her Juggad, her shortcomings, and her constant pursuit of living a good life while struggling as a full-time mother and part-time businesswoman. The show is an autobiography of a mother, who decides to go back to school and change her life by impacting many lives!', 'Pushpa Impossible is the story about a feisty middle-aged woman having studied until grade 9 in a Gujarati medium school and going back to school at the age of 44! She is boisterous, uncouth, impulsive, hardworking and an endearingly loveable mother of three children. She is Pushpa Patel hailing from a small town Patan in Gujarat and now residing at Bapodra Chawl in Mumbai. The show is a peek into her day-to-day struggles, her small victories, her Juggad, her shortcomings, and her constant pursuit of living a good life while struggling as a full-time mother and part-time businesswoman. The show is an autobiography of a mother, who decides to go back to school and change her life by impacting many lives!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A0ZMTiipcHQONUgNUdkefD93Sc4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203769'),
  ('356482932802675390', 'Put Your Head on My Shoulder', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Zhao Qian Qian', 'Zhao Qian Qian, Dai Qi, Wu Xueying', 'Xing Fei, Lin Yi, Tang Xiaotian, Zheng Yingchen, Jacky Zhou, Zhou Zixin, Zhang Haolun, Jie Bing', 'TV-Y7', 'As Si Tu Mo''s graduation is nearing, she is confused about her future plans. Her ordinary days are suddenly shaken up when the genius Physics student Gu Wei Yi appears in her life. The two accidentally end up living together and chaos begins.', 'As Si Tu Mo''s graduation is nearing, she is confused about her future plans. Her ordinary days are suddenly shaken up when the genius Physics student Gu Wei Yi appears in her life. The two accidentally end up living together and chaos begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zVYvodC12ZHGVPHX8LJjZHDERmK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88548'),
  ('842260135639298049', 'Putous', 2010, 'Comedy, Reality', null, null, 'Niina Lahtinen, Eino Heiskanen, Linda Wiklund, Joonas Kääriäinen, Ushma Karnani, Juuso Kallio, Nicklas Pohjola', null, 'Finnish sketch comedy television show.', 'Finnish sketch comedy television show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTasblSN5pSkDoKUcgGyTXnb7p3.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:40367'),
  ('61717138679337562', 'Puzzle & Dragons', 2018, 'Kids, Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Asuna Tomari, Tetsuya Kakihara, Honoka Inoue, Yusuke Kobayashi, Chie Koujiro, Minami Takayama', null, 'The story is set in modern day Japan following the growth of the protagonist Taiga Akashi, an elementary school kid who wants to be a professional gamer someday.', 'The story is set in modern day Japan following the growth of the protagonist Taiga Akashi, an elementary school kid who wants to be a professional gamer someday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oW9rE2Zo38eTBcCcnDl5tZijYHq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80559'),
  ('749540450559977259', 'Puzzle & Dragons X', 2016, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Takuto Yoshinaga, Tetsuya Kakihara, Tomoko Kaneda, Sora Amamiya, Yuka Terasaki, Anri Katsu, Nanami Yamashita, Miyuki Sawashiro', null, 'The story takes place in a fantasy world consisting of humans, Dragonoids and Monsters. There is a relative harmony between the three races. There are also Drops, spherical objects that come out of the planet, which can power up the Monsters. Humans and Dragonoids can take on the role of Dragon Callers if they have the capability to see the Drops, wherein, they form bonds with monsters. Currently, the planet is facing Drop Impacts, occurrences where a large amount of Drops are suddenly generated in a single area (and can also spread), which affects the lands and makes the Monsters berserk. In fact, one of the main duties of Dragon Callers is to settle the Drop Impacts by stabilizing the Drop distribution.', 'The story takes place in a fantasy world consisting of humans, Dragonoids and Monsters. There is a relative harmony between the three races. There are also Drops, spherical objects that come out of the planet, which can power up the Monsters. Humans and Dragonoids can take on the role of Dragon Callers if they have the capability to see the Drops, wherein, they form bonds with monsters. Currently, the planet is facing Drop Impacts, occurrences where a large amount of Drops are suddenly generated in a single area (and can also spread), which affects the lands and makes the Monsters berserk. In fact, one of the main duties of Dragon Callers is to settle the Drop Impacts by stabilizing the Drop distribution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2m6FIy66rhBZkNrewwKclOR5AoQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80573'),
  ('660524518919280949', 'Pyaar Ka Pehla Adhyaya - Shiv Shakti', 2023, 'Drama, Soap', 'Prateek Sharma', null, 'Arjun Bijlani, Nikki Sharma', null, 'Shiv has a rewarding career as a doctor, but his personal life is in tatters. Shakti, an orphan, is a nurturer by nature. Will Shakti heal a broken Shiv?', 'Shiv has a rewarding career as a doctor, but his personal life is in tatters. Shakti, an orphan, is a nurturer by nature. Will Shakti heal a broken Shiv?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHK9bCDefHq43cHvMVUM7SLumYF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:229932'),
  ('245202428270562025', 'Pyar Ka Pehla Naam: Radha Mohan', 2022, 'Drama', 'Allee Khan', null, 'Neeharika Roy, Shabir Ahluwalia, Sambhabana Mohanty, Keerti Nagpure, Swati Shah, Reeza Choudhary', null, 'In modern-day Vrindavan, Mohan, a charming flute player, loses his spark post a tragedy. Radha, who admires him since her childhood days, decides to remind him of his true love, Lord Krishna.', 'In modern-day Vrindavan, Mohan, a charming flute player, loses his spark post a tragedy. Radha, who admires him since her childhood days, decides to remind him of his true love, Lord Krishna.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cGUF4aT3GCmCy3f84KKIpWS3kty.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:216289'),
  ('885113891801213649', 'Pyramid Game', 2024, 'Drama', null, 'Choi Soo-i', 'Bona, Jang Da-a, Ryu Da-in, Kang Na-eon, Jeong Ha-dam, Ha Yul-Ri, Hwang Hyun-jung, Shin Seul-ki', null, 'Every last Thursday of the month at an all-girls high school, the students of Class 2–5 cast their votes in a popularity poll. The results classify them into Grades A, B, C, D, and F. If they fall into Grade F, they become legitimate victims of school violence.', 'Every last Thursday of the month at an all-girls high school, the students of Class 2–5 cast their votes in a popularity poll. The results classify them into Grades A, B, C, D, and F. If they fall into Grade F, they become legitimate victims of school violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pBUERwWNCuO36CPxiVFsoQCPu7W.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:227192'),
  ('894631387271317300', 'Q-Force', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Gabe Liedman', null, 'Sean Hayes, Gary Cole, David Harbour, Patti Harrison, Laurie Metcalf, Matt Rogers, Wanda Sykes, Gabe Liedman', 'TV-MA', 'A gay superspy and his scrappy LGBTQ squad fight to prove themselves to the agency that underestimated them. Today, West Hollywood… tomorrow, the world!', 'A gay superspy and his scrappy LGBTQ squad fight to prove themselves to the agency that underestimated them. Today, West Hollywood… tomorrow, the world!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30m8oSz46yESF57ihmWMIwneG7d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128036'),
  ('1033651304325347579', 'Q: Into the Storm', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Cullen Hoback, Ron Watkins, Fredrick Brennan, Craig James', 'TV-MA', 'A three-year investigation chronicles the evolution of “Q” in real time, with access to key players, along with an examination of how the anonymous character uses conspiracy theories and information warfare to influence politics.', 'A three-year investigation chronicles the evolution of “Q” in real time, with access to key players, along with an examination of how the anonymous character uses conspiracy theories and information warfare to influence politics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/928q6AQq2xuxXdtHSlzboK8IjLc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:119761'),
  ('507547531587199073', 'Q&A', 2008, 'News, Talk', null, null, 'Hamish Macdonald', null, 'Hosted by Hamish Macdonald, Q&A puts punters, pollies and pundits together in the studio to thrash out the hot issues of the week. It''s about democracy in action - the audience gets to ask the questions.', 'Hosted by Hamish Macdonald, Q&A puts punters, pollies and pundits together in the studio to thrash out the hot issues of the week. It''s about democracy in action - the audience gets to ask the questions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fkO0LWXU6R21J3GUIbzCZclZObp.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:7562'),
  ('489184108879750246', 'Q10', 2010, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, 'Tsutomu Izumi, Tokiko Mega', 'Takeru Satoh, Atsuko Maeda, Misako Renbutsu, Kento Kaku, Tokio Emoto, Yoshihiko Hosoda, Mayuko Fukuda, Sosuke Ikematsu', null, 'High school senior Heita Fukai doesn''t know what to do with his life. Having been seriously ill until recently, he never had the opportunity to think about his future. He leads a mundane existence among his classmates, all of whom are struggling with their own issues. There''s the popular guy with secret hang-ups, the boy who can''t afford the tuition, the girl with bulimia and the pathologically shy kid. The teachers don''t fare much better. The high school is a microcosm of our troubled modern society. One day Fukai stumbles across a mysterious and attractive new girl in school, Q10, whom he soon finds out is actually a robot. Assigned by the principal to be her mentor and told to keep her true identity a secret, Fukai tries to teach Q10 about human feelings. In the process, he becomes aware of his own complex, emotional makeup. Fukai realizes that he is learning about life from an android, and that he may be falling in love with her.', 'High school senior Heita Fukai doesn''t know what to do with his life. Having been seriously ill until recently, he never had the opportunity to think about his future. He leads a mundane existence among his classmates, all of whom are struggling with their own issues. There''s the popular guy with secret hang-ups, the boy who can''t afford the tuition, the girl with bulimia and the pathologically shy kid. The teachers don''t fare much better. The high school is a microcosm of our troubled modern society. One day Fukai stumbles across a mysterious and attractive new girl in school, Q10, whom he soon finds out is actually a robot. Assigned by the principal to be her mentor and told to keep her true identity a secret, Fukai tries to teach Q10 about human feelings. In the process, he becomes aware of his own complex, emotional makeup. Fukai realizes that he is learning about life from an android, and that he may be falling in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nOaZ51u8qX6UKQESUvBma00dPHd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71404'),
  ('1084675038287496299', 'QI', 2003, 'Comedy, Talk', 'John Lloyd', null, 'Sandi Toksvig, Alan Davies', null, 'Comedy quiz show full of quirky facts, in which contestants are rewarded more if their answers are ''quite interesting''.', 'Comedy quiz show full of quirky facts, in which contestants are rewarded more if their answers are ''quite interesting''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9zWVsauqP7GM9E1N9WDYVf9CWe3.jpg', 23, 'tmdb:tv:1554'),
  ('26826488378655415', 'Qin Dynasty Epic', 2020, 'Drama', null, null, 'Zhang Luyi, Duan Yihong, Li Naiwen, Zhu Zhu, Xin Baiqing, Vivian Wu, You Yongzhi, Li Hongtao', null, 'During the late stages of the Warring States era of the Qin state, Ying Zheng, Lu Bu Wei, Li Si, Wang Jian and many formidable politicians work together to unite the six states under one rule.', 'During the late stages of the Warring States era of the Qin state, Ying Zheng, Lu Bu Wei, Li Si, Wang Jian and many formidable politicians work together to unite the six states under one rule.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5P0iwKxPHeAPp2sJRa5ThRdxQWh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114043');
