  ('781664909540766792', 'Quack Pack', 1996, 'Animation, Kids, Family, Comedy', 'Rob Humphrey, Jim Peterson', null, 'Tony Anselmo, Jeannie Elias, E. G. Daily, Pamela Adlon, Kath Soucie', 'TV-Y7', 'This cartoon follows on from the 1980’s cartoon “Ducktales”, continuing the adventures of Huey, Dewey and Louie. Now 12 year olds and living with their uncle Donald Duck, the three spend their time playing practical jokes on their hapless uncle and otherwise getting into trouble.', 'This cartoon follows on from the 1980’s cartoon “Ducktales”, continuing the adventures of Huey, Dewey and Louie. Now 12 year olds and living with their uncle Donald Duck, the three spend their time playing practical jokes on their hapless uncle and otherwise getting into trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d6VewnlRManLlOzV06jPUb08Hgf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1863'),
  ('49397428977032004', 'Quacks', 2017, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Rory Kinnear, Tom Basden, Lydia Leonard, Mathew Baynton, Rupert Everett, Geoffrey McGivern, Andy Linden, Ed Gaughan', null, 'A raucous comedy set in Victorian London about four medical pioneers fighting to make a mark on the world.', 'A raucous comedy set in Victorian London about four medical pioneers fighting to make a mark on the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lwvaxIjapCE6f4TaUjums0tIr3P.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73333'),
  ('836803641528509983', 'Qualidea Code', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', null, 'Wataru Watari, Sou Sagara', 'Soma Saito, Yuma Uchida, Hiroaki Hirata, Sora Amamiya, Yui Ishikawa, Mamiko Noto, Ayaka Fukuhara, Chika Anzai', null, 'The story takes place in a world where people continue their war against the "unknown"—the enemy of humanity. Children who have been evacuated to a cold sleep facility during the invasion by the "unknown" several decades ago wake up from their slumber and learn that their bodies developed some supernatural forces. In order to protect the country from the "unknown" emerging from the Tokyo bay gate, the boys and girls wage battles in the defense the cities of Tokyo, Kanagawa, and Chiba.', 'The story takes place in a world where people continue their war against the "unknown"—the enemy of humanity. Children who have been evacuated to a cold sleep facility during the invasion by the "unknown" several decades ago wake up from their slumber and learn that their bodies developed some supernatural forces. In order to protect the country from the "unknown" emerging from the Tokyo bay gate, the boys and girls wage battles in the defense the cities of Tokyo, Kanagawa, and Chiba.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssMDIsGgo5AyDtrYCTsWURqQVeY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67359'),
  ('482940903111294502', 'Quality Assurance in Another World', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Kaito Ishikawa, Hinaki Yano, Taiki Yamashita', 'TV-14', 'When a dragon attacks a peaceful village, it’s not the beast that perplexes resident Nikola, but the man who comes to their aid. Haga, member of a secret royal team of investigators, intrigues her with his eccentric ways. It may be due to the fact he’s a real-life QA debugger and this world is a VR game! With Haga by her side, Nikola’s inspired to venture out and learn her world’s true nature.', 'When a dragon attacks a peaceful village, it’s not the beast that perplexes resident Nikola, but the man who comes to their aid. Haga, member of a secret royal team of investigators, intrigues her with his eccentric ways. It may be due to the fact he’s a real-life QA debugger and this world is a VR game! With Haga by her side, Nikola’s inspired to venture out and learn her world’s true nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/toNVPhr8BpCbJ4LUGdiOGJpcy80.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222925'),
  ('589595423293379120', 'Quantico', 2015, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Joshua Safran', null, 'Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Jake McLaughlin, Johanna Braddy, Russell Tovey, Blair Underwood, Marlee Matlin, Alan Powell', 'TV-14', 'A diverse group of recruits has arrived at the FBI Quantico Base for training. They are the best, the brightest and the most vetted, so it seems impossible that one of them is suspected of masterminding the biggest attack on New York City since 9/11.', 'A diverse group of recruits has arrived at the FBI Quantico Base for training. They are the best, the brightest and the most vetted, so it seems impossible that one of them is suspected of masterminding the biggest attack on New York City since 9/11.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ofY2mALEiE0QDyRlVOV3sDNMYC.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:62816'),
  ('751922083151492086', 'Quantum Break', 2016, 'Crime, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ben Ketai', 'Terri Hughes, Josh Corbin, Ron Milbauer', 'Aidan Gillen, Lance Reddick, Patrick Heusinger, Marshall Allman, Courtney Hope, Mimi Michaels, Brooke Nevin, Jacqueline Pinol', null, 'Follows the exploits of Paul Serene and Martin Hatch of Monarch Solutions as well as three Monarch employees (Liam Burke, Charlie Wincott and Fiona Miller) as they fight to prevent or survive the approaching End of Time.', 'Follows the exploits of Paul Serene and Martin Hatch of Monarch Solutions as well as three Monarch employees (Liam Burke, Charlie Wincott and Fiona Miller) as they fight to prevent or survive the approaching End of Time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yikLNJxKny8oOHw17tgo5dgGAJ4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66998'),
  ('539008039900162236', 'Quantum Leap', 1989, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Donald P. Bellisario', null, 'Scott Bakula, Dean Stockwell', 'TV-PG', 'Theorizing that one could time travel within his own lifetime, Dr. Sam Beckett stepped into the Quantum Leap accelerator and vanished... He woke to find himself trapped in the past, facing mirror images that were not his own and driven by an unknown force to change history for the better. His only guide on this journey is Al, an observer from his own time, who appears in the form of a hologram that only Sam can see and hear. And so Dr. Beckett finds himself leaping from life to life, striving to put right what once went wrong and hoping each time that his next leap will be the leap home.', 'Theorizing that one could time travel within his own lifetime, Dr. Sam Beckett stepped into the Quantum Leap accelerator and vanished... He woke to find himself trapped in the past, facing mirror images that were not his own and driven by an unknown force to change history for the better. His only guide on this journey is Al, an observer from his own time, who appears in the form of a hologram that only Sam can see and hear. And so Dr. Beckett finds himself leaping from life to life, striving to put right what once went wrong and hoping each time that his next leap will be the leap home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujIGP3e3V6kDQHRhjNYtUE3fHJi.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:4018'),
  ('631019066216891352', 'Quantum Leap', 2022, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Mystery', 'Donald P. Bellisario', null, 'Raymond Lee, Caitlin Bassett, Mason Alexander Park, Nanrisa Lee, Ernie Hudson', 'TV-PG', 'It''s been nearly 30 years since Dr. Sam Beckett stepped into the Quantum Leap accelerator and vanished. Now, a new team, led by physicist Ben Song, has been assembled to restart the project in hope of understanding the mysteries behind the machine and the man who created it. Everything changes, however, when Ben makes an unauthorized leap into the past, leaving the team behind to solve the mystery of why he did it.', 'It''s been nearly 30 years since Dr. Sam Beckett stepped into the Quantum Leap accelerator and vanished. Now, a new team, led by physicist Ben Song, has been assembled to restart the project in hope of understanding the mysteries behind the machine and the man who created it. Everything changes, however, when Ben makes an unauthorized leap into the past, leaving the team behind to solve the mystery of why he did it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wAoei8KMQ5SXpmABw43hbfQKS8q.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:202102'),
  ('277523161174776412', 'Quark', 1977, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Buck Henry', null, 'Richard Benjamin, Tim Thomerson, Conrad Janis, Richard Kelton, Patricia Barnstable, Cyb Barnstable, Alan Caillou, Bobby Porter', 'TV-PG', 'Quark is an American science fiction situation comedy starring Richard Benjamin broadcast on NBC. The pilot first aired on May 7, 1977, and the series followed as a mid-season replacement in February 1978. The series was cancelled in April 1978. Quark was created by Buck Henry, co-creator of the spy spoof Get Smart. The show was set on a United Galaxy Sanitation Patrol Cruiser, an interstellar garbage scow operating out of United Galaxies Space Station Perma One in the year 2226. Adam Quark, the main character, works to clean up trash in space by collecting "space baggies" with his trusted and highly unusual crew. In its short run, Quark satirized such science fiction as Star Wars, 2001: A Space Odyssey and Flash Gordon. Three of the episodes were direct satires of Star Trek episodes. The series won one Emmy Award nomination, for costume designer Grady Hunt''s work in the episode "All the Emperor''s Quasi-Norms, Part 2". The complete series was released on DVD on October 14, 2008.', 'Quark is an American science fiction situation comedy starring Richard Benjamin broadcast on NBC. The pilot first aired on May 7, 1977, and the series followed as a mid-season replacement in February 1978. The series was cancelled in April 1978. Quark was created by Buck Henry, co-creator of the spy spoof Get Smart. The show was set on a United Galaxy Sanitation Patrol Cruiser, an interstellar garbage scow operating out of United Galaxies Space Station Perma One in the year 2226. Adam Quark, the main character, works to clean up trash in space by collecting "space baggies" with his trusted and highly unusual crew. In its short run, Quark satirized such science fiction as Star Wars, 2001: A Space Odyssey and Flash Gordon. Three of the episodes were direct satires of Star Trek episodes. The series won one Emmy Award nomination, for costume designer Grady Hunt''s work in the episode "All the Emperor''s Quasi-Norms, Part 2". The complete series was released on DVD on October 14, 2008.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jzHndascxtvxE6FtAczjIymckS7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1521'),
  ('745891024275802809', 'Quarry', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Michael D. Fuller, Graham Gordy', null, 'Logan Marshall-Green, Jodi Balfour, Peter Mullan, Damon Herriman, Edoardo Ballerini, Nikki Amuka-Bird, Aoibhinn McGinnity, Mustafa Shakir', 'TV-MA', 'The story of Mac Conway, a Marine who returns home to Memphis from Vietnam in 1972 and finds himself shunned by those he loves and demonized by the public. As he struggles to cope with his experiences at war, Conway is drawn into a network of killing and corruption that spans the length of the Mississippi River.', 'The story of Mac Conway, a Marine who returns home to Memphis from Vietnam in 1972 and finds himself shunned by those he loves and demonized by the public. As he struggles to cope with his experiences at war, Conway is drawn into a network of killing and corruption that spans the length of the Mississippi River.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRv9QhsnNVwMKJ7Xqmmh4PXWSej.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66911'),
  ('47744801246727421', 'Quarterback', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Kirk Cousins, Joe Burrow, Jared Goff', 'TV-MA', 'Follow the bruised bodies, soul-crushing fumbles, agonizing losses, and pure joy of three NFL quarterbacks during one season.', 'Follow the bruised bodies, soul-crushing fumbles, agonizing losses, and pure joy of three NFL quarterbacks during one season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bKdElEIyuwrbdochxCXwlaUBFaR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:220998'),
  ('287408056360297337', 'Quartet', 2017, 'Drama', null, null, 'Takako Matsu, Hikari Mitsushima, Issey Takahashi, Ryuhei Matsuda, Riho Yoshioka, Takeshi Tomizawa, Akiko Yagi, Mummy-D', null, 'Maki Maki, Sebuki Suzume, Beppu Tsukasa and Iemori Yutaka happen to meet and form a quartet. They even begin to live together in Karuizawa during the winter, but there is a big hidden secret.', 'Maki Maki, Sebuki Suzume, Beppu Tsukasa and Iemori Yutaka happen to meet and form a quartet. They even begin to live together in Karuizawa during the winter, but there is a big hidden secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCuCYARnYLlXRbxaLpFzETLT3Zm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69857'),
  ('271720634559899054', 'Quatermass', 1979, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Nigel Kneale', 'Nigel Kneale', 'John Mills, Simon MacCorkindale, Paul Rosebury, Jane Bertish, Ralph Arliss, Margaret Tyzak, Brian Croucher', null, 'In the near future, a now-elderly Bernard Quatermass investigates the disappearance of his granddaughter and a mysterious cult.', 'In the near future, a now-elderly Bernard Quatermass investigates the disappearance of his granddaughter and a mysterious cult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUTfw6EgWfwctAULgLF9C5Q47eS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3537'),
  ('858342416634956972', 'Quatermass and the Pit', 1958, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Nigel Kneale', 'Nigel Kneale', 'André Morell, Cec Linder, John Stratton, Christine Finn, Anthony Bushell', null, 'A team of scientists search for the origin and purpose of a mysterious capsule found on a building site.', 'A team of scientists search for the origin and purpose of a mysterious capsule found on a building site.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtcmZEcsFiczV4mcmOQ2yYWMm06.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6143'),
  ('282452064713761647', 'Quatermass II', 1955, 'Drama', 'Nigel Kneale', 'Nigel Kneale', 'John Robinson, Monica Grey, Hugh Griffith', null, 'Professor Bernard Quatermass of the British Experimental Rocket Group is sought to examine strange meteorite showers. His investigations lead to his uncovering a conspiracy involving alien infiltration at the highest levels of the British Government. As even some of Quatermass''s closest colleagues fall victim to the alien influence, he is forced to use his own unsafe rocket prototype, which recently caused a nuclear disaster at an Australian testing range, to prevent the aliens from taking over mankind.', 'Professor Bernard Quatermass of the British Experimental Rocket Group is sought to examine strange meteorite showers. His investigations lead to his uncovering a conspiracy involving alien infiltration at the highest levels of the British Government. As even some of Quatermass''s closest colleagues fall victim to the alien influence, he is forced to use his own unsafe rocket prototype, which recently caused a nuclear disaster at an Australian testing range, to prevent the aliens from taking over mankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9dV59VWbfbkTPrkkrnRg5bnAO9c.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1565'),
  ('1144930493202474268', 'Quatro por Quatro', 1994, 'Soap, Comedy, Drama', 'Carlos Lombardi', 'Carlos Lombardi, Ronaldo Santos, Maurício Arruda', 'Leticia Spiller, Betty Lago, Elizabeth Savalla, Cristiana Oliveira, Humberto Martins, Marcos Paulo, Marcello Novaes, Tato Gabus Mendes', null, 'A traffic accident causes four women''s destinies to intertwine. In the series, the four enter a pact of revenge against the men who hit them and caused them to suffer. Auxiliadora struggled to help her husband Alcebíades prosper, but when he leaves her for a younger woman, is thrown out of the house. The shy Tatiana was engaged to Fortunato, who failed to show up at their wedding. The Babalu hurricane caught mechanic Raí in bed with another woman. Abigail, a preppy psychologist who is struggling in a failing marriage, decides superficially to continue it but revolts against her husband, Gustavo, who humiliates her in public at a congress. Gustavo has custody of Ângela, a girl who longs to know her true father, Bruno. Her mother died in the childbirth, traumatizing him.', 'A traffic accident causes four women''s destinies to intertwine. In the series, the four enter a pact of revenge against the men who hit them and caused them to suffer. Auxiliadora struggled to help her husband Alcebíades prosper, but when he leaves her for a younger woman, is thrown out of the house. The shy Tatiana was engaged to Fortunato, who failed to show up at their wedding. The Babalu hurricane caught mechanic Raí in bed with another woman. Abigail, a preppy psychologist who is struggling in a failing marriage, decides superficially to continue it but revolts against her husband, Gustavo, who humiliates her in public at a congress. Gustavo has custody of Ângela, a girl who longs to know her true father, Bruno. Her mother died in the childbirth, traumatizing him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eF6rrVrGAfHSLgzAbiPqv7IzGPe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:20885'),
  ('402831846547153289', 'Qué Bonito Amor', 2012, 'Drama', 'Ricardo Fiallega', null, 'Jorge Salinas, Danna García, Pablo Montero, Juan Ferrara, Angélica María, Roberto Palazuelos, Víctor Noriega, Malillany Marín', 'TV-14', 'Qué bonito amor is a 2012 Mexican telenovela produced by Salvador Mejía Alexandre for Televisa. It is based on La Hija del Mariachi, produced by Colombian''s RCN Television and written by Mónica Agudelo in 2006-2007. Jorge Salinas and Danna García star as the protagonists, while Malillany Marin, Roberto Palazuelos, Marcelo Buquet, Salvador Pineda and Pablo Montero star as the antagonists.', 'Qué bonito amor is a 2012 Mexican telenovela produced by Salvador Mejía Alexandre for Televisa. It is based on La Hija del Mariachi, produced by Colombian''s RCN Television and written by Mónica Agudelo in 2006-2007. Jorge Salinas and Danna García star as the protagonists, while Malillany Marin, Roberto Palazuelos, Marcelo Buquet, Salvador Pineda and Pablo Montero star as the antagonists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZkseBaM3VmD1UVQrabW4D1ZKSt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46144'),
