  ('707725987049339612', 'Rangbaaz', 2018, 'Crime, Action & Adventure, Reality', 'Bhav Dhulia', 'Siddharth Mishra', 'Vineet Kumar Singh, Aakanksha Singh, Vijay Maurya, Rajesh Tailang, Prashant Narayanan, Geetanjali Kulkarni, Sudhanva Deshpande, Soham Majumdar', null, 'Shiv Prakash Shukla a 25 year age boy from Gorakhpur becomes the deadliest gangster of Uttar Pradesh in 1990s. He works for powerful politicians and involves in organised crimes. The state government felt danger from him and form STF to get him killed in a police encounter by tracking his mobile phone location.', 'Shiv Prakash Shukla a 25 year age boy from Gorakhpur becomes the deadliest gangster of Uttar Pradesh in 1990s. He works for powerful politicians and involves in organised crimes. The state government felt danger from him and form STF to get him killed in a police encounter by tracking his mobile phone location.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pzs6o3OIly2SAssgP3GRCFpAKsD.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:85201'),
  ('28022943776444737', 'Ranking of Kings', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Minami Hinata, Ayumu Murase, Yuki Kaji, Takuya Eguchi, Yoji Ueda, Daiki Yamashita', 'TV-14', 'In a world where kings are ranked, a kindly little hearing-impaired prince sets off on a journey to become a powerful king, despite all odds.', 'In a world where kings are ranked, a kindly little hearing-impaired prince sets off on a journey to become a powerful king, despite all odds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujMjMUi6z02uOfQEerEDC4rH6aG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112613'),
