  ('1035564091413338547', 'Re-Kan!', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Hinako Seta', null, 'Ibuki Kido, Mao Ichimichi, Miku Ito, Erii Yamazaki, Riho Iida, Aya Uchida, Yoshihisa Kawahara, Kujira', null, 'Amami Hibiki is a girl who can see ghosts and other supernatural phenomena in her surroundings. The stories follow her daily life with both her friends and the otherworldly.', 'Amami Hibiki is a girl who can see ghosts and other supernatural phenomena in her surroundings. The stories follow her daily life with both her friends and the otherworldly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNYaH3aDGg0jjTf1nzymQJfV6x.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76117'),
  ('1044375429289843357', 'RE-MAIN', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Yuto Uemura, Koutaro Nishiyama, Subaru Kimura, Lynn, Soma Saito, Makoto Furukawa, Tasuku Hatanaka, Daisuke Hirose', 'TV-14', 'Minato is a boy who stopped playing water polo due to a certain incident in the winter of his third middle school year. He picks the sport back up again with a new team when he starts in high school, but the fledgling team runs into many problems.', 'Minato is a boy who stopped playing water polo due to a certain incident in the winter of his third middle school year. He picks the sport back up again with a new team when he starts in high school, but the fledgling team runs into many problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nnsLtt5RndrFzNBgVRQjRdXLeeq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:120013'),
  ('670676155969058760', 'Re: Cutie Honey', 2004, 'Comedy, Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yui Horie, Junko Noda, Hideo Ishikawa, Kazue Ikura, Mami Kingetsu, Yumi Touma, Hiromi Konno, Motomu Kiyokawa', null, 'A mysterious organization known as Panther Claw make their presence known by terrorizing Tokyo and giving the cops a run for their money. Police are further baffled by the appearance of a lone cosplaying vigilante who thwarts all of Panther Claw''s evil schemes before disappearing. That cosplayer is Honey Kisaragi, the result of the late Professor Kisaragi''s prize experiment. A master of disguise, Honey can instantly alter her physical appearance and outfits. But with a push of the heart-shaped button on her choker, she transforms herself into Cutie Honey, the scantily clad, sword-wielding warrior of love and justice.', 'A mysterious organization known as Panther Claw make their presence known by terrorizing Tokyo and giving the cops a run for their money. Police are further baffled by the appearance of a lone cosplaying vigilante who thwarts all of Panther Claw''s evil schemes before disappearing. That cosplayer is Honey Kisaragi, the result of the late Professor Kisaragi''s prize experiment. A master of disguise, Honey can instantly alter her physical appearance and outfits. But with a push of the heart-shaped button on her choker, she transforms herself into Cutie Honey, the scantily clad, sword-wielding warrior of love and justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gn3oEmUnYcPHqjfdurJXcVQ4h80.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95736'),
  ('350732327796176418', 'RE: European Stories', 2017, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'NR', 'Discover Europe in all its diversity of viewpoints', 'Discover Europe in all its diversity of viewpoints', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/19ChTJxvw9jZpMnWKsuXc83eI5C.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:98271'),
  ('199169671391059102', 'Re:Creators', 2017, 'Animation, Mystery, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Daiki Yamashita, Mikako Komatsu, Inori Minase, Aki Toyosaki, Yoko Hikasa, Rie Murakawa, Kenichi Suzumura, Sora Amamiya', 'TV-14', 'Humans have created many stories. Joy, sadness, anger, deep emotion. Stories shake our emotions, and fascinate us. However, these are only the thoughts of bystanders. But what if the characters in the story have "intentions"? To them, are we god-like existences for bringing their story into the world? Our world is changed. Mete out punishment upon the realm of the gods. In Re:CREATORS, everyone becomes a Creator.', 'Humans have created many stories. Joy, sadness, anger, deep emotion. Stories shake our emotions, and fascinate us. However, these are only the thoughts of bystanders. But what if the characters in the story have "intentions"? To them, are we god-like existences for bringing their story into the world? Our world is changed. Mete out punishment upon the realm of the gods. In Re:CREATORS, everyone becomes a Creator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVOYool4Um1ZqpbYIBoBgR5qoEO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70592'),
  ('20238023687522707', 'Re:Mind', 2017, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Yûsuke Koroyasu, Yusuke Ishida, Akira Uchikata', null, 'Mirei Sasaki, Sarina Ushio, Mei Higashimura, Ayaka Takamoto, Shiho Kato, Yuka Kageyama, Mao Iguchi, Memi Kakizaki', 'TV-MA', 'Eleven high school classmates awaken, restrained to a large dining room. While fearing for their lives, they question a motive to this bizarre act.', 'Eleven high school classmates awaken, restrained to a large dining room. While fearing for their lives, they question a motive to this bizarre act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xvLY7cusdwRMYSDdgL0HZrHBEGT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77156'),
  ('1047244435955655015', 'Re:Monster', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Takuya Sato, Kenta Hosoda, Ai Kakuma, Kana Ueda, Aya Yamane, Nichika Omori, Mai Kanno, Hibiku Yamamura', 'TV-14', 'After meeting an untimely death, Tomokui Kanata is reincarnated as a lowly goblin, but he''s worked up a monstrous appetite. Thanks to his new ability that allows him to grow stronger the more he feeds, his feeble status quickly changes, and he rises to become the goblin leader. With a mix of his past memories, new body, and strong stomach, he''s taking a bite out of this new fantastical world!', 'After meeting an untimely death, Tomokui Kanata is reincarnated as a lowly goblin, but he''s worked up a monstrous appetite. Thanks to his new ability that allows him to grow stronger the more he feeds, his feeble status quickly changes, and he rises to become the goblin leader. With a mix of his past memories, new body, and strong stomach, he''s taking a bite out of this new fantastical world!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AmFrA0jX0p9twH1IKfxcGWVz2X3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:235389'),
  ('856801000187931517', 'Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World-', 2016, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', null, null, 'Yusuke Kobayashi, Rie Takahashi, Yumi Uchiyama, Chinatsu Akasaki, Yuichi Nakamura, Inori Minase, Rie Murakawa, Takehito Koyasu', 'TV-14', 'Natsuki Subaru, an ordinary high school student, is on his way home from the convenience store when he finds himself transported to another world. As he''s lost and confused in a new world where he doesn''t even know left from right, the only person to reach out to him was a beautiful girl with silver hair. Determined to repay her somehow for saving him from his own despair, Subaru agrees to help the girl find something she''s looking for.', 'Natsuki Subaru, an ordinary high school student, is on his way home from the convenience store when he finds himself transported to another world. As he''s lost and confused in a new world where he doesn''t even know left from right, the only person to reach out to him was a beautiful girl with silver hair. Determined to repay her somehow for saving him from his own despair, Subaru agrees to help the girl find something she''s looking for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRwmcX36r1ZpR5Xq5mmFcpUDQ8J.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65942'),
  ('448685831485095113', 'Reacher', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Nick Santora', null, 'Alan Ritchson, Maria Sten, Sonya Cassidy, Johnny Berchtold, Roberto Montesinos, Olivier Richters, Brian Tee, Anthony Michael Hall', 'TV-MA', 'Jack Reacher, a veteran military police investigator, has just recently entered civilian life. Reacher is a drifter, carrying no phone and the barest of essentials as he travels the country and explores the nation he once served.', 'Jack Reacher, a veteran military police investigator, has just recently entered civilian life. Reacher is a drifter, carrying no phone and the barest of essentials as he travels the country and explores the nation he once served.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31GlRQMiDunO8cl3NxTz34U64rf.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:108978'),
  ('23074268878601325', 'Reaching Out', 2001, null, null, null, 'Gordon Lam Ka-Tung, Kenix Kwok Ho-Ying, Benny Chan Ho-Man, Michelle Ye Xuan, Nicola Cheung Sun-Yuet, Ha Yue, Michelle Yim, Woo Fung', null, 'Dai Fusheng (played by Lin Jiadong), Liu Ersuo (played by Chen Haomin) and Hui Ting (played by Zhang Shenyue) met in an orphanage. The helpless three regard each other as their own family members, and their relationship is very close. Dai Fusheng is old and willing to give, so he has always played the role of the brother among the three, while Liu Ersuo, who is idle and not doing business, depends entirely on Dai Fusheng''s shelter. In fact, Hui Ting has been silently admiring Dai Fusheng, but Hui Ting knows that Dai Fusheng only regards herself as her younger sister, and her feelings for herself are only family affection, and what he really likes is a woman named Yin Xueyi (played by Ye Xuan). Hui Ting decided to bury this feeling silently in her heart, and instead helped Dai Fusheng make plans to pursue Yin Xueyi, in order to fulfill the happiness of her favorite man.', 'Dai Fusheng (played by Lin Jiadong), Liu Ersuo (played by Chen Haomin) and Hui Ting (played by Zhang Shenyue) met in an orphanage. The helpless three regard each other as their own family members, and their relationship is very close. Dai Fusheng is old and willing to give, so he has always played the role of the brother among the three, while Liu Ersuo, who is idle and not doing business, depends entirely on Dai Fusheng''s shelter. In fact, Hui Ting has been silently admiring Dai Fusheng, but Hui Ting knows that Dai Fusheng only regards herself as her younger sister, and her feelings for herself are only family affection, and what he really likes is a woman named Yin Xueyi (played by Ye Xuan). Hui Ting decided to bury this feeling silently in her heart, and instead helped Dai Fusheng make plans to pursue Yin Xueyi, in order to fulfill the happiness of her favorite man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBDGSaVnIX6DpmGiZTGGYwr8xDi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108660'),
  ('163496099256731191', 'Read or Die the TV', 2003, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Hideyuki Kurata', null, 'Chiwa Saito, Hiromi Hirata, Shouko Kikuchi, Satsuki Yukino', null, 'Five years have passed since the occurrence of the incident known as the "Human Annihilation Mission." In Japan, a novelist is dealing with writer''s block after her friend has gone missing. In Hong Kong, three sisters, masters in the use of paper, run their own detective agency to solve cases that involve books. When these people are brought together, a bond greater than blood is formed - a bond that will be sorely tested by the evil powers intent on taking over the world. Join Anita, Maggie, Michelle, and Nenene as they travel the globe in order to save the world from the evil mastermind, Mr. Carpenter! Of course, that''s if they can find the time to put down the books they''re reading...', 'Five years have passed since the occurrence of the incident known as the "Human Annihilation Mission." In Japan, a novelist is dealing with writer''s block after her friend has gone missing. In Hong Kong, three sisters, masters in the use of paper, run their own detective agency to solve cases that involve books. When these people are brought together, a bond greater than blood is formed - a bond that will be sorely tested by the evil powers intent on taking over the world. Join Anita, Maggie, Michelle, and Nenene as they travel the globe in order to save the world from the evil mastermind, Mr. Carpenter! Of course, that''s if they can find the time to put down the books they''re reading...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d0oPRXZznnP3B9sovtlbaxU6veK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:27647'),
  ('504816687739337971', 'Reading Rainbow', 1983, 'Kids', null, null, 'LeVar Burton', 'TV-Y', 'Journey to exciting places and build a lasting connection with your favorite books. Each episode centers on a theme from a book, or other children''s literature, which is explored through a number of segments or stories.', 'Journey to exciting places and build a lasting connection with your favorite books. Each episode centers on a theme from a book, or other children''s literature, which is explored through a number of segments or stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ndlSMn2zCP6MNIp6OYexGAa1Yj1.jpg', 21, 'tmdb:tv:10048'),
  ('205845738492747282', 'Ready, Set, Love', 2024, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Pongtiwat Tangwancharoen, Kemisara Paladesh, Ladapa Thongkham, Trisanu Soranun, Chayapak Tunprayoon, Natthaweeranuch Thongmee, Panadda Wongphudee, Phuriphat Jiramethapon', null, 'In a world grappling with a dwindling male population, an unassuming woman becomes a contender in a government-sponsored dating competition.', 'In a world grappling with a dwindling male population, an unassuming woman becomes a contender in a government-sponsored dating competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQL1O2rBDbkXTFPyWSopCJs8l4X.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:243403'),
  ('591456507440574182', 'Ready, Steady, Cook', 1994, 'Reality', null, null, 'Ainsley Harriott', null, 'Talented chefs battle it out against the clock, creating delicious dishes in 20 minutes', 'Talented chefs battle it out against the clock, creating delicious dishes in 20 minutes', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NotbtMdZouIVywd5VcGezBEcNC.jpg', 21, 'tmdb:tv:256059'),
  ('952681799679457597', 'Real Actor', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, 'Yu Zheng, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Zhang Jingchu, Zhang Songwen, Zhao Lusi, Zheng Qiuhong, Lu Yuxiao, Wang Yuwen', null, '"Real Actor" combines the three concepts of studio, workplace and battlefield. By recording the actors'' workplace and the survival of the studio, the audience can see the real actor''s suffering, the actor''s difficulty, the actor''s specialty, and see the most realistic "acting school".', '"Real Actor" combines the three concepts of studio, workplace and battlefield. By recording the actors'' workplace and the survival of the studio, the audience can see the real actor''s suffering, the actor''s difficulty, the actor''s specialty, and see the most realistic "acting school".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qukFdPlSnojP4UrcQMnGCGXr8P0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:118615'),
  ('185170198465953986', 'Real Detective', 2016, 'Drama, Documentary, Crime', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'With narrative driven exclusively by the detectives themselves, each episode ventures deep into the mind of a homicide detective as they describe in vivid detail the one case forever ingrained in their memory.', 'With narrative driven exclusively by the detectives themselves, each episode ventures deep into the mind of a homicide detective as they describe in vivid detail the one case forever ingrained in their memory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4f7CCoRbrETYNvkShUFwoma3bEZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:65368'),
  ('163576928558139317', 'Real Drive', 2008, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Crime', null, null, 'Kanae Oki, Hiroki Takahashi, Katsuji Mori, Keiji Fujiwara, Hiromi Tsuru, Ai Nonaka, Ayako Kawasumi, Akeno Watanabe', 'TV-14', 'The story takes place in 2061, 50 years after humanity developed the "Net society" that depended on information networks despite their security issues. To improve security, a new network called Meta Real Network — or "Metal" for short — was developed. People''s personal memories are reduced to information and placed within "protected virtual stand-alone organic cyber enclaves" called bubble shells online. The result was a virtual "explosion" of creative freedom as people felt safe enough to explore instincts and desires on Metal that they would not otherwise explore in real life. This "friction" between the Metal''s alluring lack of restrictions and rules-bound reality led to trouble and incidents that investigators known as "cyber divers" must handle. Masamichi Haru is one such cyber diver.', 'The story takes place in 2061, 50 years after humanity developed the "Net society" that depended on information networks despite their security issues. To improve security, a new network called Meta Real Network — or "Metal" for short — was developed. People''s personal memories are reduced to information and placed within "protected virtual stand-alone organic cyber enclaves" called bubble shells online. The result was a virtual "explosion" of creative freedom as people felt safe enough to explore instincts and desires on Metal that they would not otherwise explore in real life. This "friction" between the Metal''s alluring lack of restrictions and rules-bound reality led to trouble and incidents that investigators known as "cyber divers" must handle. Masamichi Haru is one such cyber diver.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/33lPIG5divmPEIiCj8UmqbjQIsm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34773'),
  ('808715704674168006', 'Real Girl', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Teppei Uenishi, Yu Serizawa, Reina Ueda, Sayaka Kanda, Minami Tsuda, Shouta Aoi, Takuma Terashima', null, 'Tsutsui Hikari (a.k.a "Tsuttsun") is a high school student who is content with his virtual life of anime and video games. One day, he gets stuck cleaning the pool with Iroha, a real live girl who is stylish, sassy and known to be easy with boys ... and she aggressively approaches him! Tsuttsun, who has few friends and lives in his own world, finds himself smitten by the confident and wild Iroha ... and his whole world is turned upside down!! It''s the awkward and pure love story of a boy who experiences relationship for the first time.', 'Tsutsui Hikari (a.k.a "Tsuttsun") is a high school student who is content with his virtual life of anime and video games. One day, he gets stuck cleaning the pool with Iroha, a real live girl who is stylish, sassy and known to be easy with boys ... and she aggressively approaches him! Tsuttsun, who has few friends and lives in his own world, finds himself smitten by the confident and wild Iroha ... and his whole world is turned upside down!! It''s the awkward and pure love story of a boy who experiences relationship for the first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UmNynM1YXkYylyontGXPHncjOC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:77721'),
  ('1078588410797998892', 'Real Girls ...', 2011, 'Reality', null, null, 'Valerio Zeno', 'NR', 'In Real Girls in the Jungle, reality stars compete against each other by completing challenging tasks in a wild jungle. The reality series last aired over 10 years ago and was primarily known for the contestants'' heated arguments. Given the contestants in the new season, it''s likely to be just as spectacular.', 'In Real Girls in the Jungle, reality stars compete against each other by completing challenging tasks in a wild jungle. The reality series last aired over 10 years ago and was primarily known for the contestants'' heated arguments. Given the contestants in the new season, it''s likely to be just as spectacular.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1laKUjIHTkuLIuknSUKyt4qCVh7.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:38799'),
  ('351916074872959460', 'Real Humans', 2012, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Lars Lundström', null, 'Lisette Pagler, Pia Halvorsen, Johan Paulsen, Natalie Minnevik, Kåre Hedebrant, Aline Palmstierna, Sten Elfström, Alexander Stocks', 'NR', 'Set in a parallel universe, Real Humans imagines a world where robots have become so human that they''re barely distinguishable from real humans and follows the resulting emotional effects on two families as well as the trials of a group of robots who have attained free will and want their freedom from human ownership.', 'Set in a parallel universe, Real Humans imagines a world where robots have become so human that they''re barely distinguishable from real humans and follows the resulting emotional effects on two families as well as the trials of a group of robots who have attained free will and want their freedom from human ownership.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5T02n5d6aKRga9jlBaNrJTYS52p.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:43058'),
  ('624246864603582129', 'Real Husbands of Hollywood', 2013, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Duane Martin, Dondré Whitfield, Cynthia Kaye McWilliams, Nick Cannon, Kevin Hart, Nelly', 'TV-14', 'Comedian and actor, Kevin Hart teams up with BET Networks to bring viewers one of the funniest shows on television "Real Husbands of Hollywood". The semi-scripted series is the fakest reality show ever following these men of Hollywood along their surreal lives. Enjoy the ride as these guys take on all things, from the husband''s point of view. You may recognize some situations or characters from those other reality shows.', 'Comedian and actor, Kevin Hart teams up with BET Networks to bring viewers one of the funniest shows on television "Real Husbands of Hollywood". The semi-scripted series is the fakest reality show ever following these men of Hollywood along their surreal lives. Enjoy the ride as these guys take on all things, from the husband''s point of view. You may recognize some situations or characters from those other reality shows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ylRzw81gVNOujaDQvnDGOhXc5LZ.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:61879'),
  ('1081857848881677564', 'Real Madrid: How Could I Not Love You', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Carlo Ancelotti, Jude Bellingham, Vini Jr., Thibaut Courtois, Toni Kroos, Luka Modrić, Rodrygo Goes, Joselu', null, 'At Real Madrid, the demand to win every title each year consistently tests the club''s executives, coaching staff, and players. As the 2023-24 season approaches, the club is reinforcing its squad to meet this immense challenge. The goal is to cap off a decade of success that could solidify the team''s legendary status and carve out a new golden era in football history.', 'At Real Madrid, the demand to win every title each year consistently tests the club''s executives, coaching staff, and players. As the 2023-24 season approaches, the club is reinforcing its squad to meet this immense challenge. The goal is to cap off a decade of success that could solidify the team''s legendary status and carve out a new golden era in football history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1N772Xtr8O6oaXomqS4wvZZiGJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:283286'),
  ('762777777972910078', 'Real Madrid: Until the End', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Step onto the field and go behind the scenes with the iconic soccer team for a look at their astonishing 2021–2022 season. Fueled by their fervent fans, they defy the odds and silence the skeptics.', 'Step onto the field and go behind the scenes with the iconic soccer team for a look at their astonishing 2021–2022 season. Fueled by their fervent fans, they defy the odds and silence the skeptics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jxKrPVSn4PFdv08uWQPTxQzEXHA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:221490'),
  ('801182881799540128', 'Real Men', 2025, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Maurizio Lastrico, Matteo Martari, Francesco Montanari, Pietro Sermonti, Sarah Felberbaum, Laura Adriani, Alice Lupparelli, Corrado Fortuna', null, 'Four old friends, Massimo, Mattia, Luigi and Riccardo, juggle relationships, careers and dating in a modern world set on giving masculinity a hard time.', 'Four old friends, Massimo, Mattia, Luigi and Riccardo, juggle relationships, careers and dating in a modern world set on giving masculinity a hard time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nqmDX50dhW4UlWaS4jIU7dre05u.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:255650'),
  ('146398085789546629', 'Real Rob', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Rob Schneider', null, 'Rob Schneider, Patricia Schneider, Jamie Lissow, Max Amini', 'TV-14', 'Centers around comedian Rob Schneider''s real life while living in Hollywood.', 'Centers around comedian Rob Schneider''s real life while living in Hollywood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8iDw1f76Z1CUusIq0H9v847bso3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:64823'),
