  ('567062184315171192', 'Reality Check: Inside America''s Next Top Model', 2026, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, 'Tyra Banks, Jay Manuel, J. Alexander, Nigel Barker, Ken Mok, Shandi Sullivan, Giselle Samson, Shannon Stewart', 'TV-MA', 'What started as a glamorous launchpad for aspiring models became a pop-culture juggernaut defined by explosive drama, public meltdowns, and controversies that still fuel viral moments today.', 'What started as a glamorous launchpad for aspiring models became a pop-culture juggernaut defined by explosive drama, public meltdowns, and controversies that still fuel viral moments today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxlsvsgvEYlf2wrSV9qUipHRAuk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:312423'),
  ('1135076163963141647', 'Reality Queens – auf High Heels durch den Dschungel', 2024, 'Reality, Comedy', null, null, 'Twenty4tim, Kader Loth, Cecilia Asoro, Arielle Rippegather, Paulina Ljubas, Gina-Lisa Lohfink, Jenny Elvers, Tanja Tischewitsch', null, 'High heels on, glamor off: In the new reality series, 12 well-known reality contestants trek through the jungle of the greenest country in the world: Suriname. But they don''t know exactly where they are going until they leave.', 'High heels on, glamor off: In the new reality series, 12 well-known reality contestants trek through the jungle of the greenest country in the world: Suriname. But they don''t know exactly where they are going until they leave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vCN8ezsMO3NQ3TyDOwM2LeBANcO.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:256321'),
  ('914672789087020977', 'Reality Z', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Cláudio Torres, João Costa', 'João Costa', 'Ravel Andrade, Ana Hartmann, João Pedro Zappa, Carla Ribas, Emílio de Mello, Guilherme Weber, Luellem de Castro, Pierre Baitelli', null, 'A zombie apocalypse that imprisons participants and producers of a reality show called Olimpo, The House of the Gods. The studio becomes a shelter for those who seek salvation in Rio de Janeiro where chaos and hopelessness begin to rule.', 'A zombie apocalypse that imprisons participants and producers of a reality show called Olimpo, The House of the Gods. The studio becomes a shelter for those who seek salvation in Rio de Janeiro where chaos and hopelessness begin to rule.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hpqLI8lq8u1biqZgdQomERkIsSC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:104108'),
  ('728541749818371918', 'Reaper', 2007, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Tara Butters, Michele Fazekas', null, 'Bret Harrison, Tyler Labine, Rick Gonzalez, Ray Wise, Missy Peregrym, Andrew Airlie, Donavon Stinson', 'TV-14', '21 year-old slacker Sam Oliver learns that his parents sold his soul to the devil before he was born, and now Sam has to repay the debt by becoming the Devil''s bounty hunter, retrieving souls that have somehow escaped from Hell.', '21 year-old slacker Sam Oliver learns that his parents sold his soul to the devil before he was born, and now Sam has to repay the debt by becoming the Devil''s bounty hunter, retrieving souls that have somehow escaped from Hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sR0BOGjhMce5eRsSGh3CgGpAUL8.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:5107'),
  ('204199954841298584', 'Rear Mirror', 2014, null, null, null, 'Wayne Lai Yiu-Cheung, Louisa So Yuk-Wah, Tony Hung, Natalie Tong, Ram Chiang Chi-Kwong, Amy Fan, Elaine Yiu, Ali Lee', null, 'A single father who works as a mini bus driver that struggles to raise his young son with a severe food allergy problem alone, meets a female CEO of a huge corporation who seems to have it all on the outside but has struggles of her own due to her father''s illness and family members fighting with each other for the CEO position.', 'A single father who works as a mini bus driver that struggles to raise his young son with a severe food allergy problem alone, meets a female CEO of a huge corporation who seems to have it all on the outside but has struggles of her own due to her father''s illness and family members fighting with each other for the CEO position.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/axgmWWOKLHV5i5HN7BZ7sT1Vb7x.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106022'),
  ('1063518929544124362', 'Reasonable Doubt', 2022, 'Drama', 'Raamla Mohamed', null, 'Emayatzy Corinealdi, Tim Jo, McKinley Freeman, Angela Grovey, Thaddeus J. Mixson, Aderinsola Olabode, Shannon Kane, Joseph Sikora', 'TV-MA', 'In this legal drama, you’ll judge Jax Stewart for her questionable ethics and wild interpretations of the law… until you’re the one in trouble. Then you’ll see her for what she is: the most brilliant and fearless defense attorney in Los Angeles who bucks the justice system at every chance she gets.', 'In this legal drama, you’ll judge Jax Stewart for her questionable ethics and wild interpretations of the law… until you’re the one in trouble. Then you’ll see her for what she is: the most brilliant and fearless defense attorney in Los Angeles who bucks the justice system at every chance she gets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3I6GwIbRKlym6hFw1weEUdgTFFT.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:205272'),
  ('999433432551154513', 'Reba', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Allison M. Gibson', null, 'Reba McEntire, Christopher Rich, JoAnna Garcia Swisher, Steve Howey, Scarlett Pomers, Mitch Holleman, Melissa Peterman', 'TV-PG', 'After her dentist husband of 20 years leaves her for his dental hygienist, Reba Hart''s seemingly perfect world is turned upside down.​', 'After her dentist husband of 20 years leaves her for his dental hygienist, Reba Hart''s seemingly perfect world is turned upside down.​', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3pdrwxTNxKdwuc95vOotrbnvJVa.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:654'),
  ('1050372776327745806', 'Rebecca', 1997, 'Drama', null, null, 'Charles Dance, Emilia Fox, Diana Rigg, Faye Dunaway, Jonathan Cake, Tom Chadbon, Denis Lill, John Branwell', 'TV-PG', 'Based on the Gothic romance novel by Daphne Du Maurier, Rebecca is a classic tale of love and hate. Maxim De Winter marries a woman half his age only a year after his first wife, the beautiful and accomplished Rebecca, dies. She finds herself in an aristocratic social world her middle class upbringing did not prepare her for, and housekeeper Mrs Danvers despises her for taking her darling Rebecca''s place. But these are not the only problems to face...', 'Based on the Gothic romance novel by Daphne Du Maurier, Rebecca is a classic tale of love and hate. Maxim De Winter marries a woman half his age only a year after his first wife, the beautiful and accomplished Rebecca, dies. She finds herself in an aristocratic social world her middle class upbringing did not prepare her for, and housekeeper Mrs Danvers despises her for taking her darling Rebecca''s place. But these are not the only problems to face...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3XQPJRzWAMIx5Mffpkee05RHRG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:20259'),
  ('587716883798497588', 'Rebecka Martinsson', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Mattias Grosin, Henrik Engström', null, 'Sascha Zacharias, Eva Melander, Jakob Öhrman, Ardalan Esmaili, Thomas Oredsson, Gunilla Röör, Ville Virtanen, Lars Lind', null, 'Rebecka Martinsson from Kiruna has not really found herself despite her big successes at a law firm in Stockholm. When a friend from her childhood passes away, Rebecka returns to Kiruna where she''s drawn into a thrilling hunt for a killer.', 'Rebecka Martinsson from Kiruna has not really found herself despite her big successes at a law firm in Stockholm. When a friend from her childhood passes away, Rebecka returns to Kiruna where she''s drawn into a thrilling hunt for a killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rekEkMhWZVIZHNXAV7Z3RnkHWWD.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:70742'),
  ('1125048072462743465', 'Rebel', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', 'Krista Vernoff', null, 'Katey Sagal, John Corbett, Andy Garcia, James Lesure, Tamala Jones, Lex Scott Davis, Ariela Barer, Kevin Zegers', 'TV-14', 'Annie “Rebel” Bello is a blue-collar legal advocate without a law degree. She’s a funny, messy, brilliant and fearless woman who cares desperately about the causes she fights for and the people she loves. When Rebel applies herself to a fight she believes in, she will win at almost any cost.', 'Annie “Rebel” Bello is a blue-collar legal advocate without a law degree. She’s a funny, messy, brilliant and fearless woman who cares desperately about the causes she fights for and the people she loves. When Rebel applies herself to a fight she believes in, she will win at almost any cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyHAr6lk3EW2krnUp5RFkK6ouwB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:111261'),
  ('47833613029858286', 'Rebel Cheer Squad: A Get Even Series', 2022, 'Family, Drama, Mystery', 'Holly Phillips', null, 'Lashay Anderson, Amelia Brooks, Ashling O’Shea, Elliott Wooster, Ramanique Ahluwalia, Renee Bailey, Asha Banks', 'TV-PG', 'The old DGM might have left Bannerman School, but their spirit remains, and there is still a need to get even, wrongs must be righted and injustice has to be fought.', 'The old DGM might have left Bannerman School, but their spirit remains, and there is still a need to get even, wrongs must be righted and injustice has to be fought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7a0milHiNVtENcf4XEPLXQcumA1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:196511'),
  ('1019108334342741066', 'Rebel Rio', 2011, 'Soap, Family, Drama', 'Margareth Boury, Cris Morena', 'Emílio Boechat, Carolina Galvão, Valéria Motta', 'Sophia Abrahão, Micael Borges, Lua Blanco, Arthur Aguiar, Mel Fronckowiak, Chay Suede, Rayana Carvalho, Pedro Cassiano', null, 'Elite Way is one of the most renowned educational institutions in the country, where students have access to high quality education and play sports. Despite the rigid schedule, the richest families in Rio de Janeiro want that their children study in the Elite Way. This is the case of Alice, Diego, Roberta, Carla and Tomás, some rebel teenagers and full of fancies that will discover in music a common goal.', 'Elite Way is one of the most renowned educational institutions in the country, where students have access to high quality education and play sports. Despite the rigid schedule, the richest families in Rio de Janeiro want that their children study in the Elite Way. This is the case of Alice, Diego, Roberta, Carla and Tomás, some rebel teenagers and full of fancies that will discover in music a common goal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yor8wTpvqQxz6w3wWlIsUC5cMe1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:46154'),
  ('858047979697348849', 'Rebelde', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Cris Morena, Pedro Damián', 'Iván Cuevas, Pedro Armando Rodríguez', 'Anahí, Alfonso Herrera, Dulce María, Christopher Von Uckermann, Maite Perroni, Christian Chávez, Angelique Boyer, Diego Boneta', 'TV-14', 'A group of young adults will spend their adolescence at the Elite Way School, where they will learn about love, life and live their passion for music.', 'A group of young adults will spend their adolescence at the Elite Way School, where they will learn about love, life and live their passion for music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQHXg2BOiODkF4yVI75NcodMmAJ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:12637'),
  ('410515772901262320', 'Rebelde', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Azul Guaita, Franco Masini, Sergio Mayer Mori, Andrea Chaparro, Jerónimo Cantillo, Giovanna Grigio, Alejandro Puente, Lizeth Selene', 'TV-MA', 'Head back to Elite Way School as a new generation of students hope to win the Battle of the Bands.', 'Head back to Elite Way School as a new generation of students hope to win the Battle of the Bands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b1IBsimEJOLjBLYsdBZ1VAcmq73.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:134949'),
  ('557916262264758465', 'Rebelde Way', 2002, 'Soap, Drama', 'Cris Morena', 'Cris Morena, Patricia Maldonado, Maque Lagos', 'Luisana Lopilato, Benjamín Rojas, Camila Bordonaba, Felipe Colombo, Ángeles Balbiani, Jazmín Beccar Varela, Victoria Maurette, Diego García', null, 'Four teenagers at an elite school in Buenos Aires are drawn together by their love of music, despite their differing social and economic backgrounds.', 'Four teenagers at an elite school in Buenos Aires are drawn together by their love of music, despite their differing social and economic backgrounds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ROiiGuYqXkm1CKX1h3KtmSvI8z.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:9027'),
  ('954148711463694095', 'Rebelde Way', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'João Matos, Cris Morena', null, 'Tiago Barroso, Joana Alvarenga, Nelson Antunes, Joana Anes', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qYlufoUmXGRtEeHT9LXXKLuo6v.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:158866'),
  ('504380738225202179', 'Rebellion', 2016, 'War & Politics, Drama', 'Colin Teevan', null, 'Charlie Murphy, Ruth Bradley, Sarah Greene, Brian Gleeson, Barry Ward, Michelle Fairley, Ian McElhinney, Michael Ford-FitzGerald', 'TV-MA', 'A group of young men and women in Dublin in 1916 are embroiled in a fight for independence during the Easter Rising. The story begins with the outbreak of World War I. As expectations of a short and glorious campaign are dashed, social stability is eroded and Irish nationalism comes to the fore. The tumultuous events that follow are seen through the eyes of a group of friends from Dublin, Belfast and London as they play vital and conflicting roles in the narrative of Ireland''s independence.', 'A group of young men and women in Dublin in 1916 are embroiled in a fight for independence during the Easter Rising. The story begins with the outbreak of World War I. As expectations of a short and glorious campaign are dashed, social stability is eroded and Irish nationalism comes to the fore. The tumultuous events that follow are seen through the eyes of a group of friends from Dublin, Belfast and London as they play vital and conflicting roles in the narrative of Ireland''s independence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0BnaDnGZ5zucdyMPRtQZ96jqL0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65153'),
  ('663239926108600576', 'Rebirth', 1993, 'Soap, Drama', 'Benedito Ruy Barbosa', 'Benedito Ruy Barbosa, Edilene Barbosa, Edmara Barbosa', 'Antônio Fagundes, Marcos Palmeira, Adriana Esteves, Herson Capri, Osmar Prado, Chica Xavier, Patricia Pillar, Luciana Braga', null, 'Jose Inocencio had innocence only as part of his name, but only those who new him well could notice this. But nobody knew him. He was a storyteller, and he was always the main character in the stories he told. He managed not only to create stories about himself, he managed to create a legend. The story of this powerful cacao farmer; Maria Santa, the beloved wife who died; and their four children is the main theme of ''Renascer''.', 'Jose Inocencio had innocence only as part of his name, but only those who new him well could notice this. But nobody knew him. He was a storyteller, and he was always the main character in the stories he told. He managed not only to create stories about himself, he managed to create a legend. The story of this powerful cacao farmer; Maria Santa, the beloved wife who died; and their four children is the main theme of ''Renascer''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXDOzn7rXgF65KWFxzDWZaHgKwm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45759'),
  ('400564818832263602', 'Rebirth', 2024, 'Soap, Drama', 'Bruno Luperi', 'Bruno Luperi', 'Marcos Palmeira, Theresa Fonseca, Juan Paiva, Vladimir Brichta, Sophie Charlotte, Matheus Nachtergaele, Humberto Carrão, Duda Santos', null, 'After making a pact with Jequitibá, José Inocêncio becomes a mythical figure, known as the most successful cocoa farmer in the region. While still young, he wins the heart of Maria Santa. Their intense passion results in four children: José Augusto, José Bento, José Venâncio, and the youngest, João Pedro, who never had the opportunity to know his mother, as she dies while giving birth to him. This tragedy fuels José Inocêncio’s anger, blaming João Pedro for the loss of his great love. Throughout their lives, indifference and resentment mark the relationship between the father and his youngest son. As if the past weren’t enough, years later, the arrival of the mysterious Mariana puts all these emotions to the test when both father and son fall in love with the same woman. This situation reawakens feelings that were either dormant or previously unknown to them.', 'After making a pact with Jequitibá, José Inocêncio becomes a mythical figure, known as the most successful cocoa farmer in the region. While still young, he wins the heart of Maria Santa. Their intense passion results in four children: José Augusto, José Bento, José Venâncio, and the youngest, João Pedro, who never had the opportunity to know his mother, as she dies while giving birth to him. This tragedy fuels José Inocêncio’s anger, blaming João Pedro for the loss of his great love. Throughout their lives, indifference and resentment mark the relationship between the father and his youngest son. As if the past weren’t enough, years later, the arrival of the mysterious Mariana puts all these emotions to the test when both father and son fall in love with the same woman. This situation reawakens feelings that were either dormant or previously unknown to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kUWvvMkNIf21UUDmHjYw55v6o7C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223365'),
  ('47319280701968327', 'Rebirth', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Li Yunrui, Huangyang Tiantian, Zhang Kangle, Xia Meng, Li Xiaoqian', null, 'Chu Qiao, a slave girl, is rescued by Yan Xun, the heir of Yanbei, forming a strong bond with him. However, as ambitions clash and trust is betrayed, Chu Qiao finds herself entangled in power struggles and a quest for justice. Amid political turmoil and personal sacrifice, she rises as a symbol of hope, fighting to protect her people and homeland.', 'Chu Qiao, a slave girl, is rescued by Yan Xun, the heir of Yanbei, forming a strong bond with him. However, as ambitions clash and trust is betrayed, Chu Qiao finds herself entangled in power struggles and a quest for justice. Amid political turmoil and personal sacrifice, she rises as a symbol of hope, fighting to protect her people and homeland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1NVh7a8BmiHGRzXykYiVJBBhq6O.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278894'),
  ('240008609687107373', 'Reboot', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Steven Levitan', 'Hannah Stoddard, Jenny Ulmer', 'Keegan-Michael Key, Johnny Knoxville, Judy Greer, Calum Worthy, Rachel Bloom, Paul Reiser, Krista Marie Yu', 'TV-MA', 'When Hulu reboots an early 2000s family sitcom, its dysfunctional cast is forced back together and now must deal with their unresolved issues in today’s fast-changing world.', 'When Hulu reboots an early 2000s family sitcom, its dysfunctional cast is forced back together and now must deal with their unresolved issues in today’s fast-changing world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Ifv1Z5nYK19AQVZQkEpH0S0IcT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155427'),
  ('206681528675732170', 'ReBoot', 1994, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids', 'John Grace, Philip Mitchell, Gavin Blair', null, 'Paul Dobson, Sharon Alexander, Kathleen Barr, Ian James Corlett, Giacomo Baessato, Shirley Milliner, Scott McNeil, Garry Chalk', 'TV-Y7', 'Bob, a guardian from the Super Computer, helped by his friends Dot, Enzo, and dog Frisket, defend the digital city of Mainframe from evil computer viruses that seek to dominate the city and infect the entire net.', 'Bob, a guardian from the Super Computer, helped by his friends Dot, Enzo, and dog Frisket, defend the digital city of Mainframe from evil computer viruses that seek to dominate the city and infect the entire net.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5C2ZVZEZJdQLkaeO9cCw7rJ0EUM.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2121'),
  ('561345570871087109', 'ReBoot: The Guardian Code', 2018, 'Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Hefferon', null, 'Ty Wood, Ajay Friese, Sydney Scotia, Gabriel Darku, Hannah Vandenbygaart', 'TV-G', 'Four tech-savvy teens hone their skills as cyber-superheroes in a series of secret missions to save the world.', 'Four tech-savvy teens hone their skills as cyber-superheroes in a series of secret missions to save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sarHU6PGc7rXiXgY4Ijs2SCzcj3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78418'),
  ('381764151045765140', 'Rebooting', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Bakarhythm', null, 'Sakura Ando, Kaho, Haruka Kinami', null, 'A comedy focusing on Kondo Asami, a 33-year-old single woman who lives with her parents and works at the local city hall, and suddenly finds herself starting her life over from scratch.', 'A comedy focusing on Kondo Asami, a 33-year-old single woman who lives with her parents and works at the local city hall, and suddenly finds herself starting her life over from scratch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEqyoS81tZJWDW0myiG42lNzUox.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215197'),
  ('914616662871074840', 'Reborn', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Zhang Jingyi, Zhou Yiran, Liu Dan, Wu You, Tim Huang, Wang Yidi, Chen Xixu, Huang Yi', null, 'In 2007, 16-year-old girl Qiao Qingyu and her family, tormented by rumors about her sister Qiao Beiyu''s death, were forced to relocate from their small county town of Shunyun to the provincial capital of Huanzhou. In order to quickly restore their family''s normal life, Qingyu, with the help of her classmate Ming Sheng, began searching for the true cause of her sister''s death.', 'In 2007, 16-year-old girl Qiao Qingyu and her family, tormented by rumors about her sister Qiao Beiyu''s death, were forced to relocate from their small county town of Shunyun to the provincial capital of Huanzhou. In order to quickly restore their family''s normal life, Qingyu, with the help of her classmate Ming Sheng, began searching for the true cause of her sister''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yACjzsC4FEjN7iuDzbBkE2somab.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:255483'),
  ('1095808165042806372', 'Reborn', 2026, 'Mystery', null, null, 'Issey Takahashi, Anne Nakamura, Ouji Suzuka, Mayuu Yokota, Masachika Ichimura, Fumiyo Kohinata', null, 'An arrogant IT tycoon is reincarnated as a struggling dry cleaner in the past, using his future knowledge to find his killer while rediscovering his humanity.', 'An arrogant IT tycoon is reincarnated as a struggling dry cleaner in the past, using his future knowledge to find his killer while rediscovering his humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xlcm1xtiSlUWZm16LBtlYb0SIS6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:315494'),
  ('801445858272616621', 'Reborn as a Cat', 2025, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Ajie, Li Shimeng, Qiu Qiu', null, 'Ji Miaomiao, a young woman just starting her career, is betrayed by a friend and left with a mountain of debt. While fleeing from ruthless debt collectors, she accidentally falls from a building. On the brink of death, a mysterious figure transforms her into a cat. By a twist of fate, she ends up being adopted—by none other than her own boss, Lu Chengze. Thus begins her strange and magical 100-day life... as a cat.', 'Ji Miaomiao, a young woman just starting her career, is betrayed by a friend and left with a mountain of debt. While fleeing from ruthless debt collectors, she accidentally falls from a building. On the brink of death, a mysterious figure transforms her into a cat. By a twist of fate, she ends up being adopted—by none other than her own boss, Lu Chengze. Thus begins her strange and magical 100-day life... as a cat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8aAZqMnfW906OCAdFbKhAc9BEJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:305386'),
  ('87530344475022354', 'Reborn as a Vending Machine, I Now Wander the Dungeon', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Jun Fukuyama, Kaede Hondo', null, 'A middle-aged man with only one passion in his life meets a fitting end in a traffic accident. That''s where most stories would end, but instead, this is when his story begins when he''s reborn as what he admired the most in life--a vending machine! But his new lease on life happens in the worst place possible--what can a vending machine do in a monster-infested dungeon when he can''t speak or even move on his own?', 'A middle-aged man with only one passion in his life meets a fitting end in a traffic accident. That''s where most stories would end, but instead, this is when his story begins when he''s reborn as what he admired the most in life--a vending machine! But his new lease on life happens in the worst place possible--what can a vending machine do in a monster-infested dungeon when he can''t speak or even move on his own?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bY6oLDoxDyP7JNLVGjeO3udND4g.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:207564'),
  ('171622137287135304', 'Reborn at 18: The Great-Grandma Takes Charge', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Li Keyi, Wang Peiyan, Zeng Hui, Qu Gang, Zhao Tingyi, Wu Tianhao, Yue Dongfeng, Chen Tianxiang', null, 'Prof. Rong Yu dies in 1955 & wakes up as an 18-yo girl in 2025. Now her son is a 70+ CEO & she has handsome great-grandsons! Using her wit, she disciplines her unruly descendants while embracing her new life.', 'Prof. Rong Yu dies in 1955 & wakes up as an 18-yo girl in 2025. Now her son is a 70+ CEO & she has handsome great-grandsons! Using her wit, she disciplines her unruly descendants while embracing her new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gi8OL0rAP1hckftAD6pMjHpLEhG.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:293371'),
  ('1073253693319320507', 'Reborn Rich', 2022, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kim Tae-hee, Jung Dae-yoon, San Kyung', 'Kim Tae-hee, Jang Eun-jae', 'Song Joong-ki, Lee Sung-min, Shin Hyun-been, Yoon Je-moon, Kim Shin-rock, Cho Han-cheul, Kim Nam-hee, Park Ji-hyun', null, 'After ten years, a loyal employee is framed for embezzlement, then murdered by his employers, only to be reborn as their youngest son, with a yearn for revenge guiding his hostile takeover.', 'After ten years, a loyal employee is framed for embezzlement, then murdered by his employers, only to be reborn as their youngest son, with a yearn for revenge guiding his hostile takeover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ksXvHQEzcOy8wyxZUivhfHakiXg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:153496'),
  ('884438801312731675', 'Reborn to Master the Blade: From Hero-King to Extraordinary Squire ♀', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Akari Kito, Ai Kakuma, Tomori Kusunoki, Wakana Kuramochi, Haruka Shiraishi, Eri Kitamura, Naomi Ohzora, Atsushi Tamaru', 'TV-14', 'After living a life devoted to serving his country and people, Inglis’ one wish to be free of a king’s burden and to train was actually heard, but as a beautiful girl! Reborn in the far future as a daughter to renowned knights, Inglis can now focus on mastering the martial arts. A wish has been granted, and Inglis will be on the front lines fulfilling the dream of becoming the strongest knight.', 'After living a life devoted to serving his country and people, Inglis’ one wish to be free of a king’s burden and to train was actually heard, but as a beautiful girl! Reborn in the far future as a daughter to renowned knights, Inglis can now focus on mastering the martial arts. A wish has been granted, and Inglis will be on the front lines fulfilling the dream of becoming the strongest knight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zrnUnV0PFWnJ1G6wDvzkQL2HL9d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:194718'),
  ('1086931911689762557', 'REBORN!', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, 'Masashi Suzuki, Nobuaki Kishima, Hideki Mitsui', 'Yukari Kokubun, NEEKO, Takashi Kondo, Toshinobu Iida, Kenjiro Tsuda, Yuka Terasaki, Junko Takeuchi, Satomi Akesaka', 'TV-14', 'Tsuna, a timid junior high student, is a failure at school, sports, and social life. But everything around Tsuna has been completely changed when a baby called Reborn, who claims to be an Italian hit man from Vongola family shows up! Reborn was sent to groom Tsuna for his future life as a mafia boss of the family!', 'Tsuna, a timid junior high student, is a failure at school, sports, and social life. But everything around Tsuna has been completely changed when a baby called Reborn, who claims to be an Italian hit man from Vongola family shows up! Reborn was sent to groom Tsuna for his future life as a mafia boss of the family!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6x7mx9f3ufHCC3pNgMoMnzVo3jw.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:45857'),
  ('96070250659735981', 'Rebus', 2000, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ian Rankin', null, 'Ken Stott, Claire Price, Jennifer Black', 'TV-PG', 'Detective series set in and around Edinburgh, Scotland. Inspector John Rebus, whose methods earn him the wrath of his superiors, does not hesitate to circumvent the law to enforce it.', 'Detective series set in and around Edinburgh, Scotland. Inspector John Rebus, whose methods earn him the wrath of his superiors, does not hesitate to circumvent the law to enforce it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/quXSK0nqneQ0fIgvDfW9EK0Txfy.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1165'),
  ('1071222160354093637', 'Rebus', 2024, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Richard Rankin, Brian Ferguson, Lucie Shorthouse, Amy Manson, Stuart Bowman, Caroline Lee-Johnson, Noof Ousellam, Thoren Ferguson', null, 'Iconic character John Rebus is reimagined as a younger Detective Sergeant, drawn into a violent criminal conflict that turns personal when his brother Michael, a former soldier, crosses the line into criminality.', 'Iconic character John Rebus is reimagined as a younger Detective Sergeant, drawn into a violent criminal conflict that turns personal when his brother Michael, a former soldier, crosses the line into criminality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5zOMfiVSgJieF5hA2Tqh2i0Kzil.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:239946'),
  ('779201621226648249', 'Rec', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Qtaro Hanamizawa', 'Reiko Yoshida', 'Makoto Yasumura, Kanako Sakai, Daisuke Ono, Kimiko Koyama, Megumi Toyoguchi', 'TV-14', 'Rec is a Japanese manga about an aspiring voice actress by Q-Tarō Hanamizawa. A nine-episode anime adaptation by Shaft aired between February and March 2006; an original video animation episode was also produced.', 'Rec is a Japanese manga about an aspiring voice actress by Q-Tarō Hanamizawa. A nine-episode anime adaptation by Shaft aired between February and March 2006; an original video animation episode was also produced.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eoNfmHW656JCIdfxKuW3MyG20u7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34195'),
  ('1072752788275039491', 'Receiver', 2024, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Davante Adams, Justin Jefferson, George Kittle, Deebo Samuel, Amon-Ra St. Brown', 'TV-MA', 'This riveting sports series follows the 2023 season of NFL receivers Davante Adams, Justin Jefferson, George Kittle, Deebo Samuel and Amon-Ra St. Brown.', 'This riveting sports series follows the 2023 season of NFL receivers Davante Adams, Justin Jefferson, George Kittle, Deebo Samuel and Amon-Ra St. Brown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snVuizI42B08cB6DazARwg8CA60.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:249589'),
  ('479604709010117279', 'Recently, My Sister is Unusual', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Junji Majima, Aimi, Kumi Sakuma, Mikoi Sasaki, Yui Ogura, Yasuaki Takumi, Hisako Kanemoto, Chinami Hashimoto', 'TV-MA', 'A girl named Mitsuki Kanzaki lives with her step-brother Yuya after her mother remarries. One day, Mitsuki is possessed by the self-proclaimed spirit of a young girl, Hiyori Kotobuki. Hiyori (in Mitsuki''s body) must fall in love with Yuya to move towards the "Gates of Heaven."', 'A girl named Mitsuki Kanzaki lives with her step-brother Yuya after her mother remarries. One day, Mitsuki is possessed by the self-proclaimed spirit of a young girl, Hiyori Kotobuki. Hiyori (in Mitsuki''s body) must fall in love with Yuya to move towards the "Gates of Heaven."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkoE7RxkBXuTfGUA6HwQ1DQftDc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60672'),
  ('994434520577254231', 'Recess', 1997, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy', 'Paul Germain, Joe Ansolabehere', null, 'Andrew Lawrence, Rickey D''Shon Collins, Pamela Adlon, Ashley Johnson, Jason Davis, Courtland Mead', 'TV-Y7', 'Join a group of six fourth-grade best friends at Third Street Elementary School on their fun-filled adventures in their school playground. Through the ups-and-downs of adolescence, they must wrestle with authority, avoid the school snitch, and try their best to win at kick-ball.', 'Join a group of six fourth-grade best friends at Third Street Elementary School on their fun-filled adventures in their school playground. Through the ups-and-downs of adolescence, they must wrestle with authority, avoid the school snitch, and try their best to win at kick-ball.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRKCxiZROeNaC5H80hVqSqWMYZr.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:1546'),
  ('921486922864353422', 'Recipe for Farewell', 2022, 'Drama, Family', 'Lee Ho-jae', 'Lee Ho-jae', 'Han Suk-kyu, Kim Seo-hyung, Jin Ho-eun, Cho Yu-jung, Yang Kyung-won, Jeon Yeo-jin, Jung Min-gyeol, Kim Mi-ji', null, 'Based on the true story of writer Kang Chang-rae. Da-jung used to be a sweet working mom, but as colorectal cancer strikes her, she gradually becomes unable to eat. Da-jung''s husband, Chang-wook, has never cooked before, but he begins cooking to take care of his wife''s health and meals. Chang-wook handpicks decent ingredients and tries to develop healthy recipes to make a precious meal for his ill wife. Although he may be clumsy sometimes, he begins to realize how to treasure the time cooking and having a meal together with his family.', 'Based on the true story of writer Kang Chang-rae. Da-jung used to be a sweet working mom, but as colorectal cancer strikes her, she gradually becomes unable to eat. Da-jung''s husband, Chang-wook, has never cooked before, but he begins cooking to take care of his wife''s health and meals. Chang-wook handpicks decent ingredients and tries to develop healthy recipes to make a precious meal for his ill wife. Although he may be clumsy sometimes, he begins to realize how to treasure the time cooking and having a meal together with his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1iazeLDidTnmDnWMuZyP747MOUI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:195743'),
  ('656432822285861613', 'Recipe For Love', 2026, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', null, 'Park Ji-sook', 'Jin Se-yeon, Park Ki-woong, Kim Mi-sook, Kim Seung-su, Yoo Ho-jeong, Choi Dae-chul, Ju Jin-mo, Kim Hyeong-mook', null, 'Two families entangled in a bad relationship for 30 years, resolving misunderstandings, healing each other''s wounds, and ultimately being reborn as one family.', 'Two families entangled in a bad relationship for 30 years, resolving misunderstandings, healing each other''s wounds, and ultimately being reborn as one family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1kkiRAgFGzSfsprZLKwXkqC1rJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:307602'),
  ('820435409124852701', 'Recipes for Love and Murder', 2022, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Sally Andrew, Karen Jeynes, Tannie Maria', 'Karen Jeynes', 'Maria Doyle Kennedy, Kylie Fisher, Tony Kgoroge', null, 'Tannie Maria sees food as "medicine for the body and heart". She envies romance as much as she enjoys cooking and eating. But it''s death that shakes up Tannie Maria''s life, when one of the correspondents to her column is brutally murdered.', 'Tannie Maria sees food as "medicine for the body and heart". She envies romance as much as she enjoys cooking and eating. But it''s death that shakes up Tannie Maria''s life, when one of the correspondents to her column is brutally murdered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nx6G7t3mN6WbMiYx7RFuTpau8Mn.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:157411'),
  ('3952807713085712', 'Reckless', 2014, 'Crime, Drama', 'Dana Stevens', null, 'Cam Gigandet, Anna Wood, Georgina Haig, Shawn Hatosy, Adam Rodriguez, Michael Gladis, Kim Wayans, Gregory Harrison', 'TV-PG', 'A gorgeous Yankee litigator and a charming southern attorney must hide their intense mutual attraction as a police sex scandal threatens to tear the city of Charleston, S.C. apart.', 'A gorgeous Yankee litigator and a charming southern attorney must hide their intense mutual attraction as a police sex scandal threatens to tear the city of Charleston, S.C. apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPhc4IpzLTV7nu663kAhhQQr0UP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:58951'),
  ('770485705657507260', 'Reckoning', 2019, 'Drama', null, null, 'Simone Kessell, Laura Gordon, Aden Young, Milly Alcock, Di Smith, Ed Oxenbould, Mitzi Ruhlmann, Toby Schmitz', null, 'The murder of a teenager and the hunt for a serial killer in a suburban Northern California town sets two fathers on a course of mutual destruction that will reverberate through their quiet community.', 'The murder of a teenager and the hunt for a serial killer in a suburban Northern California town sets two fathers on a course of mutual destruction that will reverberate through their quiet community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tJg6csE18HRNvLrpLxcoY4PlZE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98537'),
  ('1073188858286677386', 'Record of Grancrest War', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics', null, null, 'Akari Kito, Kentaro Kumagai, Reina Ueda, Satoshi Hino, Natsumi Takamori, Yuichi Nakamura, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Ai Kayano', null, 'On a continent ruled by chaos, the Lords have the power of a holy seal that can calm the chaos and protect the people. However, before anyone realizes it, the rulers cast aside their creed of purifying the chaos, and instead start to fight each other for each other''s holy seals to gain dominion over one another. Siluca, an isolated mage who scorns the Lords for abandoning their creed, and a wandering knight named Theo, who is on a journey to train to one day liberate his hometown, make an everlasting oath to work together to reform this continent dominated by wars and chaos.', 'On a continent ruled by chaos, the Lords have the power of a holy seal that can calm the chaos and protect the people. However, before anyone realizes it, the rulers cast aside their creed of purifying the chaos, and instead start to fight each other for each other''s holy seals to gain dominion over one another. Siluca, an isolated mage who scorns the Lords for abandoning their creed, and a wandering knight named Theo, who is on a journey to train to one day liberate his hometown, make an everlasting oath to work together to reform this continent dominated by wars and chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tECUAfNnSrNp7IS1HwXboLvg1FQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76125'),
  ('1113960135192252117', 'Record of Lodoss War', 1990, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Yumi Touma, Kappei Yamaguchi, Yoshisada Sakaguchi, Takeshi Kusao, Hideyuki Tanaka, Akira Kamiya, Yoshiko Sakakibara, Norio Wakamoto', null, 'Born in battle, baptized in fire, it''s kingdoms have been ravaged by war for thousands of years. Now, an evil stirs, an ancient goddess of destruction awakened by an evil wizard. A party of six is forged to defeat this threat, or die in the attempt. Join Parn, the young fighter, as he leads his warriors into the heart of a land where dragons rule and evil holds sway over the earth. Six swords are now drawn against this darkness. The war for Lodoss has begun!', 'Born in battle, baptized in fire, it''s kingdoms have been ravaged by war for thousands of years. Now, an evil stirs, an ancient goddess of destruction awakened by an evil wizard. A party of six is forged to defeat this threat, or die in the attempt. Join Parn, the young fighter, as he leads his warriors into the heart of a land where dragons rule and evil holds sway over the earth. Six swords are now drawn against this darkness. The war for Lodoss has begun!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4DmzoxYfS4A1eFA35QIEJCvZE4D.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42713'),
  ('151833665563424680', 'Record of Lodoss War: Chronicles of the Heroic Knight', 1998, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kenji Nojima, Chie Ishibashi, Nobutoshi Canna, Shiho Niiyama, Jouji Nakata, Chikao Ohtsuka, Show Hayami, Kumiko Nishihara', null, 'Five years after the death of the Emperor of Marmo in the War of Heroes, Parn is now the Free Knight of Lodoss, he and his old allies now famous through the land. However, the Emperor''s right-hand-man, Ashram, seeks the Scepter of Domination to re-unify Lodoss under his former leader''s banner. Meanwhile, beyond his attempts at conquest lies a more sinister force beginning to set the stage for the resurrection of the goddess of death and destruction...', 'Five years after the death of the Emperor of Marmo in the War of Heroes, Parn is now the Free Knight of Lodoss, he and his old allies now famous through the land. However, the Emperor''s right-hand-man, Ashram, seeks the Scepter of Domination to re-unify Lodoss under his former leader''s banner. Meanwhile, beyond his attempts at conquest lies a more sinister force beginning to set the stage for the resurrection of the goddess of death and destruction...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cC03MG5593IWXPUeKZAQX9qW3A1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72041'),
  ('58708629694344637', 'Record of Ragnarok', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Miyuki Sawashiro, Tomoyo Kurosawa, Wataru Takagi, Junichi Suwabe, Soma Saito', 'TV-MA', 'Before eradicating humankind from the world, the gods give them one last chance to prove themselves worthy of survival. Let the Ragnarok battles begin.', 'Before eradicating humankind from the world, the gods give them one last chance to prove themselves worthy of survival. Let the Ragnarok battles begin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t6GEKms3JgLhC6pXjFHhDvPP65y.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:114868'),
  ('494485446008812697', 'Record of Youth', 2020, 'Drama', 'Ha Myung-hee, An Gil-ho', 'Ha Myung-hee', 'Park Bo-gum, Park So-dam, Byeon Woo-seok, Lee Chang-hoon, Jo Yoon Jung, Kwon Soo-hyun, Ha Hee-ra, Shin Ae-ra', 'TV-14', 'In a cutthroat world where the life you’re born into decides your success, three aspiring youths are determined to change that perception as they fight for their dreams.', 'In a cutthroat world where the life you’re born into decides your success, three aspiring youths are determined to change that perception as they fight for their dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/54yTLS5d4OPOuunzOvHlmP82eIT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99047'),
  ('37132878868691502', 'Recovery of an MMO Junkie', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Mamiko Noto, Takahiro Sakurai, Ryota Suzuki, Reina Ueda, Tomoaki Maeno, Takuma Terashima, Yuichi Nakamura, Yuuka Aisaka', 'TV-14', 'Moriko Morioka is a 30-year-old single NEET woman. After dropping out from reality, she has taken off in search for a fulfilling life and ended up in a net game or "netoge." In the netoge world, she began her new life as a refreshing and handsome character named Hayashi. While starting out as a beginner, a pretty character named Lily reached out to help her. Meanwhile, in the real world, awaits a shocking encounter with a good-looking elite company employee, a mysterious blue-eyed blonde.', 'Moriko Morioka is a 30-year-old single NEET woman. After dropping out from reality, she has taken off in search for a fulfilling life and ended up in a net game or "netoge." In the netoge world, she began her new life as a refreshing and handsome character named Hayashi. While starting out as a beginner, a pretty character named Lily reached out to help her. Meanwhile, in the real world, awaits a shocking encounter with a good-looking elite company employee, a mysterious blue-eyed blonde.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kl3Jv6KPiIeveZNvh8jg0UerxRt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74163'),
  ('913222358922805310', 'Recovery Road', 2016, 'Drama', null, null, 'Sharon Leal, Sebastian de Souza, Daniel Franzese, Kyla Pratt, David Witts, Alexis Carra, Jessica Sula', 'TV-14', 'Maddie is a teenage girl dealing with addiction who has a reputation as a party girl who doesn’t think she has a problem, until she’s confronted one day by her school guidance counselor and is forced to choose between expulsion and rehab. Maddie makes the difficult decision to live with other recovering addicts at a sober living facility while facing the daily pressures of her teenage life. Based on the popular young adult novel by Blake Nelson.', 'Maddie is a teenage girl dealing with addiction who has a reputation as a party girl who doesn’t think she has a problem, until she’s confronted one day by her school guidance counselor and is forced to choose between expulsion and rehab. Maddie makes the difficult decision to live with other recovering addicts at a sober living facility while facing the daily pressures of her teenage life. Based on the popular young adult novel by Blake Nelson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/awoLSvv65KBx1rzb1BG7GI4o0zD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64673'),
  ('403791157274523968', 'Rectify', 2013, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ray McKinnon', null, 'Aden Young, Abigail Spencer, Adelaide Clemens, Clayne Crawford, J. Smith-Cameron, Bruce McKinnon, Jake Austin Walker, Luke Kirby', 'TV-14', 'After 19 years on Death Row for the rape and murder of his teenage girlfriend, Daniel Holden is going home. His conviction has been vacated due to new DNA evidence. Now he has to return to a world he no longer knows and his reentry into the outside world may be as unforgiving as prison. Daniel is haunted by the past, dogged by the present, and uncertain of the future. As he struggles to adapt to his new life, his homecoming reignites the fears of a small town and threatens to shatter his family’s fragile peace. Daniel’s alleged crime divided a community. Will his freedom tear it in half?', 'After 19 years on Death Row for the rape and murder of his teenage girlfriend, Daniel Holden is going home. His conviction has been vacated due to new DNA evidence. Now he has to return to a world he no longer knows and his reentry into the outside world may be as unforgiving as prison. Daniel is haunted by the past, dogged by the present, and uncertain of the future. As he struggles to adapt to his new life, his homecoming reignites the fears of a small town and threatens to shatter his family’s fragile peace. Daniel’s alleged crime divided a community. Will his freedom tear it in half?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tm9nQe9165cyjnTz8NB50izwcpJ.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:46619'),
  ('201928513186884433', 'Red 5', 2024, 'Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Inga Koshavtseva', 'Ivan Baranov, Evgeny Shelyakin, Kirill Sitnikov', 'Denis Shvedov, Gosha Kutsenko, Roman Kurtsyn, Mariya Lisovaya, Yan Tsapnik, Sevastyan Bugaev, Egor Druzhinin, Tatyana Khramova', null, 'Special services agent Bekeshev, who alone can neutralize any enemy, once fails the task, and he is dismissed.', 'Special services agent Bekeshev, who alone can neutralize any enemy, once fails the task, and he is dismissed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sG0fTbGXd48WDVeLZTZP5KQZTL9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:247208'),
  ('976168271213535238', 'Red Alert', 2025, 'Drama', 'Ruth Efroni, Lior Chefetz', null, 'Rotem Sela, Rotem Abuhav, Chen Amsalem, Israel Atias, Hisham Suliman, Mickey Leon, Sarit Vino-Elad, Nevo Katan', null, 'From the ambush at an open-air music festival to a family''s last stand inside their home, ordinary people face life-or-death situations as a terrorist invasion turns southern Israel into a war zone.', 'From the ambush at an open-air music festival to a family''s last stand inside their home, ordinary people face life-or-death situations as a terrorist invasion turns southern Israel into a war zone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQHAFDVddLMIhJaxtI6GhxuL7sI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:301809'),
  ('851880211655491707', 'Red Balloon', 2017, 'Drama', null, null, 'Hsu Tao, Edward Chen, Xie Kun-da, Chen Liang-che, Beatrice Fang, Joseph Hsia', null, 'Zi-chen, the school''s star student, seeks solitude—until Hsiang-wan intrudes, snapping photos. But when Zi-chen returns to his dorm, an unsettling surprise awaits.', 'Zi-chen, the school''s star student, seeks solitude—until Hsiang-wan intrudes, snapping photos. But when Zi-chen returns to his dorm, an unsettling surprise awaits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7HZbp2D5hdm70tCd3eg5SAywdQp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71704'),
  ('406356159902128508', 'Red Balloon', 2022, 'Family, Drama', null, 'Moon Young-nam', 'Seo Ji-hye, Lee Sung-jae, Hong Soo-hyun, Lee Sang-woo, Jung Yoo-min, Yoon Mi-ra, Yun Ju-sang, Lee Bo-hee', null, 'Two women — best friends since high school — realize the limits of their friendship as secrets, jealousy and desire come between them.', 'Two women — best friends since high school — realize the limits of their friendship as secrets, jealousy and desire come between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/exafE11UeeBZs9kQxnyH5YNQGiI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208832'),
  ('414533069004277003', 'Red Band', 2014, 'Drama', 'Guido Simonetti', 'Tommaso Renzoni', 'Carmine Buschini, Brando Pacitto, Aurora Ruffino, Mirko Trovato, Denise Tantucci, Clòe Romagnoli, Daniel Lorenz Alviar Tenorio, Lorenzo Guidi', null, 'Braccialetti Rossi is a story of friendship, values and life, a modern tale about the power of sharing, where protagonists are six young guys that the destiny brings together within a hospital. While laughing, playing, crying and gets excited, as only young people can do, a group is created taking the center of the story.', 'Braccialetti Rossi is a story of friendship, values and life, a modern tale about the power of sharing, where protagonists are six young guys that the destiny brings together within a hospital. While laughing, playing, crying and gets excited, as only young people can do, a group is created taking the center of the story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zbnRBSfeab9ITdsLOTQWnXHHZRe.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:65655'),
  ('133531737249175440', 'Red Band Society', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Margaret Nagle', null, 'Octavia Spencer, Dave Annable, Stro, Griffin Gluck, Zoe Levin, Ciara Bravo, Rebecca Rittenhouse, Charlie Rowe', 'TV-PG', 'Children and teenagers become friends in a hospital where they are all patients. Together they try to escape the sad reality to create their own world with their own codes , while the nursing staff do their best to bring them a little happiness everyday. Charlie , in a coma for several months, attending meanwhile helplessly bustle around him. He sees nothing , but he hears everything ...', 'Children and teenagers become friends in a hospital where they are all patients. Together they try to escape the sad reality to create their own world with their own codes , while the nursing staff do their best to bring them a little happiness everyday. Charlie , in a coma for several months, attending meanwhile helplessly bustle around him. He sees nothing , but he hears everything ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dyMoktne1EVap1TAiS4ecZUWQ4V.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61399'),
  ('694113603896742317', 'Red Baron', 1994, 'Animation', 'Akio Sakai', null, 'Yoshiko Kamei, Kappei Yamaguchi, Rie Iwatsubo, Naoki Tatsuta, Ikuya Sawaki, Yuko Kobayashi, Ginzo Matsuo, Chafurin', 'NR', 'In the year 2050 the world population is crazy about the "Metal Fight", a competition where people compete in battles featuring giant robots. An organization called Iron Mask is planning on transforming Metal Fight competitors and their robots into weapons, and tries to kidnap Shoko Saeba, a robot programmer who created the Red Baron, which uses a feedback system. Ken Kurenai is able to protect Sally and the Red Baron, and becomes Metal Fight World Champion in the process. Iron Mask then decides to send out their forces to take Ken and the Red Baron out forever.', 'In the year 2050 the world population is crazy about the "Metal Fight", a competition where people compete in battles featuring giant robots. An organization called Iron Mask is planning on transforming Metal Fight competitors and their robots into weapons, and tries to kidnap Shoko Saeba, a robot programmer who created the Red Baron, which uses a feedback system. Ken Kurenai is able to protect Sally and the Red Baron, and becomes Metal Fight World Champion in the process. Iron Mask then decides to send out their forces to take Ken and the Red Baron out forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqgXe18xtYDbS36CmpBgVRRNTf2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34090'),
  ('720543069855143442', 'Red Carpet Survival', 2025, 'Comedy, Reality', null, null, 'Alessia Marcuzzi, Antonio Ornano, Alessandro Betti, Alessandro Ciacci, Gianluca Fubelli, Giulia Vecchio, Valentina Cardinali, Alessandro Trolli', null, 'Herbert Ballerina, Brenda Lodigiani, Antonio Ornano, Awed, Ginevra Fenyes, Pierluca Mariti, Michela Giraud, Gabriele Vagnato, and Francesco Arienzo are the bodyguards in the first edition of "Red Carpet Survival." The best team, at the end of the four episodes, will win the coveted Golden Pigeon. Alessia Marcuzzi will lead the bodyguards. Commenting on it all are the voices of Gialappa''s Band.', 'Herbert Ballerina, Brenda Lodigiani, Antonio Ornano, Awed, Ginevra Fenyes, Pierluca Mariti, Michela Giraud, Gabriele Vagnato, and Francesco Arienzo are the bodyguards in the first edition of "Red Carpet Survival." The best team, at the end of the four episodes, will win the coveted Golden Pigeon. Alessia Marcuzzi will lead the bodyguards. Commenting on it all are the voices of Gialappa''s Band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/csUDYNLdbjAFjpmyvJivvicpeSB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:281094'),
  ('199386338847197517', 'Red Data Girl', 2013, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Saori Hayami, Koki Uchiyama, Madoka Yonezawa, Kaito Ishikawa, Ryohei Kimura, Jun Fukuyama, Rie Kugimiya, Hirofumi Nojima', 'TV-14', 'Izumiko Suzuhara (15) was born and raised at Tamakura Shrine, and always destroys any electrical device she touches. She decides to try living in the city, and enrolls in Houjou High School in Tokyo. With her are her guardians son and Izumiko''s childhood friend Miyuki Sagara. While she''s there, an entity called "Himegami" appears. She learns she is something called a "kami" a vessel for a shinto spirit, while Miyuki is a "yamabushi", a warrior meant to protect the "kami."', 'Izumiko Suzuhara (15) was born and raised at Tamakura Shrine, and always destroys any electrical device she touches. She decides to try living in the city, and enrolls in Houjou High School in Tokyo. With her are her guardians son and Izumiko''s childhood friend Miyuki Sagara. While she''s there, an entity called "Himegami" appears. She learns she is something called a "kami" a vessel for a shinto spirit, while Miyuki is a "yamabushi", a warrior meant to protect the "kami."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYq76MlEark6BQoU3BRKaJwOpl3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:57778'),
  ('41267124614548886', 'Red Dwarf', 1988, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Doug Naylor, Rob Grant', null, 'Craig Charles, Chris Barrie, Danny John-Jules, Robert Llewellyn', 'TV-PG', 'The adventures of the last human alive and his friends, stranded three million years into deep space on the mining ship Red Dwarf.', 'The adventures of the last human alive and his friends, stranded three million years into deep space on the mining ship Red Dwarf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cU9RFlyvJXbzyCzCGRqRmZrTDZU.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:326'),
  ('898025608467091966', 'Red Eagle', 2009, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Mystery', 'Pilar Nadal, Ernesto Pozuelo, Juan Carlos Cueto', null, 'David Janer, Inma Cuesta, Pepa Aniorte, Guillermo Campra, Patrick Criado, Francis Lorenzo, Xabier Elorriaga, Elisa Mouliaá', 'NR', 'Red Eagle is a series of adventure and intrigue on the courage, nobility, friendship and love. The protagonist is an unsung hero of justice of the seventeenth century, known by the nickname of Red Eagle, who helps the weak and who is determined to uncover the conspiracy behind the murder of his young wife.', 'Red Eagle is a series of adventure and intrigue on the courage, nobility, friendship and love. The protagonist is an unsung hero of justice of the seventeenth century, known by the nickname of Red Eagle, who helps the weak and who is determined to uncover the conspiracy behind the murder of his young wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZsVB0knyB21UwFBC6Bn2p7fqcw.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:25065'),
  ('342680213896804547', 'Red Election', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Ola Norén, Roland Ulvselius', null, 'Vic Carmen Sonne, Lydia Leonard, James D''Arcy, Stephen Dillane, Kobna Holdbrook-Smith, Lorraine Burroughs, Aidan McArdle, Clinton Liberty', null, 'Danish secret service agent Katrine Poulson and British spy Beatrice Ogilvy are thrown together in a race against time. As a terrorist plot against the British PM unfolds, Poulson and Ogilvy are tangled up in a web of lies, murder and power struggles; they can''t trust anyone, and they soon realise the deadly conspiracy could be part of a far-reaching geopolitical masterplan.', 'Danish secret service agent Katrine Poulson and British spy Beatrice Ogilvy are thrown together in a race against time. As a terrorist plot against the British PM unfolds, Poulson and Ogilvy are tangled up in a web of lies, murder and power struggles; they can''t trust anyone, and they soon realise the deadly conspiracy could be part of a far-reaching geopolitical masterplan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvmlsAfnk22XSJTDkwBoPtUobWt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135386'),
  ('1336939637206534', 'Red Eye', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Peter A. Dowling', 'Peter A. Dowling', 'Jing Lusi, Martin Compston, Nicholas Rowe, Trevor White, Tom Forbes, Cash Holland, Steph Lacey, Guy Williams', 'TV-14', 'London police officer DC Hana Li is escorting Dr Matthew Nolan back to Beijing where he has been accused of a crime. However, on board flight 357, she finds herself embroiled in an escalating conspiracy and a growing number of murders.', 'London police officer DC Hana Li is escorting Dr Matthew Nolan back to Beijing where he has been accused of a crime. However, on board flight 357, she finds herself embroiled in an escalating conspiracy and a growing number of murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hmNbB68i1zQ7xq7MY82eBujziYF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:247704'),
  ('67871560805677895', 'Red Garden', 2006, 'Mystery, Animation', null, null, 'Akira Tomisaka, Ayumi Tsuji, Ryoko Shintani, Miyuki Sawashiro, Rie Tanaka, Misato Fukuen', null, 'Four students of the same age have nothing in common except that they attend the same elite New York City school. Kate, Rose, Claire and Rachel all belong to different cliques and hardly notice each other''s existence. Then one day they gain something in common, something very important, something mysterious. They find themselves drawn together by the death of a fellow student and the secret of their own missing memories. Suddenly they are thrown into a world of hidden warfare on the city streets and are caught up in secrets which would not be believed by others. These four all have their own problems to struggle with, things that seem more important than such strange conflicts. Can they escape from this fate? The only thing they know is that despite coming from four different worlds they now have to rely on each other or die without a hope.', 'Four students of the same age have nothing in common except that they attend the same elite New York City school. Kate, Rose, Claire and Rachel all belong to different cliques and hardly notice each other''s existence. Then one day they gain something in common, something very important, something mysterious. They find themselves drawn together by the death of a fellow student and the secret of their own missing memories. Suddenly they are thrown into a world of hidden warfare on the city streets and are caught up in secrets which would not be believed by others. These four all have their own problems to struggle with, things that seem more important than such strange conflicts. Can they escape from this fate? The only thing they know is that despite coming from four different worlds they now have to rely on each other or die without a hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hVUMzed0rnH347oY9kPJ6zeOAe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38790'),
  ('1076463767329986496', 'Red Iron Road', 2023, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, null, null, 'Red Iron Road is an animated horror anthology series, based on the works of famous European authors. Each of the episodes are between 10-20 minutes, produced with different creative partners in unique visual styles to suit each story.', 'Red Iron Road is an animated horror anthology series, based on the works of famous European authors. Each of the episodes are between 10-20 minutes, produced with different creative partners in unique visual styles to suit each story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lS7BGVJlIDSC1OTpxzyvTE2C4cK.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:219588'),
  ('432236675003279837', 'Red Light', 2020, 'Drama', 'Carice van Houten, Halina Reijn', 'Esther Gerritsen, Christophe Dirickx, Frank Ketelaar', 'Carice van Houten, Halina Reijn, Maaike Neuville, Geert Van Rampelberg, Koen De Bouw, Robert de Hoog', 'TV-MA', 'Three women become entangled in the world of human trafficking and prostitution when Esther''s husband suddenly disappears. From completely different worlds, the lives of these women become intertwined. They discover that they need each other to escape from the difficult situations they find themselves in.', 'Three women become entangled in the world of human trafficking and prostitution when Esther''s husband suddenly disappears. From completely different worlds, the lives of these women become intertwined. They discover that they need each other to escape from the difficult situations they find themselves in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2ukCeVRvkmlayYTcYEDRgwN6ov.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114641'),
  ('1028992801462787157', 'Red Oaks', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Joe Gangemi, Gregory Jacobs', null, 'Craig Roberts, Alexandra Socha, Paul Reiser, Oliver Cooper, Gage Golightly, Ennis Esmer, Jennifer Grey, Josh Meyers', 'TV-MA', 'A coming-of-age comedy set in the "go-go" 80s that is equal parts hijinks and heartfelt about a college student enjoying a last hurrah before summer comes to an end--and the future begins. David Myers, an assistant tennis pro at the Red Oaks Country Club in suburban New Jersey in 1985, is both reeling from his father''s heart attack and conflicted about what major to declare in the fall. While there, he meets a colorful cast of misfit co-workers and wealthy club members including an alluring art student named Skye and her corporate raider father Getty.', 'A coming-of-age comedy set in the "go-go" 80s that is equal parts hijinks and heartfelt about a college student enjoying a last hurrah before summer comes to an end--and the future begins. David Myers, an assistant tennis pro at the Red Oaks Country Club in suburban New Jersey in 1985, is both reeling from his father''s heart attack and conflicted about what major to declare in the fall. While there, he meets a colorful cast of misfit co-workers and wealthy club members including an alluring art student named Skye and her corporate raider father Getty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGI54TyocVBOAAfPmq8sytJGxeG.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:63130'),
  ('461150494173097597', 'Red Queen', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Mystery', 'Amaya Muruzabal, Salvador Perpiñá', null, 'Victoria Luengo, Hovik Keuchkerian, Celia Freijeiro, Karmele Larrinaga, José Ángel Egido, Nacho Fresneda', 'TV-MA', 'A gifted woman''s intellect brings chance to lead covert European police force. But it backfires, costing her everything. Following murder at her home and kidnapped heiress, her ex-supervisor enlists a policeman''s aid to reinstate her.', 'A gifted woman''s intellect brings chance to lead covert European police force. But it backfires, costing her everything. Following murder at her home and kidnapped heiress, her ex-supervisor enlists a policeman''s aid to reinstate her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lk7LVXYSOO5rReR2jzLo8Le3cO1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:203667'),
  ('695645104452626360', 'Red Rose', 2022, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Paul Clarkson, Michael Clarkson', null, 'Amelia Clarkson, Isis Hainsworth, Natalie Blair, Ali Khan, Ellis Howard, Harry Redding, Ashna Rabheru, Adam Nagaitis', null, 'When one of a group of friends downloads the mysterious Red Rose app, plans change. What starts innocently as a game of admiration rapidly descends into something much darker.', 'When one of a group of friends downloads the mysterious Red Rose app, plans change. What starts innocently as a game of admiration rapidly descends into something much darker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pLJhY7K0FQwO3oa6UyPCSw4D9bl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207878'),
  ('626538062364033403', 'Red Roses', 2023, 'Drama', 'Necati Şahin', null, 'Özgü Namal, Özcan Deniz, Erkan Avcı, Mert Turak, Mert Yazıcıoğlu, Selen Öztürk, Şerif Erol, Duygu Sarışın', null, '“Kızıl Goncalar” tells the poignant story of Meryem, married off at 14 in an Islamic sect, and now battling bravely to prevent her daughter Zeynep from suffering the same fate as the bride of the sheikh’s grandson. Guided by her sister-in-law, a former sect member, they realize they must flee to save Zeynep from the sect’s powerful clutches. Fearfully hiding her plans from her cruel husband, Meryem must first earn money as a carer in the home of secular psychiatrist Levent, who agrees to help her. Despite their clashing religious and progressive beliefs, Meryem and Levent are drawn together emotionally, but the turmoil in their lives deepens as the identity of his daughter is revealed.', '“Kızıl Goncalar” tells the poignant story of Meryem, married off at 14 in an Islamic sect, and now battling bravely to prevent her daughter Zeynep from suffering the same fate as the bride of the sheikh’s grandson. Guided by her sister-in-law, a former sect member, they realize they must flee to save Zeynep from the sect’s powerful clutches. Fearfully hiding her plans from her cruel husband, Meryem must first earn money as a carer in the home of secular psychiatrist Levent, who agrees to help her. Despite their clashing religious and progressive beliefs, Meryem and Levent are drawn together emotionally, but the turmoil in their lives deepens as the identity of his daughter is revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTNGJnl1qA4nVSxl0RUGX7plo4R.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:241020'),
  ('475173741604586159', 'Red Shoe Diaries', 1992, 'Drama', null, null, 'David Duchovny', null, 'Jake takes out an ad in the newspaper after the suicide of his unfaithful fiancée, in an effort to understand the reasons for the betrayal. By soliciting the secret diaries of other women, he hopes to find some reconciliation with the truth.', 'Jake takes out an ad in the newspaper after the suicide of his unfaithful fiancée, in an effort to understand the reasons for the betrayal. By soliciting the secret diaries of other women, he hopes to find some reconciliation with the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ko7HHjQSMSz0lcYtRSFOX2EWdSj.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1082'),
  ('571913584341789752', 'Red Sorghum', 2014, 'Drama', 'Xiaolong Zheng', 'Zhao Dongling, Geng Pan', 'Zhou Xun, Zhu Yawen, Huang Xuan, Yu Rongguang, Qin Hailu, Alvin Cao, Han Tongsheng, Lan Wang', null, 'Red Sorghum is a Chinese television series based on Nobel laureate Mo Yan''s 1986/1987 eponymous novel. Directed by Zheng Xiaolong, it also features the highly-anticipated return of actress Zhou Xun to television after 10 years.', 'Red Sorghum is a Chinese television series based on Nobel laureate Mo Yan''s 1986/1987 eponymous novel. Directed by Zheng Xiaolong, it also features the highly-anticipated return of actress Zhou Xun to television after 10 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j3Hn63ZZyuPzupDgHVItAqKEqrq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61718'),
  ('149717991154777635', 'Red Swan', 2024, 'Drama', 'Park Hong-kyun', null, 'Kim Ha-neul, Rain, Jung Gyu-woon, Seo Yi-sook, Yoon Je-moon, Ki Eun-se, Go Yoon, Kim Young-pil', null, 'Oh Wan-soo, who married into the powerful Hwain Group, faces death threats. She crosses paths with Seo Do-yoon, a bodyguard investigating a friend''s death that is tied to the Hwain Group. Together, they unravel Hwain Group''s secrets tainted with desire.', 'Oh Wan-soo, who married into the powerful Hwain Group, faces death threats. She crosses paths with Seo Do-yoon, a bodyguard investigating a friend''s death that is tied to the Hwain Group. Together, they unravel Hwain Group''s secrets tainted with desire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5B2U7t7bMFP0UO32BhOWlV2diqL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:227189'),
  ('3192476511910776', 'Red vs. Blue', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Burnie Burns', null, 'Matt Hullum, Jason Saldaña, Gustavo Sorola, Burnie Burns, Joel Heyman, Geoff Ramsey, Dan Godwin', 'TV-MA', 'In the distant future, two groups of soldiers battle for control of the least desirable piece of real estate in the known universe: a box canyon in the middle of nowhere.', 'In the distant future, two groups of soldiers battle for control of the least desirable piece of real estate in the known universe: a box canyon in the middle of nowhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ieGCVoyOkOo6jNPM9v1L6jGiM0N.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:39373'),
  ('117309191686846084', 'Red Widow', 2013, 'Drama, Crime', 'Pieter Bart Korthuis', null, 'Radha Mitchell, Goran Višnjić, Sterling Beaumon, Clifton Collins Jr., Luke Goss, Suleka Mathew, Erin Moriarty, Jaime Ray Newman', 'TV-PG', 'When Marta Walraven''s mob husband is brutally murdered, she takes on gangsters and the FBI to unveil the truth about his death. As she digs into this dark underworld, she''ll test her own strength, relying on her resourcefulness, determination and family ties like never before. To get out of this mob, she needs to beat the bad guys at their own deadly game.', 'When Marta Walraven''s mob husband is brutally murdered, she takes on gangsters and the FBI to unveil the truth about his death. As she digs into this dark underworld, she''ll test her own strength, relying on her resourcefulness, determination and family ties like never before. To get out of this mob, she needs to beat the bad guys at their own deadly game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7QFn1uHKHzE7PcPS5sYH9d4YIok.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44235'),
  ('334189916650702362', 'Red Zora and Her Gang', 1979, 'Action & Adventure, Family, Drama', null, 'Bora Ćosić, Kurt Held, Rainer Söhnlein', 'Lidija Kovačević, Nedeljko Vukasović, Anđelko Kos, Esad Krčić, Boris Ninkov, Dragomir Felba, Uwe Falkenbach, Erich Schleyer', null, 'In the Croatian coastal town of Senj , orphans living on the fringes of society come together under the leadership of a girl who, because of her red hair , is called Rote Zora . The citizens of the city treat the destitute children like outcasts. Wild pranks are the reactions of the troops. In order to survive, the children become criminals, but within their community they adhere to fixed rules. Your top priority is solidarity. They call themselves Uskoks . The only one who feels connected to them is the old fisherman Gorian. The children help him to assert himself against the big fishing companies.', 'In the Croatian coastal town of Senj , orphans living on the fringes of society come together under the leadership of a girl who, because of her red hair , is called Rote Zora . The citizens of the city treat the destitute children like outcasts. Wild pranks are the reactions of the troops. In order to survive, the children become criminals, but within their community they adhere to fixed rules. Your top priority is solidarity. They call themselves Uskoks . The only one who feels connected to them is the old fisherman Gorian. The children help him to assert himself against the big fishing companies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ibrHNqVagmaOifBP2SVgNRqElRP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40684'),
  ('855922069776440224', 'Redemption', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Gianluca Maria Tavarelli', null, 'Luigi Fedele, Giordano De Plano, Maya Sansa, Zoe Tavarelli, Andrea Sartoretti, Fiorenza Pieri, Alessandro Gassmann', null, 'In a nocturnal and hostile Rome, Valerio must investigate the death of his son, an apparently suicide. An investigation that''s also a last chance to restore a bond with that son he hadn''t seen in years, facing the ghosts of the past.', 'In a nocturnal and hostile Rome, Valerio must investigate the death of his son, an apparently suicide. An investigation that''s also a last chance to restore a bond with that son he hadn''t seen in years, facing the ghosts of the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEUCfXQtTbDwNcXMmHpp593UUOT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110979'),
  ('955984210823396898', 'Redemption', 2022, 'Drama', 'Ayhan Özen', null, 'Mahassine Merabet, Cenk Torun, Melahat Abbasova, Fulya Özcan, Pervin Mert, Ali Yağcı, Mustafa Şimşek', null, 'Orhun is a successful businessman who was raised in a wealthy but loveless family along with his twin sister Nihan, younger sister Nurşah and their cold, distant mother Afife. Nihan left to do volunteer work as a doctor in Eritrea, but recently she has been impossible to contact, and her family is worried about her. While looking for his sister, he comes across Hira, a poor girl living the life of a prisoner at the hands of traffickers. When they find out that Nihan has been poisoned and killed by a local gang, Orhun breaks down. When it emerges that it was actually Hira who poisoned his sister, Orhun hatches an evil revenge plan. Meanwhile, Afife, their mother, has kept Orhun''s father away since his childhood secretly. Orhun decides to marry Hira as revenge. Afife hates people of lower status and she’s obsessed with “pure blood”. Will this marriage imprison Afife , or will the couple find redemption after paying all their dues?', 'Orhun is a successful businessman who was raised in a wealthy but loveless family along with his twin sister Nihan, younger sister Nurşah and their cold, distant mother Afife. Nihan left to do volunteer work as a doctor in Eritrea, but recently she has been impossible to contact, and her family is worried about her. While looking for his sister, he comes across Hira, a poor girl living the life of a prisoner at the hands of traffickers. When they find out that Nihan has been poisoned and killed by a local gang, Orhun breaks down. When it emerges that it was actually Hira who poisoned his sister, Orhun hatches an evil revenge plan. Meanwhile, Afife, their mother, has kept Orhun''s father away since his childhood secretly. Orhun decides to marry Hira as revenge. Afife hates people of lower status and she’s obsessed with “pure blood”. Will this marriage imprison Afife , or will the couple find redemption after paying all their dues?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2lUypzrIpZ87Crg2yrJKIJ5N5Z9.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:215709'),
  ('826914714381439070', 'Rederiet', 1992, 'Drama', 'Louise Boije af Gennäs, Peter Emanuel Falck', null, 'Johannes Brost, Gösta Krantz, Gaby Stenberg, Kenneth Söderman, Yvonne Schaloske, Margaretha Byström, Mikael Samuelson, Bert-Åke Varg', null, 'This Swedish soap opera follows the lives of the captain and crew of the MS Freja, a cruiseferry that travels on the Baltic Sea between between Stockholm, Sweden and Turku, Finland.', 'This Swedish soap opera follows the lives of the captain and crew of the MS Freja, a cruiseferry that travels on the Baltic Sea between between Stockholm, Sweden and Turku, Finland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p3ae3ZkzMgiWdxlwJMkBHhfLNN6.jpg', 20, 'tmdb:tv:5216'),
  ('953854276416036339', 'Redwall', 1999, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Brian Jacques', null, 'Jake Goldsbie, Melissa McIntyre, Al Mukadam, Alison Pill, Amos Crawley, Benedict Campbell, Catherine Disher, Deborah Odell', 'TV-Y7', 'To save his besieged Abbey, a young mouse novice must learn of his destiny to be the successor to a great warrior.', 'To save his besieged Abbey, a young mouse novice must learn of his destiny to be the successor to a great warrior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vLXvgV2bpqPuva4k0jCSJ4kidRZ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:29904'),
  ('65264468155768752', 'Reef Break', 2019, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Ken Sanzel', null, 'Poppy Montgomery, Ray Stevenson, Desmond Chiam, Melissa Bonne, Tamala Shelton', 'TV-14', 'Cat Chambers is a thief-turned-fixer for the governor of a stunning and seductive Pacific Island paradise. Impulsive, reckless, and irresistible, Cat''s less-than-perfect past gives her an instinctive gift for understanding crime and criminals as she becomes enmeshed in fast-paced, high-octane adventures and island intrigue.', 'Cat Chambers is a thief-turned-fixer for the governor of a stunning and seductive Pacific Island paradise. Impulsive, reckless, and irresistible, Cat''s less-than-perfect past gives her an instinctive gift for understanding crime and criminals as she becomes enmeshed in fast-paced, high-octane adventures and island intrigue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZkIUk12jijhkqLI6fXWeLkTG1C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88561'),
  ('248201571284387021', 'Reflection of You', 2021, 'Drama', 'Yu Bo-ra', 'Yu Bo-ra', 'Ko Hyun-jung, Shin Hyun-been, Kim Jae-young, Choi Won-young, Kim Bo-yeon, Jang Hye-jin, Kim Ho-jung, Kim Sang-ho', null, 'A thriving painter''s enviable life begins to fray at the edges when a bright young woman she once befriended resurfaces as a shell of her former self.', 'A thriving painter''s enviable life begins to fray at the edges when a bright young woman she once befriended resurfaces as a shell of her former self.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AjXKP32QrZehpWjhFiqIs0V0lRa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112834'),
