  ('709765691568769054', 'Refresh Man', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Joanne Tseng, Aaron Yan, Lene Lai, Jack Lee, Paul Hsu, J.R. Chien', 'TV-PG', 'Zhong Yu Tang and Ji Wen Kai are childhood friends. Wen Kai''s grades has always been normal but Yu Tang''s grades were really good. After becoming adults and entering society, Yu Tang has entered the cosmetic world and has the chance to become the secretary of the new CEO. The CEO ended up being Ji Wen Kai! And their story continues...', 'Zhong Yu Tang and Ji Wen Kai are childhood friends. Wen Kai''s grades has always been normal but Yu Tang''s grades were really good. After becoming adults and entering society, Yu Tang has entered the cosmetic world and has the chance to become the secretary of the new CEO. The CEO ended up being Ji Wen Kai! And their story continues...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wmUjvCqxMeMR3XHXSB3f8Qk8Va4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65863'),
  ('958840990892134085', 'Regal Academy', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Joanne Lee, Iginio Straffi', null, 'Chiara Francese, Giulia Tarquini, Emanuela Gabriela Ionică, Alex Polidori, Manuel Meli, Elena Perino, Eleonora Reti, Emanuele Ruzza', 'TV-PG', 'Rose Cinderella is an average teenage girl who''s as obsessed with shoes as she is fairy tales. But when she finds a key that unlocks a magical new world, she learns that fairy tales are not just in storybooks! When Rose tumbles into Fairy Tale Land, she discovers something even greater – her own magical family legacy! Her grandmother Cinderella is headmistress of Regal Academy, where five famous fairy tale families come together to teach the next generation of princes and princesses how to become heroes…with a lot of help from their legendary grandparents. Now Rose and her new best friends – Astoria Rapunzel, Joy Le Frog, Travis Beast and Hawk Snow-white – figure out how to fly dragons and outsmart witches, all while learning to use their magic and live up to their famous family names.', 'Rose Cinderella is an average teenage girl who''s as obsessed with shoes as she is fairy tales. But when she finds a key that unlocks a magical new world, she learns that fairy tales are not just in storybooks! When Rose tumbles into Fairy Tale Land, she discovers something even greater – her own magical family legacy! Her grandmother Cinderella is headmistress of Regal Academy, where five famous fairy tale families come together to teach the next generation of princes and princesses how to become heroes…with a lot of help from their legendary grandparents. Now Rose and her new best friends – Astoria Rapunzel, Joy Le Frog, Travis Beast and Hawk Snow-white – figure out how to fly dragons and outsmart witches, all while learning to use their magic and live up to their famous family names.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jwY26JhCjd5DpIpEvv47HYrnxd.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:68737'),
  ('667752675461106097', 'Regalia: The Three Sacred Stars', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kaede Hondo, Ayane Sakura, Yurika Kubo, Yui Ogura, Asami Seto, Nao Toyama, Hisako Kanemoto, Megumi Ogata', null, '12 years ago, in the country of Rimguard, a big incident left an unsolved mystery that has begun to fade from people''s memories. Time passes, and sisters Yui and Rena are living peacefully in the Enastria Empire. However, one day, a large mecha attacks Enastria. This day marks the turning point when the two girls get caught in the vortex of fate.', '12 years ago, in the country of Rimguard, a big incident left an unsolved mystery that has begun to fade from people''s memories. Time passes, and sisters Yui and Rena are living peacefully in the Enastria Empire. However, one day, a large mecha attacks Enastria. This day marks the turning point when the two girls get caught in the vortex of fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5xGOImOibD85UFNdYVNrNT93MW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67853'),
  ('1019963298867272698', 'Regalo De Amor', 2025, 'Drama, Family, Kids, Comedy', null, null, 'Chris Pascal, Alejandra Robles Gil, Claudia Ramírez, Diana Bracho, Valentina Buzzurro, Bárbara Islas, Juan Martín Jáuregui, María Penella', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96vEDoHQlmmQezbdrwjfdTCd1ZU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:292652'),
  ('165466028399119829', 'Regeneration', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', null, 'Shen Ao, Zhang Yifan, Boyang Gao', 'Jing Boran, Zhou Yiran, Wang Yanhui, Huang Jue, Zhang Yifan, Peng Yang, Heliao Lüyun, Chen Yuxian', null, 'A memorial service for Fei Ke brings together female journalist He Shan and four strangers who are invited. They all share undisclosed pasts with Fei Ke, but they discover that the Fei Ke they knew is not the same person. Who is Fei Ke really? As they look back, the group gradually uncovers the truth about Fei Ke.', 'A memorial service for Fei Ke brings together female journalist He Shan and four strangers who are invited. They all share undisclosed pasts with Fei Ke, but they discover that the Fei Ke they knew is not the same person. Who is Fei Ke really? As they look back, the group gradually uncovers the truth about Fei Ke.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wWz0enTclDv5MAV7qiQNQXkDZdg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:236617'),
  ('225216557134120633', 'ReGenesis', 2004, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Christina Jennings', null, 'Peter Outerbridge, Conrad Pla, Mayko Nguyen, Dmitry Chepovetsky, Greg Bryk, Wendy Crewson', null, 'ReGenesis is a Canadian television program produced by The Movie Network and Movie Central in conjunction with Shaftesbury Films. The series, which ran for four seasons, revolves around the scientists of NorBAC, a fictional organization with a lab based in Toronto. The organization investigates problems of a scientific nature, such as bio-terrorism, mysterious diseases or radical changes in environment throughout Canada, the United States, and Mexico. NorBAC is headed by David Sandström, the chief scientist and molecular biologist. Through this character the show often addresses topical social, political and ethical issues related to the science at hand. The series was originally seen on The Movie Network and Movie Central with rebroadcasts on Global and Showcase in Canada. Internationally it can be seen on FX in the United Kingdom, The Science Channel, Halogen TV and in syndication and CW Plus in the United States, and FX Latin America in Mexico; as well as numerous broadcasters in Europe and Asia. International distribution is handled by Oasis International. As of April 2012 the show can also be seen on Hulu.com.', 'ReGenesis is a Canadian television program produced by The Movie Network and Movie Central in conjunction with Shaftesbury Films. The series, which ran for four seasons, revolves around the scientists of NorBAC, a fictional organization with a lab based in Toronto. The organization investigates problems of a scientific nature, such as bio-terrorism, mysterious diseases or radical changes in environment throughout Canada, the United States, and Mexico. NorBAC is headed by David Sandström, the chief scientist and molecular biologist. Through this character the show often addresses topical social, political and ethical issues related to the science at hand. The series was originally seen on The Movie Network and Movie Central with rebroadcasts on Global and Showcase in Canada. Internationally it can be seen on FX in the United Kingdom, The Science Channel, Halogen TV and in syndication and CW Plus in the United States, and FX Latin America in Mexico; as well as numerous broadcasters in Europe and Asia. International distribution is handled by Oasis International. As of April 2012 the show can also be seen on Hulu.com.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yJ8ThIxnEZ9snyI6zsq4Ataz9mB.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:3406'),
  ('309273698368254460', 'Reggie Perrin', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Simon Nye, David Nobbs', null, 'Fay Ripley, Martin Clunes, Lucy Liemann, Kerry Howard, Jim Howick, Nick Mohammed, Geoffrey Whitehead, Susan Earl', null, 'Reggie Perrin is a modern update of the 1970s BBC sitcom The Fall and Rise of Reginald Perrin, which starred Leonard Rossiter. The revival stars Martin Clunes and was first broadcast on 24 April 2009. Series 1 was released on DVD in Region 2 by 2entertain on 1 June 2009.', 'Reggie Perrin is a modern update of the 1970s BBC sitcom The Fall and Rise of Reginald Perrin, which starred Leonard Rossiter. The revival stars Martin Clunes and was first broadcast on 24 April 2009. Series 1 was released on DVD in Region 2 by 2entertain on 1 June 2009.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e27k16NUzeGrmRX0baQ26wCSM1C.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:16257'),
  ('919828553084125802', 'Reginald the Vampire', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Harley Peyton', null, 'Jacob Batalon, Mandela Van Peebles, Em Haine, Aren Buchholz, Savannah Basley, Marguerite Hanna, Thailey Roberge, Jed Rees', 'TV-14', 'Imagine a world populated by beautiful, fit and vain vampires. Reginald Andres tumbles headlong into it as an unlikely hero who will have to navigate every kind of obstacle – the girl he loves but can’t be with, a bully manager at work and the vampire chieftain who wants him dead. Fortunately, Reginald discovers he has a few unrecognized powers of his own.', 'Imagine a world populated by beautiful, fit and vain vampires. Reginald Andres tumbles headlong into it as an unlikely hero who will have to navigate every kind of obstacle – the girl he loves but can’t be with, a bully manager at work and the vampire chieftain who wants him dead. Fortunately, Reginald discovers he has a few unrecognized powers of his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38kvKPyz7u3iTbip1tg4hXSLfsh.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:155437'),
  ('382543096210319953', 'Region', 2003, 'Comedy, Crime, Family', null, null, 'Leonid Yarmolnik, Tatyana Dogileva, Aleksandr Mokhov, Semyon Morozov, Yuriy Kuznetsov, Nadezhda Markina, Anna Snatkina, Svetlana Varetskaya', null, 'Policeman Pavel Kravtsov is a rather strange man. If he has to handcuff someone, he apologizes and asks if he is pressing. He is ambitious but honest; he is young but thoughtful. With such inclinations, you can''t really make a career in the city police. So a city man, senior Lieutenant Kravtsov, gets through to the remote village of Anisovka by an ordinary district police officer.', 'Policeman Pavel Kravtsov is a rather strange man. If he has to handcuff someone, he apologizes and asks if he is pressing. He is ambitious but honest; he is young but thoughtful. With such inclinations, you can''t really make a career in the city police. So a city man, senior Lieutenant Kravtsov, gets through to the remote village of Anisovka by an ordinary district police officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ywEqXWIWc0uZlizcwam0zBk7GyM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61693'),
