  ('304023827697180744', 'Regular Show', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'J.G. Quintel', 'J.G. Quintel', 'J.G. Quintel, William Salyers, Mark Hamill, Sam Marin, Minty Lewis, Matthew Mercer, Vanessa Marshall', 'TV-PG', 'The surreal misadventures of two best friends - a blue jay and a raccoon - as they seek to liven up their mundane jobs as groundskeepers at the local park.', 'The surreal misadventures of two best friends - a blue jay and a raccoon - as they seek to liven up their mundane jobs as groundskeepers at the local park.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mS5SLxMYcKfUxA0utBSR5MOAWWr.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:31132'),
  ('885651654385594829', 'Reideen', 2007, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shin-ichiro Miki, Keiji Fujiwara, Saeko Chiba, Masataka Azuma, Takako Honda, Hirofumi Nojima', null, 'Reideen is a Japanese animated television series remake of the 1975 Super Robot anime Brave Raideen. It was produced by Production I.G and directed by Mitsuru Hongo. Which was originally broadcast on the satellite network WOWOW in 2007.', 'Reideen is a Japanese animated television series remake of the 1975 Super Robot anime Brave Raideen. It was produced by Production I.G and directed by Mitsuru Hongo. Which was originally broadcast on the satellite network WOWOW in 2007.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/em5c6BFT7g5lS81nDueAlr4JaaM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34775'),
  ('595999938200865312', 'Reign', 2013, 'Drama', 'Laurie McCarthy, Stephanie Sengupta', null, 'Adelaide Kane, Will Kemp, Dan Jeannotte, Megan Follows, Celina Sinden, Craig Parker, Jonathan Goad, Rachel Skarsten', 'TV-14', 'Mary, Queen of Scots, faces political and sexual intrigue in the treacherous world of the French court.', 'Mary, Queen of Scots, faces political and sexual intrigue in the treacherous world of the French court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epNfFs0gPyrpekecpzyX0XTkZgI.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:48865'),
  ('1143829782034721383', 'Reign of the Seven Spellblades', 2023, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Bokuto Uno', null, 'Atsushi Tamaru, Yuka Nukui, Hitomi Ohwada, Misuzu Yamada, Riho Sugiyama, Shinsuke Sugawara', 'TV-14', 'It’s springtime at Kimberly Magic Academy, and new students are beginning their first year. Among them are a skilled and studious boy, Oliver, and a headstrong samurai girl, Nanao. They soon form a unique bond in the halls of Kimberly, but this picturesque school isn’t what it seems. Dark secrets and endless danger lurk behind every corner. Can these wizards make it to graduation alive?!', 'It’s springtime at Kimberly Magic Academy, and new students are beginning their first year. Among them are a skilled and studious boy, Oliver, and a headstrong samurai girl, Nanao. They soon form a unique bond in the halls of Kimberly, but this picturesque school isn’t what it seems. Dark secrets and endless danger lurk behind every corner. Can these wizards make it to graduation alive?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqjLHtt539Sm6aasMvlJ7tuBr4i.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:153337'),
  ('44331949148453165', 'Reign Supreme', 2022, 'Drama', 'Hélier Cisterne, Katell Quillévéré, David Elkaïm', null, 'Melvin Boomer, Anthony Bajon, Laïka Blanc-Francard, Andranic Manet, Joshua Raccah, Victor Bonnel, Léo Chalié, Yannick Choirat', null, 'In the 80s, the beginnings of french hip hop told through the birth of the french rap band NTM and the ascension of dancer and graffiti artist Lady V and DJ Dee Nasty.', 'In the 80s, the beginnings of french hip hop told through the birth of the french rap band NTM and the ascension of dancer and graffiti artist Lady V and DJ Dee Nasty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f1sONdnwAR9fJNW7rp5VmGjGYTl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121171'),
  ('286701563489853424', 'Reign: The Conqueror', 1999, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Hiroshi Aramata', null, 'Satsuki Yukino, Atsuko Tanaka, Nachi Nozawa, Hochu Otsuka, Koichi Yamadera, Toshihiko Seki, Daisuke Gori, Kohsuke Meguro', 'TV-14', 'In the 4th century B.C., a pagan shaman prophesies that Olympias, Queen of Macedonia, wife of King Phillip II will give birth to a baby who will grow up to destroy the world, and the baby named Alexander. Years later, Alexander with many successful campaigns unifies Persia and Macedonia, so great that it makes Aristotle worry that the world can be destroyed by Alexander''s advance toward the East...', 'In the 4th century B.C., a pagan shaman prophesies that Olympias, Queen of Macedonia, wife of King Phillip II will give birth to a baby who will grow up to destroy the world, and the baby named Alexander. Years later, Alexander with many successful campaigns unifies Persia and Macedonia, so great that it makes Aristotle worry that the world can be destroyed by Alexander''s advance toward the East...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ojGaczms0oztjf0xuOY1pEqxkk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35508'),
  ('1014881547866181915', 'Reilly: Ace of Spies', 1983, 'Crime, Drama', 'Troy Kennedy Martin', 'Robin Bruce Lockhart', 'Sam Neill', 'NR', 'Reilly, Ace of Spies is a 1983 television miniseries dramatising the life of Sidney Reilly, a Russian Jew who became one of the greatest spies ever to work for the British. Among his exploits, in the early 20th-century, were the infiltration of the German General Staff in 1917 and a near-overthrow of the Bolsheviks in 1918. His reputation with women was as legendary as his genius for espionage.', 'Reilly, Ace of Spies is a 1983 television miniseries dramatising the life of Sidney Reilly, a Russian Jew who became one of the greatest spies ever to work for the British. Among his exploits, in the early 20th-century, were the infiltration of the German General Staff in 1917 and a near-overthrow of the Bolsheviks in 1918. His reputation with women was as legendary as his genius for espionage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xsM7xRTIoba2J70eaRnlThureUS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12026'),
  ('422690687386683260', 'Reincarnated', 1979, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Norman Tsui Siu-Keung, Eric Wan Tin-Chiu, Erica Choi Hiu-Yee, Law Chung-Wah, Yeung Chung, Sidney Yim, Pat Poon, Jiing Mak', null, 'Reincarnated is a 60 episode 1979 wuxia television series and was produced and aired by Rediffusion Television in Hong Kong and also a series of books, TV and films written by Wong Ying who co-wrote some of Gu Long stories, such as the Six Spine-Chilling Stories Series and other people.', 'Reincarnated is a 60 episode 1979 wuxia television series and was produced and aired by Rediffusion Television in Hong Kong and also a series of books, TV and films written by Wong Ying who co-wrote some of Gu Long stories, such as the Six Spine-Chilling Stories Series and other people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bYMRh9Wo81nyrneZ8VVNGTrjqKd.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:17454'),
  ('477232711673820810', 'Reincarnated as a Dragon Hatchling', 2026, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shunichi Toki, Ami Koshimizu, Miku Ito, Rie Kugimiya, Tomori Kusunoki', 'TV-14', 'A hero, reborn as an egg in a forest surrounded by beasts, aims to become the strongest dragon, despite lacking fighting skills or magic powers.', 'A hero, reborn as an egg in a forest surrounded by beasts, aims to become the strongest dragon, despite lacking fighting skills or magic powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPMmOoyHEMUW4l5FAnox8lQmBjh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:285291'),
  ('754860212839507830', 'Reincarnated as a Sword', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shin-ichiro Miki, Ai Kakuma, Ami Koshimizu, Wataru Hatano, Tetsu Inada, Rumi Okubo, Shinpachi Tsuji', 'TV-14', 'Reincarnated as a sentient weapon with memories of his past life, but not his name, a magical sword saves a young beastgirl from a life of slavery. Fran, the cat-eared girl, becomes his wielder, and wants only to grow stronger, while the sword wants to know why he is here. Together, the strange duo''s journey has only just begun!', 'Reincarnated as a sentient weapon with memories of his past life, but not his name, a magical sword saves a young beastgirl from a life of slavery. Fran, the cat-eared girl, becomes his wielder, and wants only to grow stronger, while the sword wants to know why he is here. Together, the strange duo''s journey has only just begun!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZ3VZVc7iyF7KtIjERBGEedVXqA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:134667'),
  ('174471951520480566', 'Reindeer Mafia', 2023, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', null, 'Mika Kurvinen', 'Samuli Edelmann, Anna-Maija Tuokko, Aake Kalliala, Mikael Persbrandt, Olavi Uusivirta, Rea Mauranen, Rune Temte, Paavo Westerberg', null, 'Poromafia is a crime saga tinged with black humor, centered on the internal power struggle of a family ruling the northern wilderness. The northern matriarch leaves behind an inheritance, which divides the family''s lands among the family. However, the wills tear the family apart as buried secrets come to light.', 'Poromafia is a crime saga tinged with black humor, centered on the internal power struggle of a family ruling the northern wilderness. The northern matriarch leaves behind an inheritance, which divides the family''s lands among the family. However, the wills tear the family apart as buried secrets come to light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8t1o1kaZJ9UZ175pamXJrwYkkNH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:219136'),
