  ('955448345020693981', 'Release that Witch', 2026, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Chen Zhangtaikang, Qiao Su, Guo Zhengjian, Lu Lifeng', null, 'Roland, a modern man reborn as a prince in the dangerous Border Town, rescues the witches Anna and Nana Pine from the Church. Harnessing their extraordinary powers, he fuses magic and technology to craft weapons, armies, and steam engines to defend his people. As the Demon Moon rises and conspiracies close in on his family, Roland must lead a revolution to protect his allies and reshape the world.', 'Roland, a modern man reborn as a prince in the dangerous Border Town, rescues the witches Anna and Nana Pine from the Church. Harnessing their extraordinary powers, he fuses magic and technology to craft weapons, armies, and steam engines to defend his people. As the Demon Moon rises and conspiracies close in on his family, Roland must lead a revolution to protect his allies and reshape the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ZfiXCxh28by13SW4pDmRTVHoOA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:298026'),
  ('489100139537367732', 'Release the Spyce', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Sorasaki F., Takahiro', null, 'Yukari Anzai, Akane Fujita, Manami Numakura, Aya Suzaki, Mikako Komatsu, Yuri Noguchi, Aya Uchida, Shizuka Itoh', null, 'The series is about a girl named Momo who attends high school at the city of Sorasaki. However, she is secretly a member of Tsukikage, an intelligence agency that protects people. As a new member of the agency, she works alongside her colleagues including her senior Yuki and friends. Together, they work to establish peace in the city.', 'The series is about a girl named Momo who attends high school at the city of Sorasaki. However, she is secretly a member of Tsukikage, an intelligence agency that protects people. As a new member of the agency, she works alongside her colleagues including her senior Yuki and friends. Together, they work to establish peace in the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bebou99kYubm1xYBpiO0psbxYRM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82905'),
