  ('1104346989851608736', 'RI:SE', 2002, null, null, null, 'Mark Durden-Smith, Kate Lawler, Liz Bonnin, Sue Perkins, Mel Giedroyc, Colin Murray, Helen Chamberlain, Kirsty Gallacher', null, 'RI:SE is a breakfast television show made by Princess Productions in collaboration with BSkyB for Channel 4 in the United Kingdom. It was scheduled to replace The Big Breakfast after declining ratings. It launched on 29 April 2002. The programme was broadcast between 06:55 and 09:00 in the morning - nationally in the UK.', 'RI:SE is a breakfast television show made by Princess Productions in collaboration with BSkyB for Channel 4 in the United Kingdom. It was scheduled to replace The Big Breakfast after declining ratings. It launched on 29 April 2002. The programme was broadcast between 06:55 and 09:00 in the morning - nationally in the UK.', null, 2, 'tmdb:tv:2484'),
  ('1148632716118675410', 'Rich Man, Poor Man', 1976, 'Drama, Soap', 'Irwin Shaw', null, 'Peter Strauss, Nick Nolte, Susan Blakely, Ed Asner, Dorothy McGuire, Bill Bixby, Ray Milland, Robert Reed', null, 'Based on the best-selling 1969 novel by Irwin Shaw, the series follows the divergent career courses of the impoverished German American Jordache brothers.', 'Based on the best-selling 1969 novel by Irwin Shaw, the series follows the divergent career courses of the impoverished German American Jordache brothers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8LmpOZ8JVzHEgHGLi3opMWsqOdt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14733'),
  ('805766718969911755', 'Rich Man, Poor Woman', 2012, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Shun Oguri, Arata Iura, Satomi Ishihara, Saki Aibu, Yōsuke Asari, Yasuhi Nakamura, Aiku Maikawa, Kiyohiko Ueki', null, 'Hyuga began his career with a website he built out of interest. Later, he developed an IT company and became a billionaire while Makoto encountered a lot of hardships in job hunting. Their personalities were radically different. Even though they faced a lot of conflicts ever since they first met, they were gradually attracted by each other and went through a lot of things together.', 'Hyuga began his career with a website he built out of interest. Later, he developed an IT company and became a billionaire while Makoto encountered a lot of hardships in job hunting. Their personalities were radically different. Even though they faced a lot of conflicts ever since they first met, they were gradually attracted by each other and went through a lot of things together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1zmTsNAHVg4XVTgLevuFyPH0HE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45938'),
  ('1075302347113394838', 'Rich Man, Poor Woman', 2018, 'Comedy', null, 'Hwang Jo-yoon, Park Jeong-ye', 'Suho, Ha Yeon-soo, Oh Chang-seok, Park Sung-hoon, Kim Ye-won, Yoon Da-young, Lee Jae-jin, Kim Min-ji', null, 'A man who can’t distinguish faces meets a woman who is unforgettable. Lee Yoo Chan is the founder and CEO of the IT company Next One, which has become the most desirable place to work. He suffers from a condition where he can’t recognize faces, and this makes him very guarded and mistrustful of most people. Kim Bo Ra is the pride of her hometown on Jeju Island who came to Seoul to attend college. With her imminent graduation, her dream is to work for Next One. When Bo Ra meets Yoo Chan, will both their lives change in unexpected ways?', 'A man who can’t distinguish faces meets a woman who is unforgettable. Lee Yoo Chan is the founder and CEO of the IT company Next One, which has become the most desirable place to work. He suffers from a condition where he can’t recognize faces, and this makes him very guarded and mistrustful of most people. Kim Bo Ra is the pride of her hometown on Jeju Island who came to Seoul to attend college. With her imminent graduation, her dream is to work for Next One. When Bo Ra meets Yoo Chan, will both their lives change in unexpected ways?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/77PP7SfgONe8AgdTHXg3nHwExQo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79064'),
  ('692742553249071170', 'Richard & Judy', 2001, 'Talk', 'Judy Finnigan, Richard Madeley', null, 'Richard Madeley, Judy Finnigan', null, 'Richard &amp; Judy was a British chat show presented by the married couple Richard Madeley and Judy Finnigan. The show originally aired on Channel 4, from 2001 to 2008, but later moved to digital channel, Watch, in October 2008. The programme featured a number of celebrities and a book club. Its final episode aired in July 2009 due to low ratings.', 'Richard &amp; Judy was a British chat show presented by the married couple Richard Madeley and Judy Finnigan. The show originally aired on Channel 4, from 2001 to 2008, but later moved to digital channel, Watch, in October 2008. The programme featured a number of celebrities and a book club. Its final episode aired in July 2009 due to low ratings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGBCP2UOeZhX0GijSI8NZX6xxXt.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:4027'),
  ('793271120235819802', 'Richard Hammond''s Big', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Richard Hammond', null, 'Richard Hammond embarks on a global adventure to explore the world’s biggest structures and machines and discover how engineers build, maintain and use them.', 'Richard Hammond embarks on a global adventure to explore the world’s biggest structures and machines and discover how engineers build, maintain and use them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4xMgDP7lkeetMvXejdyIbEqXbUF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97979'),
  ('49427771123773981', 'Richard Hammond''s Invisible Worlds', 2010, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Richard Hammond', 'NR', 'Using state-of-the-art technologies, Richard Hammond goes beyond the limits of the naked eye and explores the hidden secrets of the invisible world around us.', 'Using state-of-the-art technologies, Richard Hammond goes beyond the limits of the naked eye and explores the hidden secrets of the invisible world around us.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oFIvw2vd14tMwrzxrnefBNS60n8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:33973'),
  ('726356562987695652', 'Richard Hammond''s Workshop', 2021, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, 'Richard Hammond, Anthony Greenhouse', null, 'Richard Hammond trades his jet-setting lifestyle for a long-standing dream to set up a classic car restoration workshop close to his home in Herefordshire. With the help of skilled craftsmen, he navigates the ups and downs of building a new business.', 'Richard Hammond trades his jet-setting lifestyle for a long-standing dream to set up a classic car restoration workshop close to his home in Herefordshire. With the help of skilled craftsmen, he navigates the ups and downs of building a new business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBuKrhOa6m3GTvvSNuOFPP2IlBQ.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:136638'),
  ('351969066217712066', 'Richard Osman''s House of Games', 2017, 'Comedy, Talk', null, null, 'Richard Osman', null, 'Each week a group of four famous faces go toe to toe in testing their general knowledge skills in a variety of entertaining games.', 'Each week a group of four famous faces go toe to toe in testing their general knowledge skills in a variety of entertaining games.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWMXxw4JPjHv6NzozU5dmAdialX.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:103960'),
  ('424617389454003196', 'Riches', 2022, 'Drama', 'Abby Ajayi', null, 'Deborah Ayorinde, Hugh Quarshie, Sarah Niles, Brendan Coyle, Hermione Norris', null, 'Stephen Richards has built a cosmetics empire, but when he suffers a stroke, his family''s secrets and lies rise to the surface and the future of his multi-million-pound company is at stake.', 'Stephen Richards has built a cosmetics empire, but when he suffers a stroke, his family''s secrets and lies rise to the surface and the future of his multi-million-pound company is at stake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g4oVHnbi7V7PJYOGSxizxuzj6gK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211772'),
  ('752380004060597', 'Richie Rich', 1980, 'Animation, Family', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Nancy Cartwright, Frank Welker, Christian Hoff, Sparky Marcus, Stan Jones, Joan Gerber, Dick Beals, William Callaway', 'TV-G', 'Richie Rich is an animated television series produced by Hanna-Barbera Productions that aired on ABC from 1980 to 1984 and again in 1988 as part of the weekend/weekday programming block The Funtastic World of Hanna-Barbera, Based upon Harvey Comics'' popular Richie Rich comic book characters, the series shared time slots with Scooby-Doo and Scrappy-Doo, The Little Rascals, and Pac-Man over its original broadcast run. The other most visible character was Richie''s dog, the appropriately named Dollar. The show airs occasionally on Boomerang; Boomerang''s reruns feature the theme from The Richie Rich/Scooby-Doo Show and Scrappy Too! over the closing credits.', 'Richie Rich is an animated television series produced by Hanna-Barbera Productions that aired on ABC from 1980 to 1984 and again in 1988 as part of the weekend/weekday programming block The Funtastic World of Hanna-Barbera, Based upon Harvey Comics'' popular Richie Rich comic book characters, the series shared time slots with Scooby-Doo and Scrappy-Doo, The Little Rascals, and Pac-Man over its original broadcast run. The other most visible character was Richie''s dog, the appropriately named Dollar. The show airs occasionally on Boomerang; Boomerang''s reruns feature the theme from The Richie Rich/Scooby-Doo Show and Scrappy Too! over the closing credits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fhrIXZDVK3wc3FlX394ASanVH8a.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:3026'),
  ('1080473112145183747', 'Richie Rich', 2015, 'Family, Comedy, Kids, Drama', 'Jeff Hodsden, Tim Pollock', null, 'Jake Brennan, Brooke Wexler, Kiff VandenHeuvel, Lauren Taylor, Joshua Carlon, Jenna Ortega', 'TV-PG', 'Richie Rich is a boy who turned vegetables into a clean energy source. As a result, Rich now has over a trillion dollars. Rich lives with his family in a mansion filled with toys, contraptions, and his best friends Darcy and Murray are always by his side, along with Irona, Richie''s robot maid, his dad Cliff, who loves naps and is a bit dense, and his jealous sister Harper. Also, Darcy loves spending money and Murray doesn''t want anything out of budget.', 'Richie Rich is a boy who turned vegetables into a clean energy source. As a result, Rich now has over a trillion dollars. Rich lives with his family in a mansion filled with toys, contraptions, and his best friends Darcy and Murray are always by his side, along with Irona, Richie''s robot maid, his dad Cliff, who loves naps and is a bit dense, and his jealous sister Harper. Also, Darcy loves spending money and Murray doesn''t want anything out of budget.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlFxrggqMC5NA6rtFdm81zUEnw4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62626'),
  ('178350662974709924', 'Rick and Morty', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Dan Harmon, Justin Roiland', null, 'Chris Parnell, Spencer Grammer, Sarah Chalke, Ian Cardoni, Harry Belden', 'TV-14', 'Follows a sociopathic genius scientist who drags his inherently timid grandson on adventures across the universe.', 'Follows a sociopathic genius scientist who drags his inherently timid grandson on adventures across the universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WGRQ8FpjkDTzivQJ43t94bOuY0.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:60625'),
  ('917294315044814845', 'Rick and Morty: The Anime', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Yohei Tadano, Keisuke Chiba, Akiha Matsui, Manabu Muraji, Takako Fuji, Hitomi Sasaki', 'TV-14', 'It''s life mostly as usual for the Smith family. Rick is in a pseudo-world, Summer helps Space Beth and Morty''s in love. And they''re all an anime.', 'It''s life mostly as usual for the Smith family. Rick is in a pseudo-world, Summer helps Space Beth and Morty''s in love. And they''re all an anime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQFPw9W3EO6ZLhg3TI782edq9Fr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:202282'),
  ('952619621449689040', 'Ricochet Rabbit & Droop-a-Long', 1964, 'Animation, Comedy, Western, Kids', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Don Messick, Mel Blanc', null, 'Taking place in a Wild West setting, Ricochet Rabbit works as a sheriff in the town of Hoop ''n'' Holler. Ricochet bounces off stationary objects yelling "Bing-bing-bing!" His deputy and foil Droop-a-Long Coyote is not as fast and is very clumsy.', 'Taking place in a Wild West setting, Ricochet Rabbit works as a sheriff in the town of Hoop ''n'' Holler. Ricochet bounces off stationary objects yelling "Bing-bing-bing!" His deputy and foil Droop-a-Long Coyote is not as fast and is very clumsy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4O2NpSaVkj3ROeKzkJc6idOyl7c.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96547'),
  ('489869060800128230', 'Ridatemi mia moglie', 2021, null, 'Giovanni Bognetti, Alessandro Genovesi', 'Alessandro Genovesi, Giovanni Bognetti', 'Fabio De Luigi, Anita Caprioli, Carla Signoris, Diego Abatantuono, Diana Del Bufalo, Alessandro Betti', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7CdJeP8UG8IkMoTCl2IsvfJzjeI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:131725'),
  ('590424254968519463', 'Riddle Story of Devil', 2014, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Ayaka Suwa, Hisako Kanemoto, Yoshino Nanjo, Azumi Asakura, Mami Uchida, Sachika Misawa', 'TV-14', 'The "Class Black," 10th Grade of Myōjō Academy is composed of 12 assassins disguised as students and one target: Haru Ichinose. Fully aware of being the prey, Ichinose vows to survive assassination attempts and graduate from the school alive. One of the assassins, Tokaku Azuma, has started building up feelings for Ichinose and switched side to become her protector. Together they have to face the onslaught from their classmates of 11 assassins.', 'The "Class Black," 10th Grade of Myōjō Academy is composed of 12 assassins disguised as students and one target: Haru Ichinose. Fully aware of being the prey, Ichinose vows to survive assassination attempts and graduate from the school alive. One of the assassins, Tokaku Azuma, has started building up feelings for Ichinose and switched side to become her protector. Together they have to face the onslaught from their classmates of 11 assassins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rfmsXihfuUodPTB4lirJtTcYkKN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60845'),
  ('1083367256989005464', 'Ride', 2016, 'Family, Action & Adventure, Drama, Documentary', 'Jill Girling, Lori Mather-Welch', null, 'Alana Boden, Rameet Rauli, Kendra Leigh Timmins, Oliver Dench, Jonny Gray, Natalie Lisinska, Manuel Pacific, Sara Botsford', 'TV-Y', 'The adventures of Katherine '' Kit'' Bridges who relocates to England when her father joins the faculty at Covington Academy, an elite equestrian boarding school.', 'The adventures of Katherine '' Kit'' Bridges who relocates to England when her father joins the faculty at Covington Academy, an elite equestrian boarding school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cewmFMFZ3Pejumn5onEIWHHhZhI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69867'),
  ('185763856868664440', 'Ride', 2023, 'Drama, Western', 'Sherri Cooper-Landsman', null, 'Nancy Travis, Tiera Skovbye, Beau Mirchoff, Sara Alicia Garcia, Jake Foy, Tyler Jacob Moore', null, 'Follows the lives of the Murrays as they struggle to keep their beloved ranch afloat.', 'Follows the lives of the Murrays as they struggle to keep their beloved ranch afloat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1wyw44AXs8Sw3lRVHPuowk3xsd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211562'),
  ('342166218165872613', 'Ride Back', 2009, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Nana Mizuki, Romi Park, Rikiya Koyama, Megumi Toyoguchi, Megumi Matsumoto', null, 'After ex-dancer Rin trades her stage career for college life, she forms an unusual connection with a robotic RideBack motorcycle—Fuego. As a tyrannical new government oppresses the population and crushes civil liberties, Rin may have no choice but to gun Fuego’s engines and speed directly into the heart of the fight for freedom.', 'After ex-dancer Rin trades her stage career for college life, she forms an unusual connection with a robotic RideBack motorcycle—Fuego. As a tyrannical new government oppresses the population and crushes civil liberties, Rin may have no choice but to gun Fuego’s engines and speed directly into the heart of the fight for freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c3xPlnsN8nP9VGaHfOK8jVSDOxw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:30987'),
  ('415095074635072308', 'Ride the Wind', 2020, 'Reality', null, null, 'Stephanie Siao, Angelica Lee Sin-Jie, Christine Fan, Li Xiaoran, Zhao Ziqi, Jill Hsu, Wen Zhengrong, 乌兰图雅', null, 'A chinese variety show which features 30 female celebrities all over 30 years old who must compete to debut in a seven-member girlsband.', 'A chinese variety show which features 30 female celebrities all over 30 years old who must compete to debut in a seven-member girlsband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3ZzkYM26UZ536SzQIhIcswtdGO.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:104716'),
  ('1118211898802818072', 'Ride the Wind 2025', 2025, 'Reality', '任洋', null, 'Xie Na, Qi Sijun', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/61DJMqFUFX6222ctnzuQEJLYdUT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:286995'),
  ('848631574024487773', 'Ride Upon the Storm', 2017, 'Drama', 'Adam Price', 'Andreas Garfield, Poul Berg, Karina Dam', 'Lars Mikkelsen, Ann Eleonora Jørgensen, Simon Sears, Morten Hee Andersen, Fanny Louise Bernth, Joen Højerslev, Camilla Lau, Maj-Britt Mathiesen', 'TV-MA', 'The story centers on a family of priests: Johannes, Elisabeth and their sons August and Christian. Johannes is God-like to his sons - he gives, loves, and punishes. His favoritism for August and his disappointment with Christian forces both into making desperate choices in order to either gain his love or break free from him.', 'The story centers on a family of priests: Johannes, Elisabeth and their sons August and Christian. Johannes is God-like to his sons - he gives, loves, and punishes. His favoritism for August and his disappointment with Christian forces both into making desperate choices in order to either gain his love or break free from him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8eqZPWEZCD4lkRgw2KMQlL13LnM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:74145'),
  ('273669100036155031', 'Ride with Norman Reedus', 2016, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, 'Norman Reedus', 'TV-14', 'The Walking Dead star and motorcycle enthusiast Norman Reedus hits the open road to explore local biker culture and celebrate the best and brightest collectors, mechanics and craftsmen around the country. Each episode features Reedus and a riding companion – a fellow actor, musician, friend or local chopper fanatic – as they journey to custom bike shops, tattoo parlors, collector’s warehouses, or a roadside smokehouse… with plenty of time for unplanned detours and tire changes.', 'The Walking Dead star and motorcycle enthusiast Norman Reedus hits the open road to explore local biker culture and celebrate the best and brightest collectors, mechanics and craftsmen around the country. Each episode features Reedus and a riding companion – a fellow actor, musician, friend or local chopper fanatic – as they journey to custom bike shops, tattoo parlors, collector’s warehouses, or a roadside smokehouse… with plenty of time for unplanned detours and tire changes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQyDwNVO88PK2l8rQLaGR2mW6od.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:66402'),
  ('1117900957626985861', 'Ridiculousness', 2011, 'Comedy, Talk, Reality', 'Rob Dyrdek', null, 'Rob Dyrdek, Chanel West Coast, Sterling ''Steelo'' Brim', 'TV-14', 'Rob Dyrdek takes the funniest amateur internet videos and builds them into an episode of edgy, funny, and most importantly, timeless television.', 'Rob Dyrdek takes the funniest amateur internet videos and builds them into an episode of edgy, funny, and most importantly, timeless television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4rJdcHQrE4stnZTEAP0m4gnlVQi.jpg', 50, 'tmdb:tv:38657'),
  ('406280207782026568', 'Riding in Darkness', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', null, 'Ulf Kvensler', 'Jonas Karlsson, Hanna Ardéhn, Malin Persson, Saga Samuelsson, Amanda Jansson', null, 'This is a survival thriller, based on true events. Three women with different connections to one man need to find a way to get out of the monster''s grip. Will they be believed or can he manipulate the surroundings once again.', 'This is a survival thriller, based on true events. Three women with different connections to one man need to find a way to get out of the monster''s grip. Will they be believed or can he manipulate the surroundings once again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSJxtsUv9mw8dfKtYuQCSeRFdHF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213328'),
  ('72442307562469783', 'Ridley', 2022, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Paul Matthew Thompson, Jonathan Fisher', null, 'Adrian Dunbar, Bronagh Waugh, Terence Maynard, George Bukhari, Julie Graham, Georgie Glen, Bhavna Limbachia, Tareq Al-Jeddal', null, 'Retired Detective Inspector Alex Ridley is lured back into service as a consultant detective when his former protégée, Carol Farman, needs help cracking a complex murder case.', 'Retired Detective Inspector Alex Ridley is lured back into service as a consultant detective when his former protégée, Carol Farman, needs help cracking a complex murder case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gdvihv6BhxYDWquoQbZctlVSBwS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:132306'),
  ('1054891575911397788', 'Ridley Jones', 2021, 'Animation, Kids', 'Chris Nee', null, 'Iara Nemirovsky, iris menas, Laraine Newman, David Errigo Jr., Tyler Shamy, Ashlyn Madden', 'TV-Y', 'Curious kid Ridley and her friends protect the Museum of Natural History’s treasures and keep its magical secret safe: Everything comes alive at night!', 'Curious kid Ridley and her friends protect the Museum of Natural History’s treasures and keep its magical secret safe: Everything comes alive at night!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6BzkRAldoqpolMuAmNa9XnbMw83.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:127289'),
  ('749865920901945445', 'Ridley Road', 2021, 'Drama', 'Sarah Solemani', 'Sarah Solemani', 'Agnes O''Casey, Tom Varey, Rory Kinnear, Eddie Marsan, Danny-Boy Hatchard, Rita Tushingham, Gabriel Akuwudike, James Craze', null, 'During London''s swinging sixties, young Jewish Vivien Epstein follows her lover into danger and when he is caught between life and death, she finds herself going undercover with the fascists, not only for him but for the sake of her country.', 'During London''s swinging sixties, young Jewish Vivien Epstein follows her lover into danger and when he is caught between life and death, she finds herself going undercover with the fascists, not only for him but for the sake of her country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6fUvGknVpFpTEC5byjTEae6u3gm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:134050'),
  ('550613773595922681', 'Rien ne t''efface', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Anne Rambach, Marine Rambach', null, 'Gwendoline Hamon, Benjamin Baroche, Lannick Gautry, Fauve Hautot, Bruno Debrandt, Samy Gharbi, Flore Bonaventura, Mathieu Madénian', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rOKrzI4ufYXRcBpT5SzMeIzCQcv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:251352'),
  ('598181690020104193', 'Riese: Kingdom Falling', 2009, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kaleena Kiff', null, 'Christine Chatelain, Ben Cotton, Allison Mack, Ryan Robbins, Emilie Ullerup, Alessandro Juliani, Sharon Taylor, Patrick Gilmore', 'TV-14', 'Riese: Kingdom Falling is a science fiction-fantasy series which debuted online on November 2, 2009. The series is about a traveller named Riese, who flees across the wartorn lands of Eleysia with her wolf, Fenrir. Hunted by a terrifying religious group, The Sect, Riese must evade the assassins that have been sent to kill her and discover their true objective.', 'Riese: Kingdom Falling is a science fiction-fantasy series which debuted online on November 2, 2009. The series is about a traveller named Riese, who flees across the wartorn lands of Eleysia with her wolf, Fenrir. Hunted by a terrifying religious group, The Sect, Riese must evade the assassins that have been sent to kill her and discover their true objective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mGA7lqZ3AKLOPQ8KmjXRYxx2V41.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31254'),
  ('1044568182978108855', 'Rififi', 2025, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Vassilis Risvas, Dimitra Sakali', 'Vassilis Risvas, Dimitra Sakali', 'Vassilis Haralambopoulos, Panos Vlahos, Prometheus Aleifer, Evaggelia Moumouri, Hristos Hatzipanagiotis, Vladimiros Kiriakidis, Dimos Gigantakis, Achilleas Zervas', null, '"RIFIFI" is inspired by the notorious bank robbery that took place in Athens in 1992. Who carried it out and why? The authorities spoke of organized crime, terrorist groups, and highly educated, ruthless perpetrators. But was it really like that? Through the power of fiction, the new production by COSMOTE TV combines the biggest heist ever committed in Greece with a true story of human tragedy, creating a character-driven series full of emotion and strong elements of humor.', '"RIFIFI" is inspired by the notorious bank robbery that took place in Athens in 1992. Who carried it out and why? The authorities spoke of organized crime, terrorist groups, and highly educated, ruthless perpetrators. But was it really like that? Through the power of fiction, the new production by COSMOTE TV combines the biggest heist ever committed in Greece with a true story of human tragedy, creating a character-driven series full of emotion and strong elements of humor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ngCwoSAGQBB1qKnPinRInmvfMDj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:306114'),
  ('370041692727881273', 'Rig 45', 2018, 'Crime', 'Per Hanefjord', 'Roland Ulvselius, Ola Norén, Alexander Kantsjö', 'Natalie Gumede, Ciarán McMenamin, Lisa Henni, Julie McLellan, Rune Temte, Maria Erwolter, Jermaine Liburd, Andrei Alén', null, 'When Andrea, a damage regulator from Benthos Oil, is sent out to Rig 45 two days before Christmas to investigate a fatal accident, the rig is hit by a hurricane and all communications lost. Soon, the crew realize that the accident is in fact a murder, and they now know that they are in real danger.', 'When Andrea, a damage regulator from Benthos Oil, is sent out to Rig 45 two days before Christmas to investigate a fatal accident, the rig is hit by a hurricane and all communications lost. Soon, the crew realize that the accident is in fact a murder, and they now know that they are in real danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrTE8fy8Hvx71QjdJcipG9MqWMw.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:80210'),
  ('111431738334876855', 'Right Here Waiting for You', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy, Mystery', 'Liu Tong', 'Liu Tong', 'Li Guangjie, Sun Qian, Fei Qiming, Jelly Xu, Xin Yunlai, Zhang Zhi-Lu, Yuki Hsu, Chen Sisi', 'TV-14', 'A middle-aged man time travels to the past to become a teacher to his 17-year-old classmates. Hao Hui Gui is a 36-year-old high school teacher who is still single. During a gathering, he gets into a huge disagreement with everyone present and even gets into a fistfight with his best friend. Upon returning home, he mindlessly flips through his personal diary from 20 years ago and starts to recall many memories from the past. He falls asleep eventually and meets with his younger self in his dreams.', 'A middle-aged man time travels to the past to become a teacher to his 17-year-old classmates. Hao Hui Gui is a 36-year-old high school teacher who is still single. During a gathering, he gets into a huge disagreement with everyone present and even gets into a fistfight with his best friend. Upon returning home, he mindlessly flips through his personal diary from 20 years ago and starts to recall many memories from the past. He falls asleep eventually and meets with his younger self in his dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wu2y8J9yeRcEvdA3s7RORrcDp1j.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93877'),
  ('1095397605896799113', 'Rigo', 2023, 'Drama', null, 'César Augusto Betancourt', 'Juan Pablo Urrego, Ana María Estupiñán, Sandra Reyes, Ramiro Meneses, Ella Becerra, Andrea Guzmán, Sebastián Toro, Sebastián Gutiérrez', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cpNVaiWGuKcUubMQgq3Ee6F9HBq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:236873'),
  ('973007152568640222', 'Rikuoh', 2017, 'Drama', 'Jun Ikeido', null, 'Koji Yakusho, Kento Yamazaki, Haruka Uchimura, Ayako Yoshitani, Yasuko Haru, Kotaro Shiga, Masato Wada, Yoshihisa Amano', 'TV-PG', 'A CEO struggling to maintain his small sock business risks the company''s future with a new challenge — creating a line of running shoes.', 'A CEO struggling to maintain his small sock business risks the company''s future with a new challenge — creating a line of running shoes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LfrZbz9gMc60xeZ9oaPZcB5pQ1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74706'),
