  ('463160418176789518', 'Rimti Reikalai', 2018, 'Crime', null, 'Edvinas Rekašius', null, null, 'An abundance of stories, an energetic storytelling style and an ironic approach to situations - this is the new LNK series "Rimti Reikalai". Released after five years in prison, the criminal Hard finds himself at the epicenter of bloody events. The criminal gang to which he belonged breaks up, and a fierce battle begins for the chair of the mafia boss.', 'An abundance of stories, an energetic storytelling style and an ironic approach to situations - this is the new LNK series "Rimti Reikalai". Released after five years in prison, the criminal Hard finds himself at the epicenter of bloody events. The criminal gang to which he belonged breaks up, and a fierce battle begins for the chair of the mafia boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/RI8faRw1Q0grBP5W7nkN8mb9dS.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:224527'),
  ('964628086155821252', 'Rin-ne', 2015, 'Comedy, Animation', null, null, 'Kaito Ishikawa, Marina Inoue', 'TV-PG', 'As a child Sakura Mamiya mysteriously disappeared in the woods behind her grandma''s home. She returned whole and healthy, but since then she has had the power to see ghosts. Now a teenager, she just wishes the ghosts would leave her alone! At school, the desk next to Sakura''s has been empty since the start of the school year, then one day her always-absent classmate shows up, and he''s far more than what he seems!', 'As a child Sakura Mamiya mysteriously disappeared in the woods behind her grandma''s home. She returned whole and healthy, but since then she has had the power to see ghosts. Now a teenager, she just wishes the ghosts would leave her alone! At school, the desk next to Sakura''s has been empty since the start of the school year, then one day her always-absent classmate shows up, and he''s far more than what he seems!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aWTAIftIb2pEnOPyXRDgpscJOKK.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:62601'),
  ('100762274043055708', 'Rin: Daughters of Mnemosyne', 2008, 'Animation, Mystery, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Mamiko Noto, Rie Kugimiya, Akira Ishida, Sayaka Ohara, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Kaori Nazuka, Emiri Kato, Rie Tanaka', 'TV-MA', 'Rin Asōgi may look like an ordinary office lady on the outside but she is actually a private investigator taking on any jobs, from finding a stray cat to infiltrating a high-security corporate lab. What''s more, she appears literally indestructible, supernaturally healing any injuries and mutilations. Together with her partner Mimi, Rin delves into the darkest secrets of the society but the ones she hides herself are by far more sinister...', 'Rin Asōgi may look like an ordinary office lady on the outside but she is actually a private investigator taking on any jobs, from finding a stray cat to infiltrating a high-security corporate lab. What''s more, she appears literally indestructible, supernaturally healing any injuries and mutilations. Together with her partner Mimi, Rin delves into the darkest secrets of the society but the ones she hides herself are by far more sinister...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dP4ASok5d48UycHnhG7BP4XCmU6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42953'),
  ('66924456804325544', 'Rina', 1977, 'Soap, Drama', 'Inés Rodena', 'Inés Rodena, Luis Reyes de la Maza', 'Ofelia Medina, Enrique Álvarez Félix, María Rubio, Carlos Ancira, Alicia Rodríguez Fernández, Ana Laura Maldonado, Rafael Llamas, Alicia Encinas', null, 'Rina is a Mexican telenovela, which was produced by and broadcast on Televisa in 1977. It was written by Inés Rodena and starred Ofelia Medina as a hunchback named Rina and Enrique Álvarez Félix as her love interest. Since the original, several remakes have been produced under different names: ⁕La italianita ⁕Rubí rebelde ⁕María Mercedes ⁕Inocente de Ti ⁕Maria Esperança', 'Rina is a Mexican telenovela, which was produced by and broadcast on Televisa in 1977. It was written by Inés Rodena and starred Ofelia Medina as a hunchback named Rina and Enrique Álvarez Félix as her love interest. Since the original, several remakes have been produced under different names: ⁕La italianita ⁕Rubí rebelde ⁕María Mercedes ⁕Inocente de Ti ⁕Maria Esperança', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oW23fjFNlCxMP6CZ4Crg0n7BQSZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12798'),
  ('973541522195614638', 'Ring of Fire', 2012, 'Drama', null, 'Michael Vickerman', 'Michael Vartan, Lauren Lee Smith, Terry O''Quinn, Ian Tracey, Agam Darshi, Brian Markinson, Brendan Fletcher, Adam Greydon Reid', 'NR', 'When an oil rig causes an eruption in a small town, it''s just the first in a series that could affect the dangerous Ring of Fire that contains most of the world''s volcanoes. If these cataclysmic eruptions cannot be stopped, the Earth could be headed for an extinction level event.', 'When an oil rig causes an eruption in a small town, it''s just the first in a series that could affect the dangerous Ring of Fire that contains most of the world''s volcanoes. If these cataclysmic eruptions cannot be stopped, the Earth could be headed for an extinction level event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3QS11lTqOWFYjewYmmyebAD4WJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:56242'),
  ('734635116716879043', 'Ring: The Final Chapter', 1999, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Kōji Suzuki', null, 'Tae Kimura, Kotomi Kyono, Tomoya Nagase, Akiko Yada, Aya Okamoto, Kei Yamamoto, Toshiro Yanagiba, Hitomi Kuroki', null, 'Ring: The Final Chapter is a television series, produced in Japan, based on the Ring movie series. There are a total of 12 episodes in the series and a sequel was made called Rasen, consisting of 13 episodes.', 'Ring: The Final Chapter is a television series, produced in Japan, based on the Ring movie series. There are a total of 12 episodes in the series and a sequel was made called Rasen, consisting of 13 episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1eZwWOVrMJs0eEkwAt26Xuen23Z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16287'),
  ('350229102696639658', 'Ringer', 2011, 'Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Sarah Michelle Gellar, Kristoffer Polaha, Ioan Gruffudd, Nestor Carbonell, Mike Colter', 'TV-14', 'Six months after deciding to pull herself together and get sober, Bridget witnesses a murder. Realizing her life is in danger and not trusting the FBI to protect her, she runs to her wealthy twin sister, Siobhan, in New York. Things start out well—with the two patching up a fractured relationship—when Siobhan suddenly goes missing. Bridget assumes her sister''s identity, but soon learns that Siobhan''s life is not as perfect as it looks and she is no safer than she was before.', 'Six months after deciding to pull herself together and get sober, Bridget witnesses a murder. Realizing her life is in danger and not trusting the FBI to protect her, she runs to her wealthy twin sister, Siobhan, in New York. Things start out well—with the two patching up a fractured relationship—when Siobhan suddenly goes missing. Bridget assumes her sister''s identity, but soon learns that Siobhan''s life is not as perfect as it looks and she is no safer than she was before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t27TSKDVmGwrH8NQjyQuPvKSmo5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35341'),
  ('1086787044582715051', 'Ringlstetter', 2016, 'Talk, Comedy', null, null, 'Carolin Matzko, Hannes Ringlstetter', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qDIGlzQkAC3pMreJGQLyKREtdI9.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:104269'),
  ('1024338492577066143', 'Ringo, la pelea de su vida', 2019, 'Drama', 'Adrián Suar, Lucero Suárez', null, 'José Ron, Mariana Torres, Jorge Poza, César Évora Díaz, Silvia Mariscal, Otto Sirgo, Luz Ramos, Óscar Bonfiglio', null, 'Ringo is a young man, who has dedicated his life to boxing, and at the peak of his career he loses the national title upon receiving the news of the death of his brother. From that moment, Ringo decides to retire from boxing. Gloria, his wife, leaves him to go live with El Turco, Ringo''s main rival in the ring. Gloria''s decision leaves Ringo alone in charge of the care of his son Santi. Then, Gloria will return to claim custody of her son, and in that situation, Ringo will have to obtain a job that provides fixed income, to keep custody of his son. He decides to return to boxing with the clear goal to be crowned champion.', 'Ringo is a young man, who has dedicated his life to boxing, and at the peak of his career he loses the national title upon receiving the news of the death of his brother. From that moment, Ringo decides to retire from boxing. Gloria, his wife, leaves him to go live with El Turco, Ringo''s main rival in the ring. Gloria''s decision leaves Ringo alone in charge of the care of his son Santi. Then, Gloria will return to claim custody of her son, and in that situation, Ringo will have to obtain a job that provides fixed income, to keep custody of his son. He decides to return to boxing with the clear goal to be crowned champion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lUkVJPd70pxDBzCoNtfgUsVHKLB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87956'),
  ('1121770263876243582', 'Ringo. Glory and Death', 2023, 'Drama', 'Nicolás Pérez Veiga', null, 'Jerónimo Bosia, Delfina Chaves, María Onetto, Martín Slipak, Renato Quattordio, Thomas Grube, Lucila Gandolfo, Germán de Silva', 'TV-MA', 'After a string of bad contacts, Argentina’s greatest heavyweight boxer, Oscar “Ringo” Bonavena, arrives in Nevada in 1976 seeking to restart his career. There, Ringo unknowingly stumbles into the criminal world of Joe Conforte, who promises Ringo a bright future. But a bright future would not come, nor a sought-after rematch against Ali, as the boxer would be found dead in three months'' time.', 'After a string of bad contacts, Argentina’s greatest heavyweight boxer, Oscar “Ringo” Bonavena, arrives in Nevada in 1976 seeking to restart his career. There, Ringo unknowingly stumbles into the criminal world of Joe Conforte, who promises Ringo a bright future. But a bright future would not come, nor a sought-after rematch against Ali, as the boxer would be found dead in three months'' time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hT8KLz6zRLfjklJErVEfHIpYVlD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127447'),
  ('22306203208147525', 'Rinko-san Wants to Try', 2021, 'Drama', 'Fujita Mio', null, 'Kaho Takada, Shota Totsuka, Kenta Izuka, Miwako Kakei, Hiroki Iijima, Yun, Rika Makino, Yume Hayashi', 'TV-MA', 'Rinko Amaki is a successful 27-year-old woman who works at a busy wedding planning agency. She excels at her job to such an extent that she is promoted to lead her unit. She is popular, beautiful, and hard-working, but there is just one thing that frustrates her: Despite being surrounded by loved-up couples and romance all day at work for years, she is still single. And on top of that, she has never made love. She wants to lose her virginity, but has never found the right man. In a twist of fate, her male co-worker Gen Kamisaka, another wildly successful wedding planner is in the exact same predicament. Also aged 27, he has never had any intimate relations with a woman. The duo, having discovered they share the same “problem,” decides to do something about it. But they soon discover that work and physical intimacy are not easy to balance. And while they might have initially envisaged a quick and fuss-free fling, Cupid might have other plans for them...', 'Rinko Amaki is a successful 27-year-old woman who works at a busy wedding planning agency. She excels at her job to such an extent that she is promoted to lead her unit. She is popular, beautiful, and hard-working, but there is just one thing that frustrates her: Despite being surrounded by loved-up couples and romance all day at work for years, she is still single. And on top of that, she has never made love. She wants to lose her virginity, but has never found the right man. In a twist of fate, her male co-worker Gen Kamisaka, another wildly successful wedding planner is in the exact same predicament. Also aged 27, he has never had any intimate relations with a woman. The duo, having discovered they share the same “problem,” decides to do something about it. But they soon discover that work and physical intimacy are not easy to balance. And while they might have initially envisaged a quick and fuss-free fling, Cupid might have other plans for them...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZ8ZUTtsQQZDdEn4lutVoCYvTu1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:136770'),
  ('724138829730575072', 'Rinshi!! Ekoda-chan', 2019, 'Animation', null, null, 'Romi Park, Haruka Ishida, Chiemi Chiba, Yuiko Tatsumi, Suzuko Mimori, Rumi Shishido, Ami Koshimizu, Megumi Koshouji', null, 'Ekoda-chan is from the countryside, living alone in the city. She''s a temp worker and a strong, carefree soul, with no solid plan for the future, who doesn''t care much about guys. She talks about how she lives her life and provides support to all those women trying to survive in the real life society.', 'Ekoda-chan is from the countryside, living alone in the city. She''s a temp worker and a strong, carefree soul, with no solid plan for the future, who doesn''t care much about guys. She talks about how she lives her life and provides support to all those women trying to survive in the real life society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pF7sm6tTg3dwusKfebPhcAWDyZl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83117'),
  ('548806378568644622', 'Riot Police', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', 'Rodrigo Sorogoyen, Isabel Peña', null, 'Victoria Luengo, Raúl Arévalo, Álex García, Hovik Keuchkerian, Roberto Álamo, Raúl Prieto, Patrick Criado, David Llorente', 'TV-MA', 'A fictionalised look into the human tragedy of riot police and police brutality in Spain.', 'A fictionalised look into the human tragedy of riot police and police brutality in Spain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJyARtlOZfwONBoCGLhxtpunwYL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96005'),
  ('306729198602083458', 'Ripe Town', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', null, '王铮', 'Bai Yufan, Ning Li, Xiang Hanzhi, Liu Yitong, Zhang Haowei, Zeng Li, Yu Yao, Zong Juntao', null, 'In the 37th year of the Wan Li Period of the Ming Dynasty, there were successive murders in the county seat of Jiangnan County. The identities of the dead were different and unrelated to each other. The corpses were arranged in bizarre poses, and there was a sentence left at the scene of each case. As the apprentice of the first victim, Xiaohu Kuaiqu Sanren cooperated with his friends to launch an investigation. With the deepening of the investigation, the three religions and nine streams, local farmers, workers and merchants of all colors appeared one after another. Amidst the fog, an old case from ten years ago surfaced. Who would the murderer be and for what purpose?', 'In the 37th year of the Wan Li Period of the Ming Dynasty, there were successive murders in the county seat of Jiangnan County. The identities of the dead were different and unrelated to each other. The corpses were arranged in bizarre poses, and there was a sentence left at the scene of each case. As the apprentice of the first victim, Xiaohu Kuaiqu Sanren cooperated with his friends to launch an investigation. With the deepening of the investigation, the three religions and nine streams, local farmers, workers and merchants of all colors appeared one after another. Amidst the fog, an old case from ten years ago surfaced. Who would the murderer be and for what purpose?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9T6iuw0VpTVjOFzN36WeOHVCcgE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233959'),
  ('717610474723133365', 'RIPLEY', 2024, 'Drama', 'Steven Zaillian', null, 'Andrew Scott, Dakota Fanning, Johnny Flynn', 'TV-MA', 'A grifter in 1960s New York is hired to convince a wealthy man''s son to return home from Italy and begins a life of deceit, fraud and murder.', 'A grifter in 1960s New York is hired to convince a wealthy man''s son to return home from Italy and begins a life of deceit, fraud and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rpSo8z9alultGVTqQ3dkLEyU8xx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94028'),
  ('680649582152148018', 'Ripley''s Believe It or Not!', 1982, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Jack Palance, Cathie Shirriff, Marie Osmond, Holly Palance', 'TV-14', 'Strange occurrences, odd historical facts and unusual artistic and social activities are explored. Ripley''s Believe It or Not! is the name of several documentary television series based on the newspaper feature. The first series aired on NBC from 1949 to 1950, and was hosted by Robert L. Ripley until his death. The series was revived again on ABC, running from 1982 to 1986, and was hosted primarily by Jack Palance.', 'Strange occurrences, odd historical facts and unusual artistic and social activities are explored. Ripley''s Believe It or Not! is the name of several documentary television series based on the newspaper feature. The first series aired on NBC from 1949 to 1950, and was hosted by Robert L. Ripley until his death. The series was revived again on ABC, running from 1982 to 1986, and was hosted primarily by Jack Palance.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:42088'),
  ('641568812772579939', 'Ripley''s Believe It or Not!', 2000, 'Documentary, Family, Reality', null, null, 'Gregory Jbara, Dean Cain, Kelly Packard', 'NR', 'Explorer Michael Ripley''s adventures were chronicled in this animated series based on the popular newspaper feature and live-action television shows. Michael---who had inherited his famous uncle Robert''s fortune and his entire museum collection---joined forces with a documentarian and an accident-prone computer wizard to examine various bizarre happenings.', 'Explorer Michael Ripley''s adventures were chronicled in this animated series based on the popular newspaper feature and live-action television shows. Michael---who had inherited his famous uncle Robert''s fortune and his entire museum collection---joined forces with a documentarian and an accident-prone computer wizard to examine various bizarre happenings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hp1a0UJTEy6Yy6e6CCXudXgSV59.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:37864'),
  ('14694159168525466', 'Ripper Street', 2012, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Richard Warlow', null, 'Matthew Macfadyen, Adam Rothenberg, MyAnna Buring, Charlene McKenna, Matthew Lewis', 'TV-MA', 'A drama set in the East End of London in 1889, during the aftermath of the "Ripper" murders. The action centres around the notorious H Division – the police precinct from hell – which is charged with keeping order in the chaotic streets of Whitechapel. Ripper Street explores the lives of characters trying to recover from the Ripper''s legacy, from crimes that have not only irretrievably altered their lives, but the very fabric of their city. At the drama''s heart our detectives try to bring a little light into the dark world they inhabit.', 'A drama set in the East End of London in 1889, during the aftermath of the "Ripper" murders. The action centres around the notorious H Division – the police precinct from hell – which is charged with keeping order in the chaotic streets of Whitechapel. Ripper Street explores the lives of characters trying to recover from the Ripper''s legacy, from crimes that have not only irretrievably altered their lives, but the very fabric of their city. At the drama''s heart our detectives try to bring a little light into the dark world they inhabit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6w8yKYsA7RkuyauW224kBZQebFt.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:46930'),
  ('113252033714237342', 'Rippers', 2026, null, null, null, 'Marouane Meftah, Bilal Wahib, Ahlaam Teghadouini, Teun Kuilboer, Mike Weerts, Jeroen van Koningsbrugge, Holly Mae Brood, Raymond Thiry', null, 'Rippers is about a war between rival gangs that ends with a brutal robbery of an underground opium plantation in Eindhoven. Those pulling the strings in that heist are the people you would least expect: three young guys planning to make off with the loot themselves.', 'Rippers is about a war between rival gangs that ends with a brutal robbery of an underground opium plantation in Eindhoven. Those pulling the strings in that heist are the people you would least expect: three young guys planning to make off with the loot themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f7vClKT75D1xliL3SxrcC9mZeZ0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:314295'),
  ('788673439650884735', 'Ripping Yarns', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Michael Palin, Terry Jones', null, 'Michael Palin', null, 'A British television comedy series, written by Michael Palin and Terry Jones of Monty Python fame. Following an initial pilot episode in January 1976, it ran for two subsequent series of five and three episodes in October 1977 and October 1979 respectively. Each episode had a different setting and characters, looking at a different aspect of British culture and parodying pre-World War II literature aimed at schoolboys.', 'A British television comedy series, written by Michael Palin and Terry Jones of Monty Python fame. Following an initial pilot episode in January 1976, it ran for two subsequent series of five and three episodes in October 1977 and October 1979 respectively. Each episode had a different setting and characters, looking at a different aspect of British culture and parodying pre-World War II literature aimed at schoolboys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/urCGtnlAdFDTw44TJ8bx7rVlGwl.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:854'),
  ('57641452644502428', 'Ripple', 2025, 'Drama', 'Michele Giannusa', null, 'Frankie Faison, Julia Chan, Ian Harding, Sydney Agudong, Isabella Astbury', 'TV-PG', 'In New York City, four strangers navigate life''s challenges while their separate paths unexpectedly intertwine in ways that change them forever.', 'In New York City, four strangers navigate life''s challenges while their separate paths unexpectedly intertwine in ways that change them forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/exoDCWUEF7dTpCdatH23OammvQ7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:263346'),
  ('285042199955143867', 'Riptide', 1984, 'Crime, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Frank Lupo, Stephen J. Cannell', null, 'Perry King, Joe Penny, Thom Bray', 'NR', 'The cases of a private investigations agency run by two Vietnam War veterans and their computer geek friend from high school, armed with toughness, their own helicopter, and the third''s technical ability.', 'The cases of a private investigations agency run by two Vietnam War veterans and their computer geek friend from high school, armed with toughness, their own helicopter, and the third''s technical ability.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bw5CgVgGDbPSX6YMo81x1ND9s2.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:4379'),
