  ('1122572631601927109', 'Rise of Empires: Ottoman', 2020, 'Documentary, War & Politics, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Charles Dance, Cem Yiğit Üzümoğlu, Daniel Nuță, Ali Gözüşirin, Nik Xhelilaj, Radu Andrei Micu, Tuba Büyüküstün', null, 'Ottoman Sultan Mehmed II wages an epic campaign to take the Byzantine capital of Constantinople and shapes the course of history for centuries.', 'Ottoman Sultan Mehmed II wages an epic campaign to take the Byzantine capital of Constantinople and shapes the course of history for centuries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkvdPFYo7o2IQWooJvA9UE0nvAp.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:96481'),
  ('128987366802736608', 'Rise of the Continents', 2013, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Iain Stewart', null, 'The Earth’s continents are instantly recognizable. These iconic landmasses seem permanent and unchanging, yet they are merely the wreckage of a much larger long-lost supercontinent – Pangaea. In this stunning four part series Professor Iain Stewart uncovers the evidence for this ancient past. He reveals how the world around us is full of clues – in the rocks, the landscapes and even the animals. All of which tell us how the land we live on was created.', 'The Earth’s continents are instantly recognizable. These iconic landmasses seem permanent and unchanging, yet they are merely the wreckage of a much larger long-lost supercontinent – Pangaea. In this stunning four part series Professor Iain Stewart uncovers the evidence for this ancient past. He reveals how the world around us is full of clues – in the rocks, the landscapes and even the animals. All of which tell us how the land we live on was created.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ghZXY4fCR24UqmgOvR66PMDHkpO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60578'),
  ('36207798855814656', 'Rise of the Nazis', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Kate Fleetwood', 'TV-PG', 'How did 20th Century Europe''s most liberal democracy fall into the hands of fascists? From Hitler''s political scheming that turned Germany''s parliament into a House of Cards, his War on Truth leading to book burning, and his scapegoating of minorities, this series explores in extraordinary detail the events leading up to the outbreak of World War II.', 'How did 20th Century Europe''s most liberal democracy fall into the hands of fascists? From Hitler''s political scheming that turned Germany''s parliament into a House of Cards, his War on Truth leading to book burning, and his scapegoating of minorities, this series explores in extraordinary detail the events leading up to the outbreak of World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n2PvgyzjFyqd663idTbToHsvE0K.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:93192'),
  ('927901651252690409', 'Rise of the Raven', 2025, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Robert Lantos, Robert Dornhelm', null, 'L. Gellért Kádár, Vivien Rujder, Murathan Muslu, Franciska Törőcsik, László Mátray, Ernő Fekete, Csémy Balázs, Balázs Medveczky', null, 'The story of János Hunyadi is the epic tale of a hero born into modest circumstances, who, in 1456, with relentless determination and against all odds, vanquished the much larger Ottoman army, halting its drive to conquer the Vatican and overrun Western Europe. In so doing, Hunyadi not only shaped the history of Hungary, but that of all Europe.', 'The story of János Hunyadi is the epic tale of a hero born into modest circumstances, who, in 1456, with relentless determination and against all odds, vanquished the much larger Ottoman army, halting its drive to conquer the Vatican and overrun Western Europe. In so doing, Hunyadi not only shaped the history of Hungary, but that of all Europe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q69nebvjrLU6u131L6HGQyO2OwP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:271050'),
  ('855547623816093638', 'Rise of the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ant Ward, Andy Suriano', null, 'Josh Brener, Ben Schwartz, Omar Benson Miller, Brandon Mychal Smith, Eric Bauza, Kat Graham', 'TV-Y7', 'Rise up! The Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles get an all-new look, new weapons, and awesome new powers! Join the legendary heroes, Raph, Leo, Donnie and Mikey as these brothers discover a Hidden City beneath New York, learn amazing mystic ninja skills, battle absurd mutants… and always find time for a slice of their favorite pizza! Cowabunga!', 'Rise up! The Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles get an all-new look, new weapons, and awesome new powers! Join the legendary heroes, Raph, Leo, Donnie and Mikey as these brothers discover a Hidden City beneath New York, learn amazing mystic ninja skills, battle absurd mutants… and always find time for a slice of their favorite pizza! Cowabunga!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4LZxcn6nWG1yWBKG0RD98HY13b4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:81026'),
