  ('570010201043273655', 'Rising with the Wind', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Gong Jun, Zhong Chuxi, Gao Zhiting, Wu Xuanyi, Morning Chang, Liu Peiqi', null, 'When her family''s business empire collapses, Jiang Hu is determined to save, Tengyue, her father’s shoe brand legacy. But ambitious investor Xu Si, recently returned from Hong Kong, has his own plans for the company. As their opposing visions collide, a fierce battle for control unfolds, with the future of Tengyue hanging in the balance.', 'When her family''s business empire collapses, Jiang Hu is determined to save, Tengyue, her father’s shoe brand legacy. But ambitious investor Xu Si, recently returned from Hong Kong, has his own plans for the company. As their opposing visions collide, a fierce battle for control unfolds, with the future of Tengyue hanging in the balance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZSb43j1O1pRZIwwn0fgCx5XJIP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:152551'),
