  ('719346504466912634', 'Ristorante Paradiso', 2009, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Fumiko Orikasa, Jin Yamanoi, Kazuhiko Nishimatsu, Mitsutaka Tachikawa, Shigeo Kiyama, Yoji Ueda', 'TV-14', 'When she was a child, Nicoletta was taken in by her grandmother so that her mother could remarry. Now grown up, she leaves everything in the countryside behind to visit her mother and her mother''s second husband, a ristorante owner. To her surprise, her stepfather did not know his wife had a daughter! Delicious food and dreamy gentlemen await at the ristorante, casetta dell''orso. For everyone who works there, a tender connection to the hearts of each visitor is spun, and the curtain raises on a story about these first-rate Italian gentlemen in spectacles.', 'When she was a child, Nicoletta was taken in by her grandmother so that her mother could remarry. Now grown up, she leaves everything in the countryside behind to visit her mother and her mother''s second husband, a ristorante owner. To her surprise, her stepfather did not know his wife had a daughter! Delicious food and dreamy gentlemen await at the ristorante, casetta dell''orso. For everyone who works there, a tender connection to the hearts of each visitor is spun, and the curtain raises on a story about these first-rate Italian gentlemen in spectacles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vB0geaRyL3Or4ereDl1VoJOxN9G.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34855'),
  ('682278865966789734', 'Rita', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Christian Torpe', 'Marie Østerbye, Christian Torpe', 'Mille Dinesen, Carsten Bjørnlund, Lise Baastrup, Morten Vang Simonsen, Sara Hjort Ditlevsen, Nikolaj Groth, Ellen Hillingsø, Kristoffer Fabricius', 'TV-14', 'Independent, outspoken and adored by her students, private school teacher Rita fares less well with adults.', 'Independent, outspoken and adored by her students, private school teacher Rita fares less well with adults.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1DVjL6rDc1B73rwYMWSgZMgYSGe.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:51078'),
  ('469359105478941156', 'Rivals', 2024, 'Drama', null, null, 'Alex Hassell, Nafessa Williams, Bella Maclean, Katherine Parkinson, Victoria Smurfit, Claire Rushbrook, Oliver Chris, Lisa McGrillis', 'TV-MA', 'It is 1986 and Britain is booming. "Rivals" dives headfirst into the cutthroat world of TV where hair-dos are big and ambitions are even bigger. Deals are brokered in boardrooms, as well as bedrooms. Nobody can be sure who will come out on top. With every man and woman out only for themselves, can true love really blossom?', 'It is 1986 and Britain is booming. "Rivals" dives headfirst into the cutthroat world of TV where hair-dos are big and ambitions are even bigger. Deals are brokered in boardrooms, as well as bedrooms. Nobody can be sure who will come out on top. With every man and woman out only for themselves, can true love really blossom?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1U5jlDDRaEylEUVbu6mtVbCAUL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:208921'),
  ('1133145570589088275', 'Rivals Forever - The Sneaker Battle', 2017, 'Drama, Family', null, 'Cyrill Boss, Chris Silber, Philipp Stennert', 'Christian Friedel, Hanno Koffler, Hannah Herzsprung, Alina Levshin, Ted Otis, John Keogh, Dirk Borchardt, Rafael Gareisen', null, 'The life and struggle of the Dassler brothers. Founders of the brands of Adidas and Puma.', 'The life and struggle of the Dassler brothers. Founders of the brands of Adidas and Puma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6S02VdlDqzjjfCDmq1xsbwbDdz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77288'),
  ('64525489227891', 'River', 2015, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Abi Morgan', null, 'Stellan Skarsgård, Nicola Walker, Adeel Akhtar, Lesley Manville, Owen Teale, Georgina Rich, Eddie Marsan, Turlough Convery', 'TV-MA', 'Respected police officer John River, a gifted cop with a troubled mind, struggles to come to terms with the recent loss of a colleague, and chases a suspect across London - with tragic consequences. Now at odds with the authorities, River ends up in a precarious position as he seeks to bring closure to the mother of murdered teenager, who blames him for failing to keep his promise.', 'Respected police officer John River, a gifted cop with a troubled mind, struggles to come to terms with the recent loss of a colleague, and chases a suspect across London - with tragic consequences. Now at odds with the authorities, River ends up in a precarious position as he seeks to bring closure to the mother of murdered teenager, who blames him for failing to keep his promise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fhiVcu9RA3MEVQtMowwQUsHJfJR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64158'),
  ('761925679790984418', 'River Monsters', 2009, 'Documentary, Action & Adventure, Reality', null, null, 'Jeremy Wade', 'TV-PG', 'Extreme angler Jeremy Wade is on the hunt for fish with a taste for human flesh. This rip-roaring ride mixes action and adventure with mysteries, edge-of-the-seat chase and a battle of wills between man and nature.', 'Extreme angler Jeremy Wade is on the hunt for fish with a taste for human flesh. This rip-roaring ride mixes action and adventure with mysteries, edge-of-the-seat chase and a battle of wills between man and nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2JhUaEgz8O9n5IBNUZ5aKXFYgMD.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:18150'),
  ('127205536266491719', 'River of Passions', 2016, 'Drama', 'Lilian Viñas, Ramón Pineda', null, 'Natalia Jerez, Jorge Enrique Abello, Carlos Enrique Almirante, Sofia Araujo, Jacqueline Arenal, Jorge Cao, Abel Rodríguez, Diana Hoyos', 'NR', 'The story of Felipe, a farm foreman, who falls in love with Lina. To overcome his financial limitations, Felipe accepts Marcos''s proposal, which involves getting away from it all and assuming a new identity.', 'The story of Felipe, a farm foreman, who falls in love with Lina. To overcome his financial limitations, Felipe accepts Marcos''s proposal, which involves getting away from it all and assuming a new identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nuoduifxcFzEmxI2VjTVRoO7aS6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105499'),
  ('304412407959106142', 'River Where the Moon Rises', 2021, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Kim Sang-hui', 'Han Ji-hoon', 'Kim So-hyun, Na In-woo, Lee Ji-hoon, Choi Yu-hwa, Kwon Hwa-woon, Kim Hee-jung, Ryu Ui-hyun, Wang Bit-na', null, 'Born a princess and raised a soldier, Pyeong Gang is a woman with big dreams and limitless ambition. Determined to become the first Empress of Goguryeo, Pyeong Gang will stop at nothing to make her dream come true. Clever and level headed, Pyeong Gang is well aware of the obstacles that stand in her way and she’s more than capable of taking them on. With meticulous planning, she sets out to make her dream come true. But things take an unexpected turn, the day she meets On Dal.', 'Born a princess and raised a soldier, Pyeong Gang is a woman with big dreams and limitless ambition. Determined to become the first Empress of Goguryeo, Pyeong Gang will stop at nothing to make her dream come true. Clever and level headed, Pyeong Gang is well aware of the obstacles that stand in her way and she’s more than capable of taking them on. With meticulous planning, she sets out to make her dream come true. But things take an unexpected turn, the day she meets On Dal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/diZfYo9Z6AqdK8yfCp8GLzMePqc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:116605'),
  ('260918416667236988', 'River''s Edge Investigative Agency Okawabata', 2014, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Joe Odagiri, Renji Ishibashi, Maya Koizumi, Kyosuke Yabe, Tarō Suwa, Chika Uchida, Hideto Iwai, Rina Koike', null, 'Muraki works for a small detective office situated in downtown Tokyo. He takes frequent naps in between cases, during which he often have dreams with premonitions of his next client''s case. Their clients come up with strange requests that sometimes seem impossible to solve.', 'Muraki works for a small detective office situated in downtown Tokyo. He takes frequent naps in between cases, during which he often have dreams with premonitions of his next client''s case. Their clients come up with strange requests that sometimes seem impossible to solve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2V6v1VrZoGdEWhUDfw3ZNSeL2Kg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71317'),
  ('704904372608733118', 'Riverboat', 1959, 'Western', null, null, 'Darren McGavin, Dick Wessel, Jack Lambert, William D. Gordon, Michael McGreevey, Burt Reynolds, John Mitchum, Bart Patton', 'TV-PG', 'Riverboat is a 44-episode western television series starring Darren McGavin and Burt Reynolds broadcast on the NBC television network from September 13, 1959 until January 2, 1961. It was produced by Revue Studios.', 'Riverboat is a 44-episode western television series starring Darren McGavin and Burt Reynolds broadcast on the NBC television network from September 13, 1959 until January 2, 1961. It was produced by Revue Studios.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zVFyQcQWGtRfsbv2mQQaW9pjitA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:14105'),
