  ('775378870307518155', 'RuPaul''s Drag Race All Stars: UNTUCKED', 2012, 'Reality', null, null, 'RuPaul', 'TV-MA', 'An access-all-areas pass to the drama that you didn''t see on the runway. See what happens behind the scenes when the queens let their tucks breathe... and let their emotions flow.', 'An access-all-areas pass to the drama that you didn''t see on the runway. See what happens behind the scenes when the queens let their tucks breathe... and let their emotions flow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LpE4jiIXtzt42I5NdE0blyeiwr.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:67564'),
