  ('529086783013134382', 'Ruri Rocks', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Miyari Nemoto, Asami Seto', 'TV-14', 'High schooler Ruri Tanigawa loves shiny things. She loves them so much that she heads into the mountains to search for crystals herself—where she unexpectedly meets Nagi Arato, a graduate student studying mineralogy. As the pair start collecting minerals together, Ruri begins developing a genuine appreciation for science and the beauty of the natural world.', 'High schooler Ruri Tanigawa loves shiny things. She loves them so much that she heads into the mountains to search for crystals herself—where she unexpectedly meets Nagi Arato, a graduate student studying mineralogy. As the pair start collecting minerals together, Ruri begins developing a genuine appreciation for science and the beauty of the natural world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHI3fkZMR05PeiB1SN0JADZKfdj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:271649'),
  ('1045407482694197244', 'Rurouni Kenshin', 1996, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Mayo Suzukaze, Miki Fujitani, Mina Tominaga, Yuji Ueda, Mika Doi, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Tomo Sakurai, Yoshito Yasuhara', 'TV-14', 'The Meiji Era was one of great renewal for Japan, where swords and killing were outlawed. However, many survivors from the time of Revolution still live, lurking in the shadows and waiting for a chance to use their killing blades again. Only Kenshin Himura, formerly one of the most brutal of killers, hopes to keep his swordsman''s honor and still live in the new era.', 'The Meiji Era was one of great renewal for Japan, where swords and killing were outlawed. However, many survivors from the time of Revolution still live, lurking in the shadows and waiting for a chance to use their killing blades again. Only Kenshin Himura, formerly one of the most brutal of killers, hopes to keep his swordsman''s honor and still live in the new era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iP6i2AJGkxSugByBRrxNd2Goey8.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:28136'),
  ('341279549009252501', 'Rurouni Kenshin', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Soma Saito, Rie Takahashi, Taku Yashiro, Makoto Koichi, Saori Onishi', 'TV-14', 'Ten years have passed since the end of Bakumatsu, an era of war that saw the uprising of citizens against the Tokugawa shogunate. The revolutionaries wanted to create a time of peace, and a thriving country free from oppression. The new age of Meiji has come, but peace has not yet been achieved. Swords are banned but people are still murdered in the streets. Orphans of war veterans are left with nowhere to go, while the government seems content to just line their pockets with money.', 'Ten years have passed since the end of Bakumatsu, an era of war that saw the uprising of citizens against the Tokugawa shogunate. The revolutionaries wanted to create a time of peace, and a thriving country free from oppression. The new age of Meiji has come, but peace has not yet been achieved. Swords are banned but people are still murdered in the streets. Orphans of war veterans are left with nowhere to go, while the government seems content to just line their pockets with money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zT77Y6iQGmYGBqbhQi0ySD60o9i.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210879'),
  ('313746697494081463', 'Rush', 2008, 'Drama, Crime', 'Christopher Lee, John Edwards', 'Tony McNamara', 'Rodger Corser, Callan Mulvey, Jolene Anderson, Nicole da Silva, Ashley Zukerman, Samuel Johnson, Catherine McClements, Kevin Hofbauer', 'TV-14', 'They are trained to be smarter, tactically superior and technologically advantaged - Melbourne''s answer for a cutting edge trend in policing worldwide. Rush was an Australian television police drama that first screened on Network Ten in September 2008. Set in Melbourne, Victoria, it focuses on the members of a Police Tactical Response team. It is produced by John Edwards and Southern Star. On 10 November 2011, as with Network Ten setting out DVD promotions for the finale of season 4, David Knox of TV Tonight has announced that Rush would not return after 4 years, as the next episode would be its last.', 'They are trained to be smarter, tactically superior and technologically advantaged - Melbourne''s answer for a cutting edge trend in policing worldwide. Rush was an Australian television police drama that first screened on Network Ten in September 2008. Set in Melbourne, Victoria, it focuses on the members of a Police Tactical Response team. It is produced by John Edwards and Southern Star. On 10 November 2011, as with Network Ten setting out DVD promotions for the finale of season 4, David Knox of TV Tonight has announced that Rush would not return after 4 years, as the next episode would be its last.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nit525TLOlV560oXZDQawbcRiRl.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:5566'),
  ('1030947435324932088', 'Rush', 2014, 'Drama', 'Jonathan Levine', null, 'Tom Ellis, Larenz Tate, Rick Gonzalez, Sarah Habel', 'TV-14', 'Dr. William Rush is not your average on-call doctor. He''s not attached to any hospital, he''s highly discreet no matter what the ailment as long as the client can pay his cash-only premium and the doctor can party with the best of them. He has no desire to change his life or how he lives it, until an old flame and his conscience begin to stir things up.', 'Dr. William Rush is not your average on-call doctor. He''s not attached to any hospital, he''s highly discreet no matter what the ailment as long as the client can pay his cash-only premium and the doctor can party with the best of them. He has no desire to change his life or how he lives it, until an old flame and his conscience begin to stir things up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQiWbhicCGDJAgCV60pmfkfFJNB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61096'),
  ('481433812337307738', 'Rush Hour', 2016, 'Crime, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Bill Lawrence', null, 'Justin Hires, Page Kennedy, Wendie Malick, Jonathan Patrick Foo, Aimee Garcia', 'TV-14', 'The series follows Detective Carter, a radical LAPD detective, and Detective Lee, a by-the-book detective from Hong Kong, as they are forced into forming an unlikely partnership', 'The series follows Detective Carter, a radical LAPD detective, and Detective Lee, a by-the-book detective from Hong Kong, as they are forced into forming an unlikely partnership', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vDMkZnP3pHruaqwiVfGi29lJOe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65367'),
  ('526572316985708528', 'Rush TV', null, null, null, null, null, null, 'Rush TV is a primetime show airing Studio 23 in the Philippines. It is basically a variety show, the main difference perhaps is that half the show is packed with segments made by students from the top universities and colleges in and around Metro Manila.', 'Rush TV is a primetime show airing Studio 23 in the Philippines. It is basically a variety show, the main difference perhaps is that half the show is packed with segments made by students from the top universities and colleges in and around Metro Manila.', null, 0, 'tmdb:tv:15379'),
  ('368471298555956401', 'Russell Howard''s Good News', 2009, 'Comedy, News', null, null, 'Russell Howard', 'NR', 'Russell Howard offers his unique perspective on the big stories dominating all of our news outlets, from online and print to broadcast, as well as picking up on those sometimes overlooked things. He uses clips, sketches and studio guests to look at things that have made him smile during the week.', 'Russell Howard offers his unique perspective on the big stories dominating all of our news outlets, from online and print to broadcast, as well as picking up on those sometimes overlooked things. He uses clips, sketches and studio guests to look at things that have made him smile during the week.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDgDEoUGgn3TItWUx1Y1adaEGnn.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:30920'),
  ('245825192336691997', 'Russia 1985-1999: TraumaZone', 2022, 'Documentary, War & Politics', 'Adam Curtis', 'Adam Curtis', 'Mikhail Gorbachev, Boris Yeltsin, Vladimir Putin', null, 'What it felt like to live through the collapse of communism and democracy. A series of films by Adam Curtis.', 'What it felt like to live through the collapse of communism and democracy. A series of films by Adam Curtis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jVIazmo9NvnjIGDxo3dVmwaGBpZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210992'),
  ('1117285906415368418', 'Russian Affairs', 2019, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Konstantin Bogomolov', null, 'Darya Moroz, Marina Zudina, Vladimir Mishukov, Cengiz Coşkun, Sabina Akhmedova, Nikita Efremov, Aleksandra Rebenok, Aleksandra Revenko', null, 'Moscow, present day. The city of big money, passion, gorgeous women and wealthy men, receptions and dangerous intrigue. Dasha, an art historian from the province, who came to the capital, dreams of a new, better life, but a mysterious and cruel incident will change everything.', 'Moscow, present day. The city of big money, passion, gorgeous women and wealthy men, receptions and dangerous intrigue. Dasha, an art historian from the province, who came to the capital, dreams of a new, better life, but a mysterious and cruel incident will change everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6TOmAMpIq3LPU37Jwu4Rnt9CSy5.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:87525'),
  ('446378380467658564', 'Russian Doll', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Natasha Lyonne, Amy Poehler, Leslye Headland', null, 'Natasha Lyonne, Charlie Barnett, Greta Lee, Chloë Sevigny, Elizabeth Ashley', 'TV-MA', 'Nadia keeps dying and reliving her 36th birthday party. She''s trapped in a surreal time loop -- and staring down the barrel of her own mortality.', 'Nadia keeps dying and reliving her 36th birthday party. She''s trapped in a surreal time loop -- and staring down the barrel of her own mortality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ju4vQ1EwlIkQxEgWiYmxOs3iBG.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:84977'),
  ('76336333920253502', 'Russian Dolls: Sex Trade', 2005, 'Crime, Drama', 'Mark Punt, Guy Goossens', 'Guy Goossens, Mark Punt', 'Axel Daeseleire, Manou Kersting, Luk Wyns, Viktorya Kosova, Chalita Chaisaeng, Dirk van Dijck', null, 'Young women from Lithuania and Russia are taken to Belgium by a gang involved in the sex trade to work as sex slaves.', 'Young women from Lithuania and Russia are taken to Belgium by a gang involved in the sex trade to work as sex slaves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQ5uoXngUaMBKcgDXN9YPPz8c5G.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:20790'),
  ('139619134868686136', 'Rust Valley Restorers', 2018, 'Documentary, Reality', 'Matthew Shewchuk, Tyson Hepburn', null, 'Mike Hall, Avery Shoaf, Connor Hall', 'TV-14', 'A crew of car lovers at a garage in the Rocky Mountains transforms abandoned heaps of rust into collectible classics.', 'A crew of car lovers at a garage in the Rocky Mountains transforms abandoned heaps of rust into collectible classics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iie281wQpFiaGq3KBCrN1Yhq3LG.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:85837'),
  ('833448603259620872', 'Rutherford Falls', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Michael Schur, Sierra Teller Ornelas, Ed Helms', null, 'Ed Helms, Jana Schmieding, Michael Greyeyes, Jesse Leigh, Dustin Milligan', null, 'A small town in upstate New York is turned upside down when local legend and town namesake, Nathan Rutherford fights the moving of a historical statue.', 'A small town in upstate New York is turned upside down when local legend and town namesake, Nathan Rutherford fights the moving of a historical statue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lVscDiBXWBVvLa83zwiSW7Ox8L0.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:93748'),
  ('318872304271775314', 'Ruthless Aggression', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'For the first time ever, hear the true stories from those who lived it, and witness the emergence of an entire new generation of Superstars, who would change WWE forever. WWE Ruthless Aggression will feature brand-new interviews with Cena, Batista, Orton, Triple H, Kurt Angle, Mark Henry, Becky Lynch, Kevin Owens, The Miz, Paul Heyman, Bruce Prichard and many more, giving WWE fans firsthand accounts of events that transpired in front of, and behind, the camera. Each episode is also packed with rare and never-before-seen footage, providing unprecedented access to the Ruthless Aggression Era.', 'For the first time ever, hear the true stories from those who lived it, and witness the emergence of an entire new generation of Superstars, who would change WWE forever. WWE Ruthless Aggression will feature brand-new interviews with Cena, Batista, Orton, Triple H, Kurt Angle, Mark Henry, Becky Lynch, Kevin Owens, The Miz, Paul Heyman, Bruce Prichard and many more, giving WWE fans firsthand accounts of events that transpired in front of, and behind, the camera. Each episode is also packed with rare and never-before-seen footage, providing unprecedented access to the Ruthless Aggression Era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKtOkvEGJOwRwWgcU6HFDxk5HV0.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:99462'),
  ('154294152453434161', 'Ruthless City', 2019, 'Drama, Family', 'Cevdet Mercan, Sırma Yanık', null, 'Fikret Kuşkan, Deniz Uğur, Mine Tugay, Ozan Dolunay, Sera Kutlubey, Berker Güven, Simay Barlas, Bahar Şahin', null, 'The life of a disabled guy changes dramatically after a family from a small town comes to Istanbul. How will Seher behave after she learns that her mother-in-law has agreed with Agah Karacay? What will Ceren do when she learns that she is supposed to get married to disabled Nedim instead of Cenk? Will Cemre manage to save Nedim’s life with her care and treatment? Will Seniz manage to keep her secrets? Will Ceren eventually fulfill her dreams of becoming rich? Will Cenk eventually find a true love? How will the life of Karacay family change after the arrival of Seher and her children? Will Nedim become healthy again?', 'The life of a disabled guy changes dramatically after a family from a small town comes to Istanbul. How will Seher behave after she learns that her mother-in-law has agreed with Agah Karacay? What will Ceren do when she learns that she is supposed to get married to disabled Nedim instead of Cenk? Will Cemre manage to save Nedim’s life with her care and treatment? Will Seniz manage to keep her secrets? Will Ceren eventually fulfill her dreams of becoming rich? Will Cenk eventually find a true love? How will the life of Karacay family change after the arrival of Seher and her children? Will Nedim become healthy again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/11vDIfbzW9Yauuymz8QYYlpMDQv.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:88024'),
  ('77976886804711094', 'Ruxx', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Alec Secăreanu, Raluca Aprodu, Șerban Pavlu, Mădălina Craiu, Ioana Bugarin, Alina Chivulescu', 'TV-MA', 'Reliable 30-something Rux’s plans to leave Bucharest to join her long-distance lover in LA are upended when her boss assigns her to his wife’s mayoral race and pairs her with a know-it-all colleague.', 'Reliable 30-something Rux’s plans to leave Bucharest to join her long-distance lover in LA are upended when her boss assigns her to his wife’s mayoral race and pairs her with a know-it-all colleague.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/M92pm8PaUpZ44bLoylMtsfB1Zl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:194635'),
  ('159814785140272770', 'Ruy, the Little Cid', 1980, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Kids', 'Claudio Biern Boyd', 'Joaquín Amichartis, Kōzō Kusuba, Toshiyuki Kashiwakura', 'Ana Ángeles García, Matilde F. Vilariño, Matilde Conesa, Amelia Jara, Teófilo Martínez, Fernando Mateo, Eduardo Moreno, Manuel Peiró', null, 'In war-torn 11th century Spain, Ruy de Vivar, just a boy, dreams of becoming an invincible warrior.', 'In war-torn 11th century Spain, Ruy de Vivar, just a boy, dreams of becoming an invincible warrior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHmsI3dHgm8w2uZacz0jLesSGL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73616'),
  ('1097574285345609459', 'Ruyi''s Royal Love in the Palace', 2018, 'Drama', 'Wang Jun', null, 'Zhou Xun, Wallace Huo, Janine Chang Chun-Ning, Dong Jie, Xin Zhilei, Tong Yao, Li Chun, Hu Ke', null, 'The road to becoming an empress is paved with treachery. Ruyi is a consort who quickly learns to navigate the treacherous politics of the the royal court and move up the ranks. After becoming Empress, Ruyi still must survive the many conspiracies against her. Her relationship with Emperor Qianlong becomes eroded even when Ruyi is able to overcome the challenges. Can Ruyi maintain her role as Empress under such difficult circumstances?', 'The road to becoming an empress is paved with treachery. Ruyi is a consort who quickly learns to navigate the treacherous politics of the the royal court and move up the ranks. After becoming Empress, Ruyi still must survive the many conspiracies against her. Her relationship with Emperor Qianlong becomes eroded even when Ruyi is able to overcome the challenges. Can Ruyi maintain her role as Empress under such difficult circumstances?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d6qA9ENvBpic357ogejhfZSmPZh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81769'),
  ('235391189690758823', 'RWBY', 2013, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Monty Oum', 'Monty Oum', 'Lindsay Jones, Kara Eberle, Arryn Zech, Barbara Dunkelman', 'TV-14', 'The future-fantasy world of Remnant is filled with ravenous monsters, treacherous terrain, and more villains than you can shake a sniper-scythe at. Fortunately, Beacon Academy is training Huntsmen and Huntresses to battle the evils of the world, and Ruby, Weiss, Blake, and Yang are ready for their first day of class.', 'The future-fantasy world of Remnant is filled with ravenous monsters, treacherous terrain, and more villains than you can shake a sniper-scythe at. Fortunately, Beacon Academy is training Huntsmen and Huntresses to battle the evils of the world, and Ruby, Weiss, Blake, and Yang are ready for their first day of class.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pTLBkalS00rc9FSxgdt4bcwWdvH.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:50137'),
  ('332470468634852979', 'RWBY Chibi', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Monty Oum', null, 'Kara Eberle, Miles Luna, Michael Jones, Arryn Zech, Jen Brown, Neath Oum, Lindsay Jones, Jessica Nigri', null, 'Join the cast of RWBY in cute comedy shorts with infinite possibilities! It''s playing tag! It''s baking cookies! It''s posing as police officers! It''s... really quite absurd. It''s RWBY CHIBI!', 'Join the cast of RWBY in cute comedy shorts with infinite possibilities! It''s playing tag! It''s baking cookies! It''s posing as police officers! It''s... really quite absurd. It''s RWBY CHIBI!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9XmS0yDLMpjOIyP9RSoDFSfbYi9.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:68415'),
  ('1114918890751453439', 'RWBY: Ice Queendom', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Saori Hayami, Yoko Hikasa, Yu Shimamura, Ami Koshimizu, Hiro Shimono, Soma Saito, Aya Suzaki, Kazuhiko Inoue', 'TV-14', 'In the world of Remnant, a place where science and fairy tales coexist, human civilization is plagued by deadly monsters known as the Grimm. For a time, victory by the Grimm seemed all but certain, if not for the heroism of those sworn to protect humanity -- Huntsmen and Huntresses. These warriors are trained and assembled into teams at schools like Beacon Academy, where Ruby meets Weiss and Blake -- forming Team RWBY along with Ruby’s sister, Yang. While team RWBY studies to become the greatest Huntresses the world of Remnant has ever known, they are faced with a horrifying threat...', 'In the world of Remnant, a place where science and fairy tales coexist, human civilization is plagued by deadly monsters known as the Grimm. For a time, victory by the Grimm seemed all but certain, if not for the heroism of those sworn to protect humanity -- Huntsmen and Huntresses. These warriors are trained and assembled into teams at schools like Beacon Academy, where Ruby meets Weiss and Blake -- forming Team RWBY along with Ruby’s sister, Yang. While team RWBY studies to become the greatest Huntresses the world of Remnant has ever known, they are faced with a horrifying threat...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vG14o43Bb4zrhDeURQIyht5JALO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:195966'),
  ('88517771908657192', 'Ryan Hansen Solves Crimes on Television', 2017, 'Crime, Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Rawson Marshall Thurber', null, 'Ryan Hansen, Samira Wiley, Wood Harris', 'TV-MA', 'The LAPD thinks it''s a good idea to form a task force partnering actors with homicide detectives.', 'The LAPD thinks it''s a good idea to form a task force partnering actors with homicide detectives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iG94QaTWoOyfenPA5phld2SIVnF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:74216'),
  ('674143747145407382', 'Rykter', 2022, 'Drama', 'Christoffer V. Ebbesen', null, 'Benjamin Ebbesen, Teo Tomczuk, Alisah Sussmann, Sisilja Garen, Martin Storebø Koh, Mathea Onarheim Grønnevik, Serian Elisabeth Jeng', null, 'Erik is forced to move to an island to get away from his past, but you don''t easily run away from rumours, and a broken past.', 'Erik is forced to move to an island to get away from his past, but you don''t easily run away from rumours, and a broken past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vohbfINb7hGPkHsHP68MbHuA0TE.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:210640'),
  ('772107348871031743', 'Ryōmaden', 2010, 'Drama', 'Keishi Otomo', 'Yasushi Fukuda', 'Masaharu Fukuyama, Tatsuomi Hamada, Kiyoshi Kodama, Shinobu Terajima, Tao Tsuchiya, Yoko Maki, Tamiyo Kusakari, Chieko Matsubara', null, 'Ryōmaden is the 49th NHK Taiga drama. It was shown on NHK from January 3 to November 28, 2010 spanning 48 episodes. The story centers on the life of 19th-century Japanese historical figures Iwasaki Yatarō and Sakamoto Ryōma. It has been announced that the series will be aired in several other countries, for example Hong Kong, South Korea, Taiwan and Thailand.', 'Ryōmaden is the 49th NHK Taiga drama. It was shown on NHK from January 3 to November 28, 2010 spanning 48 episodes. The story centers on the life of 19th-century Japanese historical figures Iwasaki Yatarō and Sakamoto Ryōma. It has been announced that the series will be aired in several other countries, for example Hong Kong, South Korea, Taiwan and Thailand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LlZsgainsCjYVyVUTMhOYxY5ax.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31616'),
  ('307628518174958885', 'S -The Last Policeman', 2014, 'Crime, Drama', 'Shunichi Hirano', 'Kazunao Furuya', 'Osamu Mukai, Go Ayano, Kazue Fukiishi, Nao Omori, Joe Odagiri, Yui Aragaki, Anna Tsuchiya, Hiroyuki Ikeuchi', null, 'The NPS (Nationai Police Safetyrescue) was formed to combat extreme crimes like terrorism, which is beyond the scope of the ordinary police force. Their purpose is to catch criminals alive. The elite members in the police organization formed NPS to strengthen the authority of SAT (Special Assault Team). When the NPS cannot solve a crime then they send in SAT. When SAT succeeds their authority strengthens. Ichigo (Osamu Mukai) is a member of NPS. He is a former boxer, but became a police officer at the age of 23. In his second year as a police officer, he was scouted by the NPS. His strength is hand to hand combat at close range. He is also blunt with strangers. Iori (Gou Ayano) is a member of SAT. He is the best shooter in the group and possesses a calm and steady personality. Ichigo and Iori, with their different personalities, find themselves having constant conflicts.', 'The NPS (Nationai Police Safetyrescue) was formed to combat extreme crimes like terrorism, which is beyond the scope of the ordinary police force. Their purpose is to catch criminals alive. The elite members in the police organization formed NPS to strengthen the authority of SAT (Special Assault Team). When the NPS cannot solve a crime then they send in SAT. When SAT succeeds their authority strengthens. Ichigo (Osamu Mukai) is a member of NPS. He is a former boxer, but became a police officer at the age of 23. In his second year as a police officer, he was scouted by the NPS. His strength is hand to hand combat at close range. He is also blunt with strangers. Iori (Gou Ayano) is a member of SAT. He is the best shooter in the group and possesses a calm and steady personality. Ichigo and Iori, with their different personalities, find themselves having constant conflicts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5AyWkFxv0IJWSUXDwSL2M8rv06q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85157'),
  ('107922514480123029', 'S Line', 2025, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Mystery', 'Ahn Joo-Young, Kkomabi', null, 'Lee Soo-hyuk, ARIN, Lee Da-hee, Lee Eun-saem, Kim Dong-young, Lee Gwang-hee, Lee Han-joo, Woo Ji-hyun', 'TV-MA', 'A young woman with the ability to see mysterious red connections between lovers discovers her secret gift is no longer unique when special glasses granting similar powers appear on the black market.', 'A young woman with the ability to see mysterious red connections between lovers discovers her secret gift is no longer unique when special glasses granting similar powers appear on the black market.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7TGolwcia6AI6uvInBOoedAi9Il.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:232402'),
  ('551791545366948039', 's-CRY-ed', 2001, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Goro Taniguchi', null, 'Soichiro Hoshi, Yukari Tamura, Takumi Yamazaki, Ginzo Matsuo, Bin Shimada, Hikaru Midorikawa, Yuko Nagashima, Masayo Kurata', null, 'The aftermath of a mysterious environmental catastrophe has left the land in complete desolation! While mankind has been able to rebuild the city, the catastrophe has caused some humans to undergo genetic mutations granting them special powers and abilities. These genetically enhanced humans are known as Alters. Kazuma has spent his entire life in the wastelands relying on his special powers to survive, but when a secret organization called ‘Holy’ threatens to take away his freedom, he will be left with a choice to join or die. His fight to seek the truth behind the ‘Holy’ will rage and consume humanity and Alter alike!', 'The aftermath of a mysterious environmental catastrophe has left the land in complete desolation! While mankind has been able to rebuild the city, the catastrophe has caused some humans to undergo genetic mutations granting them special powers and abilities. These genetically enhanced humans are known as Alters. Kazuma has spent his entire life in the wastelands relying on his special powers to survive, but when a secret organization called ‘Holy’ threatens to take away his freedom, he will be left with a choice to join or die. His fight to seek the truth behind the ‘Holy’ will rage and consume humanity and Alter alike!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjTNWCwl1fZuYjkJMHg4kYNUpPF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42676'),
  ('841081100450968338', 'S.O.S I''m Falling In Love', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Edwin Valencia, Lucero Suárez', null, 'Leo Herrera, Daniel Arenas, Irán Castillo, Jorge Salinas, César Évora Díaz, Marcelo Córdoba, Juan Martín Jáuregui, Yolanda Ventura', 'TV-PG', 'Alberto falls in love with the daughter of one of the men who wants to close the printing press that his family has run for generations. Although his love is immense, saving the business', 'Alberto falls in love with the daughter of one of the men who wants to close the printing press that his family has run for generations. Although his love is immense, saving the business', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whhwHWXhtNL2UJ80NqelDPl6Fu5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132960'),
  ('511679437811176427', 'S.O.Z: Soldiers or Zombies', 2021, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Nicolás Entel, Miguel Tejada-Flores', null, 'Adria Morales, Sergio Peris-Mencheta, Nery Arredondo, Horacio García Rojas, Fátima Molina', null, 'Drug lord Alonso Marroquín escapes from a Mexican prison in an attempt to go into hiding. A US military secret experiment goes wrong and the elite unit from the Mexican Police that is after Marroquín gets infected, creating a new zombie species. The Army and the zombies end up at the drug lord’s hideout and a battle for human survival begins.', 'Drug lord Alonso Marroquín escapes from a Mexican prison in an attempt to go into hiding. A US military secret experiment goes wrong and the elite unit from the Mexican Police that is after Marroquín gets infected, creating a new zombie species. The Army and the zombies end up at the drug lord’s hideout and a battle for human survival begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/arYdHX708nDq6oWNOSjw6NczWc5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95281'),
  ('726288926449657904', 'S.W.A.T.', 1975, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Lee Stanley, Robert Hamner', null, 'Steve Forrest, Robert Urich, Rod Perry, Mark Shera, James Coleman', 'TV-14', 'S.W.A.T. is an American action/crime drama series about the adventures of a Special Weapons And Tactics team operating in an unidentified California city. A spin-off of The Rookies, the series aired on ABC from February 1975 to April 1976. Like The Rookies, S.W.A.T. was produced by Aaron Spelling and Leonard Goldberg.', 'S.W.A.T. is an American action/crime drama series about the adventures of a Special Weapons And Tactics team operating in an unidentified California city. A spin-off of The Rookies, the series aired on ABC from February 1975 to April 1976. Like The Rookies, S.W.A.T. was produced by Aaron Spelling and Leonard Goldberg.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nqAwPI72AxzFxPevUO2LqM0OFFu.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:11129'),
  ('865972197619944819', 'S.W.A.T.', 2017, 'Crime, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Aaron Rahsaan Thomas, Shawn Ryan', null, 'Shemar Moore, Jay Harrington, David Lim, Patrick St. Esprit, Anna Enger Ritch, Niko Pepaj, Annie Ilonzeh', 'TV-14', 'A Los Angeles S.W.A.T. sergeant is assigned to lead a highly skilled unit in the community where he grew up. Torn between loyalty to the streets, where the cops are sometimes the enemy, and allegiance to his brothers in blue, he strategically straddles the two worlds.', 'A Los Angeles S.W.A.T. sergeant is assigned to lead a highly skilled unit in the community where he grew up. Torn between loyalty to the streets, where the cops are sometimes the enemy, and allegiance to his brothers in blue, he strategically straddles the two worlds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttzrYMdsKWR8PTRLw7uo4noqaOJ.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:71790'),
  ('1052025007381724304', 'Sa Dulo Ng Walang Hanggan', 2001, 'Drama, Family', null, 'Keiko Aquino, Rondel Lindayag', 'Claudine Barretto, Carlos Agassi, Adrian Alandy, Mylene Dizon, Gloria Romero, Helen Gamboa, Ronaldo Valdez, Leandro Muñoz', null, 'Sa Dulo ng Walang Hanggan is a Philippine primetime drama teleserye aired from 26 March 2001 to 28 February 2003 by ABS-CBN.', 'Sa Dulo ng Walang Hanggan is a Philippine primetime drama teleserye aired from 26 March 2001 to 28 February 2003 by ABS-CBN.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:7514'),
  ('593856916356126884', 'Så ska det låta', 1997, 'Reality', 'Philip Kampff, Andy Ruane', null, 'Marika Willstedt, Emanuel Norrby, Sarah Dawn Finer', 'NR', 'Så ska det låta is a Swedish game show, based on the Irish The Lyrics Board. The show was introduced in 1997 and led by Peter Harryson until Peter Settman took over in 2006. Så ska det låta can be watched online at svt play for approximately one month after airing.', 'Så ska det låta is a Swedish game show, based on the Irish The Lyrics Board. The show was introduced in 1997 and led by Peter Harryson until Peter Settman took over in 2006. Så ska det låta can be watched online at svt play for approximately one month after airing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vz9w8YijoH6SvZ9Vvg67igSFmNW.jpg', 25, 'tmdb:tv:31096'),
  ('1135219438369715692', 'Saare Jahan Se Accha: The Silent Guardians', 2025, 'Drama', 'Gaurav Shukla', 'Gaurav Shukla, Bhavesh Mandalia', 'Pratik Gandhi, Tillotama Shome, Sunny Hinduja, Rajat Kapoor, Hemant Kher', 'TV-MA', 'A resilient Indian spy must defeat his counterpart across the border in a battle of wits and tradecraft to sabotage a nuclear program.', 'A resilient Indian spy must defeat his counterpart across the border in a battle of wits and tradecraft to sabotage a nuclear program.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4moj0PXeFILF3mNBJywHqmfBm7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:283610'),
  ('798973128010869151', 'Saas, Bahu Aur Flamingo', 2023, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Homi Adajania', 'Aman Mannan, Saurav Dey, Nandini Gupta', 'Dimple Kapadia, Radhikka Madan, Isha Talwar, Angira Dhar, Varun Mitra, Ashish Verma, Udit Arora, Naseeruddin Shah', 'TV-MA', 'Savitri, the matriarch of a massive cartel in the lawless Borderlands, opens up a battle for succession to find her heir in a murky world of drugs and violence.', 'Savitri, the matriarch of a massive cartel in the lawless Borderlands, opens up a battle for succession to find her heir in a murky world of drugs and violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6r18hrbrPRPknqqSFxahX4JU99E.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:224654'),
  ('1071495202299748741', 'Saber Amar', 2003, 'Drama', 'Casa da Criação, Maria João Mira', 'António Barreira, Miguel Barros, Isabel Jacinto', 'Leonor Seixas, Rodrigo Menezes, Marcantonio Del Carlo, Dina Félix Costa, Sílvia Rizzo, Manuel Melo, Ruy de Carvalho, Maria Emília Correia', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJCTxOrI1drwNCDsghC575w20jc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:194696'),
  ('862129290967078687', 'Saber Marionette J', 1996, 'Animation', 'Satoru Akahori', null, 'Yuka Imai, Megumi Hayashibara, Yuri Shiratori, Akiko Hiramatsu, Takehito Koyasu, Hikaru Midorikawa, Urara Takano, Yuko Mizutani', null, '300 years ago, the interstellar colonization transport, The Mesopotamia, had an accident, setting mankind down on the surface of Terra II. The only survivors were six males. Due to a twist of events, the hard-working Otaru visits the run-down Pioneer Museum, where, remembering his childhood, he sees the painting of a woman, titled: "In the memory of the human female." Suddenly a trap door opens under him, dropping him into a room with a hibernation capsule containing a beautiful female android, a so-called Marionette. Also see: Saber Marionette R', '300 years ago, the interstellar colonization transport, The Mesopotamia, had an accident, setting mankind down on the surface of Terra II. The only survivors were six males. Due to a twist of events, the hard-working Otaru visits the run-down Pioneer Museum, where, remembering his childhood, he sees the painting of a woman, titled: "In the memory of the human female." Suddenly a trap door opens under him, dropping him into a room with a hibernation capsule containing a beautiful female android, a so-called Marionette. Also see: Saber Marionette R', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mhGgJVo31CgWZ3XEXFcYr8d029P.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:25850'),
  ('281146874056624804', 'Saber Rider and the Star Sheriffs', 1987, 'Animation, Western, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, 'Rob Paulsen, Pat Fraley, Pat Musick, Peter Cullen, B.J. Ward, Cam Clarke, Lennie Weinrib, Neil Ross', null, 'In the distant future, humanity has colonized the stars. To maintain peace and order across mankind''s New Frontier, Earth''s Cavalry Command develops the "Ramrod Equalizer Unit", a transforming battleship operated by their elite unit of special operatives, the Star Sheriffs, to defend the settlers of the galaxy. Their biggest threat? The Outriders, a group of extra-dimensional beings that intend to conquer our dimension and enslave humanity with their superior technology and weaponry. Armed with their wits, courage, and of course, Ramrod, it''s up to Saber Rider and his team to stop the Outriders once and for all and bring peace to the universe!', 'In the distant future, humanity has colonized the stars. To maintain peace and order across mankind''s New Frontier, Earth''s Cavalry Command develops the "Ramrod Equalizer Unit", a transforming battleship operated by their elite unit of special operatives, the Star Sheriffs, to defend the settlers of the galaxy. Their biggest threat? The Outriders, a group of extra-dimensional beings that intend to conquer our dimension and enslave humanity with their superior technology and weaponry. Armed with their wits, courage, and of course, Ramrod, it''s up to Saber Rider and his team to stop the Outriders once and for all and bring peace to the universe!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aBAspH0ymilRgCVUixnVJrR2iWy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13889'),
  ('1005275564516586900', 'Saber y Ganar', 1997, 'Family', null, null, 'Jordi Hurtado, Pilar Vázquez, Elisenda Roca', 'NR', 'Saber y ganar, the cultural quiz show of "La 2" hosted by Jordi Hurtado, has celebrated sixteen years on the air, thus becoming the daily program with a longer running time in the history of Spanish television. During the show''s thirty-minute duration three contestants compete in different tests where they have to answer trivia-like questions, putting their mental, reasoning and memory abilities to the test. Most of the questions have a moderate level of difficulty and are spread over six different games: "Cada sabio con su tema", where each contestant answer questions about a given topic of their choice; "La pregunta caliente", where contestants must answer random questions; "El duelo", where two contestants answer questions about a topic that changes daily; "La parte por el todo", where the contestants must figure out what an image, piece of text or piece of music belong to; "La calculadora humana", where the contestant with the second highest score must answer fifteen basic arithmetic operations in 50 seconds in order to keep his/her earnings for the day; and finally "El reto", where the contestant with the least score has to figure out seven words from their root and definition in order to remain in the game. If the contestant loses the "El Reto", a new individual will be chosen to replace him/her the next episode.', 'Saber y ganar, the cultural quiz show of "La 2" hosted by Jordi Hurtado, has celebrated sixteen years on the air, thus becoming the daily program with a longer running time in the history of Spanish television. During the show''s thirty-minute duration three contestants compete in different tests where they have to answer trivia-like questions, putting their mental, reasoning and memory abilities to the test. Most of the questions have a moderate level of difficulty and are spread over six different games: "Cada sabio con su tema", where each contestant answer questions about a given topic of their choice; "La pregunta caliente", where contestants must answer random questions; "El duelo", where two contestants answer questions about a topic that changes daily; "La parte por el todo", where the contestants must figure out what an image, piece of text or piece of music belong to; "La calculadora humana", where the contestant with the second highest score must answer fifteen basic arithmetic operations in 50 seconds in order to keep his/her earnings for the day; and finally "El reto", where the contestant with the least score has to figure out seven words from their root and definition in order to remain in the game. If the contestant loses the "El Reto", a new individual will be chosen to replace him/her the next episode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/32Xh0zXL8Z7TYuVNG2MOEHcqMlh.jpg', 30, 'tmdb:tv:5455'),
  ('305001886915221911', 'SABIKUI BISCO', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ryota Suzuki, Natsuki Hanae, Reina Kondo, Miyu Tomita, Shirou Saitou, Kenjiro Tsuda', 'TV-14', 'Japan’s post-apocalyptic wasteland replete with dust can only be saved by one thing—fungus. Bisco Akaboshi, a wanted criminal and skilled archer, searches for a legendary mushroom, known as Sabikui, said to devour any and all rust. Joining him on this epic saga to save the country is a giant crab and a young doctor. Can this unlikely trio find the fabled fungi and save the land?', 'Japan’s post-apocalyptic wasteland replete with dust can only be saved by one thing—fungus. Bisco Akaboshi, a wanted criminal and skilled archer, searches for a legendary mushroom, known as Sabikui, said to devour any and all rust. Joining him on this epic saga to save the country is a giant crab and a young doctor. Can this unlikely trio find the fabled fungi and save the land?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0svbwWz6I0qOoR8pFIDoAiSFCW.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:120142'),
  ('77113777428582642', 'Sabine Christiansen', 1998, 'Talk', null, null, 'Sabine Christiansen', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 10, 'tmdb:tv:64193'),
  ('282887973484279318', 'Sabrina, the Teenage Witch', 1996, 'Comedy, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Nell Scovell', null, 'Melissa Joan Hart, Elisa Donovan, Soleil Moon Frye, Nick Bakay', 'TV-G', 'On her sixteenth birthday, Sabrina Spellman discovers she has magical powers. She lives with her 600-year-old aunts Hilda and Zelda as well as talking cat Salem in the fictional town of Westbridge, Massachusetts.', 'On her sixteenth birthday, Sabrina Spellman discovers she has magical powers. She lives with her 600-year-old aunts Hilda and Zelda as well as talking cat Salem in the fictional town of Westbridge, Massachusetts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNhj3coHNVVJPVM7fm5PEYVTCMO.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:605'),
  ('804093467349091239', 'Sabrina: The Animated Series', 1999, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Savage Steve Holland, Kat Likkel', null, 'Emily Hart, Melissa Joan Hart, Nick Bakay, Jay Brazeau, Jason Michas, David Sobolov, Chantal Strand, Cree Summer', 'TV-Y7', 'An animated prequel to the live-action show "Sabrina, the Teenage Witch," the series features 12-year-old Sabrina Spellman, who''s half mortal and half witch. Though few people know of her powers, and her mortal uncle frequently warns her not to use her magic to solve problems, Sabrina still borrows spells from the Spookie Jar and gets into trouble with her friend Harvey.', 'An animated prequel to the live-action show "Sabrina, the Teenage Witch," the series features 12-year-old Sabrina Spellman, who''s half mortal and half witch. Though few people know of her powers, and her mortal uncle frequently warns her not to use her magic to solve problems, Sabrina still borrows spells from the Spookie Jar and gets into trouble with her friend Harvey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qWO7Abwft8GyHBtGx96AFRPUpFZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:733'),
  ('707488076179220485', 'Sabrina''s Secret Life', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Britt McKillip, Maurice LaMarche, Alexandra Collins, Christopher Gaze, Jane Mortifee, Michael Monroe Heyward, Moneca Stori, Shannon Chan-Kent', null, 'Sabrina enrolls in secret witchcraft training classes while attending her normal high school, but discovers she must share her clandestine instruction and her regular school with Portia, a snooty young witch from the “other side”. Thus the stage is set for magical mayhem in the craziest, weirdest, most mixed-up world of all: high school.', 'Sabrina enrolls in secret witchcraft training classes while attending her normal high school, but discovers she must share her clandestine instruction and her regular school with Portia, a snooty young witch from the “other side”. Thus the stage is set for magical mayhem in the craziest, weirdest, most mixed-up world of all: high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x82BNRrjMHIxHZak8RiitDTwCc2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4900'),
  ('431698125067963599', 'Sabuesos', 2018, 'Action & Adventure, Mystery, Family, Comedy, Crime', 'David Cotarelo, Roberto Serrano, César Benítez', null, 'Salva Reina, María Esteve, Thaïs Blume, Isabel Madolell, Fernando Gil, Gabriel Ángel Delgado, Ramsés, Fernando Cabrera', null, 'Max is a Jack Russell dog genetically modified for criminal purposes so he is able to talk. Running away from the criminals he''s working for, he is wounded, then saved by detective-wannabe Alberto, who is fire and house-hunting. They end up staying with Alberto''s sister-in-law Marta and her two children. Thanks to them all, Alberto finally manages to be a detective, and he and Max establish their detective agency: Sabuesos.', 'Max is a Jack Russell dog genetically modified for criminal purposes so he is able to talk. Running away from the criminals he''s working for, he is wounded, then saved by detective-wannabe Alberto, who is fire and house-hunting. They end up staying with Alberto''s sister-in-law Marta and her two children. Thanks to them all, Alberto finally manages to be a detective, and he and Max establish their detective agency: Sabuesos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mC5x6sNZr8x9Z7t1umZyoriH0mZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81271'),
  ('666641047467008810', 'Sacred Games', 2018, 'Drama, Crime, Action & Adventure', 'Vikramaditya Motwane', null, 'Saif Ali Khan, Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Pankaj Tripathi, Kalki Koechlin, Chittaranjan Tripathy', 'TV-MA', 'A link in their pasts leads an honest cop to a fugitive gang boss, whose cryptic warning spurs the officer on a quest to save Mumbai from cataclysm.', 'A link in their pasts leads an honest cop to a fugitive gang boss, whose cryptic warning spurs the officer on a quest to save Mumbai from cataclysm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uEbNtFbK4At9WBDGap23lt1qO9n.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:79352'),
  ('888355344986863176', 'Sacred Lies', 2018, 'Drama', 'Raelle Tucker', 'Raelle Tucker, Jenniffer Gomez', 'Elena Kampouris, Kevin Carroll, Kiana Madeira, Ryan Robbins, Kimiko Glenn, Juliette Lewis, Emily Alyn Lind, Leah Gibson', 'TV-MA', 'Based on the classic Grimm Brothers tale The Handless Maiden, and Stephanie Oakes’ novel The Sacred Lies of Minnow Bly, and adapted and updated by Tucker, Sacred Lies is about a handless teen who escapes from a cult and finds herself in juvenile detention, suspected of knowing who killed her cult leader.', 'Based on the classic Grimm Brothers tale The Handless Maiden, and Stephanie Oakes’ novel The Sacred Lies of Minnow Bly, and adapted and updated by Tucker, Sacred Lies is about a handless teen who escapes from a cult and finds herself in juvenile detention, suspected of knowing who killed her cult leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecdmiokFSOE5erqqcwDG2iEkIIW.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:81183'),
  ('695781821603658098', 'Sacrée Soirée', 1987, 'Talk', null, null, 'Jean-Pierre Foucault', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h2GaYY9A66LNbVlUb33rBnByEFU.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:111115'),
  ('901782978272817944', 'Sacrificial Princess and the King of Beasts', 2023, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kana Hanazawa, Satoshi Hino, Takuma Terashima, Yuka Nukui, Natsumi Fujiwara, Megumi Han, Chikahiro Kobayashi, Hiroyuki Yoshino', 'TV-14', 'One hundred years ago, a grave tradition was born in a land where demons live among people: a human must be sacrificed to the King of Beasts. But when Sariphi, the 99th sacrifice, is offered to the King, she isn’t afraid at all! Intrigued by her calm and cute nature, the King decides to spare her life with plans to make her his bride.', 'One hundred years ago, a grave tradition was born in a land where demons live among people: a human must be sacrificed to the King of Beasts. But when Sariphi, the 99th sacrifice, is offered to the King, she isn’t afraid at all! Intrigued by her calm and cute nature, the King decides to spare her life with plans to make her his bride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBfTGMOPAg10BeKLXTnQ7s3sgHW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117024'),
  ('502070436250027097', 'Sad Love Story', 2005, 'Drama', null, 'Han Sul-hee', 'MC Mong, Jin Hee-kyung, Kwon Sang-woo, Yeon Joo Kim, Kim Hee-seon, Lee Yeong-ha, Nah Young Hee, Yeon Jeong-hun', null, 'Misleadingly informed that Jon-young is dead, Hye-in struggles to begin a new life alone. Years later, Hye-in returns to Seoul. With her eyesight restored, she is now a singer happily engaged to her producer Gun-woo (Yeon Jung-hoon). ... This series is a series of love, death and suspense.', 'Misleadingly informed that Jon-young is dead, Hye-in struggles to begin a new life alone. Years later, Hye-in returns to Seoul. With her eyesight restored, she is now a singer happily engaged to her producer Gun-woo (Yeon Jung-hoon). ... This series is a series of love, death and suspense.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPMxKIz2UPLq3bdnhe9RwmHjXIS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14012'),
  ('998648152650207741', 'Saekano: How to Raise a Boring Girlfriend', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Kiyono Yasuno, Saori Onishi, Ai Kayano, Sayuri Yahagi, Chinatsu Akasaki, Tetsuya Kakihara', 'TV-14', 'Tomoya Aki is an otaku who has a dream. His dream is to create the best visual novel game ever. The main heroine for this game and the inspiration for this dream is a background character named Megumi Kato who somehow stumbles into main character-esque traits in his eyes. To complete the game in time he has to call upon the aid of his anime loving professional friends who aren''t so keen on the choice of his main heroine.', 'Tomoya Aki is an otaku who has a dream. His dream is to create the best visual novel game ever. The main heroine for this game and the inspiration for this dream is a background character named Megumi Kato who somehow stumbles into main character-esque traits in his eyes. To complete the game in time he has to call upon the aid of his anime loving professional friends who aren''t so keen on the choice of his main heroine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pE9f3evd40No5T8Bx53hN93CqJK.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69367'),
