  ('63642088073546951', 'Sammy''s Children''s Day', 2026, 'Drama, Crime, Action & Adventure', '安优, 燕兰', '燕兰', 'He Changxi, He Yanzhao, Zhang Mingbo, Matthew Han', null, 'In the lawless 1980s Kowloon Walled City, an aspiring student and a triad enforcer find an unlikely, dangerous love while fighting for their lives.', 'In the lawless 1980s Kowloon Walled City, an aspiring student and a triad enforcer find an unlikely, dangerous love while fighting for their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/87poJu88dlaReAe67HD6TUec1Cr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:307624'),
  ('765493691584689824', 'Samson & Gert', 1990, 'Kids', 'Gert Verhulst, Hans Bourlon, Danny Verbiest', null, 'Dirk Bosschaert, Gert Verhulst, Koen Crucke, Walter Baele', null, 'Samson & Gert is a Flemish children''s television series produced by Studio 100, centered around the talking dog Samson and his boss Gert.', 'Samson & Gert is a Flemish children''s television series produced by Studio 100, centered around the talking dog Samson and his boss Gert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99kGWN0jMMbFoRWs6SVFk1XicLH.jpg', 17, 'tmdb:tv:33088'),
  ('486118677293707798', 'Samson & Marie Live', 2026, 'Kids', null, null, 'Dirk Bosschaert, Marie Verhulst', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 2, 'tmdb:tv:318270'),
  ('334633804230478948', 'Samson and Delilah', 2011, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Gustavo Reiz', 'Gustavo Reiz', 'Fernando Pavão, Mel Lisboa, Milhem Cortaz, Marcello Escorel, Rafaela Mandelli, Miguel Thiré, Cláudio Gabriel, Thais Fersoza', 'NR', 'Samson is a courageous man, strong, fearless, a Hebrew who fights many armies of his people enemies, and savage beasts; also, he keeps to himself the mysterious secret of his strength. He was born as the promise of being the rescuer of his people who were oppressed and persecuted.', 'Samson is a courageous man, strong, fearless, a Hebrew who fights many armies of his people enemies, and savage beasts; also, he keeps to himself the mysterious secret of his strength. He was born as the promise of being the rescuer of his people who were oppressed and persecuted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bdxncan9iyCtQkgy1NwILR6h9A.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69697'),
  ('738498920438990820', 'Samuel', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Émilie Tronche', null, 'Émilie Tronche', 'TV-14', 'Samuel is 10 years old. He''s keeping a diary, and he has a problem. His problem is that Basile told the tall Julie that Samuel loved her. Which isn''t true, he doesn''t care about Julie. It''s only that she laughed at one of his jokes once and he thought she was nice to do so.', 'Samuel is 10 years old. He''s keeping a diary, and he has a problem. His problem is that Basile told the tall Julie that Samuel loved her. Which isn''t true, he doesn''t care about Julie. It''s only that she laughed at one of his jokes once and he thought she was nice to do so.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qW8sa5evzMOEZ5ZhFfCQGMLx6fm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:248664'),
  ('844640108099022993', 'Samurai 7', 2004, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kong Kuwata, Masaki Terasoma, Romi Park, Shin-ichiro Miki, Toru Kusano, Tetsu Inada, Fumiko Orikasa, Tadahisa Saizen', 'TV-PG', 'As villages perish under the thumb of a cruel race of warriors, a young priestess named Kirara travels the countryside gathering stray samurais.', 'As villages perish under the thumb of a cruel race of warriors, a young priestess named Kirara travels the countryside gathering stray samurais.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebA9HuNZLscfmcWaOGHiBra0o1B.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5863'),
  ('932236533913276187', 'Samurai Champloo', 2004, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Shinichiro Watanabe', null, 'Ayako Kawasumi, Kazuya Nakai, Ginpei Sato, Akio Otsuka, Eiji Maruyama, Keiichi Nanba, Kiyoyuki Yanada, Takayuki Sugo', 'TV-MA', 'Break-dancing but fierce warrior Mugen has to deal with the cold-blooded and conceited Jin, a samurai who believes he is above all. These sworn enemies are brought together by Fuu for a special task.', 'Break-dancing but fierce warrior Mugen has to deal with the cold-blooded and conceited Jin, a samurai who believes he is above all. These sworn enemies are brought together by Fuu for a special task.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lYpHeSm7BcUxAbBx1ucuEH7oGAe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1063'),
  ('313777305951470061', 'Samurai Flamenco', 2013, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Toshiki Masuda, Tomokazu Sugita, Atsushi Imaruoka, Erii Yamazaki, Haruka Tomatsu, Jurota Kosugi, Hiroki Yasumoto, Mao Ichimichi', null, 'Male model Masayoshi Hazama decides to become a superhero, despite having no superpowers or the technology to create a high-powered suit. He becomes the hero, Samurai Flamenco and begins to fight crime in the name of justice. Police officer Hidenori Goto finds out about Samurai Flamenco and his real identity by a twist of fate, which leads to him getting involved in lots of trouble. These two young men will come face to face with hardships of being crime-fighters while discovering what it truly means to be a hero of justice.', 'Male model Masayoshi Hazama decides to become a superhero, despite having no superpowers or the technology to create a high-powered suit. He becomes the hero, Samurai Flamenco and begins to fight crime in the name of justice. Police officer Hidenori Goto finds out about Samurai Flamenco and his real identity by a twist of fate, which leads to him getting involved in lots of trouble. These two young men will come face to face with hardships of being crime-fighters while discovering what it truly means to be a hero of justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijHECy9gGDZ8caOez8gDViHNqWN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61363'),
  ('132264834794509328', 'Samurai Girl', 2008, 'Drama', 'Christopher Leitch', null, 'Stacy Keibler, Anthony Brandon Wong, Jamie Chung, Brendan Fehr, Kenneth Choi, Kyle Labine, Byron Lawson, Saige Thompson', 'TV-14', 'After a sheltered upbringing as the adopted daughter of one of Japan''s most powerful clans, Heaven Kogo embarks on a dangerous journey to learn the truth about her family and her own destiny, in this adaptation of a series of popular young-adult novels by Carrie Asai. The six-hour miniseries began its three-day premiere on ABC Family on September 5, 2008.', 'After a sheltered upbringing as the adopted daughter of one of Japan''s most powerful clans, Heaven Kogo embarks on a dangerous journey to learn the truth about her family and her own destiny, in this adaptation of a series of popular young-adult novels by Carrie Asai. The six-hour miniseries began its three-day premiere on ABC Family on September 5, 2008.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sFiI5WX8zl77rP9u0Z9LM0uiKx0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8823'),
  ('710228771408955828', 'Samurai Girls', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Rie Kugimiya, Minako Kotobuki, Daisuke Hirakawa, Kaoru Mizuhara, Saori Goto, Ami Koshimizu, Aoi Yuuki, Aki Toyosaki', null, 'The story takes place in Japan in the early 21st century, in an alternate reality where the Tokugawa Shogunate has remained in power. In this reality, student councils are tasked with oppressing schools. Yagyuu Muneakira is a high school student who rebels against his student council with the help of girls who''ve had the names of famous samurai heroes passed on to them.', 'The story takes place in Japan in the early 21st century, in an alternate reality where the Tokugawa Shogunate has remained in power. In this reality, student councils are tasked with oppressing schools. Yagyuu Muneakira is a high school student who rebels against his student council with the help of girls who''ve had the names of famous samurai heroes passed on to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/HTVddlolhBpsE2JDPRpUrfv74G.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:46440'),
  ('399946353504108357', 'Samurai Gourmet', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Masayuki Qusumi', null, 'Honami Suzuki, Tetsuji Tamayama, Naoto Takenaka, Yurina Yanagi', null, 'Recent retiree Takeshi rediscovers his passion for food and life by getting in touch with his inner warrior and eating what he truly desires.', 'Recent retiree Takeshi rediscovers his passion for food and life by getting in touch with his inner warrior and eating what he truly desires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qieWfVYOAB0FRX5w4YSDaEdWfT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70781'),
  ('1063487968704067093', 'Samurai Harem', 2009, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, 'Tatsuya Takahashi, Hideyuki Kurata', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto, Haruka Tomatsu, Rina Sato, Yukari Tamura, Kana Hanazawa, Atsushi Ono, Kazuya Nakai, Shintaro Asanuma', 'TV-14', 'Having been raised and trained for the past seventeen years as a traditional samurai ''bushi'', Yoichi was surprised when his father suddenly announces that there nothing more that he could teach his son, but he arranges for Yoichi to continue training at a dojo owned by one of his fathers friends. So now, Yoichi must leave the tranquility of his remote rural mountain life and move to city to live with his fathers friend''s family to continue his studies. And if learning how to cope with city life were not hard enough, he finds himself living with 4 beautiful sisters, and having to endure a ‘training’ regiment more severe than he could ever imagine...', 'Having been raised and trained for the past seventeen years as a traditional samurai ''bushi'', Yoichi was surprised when his father suddenly announces that there nothing more that he could teach his son, but he arranges for Yoichi to continue training at a dojo owned by one of his fathers friends. So now, Yoichi must leave the tranquility of his remote rural mountain life and move to city to live with his fathers friend''s family to continue his studies. And if learning how to cope with city life were not hard enough, he finds himself living with 4 beautiful sisters, and having to endure a ‘training’ regiment more severe than he could ever imagine...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jCafttmSz7sYNOTWS4HcjgYPfSA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46033'),
  ('685085031280557234', 'Samurai Jack', 2001, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Animation', 'Genndy Tartakovsky', 'David Krentz, Bryan Andrews, Genndy Tartakovsky', 'Phil LaMarr, Greg Baldwin, Tara Strong, Grey DeLisle', 'TV-14', 'A great warrior is displaced to the distant future by the evil shape-shifting wizard Aku. The world has become a bleak place under the rule of Aku, segregated into fantastic tribes and ruled by Aku''s evil robot warlords. Jack travels this foreign landscape in search of a time portal that can return him to his home time so he can "undo the future that is Aku!".', 'A great warrior is displaced to the distant future by the evil shape-shifting wizard Aku. The world has become a bleak place under the rule of Aku, segregated into fantastic tribes and ruled by Aku''s evil robot warlords. Jack travels this foreign landscape in search of a time portal that can return him to his home time so he can "undo the future that is Aku!".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ddZ7Q2WZ0xAHkVXYvcEgNGFgVkw.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:2723'),
  ('52294467150682939', 'Samurai Pizza Cats', 1990, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Kids', 'Mineo Fuji', null, 'Kappei Yamaguchi, Ai Orikasa, Jurota Kosugi, Satomi Korogi, Yuko Mizutani, Kenyu Horiuchi, Maria Kawamura, Kenichi Ogata', null, 'The setting is a Japanese looking village named "Little Tokyo" where the Pizza Cats run a pizza fast food business. Little Tokyo is populated by all kinds of animals. The official governor of the town is the Emperor, but since he has gone bananas a council takes care of the well-being of the village. One of the members of this council is called Seymour "Big" Cheese, who secretly wishes to take over control of the village. The pizza take away restaurant is merely a cover for their true job... Whenever evil is afoot, the Pizza Cats are launched towards the danger from the gun-lookalike clock tower that emerges from the top of their restaurant.', 'The setting is a Japanese looking village named "Little Tokyo" where the Pizza Cats run a pizza fast food business. Little Tokyo is populated by all kinds of animals. The official governor of the town is the Emperor, but since he has gone bananas a council takes care of the well-being of the village. One of the members of this council is called Seymour "Big" Cheese, who secretly wishes to take over control of the village. The pizza take away restaurant is merely a cover for their true job... Whenever evil is afoot, the Pizza Cats are launched towards the danger from the gun-lookalike clock tower that emerges from the top of their restaurant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zQ4lohCOwaxb9T8VofAw2SkudxO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10797'),
  ('357414110646918003', 'Samurai Rabbit: The Usagi Chronicles', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Candie Langdale, Doug Langdale, Heather A. Maxwell', null, 'Darren Barnet, Aleks Le, Mallory Low, Keone Young, Shelby Rabara, Eric Bauza, Mela Lee, SungWon Cho', 'TV-Y7', 'A teenage rabbit aspiring to become a real samurai teams up with new warrior friends to protect their city from Yokai monsters, ninjas and evil aliens.', 'A teenage rabbit aspiring to become a real samurai teams up with new warrior friends to protect their city from Yokai monsters, ninjas and evil aliens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEar4pCI71nhJKd2QqZSN9Zw9tx.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:195926'),
  ('658037427729516200', 'Samurai Sentai Shinkenger', 2009, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Kids', null, null, 'Tori Matsuzaka, Hiroki Aiba, Rin Takanashi, Shôgo Suzuki, Suzuka Morita, Keisuke Sohma, Gorō Ibuki, Rintaro Nishi', null, 'For eighteen generations, samurai of the Shiba Clan have suppressed the evil intentions of the Gedoushu, malevolent spirits that enter the world of the living from gaps between buildings and other structures. Now, Takeru Shiba, the youngest head of the Shiba Clan must gather his four vassals in order to battle the Gedoushu under the revived Doukoku Chimatsuri as the Shinkengers.', 'For eighteen generations, samurai of the Shiba Clan have suppressed the evil intentions of the Gedoushu, malevolent spirits that enter the world of the living from gaps between buildings and other structures. Now, Takeru Shiba, the youngest head of the Shiba Clan must gather his four vassals in order to battle the Gedoushu under the revived Doukoku Chimatsuri as the Shinkengers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tMAqqOU2Tz5F6uDpJuqAlRhyvhP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16347'),
  ('248365875391737999', 'Sanadamaru', 2016, 'Drama', null, null, 'Masato Sakai, Yo Oizumi, Masao Kusakari, Yoshino Kimura, Masami Nagasawa, Atsuko Takahata, Haru Kuroki', null, 'Spanning over 50 episodes, we follow the historical fiction of the Sanada clansmen as they plotted and fought their ways to survive the changing political alliances during the Warring States Period of Japan.', 'Spanning over 50 episodes, we follow the historical fiction of the Sanada clansmen as they plotted and fought their ways to survive the changing political alliances during the Warring States Period of Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9boJzhF4kVF49Xlzibk5REhxQZE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72401'),
  ('937751841919798336', 'Sanctuary', 2008, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Damian Kindler', null, 'Amanda Tapping, Robin Dunne, Christopher Heyerdahl, Ryan Robbins', 'TV-14', 'The adventures of the beautiful, enigmatic and always surprising Dr. Helen Magnus, a brilliant scientist who holds the secrets of a clandestine population called Abnormals—a group of strange and sometimes terrifying beings that hide among humans. Magnus seeks to protect this threatened phenomena as well as unlock the mysteries behind their existence.', 'The adventures of the beautiful, enigmatic and always surprising Dr. Helen Magnus, a brilliant scientist who holds the secrets of a clandestine population called Abnormals—a group of strange and sometimes terrifying beings that hide among humans. Magnus seeks to protect this threatened phenomena as well as unlock the mysteries behind their existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7KIBYETkRSfHNsfWAWAt7uq7oGm.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1310'),
  ('387011760664455810', 'Sanctuary', 2019, 'Drama, Mystery', null, 'Charlie Fletcher', 'Josefin Asplund, Nathalie Rapti Gomez, Chiara Martegiani, Agnieszka Grochowska, Philip Arditti, Lorenzo Richelmy, Will Mellor, Felix Garcia Guyer', null, 'Hel receives an invitation to visit her estranged twin Siri at an exclusive residential sanatorium set against the idyllic setting of the Italian Alps. Tension soon rises when Hel refuses Siri’s plea for help in taking care of some business by swapping places with her for a few days. Much to her horror, Hel wakes up the next day to find Siri gone. She soon realizes that Siri isn’t coming back, and that the clinic is far from a place of recovery.', 'Hel receives an invitation to visit her estranged twin Siri at an exclusive residential sanatorium set against the idyllic setting of the Italian Alps. Tension soon rises when Hel refuses Siri’s plea for help in taking care of some business by swapping places with her for a few days. Much to her horror, Hel wakes up the next day to find Siri gone. She soon realizes that Siri isn’t coming back, and that the clinic is far from a place of recovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHxvBv4OF78GhcFC5GIwOOAJq7P.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89416'),
  ('611776950999265360', 'Sanctuary', 2023, 'Drama', 'Kan Eguchi', null, 'Wataru Ichinose, Shota Sometani, Pierre Taki, Koyuki, Shioli Kutsuna, Rio Teramoto, Suzuki Matsuo, Tomorowo Taguchi', 'TV-MA', 'A tough, desperate kid becomes a sumo wrestler, captivating fans with his cocky attitude — and upsetting an industry steeped in tradition.', 'A tough, desperate kid becomes a sumo wrestler, captivating fans with his cocky attitude — and upsetting an industry steeped in tradition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fnr87DcGxKB02vcuZlLgxX8tHPs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210269'),
  ('174137816600343423', 'Sanctuary: A Witch''s Tale', 2024, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Debbie Horsfield', null, 'Elaine Cassidy, Hazel Doupe, Stephanie Levi-John, Clive Standen', 'TV-MA', 'Set in a contemporary world where witchcraft is real, the story takes place in the idyllic English town of Sanctuary, where for hundreds of years witches have lived peacefully, as valued members of society. Until now…', 'Set in a contemporary world where witchcraft is real, the story takes place in the idyllic English town of Sanctuary, where for hundreds of years witches have lived peacefully, as valued members of society. Until now…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZllgPmOXS5PadAs4mDp6JhQJod.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:238585'),
  ('198085026812215728', 'SAND LAND: THE SERIES', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Mutsumi Tamura, Kazuhiro Yamaji, Cho, Satoshi Tsuruoka, Nobuo Tobita', 'TV-14', 'Sand Land is a mysterious world where demons and humans eke out an existence in a barren desert wasteland. In hopes of replenishing their water supply, Fiend Prince Beelzebub, a demon named Thief, and a human named Sheriff Rao team up and embark on a journey in search of the Legendary Spring.', 'Sand Land is a mysterious world where demons and humans eke out an existence in a barren desert wasteland. In hopes of replenishing their water supply, Fiend Prince Beelzebub, a demon named Thief, and a human named Sheriff Rao team up and embark on a journey in search of the Legendary Spring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxBu818TRNHjHkUwGQctH775Ro3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:239478'),
  ('512699535011463129', 'SANDA', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Mystery', null, null, 'Ayumu Murase, Hiroki Touchi, Umeka Shouji, Anna Nagase, Yuuki Shin, Misato Matsuoka, Toshihiko Seki, Hiroaki Hirata', 'TV-14', 'In near-future Japan with ultra-low birthrates, children are treasured but monitored. Santa is banned as dangerous. One snowy December 25th, middle-schooler Kazushige Sanda, descendant of Santa, is attacked by classmate Fuyumura who wants him to find her missing friend, Ono. "Santa, please find my friend." To protect children from adults, Sanda decides to become Santa and fight the adults.', 'In near-future Japan with ultra-low birthrates, children are treasured but monitored. Santa is banned as dangerous. One snowy December 25th, middle-schooler Kazushige Sanda, descendant of Santa, is attacked by classmate Fuyumura who wants him to find her missing friend, Ono. "Santa, please find my friend." To protect children from adults, Sanda decides to become Santa and fight the adults.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2kDRbp956EzPfDMEKBhouzk7E8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:258901'),
  ('1070938570897122827', 'Sandeep Bhaiya', 2023, 'Drama', 'Nitin Tiwari, Siddhartha Tiwari', 'Siddhartha Tiwari, Nitin Tiwari', 'Sunny Hinduja, Deepali Gautam, Punit Tiwari, Rajendra Gupta, Abhinav Anand', null, '‘Sandeep Bhaiya’ is a spinoff of the blockbuster webshow TVF Aspirants. It will have a total of eight episodes and is inspired by his iconic character in TVF Aspirants.', '‘Sandeep Bhaiya’ is a spinoff of the blockbuster webshow TVF Aspirants. It will have a total of eight episodes and is inspired by his iconic character in TVF Aspirants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9ILwngvdDfznuXFwkle0sEQrjW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:229429'),
  ('783393685321267746', 'Sanditon', 2019, 'Drama', 'Andrew Davies', null, 'Rose Williams, Ben Lloyd-Hughes, Crystal Clarke, Anne Reid, Kris Marshall, Jack Fox, Sophie Winkleman, Liam Garrigan', null, 'The spirited and impulsive Charlotte Heywood moves from her rural home to Sanditon, a fishing village attempting to reinvent itself as a seaside resort.', 'The spirited and impulsive Charlotte Heywood moves from her rural home to Sanditon, a fishing village attempting to reinvent itself as a seaside resort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iKMCbTAkEgvA97M8Isdqp4t12Cf.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:92875'),
  ('197848901446231681', 'Sandokan', 1976, 'Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Kabir Bedi, Philippe Leroy, Carole André, Andrea Giordana, Hans Caninenberg, Milla Sannoner, Renzo Giovampietro, Adolfo Celi', null, 'In this mini-series in six parts from 1976 the Indian actor Kabir Bedi plays the lead role. Carol Andre plays Lady Marianna Guillonk and as Sandokans best friend Yanez de Gomera we see Phillipe Leroy. The noble prince Sandokan is a fighter of the first rank who are cruel to their enemies, but always loyal to his friends.', 'In this mini-series in six parts from 1976 the Indian actor Kabir Bedi plays the lead role. Carol Andre plays Lady Marianna Guillonk and as Sandokans best friend Yanez de Gomera we see Phillipe Leroy. The noble prince Sandokan is a fighter of the first rank who are cruel to their enemies, but always loyal to his friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/opwgDUOaUHxWPUqeW1mw93tMxyS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43966'),
  ('485201224820268528', 'Sandokan', 1992, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids', 'Claudio Biern Boyd', null, 'Luis Varela, Gabriel Jiménez, Marta García, Juan Luis Rovira, Luis Reina, Claudio Rodríguez, José María Cordero, Luis Marín', 'NR', 'An unforgettable story of love, justice and loyalty, full of stirring events from the pages of Emilio Salgari''s classic novels. What are you waiting for? Board their ship!', 'An unforgettable story of love, justice and loyalty, full of stirring events from the pages of Emilio Salgari''s classic novels. What are you waiting for? Board their ship!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odSLA7ACW6GiotVyr8mZb166bFd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81085'),
  ('1151549968432172854', 'Sandokan', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, War & Politics', 'Davide Lantieri, Scott Rosenbaum, Alessandro Sermoneta', 'Jeane Wong, Alessandro Sermoneta', 'Can Yaman, Alanah Bloor, Alessandro Preziosi, Ed Westwick, Madeleine Price, Owen Teale, John Hannah', null, 'Sandokan is a Malaysian pirate who, along with his friend Yanez and their crew, attacks the British forces from his island of Mompracem. During his adventures, he falls in love with Lady Marianna Guillonk, an English-Italian aristocrat.', 'Sandokan is a Malaysian pirate who, along with his friend Yanez and their crew, attacks the British forces from his island of Mompracem. During his adventures, he falls in love with Lady Marianna Guillonk, an English-Italian aristocrat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knEfDIVlJpoYAFQYlbOr78uDIqq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:271855'),
  ('193340728570099597', 'Sandro de América', 2018, 'Drama', 'Adrián Caetano', 'Adrián Caetano, Mariano Vera, Esther Feldman', 'Agustín Sullivan, Marco Antonio Caponi, Antonio Grimau, Jorge Suárez, Paula Ransenberg, Luis Machín, Muriel Santa Ana, Fiorella Indelicato', null, 'Sandro de América is a series of Argentine biographical, musical, dramatic and romantic television broadcasted by Telefe and produced by The Magic Eye, starring Antonio Grimau, Marco Antonio Caponi and Agustín Sullivan, who will perform the famous Argentine singer and composer Sandro en different stages of his life. The series has 13 episodes and debuted on March 5, 2018, broadcasting Monday through Thursday, over three weeks, as a "unique event" television.', 'Sandro de América is a series of Argentine biographical, musical, dramatic and romantic television broadcasted by Telefe and produced by The Magic Eye, starring Antonio Grimau, Marco Antonio Caponi and Agustín Sullivan, who will perform the famous Argentine singer and composer Sandro en different stages of his life. The series has 13 episodes and debuted on March 5, 2018, broadcasting Monday through Thursday, over three weeks, as a "unique event" television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kG9NiZwWJrKWTviOn5G4ljrAbpW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78069'),
  ('565018809444152660', 'Sands of Destruction', 2008, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation', null, null, 'Chiaki Ito, Kouji Watanabe, Kunio Ida, Maaya Sakamoto, Mamoru Miyano, Daisuke Ono, Hiroyuki Yoshino, Yu Kobayashi', null, 'Made bitter by the loss of her brother in the war between men and beasts, Morte considers the whole world to be unredeemable. A mysterious orb capable of obliterating everything in existence will enable her vengence, and her new companion Kyrie may hold the key to unlocking it. The fate of the world hangs in the balance, but these heroes would rather destroy the world than save it.', 'Made bitter by the loss of her brother in the war between men and beasts, Morte considers the whole world to be unredeemable. A mysterious orb capable of obliterating everything in existence will enable her vengence, and her new companion Kyrie may hold the key to unlocking it. The fate of the world hangs in the balance, but these heroes would rather destroy the world than save it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8jWAuIYWfbBauOFmrxcRJS6DULS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42979'),
  ('1080482612250641695', 'Sandstorm', 2025, 'Mystery, Crime', null, 'Zhao Dongling', 'Duan Yihong, Wang Qiang, Karlina Zhang, Zhang Yao, Yang Xinming, Huang Xiaolei, Zheng Hao, Zheng Chuyi', null, 'An old body-burning case is reopened, and Officer Chen Jianghe is urgently called back to his small town. Upon returning, he’s swept into chaos—schemers, a lying killer, and revenge-driven victims, all closing in like a raging sandstorm. Yet, Chen believes every storm ends, and justice will prevail once the dust settles.', 'An old body-burning case is reopened, and Officer Chen Jianghe is urgently called back to his small town. Upon returning, he’s swept into chaos—schemers, a lying killer, and revenge-driven victims, all closing in like a raging sandstorm. Yet, Chen believes every storm ends, and justice will prevail once the dust settles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/467KdLIgp69tnGa0WJCQ3RbrqrI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:272100'),
  ('334297972844321052', 'Sandy & Junior', 1999, 'Comedy, Kids, Family', 'Adriana Avellar, Sarah Lavigne, Thiago Marinho', null, 'Sandy, Junior Lima, Fernanda Paes Leme, Wagner Santisteban, Camila dos Anjos, Karina Dohme, Bruna Thedy, Igor Cotrim', null, 'Two high school students have a life of flirting, misadventures and friendship with a group of friends.', 'Two high school students have a life of flirting, misadventures and friendship with a group of friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJryWpNBVbMD848Q62NkJCq3Gjq.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:73667'),
