  ('319535243864669114', 'Schitt''s Creek', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Eugene Levy, Dan Levy', null, 'Eugene Levy, Catherine O''Hara, Dan Levy, Annie Murphy, Emily Hampshire, Chris Elliott, Jennifer Robertson, Noah Reid', 'TV-14', 'Formerly filthy rich video store magnate Johnny Rose, his soap star wife Moira, and their two kids, über-hipster son David and socialite daughter Alexis, suddenly find themselves broke and forced to live in Schitt''s Creek, a small depressing town they once bought as a joke.', 'Formerly filthy rich video store magnate Johnny Rose, his soap star wife Moira, and their two kids, über-hipster son David and socialite daughter Alexis, suddenly find themselves broke and forced to live in Schitt''s Creek, a small depressing town they once bought as a joke.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRfSzrPS5VYWQv7KVSEg2BZZL6C.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:61662'),
