  ('673244460039984844', 'Sesame Street', 1969, 'Kids, Comedy', 'Lloyd Morrisett, Joan Ganz Cooney, Jim Henson', 'Halcyon Person', 'Frank Oz, Sonia Manzano, Roscoe Orman, Martin P. Robinson, Suki Lopez, Violet Tinnirello, Jennifer Barnhart, Ryan Dillon', 'TV-Y', 'On a special inner city street, the inhabitants—human and muppet—teach preschoolers basic educational and social concepts using comedy, cartoons, games, and songs.', 'On a special inner city street, the inhabitants—human and muppet—teach preschoolers basic educational and social concepts using comedy, cartoons, games, and songs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14k9BfZ2p4rQBMeJ5crKTfUZVwD.jpg', 56, 'tmdb:tv:502'),
  ('309543637813001907', 'Sesamstraße', 1975, 'Family, Kids, Comedy', 'Lloyd Morrisett', null, null, 'TV-Y', 'Sesamstraße is the German-language version of Sesame Street, a children''s television series. It airs primarily in Germany and the surrounding German-speaking countries. The show premièred on 8 January 1973, Sesamstraße has been running on Norddeutscher Rundfunk since 1973; it''s now in its 40th season. Sesamstraße is also broadcast on Das Erste and KiKa.', 'Sesamstraße is the German-language version of Sesame Street, a children''s television series. It airs primarily in Germany and the surrounding German-speaking countries. The show premièred on 8 January 1973, Sesamstraße has been running on Norddeutscher Rundfunk since 1973; it''s now in its 40th season. Sesamstraße is also broadcast on Das Erste and KiKa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9BBmkVDjDi0cYLPVcPPC6JmUxpC.jpg', 34, 'tmdb:tv:10732'),
  ('135493473331670223', 'Seth MacFarlane''s Cavalcade of Cartoon Comedy', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Seth MacFarlane', null, 'Alex Borstein, Alexandra Breckenridge, Seth Green, Rachael MacFarlane, Phil LaMarr, Seth MacFarlane, Jeff Bergman', 'TV-MA', 'Seth MacFarlane''s Cavalcade of Cartoon Comedy is an American cartoon web series created by Seth MacFarlane. The series is based on the cutaway jokes on Family Guy.', 'Seth MacFarlane''s Cavalcade of Cartoon Comedy is an American cartoon web series created by Seth MacFarlane. The series is based on the cutaway jokes on Family Guy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fqF6s89GdSyHTwuI4seqBrvapHR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:7985'),
  ('987937478320387517', 'Seton Academy: Join the Pack!', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Hina Kino, Haruki Ishiya, Yume Miyamoto, Misaki Kuno, Konomi Kohara, Sora Tokui, Yoshino Aoyama, Tomokazu Sugita', 'TV-14', 'Seton Academy, a school where animals of all species gather to live and learn together. A sacred garden of learning, where students hone their primal instincts and the laws are of the jungle. Where species pit against species in a daily struggle for survival... Now enter the animal-hating human Jin Mazama, and the lonely wolf Ranka Okami. When man meets wolf in an encounter for the ages, this food chain is about to be shook. “Species shmecies! If we’ve shared face-licks, you’re a friend to me! Welcome to the pack!”', 'Seton Academy, a school where animals of all species gather to live and learn together. A sacred garden of learning, where students hone their primal instincts and the laws are of the jungle. Where species pit against species in a daily struggle for survival... Now enter the animal-hating human Jin Mazama, and the lonely wolf Ranka Okami. When man meets wolf in an encounter for the ages, this food chain is about to be shook. “Species shmecies! If we’ve shared face-licks, you’re a friend to me! Welcome to the pack!”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yXSH5BYOhYt26S5x7Aqz2VXj6P1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96150'),
  ('326697042324962986', 'Seven Days', 1998, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Christopher Crowe', null, 'Jonathan LaPaglia, Justina Vail Evans, Don Franklin, Alan Scarfe, Nick Searcy, Norman Lloyd', 'TV-PG', '"Ever wish you could live your last week all over again? Well, my name''s Frank B. Parker, and I do it all the time. I work for a secret government project experimenting in time travel. When things really get screwed up, I''m the guinea pig they send back to take care of it. The catch is, I can only go back 7 days."', '"Ever wish you could live your last week all over again? Well, my name''s Frank B. Parker, and I do it all the time. I work for a secret government project experimenting in time travel. When things really get screwed up, I''m the guinea pig they send back to take care of it. The catch is, I can only go back 7 days."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhnSqxQc8QaeBC2ZuWqZDtECtHv.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:4562'),
  ('28652119341343863', 'Seven Days of a Daddy and a Daughter', 2007, 'Family, Drama, Comedy', 'Mahoko Takanari', null, 'Yui Aragaki, Hiroshi Tachi, Mayumi Sada, Shigeaki Kato, Yumi Aso, Norito Yashima, Tohru Emori', null, 'This home comedy tells the story of Kyoichiro and his teenage daughter Koume. One day, the two ride a train together after visiting Kyoichiro''s mother-in-law. He sees it as a chance to get to know his daughter better, but he ends up getting more than that - by some mysterious force, both Kyoichiro and Koume end up with their mind in the other''s body! Unfortunately, they have no choice but to swap lives, pretending to be each other at school and work.', 'This home comedy tells the story of Kyoichiro and his teenage daughter Koume. One day, the two ride a train together after visiting Kyoichiro''s mother-in-law. He sees it as a chance to get to know his daughter better, but he ends up getting more than that - by some mysterious force, both Kyoichiro and Koume end up with their mind in the other''s body! Unfortunately, they have no choice but to swap lives, pretending to be each other at school and work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6AdVg60vl8sqSAEniDDepcirj7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62054'),
  ('505165312229639562', 'Seven Deadly Sins', 2008, 'Documentary', null, 'Brittany Graham', null, null, 'The series traces the history of the seven deadly sins, how they became part of religious doctrine, and looks at historical figures who have been the worst perpetrators of each. Each of the seven sins is explored, from their origins and nature, their opposing virtue, and their corresponding punishment.', 'The series traces the history of the seven deadly sins, how they became part of religious doctrine, and looks at historical figures who have been the worst perpetrators of each. Each of the seven sins is explored, from their origins and nature, their opposing virtue, and their corresponding punishment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7UUYOeMcQ62qHhRhWeGO09h8qH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:27240'),
  ('685349145291807931', 'Seven Detectives', 2015, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Noriyuki Higashiyama, Kana Kurashina, Kotaro Yoshida, Kinya Kitaoji', null, 'Yū Amagi is a slightly eccentric detective who has been assigned to the Twelfth Section of the Tokyo Metropolitan Police Department''s First Investigative Division from the Lost and Found Centre. The Twelfth Section is called the "graveyard of detectives" and ridiculed as the "banishment room where hardened detectives who cannot be fired are sent." Its assembled detectives Kōsuke Samura, Takumi Yamashita, Keita Nagasawa, Tamaki Mizuta, and Masatoshi Katagiri are elite and yet oddballs. Amagi appears fixated with time which seems to have no relation with a case. Raising questions about the timelines of the perpetrator and victim derived from the estimated time of death, time of crime, time of alibi, and time limit, he searches for the meaning of "blank time" which arises from this. He obsesses over the weight of every minute and second of time because of some incident.', 'Yū Amagi is a slightly eccentric detective who has been assigned to the Twelfth Section of the Tokyo Metropolitan Police Department''s First Investigative Division from the Lost and Found Centre. The Twelfth Section is called the "graveyard of detectives" and ridiculed as the "banishment room where hardened detectives who cannot be fired are sent." Its assembled detectives Kōsuke Samura, Takumi Yamashita, Keita Nagasawa, Tamaki Mizuta, and Masatoshi Katagiri are elite and yet oddballs. Amagi appears fixated with time which seems to have no relation with a case. Raising questions about the timelines of the perpetrator and victim derived from the estimated time of death, time of crime, time of alibi, and time limit, he searches for the meaning of "blank time" which arises from this. He obsesses over the weight of every minute and second of time because of some incident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j2y2rn7ZowoPrOqzAJwUlIIg9qk.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:84574'),
  ('978244380048459710', 'Seven Doors', 2024, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', null, null, 'Femi Adebayo, Chioma Chukwuka Akpotha, Kolawole Ajeyemi, Adebayo Salami, Jide Kosoko, Afeez Oyetoro, Dele Odule, Gabriel Afolayan', null, 'It tells a story of Adedunjoye, a simple man who loves his wife and children, he was told to become the King of Ilara''s Kingdom as the Kingship has gotten to his family lineage, uninterested in the offer, he vehemently refused, after several persuasion, he obliged and became the King, his ascension to the King was followed by a lot of opposition who sought to make his tenure miserable', 'It tells a story of Adedunjoye, a simple man who loves his wife and children, he was told to become the King of Ilara''s Kingdom as the Kingship has gotten to his family lineage, uninterested in the offer, he vehemently refused, after several persuasion, he obliged and became the King, his ascension to the King was followed by a lot of opposition who sought to make his tenure miserable', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOpLUavvZAVYWU2deu50qeEnJUU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:279517'),
  ('1139887733753869853', 'Seven First Kisses', 2016, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Lee Cho-hee, Lee Joon-gi, Park Hae-jin, Ji Chang-wook, Kai, Ok Taec-yeon, Choi Ji-woo, Lee Jong-suk', null, 'Min Soo Jin meets a goddess who allows her to choose one guy among seven as her first kiss.', 'Min Soo Jin meets a goddess who allows her to choose one guy among seven as her first kiss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wr6zop4TiWFSzgPCvSuW9WaREj2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68879'),
  ('517060295790471802', 'Seven Knights Revolution: Hero Successor', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Daiki Yamashita, Hibiku Yamamura, Kana Hanazawa, Yuuichirou Umehara, Shunsuke Takeuchi, Yuya Hozumi, Manami Numakura, Takahiro Sakurai', 'TV-14', 'Long ago, Heroes had saved this world. Many Heroes fought against the powers of Destruction and protected the world. Years in the future… The Heroes had disappeared as the years passed and those possessing their powers called Successors now have the fate of the world in their hands. One of the elite Successors known as the Seven Knights is fighting an army of the Destruction when she saves a boy named Nemo. During the battle, Nemo awakens the powers of a Hero even he didn''t know about and displays his powers as a Successor. But his Hero is someone who no one knew and no one ever spoke of.', 'Long ago, Heroes had saved this world. Many Heroes fought against the powers of Destruction and protected the world. Years in the future… The Heroes had disappeared as the years passed and those possessing their powers called Successors now have the fate of the world in their hands. One of the elite Successors known as the Seven Knights is fighting an army of the Destruction when she saves a boy named Nemo. During the battle, Nemo awakens the powers of a Hero even he didn''t know about and displays his powers as a Successor. But his Hero is someone who no one knew and no one ever spoke of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dg5uxhusJlfJSq9ZtiPi4FRj0Gn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:118151'),
  ('266707280048424609', 'Seven Little Monsters', 2000, 'Kids, Family, Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Maurice Sendak', null, 'Joanne Vannicola, Colin Mochrie, Dwayne Hill, Seán Cullen, Debra McGrath, Michele Scarabelli', null, 'About a family of seven monsters and their mother. Each monster is named after a different number from one to seven, and each has unique physical characteristics.', 'About a family of seven monsters and their mother. Each monster is named after a different number from one to seven, and each has unique physical characteristics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZhgOx3Y5OmuNthwRzHSx2IVUMj.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:20113'),
  ('738004821323428642', 'Seven Mortal Sins', 2017, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kinji Yoshimoto', null, 'Eri Kitamura, Akane Fujita, Arisa Sakuraba, Ai Kakuma, Yoko Hikasa, Yui Ogura, Chiaki Takahashi, Shizuka Itoh', 'TV-MA', 'The prideful archangel Lucifer disobeys God and is cast into the lowest level of hell as a fallen angel. On her way to hell, Lucifer happens to meet a high school girl on Earth named Maria, who helps her. In hell, Lucifer meets Leviathan, and Leviathan explains to Lucifer about The Seven Deadly Sins, the seven demon king rulers of hell. After The Seven Deadly Sins seal Lucifer''s powers, Lucifer goes on a journey with Maria and Leviathan to defeat them.', 'The prideful archangel Lucifer disobeys God and is cast into the lowest level of hell as a fallen angel. On her way to hell, Lucifer happens to meet a high school girl on Earth named Maria, who helps her. In hell, Lucifer meets Leviathan, and Leviathan explains to Lucifer about The Seven Deadly Sins, the seven demon king rulers of hell. After The Seven Deadly Sins seal Lucifer''s powers, Lucifer goes on a journey with Maria and Leviathan to defeat them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvJvByy99ul4hytAfNEboAFaFEY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71018'),
  ('93038859480169714', 'Seven Seconds', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', 'Veena Sud', null, 'Clare-Hope Ashitey, Michael Mosley, Beau Knapp, Regina King, Russell Hornsby, Zackary Momoh, David Lyons, Nadia Alexander', 'TV-MA', 'Tensions run high between African American citizens and Caucasian cops in Jersey City when a teenage African American boy is critically injured by a cop.', 'Tensions run high between African American citizens and Caucasian cops in Jersey City when a teenage African American boy is critically injured by a cop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mexUP20U3sPzu8jfGeRIHzI3TUC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75540'),
  ('441558917192437524', 'Seven Senses of the Re''Union', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kengo Takanashi, Nichika Omori, Akari Kito, Kaito Ishikawa, Takuma Terashima, Yumiri Hanamori, Chika Anzai', 'TV-14', 'In the popular MMORPG world ''Union'' there existed a legendary party named Subaru. This party, made up of a group of childhood friends and elementary schoolers, exceeded the limits of the game with their various senses. However, due to an incident which resulted in a death, ''Union'' ended its service and the group of childhood friends went separate ways. Six years later, highschooler Haruto logged into the new ''Reunion'' and reunited with a single girl. Asahi—one of old ''Subaru'' party members, and his childhood friend who should have died six years ago. Is she a digital ghost, or...?', 'In the popular MMORPG world ''Union'' there existed a legendary party named Subaru. This party, made up of a group of childhood friends and elementary schoolers, exceeded the limits of the game with their various senses. However, due to an incident which resulted in a death, ''Union'' ended its service and the group of childhood friends went separate ways. Six years later, highschooler Haruto logged into the new ''Reunion'' and reunited with a single girl. Asahi—one of old ''Subaru'' party members, and his childhood friend who should have died six years ago. Is she a digital ghost, or...?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0fq29g3hFitgoq15aXbLH4FVOf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80562'),
  ('38157346276194103', 'Seven Sisters', 2001, null, null, null, 'Gallen Lo Ka-Leung, Charmaine Sheh Sze-Man, Annie Man Chung-Han, Kwong Wa, Ellesmere Choi, Anne Heung Hoi-Lam, Kingdom Yuen King-Tan, Florence Kwok Siu-Wan', null, 'The touching sisterhood of 7 girls who are not related by blood will definitely make you have heartbreaking moments. 7 daughters sworn to each other, they vowed to die together even though they were not born together, sharing all the sorrows in this life. Then the day of their death also came, one of the 7 of them jumped into the sea to commit suicide, because of the oath of sisterhood, the remaining 6 jumped into the sea together with the other. Since then, the movie Seven Sisters began to spread the ghost story of these 7 sisters and have a street named after the seven sisters…', 'The touching sisterhood of 7 girls who are not related by blood will definitely make you have heartbreaking moments. 7 daughters sworn to each other, they vowed to die together even though they were not born together, sharing all the sorrows in this life. Then the day of their death also came, one of the 7 of them jumped into the sea to commit suicide, because of the oath of sisterhood, the remaining 6 jumped into the sea together with the other. Since then, the movie Seven Sisters began to spread the ghost story of these 7 sisters and have a street named after the seven sisters…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqbfkFI4LtOm2RWL751nuCavf1Y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108777'),
  ('625439599515971155', 'Seven Types of Ambiguity', 2017, 'Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Alex Dimitriades, Xavier Samuel, Andrea Demetriades, Leeanna Walsman, Hugo Weaving, Anthony Hayes, Susie Porter', null, 'The shifting perspective of six characters following a complicated chain of events triggered when a child is taken and relationships are thrown into crisis.', 'The shifting perspective of six characters following a complicated chain of events triggered when a child is taken and relationships are thrown into crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1dtGG7dH2rwNAC2gAzzcFz0YNZh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70389'),
  ('569232164481229847', 'Seven Women', 2003, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Maria Adelaide Amaral, Walther Negrão', 'Maria Adelaide Amaral, Walther Negrão, Lucio Manfredi', 'Camila Morgado, Mariana Ximenes, Nívea Maria, Eliane Giardini, Bete Mendes, Daniela Escobar, Samara Felippo, Thiago Lacerda', 'NR', 'When the men go to war, the women also battle. This tale takes place in the XIX century, during a terrible civil war. Italy’s revolutionary leader Garibaldi must choose between two loves: a sweet aristocratic lady or a brave woman who leaves her husband to accompany him into battle. This super-production recounts the saga of women who do not go to war but must bear pain, solitude and new passions while their husbands and fathers fight the battles.', 'When the men go to war, the women also battle. This tale takes place in the XIX century, during a terrible civil war. Italy’s revolutionary leader Garibaldi must choose between two loves: a sweet aristocratic lady or a brave woman who leaves her husband to accompany him into battle. This super-production recounts the saga of women who do not go to war but must bear pain, solitude and new passions while their husbands and fathers fight the battles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jhMEYknTrAKgjsxQQpSNafKU31V.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42336'),
  ('727307973575089075', 'Seven Worlds, One Planet', 2019, 'Documentary, Family', null, null, 'David Attenborough', 'TV-PG', 'Millions of years ago, incredible forces ripped apart the Earth’s crust creating seven extraordinary continents. This documentary series reveals how each distinct continent has shaped the unique animal life found there.', 'Millions of years ago, incredible forces ripped apart the Earth’s crust creating seven extraordinary continents. This documentary series reveals how each distinct continent has shaped the unique animal life found there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzKNMIlqyznC1jjht8mI2oEtDcp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90790'),
  ('406673006535599138', 'Seventeen Moments of Spring', 1973, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Vyacheslav Tikhonov, Efim Kopelyan', null, 'A Soviet spy is tasked with disrupting the negotiations between Karl Wolff and Allen Dulles taking place in Switzerland, aimed at forging a separate peace between Germany and the Western Allies.', 'A Soviet spy is tasked with disrupting the negotiations between Karl Wolff and Allen Dulles taking place in Switzerland, aimed at forging a separate peace between Germany and the Western Allies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sthe29vwA5HCql06b1aKjA6V4P4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42779'),
