  ('810597933595135237', 'Shadow Beauty', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Ahum', 'Bang Soo-in', 'Shim Dal-gi, Choi Bo-min, Lee Nagyung, Hur Jung-hee, Yang Hong-seok, Baek Ji-hye', null, 'Because of her looks, Koo Ae-jin is bullied at school and even insulted by strangers. But after school, she leads a secret life: with heavy makeup and hours of photo editing, she lives as Genie, a social media star with 770K followers.', 'Because of her looks, Koo Ae-jin is bullied at school and even insulted by strangers. But after school, she leads a secret life: with heavy makeup and hours of photo editing, she lives as Genie, a social media star with 770K followers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVmGiIwSmF8UvGqpAHRXKA25Kwd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137408'),
  ('23077165541084250', 'Shadow Detective', 2022, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Im Chang-se', 'Hwang Seol-heon, Son Jung-woo', 'Lee Sung-min, Gyeong Su-jin, Lee Hak-ju, Jung Jin-young, Kim Shin-rock, Kim Hong-pa, Ju Jin-mo, Jung Hae-kyun', null, 'A veteran detective who is about to retire unfolds a breathtaking psychological warfare with a mysterious man who follows his path while hiding his identity.', 'A veteran detective who is about to retire unfolds a breathtaking psychological warfare with a mysterious man who follows his path while hiding his identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bQlLY4OWGKKFCS1OwkIC9n6hsm7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:157161'),
  ('812432018074606591', 'Shadow Hunter', 2005, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Darryll Walsh', null, 'A documentary series about the paranormal, hosted by Darryll Walsh, a ghost hunter, best-selling author and doctor of parapsychology.', 'A documentary series about the paranormal, hosted by Darryll Walsh, a ghost hunter, best-selling author and doctor of parapsychology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hOTaiR2qRDZtHgR2Kwz7RcAVqA6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12313'),
  ('46148686814522914', 'Shadow Lines', 2019, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Katri Manninen, Kirsti Manninen', null, 'Emmi Parviainen, Olavi Uusivirta, Sampo Sarkola, Katja Küttner, Hannu-Pekka Björkman, Jessica Grabowsky, Eero Ritala', null, 'During the 1950s, Helsinki was the focal point of the Cold War, as global powers and their intelligence agencies coalesced in the small neutral country that stood between the East and the West. Shadow Lines is an international spy thriller that follows a secret intelligence team whose mission is to defend the independence of Finland no matter the cost.', 'During the 1950s, Helsinki was the focal point of the Cold War, as global powers and their intelligence agencies coalesced in the small neutral country that stood between the East and the West. Shadow Lines is an international spy thriller that follows a secret intelligence team whose mission is to defend the independence of Finland no matter the cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4pO2n6Xp3HUjHnmd4TdwI7TzSK.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:93891'),
  ('350907939686916535', 'Shadow Love', 2025, 'Drama', 'Jiu Lu Fei Xiang', null, 'Song Yi, Ryan Cheng, Bi Wenjun, Shi Ce, Darren Chen, Gao Maotong, 李钊', null, 'General Li Shuang of Taijin finds a man who has lost his memory and names him Jin''an. Jin''an devotes himself to accompanying Li Shuang; however, as he gradually regains his memories, he discovers that he is actually a prince from an enemy nation. Once bound by love, the two are forced into battle. Together, they confront challenges that test their loyalties and beliefs, striving to resolve the conflict and uphold the justice they both believe in.', 'General Li Shuang of Taijin finds a man who has lost his memory and names him Jin''an. Jin''an devotes himself to accompanying Li Shuang; however, as he gradually regains his memories, he discovers that he is actually a prince from an enemy nation. Once bound by love, the two are forced into battle. Together, they confront challenges that test their loyalties and beliefs, striving to resolve the conflict and uphold the justice they both believe in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qOxfpvyXtbV31ruLIAYAtxfu4OW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:253093'),
  ('969006370512603740', 'Shadow of Love', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Penpat Kairapee, Patthanarat Ketkaew, Kornrawee Wongtrakul, Ketsamanee Misapmakluea, Ake Oree, Namthip Siamthong', null, 'Their relationship began with a lack of affection, but living in the same family and bonding with each other led to feelings that transcended the usual sibling dynamic. Despite their attempts to restrain their feelings, they were unable to resist their feelings for each other.', 'Their relationship began with a lack of affection, but living in the same family and bonding with each other led to feelings that transcended the usual sibling dynamic. Despite their attempts to restrain their feelings, they were unable to resist their feelings for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/613AmtIGnTHWBZPmaKpEeFONbeP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:303536'),
  ('410097043594401092', 'Shadow of Truth', 2016, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Ari Pines, Mika Timor, Yotam Guendelman', null, 'Ilana Rada, Roman Zadorov, Shmuel Rada', 'TV-MA', 'In 2006, the body of the girl Tair Rada was found in the bathroom stall at the school where she studied. Days later, the police arrested a suspect - Roman Zadorov, and after a week of intense interrogation he admits and restores the murder. However, even after he was convicted three times, many still believe in his innocence. The series explores the length and breadth provision and leaving no stone unturned in an attempt to complete the picture of the puzzle, exposing new and dramatic discoveries. Through a complex mosaic of interviews, photographs and cinematic touch with the extensive use of inquiry and archives, the show tries to fathom the overwhelming truth.', 'In 2006, the body of the girl Tair Rada was found in the bathroom stall at the school where she studied. Days later, the police arrested a suspect - Roman Zadorov, and after a week of intense interrogation he admits and restores the murder. However, even after he was convicted three times, many still believe in his innocence. The series explores the length and breadth provision and leaving no stone unturned in an attempt to complete the picture of the puzzle, exposing new and dramatic discoveries. Through a complex mosaic of interviews, photographs and cinematic touch with the extensive use of inquiry and archives, the show tries to fathom the overwhelming truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/339w1FvyQvZTdaY6knV4iaItRJJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66201'),
  ('776145041430564227', 'Shadow Raiders', 1998, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Kids', null, null, 'Paul Dobson, Donna Yamamoto, Garry Chalk, Mark Oliver, Enuka Okuma, Tegan Moss, Matt Hill, Jim Byrnes', null, 'Despite the history of their warring past, the four planets of Ice, Rock, Fire, and Bone must set aside their differences and feuds to work together and form an alliance: their only hope of defeating a common enemy. The powerful Beast Planet, whose only purpose is the total destruction and annihilation of other worlds, has now entered their universe from the darkest reaches of space.', 'Despite the history of their warring past, the four planets of Ice, Rock, Fire, and Bone must set aside their differences and feuds to work together and form an alliance: their only hope of defeating a common enemy. The powerful Beast Planet, whose only purpose is the total destruction and annihilation of other worlds, has now entered their universe from the darkest reaches of space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zQXauw9aUl9h4mYQp3i1sLcQpHK.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:464'),
  ('590883011933468997', 'Shadow Skill', 1998, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Megumu Okada', null, 'Akio Matsuoka, Ikue Otani, Yuko Mizutani, Megumi Hayashibara, Yasunori Matsumoto, Chieko Honda, Chinami Nishimura, Kazuhiro Nakata', 'TV-PG', 'Sevalle, an elite breed whose mastery of martial arts has made them legendary. But for the 59th Sevalle, Elle Ragu, a.k.a. Shadow Skill, being a legend is shaping up to be something of a drag. After all, adventure alone doesn''t pay the rent, and living check to check takes its toll on even the fiercest warrior. Strong as an ox and stubborn as a mule she may be, but it''s drinking like a fish that usually gets Elle in trouble. And as she travels alongside her brother Gau, leaving property damage and unpaid bar-tabs in their wake, a new threat looms on the horizon: spies from the kingdom of Solfan have entered the picture, and Kuruda seems to be headed for war...', 'Sevalle, an elite breed whose mastery of martial arts has made them legendary. But for the 59th Sevalle, Elle Ragu, a.k.a. Shadow Skill, being a legend is shaping up to be something of a drag. After all, adventure alone doesn''t pay the rent, and living check to check takes its toll on even the fiercest warrior. Strong as an ox and stubborn as a mule she may be, but it''s drinking like a fish that usually gets Elle in trouble. And as she travels alongside her brother Gau, leaving property damage and unpaid bar-tabs in their wake, a new threat looms on the horizon: spies from the kingdom of Solfan have entered the picture, and Kuruda seems to be headed for war...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iBHz9ABqQR7fFfBoppl1WiQf29B.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42673'),
  ('772120691146877388', 'Shadow Star Narutaru', 2003, 'Drama, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Asami Sanada, Mamiko Noto, Sakura Nogawa, Satsuki Yukino, Akira Ishida, Eiji Miyashita, Hideki Tasaka, Hisayoshi Suganuma', null, 'A girl named Shiina Tamai bonds with a starfish-shaped "dragonchild" whom she calls Hoshimaru.', 'A girl named Shiina Tamai bonds with a starfish-shaped "dragonchild" whom she calls Hoshimaru.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ixARvxzqc4COaJwf5kXJweS0Op.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:24667'),
  ('869371400739163219', 'Shadowhunters', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ed Decter', null, 'Katherine McNamara, Dominic Sherwood, Alberto Rosende, Matthew Daddario, Harry Shum Jr., Anna Hopkins, Emeraude Toubia, Isaiah Mustafa', 'TV-14', 'When Clary Fray''s mother has disappeared, Clary joins a band of Shadowhunters; demon killing hunters, and gets caught up in a plan to save the world.', 'When Clary Fray''s mother has disappeared, Clary joins a band of Shadowhunters; demon killing hunters, and gets caught up in a plan to save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66YHvvVduC21xcMXPpBBF0ywyVZ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:63210'),
  ('1068997656595078076', 'Shadowlands', 2018, 'Drama', 'Charlie David', 'Charlie David', 'Nicolas James Wilson, Patrick Ware, James Tuckett, Leo Sciara, Cody Ray, Katherine Piro, Rubie Magnitude, Bea Macapagal', 'NR', 'An anthology style series that explores love in three separate stories - a couple renegotiating a relationship, a narcissist grasping to comprehend it, and star-crossed lovers mourning its loss.', 'An anthology style series that explores love in three separate stories - a couple renegotiating a relationship, a narcissist grasping to comprehend it, and star-crossed lovers mourning its loss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bLwtxJ9EueCjn8Eos7AKPX89TU9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81299'),
  ('954666491306781953', 'Shadowplay', 2020, 'Drama', 'Måns Mårlind', null, 'Taylor Kitsch, Michael C. Hall, Nina Hoss, Sebastian Koch, Tuppence Middleton, Logan Marshall-Green, Mala Emde, Anne Ratte-Polle', 'TV-MA', 'In 1946 Berlin, an American cop searches for his missing brother while helping a novice German policewoman fight the violent crimes engulfing the city.', 'In 1946 Berlin, an American cop searches for his missing brother while helping a novice German policewoman fight the violent crimes engulfing the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKWqlJ61exCULoGanpKLtevURwN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93781'),
  ('591927412232170389', 'Shadows', 2014, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Șerban Pavlu', null, 'Relu is a family man. He has two children, a wife and a double life. Seen through the eyes of his family, Relu Oncescu appears to be an ordinary taxi driver. No one suspects that Relu works as a collector for Capitanu'', a local mobster. Neither of the two worlds (his family and the mafia) knows of the other''s existence. Relu manages to keep everything under control, but not for long. After accidentally killing a man, he tries to get out of the underworld, but he can''t find his way back. Day by day, the secrets he keeps become increasingly oppressive and the lies begin to surface, one by one.', 'Relu is a family man. He has two children, a wife and a double life. Seen through the eyes of his family, Relu Oncescu appears to be an ordinary taxi driver. No one suspects that Relu works as a collector for Capitanu'', a local mobster. Neither of the two worlds (his family and the mafia) knows of the other''s existence. Relu manages to keep everything under control, but not for long. After accidentally killing a man, he tries to get out of the underworld, but he can''t find his way back. Day by day, the secrets he keeps become increasingly oppressive and the lies begin to surface, one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/anYqLjFi1CuGQDIlsSuEfTEBjBz.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:62111'),
  ('1126774270890422403', 'Shadows Disappear at Noon', 1972, 'Drama', null, 'Arnold Vitol, Anatoliy Ivanov', 'Sergei Yakovlev, Valeri Gatayev, Pyotr Velyaminov, Nina Ruslanova, Galina Polskikh, Boris Novikov, Aleksandra Zavyalova, Vladimir Samoylov', null, 'The story of a small village Zeleny Dol, lost in the taiga wilderness, became a reflection of the fate of a huge country. A wide panorama of people''s life unfolds before the viewer: from the defeat of Kolchak''s White gangs to the first tractor furrow on the collective farm meadow, from the first elections to the Supreme Soviet to the send-off of Zelenodol residents to the fronts of the WW2, from the labor feat of women''s hands in the rear to Victory Day, to the first post-war bread.', 'The story of a small village Zeleny Dol, lost in the taiga wilderness, became a reflection of the fate of a huge country. A wide panorama of people''s life unfolds before the viewer: from the defeat of Kolchak''s White gangs to the first tractor furrow on the collective farm meadow, from the first elections to the Supreme Soviet to the send-off of Zelenodol residents to the fronts of the WW2, from the labor feat of women''s hands in the rear to Victory Day, to the first post-war bread.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x0OHH0xgeak9Z4kMH1GmqWHmpdk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:53005'),
  ('929177275075048674', 'Shadows House', 2021, 'Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Akari Kito, Yu Sasahara, Koudai Sakai, Ayane Sakura, Reiji Kawashima, Mai Nakahara, Saori Onishi, Rie Kugimiya', 'TV-14', 'A faceless clan lives in a large mansion, masquerading as nobles. Their caretakers are living dolls who spend their days cleaning up the dirt the tenants leave behind. But there’s a deeper mystery at play… and the secret of the house will be unveiled.', 'A faceless clan lives in a large mansion, masquerading as nobles. Their caretakers are living dolls who spend their days cleaning up the dirt the tenants leave behind. But there’s a deeper mystery at play… and the secret of the house will be unveiled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lyB5T6lWA4yCPZxolZ2KuVm8YV3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:111576'),
  ('767475323565550696', 'Shadows of Love', 2026, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Berna Aruz', 'Berna Aruz', 'Deniz Can Aktaş, Uraz Kaygılaroğlu, Devrim Özkan, Sümeyye Aydoğan, Burak Sevinç, Ülkü Hilal Çiftçi, Koray Şahinbaş, Hülya Gülşen Irmak', null, 'Haydar Ali after avenging his family’s murder, ends up in prison. There, he finds himself in the middle of one of Türkiye’s most dangerous underground cartels. However, the truly deadly confrontation begins three years later, when he regains his freedom and learns that the woman whom he has never been able to forget, is now the wife of the man closest to him.', 'Haydar Ali after avenging his family’s murder, ends up in prison. There, he finds himself in the middle of one of Türkiye’s most dangerous underground cartels. However, the truly deadly confrontation begins three years later, when he regains his freedom and learns that the woman whom he has never been able to forget, is now the wife of the man closest to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bu8ks983hBPEzyAH8gSATW5aPJ7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:309328'),
  ('195230316365353918', 'Shadows of the Past', 2014, 'Soap, Drama', 'María del Carmen Peña, Cuauhtémoc Blanco, Víctor Manuel Medina', 'Víctor Manuel Medina, Antonio Abascal, María del Carmen Peña', 'Michelle Renaud, Pablo Lyle, Alejandra Barros, Alexis Ayala, Susana González, Thelma Madrigal, Cynthia Klitbo, Alfredo Adame', 'NR', 'Two very different families live in the village of Santa Lucía who are involved in a whirlwind of passion, pain, and revenge. The rivaling families are the Mendozas and the Alcocers. Severiano Mendoza and Candela Santana are a rich and powerful marriage who live at the ranch, "Las Ánimas", along with their young son, Cristóbal. Roberta and Raymundo Alcocer also have a daughter named Alonza; however, they do not live with the same luxuries as the Mendoza family, which causes frustration and resentment in Roberta as nothing is enough to fill the inferiority complex that follows her like a shadow.', 'Two very different families live in the village of Santa Lucía who are involved in a whirlwind of passion, pain, and revenge. The rivaling families are the Mendozas and the Alcocers. Severiano Mendoza and Candela Santana are a rich and powerful marriage who live at the ranch, "Las Ánimas", along with their young son, Cristóbal. Roberta and Raymundo Alcocer also have a daughter named Alonza; however, they do not live with the same luxuries as the Mendoza family, which causes frustration and resentment in Roberta as nothing is enough to fill the inferiority complex that follows her like a shadow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2j4tr5ZaY6ljPWik0GQE3RvVyXz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78293'),
  ('37840953793467573', 'Shadows over the Balkans', 2017, 'Crime, Drama, War & Politics', 'Dragan Bjelogrlić', null, 'Andrija Kuzmanović, Marija Bergam, Dragan Bjelogrlić, Miloš Timotijević, Srđan ''Žika'' Todorović', 'NR', 'A historical fiction drama and thriller set in the turbulent period of the late 1930s in the Balkans as a place where high politics, local interests, capital and crime all merge together.', 'A historical fiction drama and thriller set in the turbulent period of the late 1930s in the Balkans as a place where high politics, local interests, capital and crime all merge together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8CoJjks7qPiycXzgHTt7f0capzB.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:74647'),
  ('925002383287987862', 'Shadowverse', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuto Uemura, Hibiku Yamamura, Kazuki Ura, Shiori Izawa, Showtaro Morikubo, Larissa Tago Takeda, Miyu Tomita, Yuki Sakakihara', 'TV-14', 'The hottest battle is about to begin! While attending Tensei Academy, Hiro Ryugasaki ends up acquiring a mysterious smartphone. It comes installed with the popular card game, Shadowverse! Meeting new rivals, facing major tournaments, forging bonds with friends... Shadowverse leads Hiro to all sorts of new experiences, all that serve to "evolve" him...', 'The hottest battle is about to begin! While attending Tensei Academy, Hiro Ryugasaki ends up acquiring a mysterious smartphone. It comes installed with the popular card game, Shadowverse! Meeting new rivals, facing major tournaments, forging bonds with friends... Shadowverse leads Hiro to all sorts of new experiences, all that serve to "evolve" him...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5OaguSPlSrfE1JCSsymwDXsdbz6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:98823'),
  ('732097857580700246', 'Shafted', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Noémie Saglio', null, 'Manu Payet, Guillaume Labbé, Vincent Heneine, Antoine Gouy, Mélanie Bernier, Ariane Mourier, Olga Kurylenko, Frankie Wallach', 'TV-MA', 'Four middle-aged male friends fumble their way through love, life and career crises in modern-day Paris — when did being a man become so hard?', 'Four middle-aged male friends fumble their way through love, life and career crises in modern-day Paris — when did being a man become so hard?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCP1vmCODED6TzCCXEQFr5dYymh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241816'),
  ('780134007029232756', 'Shaggy & Scooby-Doo Get a Clue!', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Kids, Mystery', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Frank Welker, Scott Menville, Jim Meskimen, Casey Kasem, Jeff Bennett', 'TV-Y7', 'When Shaggy''s rich Uncle Albert goes missing and is presumed dead, Shaggy receives an inheritance, which he uses to upgrade the Mystery Machine so it can transform itself into other types of vehicles. Before disappearing, Uncle Albert made some enemies and it is up to Shaggy and his trusty canine, Scooby-Doo, to defeat those enemies, the most dangerous of whom is evil Dr. Phineas Phibes. Armed with the upgraded Mystery Machine, a loyal robot servant and their new riches, Shaggy and Scooby must stop Dr. Phibes'' evil plans and save the world.', 'When Shaggy''s rich Uncle Albert goes missing and is presumed dead, Shaggy receives an inheritance, which he uses to upgrade the Mystery Machine so it can transform itself into other types of vehicles. Before disappearing, Uncle Albert made some enemies and it is up to Shaggy and his trusty canine, Scooby-Doo, to defeat those enemies, the most dangerous of whom is evil Dr. Phineas Phibes. Armed with the upgraded Mystery Machine, a loyal robot servant and their new riches, Shaggy and Scooby must stop Dr. Phibes'' evil plans and save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5pGwh9BKmw6Ciy5EvXqm9aKPZWT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:593'),
  ('662784206134173004', 'Shagun', 2001, 'Drama, Family', null, null, 'Surbhi Tiwari, Kabir Sadanand, Rekha Rao, Surendra Pal', 'NR', 'Shagun was a Hindi language daily Indian soap opera that was telecast on STAR Plus. It was story of fortune''s twists and pitfalls that tear asunder the lives of two cousins tied together by a bond stronger than that of blood - the bond of love.', 'Shagun was a Hindi language daily Indian soap opera that was telecast on STAR Plus. It was story of fortune''s twists and pitfalls that tear asunder the lives of two cousins tied together by a bond stronger than that of blood - the bond of love.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:8478'),
  ('50045765899942661', 'Shahmaran', 2023, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Pınar Bulut', null, 'Serenay Sarıkaya, Burak Deniz, Mert Ramazan Demir, Saadet Işıl Aksoy, Olimpia Ahenk', 'TV-MA', 'In this fantasy drama series, a lonely young woman finds her soul mate and discovers they are both part of an ancient legend.', 'In this fantasy drama series, a lonely young woman finds her soul mate and discovers they are both part of an ancient legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Syz73lDTw9A4AeUIVDJvaYbXJh.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:214078'),
