  ('333024812960569929', 'Shaka iLembe', 2023, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Teboho Mahlatsi, Angus Gibson, Mpumelelo Paul Grootboom', 'Teboho Mahlatsi', 'Lemogang Tsipa, Nomzamo Mbatha, Senzo Radebe, Dawn Thandeka King, Khabonina Qubeka, Thembinkosi Mthembu, Hope Mbhele, Abdul Khoza', null, 'Set in the 1700s, Shaka iLembe tells the story of the making of the iconic African king, with iterations from his early childhood through to adulthood.', 'Set in the 1700s, Shaka iLembe tells the story of the making of the iconic African king, with iterations from his early childhood through to adulthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/unst24GN4ide77Sa0FWrp6mdVGC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:226218'),
