  ('937786495402927237', 'Shaka Zulu', 1986, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, War & Politics', 'William C. Faure', null, 'Henry Cele, Dudu Mkhize, Edward Fox, Robert Powell, Trevor Howard, Fiona Fullerton, Christopher Lee, Roy Dotrice', 'TV-14', 'South Africa, 1823. The Zulu Empire, headed by King Shaka, a brilliant but ruthless military strategist, begin to encroach on the British colony of Cape Town. A volunteer cadre of explorers, mercenaries and professional soldiers are sent to Zululand to try to make contact with Shaka and assess the real threat of his army.', 'South Africa, 1823. The Zulu Empire, headed by King Shaka, a brilliant but ruthless military strategist, begin to encroach on the British colony of Cape Town. A volunteer cadre of explorers, mercenaries and professional soldiers are sent to Zululand to try to make contact with Shaka and assess the real threat of his army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w9bMK4TmRtRzSIlvBkWPH6bUSjr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8068'),
  ('811803333609698361', 'Shake It Up', 2010, 'Family, Kids, Comedy, Drama', 'Chris Thompson', null, 'Bella Thorne, Zendaya, Davis Cleveland, Roshon Fegan, Adam Irigoyen, Caroline Sunshine', 'TV-G', 'Best pals CeCe and Rocky dream of dancing stardom. And they seem on the verge of realizing that goal when they win places as backup dancers on the local TV show "Shake It Up, Chicago." While they get to show off their moves, they find out they need to keep putting their best feet forward to keep up with the rest of the crew on the show.', 'Best pals CeCe and Rocky dream of dancing stardom. And they seem on the verge of realizing that goal when they win places as backup dancers on the local TV show "Shake It Up, Chicago." While they get to show off their moves, they find out they need to keep putting their best feet forward to keep up with the rest of the crew on the show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oD7B9qrgqT7tUZNi3pk2onk5C2D.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:33213'),
  ('966498762378536238', 'Shakespeare & Hathaway - Private Investigators', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'Jude Tindall, Paul Matthew Thompson', null, 'Jo Joyner, Mark Benton, Patrick Walshe McBride', 'TV-PG', 'Frank Hathaway, a hardboiled private investigator, and his rookie sidekick Lu Shakespeare form the unlikeliest of partnerships as they investigate the secrets of rural Warwickshire''s residents.', 'Frank Hathaway, a hardboiled private investigator, and his rookie sidekick Lu Shakespeare form the unlikeliest of partnerships as they investigate the secrets of rural Warwickshire''s residents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3NOaMERvhLD88SLKYRUs7HmM1i.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:77493'),
  ('439593388092261089', 'ShakespeaRe-Told', 2005, 'Drama', 'Peter Bowker', null, 'Nick Malinowski', null, 'Four of Shakespeare''s plays are dramatically relocated to the modern day.', 'Four of Shakespeare''s plays are dramatically relocated to the modern day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pmn47AXUaCUK2PjIeqolDFJDoiW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13562'),
  ('858200466703414748', 'Shakespeare: The Animated Tales', 1992, 'Animation', 'Christopher Grace', null, null, null, 'An animated adaptation of twelve of Shakespeare''s best-known plays. The series was produced by S4C for the BBC, but animated by some of the foremost artists of Soyuzmultfilm, the former Soviet Union''s main animation studio. Each 26-minute play is directed by a different animator, in a wide variety of styles: cel animation for Macbeth, stop-motion puppets in Twelfth Night, and paint on glass for Hamlet.', 'An animated adaptation of twelve of Shakespeare''s best-known plays. The series was produced by S4C for the BBC, but animated by some of the foremost artists of Soyuzmultfilm, the former Soviet Union''s main animation studio. Each 26-minute play is directed by a different animator, in a wide variety of styles: cel animation for Macbeth, stop-motion puppets in Twelfth Night, and paint on glass for Hamlet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTVrqJ1kdXgOaqlCthmd9iqfmrD.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:47361'),
  ('268444470039114186', 'Shakugan no Shana', 2005, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Satoshi Hino, Rie Kugimiya, Masashi Ebara, Hitomi Nabatame, Mitsuo Iwata, Mamiko Noto, Kenta Miyake, Junko Minagawa', 'TV-14', 'Murdered by a demonic being, 15-year-old Yuji Sakai has his life force replaced by a flame that dims with each day. When the flame dies, no one will remember he was ever alive. This is how he meets Shana: a warrior with a burning sword, and the will of a god as her guide. The two form a bond as Yuji becomes Shana’s accomplice in her battles to keep the balance between the ordinary world and hers.', 'Murdered by a demonic being, 15-year-old Yuji Sakai has his life force replaced by a flame that dims with each day. When the flame dies, no one will remember he was ever alive. This is how he meets Shana: a warrior with a burning sword, and the will of a god as her guide. The two form a bond as Yuji becomes Shana’s accomplice in her battles to keep the balance between the ordinary world and hers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sesXxmmb2TZ9uq6ETIkOQkxK1wV.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:22634'),
  ('1027180017831072285', 'Shalen', 2012, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Jiang Bian, Bai Xuecen, Shan Xin, Hui Long, Li Lu, Zhao Yi, Kai Wang', 'TV-14', 'When Nian Chi was a young child, his elder sister was kidnapped in front of him, while he could do nothing but watch, a thing that has tormented him for all these years. Now 10 years later, he''s dead set on going to rescue his sister, and sets out.', 'When Nian Chi was a young child, his elder sister was kidnapped in front of him, while he could do nothing but watch, a thing that has tormented him for all these years. Now 10 years later, he''s dead set on going to rescue his sister, and sets out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dXTSTaxxLaRobsHdDiWmCHRI4XR.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:106853'),
  ('1059889157481241373', 'Shaman King', 2001, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Katsuhiko Koide', 'Inuko Inuyama, Katsuyuki Konishi, Masahiko Tanaka, Yuuko Satou, Megumi Hayashibara, Romi Park, Takehito Koyasu, Yoko Soumi', 'TV-Y7', 'Asakura Yoh is a shaman, a person who communicates with ghosts. He enters the Shaman Fight, for whoever wins the tournament gets to commune with the Great Spirit, God... that and his fiance Anna wants to be the wife of the Shaman King. Helping him are his friends Manta, Horo Horo, Ryu, and his samurai ghost partner, Amidamaru.', 'Asakura Yoh is a shaman, a person who communicates with ghosts. He enters the Shaman Fight, for whoever wins the tournament gets to commune with the Great Spirit, God... that and his fiance Anna wants to be the wife of the Shaman King. Helping him are his friends Manta, Horo Horo, Ryu, and his samurai ghost partner, Amidamaru.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bDJLF92frEmKSr1OlCZN5P1kx6W.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40143'),
  ('952806686818558806', 'SHAMAN KING', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Yoko Hikasa, Katsuyuki Konishi, Minami Takayama, Megumi Hayashibara, Inuko Inuyama, Romi Park, Kosuke Takaguchi, Masahiko Tanaka', 'TV-14', 'Medium Yoh Asakura enters a battle tournament held every 500 years, competing with other shamans in a bid to become the all-powerful Shaman King.', 'Medium Yoh Asakura enters a battle tournament held every 500 years, competing with other shamans in a bid to become the all-powerful Shaman King.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/my6AEDKL6NfJYOLZg5g71D3PBe2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:104699'),
  ('1015864812552246617', 'SHAMAN KING FLOWERS', 2024, 'Animation', null, null, 'Yoko Hikasa, Katsuyuki Konishi, Sumire Uesaka, Shun Horie, Kentaro Ito, Ami Koshimizu, Nana Mizuki, Takumu Miyazono', null, 'Asakura Hana finds that being the son of Asakura You & Anna isn''t all it''s cracked up to be, and his boredom has him itching for any kind of excitement. But when a fight comes straight to his doorstep, it''s from a place he least expects—his own family? The battle for Asakura supremacy begins!', 'Asakura Hana finds that being the son of Asakura You & Anna isn''t all it''s cracked up to be, and his boredom has him itching for any kind of excitement. But when a fight comes straight to his doorstep, it''s from a place he least expects—his own family? The battle for Asakura supremacy begins!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMViGZqSsj58BEWdGkYWvgKF9Mm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:232865'),
  ('335351498387455927', 'Shamanic Princess', 1996, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Mami Watanabe', 'Mami Watanabe', 'Hiro Yuuki, Koichi Yamadera, Mitsuki Yayoi, Sayuri, Rica Matsumoto, Tomoko Maruo, Yuki Imai, Ai Satou', 'TV-14', 'To retrieve the talisman stolen by her beloved, Tiara hunts the night, battling monsters with her awesome shamanic powers. Disguised as an ordinary schoolgirl by day, she arrives at his lair only to find her arch rival on the scene... protecting the thief. Dark secrets unravel as Tiara faces these powerful opponents, and her one hope for survival may be to betray her mission.', 'To retrieve the talisman stolen by her beloved, Tiara hunts the night, battling monsters with her awesome shamanic powers. Disguised as an ordinary schoolgirl by day, she arrives at his lair only to find her arch rival on the scene... protecting the thief. Dark secrets unravel as Tiara faces these powerful opponents, and her one hope for survival may be to betray her mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jUCGoVhkXoBHNXu22O9ojnxc8h0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42778'),
  ('168221968061153017', 'Shambles', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Florence Foresti', null, 'Florence Foresti, Béatrice Facquer, Laetitia Vercken, Anouk Feral', null, 'When Florence Foresti is not on stage, she is a woman like any other. Worse yet. A public figure, she’s also a joint-custodial mother, a drifting bachelor, an inspiration-seeking artist, and a chronic sufferer.', 'When Florence Foresti is not on stage, she is a woman like any other. Worse yet. A public figure, she’s also a joint-custodial mother, a drifting bachelor, an inspiration-seeking artist, and a chronic sufferer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4LkhPcTQ6HboHaL4gL1wpp14AT7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:201824'),
  ('1140985631905505706', 'Shameless', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Paul Abbott', null, 'David Threlfall, Nicky Evans, Rebecca Atkinson, Tina Malone, Aaron McCusker, Qasim Akhtar, Alice Barry, Robbie Conway', 'TV-MA', 'The story of a young group of siblings pretty much abandoned by their parents, surviving by their wits - and humor - on a rough Manchester council estate. Whilst they won''t admit it, they need help and find it in Steve, a young middle class lad who falls for Fiona, the oldest sibling, and increasingly finds himself drawn to this unconventional and unique family. Anarchic family life seen through the eyes of an exceptionally bright fifteen year old, who struggles to come of age in the context of his belligerent father, closeted brother, psychotic sister and internet porn star neighbors.', 'The story of a young group of siblings pretty much abandoned by their parents, surviving by their wits - and humor - on a rough Manchester council estate. Whilst they won''t admit it, they need help and find it in Steve, a young middle class lad who falls for Fiona, the oldest sibling, and increasingly finds himself drawn to this unconventional and unique family. Anarchic family life seen through the eyes of an exceptionally bright fifteen year old, who struggles to come of age in the context of his belligerent father, closeted brother, psychotic sister and internet porn star neighbors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kE30UWJvJZ03KIIJMmL6m6YoG0l.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:1906'),
  ('926014773289649194', 'Shameless', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Paul Abbott, John Wells', null, 'William H. Macy, Jeremy Allen White, Ethan Cutkosky, Shanola Hampton, Steve Howey, Emma Kenney, Christian Isaiah, Cameron Monaghan', 'TV-MA', 'Chicagoan Frank Gallagher is the proud single dad of six smart, industrious, independent kids, who without him would be... perhaps better off. When Frank''s not at the bar spending what little money they have, he''s passed out on the floor. But the kids have found ways to grow up in spite of him. They may not be like any family you know, but they make no apologies for being exactly who they are.', 'Chicagoan Frank Gallagher is the proud single dad of six smart, industrious, independent kids, who without him would be... perhaps better off. When Frank''s not at the bar spending what little money they have, he''s passed out on the floor. But the kids have found ways to grow up in spite of him. They may not be like any family you know, but they make no apologies for being exactly who they are.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifo31fMWLmyOVpdak9K0kY4jldQ.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:34307'),
  ('1042332980058310490', 'Shameless (US)', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', 'William H. Macy, Alex Borstein, John Wells, Nancy M. Pimental, Etan Frankel', 'William H. Macy, Alex Borstein, John Wells, Nancy M. Pimental, Etan Frankel, Sheila Callaghan, Krista Vernoff, Joe Lawson, Davey Holmes, Molly Smith Metzler, Philip Buiser, Mike O''Malley, Dominique Morisseau, Sherman Payne, Paul Abbott, Corina Maritescu, Cindy Caponera, Mark Steilen, Nathan Jackson, Steven Schachter, LaToya Morgan, Lisa Morales', 'Jeremy Allen White, Ethan Cutkosky, Steve Howey, Emma Kenney, Cameron Monaghan', 'TV-MA', 'Chicagoan Frank Gallagher is the proud single dad of six smart, industrious, independent kids, who without him would be... perhaps better off. When Frank''s not at the bar spending what little money they have, he''s passed out on the floor. But the kids have found ways to grow up in spite of him. They may not be like any family you know, but they make no apologies for being exactly who they are.', 'Chicagoan Frank Gallagher is the proud single dad of six smart, industrious, independent kids, who without him would be... perhaps better off. When Frank''s not at the bar spending what little money they have, he''s passed out on the floor. But the kids have found ways to grow up in spite of him. They may not be like any family you know, but they make no apologies for being exactly who they are.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fifo31fMWLmyOVpdak9K0kY4jldQ.jpg', 11, 'plex:tv:shameless-us'),
  ('319168702326938618', 'Shameless Hall of Shame', 2020, 'Drama', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Retrospective look at ten seasons of Gallagher trials and tribulations.', 'Retrospective look at ten seasons of Gallagher trials and tribulations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IFTqMzUHzAYsrhfcX9jxIYVZHw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208736'),
  ('404704414931909985', 'Shangri-La', 2009, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mikako Takahashi, Jouji Nakata, Takahiro Sakurai, Daisuke Hirakawa, Hisako Kyoda, Sachika Misawa, Makoto Ishii, Tomoko Kaneda', 'TV-14', 'The story of a young woman fighting for her survival in a real "urban jungle." Only 18 years old, Kuniko Hojo finds herself at the heart of the battle for humanity''s future when she discovers that the government which rules Atlas intends to continue marginalising the less-privileged masses outside the tower - by force, if necessary.', 'The story of a young woman fighting for her survival in a real "urban jungle." Only 18 years old, Kuniko Hojo finds herself at the heart of the battle for humanity''s future when she discovers that the government which rules Atlas intends to continue marginalising the less-privileged masses outside the tower - by force, if necessary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6zqDAcSXqDeUHfJY1WviBBGicIt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:27008'),
  ('514426849087657372', 'Shangri-La', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Rick Rubin', 'TV-MA', 'An intimate look at the creative process through the lens of legendary music producer Rick Rubin.', 'An intimate look at the creative process through the lens of legendary music producer Rick Rubin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCdmFw80tx6N9Y008KExXsx0fj1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89954'),
  ('133440684834375303', 'Shangri-La Frontier', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuma Uchida, Azumi Waki, Yoko Hikasa, Makoto Koichi, Rina Hidaka, Akio Otsuka, Seiichiro Yamashita, Yumiri Hanamori', 'TV-14', 'Rakuro Hizutome only cares about one thing: beating crappy VR games. He devotes his entire life to these buggy games and could clear them all in his sleep. One day, he decides to challenge himself and play a popular god-tier game called Shangri-La Frontier. But he quickly learns just how difficult it is. Will his expert skills be enough to uncover its hidden secrets?', 'Rakuro Hizutome only cares about one thing: beating crappy VR games. He devotes his entire life to these buggy games and could clear them all in his sleep. One day, he decides to challenge himself and play a popular god-tier game called Shangri-La Frontier. But he quickly learns just how difficult it is. Will his expert skills be enough to uncover its hidden secrets?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCGdpgNkgz66R1winFkTFsMAhlC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:205050'),
  ('261029029397189719', 'Shantaram', 2022, 'Crime, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Eric Warren Singer, Steve Lightfoot', null, 'Charlie Hunnam, Shubham Saraf, Antonia Desplat, Elektra Jansson-Kilbey, Fayssal Bazzi, Elham Ehsas, Sujaya Dasgupta, Rachel Kamath', 'TV-MA', 'Escaped convict Lin Ford flees to the teeming streets of 1980s Bombay, looking to disappear. Working as a medic for the city''s poor and neglected, Lin finds unexpected love, connection, and courage on the long road to redemption.', 'Escaped convict Lin Ford flees to the teeming streets of 1980s Bombay, looking to disappear. Working as a medic for the city''s poor and neglected, Lin finds unexpected love, connection, and courage on the long road to redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6FZCmmAdszkEFLAoibEuJPDhW40.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95341'),
  ('936198280856531223', 'Shanty Town', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', null, 'Shirleyann Ede, Xavier Ighorodje, Ayomikun Paseda', 'Richard Mofe-Damijo, Sola Sobowale, Nse Ikpe-Etim, Lilian Afegbai, Toyin Abraham, Ini Edo, Ali Nuhu, Chidi Mokeme', 'TV-MA', 'A group of courtesans attempts to escape the grasp of a notorious kingpin – but political corruption and blood ties make freedom a near-impossible goal.', 'A group of courtesans attempts to escape the grasp of a notorious kingpin – but political corruption and blood ties make freedom a near-impossible goal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a7jRDMea7ADCtPphb9nOMp2dkgK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217460'),
  ('1112873092857927327', 'Shaolin Wuzang', 2006, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Eric-Paul Marais, 周铭', 'Yiqing Huang, Liu Qiang, Xu Gang, Wang Xiaobing, Fily Keita, Sébastien Desjours, Fabrice Josso, Yves Barsacq', null, 'Set in Ancient China, three teenagers are admitted into the most prestigious school of kung fu: the Temple of Shaolin. But they don''t know that they are the reincarnation of three Shaolin monks who a thousand years earlier gave their life to neutralize the worst demon. This demon is back now and our three heroes will have to destroy it while initiating themselves with the art of kung fu.', 'Set in Ancient China, three teenagers are admitted into the most prestigious school of kung fu: the Temple of Shaolin. But they don''t know that they are the reincarnation of three Shaolin monks who a thousand years earlier gave their life to neutralize the worst demon. This demon is back now and our three heroes will have to destroy it while initiating themselves with the art of kung fu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k8huQPeNiZOt6QL6PCAqljw5cVA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:58394'),
  ('370658626724126508', 'Shape Island', 2023, 'Kids, Family, Animation', 'Mac Barnett, Jon Klassen', null, 'Gideon Adlon, Scott Adsit, Harvey Guillén, Yvette Nicole Brown', 'TV-G', 'On a charming island, Square, Triangle, and Circle seek adventure and connection while learning how to navigate each other''s differences.', 'On a charming island, Square, Triangle, and Circle seek adventure and connection while learning how to navigate each other''s differences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJu8gM5eso8It2uPNbvGV7A95VN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:217658'),
  ('312813392639741469', 'Shaped By Sound', 2025, 'Documentary, Talk', 'N.C. Music Office', null, 'James Mieczkowski', null, 'Shaped by Sound spotlights North Carolina’s thriving music scene, featuring artists from a broad range of genres, including indie rock, hip-hop, R&B, alt-country, jazz, bluegrass and folk. Each episode weaves a visually stunning live studio performance by an NC artist or band with an intimate conversation about their creative journey. Made possible through support from Come Hear NC, a program of the N.C. Music Office within the N.C. Department of Natural and Cultural Resources.', 'Shaped by Sound spotlights North Carolina’s thriving music scene, featuring artists from a broad range of genres, including indie rock, hip-hop, R&B, alt-country, jazz, bluegrass and folk. Each episode weaves a visually stunning live studio performance by an NC artist or band with an intimate conversation about their creative journey. Made possible through support from Come Hear NC, a program of the N.C. Music Office within the N.C. Department of Natural and Cultural Resources.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9cumi3eFo6Tpv869woJz7Rm2gSt.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:284866'),
  ('216014496194484499', 'Shaq', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Peter Berg', null, 'Shaquille O''Neal, Rick Fox, Dwyane Wade, Pat Riley, Lucille O''Neal, Derek Fisher, Brian Shaw, Dennis Scott', 'TV-14', 'Featuring a series of revealing interviews with Shaquille O''Neal, this four-part documentary tells the story of a basketball legend unlike any other, whose larger-than-life personality transcended the sport and transformed him into a cultural icon.', 'Featuring a series of revealing interviews with Shaquille O''Neal, this four-part documentary tells the story of a basketball legend unlike any other, whose larger-than-life personality transcended the sport and transformed him into a cultural icon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jIAXxjHo4FUYFCNZ8YNfgDfWzD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213083'),
  ('540416592568764960', 'Shararat - Thoda Jaadu, Thodi Nazaakat', 2003, 'Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Poonam Narula, Addite Shirwaikar Malik, Shruti Seth, Simple Kaul, Farida Jalal, Karanvir Bohra, Eva Grover, Menka Lalwani', null, 'The story revolves around how different people in the family adjust to the magical powers of naani and her daughters, who use their magical powers for their needs.', 'The story revolves around how different people in the family adjust to the magical powers of naani and her daughters, who use their magical powers for their needs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4WC8AEpg32wgumtqbbQDmEz1NoZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15428'),
  ('1126492239691414436', 'Shardlake', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Stephen Butchard, C. J. Sansom', null, 'Arthur Hughes, Anthony Boyle, Babou Ceesay, Paul Kaye, Ruby Ashbourne Serkis, Brian Vernel, David Pearse, Irfan Shamji', 'TV-14', 'The year is 1536. Lawyer Matthew Shardlake finds his life turned upside down when Thomas Cromwell sends him to investigate a suspicious death at the remote monastery of Scarnsea. Deception, deceit, and corruption are rife as it soon becomes clear that the murder is not the first. Shardlake is drawn into a web of lies that threatens not only his integrity but his life.', 'The year is 1536. Lawyer Matthew Shardlake finds his life turned upside down when Thomas Cromwell sends him to investigate a suspicious death at the remote monastery of Scarnsea. Deception, deceit, and corruption are rife as it soon becomes clear that the murder is not the first. Shardlake is drawn into a web of lies that threatens not only his integrity but his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sGolleKPiX4gCAuFWR2Yp7KZ1L.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223599'),
  ('88379021630207168', 'Shards of Her', 2022, 'Mystery, Drama', null, 'Yu-Fang Wen', 'Hsu Wei-ning, Toby Lee, Patty Lee, Chen-Ling Wen, Sara Yu, Ding Ning, Vins Wang, Jake Hsu', 'TV-MA', 'Waking up from a coma, an accomplished headhunter finds herself in an alternate reality where she has to revisit an excruciating childhood trauma.', 'Waking up from a coma, an accomplished headhunter finds herself in an alternate reality where she has to revisit an excruciating childhood trauma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9CkHdmob7SrjlfyKpQ4I9rZoAwX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197235'),
  ('928177196857975350', 'Shark', 2006, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Ian Biederman', null, 'James Woods, Jeri Ryan, Danielle Panabaker, Sophina Brown, Sarah Carter, Henry Simmons, Kevin Alejandro', 'TV-14', 'Notorious Los Angeles defense attorney Sebastian Stark becomes disillusioned with his career after his successful defense of a wife-abuser results in the wife''s death. After more than a month trying to come to grips with his situation, he is invited by the Los Angeles district attorney to become a public prosecutor so he can apply his unorthodox-but-effective talents to putting guilty people away instead of putting them back on the street.', 'Notorious Los Angeles defense attorney Sebastian Stark becomes disillusioned with his career after his successful defense of a wife-abuser results in the wife''s death. After more than a month trying to come to grips with his situation, he is invited by the Los Angeles district attorney to become a public prosecutor so he can apply his unorthodox-but-effective talents to putting guilty people away instead of putting them back on the street.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ahxpbk4Uu6zs1DgAbgfU80eHerx.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:400'),
  ('143214576143747638', 'Shark', 2015, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Paul McGann', 'NR', 'A major wildlife series on the sharks of the world with over thirty species filmed, showing how they hunt, intricate social lives, courtship, growing up and the threats they face.', 'A major wildlife series on the sharks of the world with over thirty species filmed, showing how they hunt, intricate social lives, courtship, growing up and the threats they face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gsP6XfyRu0b3RqxN3rt09Yc9S74.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65165'),
  ('485989028689829840', 'Shark Tank', 2009, 'Reality', 'Mark Burnett', null, 'Daymond John, Barbara Corcoran, Robert Herjavec, Kevin O''Leary, Lori Greiner, Daniel Lubetzky, Phil Crowley', 'TV-PG', 'Aspiring entrepreneurs pitch various business ideas to "The Sharks" -- tough, self-made, multi-millionaire and billionaire tycoons -- in hopes of landing an investment.', 'Aspiring entrepreneurs pitch various business ideas to "The Sharks" -- tough, self-made, multi-millionaire and billionaire tycoons -- in hopes of landing an investment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wztqq3SWfdzcuxvl9oA2HwOXasO.jpg', 17, 'tmdb:tv:30703'),
