  ('604045189119762068', 'Simon Schama''s Power of Art', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Simon Schama', null, 'Simon Schama', null, 'Documentary series in which historian Simon Schama recounts the story of eight moments of high drama in the making of eight artistic masterpieces.', 'Documentary series in which historian Simon Schama recounts the story of eight moments of high drama in the making of eight artistic masterpieces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7rjzgwQAPlauv5AOHmo8DTP8oxQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14131'),
