  ('945986360535373940', 'Sixth Sense', 2020, 'Talk, Reality', 'Jung Chul-min', null, 'Yoo Jae-suk, Lee Sang-yeob, Jessi, Lee Mi-joo, Oh Na-ra', null, 'Korea’s top stars have gathered to really use their sixth sense. Each week they will encounter the hottest places or people and have to distinguish one fake set-up. The production crew uses all of their resources and effort to create the most perfect-looking fake set-up. The member who makes the correct decision of finding the fake set-up will be awarded with a great prize. The member who makes the wrong decision will face a punishment.', 'Korea’s top stars have gathered to really use their sixth sense. Each week they will encounter the hottest places or people and have to distinguish one fake set-up. The production crew uses all of their resources and effort to create the most perfect-looking fake set-up. The member who makes the correct decision of finding the fake set-up will be awarded with a great prize. The member who makes the wrong decision will face a punishment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5qVVzz3G5wSPKiCjRzxeJmRDzWr.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:108877'),
  ('1045520767376747112', 'Siyah İnci', 2017, 'Drama', 'Erol Özlevi, Sedat İnci', 'Alphan Dikmen, Başak Angigün', 'Tolgahan Sayışman, Hande Erçel, Berk Hakman, Hüseyin Avni Danyal, Yeşim Büber, Melis Sezen, Mehmet Mehmedof, Selin Işık', null, 'Hazal, beautiful young girl is engajed with Kenan, handsome young fisherman. The day before their wedding, Hazal is forced to marry Vural, successful businessman who fall in love with her since the first time he saw her working on his birthday party as a waitress. Vurals first wife, Naz, was just alike Hazal, and thats the reason why Vural fell in love with her so much, since Naz died 2 years ago and now he finds a replacement of her in Hazal. The story is telling us about the love story between Kenan who thought Hazal dumped him just for money and higher society life and who became a successful businessman with the aim of avenging them , and Hazal who tries to forget all she has been through and the way Vural stole her dreams and youth, and of course Vural who is still waiting for Hazal to love him as much as she loves Kenan.', 'Hazal, beautiful young girl is engajed with Kenan, handsome young fisherman. The day before their wedding, Hazal is forced to marry Vural, successful businessman who fall in love with her since the first time he saw her working on his birthday party as a waitress. Vurals first wife, Naz, was just alike Hazal, and thats the reason why Vural fell in love with her so much, since Naz died 2 years ago and now he finds a replacement of her in Hazal. The story is telling us about the love story between Kenan who thought Hazal dumped him just for money and higher society life and who became a successful businessman with the aim of avenging them , and Hazal who tries to forget all she has been through and the way Vural stole her dreams and youth, and of course Vural who is still waiting for Hazal to love him as much as she loves Kenan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6McbrPX8QEVbDCAJeI5idCDQGv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79125'),
