  ('129208693419638561', 'Skärgårdsdoktorn', 1997, 'Drama', 'Lars Bill Lundholm, Gunilla Linn Persson', 'Gunilla Linn Persson, Lars Bill Lundholm', 'Samuel Fröler, Ebba Hultkvist Stragne, Sten Ljunggren, Helena Brodin, Göran Engman, Tove Nordin', null, 'TV series about the doctor Johan Steen who returns to Sweden after working in Somalia. He takes over his father in law''s practice in the archipelago and together with his daughter Wilma, they try to make a new life for themselves.', 'TV series about the doctor Johan Steen who returns to Sweden after working in Somalia. He takes over his father in law''s practice in the archipelago and together with his daughter Wilma, they try to make a new life for themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJXezqpilWDYZGgxmtuyDTuK843.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:17753'),
  ('790254849519513106', 'Skate Into Love', 2020, 'Drama', null, 'Ma Jia', 'Zhang Xincheng, Janice Wu, Zhou Lijie, Chu Yue, Cao Bo, He Xuanlin, Wei Tianhao, Han Jiunuo', null, 'A speed skating girl, Tang Xue, reunites with her former seatmate, Li Yubing, now the school’s ice hockey star, reigniting a childhood rivalry. As resentment gives way to understanding, Tang Xue and Li Yubing inspire each other to overcome past fears, rediscover their dreams, and chase success on the ice.', 'A speed skating girl, Tang Xue, reunites with her former seatmate, Li Yubing, now the school’s ice hockey star, reigniting a childhood rivalry. As resentment gives way to understanding, Tang Xue and Li Yubing inspire each other to overcome past fears, rediscover their dreams, and chase success on the ice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihRyFDl2RdJzB53mwcig2Gh9OFr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100803'),
  ('482521091737613103', 'Skate-Leading Stars', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', 'Goro Taniguchi', null, 'Yuma Uchida, Reo Tsuchida, Kaito Takeda, Hiroshi Kamiya, Makoto Furukawa, Hirofumi Nojima, Tomoaki Maeno, Gen Sato', 'TV-14', 'Kensei Maeshima quit figure skating a few years ago, but when his rival moves to the team sport of skate-leading, Kensei returns to the ice.', 'Kensei Maeshima quit figure skating a few years ago, but when his rival moves to the team sport of skate-leading, Kensei returns to the ice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fM79SzsBWtFrMBlUszjjfeTz2Oi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96042'),
  ('1082824275800269892', 'Skavlan', 2009, 'Talk', null, null, 'Fredrik Skavlan', null, 'Skavlan is a Norwegian-Swedish television talk show hosted by Norwegian journalist Fredrik Skavlan. It premiered in Sweden on Sveriges Television in January 2009, and the first guests to appear on the show were former Prime Minister of Sweden Göran Persson and his wife Anitra Steen. On 8 May 2009, it was announced that Skavlan had been renewed for a second season. It was also announced that the show would no longer only be produced by SVT in Sweden; Skavlan would now be partly produced in Norway by the Norwegian Broadcasting Corporation. The first twelve episodes of Skavlan''s second season were produced by SVT in Sweden, and the remaining twelve by NRK in Norway. Skavlan speaks Norwegian and his dialog is therefore subtitled in Swedish in Sweden, even though the two languages are quite similar and mutually intelligible. If the persons being interviewed by Skavlan are Swedish, he often tells them to let him know if they do not understand what he is saying. Swedish novelist Jan Guillou has criticized SVT for subtitling the program, stating "there is no need for that. If the host had been Danish, subtitling would have been necessary, but with a Norwegian host it does not make any sense."', 'Skavlan is a Norwegian-Swedish television talk show hosted by Norwegian journalist Fredrik Skavlan. It premiered in Sweden on Sveriges Television in January 2009, and the first guests to appear on the show were former Prime Minister of Sweden Göran Persson and his wife Anitra Steen. On 8 May 2009, it was announced that Skavlan had been renewed for a second season. It was also announced that the show would no longer only be produced by SVT in Sweden; Skavlan would now be partly produced in Norway by the Norwegian Broadcasting Corporation. The first twelve episodes of Skavlan''s second season were produced by SVT in Sweden, and the remaining twelve by NRK in Norway. Skavlan speaks Norwegian and his dialog is therefore subtitled in Swedish in Sweden, even though the two languages are quite similar and mutually intelligible. If the persons being interviewed by Skavlan are Swedish, he often tells them to let him know if they do not understand what he is saying. Swedish novelist Jan Guillou has criticized SVT for subtitling the program, stating "there is no need for that. If the host had been Danish, subtitling would have been necessary, but with a Norwegian host it does not make any sense."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aDQoVmOfYIy7iGEQno9NtxDmaDI.jpg', 25, 'tmdb:tv:31449'),
  ('327228786747504884', 'Skeleton Knight in Another World', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Tomoaki Maeno, Fairouz Ai, Nene Hieda, Miyu Tomita, Takuya Eguchi, Kohsuke Toriumi, Yuko Minaguchi, Rumi Okubo', 'TV-14', 'One day, a gamer played video games until he fell asleep...and when he woke up, he found himself in the game world—as a skeleton! Equipped with the powerful weapons and armor of his avatar but stuck with its frightening skeletal appearance, Arc has to find a place for himself in this new, fantastical land. All his hopes for a quiet life are dashed when he crosses paths with a beautiful elven warrior, setting him on a journey full of conflict and adventure.', 'One day, a gamer played video games until he fell asleep...and when he woke up, he found himself in the game world—as a skeleton! Equipped with the powerful weapons and armor of his avatar but stuck with its frightening skeletal appearance, Arc has to find a place for himself in this new, fantastical land. All his hopes for a quiet life are dashed when he crosses paths with a beautiful elven warrior, setting him on a journey full of conflict and adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMhzjbRI1iL2ENtMnS3Zm3DBAJw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:123528'),
  ('326313347171064038', 'Skeleton Warriors', 1994, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids', 'Gary Goddard', null, 'Jeff Bennett, Jennifer Hale, Michael Corbett, Kevin Schon, Philip L. Clarke, Valery Pappas, Nathan Carlson, Danny Mann', null, 'The all-powerful Lightstar Crystal, which has protected the planet Luminaire from danger for eons, has been broken into two by the treacherous Baron Dark. "Rewarded" for his evil deed with a ghastly new form - that of a living skeleton - the Baron now has the power to turn others of evil heart into Skeleton Warriors! The Legion of Light is the last line of defense in this war of good and evil. Led by young Prince Lightstar, the true heir to the throne of Luminaire, the super-powered family of heroes confronts an epic challenge: control the Lightstar Crystal and save Luminaire or lose it and face the unthinkable!', 'The all-powerful Lightstar Crystal, which has protected the planet Luminaire from danger for eons, has been broken into two by the treacherous Baron Dark. "Rewarded" for his evil deed with a ghastly new form - that of a living skeleton - the Baron now has the power to turn others of evil heart into Skeleton Warriors! The Legion of Light is the last line of defense in this war of good and evil. Led by young Prince Lightstar, the true heir to the throne of Luminaire, the super-powered family of heroes confronts an epic challenge: control the Lightstar Crystal and save Luminaire or lose it and face the unthinkable!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5GWrj3NpGVmSK44mwgKMJatROw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1718'),
  ('272373919383627478', 'Skemergrond', 2024, 'Soap', null, null, 'Khadija Heeger, Charlton George, Hildegardt Whites, Carmen Maarman, Talia A Davis, Shimmy Isaacs, Dirk Stoltz, William Adams', null, 'It centres round the Louw family who own a beautiful flower farm in Gemoedsdrif. Their peaceful existence is turned upside down when unexpected guests arrive who threaten to reveal shocking family secrets. Old wounds are opened and new bonds are forged to save and protect the Louws and their legacy.', 'It centres round the Louw family who own a beautiful flower farm in Gemoedsdrif. Their peaceful existence is turned upside down when unexpected guests arrive who threaten to reveal shocking family secrets. Old wounds are opened and new bonds are forged to save and protect the Louws and their legacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/69P4xkvmUZxy5geVbEN5c3YIYTU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:246492'),
  ('809715844632652665', 'SKET DANCE', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Hiroyuki Yoshino, Ryoko Shiraishi, Tomokazu Sugita', 'TV-14', 'At Kaimei High School, the Living Assistance Club (aka the Sket Brigade) was organized to help students with problems big or small. Most of the time, though, they hang out in their club room, bored, with only a few trivial problems floating in every once in a while. In spite of this, they still throw all their energy into solving these worries.', 'At Kaimei High School, the Living Assistance Club (aka the Sket Brigade) was organized to help students with problems big or small. Most of the time, though, they hang out in their club room, bored, with only a few trivial problems floating in every once in a while. In spite of this, they still throw all their energy into solving these worries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYMBMX3s6X3aCTifAIrLRxR5A3f.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42419'),
  ('1142892867342314798', 'Sketch', 2018, 'Mystery, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Kang Hyun Sung, 林泰佑', 'Kang Hyun Sung', 'Rain, Lee Sun-bin, Lee Dong-gun, Jung Jin-young, Kang Shin-il, Im Hwa-young, Yoo Da-in, Lee Seung-joo', null, 'Detective Kang Dong-Soo''s fiance is killed mysteriously. He works with a female detective who can see 3 days into the future. She sketches what she sees. They set out to capture the murderer. Kim Do-Jin is a former special forces member. His pregnant wife was killed and he plots revenge.', 'Detective Kang Dong-Soo''s fiance is killed mysteriously. He works with a female detective who can see 3 days into the future. She sketches what she sees. They set out to capture the murderer. Kim Do-Jin is a former special forces member. His pregnant wife was killed and he plots revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPRK838BrS8V9oA92wtKEhy72U9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79566'),
  ('1033237739288316399', 'Sketchbook ~full color''s~', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Kana Hanazawa, Asuka Nakase, Yui Makino, Masumi Asano, Natsuko Kuwatani', 'TV-14', 'No matter where she goes, Sora takes her sketchbook along. The world is full of mysterious and beautiful things, after all, and Sora doesn''t want to miss a single one. The best way she knows to capture each moment is by drawing and sketching, watching and learning.', 'No matter where she goes, Sora takes her sketchbook along. The world is full of mysterious and beautiful things, after all, and Sora doesn''t want to miss a single one. The best way she knows to capture each moment is by drawing and sketching, watching and learning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mG07Jsec9m2O7jlCNr3Cbcmpboe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72249'),
  ('408111874327615769', 'Ski into Love', 2025, 'Drama', 'Qing Mei', null, 'Yu Shuxin, Lin Yi, Fei Qiming, Jenny Zeng, Xia Haoran, Hu Wenxuan, Wang Runze, Xu Shiyue', 'TV-PG', 'After a scandal threatens her career, manga artist Wei Zhi escapes to a ski resort, where she meets instructor Shan Chong and begins to heal.', 'After a scandal threatens her career, manga artist Wei Zhi escapes to a ski resort, where she meets instructor Shan Chong and begins to heal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t8OKl6AmOe9DkNe3dIIVPK2HJVP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:247207'),
  ('386727956996632655', 'Skin Wars', 2014, 'Reality', null, null, 'Rebecca Romijn, RuPaul, Craig Tracy, Robin Slonina', null, 'Rebecca Romijn hosts television''s first ever body painting competition show, which seeks to find the most skillful, accomplished and versatile body painter in America. The body artists will compete in elaborate body painting challenges to avoid elimination and win over the approval of the judges, including legendary entertainer RuPaul Charles, and body painting icons Craig Tracy and Robin Slonina.', 'Rebecca Romijn hosts television''s first ever body painting competition show, which seeks to find the most skillful, accomplished and versatile body painter in America. The body artists will compete in elaborate body painting challenges to avoid elimination and win over the approval of the judges, including legendary entertainer RuPaul Charles, and body painting icons Craig Tracy and Robin Slonina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3eZ8JhBlcab7TklqS1sL6YsvMoN.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:62923'),
  ('580865296538746029', 'Skins', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Bryan Elsley, Jamie Brittain', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Irreverent comedy drama which follows the messy lives, loves, delirious highs and inevitable lows of a group of raucous teenage friends in Bristol.', 'Irreverent comedy drama which follows the messy lives, loves, delirious highs and inevitable lows of a group of raucous teenage friends in Bristol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fC7UYY12Cy0TzNEjzV2K7gxPgi.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:900'),
  ('659356392264797769', 'Skins', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Bryan Elsley, Jamie Brittain', null, 'James Newman, Rachel Thevenard, Danny Flaherty, Sofia Black-D''Elia, Britne Oldford, Jesse Carere, Ron Mustafaa, Anastasia Phillips', 'TV-14', 'A wild ride through the lives of a group of high school friends stumbling through the mine field of adolescence... and stepping on most of the mines as they go.', 'A wild ride through the lives of a group of high school friends stumbling through the mine field of adolescence... and stepping on most of the mines as they go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZekXjooNYM4ikufsQnSVVnjYDP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34390'),
  ('8491431188909422', 'Skip and Loafer', 2023, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Tomoyo Kurosawa, Akinori Egoshi, Yuka Terasaki, Maaya Uchida, Megumi Han', 'TV-14', 'Iwakura Mitsumi, a tenacious country girl, prepares for high school in the big city. She meets the handsome Shima Sousuke, whose easygoing ways help her adapt in the real world.', 'Iwakura Mitsumi, a tenacious country girl, prepares for high school in the big city. She meets the handsome Shima Sousuke, whose easygoing ways help her adapt in the real world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHVy0gnLNpkNAdtd3DHsUVYYEDN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:139130'),
  ('750991645679529980', 'Skip Beat!', 2008, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', 'Yoshiki Nakamura', null, 'Ayumi Tsunematsu, Rio Natsuki, Atsuko Enomoto, Takeshi Kusao, Keisuke Oda, Toru Nara, Hiroaki Ishikawa, Haruo Satou', null, 'Kyoko followed her true love and childhood friend Sho to Tokyo so she could help him reach his dream of becoming an idol. She cleans, cooks, works three jobs and does nothing for herself because she loves him so much, but gets nothing in return. Still, she remains by his side. But then one day she goes unannounced to his agency with a delivery, and overhears him talking about her; he reveals to his manager that he only took her with him as a maid, and that he doesn''t care for her at all. Upon hearing this, Kyoko doesn''t just sit around and cry. She cuts and dyes her hair, changes her clothes and attitude and thus begins her journey to join showbiz and have her revenge against Sho', 'Kyoko followed her true love and childhood friend Sho to Tokyo so she could help him reach his dream of becoming an idol. She cleans, cooks, works three jobs and does nothing for herself because she loves him so much, but gets nothing in return. Still, she remains by his side. But then one day she goes unannounced to his agency with a delivery, and overhears him talking about her; he reveals to his manager that he only took her with him as a maid, and that he doesn''t care for her at all. Upon hearing this, Kyoko doesn''t just sit around and cry. She cuts and dyes her hair, changes her clothes and attitude and thus begins her journey to join showbiz and have her revenge against Sho', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/swcwu5M0xoquONxobt57hWK7U9M.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46669'),
  ('143050625117467084', 'Skippy the Bush Kangaroo', 1968, 'Family', 'John McCallum', null, 'Ed Devereaux, Garry Pankhurst, Ken James, Tony Bonner', null, 'Skippy the Bush Kangaroo is an Australian television series telling the adventures of a young boy and his intelligent pet kangaroo, and the various visitors to the fictional Waratah National Park in Duffys Forest, near Sydney, New South Wales.', 'Skippy the Bush Kangaroo is an Australian television series telling the adventures of a young boy and his intelligent pet kangaroo, and the various visitors to the fictional Waratah National Park in Duffys Forest, near Sydney, New South Wales.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eN4y8woOBbtuLFJqNKe8KACabDU.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:10762'),
