  ('1030384181464213418', 'Snoops', 1989, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Tim Reid, Sam Egan', null, 'Tim Reid, Daphne Maxwell Reid, Troy Curvey Jr., Tasha Scott, John Karlen', null, 'Snoops is an American crime themed comedy-drama series which aired for one season from September 1989 to July 1990 on CBS. The series was created and executive produced by series star Tim Reid and Sam Egan.', 'Snoops is an American crime themed comedy-drama series which aired for one season from September 1989 to July 1990 on CBS. The series was created and executive produced by series star Tim Reid and Sam Egan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBueEc8hon4WDDMqszTKtDaCLNN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10364'),
  ('1072742315652456005', 'Snoopy in Space: The Search for Life', 2019, 'Animation, Kids', 'Betsy Walters, Mark Evestaff', null, 'Tyler James Nathan, Terry McGurrin, Rob Tinkler, Christian Dal Dosso, Isabella Leo, Holly Gorski, Hattie Kragten, Seán Cullen', 'TV-G', 'Blast off with Snoopy as he takes on a new frontier: space! Joined by Charlie Brown, Woodstock, and the rest of the Peanuts gang, Snoopy embarks on epic adventures of interstellar exploration and discovery.', 'Blast off with Snoopy as he takes on a new frontier: space! Joined by Charlie Brown, Woodstock, and the rest of the Peanuts gang, Snoopy embarks on epic adventures of interstellar exploration and discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssAYRDytRsA8S0TAYMrr8dJgrlT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:91249'),
  ('321500498428513861', 'Snorks', 1984, 'Family, Animation, Kids', 'Nic Broca', null, 'René Auberjonois, Nancy Cartwright, Frank Welker, Rob Paulsen, Barry Gordon, Clive Revill, Michael Bell, B.J. Ward', null, 'The Snorks is an animated television series produced by Hanna-Barbera which ran on NBC from September 15, 1984, to May 13, 1989. Although not as popular as the animated series The Smurfs, the program continued to be available in syndication from 1986 to 1989 as part of The Funtastic World of Hanna-Barbera''s 3rd season, on USA Network in the late-1980s and early-1990s, on the BBC in the late 1990s, and from 2009–2011 and again from 2012–Present on Boomerang.', 'The Snorks is an animated television series produced by Hanna-Barbera which ran on NBC from September 15, 1984, to May 13, 1989. Although not as popular as the animated series The Smurfs, the program continued to be available in syndication from 1986 to 1989 as part of The Funtastic World of Hanna-Barbera''s 3rd season, on USA Network in the late-1980s and early-1990s, on the BBC in the late 1990s, and from 2009–2011 and again from 2012–Present on Boomerang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQmrzG1US6nvVRdW4dYHIXd7NQy.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:4237'),
  ('340662570582212774', 'Snow Angels', 2021, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Mette Heeno', 'Andreas Garfield, Marie Østerbye', 'Josefin Asplund, Ardalan Esmaili, Eva Melander, Maria Rossing, Cecilia Nilsson, Mattias Nordkvist, Ylvali Rurling, Pablo Leiva Wenger', null, 'Two days before Christmas, while Sweden is paralyzed by a heavy snowstorm, five-week-old baby Lukas inexplicably disappears from his home. Experienced police officer Alice thinks that something is not right in the parents'' stories.', 'Two days before Christmas, while Sweden is paralyzed by a heavy snowstorm, five-week-old baby Lukas inexplicably disappears from his home. Experienced police officer Alice thinks that something is not right in the parents'' stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLIwhWpfDFqIsIEp44MRftNT0ea.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121950'),
  ('259938370233543118', 'Snow Fall', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Gao Weiguang, Ouyang Nana, Winwin, Maggie Huang, Ren Shihao, Tang Jingmei, Benson Wang, Meng Ziyi', null, 'Shen Zhiheng is a gentleman in the Republic of China, and Mi Lan is the daughter of a wealthy businessman, who has been blind since childhood. They met on a fateful night when Mi Lan saves Shen Zhiheng from the brink of death. From then on they have been tied to each other and redeemed each other ever since.', 'Shen Zhiheng is a gentleman in the Republic of China, and Mi Lan is the daughter of a wealthy businessman, who has been blind since childhood. They met on a fateful night when Mi Lan saves Shen Zhiheng from the brink of death. From then on they have been tied to each other and redeemed each other ever since.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oqr5gP5CQUPpXk7bPAHXLmfDMJ3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213086'),
  ('1123614225945956248', 'Snow Leopard', 2010, 'War & Politics', 'Chen Haowei', '景旭枫', 'Wen Zhang, Zhu Jie, Du Yuming, Qiao Pengyue, Wu Xiubo, Liu Liwei, Tao Feifei, Zhang Ruoyun', null, 'The story of Zhou Wen, a graduate of Whampoa Military Academy for rich kids. After being sentenced to death for murder, he was able to escape. Changing his name to Zhou Wei Guo and joining the military, he went on to create the special operations task force known as “Snow Leopard” to fight off the Japanese during WWII.', 'The story of Zhou Wen, a graduate of Whampoa Military Academy for rich kids. After being sentenced to death for murder, he was able to escape. Changing his name to Zhou Wei Guo and joining the military, he went on to create the special operations task force known as “Snow Leopard” to fight off the Japanese during WWII.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5MP6w8cFLTMpG3TbxENUP7RckG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80447'),
  ('411513994039597597', 'Snow White with the Red Hair', 2015, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Saori Hayami, Ryota Osaka', 'TV-14', 'Shirayuki was a young girl born with unique apple-red hair. She meets a famous but foolish Prince Raji, who falls in love with her at first sight and orders her to become his concubine. With nowhere else to go, Shirayuki cuts her hair and escapes to a neighboring country. While traversing through the forests, she meets a young boy, Zen, who helps her after she boldly cures his wounds but then gets poisoned by an apple given to Shirayuki. Meanwhile, Prince Raji sends out henchmen to search for her. What will happen to Shirayuki? What is Zen''s true character? A refreshing fantasy story between an optimistic heroine and a prince who constantly stays on her watch.', 'Shirayuki was a young girl born with unique apple-red hair. She meets a famous but foolish Prince Raji, who falls in love with her at first sight and orders her to become his concubine. With nowhere else to go, Shirayuki cuts her hair and escapes to a neighboring country. While traversing through the forests, she meets a young boy, Zen, who helps her after she boldly cures his wounds but then gets poisoned by an apple given to Shirayuki. Meanwhile, Prince Raji sends out henchmen to search for her. What will happen to Shirayuki? What is Zen''s true character? A refreshing fantasy story between an optimistic heroine and a prince who constantly stays on her watch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jZtP1Zd7DNfVkPolpVhe7BCdDhL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63087'),
  ('395042984606731275', 'SNOWBALL EARTH', 2026, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Takuto Yoshinaga, Daisuke Hirakawa, Ami Koshimizu, Konomi Tamura', null, 'Ten years after saving Earth with his robot friend Yukio, Tetsuo returns to a planet of endless ice and snow.', 'Ten years after saving Earth with his robot friend Yukio, Tetsuo returns to a planet of endless ice and snow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLin4VCC1QK7MDmeaSBZqw7SWRu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:296232'),
  ('568772673594929778', 'Snowdrop', 2021, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Yoo Hyun-mi', null, 'Jung Hae-in, JISOO, Yoo In-na, Jang Seung-jo, Yoon Se-a, Kim Hye-yoon, Jung Yoo-jin, Huh Joon-ho', 'TV-14', 'In 1987, bloodied man Soo-ho jumps into a women''s university dormitory in Seoul. Yeong-ro, a female student who fell in love with him at a group blind date, tends to his wounds as the dormitory is ensnared in intense surveillance. As Soo-ho''s secrets unravel, he must eventually face the conflict between his heart to Yeong-ro and responsibility to his comrades, as well as to his sibling who awaits him in his home country. What will be of their fate?', 'In 1987, bloodied man Soo-ho jumps into a women''s university dormitory in Seoul. Yeong-ro, a female student who fell in love with him at a group blind date, tends to his wounds as the dormitory is ensnared in intense surveillance. As Soo-ho''s secrets unravel, he must eventually face the conflict between his heart to Yeong-ro and responsibility to his comrades, as well as to his sibling who awaits him in his home country. What will be of their fate?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3AhTqNJVr1v7Jfplg8Y1YOzzdWE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108291'),
  ('93785028501691450', 'Snowfall', 2016, 'Family, Kids, Drama', 'Synne Teksum', 'Ingrid Marie Hafstad, Synne Teksum, Hanne Hagerup', 'Siri Skjeggedal, Kevin Haugan, Charlotte Myrset, Iselin Shumba Skjævesland, Kjersti Elvik, Trond Høvik, Vidar Magnussen, Johannes Joner', 'TV-Y', 'Selma, a 9 year old girl who lost her parents in an accident, is now living with Ruth, a quite strict neighbour who was just supposed to temporarily look after Selma and her dog Casper.', 'Selma, a 9 year old girl who lost her parents in an accident, is now living with Ruth, a quite strict neighbour who was just supposed to temporarily look after Selma and her dog Casper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9n1CAFyhf6IgSCNqTFOC1OEctE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:68913'),
  ('431405697037532256', 'Snowfall', 2017, 'Drama, Crime', 'Eric Amadio, John Singleton, Dave Andron', null, 'Damson Idris, Carter Hudson, Sergio Peris-Mencheta, Michael Hyatt, Amin Joseph, Angela Lewis, Isaiah John, Devyn A. Tyler', 'TV-MA', 'Los Angeles. 1983. A storm is coming and its name is crack. Set against the infancy of the crack cocaine epidemic and its ultimate radical impact on the culture as we know it, the story follows numerous characters on a violent collision course.', 'Los Angeles. 1983. A storm is coming and its name is crack. Set against the infancy of the crack cocaine epidemic and its ultimate radical impact on the culture as we know it, the story follows numerous characters on a violent collision course.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7ntzl7msiaS6o7dvDbNG7XFYcR.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:71694'),
  ('62567019332552240', 'Snowflake Mountain', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'Hopelessly entitled or simply in need of tough love? Ten spoiled young adults experience nature without a parental safety net in this reality series.', 'Hopelessly entitled or simply in need of tough love? Ten spoiled young adults experience nature without a parental safety net in this reality series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fOjNFcbuwXT1nGkaweqEWlsD2Z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204418'),
  ('952531431273562692', 'Snowpiercer', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Graeme Manson, Josh Friedman', null, 'Daveed Diggs, Mickey Sumner, Alison Wright, Iddo Goldberg, Roberto Urbina, Rowan Blanchard, Katie McGuinness, Sam Otto', 'TV-MA', 'More than seven years after the world has become a frozen wasteland, the remnants of humanity inhabit a gigantic, perpetually-moving train that circles the globe as class warfare, social injustice and the politics of survival play out.', 'More than seven years after the world has become a frozen wasteland, the remnants of humanity inhabit a gigantic, perpetually-moving train that circles the globe as class warfare, social injustice and the politics of survival play out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/exKzfiKzMdQBHrdd7zNmKauJkbg.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:79680'),
  ('168114952732544618', 'Snowy', 1993, 'Drama', null, null, 'Lucy Bell, Bernard Curry, Rebecca Gibney, Jochen Horst, Annie Jones, William McInnes, Neil Melville, Charlie Powles', null, 'The family lives of those working on Australia''s Snowy Mountains dam in the 1950s.', 'The family lives of those working on Australia''s Snowy Mountains dam in the 1950s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/my3XEomPIvhtPlo1uGC33jtCZWr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:26384'),
  ('218314560020378253', 'Snuff Box', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Rich Fulcher', null, 'Matt Berry, Rich Fulcher, Terry Wade', null, '"High Executioner to the King of England" Matt Berry and his assistant Rich Fulcher, spend their free time in a gentleman’s club for hangmen, competing for women, money and happiness, while engaging general depravity.', '"High Executioner to the King of England" Matt Berry and his assistant Rich Fulcher, spend their free time in a gentleman’s club for hangmen, competing for women, money and happiness, while engaging general depravity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uiUcnsQBQfrZOhZw0vb8ASkREnW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2602'),
