  ('226680139783700563', 'So Help Me Todd', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery, Comedy', 'Scott Prendergast', null, 'Marcia Gay Harden, Skylar Astin, Madeline Wise, Tristen J. Winger, Inga Schlingmann, Rosa Arredondo', 'TV-14', 'Despite their opposing personalities, a talented but directionless P.I. who is the black sheep of his family begrudgingly agrees to work as the in-house investigator for his overbearing mother, a successful attorney reeling from the recent dissolution of her marriage.', 'Despite their opposing personalities, a talented but directionless P.I. who is the black sheep of his family begrudgingly agrees to work as the in-house investigator for his overbearing mother, a successful attorney reeling from the recent dissolution of her marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pL7iPzx1PQSOoR7y6ZQ5Bl6c9rV.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:202307'),
  ('351847516374206965', 'So I Married an Anti-Fan', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kim Eun-jeong', 'Nam Ji-Yeon, Kim Eun-jeong', 'Choi Tae-joon, Sooyoung Choi, Hwang Chan-sung, Han Ji-an, Kim Min-gue, Kim Ha-kyung, Kim Sun-hyuk, Dong Hyun-bae', null, 'The romance between top star Hoo Joon and his anti-fan reporter Lee Geun-young who end up living together.', 'The romance between top star Hoo Joon and his anti-fan reporter Lee Geun-young who end up living together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nfyJOt9HjdoF9q1XI1Hdm7c28V0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:122978'),
  ('699501356645865731', 'So I''m a Spider, So What?', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Aoi Yuuki, Shun Horie, Nao Toyama, Kaito Ishikawa, Yui Ogura, Eri Kitamura, Kaya Okuno, Aimi Tanaka', 'TV-14', 'I, the protagonist, was just an ordinary high school girl, but suddenly I was reincarnated as a spider monster in a fantasy world. Not only that, but I awakened in a dungeon filled with vicious monsters. Armed with only my human knowledge and my overwhelming positivity, I''m forced to use spiderwebs and traps to defeat far stronger monsters just to stay alive... So begins the labyrinth survival story of a girl with incredible mental strength living as one of the lowest-ranked beasts!', 'I, the protagonist, was just an ordinary high school girl, but suddenly I was reincarnated as a spider monster in a fantasy world. Not only that, but I awakened in a dungeon filled with vicious monsters. Armed with only my human knowledge and my overwhelming positivity, I''m forced to use spiderwebs and traps to defeat far stronger monsters just to stay alive... So begins the labyrinth survival story of a girl with incredible mental strength living as one of the lowest-ranked beasts!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTbqSiJx2nxFJ8zSM8JLdkTUFKZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99618'),
  ('834998381219197913', 'So Little Time', 2001, 'Comedy, Family', 'Tonya Hurley, Eric Cohen', null, 'Mary-Kate Olsen, Ashley Olsen, Eric Lutes, Jesse Head, Natashia Williams, Taylor Negron', 'TV-G', 'So Little Time is an American sitcom starring Mary-Kate and Ashley Olsen that aired on Fox Family. The first half of the series aired from June 2, 2001, to August 15, 2001. The series then went on a four-month hiatus owing to network management changes. By December 2001, Fox Family had become ABC Family, and the remaining episodes aired until May 4, 2002.', 'So Little Time is an American sitcom starring Mary-Kate and Ashley Olsen that aired on Fox Family. The first half of the series aired from June 2, 2001, to August 15, 2001. The series then went on a four-month hiatus owing to network management changes. By December 2001, Fox Family had become ABC Family, and the remaining episodes aired until May 4, 2002.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iNkK6WIixZlJNlMu912ngUOYTmF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:248'),
  ('208990702174800952', 'So Long, Marianne', 2024, 'Drama', 'Øystein Karlsen, Ingeborg Klyve, Tony Wood', null, 'Alex Wolff, Thea Sofie Loch Næss, Noah Taylor, Peter Stormare, Jonas Strand Gravli, Simon Lööf, Anna Torv', null, 'The intimate tale of two young people, Canadian singer and poet Leonard Cohen and extraordinary Norwegian woman Marianne Ihlen, falling in love during a period of their life when they are trying to figure out who they are and their place in the world, while one is becoming one of the most famous singers of all time.', 'The intimate tale of two young people, Canadian singer and poet Leonard Cohen and extraordinary Norwegian woman Marianne Ihlen, falling in love during a period of their life when they are trying to figure out who they are and their place in the world, while one is becoming one of the most famous singers of all time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tdJE9vLZAtb4Ln1A6gqAnS5YKGA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:220233'),
  ('456997075557470722', 'So Not Worth It', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kwon Ik-jun', 'Baek Ji-hyun, Seo Eun-jung', 'Park Se-wan, Shin Hyeon-seung, Choi Young-jae, Minnie, Han Hyun-min, Joakim Sorensen, Terris Brown, Carson Allen', null, 'New friends, new loves and new experiences mix together inside a colorful college dormitory in Korea that''s home to students from around the world.', 'New friends, new loves and new experiences mix together inside a colorful college dormitory in Korea that''s home to students from around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wiByXTq5vaDppWnYCLt6fzDuu7x.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110545'),
  ('63184024440678408', 'So Random!', 2011, 'Comedy, Family', 'Steve Marmel', null, 'Sterling Knight, Allisyn Snyder, Doug Brochu, Tiffany Thornton, Brandon Mychal Smith, Shayne Topp, Damien C. Haas, Matthew Scott Montgomery', 'TV-G', '"So Random" has the biggest cast, the biggest stars, and the biggest laughs on Disney Channel! Nothing is off limits in this all new musical sketch comedy. Each episode features original skits, songs and parodies with celebrity guest stars like Tony Hawk, Mitchel Musso and Selena Gomez!', '"So Random" has the biggest cast, the biggest stars, and the biggest laughs on Disney Channel! Nothing is off limits in this all new musical sketch comedy. Each episode features original skits, songs and parodies with celebrity guest stars like Tony Hawk, Mitchel Musso and Selena Gomez!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ymbNwsq62KiusOlNyVZBTqVqHrH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39320'),
  ('820878524054531248', 'So Weird', 1999, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Tom J. Astle', null, 'Mackenzie Phillips, Alexz Johnson, Patrick Levis, Belinda Metz, Eric Lively, Dave ''Squatch'' Ward', null, 'Fourteen-year-old Fi Phillips investigates the paranormal while touring the country in a bus with her widowed rock-star mom and her skeptical brother, Jack. At the beginning of Season 3, Fi passed the job of case cracker to a songbird named Annie', 'Fourteen-year-old Fi Phillips investigates the paranormal while touring the country in a bus with her widowed rock-star mom and her skeptical brother, Jack. At the beginning of Season 3, Fi passed the job of case cracker to a songbird named Annie', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3JXACRlBkEGRdzXvHH7R1houDeS.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1954'),
  ('112425943093451090', 'So You Think You Can Dance', 2005, 'Reality', 'Simon Fuller, Nigel Lythgoe', null, 'Cat Deeley, Stephen ''tWitch'' Boss, Matthew Morrison, JoJo Siwa, Maksim Chmerkovskiy, Allison Holker', 'TV-14', 'Dancers selected in open auditions across America take part in a rigorous competition designed to best display their talents, training and personalities to a panel of judges and viewers as they strive to win votes and avoid elimination.', 'Dancers selected in open auditions across America take part in a rigorous competition designed to best display their talents, training and personalities to a panel of judges and viewers as they strive to win votes and avoid elimination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4JAJ3UGBmAshXQG69uH9AgnZkp.jpg', 18, 'tmdb:tv:3976'),
  ('318327148170757595', 'So You Think You Can Dance', 2008, 'Family', null, null, 'Dan Karaty, Wendy van Dijk, Laura Tesoro, Nora Monsecour, Kenzo Alvares, Vincent Fierens', null, 'So You Think You Can Dance is a joint Belgian-Dutch dance competition show broadcast on RTL 5 and vtm television stations. The first season was broadcast only in the Netherlands, whereas starting with season 2, the show became a joint Belgian-Dutch production. The show premiered on 4 September 2008 in the Netherlands and expanded to broadcasting in Flanders for its second season on 1 September 2009. Like other series in the So You Think You Can Dance franchise, the show is a talent search that uses a combination of expert judge decisions and call-in voting to advance dancers from a wide variety of backgrounds through various different dance styles. A season winner is awarded a cash prize, funded study-abroad or work-abroad opportunities and other prizes, as well as the title "The Netherlands'' Favourite Dancer". The winners of the first five seasons have been Ivan Paulovich, Els Smekens, Floris Bosveld, Nina Plantefève-Castryck and Frederic De Smet. The first season was hosted by singer Elise van der Horst. From the second season on, Dennis Weening and An Lemmens have co-presented.', 'So You Think You Can Dance is a joint Belgian-Dutch dance competition show broadcast on RTL 5 and vtm television stations. The first season was broadcast only in the Netherlands, whereas starting with season 2, the show became a joint Belgian-Dutch production. The show premiered on 4 September 2008 in the Netherlands and expanded to broadcasting in Flanders for its second season on 1 September 2009. Like other series in the So You Think You Can Dance franchise, the show is a talent search that uses a combination of expert judge decisions and call-in voting to advance dancers from a wide variety of backgrounds through various different dance styles. A season winner is awarded a cash prize, funded study-abroad or work-abroad opportunities and other prizes, as well as the title "The Netherlands'' Favourite Dancer". The winners of the first five seasons have been Ivan Paulovich, Els Smekens, Floris Bosveld, Nina Plantefève-Castryck and Frederic De Smet. The first season was hosted by singer Elise van der Horst. From the second season on, Dennis Weening and An Lemmens have co-presented.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wzKuUNCnSpW57w6Em6VDuCdcZKJ.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:40231'),
  ('1037766369270205068', 'So, I Can''t Play H!', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy', 'Tachibana Pan', null, 'Hiro Shimono, Kaori Ishihara, Aya Endo, Arisa Nishiguchi, Misato Fukuen, Yoshinori Tsushima', 'TV-MA', 'Ryousuke Kaga, a helplessly romantic teenager, was walking in the rain when he sees a beautiful girl with red eyes drenched in the rain. Everyone was avoiding her, but Ryousuke was taught to treasure women so he offered his help by letting her dry off at his home. Ryousuke can’t imagine that this mysterious girl would stab him in the chest and leave him to die… Or did she? Who is this pretty girl and what does she want with him?', 'Ryousuke Kaga, a helplessly romantic teenager, was walking in the rain when he sees a beautiful girl with red eyes drenched in the rain. Everyone was avoiding her, but Ryousuke was taught to treasure women so he offered his help by letting her dry off at his home. Ryousuke can’t imagine that this mysterious girl would stab him in the chest and leave him to die… Or did she? Who is this pretty girl and what does she want with him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wRq7t74dGefQK1mU0owrXXbHKx5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45234'),
  ('160657371306438103', 'Soap', 1977, 'Comedy, Soap, Drama', 'Susan Harris', null, 'Katherine Helmond, Cathryn Damon, Richard Mulligan, Robert Mandan, Billy Crystal, Ted Wass, Diana Canova, Jennifer Salt', 'TV-PG', 'The antics of a wealthy family, the Tates, and a working-class family, the Campbells, in the fictional town of Dunn''s River, Connecticut.', 'The antics of a wealthy family, the Tates, and a working-class family, the Campbells, in the fictional town of Dunn''s River, Connecticut.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kq2G0SjdVcZnKh5cpq9hp0MKvWL.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:3295'),
  ('435023325577131572', 'Soap Opera', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Gabriel Esteves, Valentina Castello Branco', 'João Falcão, Valentina Castello Branco, Gabriel Esteves', 'Monica Iozzi, Miguel Falabella, Caio Menck, Maria Bopp, Suzy Rêgo, Marcello Antony, Herson Capri, Ary França', null, 'Isabel is a promising screenwriter who has dedicated her life to become a writer for a hit telenovela. When she finally gets her chance, her mentor Lauro Valente betrays her. At the premiere, Isabel decides to confront him and magically ends up in his telenovela as the main character. From the inside, she will be able to prove her creativity.', 'Isabel is a promising screenwriter who has dedicated her life to become a writer for a hit telenovela. When she finally gets her chance, her mentor Lauro Valente betrays her. At the premiere, Isabel decides to confront him and magically ends up in his telenovela as the main character. From the inside, she will be able to prove her creativity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/msMIkS6HPRWWXXHLaTa8nQLbnz6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130845'),
  ('19589057576143541', 'Soaring Sky! Precure', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids, Family', null, null, 'Akira Sekine, Ai Kakuma, Aoi Koga, Ayumu Murase, Ayaka Nanase, Yasuhiro Mamiya, Kouichi Souma, Takako Honda', null, 'A major incident has occurred in the peaceful Sky Land!? The young Princess Ellee has been kidnapped by the monsters of Underg Empire! A brave young girl, Sora, follows the princess through a mysterious hole. "TV"? "Cars"? Are those some kind of magic tools!?!? But there''s no time to be surprised! She has to get the princess back to the castle...! Flying between two worlds! The adventure with the Pretty Cure begins now!', 'A major incident has occurred in the peaceful Sky Land!? The young Princess Ellee has been kidnapped by the monsters of Underg Empire! A brave young girl, Sora, follows the princess through a mysterious hole. "TV"? "Cars"? Are those some kind of magic tools!?!? But there''s no time to be surprised! She has to get the princess back to the castle...! Flying between two worlds! The adventure with the Pretty Cure begins now!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nUBxAQBOCU9IFUPsPUxXTEOIJ74.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213883'),
  ('212942178128419431', 'Sobreamor', null, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Alberto Garmassi, Tatiana Del Real, Eugenio Rubio, Susana González, Francisco De La Reguera', null, 'After two years of ending a traumatic relationship, Martín is ready to try again to find love.', 'After two years of ending a traumatic relationship, Martín is ready to try again to find love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDTPlefqrSJTSglcEaQyzjtvmqU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107879'),
  ('1126174514390882619', 'Sobreviví', 2018, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Santiago Hinzpeter, Oscar Piñero, Sofía Niño de Rivera, Ricardo Peralta, Ricardo Perez, Ariane Pellicer, Octavio Hinojosa Martínez, Ana Gonzalez Bello', null, 'Sofia is a single young stand up comedian trying to navigate the comedy business as well as the very traditional world in which she was brought up. She is constantly getting into trouble due to her ideas and graceless attitude. But deep down she melts at the sight of a helpless dog and would do anything for her family and friends.', 'Sofia is a single young stand up comedian trying to navigate the comedy business as well as the very traditional world in which she was brought up. She is constantly getting into trouble due to her ideas and graceless attitude. But deep down she melts at the sight of a helpless dog and would do anything for her family and friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qsD8LbWeujHOLaTAOATDtBWL06H.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83674'),
  ('1002635721003929784', 'Social Distance', 2020, 'Drama', 'Hilary Weisman Graham', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Filmed in isolation, this narrative anthology series features both dark and funny takes on how people strive to stay connected while staying apart.', 'Filmed in isolation, this narrative anthology series features both dark and funny takes on how people strive to stay connected while staying apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n0S3xJwIuhOewXgaYS4zcm4rkDq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110862'),
