  ('776437883799669759', 'Soda', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Kev Adams', null, 'Kev Adams, William Lebghil, Gaël Cottat, Laurence Oltuski, Guy Lecluyse, Alika Del Sol, Chantal Garrigues, Lucie Boujenah', null, 'The series follows Adam, an 18-year-old high school student as he struggles with amusing yet realistic everyday issues. His group of friends are always there to help him through it all.', 'The series follows Adam, an 18-year-old high school student as he struggles with amusing yet realistic everyday issues. His group of friends are always there to help him through it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/97DHrBEl4kGlSQVD3RPA6CWR61A.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:60652'),
  ('654700712137548642', 'Sofa', 2021, 'Talk, Comedy', 'Tania Alexander, Stephen Lambert', null, 'Jonas Lihaug Fredriksen, Janicke Kvisle, Nora Svenningsen, Egil Skurdal, Simen Bondevik, Guro Helene Bondevik, Kasper Kvello, Harald Bredeli', null, 'Sofa invites us into the living rooms of well-known personalities as they watch and react to TV from the comfort of their own couches - giving us a genuine fly-on-the-wall glimpse into their viewing habits.', 'Sofa invites us into the living rooms of well-known personalities as they watch and react to TV from the comfort of their own couches - giving us a genuine fly-on-the-wall glimpse into their viewing habits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQoKN5SYulhRBTyL4Ryxw0tz3MJ.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:116278'),
  ('767810727869080519', 'Sofia the First', 2013, 'Family, Animation, Kids', 'Craig Gerber', null, 'Ariel Winter', 'TV-Y', 'Set in the storybook world of Enchancia, this is the story of Princess Sofia, an adventurous little girl who is learning how to adjust to royal life after her mom marries the king and she becomes a princess overnight.', 'Set in the storybook world of Enchancia, this is the story of Princess Sofia, an adventurous little girl who is learning how to adjust to royal life after her mom marries the king and she becomes a princess overnight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZHmUO1OQRpVkAOdj9VwYCCyQew.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:46928'),
  ('236819603175365882', 'Soft-Hearted God', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Yan Zixian, Wu Rilige, Guo Xinyu, Yu Yang, Ashin Shu, Kui Yuan', null, 'God Ye Zhao descends into the mortal world for love, only to become entangled with Princess Chu Xihe, who hides a dangerous dual identity. As their relationship spans lifetimes, they confront fate, power, and buried truths, ultimately unraveling a story of devotion and sacrifice.', 'God Ye Zhao descends into the mortal world for love, only to become entangled with Princess Chu Xihe, who hides a dangerous dual identity. As their relationship spans lifetimes, they confront fate, power, and buried truths, ultimately unraveling a story of devotion and sacrifice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zxMWbl7cxmz67f9QToX3HchzPkL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:318675'),
  ('411442857007399678', 'Softly from Paris', 1986, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Pierre Grimblat', null, 'Jean-Pierre Kalfon', null, 'An anthology of erotic stories by famous writers like Guy de Maupassant, Nicolas Edme Restif de La Bretonne, Marquis de Sade, Giovanni Boccaccio, Marquis de Foudras, Daniel Defoe, Anton Tchekov, Jin Ping Mei, and Aristophanes.', 'An anthology of erotic stories by famous writers like Guy de Maupassant, Nicolas Edme Restif de La Bretonne, Marquis de Sade, Giovanni Boccaccio, Marquis de Foudras, Daniel Defoe, Anton Tchekov, Jin Ping Mei, and Aristophanes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4fdYcPVqidr3fTvkfT72rDBMIEv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60624'),
  ('434098173910057606', 'Softly, Softly', 1966, 'Drama, Crime', 'Troy Kennedy Martin', null, null, null, 'Softly, Softly is a British television drama series, produced by the BBC and screened on BBC 1 from January 1966. It centred around the work of regional crime squads, plain-clothes CID officers based in the fictional region of Wyvern, supposedly in the Bristol area of England.', 'Softly, Softly is a British television drama series, produced by the BBC and screened on BBC 1 from January 1966. It centred around the work of regional crime squads, plain-clothes CID officers based in the fictional region of Wyvern, supposedly in the Bristol area of England.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTkdPnZMjaAFLo8NcasiBEadlTE.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:1704'),
  ('453203547881446968', 'Soil', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Yassine Ouaich, Ward Kerremans, Ahlaam Teghadouini, Saïd Boumazoughe, Ben Hamidou, Charlotte De Bruyne, Barbara Sarafian, Reinhilde Decleir', 'TV-MA', 'In a community bound by an age-old tradition, how possible is it to revamp a business for the dead? A Moroccan-Belgian entrepreneur attempts to find out.', 'In a community bound by an age-old tradition, how possible is it to revamp a business for the dead? A Moroccan-Belgian entrepreneur attempts to find out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Cum0U2yTrRxBNYJJRUuo6nJ0P4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137650'),
  ('252999574964233956', 'SOKO Kitzbühel', 2001, 'Crime', 'Martin Kinkel', null, 'Heinz Marecek, Andrea L''Arronge, Ferry Öllinger, Kristina Sprenger, Christine Klein, Jakob Seeböck, Hans Sigl, Andreas Kiendl', 'NR', 'SOKO Kitzbühel is an Austrian television series produced by ORF and ZDF. It is a spin-off of the German crime series SOKO 5113. It is set in the renowned Tyrolean tourist centre of Kitzbühel. The production company "beo-Film" has produced the show since 2001. The German abbreviation SOKO stands for Sonderkommission, "special commission", a task force with specific duties.', 'SOKO Kitzbühel is an Austrian television series produced by ORF and ZDF. It is a spin-off of the German crime series SOKO 5113. It is set in the renowned Tyrolean tourist centre of Kitzbühel. The production company "beo-Film" has produced the show since 2001. The German abbreviation SOKO stands for Sonderkommission, "special commission", a task force with specific duties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ufi6NFLlPkFLhdbGbbMmj05Ezc3.jpg', 20, 'tmdb:tv:41451'),
  ('281697888344744142', 'SOKO Köln', 2003, 'Crime', null, null, 'Kerstin Landsmann', 'NR', 'The SOKO Köln investigates the cathedral city with humor and often with hard work. Their cases take them into a variety of environments, from the Cologne clique to the terraced housing estates on the outskirts of the city.', 'The SOKO Köln investigates the cathedral city with humor and often with hard work. Their cases take them into a variety of environments, from the Cologne clique to the terraced housing estates on the outskirts of the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jLwoCyFg0vFze0JIQIhItsAE4yR.jpg', 24, 'tmdb:tv:40862'),
  ('1001368808738674196', 'SOKO Leipzig', 2001, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Melanie Marschke, Marco Girnth, Daniel Steiner, Anna Stieblich, Johannes Hendrik Langer', null, 'SOKO Leipzig is a German police procedural television programme, a spin-off of the earlier German police programme SOKO 5113. It was first broadcast on 31 January 2001, on German television channel ZDF. On 12 November 2008, the first part of a two-part crossover between SOKO Leipzig and British police procedural The Bill was aired, with the same version being shown on both ZDF and British television channel ITV1.', 'SOKO Leipzig is a German police procedural television programme, a spin-off of the earlier German police programme SOKO 5113. It was first broadcast on 31 January 2001, on German television channel ZDF. On 12 November 2008, the first part of a two-part crossover between SOKO Leipzig and British police procedural The Bill was aired, with the same version being shown on both ZDF and British television channel ITV1.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fiWiLPZnFfIF6s6dcEblG7u749.jpg', 26, 'tmdb:tv:19758'),
  ('805212030409229833', 'SOKO Linz', 2022, 'Crime', null, null, 'Katharina Stemberger, Damyan Andreev, Alexander Pschill, Miriam Hie, Angelika Niedetzky, Michael Steinocher', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFDggOqW3lhH85gspnN3FRzLfRQ.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:154011'),
  ('857606329029189740', 'Soko Magattara, Sakurazaka?', 2020, 'Talk', 'Yasushi Akimoto', null, 'Hikari Endo, Rei Ōzono, Ōnuma Akiho, Marino Kōsaka, Kira Masumoto, Rena Moriya, Rina Uemura, Rika Ozeki', null, 'Soko Magattara, Sakurazaka? is a Japanese late night variety show starring Japanese idol group Sakurazaka46. It is hosted by Yū Sawabe and Teruyuki Tsuchida and airs every Sunday at 12:35 AM JST on TV Tokyo.', 'Soko Magattara, Sakurazaka? is a Japanese late night variety show starring Japanese idol group Sakurazaka46. It is hosted by Yū Sawabe and Teruyuki Tsuchida and airs every Sunday at 12:35 AM JST on TV Tokyo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7S5jOnC05iezRKSaevmSYitkaKN.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:207553'),
  ('538779493139665018', 'SOKO München', 1978, 'Crime', null, null, 'Gerd Silberbauer, Joscha Kiefer, Mersiha Husagić, Christofer von Beau', null, 'SOKO 5113 is a long-running German police procedural television series. It was first aired in 1978 on 2 January. SOKO is an abbreviation of the term "Sonderkommission" in German.', 'SOKO 5113 is a long-running German police procedural television series. It was first aired in 1978 on 2 January. SOKO is an abbreviation of the term "Sonderkommission" in German.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXWVu2OyKMnfrurvCRUY1TpzOjx.jpg', 46, 'tmdb:tv:5500'),
  ('292144813659874629', 'SOKO Stuttgart', 2009, 'Crime', null, null, 'Peter Ketnath, Benjamin Strecker, Astrid M. Fünderich, Karl Kranzkowski, Mike Zaka Sommerfeldt, Michael Gaedt', 'NR', 'The SOKO Stuttgart team investigates analytically and with sensitivity in the likeable state capital. The exciting cases of the series lead them to bizarre crime scenes and to different milieus.', 'The SOKO Stuttgart team investigates analytically and with sensitivity in the likeable state capital. The exciting cases of the series lead them to bizarre crime scenes and to different milieus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eu50QVZd1b7itOI76oKPUR0Eqvl.jpg', 17, 'tmdb:tv:40905'),
  ('1038546742784858247', 'SOKO Wismar', 2004, 'Crime', 'Rainer Berg, Matthias Herbert', null, 'Udo Kroschwald, Dominic Boeer, Katharina Blaschke, Silke Matthias', 'NR', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jvc2fWkPfr5CdiK18k9VOM6xYZ5.jpg', 22, 'tmdb:tv:41018'),
  ('119289222019934980', 'Sola', 2007, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Nobuhiko Okamoto, Mamiko Noto, Mai Nakahara, Youko Honda, Ai Shimizu, Tomoko Kaneda, Keiji Fujiwara', 'TV-14', 'Yorito Morimiya is obsessed with photographing the sky-- sunrises, sunsets, and clouds. While trying to photograph a sunrise, he helps a girl who''s fighting a vending machine to get her tomato juice. Then she disappears. The story of a world of mystery and magic is narrated by Sola. An enigmatic girl comes and goes, withholding a dark secret and Yorito''s sky becomes the battleground for love and solitude.', 'Yorito Morimiya is obsessed with photographing the sky-- sunrises, sunsets, and clouds. While trying to photograph a sunrise, he helps a girl who''s fighting a vending machine to get her tomato juice. Then she disappears. The story of a world of mystery and magic is narrated by Sola. An enigmatic girl comes and goes, withholding a dark secret and Yorito''s sky becomes the battleground for love and solitude.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jdM4NVmNRQB5NQ5Ic51hdQktgnK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34214'),
  ('831510210419063295', 'Solar Opposites', 2020, 'Comedy, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Mike McMahan, Justin Roiland', null, 'Dan Stevens, Thomas Middleditch, Sean Giambrone, Mary Mack', 'TV-MA', 'A family of aliens from a much better world must take refuge in middle America after the destruction of their planet. Their mission: protect the Pupa, a living super computer that will one day evolve into its true form, consume them and terraform the Earth.', 'A family of aliens from a much better world must take refuge in middle America after the destruction of their planet. Their mission: protect the Pupa, a living super computer that will one day evolve into its true form, consume them and terraform the Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nuBD4dlO7gfg4RhW0sS0pTeiYRc.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:97645'),
  ('647096326103687302', 'Solar System', 2024, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Professor Brian Cox', 'TV-PG', 'Voyage across the solar system with Professor Brian Cox and explore the new discoveries, natural wonders and strange mysteries on the diverse worlds that orbit the sun.', 'Voyage across the solar system with Professor Brian Cox and explore the new discoveries, natural wonders and strange mysteries on the diverse worlds that orbit the sun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ufpE2uTV0GKRKlgY70n67G3z3K.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:272500'),
  ('309887941194775137', 'Soldier of Fortune', 1982, 'Drama', 'Dennis Chiu Jan-Keung', null, 'Patricia Chong, Felix Wong Yat-Wah, Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Kent Tong Chun-Yip, Meg Lam Kin-Ming, Lau Siu-Ming, Fu Yuk-Lan, Law Keung', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5MNCqzpcEbZiNbYEt5MlKGx5dpw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109723'),
  ('62985386825787135', 'Soldier of Fortune, Inc.', 1997, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Dan Gordon', null, 'Brad Johnson, Tim Abell, Melinda Clarke, David Selby, Dennis Rodman, Julie Nathanson', 'NR', 'Soldier of Fortune, Inc. was a television show created by Dan Gordon which ran for two seasons, from 1997–1999. The show followed an elite team who performed "unofficial" missions for the US Government. During the first season, the show dealt with terrorists and drug lords, and often tackled issues such as patriotism and self-sacrifice. The theme song was performed by Trevor Rabin. During the second season, a voiceover by Peter Graves was added. For the second season, the show was renamed SOF: Special Ops Force. Andrews and Sheppard left the show. Dennis Rodman and David Eigenberg replaced them, though their "hip" characters and new plots led many to abandon the show, leading to its cancellation.', 'Soldier of Fortune, Inc. was a television show created by Dan Gordon which ran for two seasons, from 1997–1999. The show followed an elite team who performed "unofficial" missions for the US Government. During the first season, the show dealt with terrorists and drug lords, and often tackled issues such as patriotism and self-sacrifice. The theme song was performed by Trevor Rabin. During the second season, a voiceover by Peter Graves was added. For the second season, the show was renamed SOF: Special Ops Force. Andrews and Sheppard left the show. Dennis Rodman and David Eigenberg replaced them, though their "hip" characters and new plots led many to abandon the show, leading to its cancellation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jFcq9hiUyBfUUX9A27kwbvXKyNN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:12473'),
  ('161734820510343137', 'Soldier Soldier', 1991, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Lucy Gannon', null, null, null, 'The daily lives of a group of soldiers in ''B'' Company, 1st Battalion The King''s Fusiliers.', 'The daily lives of a group of soldiers in ''B'' Company, 1st Battalion The King''s Fusiliers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTViK9932qvFrEOJznd82HTsl92.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:13587'),
  ('222267579997298932', 'Soldiers', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Andrey Yakovlev, Djamal Atabay', 'Djamal Atabay, Andrey Yakovlev', 'Aleksey Maklakov, Ivan Mokhovikov, Aleksandr Lymarev, Olga Fadeyeva, Boris Shcherbakov, Roman Madyanov, Pavel Kassinskiy, Maksim Konovalov', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gfA8qCggI61oLFun7ZjVpwCcuCw.jpg', 17, 'tmdb:tv:69830'),
  ('1072532939482652559', 'Soldiers Sortie', 2006, 'Drama', 'Kang Honglei', 'Lan Xiaolong', 'Wang Baoqiang, Chen Sicheng, Duan Yihong, Zhang Guoqiang, Zhang Yi, Xing Jiadong, Gao Jin, Jerry Lee', null, 'Soldiers Sortie is a 2007 Chinese TV drama based on a novel by Lan Xiaolong. It was co-produced by the 8-1 Film Studio, Chengdu Military Region Television Arts Center, Huayi Brothers Film Investment Co. Ltd., and Yunnan TV Station. The production cast includes Kang Honglei as director, Wu Yi as producer, Qian Zhang as chief producer, and Lan Xiaolong as script writer.', 'Soldiers Sortie is a 2007 Chinese TV drama based on a novel by Lan Xiaolong. It was co-produced by the 8-1 Film Studio, Chengdu Military Region Television Arts Center, Huayi Brothers Film Investment Co. Ltd., and Yunnan TV Station. The production cast includes Kang Honglei as director, Wu Yi as producer, Qian Zhang as chief producer, and Lan Xiaolong as script writer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shCcbHmdofo9iDNLHYTEeIm8pye.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:18335'),
  ('12729350351640547', 'Solitary Gourmet', 2012, 'Drama', null, null, 'Yutaka Matsushige, Tomoki Uekusa, Masayuki Kusumi', null, 'Centered around typical Japanese food, a solitary salesman travelling through the country for business purposes, eats at its various establishments and experiences the various delicacies of Japanese cuisine.', 'Centered around typical Japanese food, a solitary salesman travelling through the country for business purposes, eats at its various establishments and experiences the various delicacies of Japanese cuisine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3DEWsJv0OxHON7AEy4Us6m3e7fS.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:55582'),
  ('378762683604522632', 'Solo Camping for Two', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Daiki Hamano, Mizuki Niizaki', null, 'Gen Kinokura just wanted to enjoy his peaceful solo camping trips—no distractions, no problems. Enter Shizuku Kusano, a clueless but enthusiastic newbie who crashes his campsite (literally). Now, this bothered outdoorsman is stuck teaching her the ropes. Laughs, mishaps, and heartwarming moments await this duo-camp adventure under the stars!', 'Gen Kinokura just wanted to enjoy his peaceful solo camping trips—no distractions, no problems. Enter Shizuku Kusano, a clueless but enthusiastic newbie who crashes his campsite (literally). Now, this bothered outdoorsman is stuck teaching her the ropes. Laughs, mishaps, and heartwarming moments await this duo-camp adventure under the stars!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1UVwYCQ4q02T40bdnRgTFLkOXc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:281044'),
  ('947975792379289335', 'Solo Leveling', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Taito Ban, Genta Nakamura, Haruna Mikawa, Reina Ueda, Daisuke Hirakawa, Hiroki Touchi, Banjo Ginga, Makoto Furukawa', 'TV-14', 'They say whatever doesn’t kill you makes you stronger, but that’s not the case for the world’s weakest hunter Sung Jinwoo. After being brutally slaughtered by monsters in a high-ranking dungeon, Jinwoo came back with the System, a program only he could see, that’s leveling him up in every way. Now, he’s inspired to discover the secrets behind his powers and the dungeon that spawned them.', 'They say whatever doesn’t kill you makes you stronger, but that’s not the case for the world’s weakest hunter Sung Jinwoo. After being brutally slaughtered by monsters in a high-ranking dungeon, Jinwoo came back with the System, a program only he could see, that’s leveling him up in every way. Now, he’s inspired to discover the secrets behind his powers and the dungeon that spawned them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/geCRueV3ElhRTr0xtJuEWJt6dJ1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127532'),
  ('884015152365934265', 'Solo para Mujeres', 2025, 'Documentary, News, Drama', 'Santiago Dosal, Alfonso de Angoitia, Santiago Mohar', null, 'Sergio Mayer, Eugenio Derbez, Raúl Magaña, Alexis Ayala, Juan Carlos Casasola, Jorge Salinas, Lorena Herrera, Victor Manuel Resendiz Ruiz', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w3ooMjVvnijP1cpvURVsP3y6SL4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:291151'),
  ('52283655575281586', 'Solomon''s Perjury', 2016, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Kim Hyeon-soo, Jang Dong-yoon, Seo Ji-hoon, Seo Young-joo, Seo Shin-ae, Cho Jae-hyun, Shin Se-hwi, Ahn Seung-gyun', null, 'A male student''s body is found at school. Authorities assume that the student killed himself in a fall. Other students at the school hold a trial to uncover the truth behind his death.', 'A male student''s body is found at school. Authorities assume that the student killed himself in a fall. Other students at the school hold a trial to uncover the truth behind his death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z3aGCmYzgsYMYxkCwcvshRLtjRM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68815'),
  ('634229805584459960', 'Solos', 2021, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'David Weil', 'Tori Sampson', 'Morgan Freeman', 'TV-14', 'Anthology series telling character-driven stories set at different moments in time, aiming to showcase that during people''s most isolated moments, and in disparate circumstances, the human experience connects everyone.', 'Anthology series telling character-driven stories set at different moments in time, aiming to showcase that during people''s most isolated moments, and in disparate circumstances, the human experience connects everyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/szoC8f6wAXGmgn0aiSDroRx7Ngs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:119279'),
  ('618789261029230980', 'Solsidan', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Felix Herngren, Pontus Edgren, Jacob Seth Fransson', null, 'Felix Herngren, Mia Skäringer, Johan Rheborg, Josephine Bornebusch', 'NR', 'The series is named after a small part of Saltsjöbaden called Solsidan. It revolves around Alex and Anna who are expecting their first child and have just moved to Alex''s childhood home in Saltsjöbaden, Stockholm County. Alex tries to get Anna to enjoy herself, and at the same time spend time with his childhood friend Fredde.', 'The series is named after a small part of Saltsjöbaden called Solsidan. It revolves around Alex and Anna who are expecting their first child and have just moved to Alex''s childhood home in Saltsjöbaden, Stockholm County. Alex tries to get Anna to enjoy herself, and at the same time spend time with his childhood friend Fredde.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aDTeUiIXqLeV82OFVkNGaUfS3GN.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:31934'),
  ('933797443808059332', 'Soltero con hijas', 2019, 'Soap, Comedy, Family, Kids, Drama', null, null, 'Gabriel Soto, Vanessa Guzmán, Irina Baeva, Pablo Montero, Laura Vignatti, Juan Vidal, Mayrín Villanueva, Carlos Mata', 'TV-PG', 'The life of a single, carefree man suddenly changes when he has to take care of three nieces.', 'The life of a single, carefree man suddenly changes when he has to take care of three nieces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6OK41OFAE8gzj6TvAeq0gmKhVw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95160'),
  ('211660596423959036', 'Solty Rei', 2005, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Jouji Nakata, Momoko Saito, Natsuko Kuwatani, Sayaka Ohara', 'TV-14', 'It’s been twelve years since the Blast Fall, an unexplained disaster that left countless dead and many more maimed. Society is divided and every citizen feels the burn, most of all the Resembles – people whose mangled bodies have been rebuilt with high-tech prosthetic devices. Bounty hunter Roy Revant has seen it all, walking alone in this shattered city. That is, until the day a strange little girl named Solty falls from the sky straight into his heart. The search for family turns into a search for meaning and those that wield harsh power over society won’t go unnamed for long. Roy and Solty may seek different things… But who wants to search for truth alone?', 'It’s been twelve years since the Blast Fall, an unexplained disaster that left countless dead and many more maimed. Society is divided and every citizen feels the burn, most of all the Resembles – people whose mangled bodies have been rebuilt with high-tech prosthetic devices. Bounty hunter Roy Revant has seen it all, walking alone in this shattered city. That is, until the day a strange little girl named Solty falls from the sky straight into his heart. The search for family turns into a search for meaning and those that wield harsh power over society won’t go unnamed for long. Roy and Solty may seek different things… But who wants to search for truth alone?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u8ONAAB4eWjn9CkE8s0JPMdcOUN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:26674'),
  ('947840893782448397', 'Solveig and John''s Dolce Villa', 2026, 'Reality', null, null, 'Solveig Kloppen, John Brungot', null, 'Two Norwegian TV personalities ditch their everyday lives to buy and fix up a place in a tiny Italian town. They barely speak the language, can''t really renovate, and their budget is laughably small. Everything goes sideways constantly, but they insist it''s all a love story.', 'Two Norwegian TV personalities ditch their everyday lives to buy and fix up a place in a tiny Italian town. They barely speak the language, can''t really renovate, and their budget is laughably small. Everything goes sideways constantly, but they insist it''s all a love story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cXbuatgBTwFM5Hqe2u4EcKxYGoq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:313682'),
  ('974842992802470108', 'Somali and the Forest Spirit', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Inori Minase, Daisuke Ono, Hiroki Nanami, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Saori Hayami, Yuki Ono, Yu Kobayashi, Tomokazu Seki', 'TV-PG', 'The world is ruled by spirits, goblins, and all manner of strange creatures. Human beings are persecuted, to the very point of extinction. One day, a golem and a lone human girl meet. This is a record of the pair, one a member of a ruined race, the other a watchman of the forest. It tells of their travels together and of the bond between father and daughter.', 'The world is ruled by spirits, goblins, and all manner of strange creatures. Human beings are persecuted, to the very point of extinction. One day, a golem and a lone human girl meet. This is a record of the pair, one a member of a ruined race, the other a watchman of the forest. It tells of their travels together and of the bond between father and daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oWEIcSsevQREpdQQleynW3s1zh2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92586'),
  ('280037357285492273', 'Some Assembly Required', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Dan Signer, Howard Nemetz', null, 'Kolton Stewart, Charlie Storwick, Dylan Playfair, Harrison Houde, Sydney Scotia, Ellie Harvie, Travis Turner', 'TV-G', 'When fourteen-year-old Jarvis Raines gets a chemistry set from his Aunt Marlene for Christmas, he assumes it''s just another boring gift. Boy is he wrong! The contents create a chemical reaction that destroys his houseso much for a Merry Christmas! After getting not even an apology from the manufacturer, Knickknack Toys, Jarvis takes them to court, wins, and ends up owning the company!', 'When fourteen-year-old Jarvis Raines gets a chemistry set from his Aunt Marlene for Christmas, he assumes it''s just another boring gift. Boy is he wrong! The contents create a chemical reaction that destroys his houseso much for a Merry Christmas! After getting not even an apology from the manufacturer, Knickknack Toys, Jarvis takes them to court, wins, and ends up owning the company!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cDdcJe6NReLfGZi1mMPvO2fHmq8.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:62792'),
  ('260585882767252122', 'Some Day', 2010, 'Family, Comedy', 'Yuk-On Tsui', null, 'Louise Lee Si-Kei, Teresa Mo Shun-Kwan, Wayne Lai Yiu-Cheung, Wong Hei, Kristal Tin Yui-Nei, Johnson Lee Sze-Chit, Aimee Chan, Tsui Wing', null, 'After taking charge of her deceased husband’s jewelry shop, MING SUM-ON (Lee Sze Kei) makes it a big success with the help of both jewelry designers, MA HO-MAN (Cheng Tse Sing) and his wife CHENG KIU (Teresa Mo). However, KIU falls out with SUM after her divorce with MAN for SUM didn’t tell her that MAN was committing adultery. SUM’s youngest uncle (Lee Sze Chit) tries to mediate between them but it doesn’t work. On top of the dispute with KIU, SUM is also troubled by the Administrative Consultant CHU BO (Lau Tan) who is assigned by her husband’s family and the rebellious step daughter SHEK HO-YEE (Aimee Chan). With the support of her best friend LAM CHING-LING (Kristal Tin) after the divorce, KIU has transformed from a home-loving housewife into a total workaholic. Consequently, she is promoted as chief designer and achieves great success at work...', 'After taking charge of her deceased husband’s jewelry shop, MING SUM-ON (Lee Sze Kei) makes it a big success with the help of both jewelry designers, MA HO-MAN (Cheng Tse Sing) and his wife CHENG KIU (Teresa Mo). However, KIU falls out with SUM after her divorce with MAN for SUM didn’t tell her that MAN was committing adultery. SUM’s youngest uncle (Lee Sze Chit) tries to mediate between them but it doesn’t work. On top of the dispute with KIU, SUM is also troubled by the Administrative Consultant CHU BO (Lau Tan) who is assigned by her husband’s family and the rebellious step daughter SHEK HO-YEE (Aimee Chan). With the support of her best friend LAM CHING-LING (Kristal Tin) after the divorce, KIU has transformed from a home-loving housewife into a total workaholic. Consequently, she is promoted as chief designer and achieves great success at work...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7nlCXYQcn2pweP9VDJ3yjg1Np2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32905'),
  ('350035897625640845', 'Some Girls', 2012, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Adelayo Adedayo, Natasha Jonas, Alice Felgate, Mandeep Dhillon, Dolly Wells', null, 'The lives and loves of a group of quirky 16-year-old high school girls who live within the same south London housing estate.', 'The lives and loves of a group of quirky 16-year-old high school girls who live within the same south London housing estate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVNMVGKaX0WFQzk4AbthB2f9myu.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:59086'),
  ('946164789315261163', 'Some Good News', 2020, 'News, Talk, Comedy', 'John Krasinski', null, 'John Krasinski', 'TV-PG', 'John Krasinski highlights some good news from around the world.', 'John Krasinski highlights some good news from around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8KrhN7Mx6uoxFnRAaZrzYRO5TVB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:101214'),
  ('817798426037780282', 'Some Mothers Do ''Ave ''Em', 1973, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Michael Crawford, Michele Dotrice', 'TV-PG', 'Meet Frank Spencer, an eager young man trying to find his way in the world. He''s enthusiastic, well-meaning... and disaster-prone.', 'Meet Frank Spencer, an eager young man trying to find his way in the world. He''s enthusiastic, well-meaning... and disaster-prone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mO1rl37Jduy6wGxAE1pQS51qKwz.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:5986'),
  ('714713603281498996', 'Somebody', 2022, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Han Ji-wan, Jung Ji-woo', 'Han Ji-wan', 'Kim Young-kwang, Kang Hae-lim, Kim Yong-ji, Kim Su-yeon, Kim Byung-nam, Song Yeon-ji', null, 'A software developer and her friends become entangled in a murder case involving her dating app and a mysterious man who seems to be hiding something.', 'A software developer and her friends become entangled in a murder case involving her dating app and a mysterious man who seems to be hiding something.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wTips9yZIOfHsTuK1b6kVYlEOdn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112837'),
  ('515034578861459194', 'Somebody Feed Phil', 2018, 'Documentary, Reality', 'Phil Rosenthal', null, 'Phil Rosenthal', 'TV-14', '"Everybody Loves Raymond" creator Phil Rosenthal travels the globe to take in the local cuisine and culture of Bangkok, Lisbon, Mexico City and more.', '"Everybody Loves Raymond" creator Phil Rosenthal travels the globe to take in the local cuisine and culture of Bangkok, Lisbon, Mexico City and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/baB2pARwDixrwnwKKmGY415hqPL.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:76305'),
  ('572095609338851196', 'Somebody Somewhere', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hannah Bos, Paul Thureen', null, 'Bridget Everett, Jeff Hiller, Mary Catherine Garrison, Murray Hill', 'TV-MA', 'Sam is a true Kansan on the surface but beneath it all struggles to fit the hometown mold. As she grapples with loss and acceptance, singing is Sam’s saving grace and leads her on a journey to discover herself and a community of outsiders that don’t fit in but don’t give up, showing that finding your people, and finding your voice, is possible. Anywhere. Somewhere.', 'Sam is a true Kansan on the surface but beneath it all struggles to fit the hometown mold. As she grapples with loss and acceptance, singing is Sam’s saving grace and leads her on a journey to discover herself and a community of outsiders that don’t fit in but don’t give up, showing that finding your people, and finding your voice, is possible. Anywhere. Somewhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1GkoExnlnyTcyGWIoHA4YG8mysc.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:106308'),
  ('1069651540124130786', 'Someday or One Day', 2019, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Chi-Feng Chien', 'Hsin Hui Lin, Chi-Feng Chien', 'Ko Chia-Yen, Greg Hsu, Patrick Shih, Kenny Yen, Yen Yi-wen, Chang Han, Lin He-hsuan, Jacqueline Zhu', null, 'Yu-Hsuan lost her boyfriend Chuan-Sheng in plane accident. She then discovered Chuan-Sheng and a girl look alike Yu-Hsuan both appeared in a photo taken in 1998. Accidentally, she had backed to 1998 and met a boy looked alike Chuan-Sheng.', 'Yu-Hsuan lost her boyfriend Chuan-Sheng in plane accident. She then discovered Chuan-Sheng and a girl look alike Yu-Hsuan both appeared in a photo taken in 1998. Accidentally, she had backed to 1998 and met a boy looked alike Chuan-Sheng.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZF4fNtVSeTPSp0k2jp4qrupgbb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95717'),
  ('459079752164647223', 'Someday''s Dreamers', 2003, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Miku Sasao, Porsche Okite, Kana Hanazawa, Tomoaki Maeno, Daisuke Matsubara, Daisuke Namikawa, Eriko Matsushima, Fuyuka Ono', 'TV-14', 'Someday''s Dreamers is a manga written by Norie Yamada and illustrated by Kumichi Yoshizuki. It was serialized in Kadokawa Shoten''s Comic Dragon magazine from May 2002 to January 2003 and was later collected in two bound volumes. In 2006, Tokyopop released the manga in the United States under the name Someday''s Dreamers. Someday''s Dreamers was also adapted into an anime series that was produced by J.C.Staff under the direction of Masami Shimoda. It is loosely based on the storyline of the first manga series with new characters added to the story. It ran for a total of 12 episodes on TV Asahi and was later licensed by Geneon Entertainment USA. However, due to the closure of Geneon USA, the series has been relicensed by Sentai Filmworks. Another story set in the same universe, Someday''s Dreamers: Spellbound, written and drawn by the same author and illustrator, was serialized in Kadokawa Shoten''s Comic Dragon Age. It ran from December 2003 to February 2006 and was later released in five bound volumes. In 2006, Tokyopop released the manga in the United States under the name Someday''s Dreamers: Spellbound.', 'Someday''s Dreamers is a manga written by Norie Yamada and illustrated by Kumichi Yoshizuki. It was serialized in Kadokawa Shoten''s Comic Dragon magazine from May 2002 to January 2003 and was later collected in two bound volumes. In 2006, Tokyopop released the manga in the United States under the name Someday''s Dreamers. Someday''s Dreamers was also adapted into an anime series that was produced by J.C.Staff under the direction of Masami Shimoda. It is loosely based on the storyline of the first manga series with new characters added to the story. It ran for a total of 12 episodes on TV Asahi and was later licensed by Geneon Entertainment USA. However, due to the closure of Geneon USA, the series has been relicensed by Sentai Filmworks. Another story set in the same universe, Someday''s Dreamers: Spellbound, written and drawn by the same author and illustrator, was serialized in Kadokawa Shoten''s Comic Dragon Age. It ran from December 2003 to February 2006 and was later released in five bound volumes. In 2006, Tokyopop released the manga in the United States under the name Someday''s Dreamers: Spellbound.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPWHphwoXvXjz7Tdb8giYkYD7PV.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:34067'),
  ('898189270853680905', 'Somehow 18', 2017, 'Drama', null, 'Yoo Soo-ji', 'Minho, Lee Yu-bi, Kim Bo-mi, Kim Hee-chan, Choi Seo Hyuk, Yoo Joon-hong, Choo Soo Bin, Min-seo', null, 'The web drama tells the story of a popular orthopedic surgeon, Oh Kyung Hwi, who used to be a loner and a bullying victim during his highschool days. In order to save his first love, who committed suicide, Kyung Hwi goes back in time to when he was 18 years old.', 'The web drama tells the story of a popular orthopedic surgeon, Oh Kyung Hwi, who used to be a loner and a bullying victim during his highschool days. In order to save his first love, who committed suicide, Kyung Hwi goes back in time to when he was 18 years old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wumaOj1E2WlAPHP4HgpY33Wu8lA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73780'),
  ('317429325435413983', 'Someone Has to Die', 2020, 'Drama', 'Manolo Caro', null, 'Ernesto Alterio, Carmen Maura, Carlos Cuevas, Alejandro Speitzer, Cecilia Suárez, Isaac Hernández, Ester Expósito, Mariola Fuentes', 'TV-MA', 'In 1950s Spain, a couple summon their son home from Mexico to introduce him to his fiancée, but are shocked when he returns with a ballerino.', 'In 1950s Spain, a couple summon their son home from Mexico to introduce him to his fiancée, but are shocked when he returns with a ballerino.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/srFvdWGF1ZJc8JYHx9AdyMy968p.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105904'),
  ('332258833689151111', 'Something About 1%', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hyun Go-Woon', 'Hyun Go-Woon', 'Ha Seok-jin, Jeon So-min, Im Do-yoon, Lee Hae-in, Kim Sun-hyuk, Seo Eun-Chae, Kim Hyung-min, Cho Jae-ryong', null, 'Lee Jae-In possesses a good appearance, he is smart and comes from a wealthy family, but he is also arrogant. His grandfather orders Jae-In to enter into a 10 month contract engagement with a female school teacher that he has never met in his life. Lee Jae-In slowly falls in love with her.', 'Lee Jae-In possesses a good appearance, he is smart and comes from a wealthy family, but he is also arrogant. His grandfather orders Jae-In to enter into a 10 month contract engagement with a female school teacher that he has never met in his life. Lee Jae-In slowly falls in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hmj93zym1op2IEM4HIlYYezTI5c.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67802'),
  ('694278022036305357', 'Something in the Air', 2000, 'Drama', null, null, 'Ullie Birvé, Colin Moody, Danielle Carter, Kate Fitzpatrick, Frankie J. Holden, Anne Phelan, Nina Liu, Mariel McClorey', null, 'Something in the Air was an Australian television soap opera transmitted by the Australian Broadcasting Corporation between 2000 and 2002. It was one of the first programs in Australia that was filmed in widescreen. It won the AACTA Award for Best Television Drama Series in 2001.', 'Something in the Air was an Australian television soap opera transmitted by the Australian Broadcasting Corporation between 2000 and 2002. It was one of the first programs in Australia that was filmed in widescreen. It won the AACTA Award for Best Television Drama Series in 2001.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4Rdtd2kfkAY7F6yJRzsS907LtK.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:15008'),
  ('840557877122195555', 'Something in the Rain', 2018, 'Drama', 'Kim Eun', 'Kim Eun', 'Son Ye-jin, Jung Hae-in, Jang So-yeon, Jung Yoo-jin, Joo Min-kyung, Lee Joo-young, Seo Jeong-yeon, Park Hyuk-kwon', 'TV-MA', 'Explore the relationship of two people as they go from being “just acquaintances” to “a genuine couple” — Yoon Jin Ah, a coffee shop supervisor in her 30s, and Seo Joon Hee, a designer at a video game company who has just returned from working abroad.', 'Explore the relationship of two people as they go from being “just acquaintances” to “a genuine couple” — Yoon Jin Ah, a coffee shop supervisor in her 30s, and Seo Joon Hee, a designer at a video game company who has just returned from working abroad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sTNXMCASbNn7cSzcQ7DVazixnAc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78385'),
  ('833216616880697956', 'Something Is Out There', 1988, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Frank Lupo', 'Joe Cortese, Maryam D''Abo, George Dzundza, Gregory Sierra, Kim Delaney, John Putch, Robert Webber', null, 'Two police officers investigate a series of brutal murders in which the victims have had bodily organs removed. When one of them questions a young woman who has been seen at the crime scenes, it turns out she is an alien from an interstellar prison ship and that the murders have been committed by a powerful xenomorphic alien which had escaped.', 'Two police officers investigate a series of brutal murders in which the victims have had bodily organs removed. When one of them questions a young woman who has been seen at the crime scenes, it turns out she is an alien from an interstellar prison ship and that the murders have been committed by a powerful xenomorphic alien which had escaped.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jOzhQzRw0lDscsyyxYGjTS9AxR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77275'),
  ('957081698959972881', 'Something to Hide', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', 'Vincent Garenq', null, 'Daniel Auteuil, Victor Meutelet, Benjamin Bellecour, Catherine Alric, Grégoire Bonnet, Myriam Bourguignon, Charlie Bruneau, Alex Terrier-Thiebaux', 'NR', 'Marriage, family, career, everything in Claude''s life is a success. Mayor of his town, he is almost certain to become senator. For his beloved grandson Lucas, life is much less cheerful: his parents are divorcing and he''s awkward and ill at ease. One day he accuses his grandfather of rape.', 'Marriage, family, career, everything in Claude''s life is a success. Mayor of his town, he is almost certain to become senator. For his beloved grandson Lucas, life is much less cheerful: his parents are divorcing and he''s awkward and ill at ease. One day he accuses his grandfather of rape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kAPS9P07QtWVdUoirQvOgKfteIo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110886'),
  ('698607607284389920', 'Something Very Bad Is Going to Happen', 2026, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Haley Z. Boston', null, 'Camila Morrone, Adam DiMarco, Gus Birney, Jeff Wilbusch, Karla Crome, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Ted Levine, Sawyer Fraser', 'TV-MA', 'A bride has a feeling that something horrifying will happen at her wedding — and the closer to the altar she gets, the worse it becomes.', 'A bride has a feeling that something horrifying will happen at her wedding — and the closer to the altar she gets, the worse it becomes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tuj37DlqEqib8sTO4h3nHJeTAJ2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259265'),
  ('946121308419811861', 'Something''s Not Right', 2025, 'Drama', 'Tak Bon', null, 'Choi Min-ho, Jeong Je-hyeon, Ji Min-seo, Jeon Sa-ra, Park Soo-hyung, Bae Seung-hyeok, Hong Yu-ri, Park Sang-hyeon', null, 'Bawoo asks his longtime friend Hoon to date for a week to move on—but with a stalker looming and feelings deepening, fake love may turn real.', 'Bawoo asks his longtime friend Hoon to date for a week to move on—but with a stalker looming and feelings deepening, fake love may turn real.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hcIwo9w0apPMbdXeFDdakzWYRWd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:286486'),
  ('946923739591027251', 'Somewhere Between', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Stephen Tolkin', null, 'Paula Patton, Devon Sawa, JR Bourne, Aria Birch', 'TV-14', 'Laura Price, a local news producer in San Francisco, is helping the police to hunt down a serial killer. After the killer strikes close to home, a twist of fate allows a “Groundhog Day”-type reset, and Laura relives the week prior to the string of murders. Can she change fate and stop the killer?', 'Laura Price, a local news producer in San Francisco, is helping the police to hunt down a serial killer. After the killer strikes close to home, a twist of fate allows a “Groundhog Day”-type reset, and Laura relives the week prior to the string of murders. Can she change fate and stop the killer?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/seXbYwMR9fNqEYwaPPvPReZGiJQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70390'),
  ('775215111701806175', 'Somewhere Boy', 2022, 'Drama', 'Pete Jackson', 'Pete Jackson', 'Lewis Gribben, Samuel Bottomley, Rory Keenan, Lisa McGrillis, Johann Myers', 'TV-MA', 'Danny was a baby when his mother was killed in a car crash. Overcome with grief, his father locked him away in a house, telling him the outside world is full of monsters that will spirit him away like his mother.', 'Danny was a baby when his mother was killed in a car crash. Overcome with grief, his father locked him away in a house, telling him the outside world is full of monsters that will spirit him away like his mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kewJo0Kul1ukTIPXvL8aObNlEXo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210180'),
  ('1111737812958137439', 'Somewhere Only We Know', 2019, 'Drama', 'Mu Fusheng', 'Wang Zhi Yong, Chen Xi, Lang Xiaomeng', 'Zhang Chao, Li Tingting, Chen Bohao, Deng Yuli, Sun Jialing, Li Jiuxiao, Fang Wenqiang, Fu Bohan', 'TV-MA', 'Ph.D. candidate in Physics Mu Cheng He catches a third-year student in English Xue Tong cheating on an exam. When he even becomes the substitute teacher in her elective course Russian and makes her study with him after classes, her hatred for him only grows. Over time, however, Xue Tong discovers Teacher Mu’s true character and comes to secretly love him.', 'Ph.D. candidate in Physics Mu Cheng He catches a third-year student in English Xue Tong cheating on an exam. When he even becomes the substitute teacher in her elective course Russian and makes her study with him after classes, her hatred for him only grows. Over time, however, Xue Tong discovers Teacher Mu’s true character and comes to secretly love him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vw0TAVjewOJQg5As5e6d2jYMEB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86074'),
  ('1019593999250992053', 'Somewhere Somehow', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Mon Maew', null, 'Kanyaphat Na Nakhon, Yada Watcharamusik, Orntara Poolsak, Kunjiranut Intarasin, Chatchawit Techarukpong, Milin Watinthanakit, Asavarid Pinitkanjanapun, Lapisara Intarasut', null, 'Kee, a cool tsundere, and Peem, a mischievous rich girl, become inseparable friends. No one knows the truth, though, that really, they''ve been secretly in love with one another since high school. From handmade pork floss, a gear necklace as a token of love, to an accidental first kiss, hearts will be racing. But love is never so easy, and fate plays its tricks. The two are separated and it will be seven years before they meet again... as boss and employee.', 'Kee, a cool tsundere, and Peem, a mischievous rich girl, become inseparable friends. No one knows the truth, though, that really, they''ve been secretly in love with one another since high school. From handmade pork floss, a gear necklace as a token of love, to an accidental first kiss, hearts will be racing. But love is never so easy, and fate plays its tricks. The two are separated and it will be seven years before they meet again... as boss and employee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d8YvEerCNvKpfXoJHpvp2XvqjKY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:275216'),
  ('328361190137557369', 'Somos.', 2021, 'Drama', 'James Schamus', null, 'Jesús Sida, Mercedes Hernández, Jero Medina, Everardo Arzate, Natalia Solián, Fernando Larrañaga, Iliana Donatlán, Eduardo Humaran', 'TV-MA', 'The lives of the people of Allende, a Mexican border town, are overtaken by a powerful cartel''s operations, leading to tragedy. Inspired by true events.', 'The lives of the people of Allende, a Mexican border town, are overtaken by a powerful cartel''s operations, leading to tragedy. Inspired by true events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/opHopqkLzkftwUl4jTLcwckjuu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:126386'),
