  ('968203512399643909', 'Star Wars: The Bad Batch', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Dave Filoni', 'Amanda Rose Muñoz, George Lucas', 'Dee Bradley Baker, Michelle Ang', 'TV-PG', 'The ''Bad Batch'' of elite and experimental clones make their way through an ever-changing galaxy in the immediate aftermath of the Clone Wars.', 'The ''Bad Batch'' of elite and experimental clones make their way through an ever-changing galaxy in the immediate aftermath of the Clone Wars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5mHus672nuinyaE0FtqvD0AddcY.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:105971'),
