  ('1138885949892598861', 'Stark Raving Mad', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Steven Levitan', null, 'Tony Shalhoub, Neil Patrick Harris, Eddie McClintock, Heather Dubrow, Dorie Barton', null, 'A neurotic book editor is paired with an eccentric writer. The series stars Tony Shalhoub and Neil Patrick Harris.', 'A neurotic book editor is paired with an eccentric writer. The series stars Tony Shalhoub and Neil Patrick Harris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6VhRrggGd1VbtBzk5d2nbdhHcJB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:353'),
  ('846247686090357897', 'Starman', 1986, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Robert Hays, Christopher Daniel Barnes, Michael Cavanaugh', null, 'Starman is an American science fiction television series, starring Robert Hays and Christopher Daniel Barnes and continuing the story from John Carpenter''s 1984 film. The series ran on the ABC network from September 19, 1986 to May 2, 1987. The series was an adaptation and sequel to a movie of the same name produced in 1984.', 'Starman is an American science fiction television series, starring Robert Hays and Christopher Daniel Barnes and continuing the story from John Carpenter''s 1984 film. The series ran on the ABC network from September 19, 1986 to May 2, 1987. The series was an adaptation and sequel to a movie of the same name produced in 1984.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4fKXWIiaLTQDvOS5Ok4XfD5qKJb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5403'),
  ('16170188972971819', 'Stars Align', 2019, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Gen Sato, Natsuki Hanae, Tasuku Hatanaka, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Toshiyuki Toyonaga, Yusuke Kobayashi, Kohei Amasaki, Yoshitaka Yamaya', 'TV-14', 'Toma Shinjo has one mission: save his school’s tennis team. And his only hope rests on the talent of Maki Katsuragi, who’s reluctant to part from his studies. This will be the team’s last summer together unless they convince Maki to step on the court!', 'Toma Shinjo has one mission: save his school’s tennis team. And his only hope rests on the talent of Maki Katsuragi, who’s reluctant to part from his studies. This will be the team’s last summer together unless they convince Maki to step on the court!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHvY0YZ5gzvQFKuK4m7cCXFgcjo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92835'),
  ('5383323665117569', 'Stars in the House', 2020, null, null, null, null, null, 'In the wake of the Coronavirus pandemic and theatres across the world closing their curtains indefinitely, SiriusXM host Seth Rudetsky and his husband, producer James Wesley have created Stars in the House, a daily live streamed series to support The Actors Fund and its services.', 'In the wake of the Coronavirus pandemic and theatres across the world closing their curtains indefinitely, SiriusXM host Seth Rudetsky and his husband, producer James Wesley have created Stars in the House, a daily live streamed series to support The Actors Fund and its services.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Cp64eLIOErysYDX2K9gHNsDVD3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:232929'),
  ('301600843139747601', 'Stars in the Ring', 1959, 'Reality', null, null, 'Wim Thoelke, Peter Frankenfeld, Hans-Joachim Kulenkampff, Axel von Ambesser', null, 'Every year there was a Gala of the Stars at the Zirkus Krone in Munich.', 'Every year there was a Gala of the Stars at the Zirkus Krone in Munich.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2PWPCE2jSYEdt3ExIKbPDQoslR1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62837'),
  ('356775490117159938', 'Stars'' Top Recipe at Fun-Staurant', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, 'Lee Won-il, Do Kyung-wan, Jin Se-yeon, Lee Young-ja, Jung Il-woo, Lee Yeon-bok, Kim Na-young, Jeong Hye-young', null, 'Stars'' Top Recipe at Fun-Staurant or Fun Restaurant is a new variety show where celebrities are competing to make a new F&B product for the convenience store franchise. The program looks at the celebs'' daily lives that are filled with constant development on some exciting and delicious menus. Celebs compete every week, and the winner''s cuisine turns to the product that will sell the stores the next day. The profits will be donated to support children. The casts are led by Lee Kyung-kyu, who has had his own development into an actual product, and Lee Young-ja, the Muk-bang genius, and food aficionado.', 'Stars'' Top Recipe at Fun-Staurant or Fun Restaurant is a new variety show where celebrities are competing to make a new F&B product for the convenience store franchise. The program looks at the celebs'' daily lives that are filled with constant development on some exciting and delicious menus. Celebs compete every week, and the winner''s cuisine turns to the product that will sell the stores the next day. The profits will be donated to support children. The casts are led by Lee Kyung-kyu, who has had his own development into an actual product, and Lee Young-ja, the Muk-bang genius, and food aficionado.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujBF2OTTAtacUTPTicpXPL6T4l1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96108'),
  ('946317751548618194', 'Starship Operators', 2005, 'Animation, Drama, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Ryo Mizuno', null, 'Satomi Arai, Ayako Kawasumi, Masumi Asano, Mamiko Noto, Akeno Watanabe, Tomohiro Tsuboi, Shizuka Itoh, Yukimasa Obi', null, 'For the 73rd class of cadets of the Defense University of the small planet Kibi, a maiden voyage on the new warship Amaterasu is a fitting event just before graduation. As they are returning home, however, they are shocked to hear news of a declaration of war by the aggressive Kingdom of Henrietta against Kibi. When the Kibi government surrenders without a struggle, the cadets decide to fight back using the Amaterasu, with funding from the Galaxy News Network. The only stipulation? Exclusive airing rights to the action and good ratings. So, the cadets find themselves the "stars" of their own reality show.', 'For the 73rd class of cadets of the Defense University of the small planet Kibi, a maiden voyage on the new warship Amaterasu is a fitting event just before graduation. As they are returning home, however, they are shocked to hear news of a declaration of war by the aggressive Kingdom of Henrietta against Kibi. When the Kibi government surrenders without a struggle, the cadets decide to fight back using the Amaterasu, with funding from the Galaxy News Network. The only stipulation? Exclusive airing rights to the action and good ratings. So, the cadets find themselves the "stars" of their own reality show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v21ilHIRtt6LYyxox7G3I0HoWrt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34790'),
  ('177755684580808487', 'Starsky & Hutch', 1975, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'William Blinn', null, 'David Soul, Paul Michael Glaser, Antonio Fargas, Bernie Hamilton', 'TV-14', 'Streetwise Detective David Starsky partners up with a more intellectual partner, Kenneth ''Hutch'' Hutchinson, to protect citizens and patrol the streets of Bay City.', 'Streetwise Detective David Starsky partners up with a more intellectual partner, Kenneth ''Hutch'' Hutchinson, to protect citizens and patrol the streets of Bay City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aBj5oTi1uibVcXDoCJeKseJNY2d.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1532'),
  ('371332188207207629', 'Starstruck', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Rose Matafeo', null, 'Rose Matafeo, Nikesh Patel, Lorne MacFadyen', 'TV-MA', 'A drunken New Year''s Eve hook-up becomes far more complicated for Jessie when she discovers her one night stand is actually a film star.', 'A drunken New Year''s Eve hook-up becomes far more complicated for Jessie when she discovers her one night stand is actually a film star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/edwRHGJyn3mcQuOxPJwWVENKqL0.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:93288'),
  ('606717669791959962', 'Start Up, Fall Down: From Billionaire to Convict', 2025, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, null, null, 'One of Milan''s most exclusive parties takes a dark turn when a woman reports sexual assault. This documentary chronicles the investigation that followed.', 'One of Milan''s most exclusive parties takes a dark turn when a woman reports sexual assault. This documentary chronicles the investigation that followed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uxntXFQ6SqY4celQejnUC9y6TQ3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:304936'),
  ('797846972358163307', 'Start-Up', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Park Hye-ryun', null, 'Suzy, Nam Joo-hyuk, Kim Seon-ho, Kang Hanna, Kim Hae-sook, Kim Do-wan, Kim Won-hae, Song Sun-mi', 'TV-14', 'Young entrepreneurs aspiring to launch virtual dreams into reality compete for success and love in the cutthroat world of Korea''s high-tech industry.', 'Young entrepreneurs aspiring to launch virtual dreams into reality compete for success and love in the cutthroat world of Korea''s high-tech industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxJQ3A2wtreuWDnVBbzzXI3YlOE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99048'),
  ('392870532680656886', 'StarTalk with Neil deGrasse Tyson', 2015, 'Talk', 'Neil deGrasse Tyson', null, 'Neil deGrasse Tyson', 'TV-G', 'Host Neil deGrasse Tyson brings together celebrities, scientists and comedians to explore a variety of cosmic topics and collide pop culture with science in a way that late-night television has never seen before. Weekly topics range from popular science fiction, space travel, extraterrestrial life, the Big Bang, to the future of Earth and the environment. Tyson is an astrophysicist with a gifted ability to connect with everyone, inspiring us all to to "keep looking up."', 'Host Neil deGrasse Tyson brings together celebrities, scientists and comedians to explore a variety of cosmic topics and collide pop culture with science in a way that late-night television has never seen before. Weekly topics range from popular science fiction, space travel, extraterrestrial life, the Big Bang, to the future of Earth and the environment. Tyson is an astrophysicist with a gifted ability to connect with everyone, inspiring us all to to "keep looking up."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qCSXMlSNtgqTkrAYzK9dWPS7hHR.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:64711'),
  ('4636566675579499', 'Startime', 1959, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, null, null, 'Startime is an anthology show of drama, comedy, and variety, and was one of the first American television shows broadcast in color. The program was aired Tuesday nights in the United States on the NBC Television network in the 1959-60 television season.', 'Startime is an anthology show of drama, comedy, and variety, and was one of the first American television shows broadcast in color. The program was aired Tuesday nights in the United States on the NBC Television network in the 1959-60 television season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHi6lJMLkXAC23eoRZTQuf6610m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:27907'),
  ('605151188398612812', 'Starting 5', 2024, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, 'Jaylen Brown, Kevin Durant, Shai Gilgeous-Alexander, Tyrese Haliburton, James Harden', 'TV-MA', 'Follows 5 NBA players throughout an entire NBA series, delving into their on-court performance and off-court personal lives.', 'Follows 5 NBA players throughout an entire NBA series, delving into their on-court performance and off-court personal lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i6SYNxGbyo9nIg4MugPMnaUHKYR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:262955'),
  ('196410578228594815', 'StartUp', 2016, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ben Ketai', null, 'Adam Brody, Edi Gathegi, Otmara Marrero, Addison Timlin, Ron Perlman, Mira Sorvino', 'TV-MA', 'A desperate banker needs to conceal stolen money. A Haitian-American gang lord wants to go legit. A Cuban-American hacker has an idea that will revolutionize the very future of money itself. Forced to work together, they unwittingly create their version of the American dream - organized crime 2.0.', 'A desperate banker needs to conceal stolen money. A Haitian-American gang lord wants to go legit. A Cuban-American hacker has an idea that will revolutionize the very future of money itself. Forced to work together, they unwittingly create their version of the American dream - organized crime 2.0.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXiB1e0x3iaRaaPPVhC1c7rgwPr.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:66310'),
