  ('866900753473186821', 'Steal', 2026, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Sotiris Nikias', 'Sotiris Nikias, Poppy Cogan, Shyam Popat', 'Sophie Turner, Archie Madekwe, Jacob Fortune-Lloyd, Andrew Howard, Jonathan Slinger, Ellie James, Sarah Belcher, Thomas Larkin', null, 'A typical day at Lochmill Capital is upended when armed thieves burst in and force Zara and her best friend Luke to execute their demands. In the aftermath, conflicted detective Rhys races against time to find out who stole £4 billion pounds of people''s pensions and why.', 'A typical day at Lochmill Capital is upended when armed thieves burst in and force Zara and her best friend Luke to execute their demands. In the aftermath, conflicted detective Rhys races against time to find out who stole £4 billion pounds of people''s pensions and why.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6KmlaPhsohh3Ki9XJUq0jiUYbf3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:254071'),
