  ('445735366385329143', 'Stolen Youth: Inside the Cult at Sarah Lawrence', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Isabella Pollok, Felicia Rosario, Larry Ray, Daniel Levin', 'TV-MA', 'A group of bright Sarah Lawrence College students fall under the dark influence of a friend''s father, Larry Ray. With unprecedented access to the survivors who lived with Ray, the series follows the cult from its origins through its still-unfolding aftermath.', 'A group of bright Sarah Lawrence College students fall under the dark influence of a friend''s father, Larry Ray. With unprecedented access to the survivors who lived with Ray, the series follows the cult from its origins through its still-unfolding aftermath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r00i76ZaQ0NtwK2mkpVLkT6skkg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:216315'),
  ('742392045895267398', 'Stone Jungle Laws', 2015, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ilya Kulikov', null, 'Elizaveta Kononova, Darya Rudenok, Aleksey Kirsanov, Yuliya Khlynina, Daniil Vakhrushev, Vladimir Sychev, Aleksandr Melnikov, Aristarkh Venes', null, 'Four guys from the outskirts of Moscow decide to make easy money - to overtake a car with stolen cargo inside. Not really thinking about the consequences, they make one mistake after another, and very soon they have serious problems with the law. Now there is no turning back, and in order to survive, four friends need to stick together at all costs.', 'Four guys from the outskirts of Moscow decide to make easy money - to overtake a car with stolen cargo inside. Not really thinking about the consequences, they make one mistake after another, and very soon they have serious problems with the law. Now there is no turning back, and in order to survive, four friends need to stick together at all costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ksia9Xq1GS6hwuadYBAyNCqNTv3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66855'),
  ('32386167880387026', 'Stonehouse', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'John Preston', null, 'Matthew Macfadyen, Keeley Hawes, Emer Heatley, Kevin McNally, Dorothy Atkinson, Archie Barnes, Simon Greenall, Orla Hill', null, 'Drama following the life and times of disgraced Labour politician John Stonehouse, a high-flying minister under Prime Minister Harold Wilson’s government vanished from the beach of a large luxury hotel in Florida in November 1974, leaving a neatly folded pile of clothes as he swam into the sea, intent on faking his own death.', 'Drama following the life and times of disgraced Labour politician John Stonehouse, a high-flying minister under Prime Minister Harold Wilson’s government vanished from the beach of a large luxury hotel in Florida in November 1974, leaving a neatly folded pile of clothes as he swam into the sea, intent on faking his own death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7xmnEX695cnHmug9biL9J28IW8l.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:196142'),
