  ('695569273685314028', 'Storm Eye', 2021, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', null, 'Liang Zhenhua, Jiang Da Qiao, Wen Qin', 'Yang Mi, Vin Zhang, Liu Ruilin, Dai Si, Wang Xiao, Wang Dong, Shi Liang, Zhang Shen', null, 'A story about a team of agents is told from the perspective of An Jing and Ma Shang. Showing no fear in their mission to uphold justice, these officers work hard to protect national interests.', 'A story about a team of agents is told from the perspective of An Jing and Ma Shang. Showing no fear in their mission to uphold justice, these officers work hard to protect national interests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nV4Y4QvutziGNLaiO1aHbXIjAzq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90701'),
  ('423463676761332870', 'Storm Hawks', 2007, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', 'Asaph Fipke', null, 'Scott McNeil, Matt Hill, Sam Vincent, Nicole Oliver, Cathy Weseluck, Lenore Zann, Chiara Zanni, Colin Murdock', 'TV-Y7', 'Storm Hawks is an animated television series created by Asaph "Ace" Fipke and made by Nerd Corps Entertainment in conjunction and collaboration with Cartoon Network and YTV. It premiered on Cartoon Network on May 25, 2007. It started to air on YTV in September 2007. It started to air on Cartoon Network in the UK on August 6, 2007. In Poland, it started to air on Cartoon Network on November 10, 2007. Internationally, it first aired on ABC1 in Australia on February 26, 2008 and on Hero in the Philippines on March 12, 2008. The show also started airing in Singapore on okto, Bulgaria, Turkey, Portugal and Romania in 2008. Disney XD began airing the series on February 28, 2011.', 'Storm Hawks is an animated television series created by Asaph "Ace" Fipke and made by Nerd Corps Entertainment in conjunction and collaboration with Cartoon Network and YTV. It premiered on Cartoon Network on May 25, 2007. It started to air on YTV in September 2007. It started to air on Cartoon Network in the UK on August 6, 2007. In Poland, it started to air on Cartoon Network on November 10, 2007. Internationally, it first aired on ABC1 in Australia on February 26, 2008 and on Hero in the Philippines on March 12, 2008. The show also started airing in Singapore on okto, Bulgaria, Turkey, Portugal and Romania in 2008. Disney XD began airing the series on February 28, 2011.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3reKIGnsb686qHyi3hnoJnpvH8.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:6067'),
  ('309492948323113402', 'Storm of the Century', 1999, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Stephen King', null, 'Tim Daly, Colm Feore, Debrah Farentino, Jeffrey DeMunn, Julianne Nicholson, Becky Ann Baker, Spencer Breslin, Nada Despotovich', 'TV-14', 'When a blizzard hits an isolated island town it brings with it a mysterious stranger intent on terrorizing the people for a sinister purpose.', 'When a blizzard hits an isolated island town it brings with it a mysterious stranger intent on terrorizing the people for a sinister purpose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xFPh9zZickYu9AWqOcfUZBCIu14.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5028'),
  ('1102607555054934890', 'Storm Over Paradise', 2007, 'Drama', 'Caridad Bravo Adams', 'María Antonieta Gutiérrez, Ricardo Tejeda, Marcia del Río', 'Sara Maldonado, Erick Elías, Mariana Seoane, Alejandro Tommasi, Ursula Prats, Ingrid Martz, José Luis Reséndez, Manuel Ojeda', null, 'Tormenta en el Paraíso is a telenovela that was made by Televisa. This telenovela has a blend of new talents and with figures of extense experience in the television, and it began filming scenes in locations in the states of Quintana Roo and Veracruz on September 20, 2007. The telenovela is a production of Juan Osorio, premiered November 12 of 2007 in El Canal de las Estrellas.', 'Tormenta en el Paraíso is a telenovela that was made by Televisa. This telenovela has a blend of new talents and with figures of extense experience in the television, and it began filming scenes in locations in the states of Quintana Roo and Veracruz on September 20, 2007. The telenovela is a production of Juan Osorio, premiered November 12 of 2007 in El Canal de las Estrellas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGaEgeloGtoiNYYgyRMlEnEW58m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15354'),
