  ('572858652404158751', 'Story of Kunning Palace', 2023, 'Drama', 'Shi Jing', null, 'Bai Lu, Zhang Linghe, Wang Xingyue, Jacky Zhou, Liu Xiening, Elisa Ye, Tang Mengjia', null, 'A fallen queen, Jiang Xuening who aspired to have the highest power and authority in her life was held hostage by rebels after the king, Shen Jie was poisoned. In this life, she used everyone around her to reach the authority of the queen but in the end, she remained under house arrest and Xie Wei slaughtered the entire city. Later, she received the decree to be buried with the emperor. She got a second chance to change her fate by not entering the palace but when she woke up after rebirth, she was already messing around. Even though she vowed not to enter the palace, a certain turn of events again entangles her with the palace and Xie Wei whom she hated the most.', 'A fallen queen, Jiang Xuening who aspired to have the highest power and authority in her life was held hostage by rebels after the king, Shen Jie was poisoned. In this life, she used everyone around her to reach the authority of the queen but in the end, she remained under house arrest and Xie Wei slaughtered the entire city. Later, she received the decree to be buried with the emperor. She got a second chance to change her fate by not entering the palace but when she woke up after rebirth, she was already messing around. Even though she vowed not to enter the palace, a certain turn of events again entangles her with the palace and Xie Wei whom she hated the most.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hS7udvNJxgg9US5MoNq2fvkyR2X.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207197'),
  ('910644598005578497', 'Story of My Family!!!', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kankuro Kudo', 'Kankuro Kudo', 'Tomoya Nagase, Erika Toda, Toshiyuki Nishida, Kento Nagayama, Noriko Eguchi, Kenta Kiritani, Yoshiyoshi Arakawa, Shunsuke Michieda', null, 'An aging pro wrestler returns to fight for his inheritance when his father — a respected Noh actor — threatens to leave his fortune to his caregiver.', 'An aging pro wrestler returns to fight for his inheritance when his father — a respected Noh actor — threatens to leave his fortune to his caregiver.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sKYM0g7xzmy2DH68bsstUg2fRxy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117184'),
  ('1002558911007669994', 'Story of Yanxi Palace', 2018, 'Drama', 'Hui Kaidong, Wen Deguang', 'Zhou Mo', 'Wu Jinyan, Nie Yuan, Charmaine Sheh Sze-Man, Qin Lan, Xu Kai, Wang Yuanke, Tan Zhuo, Zhang Jiani', null, 'The smart and witty Wei Yingluo enters the palace as a seamstress to find the truth behind her older sister’s death. Believing the imperial guard Fucha Fuheng to be her sister''s killer, Yingluo purposely attracts the attention of his sister the Empress Fucha, and is successfully transferred to Changchun Palace as a maid. Over time, she learns that the Fucha siblings are honest and kind-hearted people, and also develops romantic affections for Fuheng.', 'The smart and witty Wei Yingluo enters the palace as a seamstress to find the truth behind her older sister’s death. Believing the imperial guard Fucha Fuheng to be her sister''s killer, Yingluo purposely attracts the attention of his sister the Empress Fucha, and is successfully transferred to Changchun Palace as a maid. Over time, she learns that the Fucha siblings are honest and kind-hearted people, and also develops romantic affections for Fuheng.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6eVxXSsyK6ukKzdgn9eNCAiLJ0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81133'),
  ('285014486772102162', 'StoryBots: Answer Time', 2022, 'Kids, Animation', 'Evan Spiridellis, Gregg Spiridellis', null, 'Judy Greer, Erin Fitzgerald, Fred Tatasciore, Jeff Gill, Gregg Spiridellis', 'TV-Y', 'Got a question? The StoryBots have an answer! Join curious friends Beep, Boop, Bing, Bang and Bo on fun adventures to find facts for real kids like you.', 'Got a question? The StoryBots have an answer! Join curious friends Beep, Boop, Bing, Bang and Bo on fun adventures to find facts for real kids like you.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ccMq0WNCvgq1GitFrBRbJ3BTzet.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:213573'),
  ('553479667107156497', 'Storyville', 1997, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'NR', 'Showcasing the best in international documentaries, Storyville has developed an enviable reputation since its inception more than a decade ago. Screening over 340 films, from some 70 different countries, the strand has garnered a staggering array of awards: five Oscars, 15 Griersons, three Peabodys and two International Emmys. In true, unique, Storyville style, the new series promises to deliver the strand''s usual eclectic mix of compelling stories from across the globe.', 'Showcasing the best in international documentaries, Storyville has developed an enviable reputation since its inception more than a decade ago. Screening over 340 films, from some 70 different countries, the strand has garnered a staggering array of awards: five Oscars, 15 Griersons, three Peabodys and two International Emmys. In true, unique, Storyville style, the new series promises to deliver the strand''s usual eclectic mix of compelling stories from across the globe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLOvaj0zL70g2rxctAnLO3kMw0W.jpg', 30, 'tmdb:tv:36695'),
  ('471877156948446816', 'Stove League', 2019, 'Drama', null, 'Lee Shin-hwa', 'Namkoong Min, Park Eun-bin, Oh Jung-se, Cho Byeong-kyu, Yoon Byung-hee, Lee Jun-hyeok, Kim Kang-min, Kim Do-hyun', 'TV-14', 'Se Young is the youngest head of the management team of Dreams, a cellar-dwelling baseball team. She''s highly recognized for her perseverance and intense passion for the team. One day, Seung Su is appointed as a general manager. Although he''s been working in the sports field, the teams he led to the championship were unpopular, and some of them were even disbanded after winning the league due to the financial difficulties of their parent companies. Would this unlucky new general manager be able to steer Dreams to the championship with passionate Se Young?', 'Se Young is the youngest head of the management team of Dreams, a cellar-dwelling baseball team. She''s highly recognized for her perseverance and intense passion for the team. One day, Seung Su is appointed as a general manager. Although he''s been working in the sports field, the teams he led to the championship were unpopular, and some of them were even disbanded after winning the league due to the financial difficulties of their parent companies. Would this unlucky new general manager be able to steer Dreams to the championship with passionate Se Young?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6C69xR1hMM66pZmlEAKeIDXpssh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95484'),
