  ('711843425232392268', 'Strange Tales of Tang Dynasty', 2022, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Wei Fenghua', 'Guo Jingyu, Wei Fenghua', 'Yang Zhigang, Yang Xuwen, Gao Siwen, Chen Chuang, Sun Xuening, Yue Lina', 'TV-PG', 'General Lu Lingfeng and Detective Su Wuming uncover supernatural mysteries and hidden conspiracies threatening the empire during Emperor Xuanzong’s reign.', 'General Lu Lingfeng and Detective Su Wuming uncover supernatural mysteries and hidden conspiracies threatening the empire during Emperor Xuanzong’s reign.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nyhBueT07zQS7wWLYFDNO8LdO3N.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:211089'),
  ('172267841092022932', 'Stranger', 2017, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Lee Su-yeon, An Gil-ho, Yu Je-won', null, 'Cho Seung-woo, Bae Doona, Lee Jun-hyuk, Jeon Hye-jin, Choi Moo-seong, Yoon Se-a, Park Seong-geun, Jeon Bae-soo', 'TV-MA', 'Hwang Shi Mok underwent brain surgery as a child to curb his violent temper, which left him devoid of emotions. Hwang becomes a prosecutor known for his piercing intelligence and logic, but he is ostracized because he lacks empathy and social skills. He is also one of only a handful of upright prosecutors who have refused to take bribes. One day, he encounters a stabbing victim while investigating corruption. He meets Lieutenant Han Yeo Jin at the crime scene. They join forces to root out corruption at the prosecutors’ office and solve a serial murder case.', 'Hwang Shi Mok underwent brain surgery as a child to curb his violent temper, which left him devoid of emotions. Hwang becomes a prosecutor known for his piercing intelligence and logic, but he is ostracized because he lacks empathy and social skills. He is also one of only a handful of upright prosecutors who have refused to take bribes. One day, he encounters a stabbing victim while investigating corruption. He meets Lieutenant Han Yeo Jin at the crime scene. They join forces to root out corruption at the prosecutors’ office and solve a serial murder case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/blbbtx7DyvZ3JTGyc9MCArDL79b.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:70626'),
  ('349427339777971464', 'Stranger Things', 2016, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Ross Duffer, Matt Duffer', null, 'Winona Ryder, David Harbour, Millie Bobby Brown, Finn Wolfhard, Gaten Matarazzo, Caleb McLaughlin, Noah Schnapp, Sadie Sink', 'TV-14', 'When a young boy vanishes, a small town uncovers a mystery involving secret experiments, terrifying supernatural forces, and one strange little girl.', 'When a young boy vanishes, a small town uncovers a mystery involving secret experiments, terrifying supernatural forces, and one strange little girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uOOtwVbSr4QDjAGIifLDwpb2Pdl.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:66732'),
  ('765726648222784710', 'Strangers', 1978, 'Crime, Drama', 'Murray Smith', null, 'Don Henderson, Dennis Blanch, Fiona Mollison, Mark McManus', null, 'Strangers is a 1978–82 ITV police procedural created and principally written by Murray Smith, based on characters created by Kenneth Royce in his novel series and subsequent 1977–78 television adaptation The XYY Man. Don Henderson and Dennis Blanch reprise their roles, respectively, of Detective Sergeant (DS) George Bulman and Detective Constable (DC) Derek Willis. A group of police officers are brought together from across the country to the north of England. There, the fact that they''re not well-known gives them the advantage to infiltrate where a more familiar local detective could not. Despite being based around a comparatively small team of detectives, a regular feature in its early years is that few episodes feature the entire team, with most using just two or three regulars in any major role.', 'Strangers is a 1978–82 ITV police procedural created and principally written by Murray Smith, based on characters created by Kenneth Royce in his novel series and subsequent 1977–78 television adaptation The XYY Man. Don Henderson and Dennis Blanch reprise their roles, respectively, of Detective Sergeant (DS) George Bulman and Detective Constable (DC) Derek Willis. A group of police officers are brought together from across the country to the north of England. There, the fact that they''re not well-known gives them the advantage to infiltrate where a more familiar local detective could not. Despite being based around a comparatively small team of detectives, a regular feature in its early years is that few episodes feature the entire team, with most using just two or three regulars in any major role.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qcn0luhISlkNy8Iil9WZvwMFGp6.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:934'),
  ('78309581533691502', 'Strangers', 2018, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Mark Denton, Jonny Stockwood', 'Harry Williams, Jack Williams', 'John Simm, Anthony Hayes, Tom Wu, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Thomas Chaanhing, Katie Leung', 'TV-MA', 'A sheltered London professor attempts to uncover the cause of his wife’s mysterious death in Hong Kong, traveling there after discovering she died in a car accident on the mountain roads of Tai Po.', 'A sheltered London professor attempts to uncover the cause of his wife’s mysterious death in Hong Kong, traveling there after discovering she died in a car accident on the mountain roads of Tai Po.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yw0XGZXcKi5bb45FMDDwPZ2RAUq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82183'),
  ('580444942653446975', 'Strangers Again', 2023, 'Drama', 'Jang Young-mo, Park Min-seol', null, 'Kang So-ra, Jang Seung-jo, Lee Jae-won, Cho Eun-ji, Moo Jin-sung, Kil Hae-yeon, Kim Ji-su', null, 'It follows an ex-married couple who are both lawyers that specialize in divorce. They find themselves working together as colleagues dealing with cases related to divorce and relationships.', 'It follows an ex-married couple who are both lawyers that specialize in divorce. They find themselves working together as colleagues dealing with cases related to divorce and relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yGAXxkAa1XFCA9PF5y8R9iNxC04.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213655'),
  ('892361795752435474', 'Strangers from Hell', 2019, 'Mystery, Drama', null, 'Jung Yi-do', 'Yim Si-wan, Lee Dong-wook, Lee Hyun-wook, Park Jong-hwan, Ro Jong-hyun, Lee Jung-eun, Kim Ji-eun, Ahn Eun-jin', 'TV-MA', 'Unpleasant events disturb the life of an aspiring crime fiction writer when he becomes a resident of an apartment building teeming with shady neighbors.', 'Unpleasant events disturb the life of an aspiring crime fiction writer when he becomes a resident of an apartment building teeming with shady neighbors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o66rEzPzZZWxSrcus2f46CedHhq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89959'),
  ('906759599246612897', 'Strangers with Candy', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Stephen Colbert, Mitch Rouse, Amy Sedaris', null, 'Amy Sedaris, Paul Dinello, Stephen Colbert, Greg Hollimon', null, 'Jerri Blank is a former prostitute and junkie whore who returns to high school as a 46-year-old freshman at Flatpoint High. Jerri ran away from home and became ''a boozer, a user, and a loser'' after dropping out as a teenager, supporting her drug habits through prostitution, stripping, and larceny. She has been to prison several times, the last time because she ''stole the TV''. At home, Jerri''s father Guy is comatose, although he seems perfectly capable of amazing feats. Her stepmother Sara is vain and bitter, and stepbrother Derrick is a bullying jock. Jerri tries to do things the right way but always ends up learning the wrong lesson. Her hijinks often involve, either directly or indirectly, neurotic history teacher Chuck Noblet and his secret lover, sensitive art teacher Geoffrey Jellineck.', 'Jerri Blank is a former prostitute and junkie whore who returns to high school as a 46-year-old freshman at Flatpoint High. Jerri ran away from home and became ''a boozer, a user, and a loser'' after dropping out as a teenager, supporting her drug habits through prostitution, stripping, and larceny. She has been to prison several times, the last time because she ''stole the TV''. At home, Jerri''s father Guy is comatose, although he seems perfectly capable of amazing feats. Her stepmother Sara is vain and bitter, and stepbrother Derrick is a bullying jock. Jerri tries to do things the right way but always ends up learning the wrong lesson. Her hijinks often involve, either directly or indirectly, neurotic history teacher Chuck Noblet and his secret lover, sensitive art teacher Geoffrey Jellineck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYQ9ugFYIj5zoIplo79YHf7v9Ed.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1912'),
  ('603293297414705635', 'Strangled', 2020, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Péter Bárnai, Zsolt Anger, Zsolt Trill, Mónika Balsai, Zsófia Szamosi, Károly Hajduk, Gábor Jászberényi', null, 'In 1960s socialist Hungary, a serial killer targeting young women torments a small town and the determined detective on his trail. Based on true events.', 'In 1960s socialist Hungary, a serial killer targeting young women torments a small town and the determined detective on his trail. Based on true events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLPUEgHEcLvOwbuyA2H3mdPSqMP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106937'),
  ('1111922705577424106', 'Strategist KANBE', 2014, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, 'Yoichi Maekawa, Ichirō Anabuki', 'Junichi Okada, Yosuke Eguchi, Miki Nakatani, Kirato Wakayama, Hitomi Kuroki, Yanagishita Tomo, Shozo Uesugi, Kisuke Iida', null, 'July 1590, Odawara. Toyotomi Hideyoshi''s army had surrounded the Odawara Castle for over 3 months, hoping to conquer this last obstacle to his dream of the country''s unification. Standing at the gate of the castle, a lone man facing the menacing guards shouted out: "Do not throw your lives away. Treasure living!". Not long after, the castle gates opened and the reigning lord surrendered. The name of that man is Kuroda Kanbee. An excellent military strategist, he worked hand-in-hand with Hideyoshi to unify the country.', 'July 1590, Odawara. Toyotomi Hideyoshi''s army had surrounded the Odawara Castle for over 3 months, hoping to conquer this last obstacle to his dream of the country''s unification. Standing at the gate of the castle, a lone man facing the menacing guards shouted out: "Do not throw your lives away. Treasure living!". Not long after, the castle gates opened and the reigning lord surrendered. The name of that man is Kuroda Kanbee. An excellent military strategist, he worked hand-in-hand with Hideyoshi to unify the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1zuQsomE0Op76BsMCyNeK3OobzP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65968'),
  ('1016768943726378398', 'Strawberries with Sugar', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy, Soap', 'Casa da Criação', null, 'Filipa Areosa, Luís Garcia, Tiago Costa, Marta Andrino, Carla Salgueiro, Inês Costa, Francisco Arraiol, Rui Santos', null, 'Morangos com Açúcar was a Portuguese Teen drama. It was broadcast daily on the Portuguese TV station TVI between 30 August 2003 to 15 September 2012. It has also been broadcast in Angola, Syria, Brazil and Romania.', 'Morangos com Açúcar was a Portuguese Teen drama. It was broadcast daily on the Portuguese TV station TVI between 30 August 2003 to 15 September 2012. It has also been broadcast in Angola, Syria, Brazil and Romania.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uyzx0JkWOOF3Mfcq4uiuIr2Ykju.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:308'),
  ('768426596260841785', 'Strawberry 100%', 2005, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Mizuki Kawashita', 'Mizuki Kawashita', 'Kenichi Suzumura, Mamiko Noto, Sanae Kobayashi, Nana Mizuki, Megumi Toyoguchi, Takashi Kondo, Wataru Takagi, Mitsuki Saiga', null, 'One day Junpei Manaka catches a glimpse of a beautiful girl... and her strawberry-print panties. For the first time in Junpei''s life, he notices the opposite sex. It also helps that the mystery girl left behind a notebook, filled with a story that Junpei can''t put down. Obsessed with this mystery girl, he isn''t sure where to turn... shy bookworm Aya Tojo, whose name is in the notebook, or confident school beauty Tsukasa Nishino, who outright told him she was wearing strawberry-print panties.', 'One day Junpei Manaka catches a glimpse of a beautiful girl... and her strawberry-print panties. For the first time in Junpei''s life, he notices the opposite sex. It also helps that the mystery girl left behind a notebook, filled with a story that Junpei can''t put down. Obsessed with this mystery girl, he isn''t sure where to turn... shy bookworm Aya Tojo, whose name is in the notebook, or confident school beauty Tsukasa Nishino, who outright told him she was wearing strawberry-print panties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4KiyjGANlyMqnbB4CmAGHN2Ph0e.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42873'),
  ('527871322213383295', 'Strawberry Marshmallow', 2005, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Fumiko Orikasa, Ayako Kawasumi, Mamiko Noto, Hitomi Nabatame, Saeko Chiba, Junko Minagawa, Takayuki Kondo', 'TV-PG', 'Everyday things make up the fabric of life—whether it''s making friends, going to school, trying to make money, or celebrating a holiday. Ichigo Mashimaro is a heartwarming series that follows the daily lives of Chika Itoh, her sister Nobue, and her friends Miu, Matsuri, and Ana.', 'Everyday things make up the fabric of life—whether it''s making friends, going to school, trying to make money, or celebrating a holiday. Ichigo Mashimaro is a heartwarming series that follows the daily lives of Chika Itoh, her sister Nobue, and her friends Miu, Matsuri, and Ana.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcb6GPHQGWQNCbL338TOOlnmTrI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35730'),
  ('254605992210178839', 'Strawberry Night', 2012, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Tetsuya Honda', null, 'Yuko Takeuchi, Hidetoshi Nishijima, Keisuke Koide, Takashi Ukaji, Katsuhisa Namase, Ryuhei Maruyama, Masahiko Tsugawa, Ikkei Watanabe', null, 'Reiko Himekawa is a female detective at the Metropolitan Police Department. Reiko doesn''t come from an elite background, but she has risen fast through the ranks with hard work and gain the respect of the policeman.', 'Reiko Himekawa is a female detective at the Metropolitan Police Department. Reiko doesn''t come from an elite background, but she has risen fast through the ranks with hard work and gain the respect of the policeman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hEmkdb6FTz0AVgwdhZ1cKqrgiEs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65501'),
  ('948486074926175837', 'Strawberry Panic', 2006, 'Animation, Drama', null, 'Tatsuhiko Urahata', 'Ai Shimizu, Hitomi Nabatame, Mai Nakahara, Junko Noda, Chiwa Saito, Yokote Kumiko, Kotomi Iwamura, Miyu Matsuki', null, 'Nagisa Aoi is a new transfer student into one of the three prestigious all-girls Catholic high schools on Astraea Hill: a school called St. Miator (the other two are St. Spica and St. Lelim (known in the anime as Le Rim, for some reason). While getting totally lost on her first day, she stumbles into a clearing with a tree, and also into a girl with long silver hair. Nagisa is immediately smitten with the girl, Shizuma Hanazono, otherwise known as the Etoile of the three schools (the most idolized girl). Shizuma, after picking up a figurine dropped by Nagisa, kisses her on the forehead, leading to Nagisa fainting. After waking up in the school''s infirmary, Nagisa then meets her new roommate, Tamao Suzumi. Things, however, will be getting a lot more complicated for the new student than just that.', 'Nagisa Aoi is a new transfer student into one of the three prestigious all-girls Catholic high schools on Astraea Hill: a school called St. Miator (the other two are St. Spica and St. Lelim (known in the anime as Le Rim, for some reason). While getting totally lost on her first day, she stumbles into a clearing with a tree, and also into a girl with long silver hair. Nagisa is immediately smitten with the girl, Shizuma Hanazono, otherwise known as the Etoile of the three schools (the most idolized girl). Shizuma, after picking up a figurine dropped by Nagisa, kisses her on the forehead, leading to Nagisa fainting. After waking up in the school''s infirmary, Nagisa then meets her new roommate, Tamao Suzumi. Things, however, will be getting a lot more complicated for the new student than just that.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hANg0nAu0Oe8e1e7cU6989Rzqtz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:36157'),
  ('493005903533517930', 'Strawberry Shortcake', 2003, 'Animation, Kids', 'Muriel Fahrion', null, 'Sarah Heinke, Rachel Ware, Anna Jordan, Samantha Triba, James Street, DeJare Barfield, Nils Haaland', 'TV-Y', 'Strawberry and her friends, including her sister, Apple Dumplin'', and her pony, Honey Pie, embark on sweet-smelling adventures in Strawberryland.', 'Strawberry and her friends, including her sister, Apple Dumplin'', and her pony, Honey Pie, embark on sweet-smelling adventures in Strawberryland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/744dPrpzK89x5H4AbFMMv0aKEgF.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:16033'),
  ('287182873906653494', 'Strawberry Shortcake: Berry in the Big City', 2021, 'Animation, Kids', null, null, 'Bahia Watson, Andrea Libman, Margarita Valderrama, Tabitha St. Germain, Vincent Tong, Alexandra Jennifer "Alex" Teran', null, 'Aspiring baker Strawberry Shortcake arrives in Big Apple City to get her big break — and have flan-tastic adventures with her new berry besties!', 'Aspiring baker Strawberry Shortcake arrives in Big Apple City to get her big break — and have flan-tastic adventures with her new berry besties!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8skssG3StzcAESCZTns2sqvdPXN.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:197322'),
  ('556832958589070514', 'Strawberry Shortcake''s Berry Bitty Adventures', 2010, 'Animation, Family, Kids, Comedy', null, null, 'Anna Cummer, Rebecca Shoichet, Andrea Libman, Janyse Jaud, Ashleigh Ball, Britt McKillip, Ingrid Nilson, Shannon Chan-Kent', 'TV-Y', 'Welcome to Berry Bitty City, a berry special little world under the leaves of a berry patch. It may be small, but Berry Bitty City is big on fun and adventure. It''s where Strawberry Shortcake and all her friends live. Together, they prove that little girls can do berry big things. There''s always something fun to do, and when someone needs help, her friends are always there to lend a hand.', 'Welcome to Berry Bitty City, a berry special little world under the leaves of a berry patch. It may be small, but Berry Bitty City is big on fun and adventure. It''s where Strawberry Shortcake and all her friends live. Together, they prove that little girls can do berry big things. There''s always something fun to do, and when someone needs help, her friends are always there to lend a hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xweEe66HXnW5LAGanucy5ZOL6fu.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:33835'),
  ('270586278059686437', 'Stray Birds', 2021, 'Drama', null, null, 'Xu Lu, Gao Zhiting, Wen Sheng, Wu Yue, Gardner Tse Kwan-Ho, Anson Qiu, Lin Jing, Cheng Zi', null, 'A youth inspirational drama about the struggles, love, life, and friendship among a group of rich and passionate young adults who try their best to change the pejorative label they''ve been given by China''s society (rich second generation) into a positive one (new second generation). Graduate student Wu Yue, rich second-generation Lin Shaoting and Su Xiao Man participated in a large scale job fair and won NBI (IT company)''s internship qualification. Entering workplace, they face many challenges in a competitive environment and complex interpersonal relationships. As they work to prove their abilities, they also face pressure and test of love and friendship.', 'A youth inspirational drama about the struggles, love, life, and friendship among a group of rich and passionate young adults who try their best to change the pejorative label they''ve been given by China''s society (rich second generation) into a positive one (new second generation). Graduate student Wu Yue, rich second-generation Lin Shaoting and Su Xiao Man participated in a large scale job fair and won NBI (IT company)''s internship qualification. Entering workplace, they face many challenges in a competitive environment and complex interpersonal relationships. As they work to prove their abilities, they also face pressure and test of love and friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRJHlGJtsTwezBMJkrQPpa26JPm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:126899'),
  ('304368407924586266', 'Stray Cats Overrun!', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Nobuhiko Okamoto, Kanae Itou, Ayana Taketatsu, Yuka Iguchi, Satomi Sato, Yui Horie, Hiroyuki Yoshino, Junji Majima', null, 'Takumi lives with his older adoptive sister Otome, she manages a confectionery store called Stray Cats. One day, Otome finds a mysterious girl on the street.', 'Takumi lives with his older adoptive sister Otome, she manages a confectionery store called Stray Cats. One day, Otome finds a mysterious girl on the street.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1HXPYehIZIccOZAGfvjlAizwJ1f.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46000'),
  ('612152760972426159', 'Street Fighter', 1995, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids', null, null, 'Michael Donovan, Donna Yamamoto, Lisa Ann Beley, Tong Lung, Scott McNeil, Richard Newman, Michael Dobson, Robert O. Smith', 'TV-Y7', 'A new challenger approaches in Street Fighter II: The Animated Series! Discipline! Justice! Commitment! That''s the code that the secret international peacekeeping force "Street Fighter" adheres to! Made up of the top martial artists from around the world, Street Fighter opposes criminal activities anywhere, at any time. William F. Guile, the leader of Street Fighter, conducts himself with honor even as he blows away bad guys at the speed of sound with his "Sonic Boom"! Meanwhile, the bestial Blanka shocks his opponents all too literally, and Chun-Li''s furiously flying fleet feet take down anything that gets between her and justice! They''ll need all the help they can get against the villainous Shadaloo, whose leader M.Bison is one of the strongest, most vile criminals around! Fortunately for Street Fighter, they''ve got Ryu and Ken to back them up.', 'A new challenger approaches in Street Fighter II: The Animated Series! Discipline! Justice! Commitment! That''s the code that the secret international peacekeeping force "Street Fighter" adheres to! Made up of the top martial artists from around the world, Street Fighter opposes criminal activities anywhere, at any time. William F. Guile, the leader of Street Fighter, conducts himself with honor even as he blows away bad guys at the speed of sound with his "Sonic Boom"! Meanwhile, the bestial Blanka shocks his opponents all too literally, and Chun-Li''s furiously flying fleet feet take down anything that gets between her and justice! They''ll need all the help they can get against the villainous Shadaloo, whose leader M.Bison is one of the strongest, most vile criminals around! Fortunately for Street Fighter, they''ve got Ryu and Ken to back them up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xM0ZzCUyX5H5slMD5jKATaEBuzQ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:13655'),
  ('585645905624356040', 'Street Fighter II: V', 1995, 'Animation', 'Gisaburō Sugii', null, 'Chisa Yokoyama, Kenji Utsumi, Koji Tsujitani, Kenji Haga, Tessyo Genda, Rokuro Naya, Kazuki Yao, Banjo Ginga', 'TV-14', 'Ryu and Ken travel the world to become better fighters and learn new techniques. During their journey, they find themselves caught up in a conspiracy of the mysterious Shadowlaw.', 'Ryu and Ken travel the world to become better fighters and learn new techniques. During their journey, they find themselves caught up in a conspiracy of the mysterious Shadowlaw.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jwhr0Cttec7FgDDZqz19EIqNETK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31713'),
  ('475089564313916742', 'Street Fighter: Assassin''s Fist', 2014, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Joey Ansah, Christian Howard', 'Christian Howard, Joey Ansah', 'Christian Howard, Mike Moh, Akira Koieyama, Togo Igawa, Hyunri, Shogen, Gaku Space, Hal Yamanouchi', null, 'A multi-layered series that looks back to the formative years of Ryu and Ken as they live a traditional warrior''s life in secluded Japan.', 'A multi-layered series that looks back to the formative years of Ryu and Ken as they live a traditional warrior''s life in secluded Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qrk8cVHgQZoq3Lo4BdqlWaHV8m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61873'),
  ('238219842025016420', 'Street Fighters', 2000, null, null, '劉彩雲, Szeto Kam-Yuen, Andrew Fung Chih-Chiang', 'Hacken Lee, Edmond Leung Hon-Man, Michelle Ye Xuan, Gigi Wong, Margaret Chung, Jerry Lamb Hiu-Fung, Simon Man Kit Lo, Rain Lau Yuk-Chui', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qGAWnzwJgQiWId0IdRGxiHe9oRU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108238'),
  ('925066031643724607', 'Street Food: Asia', 2019, 'Documentary', 'David Gelb, Brian McGinn', null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Embark on a global cultural journey into street food and discover the stories of the people who create the flavorful dishes.', 'Embark on a global cultural journey into street food and discover the stories of the people who create the flavorful dishes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/utarEk1Z5w1uoRiBqAwXKhF5pQy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87832'),
  ('987976093053306095', 'Street Food: Latin America', 2020, 'Documentary', 'David Gelb, Brian McGinn', null, null, 'TV-PG', 'In this vibrant docuseries, Latin American chefs tell their stories and bring a taste of tradition and innovation to their delicious offerings.', 'In this vibrant docuseries, Latin American chefs tell their stories and bring a taste of tradition and innovation to their delicious offerings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zuM2AUIlFn4S2TfZ0oKKEIwcNGT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105488'),
  ('561204139975569017', 'Street Food: USA', 2022, 'Documentary', 'David Gelb, Brian McGinn', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Get a taste of the most beloved bites on American streets and, along the way, discover the heart, soul and wildly diverse real people behind the food.', 'Get a taste of the most beloved bites on American streets and, along the way, discover the heart, soul and wildly diverse real people behind the food.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3JS63O9pojbk93V0p29i39iNywE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:205857'),
  ('832384620515224826', 'Street Football', 2005, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy', 'Marco Beretta, Serge Rosenzweig', null, null, 'NR', 'Tag and his friends live for one thing: Street Football! They meet every day to play in the street. Thanks to this passion that goes beyond the sports fields, they find the strength to face their everyday problems.', 'Tag and his friends live for one thing: Street Football! They meet every day to play in the street. Thanks to this passion that goes beyond the sports fields, they find the strength to face their everyday problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQMulfPHPpi7GCvw0z8Q1tAGWyP.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:65141'),
  ('746363792565755521', 'Street Hawk', 1985, 'Action & Adventure, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Paul M. Belous, Robert Wolterstorff, Bruce Lansbury', null, 'Rex Smith, Joe Regalbuto, Richard Venture, Jeannie Wilson, Ernie Anderson', 'TV-PG', 'Street Hawk is an American television series that aired for 13 episodes on ABC in 1985. The series is a Limekiln and Templar Production in association with Universal Television. Its central characters were created by Paul M. Belous and Robert "Bob" Wolterstorff, and its core format was developed by Bruce Lansbury, who had initially commissioned the program''s creation. This series was originally planned for the fall of 1984, Mondays at 8:00PM Eastern/7:00PM Central. However, ABC executives changed their minds when the summer series Call to Glory did well, and Street Hawk was pushed to mid-season. Street Hawk made its debut on January 4, 1985 on ABC at 9:00PM Eastern/8:00PM Central and ran until May 16, 1985. Reruns aired on the USA Network on Saturdays at 10:00AM from 1990-91.', 'Street Hawk is an American television series that aired for 13 episodes on ABC in 1985. The series is a Limekiln and Templar Production in association with Universal Television. Its central characters were created by Paul M. Belous and Robert "Bob" Wolterstorff, and its core format was developed by Bruce Lansbury, who had initially commissioned the program''s creation. This series was originally planned for the fall of 1984, Mondays at 8:00PM Eastern/7:00PM Central. However, ABC executives changed their minds when the summer series Call to Glory did well, and Street Hawk was pushed to mid-season. Street Hawk made its debut on January 4, 1985 on ABC at 9:00PM Eastern/8:00PM Central and ran until May 16, 1985. Reruns aired on the USA Network on Saturdays at 10:00AM from 1990-91.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3bajIlqFrqcd4aztq8E2Dcouur.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3318'),
  ('1132111358187740114', 'Street Legal', 1987, 'Drama', null, null, 'Eric Peterson, Cynthia Dale, Julie Khaner, Sonja Smits, Albert Schultz, David James Elliott, Ron Lea, Cara Ricketts', null, 'The professional and private lives of a group of young, aggressive attorneys in partnership together in a small downtown Toronto law firm. However they do not necessarily always see eye to eye on things.', 'The professional and private lives of a group of young, aggressive attorneys in partnership together in a small downtown Toronto law firm. However they do not necessarily always see eye to eye on things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bp2g4RXbZTYoEs93ObPVLnngO3i.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:12400'),
  ('169548970893606298', 'Street Outlaws', 2013, 'Reality', null, null, 'James Love, Jeff Lutz, Sean Whitley, Chris Dave, Justin Shearer, Jerry Johnston, Ryan Martin, David Comstock', 'TV-14', 'From a 1969 Chevy Nova to a race-ready farm truck, the vehicles - and their drivers - come in all shapes and sizes and have one thing in common: the need for speed. But according to the STREET OUTLAWS of Oklahoma City - home to one of the largest undercover street racing rings in America – if you’re not on “the list,” you don’t matter. The “list” contains the 10 fastest street-racing cars in Oklahoma City and they are the best of the best. Not only will these guys will do anything -ANYTHING- to get ranked on this list, they’ll do whatever it takes to STAY ranked. Street racing comes first - before family, before friends and before work. The stakes are high and these drivers will put everything on the line to get to top, where there can only be one #1.', 'From a 1969 Chevy Nova to a race-ready farm truck, the vehicles - and their drivers - come in all shapes and sizes and have one thing in common: the need for speed. But according to the STREET OUTLAWS of Oklahoma City - home to one of the largest undercover street racing rings in America – if you’re not on “the list,” you don’t matter. The “list” contains the 10 fastest street-racing cars in Oklahoma City and they are the best of the best. Not only will these guys will do anything -ANYTHING- to get ranked on this list, they’ll do whatever it takes to STAY ranked. Street racing comes first - before family, before friends and before work. The stakes are high and these drivers will put everything on the line to get to top, where there can only be one #1.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQXmhjhmqdArArpnubmtm20d0zX.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:61019'),
  ('861767715279087485', 'Street Sharks', 1994, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Martha Moran, Phil Harnage', null, 'Lee Tockar, Matt Hill, Andrew Rannells, D. Kevin Williams, Jim Hoggatt, John Michael Lee', 'TV-Y7', 'Gene-slammed by an evil genius, four young brothers fight for honor and goodness. They are street smart, street tough...STREET SHARKS!', 'Gene-slammed by an evil genius, four young brothers fight for honor and goodness. They are street smart, street tough...STREET SHARKS!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zbTgkwLXELZSeZZkEpDCv7ETIcL.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:12544'),
  ('834955236231619052', 'Street Time', 2002, 'Drama', null, null, 'Rob Morrow, Michelle Nolden, Terrence Howard', null, 'Follows a fair parole officer and his parolee who wants to go straight but his former business associates are after him.', 'Follows a fair parole officer and his parolee who wants to go straight but his former business associates are after him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQLfv5GdLfgT7O0Xez5G05yOW8A.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:24311'),
  ('70213788258746784', 'Street Woman Fighter', 2021, 'Reality', 'Choi Jung-nam', null, 'Sung Hanbin, Monika, Honey J, Lip J, Aiki, Rihey, Hyojin Choi, Gabee', null, 'The fierce women armed with stunning street dance take over the stage this summer. The unceasing battles between the real dancers will make you hold your breath. They boast their unique dance styles, skilled performance, and a highly competitive spirit. Eight dance crews get together on the fight stage and compete in the battles. In the fight zone, which crew will be the final winner to take the championship?', 'The fierce women armed with stunning street dance take over the stage this summer. The unceasing battles between the real dancers will make you hold your breath. They boast their unique dance styles, skilled performance, and a highly competitive spirit. Eight dance crews get together on the fight stage and compete in the battles. In the fight zone, which crew will be the final winner to take the championship?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6sYtJUrl2821oRzhhjXpJ3RXVQ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:130347'),
  ('372743412740150238', 'Streets of Broken Lights', 1998, 'Mystery, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Aleksandr Polovtsev, Oleg Andreev, Mikhail Luchko, Aleksandr Nesterov, Elena Kuprashevich, Boris Cherdyntsev', null, 'Russian detectives unwind the ball of the most intricate and cruel crimes. They are consummate professionals, the best cops in town. Even on the most dangerous missions, this quartet never loses their sense of humor. It is it that helps them find the most incredible ways out of any situation. They uphold the law and emerge victorious.', 'Russian detectives unwind the ball of the most intricate and cruel crimes. They are consummate professionals, the best cops in town. Even on the most dangerous missions, this quartet never loses their sense of humor. It is it that helps them find the most incredible ways out of any situation. They uphold the law and emerge victorious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/szNH2weSSwKndvpD06qGcp06Bb8.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:45937'),
  ('712374854376264075', 'Streets of Laredo', 1995, 'Western, Drama', 'Larry McMurtry', null, 'James Garner, Sissy Spacek, Sam Shepard, Ned Beatty, Randy Quaid, Wes Studi, Charles Martin Smith, George Carlin', 'TV-14', 'Captain Woodrow Call, now retired from the Rangers, is a bounty hunter. He is hired by an eastern rail baron to track down Joey Garza, a new kind of killer, only a boy, who kills from a distance with a rifle.', 'Captain Woodrow Call, now retired from the Rangers, is a bounty hunter. He is hired by an eastern rail baron to track down Joey Garza, a new kind of killer, only a boy, who kills from a distance with a rifle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wkVIi2dRyeEEnMpBTcCIiO5IK33.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45270'),
  ('48388728284104537', 'Strictly Come Dancing', 2004, 'Reality', 'Fenia Vardanis, Richard Hopkins, Karen Smith', null, 'Claudia Winkleman, Tess Daly, Anton du Beke, Craig Revel Horwood, Motsi Mabuse, Shirley Ballas', null, 'A dance competition where celebrities compete to be crowned the winner. Who is kicked out of the competition each week is decided by the judges scores and viewer votes. Are today''s celebrities fleet of foot or do they have two left feet?', 'A dance competition where celebrities compete to be crowned the winner. Who is kicked out of the competition each week is decided by the judges scores and viewer votes. Are today''s celebrities fleet of foot or do they have two left feet?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uu7VGiQzhBDjH6oh85QWa8Z5qXY.jpg', 23, 'tmdb:tv:1711'),
  ('152241645813308912', 'Strictly Come Dancing: It Takes Two', 2004, null, null, null, 'Janette Manrara, Fleur East', 'NR', 'The companion show to the popular BBC One programme Strictly Come Dancing which features interviews and training footage of the couples competing in the main Saturday night show, opinions from the judges on the previous Saturday show and the training footage for the next, and interviews with celebrities who have been watching the show.', 'The companion show to the popular BBC One programme Strictly Come Dancing which features interviews and training footage of the couples competing in the main Saturday night show, opinions from the judges on the previous Saturday show and the training footage for the next, and interviews with celebrities who have been watching the show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1YbT9GtnHlfRhmUNecM9rOBxAaw.jpg', 22, 'tmdb:tv:4682'),
  ('392788059434812508', 'Strictly Sexual The Series', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Joel Viertel', null, 'Johann Urb, Stevie Long, Mercedes Manning, Kristen Renton', 'TV-MA', 'Joe and Stanny are two likable losers who are unlucky in love, but lucky with sex. Summer and Georgia are two girls who make a deal to swear off dating to focus on their careers and keep things strictly sexual. One girl starts dating another girl to avoid falling in love, while Georgia starts having sex with Stanny, knowing she could never fall for him. To everyones surprise, real feelings arise, causing the drama and heartache everyone was trying to avoid. The show addresses the entanglements of love and sex. This is a spinoff of the hit indie film of the same name, directed by Independent Spirit Award winner Joel Viertel, and written and starring Stevie Long.', 'Joe and Stanny are two likable losers who are unlucky in love, but lucky with sex. Summer and Georgia are two girls who make a deal to swear off dating to focus on their careers and keep things strictly sexual. One girl starts dating another girl to avoid falling in love, while Georgia starts having sex with Stanny, knowing she could never fall for him. To everyones surprise, real feelings arise, causing the drama and heartache everyone was trying to avoid. The show addresses the entanglements of love and sex. This is a spinoff of the hit indie film of the same name, directed by Independent Spirit Award winner Joel Viertel, and written and starring Stevie Long.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1I4KLhTan73xet1ZVakf3IwbbPu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64298'),
  ('441897462045940216', 'Strike', 2017, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'J.K. Rowling, Ben Richards, Tom Edge', 'J.K. Rowling', 'Tom Burke, Holliday Grainger, Jack Greenlees, Ruth Sheen, Emma Fielding, Stephen Hagan', 'TV-MA', 'A war veteran turned private detective operates out of a tiny office in London’s Denmark Street. Although wounded both physically and psychologically, his unique insight and background as a military police investigator prove crucial in solving complex crimes that have baffled the police. Based on the bestselling novels written by J.K. Rowling under the pseudonym Robert Galbraith.', 'A war veteran turned private detective operates out of a tiny office in London’s Denmark Street. Although wounded both physically and psychologically, his unique insight and background as a military police investigator prove crucial in solving complex crimes that have baffled the police. Based on the bestselling novels written by J.K. Rowling under the pseudonym Robert Galbraith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPTJfwuMLz6Lr3suGK4584MAJAC.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:72748'),
  ('855362099257684370', 'Strike Back', 2010, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Jed Mercurio, Marigo Kehoe', null, 'Warren Brown, Daniel MacPherson, Alin Sumarwata, Jamie Bamber, Thulasizwe Kubheka', 'TV-MA', 'The series follows John Porter, a former British Special Forces soldier, who is drafted back into service by Section 20, a fictional branch of the Secret Intelligence Service.', 'The series follows John Porter, a former British Special Forces soldier, who is drafted back into service by Section 20, a fictional branch of the Secret Intelligence Service.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0ItaC2Grf4WVJ06G87BjNn9pRs.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:32573'),
  ('393531762179844671', 'Strike the Blood', 2013, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yoshimasa Hosoya, Risa Taneda, Asami Seto, Rina Hidaka, Ikumi Hayama, Ryota Osaka, Hisako Kanemoto, Kanae Itou', 'TV-MA', 'Kojou Akatsuki''s days as an ordinary high school student in the Demon District of Itogami Island come to an abrupt end after a fateful encounter leaves him with the remarkable abilities of a vampire. It isn''t long before he is thrust into the center of attention when it is discovered that he is the fourth primogenitor, an immensely powerful vampire whom most consider to be merely a legend. Fearing Kojou''s destructive potential, the Lion King Organization sends in an apprentice sword-shaman, Yukina Himeragi, to monitor, and should he become a threat, kill the boy deemed the world''s most powerful vampire. Forced together by circumstance, the two form an unlikely alliance as Kojou comes to terms with his abilities and they both struggle to protect the city from various emerging chaotic forces.', 'Kojou Akatsuki''s days as an ordinary high school student in the Demon District of Itogami Island come to an abrupt end after a fateful encounter leaves him with the remarkable abilities of a vampire. It isn''t long before he is thrust into the center of attention when it is discovered that he is the fourth primogenitor, an immensely powerful vampire whom most consider to be merely a legend. Fearing Kojou''s destructive potential, the Lion King Organization sends in an apprentice sword-shaman, Yukina Himeragi, to monitor, and should he become a threat, kill the boy deemed the world''s most powerful vampire. Forced together by circumstance, the two form an unlikely alliance as Kojou comes to terms with his abilities and they both struggle to protect the city from various emerging chaotic forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbGaCkEVS7PE5fKKMAmvO4XZXyA.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:61440'),
  ('22798148752315674', 'Strike Witches', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Toshihiko Tsukiji, Takashi Aoshima', 'Ami Koshimizu, Ayuru Ohashi, Sakura Nogawa, Misato Fukuen, Chiwa Saito, Kaori Nazuka, Mai Kadowaki, Rie Tanaka', 'TV-MA', 'The year is 1939 - it was then that the Neuroi appeared. Nobody knows where they came from or what their ultimate agenda is, but the fact remains that their attacks drove people out of their towns and cities. In order to take arms against them, humanity develops a new anti-Neuroi weapon called the "Striker Unit." Using the power of magic to fight against the monsters, this new device enhances and amplifies the power of female magic-wielders. To use this device, young witches from all over the world have been brought together to form an elite task force unit called the 501st Joint Fighter Wing, commonly known as the "Strike Witches."', 'The year is 1939 - it was then that the Neuroi appeared. Nobody knows where they came from or what their ultimate agenda is, but the fact remains that their attacks drove people out of their towns and cities. In order to take arms against them, humanity develops a new anti-Neuroi weapon called the "Striker Unit." Using the power of magic to fight against the monsters, this new device enhances and amplifies the power of female magic-wielders. To use this device, young witches from all over the world have been brought together to form an elite task force unit called the 501st Joint Fighter Wing, commonly known as the "Strike Witches."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8313VGYl6CWVButaAWIP4G9ViuR.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:35464'),
  ('698974503406371954', 'Strike Witches: 501st JOINT FIGHTER WING Take Off!', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Misato Fukuen, Kaori Nazuka, Miyuki Sawashiro, Rie Tanaka', 'TV-14', 'Strike Witches, the 501st Joint Fighter Wing girls, are back from battle and ready to relax as best they can! War with the deadly Neuroi won’t last forever, but one thing is certain, the war on laundry is eternal. Join these aerial combat cuties in a down-to-earth series highlighting the team’s hijinks between missions.', 'Strike Witches, the 501st Joint Fighter Wing girls, are back from battle and ready to relax as best they can! War with the deadly Neuroi won’t last forever, but one thing is certain, the war on laundry is eternal. Join these aerial combat cuties in a down-to-earth series highlighting the team’s hijinks between missions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aBMlhLUt4CxoskvFgqhmbLHO1S9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:87693'),
  ('967772340598198330', 'Striking Out', 2017, 'Drama', null, null, 'Amy Huberman, Neil Morrissey, Fiona O''Shaughnessy, Rory Keenan, Brahm Gallagher, Emmet Byrne, Nigel Davey', null, 'When Tara discovers her fiancé and fellow solicitor Eric has been cheating with a colleague, she leaves him and their prestigious law firm to set up her own practice specializing in family and divorce law. Tara''s cases will put her in direct conflict with influential families and the legal and political establishment as well as challenging her own personal morals.', 'When Tara discovers her fiancé and fellow solicitor Eric has been cheating with a colleague, she leaves him and their prestigious law firm to set up her own practice specializing in family and divorce law. Tara''s cases will put her in direct conflict with influential families and the legal and political establishment as well as challenging her own personal morals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqxHoEiuartFmfgmVW0vuMqzwLG.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69194'),
  ('129648106667030551', 'Strip Law', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Cullen Crawford', null, 'Adam Scott, Janelle James, Keith David, Stephen Root, Shannon Gisela', 'TV-MA', 'An uptight lawyer teams with a flashy Las Vegas magician to bring some pizzazz to the city''s stupidest cases in this adult animated comedy.', 'An uptight lawyer teams with a flashy Las Vegas magician to bring some pizzazz to the city''s stupidest cases in this adult animated comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hs9kjF67nO5vc3kBgm3IF2MLnRe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:298343'),
  ('273995873639686141', 'Stripperella', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Stan Lee', null, 'Pamela Anderson, Jill Talley, Tom Kenny, Maurice LaMarche, Sirena Irwin', 'TV-MA', 'From Stan Lee, the man who brought us such popular superheroes as Spider-Man and The X-Men, comes this new kind of superhero in the form of the animated series "Stripperella". Pamela Anderson provides the voice of Erotica Jones who is stripper by night and superhero Stripperella by even later at night. A show with something for everyone, Stan Lee promises that despite it''s adult setting ''Stripperella'' is "really a family show...but for a highly sophisticated family."', 'From Stan Lee, the man who brought us such popular superheroes as Spider-Man and The X-Men, comes this new kind of superhero in the form of the animated series "Stripperella". Pamela Anderson provides the voice of Erotica Jones who is stripper by night and superhero Stripperella by even later at night. A show with something for everyone, Stan Lee promises that despite it''s adult setting ''Stripperella'' is "really a family show...but for a highly sophisticated family."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guRGnuhn2RC240XmHQQkNAu5v7z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3072'),
