  ('749507350698854837', 'Stroker and Hoop', 2004, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Casper Kelly, Jeffrey G. Olsen', 'Jeffrey G. Olsen, Casper Kelly', 'Jon Glaser, Timothy "Speed" Levitch, Paul Christie', 'TV-MA', 'Stroker and Hoop is an American Flash animated television series on Cartoon Network''s late night programming block, Adult Swim. The series is a parody of buddy cop films and television series such as Starsky & Hutch, and features the voices of Jon Glaser as Stroker and Timothy "Speed" Levitch as Hoop. This might also be a parody of the two Burt Reynolds characters: "Stroker Ace" and "Hooper". Stroker and Hoop premiered on August 1, 2004, and ended on December 25, 2005, with 13 episodes. Adult Swim continues to air reruns of Stroker and Hoop on an infrequent basis.', 'Stroker and Hoop is an American Flash animated television series on Cartoon Network''s late night programming block, Adult Swim. The series is a parody of buddy cop films and television series such as Starsky & Hutch, and features the voices of Jon Glaser as Stroker and Timothy "Speed" Levitch as Hoop. This might also be a parody of the two Burt Reynolds characters: "Stroker Ace" and "Hooper". Stroker and Hoop premiered on August 1, 2004, and ended on December 25, 2005, with 13 episodes. Adult Swim continues to air reruns of Stroker and Hoop on an infrequent basis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w34yxFrhptVHLbAOJ6GHwv9OQo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2590'),
  ('195635846231183087', 'Stromberg', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Ralf Husmann, Moritz Netenjakob', null, 'Christoph Maria Herbst, Oliver Wnuk, Bjarne Mädel, Diana Staehly, Milena Dreißig', null, 'A comedy centered around the incompetent boss of a German insurance office.', 'A comedy centered around the incompetent boss of a German insurance office.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ThMER8tdMHzSq4GKx9PbRndGHk.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:6202'),
  ('449946413715220763', 'Strong Girl Nam-soon', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Crime', 'Baek Mi-kyoung, Kim Jung-sik, Lee Kyung-shik', 'Baek Mi-kyoung', 'Lee You-mi, Kim Jung-eun, Kim Hae-sook, Ong Seong-wu, Byeon Woo-seok, Lee Seung-joon, Kim Ki-doo, Han Sang-jo', 'TV-14', 'Gifted with superhuman strength, a young woman returns to Korea to find her birth family — only to be entangled in a drug case that could test her power.', 'Gifted with superhuman strength, a young woman returns to Korea to find her birth family — only to be entangled in a drug case that could test her power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rjkHORZvB5bnz7kH1PufFCKsX4I.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203164'),
