  ('19967764895012476', 'Subteran', 2025, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Ana Ularu, Cezar Grumăzescu, Florin Piersic Jr., Irina Artenii', 'TV-MA', 'A young mother''s life is upended when she finds herself hiding behind a secret identity to escape the Bucharest gang responsible for her fiancé''s death.', 'A young mother''s life is upended when she finds herself hiding behind a secret identity to escape the Bucharest gang responsible for her fiancé''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sEPtLYooqRKsjAFirxyYRELKRpS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:277805'),
  ('726568764189449471', 'Suburbia - Women on the Edge', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Uli Brée', null, 'Maria Köstlinger, Nina Proll, Bernhard Schir, Juergen Maurer, Thomas Mraz, Hilde Dalik, Ines Honsel, Ruth Brauer-Kvam', null, 'Vienna suburb. Better society. Appearance and reality. A golden cage. But is everything that glitters really gold? Actually, the five "suburban women" of the title couldn''t be doing any better in their supposedly perfect, affluent world – could they?', 'Vienna suburb. Better society. Appearance and reality. A golden cage. But is everything that glitters really gold? Actually, the five "suburban women" of the title couldn''t be doing any better in their supposedly perfect, affluent world – could they?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/um3A1r8A5Cuco7ldJHKtMhU7zU9.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:61945'),
  ('758091732013784254', 'Suburgatory', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Emily Kapnek', null, 'Jane Levy, Jeremy Sisto, Carly Chaikin, Allie Grant, Cheryl Hines, Ana Gasteyer, Chris Parnell', 'TV-PG', 'Single father George Altman is doing his best to raise his sixteen-year-old daughter Tessa in the big city. When he discovers a box of condoms in her bedroom, though, he decides the time has come to move her to a more wholesome and nurturing environment: the suburbs. But behind the beautiful homes and perfect lawns lurk the Franken-moms, spray tans, nose jobs, and Red Bull-guzzling teens who have nothing in common with Tessa. It’s a whole new world, one that makes George wonder if they haven’t jumped out of the frying pan and into the fire.', 'Single father George Altman is doing his best to raise his sixteen-year-old daughter Tessa in the big city. When he discovers a box of condoms in her bedroom, though, he decides the time has come to move her to a more wholesome and nurturing environment: the suburbs. But behind the beautiful homes and perfect lawns lurk the Franken-moms, spray tans, nose jobs, and Red Bull-guzzling teens who have nothing in common with Tessa. It’s a whole new world, one that makes George wonder if they haven’t jumped out of the frying pan and into the fire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJiclykJKNv1FAlTubCdaY2KM2a.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:39357'),
  ('393663143968891267', 'Suburra: Blood on Rome', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Carlo Bonini, Daniele Cesarano, Barbara Petronio', null, 'Alessandro Borghi, Giacomo Ferrara, Carlotta Antonelli, Federica Sabatini, Filippo Nigro, Adamo Dionisi, Paola Sotgiu, Alessandro Bernardini', 'TV-MA', 'In 2008, a fight over land in a seaside town near Rome spirals into a deadly battle between organized crime, corrupt politicians and the Vatican.', 'In 2008, a fight over land in a seaside town near Rome spirals into a deadly battle between organized crime, corrupt politicians and the Vatican.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ri1WF0vxDfJcUW8iNUOu8OsmVeJ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:73671'),
  ('552966070278781814', 'Suburræterna', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Giacomo Ferrara, Filippo Nigro, Carlotta Antonelli, Federica Sabatini, Marlon Joubert, Aliosha Massine, Alberto Cracco, Federigo Ceci', 'TV-MA', 'While chaos rules over Rome, established alliances are at risk as tensions rise with emerging criminal clans. The world of "Suburra" takes a new turn.', 'While chaos rules over Rome, established alliances are at risk as tensions rise with emerging criminal clans. The world of "Suburra" takes a new turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atKm8I80G85Afx1Kfz9kmB8UGfn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:235350'),
