  ('206012099167871659', 'Such Brave Girls', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kat Sadler', null, 'Kat Sadler, Louise Brealey, Lizzie Davidson', 'TV-MA', 'Sisters Josie and Billie and their single mother Deb navigate life armed with nothing but poor judgement and self-esteem exclusively tied to people who couldn''t care less about them. They''re vain, selfish, heavily in debt, pathologically desperate for affection and bursting with misplaced, terrifying love.', 'Sisters Josie and Billie and their single mother Deb navigate life armed with nothing but poor judgement and self-esteem exclusively tied to people who couldn''t care less about them. They''re vain, selfish, heavily in debt, pathologically desperate for affection and bursting with misplaced, terrifying love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7g60yren32dIyR0ZsMFPXWn3vGt.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:239614'),
  ('594630301724765384', 'SUCHWITA', 2022, 'Talk', null, null, 'Suga', null, 'With a playful, fitting rhyme with the title track of D-2, Daechwita, this talk-show format provides Min Yoon Gi, as the main host, to engage in open dialogue with guests from a range of professions while drinking. He will utilize his conversational talents to highlight the attractions of his visitors by drawing on his understanding of a variety of topics, including music.', 'With a playful, fitting rhyme with the title track of D-2, Daechwita, this talk-show format provides Min Yoon Gi, as the main host, to engage in open dialogue with guests from a range of professions while drinking. He will utilize his conversational talents to highlight the attractions of his visitors by drawing on his understanding of a variety of topics, including music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i73K5yxgRPKbe4wqdym51rdJxXu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215789'),
