  ('345318154083636285', 'Suddenly Susan', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Clyde Phillips', null, 'Brooke Shields, Nestor Carbonell, Kathy Griffin, Currie Graham, Sherri Shepherd, Barbara Barrie, Eric Idle', null, 'Susan Keane is a glamorous San Francisco magazine writer beginning to adjust to being single, who learns to be independent-minded, after being taken care of all her life.', 'Susan Keane is a glamorous San Francisco magazine writer beginning to adjust to being single, who learns to be independent-minded, after being taken care of all her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfM8shbsRi7Iw6SZmamX3mZ2313.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1076'),
  ('153960192269741863', 'Sue Thomas: F.B.Eye', 2002, 'Family, Drama, Crime', 'Dave Alan Johnson, Gary R. Johnson', null, 'Deanne Bray, Yannick Bisson, Rick Peters, Marc Gomes, Enuka Okuma, Ted Atherton, Tara Samuel', 'TV-PG', 'Based on a true story, this family-friendly series follows the adventures of a young, hearing impaired woman who has a special gift and goes to work for the FBI in Washington, D.C. She''s one hard-headed, soft-hearted woman whose talent for reading lips helps crack crimes and bag the bad guys in places listening devices can''t penetrate. With her hearing-ear dog, Levi, Sue''s a glutton for jeopardy – and there''s (almost) nothing she won''t do to bring notorious criminals to justice. This remarkable, edge-of-your-seat drama is an inspiring tribute to the ability of the human spirit to overcome adversity and achieve great things.', 'Based on a true story, this family-friendly series follows the adventures of a young, hearing impaired woman who has a special gift and goes to work for the FBI in Washington, D.C. She''s one hard-headed, soft-hearted woman whose talent for reading lips helps crack crimes and bag the bad guys in places listening devices can''t penetrate. With her hearing-ear dog, Levi, Sue''s a glutton for jeopardy – and there''s (almost) nothing she won''t do to bring notorious criminals to justice. This remarkable, edge-of-your-seat drama is an inspiring tribute to the ability of the human spirit to overcome adversity and achieve great things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5tHDB8vSOk6WB0rFufFUILxBKZz.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1625'),
  ('34210110459880717', 'Sueños y Caramelos', 2005, 'Drama, Family', 'Abel Santacruz', 'Dolores Ortega, Denisse Pfeiffer, Ricardo Tejeda', 'Alessandra Rosaldo, René Strickler, María Antonieta de las Nieves, Manuel Saval, Nora Salinas, Nashla Aguilar, Raúl Padilla, Elizabeth Álvarez', null, 'Sueños y Caramelos is a 2005 Mexican telenovela that starred Nashla Aguilar as a little girl who lives in an almacen where she assembles a Maniqui or Mannequin, which comes to life and becomes like a mother to her. Remake of La Pícara Soñadora', 'Sueños y Caramelos is a 2005 Mexican telenovela that starred Nashla Aguilar as a little girl who lives in an almacen where she assembles a Maniqui or Mannequin, which comes to life and becomes like a mother to her. Remake of La Pícara Soñadora', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emqK3MvA74bumSRGd1ftJ2Z2S7J.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37613'),
  ('189023531829943804', 'Sugar', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Mark Protosevich', null, 'Colin Farrell, Kirby Howell-Baptiste, Amy Ryan, Dennis Boutsikaris, Nate Corddry, Alex Hernandez, James Cromwell', 'TV-MA', 'An enigmatic private detective struggles with personal demons as he investigates the disappearance of a Hollywood producer''s beloved granddaughter.', 'An enigmatic private detective struggles with personal demons as he investigates the disappearance of a Hollywood producer''s beloved granddaughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNrk52Rt13MxwahLneTZJezM6qD.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:203744'),
  ('517953606528144151', 'Sugar Apple Fairy Tale', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuka Nukui, Masaaki Mizunaka, Rie Takahashi, Tomoaki Maeno, Takuma Terashima, Reiji Kawashima, Yuto Uemura, Kazuyuki Okitsu', 'TV-14', 'Anne Halford is on her way to fulfill her dream of becoming a confectionary artisan, a Silver Sugar Master—however, the road to her destination is filled with a world of danger. To protect herself, she reluctantly buys Challe, a fairy forced into a life of servitude, but she seeks friendship more than a lackey. Torn between his freedom and her needs, she must confront what the sweet life is worth.', 'Anne Halford is on her way to fulfill her dream of becoming a confectionary artisan, a Silver Sugar Master—however, the road to her destination is filled with a world of danger. To protect herself, she reluctantly buys Challe, a fairy forced into a life of servitude, but she seeks friendship more than a lackey. Torn between his freedom and her needs, she must confront what the sweet life is worth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rPnkNlQKcqHDAePcCevweedRD3E.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135335'),
  ('184860543410585747', 'Sugar Daddy', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Андрей Смольский, Евгений Бржусь, Николай Мисник', null, 'Daria Petrozhytska, Stanislav Boklan, Sergey Siplivyy, Mykhailo Kukuyuk, Olesia Zhurakivska', null, 'Forgotten by everyone, one of the country''s best actors in the past is going through difficult times. Suffering from deep depression, he decides to commit suicide, but fate throws him an unexpected future. The hero ends up in a barber shop, where his terrible appearance is transformed into model looks that catch the eye of young women.', 'Forgotten by everyone, one of the country''s best actors in the past is going through difficult times. Suffering from deep depression, he decides to commit suicide, but fate throws him an unexpected future. The hero ends up in a barber shop, where his terrible appearance is transformed into model looks that catch the eye of young women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ajUKXpi6ydrwACnqoCqluMLe5p3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:97917'),
  ('507727522814116989', 'Sugar Rush', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Katie Baxendale, Julie Burchill', null, 'Olivia Hallinan, Lenora Crichlow, Sarah-Jane Potts, Richard Lumsden, Sara Stewart', null, 'Sugar Rush is an Emmy Award–winning British television comedy drama series developed by Shine Limited and broadcast by Channel 4, based on the Julie Burchill novel of the same name. It follows the trials and tribulations of teenager Kim Daniels, who is dealing with all the usual adolescent issues, plus one - she thinks she might be gay. Her family has recently moved to Brighton from London, and she finds herself with a huge crush on her new best friend, Maria `Sugar'' Sweet. Sugar has a bit of a wild side, and frequently gets Kim into trouble, though Kim can find trouble on her own as well. Despite attractions to other girls, and a few attempts at being interested in guys, Kim continues to long for Sugar.', 'Sugar Rush is an Emmy Award–winning British television comedy drama series developed by Shine Limited and broadcast by Channel 4, based on the Julie Burchill novel of the same name. It follows the trials and tribulations of teenager Kim Daniels, who is dealing with all the usual adolescent issues, plus one - she thinks she might be gay. Her family has recently moved to Brighton from London, and she finds herself with a huge crush on her new best friend, Maria `Sugar'' Sweet. Sugar has a bit of a wild side, and frequently gets Kim into trouble, though Kim can find trouble on her own as well. Despite attractions to other girls, and a few attempts at being interested in guys, Kim continues to long for Sugar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/YEW7UwhDpVo6N1tpNHGmC9ZjNO.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:407'),
  ('852735457176741395', 'Sugar Rush', 2018, 'Reality', null, null, 'Hunter March, Candace Nelson, Adriano Zumbo', 'TV-PG', 'A relentlessly fast-paced baking competition that challenges brilliant bakers to create sweet treats that look and taste amazing – all against the clock. Who will race to the finish and win $10,000?', 'A relentlessly fast-paced baking competition that challenges brilliant bakers to create sweet treats that look and taste amazing – all against the clock. Who will race to the finish and win $10,000?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6acuhLK1eGaJy46uqJJE8q6MhP.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:80341'),
  ('445107521511667925', 'Sugar Rush Christmas', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, 'Adriano Zumbo', null, 'It''s everything you love about "Sugar Rush" -- with a holly jolly holiday twist -- in this Christmas-themed spin on competitive baking.', 'It''s everything you love about "Sugar Rush" -- with a holly jolly holiday twist -- in this Christmas-themed spin on competitive baking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/daiV3ttqSLXG7VhVwD1dyaAX5xA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:95953'),
  ('677616242400735955', 'Sugar Rush: The Baking Point', 2023, 'Reality', null, null, 'Carlos ''Capi'' Pérez, Gris Verduzco, Luis Robledo Richards', 'TV-PG', 'In this race against time, six teams of pastry chefs blend innovation and tradition to create edible marvels. Who will bake their way to the top?', 'In this race against time, six teams of pastry chefs blend innovation and tradition to create edible marvels. Who will bake their way to the top?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rzNM1JFQviIc9u0PBDgqGk1TPRg.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:229736'),
  ('888687613124873029', 'Sugar Sugar Rune', 2005, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Sakiko Uran, Ryou Naitou, Ayaka Saito, Akina Abe, Marika Matsumoto, Kanako Mitsuhashi, Kenjiro Tsuda, Mariya Ise', null, 'Chocolat Meilleure is a happy-going and optimistic girl. Together with her friend-cum-rival, Vanilla Mieux, they are potential candidates to become Queen of the magic world. After obtaining their magic wands, they set off to the human world to gather the hearts of unsuspecting humans. Whoever gets the most hearts will be the crowned Queen.', 'Chocolat Meilleure is a happy-going and optimistic girl. Together with her friend-cum-rival, Vanilla Mieux, they are potential candidates to become Queen of the magic world. After obtaining their magic wands, they set off to the human world to gather the hearts of unsuspecting humans. Whoever gets the most hearts will be the crowned Queen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n0DumZEBpuIDfgAMzSPU2JMjyyR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:54241'),
  ('683482432438662936', 'Suicide Squad Isekai', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Anna Nagase, Reigo Yamaguchi, Takehito Koyasu, Jun Fukuyama, Subaru Kimura, Jun Fukushima, Seán Patrick Judge', 'TV-MA', 'In the crime-ridden city of Gotham, Amanda Waller, the head of A.R.G.U.S., assembles a group of notorious criminals—Harley Quinn, Deadshot, Peacemaker, Clayface and King Shark—for a mission into an otherworldly realm that''s connected to this world through a gate. It''s a realm of swords and magic where orcs rampage and dragons rule the skies. Can Harley Quinn and her crew conquer this perilous realm?', 'In the crime-ridden city of Gotham, Amanda Waller, the head of A.R.G.U.S., assembles a group of notorious criminals—Harley Quinn, Deadshot, Peacemaker, Clayface and King Shark—for a mission into an otherworldly realm that''s connected to this world through a gate. It''s a realm of swords and magic where orcs rampage and dragons rule the skies. Can Harley Quinn and her crew conquer this perilous realm?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AbVwsBJnLoqJzPJn8dlGFSGfygy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:229926'),
  ('550460804898893098', 'Suidooster', 2015, 'Soap', null, null, 'Portia Joel, Denise Newman, Jill Levenberg, Simone Biscombe, Irshaad Ally, Eden Classens, Gantane Gwane Kusch, Lauren Joseph', null, 'Suidooster is a South African television soap opera produced by Suidooster Films which revolves around a matriarch, her family, friends and the people of Suidooster, a small shopping and business centre in the fictional Cape Town suburb of Ruiterbosch.', 'Suidooster is a South African television soap opera produced by Suidooster Films which revolves around a matriarch, her family, friends and the people of Suidooster, a small shopping and business centre in the fictional Cape Town suburb of Ruiterbosch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/naCgSiacvV685kait6fBvhVhdce.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:235484'),
  ('465870285645250174', 'Suite Precure♪', 2011, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Kids, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ami Koshimizu, Fumiko Orikasa, Megumi Toyoguchi, Rumi Okubo, Kotono Mitsuishi, Keiichi Sonobe, Kenyu Horiuchi, Mayu Kudo', null, 'Hibiki and Kanade are two friends who grew up together in Kanon Town. Very different in their personalities, they share one thing in common: A connection to music. No matter how different they are or how much their differences cause them to quarrel, they both continue to share loving hearts. One day they meet Hummy, who is sent to the Human World from Major Land to collect the scattered notes of the Melody of Happiness. They have to instantly transform into Pretty Cures to resist the threats and evil music from Mephisto. Can they stop the Melody of Sorrow from disrupting their peaceful town, and can their warped friendship measure up to the bonds of Pretty Cure?', 'Hibiki and Kanade are two friends who grew up together in Kanon Town. Very different in their personalities, they share one thing in common: A connection to music. No matter how different they are or how much their differences cause them to quarrel, they both continue to share loving hearts. One day they meet Hummy, who is sent to the Human World from Major Land to collect the scattered notes of the Melody of Happiness. They have to instantly transform into Pretty Cures to resist the threats and evil music from Mephisto. Can they stop the Melody of Sorrow from disrupting their peaceful town, and can their warped friendship measure up to the bonds of Pretty Cure?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t8kOqKwWKj9cv8BIYBLxaCCFEKy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43055'),
  ('107857851628030621', 'Suits', 2011, 'Drama', 'Aaron Korsh', null, 'Gabriel Macht, Rick Hoffman, Sarah Rafferty, Amanda Schull, Dulé Hill, Katherine Heigl', 'TV-14', 'While running from a drug deal gone bad, Mike Ross, a brilliant young college-dropout, slips into a job interview with one of New York City''s best legal closers, Harvey Specter. Tired of cookie-cutter law school grads, Harvey takes a gamble by hiring Mike on the spot after he recognizes his raw talent and photographic memory.', 'While running from a drug deal gone bad, Mike Ross, a brilliant young college-dropout, slips into a job interview with one of New York City''s best legal closers, Harvey Specter. Tired of cookie-cutter law school grads, Harvey takes a gamble by hiring Mike on the spot after he recognizes his raw talent and photographic memory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fO0nFvGcbTHpwZGLkr98xuZ5hFs.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:37680'),
  ('337679503571057247', 'Suits', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kim Jin-woo', 'Kim Jung-min', 'Jang Dong-gun, Park Hyung-sik, Chae Jung-an, Ko Sung-hee, Jin Hee-kyung, Choi Gwi-hwa, Lee Sang-yi, Lee Si-won', null, 'Choi Kyung Seo is a legendary lawyer at the top law firm in South Korea. He has charisma and an attractive appearance. He hires Go Yeon Woo as a rookie lawyer for the law firm. Go Yeon Woo has excellent memory.', 'Choi Kyung Seo is a legendary lawyer at the top law firm in South Korea. He has charisma and an attractive appearance. He hires Go Yeon Woo as a rookie lawyer for the law firm. Go Yeon Woo has excellent memory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7ds0EcHjhavjIlrJmTvGp43M6n.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77548'),
  ('954584809175622983', 'Suits', 2022, 'Drama', 'Mohamed Hefzy, Yasser Abdel Mageed, Mohamed Galal', 'Yasser Abdel Mageed, Mohamed Hefzy, Mohamed Galal', 'Asser Yassin, Ahmed Dawood, Saba Mubarak, Reem Mostafa, Mohamed Shaheen, Tara Emad, Mostafa Darwish, Lobna Wanas', null, 'Adam turns into a lawyer in a large law firm by chance, when he reveals his secret to lawyer Zain, and together they handle many challenging cases.', 'Adam turns into a lawyer in a large law firm by chance, when he reveals his secret to lawyer Zain, and together they handle many challenging cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gBDSstcj7PRKWVM6p12hxD8en2w.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:194677'),
  ('524760755380101120', 'Suits LA', 2025, 'Drama', 'Aaron Korsh', null, 'Stephen Amell, Lex Scott Davis, Josh McDermitt, Bryan Greenberg', 'TV-14', 'Ted Black, a former federal prosecutor from New York, has reinvented himself representing the most powerful clients in Los Angeles. But his firm is at a crisis point, and in order to survive, he must embrace a role he held in contempt his entire career.', 'Ted Black, a former federal prosecutor from New York, has reinvented himself representing the most powerful clients in Los Angeles. But his firm is at a crisis point, and in order to survive, he must embrace a role he held in contempt his entire career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3hYiNPkcLoI3QWDokOHQJIfn55O.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259453'),
  ('464801507023776972', 'Sukeban Deka II: Legend of the Iron-Masked Girl', 1985, 'Crime, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, 'Tokio Tsuchiya, Izo Hashimoto, Hiroshi Toda', 'Yoko Minamino, Haruko Sagara, Akie Yoshizawa, Keizo Kanie, Akiko Izumi', null, 'Sukeban Deka II in 1985-1986 starred Yoko Minamino as the second "Sukeban Deka", a mysterious girl with an iron mask named Yoko Godai who takes on the identity of Asamiya Saki after being freed from her mask; She will get the help of two other sukeban: Kyoko "Okyo" Nakamura (Haruko Sagara), and Yukino Yajima (Akie Yoshizawa, from jpop band Onyanko Club which will appear in two episodes).', 'Sukeban Deka II in 1985-1986 starred Yoko Minamino as the second "Sukeban Deka", a mysterious girl with an iron mask named Yoko Godai who takes on the identity of Asamiya Saki after being freed from her mask; She will get the help of two other sukeban: Kyoko "Okyo" Nakamura (Haruko Sagara), and Yukino Yajima (Akie Yoshizawa, from jpop band Onyanko Club which will appear in two episodes).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kgVVilNyNvSS74B7rAJn0b0K9eQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89352'),
  ('139713385063774940', 'Sullivan & Son', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Steve Byrne, Rob Long', null, 'Steve Byrne, Christine Ebersole, Dan Lauria, Brian Doyle-Murray, Valerie Azlynn, Jodi Long, Owen Benjamin, Vivian Bang', null, 'A New York lawyer returns home to Pittsburgh and reclaims his family’s bar, finding laughter, chaos, and purpose in the community he left behind.', 'A New York lawyer returns home to Pittsburgh and reclaims his family’s bar, finding laughter, chaos, and purpose in the community he left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zm5FT4BHME3mYY05oXsTRQKV01.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:43087'),
  ('293645501357226931', 'Sullivan''s Crossing', 2023, 'Drama', 'Roma Roth', null, 'Morgan Kohan, Chad Michael Murray, Tom Jackson, Andrea Menard, Amalia Williamson, Lindura, Reid Price', 'TV-PG', 'After Neurosurgeon Maggie Sullivan’s personal and professional life are thrown into turmoil she returns home to Sullivan’s Crossing. While there, Maggie is forced to navigate her complicated present while confronting the painful past she has chosen to ignore for years.', 'After Neurosurgeon Maggie Sullivan’s personal and professional life are thrown into turmoil she returns home to Sullivan’s Crossing. While there, Maggie is forced to navigate her complicated present while confronting the painful past she has chosen to ignore for years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYRnuQNR13nEYaXkOZaY0qIWl2K.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:211564'),
  ('925862774429374337', 'Summer Camp Island', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family', 'Julia Pott', null, 'Oona Laurence, Julia Pott, Antonio Raul Garcia', 'TV-Y7', 'Oscar and Hedgehog are dropped off at a strange summer camp, full of fantastical things ranging from magical camp counselors to sticky notes that are portals to other dimensions.', 'Oscar and Hedgehog are dropped off at a strange summer camp, full of fantastical things ranging from magical camp counselors to sticky notes that are portals to other dimensions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/syipk7iIpV4DTvGuBuEqrVbAbaY.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:81665'),
  ('981297783910770526', 'Summer Guys', 2021, 'Drama', 'Yook Shi Mon', 'Yook Simon', 'Lee Jung-sic, Lee Jung-shin, Kwon Hyun-bin, Kang Mi-na, Viini, Lim Na-young', null, 'Next to a luxury resort on a beach in Jeju Island is a run-down cocktail bar called “Summer Guys”. The owner, and the only bartender of this establishment, is Oh Jin Dal Lae who has been barely making ends meet and very close to going out of business. On a hot summer day with the sun blazing overhead, three suspicious guys appear before her. These three end up becoming bartenders with a mission to save the bar. Three guys, one girl, and cocktails are a recipe for love. Jin Dal Lae finds herself in a blissful dilemma among them, but all three of the guys seem to have an ulterior motive. Why did these three come to Summer Guys? Why are they helping Jin Dal Lae? And, which of the three is her fated match?', 'Next to a luxury resort on a beach in Jeju Island is a run-down cocktail bar called “Summer Guys”. The owner, and the only bartender of this establishment, is Oh Jin Dal Lae who has been barely making ends meet and very close to going out of business. On a hot summer day with the sun blazing overhead, three suspicious guys appear before her. These three end up becoming bartenders with a mission to save the bar. Three guys, one girl, and cocktails are a recipe for love. Jin Dal Lae finds herself in a blissful dilemma among them, but all three of the guys seem to have an ulterior motive. Why did these three come to Summer Guys? Why are they helping Jin Dal Lae? And, which of the three is her fated match?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLuDMvQtljncGE4iSaBKCAnXH9o.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:122098'),
  ('198813840733272344', 'Summer Heat', 2022, 'Drama', 'Isabel Valiante, Caroline Fioratti', null, 'Giovanna Lancellotti, Jorge López, Gabz, André Luiz Frambach, Giovanna Rispoli, Maicon Rodrigues, Cynthia Aparecida, Felipe Rocha', 'TV-MA', 'A group of young adults working at a paradisiac resort live an unforgettable summer as they discover love, true friendships and devastating secrets.', 'A group of young adults working at a paradisiac resort live an unforgettable summer as they discover love, true friendships and devastating secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4FsjdxJYhOYxJUp32KqZw9Mn7i2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:139792'),
  ('1043452050692129071', 'Summer Heights High', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Chris Lilley', null, 'Chris Lilley, David Lennie, Asolima Tauati, Iro Utaifeau, Zach Fa''atoe, Ofa Palu, Kristy Barnes Cullen, Stan Roach', 'TV-MA', 'Exploring what happens over one school term in an average Australian high school, this mockumentary brings to life Jonah, a 13 year old mischievous schoolboy from Tonga with the odds stacked against him; Mr G, an ego-driven drama teacher with delusional showbiz dreams; and Ja’mie, a private schoolgirl on a student exchange, set to make her mark on Summer Heights High.', 'Exploring what happens over one school term in an average Australian high school, this mockumentary brings to life Jonah, a 13 year old mischievous schoolboy from Tonga with the odds stacked against him; Mr G, an ego-driven drama teacher with delusional showbiz dreams; and Ja’mie, a private schoolgirl on a student exchange, set to make her mark on Summer Heights High.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7IzblHA4i0tqzLljYb5VMv5Ol2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15082'),
  ('566182021108418249', 'Summer House', 2017, 'Reality', null, null, 'Kyle Cooke, Lindsay Hubbard, Carl Radke, Amanda Batula, Ciara Miller, West Wilson, Jesse Solomon, Mia Calabrese', 'TV-14', 'Take the beach town of Montauk, New York by storm while following a group of nine friends who make the exclusive enclave their go-to party spot between Memorial Day and Labor Day — that is, when they''re not hustling at their day jobs. You could say they work hard and party way harder.', 'Take the beach town of Montauk, New York by storm while following a group of nine friends who make the exclusive enclave their go-to party spot between Memorial Day and Labor Day — that is, when they''re not hustling at their day jobs. You could say they work hard and party way harder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fjU5MPJqP5BOP5Zr6Ud2LL2y97.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:69720'),
  ('587288699049540261', 'Summer Job', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Matilde Gioli', 'TV-MA', 'They''re young, spoiled, lazy and thought they were escaping the Italian winter for their dream vacation — but there''s a catch to the luxury.', 'They''re young, spoiled, lazy and thought they were escaping the Italian winter for their dream vacation — but there''s a catch to the luxury.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uCLh9dPz9dHKrtLs569lmeDwMq3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214669'),
  ('491321520977404510', 'Summer Love', 2015, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Yoona, Lee Min-ho', null, 'Two young people who have been friends for a long time spend their time together.', 'Two young people who have been friends for a long time spend their time together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KUGQAxhsvwR6yiKyCEjQoxY6yY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92635'),
  ('1112473063208383802', 'Summer Nude', 2013, 'Drama', null, null, 'Tomohisa Yamashita, Karina, Erika Toda, Ryo Katsuji, Masataka Kubota, Shori Sato, Mizuki Yamamoto, Yudai Chiba', null, 'Asahi Mikuri‎ya works at a photography studio, located near the sea. In the past, Asahi Mikuri‎ya dreamed of becoming a famous photographer, but now he as a cameraman for weddings and school events. Asahi Mikuri‎ya was also in love with a woman, but she suddenly left him. Natsuki Chiyohara‎ then appears in Asahi''s life. Natsuki works as a manager at a well known Italian restaurant in Tokyo. During the worst moment in her life, when her boyfriend dumps her, Asahi appears and even takes a picture of that moment. Natsuki begins work as a chef at the "House of Sea," located in the same seaside town where Asahi lives. Asahi''s former senior classmate runs the restaurant. Natsuki and Asahi have their past in common and they begin to get closer. Meanwhile, Taniyama is Asahi''s former junior classmates. She holds feelings for Asahi.', 'Asahi Mikuri‎ya works at a photography studio, located near the sea. In the past, Asahi Mikuri‎ya dreamed of becoming a famous photographer, but now he as a cameraman for weddings and school events. Asahi Mikuri‎ya was also in love with a woman, but she suddenly left him. Natsuki Chiyohara‎ then appears in Asahi''s life. Natsuki works as a manager at a well known Italian restaurant in Tokyo. During the worst moment in her life, when her boyfriend dumps her, Asahi appears and even takes a picture of that moment. Natsuki begins work as a chef at the "House of Sea," located in the same seaside town where Asahi lives. Asahi''s former senior classmate runs the restaurant. Natsuki and Asahi have their past in common and they begin to get closer. Meanwhile, Taniyama is Asahi''s former junior classmates. She holds feelings for Asahi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hs3Tyij8NVbx5ndThdEnkUIMxo5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64293'),
  ('77383790023473391', 'Summer of Rockets', 2019, 'Drama', null, null, 'Toby Stephens, Keeley Hawes, Linus Roache, Mark Bonnar, Lucy Cohu, Claire Bloom, Lily Sacofsky, Timothy Spall', 'TV-14', 'Samuel, a Russian-born Jewish inventor who specialises in the development of hearing aids, is tasked with a secret mission by MI5 to use his technological expertise to contribute to western Cold War efforts. Following the tensions of the space race and the first hydrogen bomb test, Samuel''s efforts factor in to the emergence of the modern world.', 'Samuel, a Russian-born Jewish inventor who specialises in the development of hearing aids, is tasked with a secret mission by MI5 to use his technological expertise to contribute to western Cold War efforts. Following the tensions of the space race and the first hydrogen bomb test, Samuel''s efforts factor in to the emergence of the modern world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dXtr2q8oDy3AfD5RdlH2w31rIgn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89661'),
  ('1065315319600835944', 'Summer Pockets', 2025, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Shoya Chiba, Konomi Kohara, Natsumi Takamori, Nene Hieda, Emiri Iwai, Saku Ichimiya, Sahomi Koyama, Aimi Tanaka', null, 'Hairi Takahara never expected summer to feel like a dream. Sent to Torishirojima to sort through his late grandmother''s belongings, he''s met with endless sea, quiet nostalgia, and mysterious girls, each chasing something just out of reach. As he settles into island life, lost memories begin to surface and he finds what he never knew he''d lost.', 'Hairi Takahara never expected summer to feel like a dream. Sent to Torishirojima to sort through his late grandmother''s belongings, he''s met with endless sea, quiet nostalgia, and mysterious girls, each chasing something just out of reach. As he settles into island life, lost memories begin to surface and he finds what he never knew he''d lost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9k1bD9S3djSemQsQO7csBxEwMar.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:271576'),
  ('390950850651863965', 'Summer Rose', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Liu Xiaoxu, Guo Yuxin, Guo Longfei, Weng Yizhen, Guo Shichen, He Jianqi, Wang Gege', null, 'An arranged marriage brings heir Zhou Sheng’an and photographer Bai Qingmei together, where his unwavering devotion helps her overcome past scars and learn to embrace love.', 'An arranged marriage brings heir Zhou Sheng’an and photographer Bai Qingmei together, where his unwavering devotion helps her overcome past scars and learn to embrace love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9CdEmMofQyzdzyM8dsVUdWDe16w.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:301366'),
  ('19321214993914320', 'Summer Strike', 2022, 'Drama', 'Lee Yoon-jung', 'Hong Moon-Pyo, Lee Yoon-jung', 'Kim Seol-hyun, Yim Si-wan, Shin Eun-soo, Bang Jae-min, Park Ye-yeong, Kwak Min-kyu, Yoo Soon-woong, Kim Joon', 'TV-MA', 'After getting dumped by her boyfriend and losing her mother in an accident, Yeo-reum decides to move to a small village to do nothing.', 'After getting dumped by her boyfriend and losing her mother in an accident, Yeo-reum decides to move to a small village to do nothing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ge4M0QHCfegOETAkjAKZroo82Rr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197078'),
  ('140191406182193530', 'Summer Time Rendering', 2022, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Natsuki Hanae, Anna Nagase, Saho Shirasu, Yoko Hikasa, Jin Urayama, Kensho Ono, Maki Kawase, Akio Otsuka', 'TV-MA', 'Shinpei Ajiro travels home to attend the funeral of a childhood friend, and finds the remote island plagued by a sinister, supernatural force.', 'Shinpei Ajiro travels home to attend the funeral of a childhood friend, and finds the remote island plagued by a sinister, supernatural force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9e7chRW8Q8Go1Dv00RCUHbMoNe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117933'),
  ('644990943881970769', 'Summer with the Family', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Mikael Syrén, Peter Magnusson, Staffan Lindberg', 'Peter Magnusson', 'Peter Magnusson, Christine Meltzer, Christopher Wagelin, Rakel Wärmländer, Krister Henriksson, Anki Lidén', null, 'Jens and wife Åsa pack up the family to spend the summer in the archipelago. The idyll, however, does not appear when it comes out that the in-laws do not intend to leave the cottage to Jens and Åsa, but plan to spend the whole summer there with them.', 'Jens and wife Åsa pack up the family to spend the summer in the archipelago. The idyll, however, does not appear when it comes out that the in-laws do not intend to leave the cottage to Jens and Åsa, but plan to spend the whole summer there with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6isxHTU10VfCrDTYl3b4Ws6CQBI.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:77473'),
  ('797648958040829539', 'Summerland', 2004, 'Drama', 'Stephen Tolkin, Lori Loughlin', null, 'Lori Loughlin, Shawn Christian, Merrin Dungey, Ryan Kwanten, Jesse McCartney, Taylor Cole, Kay Panabaker, Nick Benson', 'TV-PG', 'Bradin, Nikki and Derrick are 3 kids from an average normal Kansas household. Their whole life is thrown upside-down when their parents are tragically killed in a car accident. Ava Gregory (their aunt) gets custody of her niece and nephews and they move into her Californian home (in Summerland). Ava, a struggling clothes designer, lives with her best friend and business partner, Susannah Rexford, her friend, an ex- pro.surfer, Jay Robertson and her ex-boyfriend, real estate agent, Johnny Durrant. All four of them are highly unequipped to handle children and are not use to including them in their everyday lives.', 'Bradin, Nikki and Derrick are 3 kids from an average normal Kansas household. Their whole life is thrown upside-down when their parents are tragically killed in a car accident. Ava Gregory (their aunt) gets custody of her niece and nephews and they move into her Californian home (in Summerland). Ava, a struggling clothes designer, lives with her best friend and business partner, Susannah Rexford, her friend, an ex- pro.surfer, Jay Robertson and her ex-boyfriend, real estate agent, Johnny Durrant. All four of them are highly unequipped to handle children and are not use to including them in their everyday lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvdhBaU7CaIaZzoO4SgjPcyxXAM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:4106'),
  ('1018345576381601827', 'Summertime', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mirko Cetrangolo, Anita Rivaroli', null, 'Coco Rebecca Edogamhe, Ludovico Tersigni, Amanda Campana, Andrea Lattanzi, Thony, Giovanni Maini, Alicia Ann Edogamhe, Romina Colbasso', 'TV-MA', 'A modern love story set during the summer on Italy’s Adriatic Coast. An undeniable attraction brings together Ale and Summer, who come from very different worlds. For both, these holidays will be an unforgettable journey that will take them far from who they were before they met.', 'A modern love story set during the summer on Italy’s Adriatic Coast. An undeniable attraction brings together Ale and Summer, who come from very different worlds. For both, these holidays will be an unforgettable journey that will take them far from who they were before they met.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9PCmLDADfqrCnnxOo8yeM5AjnWY.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:100333'),
  ('332948099841248113', 'Summit of Our Youth', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Sun Zhenni, Chen Jingke, Ge Qiugu, Tu Zhiying, Wu Chongxuan, Kuai Jiale, Zhang Zhang, Hou Jiayin', null, 'After failing her college entrance exam and struggling in her career, Gu Xuejiao is unexpectedly sent back to her high school years. Determined to change her fate, she shifts her focus from love to success, prioritizing academics and career ambitions. Along the way, she finds herself in a transformative romance where both partners inspire each other to grow.', 'After failing her college entrance exam and struggling in her career, Gu Xuejiao is unexpectedly sent back to her high school years. Determined to change her fate, she shifts her focus from love to success, prioritizing academics and career ambitions. Along the way, she finds herself in a transformative romance where both partners inspire each other to grow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oxFbePAxm9imnEhJxMzoTgHv42F.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:270432'),
  ('591707317212900679', 'Summoned to Another World for a Second Time', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shunichi Toki, Kaori Maeda, Satomi Amano, Fairouz Ai, Saori Onishi', 'TV-14', 'There was once a man who was summoned to another world, and saved it. Of course, he became too popular there, and turned into an isekai-normie. However, that man fell into a "trap" and was forcibly returned to his original world. Moreover, he had to start over as a baby! This is the story of the way-too-fantastic ex-hero who lived as a gloomy high-schooler, as he gets summoned once again to that same other world in a very unexpected development!', 'There was once a man who was summoned to another world, and saved it. Of course, he became too popular there, and turned into an isekai-normie. However, that man fell into a "trap" and was forcibly returned to his original world. Moreover, he had to start over as a baby! This is the story of the way-too-fantastic ex-hero who lived as a gloomy high-schooler, as he gets summoned once again to that same other world in a very unexpected development!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sRnUYGttSV1pAszU3BxhM7UOQxI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137391'),
  ('174216154006171440', 'Sumomomo Momomo - The Strongest Bride on Earth', 2006, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Yui Kano, Hiroki Takahashi, Ui Miyazaki, Aya Hirano, Chihiro Suzuki, Takeshi Kusao, Inaho Kameda', 'TV-14', 'Koushi is in high school, oblivious to the marriage arranged for him at his birth. Enter Momoko Kuzuryuu: airhead martial artist and Koushi''s self-proclaimed bride. Her wish for sexual intercourse meets with Koushi''s square refusal as he has absolutely no desire to get it on with someone who looks like she could be his little sister, not to mention that he doesn''t have the foggiest idea who she actually is. Meanwhile, a war has broken out between the martial arts families. For Koushi, this means that numerous fighters are out to challenge/assassinate him.', 'Koushi is in high school, oblivious to the marriage arranged for him at his birth. Enter Momoko Kuzuryuu: airhead martial artist and Koushi''s self-proclaimed bride. Her wish for sexual intercourse meets with Koushi''s square refusal as he has absolutely no desire to get it on with someone who looks like she could be his little sister, not to mention that he doesn''t have the foggiest idea who she actually is. Meanwhile, a war has broken out between the martial arts families. For Koushi, this means that numerous fighters are out to challenge/assassinate him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqTGGbhb5fgsWP3hZsgpi0b8EXD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82509'),
  ('333818836960713009', 'Sun Records', 2017, 'Drama', null, null, 'Dustin Ingram, Jennifer Holland, Keir O''Donnell, Castro Coleman, Drake Milligan, Billy Gardell, Pokey LaFarge, Kerry Holliday', 'TV-14', 'The untold story of nothing less than the birth of rock ‘n’ roll. Guided by Sam Phillips, young musicians like Johnny Cash, Elvis Presley, Carl Perkins and Jerry Lee Lewis combined the styles of hillbilly country with the 1950s R&B sound created by artists like Muddy Waters, B.B. King, Fats Domino and Ike Turner, and changed the course of music forever.', 'The untold story of nothing less than the birth of rock ‘n’ roll. Guided by Sam Phillips, young musicians like Johnny Cash, Elvis Presley, Carl Perkins and Jerry Lee Lewis combined the styles of hillbilly country with the 1950s R&B sound created by artists like Muddy Waters, B.B. King, Fats Domino and Ike Turner, and changed the course of music forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPNhnfrfEg4l5NJa59zRW7OLMQm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70046'),
  ('448734270082304284', 'Sun''s Daughters', 2015, 'Family, Drama', 'Deniz Dargı, Cenk Boğatur', 'Deniz Dargı, Cenk Boğatur', 'Emre Kınay, Evrim Alasya, Tolga Sarıtaş, Burcu Özberk, Berk Atan, Hande Erçel, Miray Akay, Meltem Gülenç', 'NR', 'Güneş finds her prince charming at the age of 35, after raising 3 daughters and completely giving up hope on love. When she accepts the marriage proposal of Istanbul businessman Haluk Mertoğlu, Güneş and her troublesome daughters fall like a bomb into the middle of the Mertoğlu family''s life. All of them have different wishes and expectations from their new lives, but the life of the Mertoğlu family is not as perfect as it seems. With the arrival of Güneş and her daughters, the secrets of the past will begin to be revealed one by one.', 'Güneş finds her prince charming at the age of 35, after raising 3 daughters and completely giving up hope on love. When she accepts the marriage proposal of Istanbul businessman Haluk Mertoğlu, Güneş and her troublesome daughters fall like a bomb into the middle of the Mertoğlu family''s life. All of them have different wishes and expectations from their new lives, but the life of the Mertoğlu family is not as perfect as it seems. With the arrival of Güneş and her daughters, the secrets of the past will begin to be revealed one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/NZeAEg9XuxSMAxE5ecW4pH6QXy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64164'),
  ('407820149407109757', 'Sunday', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Melvin Kakooza, Magnus Millang', 'Jesper Rofelt, Søren Felbo, Emil Millang', 'Melvin Kakooza, Anders Brink Madsen, Lars Hjortshøj, Rikke Bilde, Thue Ersted Rasmussen, Nadia Kvist, Birthe Neumann, Kurt Dreyer', null, 'The trainer for FC Fredericia is sent to Kenya to find a talented player that can save the club.', 'The trainer for FC Fredericia is sent to Kenya to find a talented player that can save the club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6BbNTVqdJpa3qbsGLRt2G7CIbHt.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:90824'),
  ('683805682058618230', 'Sunday Brunch', 2012, null, null, null, 'Simon Rimmer, Tim Lovejoy', null, 'Sunday Brunch is a British television series, broadcast live on Channel 4 on Sunday mornings. It features cookery and interviews with celebrity guests.', 'Sunday Brunch is a British television series, broadcast live on Channel 4 on Sunday mornings. It features cookery and interviews with celebrity guests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovpSy8cFk5UbaQhGY3FLdEXVGfK.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:44963'),
  ('569044208967184061', 'Sunday Night Theatre', 1950, 'Drama', null, null, 'Oliver MacGreevy', null, 'Sunday Night Theatre was a long-running series of televised live television plays screened by BBC Television from early 1950 until 1959. The productions for the first five years or so of the run were re-staged live the following Thursday, partly because of technical limitations in this era, and the theatrical basis of early television drama. Some of the earliest collaborations between Rudolph Cartier and Nigel Neale were produced for this series, including Arrow to the Heart and Nineteen Eighty-Four. The Sunday night drama slot was subsequently renamed The Sunday-Night Play which ran for four seasons between 1960 and 1963. ITV transmitted its own unrelated run of Sunday Night Theatre between 1971 and 1974.', 'Sunday Night Theatre was a long-running series of televised live television plays screened by BBC Television from early 1950 until 1959. The productions for the first five years or so of the run were re-staged live the following Thursday, partly because of technical limitations in this era, and the theatrical basis of early television drama. Some of the earliest collaborations between Rudolph Cartier and Nigel Neale were produced for this series, including Arrow to the Heart and Nineteen Eighty-Four. The Sunday night drama slot was subsequently renamed The Sunday-Night Play which ran for four seasons between 1960 and 1963. ITV transmitted its own unrelated run of Sunday Night Theatre between 1971 and 1974.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/55UGSQ167w5MQJnYaekz7cRZxzl.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:21503'),
  ('89676069398479373', 'Sunday with Laura Kuenssberg', 2022, 'News, Talk', null, null, 'Laura Kuenssberg', null, 'The big names behind the big stories. Laura Kuenssberg talks to those making the news, inside and outside politics.', 'The big names behind the big stories. Laura Kuenssberg talks to those making the news, inside and outside politics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/le6vaFe9E0en3znFhy8eFhP3DQV.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:209415'),
  ('275022827535621400', 'Sunday Without God', 2013, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Aki Toyosaki, Daisuke Namikawa, Eri Kitamura, Koki Uchiyama, Mamiko Noto, Keiji Fujiwara, Mikako Komatsu, Tetsuya Kakihara', 'TV-MA', 'Since 15 years ago, no new lives are born... and no one can die. Then, "gravekeepers" appeared in the world, with the ability to give rest to the living dead. Therefore the people said, "God abandoned the World". Ai who is 12 years old, one of "gravekeepers". Her life changes, when an immortal gunman named Hampnie Hambart murders the residents of her small village. She learns the "truth of the world" from him, and decides to travel in order to save the world.', 'Since 15 years ago, no new lives are born... and no one can die. Then, "gravekeepers" appeared in the world, with the ability to give rest to the living dead. Therefore the people said, "God abandoned the World". Ai who is 12 years old, one of "gravekeepers". Her life changes, when an immortal gunman named Hampnie Hambart murders the residents of her small village. She learns the "truth of the world" from him, and decides to travel in order to save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvJOxuu7BT6fSq5zsGlW3JNNalX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:49473'),
  ('246337196153461233', 'Sunderland ''Til I Die', 2018, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'This docuseries follows English soccer club Sunderland through the 2017-18 season as they try to bounce back after relegation from the Premier League.', 'This docuseries follows English soccer club Sunderland through the 2017-18 season as they try to bounce back after relegation from the Premier League.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xBb1OvJxOTXtjdZDPfkzi5nXkAd.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:84777'),
  ('728613887639241471', 'Sunes jul', 1991, 'Family, Comedy', 'Sören Olsson, Anders Jacobsson', 'Anders Jacobsson, Sören Olsson', 'Andreas Hoffer, Peter Haber, Carina Lidbom, Gabriel Odenhammar, Nina Almlöf, Rebecka Liljeberg', null, 'Sune, an 11 year old boy struggles with girl troubles and school while he and his goofy family prepares for Christmas with failed attempts at all of the usual December traditions.', 'Sune, an 11 year old boy struggles with girl troubles and school while he and his goofy family prepares for Christmas with failed attempts at all of the usual December traditions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m91EM7ASw19lxLX4jduMicPSzjH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:33565'),
  ('1084456833477535598', 'Sunflower', 2021, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Vikas Bahl', null, 'Sunil Grover, Ranvir Shorey, Adah Sharma, Girish Kulkarni, Mukul Chadda, Radha Bhatt, Ashish Vidhyarthi, Sonal Jha', null, 'When Mr. Kapoor of Sunflower society is found dead, the cops arrive and interrogate the neighbours. In a society full of quirky characters, who must have killed Kapoor and why?', 'When Mr. Kapoor of Sunflower society is found dead, the cops arrive and interrogate the neighbours. In a society full of quirky characters, who must have killed Kapoor and why?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pnWtrlVsBWC68b10l8aPBLguTzB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:127332'),
  ('874071065547769879', 'Sungkyunkwan Scandal', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Kim Tae-hee', 'Park Min-young, MICKY Yoochun, Yoo Ah-in, Song Joong-ki, Kim Kap-soo, Lee Jae-yong, Ahn Nae-sang, Kim Ha-kyoon', null, 'In the Joseon dynasty, a female breadwinner takes a job as a substitute test-taker, but soon finds herself attending a men''s university in disguise.', 'In the Joseon dynasty, a female breadwinner takes a job as a substitute test-taker, but soon finds herself attending a men''s university in disguise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ybx2GDBkbzV2P8NUIj6r3U7ht3A.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34510'),
  ('84525538603017921', 'Sunny', 2024, 'Mystery, Drama, Comedy', 'Katie Robbins', 'Julissa Castillo', 'Rashida Jones, Hidetoshi Nishijima, Joanna Sotomura, Judy Ongg, YOU, annie the clumsy', 'TV-MA', 'The life of an American woman living in Kyoto, Japan, is upended when her husband and son disappear in a mysterious plane crash. As consolation, she''s given Sunny, one of a new class of domestic robots made by her husband''s electronics company.', 'The life of an American woman living in Kyoto, Japan, is upended when her husband and son disappear in a mysterious plane crash. As consolation, she''s given Sunny, one of a new class of domestic robots made by her husband''s electronics company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7x3rqEpps3msoQhBUJyiaXotGBL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157226');
