  ('157483707846446191', 'Sunnyside', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Kal Penn, Matt Murray', null, 'Kal Penn, Diana Maria Riva, Joel Kim Booster, Poppy Liu, Moses Storm, Samba Schutte, Kiran Deol', null, 'A disgraced New York politician who was the city''s youngest city councilman in history until he was brought down by a public intoxication incident gets an opportunity to rebuild his life when he is hired by a group of immigrants who hope to become American citizens.', 'A disgraced New York politician who was the city''s youngest city councilman in history until he was brought down by a public intoxication incident gets an opportunity to rebuild his life when he is hired by a group of immigrants who hope to become American citizens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pvnTGNaLKO7vpSLoGoUt38HYLcY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92634'),
  ('896046021891816700', 'Suno Chanda', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Ahson Talish', 'Saima Akram Chaudhry', 'Farhan Saeed, Iqra Aziz, Samina Ahmad, Farhan Ally Agha, Nadia Afgan, Sohail Sameer, Farah Shah, Adnan Shah Tipu', null, 'The series revolves around two people who hate each other but their families want them to marry. They make some plans to cancel their wedding but slowly get in love.', 'The series revolves around two people who hate each other but their families want them to marry. They make some plans to cancel their wedding but slowly get in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1yorViYBw5wdpToXfZReivdEri.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:80018'),
  ('569027603171500811', 'Sunset Beach', 1997, 'Soap, Drama', 'Josh Griffith, Robert Guza Jr., Charles Pratt, Jr.', null, 'Eddie Cibrian, Kathleen Noone, Nick Kiriazis, Lesley-Anne Down, Sarah Buxton, Susan Ward, Priscilla Garita, Timothy Adams', null, 'Sunset Beach is an American television soap opera that aired on NBC from January 6, 1997 to December 31, 1999. The show follows the loves and lives of the people living in the Orange County coastal area named Sunset Beach, on the coast of California. Although there is a town in California called Sunset Beach, the show''s beach scenes were shot on nearby Seal Beach. The show was co-produced by NBC and Spelling Television. Sunset Beach won two Daytime Emmy Awards and was nominated another eleven times. The show also received twenty-two nominations for various other awards.', 'Sunset Beach is an American television soap opera that aired on NBC from January 6, 1997 to December 31, 1999. The show follows the loves and lives of the people living in the Orange County coastal area named Sunset Beach, on the coast of California. Although there is a town in California called Sunset Beach, the show''s beach scenes were shot on nearby Seal Beach. The show was co-produced by NBC and Spelling Television. Sunset Beach won two Daytime Emmy Awards and was nominated another eleven times. The show also received twenty-two nominations for various other awards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b4wqMNq1v3oksZ1V88aemWxbx15.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2254'),
  ('28681350834283088', 'Sunset Vibes', 2024, 'Drama', 'Rosesarin', null, 'Panuwat Sopradit, Mondop Heamtan, Bovorn Kongnawdee, Rathasat Butwong, Anunta Teavirat, Kamollak Sangsubsin, Teachapat Pinrat, Wacharanon Seeduan', null, 'Salin dreamed of a mysterious man for years, but when the dreams stop, fate brings him face-to-face with Suriyen in real life.', 'Salin dreamed of a mysterious man for years, but when the dreams stop, fate brings him face-to-face with Suriyen in real life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2bS6TgPvRizGIer0RUFGeDzSVVK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:225355'),
  ('1059954251119754626', 'Sunsets Secrets Regrets', 2026, 'Crime, Mystery', '弃吴钩', '顾汉语', 'Jing Boran, Cai Wenjing, Qin Junjie, Zhao Xun, Du Yuan, Xu Honghao, Fu Chengpeng', null, 'A mysterious body by the Tong River resurfaces clues to a five-year-old case, bringing together three childhood friends—now a criminal investigator, a detective, and an undercover agent. As they pursue the truth behind multiple unsolved crimes, they navigate hidden dangers and unravel deep conspiracies.', 'A mysterious body by the Tong River resurfaces clues to a five-year-old case, bringing together three childhood friends—now a criminal investigator, a detective, and an undercover agent. As they pursue the truth behind multiple unsolved crimes, they navigate hidden dangers and unravel deep conspiracies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qwzV5Y24L5Brzi9ycvL2ynubYh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:281392'),
