  ('628491687053158566', 'Super Monsters', 2017, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy', 'Avi Arad', null, 'Alessandro Juliani, Vincent Tong, Andrea Libman, Erin Mathews, Britt McKillip', 'TV-Y', 'Preschool kids whose parents are the world''s most famous monsters try to master their special powers while preparing for kindergarten.', 'Preschool kids whose parents are the world''s most famous monsters try to master their special powers while preparing for kindergarten.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uB0Nxqva9znFojlLBgBJtEx6wIB.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:74495'),
  ('512211333248043619', 'Super Nova Games', 2018, 'Reality', null, null, 'Xu Mengjie, Zhong Qi, Sun Rui, Zhao Yue, Xuan Lu, Guan Yue, Ren Hao, Zhao Pinlin', null, 'The program brings together nearly 150 artists who cross the border to become athletes in the program to prepare for and compete in three categories of athletics, water sports and general events.', 'The program brings together nearly 150 artists who cross the border to become athletes in the program to prepare for and compete in three categories of athletics, water sports and general events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3exKhLmc09Jwtnw37VThZc2F6dK.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:84121'),
  ('957190360436489399', 'Super Pig', 1994, 'Comedy, Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids, Family', 'Taeko Ikeda', null, 'Yuri Shiratori, Yoshiharu Yamada, Rica Matsumoto, Tsutomu Kashiwakura, Yuriko Fuchizaki, Junko Asami, Wataru Takagi, Cho', null, 'One fateful day, Karin, a junior-high student, found what she thought was an injured piglet. However, the piglet was just exhausted from hunger. After the piglet regained his health by eating Karin''s apple, he revealed that he is a prince, Tonrariano III, from a planet called Booringo. Tonrariano wanted to reward Karin for helping him and so he transformed her into a pig with superpowers. Karin was not at all pleased with the gift because she wanted to become a pretty superheroine like "Cutey Chao" (a parody of Cutey Honey), not Super Pig. Reluctantly, she became more interested in her role as Super Pig when she found out that she can turn into someone like "Cutey Chao" if she can collect 108 pearls through doing good deeds for other people.', 'One fateful day, Karin, a junior-high student, found what she thought was an injured piglet. However, the piglet was just exhausted from hunger. After the piglet regained his health by eating Karin''s apple, he revealed that he is a prince, Tonrariano III, from a planet called Booringo. Tonrariano wanted to reward Karin for helping him and so he transformed her into a pig with superpowers. Karin was not at all pleased with the gift because she wanted to become a pretty superheroine like "Cutey Chao" (a parody of Cutey Honey), not Super Pig. Reluctantly, she became more interested in her role as Super Pig when she found out that she can turn into someone like "Cutey Chao" if she can collect 108 pearls through doing good deeds for other people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2B3eqlNIULKwo0X7qmwHf7W3rXd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71961'),
  ('197855932746446914', 'Super Pumped: The Battle for Uber', 2022, 'Drama', 'Brian Koppelman, David Levien', null, 'Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Kyle Chandler, Kerry Bishé, Babak Tafti, Jon Bass, Bridget Gao-Hollitt', 'TV-MA', 'Based on the shocking true story, strap in for the meteoric rise and fall of Uber founder, Travis Kalanick. With a lift from venture capitalist Bill Gurley and board member Arianna Huffington, Kalanick takes a win-at-all-costs approach to forge the fledgling start-up into a multi-billion-dollar tech titan. But every surge comes at a price – and as his visionary drive spirals out of control, it threatens to be the downfall of it all.', 'Based on the shocking true story, strap in for the meteoric rise and fall of Uber founder, Travis Kalanick. With a lift from venture capitalist Bill Gurley and board member Arianna Huffington, Kalanick takes a win-at-all-costs approach to forge the fledgling start-up into a multi-billion-dollar tech titan. But every surge comes at a price – and as his visionary drive spirals out of control, it threatens to be the downfall of it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGZ7Hv2VvPHKM0Pav6cHyX4jaLN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:126301'),
  ('486902423983942229', 'Super PupZ', 2022, 'Comedy, Family, Kids', 'Robert Vince', null, 'Dave Foley, Harland Williams, Michael Teigen, Brian George, Aria Birch, Davide Fair, April Cameron, Veena Sood', null, 'Four pups with superpowers team up to help their new friends and a furry alien comrade in this cuddly, cosmic adventure.', 'Four pups with superpowers team up to help their new friends and a furry alien comrade in this cuddly, cosmic adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8BGHRMBA7zBGI6LnbfG9DX3BG7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:194682'),
  ('946479805706496296', 'Super Rescue Solbrain', 1991, 'Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Kōichi Nakayama, Mitsue Mori, Seizo Kato, Hidenori Iura, Hiroshi Miyauchi, Masaki Terasoma, Takeshi Kuwabara', null, 'After the Winspector police team leaves Japan to fight crime in France, Chief Shunsuke Masaki realizes he must create a new police team to defend Tokyo from crime. He creates Solbrain – a high-tech special rescue force, expert in missions requiring rescue and firepower. Its leader is Daiki Nishio, a rookie detective who can use the Plus Up command in his car to transform into SolBraver. Other members are Reiko Higuchi, also able to use the Plus Up command to transform into SolJeanne, SolBraver''s female counterpart; and SolDozer, a yellow bulldozer robot.', 'After the Winspector police team leaves Japan to fight crime in France, Chief Shunsuke Masaki realizes he must create a new police team to defend Tokyo from crime. He creates Solbrain – a high-tech special rescue force, expert in missions requiring rescue and firepower. Its leader is Daiki Nishio, a rookie detective who can use the Plus Up command in his car to transform into SolBraver. Other members are Reiko Higuchi, also able to use the Plus Up command to transform into SolJeanne, SolBraver''s female counterpart; and SolDozer, a yellow bulldozer robot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjOR1YhVFLqPBjRhLECINppKNaE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3704'),
  ('101365070639108423', 'Super Robot Monkey Team Hyperforce Go!', 2004, 'Animation, Kids, Action & Adventure, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Ciro Nieli', 'Brandon Auman, Thomas Hart', 'Greg Cipes, Kevin Michael Richardson, Corey Feldman, Mark Hamill', 'TV-Y7', 'Super Robot Monkey Team Hyperforce Go! is an American/Japanese animated television series, and was created by Ciro Nieli, one of the directors of Teen Titans, with animation being done by a Japanese studio known as The Answer Studio. Set mainly on the fictional planet of Shuggazoom, the series follows the adventures of five cyborg monkeys and a human boy named Chiro as they struggle to protect their planet - and the rest of the universe - from the forces of evil. As is obvious from the visual appearance of the show, there is a significant anime influence present, despite being produced for American television. It was also influenced by Star Trek, Super Sentai, Voltron, and Star Wars. The show also contains various references to pop culture, a notable example being the episode "Season of the Skull", which is a parody of the 1970s thriller The Wicker Man.', 'Super Robot Monkey Team Hyperforce Go! is an American/Japanese animated television series, and was created by Ciro Nieli, one of the directors of Teen Titans, with animation being done by a Japanese studio known as The Answer Studio. Set mainly on the fictional planet of Shuggazoom, the series follows the adventures of five cyborg monkeys and a human boy named Chiro as they struggle to protect their planet - and the rest of the universe - from the forces of evil. As is obvious from the visual appearance of the show, there is a significant anime influence present, despite being produced for American television. It was also influenced by Star Trek, Super Sentai, Voltron, and Star Wars. The show also contains various references to pop culture, a notable example being the episode "Season of the Skull", which is a parody of the 1970s thriller The Wicker Man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gcTY3iHLC1wm9wB4pKn2vvCxCfK.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:3428'),
  ('656961025229115200', 'Super Sentai Strongest Battle!!', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Koichi Sakamoto, Naruhisa Arakawa', 'Naruhisa Arakawa', 'Ryota Ozawa, Yosuke Kishi, Ai Moritaka, Shunsuke Nishikawa, Masaki Nakao, Nana Asakawa, Tomokazu Seki, Cho', null, 'The story begins when a mysterious girl named Rita gathers heroes from Super Sentai teams to the planet Nemesis. The heroes are told that any wish they desire will come true if they can win the “Super Sentai Strongest Battle” tournament!', 'The story begins when a mysterious girl named Rita gathers heroes from Super Sentai teams to the planet Nemesis. The heroes are told that any wish they desire will come true if they can win the “Super Sentai Strongest Battle” tournament!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7fbsnHwqfcYrAdQKZjDJH9AU6U.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85198'),
  ('757124443394251750', 'Super Sentai Zyuranger', 1992, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, 'Yuuta Mochizuki, Seiju Umon, Hideki Fujiwara, Takumi Hashimoto, Reiko Chiba, Shirô Izumi, Machiko Soga, Jun Tatara', 'TV-PG', 'Five young warriors from the ancient civilization of Dinosaur-evolved Humans are awakened in the present day after 170 million years of suspended animation when their sworn enemy, Bandora the Witch, is inadvertently released from her magical container on Planet Nemesis by two astronauts. The five warriors, the Zyurangers, must summon the power of mechanical-looking deities known as the Guardian Beasts, each modeled after a different prehistoric beast, in order to protect mankind from Bandora''s evil forces.', 'Five young warriors from the ancient civilization of Dinosaur-evolved Humans are awakened in the present day after 170 million years of suspended animation when their sworn enemy, Bandora the Witch, is inadvertently released from her magical container on Planet Nemesis by two astronauts. The five warriors, the Zyurangers, must summon the power of mechanical-looking deities known as the Guardian Beasts, each modeled after a different prehistoric beast, in order to protect mankind from Bandora''s evil forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uCx5e9u4f43Afhpvycad1giUU4e.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12114'),
  ('344285234091283076', 'Super Shiro', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Akio Otsuka, Mari Mashiba, Anri Katsu, Yukana', 'TV-PG', 'The Nohara family dog Shiro becomes a superhero and protects the legendary bone "Bobobobobone" from the evil inventor dog Dekapoo and his ambitions of world domination.', 'The Nohara family dog Shiro becomes a superhero and protects the legendary bone "Bobobobobone" from the evil inventor dog Dekapoo and his ambitions of world domination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDYOQEXxAx3t8sJXABVSNbwQfwh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94572'),
  ('372577886858973608', 'Super Shore', 2016, 'Reality', null, null, 'Luis Caballero, Igor Freitas, Víctor Ortiz, Isaac Torres, Jaime "Ferre" Ferrera, Adela Hernández, Danik Michell, Elettra Lamborghini', 'NR', 'Super Shore is a co-production between MTV Spain and MTV Latin American. Four casts member from Acapulco Shore, three members from Gandia Shore, and two new characters are the main characters.', 'Super Shore is a co-production between MTV Spain and MTV Latin American. Four casts member from Acapulco Shore, three members from Gandia Shore, and two new characters are the main characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sC2Z3pKUBD71tt6uBgl6frSkmvL.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:65667'),
  ('577423671301171478', 'Super Simple Draw', 2025, 'Animation', null, null, 'Steven Shanahan, Kathryn Durst', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ohFXoseOBEF5FQuzYFYrtNuEWSQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:296532'),
  ('722809700371437350', 'Super Singer', 2006, 'Reality', 'Pradeep Milroy Peter', null, 'Ma Ka Pa Anand, Priyanka Deshpande, Mysskin, S. Thaman, Anuradha Sriram, P. Unnikrishnan, Gangai Amaran', null, 'Super Singer is a reality-based Indian singing competition in Tamil language that aired on STAR Vijay. The program seeks to discover the best singing talent in Tamil Nadu through a series of statewide auditions. The show is sponsored by the mobile service provider, Airtel. The show debuted in 2006 and has completed its three seasons,presently in fourth season. The winner of event gets a chance to sing a Tamil movie song. The show usually airs on All Weekday nights in India and is telecast worldwide through partner broadcasting networks.', 'Super Singer is a reality-based Indian singing competition in Tamil language that aired on STAR Vijay. The program seeks to discover the best singing talent in Tamil Nadu through a series of statewide auditions. The show is sponsored by the mobile service provider, Airtel. The show debuted in 2006 and has completed its three seasons,presently in fourth season. The winner of event gets a chance to sing a Tamil movie song. The show usually airs on All Weekday nights in India and is telecast worldwide through partner broadcasting networks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vThkUfJOferJ69yuCCniB7AFRT8.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:17964'),
  ('518201877654424726', 'Super Sketch Show', 2021, 'Reality', 'Ma Dong', null, 'Ma Dong, Huang Bo, Yu Hewei, Li Dan, Song Tianshuo, Jerry Liu, Yuwen Qiushi, Teng Gen', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aqEj2RPkxNW6VmZtDuJGGohtLZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:136503'),
