  ('908692591045796542', 'Supersex', 2024, 'Drama', null, null, 'Alessandro Borghi, Jasmine Trinca, Adriano Giannini', 'TV-MA', 'Inspired by true events, this is the story of how Rocco Siffredi escaped a humble life and emerged as the world''s greatest porn star.', 'Inspired by true events, this is the story of how Rocco Siffredi escaped a humble life and emerged as the world''s greatest porn star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9tSS4VeR5lYzny2c6Fj6lgYszRP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211079'),
  ('508533372729124403', 'Superstar', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Nacho Vigalondo', null, 'Ingrid García Jonsson, Rocío Ibáñez, Secun de la Rosa, Carlos Areces, Pepón Nieto, Natalia de Molina, Julián Villagrán, Nacho Vigalondo', null, 'Set deep in the chaos of the early 2000s, this series reimagines the life of pop icon Tamara — and her metamorphosis into Yurena — as never seen before.', 'Set deep in the chaos of the early 2000s, this series reimagines the life of pop icon Tamara — and her metamorphosis into Yurena — as never seen before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OJsdTo8iXGsH9JPKt17ikDD9wt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:243456'),
  ('1059798150179244594', 'Superstition', 2017, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Mystery', 'Mario Van Peebles, Joel Anderson Thompson', 'Joel Anderson Thompson', 'Brad James, Demetria McKinney, W. Earl Brown, Robinne Lee, Page Falkinburg Jr.', 'TV-14', 'The Mosley family keeps the secrets and dark history of a town located on the outskirts of New Orleans that is also a landing patch for the world''s darkest manifestations of fear, guided into the world by a mysterious malefactor named The Dredge.', 'The Mosley family keeps the secrets and dark history of a town located on the outskirts of New Orleans that is also a landing patch for the world''s darkest manifestations of fear, guided into the world by a mysterious malefactor named The Dredge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qQ9XiufNl4R0fH6YrX6FFpLDdav.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74104'),
  ('708133102300280277', 'Superstore', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Justin Spitzer', null, 'Ben Feldman, Lauren Ash, Colton Dunn, Nico Santos, Nichole Sakura, Mark McKinney, Kaliko Kauahi', 'TV-14', 'A hilarious workplace comedy about a unique family of employees at a super-sized mega store. From the bright-eyed newbies and the seen-it-all veterans to the clueless summer hires and the in-it-for-life managers, together they hilariously tackle the day-to-day grind of rabid bargain hunters, riot-causing sales and nap-worthy training sessions.', 'A hilarious workplace comedy about a unique family of employees at a super-sized mega store. From the bright-eyed newbies and the seen-it-all veterans to the clueless summer hires and the in-it-for-life managers, together they hilariously tackle the day-to-day grind of rabid bargain hunters, riot-causing sales and nap-worthy training sessions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tpY5qIYwH85njvjI5BnH4VNA6p.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:62649'),
  ('204094219021780588', 'Superstorm', 2007, 'Drama', null, null, 'JR Bourne, Tom Sizemore, Chris Potter, Nicola Stephenson, Nicolas Wright, Cas Anvar, Jana Carpenter', null, 'Superstorm is a three-part British docudrama miniseries written and directed by Julian Simpson, about a group of scientists that try to divert and weaken hurricanes using cloud seeding. Superstorm originally aired on BBC One for a period of three weeks, totaling three 59 minute episodes, from 15 April 2007 to 29 April 2007. Each episode was followed by a half-hour documentary on BBC Two on extreme weather monitoring and forecasting, called The Science of Superstorms. The series was also aired on the Discovery Channel in the U.S. and Canada during the summer of 2007. Superstorm is a co-production of BBC Worldwide, Discovery Channel and ProSieben, in association with M6 and NHK. Ailsa Orr and Michael Mosley, who made also Supervolcano, are the executive producers for BBC, while Jack E. Smith is the executive producer for Discovery Channel. The miniseries was released on DVD in the United Kingdom on 2 July 2007.', 'Superstorm is a three-part British docudrama miniseries written and directed by Julian Simpson, about a group of scientists that try to divert and weaken hurricanes using cloud seeding. Superstorm originally aired on BBC One for a period of three weeks, totaling three 59 minute episodes, from 15 April 2007 to 29 April 2007. Each episode was followed by a half-hour documentary on BBC Two on extreme weather monitoring and forecasting, called The Science of Superstorms. The series was also aired on the Discovery Channel in the U.S. and Canada during the summer of 2007. Superstorm is a co-production of BBC Worldwide, Discovery Channel and ProSieben, in association with M6 and NHK. Ailsa Orr and Michael Mosley, who made also Supervolcano, are the executive producers for BBC, while Jack E. Smith is the executive producer for Discovery Channel. The miniseries was released on DVD in the United Kingdom on 2 July 2007.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHU51HpvTeoQKWi2ZqzuAtWT4cp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4832'),
  ('35373737945079598', 'Superstructures: Engineering Marvels', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Trevor Cooper', 'TV-G', 'An exploration of engineering marvels. This brand new series reveals the extraordinary feats of engineering hidden inside the world''s most spectacular man-made constructions. From the world''s biggest plane and largest free-spanning dome to the tallest building and the largest space ship, each superstructure is taken apart using state-of-the-art CGI and insight from world class specialists to reveal the startling innovations that turn it from dream to reality.', 'An exploration of engineering marvels. This brand new series reveals the extraordinary feats of engineering hidden inside the world''s most spectacular man-made constructions. From the world''s biggest plane and largest free-spanning dome to the tallest building and the largest space ship, each superstructure is taken apart using state-of-the-art CGI and insight from world class specialists to reveal the startling innovations that turn it from dream to reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejlflHpUTbeFO46RFXbODzwR4IK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95239'),
  ('963707597747349762', 'SuperTed', 1983, 'Animation, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Mike Young', null, 'Victor Spinetti, Roy Kinnear, Melvyn Hayes, Sheila Steafel, Jon Pertwee, Derek Griffiths, Peter Hawkins', null, 'SuperTed is a Welsh fictional anthropomorphic bear character created by Mike Young. Originally created by Young as a series of stories to help his son overcome his fear of the dark, SuperTed became a popular series of books and led to an animated series produced from 1982 to 1986.', 'SuperTed is a Welsh fictional anthropomorphic bear character created by Mike Young. Originally created by Young as a series of stories to help his son overcome his fear of the dark, SuperTed became a popular series of books and led to an animated series produced from 1982 to 1986.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vYYT8V6lioLQ1OkhkIKiL1Q9gQ9.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:705'),
  ('414979749870539240', 'Supertorpe', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Tomás Yankelevich', null, 'Candela Vetrano, Facundo Parolari, Pablo Martínez, Chen Min, Olivia Viggiano, Adriana Salonia, Fabián Pizzorno, Pía Uribelarrea', null, 'Supertorpe is an Argentinian series targeted at children and teenagers. The show is distributed worldwide by Disney Channel and Telefe Internacional, and locally by Telefe.', 'Supertorpe is an Argentinian series targeted at children and teenagers. The show is distributed worldwide by Disney Channel and Telefe Internacional, and locally by Telefe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jEwE7JmRjDuZFgOOzHYqJ1unDm4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:44067'),
  ('535827087848350316', 'Supervillain: The Making of Tekashi 6ix9ine', 2021, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, '6ix9ine, Giancarlo Esposito', 'TV-MA', 'This three-part documentary series profiles hip-hop artist Tekashi 6ix9ine''s epic rise to notoriety. Director Karam Gill examines the culture of manufactured celebrity through 6ix9ine''s mastery of social media.', 'This three-part documentary series profiles hip-hop artist Tekashi 6ix9ine''s epic rise to notoriety. Director Karam Gill examines the culture of manufactured celebrity through 6ix9ine''s mastery of social media.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9oqNsuspnnXZKpWHU9i55OLTVbB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:118570'),
