  ('689643081157299725', 'Supreme God Emperor', 2020, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Xie Tian', null, '溪林, 忻子约, Shuai Guan, 季骜杰, 钟巍, Zhang Ni, Xiang Xu, Akira明', null, 'Ten thousand years after his betrayal, Immortal King Mu Yun awakens in the body of a "useless" young man. With hidden alchemy skills and the Slaughter Immortal Diagram, he cures Qin Mengyao, uncovering her Ice Phoenix spirit. As their bond grows, jealous rival Dongfang Yu seeks revenge. Mu Yun embarks on a training journey—unaware assassins await their chance to strike.', 'Ten thousand years after his betrayal, Immortal King Mu Yun awakens in the body of a "useless" young man. With hidden alchemy skills and the Slaughter Immortal Diagram, he cures Qin Mengyao, uncovering her Ice Phoenix spirit. As their bond grows, jealous rival Dongfang Yu seeks revenge. Mu Yun embarks on a training journey—unaware assassins await their chance to strike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8vmZErkbw5d5iwXHO23zVmvixOB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107116'),
  ('285355801902994541', 'Supreme Team', 2022, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'LL Cool J, Gerald ''Prince'' Miller, Kenneth McGriff', null, 'This limited docuseries takes an in-depth look at the notorious Queens, New York gang, and tells the real story from the mouths of its two leaders and family members, Kenneth “Supreme” McGriff and Gerald “Prince" Miller.', 'This limited docuseries takes an in-depth look at the notorious Queens, New York gang, and tells the real story from the mouths of its two leaders and family members, Kenneth “Supreme” McGriff and Gerald “Prince" Miller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6gTKBIIHIWA32eNEY0bV5Bku6fS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204672'),
  ('838486681289777400', 'Surely Tomorrow', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Im Hyeon-wook', null, 'Park Seo-jun, Won Ji-an, Lee El, Lee Zoo-young, Kang Ki-doong, Cho Min-guk, Kang Mal-geum, Han Eun-seong', null, 'In their twenties, Lee Kyeong-do and Seo Ji-woo part ways after two passionate relationships. A decade later, they meet again as a reporter who covers an adultery scandal and the wife of the man at the center of that scandal. Reuniting in their late thirties, their youth has passed, but their love remains vivid. Kyeong-do now strives to prove to her and to himself that he still loves her.', 'In their twenties, Lee Kyeong-do and Seo Ji-woo part ways after two passionate relationships. A decade later, they meet again as a reporter who covers an adultery scandal and the wife of the man at the center of that scandal. Reuniting in their late thirties, their youth has passed, but their love remains vivid. Kyeong-do now strives to prove to her and to himself that he still loves her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9xPcIsxXbc1Xuf45K0FU8yM2m5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:281005'),
  ('200661608884280045', 'Surface', 2005, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Josh Pate, Jonas Pate', null, 'Lake Bell, Jay R. Ferguson, Carter Jenkins, Leighton Meester, Ian Anthony Dale, Eddie Hassell', 'TV-PG', 'A marine biologist, an insurance salesman and a teenage boy find their lives changed when a new and often dangerous sea life species emerges, while the government tries to keep the affair under wraps.', 'A marine biologist, an insurance salesman and a teenage boy find their lives changed when a new and often dangerous sea life species emerges, while the government tries to keep the affair under wraps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipFnYr4VpVKVOzKTPPtNEVImZaE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3486'),
  ('912614404488164146', 'Surface', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Veronica West', 'Scott Barrett', 'Gugu Mbatha-Raw, Oliver Jackson-Cohen, Millie Brady, Phil Dunster, Gavin Drea, Freida Pinto, Rupert Graves, Joely Richardson', 'TV-MA', 'A traumatic head injury leaves Sophie with extreme memory loss. In her quest to put the pieces of her life back together—with help from her husband and friends—Sophie begins to question the truth behind her picture-perfect life.', 'A traumatic head injury leaves Sophie with extreme memory loss. In her quest to put the pieces of her life back together—with help from her husband and friends—Sophie begins to question the truth behind her picture-perfect life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5wPNto4AHCczZ62QRWycUuBOuyT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:127641'),
  ('254148830942196458', 'Surface', 2025, 'Crime', 'Catherine Touzet, Marie Deshaires', null, 'Laura Smet, Tomer Sisley, Théo Costa-Marini, Florence Muller, Otis Ngoi, Quentin Laclotte, Pauline Serieys, Luc-Antoine Diquéro', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8aNHx7dvSFu7AtgOhImlhR9dACU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:237670'),
  ('212238230284166522', 'Surfside 6', 1960, 'Drama', null, null, 'Troy Donahue, Van Williams, Lee Patterson, Diane McBain, Margarita Sierra', null, 'Surfside 6 was an ABC television series which aired from 1960 to 1962. The show centered on a Miami Beach detective agency set on a houseboat and featured Troy Donahue as Sandy Winfield II; Van Williams as Kenny Madison; and Lee Patterson as Dave Thorne. Diane McBain co-starred as socialite Daphne Dutton, whose yacht was berthed next to their houseboat. Margarita Sierra also had a supporting role as Cha Cha O''Brien, an entertainer who worked at The Boom Boom Room, a popular Miami Beach hangout at the Fontainebleau Hotel, directly across the street from Surfside 6. Surfside 6 was in fact a real address in Miami Beach, where an unrelated houseboat was moored at the time; it can also be seen in the sweeping aerial establishing shot of the Fontainebleu in 1964''s Goldfinger.', 'Surfside 6 was an ABC television series which aired from 1960 to 1962. The show centered on a Miami Beach detective agency set on a houseboat and featured Troy Donahue as Sandy Winfield II; Van Williams as Kenny Madison; and Lee Patterson as Dave Thorne. Diane McBain co-starred as socialite Daphne Dutton, whose yacht was berthed next to their houseboat. Margarita Sierra also had a supporting role as Cha Cha O''Brien, an entertainer who worked at The Boom Boom Room, a popular Miami Beach hangout at the Fontainebleau Hotel, directly across the street from Surfside 6. Surfside 6 was in fact a real address in Miami Beach, where an unrelated houseboat was moored at the time; it can also be seen in the sweeping aerial establishing shot of the Fontainebleu in 1964''s Goldfinger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqCKiWLr9vs4YOgnREDFKPFliHF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2627'),
  ('715692139653635676', 'Surfside Girls', 2022, 'Family, Mystery', 'May Chan, Alex Diaz, Julie Sagalowsky Diaz', null, 'Miya Cech, YaYa Gosselin, Spencer Hermes-Rebello', 'TV-G', 'Quick wits lead to daring discoveries for beachside besties Sam and Jade as they sleuth out supernatural mysteries in their sleepy hometown of Surfside.', 'Quick wits lead to daring discoveries for beachside besties Sam and Jade as they sleuth out supernatural mysteries in their sleepy hometown of Surfside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4UsNYs4BiEy3hQd76fCmAOYIZ97.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:153307'),
  ('89127827499103738', 'Surge', 2021, 'Drama', 'Sébastien Drouin, Julien Bittner', null, 'Golshifteh Farahani, Nicolas Phong Pheth, Vincent Heneine, Gringe, Doudou Masta', null, 'Nora is a night driver for a ride sharing company. Addicted to amphetamines, her life is falling apart: she is drowning in debts, divorced, and she''s now sleeping in her car to save enough money to rent an apartment and obtain joint custody of her daughter. When her brother Ben (also a driver) crashes his car, Nora offers to deliver a strange package for him and ends up being generously paid. Without realizing it, Nora is now bound to a mysterious and dangerous underground network. Tonight will be the darkest night of her life.', 'Nora is a night driver for a ride sharing company. Addicted to amphetamines, her life is falling apart: she is drowning in debts, divorced, and she''s now sleeping in her car to save enough money to rent an apartment and obtain joint custody of her daughter. When her brother Ben (also a driver) crashes his car, Nora offers to deliver a strange package for him and ends up being generously paid. Without realizing it, Nora is now bound to a mysterious and dangerous underground network. Tonight will be the darkest night of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/myLQjcFDHkyQOP1MMnH97dfFDsF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:136205'),
  ('248306578591471452', 'Surgeons', 2017, 'Drama', null, 'Zhu Zhu', 'Zhou Le, Jin Zehao, Li Jiahang, Jin Dong, Bai Baihe, Liu Yijun, Hu Ge, Ning Wentong', null, 'Renhe Hospital nurse Zhang Shumei is forced to resign after being suspected of accidentally killing a patient. Zhang Shumei’s 4 year old daughter is abducted, and she herself dies in a car accident a couple of years later. 30 years later, Zhang Shumei’s son Zhuang Shu returns to the hospital as a surgeon who is intent on unraveling the secret behind his family’s misfortune.', 'Renhe Hospital nurse Zhang Shumei is forced to resign after being suspected of accidentally killing a patient. Zhang Shumei’s 4 year old daughter is abducted, and she herself dies in a car accident a couple of years later. 30 years later, Zhang Shumei’s son Zhuang Shu returns to the hospital as a surgeon who is intent on unraveling the secret behind his family’s misfortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1NkSNXgnw45zQEi0d6qwRSNxX5N.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71272'),
  ('109534569893959524', 'SurrealEstate', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'George R. Olson', null, 'Tim Rozon, Sarah Levy, Maurice Dean Wint', 'TV-14', 'Aided by his own remarkable abilities and an eclectic team of associates, real estate agent Luke Roman specializes in “metaphysically engaged properties,” aka haunted houses. Together they investigate, clear and close the houses nobody else can.', 'Aided by his own remarkable abilities and an eclectic team of associates, real estate agent Luke Roman specializes in “metaphysically engaged properties,” aka haunted houses. Together they investigate, clear and close the houses nobody else can.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yrwNLzth5FjydiXJK1I1tOKdAFs.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:106148'),
  ('1066890393721911897', 'Survival Game Club', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Ayaka Ohashi, Rumi Okubo, Lynn, Yumi Uchiyama, Nao Toyama', 'TV-G', 'Momoka is a high school student who''s mastered the art of blending in after transferring from one school to another several times. Despite her ability to fly under the radar, she finds herself recruited by her new school''s survival game club. Most of the other girls in the club are a bit eccentric in one way or another: there''s the wealthy gun nut, the cosplaying otaku, and the seemingly cute girl with a terrifying dark side. Momoka, however, is just as eccentric herself.', 'Momoka is a high school student who''s mastered the art of blending in after transferring from one school to another several times. Despite her ability to fly under the radar, she finds herself recruited by her new school''s survival game club. Most of the other girls in the club are a bit eccentric in one way or another: there''s the wealthy gun nut, the cosplaying otaku, and the seemingly cute girl with a terrifying dark side. Momoka, however, is just as eccentric herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5giOngzsnaTzSvyI7RQs9Q3ytdR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61424'),
  ('397332745340196019', 'Survival of the Thickest', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michelle Buteau, Danielle Sanchez-Witzel', null, 'Michelle Buteau, Tone Bell, Tasha Smith', 'TV-MA', 'Black, plus-size and newly single, Mavis unexpectedly finds herself having to rebuild her life after putting all her eggs in one man''s basket, but she''s determined to not only survive but thrive with the support of her chosen family.', 'Black, plus-size and newly single, Mavis unexpectedly finds herself having to rebuild her life after putting all her eggs in one man''s basket, but she''s determined to not only survive but thrive with the support of her chosen family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sD8RToyFl1oMF3kXgkeSmSsJIpa.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:227139'),
  ('805706639406114820', 'Survive', 2020, 'Drama', null, null, 'Sophie Turner, Corey Hawkins', 'TV-MA', 'Jane''s plane crashes on a remote snow-covered mountain and she, along with Paul, the only remaining survivors, must pull themselves out of the wreckage and fight for their lives. Together they embark on a harrowing journey out of the wilderness, battling brutal conditions and personal traumas.', 'Jane''s plane crashes on a remote snow-covered mountain and she, along with Paul, the only remaining survivors, must pull themselves out of the wreckage and fight for their lives. Together they embark on a harrowing journey out of the wilderness, battling brutal conditions and personal traumas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/stere2OYFYoqj6LTGm0XXWUcKYy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99248'),
  ('707683712988784790', 'Survive Your Family', 2026, 'Reality', 'Art Rooijakkers', null, 'Art Rooijakkers', null, 'The program pits four teams (consisting of a celebrity and three loved ones) against each other in a battle in nature. Think of families, close friendships, colleagues, or artists who feel connected to each other. Each team is split in two: two members become survivors, two become providers.', 'The program pits four teams (consisting of a celebrity and three loved ones) against each other in a battle in nature. Think of families, close friendships, colleagues, or artists who feel connected to each other. Each team is split in two: two members become survivors, two become providers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/73Umg54qYaOutFEnXFIJoqhaZb7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:305869'),
  ('542431874752200578', 'Surviving Black Hawk Down', 2025, 'Documentary, War & Politics', 'Sam Hobkinson, Jack Macinnes', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'In extraordinary detail, US soldiers and Somali fighters recall the 1993 Battle of Mogadishu and the now-famous downing of three Black Hawk helicopters.', 'In extraordinary detail, US soldiers and Somali fighters recall the 1993 Battle of Mogadishu and the now-famous downing of three Black Hawk helicopters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/K2pPWcpbkcnECZaUcgYVjPFMHL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:282201'),
  ('1079167571709904333', 'Surviving Death', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'What happens after we die? This docuseries explores personal stories and research on near-death experiences, reincarnation and paranormal phenomena.', 'What happens after we die? This docuseries explores personal stories and research on near-death experiences, reincarnation and paranormal phenomena.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xk87pgtyn7Kib8iV8yhmH0CnsWx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:115391'),
  ('207639491300072697', 'Surviving Escobar - Alias JJ', 2017, 'Drama, Crime', 'John Jairo Velásquez', 'Gerardo Pinzón, Johnny A. Ortiz', 'Juan Pablo Urrego, Toto Vega, Ramsés Ramos, Nicole Santamaría, Natasha Klauss, Amparo Grisales, Luis Mesa, Roberto Mateos', 'TV-MA', 'As the Medellín Cartel crumbles, Pablo Escobar''s No. 1 hit man struggles to stay alive and gain respect in the prison hierarchy.', 'As the Medellín Cartel crumbles, Pablo Escobar''s No. 1 hit man struggles to stay alive and gain respect in the prison hierarchy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iaIFLYKIInDohWnq2Lm63PKipi6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70828'),
  ('297106271981479754', 'Surviving Jack', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Justin Halpern, Patrick Schumacker', null, 'Christopher Meloni, Rachael Harris, Connor Buckley, Claudia Lee, Kevin Hernandez, Tyler Foden, Mell Bowser', null, 'A boy becomes a man, and a man becomes a father, in a time before coming of age was something you could Google.', 'A boy becomes a man, and a man becomes a father, in a time before coming of age was something you could Google.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mDbKt7W6wQRg59dpGJUY8r9HNx2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60772'),
  ('493638490604088798', 'Surviving R. Kelly', 2019, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'R. Kelly', 'TV-14', 'Celebrated as one of the greatest R&B singers of all time, R. Kelly’s genre defining career and playboy lifestyle has been riddled with rumors of abuse, predatory behavior, and pedophilia. Despite damning evidence and multiple witnesses, to date, none of these accusations have seemingly affected him. For the first time ever, survivors and people from R. Kelly’s inner circle, are coming forward with new allegations about his sexual, mental, and physical abuse. They are now finally ready to share their full story and shed light on the secret life the public has never seen.', 'Celebrated as one of the greatest R&B singers of all time, R. Kelly’s genre defining career and playboy lifestyle has been riddled with rumors of abuse, predatory behavior, and pedophilia. Despite damning evidence and multiple witnesses, to date, none of these accusations have seemingly affected him. For the first time ever, survivors and people from R. Kelly’s inner circle, are coming forward with new allegations about his sexual, mental, and physical abuse. They are now finally ready to share their full story and shed light on the secret life the public has never seen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nH0q0ePjZKfqXRe70oueVJ5rDDS.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:85389'),
  ('1037488321100659592', 'Surviving Science!', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Satsumi Matsuda, Megumi Han, Hiroshi Iwasaki, Mikako Komatsu, Yumi Uchiyama, Rie Kugimiya, Yoko Hikasa', null, 'The series follows children in various adventurous situations while weaving information about science into the story.', 'The series follows children in various adventurous situations while weaving information about science into the story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8TIcdVfwqHETerctw4byya1aZnY.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:259789'),
  ('973295839726625132', 'Surviving Summer', 2022, 'Drama', 'Josh Mapleston, Joanna Werner', null, 'Sky Katz, Kai Lewins, Lilliana Bowrey, Savannah La Rain, Joao Marinho, Annabel Wolfe, Josh MacQueen', 'TV-PG', 'Rebellious Brooklyn teen Summer Torres is sent to live with family friends in the tiny town of Shorehaven on the Great Ocean Road, Victoria, AUS. Despite her best efforts, Summer falls in love with the town, the people and the surf.', 'Rebellious Brooklyn teen Summer Torres is sent to live with family friends in the tiny town of Shorehaven on the Great Ocean Road, Victoria, AUS. Despite her best efforts, Summer falls in love with the town, the people and the surf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zJTi8sM9fvpYhZmxysVQnG4OFM9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:129141'),
  ('1134486107703910676', 'Survivor', 2000, 'Reality', 'Mark Burnett, Charlie Parsons', null, 'Jeff Probst', 'TV-PG', 'A reality show contest where sixteen or more castaways split between two or more “Tribes” are taken to a remote isolated location and are forced to live off the land with meager supplies for roughly 39 days. Frequent physical challenges are used to pit the tribes against each other for rewards, such as food or luxuries, or for “Immunity”, forcing the other tribe to attend “Tribal Council”, where they must vote off one of their players.', 'A reality show contest where sixteen or more castaways split between two or more “Tribes” are taken to a remote isolated location and are forced to live off the land with meager supplies for roughly 39 days. Frequent physical challenges are used to pit the tribes against each other for rewards, such as food or luxuries, or for “Immunity”, forcing the other tribe to attend “Tribal Council”, where they must vote off one of their players.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1usR1nanbDvnc0LJlWd5TOylT9M.jpg', 50, 'tmdb:tv:14658'),
  ('929588958569838870', 'Survivor Česko a Slovensko', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Ondřej Novotný', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/B7qnTrKQ4WbQZmMLnwSw3v9CL9.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:155847'),
  ('551034998440686685', 'Survivor Québec', 2023, 'Reality', null, 'Yan Bilodeau', 'Patrice Bélanger', null, 'For over 40 days days, 20 players isolated on an exotic island in the Philippines will face extreme mental and physical challenges. They will have to use strategy to survive the eliminations in order to become the sole survivor and get their hands on the $100,000 grand prize!', 'For over 40 days days, 20 players isolated on an exotic island in the Philippines will face extreme mental and physical challenges. They will have to use strategy to survive the eliminations in order to become the sole survivor and get their hands on the $100,000 grand prize!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ur3ui4ueknPN6vHTowo1BQKhs4g.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:210479'),
  ('773534718736793950', 'Survivor Romania', 2020, 'Reality', 'Charlie Parsons, Acun Ilıcalı', null, 'Adrian Vasile', null, 'Survivor România is a Romanian reality game show based on the international Survivor format. The season premiered on 18 January 2020 on Kanal D. Following the basic premise of other international versions of the format, it features a group of contestants who are marooned in an isolated location, where they must provide food, water, fire, and shelter for themselves. The contestants compete in challenges for rewards and immunity from elimination. The contestants are progressively eliminated from the game until only one remains and is given the title of "Sole Survivor" and awarded the grand prize. The first two seasons''s "Sole Survivor" received the prize of €50.000. By the third season, the prize for the winner got bumped up to €100.000.', 'Survivor România is a Romanian reality game show based on the international Survivor format. The season premiered on 18 January 2020 on Kanal D. Following the basic premise of other international versions of the format, it features a group of contestants who are marooned in an isolated location, where they must provide food, water, fire, and shelter for themselves. The contestants compete in challenges for rewards and immunity from elimination. The contestants are progressively eliminated from the game until only one remains and is given the title of "Sole Survivor" and awarded the grand prize. The first two seasons''s "Sole Survivor" received the prize of €50.000. By the third season, the prize for the winner got bumped up to €100.000.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zJjRVNsLWgxO7dYme6EbQTR6hGd.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:217972'),
  ('1069640904225314648', 'Survivor''s Remorse', 2014, 'Drama', 'Mike O''Malley', null, 'Jessie T. Usher, RonReaco Lee, Teyonah Parris, Mike Epps, Erica Ash, Tichina Arnold', 'TV-MA', 'Cam Calloway is about to find out the price he''ll pay for stardom, love and loyalty. A basketball star in his early 20s, Calloway''s life changes after he signs a multimillion-dollar contract with a team in Atlanta. He arrives in Georgia bright-eyed and eager to begin his career, joined by cousin and confidant Reggie Vaughn, who tries to keep Cam focused and free from distractions caused by Cam''s blunt-but-loyal sister M-Chuck and opportunistic mom Cassie. Feeling a responsibility to support needy family and friends, Cam wrestles with the rewards and pitfalls of sudden wealth and fame.', 'Cam Calloway is about to find out the price he''ll pay for stardom, love and loyalty. A basketball star in his early 20s, Calloway''s life changes after he signs a multimillion-dollar contract with a team in Atlanta. He arrives in Georgia bright-eyed and eager to begin his career, joined by cousin and confidant Reggie Vaughn, who tries to keep Cam focused and free from distractions caused by Cam''s blunt-but-loyal sister M-Chuck and opportunistic mom Cassie. Feeling a responsibility to support needy family and friends, Cam wrestles with the rewards and pitfalls of sudden wealth and fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1kJwkzdsGKlmRrK8HIOCgGtw6oU.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:61469'),
  ('1094196255177141318', 'Survivorman', 2005, 'Documentary, Reality', 'Les Stroud', null, 'Les Stroud', 'TV-PG', 'In this harrowing reality series, “Survivorman” Les Stroud travels to far-flung locales with little more than the clothes on his back and 50 pounds of camera equipment to battle - and try to survive - insanely harsh conditions.', 'In this harrowing reality series, “Survivorman” Les Stroud travels to far-flung locales with little more than the clothes on his back and 50 pounds of camera equipment to battle - and try to survive - insanely harsh conditions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8c8zrnmsAnTtSW1Eo4QHrOzDW0o.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:4437'),
  ('890275465140008996', 'Survivors', 1975, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Terry Nation', null, 'Lucy Fleming, Ian McCulloch, Denis Lill, Lorna Lewis, John Abineri, Stephen Dudley, Gordon Salkilld', null, 'Survivors is a British post-apocalyptic fiction television series devised by Terry Nation and produced by Terence Dudley at the BBC from 1975 to 1977. It concerns the plight of a group of people who have survived an accidentally released plague – referred to as "The Death" – that kills nearly the entire human population of the planet.', 'Survivors is a British post-apocalyptic fiction television series devised by Terry Nation and produced by Terence Dudley at the BBC from 1975 to 1977. It concerns the plight of a group of people who have survived an accidentally released plague – referred to as "The Death" – that kills nearly the entire human population of the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djYiHmLuom48ja9g712ZIiHgRbP.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:4351'),
  ('208513955527279523', 'Survivors', 2008, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Terry Nation, Adrian Hodges', null, 'Julie Graham, Max Beesley, Paterson Joseph, Zoë Tapper, Phillip Rhys, Robyn Addison', null, 'When a deadly virus wipes out most of the world''s population, a handful of survivors struggle to stay alive.', 'When a deadly virus wipes out most of the world''s population, a handful of survivors struggle to stay alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qw1veNeQzzN0FD2DJyemxO7hPPE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:7485'),
  ('358409630378159748', 'Survivors', 2021, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Alexandr Lungin, Roman Volobuev, Elena Vanina', null, 'Aleksey Filimonov, Darya Savelyeva, Valentina Lukashchuk, Anna Slyu, Vitaliya Kornienko, Evgeny Koryakovsky, Sergey Bondarchuk, Marietta Tsigal-Polishchuk', null, 'The series takes place in a small Russian town where a deadly virus appears. Most of the inhabitants die, only a few people remain alive, who are affected by sleeping sickness: people cannot wake up on their own, and after two hours of sleep they fall into a coma.', 'The series takes place in a small Russian town where a deadly virus appears. Most of the inhabitants die, only a few people remain alive, who are affected by sleeping sickness: people cannot wake up on their own, and after two hours of sleep they fall into a coma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmK3RkS0NM1Yy9rJWkoBTWnJUiD.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:133812'),
