  ('833826497160919217', 'Sweet Blood', 2026, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', '김동휘', null, 'Lee Sang-min, In Jae-min, Kang Seon-ho', null, 'A fateful bond sealed by blood begins an unexpected story of humans and vampires living together. A dangerous yet sweet relationship is about to begin.', 'A fateful bond sealed by blood begins an unexpected story of humans and vampires living together. A dangerous yet sweet relationship is about to begin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNL9ctRPSZ08rRqh0Rok7v9HjnQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:316342'),
  ('1067049566937624189', 'Sweet Blue Flowers', 2009, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Ai Takabe, Yuko Gibu, Chiemi Ishimatsu, Yui Horie, Sayuri Yahagi, Yuka Iguchi, Aki Toyosaki', 'TV-14', 'Fumi Manjoume enters Kamakura''s accelerated high school - Matsuoka All-Girls High School. While waiting at the Kamakura station on the day of her entrance ceremony, she runs into an old childhood friend whom she had not seen in 10 years: Akira Okudaira. As their friendship is rekindled and they start falling back into the rhythm of friends again, it starts a delicate love story...', 'Fumi Manjoume enters Kamakura''s accelerated high school - Matsuoka All-Girls High School. While waiting at the Kamakura station on the day of her entrance ceremony, she runs into an old childhood friend whom she had not seen in 10 years: Akira Okudaira. As their friendship is rekindled and they start falling back into the rhythm of friends again, it starts a delicate love story...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r6HKAGL5MJH0QiaQIqrIc3vHqLD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34838'),
  ('487994741577594992', 'Sweet Combat', 2018, 'Comedy, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Lu Han, Guan Xiaotong, Ivy Shao, Ding Chengxin, Zhang Yuyi, Wang Qianyue, Tien Niu, Pei Zitian', 'TV-14', 'As the eldest daughter of the Fang Conglomerate, Fang Yu was raised to become the sole successor of the company, yet she goes against her family''s objections to pursue boxing and won the championship title at the young age of 18. On the other hand, Ming Tian comes from a poor family. He once stopped schooling for three years in order to work and he decided to apply for a sports scholarship despite not having any background whatsoever. Fang Yu was one of the first to see his talents and their relationship grows over time.', 'As the eldest daughter of the Fang Conglomerate, Fang Yu was raised to become the sole successor of the company, yet she goes against her family''s objections to pursue boxing and won the championship title at the young age of 18. On the other hand, Ming Tian comes from a poor family. He once stopped schooling for three years in order to work and he decided to apply for a sports scholarship despite not having any background whatsoever. Fang Yu was one of the first to see his talents and their relationship grows over time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fcvDI5lDOgvu7ehZpFPq8Xd300o.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81105'),
  ('619840886006711204', 'Sweet Diva', 2019, 'Soap, Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Walcyr Carrasco', 'Marcio Haiduck, Walcyr Carrasco, Nelson Nadotti', 'Juliana Paes, Agatha Moreira, Marcos Palmeira, Paolla Oliveira, Nathalia Dill, Sérgio Guizé, Reynaldo Gianecchini, Lee Taylor', 'NR', 'Maria da Paz is a committed baker who becomes a wealthy businesswoman twenty years after a tragedy strikes on the day of her wedding to Amadeu. From this broken union a baby is born, Jô, who seeks power and despises her mother’s humble origins. Afraid that her parents’ reunion might spoil her plans, Jô starts an alliance with the charming Régis to convince Maria to marry him and, together, they plan to steal all of Maria’s fortune. In this exciting telenovela written by Emmy Awards winner Walcyr Carrasco, Maria’s optimism must be stronger than Jô’s ambition when the baker finds out about the betrayal and her own daughter’s dangerous secrets.', 'Maria da Paz is a committed baker who becomes a wealthy businesswoman twenty years after a tragedy strikes on the day of her wedding to Amadeu. From this broken union a baby is born, Jô, who seeks power and despises her mother’s humble origins. Afraid that her parents’ reunion might spoil her plans, Jô starts an alliance with the charming Régis to convince Maria to marry him and, together, they plan to steal all of Maria’s fortune. In this exciting telenovela written by Emmy Awards winner Walcyr Carrasco, Maria’s optimism must be stronger than Jô’s ambition when the baker finds out about the betrayal and her own daughter’s dangerous secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9WXkn39mIIOT9dFsQJMczk3PeFJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90234'),
  ('180395167664302217', 'Sweet Home', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Song Kang, Lee Jin-uk, Lee Si-young, Jung Jin-young, Lee Do-hyun, Go Min-si, Yu Oh-seong, Oh Jung-se', 'TV-MA', 'As humans turn into savage monsters and the world plunges into terror, a handful of survivors fight for their lives — and to hold on to their humanity.', 'As humans turn into savage monsters and the world plunges into terror, a handful of survivors fight for their lives — and to hold on to their humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovLdkMclsr9NjkfRPgMaGDTHyGk.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:96648'),
  ('232010027569933076', 'Sweet Life', 2001, 'Family, Comedy', 'Haluk Özenç, Bora Tekay', 'Bora Tekay, Haluk Özenç', 'Haluk Bilginer, Türkan Şoray, Neco, Çolpan İlhan, Emre Altuğ, Celal Kadri Kınoğlu, Asuman Dabak, Gamze Özçelik', null, 'A Turkish remake of "The Jeffersons". With Ihsan Yildirim''s cleaning business booming, he insisted his family leave the "plain folks" and move up to Etiler with the "fancy folks." It is Ihsan''s hope that relocation and his newly acquired wealth will mean the end of his problems in general and his troubles with neighbors in specific. But life in a luxurious high rise holds some unexpected pitfalls for the Yildirims, including Basar''s struggle to convince his father that his marriage into a Turkish-Greek mixed family is cause for celebration, not disappointment. All events in Yildirim''s lives is accompanied by its share of problems, confusion and most of all humor.', 'A Turkish remake of "The Jeffersons". With Ihsan Yildirim''s cleaning business booming, he insisted his family leave the "plain folks" and move up to Etiler with the "fancy folks." It is Ihsan''s hope that relocation and his newly acquired wealth will mean the end of his problems in general and his troubles with neighbors in specific. But life in a luxurious high rise holds some unexpected pitfalls for the Yildirims, including Basar''s struggle to convince his father that his marriage into a Turkish-Greek mixed family is cause for celebration, not disappointment. All events in Yildirim''s lives is accompanied by its share of problems, confusion and most of all humor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGFkjXoAFoYXIqQTOOUXjF2L7JX.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:49340'),
  ('223224711766792823', 'Sweet Life', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Marta Nosova, Anton Denisenko, Lukerya Ilyashenko, Roman Mayakin, Mariya Shumakova, Anastasiya Meskova, Nikita Panfilov, Anatoliy Goryachev', null, 'A single mother from Perm, by the will of fate, finds herself in the capital of Russia, where she makes significant changes to the well-established life of six successful 30-year-old Muscovites.', 'A single mother from Perm, by the will of fate, finds herself in the capital of Russia, where she makes significant changes to the well-established life of six successful 30-year-old Muscovites.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXWuERyuRZ3F4CUFSOC5Dy7vXvG.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:64466'),
  ('653031451397412715', 'Sweet Magnolias', 2020, 'Drama', 'Sheryl J. Anderson', null, 'JoAnna Garcia Swisher, Brooke Elliott, Heather Headley, Logan Allen, Anneliese Judge, Carson Rowland, Justin Bruening, Jamie Lynn Spears', 'TV-14', 'Lifelong friends Maddie, Helen and Dana Sue lift each other up as they juggle relationships, family and careers in the small Southern town of Serenity.', 'Lifelong friends Maddie, Helen and Dana Sue lift each other up as they juggle relationships, family and careers in the small Southern town of Serenity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1WDSFOnCCg3cdHHGBywZtYIzf9.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:102904'),
  ('903850467994910401', 'Sweet Munchies', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Park Seung-hye, Song Ji-won', '박승혜', 'Jung Il-woo, Kang Ji-young, Lee Hak-ju, Kim Seung-su, Kim Soo-jin, Yang Dae-hyeok, Gong Min-jeung, Park Sung-jun', null, 'To get his own TV show, a chef known for delectable late-night eats tells a major lie that complicates his relationships with those around him.', 'To get his own TV show, a chef known for delectable late-night eats tells a major lie that complicates his relationships with those around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nPVxUVnGf6jTqoHik14YreBDPQj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99493'),
  ('284806801559212238', 'Sweet Punishment: I''m the Guard''s Personal Pet', 2018, 'Animation', null, null, 'Yoshitaka Yamaya, Marie Miyake, Yoshiki Nakajima, Takafumi Maeuchi, Haruki Ishiya, Koudai Sakai', null, 'The story is set in a prison in the near future. It revolves around Hina Saotome, imprisoned despite her innocence, and the elegant yet sadistic guard Aki Myoujin. Hina''s heart and body are at the mercy of Myoujin''s "heartless yet sweet domination" from physical examinations to lovers'' prison visits.', 'The story is set in a prison in the near future. It revolves around Hina Saotome, imprisoned despite her innocence, and the elegant yet sadistic guard Aki Myoujin. Hina''s heart and body are at the mercy of Myoujin''s "heartless yet sweet domination" from physical examinations to lovers'' prison visits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbETzzJLGIB2Bg6NwNekWTKfM6d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78501'),
  ('443067478263471904', 'Sweet Reincarnation', 2023, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ayumu Murase, Hiroshi Tsuchida, Hitomi Nabatame, Kaede Hondo, Kaya Okuno, Maaya Uchida, Natsumi Fujiwara', 'TV-PG', 'Pastry Mille Morteln, age 9, is both his father''s heir and the reincarnation of an unfulfilled pastry chef. While he dreams of a land filled with sweet treats, there''s a lot to be done first! From learning how to fight, to controlling his new magical talents and doing his best to defend his village from bandits, and yet all he really wants to do is bake the perfect apple pie... Pastry Mille Morteln has his work cut out for him in Sweet Reincarnation.', 'Pastry Mille Morteln, age 9, is both his father''s heir and the reincarnation of an unfulfilled pastry chef. While he dreams of a land filled with sweet treats, there''s a lot to be done first! From learning how to fight, to controlling his new magical talents and doing his best to defend his village from bandits, and yet all he really wants to do is bake the perfect apple pie... Pastry Mille Morteln has his work cut out for him in Sweet Reincarnation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/51CKhQNOvH3cxjljRize0oPfPyR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207521'),
  ('461604776594695703', 'Sweet Revenge', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Barış Erçetin', 'Ilker Aslan, Pinar Ordu', 'Leyla Lydia Tuğutlu, Furkan Andıç, Çağrı Çıtanak, Hazal Türesan, Cemre Gümeli, Zeyno Günenç, Kerem Atabeyoğlu, Bülent Seyran', null, 'Pelin is left behind in her wedding. While trying to get over this bad experience, she comes across a fortuneteller who tells her that the only way she could get rid of her pain is by asking for forgiveness from the guy whose heart she has broken. She and her friends start to search for this guy.', 'Pelin is left behind in her wedding. While trying to get over this bad experience, she comes across a fortuneteller who tells her that the only way she could get rid of her pain is by asking for forgiveness from the guy whose heart she has broken. She and her friends start to search for this guy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hoOSZYDXhcb4tjdzzEbe4dsDz8N.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66071'),
  ('638430749864188190', 'Sweet Revenge', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Han Sang-im, Kim Jong-seon, Seo Won-tae', null, 'Samuel, Ji Min-hyuk, Jin Geon-woo, An Seo-hyun, Kim Ji-young, Park Ji-hu, Lee Eun-saem, Choi Ki-seob', null, 'A teenager manages to stumble upon a phone application, where, upon writing a person''s name, that person is punished. Moreover, she uses this newfound power for her own benefit.', 'A teenager manages to stumble upon a phone application, where, upon writing a person''s name, that person is punished. Moreover, she uses this newfound power for her own benefit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yfyFd2BQ3Z4tu6wb3RemumKHtle.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:76330'),
  ('1118137628525939016', 'Sweet Stranger and Me', 2016, 'Drama', 'Kim Jung-min, Yoo Hyun-sook', null, 'Soo Ae, Kim Young-kwang, Lee Soo-hyuk, Cho Bo-ah, Kim Ji-hoon, Jung Kyung-soon, Kim Ha-kyoon, Kim Mi-sook', 'NR', 'A 30-year-old woman suddenly has a new father who is three years younger than her. With time, she accepts him as a family; he always takes her side and loves her unconditionally. What would happen to them?', 'A 30-year-old woman suddenly has a new father who is three years younger than her. With time, she accepts him as a family; he always takes her side and loves her unconditionally. What would happen to them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ON43Foz15rWlVD4zaQVWSbJeZX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67856'),
  ('1115162073859550513', 'Sweet Tasks', 2019, 'Talk, Comedy', null, null, null, null, 'Taking look on the day-to-day work schedule of literary and art workers as the starting point, it uses the three stages of meeting, observation, and dialogue to demonstrate professionalism, moral character, and positive values. To promote the fighting spirit and creative spirit of professionals from all walks of life in a general way.', 'Taking look on the day-to-day work schedule of literary and art workers as the starting point, it uses the three stages of meeting, observation, and dialogue to demonstrate professionalism, moral character, and positive values. To promote the fighting spirit and creative spirit of professionals from all walks of life in a general way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Z2srGbc1U4LBTybTozOgP1DwyT.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:201453'),
  ('17611304896232317', 'Sweet Teeth', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mu Fusheng', 'Mu Fusheng', 'Wu Xuanyi, Bi Wenjun, Zhai Xiaowen, Zhang Bojia, Liu Te, Wan Zilin', null, 'Dentist Ai Jingchu, who also teaches at Donghu University, is known to be the most handsome man at school. University librarian Zeng Li, however, is prejudiced against him because of a little misunderstanding. When Zeng Li’s mother forces her to get braces, she tries to avoid Ai Jingchu at all costs, but eventually still ends up becoming his patient. As the two interact more and more with each other, Zeng Li realizes that Ai Jing Chu is actually a very professional and caring person, and starts to develop feelings for him.', 'Dentist Ai Jingchu, who also teaches at Donghu University, is known to be the most handsome man at school. University librarian Zeng Li, however, is prejudiced against him because of a little misunderstanding. When Zeng Li’s mother forces her to get braces, she tries to avoid Ai Jingchu at all costs, but eventually still ends up becoming his patient. As the two interact more and more with each other, Zeng Li realizes that Ai Jing Chu is actually a very professional and caring person, and starts to develop feelings for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1nIZLCwadXVXsUjzpJEBQG0TEn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128715'),
  ('565310928493399264', 'Sweet Tooth', 2021, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jim Mickle', null, 'Nonso Anozie, Christian Convery, Adeel Akhtar, Stefania LaVie Owen, Naledi Murray, Amy Seimetz, Rosalind Chao, Kelly Marie Tran', 'TV-14', 'On a perilous adventure across a post-apocalyptic world, a lovable boy who''s half-human and half-deer searches for a new beginning with a gruff protector.', 'On a perilous adventure across a post-apocalyptic world, a lovable boy who''s half-human and half-deer searches for a new beginning with a gruff protector.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgMfhcrVZjuy5b7Pn0KzCRCEnMX.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:103768'),
  ('413611380081368837', 'Sweet Valley High', 1994, 'Comedy, Kids', 'Josh Goldstein, Jonathan Prince', null, 'Cynthia Daniel, Brittany Daniel, Shirlee Elliot, Andrea Savage, Michael Perl, Amy Danles, Harley Rodriguez, Jeremy Garrett', null, 'Twins Jessica and Liz face the ups and downs of life at Sweet Valley High.', 'Twins Jessica and Liz face the ups and downs of life at Sweet Valley High.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkdEnsWEJuNREP1DUFNqy6zKbmk.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:11671'),
  ('996605915185913655', 'Sweet/Vicious', 2016, 'Crime, Drama, Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Jennifer Kaytin Robinson', null, 'Eliza Bennett, Taylor Dearden, Nick Fink, Brandon Mychal Smith', 'TV-14', 'Jules balances her life of being a college student, while serving up vigilante justice on her school''s campus. Until Ophelia, a computer hacker, discovers her secret and entangles herself in Jules'' quest for vengeance.', 'Jules balances her life of being a college student, while serving up vigilante justice on her school''s campus. Until Ophelia, a computer hacker, discovers her secret and entangles herself in Jules'' quest for vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQQyJJto0nzu8EgLDS6O9IezqXN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68610'),
  ('53277357154505539', 'Sweetbitter', 2018, 'Drama', 'Stephanie Danler', null, 'Ella Purnell, Tom Sturridge, Evan Jonigkeit, Eden Epstein, Jasmine Mathews, Daniyar, Paul Sparks, Caitlin FitzGerald', 'TV-MA', 'Shortly after arriving in New York City, 22-year-old Tess lands a job at a celebrated downtown restaurant. Swiftly introduced to the world of drugs, alcohol, love, lust, dive bars, and fine dining, she learns to navigate the chaotically alluring, yet punishing life she has stumbled upon.', 'Shortly after arriving in New York City, 22-year-old Tess lands a job at a celebrated downtown restaurant. Swiftly introduced to the world of drugs, alcohol, love, lust, dive bars, and fine dining, she learns to navigate the chaotically alluring, yet punishing life she has stumbled upon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jTDgxE9xwNpiKoZqGo0VODC6cAR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:77032'),
  ('445613866774337803', 'Sweetness & Lightning', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Rina Endou, Saori Hayami, Yuichi Nakamura, Aina Suzuki, Satomi Arai, Ai Kayano, Saaya Andou, Seiya Kimura', 'TV-14', 'Kohei is a single father and high school teacher who lives with his only daughter. A chance encounter brings him together with Kotori, one of his students. The three of them start to meet together to make meals. None of them know how to cook, but they all love delicious food!', 'Kohei is a single father and high school teacher who lives with his only daughter. A chance encounter brings him together with Kotori, one of his students. The three of them start to meet together to make meals. None of them know how to cook, but they all love delicious food!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lo2koVLl9NbtGqnkmxCwUS5lseF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66990'),
  ('881107754944866402', 'Sweetpea', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kirstie Swain', null, 'Ella Purnell, Nicôle Lecky, Jon Pointing, Calam Lynch, Jeremy Swift, Dustin Demri-Burns, Leah Harvey', 'TV-MA', 'Rhiannon Lewis doesn''t make much of an impression - people walk past her in the street without a second glance. That is until she is pushed over the edge and loses control. Rhiannon''s life transforms, but can she keep her killer secret?', 'Rhiannon Lewis doesn''t make much of an impression - people walk past her in the street without a second glance. That is until she is pushed over the edge and loses control. Rhiannon''s life transforms, but can she keep her killer secret?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/feoDYCy0AUD031gLqBmA9gC4pw1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:218347'),
  ('538862731794192077', 'Świat według Kiepskich', 1999, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Andrzej Grabowski, Marzena Kipiel-Sztuka, Bartosz Żukowski, Barbara Mularczyk, Ryszard Kotys, Renata Pałys, Dariusz Gnatowski', null, 'Follow the life of a dysfunctional Polish family from Wrocław, who live in an old apartment in Wrocław on 3/4 Ćwiartki street. The show is centered on Ferdynand Kiepski, who tries to make various schemes to improve his financial or life situation, all of which ultimately fail.', 'Follow the life of a dysfunctional Polish family from Wrocław, who live in an old apartment in Wrocław on 3/4 Ćwiartki street. The show is centered on Ferdynand Kiepski, who tries to make various schemes to improve his financial or life situation, all of which ultimately fail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/niekd6jAbPZJnZrktBSM5rgXSra.jpg', 35, 'tmdb:tv:48318'),
  ('470445494197433613', 'Swimming with Sharks', 2022, 'Drama', 'Kathleen Robertson', null, 'Kiernan Shipka, Diane Kruger, Donald Sutherland, Thomas Dekker, Finn Jones, Erica Alexander, Ross Butler, Gerardo Celasco', 'TV-MA', 'When Lou Simms starts her internship at Fountain Pictures she seems like a naïve Hollywood newcomer, awestruck by the studio’s notorious CEO, Joyce Holt. In truth, Lou has done extensive research on Joyce and landing this internship was no happy accident. As Lou’s obsession grows, she will do anything to get close to her idol.', 'When Lou Simms starts her internship at Fountain Pictures she seems like a naïve Hollywood newcomer, awestruck by the studio’s notorious CEO, Joyce Holt. In truth, Lou has done extensive research on Joyce and landing this internship was no happy accident. As Lou’s obsession grows, she will do anything to get close to her idol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kiBuVgOdEYAx2kApt5FJ4SXiczz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156822'),
  ('672290796192889085', 'Swingtown', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mike Kelley', null, 'Molly Parker, Jack Davenport, Grant Show, Lana Parrilla, Miriam Shor, Josh Hopkins, Shanna Collins, Britt Robertson', 'TV-14', 'This period and relationship drama takes viewers back to the 1970s for a look at suburban households testing the murky waters of sexual revolution following swingers throughout open marriages, "key parties" and other swingers extravaganzas.', 'This period and relationship drama takes viewers back to the 1970s for a look at suburban households testing the murky waters of sexual revolution following swingers throughout open marriages, "key parties" and other swingers extravaganzas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/os3UoeuvCmmOuTrlTV97jdtZsn0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10133'),
  ('1093830027560277791', 'Switch', 1997, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Michael Müller, Annette Frier, Michael Kessler, Bettina Lamprecht, Peter Nottmeier, Bernhard Hoëcker, Petra Nadolny', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJ2Ziv69eJEsd89vNoQG9lKLBgk.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:45338'),
  ('306995407512498891', 'Switch Girl!!', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Natsumi Aida', 'Kota Oura', 'Mariya Nishiuchi, Renn Kiriyama, Rikako Sakata, Anri Okamoto, Shō Jinnai, Tsugumi Shinohara, Yohei Kumabe, Park Hosino', null, 'Based on a manga with the same name created by Aida Natsumi, ''Switch Girl!!'' revolves around a high school student named Nika who appears to be a stylish and fashionable girl at school, but that''s really a fake persona that she uses when she''s in public. At home, she “switches off” the facade and her returns to her true slovenly nature. Kiriyama Renn plays the good-looking transfer student Arata, who is Nika''s love interest in the story.', 'Based on a manga with the same name created by Aida Natsumi, ''Switch Girl!!'' revolves around a high school student named Nika who appears to be a stylish and fashionable girl at school, but that''s really a fake persona that she uses when she''s in public. At home, she “switches off” the facade and her returns to her true slovenly nature. Kiriyama Renn plays the good-looking transfer student Arata, who is Nika''s love interest in the story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mfyW6X9vNc5BvOhcksIBrBFlemO.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:46204'),
  ('130517737501756425', 'Switch Reloaded', 2007, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Bernhard Hoëcker, Susanne Pätzold, Michael Kessler, Martin Klempnow, Max Giermann, Petra Nadolny, Peter Nottmeier, Martina Hill', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUgCDm1n6qFUP8gMl0uXigMAbBk.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:23336'),
  ('194696604740729590', 'Switched', 2018, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Shiki Kawabata, Michitaka Okada', null, 'Miu Tomita, Kaya Kiyohara, Daiki Shigeoka, Tomohiro Kamiyama, Megumi Seki, Shinji Rokkaku, Miu Suzuki, Reika Kirishima', null, 'High schooler Ayumi''s perfect world evaporates when her envious classmate Zenko somehow steals her body, her boyfriend and her life.', 'High schooler Ayumi''s perfect world evaporates when her envious classmate Zenko somehow steals her body, her boyfriend and her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v1PrIS8oOS5MCVg76anHVnSdcBc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81315'),
  ('84111430822836201', 'Switched at Birth', 2011, 'Drama, Family', 'Lizzy Weiss', null, 'Vanessa Marano, Katie Leclerc, Lucas Grabeel, Lea Thompson, Constance Marie, D.W. Moffett', 'TV-14', 'The story of two teenage girls who discover they were accidentally switched as newborns in the hospital. Bay Kennish grew up in a wealthy family with two parents and a brother, while Daphne Vasquez, who lost her hearing at an early age due to a case of meningitis, grew up with a single mother in a working-class neighborhood. Things come to a dramatic head when both families meet and struggle to learn how to live together for the sake of the girls.', 'The story of two teenage girls who discover they were accidentally switched as newborns in the hospital. Bay Kennish grew up in a wealthy family with two parents and a brother, while Daphne Vasquez, who lost her hearing at an early age due to a case of meningitis, grew up with a single mother in a working-class neighborhood. Things come to a dramatic head when both families meet and struggle to learn how to live together for the sake of the girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/db5XnOxGcUHeNhBRNbHfqTlzXmk.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:37632'),
