  ('488526552326030811', 'Sword and Beloved', 2025, 'Drama', 'Tuo Xiaoxin', null, 'Cheng Yi, Li Yitong, Guo Junchen, Ken Chang Tzu-Yao, Mao Xiaohui', null, 'The drama series revolves around Wangquan Fugui, who is trained as the ultimate demon-slayer of the Yiqi Alliance since childhood, meeting Qing Tong, a spider demon who infiltrates Wangquan Manor as a spy. Qing Tong’s presence allows Fugui to broaden his horizon and change his view on demons. Yearning for freedom, Fugui’s fervor for attaining world peace is gradually ignited. After experiencing extreme agony, he leaves Wangquan Manor with Qing Tong, embarking on a journey of self-enlightenment.', 'The drama series revolves around Wangquan Fugui, who is trained as the ultimate demon-slayer of the Yiqi Alliance since childhood, meeting Qing Tong, a spider demon who infiltrates Wangquan Manor as a spy. Qing Tong’s presence allows Fugui to broaden his horizon and change his view on demons. Yearning for freedom, Fugui’s fervor for attaining world peace is gradually ignited. After experiencing extreme agony, he leaves Wangquan Manor with Qing Tong, embarking on a journey of self-enlightenment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vW0BW5OiQufPnCyWhi4czVL3nhf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:240442'),
  ('576079178143271111', 'Sword and Fairy', 2024, 'Drama', 'Liu Guo Nan', null, 'Xu Kai, Yu Shuxin, Fu Xinbo, Wan Peng, Bai Bingke, Zhou Lijie, Ganana, Xue Bayi', null, 'The two amnesiac youths, Yue Jinzhao and Yue Qi, have been wandering the land in search of their identities and pasts, only for Yue Qi to lose all of her money to a member of the Risen Soul Cult. In the process of trying to recover the lost money, they meet up with Luo Zhouyan, the head of the "Evanescent" Luo family who is spearheading efforts in her region to destroy the cult and expose its crimes. As the Yue siblings and Luo Zhaoyan join forces with each other and members of the True Martial Alliance: Ju Shifang, Ming Xin, and her uncle Xian Qing, to root out the leaders of the cult while overcoming their personal demons and finding out about the mysterious organizations operating in the shadows.', 'The two amnesiac youths, Yue Jinzhao and Yue Qi, have been wandering the land in search of their identities and pasts, only for Yue Qi to lose all of her money to a member of the Risen Soul Cult. In the process of trying to recover the lost money, they meet up with Luo Zhouyan, the head of the "Evanescent" Luo family who is spearheading efforts in her region to destroy the cult and expose its crimes. As the Yue siblings and Luo Zhaoyan join forces with each other and members of the True Martial Alliance: Ju Shifang, Ming Xin, and her uncle Xian Qing, to root out the leaders of the cult while overcoming their personal demons and finding out about the mysterious organizations operating in the shadows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vEQyhCaZFE5EXOzk0B4ssLCEAs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209916'),
  ('320362579315032410', 'Sword and Fairy 1', 2024, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Yang Long', null, 'He Yu, Yang Yutong, Xu Hao, Li Chuan, Ye Shengjia, Hu Yixuan, Wang Jinsong, Wu Yue', null, 'Li Xiaoyao, a young inn attendant who dreams of becoming a great hero, accidentally meets Zhao Ling''er, a descendant of the goddess Nuwa. Together, they embark on a quest to find the Water Spiritual Bead, which can end the drought plaguing the land. Along the way, they befriend the bickering partner Lin Yueru and the scholarly Liu Jinyuan, among other like-minded companions. They face numerous dangers in their search for the spiritual bead and ultimately thwart the cataclysmic scheme of the Moon Worship Sect''s leader, who aims to destroy the world.', 'Li Xiaoyao, a young inn attendant who dreams of becoming a great hero, accidentally meets Zhao Ling''er, a descendant of the goddess Nuwa. Together, they embark on a quest to find the Water Spiritual Bead, which can end the drought plaguing the land. Along the way, they befriend the bickering partner Lin Yueru and the scholarly Liu Jinyuan, among other like-minded companions. They face numerous dangers in their search for the spiritual bead and ultimately thwart the cataclysmic scheme of the Moon Worship Sect''s leader, who aims to destroy the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jelH4T7Kt8VeziZ9tnv2FwNjOzA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213882'),
  ('437951286281905287', 'Sword and Fairy 3', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Lan Taoyi, Chen Linling, Ajie, Tu Xiongfei, He Wenxiao, Baomu Zhongyang, Haiting Cai', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gorGXNaHiFIBn7EEafx5uh7VzhT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233295'),
  ('22676386411912367', 'Sword and Fairy 4', 2024, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ju Jingyi, Chen Zheyuan, Mao Xiaohui, Mao Zijun, Wang Duo, Baron Chen, Wang Yuanke, Ai Xiaoqi', null, 'Yun Tianhe, a young man who had been living alone on a mountain peak, was on a regular boar hunting trip when he came across the young woman Han Lingsha, from a clan of short-lived tomb raiders, attempting to break into his parents'' tomb, culminating in the destruction of the tomb, and setting him on a journey alongside Lingsha to the outside world to uncover his parents'' past. On the journey, they encountered and befriended the adopted daughter of the magistrate of Shouyang, Liu Mengli, who seemed to have connections to Tianhe''s father, and a skilled and kind swordmaster who trained at Mt. Kunlun''s Qionghua School since a young age, Murong Ziying.', 'Yun Tianhe, a young man who had been living alone on a mountain peak, was on a regular boar hunting trip when he came across the young woman Han Lingsha, from a clan of short-lived tomb raiders, attempting to break into his parents'' tomb, culminating in the destruction of the tomb, and setting him on a journey alongside Lingsha to the outside world to uncover his parents'' past. On the journey, they encountered and befriended the adopted daughter of the magistrate of Shouyang, Liu Mengli, who seemed to have connections to Tianhe''s father, and a skilled and kind swordmaster who trained at Mt. Kunlun''s Qionghua School since a young age, Murong Ziying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lLy8pJWlNEVzrR8TZR0LMYVj79r.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:239631'),
  ('1135741986735231187', 'Sword Art Online', 2012, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Haruka Tomatsu, Hiroaki Hirata, Ai Kayano, Rina Hidaka, Hiroki Yasumoto, Isshin Chiba, Kaori Maeda', 'TV-MA', 'In the near future, a Virtual Reality Massive Multiplayer Online Role-Playing Game (VRMMORPG) called Sword Art Online has been released where players control their avatars with their bodies using a piece of technology called Nerve Gear. One day, players discover they cannot log out, as the game creator is holding them captive unless they reach the 100th floor of the game''s tower and defeat the final boss. However, if they die in the game, they die in real life. Their struggle for survival starts now...', 'In the near future, a Virtual Reality Massive Multiplayer Online Role-Playing Game (VRMMORPG) called Sword Art Online has been released where players control their avatars with their bodies using a piece of technology called Nerve Gear. One day, players discover they cannot log out, as the game creator is holding them captive unless they reach the 100th floor of the game''s tower and defeat the final boss. However, if they die in the game, they die in real life. Their struggle for survival starts now...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9m8bFIXPg26taNrFSXGwEORVACD.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:45782'),
  ('471157784723773827', 'Sword Art Online Alternative: Gun Gale Online', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tomori Kusunoki, Yoko Hikasa, Kazuyuki Okitsu, Chinatsu Akasaki', 'TV-14', 'College student Karen takes up Gun Gale Online and gets a reputation as the Pink Demon. Then her gaming buddy Pitohui asks her to join the Squad Jam.', 'College student Karen takes up Gun Gale Online and gets a reputation as the Pink Demon. Then her gaming buddy Pitohui asks her to join the Squad Jam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1EBk96E3cVVOEVlx2z744oEuFQk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:78204'),
  ('331846888775719494', 'SWORD GAI: The Animation', 2018, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'The swordsmith Amon accidentally comes across an infant and its dead mother in the forest. Although he is initially overwhelmed by the situation, he finally decides to take the boy with him and thus save him from certain death. Ten years after this fateful encounter, the boy from that time, Gai, is apprenticed to Amon. While making a sword, however, there is a tragic accident in which Gai loses his right arm. Amon then decides to use a sword called Shiryuu to make an artificial arm for Gai. Thus, it begins…', 'The swordsmith Amon accidentally comes across an infant and its dead mother in the forest. Although he is initially overwhelmed by the situation, he finally decides to take the boy with him and thus save him from certain death. Ten years after this fateful encounter, the boy from that time, Gai, is apprenticed to Amon. While making a sword, however, there is a tragic accident in which Gai loses his right arm. Amon then decides to use a sword called Shiryuu to make an artificial arm for Gai. Thus, it begins…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAlxdiEa0L9F0Ofu4r1Og0BJbqd.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:78239'),
  ('1068203804491313855', 'Sword Of Coming', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Chen Zhenghua', null, 'Chen Zhangtaikang, Chen Hao, Yun Wei Yi, 徐宇隆, He Wenxiao, Liu Xiaoyu, Ling Zhenhe, Bai Xuecen', 'TV-14', 'Chen Ping’an grew up in a small, quiet town, living a humble and peaceful life. But when mysterious outsiders arrived, his ordinary world unraveled, exposing him to a reality where immortal cultivators, mythical dragons, and extraordinary powers were no longer just stories. Strange occurrences began to ripple through his town, pulling him into a grand, unpredictable destiny he never imagined.', 'Chen Ping’an grew up in a small, quiet town, living a humble and peaceful life. But when mysterious outsiders arrived, his ordinary world unraveled, exposing him to a reality where immortal cultivators, mythical dragons, and extraordinary powers were no longer just stories. Strange occurrences began to ripple through his town, pulling him into a grand, unpredictable destiny he never imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2pT4uBFKymVPLktor6dbeOZzDcJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:259537'),
  ('771600466130359148', 'Sword of Fury', 1979, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, War & Politics', 'Tsui Siu-Ming', null, 'Pat Poon, Cub Chin Kong-Hon, Pui-chun Yuen, Lam Kwok-Hung, Yung Wai-Man, Kong Hon, Wong Wai, Cheung Ying', null, 'In the sixth year of Baoyou, the Mongol army pressed the border, and Fan Chengshun general Zhang Tianshun saved the people of Fancheng, handed over the yellow dragon sword containing the anti-yuan roster to the partial general Fan Guoxing, and then killed himself, so that Guoxing sent his head to surrender the enemy. Since then, Guoxing has been known as a traitor, and his son Fan Qiu was born in the countryside and lived incognito, and many years later he was discovered by Mrs. Qiu Wan, who "pierced the heart with a sword". During Qiusheng and Guoxing''s exile, he met Liu Qinglian, who was ordered by his mother to insist on a duel with Mrs. Wan and killed her with her own hands. On the other side, Zhang Qi, who had been adopted by a Mongol since childhood, was arranged to appear as the son of Tianshun, and colluded with Ling Chufeng, the head of the famous sword gate, in an attempt to eliminate the anti-Yuan forces in the Central Plains.', 'In the sixth year of Baoyou, the Mongol army pressed the border, and Fan Chengshun general Zhang Tianshun saved the people of Fancheng, handed over the yellow dragon sword containing the anti-yuan roster to the partial general Fan Guoxing, and then killed himself, so that Guoxing sent his head to surrender the enemy. Since then, Guoxing has been known as a traitor, and his son Fan Qiu was born in the countryside and lived incognito, and many years later he was discovered by Mrs. Qiu Wan, who "pierced the heart with a sword". During Qiusheng and Guoxing''s exile, he met Liu Qinglian, who was ordered by his mother to insist on a duel with Mrs. Wan and killed her with her own hands. On the other side, Zhang Qi, who had been adopted by a Mongol since childhood, was arranged to appear as the son of Tianshun, and colluded with Ling Chufeng, the head of the famous sword gate, in an attempt to eliminate the anti-Yuan forces in the Central Plains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Gq0rC8bXFeYhOLDEQTnudWjVWX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108007'),
  ('968597174580272953', 'Sword of the Demon Hunter', 2025, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Taku Yashiro, Reina Ueda, Saori Hayami, Hiroshi Shirokuma, Yui Kondo', 'TV-MA', 'Jinta journeys through a century-spanning epic, all while questioning why he wields a sword.', 'Jinta journeys through a century-spanning epic, all while questioning why he wields a sword.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BNGnDKMaDvpmkTd6z9pQL97Upe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:133154'),
  ('718798368943349314', 'Sword Snow Stride', 2021, 'Drama', 'Chen Zhenghua', 'Wang Juan', 'Zhang Ruoyun, Hu Jun, Li Gengxi, Yang Haoyu, Zhang Tian''ai, Li Chun', null, 'In a time of turmoil, Xu Xiao rises as King of Northern Liang, defeating threats from steppe kingdoms and southern uprisings. His heir, Xu Fengnian, a free-spirited warrior, has spent years mastering his skills while forming alliances, including with the skilled swordswoman Nangong Pushe. Among the royal household is Jiang Ni, a princess from a rival kingdom who may harbor hidden motives. As Xu Fengnian ascends the throne, doubts arise about his ability to uphold his father’s legacy. When a critical campaign looms, the fate of the realm hangs in the balance.', 'In a time of turmoil, Xu Xiao rises as King of Northern Liang, defeating threats from steppe kingdoms and southern uprisings. His heir, Xu Fengnian, a free-spirited warrior, has spent years mastering his skills while forming alliances, including with the skilled swordswoman Nangong Pushe. Among the royal household is Jiang Ni, a princess from a rival kingdom who may harbor hidden motives. As Xu Fengnian ascends the throne, doubts arise about his ability to uphold his father’s legacy. When a critical campaign looms, the fate of the realm hangs in the balance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avUmZDbbCcvnIFw0yrTM3A4CLlW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89614'),
  ('534628774109515380', 'Swords Into Plowshares', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Bai Yu, Zhou Yutong, Zhu Yawen, Yu Haoming, Dong Yong, Jiang Kai, Hao Ping, Shang Bai', null, 'During the tumultuous period of the Five Dynasties and Ten Kingdoms, three determined youths—Qian Hongshu, Zhao Kuangyin, and Guo Rong—navigate the chaos of political upheaval and war as they strive to overcome the suffering caused by endless conflict.', 'During the tumultuous period of the Five Dynasties and Ten Kingdoms, three determined youths—Qian Hongshu, Zhao Kuangyin, and Guo Rong—navigate the chaos of political upheaval and war as they strive to overcome the suffering caused by endless conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/76gwCVQG1MoItK25o48opYP7TmG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:279446'),
  ('54079457835344090', 'Swords of Legends', 2014, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, 'Shao Xiaoli', 'Li Yifeng, Yang Mi, Qiao Zhenyu, Ma Tianyu, Zheng Shuang, Gillian Chung, William Chan, Dilraba Dilmurat', null, 'Set during the Tang Dynasty, a young and quiet swordsman name Baili Tusu is infected by the aura of an ancient demonic sword known as the Sword of Burning Solitude. Living with the dark energy, he grew up without family. Until one day, he meets a friendly girl Feng Qingxue along with a group of heroes, and together they wander the land to seek out destiny and bring balance to the world.', 'Set during the Tang Dynasty, a young and quiet swordsman name Baili Tusu is infected by the aura of an ancient demonic sword known as the Sword of Burning Solitude. Living with the dark energy, he grew up without family. Until one day, he meets a friendly girl Feng Qingxue along with a group of heroes, and together they wander the land to seek out destiny and bring balance to the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8oenw5SKBSr9cENPxsQg07xjOY6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68083'),
  ('551051164880108607', 'Swordsman', 2013, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Wallace Huo, Yuan Shanshan, Joe Chen, Yang Rong, Hei Zi, Dicky Cheung Wai-Kin, Kou Zhenhai, Sophie Zhang', null, 'Swordsman is a Chinese television series adapted from Louis Cha''s novel The Smiling, Proud Wanderer. The series is written and produced by Yu Zheng, and directed by Hu Yijuan, starring Wallace Huo and Yuan Shanshan in the leading roles. Shooting started on 24 March 2012 in Xiandu, Jinyun County, Lishui, Zhejiang. It was aired in China on Hunan Television from 6 February to 4 March 2013.', 'Swordsman is a Chinese television series adapted from Louis Cha''s novel The Smiling, Proud Wanderer. The series is written and produced by Yu Zheng, and directed by Hu Yijuan, starring Wallace Huo and Yuan Shanshan in the leading roles. Shooting started on 24 March 2012 in Xiandu, Jinyun County, Lishui, Zhejiang. It was aired in China on Hunan Television from 6 February to 4 March 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oC4AX6PUblppCW2AFVwzxN3j4u3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:48139'),
  ('633477047176633490', 'Swordsman Lai Bo Yee', 1995, null, 'Hin-Fai Siu', null, 'Noel Leung, Patrick Tam Yiu-Man, Timmy Ho Bo-Sang, Elizabeth Lee Mei-Fung, Josephine Lam Kei-Yan, Jason Pai Piao, Lee Lung-Kei, Newton Lai Hon-Chi', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/72w1pWpeseXCFQjSyevmvmyUVND.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107520'),
  ('247368670333756910', 'SWWW', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', null, 'Stas Ivanov', 'Anton Kuznetsov, Kuzma Kotrelev, Masha Mashkova, Maria Matsel, Dmitry Chebotarev, Gela Meskhi, Natalya Tsvetkova, Polina Yastrebova', null, 'Rostov-on-Don, our days. In one of the working-class residential areas in the south–west of the city, christened by residents of the "SouthWest", life is in full swing - a local group of young guys is constantly measuring strength with peers from the "thug" center, well, the adult "owners" of the districts are turning over more serious matters. Ravil is a young programmer living on the South. After graduating from college, the guy dreams of going to the USA and doing what he loves there. While waiting for the grant, Ravil moonlights as a courier. However, the young romantic is attracted by the temptation of fast criminal money. In order to realize the cherished dream of another life and win the heart of a young beauty Or from the rich area, Ravil steps on a slippery path.', 'Rostov-on-Don, our days. In one of the working-class residential areas in the south–west of the city, christened by residents of the "SouthWest", life is in full swing - a local group of young guys is constantly measuring strength with peers from the "thug" center, well, the adult "owners" of the districts are turning over more serious matters. Ravil is a young programmer living on the South. After graduating from college, the guy dreams of going to the USA and doing what he loves there. While waiting for the grant, Ravil moonlights as a courier. However, the young romantic is attracted by the temptation of fast criminal money. In order to realize the cherished dream of another life and win the heart of a young beauty Or from the rich area, Ravil steps on a slippery path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7iNpXqFMYfIurthMgxW6eaPPLLV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:202934'),
  ('326467008093448450', 'Sybil', 1976, 'Drama', null, null, 'Sally Field, Joanne Woodward, Brad Davis, Martine Bartlett, Jane Hoffman, Charles Lane, Jessamine Milner, William Prince', 'TV-14', 'A young woman whose childhood was so harrowing to her that she developed at least 13 different personalities.', 'A young woman whose childhood was so harrowing to her that she developed at least 13 different personalities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQxfLUaZ67vS1bBxR9hqDGOJwqA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19002'),
  ('466556031759990731', 'Sydney to the Max', 2019, 'Comedy, Family', 'Mark Reisman', null, 'Ruth Righi, Ava Kolker, Ian Reed Kesler, Caroline Rhea, Jackson Dollinger, Christian J. Simon', 'TV-G', 'Outgoing 13-year-old Sydney is on the fast track to growing up, despite the goodhearted efforts of her protective father, Max. As Sydney attempts to spread her wings and make more decisions for herself, Max does everything he can to rein her in and keep her his little girl. But in so doing, his mother, Judy, is reminded of his own antics at Sydney''s age, and the parallels -- illustrated by comical flashback sequences starring a young Max -- are both amusing and enlightening.', 'Outgoing 13-year-old Sydney is on the fast track to growing up, despite the goodhearted efforts of her protective father, Max. As Sydney attempts to spread her wings and make more decisions for herself, Max does everything he can to rein her in and keep her his little girl. But in so doing, his mother, Judy, is reminded of his own antics at Sydney''s age, and the parallels -- illustrated by comical flashback sequences starring a young Max -- are both amusing and enlightening.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fUg9oTNbf0Wlhv4Ww97JAdAhL4.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:84915'),
  ('691977472205115008', 'Sykes', 1972, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Eric Sykes, Deryck Guyler, Hattie Jacques', null, 'Classic sitcom starring Eric Sykes and Hattie Jacques as brother and sister twins who have to tackle the trials and tribulations of suburban life.', 'Classic sitcom starring Eric Sykes and Hattie Jacques as brother and sister twins who have to tackle the trials and tribulations of suburban life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqLVxWWTd3fBs4XJybGluG943Kv.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:11829'),
  ('1010572316319732143', 'Sylvia''s Cats', 2016, 'Drama', 'Nathalie Basteyns', null, 'Tiny Bertels, Romy Lauwers, Thomas De Smet, Josse De Pauw, Ruth Becquart, Renée Fokker, Dirk Roofthooft, Evelien Bosmans', null, 'When her marriage fails Sylvia is forced to move with her children into a brothel on the Chaussée d''Amour. Out of financial necessity she decides to exploit the bar. Meanwhile a detective tries to solve an old murder case.', 'When her marriage fails Sylvia is forced to move with her children into a brothel on the Chaussée d''Amour. Out of financial necessity she decides to exploit the bar. Meanwhile a detective tries to solve an old murder case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQLzJSZz3dDEnWXwYjkk8NFSeQp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66971'),
  ('852306226975602024', 'Sym-Bionic Titan', 2010, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', 'Genndy Tartakovsky, Paul Rudish, Bryan Andrews', null, 'Brian Posehn, Tara Strong', 'TV-PG', 'Three beings from the planet Galaluna crash-land on Earth while attempting to escape their war-torn world.', 'Three beings from the planet Galaluna crash-land on Earth while attempting to escape their war-torn world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e1HgZg7ReDfS4UXDho7CTSRcGXr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32315'),
  ('394714283452097063', 'Syndrome [E]', 2022, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Mathieu Missoffe', null, 'Vincent Elbaz, Jennifer Decker, Emmanuelle Béart, Kool Shen, Bérengère Krief, Anne Charrier, Michèle Bernier, Richard Bohringer', null, 'He is Franck Sharko, a crabby cop at the end of his rope. She is Lucie Henebelle, a lieutenant on the anti-crime squad obsessed with evil. Sharko and Lucie investigate top-secret scientific experiments and programs.', 'He is Franck Sharko, a crabby cop at the end of his rope. She is Lucie Henebelle, a lieutenant on the anti-crime squad obsessed with evil. Sharko and Lucie investigate top-secret scientific experiments and programs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d1KLA95GTR0WbG9dXe4JF1LRy3Z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:205203'),
  ('938137678026298870', 'Synduality Noir', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Takeo Otsuka, Aoi Koga, Nagisa Aoyama, Yusuke Kobayashi, Fuminori Komatsu, Konomi Inagaki, Ayaka Ohashi, Taito Ban', 'TV-MA', 'The year is 2242. Kanata wants to be a Drifter and meets Noir, who is a dud Magus with no memories. However, because Noir excels in battle against the Enders, Kanata partners with her and discovers exactly what it takes to be a Drifter.', 'The year is 2242. Kanata wants to be a Drifter and meets Noir, who is a dud Magus with no memories. However, because Noir excels in battle against the Enders, Kanata partners with her and discovers exactly what it takes to be a Drifter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x97QNSsHpHaq3HsbYD5Nhbsmr11.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210181'),
  ('627493503890505976', 'Szomszédok', 1987, 'Family, Drama, Comedy', 'László Czető Bernát', null, 'Ferenc Zenthe, Juci Komlós, Anna Fehér, Károly Nemcsák, Ilona Ivancsics, Edit Frajt, Anita Ábel, Karola Csürös', null, 'Szomszédok was a Hungarian television series, occasionally called the Hungarian Dallas, that ran from 1987–1999 and produced 331 episodes, airing its grand finale on December 31, 1999. The series was a soap opera, dealing with the lives of ordinary people, living and working in or around an average lakótelep. Its characters were explored, over time, in equal depth: ranging from elderly pensioners, busy middle aged professionals, up-and-coming young people, and children growing into their teens. Many consider Szomszédok to be the definitive Hungarian television series, being a period piece of sorts that covers the last few years of the communist era, the rendszerváltozás, and nearly a decade of the new market economy Hungary thereafter.', 'Szomszédok was a Hungarian television series, occasionally called the Hungarian Dallas, that ran from 1987–1999 and produced 331 episodes, airing its grand finale on December 31, 1999. The series was a soap opera, dealing with the lives of ordinary people, living and working in or around an average lakótelep. Its characters were explored, over time, in equal depth: ranging from elderly pensioners, busy middle aged professionals, up-and-coming young people, and children growing into their teens. Many consider Szomszédok to be the definitive Hungarian television series, being a period piece of sorts that covers the last few years of the communist era, the rendszerváltozás, and nearly a decade of the new market economy Hungary thereafter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y9bQWK6bJgde3YseKKaLvpwmF0T.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:35437'),
  ('476311993310920906', 'T・P BON', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Akihisa Wakayama, Mamoru Miyano, Tomoyo Kurosawa', 'TV-MA', 'After Bon accidentally intervenes in a Time Patrol case, he must join Agent Ream in saving innocent lives from the past — while watching history unfold.', 'After Bon accidentally intervenes in a Time Patrol case, he must join Agent Ream in saving innocent lives from the past — while watching history unfold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/13HE9ZZorQ3KLQrFW2KOH0dZLlW.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:236385'),
  ('702503671584239190', 'T. J. Hooker', 1982, 'Drama, Crime', 'Aaron Spelling, Rick Husky', null, 'William Shatner, Heather Locklear, James Darren', 'TV-PG', 'Sergeant Thomas Jefferson Hooker is a tough-as-nails veteran police officer with the LCPD who turns his back on a gold badge and goes back to patrolling the streets and training recruits. Along with his young partners in blue, Hooker take on Lake City''s toughest criminals.', 'Sergeant Thomas Jefferson Hooker is a tough-as-nails veteran police officer with the LCPD who turns his back on a gold badge and goes back to patrolling the streets and training recruits. Along with his young partners in blue, Hooker take on Lake City''s toughest criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zcHUwD20mqMD4g8LKdpKD12QRhE.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1059'),
  ('389548446249083199', 'T.O.T.S.', 2019, 'Kids, Family, Animation', 'Travis Braun', 'Travis Braun, Brandon Violette', 'Christian J. Simon, Vanessa Williams, Megan Hilty, Tucker Chandler', 'TV-Y', 'A heartfelt animated comedy series for preschoolers exploring the hilarious adventures of best friends Pip and Freddy, a tenacious penguin and a kind-hearted flamingo, who are the only non-stork delivery birds in-training at Tiny Ones Transport Service (T.O.T.S.).', 'A heartfelt animated comedy series for preschoolers exploring the hilarious adventures of best friends Pip and Freddy, a tenacious penguin and a kind-hearted flamingo, who are the only non-stork delivery birds in-training at Tiny Ones Transport Service (T.O.T.S.).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4nLOFTtj7rVCtzKLlvvGw8rK264.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:91433'),
  ('393744370561089629', 'T.U.F.F. Puppy', 2010, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Butch Hartman', null, 'Jerry Trainor, Grey DeLisle, Daran Norris, Jeff Bennett, Maddie Taylor, Rob Paulsen', 'TV-Y7', 'In the fictional city of Petropolis dog Dudley Puppy works as a spy for the organization T.U.F.F. (Turbo Undercover Fighting Force). Together with his partner, a cat named Kitty Katswell, Dudley works to protect Petropolis.', 'In the fictional city of Petropolis dog Dudley Puppy works as a spy for the organization T.U.F.F. (Turbo Undercover Fighting Force). Together with his partner, a cat named Kitty Katswell, Dudley works to protect Petropolis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzJSwX75Gjty8hZIEbqblPbEvkl.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:18828'),
  ('714001701249049387', 'T@gged', 2016, 'Drama', 'Hannah Macpherson', null, 'Lulu Antariksa, Noah Centineo, Katelyn Nacon, Timothy Granaderos, Lukas Gage, Nick Fink, Danielle Savre, Kurt Caceres', 'TV-14', 'T@gged is a modern day thriller that explores the terrifying risks of social media in a world of anonymity.', 'T@gged is a modern day thriller that explores the terrifying risks of social media in a world of anonymity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tfacaZ6WZ8dJuKYiH0NcHPV9G28.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:71437'),
  ('696143563612290350', 'Tá no Ar: A TV na TV', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Marcelo Adnet', null, 'Marcelo Adnet, Marcius Melhem, Danton Mello, Márcio Vito, Maurício Rizzo, Welder Rodrigues, Georgiana Góes, Verônica Debom', null, 'A sketch show satirizing Brazilian television programs.', 'A sketch show satirizing Brazilian television programs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fTWR6TfS5YADlpBxeaVjgvWFwHk.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:66445'),
  ('780795996292035037', 'Taarak Mehta Ka Ooltah Chashmah', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Kids, Soap', 'Asit Kumarr Modi', 'Raju Odedra', 'Dilip Joshi, Amit Bhatt, Nitish Bhaluni, Sachin Shroff, Sunayana Fozdar, Mandar Chandwadkar, Sonalika Joshi, Khushi Mali', 'TV-PG', 'Inspired by the famous Gujarati column 𝗗𝘂𝗻𝗶𝘆𝗮 𝗡𝗲 𝗨𝗻𝗱𝗵𝗮 𝗖𝗵𝗮𝘀𝗺𝗮 by Taarak Mehta, this show captures the everyday life in Gokuldham Co-operative Society, addressing socially relevant issues with humor. At its heart is Jethalal, an uneducated Gujarati businessman, who often seeks guidance from his wise neighbor and friend, Taarak Mehta. Jethalal lives with his naive yet lovable wife Daya Ben and their mischievous son Tapu, whose antics frequently disrupt the peace of the society. The members often warn Jethalal to control Tapu or face eviction. In desperation, he calls his father, Champaklal, from the village, hoping he’ll instill discipline in Tapu. Instead, the grandfather-grandson duo teams up, creating even more chaos and turning Jethalal’s life into a comedic roller coaster. The show blends family dynamics, friendship, and neighborhood bonds with a dose of satire and laughter.', 'Inspired by the famous Gujarati column 𝗗𝘂𝗻𝗶𝘆𝗮 𝗡𝗲 𝗨𝗻𝗱𝗵𝗮 𝗖𝗵𝗮𝘀𝗺𝗮 by Taarak Mehta, this show captures the everyday life in Gokuldham Co-operative Society, addressing socially relevant issues with humor. At its heart is Jethalal, an uneducated Gujarati businessman, who often seeks guidance from his wise neighbor and friend, Taarak Mehta. Jethalal lives with his naive yet lovable wife Daya Ben and their mischievous son Tapu, whose antics frequently disrupt the peace of the society. The members often warn Jethalal to control Tapu or face eviction. In desperation, he calls his father, Champaklal, from the village, hoping he’ll instill discipline in Tapu. Instead, the grandfather-grandson duo teams up, creating even more chaos and turning Jethalal’s life into a comedic roller coaster. The show blends family dynamics, friendship, and neighborhood bonds with a dose of satire and laughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3p9EtiZJKV5L8CBYjjL2b4T8cWP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8630'),
  ('89599594032549792', 'Taaza Khabar', 2023, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Bhuvan Bam', 'Aziz Dalal, Hussain Dalal, Abbas Dalal', 'Bhuvan Bam, Shriya Pilgaonkar, Deven Bhojani, Prathmesh Parab, Shilpa Shukla, Nitya Mathur, Atisha Naik, Vijay Nikam', 'TV-MA', 'A public toilet caretaker''s poverty-stricken life takes a drastic U-turn when he helps an old woman. How long will fate smile upon him?', 'A public toilet caretaker''s poverty-stricken life takes a drastic U-turn when he helps an old woman. How long will fate smile upon him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRrF8oj20lhd2jU0Yj9dg4sP5z5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:203832'),
  ('385334622280484271', 'Tabaluga', 1997, 'Animation', 'Peter Maffay', null, 'Dietmar Wunder, Sabine Manke, Santiago Ziesmer, Frank Ciazynski, Inken Sommer, Andreas Mannkopff', 'NR', 'Flying Bark Animation produced an animated cartoon series of Tabaluga. In this series, Tabaluga is the last of the dragons and the crown-prince of Greenland, a magical place inhabited by talking animals of many different species. Tabaluga must defend his home from two rival kingdoms on either side of Greenland; a frigid arctic tundra, ruled by the evil snowman Arktos and a searing desert, ruled by an evil sand-spirit named Humsin.', 'Flying Bark Animation produced an animated cartoon series of Tabaluga. In this series, Tabaluga is the last of the dragons and the crown-prince of Greenland, a magical place inhabited by talking animals of many different species. Tabaluga must defend his home from two rival kingdoms on either side of Greenland; a frigid arctic tundra, ruled by the evil snowman Arktos and a searing desert, ruled by an evil sand-spirit named Humsin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e7BKxTucnB1TckV2naCdpPC8JVF.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:47424'),
  ('423199683869092955', 'Tabiji', 1967, 'Drama, Family', null, null, 'Tadashi Yokouchi, Tomoe Hiiro, Jūkichi Uno, Hatae Kishi, Yoshiko Kuga, Aiko Nagayama, Goichi Yamada, Yukiyo Toake', null, 'The 7th NHK Asadora. Starring Tadashi Yokouchi in a narrative about an employee of the national railroad living through 50 years of modern history with his wife.', 'The 7th NHK Asadora. Starring Tadashi Yokouchi in a narrative about an employee of the national railroad living through 50 years of modern history with his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5TLAXnf85Y2ifY21f9TSlqvjRJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209385'),
  ('781261757203812656', 'Tabloid', 2025, 'Crime, Mystery', null, 'Ke Ying-an, Chan Chun-chieh, Leong Siew-hong', 'Allison Lin, Simon Hsueh, Wang Yu-xuan, Ko Shu-Chin, Frederick Lee, Edison Song', null, 'Senior entertainment journalist Liu Chih Chun''s career is thrown into turmoil when her junior colleague, Lin Pei Ting, dies under mysterious circumstances at a scandalous party. As the magazine''s reputation hangs in the balance, Chih Chun embarks on a dangerous investigation to uncover the truth. With only Lin''s cryptic notes to guide her, she ventures into the hidden shadows of the entertainment industry, determined to reveal a story far bigger than anyone imagined.', 'Senior entertainment journalist Liu Chih Chun''s career is thrown into turmoil when her junior colleague, Lin Pei Ting, dies under mysterious circumstances at a scandalous party. As the magazine''s reputation hangs in the balance, Chih Chun embarks on a dangerous investigation to uncover the truth. With only Lin''s cryptic notes to guide her, she ventures into the hidden shadows of the entertainment industry, determined to reveal a story far bigger than anyone imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/icFh8Q9E6J2RksC4IO2shviHz4u.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:221819'),
  ('814697706808198238', 'Taboo', 2017, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Steven Knight, Chips Hardy, Tom Hardy', null, 'Tom Hardy, David Hayman, Jonathan Pryce, Oona Chaplin, Richard Dixon, Leo Bill, Edward Hogg, Jessie Buckley', 'TV-MA', 'Adventurer James Keziah Delaney returns to London from Africa in 1814 along with fourteen stolen diamonds to seek vengeance after the death of his father.', 'Adventurer James Keziah Delaney returns to London from Africa in 1814 along with fourteen stolen diamonds to seek vengeance after the death of his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/om1wVOuEtwH3krHutIWO9sJzkS5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65708'),
  ('518129151447974049', 'Taboo Tattoo', 2016, 'Animation, Mystery, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Makoto Furukawa, Mikako Komatsu, Chika Anzai, Tomokazu Sugita, Eri Kitamura, Tessyo Genda, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Toshiyuki Morikawa', null, 'The story follows Justice Akazuka (a.k.a. Seigi), a young man who is good at martial arts. One day, Seigi rescues a homeless old man from some thugs, and the man gives him an object that imprints a tattoo on his palm. However, it is not an ordinary tattoo, but a special weapon that gives Seigi supernatural powers such as warping space-time. Seigi then meets a female American agent named Izzie, whose duty is to recover the tattoos. He decides to help her and gets wrapped up in a cross-national conspiracy.', 'The story follows Justice Akazuka (a.k.a. Seigi), a young man who is good at martial arts. One day, Seigi rescues a homeless old man from some thugs, and the man gives him an object that imprints a tattoo on his palm. However, it is not an ordinary tattoo, but a special weapon that gives Seigi supernatural powers such as warping space-time. Seigi then meets a female American agent named Izzie, whose duty is to recover the tattoos. He decides to help her and gets wrapped up in a cross-national conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/amSovufH8T18cdB2FmDQ2qpSLLe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66992'),
  ('719253547480732980', 'Tabula Rasa', 2017, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Malin-Sarah Gozin, Veerle Baetens', 'Malin-Sarah Gozin, Christophe Dirickx, Veerle Baetens', 'Veerle Baetens, Stijn Van Opstal, Jeroen Perceval, Gene Bervoets, Natali Broods, Cécile Enthoven, Hilde Van Mieghem, Peter van den Begin', 'TV-MA', 'A psychological thriller about Mie, a young woman with amnesia who is locked up in a secure psychiatric hospital. Mie is visited by Detective Inspector Wolkers who claims she was the last person seen with the vanished Thomas Spectre. As a witness and prime suspect, she appears to be the sole key to this mysterious disappearance. In order to solve the puzzle and find Thomas, Mie has to reconstruct her lost memories and find her way back through the dark labyrinth of her recent past.', 'A psychological thriller about Mie, a young woman with amnesia who is locked up in a secure psychiatric hospital. Mie is visited by Detective Inspector Wolkers who claims she was the last person seen with the vanished Thomas Spectre. As a witness and prime suspect, she appears to be the sole key to this mysterious disappearance. In order to solve the puzzle and find Thomas, Mie has to reconstruct her lost memories and find her way back through the dark labyrinth of her recent past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A8LZI3pv0VgXsfad9AFDtv6ZTJC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74764'),
  ('330700905023157165', 'Taco Chronicles', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Pablo Cruz', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Many of the most popular taco styles have long, rich, little-known histories. Explore some of them in this eye-opening, mouth-watering food adventure.', 'Many of the most popular taco styles have long, rich, little-known histories. Explore some of them in this eye-opening, mouth-watering food adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4eTwFJWM2RM9zjSZJCKakqp3PN.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:91065'),
  ('742212720478752633', 'Tacoma FD', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Kevin Heffernan, Steve Lemme', null, 'Kevin Heffernan, Steve Lemme, Hassie Harrison, Marcus Henderson, Gabriel Hogan', 'TV-14', 'There''s not a lot of fires to fight in one of the rainiest cities in America, leaving the crew at the Tacoma Fire Department tackling the less glamorous elements of the job. Light on blazes that need extinguishing, this squad keeps itself entertained with creative competitions, friendly first responder rivalries, and bizarre emergency calls.', 'There''s not a lot of fires to fight in one of the rainiest cities in America, leaving the crew at the Tacoma Fire Department tackling the less glamorous elements of the job. Light on blazes that need extinguishing, this squad keeps itself entertained with creative competitions, friendly first responder rivalries, and bizarre emergency calls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mH0d0dUdHYkmHLAkoTVXc1FUS9V.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:86893'),
  ('790510547918762457', 'Tada Never Falls in Love', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Yuichi Nakamura, Manaka Iwami, Mamoru Miyano, Shino Shimoji, Yuuichirou Umehara, Hiro Shimono, Inori Minase, Takahiro Sakurai', 'TV-14', 'Mitsuyoshi Tada, a boy who has never known love, is taking pictures of the cherry blossoms in full bloom when he meets Teresa Wagner, a transfer student from Luxembourg. Upon arriving in Japan, she got lost, separated from her travel companion. Mitsuyoshi helps her and brings her to his grandfather''s coffee shop.', 'Mitsuyoshi Tada, a boy who has never known love, is taking pictures of the cherry blossoms in full bloom when he meets Teresa Wagner, a transfer student from Luxembourg. Upon arriving in Japan, she got lost, separated from her travel companion. Mitsuyoshi helps her and brings her to his grandfather''s coffee shop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3BazV6nF9Cr3vVepAhWCFMp12b4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75975'),
  ('374697604285721076', 'Tada''s Do-It-All House', 2013, 'Drama', null, null, 'Eita Nagayama, Ryuhei Matsuda', null, 'In the fictional town of Mahoro on the outskirts of Tokyo is Tada Benriken, a small business which does odd jobs. Its owner is the solemn and level-headed Tada Keisuke, and his unexpected guest, the easygoing but vague Gyoten Haruhiko, a former junior high school classmate who showed up one day and started to sponge on him. The two of them get on like oil and water, and yet are somehow inseparable. They receive queer, dubious incoming odd job requests which they accept, and what comes into view are the friendship between them as well as the backgrounds of their clients.', 'In the fictional town of Mahoro on the outskirts of Tokyo is Tada Benriken, a small business which does odd jobs. Its owner is the solemn and level-headed Tada Keisuke, and his unexpected guest, the easygoing but vague Gyoten Haruhiko, a former junior high school classmate who showed up one day and started to sponge on him. The two of them get on like oil and water, and yet are somehow inseparable. They receive queer, dubious incoming odd job requests which they accept, and what comes into view are the friendship between them as well as the backgrounds of their clients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e0h79Fygv0JWEBeGuWqK4rwdmub.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:53460'),
  ('523345238282754064', 'Tadaima, Okaeri', 2024, 'Animation', null, null, 'Atsushi Tamaru, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Atsumi Tanezaki, Taku Yashiro, Kaede Hondo, Shintaro Asanuma, Kazuyuki Okitsu, Toshiki Masuda', null, 'Masaki struggles with self-worth as an omega parent, but just as life feels stable, the past comes knocking with uneasy motives.', 'Masaki struggles with self-worth as an omega parent, but just as life feels stable, the past comes knocking with uneasy motives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hEpXSDGopY61A13lGfgZQVqkoLB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:235978'),
