  ('496602065248977207', 'Taggart', 1983, 'Crime, Drama', 'Glenn Chandler', null, 'Mark McManus, James MacPherson, Alex Norton, Colin McCredie, John Michie, Harriet Buchan, Tom Watson', 'TV-14', 'Taggart is a Scottish detective television program. The series revolves around a group of detectives initially in the Maryhill CID of Strathclyde Police, though various storylines have happened in other parts of the Greater Glasgow area, and as of the most recent series the team have operated out of the fictional John Street police station across the street from the City Chambers.', 'Taggart is a Scottish detective television program. The series revolves around a group of detectives initially in the Maryhill CID of Strathclyde Police, though various storylines have happened in other parts of the Greater Glasgow area, and as of the most recent series the team have operated out of the fictional John Street police station across the street from the City Chambers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3PbPPSHjaiZ2jxFUSvbd8clmfaB.jpg', 27, 'tmdb:tv:2428'),
  ('1042813483739320595', 'TAGUSARI bros.', 2026, 'Mystery, Crime', null, 'Kei Watanabe', 'Masaki Okada, Shota Sometani, Ayami Nakajo, Haruka Igawa, Miyachika Kaito, Goro Kishitani, Takashi Yamanaka, Nobuko Sendo', null, 'Two brothers become police officers to hunt down their parents'' killer, who escaped justice by just two days before the statute of limitations was abolished.', 'Two brothers become police officers to hunt down their parents'' killer, who escaped justice by just two days before the statute of limitations was abolished.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m6UmAAt2X39j6KWeIsATEX2O5qu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:311871'),
  ('380436292631830497', 'Taiga Novel', 2000, 'Crime, Drama', 'Aleksandr Mitta', null, 'Aleksey Guskov, Marat Basharov, Olga Budina, Elena Panova, Mikhail Efremov, Renata Litvinova, Andrei Panin, Vladimir Simonov', null, 'Far East. 70th years. A small garrison on the border with China. Here, as everywhere, there are men and women. Everyone has his own story, his own destiny, his own love. The common thing is that they all came here once on duty and stayed for a long time. Marina Goloshchekina is nice, kind, right. Galya The tourniquet is intelligent, passionate, determined. Albina Raven - extravagant, unpredictable, thin. Three friends, three sisters in happiness and misfortune, officers'' wives. They help each other stand in this completely feminine world, where every man has a gun! And this means that love and danger go hand in hand. Marina quite unexpectedly meets her true love of the young officer Ivan Stolbov. Learn about this new secret love girlfriend. On the one hand, you can rejoice over Marina. But how can she rejoice herself, if behind five years of marriage with a strong, strong-willed and very unpredictable Nikita Goloshchekin?', 'Far East. 70th years. A small garrison on the border with China. Here, as everywhere, there are men and women. Everyone has his own story, his own destiny, his own love. The common thing is that they all came here once on duty and stayed for a long time. Marina Goloshchekina is nice, kind, right. Galya The tourniquet is intelligent, passionate, determined. Albina Raven - extravagant, unpredictable, thin. Three friends, three sisters in happiness and misfortune, officers'' wives. They help each other stand in this completely feminine world, where every man has a gun! And this means that love and danger go hand in hand. Marina quite unexpectedly meets her true love of the young officer Ivan Stolbov. Learn about this new secret love girlfriend. On the one hand, you can rejoice over Marina. But how can she rejoice herself, if behind five years of marriage with a strong, strong-willed and very unpredictable Nikita Goloshchekin?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDOLIKzG3KyHSU4vfVU47tnrxpl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100997'),
