  ('628794526038541877', 'Tari Tari', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Ayahi Takagaki, Asami Seto, Saori Hayami, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Natsuki Hanae', null, 'Wakana Sakai was involved in music, but gave it up one day. Konatsu Miyamoto loves singing and can''t be torn from it. Sawa Okita would do anything for her closest friends. They laugh, they fight, they worry, they love... Through their very ordinary lives, little by little the girls learn to move forward. Sometimes they feel as if they can''t go on alone, but as long as they have their friends, they believe they''ll make it someday. Wakana, Konatsu, Sawa, and the music they make in their ensemble weave a tiny but dazzling story of the power of music.', 'Wakana Sakai was involved in music, but gave it up one day. Konatsu Miyamoto loves singing and can''t be torn from it. Sawa Okita would do anything for her closest friends. They laugh, they fight, they worry, they love... Through their very ordinary lives, little by little the girls learn to move forward. Sometimes they feel as if they can''t go on alone, but as long as they have their friends, they believe they''ll make it someday. Wakana, Konatsu, Sawa, and the music they make in their ensemble weave a tiny but dazzling story of the power of music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uBnGs7fMeDcbeb3AWYmpQEn9VqY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45211'),
  ('321486676324478101', 'Tarot', 2024, 'Mystery', null, null, null, null, 'A brutal fate mystery series that tells the story of being trapped in the curse of tarot cards twisted by a moment''s choice.', 'A brutal fate mystery series that tells the story of being trapped in the curse of tarot cards twisted by a moment''s choice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/diEPoV1IgS0RCAae3pE4ZVkCq2A.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:243763'),
  ('412562625899158219', 'Tarzan', 1966, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Sy Weintraub', null, 'Ron Ely, Manuel Padilla Jr., Alan Caillou, Rockne Tarkington', 'NR', 'Tarzan is a series that aired on NBC from 1966 – 1968. The series portrayed Tarzan as a well-educated character, one who, tired of civilization, had returned to the jungle where he had been raised. The show retained many of the trappings of the classic movie series, including Cheeta, while excluding other elements, such as Jane, as part of the "new look" for the fabled apeman that producer Sy Weintraub had introduced in previous motion pictures starring Gordon Scott, Jock Mahoney, and Mike Henry. CBS aired repeat episodes the program during the summer of 1969.', 'Tarzan is a series that aired on NBC from 1966 – 1968. The series portrayed Tarzan as a well-educated character, one who, tired of civilization, had returned to the jungle where he had been raised. The show retained many of the trappings of the classic movie series, including Cheeta, while excluding other elements, such as Jane, as part of the "new look" for the fabled apeman that producer Sy Weintraub had introduced in previous motion pictures starring Gordon Scott, Jock Mahoney, and Mike Henry. CBS aired repeat episodes the program during the summer of 1969.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/keL3WMJW45o7rd5aKDPMG3bgf1p.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:10808'),
  ('420912971264780727', 'Tarzan', 2003, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Eric Kripke', null, 'Travis Fimmel, Sarah Wayne Callies, Miguel A. Núñez Jr., Leighton Meester, Lucy Lawless, Mitch Pileggi', null, 'From the day two decades ago that young John Clayton''s parents died and left him alone in the African jungle, he was raised by apes and has emerged as the fearless Tarzan. Captured by his billionaire uncle, Richard Clayton, the CEO of powerful Greystoke Industries, Tarzan is returned, against his will, to his family''s home in New York City. Resisting captivity, he escapes into the concrete jungle of New York City where he encounters the strong-willed NYPD detective Jane Porter. Jane''s perfectly ordered life is turned upside-down by Tarzan''s dangerous yet profoundly untainted morality. Romantically involved with another member of the force, Detective Michael Foster, Jane is left to choose between reason and instinct, civilization and pure humanity, her head and her heart.', 'From the day two decades ago that young John Clayton''s parents died and left him alone in the African jungle, he was raised by apes and has emerged as the fearless Tarzan. Captured by his billionaire uncle, Richard Clayton, the CEO of powerful Greystoke Industries, Tarzan is returned, against his will, to his family''s home in New York City. Resisting captivity, he escapes into the concrete jungle of New York City where he encounters the strong-willed NYPD detective Jane Porter. Jane''s perfectly ordered life is turned upside-down by Tarzan''s dangerous yet profoundly untainted morality. Romantically involved with another member of the force, Detective Michael Foster, Jane is left to choose between reason and instinct, civilization and pure humanity, her head and her heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7VqtvdnT5INWyS2iIqNu49dDwC1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2210'),
  ('358442420520609254', 'Tarzán', 1991, 'Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Wolf Larson, Sean Roberge, Lydie Denier', null, 'Tarzán was a half-hour syndicated series that aired 1991–1994. In this version of the show, Tarzan was portrayed as a blond environmentalist, with Jane turned into a French ecologist. Ron Ely, famous for playing Tarzan in the original series, played a character named Gorden Shaw in the first season episode “Tarzan the Hunted”.', 'Tarzán was a half-hour syndicated series that aired 1991–1994. In this version of the show, Tarzan was portrayed as a blond environmentalist, with Jane turned into a French ecologist. Ron Ely, famous for playing Tarzan in the original series, played a character named Gorden Shaw in the first season episode “Tarzan the Hunted”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8SkdODSGOfK8awjyLi7VAilctB.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:11737'),
  ('702741235913077773', 'Tash ma Tash', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nasser Al Qasabi, Abdullah Al Sadhan', null, 'Nasser Al Qasabi, Abdullah Al-Sadhan', null, 'Comedy drama sketches portraying social problems in the Saudi society with different takes on storylines.', 'Comedy drama sketches portraying social problems in the Saudi society with different takes on storylines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewZskTZm8O04XeXoIlBJuKe02ZV.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:67699'),
  ('830242445506379939', 'Task', 2025, 'Crime, Drama', 'Brad Ingelsby', null, 'Mark Ruffalo, Tom Pelphrey, Emilia Jones, Fabien Frankel, Thuso Mbedu, Raúl Castillo, Jamie McShane, Alison Oliver', 'TV-MA', 'In the working-class suburbs of Philadelphia, an FBI agent heads a task force assembled to put an end to a string of violent robberies led by an unsuspecting family man.', 'In the working-class suburbs of Philadelphia, an FBI agent heads a task force assembled to put an end to a string of violent robberies led by an unsuspecting family man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9JdL1aQdAQiyYYQ2xCqbHaEcZt8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:228305'),
  ('781167029928458402', 'Taskaree: The Smuggler''s Web', 2026, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Neeraj Pandey', 'Vipul K Rawal, Neeraj Pandey', 'Emraan Hashmi, Sharad Kelkar, Anurag Sinha, Zoya Afroz, Nandish Singh, Amruta Khanvilkar, Anuja Sathe, Freddy Daruwala', 'TV-MA', 'A dedicated customs officer and his team take on a notorious smuggler leading a powerful syndicate, but unexpected obstacles threaten their mission.', 'A dedicated customs officer and his team take on a notorious smuggler leading a powerful syndicate, but unexpected obstacles threaten their mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/25fKRXvQLBq4nXu9vjOVJcvCiiD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:308482'),
  ('630496216082840405', 'Taskmaster', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Alex Horne', 'Alex Horne', 'Greg Davies, Alex Horne, Amy Gledhill, Armando Iannucci, Joanna Page, Joel Dommett, Kumail Nanjiani', 'TV-14', 'Greg Davies is the Taskmaster, and with the help of his ever-loyal assistant Alex Horne, they will set out to test the wiles, wit, wisdom and skills of five hyper-competitive comedians. Who will be crowned the Taskmaster champion?', 'Greg Davies is the Taskmaster, and with the help of his ever-loyal assistant Alex Horne, they will set out to test the wiles, wit, wisdom and skills of five hyper-competitive comedians. Who will be crowned the Taskmaster champion?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oHLZyN7G7EpXCHxYdpMcuUNCUgS.jpg', 21, 'tmdb:tv:63404'),
