  ('43990176428488615', 'Tavis Smiley', 2004, 'Talk, News', null, null, 'Tavis Smiley', null, 'Tavis Smiley features a unique mix of news and pop culture to combine for one thought-provoking and entertaining program. A hybrid of news, issues and entertainment, it features interviews with artists, activists, newsmakers, politicians and everyday people. Since its first season, the show has won four NAACP Image Awards for "Outstanding Television, News, Talk, or Information (Series or Special)." Taped at KCET studios, Tavis Smiley is the first West Coast talk show for PBS and is produced by The Smiley Group Inc./TS Media Inc. in association with KCET/Hollywood.', 'Tavis Smiley features a unique mix of news and pop culture to combine for one thought-provoking and entertaining program. A hybrid of news, issues and entertainment, it features interviews with artists, activists, newsmakers, politicians and everyday people. Since its first season, the show has won four NAACP Image Awards for "Outstanding Television, News, Talk, or Information (Series or Special)." Taped at KCET studios, Tavis Smiley is the first West Coast talk show for PBS and is produced by The Smiley Group Inc./TS Media Inc. in association with KCET/Hollywood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/miACRlSfqYIrw4WtdY8snSMaSHz.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:26338'),
  ('592563757324027822', 'Tawan Tor Saeng', 2012, 'Drama', null, 'Nuttiya Sirakornwilai', 'Pakorn Lam, Davika Hoorne, Tawatson Plengsiriwat, Kirk Schiller, Chadaporn Rattanakorn, Rossarin Jantra, Thongpoom Siripipat, Phairoj Jaising', null, 'Rasa is an interior designer at an interior design company in Bangkok. Her boss Petiya receives an assignment from Pakaphong, a well known rich playboy. The assignment is assigned to Rasa, she meets Pakaphong and realises she''s met him before.', 'Rasa is an interior designer at an interior design company in Bangkok. Her boss Petiya receives an assignment from Pakaphong, a well known rich playboy. The assignment is assigned to Rasa, she meets Pakaphong and realises she''s met him before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jNT1iswRkTab9BFyk4k39Zg5Wf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:50757'),
  ('737538218871782712', 'Tawan Yor Saeng', 2017, 'Drama, Family', null, 'Kartarhut Bussabpaket', 'Pichukkana Wongsarattanasin, Natthawut Skidjai, Vachiravit Paisarnkulwong, Rinrada Kaewbuasai, Unnop Thongborisut, Arisara Thongborisut, Pareena Busayasiri, Rhatha Phongam', null, 'After finding her real father Tawan changes her name to Yor Saeng. She meets Lek, whose older sister is married to her father. Lek is a nice man who treats Yor Saeng as his niece but eventually he falls in love with her.', 'After finding her real father Tawan changes her name to Yor Saeng. She meets Lek, whose older sister is married to her father. Lek is a nice man who treats Yor Saeng as his niece but eventually he falls in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q1e0FU4wjoBwZgmIQyxO612f8wJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:53579'),
  ('577723220238816412', 'Tawawa on Monday', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Sayaka Harada, Junji Majima, Ai Kayano, Yasuaki Takumi', 'TV-14', 'The anime follows a salaryman who has a chance meeting with a girl named Ai on the train. They begin to meet every Monday on the train, with the man serving as her bodyguard on the crowded commute while they chat.', 'The anime follows a salaryman who has a chance meeting with a girl named Ai on the train. They begin to meet every Monday on the train, with the man serving as her bodyguard on the crowded commute while they chat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8El663tdtQUxULLx3iBQMlb3FsO.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:68455'),
  ('500097470554028350', 'Taxa', 1997, 'Drama', 'Stig Thorsboe', 'Stig Thorsboe, Adam Price', 'Pernille Højmark, Zlatko Burić, Pia Vieth, Jesper Lohmann, Leif Sylvester, Peter Gantzler, John Hahn-Petersen, Margrethe Koytu', null, 'TAXA is a Danish television drama made by Danmarks Radio with 56 episodes, written by Stig Thorsboe and produced by Rumble Hammerich. The series revolves around a small taxi central, CrownTaxi, in Copenhagen. The series was a success from the start, 14 September 1997 on DR1. The series was broadcast during the period 1997-1999 for a total of five series. CrownTaxi has its ups and downs and in the course of the series, following the various drivers, radio opertor Lizzie and boss Verner Boye-Larsen. They have all their problems both with clients and family life and constantly threaten the show''s villain Hermann from the competing taxi firm, City Car, which wants to take over the CrownTaxi. TAXA was also screened in Sweden on SVT1.', 'TAXA is a Danish television drama made by Danmarks Radio with 56 episodes, written by Stig Thorsboe and produced by Rumble Hammerich. The series revolves around a small taxi central, CrownTaxi, in Copenhagen. The series was a success from the start, 14 September 1997 on DR1. The series was broadcast during the period 1997-1999 for a total of five series. CrownTaxi has its ups and downs and in the course of the series, following the various drivers, radio opertor Lizzie and boss Verner Boye-Larsen. They have all their problems both with clients and family life and constantly threaten the show''s villain Hermann from the competing taxi firm, City Car, which wants to take over the CrownTaxi. TAXA was also screened in Sweden on SVT1.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uKbggFp5pkMYIgQitkXfKImjuOP.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:51261'),
  ('270022351559843723', 'Taxi', 1978, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Stan Daniels, Ed. Weinberger, James L. Brooks', 'Dennis Danzinger, David Davis, Holly Holmberg Brooks', 'Judd Hirsch, Danny DeVito, Marilu Henner, Tony Danza, Andy Kaufman, Christopher Lloyd, Carol Kane', 'TV-PG', 'Louie De Palma is a cantankerous, acerbic taxi dispatcher in New York City. He tries to maintain order over a collection of varied and strange characters who drive for him. As he bullies and insults them from the safety of his “cage,” they form a special bond among themselves, becoming friends and supporting each other through the inevitable trials and tribulations of life.', 'Louie De Palma is a cantankerous, acerbic taxi dispatcher in New York City. He tries to maintain order over a collection of varied and strange characters who drive for him. As he bullies and insults them from the safety of his “cage,” they form a special bond among themselves, becoming friends and supporting each other through the inevitable trials and tribulations of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pua3A2XSaO6bP6WhVDBRbcyRTAS.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:2251'),
  ('1068500495501243682', 'Taxi Brooklyn', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Crime', 'Franck Ollivier, Gary Scott Thompson, Stephen Tolkin', 'Luc Besson', 'Chyler Leigh, Jacky Ido, James Colby, José Zúñiga, Jennifer Esposito, Bill Heck, Ally Walker, Raul Casso', 'TV-14', 'Caitlin "Cat" Sullivan is an NYPD detective working in Brooklyn. After her driving privileges are suspended, she relies on Leo Romba, a highly skilled Brooklyn cab driver from France. Leo becomes Cat''s driver and a consultant on her cases. While solving crimes with Leo, Cat is also running her own unauthorized investigation into the death of her father, an NYPD detective thought to have been executed by the Capella crime family. In doing so, she clashes with her boss, Captain Baker, and her ex-husband Gregg, who has picked up the case for the FBI.', 'Caitlin "Cat" Sullivan is an NYPD detective working in Brooklyn. After her driving privileges are suspended, she relies on Leo Romba, a highly skilled Brooklyn cab driver from France. Leo becomes Cat''s driver and a consultant on her cases. While solving crimes with Leo, Cat is also running her own unauthorized investigation into the death of her father, an NYPD detective thought to have been executed by the Capella crime family. In doing so, she clashes with her boss, Captain Baker, and her ex-husband Gregg, who has picked up the case for the FBI.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjn1GSt1oXopuLqrRPKmo6AyU3R.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60941'),
  ('197989884217835959', 'Taxi Driver', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Lee Ok-gyu', null, 'Lee Je-hoon, Kim Eui-sung, Pyo Ye-jin, Jang Hyuk-jin, Bae Yu-ram, 설지원', 'TV-MA', 'A former special forces soldier delivers revenge for victims of injustice while working for a secret organization that fronts as a taxi company.', 'A former special forces soldier delivers revenge for victims of injustice while working for a secret organization that fronts as a taxi company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lghfb8beej1aH9ML8QyeSixniom.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:119769'),
  ('790497642267437637', 'Taylor Swift vs Scooter Braun: Bad Blood', 2024, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Follow the feud between global poster Swift and music industry exec Braun, looking at the $300M dispute after Braun bought the rights to Swift’s first six albums. Hear from legal experts, journalists and those close to both Swift and Braun, presenting each side of the argument.', 'Follow the feud between global poster Swift and music industry exec Braun, looking at the $300M dispute after Braun bought the rights to Swift’s first six albums. Hear from legal experts, journalists and those close to both Swift and Braun, presenting each side of the argument.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKJVL5EY5lAdN2TtyqQvsvAwWFH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:253832'),
  ('1088604212283877980', 'Taylor Swift: Journey to Fearless', 2010, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Taylor Swift, Andrea Swift, Scott Swift, Caitlin Evanson, Liz Huett, Paul Sidoti, Mike Meadows, Amos Heller', 'TV-G', 'Riveting performances from the 2010 tour, revealing interviews, behind-the-scenes footage, and early home videos come together to tell the story of a little girl who dared to dream big, and who fearlessly faced near-insurmountable obstacles to make those dreams come true.', 'Riveting performances from the 2010 tour, revealing interviews, behind-the-scenes footage, and early home videos come together to tell the story of a little girl who dared to dream big, and who fearlessly faced near-insurmountable obstacles to make those dreams come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5B4CCLw4Y6LXexZzyHHjdbCDHZU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34309'),
  ('1068698224292741082', 'Taz-Mania', 1991, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Tom Ruegger, Jean MacCurdy', null, 'Jim Cummings, Maurice LaMarche, Miriam Flynn, Kellie Martin, Debi Derryberry, Dan Castellaneta, John Astin, Rob Paulsen', 'TV-Y7', 'The wildest teenager south of the Equator, Taz lives to party. With his insatiable appetite, he tends to eat everything in sight. The oldest child in a family of five, Taz works at a rather bizarre coastal resort, the Hotel Tasmania, as a bellhop, busboy to earn party money.', 'The wildest teenager south of the Equator, Taz lives to party. With his insatiable appetite, he tends to eat everything in sight. The oldest child in a family of five, Taz works at a rather bizarre coastal resort, the Hotel Tasmania, as a bellhop, busboy to earn party money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozqJKBZq3k7BjyAwv2A7V1Zv6Ba.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:10126'),
