  ('477774647841378302', 'Teri Meri Doriyaann', 2023, 'Drama, Family', 'Snigdha Basu', null, 'Vijayendra Kumeria, Himanshi Parashar, Tushar Dhembla, Roopam Sharma, Jatin Arora, Prachi Hadaa, Lubna Salim, Sagar Saini', null, 'It’s hate at first sight for Sahiba and Angad! But destined to be together, their lives get intertwined by a marriage alliance, and a love-hate story ensues.', 'It’s hate at first sight for Sahiba and Angad! But destined to be together, their lives get intertwined by a marriage alliance, and a love-hate story ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BHDmYiuSnNL3nqKIOzLJKYX4AN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215103'),
  ('511032898976614265', 'Terim', 2022, 'Documentary', null, 'Altuğ Gültan', 'Fatih Terim, Bülent Timurlenk', null, 'Legendary manager Fatih Terim recounts his football journey, from his playing days to coaching and leading several teams to championship glory.', 'Legendary manager Fatih Terim recounts his football journey, from his playing days to coaching and leading several teams to championship glory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bl8mWAgrO8Gt93zQRka2f77j5ci.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209032'),
  ('877113694177675176', 'Terminal', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Andréas Georgiou, Azedine Bendjilali, Angela Soupe', 'Angela Soupe, Giulio Callegari, Xavier Lacaille', 'Ramzy Bedia, Bérangère McNeese, Brahim Bouhlel, Tristan Lopin, Camille Chamoux, Laureen "lapotegenante", Doully, Samuel Bambi', null, 'Welcome aboard Flywings, the lowest of all low-cost airlines! Greeting you today is your pilot, Jack, who handles his personal life as inadequately as he does his airplanes. Alongside is co-pilot Charlie, recently demoted from a classier airline, as well as an oddball -to put it mildly - crew of flight attendants: naïve Nelly, erratic Nabil, ambitious Tristan, and social justice warrior Armelle. A disaster safety check or a child who takes over the control system? Our crew of loveable losers - almost - always join forces to handle such absurd situations. And too bad if their methods don’t quite follow airline safety procedures. So why not sit back, and enjoy your flight!', 'Welcome aboard Flywings, the lowest of all low-cost airlines! Greeting you today is your pilot, Jack, who handles his personal life as inadequately as he does his airplanes. Alongside is co-pilot Charlie, recently demoted from a classier airline, as well as an oddball -to put it mildly - crew of flight attendants: naïve Nelly, erratic Nabil, ambitious Tristan, and social justice warrior Armelle. A disaster safety check or a child who takes over the control system? Our crew of loveable losers - almost - always join forces to handle such absurd situations. And too bad if their methods don’t quite follow airline safety procedures. So why not sit back, and enjoy your flight!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hnuyzMrstnioBsEphMfzhjheLI6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:237630'),
  ('115747840279073995', 'Terminator Salvation: The Machinima Series', 2009, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', 'Tor Helmstein, Ian Kirby', null, 'Moon Bloodgood, Cam Clarke, Jim Meskimen', null, 'In the Year 2016, Resistance fighter Blair Williams embarks on a deadly mission to search for a threat that is weakening humanity''s defense against the self-aware artificial intelligence called Skynet and it''s lethal Terminators.', 'In the Year 2016, Resistance fighter Blair Williams embarks on a deadly mission to search for a threat that is weakening humanity''s defense against the self-aware artificial intelligence called Skynet and it''s lethal Terminators.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/XE6GE6JFj8nMd2qPcqby15M82X.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:56150'),
  ('1133442814389883259', 'Terminator Zero', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Mattson Tomlin', null, 'Yuuya Uchida, Hiro Shimono, Saori Hayami, Toa Yukinari, Atsumi Tanezaki', 'TV-MA', 'A warrior from a post-apocalyptic future travels to 1997 to protect an AI scientist being hunted by an unfeeling — and indestructible — cyborg.', 'A warrior from a post-apocalyptic future travels to 1997 to protect an AI scientist being hunted by an unfeeling — and indestructible — cyborg.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v4sbn6IsJGAIZNHjdB4CprvS7zo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:239287'),
  ('213830614177996218', 'Terminator: The Sarah Connor Chronicles', 2008, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Josh Friedman', null, 'Lena Headey, Thomas Dekker, Summer Glau, Richard T. Jones, Shirley Manson, Brian Austin Green', 'TV-14', 'The series picks up four years after the events of Terminator 2: Judgment Day with John and Sarah Connor trying to stay under-the-radar from the government, as they plot to destroy the computer network, Skynet, in hopes of preventing Armageddon.', 'The series picks up four years after the events of Terminator 2: Judgment Day with John and Sarah Connor trying to stay under-the-radar from the government, as they plot to destroy the computer network, Skynet, in hopes of preventing Armageddon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vkMRWrVrNeX42ruRV5Q15mlBACG.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:433'),
  ('532733970994620376', 'Terms of Endearment', 2004, 'Drama', 'Moon Young-nam', 'Moon Young-nam', 'Chae Shi-ra, Ji Sung, Han Ga-in, Song Il-gook, Lee Jong-won, Lee Bo-hee, Jung Han-yong, Park Yong-woo', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5xi28ydideQpzfmEBh3BT9p78C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:36209'),
  ('190635272910726648', 'Terra Alta', 2025, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Eligio R. Montero', null, 'Miguel Bernardeau, Ivan Massagué, Marta Etura, Bea Segura, Goya Toledo, Pere Ponce, Pablo Derqui, Manel Barceló', null, 'It centred on the murder of two prominent businesspeople in Catalonia.', 'It centred on the murder of two prominent businesspeople in Catalonia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45kPCZ0u6WDkIslRqNtEWXF1qxa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259615'),
  ('230871874376557637', 'Terra Formars', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Hiroshi Hamasaki', null, 'Akira Ishida, Kaito Ishikawa, Daisuke Ono, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Kenji Akabane, Unsho Ishizuka, Shizuka Itoh, Nozomi Sasaki', 'TV-14', 'Twenty years ago, Shokichi Komachi was part of the Bugs 2 mission to Mars that discovered Terra Formars, human-cockroach hybrids that resulted from a terraforming accident. Shokichi was one of only two survivors. Now, the AE virus that came from Mars is raging wildly on earth. Shokichi boards the spacecraft Annex 1 to go back to Mars to find a sample in order to create a vaccine. They will face an unanticipated accident, a multinational conspiracy, and even more advanced Terra Formars.', 'Twenty years ago, Shokichi Komachi was part of the Bugs 2 mission to Mars that discovered Terra Formars, human-cockroach hybrids that resulted from a terraforming accident. Shokichi was one of only two survivors. Now, the AE virus that came from Mars is raging wildly on earth. Shokichi boards the spacecraft Annex 1 to go back to Mars to find a sample in order to create a vaccine. They will face an unanticipated accident, a multinational conspiracy, and even more advanced Terra Formars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZTpfSicZCwa1R6GXFFy8d2Ir8k.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61398'),
  ('957117193907630249', 'Terra Forte', 2025, 'Drama', 'Maria João Costa', null, 'Benedita Pereira, João Catarré, Rita Pereira, José Fidalgo, Francisca Salgado, Tomás Taborda, Camy Ribau, Custódia Gallego', null, 'Presumed dead for nearly twenty years, Flor reappears in Azores with a revelation capable of shaking the past and reshaping the present: her disappearance was not an accident, as everyone believed. The reunion with those who thought they had lost her forever, including a former love, reopens deep wounds and sets in motion a dangerous quest for justice.', 'Presumed dead for nearly twenty years, Flor reappears in Azores with a revelation capable of shaking the past and reshaping the present: her disappearance was not an accident, as everyone believed. The reunion with those who thought they had lost her forever, including a former love, reopens deep wounds and sets in motion a dangerous quest for justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emDXPQIYkRDvqd3EChIYc39kGmc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:293939'),
  ('288975675475244519', 'Terra Nostra', 1999, 'Soap, Drama', 'Benedito Ruy Barbosa', 'Edmara Barbosa, Edilene Barbosa', 'Thiago Lacerda, Ana Paula Arósio, Antônio Fagundes, Débora Duarte, Raul Cortez, Ângela Vieira, Maria Fernanda Cândido, Marcello Antony', null, 'This top-seller recounts the saga of Italians who immigrated to Brazil during the XIX century, seeking their fortunes in America. The forbidden love between Giulliana and Matteo flowers in the midst of the sweeping changes ushered in by the arrival of these Europeans in Brazilian towns. This great epic has thrilled viewers in more than eighty countries.', 'This top-seller recounts the saga of Italians who immigrated to Brazil during the XIX century, seeking their fortunes in America. The forbidden love between Giulliana and Matteo flowers in the midst of the sweeping changes ushered in by the arrival of these Europeans in Brazilian towns. This great epic has thrilled viewers in more than eighty countries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yEXACjIps0cehcZeIPObKjccpwD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12895'),
  ('832023750842513404', 'Terra Nova', 2011, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Kelly Marcel, Craig Silverstein', null, 'Jason O''Mara, Shelley Conn, Christine Adams, Allison Miller, Landon Liboiron, Naomi Scott, Mido Hamada, Alana Mansour', 'TV-14', 'In the year 2149, the world is dying. The planet is overdeveloped and overcrowded, with the majority of plant and animal life extinct. The future of mankind is in jeopardy, and its only hope for survival is in the distant past. An ordinary family goes on an extraordinary journey back in time to prehistoric Earth as a part of a massive expedition to save the human race.', 'In the year 2149, the world is dying. The planet is overdeveloped and overcrowded, with the majority of plant and animal life extinct. The future of mankind is in jeopardy, and its only hope for survival is in the distant past. An ordinary family goes on an extraordinary journey back in time to prehistoric Earth as a part of a massive expedition to save the human race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y8dFONeUSXhMHiFecqFoaGI7S6y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32754'),
  ('735781328267017746', 'Terrace House: Aloha State', 2016, 'Reality', null, null, 'YOU, Reina Triendl, Yoshimi Tokui, Ryota Yamasato, Azusa Babazono, Kentaro Ito', 'NR', 'The beautiful island of Oahu is host to a new batch of six strangers who share a single roof, multiple conflicts and no script in this reality series.', 'The beautiful island of Oahu is host to a new batch of six strangers who share a single roof, multiple conflicts and no script in this reality series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYBOS6hekFriElnPsXzT1FmP61Z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69864'),
  ('630229371164390399', 'Terrace House: Boys & Girls in the City', 2015, 'Reality', null, null, 'YOU, Reina Triendl, Yoshimi Tokui, Ryota Yamasato, Azusa Babazono, Kentaro Ito, Ayumu Mochizuki', 'TV-14', 'A new set of six men and women start their lives together under one roof. All they get is a fabulous home and a car. As always, there is no script.', 'A new set of six men and women start their lives together under one roof. All they get is a fabulous home and a car. As always, there is no script.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/43m08RWCk7QSB1KOVEuWl47fzyo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66647'),
  ('15607684170949298', 'Terrace House: Boys × Girls Next Door', 2012, 'Reality', null, null, 'YOU, Reina Triendl, Yoshimi Tokui, Ryota Yamasato, Azusa Babazono, Hiroomi Tosaka, Tetsuya Sugaya', null, 'Terrace House: Boys × Girls Next Door was a Japanese reality television series in the Terrace House franchise. It originally aired on Fuji Television''s "Cool TV" segment from October 12, 2012 to September 29, 2014 for eight seasons, after which a standalone movie was released as a continuation/conclusion of the show. The show took place in a modernistic house with a terrace located in the Shōnan area.', 'Terrace House: Boys × Girls Next Door was a Japanese reality television series in the Terrace House franchise. It originally aired on Fuji Television''s "Cool TV" segment from October 12, 2012 to September 29, 2014 for eight seasons, after which a standalone movie was released as a continuation/conclusion of the show. The show took place in a modernistic house with a terrace located in the Shōnan area.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMfs2pF66sF5uLsZeCAcsfC2yrD.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:75815'),
  ('524058296113378936', 'Terrace House: Opening New Doors', 2017, 'Reality', null, null, 'YOU, Reina Triendl, Yoshimi Tokui, Ryota Yamasato, Azusa Babazono, Shono Hayama', 'TV-14', 'The bright young people of Terrace House return to Japan, where they live together and face new relationship challenges.', 'The bright young people of Terrace House return to Japan, where they live together and face new relationship challenges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7FJboauhE3x5urYVTmL9YG3fxg7.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:75814'),
  ('59651093550387770', 'Terrace House: Tokyo 2019-2020', 2019, 'Reality, Drama, Soap', null, null, 'YOU, Reina Triendl, Ryota Yamasato, Azusa Babazono, Shono Hayama', null, 'Six strangers share a fabulous house in Tokyo, looking for love while living under the same roof. With no script, what happens next is all up to them.', 'Six strangers share a fabulous house in Tokyo, looking for love while living under the same roof. With no script, what happens next is all up to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TrGKyXb4AoTikFG8SLyYzqSHVs.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:88850'),
  ('665848098588485577', 'Terriers', 2010, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Ted Griffin', null, 'Donal Logue, Michael Raymond-James, Laura Allen, Kimberly Quinn, Jamie Denbo, Rockmond Dunbar', 'TV-MA', 'Ex-cop and recovering alcoholic Hank Dolworth partners with his best friend, former criminal Britt Pollack, in an unlicensed private investigation business. The series is set in Ocean Beach, San Diego, California, although it is portrayed as a distinct town, with Dolworth having once been a member of the fictional Ocean Beach Police Department.', 'Ex-cop and recovering alcoholic Hank Dolworth partners with his best friend, former criminal Britt Pollack, in an unlicensed private investigation business. The series is set in Ocean Beach, San Diego, California, although it is portrayed as a distinct town, with Dolworth having once been a member of the fictional Ocean Beach Police Department.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/51T6VEO74kijlt2SDowGiiq0Cti.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:33400'),
  ('1128902028420446887', 'Territory', 2017, 'Mystery, Drama', null, 'Konstantin Sukharkov, Vano Burduli', 'Kirill Pirogov, Pyotr Fyodorov, Roman Mayakin, Igor Chernevich, Viktor Tsekalo, Igor Jijikine, Svetlana Smirnova-Martsinkevich, Timur Bazinskiy', null, 'The series of shocking murders are forcing two absolutely opposite detectives to unite. Working as a team helping them to solve the crime but they understand that winning the war never means that war is over.', 'The series of shocking murders are forcing two absolutely opposite detectives to unite. Working as a team helping them to solve the crime but they understand that winning the war never means that war is over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5lmRCDWjU2YCXQKgZExX2h1HcWD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130643'),
  ('566800987710581103', 'Territory', 2020, 'Drama', null, null, 'Gleb Kalyuzhny, Andrey Merzlikin, Anastasiya Chistyakova, Kseniya Otinova, Aleksey Rozin, Klavdiya Korshunova, Evgeny Mundum, Sergey Kolesov', null, '19-year-old Egor Chudinov goes in search of his parents, who disappeared during an ethnographic expedition to the Perm Region. Together with his uncle Nikolai and two random fellow travelers — students of philology Tanya and Nadia - Egor moves deeper into the territory, which lives according to its own laws and traditions. There is a gloomy nature here, hermits live in forest dugouts, diseases are treated by sorcerers, and the cause of troubles is considered to be damage caused by witches, and somewhere among the dense forests a bear shaman wanders. At first, Egor is skeptical about the stories about ancient creatures of Komi-Permian mythology, but gradually realizes that the world is much wider than his ideas.', '19-year-old Egor Chudinov goes in search of his parents, who disappeared during an ethnographic expedition to the Perm Region. Together with his uncle Nikolai and two random fellow travelers — students of philology Tanya and Nadia - Egor moves deeper into the territory, which lives according to its own laws and traditions. There is a gloomy nature here, hermits live in forest dugouts, diseases are treated by sorcerers, and the cause of troubles is considered to be damage caused by witches, and somewhere among the dense forests a bear shaman wanders. At first, Egor is skeptical about the stories about ancient creatures of Komi-Permian mythology, but gradually realizes that the world is much wider than his ideas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9eUUp5PgrFCnsRYdPhEGXLvx7xK.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:110583'),
  ('568640735707232170', 'Territory', 2024, 'Western, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Timothy Lee, Ben Davies', null, 'Anna Torv, Robert Taylor, Michael Dorman, Sam Corlett, Philippa Northeast, Jay Ryan, Kylah Day, Sara Wiseman', 'TV-MA', 'When the world''s largest cattle station is left without a clear heir, rival factions descend as a fierce generational struggle upends the land''s future.', 'When the world''s largest cattle station is left without a clear heir, rival factions descend as a fierce generational struggle upends the land''s future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPoNveBQWYwwWf2UnK27LEtWiqb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:243396'),
  ('1021243432526558234', 'Terror in Resonance', 2014, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Soma Saito, Atsumi Tanezaki, Kaito Ishikawa, Shunsuke Sakuya', 'TV-14', 'In an alternate version of the present, Tokyo has been decimated by a shocking terrorist attack, and the only hint to the identity of the culprit is a bizarre video uploaded to the internet. The police, baffled by this cryptic clue, are powerless to stop the paranoia spreading across the population. While the world searches for a criminal mastermind to blame for this tragedy, two mysterious children - children who shouldn''t even exist - masterfully carry out their heinous plan. Cursed to walk through this world with the names Nine and Twelve, the two combine to form "Sphinx," a clandestine entity determine to wake the people from their slumber - and pull the trigger on this world.', 'In an alternate version of the present, Tokyo has been decimated by a shocking terrorist attack, and the only hint to the identity of the culprit is a bizarre video uploaded to the internet. The police, baffled by this cryptic clue, are powerless to stop the paranoia spreading across the population. While the world searches for a criminal mastermind to blame for this tragedy, two mysterious children - children who shouldn''t even exist - masterfully carry out their heinous plan. Cursed to walk through this world with the names Nine and Twelve, the two combine to form "Sphinx," a clandestine entity determine to wake the people from their slumber - and pull the trigger on this world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wc1PaImHVXIESClpEDwNI1mlYuC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61421'),
  ('848609514810914265', 'Terror in the Woods', 2017, 'Documentary, Mystery, Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Investigate paranormal encounters in the wild. From gator hunting in Louisiana to ice fishing in Illinois, these are the real-life stories of people who embarked on an outdoors adventure, only to be scared out of the woods by ghosts, monsters, and other unexplained phenomena.', 'Investigate paranormal encounters in the wild. From gator hunting in Louisiana to ice fishing in Illinois, these are the real-life stories of people who embarked on an outdoors adventure, only to be scared out of the woods by ghosts, monsters, and other unexplained phenomena.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/elT8QTTcokSSa8xcp0On4BPQWyQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74993'),
  ('1130816084282469398', 'Terror Man', 2026, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Mystery', 'Han Dong-woo', null, null, null, 'Jungwoo Min has a special ability, one that lets him see whenever a path leads to an unfortunate future.', 'Jungwoo Min has a special ability, one that lets him see whenever a path leads to an unfortunate future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/13izuyHXlQAAlt8Vy0H1apb3bty.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:308005'),
  ('1109049785397184290', 'Terror Tuesday: Extreme', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Chayan Laoyodtrakool', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Inspired by the Thai horror radio show "Angkhan Khlumpong," this series presents eight stories based on real-life experiences shared by listeners.', 'Inspired by the Thai horror radio show "Angkhan Khlumpong," this series presents eight stories based on real-life experiences shared by listeners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnaIFI2CkH1UQrGtVbSUqlSNFwX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:258306'),
  ('914937209887062498', 'Terrorism Close Calls', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Marek Bureš', null, 'David Bitkower, Don Borelli, Dušan Kiš, Pete King', null, 'The war on terror is everywhere and anywhere. In this series, we learn about the deadly terrorist attacks that almost happened or were not as deadly as planned. Each episodes explores a recently declassified terrorist scheme intended to cause mass casualties.', 'The war on terror is everywhere and anywhere. In this series, we learn about the deadly terrorist attacks that almost happened or were not as deadly as planned. Each episodes explores a recently declassified terrorist scheme intended to cause mass casualties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bLYSR6qHtt2kLxpgqRQ2hYUuVel.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83462'),
  ('545434778989680244', 'Terry and June', 1979, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Terry Scott, June Whitfield', null, 'Terry and June Medford are both middle aged and beginning to find the trials of life are more difficult as they try to succeed in their daily lives. The couple have just moved to Purley, south-east London... Aunt Lucy and the mynah bird had disappeared, as had the occasionally visiting daughters. Terry and June now mixed with a friendly next door neighbour, Beattie; Terry''s chatty work colleague, Malcolm; and their gruff boss Sir Dennis Hodge. Otherwise, things were much as before, with Terry''s pigheaded childishness causing no end of problems, usually thwarting June''s attempts at leading a cosy life.', 'Terry and June Medford are both middle aged and beginning to find the trials of life are more difficult as they try to succeed in their daily lives. The couple have just moved to Purley, south-east London... Aunt Lucy and the mynah bird had disappeared, as had the occasionally visiting daughters. Terry and June now mixed with a friendly next door neighbour, Beattie; Terry''s chatty work colleague, Malcolm; and their gruff boss Sir Dennis Hodge. Otherwise, things were much as before, with Terry''s pigheaded childishness causing no end of problems, usually thwarting June''s attempts at leading a cosy life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMIRsTL7aUWe7IWkTrpsgilbAd3.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:1464'),
  ('381176007464647365', 'Tesagure! Bukatsumono', 2013, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Kotaro Ishidate', 'Kotaro Ishidate', 'Asuka Nishi, Reina Ueda, Satomi Akesaka, Ayaka Ohashi, Karin Ogino', null, 'Tanaka Koharu joins a school club whose main activity is to discuss the activities of school clubs, often taking common anime/manga tropes to the extremes.', 'Tanaka Koharu joins a school club whose main activity is to discuss the activities of school clubs, often taking common anime/manga tropes to the extremes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gdFnfYRrNLK81RNiUDuSbRplB9I.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:57407'),
  ('467609413501333430', 'Tess of the D''Urbervilles', 2008, 'Drama', null, 'David Nicholls', 'Gemma Arterton, Eddie Redmayne, Hans Matheson, Ruth Jones, Christopher Fairbank, Ian Puleston-Davies, Jo Woodcock, Hugh Skinner', 'TV-14', 'The story of Tess Durbeyfield, a low-born country girl whose family find they have noble connections.', 'The story of Tess Durbeyfield, a low-born country girl whose family find they have noble connections.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1usK7ZjI5H0KRmDImu5waIVmZZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8042'),
  ('503560500374443222', 'Testament: The Story of Moses', 2024, 'Documentary, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Charles Dance, Clarke Peters, Avi Azulay, Dominique Tipper, Mehmet Kurtuluş, Ishai Golan, Reymonde Amsallem, Tülay Günal', 'TV-14', 'This illuminating docudrama series chronicles Moses'' remarkable life as a prince, prophet and more with insights from theologians and historians.', 'This illuminating docudrama series chronicles Moses'' remarkable life as a prince, prophet and more with insights from theologians and historians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRMIvf9OismdaKSuyUoo3mQa3iD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:247441'),
  ('947124442379795938', 'Testees', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Kenny Hotz', 'Derek Harvie', 'Jeff Kassel, Steve Markle, Joe Pingue, Kim Schraner, Kenny Hotz, Ho Chow, Shauna Macdonald', null, 'Testees is a Canadian television series, created by Kenny Hotz and written and produced by Kenny Hotz and Derek Harvie. Testees originally aired on Thursdays at 10:30 PM EST on FX and ran from October 9, 2008 to December 18, 2008. and debuted on October 14, 2008 on Showcase in Canada. The show is filmed in Toronto and Hamilton, Ontario. Testees is now showing on FX in the UK, I.Sat in Brazil and Comedy Central in Germany, Austria and the Netherlands. After one season, Testees was not renewed by FX.', 'Testees is a Canadian television series, created by Kenny Hotz and written and produced by Kenny Hotz and Derek Harvie. Testees originally aired on Thursdays at 10:30 PM EST on FX and ran from October 9, 2008 to December 18, 2008. and debuted on October 14, 2008 on Showcase in Canada. The show is filmed in Toronto and Hamilton, Ontario. Testees is now showing on FX in the UK, I.Sat in Brazil and Comedy Central in Germany, Austria and the Netherlands. After one season, Testees was not renewed by FX.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aEOqH2zBM4gmXiOgag2gvyS07Cs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5926'),
  ('568240279355575656', 'Testimony of N', 2014, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Nana Eikura, Masataka Kubota, Keisuke Koide, Kento Kaku, Manami Konishi, Yoshimi Tokui, Tomokazu Miura, Hideko Hara', null, 'University student Sugishita Nozomi, Naruse Shinji, Ando Nozomi and Nishizaki Masato end up coming upon the scene of the murder of the Noguchi couple, because of a plan they had devised. Nishizaki is arrested at the scene and is given a 10-year prison term because of his voluntary confession. 10 years later, Takano Shigeru, a former police officer who has misgivings about the verdict of this case, starts to pursue the truth. He is convinced that it all began as a result of an incident caused by Nozomi and Naruse on an island in the Seto Inland Sea in the summer 15 years. “They committed a crime at that time. It was for the sake of each N.”', 'University student Sugishita Nozomi, Naruse Shinji, Ando Nozomi and Nishizaki Masato end up coming upon the scene of the murder of the Noguchi couple, because of a plan they had devised. Nishizaki is arrested at the scene and is given a 10-year prison term because of his voluntary confession. 10 years later, Takano Shigeru, a former police officer who has misgivings about the verdict of this case, starts to pursue the truth. He is convinced that it all began as a result of an incident caused by Nozomi and Naruse on an island in the Seto Inland Sea in the summer 15 years. “They committed a crime at that time. It was for the sake of each N.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqlb5uVOgwXJ2afFRw3A8Fvla6N.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65558'),
  ('896449495085185883', 'TESTO', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Kida Khodr Ramadan', null, 'Kida Khodr Ramadan, Ruby O. Fee, Frederick Lau, Jeanette Hain, Nicolette Krebitz, Stipe Erceg, Veysel Gelin', null, '5 prisoners, a bank robbery, 6 hostages, adrenaline, chaos, unfinished business. Fast, unpredictable, merciless.', '5 prisoners, a bank robbery, 6 hostages, adrenaline, chaos, unfinished business. Fast, unpredictable, merciless.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7C4CXrBmRMn3BNfRQf67cO3PGPD.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:245169'),
  ('765825845213212726', 'Tetya Marta', 2022, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Vitaliya Kornienko, Yuriy Kuznetsov, Aleksandr Metelkin, Zoya Berber, Kristina Asmus, Sergey Epishev, Aleksandr Golubkov, Ekaterina Kabak', null, 'Martha, at the age of eight, leads a life full of childish worries. The only relative nearby is the grandfather, who needs supervision more than the granddaughter. In order not to end up in an orphanage, Martha hides the truth from a teacher, a district police officer and a glamorous neighbor and asks a loser actor to pretend to be her father. Kazan relatives come to the rescue in the person of adventurer Marat. Only in the plans of the arrogant boy, not caring about the girl, but her Moscow apartments.', 'Martha, at the age of eight, leads a life full of childish worries. The only relative nearby is the grandfather, who needs supervision more than the granddaughter. In order not to end up in an orphanage, Martha hides the truth from a teacher, a district police officer and a glamorous neighbor and asks a loser actor to pretend to be her father. Kazan relatives come to the rescue in the person of adventurer Marat. Only in the plans of the arrogant boy, not caring about the girl, but her Moscow apartments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQFDiY5BYWbny7hyrvi6uFP33q5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:211231'),
