  ('969054596896017681', 'The Amazing Spiez!', 2009, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'David Michel, Vincent Chalvon-Demersay', null, null, 'NR', 'Four siblings work as agents for the World Organization of Human Protection, otherwise known as WOOHP. Lee, Megan, Marc and Tony Clark all attend Southdale Junior High School and seem to be normal kids in every way -- except that they fight crime. Even their parents are unaware of the kids'' unusual activities. Jerry Lewis, founder and chief of the organization, briefs the spies on their missions and doles out the gadgetry they''ll need to take on evil.', 'Four siblings work as agents for the World Organization of Human Protection, otherwise known as WOOHP. Lee, Megan, Marc and Tony Clark all attend Southdale Junior High School and seem to be normal kids in every way -- except that they fight crime. Even their parents are unaware of the kids'' unusual activities. Jerry Lewis, founder and chief of the organization, briefs the spies on their missions and doles out the gadgetry they''ll need to take on evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jeQjucMsN2J4F8zvPWjD72xeJUd.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:18067'),
  ('117549183283844237', 'The Amazing Strategist Liu Bowen', 2006, null, null, null, 'Eric Huang, Yang Huai Min, Pally Chien, Josh Huo, Chen Ya-lan', null, 'Aided by Liu Bowen''s amazing ability to predict the future, Zhu Yuanzhang overthrew the Mongol Yuan and established the Ming Empire. Yuan Princess Nanfeng, after a failed attempt to assassinate Emperor Yuanzhang, was blinded and sought refuge in the shop of Liu Bowen''s good friend, A Tian where she ends up also be-friending Bowen and his sister-in-training, A Xiu. Finding out about Nanfeng''s identity, Bowen took her in and sought to restore her sight while keeping her from attempting another assassination on the Emperor in hopes of dispelling the emnity between Emperor Yuanzhang and the Yuan. Unfortunately, Ming official Hu Weiyong, for the sake of personal gain, influences Emperor Yuanzhang to try to have Nanfeng killed. Thus begins a battle of wits between Liu Bowen and Hu Weiyong in which the outcome will decide the fate of the Ming.-- TTV', 'Aided by Liu Bowen''s amazing ability to predict the future, Zhu Yuanzhang overthrew the Mongol Yuan and established the Ming Empire. Yuan Princess Nanfeng, after a failed attempt to assassinate Emperor Yuanzhang, was blinded and sought refuge in the shop of Liu Bowen''s good friend, A Tian where she ends up also be-friending Bowen and his sister-in-training, A Xiu. Finding out about Nanfeng''s identity, Bowen took her in and sought to restore her sight while keeping her from attempting another assassination on the Emperor in hopes of dispelling the emnity between Emperor Yuanzhang and the Yuan. Unfortunately, Ming official Hu Weiyong, for the sake of personal gain, influences Emperor Yuanzhang to try to have Nanfeng killed. Thus begins a battle of wits between Liu Bowen and Hu Weiyong in which the outcome will decide the fate of the Ming.-- TTV', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bKxc1CjFgvdAKnWiroKuFQWqI7K.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:107793'),
  ('899570654274825321', 'The Amazing World of Gumball', 2011, 'Animation, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Ben Bocquelet', null, 'Nicolas Cantu, Christian J. Simon, Dan Russell, Teresa Gallagher, Kyla Kowalewski, Sandra Dickinson, Kerry Shale, Jessica McDonald', 'TV-Y7', 'The life of Gumball Watterson, a 12-year old cat who attends middle school in Elmore. Accompanied by his pet, adoptive brother, and best friend Darwin Watterson, he frequently finds himself involved in various shenanigans around the city, during which he interacts with various family members: Anais, Richard, and Nicole Watterson, and other various citizens.', 'The life of Gumball Watterson, a 12-year old cat who attends middle school in Elmore. Accompanied by his pet, adoptive brother, and best friend Darwin Watterson, he frequently finds himself involved in various shenanigans around the city, during which he interacts with various family members: Anais, Richard, and Nicole Watterson, and other various citizens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/VYnnyA2hyxi3VUPgCA71mMtt69.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:37606'),
  ('88404926780691041', 'The Ambassador''s Daughter', 2019, 'Drama', null, null, 'Engin Akyürek, Tuba Büyüküstün, Erdal Küçükkömürcü, Gonca Cilasun, Doğukan Polat, Hivda Zizan Alp, Edip Tepeli, Beren Gençalp', null, 'Sancar has always & Nare has always yearned for love. When they meet and fall in love as children, they know they are meant to be; they just have to wait to be old enough to marry. On the night of their wedding, a startling revelation by Nare forever changes their lives and puts their love on hold until the night of another wedding many years later.', 'Sancar has always & Nare has always yearned for love. When they meet and fall in love as children, they know they are meant to be; they just have to wait to be old enough to marry. On the night of their wedding, a startling revelation by Nare forever changes their lives and puts their love on hold until the night of another wedding many years later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wkCIfkSUb71xjq0y8POOYHn1cll.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:96305'),
  ('930764024006642443', 'The Ambition of Oda Nobuna', 2012, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Takuya Eguchi, Kanae Itou, Hitomi Nabatame, Rei Matsuzaki, Sayuri Yahagi, Masumi Asano, Tomoko Kaneda, Misato Fukuen', 'TV-14', 'The historical romantic comedy follows 17-year-old high schooler Sagara Yoshiharu who one day time-travels to the Sengoku period, where all the major Samurai lords are cute girls. Yoshiharu meets Oda Nobuna, the girl counterpart of Oda Nobunaga, and begins to serve her as a substitute of Kinoshita Toukichirou, who has been dead in the world.', 'The historical romantic comedy follows 17-year-old high schooler Sagara Yoshiharu who one day time-travels to the Sengoku period, where all the major Samurai lords are cute girls. Yoshiharu meets Oda Nobuna, the girl counterpart of Oda Nobunaga, and begins to serve her as a substitute of Kinoshita Toukichirou, who has been dead in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o9iRjhIGG1LaEUTAQpeMkGTvXxb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45853'),
  ('939616723842918895', 'The American Buffalo', 2023, 'Documentary, Crime, War & Politics', null, null, 'N. Scott Momaday, Peter Coyote, Adam Arkin, Tantoo Cardinal, Tim Clark, Tokala Black Elk, Jeff Daniels, Hope Davis', 'TV-14', 'The dramatic story of America''s national mammal, which sustained the lives of Native people for untold generations, being driven to the brink of extinction, before an unlikely collection of people rescues it from disappearing forever. Ken Burns recounts the tragic collision of two opposing views of the natural world—and the unforgettable characters who pointed the nation in a different direction.', 'The dramatic story of America''s national mammal, which sustained the lives of Native people for untold generations, being driven to the brink of extinction, before an unlikely collection of people rescues it from disappearing forever. Ken Burns recounts the tragic collision of two opposing views of the natural world—and the unforgettable characters who pointed the nation in a different direction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ns8F9uzd2dE8J0gDmERedXEpio5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:219756'),
  ('822576950372670988', 'The American Guest', 2021, 'Drama', 'Bruno Barreto', 'Matthew Chapman', 'Aidan Quinn, Chico Diaz, David Herman, Chris Mason', 'TV-14', 'A look at former U.S. president Teddy Roosevelt and Brazilian army officer Cândido Rondon''s journey to explore unknown regions of the Brazilian Amazon.', 'A look at former U.S. president Teddy Roosevelt and Brazilian army officer Cândido Rondon''s journey to explore unknown regions of the Brazilian Amazon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zXYZj71MyJJVUxapq6iVVWAc99r.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132653'),
  ('449170247802944469', 'The American Revolution', 2025, 'Documentary, War & Politics', 'Ken Burns', 'Geoffrey C. Ward', 'Peter Coyote', 'TV-PG', 'The American Revolution was at once a war for independence, a war of conquest, a civil war, and a world war, fought by neighbors on American farms and between global powers an ocean or more away. It impacted millions from Vermont’s Green Mountains to the swamps of South Carolina, from Indian Country to the Iberian Peninsula. In defeating the British Empire and giving birth to a new nation, the American Revolution turned the world upside-down. Thirteen colonies on the Atlantic Coast united in rebellion, won their independence, and established a republic that still endures. The American Revolution will present the story of the men and women of the Revolutionary generation, their humanity in victory and defeat, and the crisis that they lived through.', 'The American Revolution was at once a war for independence, a war of conquest, a civil war, and a world war, fought by neighbors on American farms and between global powers an ocean or more away. It impacted millions from Vermont’s Green Mountains to the swamps of South Carolina, from Indian Country to the Iberian Peninsula. In defeating the British Empire and giving birth to a new nation, the American Revolution turned the world upside-down. Thirteen colonies on the Atlantic Coast united in rebellion, won their independence, and established a republic that still endures. The American Revolution will present the story of the men and women of the Revolutionary generation, their humanity in victory and defeat, and the crisis that they lived through.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXDHzOJxbsWZNy5jd5TMBAKIb0w.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:258023'),
  ('1010908566315325841', 'The American West', 2016, 'Documentary, Western, Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Bert Thomas Morris, Derek Chariton, David H. Stevens, Joseph Carlson, Kera O''Bryon, Morgan Lund, Jim Jackman, Mike Marunde', 'TV-14', 'The story of the aftermath of the Civil War and how the United States transformed into the “land of opportunity" spanning the years 1865 to 1890. Transporting into the violent world of cowboys, Indians, outlaws and law men, the story chronicles the personal, little-known stories of Western legends such as Jesse James, Billy the Kid, Wyatt Earp, Crazy Horse and Sitting Bull.', 'The story of the aftermath of the Civil War and how the United States transformed into the “land of opportunity" spanning the years 1865 to 1890. Transporting into the violent world of cowboys, Indians, outlaws and law men, the story chronicles the personal, little-known stories of Western legends such as Jesse James, Billy the Kid, Wyatt Earp, Crazy Horse and Sitting Bull.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xrWL6qBZQQzkZiBacFegKRcvvHd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66737'),
  ('807383249689292944', 'The Americans', 2013, 'Crime, Drama', 'Joe Weisberg', null, 'Keri Russell, Matthew Rhys, Holly Taylor, Keidrich Sellati, Noah Emmerich, Costa Ronin, Margo Martindale', 'TV-MA', 'Set during the Cold War period in the 1980s, The Americans is the story of Elizabeth and Philip Jennings, two Soviet KGB officers posing as an American married couple in the suburbs of Washington D.C. and their neighbor, Stan Beeman, an FBI Counterintelligence agent.', 'Set during the Cold War period in the 1980s, The Americans is the story of Elizabeth and Philip Jennings, two Soviet KGB officers posing as an American married couple in the suburbs of Washington D.C. and their neighbor, Stan Beeman, an FBI Counterintelligence agent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1UBlxEXhbKe8sp0fxFZh7MqTce.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:46533'),
  ('34215501866360357', 'The Americas', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Tom Hanks', 'TV-PG', 'A showcase of the wonders, secrets and fragilities of the Americas, narrated by Tom Hanks.', 'A showcase of the wonders, secrets and fragilities of the Americas, narrated by Tom Hanks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1cGlSbdDBRFWvS4Q33b4XLC5XN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:246212'),
  ('216219403652768254', 'The Anarchists', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Todd Schramke', null, 'Jason Henza, Juan Galt', 'TV-MA', 'Unfolding over six years, what begins as an impulsive one-off gathering turns into an ever-growing annual event attracting sponsorship from crypto-currency companies and featuring capitalist statist speakers such as Ron Paul and BitCoin investor Roger Ver. And when rule-avoidant "freedom" activists come together in one of the most dangerous cities in the world, incoherent ideology and cognitive dissonance rears its ugly head.', 'Unfolding over six years, what begins as an impulsive one-off gathering turns into an ever-growing annual event attracting sponsorship from crypto-currency companies and featuring capitalist statist speakers such as Ron Paul and BitCoin investor Roger Ver. And when rule-avoidant "freedom" activists come together in one of the most dangerous cities in the world, incoherent ideology and cognitive dissonance rears its ugly head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KK0u33xUQ0Z87lMoRD11NomFja.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204899'),
  ('359198936682805423', 'The Anatomy of a Moment', 2025, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Álvaro Morte, Eduard Fernández, Manolo Solo, David Lorente, Raúl Arévalo, Antonio Casares, Roberto Chapu, Antonio Esquinas', null, 'Madrid, Spain, February 23, 1981. A group of Civil Guards storm into the Congress of Deputies and terrorize those present by firing shots into the air. Only three men remain unmoved: Prime Minister Adolfo Suárez; Vice President Manuel Gutiérrez Mellado; and Santiago Carrillo, leader of the Communist Party.', 'Madrid, Spain, February 23, 1981. A group of Civil Guards storm into the Congress of Deputies and terrorize those present by firing shots into the air. Only three men remain unmoved: Prime Minister Adolfo Suárez; Vice President Manuel Gutiérrez Mellado; and Santiago Carrillo, leader of the Communist Party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/scY4Pt273NuYlZtlAkm8LKqOKGA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:282606'),
  ('976477867571155081', 'The Ancient Magus'' Bride', 2017, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Atsumi Tanezaki, Ryota Takeuchi, Koki Uchiyama, Aya Endo, Minami Tsuda, Maki Kawase, Seiichiro Yamashita, Daiki Kobayashi', 'TV-14', 'Hatori Chise has lived a life full of neglect and abuse, devoid of anything resembling love. Far from the warmth of family, she has had her share of troubles and pitfalls. Just when all hope seems lost, a fateful encounter awaits her. When a man with the head of a beast, wielding strange powers, obtains her through a slave auction, Chise''s life will never be the same again. The man is a "magus,"a sorcerer of great power, who decides to free Chise from the bonds of captivity. The magus then makes a bold statement: Chise will become his apprentice--and his bride!', 'Hatori Chise has lived a life full of neglect and abuse, devoid of anything resembling love. Far from the warmth of family, she has had her share of troubles and pitfalls. Just when all hope seems lost, a fateful encounter awaits her. When a man with the head of a beast, wielding strange powers, obtains her through a slave auction, Chise''s life will never be the same again. The man is a "magus,"a sorcerer of great power, who decides to free Chise from the bonds of captivity. The magus then makes a bold statement: Chise will become his apprentice--and his bride!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xXGAFMGiG55oS8uzuVz7V5JxFb2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:73833'),
  ('768055611266649583', 'The Ancient Magus'' Bride: The Boy from the West and the Knight of the Blue Storm', 2021, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Atsumi Tanezaki, Ryota Takeuchi, Koki Uchiyama, Aya Endo, Hiromi Igarashi, Aoi Ichikawa, Sayaka Ohara, Kappei Yamaguchi', 'TV-14', 'Gabriel, an ordinary boy who has just moved from London to the countryside, is bored and misses the friends he left behind. He gazed out the window, as if wanting to escape from it all... until something strange caught his attention: mysterious smoke rising from the woods near his house. As he follows it to investigate, his world becomes intertwined with the hidden world of mages.', 'Gabriel, an ordinary boy who has just moved from London to the countryside, is bored and misses the friends he left behind. He gazed out the window, as if wanting to escape from it all... until something strange caught his attention: mysterious smoke rising from the woods near his house. As he follows it to investigate, his world becomes intertwined with the hidden world of mages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVBxPJVLLcYOKVdHWYj5lPsKrGv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:120471'),
  ('706801415301621114', 'The Ancient Magus'' Bride: Those Awaiting a Star', 2016, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Atsumi Tanezaki, Ryota Takeuchi, Koki Uchiyama, Aya Endo, Takahiro Sakurai', 'TV-14', 'A three-part OVA series that will tell a story that takes place before Chise meets Magus. Angelica sends Chise some magical supplies, including a gift. The gift turns out to be a book that Chise read in her childhood. Elias asks Chise to tell him the story behind the book. Chise tells him about Miura-san and the mysterious library she found in the forest when she was a child.', 'A three-part OVA series that will tell a story that takes place before Chise meets Magus. Angelica sends Chise some magical supplies, including a gift. The gift turns out to be a book that Chise read in her childhood. Elias asks Chise to tell him the story behind the book. Chise tells him about Miura-san and the mysterious library she found in the forest when she was a child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bIRXLgdYU0egVmfxQZ4ZtEA2WSm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67800'),
  ('100695325252553317', 'The Andromeda Strain', 2008, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Robert Schenkkan', null, 'Benjamin Bratt, Christa Miller, Eric McCormack, Daniel Dae Kim, Viola Davis, Louis Ferreira, Barry Flatman, Rick Schroder', null, 'A U.S. satellite crash-lands near a small town in Utah, unleashing a deadly plague that kills virtually everyone except two survivors, who may provide clues to immunizing the population. As the military attempts to quarantine the area, a team of highly specialized scientists is assembled to find a cure and stop the spread of the alien pathogen, code-named Andromeda.', 'A U.S. satellite crash-lands near a small town in Utah, unleashing a deadly plague that kills virtually everyone except two survivors, who may provide clues to immunizing the population. As the military attempts to quarantine the area, a team of highly specialized scientists is assembled to find a cure and stop the spread of the alien pathogen, code-named Andromeda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n33QUOYAoNScuFu75CK0fy0Cyyk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19997'),
  ('830828460452433390', 'The Andy Griffith Show', 1960, 'Comedy, Family', 'Sheldon Leonard, Danny Thomas', 'Aaron Ruben', 'Andy Griffith, Ron Howard, Frances Bavier', 'TV-G', 'The Andy Griffith Show is an American sitcom first televised on CBS between October 3, 1960 and April 1, 1968. Andy Griffith portrays the widowed sheriff of the fictional small community of Mayberry, North Carolina. His life is complicated by an inept, but well-meaning deputy, Barney Fife, a spinster aunt and housekeeper, Aunt Bee, and a precocious young son, Opie. Local ne''er-do-wells, bumbling pals, and temperamental girlfriends further complicate his life. Andy Griffith stated in a Today Show interview, with respect to the time period of the show: "Well, though we never said it, and though it was shot in the ''60s, it had a feeling of the ''30s. It was when we were doing it, of a time gone by." The series never placed lower than seventh in the Nielsen ratings and ended its final season at number one. It has been ranked by TV Guide as the 9th-best show in American television history. Though neither Griffith nor the show won awards during its eight-season run, series co-stars Knotts and Bavier accumulated a combined total of six Emmy Awards. The show, a semi-spin-off from an episode of The Danny Thomas Show titled "Danny Meets Andy Griffith", spawned its own spin-off series, Gomer Pyle, U.S.M.C., a sequel series, Mayberry R.F.D., and a reunion telemovie, Return to Mayberry. The show''s enduring popularity has generated a good deal of show-related merchandise. Reruns currently air on TV Land, and the complete series is available on DVD. All eight seasons are also now available by streaming video services such as Netflix.', 'The Andy Griffith Show is an American sitcom first televised on CBS between October 3, 1960 and April 1, 1968. Andy Griffith portrays the widowed sheriff of the fictional small community of Mayberry, North Carolina. His life is complicated by an inept, but well-meaning deputy, Barney Fife, a spinster aunt and housekeeper, Aunt Bee, and a precocious young son, Opie. Local ne''er-do-wells, bumbling pals, and temperamental girlfriends further complicate his life. Andy Griffith stated in a Today Show interview, with respect to the time period of the show: "Well, though we never said it, and though it was shot in the ''60s, it had a feeling of the ''30s. It was when we were doing it, of a time gone by." The series never placed lower than seventh in the Nielsen ratings and ended its final season at number one. It has been ranked by TV Guide as the 9th-best show in American television history. Though neither Griffith nor the show won awards during its eight-season run, series co-stars Knotts and Bavier accumulated a combined total of six Emmy Awards. The show, a semi-spin-off from an episode of The Danny Thomas Show titled "Danny Meets Andy Griffith", spawned its own spin-off series, Gomer Pyle, U.S.M.C., a sequel series, Mayberry R.F.D., and a reunion telemovie, Return to Mayberry. The show''s enduring popularity has generated a good deal of show-related merchandise. Reruns currently air on TV Land, and the complete series is available on DVD. All eight seasons are also now available by streaming video services such as Netflix.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KvTKLH40z5zDMilg2lXqmOUrRy.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:106'),
  ('900310524309372879', 'The Andy Warhol Diaries', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Andy Warhol, Bill Irwin, Jeffrey Deitch, Jessica Beck, Bob Colacello, Christopher Makos, Glenn Ligon, Vincent Fremont', 'TV-MA', 'After he''s shot in 1968, Andy Warhol begins documenting his life and feelings. Those diaries, and this series, reveal the secrets behind his persona.', 'After he''s shot in 1968, Andy Warhol begins documenting his life and feelings. Those diaries, and this series, reveal the secrets behind his persona.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ls3Ek39IKSiAYJES1CZHPj90TEZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158233'),
  ('963847108833322759', 'The Angel Next Door Spoils Me Rotten', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Taito Ban, Manaka Iwami, Taku Yashiro, Haruka Shiraishi', 'TV-14', 'Amane lives alone in an apartment, and the most beautiful girl in school, Mahiru, lives just next door. They''ve almost never spoken—until the day he sees her in distress on a rainy day and lends her his umbrella. To return the favour, she offers him help around the house, and a relationship slowly begins to blossom as the distance between them closes…', 'Amane lives alone in an apartment, and the most beautiful girl in school, Mahiru, lives just next door. They''ve almost never spoken—until the day he sees her in distress on a rainy day and lends her his umbrella. To return the favour, she offers him help around the house, and a relationship slowly begins to blossom as the distance between them closes…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twCEEzmZZkgQIPXzw0JF350GO0P.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:154743'),
  ('400953115087231779', 'The Angry Beavers', 1997, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Family', 'Mitch Schauer', null, 'Richard Steven Horvitz, Nick Bakay', 'TV-Y7', 'Daggett and Norbert Beaver are two young beaver brothers who have left their home to become bachelors in the forest near Wayouttatown, Oregon.', 'Daggett and Norbert Beaver are two young beaver brothers who have left their home to become bachelors in the forest near Wayouttatown, Oregon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9KYUA9tZrVNVXk2LTaYNMqGpHUj.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:3579'),
  ('853854236696229267', 'The Angry Video Game Nerd', 2004, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'James D. Rolfe', null, 'James D. Rolfe', 'TV-MA', 'The Angry Video Game Nerd is an adult web television series of comedic retrogaming video reviews created by and starring James Rolfe. The show''s format revolves around his commentary and review of older, but unsuccessful video games which are deemed to be of particularly low-quality, unfair difficulty or poor design. The series began as a feature on YouTube and later became a program on ScrewAttack Entertainment before moving to GameTrailers exclusively. The show was renamed The Angry Video Game Nerd to prevent any trademark issues with Nintendo and due to the fact he started reviewing games from non-Nintendo consoles such as those made by Atari and Sega. Rolfe''s character, "The Nerd" is a short-tempered and foul-mouthed video game fanatic. He derives comic appeal from excessive and inventive use of anger, profanity, and habitual consumption of alcohol while reviewing video games.', 'The Angry Video Game Nerd is an adult web television series of comedic retrogaming video reviews created by and starring James Rolfe. The show''s format revolves around his commentary and review of older, but unsuccessful video games which are deemed to be of particularly low-quality, unfair difficulty or poor design. The series began as a feature on YouTube and later became a program on ScrewAttack Entertainment before moving to GameTrailers exclusively. The show was renamed The Angry Video Game Nerd to prevent any trademark issues with Nintendo and due to the fact he started reviewing games from non-Nintendo consoles such as those made by Atari and Sega. Rolfe''s character, "The Nerd" is a short-tempered and foul-mouthed video game fanatic. He derives comic appeal from excessive and inventive use of anger, profanity, and habitual consumption of alcohol while reviewing video games.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5s62a2ctgCWAcnPw8oOpks6PJE.jpg', 20, 'tmdb:tv:14188'),
  ('506599929019632394', 'The Animals of Farthing Wood', 1993, 'Family, Animation, Kids', 'Jenny McDade', 'Steve Walker, Valerie Georgeson', null, 'TV-Y7', 'The Animals of Farthing Wood is an animated series created by the European Broadcasting Union between 1992 and 1995 and based on the series of books written by Colin Dann. It was produced by Telemagination, based in London, and La Fabrique, based in Montpellier in France, but also aired in other European countries. The first countries to air the series were Germany and the United Kingdom, in January 1993.', 'The Animals of Farthing Wood is an animated series created by the European Broadcasting Union between 1992 and 1995 and based on the series of books written by Colin Dann. It was produced by Telemagination, based in London, and La Fabrique, based in Montpellier in France, but also aired in other European countries. The first countries to air the series were Germany and the United Kingdom, in January 1993.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRKM4v1j46jxtHR3wfbNTUrYg0T.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:188'),
  ('128959402329997250', 'The Apothecary Diaries', 2023, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Aoi Yuuki, Takeo Otsuka, Katsuyuki Konishi', 'TV-14', 'Maomao lived a peaceful life with her apothecary father. Until one day, she''s sold as a lowly servant to the emperor''s palace. But she wasn''t meant for a compliant life among royalty. So when imperial heirs fall ill, she decides to step in and find a cure! This catches the eye of Jinshi, a handsome palace official who promotes her. Now, she''s making a name for herself solving medical mysteries!', 'Maomao lived a peaceful life with her apothecary father. Until one day, she''s sold as a lowly servant to the emperor''s palace. But she wasn''t meant for a compliant life among royalty. So when imperial heirs fall ill, she decides to step in and find a cure! This catches the eye of Jinshi, a handsome palace official who promotes her. Now, she''s making a name for herself solving medical mysteries!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3ojpANrFnmJCyeBNTinYwyBCIN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:220542'),
  ('186023498812738521', 'The Apprentice', 2005, 'Reality', 'Mark Burnett', null, 'Lord Alan Sugar, Mark Halliley, Karren Brady, Tim Campbell', null, 'British version of the reality competitions series that sees young entrepreneurs compete in several business tasks, attempting to survive the weekly firings in order to become the business partner of one of the most successful businessmen.', 'British version of the reality competitions series that sees young entrepreneurs compete in several business tasks, attempting to survive the weekly firings in order to become the business partner of one of the most successful businessmen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUflI3B1Bmzxba8xgplyEnozaLt.jpg', 20, 'tmdb:tv:2472'),
  ('207001702211654969', 'The Apprentice: Unfinished Business', 2026, 'Reality, Talk', null, null, 'Angela Scanlon', null, 'A look behind the curtain of The Apprentice to analyse every task and tactic in detail as Lord Sugar searches for a new business partner.', 'A look behind the curtain of The Apprentice to analyse every task and tactic in detail as Lord Sugar searches for a new business partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AfXfSFPGdAo1HO2MQ4qDnAQW162.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:311248'),
  ('1040345729897545600', 'The aquatope on white sand', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Miku Ito, Rikako Aida, Azumi Waki, Lynn, Shimba Tsuchiya, Yohei Azakami, Hiroshi Yanaka, Yui Ishikawa', 'TV-14', 'Kukuru Misakino, an 18-year-old high school girl working in an aquarium, meets Fuuka Miyazawa, a former idol who lost her place in Tokyo and escaped. Fuuka will spend her days in the aquarium with her own thoughts in mind. However, the crisis of closing is approaching for the aquarium, as the girls explore their dreams and reality, loneliness and friends, bonds and conflicts.', 'Kukuru Misakino, an 18-year-old high school girl working in an aquarium, meets Fuuka Miyazawa, a former idol who lost her place in Tokyo and escaped. Fuuka will spend her days in the aquarium with her own thoughts in mind. However, the crisis of closing is approaching for the aquarium, as the girls explore their dreams and reality, loneliness and friends, bonds and conflicts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/86dxo38ksU7hnCpbfYgIJ3jA6kJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:116724'),
  ('461320177754429068', 'The Archie Show', 1968, 'Animation, Comedy', 'John L. Goldwater', null, 'Dal McKennon, Jane Webb, Howard Morris, John Erwin, Ron Dante, Toni Wine', 'TV-Y7', 'The Archie Show is a Saturday morning cartoon animated series produced by Filmation. Based on the Archie comic books, created by Bob Montana in 1941, The Archie Show debuted on CBS in September 1968 and lasted for one season. A total of 17 half-hour shows, each containing two 11 minute segments, were aired. Archie cartoons continued to be aired in various forms until 1978.', 'The Archie Show is a Saturday morning cartoon animated series produced by Filmation. Based on the Archie comic books, created by Bob Montana in 1941, The Archie Show debuted on CBS in September 1968 and lasted for one season. A total of 17 half-hour shows, each containing two 11 minute segments, were aired. Archie cartoons continued to be aired in various forms until 1978.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oCQTylzhqRQY6fVWMQUbpDlDryH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:951'),
  ('77368989137479455', 'The Architect', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kerren Lumer-Klabbers', 'Nora Landsrød, Kristian Kilde', 'Eili Harboe, Ingrid Unnur Giæver, Fredrik Stenberg Ditlev-Simonsen, Alexandra Gjerpen, Petronella Barker', null, 'When a project to build a thousand flats in Oslo is put out to tender, architect Julie has an idea: why not convert empty underground car parks into residential buildings? A pitch-black, keenly observed satire about an all-too-near future.', 'When a project to build a thousand flats in Oslo is put out to tender, architect Julie has an idea: why not convert empty underground car parks into residential buildings? A pitch-black, keenly observed satire about an all-too-near future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oVj9MO352wH3rTniTpc21atrM8D.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218865'),
  ('694689713441174899', 'The Åre Murders', 2025, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Viveca Sten', null, 'Carla Sehn, Kardo Razzazi, Charlie Gustafsson, Francisco Sobrado, Pia Johansson, Maxida Märak, Cora Watson, Cecilia Forss', 'TV-MA', 'A Stockholm detective under internal investigation heads to a ski resort to unwind, until a young girl''s disappearance compels her back to work.', 'A Stockholm detective under internal investigation heads to a ski resort to unwind, until a young girl''s disappearance compels her back to work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hUh2yK71us4uO3cKeDq9ONu69.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:224021'),
  ('80402072185894625', 'The Aristocrat''s Otherworldly Adventure: Serving Gods Who Go Too Far', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yoshino Nanjo, Aya Uchida, Manaka Iwami, Miharu Hanai, Natsu Yorita, Saori Onishi, Hibiku Yamamura, Sora Tokui', 'TV-14', 'After dying in the act of stopping a crime in modern Japan, our hero is reincarnated as Cain von Silford, third son of a noble family in a world of swords and sorcery. In his new life, all children receive a blessing from the gods...but Cain is unexpectedly blessed with an absolutely enormous, over-the-top cornucopia of magical powers. If his dream of traveling the world as a free spirit is to come true, he can''t reveal too much of his potential to the wrong people. A light-hearted, escapist adventure in another world begins!', 'After dying in the act of stopping a crime in modern Japan, our hero is reincarnated as Cain von Silford, third son of a noble family in a world of swords and sorcery. In his new life, all children receive a blessing from the gods...but Cain is unexpectedly blessed with an absolutely enormous, over-the-top cornucopia of magical powers. If his dream of traveling the world as a free spirit is to come true, he can''t reveal too much of his potential to the wrong people. A light-hearted, escapist adventure in another world begins!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aH3EKIPW9XRaIJQeF7EYlOe7SEK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207493'),
  ('239732520438713762', 'The Ark', 2023, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Dean Devlin', null, 'Christie Burke, Reece Ritchie, Richard Fleeshman, Stacey Read, Ryan Adams, Pavle Jerinić, Shalini Peiris, Tiana Upcheva', 'TV-14', '100 years in the future, planetary colonization missions have begun as a necessity to help secure the survival of the human race. The first of these missions on a spacecraft known as Ark One encounters a catastrophic event causing massive destruction and loss of life. With more than a year left to go before reaching their target planet, a lack of life-sustaining supplies and loss of leadership, the remaining crew must become the best versions of themselves to stay on course and survive.', '100 years in the future, planetary colonization missions have begun as a necessity to help secure the survival of the human race. The first of these missions on a spacecraft known as Ark One encounters a catastrophic event causing massive destruction and loss of life. With more than a year left to go before reaching their target planet, a lack of life-sustaining supplies and loss of leadership, the remaining crew must become the best versions of themselves to stay on course and survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rec774m02XNLSjU9qm5z6UUfMRl.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:47663'),
  ('655487861914004455', 'The Armando Iannucci Shows', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Armando Iannucci', null, 'Armando Iannucci, Stephen Mangan, Alan Ford, Tony Gardner, Darren Higham, Melanie Hudson, Hugh Cecil, James Smith', null, 'The Armando Iannucci Shows is a series of eight programmes focused on specific themes relating to human nature and existentialism, around which Iannucci would weave a series of surreal sketches and monologues. Recurring themes in the episodes are the superficiality of modern culture, our problems communicating with each other, the mundane nature of working life and feelings of personal inadequacy and social awkwardness. Several characters also make repeat appearances in the shows, including the East End thug, who solves every problem with threats of violence; Hugh, an old man who delivers surreal monologues about what things were like in the old days; and Iannucci''s barber, who is full of nonsensical anecdotes.', 'The Armando Iannucci Shows is a series of eight programmes focused on specific themes relating to human nature and existentialism, around which Iannucci would weave a series of surreal sketches and monologues. Recurring themes in the episodes are the superficiality of modern culture, our problems communicating with each other, the mundane nature of working life and feelings of personal inadequacy and social awkwardness. Several characters also make repeat appearances in the shows, including the East End thug, who solves every problem with threats of violence; Hugh, an old man who delivers surreal monologues about what things were like in the old days; and Iannucci''s barber, who is full of nonsensical anecdotes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqfwzbFu9lXdLtYolHg5L9qh4Q8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112'),
  ('659022234272969698', 'The Arrangement', 2017, 'Drama', 'Jonathan Abrahams', null, 'Josh Henderson, Christine Evangelista, Lexa Doig, Michael Vartan, Carra Patterson, Kyle Toy', 'TV-14', 'An aspiring actress is presented with an arrangement that would link her romantically to a big star in Hollywood, but sticking to the details of her contract may not be easy.', 'An aspiring actress is presented with an arrangement that would link her romantically to a big star in Hollywood, but sticking to the details of her contract may not be easy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqtG6BNCAtaYm3CqrYepjYUSf0h.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:70301'),
  ('272950915598211467', 'The Arsenio Hall Show', 1989, 'Talk', 'Arsenio Hall', null, 'Arsenio Hall', null, 'The Arsenio Hall Show aired in syndication from January 3, 1989 to May 27, 1994. The show was created and hosted by comedian and actor Arsenio Hall, who had previously hosted The Late Show for Fox television.', 'The Arsenio Hall Show aired in syndication from January 3, 1989 to May 27, 1994. The show was created and hosted by comedian and actor Arsenio Hall, who had previously hosted The Late Show for Fox television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOvSs7RNelmjG8blQVETy5ZM0w7.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:2216'),
  ('356298904760466210', 'The Art of Crime', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Angèle Herry-Leclerc, Pierre-Yves Mora', null, 'Nicolas Gob, Éléonore Bernheim, Philippe Duclos, Benjamin Egner, Salomé Partouche', 'NR', 'Fired for insubordination, PJ Antoine Verlay, good cop but a blood strand and having difficulty working as a team, is attached to the OCBC (Central Office for the fight against Traffic in Cultural Goods) thanks to the intervention of the commander Pardo, his friend who becomes, therefore, his new superior. A clever investigator, but a stranger to everything related to culture, Antoine will have to work with Florence Chassagne, renowned art historian, who lives, speaks and breathes culture, to the point that - fruit of her great imagination - it happens to her in the midst of daydreams, to see and talk to the great artists who have disappeared as if they were familiar to her.', 'Fired for insubordination, PJ Antoine Verlay, good cop but a blood strand and having difficulty working as a team, is attached to the OCBC (Central Office for the fight against Traffic in Cultural Goods) thanks to the intervention of the commander Pardo, his friend who becomes, therefore, his new superior. A clever investigator, but a stranger to everything related to culture, Antoine will have to work with Florence Chassagne, renowned art historian, who lives, speaks and breathes culture, to the point that - fruit of her great imagination - it happens to her in the midst of daydreams, to see and talk to the great artists who have disappeared as if they were familiar to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h4QoRGfDzUQriMLYXxIl31eT4LN.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:75132'),
  ('249109540270988584', 'The Art of Joy', 2024, 'Drama', 'Valeria Golino, Valia Santella, Francesca Marciano', 'Valeria Golino, Luca Infascelli, Francesca Marciano', 'Tecla Insolia, Jasmine Trinca, Guido Caprino, Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Alma Noce, Giuseppe Spata, Nika Perrone, Viviana Mocciaro', 'TV-14', 'Born on the 1st of January 1900 in a poor family in rural Sicily, Modesta pursues happiness since her childhood without falling victim to the constraints of society. After a tragic event that takes her away from her family, Modesta is welcomed into a monastery, where she becomes the Mother Superior’s protégé thanks to her intelligence and stubbornness. Later, she arrives at the villa belonging to the Princess of Brandiforti, where she makes herself indispensable. This relentless process of emancipation goes along with a journey of personal growth and sexual awakening, which lead her to discover and claim the right to pleasure and happiness.', 'Born on the 1st of January 1900 in a poor family in rural Sicily, Modesta pursues happiness since her childhood without falling victim to the constraints of society. After a tragic event that takes her away from her family, Modesta is welcomed into a monastery, where she becomes the Mother Superior’s protégé thanks to her intelligence and stubbornness. Later, she arrives at the villa belonging to the Princess of Brandiforti, where she makes herself indispensable. This relentless process of emancipation goes along with a journey of personal growth and sexual awakening, which lead her to discover and claim the right to pleasure and happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iK7Sg8lYc9oJaCoDGVDV41FYCE8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:242436'),
  ('938994886130636445', 'The Art of More', 2015, 'Crime, Drama', 'David Kob', null, 'Christian Cooke, Kate Bosworth, Cary Elwes, Dennis Quaid, Patrick Sabongui, Eugene Clark', null, 'A working-class social climber finagles his way into the world of New York City auction houses by using the smuggling skills he learned as a soldier in Iraq.', 'A working-class social climber finagles his way into the world of New York City auction houses by using the smuggling skills he learned as a soldier in Iraq.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pI4ozkOD08Xpwk4WqyRqwcDoHTt.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:64367'),
  ('776333618837009285', 'The Art of Negotiation', 2025, 'Drama', 'Ahn Pan-seok', 'Lee Seung-yeong', 'Lee Je-hoon, Kim Dae-myung, Sung Dong-il, Jang Hyun-sung, Oh Man-seok, Ahn Hyun-ho, Cha Kang-yoon, Lee Chae-won', null, 'A story following an M&A expert who is known as a legendary negotiator and his team including Lawyer O Sun Yeong and Choi Jin Sun. The M&A expert specializes in large corporation deals.', 'A story following an M&A expert who is known as a legendary negotiator and his team including Lawyer O Sun Yeong and Choi Jin Sun. The M&A expert specializes in large corporation deals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40SJ9NvLBJRCiVM0bpcznI8MJq6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:255298'),
  ('823793477537818585', 'The Art of Sarah', 2026, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Kim Jin-min, Chu Song-yeon', null, 'Shin Hye-sun, Lee Jun-hyuk, Park Bo-kyung, Jung Da-bin, Kim Jae-won, Jung Jin-young, Bae Jong-ok, Shin Hyeon-seung', 'TV-MA', 'A body found in the middle of town. A luxe label on the rise. A detective tests every stitch of a woman''s story that keeps changing. What really happened?', 'A body found in the middle of town. A luxe label on the rise. A detective tests every stitch of a woman''s story that keeps changing. What really happened?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nP2PRGSmLdbZtQtoXPPppcDAsNw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:273977'),
  ('520924170805886948', 'The Artful Dodger', 2023, 'Drama, Crime, Action & Adventure', 'David Maher, David Taylor, James McNamara', null, 'Thomas Brodie-Sangster, David Thewlis, Maia Mitchell, Luke Bracey', 'TV-14', 'It''s a tale of reinvention, betrayal, redemption, and love with a twist. Jack Dawkins is The Artful Dodger, whose pickpocketing fingers have become the skilled hands of a surgeon. He is torn between an impossible love and the criminal underworld he secretly craves. This will require Artfulness.', 'It''s a tale of reinvention, betrayal, redemption, and love with a twist. Jack Dawkins is The Artful Dodger, whose pickpocketing fingers have become the skilled hands of a surgeon. He is torn between an impossible love and the criminal underworld he secretly craves. This will require Artfulness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lcyax0pIH6vZWbho2hxsMTt9KpN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:202208'),
  ('494341132295638253', 'The Ascent of Man', 1973, 'Documentary', 'Jacob Bronowski', null, 'Jacob Bronowski', null, 'The Ascent of Man is a thirteen-part documentary television series produced by the BBC and Time-Life Films first transmitted in 1973, written and presented by Jacob Bronowski. Intended as a series of "personal view" documentaries in the manner of Kenneth Clark''s 1969 series Civilisation, the series received acclaim for Bronowski''s highly informed but eloquently simple analysis, his long unscripted monologues and its extensive location shoots.', 'The Ascent of Man is a thirteen-part documentary television series produced by the BBC and Time-Life Films first transmitted in 1973, written and presented by Jacob Bronowski. Intended as a series of "personal view" documentaries in the manner of Kenneth Clark''s 1969 series Civilisation, the series received acclaim for Bronowski''s highly informed but eloquently simple analysis, his long unscripted monologues and its extensive location shoots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/usT68RGcKcXThqyeaaqP4IMdHO4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34851'),
  ('276056546142924500', 'The Assassin', 2025, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Jack Williams, Harry Williams', null, 'Keeley Hawes, Freddie Highmore, Gerald Kyd, Shalom Brune-Franklin, Devon Terrell, David Dencik, Gina Gershon, Alan Dale', null, 'Secluded on a remote Greek island, retired assassin Julie has a somewhat thorny reunion with her estranged son, Edward, visiting from England. Armed with questions around new information on his paternity, Edward battles to find the right time to speak to his frustratingly distant mother. But, when the moment finally presents itself, things take a deadly turn as Julie’s dangerous past catches up with her and they are forced to flee the island and go on the run together.', 'Secluded on a remote Greek island, retired assassin Julie has a somewhat thorny reunion with her estranged son, Edward, visiting from England. Armed with questions around new information on his paternity, Edward battles to find the right time to speak to his frustratingly distant mother. But, when the moment finally presents itself, things take a deadly turn as Julie’s dangerous past catches up with her and they are forced to flee the island and go on the run together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3O2UgEszp1CVbL8p9XnKkFDkbk3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:262352'),
  ('301813172390626666', 'The Assassins', 2024, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Abdul Rahim Kamal', 'Abdul Rahim Kamal', 'Karim Abdel Aziz, Ahmed Eid, Sammy Sheik, Nicolas Mouawad, Ahmed Abd El Wahab, Myrna Nour El Din, Sarah Elshamy, Fathy Abdel Wahab', null, 'The events take place in a historical context, in the 11th century, where the leader of the Assassins, Hassan al-Sabah, and his leadership of the band that was famous for carrying out bloody assassinations of prominent figures at that stage.', 'The events take place in a historical context, in the 11th century, where the leader of the Assassins, Hassan al-Sabah, and his leadership of the band that was famous for carrying out bloody assassinations of prominent figures at that stage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhnkrV58m9lLUL0BWX4MtKRqpKH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:224882'),
  ('678718390389967051', 'The Asset', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Clara Dessau, Maria Cordsen, Afshin Firouzi, Nicolas Bro', 'TV-MA', 'A young agent goes undercover to befriend a drug smuggler''s wife. But the closer she gets to her target, the more complicated her mission becomes.', 'A young agent goes undercover to befriend a drug smuggler''s wife. But the closer she gets to her target, the more complicated her mission becomes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ugreFeu0Ng7wnfX6ZRNoQa2sbxX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:262920'),
  ('153672380461836344', 'The Assets', 2014, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Jodie Whittaker, Paul Rhys, Harriet Walter, Ralph Brown, Christina Cole, Stuart Milligan, Lex Shrapnel, Catalina Denis', 'TV-14', '1985 serves as the backdrop to the final showdown of the Cold War when Sandy and her partner Jeanne Vertefeuille vowed to find the mole that would turn out to be the most notorious traitor in US history, Aldrich Ames. Sandy is in a race against time to save the Soviet intelligence officers from being caught and killed. Living her own double life at home, this beautiful wife and mother vowed to stop at nothing until she uncovered the truth.', '1985 serves as the backdrop to the final showdown of the Cold War when Sandy and her partner Jeanne Vertefeuille vowed to find the mole that would turn out to be the most notorious traitor in US history, Aldrich Ames. Sandy is in a race against time to save the Soviet intelligence officers from being caught and killed. Living her own double life at home, this beautiful wife and mother vowed to stop at nothing until she uncovered the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pvyuIr5m3TLfVpi0HnLFyYm2mYr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60066'),
  ('760503834019956972', 'The Asterisk War', 2015, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Atsushi Tamaru, Ai Kakuma, Nao Toyama, Shiori Izawa, Ari Ozawa, Yuma Uchida', 'TV-14', 'Invertia was a meteor storm that caused an unprecedented disaster during the 20th century. Because of this disaster, numerous cities around the world were destroyed. However, within the meteor, an unknown element called mana was discovered. It allowed human technology to make rapid strides giving rise to a new species of super-powered humans, the Star Pulse Generation (Genestella). The Festas (Star Warrior Festivals) host battles between Genestella at a city of six academies called “Rikka,” also commonly known as “Asterisk.” Scholarship student Ayato Amagiri transferred into Seidoukan Academy in order to fulfill his own wish, swearing he too will fight in this city.', 'Invertia was a meteor storm that caused an unprecedented disaster during the 20th century. Because of this disaster, numerous cities around the world were destroyed. However, within the meteor, an unknown element called mana was discovered. It allowed human technology to make rapid strides giving rise to a new species of super-powered humans, the Star Pulse Generation (Genestella). The Festas (Star Warrior Festivals) host battles between Genestella at a city of six academies called “Rikka,” also commonly known as “Asterisk.” Scholarship student Ayato Amagiri transferred into Seidoukan Academy in order to fulfill his own wish, swearing he too will fight in this city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f3ZgoCfGwKlPEbKXwkY4esfN57s.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:64671'),
  ('14964848084322769', 'The Astronaut Wives Club', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Stephanie Savage', null, 'JoAnna Garcia Swisher, Yvonne Strahovski, Dominique McElligott, Odette Annable, Erin Cummings, Azure Parsons, Zoe Boyle, Desmond Harrington', 'TV-PG', 'As America’s astronauts were launched on death-defying missions, Life Magazine documented the astronauts’ families, capturing the behind-the-scenes lives of their young wives. Overnight, these women were transformed from military spouses into American royalty. As their celebrity rose and tragedy began to touch their lives, they rallied together.', 'As America’s astronauts were launched on death-defying missions, Life Magazine documented the astronauts’ families, capturing the behind-the-scenes lives of their young wives. Overnight, these women were transformed from military spouses into American royalty. As their celebrity rose and tragedy began to touch their lives, they rallied together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2q9bSJnZlMgHwevjiNVKtpgCyrC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62458'),
  ('962080645932406845', 'The Astronauts', 2020, 'Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Daniel Knauf', null, 'Miya Cech, Bryce Gheisar, Keith L. Williams, Kayden Grace Swan, Ben Andrusco-Daon, Paige Howard', 'TV-G', 'Five kids accidentally launch aboard a spacecraft meant to intercept a mysterious asteroid in space. With no proper training and a malfunctioning onboard AI, the kids must work together to find their way back home.', 'Five kids accidentally launch aboard a spacecraft meant to intercept a mysterious asteroid in space. With no proper training and a malfunctioning onboard AI, the kids must work together to find their way back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/adnc6gSSbqHEGcYVWFisye0ev7v.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112718'),
  ('1027438227585348100', 'The Asunta Case', 2024, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jon de la Cuesta, Gema R. Neira, Ramón Campos', null, 'Candela Peña, Tristán Ulloa, Carlos Blanco, María León, Francesc Orella, Raúl Arévalo, Iris Whu, Javier Gutiérrez', 'TV-MA', 'After two parents report that their 12-year-old daughter Asunta is missing, the investigation soon turns against them.', 'After two parents report that their 12-year-old daughter Asunta is missing, the investigation soon turns against them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3sGdiu1TPfPB01AAohlgVh1uf0q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:239966'),
  ('620253858369581585', 'The Atlanta Child Murders', 1985, 'Drama', null, 'Abby Mann', 'Jason Robards, James Earl Jones, Rip Torn, Morgan Freeman, Calvin Levels, Lynne Moody, Ruby Dee, Gloria Foster', null, 'The Atlanta Child Murders is a TV miniseries that aired on February 10 and 12, 1985 on CBS. Inspired by true events, the miniseries examines the so-called "Atlanta child murders" of the late 1970s and early 1980s.', 'The Atlanta Child Murders is a TV miniseries that aired on February 10 and 12, 1985 on CBS. Inspired by true events, the miniseries examines the so-called "Atlanta child murders" of the late 1970s and early 1980s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5lH0Jcil77pw8HzIl6N16aXbpa8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16210'),
  ('712936498973204210', 'The Atom Ant Show', 1965, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy', null, null, 'Howard Morris, Don Messick, Janet Waldo, Henry Corden, Jean Vander Pyl', null, 'Operating out of his private anthill, the formidable Atom Ant picks up distress calls via his built-in antennae and heads out to battle a fearsomely delightful array of dastards including Bug Fat Dynamo, Crankenshaft, M.D. and his arch-nemesis Ferocious Flea. Sharing screen time with our hero are Precious Pupp, a rascal of a mutt who hides his antics from the kindly Granny Sweets and the Hillbilly Bears, the most ridiculous bears to ever come from the Blue Ridge Mountains.', 'Operating out of his private anthill, the formidable Atom Ant picks up distress calls via his built-in antennae and heads out to battle a fearsomely delightful array of dastards including Bug Fat Dynamo, Crankenshaft, M.D. and his arch-nemesis Ferocious Flea. Sharing screen time with our hero are Precious Pupp, a rascal of a mutt who hides his antics from the kindly Granny Sweets and the Hillbilly Bears, the most ridiculous bears to ever come from the Blue Ridge Mountains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sKcUojLk9MEBYvfRlzbx0EBof5a.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:22172'),
  ('616985718146733393', 'The Attaché', 2019, 'Drama', 'Eli Ben-David', 'Ori Alon, Héloïse Godet', 'Ilay Lax, Eli Ben-David, Héloïse Godet, Florence Bloch, Patrick Braoudé', null, 'Avshalom, a successful musician, relocates to Paris when his wife Annabelle gets a job there. They are greeted by terrorist attacks, and the dream of a romantic year abroad soon turns into a nightmare. Together and separately, Avshalom and Annabelle deal with issues such as anxiety, career and love, all of which shake their sense of belonging and challenge their relationship.', 'Avshalom, a successful musician, relocates to Paris when his wife Annabelle gets a job there. They are greeted by terrorist attacks, and the dream of a romantic year abroad soon turns into a nightmare. Together and separately, Avshalom and Annabelle deal with issues such as anxiety, career and love, all of which shake their sense of belonging and challenge their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9uHvO70Ev5YShvHYZMUkWSJ8Ow.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109374'),
  ('758123544759907916', 'The Atypical Family', 2024, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kang Eun-kyung', null, 'Jang Ki-yong, Chun Woo-hee, Goh Doo-shim, Claudia Kim, Park Soi, Ryu Abel, Choi Gwang-rok, Kim Keum-soon', null, 'Once blessed with unique superpowers, a family loses their abilities due to modern day problems — until a mysterious woman changes everything.', 'Once blessed with unique superpowers, a family loses their abilities due to modern day problems — until a mysterious woman changes everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnoQxxH3RoMRrUj5fm9SFRYlfxP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:232616'),
  ('218126890183268951', 'The Auditors', 2024, 'Crime, Drama', 'Kwon Young-il', 'Choi Min-ho', 'Shin Ha-kyun, Lee Jung-ha, Jin Goo, Jo A-ram, Jung Moon-sung, Lee Do-yeop, Kim Hong-pa, Bek Hyun-jin', null, 'An office investigative drama that depicts the ups and downs of teamwork between a cool-headed audit team leader and affectionate audit team members.', 'An office investigative drama that depicts the ups and downs of teamwork between a cool-headed audit team leader and affectionate audit team members.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tXgBhPKLwjiWDp634RYbQcbhGi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:244071'),
  ('886263352171235524', 'The Avengers', 1961, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Sydney Newman', null, 'Patrick Macnee, Linda Thorson, William Lucas', 'TV-14', 'A quirky spy show of the adventures of eccentrically suave British Agent John Steed and his predominantly female partners. Jonathan Steed - an urbane, proper gentleman spy - teams with various assistants throughout the series'' run, including Dr. David Keel, Cathy Gale, Emma Peel and Tara King, to repeatedly save the world from diabolical schemes plotted by equally diabolical evil-doers (among them robots and man-eating monsters).', 'A quirky spy show of the adventures of eccentrically suave British Agent John Steed and his predominantly female partners. Jonathan Steed - an urbane, proper gentleman spy - teams with various assistants throughout the series'' run, including Dr. David Keel, Cathy Gale, Emma Peel and Tara King, to repeatedly save the world from diabolical schemes plotted by equally diabolical evil-doers (among them robots and man-eating monsters).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQ4GHecDFEAmJcwc10zUrdIDLFd.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:2473'),
  ('906371283432789786', 'The Avengers: Earth''s Mightiest Heroes', 2010, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family', 'Joshua Fine, Ciro Nieli, Christopher L. Yost', null, 'Eric Loomis, Brian Bloom, Rick D. Wasserman, Colleen O''Shaughnessey, Chris Cox, Fred Tatasciore, Wally Wingert, Alex Désert', 'TV-Y7', 'The most powerful villains on the planet escape from prison. However, none of the superheroes can stop them without help, not even S.H.I.E.L.D. The Avengers then join forces to fight evil, and discover that as a group they are stronger.', 'The most powerful villains on the planet escape from prison. However, none of the superheroes can stop them without help, not even S.H.I.E.L.D. The Avengers then join forces to fight evil, and discover that as a group they are stronger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1JDhMrqCOZKh7lc0vQlRYQ46cE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:33623'),
  ('223322031857757872', 'The Avengers: United They Stand', 1999, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Linda Ballantyne, Tony Daniels, Ron Rubin, Martin Roach, Rod Wilson, Lenore Zann, Stavroula Logothettis', 'TV-Y7', 'When the planet is threatened by Super Villains, time traveling conquerors, alien invaders, mythical monsters or mad robots bent on the total destruction of humanity, when the forces of evil are so overwhelming that no single hero has the power to save the world, when there is no hope left… the AVENGERS ASSEMBLE!', 'When the planet is threatened by Super Villains, time traveling conquerors, alien invaders, mythical monsters or mad robots bent on the total destruction of humanity, when the forces of evil are so overwhelming that no single hero has the power to save the world, when there is no hope left… the AVENGERS ASSEMBLE!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p2SrnKTQjLRXBCcTZtYkTZCwLpp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1300'),
  ('932667960246008972', 'The Awakener: The Series', 2019, 'Crime, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Luciano Cunha, Gabriel Wainer', 'Rodrigo Lages', 'Natália Lage, Helena Ranaldi, Kiko Pissolato, Samuel de Assis, Eduardo Moscovis, Lucy Ramos, Tainá Medina, Marília Gabriela', null, 'A masked vigilante appears to attack the impunity that allows politicians and contractors to enrich themselves at the expense of the misery and work of the Brazilian population. The story of the man behind the Awakener''s guise involves a personal journey of revenge in which a traumatized agent decides to take the law into his own hands.', 'A masked vigilante appears to attack the impunity that allows politicians and contractors to enrich themselves at the expense of the misery and work of the Brazilian population. The story of the man behind the Awakener''s guise involves a personal journey of revenge in which a traumatized agent decides to take the law into his own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cNfGEC3ug5zyFg7xNoMRwwEUczM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93159'),
  ('670083461483297867', 'The Awesomes', 2013, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Seth Meyers, Michael Shoemaker', null, 'Seth Meyers, Ike Barinholtz, Taran Killam, Bobby Lee, Paula Pell, Emily Spivey, Kenan Thompson, Josh Meyers', 'TV-14', 'After Mr. Awesome announces his retirement as leader of The Awesomes, a superhero task force, his not-so-super son Prock (Seth Meyers) fills the roster with previously rejected applicants, but despite their incompetence and general lack of ability, the team must band together to battle diabolical villains, the ever-present paparazzi, and a less-than-ideal reputation as second-class superheroes.', 'After Mr. Awesome announces his retirement as leader of The Awesomes, a superhero task force, his not-so-super son Prock (Seth Meyers) fills the roster with previously rejected applicants, but despite their incompetence and general lack of ability, the team must band together to battle diabolical villains, the ever-present paparazzi, and a less-than-ideal reputation as second-class superheroes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tWEGhSwGGEf1N7SupZsvy7UHdB9.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:28104'),
  ('953491048358827110', 'The Awful Truth', 1999, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Michael Moore', 'Nick McKinney, Annie Cohen, Jay Martel', 'Michael Moore, Karen Duffy, Gideon Evans, Jay Martel', null, 'The Awful Truth is a satirical television show that was directed, written, and hosted by filmmaker Michael Moore, and funded by the British broadcaster Channel 4.', 'The Awful Truth is a satirical television show that was directed, written, and hosted by filmmaker Michael Moore, and funded by the British broadcaster Channel 4.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qBIREWBt8rVWRzxlfJiRzxzPzlC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:11329'),
  ('605207249393772561', 'The Ayotzinapa 43: State Crime', 2024, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', '​A chilling five-part docuseries detailing an attack that led to the disappearance of 43 students – and the 10-year fight for answers.', '​A chilling five-part docuseries detailing an attack that led to the disappearance of 43 students – and the 10-year fight for answers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nUwVso7yfymS5CxYSp8cvRZkDMt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:261522'),
  ('1053385930623766188', 'The Ba***ds of Bollywood', 2025, 'Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Aryan Khan, Bilal Siddiqi, Manav Chauhan', 'Aryan Khan, Bilal Siddiqi, Manav Chauhan', 'Lakshya Lalwani, Bobby Deol, Sahher Bambba, Raghav Juyal, Mona Singh, Manoj Pahwa, Anya Singh, Manish Chaudhary', 'TV-MA', 'In this high-stakes drama, an ambitious outsider and his friends navigate the chaotic, larger-than-life, yet uncertain world of Bollywood.', 'In this high-stakes drama, an ambitious outsider and his friends navigate the chaotic, larger-than-life, yet uncertain world of Bollywood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6QFnXFx5XJAp0SxMd9g23cbti4m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:247043'),
  ('179947595991609325', 'The Baby', 2022, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Sian Robins-Grace, Lucy Gaymer', null, 'Michelle de Swarte, Amira Ghazalla, Amber Grappy, Albie Hills, Arthur Hills, Patrice Naiambana, Sinéad Cusack, Shvorne Marks', 'TV-MA', 'When 38 year-old Natasha is unexpectedly landed with a baby, her life of doing what she wants, when she wants, dramatically implodes. Controlling, manipulative and with violent powers, the baby twists Natasha''s life into a horror show. Where does it come from? What does it want? And what lengths will Natasha have to go to in order to get her life back?', 'When 38 year-old Natasha is unexpectedly landed with a baby, her life of doing what she wants, when she wants, dramatically implodes. Controlling, manipulative and with violent powers, the baby twists Natasha''s life into a horror show. Where does it come from? What does it want? And what lengths will Natasha have to go to in order to get her life back?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pFpZNexdMLM1nLALKHVDhPbuMtM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:115915'),
