  ('758470584854854461', 'The Bad Guy', 2022, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Ludovica Rampoldi, Giuseppe G. Stasi, Davide Serino', null, 'Claudia Pandolfi, Luigi Lo Cascio', null, 'The story of Nino Scotellaro, a Sicilian public prosecutor who devoted his entire life to fighting against the mafia and is suddenly accused of being one of the very men he has always fought against. After being condemned, and with nothing left to lose, Nino decides to pull off a Machiavellian revenge plan.', 'The story of Nino Scotellaro, a Sicilian public prosecutor who devoted his entire life to fighting against the mafia and is suddenly accused of being one of the very men he has always fought against. After being condemned, and with nothing left to lose, Nino decides to pull off a Machiavellian revenge plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kmuWIy5MUY1rFp3C62BUl4pZ7HE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:158050'),
  ('127509107968965110', 'The Bad Guys: The Series', 2025, 'Animation, Crime, Comedy, Family', 'Katherine Nolfi, Ben Glass, Shane Lynch', null, 'Michael Godere, Chris Diamantopoulos, Ezekiel Ajeigbe, Raul Ceballos, Mallory Low, Zehra Fazal', 'TV-Y7', 'How did the Bad Guys break into the bad guy business in the first place? Find out in this hilarious prequel series set before the hit films.', 'How did the Bad Guys break into the bad guy business in the first place? Find out in this hilarious prequel series set before the hit films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1F19BFivPc2N3sXJ4461cWsrK33.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:302540'),
  ('189608652853933382', 'The Bad Kids', 2020, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Xin Shuang, Zi Jin Chen', 'Joker Sun, Pan Yiran', 'Qin Hao, Wang Jingchun, Rong Zishan, Shi Pengyuan, Wang Shengdi, Zhang Songwen, Liu Lin, Li Meng', null, 'A story that follows three children from a coastal town who unintentionally film a murder scene. As the kids become involved with the suspect, it opens up a case that is far more complicated than it looks and entraps several families into an unpredictable outcome.', 'A story that follows three children from a coastal town who unintentionally film a murder scene. As the kids become involved with the suspect, it opens up a case that is far more complicated than it looks and entraps several families into an unpredictable outcome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i8XHjbwBUbybCQoUJbT89JpcS1c.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:104960'),
  ('777782088722692902', 'The Bad Penny', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Barbaros Bilgin', 'Eset Akçilad, Damla Serim, Murat Uyurkulak', 'Uraz Kaygılaroğlu, Ekin Koç, Aslıhan Malbora, Nesrin Cavadzade, Mustafa Kirantepe, Uğur Yıldıran, Damla Makar, Civan Canova', null, 'When a serial killer stalks a Romani neighborhood, a hardboiled police captain teams up with a Gypsy crime boss to bring the killer to justice.', 'When a serial killer stalks a Romani neighborhood, a hardboiled police captain teams up with a Gypsy crime boss to bring the killer to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90FtMHAsphVXAXAL8U8fjb3BdOP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137713'),
  ('54091240536613801', 'The BAFTA Awards', 1949, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'BAFTA presents awards for film, television and games, including children''s entertainment, at a number of annual ceremonies across the UK and in Los Angeles, USA.', 'BAFTA presents awards for film, television and games, including children''s entertainment, at a number of annual ceremonies across the UK and in Los Angeles, USA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6MwmK9oNnPbHEJFLJb8RbZiHsg.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:26183'),
  ('805019979910350133', 'The Baker and the Beauty', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Fyodor Stukov', null, 'Anna Chipovskaya, Nikita Volkov, Daniil Vakhrushev, Alina Alekseeva, Evgeniya Dmitrieva, Aleksey Makarov, Artur Vakha, Aleksey Rozin', null, 'Having met the superstar in the toilet of the restaurant, the baker from Malakhovka did not even suspect how his life would change. Luxurious parties in the style of the "Great Gatsby", social gatherings, weekends in London, the ubiquitous paparazzi and a sea of temptations – all this and not only awaits a simple guy Andrei in the world of Sasha Larina. Everything would be fine, only an offended ex-girlfriend, dreaming of revenge, and Sasha''s ex–boyfriend, a sexy Hollywood actor, who plans to return Larina, were left behind.', 'Having met the superstar in the toilet of the restaurant, the baker from Malakhovka did not even suspect how his life would change. Luxurious parties in the style of the "Great Gatsby", social gatherings, weekends in London, the ubiquitous paparazzi and a sea of temptations – all this and not only awaits a simple guy Andrei in the world of Sasha Larina. Everything would be fine, only an offended ex-girlfriend, dreaming of revenge, and Sasha''s ex–boyfriend, a sexy Hollywood actor, who plans to return Larina, were left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1eZ7WAOXDnb4bVJytF7RYqK5t6J.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86783'),
  ('30244701663317058', 'The Baker and the Beauty', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Dean Georgaris', null, 'Victor Rasuk, Nathalie Kelley, Dan Bucatinsky, David Del Rio, Michelle Veintimilla, Belissa Escobedo, Lisa Vidal, Carlos Gómez', 'TV-PG', 'Daniel Garcia is working in the family bakery and doing everything that his loving Cuban parents and siblings expect him to do. But on a wild Miami night he meets Noa Hamilton, an international superstar and fashion mogul, and his life moves into the spotlight. Will this unlikely couple upend their lives to be together and pull their families into a culture clash?', 'Daniel Garcia is working in the family bakery and doing everything that his loving Cuban parents and siblings expect him to do. But on a wild Miami night he meets Noa Hamilton, an international superstar and fashion mogul, and his life moves into the spotlight. Will this unlikely couple upend their lives to be together and pull their families into a culture clash?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0AB2fH7KZNlrh9SBNY3a5ooD0Q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92045'),
  ('760764034256076905', 'The Banana Splits Adventure Hour', 1968, 'Family, Animation', 'Marty Krofft, Sid Krofft', null, 'Paul Winchell, Don Messick, Daws Butler, Robert Towers, Allan Melvin, Jeff Winkless', null, 'The Banana Splits Adventure Hour was an hour-long, packaged television variety program featuring The Banana Splits, a fictional rock band composed of four funny animal characters. The series was produced by Hanna-Barbera, and ran for 31 episodes on NBC Saturday mornings, from September 7, 1968, to September 5, 1970.', 'The Banana Splits Adventure Hour was an hour-long, packaged television variety program featuring The Banana Splits, a fictional rock band composed of four funny animal characters. The series was produced by Hanna-Barbera, and ran for 31 episodes on NBC Saturday mornings, from September 7, 1968, to September 5, 1970.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/erXApEwZ00cRcHY1B848F3m1Dtf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:23652'),
  ('1150021084806251387', 'The Banished Court Magician Aims to Become the Strongest', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shuichiro Umeda, Yurika Kubo, Masumi Tazawa, Masaaki Mizunaka', 'TV-14', 'Once a loyal court magician supporting the crown prince from behind the scenes, Alec Ygret is cast aside and exiled for only knowing support magic. But just as he hits rock bottom, he reunites with Yorha Eisentz, a former comrade from the legendary party Lasting Period. Invited to rejoin the team that once made history, Alec returns to dungeon exploration—and begins a new chapter in his life!', 'Once a loyal court magician supporting the crown prince from behind the scenes, Alec Ygret is cast aside and exiled for only knowing support magic. But just as he hits rock bottom, he reunites with Yorha Eisentz, a former comrade from the legendary party Lasting Period. Invited to rejoin the team that once made history, Alec returns to dungeon exploration—and begins a new chapter in his life!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tmGjjRN9dRFzybRLSecgxNo46IE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:286984'),
  ('717990059694006938', 'The Banished Former Hero Lives as He Pleases', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shouta Aoi, Minami Kurisaka, Sora Amamiya, Akari Kito, Aimi, Megumi Han, Mariya Ise', 'TV-14', 'Allen is banished from the Duchy of Westfeldt on account of his low level and lack of a god-given Gift, and all seems lost. But with his memories of a past life as a hero intact, Allen sees this twist of fate as a blessing—he can finally live his life as he pleases! That momentary peace is cut short when Allen saves his ex-fiancée, beginning a new saga for the banished former hero.', 'Allen is banished from the Duchy of Westfeldt on account of his low level and lack of a god-given Gift, and all seems lost. But with his memories of a past life as a hero intact, Allen sees this twist of fate as a blessing—he can finally live his life as he pleases! That momentary peace is cut short when Allen saves his ex-fiancée, beginning a new saga for the banished former hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUDkHsNzkjTBQ55fS9pUO1ng7vk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:229108'),
  ('398121479995458607', 'The Bank Hacker', 2021, 'Drama', 'Maarten Goffin, Kristof Hoefkens', null, 'Tijmen Govaerts, Ella-June Henrard, Gene Bervoets, Koen De Graeve, Claude Musungayi, Manuel Broekman, Hilde De Baerdemaeker, An Miller', 'TV-MA', 'After two years in prison, professional con man Alidor Van Praet needs to rebuild the illegal fortune the police seized from him. When he spots 19-year-old Jeremy Peeter’s hacking skills at a computing convention, he knows this shy teenager is the key to making it happen and to get revenge on the financial system that drove his father to suicide.', 'After two years in prison, professional con man Alidor Van Praet needs to rebuild the illegal fortune the police seized from him. When he spots 19-year-old Jeremy Peeter’s hacking skills at a computing convention, he knows this shy teenager is the key to making it happen and to get revenge on the financial system that drove his father to suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j4oArZovTIrfLDdYJdXjPXsr2Lj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:125693'),
  ('803155353415352094', 'The Bannen Way', 2010, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Robert Forster, Michael Ironside, Vanessa Marcil, Brynn Thayer, Brianne Davis, Michael Lerner, Mark Gantt, Ski Carr', null, 'Neal Bannen, a third generation criminal, wants to get out of the con man lifestyle he''s been living.', 'Neal Bannen, a third generation criminal, wants to get out of the con man lifestyle he''s been living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zbAeJZ0QJLRRRhWcWcbIxSMKNlX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45607'),
