  ('984178533418519247', 'The Beverly Hillbillies', 1962, 'Comedy, Family', 'Paul Henning', null, 'Buddy Ebsen, Irene Ryan, Donna Douglas, Max Baer Jr., Raymond Bailey, Nancy Kulp', 'TV-G', 'Jed Clampett''s swamp is loaded with oil. When a wildcatter discovers the huge pool, Jed sells his land to the O.K. Oil Company and at the urging of cousin Pearl, moves his family to a 35-room mansion in Beverly Hills, California.', 'Jed Clampett''s swamp is loaded with oil. When a wildcatter discovers the huge pool, Jed sells his land to the O.K. Oil Company and at the urging of cousin Pearl, moves his family to a 35-room mansion in Beverly Hills, California.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sEZs4szkwBXIK3DOm37MnQN9fIe.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:1930'),
