  ('975525089372815253', 'The Big Flower Fight', 2020, 'Reality', null, null, 'Vic Reeves, Natasia Demetriou, Kristen Griffith-Vanderyacht', null, 'Ten pairs of florists, sculptors and garden designers face off in a friendly floral fight to see who can build the biggest, boldest garden sculptures.', 'Ten pairs of florists, sculptors and garden designers face off in a friendly floral fight to see who can build the biggest, boldest garden sculptures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ZOi6NYiYECJmpAqIXanzMEiYPH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103035'),
  ('1058858350645213572', 'The Big Game', 2020, 'Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Igor Vernik, Vladimir Verevochkin, Andrey Chadov, Linda Lapinsh, Elena Andreeva, Denis Kotov, Aleksey Chadov, Anastasiya Todorescu', null, 'Sixteen contestants of a new survival show are taken to the Siberian taiga to compete for the price of one million euros. The rules are simple: no food, personal belongings, electricity, communications and civilization for hundreds of kilometers around. The one remains wins. Soon TV project turns into a deadly game, where LIFE becomes the main prize... What is it? Is it sick TV script? Who is behind this? And who can survive without losing their humanity?', 'Sixteen contestants of a new survival show are taken to the Siberian taiga to compete for the price of one million euros. The rules are simple: no food, personal belongings, electricity, communications and civilization for hundreds of kilometers around. The one remains wins. Soon TV project turns into a deadly game, where LIFE becomes the main prize... What is it? Is it sick TV script? Who is behind this? And who can survive without losing their humanity?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/chLNbjo3QV6Sw47dH5W8ZxArBYb.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:107703'),
  ('480068574680044228', 'The Big Leap', 2021, 'Drama', 'Liz Heldens', null, 'Simone Recasner, Teri Polo, Piper Perabo, Scott Foley, Jon Rudnitsky, Kevin Daniels, Ser''Darius Blain, Raymond Cham Jr.', 'TV-14', 'Follow a group of diverse, down-on-their-luck characters attempting to change their lives by participating in a potentially life-ruining reality dance show that builds to a live production of “Swan Lake.”', 'Follow a group of diverse, down-on-their-luck characters attempting to change their lives by participating in a potentially life-ruining reality dance show that builds to a live production of “Swan Lake.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBYWTQHvN7IljiDpcjI23ihLV8I.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127161'),
  ('840559700666837390', 'The Big Moment', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Victor Shamirov', 'Victor Shamirov, Alexey Trotsyuk, Olga Motina-Suponeva', 'Dmitry Lysenkov, Evgeniya Borzikh, Victor Shamirov, Olga Motina-Suponeva, Lyudmila Artemeva, Olga Tumaykina, Sergey Belogolovtsev, Darya Semyonova', null, 'Estranged ex-lovers, Kostya and Kira are unexpectedly thrown together again when they''re asked to collaborate as script-writers on a love-story set in a music school. The script focuses on teachers Rostislav (Dmitry Lysenkov) and Arina (Evgeniya Borzykh), who are caught-up in a difficult situation, made more complicated by Arina passing off a new colleague as her boyfriend to placate her demanding mother. The real and phoney relationships, both on and off-paper (or in reality or in the script), test all the characters, and examine themes of love, trust, sex, infidelity, friendship, responsibility as well as compatibility.', 'Estranged ex-lovers, Kostya and Kira are unexpectedly thrown together again when they''re asked to collaborate as script-writers on a love-story set in a music school. The script focuses on teachers Rostislav (Dmitry Lysenkov) and Arina (Evgeniya Borzykh), who are caught-up in a difficult situation, made more complicated by Arina passing off a new colleague as her boyfriend to placate her demanding mother. The real and phoney relationships, both on and off-paper (or in reality or in the script), test all the characters, and examine themes of love, trust, sex, infidelity, friendship, responsibility as well as compatibility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/58XOsWyfM5qxP6ABI20nS8wU35H.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:134686'),
  ('16668099295871306', 'The Big O', 1999, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Mitsuru Miyamoto, Akiko Yajima, Emi Shinohara, Gorō Naya, Katsunosuke Hori, Motomu Kiyokawa, Shinpachi Tsuji, Unsho Ishizuka', 'TV-14', 'Forty years ago, the minds of Paradigm City''s inhabitants were wiped clean of all recollections of the past. Now, ruled by a powerful corporation and cut off from the rest of the world by desolate wastelands, Paradigm has become a virtual police state where Negotiators like Roger Smith keep the wheels of progress, commerce, and society turning.', 'Forty years ago, the minds of Paradigm City''s inhabitants were wiped clean of all recollections of the past. Now, ruled by a powerful corporation and cut off from the rest of the world by desolate wastelands, Paradigm has become a virtual police state where Negotiators like Roger Smith keep the wheels of progress, commerce, and society turning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AsL5J7k9diSxQcxwNEYJSKqtRCS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:18241'),
