  ('859446761722264031', 'The Bullwinkle Show', 1959, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy, Family', 'Jay Ward, Bill Scott', null, 'William Conrad, June Foray, Bill Scott, Paul Frees, Dorothy Scott, Edward Everett Horton, Walter Tetley, Daws Butler', 'TV-G', 'A variety show, with the main feature being the serialized adventures of the two title characters, the anthropomorphic moose Bullwinkle and flying squirrel Rocky. The main adversaries in most of their adventures are the Russian-like spies Boris Badenov and Natasha Fatale. Supporting segments include Dudley Do-Right, Peabody''s Improbable History, and Fractured Fairy Tales, among others.', 'A variety show, with the main feature being the serialized adventures of the two title characters, the anthropomorphic moose Bullwinkle and flying squirrel Rocky. The main adversaries in most of their adventures are the Russian-like spies Boris Badenov and Natasha Fatale. Supporting segments include Dudley Do-Right, Peabody''s Improbable History, and Fractured Fairy Tales, among others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAMWBJyYynFWxJNrIvVnHlN2e9P.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1025'),
  ('1011442845288747481', 'The Bureau', 2015, 'Crime, Drama', 'Éric Rochant', null, 'Mathieu Kassovitz, Sara Giraudeau, Stefan Crepon, Zineb Triki, Florence Loiret Caille, Jonathan Zaccaï, Oleksiy Horbunov, Mathieu Amalric', 'TV-MA', 'Within the DGSE (General Directorate for External Security), a department called the Office Of Legends (BDL) forms and remote pilot the most important agents of the French intelligence services: Clandestine. Immersion in hostile country, their mission is to identify individuals who may be recruited as sources of information. Operating "under caption", that is to say in a fabricated identity from scratch, they live for many years in a permanent duplicity. Our hero just returned from a clandestine mission six years in Damascus. But contrary to what is required by safety rules, he does not abandon his legend and the identity under which he lived in Syria, thus putting in danger the whole system.', 'Within the DGSE (General Directorate for External Security), a department called the Office Of Legends (BDL) forms and remote pilot the most important agents of the French intelligence services: Clandestine. Immersion in hostile country, their mission is to identify individuals who may be recruited as sources of information. Operating "under caption", that is to say in a fabricated identity from scratch, they live for many years in a permanent duplicity. Our hero just returned from a clandestine mission six years in Damascus. But contrary to what is required by safety rules, he does not abandon his legend and the identity under which he lived in Syria, thus putting in danger the whole system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWd0ajqIsd92tcQEgYBC7nMpOrk.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:62476'),
  ('872680150689819714', 'The Bureau of Magical Things', 2018, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids, Comedy, Family, Action & Adventure', 'Jonathan M. Shiff', null, 'Kimie Tsukakoshi, Mia Milnes, Elizabeth Cullen, Julian Cullen, Rainbow Wedell, Jamie Carter, Christopher Sommers, Nicholas Bell', 'TV-G', 'When ordinary teenager Kyra touches a mysterious book, she is transformed into a Tri-ling-–part-human, part-fairy and part-elf. In addition to acquiring amazing magical powers, Kyra discovers a secret world of magic all around her.', 'When ordinary teenager Kyra touches a mysterious book, she is transformed into a Tri-ling-–part-human, part-fairy and part-elf. In addition to acquiring amazing magical powers, Kyra discovers a secret world of magic all around her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sM1E094qxukl7GOt8EC1uVDxkXR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:82791'),
  ('1063418940824170503', 'The Burning Girls', 2023, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Hans Rosenfeldt', null, 'Samantha Morton, Ruby Stokes, Conrad Khan, David Dawson, Paul Bradley, Janie Dee, Jane Lapotaire, John Macmillan', null, 'Follows Reverend Jack Brooks and her daughter in Chapel Croft, a place for a fresh start that soon reveals its community''s dark history and where ancient superstitions and mistrust of outsiders are quite common.', 'Follows Reverend Jack Brooks and her daughter in Chapel Croft, a place for a fresh start that soon reveals its community''s dark history and where ancient superstitions and mistrust of outsiders are quite common.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjhbQMfQPcMpk9fqcB7AqGvLfHP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:234787'),
