  ('676575467398306632', 'The Busy World of Richard Scarry', 1994, 'Animation, Kids', null, null, 'Sonja Ball, Keith Knight, Judy Marshak, Philip Williams, Stephen Ouimette, Len Carlson, Tara Meyer', 'TV-Y', 'Busytown is an enchanting place that''s abuzz with energy and life. Young audiences are invited to sing and laugh along as Huckle Cat, Lowly Worm, and other beloved characters from acclaimed author Richard Scarry make their way through the day exploring their happy and lively world.', 'Busytown is an enchanting place that''s abuzz with energy and life. Young audiences are invited to sing and laugh along as Huckle Cat, Lowly Worm, and other beloved characters from acclaimed author Richard Scarry make their way through the day exploring their happy and lively world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eusoONNTGM8Bi5By7zLNDvWJdG3.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:6460'),
  ('161076293214502858', 'The Buzz on Maggie', 2005, 'Animation, Kids, Family', 'Dave Polsky', null, 'Jessica DiCicco, Cree Summer', 'TV-G', 'Maggie Pesky is an unusual young teen fly with big dreams. Maggie gets the community''s attention with her antics in a conventional world of upstanding flies. Maggie is always plotting to make even mundane tasks fun and exciting.', 'Maggie Pesky is an unusual young teen fly with big dreams. Maggie gets the community''s attention with her antics in a conventional world of upstanding flies. Maggie is always plotting to make even mundane tasks fun and exciting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3eON7Qqpvdb9TWsOQT2gCE1RD8E.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:426'),
  ('1059515380583361418', 'The Cabin with Bert Kreischer', 2020, 'Reality, Comedy', null, null, 'Bert Kreischer', 'TV-MA', 'Fast-living comic Bert Kreischer heads to a cabin for some self-care and invites his funny friends to join his quest to cleanse his mind, body and soul.', 'Fast-living comic Bert Kreischer heads to a cabin for some self-care and invites his funny friends to join his quest to cleanse his mind, body and soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6pGq8TMpkmFjK33tiiOtRWbtHX4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110512'),
  ('120659540457800065', 'The Café Terrace and Its Goddesses', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Masaaki Mizunaka, Azumi Waki, Aya Yamane, Sayumi Suzushiro, Asami Seto, Ruriko Aoki, Rie Takahashi, Ayana Taketatsu', 'TV-14', 'After inheriting his late grandmother’s failing café, Hayato sees it as a bother and plans to sell it for a quick buck. Until he discovers five beautiful girls staying there! When they beg him to keep the café open, Hayato reluctantly gives in. Can he manage the seaside shop while learning to live with these unruly women?', 'After inheriting his late grandmother’s failing café, Hayato sees it as a bother and plans to sell it for a quick buck. Until he discovers five beautiful girls staying there! When they beg him to keep the café open, Hayato reluctantly gives in. Can he manage the seaside shop while learning to live with these unruly women?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oWN39kWHYfclI2ljtkpg905fV4s.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:209707'),
  ('924754844111090453', 'The Cage', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Franck Gastambide, Sylvain Caron', null, 'Melvin Boomer, Franck Gastambide, Edwige Ahonto, Antoine Simony, Yanisse Kebbab, Bosh, Camille de Sablet', 'TV-MA', 'Dreaming of going pro, a young fighter struggles to be seen until an unexpected face-off lands him a shot at the big time — and a ruthless rivalry.', 'Dreaming of going pro, a young fighter struggles to be seen until an unexpected face-off lands him a shot at the big time — and a ruthless rivalry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4qoqqvKbugSYYE2rfpOmLb0I5kP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:230003'),
  ('1016473370581720675', 'The Calling', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'David E. Kelley', null, 'Jeff Wilbusch, Juliana Canfield, Karen Robinson, Michael Mosley', null, 'NYPD Detective Avraham Avraham''s belief in mankind is his superpower when it comes to uncovering the truth. Guided by a deep sense of spirituality and religious principles, Avraham is left to question his own humanity when a seemingly routine investigation turns upside down.', 'NYPD Detective Avraham Avraham''s belief in mankind is his superpower when it comes to uncovering the truth. Guided by a deep sense of spirituality and religious principles, Avraham is left to question his own humanity when a seemingly routine investigation turns upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjc3yqr4zj228aWdgQa5wZqTPam.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156473'),
  ('503873495546929506', 'The Camomile Lawn', 1992, 'Drama', 'Ken Taylor', 'Ken Taylor', 'Felicity Kendal, Claire Bloom, Jennifer Ehle, Richard Johnson, Rebecca Hall, James Gaddas, Nicholas Le Prevost, Paul Eddington', null, 'The Camomile Lawn is a 1992 British miniseries based on Mary Wesley''s novel of the same name, following five cousins and their family in Cornwall as they navigate the start of World War II. The story is framed by a funeral in 1984, which prompts the characters to recall their experiences during the war, including love, loss, and secrets.', 'The Camomile Lawn is a 1992 British miniseries based on Mary Wesley''s novel of the same name, following five cousins and their family in Cornwall as they navigate the start of World War II. The story is framed by a funeral in 1984, which prompts the characters to recall their experiences during the war, including love, loss, and secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yvlDWDm6rFuu6uSaZD8R1vpcLmJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:26178'),
  ('1133125478199433837', 'The Candidate', 2016, 'Drama', 'Leonardo Bechini', 'Leonardo Bechini', 'Silvia Navarro, Víctor González, Rafael Sánchez Navarro, Helena Rojo, Ari Telch, Susana González, Nailea Norvind, Patricio Castillo', null, 'Like many women, Regina struggles every day for the welfare of her family, having to cope from the worn relationship with her husband to the rebellion of her teenage son ... but in her case everything is in sight, because she is the wife of Head of Government of the city and, as if that were not enough, an honorable senator, who always tries to do what is best for her fellow men. In the world of politics, a world where men build power at any cost, is Regina, who strives to improve the reality of people and impose ideals over power.', 'Like many women, Regina struggles every day for the welfare of her family, having to cope from the worn relationship with her husband to the rebellion of her teenage son ... but in her case everything is in sight, because she is the wife of Head of Government of the city and, as if that were not enough, an honorable senator, who always tries to do what is best for her fellow men. In the world of politics, a world where men build power at any cost, is Regina, who strives to improve the reality of people and impose ideals over power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/efKmlXhRUuwRMrUBmcfOreqHbFf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75627'),
  ('603055503089065807', 'The Canterville Ghost', 2021, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Anthony Stewart Head, James Lance, Laurel Waghorn, Caroline Catz, Jonty Stephens, Catherine Russell', null, 'Follows a tech billionaire who buys Canterville Chase, unaware that the contents include a malevolent family ghost, who has been haunting the premises for centuries.', 'Follows a tech billionaire who buys Canterville Chase, unaware that the contents include a malevolent family ghost, who has been haunting the premises for centuries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1a0bnkiAhc6kt9JHnA974Wnlu9D.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:154152'),
  ('14444051663095310', 'The Cape', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Tom Wheeler', null, 'David Lyons, Keith David, Summer Glau, James Frain, Jennifer Ferrin, Ryan Wynott, Dorian Missick, Martin Klebba', 'TV-14', '"The Cape" is a drama series following Vince Faraday, an honest cop on a corrupt police force, who finds himself framed for a series of murders and presumed dead. He is forced into hiding, leaving behind his wife Dana and son, Trip. Fueled by a desire to reunite with his family and to battle the criminal forces that have overtaken Palm City, Vince Faraday becomes "The Cape" - his son''s favorite comic book superhero - and takes the law into his own hands.', '"The Cape" is a drama series following Vince Faraday, an honest cop on a corrupt police force, who finds himself framed for a series of murders and presumed dead. He is forced into hiding, leaving behind his wife Dana and son, Trip. Fueled by a desire to reunite with his family and to battle the criminal forces that have overtaken Palm City, Vince Faraday becomes "The Cape" - his son''s favorite comic book superhero - and takes the law into his own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lLgIZKEHaHrZ1O2O3dRZRKxIxWK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32715'),
  ('601641985456310251', 'The Capture', 2019, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Ben Chanan', null, 'Holliday Grainger, Ron Perlman, Ben Miles, Lia Williams, Ginny Holder, Paapa Essiedu, Indira Varma, Tessa Wong', 'TV-MA', 'When soldier Shaun Emery''s conviction for a murder in Afghanistan is overturned due to flawed video evidence, he returns to life as a free man with his young daughter. But when damning CCTV footage from a night out in London comes to light, Shaun''s life takes a shocking turn and he must soon fight for his freedom once again.', 'When soldier Shaun Emery''s conviction for a murder in Afghanistan is overturned due to flawed video evidence, he returns to life as a free man with his young daughter. But when damning CCTV footage from a night out in London comes to light, Shaun''s life takes a shocking turn and he must soon fight for his freedom once again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bCuTIRmnd6eBNZ9oBBQ2KAtErid.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:93166'),
  ('345693738619834690', 'The Capture of the Green River Killer', 2008, 'Drama', null, 'John Pielmeier', 'Tom Cavanagh, Currie Graham, Amy Davidson, Jessica Harmon, Michelle Harrison, Christina Lindley, Maya Ritter, Bret Anthony', null, 'Detective David Reichert begins a relentless search for a serial killer in Washington state.', 'Detective David Reichert begins a relentless search for a serial killer in Washington state.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1YNZ9UxbfP6sXiKzbQLAsb3Ce8L.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:28599'),
  ('886589162245730709', 'The Carbonaro Effect', 2014, 'Reality', 'Michael Carbonaro', null, 'Michael Carbonaro', null, 'Michael Carbonaro is a magician by trade, but a prankster by heart. Michael performs baffling tricks on unsuspecting people in everyday situations, all caught on hidden camera. Everyone is left stunned and delighted, even though they have no idea what just hit them.', 'Michael Carbonaro is a magician by trade, but a prankster by heart. Michael performs baffling tricks on unsuspecting people in everyday situations, all caught on hidden camera. Everyone is left stunned and delighted, even though they have no idea what just hit them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/am9aBRY0ZuUi2wEEUUySNp7ewjT.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:60913'),
  ('1117012836505113288', 'The Care Bears', 1985, 'Kids, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Linda Denham, Elena Kucharik, David H. DePatie', null, 'Dan Hennessey, John Stocker, Chris Wiggins, Melleny Melody, Luba Goy, Billie Mae Richards, Jim Henshaw, Tracey Moore', 'TV-Y', 'The Care Bears live in a faraway place up in the clouds called Care-a-Lot. They travel around the world on Missions in Caring, whilst evil villains such as Professor Coldheart and Lord No Heart, try to thwart their plans.', 'The Care Bears live in a faraway place up in the clouds called Care-a-Lot. They travel around the world on Missions in Caring, whilst evil villains such as Professor Coldheart and Lord No Heart, try to thwart their plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cEfqYEzVlnBLnT36GJ3y8Jm5gAO.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2264'),
  ('287974328698135131', 'The Carmichael Show', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Nicholas Stoller, Jerrod Carmichael, Ari Katcher', 'Andy Lee', 'Jerrod Carmichael, Amber Stevens West, Lil Rel Howery, Tiffany Haddish, Loretta Devine, David Alan Grier', null, 'From the comedy of Jerrod Carmichael and Nick Stoller ("Neighbors") comes an irreverent sitcom inspired by Jerrod''s relationships with his say-anything, contrarian father, his therapist-in-training girlfriend, his ever-hustling brother and his mother who is always, always, always right with Jesus. Taking the next step and moving in together, Jerrod and his girlfriend, Maxine (Amber West), are your average young couple trying to make it in the city. They’re smart, motivated and looking to build a fulfilling life together. The only thing standing in their way is family. Between Jerrod''s larger-than-life brother, Bobby (Lil Rel Howery), and his smothering and passionate parents (David Alan Grier, Loretta Devine), Jerrod and Maxine are put to the test navigating the boundaries of romance, family and sanity.', 'From the comedy of Jerrod Carmichael and Nick Stoller ("Neighbors") comes an irreverent sitcom inspired by Jerrod''s relationships with his say-anything, contrarian father, his therapist-in-training girlfriend, his ever-hustling brother and his mother who is always, always, always right with Jesus. Taking the next step and moving in together, Jerrod and his girlfriend, Maxine (Amber West), are your average young couple trying to make it in the city. They’re smart, motivated and looking to build a fulfilling life together. The only thing standing in their way is family. Between Jerrod''s larger-than-life brother, Bobby (Lil Rel Howery), and his smothering and passionate parents (David Alan Grier, Loretta Devine), Jerrod and Maxine are put to the test navigating the boundaries of romance, family and sanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g0DgyieyTGYrlQvT3xCjItF8TbS.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:63761'),
  ('348658761203642544', 'The Carol Burnett Show', 1967, 'Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Carol Burnett, Vicki Lawrence, Tim Conway, Harvey Korman', 'TV-G', 'The Carol Burnett Show is an American variety/sketch comedy television show starring Carol Burnett, Harvey Korman, Vicki Lawrence, Lyle Waggoner, and Tim Conway. It originally ran on CBS from September 11, 1967, to March 29, 1978, for 278 episodes and originated from CBS Television City''s Studio 33. The series won 25 prime time Emmy Awards, was ranked No. 16 on TV Guide''s 50 Greatest TV Shows of All Time in 2002 and in 2007 was listed as one of Time magazine''s "100 Best TV Shows of All Time."', 'The Carol Burnett Show is an American variety/sketch comedy television show starring Carol Burnett, Harvey Korman, Vicki Lawrence, Lyle Waggoner, and Tim Conway. It originally ran on CBS from September 11, 1967, to March 29, 1978, for 278 episodes and originated from CBS Television City''s Studio 33. The series won 25 prime time Emmy Awards, was ranked No. 16 on TV Guide''s 50 Greatest TV Shows of All Time in 2002 and in 2007 was listed as one of Time magazine''s "100 Best TV Shows of All Time."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGd9pG4PGzpJbdbPEnFxKrJ24z8.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:1027'),
  ('124622923082566304', 'The Carrie Diaries', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Candace Bushnell', 'Amy Harris', 'AnnaSophia Robb, Austin Butler, Ellen Wong, Katie Findlay, Stefania LaVie Owen, Brendan Dooling, Freema Agyeman, Matt Letscher', 'TV-14', 'Before she was a fashion icon, before her column in the New York Star, before Mr. Big, Carrie Bradshaw was an innocent 16-year-old girl living in suburban Connecticut.', 'Before she was a fashion icon, before her column in the New York Star, before Mr. Big, Carrie Bradshaw was an innocent 16-year-old girl living in suburban Connecticut.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zsGa6WCmR7ASCWqszVGGz9Wzzrm.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:46157'),
  ('140770936404936575', 'The Cartel', 2008, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Andrés López López', null, 'Juan Pablo Raba, Diego Cadavid, Sandra Reyes, Sergio Borrero', 'TV-MA', 'The Cartel follows ten friends, all of them members of a dangerous drug cartel, whose ambition for power and money will cause them to eventually kill each other. For it is an undeniable truth that, in this business, you always lose.', 'The Cartel follows ten friends, all of them members of a dangerous drug cartel, whose ambition for power and money will cause them to eventually kill each other. For it is an undeniable truth that, in this business, you always lose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSvzG2B2uafu5BoP5nt0OvrVrQG.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:7458'),
  ('19192214108948222', 'The Casagrandes', 2019, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy, Family', 'Michael Rubiner', null, 'Lexi Sexton, Izabella Alvarez, Carlos PenaVega, Eugenio Derbez, Ken Jeong, Melissa Joan Hart, Leah Mei Gold', 'TV-Y7', 'The Casagrandes tells the story of Ronnie Anne, an independent, adventurous, 11-year-old who explores city life with her big, loving, multi-generational Mexican-American family.', 'The Casagrandes tells the story of Ronnie Anne, an independent, adventurous, 11-year-old who explores city life with her big, loving, multi-generational Mexican-American family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AarlHgaDolXnWQCFqiFLlpCKuwk.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:93260'),
  ('468717551701048913', 'The Case Against Adnan Syed', 2019, 'Documentary, Crime', null, 'Amy J. Berg', 'Rabia Chaudry, Adnan Syed, Hae Min Lee', 'TV-14', 'Explore the 1999 disappearance and murder of 18-year-old Baltimore County high school student Hae Min Lee, and the subsequent conviction of her ex-boyfriend, Adnan Syed, a case brought to global attention by the hugely popular Serial podcast.', 'Explore the 1999 disappearance and murder of 18-year-old Baltimore County high school student Hae Min Lee, and the subsequent conviction of her ex-boyfriend, Adnan Syed, a case brought to global attention by the hugely popular Serial podcast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ofrnp1aml6uRH9Jsx58aSHITug.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86598'),
  ('910165972186884555', 'The Case Files of Jeweler Richard', 2020, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Madoka Shiga, Takahiro Sakurai, Yuma Uchida, Yuichi Iguchi, Kana Hanazawa, Masaya Matsukaze, Chiwa Saito, Chiaki Kano', 'TV-14', 'One night, a college student with a strong sense of justice, Seigi Nakata, saved a gorgeous foreigner, Richard, who was being harassed by some drunks. When Seigi found out that Richard was a jeweler, he asked for an appraisal on a ring with a shady history; one which his grandmother had kept secret until she died. The appraisal had revealed her past, truth, and desire. It led Seigi to work as a part-time employee for Richard''s jewelry store, the "Jewelry Etranger" in Ginza. While solving various "mysteries", the relationship between Richard and Seigi gradually changes.', 'One night, a college student with a strong sense of justice, Seigi Nakata, saved a gorgeous foreigner, Richard, who was being harassed by some drunks. When Seigi found out that Richard was a jeweler, he asked for an appraisal on a ring with a shady history; one which his grandmother had kept secret until she died. The appraisal had revealed her past, truth, and desire. It led Seigi to work as a part-time employee for Richard''s jewelry store, the "Jewelry Etranger" in Ginza. While solving various "mysteries", the relationship between Richard and Seigi gradually changes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/72HeNg8xgoT2Zv460aMk3akxt3G.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94412'),
  ('719584012176670666', 'The Case of the Dangerous Robin', 1960, 'Crime, Drama', 'Leo Gordon, John Abernathy', null, 'Rick Jason, Jean Blake Fleming', null, 'The Case of the Dangerous Robin is an American crime drama series which aired in syndication from October 1960, to July 1961. The series stars Rick Jason. It was produced by Ziv Television Productions, the company responsible for such hit series as Sea Hunt and Highway Patrol.', 'The Case of the Dangerous Robin is an American crime drama series which aired in syndication from October 1960, to July 1961. The series stars Rick Jason. It was produced by Ziv Television Productions, the company responsible for such hit series as Sea Hunt and Highway Patrol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3Oysk3AHoH5ArgWIuWcla0Iu4s.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:28068'),
  ('1151924493773314125', 'The Case of: JonBenét Ramsey', 2016, 'Crime, Documentary, Mystery', 'Tom Forman', null, 'JonBenét Ramsey, Jim Clemente, Laura Richards, Henry Lee, Jim Fitzgerald, Stan Burke, James Kolar, Werner Spitz', null, 'Clemente is joined by Scotland Yard behavioral analyst Laura Richards. Together, and with the aid of several others involved in the original case, they will try and solve the mystery of Ramsey’s death “once and for all.”', 'Clemente is joined by Scotland Yard behavioral analyst Laura Richards. Together, and with the aid of several others involved in the original case, they will try and solve the mystery of Ramsey’s death “once and for all.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bKN9WzVYPep5SaYsGsf4XSnNgDH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67507'),
  ('821376430772105879', 'The Case Solver', 2020, 'Mystery', null, 'Liu Yu', 'Dong Xuan, Jason Koo', null, 'Forensic doctor Che Suwei, gentleman detective Gu Yuan, Deputy Inspector Kang Yichen, and lively reporter Cao Qingluo navigate a web of conflicting forces as they work together to solve a series of strange and mysterious cases.', 'Forensic doctor Che Suwei, gentleman detective Gu Yuan, Deputy Inspector Kang Yichen, and lively reporter Cao Qingluo navigate a web of conflicting forces as they work together to solve a series of strange and mysterious cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZDt2DhiBjhtoUTVCPyk83HB0sJ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:115080'),
  ('242106873020202968', 'The Case Study of Vanitas', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Natsuki Hanae, Kaito Ishikawa, Inori Minase, Shino Shimoji, Ai Kayano, Yoko Hikasa, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Kengo Kawanishi', 'TV-14', 'In 19th-century Paris, young vampire Noé finds the Book of Vanitas in human hands. Calling himself Vanitas, this doctor wields its power and tempts Noé with a plan to “cure” all vampires. Allying with him may be dangerous, but does he have a choice?', 'In 19th-century Paris, young vampire Noé finds the Book of Vanitas in human hands. Calling himself Vanitas, this doctor wields its power and tempts Noé with a plan to “cure” all vampires. Allying with him may be dangerous, but does he have a choice?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hk9joSlfsrVTmcoYzQ7rFg028Fq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121964'),
  ('317762356707771733', 'The Casketeers', 2018, 'Reality', 'Annabelle Lee-Harris', null, null, 'TV-14', 'Francis and Kaiora Tipene are the passionate proprietors of Tipene Funerals. This is a unique opportunity to look behind the scenes of their business and into this little-explored but vital service, where our culture''s last taboo is being addressed with dignity and aroha.', 'Francis and Kaiora Tipene are the passionate proprietors of Tipene Funerals. This is a unique opportunity to look behind the scenes of their business and into this little-explored but vital service, where our culture''s last taboo is being addressed with dignity and aroha.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qzjvnk41AUWHfnQykzsFRK4EWP1.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:84181'),
  ('540496071395310969', 'The Castaways', 2023, 'Drama', 'Ryan Tohill, Andy Tohill', null, 'Sheridan Smith, Céline Buckens, Brendan Cowell, Lasarus Ratuere, Dominic Tighe, Charlotte Vega, Celeste Dodwell, Joseph Mydell', null, 'Lori and Erin are on the holiday of a lifetime to Fiji. But after a huge fight, Erin never boards their final flight and the plane never arrives at its destination. Months later, no plane has been found, no survivors discovered. Until now.', 'Lori and Erin are on the holiday of a lifetime to Fiji. But after a huge fight, Erin never boards their final flight and the plane never arrives at its destination. Months later, no plane has been found, no survivors discovered. Until now.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x4zWhedIoVJ2WvSKKUuUE3JDG4k.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:225729'),
  ('215070672994399120', 'The Casual Vacancy', 2015, 'Drama', 'J.K. Rowling', null, 'Michael Gambon, Keeley Hawes, Rufus Jones, Rory Kinnear, Julia McKenzie, Joe Hurst, Sonny Ashbourne Serkis, Richard Glover', 'TV-14', 'The citizens of the small British town of Pagford fight for the spot on the parish council after Barry Fairbrother dies.', 'The citizens of the small British town of Pagford fight for the spot on the parish council after Barry Fairbrother dies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXr9enVT2ECxJeOnrG5MRFtcdKJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61940'),
  ('142025658353942934', 'The Cat in the Hat Knows a Lot About That!', 2010, 'Animation, Family, Kids', null, null, 'Martin Short, DeAndray Hamilton, Halle Nunes, Rob Tinkler, Tracey Hoyt, Heather Bambrick, Annick Obonsawin, Angela Lewis', 'TV-Y', 'The Cat in the Hat is back -- and this time, he''s teaching Sally and her brother, Nick, some awfully nifty things to think about!', 'The Cat in the Hat is back -- and this time, he''s teaching Sally and her brother, Nick, some awfully nifty things to think about!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/97qKiavvmvpYNBR8mhH5e5YVOTw.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:32896'),
  ('1019562042405061426', 'The Catch', 2016, 'Drama, Crime, Comedy', 'Jennifer Schuur, Kate Atkinson, Helen Gregory', null, 'Mireille Enos, Peter Krause, Jay Hayden, Rose Rollins, Sonya Walger, Elvy, John Simm', 'TV-14', 'Strong and successful Alice Martin is a fraud investigator who''s about to be the victim of fraud by her fiancé. Between her cases, she is determined to find him before it ruins her career.', 'Strong and successful Alice Martin is a fraud investigator who''s about to be the victim of fraud by her fiancé. Between her cases, she is determined to find him before it ruins her career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yqaRCjgG2dbBtCLrHISkHVCnGDE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:65579'),
  ('329020068682690847', 'The Catch', 2023, 'Drama', 'Michael Crompton', 'Michael Crompton', 'Jason Watkins, Aneurin Barnard, Cathy Belton, Poppy Gilbert, Brenda Fricker, Ian Pirie, Jade Jordan, Morgan Palmeria', null, 'The story follows fisherman Ed Collier, who is highly protective over his family, which includes wife Claire and daughter Abbie. However, when a rich young man by the name of Ryan Wilson starts to take an interest in his daughter, Ed feels her becoming increasingly distant and fears he may lose her for good.', 'The story follows fisherman Ed Collier, who is highly protective over his family, which includes wife Claire and daughter Abbie. However, when a rich young man by the name of Ryan Wilson starts to take an interest in his daughter, Ed feels her becoming increasingly distant and fears he may lose her for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WNXQtSWFu8ZwtDFIVK5jPJnESm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218976'),
  ('791675660301385462', 'The Cathedral', 2021, 'Soap, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Sergey Marin, Svetlana Ivanova, Aleksandr Baluev, Aleksey Bardukov, Aleksandr Ilyin Jr, Polina Chernyshova, Dmitriy Kulichkov, Maksim Averin', null, 'Different strokes for different folks - says the proverb. Born a rabble dies a rabble. But this is the year 1700, the time of dramatic changes in the Russian Empire, the time of reformations carried out by Peter the Great. Young serf Ivan Starshov is head over heels in love with Maria, the daughter of his master. He doesn''t want to accept that the young princess is no match for him. "You gave me wishes, but you do not allow me to satisfy them!" rages Ivan against God. He asks a priest for help, since God created all people equal. But the priest repeats the proverb. Accept your fate destiny as it is. In despair, Starshov repudiates from faith. Ivan is stubborn; he leaves the village to take possession of his fate. This is how the protagonist gets on the winding road to the true understanding of Love.', 'Different strokes for different folks - says the proverb. Born a rabble dies a rabble. But this is the year 1700, the time of dramatic changes in the Russian Empire, the time of reformations carried out by Peter the Great. Young serf Ivan Starshov is head over heels in love with Maria, the daughter of his master. He doesn''t want to accept that the young princess is no match for him. "You gave me wishes, but you do not allow me to satisfy them!" rages Ivan against God. He asks a priest for help, since God created all people equal. But the priest repeats the proverb. Accept your fate destiny as it is. In despair, Starshov repudiates from faith. Ivan is stubborn; he leaves the village to take possession of his fate. This is how the protagonist gets on the winding road to the true understanding of Love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSa6GqivbsWvCe4Xwm7Rd0P2oOU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138558'),
  ('919856027699363312', 'The Catherine Tate Show', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Derren Litten, Catherine Tate', null, 'Catherine Tate, Niky Wardley, Bruce Mackinnon, Mathew Horne, Angela McHale', 'TV-14', 'Comedy legend Catherine Tate plays all her best-loved characters in this riotous sketch show. Expect sulky teens, offensive nans and the most tactless women in the world.', 'Comedy legend Catherine Tate plays all her best-loved characters in this riotous sketch show. Expect sulky teens, offensive nans and the most tactless women in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tz0k6pu7zwIPx7x87nKrWbOaGAk.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2799'),
  ('98409498523622038', 'The Cave of the Golden Rose', 1991, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Gianni Romoli, Lamberto Bava', null, 'Alessandra Martines, Brigitte Nielsen, Kim Rossi Stuart, Luca Venantini, Remo Girone, Ludwig Briand, Ariadna Caldas, Joan Fort', 'NR', 'The king desires nothing more than a male heir. But his wife gives birth to a girl Fantaghirò. When she refuses to marry years later, she is sent in the forest where she learns how to ride and fight like a man. She appears disguised in a duel with Prince Romualdo, the son of her father''s adversary. Both fall in love, but their marriage brings no peace to the united kingdom. Evil forces are trying to seize power.', 'The king desires nothing more than a male heir. But his wife gives birth to a girl Fantaghirò. When she refuses to marry years later, she is sent in the forest where she learns how to ride and fight like a man. She appears disguised in a duel with Prince Romualdo, the son of her father''s adversary. Both fall in love, but their marriage brings no peace to the united kingdom. Evil forces are trying to seize power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hwZBwRBuKge2E5WsmC8DyMb3MNE.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:6094'),
  ('764128150213028326', 'The Celebrity Apprentice', 2004, 'Reality', 'Mark Burnett', null, 'Arnold Schwarzenegger', null, 'The ultimate sixteen-week job interview where eighteen Americans compete in a series of rigorous business tasks, many of which include prominent Fortune 500 companies and require street smarts and intelligence to conquer, in order to show the boss that they are the best candidate for his companies. In each episode, the losing team is sent to the boardroom where they are judged on their performance in the task. One person is fired and sent home.', 'The ultimate sixteen-week job interview where eighteen Americans compete in a series of rigorous business tasks, many of which include prominent Fortune 500 companies and require street smarts and intelligence to conquer, in order to show the boss that they are the best candidate for his companies. In each episode, the losing team is sent to the boardroom where they are judged on their performance in the task. One person is fired and sent home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gaV65Dd2iyeXjaBxFGOz3zWWDhx.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:3531'),
  ('904819136912812347', 'The Celebrity Traitors', 2025, 'Reality', null, 'Lee Gant', 'Claudia Winkleman', 'TV-MA', 'An all-star cast play the ultimate game of deceit and betrayal.', 'An all-star cast play the ultimate game of deceit and betrayal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rm1GHElZeE7CmVIVeVZMVJG3qp5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:291431'),
  ('136661874201431864', 'The Center Seat: 55 Years of Star Trek', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Brian Volk-Weiss', null, 'Gates McFadden', null, 'In honor of the sci-fi franchise’s 55th anniversary this year and produced by The Nacelle Company, the project will feature interviews with cast, crew and experts as it explores pivotal moments in the franchise’s history, from its inception at Lucille Ball’s production company Desilu to recent film and television adaptations.', 'In honor of the sci-fi franchise’s 55th anniversary this year and produced by The Nacelle Company, the project will feature interviews with cast, crew and experts as it explores pivotal moments in the franchise’s history, from its inception at Lucille Ball’s production company Desilu to recent film and television adaptations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sYlsE2W1g244E3O1RLJuSiFOMDL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137895'),
  ('1081629365070489727', 'The Centurions', 1986, 'Animation, Kids, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Vince Edwards, Pat Fraley, Neil Ross, Diane Pershing, Ron Feinberg, Ed Gilbert, William Woodson, Jennifer Darling', 'TV-Y7', 'In the near future, Doc Terror and his cyborg companion Hacker unleash their forces to conquer Earth! Only one force can stop this evil: a handful of brave men. In specially created Exo-Frames, they can be transported anywhere to fuse with incredible assault weapon systems beamed down from the space station Skyvault, becoming man and machine, Power Xtreme! Max Ray, brilliant Sea Operations commander! Jake Rockwell, rugged Land Operations specialist! Ace McCloud, daring Air Operations expert! Whatever the challenge, they are ready - The Centurions!', 'In the near future, Doc Terror and his cyborg companion Hacker unleash their forces to conquer Earth! Only one force can stop this evil: a handful of brave men. In specially created Exo-Frames, they can be transported anywhere to fuse with incredible assault weapon systems beamed down from the space station Skyvault, becoming man and machine, Power Xtreme! Max Ray, brilliant Sea Operations commander! Jake Rockwell, rugged Land Operations specialist! Ace McCloud, daring Air Operations expert! Whatever the challenge, they are ready - The Centurions!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQpTDb8VTMylGRK861BPxkLwVbs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2650'),
  ('109189317080841549', 'The Century of the Self', 2002, 'Documentary, War & Politics', 'Adam Curtis', 'Adam Curtis', 'Adam Curtis, Anne Bernays, Martin Bergmann, Robert Reich, Edward L. Bernays, Sigmund Freud, Anna Freud, Wilhelm Reich', null, 'The legacy of famed psychoanalyst Sigmund Freud informs the lives of people throughout the world even to this day, though it''s a phenomenon to which most are unaware. The film is an exhaustive examination of his theories on human desire, and how they''re applied to platforms such as advertising, consumerism and politics.', 'The legacy of famed psychoanalyst Sigmund Freud informs the lives of people throughout the world even to this day, though it''s a phenomenon to which most are unaware. The film is an exhaustive examination of his theories on human desire, and how they''re applied to platforms such as advertising, consumerism and politics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/baz9Mv5N8DryVZcr4wVxR02dytt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75770'),
  ('219094952482757385', 'The Cesaronis', 2006, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Claudio Amendola, Antonello Fassari, Rita Savagnone, Matteo Branciamore, Niccolò Centioni, Micol Olivieri, Federico Russo, Elda Alvigini', null, 'Giulio is a widower, struggling to raise three sons, Marco, Rudi, and Mimmo, as best he can. He lives in Rome''s working-class Garbatella neighborhood and runs a wine shop with his two brothers. Lucia, meanwhile, comes from Milan''s middle-class background; she''s divorced and trying to rebuild her life with her two daughters, Eva and Alice. The two meet by chance and recognize each other: they had a fling as teenagers, many years earlier. Yet first love is never forgotten, and so Giulio and Lucia find themselves together again. Their meeting, however, changes not only the lives of a man and a woman, but also those of two families as different as could be. Two families who find themselves living under the same roof without even having had the time to get to know each other well.', 'Giulio is a widower, struggling to raise three sons, Marco, Rudi, and Mimmo, as best he can. He lives in Rome''s working-class Garbatella neighborhood and runs a wine shop with his two brothers. Lucia, meanwhile, comes from Milan''s middle-class background; she''s divorced and trying to rebuild her life with her two daughters, Eva and Alice. The two meet by chance and recognize each other: they had a fling as teenagers, many years earlier. Yet first love is never forgotten, and so Giulio and Lucia find themselves together again. Their meeting, however, changes not only the lives of a man and a woman, but also those of two families as different as could be. Two families who find themselves living under the same roof without even having had the time to get to know each other well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6EaTBCOZlSaAEOTiaINzsYW9VR.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:41280'),
  ('971611776374852385', 'The Chair', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Amanda Peet, Annie Julia Wyman', null, 'Nana Mensah, Holland Taylor, Sandra Oh, Jay Duplass, Bob Balaban, Everly Carganilla, David Morse', 'TV-MA', 'At a major university, the first woman of color to become chair tries to meet the dizzying demands and high expectations of a failing English department.', 'At a major university, the first woman of color to become chair tries to meet the dizzying demands and high expectations of a failing English department.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kz14K7vI2KNGyfTyBnYjBpA0pzQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99657'),
  ('755076740091593113', 'The Chair Company', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'Tim Robinson, Zach Kanin', null, 'Tim Robinson, Lake Bell, Sophia Lillis, Will Price, Joseph Tudisco', 'TV-MA', 'After an embarrassing incident at work, suburban family man William Ronald Trosper finds himself investigating a far-reaching conspiracy.', 'After an embarrassing incident at work, suburban family man William Ronald Trosper finds himself investigating a far-reaching conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2VktdoGvR0Pv6qj9P7vDsTIfw1l.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:271267'),
  ('776920801871523966', 'The Chairman''s Ear', 2017, 'Comedy, War & Politics', null, null, 'Mikołaj Cieślak, Izabela Dąbrowska', null, 'The series follows the chairman of the ruling political party in Poland (Mr Chairman). The narrative takes place primarily in his office where, joined by his assistant Mariusz, he hosts numerous visitors, including government officials and other public office holders.', 'The series follows the chairman of the ruling political party in Poland (Mr Chairman). The narrative takes place primarily in his office where, joined by his assistant Mariusz, he hosts numerous visitors, including government officials and other public office holders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/esoKmZwwzdWzXjVtMwVCWccPG6Z.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:70465'),
  ('246896737865151322', 'The Chalet', 2018, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Alexis Lecaye, Camille Bordes-Resnais', 'Alexis Lecaye, Camille Bordes-Resnais', 'Mia Delmae, Emilie de Preissac, Nicolas Gob, Mathieu Simonet, Agnès Delachair, Blanche Veisberg, Chloé Lambert, Éric Savin', null, 'Friends gathered at a remote chalet in the French Alps for a summer getaway are caught in a deadly trap as a dark secret from the past comes to light.', 'Friends gathered at a remote chalet in the French Alps for a summer getaway are caught in a deadly trap as a dark secret from the past comes to light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDDv1vi0t0gqaZUkQY2czs2JA8d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78309'),
  ('106797807534143717', 'The Challenge', 1998, 'Reality', 'Mary-Ellis Bunim, Jonathan Murray', null, 'T.J. Lavin', 'TV-14', 'Each Challenge pits numerous cast members from past seasons of reality shows against each other, dividing them into two separate teams according to different criteria, such as gender, which show they first appeared on, whether or not they''re veterans or rookies on the show, etc. The two teams compete in numerous missions in order to win prizes and advance in the overall game.', 'Each Challenge pits numerous cast members from past seasons of reality shows against each other, dividing them into two separate teams according to different criteria, such as gender, which show they first appeared on, whether or not they''re veterans or rookies on the show, etc. The two teams compete in numerous missions in order to win prizes and advance in the overall game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLwN4WTtkIQL1Waa86MDY41a1Xh.jpg', 41, 'tmdb:tv:62'),
  ('968263582471718810', 'The Challenge: All Stars', 2021, 'Reality', 'Mark Long, Johnathan Murray, Mary-Ellis Bunim', null, 'T.J. Lavin', 'TV-MA', 'Twenty-two of the most iconic, boldest, and fiercest Challenge All Stars from the original The Real World and Road Rules return for a second chance at the ultimate competition as they vie for their shot at the $500,000 grand prize. Follow the competitors as they face unprecedented, over-the-top challenges set in the Andes Mountains of Argentina.', 'Twenty-two of the most iconic, boldest, and fiercest Challenge All Stars from the original The Real World and Road Rules return for a second chance at the ultimate competition as they vie for their shot at the $500,000 grand prize. Follow the competitors as they face unprecedented, over-the-top challenges set in the Andes Mountains of Argentina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nP2fwqxrnztKnLkEoFbtPzdrykt.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:121066'),
  ('1135177696611594507', 'The Challenge: ETA', 2020, 'Documentary, War & Politics', null, 'David Zurdo', null, null, 'The story of how the Guardia Civil, a militarized police force, fought for nearly half a century against ETA, a ruthless terrorist gang dedicated to murder, kidnapping, extortion and arms and drug smuggling while cynically demanding independence for the Basque Country in northern Spain.', 'The story of how the Guardia Civil, a militarized police force, fought for nearly half a century against ETA, a ruthless terrorist gang dedicated to murder, kidnapping, extortion and arms and drug smuggling while cynically demanding independence for the Basque Country in northern Spain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yJXmGzLqq0LASbEVFdYO0d4ftv0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110825'),
  ('496214122147406525', 'The Challenge: USA', 2022, 'Reality, Drama', 'Johnathan Murray, Mary-Ellis Bunim', null, 'T.J. Lavin', 'TV-PG', 'Reality titans from the CBS universe compete in the most unpredictable and demanding game of their lives. With an ever-changing game, players are in a constant state of paranoia, unable to trust anyone but themselves. The CBS all-stars compete for a chance to join the upcoming global “War of the Worlds” championship.', 'Reality titans from the CBS universe compete in the most unpredictable and demanding game of their lives. With an ever-changing game, players are in a constant state of paranoia, unable to trust anyone but themselves. The CBS all-stars compete for a chance to join the upcoming global “War of the Worlds” championship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lbN0l6Qm8I05TTvuVKMKWYjIBzW.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:203423'),
  ('243363942111237399', 'The Challenge: World Championship', 2023, 'Reality', null, null, 'T.J. Lavin, Amber Borzotra, Darrell Taylor, Jodi Weatherton, Johnny ''Bananas'' Devenanzio, Jonna Stephens, Jordan Wiseley, Kaycee Clark', 'TV-MA', 'Champions and MVPs from the various versions of MTV''s "The Challenge" are brought together to represent their countries and battle for the coveted title of “Challenge World Champion.”', 'Champions and MVPs from the various versions of MTV''s "The Challenge" are brought together to represent their countries and battle for the coveted title of “Challenge World Champion.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zinFp4mOzxN1NTj8f2W1BWsQxhR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:219077'),
  ('402260198859584297', 'The Champions', 1968, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Monty Berman, Dennis Spooner', null, 'Alexandra Bastedo, William Gaunt, Stuart Damon, Anthony Nicholls', null, 'After a plane carrying three Agents crashes in the Himalayas, they are rescued by an advanced civilisation secretly living in Tibet who grant them enhanced versions of the ordinary five senses, and intellectual and physical abilities.', 'After a plane carrying three Agents crashes in the Himalayas, they are rescued by an advanced civilisation secretly living in Tibet who grant them enhanced versions of the ordinary five senses, and intellectual and physical abilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93fLFB8HfKAhVKF968Dl03ITwOX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4579'),
  ('62815597135506177', 'The Change', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bridget Christie', null, 'Bridget Christie', null, 'Linda finds a new lease on life when she learns that she''s experiencing menopause. So she heads to the forest on a journey of self-discovery.', 'Linda finds a new lease on life when she learns that she''s experiencing menopause. So she heads to the forest on a journey of self-discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rd6kXozxwfBN6pJ2L5AD00Ag4c.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:228241'),
  ('428390907292446865', 'The Change Of Time', 1992, null, null, null, 'Frankie Lam, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Maggie Shiu, Gigi Lai Chi, Felton Law Gwan-Joh, Bessie Chan Ming-Kwan', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vIGy2pTBFBvaPCvwo0Rd1y0tIp7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110085'),
  ('747149157148674199', 'The Changeling', 2023, 'Mystery, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kelly Marcel', null, 'LaKeith Stanfield, Clark Backo, Adina Porter, Jared Abrahamson, Samuel T. Herring, Alexis Louder, Victor LaValle', 'TV-MA', 'Apollo and Emma''s love story is a fairy tale—until Emma mysteriously vanishes. Bereft, Apollo finds himself on a death-defying odyssey through a New York City he didn''t know existed.', 'Apollo and Emma''s love story is a fairy tale—until Emma mysteriously vanishes. Bereft, Apollo finds himself on a death-defying odyssey through a New York City he didn''t know existed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLUeNjCHs8q4crMTyywflohSD8w.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:131992'),
  ('495153618076824224', 'The Charlie Brown and Snoopy Show', 1983, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Bill Melendez, Jeremy Schoenberg, Fergie, Gini Holtzman, Keri Houlihan, Brett Johnson, Heather Stoneman', 'TV-G', 'Your favorite Peanuts stories come to life in this animated television series. With short sketches featuring these classic and much-loved characters, it''s easy to, as the opening song suggests, “have a party with Charlie Brown and Snoopy.”', 'Your favorite Peanuts stories come to life in this animated television series. With short sketches featuring these classic and much-loved characters, it''s easy to, as the opening song suggests, “have a party with Charlie Brown and Snoopy.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tpCaJq94eHBWsWVtwFWojbUjcM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:6670'),
  ('884880138668366414', 'The Charm Beneath', 2005, 'Drama', 'Mui Siu-Ching', null, 'Gigi Lai Chi, Yoyo Mung Ka-Wai, Moses Chan Ho, Anne Heung Hoi-Lam, Mandy Lee Cho, Sharon Chan Man-Chi, Kiki Sheung, Joseph Lee Kwok-Lun', null, 'CHUK MING WAI (LAI CHI, GIGI) is the third child of the family. She has two elder brothers, YAU SHING (TSANG WAI KUEN) and YAU YIP (CHAN HO, MOSES), and a younger sister, MING MAN (CHO, MANDY LEE). In the 1930s, the CHUK family is rich and renowned. It runs a cosmetic shop called the “Charming Flowers”. WAI’s father CHUK MOON SHAN (CHAN HUNG LIT) plans to pass the family business to SHING. However, SHING dies young. His inheritance passes to YIP, who has no interest in running the business. After YIP takes over the “Charming Flowers”, he is forced to deal with politics and hypocrites...', 'CHUK MING WAI (LAI CHI, GIGI) is the third child of the family. She has two elder brothers, YAU SHING (TSANG WAI KUEN) and YAU YIP (CHAN HO, MOSES), and a younger sister, MING MAN (CHO, MANDY LEE). In the 1930s, the CHUK family is rich and renowned. It runs a cosmetic shop called the “Charming Flowers”. WAI’s father CHUK MOON SHAN (CHAN HUNG LIT) plans to pass the family business to SHING. However, SHING dies young. His inheritance passes to YIP, who has no interest in running the business. After YIP takes over the “Charming Flowers”, he is forced to deal with politics and hypocrites...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQKzIBB3HCdXOVfDkzs0YJIXggV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110029'),
  ('1136026147438319603', 'The Chase', 2009, 'Reality', 'Danny Carvalho, Peter Faherty, Chris Gepp', null, 'Bradley Walsh, Mark Labbett, Shaun Wallace', null, 'The Chase isn’t just a quiz… it’s a race, where the players must ensure they stay one step ahead of ‘The Chaser’, a ruthless quiz genius determined to stop them winning at all costs.', 'The Chase isn’t just a quiz… it’s a race, where the players must ensure they stay one step ahead of ‘The Chaser’, a ruthless quiz genius determined to stop them winning at all costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rPg5T51DAHn7tANKgOVtMG5JQdN.jpg', 18, 'tmdb:tv:21502'),
  ('873604357498256185', 'The Cheat', 2017, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Crime', 'Taha Ulukaya', 'Taha Ulukaya', 'Cem Asan, Taner Şahin, Andaç Ulukaya, Taha Ulukaya', null, 'Felix is a software developer who works for the department of software at an important anti-virus company. Beside that he is completing the missing parts of software on the games which are produced by game companies, eventually he gets an offer from the world famous game company called R.W games. This offer is about fixing the software errors as usual. What surprises Felix the fact that the game has no error on it. In a short time he realizes that the game can have echos in real life, and nothing will be the same anymore.', 'Felix is a software developer who works for the department of software at an important anti-virus company. Beside that he is completing the missing parts of software on the games which are produced by game companies, eventually he gets an offer from the world famous game company called R.W games. This offer is about fixing the software errors as usual. What surprises Felix the fact that the game has no error on it. In a short time he realizes that the game can have echos in real life, and nothing will be the same anymore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vRwxEd69KBmubnOJjxSYmefe6l.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:89172'),
  ('1126783472605025087', 'The Chef Show', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Jon Favreau, Roy Choi', 'TV-MA', 'Writer, director and food enthusiast Jon Favreau and chef Roy Choi explore food in and out of the kitchen with accomplished chefs and celebrity friends.', 'Writer, director and food enthusiast Jon Favreau and chef Roy Choi explore food in and out of the kitchen with accomplished chefs and celebrity friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TbekMkPD60JMKIhb8L6vigoV8a.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:89557'),
  ('185673258078434452', 'The Chelsea Detective', 2022, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Peter Fincham', null, 'Adrian Scarborough, Vanessa Emme, Anamaria Marinca, Peter Bankolé, Lucy Phelps, Sophie Stone', null, 'Detective Inspector Max Arnold lives on a battered houseboat at the end of Cheyne Walk after separating from his art dealer wife Astrid. The son of a local bookshop owner, Max is a far cry from the affluent elite whose crimes he''ll help solve along with D.C. Priya Shamsie.', 'Detective Inspector Max Arnold lives on a battered houseboat at the end of Cheyne Walk after separating from his art dealer wife Astrid. The son of a local bookshop owner, Max is a far cry from the affluent elite whose crimes he''ll help solve along with D.C. Priya Shamsie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5wkzja9xjIPMc46cAGuei172lnu.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:156240'),
  ('406823170754824702', 'The Chemistry of Death', 2023, 'Crime', null, null, 'Harry Treadaway, Samuel Anderson, Jefferson Hall, Jeanne Goursaud, Lucian Msamati', null, 'When bodies begin turning up in the tranquil English countryside that he has recently made home, a forensic anthropologist helps local police in a race against time.', 'When bodies begin turning up in the tranquil English countryside that he has recently made home, a forensic anthropologist helps local police in a race against time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPHFvc2ma51e9AEHjRDAbRSsWIA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217180'),
  ('379684146553812403', 'The Chestnut Man', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Søren Sveistrup, David Sandreuter, Mikkel Serup', null, 'Danica Ćurčić, Mikkel Boe Følsgaard, Sofie Gråbøl, Katinka Lærke Petersen', 'TV-MA', 'At a grisly murder scene sits a figurine made of chestnuts. From this creepy clue, two detectives hunt a killer linked to a politician''s missing child.', 'At a grisly murder scene sits a figurine made of chestnuts. From this creepy clue, two detectives hunt a killer linked to a politician''s missing child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tdLJTZJ184PsO9QkK9aPeeAXLlo.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:127865'),
  ('9241754700984872', 'The Chevy Mystery Show', 1960, 'Mystery', null, null, 'Walter Slezak', null, 'The Chevy Mystery Show is an American television anthology series featuring a different mystery each week that aired on NBC in 1960 as a summer replacement.', 'The Chevy Mystery Show is an American television anthology series featuring a different mystery each week that aired on NBC in 1960 as a summer replacement.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:26892'),
  ('425481125659838783', 'The Chew', 2011, 'Talk', null, null, 'Carla Hall, Clinton Kelly, Michael Symon', 'TV-PG', 'The Chew is an American talk show/cooking show that airs in the United States on ABC as part of the network''s weekday daytime lineup. The name and format was inspired by the talk show The View, though centering on food-related and lifestyle topics. Each episode has its own title based upon the episode''s theme. The program also airs in Canada on the stations of the Citytv television system. The show is recorded at ABC Studio 40 West 66th Street, New York City. Evette Rios, Marc Summers, former Food Network personality Danny Boome and Jason Roberts serve as correspondents for taped segments. Guest co-hosts have included Emeril Lagasse, Ming Tsai, Scott Conant, Sunny Anderson and Evette Rios. A scenic designer with the show, Ivan Giovanettina, a native of Switzerland, was shot dead in Bedford–Stuyvesant, Brooklyn on January 10, 2013.', 'The Chew is an American talk show/cooking show that airs in the United States on ABC as part of the network''s weekday daytime lineup. The name and format was inspired by the talk show The View, though centering on food-related and lifestyle topics. Each episode has its own title based upon the episode''s theme. The program also airs in Canada on the stations of the Citytv television system. The show is recorded at ABC Studio 40 West 66th Street, New York City. Evette Rios, Marc Summers, former Food Network personality Danny Boome and Jason Roberts serve as correspondents for taped segments. Guest co-hosts have included Emeril Lagasse, Ming Tsai, Scott Conant, Sunny Anderson and Evette Rios. A scenic designer with the show, Ivan Giovanettina, a native of Switzerland, was shot dead in Bedford–Stuyvesant, Brooklyn on January 10, 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/soaMbHCYzcCwG1HkF5xgwWAEkIj.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:39084'),
  ('27206820139494976', 'The Chi', 2018, 'Drama', 'Lena Waithe', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'A relevant, timely and distinctive coming-of-age story following a half dozen interrelated characters in the South Side of Chicago. The story centers on Brandon, an ambitious and confident young man who dreams about opening a restaurant of his own someday, but is conflicted between the promise of a new life and his responsibility to his mother and teenage brother back in the South Side.', 'A relevant, timely and distinctive coming-of-age story following a half dozen interrelated characters in the South Side of Chicago. The story centers on Brandon, an ambitious and confident young man who dreams about opening a restaurant of his own someday, but is conflicted between the promise of a new life and his responsibility to his mother and teenage brother back in the South Side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/niD8X5pEXpmRUDhSPdDOgI3Gw5Q.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:72071'),
  ('338471224767513852', 'The Chicago Code', 2011, 'Crime, Drama', 'Shawn Ryan', 'Christal Henry', 'Jennifer Beals, Todd Williams, Jason Clarke, Billy Lush, Matt Lauria, Delroy Lindo, Devin Kelley', 'TV-14', 'The series follows officers of the Chicago Police Department as they fight crime on the streets and try to expose political corruption within the city.', 'The series follows officers of the Chicago Police Department as they fight crime on the streets and try to expose political corruption within the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5yMn8xjqi3WKdDVAFKlt5YroX1m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32755'),
  ('436314032398006948', 'The Chief', 1990, 'Drama', 'Jeffrey Caine', null, 'Martin Shaw, Julian Glover, Brian Bovell, Gillian Bevan, Bosco Hogan', null, 'The Chief is a British crime drama transmitted on ITV from 20 April 1990 to 16 June 1995. Produced by Anglia Television, it centred on the politics at the top of a typical English police force in its continual battle to solve the problems the times, in this case the fictional Eastland of East Anglia.', 'The Chief is a British crime drama transmitted on ITV from 20 April 1990 to 16 June 1995. Produced by Anglia Television, it centred on the politics at the top of a typical English police force in its continual battle to solve the problems the times, in this case the fictional Eastland of East Anglia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9n7g8sI7D92lVZ74Gc1EtpD18iW.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:34447'),
  ('1059688348971081827', 'The Children of Greece', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Giannis Bezos, Dimitris Venizelos', null, 'Yiannis Savvidakis, Giannis Bezos, Kostas Evripiotis, Giannis Kapetanios, Nikos Alexiou, Dimitris Frangioglou, Renia Louizidou, Tasos Kostis', null, 'Three airthcraftmen have their military service in an aviation office camp. The commander of this camp is Kakalos with the military rank of Group Captain. He is a strict commander but he is also ambitious, flirtatious and sometimes blunderer. Other basic members of the cast are Hlapatsas, a nark aircraftman, Karavaneas a naive sergeant and Boubou the secretary of the commander. The series is based on the funny situations between the staff of this aviation camp.', 'Three airthcraftmen have their military service in an aviation office camp. The commander of this camp is Kakalos with the military rank of Group Captain. He is a strict commander but he is also ambitious, flirtatious and sometimes blunderer. Other basic members of the cast are Hlapatsas, a nark aircraftman, Karavaneas a naive sergeant and Boubou the secretary of the commander. The series is based on the funny situations between the staff of this aviation camp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggQsX4GNflOn67EjuERxlgeZQUI.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:64773'),
