  ('823127075672629763', 'The Client', 1995, 'Drama', 'Judith Paige Mitchell', null, 'JoBeth Williams, John Heard, Ossie Davis, Polly Holliday, David Barry Gray, David Michael Mullins, Burke Moses', 'NR', 'The Client is an American television series that aired on CBS from September 18, 1995 to August 16, 1996. The series was based on the 1994 film The Client, itself adapted from the 1993 John Grisham novel also of the same name.', 'The Client is an American television series that aired on CBS from September 18, 1995 to August 16, 1996. The series was based on the 1994 film The Client, itself adapted from the 1993 John Grisham novel also of the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sgIco38cVl7XnQ8VjgYVmiWxFsk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:29600'),
  ('1146436536395926796', 'The Client List', 2012, 'Drama', 'Suzanne Martin, Jordan Budde', 'Suzanne Martin', 'Jennifer Love Hewitt, Loretta Devine, Colin Egglesfield, Rebecca Field, Alicia Lagano, Brian Hallisay, Laura-Leigh, Cybill Shepherd', 'TV-14', 'Riley Parks delicately balances two starkly different lives -- one as a single mom in a conservative town struggling to provide for her family and the other as a savvy and ambitious businesswoman working with a rowdy, sexy and unpredictable group of women.', 'Riley Parks delicately balances two starkly different lives -- one as a single mom in a conservative town struggling to provide for her family and the other as a savvy and ambitious businesswoman working with a rowdy, sexy and unpredictable group of women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14T9c7aBwYlsqAc3ShzHBJwD44T.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:40244'),
  ('999090197233792315', 'The Cliff', 2009, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Björn Hlynur Haraldsson, Dóra Jóhannsdóttir, Tinna Hrafnsdóttir, Sveinn Ólafur Gunnarsson, Halldóra Geirharðsdóttir, Hilmar Jónsson', null, 'The Cliff is a dramatic mystery about a Crime Detective who is sent to a small community in Iceland to help a local policewoman investigate a suspicious accident. Together they unravel a mystery that involves bizarre incidents and unexplained deaths.', 'The Cliff is a dramatic mystery about a Crime Detective who is sent to a small community in Iceland to help a local policewoman investigate a suspicious accident. Together they unravel a mystery that involves bizarre incidents and unexplained deaths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1iVugsFwjP1HcBBs8uwxzntXhPz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68954'),
  ('733664396178572151', 'The Clinton Affair', 2018, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Monica Lewinsky, Bill Clinton, Hillary Clinton, Ken Starr, Paula Jones, Michael Isikoff, James Carville, Barney Frank', null, 'Exploring broader topics including media, feminism, politics and power, the documentary unfolds and traces the twisted, intertwined series of events that led to the impeachment trial that set the nation on the path towards a more staunchly partisan political system. The series features arresting archival footage as well as comprehensive interviews with the people closest to the events including a timely, in-depth reflection on the topic with Monica Lewinsky.', 'Exploring broader topics including media, feminism, politics and power, the documentary unfolds and traces the twisted, intertwined series of events that led to the impeachment trial that set the nation on the path towards a more staunchly partisan political system. The series features arresting archival footage as well as comprehensive interviews with the people closest to the events including a timely, in-depth reflection on the topic with Monica Lewinsky.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mRRebP51v9iyj0lacugYSPI0qS4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84197'),
  ('358456858593193651', 'The Clone', 2001, 'Soap, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Glória Perez', 'Glória Perez', 'Murilo Benício, Giovanna Antonelli, Juca de Oliveira, Reginaldo Faria, Vera Fischer, Daniela Escobar, Dalton Vigh, Débora Falabella', 'NR', 'Human cloning. The Islamic world. Two young people, two different cultures, two different beliefs. An impossible love story that not even time could erase. During a trip to Morocco, Lucas has a forbidden romance with Jade. He returns to Brazil after the death of his twin brother Diogo. A close family friend, scientist Albieri uses this situation to produce the first human clone using cells taken from Lucas. Twenty years later, Jade, Lucas and his clone form an odd love triangle.', 'Human cloning. The Islamic world. Two young people, two different cultures, two different beliefs. An impossible love story that not even time could erase. During a trip to Morocco, Lucas has a forbidden romance with Jade. He returns to Brazil after the death of his twin brother Diogo. A close family friend, scientist Albieri uses this situation to produce the first human clone using cells taken from Lucas. Twenty years later, Jade, Lucas and his clone form an odd love triangle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/55r16i772LJkfeGGtlWugScVA10.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14853'),
  ('628846184556019065', 'The Closer', 2005, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'James Duff, Michael M. Robin', null, 'Kyra Sedgwick, J.K. Simmons, Corey Reynolds, Robert Gossett, G.W. Bailey, Tony Denison, Michael Paul Chan, Phillip P. Keene', 'TV-14', 'Deputy Police Chief Brenda Leigh Johnson transfers from Atlanta to LA to head up a special unit of the LAPD that handles sensitive, high-profile murder cases. Johnson''s quirky personality and hard-nosed approach often rubs her colleagues the wrong way, but her reputation as one of the world''s best interrogator eventually wins over even her toughest critics.', 'Deputy Police Chief Brenda Leigh Johnson transfers from Atlanta to LA to head up a special unit of the LAPD that handles sensitive, high-profile murder cases. Johnson''s quirky personality and hard-nosed approach often rubs her colleagues the wrong way, but her reputation as one of the world''s best interrogator eventually wins over even her toughest critics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q6FhABXGf3TaYKoKNwzGAEzW7bt.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:1450'),
  ('3007000224992380', 'The Club', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Camila Ibarra', 'Camila Ibarra', 'Alejandro Speitzer, Minnie West, Axel Arenas, Arcelia Ramírez, Ana Gonzalez Bello, Alejandro Puente, Sofía De Llaca Mata, Nacho Tahhan', 'TV-MA', 'Dealing with the pressure of his father and his need to be someone, Pablo decides to start a new shady, tricky business that will lead him to some happy but tragic experiences.', 'Dealing with the pressure of his father and his need to be someone, Pablo decides to start a new shady, tricky business that will lead him to some happy but tragic experiences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w2TPDBH3BjlaLwH3qEl48VfWZZb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95467'),
  ('572702764743980429', 'The Club', 2021, 'Drama', 'Zeynep Günay Tan', null, 'Gökçe Bahadır, Barış Arduç, Asude Kalebek, Salih Bademci, Fırat Tanış, Merve Şeyma Zengin, Sezer Arıçay, Serra Arıtürk', 'TV-MA', 'In cosmopolitan 1950s Istanbul, a mother with a troubled past works at a nightclub to reconnect with and help the rebellious daughter she couldn''t raise.', 'In cosmopolitan 1950s Istanbul, a mother with a troubled past works at a nightclub to reconnect with and help the rebellious daughter she couldn''t raise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jrqzdQtx89pBQXocFzsBknhfhdT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:136125'),
  ('963442587933472135', 'The Clubhouse: A Year with the Red Sox', 2025, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'This immersive documentary series goes inside the dugout and gets up close and personal with the 2024 Boston Red Sox during their roller-coaster season.', 'This immersive documentary series goes inside the dugout and gets up close and personal with the 2024 Boston Red Sox during their roller-coaster season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uKPsQEAUy1aXsTK8ABxZlfPIKMQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:282628'),
  ('80429978031609521', 'The Coach', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Sergey Sentsov', 'Aleksey Lyapichev', 'Dmitriy Nagiev, Vladimir Sychev, Daniil Vakhrushev, Sonya Rayzman, Viktor Sukhorukov, Igor Lifanov, Alexandr Yakin, Georgiy Kudrenko', null, 'Retired mobster tries to get back in business by making friends with the kid of his ex-boss. To do so, he must became PE teacher in kid''s school.', 'Retired mobster tries to get back in business by making friends with the kid of his ex-boss. To do so, he must became PE teacher in kid''s school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Q8kgITlWOvJmGA3NgPqpcmhKfB.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:61256'),
  ('429228795892184584', 'The Cockfields', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Joe Wilkinson', 'David Earl, Joe Wilkinson', 'Joe Wilkinson, Sue Johnston, Ben Rufus Green, Susannah Fielding, Gregor Fisher, Michele Dotrice', null, 'Simon is taking girlfriend Donna back home to the Isle of Wight for the very first time. Can he survive a long birthday weekend with his biological and extended family without losing his cool, or his girlfriend?', 'Simon is taking girlfriend Donna back home to the Isle of Wight for the very first time. Can he survive a long birthday weekend with his biological and extended family without losing his cool, or his girlfriend?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5WLASrYvaZVRAzpsCmsU7lxPemY.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:95389'),
  ('1082919985279059943', 'The Code', 2011, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Marcus du Sautoy', 'TV-G', 'Solve The Code and find a real-life treasure! The Code is a three-part TV series about maths in the world around us, presented by Marcus du Sautoy. Why do bees make hexagonal honeycomb? Who is in charge of the flight of a flock of swallows? How can dozens of wrong answers make a correct one? Join Marcus on an exciting journey to discover The Code!', 'Solve The Code and find a real-life treasure! The Code is a three-part TV series about maths in the world around us, presented by Marcus du Sautoy. Why do bees make hexagonal honeycomb? Who is in charge of the flight of a flock of swallows? How can dozens of wrong answers make a correct one? Join Marcus on an exciting journey to discover The Code!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wObmv4ezpADkiU3nu0IPb5tVWak.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40093'),
  ('605307579239061372', 'The Code', 2014, 'Crime, Drama', 'Shelley Birse', 'Shelley Birse', 'Dan Spielman, Ashley Zukerman, Adele Perovic, Sigrid Thornton, Robyn Malcolm, Ella Scott Lynch, Ben Oxenbould, Andrew McFarlane', 'NR', 'The Code is a drama series which tells tells the story of two brothers who discover some information that those at the highest levels of political power are determined to keep secret.', 'The Code is a drama series which tells tells the story of two brothers who discover some information that those at the highest levels of political power are determined to keep secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d960SZCKOXrHQLFRlaGhlPUFEOR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61496'),
  ('928609318316590932', 'The Code', 2019, 'Drama', 'Craig Sweeny, Craig Turk', null, 'Luke Mitchell, Anna Wood, Ato Essandoh, Dana Delany, Phillipa Soo, Raffi Barsoumian', 'TV-14', 'The military''s brightest minds tackle the country''s toughest legal challenges at the Marine Corps Base Quantico, where every attorney is trained as a prosecutor, a defense lawyer, an investigator, and a Marine. Working side-by-side, they serve their country with integrity while often putting aside ideals for the sake of the truth.', 'The military''s brightest minds tackle the country''s toughest legal challenges at the Marine Corps Base Quantico, where every attorney is trained as a prosecutor, a defense lawyer, an investigator, and a Marine. Working side-by-side, they serve their country with integrity while often putting aside ideals for the sake of the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ruZu6Y4Iq5EkgaCeR80bpr64kUT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86136'),
  ('176785784404203277', 'The Colbert Report', 2005, 'News, Comedy', 'Stephen Colbert, Jon Stewart, Ben Karlin', null, 'Stephen Colbert', 'TV-14', 'The Colbert Report is an American satirical late night television program. It stars political humorist Stephen Colbert, a former correspondent for The Daily Show with Jon Stewart. The Colbert Report is a spin-off from and counterpart to The Daily Show that comments on politics and the media in a similar way. The show focuses on a fictional anchorman character named Stephen Colbert, played by his real-life namesake. The character, described by Colbert as a "well-intentioned, poorly informed, high-status idiot", is a caricature of televised political pundits.', 'The Colbert Report is an American satirical late night television program. It stars political humorist Stephen Colbert, a former correspondent for The Daily Show with Jon Stewart. The Colbert Report is a spin-off from and counterpart to The Daily Show that comments on politics and the media in a similar way. The show focuses on a fictional anchorman character named Stephen Colbert, played by his real-life namesake. The character, described by Colbert as a "well-intentioned, poorly informed, high-status idiot", is a caricature of televised political pundits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pn2CVXjOlR8kY5MgOTJjZ71IM0Q.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:4385'),
  ('465150330065237891', 'The Colbys', 1985, 'Drama, Soap', 'Richard Shapiro, Esther Shapiro, Robert Mason Pollock', null, 'Charlton Heston, John James, Stephanie Beacham, Katharine Ross, Emma Samms, Maxwell Caulfield, Tracy Scoggins, Claire Yarlett', null, 'The Colbys is an American prime time soap opera, which originally aired on ABC from November 20, 1985 to March 26, 1987. Produced by Aaron Spelling, it was a spin-off of Dynasty, which had been the highest rated series for the 1984–1985 U.S. television season. The Colbys revolved around another wealthy, upper-class family, who were distant relatives of the Carringtons of Dynasty and who owned a large multi-national corporation. Intended to surpass its predecessor in opulence, the series'' producers were handed an immensely high budget for the era and cast a handful of well-known movie stars among its leads, including Charlton Heston, Barbara Stanwyck, Katharine Ross and Ricardo Montalban. However, The Colbys was ultimately a ratings disappointment, and was canceled after two seasons.', 'The Colbys is an American prime time soap opera, which originally aired on ABC from November 20, 1985 to March 26, 1987. Produced by Aaron Spelling, it was a spin-off of Dynasty, which had been the highest rated series for the 1984–1985 U.S. television season. The Colbys revolved around another wealthy, upper-class family, who were distant relatives of the Carringtons of Dynasty and who owned a large multi-national corporation. Intended to surpass its predecessor in opulence, the series'' producers were handed an immensely high budget for the era and cast a handful of well-known movie stars among its leads, including Charlton Heston, Barbara Stanwyck, Katharine Ross and Ricardo Montalban. However, The Colbys was ultimately a ratings disappointment, and was canceled after two seasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/32fITXr8lVbV6EMlYnj6pavTotq.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:4424'),
  ('374452155579311072', 'The Colgate Comedy Hour', 1950, 'Comedy', 'Fred Hamilton', null, null, 'NR', 'The Colgate Comedy Hour is an American comedy-musical variety series that aired live on the NBC network from 1950 to 1955. The show starred many notable comedians and entertainers of the era, including Eddie Cantor, Dean Martin and Jerry Lewis, Fred Allen, Donald O''Connor, Bud Abbott and Lou Costello, Bob Hope, Jimmy Durante, Ray Bolger, Gordon MacRae, Ben Blue, Robert Paige, Tony Curtis, Burt Lancaster, Broadway dancer Wayne Lamb and Spike Jones and His City Slickers.', 'The Colgate Comedy Hour is an American comedy-musical variety series that aired live on the NBC network from 1950 to 1955. The show starred many notable comedians and entertainers of the era, including Eddie Cantor, Dean Martin and Jerry Lewis, Fred Allen, Donald O''Connor, Bud Abbott and Lou Costello, Bob Hope, Jimmy Durante, Ray Bolger, Gordon MacRae, Ben Blue, Robert Paige, Tony Curtis, Burt Lancaster, Broadway dancer Wayne Lamb and Spike Jones and His City Slickers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oWvIOn94vgsrius8HYTreQgJtjp.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:1048'),
  ('223292628625834557', 'The Collapse', 2019, 'Drama', 'Guillaume Desjardins, Jérémy Bernard, Bastien Ughetto', null, null, null, 'What if the terrible general "collapse" of our civilization, the collapse everyone is talking about right now, really happened soon? Several destinies of individuals and families, at different times of the collapse, trying to survive as best they can in a world that is no longer running smoothly, between lack of resources (energy, food ...), riots, panic and insecurity.', 'What if the terrible general "collapse" of our civilization, the collapse everyone is talking about right now, really happened soon? Several destinies of individuals and families, at different times of the collapse, trying to survive as best they can in a world that is no longer running smoothly, between lack of resources (energy, food ...), riots, panic and insecurity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9tkNyzvws0X2HR855vRmHuoCgte.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95324'),
  ('382826385406689655', 'The Collection', 2016, 'Drama', 'Oliver Goldstick', null, 'Richard Coyle, Tom Riley, Frances de la Tour, Mamie Gummer, Jenna Thiam, Max Deacon, Alix Poisson, Sarah Parish', 'TV-MA', 'A gripping family drama and entrepreneurial fable, set in a post-war Paris fashion house. It exposes the grit behind the glamour of a rising business, spearheaded by two clashing brothers.', 'A gripping family drama and entrepreneurial fable, set in a post-war Paris fashion house. It exposes the grit behind the glamour of a rising business, spearheaded by two clashing brothers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mcVVIOzfdQ1gmAmr9q8GfL9o3h.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67169'),
  ('471194958241467329', 'The Collector', 2004, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ali Marie Matheson, Jon Cooksey', null, 'Carly Pope, Christine Chatelain, Ellen Dubin, Aidan Drummond, Chris Kramer', null, 'The Collector is a Canadian supernatural drama television series about a man attempting to help save people who have bargained their souls with the Devil. After over 600 years of "collecting" the souls of people at the end of their 10-year deals, Morgan Pym negotiates with the Devil for the ability to aid the damned in redeeming themselves rather than sending them to Hell. Under the Devil''s mocking gaze, Morgan assists his "clients" in undoing the damage their deals have done because of the devil shifting good luck towards the client and away from others. The series is set in Vancouver, British Columbia, Canada, where it was also filmed. CHUM cancelled the program after three seasons.', 'The Collector is a Canadian supernatural drama television series about a man attempting to help save people who have bargained their souls with the Devil. After over 600 years of "collecting" the souls of people at the end of their 10-year deals, Morgan Pym negotiates with the Devil for the ability to aid the damned in redeeming themselves rather than sending them to Hell. Under the Devil''s mocking gaze, Morgan assists his "clients" in undoing the damage their deals have done because of the devil shifting good luck towards the client and away from others. The series is set in Vancouver, British Columbia, Canada, where it was also filmed. CHUM cancelled the program after three seasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zsvj2iP2CdIH1sgR0i4FcN3qkjN.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1644'),
  ('21176275808761498', 'The Colony', 2009, 'Reality', null, null, 'Thom Beers', null, 'The Colony is a reality television series that is produced by the Discovery Channel. The program follows a group of people who must survive in a simulated post-apocalyptic environment. Casting was done by Metal Flowers Media. The first season had 10 main cast members as well as almost 100 actors who did additional scripted and improvisational work for the show.', 'The Colony is a reality television series that is produced by the Discovery Channel. The program follows a group of people who must survive in a simulated post-apocalyptic environment. Casting was done by Metal Flowers Media. The first season had 10 main cast members as well as almost 100 actors who did additional scripted and improvisational work for the show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4lR1r8oXVWR5Kqut1HYQxojDpG.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:21678'),
  ('851237539110218867', 'The Color of Passion', 2014, 'Drama, Soap', 'María del Carmen Peña, Cuauhtémoc Blanco', 'Cuauhtémoc Blanco, María del Carmen Peña, Claudia Velazco', 'Esmeralda Pimentel, Erick Elías, Claudia Ramírez, René Strickler, Eugenia Cauduro, Helena Rojo, Arcelia Ramírez, Ximena Romo', 'TV-14', 'Rebeca murders her sister Adriana to end up with the man she loved, and becomes the step mother of her niece Lucía. Nora, Lucía''s half sister and daughter of Rebeca, resents Lucía for the same reasons Rebeca hated Adriana, as history repeats itself.', 'Rebeca murders her sister Adriana to end up with the man she loved, and becomes the step mother of her niece Lucía. Nora, Lucía''s half sister and daughter of Rebeca, resents Lucía for the same reasons Rebeca hated Adriana, as history repeats itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jjsl79Tsuu7rd25oExLEpwoJz6P.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60632'),
  ('687704508413544919', 'The Colour of Magic', 2008, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Drama', 'Terry Pratchett', null, 'Christopher Lee, David Jason, Sean Astin, Tim Curry, Jeremy Irons, Brian Cox, Geoffrey Hutchings, Terry Pratchett', 'TV-PG', 'As Rincewind involuntarily becomes a guide to the naive tourist Twoflower, they find themselves forced to flee the city of Ankh-Morpork to escape a terrible fire, and begin on a journey across the Disc. Unknown to them, their journey and fate is being decided by the Gods playing a board game the whole time.', 'As Rincewind involuntarily becomes a guide to the naive tourist Twoflower, they find themselves forced to flee the city of Ankh-Morpork to escape a terrible fire, and begin on a journey across the Disc. Unknown to them, their journey and fate is being decided by the Gods playing a board game the whole time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bsjAjZChPTvZs9oTcuER41RChRe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5885'),
  ('570251560910418145', 'The Comeback', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Patrick King, Lisa Kudrow', null, 'Lisa Kudrow, Laura Silverman, Damian Young', 'TV-MA', 'For Valerie Cherish, no price is too high to pay for clinging to the spotlight. Desperate to revive her career, she agrees to star in a reality TV series, allowing cameras to follow her every move as she lands a part on a new network sitcom.', 'For Valerie Cherish, no price is too high to pay for clinging to the spotlight. Desperate to revive her career, she agrees to star in a reality TV series, allowing cameras to follow her every move as she lands a part on a new network sitcom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFZF0ljINGUEa0wAW5d22Iqxjii.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1999'),
  ('493668442495417722', 'The Comeback: 2004 Boston Red Sox', 2024, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Pedro Martínez, Kevin Millar, Theo Epstein, David Ortiz, Curt Schilling, Terry Francona', 'TV-MA', 'This definitive docuseries chronicles the Red Sox''s journey to their first World Series title in 86 years via interviews with star players and personnel.', 'This definitive docuseries chronicles the Red Sox''s journey to their first World Series title in 86 years via interviews with star players and personnel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uEzoVKUurlDjQ0vyJgAuTXQBZO0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:270977'),
  ('1006720580083497092', 'The Comedians', 2015, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Billy Crystal, Josh Gad, Stephnie Weir, Matt Oberg, Megan Ferguson, Mary Grill, Alison Becker', null, 'A veteran comedian is reluctantly paired with a younger, edgier comedian for a late-night comedy sketch show.', 'A veteran comedian is reluctantly paired with a younger, edgier comedian for a late-night comedy sketch show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mf4fRyKmGLxjeJIQIXaRGxjULQo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62180'),
  ('130045712967564349', 'The Comedy Factory', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Al Rogers', null, null, null, 'The Comedy Factory (no known affiliation with the comedy club of the same name) was a live-action, scripted comedy series that ran during the summers of 1985 and 1986 on ABC in the United States and CTV in Canada (who also oversaw production). The show revolved around comedians and actors acting out scenes from television pilots that had been passed on previously by ABC. Further information on the show is scarce and nearly every episode of the show is presumed lost; only the premiere episode, "Honey, It''s the Mayor," is known to survive in its entirety (uploaded to YouTube).', 'The Comedy Factory (no known affiliation with the comedy club of the same name) was a live-action, scripted comedy series that ran during the summers of 1985 and 1986 on ABC in the United States and CTV in Canada (who also oversaw production). The show revolved around comedians and actors acting out scenes from television pilots that had been passed on previously by ABC. Further information on the show is scarce and nearly every episode of the show is presumed lost; only the premiere episode, "Honey, It''s the Mayor," is known to survive in its entirety (uploaded to YouTube).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j92XqAbTCKKNEMt3fM4nugwSVFr.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:30240'),
  ('209910395917190017', 'The Comedy Lineup', 2018, 'Comedy', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'A diverse group of up-and-coming comedians perform 15-minute sets in this stand-up comedy showcase series.', 'A diverse group of up-and-coming comedians perform 15-minute sets in this stand-up comedy showcase series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uEzTdhK3sy2QYUGMvC4gyWqgX7Y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80366'),
  ('362699004232875125', 'The Comey Rule', 2020, 'War & Politics, Drama', null, null, 'Jeff Daniels, Brendan Gleeson, Holly Hunter, Michael Kelly, Jennifer Ehle, Scoot McNairy, Amy Seimetz, Peter Coyote', 'TV-MA', 'An immersive, behind-the-headlines account of the historically turbulent events surrounding the 2016 presidential election and its aftermath, which divided a nation. This two-part biopic tells the story of two powerful figures, Comey and Trump, whose strikingly different personalities, ethics and loyalties put them on a collision course.', 'An immersive, behind-the-headlines account of the historically turbulent events surrounding the 2016 presidential election and its aftermath, which divided a nation. This two-part biopic tells the story of two powerful figures, Comey and Trump, whose strikingly different personalities, ethics and loyalties put them on a collision course.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wftjHCpgqziAw42JZWdFWhro3km.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:104954'),
  ('832475643514030642', 'The Comic Artist and His Assistants', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Saori Hayami, Arisa Noto', 'TV-14', 'The life of an artist can be hard: Long, arduous hours working with only your thoughts and assistants to keep you company. In the case of overworked mangaka Aito, his attempts to merge the two are so far unsuccessful. His priorities are askew and subjecting his assistants to his fantasies has taken precedent over work. Despite his abuse of power, his assistants are willing to play along. Thankfully, editor Mihari is there to keep him in line, from threatening to fire him to physical punishment.', 'The life of an artist can be hard: Long, arduous hours working with only your thoughts and assistants to keep you company. In the case of overworked mangaka Aito, his attempts to merge the two are so far unsuccessful. His priorities are askew and subjecting his assistants to his fantasies has taken precedent over work. Despite his abuse of power, his assistants are willing to play along. Thankfully, editor Mihari is there to keep him in line, from threatening to fire him to physical punishment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVpdJnlz5sCcq0gIUdIfbuHJ4CY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69217'),
  ('556138687425126932', 'The Comic Strip Presents...', 1982, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Rik Mayall, Dawn French, Adrian Edmondson, Jennifer Saunders', null, 'The Comic Strip is a group of British comedians, who do parodies of films, literature and sometimes major events.', 'The Comic Strip is a group of British comedians, who do parodies of films, literature and sometimes major events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jUMJPj1nEiDBpccJvgKDMt6XKEN.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:27119'),
  ('746704165731850244', 'The Commish', 1991, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Stephen J. Cannell, Stephen Kronish', null, 'Michael Chiklis, Theresa Saldana, Kaj-Erik Eriksen, Geoffrey Nauffts, Melinda McGraw', 'TV-14', 'Tony Scali is a former Brooklyn cop now the Police Commissioner of a small upstate city. But for Scali, this is no desk job. He''s a tough yet compassionate boss, a loving husband and father, and a hands-on law enforcer with an unorthodox style of bending the rules. From parenthood to politics, from sex crimes to murder cases, one man takes it day-to-day with offbeat humor and street- smart skill.', 'Tony Scali is a former Brooklyn cop now the Police Commissioner of a small upstate city. But for Scali, this is no desk job. He''s a tough yet compassionate boss, a loving husband and father, and a hands-on law enforcer with an unorthodox style of bending the rules. From parenthood to politics, from sex crimes to murder cases, one man takes it day-to-day with offbeat humor and street- smart skill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osvVYFdCtz223oOQmMcoM1N4JGP.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:3840'),
  ('985053997443804013', 'The Commissioner', 1969, 'Drama, Crime', 'Herbert Reinecker', null, 'Erik Ode, Günther Schramm, Reinhard Glemnitz, Helma Seitz, Rosemarie Fendel, Elmar Wepper', null, 'Der Kommissar is a German television series about a group of detectives of the Munich homicide squad. All 97 episodes, which were shot in black-and-white and first broadcast between 1969 and 1976, were written by Herbert Reinecker and starred Erik Ode as Kommissar Herbert Keller. Keller''s assistants were Walter Grabert, Robert Heines, and Harry Klein who, in 1974, was replaced by his younger brother Erwin Klein.', 'Der Kommissar is a German television series about a group of detectives of the Munich homicide squad. All 97 episodes, which were shot in black-and-white and first broadcast between 1969 and 1976, were written by Herbert Reinecker and starred Erik Ode as Kommissar Herbert Keller. Keller''s assistants were Walter Grabert, Robert Heines, and Harry Klein who, in 1974, was replaced by his younger brother Erwin Klein.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3jPtZ0ArpniildjPklBGawxING7.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:1698'),
  ('1144508871145645459', 'The Commons', 2019, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Shelley Birse', null, 'Dominic Ona-Ariki, Rupert Penry-Jones, David Lyons, Inez Curro, Simone McAullay, Joanne Froggatt, Ryan Corr', null, 'Set in a gripping vision of the near future, THE COMMONS is an absorbing character-driven relationship drama and a story about motherhood as the ultimate act of faith in humanity.', 'Set in a gripping vision of the near future, THE COMMONS is an absorbing character-driven relationship drama and a story about motherhood as the ultimate act of faith in humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDkkqQkrGKfSoJ89uLz1y3V4buX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96841'),
  ('541162024122046401', 'The Company', 2007, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Mikael Salomon', null, 'Chris O''Donnell, Michael Keaton, Rory Cochrane, Tom Hollander, Derek Aasland, Hayley Andoff, James Arnold Taylor, Szilvia Baranyai', 'TV-14', 'The Company tells the thrilling story of Cold War CIA agents imprisoned in double lives, fighting an amoral, elusive, formidable enemy – and each other – in an internecine battle within the Company itself.', 'The Company tells the thrilling story of Cold War CIA agents imprisoned in double lives, fighting an amoral, elusive, formidable enemy – and each other – in an internecine battle within the Company itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rxBchxWLVuqjG4kk1IhDAUMghr9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5314'),
  ('885385296005870891', 'The Company You Keep', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Julia Cohen, Phil Klemmer', null, 'Milo Ventimiglia, Catherine Haena Kim, Sarah Wayne Callies, Polly Draper, Tim Chiou, James Saito, Freda Foh Shen, Felisha Terrell', 'TV-14', 'A night of passion leads to love between con man Charlie and undercover CIA officer Emma, who are unknowingly on a collision course professionally. While Charlie ramps up the ‘family business’ so he can get out for good, Emma’s closing in on the vengeful criminal who holds Charlie’s family debts in-hand — forcing them to reckon with the lies they’ve told so they can save themselves and their families from disastrous consequences.', 'A night of passion leads to love between con man Charlie and undercover CIA officer Emma, who are unknowingly on a collision course professionally. While Charlie ramps up the ‘family business’ so he can get out for good, Emma’s closing in on the vengeful criminal who holds Charlie’s family debts in-hand — forcing them to reckon with the lies they’ve told so they can save themselves and their families from disastrous consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rnG8TMftQaMpGQtvsVwmlyhQ0gB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208713'),
  ('1029221912635627352', 'The Completely Made-Up Adventures of Dick Turpin', 2024, 'Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Claire Downes, Ian Jarvis, Stuart Lane', null, 'Noel Fielding, Marc Wootton, Ellie White, Mark Heap, Michael Fielding, Duayne Boachie', 'TV-14', 'Legendary highwayman Dick Turpin sets out on a series of wildly absurd escapades when he''s made the reluctant leader of a band of outlaws—and tasked with outwitting utterly corrupt lawman Jonathan Wilde.', 'Legendary highwayman Dick Turpin sets out on a series of wildly absurd escapades when he''s made the reluctant leader of a band of outlaws—and tasked with outwitting utterly corrupt lawman Jonathan Wilde.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6UZwXEb6S6KYW7JmdYM17mNUTPv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197459'),
  ('813606413742524814', 'The Completely Mental Misadventures of Ed Grimley', 1988, 'Comedy, Animation, Kids', null, null, 'Martin Short, Andrea Martin, Catherine O''Hara, Joe Flaherty, Frank Welker, Danny Cooksey, Jonathan Winters', 'TV-Y7', 'Martin Short’s Ed Grimley careens through a series of life-affirming and science learning Saturday morning adventures', 'Martin Short’s Ed Grimley careens through a series of life-affirming and science learning Saturday morning adventures', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pA5bA8RTYUPBLxB3sukQ54yRXqu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:25355'),
  ('407165341803435340', 'The Condor Heroes 95', 1995, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, 'Wong Kok Fai', 'Louis Koo, Carman Lee Yeuk-Tung, Gigi Fu Ming-Hin, Theresa Lee Yee-Hung, Jason Pai Piao, Bonnie Ngai Chau-Wah, Sidney Yim, Maggie Cheung Ho-Yee', null, 'The Condor Heroes 95 is a Hong Kong television series adapted from Louis Cha''s novel The Return of the Condor Heroes. It was first broadcast on TVB Jade in Hong Kong in 1995. Many of the cast from The Legend of the Condor Heroes reprised their roles in this series, such as Lau Dan and Wayne Lai. In addition, Jason Pai reprised his breakthrough role as Kwok Ching, whom he previously portrayed in The Legend of the Condor Heroes and The Return of the Condor Heroes.', 'The Condor Heroes 95 is a Hong Kong television series adapted from Louis Cha''s novel The Return of the Condor Heroes. It was first broadcast on TVB Jade in Hong Kong in 1995. Many of the cast from The Legend of the Condor Heroes reprised their roles in this series, such as Lau Dan and Wayne Lai. In addition, Jason Pai reprised his breakthrough role as Kwok Ching, whom he previously portrayed in The Legend of the Condor Heroes and The Return of the Condor Heroes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pkUGghGufdG17N601kD4m04LDNw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31955'),
  ('294561748392672796', 'The Confession', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', null, 'Brad Mirman', 'Kiefer Sutherland, John Hurt, Max Casella, Michael Badalucco, Greg Ellis, Daniel London, Sebastian Beacon, Curtis McClarin', 'NR', 'On Christmas Eve, a hit-man enters a church to confess his sins to a priest. While at first the Confessor seems to be an evil, cold-blooded killing machine and the Priest the ultimate arbiter of good, as the Confessor’s journey is revealed, it becomes clear that both men are much more complicated than either could have suspected.', 'On Christmas Eve, a hit-man enters a church to confess his sins to a priest. While at first the Confessor seems to be an evil, cold-blooded killing machine and the Priest the ultimate arbiter of good, as the Confessor’s journey is revealed, it becomes clear that both men are much more complicated than either could have suspected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTLBVHhU3sdcEnZyRZmWFWl1trr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38979'),
  ('658929617072598358', 'The Confession', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'When Patricia Hall vanishes from the small Yorkshire town of Pudsey, her husband Keith becomes a suspect, caught in a storm of rumour and suspicion. Only after a year, when Keith Hall falls in love with a beautiful stranger, does the terrible truth about his wife''s disappearance seem to emerge in a shocking series of twists and revelations.', 'When Patricia Hall vanishes from the small Yorkshire town of Pudsey, her husband Keith becomes a suspect, caught in a storm of rumour and suspicion. Only after a year, when Keith Hall falls in love with a beautiful stranger, does the terrible truth about his wife''s disappearance seem to emerge in a shocking series of twists and revelations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xeK3jIUctittNCYdYmJCAAlr3TV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215069'),
  ('425457805841406446', 'The Confession Killer', 2019, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Robert Kenner, Taki Oldham', null, 'Bob Prince, Henry Lee Lucas', 'TV-14', 'Henry Lee Lucas rose to infamy when he confessed to hundreds of unsolved murders. This docuseries examines the truth -- and horrifying consequences.', 'Henry Lee Lucas rose to infamy when he confessed to hundreds of unsolved murders. This docuseries examines the truth -- and horrifying consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9EICsJ2tAagT3crgGnvWRErv1pO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95986'),
  ('847284728099827958', 'The Confession Tapes', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Kelly Loudenberg', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'This true crime documentary series investigates cases where people convicted of murder claim their confessions were coerced, involuntary or false.', 'This true crime documentary series investigates cases where people convicted of murder claim their confessions were coerced, involuntary or false.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lIQuqN6E2ayR8NPflHHh5FX1YJ5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:73792'),
  ('930877675847001322', 'The Confessions of Frannie Langton', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Karla-Simone Spence, Sophie Cookson, Patrick Martins, Jodhi May, Stephen Campbell Moore, John Alan Roberts, Amarah-Jae St. Aubyn', null, 'Based on Sara Collins’ award-winning novel of the same name, which is set against the dazzling opulence of Georgian London, this powerful drama follows the eponymous Frannie’s journey from a Jamaican plantation to the grand Mayfair mansion of celebrated scientist George Benham and his exquisitely beautiful wife, Madame Marguerite Benham.', 'Based on Sara Collins’ award-winning novel of the same name, which is set against the dazzling opulence of Georgian London, this powerful drama follows the eponymous Frannie’s journey from a Jamaican plantation to the grand Mayfair mansion of celebrated scientist George Benham and his exquisitely beautiful wife, Madame Marguerite Benham.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OgzGTlfvanIBxw6NFoS4A53NYp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214065'),
  ('808350998419901803', 'The Confidante', 2024, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Samuel Doux, Fanny Burdino, Jean-Baptiste Delafon', null, 'Laure Calamy, Arieh Worthalter, Ava Baya, Annabelle Lengronne, Alexis Manenti, Anne Benoît, James Flynn', 'TV-MA', 'After witnessing the harrowing November 13, 2015 terrorist attacks, Christelle "Chris" Blandin quickly latches onto a community of survivors. Claiming that her best friend Vincent was one of dozens critically injured at the Bataclan Theatre, Chris becomes an indispensable resource for the group but discrepancies begin to pepper her story – raising serious doubts among the true victims of the tragedy.', 'After witnessing the harrowing November 13, 2015 terrorist attacks, Christelle "Chris" Blandin quickly latches onto a community of survivors. Claiming that her best friend Vincent was one of dozens critically injured at the Bataclan Theatre, Chris becomes an indispensable resource for the group but discrepancies begin to pepper her story – raising serious doubts among the true victims of the tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/39xROtSABmXcBVQgK8SAQWFKIcR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:224011'),
  ('598511854424601484', 'The Confidence Man JP', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Ryota Kosawa', 'Masami Nagasawa, Masahiro Higashide, Fumiyo Kohinata, Yosuke Eguchi, Michiko Kichise, Shiro Sano, Hikari Mitsushima, Shinya Kote', null, 'Dako is a con woman. She stays at a suite in a luxury hotel and schemes to take money from vicious wealthy people like yakuza bosses and evil businessmen. She works with Boku-chan and Richard. Boku-chan is a sincere and timid young con man. Richard is a veteran con man. Dako is able to master knowledge from various professions in a short period of time and disguises herself as someone working in that field. Along with Boku-chan and Richard, they carry their plans using fantastic teamwork.', 'Dako is a con woman. She stays at a suite in a luxury hotel and schemes to take money from vicious wealthy people like yakuza bosses and evil businessmen. She works with Boku-chan and Richard. Boku-chan is a sincere and timid young con man. Richard is a veteran con man. Dako is able to master knowledge from various professions in a short period of time and disguises herself as someone working in that field. Along with Boku-chan and Richard, they carry their plans using fantastic teamwork.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/28Coe4j6p1FdYXBMEafJrzdq39A.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78685'),
  ('476159263383698975', 'The Conners', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Matt Williams', null, 'John Goodman, Laurie Metcalf, Sara Gilbert, Alicia Goranson, Emma Kenney, Ames McNamara', 'TV-PG', 'This iconic family—Dan, Jackie, Darlene, Becky and D.J.—grapples with parenthood, dating, an unexpected pregnancy, financial pressures, aging and in-laws in working-class America.', 'This iconic family—Dan, Jackie, Darlene, Becky and D.J.—grapples with parenthood, dating, an unexpected pregnancy, financial pressures, aging and in-laws in working-class America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUXN3E67qVyTiftGptfhcmfDasW.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:80550'),
  ('305653078705910844', 'The Connor Wallace Gets Grounded Show', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Alex Kittrell', null, 'Connor Wallace, Laura Bexley, Elliott Granger', 'TV-MA', 'The story of 21-year-old vintage VHS collector Connor Wallace and how he causes mischief, violence and trouble. Laura and Elliott constantly hear about Connor''s wrongdoings and ground him.', 'The story of 21-year-old vintage VHS collector Connor Wallace and how he causes mischief, violence and trouble. Laura and Elliott constantly hear about Connor''s wrongdoings and ground him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2pCELTagOzf14CQOePyEdmtD92H.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317227'),
  ('479708916516121271', 'The Conqueror''s Story', 2004, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Lee Tim-Sing', null, 'Adam Cheng Siu-Chow, Kwong Wa, Maggie Cheung Ho-Yee, Melissa Ng Mei-Heng, Wayne Lai Yiu-Cheung, Cerina da Graça, Ram Chiang Chi-Kwong, Law Lok-Lam', null, 'The Conqueror''s Story is a Hong Kong television series based on the events in the Chu–Han Contention period of Chinese history. It was first broadcast in 2004 in Hong Kong on TVB Jade.', 'The Conqueror''s Story is a Hong Kong television series based on the events in the Chu–Han Contention period of Chinese history. It was first broadcast in 2004 in Hong Kong on TVB Jade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/50pIlU9Rk3roweAICi5ImqmMAi1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32154'),
  ('50531296877508272', 'The Consultant', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tony Basgallop', null, 'Christoph Waltz, Nat Wolff, Brittany O''Grady, Aimee Carrero', 'TV-MA', 'After an unspeakable tragedy at CompWare, a games studio based in downtown Los Angeles, a mysterious consultant, Regus Patoff, blows into town and takes charge.', 'After an unspeakable tragedy at CompWare, a games studio based in downtown Los Angeles, a mysterious consultant, Regus Patoff, blows into town and takes charge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dbmnbPdDIgH9RR1Cs0SkG4DaYgF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:139099'),
  ('259954057201674906', 'The Continental: From the World of John Wick', 2023, 'Crime, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Greg Coolidge, Kirk Ward, Shawn Simmons', 'Derek Kolstad, Glenise Mullins', 'Colin Woodell, Mel Gibson, Mishel Prada, Ben Robson, Hubert Point-Du Jour, Nhung Kate, Jessica Allain, Ayomide Adegun', 'TV-MA', 'The origin behind the iconic hotel-for-assassins through the eyes and actions of a young Winston Scott, as he''s dragged into the Hell-scape of 1970''s New York City to face a past he thought he''d left behind. Winston charts a deadly course through the hotel''s mysterious underworld in a harrowing attempt to seize the hotel where he will eventually take his future throne.', 'The origin behind the iconic hotel-for-assassins through the eyes and actions of a young Winston Scott, as he''s dragged into the Hell-scape of 1970''s New York City to face a past he thought he''d left behind. Winston charts a deadly course through the hotel''s mysterious underworld in a harrowing attempt to seize the hotel where he will eventually take his future throne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2urdwqEL9FRkGMKAkhfvWTALG00.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72710'),
  ('37375924209138411', 'The Control Room', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Nick Leather', null, 'Iain De Caestecker, Joanna Vanderham, Sharon Rooney, Daniel Portman, Taj Atwal, Stuart Bowman, Rona Morison, Conor McLeod', null, 'The story of Gabe, an ordinary man who works as an emergency call handler for the Scottish Ambulance Service in Glasgow. His world is turned upside down when he receives a desperate life-and-death call from a woman who appears to know him. With Gabe under pressure to work out who she is, he makes a decision that threatens to have devastating consequences.', 'The story of Gabe, an ordinary man who works as an emergency call handler for the Scottish Ambulance Service in Glasgow. His world is turned upside down when he receives a desperate life-and-death call from a woman who appears to know him. With Gabe under pressure to work out who she is, he makes a decision that threatens to have devastating consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mpHGWe5vnU20KU69Kq3OTVSDVRl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:194637'),
  ('400222918037570621', 'The Convict', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Agata Kulesza, Aleksandra Adamska, Marta Malikowska, Marta Ścisłowicz, Joanna Gonschorek, Dawid Zawadzki, Tomasz Schuchardt, Jacek Beler', 'TV-MA', 'The successful judge Alicja Mazur, who is known for her strictness towards criminals. The woman is unexpectedly accused of a murder she did not commit.', 'The successful judge Alicja Mazur, who is known for her strictness towards criminals. The woman is unexpectedly accused of a murder she did not commit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0xySEwArMXhX1BXeWdcaj1QPDO.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:122725'),
