  ('1009060448844091800', 'The Critic', 1994, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Mike Reiss, Al Jean', null, 'Jon Lovitz, Christine Cavanaugh, Park Overall, Russi Taylor, Charles Napier, Judith Ivey, Gerrit Graham, Nancy Cartwright', 'TV-PG', 'Jay Sherman is a TV movie critic who is forced to review the most pathetic films which he always rates as "It stinks." In addition to the film parodies, the show also deals with his personal life: working for a tyrannical media mogul boss, his lovelife and his family.', 'Jay Sherman is a TV movie critic who is forced to review the most pathetic films which he always rates as "It stinks." In addition to the film parodies, the show also deals with his personal life: working for a tyrannical media mogul boss, his lovelife and his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pVP8YDNWEV3JUVGJRySbgVJLVZU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1839'),
  ('766749702874536823', 'The Crocodile Hunter', 1997, 'Documentary, Action & Adventure, Family', 'John Stainton, Steve Irwin', null, 'Terri Irwin, Steve Irwin, Bindi Irwin', 'TV-G', 'Australian host Steve Irwin and his wife Terri run a wildlife refuge. Their shared passion is educating the world about wildlife, including the much feared crocodile and numerous venomous snakes. Steve''s specialty is the capture and relocation of crocodiles. No animal appears too threatening to Steve, his true respect for animals is the foundation for everything he does.', 'Australian host Steve Irwin and his wife Terri run a wildlife refuge. Their shared passion is educating the world about wildlife, including the much feared crocodile and numerous venomous snakes. Steve''s specialty is the capture and relocation of crocodiles. No animal appears too threatening to Steve, his true respect for animals is the foundation for everything he does.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/youExJaJ4EW8jjDllu0emOJAIKi.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1904'),
