  ('141131167538343497', 'The Dance of Passion', 2006, 'Drama', null, null, 'Bowie Lam Bo-Yee, Charmaine Sheh Sze-Man, Gigi Lai Chi, Moses Chan Ho, Ada Choi Siu-Fan, Maggie Shiu, Rebecca Chan, Tsui Wing', null, 'With almost the same cast and crew as War And Beauty, And the extensive location filming in Yinchuan, The Dance Of Passion is going to be another great legend in TV history! Across the Loess Plateau… Is a story of family feuds and furtive passions! On the Loess Plateau of Shanbei live two clans, the YIMs and the SUNGs. The SUNGs have been relying on the YIMs and a lasting peace has been going on for three generations. But this situation cannot continue when YIM MAN-HEI (LAM, BOWIE) becomes the Superintendent. His rise to power has drawn the clans into serious conflict. SUNG TUNG-SING (CHAN HO, MOSES) who falls in love with a widow has suffered the cruelest punishment, the Penalty of Torching, for his affair, as ordered by HEI. SING’s lover is burnt to death while SING is expelled from YIM’s clan...', 'With almost the same cast and crew as War And Beauty, And the extensive location filming in Yinchuan, The Dance Of Passion is going to be another great legend in TV history! Across the Loess Plateau… Is a story of family feuds and furtive passions! On the Loess Plateau of Shanbei live two clans, the YIMs and the SUNGs. The SUNGs have been relying on the YIMs and a lasting peace has been going on for three generations. But this situation cannot continue when YIM MAN-HEI (LAM, BOWIE) becomes the Superintendent. His rise to power has drawn the clans into serious conflict. SUNG TUNG-SING (CHAN HO, MOSES) who falls in love with a widow has suffered the cruelest punishment, the Penalty of Torching, for his affair, as ordered by HEI. SING’s lover is burnt to death while SING is expelled from YIM’s clan...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jzBihgshMN5XFXUQpV3X6k6ecjP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98346'),
  ('103579388290521773', 'The Dandy', 2015, 'Drama, Crime', 'Mauricio Cruz, Chava Cartas', 'Rodrigo Ordoñez, Larissa Andrade', 'Itahisa Machado, Dagoberto Gama, Damián Alcázar, Alfonso Herrera, Luis de Alba, Aleyda Gallardo, Claudio Roca', null, 'Inspired by the 1997 American drama Donnie Brasco, El Dandy tells the story of a law professor who has been hired by the Attorney General, to participate in a program of special operations, where you must infiltrate one of the most notorious drug cartels of Mexico City. Under the false name Daniel "El Dandy" Bracho, begins the task of identifying all the members of this clandestine network. However, he quickly finds that his acute ability to police work is only comparable with the exciting sense of danger that experiences living life to the fullest. Along the way, it avails itself of the help of a criminal''s petty, loyal, even corrupt, called El Chueco, who quickly befriends Bracho and comes dangerously close to discover his true identity. Much deeper Bracho is involved in the mafia, more work tells him to get out, and the professor once incorruptible has to choose between returning to a normal life as a respectable citizen or fully embrace his criminal life.', 'Inspired by the 1997 American drama Donnie Brasco, El Dandy tells the story of a law professor who has been hired by the Attorney General, to participate in a program of special operations, where you must infiltrate one of the most notorious drug cartels of Mexico City. Under the false name Daniel "El Dandy" Bracho, begins the task of identifying all the members of this clandestine network. However, he quickly finds that his acute ability to police work is only comparable with the exciting sense of danger that experiences living life to the fullest. Along the way, it avails itself of the help of a criminal''s petty, loyal, even corrupt, called El Chueco, who quickly befriends Bracho and comes dangerously close to discover his true identity. Much deeper Bracho is involved in the mafia, more work tells him to get out, and the professor once incorruptible has to choose between returning to a normal life as a respectable citizen or fully embrace his criminal life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/an8NFIDiL0L4HgZ5gpBrqalRKOE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64566'),
  ('1036365878272205501', 'The Dangerous Book for Boys', 2018, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Greg Mottola, Bryan Cranston', null, 'Chris Diamantopoulos, Gabriel Bateman, Drew Powell, Kyan Zielinski, Erinn Hayes, Swoosie Kurtz', 'TV-Y7', 'The story of a middle-class family coping with the sudden passing of their beloved patriarch Patrick, a whimsical inventor who touched the lives of all who knew him. Devastated, his family finds hope in a guide book he created for his sons.', 'The story of a middle-class family coping with the sudden passing of their beloved patriarch Patrick, a whimsical inventor who touched the lives of all who knew him. Devastated, his family finds hope in a guide book he created for his sons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sU4tfnvxpqDwr4n4usyNYrjdtQ8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77345'),
  ('140444491049120319', 'The Dangers in My Heart', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Shun Horie, Hina Youmiya', 'TV-14', 'Kyotaro Ichikawa, a boy barely clinging to the bottom rung of his school''s social ladder, secretly believes he’s the tortured lead in some psychological thriller. He spends his days dreaming up ways to disrupt his classmates'' peaceful lives and pining after Anna Yamada, the class idol. But Kyotaro''s not nearly the troubled teen he pretends to be…and it turns out Anna''s a bit odd herself!', 'Kyotaro Ichikawa, a boy barely clinging to the bottom rung of his school''s social ladder, secretly believes he’s the tortured lead in some psychological thriller. He spends his days dreaming up ways to disrupt his classmates'' peaceful lives and pining after Anna Yamada, the class idol. But Kyotaro''s not nearly the troubled teen he pretends to be…and it turns out Anna''s a bit odd herself!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKhMmREBOKXtp3tlv9rnLRxZec5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207250'),
  ('956020798285932130', 'The Danish Woman', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Benedikt Erlingsson, Ólafur Egill Egilsson', 'Benedikt Erlingsson, Ólafur Egill Egilsson', 'Trine Dyrholm, Hilmar Guðjónsson, Halldóra Geirharðsdóttir, Besir Zeciri, Jens Albinus, Kristín Þóra Haraldsdóttir, Hjálmar Hjálmarsson, Björn Thors', null, 'Having just retired from the Danish Secret Service, Ditte Jensen has settled into a small apartment building in Reykjavík. Possessing a strong sense of justice, she doesn''t hesitate to get involved in her neighbours'' problems and help them.', 'Having just retired from the Danish Secret Service, Ditte Jensen has settled into a small apartment building in Reykjavík. Possessing a strong sense of justice, she doesn''t hesitate to get involved in her neighbours'' problems and help them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5x87ouELGhodhvN5KjboZwWpDj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:287740'),
