  ('300152349930531725', 'The Dark Charisma of Adolf Hitler', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Laurence Rees', 'Laurence Rees', 'Herbert Forthuber, Stefan Gilly, Peter Kollmann', null, 'Adolf Hitler is infamous today as a war criminal - arguably one of the worst war criminals in history. Yet during the 1930s he was loved by millions of Germans. How was this possible? In this fascinating series, award-winning historian and documentary maker Laurence Rees examines the background to Hitler''s ''charismatic'' rule.', 'Adolf Hitler is infamous today as a war criminal - arguably one of the worst war criminals in history. Yet during the 1930s he was loved by millions of Germans. How was this possible? In this fascinating series, award-winning historian and documentary maker Laurence Rees examines the background to Hitler''s ''charismatic'' rule.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSi9nD7DydjEBzHYQigBounbIXl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:55585'),
  ('357968401535021174', 'The Dark Crystal: Age of Resistance', 2019, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Family', 'Jeffrey Addiss, Will Matthews', null, 'Taron Egerton, Anya Taylor-Joy, Nathalie Emmanuel, Donna Kimball, Jason Isaacs, Dave Chapman, Olly Taylor, Helena Smee', 'TV-PG', 'Return to the world of Thra, where three Gelfling discover the horrifying secret behind the Skeksis'' power and set out to ignite the fires of rebellion and save their world.', 'Return to the world of Thra, where three Gelfling discover the horrifying secret behind the Skeksis'' power and set out to ignite the fires of rebellion and save their world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xnMJ7mBC8Jx4emaj7TE4TU0Qm92.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71809'),
  ('105752949688448520', 'The Dark History of the Reincarnated Villainess', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yoshino Aoyama, Mao Ichimichi, Shohei Komatsu, Makoto Furukawa, Shunichi Toki, Arthur Lounsbery, Atsushi Tamaru, Tomoaki Maeno', 'TV-14', 'Konoha Satou’s dark fictional past becomes her reality when she’s reincarnated as Iana Magnolia, the villainess of her own adolescent fantasy. Now as a role she meticulously designed to be despicable, remembering every last detail is now a matter of life and death. Will she be able to rewrite her character’s fate into something peaceful?', 'Konoha Satou’s dark fictional past becomes her reality when she’s reincarnated as Iana Magnolia, the villainess of her own adolescent fantasy. Now as a role she meticulously designed to be despicable, remembering every last detail is now a matter of life and death. Will she be able to rewrite her character’s fate into something peaceful?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yrAx1DmfnZjTs2NKsljqd60Kg9X.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:286404'),
  ('637130257086919889', 'The Dark Romance', 2026, 'Drama, Mystery', null, 'Xue Xiaolu', 'Sun Li, Wu Kang-ren, Wang Ge, Chen Xixu, Tao Hui, Chen Tianyu, Wu Nien-hsuan, Liao Yinyue', null, 'While investigating her best friend’s suicide, single mother Yan Ling is drawn into a dangerous web of emotional manipulation. As love and betrayal become entangled, she begins to recognize the truth, break free from control, and reclaim her life.', 'While investigating her best friend’s suicide, single mother Yan Ling is drawn into a dangerous web of emotional manipulation. As love and betrayal become entangled, she begins to recognize the truth, break free from control, and reclaim her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b20DhmJR1CPQJXIEwU22BJHF94u.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:273151'),
