  ('324044520510635739', 'The Ex-Wife', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Céline Buckens, Tom Mison, Katie McGrath, Jordan Stephens', 'NR', 'Tasha is living the dream, she has the perfect house, a loving husband and a beautiful little girl. But there''s one large blot on Tasha''s marital landscape: her husbands''s ex-wife won''t leave them alone and seems intent on staying in the picture.', 'Tasha is living the dream, she has the perfect house, a loving husband and a beautiful little girl. But there''s one large blot on Tasha''s marital landscape: her husbands''s ex-wife won''t leave them alone and seems intent on staying in the picture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vp5Vs17MUizJ7bQNMRsUcvDVquC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:212196'),
