  ('263137537302440512', 'The Great Heist', 2020, 'Crime, Drama', 'C.S. Prince, Pablo González', null, 'Andrés Parra, Christian Tappán, Waldo Urrego, Marcela Benjumea, Juan Pablo Barragán, Édgar Vittorino, Kami Zea, Paula Castaño', null, 'Based on the 1994 robbery of US$33 million from Colombia''s central bank, which turned the country upside down.', 'Based on the 1994 robbery of US$33 million from Colombia''s central bank, which turned the country upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j52EFofX8hCoenmvDC4AOppoPWu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:104555'),
  ('100972596308200449', 'The Great House Revival', 2018, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, 'Hugh Wallace', null, 'Following six homeowners who have taken on the task of a lifetime: to reclaim and transform their derelict properties on the verge of ruin into comfortable modern homes, fit for the 21st century.', 'Following six homeowners who have taken on the task of a lifetime: to reclaim and transform their derelict properties on the verge of ruin into comfortable modern homes, fit for the 21st century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tEhKODTQLRr9oHvJpHJP24CeEvJ.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:122322'),
  ('486397574180419516', 'The Great Indian Kapil Show', 2024, 'Talk, Comedy', 'Kapil Sharma', null, 'Kapil Sharma, Sunil Grover, Krishna Abhishek, Kiku Sharda, Archana Puran Singh, Navjot Singh Sidhu', 'TV-14', 'Comedian Kapil Sharma hosts this laugh-out-loud variety talk show with celebrity guests, hilarious antics and his signature supporting cast.', 'Comedian Kapil Sharma hosts this laugh-out-loud variety talk show with celebrity guests, hilarious antics and his signature supporting cast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KMCmGDlYLlJ8zGOhCs6f3FZcnj.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:247769'),
  ('245444968658175660', 'The Great Indian Murder', 2022, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Tigmanshu Dhulia', 'Tigmanshu Dhulia, Puneet Sharma, Vijay Maurya', 'Richa Chadha, Pratik Gandhi, Ashutosh Rana, Sharib Hashmi, Raghubir Yadav, Shashank Arora, Paoli Dam, Ronjini Chakraborty', 'TV-MA', 'Vikrant aka Vicky Rai, industrialist with a Casanova lifestyle, is killed at his own party to celebrate his acquittal in the rape and murder of two young girls. His father, Jagannath Rai, who is also the Home Minister of Chhattisgarh, demands a CBI inquiry. Officers Suraj Yadav and Sudha Bharadwaj lead the investigation following six suspects.', 'Vikrant aka Vicky Rai, industrialist with a Casanova lifestyle, is killed at his own party to celebrate his acquittal in the rape and murder of two young girls. His father, Jagannath Rai, who is also the Home Minister of Chhattisgarh, demands a CBI inquiry. Officers Suraj Yadav and Sudha Bharadwaj lead the investigation following six suspects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ou4Dal2mFUwcHYC6lmf8SW00NzZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155846'),
  ('696128308815148213', 'The Great Indoors', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Mike Gibbons', null, 'Joel McHale, Stephen Fry, Susannah Fielding, Christopher Mintz-Plasse, Shaun Brown, Christine Ko, Chris Williams, Deborah Baker Jr.', 'TV-PG', 'An adventure reporter must adapt to the times when he becomes the boss to a group of millennials in the digital department of the magazine.', 'An adventure reporter must adapt to the times when he becomes the boss to a group of millennials in the digital department of the magazine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ot4gdEwuXHf0wOOmKJW86Cd1b69.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67157'),
  ('720353493696895024', 'The Great Jahy Will Not Be Defeated!', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Naomi Ohzora, Ai Kayano, Yoko Hikasa, Kana Hanazawa, Mikako Komatsu, Yui Ogura', 'TV-14', 'The Great Jahy, the Dark Realm''s second-in-command, cuts a frightening figure, feared and revered by all. But when a run-in with a magical girl results in the destruction of the precious mana crystal, the Dark Realm falls, transporting the newly tiny and powerless Jahy to the human world! Unfortunately, plotting the revival of the Dark Realm from a cramped, crumbling one-room apartment is no easy feat when you have rent to pay and a job to keep!', 'The Great Jahy, the Dark Realm''s second-in-command, cuts a frightening figure, feared and revered by all. But when a run-in with a magical girl results in the destruction of the precious mana crystal, the Dark Realm falls, transporting the newly tiny and powerless Jahy to the human world! Unfortunately, plotting the revival of the Dark Realm from a cramped, crumbling one-room apartment is no easy feat when you have rent to pay and a job to keep!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hrlzVgSK0y2sA6Q3Nk8oSOIYUD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:123446'),
  ('379655992590346178', 'The Great North', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Lizzie Molyneux-Logelin, Wendy Molyneux, Minty Lewis', null, 'Nick Offerman, Jenny Slate, Will Forte, Aparna Nancherla, Paul Rust, Dulcé Sloan', 'TV-14', 'Follow the Alaskan adventures of the Tobin family as a single dad does his best to keep his weird bunch of kids close, especially as the artistic dreams of his only daughter lead her away from the family fishing boat and into the glamorous world of the local mall.', 'Follow the Alaskan adventures of the Tobin family as a single dad does his best to keep his weird bunch of kids close, especially as the artistic dreams of his only daughter lead her away from the family fishing boat and into the glamorous world of the local mall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Ww56dPIuXn4NZGrJJPdoafLHGu.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:93221'),
  ('958968143519706588', 'The Great Passage', 2016, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Yoko Hikasa, Hiroshi Kamiya, Yoshiko Sakakibara, Tetsuo Kanao, Maaya Sakamoto, Takahiro Sakurai, Mugihito, Chiwa Saito', 'TV-14', 'The publication of a new dictionary titled The Great Passage progresses. Mitsuya Majime, originally from publisher Genbu Shobo''s sales department, has been recruited by Kouhei Araki, a veteran editor of the dictionary department who is looking to retire soon. The dictionary department is known internally as the "money-eating insect," but Mitsuya uses his perseverance and attachment to the words in order to become a great editor. Mitsuya, who has poor social skills, finds himself working with another man named Masashi Nishioka, who is able to express himself better.', 'The publication of a new dictionary titled The Great Passage progresses. Mitsuya Majime, originally from publisher Genbu Shobo''s sales department, has been recruited by Kouhei Araki, a veteran editor of the dictionary department who is looking to retire soon. The dictionary department is known internally as the "money-eating insect," but Mitsuya uses his perseverance and attachment to the words in order to become a great editor. Mitsuya, who has poor social skills, finds himself working with another man named Masashi Nishioka, who is able to express himself better.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jy4mxxs57mSMuZJgjrUWoDXfWAN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65952'),
  ('438197496244588626', 'The Great Pottery Throw Down', 2015, 'Reality', null, null, 'Keith Brymer Jones, Richard Miller, Siobhán McSweeney', 'TV-14', 'Ten home potters from around the country head to Stoke-on-Trent, the home of pottery, in their quest to become Top Potter.', 'Ten home potters from around the country head to Stoke-on-Trent, the home of pottery, in their quest to become Top Potter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/89RRcMbTgELBRmFCD1B9n4wPv39.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:77631'),
  ('287913355357358362', 'The Great Queen Seondeok', 2009, 'Drama, History', null, 'Kim Young-hyun, Sang-yeon Park', 'Lee Yo-won, Nam Ji-hyun, Kim Nam-gil, Ko Hyun-jung, Uhm Tae-woong, Lee Hyun-woo, Park Ye-jin, Shin Sae-kyeong', null, 'The life story of Queen Seondeok, the first queen of the Korean people during the Silla Dynasty.', 'The life story of Queen Seondeok, the first queen of the Korean people during the Silla Dynasty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ej1R5bxJ59kzzf7gYlqlEmclrUi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21771'),
  ('835476955691105771', 'The Great Rift: Africa''s Wild Heart', 2010, 'Documentary, Family', 'Phil Chapman', null, 'Hugh Quarshie', 'NR', 'A BBC/Animal Planet co-production, the three-part series focuses on the landscape and wildlife of the Great Rift Valley in East Africa.', 'A BBC/Animal Planet co-production, the three-part series focuses on the landscape and wildlife of the Great Rift Valley in East Africa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5MWrXpTMnF008urYZ22PwOExrkU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:33530'),
  ('431409994447615780', 'The Great Ruler', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, '孙郎朗, Li Shimeng, 江月, He Wenxiao, Zhang Fuzheng, Zhenyan Liu, Liu Cong', null, 'In the vast world, planes converge and numerous races thrive. A gathering of extraordinary talents unfolds, where one after another, supreme beings from the lower planes come forth. In this boundless realm, they weave captivating legends that inspire admiration, pursuing the path to dominance.', 'In the vast world, planes converge and numerous races thrive. A gathering of extraordinary talents unfolds, where one after another, supreme beings from the lower planes come forth. In this boundless realm, they weave captivating legends that inspire admiration, pursuing the path to dominance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6eI62O2pqkvwqjhLGd7EOHIPjq7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:226045'),
  ('786633033666050521', 'The Great Seljuks', 2020, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, War & Politics', 'Sedat İnci', 'Emre Konuk', 'Buğra Gülsoy, Ekin Koç, Hatice Şendil, Gürkan Uygun, Mehmet Özgür, Sevda Erginci, Bülent Alkış, İlker Kızmaz', null, 'The war of the Great Seljuk Emperor, Meliksah and her loyalist, Sencer against Hasan Sabbah, who is sworn to destroy the Seljuks.', 'The war of the Great Seljuk Emperor, Meliksah and her loyalist, Sencer against Hasan Sabbah, who is sworn to destroy the Seljuks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8B1nL3gthGN55BHTMzZOlzBYNkU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110655'),
  ('731379731193922810', 'The Great Shaman Ga Doo-shim', 2021, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kim Sae-ron, Nam Da-reum, Moon Sung-keun, Yoo Seon-ho, Bae Hae-seon, Yoon Jung-hoon, Lee Ji-won, Yoon Suk-hwa', null, '18-year-old Ga Doo Shim who wishes to live as a typical high schooler but is born with the undesired fate of becoming a shaman. She is a brave and strong character who will fight evil spirits as she works on solving mysterious cases. Na Woo Soo, a nearly perfect high schooler with a wealthy background, handsome looks, and outstanding grades. When Ga Doo Shim suddenly appears in his life, he gains the ability to see evil spirits, and the two get entangled in mysterious cases together.', '18-year-old Ga Doo Shim who wishes to live as a typical high schooler but is born with the undesired fate of becoming a shaman. She is a brave and strong character who will fight evil spirits as she works on solving mysterious cases. Na Woo Soo, a nearly perfect high schooler with a wealthy background, handsome looks, and outstanding grades. When Ga Doo Shim suddenly appears in his life, he gains the ability to see evil spirits, and the two get entangled in mysterious cases together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1XyUdGPRWfI79kGTqstXiHElVT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129096'),
  ('1035975651208202124', 'The Great Train Robbery', 2013, 'Drama', 'Chris Chibnall', null, 'Jim Broadbent, Luke Evans, Jack Roth, Robert Glenister, Paul Anderson, Neil Maskell, Martin Compston, Nicholas Murchie', 'TV-14', '8 August 1963: Britain wakes up to news of the biggest robbery in the country’s history. A train has been hijacked and robbed, 35 miles from its arrival in central London. The country is stunned. Who could be behind it? How did they pull off such an audacious raid?', '8 August 1963: Britain wakes up to news of the biggest robbery in the country’s history. A train has been hijacked and robbed, 35 miles from its arrival in central London. The country is stunned. Who could be behind it? How did they pull off such an audacious raid?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUbTniOTYkXjIUFh8QlTNEjbkpn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64257'),
  ('1122008874545482671', 'The Great War', 1964, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Michael Redgrave, Ralph Richardson, Emlyn Williams, Marius Goring, Cyril Luckham, Sebastian Shaw', null, 'A milestone 26-part history of the First World War, conceived to mark the 50th anniversary of its outbreak.', 'A milestone 26-part history of the First World War, conceived to mark the 50th anniversary of its outbreak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Nr5unuYg0amkXeRYgX0YoL0oHa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16082'),
  ('63738440312260185', 'The Great White Tower', 2003, 'Drama', 'Toyoko Yamasaki', null, 'Toshiaki Karasawa, Yosuke Eguchi, Hitomi Kuroki, Akiko Yada, Maki Mizuno, Masatô Ibu, Koji Ishizaka, Atsuko Takahata', null, 'Two surgeons with contrasting objectives are asked to work together in a city hospital. While one of them strives to achieve fame and power through his work, the other wants to save human lives.', 'Two surgeons with contrasting objectives are asked to work together in a city hospital. While one of them strives to achieve fame and power through his work, the other wants to save human lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AcpE3FOBkIILSlYGjtxuEjXJ4Et.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38242'),
  ('717138463937838756', 'The Greatest American Hero', 1981, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Crime', 'Stephen J. Cannell', null, 'William Katt, Robert Culp, Connie Sellecca, Faye Grant, Michael Paré, Jesse D. Goins, Don Cervantes', 'TV-14', 'The chronicles of teacher Ralph Hinkley''s adventures after a group of aliens gives him a red suit that gives him superhuman abilities. Unfortunately, Ralph, who hates wearing the suit, immediately loses its instruction booklet, and thus has to learn how to use its powers by trial and error, often with comical results.', 'The chronicles of teacher Ralph Hinkley''s adventures after a group of aliens gives him a red suit that gives him superhuman abilities. Unfortunately, Ralph, who hates wearing the suit, immediately loses its instruction booklet, and thus has to learn how to use its powers by trial and error, often with comical results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sViWrklUxxYw4ZYuGsrthnS63X2.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1909'),
  ('318513523659271894', 'The Greatest Demon Lord Is Reborn as a Typical Nobody', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Toshinari Fukamachi, Wakana Maruoka', 'TV-14', 'In his past life, he was known as Demon Lord Varvatos, an all-powerful magic user and ruler. But he was lonely after the loss of his friends and loved ones during his rise to power, so in his dying moments, Varvatos cast a reincarnation spell so that he''d get a second chance at just being a normal guy. At first it looks like that''s going to work – he''s reborn thousands of years later as villager Ard. Unfortunately for him, his memories are still intact and he''s not aware just how much has been lost over the time he spent not existing, and it looks like that''s going to cost him his normal life.', 'In his past life, he was known as Demon Lord Varvatos, an all-powerful magic user and ruler. But he was lonely after the loss of his friends and loved ones during his rise to power, so in his dying moments, Varvatos cast a reincarnation spell so that he''d get a second chance at just being a normal guy. At first it looks like that''s going to work – he''s reborn thousands of years later as villager Ard. Unfortunately for him, his memories are still intact and he''s not aware just how much has been lost over the time he spent not existing, and it looks like that''s going to cost him his normal life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtULGP3qRi932NzYGsp7u6q6zAS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:120155'),
  ('539661626230554812', 'The Greatest Event in Television History', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Naomi Scott, Adam Scott', null, 'Jeff Probst, Amanda Anka', 'TV-14', 'Adam Scott is determined to make the greatest event in television history by remaking the opening sequences of TV shows.', 'Adam Scott is determined to make the greatest event in television history by remaking the opening sequences of TV shows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abiiLt0LCFItR6VPtn5MT3NwJKK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:120516'),
  ('546147540730776962', 'The Greatest Love', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hong Jeong-eun, Hong Mi-ran', 'Hong Jeong-eun, Hong Mi-ran', 'Cha Seung-won, Gong Hyo-jin, Yoon Kye-sang, Yoo In-na, Han Jin-hee, Park Won-sook, Choi Hwa-jeong, Jeong Jun-ha', 'NR', 'Can you confidently love a person who you like but others don''t? Muster up the courage and a love that seems like the worst to others can become the best for you. The most-liked guy in the country, who is loved by everyone, and the most-disliked woman in the country, who is criticized by everyone, squeeze out that courage as their feelings for each other grow.', 'Can you confidently love a person who you like but others don''t? Muster up the courage and a love that seems like the worst to others can become the best for you. The most-liked guy in the country, who is loved by everyone, and the most-disliked woman in the country, who is criticized by everyone, squeeze out that courage as their feelings for each other grow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/foIZZlM7H8aB2AlA9xujrCdxDar.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39273'),
  ('638479670307972132', 'The Greatest Marriage', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', null, null, 'Park Si-yeon, Bae Soo-bin, No Min-woo, Cho Eun-ji, Jung Ae-yeun, Lee Jeong-kil, Park So-jin, Heo Joon-seok', null, 'Cha Ki Young was once a successful news anchor living the good life, but everything changed when she defied expectations and became a single mother. Jo Eun Cha was also once a news anchor, but left his career to campaign unsuccessfully for office. Though nothing quite pans out as expected for either Ki Young or Eun Cha, they''ve yet to discover what fate has in store for them. Meanwhile, four other couples grapple with whether or not they can really have it all in modern romance.', 'Cha Ki Young was once a successful news anchor living the good life, but everything changed when she defied expectations and became a single mother. Jo Eun Cha was also once a news anchor, but left his career to campaign unsuccessfully for office. Though nothing quite pans out as expected for either Ki Young or Eun Cha, they''ve yet to discover what fate has in store for them. Meanwhile, four other couples grapple with whether or not they can really have it all in modern romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iIPJgwACKzrSeHLm6F3L1L7j1x4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61486'),
  ('1008293459699890484', 'The Greatest Teacher', 2023, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Shogo Muto', 'Tsubaki Masataka', 'Mayu Matsuoka, Mana Ashida, Daiken Okudaira, Seishirou Katou, Ami Touma, Mizuki Kayashima, Soma Santoki, Hitomi Honda', null, 'Kujo Rina is a chemistry teacher and the homeroom teacher for the 3rd grade D class at Horai High School. She doesn''t have a bond with her students. On the school''s graduation day, Kujo Rina is pushed from the 4th floor and falls down. She is able to glimpse a school uniform sleeve on the person that pushed her. At that time, she wonders why she was pushed and that she does not want to die.', 'Kujo Rina is a chemistry teacher and the homeroom teacher for the 3rd grade D class at Horai High School. She doesn''t have a bond with her students. On the school''s graduation day, Kujo Rina is pushed from the 4th floor and falls down. She is able to glimpse a school uniform sleeve on the person that pushed her. At that time, she wonders why she was pushed and that she does not want to die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTDDEtGTfkL4nU5CcwL8tZSkKIC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:228921'),
  ('8794144446617159', 'The Greed of Man', 1992, 'Drama', 'Wai Ka-Fai', null, 'Adam Cheng Siu-Chow, Sean Lau Ching-wan, Amy Kwok', null, 'Told in reverse chronological order, the story starts in the present (June 7, 1994), when the stock market rebounded after the market became volatile and crashed for the weekend. After the stock market stopped trading for the weekend, the Ting''s make the wrong bet and their entire fortune is wiped out, compounded by ending up in billions of dollars in debt. Ting Hai forces his sons to commit suicide by jumping off from the top of the stock exchange building before following after them.', 'Told in reverse chronological order, the story starts in the present (June 7, 1994), when the stock market rebounded after the market became volatile and crashed for the weekend. After the stock market stopped trading for the weekend, the Ting''s make the wrong bet and their entire fortune is wiped out, compounded by ending up in billions of dollars in debt. Ting Hai forces his sons to commit suicide by jumping off from the top of the stock exchange building before following after them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ib3bGoQojw1YaSv902xjcZ9SXOL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:20382'),
  ('354365244848333112', 'The Green Glove Gang', 2022, 'Crime, Comedy', null, 'Bartosz Kozera', 'Magdalena Kuta, Małgorzata Potocka, Anna Romantowska, Krzysztof Tyniec, Mirosław Zbrojewicz, Karolina Rzepa, Andrzej Grabowski, Beata Bandurska', 'TV-MA', 'When their latest heist goes wrong, three older female burglars evade officials by hiding out in a nursing home — where they uncover a sinister secret.', 'When their latest heist goes wrong, three older female burglars evade officials by hiding out in a nursing home — where they uncover a sinister secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2xKTVxgny782RvjxCD5LfG7UqGL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:210750'),
