  ('675948666597812239', 'The Gryphon', 2023, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Sebastian Marka, Erol Yesilkaya', null, 'Jeremias Meyer, Zoran Pingel, Lea Drinda, Sabine Timoteo, Flora Thiemann, Yuri Völsch, Samirah Breuer, Thorsten Merten', 'TV-MA', 'The Gryphon, a dark power from another world, is a threat to Mark and all he loves. Mark must accept his heavy family legacy and go into battle to save our world from the Gryphon’s clutches.', 'The Gryphon, a dark power from another world, is a threat to Mark and all he loves. Mark must accept his heavy family legacy and go into battle to save our world from the Gryphon’s clutches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MJu2oVponxAZ3fods9dG8UE1l4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:221871'),
  ('562429955762066937', 'The Guardian', 2001, 'Drama', 'David Hollander', null, 'Simon Baker, Dabney Coleman, Alan Rosenberg, Wendy Moniz, Raphael Sbarge', 'TV-PG', 'Nick Fallin is a hotshot lawyer working at his father''s ultrasuccessful Pittsburgh law firm. Unfortunately, the high life has gotten the best of Nick. Arrested for drug use, he''s sentenced to do 1,500 hours of community service, somehow to be squeezed into his 24/7 cutthroat world of mergers, acquisitions and board meetings. Reluctantly, he''s now The Guardian - a part-time child advocate at Legal Aid Services, where one case after another is an eye-opening instance of kids caught up in difficult circumstances.', 'Nick Fallin is a hotshot lawyer working at his father''s ultrasuccessful Pittsburgh law firm. Unfortunately, the high life has gotten the best of Nick. Arrested for drug use, he''s sentenced to do 1,500 hours of community service, somehow to be squeezed into his 24/7 cutthroat world of mergers, acquisitions and board meetings. Reluctantly, he''s now The Guardian - a part-time child advocate at Legal Aid Services, where one case after another is an eye-opening instance of kids caught up in difficult circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5USMJz2qw9QBd8yHpguYSz7RzKA.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1791'),
  ('108139095328843481', 'The Guardians', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Zhang Yishan, Elvis Han, Zhang Tian''ai, Liu Huan, Zhu Gangrirao, Fan Shiran, Rain, He Qiang', null, 'In 1940s Shanghai, struggling actor Ding Yi is forced to impersonate a blind cryptography expert after agent Gu Yinshan mistakenly kills the real man. Disguised as his assistant, Gu Yinshan joins Ding Yi to infiltrate Japanese intelligence with the help of theater owner Xian Biyun. Facing constant danger, the unlikely duo form a deep brotherhood, but their clashing loyalties lead to an inevitable test of trust and sacrifice.', 'In 1940s Shanghai, struggling actor Ding Yi is forced to impersonate a blind cryptography expert after agent Gu Yinshan mistakenly kills the real man. Disguised as his assistant, Gu Yinshan joins Ding Yi to infiltrate Japanese intelligence with the help of theater owner Xian Biyun. Facing constant danger, the unlikely duo form a deep brotherhood, but their clashing loyalties lead to an inevitable test of trust and sacrifice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5fznpQAnFBCEzrmA3IjJmFcm81.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:271486'),
  ('382107128105766353', 'The Guardians of Carcosa', 2013, 'Animation, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Jin Jin', 'Jin Jin', 'Feifei Qiao, Wei Ruchen, Shan Xin, Qiuxiang Shen, Yang Ning, Li Xiaomeng, Ding Dang, Zhang Wei', null, 'The Guardians of Carcosa have made it their mission to protect all humans. Watch the battle for humanity ensue, and join adventures to the realms Carcosa Wonderland and beyond.', 'The Guardians of Carcosa have made it their mission to protect all humans. Watch the battle for humanity ensue, and join adventures to the realms Carcosa Wonderland and beyond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mBl9cq3SNSXqeegRve3RsqmeqFz.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:112191'),
