  ('599677234334309415', 'The Guilty', 2013, 'Mystery, Crime', null, 'Debbie O''Malley', 'Tamsin Greig, Arsher Ali, Tom Beard, Darren Boyd, Katherine Kelly, Linda Marlowe, Nicola Thorp', null, 'Lives are torn apart and relationships fractured forever when a young child goes missing. Five years later, DCI Maggie Brand leads a new investigation and puts at risk her own happy family life.', 'Lives are torn apart and relationships fractured forever when a young child goes missing. Five years later, DCI Maggie Brand leads a new investigation and puts at risk her own happy family life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l7htAfsU3mxRyJIpFsFGSNBpfH7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:58010'),
  ('647991904739656886', 'The Gulf', 2019, 'Crime', 'Paula Boock, Donna Malane', null, 'Kate Elliott, Ido Drent, Jeffrey Thomas, Mark Mitchinson, Dahnu Graham, Alison Bruce, Pana Hema-Taylor, Ross Brannigan', 'TV-14', 'A detective recovering from amnesia caused by a shocking car accident begins to suspect not everything is as it seems, following the reappearance of a young boy.', 'A detective recovering from amnesia caused by a shocking car accident begins to suspect not everything is as it seems, following the reappearance of a young boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8aFpUPQr3Swtbn1vMl1ovMuVgmK.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:92957'),
  ('123759168219617911', 'The Gumball Chronicles', 2020, 'Kids, Family, Animation', null, null, 'Duke Cutler, Christian J. Simon, Kyla Kowalewski, Teresa Gallagher, Dan Russell, Logan Grove, Jacob Hopkins, Nicolas Cantu', 'TV-Y7', 'The Gumball Chronicles is a spinoff mini-series based on The Amazing World of Gumball. The series predominantly consists of clips recycled from previous episodes but features some new content.', 'The Gumball Chronicles is a spinoff mini-series based on The Amazing World of Gumball. The series predominantly consists of clips recycled from previous episodes but features some new content.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Qukre5usOvrt27knGlVuQngT9I.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:133529'),
  ('62889201690387445', 'The Guyver: Bio-Booster Armor', 1989, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Yoshiki Takaya', 'Motonori Tachikawa', 'Takeshi Kusao, Kozo Shioya, Yuko Mizutani, Hideyuki Tanaka', null, 'The Guyver: Bio-Booster Armor is a 12 part anime OVA loosely based on Yoshiki Takaya''s manga, Bio-Booster Armor Guyver. It was released in Japan from 1989 to 1992. It is the second animated adaptation, following the 1986 OVA Guyver: Out of Control.', 'The Guyver: Bio-Booster Armor is a 12 part anime OVA loosely based on Yoshiki Takaya''s manga, Bio-Booster Armor Guyver. It was released in Japan from 1989 to 1992. It is the second animated adaptation, following the 1986 OVA Guyver: Out of Control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8LTyxMzMnN0zifWMBpJUwepslL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:45264'),
  ('156064689829724245', 'The Gymnastics Samurai', 2020, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Daisuke Namikawa, Rina Honnizumi, Kensho Ono, Kenyu Horiuchi, Yuki Kaji, Atsuko Tanaka, Kappei Yamaguchi', 'TV-14', 'In the year 2002, the formerly powerful Japanese men''s gymnastics team member Jotaro Aragaki is no longer able to compete. Even though he trained strenuously daily, he is asked about retiring by his coach Amakusa. However, a certain encounter alters Aragaki''s fate.', 'In the year 2002, the formerly powerful Japanese men''s gymnastics team member Jotaro Aragaki is no longer able to compete. Even though he trained strenuously daily, he is asked about retiring by his coach Amakusa. However, a certain encounter alters Aragaki''s fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/liHoITCCyZr9EB6KKl9VqKLOQ5H.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107408'),
  ('35601677627058500', 'The Gymnasts', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Ilaria Bernardini', null, 'Antonia Truppo, Filippo Nigro, Alessia de Falco, Giada Savi, Federica Cuomo, Eva Iurlaro, Giada Pirozzi, Emanuele Maria Di Stefano', null, 'Teenage obsessions clash with the brutal pressures of competitive training, when a team of young gymnasts compete in an elite tournament. Friendships are tested, rivalries flare, and some will do anything to win.', 'Teenage obsessions clash with the brutal pressures of competitive training, when a team of young gymnasts compete in an elite tournament. Friendships are tested, rivalries flare, and some will do anything to win.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uOZG2dI9FpICOzJrmsigqns3SNt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213228'),
  ('201360412402742968', 'The Gypsy Bride', 2022, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Nerea Barros, Darío Grandinetti, Vicente Romero Sánchez, Ignacio Montes, Lucía Martín Abello, Mona Martínez, Mónica Estarreado, Francesc Garrido', 'TV-MA', 'Set in the heart of the Spanish Romani community, the fiction follows police inspector Elena Blanco and her team, as they try to crack the crime case pertaining to the murders of sisters Lara and Susana Macaya, separated by a 7-year gap.', 'Set in the heart of the Spanish Romani community, the fiction follows police inspector Elena Blanco and her team, as they try to crack the crime case pertaining to the murders of sisters Lara and Susana Macaya, separated by a 7-year gap.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/19fHrTQ39NUqwwGl0JFsPv3gsIh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128020'),
  ('121837381408982969', 'The Hack', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jack Thorne', 'Jack Thorne, Annalisa D''Innella', 'David Tennant, Robert Carlyle, Rose Leslie, Dougray Scott, Toby Jones, Eve Myles, Steve Pemberton, Katherine Kelly', null, 'Set between 2002 and 2012, the drama deftly interweaves two real life stories, the uncovering of phone hacking at the News of the World, and running parallel, the investigation into the unsolved murder of private investigator Daniel Morgan.', 'Set between 2002 and 2012, the drama deftly interweaves two real life stories, the uncovering of phone hacking at the News of the World, and running parallel, the investigation into the unsolved murder of private investigator Daniel Morgan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yY5gamvZd82mZx7EVTkwqfAQU00.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:287167'),
  ('311611535933586294', 'The Halcyon', 2017, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Charlotte Jones', null, 'Steven Mackintosh, Olivia Williams, Hermione Corfield, Jamie Blackley, Edward Bluemel, Matt Ryan, Kara Tointon, Mark Benton', 'NR', 'The story of a bustling and glamorous five star hotel at the centre of London society and a world at war.', 'The story of a bustling and glamorous five star hotel at the centre of London society and a world at war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3DFB7WVrIrX1426R67TR65QyRMH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69129'),
  ('232479277255106742', 'The Hammer and the Rose: A Behzat Ç. Story', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Emrah Serbes', null, 'Erdal Beşikçioğlu, İnanç Konukçu, Berkan Şal, Ege Aydan, Güven Kıraç, Derin Beşikçioğlu, Ayça Eren, Eray Eserol', null, 'The Hammer and the Rose: A Behzat Ç. Story is a Turkish-made detective, adventure, comedy, and action internet series inspired by the novel of the same name by Emrah Serbes, which will be published in 2022.', 'The Hammer and the Rose: A Behzat Ç. Story is a Turkish-made detective, adventure, comedy, and action internet series inspired by the novel of the same name by Emrah Serbes, which will be published in 2022.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ImRBAUQd9y9cKcuhK7LJSn0fCt.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:209475'),
  ('47787597817560049', 'The Handmaid''s Tale', 2017, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Bruce Miller', null, 'Elisabeth Moss, Yvonne Strahovski, Samira Wiley', 'TV-MA', 'Set in a dystopian future, a woman is forced to live as a concubine under a fundamentalist theocratic dictatorship.', 'Set in a dystopian future, a woman is forced to live as a concubine under a fundamentalist theocratic dictatorship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGUT7j3n3rn5yGihlCgwUnD70HV.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:69478'),
  ('40183640903978445', 'The Hanna-Barbera New Cartoon Series', 1962, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Family', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, null, 'TV-G', 'The series included three short cartoon segments featuring funny animal characters: Wally Gator, Touché Turtle and Dum Dum and Lippy the Lion & Hardy Har Har.', 'The series included three short cartoon segments featuring funny animal characters: Wally Gator, Touché Turtle and Dum Dum and Lippy the Lion & Hardy Har Har.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3YWSeOz9GQbbDaKKn8nyZhhkKqh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15307'),
  ('43013748638887341', 'The Hard Times of RJ Berger', 2010, 'Comedy', 'David Katzenberg, Seth Grahame-Smith', 'Seth Grahame-Smith', 'Paul Iacono, Jareb Dauplaise, Kara Taitz, Amber Lancaster, Jayson Blair, Beth Littleford, Larry Poindexter, Ciena Rae', null, 'The Hard Times of RJ Berger was an American television comedy series created by David Katzenberg and Seth Grahame-Smith for MTV. The show''s central character is RJ Berger an unpopular sophomore at the fictional Pinkerton High School in Ohio who has an exceptionally large penis. Berger''s two best friends are Miles Jenner, whose ambitions for popularity cause him to clash with Berger, and goth girl Lily Miran, who has been lusting after Berger for several years. Berger''s love interest is Jenny Swanson, a cheerleader who is involved with Max Owens, a popular jock and bully. The show is presented as a coming of age story and has been described by Katzenberg and Grahame-Smith as a blend of the television series The Wonder Years and the film Superbad. The pilot episode premiered on June 6, 2010, and the first season of 12 episodes concluded August 23, 2010. MTV renewed The Hard Times of RJ Berger for a second season, which premiered on March 24, 2011, and concluded on May 30, 2011, but canceled the show that August.', 'The Hard Times of RJ Berger was an American television comedy series created by David Katzenberg and Seth Grahame-Smith for MTV. The show''s central character is RJ Berger an unpopular sophomore at the fictional Pinkerton High School in Ohio who has an exceptionally large penis. Berger''s two best friends are Miles Jenner, whose ambitions for popularity cause him to clash with Berger, and goth girl Lily Miran, who has been lusting after Berger for several years. Berger''s love interest is Jenny Swanson, a cheerleader who is involved with Max Owens, a popular jock and bully. The show is presented as a coming of age story and has been described by Katzenberg and Grahame-Smith as a blend of the television series The Wonder Years and the film Superbad. The pilot episode premiered on June 6, 2010, and the first season of 12 episodes concluded August 23, 2010. MTV renewed The Hard Times of RJ Berger for a second season, which premiered on March 24, 2011, and concluded on May 30, 2011, but canceled the show that August.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUARCVWGE1BSOc5B3Fz4StF5nBz.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:32942'),
  ('1000170691499018272', 'The Hardacres', 2024, 'Drama', 'Amy Roberts, Loren McLaughlan', null, 'Liam McMahon, Claire Cooper, Adam Little, Shannon Lavelle, Julie Graham, Siobhán O''Kelly, Mark Doherty, Taheen Modak', null, 'The sweeping rags to riches story of the Hardacres, a working-class family in 1890s Yorkshire who strike it rich and move from a grimy fish dock to a vast estate.', 'The sweeping rags to riches story of the Hardacres, a working-class family in 1890s Yorkshire who strike it rich and move from a grimy fish dock to a vast estate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHmGO337Fsx9JxWwaiyL7oen3AI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:231751'),
  ('69888250039374094', 'The Hardy Boys', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Jason Stone, Steve Cochrane', null, 'Rohan Campbell, Alexander Elliot, Keana Bastidas, Riley O''Donnell, Adam Swain, Bea Santos', 'TV-PG', 'When Frank and Joe Hardy arrive in Bridgeport, they set out to uncover the truth behind the recent tragedy that has changed their lives. In doing so, they stumble upon something much more sinister - something only the Hardy Boys can stop.', 'When Frank and Joe Hardy arrive in Bridgeport, they set out to uncover the truth behind the recent tragedy that has changed their lives. In doing so, they stumble upon something much more sinister - something only the Hardy Boys can stop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zO24XYR7pxsRHJJG9zzA5SRz48B.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:112945'),
  ('400195175707491469', 'The Hardy Boys / Nancy Drew Mysteries', 1977, 'Mystery, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Shaun Cassidy, Parker Stevenson', null, 'The Hardy Boys/Nancy Drew Mysteries is a television series which aired for three seasons on ABC. The series starred Parker Stevenson and Shaun Cassidy as amateur sleuth brothers Frank and Joe Hardy, respectively, and Pamela Sue Martin as girl detective Nancy Drew. The Hardy Boys/Nancy Drew Mysteries was unusual in that it often dealt with the characters individually, in an almost anthological style. That is, some episodes featured only the Hardy Boys and others only Nancy Drew.', 'The Hardy Boys/Nancy Drew Mysteries is a television series which aired for three seasons on ABC. The series starred Parker Stevenson and Shaun Cassidy as amateur sleuth brothers Frank and Joe Hardy, respectively, and Pamela Sue Martin as girl detective Nancy Drew. The Hardy Boys/Nancy Drew Mysteries was unusual in that it often dealt with the characters individually, in an almost anthological style. That is, some episodes featured only the Hardy Boys and others only Nancy Drew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2gNO5CI1U46a7faNu5aJUEsFS6H.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2928'),
  ('258394151131082302', 'The Harry Hill Show', 2026, 'Talk, Comedy', 'Harry Hill', null, 'Harry Hill', null, 'Hello there! It''s me, Harry Hill! I''ve got a new show, and this time, it''s visualised, A VODSCARF. Join me, my son Gary and Sarah the A.I Bot as we talk to a motley crew of comedians, celebrities and cultural icons, and if that wasn''t enough we all learn together as we speak to an expert on stuff like the big bang, day of the dead, and even FLIES as part of our theme of the week! PLUS introducing the game everyone is talking about, Name The Seed', 'Hello there! It''s me, Harry Hill! I''ve got a new show, and this time, it''s visualised, A VODSCARF. Join me, my son Gary and Sarah the A.I Bot as we talk to a motley crew of comedians, celebrities and cultural icons, and if that wasn''t enough we all learn together as we speak to an expert on stuff like the big bang, day of the dead, and even FLIES as part of our theme of the week! PLUS introducing the game everyone is talking about, Name The Seed', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:312402'),
  ('193205949017923888', 'The Haunted Hathaways', 2013, 'Comedy, Family', 'Robert Peacock', null, 'Amber Frank, Curtis Harris, Benjamin Flores Jr., Breanna Yde, Ginifer King, Chico Benymon', 'TV-G', 'When Michelle Hathaway relocates to New Orleans to open a bakery with her daughters Taylor and Frankie, they quickly learn that life in the “Big Easy” is very different. Unbeknownst to them, their new home is already occupied by a ghost family comprised of jazz musician father Ray Preston and his sons Miles and Louie. After agreeing to live under one roof, they come to care about and rely on one another while driving each other crazy – just like any normal family would. Though leery at first, the Hathaways soon discover how much fun life can be when living with ghosts.', 'When Michelle Hathaway relocates to New Orleans to open a bakery with her daughters Taylor and Frankie, they quickly learn that life in the “Big Easy” is very different. Unbeknownst to them, their new home is already occupied by a ghost family comprised of jazz musician father Ray Preston and his sons Miles and Louie. After agreeing to live under one roof, they come to care about and rely on one another while driving each other crazy – just like any normal family would. Though leery at first, the Hathaways soon discover how much fun life can be when living with ghosts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUhGlPZVWf8KCt4xMZtG1cymHRZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:59268'),
  ('904555611822397210', 'The Haunted House', 2016, 'Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Cho Hyun-jung, Kim Young-eun, Kim Chae-ha', 'TV-PG', 'With help from a 102-year-old goblin dwelling beneath their haunted apartment building, two siblings deal with ghosts and take on spooky mysteries.', 'With help from a 102-year-old goblin dwelling beneath their haunted apartment building, two siblings deal with ghosts and take on spooky mysteries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDmy9WeyfajqdLJUN0FXWGwdV4r.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:70288'),
  ('1011944740189794853', 'The Haunted Palace', 2025, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Yoon Soo-Jung', null, 'Yook Sung-jae, Bona, Kim Ji-hoon, Kil Hae-yeon, Kim Sang-ho, Shin Seul-ki, Son Byung-ho, Han So-eun', null, 'In a world of folklore and mysticism, a vengeful spirit and a devoted shaman cross paths, sparking a journey of love and redemption', 'In a world of folklore and mysticism, a vengeful spirit and a devoted shaman cross paths, sparking a journey of love and redemption', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nR1cuxMOPqHHapEzORa8RESKrWG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259486'),
  ('496232009346043289', 'The Haunting of Bly Manor', 2020, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Mike Flanagan', 'Jamie Flanagan', 'Victoria Pedretti, Oliver Jackson-Cohen, Henry Thomas, Amelia Eve, T''Nia Miller, Rahul Kohli, Tahirah Sharif, Amelie Bea Smith', 'TV-MA', 'After an au pair''s tragic death, Henry Wingrave hires a young American nanny to care for his orphaned niece and nephew who reside at Bly Manor with the estate''s chef Owen, groundskeeper Jamie and housekeeper, Mrs. Grose. But all is not as it seems at the manor, and centuries of dark secrets of love and loss are waiting to be unearthed in this chilling tale.', 'After an au pair''s tragic death, Henry Wingrave hires a young American nanny to care for his orphaned niece and nephew who reside at Bly Manor with the estate''s chef Owen, groundskeeper Jamie and housekeeper, Mrs. Grose. But all is not as it seems at the manor, and centuries of dark secrets of love and loss are waiting to be unearthed in this chilling tale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vIXQ8UymmQ7zJEPrKJP3s3fSbhR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109958'),
  ('877454934070393243', 'The Haunting of Hill House', 2018, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Mike Flanagan', null, 'Michiel Huisman, Elizabeth Reaser, Kate Siegel, Oliver Jackson-Cohen, Victoria Pedretti, Timothy Hutton, Carla Gugino, Henry Thomas', 'TV-MA', 'Flashing between past and present, a fractured family confronts haunting memories of their old home and the terrifying events that drove them from it.', 'Flashing between past and present, a fractured family confronts haunting memories of their old home and the terrifying events that drove them from it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38PkhBGRQtmVx2drvPik3F42qHO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72844'),
  ('50162875837280713', 'The Haunting Of...', 2012, 'Mystery, Documentary', null, null, 'Kim Russo', 'TV-PG', 'Featuring psychic-medium Kim Russo, "The Haunting of..." gives an exclusive look at celebrities who have had their lives changed by paranormal events.', 'Featuring psychic-medium Kim Russo, "The Haunting of..." gives an exclusive look at celebrities who have had their lives changed by paranormal events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kDE6PPFCG7kwXKPuU6vw65Ggc5G.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:62900'),
  ('953284745636894021', 'The Head', 1994, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Eric Fogel', null, 'Jason Candler, Eric Fogel, Russ Hexter, Frank Gresham, Lisa Rubish', null, 'Jim (The Head) is an animated mutant super-hero with an insanely large cranium. A freak encounter left him with a problem. A big one: he''s got an alien named Roy living inside his oversized dome.', 'Jim (The Head) is an animated mutant super-hero with an insanely large cranium. A freak encounter left him with a problem. A big one: he''s got an alien named Roy living inside his oversized dome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bq4VQYVS1Wz7Ufp1xqdJenapPtu.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2280'),
  ('887962056297513151', 'The Head', 2020, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Àlex Pastor, David Pastor', null, 'Katharine O''Donnelly, John Lynch, Olivia Morris, Ben Cura, Stanley Weber, Clara Galle, Riko Nakazono, Godehard Giese', 'TV-14', 'In an isolated and inaccessible Antarctic research station in which winter has fallen on the South Pole and the sun will soon disappear for the next six months, a small team, known as the Winterers, remain at the Polaris VI Antarctic Research Station to continue their innovative research. Renowned biologist Arthur Wilde is determined to find a solution to climate change, but his quest turns into a nightmare when several of his esteemed scientists suddenly begin to die.', 'In an isolated and inaccessible Antarctic research station in which winter has fallen on the South Pole and the sun will soon disappear for the next six months, a small team, known as the Winterers, remain at the Polaris VI Antarctic Research Station to continue their innovative research. Renowned biologist Arthur Wilde is determined to find a solution to climate change, but his quest turns into a nightmare when several of his esteemed scientists suddenly begin to die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFiFKWx8nBjo3iRYcosdJeYUtaX.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:102434'),
  ('629064921041812082', 'The Head of Joaquín Murrieta', 2023, 'Drama, Western, Action & Adventure', 'Diego Ramírez Schrempp, Mauricio Leiva-Cock', null, 'Juan Manuel Bernal, Steve Wilcox, Alejandro Speitzer, Becky Zhu Wu, Aida López, Gustavo Carr, Yoshira Escárrega, Emiliano Zurita', 'TV-MA', 'Greed took over California because of the gold rush. It made people thirsty for wealth and land. There, in the newly drawn border between Mexico and the US, a lawless war for control, fueled by the anger and xenophobia of the past war, is led by a group of immigrants who join forces to create the myth of the Latin Robin Hood: Joaquín Murrieta.', 'Greed took over California because of the gold rush. It made people thirsty for wealth and land. There, in the newly drawn border between Mexico and the US, a lawless war for control, fueled by the anger and xenophobia of the past war, is led by a group of immigrants who join forces to create the myth of the Latin Robin Hood: Joaquín Murrieta.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/szYenUSJozmEF9Bsc96mtfirix.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135502'),
  ('470274320432715694', 'The Healer Who Was Banished from His Party, Is, in Fact, the Strongest', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Kaori Maeda, Kensho Ono, Hina Tachibana, Ayaka Asai, Yuuichirou Umehara, Shunichi Toki, Marie Hashimoto, Rie Hikisaka', 'TV-14', 'Two centuries have passed since a hero defeated the evil Jaryu and saved the world. In one of the many dungeon cities, Raust, a healer scorned and cast out of his party for being too weak, struggles to find his place. Amidst despair, he meets martial artist Narsena, who invites him to form a new party together. With a fresh start and renewed motivation, the two begin their journey to greatness.', 'Two centuries have passed since a hero defeated the evil Jaryu and saved the world. In one of the many dungeon cities, Raust, a healer scorned and cast out of his party for being too weak, struggles to find his place. Amidst despair, he meets martial artist Narsena, who invites him to form a new party together. With a fresh start and renewed motivation, the two begin their journey to greatness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mloJqPmcp7UggYWGeEpSoOjPosk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:244625'),
  ('894679508182594738', 'The Healing Powers of Dude', 2020, 'Kids, Comedy, Drama', 'Erica Spates, Sam Littenberg-Weisberg', null, 'Jace Chapman, Gabrielle Quinn, Sophie Kim, Larisa Oleynik, Mauricio Lara, Tolga Kahraman, Laurel Emory', null, 'Noah, an 11-year-old boy with social anxiety disorder, has to start middle school, he turns to a mutt named Dude, a sarcastic emotional support dog who might need Noah as much as Noah needs him.', 'Noah, an 11-year-old boy with social anxiety disorder, has to start middle school, he turns to a mutt named Dude, a sarcastic emotional support dog who might need Noah as much as Noah needs him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oM3TaNKBnq8O8cDcuhrDUtY6pDk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97441'),
  ('420730317122429919', 'The Heart', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Mark Chao You-Ting, Mao Xiaotong, Jin Shijia, Chen Haoyu, Yutong Zhao, Jin Shikang, Joan Chen, Liao Xueqiu', null, 'Xiao Feng is the Deputy Chief Physician of the Cardiology Department at Dongli Hospital. He is introverted and strict. He becomes work partners with the impulsive doctor Lin Yi, yet friction arises due to the differences in their medical beliefs. Meanwhile, Xiao Feng''s younger sister also gets a job working as a doctor at the Intensive Care Unit.', 'Xiao Feng is the Deputy Chief Physician of the Cardiology Department at Dongli Hospital. He is introverted and strict. He becomes work partners with the impulsive doctor Lin Yi, yet friction arises due to the differences in their medical beliefs. Meanwhile, Xiao Feng''s younger sister also gets a job working as a doctor at the Intensive Care Unit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oCwfg5xVsUh9Yg4R51DtE1hmKys.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:233076'),
  ('741945987787587987', 'The Heart Is Never Wrong', 2019, 'Soap', 'Juan Osorio Ortiz', 'Pablo Ferrer García-Travesí, Santiago Pineda Aliceda, Juan Osorio Ortiz', 'Joaquín Bondoni, Laura Vignatti, Emiliano Vázquez, Allison Coronado, Vadhir Tiscareño, Nikolás Caballero, Eduardo Barquín, Bruno Santamaría', 'NR', 'Love story between Aristóteles & Temo, who leave Oaxaca to start a new life together in Mexico City.', 'Love story between Aristóteles & Temo, who leave Oaxaca to start a new life together in Mexico City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26cHDc2FmAjNRMTxgU0abvRp9Ke.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90630'),
  ('989759585775359216', 'The Heart Killers', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Kanaphan Puitrakul, Thanawat Ratanakitpaisan, Archen Aydin, Natachai Boonprasert, Kanthee Limpitkranon', null, 'A mission to expose two assassin brothers spirals when Kant’s feelings for one of them threaten to blow his cover—and maybe more.', 'A mission to expose two assassin brothers spirals when Kant’s feelings for one of them threaten to blow his cover—and maybe more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lFnwJJ9xOLPXJFYuIWlARmF9Gy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:252617'),
  ('546591391111862039', 'The Heart of Genius', 2022, 'Drama, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Chang Er', null, 'Lei Jiayin, Zhang Zifeng, Zhang Xincheng', null, 'A mysterious mathematical formula accidentally took Lin Chaoqi to a parallel world when she was 13 years old. In this strange adventure, with the previous years of accumulated experience in the Olympiad competition Lin Chaoqi with a buff suddenly found that those who had let down the time, abandoned beliefs, unfinished dreams, missed ties, and even her father''s incurable disease, as she enters this alternate universe, everything can be made up for. Even those who have the worst possible starting point, there is still infinite possibilities.', 'A mysterious mathematical formula accidentally took Lin Chaoqi to a parallel world when she was 13 years old. In this strange adventure, with the previous years of accumulated experience in the Olympiad competition Lin Chaoqi with a buff suddenly found that those who had let down the time, abandoned beliefs, unfinished dreams, missed ties, and even her father''s incurable disease, as she enters this alternate universe, everything can be made up for. Even those who have the worst possible starting point, there is still infinite possibilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bWWb2msvPS9Aeb4dHYRDX7BPYpX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:206489'),
  ('570782500438277724', 'The Heaven Sword and Dragon Saber', 1994, 'Drama', 'Lai Shui-Ching', 'Vera Lai-Wah Chan, Edwin Chin-Pok Kwan', 'Cecilia Yip Tung, Kathy Chow Hoi-Mei, Sun Xing, Ma Jingtao, Lee Li-Chun, Ku Feng, Chien Te-Men, Danny Lau Dan', null, 'Zhang Cuishan of the Wudang Sect was despised by the decent sect of the world because of his love for Yin Susu, the daughter of the cult hall master Baimeiying. Fortunately, Zhang Sanfeng, the head of the Wudang Sect, understood the righteousness and accepted them and his son Zhang Wuji (played by Ma Jingtao). However, the so-called upright sect does not stop. On this day, the Wudang sect gathered together and asked Zhang Cuishan to tell the whereabouts of the golden lion king Xie Xun, who had betrayed his brothers and cult. Zhang Cuishan was chivalrous and refused to betray his brothers. In front of the six major factions. In this way, Zhang Wuji became an orphan.', 'Zhang Cuishan of the Wudang Sect was despised by the decent sect of the world because of his love for Yin Susu, the daughter of the cult hall master Baimeiying. Fortunately, Zhang Sanfeng, the head of the Wudang Sect, understood the righteousness and accepted them and his son Zhang Wuji (played by Ma Jingtao). However, the so-called upright sect does not stop. On this day, the Wudang sect gathered together and asked Zhang Cuishan to tell the whereabouts of the golden lion king Xie Xun, who had betrayed his brothers and cult. Zhang Cuishan was chivalrous and refused to betray his brothers. In front of the six major factions. In this way, Zhang Wuji became an orphan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9BI9XjtwBflp1IA1ybUkUqyA6Z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90558'),
  ('633949156348645371', 'The Heaven Sword and Dragon Saber', 2000, 'Drama', 'Wai-kin Chong', 'Wing-Mui Leung', 'Lawrence Ng Kai-Wah, Gigi Lai Chi, Charmaine Sheh Sze-Man, Damian Lau Chung-Yan, Michelle Yim, Felix Lok Ying-Kwan, Liz Kong Hei-Man, Joyce Tang Lai-Ming', null, 'The Heavenly Sword and Dragon Saber is a Hong Kong television series adapted from Louis Cha''s novel of the same title. The series was first broadcast on TVB Jade in Hong Kong in 2000.', 'The Heavenly Sword and Dragon Saber is a Hong Kong television series adapted from Louis Cha''s novel of the same title. The series was first broadcast on TVB Jade in Hong Kong in 2000.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMyMnJOkwzYDyjlpSGhrzSSSg5z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32001'),
  ('197206272531767799', 'The Heavenly Idol', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Park So-yeon, Lee So-yoon', 'Lee Chun-geum', 'Kim Min-gue, Go Bo-gyeol, Lee Jang-woo, Oh Jin-seok, Ye Ji-won, Shin Myung-sung, Tak Jae-hoon, Park Sang-nam', null, 'Pontifex Lembrary fights against a devil, he gets transferred to a different world possessing the body of Woo Yeon-woo who is a member of an unpopular idol group called Wild Animal. In an entertainment business where overwhelming social skills, trendiness, and talents are highly necessary, it is hard for solemn, holy Lembrary to adapt. Due to his inappropriate says and dos as a celebrity, Lembrary is talked about from the public and receives attention that he did not expect. Using his goodness and love, Lembrary heals this twisted and barren world people live in while going this way and that way to settle himself as an idol.', 'Pontifex Lembrary fights against a devil, he gets transferred to a different world possessing the body of Woo Yeon-woo who is a member of an unpopular idol group called Wild Animal. In an entertainment business where overwhelming social skills, trendiness, and talents are highly necessary, it is hard for solemn, holy Lembrary to adapt. Due to his inappropriate says and dos as a celebrity, Lembrary is talked about from the public and receives attention that he did not expect. Using his goodness and love, Lembrary heals this twisted and barren world people live in while going this way and that way to settle himself as an idol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJCgCO3NkBpRr7KPTVYrtva9daj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:202625'),
  ('161582731751490690', 'The Heike Story', 2022, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Aoi Yuuki, Takahiro Sakurai, Saori Hayami, Miyu Irino, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Natsuki Hanae, Tessyo Genda, Kikuko Inoue', 'TV-14', 'A young orphan named Biwa is taken in by the powerful Taira Clan—also known as the Heike—after their leader witnesses her extraordinary psychic abilities. Unfortunately, what she predicts is a future of bloodshed, violence, and civil war. Inspired by the 12th-century epic tale Heike Monogatari.', 'A young orphan named Biwa is taken in by the powerful Taira Clan—also known as the Heike—after their leader witnesses her extraordinary psychic abilities. Unfortunately, what she predicts is a future of bloodshed, violence, and civil war. Inspired by the 12th-century epic tale Heike Monogatari.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCqeRND1KqfQblDDD50S0VGfNP8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132664'),
  ('130832477227603654', 'The Heirs', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kim Eun-sook', 'Kim Eun-sook', 'Park Shin-hye, Lee Min-ho, Kim Woo-bin, Kim Ji-won, Kang Min-hyuk, Choi Jin-hyuk, Krystal Jung, Kang Ha-neul', null, 'After a chance encounter in LA, two teens from different social backgrounds reunite at an exclusive high school attended by Korea''s über rich.', 'After a chance encounter in LA, two teens from different social backgrounds reunite at an exclusive high school attended by Korea''s über rich.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4RX9QVXjHbMB31TDWqqRLjshgu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:48462'),
  ('463853075179235394', 'The Helicopter Heist', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Ronnie Sandahl', 'Ronnie Sandahl', 'Mahmut Suvakci, Ardalan Esmaili, Iskra Kostic, Erik Svedberg-Zelman, Vic Carmen Sonne, Johanna Hedberg, Elmira Arikan, Dejan Milacic', 'TV-MA', 'Two childhood friends decide to try one last heist — to rob millions from Sweden''s safest cash depot. But the police are already on their heels.', 'Two childhood friends decide to try one last heist — to rob millions from Sweden''s safest cash depot. But the police are already on their heels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fKZyNZJCIrAll8thK4QyNVkRHy5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:244207'),
  ('1099076544647553335', 'The Helpful Fox Senko-san', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Azumi Waki, Junichi Suwabe, Ayane Sakura, Maaya Uchida, Eri Kitamura, Rie Kugimiya', 'TV-14', 'Sometimes the cure to a hard day’s work is the tender love and care of…a fox girl?! Salaryman Nakano’s stressful life is suddenly intruded upon by the fox, Senko-san, who is eager to help him heal his exhaustion. Whether she’s cooking, cleaning, or finding other ways to care for Nakano, she’s there to take away his stress!', 'Sometimes the cure to a hard day’s work is the tender love and care of…a fox girl?! Salaryman Nakano’s stressful life is suddenly intruded upon by the fox, Senko-san, who is eager to help him heal his exhaustion. Whether she’s cooking, cleaning, or finding other ways to care for Nakano, she’s there to take away his stress!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pygu154QHVzb0Ro3PKTdFBKcdiY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87461'),
  ('426231353720422331', 'The Herculoids', 1967, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Alex Toth', null, 'Don Messick, Virginia Gregg, Mike Road, Sparky Marcus, Ted Cassidy, Ted Eccles', null, 'Somewhere out in the deep space live the Herculoids. Humanoid Zandor, along with his wife Tara and son Dorno, lead a group of unique creatures: Zok the flying dragon, powerful simian Igoo, rhinoceros hybrid Tundro and two protoplasmic wonders named Gloop and Gleep. Together, they use their diverse super strengths to defend their utopian planet against attack from sinister invaders.', 'Somewhere out in the deep space live the Herculoids. Humanoid Zandor, along with his wife Tara and son Dorno, lead a group of unique creatures: Zok the flying dragon, powerful simian Igoo, rhinoceros hybrid Tundro and two protoplasmic wonders named Gloop and Gleep. Together, they use their diverse super strengths to defend their utopian planet against attack from sinister invaders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uoNk7Lkt44lIaosI2clzQZMAqgY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3578'),
  ('745261512379977561', 'The Herd With Colin Cowherd', 2015, 'Talk', 'Colin Cowherd', null, 'Colin Cowherd', 'NR', 'The Herd with Colin Cowherd (or simply The Herd) is an American sports talk show hosted by Colin Cowherd. A simulcast, it airs as both a sports talk radio show and television broadcast on Fox Sports Radio and Fox Sports 1, respectively. The show features commentary on the day''s sports news, perspective on other news stories, and interviews with celebrities, sports analysts and sports figures.', 'The Herd with Colin Cowherd (or simply The Herd) is an American sports talk show hosted by Colin Cowherd. A simulcast, it airs as both a sports talk radio show and television broadcast on Fox Sports Radio and Fox Sports 1, respectively. The show features commentary on the day''s sports news, perspective on other news stories, and interviews with celebrities, sports analysts and sports figures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/XocBb4MIV7mxhpl9aivYAdkrph.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:133532'),
  ('1092757533181180894', 'The Heroes From Shaolin', 1993, 'Drama', null, null, 'Amy Kwok, Deric Wan, Gigi Lai Chi, Noel Leung, Eddie Cheung Siu-Fai, Law Lok-Lam, Gordon Liu Chia-Hui, Jason Pai Piao', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bPt0gasaiTOE6X9uVXfhsmRCmiu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95527'),
  ('365660924321550400', 'The Heroic Legend of Arslan', 2015, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics', null, null, 'Yusuke Kobayashi, Daisuke Namikawa, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Natsuki Hanae, Kenta Miyake, Maaya Sakamoto, Yuki Kaji, Ai Kayano', null, 'Arslan is the heir apparent of Pars, a strong nation that sits at the hear of the trade route connecting the East and the West. When the pagan nation of Lusitania begins an invasion of Pars, the timid Arslan is confronted with battle for the first time. His worst anxieties are realized the Parsian army falls for a Lusitanian stratagem and are routed. He barely escapes with his life, thanks to the loyal and indomitable warrior Daryun. Together they will stand against the invasion and the cruelties of fate that are about to blow down on Pars.', 'Arslan is the heir apparent of Pars, a strong nation that sits at the hear of the trade route connecting the East and the West. When the pagan nation of Lusitania begins an invasion of Pars, the timid Arslan is confronted with battle for the first time. His worst anxieties are realized the Parsian army falls for a Lusitanian stratagem and are routed. He barely escapes with his life, thanks to the loyal and indomitable warrior Daryun. Together they will stand against the invasion and the cruelties of fate that are about to blow down on Pars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6F6pGoNNtIViDxHkU4wDeseiyJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62430'),
  ('691882799241603881', 'The Heroic Legend of Arslan: Age of Heroes', 1991, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kazuki Yao, Shuichi Ikeda, Masako Katsuki, Kappei Yamaguchi, Kazuhiko Inoue, Kaneto Shiozawa', null, 'As an unnaturally heavy mist descends on the battlefield, King Andragoras and his most valued officers confer among the bodies of dead and dying soldiers. When Daryoon, a young but highly skilled officer, voices his reluctance to send men into battle under these conditions, the king, unstable and enraged, banishes him. Now, Daryoon''s new mission is to insure the safety of the King''s only son, Prince Arislan. Daryoon and Prince Arislan set off on a quest of their own, but they can''t succeed alone. They must convince both the Lord Narsus and his companion, the archer Elam, to join them in their quest to somehow help the soldiers win the war. Now a group of only six they must somehow overcome an enemy of 300,000 soldiers! These unlikely soldiers have fate on their side, so anything can happen!', 'As an unnaturally heavy mist descends on the battlefield, King Andragoras and his most valued officers confer among the bodies of dead and dying soldiers. When Daryoon, a young but highly skilled officer, voices his reluctance to send men into battle under these conditions, the king, unstable and enraged, banishes him. Now, Daryoon''s new mission is to insure the safety of the King''s only son, Prince Arislan. Daryoon and Prince Arislan set off on a quest of their own, but they can''t succeed alone. They must convince both the Lord Narsus and his companion, the archer Elam, to join them in their quest to somehow help the soldiers win the war. Now a group of only six they must somehow overcome an enemy of 300,000 soldiers! These unlikely soldiers have fate on their side, so anything can happen!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vhSV1vHO84TVXmEnu80qGhQnuuh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87053'),
  ('772809683930053218', 'The Hidden Dungeon Only I Can Enter', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ryota Osaka, Miyu Tomita, Rumi Okubo, Yui Horie, Akari Kito, Yuki Nagano', 'TV-14', 'The Hidden Dungeon is a place of legend where rare treasures and items are hidden. Nor, the third son of an impoverished noble family who''s lost the one job offer he had, was lucky enough to hear about this dungeon. He then acquires a skill that allows him to create, bestow, and edit skills... and in order to use it, he needs to accumulate points by carrying out such tasks as eating delicious meals and doing sexual things with alluring members of the opposite sex.', 'The Hidden Dungeon is a place of legend where rare treasures and items are hidden. Nor, the third son of an impoverished noble family who''s lost the one job offer he had, was lucky enough to hear about this dungeon. He then acquires a skill that allows him to create, bestow, and edit skills... and in order to use it, he needs to accumulate points by carrying out such tasks as eating delicious meals and doing sexual things with alluring members of the opposite sex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTZZrTr72PKnEVm5bIt3AlHzNpm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103157'),
  ('621428091714698649', 'The High Chaparral', 1967, 'Western, Drama', 'David Dortort', null, 'Henry Darrow, Cameron Mitchell, Leif Erickson, Linda Cristal', 'TV-G', 'The High Chaparral is an American Western-themed television series starring Leif Erickson and Cameron Mitchell which aired on NBC from 1967 to 1971. The series, made by Xanadu Productions in association with NBC Productions, was created by David Dortort, who had previously created the hit Bonanza for the network. The theme song was also written and conducted by Bonanza scorer David Rose, who also scored the two-hour pilot.', 'The High Chaparral is an American Western-themed television series starring Leif Erickson and Cameron Mitchell which aired on NBC from 1967 to 1971. The series, made by Xanadu Productions in association with NBC Productions, was created by David Dortort, who had previously created the hit Bonanza for the network. The theme song was also written and conducted by Bonanza scorer David Rose, who also scored the two-hour pilot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2aiki9WLZWbv6PIl5CESOYdmOGj.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:11096'),
  ('515888532087359026', 'The High Fructose Adventures of Annoying Orange', 2012, 'Action & Adventure', 'Dane Boedigheimer, Tom Sheppard', null, 'Dane Boedigheimer, Harland Williams, Justine Ezarik, Toby Turner, Kevin Brueck, Bobby Jennings', 'TV-PG', 'An American live-action/animated TV series based on the characters from the popular web series The Annoying Orange.', 'An American live-action/animated TV series based on the characters from the popular web series The Annoying Orange.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9a07S3C2OUdiVMP5jRIKitFYhIM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:42307'),
  ('760898641373675654', 'The High School Heroes', 2021, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Yuya Takahashi, Toshio Yoshitaka, Masaya Kakei', 'Iwasaki Taisho, Nasu Yuto, Ryuga Sato, Fujii Naoki, ISSEI, Ukisho Hidaka, Yumena Yanai, Ayaka Minami', null, 'Gosei School has a long history. The principal of the school is highly ambitious and he tries to achieve his goals by using supernatural majin powers. Six students go up against the principal. The students are Taisei Manaka (Taisho Iwasaki), Ryuhei Domon (Ryuga Sato), Yusuke Takigawa (Yuto Nasu), Hyuma Oura (Hidaka Ukisho), Naoya Morimura (Naoki Fujii) and Ichika Sakurai (Issei Kanasashi).', 'Gosei School has a long history. The principal of the school is highly ambitious and he tries to achieve his goals by using supernatural majin powers. Six students go up against the principal. The students are Taisei Manaka (Taisho Iwasaki), Ryuhei Domon (Ryuga Sato), Yusuke Takigawa (Yuto Nasu), Hyuma Oura (Hidaka Ukisho), Naoya Morimura (Naoki Fujii) and Ichika Sakurai (Issei Kanasashi).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jcqyMxnH7PiifEomISUyXj3EvhN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129351'),
  ('139919090299709737', 'The Highschool Life of a Fudanshi', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Wataru Hatano, Kenji Nojima, Aya Suzaki, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Toshiki Masuda', null, 'Sakaguchi is a high school boy and also a "fudanshi" who loves boys-love stories. He hangs out with his friends, a fujoshi named Rumi, his gay friend Yūjirō, fellow fundashi Daigo, and his "normal" friend Nakamura.', 'Sakaguchi is a high school boy and also a "fudanshi" who loves boys-love stories. He hangs out with his friends, a fujoshi named Rumi, his gay friend Yūjirō, fellow fundashi Daigo, and his "normal" friend Nakamura.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p3B27eOXibFnpSuaxDPhgOVc1wo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67013'),
  ('931177034958154697', 'The Highway', 2024, 'Drama', null, 'Oleg Malovichko', 'Karina Razumovskaya, Aleksandr Ilyin Jr, Anna Mikhalkova, Elizaveta Ischenko, Semen Serzin, Sergey Umanov, Danil Steklov, Alexey Fateev', null, 'Svetlana sets out to find her adopted daughter, who left to find her real parents and disappeared. At the same time in this resort town, a thirteen-year-old girl shoots her sleeping family, after which she tries to hang herself. A neighbor comes running to the gunshots and pulls the girl out of the noose. The head of the police of the district entrusts the investigation of the high-profile case to investigator Elvira Barayeva. But how are Svetlana, a St. Petersburg judge with a dark past, and her adopted daughter Kira connected to this case and this place?', 'Svetlana sets out to find her adopted daughter, who left to find her real parents and disappeared. At the same time in this resort town, a thirteen-year-old girl shoots her sleeping family, after which she tries to hang herself. A neighbor comes running to the gunshots and pulls the girl out of the noose. The head of the police of the district entrusts the investigation of the high-profile case to investigator Elvira Barayeva. But how are Svetlana, a St. Petersburg judge with a dark past, and her adopted daughter Kira connected to this case and this place?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6zhYct2hfYBE1iBJ3gBQcyyWWrF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:250928'),
  ('810784183848578392', 'The Highwayman', 1987, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Douglas Heyes, Glen A. Larson', null, 'Sam J. Jones, Mark "Jacko" Jackson, Tim Russ, Jane Badler', null, 'The Highwaymen fight crime in the near future.', 'The Highwaymen fight crime in the near future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jvGqiUAG9EDFyT26ravM26zamOb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3802'),
  ('927283857521175154', 'The Hijacking of Flight 601', 2024, 'Drama', 'C.S. Prince, Pablo González', 'Ana Kata Carmona, Miguel Ángel Fajardo', 'Monica Lopera, Ángela Cano, Christian Tappán, Enrique Carriazo, Carlos-Manuel Vesga, Ilenia Antonini, Valentín Villafañe, Juan Pablo Raba', 'TV-MA', 'After a plane is hijacked, two flight attendants must outwit their assailants amid intense negotiations in the air and on the ground. Based on real events.', 'After a plane is hijacked, two flight attendants must outwit their assailants amid intense negotiations in the air and on the ground. Based on real events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AcSOs5wLPB9GGFY1Bact3V0riQE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:249548'),
  ('482498359980641914', 'The Hilarious House of Frightenstein', 1971, 'Comedy, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Billy Van, Ross Perigoe', null, 'Billy Van, Vincent Price, Fishka Rais, Guy Big, Mitch Markowitz, Julius Sumner Miller', null, 'The Hilarious House of Frightenstein, was a quirky Canadian sketch comedy TV series from the 1970s that included some genuine educational content among the humour. It featured the talented Billy Van, who played a variety of characters, Fishka Rais played the role of Igor, Guy Big brought Count Munchkinstein to life, and the legendary Vincent Price made special guest appearances as The Host who would start each episode with: “Another lovely day begins, for ghosts and ghouls with greenish skin. So close your eyes and you will find that you’ve arrived in Frightenstein. Perhaps the Count will find a way to make his monster work today. For if he solves this monster-mania, he can return to Transylvania! So welcome where the sun won’t shine, to the castle of Count Frightenstein!”', 'The Hilarious House of Frightenstein, was a quirky Canadian sketch comedy TV series from the 1970s that included some genuine educational content among the humour. It featured the talented Billy Van, who played a variety of characters, Fishka Rais played the role of Igor, Guy Big brought Count Munchkinstein to life, and the legendary Vincent Price made special guest appearances as The Host who would start each episode with: “Another lovely day begins, for ghosts and ghouls with greenish skin. So close your eyes and you will find that you’ve arrived in Frightenstein. Perhaps the Count will find a way to make his monster work today. For if he solves this monster-mania, he can return to Transylvania! So welcome where the sun won’t shine, to the castle of Count Frightenstein!”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLZrqlsc2MNb2Y8XpGIdmD1Nlrs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2087'),
  ('93063391409744385', 'The Hill Dyed Rose Madder', 2008, 'Drama, Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Rie Kugimiya, Aya Hirano, Marina Inoue, Rie Tanaka, Wataru Hatano, Ryo Hirohashi, Erino Hazuki, Emiri Kato', null, 'Junichi Nagase was a real delinquent in middle school, one nasty enough that he earned the nickame "Geno Killer," and it''s by this less than flattering epithet that Yuuhi Katagiri first comes to know him when he rescues her from two thugs one evening. Needless to say, both are stunned when not only does Yuuhi find herself transferred into the same high school class as "the Killer," but that shock grows into outright stupefaction when Yuuhi shows up at Junichi''s house with the mind-blowing announcement that she''s supposed to move in with him! It seems that they''re engaged, and since this is the first that Junichi and his younger sister Minato have first heard of the arranged marriage set up by their parents, it''s an idea that''s going to take a little getting used to. Get ready for ties that bind and gag as bad boy and good girl collide cohabitationally while the entire school gets to watch!', 'Junichi Nagase was a real delinquent in middle school, one nasty enough that he earned the nickame "Geno Killer," and it''s by this less than flattering epithet that Yuuhi Katagiri first comes to know him when he rescues her from two thugs one evening. Needless to say, both are stunned when not only does Yuuhi find herself transferred into the same high school class as "the Killer," but that shock grows into outright stupefaction when Yuuhi shows up at Junichi''s house with the mind-blowing announcement that she''s supposed to move in with him! It seems that they''re engaged, and since this is the first that Junichi and his younger sister Minato have first heard of the arranged marriage set up by their parents, it''s an idea that''s going to take a little getting used to. Get ready for ties that bind and gag as bad boy and good girl collide cohabitationally while the entire school gets to watch!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14wvZEk52mRSiV6sK0ohaAzhtEk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37100'),
  ('782817092265671146', 'The Hills', 2006, 'Reality, Drama', 'Liz Gateley, Adam DiVello', null, 'Lauren Conrad', 'TV-PG', 'After high school graduation, "Laguna Beach" alumna Lauren sets out to live on her own in Los Angeles and work as an intern at Teen Vogue.', 'After high school graduation, "Laguna Beach" alumna Lauren sets out to live on her own in Los Angeles and work as an intern at Teen Vogue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8GJUXpC1IPCFRrWN1vQzrkNnKXz.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:4466'),
  ('464397409428923575', 'The Hills: New Beginnings', 2019, 'Reality, Drama', null, null, 'Justin Brescia, Ashley Wahler, Frankie Delgado, Jason Wahler, Brandon Thomas Lee, Audrina Patridge, Heidi Montag, Spencer Pratt', 'TV-14', 'Follows the professional and personal lives of the cast of MTV''s ''The Hills'' and their their friends and kids, years after the final episode aired.', 'Follows the professional and personal lives of the cast of MTV''s ''The Hills'' and their their friends and kids, years after the final episode aired.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2HdQdvNriWQyOmOpA8bdOuUKuJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:90424'),
  ('702336560194191702', 'The Hire', 2001, 'Action & Adventure, Crime', 'David Fincher', null, 'Clive Owen', null, 'BMW Films presents "The Hire", a series of nine short films produced for the Internet in 2001 and 2002, with a ninth short film following in 2016. A form of branded content, all nine short films feature popular filmmakers from across the globe, star Clive Owen as the "Driver", and highlight the performance aspects of various BMW automobiles.', 'BMW Films presents "The Hire", a series of nine short films produced for the Internet in 2001 and 2002, with a ninth short film following in 2016. A form of branded content, all nine short films feature popular filmmakers from across the globe, star Clive Owen as the "Driver", and highlight the performance aspects of various BMW automobiles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Fawf9QxdlwICf6I7Ic11NcaopJ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:44150'),
  ('24816754314593089', 'The History of Our Family', 2010, 'Comedy, Family', 'Koki Mitani', null, 'Ko Shibasaki, Maki Horikita, Masami Nagasawa, Nana Eikura, Yuki Amami, Toshiyuki Nishida, Akiyoshi Nakao, Koji Yamamoto', null, 'Wagaya no Rekishi is a Japanese three-part television mini-series, shown on Fuji TV from April 9, 2010 to April 11, 2010 to celebrate its 50th Anniversary. The show was known for its star-studded cast.', 'Wagaya no Rekishi is a Japanese three-part television mini-series, shown on Fuji TV from April 9, 2010 to April 11, 2010 to celebrate its 50th Anniversary. The show was known for its star-studded cast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/faKYsSZr4bEYqQFJSamhSenDexu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46097'),
  ('825681579984423499', 'The Hitchhiker', 1983, 'Drama, Crime', 'Lewis Chesler, Richard Rothstein, Riff Markowitz', null, 'Page Fletcher, Nicholas Campbell', null, 'A young hitchhiker introduces characters who are about to experience a frightening and sometimes supernatural incident of some kind in this moody anthology series.', 'A young hitchhiker introduces characters who are about to experience a frightening and sometimes supernatural incident of some kind in this moody anthology series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AmOBNQXTMPsi3NvcadHxfM4xEVZ.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:10370'),
  ('336604450932877899', 'The Hitchhiker''s Guide to the Galaxy', 1981, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Douglas Adams', 'Douglas Adams', 'Simon Jones, David Dixon, Peter Jones', 'TV-PG', 'Don''t Panic! The story of Arthur Dent, an average Englishman whose life was spared by his friend, who turned out to be an alien, while the planet Earth is destroyed. His friend tells him about the Hitchhiker''s Guide to the Galaxy, a guide with anything you ever needed, and wanted to know. They travel across the galaxy, meeting friendly, and not so friendly characters in order to find the great question (the answer being 42).', 'Don''t Panic! The story of Arthur Dent, an average Englishman whose life was spared by his friend, who turned out to be an alien, while the planet Earth is destroyed. His friend tells him about the Hitchhiker''s Guide to the Galaxy, a guide with anything you ever needed, and wanted to know. They travel across the galaxy, meeting friendly, and not so friendly characters in order to find the great question (the answer being 42).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKiH7IIbo23uA72MmY318mXorjw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2048'),
  ('429377296833590051', 'The Hobbits', 1993, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Toni Edelmann, Timo Torikka', 'Taneli Mäkelä, Pertti Sveholm, Jarmo Hyttinen, Jari Pehkonen, Vesa Vierikko, Kari Väänänen, Carl-Kristian Rundman, Ville Virtanen', null, 'Hobitit is a Finnish live action fantasy television miniseries originally broadcast in 1993 on Yle TV1. Produced by Olof Qvickström, it is based on the events of the books The Hobbit and The Lord of the Rings by J. R. R. Tolkien.', 'Hobitit is a Finnish live action fantasy television miniseries originally broadcast in 1993 on Yle TV1. Produced by Olof Qvickström, it is based on the events of the books The Hobbit and The Lord of the Rings by J. R. R. Tolkien.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hpGe0jOdYFmnWanvZ2DKyXGVrFf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35520'),
  ('1128194219901992473', 'The Hockey Girls', 2019, 'Drama', null, null, 'Natalia Barrientos, Julia Gibert, Laia Fontàn, Pablo Hernández, Iria del Río, Nora Navas, Asia Ortega, Mireia Oriol', null, 'The passionate members of a girls'' roller hockey team chase down victories in the rink while striving to make time for school, family and romance.', 'The passionate members of a girls'' roller hockey team chase down victories in the rink while striving to make time for school, family and romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6PXK35fbG8kR6tHxhSiWNrGyfZv.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:90129'),
  ('908043016789680051', 'The Hogan Family', 1986, 'Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Sandy Duncan, Jason Bateman, Dan Ponce, Jeremy Licht, Josh Taylor, Edie McClurg, Steve Witting, John Hillerman', 'TV-G', 'The Hogan Family is an American television situation comedy that aired on NBC from March 1, 1986 to May 7, 1990, and on CBS from September 15, 1990 until July 20, 1991. It was produced by Miller-Boyett Productions, along with Tal Productions, Inc., and in association with Lorimar Productions, Lorimar-Telepictures and Lorimar Television. The show was originally titled Valerie and starred Valerie Harper as a mother trying to juggle her career with raising her three sons by her often-absent airline-pilot husband. Harper was written out of the series after the second season because of a dispute with the show''s producers. Sandy Duncan joined the cast as the boys'' aunt, who moved in and became their surrogate mom. During the show''s third season, the series was known as Valerie''s Family: The Hogans, then simply as The Hogan Family.', 'The Hogan Family is an American television situation comedy that aired on NBC from March 1, 1986 to May 7, 1990, and on CBS from September 15, 1990 until July 20, 1991. It was produced by Miller-Boyett Productions, along with Tal Productions, Inc., and in association with Lorimar Productions, Lorimar-Telepictures and Lorimar Television. The show was originally titled Valerie and starred Valerie Harper as a mother trying to juggle her career with raising her three sons by her often-absent airline-pilot husband. Harper was written out of the series after the second season because of a dispute with the show''s producers. Sandy Duncan joined the cast as the boys'' aunt, who moved in and became their surrogate mom. During the show''s third season, the series was known as Valerie''s Family: The Hogans, then simply as The Hogan Family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2deFhQTN01DGG2ys9tNmRRB4SsY.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:4453'),
  ('187989885902289659', 'The Holiday', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Michael Crompton', null, 'Jill Halfpenny, Owen McDonnell, Aidan McArdle, Liv Mjönes, Siobhan Hewlett, Cat Simmons, Andrew Macklin', null, 'The story follows Kate, a woman who discovers that her husband is having an affair during a luxurious holiday somewhere in the Mediterranean. The troubled couple are sharing a villa with four of Kate’s closest friends, one of which is the adulterous partner, but she doesn’t realise that the guilty party could be prepared to kill in order to keep their secret safe.', 'The story follows Kate, a woman who discovers that her husband is having an affair during a luxurious holiday somewhere in the Mediterranean. The troubled couple are sharing a villa with four of Kate’s closest friends, one of which is the adulterous partner, but she doesn’t realise that the guilty party could be prepared to kill in order to keep their secret safe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lIJlcEiXvIh6Oq0QtXl4K66DXQa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158389'),
  ('486304095069471035', 'The Holiday Movies That Made Us', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Phe Caplan', 'TV-PG', 'Unwrap the real stories behind these iconic Christmas blockbusters, thanks to insider interviews and behind-the-scenes peeks.', 'Unwrap the real stories behind these iconic Christmas blockbusters, thanks to insider interviews and behind-the-scenes peeks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iA2DIddggmq1UCoWqAxZCxy3Q7c.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114053'),
  ('499941164387003932', 'The Hollow', 2018, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family', 'Josh Mepham, Kathy A. Rocchio, Vito Viscomi', null, 'Ashleigh Ball, Connor Parnall, Adrian Petriw, Alex Barima, Diana Kaarina, Jesse Moss, Mark Hildreth', 'TV-Y7', 'Three teens join forces to find a way home after waking up in a strange realm filled with magic portals, perplexing puzzles and vicious beasts.', 'Three teens join forces to find a way home after waking up in a strange realm filled with magic portals, perplexing puzzles and vicious beasts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9sDgeNu67umBkX209Yh78d4tyv9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:79948'),
  ('437007440233856667', 'The Hollow Crown', 2012, 'Drama, History', null, null, null, null, 'A series of British television films featuring William Shakespeare''s History Plays.', 'A series of British television films featuring William Shakespeare''s History Plays.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Q8m6nI5m66DjnQ5V661anWqpVu.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:44037'),
  ('935384487754926242', 'The Holy Grail of Eris', 2026, 'Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kana Ichinose, Sayumi Suzushiro, Yohei Azakami, Mao Ichimichi, Maaya Uchida, Natsuki Hanae, Jun Fukuyama', 'TV-14', 'Betrayed by her fiancé''s lover and sentenced to public execution, Constance Grail, a plain viscount''s daughter known for her honesty, faces death—until a mysterious voice offers salvation. Scarlett Castiel, a noblewoman long thought dead, may be her only hope. Together, these unlikely allies uncover a dark conspiracy lurking in the heart of high society, where betrayal, secrets, and power collide.', 'Betrayed by her fiancé''s lover and sentenced to public execution, Constance Grail, a plain viscount''s daughter known for her honesty, faces death—until a mysterious voice offers salvation. Scarlett Castiel, a noblewoman long thought dead, may be her only hope. Together, these unlikely allies uncover a dark conspiracy lurking in the heart of high society, where betrayal, secrets, and power collide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rwm3nle6jWdJSQbe2TX7NxwHFY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:283891'),
  ('765556188074101204', 'The Holzer Files', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, 'Cindy Kaza, Shane Pittman, Dave Schrader', 'TV-PG', 'Paranormal investigator Dave Schrader, psychic medium Cindy Kaza, equipment expert Shane Pittman and researcher Gabe Roth investigate terrifyingly true hauntings from the recently discovered case files of America''s first ghost hunter, Dr. Hans Holzer.', 'Paranormal investigator Dave Schrader, psychic medium Cindy Kaza, equipment expert Shane Pittman and researcher Gabe Roth investigate terrifyingly true hauntings from the recently discovered case files of America''s first ghost hunter, Dr. Hans Holzer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/njKUd26r2QrLKXenBA7HRkobDw2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:93682'),
  ('711739320669595422', 'The Honest Realtor', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Tomohisa Yamashita, Haruka Fukuhara, Hayato Ichihara, Rika Izumi, Kana Kurashina, Katsunori Takahashi, Mao Daichi, Masao Kusakari', null, 'Hotshot Nagase Saichi is Tosaka Real Estate’s top realtor. He lies through his teeth and will stop at nothing to seal a deal. One day, he disturbs a monument located at a construction site. Cursed with the inability to tell a lie, he is forced to run his mouth off with things that are better left unsaid. With so many angry clients, he''s got no hope of surviving as an honest realtor.', 'Hotshot Nagase Saichi is Tosaka Real Estate’s top realtor. He lies through his teeth and will stop at nothing to seal a deal. One day, he disturbs a monument located at a construction site. Cursed with the inability to tell a lie, he is forced to run his mouth off with things that are better left unsaid. With so many angry clients, he''s got no hope of surviving as an honest realtor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4dQuTiuvkPc1uR5rfBRzYYp56aX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:157342'),
  ('154173887481986950', 'The Honeymooners', 1955, 'Comedy, Family', 'Jackie Gleason', null, 'Jackie Gleason, Audrey Meadows, Art Carney, Joyce Randolph', 'TV-PG', 'A bus driver and his sewer worker friend struggle to strike it rich while their wives look on with weary patience. One of the most influential situation comedy television series in American history.', 'A bus driver and his sewer worker friend struggle to strike it rich while their wives look on with weary patience. One of the most influential situation comedy television series in American history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBXD45yVIjvucXAwes8vu7SqgSy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4439'),
  ('535172969782919821', 'The Honor at Magic High School', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Saori Hayami, Sora Amamiya, Yuiko Tatsumi, Yuichi Nakamura, Asuka Nishi, Kana Hanazawa, Marina Inoue, Mai Nakahara', 'TV-14', 'A century has passed since magic - true magic, the stuff of legends - has returned to the world. It is spring, the season of new beginnings, and a new class of students is about to begin their studies at the First National Magic University Affiliated High School, nickname: First High. It follows the events of the original series as seen through the eyes of Shiba Miyuki, Tatsuya''s sister. The life of an honor student comes with a lot of expectations...and unexpected hidden feelings?!', 'A century has passed since magic - true magic, the stuff of legends - has returned to the world. It is spring, the season of new beginnings, and a new class of students is about to begin their studies at the First National Magic University Affiliated High School, nickname: First High. It follows the events of the original series as seen through the eyes of Shiba Miyuki, Tatsuya''s sister. The life of an honor student comes with a lot of expectations...and unexpected hidden feelings?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p5KpzUYxwbqpJMzJBrgLEdSvrA7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:115312'),
  ('862780882144067501', 'The Honourable Woman', 2014, 'Drama, War & Politics, Crime', 'Hugo Blick', 'Hugo Blick', 'Maggie Gyllenhaal, Stephen Rea, Lubna Azabal, Katherine Parkinson, Janet McTeer, Lindsay Duncan, Eve Best, Andrew Buchan', 'TV-MA', 'Nessa Stein, the daughter of a Zionist arms procurer who as a child witnessed his assassination. Now an adult, Nessa inherits her father''s company and changes course from supplying arms to laying data cabling networks between Israel and the West Bank. Her efforts to reconcile the Israelis and Palestinians lands her an appointment to the House of Lords and creates an international political maelstrom.', 'Nessa Stein, the daughter of a Zionist arms procurer who as a child witnessed his assassination. Now an adult, Nessa inherits her father''s company and changes course from supplying arms to laying data cabling networks between Israel and the West Bank. Her efforts to reconcile the Israelis and Palestinians lands her an appointment to the House of Lords and creates an international political maelstrom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9EiRdOWqzkO7bHHQxxPnIIJ7s8G.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61123'),
  ('1086126676360662792', 'The Hook Up Plan', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Noémie Saglio, Julien Teisseire, Chris Lang', 'Chris Lang', 'Zita Hanrot, Sabrina Ouazani, Joséphine Draï, Marc Ruchmann, Guillaume Labbé, Tom Dingler, Syrus Shahidi', 'TV-14', 'In a misguided attempt to build up perpetually single Elsa''s confidence, her friends hire a male escort. A comedy series set in Paris.', 'In a misguided attempt to build up perpetually single Elsa''s confidence, her friends hire a male escort. A comedy series set in Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nfuZCPZYpd5G1DUFPMjGNJ4ddsV.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:83412'),
  ('658190651185481175', 'The Hooligan', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Grzegorz Palkowski, Mila Jankowska, Karol Pocheć, Marta Żmuda-Trzebiatowska, Wojciech Zieliński, Jakub Nosiadek, Fabian Kocięcki, Michał Filipiak', 'TV-MA', 'When his father is released from prison, 17-year-old Kuba finds it difficult not to follow in his hooligan footsteps. After all, football is family.', 'When his father is released from prison, 17-year-old Kuba finds it difficult not to follow in his hooligan footsteps. After all, football is family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tP8AKqIesMsP52KkQ8GORY9i8Ra.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:280872'),
  ('88375048348015108', 'The Hope', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Chen Shu', 'Zhang Ruoyun, Huang Yao, Wang Qiang, Xu Ruohan, Li Mingde, Zhang Chen, Zeng Youzhen, Xu Qijie', null, 'Lei Ming, a former lecturer, and Sang Xia, a psychology teacher, runs a special class to help under-performing students. They guide students like Li Ran, who plans to drop out due to his grandmother’s illness, to overcome challenges and aim for university. Their combined efforts help students realize their potential and prepare for the next phase of their lives.', 'Lei Ming, a former lecturer, and Sang Xia, a psychology teacher, runs a special class to help under-performing students. They guide students like Li Ran, who plans to drop out due to his grandmother’s illness, to overcome challenges and aim for university. Their combined efforts help students realize their potential and prepare for the next phase of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5txim5se15yxM7mQNRjiRTKjZ4Q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:240880'),
  ('544157065476570431', 'The Horror of Dolores Roach', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Aaron Mark', null, 'Justina Machado, Alejandro Hernandez, Kita Updike, K. Todd Freeman, Ilan Eskenazi, Jessica Pimentel, Jimmy Alvarez, Maureen Cassidy', 'TV-MA', 'After an unjust 16-year prison sentence, Dolores Roach returns to a gentrified Washington Heights, where she reunites with an old stoner friend, Luis, who lets her live and work as a masseuse in the basement under his empanada shop. When the promise of her newfound stability is quickly threatened, “Magic Hands” Dolores is driven to shocking extremes to survive.', 'After an unjust 16-year prison sentence, Dolores Roach returns to a gentrified Washington Heights, where she reunites with an old stoner friend, Luis, who lets her live and work as a masseuse in the basement under his empanada shop. When the promise of her newfound stability is quickly threatened, “Magic Hands” Dolores is driven to shocking extremes to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTYLRBCNyOuyktuTcjqJ7rbXxaF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217825'),
  ('1030983412038558734', 'The Hot Spot', 2025, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Bakarhythm', null, 'Mikako Ichikawa, Akihiro Kakuta, Anne Suzuki, Kami Hiraiwa, Kaho, Naoki Tanaka, Kayo Noro, Maki Sakai', 'TV-PG', 'Kiyomi Endo is a single mother working at a business hotel near Mount Fuji whose life takes an unexpected twist after an encounter with an alien.', 'Kiyomi Endo is a single mother working at a business hotel near Mount Fuji whose life takes an unexpected twist after an encounter with an alien.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uuAEfL8rmzD0yOR61JZiuYBdapI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:276903'),
  ('717785919310699084', 'The Hot Zone', 2019, 'Drama', 'James V. Hart, Jeff Vintar, Brian Peterson', null, 'Daniel Dae Kim, Tony Goldwyn, Dylan Baker, Ian Colletti, Vanessa Matsui, Carlos Gonzalez-Vio', 'TV-14', 'In this anthology series, heroic scientists risk all to deal with deadly outbreaks.', 'In this anthology series, heroic scientists risk all to deal with deadly outbreaks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6CSPieuzXvp4gcSSPZzuUwBXjaP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:86799'),
  ('656914593244525984', 'The Hotwives of Orlando', 2014, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Casey Wilson, Danielle Schneider, Tymberlee Hill, Andrea Savage, Angela Kinsey, Kristen Schaal, Matt Besser, Joey McIntyre', null, 'A parody of one of the most popular franchises in reality television, “The Hotwives of Orlando,” takes you inside the uber-exclusive and glamorous world of six hot housewives livin’ large in Central Florida''s sexiest city, Orlando. The show follows a cast of ladies as they fight over pretty much everything except for their love of shoes, plastic surgery, and the pursuit of spending all of their husbands’ money.', 'A parody of one of the most popular franchises in reality television, “The Hotwives of Orlando,” takes you inside the uber-exclusive and glamorous world of six hot housewives livin’ large in Central Florida''s sexiest city, Orlando. The show follows a cast of ladies as they fight over pretty much everything except for their love of shoes, plastic surgery, and the pursuit of spending all of their husbands’ money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJCtT1aWvjNEVKqrqpPaTxnOpPq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61281'),
  ('1079885839076540098', 'The Hour', 2011, 'Drama, War & Politics, Crime', 'Abi Morgan', null, 'Ben Whishaw, Romola Garai, Dominic West, Anna Chancellor, Julian Rhind-Tutt, Oona Chaplin, Peter Capaldi, Hannah John-Kamen', 'TV-14', 'A behind-the-scenes drama and espionage thriller in Cold War-era England that centers on a journalist, a producer, and an anchorman for an investigative news programme.', 'A behind-the-scenes drama and espionage thriller in Cold War-era England that centers on a journalist, a producer, and an anchorman for an investigative news programme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxspHzwLcFMPQL3SqU3g1zqLlQL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:39718'),
  ('747223612982895007', 'The Hours of My Life', 2014, 'Drama, Family', null, 'Atsuko Hashibe', 'Haruma Miura, Mikako Tabe, Takumi Saitoh, Shunsuke Kazama, Mizuki Yamamoto, Mieko Harada, Miyoko Asada, Mantaro Koichi', null, 'Your whole outlook on life can change in an instant. Takuto Sawada (Haruma Miura) is your average college student. But one day, he finds out that he has ALS (Lou Gehrig''s disease) and only has a short time to live. How will he choose to spend the remaining days of his precious life?', 'Your whole outlook on life can change in an instant. Takuto Sawada (Haruma Miura) is your average college student. But one day, he finds out that he has ALS (Lou Gehrig''s disease) and only has a short time to live. How will he choose to spend the remaining days of his precious life?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y52HzQ1HQtro5D3Lynmd7XuRvCZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68183'),
  ('1022082538982016952', 'The House at Christianshavn', 1970, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Erik Balling, Henning Bahs', null, 'Poul Reichhardt, Arthur Jensen, Helle Virkner, Paul Hagen, Willy Rathnov, Lis Løwert, Kirsten Walther, Bodil Udsen', 'TV-PG', 'The series follows the residents of an apartment building on Copenhagen''s Christianshavn, as they go about their daily lives and challenges. There is Olsen, a mover with an old fashion view of the world, Clausen who runs the local pet shop, Egon the career focused assistant, their wives who work hard to keep their spouses lives together, the young couple Tue and Rikke who recently moved in, the hard working caretaker Meyer, who never puts in to much effort, and of course Emma, the innkeeper of Rottehullet, where all the important decisions are made while running up the bar tab. The series was produced by Nordisk Film for Danmarks Radio TV station between the years 1970-77. The series'' first director was Ebbe Langberg, then Erik Balling and Tom Hedegaard respectively. The series was conceived by an author team of well-known Danish authors such Leif Panduro, Benny Andersen, and Lise Nørgaard.', 'The series follows the residents of an apartment building on Copenhagen''s Christianshavn, as they go about their daily lives and challenges. There is Olsen, a mover with an old fashion view of the world, Clausen who runs the local pet shop, Egon the career focused assistant, their wives who work hard to keep their spouses lives together, the young couple Tue and Rikke who recently moved in, the hard working caretaker Meyer, who never puts in to much effort, and of course Emma, the innkeeper of Rottehullet, where all the important decisions are made while running up the bar tab. The series was produced by Nordisk Film for Danmarks Radio TV station between the years 1970-77. The series'' first director was Ebbe Langberg, then Erik Balling and Tom Hedegaard respectively. The series was conceived by an author team of well-known Danish authors such Leif Panduro, Benny Andersen, and Lise Nørgaard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OX9OnjHlQGMzvxdJXW5mCzkdyn.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:8988'),
  ('672942430815286415', 'The House in the Woods', 1971, 'War & Politics, Drama', 'Maurice Pialat', 'René Wheeler', 'Pierre Doris, Jacqueline Dufranne, Agathe Natanson, Fernand Gravey, Alexandre Rignault, Hervé Lévy, Albert Martinez, Marie-Christine Boulard', null, 'During World War One, in a small rural French village far away from the front, a gamekeeper and his wife take in children displaced by the war.', 'During World War One, in a small rural French village far away from the front, a gamekeeper and his wife take in children displaced by the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJjK9Gg0iWdvssoIq4toqOyafh1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74781'),
  ('803620350353689434', 'The House of Eliott', 1991, 'Drama', 'Jean Marsh, Eileen Atkins', null, 'Louise Lombard, Stella Gonet, Cathy Murphy, Aden Gillett, Victoria Alcock', null, 'Two sisters who set up a London fashion house for society of the early 1920s.', 'Two sisters who set up a London fashion house for society of the early 1920s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqEINyBSAFi7pMokvYftTaUIuld.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:3188'),
  ('1107122746680821519', 'The House of Flowers', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Manolo Caro', 'Gabriel Nuncio', 'Aislinn Derbez, Dario Yazbek Bernal, Arturo Ríos, Paco León, Cecilia Suárez, Juan Pablo Medina, Luis de la Rosa, Isela Vega', 'TV-MA', 'A wealthy matriarch tries to maintain her family''s facade of perfection after her husband''s mistress exposes their dirty secrets.', 'A wealthy matriarch tries to maintain her family''s facade of perfection after her husband''s mistress exposes their dirty secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zAIp0cT4Hy6faiPYcOPl1VsuGR.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:80169'),
  ('858236763579524592', 'The House on the Slope', 2019, 'Drama', 'Eriko Shinozaki', null, 'Ko Shibasaki, Miki Mizuno, Seiichi Tanabe, Hidekazu Mashima, Atsuko Takahata', null, 'Yamazaki Risako lives with her husband Yoichiro and 3-year-old daughter Fumika. One day, she receives a notification from the court that she has been selected as an alternate member of the jury for a shocking criminal case. The defendant in the case is Ando Mizuho, a full-time housewife who is the same age as Risako. She is on trial for causing the death of her 8-month-old daughter by dropping her into the bathtub. As a mother herself, Risako feels repulsed that Mizuho killed her own child. However, after the trial opens, Mizuho’s circumstances remind Risako of her own past and she soon becomes confused with the chaotic feelings that have lain dormant in her. (Source: jdramas.wordpress.com)', 'Yamazaki Risako lives with her husband Yoichiro and 3-year-old daughter Fumika. One day, she receives a notification from the court that she has been selected as an alternate member of the jury for a shocking criminal case. The defendant in the case is Ando Mizuho, a full-time housewife who is the same age as Risako. She is on trial for causing the death of her 8-month-old daughter by dropping her into the bathtub. As a mother herself, Risako feels repulsed that Mizuho killed her own child. However, after the trial opens, Mizuho’s circumstances remind Risako of her own past and she soon becomes confused with the chaotic feelings that have lain dormant in her. (Source: jdramas.wordpress.com)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJ76lC3AcZDuBP6uGkPhzTp3LOs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89659'),
  ('716951271744602002', 'The Houseboat', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Fynn Kliemann, Olli Schulz', null, 'With plenty of passion and little know-how, two musicians undertake a daunting project: turn a late singer''s houseboat into a creative musical space.', 'With plenty of passion and little know-how, two musicians undertake a daunting project: turn a late singer''s houseboat into a creative musical space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iSDksiuqY2qHLxhE9NVpEATJpZl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112860'),
