  ('167815514791232440', 'The Hunt', 2026, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Cédric Anger', null, 'Benoît Magimel, Mélanie Laurent, Damien Bonnard, Manuel Guillot, Cédric Appietto, Frédéric Maranber, Angelyna Danabe Mignot, Paul Beaurepaire', 'TV-MA', 'When friends on a hunting trip get into a deadly clash with other hunters, they vow to keep it a secret. But as paranoia sets in—and a ruthless gang seeks revenge—the friends must confront their morality, families, and savage instincts.', 'When friends on a hunting trip get into a deadly clash with other hunters, they vow to keep it a secret. But as paranoia sets in—and a ruthless gang seeks revenge—the friends must confront their morality, families, and savage instincts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipf1giXcXX50ylcmDBtDcXHMTaa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:257992'),
  ('1114431819514697027', 'The Hunt for a Killer', 2020, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Helene Lindholm', 'Helene Lindholm, Lotta Erikson', 'Lars Schilken, Minoo Mårtensson, Lotten Roos, Anders Beckman, Sasha Becker, Håkan Bengtsson, Rasmus Troedsson, Catherine Jeppsson', null, 'Based on true stories about real homicide investigations in the south of Sweden between 1989-2004. A reality-based crime drama about the policeman Per-Åke Åkesson and the reconnaissance group that was tasked with investigating several murders of women in northeastern Skåne. The series starts in Hörby in 1989.', 'Based on true stories about real homicide investigations in the south of Sweden between 1989-2004. A reality-based crime drama about the policeman Per-Åke Åkesson and the reconnaissance group that was tasked with investigating several murders of women in northeastern Skåne. The series starts in Hörby in 1989.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plLyqHqxcm2pxvLGnQjWXJRib3l.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113370'),
  ('735390015183040047', 'The Hunt for Raoul Moat', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', null, 'Kevin Sampson', 'Lee Ingleby, Matt Stokoe, Sonya Cassidy, Josef Davies, Sally Messham, Gemma Page, Dan Renton Skinner, Vineeta Rishi', null, 'Follows the police operation in 2010 to apprehend fugitive Raoul Moat. He went to Northumbria after killing one person and wounding two others.', 'Follows the police operation in 2010 to apprehend fugitive Raoul Moat. He went to Northumbria after killing one person and wounding two others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qBqOMxpU8HPMvYpj1vl9lGkaIZG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:224244'),
