  ('911894112110555527', 'The Ice Guy and His Cool Female Colleague', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yui Ishikawa, Chiaki Kobayashi, Yumi Uchiyama, Koki Uchiyama, Ayane Sakura, Shugo Nakamura, Hiyori Nitta', 'TV-14', 'For Himuro, being a descendant of a snow spirit is tough at the workplace when your emotions can lead to snow blasts with snowmen and igloos. Any emotionally charged incident with coworkers can trigger it—conflict, fun, and in this case, romance. And with his lovely and calm coworker Fuyutsuki, he gets more frozen, literally. Get ready for a snow-white office romance that blows in like a blizzard.', 'For Himuro, being a descendant of a snow spirit is tough at the workplace when your emotions can lead to snow blasts with snowmen and igloos. Any emotionally charged incident with coworkers can trigger it—conflict, fun, and in this case, romance. And with his lovely and calm coworker Fuyutsuki, he gets more frozen, literally. Get ready for a snow-white office romance that blows in like a blizzard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2nZrmcyMgYCHmNGKPX9NXfWEybH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204519'),
  ('445385978828033970', 'The Ice House', 1997, 'Drama, Mystery', null, 'Minette Walters', 'Daniel Craig, Frances Barber, Penny Downie, Corin Redgrave, Kitty Aldridge, James D''Arcy, Lynn Farleigh, Willie Ross', null, 'A corpse is found in an ice house ten years after Phoebe''s husband went missing. The police seem determined to accuse Phoebe, to the delight of the villagers.', 'A corpse is found in an ice house ten years after Phoebe''s husband went missing. The police seem determined to accuse Phoebe, to the delight of the villagers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtubNP745pvHDhNyLz7ZrElDse9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77353'),
  ('990570811254416860', 'The Iceblade Sorcerer Shall Rule the World', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Junya Enoki, Iori Saeki, Nana Harumura, Azumi Waki, Kaede Hondo, Akira Sekine, Atsumi Tanezaki, Nanako Mori', 'TV-14', 'The Arnold Academy of Magic is a school for the elite...and Ray White is just your ordinary guy. In fact, he doesn''t seem particularly skilled with magic at all, and is a bit of a klutz. Which is why he has nothing to do with the rumor that one of the great magicians, the Iceblade Sorcerer, is a member of the incoming class...right?', 'The Arnold Academy of Magic is a school for the elite...and Ray White is just your ordinary guy. In fact, he doesn''t seem particularly skilled with magic at all, and is a bit of a klutz. Which is why he has nothing to do with the rumor that one of the great magicians, the Iceblade Sorcerer, is a member of the incoming class...right?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xBlJYF8ROyYppm6RbZ1Ga8nERWs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:200777'),
  ('547815740819537326', 'The Idaten Deities Know Only Peace', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Romi Park, Megumi Ogata, Yui Horie, Akemi Okamura, Akira Ishida, Shizuka Itoh, Asami Seto, Sumire Uesaka', 'TV-MA', 'It has been 800 years since the incredibly fast and powerful gods of battle known as the Idaten had sealed away the demons after an intense battle. Now, that battle is just considered a myth or a fairytale. While the current generation of Idaten who have never even had to fight are enjoying their peaceful lives, someone awakened the demons once again! Armed forces, ingenuity, politics, and intrigue. If you''ve got it, use everything you can! This three-way battle royale with no rules and no limits is about to begin!!', 'It has been 800 years since the incredibly fast and powerful gods of battle known as the Idaten had sealed away the demons after an intense battle. Now, that battle is just considered a myth or a fairytale. While the current generation of Idaten who have never even had to fight are enjoying their peaceful lives, someone awakened the demons once again! Armed forces, ingenuity, politics, and intrigue. If you''ve got it, use everything you can! This three-way battle royale with no rules and no limits is about to begin!!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osCAbL4rdGUVLH3o2rlYZpDaiCb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107001'),
  ('1131913774146829765', 'The Ideal City', 2021, 'Drama', null, 'Ruo Hua Ran Ran', 'Sun Li, Mark Chao You-Ting, Chen Minghao, Yu Hewei, Li Hongtao, Li Chuanying, Gao Ye, Zhao Jun', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWbcASdCxg3cHwzdOen8JpJHsB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130816'),
  ('421082380365225059', 'The Idhun Chronicles', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Laura Gallego García, Andrés Carrión', null, 'Itzan Escamilla, Michelle Jenner, Nico Romero, Carlos Cuevas, Sergio Mur', null, 'After a necromancer takes over the magical world of Idhun, two adolescent earthlings help fight an assassin sent to kill all Idhunese refugees on Earth.', 'After a necromancer takes over the magical world of Idhun, two adolescent earthlings help fight an assassin sent to kill all Idhunese refugees on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3h2hlp6HtFwgS9m8J8EusEfRRa.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:87846'),
  ('1095225985381364343', 'The Idiot', 2003, 'Drama', 'Vladimir Bortko', null, 'Evgeny Mironov, Igor Ivanov, Lydia Velezheva, Olga Budina, Evgeniy Semyonov, Aleksandr Lazarev, Vladimir Ilin, Inna Churikova', null, 'The Idiot (Идиот) is a 2003 Russian costume drama television serial written by Vladimir Bortko, adapted from Fyodor Dostoevsky''s 1869 novel of the same title. In corrupt 19th-century St Petersburg, Christ-like Prince Myshkin becomes entangled in the lives of the self-destructive Nastasya Filippovna and the romantic Aglaya Epanchina.', 'The Idiot (Идиот) is a 2003 Russian costume drama television serial written by Vladimir Bortko, adapted from Fyodor Dostoevsky''s 1869 novel of the same title. In corrupt 19th-century St Petersburg, Christ-like Prince Myshkin becomes entangled in the lives of the self-destructive Nastasya Filippovna and the romantic Aglaya Epanchina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDOXfnOMozgNm6XIYmnyICOFqjO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68187'),
  ('1045100157572372963', 'The Idol', 2023, 'Drama', 'Sam Levinson, The Weeknd, Reza Fahim', 'Marlis Yurcisin, Nick Bilton, Howard A. Rodman', 'The Weeknd, Lily-Rose Depp, Suzanna Son, Troye Sivan, Jane Adams, Mitch Modes, Hank Azaria, Ramsey', 'TV-MA', 'After a nervous breakdown derailed Jocelyn''s last tour, she’s determined to claim her rightful status as the greatest and sexiest pop star in America. Her passions are reignited by Tedros, a nightclub impresario with a sordid past. Will her romantic awakening take her to glorious new heights or the deepest and darkest depths of her soul?', 'After a nervous breakdown derailed Jocelyn''s last tour, she’s determined to claim her rightful status as the greatest and sexiest pop star in America. Her passions are reignited by Tedros, a nightclub impresario with a sordid past. Will her romantic awakening take her to glorious new heights or the deepest and darkest depths of her soul?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gO9k7t9jSdkkWVG0deMZDpELZGw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135251'),
  ('1121759178825987783', 'THE iDOLM@STER', 2011, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Kenji Akabane, Eriko Nakamura, Asami Imai, Manami Numakura, Rie Kugimiya, Azumi Asakura, Mayako Nigo, Naomi Wakabayashi', 'TV-14', 'THE IDOLM@STER follows 13 girls from the 765 Production Studio, whose sole goals is to become the top idols in the Japanese entertainment industry. Along with the laughs, struggles and tears that are inherently part of this journey, you will cheer for the girls of iDOLM@STER as they climb their way to the top!', 'THE IDOLM@STER follows 13 girls from the 765 Production Studio, whose sole goals is to become the top idols in the Japanese entertainment industry. Along with the laughs, struggles and tears that are inherently part of this journey, you will cheer for the girls of iDOLM@STER as they climb their way to the top!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Apjxs1eRlp2H4WZHQoDXktXd76.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63463'),
  ('64716947795397117', 'THE iDOLM@STER Cinderella Girls', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Ayaka Ohashi, Naomi Ohzora, Maaya Uchida, Nozomi Yamamoto, Aya Suzaki, Natsumi Takamori, Rei Matsuzaki, Ayaka Fukuhara', 'TV-PG', 'There are many idols with long-established talent agency 346 Production. And now the company is starting a new program, the Cinderella Project! Girls leading normal lives are chosen to be aspiring idols and see another world for the first time in this Cinderella story. Can they all climb the stairs that lead to the palace? The magic begins now...', 'There are many idols with long-established talent agency 346 Production. And now the company is starting a new program, the Cinderella Project! Girls leading normal lives are chosen to be aspiring idols and see another world for the first time in this Cinderella story. Can they all climb the stairs that lead to the palace? The magic begins now...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1Z73WXPziv3JjVpwfPbtoOMFfi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63406'),
  ('533299024229405893', 'THE IDOLM@STER CINDERELLA GIRLS U149', 2023, 'Animation', null, null, 'Amina Sato, Haruka Terui, Tomoyo Kurosawa, Hana Tamegai, Makoto Koichi, Asaka Imai, Natsumi Haruse, Misaki Kuno', null, 'These small girls are ready to make it big! All 12 or younger and under 149 centimeters tall (4''11"), these aspiring pop idols dream of performing for thousands of people. But with zero experience, they''ve got a lot of work to do! With the help of their rookie producer, who''s almost just as short, can they stay focused and make it to the top?', 'These small girls are ready to make it big! All 12 or younger and under 149 centimeters tall (4''11"), these aspiring pop idols dream of performing for thousands of people. But with zero experience, they''ve got a lot of work to do! With the help of their rookie producer, who''s almost just as short, can they stay focused and make it to the top?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lAMjJGd1Ojwkw7MGj7fWLClzo7q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:216391'),
  ('273660902849318658', 'The iDOLM@STER Million Live!', 2023, 'Animation', 'Shinya Watada', null, 'Azusa Tadokoro, Machico, Haruka Yamazaki, Yu Kahara, Aimi', null, 'Mirai Kasuga, who wants to carry on a dream she has yet to see. Shizuka Mogami, who yearns to be an idol and is shaken. Tsubasa Ibuki, who does not know what she can be serious about. At 765 Production new idols gather and everyone''s "dreams" will brought into brilliance at the theater! The long-awaited anime of "The IDOLM@STER Million Live!!', 'Mirai Kasuga, who wants to carry on a dream she has yet to see. Shizuka Mogami, who yearns to be an idol and is shaken. Tsubasa Ibuki, who does not know what she can be serious about. At 765 Production new idols gather and everyone''s "dreams" will brought into brilliance at the theater! The long-awaited anime of "The IDOLM@STER Million Live!!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2QXWC8GdhyOOT6ILI7LUzrcuiPM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105902'),
  ('1098840850836063973', 'THE iDOLM@STER SHINY COLORS', 2024, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Hitomi Sekine, Reina Kondo, Mayu Mineda, Karin Isobe, Chisa Suganuma, Anna Yamaki, Shio Kisui, Mizuki Yuina', 'TV-14', 'Hands clasped, hearts alight, our idols take flight! Watch as our wannabe idols band together to forge friendships and pursue their dreams, each with their own unique personalities that light up the screen just as much as the breathtaking visuals and novel storytelling. Embark on a dazzling and heartwarming tale about chasing a shining world.', 'Hands clasped, hearts alight, our idols take flight! Watch as our wannabe idols band together to forge friendships and pursue their dreams, each with their own unique personalities that light up the screen just as much as the breathtaking visuals and novel storytelling. Embark on a dazzling and heartwarming tale about chasing a shining world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSZ8T0nKeU91QnRObdTTPjrqmZ0.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:248086'),
  ('787198074626330118', 'THE iDOLM@STER.KR', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Shin Hye Mi, Won Young Shil', 'Lee Suji, Lee Yeeun, Cha Ji-seul, Mint, Haseo Kwon, Youngjoo Heo, Jane Cheon, Kim Sori', 'TV-14', 'THE IDOLM@STER.KR, set in the world of Korean entertainment production, stars Korean idols of course, as well as other Japanese and Thai hopefuls. Like the original game, the drama follows a group of young women as they embark on a career in the entertainment industry, and depicts their sweat and tears, their hopes and dreams.', 'THE IDOLM@STER.KR, set in the world of Korean entertainment production, stars Korean idols of course, as well as other Japanese and Thai hopefuls. Like the original game, the drama follows a group of young women as they embark on a career in the entertainment industry, and depicts their sweat and tears, their hopes and dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z92d2CK4UZbjmDjYyH3lKpHpU43.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71760'),
  ('454107646562867104', 'The Ignorant Angels', 2022, 'Drama', 'Ferzan Özpetek', 'Ferzan Özpetek', 'Cristiana Capotondi, Luca Argentero, Ambra Angiolini, Eduardo Scarpetta, Ed Hendrik, Filippo Scicchitano, Federico Mancini, Edoardo Purgatori', null, 'Following the death of her husband in a car accident, Antonia discovers that he was having a homosexual affair with a man named Michele. At first devastated by the news, she finds herself building an unexpected friendship with this man she had never heard of. They both learn to know each other, to accept each other, to understand each other. Antonia thus discovers her husband''s other family made up of friends with unusual lifestyles and different sexual identities.', 'Following the death of her husband in a car accident, Antonia discovers that he was having a homosexual affair with a man named Michele. At first devastated by the news, she finds herself building an unexpected friendship with this man she had never heard of. They both learn to know each other, to accept each other, to understand each other. Antonia thus discovers her husband''s other family made up of friends with unusual lifestyles and different sexual identities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bbl4kqLbEIGuZWsdbPasdUYqoBu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156866'),
  ('599999086324598509', 'The Illusionist', 2011, 'Soap', 'Alcides Nogueira, Geraldo Carneiro', 'Alcides Nogueira, Tarcísio Puiati, Geraldo Carneiro', 'Rodrigo Lombardi, Carolina Ferraz, Marco Ricca, Regina Duarte, Daniel Filho, Fernanda Rodrigues, Thiago Fragoso, Alinne Moraes', null, 'The illusionist is mysterious, captivating and mesmerizes all those around him. But is he really a swindler or a man with extraordinary powers? This fascinating telenovela tells the story of seductive Herculano Quintanilha, who exerts significant influence over his great love Amanda, the Hayalla family and his friends. These and other enigmas can be found in The Illusionist, a telenovela where seduction is the great secret.', 'The illusionist is mysterious, captivating and mesmerizes all those around him. But is he really a swindler or a man with extraordinary powers? This fascinating telenovela tells the story of seductive Herculano Quintanilha, who exerts significant influence over his great love Amanda, the Hayalla family and his friends. These and other enigmas can be found in The Illusionist, a telenovela where seduction is the great secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r47tbJKuntpZEfduZvsOWh1iVxn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64284'),
  ('342610969029972247', 'The Imagineering Story', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Leslie Iwerks', null, 'Angela Bassett, Walt Disney', 'TV-PG', 'Explore the past, present and future of Walt Disney Imagineering with noted filmmaker Leslie Iwerks. Ms. Iwerks comes from a family with deep Disney history — her grandfather was an early Disney animator and her father is a former Imagineer — and her previous work includes profiles of Pixar Animation Studios and visual effects house Industrial Light & Magic.', 'Explore the past, present and future of Walt Disney Imagineering with noted filmmaker Leslie Iwerks. Ms. Iwerks comes from a family with deep Disney history — her grandfather was an early Disney animator and her father is a former Imagineer — and her previous work includes profiles of Pixar Animation Studios and visual effects house Industrial Light & Magic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9AXZblhInxAS9cX2qqp7mr8MlRj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95339'),
  ('726610271110772322', 'The Immortal', 2000, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Tim Gamble, Michael Grais', null, 'Lorenzo Lamas, Steve Braun, April Telek', null, 'The Immortal is a Canadian television series which aired from October 2000 to June 2001 and had 22 episodes.', 'The Immortal is a Canadian television series which aired from October 2000 to June 2001 and had 22 episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w33NI7ILRvokaeyTymvMqbvPqbB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40385'),
  ('381530446408088093', 'The Immortal Ascension', 2025, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ding Lingtao', null, 'Yang Yang, Jin Chen, Wang Duo, Zhao Xiaotang, Zhao Qing, Jin Jiayue, Rong Zixi, Zhang Waner', null, 'Han Li, an ordinary, poor boy from a mountain village, joins a small martial arts sect by chance. Despite his mediocre talent, he eventually cultivates himself into an immortal through hard work and careful planning.', 'Han Li, an ordinary, poor boy from a mountain village, joins a small martial arts sect by chance. Despite his mediocre talent, he eventually cultivates himself into an immortal through hard work and careful planning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kG8YooBxqX5BByifbA0wYeVVRYe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:243224'),
  ('967243628736499051', 'The Immortal VS Superheroes', 2026, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEwPQNqPBLeL7wewTo839jnxkKY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:313780'),
  ('91319117493961958', 'The Imperfects', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Dennis Heaton, Shelley Eriksen', null, 'Italia Ricci, Morgan Taylor Campbell, Rhianna Jagpal, Iñaki Godoy, Kyra Zagorsky, Celina Martin, Rhys Nicholson', 'TV-MA', 'After an experimental gene therapy turns them into monsters, three twenty-somethings band together to hunt down the scientist responsible and force him to make them human again.', 'After an experimental gene therapy turns them into monsters, three twenty-somethings band together to hunt down the scientist responsible and force him to make them human again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ntbfqgORC8JRRWQ5pQ56psC2Wot.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203555'),
  ('311905938167068451', 'The Imperial Age', 2022, 'Drama', 'Lijun Zhao, Gao Xixi', 'Dong Zhe', 'William Feng, Chen Baoguo, Zhang Fengyi, Wang Jinsong, Ying Er, Wang Ji, He Shengming, Chen Yuemo', null, 'In the early Ming dynasty, Zhu Di, the fourth son of Emperor Zhu Yuanzhang started military training in his early days to navigate court and palace intrigues. Zhu Di evolves into a formidable political and military leader, ultimately ushering in the prosperous Yongle era, a period famed for its accomplishments and splendor.', 'In the early Ming dynasty, Zhu Di, the fourth son of Emperor Zhu Yuanzhang started military training in his early days to navigate court and palace intrigues. Zhu Di evolves into a formidable political and military leader, ultimately ushering in the prosperous Yongle era, a period famed for its accomplishments and splendor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y8VC63f5YPGhAOBSNie7KUhrtsC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197060'),
  ('1071380396258761606', 'The Imperial Coroner', 2021, 'Mystery, Comedy', 'Qing Xian Ya Tou, Qian Xiaobai', 'Liu Yu, Qian Xiaobai, Qing Xian Ya Tou', 'Wang Ziqi, Su Xiaotong, Yang Tingdong, Zhao Yaoke, Wang Yanxin, Zhang Chenxiao, Zong Fengyan, Guo Jun', null, 'A female coroner and royal detective solve a decades-old mystery in Tang Dynasty China, risking all to expose dangerous secrets.', 'A female coroner and royal detective solve a decades-old mystery in Tang Dynasty China, risking all to expose dangerous secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xlGLbfuGJqzornTo17CQK9PwVX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:124595'),
  ('781921681326864769', 'The Imperial Doctress', 2016, 'Drama', null, 'Zhang Wei', 'Liu Shishi, Wallace Huo, Huang Xuan, Yuan Wenkang, Chengyuan Li, Jin Chen, Yu Yonghai, Joy Sheng', null, 'Growing up in a family of physicians, Tan Yunxian was adored by her grandparents for her intellect, curiosity and medical acumen. Despite the many barriers for female physicians in ancient China, Yunxian nevertheless proved herself to be a skilled family and female doctor — and ultimately the most famous female doctor of the Ming Dynasty.', 'Growing up in a family of physicians, Tan Yunxian was adored by her grandparents for her intellect, curiosity and medical acumen. Despite the many barriers for female physicians in ancient China, Yunxian nevertheless proved herself to be a skilled family and female doctor — and ultimately the most famous female doctor of the Ming Dynasty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rIvL3SWXihrW7MeDuSsYUhWCowH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65917'),
  ('722445623370992727', 'The Impossible Heir', 2024, 'Drama', null, null, 'Lee Jae-wook, Lee Jun-young, Hong Su-zu, Choi Hee-jin, Han Sang-jin, Lee Ji-hoon, Lee Hwang-eui, Kim Young-ju', 'TV-MA', 'An ambitious boy grows up and joins an intense war of desires to become a star of his own.', 'An ambitious boy grows up and joins an intense war of desires to become a star of his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ksIQrUoJERXBnVcxAxkMQDpzx3l.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223212'),
  ('118446098668990', 'The Impostor', 2014, 'Drama, Soap', 'Sebastian Arrau, Coca Gómez', 'Coca Gómez, Gerardo Cadena, Sebastian Arrau', 'Lisette Morelos, Sebastián Zurita, Christian Bach, Manuel Landeta, Begoña Narváez, Jonathan Islas, Mauricio Hénao, Mimi Morales', 'NR', 'La Impostora, is a Spanish-language telenovela presumably to be produced by United States-based television network Telemundo Studios, Miami.', 'La Impostora, is a Spanish-language telenovela presumably to be produced by United States-based television network Telemundo Studios, Miami.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4imlN0f1m5NobVpu9cXSBtOPAZq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:50864'),
  ('301050356213338396', 'The In-Laws', 2008, 'Family, Comedy', null, null, 'Fyodor Dobronravov, Tatyana Kravchenko, Anna Polishchuk, Lyudmila Artemeva, Anna Koshmal, Aleksandr Feklistov, Daniil Belykh, Olesya Zheleznyak', null, 'Parents go on vacation, and daughter is left to the care of grandparents. Father''s parents from a city, mother''s parents from a village - and this means a hot opposition.', 'Parents go on vacation, and daughter is left to the care of grandparents. Father''s parents from a city, mother''s parents from a village - and this means a hot opposition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7DtVbNXIwMCplhysJFJCANp6pwx.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:46014'),
  ('756259045784455058', 'The InBESTigators', 2019, 'Comedy, Crime, Kids', 'Robyn Butler, Wayne Hope', null, null, null, 'Four clever school kids start their own detective agency and vlog about their adventures, becoming fast friends in the process.', 'Four clever school kids start their own detective agency and vlog about their adventures, becoming fast friends in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7QBEGiRDzRsVu2VQrc8FsIFqMBa.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:91348'),
  ('255767789705663639', 'The InBetween', 2019, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Moira Kirland', null, 'Harriet Dyer, Paul Blackthorne, Justin Cornwell, Anne-Marie Johnson, Cindy Luna, Chad James Buchanan', 'TV-14', 'Cassie Bedford has visions... whether she likes it or not. Sometimes she encounters unsettled spirits who need her help. When her father, Detective Tom Hackett, and his new partner, former FBI agent Damien Asante, need assistance, Cassie reluctantly uses her abilities and helps solve some of the city’s most challenging cases.', 'Cassie Bedford has visions... whether she likes it or not. Sometimes she encounters unsettled spirits who need her help. When her father, Detective Tom Hackett, and his new partner, former FBI agent Damien Asante, need assistance, Cassie reluctantly uses her abilities and helps solve some of the city’s most challenging cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j4aKlHjHuLqZiBlYLCEkXKlgakn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81947'),
  ('684588196199644180', 'The Inbetweeners', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Damon Beesley, Iain Morris', null, 'James Buckley, Simon Bird, Emily Head, Joe Thomas, Blake Harrison, Belinda Stewart-Wilson, Greg Davies, Dominic Applewhite', 'TV-14', 'Those who remember the awkward years of adolescence can relive those painful days in this British comedy series, where the cringe-inducing humor arises from the ill-fated antics of its four protagonists. Suburban teenage friends Will, Simon, Jay and Neil, students at Rudge Park Comprehensive, attempt to navigate the social scene, attract members of the gentler sex, and saunter among the cool crowd. However, despite their best efforts, the four hapless lads usually end up on the side of the nerds.', 'Those who remember the awkward years of adolescence can relive those painful days in this British comedy series, where the cringe-inducing humor arises from the ill-fated antics of its four protagonists. Suburban teenage friends Will, Simon, Jay and Neil, students at Rudge Park Comprehensive, attempt to navigate the social scene, attract members of the gentler sex, and saunter among the cool crowd. However, despite their best efforts, the four hapless lads usually end up on the side of the nerds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNmcaXDndOkY6v9QiJjnxQD09GJ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:7317'),
  ('820697456244658145', 'The Inbetweeners', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Brad Copeland', null, 'Joey Pollari, Bubba Lewis, Mark L. Young, Zack Pearlman, Alex Frnka, Christine Scott Bennett', 'TV-14', 'A group of teenagers navigating high school and charging into adulthood the way everyone does... by taking one step forward and three steps back.', 'A group of teenagers navigating high school and charging into adulthood the way everyone does... by taking one step forward and three steps back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hfhYF9lZsz16mCd8jBvpCUb7sN0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38952'),
  ('845625588134540618', 'The Increasingly Poor Decisions of Todd Margaret', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Shaun Pye, David Cross', null, 'David Cross, Will Arnett, Sharon Horgan, Blake Harrison, Sara Pascoe, Jack McBrayer', null, 'Comedy about an inept American placed in charge of sales at his company''s London branch. He has no experience with British culture, knows nothing about sales, and has only one employee, Dave. Each episode begins with a scene of Margaret appearing in dire circumstances.', 'Comedy about an inept American placed in charge of sales at his company''s London branch. He has no experience with British culture, knows nothing about sales, and has only one employee, Dave. Each episode begins with a scene of Margaret appearing in dire circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eFknXxXZvuPNVBCkSkzMLHj4kux.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:33858'),
  ('454671360794093792', 'The Incredible Dr. Pol', 2011, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, 'Jan Pol, Ari Rubin', 'TV-PG', 'Set in Central Michigan''s farm country, this reality series follows the work done at Pol Veterinary Services. Specializing in large farm animals, Dr. Pol treats horses, pigs, cows, sheep, alpacas, goats, chickens and even an occasional reindeer. The program also features Dr. Brenda Grettenberger, who has worked with Dr. Pol since 1992.', 'Set in Central Michigan''s farm country, this reality series follows the work done at Pol Veterinary Services. Specializing in large farm animals, Dr. Pol treats horses, pigs, cows, sheep, alpacas, goats, chickens and even an occasional reindeer. The program also features Dr. Brenda Grettenberger, who has worked with Dr. Pol since 1992.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/faMFGFfNVfoyFRzEW9xODCtatj7.jpg', 24, 'tmdb:tv:49297'),
  ('206097955570840704', 'The Incredible Hulk', 1977, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Kenneth Johnson', 'Jack Kirby, Stan Lee, Richard Christian Matheson', 'Bill Bixby, Lou Ferrigno, Jack Colvin, Charles Napier', 'TV-PG', 'During an experiment gone bad, radiation turns a scientist into a raging green behemoth whenever he becomes agitated. Unable to control his transformations, David Banner searches for a cure as he crosses the country, fugitive-style, with a dogged tabloid reporter on his trail.', 'During an experiment gone bad, radiation turns a scientist into a raging green behemoth whenever he becomes agitated. Unable to control his transformations, David Banner searches for a cure as he crosses the country, fugitive-style, with a dogged tabloid reporter on his trail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8q7uFuNuMWTWfcpnCpBuZa3KZXx.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:648'),
  ('913533508585164652', 'The Incredible Hulk', 1982, 'Animation, Drama', 'Stan Lee, Jack Kirby', null, 'Michael Horton, B.J. Ward, Michael Bell, Robert Ridgely, Pat Fraley, Stan Lee, Bob Holt', null, 'The Incredible Hulk is an animated television series based on the Marvel Comics character of the same name. The series ran for 13 episodes on NBC in 1982, part of a combined hour with Spider-Man and His Amazing Friends. Unlike the previous live-action The Incredible Hulk television series from Universal in the 1970s, this series was based upon the Hulk comic-books and was able to portray the more fantastical elements of the comics as sticking to his true name and origin as well as featuring the return of the original characters in his life all of which the live-action series refused to show. It featured stories faithful to the source material from Marvel, In addition, new recurring characters were created for the series including the Hispanic family of father Rio and his youthful daughter Rita.', 'The Incredible Hulk is an animated television series based on the Marvel Comics character of the same name. The series ran for 13 episodes on NBC in 1982, part of a combined hour with Spider-Man and His Amazing Friends. Unlike the previous live-action The Incredible Hulk television series from Universal in the 1970s, this series was based upon the Hulk comic-books and was able to portray the more fantastical elements of the comics as sticking to his true name and origin as well as featuring the return of the original characters in his life all of which the live-action series refused to show. It featured stories faithful to the source material from Marvel, In addition, new recurring characters were created for the series including the Hispanic family of father Rio and his youthful daughter Rita.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svLkVHmyTFcU57MgkDstnMajDYT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11328'),
  ('338375838174737245', 'The Incredible Hulk', 1996, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, 'Lou Ferrigno, Neal McDonough, Cree Summer, John Vernon, Matt Frewer, Luke Perry, Kevin Schon, Michael Donovan', 'TV-Y7', 'When research scientist Bruce Banner is blasted with a gamma ray bomb during an experiment gone wrong, he develops a dangerous alter ego -- a mean, green monster known as the Incredible Hulk -- who emerges when he gets angry.', 'When research scientist Bruce Banner is blasted with a gamma ray bomb during an experiment gone wrong, he develops a dangerous alter ego -- a mean, green monster known as the Incredible Hulk -- who emerges when he gets angry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wa60s9NSvrH87NFCArmobnIyNnh.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:6332'),
  ('539985602505067099', 'The Incredible Human Journey', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Michael Mosley', null, 'Alice Roberts, Tessa Wojtczak', null, 'There are seven billion humans on Earth, spread across the whole planet. Scientific evidence suggests that most of us can trace our origins to one tiny group of people who left Africa around 70,000 years ago. In this five-part series, Dr Alice Roberts follows the archaeological and genetic footprints of our ancient ancestors to find out how their journeys transformed our species into the humans we are today, and how Homo Sapiens came to dominate the planet.', 'There are seven billion humans on Earth, spread across the whole planet. Scientific evidence suggests that most of us can trace our origins to one tiny group of people who left Africa around 70,000 years ago. In this five-part series, Dr Alice Roberts follows the archaeological and genetic footprints of our ancient ancestors to find out how their journeys transformed our species into the humans we are today, and how Homo Sapiens came to dominate the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3dnGvMCDdqijnLuBv35i74bEleP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:18687'),
  ('74478167764474126', 'The Incredible Journey of Mary Bryant', 2005, 'Drama', 'Peter Berry', 'Peter Berry', 'Jack Davenport, Romola Garai, Alex O''Loughlin, Sam Neill, Garry McDonald, David Field, Linal Haft, Alice McConnell', 'NR', 'Mary Bryant, a Cornish girl who was convicted of petty theft, is being transported to the Australian Penal Colony on the First Fleet with other prisoners bound for Botany Bay.', 'Mary Bryant, a Cornish girl who was convicted of petty theft, is being transported to the Australian Penal Colony on the First Fleet with other prisoners bound for Botany Bay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xd7MxMGzEqMASt0QRggNRuzXzLv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16491'),
  ('1021548904910242109', 'The Indian Detective', 2017, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama', 'Frank Spotnitz, Smita Bhide', 'Smita Bhide, Frank Spotnitz', 'Russell Peters, Mishqah Parthiephal, Christina Cole, Anupam Kher, William Shatner, Hamza Haq, Meren Reddy', null, 'A Toronto police officer gets involved in a homicide investigation while visiting his father in Mumbai.', 'A Toronto police officer gets involved in a homicide investigation while visiting his father in Mumbai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z46fxeWmLqxbsIPo0UoLj6Sm9OE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72734'),
  ('319348321987012746', 'The Influencer', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Mariana Gómez, Juan Manuel Mendoza Ruiz, Luna Baxter, Camilo Amores, Andrea Guzmán, Carlos Camacho, Marcela Agudelo, Felipe Calero', null, 'After a social media stunt goes wrong, an influencer is forced to rebuild her reputation while navigating a cutthroat online scene.', 'After a social media stunt goes wrong, an influencer is forced to rebuild her reputation while navigating a cutthroat online scene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Dc3GQZJ33rM2meCOKE00w87xmy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241455'),
  ('572657888124315924', 'The Influencer', 2024, 'Reality', 'Lee Jae-seok, Son Soo-jeong', null, 'Jang Keun-suk, Pani Bottle, Jin Yong-jin, Risabae, Chahong, OKING, Great Library, Eunji Pyo', 'TV-MA', 'YouTube, TikTok, Instagram — 77 elite influencers flaunt their skills to strategically draw the most attention in this high-stakes social survival show.', 'YouTube, TikTok, Instagram — 77 elite influencers flaunt their skills to strategically draw the most attention in this high-stakes social survival show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXnWgdMg0WejH8bwadFNX00MV6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:243149'),
  ('561061962137387328', 'The Informant', 2022, 'Drama', 'Bálint Szentgyörgyi', null, 'Gergely Váradi, Márton Patkós, Szabolcs Thuróczy, Benjámin Lengyel, Varga Ádám, Richárd Borbély, Júlia Szász, Abigél Szőke', 'TV-MA', 'Behind the Iron Curtain, Geri leaves for college, looks forward to meeting girls and partying and joins a group of radicals led by the charismatic Száva. But Geri has a secret. He’s an informant of the totalitarian state and to save his brother, he’s been forced to spy on his new friends for State Security.', 'Behind the Iron Curtain, Geri leaves for college, looks forward to meeting girls and partying and joins a group of radicals led by the charismatic Száva. But Geri has a secret. He’s an informant of the totalitarian state and to save his brother, he’s been forced to spy on his new friends for State Security.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iEzeXZrgsPJpfQoI76E9pqAXJpv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:136389'),
  ('584566534802034590', 'The Ingenious One', 2023, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Mystery', null, 'Liang Zhenhua, Yan Xi, Jiang Da Qiao', 'Chen Xiao, Mao Xiaotong, Tang Xiaotian, Amelie Xu, Liu Guanlin, Qin Lan, Wang Jinsong, Kara Hui Ying-Hung', null, 'Yun Xiang, a disciple of Yuntai, entered the arena after ten years of hard practice. In the process of traversing the rivers and lakes, Yun Xiang met several friends and gradually realized the warmth of friendship. Shu Yanan, a weird elf, intelligent and alert woman, made Yun Xiang even more dimly affectionate. The energetic Yunxiang and his friends spent a period of happiness and enmity together. But the good times didn''t last long. With the in-depth investigation of the past genocide tragedies, Yun Xiang unearthed more appalling secrets, and the situation began to take a turn for the worse. He has experienced deception, betrayal, and separation of life and death, and realized that Yuntai, which once took the blessing of life, has long fallen. Yun Xiang decided to stand up and defend the justice in his heart, even at the expense of himself.', 'Yun Xiang, a disciple of Yuntai, entered the arena after ten years of hard practice. In the process of traversing the rivers and lakes, Yun Xiang met several friends and gradually realized the warmth of friendship. Shu Yanan, a weird elf, intelligent and alert woman, made Yun Xiang even more dimly affectionate. The energetic Yunxiang and his friends spent a period of happiness and enmity together. But the good times didn''t last long. With the in-depth investigation of the past genocide tragedies, Yun Xiang unearthed more appalling secrets, and the situation began to take a turn for the worse. He has experienced deception, betrayal, and separation of life and death, and realized that Yuntai, which once took the blessing of life, has long fallen. Yun Xiang decided to stand up and defend the justice in his heart, even at the expense of himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mD62qC4llXlYwPoX2yAVkfjE3FL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:138288'),
  ('243792101728429316', 'The Ingenuity of the Househusband', 2021, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Kenjiro Tsuda', 'TV-G', 'A tough guy with a knack for housework tackles household tasks with meticulous care in these comedic live-action vignettes.', 'A tough guy with a knack for housework tackles household tasks with meticulous care in these comedic live-action vignettes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YsqAxuLUxCsJ2maSnHdEmCils2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132262'),
  ('357370068080379238', 'The Inheritance', 2023, 'Drama', 'Aschlin Ditta', 'Aschlin Ditta', 'Robert James-Collier, Gaynor Faye, Jemima Rooper, Adil Ray, Larry Lamb, Rocco Cheetham-Karcz, Kevin Harvey, Samantha Bond', null, 'The siblings discover their father has left everything to a woman they have never met. As his death becomes the subject of a police investigation, the siblings hunt for his previous will.', 'The siblings discover their father has left everything to a woman they have never met. As his death becomes the subject of a police investigation, the siblings hunt for his previous will.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mBpgq8KDnHf4kOCUZw6iBh9uefA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:49361'),
  ('934821467085656052', 'The Inmate', 2018, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Ignacio Serricchio, Ana Claudia Talancón, Erik Hayser, Alejandro Calva, Mariana Seoane, David Chocarro, Flavio Medina, Luis Felipe Tovar', null, 'A former U.S. Marine, Lázaro Mendoza, enters a maximum security prison in Mexico (La Rotunda), under a false identity and accused of an alleged triple murder. Now as Dante Pardo, his mission is to infiltrate a dangerous band of inmates and guards that operate inside and outside of prison who are the prime suspects of the kidnapping of the teenage daughter of U.S. Judge, John Morris. Inside La Rotunda, Lázaro has to find out who carried out the kidnapping and the whereabouts of the girl.', 'A former U.S. Marine, Lázaro Mendoza, enters a maximum security prison in Mexico (La Rotunda), under a false identity and accused of an alleged triple murder. Now as Dante Pardo, his mission is to infiltrate a dangerous band of inmates and guards that operate inside and outside of prison who are the prime suspects of the kidnapping of the teenage daughter of U.S. Judge, John Morris. Inside La Rotunda, Lázaro has to find out who carried out the kidnapping and the whereabouts of the girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Cs9p1kl6s2i1LfFmcquoFb56yl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82585'),
