  ('916578341570517285', 'The Kennedys', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Emma Kennedy', null, 'Lucy Hutchinson, Katherine Parkinson, Dan Renton Skinner, Emma Pierson, Harry Peacock, Trixiebell Harrowell', null, 'Multi-generation family sitcom set in the 1970s, loosely based on Emma Kennedy''s memoirs. The Kennedy family pursue every opportunity they can to climb the social ladder on their housing estate.', 'Multi-generation family sitcom set in the 1970s, loosely based on Emma Kennedy''s memoirs. The Kennedy family pursue every opportunity they can to climb the social ladder on their housing estate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lKybwk9cx3yCeig37fXhiL0DJoP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64067'),
  ('1012494101970187248', 'The Kennedys: After Camelot', 2017, 'Drama', 'Jon Cassar', null, 'Katie Holmes, Matthew Perry, Diana Hardcastle, Kristin Booth, Kristen Hager, Alexander Siddig, Brett Donahue, Ted Atherton', 'TV-PG', 'Picking up where the Emmy-winning miniseries The Kennedys left off, The Kennedys – After Camelot provides a fascinating look into the modern era of America’s royal family. Based on the best-selling book of the same name by J. Randy Taraborrelli.', 'Picking up where the Emmy-winning miniseries The Kennedys left off, The Kennedys – After Camelot provides a fascinating look into the modern era of America’s royal family. Based on the best-selling book of the same name by J. Randy Taraborrelli.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Kmb5l5NPhvpJcHg1NypLnPYver.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70908'),
  ('250891824982287612', 'The Kenny Everett Television Show', 1982, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Kenny Everett, Cleo Rocos', null, 'Sketch comedy show starring Kenny Everett.', 'Sketch comedy show starring Kenny Everett.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fWBdcUFj7MlpV2fvxbNcEEG0rmZ.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:27818'),
  ('817639116745482603', 'The Kettering Incident', 2016, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Vincent Sheehan, Victoria Madden', 'Victoria Madden, Louise Fox, Cate Shortland', 'Elizabeth Debicki, Matthew Le Nevez, Henry Nixon, Alison Whyte, Anthony Phelan, Damon Gameau, Damien Garvey, Sacha Horler', 'TV-MA', 'Anna Macy left Kettering when she was just 14, shortly after her best friend, Gillian Baxter mysteriously disappeared. The two girls had been playing in the forbidden forests outside Kettering when they saw strange lights in the sky. Eight hours later, Anna was found alone, terrified and covered in blood. 15 years on, Anna returns to find the town struggling to survive. The forests have been marked for logging and the community is being torn apart by passionate but violent clashes between environmentalists and the local loggers.', 'Anna Macy left Kettering when she was just 14, shortly after her best friend, Gillian Baxter mysteriously disappeared. The two girls had been playing in the forbidden forests outside Kettering when they saw strange lights in the sky. Eight hours later, Anna was found alone, terrified and covered in blood. 15 years on, Anna returns to find the town struggling to survive. The forests have been marked for logging and the community is being torn apart by passionate but violent clashes between environmentalists and the local loggers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHvjyl7y7kqXpciGfYsFCyYmjVp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63840'),
  ('440330273014991663', 'The Kicks', 2016, 'Family', 'Alex Morgan, David Babcock', null, 'Sixx Orange, Gabe Eggerling, Sophia Mitri Schloss, Tim Martin Gleason, Isabella Acres, Emyri Crutchfield, Monica Lacy', null, 'Devin Burke and her family have moved cross-country to California and now must adjust to a new life and a new soccer team. The Kentville Kicks don''t quite play up to the standard that Devin is used to, so she must establish herself as a leader while also trying to make friends in a strange place.', 'Devin Burke and her family have moved cross-country to California and now must adjust to a new life and a new soccer team. The Kentville Kicks don''t quite play up to the standard that Devin is used to, so she must establish herself as a leader while also trying to make friends in a strange place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lEczQVS7u92ntfZQlqY1hpMie3N.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68296'),
  ('608758617086497233', 'The Kidnapping Day', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Kim Je-young, Park Yoo-young', null, 'Yoon Kye-sang, Yuna, Park Sung-hoon, Kim Shin-rock, Kim Sang-ho, Seo Jae-hee, Kang Young-suk, Choi Eun-woo', null, 'A father turned clumsy kidnapper and a genius child get tangled in unexpected circumstances.', 'A father turned clumsy kidnapper and a genius child get tangled in unexpected circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rtuZelGw0xDo27akrKD36aCiYN5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:212203'),
  ('1020091682333455317', 'The Kidney', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Avdotya Smirnova', 'Elizaveta Tikhonova, Mariya Shulgina', 'Lyubov Aksyonova, Nikolay Fomenko, Irina Rozanova, Aleksey Rozin, Anton Filipenko, Dmitry Lysenkov, Yanina Lakoba, Irina Byakova', null, 'An employee of the fire department - a manipulator and a bribe-taker - is trying to get herself a kidney for a transplant. But this is not easy to do, since she lived her life in such a way that no one wants to help her.', 'An employee of the fire department - a manipulator and a bribe-taker - is trying to get herself a kidney for a transplant. But this is not easy to do, since she lived her life in such a way that no one wants to help her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3nP373Gxl2ggzxMoe3RnrHukvSh.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:153877'),
  ('437534874063062146', 'The Kids Are Alright', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Tim Doyle', null, 'Sam Straley, Caleb Foote, Santino Barnard, Mary McCormack, Sawyer Barth, Andy Walken, Michael Cudlitz, Jack Gore', 'TV-PG', 'In a working-class neighborhood outside Los Angeles, Mike and Peggy raise eight boisterous boys. There are 10 people, three bedrooms, one bathroom and everyone in it for themselves.', 'In a working-class neighborhood outside Los Angeles, Mike and Peggy raise eight boisterous boys. There are 10 people, three bedrooms, one bathroom and everyone in it for themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5Ox9hxPT3bxG6Utr76oKevrNOl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81923'),
  ('927276860204940320', 'The Kids from Room 402', 2000, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Betty Paraskevas', null, 'Andrew Lawrence, April Winchell, Edie McClurg, Lori Alan, Bryton James, Mindy Cohn, Olivia Hack, Tara Strong', null, 'The Kids from Room 402 is a television program that originally aired on Fox Family in the USA starting in 1999, previously aired on Teletoon, and currently airs in the UK. The show is focused primarily on the students from Room 402, as the title implies. Miss Graves, the teacher, is usually shown as an interlocutor in the problems and injustices that are inflicted upon the students, whether the dilemmas be internal or external. Each show usually ends with a substantiated moral or lesson, resulting from such aforementioned situations. The show is based on the children''s book, The Kids from Room 402, by Betty Paraskevas and Michael Paraskevas. It was developed for television by Cindy Begel and Lesa Kite, who wrote all 52 episodes.', 'The Kids from Room 402 is a television program that originally aired on Fox Family in the USA starting in 1999, previously aired on Teletoon, and currently airs in the UK. The show is focused primarily on the students from Room 402, as the title implies. Miss Graves, the teacher, is usually shown as an interlocutor in the problems and injustices that are inflicted upon the students, whether the dilemmas be internal or external. Each show usually ends with a substantiated moral or lesson, resulting from such aforementioned situations. The show is based on the children''s book, The Kids from Room 402, by Betty Paraskevas and Michael Paraskevas. It was developed for television by Cindy Begel and Lesa Kite, who wrote all 52 episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hrhvKp7A3WSsJ7JRInL0z1IhIqV.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:11191'),
  ('110985977290636878', 'The Kids in the Hall', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Mark McKinney, Dave Foley, Bruce McCulloch', null, 'Mark McKinney, Scott Thompson, Dave Foley, Kevin McDonald, Bruce McCulloch', null, 'The Kids in the Hall is a Canadian sketch comedy group formed in 1984, consisting of comedians Dave Foley, Kevin McDonald, Bruce McCulloch, Mark McKinney, and Scott Thompson.', 'The Kids in the Hall is a Canadian sketch comedy group formed in 1984, consisting of comedians Dave Foley, Kevin McDonald, Bruce McCulloch, Mark McKinney, and Scott Thompson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2dNiB88EBv64V9rcicXwNGQosJW.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1551'),
  ('932408347034081418', 'The Kids in the Hall', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Kevin McDonald, Dave Foley, Mark McKinney', null, 'Dave Foley, Bruce McCulloch, Kevin McDonald, Mark McKinney, Scott Thompson', 'TV-MA', 'The iconic Canadian sketch comedy show returns with an exciting new season, a fresh batch of fun, off-beat characters and beloved favorites, and sketches that pack a satirical punch, all laced with the edgy and fearless comedy the Kids are synonymous for.', 'The iconic Canadian sketch comedy show returns with an exciting new season, a fresh batch of fun, off-beat characters and beloved favorites, and sketches that pack a satirical punch, all laced with the edgy and fearless comedy the Kids are synonymous for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cy5WLoE5QvyWAqOpaAytq70Xyvp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:199918'),
  ('133821725811471103', 'The Kids in the Hall: Death Comes to Town', 2010, 'Comedy', null, 'Bruce McCulloch, Scott Thompson, Kevin McDonald', 'Dave Foley, Scott Thompson, Kevin McDonald, Bruce McCulloch, Mark McKinney', 'NR', 'In the fictional Ontario town of Shuckton, the mayor has been murdered! As the Shuckton residents cope with the loss, a new lawyer moves in to prosecute a suspect – though another resident, unsatisfied with the evidence, tries to find the real killer. At the same time, a character who is a personification of death waits at a motel room for the latest Shuckton residents to die...', 'In the fictional Ontario town of Shuckton, the mayor has been murdered! As the Shuckton residents cope with the loss, a new lawyer moves in to prosecute a suspect – though another resident, unsatisfied with the evidence, tries to find the real killer. At the same time, a character who is a personification of death waits at a motel room for the latest Shuckton residents to die...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rynmVYuWDNVwFpqzgw0QB0zZeHc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31770'),
  ('1038333957080451975', 'The Kill Point', 2007, 'Drama, Crime', 'James DeMonaco', null, 'John Leguizamo, Donnie Wahlberg, Michael Hyatt, Christine Evangelista, Jeremy Davidson, Steve Cirbus, Geoffrey Cantor, Wayne Kasserman', null, 'A small group of military veterans sets out to rob a major bank in Pittsburgh. When things go awry, they''re forced to take more than a dozen hostages from all walks of life, including a wealthy and powerful businessman''s daughter.', 'A small group of military veterans sets out to rob a major bank in Pittsburgh. When things go awry, they''re forced to take more than a dozen hostages from all walks of life, including a wealthy and powerful businessman''s daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lpCdvgqiH5ec4tDYgirDm2HCzm5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13171'),
  ('677489077186334532', 'The Killer''s Shopping List', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'Lee Eun-hee', 'Han Ji-wan', 'Lee Kwang-soo, Kim Seol-hyun, Jin Hee-kyung, Park Ji-bin, Jo A-ram, Kim Mi-hwa, Oh Hye-won, Shin Sung-woo', null, 'One day, a dead body is found at an apartment near the supermarket. Finding this murder odd, Dae-sung, his mother, and his girlfriend Ah-hee gather around to find the real murderer, starting by looking through the receipts of the market.', 'One day, a dead body is found at an apartment near the supermarket. Finding this murder odd, Dae-sung, his mother, and his girlfriend Ah-hee gather around to find the real murderer, starting by looking through the receipts of the market.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSXFj47WKRc4ENChaWdm7joObmI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138246'),
  ('172953063446129230', 'The Killing', 2007, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Søren Sveistrup', null, 'Sofie Gråbøl, Morten Suurballe, Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Sigurd Holmen le Dous, Anders W. Berthelsen, Olaf Johannessen, Jonatan Spang, Trine Pallesen', 'TV-MA', 'The Killing is a Danish police procedural set in the Copenhagen main police department and revolves around Detective Inspector Sarah Lund and her team, with each season series following a different murder case day-by-day and a one-hour episode covering twenty-four hours of the investigation. The series is noted for its plot twists, season-long storylines, dark tone and for giving equal emphasis to the story of the murdered victim''s family alongside the police investigation. It has also been singled out for the photography of its Danish setting, and for the acting ability of its cast.', 'The Killing is a Danish police procedural set in the Copenhagen main police department and revolves around Detective Inspector Sarah Lund and her team, with each season series following a different murder case day-by-day and a one-hour episode covering twenty-four hours of the investigation. The series is noted for its plot twists, season-long storylines, dark tone and for giving equal emphasis to the story of the murdered victim''s family alongside the police investigation. It has also been singled out for the photography of its Danish setting, and for the acting ability of its cast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p8Vc9kF4Ju059FWI9G47GyiDM89.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:32368'),
  ('294371553070114535', 'The Killing', 2011, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Veena Sud', null, 'Mireille Enos, Joel Kinnaman, Gregg Henry, Joan Allen, Sterling Beaumon, Levi Meaden, Morten Hauch-Fausbøll, Rowan Longworth', 'TV-MA', 'The Killing is an American crime drama television series based upon the Danish television series Forbrydelsen. Set in Seattle, Washington, the series follows the various murder investigations by homicide detectives Sarah Linden and Stephen Holder.', 'The Killing is an American crime drama television series based upon the Danish television series Forbrydelsen. Set in Seattle, Washington, the series follows the various murder investigations by homicide detectives Sarah Linden and Stephen Holder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3yiwAUNGn1rsPSVmFgVwPVJFtYf.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:34415'),
  ('136752430269400484', 'The Killing Kind', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Zara Hayes, Jonathan Stewart', null, 'Emma Appleton, Colin Morgan, Elliot Barnes-Worrell, Olivia D''Lima, Nicholas Rowe, Sophie Stanton', null, 'Barrister Ingrid Lewis defends John Webster against stalking charges, only for Webster to turn on her.', 'Barrister Ingrid Lewis defends John Webster against stalking charges, only for Webster to turn on her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5imNWXMYXmBZBc34BqPE3lkoIl9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:231340'),
  ('1060357659376886', 'The Killing Season', 2016, 'Crime, Documentary', null, 'Joshua Zeman', 'Joshua Zeman, Rachel Mills', 'TV-14', 'Follow documentarians Joshua Zeman and Rachel Mills as they investigate one of the most bizarre unsolved serial killer cases of our time – the deaths of ten sex workers discovered on Gilgo Beach, Long Island.', 'Follow documentarians Joshua Zeman and Rachel Mills as they investigate one of the most bizarre unsolved serial killer cases of our time – the deaths of ten sex workers discovered on Gilgo Beach, Long Island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZXUf4j28UuPv1kccrS3TVwKEoJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68505'),
  ('227725672826018104', 'The Killing Vote', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Park Shin-woo, Cho Yoon-young', null, 'Park Hae-jin, Lim Ji-yeon, Park Sung-woong, Kim Yu-mi, Shin Jung-keun, Kim Kwon, Choi Yu-hwa, Seo Young-joo', null, 'People are busy watching the screen. The person wearing a mysterious mask so called ''Gaetal'' appears, and the Killing Vote begins.', 'People are busy watching the screen. The person wearing a mysterious mask so called ''Gaetal'' appears, and the Killing Vote begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b31zFi0ZocmaxxuPCAGxEA6uxGn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217088'),
  ('208413721978342256', 'The King 2 Hearts', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Ha Ji-won, Lee Seung-gi, Lee Yoon-ji, Cho Jung-seok, Yoon Je-moon, Youn Yuh-jung, Lee Sung-min, Lee Soon-jae', null, 'Set in the constitutional monarchy in an imaginary South Korea, South Korea''s Crown Prince Lee Jae Ha is forced to join the World Officers Competition, WOC, by his brother. There, he meets North Korea''s strongest female devil instructor Kim Hang Ah.', 'Set in the constitutional monarchy in an imaginary South Korea, South Korea''s Crown Prince Lee Jae Ha is forced to join the World Officers Competition, WOC, by his brother. There, he meets North Korea''s strongest female devil instructor Kim Hang Ah.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d08001LY3ROaG8DFGhKyJzrruK8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46528'),
  ('186681941367858708', 'The King in Love', 2017, 'Drama', 'Song Ji-na', 'Park Chan-Kyung, No Sun-Jae, Song Ji-na', 'Yim Si-wan, Yoona, Hong Jong-hyun, Park Hwan-Hee, Oh Min-suk, Yoon Jong-hoon, Jung Bo-seog, Jang Young-nam', 'TV-14', 'Set during the Goryeo dynasty, Won, crown prince, has a sweet appearance hiding a lust for conquest. He is best friends with Rin, an elegant man of royal descent and Won''s bodyguard. When beautiful San, the sole daughter of the wealthiest man in the nation, enters the lives of the two young men, the three at first become friends but a tragic romance ensues afterwards. Based on the novel of the same name by Kim Yi-Ryung.', 'Set during the Goryeo dynasty, Won, crown prince, has a sweet appearance hiding a lust for conquest. He is best friends with Rin, an elegant man of royal descent and Won''s bodyguard. When beautiful San, the sole daughter of the wealthiest man in the nation, enters the lives of the two young men, the three at first become friends but a tragic romance ensues afterwards. Based on the novel of the same name by Kim Yi-Ryung.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AgRiDBIYTgIWUnTer7PAS4Fwdkb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70455'),
  ('967666295515342433', 'The King of Blaze', 2018, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Chen Bolin, Jing Tian, Zhang Yijie, Sun Shaolong, 范一宣, Du Junze, Huang Youming, Du Yuming', 'TV-14', 'Thousands of years ago, there was a beautiful planet amongst the stars where the deities lived. Among them, there were six powerful gods that include the God of Fire, God of Wind and the God of Mountain maintained the peace in the realms. During a dangerous battle with dark forces, the deities suffer a huge blow. Wind is nowhere to be found after rescuing Fire. In order to find an alternate energy source to save their home, Fire travels to the glorious age of Tang Dynasty where he meets a person who looks exactly like his long-lost love, the God of Wind and ignites a complicated romance between the two.', 'Thousands of years ago, there was a beautiful planet amongst the stars where the deities lived. Among them, there were six powerful gods that include the God of Fire, God of Wind and the God of Mountain maintained the peace in the realms. During a dangerous battle with dark forces, the deities suffer a huge blow. Wind is nowhere to be found after rescuing Fire. In order to find an alternate energy source to save their home, Fire travels to the glorious age of Tang Dynasty where he meets a person who looks exactly like his long-lost love, the God of Wind and ignites a complicated romance between the two.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2efQczjuivumDgfc33RKgvofa8B.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:84435'),
  ('946007674107207550', 'The King of Braves GaoGaiGar', 1997, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Yoshitomo Yonetani', null, 'Maiko Itou, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Shinichi Yamada, Koichi Chiba', null, 'In the year 2005, a race of alien monsters emerge from underground and launch a series of attacks on the city of Tokyo. The only defense against these creatures is the awesome giant robot GaoGaiGar and its pilot, Guy Shishio.', 'In the year 2005, a race of alien monsters emerge from underground and launch a series of attacks on the city of Tokyo. The only defense against these creatures is the awesome giant robot GaoGaiGar and its pilot, Guy Shishio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21KKpYBKf0mz4U1BX9S180uVhoE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:45116'),
