  ('397039174484926170', 'The King of Tears, Lee Bang Won', 2021, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Lee Jeong-woo', 'Lee Jeong-woo', 'Ju Sang-uk, Kim Yeong-cheol, Park Jin-hee, Ye Ji-won, Lee Kwang-gi, Ye Su-jeong, Kim Myung-soo, Hong Kyung-in', null, 'A work that sheds new light on the figure of Lee Bang-won, a leader who took the lead in the founding of the nation.', 'A work that sheds new light on the figure of Lee Bang-won, a leader who took the lead in the founding of the nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijVdfnfCrFQDC0tWBNvPejDuZUA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135751'),
