  ('171883006410775144', 'The Man, The Ghost And The Fox', 1992, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Hugo Ng Doi-Yung, Lily Chung Suk-Wai, Sher Ng Wing-Hung, Jimmy Au Shui-Wai, Ga-Bo Tsui, Chan On-ying, Chu Tit-Wo, Mak Chi-Wan', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAhUNg27WL0HRgc0f9EpWacIWH2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109854'),
  ('683694430711670555', 'The Manager', 2018, 'Reality', '김윤집', null, 'Jeon Hyun-moo, Song Eun-yi, Yoo Byung-jae, Yang Se-hyung, Lee Young-ja', null, 'We will get involved in every little detail of the stars’ lives. The managers who work closely with the stars reveal their mundane lives. Once the information is all revealed, the professional meddlers from various different fields are invited to make comments regarding even the smallest details. Lee Yeong Ja, Jun Hyun Moo, Song Eun I, Kim Saeng Min, Yang Se Hyeong and Yoo Byung Jae participate as the life meddlers along with the professionals.', 'We will get involved in every little detail of the stars’ lives. The managers who work closely with the stars reveal their mundane lives. Once the information is all revealed, the professional meddlers from various different fields are invited to make comments regarding even the smallest details. Lee Yeong Ja, Jun Hyun Moo, Song Eun I, Kim Saeng Min, Yang Se Hyeong and Yoo Byung Jae participate as the life meddlers along with the professionals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jASfIetUKhrbqEEKBnjRjjgfuGK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80736'),
  ('411811513288102947', 'The Mandalorian', 2019, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Jon Favreau', null, 'Pedro Pascal, Katee Sackhoff', 'TV-14', 'After the fall of the Galactic Empire, lawlessness has spread throughout the galaxy. A lone gunfighter makes his way through the outer reaches, earning his keep as a bounty hunter.', 'After the fall of the Galactic Empire, lawlessness has spread throughout the galaxy. A lone gunfighter makes his way through the outer reaches, earning his keep as a bounty hunter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sWgBv7LV2PRoQgkxwlibdGXKz1S.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:82856'),
  ('98869851045626773', 'The Manhattan Alien Abduction', 2024, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Linda Napolitano, Carol Rainey, Peter Robbins, Budd Hopkins', 'TV-MA', 'A woman claims to have been abducted from her bedroom in Manhattan. This docuseries explores whether it was an elaborate hoax — or proof of alien life.', 'A woman claims to have been abducted from her bedroom in Manhattan. This docuseries explores whether it was an elaborate hoax — or proof of alien life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nzaoEzVNU6nOEigbbZzUXavduuX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:272494'),
  ('565344847774941802', 'The Manipulated', 2025, 'Crime, Drama', 'Oh Sang-ho', null, 'Ji Chang-wook, Doh Kyung-soo, Lee Kwang-soo, Jo Yoon-soo, Kim Jong-soo, Yang Dong-geun, Lee Jong-hyun', 'TV-MA', 'Taejoong''s life is torn apart when he''s framed for a heinous crime and imprisoned. Discovering it was all orchestrated by someone on the outside, he embarks on a rage-fueled quest for revenge.', 'Taejoong''s life is torn apart when he''s framed for a heinous crime and imprisoned. Discovering it was all orchestrated by someone on the outside, he embarks on a rage-fueled quest for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nOj4nsomFyAVJgpp68L0xq3cREc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:239385'),
  ('198412289067003496', 'The Manny', 2023, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Sandra Echeverría, Iván Amozurrutia, Diana Bovio, Alexander Tavizón, Anthony Giuletti, Cassandra Iturralde', 'TV-14', 'A busy executive hires a rancher to care for her kids in a moment of panic. Little does she know he''ll challenge her views of gender roles — and of love.', 'A busy executive hires a rancher to care for her kids in a moment of panic. Little does she know he''ll challenge her views of gender roles — and of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iFivJqgtNbCDbLaQw1tLTsCDX5o.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:241373'),
  ('7413707378179251', 'The Mansion With Vines', 2002, 'Family, Drama', 'Mahinur Ergun, Meral Okay', 'Mahinur Ergun, Meral Okay', 'Özcan Deniz, Nurgül Yeşilçay, Selda Alkor, Ege Aydan, Selda Özer, Menderes Samancılar, Canan Hoşgör, İpek Tuzcuoğlu', null, 'Asmalı Konak was a Turkish TV series directed by Çağan Irmak and written by Mahinur Ergun and Meral Okay. It was shown on ATV for a total of 54 episodes. The finale of the series was released as a feature film titled Asmalı Konak: Hayat.', 'Asmalı Konak was a Turkish TV series directed by Çağan Irmak and written by Mahinur Ergun and Meral Okay. It was shown on ATV for a total of 54 episodes. The finale of the series was released as a feature film titled Asmalı Konak: Hayat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEkb5evNXHiKt0eTdFE0A4meS9s.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:32107'),
  ('247740435831360816', 'The Many Deaths of Nora Dalmasso', 2025, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Jamie Crawford', null, null, 'TV-14', 'Who killed Nora Dalmasso? In this true-crime series, family and journalists share the untold story of her murder and the media storm that followed.', 'Who killed Nora Dalmasso? In this true-crime series, family and journalists share the untold story of her murder and the media storm that followed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ja6BP5xleodB50Gv8sl59TRHAC1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:293130'),
  ('571688816806773292', 'The Many Faces of Ito', 2017, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Fumino Kimura, Nozomi Sasaki, Mirai Shida, Elaiza Ikeda, Kaho, Kei Tanaka, Yuki Yamada, Tomoya Nakamura', 'TV-14', 'A jaded rom-com screenwriter in her 30s mines four love-sick women for their stories under the guise of providing them with romantic advice.', 'A jaded rom-com screenwriter in her 30s mines four love-sick women for their stories under the guise of providing them with romantic advice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1oKM9oofxyCmSE4vvligYWSJhf4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75341'),
  ('1058939548494481758', 'The Many Loves of Dobie Gillis', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Max Shulman', null, 'Dwayne Hickman, Bob Denver, Frank Faylen, Florida Friebus, Sheila James Kuehl', 'TV-PG', 'The Many Loves of Dobie Gillis is an American sitcom that aired on CBS from 1959 to 1963. The series and several episode scripts were adapted from a 1951 collection of short stories of the same name, written by Max Shulman, who had also written a feature film adaptation of his short stories for MGM in 1953, The Affairs of Dobie Gillis. The series revolved around the life of teenager/young adult Dobie Gillis, who, along with his best friend, beatnik Maynard G. Krebs, struggles against the forces of his life - high school, the military, college, and his parents - as he aspires to attain both wealth and dates with girls. The Many Loves of Dobie Gillis was produced by Martin Manulis Productions in association with 20th Century Fox Television. Creator Shulman also wrote the theme song in collaboration with Lionel Newman.', 'The Many Loves of Dobie Gillis is an American sitcom that aired on CBS from 1959 to 1963. The series and several episode scripts were adapted from a 1951 collection of short stories of the same name, written by Max Shulman, who had also written a feature film adaptation of his short stories for MGM in 1953, The Affairs of Dobie Gillis. The series revolved around the life of teenager/young adult Dobie Gillis, who, along with his best friend, beatnik Maynard G. Krebs, struggles against the forces of his life - high school, the military, college, and his parents - as he aspires to attain both wealth and dates with girls. The Many Loves of Dobie Gillis was produced by Martin Manulis Productions in association with 20th Century Fox Television. Creator Shulman also wrote the theme song in collaboration with Lionel Newman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/LusZEGxE4LxIOAiBCuOvUQcLV1.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:221'),
  ('1147470554081671047', 'The Many Sides of Voice Actor Radio', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Miku Ito, Moe Toyota, Ikumi Hasegawa, Nao Toyama, Ami Koshimizu, Misato Fukuen, Miyuri Shimabukuro', 'TV-14', 'Yuhi Yugure and Yasumi Utatane, high school classmates and co-hosts of a weekly radio program, paint a picture-perfect friendship for their listeners. Yet, in reality, they couldn’t be more different. Their off-air dynamic is a whirlwind of chaos and insults. As their tumultuous relationship unfolds, they navigate the turbulent waters of friendship and rivalry in the cutthroat realm of showbiz.', 'Yuhi Yugure and Yasumi Utatane, high school classmates and co-hosts of a weekly radio program, paint a picture-perfect friendship for their listeners. Yet, in reality, they couldn’t be more different. Their off-air dynamic is a whirlwind of chaos and insults. As their tumultuous relationship unfolds, they navigate the turbulent waters of friendship and rivalry in the cutthroat realm of showbiz.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/733lDek9YYMfxplg0ELoi3mkRuH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:216760'),
  ('265672753613085414', 'The Marked Heart', 2022, 'Soap, Mystery', 'Leonardo Padrón', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'A man hell-bent on exacting revenge on the organ trafficking organization that murdered his wife becomes involved with the woman who received her heart.', 'A man hell-bent on exacting revenge on the organ trafficking organization that murdered his wife becomes involved with the woman who received her heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/M1q0HuyRnqxP8Si54srsPREFIH.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:158916'),
  ('522806316184314548', 'The Marked Hour', 1988, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Guillermo del Toro, Alfonso Cuarón, Alejandro González Iñárritu', 'María Rojo, Blanca Guerra, Ernesto Gómez Cruz, Angelina Peláez, Patricia Reyes Spíndola, Daniel Giménez Cacho, Arcelia Ramírez, Salvador Sánchez', null, 'La Hora Marcada was a 1986 Mexican television anthology series famous for its horror and science fiction themes in the vein of the Twilight Zone. Although virtually unknown outside the country, it achieved a popular and critical success in Mexico. It had a series of rotating writers and directors, among them Emmanuel Lubezki, Guillermo del Toro and Alfonso Cuarón.', 'La Hora Marcada was a 1986 Mexican television anthology series famous for its horror and science fiction themes in the vein of the Twilight Zone. Although virtually unknown outside the country, it achieved a popular and critical success in Mexico. It had a series of rotating writers and directors, among them Emmanuel Lubezki, Guillermo del Toro and Alfonso Cuarón.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t6S2PQPSHxlZfXGf7XTR611stSK.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:18390'),
  ('357808613333377208', 'The Marlow Murder Club', 2024, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Robert Thorogood', null, 'Samantha Bond, Jo Martin, Cara Horgan', null, 'Retired archaeologist and crossword setter Judith Potts believes that a brutal murder has taken place in the sleepy town of Marlow; when the police refuse to believe her story, she kicks off a private investigation with two unlikely friends.', 'Retired archaeologist and crossword setter Judith Potts believes that a brutal murder has taken place in the sleepy town of Marlow; when the police refuse to believe her story, she kicks off a private investigation with two unlikely friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ViwT4iIsQpxvrVgIoAidOp5J33.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:228079'),
  ('708126530299172273', 'The Marquis', 2024, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Begoña Álvarez, Ignacio del Moral', null, 'Víctor Clavijo, José Pastor, Juan Fernández, Lara Grube, Paco Tous, Laura Baena, Cinta Ramírez, Óscar de la Fuente', null, 'Summer of 1975, five people die on a farm in Paradas, Seville. Two years later, Onofre returns to his hometown to investigate the event, which has caused great division among the neighbors. His investigation takes him to different environments and characters, among them the Marquis of Bahia. Always as a fiction, we will reveal how this crime was conceived.', 'Summer of 1975, five people die on a farm in Paradas, Seville. Two years later, Onofre returns to his hometown to investigate the event, which has caused great division among the neighbors. His investigation takes him to different environments and characters, among them the Marquis of Bahia. Always as a fiction, we will reveal how this crime was conceived.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m7pqSTLIDWtaAyeu4uAQSIanNUR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:242872'),
  ('112642027263090655', 'The Martian Chronicles', 1980, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ray Bradbury', null, 'Rock Hudson, Darren McGavin, Roddy McDowall, Joyce Van Patten, Gayle Hunnicutt, Phil Brown, Peter Marinker, Richard Oldfield', null, 'The Martian Chronicles deals with the exploration of Mars and the inhabitants there.', 'The Martian Chronicles deals with the exploration of Mars and the inhabitants there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBq5qOxBKnhGZNcW36b2Qq6cLDG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3226'),
  ('495896274125797072', 'The Marvel Super Heroes', 1966, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, 'Chris Wiggins, John Vernon, Paul Soles', 'TV-G', 'This cartoon series, characterized by extremely limited animation, features five of the most popular super-powered heroes from Marvel Comics: the Incredible Hulk, the Mighty Thor, Captain America, Iron Man, and the Sub-Mariner.', 'This cartoon series, characterized by extremely limited animation, features five of the most popular super-powered heroes from Marvel Comics: the Incredible Hulk, the Mighty Thor, Captain America, Iron Man, and the Sub-Mariner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkY0h3WxWWKIxrcpUJdziMV3IN3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2164'),
  ('343594229380260910', 'The Marvelous Misadventures of Flapjack', 2008, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Animation', 'Thurop Van Orman', null, 'Thurop Van Orman, Brian Doyle-Murray, Roz Ryan, Jeff Bennett, Steve Little, Richard McGonagle, S. Scott Bullock, Daran Norris', 'TV-Y7', 'A young boy who grew up inside a talking whale sets sail for magical Candied Island, accompanied by Capt. K''nuckles, a crusty old pirate.', 'A young boy who grew up inside a talking whale sets sail for magical Candied Island, accompanied by Capt. K''nuckles, a crusty old pirate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dpk0bjBgX93ZkQxEI1daNSj3OW.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:6673'),
  ('841638775642590135', 'The Marvelous Mrs. Maisel', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Amy Sherman-Palladino', null, 'Rachel Brosnahan, Alex Borstein, Michael Zegen, Tony Shalhoub, Marin Hinkle, Kevin Pollak, Caroline Aaron, Reid Scott', 'TV-MA', 'It’s 1958 Manhattan and Miriam “Midge” Maisel has everything she’s ever wanted - the perfect husband, kids, and Upper West Side apartment. But when her life suddenly takes a turn and Midge must start over, she discovers a previously unknown talent - one that will take her all the way from the comedy clubs of Greenwich Village to a spot on Johnny Carson’s couch.', 'It’s 1958 Manhattan and Miriam “Midge” Maisel has everything she’s ever wanted - the perfect husband, kids, and Upper West Side apartment. But when her life suddenly takes a turn and Midge must start over, she discovers a previously unknown talent - one that will take her all the way from the comedy clubs of Greenwich Village to a spot on Johnny Carson’s couch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aslKQXXydNQxSBvP7zzsbaNTIlF.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:70796'),
  ('40433009286785796', 'The Mary Tyler Moore Show', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Allan Burns, James L. Brooks', null, 'Mary Tyler Moore, Ed Asner, Gavin MacLeod, Ted Knight', 'NR', '30-year-old single Mary Richards moves to Minneapolis to start a new life after a romantic break-up. There she reacquaints with Phyllis who rents her a room, and meets her upstairs neighbor and new best friend Rhoda. Mary unexpectedly lands a job as associate producer at the TV station WJM, where she works alongside her bristly boss, Lou; the comical newswriter, Murray; and the newscast''s often-incompetent anchor, Ted.', '30-year-old single Mary Richards moves to Minneapolis to start a new life after a romantic break-up. There she reacquaints with Phyllis who rents her a room, and meets her upstairs neighbor and new best friend Rhoda. Mary unexpectedly lands a job as associate producer at the TV station WJM, where she works alongside her bristly boss, Lou; the comical newswriter, Murray; and the newscast''s often-incompetent anchor, Ted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFsgsmK7isjtdEVTL35mJEQZHuO.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:2962'),
  ('1067668962312625718', 'The Mash Report', 2017, 'Comedy, Talk, News', null, 'Tom Neenan, Tim Telling, Neil Rafferty', 'Nish Kumar, Rachel Parris, Ellie Taylor, Steve N Allen, Andrew Hunter Murray, Greig Johnson, Tom Bell, Jason Forbes', null, 'Satirical and surreal news show. Nish Kumar and a cast of hilarious correspondents keep you up to date with everything that has happened - or not happened - this week.', 'Satirical and surreal news show. Nish Kumar and a cast of hilarious correspondents keep you up to date with everything that has happened - or not happened - this week.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kjuXdWaUt5KTwBwUHtp1nFiYBcj.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:72927'),
