  ('731652674878890009', 'The Mind, Explained', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Ezra Klein', null, 'Emma Stone, Julianne Moore, Anthony Fauci', 'TV-14', 'Ever wonder what''s happening inside your head? From dreaming to anxiety disorders, discover how your brain works with this illuminating series.', 'Ever wonder what''s happening inside your head? From dreaming to anxiety disorders, discover how your brain works with this illuminating series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ShULolWRDYbyACvWK9NbsWcqFJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:93514'),
  ('22715124696529118', 'The Mindy Project', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Mindy Kaling', null, 'Mindy Kaling, Ed Weeks, Ike Barinholtz, Beth Grant, Xosha Roquemore, Fortune Feimster, Garret Dillahunt, Rebecca Rittenhouse', 'TV-PG', 'Obstetrician/gynecologist Mindy Lahiri tries to balance her personal and professional life, surrounded by quirky co-workers in a small medical practice in New York City.', 'Obstetrician/gynecologist Mindy Lahiri tries to balance her personal and professional life, surrounded by quirky co-workers in a small medical practice in New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3txgCPox6hJlOZ0TDTOxch7rVa.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:44857'),
  ('684082539238144854', 'The Miniature Wife', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jennifer Ames, Steve Turner', null, 'Elizabeth Banks, Matthew Macfadyen, Zoe Lister-Jones, Sofia Rosinsky, O-T Fagbenle, Sian Clifford', 'TV-MA', 'A high-concept marital dramedy examining the power balances between spouses, Lindy and Les, who battle each other for supremacy after a technological accident induces the ultimate relationship crisis.', 'A high-concept marital dramedy examining the power balances between spouses, Lindy and Les, who battle each other for supremacy after a technological accident induces the ultimate relationship crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99SkFAS3S3iOtnplwH0byFUMiHK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:250220'),
  ('975573116555317722', 'The Miniaturist', 2017, 'Mystery, Drama', 'John Brownlow', 'John Brownlow', 'Anya Taylor-Joy, Romola Garai, Alex Hassell, Hayley Squires, Paapa Essiedu, Emily Berrington, Geoffrey Streatfeild, Aislín McGuckin', null, 'Nella Oortman''s life changes drastically when she marries a wealthy merchant and moves to Amsterdam. As she struggles to win her husband''s affection, she discovers dark secrets along the way.', 'Nella Oortman''s life changes drastically when she marries a wealthy merchant and moves to Amsterdam. As she struggles to win her husband''s affection, she discovers dark secrets along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bO57OA7pR4dXBQLTshuDEpkPyHF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73000'),
  ('92700118894479844', 'The Minions of Midas', 2020, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Mateo Gil, Miguel Barros', null, 'Luis Tosar, Marta Belmonte, Marta Milans, Goize Blanco, Carlos Blanco, Guillermo Toledo, Jorge Andreu, Daniel Holguín', 'TV-MA', 'Victor Genovés, an influential businessman, is blackmailed: if he doesn''t agree to pay a large sum of money, the self-styled Midas favorites will kill a person at random at a designated place and time and add a new victim periodically until they achieve their goal. How many deaths will he be able to carry on his shoulders?', 'Victor Genovés, an influential businessman, is blackmailed: if he doesn''t agree to pay a large sum of money, the self-styled Midas favorites will kill a person at random at a designated place and time and add a new victim periodically until they achieve their goal. How many deaths will he be able to carry on his shoulders?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kj3dBq2B98HRH2qcMcUP27c9Uqb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:111761'),
  ('625157873293577257', 'The Minister', 2020, 'Drama', null, null, null, null, 'A look into the life of the newly elected Prime Minister of Iceland, who starts losing his grip on reality and the effect that has on his family and the Icelandic nation.', 'A look into the life of the newly elected Prime Minister of Iceland, who starts losing his grip on reality and the effect that has on his family and the Icelandic nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/csU9xxVn8tVyhwx4rw96zse1xrU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:113554'),
  ('914990962283277579', 'The Ministry of Time', 2015, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Javier Olivares, Pablo Olivares', null, 'Rodolfo Sancho, Nacho Fresneda, Macarena García, Cayetana Guillén Cuervo, Juan Gea, Francesca Piñón, Jaime Blanch, Hugo Silva', 'TV-MA', 'A soldier from the 15th century, a university student from the 19th century and a nurse from the present join the secret ''Department of Time'', a secret department within the Spanish government with the ability to travel through time. Their mission is prevent changes in history.', 'A soldier from the 15th century, a university student from the 19th century and a nurse from the present join the secret ''Department of Time'', a secret department within the Spanish government with the ability to travel through time. Their mission is prevent changes in history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sNv6aE47PTTTpHknT3gzmF2rBgh.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:62099'),
  ('520113963187577135', 'The Miracle', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy, Soap', null, null, 'Kim Na-hyun, Hong Yun-hwa, Dong Hyun-bae, Yang Hak-jin, Jo Hye-won, Kim Ji-sung', 'TV-14', 'How could twin sisters be such polar opposites? Kwon Shi Ah is the beautiful sister, gorgeous in every way and a member of the popular girl group known as Miracle Girls. Since she was in preschool, Shia has worked as a model and then a teen actress before becoming an idol. Her fraternal twin sister, Shi Yeon, is almost double the body size of Shi Ah and has always been ridiculed and bullied in school for her large frame. Because of this, Shi Yeon has become a recluse, who prefers staying home and producing an Internet broadcast within the safety of her room. The only time Shi Yeon ventures out is to visit a mysterious tarot card reader who gives Shi Yeon a magical tarot card every day. But the twin sisters’ lives are turned upside down when they wake up one day and realize that their souls have switched bodies! What will an idol musician and Shi Yeon’s high school crush think of the women they thought they knew?', 'How could twin sisters be such polar opposites? Kwon Shi Ah is the beautiful sister, gorgeous in every way and a member of the popular girl group known as Miracle Girls. Since she was in preschool, Shia has worked as a model and then a teen actress before becoming an idol. Her fraternal twin sister, Shi Yeon, is almost double the body size of Shi Ah and has always been ridiculed and bullied in school for her large frame. Because of this, Shi Yeon has become a recluse, who prefers staying home and producing an Internet broadcast within the safety of her room. The only time Shi Yeon ventures out is to visit a mysterious tarot card reader who gives Shi Yeon a magical tarot card every day. But the twin sisters’ lives are turned upside down when they wake up one day and realize that their souls have switched bodies! What will an idol musician and Shi Yeon’s high school crush think of the women they thought they knew?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHCubcvCuECTWVupIL1gXKIyIwB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69467'),
  ('16754496344325491', 'The Miracle', 2018, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Guido Caprino, Elena Lietti, Lorenza Indovina, Sergio Albelli, Pia Lanciotti, Alessio Praticò, Irena Goloubeva, Edoardo Natoli', 'TV-14', 'In Rome, a Virgin Mary statue is found crying blood. Pondering on the implications of the existence of miracles, and eventually, the existence of God, the people involved in the enigma start losing their minds.', 'In Rome, a Virgin Mary statue is found crying blood. Pondering on the implications of the existence of miracles, and eventually, the existence of God, the people involved in the enigma start losing their minds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rSWkR3ulD7KOtYgcw50PtrkvS61.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91253'),
  ('44519154838626265', 'The Miracle of Teddy Bear', 2022, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Chairat Pipitpattanaprap', null, 'Sarin Ronnakiat, Thuchapon Koowongbundit, Apasiri Nitibhon, Thanapon Jarujitranon, Parada Chutchavalchotikul, Punpreedee Khumprom Rodsawat, Tantachj Tharinpirom, Chartayodom Hiranyatithi', null, 'When a young man''s teddy bear reveals itself in human form, it tries to find out more about its past — before its time as a human runs out.', 'When a young man''s teddy bear reveals itself in human form, it tries to find out more about its past — before its time as a human runs out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sIvHTOGpzIVas6NrKQaqHPYLiN3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:196103'),
  ('639086137013982671', 'The Miracle We Met', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Baek Mi-kyoung', 'Kim Myung-min, Kim Hyun-joo, Ra Mi-ran, Ko Chang-seok, Joseph Lee, Hwang Bo-ra, Choi Byung-mo, Hwang Seok-jeong', null, 'A man dies in a car crash, but awakes with the spirit of another person. He becomes the head of two families and he agonizes over his two different wives.', 'A man dies in a car crash, but awakes with the spirit of another person. He becomes the head of two families and he agonizes over his two different wives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ipwO1DiLnuJCA3Pm7TXuZmrcZs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78446'),
  ('714280081239262247', 'The Miracles', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, null, null, 'In Shenzhen, a jobless Lu Da rekindles hope in a 24-hour bookstore; opera star Fan becomes a tech sales whiz in Huaqiangbei; delivery rider Tan earns dignity; drone engineers Zhang Yi and Nuan build love with code; teen Xiao Peng creates a wildlife overpass; planner Wang Pengqian and daughter protect mangroves, with spoonbill Y075 marking eco-change. These stories weave entrepreneurship, innovation, and sustainability, showcasing Shenzhen’s 45-year transformation and future promise.', 'In Shenzhen, a jobless Lu Da rekindles hope in a 24-hour bookstore; opera star Fan becomes a tech sales whiz in Huaqiangbei; delivery rider Tan earns dignity; drone engineers Zhang Yi and Nuan build love with code; teen Xiao Peng creates a wildlife overpass; planner Wang Pengqian and daughter protect mangroves, with spoonbill Y075 marking eco-change. These stories weave entrepreneurship, innovation, and sustainability, showcasing Shenzhen’s 45-year transformation and future promise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sofXwv1F6yV1CkBmJDkZ7mMgIGl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:292277'),
  ('659214414827053695', 'The Miracles of Jesus', 2014, 'Drama', 'Renato Modesto, Camilo Pellegrini, Maria Cláudia Oliveira', 'Cristiane Cardoso', 'Valéria Alencar, Janaína Moura, Jorge Cerruti, Roberta Gualda, Thierry Figueira, Bemvindo Sequeira, Marcello Escorel, Plínio Soares', 'NR', 'The struggles biblical characters are confronted with.', 'The struggles biblical characters are confronted with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqTVizgMpNzJmpKnUaei6EMYNbZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:64411'),
  ('115581934280117702', 'The Mirage', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Fei Qiming, Lv Xiaoyu, Shao Zhuang, Jin Zixuan, Yang Yu, An Ning', null, 'When her younger brother mysteriously disappears in Dengzhou—a city plagued by vanishing citizens, shifting mirages, and the sudden appearance of an iron giant—warrior Zeng Qian joins forces with a cunning strategist, a masked outlaw, and a talented but arrogant fighter. As the unlikely team follows the clues, they uncover a powerful conspiracy behind the city’s supernatural disturbances and must risk everything to stop it.', 'When her younger brother mysteriously disappears in Dengzhou—a city plagued by vanishing citizens, shifting mirages, and the sudden appearance of an iron giant—warrior Zeng Qian joins forces with a cunning strategist, a masked outlaw, and a talented but arrogant fighter. As the unlikely team follows the clues, they uncover a powerful conspiracy behind the city’s supernatural disturbances and must risk everything to stop it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jdpXnEqn19Y7mQNJAbrYedG0iZW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:302726'),
  ('265514603442772420', 'The Mire', 2018, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', null, 'Kasper Bajon, Jan Holoubek', 'Andrzej Seweryn, Magdalena Różczka, Dawid Ogrodnik, Michał Pawlik, Łukasz Simlat, Marianna Gierszewska, Bartosz Mikulak', 'TV-MA', 'The town is shocked with a brutal double murder. The "Courier" hands the case to an experienced journalist - Witold Wanycz. At the same time, he learns about the mysterious suicide of two teenagers. Together with Piotr, a young journalist, they start their own investigation.', 'The town is shocked with a brutal double murder. The "Courier" hands the case to an experienced journalist - Witold Wanycz. At the same time, he learns about the mysterious suicide of two teenagers. Together with Piotr, a young journalist, they start their own investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6apcDmf8e4I3WVoUsmxUveKBTVz.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:81686'),
  ('316655758201353698', 'The Misadventures of Romesh Ranganathan', 2018, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Romesh Ranganathan', null, 'Comedian and TV presenter Romesh Ranganathan travels way beyond his comfort zone and the world of complimentary breakfast buffets to some of the most beautiful, but dangerous, places on earth.', 'Comedian and TV presenter Romesh Ranganathan travels way beyond his comfort zone and the world of complimentary breakfast buffets to some of the most beautiful, but dangerous, places on earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5xTL0FObxdnKzkebreh63EpcIDv.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:80863'),
  ('268044521896838858', 'The Misfit of Demon King Academy', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tomori Kusunoki, Yuuichirou Umehara, Yuko Natsuyoshi, Takuma Terashima, Nene Hieda, Sayumi Watabe, Misaki Kuno, Wataru Hatano', 'TV-14', 'Anos Voldigord was a tyrannical Demon King that eradicated humans, spirits, and even the gods, but became bored of eternal warfare and reincarnated with dreams of a peaceful world. However, what awaited him in reincarnation after 2000 years were descendants who became too weak after being accustomed to peace, and all sorts of magic that deteriorated to the extreme. Anos enters Demon King Academy that gathers and educates those who are viewed as the reincarnation of the Demon King, but the academy could not see through his true powers and ends up branding him as a misfit.', 'Anos Voldigord was a tyrannical Demon King that eradicated humans, spirits, and even the gods, but became bored of eternal warfare and reincarnated with dreams of a peaceful world. However, what awaited him in reincarnation after 2000 years were descendants who became too weak after being accustomed to peace, and all sorts of magic that deteriorated to the extreme. Anos enters Demon King Academy that gathers and educates those who are viewed as the reincarnation of the Demon King, but the academy could not see through his true powers and ends up branding him as a misfit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xBNR7V4s5b0qQfRCiyEvIC5PS6v.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:97617'),
  ('833794523559692075', 'The Missing', 2014, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Harry Williams, Jack Williams', 'Harry Williams, Jack Williams', 'David Morrissey, Keeley Hawes, Abigail Hardingham, Tchéky Karyo, Anastasia Hille, Lia Williams, Laura Fraser, Roger Allam', 'TV-MA', 'A gripping anthological relationship thriller series exploring the emotional fallout of a child''s abduction not only on the family but on the wider community, told over two time frames.', 'A gripping anthological relationship thriller series exploring the emotional fallout of a child''s abduction not only on the family but on the wider community, told over two time frames.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/czsrf4fx39ADnSTH7Og1Xk2SC4S.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61555'),
  ('623731590636390086', 'The Mission', 2024, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Linda Dombrovszky', null, 'Balázs Csórics, Séra Dániel, Iván Kamarás, Réka Ágota Gál, Balla Eszter, Anna Györgyi', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4B0EIgujyZRHHUSZiD5BDBgLJy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:276505'),
  ('596114216994226755', 'The Mist', 2017, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Drama', 'Christian Torpe', null, 'Morgan Spector, Alyssa Sutherland, Gus Birney, Danica Ćurčić, Okezie Morro, Luke Cosgrove, Darren Pettie, Russell Posner', 'TV-MA', 'A small town family is torn apart by a brutal crime. As they deal with the fallout an eerie mist rolls in, suddenly cutting them off from the rest of the world, and in some cases, each other.', 'A small town family is torn apart by a brutal crime. As they deal with the fallout an eerie mist rolls in, suddenly cutting them off from the rest of the world, and in some cases, each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iwDmsffJ5qYBxiGTPdwgIKTscKu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68315'),
  ('1096728446839079998', 'The Mists of Avalon', 2001, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Gavin Scott', null, 'Joan Allen, Julianna Margulies, Anjelica Huston, Samantha Mathis, Caroline Goodall, Klára Issová, Edward Atterton, Michael Vartan', 'TV-MA', 'The Mists of Avalon is a 2001 miniseries based on the novel of the same name by Marion Zimmer Bradley. It was produced by American cable channel TNT and directed by Uli Edel.', 'The Mists of Avalon is a 2001 miniseries based on the novel of the same name by Marion Zimmer Bradley. It was produced by American cable channel TNT and directed by Uli Edel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVEbAgsYBVwKH8goTkUVd59fIWB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5256'),
  ('387287808788368659', 'The Mitchell and Webb Situation', 2001, 'Comedy, Talk', 'David Mitchell, Robert Webb', null, 'David Mitchell, Robert Webb, Olivia Colman', 'TV-14', 'Comedy sketch show with hilarious characters and absurdist twists from the duo that brought us Peep Show and The Smoking Room - David Mitchell and Robert Webb.', 'Comedy sketch show with hilarious characters and absurdist twists from the duo that brought us Peep Show and The Smoking Room - David Mitchell and Robert Webb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fmcVVNw6duQhegHb4tv0BSh6Ndp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3887'),
  ('564747969326307463', 'The Moaning of Life', 2013, 'Comedy, Documentary', null, null, 'Karl Pilkington, John Montgomery', 'TV-MA', 'Now Karl’s turned 40 and has officially hit middle age, it’s time for him to re-assess his life. He’s not married, he doesn’t have kids, he’s got a job where he’s known as an ‘idiot’, and he’s known for being miserable. He’s classic ‘mid-life crisis’ material. As Karl attempts to put his life in order, he’ll be dispatched around the world on a crash course to find out how other cultures deal with life’s big questions. The ups and downs of Karl’s experiences will be contrasted against the beautiful geography of the countries he visits, captured on HD with stunning aerial photography.', 'Now Karl’s turned 40 and has officially hit middle age, it’s time for him to re-assess his life. He’s not married, he doesn’t have kids, he’s got a job where he’s known as an ‘idiot’, and he’s known for being miserable. He’s classic ‘mid-life crisis’ material. As Karl attempts to put his life in order, he’ll be dispatched around the world on a crash course to find out how other cultures deal with life’s big questions. The ups and downs of Karl’s experiences will be contrasted against the beautiful geography of the countries he visits, captured on HD with stunning aerial photography.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/beNhFMZHSNq8Lkvwvbt7NwUXpU8.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:58790'),
  ('567204541696464518', 'The Mob Doctor', 2012, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Josh Berman, Rob Wright', null, 'Jordana Spiro, William Forsythe, James Carpinello, Zach Gilford, Željko Ivanek, Floriana Lima, Jaime Lee Kirchner, Wendy Makkena', null, 'For most physicians, the Hippocratic oath is sacred. But for one Chicago doctor, who is indebted to the mafia, saving lives isn’t her only concern. The Mob Doctor is a fast-paced medical drama focusing on a young female surgeon caught between two worlds as she juggles her promising medical career with her family’s debt to Chicago’s Southside mob.', 'For most physicians, the Hippocratic oath is sacred. But for one Chicago doctor, who is indebted to the mafia, saving lives isn’t her only concern. The Mob Doctor is a fast-paced medical drama focusing on a young female surgeon caught between two worlds as she juggles her promising medical career with her family’s debt to Chicago’s Southside mob.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s0IAQRp5f9LSM7WWo1FeZPJaI4Z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43105'),
  ('964718537703582557', 'The Mod Squad', 1968, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Buddy Ruskin', null, 'Peggy Lipton, Clarence Williams III, Tige Andrews, Michael Cole', 'TV-PG', 'The Mod Squad was the enormously successful groundbreaking "hippie" undercover cop show that ran on ABC from September 24, 1968, until August 23, 1973. It starred Michael Cole as Pete Cochren, Peggy Lipton as Julie Barnes, Clarence Williams III as Linc Hayes, and Tige Andrews as Captain Adam Greer. The executive producers of the series were Aaron Spelling and Danny Thomas. The iconic counter-culture police series earned six Emmy nominations, four Golden Globe nominations plus one win for Peggy Lipton, one Directors Guild of America award, and four Logies. In 1997 the episode "Mother of Sorrow" was ranked #95 on TV Guide''s 100 Greatest Episodes of All Time.', 'The Mod Squad was the enormously successful groundbreaking "hippie" undercover cop show that ran on ABC from September 24, 1968, until August 23, 1973. It starred Michael Cole as Pete Cochren, Peggy Lipton as Julie Barnes, Clarence Williams III as Linc Hayes, and Tige Andrews as Captain Adam Greer. The executive producers of the series were Aaron Spelling and Danny Thomas. The iconic counter-culture police series earned six Emmy nominations, four Golden Globe nominations plus one win for Peggy Lipton, one Directors Guild of America award, and four Logies. In 1997 the episode "Mother of Sorrow" was ranked #95 on TV Guide''s 100 Greatest Episodes of All Time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c5HaIPOSZitasqNlLRp8ZzuUsSn.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:4003'),
  ('746735261656970115', 'The Modern Life', 2015, 'Comedy, Talk', 'David Broncano, Quequé, Ignatius Farray', null, 'David Broncano, Quequé, Ignatius Farray', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o5otth5x5l4YNfdBYjJnvVv0Z1C.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:75702'),
  ('507199970254709867', 'The Modern Love Story', 1992, 'Drama', null, null, null, null, 'A collection of different love stories starring the most famous singers and stars from Hong Kong of the 90''s.', 'A collection of different love stories starring the most famous singers and stars from Hong Kong of the 90''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uj89r020PsAhQ6W9Mwm7x3WdYKB.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:109851'),
  ('826933148268625252', 'The Modern World: Ten Great Writers', 1988, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'This documentary series uses drama and commentary to shed light on the lives and works of Joseph Conrad, Fyodor Dostoyevsky, T. S. Eliot, Henrik Ibsen, James Joyce, Franz Kafka, Thomas Mann, Luigi Pirandello, Marcel Proust and Virginia Woolf.', 'This documentary series uses drama and commentary to shed light on the lives and works of Joseph Conrad, Fyodor Dostoyevsky, T. S. Eliot, Henrik Ibsen, James Joyce, Franz Kafka, Thomas Mann, Luigi Pirandello, Marcel Proust and Virginia Woolf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGUosWMFC4t5R1C3nx1F6Kkw5ZV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:101356'),
  ('447837535794992283', 'The Mokhtar Narrative', 2010, 'Drama, War & Politics, Documentary', 'Davood Mir-Bagheri', 'Davood Mir-Bagheri', 'Fariborz Arabnia, Reza Kianian, Fariba Kowsari, Mehdi Fakhimzadeh, Reza Rouygari, Farhad Aslani, Jafar Dehghan, Zhale Olov', 'TV-G', 'The Mokhtar Narrative is an Epic/History television series directed by Davood Mirbagheri, based on the life of Al-Mokhtar. Over 140 actors were cast in it. Mokhtar Saqafi was a Shiite Muslim leader who sets up a rebellion movement in 686 A.D in the town of Kufa to avenge the martyrdom of Hussain (grandson of Islamic Prophet Muhammad).', 'The Mokhtar Narrative is an Epic/History television series directed by Davood Mirbagheri, based on the life of Al-Mokhtar. Over 140 actors were cast in it. Mokhtar Saqafi was a Shiite Muslim leader who sets up a rebellion movement in 686 A.D in the town of Kufa to avenge the martyrdom of Hussain (grandson of Islamic Prophet Muhammad).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6zUdATUbXzmUwozQjvQZe6MEQRl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:54467'),
  ('495418803591012204', 'The Mole', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Ari Shapiro, Antonio Alejandro Castellanos, Quaylyn, Sean, Ryan Warner, Neesh Riaz, Muna Abdulahi, Michael O''Brien', null, 'A high-stakes competition series where twelve players work together in challenges to add money to a pot that only one of them will win at the end. Among the players is one person who has secretly been designated "the Mole" and tasked with sabotaging the group''s money-making efforts. In the end, one player will outlast their competition and expose the Mole to win the prize pot.', 'A high-stakes competition series where twelve players work together in challenges to add money to a pot that only one of them will win at the end. Among the players is one person who has secretly been designated "the Mole" and tasked with sabotaging the group''s money-making efforts. In the end, one player will outlast their competition and expose the Mole to win the prize pot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wVipX97HY7UYiWIR6BdmnQLKEXy.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:210939'),
  ('815913157695407258', 'The Moment I Met You', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Ren Hao, Ireine Song, Li Yuhao, Yun Qianqian, Wang Junbi', null, 'Mao Buyu, heir to a legendary detective family, falls for Chu Yunshang, a flower seller hiding her true identity as the leader of a notorious thieves’ guild. As Mao Buyu vows to capture the elusive guild leader to earn a promotion and win Yunshang’s hand, a secret game of cat and mouse unfolds, where love, loyalty, and identity collide.', 'Mao Buyu, heir to a legendary detective family, falls for Chu Yunshang, a flower seller hiding her true identity as the leader of a notorious thieves’ guild. As Mao Buyu vows to capture the elusive guild leader to earn a promotion and win Yunshang’s hand, a secret game of cat and mouse unfolds, where love, loyalty, and identity collide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gzBrj9NUo4MZa2wOWqF23NDGKBv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:295608'),
  ('810151533861526854', 'The Moment of Truth', 2008, 'Reality', 'Howard Schultz', null, 'Mark L. Walberg', null, 'One participant. Twenty-one questions. All that is required is the ability to tell the truth, the whole truth, and nothing but the truth.', 'One participant. Twenty-one questions. All that is required is the ability to tell the truth, the whole truth, and nothing but the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oMlpuKuEEqSfxNiXAhMvV1rSUm0.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:14381'),
  ('1099006149130021114', 'The Monastery', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Alexander Molochnikov', 'Anastasiya Ivleeva, Filipp Yankovsky, Mark Eydelshteyn, Alexandra Babaskina, Leonid Telezhinskiy, Aleksey Rozin', null, 'Maria is a charming party girl who lives at someone else''s expense. One day in the Emirates, she goes to a nightclub with the billionaire''s wife, the party gets out of control, and now Maria is facing jail, she is being chased by dangerous people, and accounts are blocked. She has to flee to Russia, but she is not safe at home either — and the girl takes refuge in the walls of the monastery.', 'Maria is a charming party girl who lives at someone else''s expense. One day in the Emirates, she goes to a nightclub with the billionaire''s wife, the party gets out of control, and now Maria is facing jail, she is being chased by dangerous people, and accounts are blocked. She has to flee to Russia, but she is not safe at home either — and the girl takes refuge in the walls of the monastery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9d4PJzfkrEF8wB9uQVFOR9RmA6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214070'),
  ('252541798027398725', 'The Monkees', 1966, 'Comedy, Family', 'Bert Schneider, Bob Rafelson', null, 'Davy Jones, Micky Dolenz, Michael Nesmith, Peter Tork', 'TV-G', 'Micky, Mike, Peter, and Davy are four young men in mid-1960s LA, members of a struggling country-folk-rock band looking for their big break amid madcap encounters with a variety of people straight out of TV and movie central casting, with full knowledge that their existence is part of a weekly television series.', 'Micky, Mike, Peter, and Davy are four young men in mid-1960s LA, members of a struggling country-folk-rock band looking for their big break amid madcap encounters with a variety of people straight out of TV and movie central casting, with full knowledge that their existence is part of a weekly television series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNhWFmfVGkNfF3o3kdKUKgvdnaN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:7626'),
  ('991597840089569869', 'The Mononoke Lecture Logs of Chuzenji-sensei: He Just Solves All the Mysteries', 2025, 'Animation, Mystery', null, null, 'Kaori Maeda, Katsuyuki Konishi, Shinnosuke Tachibana, Shuuya Nishiji, Takanori Hoshino, Ai Furihata, Ai Kayano, Kaoru Sakura', null, 'In 1948 Tokyo, just right after the war, Kanna Kusakabe had just become a second-year at a high school when she meets the new language teacher, Akihiko Chuzenji. Mysterious supernatural things keep happening around Kanna. Once again today, Kanna is going to open the doors to the library prep room to seek help from the surly Chuzenji-sensei who is waiting inside.', 'In 1948 Tokyo, just right after the war, Kanna Kusakabe had just become a second-year at a high school when she meets the new language teacher, Akihiko Chuzenji. Mysterious supernatural things keep happening around Kanna. Once again today, Kanna is going to open the doors to the library prep room to seek help from the surly Chuzenji-sensei who is waiting inside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6OOqlrGSBRV31TlzzHSukuySqwz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:275623'),
  ('358697605996320441', 'The Monster', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mehran Modiri', 'Amir Baradaran, Peyman Ghasemkhani', 'Farhad Aslani, Mehran Modiri, Shabnam Moghadami, Gohar Kheyrandish, Mohammad Bahrani, Nima Sha''aban-Nejad, Shila Khodadad, Sima Tirandaz', 'TV-PG', 'Houshang is a simple and honest teacher who is satisfied with his life and does not have much interest in the world, but unwittingly goes in a way that changes his life and enters the process of embezzlement and fraud. He unexpectedly owns wealth and wealth, and is outspoken from his former character.', 'Houshang is a simple and honest teacher who is satisfied with his life and does not have much interest in the world, but unwittingly goes in a way that changes his life and enters the process of embezzlement and fraud. He unexpectedly owns wealth and wealth, and is outspoken from his former character.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJFpnaftMiUhR8xWgsOVAOl8nfY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90751'),
