  ('818296524970448048', 'The Moon Brightens For You', 2020, 'Drama', null, 'Ding Mo', 'Xing Fei, Yu Menglong, Merxat, Ma Yue, Zhang Kaitai, Zhang Xuehan, Ma Xier, Zheng Fanxing', null, 'Quirky and unconventional, Zhan Qinghong grew up well enough, but she never shared the dreams most treasured by her peers. While other girls dreamed of marrying well, Qinghong dreams of only one thing: to become a great martial arts master. Ready to turn her dreams into reality, Qinghong entered the martial arts world with wide-eyed innocence and insatiable curiosity.', 'Quirky and unconventional, Zhan Qinghong grew up well enough, but she never shared the dreams most treasured by her peers. While other girls dreamed of marrying well, Qinghong dreams of only one thing: to become a great martial arts master. Ready to turn her dreams into reality, Qinghong entered the martial arts world with wide-eyed innocence and insatiable curiosity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7DZOam9265HAsfcpF4HcCHMcWmp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:111148'),
