  ('319016494068872609', 'The Most Dangerous Animal of All', 2020, 'Documentary, Mystery, Crime, Reality', null, 'Ross M. Dinerstein, Elisa Bonora, Kief Davidson', 'Gary L. Stewart, Jude Gilford, Katelyn Kapocsi, Duffy Jennings, Kyle deCamp', 'TV-14', 'Soon after his birth-mother contacted him for the first time, Gary L. Stewart decided to search for his biological father. His disturbing identity would force Stewart to reconsider everything he thought he knew about himself.', 'Soon after his birth-mother contacted him for the first time, Gary L. Stewart decided to search for his biological father. His disturbing identity would force Stewart to reconsider everything he thought he knew about himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u13gKUHiDKEumiCOrux0JqJP5s6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100120'),
