  ('710967341552277673', 'The Mr. Men Show', 2008, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Roger Hargreaves', null, 'Godfrey, Richard Epcar, Katie Leigh, Nathalie Bienaimé, Olivier Constantin, Thierry Kazazian, Michel Elias, Pierre-François Pistorio', 'TV-Y', 'The Mr. Men Show was an animated television series based on the original Mr. Men and Little Miss books created in the 1970s, 80s and 90s by British author Roger Hargreaves and his son Adam Hargreaves. Adapted from the published source material into a television variety program, The Mr. Men Show features comedy sketches, pantomimes, dance numbers and music videos. The TV series is directed by Mark Risley and executive produced by Eryk Casemiro & Kate Boutilier. Original score and songs are composed by Jared Faber. Season 1 first aired on February 4, 2008 and Season 2 aired on September 8, 2009.', 'The Mr. Men Show was an animated television series based on the original Mr. Men and Little Miss books created in the 1970s, 80s and 90s by British author Roger Hargreaves and his son Adam Hargreaves. Adapted from the published source material into a television variety program, The Mr. Men Show features comedy sketches, pantomimes, dance numbers and music videos. The TV series is directed by Mark Risley and executive produced by Eryk Casemiro & Kate Boutilier. Original score and songs are composed by Jared Faber. Season 1 first aired on February 4, 2008 and Season 2 aired on September 8, 2009.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dI4L9h479tO9wcdZIwJO6Id91Gv.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:7048'),
