  ('383942188583765715', 'The Nice Guy', 2025, 'Drama, Family', 'Kim Woon-kyeong, Hyo-seok Kim', null, 'Lee Dong-wook, Lee Sung-kyung, Ryu Hye-young, Oh Na-ra, Park Hoon, Cheon Ho-jin, Park Myung-shin, Park Won-sang', 'TV-14', 'Seok-cheol, the eldest son in a family of three generations of gangsters, navigates the tumultuous ups and downs of life with tears and laughter, all to protect his family, career, and love.', 'Seok-cheol, the eldest son in a family of three generations of gangsters, navigates the tumultuous ups and downs of life with tears and laughter, all to protect his family, career, and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVOKlZ6Ix5OfXHsyuaQp4nEDE6n.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211224'),
  ('593752147944051239', 'The Night Agent', 2023, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Mystery', 'Shawn Ryan', null, 'Gabriel Basso, Fola Evans-Akingbola, Louis Herthum, Genesis Rodriguez, Albert Jones, Ward Horton, David Lyons, Jennifer Morrison', 'TV-MA', 'Brought together by a midnight phone call, an FBI agent and a cybersecurity expert must unravel an ever-growing web of political conspiracies.', 'Brought together by a midnight phone call, an FBI agent and a cybersecurity expert must unravel an ever-growing web of political conspiracies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4c5yUNcaff4W4aPrkXE6zr7papX.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:129552'),
  ('295610122630726384', 'The Night Beyond the Tricornered Window', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Nobunaga Shimazaki, Wataru Hatano, Soma Saito, Chika Anzai, Satoshi Mikami, Junichi Suwabe', 'TV-14', 'Shy bookstore clerk Kosuke Mikado has the ability to see ghosts and spirits, an ability he wishes he didn''t have, since what he sees usually terrifies him. Rihito Hiyakawa, an exorcist whose supernatural powers are as strong as his social graces are weak, doesn''t seem to fear anything, mortal or otherwise. When this odd couple gets together to solve the bizarre cases that come their way, their work methods may not be entirely safe for work!', 'Shy bookstore clerk Kosuke Mikado has the ability to see ghosts and spirits, an ability he wishes he didn''t have, since what he sees usually terrifies him. Rihito Hiyakawa, an exorcist whose supernatural powers are as strong as his social graces are weak, doesn''t seem to fear anything, mortal or otherwise. When this odd couple gets together to solve the bizarre cases that come their way, their work methods may not be entirely safe for work!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/quwMdtlHcqNATTuofOq8Cvd6Pbf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114307'),
  ('978151294983616692', 'The Night Logan Woke Up', 2022, 'Drama', 'Xavier Dolan', 'Xavier Dolan', 'Julie Le Breton, Patrick Hivon, Éric Bruneau, Xavier Dolan, Magalie Lépine-Blondeau, Anne Dorval, Julianne Côté, Jasmine Lemée', 'TV-MA', 'On a cold October night in 1991, an unspeakable event rocks a small town in Quebec, forever haunting a family who tries to hide their dark secret. Thirty years later these secrets buried deep in the past resurface, sending the family on an unstoppable pursuit of reconciliation.', 'On a cold October night in 1991, an unspeakable event rocks a small town in Quebec, forever haunting a family who tries to hide their dark secret. Thirty years later these secrets buried deep in the past resurface, sending the family on an unstoppable pursuit of reconciliation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/keDSGCKHobKCBEmZxuo6UY3yrf6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113732'),
  ('776000003779801011', 'The Night Manager', 2016, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'David Farr', null, 'Tom Hiddleston, Hugh Laurie, Diego Calva, Camila Morrone, Paul Chahidi, Hayley Squires, Indira Varma, Unax Ugalde', 'TV-MA', 'Former British soldier Jonathan Pine navigates the shadowy recesses of Whitehall and Washington where an unholy alliance operates between the intelligence community and the secret arms trade. To infiltrate the inner circle of lethal arms dealer Richard Onslow Roper, Pine must himself become a criminal.', 'Former British soldier Jonathan Pine navigates the shadowy recesses of Whitehall and Washington where an unholy alliance operates between the intelligence community and the secret arms trade. To infiltrate the inner circle of lethal arms dealer Richard Onslow Roper, Pine must himself become a criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MccRnw41qQjREuZkovqP2UX1i3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61859'),
  ('843931676693197878', 'The Night Manager', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', 'Sandeep Modi', null, 'Anil Kapoor, Aditya Roy Kapur, Sobhita Dhulipala, Tillotama Shome, Saswata Chatterjee, Ravi Behl, Anand Vikas Potdukhe, Joy Sengupta', 'TV-MA', 'A hotel''s night manager is the only weapon against a dangerous arms dealer. Will he be able to stop him?', 'A hotel''s night manager is the only weapon against a dangerous arms dealer. Will he be able to stop him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1anVoLwguecmFqsNx0Ic8cIzmuW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218953'),
  ('209432387911923884', 'The Night Of', 2016, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Richard Price, Steven Zaillian', null, 'Riz Ahmed, John Turturro, Bill Camp, Payman Maadi, Jeannie Berlin, Poorna Jagannathan', 'TV-MA', 'After a night of partying with a female stranger, a man wakes up to find her stabbed to death and is charged with her murder.', 'After a night of partying with a female stranger, a man wakes up to find her stabbed to death and is charged with her murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q13XJHdnsmxQL9rXRcnNDrZGHjO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66276'),
  ('765917114025047644', 'The Night Shift', 2014, 'Drama', 'Gabe Sachs, Jeff Judah', null, 'Eoin Macken, Jill Flint, Brendan Fehr, Robert Bailey Jr., James Roch, Scott Wolf, Tanaya Beatty', 'TV-14', 'The stories of the men and women who work the overnight shift at San Antonio Memorial Hospital. They are an irreverent and special breed, particularly adrenaline junkie T.C. Callahan.', 'The stories of the men and women who work the overnight shift at San Antonio Memorial Hospital. They are an irreverent and special breed, particularly adrenaline junkie T.C. Callahan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qSfjudewdGEHAva8LvlbyH0ydof.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:60804'),
  ('77032515072640397', 'The Night Watchman', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, 'Yoo Dong-yoon, Kim Sun-hee, Bang Ji-young', 'Jung Il-woo, Ko Sung-hee, U-KNOW Yunho, Seo Yea-ji, Kim Seung-o, Seo Yi-sook, Lee Chae-mi, Ko Chang-seok', null, 'Being able to see ghosts and other supernatural spirits is a heavy responsibility. Prince Lee Rin (Jung Il Woo), like his father before him, discovers that he has the ability to see ghosts and other supernatural beings. Armed with his newfound abilities, Lee Rin becomes the leader of a group of night watchmen who patrol the streets from dusk to dawn to protect the people of the Chosun Dynasty against evil spirits. Moo Seok (Jung Yun Ho) is the best swordsman in the land who is the prince’s trusty bodyguard. But their loyalties will be tested when they both fall in love with the same woman – Do Ha (Go Sung Hee), the successor of the Ma Go tribe who seeks their help to protect the Baek Do mountain’s spirits. But Park Soo Ryun (Seo Ye Ji), the daughter of a court officer, will stop at nothing to marry Prince Lee Rin. “The Night Watchman,” also known as "Diary of a Night Watchman,"', 'Being able to see ghosts and other supernatural spirits is a heavy responsibility. Prince Lee Rin (Jung Il Woo), like his father before him, discovers that he has the ability to see ghosts and other supernatural beings. Armed with his newfound abilities, Lee Rin becomes the leader of a group of night watchmen who patrol the streets from dusk to dawn to protect the people of the Chosun Dynasty against evil spirits. Moo Seok (Jung Yun Ho) is the best swordsman in the land who is the prince’s trusty bodyguard. But their loyalties will be tested when they both fall in love with the same woman – Do Ha (Go Sung Hee), the successor of the Ma Go tribe who seeks their help to protect the Baek Do mountain’s spirits. But Park Soo Ryun (Seo Ye Ji), the daughter of a court officer, will stop at nothing to marry Prince Lee Rin. “The Night Watchman,” also known as "Diary of a Night Watchman,"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/naAWrujd8S0hmYEapO10KbZpyG7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61209'),
  ('246842150505641478', 'The Nightly Show with Larry Wilmore', 2015, 'Talk, Comedy, News', 'Jon Stewart', 'Cord Jefferson', 'Larry Wilmore', null, 'The Nightly Show provides viewers with Larry Wilmore''s distinct point of view and comedic take on current events and pop culture. Hosted by Wilmore, the series features a diverse panel of voices, providing a perspective largely missing in the late night television landscape.', 'The Nightly Show provides viewers with Larry Wilmore''s distinct point of view and comedic take on current events and pop culture. Hosted by Wilmore, the series features a diverse panel of voices, providing a perspective largely missing in the late night television landscape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZW6diC7eWIjqCsoJWEUiGvrnr4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61587'),
  ('1075042153108511243', 'The Nightmare Room', 2001, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Kids', null, null, 'James Avery', 'TV-Y7', 'The Nightmare Room is an American children''s anthology horror series that aired on Kids'' WB. The series was based on the short-lived book series The Nightmare Room children''s books created by Goosebumps author, R.L. Stine. The Nightmare Room originally aired from August 31, 2001, to March 16, 2002, in the United States. It was rated TV-Y7 for fantasy violence and scenes deemed too scary or disturbing for younger viewers in the United States. Reruns of the series started airing on Chiller on January 7, 2013.', 'The Nightmare Room is an American children''s anthology horror series that aired on Kids'' WB. The series was based on the short-lived book series The Nightmare Room children''s books created by Goosebumps author, R.L. Stine. The Nightmare Room originally aired from August 31, 2001, to March 16, 2002, in the United States. It was rated TV-Y7 for fantasy violence and scenes deemed too scary or disturbing for younger viewers in the United States. Reruns of the series started airing on Chiller on January 7, 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5aBRRkf0UoSEIN3kTaHPbUgFk4x.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10861'),
  ('614624238543246025', 'The Nightmare Worlds of H.G. Wells', 2016, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', null, null, 'Ray Winstone', null, 'The Nightmare Worlds of H. G. Wells is a 2016 horror-fantasy television miniseries, based on short stories by H. G. Wells. The four-part series of 30-minute episodes was commissioned for broadcast by Sky Arts. The series is hosted by Ray Winstone as Wells.', 'The Nightmare Worlds of H. G. Wells is a 2016 horror-fantasy television miniseries, based on short stories by H. G. Wells. The four-part series of 30-minute episodes was commissioned for broadcast by Sky Arts. The series is hosted by Ray Winstone as Wells.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSl0VSRHfqZsyjc0j4MyKThQ2nu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65445'),
  ('1058275580077502750', 'The Nine', 2006, 'Drama, Crime', 'Hank Steinberg, K.J. Steinberg', null, 'Tim Daly, Kim Raver, John Billingsley, Chi McBride, Scott Wolf, Camille Guaty, Lourdes Benedicto, Dana Davis', null, 'Nine people are caught in a bank robbery gone wrong and endure a 52-hour hostage standoff that will leave more than one person dead. They will be forever affected and intertwined because of it.', 'Nine people are caught in a bank robbery gone wrong and endure a 52-hour hostage standoff that will leave more than one person dead. They will be forever affected and intertwined because of it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FWsBK96U8VUywOun1N34cCU7Nj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:337'),
  ('387668404010988920', 'The Nine Lives of Chloe King', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Dan Berendsen', null, 'Skyler Samuels, Gracie Gillam, Ki Hong Lee, Benjamin Stone, Alyssa Diaz, Grey Damon, Amy Pietz', 'TV-PG', 'Chloe King is looking forward to celebrating her birthday with her friends and single mother, just like every other year... that is until she starts developing heightened abilities and discovers she''s being pursued by a mysterious figure. Chloe soon learns she''s part of an ancient race which has been hunted by human assassins for millennia —and that she may be their only hope for ultimate survival.', 'Chloe King is looking forward to celebrating her birthday with her friends and single mother, just like every other year... that is until she starts developing heightened abilities and discovers she''s being pursued by a mysterious figure. Chloe soon learns she''s part of an ancient race which has been hunted by human assassins for millennia —and that she may be their only hope for ultimate survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5dbVI8Cwf0HwDmPCjsw36ZgBXNq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37646'),
  ('738137977881804967', 'The Nineties', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Gary Goetzman, Mark Herzog, Tom Hanks', null, 'Tom Hanks, Chuck Klosterman, Douglas Brinkley, Kurt Loder', null, 'Hit rewind and explore the most iconic moments and influential people of The Nineties, the decade that gave us the Internet, DVDs, and other cultural and political milestones.', 'Hit rewind and explore the most iconic moments and influential people of The Nineties, the decade that gave us the Internet, DVDs, and other cultural and political milestones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zWwsdY6BvB3jXDOOAKKQgY2VSF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72757'),
  ('572627957277220753', 'The No Man Zone', 2022, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Pelageya Nevzorova, Nikita Kologrivyy, Andrey Skorokhod, Zhanna Epple, Anna Snatkina, Vladimir Yepifantsev, Filipp Blednyy, Svetlana Kamynina', null, 'The year is 2140. Society has undergone profound change and is now run as a matriarchy, thus removing its reliance on men. Two Hills is one of the communities founded by this new order. It is a place of perfection, where there is harmony rather than conflict, science and reason prevail and the environment is protected and respected. One of its inhabitants is the history teacher, Rada. On her birthday she takes her students on a guided tour of a special area outside of Two Hills, a place where the so-called “primates” live. The "primates" are men (and a handful of women) who have chosen to live beyond female control. However, the tranquillity of Rada’s perfectly arranged female-centric world comes under threat when she meets the young "primate", Hera. It’s a classic girl-meets-boy story, in a world where the rules have fundamentally changed.', 'The year is 2140. Society has undergone profound change and is now run as a matriarchy, thus removing its reliance on men. Two Hills is one of the communities founded by this new order. It is a place of perfection, where there is harmony rather than conflict, science and reason prevail and the environment is protected and respected. One of its inhabitants is the history teacher, Rada. On her birthday she takes her students on a guided tour of a special area outside of Two Hills, a place where the so-called “primates” live. The "primates" are men (and a handful of women) who have chosen to live beyond female control. However, the tranquillity of Rada’s perfectly arranged female-centric world comes under threat when she meets the young "primate", Hera. It’s a classic girl-meets-boy story, in a world where the rules have fundamentally changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PiWLVa7ti8BDnUeg2hYrpiGkdK.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:157769'),
  ('521555261463888091', 'The No. 1 Ladies'' Detective Agency', 2009, 'Mystery, Crime, Comedy, Drama', 'Anthony Minghella, Richard Curtis', null, 'Jill Scott, Anika Noni Rose, Lucian Msamati, Desmond Dube', 'TV-PG', 'The adventures of Mma Ramotswe, a Motswana woman who starts Botswana''s first female-owned detective agency.', 'The adventures of Mma Ramotswe, a Motswana woman who starts Botswana''s first female-owned detective agency.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVPAP1fS5k8nFRtIE8TgSgdL9bb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:7154'),
  ('1100341625580035787', 'The Noite com Danilo Gentili', 2014, 'Talk, Comedy', 'Danilo Gentili', null, 'Danilo Gentili, Diguinho Coruja, Igor Guimarães, Roger Rocha Moreira, Marcos Kleine, Bacalhau, Ronaldo Cabral', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agA6JjPuTsuVdJblhVt8vtiKalf.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:85184'),
  ('673341858359459881', 'The Nokdu Flower', 2019, 'Drama', 'Jung Hyun-min, Shin Gyeong-su', 'Jung Hyun-min', 'Cho Jung-seok, Yoon Shi-yoon, Han Ye-ri, Choi Moo-seong, Park Hyuk-kwon, Hwang Young-hee, Seo Young-hee, Jeong Seon-cheol', null, 'Set during the period of the 1894 Donghak Peasant Revolution against the Japanese, the drama tells the story of two half-brothers, one illegitimate and low born, and one, part of the pro-Japanese ruling elite, who find themselves on opposite sides of the conflict.', 'Set during the period of the 1894 Donghak Peasant Revolution against the Japanese, the drama tells the story of two half-brothers, one illegitimate and low born, and one, part of the pro-Japanese ruling elite, who find themselves on opposite sides of the conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKCvoDIp36NvZPu5TGfW9ALzBEf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88398'),
  ('751265907907867644', 'The Norm Show', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Norm Macdonald, Bruce Helford', null, 'Norm Macdonald, Laurie Metcalf, Ian Gomez, Max Wright, Artie Lange, Faith Ford', 'TV-14', 'Norm Henderson was once a fairly well-known -- but not particularly good -- professional hockey player. Norm''s penchant for gambling and not paying taxes resulted in his permanent expulsion from the game. Instead of jail, he was sentenced to community service as a social worker, where his fresh perspective in the field and lack of patience for office red tape don''t always jibe well with his co-workers.', 'Norm Henderson was once a fairly well-known -- but not particularly good -- professional hockey player. Norm''s penchant for gambling and not paying taxes resulted in his permanent expulsion from the game. Instead of jail, he was sentenced to community service as a social worker, where his fresh perspective in the field and lack of patience for office red tape don''t always jibe well with his co-workers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wP6ZoZQ7d14vY50UqnV1VNhwF2I.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1320'),
  ('42657667823145054', 'The North Water', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Andrew Haigh', null, 'Colin Farrell, Jack O''Connell', 'TV-MA', 'Henry Drax is a harpooner and brutish killer whose amorality has been shaped to fit the harshness of his world, who will set sail on a whaling expedition to the Arctic with Patrick Sumner, a disgraced ex-army surgeon who signs up as the ship’s doctor. Hoping to escape the horrors of his past, Sumner finds himself on an ill-fated journey with a murderous psychopath. In search of redemption, his story becomes a harsh struggle for survival in the Arctic wasteland.', 'Henry Drax is a harpooner and brutish killer whose amorality has been shaped to fit the harshness of his world, who will set sail on a whaling expedition to the Arctic with Patrick Sumner, a disgraced ex-army surgeon who signs up as the ship’s doctor. Hoping to escape the horrors of his past, Sumner finds himself on an ill-fated journey with a murderous psychopath. In search of redemption, his story becomes a harsh struggle for survival in the Arctic wasteland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9CM0ca8pX1os3SJ24hsIc0nN8ph.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86941'),
  ('902086653590775999', 'The Not-Too-Late Show with Elmo', 2020, 'Talk, Kids, Comedy', null, null, 'Ryan Dillon', 'TV-Y', 'Elmo is the host of his very own talk show and he''s going to bring you some (not-too-late) fun with this celeb-studded talk show, bringing familiar Sesame Street friends like Elmo, Cookie Monster, celebrity guests, and laughs the whole family can enjoy!', 'Elmo is the host of his very own talk show and he''s going to bring you some (not-too-late) fun with this celeb-studded talk show, bringing familiar Sesame Street friends like Elmo, Cookie Monster, celebrity guests, and laughs the whole family can enjoy!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pFxY0D86mtZ4Efi8t7HZDLdcxwE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:101157'),
  ('969433547438482842', 'The Now', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Steve Leff, Pete Jones, Peter Farrelly', null, 'Dave Franco, Bill Murray, Alyssa Milano, O''Shea Jackson Jr., Daryl Hannah, Merritt Patterson, Jimmy Tatro', null, 'For Ed Poole, clarity comes when a secret from his past has seemingly destroyed his future. He soon realizes the only thing that will make his life worth living is to forget the past, screw the future and just live in The Now.', 'For Ed Poole, clarity comes when a secret from his past has seemingly destroyed his future. He soon realizes the only thing that will make his life worth living is to forget the past, screw the future and just live in The Now.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mlrJbTNPZYjQk0gJ3xWVUXHk2aW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95070'),
  ('759585215386083151', 'The Numbers', 2016, 'Animation', null, null, 'Daiki Kobayashi, Yuto Uemura, Tomokazu Seki, Tetsuya Kakihara, Airu Shiozaki', null, 'Four men are assigned to the prison: Jūgo, a man who attempted to break out of prison and ended up extending his jail time; Uno, a man who likes to gamble with women; Rock, a man who likes to get into fights; and Nico, a man who likes anime.', 'Four men are assigned to the prison: Jūgo, a man who attempted to break out of prison and ended up extending his jail time; Uno, a man who likes to gamble with women; Rock, a man who likes to get into fights; and Nico, a man who likes anime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/deAAWfBOx5ObJji03bEv19pY9u5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:68115'),
  ('1075853606994502400', 'The Nurse', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', 'Kasper Barfoed', null, 'Josephine Park, Fanny Louise Bernth, Peter Zandersen, Dick Kaysø, Selma Kjær Kuscu, Amalie Lindegård, Sofia Cukic, Stephanie Nguyen', 'TV-MA', 'Pernille Kurzmann Larsen, a fresh-faced nurse at a hospital, begins to question the attention-seeking tendencies of her colleague, Christina Aistrup Hansen. As Pernille delves deeper into her suspicions, she starts to believe that Christina''s behavior may be linked to a series of patient deaths.', 'Pernille Kurzmann Larsen, a fresh-faced nurse at a hospital, begins to question the attention-seeking tendencies of her colleague, Christina Aistrup Hansen. As Pernille delves deeper into her suspicions, she starts to believe that Christina''s behavior may be linked to a series of patient deaths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zxh9kjto6w8GMIEGigdLFot7pUK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:221802'),
  ('950589602162860828', 'The O.C.', 2003, 'Drama', 'Josh Schwartz', null, 'Peter Gallagher, Kelly Rowan, Ben McKenzie, Adam Brody, Melinda Clarke, Rachel Bilson, Autumn Reeser, Willa Holland', 'TV-14', 'Ryan Atwood, a teen from the wrong side of the tracks, moves in with a wealthy family willing to give him a chance. But Ryan''s arrival disturbs the status quo of the affluent, privileged community of Newport Beach, California.', 'Ryan Atwood, a teen from the wrong side of the tracks, moves in with a wealthy family willing to give him a chance. But Ryan''s arrival disturbs the status quo of the affluent, privileged community of Newport Beach, California.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDc6BMGDaeyalpSZ9KKk7RCBCz5.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2673'),
  ('357524203681215630', 'The OA', 2016, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Drama', 'Brit Marling, Zal Batmanglij', null, 'Brit Marling, Jason Isaacs, Emory Cohen, Kingsley Ben-Adir, Phyllis Smith, Patrick Gibson, Brendan Meyer, Brandon Perea', 'TV-MA', 'Seven years after vanishing from her home, a young woman returns with mysterious new abilities and recruits five strangers for a secret mission.', 'Seven years after vanishing from her home, a young woman returns with mysterious new abilities and recruits five strangers for a secret mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rueY4slMeKtTGitm0raFUJvgaa5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69061'),
  ('262943886495432020', 'The Oath', 2018, 'Drama, Crime', 'Joe Halpin', null, 'Ryan Kwanten, Katrina Law, Cory Hardrict, J. J. Soria, Christina Milian, Zulay Henao, Sebastián Zurita, J. Anthony Pena', 'TV-MA', 'Explore a gang world we''ve never seen before: gangs that are made up of the very men and women sworn to uphold the law – cops. Only select officers make the cut, but once inside, gang members will do what they must to protect each other from enemies inside and outside their ranks.', 'Explore a gang world we''ve never seen before: gangs that are made up of the very men and women sworn to uphold the law – cops. Only select officers make the cut, but once inside, gang members will do what they must to protect each other from enemies inside and outside their ranks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ouEeuz1XsMRnPPVC9pzxgM2DpBB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:75797'),
  ('935654839576913968', 'The Oath of Love', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Yang Zi, Xiao Zhan, Zhai Zilu, Li Yunrui, Ma Yujie, Daisy Li, Wang Chengyang, Zhao Shiyi', null, 'On the brink of graduation, Lin Zhixiao’s life unravels—her father falls seriously ill, she loses a key job opportunity, and her relationship ends. Amid the turmoil, she meets Gu Wei, her father’s compassionate doctor. As they navigate heartbreak, misunderstandings, and life’s challenges, they slowly discover a deep, unexpected love that proves they are meant for each other.', 'On the brink of graduation, Lin Zhixiao’s life unravels—her father falls seriously ill, she loses a key job opportunity, and her relationship ends. Amid the turmoil, she meets Gu Wei, her father’s compassionate doctor. As they navigate heartbreak, misunderstandings, and life’s challenges, they slowly discover a deep, unexpected love that proves they are meant for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/puemYOibrTKQsj9gxfj0FW3DKzz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95044'),
  ('574805985637956418', 'The Oblongs', 2001, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Angus Oblong, Jace Richdale', null, 'Jean Smart, Will Ferrell, Pamela Adlon, Lea DeLaria, Jeannie Elias, Randy Sklar, Jason Sklar, Billy West', 'TV-14', 'The Oblongs are not so much dysfunctional as slightly nonfunctional. Living next to a polluted swamp has left them with the occasional missing limb or mysterious growth, but through it all, this close-knit family sticks together.Sometimes literally.', 'The Oblongs are not so much dysfunctional as slightly nonfunctional. Living next to a polluted swamp has left them with the occasional missing limb or mysterious growth, but through it all, this close-knit family sticks together.Sometimes literally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zHgUbiQnYhU7F4GSPv2yBU8GrRo.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2568'),
  ('213579670770970418', 'The Octopus', 1984, 'Drama, Crime', 'Nicola Badalucco, Lucio Battistrada', null, 'Patricia Millardet, Remo Girone, Elena Arvigo, Rolf Hoppe, Pippo Pattavina, Gilberto Idonea, Arturo Paglia, Gabriele Bocciarelli', 'TV-14', 'An epic crime saga of power, money, violence and corruption. The mafia controls everything through local and international networks like an octopus, and anyone who tries to bring them down pays the ultimate price.', 'An epic crime saga of power, money, violence and corruption. The mafia controls everything through local and international networks like an octopus, and anyone who tries to bring them down pays the ultimate price.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2gLLftWX1ecorSXq2jBMosQAcKx.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:12822'),
  ('1039008351641978439', 'The Odd Couple', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Garry Marshall, Neil Simon', null, 'Tony Randall, Jack Klugman', 'TV-PG', 'Felix and Oscar are two divorced men. Felix is neat and tidy while Oscar is sloppy and casual. They share a Manhattan apartment, and their different lifestyles inevitably lead to conflicts.', 'Felix and Oscar are two divorced men. Felix is neat and tidy while Oscar is sloppy and casual. They share a Manhattan apartment, and their different lifestyles inevitably lead to conflicts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NYUeWc7lXq6pbHDP0Pz3xxKhPC.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1809'),
  ('847315623687465406', 'The Odd Couple', 2015, 'Comedy, Family', 'Matthew Perry, Danny Jacobson, Joe Keenan', null, 'Matthew Perry, Thomas Lennon, Lindsay Sloane, Yvette Nicole Brown, Wendell Pierce', 'TV-PG', 'Oscar''s life seems almost perfect...sure he''s divorced and his apartment is a mess, but he''s the host of a well-known sports show, and is enjoying his bachelor lifestyle in New York City. That is until his college friend, Felix, shows up at Oscar''s apartment having just been dumped by his wife. Oscar does his best to console his old buddy and get him back on the dating horse, but his attempts uncover just how unresolved his own feelings are about his ex.', 'Oscar''s life seems almost perfect...sure he''s divorced and his apartment is a mess, but he''s the host of a well-known sports show, and is enjoying his bachelor lifestyle in New York City. That is until his college friend, Felix, shows up at Oscar''s apartment having just been dumped by his wife. Oscar does his best to console his old buddy and get him back on the dating horse, but his attempts uncover just how unresolved his own feelings are about his ex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/24HI3P1UtxJy019gYQSNd1FbXdN.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:61725'),
  ('504364191709737127', 'The Odyssey', 1992, 'Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Warren Easton, Paul Vitols', null, 'Illya Woloshyn, Ashleigh Aston Moore, Tony Sampson, Janet Hodgkinson', null, 'The Odyssey is a Canadian-produced half-hour adventure-fantasy television series for children, originally broadcast 1992-94 on CBC Television. It starred Illya Woloshyn as Jay Ziegler, Ashleigh Aston Moore as Donna/Alpha, Tony Sampson as Keith/Flash, Andrea Nemeth as Medea/Sierra Jones, Mark Hildreth as Finger, Ryan Reynolds as Macro, Janet Hodgkinson as Val Ziegler, and Devon Sawa as Yudo.', 'The Odyssey is a Canadian-produced half-hour adventure-fantasy television series for children, originally broadcast 1992-94 on CBC Television. It starred Illya Woloshyn as Jay Ziegler, Ashleigh Aston Moore as Donna/Alpha, Tony Sampson as Keith/Flash, Andrea Nemeth as Medea/Sierra Jones, Mark Hildreth as Finger, Ryan Reynolds as Macro, Janet Hodgkinson as Val Ziegler, and Devon Sawa as Yudo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ixeOYFcCj6YjKrliC13pxGFNTK2.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:11121'),
  ('1090174451793760863', 'The Odyssey', 1997, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Andrei Konchalovsky', null, 'Armand Assante, Greta Scacchi, Isabella Rossellini, Bernadette Peters, Eric Roberts, Irene Papas, Jeroen Krabbé, Geraldine Chaplin', 'TV-14', 'Warrior Odysseus leaves his idyllic life in the kingdom of Ithaca to fight in the Trojan War. Following victory, he now must endure a lengthy, decade-long return journey, and with all his wits, overcome deadly monsters, powerful forces of nature, seductive enchantresses, and even journey into the bowels of the Underworld.', 'Warrior Odysseus leaves his idyllic life in the kingdom of Ithaca to fight in the Trojan War. Following victory, he now must endure a lengthy, decade-long return journey, and with all his wits, overcome deadly monsters, powerful forces of nature, seductive enchantresses, and even journey into the bowels of the Underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wCiQ7XySqnz9X1REtDNZRGLfhpe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9687'),
  ('598058031402340001', 'The Offer', 2022, 'Drama', 'Michael Tolkin', null, 'Miles Teller, Matthew Goode, Dan Fogler, Burn Gorman, Colin Hanks, Giovanni Ribisi, Juno Temple', 'TV-MA', 'Oscar-winning producer Al Ruddy’s never before revealed experiences of making the iconic 1972 film The Godfather that Francis Ford Coppola directed and adapted with Mario Puzo.', 'Oscar-winning producer Al Ruddy’s never before revealed experiences of making the iconic 1972 film The Godfather that Francis Ford Coppola directed and adapted with Mario Puzo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fdYX5uc3HZEuYotms3XJ72AbCr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114068'),
  ('236112836072680780', 'The Office', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Stephen Merchant, Ricky Gervais', null, 'Ricky Gervais, Martin Freeman, Mackenzie Crook, Lucy Davis, Stirling Gallacher, Patrick Baladi, Stacey Roca, Ben Bradshaw', 'TV-MA', 'Nightmare boss. Tedious colleagues. Pointless tasks. Welcome to Wernham Hogg. Fancy a tea break with David Brent? Classic comedy from the archive.', 'Nightmare boss. Tedious colleagues. Pointless tasks. Welcome to Wernham Hogg. Fancy a tea break with David Brent? Classic comedy from the archive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oX2JKE1RzAONMbYlujHx0hRAJo1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2996'),
