  ('169531403496029251', 'The Playlist', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Edvin Endre, Gizem Erdogan, Christian Hillborg, Ulf Stenberg, Severija Janušauskaitė, Hanna Ardéhn, Agnes Kittelsen, Ella Rappich', 'TV-MA', 'How Swedish tech entrepreneur Daniel Ek and business partner Martin Lorentzon revolutionized the music industry through free and legal music streaming when they launched Spotify.', 'How Swedish tech entrepreneur Daniel Ek and business partner Martin Lorentzon revolutionized the music industry through free and legal music streaming when they launched Spotify.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwH3duWAhZBspeFGcftWjQL4Nal.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210195'),
  ('869405783278928172', 'The Pleasure Principle', 2019, 'Crime', null, null, 'Karel Roden, Małgorzata Buczkowska, Stipe Erceg, Magdalena Boczarska, Mirosław Baka, Mirosław Haniszewski, Serhiy Strelnykov, Robert Gonera', 'NR', 'Mysterious murders has been committed in four post-communist cities: Warsaw, Prague, Odesa, and Leipzig. The investigations are carried out by three absolutely different in many aspects criminal police officers. Independently of one another, they soon come to the conclusion that all four murders are connected. Now, to solve the crimes they have to work together.', 'Mysterious murders has been committed in four post-communist cities: Warsaw, Prague, Odesa, and Leipzig. The investigations are carried out by three absolutely different in many aspects criminal police officers. Independently of one another, they soon come to the conclusion that all four murders are connected. Now, to solve the crimes they have to work together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/QuHbQBlP3QEq2DxLkT3neW0OnM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83677'),
  ('596358350911368344', 'The Plot Against America', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Ed Burns, David Simon', null, 'Winona Ryder, John Turturro, Zoe Kazan, Morgan Spector, Anthony Boyle, Azhy Robertson, Caleb Malis', 'TV-MA', 'An alternate American history told through the eyes of a working-class Jewish family in New Jersey, as they watch the political rise of Charles Lindbergh, an aviator-hero and xenophobic populist, who becomes president and turns the nation toward fascism.', 'An alternate American history told through the eyes of a working-class Jewish family in New Jersey, as they watch the political rise of Charles Lindbergh, an aviator-hero and xenophobic populist, who becomes president and turns the nation toward fascism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rC5GUHvKxlk3WPyCh4mQ5q6HDxG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83870'),
