  ('590693426973963374', 'The Real Bros of Simi Valley', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Jimmy Tatro', null, 'Jimmy Tatro, Nick Colletti, Cody Ko, Tanner Petulla, Colleen Donovan, Peter Gilroy, Monette Moio, Monica Sherer', null, 'A look inside the lives of Xander, Bryce, Duncan and Wade, who live in Simi Valley.', 'A look inside the lives of Xander, Bryce, Duncan and Wade, who live in Simi Valley.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7473gxlsMnhhY5N5biMQ4wGIl5J.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:71249'),
  ('901762435560434853', 'The Real Football Factories', 2006, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Danny Dyer', null, 'The Real Football Factories is a documentary series shown on the Bravo TV channel in the UK and created by Zig Zag Productions. The show looks at the in-depth life of football hooligans and hooligan firms. Interviews are conducted with past and present hooligans. The presenter of the show, Danny Dyer, also starred in the film The Football Factory. During the series Dyer visits Yorkshire, Scotland, The Midlands, North West England and London to meet up with and interview hooligans. On 25 May 2007 Bravo broadcast a new show, The Real Football Factories International, which looks at football firms worldwide. In September 2007 Virgin Media released a spoof version of the show starring comedian Terry Alderton as Danny Dire.', 'The Real Football Factories is a documentary series shown on the Bravo TV channel in the UK and created by Zig Zag Productions. The show looks at the in-depth life of football hooligans and hooligan firms. Interviews are conducted with past and present hooligans. The presenter of the show, Danny Dyer, also starred in the film The Football Factory. During the series Dyer visits Yorkshire, Scotland, The Midlands, North West England and London to meet up with and interview hooligans. On 25 May 2007 Bravo broadcast a new show, The Real Football Factories International, which looks at football firms worldwide. In September 2007 Virgin Media released a spoof version of the show starring comedian Terry Alderton as Danny Dire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/76c7JcuIis3i1FbmwirBmwYkwPf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3087'),
  ('1107964872519694323', 'The Real Ghostbusters', 1986, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Dan Aykroyd, Harold Ramis', null, 'Maurice LaMarche, Dave Coulier, Frank Welker, Kath Soucie, Buster Jones, Rodger Bumpass', 'TV-Y7', 'The continuing adventures of paranormal investigators Dr. Peter Venkman, Dr. Egon Spengler, Dr. Ray Stantz, Winston Zeddemore, their secretary Janine Melnitz and their mascot ghost Slimer.', 'The continuing adventures of paranormal investigators Dr. Peter Venkman, Dr. Egon Spengler, Dr. Ray Stantz, Winston Zeddemore, their secretary Janine Melnitz and their mascot ghost Slimer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j1xlBYeyOQcH51xQc4gEFJK6o13.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:2286'),
  ('678951198608307887', 'The Real Has Come!', 2023, 'Drama', 'Han Joon-seo, Jo Jung-joo', 'Jo Jung-joo', 'Baek Jin-hee, Ahn Jae-hyun, Cha Joo-young, Jung Eui-jae, Kang Boo-ja, Hong Yo-seob, Cha Hwa-yeon, Kim Hye-ok', null, 'A successful lecturer facing single motherhood devises a fake romance with a marriage-averse doctor — but keeping up the act proves harder than it seems.', 'A successful lecturer facing single motherhood devises a fake romance with a marriage-averse doctor — but keeping up the act proves harder than it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/phV9ZfUD6tQM4bIZ2kqCIDoEU9J.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214422'),
  ('1009445907315376730', 'The Real History of Science Fiction', 2014, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Dominic Sandbrook, Mark Gatiss', null, 'The series heads to the very frontiers of space and science to produce the definitive television history of science fiction, told through its impact on cinema, television and literature, with the help of filmmakers, writers, actors, and graphic artists. Each episode will explore one of the enduring themes of science fiction: time travel; the exploration of space; robots and artificial intelligence; and aliens.', 'The series heads to the very frontiers of space and science to produce the definitive television history of science fiction, told through its impact on cinema, television and literature, with the help of filmmakers, writers, actors, and graphic artists. Each episode will explore one of the enduring themes of science fiction: time travel; the exploration of space; robots and artificial intelligence; and aliens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xCPZ8trSwZPG3mf9kGViYNMW0BS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62813'),
  ('88305249087371585', 'The Real Housewives of Atlanta', 2008, 'Reality', 'Scott Dunlop', null, null, 'TV-14', 'Bravo''s cameras turn to the Southern states as the network presents this inside look at the Real Housewives of Atlanta. These women handle the personal dramas that affect their affluent lifestyles with a signature Southern brand of “style” and “grace.”', 'Bravo''s cameras turn to the Southern states as the network presents this inside look at the Real Housewives of Atlanta. These women handle the personal dramas that affect their affluent lifestyles with a signature Southern brand of “style” and “grace.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5HYOsyc1sJQYjqevaWEaLRjd6E.jpg', 17, 'tmdb:tv:17380'),
  ('267179622209766728', 'The Real Housewives of Beverly Hills', 2010, 'Reality', null, null, 'Kyle Richards, Erika Girardi, Dorit Kemsley, Sutton Stracke, Bozoma Saint John, Rachel Zoe, Amanda Frances', 'TV-14', 'A reality series that follows some of the most affluent women in the country as they enjoy the lavish lifestyle that only Beverly Hills can provide.', 'A reality series that follows some of the most affluent women in the country as they enjoy the lavish lifestyle that only Beverly Hills can provide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ktaCSlCgGDMFzgdYc1LYF6CiWq.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:32390'),
  ('816529159979311106', 'The Real Housewives of Beverly Hills: After Show', null, null, null, null, null, null, 'The Beverly Hills wives are breaking down all of this season’s drama!', 'The Beverly Hills wives are breaking down all of this season’s drama!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iFBaylh0N220nvmJIjAO7hVu29K.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:314090'),
  ('47744990282007964', 'The Real Housewives of Cheshire', 2015, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'The series steps inside the champagne fuelled lives of Ampika Pickston, Dawn Ward, Lauren Simon, Leanne Brown, Magali Gorré and Tanya Bardsley. Throughout the series we’ll get to know these amazing characters and their intertwining lives. In the extreme world of Cheshire’s rich and famous residents, life moves fast and each day has its dramas, ensuring every episode will be action packed and entertaining. All with the gorgeous backdrop of the lavish homes and the exclusive locations that these women live in. The Housewives’ wealth and connections also mean that through them, you''ll get unique access to the elite events and fabulous social occasions that punctuate the Housewives’ extraordinary lives.', 'The series steps inside the champagne fuelled lives of Ampika Pickston, Dawn Ward, Lauren Simon, Leanne Brown, Magali Gorré and Tanya Bardsley. Throughout the series we’ll get to know these amazing characters and their intertwining lives. In the extreme world of Cheshire’s rich and famous residents, life moves fast and each day has its dramas, ensuring every episode will be action packed and entertaining. All with the gorgeous backdrop of the lavish homes and the exclusive locations that these women live in. The Housewives’ wealth and connections also mean that through them, you''ll get unique access to the elite events and fabulous social occasions that punctuate the Housewives’ extraordinary lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6MaVL6qNu13OJ5eT5HHas9DInhs.jpg', 18, 'tmdb:tv:61868'),
  ('614940935160180294', 'The Real Housewives of Dallas', 2016, 'Reality', 'Scott Dunlop', null, 'Kary Brittingham, Stephanie Hollman, Brandi Redmond, Tiffany Moon, Jennifer Davis, Kameron Westcott, D''Andra Simmons', 'TV-14', 'An exclusive look into the glamorous galas, scintillating scandals and enormous egos of a group of women as they navigate the social scene of Dallas’ elite, all while juggling their husbands, boyfriends and families.', 'An exclusive look into the glamorous galas, scintillating scandals and enormous egos of a group of women as they navigate the social scene of Dallas’ elite, all while juggling their husbands, boyfriends and families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QDd7EZgr5cWfyEirSYxVBIjDkS.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:39283'),
  ('489055623023290688', 'The Real Housewives of Dubai', 2022, 'Reality', 'Scott Dunlop', null, 'Lesa Milan Hall, Caroline Brooks, Sara Al Madani, Chanel Ayan, Caroline Stanbury, Taleen Marie', 'TV-14', 'As the 11th city in the franchise, the series highlights a group of women navigating their relationships, careers, and supremely lavish and ultra-wealthy lifestyles in the United Arab Emirates. With the desert paradise of Dubai as the backdrop, this billionaire''s playground is known for its over-the-top opulence, jaw-dropping modern architecture and wild nightlife scene. Whether they''re coasting on a private plane, running their own empires or hosting on a private island, these glamourous, successful women are ready to serve up scorching hot drama and unexpected twists.', 'As the 11th city in the franchise, the series highlights a group of women navigating their relationships, careers, and supremely lavish and ultra-wealthy lifestyles in the United Arab Emirates. With the desert paradise of Dubai as the backdrop, this billionaire''s playground is known for its over-the-top opulence, jaw-dropping modern architecture and wild nightlife scene. Whether they''re coasting on a private plane, running their own empires or hosting on a private island, these glamourous, successful women are ready to serve up scorching hot drama and unexpected twists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nC8PyRTFwrs6xKDrGSJWoqcYBUR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:196592'),
  ('403611983316794333', 'The Real Housewives of Melbourne', 2014, 'Reality', null, null, 'Jackie Gillies, Janet Roach, Gamble Breaux, Cherry Dipietrantonio, Kyla Kirkpatrick, Anjali Rao, Simone Elliott', null, 'Follow the busy, aspirational lifestyles of a group of driven and ambitious women who enjoy the lavish, pampered and cultured lifestyle of Melbourne. Between them, they own private jets, amazing homes and are married to high profile businessmen, including one to a rock star and another to a plastic surgeon.', 'Follow the busy, aspirational lifestyles of a group of driven and ambitious women who enjoy the lavish, pampered and cultured lifestyle of Melbourne. Between them, they own private jets, amazing homes and are married to high profile businessmen, including one to a rock star and another to a plastic surgeon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mN25UK65gJEV8lHxfHKrXG4kPDx.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:62087'),
  ('1031306885477658525', 'The Real Housewives of Miami', 2011, 'Reality', 'Scott Dunlop', null, 'Larsa Pippen, Alexia Echevarria, Lisa Hochstein, Guerdy Abraira, Julia Lemigova, Stephanie Shojaee', 'TV-14', 'Six of the most influential and connected women live life to the fullest in the sunny city where both the party and the drama never stop.', 'Six of the most influential and connected women live life to the fullest in the sunny city where both the party and the drama never stop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mlhCJsrZ2QsZmMuvI66RUhPAy3h.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:34268'),
  ('410845232035822750', 'The Real Housewives of New Jersey', 2009, 'Reality', 'Scott Dunlop', null, null, 'TV-14', 'We head to the Garden State for this installment of the “Housewives” franchise, focusing on affluent Jersey girls who are more than just friends. The cast has changed through the seasons but the featured housewives through the years have included Caroline Manzo, a devoted wife and mother of three adult children; former Las Vegas cosmetologist Jacqueline Laurita, who is now a full-time housewife; and Teresa Giudice, a mother of four who runs her household without help from a nanny or personal assistant.', 'We head to the Garden State for this installment of the “Housewives” franchise, focusing on affluent Jersey girls who are more than just friends. The cast has changed through the seasons but the featured housewives through the years have included Caroline Manzo, a devoted wife and mother of three adult children; former Las Vegas cosmetologist Jacqueline Laurita, who is now a full-time housewife; and Teresa Giudice, a mother of four who runs her household without help from a nanny or personal assistant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3ZNgp7IpQOUXoGoV8svZccZeoP.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:18204'),
  ('763504051307727375', 'The Real Housewives of New York City', 2008, 'Reality', 'Scott Dunlop', null, 'Sai De Silva, Ubah Hassan, Erin Lichy, Jenna Lyons, Jessel Taank, Brynn Whitfield, Racquel Chevremont', 'TV-14', 'A fast-paced reality show that follows several incredibly busy and ambitious Manhattan women. Watch as they balance envious social calendars, challenging careers, and motherhood, with the hustle and bustle of the big city all around.', 'A fast-paced reality show that follows several incredibly busy and ambitious Manhattan women. Watch as they balance envious social calendars, challenging careers, and motherhood, with the hustle and bustle of the big city all around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzy5nUc4MfTdQFBdbUFAT1FRPLQ.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:14808'),
  ('208366443658873433', 'The Real Housewives of Orange County', 2006, 'Reality', 'Scott Dunlop', null, 'Tamra Judge, Shannon Storms Beador, Emily Simpson, Heather Dubrow, Gina Kirschenheiter, Jennifer Pedranti, Katie Ginella', 'TV-14', 'A view into the lives of several women and their families who live in one of the wealthiest communities in the country with the viewer taken "inside the gates" to show their lives aren''t always perfect.', 'A view into the lives of several women and their families who live in one of the wealthiest communities in the country with the viewer taken "inside the gates" to show their lives aren''t always perfect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mEg3ohdBkLOs0L1GmYGtiwyJXlE.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:10222'),
  ('718128042577663486', 'The Real Housewives of Potomac', 2016, 'Reality', 'Scott Dunlop', null, 'Gizelle Bryant, Ashley Darby, Wendy Osefo, Keiarna Stewart, Stacey Rusch, Tia Glover, Angel Massie', 'TV-14', 'Just up the river from our nation’s capital lies a hidden gem—Potomac, Maryland. Its rolling hills, gated mansions, sophisticated prep schools, and exclusive country clubs all serve to keep the area invitation-only. Sprinkled throughout this community are a handful of old-line, wealthy African-American families who have historically broken racial barriers to provide a life of privilege for their children. In a town where entry is granted only through class, pedigree, and lineage, how far will the ladies go to secure their spot at the top of this prestigious circle?', 'Just up the river from our nation’s capital lies a hidden gem—Potomac, Maryland. Its rolling hills, gated mansions, sophisticated prep schools, and exclusive country clubs all serve to keep the area invitation-only. Sprinkled throughout this community are a handful of old-line, wealthy African-American families who have historically broken racial barriers to provide a life of privilege for their children. In a town where entry is granted only through class, pedigree, and lineage, how far will the ladies go to secure their spot at the top of this prestigious circle?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lgSkHpr6LXxsh2YXiBrDZHn5wUR.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:65300'),
  ('387577850763294260', 'The Real Housewives of Salt Lake City', 2020, 'Reality', 'Scott Dunlop', null, 'Lisa Barlow, Whitney Rose, Meredith Marks, Mary Cosby, Heather Gay, Angie Katsanevas, Bronwyn Newport', 'TV-14', 'Fueled by multi-million-dollar businesses and brands, a hidden social circle of successful women have created their own paradise in the majestic mountains of Utah.', 'Fueled by multi-million-dollar businesses and brands, a hidden social circle of successful women have created their own paradise in the majestic mountains of Utah.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1tQ2wVVKoma672CxE2kfl9oxHR8.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:110381'),
  ('450059938667534854', 'The Real Housewives Ultimate Girls Trip', 2021, 'Reality', 'Scott Dunlop', null, 'Luann de Lesseps, Ramona Singer, Dorinda Medley, Kelly Jean Killoren, Sonja Morgan, Kristen Taekman', null, 'Bravo universes collide as iconic Housewives from different cities come together for the ultimate girls'' trip to beautiful Turks and Caicos.', 'Bravo universes collide as iconic Housewives from different cities come together for the ultimate girls'' trip to beautiful Turks and Caicos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iepv1O8RgPREdoWlCaM1zNiUFAm.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:136105'),
  ('335888148640479996', 'The Real Hustle', 2006, 'Reality, Crime', null, null, 'Jessica-Jane Stafford, Alexis Conran, R. Paul Wilson', null, 'A team of hustlers - Alexis Conran, Paul Wilson and Jessica-Jane Clement, try out some notorious scams on ‘marks’, filmed with hidden cameras. The aim is to reveal how scams work so that the viewer can avoid being ripped off by the same con.', 'A team of hustlers - Alexis Conran, Paul Wilson and Jessica-Jane Clement, try out some notorious scams on ‘marks’, filmed with hidden cameras. The aim is to reveal how scams work so that the viewer can avoid being ripped off by the same con.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sk12iAjLI1cTi6IIfS4nSbFeMNs.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:3685'),
  ('202469375930362617', 'The Real L Word', 2010, 'Reality', null, null, 'Whitney Mixter, Alyssa Morgan, Jill Sloane Goldstein', 'TV-MA', 'This sexy reality series features a fascinating group of smart, gorgeous, and fiercely successful LA ladies ready to make the scene with their uniquely captivating stories and sizzling drama. From love and lust to family and career, these women know what they want and just how to get it.', 'This sexy reality series features a fascinating group of smart, gorgeous, and fiercely successful LA ladies ready to make the scene with their uniquely captivating stories and sizzling drama. From love and lust to family and career, these women know what they want and just how to get it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4prOUS3LgkWjxWsrT6kHE8NFLT.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:33054'),
  ('1031015519415005793', 'The Real McCoys', 1957, 'Comedy', 'Irving Pincus', null, 'Richard Crenna, Walter Brennan, Lydia Reed, Tony Martinez', 'TV-14', 'The Real McCoys is an American situation comedy co-produced by Danny Thomas'' "Marterto Productions", in association with Walter Brennan and Irving Pincus'' "Westgate" company. The series aired for five seasons on the ABC-TV network from 1957 through 1962 and then for its final year on CBS from 1962 to 1963. The series, set in the San Fernando Valley of California, was filmed in Hollywood at Desilu studios.', 'The Real McCoys is an American situation comedy co-produced by Danny Thomas'' "Marterto Productions", in association with Walter Brennan and Irving Pincus'' "Westgate" company. The series aired for five seasons on the ABC-TV network from 1957 through 1962 and then for its final year on CBS from 1962 to 1963. The series, set in the San Fernando Valley of California, was filmed in Hollywood at Desilu studios.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2xpqTNMVtnBfXQVAR1eP5ay2UAz.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:10458'),
  ('511316452061689785', 'The Real O''Neals', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Joshua Sternin, Jennifer Ventimilia', null, 'Martha Plimpton, Jay R. Ferguson, Noah Galvin, Matt Shively, Bebe Wood, Mary Hollis Inboden', 'TV-PG', 'A contemporary take on a seemingly perfect Catholic family, whose lives take an unexpected turn when surprising truths are revealed. Instead of ruining their family, the honesty triggers a new, messier chapter where everyone stops pretending to be perfect and actually starts being real.', 'A contemporary take on a seemingly perfect Catholic family, whose lives take an unexpected turn when surprising truths are revealed. Instead of ruining their family, the honesty triggers a new, messier chapter where everyone stops pretending to be perfect and actually starts being real.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1I7Ta2NzLKjVzYsIBct0UF2U3ul.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62856'),
  ('1101157386855242143', 'The Real War of Thrones', 2017, 'Documentary, War & Politics', null, null, 'Bruno Solo, Delphine Braillon', 'TV-MA', 'In the turbulent formative centuries of early Europe, power-hungry family dynasties fought for domination of the continent.', 'In the turbulent formative centuries of early Europe, power-hungry family dynasties fought for domination of the continent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8r2EQbMeiyAisy71lq8b0MsfQ6O.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:76016'),
  ('684953940766997486', 'The Real World', 1992, 'Reality', 'Mary-Ellis Bunim, Jonathan Murray', null, 'Yasmin Almokhamad', 'TV-14', 'Each year, seven strangers in their twenties, from different backgrounds and countries, are chosen to come live together in a major city.', 'Each year, seven strangers in their twenties, from different backgrounds and countries, are chosen to come live together in a major city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqeqlmK1KEBfEfABnPjEr7oXjWL.jpg', 33, 'tmdb:tv:5022'),
  ('28544891486509279', 'The Really Loud House', 2022, 'Comedy, Kids', 'Jonathan Judge', null, 'Wolfgang Schaeffer, Jahzir Bruno, Brian Stepanek, Stephen Full', 'TV-G', '12-year-old Lincoln Loud goes on new adventures in the town of Royal Woods with his best friend Clyde McBride, while also navigating the chaos of living in a family with 10 sisters.', '12-year-old Lincoln Loud goes on new adventures in the town of Royal Woods with his best friend Clyde McBride, while also navigating the chaos of living in a family with 10 sisters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMQiGeozy1xUWjhlbcp2QArtnPV.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:211779'),
  ('956379706775266312', 'The Reaping', 2018, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'Roberto D''Antona, Annamaria Lorusso, Michael Segal, Federico Mariotti, Francesco Emulo, David White, Mirco Magnani, Alessandra Salvoldi', null, 'The peace of a small town is going to be upset. Through a series of coincidences, acts of violence and corruption, unexpected truths will be revealed and the lives of nine people become intertwined thanks to sudden and stunning changes.', 'The peace of a small town is going to be upset. Through a series of coincidences, acts of violence and corruption, unexpected truths will be revealed and the lives of nine people become intertwined thanks to sudden and stunning changes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/efgufSzYd8MWXhp2N8GfmimE0CN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77419'),
  ('531119195341011232', 'The Rebel', 1959, 'Western', 'Nick Adams', null, 'Nick Adams', null, 'After the end of the Civil War, a former Confederate Army private roams the Wild West, and, as a rogue drifter, gets involved in helping out various settlers threatened by various bad guys... THE REBEL is a 76-episode American western television series starring Nick Adams that debuted on the ABC network from 1959 to 1961. The Rebel was one of the few Goodson-Todman Productions outside of their game show ventures. Beginning in December 2011, The Rebel reruns began to air Saturday mornings on Me-TV.', 'After the end of the Civil War, a former Confederate Army private roams the Wild West, and, as a rogue drifter, gets involved in helping out various settlers threatened by various bad guys... THE REBEL is a 76-episode American western television series starring Nick Adams that debuted on the ABC network from 1959 to 1961. The Rebel was one of the few Goodson-Todman Productions outside of their game show ventures. Beginning in December 2011, The Rebel reruns began to air Saturday mornings on Me-TV.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Qs3Bk38S65h5Tsi2EVZGHvSLIG.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:13844'),
  ('265990192403643759', 'The Rebel', 2017, 'Drama', null, 'Hwang Jin-young', 'Yoon Kyun-sang, Kim Ji-seok, Chae Soo-bin, Lee Hanee, Kim Sang-joong, Lee Jun-hyeok, Ahn Nae-sang, Shin Eun-jung', null, 'During the period of Joseon Yeonsanjo, Hong Gildong was a hero who helped the unfortunate locals and fought against greedy governors. This legendary rebel, Hong Gildong''s journey unveils his battle for love and justice.', 'During the period of Joseon Yeonsanjo, Hong Gildong was a hero who helped the unfortunate locals and fought against greedy governors. This legendary rebel, Hong Gildong''s journey unveils his battle for love and justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/posvP9SXFXzTzAH0pj3rbRk9Hj1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68892'),
  ('107319010757772469', 'The Rebel Princess', 2021, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Li Jing Ling', 'Li Jing Ling', 'Zhang Ziyi, Zhou Yiwei, Tony Yang, Yu Hewei, Jia Yiping, Jiang Kai, Liu Yun, Purba Rgyal', null, 'Wang Xuan and Xiao Qi strike a deal for the sake of power. They marry first before falling in love and join hands to protect their homeland. She is a woman who is no less than any man while he rose from humble beginnings. The imperial family has become rotten to the core. The nobles are lavish with no regard for the people. Princess Wang Xuan and her childhood sweetheart, the third prince, become pawns of a prophecy that states, "to acquire thee is to obtain the world." Being pulled into the matters of the court, Wang Xuan is married off by her father to Xiao Qi who comes from a poor family. On the night of their wedding, Xiao Qi is forced to leave the capital. Wang Xuan is shamed and discouraged. The Helan Prince kidnaps Wang Xuan in order to seek revenge on Xiao Qi. The crisis they face becomes a blessing in disguise for the couple. Wang Xuan is moved and inspired by Xiao Qi''s wish to bring peace and prosperity to the nation and they fall in love.', 'Wang Xuan and Xiao Qi strike a deal for the sake of power. They marry first before falling in love and join hands to protect their homeland. She is a woman who is no less than any man while he rose from humble beginnings. The imperial family has become rotten to the core. The nobles are lavish with no regard for the people. Princess Wang Xuan and her childhood sweetheart, the third prince, become pawns of a prophecy that states, "to acquire thee is to obtain the world." Being pulled into the matters of the court, Wang Xuan is married off by her father to Xiao Qi who comes from a poor family. On the night of their wedding, Xiao Qi is forced to leave the capital. Wang Xuan is shamed and discouraged. The Helan Prince kidnaps Wang Xuan in order to seek revenge on Xiao Qi. The crisis they face becomes a blessing in disguise for the couple. Wang Xuan is moved and inspired by Xiao Qi''s wish to bring peace and prosperity to the nation and they fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6MFsVuhe23tdYKxgyZk0OPRi9XV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:116293'),
  ('611778808673439678', 'The Recipe for a Happy Marriage', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Atsuya Asano', 'Aimi Satsukawa, Kento Senga, Manami Hashimoto, Yurina Yanagi, Masanari Wada, Maho Nonami, Yuma Ishigaki, Yuka Itaya', null, 'Nishina Shiho, is a young mother and raises her child while working as a writer at home. Although she enjoys her life and has a perfect husband, she is troubled by her lack of sex with her husband, Kosuke, who has ED. Due to this, Kosuke suggests that they attend a "couple exchange party", where couples change their partners for various reasons.', 'Nishina Shiho, is a young mother and raises her child while working as a writer at home. Although she enjoys her life and has a perfect husband, she is troubled by her lack of sex with her husband, Kosuke, who has ED. Due to this, Kosuke suggests that they attend a "couple exchange party", where couples change their partners for various reasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dpeFCeDItnHpZG63kgmesugJg2y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209538'),
  ('947207067714232513', 'The Reckoning', 2011, 'Drama', null, 'Chris Lang', 'Ashley Jensen, Max Beesley, Sophie Stuckey, Jane Perry, Aidan McArdle, Peter Wight, Daniel Ryan', null, 'Sally Wilson''s daughter Amanda is stricken with a brain tumour and each day, her condition appears to be worsening. Sally is at her wits end as to how to help her daughter and knows a life saving operation in America that she can''t afford would be the answer. When the harassed single Mum is called to the office of a swish city lawyer, she never expects a life or death proposition. She’s been bequeathed £5 million! But in order to qualify for this amazing transfer of funds, Sally must first kill a man who deserves to die.', 'Sally Wilson''s daughter Amanda is stricken with a brain tumour and each day, her condition appears to be worsening. Sally is at her wits end as to how to help her daughter and knows a life saving operation in America that she can''t afford would be the answer. When the harassed single Mum is called to the office of a swish city lawyer, she never expects a life or death proposition. She’s been bequeathed £5 million! But in order to qualify for this amazing transfer of funds, Sally must first kill a man who deserves to die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aAVqq9bEpAiKpXWm6fnYjNPQ1Ed.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43747'),
  ('376661318597503834', 'The Reckoning', 2023, 'Drama', 'Neil McKay, Dan Davies', 'Neil McKay', 'Steve Coogan, Mark Stanley, Fenella Woolgar, Michael Jibson, Gemma Jones, Robert Emms, Julian Rhind-Tutt, Mark Lewis Jones', null, 'The life of Jimmy Savile, a man who, for decades, became one of the UK’s most influential celebrities, but in death has become one of the most reviled figures of modern history following revelations of extensive and horrific abuse.', 'The life of Jimmy Savile, a man who, for decades, became one of the UK’s most influential celebrities, but in death has become one of the most reviled figures of modern history following revelations of extensive and horrific abuse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zXSIWNCuLT4NugyC70RR4aRJSif.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197193'),
  ('493412839024538665', 'The Record of Strange Things', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Hongchou Li', 'Shao Zhuang, Yang Yu, Doris Tong, Tian Song', null, 'After his girlfriend’s mysterious death, Shi Jian launches a company that investigates supernatural cases and uncovers magical objects connected to her fate, revealing a hidden conspiracy.', 'After his girlfriend’s mysterious death, Shi Jian launches a company that investigates supernatural cases and uncovers magical objects connected to her fate, revealing a hidden conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7DexGetQBiFuNlJHbnizSCRGR7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197476'),
  ('731583409724597058', 'The Recruit', 2022, 'Drama, Crime, Action & Adventure', 'Alexi Hawley', null, 'Noah Centineo, Colton Dunn, Aarti Mann, Fivel Stewart, Kristian Bruun, Kaylah Zander, Maddie Hasson, Angel Parker', 'TV-MA', 'Recruited out of law school by the CIA, a daredevil young attorney leaps unprepared into the dangerous world of international espionage.', 'Recruited out of law school by the CIA, a daredevil young attorney leaps unprepared into the dangerous world of international espionage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mLbFg0u2DPYuB5CILzwWk3kdI8b.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:210916'),
  ('148634939120469276', 'The Red Apple', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Rio Komiya, Asuka Kawazu, Yume Shinjo, Soko Wada, Yuki Tayama, Sakurako Okubo, Hitomi Miwa, Nana Oda', null, 'The story happens in the near future of Japan, where sexual activity is forbidden by law. Inuda Hikaru is an honor student whose father is an executive at Setori (Sexual Misconduct Control Bureau of the Ministry of Health, Labor and Welfare). Hikaru aspires to become like his father and finds sex unpleasant. Minase Yu is Hikaru''s childhood friend who has a sharp tongue but excels in her grades. Yu is also a big fan of nationally known actress Uchu Misora, commonly known as Uchura. One day, Hikaru is invited by a classmate to a shady members-only club where he witnesses men and women engaging in illegal sexual acts. He is also surprised to see Uchura, who claims to be "pure" there with a man. Before he realised, Hikaru finds himself being caught in an "underworld organization" where sexual activity is performed.', 'The story happens in the near future of Japan, where sexual activity is forbidden by law. Inuda Hikaru is an honor student whose father is an executive at Setori (Sexual Misconduct Control Bureau of the Ministry of Health, Labor and Welfare). Hikaru aspires to become like his father and finds sex unpleasant. Minase Yu is Hikaru''s childhood friend who has a sharp tongue but excels in her grades. Yu is also a big fan of nationally known actress Uchu Misora, commonly known as Uchura. One day, Hikaru is invited by a classmate to a shady members-only club where he witnesses men and women engaging in illegal sexual acts. He is also surprised to see Uchura, who claims to be "pure" there with a man. Before he realised, Hikaru finds himself being caught in an "underworld organization" where sexual activity is performed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s4pjlaBsQCu5EGycnux0DVAID6D.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217326'),
  ('1025782083950788742', 'The Red Band Society', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Tim Oliver Schultz, Damian Hardung, Luise Befort, Ivo Kortlang, Timur Bartels, Nick Julius Schuck, Sahin Eryilmaz, Julie Stark', null, 'Based upon the Catalan drama series Polseres vermelles, the series focuses on a group of teenagers living together as patients in a hospital''s pediatric ward.', 'Based upon the Catalan drama series Polseres vermelles, the series focuses on a group of teenagers living together as patients in a hospital''s pediatric ward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pud1ASvVIK9K1m7defo8qSbCPpM.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:64145'),
  ('928936741529465196', 'The Red Door', 2017, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Carlo Lucarelli, Giampiero Rigosi', 'Davide Orsini, Giampiero Rigosi, Carlo Lucarelli', 'Lino Guanciale, Valentina Romani, Gabriella Pession, Gaetano Bruno, Elena Radonicich, Cecilia Dazzi, Alessia Barela, Pierpaolo Spollon', null, 'Leonardo Cagliostro, a policeman, dies and decides to stay on Earth in order to find out more about the circumstances of his death and to save his wife, Anna, who''s in danger.', 'Leonardo Cagliostro, a policeman, dies and decides to stay on Earth in order to find out more about the circumstances of his death and to save his wife, Anna, who''s in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yBlrWtyTeDpC96yswLhcP2WonwX.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:70858'),
  ('885378609949174822', 'The Red Grasshopper', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Roberto Gómez Bolaños', null, 'Jesús Guzmán', 'NR', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nO9Ik4eH7RTX9r11qPtUWfMsWJA.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:68340'),
  ('889723509131588885', 'The Red Green Show', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Steve Smith, Rick Green', 'Steve Smith, David C. Smith, Rick Green', 'Steve Smith, Patrick McKenna, Rick Green, Albert Schultz, Bob Bainborough, Derek McGrath, Gavin Crawford, George Buza', 'TV-PG', 'The Red Green Show is a Canadian television comedy that aired on various channels in Canada, with its ultimate home at CBC Television, and on Public Broadcasting Service stations in the United States, from 1991 until the series finale April 7, 2006, on CBC. The Red Green Show is essentially a cross between a sitcom and a sketch comedy series, and is a parody of home improvement, do-it-yourself, fishing, and other outdoors shows.', 'The Red Green Show is a Canadian television comedy that aired on various channels in Canada, with its ultimate home at CBC Television, and on Public Broadcasting Service stations in the United States, from 1991 until the series finale April 7, 2006, on CBC. The Red Green Show is essentially a cross between a sitcom and a sketch comedy series, and is a parody of home improvement, do-it-yourself, fishing, and other outdoors shows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrDCC0WbGgSDB5pPU1HvllrygNh.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:2400'),
  ('108399260223039760', 'The Red King', 2024, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Toby Whithouse', 'Toby Whithouse', 'Anjli Mohindra, Jill Halfpenny, Adjoa Andoh, Mark Lewis Jones, Lu Corfield, Sam Swainsbury, Marc Warren', null, 'Smart, capable and by the book Grace Narayan was flying high as an inner-city police sergeant before being forced into a ''punishment posting'' on the small, antiquated island of St. Jory. Confronted by the forgotten and unsolved case of missing teenage boy Cai, Grace quickly discovers that she must overcome scarce evidence, extraordinary local characters, and the island''s strange cult history to uncover the truth.', 'Smart, capable and by the book Grace Narayan was flying high as an inner-city police sergeant before being forced into a ''punishment posting'' on the small, antiquated island of St. Jory. Confronted by the forgotten and unsolved case of missing teenage boy Cai, Grace quickly discovers that she must overcome scarce evidence, extraordinary local characters, and the island''s strange cult history to uncover the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dgRz3HVegJCnWOUqt3JPvgITOYf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:252284'),
  ('36718606927468196', 'The Red Line', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Caitlin Parrish, Erica Weiss', null, 'Noah Wyle, Emayatzy Corinealdi, Noel Fisher, Aliyah Royale, Elizabeth Laidlaw, Michael Patrick Thornton, Vinny Chhibber, Howard Charles', null, 'A heart-in-your-throat drama, Red Line begins with the mistaken shooting of a black doctor at the hands of a white cop and unfolds from the perspective of each of the families connected to the tragedy. It''s a then-and-now meets us-and-them tale about the often-personal politics of crime.', 'A heart-in-your-throat drama, Red Line begins with the mistaken shooting of a black doctor at the hands of a white cop and unfolds from the perspective of each of the families connected to the tragedy. It''s a then-and-now meets us-and-them tale about the often-personal politics of crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r6EYUEOBHu2haKq5q6KE1bsXgIU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86365'),
  ('575720459931729966', 'The Red Queen', 2015, 'Drama', null, null, 'Ксения Лукьянчикова, Tatyana Orlova, Elena Morozova, Anatoliy Rudenko', null, 'Story of the rise of a girl from proverbial humble beginnings to top Russian fashion model during Cold War-era USSR.', 'Story of the rise of a girl from proverbial humble beginnings to top Russian fashion model during Cold War-era USSR.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mgdSJPXKIyj4MAIMXwLEphh7ZcR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99988'),
  ('947057321210013466', 'The Red Ranger Becomes an Adventurer in Another World', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tomoya Ito, Konomi Inagaki, Minami Tanaka, Tomohiro Ono, Tetsu Inada', 'TV-14', 'Togo Asagaki was the Red Ranger in a heroic Ranger squad. During their final battle against an evil organization, he gave his life to guarantee their triumph. But fate had other plans, and he found himself reborn in an entirely different world. Embracing his new role as an adventurer, he transforms into Kizuna Red and continues his pursuit of justice, helping those in need.', 'Togo Asagaki was the Red Ranger in a heroic Ranger squad. During their final battle against an evil organization, he gave his life to guarantee their triumph. But fate had other plans, and he found himself reborn in an entirely different world. Embracing his new role as an adventurer, he transforms into Kizuna Red and continues his pursuit of justice, helping those in need.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ZkvF2ASZD3gLDnn2ZJ7L7RGSBc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:261148'),
  ('589846528600969928', 'The Red Road', 2014, 'Crime, Drama', 'Aaron Guzikowski', null, 'Martin Henderson, Jason Momoa, Julianne Nicholson, Allie Gonino, Tom Sizemore, Kiowa Gordon, Tamara Tunie', 'TV-14', 'Lines will be crossed when tragedy forces two men, a mesmerizing ex-con and an embattled local cop, to face the secrets of their past. As these two men find themselves increasingly compromised by one another, the lives of both quickly unravel.', 'Lines will be crossed when tragedy forces two men, a mesmerizing ex-con and an embattled local cop, to face the secrets of their past. As these two men find themselves increasingly compromised by one another, the lives of both quickly unravel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlUbfYYGmWfLwdCh2H78nRomSg1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:57273'),
  ('478083738052262502', 'The Red Skelton Show', 1951, 'Comedy, Talk, Family', null, null, 'Red Skelton', 'TV-G', 'The Red Skelton Show is an American variety show that was a television staple for two decades, from 1951 to 1971. It was second to Gunsmoke and third to The Ed Sullivan Show in the ratings during that time. Skelton, who had previously been a radio star, had appeared in several motion pictures as well. Although his television series is largely associated with CBS, where it appeared for more than fifteen years, it actually began and ended on NBC. During its run, the program received three Emmy Awards, for Skelton as best comedian and the program as best comedy show during its initial season, and an award for comedy writing in 1961.', 'The Red Skelton Show is an American variety show that was a television staple for two decades, from 1951 to 1971. It was second to Gunsmoke and third to The Ed Sullivan Show in the ratings during that time. Skelton, who had previously been a radio star, had appeared in several motion pictures as well. Although his television series is largely associated with CBS, where it appeared for more than fifteen years, it actually began and ended on NBC. During its run, the program received three Emmy Awards, for Skelton as best comedian and the program as best comedy show during its initial season, and an award for comedy writing in 1961.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6e54gnblIDcwDGOGhzPyV0fB6Rw.jpg', 20, 'tmdb:tv:10534'),
  ('570414947032167236', 'The Red Sleeve', 2021, 'Drama', 'Jung Hae-ri', 'Jung Hae-ri', 'Lee Jun-ho, Lee Se-young, Kang Hoon, Lee Duck-hwa, Park Ji-young, Jang Hee-jin, Ahn Se-min, Jang Hye-jin', null, 'Based on a novel of the same name, it tells the record of a royal court romance between the King of Joseon who believes his duty is to his country first above love, and a court lady who wants to protect the life she has chosen.', 'Based on a novel of the same name, it tells the record of a royal court romance between the King of Joseon who believes his duty is to his country first above love, and a court lady who wants to protect the life she has chosen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eXncJTjrw6VrwK3uulFJks7tvBv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132925'),
  ('1017333167700254462', 'The Red Tent', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, 'Elizabeth Chandler, Anne Meredith', 'Minnie Driver, Rebecca Ferguson, Morena Baccarin, Iain Glen, Debra Winger, Darwin Shaw, Toby Sebastian, Will Tudor', null, 'Her name is Dinah. In the Bible her life is only hinted at during a brief and violent detour within the more familiar chapters about her father, Jacob, and his dozen sons in the Book of Genesis. Told through Dinah''s eloquent voice, this sweeping miniseries reveals the traditions and turmoil of ancient womanhood. Dinah''s tale begins with the story of her mothers: Leah, Rachel, Zilpah, and Bilhah, the four wives of Jacob. They love Dinah and give her gifts that are to sustain her through a hard-working youth, a calling to midwifery, and a new home in a foreign land. Dinah tells us of the world of the red tent, the place where women were sequestered during their cycles of birthing, menses, and illness; of her initiations into the religious and sexual practices of her tribe; of Jacob''s courtship with his four wives; of the mystery and wonder of caravans, farmers, shepherds, and slaves; of love and death in the city of Shechem; of her half-brother Joseph''s rise in Egypt, and of course her marriage to Shechem and it''s bloody consequences.', 'Her name is Dinah. In the Bible her life is only hinted at during a brief and violent detour within the more familiar chapters about her father, Jacob, and his dozen sons in the Book of Genesis. Told through Dinah''s eloquent voice, this sweeping miniseries reveals the traditions and turmoil of ancient womanhood. Dinah''s tale begins with the story of her mothers: Leah, Rachel, Zilpah, and Bilhah, the four wives of Jacob. They love Dinah and give her gifts that are to sustain her through a hard-working youth, a calling to midwifery, and a new home in a foreign land. Dinah tells us of the world of the red tent, the place where women were sequestered during their cycles of birthing, menses, and illness; of her initiations into the religious and sexual practices of her tribe; of Jacob''s courtship with his four wives; of the mystery and wonder of caravans, farmers, shepherds, and slaves; of love and death in the city of Shechem; of her half-brother Joseph''s rise in Egypt, and of course her marriage to Shechem and it''s bloody consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hSttE4mnZdmANv6snbK2RYncbbs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61689'),
  ('1073935255067712635', 'THE REFLECTION', 2017, 'Animation', null, 'Hiroshi Nagahama', 'Shin-ichiro Miki, Satoshi Mikami, Mariya Ise, Satomi Hanamura, Toshihiko Seki', 'TV-MA', 'After The Reflection, some of the people in all parts of the world are discovered with super powers. Some become heroes, and others villains. How did the Reflection happen? What was the cause of it? With many unsolved mysteries, the world is led into turmoil.', 'After The Reflection, some of the people in all parts of the world are discovered with super powers. Some become heroes, and others villains. How did the Reflection happen? What was the cause of it? With many unsolved mysteries, the world is led into turmoil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6lu63gmcN1UP6eq2MgqVHE8AXo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72525'),
  ('422514097129231083', 'The Regime', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Will Tracy', null, 'Kate Winslet, Matthias Schoenaerts, Guillaume Gallienne, Andrea Riseborough, Danny Webb, Henry Goodman, David Bamber, Rory Keenan', 'TV-MA', 'The story of one year within the walls of the palace of a modern European regime as it begins to unravel.', 'The story of one year within the walls of the palace of a modern European regime as it begins to unravel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ztqPixNyezY6pWSNIP2AlhwPMO0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:206829'),
  ('471958726326399568', 'The Regression of Great Sage Riddle', 2026, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Junya Enoki, Azusa Tadokoro', null, 'Reclaim everything you lost—in your second run through the world. The mysterious group “Box of Malice” has taken everything from the young man Ryddel—his companions, his world, his future. Standing at the edge of despair, he grasps one final idea: What if I could return to the time before everything was destroyed? Having survived a thousand years and transformed into an inhuman being, Ryddel finally succeeds in reversing time. “This time… I will stop it all!” Carrying a millennium of knowledge and experience back into his youthful body, the great sage Ryddel begins his journey of time reversal!', 'Reclaim everything you lost—in your second run through the world. The mysterious group “Box of Malice” has taken everything from the young man Ryddel—his companions, his world, his future. Standing at the edge of despair, he grasps one final idea: What if I could return to the time before everything was destroyed? Having survived a thousand years and transformed into an inhuman being, Ryddel finally succeeds in reversing time. “This time… I will stop it all!” Carrying a millennium of knowledge and experience back into his youthful body, the great sage Ryddel begins his journey of time reversal!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nI42iJ6GAWN6U4MkJgLq75vGNmx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:313395'),
  ('1115788508592231602', 'The Rehearsal', 2022, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Nathan Fielder', null, 'Nathan Fielder', 'TV-MA', 'With a construction crew, a legion of actors, and seemingly unlimited resources, Nathan Fielder allows ordinary people to prepare for life''s biggest moments by "rehearsing" them in carefully crafted simulations of his own design. When a single misstep could shatter your entire world, why leave life to chance?', 'With a construction crew, a legion of actors, and seemingly unlimited resources, Nathan Fielder allows ordinary people to prepare for life''s biggest moments by "rehearsing" them in carefully crafted simulations of his own design. When a single misstep could shatter your entire world, why leave life to chance?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mIevNYxovnH4sR22qkUmAgS5vdv.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:204284'),
  ('232112151686861555', 'The Reichen Show', 2005, 'Talk', null, null, 'Lesley DeBrier, Reichen Lehmkuhl', null, 'A list of celebrity interviews and sensational topics.', 'A list of celebrity interviews and sensational topics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9fDBKqmmHHUvcaal1Tzw6iqTW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80515'),
  ('307723237188844018', 'The Reincarnation of the Strongest Exorcist in Another World', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yumiri Hanamori, Azumi Waki, Nene Hieda, Akari Kito, Yui Ogura, Kaede Hondo, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Gakuto Kajiwara', 'TV-14', 'Betrayed and on the brink of death, genius exorcist Haruyoshi Kuga still has an ace up his sleeve—a reincarnation spell. With a successful incantation taking him to a new world reborn as Seika Lamprogue into a distinguished wizard family, his only wish is to find happiness. But as Seika’s onmyō art exceeds this world’s magic, will he be able to live an easy, happy-go-lucky life?', 'Betrayed and on the brink of death, genius exorcist Haruyoshi Kuga still has an ace up his sleeve—a reincarnation spell. With a successful incantation taking him to a new world reborn as Seika Lamprogue into a distinguished wizard family, his only wish is to find happiness. But as Seika’s onmyō art exceeds this world’s magic, will he be able to live an easy, happy-go-lucky life?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvVe8mmY3FY3CJwbw5sCYubzaTj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156563'),
  ('732696289223474120', 'The Relative Worlds', 2017, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Maaya Uchida, Aoi Yuuki, Yuki Kaji', null, 'The story is set in Japan in 2020. The story centers on Shin Hazama, and a version of himself who led a different life in another Japan appears. A crack opens in the everyday life that he thought was impossible to change. Boys and girls have to decide what to think and choose when the world changes completely. The battle with another world and another self begins.', 'The story is set in Japan in 2020. The story centers on Shin Hazama, and a version of himself who led a different life in another Japan appears. A crack opens in the everyday life that he thought was impossible to change. Boys and girls have to decide what to think and choose when the world changes completely. The battle with another world and another self begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4clNQO7t5Ea8sTQrnGPGKXMvAA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87306'),
  ('122674943212521130', 'The Reluctant Preacher', 2025, 'Drama', null, 'Ookura', 'Alice Hirose, Shota Watanabe, Sae Okazaki, Kayo Noro, Keiko Horiuchi, Shinya Kote, Atsushi Ito, Yoshino Kimura', null, 'When Shizuka Urumi reluctantly works as a high school teacher and aims to keep her distance, her students provoke her to get involved in their lives.', 'When Shizuka Urumi reluctantly works as a high school teacher and aims to keep her distance, her students provoke her to get involved in their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rigIQ00vyE6LPpox5ugKEJjP3bO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:287868'),
  ('227745021048194155', 'The Reluctant Traveller with Eugene Levy', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Eugene Levy', 'TV-PG', 'Award-winning actor and nervous explorer Eugene Levy steps out of his comfort zone for a whirlwind tour of the world''s most beautiful and intriguing destinations.', 'Award-winning actor and nervous explorer Eugene Levy steps out of his comfort zone for a whirlwind tour of the world''s most beautiful and intriguing destinations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcwuOg24gPxnOOpTAr6xw8epDZg.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:137735'),
  ('852451700407678539', 'The Ren & Stimpy Show', 1991, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Kids, Family', 'John Kricfalusi, Bob Camp', null, 'Billy West', 'TV-Y7', 'Ren and Stimpy are a mismatch made in animation heaven with nothing in common but a life-long friendship and an incredible knack for getting into trouble. Join them in their bizarre and gross world for some outlandish situations coupled with hilarious jokes.', 'Ren and Stimpy are a mismatch made in animation heaven with nothing in common but a life-long friendship and an incredible knack for getting into trouble. Join them in their bizarre and gross world for some outlandish situations coupled with hilarious jokes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4plB7fMf1xob12ui7kpgnO3h4tJ.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:504'),
  ('728209296654455187', 'The Repair Shop', 2017, 'Reality', null, null, 'Dean Westmoreland, Chris Shaw, Will Kirk, Sonnaz Nooranvary, David Burville, Rebecca Bissonnet, Charlotte Abbott', 'TV-PG', 'The Repair Shop is a workshop of dreams, where broken or damaged cherished family heirlooms are brought back to life. Furniture restorers, horologists, metal workers, ceramicists, upholsterers and all manner of skilled craftsmen and women have been brought together to work in one extraordinary space, restoring much-loved possessions to their former glory.', 'The Repair Shop is a workshop of dreams, where broken or damaged cherished family heirlooms are brought back to life. Furniture restorers, horologists, metal workers, ceramicists, upholsterers and all manner of skilled craftsmen and women have been brought together to work in one extraordinary space, restoring much-loved possessions to their former glory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4YjXfhJmwCWWqoHWiPSNkoMPZHd.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:78075'),
  ('984106075545490279', 'The Replacement', 2017, 'Drama', 'Joe Ahearne', 'Joe Ahearne', 'Morven Christie, Vicky McClure, Richard Rankin, Neve McIntosh, Navin Chowdhry, Kim Allan, Gilly Gilchrist, Siobhan Redmond', 'NR', 'A woman who goes on maternity leave becomes increasingly paranoid about the motives of the person covering for her.', 'A woman who goes on maternity leave becomes increasingly paranoid about the motives of the person covering for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vtNE4SiJ0lN340XIUaNJ0UIZ3y4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70514'),
  ('1046377365075487561', 'The Replacements', 2006, 'Animation, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family, Comedy', 'Dan Santat', null, 'Grey DeLisle, Nancy Cartwright, Daran Norris, David McCallum, Kath Soucie, Jeff Bennett, Candi Milo', 'TV-G', 'Two orphans, Riley and little brother Todd, answer an ad for Fleemco Replacement People and order new parents, a spy mother and daredevil father. As Riley and Todd go on adventures (or misadventures as it were), they team up with Conrad Fleem to replace any adult in their lives that they don''t like, but they don''t get to choose the replacements and sometimes their good intentions don''t work out as they planned', 'Two orphans, Riley and little brother Todd, answer an ad for Fleemco Replacement People and order new parents, a spy mother and daredevil father. As Riley and Todd go on adventures (or misadventures as it were), they team up with Conrad Fleem to replace any adult in their lives that they don''t like, but they don''t get to choose the replacements and sometimes their good intentions don''t work out as they planned', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dEzojA3nQF5zhBGVRdx16EF8OZj.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:4627'),
  ('63055577707290575', 'The Republic', 1998, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, 'Turgut Özakman', 'Rutkay Aziz, Savaş Dinçel, Ayda Aksel, Dolunay Soysert, Macide Tanır, Çetin Tekindor, Tarık Ünlüoğlu, Tijen Par', null, 'This origin of the republic of Turkey. As İzmir celebrates victory, Latife Hanım’s admiration for Mustafa Kemal deepens while she hosts his mother, Zübeyde Hanım, in her home. Meanwhile, at Çankaya Mansion, the ailing Fikriye Hanım hides her worsening condition from Mustafa Kemal, only to be sent to a sanatorium as the War of Independence rages on.', 'This origin of the republic of Turkey. As İzmir celebrates victory, Latife Hanım’s admiration for Mustafa Kemal deepens while she hosts his mother, Zübeyde Hanım, in her home. Meanwhile, at Çankaya Mansion, the ailing Fikriye Hanım hides her worsening condition from Mustafa Kemal, only to be sent to a sanatorium as the War of Independence rages on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zuqIlBJtQxCtYMcdFUGgNSJmD36.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95405'),
  ('118684674651116279', 'The Republic of Sarah', 2021, 'Drama', null, null, 'Stella Baker, Nia Holloway, Luke Mitchell, Izabella Alvarez, Hope Lauren, Ian Duff, Forrest Goodluck', 'TV-14', 'Faced with the destruction of her town at the hands of a greedy mining company, rebellious high school teacher Sarah Cooper utilizes an obscure cartographical loophole to declare independence. Now Sarah must lead a young group of misfits as they attempt to start their own country from scratch.', 'Faced with the destruction of her town at the hands of a greedy mining company, rebellious high school teacher Sarah Cooper utilizes an obscure cartographical loophole to declare independence. Now Sarah must lead a young group of misfits as they attempt to start their own country from scratch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/egotOnlmUCFhEGdz1ifW1gzX6cY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114162'),
  ('507055364985710061', 'The Residence', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Paul William Davies', null, 'Uzo Aduba, Giancarlo Esposito, Molly Griggs, Ken Marino, Randall Park, Susan Kelechi Watson, Isiah Whitlock Jr., Jason Lee', 'TV-MA', 'A brilliant, eccentric detective must solve a murder in the White House residence — where the staff and guests at a state dinner are all suspects.', 'A brilliant, eccentric detective must solve a murder in the White House residence — where the staff and guests at a state dinner are all suspects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cJZbg425I9LF3SlJVQDOg4nJEvq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:242054'),
  ('170045770747943676', 'The Resident', 2018, 'Drama', 'Roshan Sethi, Amy Holden Jones, Hayley Schore', null, 'Matt Czuchry, Manish Dayal, Malcolm-Jamal Warner, Jessica Lucas, Bruce Greenwood, Anuja Joshi, Jane Leeves, Andrew McCarthy', 'TV-14', 'A tough, brilliant senior resident guides an idealistic young doctor through his first day, pulling back the curtain on what really happens, both good and bad, in modern-day medicine.', 'A tough, brilliant senior resident guides an idealistic young doctor through his first day, pulling back the curtain on what really happens, both good and bad, in modern-day medicine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2IkYQJlT26yXef2iot7dhRtavSC.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:74016'),
  ('363363050937576451', 'The Resort', 2022, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Andy Siara', null, 'William Jackson Harper, Cristin Milioti, Nick Offerman, Skyler Gisondo, Luis Gerardo Méndez, Nina Bloomgarden, Gabriela Cartol, Gisela Rosario Ramos', 'TV-MA', 'An anniversary trip puts a marriage to the test when a couple finds themselves embroiled in one of Yucatan''s most bizarre unsolved mysteries.', 'An anniversary trip puts a marriage to the test when a couple finds themselves embroiled in one of Yucatan''s most bizarre unsolved mysteries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6pHkt81gCdR3bw41xHyzsoQccrj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:194728'),
  ('429148578321850815', 'The Responder', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Tony Schumacher', null, 'Martin Freeman, Adelayo Adedayo, Emily Fairn, Romi Hyland-Rylands, Josh Finan, Mark Womack, Philip Shaun McGuinness, Faye McKeever', 'TV-MA', 'Under pressure, fraying at the edges. In relentless night-time Liverpool, copper Chris is paired with a rookie. Will they save or destroy each other?', 'Under pressure, fraying at the edges. In relentless night-time Liverpool, copper Chris is paired with a rookie. Will they save or destroy each other?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mU51EB4OSEL7oxMIub1Rl7N0xFB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:155346'),
  ('711829027075667045', 'The Restaurant', 2017, 'Drama', 'Ulf Kvensler, Malin Nevander, Johan Rosenlind', null, 'Hedda Stiernstedt, Charlie Gustafsson, Anna Bjelkerud, Adam Lundgren, Josefin Neldén, Suzanne Reuter, Peter Dalle, Malin Persson', 'TV-PG', 'Monday May 7, 1945 – the Second World War finally comes to an end and a new, brighter future beckons. In the midst of central Stockholm celebrations, two strangers come together with a quick kiss, parting company immediately after. Upper-class girl Nina and kitchen hand Calle don’t yet know that their brief encounter will come to have tumultuous consequences.', 'Monday May 7, 1945 – the Second World War finally comes to an end and a new, brighter future beckons. In the midst of central Stockholm celebrations, two strangers come together with a quick kiss, parting company immediately after. Upper-class girl Nina and kitchen hand Calle don’t yet know that their brief encounter will come to have tumultuous consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/niVbOhFPDXDUWwnuC6Unt6VN8Z.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:74731'),
  ('4285019463756478', 'The Restless Gun', 1957, 'Western', null, null, 'John Payne', 'TV-PG', 'The Restless Gun is an American western television series that appeared on NBC between 1957 and 1959, with John Payne in the role of Vint Bonner, a wandering cowboy in the era after the American Civil War. A skilled gunfighter, Bonner is an idealistic person who prefers peaceful resolutions of conflict wherever possible. He is gregarious, intelligent, and public-spirited. The half-hour black-and-white program aired seventy-eight episodes. Jeanne Bates appeared in varying roles with Payne in five episodes of The Restless Gun. The Restless Gun theme song begins: "I ride with the wind, my eyes on the sun, and my hand on my restless gun..." The song composer is probably Paul Dunlap, credited as the primary series composer, but could have been contributed to by either of the two other series composers, Dave Kahn and Stanley Wilson, also. Two versions are currently posted on YouTube, but neither posting lists any composer or performance credits.', 'The Restless Gun is an American western television series that appeared on NBC between 1957 and 1959, with John Payne in the role of Vint Bonner, a wandering cowboy in the era after the American Civil War. A skilled gunfighter, Bonner is an idealistic person who prefers peaceful resolutions of conflict wherever possible. He is gregarious, intelligent, and public-spirited. The half-hour black-and-white program aired seventy-eight episodes. Jeanne Bates appeared in varying roles with Payne in five episodes of The Restless Gun. The Restless Gun theme song begins: "I ride with the wind, my eyes on the sun, and my hand on my restless gun..." The song composer is probably Paul Dunlap, credited as the primary series composer, but could have been contributed to by either of the two other series composers, Dave Kahn and Stanley Wilson, also. Two versions are currently posted on YouTube, but neither posting lists any composer or performance credits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r9Kk7XVHhhjVfif4i6YYNFkvegM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:13537'),
  ('541651088810512051', 'The Resurrected', 2025, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Leste Chen, Hsu Chao-jen', 'Yang Shen, Shuaijie Yi, Xiaorui Luo', 'Shu Qi, Angelica Lee Sin-Jie, Fu Meng-po, Chung Hsin-ling, Alyssa Chia, Caitlin Fang, Suri Lin, Chu-Ping Liu', null, 'Two grieving mothers resurrect a scam ringleader to avenge their daughters — but as painful truths emerge, justice slips from their reach.', 'Two grieving mothers resurrect a scam ringleader to avenge their daughters — but as painful truths emerge, justice slips from their reach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1bJ4lSl2pSMpCFpIhhKeT7N34a.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:252135'),
  ('1019515223936060969', 'The Return', 2013, 'Drama, Soap', 'Valentina Párraga, José Ignacio Cabrujas, Julio César Mármol', null, 'Aracely Arámbula, Jorge Luis Pila, Christian Bach, Erika de la Rosa, Gonzalo García Vivanco, Aldo Gallardo, Christian de la Campa, Diego Soldano', 'NR', 'La Patrona is a Spanish-language telenovela produced by United States-based television network Telemundo Studios, Miami and Mexican Argos Comunicación. The telenovela is a remake of the Venezuelan telenovela La Dueña, written by José Ignacio Cabrujas. The name reflects a local term or slang in Mexico to address a person recognized as the main boss. However, the title is also a reflection of both the protagonist and the antagonist struggle to conquer power, authority and respect in a labor field traditionally deemed to be a man''s job.', 'La Patrona is a Spanish-language telenovela produced by United States-based television network Telemundo Studios, Miami and Mexican Argos Comunicación. The telenovela is a remake of the Venezuelan telenovela La Dueña, written by José Ignacio Cabrujas. The name reflects a local term or slang in Mexico to address a person recognized as the main boss. However, the title is also a reflection of both the protagonist and the antagonist struggle to conquer power, authority and respect in a labor field traditionally deemed to be a man''s job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sY5Uf3VQmxA3MVxSgdDrHQcKwCV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44914'),
  ('1139784014311012643', 'The Return Of Luk Siu Fung', 1986, null, 'Gu Long', null, 'Alex Man Chi-Leung, Rebecca Chan, Wong Wan-Choi, Mitra King Toi-Yam, Yung Wai-Man, Bobby Au-Yeung Tsan-Wah, Pak Yan, Austin Wai Tin-Chi', null, 'The Return of Luk Siu-fung is a 1986 Hong Kong television series adapted from Gu Long''s Lu Xiaofeng novel series. The series was first aired on TVB in Hong Kong in 1986.', 'The Return of Luk Siu-fung is a 1986 Hong Kong television series adapted from Gu Long''s Lu Xiaofeng novel series. The series was first aired on TVB in Hong Kong in 1986.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZ5P5aaBJNWU0aAIm0JP04dapFw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8333'),
  ('1125097616296198205', 'The Return of Superman', 2013, 'Reality', 'Park Ji-young, 奇河正, 徐宥真', null, 'Park Joo-ho, Park Ji-young, Park Na-eun, Park Soo-hong, Choi Ji-woo, An Young-mi', 'NR', 'An up-close look at celebrity dads who have to take care of their kids for the next 48 hours without any help. Will it be a dad-tastrophe, or can they finish their wives'' to-do lists while having fun with their kids?', 'An up-close look at celebrity dads who have to take care of their kids for the next 48 hours without any help. Will it be a dad-tastrophe, or can they finish their wives'' to-do lists while having fun with their kids?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjBx2RCnyyBPgu9qBV7j3UiXjeo.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:64356');
