  ('497031135751638083', 'The Return of the Condor Heroes', 1983, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, War & Politics', null, 'Wai Ka-Fai', 'Andy Lau, Idy Chan Yuk-Lin, Bryan Leung Kar-Yan, Susanna Au-Yeung Pui-San, Annie Liu On-Lai, Simon Yam, Isabella Wong, Lisa Lui Yau-Wai', null, 'The Return of the Condor Heroes is a Hong Kong television series adapted from Louis Cha''s novel of the same title. It was first broadcast on TVB Jade from 31 October 1983 to 6 January 1984 in Hong Kong.', 'The Return of the Condor Heroes is a Hong Kong television series adapted from Louis Cha''s novel of the same title. It was first broadcast on TVB Jade from 31 October 1983 to 6 January 1984 in Hong Kong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6I0eu1qFArRchIt7ds1VW1dCJXZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32152'),
  ('22059513494346496', 'The Return of the Condor Heroes', 1998, null, null, 'Edwin Chin', 'Richie Jen, Jacklyn Wu Chien-Lien, Sun Xing, Pat Ha Man-Jik, June Tsai, Chen Hong, Yue Yueli, Bryan Leung Kar-Yan', null, 'The Return of the Condor Heroes is a Taiwanese television series adapted from Louis Cha''s novel of the same title. It was first broadcast on TTV in 1998 in Taiwan.', 'The Return of the Condor Heroes is a Taiwanese television series adapted from Louis Cha''s novel of the same title. It was first broadcast on TTV in 1998 in Taiwan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/20yR52FgmGVKduSIDNYUzK3Cof0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:102968'),
  ('899621481846269806', 'The Return of the Condor Heroes', 2006, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Huang Xiaoming, Liu Yifei, Yang Mi, Wang Luoyong, Jessey Meng, Kong Lin, Chen Zihan, Zhao Liang', null, 'The Return of the Condor Heroes is a Chinese television series adapted from Louis Cha''s novel of the same title. It is the second installment of a trilogy produced by Zhang Jizhong, preceded by The Legend of the Condor Heroes and followed by The Heaven Sword and Dragon Saber. It was first broadcast on 17 March 2006 in China and subsequently broadcast in other Asian countries such as South Korea, Taiwan and Singapore.', 'The Return of the Condor Heroes is a Chinese television series adapted from Louis Cha''s novel of the same title. It is the second installment of a trilogy produced by Zhang Jizhong, preceded by The Legend of the Condor Heroes and followed by The Heaven Sword and Dragon Saber. It was first broadcast on 17 March 2006 in China and subsequently broadcast in other Asian countries such as South Korea, Taiwan and Singapore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zZYhsbRJpqjI6xd1sln42uyjQNa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3824'),
  ('697120870876800214', 'The Returned', 2012, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Fabrice Gobert', null, 'Anne Consigny, Frédéric Pierrot, Clotilde Hesme, Céline Sallette, Samir Guesmi, Guillaume Gouix, Jean-François Sivadier, Alix Poisson', 'TV-MA', 'In the shadow of an enormous hydraulic dam, the lives of the residents of a small French town are changed to their core when hundreds of previously dead relatives all return home on the same day.', 'In the shadow of an enormous hydraulic dam, the lives of the residents of a small French town are changed to their core when hundreds of previously dead relatives all return home on the same day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6B2UTMMU06GNzRgbDfaObuWFT6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:46616'),
  ('413916869545367853', 'The Returned', 2015, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Carlton Cuse', null, 'Kevin Alejandro, Mary Elizabeth Winstead, Agnes Bruckner, India Ennenga, Sandrine Holt, Sophie Lowe, Mark Pellegrino, Jeremy Sisto', 'TV-14', 'A small town that is turned upside down when several local people, who have long been presumed dead, suddenly reappear; their presence creates both positive and negative consequences. As families are reunited, the lives of those who were left behind are challenged both physically and emotionally.', 'A small town that is turned upside down when several local people, who have long been presumed dead, suddenly reappear; their presence creates both positive and negative consequences. As families are reunited, the lives of those who were left behind are challenged both physically and emotionally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cKp0ZDYGydWxI3v8KS3tY8W9aM7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62142'),
  ('988138744526135399', 'The Reunion', 2022, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Marston Bloom', null, 'Ioan Gruffudd, Ivanna Sakhno, Grégory Fitoussi, Dervla Kirwan, Vahina Giocante, Rupert Graves, Salome R. Gunnarsdottir, Cosimo Fusco', null, 'The story opens in the present day, at a high school reunion in the south of France where three former friends reconnect. They grew apart and lost touch, but they are still bound by a tragic secret tied to the disappearance of a high school girl who went missing 25 years ago in the region.', 'The story opens in the present day, at a high school reunion in the south of France where three former friends reconnect. They grew apart and lost touch, but they are still bound by a tragic secret tied to the disappearance of a high school girl who went missing 25 years ago in the region.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j1CXrWUTKStCJ3eBHD8Rh29Hqk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204539'),
  ('980827539763529905', 'The Rich and Lazarus', 2017, 'Drama, Family, Soap', 'Paula Richard', 'Camilo Pellegrini, Cristianne Fridman, Joaquim Assis', 'Dudu Azevedo, Igor Rickli, Milena Toscano, Gabriel Gracindo, Heitor Martinez, Adriana Garambone, Christine Fernandes, Sthefany Brito', null, 'After the death of Joshua, the Hebrew people begin to "go their own way", turning their backs on God and beginning to worship pagan gods. But when the prophet Jeremiah tries to warn them, his own people try to stone him, calling him a traitor and false prophet, but his prophecy is fulfilled with the arrival of King Nebuchadnezzar II and his wife Queen Amytis. And in another part of the story involves the love triangle involving Joana, Zac and Asher, who at the beginning of the novel were childhood friends, but over time the trio is growing and Zac and Asher fall in love with Joan, but she corresponds only to Asher.', 'After the death of Joshua, the Hebrew people begin to "go their own way", turning their backs on God and beginning to worship pagan gods. But when the prophet Jeremiah tries to warn them, his own people try to stone him, calling him a traitor and false prophet, but his prophecy is fulfilled with the arrival of King Nebuchadnezzar II and his wife Queen Amytis. And in another part of the story involves the love triangle involving Joana, Zac and Asher, who at the beginning of the novel were childhood friends, but over time the trio is growing and Zac and Asher fall in love with Joan, but she corresponds only to Asher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ehDO5edMGt32VPkMtSYalTqiShY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71611'),
  ('391625330031125422', 'The Richard Pryor Show', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Richard Pryor', null, 'Richard Pryor, Robin Williams, Sandra Bernhard, Charles Fleischer, Paul Mooney, Shirley Hemphill, Peter Cullen, Edie McClurg', null, 'The Richard Pryor Show is an American comedy variety series starring Richard Pryor. It premiered on NBC on Tuesday, September 13, 1977 at 8 p.m. opposite ABC''s popular television shows Laverne & Shirley and Happy Days. The show was produced by Rocco Urbisci for Burt Sugarman Productions. It was conceived out of a special that Pryor did for NBC in May 1977. Because the special was a major hit, both critically and commercially, Pryor was given a chance to host and star in his own television show. TV Guide included the series in their 2013 list of 60 shows that were "Cancelled Too Soon".', 'The Richard Pryor Show is an American comedy variety series starring Richard Pryor. It premiered on NBC on Tuesday, September 13, 1977 at 8 p.m. opposite ABC''s popular television shows Laverne & Shirley and Happy Days. The show was produced by Rocco Urbisci for Burt Sugarman Productions. It was conceived out of a special that Pryor did for NBC in May 1977. Because the special was a major hit, both critically and commercially, Pryor was given a chance to host and star in his own television show. TV Guide included the series in their 2013 list of 60 shows that were "Cancelled Too Soon".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2IBy0o8vXJMC6B9udLVLkrIvlUB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3488'),
  ('676777663974673389', 'The Riches', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Dmitry Lipkin', null, 'Eddie Izzard, Minnie Driver, Shannon Woodward, Noel Fisher, Aidan Mitchell, Todd Stashwick, Gregg Henry, Margo Martindale', 'TV-MA', 'A family of crooks assume the identity of an upper-middle-class suburban clan in the Deep South.', 'A family of crooks assume the identity of an upper-middle-class suburban clan in the Deep South.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8eyL7xBTVZeeqb9oDEADqHlNc2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2933'),
  ('1008808569432964773', 'The Richie Rich/Scooby-Doo Show and Scrappy Too!', 1980, 'Animation, Family, Kids, Mystery, Comedy', 'Joe Ruby, Ken Spears, Mark Evanier', null, 'Nancy Cartwright, Dick Beals, Casey Kasem, Don Messick, Frank Welker, Christian Hoff, Joan Gerber, Sparky Marcus', null, 'The Richie Rich/Scooby-Doo Show and Scrappy Too! is a package show produced by Hanna-Barbera Productions in 1980 for ABC Saturday mornings. The program contained segments from Scooby-Doo and Scrappy-Doo and Richie Rich. The Scooby-Doo and Scrappy-Doo shorts represents the sixth show in which Scooby-Doo appears. This was the only Hanna-Barbera package series for which Scooby-Doo was given second billing and also notable for Richie Rich''s debut in animation.', 'The Richie Rich/Scooby-Doo Show and Scrappy Too! is a package show produced by Hanna-Barbera Productions in 1980 for ABC Saturday mornings. The program contained segments from Scooby-Doo and Scrappy-Doo and Richie Rich. The Scooby-Doo and Scrappy-Doo shorts represents the sixth show in which Scooby-Doo appears. This was the only Hanna-Barbera package series for which Scooby-Doo was given second billing and also notable for Richie Rich''s debut in animation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BIaNz6xZc0u2H5ncbYmveVqDDS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1071'),
  ('1095265069498343532', 'The Ricky Gervais Show', 2010, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Ricky Gervais, Stephen Merchant', null, 'Stephen Merchant, Ricky Gervais, Karl Pilkington', 'TV-MA', 'The Ricky Gervais Show is an American cartoon series produced for and broadcast by HBO and Channel 4. The series is an animated version of the popular British audio podcasts and audiobooks of the same name, which feature Ricky Gervais and Stephen Merchant, along with colleague and friend Karl Pilkington, talking about various subjects behind the microphone. The TV show consists of past audio recordings of these unscripted "pointless conversations," with animation drawn in a style similar to classic era Hanna-Barbera cartoons, presenting jokes and situations in a literal context. The animated Ricky Gervais Show has aired 39 episodes across three seasons since it premiered in 2010. There were some plans for a possible fourth season which would have used newly recorded audio, but this was shelved in June 2012. Series 3 of The Ricky Gervais Show premiered on 20 April 2012 on HBO, and on 8 May 2012 on E4.', 'The Ricky Gervais Show is an American cartoon series produced for and broadcast by HBO and Channel 4. The series is an animated version of the popular British audio podcasts and audiobooks of the same name, which feature Ricky Gervais and Stephen Merchant, along with colleague and friend Karl Pilkington, talking about various subjects behind the microphone. The TV show consists of past audio recordings of these unscripted "pointless conversations," with animation drawn in a style similar to classic era Hanna-Barbera cartoons, presenting jokes and situations in a literal context. The animated Ricky Gervais Show has aired 39 episodes across three seasons since it premiered in 2010. There were some plans for a possible fourth season which would have used newly recorded audio, but this was shelved in June 2012. Series 3 of The Ricky Gervais Show premiered on 20 April 2012 on HBO, and on 8 May 2012 on E4.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/17pjo5C1TO6PxfEtMAZX31byHRN.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:35305'),
  ('474007902055450755', 'The Rifleman', 1958, 'Action & Adventure, Western, Family', 'Sam Peckinpah', null, 'Chuck Connors, Johnny Crawford, Paul Fix', 'TV-PG', 'The Rifleman is an American Western television program starring Chuck Connors as rancher Lucas McCain and Johnny Crawford as his son, Mark McCain. It was set in the 1880s in the town of North Fork, New Mexico Territory. The show was filmed in black-and-white, half-hour episodes. "The Rifleman" aired on ABC from September 30, 1958 to April 8, 1963 as a production of Four Star Television. It was one of the first prime time series to have a widowed parent raise a child.', 'The Rifleman is an American Western television program starring Chuck Connors as rancher Lucas McCain and Johnny Crawford as his son, Mark McCain. It was set in the 1880s in the town of North Fork, New Mexico Territory. The show was filmed in black-and-white, half-hour episodes. "The Rifleman" aired on ABC from September 30, 1958 to April 8, 1963 as a production of Four Star Television. It was one of the first prime time series to have a widowed parent raise a child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYf5Sc83chWG2nBlo5xKdpBBwlI.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:13859'),
  ('625503365093725027', 'The Rig', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'David Macpherson', null, 'Emily Hampshire, Iain Glen, Martin Compston, Rochenda Sandall, Owen Teale, Molly Vevers, Stuart McQuarrie, Alice Krige', 'TV-14', 'When the crew of the Kinloch Bravo find themselves cut off from all communication with the Scottish mainland by a mysterious fog, they must fight to find a way home whilst managing environmental pressures, mounting paranoia and rising tensions. But as the threat facing them reveals itself to be something beyond their wildest imagination, the divided crew must form an alliance to ensure survival.', 'When the crew of the Kinloch Bravo find themselves cut off from all communication with the Scottish mainland by a mysterious fog, they must fight to find a way home whilst managing environmental pressures, mounting paranoia and rising tensions. But as the threat facing them reveals itself to be something beyond their wildest imagination, the divided crew must form an alliance to ensure survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o8KxvfdpSVCP53d4S6a4DPHOqNh.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:112581'),
  ('1028952358259788535', 'The Right Stuff', 2020, 'Drama', 'Mark Lafferty', null, 'Jake McDorman, Patrick J. Adams, Colin O''Donoghue, Eloise Mumford, James Lafferty, Nora Zehetner, Eric Ladin, Patrick Fischler', 'TV-14', 'At the height of the Cold War, newly formed NASA selects seven of the military’s best test pilots to become astronauts. Competing to be the first in space, these men achieve the extraordinary, inspiring the world to turn towards a new horizon of ambition and hope.', 'At the height of the Cold War, newly formed NASA selects seven of the military’s best test pilots to become astronauts. Competing to be the first in space, these men achieve the extraordinary, inspiring the world to turn towards a new horizon of ambition and hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBmSygz6GfmDotQV57THjAOVnmU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93786'),
  ('964062636571714063', 'The Righteous Gemstones', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Danny McBride', null, 'Danny McBride, Adam Devine, Edi Patterson, John Goodman, Cassidy Freeman, Tony Cavalero, Tim Baltz, Skyler Gisondo', 'TV-MA', 'The story of a world-famous televangelist family with a history of deviance, greed and, yes, charitable work, all in the name of Jesus.', 'The story of a world-famous televangelist family with a history of deviance, greed and, yes, charitable work, all in the name of Jesus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bKb54fgtMrS54VMMl8KdDIFlG3g.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:82782'),
  ('930503420181947800', 'The Ripper', 2020, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Ellena Wood, Jesse Vile', null, 'Alan Whitehouse, Keith Hellawell, Bruce Jones, Jeremy Thompson, Christa Ackroyd', 'TV-MA', 'For five years, from 1975 to 1980, the Yorkshire Ripper murders cast a dark shadow over the lives of women in the North of England. 13 women were dead and the police seemed incapable of catching the killer. No one felt safe – and every man was a suspect.', 'For five years, from 1975 to 1980, the Yorkshire Ripper murders cast a dark shadow over the lives of women in the North of England. 13 women were dead and the police seemed incapable of catching the killer. No one felt safe – and every man was a suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sEgCNz0BMWTjuAVIGeK3PV5jIt6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113372'),
  ('624402555314994774', 'The Rise of Ning', 2024, 'Drama', null, null, 'Zhang Wanyi, Ren Min, Ci Sha, Dong Siyi, Wu Yuheng', null, 'Luo Yining, unbound by traditional formalities, frequently stood up for her downtrodden "Third Brother" Luo Shenyuan, discovering his hidden talents in the process. After heartbreak, she aimed for independence by starting a business. Luo Shenyuan, wrongfully accused, sought the truth about his mentor''s death. Grateful for Yining''s support, he helped her when her business faced difficulties, and their mutual understanding grew into love.', 'Luo Yining, unbound by traditional formalities, frequently stood up for her downtrodden "Third Brother" Luo Shenyuan, discovering his hidden talents in the process. After heartbreak, she aimed for independence by starting a business. Luo Shenyuan, wrongfully accused, sought the truth about his mentor''s death. Grateful for Yining''s support, he helped her when her business faced difficulties, and their mutual understanding grew into love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vksmquRtKRXu8Yq6BHI3m5ezSDq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:229036'),
  ('190696773049194104', 'The Rise of Phoenixes', 2018, 'Drama', null, null, 'Chen Kun, Ni Ni, Zhao Lixin, Ni Dahong, Yuan Hong, Bai Jingting, Zhang Xiaochen, Hou Yansong', 'TV-14', 'When a secret from the past rears its head, respected warrior Feng Zhiwei is forced to choose between revenge and her loyalty to ruling prince Ning Yi.', 'When a secret from the past rears its head, respected warrior Feng Zhiwei is forced to choose between revenge and her loyalty to ruling prince Ning Yi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oClpkfN2ath0GLZFstW1P7wMlan.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81667'),
  ('203469210618842068', 'The Rise of the Nazi Party', 2013, 'Documentary, War & Politics', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogkFS7AKlHBB1RJ1WTfqvpvS8Eu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82710'),
  ('909492909579441057', 'The Rising', 2022, 'Crime, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Sanne Nuyens, Bert Van Dael', null, 'Clara Rugaard, Matthew McNulty, Emily Taaffe, Nicholas Gleaves, Alex Lanipekun, William Ash, Robyn Cara, Solly McLeod', null, 'Neve Kelly is dead. She is stuck in limbo and must find out who killed her. This adaptation of the mystery series Beau Séjour impresses on account of its young cast and the breath-taking landscapes of England’s Lake District.', 'Neve Kelly is dead. She is stuck in limbo and must find out who killed her. This adaptation of the mystery series Beau Séjour impresses on account of its young cast and the breath-taking landscapes of England’s Lake District.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pg1jhu8jtue4PQjUtkT4UUXf0XW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:124477'),
  ('685536870313536248', 'The Rising of the Shield Hero', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Kaito Ishikawa, Asami Seto, Rina Hidaka', 'TV-14', 'Iwatani Naofumi, a run-of-the-mill otaku, finds a book in the library that summons him to another world. He is tasked with joining the sword, spear, and bow as one of the Four Cardinal Heroes and fighting the Waves of Catastrophe as the Shield Hero. Excited by the prospect of a grand adventure, Naofumi sets off with his party. However, merely a few days later, he is betrayed and loses all his money, dignity, and respect. Unable to trust anyone anymore, he employs a slave named Raphtalia and takes on the Waves and the world. But will he really find a way to overturn this desperate situation?', 'Iwatani Naofumi, a run-of-the-mill otaku, finds a book in the library that summons him to another world. He is tasked with joining the sword, spear, and bow as one of the Four Cardinal Heroes and fighting the Waves of Catastrophe as the Shield Hero. Excited by the prospect of a grand adventure, Naofumi sets off with his party. However, merely a few days later, he is betrayed and loses all his money, dignity, and respect. Unable to trust anyone anymore, he employs a slave named Raphtalia and takes on the Waves and the world. But will he really find a way to overturn this desperate situation?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjq2n0agGJfmZQ9NpbYIhuBofcq.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:83095'),
  ('887465525030915384', 'The Rivals of Sherlock Holmes', 1971, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Hugh Greene', null, null, 'TV-PG', 'An anthology series produced by Thames Television, comprised of short mystery, suspense or crime adaptations featuring, as the title suggests, detectives who were literary contemporaries of Arthur Conan Doyle''s Sherlock Holmes.', 'An anthology series produced by Thames Television, comprised of short mystery, suspense or crime adaptations featuring, as the title suggests, detectives who were literary contemporaries of Arthur Conan Doyle''s Sherlock Holmes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3sfRBSpBT6k5mEANa53T6hFg5lk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:12964'),
  ('667252398660268634', 'The River', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Michael R. Perry, Oren Peli', null, 'Bruce Greenwood, Joe Anderson, Leslie Hope, Eloise Mumford, Paul Blackthorne, Thomas Kretschmann, Daniel Zacapa, Shaun Parkes', 'TV-MA', 'Wildlife expert and TV personality Emmet Cole sets course around the world with his wife, Tess, and son, Lincoln, while filming what would become one of the most popular shows in television. After he goes missing deep in the Amazon, his family, friends and crew set out on a mysterious and deadly journey to find him.', 'Wildlife expert and TV personality Emmet Cole sets course around the world with his wife, Tess, and son, Lincoln, while filming what would become one of the most popular shows in television. After he goes missing deep in the Amazon, his family, friends and crew set out on a mysterious and deadly journey to find him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8gaGHgNLckAQMwGGFoHzCc92FGj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39336'),
  ('944502563121047958', 'The River', 2017, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Kristine Berg, Arne Berggren', 'Kristine Berg, Arne Berggren', 'Espen Reboli Bjerke, Ingeborg Raustøl, Thomas Hayes, Dennis Storhøi, Stig Henrik Hoff, Ánna Mággá Wigelius, Erik Smith-Meyer, John Sigurd Kristensen', null, 'A young girl playing by "Djupelv" finds the remains of a body. The family doesn''t want to get involved and calls in an anonymous tip, but the same day the girl runs away from home.', 'A young girl playing by "Djupelv" finds the remains of a body. The family doesn''t want to get involved and calls in an anonymous tip, but the same day the girl runs away from home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s26MAm41r6fTxwSXft5k1mQBKA9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70618'),
  ('91175248312716562', 'The Road to Calvary', 2017, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Sergey Koltakov, Anna Chipovskaya, Andrey Merzlikin, Yuliya Snigir, Aleksey Fokin, Anton Shagin, Svetlana Khodchenkova, Leonid Bichevin', null, 'Swept up in political unrest during World War I, two sisters in St. Petersburg cope with turbulent romances as Russian history is made around them.', 'Swept up in political unrest during World War I, two sisters in St. Petersburg cope with turbulent romances as Russian history is made around them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dvg4EzBBzCXabrWOzlwOCA3l61Q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82195'),
  ('546401379165978741', 'The Road to Love', 2019, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Katherine Escobar, Juan Manuel Restrepo, Mario Espitia, César Mora, Carmenza González', null, 'El camino al amor (Spanish: Los Briceños), [2] is a Colombian comedy soap opera produced by Juan Carlos Villamizar for Caracol Televisión. [1] Production for the series began in February 2019 and is recorded on 4K ultra-high-definition television. [1] The production was presented at the LA Screenings 2019, [3] and stars Katherine Escobar Farfán, Juan Manuel Restrepo, Mario Espitia, César Mora, Carmenza González, José Daniel Cristancho, Maria Laura Quintero and Toto Vega. [4] The way to love', 'El camino al amor (Spanish: Los Briceños), [2] is a Colombian comedy soap opera produced by Juan Carlos Villamizar for Caracol Televisión. [1] Production for the series began in February 2019 and is recorded on 4K ultra-high-definition television. [1] The production was presented at the LA Screenings 2019, [3] and stars Katherine Escobar Farfán, Juan Manuel Restrepo, Mario Espitia, César Mora, Carmenza González, José Daniel Cristancho, Maria Laura Quintero and Toto Vega. [4] The way to love', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q9cRILAWLff5A3NGGZ0OAbR1Fo0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96532'),
  ('631108434359187477', 'The Road to Ordinary', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Guo Qilin, Jin Chen, Yan Zidong, Zhu Zhu, Zhang Zixian, Kang Keren, Li Zheng, Niu Li', null, 'Four trainee lawyers at Rongke Law Firm navigate the challenges of their internship, balancing limited responsibilities with a commitment to justice. As they face workplace pressures and family struggles, guidance from senior partners helps them mature both professionally and personally.', 'Four trainee lawyers at Rongke Law Firm navigate the challenges of their internship, balancing limited responsibilities with a commitment to justice. As they face workplace pressures and family struggles, guidance from senior partners helps them mature both professionally and personally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/duygEuT0LW1DJ8bYCa8q6Jr9eNI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:225577'),
  ('531134191954866702', 'The Road to Red Restaurant List', 2020, 'Drama', null, null, 'Takayuki Hamatsu', null, 'Suda Tamio is an ordinary salaryman. He experiences various stress throughout his daily life. His only pleasure is to set out on trips to find "Zetsumeshi." Zetsumeshi refers to endangered meals, that may no longer exist in the future. While his wife Kanae and child go attend concerts by their favourite idol groups, he leaves home on Friday after work and returns home Saturday night.', 'Suda Tamio is an ordinary salaryman. He experiences various stress throughout his daily life. His only pleasure is to set out on trips to find "Zetsumeshi." Zetsumeshi refers to endangered meals, that may no longer exist in the future. While his wife Kanae and child go attend concerts by their favourite idol groups, he leaves home on Friday after work and returns home Saturday night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdOmK1hY1cDscPlJ6LhHJCn754D.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:101251'),
  ('758579474791669691', 'The Road Trip', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Beth O''Leary', 'Matilda Wnek, Ryan O’Sullivan, Phoebe Eclair-Powell', 'Emma Appleton, Laurie Davidson, David Jonsson, Isabella Laughland, Angus Imrie, Olaya Lopez, Adrià Escudero, Carlos Martín', null, 'On an epic road trip to a wedding in Spain with her sister Deb, Addie nearly collides with a speeding Porsche. Forced to give her ex, Dylan, and his best friend, Marcus, a lift, the gang are stuck on the most awkward road trip imaginable.', 'On an epic road trip to a wedding in Spain with her sister Deb, Addie nearly collides with a speeding Porsche. Forced to give her ex, Dylan, and his best friend, Marcus, a lift, the gang are stuck on the most awkward road trip imaginable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncKjneFlDSy9kWezDa4qoju0vz2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:275277'),
  ('1037798096789943118', 'The Roads Men Travel', 1976, 'Drama', null, 'Taichi Yamada', 'Koji Tsuruta, Kentarō Shimizu, Kayoko Kishimoto, Toshio Shiba', null, 'The series depicts the employees of a security company from different generations and backgrounds facing many difficult questions. It features a guard who survived a suicide mission during the war and his conflicts, rebellion, empathy and reconciliation with the younger generation born after the war.', 'The series depicts the employees of a security company from different generations and backgrounds facing many difficult questions. It features a guard who survived a suicide mission during the war and his conflicts, rebellion, empathy and reconciliation with the younger generation born after the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qcbOjil2u19A2IPZyiHFl8dIT0B.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:136833'),
  ('426571494098997081', 'The Rocketeer', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Family, Kids', 'Dave Stevens', null, 'Kitana Turnbull, Frank Welker, Maria Bamford, Billy Campbell, Kathy Najimy, Callan Farris, Kari Wahlgren, Mark L. Taylor', 'TV-Y', 'Kit Secord receives a surprise package on her birthday revealing that she''s next in line to become the Rocketeer, a legendary superhero who has the ability to fly with the help of a rocket-powered jet pack. Armed with her cool new gear and secret identity, Kit is ready to take flight and save the day with her gadget-minded best friend, Tesh, and airplane-mechanic uncle, Ambrose, who join her on epic adventures.', 'Kit Secord receives a surprise package on her birthday revealing that she''s next in line to become the Rocketeer, a legendary superhero who has the ability to fly with the help of a rocket-powered jet pack. Armed with her cool new gear and secret identity, Kit is ready to take flight and save the day with her gadget-minded best friend, Tesh, and airplane-mechanic uncle, Ambrose, who join her on epic adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jtXnWs7zOyde3VYEvz9eDWGPvZ7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95543'),
  ('598628873736631587', 'The Rockford Files', 1974, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Stephen J. Cannell, Roy Huggins', null, 'James Garner, Noah Beery Jr.', 'TV-PG', 'Cranky but likable L.A. PI Jim Rockford pulls no punches (but takes plenty of them). An ex-con sent to the slammer for a crime he didn''t commit, Rockford takes on cases others don''t want, aided by his tough old man, his lawyer girlfriend and some shady associates from his past.', 'Cranky but likable L.A. PI Jim Rockford pulls no punches (but takes plenty of them). An ex-con sent to the slammer for a crime he didn''t commit, Rockford takes on cases others don''t want, aided by his tough old man, his lawyer girlfriend and some shady associates from his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fniHEsTeqHMg41GlCYJxZVgtn7H.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:954'),
  ('270525243525154991', 'The Rogues', 1964, 'Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Ben Roberts, Ivan Goff', null, 'David Niven, Charles Boyer, Robert Coote, Gig Young, Gladys Cooper', null, 'The Rogues is an American television series that appeared on NBC from September 13, 1964, to April 18, 1965, starring David Niven, Charles Boyer, and Gig Young as a related trio of former conmen who could, for the right price, be persuaded to trick a very wealthy and heinously unscrupulous mark. Although it won the 1964 Golden Globe award for Best Television Series, the show was cancelled after one season consisting of thirty episodes.', 'The Rogues is an American television series that appeared on NBC from September 13, 1964, to April 18, 1965, starring David Niven, Charles Boyer, and Gig Young as a related trio of former conmen who could, for the right price, be persuaded to trick a very wealthy and heinously unscrupulous mark. Although it won the 1964 Golden Globe award for Best Television Series, the show was cancelled after one season consisting of thirty episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vD5RmiY9qIwWU5MqLoAMHoGrZnh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13489'),
  ('36171500731428873', 'The Rolling Girls', 2015, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tomokazu Seki, Rina Hidaka, Risa Taneda, Ayumi Fujimura, Ari Ozawa, Sayaka Ohara, Fuyuka Ono, Nozomi Furuki', 'TV-14', 'In a dystopian future where Japan''s political organization has crumbled after the Great Tokyo War, Japan is broken up into 10 independent nations, with each nation controlled by a gang led by a "Best," a human-proclaimed prophet with destructive superpowers. Nozomi Moritomo is a "Rest"—a normal girl that has just started out as a rookie in the local gang. She wants to help the Best Masami Utoku, her childhood friend and role model, in the ongoing territorial dispute. When Masami becomes severely injured and unable to fight, Nozomi decides to go on a mission to complete the requests sent to Masami from all over Japan. Along the way, she meets Yukina Kosaka, a shy girl with no sense of direction; Ai Hibiki, an upbeat girl who loves eating; and Chiaya Misono, a quiet and mysterious girl that wears a gas mask. Together, the four girls travel all over the country on their motorcycles while getting involved in territorial wars, disagreements, and even suspicious conspiracies.', 'In a dystopian future where Japan''s political organization has crumbled after the Great Tokyo War, Japan is broken up into 10 independent nations, with each nation controlled by a gang led by a "Best," a human-proclaimed prophet with destructive superpowers. Nozomi Moritomo is a "Rest"—a normal girl that has just started out as a rookie in the local gang. She wants to help the Best Masami Utoku, her childhood friend and role model, in the ongoing territorial dispute. When Masami becomes severely injured and unable to fight, Nozomi decides to go on a mission to complete the requests sent to Masami from all over Japan. Along the way, she meets Yukina Kosaka, a shy girl with no sense of direction; Ai Hibiki, an upbeat girl who loves eating; and Chiaya Misono, a quiet and mysterious girl that wears a gas mask. Together, the four girls travel all over the country on their motorcycles while getting involved in territorial wars, disagreements, and even suspicious conspiracies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QuzoUebSW3xu6F40tYOb70rODt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70634'),
  ('699058484481488067', 'The Romance of Hua Rong', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Li Nan, Xiao Zhi Yao', 'Yuan Hao, Zhao Zhaoyi, Wang Zexuan, Guan Xin, Mao Na, Yu Kaining, Huang Qianshuo, Dai Yi', null, 'Hua Rong, daughter of a general, accidentally becomes the wife of the pirate king Qin Shangcheng. However on the night of their wedding Hua Luo escaped. Qin Shangcheng is determined to hunt her down.', 'Hua Rong, daughter of a general, accidentally becomes the wife of the pirate king Qin Shangcheng. However on the night of their wedding Hua Luo escaped. Qin Shangcheng is determined to hunt her down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPWqoMzP8RBSBWOOxaGvdkUmoPN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:96562'),
  ('649157997069326240', 'The Romance of the Condor Heroes', 2014, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Chen Xiao, Michelle Chen Yan-Hsi, Mao Xiaotong, Elvis Han, Zong Fengyan, Yang Rong, Zhao Yingzi, Viann Zhang Xinyu', null, 'While escaping from a tortured experience under Quan Zhen Sect''s Zhao Zhi Jing, the trouble-maker Yang Guo meets the girl who will become his martial arts master and eventually the love of his life: Xiao Long Nu. Their story moves along filled with adventures, betrayal, and love. This is the newest version of Jin Yong''s "Return of the Condor Heroes" by the famous director Yu Zheng. Sequel to The Legend of Condor Heroes and a prequel of sorts to The Heavenly Sword and Dragon Sabre. The story concerns the adventures of Yang Guo, an orphaned boy in a mid-13th Century China.', 'While escaping from a tortured experience under Quan Zhen Sect''s Zhao Zhi Jing, the trouble-maker Yang Guo meets the girl who will become his martial arts master and eventually the love of his life: Xiao Long Nu. Their story moves along filled with adventures, betrayal, and love. This is the newest version of Jin Yong''s "Return of the Condor Heroes" by the famous director Yu Zheng. Sequel to The Legend of Condor Heroes and a prequel of sorts to The Heavenly Sword and Dragon Sabre. The story concerns the adventures of Yang Guo, an orphaned boy in a mid-13th Century China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hrfqpadWj3UKaz0u0uSsnwajUEK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68871'),
  ('96093456210220815', 'The Romance Of Three Kingdoms', 1994, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Wang Fulin', 'Jiafu Du, Liu Shusheng, Yi-bo Li', null, 'NR', 'Adapted from the classical 14th century novel of the same title by Luo Guanzhong, Romance of the Three Kingdoms is part historical, part legend, and part mythical – romanticises and dramatises the lives of feudal lords and their retainers, who tried to replace the dwindling Han dynasty or restore it. The focus is mainly on the three power blocs that emerged from the remnants of the Han dynasty, and would eventually form the three states of Cao Wei, Shu Han, and Eastern Wu.', 'Adapted from the classical 14th century novel of the same title by Luo Guanzhong, Romance of the Three Kingdoms is part historical, part legend, and part mythical – romanticises and dramatises the lives of feudal lords and their retainers, who tried to replace the dwindling Han dynasty or restore it. The focus is mainly on the three power blocs that emerged from the remnants of the Han dynasty, and would eventually form the three states of Cao Wei, Shu Han, and Eastern Wu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ex6DcbKNim993aFjEasrU1fIMXT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72645'),
  ('181517899879858401', 'The Romance of Tiger and Rose', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Nan Zhen', 'Zhao Lusi, Ding Yuxi, Sheng Yinghao, Zhou Zixin, Zhao Xin, Patrick Quan, Chen Minghao, Wei Xiao', null, 'Chen Xiaoqian, a struggling screenwriter suddenly finds herself trapped inside her own script as the Third Princess of Dongliang, a female-led kingdom. With her character caught between an arranged engagement to the noble Pei Heng and a forbidden love for Prince Han Shuo of a rival nation, Xiaoqian must rewrite her fate to survive—and discover what love truly means.', 'Chen Xiaoqian, a struggling screenwriter suddenly finds herself trapped inside her own script as the Third Princess of Dongliang, a female-led kingdom. With her character caught between an arranged engagement to the noble Pei Heng and a forbidden love for Prince Han Shuo of a rival nation, Xiaoqian must rewrite her fate to survive—and discover what love truly means.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mCsidkxf6ji8e71T07dYff3FjCF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103635'),
  ('943077098419264801', 'The Romanoffs', 2018, 'Drama', 'Matthew Weiner', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'An anthology series centered around people who believe themselves to be the modern-day descendants of the Romanov family.', 'An anthology series centered around people who believe themselves to be the modern-day descendants of the Romanov family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/chZjmnJhKt9nliQy7gvwIPp7QQm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73607'),
  ('512619037002856646', 'The Romantics', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Smriti Mundhra', 'Smriti Mundhra, Michael T. Vollmann', 'Yash Chopra, Aditya Chopra, Uday Chopra, Pamela Chopra, Amitabh Bachchan, Shah Rukh Khan, Kajol, Rani Mukerji', 'TV-14', 'Featuring archival footage and in-depth celebrity interviews, this docuseries celebrates the life and the legacy of Bollywood filmmaking titan Yash Chopra and his studio.', 'Featuring archival footage and in-depth celebrity interviews, this docuseries celebrates the life and the legacy of Bollywood filmmaking titan Yash Chopra and his studio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hOBiDTcHsZBqZYYTAuC9oSJUNKf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:219819'),
  ('941485397553630448', 'The Romeo Section', 2015, 'Crime, Drama', 'Chris Haddock, Stephen Surjik, Anne Wheeler', null, 'Sophia Lauchlin Hirt, Stephanie Bennett, Eugene Lipinski, Mathias Retamal, Manny Jacinto', 'TV-14', 'Set in Vancouver, THE ROMEO SECTION is an hour-long serialized espionage drama following spymaster Professor Wolfgang McGee, an academic who secretly manages a roster of espionage assets. These assets, referred to as Romeo or Juliet spies, are informants engaged in intimate long or short term relations with state intelligence targets. Wolfgang is a semi-retired Romeo operator, having worked his way up from youth in an unnamed and officially deniable “service” under the umbrella of Canada’s Intelligence Community.', 'Set in Vancouver, THE ROMEO SECTION is an hour-long serialized espionage drama following spymaster Professor Wolfgang McGee, an academic who secretly manages a roster of espionage assets. These assets, referred to as Romeo or Juliet spies, are informants engaged in intimate long or short term relations with state intelligence targets. Wolfgang is a semi-retired Romeo operator, having worked his way up from youth in an unnamed and officially deniable “service” under the umbrella of Canada’s Intelligence Community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfA3g9heW6as73Dd2Qn5M3SDXtC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:64166'),
  ('577825288732624726', 'The Rook', 2019, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Emma Greenwell, Joely Richardson, Olivia Munn, Adrian Lester, Jon Fletcher, Catherine Steadman, Ronan Raftery, Aidan O''Callaghan', 'TV-MA', 'After waking in a park with total amnesia — and surrounded by dead bodies, all wearing latex gloves — a young woman must fight to uncover her past, and resume her position at the head of Britain’s most secret (supernatural) service before the traitors who stole her memory can finish what they started.', 'After waking in a park with total amnesia — and surrounded by dead bodies, all wearing latex gloves — a young woman must fight to uncover her past, and resume her position at the head of Britain’s most secret (supernatural) service before the traitors who stole her memory can finish what they started.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wwAy8PF5fx1ttY5T4pltL2vxNgs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79272'),
  ('1000456639426921943', 'The Rookie', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Alexi Hawley', null, 'Nathan Fillion, Melissa O''Neil, Eric Winter, Alyssa Diaz, Mekia Cox, Richard T. Jones, Shawn Ashmore, Jenna Dewan', 'TV-14', 'Starting over isn''t easy, especially for small-town guy John Nolan who, after a life-altering incident, is pursuing his dream of being an LAPD officer. As the force''s oldest rookie, he''s met with skepticism from some higher-ups who see him as just a walking midlife crisis.', 'Starting over isn''t easy, especially for small-town guy John Nolan who, after a life-altering incident, is pursuing his dream of being an LAPD officer. As the force''s oldest rookie, he''s met with skepticism from some higher-ups who see him as just a walking midlife crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/70kTz0OmjjZe7zHvIDrq2iKW7PJ.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:79744'),
  ('331008982840660065', 'The Rookie: Feds', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Terence Paul Winter, Alexi Hawley', 'Nick Hurwitz, Amanda Mercedes', 'Niecy Nash, Felix Solis, James Lesure, Britt Robertson, Kevin Zegers, Frankie Faison, Devika Bhise', 'TV-14', 'Special Agent Simone Clark, the oldest rookie in the FBI, is a force of nature, the living embodiment of a dream deferred – and she works together with her new colleagues at the Los Angeles office of the Bureau to bring down the country’s toughest criminals.', 'Special Agent Simone Clark, the oldest rookie in the FBI, is a force of nature, the living embodiment of a dream deferred – and she works together with her new colleagues at the Los Angeles office of the Bureau to bring down the country’s toughest criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttqpW20UVabyy8DQFWe56ov1JHS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:201992'),
  ('789766356554120949', 'The Rookies', 1972, 'Drama, Crime', 'Rita Lakin', null, 'Georg Stanford Brown, Sam Melville, Bruce Fairbairn, Kate Jackson, Gerald S. O''Loughlin', null, 'The Rookies is an American crime drama series that aired on ABC from 1972 until 1976. It follows the exploits of three rookie police officers working in an unidentified city for the fictitious Southern California Police Department.', 'The Rookies is an American crime drama series that aired on ABC from 1972 until 1976. It follows the exploits of three rookie police officers working in an unidentified city for the fictitious Southern California Police Department.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aprq6E5NO2GiBwKwjFop7kOGiO1.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:988'),
  ('976257738164073006', 'The Roosevelts: An Intimate History', 2014, 'Documentary, History, War & Politics', 'Ken Burns', 'Geoffrey C. Ward, Ken Burns', 'Peter Coyote, David McCullough, Meryl Streep, Edward Herrmann, Paul Giamatti, Theodore Roosevelt, Doris Kearns Goodwin, Franklin D. Roosevelt', 'TV-PG', 'Chronicles the lives of Theodore, Franklin and Eleanor Roosevelt, three members of the most prominent and influential family in American politics. It is the first time in a major documentary television series that their individual stories have been interwoven into a single narrative. This seven-part, fourteen hour film follows the Roosevelts for more than a century, from Theodore’s birth in 1858 to Eleanor’s death in 1962.', 'Chronicles the lives of Theodore, Franklin and Eleanor Roosevelt, three members of the most prominent and influential family in American politics. It is the first time in a major documentary television series that their individual stories have been interwoven into a single narrative. This seven-part, fourteen hour film follows the Roosevelts for more than a century, from Theodore’s birth in 1858 to Eleanor’s death in 1962.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihcY2Kf8ytjhoSTddH3G1asVDOw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65646'),
  ('507152880139072726', 'The Rope', 2022, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Éric Forestier, Dominique Rocher', 'Dominique Rocher, Éric Forestier', 'Planitia Kenese, Suzanne Clément, Jean-Marc Barr, Christa Théret, Tom Mercier, Richard Sammel, Jakob Cedergren, Gilles Vandeweerd', 'TV-MA', 'A team of scientists face a test of faith and survival when they discover a mysterious rope in the middle of a forest, in this riveting French mini-series.', 'A team of scientists face a test of faith and survival when they discover a mysterious rope in the middle of a forest, in this riveting French mini-series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yVGpBeSbBlFZI0mvG7EhkvqafWN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:133280'),
  ('493667578108721021', 'The Ropers', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Don Nicholl, Michael Ross, Bernie West', null, 'Norman Fell, Audra Lindley, Jeffrey Tambor, Patty McCormack, Evan Cohen', 'TV-PG', 'A spin-off of Three''s Company and based on the British sitcom George and Mildred, the series focuses on middle-aged couple Stanley and Helen Roper, who were landlords to Jack, Janet, and Chrissy on Three''s Company.', 'A spin-off of Three''s Company and based on the British sitcom George and Mildred, the series focuses on middle-aged couple Stanley and Helen Roper, who were landlords to Jack, Janet, and Chrissy on Three''s Company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tmKtdtAHrYlJkWLgh79yj9FSnPE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2905'),
  ('443248521875469713', 'The Rose and the Thorn', 2004, 'Family, Drama, War & Politics', 'Çağan Irmak, Tomris Giritlioğlu', 'Sertaç Ergin', 'Selda Alkor, Kenan Bal, Özge Özberk, Mehmet Ali Nuroğlu, Melisa Sözen, Işıl Yücesoy, Şerif Sezer, Goncagül Sunar', null, 'Events occurred in Turkey in late seventies and early eighties.', 'Events occurred in Turkey in late seventies and early eighties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fEDcnROWnMQw7pwhrYbgpHt1Jni.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:49527'),
  ('712968705580444921', 'The Rose of Versailles', 1979, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Reiko Tajima, Miyuki Ueda, Tarō Shigaki, Nachi Nozawa, Rihoko Yoshida, Yoneko Matsukane, Yoshito Yasuhara, Keaton Yamada', 'NR', 'Raised from birth as a man, the Lady Oscar commands the palace guards at Versailles in the years before the French Revolution. Her beauty and noble spirit make her a shining figure in the eyes of both men and women but she is torn between her chosen life of service and duty to class and country and her own heart and desires. She lives as a noble amidst the opulence of Versailles but her keen senses and compassion are not blinded to the poverty of the French people.', 'Raised from birth as a man, the Lady Oscar commands the palace guards at Versailles in the years before the French Revolution. Her beauty and noble spirit make her a shining figure in the eyes of both men and women but she is torn between her chosen life of service and duty to class and country and her own heart and desires. She lives as a noble amidst the opulence of Versailles but her keen senses and compassion are not blinded to the poverty of the French people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/stv9ZmIELR1gVIoa5ZuomEbHFqd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32676'),
  ('754252913602739875', 'The Rosie O''Donnell Show', 1996, 'Talk, Family, Comedy', 'Rosie O''Donnell', null, 'Rosie O''Donnell, John McDaniel, Ray Marchica, Tracy Wormworth, Morris Goldberg, Rodney Jones', 'TV-G', 'The Rosie O''Donnell Show was an American daytime television talk show hosted and produced by actress and comedian Rosie O''Donnell. It aired for six seasons from 1996 to 2002. Topics often discussed on the show include Broadway, children, extended families and charitable works, people and organizations. The show was based out of Studio 8G at NBC''s Rockefeller Center studios in New York City, NY, USA and was produced and syndicated by KidRo Productions, Telepictures Productions and Warner Bros. Television.', 'The Rosie O''Donnell Show was an American daytime television talk show hosted and produced by actress and comedian Rosie O''Donnell. It aired for six seasons from 1996 to 2002. Topics often discussed on the show include Broadway, children, extended families and charitable works, people and organizations. The show was based out of Studio 8G at NBC''s Rockefeller Center studios in New York City, NY, USA and was produced and syndicated by KidRo Productions, Telepictures Productions and Warner Bros. Television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHHSx7kyLEHK48Y3LO3sNfclOT2.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:1503'),
  ('812720582881903499', 'The Rosie Show', 2011, 'Talk', null, null, 'Rosie O''Donnell', null, 'The Rosie Show is an American evening television talk show starring and produced by actress, comedian, and Emmy Award-winning talk show host Rosie O''Donnell.', 'The Rosie Show is an American evening television talk show starring and produced by actress, comedian, and Emmy Award-winning talk show host Rosie O''Donnell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9OR3nitwNbaTg9LHJDZbacvr2T5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:41528'),
  ('476508585829308917', 'The Rough Ride', 1985, 'Drama', 'Yau Kar-Hung', null, 'Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Barbara Yung, Ray Lui, Ha Yue, Kwan Hoi-San, Lau Siu-Ming, Susanna Au-Yeung Pui-San, Barbara Chan', null, 'The Rough Ride is a TVB television series, premiered in 1985. Theme song "Me and You, He and Me" composition and arrangement by Joseph Koo, lyricist by Wong Jim, sung by Anita Mui.', 'The Rough Ride is a TVB television series, premiered in 1985. Theme song "Me and You, He and Me" composition and arrangement by Joseph Koo, lyricist by Wong Jim, sung by Anita Mui.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rQy7ZBjxSTJZAUGg2EGVWN4RUc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109889'),
  ('738341781554950759', 'The Royal House of Windsor', 2017, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Elizabeth II of the United Kingdom, Prince Philip, Duke of Edinburgh, King Charles III of the United Kingdom, Diana, Princess of Wales, Camilla Shand, William, Prince of Wales, Prince Harry, Duke of Sussex, King George VI of the United Kingdom', 'TV-14', 'Drawing on newly available evidence, this epic series explores the Windsor dynasty''s gripping family saga, providing fresh insights into how our royal family have survived four generations of crisis.', 'Drawing on newly available evidence, this epic series explores the Windsor dynasty''s gripping family saga, providing fresh insights into how our royal family have survived four generations of crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/43UHdaOtj4MgU8mfsbaxY8xXckk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74308'),
  ('992190555541854236', 'The Royal Swordsmen', 2005, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Li Yapeng, Roger Kwok Chun-On, Tammy Chen, Wallace Huo, Michelle Ye Xuan, Gao Yuanyuan, Deng Chao, Damian Lau Chung-Yan', null, 'Set in the Ming dynasty, the series follows Zhu Wushi, tasked with forming a secret service to protect the Emperor. He recruits four elite agents—Duan Tianya, a skilled martial artist; Shangguan Haitang, an intelligent and resourceful woman; Guihai Yidao, a master of the dao seeking vengeance; and Cheng Shifei, a former thief with powerful inherited skills. Locked in a rivalry with the Eastern Depot led by eunuch Cao Zhengchun, the agents work to protect the monarchy while uncovering deeper conspiracies. As Zhu Wushi’s true ambitions unfold, the agents must confront betrayal and save the Emperor.', 'Set in the Ming dynasty, the series follows Zhu Wushi, tasked with forming a secret service to protect the Emperor. He recruits four elite agents—Duan Tianya, a skilled martial artist; Shangguan Haitang, an intelligent and resourceful woman; Guihai Yidao, a master of the dao seeking vengeance; and Cheng Shifei, a former thief with powerful inherited skills. Locked in a rivalry with the Eastern Depot led by eunuch Cao Zhengchun, the agents work to protect the monarchy while uncovering deeper conspiracies. As Zhu Wushi’s true ambitions unfold, the agents must confront betrayal and save the Emperor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQwctUzlT1mikcq8mcDOyoC42Mr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:55448'),
  ('334024401062833263', 'The Royal Tutor', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Keisuke Ueda, Yūya Asato, Yuuto Adachi, Daisuke Hirose, Shouta Aoi, Daisuke Namikawa, Shinnosuke Tachibana, Toshiyuki Morikawa', 'TV-PG', 'Heine Wittgenstein is a pint-sized man given a monumental task. He''s recently hired by the King of Grannzreich to whip four of his five sons into royalty material as their tutor. At first glance, the princes have all the allure and refinement Heine would expect but underneath their manicured exteriors are four potentially terrible tyrants.', 'Heine Wittgenstein is a pint-sized man given a monumental task. He''s recently hired by the King of Grannzreich to whip four of his five sons into royalty material as their tutor. At first glance, the princes have all the allure and refinement Heine would expect but underneath their manicured exteriors are four potentially terrible tyrants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bo8eP8Bx9WRlLGPsJGaNk7rGkkL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71008'),
  ('996795486850415611', 'The Royals', 2015, 'Drama', 'Mark Schwahn', null, 'Elizabeth Hurley, William Moseley, Alexandra Park, Tom Austen, Victoria Ekanoye, Hatty Preston', 'TV-14', 'Drama about a fictional British Royal family set in modern day London, who inhabit a world of opulence and regal tradition that caters to any and every desire, but one that also comes with a price tag of duty, destiny and intense public scrutiny.', 'Drama about a fictional British Royal family set in modern day London, who inhabit a world of opulence and regal tradition that caters to any and every desire, but one that also comes with a price tag of duty, destiny and intense public scrutiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2nexpqqf0CUedCyiVAJQz9QCrp1.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:62137'),
  ('8483769487785375', 'The Royals', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ishita Pritish Nandy, Rangita Pritish Nandy', 'Neha Veena Sharma, Vishnu Sinha, Iti Agarwal', 'Bhumi Pednekar, Ishaan Khatter, Sakshi Tanwar, Vihaan Samat, Udit Arora, Lisa Mishra, Sumukhi Suresh, Kavya Trehan', 'TV-MA', 'When charming Prince Aviraaj meets Sophia, a self-made girl boss, the worlds of royalty and startups collide in a whirlwind of romance and ambition.', 'When charming Prince Aviraaj meets Sophia, a self-made girl boss, the worlds of royalty and startups collide in a whirlwind of romance and ambition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nnD4364ToXZwDpFWEnY94xzykIs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:261545'),
  ('1053617613893719902', 'The Royle Family', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Craig Cash, Caroline Aherne', 'Phil Mealey', 'Ricky Tomlinson, Sue Johnston, Caroline Aherne, Craig Cash, Ralf Little', 'TV-PG', 'The Royle Family is a British sitcom created by Caroline Aherne and Craig Cash, and produced by Granada Television for BBC Two (series 1) and BBC One (series 2 and 3). It centres on the lives of a television-fixated Manchester family, the Royles, comprising lazy patriarch Jim, his hard-working wife Barbara, their entitled daughter Denise, their put-upon son Antony, and Denise''s lad fiancé–later husband–David.', 'The Royle Family is a British sitcom created by Caroline Aherne and Craig Cash, and produced by Granada Television for BBC Two (series 1) and BBC One (series 2 and 3). It centres on the lives of a television-fixated Manchester family, the Royles, comprising lazy patriarch Jim, his hard-working wife Barbara, their entitled daughter Denise, their put-upon son Antony, and Denise''s lad fiancé–later husband–David.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bx0JJyMiMnYJdCtryxQCrRe2aen.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:4388'),
  ('75097638488615920', 'The Ruff and Reddy Show', 1957, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Daws Butler, Don Messick', null, 'The Ruff and Reddy Show is a Hanna-Barbera animated series starring Ruff, a straight and smart cat voiced by Don Messick, and Reddy, a dumb and stupid dog voiced by Daws Butler. First broadcast in December 1957 on NBC, it was the first television show produced by Hanna-Barbera and presented by Screen Gems, the television arm of Columbia Pictures.', 'The Ruff and Reddy Show is a Hanna-Barbera animated series starring Ruff, a straight and smart cat voiced by Don Messick, and Reddy, a dumb and stupid dog voiced by Daws Butler. First broadcast in December 1957 on NBC, it was the first television show produced by Hanna-Barbera and presented by Screen Gems, the television arm of Columbia Pictures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2dj9Vvy689ZYNQQ85X2Iq3WpoXo.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:12519'),
  ('955986092101889778', 'The Runarounds', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Jonas Pate', null, 'William Lipton, Axel Ellis, Jeremy Yun, Zendé Murdock, Jesse Golliher, Lilah Pate, Maximo Salas, Kelley Pereira', 'TV-14', 'Follow a tight-knit group of young adults from all walks of life who come together to form a rock band the summer after graduating from high school. Set against the backdrop of Wilmington, North Carolina, The Runarounds must choose between succumbing to the pressures of real life or risking everything to become the greatest band of all time.', 'Follow a tight-knit group of young adults from all walks of life who come together to form a rock band the summer after graduating from high school. Set against the backdrop of Wilmington, North Carolina, The Runarounds must choose between succumbing to the pressures of real life or risking everything to become the greatest band of all time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/653V492dSynzQcSDPubzZLJAjkf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:248833'),
  ('618952350479658552', 'The Runaway', 2011, 'Drama', null, 'Allan Cubitt', 'Joanna Vanderham, Jack O''Connell, Keith Allen, Ken Stott, Kierston Wareing, Burn Gorman, Alan Cumming, Max Irons', null, 'Childhood friends Cathy Connor and Eamonn Docherty were brought up together in the heart of gangland East London. Separated by violent circumstances their lives take strikingly different directions until they meet again as adults.', 'Childhood friends Cathy Connor and Eamonn Docherty were brought up together in the heart of gangland East London. Separated by violent circumstances their lives take strikingly different directions until they meet again as adults.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QhMvJduYKwfZJX7oDsppK8nqr0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39145'),
  ('259723950334860171', 'The Russell Howard Hour', 2017, 'Comedy, Talk', null, 'Russell Howard', 'Russell Howard', null, 'Russell Howard offers his unique take on the week''s news and current affairs, picking through the biggest UK and international stories, and offering a wise and worldly view on the globe''s news. Along the way, he''ll welcome celebrity guests and leading experts, as well as hear from fledgling global correspondents. Plus, there will be stand-up, too, as Russell showcases some of the comedy scene''s finest and most exciting stars.', 'Russell Howard offers his unique take on the week''s news and current affairs, picking through the biggest UK and international stories, and offering a wise and worldly view on the globe''s news. Along the way, he''ll welcome celebrity guests and leading experts, as well as hear from fledgling global correspondents. Plus, there will be stand-up, too, as Russell showcases some of the comedy scene''s finest and most exciting stars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhhZyhYgLU79jx7mXlnv9kPmxWu.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:74239'),
  ('42768863135210892', 'The Ruth Rendell Mysteries', 1987, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Ruth Rendell', null, 'George Baker, Christopher Ravenscroft, Louie Ramsay, Diane Keen', 'TV-14', 'The Ruth Rendell mysteries is a British television series made by TVS and Meridian Television for ITV between 2 August 1987 and 11 October 2000.', 'The Ruth Rendell mysteries is a British television series made by TVS and Meridian Television for ITV between 2 August 1987 and 11 October 2000.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y9wIBLSOOBwGCiEbfMNIeRjGOzM.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:12188'),
  ('974408268440439723', 'The Ryuo''s Work is Never Done!', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Rina Hidaka, Yuma Uchida, Ayane Sakura, Ayaka Suwa, Ai Kayano, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Toshihiko Seki, Hisako Kanemoto', null, 'The story is about a teenage boy who happens to be a shougi master. One day, a nine-year-old girl turns up at his house, requesting to be taken as his disciple. From there, all kinds of wacky hijinks ensue.', 'The story is about a teenage boy who happens to be a shougi master. One day, a nine-year-old girl turns up at his house, requesting to be taken as his disciple. From there, all kinds of wacky hijinks ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lbHY3xFcffIQddcldG9WaEVWWhn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76141'),
  ('325816432331234998', 'The Saboteur', 2004, 'War & Politics, Drama', null, null, 'Aleksey Bardukov, Vladislav Galkin, Kirill Pletnyov, Andrey Krasko, Mikhail Efremov, Aleksandr Lykov, Vladimir Menshov, Renata Litvinova', null, '1942. Young men, graduates of a reconnaissance school, develop and carry out extremely complex operations behind enemy lines.', '1942. Young men, graduates of a reconnaissance school, develop and carry out extremely complex operations behind enemy lines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eUfQZdIdjKpnvFhpYzGhd0AECPe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72880'),
