  ('447925502194784010', 'The Saboteurs', 2015, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Per-Olav Sørensen, Petter Rosenlund', null, 'Eirik Evjen, Anna Friel, Mads Sjøgård Pettersen, Andreas Döhler, Robert Hunger-Bühler, Tobias Santelmann, Dennis Storhøi, Christian Rubeck', 'TV-14', 'When the Nazis secure a heavy water plant to realize their plan to create an atomic bomb, the Norwegian Allies struggle to sabotage the operation.', 'When the Nazis secure a heavy water plant to realize their plan to create an atomic bomb, the Norwegian Allies struggle to sabotage the operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/suKrjsnOV6BGufvWYWXN8ZaLtAt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61836'),
  ('320241669634283449', 'The Sacketts', 1979, 'Western', 'Louis L''Amour', null, 'Sam Elliott, Tom Selleck, Jeff Osterhage, Glenn Ford, Ben Johnson, Gilbert Roland, John Vernon, Ruth Roman', null, 'A traditional sagebrush saga based on two novels ("Sackett" and "The Daybreakers") by Louis L''Amour. It focuses on the three Sackett brothers in New Mexico after the Civil War, seeking their fortunes, avenging a family killing, driving cattle, and fighting for law and order.', 'A traditional sagebrush saga based on two novels ("Sackett" and "The Daybreakers") by Louis L''Amour. It focuses on the three Sackett brothers in New Mexico after the Civil War, seeking their fortunes, avenging a family killing, driving cattle, and fighting for law and order.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofw3BWHJIvRXTfpkdVlcrluAGHL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:23259'),
  ('781923022366215174', 'The Sacred Blacksmith', 2009, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Miura Isao', null, 'Aki Toyosaki, Ayumi Fujimura, Megumi Toyoguchi, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Hideki Tasaka, Hideyuki Umezu, Hinako Sasaki, Hochu Otsuka', 'TV-MA', 'Cecily''s a blushing knight in shining armor. Unfortunately, it seems most battles end with her as the damsel in distress. Her lack of skill and distaste for violence make her an unlikely heroine - until the brooding blacksmith Luke comes to her aid, using his powerful magic to forge blades of supernatural strength. Cecily wields this sacred steel and charges forth to face a dangerous new threat. A cloaked fiend is unleashing demons upon the land, and though he lurks in shadows, the villain is much closer than Cecily can imagine.', 'Cecily''s a blushing knight in shining armor. Unfortunately, it seems most battles end with her as the damsel in distress. Her lack of skill and distaste for violence make her an unlikely heroine - until the brooding blacksmith Luke comes to her aid, using his powerful magic to forge blades of supernatural strength. Cecily wields this sacred steel and charges forth to face a dangerous new threat. A cloaked fiend is unleashing demons upon the land, and though he lurks in shadows, the villain is much closer than Cecily can imagine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8u8G9sYg4oXXwCBaRBEwECwsNb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:36134'),
  ('23913982814698766', 'The Saddle Club', 2001, 'Family, Drama', 'Sarah Dodd', 'Sarah Dodd', 'Briony Behets, Marny Kennedy, Ariel Kaplan, Connor Jessup, Kaiya Jones, Richard Davies, Viktoria Kampbell, Lauren Dixon', 'TV-Y', 'The Saddle Club is a children''s television series based on the books written by Bonnie Bryant Like the book series, the scripted live action series follows the lives of three teenage girls in training to compete in equestrian competitions at the fictional Pine Hollow Stables, while dealing with problems in their personal lives. Throughout the series, The Saddle Club navigates their rivalry with Veronica, training for competitions, horse shows, and the quotidian dramas that arise between friends and staff in the fictional Pine Hollow Stables. In each show, The Saddle Club prevails over its adversities, usually sending a message emphasizing the importance of friendship and teamwork.', 'The Saddle Club is a children''s television series based on the books written by Bonnie Bryant Like the book series, the scripted live action series follows the lives of three teenage girls in training to compete in equestrian competitions at the fictional Pine Hollow Stables, while dealing with problems in their personal lives. Throughout the series, The Saddle Club navigates their rivalry with Veronica, training for competitions, horse shows, and the quotidian dramas that arise between friends and staff in the fictional Pine Hollow Stables. In each show, The Saddle Club prevails over its adversities, usually sending a message emphasizing the importance of friendship and teamwork.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vq0UMUB1EZLe9dDduC92YpdeymT.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:38848'),
  ('107513912525321871', 'The Saint', 1962, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Leslie Charteris', null, 'Roger Moore', 'TV-PG', 'Simon Templar is The Saint, a handsome, sophisticated, debonair, modern-day Robin Hood who recovers ill-gotten wealth and redistributes it to those in need.', 'Simon Templar is The Saint, a handsome, sophisticated, debonair, modern-day Robin Hood who recovers ill-gotten wealth and redistributes it to those in need.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwNVpAJkE4Gu1jv922IH7GOQlen.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:4333'),
  ('722991032357235304', 'The Saint''s Magic Power Is Omnipotent', 2021, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yui Ishikawa, Takahiro Sakurai, Takuya Eguchi, Yusuke Kobayashi, Taku Yashiro, Kana Ichinose, Reina Ueda, Yuuichirou Umehara', 'TV-14', 'Sei, a 20-year-old office worker, is whisked away to a whole new world. Unfortunately for Sei, the ritual that summoned her—meant to produce a "Saint" who would banish the dark magic—brought two people over instead of one. And everyone prefers the second girl over Sei?! But this is just fine by Sei, who leaves the royal palace to set up shop making potions and cosmetics with her newfound magic. Business is booming, and this might not be such a bad life, after all...as long as her supposed Sainthood doesn''t come back to haunt her.', 'Sei, a 20-year-old office worker, is whisked away to a whole new world. Unfortunately for Sei, the ritual that summoned her—meant to produce a "Saint" who would banish the dark magic—brought two people over instead of one. And everyone prefers the second girl over Sei?! But this is just fine by Sei, who leaves the royal palace to set up shop making potions and cosmetics with her newfound magic. Business is booming, and this might not be such a bad life, after all...as long as her supposed Sainthood doesn''t come back to haunt her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mPbvla7nfhpfILvJhmbeKGpVYwu.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:115236'),
  ('610665699291687359', 'The Salisbury Poisonings', 2020, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', null, 'Declan Lawn, Adam Patterson', 'Anne-Marie Duff, Rafe Spall, MyAnna Buring, Judah Cousin, Annabel Scholey, Sophia Ally, Johnny Harris, Nigel Lindsay', 'TV-14', 'In March 2018 Salisbury became the site of an unprecedented national emergency. This three-part dramatisation focuses on the extraordinary heroism shown by the local community.', 'In March 2018 Salisbury became the site of an unprecedented national emergency. This three-part dramatisation focuses on the extraordinary heroism shown by the local community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80CObOtHNCdROSPuPNfETW4OOyA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:104647'),
  ('766251910603940612', 'The Same Sky', 2017, 'War & Politics, Drama', 'Paula Milne', 'Paula Milne', 'Tom Schilling, Sofia Helin, Ben Becker, Hannes Wegener, Uwe Preuss, Friederike Becht, Anja Kling, Daniel Krejčík', null, 'Cold War, the seventies. Lars is a Romeo agent from East Germany: he must go to the West side and seduce and spy on Western women who work in government or defense institutions.', 'Cold War, the seventies. Lars is a Romeo agent from East Germany: he must go to the West side and seduce and spy on Western women who work in government or defense institutions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tv4C38mC21bmEjl09D1jTf6aZjW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68498'),
  ('1070713793686018009', 'The Sandbaggers', 1978, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Ian Mackintosh', null, 'Roy Marsden, Ray Lonnen, Michael Cashman, Dennis Burgess, Sue Holderness', null, 'The Sandbaggers is a British television drama series about men and women on the front lines of the Cold War. Set contemporaneously with its original broadcast on ITV in 1978 and 1980, The Sandbaggers examines the effect of the espionage game on the personal and professional lives of British and American intelligence specialists.', 'The Sandbaggers is a British television drama series about men and women on the front lines of the Cold War. Set contemporaneously with its original broadcast on ITV in 1978 and 1980, The Sandbaggers examines the effect of the espionage game on the personal and professional lives of British and American intelligence specialists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogtTW2USCPwlWL8u9LFug4j77qw.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:11975'),
  ('734517695109919455', 'The Sandhamn Murders', 2010, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Viveca Sten', null, 'Alexandra Rapaport, Nicolai Cleve Broch, Jonas Malmsjö, Anton Lundqvist, Julius Fleischanderl, Camila Bejarano Wahlgren', 'TV-14', 'Viveca Stens popular novels come to life in "The Sandhamn Murders", a perfect mix of Nordic crime & the beautiful surroundings of the outer Stockholm archipelago.', 'Viveca Stens popular novels come to life in "The Sandhamn Murders", a perfect mix of Nordic crime & the beautiful surroundings of the outer Stockholm archipelago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lncpOcNcP4cxTaH0MkyQERRwJZz.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:55270'),
  ('695131653767756598', 'The Sandman', 2022, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Neil Gaiman, Allan Heinberg, David S. Goyer', null, 'Tom Sturridge, Vivienne Acheampong, Patton Oswalt', 'TV-MA', 'After years of imprisonment, Morpheus — the King of Dreams — embarks on a journey across worlds to find what was stolen from him and restore his power.', 'After years of imprisonment, Morpheus — the King of Dreams — embarks on a journey across worlds to find what was stolen from him and restore his power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q54qEgagGOYCq5D1903eBVMNkbo.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:90802'),
  ('467461072259649769', 'The Santa Clauses', 2022, 'Comedy, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jack Burditt', null, 'Tim Allen, Elizabeth Mitchell, Austin Kane, Elizabeth Allen-Dick, Devin Bright, Matilda Lawler, Gabriel Iglesias, Eric Stonestreet', 'TV-PG', 'After nearly three decades of being Santa Claus, Scott Calvin’s magic begins to falter. As he struggles to keep up with the demands of the job, he discovers a new clause that forces him to rethink his role as Santa and as a father.', 'After nearly three decades of being Santa Claus, Scott Calvin’s magic begins to falter. As he struggles to keep up with the demands of the job, he discovers a new clause that forces him to rethink his role as Santa and as a father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fWTQBoKfGdn6n2UaD7TQp9WxeHO.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:155631'),
  ('695803898060299675', 'The Sarah Jane Adventures', 2007, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Russell T Davies', null, 'Elisabeth Sladen, Alexander Armstrong, Daniel Anthony, Anjli Mohindra, Sinead Michael', null, 'Sarah Jane Smith is a truly remarkable woman who inhabits a world of mystery, danger and wonder; a world where aliens are commonplace and the Earth is under constant threat. A world that Maria Jackson, a seemingly ordinary girl, can only dream of – until she moves in next door. Nothing will ever be ordinary again.', 'Sarah Jane Smith is a truly remarkable woman who inhabits a world of mystery, danger and wonder; a world where aliens are commonplace and the Earth is under constant threat. A world that Maria Jackson, a seemingly ordinary girl, can only dream of – until she moves in next door. Nothing will ever be ordinary again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hq0S1VtUabnORdp3l3m11OA67BP.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:203'),
  ('232843994969422479', 'The Sarah Silverman Program.', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Rob Schrab, Dan Harmon, Sarah Silverman', null, 'Sarah Silverman, Laura Silverman, Jay Johnston, Brian Posehn, Steve Agee', null, 'Sarah Silverman plays a character named Sarah Silverman, whose absurd daily life unfolds in scripted scenes and songs. With her sister and her gay neighbors by her side, Sarah always manages to fall into unique, unsettling and downright weird predicaments.', 'Sarah Silverman plays a character named Sarah Silverman, whose absurd daily life unfolds in scripted scenes and songs. With her sister and her gay neighbors by her side, Sarah always manages to fall into unique, unsettling and downright weird predicaments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNDxMDBSbUNK4PtioCC9uZmAPg0.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:901'),
  ('883456322562956912', 'The Scent of Passion', 2021, 'Soap', 'Adriana Suarez', null, 'Luis Eduardo Motoa, María Teresa Barreto, William Levy, Laura Londoño, Carmen Villalobos, Diego Cadavid, Juan David Agudelo, Katherine Vélez', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ztyJqTdS7RApGgl6ZXmFdGZX3g0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:124124'),
  ('28892238345609791', 'The Scholar Who Walks the Night', 2015, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Lee Joon-gi, Lee Yu-bi, MAX Changmin, Lee Soo-hyuk, Kim So-eun, Jang Hee-jin, Lee Soon-jae, Choi Tae-hwan', null, 'When Jo Yang Sun is driven out of house and home after her father is framed for a crime, she is forced to crossdress in order to make ends meet as a bookseller, where she meets Kim Sung Yeol, a handsome, but mysterious scholar who is actually a vampire. Meanwhile, an evil presence at the royal palace stops at nothing to keep the Crown Prince from claiming his rightful throne.', 'When Jo Yang Sun is driven out of house and home after her father is framed for a crime, she is forced to crossdress in order to make ends meet as a bookseller, where she meets Kim Sung Yeol, a handsome, but mysterious scholar who is actually a vampire. Meanwhile, an evil presence at the royal palace stops at nothing to keep the Crown Prince from claiming his rightful throne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/115598hfMYGkUtPwA5p95gntKaC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63106'),
  ('341775548375469227', 'The School for Scandal', 2002, 'Talk', 'Yuriy Bogomolov', null, 'Avdotya Smirnova, Tatyana Tolstaya', null, 'A talk show', 'A talk show', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Zu5gDQFREbqN6ztEXHTs3s4MND.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:70132'),
  ('70129850240297330', 'The School Nurse Files', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Lee Kyoung-mi, Chung Se-rang', null, 'Jung Yu-mi, Nam Joo-hyuk, Hyun Woo-seok, Park Hae-eun, Kwon Ji-woo, Park Se-jin, Shim Dal-gi, Lee Suk-hyeong', 'TV-14', 'Wielding a light-up sword through the dark corners of a high school, a nurse with an unusual gift protects students from monsters only she can see.', 'Wielding a light-up sword through the dark corners of a high school, a nurse with an unusual gift protects students from monsters only she can see.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lR8WZYdNEcG6pmhddC04yfjOHte.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87313'),
  ('1130025859985099593', 'The Scooby-Doo/Dynomutt Hour', 1976, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Mystery', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Henry Corden, Allan Melvin, Casey Kasem, Julie McWhirter, Micky Dolenz, Don Messick, Gary Owens, Virginia Gregg', 'TV-Y7', 'The Scooby-Doo/Dynomutt Hour is a 60-minute package show produced by Hanna-Barbera Productions in 1976 for ABC Saturday mornings. It marked the first new installments of the cowardly canine since 1973, and contained the following segments: The Scooby-Doo Show and Dynomutt, Dog Wonder.', 'The Scooby-Doo/Dynomutt Hour is a 60-minute package show produced by Hanna-Barbera Productions in 1976 for ABC Saturday mornings. It marked the first new installments of the cowardly canine since 1973, and contained the following segments: The Scooby-Doo Show and Dynomutt, Dog Wonder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7w13OFlmt6QPFEVxqs6eJwGXAZR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2150'),
  ('5911164147205828', 'The Scooby, Scrappy & Yabba-Doo Show', 1982, 'Animation, Comedy, Mystery, Family', null, null, 'Frank Welker, Casey Kasem, Don Messick, Heather North', null, 'Scooby & Scrappy-Doo: Scooby-Doo, Scrappy-Doo and Shaggy travel across the country as the "Fearless Detective Agency" and get involved in typical spy or criminal cases. Scrappy & Yabba-Doo: Scrappy-Doo partakes in adventures with his uncle Yabba-Doo and Deputy Dusty in the wild west. They would often deal with various bad guys, which always ended with the bad guys apprehended in the end.', 'Scooby & Scrappy-Doo: Scooby-Doo, Scrappy-Doo and Shaggy travel across the country as the "Fearless Detective Agency" and get involved in typical spy or criminal cases. Scrappy & Yabba-Doo: Scrappy-Doo partakes in adventures with his uncle Yabba-Doo and Deputy Dusty in the wild west. They would often deal with various bad guys, which always ended with the bad guys apprehended in the end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sFQbNHjrOe2tHw6R07wsEeMUK4i.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12978'),
  ('920035163643161388', 'The Sea Beyond', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', 'Cristiana Farina', null, 'Carmine Recano, Nicolas Maupas, Massimiliano Caiazzo, Valentina Romani, Artem Tkachuk, Matteo Paolillo, Antonio De Matteo, Vincenzo Ferrera', 'NR', 'Naples. Still an organized crime stronghold. For the inmates at the Juvenile Detention Centre, time and space are interrupted. Taken away from their families and friends, they now have the opportunity to understand who they have been, who they are, who they want to be.', 'Naples. Still an organized crime stronghold. For the inmates at the Juvenile Detention Centre, time and space are interrupted. Taken away from their families and friends, they now have the opportunity to understand who they have been, who they are, who they want to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ApBEhgv4jE7K7RdpawLCLLtlJd.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:110283'),
  ('956912656402087699', 'The Sea Wolf', 1971, 'Action & Adventure', 'Jack London', null, 'Raimund Harmstorf, Edward Meeks, Beatrice Cardon, Emmerich Schäffer, Sergiu Nicolaescu, Dieter Schidor, Peter De Kock, Sandu Popa', null, 'Writer Humphrey van Weyden is thrown overboard in a shipwreck in the Bay of San Francisco, and is rescued by the seal-hunting schooner ''Ghost'' under the command of the brutal Captain Wolf Larsen.', 'Writer Humphrey van Weyden is thrown overboard in a shipwreck in the Bay of San Francisco, and is rescued by the seal-hunting schooner ''Ghost'' under the command of the brutal Captain Wolf Larsen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSrBO9HhzfKDbTQtFchsAtq3U5D.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69490'),
  ('442944459555391964', 'The Search', 2020, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Santiago Limón', 'Fabián Archondo, Silvia Jiménez, Santiago Limón', 'Regina Blandón, Dario Yazbek Bernal, Diana Bovio, Adrián Ladrón, Verónica Bravo, Alejandro Calva, Memo Villegas, Edmundo Vargas', null, 'When a girl vanishes from a suburb near Mexico City, the personal goals of some involved in the case muddy the search. Based on a true story.', 'When a girl vanishes from a suburb near Mexico City, the personal goals of some involved in the case muddy the search. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kHfbT8U8W9exQWYW49h3aVFdReA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:18712'),
  ('996694187760792711', 'The Seasons', 1987, 'Drama', null, null, 'Chu Shui-Tong, Tang Pik-Wan, Lo Hoi-Pang, Angelina Lo, Samuel Kwok Fung, Johnny Ngan Kwok-Leung, Meg Lam Kin-Ming, Gallen Lo Ka-Leung', null, 'The Seasons was a 389 episode drama series that was shown during Enjoy Yourself Tonight on Hong Kong TV station TVB from 1987 to 1988. The show, being a section of the main program, Enjoy Yourself Tonight, meant that it was only 15 minutes long, a rarity in Hong Kong television drama programs. Another rarity is that each episode ends in the same shot: a flower being tossed into the water.', 'The Seasons was a 389 episode drama series that was shown during Enjoy Yourself Tonight on Hong Kong TV station TVB from 1987 to 1988. The show, being a section of the main program, Enjoy Yourself Tonight, meant that it was only 15 minutes long, a rarity in Hong Kong television drama programs. Another rarity is that each episode ends in the same shot: a flower being tossed into the water.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z6WBeqlRVSvqgyPz1we4FHMVcIL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:6972'),
