  ('1134768228160716075', 'The Twilight Zone', 2019, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Drama', 'Simon Kinberg, Jordan Peele, Rod Serling', null, 'Jordan Peele', 'TV-MA', 'Tales of science fiction, fantasy and the occult, exploring humanity''s hopes, despairs, prides and prejudices in metaphoric ways. Next stop ahead The Twilight Zone.', 'Tales of science fiction, fantasy and the occult, exploring humanity''s hopes, despairs, prides and prejudices in metaphoric ways. Next stop ahead The Twilight Zone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aEuzZqJTEH9E4JwQyv8JtuCu22B.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:83135'),
  ('563842758414103316', 'The Twisted Tale of Amanda Knox', 2025, 'Drama', 'K.J. Steinberg', null, 'Grace Van Patten, Sharon Horgan, Francesco Acquaroli, Giuseppe De Domenico, John Hoogenakker, Roberta Mattei, Joe Lanza, Anna van Patten', 'TV-MA', 'Amanda Knox arrives in Italy for her study abroad only to be wrongfully imprisoned for murder weeks later. Follow Knox''s relentless fight to prove her innocence and reclaim her freedom and examines why authorities and the world stood so firmly in judgment.', 'Amanda Knox arrives in Italy for her study abroad only to be wrongfully imprisoned for murder weeks later. Follow Knox''s relentless fight to prove her innocence and reclaim her freedom and examines why authorities and the world stood so firmly in judgment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udxkpbqBsVS4Hnrfn4HabDKKxb5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:248416'),
  ('900169890993954677', 'The Twisted Tales of Felix the Cat', 1995, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Kids', null, null, 'Charlie Adler, E. G. Daily, John Astin, Nancy Cartwright, Susan Silo, Cam Clarke, Ben Diskin, Gilbert Gottfried', 'NR', 'The Twisted Tales of Felix the Cat is an American animated television series produced by Film Roman. the series first aired on September 16, 1995 on CBS Saturday mornings lasting for two seasons with the final episode airing on April 12, 1997. The first season consists of 13 episodes and the second and final season consists of 8 episodes.', 'The Twisted Tales of Felix the Cat is an American animated television series produced by Film Roman. the series first aired on September 16, 1995 on CBS Saturday mornings lasting for two seasons with the final episode airing on April 12, 1997. The first season consists of 13 episodes and the second and final season consists of 8 episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1tb6Rr01HCSGjOCs72BGKryNDwX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:11187'),
  ('217965041593831302', 'The Two Ronnies', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Ronnie Corbett, Ronnie Barker', 'Ronnie Barker', 'Ronnie Corbett, Ronnie Barker', 'NR', 'The Two Ronnies is a British sketch show which aired on BBC1 from 1971 to 1987. It featured the double act of Ronnie Barker and Ronnie Corbett, the "Two Ronnies" of the title.', 'The Two Ronnies is a British sketch show which aired on BBC1 from 1971 to 1987. It featured the double act of Ronnie Barker and Ronnie Corbett, the "Two Ronnies" of the title.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCutyxw1DYJnakREFDyO52EBe3J.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:2690'),
  ('241810609169731055', 'The Two Sisters', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', null, 'Kim Kyeong-hee, Jin Yu-ri', 'Lee So-yeon, Ha Yeon-joo, Oh Chang-seok, Jang Se-hyun, Park Sin-woo, Jung Chan, Yoo Ji-yeon, Yang Hye-jin', null, 'A tragic story about young sisters who part ways after their parent''s divorce but reunite once again as mother and daughter-in-law in the whirlwind of fate, ending up in catastrophe after desire and conflict.', 'A tragic story about young sisters who part ways after their parent''s divorce but reunite once again as mother and daughter-in-law in the whirlwind of fate, ending up in catastrophe after desire and conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1StP2NmPGjzhIvMIQyTvZfweUu2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241384'),
  ('853967315730928358', 'The Typist', 2018, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'Iris Berben, Moritz Bleibtreu, Peter Kurth, Zoe Moore, Mišel Matičević, Katharina Schlothauer, Timur Isik, Johannes Krisch', null, 'Freya Becker is a typist with the homicide division of the Berlin police. Freya’s daughter, Marie, disappeared 11 years ago without a trace, and Freya is determined to uncover the truth, whatever the cost.', 'Freya Becker is a typist with the homicide division of the Berlin police. Freya’s daughter, Marie, disappeared 11 years ago without a trace, and Freya is determined to uncover the truth, whatever the cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9PsDDxNAfBxupQ1fI4tuvHuBM9P.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74898'),
  ('1009751956695218202', 'The Tyra Banks Show', 2005, 'Talk', 'Tyra Banks', null, 'Tyra Banks', null, 'The Tyra Banks Show, also known as and shortened to Tyra or The Tyra Show, is an American talk show hosted by Tyra Banks. The last new episode aired on Friday, May 28, 2010. The show featured many special guest stars which include Mike Epps, Cheryl Tiegs, Miley Cyrus, LL Cool J, Rihanna, Michael Rapaport, and Robbi Morgan.', 'The Tyra Banks Show, also known as and shortened to Tyra or The Tyra Show, is an American talk show hosted by Tyra Banks. The last new episode aired on Friday, May 28, 2010. The show featured many special guest stars which include Mike Epps, Cheryl Tiegs, Miley Cyrus, LL Cool J, Rihanna, Michael Rapaport, and Robbi Morgan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/du7W8UdGmqpqUUCZdOGGZNmD6uS.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2156'),
  ('604275543985708243', 'The Tyrant', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Park Hoon-jung', null, 'Cha Seung-won, Kim Seon-ho, Kim Kang-woo, Jo Yoon-soo, Moo Jin-sung, Kim Ju-hun, Lee Ki-young, Jo Yong-geun', 'TV-MA', 'A secret project in Korea is exposed to the US so the project gets scrapped and the sample is to be handed over when a delivery accident occurs. Director Choe tries to hide the sample as Paul searches, but they end up at the same place as Jagyeong and Lim Sang. Who will seize the sample in the end?', 'A secret project in Korea is exposed to the US so the project gets scrapped and the sample is to be handed over when a delivery accident occurs. Director Choe tries to hide the sample as Paul searches, but they end up at the same place as Jagyeong and Lim Sang. Who will seize the sample in the end?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xgAZRY9swQYRkj3waCZeBDBCkuj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:246748'),
  ('404723173270676328', 'The Tyrant Falls in Love', 2010, 'Drama, Animation, Comedy', 'Hinako Takanaga', null, 'Hikaru Midorikawa, Daisuke Hirakawa, Kouki Miyata, Tomokazu Sugita', null, 'A first year doctorate student in the agricultural science department at a university in Nagoya. Extremely hot-headed and violent, he has a reputation of being a tyrant to other students at the University and is not very social in result. After almost being raped by a gay professor and other bad experiences with homosexual men, he becomes extremely homophobic. Despite this, he unconsciously becomes deeply emotionally attached to his research assistant and friend, Morinaga, whom he is aware is homosexual but allows by his side on the agreement that his sexual orientation not be an issue. He tries to rationalize his dependency on Morinaga by convincing himself that having sex with him from time to time is essential to keep him in his life, although refusing to admit why he needs him in his life in the first place.', 'A first year doctorate student in the agricultural science department at a university in Nagoya. Extremely hot-headed and violent, he has a reputation of being a tyrant to other students at the University and is not very social in result. After almost being raped by a gay professor and other bad experiences with homosexual men, he becomes extremely homophobic. Despite this, he unconsciously becomes deeply emotionally attached to his research assistant and friend, Morinaga, whom he is aware is homosexual but allows by his side on the agreement that his sexual orientation not be an issue. He tries to rationalize his dependency on Morinaga by convincing himself that having sex with him from time to time is essential to keep him in his life, although refusing to admit why he needs him in his life in the first place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zbHKl6PSpVLgWcqfmgigXrDRFqP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45226'),
  ('31642542089031526', 'The U.S. and the Holocaust', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Ken Burns, Lynn Novick, Sarah Botstein', 'Geoffrey C. Ward, Kevin Baker', 'Peter Coyote, Daniel Mendelsohn, Peter Hayes, Deborah Lipstadt, Meryl Streep, Daniel Greene, Guy Stern, Rebecca Erbelding', 'TV-14', 'Inspired in part by the United States Holocaust Memorial Museum’s “Americans and the Holocaust” exhibition and supported by its historical resources, this documentary series examines the rise of Hitler and Nazism in Germany in the context of global antisemitism and racism, the eugenics movement in the United States, and race laws in the American south.', 'Inspired in part by the United States Holocaust Memorial Museum’s “Americans and the Holocaust” exhibition and supported by its historical resources, this documentary series examines the rise of Hitler and Nazism in Germany in the context of global antisemitism and racism, the eugenics movement in the United States, and race laws in the American south.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/XhE7XKsSkopejjk5pUl228nllo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204165'),
  ('128125380516355025', 'The Ultimate Baking Championship', 2026, null, null, null, 'Jesse Palmer, Duff Goldman', null, 'Follows 16 pastry chefs tested on their core techniques, from laminated dough and pâte à choux to chocolate work and sugar artistry. Only one pastry chef will be named the Ultimate Baking Champion and win the $50,000 grand prize.', 'Follows 16 pastry chefs tested on their core techniques, from laminated dough and pâte à choux to chocolate work and sugar artistry. Only one pastry chef will be named the Ultimate Baking Champion and win the $50,000 grand prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/llgKSMZ9NT4PI8nzDI2VHEoopa2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:314485'),
