  ('142810616483213693', 'The Unaware Atelier Meister', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mikako Komatsu, Minami Tanaka, Asami Seto, Hisako Kanemoto, Rie Tanaka', null, 'Kurt Rockhans is a kind-hearted errand boy for a hero’s party, the Flaming Dragon Fang. One day, he''s banished from the party and finds out he has the lowest rank in combat. In order to make a living, Kurt picks up various jobs and discovers he has astonishing abilities. Though he doesn''t realize it yet, Kurt has SSS-rank skills in anything other than fighting, as he sets off on a new journey.', 'Kurt Rockhans is a kind-hearted errand boy for a hero’s party, the Flaming Dragon Fang. One day, he''s banished from the party and finds out he has the lowest rank in combat. In order to make a living, Kurt picks up various jobs and discovers he has astonishing abilities. Though he doesn''t realize it yet, Kurt has SSS-rank skills in anything other than fighting, as he sets off on a new journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/OPJ7k6DMm1o3A0kIXysgrqVT5w.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:277881'),
  ('655344921561969007', 'The UnBelievable with Dan Aykroyd', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Dan Aykroyd, Adam Richman', 'TV-14', 'Each episode opens up a cabinet of curiosities to reveal the strangest-but-true stories in human history, brought to life through dynamic recreation, compelling graphics, and arresting archival. From Boston’s Great Molasses Flood to a man who survived being struck by lightning not once, not twice, but SEVEN times, these seemingly tall tales all actually happened, and our cast of experts dives into the historical record to tell you how and why.', 'Each episode opens up a cabinet of curiosities to reveal the strangest-but-true stories in human history, brought to life through dynamic recreation, compelling graphics, and arresting archival. From Boston’s Great Molasses Flood to a man who survived being struck by lightning not once, not twice, but SEVEN times, these seemingly tall tales all actually happened, and our cast of experts dives into the historical record to tell you how and why.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wCdcmyYICMZ4oceqiNraSztTJn6.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:227521'),
  ('262984504951533988', 'The Unbroken Voice', 2022, 'Drama, Soap', 'Héctor Rodríguez', 'Ángela Milena Ardila, Mayra Alejandra Henao, Johnny A. Ortiz', 'Verónica Orozco, Santiago Alarcón, Mateo Rincón, Brandon Figueredo, Linda Lucía Callejas, Catalina Polo, Diego Daniel Mira, Sebastián Yatra', 'TV-MA', 'Against all odds, a young Arelys Henao pursues her dream of a singing career in this music-packed drama inspired by the Colombian icon''s early life.', 'Against all odds, a young Arelys Henao pursues her dream of a singing career in this music-packed drama inspired by the Colombian icon''s early life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCJAPtPg6b2JckKbbIeeOiFPTdD.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:155499'),
  ('16406759815197457', 'The Uncanny Counter', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Kim Sae-bom, Yoo Sun-dong, Yeoh Gee-na', 'Kim Sae-bom', 'Cho Byeong-kyu, Yu Jun-sang, Kim Se-jeong, Yeom Hye-ran, Ahn Suk-hwan, Yoo In-soo, Kim Hieora, Kang Ki-young', 'TV-MA', 'A group of supernatural demon hunters known as "Counters," each with unique abilities, disguise themselves as employees of a noodle restaurant, while tracking down evil spirits that terrorize the mortal world.', 'A group of supernatural demon hunters known as "Counters," each with unique abilities, disguise themselves as employees of a noodle restaurant, while tracking down evil spirits that terrorize the mortal world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bsbuXbQqryQ8aJlwXFkFXbrYko1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:113268'),
  ('543883855866934028', 'The Undateables', 2012, 'Documentary, Comedy', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Follow single people with disabilities as they sign up to a dating agency in order to find a partner.', 'Follow single people with disabilities as they sign up to a dating agency in order to find a partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vXoDAmbYDFiUNblUbZmIzYY2wu0.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:44600'),
  ('709253062248978074', 'The Undeclared War', 2022, 'War & Politics, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Peter Kosminsky', null, 'Hannah Khalique-Brown, Simon Pegg, Maisie Richardson-Sellers, Edward Holcroft, Adrian Lester, Alex Jennings, Hattie Morahan, Ed Stoppard', null, 'In the post-pandemic world of 2024 during an upcoming British general election involving the UK’s first Black Conservative prime minister, a leading team of analysts at the heart of the UK’s NSA-style spy agency GCHQ attempt to ward off a cyber-attack on the country’s electoral system.', 'In the post-pandemic world of 2024 during an upcoming British general election involving the UK’s first Black Conservative prime minister, a leading team of analysts at the heart of the UK’s NSA-style spy agency GCHQ attempt to ward off a cyber-attack on the country’s electoral system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k1BGSW4mvpnXYM34OqiCtyZQhEC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156988'),
  ('788132142995715724', 'The Underclass', 2020, 'Drama', null, null, 'Nannaphas Loetnamchoetsakun, Praewa Suthamphong, Sumitra Duangkaew, Tanutchai Wijitvongtong, Tarisa Preechatangkit, Natticha Chantaravareelrkha, Miori Ohkubo', 'TV-MA', 'After getting dropped from an elite program, a student gets tangled in the affairs of a high school gang while trying to find her own identity.', 'After getting dropped from an elite program, a student gets tangled in the affairs of a high school gang while trying to find her own identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDGmpAQzHfqa9gdLtgGbfpPf2Wx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105646'),
  ('482887029290802207', 'The Underground Railroad', 2021, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Barry Jenkins', null, 'Thuso Mbedu, Chase W. Dillon, Joel Edgerton', 'TV-MA', 'Follow young Cora’s journey as she makes a desperate bid for freedom in the antebellum South. After escaping her Georgia plantation for the rumored Underground Railroad, Cora discovers no mere metaphor, but an actual railroad full of engineers and conductors, and a secret network of tracks and tunnels beneath the Southern soil.', 'Follow young Cora’s journey as she makes a desperate bid for freedom in the antebellum South. After escaping her Georgia plantation for the rumored Underground Railroad, Cora discovers no mere metaphor, but an actual railroad full of engineers and conductors, and a secret network of tracks and tunnels beneath the Southern soil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/CrrTqw7LHafnbdH9UcK60aOZSm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80039'),
  ('652308417461906309', 'The Undersea World of Jacques Cousteau', 1968, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Jacques-Yves Cousteau', 'NR', 'The intrepid undersea explorer and author circles the globe on his floating laboratory, Calypso, in this occasional series. A pioneer in marine study, the red-capped Frenchman introduced generations of landlubbers to the creatures and mysteries of the sea.', 'The intrepid undersea explorer and author circles the globe on his floating laboratory, Calypso, in this occasional series. A pioneer in marine study, the red-capped Frenchman introduced generations of landlubbers to the creatures and mysteries of the sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4nMk7XRR7hlQgUtszbd9pbVFwa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44103'),
  ('547572583662970988', 'The Undertaker', 2013, 'Crime', 'Hartmut Block', null, 'Mike Müller, Barbara Terpoorten, Reto Stalder, Samuel Streiff, Suly Röthlisberger, Martin Ostermeier', null, 'A detective leaves the force to take over the family business as an undertaker at the same time as he is being investigated for murder. His close encounters with corpses and his earlier police training lead him to see things some of his ex-colleagues miss and he investigates the crimes he encounters in an unofficial capacity often to the dismay of the official police.', 'A detective leaves the force to take over the family business as an undertaker at the same time as he is being investigated for murder. His close encounters with corpses and his earlier police training lead him to see things some of his ex-colleagues miss and he investigates the crimes he encounters in an unofficial capacity often to the dismay of the official police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8nKpZSHvqCDvMRItx19gyIGflne.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:62514'),
  ('7612193443450826', 'The Undoing', 2020, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'David E. Kelley', 'David E. Kelley', 'Nicole Kidman, Hugh Grant, Edgar Ramírez, Noah Jupe, Lily Rabe, Matilda De Angelis, Ismael Cruz Cordova, Edan Alexander', 'TV-MA', 'Grace and Jonathan Fraser are living the only lives they ever wanted. Overnight a chasm opens in their lives: a violent death and a chain of terrible revelations. Left behind in the wake of a spreading and very public disaster, Grace must dismantle one life and create another for her child and her family.', 'Grace and Jonathan Fraser are living the only lives they ever wanted. Overnight a chasm opens in their lives: a violent death and a chain of terrible revelations. Left behind in the wake of a spreading and very public disaster, Grace must dismantle one life and create another for her child and her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3tDbJxobPN3EI2bBebL6zmusmw5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83851'),
  ('828001603278182772', 'The Unforgettable Memory', 2004, 'Drama', null, 'Ting Wa-Chung', 'Wang Shih-sian, Phoenix Chang, Lee Lee-zen, Anais Yang, Qin Zhang, Angel Han, Lee Hsing-wen, Johnny Hsu', null, 'The Unforgettable Memory is a Taiwanese prime-time television series, originally broadcast on Formosa Television from 22 September 2004 to 28 September 2006 for 526 episodes. With a run-time of over 50,000 minutes, it is the longest Taiwanese TV drama in the 21st century.', 'The Unforgettable Memory is a Taiwanese prime-time television series, originally broadcast on Formosa Television from 22 September 2004 to 28 September 2006 for 526 episodes. With a run-time of over 50,000 minutes, it is the longest Taiwanese TV drama in the 21st century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPqcyiBoTax5wHUR89pPvv33fl0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108586'),
  ('100830187581160998', 'The Unicorn', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Mike Schiff, Bill Martin', null, 'Walton Goggins, Rob Corddry, Michaela Watkins, Omar Benson Miller, Maya Lynne Robinson, Ruby Jay, Makenzie Moss', 'TV-PG', 'A tight-knit group of best friends and family helps Wade embrace his “new normal” in the wake of the loss of his wife. As a sometimes ill-equipped but always devoted single parent to his two adolescent daughters, he is taking the major step of dating again.', 'A tight-knit group of best friends and family helps Wade embrace his “new normal” in the wake of the loss of his wife. As a sometimes ill-equipped but always devoted single parent to his two adolescent daughters, he is taking the major step of dating again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/464MyJvlG2Po8J1ObAwRljf2Exf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:89611'),
  ('333183754843635331', 'The Unit', 2006, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'David Mamet', null, 'Dennis Haysbert, Regina Taylor, Scott Foley, Audrey Marie Anderson, Max Martini, Abby Brammell, Michael Irby, Robert Patrick', 'TV-14', 'A covert team of special forces operatives risk their lives on undercover missions around the globe, while their wives maintain the homefront, protecting their husbands'' secrets.', 'A covert team of special forces operatives risk their lives on undercover missions around the globe, while their wives maintain the homefront, protecting their husbands'' secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ftwhXqizcVRo4pgqFnTysR9tAIM.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2321'),
  ('337274942368720285', 'The United States Steel Hour', 1953, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Cyril Hume, Richard Maibaum', null, null, 'The United States Steel Hour is an anthology series which brought hour-long dramas to television from 1953 to 1963. The television series and the radio program that preceded it were both sponsored by the United States Steel Corporation.', 'The United States Steel Hour is an anthology series which brought hour-long dramas to television from 1953 to 1963. The television series and the radio program that preceded it were both sponsored by the United States Steel Corporation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/15Lz0tLjmTswcp46Buc3jxvhUoL.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:12450'),
  ('621792311904098527', 'The Universe', 2007, 'Documentary', null, null, 'David Ackroyd, Erik Thompson', 'TV-PG', 'From the planets to the stars and out to the edge of the unknown, history and science collide in a wondrous yet deadly adventure through space and time.', 'From the planets to the stars and out to the edge of the unknown, history and science collide in a wondrous yet deadly adventure through space and time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wbtVDGQbzvNSbAqXIVE1X7BUtq2.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:2622'),
  ('100624450901584349', 'The Unlikely Murderer', 2021, 'Drama', 'Thomas Pettersson, Wilhelm Behrman, Niklas Rockström', null, 'Robert Gustafsson, Mikael Persbrandt, Eva Melander, Björn Bengtsson, Peter Viitanen, Cilla Thorell, Joel Spira, Magnus Krepper', 'TV-MA', 'After the assassination of prime minister Olof Palme in 1986, Stig Engström managed to elude justice right up to his death through a combination of audacity, luck, and a perplexed police force.', 'After the assassination of prime minister Olof Palme in 1986, Stig Engström managed to elude justice right up to his death through a combination of audacity, luck, and a perplexed police force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5doyEwXiowg2mrjKsS9NSvPs53.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132316'),
  ('170444221607868355', 'The Unlisted', 2019, 'Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Justine Flynn', null, 'Vrund Rao, Ved Rao, Abigail Adriano, Miah Madden, Annabel Wolfe, Danny Kim', 'TV-PG', 'Twelve-year-old identical twins Dru and Kal discover that the government is secretly tracking and manipulating Australia''s youth via electronic tracking devices.', 'Twelve-year-old identical twins Dru and Kal discover that the government is secretly tracking and manipulating Australia''s youth via electronic tracking devices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dlDPN9MMMc1NQpx5EA6HIUFnRVy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94625'),
  ('448852416141279476', 'The Unremarkable Juanquini', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Dago García', null, 'Julián Cerati, Antonio Sanint, Biassini Segura, Julio Cesar Herrera, María Cecilia Sánchez, Jacques Toukhmanian, Mariana Gómez', null, 'An inept magician pulls off the trick of his life: accidentally disappearing a wanted criminal during a police raid. Now he''s going to pay for that.', 'An inept magician pulls off the trick of his life: accidentally disappearing a wanted criminal during a police raid. Now he''s going to pay for that.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d2jgq3q8MGHwP5ZNtnJ8GPCSQ1W.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:103505'),
  ('1060490664481366510', 'The Unsettling', 2019, 'Crime, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Nick Maniatis, Andrew Jacobsen, Adam Jay Epstein', null, 'Holly Taylor, Tequan Richmond, Willow Shields, Alex Lange, Marguerite Moreau, David Clayton Rogers, Lora Martinez-Cunningham, An-Li Bogan', null, 'Becca, a 16-year-old girl, arrives at her new foster home located in a remote area. Her foster siblings are less than welcoming but none more so than the 11-year-old biological son of their foster parents. Becca tries to keep to herself and adjust to her new home, but strange things start to happen around her, and Becca is uncertain about who or what is responsible.', 'Becca, a 16-year-old girl, arrives at her new foster home located in a remote area. Her foster siblings are less than welcoming but none more so than the 11-year-old biological son of their foster parents. Becca tries to keep to herself and adjust to her new home, but strange things start to happen around her, and Becca is uncertain about who or what is responsible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/klQFSpyENmZyb2rkogAvxHKtWwd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91198'),
  ('438599821719104859', 'The Unsolved Murder of Beverly Lynn Smith', 2022, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Ashley Pearson', null, 'Follows the cold case and controversial investigation into the murder of Beverly Lynn Smith in her home in Oshawa, Ontario. Woven together from first hand accounts, expert interviews, family archives, and rare access to key participants, The Unsolved Murder of Beverly Lynn Smith is an unpredictable tale that explores the unrelenting enigma of ethics and accountability in this provocative criminal case.', 'Follows the cold case and controversial investigation into the murder of Beverly Lynn Smith in her home in Oshawa, Ontario. Woven together from first hand accounts, expert interviews, family archives, and rare access to key participants, The Unsolved Murder of Beverly Lynn Smith is an unpredictable tale that explores the unrelenting enigma of ethics and accountability in this provocative criminal case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96FdKhAu0YPsnoUq0GVpNI7JIB5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:201429'),
  ('104037795301353706', 'The Untamed', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Mystery', 'Mo Xiang Tong Xiu', 'Ma Jing, Guo Guangyun, Deng Yaoyu', 'Xiao Zhan, Wang Yibo, Meng Ziyi, Xuan Lu, Wang Zhuocheng, Yu Bin, Liu Haikuan, James Huang', null, 'In a magical world of inter-clan rivalry, two soulmates face treacherous schemes and uncover a dark mystery linked to a tragic event in the past.', 'In a magical world of inter-clan rivalry, two soulmates face treacherous schemes and uncover a dark mystery linked to a tragic event in the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8TZbpPpLQVS2i7P7yUVhrFlFsmW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90761'),
  ('1039038237678119663', 'The Untamed: Special Edition', 2019, 'Drama, Mystery, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Xiao Zhan, Wang Yibo, Liu Haikuan, Wang Zhuocheng', null, '"The Untamed Special Edition" is a 20-episode cut of The Untamed specially made to overseas fans for better integration and comprehension of the series. This special edition focuses more on Lan Wangji/Lan Zhan and his emotions towards Wei Wuxian/Wei Ying.', '"The Untamed Special Edition" is a 20-episode cut of The Untamed specially made to overseas fans for better integration and comprehension of the series. This special edition focuses more on Lan Wangji/Lan Zhan and his emotions towards Wei Wuxian/Wei Ying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHy38hbjjNyGHXp5DIAyGeiepfF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97706'),
  ('110031700897553167', 'The Untouchables', 1959, 'Drama, Crime', 'Quinn Martin', null, 'Robert Stack, Nicholas Georgiade, Steve London, Paul Picerni, Abel Fernandez, Walter Winchell', 'TV-PG', 'Special Agent Eliot Ness and his elite team of incorruptible agents battle organized crime in 1930s Chicago.', 'Special Agent Eliot Ness and his elite team of incorruptible agents battle organized crime in 1930s Chicago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80IDXgaHmcxj6CKRImkpHjnIMcd.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2774'),
  ('642178028663352331', 'The Untouchables', 1993, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Tom Amandes, John Rhys-Davies, William Forsythe, Paul Regina, David James Elliott, Michael Horse, John Newton, Hynden Walch', 'NR', 'The Untouchables is an American crime drama series that aired for two seasons in syndication, from January 1993 to May 1994. The series portrayed work of the real life Untouchables federal investigative squad in Prohibition-era Chicago and its efforts against Al Capone''s attempts to profit from the market in bootleg liquor. The series features Tom Amandes as Eliot Ness and William Forsythe as Al Capone, and was based on the 1959 series and 1987 film of the same name.', 'The Untouchables is an American crime drama series that aired for two seasons in syndication, from January 1993 to May 1994. The series portrayed work of the real life Untouchables federal investigative squad in Prohibition-era Chicago and its efforts against Al Capone''s attempts to profit from the market in bootleg liquor. The series features Tom Amandes as Eliot Ness and William Forsythe as Al Capone, and was based on the 1959 series and 1987 film of the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e8ks6yxQkyf4buS6DjKyRvnYQJU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:11530'),
  ('972331858440677985', 'The Unusual Suspects', 2021, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama', 'Jessica Redenbach', null, 'Miranda Otto, Aina Dumlao, Michelle Vergara Moore, Lena Cruz, Susana Downes, Toby Leonard Moore, Matt Day, Peter O''Brien', null, 'Follows the theft of a multi-million-dollar necklace and the women from different walks of life who come together to ensure that justice is served.', 'Follows the theft of a multi-million-dollar necklace and the women from different walks of life who come together to ensure that justice is served.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMxSrhaESNFiz6dgqa8dx0jj0Uf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:125309'),
  ('93738720094753831', 'The Unusuals', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Noah Hawley', null, 'Amber Tamblyn, Jeremy Renner, Harold Perrineau, Adam Goldberg, Joshua Close, Monique Gabriela Curnen, Kai Lennox, Terry Kinney', null, 'Like a modern-day M*A*S*H, The Unusuals explores both the grounded drama and comic insanity of New York City police detectives.', 'Like a modern-day M*A*S*H, The Unusuals explores both the grounded drama and comic insanity of New York City police detectives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bpxRTb56npkF6gLSYgynPXEy7MT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:17385'),
  ('236477849159874420', 'The Unwanted Undead Adventurer', 2024, 'Animation, Mystery, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ryota Suzuki, Ikumi Hasegawa, Mikako Komatsu, Sayumi Suzushiro', 'TV-14', 'Rentt Faina has hunted monsters for the last 10 years. Sadly, he’s not great at his job, stuck hunting slimes and goblins for a few coins each day. His luck turns when he finds an undiscovered path. At the path’s end, he meets his demise in the maw of a legendary dragon. But, he wakes up as an undead bag of bones! He sets out to achieve Existential Evolution and rejoin the land of the living.', 'Rentt Faina has hunted monsters for the last 10 years. Sadly, he’s not great at his job, stuck hunting slimes and goblins for a few coins each day. His luck turns when he finds an undiscovered path. At the path’s end, he meets his demise in the maw of a legendary dragon. But, he wakes up as an undead bag of bones! He sets out to achieve Existential Evolution and rejoin the land of the living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQpkZLyw8ID6lZG3djRtihzVWmY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197848'),
  ('163844314527039511', 'The UnXplained', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, 'William Shatner', 'TV-14', 'Explore the world’s most fascinating, strange and inexplicable mysteries. Each episode features compelling contributions from scientists, historians, witnesses and experiencers—each seeking to shed light on how the seemingly impossible actually can happen.', 'Explore the world’s most fascinating, strange and inexplicable mysteries. Each episode features compelling contributions from scientists, historians, witnesses and experiencers—each seeking to shed light on how the seemingly impossible actually can happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4jKrJ03pJPyDJgHGQU6au8gpRL.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:91371'),
  ('824947348428721508', 'The Upper Hand', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Blake Hunter', null, 'Honor Blackman, Kellie Bright, Joe McGann, Diana Weston, William Puttock', null, 'The Upper Hand is a British television sitcom, produced by Central Independent Television and Columbia Pictures Television and broadcast by ITV from 1990 to 1996. The programme was adapted from the American sitcom Who''s the Boss?. As in the former series, an affluent single woman, raising a son with the help of her mother, hires a housekeeper only to have a man apply for the job.', 'The Upper Hand is a British television sitcom, produced by Central Independent Television and Columbia Pictures Television and broadcast by ITV from 1990 to 1996. The programme was adapted from the American sitcom Who''s the Boss?. As in the former series, an affluent single woman, raising a son with the help of her mother, hires a housekeeper only to have a man apply for the job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Ir9cVYy9uRtlTMcDDB7rZrjSHJ.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:2272'),
  ('203431248722589425', 'The Upshaws', 2021, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Regina Y. Hicks, Wanda Sykes', null, 'Mike Epps, Kim Fields, Wanda Sykes, Khali Spraggins, Journey Christine, Jermelle Simon', 'TV-MA', 'Bennie Upshaw, the head of a Black working class family in Indianapolis, is a charming, well-intentioned mechanic and lifelong mess just trying his best to step up and care for his family and tolerate his sardonic sister-in-law, all without a blueprint for success.', 'Bennie Upshaw, the head of a Black working class family in Indianapolis, is a charming, well-intentioned mechanic and lifelong mess just trying his best to step up and care for his family and tolerate his sardonic sister-in-law, all without a blueprint for success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bgtpwAsKNfqJmgp3zBxuSHMBAaW.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:121509'),
  ('413812349117702266', 'The Upstart and the Self-Made Man', 1987, null, null, null, 'Felix Wong Yat-Wah, Kit-wah Leung, Eugina Lau Mei-Guen, Anthony Tang Ho-Kwong, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Felix Lok Ying-Kwan, Debbie Chui, Helena Law Lan', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNz2fy5yr0Wws6ig8dLEXCJj63i.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108088'),
  ('910473390841047073', 'The Usurper', 2019, 'Drama, Soap', 'Inés Rodena', 'Larissa Andrade', 'Sandra Echeverría, Andrés Palacios, Arap Bethke, Daniela Schmidt, Juan Carlos Barreto, Aurora Gil, Germán Bracco, Macarena Oz', 'TV-14', 'A humble young woman allows herself be manipulated by her twin sister to replace her so she can leave with another man.', 'A humble young woman allows herself be manipulated by her twin sister to replace her so she can leave with another man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fnBu7Ym3WeMZy2goTl3c2YReVqE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92433'),
  ('820404206956620612', 'The Valhalla Murders', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Thordur Palsson', null, 'Nína Dögg Filippusdóttir, Björn Thors, Bergur Ebbi Benediktsson, Aldís Amah Hamilton, Sigurður Skúlason, Tinna Hrafnsdóttir, Arndís Hrönn Egilsdóttir, Edda Björgvinsdóttir', 'TV-MA', 'An Oslo detective with a painful past returns to his native Iceland to help a dedicated cop hunt a serial killer with a link to a mysterious photo.', 'An Oslo detective with a painful past returns to his native Iceland to help a dedicated cop hunt a serial killer with a link to a mysterious photo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gYmFudSTEu7t6a5fWUV3c89d8tQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97405'),
  ('429613430941098095', 'The Valley', 2015, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Arved Birnbaum, Victoria Trauttmansdorff, Friedrich Mücke, Laura Tonke, Jenny Schily, Christina Große, Arnd Klawitter, Anna Böttcher', null, 'Between forests and hills, the river Ahr meanders through a mystical, foggy autumn landscape. Amidst this idyll a man awakens in the middle of a vineyard. He does not know who he is, where he is or how he came to be here. Next to him is a dead young woman lying among the vines. As a foreigner in the secluded town in the Ahr valley he enters an archaic village community, which seems to keep a secret from him.', 'Between forests and hills, the river Ahr meanders through a mystical, foggy autumn landscape. Amidst this idyll a man awakens in the middle of a vineyard. He does not know who he is, where he is or how he came to be here. Next to him is a dead young woman lying among the vines. As a foreigner in the secluded town in the Ahr valley he enters an archaic village community, which seems to keep a secret from him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lmheTHvaQYVPS0s4w3qEpkzwcGG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64086'),
  ('925561771899859224', 'The Valley', 2024, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'One day they are living the glam party life at SUR with Lisa Vanderpump and the next they''re married and dealing with homeownership and children. From bottle service to baby bottles, close friends and reality stars find their way out of the young and fast life of the Hollywood lights. They are getting ready to grow up and have moved to the serenity of The Valley, where they navigate bustling businesses, rocky relationships and feisty friendships.', 'One day they are living the glam party life at SUR with Lisa Vanderpump and the next they''re married and dealing with homeownership and children. From bottle service to baby bottles, close friends and reality stars find their way out of the young and fast life of the Hollywood lights. They are getting ready to grow up and have moved to the serenity of The Valley, where they navigate bustling businesses, rocky relationships and feisty friendships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8CnDkyevooH4OneksUTBO9OQ8UU.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:247758'),
  ('25593204893485220', 'The Valley of The Wolves', 2003, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, War & Politics, Crime', 'Osman Sınav, Raci Şaşmaz', null, 'Necati Şaşmaz, Özgü Namal, Kenan Çoban, Gürkan Uygun, İpek Tenolcay, Erhan Ufak, Emin Olcay, Serpil Tamur', null, 'Valley of the Wolves was a Turkish television drama which broadcast mainly on Show TV and then transferred to Kanal D, then atv for its last season. It was mostly about an agent named Polat Alemdar who leaked into the mafia after his plastic surgery. The scenario has direct and indirect references to the Turkish politics and political history from a viewpoint of an undercover agent. Valley of the Wolves became one of the most successful TV shows in Turkey and produced a successful feature film named Valley of the Wolves: Iraq.', 'Valley of the Wolves was a Turkish television drama which broadcast mainly on Show TV and then transferred to Kanal D, then atv for its last season. It was mostly about an agent named Polat Alemdar who leaked into the mafia after his plastic surgery. The scenario has direct and indirect references to the Turkish politics and political history from a viewpoint of an undercover agent. Valley of the Wolves became one of the most successful TV shows in Turkey and produced a successful feature film named Valley of the Wolves: Iraq.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGi8EuXsf5bbM4O59Uu0pucLcT.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:34587'),
  ('764063598947020650', 'The Vampire Diaries', 2009, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Julie Plec, Kevin Williamson', null, 'Paul Wesley, Ian Somerhalder, Kat Graham, Candice King, Zach Roerig, Michael Malarkey, Matthew Davis', 'TV-14', 'The story of two vampire brothers obsessed with the same girl, who bears a striking resemblance to the beautiful but ruthless vampire they knew and loved in 1864.', 'The story of two vampire brothers obsessed with the same girl, who bears a striking resemblance to the beautiful but ruthless vampire they knew and loved in 1864.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3vl6wV1W8PBezFfntKTrhrehCY.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:18165'),
  ('511109224275060225', 'The Vampire Dies in No Time', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Jun Fukuyama, Makoto Furukawa, Mutsumi Tamura, Natsumi Hioka, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Atsushi Tamaru, Shunichi Toki', 'TV-14', 'In Shin-Yokohama, humans engage in a long, drawn out battle against vampires. Amongst them, the last "true vampire" stands... Will he be a bringer of peace, or destruction?', 'In Shin-Yokohama, humans engage in a long, drawn out battle against vampires. Amongst them, the last "true vampire" stands... Will he be a bringer of peace, or destruction?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ZFAqdFmg7wHUiJqowTITBxh7C2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:112624'),
  ('293726685652205564', 'The Vampires of Midland', 2021, 'Mystery, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Alexey Akimov', null, 'Yuriy Stoyanov, Tatyana Dogileva, Mikhail Gavrilov, Artyom Tkachenko, Olga Medynich, Dmitry Chebotarev, Anastasiya Stezhko, Timofey Kochnev', null, 'Grandpa Slava is the oldest of the Midland vampire family. They live quietly. They live by the law. They live the unremarkable life of an ordinary Russian family and they never kill humans – ever. Although, of course, everyone knows they drink blood. And when some lifeless corpses are found in a birch grove near Smolensk... their peaceful life falls under threat.', 'Grandpa Slava is the oldest of the Midland vampire family. They live quietly. They live by the law. They live the unremarkable life of an ordinary Russian family and they never kill humans – ever. Although, of course, everyone knows they drink blood. And when some lifeless corpses are found in a birch grove near Smolensk... their peaceful life falls under threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7AHDGuOm0pefzw4tyZ7s13VAQ8P.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:105136'),
  ('964941410973730560', 'The Vanishing Triangle', 2023, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Ivan Kavanagh', 'Sally Tatchell, Rachel Anthony', 'India Mullen, Allen Leech, Adam Richardson, Laoise Sweeney, Fionnuala Murphy, Sarah Carroll, Philip O''Sullivan, Stephen Hogan', 'TV-MA', 'After investigative journalist Lisa Wallace publishes an article about her mother''s murder, other girls start to disappear; she and Detective David Burkely investigate across Ireland, searching for the missing girls while the killer taunts Lisa. Inspired by true events.', 'After investigative journalist Lisa Wallace publishes an article about her mother''s murder, other girls start to disappear; she and Detective David Burkely investigate across Ireland, searching for the missing girls while the killer taunts Lisa. Inspired by true events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7hZA4hoXV3iGCZ6Jym8fiDoNUl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209280'),
  ('340098765714475822', 'The Veil', 2021, 'Crime, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Park Seok-ho', null, 'Namkoong Min, Park Ha-seon, Kim Ji-eun, Kim Byeong-gi, Lee Kyung-young, Jang Young-nam, Yu Oh-seong, Kim Jong-tae', 'TV-MA', 'Han Ji-hyuk, an NIS agent gone MIA, returns after one year to join a new team as he searches for his lost past.', 'Han Ji-hyuk, an NIS agent gone MIA, returns after one year to join a new team as he searches for his lost past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nVMmNwMXrXBmTMn1HtUdpB7RPZw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127358'),
  ('1010180151081089603', 'The Veil', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', 'Steven Knight', null, 'Elisabeth Moss, Yumna Marwan, Dali Benssalah, Thibault de Montalembert, Josh Charles, James Purefoy', 'TV-MA', 'Two women play a deadly game of truth and lies on the road from Istanbul to Paris and London. One woman has a secret, the other a mission to reveal it before thousands of lives are lost. In the shadows, mission controllers at the CIA and French DGSE must put differences aside and work together to avert potential disaster.', 'Two women play a deadly game of truth and lies on the road from Istanbul to Paris and London. One woman has a secret, the other a mission to reveal it before thousands of lives are lost. In the shadows, mission controllers at the CIA and French DGSE must put differences aside and work together to avert potential disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6aM5Lyp3zUtPyc0WVofES6UrV06.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207334'),
  ('964819904190875839', 'The Velvet Collection', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ramón Campos, Gema R. Neira', null, 'Marta Hazas, Asier Etxeandia, Adrián Lastra, Diego Martín, Javier Rey, Fernando Guallar, Llorenç González, Megan Montaner', null, 'It is the year 1967. After five happy years of marriage in New York with Alberto and their young son, Anna Ribera returns to Spain to take her project Velvet to the next level. She and Alberto had been managing all things Velvet from across the ocean and, together with their best friends and partners, had made a name for Velvet as the number one address in the world of fashion and innovation. Now they decide to take the next step and turn their reputation into a franchise, first at home, then abroad. The first step is opening shop in the other great Spanish city, Barcelona, on its world famous promenade, the Passeig de Gracia. There, the second Velvet Fashion Store is about to open its gates, managed by Ana''s good friend Clara who had made it up the career ladder from seamstress to directorial assistant in the Madrid Velvet years.', 'It is the year 1967. After five happy years of marriage in New York with Alberto and their young son, Anna Ribera returns to Spain to take her project Velvet to the next level. She and Alberto had been managing all things Velvet from across the ocean and, together with their best friends and partners, had made a name for Velvet as the number one address in the world of fashion and innovation. Now they decide to take the next step and turn their reputation into a franchise, first at home, then abroad. The first step is opening shop in the other great Spanish city, Barcelona, on its world famous promenade, the Passeig de Gracia. There, the second Velvet Fashion Store is about to open its gates, managed by Ana''s good friend Clara who had made it up the career ladder from seamstress to directorial assistant in the Madrid Velvet years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dYrLZbWKKSUECCQ5CCvpEm6HZma.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:74024'),
  ('171290613244643974', 'The Vendetta of An', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery, War & Politics', null, null, 'Cheng Yi, Liu Yijun, Wang Jinsong, Zhou Qi, Tong Mengshi, Xu Lu, Ni Dahong, Wang Zixuan', 'TV-14', 'Xie Huai''an, son of the Huben Army''s creator, survives his family''s massacre. After ten long years in hiding, he returns to Chang''an disguised as a lowly registrar, moving step by step through jianghu clashes and palace power plays in a tense battle of wits to avenge his family and safeguard the realm.', 'Xie Huai''an, son of the Huben Army''s creator, survives his family''s massacre. After ten long years in hiding, he returns to Chang''an disguised as a lowly registrar, moving step by step through jianghu clashes and palace power plays in a tense battle of wits to avenge his family and safeguard the realm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vMwB4BNicfWJl0JhU7YQApcoiHE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:254482'),
  ('472951881411548369', 'The Venture Bros.', 2004, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Doc Hammer, Christopher McCulloch', null, 'Doc Hammer, Christopher McCulloch, Patrick Warburton, James Urbaniak, Michael Sinterniklaas', 'TV-MA', 'Hank and Dean Venture, with their father Doctor Venture and faithful bodyguard Brock Samson, go on wild adventures facing megalomaniacs, zombies, and suspicious ninjas, all for the glory of adventure. Or something like that.', 'Hank and Dean Venture, with their father Doctor Venture and faithful bodyguard Brock Samson, go on wild adventures facing megalomaniacs, zombies, and suspicious ninjas, all for the glory of adventure. Or something like that.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ckQE1aLYQkRpp2HmHljiELAiOr1.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:2418'),
  ('471704177329268505', 'The Verdict', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Chris ''Mad Dog'' Russo', 'TV-PG', 'Host Christopher “Mad Dog” Russo gets to the bottom of the hottest debates in sports.', 'Host Christopher “Mad Dog” Russo gets to the bottom of the hottest debates in sports.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92meMg9DtdFCKUEKLoQm1OZlniI.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:282855'),
  ('179172667725365543', 'The Vertical Line', 2018, 'Drama', 'Mattia Torre', null, 'Valerio Mastandrea, Greta Scarano, Babak Karimi, Antonino Bruschetta, Antonio Catania, Giorgio Tirabassi, Paolo Calabresi, Barbara Ronchi', null, 'Heartfelt Italian comedy-drama about the patients and staff of a hospital oncology ward.', 'Heartfelt Italian comedy-drama about the patients and staff of a hospital oncology ward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3HaiqcTZnVwWzbXhZRtjRHOdFam.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77411'),
  ('713846230567997482', 'The Vexations of a Shut-In Vampire Princess', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tomori Kusunoki, Sayumi Suzushiro, Manaka Iwami, Fairouz Ai, Miyuri Shimabukuro, Yoko Hikasa, Sora Amamiya, Rina Hidaka', 'TV-14', 'Shut-in vampire Terakomari, or Komari for short, awakens from her slumber to find she''s been promoted to a commander of the army! The thing is, though, her new squad has a reputation for being violently insubordinate. And although Komari was born to a prestigious vampire family, her hatred of blood has made her the picture of mediocrity-scrawny, uncoordinated, and inept at magic. With the odds stacked against her, will the help of her trusty maid be enough for this recluse to blunder her way to success?', 'Shut-in vampire Terakomari, or Komari for short, awakens from her slumber to find she''s been promoted to a commander of the army! The thing is, though, her new squad has a reputation for being violently insubordinate. And although Komari was born to a prestigious vampire family, her hatred of blood has made her the picture of mediocrity-scrawny, uncoordinated, and inept at magic. With the odds stacked against her, will the help of her trusty maid be enough for this recluse to blunder her way to success?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IfQxH5ORqYbsxtCNcUVCwID8Cg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217755'),
  ('1038798275782094008', 'The Vicar of Dibley', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Paul Mayhew-Archer, Richard Curtis', null, 'Dawn French, Emma Chambers, Trevor Peacock, John Bluthal, James Fleet, Gary Waldhorn, Liz Smith, Roger Lloyd Pack', 'TV-PG', 'Reverend Granger is assigned as the Vicar of the rural parish of Dibley, but she is not quite what the villagers expected.', 'Reverend Granger is assigned as the Vicar of the rural parish of Dibley, but she is not quite what the villagers expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSMljUndA07O8eMCSwaal4kcWoq.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2767'),
  ('552402806949181776', 'The Vice', 1999, 'Drama', null, 'Barry Simner', 'Caroline Catz, Tim Pigott-Smith, David Harewood, Rosie Marcel, Mel Raido, Tamzin Malleson, Jake Nightingale', null, 'The Vice is an ITV police drama about the Metropolitan Police Vice Unit. It ran for five short series between 1999 and 2003. It tells the story of the London Metropolitan police force''s vice squad, where prostitution, underage sex, and other such organized crime are regular occurrences. Most episodes end in such a way where the main villain is caught but often not in a ''naturally'' concluded way that you would expect with other TV dramas, and often ending an episode with more questions unanswered than answered. The small dedicated team is led by Detective Inspector Pat Chappel who struggles to manage the balance between his home life and his work life - as do the other members of the team. Working in the seedy underworld leads to a continual dilemma for the team - the tension between the Vice Squad and the vice-related crimes that they investigate runs throughout the series and gives the show a rich viewing experience. The programme often blurs the line of the team staying on the right side of the law, as almost every member of the team at different points submits briefly or permanently to the temptations of either sex, drugs, money or honey traps. Sometimes with drastic consequences.', 'The Vice is an ITV police drama about the Metropolitan Police Vice Unit. It ran for five short series between 1999 and 2003. It tells the story of the London Metropolitan police force''s vice squad, where prostitution, underage sex, and other such organized crime are regular occurrences. Most episodes end in such a way where the main villain is caught but often not in a ''naturally'' concluded way that you would expect with other TV dramas, and often ending an episode with more questions unanswered than answered. The small dedicated team is led by Detective Inspector Pat Chappel who struggles to manage the balance between his home life and his work life - as do the other members of the team. Working in the seedy underworld leads to a continual dilemma for the team - the tension between the Vice Squad and the vice-related crimes that they investigate runs throughout the series and gives the show a rich viewing experience. The programme often blurs the line of the team staying on the right side of the law, as almost every member of the team at different points submits briefly or permanently to the temptations of either sex, drugs, money or honey traps. Sometimes with drastic consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ppblehy6Ezs8AeAlqwA3Q6vgQyP.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:17766'),
  ('22564058263071194', 'The Victim', 2019, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Rob Williams', 'Rob Williams', 'Kelly Macdonald, James Harkness, John Hannah, Jamie Sives, Karla Crome, John Scougall, Isis Hainsworth, Chloe Pirrie', null, 'A grieving mother is accused of identifying online the man she believes killed her son. But is he really a notorious child murderer or a tragic victim of mistaken identity?', 'A grieving mother is accused of identifying online the man she believes killed her son. But is he really a notorious child murderer or a tragic victim of mistaken identity?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ow8vlCfGzZuUxipm0CNGRiCnSiX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88129'),
  ('1041443287159406781', 'The Victims'' Game', 2020, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Chen Kuan-chung, David Chuang', 'Chien Shih-Keng, Huang Yu Chia, Kong Hiu-Yan', 'Joseph Chang, Hsu Wei-ning, Wang Shih-sian, Tarcy Su, Dean Fujioka, Moon Lee, Terrance Lau Chun-Him, Chang Tsai-hsing', null, 'After discovering his estranged daughter''s link to mysterious murders, a forensic detective with Asperger''s syndrome risks everything to solve the case.', 'After discovering his estranged daughter''s link to mysterious murders, a forensic detective with Asperger''s syndrome risks everything to solve the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGINJfhBDzUNEYx3fUKooSlgITe.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:101146'),
  ('122640762983668841', 'The Vietnam War', 2017, 'Documentary, War & Politics', null, null, 'Peter Coyote', 'TV-MA', 'An immersive 360-degree narrative telling the epic story of the Vietnam War as it has never before been told on film. Featuring testimony from nearly 80 witnesses, including many Americans who fought in the war and others who opposed it, as well as Vietnamese combatants and civilians from both the winning and losing sides.', 'An immersive 360-degree narrative telling the epic story of the Vietnam War as it has never before been told on film. Featuring testimony from nearly 80 witnesses, including many Americans who fought in the war and others who opposed it, as well as Vietnamese combatants and civilians from both the winning and losing sides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKt4lYTA4YmfBUH5Vtd7qqgqGBW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46434'),
  ('430836068554907403', 'The View', 1997, 'Talk', 'Barbara Walters, Bill Geddie', null, 'Joy Behar, Sunny Hostin, Sara Haines, Whoopi Goldberg, Alyssa Farah Griffin, Ana Navarro', 'TV-14', 'ABC Daytime''s morning chatfest, currently featuring Whoopi Goldberg, Joy Behar, Sunny Hostin, Sara Haines, Alyssa Farah Griffin, and Ana Navarro discussing the most exciting events of the day. Hot topics in the news, the best experts in their field, celebrity interviews and general entertainment are all part of The View.', 'ABC Daytime''s morning chatfest, currently featuring Whoopi Goldberg, Joy Behar, Sunny Hostin, Sara Haines, Alyssa Farah Griffin, and Ana Navarro discussing the most exciting events of the day. Hot topics in the news, the best experts in their field, celebrity interviews and general entertainment are all part of The View.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pEUNIxCMh2jFjUj7u09f4O5CcR4.jpg', 29, 'tmdb:tv:2221'),
  ('612470877770912039', 'The Village', 2013, 'Drama', 'Peter Moffat', null, 'David Ryall, Tom Varey, Maxine Peake, John Simm, Charlie Murphy, Emily Beecham, Rupert Evans, Augustus Prew', null, 'The Village is a BBC television drama created and written by Peter Moffat. Consisting of two six-episode series—the project intended as a 42-hour televised epic—the first series covers 1914 to 1920; the second continued the story into the 1920s. However, it was not commissioned for a third series. An epic drama charting the turbulent times experienced by one English village throughout the 20th century; births, deaths, political events and rebellions are among the events that occur during the time. Bert Middleton lives across the entire 100-year period, and his story from boyhood to old age forms the crux of the story, seen via flashbacks as Bert is interviewed in the present day by a documentarian working on a project about the second eldest man in the United Kingdom and his village.', 'The Village is a BBC television drama created and written by Peter Moffat. Consisting of two six-episode series—the project intended as a 42-hour televised epic—the first series covers 1914 to 1920; the second continued the story into the 1920s. However, it was not commissioned for a third series. An epic drama charting the turbulent times experienced by one English village throughout the 20th century; births, deaths, political events and rebellions are among the events that occur during the time. Bert Middleton lives across the entire 100-year period, and his story from boyhood to old age forms the crux of the story, seen via flashbacks as Bert is interviewed in the present day by a documentarian working on a project about the second eldest man in the United Kingdom and his village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojTX0B5o5yI2mKkLyyTxaKoPvWL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:46878'),
  ('603205035459421450', 'The Village', 2019, 'Drama', 'Mike Daniels', null, 'Lorraine Toussaint, Dominic Chianese, Frankie Faison, Grace Van Dien, Daren Kagasoff, Michaela McManus, Warren Christie, Moran Atias', 'TV-14', 'Welcome to the Village, an apartment building in Brooklyn that appears like any other from the outside but is quite unique inside. The people who reside here have built a bonded family of friends and neighbors.', 'Welcome to the Village, an apartment building in Brooklyn that appears like any other from the outside but is quite unique inside. The people who reside here have built a bonded family of friends and neighbors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhOrzKjnNpKtNQuGABj5ygAc9Kn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81948'),
  ('322402001755904976', 'The Village', 2023, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Milind Rau', 'Milind Rau, Deeraj Vaidy, Deepthi Govindarajan', 'Arya, John Kokken, Aadukalam Naren, Muthukumar, Divya Pillai, Baby Aazhiya, Thalaivasal Vijay, George Mariyan', 'TV-MA', 'In the desolate hinterlands of Tamil Nadu, a stranded urbanite enlists the help of three locals to find his missing family believed to have been abducted by nefarious beings of a cursed village. Meanwhile, a maniacal heir to a pharma empire sends a group of mercenaries to the same village to retrieve something long forgotten. Will they come out of this terror-stricken night alive?', 'In the desolate hinterlands of Tamil Nadu, a stranded urbanite enlists the help of three locals to find his missing family believed to have been abducted by nefarious beings of a cursed village. Meanwhile, a maniacal heir to a pharma empire sends a group of mercenaries to the same village to retrieve something long forgotten. Will they come out of this terror-stricken night alive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l3amr8DNfvhszpTR7wzr3Rb3RM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:200879'),
  ('847812302869001525', 'The Village: Achiara''s Secret', 2015, 'Mystery', null, 'Do Hyun-jung', 'Moon Geun-young, Yook Sung-jae, Shin Eun-kyung, On Ju-wan, Jang Hee-jin, Park Eun-seok, Kim Min-jae, Lee Yul-eum', null, 'Achiara is a quiet, peaceful village with hardly any crime. But on her first day of school there, English language instructor Kim So-yoon discovers a buried corpse. As the townspeople speculate on the identity of the dead person and the reason she was killed, So-yoon and policeman Park Woo-jae become determined to solve the mystery.', 'Achiara is a quiet, peaceful village with hardly any crime. But on her first day of school there, English language instructor Kim So-yoon discovers a buried corpse. As the townspeople speculate on the identity of the dead person and the reason she was killed, So-yoon and policeman Park Woo-jae become determined to solve the mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/layQ0TmOUDPVEOsP3XPiR7C1LQP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63929'),
  ('310837062731826817', 'The Villainess Is Adored by the Prince of the Neighbor Kingdom', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mai Fuchigami, Yuuichirou Umehara, Takuya Sato, Yumiri Hanamori', null, 'Tiararose Lapis Clamentile is set to marry Hartknights, crown prince of Lapis Lazuli—until she suddenly remembers her past life and realizes she’s been reincarnated into her favorite game, The Ring of Lapis Lazuli, as the doomed villainess! But just as she’s about to lose hope, the crown prince of Aquasteed proposes instead. Could this unexpected turn finally lead to a happy ending of her own?', 'Tiararose Lapis Clamentile is set to marry Hartknights, crown prince of Lapis Lazuli—until she suddenly remembers her past life and realizes she’s been reincarnated into her favorite game, The Ring of Lapis Lazuli, as the doomed villainess! But just as she’s about to lose hope, the crown prince of Aquasteed proposes instead. Could this unexpected turn finally lead to a happy ending of her own?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h96XGrKnxMLns3QZVDytji37Ng6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:295483'),
  ('1052738000936749252', 'The Villains of Valley View', 2022, 'Comedy, Family', 'Chris Peterson, Bryan Moore', null, 'Isabella Pappas, Malachi Barton, Reed Horstmann, Kayden Muller-Janssen, James Patrick Stuart, Lucy Davis', 'TV-Y7', 'A family of raucous supervillains who recently ran afoul of the League of Villains and now must somehow beat a path to normalcy in a small Texas town.', 'A family of raucous supervillains who recently ran afoul of the League of Villains and now must somehow beat a path to normalcy in a small Texas town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Q4QWFm2SOyjeJniHi8ncTRc2iU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:153715'),
  ('549242622721978510', 'The Vince Staples Show', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Maurice Williams, Vince Staples, Ian Edelman', null, 'Vince Staples', 'TV-MA', 'Kind of famous and sort of rich, rapper and actor Vince Staples navigates the challenges and surprises of everyday life in his hometown of The Beach.', 'Kind of famous and sort of rich, rapper and actor Vince Staples navigates the challenges and surprises of everyday life in his hometown of The Beach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gyUKo6ILKVwuiVq4EWv1avEXpBp.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:243861'),
  ('1023049320770017488', 'The Vineyard', 2021, 'Drama', 'Susana López Rubio', null, 'Leonor Watling, Rafael Novoa, Emilio Gutiérrez Caba, Juana Acosta, Esmeralda Pimentel, Nathaniel Parker, Alejandro de la Madrid, Raúl Briones', 'TV-MA', 'Mauro Larrea and Soledad Montalvo are two strangers whose destinies cross in the second half of the 19th century, leading to their lives changing forever. A history of glories and defeats, of silver mines, family intrigues, vineyards, wineries, and fascinating cities whose splendor faded over time.', 'Mauro Larrea and Soledad Montalvo are two strangers whose destinies cross in the second half of the 19th century, leading to their lives changing forever. A history of glories and defeats, of silver mines, family intrigues, vineyards, wineries, and fascinating cities whose splendor faded over time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/koLnCEa4Pzm9d5IQQeBjaCAIRJz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:118587'),
  ('593286014413908262', 'The Virgin Queen', 2006, 'Drama', null, 'Paula Milne', 'Anne-Marie Duff, Tom Hardy, Ian Hart, Dexter Fletcher, Joanne Whalley, Ben Daniels, Kevin McKidd, Emilia Fox', null, 'The Virgin Queen explores the full sweep of Elizabeth''s life: from her days of fear as a potential victim of her sister''s terror; through her great love affair with Robert Dudley; into her years of triumph over the Armada; and finally her old age and her last, enigmatic relationship with her young protégé, the Earl of Essex.', 'The Virgin Queen explores the full sweep of Elizabeth''s life: from her days of fear as a potential victim of her sister''s terror; through her great love affair with Robert Dudley; into her years of triumph over the Armada; and finally her old age and her last, enigmatic relationship with her young protégé, the Earl of Essex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcjkkS23K7EKZv5vLLjqidI3Fmc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13710'),
  ('596191662972857624', 'The Virgin Wife', 2005, 'Drama, Soap', 'Caridad Bravo Adams, Liliana Abud', null, 'Lilia Aragón, Adela Noriega, Jorge Salinas, Sergio Sendel, Delia Casanova, Roberto Ballesteros, Alejandro Ruiz, Luis Bayardo', null, 'La esposa virgen is a Mexican telenovela that first aired in 2005. Produced by Salvador Mejia, it starred Adela Noriega and Jorge Salinas.', 'La esposa virgen is a Mexican telenovela that first aired in 2005. Produced by Salvador Mejia, it starred Adela Noriega and Jorge Salinas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hOEP6jdY4INbHl53RpBnBaukJbS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40298'),
  ('1076731048322393463', 'The Virginian', 1962, 'Western, Drama', null, null, 'Doug McClure, James Drury, Lee Majors, Stewart Granger', 'TV-PG', 'The Shiloh Ranch in Wyoming Territory of the 1890s is owned in sequence by Judge Henry Garth, the Grainger brothers, and Colonel Alan MacKenzie. It is the setting for a variety of stories, many more based on character and relationships than the usual western.', 'The Shiloh Ranch in Wyoming Territory of the 1890s is owned in sequence by Judge Henry Garth, the Grainger brothers, and Colonel Alan MacKenzie. It is the setting for a variety of stories, many more based on character and relationships than the usual western.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oAbCE44r6wtmAnfzZI2SxyeaBmW.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:10180'),
  ('648228221818583994', 'The Virtues', 2019, 'Drama', 'Shane Meadows', null, 'Stephen Graham, Niamh Algar, Helen Behan, Frank Laverty, Mark O''Halloran, Deirdre Donnelly, James Nelson-Joyce, Liam Carney', 'TV-MA', 'Joseph falls into despair when his nine-year-old son Shea leaves for Australia with his ex Debbie. Suffering the hangover from hell, he walks away from his present life and boards a boat bound for Ireland to confront memories from his childhood.', 'Joseph falls into despair when his nine-year-old son Shea leaves for Australia with his ex Debbie. Suffering the hangover from hell, he walks away from his present life and boards a boat bound for Ireland to confront memories from his childhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xj6eGPbkGGoGW8vSTZdSF2svBZt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87932'),
  ('174625759789717170', 'The Vision of Escaflowne', 1996, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Shoji Kawamori', 'Ryota Yamaguchi', 'Maaya Sakamoto, Tomokazu Seki, Shin-ichiro Miki, Mayumi Izuka, Minami Takayama, Jouji Nakata, Yuri Amano, Ikue Otani', 'TV-14', 'High school student Hitomi is transported from Earth to the magical world of Gaea, where she meets boy prince Van Fanel, and is caught up in his quest to unite the countries of Gaea against the ominous Zaibach empire. On the way, she discovers an hidden ability and strives to unravel layers of mystery surrounding Van, his past, and the giant machine known as Escaflowne.', 'High school student Hitomi is transported from Earth to the magical world of Gaea, where she meets boy prince Van Fanel, and is caught up in his quest to unite the countries of Gaea against the ominous Zaibach empire. On the way, she discovers an hidden ability and strives to unravel layers of mystery surrounding Van, his past, and the giant machine known as Escaflowne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6uX0Q7Sn9JYWbHqQ5ZRJoJKcTmp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8779'),
  ('527061499549554698', 'The Visitor', 1997, 'Drama', 'Dean Devlin', null, 'John Corbett, Grand L. Bush, Leon Rippy, John Storey, Steve Railsback', null, 'The Visitor is a science fiction television series created by Roland Emmerich and Dean Devlin which aired on Fox from 1997–1998. It starred John Corbett as Adam McArthur who was abducted by extraterrestrials 50 years earlier and escapes back to Earth to help improve life for humanity.', 'The Visitor is a science fiction television series created by Roland Emmerich and Dean Devlin which aired on Fox from 1997–1998. It starred John Corbett as Adam McArthur who was abducted by extraterrestrials 50 years earlier and escapes back to Earth to help improve life for humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tlJR5IMAp4eZC66H8VoeSAXxPmp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12011'),
  ('823270416424433226', 'The Visitor from the Future', 2009, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'François Descraques', 'François Descraques', 'Florent Dorin, Raphaël Descraques, Slimane-Baptiste Berhoun, Mathieu Poggi, Isabel Jeannin, Justine Le Pottier, Sabine Perraud, Samuel Brafman', null, 'The Visitor from the Future is a cross-media series that combines comedy and science fiction. Since its launch in April 2009, it was viewed 5 million times on the French web and was aired on the TV channel NOLIFE.', 'The Visitor from the Future is a cross-media series that combines comedy and science fiction. Since its launch in April 2009, it was viewed 5 million times on the French web and was aired on the TV channel NOLIFE.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMZ9zp2P6qWm4kMz4PwkDU5qN1E.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:60013'),
  ('177377612743945458', 'The Visitors', 1983, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family, Comedy', 'Jindřich Polák, Ota Hofman', null, null, null, 'It''s the year 2484 and the Earth is threatened by a rogue comet which could fatally change its orbit. The solution is surprising - Adam Bernau, the greatest genius of 20th century developed 500 years ago an ingenious formula for easy transporting of continents and even worlds. Unfortunately, he made this discovery at the age of 11 and the exercise book containing it was destroyed in the fire. But this is not a challenge to Academic Filip who decides to send an expedition back in time to retrieve the precious exercise book from the fire. But everything is not so simple as it seems...', 'It''s the year 2484 and the Earth is threatened by a rogue comet which could fatally change its orbit. The solution is surprising - Adam Bernau, the greatest genius of 20th century developed 500 years ago an ingenious formula for easy transporting of continents and even worlds. Unfortunately, he made this discovery at the age of 11 and the exercise book containing it was destroyed in the fire. But this is not a challenge to Academic Filip who decides to send an expedition back in time to retrieve the precious exercise book from the fire. But everything is not so simple as it seems...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dY0e2zKHhgwOmp21QlGOAu8YgFu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5464'),
  ('478457439228552896', 'The Voice', 2011, 'Reality', 'Roel van Velzen, John de Mol', null, 'Carson Daly, Adam Levine, Kelly Clarkson, John Legend', 'TV-PG', 'The strongest vocalists from across the United states compete in a blockbusters vocal competition, the winner becomes “The Voice.” The show''s innovative format features four stages of competition: the blind auditions, the battle rounds, the knockouts and, finally, the live performance shows.', 'The strongest vocalists from across the United states compete in a blockbusters vocal competition, the winner becomes “The Voice.” The show''s innovative format features four stages of competition: the blind auditions, the battle rounds, the knockouts and, finally, the live performance shows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8jgjykcCuQ5rYreyqba4mazNKYd.jpg', 29, 'tmdb:tv:37678'),
  ('276049544053250833', 'The Voice', 2012, 'Reality', 'John de Mol', null, 'Sonia Kruger, Kate Miller-Heidke, Melanie C, Ronan Keating, Richard Marx', 'NR', 'Contestants compete in a singing competition that focuses on the quality of their voice.', 'Contestants compete in a singing competition that focuses on the quality of their voice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t79aBTcPC4vEeeDMv8cWE9tnVwe.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:39845'),
  ('54206989750544368', 'The Voice', 2025, 'Reality', 'John de Mol', null, 'Bryn Terfel, Aleighcia Scott, Ywain Gwynedd, Bronwen Lewis, Sian Eleri', null, '"Y Llais" is the Welsh-language adaptation of the globally popular singing competition, The Voice. Airing on S4C, the show features four renowned coaches searching for the best Welsh-speaking vocal talent. Contestants compete through blind auditions, battles, and live performances, aiming to win the title of Y Llais champion. With a focus on vocal ability and mentorship, the series celebrates the rich musical heritage of Wales.', '"Y Llais" is the Welsh-language adaptation of the globally popular singing competition, The Voice. Airing on S4C, the show features four renowned coaches searching for the best Welsh-speaking vocal talent. Contestants compete through blind auditions, battles, and live performances, aiming to win the title of Y Llais champion. With a focus on vocal ability and mentorship, the series celebrates the rich musical heritage of Wales.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yb4zib3ua021MiEwA1MPUx2QMC4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:284226'),
  ('490545557673447590', 'The Voice - Norges beste stemme', 2012, 'Reality', null, null, 'Espen Lind, Jarle Bernhoft, Marion Ravn, Ingebjørg Bratland', null, 'A reality singing competition, featuring blind auditions where coaches, who are popular artists, select and train singing talents based solely on their voice. The show emphasizes vocal quality, with coaches occasionally performing alongside their chosen talents.', 'A reality singing competition, featuring blind auditions where coaches, who are popular artists, select and train singing talents based solely on their voice. The show emphasizes vocal quality, with coaches occasionally performing alongside their chosen talents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUclkMi49cD6t0nCrG9kAm4rIih.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:115528'),
  ('685794676227738342', 'The Voice (The Treasured of China)', 2020, 'Reality', null, null, 'Huan Chen, Lars Huang, Jike Junyi, Liu Yuning, Sitar Tan, Heye Wang, Roy Wang, Yitai Wang', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xqVefZwWSe0Z0aLtzW1lAoC9WUU.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:116777'),
  ('513283913423154281', 'The Voice Comeback Stage', 2021, null, null, null, 'Maarten Vancoillie, Dorothee Dauwe', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fvIv0KKwN4woy55YL3OJD7KMkq2.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:118113'),
  ('537596835457782945', 'The Voice Kids', 2017, 'Reality, Kids, Family', 'John de Mol', null, 'will.i.am, Ronan Keating, Pixie Lott, Danny Jones', 'TV-G', 'Talented young solo singers between the ages of 7 and 14 wow coaches and audiences alike in a bid to become the next big thing!', 'Talented young solo singers between the ages of 7 and 14 wow coaches and audiences alike in a bid to become the next big thing!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/azrvY3RNyN3xhsAVJdVC6zjVmRh.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:72235'),
  ('462103509969080709', 'The Voice of Holland', 2010, 'Reality', 'John de Mol, Roel van Velzen', null, 'Chantal Janzen, Edson da Graça, Ilse DeLange, Wiwa, Suzan Stortelder, Freek Rikkerink, Dinand Woesthoff', null, 'Dutch reality singing competition where four coaches, themselves popular performing artists, train the talents in their group and occasionally perform with them. Talents are selected in blind auditions, where the coaches cannot see, but only hear the auditioner.', 'Dutch reality singing competition where four coaches, themselves popular performing artists, train the talents in their group and occasionally perform with them. Talents are selected in blind auditions, where the coaches cannot see, but only hear the auditioner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdmBc06TSVeNb917e7vLY0iCkwT.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:37734'),
  ('787281747764447131', 'The Voice Spain', 2012, 'Reality', 'John de Mol', null, 'Malú, Pablo López, MIKA, Sebastián Yatra, Eva González', 'NR', 'La Voz is a Spanish reality talent show that premiered on 19 September 2012 on Telecinco. It is part of the international syndication The Voice based on the original Dutch television program The Voice of Holland, created by Dutch television producer John de Mol. One of the important premises of the show is the quality of the singing talent. Four coaches, themselves popular performing artists, train the talents in their group and occasionally perform with them. Talents are selected in blind auditions, where the coaches cannot see, but only hear the audition. The series is hosted by Jesús Vázquez, with Tania Llasera as social media correspondent. The original judging panel consisted of David Bisbal, Rosario Flores, Malú and Melendi as the four coaches. In the second season, Antonio Orozco replaced Melendi.', 'La Voz is a Spanish reality talent show that premiered on 19 September 2012 on Telecinco. It is part of the international syndication The Voice based on the original Dutch television program The Voice of Holland, created by Dutch television producer John de Mol. One of the important premises of the show is the quality of the singing talent. Four coaches, themselves popular performing artists, train the talents in their group and occasionally perform with them. Talents are selected in blind auditions, where the coaches cannot see, but only hear the audition. The series is hosted by Jesús Vázquez, with Tania Llasera as social media correspondent. The original judging panel consisted of David Bisbal, Rosario Flores, Malú and Melendi as the four coaches. In the second season, Antonio Orozco replaced Melendi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qQDBMAuf2OSTsFE2u9yIUBPtndG.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:60216'),
  ('775713851889283716', 'The Voice UK', 2012, 'Reality', 'John de Mol, Roel van Velzen', null, 'Emma Willis, will.i.am, Tom Jones, LeAnn Rimes, Tom Fletcher, Danny Jones', null, 'A vocal contest reality series featuring people with real talent and great voices. Only the very best singers make it through the the blind auditions, the decisions from the four celebrity coaches are based solely on the voices they hear - and nothing else.', 'A vocal contest reality series featuring people with real talent and great voices. Only the very best singers make it through the the blind auditions, the decisions from the four celebrity coaches are based solely on the voices they hear - and nothing else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKD4UgvZwn0MIAAwp5fEx5Z68J2.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:39614'),
  ('109004572577636563', 'The Voice van Vlaanderen', 2011, 'Reality', 'John de Mol, Roel van Velzen', null, 'An Lemmens, Koen Wauters, Mathieu Terryn, Laura Tesoro, Aster Nzeyimana, Joost Klein, Dorothee Dauwe, Maarten Vancoillie', null, 'The Voice van Vlaanderen is a Belgian reality singing competition for the Flemish part of Belgium, and which is part of the franchise that started in the Netherlands as The Voice of Holland. It kicked-off on November 25, 2011 on VTM, shortly before the francophone Belgian variant The Voice Belgique went on air. A second season of The Voice van Vlaanderen for the 2012-13 season has started. One of the important premises of the show is the quality of the singing talent. Four coaches, themselves popular performing artists, train the talents in their group and occasionally perform with them. Talents are selected in blind auditions, where the coaches cannot see, but only hear the auditioner.', 'The Voice van Vlaanderen is a Belgian reality singing competition for the Flemish part of Belgium, and which is part of the franchise that started in the Netherlands as The Voice of Holland. It kicked-off on November 25, 2011 on VTM, shortly before the francophone Belgian variant The Voice Belgique went on air. A second season of The Voice van Vlaanderen for the 2012-13 season has started. One of the important premises of the show is the quality of the singing talent. Four coaches, themselves popular performing artists, train the talents in their group and occasionally perform with them. Talents are selected in blind auditions, where the coaches cannot see, but only hear the auditioner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x20iKgiKEHSpZEOxkZ6lrOl0fjE.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:51668'),
  ('751736931244953043', 'The Voronins', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Lew Schneider, Phil Rosenthal', 'Sergey Nezhdanov', 'Georgiy Dronov, Ekaterina Volkova, Stanislav Duzhnikov, Anna Frolovtseva, Maria Ilykhina, Boris Klyuev, Yulia Kuvarzina, Vera Tarasova', null, 'The main characters of the series are an ordinary family. The family consists of the following: Kostya, his wife Vera and their children: Masha and the twins Philip and Kirill. Right on the same landing, where the apartment of the young Voronin family is located, Kostya’s parents live: Galina Ivanovna, Nikolai Petrovich and Lyonya - Kostya''s older brother.', 'The main characters of the series are an ordinary family. The family consists of the following: Kostya, his wife Vera and their children: Masha and the twins Philip and Kirill. Right on the same landing, where the apartment of the young Voronin family is located, Kostya’s parents live: Galina Ivanovna, Nikolai Petrovich and Lyonya - Kostya''s older brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lKW2c9KrIhKy272AYZCzY2SSVcM.jpg', 24, 'tmdb:tv:46078'),
  ('1079813867346055101', 'The Vortex', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Juan Pablo Urrego, Viviana Serna, Nelson Camayo, Nicole Santamaría, Tatiana Ariza, Mónica Layton, Lucas Buelvas, Jose Lombana', null, 'This adaptation of the Colombian literary classic follows a wealthy young woman and an idealist poet, two rebellious lovers who flee from the rules of the 20th century into a jungle promising freedom, unaware that an even crueler law reigns there.', 'This adaptation of the Colombian literary classic follows a wealthy young woman and an idealist poet, two rebellious lovers who flee from the rules of the 20th century into a jungle promising freedom, unaware that an even crueler law reigns there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dmugDcvWe093MbV7YcRCSUeIUoS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:296298'),
  ('697368304504034819', 'The Vow', 2020, 'Documentary, Crime, Drama', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'The docuseries follows people deeply involved in the group NXIVM — which is faced with various charges, including sex trafficking and racketeering conspiracy — over the course of several years.', 'The docuseries follows people deeply involved in the group NXIVM — which is faced with various charges, including sex trafficking and racketeering conspiracy — over the course of several years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7AwKXXri13OIiGJIYhVELkx4pb5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:49920'),
  ('493888667469466974', 'The Wacky World of Tex Avery', 1997, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Billy West, Kathleen Barr, Lee Tockar, Cree Summer, Ian James Corlett, Alec Willows, Terry Klassen, Maurice LaMarche', null, 'A series of belly-laugh-funny short segments each starring different characters including the Roman centurion Pompeii Pete, an inept conqueror and the little princess he cannot conquer, the lamest super hero on 4 legs, the world''s first inventor, the ultra pesky Freddie the Fly and the wackiest hero in the old West, Tex Avery himself.', 'A series of belly-laugh-funny short segments each starring different characters including the Roman centurion Pompeii Pete, an inept conqueror and the little princess he cannot conquer, the lamest super hero on 4 legs, the world''s first inventor, the ultra pesky Freddie the Fly and the wackiest hero in the old West, Tex Avery himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSP3XK3yknjJln9LinTmsvECHYI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8123'),
  ('135653907147539188', 'The Wagner Method', 2020, 'Crime', 'Eric Vérat', null, 'Gil Alma, Olivia Côte, Joséphine de Meaux, Fanny Cottençon, Etienne Diallo, Coralie Russier, Soufiane Guerrab, Amaury de Crayencour', null, 'Police Captain César Wagner is a compulsive hypochondriac, obsessed with his work. His singular, distinctive style unsettles not only his suspects but also the members of his squad.', 'Police Captain César Wagner is a compulsive hypochondriac, obsessed with his work. His singular, distinctive style unsettles not only his suspects but also the members of his squad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dXN5qNSd3321JS6e704VGINBS4k.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114193'),
  ('388657037341185930', 'The Wakos', 2013, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Balak', null, 'Jeanne Chartier, Thierry Simon, Guillaume Darnault, Baptiste Lorber, Kévin Razy, Pauline Moingeon, Marion Séclin, Brigitte Lecordier', null, 'The crisis saves nobody. Even not the characters of our childhood. To such a point that some people of them even became socially disadvantaged persons. Fortunately for them, all is not lost and a brave social worker decided to deal with their case. Come in his office and assist its confidential interviews with Aspegix and Grodebilix, Zizimir, Sandy, Proumfs, Mr Patatos, Marius and Gigi, the Tortoises Tramps and all Kassos which suffer in the biggest indifference.', 'The crisis saves nobody. Even not the characters of our childhood. To such a point that some people of them even became socially disadvantaged persons. Fortunately for them, all is not lost and a brave social worker decided to deal with their case. Come in his office and assist its confidential interviews with Aspegix and Grodebilix, Zizimir, Sandy, Proumfs, Mr Patatos, Marius and Gigi, the Tortoises Tramps and all Kassos which suffer in the biggest indifference.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e8QQghtMh5iPkp10YSJBEww3nU5.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:66038'),
  ('1003503713388346238', 'The Walk-In', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jeff Pope', 'Jeff Pope', 'Stephen Graham, Jason Flemyng, Leanne Best, Andrew Ellis, Chris Coghill, Dean-Charles Chapman, Sami Amber', null, 'Forced to flee the UK and go into hiding in the 1990s, when he became a mole from within the BNP, Matthew Collins returned to Britain to make a new life for himself, working with young white men in the fight against radicalisation.', 'Forced to flee the UK and go into hiding in the 1990s, when he became a mole from within the BNP, Matthew Collins returned to Britain to make a new life for himself, working with young white men in the fight against radicalisation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67lqoQrhvby2iNfNQnFGZgXemfB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210664'),
  ('536707534081210923', 'The Walking Dead', 2010, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Frank Darabont', null, 'Lauren Cohan, Norman Reedus, Jeffrey Dean Morgan, Melissa McBride, Christian Serratos, Seth Gilliam, Ross Marquand, Josh McDermitt', 'TV-MA', 'Sheriff''s deputy Rick Grimes awakens from a coma to find a post-apocalyptic world dominated by flesh-eating zombies. He sets out to find his family and encounters many other survivors along the way.', 'Sheriff''s deputy Rick Grimes awakens from a coma to find a post-apocalyptic world dominated by flesh-eating zombies. He sets out to find his family and encounters many other survivors along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3OIDrCErUjthsnPPreY7XktQXB.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:1402'),
  ('460263437217127911', 'The Walking Dead: Daryl Dixon', 2023, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'David Zabel', null, 'Norman Reedus, Melissa McBride, Eduardo Noriega, Óscar Jaenada, Alexandra Masangkay, Hugo Arbues, Candela Saitta', 'TV-MA', 'The Walking Dead: Daryl Dixon follows Daryl (Norman Reedus) after he washes ashore in France, navigating a fractured, walker-infested landscape to find his way home. As the fifth spin-off, it focuses on Daryl protecting a young boy, Laurent, who is seen as a messiah, while facing new, dangerous walker variants and the "Power of the Living" paramilitary group.', 'The Walking Dead: Daryl Dixon follows Daryl (Norman Reedus) after he washes ashore in France, navigating a fractured, walker-infested landscape to find his way home. As the fifth spin-off, it focuses on Daryl protecting a young boy, Laurent, who is seen as a messiah, while facing new, dangerous walker variants and the "Power of the Living" paramilitary group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sP5QdW9FN18XWcA4ROz3MPAQBTx.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:211684'),
  ('1125066767041492204', 'The Walking Dead: Dead City', 2023, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Eli Jorné', null, 'Lauren Cohan, Jeffrey Dean Morgan, Željko Ivanek, Gaius Charles, Logan Kim, Mahina Napoleon, Lisa Emery, Dascha Polanco', 'TV-MA', 'Maggie and Negan travel to post-apocalyptic Manhattan - long ago cut off from the mainland. The crumbling city is filled with the dead and denizens who have made it a world full of anarchy, danger, beauty, and terror.', 'Maggie and Negan travel to post-apocalyptic Manhattan - long ago cut off from the mainland. The crumbling city is filled with the dead and denizens who have made it a world full of anarchy, danger, beauty, and terror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wq3vuQzQgbS83zX3malAFWMsSwX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:194583'),
  ('310069264077415959', 'The Walking Dead: Origins', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Norman Reedus, Melissa McBride, Jeffrey Dean Morgan, Lauren Cohan', null, 'The Walking Dead: Origins is a series of specials exploring the journeys of the series'' most celebrated characters. Each episode charts the story of the zombie apocalypse from the point of view of a single character and features new interviews and narrations from the actors that portray these iconic characters, interwoven with clips from the most pivotal moments of their journeys so far.', 'The Walking Dead: Origins is a series of specials exploring the journeys of the series'' most celebrated characters. Each episode charts the story of the zombie apocalypse from the point of view of a single character and features new interviews and narrations from the actors that portray these iconic characters, interwoven with clips from the most pivotal moments of their journeys so far.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6stEKYqgLBhSieTRnnZ5ShE5ZPS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129035'),
  ('540325960856471320', 'The Walking Dead: Red Machete', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Follow the path of the red-handled weapon from its innocent beginnings, as it lands in the hands of survivors good and evil, familiar and new.', 'Follow the path of the red-handled weapon from its innocent beginnings, as it lands in the hands of survivors good and evil, familiar and new.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8gILQcNOrMFNzKqN307vih44G7a.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233436'),
  ('106628546119039602', 'The Walking Dead: The Ones Who Live', 2024, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Andrew Lincoln, Scott M. Gimple, Danai Gurira', 'Nana Nkweti', 'Andrew Lincoln, Danai Gurira, Pollyanna McIntosh', 'TV-MA', 'Rick and Michonne are thrown into another world, built on a war against the dead... And ultimately, a war against the living. Can they find each other and who they were in a place and situation unlike any they''ve ever known before? Are they enemies? Lovers? Victims? Victors? Without each other, are they even alive – or will they find that they, too, are the Walking Dead?', 'Rick and Michonne are thrown into another world, built on a war against the dead... And ultimately, a war against the living. Can they find each other and who they were in a place and situation unlike any they''ve ever known before? Are they enemies? Lovers? Victims? Victors? Without each other, are they even alive – or will they find that they, too, are the Walking Dead?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ywbacot78IuNhGW4uVZPxxxVTkm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:206586'),
  ('473778038722147466', 'The Walking Dead: World Beyond', 2020, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Scott M. Gimple, Matthew Negrete', null, 'Aliyah Royale, Alexa Mansour, Hal Cumpston, Nicolas Cantu, Nico Tortorella, Annet Mahendru, Joe Holt, Natalie Gold', 'TV-MA', 'A heroic group of teens sheltered from the dangers of the post-apocalyptic world receive a message that inspires them to leave the safety of the only home they have ever known and embark on a cross-country journey to find the one man who can possibly save the world.', 'A heroic group of teens sheltered from the dangers of the post-apocalyptic world receive a message that inspires them to leave the safety of the only home they have ever known and embark on a cross-country journey to find the one man who can possibly save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HanIV2hTLE2w7A5bI1KJb3bTL7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:94305'),
  ('321946130891917147', 'The Wall', 2016, 'Reality', null, null, 'Chris Hardwick', 'TV-PG', 'Game show in which correct answers cause a green ball to fall down the wall adding the value of the slot to the players'' winning total and a missed question causes an ominous red ball to fall and deduct the value from the team''s total. Teammates have to work together to build a huge cash prize.', 'Game show in which correct answers cause a green ball to fall down the wall adding the value of the slot to the players'' winning total and a missed question causes an ominous red ball to fall and deduct the value from the team''s total. Teammates have to work together to build a huge cash prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bKORjL8BOISHkz4HSOW8uBp2I1W.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:69153'),
  ('216743712549257757', 'The Wallflower', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Tomoko Hayakawa', null, 'Showtaro Morikubo, Hirofumi Nojima, Yukiko Takaguchi, Yuuya Yamauchi, Tomokazu Sugita, Mai Nakahara, Yuka Komatsu, Norihisa Mori', 'TV-14', 'It''s a gorgeous, spacious mansion, and four handsome, fifteen-year-old friends are allowed to live in it for free! There''s only one condition—that within three years the guys must transform the owner''s wallflower niece into a lady befitting the palace in which they all live! How hard can it be? Enter Sunako Nakahara, the agoraphobic, horror-movie-loving, pockmark-faced, frizzy-haired, fashion-illiterate recluse who tends to break into explosive nosebleeds whenever she sees anyone attractive. This project is going to take more than our four heroes ever expected: it needs a miracle!', 'It''s a gorgeous, spacious mansion, and four handsome, fifteen-year-old friends are allowed to live in it for free! There''s only one condition—that within three years the guys must transform the owner''s wallflower niece into a lady befitting the palace in which they all live! How hard can it be? Enter Sunako Nakahara, the agoraphobic, horror-movie-loving, pockmark-faced, frizzy-haired, fashion-illiterate recluse who tends to break into explosive nosebleeds whenever she sees anyone attractive. This project is going to take more than our four heroes ever expected: it needs a miracle!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zlcuBwbCHki0oWplNQhHhStYwFn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:899'),
  ('373317846916305351', 'The Waltons', 1972, 'Drama', 'Earl Hamner, Jr.', null, 'Ralph Waite, Jon Walmsley, Mary Elizabeth McDonough, David W. Harper, Earl Hamner, Jr., Eric Scott, Kami Cotler, Joe Conley', 'TV-G', 'The Waltons live their life in a rural Virginia community during the Great Depression and World War II.', 'The Waltons live their life in a rural Virginia community during the Great Depression and World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/51HX9eNn5ZPjRIngDvnk4KzFb1a.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:5021'),
  ('571429102974923010', 'The Wanted Detective', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Zhang Yunxiao', 'Zhang Yunxiao', 'Wang Xingyue, Xiang Hanzhi, Chen Youwei, Zhang Nan, He Luoluo, Deng Kai, Feng Hui, Du Yuming', 'TV-14', 'Framed as the notorious Night Devil on his wedding day, top detective Xiao Beiming is accused of murder and treason, forcing him to flee. Three years later, he returns to the capital, earning the trust of his apprentice sister, Zhong Xueman. With a team of fearless allies, he unravels a series of mysterious cases, to expose the real Night Devil and restore order to Da Qi.', 'Framed as the notorious Night Devil on his wedding day, top detective Xiao Beiming is accused of murder and treason, forcing him to flee. Three years later, he returns to the capital, earning the trust of his apprentice sister, Zhong Xueman. With a team of fearless allies, he unravels a series of mysterious cases, to expose the real Night Devil and restore order to Da Qi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4bGLAKdqOqrCR2oGuQGrdR51Piq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:253955'),
  ('836374250392664688', 'The War', 2007, 'Documentary, War & Politics, Crime', null, null, 'Keith David, Tom Hanks, Josh Lucas, Bobby Cannavale, Samuel L. Jackson, Eli Wallach, Robert Wahlberg, Adam Arkin', 'TV-14', 'The story of the Second World War through the personal accounts of a handful of men and women from four American towns. The war touched the lives of every family on every street in every town in America and demonstrated that in extraordinary times, there are no ordinary lives.', 'The story of the Second World War through the personal accounts of a handful of men and women from four American towns. The war touched the lives of every family on every street in every town in America and demonstrated that in extraordinary times, there are no ordinary lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s2pJDvs6LZdijaiWCdSuLRkDryV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31750'),
  ('179910209353617809', 'The War at Home', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Rob Lotterstein', null, 'Michael Rapaport, Anita Barone, Kaylee DeFer, Kyle Sullivan, Dean Collins', null, 'When Dave and Vicky were growing up, their parents had it easy. Back then, there were no “time-outs,” no one had any “boundaries,” and “parenting” wasn’t even a word. Parents had no idea what their kids were really up to and ignorance truly was bliss. Now Dave and Vicky have teenagers of their own, and anything their kids might even think about doing, Dave and Vicky have already done… at least twice.', 'When Dave and Vicky were growing up, their parents had it easy. Back then, there were no “time-outs,” no one had any “boundaries,” and “parenting” wasn’t even a word. Parents had no idea what their kids were really up to and ignorance truly was bliss. Now Dave and Vicky have teenagers of their own, and anything their kids might even think about doing, Dave and Vicky have already done… at least twice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f19CYSWxJ1oYn5Gp0MM2pYbtvjC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2262'),
  ('1146961504913749821', 'The War Between the Land and the Sea', 2025, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Russell T Davies', null, 'Russell Tovey, Gugu Mbatha-Raw, Jemma Redgrave, Ruth Madeley', null, 'When a fearsome and ancient species emerges from the ocean, dramatically revealing themselves to humanity, an international crisis is triggered. With the entire population at risk, UNIT step into action as the land and sea wage war.', 'When a fearsome and ancient species emerges from the ocean, dramatically revealing themselves to humanity, an international crisis is triggered. With the entire population at risk, UNIT step into action as the land and sea wage war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4wDU61HtpXbcwpgCy1xnodxKRYN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259886'),
  ('124209135126653116', 'The War Next-door', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Carolina Rivera, Fernando Sariñana', null, 'Luz Aldán', 'TV-MA', 'When two antagonistic families end up living next door in a posh neighborhood, the matriarchs ensue a full-scale war of unintended consequences.', 'When two antagonistic families end up living next door in a posh neighborhood, the matriarchs ensue a full-scale war of unintended consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/btZ7EjWaap6bdPTGKefn9rsc4Ok.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:127571'),
  ('558567241051030619', 'The War of the Worlds', 2019, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Peter Harness', null, 'Eleanor Tomlinson, Rafe Spall, Robert Carlyle, Rupert Graves', 'TV-14', 'In Edwardian England, George and his partner Amy attempt to defy society and start a life together as they face the escalating terror of an alien invasion, fighting for their lives against an enemy beyond their comprehension.', 'In Edwardian England, George and his partner Amy attempt to defy society and start a life together as they face the escalating terror of an alien invasion, fighting for their lives against an enemy beyond their comprehension.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zcUkFaxUtP3V3YjoS1fh8YRW19H.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83981'),
  ('247018436116409287', 'The Warrior Princess', 2021, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Emir Khalilzadeh, Ayse Ferda Eryilmaz, Nehir Erdem', null, 'Ebru Şahin, Edip Tepeli, Selim Bayraktar, Kanbolat Görkem Arslan, Teoman Kumbaracıbaşı, Deniz Barut, Elif Doğan, Ipek Karapinar', null, 'The epic love between Akkiz, the legendary warrior mountain girl orphaned by Gök Khan Korkut Khan in the harsh steppes of Central Asia, and Gök Tegini Batuga, who was orphaned by Korkut Khan in the Gök Palace during Gokturk Khaganate.', 'The epic love between Akkiz, the legendary warrior mountain girl orphaned by Gök Khan Korkut Khan in the harsh steppes of Central Asia, and Gök Tegini Batuga, who was orphaned by Korkut Khan in the Gök Palace during Gokturk Khaganate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ptrQFvg6sB0ouJXllVUczvm0RXw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:136506'),
  ('184964172226643428', 'The Warrior Princess and the Barbaric King', 2026, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Sayumi Suzushiro, Satoshi Inomata, Hana Hishikawa, Aki Toyosaki', null, 'Serafina, the West’s fiercest knight, expected torture when captured by barbarians. Instead, she got a marriage proposal! Marrying her sworn enemy is a hard no! But after seeing her wedding captor’s culture and very pretty face, she may be tempted to swap her sword for a wedding veil. Get ready for the ultimate enemies-to-maybe-lovers arc.', 'Serafina, the West’s fiercest knight, expected torture when captured by barbarians. Instead, she got a marriage proposal! Marrying her sworn enemy is a hard no! But after seeing her wedding captor’s culture and very pretty face, she may be tempted to swap her sword for a wedding veil. Get ready for the ultimate enemies-to-maybe-lovers arc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hO5fLLMqteEopcYy5r0gQB1pWl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:273467'),
  ('144544420749501668', 'The Wasp', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jan Berger', null, 'Florian Lukas, Lisa Wagner, Leonard Scheicher, Sahin Eryilmaz, Matthias Matschke, Sophie Paasch', null, 'Professional dartsplayer Eddie is in a crisis. Fame gone, money gone, wife gone and physical fitness also leaves much to be desired. With the help of his old buddy Nobbe, who is also a rusty dart professional, but with a strong tendency towards alcohol, Eddie wants to find his way back into life and his career and to prove that he was not called "the wasp" for nothing. Easier said than done...', 'Professional dartsplayer Eddie is in a crisis. Fame gone, money gone, wife gone and physical fitness also leaves much to be desired. With the help of his old buddy Nobbe, who is also a rusty dart professional, but with a strong tendency towards alcohol, Eddie wants to find his way back into life and his career and to prove that he was not called "the wasp" for nothing. Easier said than done...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vizruHVly7Qt1OGToHo39900ImB.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:152474'),
  ('713529501955792505', 'The Watch', 2021, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Simon Allen', null, 'Richard Dormer, Lara Rossi, Marama Corlett, Adam Hugill, Joni Ayton-Kent, Samuel Adewunmi, Bianca Simone Mannie', 'TV-14', 'A group of misfit cops rise up from decades of helplessness to save their corrupt city from catastrophe. Inspired by the characters created by Sir Terry Pratchett’s famous “Discworld” novels.', 'A group of misfit cops rise up from decades of helplessness to save their corrupt city from catastrophe. Inspired by the characters created by Sir Terry Pratchett’s famous “Discworld” novels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ZNamnEnExlzyEcbpg0tBviNEDc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94235'),
  ('356905517678539815', 'The Watcher', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Ian Brennan, Ryan Murphy', null, 'Naomi Watts, Bobby Cannavale, Isabel Gravitt, Luke David Blumm, Jennifer Coolidge, Margo Martindale, Richard Kind, Mia Farrow', 'TV-MA', 'A family moves into their suburban dream home, only to discover they''ve inherited a nightmare.', 'A family moves into their suburban dream home, only to discover they''ve inherited a nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6RrseODZo2e66XOzC1XMzMuecnf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210232'),
  ('478401435502102312', 'The Watchful Eye', 2023, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Julie Durk', null, 'Mariel Molino, Warren Christie, Kelly Bishop, Amy Acker, Jon Ecker, Lex Lumpkin, Henry Joseph Samiri, Aliyah Royale', 'TV-14', 'Elena Santos, a young woman with a complicated past, maneuvers her way into working as a live-in nanny for an affluent family in Manhattan. She quickly learns that everyone in the mysterious building has deadly secrets and ulterior motives. What they don''t know, however, is that Elena has some shocking secrets of her own.', 'Elena Santos, a young woman with a complicated past, maneuvers her way into working as a live-in nanny for an affluent family in Manhattan. She quickly learns that everyone in the mysterious building has deadly secrets and ulterior motives. What they don''t know, however, is that Elena has some shocking secrets of her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A72yzhDcZwGckHkQ7JzXyHUqCIO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:205440'),
  ('398375805896671143', 'The Water', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Salmon', null, 'Engfa Waraha, Charlotte Austin, Thanthip Thaweesinthanat, Suchita Oxman, Panichada Kongsawanya, Chutima Sodaphak, Sarocha Chankimha, Milin Watinthanakit', null, 'When Apo Wathinwanit, the heir to the Wathin Group hotel chain, meets a troublemaker, Chonlada, the new receptionist who comes to cause chaos and change the life of a talented female executive who is always focused on work. A relationship full of tricks, between a game of hate and love, which will reach the finish line first?', 'When Apo Wathinwanit, the heir to the Wathin Group hotel chain, meets a troublemaker, Chonlada, the new receptionist who comes to cause chaos and change the life of a talented female executive who is always focused on work. A relationship full of tricks, between a game of hate and love, which will reach the finish line first?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPGRtuthwLU1uxDnV1ofiHlLaUb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:287114'),
  ('4563695947708908', 'The Water Magician', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ayumu Murase, Kazuki Ura, Kaede Hondo, Genki Muro, Naoya Miyase, Kohei Amasaki, Kaori Ishihara, Sara Matsumoto', 'TV-14', 'Reincarnation had Ryo dreaming of peace, but instead he lands into a monster-infested wilderness. With water magic and eternal youth, he survives countless wicked concoctions for 20 years, becoming one of the most powerful magicians ever. Ryo’s fate shifts when he meets Abel, a genius knight, thrusting him into magical society’s spotlight. Thus, the Water Magician’s wild adventure begins!', 'Reincarnation had Ryo dreaming of peace, but instead he lands into a monster-infested wilderness. With water magic and eternal youth, he survives countless wicked concoctions for 20 years, becoming one of the most powerful magicians ever. Ryo’s fate shifts when he meets Abel, a genius knight, thrusting him into magical society’s spotlight. Thus, the Water Magician’s wild adventure begins!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GWz3D9aBgtn6pMiu3DTZL3h5ua.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:281615'),
  ('45979232405037146', 'The Water Margin', 1973, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Atsuo Nakamura, Sanae Tsuchida, Kei Satō, Takeshi Ōbayashi, Toshio Kurosawa, Makoto Satō, Teruhiko Aoi, Isamu Nagato', 'NR', 'The Water Margin is a Japanese television series based on Water Margin, one of the Four Great Classical Novels of Chinese literature. The novel details the trials and tribulations of 108 outlaws during the Song Dynasty. This adaptation follows Lin Chung and his clashes with the local government official Kao Chiu. The Water Margin is famous for its, sometimes obscure, but memorable philosophical quotes, such as "Do not despise the snake for having no horns,for who is to say it will not become a dragon?""', 'The Water Margin is a Japanese television series based on Water Margin, one of the Four Great Classical Novels of Chinese literature. The novel details the trials and tribulations of 108 outlaws during the Song Dynasty. This adaptation follows Lin Chung and his clashes with the local government official Kao Chiu. The Water Margin is famous for its, sometimes obscure, but memorable philosophical quotes, such as "Do not despise the snake for having no horns,for who is to say it will not become a dragon?""', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cawhgSjMdewqjDChm8iAk1HnDR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:34355'),
  ('939472768208795411', 'The Water Margin', 1998, 'Drama', null, null, null, 'TV-Y', 'The trials and tribulations of 108 outlaws during the mid Song Dynasty.', 'The trials and tribulations of 108 outlaws during the mid Song Dynasty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8E8qTBaSDTQKvy3BLG6nZGYRQfK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78132'),
  ('536090436161915220', 'The Waterfront', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Kevin Williamson', null, 'Holt McCallany, Melissa Benoist, Jake Weary, Rafael L. Silva, Humberly González, Danielle Campbell, Brady Hepner, Maria Bello', 'TV-MA', 'A prominent North Carolina fishing family wades into treacherous waters to keep their crumbling business empire afloat.', 'A prominent North Carolina fishing family wades into treacherous waters to keep their crumbling business empire afloat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uRzJaOysinMti88BGuu8m8shVCp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:254544'),
  ('546526051486736563', 'The Way', 2024, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Michael Sheen, James Graham, Adam Curtis', 'James Graham', 'Steffan Rhodri, Mali Harries, Sophie Melville, Callum Scott Howells, Michael Sheen, Teilo James Le Masurier, Maja Laskowska, Aneurin Barnard', null, 'Strikes in Port Talbot spark a revolution – and a family of fugitives go on the run. Facing impossible choices, what would you do?', 'Strikes in Port Talbot spark a revolution – and a family of fugitives go on the run. Facing impossible choices, what would you do?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xcTF1F6YWVrGTqrXatNkJL7ePPN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233285'),
  ('1036488257410690949', 'The Way Down: God, Greed, and the Cult of Gwen Shamblin', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Gwen Shamblin Lara, Joe Lara, Natasha Pavlovich, Megan Cox, Helen Byrd, Rafael Martinez, Gina Wilson, Rachel Phillips', 'TV-MA', 'Explore how the late Gwen Shamblin Lara, who founded the controversial Remnant Fellowship Church and created the Christian weight loss program The Weigh Down Workshop, rose to fame as a diet guru and church leader.', 'Explore how the late Gwen Shamblin Lara, who founded the controversial Remnant Fellowship Church and created the Christian weight loss program The Weigh Down Workshop, rose to fame as a diet guru and church leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uOr6OoVh9Q7REqLvD8ISy9mGLdj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:131561'),
  ('41149566653236527', 'The Way Home', 2023, 'Drama, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Alexandra Clarke, Heather Conkie, Marly Reed', null, 'Andie MacDowell, Chyler Leigh, Evan Williams, Sadie Laflamme-Snow', 'TV-PG', 'When three generations of women reunite after being estranged for more than two decades, they embark on an enlightening – and surprising – journey toward healing none of them could have imagined as they learn how to find their way back to each other.', 'When three generations of women reunite after being estranged for more than two decades, they embark on an enlightening – and surprising – journey toward healing none of them could have imagined as they learn how to find their way back to each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avKyE55YwWNSLE24IGDRSfpPnaJ.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:201836'),
  ('509930949212030254', 'The Way of the Househusband', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Manabu Uda', null, 'Hiroshi Tamaki, Haruna Kawaguchi, Jun Shison, Tina Tamashiro, Yuta Furukawa, Tamaki Shiratori, Naoto Takenaka, Izumi Inamori', 'TV-PG', 'An infamous yakuza sets out to master the Way of the Househusband! "The Immortal Dragon"—an infamous and feared yakuza who has left behind countless legends in the underworld—has decided to wash his hands of his dark past and become… a "househusband"! Under the watchful eye of the neighborhood, the yakuza, and the police, witness this gangster-turned-husband''s style of "justice and family love." A thrilling slapstick drama where the ultimate househusband faces struggles from every side! Can Tatsu protect his beloved family and neighborhood when they are caught up in an incident?', 'An infamous yakuza sets out to master the Way of the Househusband! "The Immortal Dragon"—an infamous and feared yakuza who has left behind countless legends in the underworld—has decided to wash his hands of his dark past and become… a "househusband"! Under the watchful eye of the neighborhood, the yakuza, and the police, witness this gangster-turned-husband''s style of "justice and family love." A thrilling slapstick drama where the ultimate househusband faces struggles from every side! Can Tatsu protect his beloved family and neighborhood when they are caught up in an incident?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kLUONufhEkWfyVEf8Npc3JQkgCU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106850'),
  ('369970795391047592', 'The Way of the Househusband', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Kenjiro Tsuda, Shizuka Itoh, Kazuyuki Okitsu', 'TV-MA', 'After disappearing from the underworld, the legendary yakuza known as the "Immortal Dragon" resurfaces — as a fiercely devoted stay-at-home husband.', 'After disappearing from the underworld, the legendary yakuza known as the "Immortal Dragon" resurfaces — as a fiercely devoted stay-at-home husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p63rAZt0s8kedJtdxGwD5VYZafc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:112160'),
  ('1066621216329342358', 'The Way We Live Now', 2001, 'Drama', null, null, 'David Suchet, Matthew Macfadyen, Cillian Murphy, Paloma Baeza, Cheryl Campbell, Richard Cant, Shirley Henderson, Tony Britton', null, 'Anthony Trollope’s epic tale of Victorian power and corruption, set in the 1870s. Within weeks of his arrival in London, financier Augustus Melmotte announces a railway is to be built from Salt Lake City to the Gulf of Mexico and entices distinguished members of England''s land-rich, cash-poor aristocracy into his web. Many are eager to sell their ailing land parcels to afford moving to London proper and naïve speculators are all lured in with promises of an instant fortune.', 'Anthony Trollope’s epic tale of Victorian power and corruption, set in the 1870s. Within weeks of his arrival in London, financier Augustus Melmotte announces a railway is to be built from Salt Lake City to the Gulf of Mexico and entices distinguished members of England''s land-rich, cash-poor aristocracy into his web. Many are eager to sell their ailing land parcels to afford moving to London proper and naïve speculators are all lured in with promises of an instant fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfPRBOrtKDT9bM70OQ2iSvE0BKH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:7827'),
  ('714113738136006477', 'The Way We Were', 2018, 'Drama', null, null, 'Tang Yan, Luo Jin, Yu Jiwei, Amelie Xu, Wang Tianchen, Ma Chengcheng, Gao Liwen, Qu Shanshan', null, 'Xiao Qing, the principled daughter of a heroic prosecutor, meets Shu Che, a classmate determined to distance himself from his corrupt father''s shadow. Their love blossoms, but when their fathers face off in a legal battle, their relationship is tested, forcing them to choose between love and duty.', 'Xiao Qing, the principled daughter of a heroic prosecutor, meets Shu Che, a classmate determined to distance himself from his corrupt father''s shadow. Their love blossoms, but when their fathers face off in a legal battle, their relationship is tested, forcing them to choose between love and duty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cJTZ8g3NIxa82a7ivEb6WR9KWGz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79421'),
  ('23086474597334636', 'The Wayans Bros.', 1995, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Shawn Wayans, Marlon Wayans, Anna Maria Horsford, John Witherspoon', 'TV-PG', 'Brothers Shawn and Marlon are on the lookout for money and success, though the two are complete opposites. Shawn is responsible and conservative while Marlon is free-spirited and liberal. They are not immune to sibling rivalry, but frequently enjoy being each other''s partner in crime.', 'Brothers Shawn and Marlon are on the lookout for money and success, though the two are complete opposites. Shawn is responsible and conservative while Marlon is free-spirited and liberal. They are not immune to sibling rivalry, but frequently enjoy being each other''s partner in crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmbV7HcX9hXvxSvd6WJDBg6GHtr.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:2297'),
  ('583702339514312281', 'The Weakest Link', 2001, 'Reality', null, null, 'Anne Robinson', 'NR', 'Anne Robinson hosts the quick-fire general knowledge quiz in which contestants must decide at the end of each round which of their number should be eliminated.', 'Anne Robinson hosts the quick-fire general knowledge quiz in which contestants must decide at the end of each round which of their number should be eliminated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZcC7EdRWfKSxBnyhEc9kS2hPaj.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:15127'),
  ('272757706410846071', 'The Weakest Link', 2021, 'Reality', 'Cathy Dunning, Fintan Coyle', 'Aiden Spackman', 'Romesh Ranganathan', null, 'Romesh Ranganathan takes charge of the back-stabbing big money game show. Can the contestants create a chain of answers and avoid the boot?', 'Romesh Ranganathan takes charge of the back-stabbing big money game show. Can the contestants create a chain of answers and avoid the boot?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zmOwXMeVWgRNmn8wVypnUZAhRgy.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:153720'),
  ('300395571848817307', 'The Weakest Tamer Began a Journey to Pick Up Trash', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Aina Suzuki, Mutsumi Tamura, Fumi Hirano, Kenta Miyake, Kohsuke Toriumi, Masaki Terasoma, Taku Yashiro, Hiroki Yasumoto', 'TV-14', 'Stars are everything, granting abilities to Tamers. So when Ivy was born without one, her village took it as an ill omen! Now banished, she leads a lonely life of salvaging rubbish to survive. That is until she befriends Sora, a weak little slime, in the forest. Together, the delicate duo embarks on a heartwarming journey of survival and discovers there’s more to Ivy than being starless.', 'Stars are everything, granting abilities to Tamers. So when Ivy was born without one, her village took it as an ill omen! Now banished, she leads a lonely life of salvaging rubbish to survive. That is until she befriends Sora, a weak little slime, in the forest. Together, the delicate duo embarks on a heartwarming journey of survival and discovers there’s more to Ivy than being starless.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/za2EAhBtO08JJw9Q25zKyrY5Jkd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214310'),
  ('521041213696842468', 'The Wednesday Play', 1964, 'Drama', 'Sydney Newman', null, null, null, 'An anthology series of television plays which aired on BBC1 from October 1964 to May 1970. The plays were usually written for television, although adaptations from other sources also featured.', 'An anthology series of television plays which aired on BBC1 from October 1964 to May 1970. The plays were usually written for television, although adaptations from other sources also featured.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJ3G30k2IjxHnipXobZJZKQZErR.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:11303'),
