  ('91123794311158327', 'The Weird Al Show', 1997, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Family', '''Weird Al'' Yankovic', null, '''Weird Al'' Yankovic, Brian Haley, Gary LeRoi Gray, Billy West, Beau Weaver, Danielle Weeks, Stan Freberg, Paula Jai Parker', 'TV-Y7', 'This Saturday morning hit brings Weird Al’s signature warped comedy, original songs, spoofs, offbeat animation, and a motley crew of surprise guests.', 'This Saturday morning hit brings Weird Al’s signature warped comedy, original songs, spoofs, offbeat animation, and a motley crew of surprise guests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rBoDRkqkZuliQYQRxKPFfEcA3zC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1518'),
  ('520188633719702991', 'The Wendy Williams Show', 2008, 'Talk', null, null, 'Leah Remini, Michelle Visage, Fat Joe, Remy Ma, Jerry Springer, Michael Rapaport, Sherri Shepherd, Whitney Cummings', 'TV-PG', 'Radio personality Wendy Williams is the host to her own live syndicated talk show. Wendy injects her television series with the same style that characterizes her radio show, and divides on-air time between probing celebrity interviews and advice-giving to audience members.', 'Radio personality Wendy Williams is the host to her own live syndicated talk show. Wendy injects her television series with the same style that characterizes her radio show, and divides on-air time between probing celebrity interviews and advice-giving to audience members.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c57IMqWGHMyu8Q9fSdzIwpmH5np.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:21676'),
  ('363569065295108633', 'The West', 1996, 'Documentary', null, 'Geoffrey C. Ward, Stephen Ives', 'Peter Coyote, N. Scott Momaday, Murphy Guyer, John Trudell, Eli Wallach, Arthur Miller, John Lithgow, Gary Sinise', 'TV-PG', 'The West, sometimes marketed as Ken Burns Presents: The West, is a documentary film about the American Old West. It was directed by Stephen Ives and the executive producer was Ken Burns. The film originally aired on PBS in September 1996.', 'The West, sometimes marketed as Ken Burns Presents: The West, is a documentary film about the American Old West. It was directed by Stephen Ives and the executive producer was Ken Burns. The film originally aired on PBS in September 1996.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3QyHP8J67jc54QBC2PiozI3HrHH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:30715'),
  ('614146891772382232', 'The West Wing', 1999, 'Drama', 'Aaron Sorkin', null, 'Martin Sheen, Allison Janney, John Spencer, Bradley Whitford, Joshua Malina, Alan Alda, Jimmy Smits, Kristin Chenoweth', 'TV-14', 'The West Wing provides a glimpse into presidential politics in the nation''s capital as it tells the stories of the members of a fictional presidential administration. These interesting characters have humor and dedication that touches the heart while the politics that they discuss touch on everyday life.', 'The West Wing provides a glimpse into presidential politics in the nation''s capital as it tells the stories of the members of a fictional presidential administration. These interesting characters have humor and dedication that touches the heart while the politics that they discuss touch on everyday life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yqDWr5NAE7m1IWrygYwLyEB6pN0.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:688'),
  ('590507630689585629', 'The Westerner', 1960, 'Western', 'Sam Peckinpah', null, 'Brian Keith', 'NR', 'The Westerner is an American Western series that aired on NBC from September to December 1960. Created by Sam Peckinpah, the series was produced by Four Star Television. The Westerner stars Brian Keith as Dave Blassingame and features John Dehner as semi-regular Burgundy Smith.', 'The Westerner is an American Western series that aired on NBC from September to December 1960. Created by Sam Peckinpah, the series was produced by Four Star Television. The Westerner stars Brian Keith as Dave Blassingame and features John Dehner as semi-regular Burgundy Smith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWTni2PH6unZRMc9sFIEl2d9YGw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3524'),
  ('379516844961364448', 'The Westward', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Xia Lei, Lei Wu, Ajie, Shen Dawei, Xie Tiantian, Feng Junhua, Liu Beichen, Yixiao Wen', null, 'The journey to the West was a conspiracy of heaven! After Sutra went missing for more than a decade, Heaven sent its army to search, in order not to let the Sutra once again fall into the hands of heaven, the journey to West begin again.', 'The journey to the West was a conspiracy of heaven! After Sutra went missing for more than a decade, Heaven sent its army to search, in order not to let the Sutra once again fall into the hands of heaven, the journey to West begin again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Acq2LVNnf3mFyQhDSn6sM5qqfav.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:83031'),
  ('430540092058856717', 'The Wheel of Time', 2021, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Rafe Judkins', null, 'Rosamund Pike, Daniel Henney, Josha Stradowski, Zoë Robins, Madeleine Madden, Marcus Rutherford, Dónal Finn, Ceara Coveney', 'TV-14', 'The lives of five young villagers change forever when a strange and powerful woman arrives, claiming one of them is the child of an ancient prophecy with the power to tip the balance between Light and Dark forever. They must choose whether to trust this stranger – and each other – with the fate of the world before the Dark One breaks out of His prison, and the Last Battle begins.', 'The lives of five young villagers change forever when a strange and powerful woman arrives, claiming one of them is the child of an ancient prophecy with the power to tip the balance between Light and Dark forever. They must choose whether to trust this stranger – and each other – with the fate of the world before the Dark One breaks out of His prison, and the Last Battle begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihBi24EIr5kwAeY2PqmsgAcCj4n.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:71914'),
  ('795029984349236856', 'The Whirlwind', 2024, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Park Kyung-soo, Kim Yong-wan', null, 'Sul Kyung-gu, Kim Hee-ae, Kim Mi-sook, Kim Young-min, Lim Se-mi', 'TV-14', 'A whirlwind power clash between the prime minister and deputy prime minister unravels the day the president suffers an assassination attempt.', 'A whirlwind power clash between the prime minister and deputy prime minister unravels the day the president suffers an assassination attempt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dMNPN1cxX0CuL9POyT5xoiTk10h.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223329'),
  ('336281135602088786', 'The Whirlwind Girl', 2015, 'Action & Adventure', 'Ming Xiaoxi', 'Li Lei, Ming Xiaoxi', 'Ji Chang-wook, An Yuexi, Sean Chen, Tan Songyun, Leo Wu, Guo Junchen, Gao Guangze', 'TV-G', '10 years ago in the town of An Yang, the origin of Yuan Wu Dao martial arts, world champion Qu Xiang Nan was accused of doping and his prestigious title was stripped. He became a disgrace to the town and tarnished their name in the arts of Yuan Wu Dao. The story of Tornado Girl is set in the present and revolves around his adopted daughter and student Qi Bai Cao in her journey of becoming a true Yuan Wu Dao martial artist, fighting her way to the top and reclaiming her Teacher''s innocence. Along the way she encounters friends such as her stoic and selfless Yuan Wu Dao senior Ruo Bai, the warm and caring but mysteriously secluded medic Yu Chu Yuan, and the flirtatious, playful Fang Ting Hao with a hidden agenda. Together they learn, grow, compete, find love and fight for their dreams.', '10 years ago in the town of An Yang, the origin of Yuan Wu Dao martial arts, world champion Qu Xiang Nan was accused of doping and his prestigious title was stripped. He became a disgrace to the town and tarnished their name in the arts of Yuan Wu Dao. The story of Tornado Girl is set in the present and revolves around his adopted daughter and student Qi Bai Cao in her journey of becoming a true Yuan Wu Dao martial artist, fighting her way to the top and reclaiming her Teacher''s innocence. Along the way she encounters friends such as her stoic and selfless Yuan Wu Dao senior Ruo Bai, the warm and caring but mysteriously secluded medic Yu Chu Yuan, and the flirtatious, playful Fang Ting Hao with a hidden agenda. Together they learn, grow, compete, find love and fight for their dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUye3TnlXvq08FKhaBtChoZ9vR0.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:68657'),
  ('449279111716974429', 'The Whispers', 2015, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Soo Hugh', null, 'Lily Rabe, Barry Sloane, Milo Ventimiglia, Derek Webster, Kristen Connolly, Kylie Rogers, Kyle Breitkopf, Spencer Drever', 'TV-14', 'We love to play games with our children. But what happens when someone else starts to play with them too? Someone we don''t know. Can''t see. Can''t hear. In The Whispers, someone or something -- is manipulating the ones we love most to accomplish the unthinkable. An unseen alien force has figured this human weakness out. They have invaded earth and are using our most unlikely resource to achieve world domination – our children.', 'We love to play games with our children. But what happens when someone else starts to play with them too? Someone we don''t know. Can''t see. Can''t hear. In The Whispers, someone or something -- is manipulating the ones we love most to accomplish the unthinkable. An unseen alien force has figured this human weakness out. They have invaded earth and are using our most unlikely resource to achieve world domination – our children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSoXUOYmzvCfXzElnAVl9cSEnTa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62195'),
  ('380758585439342784', 'The White Line', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Alberto Barrera Tyszka', 'Claudia Sánchez Morales', 'Carla Giraldo, Juan Pablo Gamboa, Tsuria Díaz, Dagoberto Gama, Carlos Athié, Zharick León, Carolina Guerra, Dolores Heredia', 'TV-PG', 'A raw and realistic story that connects four characters whose lives are affected by the dark world of drug trafficking. From the Colombian jungle to Miami, passing through Bogotá and Mexico, the plot shows how cocaine impacts everything from production to consumption. An intense series that reveals crime never brings favorable consequences.', 'A raw and realistic story that connects four characters whose lives are affected by the dark world of drug trafficking. From the Colombian jungle to Miami, passing through Bogotá and Mexico, the plot shows how cocaine impacts everything from production to consumption. An intense series that reveals crime never brings favorable consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0kl61rfAEV6SmPYjOwwCaproeV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:120095'),
  ('614473088009629555', 'The White Lotus', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'Mike White', null, 'Leslie Bibb, Carrie Coon, Walton Goggins, Sarah Catherine Hook, Jason Isaacs, LISA, Michelle Monaghan, Natasha Rothwell', 'TV-MA', 'Follow the exploits of various guests and employees at an exclusive tropical resort over the span of a week as with each passing day, a darker complexity emerges in these picture-perfect travelers, the hotel’s cheerful employees and the idyllic locale itself.', 'Follow the exploits of various guests and employees at an exclusive tropical resort over the span of a week as with each passing day, a darker complexity emerges in these picture-perfect travelers, the hotel’s cheerful employees and the idyllic locale itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gbSaK9v1CbcYH1ISgbM7XObD2dW.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:111803'),
  ('904190673657739644', 'The White Olive Tree', 2025, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Chen Zheyuan, Liang Jie, Wang Tianchen, Gu Zicheng, Zheng Yingchen, Liu Yongxi, Ding Ye', null, 'During an interview mission in the turbulent East Country, Song Ran, a female reporter from Liangcheng Satellite TV, came across a sudden danger. Thankfully, Li Zan, a Chinese explosive engineer who volunteered in the East Country, was able to save her. After multiple interactions, Li Zan discovered that despite appearing weak on the outside, Song Ran was brave, strong, and full of justice and kindness. The same ideals and compatible souls ignited the love between them. A sudden bombing attack ended their budding relationship, and they fell into a trough of life after returning to China and even losing contact with each other. By chance, they came across each other again, and gradually, their lives got back on track. Together, they planted the seeds of the white olive tree.', 'During an interview mission in the turbulent East Country, Song Ran, a female reporter from Liangcheng Satellite TV, came across a sudden danger. Thankfully, Li Zan, a Chinese explosive engineer who volunteered in the East Country, was able to save her. After multiple interactions, Li Zan discovered that despite appearing weak on the outside, Song Ran was brave, strong, and full of justice and kindness. The same ideals and compatible souls ignited the love between them. A sudden bombing attack ended their budding relationship, and they fell into a trough of life after returning to China and even losing contact with each other. By chance, they came across each other again, and gradually, their lives got back on track. Together, they planted the seeds of the white olive tree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sLJ7z9IT0nLXJbuszYbZ4uy8AOO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:252774'),
  ('19409918156437340', 'The White Princess', 2017, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Jodie Comer, Rebecca Benson, Jacob Collins-Levy, Kenneth Cranham, Essie Davis, Richard Dillane, Patrick Gibson, Caroline Goodall', 'TV-MA', 'The story of Elizabeth of York, the White Queen''s daughter, and her marriage to the Lancaster victor, Henry VII. Based on the Philippa Gregory book of the same name.', 'The story of Elizabeth of York, the White Queen''s daughter, and her marriage to the Lancaster victor, Henry VII. Based on the Philippa Gregory book of the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8urYFWrEd8ue94Fm4JpHccQg3M7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70215'),
  ('890270004679456061', 'The White Queen', 2013, 'Drama', null, null, 'Rebecca Ferguson, Max Irons, Amanda Hale, Janet McTeer, James Frain, Tom McKay, Faye Marsay, Juliet Aubrey', 'TV-MA', 'Set against the backdrop of the Wars of the Roses, the series is the story of the women caught up in the protracted conflict for the throne of England.', 'Set against the backdrop of the Wars of the Roses, the series is the story of the women caught up in the protracted conflict for the throne of England.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dB8lh4OeQZz0A3gDu5aKwm25kU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:57092'),
  ('760506227708341160', 'The White Shadow', 1978, 'Drama, Family', 'Bruce Paltrow', 'Steven Bochco, Mark Tinker', 'Ken Howard, Kevin Hooks, Byron Stewart, Tim Van Patten, Stoney Jackson, Ed Bernard, Erik Kilpatrick, Nathan Cook', 'TV-14', 'The White Shadow is an American drama television series that ran on the CBS network from November 27 1978, to March 16 1981.', 'The White Shadow is an American drama television series that ran on the CBS network from November 27 1978, to March 16 1981.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lbtkkMLoQgiYO478jYlBGtNJX0k.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:10050'),
  ('398885523195392182', 'The White Slave', 2016, 'Drama', 'Eduardo Galdo, María Helena Porta', null, 'Orian Suarez, Ricardo Vesga, Miguel de Miguel, Nerea Camacho, Norma Martínez, Andrés Suárez, Viña Machado, Modesto Lacen', 'TV-14', '“The White Slave”, is a production which narrates the story of Victoria, a woman who everyone knows as a marchioness who arrived in America to marry a prosperous merchant from the region. However, the truth is different, because years back in that same city, she was rescued from death and raised in secret by some slaves who became her family. She was taken from the arms of her loved ones and sent to Spain because according to the society of the time, a white woman could not live with slaves. Victoria is an indomitable woman and she will come back pretending to be someone else to seek justice and liberate her family. This woman is determined to face anyone who gets on her way to free her loved ones from slavery, confront her parents killer and reunite with the man she would give her life for. For Victoria everyone is the same colour which is why she won’t rest until she claims justice and becomes a heroine.', '“The White Slave”, is a production which narrates the story of Victoria, a woman who everyone knows as a marchioness who arrived in America to marry a prosperous merchant from the region. However, the truth is different, because years back in that same city, she was rescued from death and raised in secret by some slaves who became her family. She was taken from the arms of her loved ones and sent to Spain because according to the society of the time, a white woman could not live with slaves. Victoria is an indomitable woman and she will come back pretending to be someone else to seek justice and liberate her family. This woman is determined to face anyone who gets on her way to free her loved ones from slavery, confront her parents killer and reunite with the man she would give her life for. For Victoria everyone is the same colour which is why she won’t rest until she claims justice and becomes a heroine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8U3UoUfK5WXOpzB0gfE6nHSoglw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73640'),
  ('343697690986184783', 'The Whitest Kids U'' Know', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Sam Brown, Zach Cregger, Trevor Moore', null, 'Trevor Moore, Timmy Williams, Darren Trumeter, Sam Brown, Zach Cregger', 'TV-MA', 'The New York-based sketch comedy ensemble takes it''s act to the small screen in this outrageous cable series. Led by Trevor Moore and Zach Cregger, the troupe takes on every stereotype, foible, and irony found in everyday life, no matter how un-PC the results.', 'The New York-based sketch comedy ensemble takes it''s act to the small screen in this outrageous cable series. Led by Trevor Moore and Zach Cregger, the troupe takes on every stereotype, foible, and irony found in everyday life, no matter how un-PC the results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7nBZbpqjImz5azIM91ZUaFjTdVR.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:10420'),
  ('370843662308903641', 'The Wicked Game', 2025, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Mystery', null, null, 'Pittaya Saechua, Kantapon Jindataweephol, Natthawut Skidjai, Kitsakorn Kanogtorn, Monchanok Saengchaipiangpen, Arisara Wongchalee, Jakkrasin Atsavatanachai, Pichaorn Wanarat', null, 'An abandoned heir wages war to expose his ruthless father and seize control of the family empire, but treachery—and desire—threaten his plan.', 'An abandoned heir wages war to expose his ruthless father and seize control of the family empire, but treachery—and desire—threaten his plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vcOR221FjqIUYAnPB7ZhE20z0Ch.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:274559'),
  ('609527721101173808', 'The Widow', 2019, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Jack Williams, Harry Williams', 'Harry Williams, Jack Williams', 'Kate Beckinsale, Matthew Le Nevez, Alex Kingston, Charles Dance, Bart Fouche, Ólafur Darri Ólafsson, Shalom Nyandiko, Babs Olusanmokun', 'TV-MA', 'A woman''s search to uncover the mystery of the disappearance of her husband leads her to the Congo, where she''s forced to seek the truth about what happened to the man she loved.', 'A woman''s search to uncover the mystery of the disappearance of her husband leads her to the Congo, where she''s forced to seek the truth about what happened to the man she loved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lSeCcQ2yMMmetbKZWePRLFqwDT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85854'),
  ('234043051050226990', 'The Widower', 2014, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Jeff Pope', 'Jim Barton', 'Reece Shearsmith, Kate Fleetwood, Federay Holmes, James Laurenson', null, 'Over a thirteen year period, a seemingly mild‐mannered male nurse, Malcolm Webster, set about poisoning and murdering his first wife, attempting to do the same to his second wife and moving on to a further scheme to deceive his third fiancée.', 'Over a thirteen year period, a seemingly mild‐mannered male nurse, Malcolm Webster, set about poisoning and murdering his first wife, attempting to do the same to his second wife and moving on to a further scheme to deceive his third fiancée.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6DImb7IFoLm5ghofYwLxmsvull2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60750'),
  ('733979473029128372', 'The Wife''s Secret', 2014, 'Drama, Family', null, null, 'Hawick Lau Hau-Wai, Zhao Liying, Allen Ting Chi-Chun, Kenny Kwan, Wang Zhi, Yang Chengcheng, Huang Ailing, Feng Dalu', null, 'Zhang Baihe and Li Minglang, heirs to powerful conglomerates, are set to be engaged. However, a tragic event changes the course of their lives, and as they navigate their new circumstances, they must contend with challenges to their relationship and external pressures.', 'Zhang Baihe and Li Minglang, heirs to powerful conglomerates, are set to be engaged. However, a tragic event changes the course of their lives, and as they navigate their new circumstances, they must contend with challenges to their relationship and external pressures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7mss6QkIsFBsVdDzCr3vxQ7Ngn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77629'),
  ('69606184819965462', 'The Wiggles', 1998, 'Kids, Family', 'Anthony Field, Greg Page, Jeff Fatt', null, 'Anthony Field, Lachlan Gillespie, Simon Pryce, Paul Paddick, Tsehay Hawkins, John Pearce, Lucia Field, Evie Ferris', 'TV-Y', 'A show geared for babies up to older toddlers. This show is full of music, teaching kids songs and easy dances.', 'A show geared for babies up to older toddlers. This show is full of music, teaching kids songs and easy dances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4O9IXM3ZmuDsrEICslrwqCl7MT.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:34921'),
  ('1033349388290785726', 'The Wil Wheaton Project', 2014, 'Comedy, Talk', null, null, 'Wil Wheaton', null, 'Each week, Wil provides his insider point-of-view, sense of humor and expertise as he dissects the week’s most popular and trending topics across sci-fi film, television and pop culture, as well as video games, viral videos and news. Wil is on his feet for the rapid-fire half hour, delivering sharp, straight-to-camera commentary as he riffs his way through content clips. The result is a fun appreciation for all things nerdy/geeky.', 'Each week, Wil provides his insider point-of-view, sense of humor and expertise as he dissects the week’s most popular and trending topics across sci-fi film, television and pop culture, as well as video games, viral videos and news. Wil is on his feet for the rapid-fire half hour, delivering sharp, straight-to-camera commentary as he riffs his way through content clips. The result is a fun appreciation for all things nerdy/geeky.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8skWL2OIlK33RwjhDQs3Nw4K5k5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60964'),
  ('802150299557700637', 'The Wild', 2011, 'Soap', 'Rohan Dickson, Rich Nosworthy, Bronwyn Berry', null, 'Shona Ferguson, Tumisho Masha, Connie Ferguson, Gail Nkoane, Ian Roberts, James Alexander, Lele Ledwaba, Clementine Mosimane', null, 'The Wild is a South African soap opera created by Rohan Dickson, Richard Nosworthy and Bronwyn Berry and produced by M-Net''s in-house production arm Magic Factory and shot entirely on location which revolves around three families – the Lebones, the van Reenens and the Tladis - who, because of past conflicts, struggle to negotiate a cohesive future, despite being bound together by their relationship to a special piece of land.', 'The Wild is a South African soap opera created by Rohan Dickson, Richard Nosworthy and Bronwyn Berry and produced by M-Net''s in-house production arm Magic Factory and shot entirely on location which revolves around three families – the Lebones, the van Reenens and the Tladis - who, because of past conflicts, struggle to negotiate a cohesive future, despite being bound together by their relationship to a special piece of land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uq94VEMasYOxUiMxoaCMWU9FwQe.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67573'),
  ('1083838763575836272', 'The Wild Thornberrys', 1998, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Kids, Family', 'Gábor Csupó, Arlene Klasky', null, 'Lacey Chabert, Jodi Carlisle, Tim Curry, Flea, Danielle Harris, Tom Kane', 'TV-Y7', 'Travel the world with the Thornberrys and come face-to-face with blue sheep in Nepal, emus in Australia, marmots in Pakistan, flash floods in Siberia, Egyptian burial chambers, a runaway hot air balloon, a rock slide on the Karakoram Highway and more!', 'Travel the world with the Thornberrys and come face-to-face with blue sheep in Nepal, emus in Australia, marmots in Pakistan, flash floods in Siberia, Egyptian burial chambers, a runaway hot air balloon, a rock slide on the Karakoram Highway and more!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6SHAvvwmOFJwFhbkAqa6MjsiO7P.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:2408'),
  ('933443599505465419', 'The Wild Wild West', 1965, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Western, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Michael Garrison', null, 'Robert Conrad, Ross Martin', 'TV-PG', 'The Wild Wild West is an American television series. Developed at a time when the television western was losing ground to the spy genre, this show was conceived by its creator, Michael Garrison, as "James Bond on horseback." Set during the administration of President Ulysses Grant, the series followed Secret Service agents James West and Artemus Gordon as they solved crimes, protected the President, and foiled the plans of megalomaniacal villains to take over all or part of the United States. The show also featured a number of fantasy elements, such as the technologically advanced devices used by the agents and their adversaries. The combination of the Victorian era time-frame and the use of Verne-esque style technology have inspired some to give the show credit for the origins of the steam punk subculture.', 'The Wild Wild West is an American television series. Developed at a time when the television western was losing ground to the spy genre, this show was conceived by its creator, Michael Garrison, as "James Bond on horseback." Set during the administration of President Ulysses Grant, the series followed Secret Service agents James West and Artemus Gordon as they solved crimes, protected the President, and foiled the plans of megalomaniacal villains to take over all or part of the United States. The show also featured a number of fantasy elements, such as the technologically advanced devices used by the agents and their adversaries. The combination of the Victorian era time-frame and the use of Verne-esque style technology have inspired some to give the show credit for the origins of the steam punk subculture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4LSZNCSxDodwCP8EsKRTgMDUKY4.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:10929'),
  ('185469105445391664', 'The Wilds', 2020, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Sarah Streicher', null, 'Zack Calderon, Alex Fitzalan, Sarah Pidgeon, Sophia Ali, Charles Alexander, Shannon Berry, Jenna Clause, Reign Edwards', 'TV-MA', 'A group of teen girls from different backgrounds must fight for survival after a plane crash strands them on a deserted island. The castaways both clash and bond as they learn more about each other, the secrets they keep, and the traumas they''ve all endured. But there’s just one twist… these girls did not end up on this island by accident.', 'A group of teen girls from different backgrounds must fight for survival after a plane crash strands them on a deserted island. The castaways both clash and bond as they learn more about each other, the secrets they keep, and the traumas they''ve all endured. But there’s just one twist… these girls did not end up on this island by accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHBtyMdHbWoM3tpM8VZymer8HfF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:113367'),
  ('498119355244025733', 'The Winchesters', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Robbie Thompson', null, 'Meg Donnelly, Drake Rodger, Nida Khurshid, Jojo Fleites, Demetria McKinney, Bianca Kajlich', 'TV-14', 'Before Sam and Dean, there was John and Mary. Told from the perspective of narrator Dean Winchester, this is the epic, untold love story of how John met Mary, and how they put it all on the line to not only save their love, but the entire world.', 'Before Sam and Dean, there was John and Mary. Told from the perspective of narrator Dean Winchester, this is the epic, untold love story of how John met Mary, and how they put it all on the line to not only save their love, but the entire world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/doKL0GMtPfkb6OSBtLQIvFBVc9w.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128113'),
  ('922674165905064770', 'The Wind Blows From Longxi', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Ma Boyong', 'Jin Haishu, Jin Yu', 'Chen Kun, Bai Yu, Nie Yuan, Yin Zhusheng, Chang Yuan, AngelaBaby, Sun Yi, Yu Haoming', null, 'The year is 228 of the Common Era, and China is divided into Three Kingdoms, which find themselves at odds with each other. A seemingly decisive battle has just taken place, with the Shu army clashing with the Wei. But military leaders in the state of Shu believe that the battle’s result was swayed by a campaign of misinformation – with faulty information leading to a critical misjudgment. They believe that this was all masterminded by Chen Gong, a powerful spy believed to be located somewhere in Wei lands.', 'The year is 228 of the Common Era, and China is divided into Three Kingdoms, which find themselves at odds with each other. A seemingly decisive battle has just taken place, with the Shu army clashing with the Wei. But military leaders in the state of Shu believe that the battle’s result was swayed by a campaign of misinformation – with faulty information leading to a critical misjudgment. They believe that this was all masterminded by Chen Gong, a powerful spy believed to be located somewhere in Wei lands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zcCyK8obdrOBZg15XurzEkNuf43.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:136548'),
  ('181423184629000728', 'The Wind in the Willows', 1984, 'Animation, Kids', 'Mark Hall, Chris Taylor', null, 'Peter Sallis, Michael Hordern, David Jason, Ian Carmichael, Richard Pearson', null, 'The Wind in the Willows is a TV series that was originally broadcast between 1984 and 1987, based on characters from Kenneth Grahame''s classic story The Wind in the Willows and following the 1983 film The Wind in the Willows. It was made by animation company Cosgrove Hall for Thames Television and shown on the ITV network. An hour-long feature, A Tale Of Two Toads, was broadcast in 1988, and a fifth season of 13 episodes was shown in 1989 under the title Oh! Mr Toad in some countries, whilst retaining the title The Wind in the Willows in others.', 'The Wind in the Willows is a TV series that was originally broadcast between 1984 and 1987, based on characters from Kenneth Grahame''s classic story The Wind in the Willows and following the 1983 film The Wind in the Willows. It was made by animation company Cosgrove Hall for Thames Television and shown on the ITV network. An hour-long feature, A Tale Of Two Toads, was broadcast in 1988, and a fifth season of 13 episodes was shown in 1989 under the title Oh! Mr Toad in some countries, whilst retaining the title The Wind in the Willows in others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2xkKM5SaGHGo1uoDyF7hlAB92Jy.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:11688'),
  ('640581298774904577', 'The Window of non-REM', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Bakarhythm', null, null, null, '"Non-rem sleep" means deep sleep. Are the three mysterious short stories that we broadcast this time a dream? Or is it real? Dreams and reality, reality and unreality ... The mysterious bakarhythm world that goes back and forth between them is the "non-rem window."', '"Non-rem sleep" means deep sleep. Are the three mysterious short stories that we broadcast this time a dream? Or is it real? Dreams and reality, reality and unreality ... The mysterious bakarhythm world that goes back and forth between them is the "non-rem window."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bglhbQurVdSf3EJ7V1FRpdcIZij.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:196679'),
  ('810671992606528692', 'The Winds of War', 1983, 'War & Politics, Drama', 'Dan Curtis', null, 'Robert Mitchum, Ali MacGraw, Jan-Michael Vincent, John Houseman, Polly Bergen, Lisa Eilbacher, David Dukes, Chaim Topol', 'NR', 'Against the backdrop of world events that led to the Japanese attack on Pearl Harbor in 1941, Victor ''Pug'' Henry is a career naval officer who, along with his family, learns to navigate the waters of his dangerous times in the late 1930s.', 'Against the backdrop of world events that led to the Japanese attack on Pearl Harbor in 1941, Victor ''Pug'' Henry is a career naval officer who, along with his family, learns to navigate the waters of his dangerous times in the late 1930s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fsGLuaGM3sWusRtP8WI7m87i5B0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42240'),
  ('1093740085416153765', 'The Windsors', 2016, 'Comedy, Soap', 'George Jeffrie, Bert Tyler-Moore', null, 'Harry Enfield, Haydn Gwynne, Hugh Skinner, Morgana Robinson, Katy Wix, Tom Durant-Pritchard', 'TV-MA', 'Comedy soap opera re-imagining the lives of the British Royal Family as you have never seen them before.', 'Comedy soap opera re-imagining the lives of the British Royal Family as you have never seen them before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mW3mUGxpuzgvRVdxNDfcuXemFzw.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:66437'),
  ('657863231746338327', 'The Wingfeather Saga', 2022, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'J. Chris Wall', null, 'Alkaio Thiele, Griffin Robert Faulkner, Romy Fay, Jodi Benson, Kevin McNally, Andrew Peterson, Ari Elizabeth Johnson, Adam Sietz', 'TV-Y7', 'Once upon a time, in a cottage above the cliffs on the Dark Sea of Darkness, there lived three children and their trusty dog Nugget. Janner Igiby, his brother Tink, and his sister Leeli are gifted children as all children are. Together they discover the secret of the Jewels of the Shining Isle. They will need their special gifts and all the love of their noble mother and ex-pirate grandfather to survive the venomous Fangs, sea dragons, flabbits, and (gulp) toothy cows! The Wingfeather Saga blends the whimsy and heart of THE PRINCESS BRIDE with the vastness and peril of THE LORD OF THE RINGS. After living for years under occupation by the evil Fangs of Dang, the Igiby children find a map rumored to lead to the lost Jewels of Anniera---the one thing the Fangs will do anything to find---and the family is thrown headlong into a perilous adventure, uncovering hidden truths about who they are that will change their world forever.', 'Once upon a time, in a cottage above the cliffs on the Dark Sea of Darkness, there lived three children and their trusty dog Nugget. Janner Igiby, his brother Tink, and his sister Leeli are gifted children as all children are. Together they discover the secret of the Jewels of the Shining Isle. They will need their special gifts and all the love of their noble mother and ex-pirate grandfather to survive the venomous Fangs, sea dragons, flabbits, and (gulp) toothy cows! The Wingfeather Saga blends the whimsy and heart of THE PRINCESS BRIDE with the vastness and peril of THE LORD OF THE RINGS. After living for years under occupation by the evil Fangs of Dang, the Igiby children find a map rumored to lead to the lost Jewels of Anniera---the one thing the Fangs will do anything to find---and the family is thrown headlong into a perilous adventure, uncovering hidden truths about who they are that will change their world forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wRquZNWAqtp6cPUEM4RS4DZULLs.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:215597'),
  ('295724151034773402', 'The Winning Try', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Im Jin-ah', 'Yoon Kye-sang, Lim Se-mi, Kim Yo-han, Kim Dan, Kil Hae-yeon, Kim Min-sang, Lee Sung-wook, Jung Soon-won', null, 'A disgraced former rugby star returns as a coach to his high school’s struggling team, where he reunites with his ex-girlfriend and helps the determined captain lead the team to redemption.', 'A disgraced former rugby star returns as a coach to his high school’s struggling team, where he reunites with his ex-girlfriend and helps the determined captain lead the team to redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qgh3m9Oh3CoqVBuWkiMIgVgFwI1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:250463'),
  ('522565336885322155', 'The Winter King', 2023, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kate Brooke, Ed Whitmore', null, 'Iain De Caestecker, Stuart Campbell, Ellie James, Steven Elder, Valene Kane, Simon Merrells, Ken Nwosu', 'TV-MA', 'Bastard son Arthur returns to the land he''s been banished from to find a kingdom in chaos. Seeking the aid of his oldest confidants, Arthur aims to right Britain''s path as he faces the most unexpected of obstacles.', 'Bastard son Arthur returns to the land he''s been banished from to find a kingdom in chaos. Seeking the aid of his oldest confidants, Arthur aims to right Britain''s path as he faces the most unexpected of obstacles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYx5q9hPAmbDrWzsYUDhxZJnigC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99737'),
  ('761681887418588090', 'The Wire', 2002, 'Crime, Drama', 'David Simon', null, 'Dominic West, Lance Reddick, Sonja Sohn, Wendell Pierce, Michael Kenneth Williams, Deirdre Lovejoy, Andre Royo, John Doman', 'TV-MA', 'Told from the points of view of both the Baltimore homicide and narcotics detectives and their targets, the series captures a universe in which the national war on drugs has become a permanent, self-sustaining bureaucracy, and distinctions between good and evil are routinely obliterated.', 'Told from the points of view of both the Baltimore homicide and narcotics detectives and their targets, the series captures a universe in which the national war on drugs has become a permanent, self-sustaining bureaucracy, and distinctions between good and evil are routinely obliterated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4lbclFySvugI51fwsyxBTOm4DqK.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1438'),
  ('880688389964041216', 'The Witch', 2011, 'Drama', 'Germán Castro Caycedo', null, 'Flora Martínez, Andrés Parra, Andrés Toro, Vicky Hernández, Viviana Serna Ramirez, Gledys Ibarra, Luis Fernando Montoya, Andrés Echavarría', 'TV-G', 'The Witch is a 2011 Colombian telenovela starring Flora Martínez, based on the novel of the same name by Colombian writer Germán Castro Caycedo.', 'The Witch is a 2011 Colombian telenovela starring Flora Martínez, based on the novel of the same name by Colombian writer Germán Castro Caycedo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNGMGzB8WykqLGlFlh0u2qdauWq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46986'),
  ('524796308306034858', 'The Witch', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Kang Full', null, 'Jinyoung, Roh Jeong-eui, Lee Hyun So, Park Soo-oh, Lim Jae-hyeok, Joo Jong-hyuk, Jang He-ryung, Jang Hye-jin', null, 'The story of a woman who is kicked out of her village and called a "witch" when the men that she likes get hurt or die, and a man who risks his life to try to save her from the law of death.', 'The story of a woman who is kicked out of her village and called a "witch" when the men that she likes get hurt or die, and a man who risks his life to try to save her from the law of death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AeBzGdbXlSm0FQyhKyYvfr0ugZl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:200794'),
  ('1105891477230320722', 'The Witch and the Beast', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'You Taichi, Toshiyuki Morikawa', null, 'Guideau is a young woman who was cursed by a witch, forced to carry a dark secret. Ashaf is a tall, soft-spoken man with a coffin strapped to his back and secrets yet untold. Together they venture across the land on their quest for vengeance. Appearances can be deceiving, and each step could be their last. In a dark fantasy filled with adventure, will unlikely heroes find the vengeance they seek?', 'Guideau is a young woman who was cursed by a witch, forced to carry a dark secret. Ashaf is a tall, soft-spoken man with a coffin strapped to his back and secrets yet untold. Together they venture across the land on their quest for vengeance. Appearances can be deceiving, and each step could be their last. In a dark fantasy filled with adventure, will unlikely heroes find the vengeance they seek?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ooSzpaJkU8MnfuLKn0IThcACv57.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208445'),
  ('634372130818257514', 'The Witch Store', 2019, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Jeong Hyo-jun, Yeo One, Lee Hyun-joo', null, 'Hye Ji becomes a part-timer at the Witch Store which is only seen by those who have a wish. Hye Ji sees no progress in her relationship with Yoo Ho and in front of her, a witch transformed into a high school girl named YoungJi. This is when Sung Woo a handsome judo player appears.', 'Hye Ji becomes a part-timer at the Witch Store which is only seen by those who have a wish. Hye Ji sees no progress in her relationship with Yoo Ho and in front of her, a witch transformed into a high school girl named YoungJi. This is when Sung Woo a handsome judo player appears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hpAB3GYHMryxJdsjBmdEf4J6EVP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95015'),
  ('16115303945231393', 'The Witch Store Reopens', 2022, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ahn Se Hwa', 'Ahn Se Hwa', 'Kim Yong-hee, Yerin, Kim Yae-lim, Kwon Ah-reum, Seo Jun', null, 'The story of Ji-ho, a timid and helpless high school boy without a dream, who struggles to save the shop by meeting the black witch Hae-na, the owner of a witch shop that is on the verge of closing.', 'The story of Ji-ho, a timid and helpless high school boy without a dream, who struggles to save the shop by meeting the black witch Hae-na, the owner of a witch shop that is on the verge of closing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8SS4naAkqnt8gpAV1qxzBGZgb4u.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137469'),
  ('785266952739962058', 'The Witch''s Diner', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Lee Young-sook', 'Song Ji-hyo, Nam Ji-hyun, Chae Jong-hyeop, Ha Do-kwon, So Hee-jung, Son Kwang-Eop, Ji Soo-won, Yoon Da-young', null, 'Hee-ra is the owner of the Witch''s Diner where employee Jin and intern Gil-yong work with her. Guests are welcome to the Witch''s Diner where they sell their souls for their wishes to come true.', 'Hee-ra is the owner of the Witch''s Diner where employee Jin and intern Gil-yong work with her. Guests are welcome to the Witch''s Diner where they sell their souls for their wishes to come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h09DoOLdoEqzAoUk0CF41wlZIvq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127651'),
  ('1037138596032816544', 'The Witcher', 2002, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Michał Żebrowski, Wieslaw Chmielinski, Magdalena Warzecha, Wojciech Duryasz, Władysław Barański, Anna Dymna, Marta Bitner, Maciej Kozłowski', 'TV-MA', '"Later it was said that the man came from the north from the Powroznicza gate. He walked on foot, and led his horse, which was laden, by the bridle. It was late afternoon and the stalls of the ropemakers and saddlers were already closed, and the street was empty. It was warm, and the man was wearing a black cloak thrown over his shoulders. He was drawing attention." - So begins the short story "The Witcher" by Andrzej Sapkowski, which gave rise to a seven-volume series.', '"Later it was said that the man came from the north from the Powroznicza gate. He walked on foot, and led his horse, which was laden, by the bridle. It was late afternoon and the stalls of the ropemakers and saddlers were already closed, and the street was empty. It was warm, and the man was wearing a black cloak thrown over his shoulders. He was drawing attention." - So begins the short story "The Witcher" by Andrzej Sapkowski, which gave rise to a seven-volume series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggsqoEYRKwGRbPcHD4KGL2VXHD5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:17625'),
  ('1144439695683779290', 'The Witcher', 2019, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Lauren Schmidt Hissrich', null, 'Liam Hemsworth, Anya Chalotra, Freya Allan, Joey Batey, Eamon Farren, Mimî M. Khayisa, Anna Shaffer, Mahesh Jadu', 'TV-MA', 'Geralt of Rivia, a mutated monster-hunter for hire, journeys toward his destiny in a turbulent world where people often prove more wicked than beasts.', 'Geralt of Rivia, a mutated monster-hunter for hire, journeys toward his destiny in a turbulent world where people often prove more wicked than beasts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AoGsDM02UVt0npBA8OvpDcZbaMi.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:71912'),
  ('674517006758259128', 'The Witcher: A Look Inside the Episodes', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Lauren Schmidt Hissrich', null, 'With series creator Lauren S. Hissrich as your guide, take an in-depth journey into the stories and themes powering the first season of The Witcher.', 'With series creator Lauren S. Hissrich as your guide, take an in-depth journey into the stories and themes powering the first season of The Witcher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thnU4dg5tvipytPj8BEuhkiQFSW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108987'),
  ('867889210673052567', 'The Witcher: Blood Origin', 2022, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Declan de Barra, Lauren Schmidt Hissrich', 'Aaron Stewart-Ahn, Tasha Huo', 'Sophia Brown, Laurence O''Fuarain, Mirren Mack, Lenny Henry, Jacob Collins-Levy, Zach Wyatt, Lizzie Annis, Huw Novelli', 'TV-MA', 'More than a thousand years before the world of The Witcher, seven outcasts in the elven world unite in a blood quest against an unstoppable power.', 'More than a thousand years before the world of The Witcher, seven outcasts in the elven world unite in a blood quest against an unstoppable power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpfJK9F0UJNcAIIeC42oJyKMnZQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106541'),
  ('835161277568207884', 'The Witches of Calenda', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'David Bermejo, Laura Belloso', null, 'Belén Rueda, Daniel Grao, Álvaro Cervantes, Fran Perea, Marc Martínez, Olivia Molina, Belén López, Lucía Guerrero', null, 'The judge named Sara has moved to Calenda, along with her teenage daughter, Leire. Her plan to rebuild the family life has been spoiled when her husband disappears. This will be the first of a series of shocking events that will convince the judge that Calenda is not the peaceful place as it seemed to be.', 'The judge named Sara has moved to Calenda, along with her teenage daughter, Leire. Her plan to rebuild the family life has been spoiled when her husband disappears. This will be the first of a series of shocking events that will convince the judge that Calenda is not the peaceful place as it seemed to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/343a7WH2VrczBcMmvfHU3KSyZxx.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:46824'),
  ('1035144112086570224', 'The Witches of Oz', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Leigh Scott, Chris Campbel, Eliza Swenson', 'Christopher Lloyd, Sean Astin, Lance Henriksen, Billy Boyd, Ethan Embry, Jeffrey Combs, Mia Sara, Paulie Redding', null, 'The Witches of Oz follows the exploits of the grown Dorothy Gale, now a successful children''s book author, as she moves from Kansas to present day New York City. Dorothy quickly learns that her popular books are based on repressed childhood memories, and that the wonders of Oz are very, very real. When the Wicked Witch of the West shows up in Times Square, Dorothy must find the inner courage to stop her.', 'The Witches of Oz follows the exploits of the grown Dorothy Gale, now a successful children''s book author, as she moves from Kansas to present day New York City. Dorothy quickly learns that her popular books are based on repressed childhood memories, and that the wonders of Oz are very, very real. When the Wicked Witch of the West shows up in Times Square, Dorothy must find the inner courage to stop her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ApRlpEpjF6HFBChikxbsxxA1bSH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43069'),
  ('40021328687167457', 'The Witchfinder', 2022, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Tim Key, Daisy May Cooper', null, 'A failing witchfinder transports a suspected witch across 1640s East Anglia to a trial that could change his fortunes forever.', 'A failing witchfinder transports a suspected witch across 1640s East Anglia to a trial that could change his fortunes forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyXbkIMnzLpggVWn7m0m6EcvAqh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130189'),
  ('835143082217672343', 'The Witching Season', 2015, 'Mystery', 'Michael Ballif', 'James Morris', null, null, 'Fueled by nostalgia, this anthology of short horror films tells original tales of terror set during the Halloween season.', 'Fueled by nostalgia, this anthology of short horror films tells original tales of terror set during the Halloween season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZ7lWlFPc0KpobY1P4WI66DM3XW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79499'),
  ('63578092041499531', 'The Witness for the Prosecution', 2016, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Toby Jones, Andrea Riseborough, Kim Cattrall, David Haig, Monica Dolan, Billy Howle, Paul Ready, Tim McMullan', 'NR', 'The hunt is on to find the murderer of a wealthy glamorous heiress who is found dead in her London townhouse. Based on the short story by Agatha Christie.', 'The hunt is on to find the murderer of a wealthy glamorous heiress who is found dead in her London townhouse. Based on the short story by Agatha Christie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n6i4LpDcyiwGbZg3to3Z8puyS1F.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74447'),
  ('94313679639334011', 'The Witnesses', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Christian Rohde, Jörg Lühdorff', null, 'Alexandra Maria Lara, Ralph Herforth, Ceci Chuh, Sylvester Groth, Johann von Bülow, Nilam Farooq, Rauand Taleb, Ursula Werner', null, 'When 10 year old girl is kidnapped from the natural history museum, the police questions eight key witnesses to uncover the truth and find the child before it''s too late.', 'When 10 year old girl is kidnapped from the natural history museum, the police questions eight key witnesses to uncover the truth and find the child before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xQnbnewh8szXambCGzkZ3S1v7V.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121671'),
  ('339839858890606756', 'The Wizard', 1986, 'Action & Adventure', 'Michael Berk, Douglas Schwartz', null, 'David Rappaport, Douglas Barr, Fran Ryan', null, 'The Wizard is a live-action, family friendly, action/adventure series created by Michael Berk, Douglas Schwartz, and Paul B. Radin. The series included lessons in diversity, friendship, imagination, respect, and never giving up.', 'The Wizard is a live-action, family friendly, action/adventure series created by Michael Berk, Douglas Schwartz, and Paul B. Radin. The series included lessons in diversity, friendship, imagination, respect, and never giving up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPYBKiOZNLBIgHlEIOMlZjDaX0u.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10977'),
  ('873985879138746667', 'The Wizards of Aus', 2016, null, null, 'Michael Shanks', 'Michael Shanks, Mark Bonanno, Menik Gooneratne', null, 'Fed up with the Magical Realm''s obsession with large-scale fantasy warfare, Jack the Wizard decides to migrate to the sanest place he can think of: Melbourne''s Western suburbs. After accidentally causing Flinders Street Station to turn ever so slightly into a giant Fish monster, his existence (and that of his fellow magical immigrants) is revealed to the Australian public. Fearing a backlash against himself and his kind, Jack swears off using magic in a bid to better assimilate into human life. But of course, fitting in was never going to be easy when people tend to get a bit ''explode-y'' whenever you sneeze...', 'Fed up with the Magical Realm''s obsession with large-scale fantasy warfare, Jack the Wizard decides to migrate to the sanest place he can think of: Melbourne''s Western suburbs. After accidentally causing Flinders Street Station to turn ever so slightly into a giant Fish monster, his existence (and that of his fellow magical immigrants) is revealed to the Australian public. Fearing a backlash against himself and his kind, Jack swears off using magic in a bid to better assimilate into human life. But of course, fitting in was never going to be easy when people tend to get a bit ''explode-y'' whenever you sneeze...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/at8aZFnICBiGC3Xr88Ao3Sv7zvW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65677'),
  ('258316624406279464', 'The Wolf', 2020, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', '陈玉珊, 王为', null, 'Darren Wang, Li Qin, Xiao Zhan, Xin Zhilei, Shu-yao Kuo, Lin Yo-Wei, Ding Yongdai', 'NR', 'Towards the end of the Tang Dynasty, Zhu Wen usurped the throne and established the Liang Kingdom. A boy from the wild accidentally falls off a cliff while being pursued for saving wolf pups. He is rescued by Zhu Wen who adopts him as a son, and is renamed Zhu Youwen. Ten years later, the young boy has been conferred the title Prince of Bo and he meets and falls in love with Zhaixing, the daughter of a governor. Zhaixing discovers that Zhu Youwen is kind and righteous in spite of his status and the two become embroiled in a struggle for power.', 'Towards the end of the Tang Dynasty, Zhu Wen usurped the throne and established the Liang Kingdom. A boy from the wild accidentally falls off a cliff while being pursued for saving wolf pups. He is rescued by Zhu Wen who adopts him as a son, and is renamed Zhu Youwen. Ten years later, the young boy has been conferred the title Prince of Bo and he meets and falls in love with Zhaixing, the daughter of a governor. Zhaixing discovers that Zhu Youwen is kind and righteous in spite of his status and the two become embroiled in a struggle for power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1ykZNT8N82P9CSHg7HhledEbOx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100033'),
  ('1903447632354898', 'The Woman in the House Across the Street from the Girl in the Window', 2022, 'Mystery, Crime, Comedy', 'Hugh Davidson, Larry Dorf, Rachel Ramras', null, 'Kristen Bell, Tom Riley', 'TV-MA', 'For Anna, every day is the same. She sits with her wine, staring out the window, watching life go by without her. But when a handsome neighbor moves in across the street, Anna starts to see a light at the end of the tunnel. That is until she witnesses a gruesome murder… Or did she?', 'For Anna, every day is the same. She sits with her wine, staring out the window, watching life go by without her. But when a handsome neighbor moves in across the street, Anna starts to see a light at the end of the tunnel. That is until she witnesses a gruesome murder… Or did she?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/riSoMsWYkwqed4ul5PgHOnbIVFp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:111838'),
  ('532859492351285105', 'The Woman in the Wall', 2023, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Joe Murtagh', null, 'Ruth Wilson, Daryl McCormack, Abby Fitz, Mark Huberman, Hilda Fay, Simon Delaney, Phillipa Dunne, Frances Tomelty', 'TV-MA', 'When Lorna Brady, a survivor of one of Ireland''s Magdalene Laundries, wakes to find a corpse in her house, she has no idea who the dead woman is or if she''s responsible for the apparent murder, because she has long suffered from extreme bouts of sleepwalking.', 'When Lorna Brady, a survivor of one of Ireland''s Magdalene Laundries, wakes to find a corpse in her house, she has no idea who the dead woman is or if she''s responsible for the apparent murder, because she has long suffered from extreme bouts of sleepwalking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tnqCuFq0RNBCdI8Tl3nFD0WLlis.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209922'),
  ('187903187989584532', 'The Woman in White', 2018, 'Drama, Mystery', null, 'Fiona Seres', 'Olivia Vinall, Jessie Buckley, Ben Hardy, Dougray Scott, Riccardo Scamarcio, Clare McMahon, Charles Dance, Ivan Kaye', null, 'The lives of two half-sisters and their drawing master get caught up in a deadly conspiracy revolving around a mentally ill woman dressed all in white.', 'The lives of two half-sisters and their drawing master get caught up in a deadly conspiracy revolving around a mentally ill woman dressed all in white.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/crtxUhsdf6SpodR5A7ECyhZ6g0X.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79012'),
  ('24344358498483615', 'The Woman of S.R.I.', 1999, 'Drama', null, null, 'Yasuko Sawaguchi', null, 'Mariko is a forensic scientist working at the Kyoto PD Crime Lab. Her credo is “science never lies” and she delves into the truth of the case with her colleagues with their specialized skills and knowledge in forensic medicine, physics, chemistry etc. Mariko’s steadfast belief in science makes her stand against conventional institutional ethics of the police department, diehard detectives averse to scientific investigation and sometimes even with her own colleagues, but she stays faithful to her belief in science and continues to pursue the truth.', 'Mariko is a forensic scientist working at the Kyoto PD Crime Lab. Her credo is “science never lies” and she delves into the truth of the case with her colleagues with their specialized skills and knowledge in forensic medicine, physics, chemistry etc. Mariko’s steadfast belief in science makes her stand against conventional institutional ethics of the police department, diehard detectives averse to scientific investigation and sometimes even with her own colleagues, but she stays faithful to her belief in science and continues to pursue the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3yhUPZ5ojuxktyt2dfA0SLMOBEv.jpg', 24, 'tmdb:tv:55891'),
  ('1030050312519772236', 'The Wombles', 1973, 'Animation, Family', 'Elizabeth Beresford', null, 'Bernard Cribbins', null, 'The misadventures of a small community dedicated to cleaning up litter and putting it to their own use.', 'The misadventures of a small community dedicated to cleaning up litter and putting it to their own use.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xoxXtDpwJGBkoGiOCYdRI8wcxac.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:15122'),
  ('51929494941658212', 'The Wonder Years', 1988, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Neal Marlens, Carol Black', null, 'Fred Savage, Dan Lauria, Alley Mills, Jason Hervey, Danica McKellar, Josh Saviano, Daniel Stern', 'TV-PG', 'The story of Kevin Arnold facing the trials and tribulations of youth while growing up during the 1960s and 70s. Told through narration from an adult Kevin, Kevin faces the difficulties of maintaining relationships and friendships on his enthralling journey into adulthood.', 'The story of Kevin Arnold facing the trials and tribulations of youth while growing up during the 1960s and 70s. Told through narration from an adult Kevin, Kevin faces the difficulties of maintaining relationships and friendships on his enthralling journey into adulthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkaduqdhFrF1vp8L55OJfB5jw8Z.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:4500'),
  ('255563766575612505', 'The Wonder Years', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Saladin K. Patterson', null, 'Elisha Williams, Dulé Hill, Saycon Sengbloh, Laura Kariuki, Amari O''Neil, Julian Lerner, Milan Ray, Don Cheadle', 'TV-PG', 'A coming of age story set in the late 1960s that takes a nostalgic look at a black middle-class family in Montgomery, Alabama through the point-of-view of imaginative 12 year-old Dean. With the wisdom of his adult years, Dean’s hopeful and humorous recollections show how his family found their “wonder years” in a turbulent time. Inspired by the classic series of the same name.', 'A coming of age story set in the late 1960s that takes a nostalgic look at a black middle-class family in Montgomery, Alabama through the point-of-view of imaginative 12 year-old Dean. With the wisdom of his adult years, Dean’s hopeful and humorous recollections show how his family found their “wonder years” in a turbulent time. Inspired by the classic series of the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/stTtZ97QiXTvCQFDF6rNfFfFt9K.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:126164'),
  ('260897051964434641', 'The Wonderful Adventures of Nils', 1980, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, 'Mami Koyama, Masane Tsukayama, Joji Yanami, Masako Ikeda, Tadashi Yamazaki, Hideyuki Tanaka, Yoshito Yasuhara, Keiko Yokozawa', null, 'Nils Holgersson is a young boy on a farm who is cruel to the animals. But when he catches the farm''s little goblin it becomes one prank too many. He is magically shrunk and suddenly the farm animals are out for revenge. He flees on the back of the goose Morten and they join up with a flock of wild geese. Together they travel all over Sweden, with Nils hoping to find a way to become big again.', 'Nils Holgersson is a young boy on a farm who is cruel to the animals. But when he catches the farm''s little goblin it becomes one prank too many. He is magically shrunk and suddenly the farm animals are out for revenge. He flees on the back of the goose Morten and they join up with a flock of wild geese. Together they travel all over Sweden, with Nils hoping to find a way to become big again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eoCxhDHMGx2i3qUBWu3N6tBRxbx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19521'),
  ('1130782139990175320', 'The Wonderful Wizard of Oz', 1986, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Family, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Hiro Obayashi, Katsu Denka', null, 'Sumi Shimamoto, Yoshito Yasuhara, Takuzō Kamiyama, Ichiro Nagai, Masako Nozawa, Osamu Saka, Tamio Ohki, Rihoko Yoshida', null, 'A young girl named Dorothy has gone to live with her grandparents on their small farm. One day when Dorothy is left alone in the house a tornado appears. Dorothy fails to get to the basement in time, and the entire house is picked up and transported to a magical land, falling on and killing a wicked witch. There she is informed by a good witch that she must travel to the Capital of Emerald and meet a great magician who may be able to help her find a way home. Along the way she makes some incredible friends and sees many strange and fantastic things.', 'A young girl named Dorothy has gone to live with her grandparents on their small farm. One day when Dorothy is left alone in the house a tornado appears. Dorothy fails to get to the basement in time, and the entire house is picked up and transported to a magical land, falling on and killing a wicked witch. There she is informed by a good witch that she must travel to the Capital of Emerald and meet a great magician who may be able to help her find a way home. Along the way she makes some incredible friends and sees many strange and fantastic things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gULxsk1pbbhqal80ghawS2ZZhaY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66081'),
  ('446194137997520493', 'The Wonderful World of Disney', 1954, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Documentary, Kids, Family', null, null, 'Michael Eisner', 'NR', 'Walt Disney Productions has produced an anthology television series under several different titles since 1954. The original version of the series premiered on ABC, Wednesday night, October 27, 1954. The show, which was hosted by Walt Disney until his death and then from 1996 to 2002 by then-CEO Michael Eisner (with one-off hosts or no hosts during other periods) has since aired continually as either a weekly program or an irregular series of specials on several networks and streaming services, most recently on ABC and Disney+. The show is the second longest showing prime-time program on American television, behind its rival, Hallmark Hall of Fame. However, Hallmark Hall of Fame was a weekly program only during its first five seasons, while Disney remained a weekly program for more than forty years.', 'Walt Disney Productions has produced an anthology television series under several different titles since 1954. The original version of the series premiered on ABC, Wednesday night, October 27, 1954. The show, which was hosted by Walt Disney until his death and then from 1996 to 2002 by then-CEO Michael Eisner (with one-off hosts or no hosts during other periods) has since aired continually as either a weekly program or an irregular series of specials on several networks and streaming services, most recently on ABC and Disney+. The show is the second longest showing prime-time program on American television, behind its rival, Hallmark Hall of Fame. However, Hallmark Hall of Fame was a weekly program only during its first five seasons, while Disney remained a weekly program for more than forty years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qxzolPXbAigjPANgTOdXXDxqcbr.jpg', 34, 'tmdb:tv:4231'),
  ('406471972725863348', 'The Wonderful World of Disney', 1997, 'Animation, Family', null, null, null, null, 'Walt Disney Productions (later The Walt Disney Company) has produced an anthology television series under several different titles since 1954. The original version of the series premiered on ABC in 1954. The show was broadcast weekly on one of the Big Three television networks until 1990, a 36-year span with only a two-year hiatus in 1984-85. The series was broadcast on Sunday for 25 of those years. From 1991 until 1997, the series aired infrequently. The program resumed a regular schedule in 1997 on the ABC fall schedule, coinciding with Disney''s recent purchase of the network. From 1997 until 2008, the program aired regularly on ABC. Subsequently, ABC continued the series as an occasional special presentation.', 'Walt Disney Productions (later The Walt Disney Company) has produced an anthology television series under several different titles since 1954. The original version of the series premiered on ABC in 1954. The show was broadcast weekly on one of the Big Three television networks until 1990, a 36-year span with only a two-year hiatus in 1984-85. The series was broadcast on Sunday for 25 of those years. From 1991 until 1997, the series aired infrequently. The program resumed a regular schedule in 1997 on the ABC fall schedule, coinciding with Disney''s recent purchase of the network. From 1997 until 2008, the program aired regularly on ABC. Subsequently, ABC continued the series as an occasional special presentation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/liQIvgYvnNwqjV6MvnFzvlXJNL2.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:23936'),
  ('753603261091230774', 'The Wonderful World of Mickey Mouse', 2020, 'Animation, Family, Kids', 'Darrick Bachman', null, 'Chris Diamantopoulos, Kaitlyn Robrock, Bill Farmer, Tony Anselmo, Tress MacNeille', 'TV-G', 'It''s nothing but fun and excitement for Mickey and his best pals – Minnie, Donald, Daisy, Goofy and Pluto - as they embark on their greatest adventures yet, navigating the curveballs of a wild and zany world where the magic of Disney makes the impossible possible.', 'It''s nothing but fun and excitement for Mickey and his best pals – Minnie, Donald, Daisy, Goofy and Pluto - as they embark on their greatest adventures yet, navigating the curveballs of a wild and zany world where the magic of Disney makes the impossible possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8F1V4ve64YPmyRZZ5u0jh7KCIID.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109930'),
  ('990288429661361370', 'The Wonderfully Weird World of Gumball', 2025, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ben Bocquelet', null, 'Alkaio Thiele, Hero Hunter, Kinza Khan, Teresa Gallagher, Dan Russell', 'TV-PG', 'Welcome back to Elmore, where the laws of reality are a joke, and family life is anything but ordinary. Whether he''s battling an evil fast-food empire, facing off against a sentient AI in love with his mom, or trying to stop Banana Joe from wearing pants — Gumball Watterson drags his brother Darwin, sister Anais, and the rest of the town of Elmore along for the ride. With even wilder stories, bigger twists, and surreal humor, the show is so amazing that they had to rename it!', 'Welcome back to Elmore, where the laws of reality are a joke, and family life is anything but ordinary. Whether he''s battling an evil fast-food empire, facing off against a sentient AI in love with his mom, or trying to stop Banana Joe from wearing pants — Gumball Watterson drags his brother Darwin, sister Anais, and the rest of the town of Elmore along for the ride. With even wilder stories, bigger twists, and surreal humor, the show is so amazing that they had to rename it!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wG6tRzXB8lTE03i7NaqwO04z5Oy.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:291904'),
  ('867427771801523219', 'The Wonderland of Ten Thousands', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, null, null, 'Ye Xingyu''’s master Yu Huanxian went and left a giant Tianyuan Shenzong. Ye Xingyun became the new leader of the Tianyuan Shenzong. At the same time, he exchanged place with the tenth prince of King Qi, and became a child of a small family, hidden in it, waiting for revenge. Ye Xingyun embarked on a very dangerous road, but with his own strategy, and Tianyuan Shenzong masters of all the help of experts, vertical and horizontal tactics, strategizing, against the huge Grand Dynasty.', 'Ye Xingyu''’s master Yu Huanxian went and left a giant Tianyuan Shenzong. Ye Xingyun became the new leader of the Tianyuan Shenzong. At the same time, he exchanged place with the tenth prince of King Qi, and became a child of a small family, hidden in it, waiting for revenge. Ye Xingyun embarked on a very dangerous road, but with his own strategy, and Tianyuan Shenzong masters of all the help of experts, vertical and horizontal tactics, strategizing, against the huge Grand Dynasty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fDLczJzCijwo9M73XkZPzsAull.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:89364'),
  ('477184211319330265', 'The Woods', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Grzegorz Damięcki, Hubert Miłkowski, Agnieszka Grochowska, Wiktoria Filus, Adam Wietrzyński, Jacek Koman, Ewa Skibińska, Roman Gancarczyk', 'TV-MA', 'Evidence found on the body of a homicide victim sparks hope in a prosecutor that his sister who disappeared 25 years earlier could still be alive.', 'Evidence found on the body of a homicide victim sparks hope in a prosecutor that his sister who disappeared 25 years earlier could still be alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cA0o5dT1xCAQNKl8ShYNf84AySO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103425'),
  ('851542150010713682', 'The World According to Jeff Goldblum', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Jeff Goldblum', 'TV-PG', 'Through the prism of Jeff Goldblum''s always inquisitive and highly entertaining mind, nothing is as it seems. Each episode is centered around something we all love — like sneakers or ice cream — as Jeff pulls the thread on these deceptively familiar objects and unravels a wonderful world of astonishing connections, fascinating science and history, amazing people, and a whole lot of surprising big ideas and insights.', 'Through the prism of Jeff Goldblum''s always inquisitive and highly entertaining mind, nothing is as it seems. Each episode is centered around something we all love — like sneakers or ice cream — as Jeff pulls the thread on these deceptively familiar objects and unravels a wonderful world of astonishing connections, fascinating science and history, amazing people, and a whole lot of surprising big ideas and insights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vvdsYCsCPeyBWqIMIwsVXiZISrU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:92807'),
  ('1019771356540551238', 'The World at War', 1973, 'Documentary, War & Politics', null, null, 'Laurence Olivier', 'TV-PG', 'A documentary series that gives a historical account of the events of World War II, from its roots in the 1920s to the aftermath and the lives it profoundly influenced.', 'A documentary series that gives a historical account of the events of World War II, from its roots in the 1920s to the aftermath and the lives it profoundly influenced.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bWdwEYQQEsz9HuXy5m95z95BYQM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:751'),
  ('359311223204671487', 'The World Between Us', 2019, 'Drama', null, null, 'Vic Chou, Simon Hsueh, Yang Kuei-mei, Sara Yu, Nikki Hsieh, Troy Liu, Bai Run-yin, Brando Huang', null, 'A ten-part hour-long series that follows the aftermath of a mass-shooting where all parties involved - the killer, the victims, the victims’ families, the media and the defense teams, whose fates are all intertwined.', 'A ten-part hour-long series that follows the aftermath of a mass-shooting where all parties involved - the killer, the victims, the victims’ families, the media and the defense teams, whose fates are all intertwined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79SrWiXdxuEmhpXY2MD2e6HPLKs.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:87969'),
  ('179670411307138511', 'The World Ends with You: The Animation', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Koki Uchiyama, Anna Hachimine, Ayana Taketatsu, Subaru Kimura, Ryohei Kimura, Kenji Takahashi, Takayuki Fujimoto, Anri Katsu', 'TV-14', 'Neku awakens in the middle of Shibuya''s bustling Scramble Crossing with no memory of how he got there. Little does he know, he''s been transported to an alternate plane of existence known as the Underground. Now an unwilling participant in the mysterious "Reapers'' Game," Neku must partner up with a girl named Shiki in order to survive...', 'Neku awakens in the middle of Shibuya''s bustling Scramble Crossing with no memory of how he got there. Little does he know, he''s been transported to an alternate plane of existence known as the Underground. Now an unwilling participant in the mysterious "Reapers'' Game," Neku must partner up with a girl named Shiki in order to survive...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qbkiUDUkJIcb5Jgc6kYIfBKE1i.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105249'),
  ('89818898728127227', 'The World God Only Knows', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kanae Itou, Ryoka Yuzuki, Hiro Shimono, Kana Hanazawa, Saori Hayami, Ayana Taketatsu, Aoi Yuuki, Nao Toyama', 'TV-14', 'Keima is a dating sim champion. Cute girls are rendered powerless by his irresistible game playing techniques. Too bad things aren''t that way in the real world. That is, until his tempting game playing causes a real live—and very bubbly-cute—demon hunter named Elsie to materialize! Now Elsie wants Keima to help her free hot girls from sneaky demons who secretly possess them.', 'Keima is a dating sim champion. Cute girls are rendered powerless by his irresistible game playing techniques. Too bad things aren''t that way in the real world. That is, until his tempting game playing causes a real live—and very bubbly-cute—demon hunter named Elsie to materialize! Now Elsie wants Keima to help her free hot girls from sneaky demons who secretly possess them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7OmvlaTEivrL1WsHAnLu4D3RnUt.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:56351'),
  ('698386808047554941', 'The World in Front', 1987, 'Documentary, Talk', null, null, null, 'NR', 'Weekly current affairs show', 'Weekly current affairs show', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rs0TKkcfuCjb3Ein1v3ZOUYTqDU.jpg', 20, 'tmdb:tv:95221'),
  ('147631714548561076', 'The World in Images', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Sonia Devillers', 'Alexandre Laurent, Caroline Diebold, Mathis Lescanne', 'Sonia Devillers', null, 'Telling the story of an image: From its creation to its impact on our vision of the world, how can we explain its power? The World in Images offers an interpretation that asks us to look beyond the first glance.', 'Telling the story of an image: From its creation to its impact on our vision of the world, how can we explain its power? The World in Images offers an interpretation that asks us to look beyond the first glance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vB3XtADWR9LXX8AKMuKOzg2OEBE.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:219841'),
  ('1090671063776260865', 'The World is Still Beautiful', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Rena Maeda, Haruka Kudou, Tomokazu Sugita, Chisa Yokoyama, Mariya Ise, Nobunaga Shimazaki', 'TV-14', 'Nike, the fourth princess of the Principality of Rain and one who holds the power to call forth the rain, travels to the Sun Kingdom to marry Sun King Livius for her country, despite her own reluctance. She soon discovers that the King, who conquered the world in only three years after his ascendance to the throne, is still a child!! Furthermore, for trivial reasons, he has demanded that Nike call forth the rain…!?', 'Nike, the fourth princess of the Principality of Rain and one who holds the power to call forth the rain, travels to the Sun Kingdom to marry Sun King Livius for her country, despite her own reluctance. She soon discovers that the King, who conquered the world in only three years after his ascendance to the throne, is still a child!! Furthermore, for trivial reasons, he has demanded that Nike call forth the rain…!?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5dsvoY06sJR86y7L8DPqOQV2gUi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60818'),
  ('681589675276424193', 'The World of David the Gnome', 1985, 'Animation, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Claudio Biern Boyd', null, 'José María Cordero, Matilde Conesa, Teófilo Martínez, Ramón Langa, Manuel Peiró, Paco Hernández', 'TV-Y', 'A Spanish animated television series based on the children''s book The Secret Book of Gnomes, by the Dutch author Wil Huygen and illustrator Rien Poortvliet.', 'A Spanish animated television series based on the children''s book The Secret Book of Gnomes, by the Dutch author Wil Huygen and illustrator Rien Poortvliet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9jvDfTtMVLbcNV0gyt69ROZa6Yb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2849'),
  ('617273071204835709', 'The World of Hammer', 1994, 'Documentary', 'Robert Sidaway, Ashley Sidaway', 'Robert Sidaway, Ashley Sidaway', 'Oliver Reed', null, 'The World of Hammer is a thirteen-part British documentary series created and written by Robert and Ashley Sidaway for Channel 4. Initially broadcast from 12 August to 4 November 1994, the series is narrated by English actor and frequent Hammer collaborator Oliver Reed.', 'The World of Hammer is a thirteen-part British documentary series created and written by Robert and Ashley Sidaway for Channel 4. Initially broadcast from 12 August to 4 November 1994, the series is narrated by English actor and frequent Hammer collaborator Oliver Reed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXuCwrKNsOfPzrDoSl8dj3eYw5i.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:134764'),
  ('656686665473629543', 'The World of My 17', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Choi Seon-mi', null, 'Choi Ye-na, Yoo Seon-ho, Hwang Bo-reum-byeol, Lee Won-jeong, Han Chae-kyung, Han Ji-hyo, Kwon Hyun-bin, Yang Seo-hyun', null, 'Four high school girls navigate insecurities, challenges, and personal growth while forming deep bonds of friendship. As Oh Na-ri adjusts to a new chapter in her life, she finds support in her elegant childhood friend Yoo Na, protective classmate Sun Ji, and idol trainee Mi Rae. Together, they face struggles and discover the true meaning of friendship.', 'Four high school girls navigate insecurities, challenges, and personal growth while forming deep bonds of friendship. As Oh Na-ri adjusts to a new chapter in her life, she finds support in her elegant childhood friend Yoo Na, protective classmate Sun Ji, and idol trainee Mi Rae. Together, they face struggles and discover the true meaning of friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXbZzHm3TWCoxeiZdovw8s0h2lS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:102938'),
  ('475780665148690332', 'The World of Peter Rabbit and Friends', 1992, 'Animation, Family', 'Colin Towns, Dianne Jackson, John Coates', 'Dianne Jackson', 'Niamh Cusack', 'TV-G', 'Nine animated stories based on the original Peter Rabbit books by Beatrix Potter.', 'Nine animated stories based on the original Peter Rabbit books by Beatrix Potter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tji54kBnBhcaraT0sVr2wwRP11Y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10817'),
  ('994503630046329773', 'The World of the Married', 2020, 'Drama', 'Kang Eun-kyung, Mo Wan-il', 'Joo Hyun', 'Kim Hee-ae, Park Hae-joon, Han So-hee, Park Sun-young, Kim Young-min, Chae Kook-hee, Lee Kyung-young, Kim Sun-kyung', 'TV-MA', 'Ji Sun Woo is an associate director of a family clinic with a perfect life—a great career, married to a handsome, young-looking man, mother to an adoring son, and surrounded by seemingly caring friends. She couldn''t be more content. Lee Tae Oh, her husband, is an aspiring movie director. However, when his temptation leads him to betray Sun Woo along with the people around her, she gets driven to revenge. The perilous twists-and-turns of a married couple''s life unfolds.', 'Ji Sun Woo is an associate director of a family clinic with a perfect life—a great career, married to a handsome, young-looking man, mother to an adoring son, and surrounded by seemingly caring friends. She couldn''t be more content. Lee Tae Oh, her husband, is an aspiring movie director. However, when his temptation leads him to betray Sun Woo along with the people around her, she gets driven to revenge. The perilous twists-and-turns of a married couple''s life unfolds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/240WwUgMGGgIF4gUWg0ecVfSeKE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96164'),
  ('27780153334876275', 'The World Wars', 2014, 'Documentary, War & Politics', null, 'Frederick Rendina, Alec Michod, Keith Palmer', 'Dean Gosdin, Ian Beyts, David Mitchum Brown, C. Conrad Cady, Jonathan Hartman, Don Meehan Jr, Michael Perrie Jr., Jacopo Rampini', null, 'The story of three decades of war told through the eyes of various men who were its key players: Roosevelt, Hitler, Patton, Mussolini, Churchill, Tojo, DeGaulle and MacArthur. The series examines the two wars as one contiguous timeline starting in 1914 and concluding in 1945 with these unique individuals coming of age in World War I before ultimately calling the shots in World War II.', 'The story of three decades of war told through the eyes of various men who were its key players: Roosevelt, Hitler, Patton, Mussolini, Churchill, Tojo, DeGaulle and MacArthur. The series examines the two wars as one contiguous timeline starting in 1914 and concluding in 1945 with these unique individuals coming of age in World War I before ultimately calling the shots in World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3KL7tlWsaLpB7zL1yAO5BZhoXG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61132'),
  ('410876425776870682', 'The World''s Finest Assassin Gets Reincarnated in Another World as an Aristocrat', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kenji Akabane, Reina Ueda, Yuuki Takada, Shino Shimoji, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Chiaki Takahashi, Yukari Tamura, Junpei Morita', 'TV-14', 'The world''s number one assassin has been reincarnated as the eldest son of a family of aristocrat assassins. In exchange for being reincarnated in another world, a goddess has imposed upon him one condition. "Kill the Hero who is prophesied to destroy the world." This was to be the mission in his new life. The synergistic effect of the vast knowledge and experience he gained that made all manner of assassinations possible in the modern world, and the secret techniques and magic of the fantasy world''s most powerful family of assassins turn him into the greatest assassin of all time.', 'The world''s number one assassin has been reincarnated as the eldest son of a family of aristocrat assassins. In exchange for being reincarnated in another world, a goddess has imposed upon him one condition. "Kill the Hero who is prophesied to destroy the world." This was to be the mission in his new life. The synergistic effect of the vast knowledge and experience he gained that made all manner of assassinations possible in the modern world, and the secret techniques and magic of the fantasy world''s most powerful family of assassins turn him into the greatest assassin of all time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iusQCT2pje1Mc8A8LKnW1uZ5BOO.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:118821'),
  ('709006826860098327', 'The World''s Greatest Super Friends', 1979, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Casey Kasem, Michael Bell, Olan Soule, Shannon Farnon, William Callaway, Danny Dark', null, 'The World''s Greatest Super Friends is an American animated television series about a team of superheroes which ran from September 22, 1979 to September 27, 1980 on ABC. It was produced by Hanna-Barbera and is based on the Justice League and associated comic book characters published by DC Comics.', 'The World''s Greatest Super Friends is an American animated television series about a team of superheroes which ran from September 22, 1979 to September 27, 1980 on ABC. It was produced by Hanna-Barbera and is based on the Justice League and associated comic book characters published by DC Comics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/arfqzHgDJsGpd5SSnGo8uBKFV8d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10158'),
  ('556238190269898996', 'The World''s Most Amazing Vacation Rentals', 2021, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, 'Jo Franco, Megan Batoon, Luis D. Ortiz', null, 'With an eye for every budget, three travelers visit vacation rentals around the globe and share their expert tips and tricks in this reality series.', 'With an eye for every budget, three travelers visit vacation rentals around the globe and share their expert tips and tricks in this reality series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BVUyg7Gh1EixUdmH8hxCwQM26j.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:127723'),
