  ('699771458599648314', 'They and I', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Costas Pretederis', 'Costas Pretederis', 'Giannis Bezos, Loukia Pistiola, Rania Papadakou, Niki Sereti, Valeria Kouroupi, Tasos Kostis, Panos Hatzikoutselis, Sotiris Skantzikas', null, 'The adventures of a vulture, an exquisite, handsome and particularly charming man who loves and is loved too much by women.', 'The adventures of a vulture, an exquisite, handsome and particularly charming man who loves and is loved too much by women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d6BijwiD9n6o3qcdTFAZtUjVIy9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:17020'),
  ('800798887586237694', 'They Are My Noble Masters', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Shizuka Itoh, Asuka Minamori, Yuko Goto, Tomokazu Seki, Yosuke Akimoto', null, 'Uesugi Ren and his sister Mihato ran away from home because of domestic violence. When they at last reach the city they have a hard time finding work to earn some money. They eventually enter the service of the Kuonji family, making a pledge of absolute loyalty. Thus Ren''s days of being a butler to the demanding Kuonji heir begins...', 'Uesugi Ren and his sister Mihato ran away from home because of domestic violence. When they at last reach the city they have a hard time finding work to earn some money. They eventually enter the service of the Kuonji family, making a pledge of absolute loyalty. Thus Ren''s days of being a butler to the demanding Kuonji heir begins...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/grGacfAwNtsqPfrhNwcx34q7ftx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79044'),
  ('1132334230955163460', 'They Call Me Magic', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Paul Westhead, Jeanie Buss, Magic Johnson, Michael Cooper, Jerry West, Byron Scott, Larry Bird, Kareem Abdul-Jabbar', 'TV-MA', 'Earvin “Magic” Johnson is an icon for the ages—from humble beginnings to the Dream Team to business titan. Featuring interviews with President Obama, Larry Bird, Pat Riley, and more, this docuseries charts the life and career of a legend.', 'Earvin “Magic” Johnson is an icon for the ages—from humble beginnings to the Dream Team to business titan. Featuring interviews with President Obama, Larry Bird, Pat Riley, and more, this docuseries charts the life and career of a legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJKpiQYPiCfmsiwVKAMBcF65puR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157002'),
  ('933886191847129732', 'They Think It''s All Over', 1995, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Nick Hancock, Gary Lineker, David Gower, David Seaman, Jonathan Ross, Ian Wright, Des Lynam, Phil Tufnell', null, 'They Think It''s All Over is a British comedy panel game with a sporting theme produced by Talkback and shown on BBC One. The show''s name is taken from Kenneth Wolstenholme''s famous 1966 World Cup commentary quotation, "they think it''s all over...it is now!" and the show used the phrase as the last line of every programme. In 2006 the show was axed after 11 years of being on-air.', 'They Think It''s All Over is a British comedy panel game with a sporting theme produced by Talkback and shown on BBC One. The show''s name is taken from Kenneth Wolstenholme''s famous 1966 World Cup commentary quotation, "they think it''s all over...it is now!" and the show used the phrase as the last line of every programme. In 2006 the show was axed after 11 years of being on-air.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDcjD4PchrJIfwYyvIqmtHY5uCp.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:2469'),
  ('1140167340175725859', 'They Were Ten', 2021, 'Crime, Mystery', null, 'Agatha Christie', 'Samuel Le Bihan, Matilda Lutz, Romane Bohringer, Marianne Denicourt, Patrick Mille, Manon Azem, Guillaume de Tonquédec, Nassim Lyes', 'TV-MA', 'Ten people, five women, five men, are invited to a luxury hotel on a deserted tropical island. They soon realize they are completely isolated, cut off from the rest of the word and all means of communication, which rapidly becomes their worst nightmare.', 'Ten people, five women, five men, are invited to a luxury hotel on a deserted tropical island. They soon realize they are completely isolated, cut off from the rest of the word and all means of communication, which rapidly becomes their worst nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vowNBCgOrKVvAI98KVzDdCcBCdi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106084'),
  ('807861082182054543', 'Thicker Than Water', 2014, 'Drama', 'Henrik Jansson-Schweizer', 'Veronica Zacco, Morgan Jensen, Niklas Rockström', 'Joel Spira, Björn Bengtsson, Aliette Opheim, Saga Sarkola, Jessica Grabowsky, Molly Nutley, Tobias Zilliacus, Stina Ekblad', null, 'The beautiful island of Sunnanö in the Swedish archipelago is home to a popular B&B run by Anna-Lisa and her son Oskar. Anna-Lisa has summoned her daughter Jonna, an actress, and son Lasse, an opportunist, to the island. It is the first time in years that they are together again. When Anna-Lisa is found dead one morning, the siblings learn that she had terminal cancer: Her will stipulates that all three siblings must run the family B&B together for a year, or they won''t inherit it at all. It is a mother’s last effort to reunite her children. But it will also confront them with the family’s unsolved past, present forces of attraction, and a very dark secret buried in a most unfortunate place...', 'The beautiful island of Sunnanö in the Swedish archipelago is home to a popular B&B run by Anna-Lisa and her son Oskar. Anna-Lisa has summoned her daughter Jonna, an actress, and son Lasse, an opportunist, to the island. It is the first time in years that they are together again. When Anna-Lisa is found dead one morning, the siblings learn that she had terminal cancer: Her will stipulates that all three siblings must run the family B&B together for a year, or they won''t inherit it at all. It is a mother’s last effort to reunite her children. But it will also confront them with the family’s unsolved past, present forces of attraction, and a very dark secret buried in a most unfortunate place...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qppTL3aFz2qxy6J6jHyqfZdlJNi.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:65344'),
  ('876964820828282983', 'Thicker Than Water', 2023, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Nawell Madani, Simon Jablonka', 'Mohamed Benyekhlef, Simon Jablonka, Nawell Madani', 'Nawell Madani, Kahina Carina, Carima Amarouche, Paola Locatelli, Djebril Zonga, Paul Hamy, Vincent Rottiers, Walid Afkir', 'TV-MA', 'A journalist''s life devolves into chaos when she shields her brother from the law, inadvertently entangling her family in a drug lord''s merciless scheme.', 'A journalist''s life devolves into chaos when she shields her brother from the law, inadvertently entangling her family in a drug lord''s merciless scheme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rDVfTRXMP5iwO7EgmVA5ivUwli4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222559'),
  ('981540999689113031', 'Thief', 2006, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Andre Braugher, Yancey Arias, Malik Yoba, Mae Whitman, Clifton Collins Jr., Michael Rooker, Will Yun Lee', null, 'Nick Atwater, the leader of a robbery crew, is balancing his personal life with the planning of a major heist while being targeted by a relentless cop and the Chinese mafia.', 'Nick Atwater, the leader of a robbery crew, is balancing his personal life with the planning of a major heist while being targeted by a relentless cop and the Chinese mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKbOJ6Cgsg0yxZvvxGEZvKG4T67.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3929'),
  ('871306385104914137', 'Thieves of the Wood', 2020, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Mystery', 'Pieter Van Hees, Maarten Moerkerke, Robin Pront', 'Christophe Dirickx, Benjamin Sprengers', 'Matteo Simoni, Stef Aerts, Jeroen Perceval, Dirk Roofthooft, Tom van Dyck, Anne-Laure Vandeputte, Charlotte Timmers, Anemone Valcke', 'TV-MA', 'Charismatic highwayman Jan de Lichte leads the oppressed and downtrodden in a revolt against the corrupt aristocracy of 18th-century Belgium.', 'Charismatic highwayman Jan de Lichte leads the oppressed and downtrodden in a revolt against the corrupt aristocracy of 18th-century Belgium.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQNOzoiaIQWxJAx8OUighnvnhRA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93533'),
