  ('922452357463234731', 'Tico and Friends', 1994, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Kōzō Kusuba', null, 'Chiyoko Kawashima, Megumi Hayashibara, Akiko Yajima, Shuichi Ikeda, Daisuke Gori, Bin Shimada, Hiroshi Masuoka, Hiroya Ishimaru', 'NR', 'Tico and Friends tells the story of 11-year-old Nanami Simpson and her life-long friendship with a female orca named Tico. The two have an unbreakable bond and swim with each other every day. As a result of this, Nanami has learned how to hold her breath longer and swim deeper than other humans can.', 'Tico and Friends tells the story of 11-year-old Nanami Simpson and her life-long friendship with a female orca named Tico. The two have an unbreakable bond and swim with each other every day. As a result of this, Nanami has learned how to hold her breath longer and swim deeper than other humans can.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4JZ7TjxgN7rA1vFhDqVTWvI4sC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34160'),
  ('295959399847577776', 'Tide of Love', 2025, 'Drama', 'Huh Namhee', null, 'Kim Hyun-seo, Jung Myeong-cheol', null, 'A wealthy heir and an art student enter a transactional arrangement that slowly deepens into real affection, forcing them to face what they truly want.', 'A wealthy heir and an art student enter a transactional arrangement that slowly deepens into real affection, forcing them to face what they truly want.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hNwqY2IqbcGEPTQ9nsWbUmR5pLs.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:303693'),
  ('428849328431169120', 'Tidelands', 2018, 'Drama, Crime, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Stephen M. Irwin, Tracey Robertson, Nathan Mayfield', null, 'Charlotte Best, Marco Pigossi, Elsa Pataky', 'TV-MA', 'Ex-con Cal McTeer''s return to her hometown of Orphelin Bay blows the lid off a generations-long conspiracy of silence around murder, drugs and Sirens.', 'Ex-con Cal McTeer''s return to her hometown of Orphelin Bay blows the lid off a generations-long conspiracy of silence around murder, drugs and Sirens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGVQa6Fym1wGkoM5o6LYFTlk6jx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83381'),
  ('467707401925466143', 'Tidying Up with Marie Kondo', 2019, 'Reality', null, 'Marie Kondo', 'Marie Kondo, Marie Iida', 'TV-PG', 'In a series of inspiring home makeovers, world-renowned tidying expert Marie Kondo helps clients clear out the clutter -- and choose joy.', 'In a series of inspiring home makeovers, world-renowned tidying expert Marie Kondo helps clients clear out the clutter -- and choose joy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l74KOb99Ffx4ilSEHrm8voi4XL2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85202'),
  ('1146089546896437385', 'Tientsin Mystic', 2017, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Jin Shijia, Zhang Ming''en, Chen Yumi, Wang Zixuan, Chen Jian, Guo Jiulong', 'TV-14', 'In 1900s Tianjin, a shipping magnate is found mysteriously drowned and chained underwater, and police dive captain Guo Deyou becomes the prime suspect. As the victim’s son, Ding Mao, investigates, more strange drownings occur, forcing him to team up with Guo, a spirit medium, and a journalist. Their search uncovers a dark secret tied to a deadly cult from decades ago, now resurfacing to wreak havoc. Together, they must uncover the truth and stop the rising threat.', 'In 1900s Tianjin, a shipping magnate is found mysteriously drowned and chained underwater, and police dive captain Guo Deyou becomes the prime suspect. As the victim’s son, Ding Mao, investigates, more strange drownings occur, forcing him to team up with Guo, a spirit medium, and a journalist. Their search uncovers a dark secret tied to a deadly cult from decades ago, now resurfacing to wreak havoc. Together, they must uncover the truth and stop the rising threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vsJVbT7uc08lGJ5iA7nJpH0H3kE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:73031'),
