  ('269891738047954241', 'Tig n'' Seek', 2020, 'Kids, Animation', 'Myke Chilian', null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Follow 8-year-old Tiggy and his gadget-building cat, Gweeseek, as they search for the lost items of Wee Gee City. With Tiggy’s cheerful attitude and Gweeseek’s exceptional inventing capabilities, the duo humorously navigate day-to-day dilemmas at the Department of Lost and Found.', 'Follow 8-year-old Tiggy and his gadget-building cat, Gweeseek, as they search for the lost items of Wee Gee City. With Tiggy’s cheerful attitude and Gweeseek’s exceptional inventing capabilities, the duo humorously navigate day-to-day dilemmas at the Department of Lost and Found.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbDxzZX0jJhRgivKwYCA82Q7Klp.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:103672'),
  ('901094322641565180', 'Tiger', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Tiger Woods, Earl Woods, Rachel Uchitel, Dina Parr, Amber Lauria', 'TV-MA', 'A revealing look at the rise, fall, and epic comeback of global icon Tiger Woods. The series paints an intimate picture of the prodigy whose dedication and obsession with the game of golf not only took his fame and success to new heights, but also down a dark, spiraling road that eventually led to a legendary sports comeback, culminated by his victory at the 2019 Masters.', 'A revealing look at the rise, fall, and epic comeback of global icon Tiger Woods. The series paints an intimate picture of the prodigy whose dedication and obsession with the game of golf not only took his fame and success to new heights, but also down a dark, spiraling road that eventually led to a legendary sports comeback, culminated by his victory at the 2019 Masters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7pdRvx5WbPakHCs9BIOgSeW2vg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:116455'),
  ('975462987896786716', 'TIGER & BUNNY', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hiroaki Hirata, Masakazu Morita, Go Inoue, Kenjiro Tsuda, Mariya Ise, Minako Kotobuki, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Taiten Kusunoki', 'TV-14', 'In an alternate New York City protected by a band of superheroes called NEXT, veteran Wild Tiger is forced to team up with rookie Barnaby Brooks Jr.', 'In an alternate New York City protected by a band of superheroes called NEXT, veteran Wild Tiger is forced to team up with rookie Barnaby Brooks Jr.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7wMu4oweCllUTdFFjAhIRTh1L6p.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:39659'),
  ('886856814795747906', 'Tiger and Crane', 2023, 'Action & Adventure', 'Xiaoda Huang', null, 'Jiang Long, Zhang Linghe, Wang Yuwen, Ye Qing, Chen Youwei, He Landou, Dai Xiangyu, Zhang Zhixi', null, 'In a world nearing disaster, a group of teenagers—Hui Zi, Qi Xiaoxuan, Zhao Xintong, and Wang Yuqian—are forced to travel together due to the red pearl. Together, they uncover the truth behind a centuries-old human-demon war and a looming conspiracy. Facing powerful forces, they risk everything to save Earth and restore hope.', 'In a world nearing disaster, a group of teenagers—Hui Zi, Qi Xiaoxuan, Zhao Xintong, and Wang Yuqian—are forced to travel together due to the red pearl. Together, they uncover the truth behind a centuries-old human-demon war and a looming conspiracy. Facing powerful forces, they risk everything to save Earth and restore hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ztVq28pWHrBv6dk6QPa3SjmpQU5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:235589'),
  ('1025089899306130269', 'Tiger and Dragon', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Kankuro Kudo', 'Tomoya Nagase, Junichi Okada, Misaki Itō, Takashi Tsukamoto, Yu Aoi, Toshiyuki Nishida, Sadao Abe, Toshinori Omi', 'TV-14', 'A young yakuza thug apprentices with an indebted comic "rakugo" performer, whose not-so-fashionable son runs a clothes shop in the Harajuku backstreets.', 'A young yakuza thug apprentices with an indebted comic "rakugo" performer, whose not-so-fashionable son runs a clothes shop in the Harajuku backstreets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8gqlOoehwGUO4bXwgb3F6gAUSpI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37970'),
  ('513151956173126586', 'Tiger King', 2020, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Eric Goode, Rebecca Chaiklin', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'A zoo owner spirals out of control amid a cast of eccentric characters in this true murder-for-hire story from the underworld of big cat breeding.', 'A zoo owner spirals out of control amid a cast of eccentric characters in this true murder-for-hire story from the underworld of big cat breeding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dXQCEjVth8P8L47XIsoRt0oL8Gw.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:100698'),
  ('500694942768064423', 'Tiger King: The Doc Antle Story', 2021, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Chris Smith', null, 'Doc Antle', 'TV-MA', 'A lifelong showman, Bhagavan “Doc” Antle has built his various careers on theatrics, attracting a slew of admirers along the way. But beneath the eccentric, animal-loving facade lies a predator far more dangerous than his beloved big cats and a man shadier than any of his Tiger King counterparts.', 'A lifelong showman, Bhagavan “Doc” Antle has built his various careers on theatrics, attracting a slew of admirers along the way. But beneath the eccentric, animal-loving facade lies a predator far more dangerous than his beloved big cats and a man shadier than any of his Tiger King counterparts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sie5il1GPnCuSRyEHJkKQvr8ffT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:152336'),
  ('440082303114404776', 'Tiger Mask', 1969, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Ikki Kajiwara', null, 'Kei Tomiyama, Katsuji Mori, Chisato Nakajima, Keiichi Noda', null, 'A villainous masked wrestler becomes a hero for the sake of protecting the orphanage in which he was raised.', 'A villainous masked wrestler becomes a hero for the sake of protecting the orphanage in which he was raised.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/doHX1Hg4AEw54TvOIPcY5L6BMy8.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:25114'),
  ('745257259032211282', 'Tiger Mask W', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', null, null, 'Taku Yashiro, Yuuichirou Umehara, Ryoichi Tanaka, Yu Kobayashi, Izumi Kitta, Suzuko Mimori', null, 'Two young wrestlers face each other in a recently revived underground wrestling organization, the Tiger''s Lair, which destroyed the wrestling dojo they grew up in. One took over the training facilities of Naoto Date at the foot of Mount Fuji, as well as the mask he left behind. The other dared to enter the Tiger''s Lair and won a fierce competition, receiving a jet-black tiger mask. One tiger walks the path of light, while the other walks the path of shadows. Neither one knows the other''s face. On the ring, they are natural enemies, but they have the same purpose—destroy the Tiger''s Lair!', 'Two young wrestlers face each other in a recently revived underground wrestling organization, the Tiger''s Lair, which destroyed the wrestling dojo they grew up in. One took over the training facilities of Naoto Date at the foot of Mount Fuji, as well as the mask he left behind. The other dared to enter the Tiger''s Lair and won a fierce competition, receiving a jet-black tiger mask. One tiger walks the path of light, while the other walks the path of shadows. Neither one knows the other''s face. On the ring, they are natural enemies, but they have the same purpose—destroy the Tiger''s Lair!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yisqc1PDIHL3fHoJdS0yPqGuOEO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68074'),
  ('132527777288486927', 'Tigerenten Club', 1996, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'Tigerenten Club is a German children''s television programme. The programme involves a mix of games, quizzes, cartoons and outside reports from the presenters and children, with the aim to educate and entertain. It is produced by SWR in co-operation with other regional broadcasters, and is broadcast on ARD and KiKa. The logo and the name of the programme is based upon the Tigerente or ''Tigerduck'', created by German cartoonist Janosch.', 'Tigerenten Club is a German children''s television programme. The programme involves a mix of games, quizzes, cartoons and outside reports from the presenters and children, with the aim to educate and entertain. It is produced by SWR in co-operation with other regional broadcasters, and is broadcast on ARD and KiKa. The logo and the name of the programme is based upon the Tigerente or ''Tigerduck'', created by German cartoonist Janosch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/59XEuV6hkidMsxIppbInMT6vefW.jpg', 29, 'tmdb:tv:20518'),
  ('1134359723425821950', 'Tight-rope', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Isaku Natsume', null, 'Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Shinnosuke Tachibana, Kosuke Takaguchi, Kazuya Ichijo, Jun Fukushima, Riho Fushida', 'TV-14', 'Tightrope tells the tale of the reluctant heir of a yakuza family and his childhood friend, and follows their love relationship that started budding in their school days and keeps developing slowly but surely.', 'Tightrope tells the tale of the reluctant heir of a yakuza family and his childhood friend, and follows their love relationship that started budding in their school days and keeps developing slowly but surely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pxFT7mD8oTkNlYtw1DN2s47owxX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121536'),
  ('730894555727725513', 'Tightrope', 1959, 'Drama, Crime', 'Clarence Greene, Russell Rouse', null, 'Mike Connors', null, 'Tightrope is an American crime drama series that aired on CBS from September 1959 to September 1960, under the alternate sponsorship of the J.B. Williams Company, and American Tobacco. Produced by Russell Rouse and Clarence Greene in association with Screen Gems, the series stars Mike Connors as an undercover agent named "Nick" who was assigned to infiltrate criminal gangs. The show was to have originally been titled Undercover Man but it was changed before going to air.', 'Tightrope is an American crime drama series that aired on CBS from September 1959 to September 1960, under the alternate sponsorship of the J.B. Williams Company, and American Tobacco. Produced by Russell Rouse and Clarence Greene in association with Screen Gems, the series stars Mike Connors as an undercover agent named "Nick" who was assigned to infiltrate criminal gangs. The show was to have originally been titled Undercover Man but it was changed before going to air.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xApkJPdm80GFcJ0YcHJpjgoZT3a.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16936'),
  ('533811981630911861', 'Tigtone', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy', 'Benjamin Martian, Andrew Koehler', null, 'Nils Frykdahl, Bill Corbett, Trace Beaulieu, Debi Derryberry, Lucy Davis, Jeffrey Combs, Cree Summer, John DiMaggio', 'TV-14', 'A quest-addicted hero slashes his way across a satirical fantasy universe with melodramatic ferocity, always obeying the letter of the law but never its spirit.', 'A quest-addicted hero slashes his way across a satirical fantasy universe with melodramatic ferocity, always obeying the letter of the law but never its spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/35iIZANE4UTP3trCrVjZZVMcYf0.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:86501'),
  ('1062066876586572587', 'Tijuana', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Zayre Ferrer, Daniel Posada', null, 'Tamara Vallarta, Damián Alcázar, Claudette Maillé, Tete Espinoza', 'TV-14', 'When a prominent politician is murdered, the intrepid journalists of Frente Tijuana risk their lives to uncover the truth.', 'When a prominent politician is murdered, the intrepid journalists of Frente Tijuana risk their lives to uncover the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cGdSPoZa0p8muwgqhGm2KhH1LuL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88189'),
  ('477203146726505406', 'Till Death', 2021, 'Drama', null, null, 'Maguy Bou Ghosn, Daniella Rahme, Ahmad Al Zain, Randa Kaadi, Khitam Al Lahham, Carol Abboud, Fadi Abi Samra, Rayan Harake', null, 'Fed up with his wife’s distancing from him, Hadi goes on a business trip to Turkey where he meets a special woman, an encounter that changes his life forever.', 'Fed up with his wife’s distancing from him, Hadi goes on a business trip to Turkey where he meets a special woman, an encounter that changes his life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g18jnJuhIujMYErHqeG5t8U5F9X.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:121745'),
  ('275035126589273784', 'Till Death Us Do Part', 1966, 'Comedy', 'Johnny Speight', 'Johnny Speight', 'Warren Mitchell, Una Stubbs, Anthony Booth, Patricia Hayes, Alfie Bass', null, 'This English follows the East End working-class Garnett family, headed by patriarch Alf, a reactionary working-class man who wields racist and anti-Socialist views. His long-suffering wife Else manages to keep things in control... for the most part. Their progressive daughter Rita lives with them, as does her Irish husband Mike, who, with an array of liberal worldviews, often quarrels with his father-in-law. It inspired the American show "All In The Family" and several other international variations on the same theme.', 'This English follows the East End working-class Garnett family, headed by patriarch Alf, a reactionary working-class man who wields racist and anti-Socialist views. His long-suffering wife Else manages to keep things in control... for the most part. Their progressive daughter Rita lives with them, as does her Irish husband Mike, who, with an array of liberal worldviews, often quarrels with his father-in-law. It inspired the American show "All In The Family" and several other international variations on the same theme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5r8enLaWs3SnVoInZYsOLZgboki.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:550'),
  ('485672934903433412', 'Till Murder Do Us Part: Soering vs. Haysom', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Jens Söring, Rachel Ryan, Courteney Stuart, Elizabeth Haysom', 'TV-MA', 'Did Jens Soering murder his girlfriend''s parents in 1985 — or was she the killer? This docuseries digs into questions that still swirl around the case.', 'Did Jens Soering murder his girlfriend''s parents in 1985 — or was she the killer? This docuseries digs into questions that still swirl around the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwv4nanTQiU8Rwr5cWyIvSwPtoS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:237806'),
  ('788875060954056274', 'Till The End of The Moon', 2023, 'Drama', 'Kuk Kok-Leung', 'Luo Xuan, He Fang', 'Luo Yunxi, Bai Lu, Chen Duling, Deng Wei, Sun Zhenni, Apollo Yu, Geng Yeting, Huang Xinyao', null, 'In an era when the demons are in power, they are the masters of the despicable cultivators and mortals. The cultivator elders deem it necessary to send someone back in time to determine the origin of the demon lord and to prevent his awakening. Li Susu accepts the mission, becoming the mortal Ye Xiwu, General Ye''s third daughter, who is married to Tantai Jin, the hostage prince and future demon lord. She is determined to destroy Tantai Jin, who, in the future, will massacre many. But as a witness to Tantai Jin''s past life and rise to power, an unexpected tale emerges, one complicating her quest.', 'In an era when the demons are in power, they are the masters of the despicable cultivators and mortals. The cultivator elders deem it necessary to send someone back in time to determine the origin of the demon lord and to prevent his awakening. Li Susu accepts the mission, becoming the mortal Ye Xiwu, General Ye''s third daughter, who is married to Tantai Jin, the hostage prince and future demon lord. She is determined to destroy Tantai Jin, who, in the future, will massacre many. But as a witness to Tantai Jin''s past life and rise to power, an unexpected tale emerges, one complicating her quest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xcKDmUKEzysLjJEJTjonNoMraht.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137206'),
  ('809274267464921741', 'Tim and Eric Awesome Show, Great Job!', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Eric Wareheim, Tim Heidecker', 'Bob Odenkirk, Jon Wurster, Eric Fensler', 'Eric Wareheim, Tim Heidecker', 'TV-14', 'Tim and Eric Awesome Show, Great Job! is an American sketch comedy television series, created by and starring Tim Heidecker and Eric Wareheim, which premiered February 11, 2007 on Cartoon Network''s Adult Swim comedy block and ran until May 2010. The program features surrealistic and often satirical humor, public-access television–style musical acts, bizarre faux-commercials, and editing and special effects chosen to make the show appear camp. The program featured a wide range of actors, spanning from stars such as Will Ferrell, John C. Reilly, David Cross, Bob Odenkirk, Will Forte and Zach Galifianakis, to alternative comedians like Neil Hamburger, to television actors like Alan Thicke, celebrity look-alikes and impressionists. The creators of the show have described it as "the nightmare version of television."', 'Tim and Eric Awesome Show, Great Job! is an American sketch comedy television series, created by and starring Tim Heidecker and Eric Wareheim, which premiered February 11, 2007 on Cartoon Network''s Adult Swim comedy block and ran until May 2010. The program features surrealistic and often satirical humor, public-access television–style musical acts, bizarre faux-commercials, and editing and special effects chosen to make the show appear camp. The program featured a wide range of actors, spanning from stars such as Will Ferrell, John C. Reilly, David Cross, Bob Odenkirk, Will Forte and Zach Galifianakis, to alternative comedians like Neil Hamburger, to television actors like Alan Thicke, celebrity look-alikes and impressionists. The creators of the show have described it as "the nightmare version of television."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1dzPN5M6BbT44CTMaXqqkIdhOWK.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1229'),
  ('557904791707725188', 'Tim and Eric''s Bedtime Stories', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Eric Wareheim, Tim Heidecker', 'Eric Wareheim, Tim Heidecker', null, 'TV-14', 'Tim and Eric''s dark comedy anthology series.', 'Tim and Eric''s dark comedy anthology series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4nzEg4hZuamfOvtoOObrO8h3LCp.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:72874'),
  ('443504741402549906', 'Time', 2018, 'Drama', null, 'Choi Ho-chul', 'Kim Jung-hyun, Seohyun, Kim Jun-han, Hwang Seung-eon, Choi Jong-hwan, Jeon Soo-kyeong, Seo Hyun-woo, Kim Hee-jung', null, 'For a man who was born with a silver spoon in his mouth, the suffering and hardships others go through every day are not something he can relate to. One day, he unexpectedly becomes involved in a murder incident. He meets a woman who is trapped in time by what happened. He is drawn to her, feeling responsible and guilt for what he had done. Before he can even realize, his feelings towards her grow. He struggles to find the truth so that he can allow himself to love her.', 'For a man who was born with a silver spoon in his mouth, the suffering and hardships others go through every day are not something he can relate to. One day, he unexpectedly becomes involved in a murder incident. He meets a woman who is trapped in time by what happened. He is drawn to her, feeling responsible and guilt for what he had done. Before he can even realize, his feelings towards her grow. He struggles to find the truth so that he can allow himself to love her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wioiG18yMZ8IIhl1PVi7LkkTWZq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80964'),
  ('550500940596658454', 'Time', 2021, 'Drama', 'Jimmy McGovern', 'Jimmy McGovern', 'Bella Ramsey, Siobhan Finneran, Jodie Whittaker, Tamara Lawrance, James Nelson-Joyce', null, 'Guilt, violence and impossible choices – what does it take to survive? Tense, gritty and heartbreaking – Jimmy McGovern''s award-winning prison drama, with an all-star cast.', 'Guilt, violence and impossible choices – what does it take to survive? Tense, gritty and heartbreaking – Jimmy McGovern''s award-winning prison drama, with an all-star cast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mhi7oohUBIufTjF9u41uMXYHsw2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:126116'),
  ('805088321014060611', 'Time After Time', 2015, 'Soap, Drama', 'Elizabeth Jhin', 'Wagner de Assis, Elizabeth Jhin, Eliane Garcia', 'Alinne Moraes, Rafael Cardoso, Paolla Oliveira, Irene Ravache, Ana Beatriz Nogueira, Felipe Camargo, Emílio Dantas, Louise Cardoso', null, 'Livia and Felipe are in a forbidden love story doomed to end tragically. A century later, they both have a new chance to make their love real again. “Time After Time” is an innovative romance set in two different eras in which characters hold the opportunity to make up for their mistakes, come to terms with the past and write themselves another story.', 'Livia and Felipe are in a forbidden love story doomed to end tragically. A century later, they both have a new chance to make their love real again. “Time After Time” is an innovative romance set in two different eras in which characters hold the opportunity to make up for their mistakes, come to terms with the past and write themselves another story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/806nRtr42FxowSJTWk88IZpWHrS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83595'),
  ('467972423462149284', 'Time After Time', 2017, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kevin Williamson', 'Kevin Williamson', 'Freddie Stroma, Joshua Bowman, Genesis Rodriguez, Nicole Ari Parker, Will Chase, Jennifer Ferrin, Michael Benz, Sianad Gregory', 'TV-14', 'A young H.G. Wells time travels to modern day New York City in pursuit of the charismatic—yet secretly psychopathic—Dr. John Stevenson, better known as "Jack the Ripper," following the doctor''s brazen escape from the Victorian London authorities.', 'A young H.G. Wells time travels to modern day New York City in pursuit of the charismatic—yet secretly psychopathic—Dr. John Stevenson, better known as "Jack the Ripper," following the doctor''s brazen escape from the Victorian London authorities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/brQIzcZEa5bSwq84E6b3XNFgiTE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68002'),
  ('965108428508665436', 'Time After Time', 2023, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Michele Alberico, Massimo Bacchini', 'Valerio Cilio', 'Lino Guanciale, Filippo Scotti, Claudia Pandolfi, Antonia Fotaras, Paolo Pierobon, Nicole Grimaudo, Tobia De Angelis, Martina Gatti', null, 'Elio a lawyer has a beautiful family but he became the top suspects for death of the girl he was in love with, thirty years ago.', 'Elio a lawyer has a beautiful family but he became the top suspects for death of the girl he was in love with, thirty years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmoO6CcGrLznhugWGOeZ6Kd03iG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:236308'),
  ('405416944709247236', 'Time and Him are Just Right', 2022, 'Drama', 'Jiang Mutong', null, 'Lu Yuxiao, Wu Junting, Lu Junjie, Xiao Yu, Dong Zifan, Li Mingxu, Hu Jiaxin, Zhang Hengming', null, 'The stubborn, adorable Lin Xi approaches the crafty top student Ji Jun Xing on purpose. Throughout their "opportunistic" friendship, feelings bloom between the two as they are always there for each other. Not only do they make friends, but they also make their own dreams and goals come true in the end.', 'The stubborn, adorable Lin Xi approaches the crafty top student Ji Jun Xing on purpose. Throughout their "opportunistic" friendship, feelings bloom between the two as they are always there for each other. Not only do they make friends, but they also make their own dreams and goals come true in the end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8kIXSrj7zQCxIQlFT2wTTR9E1eg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217048'),
  ('738663455298523615', 'Time Bandits', 2024, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Taika Waititi, Iain Morris, Jemaine Clement', null, 'Lisa Kudrow, Kal-El Tuck, Tadhg Murphy, Roger Jean Nsengiyumva, Rune Temte, Lo Mutuc, Rachel House, Kiera Thompson', 'TV-PG', 'Eleven-year-old Kevin''s passion for history is put to the test when he joins a ragtag group of time-traveling thieves on a high-stakes and hilarious adventure.', 'Eleven-year-old Kevin''s passion for history is put to the test when he joins a ragtag group of time-traveling thieves on a high-stakes and hilarious adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ahnTuygdAbjXvLKzLQlK2txosMX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114924'),
  ('471422462412390179', 'Time Between Dog and Wolf', 2007, 'Action & Adventure', 'Kim Jin-min, Han Ji-hoon', 'Han Ji-hoon, Ryu Yong-jae', 'Lee Joon-gi, Nam Sang-mi, Jung Kyung-ho, Kim Kap-soo, Lee Ki-young, Jung Kyung-soon, Choi Ji-ho, Lee Tae-sung', null, 'After his mother is brutally murdered by the Triad in Thailand, Soo-hyun is adopted by NIS agent Kang Joong-ho, and he grows up with Min-ki like brothers. Min-ki and Soo-hyun both become NIS agents later on. One fateful day, Soo-hyun meets Ji-woo after last seeing her in Thailand when he was a child. They start dating. One day, Soo-hyun ruins a mission when the suppressed memories of the day his mother died surfaces in his mind. NIS Director Jung gives Soo-hyun an undercover assignment to infiltrate the Triad and Soo-hyun takes the job. Soo-hyun fakes his death and assumes a new identity to become a member of the Triad. With his fake identity and new name, he prowls the back alleys of Bangkok.', 'After his mother is brutally murdered by the Triad in Thailand, Soo-hyun is adopted by NIS agent Kang Joong-ho, and he grows up with Min-ki like brothers. Min-ki and Soo-hyun both become NIS agents later on. One fateful day, Soo-hyun meets Ji-woo after last seeing her in Thailand when he was a child. They start dating. One day, Soo-hyun ruins a mission when the suppressed memories of the day his mother died surfaces in his mind. NIS Director Jung gives Soo-hyun an undercover assignment to infiltrate the Triad and Soo-hyun takes the job. Soo-hyun fakes his death and assumes a new identity to become a member of the Triad. With his fake identity and new name, he prowls the back alleys of Bangkok.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6fNbr1Rt578xR1WnFdcA3G9UfdZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1199'),
  ('963532698087943528', 'Time Bokan', 1975, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yoshiko Ohta, Noriko Ohara, Junpei Takiguchi, Kei Tomiyama, Kei Tomiyama', null, 'While experimenting with his time-travel machine, Dr. Kieta becomes lost in an unknown era. So his assistant and his daughter set out in space in a time machine to search for the missing doctor. But they must also try to defeat an evil group trying to steal the precious Dinamond jewel, which possesses the only clue to the doctor''s location.', 'While experimenting with his time-travel machine, Dr. Kieta becomes lost in an unknown era. So his assistant and his daughter set out in space in a time machine to search for the missing doctor. But they must also try to defeat an evil group trying to steal the precious Dinamond jewel, which possesses the only clue to the doctor''s location.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uX4W2M736uzc8OurpFQC9dTpSWh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:17706'),
  ('34834292609218262', 'Time Bokan 24', 2016, 'Animation', null, null, 'Akari Kito, Yuko Minaguchi, Masami Iwasaki, Yohei Azakami', null, 'The history in our textbooks are all wrong?! In the 24th century, humankind accomplished the invention of a time machine, “Time Bokan”. As they discover the truth about history, they realize that the history written in their textbooks are all wrong! To correct their knowledge of history, the government developed an organization called JKK. Our hero Tokio is recruited by Karen, a girl from the future to join the JKK. Together they travel through time to discover the true history, along with fighting the “Akudarma” a villainous group whose goal is to prevent the discovery of the truth!', 'The history in our textbooks are all wrong?! In the 24th century, humankind accomplished the invention of a time machine, “Time Bokan”. As they discover the truth about history, they realize that the history written in their textbooks are all wrong! To correct their knowledge of history, the government developed an organization called JKK. Our hero Tokio is recruited by Karen, a girl from the future to join the JKK. Together they travel through time to discover the true history, along with fighting the “Akudarma” a villainous group whose goal is to prevent the discovery of the truth!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZogex8fOTrVNE7bTvulCdo7xRr.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:70208'),
  ('750739760789679823', 'Time Concert', 2021, 'Reality', null, null, 'Laure Shang, He Jie, Dany Lee, Baby Zhang, Allen Su', null, 'Time Concert is a music variety show. The regular members are time musicians and the guests are time friends.', 'Time Concert is a music variety show. The regular members are time musicians and the guests are time friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j6AFu7MLxLM8dOOo0My9CQV9Ctt.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:137092'),
  ('1127154647131106162', 'Time Flies', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', null, null, 'Carla Peterson, Nancy Dupláa, Valeria Lois', 'TV-MA', 'Fresh out of prison and low on options, two women run a fumigation business — until a shady client pulls them back into the life they fought to escape.', 'Fresh out of prison and low on options, two women run a fumigation business — until a shady client pulls them back into the life they fought to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40aA6WAvTNFhucaO7s3K4iWEFSa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:285636'),
  ('426953156933271132', 'Time Gentlemen Please', 2000, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Julia Sawalha, Phil Daniels, Al Murray, David Walliams, Alexander Armstrong, Roy Heather, Rebecca Front, Marc Bannerman', null, 'The Pub Landlord’s rules are a pint for the fella and a glass of white wine or fruit based drink for the lady. It might be the 21st century but the landlord’s gaff is the last bastion of all things normal. He ain’t interested in change. It’s just the way things are, and don’t you or anybody else go questioning it.', 'The Pub Landlord’s rules are a pint for the fella and a glass of white wine or fruit based drink for the lady. It might be the 21st century but the landlord’s gaff is the last bastion of all things normal. He ain’t interested in change. It’s just the way things are, and don’t you or anybody else go questioning it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJcFyDDbyKaySGGdX4PJ72BO7lk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:11930'),
  ('993157416472058868', 'Time Goes By', 2010, 'Family, Drama, War & Politics', 'Coşkun Irmak', 'Coşkun Irmak', 'Ayça Bingöl, Wilma Elles, Yıldız Çağrı Atiksoy, Aras Bulut Iynemli, Gün Koper, Farah Zeynep Abdullah, Meral Çetinkaya, Mete Horozoğlu', 'NR', 'Set in the 1960s, the story of the Akarsu family includes Ali, Cemile and their four children: Berrin, a law student, Aylin and Mete, high school students, and 5 year old Osman. Ali begins an affair with Caroline, a Dutch woman, which leads to the disintegration of the family.', 'Set in the 1960s, the story of the Akarsu family includes Ali, Cemile and their four children: Berrin, a law student, Aylin and Mete, high school students, and 5 year old Osman. Ali begins an affair with Caroline, a Dutch woman, which leads to the disintegration of the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9EdummL201K7rYtcZ5z08yX8NKm.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:39892'),
  ('86279274773737143', 'Time Hustler', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Halder Gomes', 'Chico Amorim, Clara Deák, Halder Gomes', 'Edmilson Filho, Dudu Azevedo, Chandelly Braz, Haroldo Guimarães, Max Petterson, Monique Hortolani, Roberta Wermont, Fábio Lago', 'TV-14', 'After being hit in the head, a man wakes up in 1927 to discover that he’s the spitting image of a famous bandit — and decides to make the most of it.', 'After being hit in the head, a man wakes up in 1927 to discover that he’s the spitting image of a famous bandit — and decides to make the most of it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92irtgxDBPoImSnxT72lkcqskrH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:195298'),
  ('1097616001335825930', 'Time Is a Killer', 2019, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Claude-Michel Rome, Franck Ollivier, Akima Sehhir', null, 'Mathilde Seigner, Caterina Murino, Jenifer, Grégory Fitoussi, Thierry Godard, Fred Testot, Yves Rénier, Esther Valding', null, 'A gripping psychological thriller told over two eras about a woman who must delve into her past to get to the heart of a dangerous mystery that has fragmented her life.', 'A gripping psychological thriller told over two eras about a woman who must delve into her past to get to the heart of a dangerous mystery that has fragmented her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGYLQrmdpooo8dCHuusnSmqFWEH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92845'),
  ('1120706570489269754', 'Time Limit Investigator', 2006, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Satoshi Miki', null, 'Joe Odagiri, Kumiko Aso, Ken Mitsuishi, Eri Fuse, Kosuke Toyohara, Noriko Eguchi, Ryo Iwamatsu, Yasuhito Hida', null, 'Shūichirō Kiriyama works at the Limitation Task Force, the place where the cases which have reached the statute of limitations are destroyed. Getting bored of his job, he decides to find a hobby, because it seems important to him to have a hobby. So he decides to puzzle out the unsolved cases on his free time, helped by his coworker Mikazuki, who seems to have a crush on him.', 'Shūichirō Kiriyama works at the Limitation Task Force, the place where the cases which have reached the statute of limitations are destroyed. Getting bored of his job, he decides to find a hobby, because it seems important to him to have a hobby. So he decides to puzzle out the unsolved cases on his free time, helped by his coworker Mikazuki, who seems to have a crush on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aZ9d8ZQelipO9HZwfxpL2iUjA77.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:36916'),
  ('168650973959383018', 'Time of Eve', 2008, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Jun Fukuyama, Kenji Nojima, Yuko Sanpei, Rie Tanaka, Rina Sato, Yukana, Michio Nakao, Miki Ito', null, 'The future, probably Japan. Robots have long been put into practical use, and androids have just come into use. Influenced by the Robot Ethics Committee, it''s become common sense for people to treat androids like household appliances. Their appearance – indistinguishable from humans except for the ring over each android''s head – has led some people to empathize unnecessarily with androids. Known as "android-holics", such people have become a social problem. Rikuo, a high school student, has been taught from childhood that androids are not to be viewed as humans, and has always used them as convenient tools. One day, Rikuo discovers some strange data in the behavior records of his family''s household android, Sammy. Rikuo and his friend Masaki trace Sammy''s movements, only to discover a mysterious café that features a house rule that "humans and robots are to be treated the same".', 'The future, probably Japan. Robots have long been put into practical use, and androids have just come into use. Influenced by the Robot Ethics Committee, it''s become common sense for people to treat androids like household appliances. Their appearance – indistinguishable from humans except for the ring over each android''s head – has led some people to empathize unnecessarily with androids. Known as "android-holics", such people have become a social problem. Rikuo, a high school student, has been taught from childhood that androids are not to be viewed as humans, and has always used them as convenient tools. One day, Rikuo discovers some strange data in the behavior records of his family''s household android, Sammy. Rikuo and his friend Masaki trace Sammy''s movements, only to discover a mysterious café that features a house rule that "humans and robots are to be treated the same".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5lduPCqsghIsrpebfiunU4hp0s.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60937'),
  ('194116513900918009', 'Time Off', 2000, null, null, null, 'Felix Wong Yat-Wah, Mark Kwok, Charmaine Sheh Sze-Man, Monica Chan Fat-Yung, Mimi Chu Mai-Mai, Michelle Fung, Cindy Au, Chor Yuen', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kk0igSZfKF0EwEP3tDrjsTY0pak.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108224'),
  ('441226139904652714', 'Time Slip Dr. Jin', 2012, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, 'Han Ji-hoon', 'Park Min-young, Song Seung-heon, Lee So-yeon, HERO Jaejoong, Lee Beom-soo, Jin Yi-han, Lee Seung-joon, Kim Kwang-shik', null, 'A talented doctor travels over 150 years back in time to when the powerful Joseon dynasty ruled over Korea, and uses his skills to save lives in this intriguing fantasy drama. Dr. Jin Hyuk, the 21st century’s best neurosurgeon meets an unidentified patient and passes out while in despair over an accident that his lover Mina has had. As he wakes up, he''s suddenly transported to the time of the Joseon Dynasty. When a plague strikes Joseon, Hyuk treats the dying people and makes a new resolution with Yi Ha Eung, who dreams of the reform of Joseon. But Jin Hyuk hesitates to study and practice medicine to out of fear that he might change history forever. Follow the trials and triumphs of this traveling doctor who ends up in the wrong place at the wrong time.', 'A talented doctor travels over 150 years back in time to when the powerful Joseon dynasty ruled over Korea, and uses his skills to save lives in this intriguing fantasy drama. Dr. Jin Hyuk, the 21st century’s best neurosurgeon meets an unidentified patient and passes out while in despair over an accident that his lover Mina has had. As he wakes up, he''s suddenly transported to the time of the Joseon Dynasty. When a plague strikes Joseon, Hyuk treats the dying people and makes a new resolution with Yi Ha Eung, who dreams of the reform of Joseon. But Jin Hyuk hesitates to study and practice medicine to out of fear that he might change history forever. Follow the trials and triumphs of this traveling doctor who ends up in the wrong place at the wrong time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/CMHIPKEEC7Fus7Hu8Qq1hjf1y8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45940'),
  ('469248848328831281', 'Time Squad', 2001, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Dave Wasson', null, 'Pamela Adlon, Rob Paulsen, Mark Hamill', 'TV-Y7', 'Time Squad is an American animated television series created by Dave Wasson, following the adventures of a trio of hapless "time cops", who travel back in time attempting to correct the course of history. The series ran on Cartoon Network from June 8, 2001, to November 26, 2003, airing 26 episodes in total. Wasson described the series as "a C-average student''s approach to history."', 'Time Squad is an American animated television series created by Dave Wasson, following the adventures of a trio of hapless "time cops", who travel back in time attempting to correct the course of history. The series ran on Cartoon Network from June 8, 2001, to November 26, 2003, airing 26 episodes in total. Wasson described the series as "a C-average student''s approach to history."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kDxN48XVDN4fRruZQq7d9AZybD8.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:4314'),
  ('242539521043123736', 'Time Switch', 2023, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ariana Saiegh', 'Ariana Saiegh, Giuliano Cedroni, Mariana Tesch Morgon', 'Mari Oliveira, Sol Menezzes, Martha Nowill, Leonardo Bianchi, Paulo Rocha, Dadá Coelho, Nicolas Ahnert, Luíza Nery', 'TV-MA', 'Paz is a self-centered influencer who arrives in the town of Água-Marinha, where she clashes with a local activist and is “canceled” for offensive insults. One hundred years earlier, in 1922, Cecília is facing a forced marriage — a life she doesn''t want — in Água-Marinha after her parents’ death. Mysteriously, the universe gives the two women an exit as they are swapped into each other’s bodies.', 'Paz is a self-centered influencer who arrives in the town of Água-Marinha, where she clashes with a local activist and is “canceled” for offensive insults. One hundred years earlier, in 1922, Cecília is facing a forced marriage — a life she doesn''t want — in Água-Marinha after her parents’ death. Mysteriously, the universe gives the two women an exit as they are swapped into each other’s bodies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tE0Xe0vlXXqEEVYIYOUkGVjB0pe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:154114'),
  ('608291620160284798', 'Time Team', 1994, 'Documentary, Mystery', 'Tim Taylor', null, 'Gus Casely-Hayford, Natalie Haynes, Carenza Lewis, John Gater, Stewart Ainsworth, Helen Geake, Matt Williams, Derek Pitman', null, 'Time Team is a British television series which has been aired on British Channel 4 from 1994. Created by television producer Tim Taylor and presented by actor Tony Robinson, each episode featured a team of specialists carrying out an archaeological dig over a period of three days, with Robinson explaining the process in layman''s terms. This team of specialists changed throughout the series'' run, although has consistently included professional archaeologists such as Mick Aston, Carenza Lewis, Francis Pryor and Phil Harding. The sites excavated over the show''s run have ranged in date from the Palaeolithic right through to the Second World War.', 'Time Team is a British television series which has been aired on British Channel 4 from 1994. Created by television producer Tim Taylor and presented by actor Tony Robinson, each episode featured a team of specialists carrying out an archaeological dig over a period of three days, with Robinson explaining the process in layman''s terms. This team of specialists changed throughout the series'' run, although has consistently included professional archaeologists such as Mick Aston, Carenza Lewis, Francis Pryor and Phil Harding. The sites excavated over the show''s run have ranged in date from the Palaeolithic right through to the Second World War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LXvcjdQMsb9094a4cNGdk0S6QC.jpg', 21, 'tmdb:tv:2863'),
  ('27349738318055422', 'Time Traveling Bong', 2016, 'Comedy', null, 'Paul W. Downs, Lucia Aniello, Ilana Glazer', 'Ilana Glazer, Paul W. Downs', 'TV-14', 'After discovering a bong capable of transporting them through space and time, two stoner cousins embark on an adventure that will bring them up close and personal with cavemen, the Salem witch trials and more.', 'After discovering a bong capable of transporting them through space and time, two stoner cousins embark on an adventure that will bring them up close and personal with cavemen, the Salem witch trials and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRWQhrR6xEXj9zAF8M32J0tezet.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66259'),
  ('540818698179456121', 'Time Trax', 1993, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Grant Rosenberg, Harve Bennett, Ruel Fischmann', null, 'Dale Midkiff, Elizabeth Alexander', null, 'Time Trax is an American/Australian co-produced science fiction television series that first aired in 1993. A police officer, sent through time into the past, has to track down and return convicted criminals who have escaped prison in the future. This was the last new production from Lorimar Television.', 'Time Trax is an American/Australian co-produced science fiction television series that first aired in 1993. A police officer, sent through time into the past, has to track down and return convicted criminals who have escaped prison in the future. This was the last new production from Lorimar Television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cNQu8ufkHGtXDkeQ6cbfWBGYg6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:4295'),
  ('876102619617632421', 'Time Trumpet', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Armando Iannucci, Will Smith, Roger Drew', 'Roger Drew, Will Smith, Armando Iannucci', 'Richard Ayoade, Jo Enright, Stewart Lee, Adam Buxton, Matthew Holness, Armando Iannucci, Mark Watson', null, 'Set in the year 2031, this mockumentary looks back at events that ostensibly happened during the first 30 years of the 21st century. The series follows a format that co-creator Armando Iannucci previously used in his satirical year-in-review programme ''2004: The Stupid Version''.', 'Set in the year 2031, this mockumentary looks back at events that ostensibly happened during the first 30 years of the 21st century. The series follows a format that co-creator Armando Iannucci previously used in his satirical year-in-review programme ''2004: The Stupid Version''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnkPUbg7437UiG6Zdx2CEJUFTyo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2125'),
  ('240000166401954152', 'Time Warp', 2008, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'Jeff Lieberman, an MIT scientist, teacher, and artist, along with high speed camera expert Matt Kearney, use their high speed camera to examine everyday occurrences and singular talents. The show captures common everyday events and views them again in slow motion to uncover the many principles of physics. To do so, they examine things such as a drop of water, explosions, gunshots, ballet dancing, cornflour, shallow water diving, X games and sometimes some uncanny things like piercing one''s cheek or standing on blades.', 'Jeff Lieberman, an MIT scientist, teacher, and artist, along with high speed camera expert Matt Kearney, use their high speed camera to examine everyday occurrences and singular talents. The show captures common everyday events and views them again in slow motion to uncover the many principles of physics. To do so, they examine things such as a drop of water, explosions, gunshots, ballet dancing, cornflour, shallow water diving, X games and sometimes some uncanny things like piercing one''s cheek or standing on blades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5QTyUZ2e3auDsVwTO6oWdzxVeoM.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:8158'),
  ('421825206964023752', 'Time Warp Trio', 2005, 'Family, Animation', 'Jon Scieszka', null, 'Mark Rendall, Tajja Isen, Sarah Gadon, Darren Frost, Scott McCord, Annick Obonsawin, Laurie Elliott, Sunday Muse', null, 'The adventures of three curious boys who are transported back to dramatically different places in history.', 'The adventures of three curious boys who are transported back to dramatically different places in history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnPnZyHHAjJg72g9VsHqM409aNa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38'),
  ('975839472784891459', 'Time: The Kalief Browder Story', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Julia Willoughby Nason, Jenner Furst, Nick Sandow', null, 'Kalief Browder', 'TV-MA', 'The story of a teenager wrongfully charged with theft and jailed at Riker''s Island prison for over 1,000 days.', 'The story of a teenager wrongfully charged with theft and jailed at Riker''s Island prison for over 1,000 days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2uJWtcLq231IkwwiUonS7QhZtMk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70490'),
  ('395293543499024388', 'Timecop', 1997, 'Action & Adventure, Crime', null, null, 'Ted King, Don Stark, Cristi Conaway, Kurt Fuller', null, 'Jack Logan is a time traveler from 2007 who hunts down rogue travelers and brings them to justice before they can alter the past.', 'Jack Logan is a time traveler from 2007 who hunts down rogue travelers and brings them to justice before they can alter the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sFG2W7eAQRN3CsrT5gCcqN2ssJx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13782'),
  ('550163641389648173', 'Timeless', 2016, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Shawn Ryan, Eric Kripke', null, 'Abigail Spencer, Matt Lanter, Malcolm Barrett, Goran Višnjić, Paterson Joseph, Sakina Jaffrey, Claudia Doumit', 'TV-PG', 'A mysterious criminal steals a secret state-of-the-art time machine, intent on destroying America as we know it by changing the past. Our only hope is an unexpected team: a scientist, a soldier and a history professor, who must use the machine''s prototype to travel back in time to critical events. While they must make every effort not to affect the past themselves, they must also stay one step ahead of this dangerous fugitive. But can this handpicked team uncover the mystery behind it all and end his destruction before it''s too late?', 'A mysterious criminal steals a secret state-of-the-art time machine, intent on destroying America as we know it by changing the past. Our only hope is an unexpected team: a scientist, a soldier and a history professor, who must use the machine''s prototype to travel back in time to critical events. While they must make every effort not to affect the past themselves, they must also stay one step ahead of this dangerous fugitive. But can this handpicked team uncover the mystery behind it all and end his destruction before it''s too late?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wFaS9kROwztTWNxIKBbOLwIgApV.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66786'),
  ('1043907788915876188', 'Timeless Love', 2010, 'Drama', 'Caridad Bravo Adams, Martha Carrillo, Cristina Garcia', null, 'Silvia Navarro, Juan Soler, Rocío Banquells, Julieta Rosen, Lisardo Guarinos, Jessica Coch, José Ron, Alfredo Adame', 'TV-14', 'Cuando me enamoro, se detiene el tiempo is a Mexican Spanish-language telenovela produced by Carlos Moreno Laguillo and Televisa. It is a remake of the 1998 Televisa telenovela La mentira. Silvia Navarro, Juan Soler and Jessica Coch are stars, with the participations of Rocío Banquells and Lisardo Guarinos as the main villains, the stellar participations of René Casados, Julieta Rosen, José Ron, and the special participation of Sebastián Zurita. Univision promoted Cuando me enamoro for the United States audience, with the first promo shown on March 30, and was initially scheduled to air at 8pm central. A second promo confirmed an April 19 airing at 7pm central. The third promo aired on April 5, confirming a 7pm/6pm central on Univision, and aired from April 20, 2011 to January 6, 2012.', 'Cuando me enamoro, se detiene el tiempo is a Mexican Spanish-language telenovela produced by Carlos Moreno Laguillo and Televisa. It is a remake of the 1998 Televisa telenovela La mentira. Silvia Navarro, Juan Soler and Jessica Coch are stars, with the participations of Rocío Banquells and Lisardo Guarinos as the main villains, the stellar participations of René Casados, Julieta Rosen, José Ron, and the special participation of Sebastián Zurita. Univision promoted Cuando me enamoro for the United States audience, with the first promo shown on March 30, and was initially scheduled to air at 8pm central. A second promo confirmed an April 19 airing at 7pm central. The third promo aired on April 5, confirming a 7pm/6pm central on Univision, and aired from April 20, 2011 to January 6, 2012.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zOUviZ6A4aExs2Y0TD3X0Y2U7Gq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32778'),
  ('829300710187055413', 'Timeless Love', 2023, 'Drama, Soap, Family', 'Inês Gomes', 'Manuel Carneiro, Ana Casaca, Inês Gomes', 'Bárbara Branco, Francisco Froes, Rui Morisson, Joana Santos, Albano Jerónimo, Maria João Bastos, José Wallenstein, Rita Blanco', null, 'Catarina embarks on a dangerous journey to find who made her mother vanish. The Torres family seems to be the obvious suspect, but within them there''s Vasco, the love of Catarina''s life. Two opposed sides connected by love.', 'Catarina embarks on a dangerous journey to find who made her mother vanish. The Torres family seems to be the obvious suspect, but within them there''s Vasco, the love of Catarina''s life. Two opposed sides connected by love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8vQa1dJ0CCg7fjmbGA0l7yp6xDU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217216'),
  ('828210046865398885', 'Times', 2021, 'Mystery, Crime', null, '이새봄, Ahn Hye-jin', 'Lee Seo-jin, Lee Joo-young, Kim Yeong-cheol, Moon Jeong-hee, Kim In-kwon, Moon Ji-in, Shim Hyung-tak, You Seong-joo', null, 'A passionate reporter with exceptional talent, Lee Jin Woo has dedicated his entire career to pursuing nothing but the truth. Committed to telling the whole story, Jin Woo will do whatever it takes to find and report the hard facts. A hard-working man with a nose for news, Jin Woo’s life takes an unexpected turn when a mysterious phone call connects him with Seo Jung In, a woman who claims to be living five years in the future. A hard-nosed reporter with a burning passion for her work, Seo Jung In has a knack for finding the best stories. But sometimes digging deep uncovers some nasty truths. Following a string of leads, Jung In uncovers a dark plot that could shake the very foundations of the country. With the life of her father, South Korea’s President, Seo Ki Tae on the line, Jung In finds herself in a deadly race against time. But she’s not in this race alone. Mysteriously connected by phone to Lee Jin Woo, the two agree to join forces to save the president.', 'A passionate reporter with exceptional talent, Lee Jin Woo has dedicated his entire career to pursuing nothing but the truth. Committed to telling the whole story, Jin Woo will do whatever it takes to find and report the hard facts. A hard-working man with a nose for news, Jin Woo’s life takes an unexpected turn when a mysterious phone call connects him with Seo Jung In, a woman who claims to be living five years in the future. A hard-nosed reporter with a burning passion for her work, Seo Jung In has a knack for finding the best stories. But sometimes digging deep uncovers some nasty truths. Following a string of leads, Jung In uncovers a dark plot that could shake the very foundations of the country. With the life of her father, South Korea’s President, Seo Ki Tae on the line, Jung In finds herself in a deadly race against time. But she’s not in this race alone. Mysteriously connected by phone to Lee Jin Woo, the two agree to join forces to save the president.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lx7oMbwEJmtKx8JkorKc40PCluN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:116673'),
  ('456996483736752311', 'Timeshift', 2002, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'Documentary series which ranges widely over Britain''s social and cultural history, its narrative-led storytelling offering a richly immersive and varied window onto the past.', 'Documentary series which ranges widely over Britain''s social and cultural history, its narrative-led storytelling offering a richly immersive and varied window onto the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u3YthvdTOWgyG3bIHlUKVsuFSm9.jpg', 17, 'tmdb:tv:96414'),
  ('31643516976060793', 'Timewasters', 2017, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Daniel Lawrence Taylor, Kadiff Kirwan, Samson Kayo, Adelayo Adedayo, Ellie White', 'TV-PG', 'A struggling four-piece South London jazz band find themselves transported back in time to the 1920s and 1950s via an elevator in a dilapidated block of flats. Met with stares and curiosity in the past, the group hilariously navigates the clash of cultures and social conventions all while exploring worlds that are both incredibly familiar and painfully foreign.', 'A struggling four-piece South London jazz band find themselves transported back in time to the 1920s and 1950s via an elevator in a dilapidated block of flats. Met with stares and curiosity in the past, the group hilariously navigates the clash of cultures and social conventions all while exploring worlds that are both incredibly familiar and painfully foreign.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zbIpdsflN7fc4O8NoEIOxQ6XYcY.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:74539'),
  ('910908445852706025', 'Timewatch', 1982, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Timewatch is a long-running British television series showing documentaries on historical subjects, spanning all human history. It was first broadcast on 29 September 1982 and is produced by the BBC, the Timewatch brandname is used as a banner title in the UK, but many of the individual documentaries can be found on US cable channels without the branding.', 'Timewatch is a long-running British television series showing documentaries on historical subjects, spanning all human history. It was first broadcast on 29 September 1982 and is produced by the BBC, the Timewatch brandname is used as a banner title in the UK, but many of the individual documentaries can be found on US cable channels without the branding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n8x9uDQM1Z0O37s4IHbyMpmG05c.jpg', 30, 'tmdb:tv:6135'),
  ('877258359485541233', 'Timis', 2026, 'Drama', 'Ibou Gueye', 'Ibou Gueye, Kine Gueye, Bathie S. Diagne', 'Kader Gadji, Yakhara Gueye, Seynabou Touré, Moussa Sow, Arfang Sané', null, 'Dive into the heart of Timis, where Fella and Sémou tackle corruption and the issue of oil in Senegal. Facing the formidable Minister Kanté, the Treasury inspector and the journalist must choose: remain silent to survive or risk everything to expose the truth. They will be supported by Matar Lô, the last remaining union force, ready to do anything to resist. A gripping thriller of power struggles, betrayals, and resistance.', 'Dive into the heart of Timis, where Fella and Sémou tackle corruption and the issue of oil in Senegal. Facing the formidable Minister Kanté, the Treasury inspector and the journalist must choose: remain silent to survive or risk everything to expose the truth. They will be supported by Matar Lô, the last remaining union force, ready to do anything to resist. A gripping thriller of power struggles, betrayals, and resistance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qYZ4rOAfTQmNStRmSGsBnEeNZfc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:314665'),
  ('714330329234949020', 'Timmy Time', 2009, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Jackie Cockle, Liz Whitaker', null, 'Kate Harbour, Justin Fletcher', 'TV-Y', 'Timmy is a little lamb which has just turned three (in sheep years) and is going to nursery! In this bright and colourful environment, Timmy and his animal chums learn how to make friends, create new things, paint, draw and generally learn those very important ''life lessons'' from their nursery teachers, Harriet Heron and Osbourne Owl.', 'Timmy is a little lamb which has just turned three (in sheep years) and is going to nursery! In this bright and colourful environment, Timmy and his animal chums learn how to make friends, create new things, paint, draw and generally learn those very important ''life lessons'' from their nursery teachers, Harriet Heron and Osbourne Owl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4n6ROx77ex5zmOZVA4sjtoLJp8.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:19889'),
  ('1089760481908268687', 'Timon and Pumbaa', 1995, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Family', null, null, 'Ernie Sabella, Kevin Schon, Corey Burton, Michael Gough, Robert Guillaume', 'TV-Y', 'Set after the events of the "The Lion King," follow Timon and Pumbaa as they go on misadventures in the jungle, as well as across the globe in various.', 'Set after the events of the "The Lion King," follow Timon and Pumbaa as they go on misadventures in the jungle, as well as across the globe in various.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sn9PTOwI6ktLHZcysCrP8cqOw1b.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:4429'),
  ('1086051836922583643', 'Tin Man', 2007, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Craig W. Van Sickle', null, 'Raoul Max Trujillo, Neal McDonough, Richard Dreyfuss, Zooey Deschanel, Alan Cumming, Kathleen Robertson, Blu Mankuma, Callum Keith Rennie', 'TV-PG', 'Small-town waitress DG is pulled into a magical realm called the Outer Zone, ruled by the tyrannical Azkadellia. Together with her companions Glitch, Raw and Cain, DG journeys to uncover her lost memories, find her true parents, and foil Azkadellia’s plot to trap the O.Z. in eternal darkness.', 'Small-town waitress DG is pulled into a magical realm called the Outer Zone, ruled by the tyrannical Azkadellia. Together with her companions Glitch, Raw and Cain, DG journeys to uncover her lost memories, find her true parents, and foil Azkadellia’s plot to trap the O.Z. in eternal darkness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4OeV2fR2IxhLsILMfkh10oY6Ju2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12584'),
  ('100781563368026145', 'Tin Star', 2017, 'Crime, Drama, Family', 'Rowan Joffé', null, 'Tim Roth, Genevieve O''Reilly, Abigail Lawrie', 'TV-MA', 'The story of Jim Worth, an expat British police officer starting a new life with his family as police chief in Little Big Bear, an idyllic town near the Rocky Mountains. When his small town is overrun by migrant workers from a massive new oil refinery – the wave of drugs, prostitution and organised crime that follows them threatens to sweep away everything in its wake.', 'The story of Jim Worth, an expat British police officer starting a new life with his family as police chief in Little Big Bear, an idyllic town near the Rocky Mountains. When his small town is overrun by migrant workers from a massive new oil refinery – the wave of drugs, prostitution and organised crime that follows them threatens to sweep away everything in its wake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFHZBtugqDiLtjVP9GC3Ig5GfwU.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:70384'),
  ('557668895397387645', 'Tinker Tailor Soldier Spy', 1979, 'War & Politics, Drama, Mystery', 'John Irvin, John le Carré', null, 'Alec Guinness, Michael Jayston, Anthony Bate, George Sewell', null, 'Tinker Tailor Soldier Spy is a seven-part BBC2 spy drama written by Arthur Hopcraft, adapted from John le Carré''s eponymous 1974 novel. The serial, which stars Alec Guinness, Alexander Knox, Ian Richardson, Michael Jayston, Bernard Hepton, Anthony Bate, Ian Bannen, George Sewell and Michael Aldridge, was broadcast from 10 September to 22 October 1979. George Smiley, the ageing master spy of the Cold War and once heir-apparent to Control, is brought back out of retirement to flush out a top level mole within the Circus. Smiley must travel back through his life and murky workings of the Circus to unravel the net spun by his nemesis Karla ''The Sandman'' of the KGB and reveal the identity of the mole before he disappears.', 'Tinker Tailor Soldier Spy is a seven-part BBC2 spy drama written by Arthur Hopcraft, adapted from John le Carré''s eponymous 1974 novel. The serial, which stars Alec Guinness, Alexander Knox, Ian Richardson, Michael Jayston, Bernard Hepton, Anthony Bate, Ian Bannen, George Sewell and Michael Aldridge, was broadcast from 10 September to 22 October 1979. George Smiley, the ageing master spy of the Cold War and once heir-apparent to Control, is brought back out of retirement to flush out a top level mole within the Circus. Smiley must travel back through his life and murky workings of the Circus to unravel the net spun by his nemesis Karla ''The Sandman'' of the KGB and reveal the identity of the mole before he disappears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3HlMztiMrTnhU1u807MGUizEXxH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35430'),
  ('161093475757488441', 'Tinted with You', 2021, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'La Ha-na', null, 'Yoo Hyun-woo, Park Jun-hee, Kim Tae-jeong, Yoon Ye-hee', null, 'A time-traveling art student becomes the exiled Crown Prince''s lifeline in a dangerous royal struggle where love might be his only chance of survival.', 'A time-traveling art student becomes the exiled Crown Prince''s lifeline in a dangerous royal struggle where love might be his only chance of survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t9Zv4lY5vvo3GZPqfiSn948DBdv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:153169'),
