  ('757576672429784268', 'Tis Time for "Torture," Princess', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Haruka Shiraishi, Chikahiro Kobayashi, Shizuka Itoh, Tessyo Genda, Anna Nagase, Honoka Inoue, Aya Yamane, Ai Kayano', 'TV-14', 'As the war between the Imperial Army and Hellhorde rages on, the Princess, despite being armed with her mythical sword Excalibur, is captured and imprisoned. What kind of torture does she face at the hands of the chief demon interrogator? Fluffy fresh-baked toast! Hot, steaming ramen! Oh, the humanity! Can the Princess withstand these tormenting treats and keep her kingdom’s secrets safe?', 'As the war between the Imperial Army and Hellhorde rages on, the Princess, despite being armed with her mythical sword Excalibur, is captured and imprisoned. What kind of torture does she face at the hands of the chief demon interrogator? Fluffy fresh-baked toast! Hot, steaming ramen! Oh, the humanity! Can the Princess withstand these tormenting treats and keep her kingdom’s secrets safe?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xAC9rRQRVcW9bpv6bYZA5d5To0Y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:229443'),
  ('1073279030035626463', 'Titanic', 1996, 'Drama', null, null, 'Peter Gallagher, George C. Scott, Catherine Zeta-Jones, Eva Marie Saint, Tim Curry, Roger Rees, Harley Jane Kozak, Marilu Henner', null, 'Titanic is a made-for-TV dramatization that premiered as a 2-part miniseries on CBS in 1996. Titanic follows several characters on board the RMS Titanic when she sinks on her maiden voyage in 1912. The miniseries was directed by Robert Lieberman. The original music score was composed by Lennie Niehaus. This is the first Titanic movie to show the ship breaking in two.', 'Titanic is a made-for-TV dramatization that premiered as a 2-part miniseries on CBS in 1996. Titanic follows several characters on board the RMS Titanic when she sinks on her maiden voyage in 1912. The miniseries was directed by Robert Lieberman. The original music score was composed by Lennie Niehaus. This is the first Titanic movie to show the ship breaking in two.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zY6B39Jxt54MLl2SgDs5fPICgpz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:20455'),
  ('996874571425348498', 'Titanic', 2012, 'Drama', 'Julian Fellowes', 'Julian Fellowes', 'Peter Wight, Brian McCardie, David Calder, Geraldine Somerville, Jenna Coleman, Maria Doyle Kennedy, Noah Reid, Perdita Weeks', 'TV-PG', 'A heart-wrenching journey through Titanic''s last moments, featuring both fictional and historical characters, ranging from steerage passengers and crew to upper class guests and staff.', 'A heart-wrenching journey through Titanic''s last moments, featuring both fictional and historical characters, ranging from steerage passengers and crew to upper class guests and staff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aivkYWP73tsbfC4AUudYfbMHII2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39016'),
  ('760172819058526844', 'Titanic: Blood and Steel', 2012, 'Drama', null, null, 'Kevin Zegers, Derek Jacobi, Alessandra Mastronardi, Valentina Corti, Massimo Ghini, Ian McElhinney, Billy Carter', 'TV-14', 'Belfast, 1909. The Harland and Wolff shipyard has been handed the greatest project in its history. It will build a great, unsinkable ship. And it will be called the RMS Titanic.', 'Belfast, 1909. The Harland and Wolff shipyard has been handed the greatest project in its history. It will build a great, unsinkable ship. And it will be called the RMS Titanic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5awTemzEgzOvsopOk92vmLRwhhu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40161'),
  ('632390786544642855', 'Titans', 2018, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Geoff Johns, Greg Berlanti, Akiva Goldsman', 'Melissa Brides Ockman', 'Brenton Thwaites, Anna Diop, Teagan Croft, Ryan Potter, Joshua Orpin, Jay Lycurgo, Franka Potente, Joseph Morgan', 'TV-MA', 'A team of young superheroes led by Nightwing (formerly Batman''s first Robin) form to combat evil and other perils.', 'A team of young superheroes led by Nightwing (formerly Batman''s first Robin) form to combat evil and other perils.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8e6QiSexmYKaiHGPvbhaFMmQEhc.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:75450'),
  ('400727788107622813', 'Titletown High', 2021, 'Reality', 'Jason Sciavicco', null, 'Jake Garcia, Lenley Gross, Kendall Haden, Amari Jones, Samuel Brown', 'TV-14', 'In a Georgia town where football rules and winning is paramount, a high school team tackles romance, rivalries and real life while vying for a title.', 'In a Georgia town where football rules and winning is paramount, a high school team tackles romance, rivalries and real life while vying for a title.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqy9PwKHMI2k2otdHyndHLnvQ1i.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:131114'),
  ('502435126109723201', 'Titlie', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Neha Solanki, Avinash Mishra, Vatsal Sheth, Sachin Parikh, Susheel Parashara', null, 'Obsessed by the notion of fairy tale love , Titlie marries her beau Garv . Soon , the picture - perfect romance turns abusive , forcing her to wrestle with reality .', 'Obsessed by the notion of fairy tale love , Titlie marries her beau Garv . Soon , the picture - perfect romance turns abusive , forcing her to wrestle with reality .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1di1OHdwscJTXrS33Xw1f3s6IsK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:228093'),
  ('259474528623084817', 'Titus', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Christopher Titus, Jack Kenny, Brian Hargrove', null, 'Christopher Titus, Cynthia Watros, Zack Ward, David Shatraw, Stacy Keach', null, 'Titus is an American dark comedy sitcom that debuted on Fox in 2000. The series was created by its star, Christopher Titus, Jack Kenny, and Brian Hargrove. This sitcom was based on Christopher''s stand-up comedy act, more specifically his one-man show Norman Rockwell is Bleeding, which was based loosely upon his real-life family; lines from Norman Rockwell is Bleeding were spoken by Titus as commentary. Titus plays an outwardly childish adult, who owns a custom car shop. The show follows him and his dimwitted halfbrother Dave, his girlfriend Erin with the "heart of gold", his goody-goody friend Tommy, and his arrogantly lewd, bigoted and multiple-divorced father Ken "Papa" Titus.', 'Titus is an American dark comedy sitcom that debuted on Fox in 2000. The series was created by its star, Christopher Titus, Jack Kenny, and Brian Hargrove. This sitcom was based on Christopher''s stand-up comedy act, more specifically his one-man show Norman Rockwell is Bleeding, which was based loosely upon his real-life family; lines from Norman Rockwell is Bleeding were spoken by Titus as commentary. Titus plays an outwardly childish adult, who owns a custom car shop. The show follows him and his dimwitted halfbrother Dave, his girlfriend Erin with the "heart of gold", his goody-goody friend Tommy, and his arrogantly lewd, bigoted and multiple-divorced father Ken "Papa" Titus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ab7WWSBFSYbZVXORydeEaPltG9K.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:89'),
  ('458030487309074222', 'TMZ', 2007, 'News, Comedy', 'Harvey Levin, Jim Paratore', null, 'Harvey Levin', 'TV-PG', 'Based on the popular gossip website, this entertainment newsmagazine delivers daily updates on Hollywood''s rich, beautiful and screwed-up. The program often shows highlights of the day''s staff meeting during which reporters pitch ideas for stories to air that day.', 'Based on the popular gossip website, this entertainment newsmagazine delivers daily updates on Hollywood''s rich, beautiful and screwed-up. The program often shows highlights of the day''s staff meeting during which reporters pitch ideas for stories to air that day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qotUEfomNK4r1ZVPVNAbXHon8Oh.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:13008'),
  ('375054433958344449', 'TNA iMPACT!', 2004, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Mystery', 'Jeffrey Jarrett, Jerry Jarrett', null, null, 'TV-14', 'TNA iMPACT offers a unique style of wrestling that features a blend of the traditional with high-flying athleticism and cutting edge action. TNA''s roster includes the biggest names in wrestling today, and the hottest new stars in the sport.', 'TNA iMPACT offers a unique style of wrestling that features a blend of the traditional with high-flying athleticism and cutting edge action. TNA''s roster includes the biggest names in wrestling today, and the hottest new stars in the sport.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpyxrPBjIaJ2UgYSl5RmjkMb8Jg.jpg', 23, 'tmdb:tv:4638'),
  ('148820488438277769', 'TNA Xplosion', 2002, null, null, null, null, 'NR', 'TNA Xplosion is a television program produced by Total Nonstop Action Wrestling, featuring both highlights from Impact Wrestling and exclusive taped matches. It is now produced only for international markets, no longer airing in the United States. It currently airs in Canada on The Fight Network, in Asia and the Middle East on ESPN Star Sports, the Arab World on MBC Action, and is available on Challenge in the UK. On March 14, 2013 Impact Wrestling and Xplosion will be film permanently from the road .', 'TNA Xplosion is a television program produced by Total Nonstop Action Wrestling, featuring both highlights from Impact Wrestling and exclusive taped matches. It is now produced only for international markets, no longer airing in the United States. It currently airs in Canada on The Fight Network, in Asia and the Middle East on ESPN Star Sports, the Arab World on MBC Action, and is available on Challenge in the UK. On March 14, 2013 Impact Wrestling and Xplosion will be film permanently from the road .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vAYGi3K7Mfhzx72kpBWWYK0GpXr.jpg', 23, 'tmdb:tv:628'),
  ('1061503829599714869', 'To All The Guys Who Loved Me', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lee Ho, Choi Yoon-seok, Lee Eun-young', 'Lee Eun-young', 'Hwang Jung-eum, Yoon Hyun-min, Seo Ji-hoon, Choi Myung-gil, Jo Woo-ri, Seo Hyun-chul, Noh Susanna, 서은오', null, 'Seo Hyun-Joo works as the leader of a webcomic planning team. She declares that she plans to remain single, but she receives confessions from two men: Hwang Ji-Woo and Park Do-Gyeom. Hwang Ji-Woo is the CEO of a pharmaceutical company. He has a cold personality and excellent business ability. Park Do-Gyeom is a popular webcomic writer. He is a sociable person. He and Seo Hyun-Joo grew up like siblings, but he has held a crush on Seo Hyun-Joo for a long time.', 'Seo Hyun-Joo works as the leader of a webcomic planning team. She declares that she plans to remain single, but she receives confessions from two men: Hwang Ji-Woo and Park Do-Gyeom. Hwang Ji-Woo is the CEO of a pharmaceutical company. He has a cold personality and excellent business ability. Park Do-Gyeom is a popular webcomic writer. He is a sociable person. He and Seo Hyun-Joo grew up like siblings, but he has held a crush on Seo Hyun-Joo for a long time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5X1p2Geqevm06dOeaI8kXkB64GH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:104247'),
  ('525109023401160102', 'To Be a Better Man', 2016, 'Drama', 'Zhang Xiaobo', null, 'Che Xiao, Sun Honglei, David Wang, Maggie Jiang, Guan Xiaotong, Zhang Yixing, Dong Yong, Wan Qian', null, 'Lu Yuan worked hard in America to become a Michelin 3-starred chef. To many, he is the Devil incarnate, reckless and wanton. But when it comes to the person he loves, he is an entirely different "good man," loyal, kind, and honest. After a nightmarish car accident takes away his friend, he returns home with his remains. There, he runs into the person he most doesn''t want to see, and becomes entangled with his ex, Gan Jing, their old classmate, Jiang Haokun, and Haokun''s younger sister, Jiang Lai.', 'Lu Yuan worked hard in America to become a Michelin 3-starred chef. To many, he is the Devil incarnate, reckless and wanton. But when it comes to the person he loves, he is an entirely different "good man," loyal, kind, and honest. After a nightmarish car accident takes away his friend, he returns home with his remains. There, he runs into the person he most doesn''t want to see, and becomes entangled with his ex, Gan Jing, their old classmate, Jiang Haokun, and Haokun''s younger sister, Jiang Lai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7rpHfwDUUufwBR7Pc5zVQyLVWa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74063'),
  ('578940151789273423', 'To Be Continued', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kim Sae-ron, Cha Eun-woo, Moon Bin, Kim Myung-jun, Park Jin-woo, Park Min-hyuk, Yoon San-ha, Seo Kang-joon', null, 'This web-drama is about a boy group who fall to the past just a day before their debut and getting back in time with the help of a girl.', 'This web-drama is about a boy group who fall to the past just a day before their debut and getting back in time with the help of a girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVeiZaw8bd7om7rSh6NP2xydHN6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66211'),
  ('1113414024725766404', 'To Be Hero', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Li Haoling', null, 'Wei Chao, Liu Xiaoyu, Chen Zhangtaikang, Chang Wentao, Jinwen Chen, Qian Chen, Shuang Zhao, Zhang Fuzheng', 'TV-14', 'Our main character, Uncle, is a no-good father with a messy appearance even though he looks nice, and decorates restrooms. He is a divorced, single-dad and lives with his daughter Min, who is good at both studying and sport. One day, Uncle has been sucked into the toilet that he finished using, and becomes a hero to save the Earth! The price is he lost his ikemen appearance and becomes a fat person!! Uncle''s battle to protect the Earth and Min has begun…', 'Our main character, Uncle, is a no-good father with a messy appearance even though he looks nice, and decorates restrooms. He is a divorced, single-dad and lives with his daughter Min, who is good at both studying and sport. One day, Uncle has been sucked into the toilet that he finished using, and becomes a hero to save the Earth! The price is he lost his ikemen appearance and becomes a fat person!! Uncle''s battle to protect the Earth and Min has begun…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1vTLG5TM8LMBB3a5LEbFSoxP4IR.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:68135'),
  ('957631466216478901', 'TO BE HERO X', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Li Haoling', null, 'Nie Xiying, Gu Jiangshan, Yang Kaiqi, Zhang Fuzheng, Shuang Zhao', 'TV-14', 'In a world full of brilliant heroes, it’s the trust of fans that turns heroes into superheroes. If a hero loses the people’s trust, they lose their special abilities. Trust value is collected, quantified, and used to determine a hero’s ranking, displayed on their wrist. Every two years, the top heroes go to a tournament to fight, determine new trust values, and earn their rankings.', 'In a world full of brilliant heroes, it’s the trust of fans that turns heroes into superheroes. If a hero loses the people’s trust, they lose their special abilities. Trust value is collected, quantified, and used to determine a hero’s ranking, displayed on their wrist. Every two years, the top heroes go to a tournament to fight, determine new trust values, and earn their rankings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ynNG9lYS9HIR8cYMgawO19VPkg.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:272059'),
  ('270632981621043124', 'To be or not to be', 2022, 'Drama', 'Coral Cruz', null, 'Ander Puig, Anna Alarcón, Julia Gibert, Berta Galo, Lion Armas, Alícia Falcó, Eduard Torres, Enzo Oliver', null, '''To be or not to be'' tells the story of Joel, a 16-year-old trans teenager who dreams of becoming a great performer, while also facing the emotional challenges of his recently begun transition. It is a naturalistic series that addresses a highly current topic without prejudice and sheds light on the experiences of a group unknown to many or poorly understood by others. It aims to be a transformative series, which gives visibility and naturalizes with freshness and humor the ever-widening range of identities and gender expressions of today''s young people.', '''To be or not to be'' tells the story of Joel, a 16-year-old trans teenager who dreams of becoming a great performer, while also facing the emotional challenges of his recently begun transition. It is a naturalistic series that addresses a highly current topic without prejudice and sheds light on the experiences of a group unknown to many or poorly understood by others. It aims to be a transformative series, which gives visibility and naturalizes with freshness and humor the ever-widening range of identities and gender expressions of today''s young people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z0zipqRdOiE2TRtIQ5BsMIiYfhU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:155547'),
  ('982146877256560284', 'To Catch a Smuggler', 2015, 'Documentary, Reality, Crime, Drama', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Following the police of Latinoamerica & Europe airports in and their fight against crime.', 'Following the police of Latinoamerica & Europe airports in and their fight against crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rdXwhmTcxEmQetosZEgjrfghuw1.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:101129'),
  ('885320028188053175', 'To Catch the Kaidash', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Nataliia Vorozhbyt', 'Nataliia Vorozhbyt', 'Viktor Zhdanov, Iryna Mak, Hryhorii Baklanov, Taras Tsymbaliuk, Antonina Khyzhniak, Daryna Fedyna, Yulia Vrublievska, Roman Yasinovskyi', null, 'Modern retelling of a classical Ukrainian family drama. Generations clash as the rural Kaidash family tries to make room for their sons, their sons'' love interests and all the predicaments that ensue.', 'Modern retelling of a classical Ukrainian family drama. Generations clash as the rural Kaidash family tries to make room for their sons, their sons'' love interests and all the predicaments that ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kpTFwrl7C8xTEg5Q7KH94i2YOu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:101504'),
  ('1110639441084279036', 'To Catch the Uncatchable', 2004, 'Crime, Comedy', null, null, 'Dayo Wong Chi-Wah, Ada Choi Siu-Fan, Marco Ngai Chun-Git, Ram Chiang Chi-Kwong, Suet Nei, Michael Tong Man-Lung, Woo Fung, Belinda Hamnett', null, 'A sitcom centering around the genius CID Mok Tsok Tung and Vivi Lee Wai Wai, an insurance agent.', 'A sitcom centering around the genius CID Mok Tsok Tung and Vivi Lee Wai Wai, an insurance agent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xprCoIfVbRkIThqsXGIs65g5r6f.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15167'),
  ('806118878411574680', 'To Cook a Bear', 2025, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Jesper Harrie', 'Jesper Harrie', 'Gustaf Skarsgård, Jaakko Ohtonen, Pernilla August, Magnus Krepper, Ane Dahl Torp, Jonas Karlsson, Gusten Wickberg, Tyra Wingren', null, 'In Northern Sweden, 1852, a new pastor and his family arrive in Kengis, a village riddled with disorder.', 'In Northern Sweden, 1852, a new pastor and his family arrive in Kengis, a village riddled with disorder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/71dqddtGqtCWLJApvZuznxvIzvj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:281555'),
  ('68133738936926776', 'To Dear Myself', 2020, 'Drama', null, 'Su Xiaoyuan', 'Liu Shishi, Zhu Yilong, Kan Qingzi, Peng Guanying, Chen Miqi, Li Zefeng, Zhang Yao, Zhai Zilu', null, 'Three female friends – Li Si Yu, Gu Xiao Ling, and Zhang Zhi Zhi – have a close bond and a shared goal: to make a success of their busy urban lives. But their lives have taken very different paths, and now present them with a host of very different obstacles. Li Si Yu is a focused woman with a brilliant career as a sales rep. She thinks she has met her perfect match in a boyfriend who also has a successful career. However, when he suddenly loses his job, the pressure starts to take a toll on their relationship. Things are a little different for Gu Xiao Ling, who has been holding out for Mr. Right. Beautiful and attractive, she has always relied on her many charms to help her on her quest, but she discovers that age is no longer on her side… until she meets a certain someone. Zhang Zhi Zhi, meanwhile, wants a quiet life.', 'Three female friends – Li Si Yu, Gu Xiao Ling, and Zhang Zhi Zhi – have a close bond and a shared goal: to make a success of their busy urban lives. But their lives have taken very different paths, and now present them with a host of very different obstacles. Li Si Yu is a focused woman with a brilliant career as a sales rep. She thinks she has met her perfect match in a boyfriend who also has a successful career. However, when he suddenly loses his job, the pressure starts to take a toll on their relationship. Things are a little different for Gu Xiao Ling, who has been holding out for Mr. Right. Beautiful and attractive, she has always relied on her many charms to help her on her quest, but she discovers that age is no longer on her side… until she meets a certain someone. Zhang Zhi Zhi, meanwhile, wants a quiet life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/npkaIeXS61H3npaDBX3HWmhoe1O.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109288'),
  ('570947759297564438', 'To Heart', 1999, 'Animation', null, null, 'Kazuya Ichijo, Ayako Kawasumi, Chieko Higuchi, Aya Hisakawa, Rumi Kasahara, Junko Iwao, Mayumi Izuka, Kyoko Hikami', null, 'For as long as Akari can remember, she and Hiroyuki have always been friends. But with time, everything changes, and her feelings have turned into something more. As a new semester of high school begins, will the two childhood friends come closer together or drift further apart? Join Hiroyuki, Akari and all their friends—the bubbly Shiho, the quiet Serika, the lovely Kotone, and more—in this heartwarming tale of love, relationships and friendship!', 'For as long as Akari can remember, she and Hiroyuki have always been friends. But with time, everything changes, and her feelings have turned into something more. As a new semester of high school begins, will the two childhood friends come closer together or drift further apart? Join Hiroyuki, Akari and all their friends—the bubbly Shiho, the quiet Serika, the lovely Kotone, and more—in this heartwarming tale of love, relationships and friendship!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9EuhiTMDpdWEIWq9D1IZte2b1xL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:27346'),
  ('174732253599738327', 'To Kill a Monkey', 2025, 'Crime, Drama', 'Kemi Adetiba', null, 'Chidi Mokeme, Bucci Franklin, Bimbo Akintola, Ireti Doyle, Damilola Adegbite, William Benson, Stella Damasus', null, 'Efemini, a down-on-his-luck everyman whose life changes forever after a chance meeting with an old friend. Forced by circumstance to suppress his principles and explore a life of cybercrime, he finds himself making ever-greater moral compromises to stay ahead of the consequences of his new choices and broadening tastes.', 'Efemini, a down-on-his-luck everyman whose life changes forever after a chance meeting with an old friend. Forced by circumstance to suppress his principles and explore a life of cybercrime, he finds himself making ever-greater moral compromises to stay ahead of the consequences of his new choices and broadening tastes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a40q3ps7Z8VHtRXOum0KqVmy4Fd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:295167'),
  ('471436209488992917', 'To LOVE-Ru', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Akeno Watanabe, Haruka Tomatsu, Sayuri Yahagi, Misato Fukuen, Kanae Itou, Aki Toyosaki, Kaori Nazuka, Ayako Kawasumi', 'TV-MA', 'The story is about Rito Yuuki , a high-school boy who cannot confess to the girl of his dreams, Haruna Sairenji. One day when coming home and sulking in the bathtub a mysterious, nude girl, appears out of nowhere. Her name is Lala and she comes from the planet Deviluke, where she is the heir to the throne. Her father wants her to return to her home planet so she can marry one of the husband candidates, but she decides that she wants to marry Rito in order to stay on Earth.', 'The story is about Rito Yuuki , a high-school boy who cannot confess to the girl of his dreams, Haruna Sairenji. One day when coming home and sulking in the bathtub a mysterious, nude girl, appears out of nowhere. Her name is Lala and she comes from the planet Deviluke, where she is the heir to the throne. Her father wants her to return to her home planet so she can marry one of the husband candidates, but she decides that she wants to marry Rito in order to stay on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vsWNCisRhrBbUaTR56qCk6pLsEn.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:34742'),
  ('728733850797727575', 'To Love, To Lose', 2026, 'Drama', 'Yavuz Turgul', 'Kurtcebe Turgul, Nilgün Öneş', 'İbrahim Çelikkol, Eminé Meyrem, Yasemin Kay Allen, Tarik Pabuccuoglu, Deniz Türkali, Menderes Samancılar, Sinan Bengier, Asuman Çakır', null, 'A star-crossed romance seals the fate of two families when a woman trying to save her family restaurant falls for the surly heir of a debt collector.', 'A star-crossed romance seals the fate of two families when a woman trying to save her family restaurant falls for the surly heir of a debt collector.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5mbscE83E2udAljoALb65Sxhmt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:310045'),
  ('630830650334136908', 'To My Beloved Thief', 2026, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Drama', '이선', '이선', 'Nam Ji-hyun, Moon Sang-min, Hong Min-gi, Han So-eun, Choi Won-young, Ha Seok-jin, Kim Suk-hoon, Kim Jung-nan', null, 'A noblewoman who becomes a righteous bandit called Gil Dong, and Joseon Prince Yi Yeol who secretly investigates this bandit, only to find their souls mysteriously swapped, forcing them to work together and fall in love amidst intrigue, as they uncover conspiracies while protecting the people!', 'A noblewoman who becomes a righteous bandit called Gil Dong, and Joseon Prince Yi Yeol who secretly investigates this bandit, only to find their souls mysteriously swapped, forcing them to work together and fall in love amidst intrigue, as they uncover conspiracies while protecting the people!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rovxC2ugTtaMsgo7lOF4R4VBSb9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:301886'),
  ('875061131823074879', 'To My Shore', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Yun Qi, Hao Yiran, Chen Jianyu, Kou Weilong', null, 'After a car accident, a ruthless Thai heir and a reserved company executive become trapped in a dangerous game of desire that spirals into obsession.', 'After a car accident, a ruthless Thai heir and a reserved company executive become trapped in a dangerous game of desire that spirals into obsession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1iU3Ak0HaJfMeIVGVgvOWLuYx3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:293391'),
  ('493785670567660787', 'To My Star', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Hwang Da-seul', 'Young Park', 'Son Woo-hyeon, Kim Kang-min, Go Jae-hyun, Chun Jae-young, Kim Jin-kwon, Han Ji-won', 'TV-PG', 'Kang Seo-jun seeks escape, Han Ji-woo craves peace—but when their worlds collide, neither can stay the same.', 'Kang Seo-jun seeks escape, Han Ji-woo craves peace—but when their worlds collide, neither can stay the same.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJ4fE1idKvIlViZsDz6MOuvIfJr.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:115663'),
  ('579968000600007156', 'To Paidi', 2025, 'Family, Comedy', 'Stelios Kotionis', null, 'Vassilis Boutsikos, Denia Stasinopoulou, Nikos Zeginoglou, Izabella Baltsavia, Anna Mascha, Elena Topalidou, Christos Kontogeorgis, Stefi Poulopoulou', null, 'Artemis, a former taekwondo champion, is forced to become the guardian of Dimitris, a child on the autism spectrum and the son of a Russian tycoon, after his family is violently attacked. With his parents abducted and the police unwilling to intervene, she takes him and seeks refuge in her father’s remote village. But there, another mystery awaits: the unexplained disappearance of the mayor and the wary, secretive locals.', 'Artemis, a former taekwondo champion, is forced to become the guardian of Dimitris, a child on the autism spectrum and the son of a Russian tycoon, after his family is violently attacked. With his parents abducted and the police unwilling to intervene, she takes him and seeks refuge in her father’s remote village. But there, another mystery awaits: the unexplained disappearance of the mayor and the wary, secretive locals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3So4PEoGjn1KtzuxCGGqSwKDMn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:300805'),
  ('522763112191615244', 'To Play the King', 1993, 'Drama, Comedy, War & Politics', 'Andrew Davies', 'Andrew Davies, Michael Dobbs', 'Ian Richardson, Kitty Aldridge, Michael Kitchen, Colin Jeavons, Nicholas Farrell, Rowena King, Diane Fletcher, Erika Hoffman', null, 'Francis Urquhart''s survival at the top is threatened by the new king''s populist agenda.', 'Francis Urquhart''s survival at the top is threatened by the new king''s populist agenda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uyTPnSlh7NKic8MgYn2GzD7s0La.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13868'),
