  ('1092793609998609614', 'To Sir, with Love', 2022, 'Drama, Family, War & Politics', null, null, 'Thanapat Kawila, Rachata Hampanont, Kitsakorn Kanogtorn, Kittivat Kirn, Piyathida Mittiraroch, Panward Hemmanee, Mayurin Pongpudpunth, Somchai Kemklad', null, 'Jao Sua Song leads the Five Dragon Guild, but family chaos brews. Eldest son Thian faces pressure to inherit power while battling forbidden love.', 'Jao Sua Song leads the Five Dragon Guild, but family chaos brews. Eldest son Thian faces pressure to inherit power while battling forbidden love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/55MnjnSAn0aGNy5oIJqDw7Gks5q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211598'),
