  ('837389330565766443', 'Tojima Wants to Be a Kamen Rider', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Katsuyuki Konishi, Ai Kayano, Kenichi Suzumura, Soma Saito, Fairouz Ai', null, 'Even after turning 40 years old, Tojima Tanzaburo still seriously wants to be a Kamen Rider. Just when it seems like his dream may never come true, he gets caught up in a series of infamous Shocker-inspired robberies... Shibata Yokusaru, the author of Air Master and 81 Diver, presents a story about adults who love Kamen Rider a little too much, and start playing pretend... for real!', 'Even after turning 40 years old, Tojima Tanzaburo still seriously wants to be a Kamen Rider. Just when it seems like his dream may never come true, he gets caught up in a series of infamous Shocker-inspired robberies... Shibata Yokusaru, the author of Air Master and 81 Diver, presents a story about adults who love Kamen Rider a little too much, and start playing pretend... for real!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oDHsngq989H1jY2ZsLB5KRUVIb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:285788'),
  ('353099518980544420', 'Toki Sudeni Osushi!?', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy', null, '兵藤 るり', 'Hiromi Nagasaku, Kenichi Matsuyama, Shiro Sano, First Summer Uika, Soma Santoki, Motoki Nakazawa, Kyoka Shibata, Tsutomu Sekine', null, 'After devoting 14 years to raising her son following her husband’s sudden death, Minato finally faces life on her own as he enters the workforce. Unsure how to spend her newfound freedom, she discovers a new passion by enrolling in a sushi academy, learning the art of sushi and rediscovering herself along the way.', 'After devoting 14 years to raising her son following her husband’s sudden death, Minato finally faces life on her own as he enters the workforce. Unsure how to spend her newfound freedom, she discovers a new passion by enrolling in a sushi academy, learning the art of sushi and rediscovering herself along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oKZYZoJqeemSntNmCVoQm1Ersav.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:314642'),
  ('355659014768671117', 'Tokko', 2006, 'Animation, Crime', null, null, 'Wataru Takagi, Kenichi Suzumura, Akemi Kanda, Kana Ueda, Fumiko Orikasa, Rio Natsuki, Hiroshi Tsuchida', null, 'Tokko is a Japanese manga series written and illustrated by Tohru Fujisawa. It was serialized in Kodansha''s Afternoon in 2003 and collected into 3 tankōbon volumes. An anime adaptation directed by Masashi Abe, animated by AIC Spirits and Group Tac, first aired in Japan on April 15, 2006 and ran for 13 episodes. The manga was licensed in North America by Tokyopop, who released the first volume on July 15, 2008. The anime was licensed in the United States and United Kingdom by Manga Entertainment, with its first DVD released on March 20, 2007, and in Australasia by Madman Entertainment. In the US the SciFi Channel aired Tokko in 2007, in 2010 it aired on Chiller, while in Canada it was shown on Super Channel.', 'Tokko is a Japanese manga series written and illustrated by Tohru Fujisawa. It was serialized in Kodansha''s Afternoon in 2003 and collected into 3 tankōbon volumes. An anime adaptation directed by Masashi Abe, animated by AIC Spirits and Group Tac, first aired in Japan on April 15, 2006 and ran for 13 episodes. The manga was licensed in North America by Tokyopop, who released the first volume on July 15, 2008. The anime was licensed in the United States and United Kingdom by Manga Entertainment, with its first DVD released on March 20, 2007, and in Australasia by Madman Entertainment. In the US the SciFi Channel aired Tokko in 2007, in 2010 it aired on Chiller, while in Canada it was shown on Super Channel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Ws4iReO1k1NDXMhKhQtdaDFvKR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14350'),
  ('816307401344667999', 'Tokumei Sentai Go-Busters', 2012, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama, Kids', null, null, 'Katsuhiro Suzuki, Ryoma Baba, Arisa Komiya, Hiroya Matsumoto, Yuichi Nakamura, Hideo Sakaki, Naoto Takahashi, Fuuka Nishihira', null, 'New CE 2012. the mysterious organization Vagras aims to threaten the city by stealing the Enetron which is a new power source supporting people’s life. It''s up to the Go-Busters to protect the city alongside their partners, the Buddyroids.', 'New CE 2012. the mysterious organization Vagras aims to threaten the city by stealing the Enetron which is a new power source supporting people’s life. It''s up to the Go-Busters to protect the city alongside their partners, the Buddyroids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qE6IUejECzwJKI4ZBrR7ABFDsVe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42361'),
  ('835995744758382933', 'Tokusatsu GaGaGa', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Tanba Niwa', null, 'Fuka Koshiba, Kana Kurashina, Haruka Kinami, Yuki Morinaga, Honda Takafumi, Rena Takeda, Mikoto Uchiyama, Kokoro Terada', null, 'The series is based on the manga Tokusatsu Gagaga, a comedy manga by Tanba Niwa. Tokusatsu Gagaga series follows Kano Nakamura, an office lady played by Fuka Koshiba, who is secretly a tokusatsu otaku, a toku-ota. She lives her life by the code of tokusatsu heroes and often envisions herself as one as a means to make it through her daily struggles.', 'The series is based on the manga Tokusatsu Gagaga, a comedy manga by Tanba Niwa. Tokusatsu Gagaga series follows Kano Nakamura, an office lady played by Fuka Koshiba, who is secretly a tokusatsu otaku, a toku-ota. She lives her life by the code of tokusatsu heroes and often envisions herself as one as a means to make it through her daily struggles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekrEZFXoKuDJ6YGtV4mbXWcL4GN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85517'),
  ('931746432471380815', 'Tokusou Sentai Dekaranger', 2004, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Kids', null, null, 'Ryuji Sainei, Tsuyoshi Hayashi, Yosuke Ito, Ayumi Kinoshita, Mika Kikuchi, Tomokazu Yoshida, Tetsu Inada, Mako Ishino', null, 'Welcome to Megalopolis! Once a peaceful Earth city, it''s now a haven for criminals aided by the nefarious Alienizer arms dealer, Agent Abrella. Now, it''s up to Ban Akaza and the Special Police Dekarangers to protect the Earth from the invading Alienizers and finally bring peace and justice back to the planet.', 'Welcome to Megalopolis! Once a peaceful Earth city, it''s now a haven for criminals aided by the nefarious Alienizer arms dealer, Agent Abrella. Now, it''s up to Ban Akaza and the Special Police Dekarangers to protect the Earth from the invading Alienizers and finally bring peace and justice back to the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vupRI1U1wFMF6hDBXRkx93A6xGE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5744'),
  ('680342022005679109', 'Tokyo 24th Ward', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Yuma Uchida, Kaito Ishikawa, Junya Enoki, Yui Makino, Nanami Tomaru, Hitomi Nabatame, Taiten Kusunoki, Soma Saito', 'TV-14', 'The Far Eastern Special Administrative Region, also known as the 24th Ward, is a man-made island. Shuta, Ran, and Koki were born and raised on the island. Their family backgrounds, preferences, and personalities are completely different, but they always stuck together. However, one incident changed their relationship forever. A year afterward, the three friends are reunited by chance at a memorial service held for the incident. All three of their phones suddenly ring simultaneously. Their friend, who is supposed to be dead, is calling and demands that they make a decision about the future.', 'The Far Eastern Special Administrative Region, also known as the 24th Ward, is a man-made island. Shuta, Ran, and Koki were born and raised on the island. Their family backgrounds, preferences, and personalities are completely different, but they always stuck together. However, one incident changed their relationship forever. A year afterward, the three friends are reunited by chance at a memorial service held for the incident. All three of their phones suddenly ring simultaneously. Their friend, who is supposed to be dead, is calling and demands that they make a decision about the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NYB8HfKALKQ4cHGx8Rx4Dhd0YE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137045'),
  ('41146992470030072', 'Tokyo Babylon', 1992, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Crime', null, null, 'Kappei Yamaguchi, Miki Ito, Takehito Koyasu', 'TV-MA', 'Psychic investigator Subaru Sumeragi is hot on the tail of a serial killer who seems to have some supernatural powers of his own. When Subaru encounters a young girl placing a curse on his suspect, the mystery deepens. The body count continues to rise, and Subaru must solve the case quickly, or he may become the killer’s next target!', 'Psychic investigator Subaru Sumeragi is hot on the tail of a serial killer who seems to have some supernatural powers of his own. When Subaru encounters a young girl placing a curse on his suspect, the mystery deepens. The body count continues to rise, and Subaru must solve the case quickly, or he may become the killer’s next target!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ieYl3kVOzC7lQ9jNwkvG1nwkADh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44485'),
  ('71615355782049826', 'Tokyo Dogs', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yusuke Ishii, Takashi Narita', 'Yuichi Fukuda', 'Shun Oguri, Hiro Mizushima, Yuriko Yoshitaka, Tomokazu Miura, Nene Otsuka, Ryo Katsuji, Mikihisa Azuma, Kotaro Shiga', null, 'Kanade Takakura is an elite detective from the New York Police department. He has a very keen sense of judgement but is cold and inflexible. Kanade lost his father in a murder as a young boy, which drove him to become a detective. Maruo Kudo is a former motorcycle gang member now special detective with the Japanese police department. These two opposite characters team up on a case in which secrets are held by a young lady named Yuki Matsunada.', 'Kanade Takakura is an elite detective from the New York Police department. He has a very keen sense of judgement but is cold and inflexible. Kanade lost his father in a murder as a young boy, which drove him to become a detective. Maruo Kudo is a former motorcycle gang member now special detective with the Japanese police department. These two opposite characters team up on a case in which secrets are held by a young lady named Yuki Matsunada.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jtbyREMlGorAYuUCc7KejuXFu6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31422'),
  ('669457021176444296', 'Tokyo Encounter', 2010, null, null, null, 'Tomokazu Sugita, Yuichi Nakamura', null, 'Starring anime voice actors Tomokazu Sugita and Yuichi Nakamura, the show features the pair playing video games (from retro to modern-day) and generally goofing around.', 'Starring anime voice actors Tomokazu Sugita and Yuichi Nakamura, the show features the pair playing video games (from retro to modern-day) and generally goofing around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMKbxatuTg3B23CEaosl9wJZt0V.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62567'),
  ('232863134831344394', 'Tokyo ESP', 2014, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Hideyuki Kurata, Katsuhiko Takayama', 'Ibuki Kido, Keisuke Komoto, Tetsu Inada, Mai Aizawa, Kaoru Mizuhara, Megumi Ogata, Yoshihisa Kawahara, Azusa Tadokoro', 'TV-MA', 'Rinka Urushiba is a normal high school girl, until she encounters a penguin and shoals of glowing fish swimming through the sky. She looses consciousness only to awaken with the power to move through inanimate objects. At first she thought it was a hallucination if it were not for Kyotaro Azuma who witnessed the event and who, incidentally, has the ability to teleport. They decide to use their powers to combat people who might use their powers for evil.', 'Rinka Urushiba is a normal high school girl, until she encounters a penguin and shoals of glowing fish swimming through the sky. She looses consciousness only to awaken with the power to move through inanimate objects. At first she thought it was a hallucination if it were not for Kyotaro Azuma who witnessed the event and who, incidentally, has the ability to teleport. They decide to use their powers to combat people who might use their powers for evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p8eqfHkrRF1pviqFEyKw3LeLeEA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61202'),
  ('129442790076696034', 'Tokyo Ghoul', 2014, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Natsuki Hanae, Sora Amamiya, Shintaro Asanuma, Takahiro Sakurai, Sumire Morohoshi, Yuuya Uchida', 'TV-MA', 'Ken Kaneki, a bookworm college student, meets Rize, a girl his own age with whom he shares many interests.', 'Ken Kaneki, a bookworm college student, meets Rize, a girl his own age with whom he shares many interests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1m4RlC9BTCbyY549TOdVQ5NRPcR.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:61374'),
  ('504425867805355921', 'Tokyo Girl', 2016, 'Drama', 'Yuki Tanada', null, 'Asami Mizukawa, Tsuyoshi Abe, Syohei Ueki, Airi Matsuyama, Masumi Nomura, Sara Imaizumi, Arisa Notomi, Renge Ishiyama', 'NR', 'The story follows Aya from the time she moves to Tokyo at age 23 up until she turns 40. Aya has to adjust to the different values and perceptions of the big city as she struggles with challenging situations. We get to follow Aya’s move from one neighborhood to another as she maneuvers her career and love life.', 'The story follows Aya from the time she moves to Tokyo at age 23 up until she turns 40. Aya has to adjust to the different values and perceptions of the big city as she struggles with challenging situations. We get to follow Aya’s move from one neighborhood to another as she maneuvers her career and love life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uFD1J95XjCXVqAEJ4CMyRBvmaKB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80784'),
  ('415047285930406561', 'Tokyo in April Is...', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Sakurai Yuki, Aloha Takamatsu, Tsuyoshi Furukawa, Ayano Aya, Takeno Sena, Mitsunobu Jiyo, Nao Okabe, Shingo Nakayama', 'TV-MA', 'Childhood friends Kazuma and Ren reunite as coworkers after a decade apart, but Ren’s cold demeanor forces Kazuma to confront their past and buried emotions.', 'Childhood friends Kazuma and Ren reunite as coworkers after a decade apart, but Ren’s cold demeanor forces Kazuma to confront their past and buried emotions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTUUVJFySNTRxxmmihikdOrs4qJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:227212'),
  ('1101703966602262972', 'Tokyo Joshi Pro-Wrestling', 2013, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Comedy', 'Tetsuya Koda, Tadashi Takagi', null, null, null, 'Tokyo Joshi Pro-Wrestling, often abbreviated to TJP or TJPW, is a Japanese joshi puroresu or women''s professional wrestling promotion founded in 2012 as a sister promotion of DDT Pro-Wrestling. Initially running alongside other shows such as live music and other idol performances, it became its own fully fledged promotion starting on February 28, 2015.', 'Tokyo Joshi Pro-Wrestling, often abbreviated to TJP or TJPW, is a Japanese joshi puroresu or women''s professional wrestling promotion founded in 2012 as a sister promotion of DDT Pro-Wrestling. Initially running alongside other shows such as live music and other idol performances, it became its own fully fledged promotion starting on February 28, 2015.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mfXK8BFhEDFsJrwr40MMZHFjwDL.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:198988'),
  ('7410912240194362', 'Tokyo Love Act Story', 2023, 'Drama', null, '姜晓欣', 'Kana Momonogi, Moe Amatsuka, Umi Yatsugake, Ria Yamate, Minami Aizawa, Iori Kogawa, Karen Yuzuriha, Saika Kawakita', 'TV-MA', 'Zhou Guobin''s long-awaited trip to Tokyo was just to meet netizen Momo Nogi, who he had been in love with for three years. Suddenly, a mysterious man stuffed Bin with a small book called "Shi" and a condom, threatening him to look for his pubic hair, otherwise he would be exhausted and die! This book "Shi" allowed Bin to meet different AV actresses one after another.', 'Zhou Guobin''s long-awaited trip to Tokyo was just to meet netizen Momo Nogi, who he had been in love with for three years. Suddenly, a mysterious man stuffed Bin with a small book called "Shi" and a condom, threatening him to look for his pubic hair, otherwise he would be exhausted and die! This book "Shi" allowed Bin to meet different AV actresses one after another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8bffoPC4ODJ9hiPpaOjUMop3W7v.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:232892'),
  ('167275677704577694', 'Tokyo Love Story', 1991, 'Drama', null, null, 'Honami Suzuki, Yuji Oda, Yosuke Eguchi, Narimi Arimori, Akiho Sendo, Miki Ito, Tokuma Nishioka, Hideyuki Nakayama', null, 'Nagao Kanji who comes from Ehime Prefecture joins Heartsports company located in Tokyo, where he met lovely and sunny Akana Rika. The love story begins.', 'Nagao Kanji who comes from Ehime Prefecture joins Heartsports company located in Tokyo, where he met lovely and sunny Akana Rika. The love story begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xsDh00GOrmEfS9Q1M11DVUEpCL7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16069'),
  ('501851692962245874', 'Tokyo Magnitude 8.0', 2009, 'Animation, Drama', null, 'Kazuya Murata', 'Satomi Hanamura, Yumiko Kobayashi, Yuhko Kaida, Narumi Takahira, Ai Nonaka, Hiroshi Naka, Kikuko Inoue, Takeshi Aono', 'TV-14', 'There is an estimated 70% or higher possibility that a magnitude 7.0 earthquake will occur in Tokyo in the next 30 years. In 2012, Mirai, a middle school freshman girl, goes to Tokyo’s artificial Odaiba Island for a robot exhibition with her brother Yuuki at the start of summer vacation. A powerful tremor registering 8.0 on the JMA scale emanates from an ocean trench, the famed Tokyo Tower and Rainbow Bridge crumble and fall, and the landscape of Tokyo changes in seconds. With the help of a motorcycle delivery woman named Mari who they meet on Odaiba, Mirai and Yuuki strive to head back to their Setagaya home in western Tokyo.', 'There is an estimated 70% or higher possibility that a magnitude 7.0 earthquake will occur in Tokyo in the next 30 years. In 2012, Mirai, a middle school freshman girl, goes to Tokyo’s artificial Odaiba Island for a robot exhibition with her brother Yuuki at the start of summer vacation. A powerful tremor registering 8.0 on the JMA scale emanates from an ocean trench, the famed Tokyo Tower and Rainbow Bridge crumble and fall, and the landscape of Tokyo changes in seconds. With the help of a motorcycle delivery woman named Mari who they meet on Odaiba, Mirai and Yuuki strive to head back to their Setagaya home in western Tokyo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fIRYkOCNH18vF1ygXAtCVqqZZPc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37866'),
  ('258166893462659437', 'Tokyo Majin', 2007, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, 'Toshizo Nemoto', 'Yui Horie, Satomi Arai, Hiro Shimono, Masaki Kawanabe, Katsui Taira, Eiji Sekiguchi, Anri Katsu, Kana Ueda', null, 'A force of supernatural darkness is unleashing the walking dead on Tokyo, and five high school students with extraordinary powers - and nothing in common - must band together to fight the scourge.', 'A force of supernatural darkness is unleashing the walking dead on Tokyo, and five high school students with extraordinary powers - and nothing in common - must band together to fight the scourge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4fnbCDUzplQIVlEjPcRrl5PuVc9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34726'),
  ('451475145256267984', 'TOKYO MER: Mobile Emergency Room', 2021, 'Drama', null, null, 'Ryohei Suzuki, Kento Kaku, Ayami Nakajo, Jun Kaname, Nanao, Shingo Tsurumi, Satoshi Hashimoto, Makiko Watanabe', null, 'TOKYO MER is formed by order from the Governor of Tokyo. The name of the group stands for TOKYO Mobile Emergency Room. The members are emergency care professionals and they are to go to sites of dangerous accidents and disasters by ER car. Their ER car is a large vehicle equipped with the latest medical devices and an operating area. There, TOKYO MER saves lives of the injured. Kōta Kitami is a doctor for TOKYO MER and its leader. He holds a strong conviction that, regardless of the dangers, he will go to accident sites to save lives.', 'TOKYO MER is formed by order from the Governor of Tokyo. The name of the group stands for TOKYO Mobile Emergency Room. The members are emergency care professionals and they are to go to sites of dangerous accidents and disasters by ER car. Their ER car is a large vehicle equipped with the latest medical devices and an operating area. There, TOKYO MER saves lives of the injured. Kōta Kitami is a doctor for TOKYO MER and its leader. He holds a strong conviction that, regardless of the dangers, he will go to accident sites to save lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/op6EKK1x2mtuWWXRZWtNhnCo9YJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128163'),
  ('233265456008921823', 'Tokyo Mew Mew', 2002, 'Animation, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Saki Nakajima, Yumi Kakazu, Kumi Sakuma, Hisayo Mochizuki, Junko Noda, Megumi Ogata, Koichi Tochika, Hikaru Midorikawa', 'TV-Y7', 'On her first date with the cutest boy in school, Ichigo is zapped by a mysterious ray that scrambles her DNA with that of the endangered Iriomote wildcat. The next day, Ichigo discovers that she has developed the agility (and occasionally the ears and tail) of a cat, as well as the power to transform into a pink-haired superheroine, Mew Ichigo. She and four other girls, each endowed with the genes of a different "Red Data" animal, have been selected for the top-secret Mew Project, which aims to protect the Earth from an alien menace known as Deep Blue.', 'On her first date with the cutest boy in school, Ichigo is zapped by a mysterious ray that scrambles her DNA with that of the endangered Iriomote wildcat. The next day, Ichigo discovers that she has developed the agility (and occasionally the ears and tail) of a cat, as well as the power to transform into a pink-haired superheroine, Mew Ichigo. She and four other girls, each endowed with the genes of a different "Red Data" animal, have been selected for the top-secret Mew Project, which aims to protect the Earth from an alien menace known as Deep Blue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEBuze5ULPfMYfMX8BYuVa2moRs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46345'),
  ('447456142554270522', 'Tokyo Mew Mew New', 2022, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Yuuki Temma, Mirai Hinata, Ryouko Jyuni, Rian Toda, Momoka Ishii, Yuma Uchida, Yuichi Nakamura, Yusuke Shirai', 'TV-PG', 'The scientists of the μ(Mew) Project use DNA of endangered species to create a team of heroines imbued with amazing abilities. Armed with the skills of an Iriomote cat, Ichigo must band together with other Mew Mew girls to repel an alien incursion.', 'The scientists of the μ(Mew) Project use DNA of endangered species to create a team of heroines imbued with amazing abilities. Armed with the skills of an Iriomote cat, Ichigo must band together with other Mew Mew girls to repel an alien incursion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mTMyfBtlFB8mYs5vxa5CoIP4m2i.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:118017'),
  ('379079504593956160', 'Tokyo MPD – From ZERO to HERO', 2016, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Takashi Naito, Yuki Saito, Hirotaro Honda, Akio Kaneda, Hiroki Suzuki, Hana Hizuki, Nobuyuki Hanawa, Hiroki Iijima', null, 'The First Investigative Division is the star unit of the Tokyo Metropolitan Police Department. Jun''ichi Ōiwa, the head of the division, leads around 400 elite detectives. He has an extremely heavy responsibility: attends initial investigations at the scenes of all brutal crimes that occur within the metropolis, decides on the course of action of the investigations at the same time as he directs many investigation task forces and gets into investigations himself at the critical phase. However, Ōiwa is definitely not a superman. Amid his suffering, Ōiwa overcomes this grave responsibility and is quite simply a "life-size hero" and "ideal boss" to his subordinates.', 'The First Investigative Division is the star unit of the Tokyo Metropolitan Police Department. Jun''ichi Ōiwa, the head of the division, leads around 400 elite detectives. He has an extremely heavy responsibility: attends initial investigations at the scenes of all brutal crimes that occur within the metropolis, decides on the course of action of the investigations at the same time as he directs many investigation task forces and gets into investigations himself at the critical phase. However, Ōiwa is definitely not a superman. Amid his suffering, Ōiwa overcomes this grave responsibility and is quite simply a "life-size hero" and "ideal boss" to his subordinates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/43dUCJNYfsiaIzSneuaJIxgUDTm.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:113639'),
  ('1059368619485141950', 'Tokyo Override', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Fairouz Ai, Ryota Takeuchi, Mariya Ise, Hochu Otsuka, Yuhko Kaida', 'TV-14', 'When a lonely hacker gets entangled with a group of underground couriers, they uncover the dark truth lurking beneath Tokyo''s seemingly perfect facade.', 'When a lonely hacker gets entangled with a group of underground couriers, they uncover the dark truth lurking beneath Tokyo''s seemingly perfect facade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MvNTEbOAgNsXPkzcYvBw6gJNzo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:256324'),
  ('742438038115071173', 'Tokyo Pig', 1997, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', null, 'Yoshio Urasawa', 'Omi Minami, Mika Kanai, Kurumi Mamiya, Kiyoyuki Yanada, Naoko Matsui, Kotono Mitsuishi, Misa Watanabe, Yoku Shioya', 'TV-Y7', 'Tokyo Pig is about a young boy and the adventures he has with his magic diary where anything he draws will come to life. In the first episode, "When Pigs Fly," he draws hundreds of flying pigs. As he experiences his first drawing coming to life, he tries to erase them all before his parents catch him. In his haste however, he misses one pig which becomes his pet, Sunny Pig.', 'Tokyo Pig is about a young boy and the adventures he has with his magic diary where anything he draws will come to life. In the first episode, "When Pigs Fly," he draws hundreds of flying pigs. As he experiences his first drawing coming to life, he tries to erase them all before his parents catch him. In his haste however, he misses one pig which becomes his pet, Sunny Pig.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1YCq4njNsdg9edgaoTGDakE2XqV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9644'),
  ('1125115402673025464', 'Tokyo Ravens', 2013, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kaito Ishikawa, Kana Hanazawa, Ryohei Kimura, Hisako Kanemoto, Ayane Sakura, Aki Toyosaki, Eri Kitamura, Hiro Shimono', 'TV-14', 'Tsuchimikado Harutora was born into a prestigious Onmyoji family, but he can''t see "spirit energy". Therefore, he''s been enjoying a peaceful daily life with his friends at an Onmyo branch school. One day, his childhood friend Tsuchimikado Natsume, heir to the head family, suddenly appears. Will this cause his destiny spring into motion!?', 'Tsuchimikado Harutora was born into a prestigious Onmyoji family, but he can''t see "spirit energy". Therefore, he''s been enjoying a peaceful daily life with his friends at an Onmyo branch school. One day, his childhood friend Tsuchimikado Natsume, heir to the head family, suddenly appears. Will this cause his destiny spring into motion!?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgCoBUFzK89BdWV3xh8oqw0PGGU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67395'),
  ('650971371408751075', 'Tokyo Revengers', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', null, null, 'Yuuki Shin, Azumi Waki, Ryota Osaka, Yuu Hayashi, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Takuma Terashima, Yuya Hirose, Shunsuke Takeuchi', 'TV-MA', 'Takemichi Hanagaki is a freelancer that’s reached the absolute pits of despair in his life. He finds out that the only girlfriend he ever had, in middle school, Hinata Tachibana, had been killed by the ruthless Tokyo Manji Gang. The day after hearing about her death, he’s standing on the station platform and ends up being pushed over onto the tracks by a herd of people. He closes his eyes thinking he’s about to die, but when he opens his eyes back up, he somehow had gone back in time 12 years. Now that he’s back living the best days of his life, Takemichi decides to get revenge on his life.', 'Takemichi Hanagaki is a freelancer that’s reached the absolute pits of despair in his life. He finds out that the only girlfriend he ever had, in middle school, Hinata Tachibana, had been killed by the ruthless Tokyo Manji Gang. The day after hearing about her death, he’s standing on the station platform and ends up being pushed over onto the tracks by a herd of people. He closes his eyes thinking he’s about to die, but when he opens his eyes back up, he somehow had gone back in time 12 years. Now that he’s back living the best days of his life, Takemichi decides to get revenge on his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/arB3L9pZZBSzUPSC8BEv8c3X0bF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105009'),
  ('785107948723622732', 'Tokyo Salad Bowl', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', null, 'Tomoki Kanazawa', 'Nao, Ryuhei Matsuda, Aoi Nakamura, Rena Takeda, Daisuke Nakagawa, Itose Soichi, Mandy Sekiguchi, Daichi Asai', null, 'In Tokyo, police officer Mari Kouda and Chinese interpreter Ryo Arikino solve cases while bonding over meals from different cultures, forming an unexpected connection through their shared experiences.', 'In Tokyo, police officer Mari Kouda and Chinese interpreter Ryo Arikino solve cases while bonding over meals from different cultures, forming an unexpected connection through their shared experiences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wjSolHsLh98Sq5fqyK9426TXgAC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:274008'),
  ('82073660296687847', 'Tokyo Swindlers', 2024, 'Crime', null, null, 'Go Ayano, Etsushi Toyokawa, Kazuki Kitamura, Eiko Koike, Pierre Taki, Shota Sometani, Takayuki Yamada, Izumi Matsuoka', 'TV-MA', 'A team of swindlers gets wind of prime real estate worth 10 billion yen and will stop at nothing to pull off their most ambitious scam yet.', 'A team of swindlers gets wind of prime real estate worth 10 billion yen and will stop at nothing to pull off their most ambitious scam yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/892R0peQpBJP6VnAiQWtAGxRUr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:249906'),
  ('673890483560853282', 'Tokyo Trial', 2016, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, 'Max Mannix, Kees van Beijnum, Rob W. King', 'Stacy Keach, Tim Ahern, Serge Hazanavicius, Jonathan Hyde, Julian Wadham, Stephen McHattie, David K.S. Tse, Bert Matias', null, 'In the wake of World War II, 11 Allied judges are tasked with weighing the fates of Japanese war criminals in a tense international trial.', 'In the wake of World War II, 11 Allied judges are tasked with weighing the fates of Japanese war criminals in a tense international trial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBg3NPA0kf2Qt01FAL52hkWhbZa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69090'),
  ('376585346267335335', 'TOKYO TRIBE 2', 2006, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Daisuke Namikawa, Kenta Miyake, Yu Kobayashi, Yuji Ueda, Daisuke Gori, Hidekatsu Shibata, Hiroki Yasumoto, Issei Miyazaki', 'TV-MA', 'This is the other side of Tokyo, a Tokyo of a different color. There, various tribes are living. The SARU from Japan''s Musashino, WU-RONZE of Bukuro, and HANDS of Shindyuku - Young men living in the city...the public of modern times builds a home out of corruption, these young men of the sordid side of life, a side called "reality," are depicted here. (Source: AnimeNfo)', 'This is the other side of Tokyo, a Tokyo of a different color. There, various tribes are living. The SARU from Japan''s Musashino, WU-RONZE of Bukuro, and HANDS of Shindyuku - Young men living in the city...the public of modern times builds a home out of corruption, these young men of the sordid side of life, a side called "reality," are depicted here. (Source: AnimeNfo)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7RkMeaM3NlnF9N15Z7WuOxpV4Hu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117450'),
  ('198777188378603868', 'Tokyo Underground', 2002, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Akinobu Uraka', null, 'Tomokazu Seki, Junko Noda, Shin-ichiro Miki, Shigeru Ushiyama, Kaoru Morota, Haruhi Nanao, Mayumi Izuka, Soichiro Hoshi', 'TV-14', 'Tokyo Underground is a manga series by Akinobu Uraka and published by Enix. It became an anime series, produced by Studio Pierrot and shown on the TV Tokyo Network from April 2 until September 24, 2002. The TV series was released on DVD by Geneon Entertainment in the US and Canada, released as a boxset by Manga Entertainment in the UK and by Tokyo Night Train in Australia. It also aired in Canada on the digital channel G4techTV Canada, starting on July 22, 2007 at 8:30 pm ET/PT.', 'Tokyo Underground is a manga series by Akinobu Uraka and published by Enix. It became an anime series, produced by Studio Pierrot and shown on the TV Tokyo Network from April 2 until September 24, 2002. The TV series was released on DVD by Geneon Entertainment in the US and Canada, released as a boxset by Manga Entertainment in the UK and by Tokyo Night Train in Australia. It also aired in Canada on the digital channel G4techTV Canada, starting on July 22, 2007 at 8:30 pm ET/PT.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gsjdYvsZmvgeU2ysNj0DTbfIP2X.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34834'),
  ('588507206756679808', 'Tokyo Vampire Hotel', 2017, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Sion Sono', 'Manabu Ikarimoto, Jun Tsugita, Sion Sono', 'Kaho, Ami Tomite, Shinnosuke Mitsushima, Yumi Adachi, Megumi Kagurazaka, Lorena Koto, Joey Iwanaga, Ayumi Teresa', null, 'Manami suddenly encounters mass murder at a pub on her 22nd birthday as she is hunted down by two warring vampire clans, the Draculas and the Corvins. Manami is a child of prophecy who is meant to help the Draculas overcome their Corvin enemies who have driven them underground. Meanwhile, droves of young men and women are gathered at the Hotel Requiem by a Corvin named Yamada who informs them that the world is about to end, with this hotel being the only refuge.', 'Manami suddenly encounters mass murder at a pub on her 22nd birthday as she is hunted down by two warring vampire clans, the Draculas and the Corvins. Manami is a child of prophecy who is meant to help the Draculas overcome their Corvin enemies who have driven them underground. Meanwhile, droves of young men and women are gathered at the Hotel Requiem by a Corvin named Yamada who informs them that the world is about to end, with this hotel being the only refuge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sg2MBPMW8Ys11VTS51NxtLAC1vU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71495'),
  ('549731439250523645', 'Tokyo Vice', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'J.T. Rogers', null, 'Ansel Elgort, Ken Watanabe, Rachel Keller, Show Kasamatsu, Rinko Kikuchi, Yosuke Kubozuka, Miki Maya, Takaki Uda', 'TV-MA', 'A first-hand account of the Tokyo Metropolitan Police beat following Jake Adelstein, an American journalist who embeds himself into the Tokyo Vice police squad to reveal corruption. Based on Jake Adelstein’s non-fiction book of the same name.', 'A first-hand account of the Tokyo Metropolitan Police beat following Jake Adelstein, an American journalist who embeds himself into the Tokyo Vice police squad to reveal corruption. Based on Jake Adelstein’s non-fiction book of the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/za5QWRfCLwgRLLVXUkx3NUSAm6G.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:90296'),
  ('1085714941581374225', 'TOLGSHOW', 2018, 'Comedy, Talk', 'Ebru Yalçın', 'Tolga Çevik, Fırat Parlak', 'Tolga Çevik, Özer Atik, Fırat Parlak', null, 'Tolga Çevik’s highly anticipated new show, TOLGSHOW, is ready to air! Tolga Çevik, who has been making millions laugh for 10 years with his improvised “Arkadaşım” character, will also be hosting surprise guests on his new show. Featuring “Mysterious Director” Fırat Parlak and “Little Musician” Özer Atik, TOLGSHOW will once again be filled with misunderstandings, uncertainties, spats, and laughter.', 'Tolga Çevik’s highly anticipated new show, TOLGSHOW, is ready to air! Tolga Çevik, who has been making millions laugh for 10 years with his improvised “Arkadaşım” character, will also be hosting surprise guests on his new show. Featuring “Mysterious Director” Fırat Parlak and “Little Musician” Özer Atik, TOLGSHOW will once again be filled with misunderstandings, uncertainties, spats, and laughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cpIuEqufA0efZ6mbB5GDMbifSzM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:76579'),
  ('905627533299839286', 'Tom & Jerry Kids Show', 1990, 'Kids, Animation, Comedy', 'Carl Urbano, Don Lusk, Paul Sommer', null, 'Frank Welker, Don Messick, Charlie Adler, Richard Gautier, Patric Zimmerman, Phil Hartman, Teresa Ganzel', 'TV-G', 'Tom and Jerry in their childhood days, playing cat-and-mouse games even then.', 'Tom and Jerry in their childhood days, playing cat-and-mouse games even then.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pApniCXhegDnhxQda7RcpG8gFP0.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:4274'),
  ('308978441896754192', 'Tom and Jerry in New York', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', null, null, 'Kath Soucie, Rick Zieff, Sam Kwasman', 'TV-PG', 'Follow the iconic cat and mouse duo as they settle in to their new digs at the Royal Gate Hotel and unleash mayhem across the big city, inciting hilarious chaos uptown, downtown and everywhere their manic escapades take them.', 'Follow the iconic cat and mouse duo as they settle in to their new digs at the Royal Gate Hotel and unleash mayhem across the big city, inciting hilarious chaos uptown, downtown and everywhere their manic escapades take them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5nvIUVjFpRAiMziG5zP2KR1uLHV.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:127445'),
