  ('480050342097151220', 'Traces', 2019, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Val McDermid, Amelia Bullmore', 'Amelia Bullmore, Val McDermid', 'Molly Windsor, Laura Fraser, Jennifer Spence, Martin Compston, Michael Nardone, Laurie Brett, John Gordon Sinclair, Vincent Regan', 'TV-14', 'Set against the stunning Scottish landscape in and around Dundee, three compelling female characters — Emma Hedges, Prof. Sarah Gordon and Prof. Kathy Torrance — join forces to uncover the truth about an unsolved murder case that''s very close to home.', 'Set against the stunning Scottish landscape in and around Dundee, three compelling female characters — Emma Hedges, Prof. Sarah Gordon and Prof. Kathy Torrance — join forces to uncover the truth about an unsolved murder case that''s very close to home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bP5CMdMtkmNBmdoSIe6ByfGh7ZN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:96335'),
