  ('1065184643794235593', 'Trailer Park Boys: Out of the Park: USA', 2017, 'Comedy', null, null, 'John Paul Tremblay, Robb Wells, Mike Smith', 'TV-MA', 'The boys are back on the loose as Bubbles, Julian and Ricky head south of the Canadian border for some outrageous American adventures.', 'The boys are back on the loose as Bubbles, Julian and Ricky head south of the Canadian border for some outrageous American adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guwD8o0KwnFxqEeKMLcnNN8cnCp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75293'),
  ('354535688788702177', 'Trailer Park Boys: The Animated Series', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy', 'John Paul Tremblay, Robb Wells, Mike Smith', null, 'Robb Wells, Mike Smith, John Paul Tremblay', 'TV-MA', 'Nova Scotia’s favorite miscreants have always been super sketchy. Now, carrying on from the Season 12 finale, the boys have become complete cartoons.', 'Nova Scotia’s favorite miscreants have always been super sketchy. Now, carrying on from the Season 12 finale, the boys have become complete cartoons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emro60z8wYdPwuUOiCawbbqfAs0.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:88071'),
  ('169816531640932681', 'Train', 2020, 'Crime, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Park Ga-yeon', 'Yoon Shi-yoon, Gyeong Su-jin, Choi Seung-yoon, Shin So-yul, Cho Wan-ki, Cha Yeob, Kim Dong-young, Lee Hang-na', null, 'Several skeletons are discovered on the tracks of a closed train station. However, one of the dead victims walks into the police station. Where did all these dead bodies come from, and who is committing all of these murders? The world split into two on the night of a murder 12 years ago, and Do Won chases after the hidden truth in the parallel universe. This drama shows the contrast between two different worlds, divided by two different choices.', 'Several skeletons are discovered on the tracks of a closed train station. However, one of the dead victims walks into the police station. Where did all these dead bodies come from, and who is committing all of these murders? The world split into two on the night of a murder 12 years ago, and Do Won chases after the hidden truth in the parallel universe. This drama shows the contrast between two different worlds, divided by two different choices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9TScERozyKFUKbc63aB4bF6jqkD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:104811'),
  ('749754113480838174', 'Train Man', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Atsushi Ito, Misaki Itō, Miho Shiraishi, Mokomichi Hayami, Eriko Sato, Maki Horikita, Kosuke Toyohara, Risa Sudou', null, 'With the help of an online community, a nerdy and socially awkward man gathers the courage to start dating an attractive lady he met on a train.', 'With the help of an online community, a nerdy and socially awkward man gathers the courage to start dating an attractive lady he met on a train.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXy3TwY5jgXAP7Q9CAHlroR7GEz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:20043'),
  ('118003586768795996', 'Train to the End of the World', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Chika Anzai, Azumi Waki, Erisa Kuon, Hina Kino, Nao Toyama, Kazuyuki Okitsu', 'TV-14', 'In a seemingly ordinary rural town, something strange is happening to the residents. But Shizuru Chikura is more concerned for her missing friend. Determined to find her, Shizuru and three other girls board an abandoned train and travel to the outside world, unsure if they''ll make it back alive. As they venture toward the unknown, the question looms: What awaits them at the final stop?', 'In a seemingly ordinary rural town, something strange is happening to the residents. But Shizuru Chikura is more concerned for her missing friend. Determined to find her, Shizuru and three other girls board an abandoned train and travel to the outside world, unsure if they''ll make it back alive. As they venture toward the unknown, the question looms: What awaits them at the final stop?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9eyKUHjD3roRqyypM8FbsUV5iKT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:212273'),
  ('733303979179105343', 'Training Day', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Will Beall', null, 'Bill Paxton, Justin Cornwell, Katrina Law, Drew Van Acker', null, 'Fifteen years after the events of the feature film, Kyle Craig is assigned to go undercover in an elite squad of the LAPD as Detective Frank Rourke’s trainee to spy on him and report on his off-book methods. As Frank starts teaching his principled trainee the way of the streets, they form an uneasy alliance that will change the course of both their lives irrevocably.', 'Fifteen years after the events of the feature film, Kyle Craig is assigned to go undercover in an elite squad of the LAPD as Detective Frank Rourke’s trainee to spy on him and report on his off-book methods. As Frank starts teaching his principled trainee the way of the streets, they form an uneasy alliance that will change the course of both their lives irrevocably.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/miM5b0i5il3XT1qMHfQQ8k5DJ6B.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68000');
insert into temp_tv_shows_seed (id, title, year, genre, creator, writers, cast_members, age_rating, overview, synopsis, poster_url, seasons, source_key)
values
  ('1145871616682658957', 'Trainwreck: Storm Area 51', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'A viral joke about storming a secretive US Air Force base sparks a meme-fueled media frenzy and puts the military on alert in this bizarre true story.', 'A viral joke about storming a secretive US Air Force base sparks a meme-fueled media frenzy and puts the military on alert in this bizarre true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HTpeTo7oW1UaHY5SziVUdh0u9H.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:297010'),
  ('34453331302804376', 'Trainwreck: Woodstock ''99', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Ananda Lewis, John Scher, Michael Lang', 'TV-MA', 'Woodstock 1969 promised peace and music, but its ''99 revival delivered days of rage, riots and real harm. Why did it go so horribly wrong?', 'Woodstock 1969 promised peace and music, but its ''99 revival delivered days of rage, riots and real harm. Why did it go so horribly wrong?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hFWNQTiJ2VXfZeKrsykem0o9nWc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:206246'),
  ('180880352162181793', 'Traitors', 2019, 'War & Politics, Drama', 'Bathsheba Doran', null, 'Emma Appleton, Keeley Hawes, Brandon P Bell, Greg McHugh, Matt Lauria, Luke Treadaway, Michael Stuhlbarg, Simon Kunz', 'TV-MA', '1945 London. Feef is seduced by a rogue American spy into spying on her own country. Her task? To uncover a Russian agent in the heart of the British Government.', '1945 London. Feef is seduced by a rogue American spy into spying on her own country. Her task? To uncover a Russian agent in the heart of the British Government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3OI66SF1M0bsnP6kWh8uqJORpcT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86733'),
  ('360898848361648013', 'Transatlantic', 2023, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Anna Winger, Daniel Hendler', 'Tunde Aladese, Daniel Handler, Anna Winger', 'Gillian Jacobs, Cory Michael Smith, Lucas Englander, Corey Stoll, Ralph Amoussou, Deleila Piasko, Amit Rahav, Grégory Montel', 'TV-14', 'Two Americans and their allies form a scrappy rescue operation in 1940 Marseilles to help artists, writers and other refugees fleeing Europe during WWII. Transatlantic is a historical drama television miniseries created by Anna Winger and Daniel Hendler, based on the 2019 novel The Flight Portfolio by Julie Orringer. The novel explores the historic Emergency Rescue Committee that operated in Marseilles, Spain, and Portugal in 1940 after the fall of France. The series includes or refers to well-known artists or scholars of the time who were saved by the Committee or interacted with it. The series closed the 2023 Series Mania festival in March, ahead of its Netflix premiere on 7 April 2023.', 'Two Americans and their allies form a scrappy rescue operation in 1940 Marseilles to help artists, writers and other refugees fleeing Europe during WWII. Transatlantic is a historical drama television miniseries created by Anna Winger and Daniel Hendler, based on the 2019 novel The Flight Portfolio by Julie Orringer. The novel explores the historic Emergency Rescue Committee that operated in Marseilles, Spain, and Portugal in 1940 after the fall of France. The series includes or refers to well-known artists or scholars of the time who were saved by the Committee or interacted with it. The series closed the 2023 Series Mania festival in March, ahead of its Netflix premiere on 7 April 2023.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pCqUcxfxIAalYyaoDqMli8xtb1d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:195359'),
  ('923379560294278003', 'Transfers', 2017, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Patrick Bénédek, Claude Scasso', 'Patrick Bénédek, Claude Scasso', 'Arieh Worthalter, Brune Renault, Toinette Laquière, Steve Tientcheu, Balthazar Monfé, Aïssatou Diop, Sébastien Chassagne, Pili Groyne', 'TV-MA', 'Thanks to science, after five years of coma, Florian has his mind transferred into another''s body. Now he has to hide his identity, living as an officer with BATI, the anti-transfers unit.', 'Thanks to science, after five years of coma, Florian has his mind transferred into another''s body. Now he has to hide his identity, living as an officer with BATI, the anti-transfers unit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCDNVreh06y9ndXpe4CJGDgeq5E.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75074'),
  ('928498736687989962', 'Transformers: Animated', 2007, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Derrick J. Wyatt', null, 'David Kaye, Bumper Robinson, Corey Burton, Bill Fagerbakke, Jeff Bennett, Tara Strong, Tom Kenny, Phil LaMarr', 'TV-G', 'The evil Decepticons have appeared in Detroit. With the all powerful Allspark, Megatron can use it to turn all of Earth''s robots into Decepticons. However, Optimus Prime and his Autobots arrive and plan to stop Megatron and his evil plan in Transformers Animated.', 'The evil Decepticons have appeared in Detroit. With the all powerful Allspark, Megatron can use it to turn all of Earth''s robots into Decepticons. However, Optimus Prime and his Autobots arrive and plan to stop Megatron and his evil plan in Transformers Animated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZkn34WF6AIYlPP2w1iR6g0gcIZ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:10548'),
  ('21299934906294739', 'Transformers: Armada', 2003, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Eugene Ishikawa', null, 'Garry Chalk, David Kaye, Kirby Morrow, Tabitha St. Germain, Matt Hill, Michael Dobson, Brent Miller', 'TV-Y7', 'Earth kids enter a conflict between two factions of Transformers.', 'Earth kids enter a conflict between two factions of Transformers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjbBjYfXyISFZMbpNQBNoiKwJp2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:982'),
  ('594364626171846522', 'Transformers: Cybertron', 2005, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids', null, null, 'Taiten Kusunoki, Kōji Nakata, Daisuke Hirakawa, Hideo Ishikawa, Show Hayami, Tomoyuki Shimura, Tarusuke Shingaki, Takaya Kuroda', 'TV-Y7', 'Transformers: Cybertron, known in Japan originally as Transformers: Galaxy Force, is the 2005-2007 Transformers toy line and animated series, another co-production between Hasbro and Takara. It was aired in Japan as a separate rebooted transformers series, though in America, the English dub was presented as a sequel to the previous series, Transformers: Armada and Transformers: Energon by adding dialogue and reusing a number of screens to link elements of the Armada and Energon series to the show, giving the impression that it is a sequel. In the anime, all of the Transformers are computer-generated, while the humans and backgrounds are rendered in traditional 2D animation. It is the last series in the Transformers franchise to be produced in Japan.', 'Transformers: Cybertron, known in Japan originally as Transformers: Galaxy Force, is the 2005-2007 Transformers toy line and animated series, another co-production between Hasbro and Takara. It was aired in Japan as a separate rebooted transformers series, though in America, the English dub was presented as a sequel to the previous series, Transformers: Armada and Transformers: Energon by adding dialogue and reusing a number of screens to link elements of the Armada and Energon series to the show, giving the impression that it is a sequel. In the anime, all of the Transformers are computer-generated, while the humans and backgrounds are rendered in traditional 2D animation. It is the last series in the Transformers franchise to be produced in Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ul8l6uP1nUeFKQXiElI6pHzMeat.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10085'),
  ('124724543060927407', 'Transformers: Cyberverse', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Randolph Heard', null, 'Jeremy Levy, Jessica DiGiovanni, Jake Tillman, Marc Thompson', 'TV-Y7', 'When Bumblebee begins to suffer amnesia, his partner, Windblade, comes to the rescue, and repairs his memory chips, enabling him to rediscover his past adventures on Cybertron. Once his memories are repaired, Bumblebee gets a clue that will lead both him and Windblade to complete their current mission and save their friends, unaware that Megatron sent his Decepticon assassins to hunt them down.', 'When Bumblebee begins to suffer amnesia, his partner, Windblade, comes to the rescue, and repairs his memory chips, enabling him to rediscover his past adventures on Cybertron. Once his memories are repaired, Bumblebee gets a clue that will lead both him and Windblade to complete their current mission and save their friends, unaware that Megatron sent his Decepticon assassins to hunt them down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxgzkgFavRmKLawUR4w6MQmWmCl.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:83002'),
  ('309135975491494990', 'Transformers: EarthSpark', 2022, 'Animation, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Drama', 'Dale Malinowski, Ant Ward, Nicole Dubuc', null, 'Danny Pudi, Kathreen Khavari, Zeno Robinson, Sydney Mikayla, Zion Broadnax, Jon Jon Briones, Alan Tudyk, Rory McCann', 'TV-Y7', 'The Malto Family’s world turns upside down when the Terrans, the first Earthborn Transformers robots, spark to life. The Terrans will forge an alliance between the human Malto family and the legendary Autobots, uniting them in a shared mission.', 'The Malto Family’s world turns upside down when the Terrans, the first Earthborn Transformers robots, spark to life. The Terrans will forge an alliance between the human Malto family and the legendary Autobots, uniting them in a shared mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jLwU37QusZDkkOuFNb1TA6NQZNT.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:157747'),
  ('194840784454847432', 'Transformers: Energon', 2004, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Kids', null, null, 'Katsuyuki Konishi, Junichi Endo, Mitsuo Iwata, Kohsuke Toriumi, Nobutoshi Canna, Nobuo Tobita, Isshin Chiba, Koji Yusa', 'TV-PG', 'The show takes place ten years after the finale of Armada, opening in an age of peace on Cybertron and Earth which is destined not to last long. Energon pits the Autobots against an array of villains: the reborn Megatron , the barely functional Unicron, and the mysterious Alpha Q and his Terrorcon minions.', 'The show takes place ten years after the finale of Armada, opening in an age of peace on Cybertron and Earth which is destined not to last long. Energon pits the Autobots against an array of villains: the reborn Megatron , the barely functional Unicron, and the mysterious Alpha Q and his Terrorcon minions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNoznz2CDSWbarJ1NuT0m6zU2SP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75911'),
  ('148302792245134738', 'Transformers: Prime', 2010, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Kids', 'Roberto Orci, Alex Kurtzman, Duane Capizzi', null, 'Peter Cullen, Jeffrey Combs, Frank Welker, Tania Gunadi, Josh Keaton, Kevin Michael Richardson, Ernie Hudson, Andy Pessoa', 'TV-Y7', 'Roll out with Optimus Prime, Bumblebee, Arcee, Ratchet, Bulkhead, and the rest of the heroic Autobots as they battle the evil Decepticons. Now that big bad Megatron has returned with a mysterious and dangerous element, Team Prime must prepare for an epic battle.', 'Roll out with Optimus Prime, Bumblebee, Arcee, Ratchet, Bulkhead, and the rest of the heroic Autobots as they battle the evil Decepticons. Now that big bad Megatron has returned with a mysterious and dangerous element, Team Prime must prepare for an epic battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ilOKsGRHYc78R2tSMusAd3xGJWq.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:32910'),
  ('662367892548293505', 'Transformers: Rescue Bots', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jeff Kline, Brian Hohlfeld, Nicole Dubuc', null, 'Elan Garfias, Lacey Chabert, Steve Blum, D. C. Douglas, Imari Williams, Parvesh Cheena, Maurice LaMarche, Jason Marsden', 'TV-Y7', 'A team of specialized Autobots not quite ready for prime-time battles against the Decepticons is given a vital mission by Optimus Prime. The goal for the Bots is to learn about mankind and how to help others to find out what it really means to be a hero.', 'A team of specialized Autobots not quite ready for prime-time battles against the Decepticons is given a vital mission by Optimus Prime. The goal for the Bots is to learn about mankind and how to help others to find out what it really means to be a hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtugHPxksnORftAs7EOGK3Oy0I5.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:38881'),
  ('399191710416846006', 'Transformers: Robots in Disguise', 2000, 'Animation, Kids, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Satoshi Hashimoto, Yoichi Kobiyama, Takashi Matsuyama, Masayuki Kiyama, Chieko Higuchi, Masahiro Shibahara, Takayuki Kondo, Punch UFO', 'TV-Y7', 'Only Koji and the Autobots can save the Earth from the evil Predacons! The Predacons have been battling the Autobots for thousands of years, but this time, they''ve kidnapped the world''s greatest minds, including Dr. Onishi, a brilliant scientist. Optimus Prime, the leader of the Autobots has dispatched his troops to try to save Onishi and the others, enlisting the help of Koji, Onishi''s son. But can these heroes outwit the evil Megatron, leader of the Predacons in time to save the Earth?', 'Only Koji and the Autobots can save the Earth from the evil Predacons! The Predacons have been battling the Autobots for thousands of years, but this time, they''ve kidnapped the world''s greatest minds, including Dr. Onishi, a brilliant scientist. Optimus Prime, the leader of the Autobots has dispatched his troops to try to save Onishi and the others, enlisting the help of Koji, Onishi''s son. But can these heroes outwit the evil Megatron, leader of the Predacons in time to save the Earth?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhqNODaL2cy4mjll8RsIdXS8YXv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:20469'),
  ('302279408710373502', 'Transformers: Robots In Disguise', 2015, 'Kids, Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Will Friedle, Khary Payton, Darren Criss, Mitchell Whitfield, Constance Zimmer', 'TV-Y7', 'Years after the events of Predacons Rising, Bumblebee is summoned back to Earth to battle several of Cybertron''s most wanted Decepticons that escaped from a crashed prison ship and assembles a team of young Autobots that includes Sideswipe (a rebel "bad boy bot"), Strongarm (an Elite Guard cadet), Grimlock (a bombastic Dinobot), and Fixit (a hyperactive Mini-Con with faulty wiring).', 'Years after the events of Predacons Rising, Bumblebee is summoned back to Earth to battle several of Cybertron''s most wanted Decepticons that escaped from a crashed prison ship and assembles a team of young Autobots that includes Sideswipe (a rebel "bad boy bot"), Strongarm (an Elite Guard cadet), Grimlock (a bombastic Dinobot), and Fixit (a hyperactive Mini-Con with faulty wiring).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbRpKAGbXnASnNFHCGFC4CwVPla.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:63090'),
  ('311796020591660001', 'Transformers: The Headmasters', 1987, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Ikuya Sawaki, Tomiko Suzuki, Hideyuki Hori, Ryoichi Tanaka, Masato Hirano, Michitaka Kobayashi, Hochu Otsuka, Masaharu Sato', null, 'Following on The Return of Optimus Prime (and in place of The Rebirth), The Headmasters is the first Japanese-exclusive Transformers franchise.', 'Following on The Return of Optimus Prime (and in place of The Rebirth), The Headmasters is the first Japanese-exclusive Transformers franchise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWt6Zvej0a88KR1DiHE8P3UgEnt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19237'),
  ('145188660951251621', 'Transformers: War for Cybertron: Earthrise', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Jason Marnocha, Jake Foushee, Joe Zieja, Frank Todaro, Kaiser Johnson, Sophia Isabella, Bill Rogers', 'TV-Y7', 'While Megatron takes drastic measures to save the Decepticons, the Autobots fight to save all of Cybertron from both on the planet and aboard the Ark.', 'While Megatron takes drastic measures to save the Decepticons, the Autobots fight to save all of Cybertron from both on the planet and aboard the Ark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/63E619RuPL9EUjPzVTWCs2jUChl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117682'),
  ('290035707499892134', 'Transformers: War for Cybertron: Kingdom', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Jake Foushee, Jason Marnocha, Justin Luther, Marqus Bobesich, Joe Zieja', 'TV-Y7', 'The frantic race to locate the Allspark first culminates on a strange planet as the future comes crashing through to the present day.', 'The frantic race to locate the Allspark first culminates on a strange planet as the future comes crashing through to the present day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2IouRpN9IXMyY8RX0YnJhkCirE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128255'),
  ('760915378525180949', 'Transformers: War for Cybertron: Siege', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Jason Marnocha, Jake Foushee, Linsay Rousseau, Frank Todaro, Joe Zieja, Rafael Goldstein, Bill Rogers, Keith Silverstein', 'TV-14', 'On their dying planet, the Autobots and Decepticons battle fiercely for control of the AllSpark in the Transformers universe''s origin story.', 'On their dying planet, the Autobots and Decepticons battle fiercely for control of the AllSpark in the Transformers universe''s origin story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBUPQLk9gEg8Mg6noHcew8Aag0M.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100617'),
  ('1040298982070218576', 'Transit Girls', 2015, 'Drama', null, null, 'Sairi Ito, Yui Sakuma, Kentaro Ito, Ai Yoshikawa, Erena Watanabe, Reika Kirishima, Shogen', null, 'High School student Sayuri is falling in love with Yui, the daughter of her father''s fiancee.', 'High School student Sayuri is falling in love with Yui, the daughter of her father''s fiancee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qmQqRCHIdlQvnbFG3xh4OnkznVJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78749'),
  ('864173102529735202', 'Transparent', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Joey Soloway', null, 'Gaby Hoffmann, Amy Landecker, Judith Light, Jay Duplass', 'TV-MA', 'An LA family with serious boundary issues have their past and future unravel when a dramatic admission causes everyone''s secrets to spill out.', 'An LA family with serious boundary issues have their past and future unravel when a dramatic admission causes everyone''s secrets to spill out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrLzehvZpm5osA4MlMR41gYayWZ.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:61406'),
  ('620222780120109448', 'Transplant', 2020, 'Drama', 'Joseph Kay', null, 'Hamza Haq, Laurence Leboeuf, Ayisha Issa, Jim Watson', 'TV-14', 'Dr. Bashir Hamed, a Syrian doctor with battle-tested skills in emergency medicine, makes the difficult decision to flee his country and build a new life in Canada with his younger sister Amira. Bash works to navigate a new environment after earning a coveted residency in the Emergency Department of one of the best hospitals in Toronto, York Memorial.', 'Dr. Bashir Hamed, a Syrian doctor with battle-tested skills in emergency medicine, makes the difficult decision to flee his country and build a new life in Canada with his younger sister Amira. Bash works to navigate a new environment after earning a coveted residency in the Emergency Department of one of the best hospitals in Toronto, York Memorial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ukvqJZI0XctnLst0CTE2r0AC2eu.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:99530'),
  ('581329256621015762', 'Transporter: The Series', 2013, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Robert Mark Kamen, Luc Besson', null, 'Chris Vance, Violante Placido, Mark Rendall', 'TV-14', 'The adventures of professional transporter Frank Martin, who can always be counted on to get the job done—discreetly. Operating in a seedy underworld of dangerous criminals and desperate players, his three rules are: Never change the deal, no names, and never open the package. Occasionally, complications arise and rules get broken.', 'The adventures of professional transporter Frank Martin, who can always be counted on to get the job done—discreetly. Operating in a seedy underworld of dangerous criminals and desperate players, his three rules are: Never change the deal, no names, and never open the package. Occasionally, complications arise and rules get broken.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23ESZ6mTcJw8zHOkW4G38uIz147.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:39497'),
  ('1103821607691531414', 'Trap', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Eylem Canpolat, Ayşenur Sıkı, Ali Yörükoğlu', 'Akin Akinözü, Bensu Soral, Talat Bulut, Rıza Kocaoğlu, Yağız Can Konyalı, Gamze Süner Atay, Naz Göktan, Emir Benderlioğlu', null, 'Tuzak tells the story of three siblings Mahir, Umut and Umay whose springs of life were taken from them. Who is bad, who is real, who is fake? In such a mixed-up world, three siblings Umut, Mahir and Umay who came together for a common purpose, find out that they don’t have the bond they thought they had. On the other hand, Güneş, Güven and Mete are the siblings, each one of whom believed that their father’s approval and their comfortable lives were more important than each other. Umut, as he is taking revenge from this family he hates, he goes through his biggest conflict thanks to Güneş, the girl whom he believes to be the love of his life with each passing day. Güneş doesn’t know the real identity and purpose of Umut whom she knows as a dirty lawyer Çınar Yılmaz. She will entrust her family’s and her own future to this man whom she falls in love with...', 'Tuzak tells the story of three siblings Mahir, Umut and Umay whose springs of life were taken from them. Who is bad, who is real, who is fake? In such a mixed-up world, three siblings Umut, Mahir and Umay who came together for a common purpose, find out that they don’t have the bond they thought they had. On the other hand, Güneş, Güven and Mete are the siblings, each one of whom believed that their father’s approval and their comfortable lives were more important than each other. Umut, as he is taking revenge from this family he hates, he goes through his biggest conflict thanks to Güneş, the girl whom he believes to be the love of his life with each passing day. Güneş doesn’t know the real identity and purpose of Umut whom she knows as a dirty lawyer Çınar Yılmaz. She will entrust her family’s and her own future to this man whom she falls in love with...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IHX7A7tMc2hAET8Oy7DRdglfOz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:212799'),
  ('169896630376863281', 'Trapp Family Story', 1991, 'Animation, Drama, Family', null, null, 'Masako Katsuki, Hiromi Ishikawa, Junko Hagimori, Kyoko Irokawa, Maria Kawamura, Masato Hirano, Naoko Watanabe, Saori Sugimoto', 'NR', 'Trapp Family Story is a Japanese anime series by Nippon Animation. It was based on the memoir The Story of the Trapp Family Singers by Maria von Trapp, which has also inspired the world famous musical The Sound of Music. While many things were changed from the original story, unlike other adaptations such as The Sound of Music, the children''s names are all correct in this version.', 'Trapp Family Story is a Japanese anime series by Nippon Animation. It was based on the memoir The Story of the Trapp Family Singers by Maria von Trapp, which has also inspired the world famous musical The Sound of Music. While many things were changed from the original story, unlike other adaptations such as The Sound of Music, the children''s names are all correct in this version.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mr2O0tb98PIFVTToXi9hUKO4Ozi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43938'),
  ('263965683459076262', 'Trapped', 2015, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Baltasar Kormákur', null, 'Ólafur Darri Ólafsson, Ilmur Kristjánsdóttir, Björn Hlynur Haraldsson, Kara Ingudóttir', 'TV-14', 'The body of a murder victim turns up in a small Icelandic village just as a major snowstorm cuts the region off from the rest of the world.', 'The body of a murder victim turns up in a small Icelandic village just as a major snowstorm cuts the region off from the rest of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bTpSWcEqeTXH7Ipr2XUfGW36n02.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:64852'),
  ('122913769624988859', 'Trapped in a Dating Sim: The World of Otome Games Is Tough for Mobs', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Takeo Otsuka, Kana Ichinose, Fairouz Ai, Ayane Sakura, Kenichi Suzumura, Kohsuke Toriumi, Shinnosuke Tachibana, Koji Yusa', 'TV-14', 'An ordinary office worker is reincarnated as Leon into a particularly punishing dating sim video game, where women reign supreme and only beautiful men have a seat at the table. But Leon has a secret weapon: he remembers everything from his past life, which includes a complete playthrough of the very game in which he is now trapped. Watch Leon spark a revolution to change this new world in order to fulfill his ultimate desire...of living a quiet, easy life in the countryside!', 'An ordinary office worker is reincarnated as Leon into a particularly punishing dating sim video game, where women reign supreme and only beautiful men have a seat at the table. But Leon has a secret weapon: he remembers everything from his past life, which includes a complete playthrough of the very game in which he is now trapped. Watch Leon spark a revolution to change this new world in order to fulfill his ultimate desire...of living a quiet, easy life in the countryside!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8AhHtqY4yPquNrprkVbzUKw8kRh.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:139512'),
  ('379055583333018435', 'Trapper John, M.D.', 1979, 'Drama', 'Don Brinkley, Frank Glicksman', null, 'Pernell Roberts, Gregory Harrison, Madge Sinclair, Charles Siebert, Brian Stokes Mitchell, Timothy Busfield, Lorna Luft, Kip Gilman', null, 'Trapper John, M.D. is an American television medical drama and spin-off of the film MASH, concerning a lovable doctor who became a mentor and father figure in San Francisco, California. The show ran on CBS from September 23, 1979, to September 4, 1986.', 'Trapper John, M.D. is an American television medical drama and spin-off of the film MASH, concerning a lovable doctor who became a mentor and father figure in San Francisco, California. The show ran on CBS from September 23, 1979, to September 4, 1986.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUqIscf4OwAs061JVDh3wdNRye9.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:1039'),
  ('681831796719446965', 'Traqueur de chars', 2025, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, 'Michel Gaucher', null, 'With the help of his team, bailiff Michel Gaucher conducts investigations to recover stolen or fraudulently acquired vehicles.', 'With the help of his team, bailiff Michel Gaucher conducts investigations to recover stolen or fraudulently acquired vehicles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpv4JVT03rpriq1TqQRSH6QHJc1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:288814'),
  ('545465610549338419', 'Trauma', 2009, 'Drama', 'Dario Scardapane', null, 'Cliff Curtis, Derek Luke, Anastasia Griffith, Aimee Garcia, Kevin Rankin, Taylor Kinney, Carl Marino, Jamey Sheridan', 'TV-14', 'When emergencies occur, the trauma team from San Francisco City Hospital is first on the scene, traveling by land, by sea or by air to reach their victims in time. From the heights of the city''s Transamerica Pyramid to the depths of the San Francisco Bay, these heroes must face the most extreme conditions to save lives, and give meaning to their own existence in the process.', 'When emergencies occur, the trauma team from San Francisco City Hospital is first on the scene, traveling by land, by sea or by air to reach their victims in time. From the heights of the city''s Transamerica Pyramid to the depths of the San Francisco Bay, these heroes must face the most extreme conditions to save lives, and give meaning to their own existence in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fiFgeu9Sxsq31WYWHaKcgSvSU1P.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:18415'),
  ('163453497213841079', 'Trauma', 2018, 'Drama', 'Mike Bartlett', 'Mike Bartlett', 'Adrian Lester, John Simm, Lyndsey Marshal, Rowena King, Jade Anouka, Jemima Rooper, India Lewis, Albie Marber', 'TV-14', 'A three-part drama set in the trauma unit of a London hospital, a grieving father blames a high-achieving trauma consultant for the death of his teenage son.', 'A three-part drama set in the trauma unit of a London hospital, a grieving father blames a high-achieving trauma consultant for the death of his teenage son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/igdmYGPhD9HS9i405NKvuxRJPyl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77059'),
  ('774501059602170698', 'Travel Man: 48 Hours in...', 2015, 'Comedy, Documentary', null, null, 'Joe Lycett', null, 'British comedian Richard Ayoade (later taken over by Joe Lycett), accompanied by a celebrity guest, takes a ruthlessly efficient approach to travel, covering everything top tourist destinations have to offer in just 48 hours.', 'British comedian Richard Ayoade (later taken over by Joe Lycett), accompanied by a celebrity guest, takes a ruthlessly efficient approach to travel, covering everything top tourist destinations have to offer in just 48 hours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wc8KXKJDqvveO7bplrHHTRMO14B.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:62247'),
  ('874592874928768621', 'Traveler', 2007, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'David DiGilio', null, 'Matt Bomer, Logan Marshall-Green, Aaron Stanford, Anthony Ruivivar, Pascale Hutton, Viola Davis, Steven Culp, William Sadler', null, 'Jay, Tyler and Will are friends who have spent the last two years in grad school. A simple prank to rollerblade through one of New York City''s most famous museums makes Jay and Tyler prime suspects in a terrorist bombing. They''re unable to turn to authorities when they realize they can''t prove Will even exists. In every photo from the past two years, he has managed to block his face. Who will believe them?', 'Jay, Tyler and Will are friends who have spent the last two years in grad school. A simple prank to rollerblade through one of New York City''s most famous museums makes Jay and Tyler prime suspects in a terrorist bombing. They''re unable to turn to authorities when they realize they can''t prove Will even exists. In every photo from the past two years, he has managed to block his face. Who will believe them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wUHt1W2yNmobzTWaiM7OCZ1mWXh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1945'),
  ('390760201171250190', 'Travelers', 2016, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Brad Wright', null, 'Eric McCormack, MacKenzie Porter, Nesta Cooper, Jared Abrahamson, Reilly Dolman, Patrick Gilmore', 'TV-MA', 'Hundreds of years from now, the last surviving humans discover the means of sending consciousness back through time, directly into people in the 21st century. These "travelers" assume the lives of seemingly random people, while secretly working as teams to perform missions in order to save humanity from a terrible future.', 'Hundreds of years from now, the last surviving humans discover the means of sending consciousness back through time, directly into people in the 21st century. These "travelers" assume the lives of seemingly random people, while secretly working as teams to perform missions in order to save humanity from a terrible future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUVeyeyTrQrSFuUkqLCT8FtV7pp.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:67683'),
  ('43873073284295185', 'Travelers (2016)', 2016, 'Drama, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action', 'Pat Smith, Ashley Park, Jason Whiting, Brad Wright, Ken Kabatoff', 'Pat Smith, Ashley Park, Jason Whiting, Brad Wright, Ken Kabatoff, S.B. Edwards, Gillian Muller, Rebecca Hales, Amanda Smith-Kolic, Tara Armstrong, Mika Collins', 'MacKenzie Porter, Nesta Cooper, Jared Abrahamson, Reilly Dolman, Patrick Gilmore', 'TV-MA', 'Hundreds of years from now, the last surviving humans discover the means of sending consciousness back through time, directly into people in the 21st century. These "travelers" assume the lives of seemingly random people, while secretly working as teams to perform missions in order to save humanity from a terrible future.', 'Hundreds of years from now, the last surviving humans discover the means of sending consciousness back through time, directly into people in the 21st century. These "travelers" assume the lives of seemingly random people, while secretly working as teams to perform missions in order to save humanity from a terrible future.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FaUVeyeyTrQrSFuUkqLCT8FtV7pp.jpg', 3, 'plex:tv:travelers-2016'),
  ('163377341735621779', 'Treadstone', 2019, 'Action & Adventure', 'Tim Kring', null, 'Jeremy Irvine, Brian J. Smith, Omar Metwally, Han Hyo-joo, Tracy Ifeachor, Gabrielle Scharnitzky, Emilia Schüle, Michelle Forbes', 'TV-MA', 'The Treadstone project, having created super spy Jason Bourne, turns its attention on a new protocol to develop unstoppable superhuman assassins.', 'The Treadstone project, having created super spy Jason Bourne, turns its attention on a new protocol to develop unstoppable superhuman assassins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tzoxJjPSgsPCepWgpl4LWjCKise.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83949'),
  ('805308245655070814', 'Treason', 2022, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Matt Charman', null, 'Charlie Cox, Olga Kurylenko, Oona Chaplin, Ciarán Hinds', 'TV-MA', 'An MI6 deputy''s bright future takes a sharp turn after a reunion with a Russian spy forces him to question his entire life.', 'An MI6 deputy''s bright future takes a sharp turn after a reunion with a Russian spy forces him to question his entire life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4CmYS7nD4K8ROoUeoZZmUBWKul.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157080'),
  ('28304331615763835', 'Treasure Island', 1978, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', null, null, 'Akio Nojima, Iemasa Kayumi, Junpei Takiguchi, Shozo Iizuka, Akira Kamiya, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Mitsuo Senda, Rihoko Yoshida', null, 'Jim Hawkins is a young boy lead by progressive events to embark on a search journey for the legendary treasure of the once dreaded pirate, Captain Flint. On their way to Treasure Island, John Silver, Jim''s best friend, take over command of the ship revealing his true self as the ruthless pirate who once was the right hand of Flint himself. Feeling betrayed, Jim now has to deal with his mixed feelings and face Silver who still consider himself and Jim as friends.', 'Jim Hawkins is a young boy lead by progressive events to embark on a search journey for the legendary treasure of the once dreaded pirate, Captain Flint. On their way to Treasure Island, John Silver, Jim''s best friend, take over command of the ship revealing his true self as the ruthless pirate who once was the right hand of Flint himself. Feeling betrayed, Jim now has to deal with his mixed feelings and face Silver who still consider himself and Jim as friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oppcDycVry07Y0M9983aBall7hr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:23956'),
  ('280290502942429831', 'Treasure Island', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Steve Barron', 'Stewart Harcourt', 'Eddie Izzard, Elijah Wood, Philip Glenister, Rupert Penry-Jones, Toby Regbo, Daniel Mays, Reda Kateb, Donald Sutherland', 'TV-PG', 'In this two-part miniseries adaptation of the classic adventure novel, young Jim Hawkins is the only one who can direct a schooner to an island known for buried treasure. But aboard the ship is a mysterious man whose true motives challenge Jim''s trust in the entire crew.', 'In this two-part miniseries adaptation of the classic adventure novel, young Jim Hawkins is the only one who can direct a schooner to an island known for buried treasure. But aboard the ship is a mysterious man whose true motives challenge Jim''s trust in the entire crew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/94HhCCbzl3ZVVUVZGlUNYKkzoW4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43065'),
  ('1117784575126074076', 'Treasure Quest: Snake Island', 2015, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'Hidden somewhere off the southeastern coast of Brazil could lie hundreds of millions of dollars-worth of lost Incan gold. One team of treasure hunters has a new theory on where the treasure lies - a remote spot home to 1,000s of deadly vipers.', 'Hidden somewhere off the southeastern coast of Brazil could lie hundreds of millions of dollars-worth of lost Incan gold. One team of treasure hunters has a new theory on where the treasure lies - a remote spot home to 1,000s of deadly vipers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/viQ7UOa0aZMqxf2vveflkqPJBSM.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:63555'),
  ('173025446458771046', 'Tree with Deep Roots', 2011, 'Drama', 'Kim Young-hyun, Jang Tae-yoo, Sang-yeon Park', 'Sang-yeon Park, Kim Young-hyun', 'Han Suk-kyu, Jang Hyuk, Shin Sae-kyeong, Lee Soo-hyuk, Cho Jin-woong, Seo Jun-young, Yoon Je-moon, Baek Yoon-sik', null, 'Deep Rooted Tree is a 2011 South Korean television series starring Jang Hyuk, Shin Se-kyung and Han Suk-kyu. Based on the novel of the same title by Lee Jeong-myeong, it aired on SBS from October 5 to December 22, 2011 on Wednesdays and Thursdays at 21:55 for 24 episodes. Taking its name from the poem Yongbieocheonga that says that trees with deep roots do not sway, the series tells the story of a royal guard investigating a case involving the serial murders of Jiphyeonjeon scholars in Gyeongbok Palace while King Sejong comes to create the Korean written language.', 'Deep Rooted Tree is a 2011 South Korean television series starring Jang Hyuk, Shin Se-kyung and Han Suk-kyu. Based on the novel of the same title by Lee Jeong-myeong, it aired on SBS from October 5 to December 22, 2011 on Wednesdays and Thursdays at 21:55 for 24 episodes. Taking its name from the poem Yongbieocheonga that says that trees with deep roots do not sway, the series tells the story of a royal guard investigating a case involving the serial murders of Jiphyeonjeon scholars in Gyeongbok Palace while King Sejong comes to create the Korean written language.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cBM4HLNMQs1UBrORf3T3tfEtuHz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:41652'),
  ('593562849110166289', 'Treehouse Masters', 2013, 'Reality', null, null, 'Pete Nelson', 'TV-PG', 'People who know and work with Pete Nelson describe him as a tree whisperer. For his part, Nelson lets the trees do the talking. He''s a world-renowned treehouse designer and builder, and this series documents the work he and his team of craftsmen—including his son Charlie—do to create incredible homes and businesses in nature''s canopy. Pete uses a combination of science and art to realize clients'' sky-high aspirations of magnificent multi-bedroom treehouses with elaborate kitchens and bathrooms, or simpler, peaceful one-room escapes. Other backyard escapes featured in the series include a spa retreat, a brewery, and a honeymoon suite. "We awaken that inner child who dreams of living among the trees," Pete says.', 'People who know and work with Pete Nelson describe him as a tree whisperer. For his part, Nelson lets the trees do the talking. He''s a world-renowned treehouse designer and builder, and this series documents the work he and his team of craftsmen—including his son Charlie—do to create incredible homes and businesses in nature''s canopy. Pete uses a combination of science and art to realize clients'' sky-high aspirations of magnificent multi-bedroom treehouses with elaborate kitchens and bathrooms, or simpler, peaceful one-room escapes. Other backyard escapes featured in the series include a spa retreat, a brewery, and a honeymoon suite. "We awaken that inner child who dreams of living among the trees," Pete says.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbt70N1mEHD8wRmFJX1lc6sNhXR.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:49474'),
  ('294407283103026732', 'Treme', 2010, 'Drama', 'David Simon, Eric Overmyer', null, 'Khandi Alexander, Rob Brown, Chris Coy, Kim Dickens, India Ennenga, Michiel Huisman, Melissa Leo, Lucia Micarelli', 'TV-MA', 'Tremé takes its name from a neighborhood of New Orleans and portrays life in the aftermath of the 2005 hurricane. Beginning three months after Hurricane Katrina, the residents of New Orleans, including musicians, chefs, Mardi Gras Indians, and other New Orleanians struggle to rebuild their lives, their homes and their unique culture.', 'Tremé takes its name from a neighborhood of New Orleans and portrays life in the aftermath of the 2005 hurricane. Beginning three months after Hurricane Katrina, the residents of New Orleans, including musicians, chefs, Mardi Gras Indians, and other New Orleanians struggle to rebuild their lives, their homes and their unique culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4pV1FUccFmmbz9DwUON7KWT0gi.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:17967'),
  ('818655864483330419', 'Tremembé', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Vera Egito, Daniel Lieff, Ullisses Campbell', null, 'Marina Ruy Barbosa, Carol Garcia, Letícia Rodrigues, Bianca Comparato, Felipe Simas, Kelner Macêdo, Anselmo Vasconcelos, Lucas Oradovschi', 'TV-MA', 'The arrival of Suzane Von Richthofen shakes Tremembé''s order, sparking a power struggle with Elize Matsunaga. Jatobá seeks protection, while Nardoni, the Cravinhos brothers, Roger A. and others face internal clashes and defy the system.', 'The arrival of Suzane Von Richthofen shakes Tremembé''s order, sparking a power struggle with Elize Matsunaga. Jatobá seeks protection, while Nardoni, the Cravinhos brothers, Roger A. and others face internal clashes and defy the system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVqBFACBpovk0sEtjx3HEb3jOYS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:279013'),
  ('375927876246178410', 'Tremors', 2003, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'S.S. Wilson, Brent Maddock', null, 'Michael Gross, Lela Lee, J.D. Walsh, Marcia Strassman, Dean Norris, Gladise Jimenez, Victor Browne', 'TV-14', 'Inspired by the cult classic Tremors movies, locals attempt to coexist with the monstrous, man-eating Graboids, Shriekers, and Ass-blasters, which are now on a "protected species" list.', 'Inspired by the cult classic Tremors movies, locals attempt to coexist with the monstrous, man-eating Graboids, Shriekers, and Ass-blasters, which are now on a "protected species" list.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJXjZ3OgU8v0HKUPbHk1DZUW3m9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4372'),
  ('69494256547792149', 'Trepalium', 2016, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Antarès Bassis, Sophie Hiet', null, 'Léonie Simaga, Pierre Deladonchamps, Ronit Elkabetz, Aurélien Recoing, Lubna Azabal, Charles Berling, Olivier Rabourdin, Némo Schiffman', 'NR', 'The economic situation is a nightmare: only 20% of the population is employed. The Actives live inside the city. On the fringes, in the Zone, live the Jobless. Separating them is a wall.', 'The economic situation is a nightmare: only 20% of the population is employed. The Actives live inside the city. On the fringes, in the Zone, live the Jobless. Separating them is a wall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRvBDs1x3gh42KX4fxogLNVG1yO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65529'),
  ('1048349376829045751', 'Tres Caínes', 2013, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, War & Politics', 'Gustavo Bolívar', 'Gustavo Bolívar, Yesmer Uribe', 'Julián Román, Elkin Díaz, Gregorio Pernía, Luis Fernando Múnera, Luz Stella Luengas, Eileen Moreno, Alexander Gil, Juliana Posso', 'NR', 'The story follows the Castaño Gil family, a prosperous cattle ranching family marked by the kidnapping and murder of patriarch José Castaño by the guerrilla. This event triggers the decision of brothers Fidel, Vicente, and Carlos to form a self-defense army to fight the guerrillas, intensifying the armed conflict in Colombia. However, what seemed like a unified struggle is threatened by betrayal.', 'The story follows the Castaño Gil family, a prosperous cattle ranching family marked by the kidnapping and murder of patriarch José Castaño by the guerrilla. This event triggers the decision of brothers Fidel, Vicente, and Carlos to form a self-defense army to fight the guerrillas, intensifying the armed conflict in Colombia. However, what seemed like a unified struggle is threatened by betrayal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6HFR8DvCS2nlm2FYQy9gGpGrBB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:58457'),
  ('396915306153939324', 'Tres milagros', 2018, 'Drama', null, 'Miguel Otero Silva, Luz Mariela Santofimio, Carlos Duplat Sanjuan', 'Marcela Guirado, Fátima Molina', 'TV-14', 'The series follows the lives of three young people who end up joining their destinies thanks to a prophecy, the prophecy says: "The day that Milagros meets Milagros and Milagros, Milagros and the love of Milagros, They will die". On September 18, 1985 there is a birth of three girls who are baptized with the same name. Catemaco''s jaguar manages to see the connection between the three girls. and to his own sorrow he anticipates a prophecy. What will make the three girls start their lives and both fall in love with the same man, but only one of them will die.', 'The series follows the lives of three young people who end up joining their destinies thanks to a prophecy, the prophecy says: "The day that Milagros meets Milagros and Milagros, Milagros and the love of Milagros, They will die". On September 18, 1985 there is a birth of three girls who are baptized with the same name. Catemaco''s jaguar manages to see the connection between the three girls. and to his own sorrow he anticipates a prophecy. What will make the three girls start their lives and both fall in love with the same man, but only one of them will die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dE3k1uOAncEdaIA6Gtx82JFzI3p.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78314'),
  ('844764121024211504', 'Tres Milagros', 2011, 'Crime, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Carlos Duplat Sanjuan', null, 'Andres Sandoval, Angélica Blandón, Johana Bahamon, Farina Paucafranco', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/isXdfgHH90ZPEwwjuRMsBTXaAbI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218599'),
  ('935152432793491809', 'Trese', 2021, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Crime', null, null, 'Shay Mitchell, Carlos Alazraqui, Eric Bauza, Steve Blum, Jon Jon Briones, Matthew Yang King, Griffin Puatu', 'TV-MA', 'In Manila, where dark supernatural forces pervade the criminal underworld, it’s up to Alexandra Trese to keep the peace — but there’s a storm brewing.', 'In Manila, where dark supernatural forces pervade the criminal underworld, it’s up to Alexandra Trese to keep the peace — but there’s a storm brewing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNYPSo9nhrLyy453s5SsC0MCTuz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94924'),
  ('687592385971739674', 'Trespasses', 2025, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Louise Kennedy', null, 'Gillian Anderson, Lola Petticrew, Tom Cullen, Martin McCann, Emily Taaffe, Conlaoch Gough-Cunningham, Andrew Porter, Daithí Ó Haragáin', null, 'When young Catholic teacher Cushla falls for a married Protestant man, their secret passion ignites a dangerous love that defies the Troubles divide.', 'When young Catholic teacher Cushla falls for a married Protestant man, their secret passion ignites a dangerous love that defies the Troubles divide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ucwjasSOz2pr4TsRycK7Muegsh2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:260650'),
