  ('883167317812500846', 'True Lies', 2023, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Matt Nix', 'Didier Kaminka, James Cameron, Claude Zidi', 'Steve Howey, Ginger Gonzaga, Mike O''Gorman, Erica Hernandez, Annabella Didion, Lucas Jaye, Omar Benson Miller', 'TV-PG', 'Shocked to discover that her bland and unremarkable computer consultant husband is a skilled international spy, an unfulfilled suburban housewife is propelled into a life of danger and adventure when she''s recruited to work alongside him to save the world as they try to revitalize their passionless marriage.', 'Shocked to discover that her bland and unremarkable computer consultant husband is a skilled international spy, an unfulfilled suburban housewife is propelled into a life of danger and adventure when she''s recruited to work alongside him to save the world as they try to revitalize their passionless marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lTnVIuHiXPnFALOSBQWUOkSR8Ya.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:202099'),
  ('1127363936669709628', 'True Love', 2012, 'Drama', null, 'Dominic Savage', null, null, 'A five-part series of intertwining, semi-improvised love stories exploring the reality of love in the modern world.', 'A five-part series of intertwining, semi-improvised love stories exploring the reality of love in the modern world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzSZES4c7xKzgmJP6Eu7r0ilvH6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44583'),
  ('929283098604190604', 'True Love is Delicious', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sumith Thiangtrongjith', null, 'Chawitkan Vorarojyothin, Patsita Athianantasak, Paul de Bodt, Nita Nikita Kannaket, Pitipon Porntrisat, Gatesara Watthanasang', null, 'Chomjan is a prickle-fish vendor who sells her pickled fish using her family''s secret recipe in order to support her sister, Methinee, study abroad. Her main helper is Gloy, an orphan who loves her like a sister. When Methinee returns, she brings along a boyfriend who is unaware of her true lifestyle. Ashamed of her life and poverty, Methinee asks Chomjan to lie about her occupation in order to not embarrass Methinee in front of her boyfriend and his family. A request which brings Chomjan a lot of sadness.', 'Chomjan is a prickle-fish vendor who sells her pickled fish using her family''s secret recipe in order to support her sister, Methinee, study abroad. Her main helper is Gloy, an orphan who loves her like a sister. When Methinee returns, she brings along a boyfriend who is unaware of her true lifestyle. Ashamed of her life and poverty, Methinee asks Chomjan to lie about her occupation in order to not embarrass Methinee in front of her boyfriend and his family. A request which brings Chomjan a lot of sadness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNsUxX1p8Ofbb8GHzE5sdzk1BNz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:221034'),
