  ('950353601654726676', 'Truelove', 2024, 'Drama', 'Charlie Covell, Iain Weatherby', 'Charlie Covell', 'Lindsay Duncan, Clarke Peters, Fiona Button, Phil Davis, Peter Egan, Sue Johnston, Kiran Sonia Sawar, Sandra James-Young', null, 'A group of old friends reunited at a funeral make a drunken pact. Rather than let each other suffer a slow and painful decline they would engineer a dignified death. But what starts out as a fanciful idea soon morphs into shocking reality.', 'A group of old friends reunited at a funeral make a drunken pact. Rather than let each other suffer a slow and painful decline they would engineer a dignified death. But what starts out as a fanciful idea soon morphs into shocking reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwuYkLlW6ZYQHrZfHmjf9TvZ1iZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218353'),
