  ('1041699984649768882', 'Tyrant', 2014, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Gideon Raff', null, 'Adam Rayner, Jennifer Finnigan, Moran Atias, Ashraf Barhom, Noah Silver, Anne Winters, Sibylla Deen, Waleed Elgadi', 'TV-MA', 'The story of an unassuming American family drawn into the workings of a turbulent Middle Eastern nation. Bassam "Barry" Al Fayeed, the younger son of the dictator of a war-torn nation, ends a self-imposed 20-year exile to return to his homeland, accompanied by his American wife and children, for his nephew''s wedding. Barry’s reluctant homecoming leads to a dramatic clash of cultures as he is thrown back into the familial and national politics of his youth.', 'The story of an unassuming American family drawn into the workings of a turbulent Middle Eastern nation. Bassam "Barry" Al Fayeed, the younger son of the dictator of a war-torn nation, ends a self-imposed 20-year exile to return to his homeland, accompanied by his American wife and children, for his nephew''s wedding. Barry’s reluctant homecoming leads to a dramatic clash of cultures as he is thrown back into the familial and national politics of his youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14xKxbF3Si8m5u0m5yPj9ZGlEkj.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:60972'),
