  ('1112575956139174056', 'Uglymug, Epicfighter', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Junichi Suwabe, Konomi Inagaki, Kento Shiraishi, Maaya Uchida', 'TV-14', 'After a false accusation, Shigeru Yoshioka becomes an unemployed recluse. By choosing to remain ugly in another world, Shigeru gains higher status. He begins his second life as an absolute god with cheat-level stats. At first, Shigeru tags along with Seika, Seiji, and Leeds, but due to a weakness caused by direct contact with a girl, he considers breaking away from the party. However…', 'After a false accusation, Shigeru Yoshioka becomes an unemployed recluse. By choosing to remain ugly in another world, Shigeru gains higher status. He begins his second life as an absolute god with cheat-level stats. At first, Shigeru tags along with Seika, Seiji, and Leeds, but due to a weakness caused by direct contact with a girl, he considers breaking away from the party. However…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6lYZ29Y4lBpod50gBz1OndQFqx0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:286434'),
  ('323545022288365698', 'Ulice', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Radek Bajgar, Dušan Klein, Petr Erben', null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Ulice is a Czech soap opera produced and broadcast by Nova. In the Czech language Ulice means street. The show describes the lives of the Farský, Jordán, Boháč, Nikl, and Liška families and many other people that live in Prague. Their daily battle against real problems of living in a modern world like divorce, love, betrayal and illness or disease. Ulice often shows crime.', 'Ulice is a Czech soap opera produced and broadcast by Nova. In the Czech language Ulice means street. The show describes the lives of the Farský, Jordán, Boháč, Nikl, and Liška families and many other people that live in Prague. Their daily battle against real problems of living in a modern world like divorce, love, betrayal and illness or disease. Ulice often shows crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFEHva8Csx18hMGJJZ6gi4sFSKR.jpg', 22, 'tmdb:tv:36361'),
  ('558326006631993264', 'Ultimate Beastmaster', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Reality', 'Sylvester Stallone, Dave Broome', null, null, 'TV-PG', 'In this intense obstacle course series, elite athletes from the U.S. and other countries compete for cash prizes, individual glory and national pride.', 'In this intense obstacle course series, elite athletes from the U.S. and other countries compete for cash prizes, individual glory and national pride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fTyEg49HD4ekxdgYtcIL9pw2gfB.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:69886'),
  ('1097412168504039091', 'Ultimate Expedition', 2018, 'Reality', null, null, 'Chuck Liddell, Alia Shelesh, Jus Reign, Chachi Hildén, Steve-O, Gus Kenworthy, Nikki Baker, Jukka Hildén', 'TV-14', 'Nine strangers are brought together to summit a 20,000-foot mountain in the Peruvian Andes. With each step, these novice climbers will push themselves to their limits and beyond.', 'Nine strangers are brought together to summit a 20,000-foot mountain in the Peruvian Andes. With each step, these novice climbers will push themselves to their limits and beyond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AgdbDxbMKuvoWQhLiqLjUl4gLkg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77361'),
  ('232529164271297623', 'Ultimate Factories', 2006, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Ultimate Factories also known as Megafactories is an American documentary television series that premiered in 2006 on the National Geographic Channel. The program explores the inner workings of factories worldwide. Each episode profiles the machinery and manpower behind each factory''s main product, featuring close-ups, breakdowns, interviews, and side stories to show the sequence of events to produce the product in the factory. Hoff Productions was one of the principal producers of this highly successful series. It also airs in non-US markets as Megafactories.', 'Ultimate Factories also known as Megafactories is an American documentary television series that premiered in 2006 on the National Geographic Channel. The program explores the inner workings of factories worldwide. Each episode profiles the machinery and manpower behind each factory''s main product, featuring close-ups, breakdowns, interviews, and side stories to show the sequence of events to produce the product in the factory. Hoff Productions was one of the principal producers of this highly successful series. It also airs in non-US markets as Megafactories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mkAIa0mMowtKZFrh8wSHIqNZb56.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:5347'),
  ('573710664948268137', 'Ultimate Force', 2002, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, War & Politics', 'Chris Ryan, Rob Heyland', null, 'Ross Kemp, Miles Anderson, Christopher Fox, Alex Reid, Danny Sapani, Elliot Cowan, Heather Peace, Liam Garrigan', null, 'This covert combat series focuses on the Red Troop, an elite group of soldiers from the British military''s Special Air Service group.', 'This covert combat series focuses on the Red Troop, an elite group of soldiers from the British military''s Special Air Service group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/616qGkxSeZBAX5t1fIO7h6WY2Ec.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:347'),
  ('491773305899111928', 'Ultimate Muscle: The Kinnikuman Legacy', 2002, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Konami Yoshida, Masaya Onosaka, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Takumi Yamazaki, Yasunori Masutani, Ai Nonaka, Fumiko Orikasa, Hideyuki Tanaka', 'TV-Y7', 'Ultimate Muscle: The Kinnikuman Legacy, known in Japan as Kinnikuman II sei, is a manga and anime series made by Yoshinori Nakai and Takashi Shimada under the pen name Yudetamago. It is the sequel to the hit manga Kinnikuman that they started in 1979. The toy line of Kinnikuman was released in North America as M.U.S.C.L.E.. The name of Ultimate Muscle was chosen to connect the Americanized storyline of the M.U.S.C.L.E. toyline of the 1980s into the anime. Bandai also produced intermittently distributed toy tie-ins during the initial run of Ultimate Muscle.', 'Ultimate Muscle: The Kinnikuman Legacy, known in Japan as Kinnikuman II sei, is a manga and anime series made by Yoshinori Nakai and Takashi Shimada under the pen name Yudetamago. It is the sequel to the hit manga Kinnikuman that they started in 1979. The toy line of Kinnikuman was released in North America as M.U.S.C.L.E.. The name of Ultimate Muscle was chosen to connect the Americanized storyline of the M.U.S.C.L.E. toyline of the 1980s into the anime. Bandai also produced intermittently distributed toy tie-ins during the initial run of Ultimate Muscle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oONgggpDToiOQgCDY4NCyHFK6yv.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:9550'),
  ('790511355574692822', 'Ultimate Note', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery', null, 'Kennedy Xu', 'Joseph Zeng, Xiao Yuliang, Hani Kyzy, Liu Yuning, Fan Ming, Wang Jinsong, Liu Yuhan, Cheng Fangxu', null, 'The story focuses on Wu Xie who was born in a family of tomb explorers trying to find the secrets of a mysterious event decades ago with his friends.', 'The story focuses on Wu Xie who was born in a family of tomb explorers trying to find the secrets of a mysterious event decades ago with his friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8OLrzB2zw9fIjuqekFRWGSru4za.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114497'),
  ('542244284488378315', 'Ultimate Otaku Teacher', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Suzuko Mimori, Hiroshi Kamiya, Rena Matsui, Aki Toyosaki, Ayane Sakura, Sora Amamiya, Azusa Tadokoro, Yoshimasa Hosoya', 'TV-14', 'Kagami Junichirou was known as a physics genius when he was a teenager, and he was even published in "Nature." However, after college, he suddenly lost all interest in science. As a NEET, he''s devoted himself to his anime blog and nerdy collecting habits. He claims he has a serious illness called "I can''t do anything I don''t want to do." Desperate to get him to do something with his life, his little sister manages to get him a job teaching physics at his old high school. He''s certainly an unconventional teacher, but he becomes fairly popular with the students. After helping a girl who''s being ruthlessly bullied, Kagami finds that he actually likes teaching. Will he continue his career as a weird teacher? Will he go back into physics? Or will he end up back where he started?', 'Kagami Junichirou was known as a physics genius when he was a teenager, and he was even published in "Nature." However, after college, he suddenly lost all interest in science. As a NEET, he''s devoted himself to his anime blog and nerdy collecting habits. He claims he has a serious illness called "I can''t do anything I don''t want to do." Desperate to get him to do something with his life, his little sister manages to get him a job teaching physics at his old high school. He''s certainly an unconventional teacher, but he becomes fairly popular with the students. After helping a girl who''s being ruthlessly bullied, Kagami finds that he actually likes teaching. Will he continue his career as a weird teacher? Will he go back into physics? Or will he end up back where he started?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sviWdbsLRWrI2tLpBe8ubVP1Cza.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62283'),
  ('89073387191434476', 'Ultimo', 1998, 'Drama, Crime', 'Graziano Diana, Salvatore Basile', 'Salvatore Basile', 'Raoul Bova, Nerea Barros, Rubén Zamora, Jose Dammert, Alberto Basaluzzo, Luca Fiamenghi, Pier Giorgio Bellocchio, Turi Catanzaro', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djkKYwG0dZZHGLt4fVFD3sxr3EZ.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:80555'),
  ('964514616822769966', 'Último a Sair', 2011, 'Comedy, Reality', 'Bruno Nogueira, Frederico Pombares, João Quadros', 'João Quadros, Frederico Pombares, Bruno Nogueira', 'Bruno Nogueira, Roberto Leal, Luciana Abreu, Miguel Guilherme, Rui Unas, Miguel Damião, Débora Monteiro, Sónia Balacó', null, 'An original and unique parody to reality shows. In Portugal, different celebrities, from different artistic areas, "live" together in a house where everything looks real, but it''s not. Pure comedy and social satire.', 'An original and unique parody to reality shows. In Portugal, different celebrities, from different artistic areas, "live" together in a house where everything looks real, but it''s not. Pure comedy and social satire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHjDBYxPWwv9n3ZXPBXbY2IyWbA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78951'),
  ('312798752991491572', 'Ultra City Smiths', 2021, 'Comedy, Animation, Drama', 'Steven Conrad', null, 'Tom Waits, Jimmi Simpson, Da''Vine Joy Randolph, John C. Reilly, Bebe Neuwirth, Jason Mantzoukas, Damon Herriman, Melissa Villaseñor', 'TV-14', 'Two detectives must contend with dangerous corruption as they investigate the mysterious disappearance of the last honest politician in their dark city. A group of unlikely suspects emerges - each with the last name of Smith.', 'Two detectives must contend with dangerous corruption as they investigate the mysterious disappearance of the last honest politician in their dark city. A group of unlikely suspects emerges - each with the last name of Smith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1TkSXf3SjHNhPyK7nXpcxAaM7Qa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90306'),
  ('116526511649050426', 'Ultra Galaxy Fight: The Destined Crossroad', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yō Murakami, Mamoru Miyano, Wataru Komada, Shugo Nakamura, Shunsuke Takeuchi, Takahiro Sakurai, Hiroki Touchi, Shin-ichiro Miki', null, 'A sequel to Ultra Galaxy Fight: The Absolute Conspiracy.', 'A sequel to Ultra Galaxy Fight: The Absolute Conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wftGQsJBe4Ljle5rBBJN06gvuKf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:153445'),
  ('1112189169920532211', 'Ultra Q', 1966, 'Mystery', null, null, 'Kenji Sahara, Yasuhiko Saijō, Hiroko Sakurai, Ureo Egawa, Yoshibumi Tajima', null, 'As supernatural events and monster attacks rock Japan, the military and government look to be overwhelmed. Three intrepid young investigators—two pilots and a reporter—take it upon themselves to study these unexplained phenomena in order to inform and protect the public. With allies and science aiding them on their journey, the trio must separate myth from history as they explore the greater mysteries of these occurrences: are they unrelated, or is this barrage somehow a portent of even worse things to come?', 'As supernatural events and monster attacks rock Japan, the military and government look to be overwhelmed. Three intrepid young investigators—two pilots and a reporter—take it upon themselves to study these unexplained phenomena in order to inform and protect the public. With allies and science aiding them on their journey, the trio must separate myth from history as they explore the greater mysteries of these occurrences: are they unrelated, or is this barrage somehow a portent of even worse things to come?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jcPwG0aneLwZ0dszjwIppSFCYL4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4766'),
  ('1010795339954753487', 'Ultraman', 1966, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', null, null, 'Susumu Kurobe, Akiji Kobayashi, Sandayuu Dokumamushi, Hiroko Sakurai, Masaya Nihei, Akihide Tsuzawa, Akihiko Hirata, Koji Ishizaka', 'TV-PG', 'Hayata is a member of the Science Patrol, an organization tasked with investigating bizarre anomalies. He is mortally wounded when accidently encountering an alien being from Land of Light, who grants Hayata new life as the two are merged into one. Now, whenever a threat arises that is too great for the Science Patrol to handle, Hayata activates the beta capsule and becomes the hero known as Ultraman.', 'Hayata is a member of the Science Patrol, an organization tasked with investigating bizarre anomalies. He is mortally wounded when accidently encountering an alien being from Land of Light, who grants Hayata new life as the two are merged into one. Now, whenever a threat arises that is too great for the Science Patrol to handle, Hayata activates the beta capsule and becomes the hero known as Ultraman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7BanECmWCduOuJ5LzCjY93IdyPU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3425'),
  ('914927009207685376', 'ULTRAMAN', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, 'Ryohei Kimura, Takuya Eguchi', 'TV-14', 'Decades ago, a hero from the stars left this world in peace. Now, the son of Ultraman must rise to protect the Earth from a new alien threat.', 'Decades ago, a hero from the stars left this world in peace. Now, the son of Ultraman must rise to protect the Earth from a new alien threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oD1E8eKTzrav7Xdil7ZkRcgBKdQ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:80795'),
  ('53884269658111162', 'Ultraman 80', 1980, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hatsunori Hasegawa, Eri Ishida, Jin Nakayama, Masaaki Daimon, Sayoko Hagiwara, Masashi Furuta, Hachiro Okamoto', null, 'Takeshi Yamato, a twenty-two-year-old young man lives a double life. During the daytime, he is a rookie but popular science teacher at a junior high school in Tokyo. But after school and on Sundays he works as a member of the elite UGM (Utility Government Members).', 'Takeshi Yamato, a twenty-two-year-old young man lives a double life. During the daytime, he is a rookie but popular science teacher at a junior high school in Tokyo. But after school and on Sundays he works as a member of the elite UGM (Utility Government Members).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lcF17uIzWI3EAUWNy1qqB0uicD9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1157'),
  ('371128930995493981', 'Ultraman Ace', 1972, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Keiji Takamine, Gorō Naya, Mitsuko Hoshi, Tetsurō Sagawa, Shunichi Okita, Masaaki Yamamoto, Akinori Umezu, Mahito Tsujimura', null, 'Yapool, an ancient interdimensional race of beings tries to conquer the Planet Earth with his army of monsters, called Terrible-Monsters. The newest member of the Ultra Brothers, Ultraman Ace, arrives on Earth to aid humanity in the battle against Yapool. Touched by the sacrifices of Seiji Hokuto and Yuko Minami, he revives them and grants them the Ultra Rings, which allows them to transform into Ultraman Ace in times of need.', 'Yapool, an ancient interdimensional race of beings tries to conquer the Planet Earth with his army of monsters, called Terrible-Monsters. The newest member of the Ultra Brothers, Ultraman Ace, arrives on Earth to aid humanity in the battle against Yapool. Touched by the sacrifices of Seiji Hokuto and Yuko Minami, he revives them and grants them the Ultra Rings, which allows them to transform into Ultraman Ace in times of need.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6EBzbYkT7ATQYB7RpgiAmTS8wS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1279'),
  ('442224070190400726', 'Ultraman Arc', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids, Drama', null, 'Jun Tsugita', 'Yuki Totsuka, Masato Hagiwara, Sho Kaneta, Kaho Mizutani, Kouichiro Nishi, Yuya Hirose', null, 'A being of light hailing from a faraway galaxy unites with Yuma, the protagonist who owns tremendous “power of imagination,” and they form the gigantic new Ultra Hero: Ultraman Arc.', 'A being of light hailing from a faraway galaxy unites with Yuma, the protagonist who owns tremendous “power of imagination,” and they form the gigantic new Ultra Hero: Ultraman Arc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pVZaASB88vtKqSYc6zXzzaq59ca.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:251104'),
  ('102666208079303318', 'Ultraman Blazar', 2023, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Tomoya Warabino, Hideyoshi Iwata, Yuki Ito, Yamada Himina, Konomi Naito, Hayate Kajihara, Masaya Katō, Genki Yoshimoto', null, 'Ultraman Blazar is a hero with a great sense of justice hailing from “M421,” an extragalactic astronomical object far from Earth. The main protagonist, Gento Hiruma, is the captain of the Special Kaiju Reaction Detachment (SKaRD), established by the Global Guardian Force (GGF) in a world where kaiju disasters are a common practice. When their strong desire for the power to save human lives resonates, the two unite.', 'Ultraman Blazar is a hero with a great sense of justice hailing from “M421,” an extragalactic astronomical object far from Earth. The main protagonist, Gento Hiruma, is the captain of the Special Kaiju Reaction Detachment (SKaRD), established by the Global Guardian Force (GGF) in a world where kaiju disasters are a common practice. When their strong desire for the power to save human lives resonates, the two unite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJFVvLPjZJSnOpBc5O9byFbB0U.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213442'),
  ('1102298593104429713', 'Ultraman Cosmos', 2001, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Family', null, 'Nobusuke Ônishi, Keiichi Hasegawa, Masakazu Migita', 'Taiyo Sugiura, Daisuke Shima, Kaori Sakagami, Hidekazu Ichinose, Yuhki Sato, Koichi Suto, Mayuka Suzuki, Koji Haramaki', null, 'Ultraman Cosmos is a calm and gentle alien of unknown origin who seeks to protect Earth. Unlike most Ultramen, Cosmos is a pacifist and prefers to resolve his disputes or disagreements by the way of peace.', 'Ultraman Cosmos is a calm and gentle alien of unknown origin who seeks to protect Earth. Unlike most Ultramen, Cosmos is a pacifist and prefers to resolve his disputes or disagreements by the way of peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bHjgB6jV8wCGleYN0T9ha5Q3Ag.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2434'),
  ('573938826009022123', 'Ultraman Decker', 2022, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hiroki Matsumoto, Yūka Murayama, Nobunaga Daichi, Sae Miyazawa, Masaya Kikawada, Hiroshi Tsuchida, Yu Koyanagi', null, 'Seven years have passed since Ultraman Trigger protected the world from various threats. In the present, Kanata Asumi, who is a positive young man, peacefully lives together with his grandpa. One day, while delivering ordered food, he witnessed a catastrophe: Spheres from the outer space attack Earth and Mars. Motivated by saving the precious lives of the people, he merges with Ultraman Decker and joins GUTS-Select, in order to protect what''s important.', 'Seven years have passed since Ultraman Trigger protected the world from various threats. In the present, Kanata Asumi, who is a positive young man, peacefully lives together with his grandpa. One day, while delivering ordered food, he witnessed a catastrophe: Spheres from the outer space attack Earth and Mars. Motivated by saving the precious lives of the people, he merges with Ultraman Decker and joins GUTS-Select, in order to protect what''s important.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/16cDHTM88Se3IqFEv5ViQaP8hQt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:154129'),
  ('766408372181981972', 'Ultraman Dyna', 1997, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Takeshi Tsuruno, Syunsuke Gondo, Risa Saito, Ryô Kinomoto, Mariya Yamada, Hiroshi Nagano, Mio Takaki, Tamio Kawachi', 'TV-G', 'As humanity begins migrating beyond Earth, a new Ultraman named Dyna arrives and bonds with defense organization GUTS'' newest recruit, Shin Asuka, to protect a colony on Mars.', 'As humanity begins migrating beyond Earth, a new Ultraman named Dyna arrives and bonds with defense organization GUTS'' newest recruit, Shin Asuka, to protect a colony on Mars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUoe3ZGS2am6obGeKltUkwF7UO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3459'),
  ('625960337110782098', 'Ultraman Gaia', 1998, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Takeshi Yoshioka, Hassei Takano, Hiroyuki Watanabe, Sei Hiraizumi, Takashi Ukaji, Ai Hashimoto, Maria Theresa Gow, Masami Nakagami', null, 'Ultraman Gaia is a Japanese tokusatsu TV show and is the 13th show in the Ultra Series. Created by Chiaki J. Konaka and produced by Tsuburaya Productions and Mainichi Broadcasting System, Ultraman Gaia was aired on JNN TV stations from September 5, 1998 until August 28, 1999, with a total of 51 episodes.', 'Ultraman Gaia is a Japanese tokusatsu TV show and is the 13th show in the Ultra Series. Created by Chiaki J. Konaka and produced by Tsuburaya Productions and Mainichi Broadcasting System, Ultraman Gaia was aired on JNN TV stations from September 5, 1998 until August 28, 1999, with a total of 51 episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vy3WvKpc3qev0AGQWLJBoaUIE4N.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4426'),
  ('192790408238436304', 'Ultraman Geed', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Uiko Miura', 'Tatsuomi Hamada, Chihiro Yamamoto, Hitomi Hasebe, Shintaro Asanuma, Megumi Han, Suzuko Mimori, Mamoru Miyano, Yuki Ono', null, 'After escaping from the raid of giant monster Skull Gomora, Riku Asakura and his partner Pega stumbled upon a secret base lied 500 m underground. Given the Geed Riser and Ultra Capsules by operating system Rem, he transforms into Ultraman Geed and becomes a hero that his childhood inspired.', 'After escaping from the raid of giant monster Skull Gomora, Riku Asakura and his partner Pega stumbled upon a secret base lied 500 m underground. Given the Geed Riser and Ultra Capsules by operating system Rem, he transforms into Ultraman Geed and becomes a hero that his childhood inspired.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6dKNxX3G7WoALemWxlbDVXdi9t.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73169'),
  ('224375610154358310', 'Ultraman Ginga', 2013, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Keiichi Hasegawa', null, 'Takuya Negishi, Mio Miyatake, Mizuki Ohno, Kirara, Takuya Kusakawa, Shohei Uno, Mitsuki Koga, Masahiko Tsugawa', null, 'All of the Ultraman and monsters have been turned into figures known as Spark Dolls and become scattered throughout the universe. A young man named Hikaru Raido finds an item called the Ginga Spark which not only allows him to become Ultraman Ginga but also allows him to go UltLive with the figures to revert them to their rightful size and become one with them. Hikaru fights with his friends to uncover the darkness behind the Spark Dolls. Alien Nackie drops a clue that the wielder of darkness resides in their very elementary school.', 'All of the Ultraman and monsters have been turned into figures known as Spark Dolls and become scattered throughout the universe. A young man named Hikaru Raido finds an item called the Ginga Spark which not only allows him to become Ultraman Ginga but also allows him to go UltLive with the figures to revert them to their rightful size and become one with them. Hikaru fights with his friends to uncover the darkness behind the Spark Dolls. Alien Nackie drops a clue that the wielder of darkness resides in their very elementary school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9rSmq3OJKogKNwXeJz6OFOEMDpO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68693'),
  ('148007342928070242', 'Ultraman Ginga S', 2014, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Takuya Negishi, Kiyotaka Uji, Yukari Taki, Takahiro Katou, Ryuichi Ohura, Takuya Kusakawa, Moga Mogami, Rina Koike', null, 'In this new series, two years after Ginga''s battle with Dark Lugiel ended, Hikaru and Tomoya joined the UPG (Ultra Party Guardians) after countless monster sightings appeared. Also, an Alien Chibu named Exceller plans to steal the Victorium Stone which believed to contained mysterious powers that located deep underground the Victorian civilization. Due to this, Shou, a Victorian Prince was sent by his mother to retrieve it with the help of Victory Lancer which enable him to become the ancient Ultra, Ultraman Victory.', 'In this new series, two years after Ginga''s battle with Dark Lugiel ended, Hikaru and Tomoya joined the UPG (Ultra Party Guardians) after countless monster sightings appeared. Also, an Alien Chibu named Exceller plans to steal the Victorium Stone which believed to contained mysterious powers that located deep underground the Victorian civilization. Due to this, Shou, a Victorian Prince was sent by his mother to retrieve it with the help of Victory Lancer which enable him to become the ancient Ultra, Ultraman Victory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62c0hsfqi3EB9px96GLb7A8u6iz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137788'),
  ('402023372807318659', 'Ultraman Leo', 1974, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ryu Manatsu, Kohji Moritsugu, Keiko Yamada, Mina Tominaga, Yū Fujiki, Tetsurō Sagawa, Yukio Itô', null, 'Ultraman Leo is an Ultra foreign to the Land of Light, instead hailing from the fallen Planet L77 of the Leo constellation, where he and his brother Astra were royalty. After his planet was destroyed by Alien Magma and his twin Giras kaiju, Leo traveled to Earth, intending to make it a second home. While there, he blended into human society as Gen Ohtori, and became a gym instructor at a fitness club for children. But, when the Alien Magma that destroyed L77 came to conquer Earth, he was forced to take action. Leo met Ultraseven during his initial fight against Alien Magma, and became the first Ultra Crusader of Earth to not hail from the Land of Light. Unlike most of the previous Ultras to visit Earth, Leo''s fighting style specializes in martial arts giving him far greater physical abilities than any other known Ultras. Despite his foreign origins, he, along with Astra, were readily accepted into the pantheon of the Ultra Brothers. During his tenure on Earth, Leo and Seven became very close, and it was for this reason that Seven would eventually entrust the training of his son Ultraman Zero to Leo and Astra.', 'Ultraman Leo is an Ultra foreign to the Land of Light, instead hailing from the fallen Planet L77 of the Leo constellation, where he and his brother Astra were royalty. After his planet was destroyed by Alien Magma and his twin Giras kaiju, Leo traveled to Earth, intending to make it a second home. While there, he blended into human society as Gen Ohtori, and became a gym instructor at a fitness club for children. But, when the Alien Magma that destroyed L77 came to conquer Earth, he was forced to take action. Leo met Ultraseven during his initial fight against Alien Magma, and became the first Ultra Crusader of Earth to not hail from the Land of Light. Unlike most of the previous Ultras to visit Earth, Leo''s fighting style specializes in martial arts giving him far greater physical abilities than any other known Ultras. Despite his foreign origins, he, along with Astra, were readily accepted into the pantheon of the Ultra Brothers. During his tenure on Earth, Leo and Seven became very close, and it was for this reason that Seven would eventually entrust the training of his son Ultraman Zero to Leo and Astra.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ycyDo1LF5UyEaQUkBybDRj87av0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5157'),
  ('566561713639715497', 'Ultraman Max', 2005, 'Action & Adventure, Family, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Nobuyuki Ogawa, Sean Nichols, Kai Shishido, Sota Aoyama, Hitomi Hasebe, Hikari Mitsushima, Kazuya Nakai, Susumu Kurobe', null, 'Ultraman Max was an Ultraman TV series which started airing on 7 July 2005, and produced by Tsuburaya Productions and Chubu-Nippon Broadcasting Co., Ltd.. The show tried to return to the true formula of new monsters every week and being a fast paced show like previous series with the exception of Ultraman Nexus. The show is full of homages to past series by having three of the original cast members from the first Ultraman series being featured in an episode, updated versions of classic monsters like Red King, Eleking and Pigmon among others. One unusual episode revolves around the filming of the 1964 program Ultra Q which was the predecessor to the first Ultraman show in 1966. Two actors from that show appear as themselves.', 'Ultraman Max was an Ultraman TV series which started airing on 7 July 2005, and produced by Tsuburaya Productions and Chubu-Nippon Broadcasting Co., Ltd.. The show tried to return to the true formula of new monsters every week and being a fast paced show like previous series with the exception of Ultraman Nexus. The show is full of homages to past series by having three of the original cast members from the first Ultraman series being featured in an episode, updated versions of classic monsters like Red King, Eleking and Pigmon among others. One unusual episode revolves around the filming of the 1964 program Ultra Q which was the predecessor to the first Ultraman show in 1966. Two actors from that show appear as themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18bp74xrGnx71aLEWHlZXBO9jlP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3155'),
  ('104825287939275094', 'Ultraman Mebius', 2006, 'Action & Adventure', null, 'Masanao Akahoshi', 'Shunji Igarashi, Masaki Nishina, Ai Saikawa, Daisuke Watanabe, Misato Hirata, Kenta Uchino, Minoru Tanaka, Ken''ichi Ishii', null, 'Ultraman Mebius is a Japanese television series produced by Tsuburaya Productions and Chubu-Nippon Broadcasting. It is the 17th TV series and 40th anniversary production in the Ultra Series, which first began in 1966. It premiered on the Tokyo Broadcasting System on April 8, 2006. Unlike the two prior entries, Ultraman Nexus and Ultraman Max, Mebius was moved from Saturday mornings to Saturday evenings at 05:30. "Mebius" is the Japanese approximation of Möbius; the Möbius strip is a recurring motif in the series and the show going to air in Korea in April 2012. The series opens with the introduction of the rookie Ultraman Mebius, who is sent to Earth by the Father of Ultra. The series is set 40 years after the shows of Ultraman, and makes many references from Ultra Q through to Ultraman 80.', 'Ultraman Mebius is a Japanese television series produced by Tsuburaya Productions and Chubu-Nippon Broadcasting. It is the 17th TV series and 40th anniversary production in the Ultra Series, which first began in 1966. It premiered on the Tokyo Broadcasting System on April 8, 2006. Unlike the two prior entries, Ultraman Nexus and Ultraman Max, Mebius was moved from Saturday mornings to Saturday evenings at 05:30. "Mebius" is the Japanese approximation of Möbius; the Möbius strip is a recurring motif in the series and the show going to air in Korea in April 2012. The series opens with the introduction of the rookie Ultraman Mebius, who is sent to Earth by the Father of Ultra. The series is set 40 years after the shows of Ultraman, and makes many references from Ultra Q through to Ultraman 80.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v19lPIh9qGwEc6OHVJdpwlaxOyI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5646'),
  ('354805747663927915', 'Ultraman New Generation Stars', 2023, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, null, null, 'When memories of Ultra Heroes are erased by a mysterious entity, a device called Dimensionizer is sent from the future dimension Ultraman Decker is from. Trying to get memories of the Land of Light residents back, New Generation Heroes remember all their battles and hardships they''ve gone through.', 'When memories of Ultra Heroes are erased by a mysterious entity, a device called Dimensionizer is sent from the future dimension Ultraman Decker is from. Trying to get memories of the Land of Light residents back, New Generation Heroes remember all their battles and hardships they''ve gone through.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x8DZSixZF9XU169YSkKUMHML2b3.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:216843'),
  ('816443656873540141', 'Ultraman Nexus', 2004, 'Action & Adventure', null, 'Keiichi Hasegawa', 'Takuji Kawakubo, Yusuke Kirishima, Masato Uchiyama, Yasue Sato, Tamotsu Ishibashi, Keiko Goto, Nobuhiko Tanaka, Shion Nakamura', null, 'The TLT is a covert international anti-monster unit established secretly to combat Space Beasts, mysterious monsters that are out to attack humans in the year 2009. One of the TLT''s new recruits, Kazuki Komon, is attacked by one of them prior to reporting for duty. However, he is saved by a silver giant that he names "Ultraman". What no one knows is that the silver giant is an Ultraman — to be precise, Ultraman Nexus, ready to fight the Space Beasts to save the planet Earth.', 'The TLT is a covert international anti-monster unit established secretly to combat Space Beasts, mysterious monsters that are out to attack humans in the year 2009. One of the TLT''s new recruits, Kazuki Komon, is attacked by one of them prior to reporting for duty. However, he is saved by a silver giant that he names "Ultraman". What no one knows is that the silver giant is an Ultraman — to be precise, Ultraman Nexus, ready to fight the Space Beasts to save the planet Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/72mNqktWE333mGMlOwwZFZcrQHq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1281'),
  ('851593616821908995', 'Ultraman Omega', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, 'Shori Kondo, Haruto Yoshida, Ayano Kudo, Mirai Yamamoto, Shunichi Maki, Megumi Han, Ryô Kinomoto, Hideyoshi Iwata', null, 'On Earth, an alien falls from the sky. Taking human form and the name "Sorato", he becomes interested in the "Earthlings" and attempts to understand them. As kaiju continue to appear before him, he transforms into "Ultraman Omega".', 'On Earth, an alien falls from the sky. Taking human form and the name "Sorato", he becomes interested in the "Earthlings" and attempts to understand them. As kaiju continue to appear before him, he transforms into "Ultraman Omega".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jy9jTgFhMld1aNBrNsGn7g93ocI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:289745'),
  ('139418715732667203', 'Ultraman Orb', 2016, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Kids', null, null, 'Hideo Ishiguro, Miyabi Matsuura, Naoto Takahashi, Hiroaki Nerio, Takaya Aoyagi, Shingo Yanagisawa, Hiroki Yasumoto, Vlada', null, 'A young man becomes the giant hero Ultraman Orb, a warrior of light, to battle monsters and aliens threatening Earth using the powers of his many predecessor guardians.', 'A young man becomes the giant hero Ultraman Orb, a warrior of light, to battle monsters and aliens threatening Earth using the powers of his many predecessor guardians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1sn57RylxVzRuwkGN9FPbfP4sP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67904'),
  ('570144978320584125', 'Ultraman Orb: The Origin Saga', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hideo Ishiguro, Takaaki Enoki, Saki Fukuda, Takaya Aoyagi, Karen Miyazaki, Motoya Izumi, Riho Iida, Asuka Shibuya', null, 'The story chronicles upon the past of Gai Kurenai and Jugglus Juggler, the original series'' main protagonist and antagonist, who were once heroes fighting on the side of light, facing Dr. Psychi and his army of Bezelbs.', 'The story chronicles upon the past of Gai Kurenai and Jugglus Juggler, the original series'' main protagonist and antagonist, who were once heroes fighting on the side of light, facing Dr. Psychi and his army of Bezelbs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qV6oxhwvCpTMfoIgEEtvrLbbfM4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82054'),
  ('501979937982272436', 'Ultraman R/B', 2018, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Eiji Tsuburaya', null, 'Yuya Hirata, Ryosuke Koike, Arisa Sonohara, Ginnojo Yamazaki, Fujisawa Hajime, Kaori Manabe, Kaede Yuasa, Motoki Fukami', null, 'The two main characters, Katsumi and Isami Minato, are brothers who live with their younger sister and father who runs a specialty store. One day, they found the R/B Gyro and R/B Crystals, which transforms Katsumi into Ultraman Rosso and Isami into Ultraman Blu.', 'The two main characters, Katsumi and Isami Minato, are brothers who live with their younger sister and father who runs a specialty store. One day, they found the R/B Gyro and R/B Crystals, which transforms Katsumi into Ultraman Rosso and Isami into Ultraman Blu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aySvBToQIdAOMMXvnhydkQ1Kwbx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81959'),
  ('599507908911797386', 'Ultraman Taiga', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuki Inoue, Chiharu Niiyama, Kô Nanase, Ayuri Yoshinaga, Ryotaro, Takuma Terashima, Satoshi Hino, Shota Hayama', null, 'Aliens have been emigrating to Earth secretly, but only a handful knows about this truth. Living in such a society, the main character Hiroyuki Kudo begins working at a private security organization E.G.I.S. (Enterprise of Guard and Investigation Services). The organization takes care of cases related with aliens, and Hiroyuki works day and night to protect peace. However, there lies a huge secret in him, which he himself is not aware of. He carries Ultraman Taiga’s “particle of light”. The new story begins as Taiga’s powers revive from Hiroyuki’s body!', 'Aliens have been emigrating to Earth secretly, but only a handful knows about this truth. Living in such a society, the main character Hiroyuki Kudo begins working at a private security organization E.G.I.S. (Enterprise of Guard and Investigation Services). The organization takes care of cases related with aliens, and Hiroyuki works day and night to protect peace. However, there lies a huge secret in him, which he himself is not aware of. He carries Ultraman Taiga’s “particle of light”. The new story begins as Taiga’s powers revive from Hiroyuki’s body!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJTT3rKPkbgNmPF7nRVaZlDFYiW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88597'),
  ('6911644019692044', 'Ultraman Taro', 1973, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Saburo Shinoda, Akira Nagoya, Toyoyuki Kimura, Kiyotaka Mitsugi, Kiyoko Matsuya, Takashi Tsumura, Noboru Mitani, Mayumi Asaka', null, 'Kotaro Higashi trained to be a boxer, but after an icident with Astromons, he was killed. However, his body was brought to Nebula M-78 where Mother of Ultra saved his life by joining him with Ultraman Taro. Taro had spent many years training, honing his skills based on those of the other Ultra Brothers to become strong. The two returned to earth as a new kaiju era was beginning.', 'Kotaro Higashi trained to be a boxer, but after an icident with Astromons, he was killed. However, his body was brought to Nebula M-78 where Mother of Ultra saved his life by joining him with Ultraman Taro. Taro had spent many years training, honing his skills based on those of the other Ultra Brothers to become strong. The two returned to earth as a new kaiju era was beginning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQIcKS1N0HPahg3HcamPszw31H2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3856'),
  ('1013070888770081992', 'Ultraman Tiga', 1996, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, 'Masakazu Migita', 'Hiroshi Nagano, Takami Yoshimoto, Mio Takaki, Akitoshi Ohtaki, Masuda Yukio, Shigeki Kagemaru, Yoichi Furuya', 'NR', 'A high-tech squadron protects Earth from evil monsters and aliens with the help of a giant super-being named Ultraman Tiga.', 'A high-tech squadron protects Earth from evil monsters and aliens with the help of a giant super-being named Ultraman Tiga.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lYvAiTqXFGuLqos0Wi7899scn6z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2253'),
  ('35078319204871576', 'Ultraman Trigger: New Generation Tiga', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Raiga Terasaka, Runa Toyoda, Shunya Kaneko, Kei Hosogai, Tadashi Mizuno, Meiku Harukawa, Katsuya Takagi, Mao Ichimichi', null, 'Young Kengo Manaka lives on Mars. As he lives out his peaceful, day-to-day life, the monster Golba suddenly appears, throwing the town into chaos! Meanwhile, Kengo has a fateful meeting with a giant stone statue sleeping deep beneath the ground on Mars. When Kengo becomes one with an Ultra-Ancient light, his destiny is forcefully thrown into motion!', 'Young Kengo Manaka lives on Mars. As he lives out his peaceful, day-to-day life, the monster Golba suddenly appears, throwing the town into chaos! Meanwhile, Kengo has a fateful meeting with a giant stone statue sleeping deep beneath the ground on Mars. When Kengo becomes one with an Ultra-Ancient light, his destiny is forcefully thrown into motion!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dbdC74YfFWG3FNbur2swe5H8ABP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:123417'),
  ('733557447512862934', 'Ultraman X', 2015, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Yuji Kobayashi', 'Kensuke Takahashi, Akane Sakanoue, Yoshihiko Hosoda, Ukyo Matsumoto, Hayato Harada, Haruka Momokawa, TAKERU, Chiaki Seshimo', null, 'A solar flare has awakened Spark Dolls from the depths of the earth and the ocean! Fifteen years later, Daichi Ozora transforms into Ultraman X to battle threats from both aliens and monsters. He is also a member of Xio, a team created to battle the monstrous threats.', 'A solar flare has awakened Spark Dolls from the depths of the earth and the ocean! Fifteen years later, Daichi Ozora transforms into Ultraman X to battle threats from both aliens and monsters. He is also a member of Xio, a team created to battle the monstrous threats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLkApQhMVe1R0PKdrHBSGHNnTdu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66631'),
  ('360810671022121191', 'Ultraman Z', 2020, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kohshu Hirano, Tasuku Hatanaka, Mamoru Miyano, Rima Matsuda, Jun Hashizume, Hikari Kuroki, Takaya Aoyagi, Karasu Hayashi', null, 'The newest Ultra Hero is Ultraman Zett, the disciple of Ultraman Zero, who is now celebrating his tenth anniversary! An admirer of Zero, Zett worked hard to become a member of the “Inter Galactic Defense Force.” With a passion inherited from his teacher Zero, Zett is an Ultraman who always looks forward and forges ahead.', 'The newest Ultra Hero is Ultraman Zett, the disciple of Ultraman Zero, who is now celebrating his tenth anniversary! An admirer of Zero, Zett worked hard to become a member of the “Inter Galactic Defense Force.” With a passion inherited from his teacher Zero, Zett is an Ultraman who always looks forward and forges ahead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xE0tlBJjWZNjY7BbY0fRaNCe9p.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:101005'),
  ('489624296073047889', 'Ultraman Zero: The Chronicle', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mamoru Miyano, Shota Minami, Hiroyuki Konishi, Hikaru Midorikawa, Hideo Ishiguro, Tomokazu Seki, Hiroshi Kamiya', null, 'Ultraman Zero: The Chronicle is a series that tells the story of Ultraman Zero''s adventures. All episodes use footage from various Ultraman Zero films: Mega Monster Battle: Ultra Galaxy Legends The Movie, Ultra Galaxy Legend Gaiden: Ultraman Zero vs. Darklops Zero, Ultraman Zero The Movie: Super Deciding Fight! The Belial Galactic Empire, Ultraman Saga, Ultraman Zero Gaiden: Killer the Beatstar, and Ultraman Retsuden.', 'Ultraman Zero: The Chronicle is a series that tells the story of Ultraman Zero''s adventures. All episodes use footage from various Ultraman Zero films: Mega Monster Battle: Ultra Galaxy Legends The Movie, Ultra Galaxy Legend Gaiden: Ultraman Zero vs. Darklops Zero, Ultraman Zero The Movie: Super Deciding Fight! The Belial Galactic Empire, Ultraman Saga, Ultraman Zero Gaiden: Killer the Beatstar, and Ultraman Retsuden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXYFUWTFuN1o19xIrOtbDtjbaq5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:120781'),
  ('653306813675196769', 'Ultramarine Magmell', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Mao Ichimichi, Kengo Kawanishi, Hibiku Yamamura, Toshiyuki Morikawa', null, 'One day in the middle of the pacific ocean a miracle occurred, a new continent appeared out of nowhere! The new continent was the home for new and mysterious plants, creatures and minerals! Humanity is excited as the age of exploration has returned.', 'One day in the middle of the pacific ocean a miracle occurred, a new continent appeared out of nowhere! The new continent was the home for new and mysterious plants, creatures and minerals! Humanity is excited as the age of exploration has returned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tgqna6q27frmiwYFwJ5f1VRTqsE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85841'),
  ('953350914240789776', 'Ultraseven', 1967, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family', null, null, 'Kohji Moritsugu, Shoji Nakayama, Sandayuu Dokumamushi, Yuriko Hishimi, Shinsuke Achiwa, Bin Furuya, Hikaru Urano', null, 'In the not-too-distant future, the Earth finds itself constantly under attack from extraterrestrial threats. The Terrestrial Defense Force establishes the Ultra Garrison, a team of six elite members who utilize high-tech vehicles and weaponry. Joining their fight is the mysterious Dan Moroboshi, secretly an alien from the Land of Light in Nebula M-78, who transforms into his true form in times of crisis, Ultraseven.', 'In the not-too-distant future, the Earth finds itself constantly under attack from extraterrestrial threats. The Terrestrial Defense Force establishes the Ultra Garrison, a team of six elite members who utilize high-tech vehicles and weaponry. Joining their fight is the mysterious Dan Moroboshi, secretly an alien from the Land of Light in Nebula M-78, who transforms into his true form in times of crisis, Ultraseven.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4HEtZZY4OISae6vpMCzREyzXFQi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77396'),
  ('496396245203704676', 'Ultraviolet', 1998, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Joe Ahearne', 'Joe Ahearne', 'Jack Davenport, Susannah Harker, Idris Elba, Philip Quast, Stephen Moyer', null, 'With the growing threat of viral epidemic and the possibility of worldwide environmental catastrophe, humanity has an unprecedented ability to destroy itself, and vampires need to take control of their threatened food source. CIB, an elite government force, has been formed to combat the vampire threat. But when eternal life is offered, no one is beyond temptation...', 'With the growing threat of viral epidemic and the possibility of worldwide environmental catastrophe, humanity has an unprecedented ability to destroy itself, and vampires need to take control of their threatened food source. CIB, an elite government force, has been formed to combat the vampire threat. But when eternal life is offered, no one is beyond temptation...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oE6YG0gBvJ7AuFauq6MK7LgCOzB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:232'),
  ('137098691757847520', 'Ultraviolet', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Marta Nieradkiewicz, Michał Żurawski, Karolina Chapko, Viet Anh Doan', 'TV-MA', 'An online community of amateur sleuths use technology to solve crimes -- and make quirky friends -- in their quest for justice.', 'An online community of amateur sleuths use technology to solve crimes -- and make quirky friends -- in their quest for justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3AAxYTjoMMBgu79bzMrilStWOoo.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:76386'),
  ('829915348745660131', 'Ulysses 31', 1981, 'Kids, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jean Chalopin, Yoshitake Suzuki, Nina Wolmark', 'Jean Chalopin, Yoshitake Suzuki', 'Claude Giraud, Jacques Ebner, Amélie Morin, André Valmy, Annie Balestra, Annie Sinigalia, Arlette Thomas, Fabrice Josso', 'TV-Y7', 'Ulysses and his crew struggle against the divine entities that rule the universe, the ancient gods from Greek mythology.', 'Ulysses and his crew struggle against the divine entities that rule the universe, the ancient gods from Greek mythology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJLwSnPxQWDj6BFopbAg2qTMQPr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4025'),
  ('698738982547325886', 'Ulysses: Jeanne d''Arc and the Alchemist Knight', 2018, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation', null, null, 'Hisako Tojo, Saori Onishi, Yuko Ono, Shizuka Ishigami, Ryota Osaka, Yuuki Takada, Manami Numakura, Tessyo Genda', 'TV-14', 'The story is set in the 15th century, during the Hundred Years'' War between France and England over the succession to the French throne. Montmorency, the son of a noble, immerses himself in the studies of magic and alchemy at a royal knight training school. However, following France''s crushing defeat at Agincourt, the school is dissolved. Having lost everything and now a wanted man, Montmorency, who had just become an alchemist, encounters a mysterious village girl named Jehanne.', 'The story is set in the 15th century, during the Hundred Years'' War between France and England over the succession to the French throne. Montmorency, the son of a noble, immerses himself in the studies of magic and alchemy at a royal knight training school. However, following France''s crushing defeat at Agincourt, the school is dissolved. Having lost everything and now a wanted man, Montmorency, who had just become an alchemist, encounters a mysterious village girl named Jehanne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pUO8GCYbKCJgFgFDP27XS7AFCxE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82737'),
  ('603097671942244070', 'Um, Actually...', 2018, 'Reality', 'Mike Trapp', null, 'Ify Nwadiwe, Brian David Gilbert', null, 'Introducing a game show of fandom minutiae one-upmanship, where nerds do what nerds do best: flaunt encyclopedic nerd knowledge at Millennium Falcon nerd-speed.', 'Introducing a game show of fandom minutiae one-upmanship, where nerds do what nerds do best: flaunt encyclopedic nerd knowledge at Millennium Falcon nerd-speed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jdto0Xzy0tRlEpUnFc4INGZK67.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:126565'),
  ('318051502304977312', 'Umamusume: Cinderella Gray', 2025, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Tomoyo Takayanagi, Momoko Seto, Katsuyuki Konishi, Hochu Otsuka, Mariya Ise, Ayano Shibuya, You Taichi, Shiori Izawa', 'NR', 'Unbeknownst to those around her, the staggering potential of this ashen-haired “Beast” will soon catapult her to the national stage—and down the path of a legend.', 'Unbeknownst to those around her, the staggering potential of this ashen-haired “Beast” will soon catapult her to the national stage—and down the path of a legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncq5uKIcifVITPIYT2G1KpUPMoW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:262700'),
  ('242464209410044220', 'Umamusume: Pretty Derby', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Hinaki Yano, Hina Tachibana, Sayumi Suzushiro', 'TV-14', 'In a world very much like our own, great race horses of the past have a chance to be reborn as "horse girls"—girls with the ears and tails of horses as well as their speed and endurance. The best of these horse girls go to train at Tokyo''s Tracen Academy, hopefully moving on to fame and fortune as both racers and idols. Special Week, a high school horse girl from the countryside, has just transferred to Tracen, and she''s determined to fulfill her promise to her mother to become the best horse girl in Japan. On her way to school, she takes a pit stop at the race track and instantly falls in love with Silence Suzuka''s style, becoming determined to race on the same team as her.', 'In a world very much like our own, great race horses of the past have a chance to be reborn as "horse girls"—girls with the ears and tails of horses as well as their speed and endurance. The best of these horse girls go to train at Tokyo''s Tracen Academy, hopefully moving on to fame and fortune as both racers and idols. Special Week, a high school horse girl from the countryside, has just transferred to Tracen, and she''s determined to fulfill her promise to her mother to become the best horse girl in Japan. On her way to school, she takes a pit stop at the race track and instantly falls in love with Silence Suzuka''s style, becoming determined to race on the same team as her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9TVHxWbWAHiIQjzGTx1vXi95r2X.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:77694'),
  ('690568011813662351', 'Umamusume: Pretty Derby - Road to the Top', 2023, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Kanna Nakamura, Hitomi Sasaki, Sora Tokui, Hiroshi Tsuchida, Manaka Iwami, Yu Sasahara, Misaki Watada, Yukina Shuto', 'TV-PG', 'After making a promise to stand on the top of the Twinkle Series with her trainer as a child, horse girl Narita Top Road has been practicing diligently ever since. After winning several races, Top Road''s efforts finally pay off when she earns a chance to participate in the race she has always dreamed of: the first race of the prestigious Classic Triple Crown, the Satsuki Sho. However, winning the Satsuki Sho is no simple task. Numerous brilliant horse girls are also joining the race—including two other rising racers—the flamboyant T.M. Opera O and the reserved Admire Vega, who seeks revenge against Top Road for a previous defeat. Although triumphing in the Satsuki Sho and the rest of the Triple Crown races is far from guaranteed, there is nothing that can stop Top Road on her road to the top.', 'After making a promise to stand on the top of the Twinkle Series with her trainer as a child, horse girl Narita Top Road has been practicing diligently ever since. After winning several races, Top Road''s efforts finally pay off when she earns a chance to participate in the race she has always dreamed of: the first race of the prestigious Classic Triple Crown, the Satsuki Sho. However, winning the Satsuki Sho is no simple task. Numerous brilliant horse girls are also joining the race—including two other rising racers—the flamboyant T.M. Opera O and the reserved Admire Vega, who seeks revenge against Top Road for a previous defeat. Although triumphing in the Satsuki Sho and the rest of the Triple Crown races is far from guaranteed, there is nothing that can stop Top Road on her road to the top.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2VDvSegh2mCcaeC63Ai8tfooNuE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223251'),
  ('772568139769958093', 'Umayuru', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', null, 'Yoko Yonaiyama', 'Misato Matsuoka, Ayaka Ohashi, Meiku Harukawa, Azumi Waki, Hikaru Tono, Misaki Watada, Chisa Kimura, Yoshino Aoyama', null, 'The Umamusume are up to their usual hijinks—in teeny-tiny chibi form! Each 3-minute short in this miniseries is packed with silly fun, where you can''t help but cheer ALL the racers on!', 'The Umamusume are up to their usual hijinks—in teeny-tiny chibi form! Each 3-minute short in this miniseries is packed with silly fun, where you can''t help but cheer ALL the racers on!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pUpKGE68wUTQTS3sw0JvyQqHmmK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:212385'),
  ('906454915401166998', 'Umechan Sensei', 2012, 'Drama', null, 'Masaya Ozaki', 'Maki Horikita, Tori Matsuzaka, Katsumi Takahashi, Shinnosuke Mitsushima, Hiroki Narimiya, Shuhei Nomura, Kaho Minami, Mitsuko Baisho', null, 'Umechan Sensei is a Japanese television drama series. It debuted on April 2, 2012. It is about a girl named Umeko Shimomura who, despite being overshadowed by her talented older brother and sister, and despite being thought of as a clumsy child, decides to follow in her father''s footsteps and become a doctor. It is the 86th NHK Asadora.', 'Umechan Sensei is a Japanese television drama series. It debuted on April 2, 2012. It is about a girl named Umeko Shimomura who, despite being overshadowed by her talented older brother and sister, and despite being thought of as a clumsy child, decides to follow in her father''s footsteps and become a doctor. It is the 86th NHK Asadora.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bXsG6XTQk8sw1zZCGOVGPMmyg3i.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45792'),
  ('687710100099344202', 'Umineko: When They Cry', 2009, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Mystery, Crime', null, null, 'Marina Inoue, Daisuke Ono, Emi Shinohara, Akihiko Ishizumi, Kenichi Suzumura, Ami Koshimizu, Yui Horie, Rie Kugimiya', 'TV-MA', 'As customary per year, the entire family is gathering on the island for a conference that discusses the current financial situations of each respective person. Because of the family head''s poor health, this year involves the topic of the head of the family''s inheritance and how it will be distributed. However, the family is unaware that the distribution of his wealth is the least of Ushiromiya Kinzo''s concerns for this year''s family conference. After being told that his end was approaching by his longtime friend and physician, Kinzo is desperate to meet his life''s true love one last time: the Golden Witch, Beatrice. Having immersed himself in black magic for many of the later years in his life, Kinzo instigates a ceremony to revive his beloved upon his family''s arrival on Rokkenjima.', 'As customary per year, the entire family is gathering on the island for a conference that discusses the current financial situations of each respective person. Because of the family head''s poor health, this year involves the topic of the head of the family''s inheritance and how it will be distributed. However, the family is unaware that the distribution of his wealth is the least of Ushiromiya Kinzo''s concerns for this year''s family conference. After being told that his end was approaching by his longtime friend and physician, Kinzo is desperate to meet his life''s true love one last time: the Golden Witch, Beatrice. Having immersed himself in black magic for many of the later years in his life, Kinzo instigates a ceremony to revive his beloved upon his family''s arrival on Rokkenjima.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSXaOtStb2vyNoGQSSXLT5EG0g7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:25499'),
  ('255967940297759452', 'Un Amore', 2024, 'Drama', 'Enrico Audenino, Stefano Accorsi', null, 'Stefano Accorsi, Micaela Ramazzotti, Ottavia Piccolo, Alessandro Tedeschi, Ivan Zerbinati, Camille Dugay Comencini, Beatrice Fiorentini, Federico Pasquali', null, 'Alessandro and Anna, just over the age of 18, meet by chance during an Interrail trip to Spain. It is a hot summer in the late 1990s, and the two immediately fall in love. Their lives, however, are much more complicated than the fate that brought them together, and soon the two are forced to separate. Over the years they remain linked by an intense correspondence, never able to muster the courage to see each other. However, 20 years after their first meeting and now adults, they meet again in Bologna. Their feeling, which has never faded over time, will have to clash with the interferences of a reality more complex than the one they had created only through words.', 'Alessandro and Anna, just over the age of 18, meet by chance during an Interrail trip to Spain. It is a hot summer in the late 1990s, and the two immediately fall in love. Their lives, however, are much more complicated than the fate that brought them together, and soon the two are forced to separate. Over the years they remain linked by an intense correspondence, never able to muster the courage to see each other. However, 20 years after their first meeting and now adults, they meet again in Bologna. Their feeling, which has never faded over time, will have to clash with the interferences of a reality more complex than the one they had created only through words.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/814wqppJW0E4vmJMvhiYkEEdK2G.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:246395'),
