  ('74246272902710858', 'Un paso adelante', 2002, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Pilar Nadal, Daniel Écija, Ernesto Pozuelo', null, 'Beatriz Luengo, Mónica Cruz, Miguel Ángel Muñoz, Pablo Puyol, Silvia Marty, Dafne Fernández, Toni Acosta, Lola Herrera', 'NR', 'Un Paso Adelante was a Spanish TV drama similar to the American 1980’s TV series Fame. It was originally broadcast on Spanish channel Antena 3 from 2002 to 2005. It has also been a huge success in Spanish-speaking countries, in Germany, Italy, Serbia, Montenegro and in France. It began airing on Séries+ in Canada in 2011.', 'Un Paso Adelante was a Spanish TV drama similar to the American 1980’s TV series Fame. It was originally broadcast on Spanish channel Antena 3 from 2002 to 2005. It has also been a huge success in Spanish-speaking countries, in Germany, Italy, Serbia, Montenegro and in France. It began airing on Séries+ in Canada in 2011.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snJhxuAN0GbfCEUjToWXiIuTElo.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:6798'),
  ('996738746139983186', 'Un poquito tuyo', 2018, null, null, null, 'Jorge Salinas, Marjorie de Sousa, Lorena Herrera, Raúl Coronado, Thalí García, David Palacio, David Caro Levy, Carlos Speitzer', null, 'When his spoiled family forgets his birthday, hardworking and generous successful executive Antonio decides to cut them off unless they work for their money.', 'When his spoiled family forgets his birthday, hardworking and generous successful executive Antonio decides to cut them off unless they work for their money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPyfFJggPsifnBe8wzG8O4EGnx7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88094'),
