  ('846247469813479990', 'Uncle from Another World', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Takehito Koyasu, Jun Fukuyama, Mikako Komatsu, Haruka Tomatsu, Aoi Yuuki, Aki Toyosaki, Kenichi Suzumura, Nobuhiko Okamoto', 'TV-MA', 'After being in a coma for 17 years, Takafumi''s middle-aged uncle suddenly wakes up speaking an unrecognizable language and wielding magical powers.', 'After being in a coma for 17 years, Takafumi''s middle-aged uncle suddenly wakes up speaking an unrecognizable language and wielding magical powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ixYH9Ngm3IcPtK4964jbvB0Czi9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127714'),
  ('1127324500850555767', 'Uncle Grandpa', 2013, 'Comedy, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family', 'Peter Browngardt', null, 'Peter Browngardt, Eric Bauza, Kevin Michael Richardson, Adam Devine', 'TV-PG', 'The adventures of Uncle Grandpa who is out to help every child and adult in the world through the power of imagination. With his mystical R.V. and eternal optimism, Uncle Grandpa is always ready to greet the day - and everyone he meets - with his signature, "Good Mornin''."', 'The adventures of Uncle Grandpa who is out to help every child and adult in the world through the power of imagination. With his mystical R.V. and eternal optimism, Uncle Grandpa is always ready to greet the day - and everyone he meets - with his signature, "Good Mornin''."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLVOgigPMsd2hkwmcY5AqNhqgcn.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:47035'),
  ('862734834119743187', 'Uncles', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jelle De Beule, Koen de Poorter , Rik Verheye', null, 'Jelle De Beule, Isabelle Van Hecke, Rik Verheye, Wim Willaert, Blaise Afonso, Emilie De Roo, Silke Thorrez, Assa Sylla', null, 'Three middle-aged brothers and their families are turned upside down when an unexpected guest, a refugee from Cameroon, shows up on their doorstep.', 'Three middle-aged brothers and their families are turned upside down when an unexpected guest, a refugee from Cameroon, shows up on their doorstep.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/czAyMCcGsDX8FQgvKYB6U7cLYEe.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:158576'),
  ('985079309855248184', 'Uncontrollably Fond', 2016, 'Drama', 'Lee Kyoung-hee', 'Lee Kyoung-hee', 'Kim Woo-bin, Suzy, Lim Ju-hwan, Im Joo-eun, Jin Kyung, Choi Moo-seong, Jang He-ryung, Kim Min-young', null, 'The memory of their painful breakup still fresh in their minds, two former lovers reunite years later as a top actor and a documentary producer.', 'The memory of their painful breakup still fresh in their minds, two former lovers reunite years later as a top actor and a documentary producer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oFi7YZuLWRE2K5ggkfBjVb60jrb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66272'),
  ('578653888615588258', 'Uncoupled', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Jeffrey Richman, Darren Star', null, 'Neil Patrick Harris, Tisha Campbell, Emerson Brooks, Brooks Ashmanskas, Elizabeth Piper S.', 'TV-MA', 'Michael thought his life was perfect until his husband blindsided him by walking out after 17 years. Michael has to confront two nightmares — losing his soulmate and suddenly finding himself a single gay man in his mid-40s.', 'Michael thought his life was perfect until his husband blindsided him by walking out after 17 years. Michael has to confront two nightmares — losing his soulmate and suddenly finding himself a single gay man in his mid-40s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ckwIGJghs2AuUcjyhByRlXNMBYZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:201380'),
  ('1046812186373146271', 'Uncoupled in Rio', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Dani Valente, Mina Nercessian', 'Dani Valente, Mina Nercessian', 'Letícia Lima, Gabriel Godoy, Rômulo Arantes Neto, Letícia Isnard, Solange Teixeira, Marcelo Laham, Matheus Macena, Danni Suzuki', null, 'A couple breaks up but is forced to live in the same apartment together for financial reasons.', 'A couple breaks up but is forced to live in the same apartment together for financial reasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79J57FjKOFWmN9cWHDg7qjs6aqm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:123381'),
  ('1004147512014765168', 'Undateable', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Adam Sztykiel', null, 'Chris D''Elia, Brent Morin, Ron Funches, Bianca Kajlich, David Fynn, Rick Glassman, Bridgit Mendler', 'TV-14', 'Danny Burton is a 30-ish carefree single guy who has watched most of his friends move on to serious relationships. When his last remaining friend Shannon moves out to get married, Danny searches for a new roommate. A promising candidate is Justin, the owner of Black Eyes Bar in Detroit (frequently mispronounced "Black Guys Bar"). Justin and his friends - the nerdy Burski, oddball Shelly, and recently out-of-the-closet gay guy Brett - all have certain qualities that make them appear "undateable".', 'Danny Burton is a 30-ish carefree single guy who has watched most of his friends move on to serious relationships. When his last remaining friend Shannon moves out to get married, Danny searches for a new roommate. A promising candidate is Justin, the owner of Black Eyes Bar in Detroit (frequently mispronounced "Black Guys Bar"). Justin and his friends - the nerdy Burski, oddball Shelly, and recently out-of-the-closet gay guy Brett - all have certain qualities that make them appear "undateable".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4f8ZWo6ROu0zs1OtqRVAZ9SzbzZ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:51345'),
  ('820507035842772839', 'Undead Murder Farce', 2023, 'Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tomoyo Kurosawa, Taku Yashiro, Makoto Koichi', 'TV-14', 'In this world, creatures like vampires and werewolves still walk about, but Aya Rindo can’t say the same for herself. This beautiful disembodied head, carried by her maid Shizuku Hasei, is a detective in search of her stolen body. One evening, they meet half-human Oni Slayer Tsugaru Shunichi, who offers a lending hand. Now, the trio is traveling through Europe, solving mysteries along the way.', 'In this world, creatures like vampires and werewolves still walk about, but Aya Rindo can’t say the same for herself. This beautiful disembodied head, carried by her maid Shizuku Hasei, is a detective in search of her stolen body. One evening, they meet half-human Oni Slayer Tsugaru Shunichi, who offers a lending hand. Now, the trio is traveling through Europe, solving mysteries along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/piBcfGsjpUmPeErNKxG7RDHF682.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222785'),
  ('398258892034525245', 'Undead Unluck', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Moe Kahara, Yuichi Nakamura, Natsuki Hanae, Kenji Nomura, Aoi Yuuki, Koji Yusa, Mariya Ise, Rie Kugimiya', 'TV-MA', 'Andy, a Negator with the ability "Undead," has been long in search for someone with the ability to give him a ''real death.'' Fuko Izumo brings misfortune to those around her due to her ability "Unluck." The two decide to join the Union, an organization which aims to control and protect the world from unidentified phenomena. The two uncover the mystery of the world as they search for the "greatest death ever."', 'Andy, a Negator with the ability "Undead," has been long in search for someone with the ability to give him a ''real death.'' Fuko Izumo brings misfortune to those around her due to her ability "Unluck." The two decide to join the Union, an organization which aims to control and protect the world from unidentified phenomena. The two uncover the mystery of the world as they search for the "greatest death ever."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJYOYFlu4Vayz5xXJJuP7ViwHnT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209077'),
  ('735453276275048557', 'Undeclared', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Judd Apatow', null, 'Jay Baruchel, Carla Gallo, Charlie Hunnam, Monica Keena, Seth Rogen, Timm Sharp, Loudon Wainwright III', 'TV-14', 'College freshman Steve Karp, his girlfriend and their fellow dorm-mates embark on one the greatest experiences of their lives...unfortunately for Steve, his lonely and recently divorced father is tagging along for the ride.', 'College freshman Steve Karp, his girlfriend and their fellow dorm-mates embark on one the greatest experiences of their lives...unfortunately for Steve, his lonely and recently divorced father is tagging along for the ride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCCy0WYZvMxoz3LC2kyHX4Vy6eT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3948'),
  ('628855634797418779', 'Undefeated Bahamut Chronicle', 2016, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yukiyo Fujii, Mutsumi Tamura, Lynn, Shizuka Ishigami, Yurika Kubo, Risa Taneda, Ari Ozawa, Ryota Osaka', null, 'Lux, a former prince of an empire named Arcadia that was overthrown via a rebellion five years earlier, accidentally trespasses in a female dormitory''s bathing area, sees the kingdom''s new princess Lisesharte naked, incurring her wrath. Lisesharte then challenges Lux to a Drag-Ride duel. Drag-Rides are ancient armored mechanical weapons that have been excavated from ruins all around the world. Lux used to be called the strongest Drag-Knight, but now he''s known as the "undefeated weakest" Drag-Knight because he will absolutely not attack in battle. After his duel with Lisesharte, Lux ends up attending the female-only academy that trains royals to be Drag-Knights.', 'Lux, a former prince of an empire named Arcadia that was overthrown via a rebellion five years earlier, accidentally trespasses in a female dormitory''s bathing area, sees the kingdom''s new princess Lisesharte naked, incurring her wrath. Lisesharte then challenges Lux to a Drag-Ride duel. Drag-Rides are ancient armored mechanical weapons that have been excavated from ruins all around the world. Lux used to be called the strongest Drag-Knight, but now he''s known as the "undefeated weakest" Drag-Knight because he will absolutely not attack in battle. After his duel with Lisesharte, Lux ends up attending the female-only academy that trains royals to be Drag-Knights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ymEG0G9uMSzTa5PZLDvs8UjJ9zs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65816'),
  ('229981520280961321', 'Undeniable', 2014, 'Drama, Mystery', null, 'Chris Lang', 'Claire Goose, Peter Firth, Christine Bottomley, Robert Pugh, Pippa Haywood', null, 'Nearly a quarter of a century after she witnessed the murder of her mother, Jane Fielding is married and has a daughter of her own, but the traumatic events of that day still haunt her. She constantly aware that the murderer is still at large. While on a routine visit to hospital, she locks eyes with the man she believes killed her mother.', 'Nearly a quarter of a century after she witnessed the murder of her mother, Jane Fielding is married and has a daughter of her own, but the traumatic events of that day still haunt her. She constantly aware that the murderer is still at large. While on a routine visit to hospital, she locks eyes with the man she believes killed her mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8GixCmMoqysyxLGbNrLXHARkpCg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64072'),
  ('885480117023335286', 'Under a Dark Sun', 2025, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Nils-Antoine Sambuc', null, 'Isabelle Adjani, Ava Baya, Louise Coldefy, Guillaume Gouix, Thibault de Montalembert, Claire Romain, Nicolas Vaude, Simon Ehrlacher', 'TV-MA', 'On the run from her troubled past, a young mother is accused of killing her new boss at a flower farm just before discovering he''s actually her father.', 'On the run from her troubled past, a young mother is accused of killing her new boss at a flower farm just before discovering he''s actually her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qRpM05HzTidQFJLKnoXlvqAVcrr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:272466'),
  ('134253142246061992', 'Under Control', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Charly Delwart', 'Benjamin Charbit, Charly Delwart', 'Léa Drucker, Samir Guesmi, Laurent Stocker, Samuel Churin, Patrick d''Assumçao, Lionel Laget, Machita Daly, Youssef Sahraoui', null, 'Marie, ex-head of a humanitarian NGO, is appointed French Minister for Diplomatic Relations. On her first day she has to deal with 5 European kept hostage in the Sael region she knows well.', 'Marie, ex-head of a humanitarian NGO, is appointed French Minister for Diplomatic Relations. On her first day she has to deal with 5 European kept hostage in the Sael region she knows well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5BcEbklUVpDNbd0rDwvvZUptAoy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:220044'),
  ('224709302862269490', 'Under Fire', 2021, 'Drama', 'Carl Plaisier, Toon Anthoni, Jasper Moeyaert', 'Nore Maatala, Laura Van Passel, Toon Anthoni', 'Louis Talpe, Ismail L''Hamiti, Lien De Graeve, Wouter Bruneel, Vincent Van Sande, Kasper Vandenberghe, Anushka Melkonian, Ellen Sterckx', null, 'At East Bank Station, a close-knit team of firefighters must balance a dangerous, high-stress job, personal challenges and professional setbacks.', 'At East Bank Station, a close-knit team of firefighters must balance a dangerous, high-stress job, personal challenges and professional setbacks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2oXF52JveZKcseNCbrZgC7JRWOU.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:122169'),
  ('71891081280057484', 'Under Military Law', 2015, 'War & Politics, Action & Adventure, Crime', null, null, 'Evgeniy Volovenko, Ekaterina Klimova, Aleksandr Pankratov-Chyornyy, Maksim Drozd', null, 'It is July 1941, and the Nazis are advancing towards Kyiv. A special squad is tasked with investigating major cases by acting both at the frontline and in the city itself, where rising criminals are joining German subversives in infiltrating the city, while a number of Soviet government representatives are happily profiting from other people’s misery.', 'It is July 1941, and the Nazis are advancing towards Kyiv. A special squad is tasked with investigating major cases by acting both at the frontline and in the city itself, where rising criminals are joining German subversives in infiltrating the city, while a number of Soviet government representatives are happily profiting from other people’s misery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xddq2DjbndsMK5UMJPUv7lWtNCm.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:70555'),
  ('71694373433801276', 'UNDER NINJA', 2023, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Taito Ban, Atsumi Tanezaki, Tarusuke Shingaki, Tasuku Hatanaka, Kouichi Souma, Chika Anzai, Cho', null, 'Thousands of ninjas live in secret across Japan. One underachieving ninja spends his days doing nothing — until he receives a special mission.', 'Thousands of ninjas live in secret across Japan. One underachieving ninja spends his days doing nothing — until he receives a special mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uliIvGVI92s0C26jBOxaiSNUH1v.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132917'),
  ('845815880035715483', 'Under One Roof', 1993, 'Drama, Family', null, null, 'Noriko Sakai, Masaharu Fukuyama, Yosuke Eguchi, Reiko Chiba, Jun Fubuki, Yumi Adachi, Takako Matsu, Miki Nakatani', null, 'Hitotsu Yane no Shita is a Japanese television series. It had a first season in 1993 and a second season, titled Hitotsu Yane no Shita 2, in 1997. It was very popular in Japan, with its highest rating being a remarkable 34 percent and it was also exported to other regions in East Asia. It features Yosuke Eguchi, Noriko Sakai and Masaharu Fukuyama as its leading characters.', 'Hitotsu Yane no Shita is a Japanese television series. It had a first season in 1993 and a second season, titled Hitotsu Yane no Shita 2, in 1997. It was very popular in Japan, with its highest rating being a remarkable 34 percent and it was also exported to other regions in East Asia. It features Yosuke Eguchi, Noriko Sakai and Masaharu Fukuyama as its leading characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2OMNiqwRY203TFsgj3pgHFoTcRy.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:9114'),
  ('330864297236654661', 'Under Pressure', 2017, 'Drama', 'Jorge Furtado, Renato Fagundes, Luiz Noronha', 'Jorge Furtado, Lucas Paraizo, Márcio Alemão', 'Júlio Andrade, Marjorie Estiano, Pablo Sanábio, Stepan Nercessian, Bruno Garcia, Josie Antello, Julia Shimura, Drica Moraes', 'NR', 'Inside a chaotic emergency room in Rio de Janeiro, a team of doctors are torn between their internal personal conflicts, the difficulties of the profession and the surprising dramas behind each patient‘s history, in a heroic attempt to save lives...See more', 'Inside a chaotic emergency room in Rio de Janeiro, a team of doctors are torn between their internal personal conflicts, the difficulties of the profession and the surprising dramas behind each patient‘s history, in a heroic attempt to save lives...See more', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nv9ay0scDNf92evgnyNejpnifZ6.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:73010'),
  ('921197765127048284', 'Under Salt Marsh', 2026, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Claire Oakley', 'Claire Oakley, Jonathan Harbottle, Nikita Lalwani', 'Kelly Reilly, Rafe Spall, Jonathan Pryce, Naomi Yang, Harry Lawtey, Bevan Thomas', null, 'Morfa Halen is a tight-knit Welsh town precariously nestled between towering mountains and a fast-encroaching sea that threatens its very existence. As a once-in-a-generation storm begins to gather far out at sea, former detective turned teacher Jackie Ellis discovers the body of her 8-year-old pupil, Cefin, seemingly drowned. The discovery sends shockwaves through the community, reviving the ghost of an unsolved cold case that rocked the town three years prior - the disappearance of Jackie’s niece, Nessa, which cost her career.', 'Morfa Halen is a tight-knit Welsh town precariously nestled between towering mountains and a fast-encroaching sea that threatens its very existence. As a once-in-a-generation storm begins to gather far out at sea, former detective turned teacher Jackie Ellis discovers the body of her 8-year-old pupil, Cefin, seemingly drowned. The discovery sends shockwaves through the community, reviving the ghost of an unsolved cold case that rocked the town three years prior - the disappearance of Jackie’s niece, Nessa, which cost her career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQK2X9gAetMpqFl5qWssOgtNi4o.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:262262'),
  ('782455731454892147', 'Under the Banner of Heaven', 2022, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Dustin Lance Black', null, 'Andrew Garfield, Sam Worthington, Daisy Edgar-Jones, Denise Gough, Wyatt Russell, Billy Howle, Chloe Pirrie, Seth Numrich', 'TV-MA', 'A devout detective''s faith is tested as he investigates a brutal murder that seems to be connected to an esteemed Utah family''s spiral into LDS fundamentalism and their distrust in the government.', 'A devout detective''s faith is tested as he investigates a brutal murder that seems to be connected to an esteemed Utah family''s spiral into LDS fundamentalism and their distrust in the government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKyXUkyKRg9LdZzZWRzk0eKD5HJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128095'),
  ('70911664537360874', 'Under the Bridge', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', 'Quinn Shephard', null, 'Lily Gladstone, Riley Keough, Vritika Gupta, Chloe Guidry, Javon Walton, Izzy G., Aiyana Goodfellow, Ezra Faroque Khan', 'TV-MA', 'Fourteen-year old Reena Virk went to join friends at a party and never returned home. Through the eyes of Rebecca Godfrey and a local police officer, learn the hidden world of the young girls accused of the murder — revealing startling truths about the unlikely killer.', 'Fourteen-year old Reena Virk went to join friends at a party and never returned home. Through the eyes of Rebecca Godfrey and a local police officer, learn the hidden world of the young girls accused of the murder — revealing startling truths about the unlikely killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4YMpCGsAAHXWGScHsK1sbd7wprE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211358'),
  ('427515586645721155', 'Under the Canopy of Love', 2006, 'Drama', 'Sum-Wai Wong', null, 'Niki Chow Lai-Kei, Kevin Cheng Ka-Wing, Bosco Wong Chung-Chak, Claire Yiu, Natalie Tong, Benz Hui Siu-Hung, Angela Tong Ying-Ying, Ha Yue', null, 'Because of a lost personal device, the lovely and childlike Fiona Ko Yat-Sze is brought together with her Prince Charming, a boy whom she had had a crush on since school days. Alan Shum Long is the Prince Charming, who, after graduation from school, lost touch with Yat-Sze. Later, Yat-Sze meets Nick Kuen Lik, who happens to be the long lost son of the mall''s rich owner. The simple and honest Nick starts to like Yat-Sze. Meanwhile, another woman falls for Alan...', 'Because of a lost personal device, the lovely and childlike Fiona Ko Yat-Sze is brought together with her Prince Charming, a boy whom she had had a crush on since school days. Alan Shum Long is the Prince Charming, who, after graduation from school, lost touch with Yat-Sze. Later, Yat-Sze meets Nick Kuen Lik, who happens to be the long lost son of the mall''s rich owner. The simple and honest Nick starts to like Yat-Sze. Meanwhile, another woman falls for Alan...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kaKElQiNjfHzfl4s8wfI1cFSXXV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3140'),
  ('904238269131361344', 'Under the Dome', 2013, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Brian K. Vaughan', null, 'Mike Vogel, Rachelle Lefevre, Alexander Koch, Eddie Cahill, Colin Ford, Kylie Bunbury, Dean Norris, Mackenzie Lintz', 'TV-14', 'A small town is suddenly and inexplicably sealed off from the rest of the world by an enormous transparent dome. While military forces, the government and the media positioned outside of this surrounding barrier attempt to break it down, a small group of people inside attempt to figure out what the dome is, where it came from, and when (and if) it will go away.', 'A small town is suddenly and inexplicably sealed off from the rest of the world by an enormous transparent dome. While military forces, the government and the media positioned outside of this surrounding barrier attempt to break it down, a small group of people inside attempt to figure out what the dome is, where it came from, and when (and if) it will go away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwH0ePhd7m3swtCuFeubtR49ZTd.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:46331'),
  ('697365385045520111', 'Under the Microscope', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Ma Boyong', 'Rongyang Zhou', 'Zhang Ruoyun, Qi Wei, Wang Yang, Wu Gang, Gao Yalin, Fei Qiming, Hou Yansong, Zhai Xiaoxing', null, 'When Shuai Jiamo, who is obsessed with mathematics, stumbles upon a historical problem in Jinhua County, he was met with multiple obstacles in his attempts to correct the mistake, triggering a tension between various stakeholders.', 'When Shuai Jiamo, who is obsessed with mathematics, stumbles upon a historical problem in Jinhua County, he was met with multiple obstacles in his attempts to correct the mistake, triggering a tension between various stakeholders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/amQahTC0Kj6KQDDDdDEazsZTsex.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:139169'),
  ('1052427466201384747', 'Under the Moonlight', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Hu Bingqing, Zhai Zilu, He Peng, Ding Xiaoying, Feng Xiaotong, Li Jiaxin, Zhai Yujia, Sun Yali', null, 'Luo Shu, a woman skilled in understanding human nature, teams up with magistrate Han Muzhi to solve a series of complex and mysterious cases. Along the way, she forms a bond with Qi Menglin, and together, they uncover hidden secrets and injustices, while a larger conspiracy looms in the background.', 'Luo Shu, a woman skilled in understanding human nature, teams up with magistrate Han Muzhi to solve a series of complex and mysterious cases. Along the way, she forms a bond with Qi Menglin, and together, they uncover hidden secrets and injustices, while a larger conspiracy looms in the background.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9u2NXEAGNwStvaLEG89XDup1wm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:261834'),
  ('468690779404807619', 'Under the Queen''s Umbrella', 2022, 'Drama', 'Kim Hyung-sik, Park Ba-ra', 'Park Ba-ra', 'Kim Hye-soo, Kim Hae-sook, Choi Won-young, Moon Seong-hyun, Kim Eui-sung, Kang Chan-hee, Moon Sang-min, Ok Ja-yeon', null, 'A spirited queen tries to rein in her rowdy sons in order to make one of them the next king of Joseon, while her competitors vie to snatch the throne.', 'A spirited queen tries to rein in her rowdy sons in order to make one of them the next king of Joseon, while her competitors vie to snatch the throne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9CIjlNBlyHbrzhTa5PoIjCUxwRP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156406'),
  ('80328728190453773', 'Under The Skin', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', null, '张莱', 'Tan Jianci, Jin Shijia, Zhang Bojia, Zhu Jiaqi, Lu Yanqi, Qin Hailu, Zhou Yanchen, Zheng Yunlong', null, 'Young artist Shen Yi''s life changes when a commission leads to a police case gone wrong. Seven years later, he joins the Criminal Investigation Unit as a portraitist alongside Captain Du Cheng.', 'Young artist Shen Yi''s life changes when a commission leads to a police case gone wrong. Seven years later, he joins the Criminal Investigation Unit as a portraitist alongside Captain Du Cheng.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1MzUsaItPeMd9L1QGeqN8SOdkv.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:139797'),
  ('67858724007596810', 'Under the Veil', 2015, 'Drama', null, null, 'Wayne Lai Yiu-Cheung, Bosco Wong Chung-Chak, Kristal Tin Yui-Nei, Eliza Sam, Sonija Kwok Sin-Nae, Raymond Ho-Yin Wong, Katy Kung, Raymond Chiu', null, 'The drama is told in three separate folklore stories about love, lust, vanity, greed and selfishness. {Changing Pins} - Male and female fraternal twins fall in love with different men with the same appearance. The older male twin has an homosexual affair with a Prince of the Liao Kingdom, while the female twin falls in love with a poor scholar. {Judge Lu} - A poor scholar has an affair with a courtesan that resembles his wife. {Chasing Fish} - A scholar becomes the object of affection to a fish spirit and human girl with the face.', 'The drama is told in three separate folklore stories about love, lust, vanity, greed and selfishness. {Changing Pins} - Male and female fraternal twins fall in love with different men with the same appearance. The older male twin has an homosexual affair with a Prince of the Liao Kingdom, while the female twin falls in love with a poor scholar. {Judge Lu} - A poor scholar has an affair with a courtesan that resembles his wife. {Chasing Fish} - A scholar becomes the object of affection to a fish spirit and human girl with the face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJyQSfBo0818gnlFKcFKm5bnjG0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95198'),
  ('749834160474904056', 'Under the Vines', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Erin White', null, 'Rebecca Gibney, Charles Edwards, Robbie Magasiva, Sarah Peirse, John Bach', null, 'Rebecca Gibney and Charles Edwards star as two city slickers who inherit a failing vineyard in rural New Zealand.. the only problems are that neither of them has ever done a hard days'' work- and they despise one another.', 'Rebecca Gibney and Charles Edwards star as two city slickers who inherit a failing vineyard in rural New Zealand.. the only problems are that neither of them has ever done a hard days'' work- and they despise one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDr6q0lQMToNxBom8SPeLzZLE1Z.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:139154'),
  ('549934510426863993', 'Underbelly', 2008, 'Drama', null, null, 'Jared Daperis', 'TV-MA', 'Underbelly is an Australian television true crime-drama series, each series is a stand alone story based on real-life events.', 'Underbelly is an Australian television true crime-drama series, each series is a stand alone story based on real-life events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6BQ3YYR4Xe4LsOkhazqxKprQ3O.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:13796');
