values
  ('1031045739115759619', 'Undercover', 2011, 'Crime, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Dimitar Mitovski', 'Iordan Bankov, Emil Andreev', 'Boyko Krastanov, Zahari Baharov, Ivaylo Zahariev, Vladimir Penev, Marian Valev, Kiril Efremov, Yoanna Temelkova, Hristo Petkov', 'TV-MA', 'Just an ordinary boy from the Sofia suburbs becomes the first bulgarian undercover cop. Forced by his father when he was young to lie and cheat, Martin becomes the perfect liar. That skill, and also the hatred of the ''underworld'' makes him the perfect match for a dangerous mission - to infiltrate the crime organisation of a rich and powerful businessman. While infiltrating and living in fear of being uncovered, Martin falls in love with the most inappropriate woman - Djaro''s girlfriend, Suni. Just when he gains the trust of the mobsters, it appears that the real enemy is in the police. Martin is alone against all, facing difficult decisions.', 'Just an ordinary boy from the Sofia suburbs becomes the first bulgarian undercover cop. Forced by his father when he was young to lie and cheat, Martin becomes the perfect liar. That skill, and also the hatred of the ''underworld'' makes him the perfect match for a dangerous mission - to infiltrate the crime organisation of a rich and powerful businessman. While infiltrating and living in fear of being uncovered, Martin falls in love with the most inappropriate woman - Djaro''s girlfriend, Suni. Just when he gains the trust of the mobsters, it appears that the real enemy is in the police. Martin is alone against all, facing difficult decisions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1XPfSUFnrBYZgEmFmSwWqVJDjt.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:43424'),
  ('1014539077837176158', 'Undercover', 2016, 'Drama', 'Peter Moffat', 'Peter Moffat', 'Sophie Okonedo, Adrian Lester, Dennis Haysbert, Alistair Petrie, Tamara Lawrance, Shannon Hayes, Daniel Ezra, David Schofield', 'NR', 'Undercover follows Maya, the first black Director Of Public Prosecutions. Just as she is about to take up the post and her life comes under intense public scrutiny, she learns that that her husband Nick has been lying to her for years. Twenty years ago Nick was a fearless and dedicated undercover officer, infiltrating organisations considered a danger to society because of their political beliefs. Nick built himself a fake past and now with his wife unsuspecting and his conscience killing him – his secret identity may compromise the new Director of Public Prosecutions.', 'Undercover follows Maya, the first black Director Of Public Prosecutions. Just as she is about to take up the post and her life comes under intense public scrutiny, she learns that that her husband Nick has been lying to her for years. Twenty years ago Nick was a fearless and dedicated undercover officer, infiltrating organisations considered a danger to society because of their political beliefs. Nick built himself a fake past and now with his wife unsuspecting and his conscience killing him – his secret identity may compromise the new Director of Public Prosecutions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oFnxDGtgmsF35E4B2wqT0Qsnmvo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64683'),
  ('75400617693102982', 'Undercover', 2019, 'Crime, Drama', 'Piet Matthys, Bart Uytdenhouwen, Nico Moolenaar', null, 'Tom Waes, Frank Lammers, Elise Schaap, Jeroen Van der Ven, Ruth Becquart, Murat Seven, Nazmiye Oral, Gökhan Girginol', 'TV-MA', 'Undercover agents infiltrate a drug kingpin''s operation by posing as a couple at the campground where he spends his weekends. Inspired by real events.', 'Undercover agents infiltrate a drug kingpin''s operation by posing as a couple at the campground where he spends his weekends. Inspired by real events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ziOJNiNUbomrs81behksd0z9Qoz.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:86942'),
  ('802780540783520046', 'Undercover', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Action & Adventure, Mystery', null, null, 'Ji Jin-hee, Kim Hyun-joo, Yeon Woo-jin, Han Seon-hwa, Huh Joon-ho, Jeong Man-sik, Han Go-eun, Son Jong-hak', null, '“Undercover” depicts the story of Han Jung Hyun, who has been hiding his identity for a long time, and Choi Yeon Soo, a human rights lawyer who becomes the first head of the Senior Civil Servant Corruption Investigations Unit to fight for justice.', '“Undercover” depicts the story of Han Jung Hyun, who has been hiding his identity for a long time, and Choi Yeon Soo, a human rights lawyer who becomes the first head of the Senior Civil Servant Corruption Investigations Unit to fight for justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ghjMzLPiFIcui0Kc1xIiJemdltg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:120318'),
  ('503017032757790589', 'Undercover Billionaire', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, 'Glenn Stearns', null, 'Billionaire Glenn Stearns attempts a monumental challenge that most would claim is impossible. Follow this self-made mogul to see if he can build a million-dollar company in just 90 days.', 'Billionaire Glenn Stearns attempts a monumental challenge that most would claim is impossible. Follow this self-made mogul to see if he can build a million-dollar company in just 90 days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pswRxPyJ56QgFVBBI9MBZ045tMk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:91987'),
  ('782319658269544880', 'Undercover Boss', 2010, 'Reality, Comedy', 'Stephen Lambert', null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Reality series that follows high-level executives as they slip anonymously into the rank-and-file of their own organizations. Each week, a different leader will sacrifice the comfort of their corner office for an undercover mission to examine the inner workings of their operation.', 'Reality series that follows high-level executives as they slip anonymously into the rank-and-file of their own organizations. Each week, a different leader will sacrifice the comfort of their corner office for an undercover mission to examine the inner workings of their operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tyydTLz1HFiMWdTXoQxclJJpsUz.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:33297'),
  ('239270398071869270', 'Undercover Boss', 2012, 'Reality', 'Stephen Lambert', null, null, null, 'A boss is going to attempt an incredible experiment: going back down to the bottom of the ladder and working for a week in his own company, incognito. He will give up his status as CEO and his comfortable lifestyle to become a simple apprentice in his own business once again. To remain incognito among his employees, he will transform himself and change his identity.', 'A boss is going to attempt an incredible experiment: going back down to the bottom of the ladder and working for a week in his own company, incognito. He will give up his status as CEO and his comfortable lifestyle to become a simple apprentice in his own business once again. To remain incognito among his employees, he will transform himself and change his identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wRaJmrXbqInpxoZGhSSHa4yHfX0.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:72576'),
  ('756538563050436148', 'Undercover High School', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Im Young-bin, Choi Jeong-in', 'Im Young-bin', 'Seo Kang-joon, Jin Ki-joo, Kim Shin-rock, Kim Min-ju, Yoon Ga-i, Kim Young-ah, Lee Hyun So, Yun Chae-bin', null, 'Ace NIS agent Jung Hae-seong is demoted after a mission failure. He goes undercover at a high school to locate King Gojong''s missing gold, meeting his teacher Oh Soo-ah, who sees him as her lost first love, stirring old heartbreak.', 'Ace NIS agent Jung Hae-seong is demoted after a mission failure. He goes undercover at a high school to locate King Gojong''s missing gold, meeting his teacher Oh Soo-ah, who sees him as her lost first love, stirring old heartbreak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vXAWUI1pYrBvZoUarGxWj1mtlXp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:248244'),
  ('1126996665945701610', 'Undercover Miss Hong', 2026, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Park Shin-hye, Go Kyung-pyo, Ha Yoon-kyung, Cho Han-gyeol, Yuna, Lee Duck-hwa, Kim Hyeong-mook, Kim Won-hae', null, 'A retro office comedy depicting the chaotic events that unfold in the late 1990s when Sammo Hung, a 30-year-old elite securities supervisor who only cares about work, goes undercover as a 20-year-old high school graduate employee at a securities firm where suspicious money flows are detected.', 'A retro office comedy depicting the chaotic events that unfold in the late 1990s when Sammo Hung, a 30-year-old elite securities supervisor who only cares about work, goes undercover as a 20-year-old high school graduate employee at a securities firm where suspicious money flows are detected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKIRkUyblxREM3k22JS5j64Bkox.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:293608'),
  ('509127412604060707', 'Undercovers', 2010, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'J.J. Abrams, Josh Reims', null, 'Gugu Mbatha-Raw, Boris Kodjoe, Ben Schwartz, Gerald McRaney, Jessica Parker Kennedy, Victor Alfieri, Mekia Cox, Sean Maguire', null, 'Five years after leaving the CIA to open a catering company, Steven and Samantha Bloom are recruited back into the agency by Carlton Shaw. They take on special missions the average agent cannot handle. Having made a pact to never discuss their pasts with each other, the Blooms find surprising new things about their spouse in the course of each mission.', 'Five years after leaving the CIA to open a catering company, Steven and Samantha Bloom are recruited back into the agency by Carlton Shaw. They take on special missions the average agent cannot handle. Having made a pact to never discuss their pasts with each other, the Blooms find surprising new things about their spouse in the course of each mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ElsQd9lz8bPArb8WyyC7pfoLVH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31865'),
  ('469698472272447175', 'Undercurrent: The Disappearance of Kim Wall', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Peter Madsen, Kim Wall', 'TV-MA', 'An investigation into the disappearance of journalist Kim Wall while on board Danish entrepreneur Peter Madsen''s self-made submarine.', 'An investigation into the disappearance of journalist Kim Wall while on board Danish entrepreneur Peter Madsen''s self-made submarine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w6xhLDm94wb47HrRd8rGwW0Ziwf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158787'),
  ('963143824562292657', 'Underdog', 1964, 'Animation, Comedy', 'W. Watts Biggers', null, 'Wally Cox, Sandy Becker, Kenny Delmar, George S. Irving, Mort Marshall, Norma MacMillan, Delo States, Ben Stone', null, 'Underdog, also known as The Underdog Show, is an American Saturday morning animated television series that ran from October 3, 1964, to March 4, 1967, starting on the NBC network until 1966, with the rest of the run on CBS, under the primary sponsorship of General Mills, for a run of 62 episodes. It is one of the early Saturday morning cartoons. The show continued in syndication until 1973. Underdog, Shoeshine Boy''s heroic alter ego, appears whenever love interest Sweet Polly Purebred is being victimized by such villains as Simon Bar Sinister or Riff Raff. Underdog nearly always speaks in rhyming couplets, as in "There''s no need to fear, Underdog is here!"', 'Underdog, also known as The Underdog Show, is an American Saturday morning animated television series that ran from October 3, 1964, to March 4, 1967, starting on the NBC network until 1966, with the rest of the run on CBS, under the primary sponsorship of General Mills, for a run of 62 episodes. It is one of the early Saturday morning cartoons. The show continued in syndication until 1973. Underdog, Shoeshine Boy''s heroic alter ego, appears whenever love interest Sweet Polly Purebred is being victimized by such villains as Simon Bar Sinister or Riff Raff. Underdog nearly always speaks in rhyming couplets, as in "There''s no need to fear, Underdog is here!"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ruDCGAKJsqkPB9qyWY9VV5B2BZ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:4979'),
  ('567603397072385895', 'Underdogs', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Ryan Reynolds', null, 'Follow the story of the heroic underdogs of the natural world – the good, the bad and the frankly ugly. From their hidden talents to their bold hygiene choices, unsavory courtship rituals, devious camouflage techniques and “tough love” parenting skills, Underdogs will celebrate and champion the unique and unpredictable behaviors of a little known and surprising cast of animal characters.', 'Follow the story of the heroic underdogs of the natural world – the good, the bad and the frankly ugly. From their hidden talents to their bold hygiene choices, unsavory courtship rituals, devious camouflage techniques and “tough love” parenting skills, Underdogs will celebrate and champion the unique and unpredictable behaviors of a little known and surprising cast of animal characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3QaBwLVPc8W71zC0E3D1j1R8ZLp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218257'),
  ('14545291851011210', 'Undergrads', 2001, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Pete Williams', null, 'Pete Williams, Rob Tinkler, Yannick Bisson, Katie Griffin, Jene Yeo, Susan Quinn', 'TV-14', 'Undergrads is an animated television series centered on the lives of four college undergraduate freshmen. Originally broadcast on MTV during 2001, only thirteen episodes were created. It has since been shown on Comedy Central in the United States, Teletoon in Canada, and Trouble in the United Kingdom. The show was conceived by Pete Williams, when he dropped out of college at the age of 19. Willams does most of the voices on the show. The series was produced by David McGrath.', 'Undergrads is an animated television series centered on the lives of four college undergraduate freshmen. Originally broadcast on MTV during 2001, only thirteen episodes were created. It has since been shown on Comedy Central in the United States, Teletoon in Canada, and Trouble in the United Kingdom. The show was conceived by Pete Williams, when he dropped out of college at the age of 19. Willams does most of the voices on the show. The series was produced by David McGrath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/924QEmUqLuvDrdVVPcAlHNxm04K.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3547'),
  ('775580370824928925', 'Underground', 2016, 'Drama', 'Joe Pokaski, Misha Green', null, 'Aldis Hodge, Jurnee Smollett, Christopher Meloni, Jessica De Gouw, Alano Miller, Brady Permenter, Darielle Stewart, Amirah Vann', 'TV-MA', 'A group of slaves plan a daring 600-mile escape from a Georgia plantation. Along the way, they are aided by a secret abolitionist couple running a station on the Underground Railroad as they attempt to evade the people charged with bringing them back, dead or alive.', 'A group of slaves plan a daring 600-mile escape from a Georgia plantation. Along the way, they are aided by a secret abolitionist couple running a station on the Underground Railroad as they attempt to evade the people charged with bringing them back, dead or alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hBgYiAHqZBY0ypGKMd8NzYbEwnq.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:64150'),
  ('620632416355868240', 'Undertaker: The Last Ride', 2020, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Vince McMahon, Mark Calaway', null, 'Mark Calaway, Michelle Calaway, Vince McMahon, Paul Levesque, Adam Copeland, Michael Hickenbottom', null, 'The anticipated WWE Network docuseries will look back on The Undertaker’s storied WWE career and place a focus on the ongoing challenges the wrestling legend appears to have with a career beginning to near it''s end.', 'The anticipated WWE Network docuseries will look back on The Undertaker’s storied WWE career and place a focus on the ongoing challenges the wrestling legend appears to have with a career beginning to near it''s end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ckKQrIUD9kKAtuTKEkybcajScyA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103026'),
  ('875076889330992454', 'Undone', 2019, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Kate Purdy, Raphael Bob-Waksberg', null, 'Rosa Salazar, Angelique Cabral, Constance Marie, Bob Odenkirk', 'TV-MA', 'After getting into a near fatal car accident, Alma discovers she has a new relationship with time and uses this ability to find out the truth about her father’s death.', 'After getting into a near fatal car accident, Alma discovers she has a new relationship with time and uses this ability to find out the truth about her father’s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1TZYhSTk6Bv7qqGc0233P3KQrA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:86340'),
  ('705412230477878403', 'Undressed', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jeff Goode', null, null, 'TV-14', 'A peek behind closed doors at the intricacies of modern relationships. Each episode features three different fictional stories and follows various characters to see what happened during their most intimate moments. No subject is too taboo. All the stories have one very important thing in common, though: someone inevitably gets undressed.', 'A peek behind closed doors at the intricacies of modern relationships. Each episode features three different fictional stories and follows various characters to see what happened during their most intimate moments. No subject is too taboo. All the stories have one very important thing in common, though: someone inevitably gets undressed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ge7irnaTcUvt6LpNe7ZGzzEKobb.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:6521'),
  ('693851919377351957', 'Unearthed', 2016, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Unearthed decodes mysteries and combines scientific investigations with CGI animation to reveal the hidden secrets of iconic structures and monuments from around the globe to discover how they were designed, built, used, and in some cases, lost and rediscovered.', 'Unearthed decodes mysteries and combines scientific investigations with CGI animation to reveal the hidden secrets of iconic structures and monuments from around the globe to discover how they were designed, built, used, and in some cases, lost and rediscovered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8s1NLGpOcEWbz2clNdHwJdAvdQo.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:71845'),
  ('831417444178081389', 'UNEND', 2024, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Xen, Sara Wile, Matt Roen', null, 'Xen, Sara Wile, Matt Roen', null, 'A supernatural ship and a remarkable crew set forth on an expedition to explore the highest heights, deepest depths, and furthest reaches of the known cosmos. But their journey is fraught with peril as they discover truths and realities far stranger than any of them could imagine.', 'A supernatural ship and a remarkable crew set forth on an expedition to explore the highest heights, deepest depths, and furthest reaches of the known cosmos. But their journey is fraught with peril as they discover truths and realities far stranger than any of them could imagine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r85ZiXx5hb0qmx9raNDnWQvcRSd.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:285232'),
  ('564437532927979663', 'Unexpected', 2017, 'Reality, Family', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'A raw look at three teenage pregnancies and the effects it has on their families as everyone prepares for the arrival of the babies.', 'A raw look at three teenage pregnancies and the effects it has on their families as everyone prepares for the arrival of the babies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/byrBF2COu2eErDp1EMDNhCAUdlz.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:75035'),
  ('163980079293246055', 'Unexpected Business', 2021, 'Talk, Reality', 'Yoo Ho-jin', 'Ji Hyun-sook', 'Cha Tae-hyun, Zo In-sung, Lim Ju-hwan, Yoon Kyung-ho', null, 'Set in a small, rural town, the show is about two friends, actors Zo In-sung and Cha Tae-hyun, running a supermarket for 10 days. They not only sell goods, but also operate small restaurant, where they cook and serve dishes. The two actors, who lived their whole lives in the city, experience life in the small town and blend into the neighborhood.', 'Set in a small, rural town, the show is about two friends, actors Zo In-sung and Cha Tae-hyun, running a supermarket for 10 days. They not only sell goods, but also operate small restaurant, where they cook and serve dishes. The two actors, who lived their whole lives in the city, experience life in the small town and blend into the neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xU3zUrA4gzakSoiSjpZAXnn6mTR.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:119645'),
  ('1038137946542209986', 'Unexpectedly Naughty Fukami', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Chasuke, Marshmallow Yakitaro', null, '"Why is a perfect specimen of a man like me getting this turned on by a guy like that?!" Thus begins the obstinate relationship of a playboy narcissist and a deceivingly frumpily-dressed, hot bodied otaku!', '"Why is a perfect specimen of a man like me getting this turned on by a guy like that?!" Thus begins the obstinate relationship of a playboy narcissist and a deceivingly frumpily-dressed, hot bodied otaku!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ktoY0ykNWt5eqjKNyZA1PPGkpsx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:284780'),
  ('56388144773284471', 'Unexpectedly Naughty Fukami', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ayaka Matsumoto', null, 'Kashio Atsuki, Yu Miyazaki', null, 'Office rivals Kaji and Fukami find their professional masks slipping during a business trip that turns a simple stay into a heated affair.', 'Office rivals Kaji and Fukami find their professional masks slipping during a business trip that turns a simple stay into a heated affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwlOfV3zPSUrsRUl9WFync5fYWI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:315312'),
  ('311019750057527037', 'Unfabulous', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Sue Rose', null, 'Emma Roberts, Jordan Calloway, Melise, Tadhg Kelly, Markus Flanagan, Molly Hagan, Chelsea Tavares, Emma Degerstedt', 'TV-Y7', 'Unfabulous is an American children''s television series that aired on Nickelodeon. The series is about an "unfabulous" 7th Grade middle school student named Addie Singer, played by Emma Roberts. The show, which debuted in late summer 2004, was one of the most-watched programs in the United States among children between the age of 10 and 16 and was created by Sue Rose, who previously created the animated series Pepper Ann and Angela Anaconda.', 'Unfabulous is an American children''s television series that aired on Nickelodeon. The series is about an "unfabulous" 7th Grade middle school student named Addie Singer, played by Emma Roberts. The show, which debuted in late summer 2004, was one of the most-watched programs in the United States among children between the age of 10 and 16 and was created by Sue Rose, who previously created the animated series Pepper Ann and Angela Anaconda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOqzMXvwAwIHGELwGP0HZB56AQy.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2967'),
  ('1030842052789740108', 'Unfair', 2006, 'Drama, Crime', 'Hideki Inada, Takehiko Hata', null, 'Ryoko Shinohara, Eita Nagayama, Sadao Abe, Mari Hamada, Kotaro Shiga, Masaya Katō, Tae Kimura, Susumu Terajima', null, 'A no-nonsense detective with a reputation for pushing limits investigates a rash of brutal murders connected by a series of cryptic short stories.', 'A no-nonsense detective with a reputation for pushing limits investigates a rash of brutal murders connected by a series of cryptic short stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fHLhLihzZsRYQG3k8ubNia4hvAc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8700'),
  ('199303324752995885', 'Unfamiliar', 2026, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Paul Coates', null, 'Felix Kramer, Susanne Wolff, Samuel Finzi, Natalia Belitski, Andreas Pietschmann, Maja Bons, Genija Rykova, Henry Hübchen', 'TV-MA', 'When the past catches up with two former spies, their biggest challenge isn''t car chases, shootouts or fistfights — it''s telling each other the truth.', 'When the past catches up with two former spies, their biggest challenge isn''t car chases, shootouts or fistfights — it''s telling each other the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hdEQWvSbDQsbdseeYjUS0NgrfT2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:274776'),
  ('563997688326042332', 'Unfinished Love Circle', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy, Mystery', 'Ethem Özışık', 'Ethem Özışık, Hakan Bonomo, Ercan Uğur', 'Dilan Çiçek Deniz, Burak Deniz, Cem Davran, Ezel Akay, Gizem Ünsal, Nazlı Bulum, Cihat Süvarioğlu, Esra Ruşan', null, 'A young and Idealist journalist Ozan loses his life in an unfortunate traffic accident. But not everything is finished for him just yet. He gets a second chance in life. He’ll come back to life and find answers to the question marks he left behind his mysterious death. But he will not be in his own body. When Ozan uses his chance to come back to life, he’ll find himself in Kadir’s body. Meanwhile Ozan’s girlfriend Elif who is also a journalist will already be after the people who took Ozan’s life. The two lovers who have crossed paths again will have a stranger’s body between them. Kadir. In Kadir’s body, Ozan, tries to unveil the mystery of his death together with Elif. Not only does he suffer facing the woman he loves in a different body, but also encounters with Kadir’s past. Not just adapting to a new body, adapting to a whole new life will not come easy for Ozan.', 'A young and Idealist journalist Ozan loses his life in an unfortunate traffic accident. But not everything is finished for him just yet. He gets a second chance in life. He’ll come back to life and find answers to the question marks he left behind his mysterious death. But he will not be in his own body. When Ozan uses his chance to come back to life, he’ll find himself in Kadir’s body. Meanwhile Ozan’s girlfriend Elif who is also a journalist will already be after the people who took Ozan’s life. The two lovers who have crossed paths again will have a stranger’s body between them. Kadir. In Kadir’s body, Ozan, tries to unveil the mystery of his death together with Elif. Not only does he suffer facing the woman he loves in a different body, but also encounters with Kadir’s past. Not just adapting to a new body, adapting to a whole new life will not come easy for Ozan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gybvx6JIs8ibk87IkY2sXet8hsG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103357'),
  ('893067209107725122', 'Unforgettable', 1999, 'Soap, Drama', 'Caridad Bravo Adams', 'Alberto Gómez, Marcia del Río', 'Edith González, Fernando Colunga, Eugenia Cauduro, Humberto Elizondo, Delia Casanova, Alma Muriel, Evita Muñoz ''Chachita'', Luis Gimeno', null, 'Nunca te olvidaré is a Mexican telenovela produced by Juan Osorio for Televisa in 1999. It is based on a novel by Caridad Bravo Adams and starring Edith González, Fernando Colunga and antagonistic interests of Alma Muriel, Eugenia Cauduro and Humberto Elizondo.', 'Nunca te olvidaré is a Mexican telenovela produced by Juan Osorio for Televisa in 1999. It is based on a novel by Caridad Bravo Adams and starring Edith González, Fernando Colunga and antagonistic interests of Alma Muriel, Eugenia Cauduro and Humberto Elizondo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hAWFzOEOhHIGeFDzE1f5pUJpUrn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:59302'),
  ('763644024100730057', 'Unforgettable', 2011, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'John Bellucci, Ed Redlich', null, 'Poppy Montgomery, Dylan Walsh, James Hiroyuki Liao, E.J. Bonilla, La La Anthony', 'TV-14', 'Former Syracuse, New York, police detective Carrie Wells has hyperthymesia, a rare medical condition that gives her the ability to visually remember everything. She reluctantly joins the New York City Police Department''s Queens homicide unit after her former boyfriend and partner asks for help with solving a case. The move allows her to try to find out the one thing she has been unable to remember, which is what happened the day her sister was murdered.', 'Former Syracuse, New York, police detective Carrie Wells has hyperthymesia, a rare medical condition that gives her the ability to visually remember everything. She reluctantly joins the New York City Police Department''s Queens homicide unit after her former boyfriend and partner asks for help with solving a case. The move allows her to try to find out the one thing she has been unable to remember, which is what happened the day her sister was murdered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6NsNh4qDhYiGp7SiHyk0Ec3Dns6.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:39276'),
  ('520336109232992727', 'Unforgettable Love', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Miles Wei, Hu Yixuan, Sheng Huizi, Yu Yijie, Shi Qingyan, Wu Chongxuan, Lennon Sun', null, 'He Qiaoyan, the stoic CEO of Heshi Group, and Qin Yiyue, a warm and optimistic child psychologist, find their relationship evolving from professional acquaintance to love when Qin Yiyue begins working with He Qiaoyan''s son.', 'He Qiaoyan, the stoic CEO of Heshi Group, and Qin Yiyue, a warm and optimistic child psychologist, find their relationship evolving from professional acquaintance to love when Qin Yiyue begins working with He Qiaoyan''s son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPDndH5bkpHZyQcmNZpoAQIugpi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128926'),
  ('940572147798337208', 'Unforgiven', 2009, 'Drama, Crime', 'Sally Wainwright', 'Sally Wainwright', 'Suranne Jones, Peter Davison, Douglas Hodge, Jemma Redgrave, Will Mellor, Siobhan Finneran, Matthew McNulty, Emily Beecham', null, 'Upon release from jail, a woman who was found guilty of murdering two police officers when she was a teenager who is determined to see her sister who was adopted.', 'Upon release from jail, a woman who was found guilty of murdering two police officers when she was a teenager who is determined to see her sister who was adopted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2vVnziMcU02wkTOmImhXFasVl6d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34579'),
  ('670095717448338752', 'Unforgotten', 2015, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Chris Lang', 'Chris Lang', 'Sanjeev Bhaskar, Sinéad Keenan, Carolina Main, Jordan Long, MyAnna Buring, Maximilian Fairley, Victoria Hamilton, Andrew Lancel', 'TV-MA', 'London police detectives Cassie Stuart and Sunny Khan investigate historic cold cases involving missing persons, murder and long-hidden secrets.', 'London police detectives Cassie Stuart and Sunny Khan investigate historic cold cases involving missing persons, murder and long-hidden secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bfysfq7JDBWKLpkKPaOU2FpfmB.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:62505'),
  ('1075525327657929884', 'Unforgotten Night', 2022, 'Drama', 'Yeo Nim', null, 'Phusanu Wongsavanischakorn, Saran Anantasetthakul, Suchanon Chueluecha, Thapanawat Kaewbumrung, Supanut Sudjinda, Tan Tanchanit Limsilatham, Deachit Daosaengpetch, Areeya Pholphutrakul', null, 'A night of lust turns into obsession when a mafia boss finds the one person who satisfies him—in every way.', 'A night of lust turns into obsession when a mafia boss finds the one person who satisfies him—in every way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qg6Hmw0OzZr72qwz5TfDAowqLbG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156990'),
  ('631559662611003887', 'Unhappily Ever After', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Ron Leavitt, Arthur Silver', null, 'Geoff Pierson, Kevin Connolly, Nikki Cox, Justin Berfield, Wendy Benson-Landes, Bobcat Goldthwait, Allan Trautman', 'TV-PG', 'A not-so-happy family is divided further when the father gets a schizophrenic disorder. Jack Malloy is the hallucinating father who works at a used car lot. Jennifer "Jennie" Slattery Malloy is the mother who hates Ryan and Ross, her two sons. Ryan Malloy is the oldest son who is not too bright. Tiffany Malloy is the beautiful smart daughter. Ross Malloy is the youngest forgotten child. Mr. Floppy is Jack''s stuffed rabbit who he sees come to life.', 'A not-so-happy family is divided further when the father gets a schizophrenic disorder. Jack Malloy is the hallucinating father who works at a used car lot. Jennifer "Jennie" Slattery Malloy is the mother who hates Ryan and Ross, her two sons. Ryan Malloy is the oldest son who is not too bright. Tiffany Malloy is the beautiful smart daughter. Ross Malloy is the youngest forgotten child. Mr. Floppy is Jack''s stuffed rabbit who he sees come to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b0UUpXSoSWwvkZKFWcDGLQ2xHM5.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:6515'),
  ('258422228760623088', 'UNHhhh', 2016, 'Talk, Comedy', null, null, 'Trixie Mattel, Katya Zamolodchikova', 'TV-14', 'RuPaul''s Drag Race season 7 queens Katya Zamolodchikova and Trixie Mattel in ''UNHhhh.'' It''s a show about nothing, and yet it''s about everything.', 'RuPaul''s Drag Race season 7 queens Katya Zamolodchikova and Trixie Mattel in ''UNHhhh.'' It''s a show about nothing, and yet it''s about everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6vsQiQS3isEcOvVZGUPgihdETg.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:75127'),
  ('298974683662934420', 'Uni', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Vyacheslav Dusmukhametov, Semyon Slepakov', 'Semyon Slepakov, Vyacheslav Dusmukhametov', 'Andrey Gaydulyan, Valentina Rubtsova, Vitaly Gogunsky, Mariya Kozhevnikova, Aleksey Klimushkin, Aleksey Gavrilov, Larisa Baranova, Stanislav Yarushin', null, 'The son of oligarch Sylvestre Sergeev, Sasha, fled from the university in London, where he studied finance, and entered the astronomical department of the physics department of a Moscow university. Sylvester Andreevich wants to return his son to his former life, but he wants to live "among the people" and wants to achieve everything in life himself. In parallel with this, many funny situations happen to the heroes of the series.', 'The son of oligarch Sylvestre Sergeev, Sasha, fled from the university in London, where he studied finance, and entered the astronomical department of the physics department of a Moscow university. Sylvester Andreevich wants to return his son to his former life, but he wants to live "among the people" and wants to achieve everything in life himself. In parallel with this, many funny situations happen to the heroes of the series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/98k931imEOxoPzphHELObRfNknH.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:46087'),
  ('1129631986039029435', 'Uni. 10 Years Later', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Ararat Keshchyan, Stanislav Yarushin, Aleksandr Martynov, Ekaterina Molokhovskaya, Nastasya Samburskaya, Anna Khilkevich, Hanna Kuzina', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o020opPCpNts3hDkx5jSkcH3k7q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:146116'),
  ('1093298783455149728', 'Uni. A New Dorm', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Semyon Slepakov, Vyacheslav Dusmukhametov', null, 'Stanislav Yarushin, Anna Khilkevich, Ararat Keshchyan, Nastasya Samburskaya, Aleksandr Martynov, Hanna Kuzina, Pavel Derevyanko, Evgeny Kazantsev', null, 'The hostel number 3, in which the heroes lived, is being demolished, and three guys (Michael, Anton and Kuzya) are relocated to a new hostel. In the new building they are settled in block number 510 with the girls Christina, Yana and Masha. Kuzya begins to date Masha, and Anton dates Christina. Later Kuzya leaves for Agapovka, the botanist Valentin is settled instead.', 'The hostel number 3, in which the heroes lived, is being demolished, and three guys (Michael, Anton and Kuzya) are relocated to a new hostel. In the new building they are settled in block number 510 with the girls Christina, Yana and Masha. Kuzya begins to date Masha, and Anton dates Christina. Later Kuzya leaves for Agapovka, the botanist Valentin is settled instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4A4uzjfTCbS8Z6qYbLSHE9l5XG.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:45966'),
  ('822048801710392970', 'Unicorn', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kim Hye-young, Yoo Byung-jae', 'Yoo Byung-jae, In Ji-hye', 'Shin Ha-kyun, Won Jin-ah, Lee You-jin, Kim Young-ah, Lee Jung-ok, Bae Yu-ram, Bae Yoon-kyung, Kim Wook', null, 'Following the crew at the fictional company Maccom, where they navigate the chaotic battlefield common to Korean start-ups. Steve is the slightly mad mastermind behind Maccom, while Ashley is on the innovation team and is one of his smartest employees.', 'Following the crew at the fictional company Maccom, where they navigate the chaotic battlefield common to Korean start-ups. Steve is the slightly mad mastermind behind Maccom, while Ashley is on the innovation team and is one of his smartest employees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8v3APBGhn4XRPjuSCQx5VvsESc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:195313'),
  ('1006446369277328835', 'Unicorn Academy', 2023, 'Animation, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Michelle Lamoreaux, Robert Lamoreaux', null, 'Sara Alicia Garcia, Ayana Visser', 'TV-Y7', 'When a dark force threatens to destroy Unicorn Island, a brave teen and her five schoolmates must rise up to protect their beloved magical academy.', 'When a dark force threatens to destroy Unicorn Island, a brave teen and her five schoolmates must rise up to protect their beloved magical academy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5aex9xH2Tq9G9m9WyhPJiyVOJol.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:221504'),
  ('121941020517621588', 'Unicorn: Warriors Eternal', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hazel Doupe, Tom Milligan, Demari Hunte', 'TV-PG', 'An evil force is looming across the dark, thick-aired streets of industrial revolution London when a group of heroes dubbed Unicorn are accidentally reawakened in the bodies of teenagers instead of adult hosts they’ve embodied in the past.', 'An evil force is looming across the dark, thick-aired streets of industrial revolution London when a group of heroes dubbed Unicorn are accidentally reawakened in the bodies of teenagers instead of adult hosts they’ve embodied in the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w0uHVrvCQYAWA4gj4j1GOCFM54a.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128024'),
  ('484321403532764730', 'Unidentified: Inside America''s UFO Investigation', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Luis Elizondo, George Knapp', null, 'In December of 2017, The New York Times published a stunning front-page exposé about the Pentagon’s mysterious UFO program, the Advanced Aerospace Threat Identification Program (AATIP). Featuring an interview with a former military intelligence official and Special Agent In-Charge, Luis Elizondo, who confirmed the existence of the hidden government program, the controversial story was the focus of worldwide attention.', 'In December of 2017, The New York Times published a stunning front-page exposé about the Pentagon’s mysterious UFO program, the Advanced Aerospace Threat Identification Program (AATIP). Featuring an interview with a former military intelligence official and Special Agent In-Charge, Luis Elizondo, who confirmed the existence of the hidden government program, the controversial story was the focus of worldwide attention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQt2PhMZxq6D7WnQImAjC1tKJf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:87983'),
  ('1069748819031254673', 'UniKitty!', 2017, 'Kids, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Ed Skudder, Lynn Wang', null, 'Tara Strong, Grey DeLisle, Kate Micucci, Roger Craig Smith, Eric Bauza, H. Michael Croner', 'TV-Y7', 'As ruler of the kingdom, Unikitty has busy days full of royal responsibilities. Unikitty is most interested in making sure everyone is happy and ridding the kingdom of negativity, but don''t misunderstand her optimism, she is one kitty not to be crossed. While she may be full of boundless energy and creativity, Unikitty is a force to be reckoned with if anyone gets in the way of spreading her positive vibes, especially if anyone makes her little brother and best friend, Puppycorn, sad. Also living in the castle are Dr. Fox, the resident scientist, and Unikitty''s trusty bodyguard, Hawkodile. Through it all, Unikitty and her friends make sure that every day is the happiest and most creative ever.', 'As ruler of the kingdom, Unikitty has busy days full of royal responsibilities. Unikitty is most interested in making sure everyone is happy and ridding the kingdom of negativity, but don''t misunderstand her optimism, she is one kitty not to be crossed. While she may be full of boundless energy and creativity, Unikitty is a force to be reckoned with if anyone gets in the way of spreading her positive vibes, especially if anyone makes her little brother and best friend, Puppycorn, sad. Also living in the castle are Dr. Fox, the resident scientist, and Unikitty''s trusty bodyguard, Hawkodile. Through it all, Unikitty and her friends make sure that every day is the happiest and most creative ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPpWpCmd7gx3ksYWQR7qRW86lvO.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:74739'),
  ('536137435897499234', 'Uninhabited Planet Survive!', 2003, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yukiko Iwai, Kiyoe Koiizuka, Mitsuaki Madono, Nahoko Kinoshita, Mabuki Ando, Akira Ishida, Akimitsu Takase, Junko Minagawa', null, 'It is the 22nd century where anti-gravity and warp travel are commonplace. However, the green Earth only exists in history book, people live in space colonies instead. Luna is a transfer student whose parents passed away when she was young, leaving her alone with her robotic cat Chako. Her dream is to become space exploration expert like her parents. A mistake during a school trip strands her and six of her classmates on a seemingly uninhabited planet. Here she must lead the introvert Shaara, the mechanic expert Shingo, the quiet Kaoru, the spoiled Howard, the obedient Bell, and the prideful Menori in s battle for their survival.', 'It is the 22nd century where anti-gravity and warp travel are commonplace. However, the green Earth only exists in history book, people live in space colonies instead. Luna is a transfer student whose parents passed away when she was young, leaving her alone with her robotic cat Chako. Her dream is to become space exploration expert like her parents. A mistake during a school trip strands her and six of her classmates on a seemingly uninhabited planet. Here she must lead the introvert Shaara, the mechanic expert Shingo, the quiet Kaoru, the spoiled Howard, the obedient Bell, and the prideful Menori in s battle for their survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQQhaG7e22MMjJZRUxePr3Qb9Tt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43242'),
  ('1093699874076895619', 'Unintentional Love Story', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Shin Ji-an', 'Cha Seo-won, Gongchan, Han Do-woo, Won Tae-min, Im Joon-hyeok, Lim Hyun-tae, Kim Yong-jin, Jang Jun-hyeon', null, 'When Ji Won-young''s direct superior at work is fired due to a corruption scandal, Won-young - in spite of being innocent of any wrongdoing - finds himself unceremoniously discharged from the company as well.', 'When Ji Won-young''s direct superior at work is fired due to a corruption scandal, Won-young - in spite of being innocent of any wrongdoing - finds himself unceremoniously discharged from the company as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7sA7TplHI0zi20VKCzVSLObCVvM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:220951'),
