  ('1108697633153203761', 'University Challenge', 1962, 'Talk', null, null, 'Amol Rajan, Roger Tilling', null, 'Academic quiz show where teams of students from UK universities answer questions on all manner of subjects.', 'Academic quiz show where teams of students from UK universities answer questions on all manner of subjects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yDLoEEFW3D6XSyT8UynTghc1Dyw.jpg', 55, 'tmdb:tv:5266'),
  ('33815514929450824', 'Unknown', 2024, 'Drama, Family', 'Priest', 'Joe Tsai, I-Wei Xiao', 'Chris Chiu, Kurt Huang, Tammy Lin, Jae-Hoon Kim, Danny Liang, Yankee Yang, Sam Lin, Justin Chang', null, 'Wei Qian, thrust into adulthood after losing his parents, faces turmoil when his adopted brother Xiao Yuan confesses feelings, challenging family bonds and emotions.', 'Wei Qian, thrust into adulthood after losing his parents, faces turmoil when his adopted brother Xiao Yuan confesses feelings, challenging family bonds and emotions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4C261RFPUrSgT9ZiZ47b4x8jDIM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:243069'),
  ('459454948831676993', 'Unknown Chaplin', 1983, 'Documentary', null, 'David Gill, Kevin Brownlow', 'Charlie Chaplin, Edna Purviance, Albert Austin, John Rand, Harry Crocker, Syd Chaplin, Jackie Coogan, Lita Grey', null, 'A documentary series examining the film making methods and techniques of Charles Chaplin. Featuring previously unseen footage from Chaplin''s private film archive.', 'A documentary series examining the film making methods and techniques of Charles Chaplin. Featuring previously unseen footage from Chaplin''s private film archive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8oTyLhXme1mcCTVQGKnEQHlmVG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21381'),
  ('202608777566083488', 'Unknown Soldier', 2018, 'Drama, War & Politics, Action & Adventure', 'Aku Louhimies', null, 'Eero Aho, Jussi Vatanen, Aku Hirviniemi, Johannes Holopainen, Hannes Suominen, Arttu Kapulainen, Max Ovaska, Vincent Willestrand', null, 'The Unknown Soldier miniseries expands the story of the 2017 film of the same name. The World War II series based on Väinö Linna''s classic novel closely follows a machine gun company of the Finnish Army on the Karelian front during the Continuation War between Finland and the Soviet Union, from mobilization in 1941 to the Moscow Armistice in 1944. It''s a story about how camaraderie, humor, and a desire to survive connect men on their journey. War upends the lives of both the individual soldiers and those left on the home front, and leaves its mark on the entire nation.', 'The Unknown Soldier miniseries expands the story of the 2017 film of the same name. The World War II series based on Väinö Linna''s classic novel closely follows a machine gun company of the Finnish Army on the Karelian front during the Continuation War between Finland and the Soviet Union, from mobilization in 1941 to the Moscow Armistice in 1944. It''s a story about how camaraderie, humor, and a desire to survive connect men on their journey. War upends the lives of both the individual soldiers and those left on the home front, and leaves its mark on the entire nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/otFtdZ0KS32XvVe5eZu1Y1OglRl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84706'),
  ('1086631777845276205', 'Unlimited Fafnir', 2015, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', null, null, 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Rina Hidaka, Manami Numakura, Hisako Kanemoto, Kana Hanazawa, Sora Tokui, Fumiko Uchimura, Ayane Sakura', null, 'Twenty-five years ago, the world suddenly changed when monsters called “Dragons” appeared; seeking to ravage the earth and find mates. Over time, superhuman girls possessing the powers of the dragons, called “D girls” were born. Yuu Mononobe is the only male “D” in existence and is forced to enroll at Midgar - an academy for D girls. At the academy, he accidentally runs into Iris, a delinquent D girl, while she’s naked, and even reunites with this long lost sister, Mitsuki, whom he was separated with at birth. Will Iris and Yuu, the boy who is supposed to become the strongest assassin, be able to challenge the seven dragons that threaten to destroy the world?', 'Twenty-five years ago, the world suddenly changed when monsters called “Dragons” appeared; seeking to ravage the earth and find mates. Over time, superhuman girls possessing the powers of the dragons, called “D girls” were born. Yuu Mononobe is the only male “D” in existence and is forced to enroll at Midgar - an academy for D girls. At the academy, he accidentally runs into Iris, a delinquent D girl, while she’s naked, and even reunites with this long lost sister, Mitsuki, whom he was separated with at birth. Will Iris and Yuu, the boy who is supposed to become the strongest assassin, be able to challenge the seven dragons that threaten to destroy the world?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zY7vcsQsoQqY8zcmjkCeeUBeTAV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66863'),
  ('353149353053794405', 'Unlimited Psychic Squad', 2013, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Junichi Suwabe, Koji Yusa, Wataru Hatano, Sayaka Ohara, Koji Ochiai, Yuichi Nakamura, Rie Kugimiya, Kisho Taniyama', 'TV-MA', 'You don''t have to be psychic to know that Hyobu Kyosuke is trouble waiting to happen, but having psychic powers of your own may be your only chance if you want to stand against him. One of the most powerful espers on the planet, Hyobu''s incredible range of abilities extends as far as controlling his own aging process, and the potential strength of all his talents combined is so terrifying that he wears a device that limits their use except in cases of extreme emergency. The time is coming, however, when Hyobu will need to unleash everything he has. Sometimes it takes a villain to do what heroes can''t, and as the leader of the secret organization P.A.N.D.R.A., Hyobu''s dedicated his life to fighting those who would entrap, enslave, or kill anyone with psychic powers. Now P.A.N.D.R.A. itself is in danger and, to combat that deadly threat, the gloves and limiter are coming off!', 'You don''t have to be psychic to know that Hyobu Kyosuke is trouble waiting to happen, but having psychic powers of your own may be your only chance if you want to stand against him. One of the most powerful espers on the planet, Hyobu''s incredible range of abilities extends as far as controlling his own aging process, and the potential strength of all his talents combined is so terrifying that he wears a device that limits their use except in cases of extreme emergency. The time is coming, however, when Hyobu will need to unleash everything he has. Sometimes it takes a villain to do what heroes can''t, and as the leader of the secret organization P.A.N.D.R.A., Hyobu''s dedicated his life to fighting those who would entrap, enslave, or kill anyone with psychic powers. Now P.A.N.D.R.A. itself is in danger and, to combat that deadly threat, the gloves and limiter are coming off!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rq8JOQgLfZ9LIC9FmcRrA1nWlyr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:55065'),
  ('85237247733276550', 'Unlock My Boss', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lee Cheol-ha, Kim Hyung-min', 'Kim Hyeong-min', 'Chae Jong-hyeop, Seo Eun-soo, Park Sung-woong, Lee Sang-hee, Kim Seung-o, Jeong Dong-hwan, Kim Beong-choun, Gi So-you', 'TV-14', 'At the brink of his death, the CEO and founder of an IT company''s spirit gets stuck inside a smartphone and enlists the help of a young man to do favors on his behalf in exchange for 10 billion won.', 'At the brink of his death, the CEO and founder of an IT company''s spirit gets stuck inside a smartphone and enlists the help of a young man to do favors on his behalf in exchange for 10 billion won.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8SmsIBU2v4AWNNhFi5qfSUOT4ZN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155459'),
  ('920717574185875771', 'Unlocked: A Jail Experiment', 2024, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'At an Arkansas detention facility, a sheriff implements a radical social experiment to grant men who are incarcerated more agency in this reality series.', 'At an Arkansas detention facility, a sheriff implements a radical social experiment to grant men who are incarcerated more agency in this reality series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6enEBjSmYoQHHQCtSE9io7IlM8.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:248984'),
  ('999274245872483437', 'Unmasked', 2025, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Yoo Sun-dong', null, 'Joo Jong-hyuk, Kim Hye-soo, Jung Sung-il, Lee Hae-yeong, Jang Hye-jin, Kim So-ra, Im Seong-mi, Jeon Jin-oh', null, 'In modern-day Seoul, a crack team of investigative journalists fight for their careers after broadcasting a controversial story. With time running out, the team are given an impossible task if they want to save their jobs – solve a twenty-year-old cold case involving a famous actor who disappeared without a trace.', 'In modern-day Seoul, a crack team of investigative journalists fight for their careers after broadcasting a controversial story. With time running out, the team are given an impossible task if they want to save their jobs – solve a twenty-year-old cold case involving a famous actor who disappeared without a trace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/piSUZXvzOw7GxwrtRuTmimW8YJE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:239006'),
  ('479107799136875496', 'Unnamed Memory', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yoshiki Nakajima, Atsumi Tanezaki', 'TV-14', 'Climbing a deadly tower, Oscar seeks the power of its master, the Witch of the Azure Moon. He hopes her incredible magic can break a curse that will kill any woman he takes for a wife. However, when the prince sees how beautiful Tinasha is, he has a better idea—since she''s surely strong enough to survive his curse, she should just marry him instead! Tinasha isn''t keen on the idea but agrees to live with Oscar in the royal castle for a year while researching the spell placed on the prince. The witch''s pretty face hides several lifetimes of dark secrets, however—secrets that begin resurfacing.', 'Climbing a deadly tower, Oscar seeks the power of its master, the Witch of the Azure Moon. He hopes her incredible magic can break a curse that will kill any woman he takes for a wife. However, when the prince sees how beautiful Tinasha is, he has a better idea—since she''s surely strong enough to survive his curse, she should just marry him instead! Tinasha isn''t keen on the idea but agrees to live with Oscar in the royal castle for a year while researching the spell placed on the prince. The witch''s pretty face hides several lifetimes of dark secrets, however—secrets that begin resurfacing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvrc6PfamASdvp334FYUrViR3Hp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:216272'),
  ('70118458612007206', 'Unnatural', 2018, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Ayuko Tsukahara', null, 'Satomi Ishihara, Arata Iura, Masataka Kubota, Mikako Ichikawa, Yutaka Matsushige, Yukiya Kitamura, Hiroko Yakushimaru, Koji Ohkura', null, 'Mikoto, a forensic investigative examiner, and her partners trace down the evidence of crimes and unravel the puzzles behind mysterious deaths.', 'Mikoto, a forensic investigative examiner, and her partners trace down the evidence of crimes and unravel the puzzles behind mysterious deaths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/37cahv1Gfi8njRh7YJ8jaYepvAW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75701'),
  ('181058063202082301', 'Unnatural History', 2010, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Mike Werb', null, 'Kevin G. Schmidt, Jordan Gavaris, Italia Ricci, Martin Donovan, Robbie Amell', 'TV-PG', 'Teenager Henry Griffin acquired many skills through years of travelling the world with his anthropologist parents. Sent to live with his uncle and cousin in Washington DC, and with the help of his cousin Jasper and friend Maggie, he must now use those skills to solve the modern mysteries of high school.', 'Teenager Henry Griffin acquired many skills through years of travelling the world with his anthropologist parents. Sent to live with his uncle and cousin in Washington DC, and with the help of his cousin Jasper and friend Maggie, he must now use those skills to solve the modern mysteries of high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEBpE5ilAk7fZvUlTFJBgxNzXcj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32616'),
  ('976672073945560821', 'Unnatural Selection', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Leeor Kaufman, Joe Egender', null, 'Kevin Esvelt, Aaron Traywick, David Ishee, Jeffrey Kahn, Tristan Roberts, Josiah Zayner, Jennifer Doudna', 'TV-MA', 'From eradicating disease to selecting a child''s traits, gene editing gives humans the chance to hack biology. Meet the real people behind the science.', 'From eradicating disease to selecting a child''s traits, gene editing gives humans the chance to hack biology. Meet the real people behind the science.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDSJbPwRWP961WzWmUuthcKV3B1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94647'),
  ('1130543584894679181', 'Uno sbirro in Appennino', 2026, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Fabio Bonifacci', null, 'Claudio Bisio, Chiara Celotto, Michele Savoia, Valentina Lodovini, Elisa Di Eusanio, Ivan Zerbinati, Lorenzo Minutillo, Jacopo Dei', null, 'Inspector Vasco Benassi is known in Bologna as the “best cop,” but after making a mistake, he is sent to the Apennines, to the small village of Muntagò, the hometown he had left years earlier following a traumatic loss. Investigating various cases will help him reconnect with his roots, in a process of “reopening his heart” that will lead him to become less solitary, to form new relationships, and to deepen others from the past.', 'Inspector Vasco Benassi is known in Bologna as the “best cop,” but after making a mistake, he is sent to the Apennines, to the small village of Muntagò, the hometown he had left years earlier following a traumatic loss. Investigating various cases will help him reconnect with his roots, in a process of “reopening his heart” that will lead him to become less solitary, to form new relationships, and to deepen others from the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l34f1K7xvpn2ENw2t3keOL8k8uH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:318760'),
  ('251237880086129456', 'Unorthodox', 2020, 'Drama', 'Anna Winger, Alexa Karolinski', null, 'Shira Haas, Amit Rahav, Jeff Wilbusch, Alex Reid, Delia Mayer, Ronit Asheri, Aaron Altaras, Dina Doron', 'TV-MA', 'A Hasidic Jewish woman in Brooklyn flees to Berlin from an arranged marriage and is taken in by a group of musicians — until her past comes calling.', 'A Hasidic Jewish woman in Brooklyn flees to Berlin from an arranged marriage and is taken in by a group of musicians — until her past comes calling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5VxoSKUlNFOuqBaw8kAHwEAtuHE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99581'),
  ('684325052209850308', 'Unprincipled', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Aleksandr Tsypkin', 'Aleksandr Tsypkin', 'Pavel Derevyanko, Pavel Tabakov, Anna Slyu, Aglaya Tarasova, Nikolay Fomenko, Yuri Kolokolnikov, Nadezhda Mikhalkova, Pavel Vorozhtsov', null, 'Collection of satirical sketches, telling about the decent inhabitants of the Patriarchal Ponds and their obscene stories. The series includes touching, outrageous and full of love intimate stories that are not accepted to speak out loud.', 'Collection of satirical sketches, telling about the decent inhabitants of the Patriarchal Ponds and their obscene stories. The series includes touching, outrageous and full of love intimate stories that are not accepted to speak out loud.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uCWVJOIEPSieYZnWy7w8LBG5SU1.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:105276'),
  ('239630991001436497', 'UnPrisoned', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Tracy McMillan', null, 'Kerry Washington, Delroy Lindo, Marque Richardson, Faly Rakotohavana, Jordyn McIntosh, Jee Young Han', 'TV-MA', 'A messy but perfectionist relationship therapist and single mom has her life turned right-side-up when her dad gets out of prison and moves in with her and her teenage son.', 'A messy but perfectionist relationship therapist and single mom has her life turned right-side-up when her dad gets out of prison and moves in with her and her teenage son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJxyT4SVRocp6Pd8xZkdyrrBXL4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:201902'),
  ('638278753241312798', 'UnREAL', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Marti Noxon, Sarah Gertrude Shapiro', null, 'Shiri Appleby, Constance Zimmer, Jeffrey Bowyer-Chapman, Craig Bierko, François Arnaud, Adam Demos, Natalie Hall, Meagan Holder', 'TV-14', 'Set against the backdrop of a hit dating competition show, Rachel is a young staffer whose sole job is to manipulate her relationships with and among the contestants to get the vital dramatic and outrageous footage the program''s dispassionate executive producer demands.', 'Set against the backdrop of a hit dating competition show, Rachel is a young staffer whose sole job is to manipulate her relationships with and among the contestants to get the vital dramatic and outrageous footage the program''s dispassionate executive producer demands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ldLTSFnLR642BAjFca96VOY7L98.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:62335'),
  ('393452210279056992', 'Unrequited Love', 2019, 'Drama', 'Ba Yue Chang An', null, 'Zhu Yanmanzi, Zhao Shunran, Zhang Yichi, Shen Yu, Chen Mengqin, Zhang Zhehao, Yuan Baizihui, Chen Jiawen', 'TV-14', 'Luo Zhi has a crush on an outstanding boy named Sheng Huainan and follows up his steps to get into the same university. They have to get over problems between themselves and their families, and make progress in their relationship.', 'Luo Zhi has a crush on an outstanding boy named Sheng Huainan and follows up his steps to get into the same university. They have to get over problems between themselves and their families, and make progress in their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8GZ7jvWjfxpfCDMG0xXaJIyqQjq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90729'),
  ('792115978440363347', 'Unrequited Love', 2021, 'Drama', null, null, 'Hu Yitian, Hu Bingqing, Zhang Yijie, Liu Meihan, Liu Jia, Deng Kai, Pu Tao, Zhai Xiaowen', 'TV-14', 'Luo Zhi has secretly loved Huainan since childhood, but they were distant in high school. When fate reunites them in university during an excursion, their bond grows. However, misunderstandings arise due to meddling from others and personal challenges, forcing them to confront their true feelings.', 'Luo Zhi has secretly loved Huainan since childhood, but they were distant in high school. When fate reunites them in university during an excursion, their bond grows. However, misunderstandings arise due to meddling from others and personal challenges, forcing them to confront their true feelings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fqeQV4guHVGizwapzF2CeqwNegN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:104982'),
  ('711451194549238699', 'Unscripted', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Bryan Greenberg, Krista Allen, Jennifer Hall, Frank Langella', 'TV-MA', 'A dryly humorous insider''s look at the all-too-earnest, frequently raucous, often disillusioning lives of several young actors trying to make a living — and make it big — in Hollywood.', 'A dryly humorous insider''s look at the all-too-earnest, frequently raucous, often disillusioning lives of several young actors trying to make a living — and make it big — in Hollywood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d3qGi8y7jPmDQAYWJFim75mwW9H.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15025'),
  ('71532528856098393', 'Unsealed: Alien Files', 2012, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'In 2011, a vault of government files were released to the public by the Freedom of Information Act. Among these, the Blue Planet Project, containing thousands of reports on UFO sightings and alien activity...these were the files they didn''t want you to see! Now Alien Files: Unsealed investigates these recently-released documents and re-examines key evidence and follows developing leads of mass UFO sightings, personal abductions, government cover-ups and breaking alien news from around the world. The show also delves into the "photoshopping" of space, the value of Wikileaks, and the role social media plays in alien stories. Finally, the newly released documents are analysed to see how alien visitations may have affected our past, and what influence they may have on our future. Exposing the biggest secret on planet Earth, Alien Files: Unsealed will have believers wanting more and skeptics questioning their long-held beliefs!', 'In 2011, a vault of government files were released to the public by the Freedom of Information Act. Among these, the Blue Planet Project, containing thousands of reports on UFO sightings and alien activity...these were the files they didn''t want you to see! Now Alien Files: Unsealed investigates these recently-released documents and re-examines key evidence and follows developing leads of mass UFO sightings, personal abductions, government cover-ups and breaking alien news from around the world. The show also delves into the "photoshopping" of space, the value of Wikileaks, and the role social media plays in alien stories. Finally, the newly released documents are analysed to see how alien visitations may have affected our past, and what influence they may have on our future. Exposing the biggest secret on planet Earth, Alien Files: Unsealed will have believers wanting more and skeptics questioning their long-held beliefs!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRpVNCaBTjbtlZfGaTlOf2fDTyV.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:54539'),
  ('876655970099272480', 'Unsealed: Conspiracy Files', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Colet Abedi', null, 'Dave Burchell, John Greenewald Jr., Jason Martell, Bill Birnes, Tom Durant', null, 'We''ve all heard them ... the Mafia killed JFK, the government had a hand in 9/11 and the existence of aliens is the world''s best-kept secret. Conspiracy theories are as old as mankind itself, and for just as long people have been taking sides. The advent of the internet provides a unique opportunity to level the playing field and give all men equal access to the facts. In April 2011, the FBI finally relented and established an online repository of files, documents and reports called "The Vault". Unsealed: Conspiracy Files is a ground breaking new show that shines a light on many of these archived case files.', 'We''ve all heard them ... the Mafia killed JFK, the government had a hand in 9/11 and the existence of aliens is the world''s best-kept secret. Conspiracy theories are as old as mankind itself, and for just as long people have been taking sides. The advent of the internet provides a unique opportunity to level the playing field and give all men equal access to the facts. In April 2011, the FBI finally relented and established an online repository of files, documents and reports called "The Vault". Unsealed: Conspiracy Files is a ground breaking new show that shines a light on many of these archived case files.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/db7RZ5MTJO2mS3zvBqJEEShSRAU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:54558'),
  ('35071205693464747', 'Unseen', 2020, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Marie Enthoven', null, 'Elisa Echevaria Menendez, Raphaël Lamaassab, Myriem Akheddiou, Luc Van Grunderbeeck, Fabio Zenoni, Roda Fawaz, Jacqueline Bollen, Bérénice Baôo', 'TV-MA', 'The fiction series UNSEEN tells the story of how, over ten days, people and their families face a mysterious phenomenon : some of them become invisible. Out of sight, the invisibles can do anything without being seen, nobody to punish them, nobody to compliment them, nobody to judge them, - But is it really an advantage? Some of them are using invisibility as a tool of revenge or domination, others live it as an exile. But all of them will have to make a moral choice: is their invisibility a power or a handicap? What is left for humanity when no one can see us anymore? Facing the unimaginable, seen and unseen will try, each in their own way, to save their own world.', 'The fiction series UNSEEN tells the story of how, over ten days, people and their families face a mysterious phenomenon : some of them become invisible. Out of sight, the invisibles can do anything without being seen, nobody to punish them, nobody to compliment them, nobody to judge them, - But is it really an advantage? Some of them are using invisibility as a tool of revenge or domination, others live it as an exile. But all of them will have to make a moral choice: is their invisibility a power or a handicap? What is left for humanity when no one can see us anymore? Facing the unimaginable, seen and unseen will try, each in their own way, to save their own world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wyQLlFSJn5M0u6OkhNuZ4ftiQQT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113574'),
  ('663031653156240576', 'Unseen', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', 'Travis Taute, Daryne Joshua', null, 'Gail Mabalane, Waldemar Schultz, Dineo Langa, Mothusi Magano', 'TV-MA', 'A house cleaner desperately searches for her husband as a dreaded criminal syndicate dredges up past tragedies and ultimately drives her to violence.', 'A house cleaner desperately searches for her husband as a dreaded criminal syndicate dredges up past tragedies and ultimately drives her to violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFKtgbboQohDi4tJNX1jp50WoXC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:220932'),
  ('800128366395787080', 'Unsolved Mysteries', 1988, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'John Cosgrove, Terry Dunn Meurer', 'Joshua Alper, Raymond Bridgers, Glenn Kirschbaum', 'Dennis Farina', 'TV-PG', 'Combines four to five segments of dramatic re-enactments, interviews and updates of real human and paranormal mysteries. An audience interactive call-to-action request allowed viewers to call in with tips to help solve the cases.', 'Combines four to five segments of dramatic re-enactments, interviews and updates of real human and paranormal mysteries. An audience interactive call-to-action request allowed viewers to call in with tips to help solve the cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bOXbWqNsRU2ykPiE586I18coLf.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:126'),
  ('290614228298593693', 'Unsolved Mysteries', 2020, 'Documentary, Drama, Mystery', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Real cases of perplexing disappearances, shocking murders and paranormal encounters fuel this gripping revival of the iconic documentary series.', 'Real cases of perplexing disappearances, shocking murders and paranormal encounters fuel this gripping revival of the iconic documentary series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Gn9hoJZUiJX5yb4datIcoq3Day.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:105177'),
  ('654466266218180264', 'Unsolved: The Murders of Tupac and The Notorious B.I.G.', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', 'Kyle Long', 'Greg Kading, Samir Mehta', 'Josh Duhamel, Jimmi Simpson, Bokeem Woodbine, Marcc Rose, Wavyy Jonez, Dominic L. Santana, Sarkis Ninos, Michael Harney', 'TV-MA', 'A chronicle of the two major police investigations by LAPD Detective Greg Kading into the deaths of Tupac and The Notorious B.I.G.', 'A chronicle of the two major police investigations by LAPD Detective Greg Kading into the deaths of Tupac and The Notorious B.I.G.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qWV5jwbQcPsQpLJnzB71gVIp9na.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76582'),
  ('544037019518008867', 'Unsoul', 2020, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Ana Paula Maia', null, 'Cássia Kis, Cláudia Abreu, Maria Ribeiro, Ismael Caneppele, Bruce Gomlevsky, Isabel Teixeira, Camila Botelho, Anna Melo', null, 'In 1988, the disappearance of a young girl shocks the population of little Brígida, in the interior of southern Brazil, resulting in the banning of pagan festivities of Ivana Kupala. Thirty years later, the city is preparing to bring the party back, but terrifying events, along with the dangerous ritual of transmigration of souls, unsettle the community and bring to light the secrets of a crime that ties three families’ destinies through time.', 'In 1988, the disappearance of a young girl shocks the population of little Brígida, in the interior of southern Brazil, resulting in the banning of pagan festivities of Ivana Kupala. Thirty years later, the city is preparing to bring the party back, but terrifying events, along with the dangerous ritual of transmigration of souls, unsettle the community and bring to light the secrets of a crime that ties three families’ destinies through time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1Z4e4FmAxdUktyWe92j9epGvN1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:97711'),
  ('63668477019946880', 'Unspeakable Sins', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Leticia López Margalli, Guillermo Ríos', 'Leticia López Margalli, Guillermo Ríos, Miguel Ferrari', 'Zuria Vega, Ana Sofía Gatica, Manuel Masalva, Mario Morán, Andres Baida, Erik Hayser', 'TV-MA', 'A woman starts an affair with a male escort to get revenge on her controlling husband, but the plan spirals into a dangerous fight for survival when it leads to a crime scene with her husband missing and her lover on the run.', 'A woman starts an affair with a male escort to get revenge on her controlling husband, but the plan spirals into a dangerous fight for survival when it leads to a crime scene with her husband missing and her lover on the run.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30eSqR2XPGz53eGElt6YAvH7cPX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:290276'),
  ('301060200060962810', 'Unstable', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rob Lowe, John Owen Lowe, Victor Fresco', 'Kate Loveless, Megana Rao', 'Rob Lowe, John Owen Lowe, Sian Clifford, Rachel Marsh, Emma Ferreira, Aaron Branch', 'TV-14', 'He''s an eccentric biotech genius. His son''s a pragmatist living in his shadow. To save the family business, they''ll have to work through some issues.', 'He''s an eccentric biotech genius. His son''s a pragmatist living in his shadow. To save the family business, they''ll have to work through some issues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yiMhsbuMYygbWnsrPbdp7PiMvvP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:219788'),
  ('27237214092181979', 'Unstoppable', 2020, 'Drama', 'Diego Martínez Ulanosky', null, 'Tessa Ía, Bárbara López, Lucía Uribe, Coty Camacho, Tomás Ruiz, Fernando Ciangherotti, Camila Valero, Diego Calva', 'TV-MA', 'A group of friends set out on a road trip when an unexpected fourth passenger forces an abrupt change of plans.', 'A group of friends set out on a road trip when an unexpected fourth passenger forces an abrupt change of plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVAdl1XsfHe6mqaZX7bvLYEyjgC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99385'),
  ('632770580543399347', 'Unsung Cinderella, Midori, the Hospital Pharmacist', 2020, 'Drama', null, null, 'Satomi Ishihara, Nanase Nishino, Ryo Narita, Yuki Sakurai, Kai Inowaki, Miho Kanazawa, Miki Maya, Takaya Sakoda', null, 'Aoi Midori is a pharmacist and in the 8-year span of her career, she has worked according to her strong belief that "One must know the patient well in order to prescribe the correct medication as medicine is the bond that connects the patient''s today to his/her daily life henceforth". Due to that, Aoi usually takes a long time in her consultations with the patients, and this causes her to be complained by her colleagues for being too inefficient in her work. Aoi shrugs off the complaints as her goal is to help the patients regain the daily life that they once took for granted.', 'Aoi Midori is a pharmacist and in the 8-year span of her career, she has worked according to her strong belief that "One must know the patient well in order to prescribe the correct medication as medicine is the bond that connects the patient''s today to his/her daily life henceforth". Due to that, Aoi usually takes a long time in her consultations with the patients, and this causes her to be complained by her colleagues for being too inefficient in her work. Aoi shrugs off the complaints as her goal is to help the patients regain the daily life that they once took for granted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7xiKvXdow3tI0ZZcSkWnqsLzV2e.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106002'),
  ('349232181030722527', 'Unsupervised', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy', 'David Hornsby, Scott Marder, Rob Rosell', null, 'Romany Malco, Justin Long, Kristen Bell, David Hornsby', null, 'Two 15-year-old best friends, Gary and Joel, they try to navigate through teenage life while also trying to do the right thing without the help of any parental supervision.', 'Two 15-year-old best friends, Gary and Joel, they try to navigate through teenage life while also trying to do the right thing without the help of any parental supervision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i8m1BIJCoDi0WUAncm9PkYJbTqY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42370'),
  ('527690398698676597', 'Unsuspicious', 2022, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Fernanda Paes Leme, Maíra Azevedo, Marcelo Médici, Thati Lopes, Rômulo Arantes Neto, Silvero Pereira, Gi Uzêda, Dhu Moraes', null, 'Conned by the same playboy, three women and their families go to his mansion to get answers — and must stay for an investigation when he’s found dead.', 'Conned by the same playboy, three women and their families go to his mansion to get answers — and must stay for an investigation when he’s found dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aaDoQjPqlfsGO6LC76PXgrJjbNz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:206232'),
  ('666441199856790080', 'Untameable', 2023, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Daniel Écija', null, 'Jaime Lorente, Belén Cuesta, Adriana Torrebejano, Cristóbal Suárez, Artur Busquets, José Milán', 'TV-MA', 'In 1980s Spain, TV and movie star Bárbara Rey and circus personality Ángel Cristo fell for each other. This is the tale of their tumultuous relationship.', 'In 1980s Spain, TV and movie star Bárbara Rey and circus personality Ángel Cristo fell for each other. This is the tale of their tumultuous relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oVKHCqEDyEJSolnSdcm9XpQlqpF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209725'),
  ('961324455592877458', 'UNTAMED', 2025, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Mark L. Smith, Elle Smith', null, 'Eric Bana, Sam Neill, Rosemarie DeWitt, Lily Santiago, Wilson Bethel', 'TV-MA', 'In the vast expanse of Yosemite National Park, a woman''s death draws a federal agent into lawless terrain — where nature obeys no rules but its own.', 'In the vast expanse of Yosemite National Park, a woman''s death draws a federal agent into lawless terrain — where nature obeys no rules but its own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tclYY8RGieQwkJXDxZGf505Zybr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:248852'),
  ('408095851098806100', 'Unter den Linden', 2002, 'Talk', null, null, 'Michaela Kolster, Michael Hirz, Christoph Minhoff, Thomas G. Becker', 'NR', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 24, 'tmdb:tv:104582'),
  ('1045889523656910440', 'Unter Uns', 1994, 'Soap', 'Ray Kolle, Jörg Brückner', null, 'Ben Ruedinger, Milos Vukovic, Petra Blossey, Isabell Hertel, Lars Steinhöfel', null, 'Unter uns is a German television soap opera, first broadcast on RTL on 28 November 1994. Centered around the lives of the people in a residential house, which is set in the fictional Schillerallee in Cologne. Since the show debuted the baker''s family Weigel is the series core family. Unter uns isn''t based on a foreign soap opera like Verbotene Liebe or Gute Zeiten, schlechte Zeiten. After Gute Zeiten, schlechte Zeiten, the show was the second daily soap for RTL, followed years later in 2006 by Alles was zählt. The show aired its 3,500th episode on 30 December 2008.', 'Unter uns is a German television soap opera, first broadcast on RTL on 28 November 1994. Centered around the lives of the people in a residential house, which is set in the fictional Schillerallee in Cologne. Since the show debuted the baker''s family Weigel is the series core family. Unter uns isn''t based on a foreign soap opera like Verbotene Liebe or Gute Zeiten, schlechte Zeiten. After Gute Zeiten, schlechte Zeiten, the show was the second daily soap for RTL, followed years later in 2006 by Alles was zählt. The show aired its 3,500th episode on 30 December 2008.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aD1QIba9mohAsdPHCjpWtrlumyp.jpg', 26, 'tmdb:tv:17892'),
  ('14120021277186074', 'Until I Destroyed My Husband''s Other Family', 2024, 'Drama', 'Ayako Kato, Ayuka Kishimoto', null, 'Marika Matsumoto, Terunosuke Takezai, Maho Nonami, Kouta Nomura, Yumi Aso, Rina Ohta, Miku Tanaka, Masaki Ota', null, 'Kisaragi Minori, who thought she had a happy family with her pure love since they were students and was married to her husband Yudai, was blessed with children, but the story begins when she finds out that her husband Yudai has been cheating on her for 15 years. Minori, who has vowed to take revenge on Yudai, who has another family, and on his lover, Riko Miyake, plots her revenge using Riko''s son, Wataru.', 'Kisaragi Minori, who thought she had a happy family with her pure love since they were students and was married to her husband Yudai, was blessed with children, but the story begins when she finds out that her husband Yudai has been cheating on her for 15 years. Minori, who has vowed to take revenge on Yudai, who has another family, and on his lover, Riko Miyake, plots her revenge using Riko''s son, Wataru.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/70WI0myoHLVpzuZ3RMWMqc5Fl0q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:256380'),
  ('713000555225754343', 'Until I Kill You', 2024, 'Crime, Drama', 'Nick Stevens', 'Nick Stevens', 'Anna Maxwell Martin, Shaun Evans', null, 'A extraordinary true story of Delia Balmer, who survived a near-fatal relationship with murderer John Sweeney. The series narrates the ordeal Delia suffered at the hands of John Sweeney, and her traumatic journey through the police and criminal justice system as they attempt to prosecute him for his crimes.', 'A extraordinary true story of Delia Balmer, who survived a near-fatal relationship with murderer John Sweeney. The series narrates the ordeal Delia suffered at the hands of John Sweeney, and her traumatic journey through the police and criminal justice system as they attempt to prosecute him for his crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uyKHq8uSDSxbxn2xVaHMxtzp0Ti.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:227496'),
  ('1122137187850050854', 'Until Life Do Us Part', 2021, 'Drama', 'Tiago R. Santos, Hugo Gonçalves, João Tordo', null, 'Rita Loureiro, Dinarte Branco, Madalena Almeida, Henriqueta Maia, José Peixoto, Ana Lopes, Ana Cunha, Diogo Martins', 'TV-MA', 'Three generations of a family living together in an idyllic villa juggle the demands of their wedding planning business and their own personal crises.', 'Three generations of a family living together in an idyllic villa juggle the demands of their wedding planning business and their own personal crises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0emUBiNikJYQPI3d0130pRtOGx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:120189'),
  ('255197322936921015', 'Until We Meet Again', 2019, 'Drama', 'LazySheep', null, 'Natouch Siripongthon, Thitiwat Ritprasert, Katsamonnat Namwirote, Noppakao Dechaphatthanakun, Warut Chawalitrujiwong, Noppanut Guntachai, Samantha Melanie Coates, Pannin Charnmanoon', null, 'Korn and Intouch’s tragiclove ends in gunfire, but years later, Pharm and Dean are drawn together by fate, unaware of their past connection.', 'Korn and Intouch’s tragiclove ends in gunfire, but years later, Pharm and Dean are drawn together by fate, unaware of their past connection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zkfCzPD5vUaRvusfzOGG6kUpdCI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95279'),
  ('175396821388229330', 'Until You Burn', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Ana María Parra Vázquez, Juana Uribe, Héctor Chiquillo', null, 'Melanie Dell’Olmo, Essined Aponte, María Elisa Camargo, Leonardo Acosta, Rita Bendek, Cristian Gamero', 'TV-MA', 'After his brother''s death, an ex-convict launches an intricate web of lies and revenge against the privileged family he believes is behind the murder.', 'After his brother''s death, an ex-convict launches an intricate web of lies and revenge against the privileged family he believes is behind the murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nssLYA0PvK3RVfBh2cV4JXyWXRN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:275464'),
  ('1094266176983141397', 'Untold Stories of the ER', 2004, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Reality', null, null, 'Armando Valdes-Kennedy', 'TV-14', 'Doctors recount the most memorable cases they’ve ever encountered. Unusual, touching, humorous or life-changing – no story is too big or too small when it comes to the ER.', 'Doctors recount the most memorable cases they’ve ever encountered. Unusual, touching, humorous or life-changing – no story is too big or too small when it comes to the ER.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5hg2Qe15DuAdF2Apey8NKTDpNw.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:268'),
  ('518173150323316492', 'Untold: Swamp Kings', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Urban Meyer, Tim Tebow', 'TV-MA', 'This docuseries explores how legendarily ruthless football coach Urban Meyer turned the ragtag 2000s-era Florida Gators into a ferocious winning machine.', 'This docuseries explores how legendarily ruthless football coach Urban Meyer turned the ragtag 2000s-era Florida Gators into a ferocious winning machine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/94xUIhSzLiU3WvatcLLK1EifCib.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:231297'),
  ('344652386996145371', 'Untold: The Girlfriend Who Didn''t Exist', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Chapman Way, Maclain Way', null, 'Manti Te''o, Naya Tuiasosopo, Brian Te''o, Ottilia Te''o, Jack Swarbrick, Robby Toma, Alex Flanagan', 'TV-MA', 'From Notre Dame to the NFL, Manti Te''o''s future in football showed promise until a secret online relationship sent his life and career spiraling.', 'From Notre Dame to the NFL, Manti Te''o''s future in football showed promise until a secret online relationship sent his life and career spiraling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWwnQYUe58TWAiQbutde8qqBSpS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208264'),
  ('577449911928539293', 'Untouchable', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Mystery', null, 'Choi Jin-won', 'Jin Goo, Kim Sung-kyun, Jung Eun-ji, Go Joon-hee, Park Keun-hyong, Son Jong-hak, Lee Jae-won, Choi Jong-won', null, 'The city of Bukcheon has been dominated by the Jang family for 3 generations. Jang Joon-Seo is the second son of family leader Jang Beom-Ho. A woman who Jang Joon-Seo loves dies. After that, he tries to reveal the truth about her death and a secret from his family.', 'The city of Bukcheon has been dominated by the Jang family for 3 generations. Jang Joon-Seo is the second son of family leader Jang Beom-Ho. A woman who Jang Joon-Seo loves dies. After that, he tries to reveal the truth about her death and a secret from his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7k2N5qp4BjFo4pE2pzMr9HxVFQG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74683'),
  ('870783084582092222', 'Untouchable Lovers', 2018, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Tian Yi You Feng', null, 'Song Weilong, Guan Xiaotong, Merxat, Viann Zhang Xinyu, Li Chung-lin, Xu Kai, Bai Lu, Zhao Lusi', null, 'Tianji Tower plots to overthrow the tyrant Liu Ziye by replacing his sister, Princess Liu Chuyu, with their disciple Zhu Que. She meets Rong Zhi, a secret Northern Wei spy, and their romance is shattered by betrayal. Rong Zhi fakes his death, and both later lose their memories. Five years later, they reunite when Chuyu is sent to marry Northern Wei’s Prince Regent—Rong Zhi himself.', 'Tianji Tower plots to overthrow the tyrant Liu Ziye by replacing his sister, Princess Liu Chuyu, with their disciple Zhu Que. She meets Rong Zhi, a secret Northern Wei spy, and their romance is shattered by betrayal. Rong Zhi fakes his death, and both later lose their memories. Five years later, they reunite when Chuyu is sent to marry Northern Wei’s Prince Regent—Rong Zhi himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8bsdq3E3ieg0FtQM3W6yoFvv4dF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77367'),
  ('394381656167447000', 'Untraceable Evidence', 1997, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Poon Ka-Tak', null, 'Flora Chan Wai-Shan, Bowie Lam Bo-Yee, Lee San-San, Margaret Chung, Jerry Koo Ming-Wah, Cheung Hak, Deon Cheung Chung-Chi, Simon Man Kit Lo', null, 'Untraceable Evidence is a Police Procedural in Hong Kong, produced by TVB. The series had two seasons.', 'Untraceable Evidence is a Police Procedural in Hong Kong, produced by TVB. The series had two seasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujzp3khWLD3yepih39w1FHTYvKS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:92267'),
  ('882940079349733316', 'Unusual Suspects', 2010, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, null, null, 'Unusual Suspects is an American documentary television series on Investigation Discovery. The series debuted on June 21, 2010. The series showcases many of the most shocking and difficult cases in law enforcement history, and also sheds light on the investigations that led to the arrest of the culprits.', 'Unusual Suspects is an American documentary television series on Investigation Discovery. The series debuted on June 21, 2010. The series showcases many of the most shocking and difficult cases in law enforcement history, and also sheds light on the investigations that led to the arrest of the culprits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4WmMdrgY4FwJceb9EP5BHpm7H0.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:41580'),
  ('705134367815809543', 'Unveil: Jadewind', 2026, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Sen Lin Lu', 'Meng Yang, Zhu Xin', 'Bai Lu, Wang Xingyue, Annabel Yao, Zhao Qing, Zhao Yiqin, Mei Baolai, Liang Yongni', null, 'A stern officer and a sharp-witted investigator form a detective duo that solves eerie murders and uncovers corruption within the Tang Dynasty.', 'A stern officer and a sharp-witted investigator form a detective duo that solves eerie murders and uncovers corruption within the Tang Dynasty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ZKyQPv473e4j8MZv8JvT1MAt9r.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278127'),
  ('778516623874862073', 'Unwrapped', 2001, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Marc Summers', null, 'Unwrapped is an American television program on Food Network that reveals the origins of sponsored foods. It first aired in June 2001 and is hosted by Marc Summers. The show leads viewers on tours of factories and other food-related locations. Popular subjects include candy, breakfast cereal, snacks, and TV dinners. The show''s spin-off, Trivia Unwrapped, is a game show also hosted by Marc Summers.', 'Unwrapped is an American television program on Food Network that reveals the origins of sponsored foods. It first aired in June 2001 and is hosted by Marc Summers. The show leads viewers on tours of factories and other food-related locations. Popular subjects include candy, breakfast cereal, snacks, and TV dinners. The show''s spin-off, Trivia Unwrapped, is a game show also hosted by Marc Summers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBczFgfRwVIPVCulTZUkBGE3ae2.jpg', 22, 'tmdb:tv:8862'),
  ('73404728878289661', 'Up All Night', 2011, 'Comedy, Family', 'Emily Spivey', null, 'Christina Applegate, Will Arnett, Maya Rudolph, Luka Jones', 'TV-14', 'An irreverent look at parenthood through the point of view of an acerbic working mother, along with her stay-at-home husband and opinionated parents.', 'An irreverent look at parenthood through the point of view of an acerbic working mother, along with her stay-at-home husband and opinionated parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5JyUoqVp34jmfvstRJc3fAVigrF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:39354'),
  ('713010156144925657', 'Up Here', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Steven Levenson, Kristen Anderson-Lopez, Robert Lopez', null, 'Mae Whitman, Carlos Valdes, Katie Finneran, Sophia Hammons, Emilia Suárez, Andréa Burns, John Hodgman, Adam Kaplan', 'TV-MA', 'Set in New York City in 1999, Lindsay and Miguel fall in love and discover that the single greatest obstacle to finding happiness together might just be themselves — and the memories, obsessions, fears, and fantasies that lives inside their heads.', 'Set in New York City in 1999, Lindsay and Miguel fall in love and discover that the single greatest obstacle to finding happiness together might just be themselves — and the memories, obsessions, fears, and fantasies that lives inside their heads.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tcjKq7l6XDd7KYwxOVKm5nWwlUV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218268'),
  ('574119593971923681', 'Up Pompeii!', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Talbot Rothwell', null, 'Frankie Howerd, Elizabeth Larner, Kerry Gardner, Jeanne Mockford, Wallas Eaton', null, 'Up Pompeii! is a British television comedy series broadcast between 1969 and 1970, starring Frankie Howerd. The first series was written by Talbot Rothwell, a scriptwriter for the Carry On films, and the second series by Rothwell and Sid Colin. Two further specials were transmitted in 1975 and 1991. In ancient Pompeii, much-put-upon slave Lurcio navigates the chaotic lives of his owner''s family', 'Up Pompeii! is a British television comedy series broadcast between 1969 and 1970, starring Frankie Howerd. The first series was written by Talbot Rothwell, a scriptwriter for the Carry On films, and the second series by Rothwell and Sid Colin. Two further specials were transmitted in 1975 and 1991. In ancient Pompeii, much-put-upon slave Lurcio navigates the chaotic lives of his owner''s family', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4qZeFAFVnPVydbhLIkGMlKln5dJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2021'),
  ('749000135094641134', 'Upload', 2020, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Greg Daniels', null, 'Robbie Amell, Andy Allo, Allegra Edwards, Zainab Johnson, Kevin Bigley, Owen Daniels', 'TV-MA', 'In 2033, people who are near death can be “uploaded” into virtual reality hotels run by 6 tech firms. Cash-strapped Nora lives in Brooklyn and works customer service for the luxurious “Lakeview” digital afterlife. When L.A. party-boy/coder Nathan’s self-driving car crashes, his high-maintenance girlfriend uploads him permanently into Nora’s VR world.', 'In 2033, people who are near death can be “uploaded” into virtual reality hotels run by 6 tech firms. Cash-strapped Nora lives in Brooklyn and works customer service for the luxurious “Lakeview” digital afterlife. When L.A. party-boy/coder Nathan’s self-driving car crashes, his high-maintenance girlfriend uploads him permanently into Nora’s VR world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6TPGDrU9MyWbn2TpggJphVAVXiq.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:86248'),
  ('528594187048014840', 'Upotte!!', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Iori Nomizu, Misato, Kaori Sadohara, Misuzu Togashi, Takayuki Kondo, Shizuka Furuya, Yuka Iguchi, Chika Horikawa', 'TV-MA', 'At Seishou Academy, girls don’t just wield guns— they ARE guns! In a school where every girl is a lethal weapon gunning for the chance to get their own personal serviceman, more than a few shots are about to be fired between Funko and her classmates. And when their newly recruited human instructor, Genkoku, arrives, he’ll have to learn how to deal with this living arsenal of high caliber cuties if he doesn’t want to get caught in the crossfire of their hair trigger tempers!', 'At Seishou Academy, girls don’t just wield guns— they ARE guns! In a school where every girl is a lethal weapon gunning for the chance to get their own personal serviceman, more than a few shots are about to be fired between Funko and her classmates. And when their newly recruited human instructor, Genkoku, arrives, he’ll have to learn how to deal with this living arsenal of high caliber cuties if he doesn’t want to get caught in the crossfire of their hair trigger tempers!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lSRFvh4bMg4B9X2GaPPJIumBJsF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45190'),
  ('727914631776313231', 'Uppdrag granskning', 2001, 'Documentary, News', null, null, null, 'NR', 'Swedish investigative journalism series known for the use of concealed cameras and microphones.', 'Swedish investigative journalism series known for the use of concealed cameras and microphones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/neUG4vI2JTiiP28nB7HR9t2kHRe.jpg', 26, 'tmdb:tv:5848'),
  ('859377247116054615', 'Upper Middle Bogan', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Wayne Hope, Robyn Butler', null, 'Annie Maynard, Patrick Brammall, Robyn Malcolm, Michala Banas, Rhys Mitchell, Madeleine Jevic, Lara Robinson, Harrison Feldman', null, 'Follow the stories of two families living at opposite ends of the freeway. Bess Denyar is a doctor with a posh mother, Margaret, an architect husband, Danny Bright, and twin 13-year-olds at a private school, Oscar and Edwina. When Bess finds out that she is adopted, she is stunned, but even more so when she meets her birth parents, Wayne and Julie Wheeler. She also discovers that she has three siblings: Amber, Kayne and Brianna. The bogan Wheelers head up a drag racing team in the outer suburbs and are thrilled to discover the daughter they thought they had lost.', 'Follow the stories of two families living at opposite ends of the freeway. Bess Denyar is a doctor with a posh mother, Margaret, an architect husband, Danny Bright, and twin 13-year-olds at a private school, Oscar and Edwina. When Bess finds out that she is adopted, she is stunned, but even more so when she meets her birth parents, Wayne and Julie Wheeler. She also discovers that she has three siblings: Amber, Kayne and Brianna. The bogan Wheelers head up a drag racing team in the outer suburbs and are thrilled to discover the daughter they thought they had lost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pM4qvHRDpAiWUAaQ2PlvI3z6qmo.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:58479'),
  ('100137993538047977', 'Upright', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Matthew Saville, Tim Minchin', null, 'Tim Minchin, Milly Alcock', null, 'When family outcast Lucky Flynn learns that his mother is dying, he decides to drive to the other side of Australia to see her, packing nothing but an upright piano for the journey. But his plans are soon turned upside down when he meets the runaway teenager Meg, who’s dealing with some family demons of her own.', 'When family outcast Lucky Flynn learns that his mother is dying, he decides to drive to the other side of Australia to see her, packing nothing but an upright piano for the journey. But his plans are soon turned upside down when he meets the runaway teenager Meg, who’s dealing with some family demons of her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x8wY8wtQsjuajH1kyx5EISwF5JI.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:95913'),
  ('917544238593027482', 'Upright Citizens Brigade', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Matt Walsh, Ian Roberts, Matt Besser', null, 'Amy Poehler, Matt Walsh, Matt Besser, Ian Roberts', 'TV-14', 'The Upright Citizens Brigade is an improvisational comedy and sketch comedy group that emerged from Chicago''s ImprovOlympic in 1990. The most recent incarnation consists of Matt Besser, Amy Poehler, Ian Roberts, and Matt Walsh. The original incarnation of the group consisted of Besser, Ali Farahnakian, Drew Franklin, Adam McKay, Roberts, Rick Roman, and Horatio Sanz. Other early members included Neil Flynn, Armando Diaz, and Rich Fulcher.', 'The Upright Citizens Brigade is an improvisational comedy and sketch comedy group that emerged from Chicago''s ImprovOlympic in 1990. The most recent incarnation consists of Matt Besser, Amy Poehler, Ian Roberts, and Matt Walsh. The original incarnation of the group consisted of Besser, Ali Farahnakian, Drew Franklin, Adam McKay, Roberts, Rick Roman, and Horatio Sanz. Other early members included Neil Flynn, Armando Diaz, and Rich Fulcher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hNvKTRDZ5ssImDTgd6BTHpnPwND.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:5396'),
  ('327414296053933834', 'Upstairs Downstairs', 2010, 'Drama', 'Heidi Thomas', null, 'Keeley Hawes, Ed Stoppard, Adrian Scarborough, Neil Jackson, Anne Reid, Claire Foy, Art Malik, Jean Marsh', null, 'Set in 1936, the show takes viewers, old and new, back to the lavish world of Belgravia, London. A new set of occupants reside at 165 Eaton Place and viewers see how external and internal influences of the tumultuous pre-war period shape and mould the lives of this wealthy family and their servants.‬', 'Set in 1936, the show takes viewers, old and new, back to the lavish world of Belgravia, London. A new set of occupants reside at 165 Eaton Place and viewers see how external and internal influences of the tumultuous pre-war period shape and mould the lives of this wealthy family and their servants.‬', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hGh87w2j5huGJeV4VVtnPoR42FZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:46609'),
  ('706053546496041113', 'Upstairs, Downstairs', 1971, 'Drama', 'John Hawkesworth, Eileen Atkins, Jean Marsh', null, 'Christopher Beeny, Gordon Jackson, Jacqueline Tong, Jenny Tomasin, Angela Baddeley, David Langton', 'TV-PG', 'Upstairs: the wealthy, aristocratic Bellamys. Downstairs: their loyal and lively servants. For nearly 30 years, they share a fashionable townhouse at 165 Eaton Place in London’s posh Belgravia neighborhood, surviving social change, political upheaval, scandals, and the horrors of the First World War.', 'Upstairs: the wealthy, aristocratic Bellamys. Downstairs: their loyal and lively servants. For nearly 30 years, they share a fashionable townhouse at 165 Eaton Place in London’s posh Belgravia neighborhood, surviving social change, political upheaval, scandals, and the horrors of the First World War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vptpN27HqU7kwIfPE1E07ffnK9n.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:492'),
  ('774932252743635594', 'Upstart Crow', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ben Elton', 'Ben Elton', 'David Mitchell, Liza Tarbuck, Spencer Jones, Helen Monks, Gemma Whelan, Steve Speirs, Dominic Coleman, Tim Downie', null, 'Comedy about the life and times of William Shakespeare as he starts to make a name for himself in London, whilst also trying to balance life as a husband and father for his family in Stratford-upon-Avon.', 'Comedy about the life and times of William Shakespeare as he starts to make a name for himself in London, whilst also trying to balance life as a husband and father for his family in Stratford-upon-Avon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aaCefKIYilykJ8e7HA04wyo4RIw.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:66369'),
  ('166720590587684879', 'UQ Holder!', 2017, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuka Takakura, Yuki Matsuoka, Yuki Matsuoka, Ai Kayano, Yui Ogura, Yuuki Hirose', 'TV-PG', 'In the decade since the world became aware of the existence of magic, the world has undergone massive upheaval. However, a boy named Tōta lives in seclusion in a rural town far removed from these changes. His ordinary life is highlighted by his magic-using female teacher and his supportive friends.', 'In the decade since the world became aware of the existence of magic, the world has undergone massive upheaval. However, a boy named Tōta lives in seclusion in a rural town far removed from these changes. His ordinary life is highlighted by his magic-using female teacher and his supportive friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7oUjy6CIwjiPCHtjKWH7vw1k9xN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74189'),
  ('441480901351532319', 'Ural Pelmeni', 2009, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Andrey Rozhkov, Dmitriy Brekotkin, Vyacheslav Myasnikov, Dmitriy Sokolov, Sergey Isayev, Maksim Yaritsa', null, 'A team of stand-up comedians entertain the audience with their improvisation acts and humorous antics, and play pranks on celebrity guests.', 'A team of stand-up comedians entertain the audience with their improvisation acts and humorous antics, and play pranks on celebrity guests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8DqvMtxGm9tWUe1cXRwqJIWKXPS.jpg', 17, 'tmdb:tv:52362'),
  ('751341685766302209', 'Uranium: Twisting the Dragon''s Tail', 2015, 'Documentary', null, 'Wain Fimeri', 'Derek Muller', null, 'A stunning new documentary series exploring the incredible story of uranium, from its creation in an exploding star to its deployment in nuclear weapons, nuclear power, and nuclear medicine. It’s a journey across nine countries and more than a century of stories, to discover the rock that made the modern world. It’s part science, part history, and all epic adventure. Join physicist and YouTube phenomenon Dr. Derek Muller as he reveals the untold story of the most wondrous and terrifying rock on Earth.', 'A stunning new documentary series exploring the incredible story of uranium, from its creation in an exploding star to its deployment in nuclear weapons, nuclear power, and nuclear medicine. It’s a journey across nine countries and more than a century of stories, to discover the rock that made the modern world. It’s part science, part history, and all epic adventure. Join physicist and YouTube phenomenon Dr. Derek Muller as he reveals the untold story of the most wondrous and terrifying rock on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fsHDOsdzesW3pBtTCiKL3PHsQ2j.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63415'),
  ('968560943598984261', 'Urara Meirocho', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Sayaka Harada, Kaede Hondo, Yurika Kubo, Haruka Yoshimura, Ai Kayano, Ayaka Suwa, Yuka Takakura, Hitomi Sasaki', 'TV-14', 'This is Meiro-machi (Labyrinth Town), the town of fortune-telling. In town, there is a fortune-telling shop called Urara, where girls aspiring to be fortune-tellers come from all over the country. Chiya, who was raised in the mountains, comes to the town with a purpose, but what is it exactly? There, she meets Kon who is always serious, Koume who loves all things western, and the shy Nono. Their fun days of living together as apprentice fortune-tellers are about to begin.', 'This is Meiro-machi (Labyrinth Town), the town of fortune-telling. In town, there is a fortune-telling shop called Urara, where girls aspiring to be fortune-tellers come from all over the country. Chiya, who was raised in the mountains, comes to the town with a purpose, but what is it exactly? There, she meets Kon who is always serious, Koume who loves all things western, and the shy Nono. Their fun days of living together as apprentice fortune-tellers are about to begin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjfwp2gErEwHJaA7U93aQMYSKqA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69345'),
  ('715252180479797838', 'Urawa no Usagi-chan', 2015, 'Animation', null, null, null, null, 'An original anime to advertise Urawa City in Saitama, Japan.', 'An original anime to advertise Urawa City in Saitama, Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5e1HJSHsnfb1rYNHQSK2DtaseoL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69605'),
  ('321665373917814589', 'Urban Horror', 2024, 'Drama', null, null, null, null, 'Do you often feel inexplicably disturbed in this cold, unconcerned city? Those things we are used to but not specifically noticed are not caused by supernatural or spiritual phenomena, but the daily, under-the-surface crises sparked by the fear, ignorance and indifference around us. This is a series without ghosts, monsters, supernatural or sci-fi components. Every story in Urban Horror is happening around us...', 'Do you often feel inexplicably disturbed in this cold, unconcerned city? Those things we are used to but not specifically noticed are not caused by supernatural or spiritual phenomena, but the daily, under-the-surface crises sparked by the fear, ignorance and indifference around us. This is a series without ghosts, monsters, supernatural or sci-fi components. Every story in Urban Horror is happening around us...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uygYZcrwPqonQsoLxxvnsZWGoDR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213220'),
  ('963465239568170109', 'Urban Legend', 2022, 'Mystery', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'This nightmarish anthology series, under the creative guidance of master of horror Eli Roth, showcases classic urban legends as you''ve never seen them before. Featuring lurking psychopaths, murderous mysteries, creepy creatures and twisting tales, these disturbing legends prey on our most deeply embedded fears to shock and terrify.', 'This nightmarish anthology series, under the creative guidance of master of horror Eli Roth, showcases classic urban legends as you''ve never seen them before. Featuring lurking psychopaths, murderous mysteries, creepy creatures and twisting tales, these disturbing legends prey on our most deeply embedded fears to shock and terrify.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJ3iZS2mHbfCutxLU7xCJcVZiET.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:33275'),
  ('279162495893429471', 'Urban Myths', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama, Documentary', 'Ben Palmer', null, null, 'NR', 'Our Urban Myths are stories that have been passed down over time and have now become part of urban folklore. But are they true? We take a slightly tongue in cheek, mischievous – and deliberately ambiguous – look at what might have happened...', 'Our Urban Myths are stories that have been passed down over time and have now become part of urban folklore. But are they true? We take a slightly tongue in cheek, mischievous – and deliberately ambiguous – look at what might have happened...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aiL7kSSL0XNh4j4TIE4pO97cLZY.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:70260'),
  ('405684688708642006', 'Urban: la vida es nuestra', 2023, 'Drama', 'Carlos del Hoyo, Nico Frasquet, Amanda Encinas', null, 'María Pedraza, Asia Ortega, Bernardo Flores, Hugo Welzel', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uYw1byytaRv4iPgayPm3Gywa5ON.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:234790'),
  ('1075959126277211073', 'Urk!', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, 'Teun Föhn, Tony Regnerus, Mathilde Keuter, Gerda Keuter, Ap Snoek, Klaas Romkes, Derrekien Regnerus, Jannie Keuter', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nSt6KXAe4sek1pQDKBKAwgyzL7Y.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:134333'),
  ('422411490243395229', 'Uroczysko', 2023, 'Crime', 'Kamila Fidler', null, 'Katarzyna Ucherska, Antoni Królikowski', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPxtJIDY9oaL4EFZEM9KXFVfIGT.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:240616'),
  ('1073237367871292170', 'Urusei Yatsura', 1981, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Toshio Furukawa, Fumi Hirano, Akira Kamiya, Saeko Shimazu, Kazuko Sugiyama, Machiko Washio, Ichiro Nagai, Noriko Ohara', 'NR', 'The invasion of an alien race known as the Oni begins a new life for Ataru Moroboshi, a lecherous trouble-making tenth grader in the small town of Tomobiki. After unwittingly proposing to the Oni princess Lum Invader instead of his sweetheart Shinobu, Ataru becomes a conduit for aliens arriving on Earth, causing all sorts of havoc for him and his companions, not to mention his own reputation!', 'The invasion of an alien race known as the Oni begins a new life for Ataru Moroboshi, a lecherous trouble-making tenth grader in the small town of Tomobiki. After unwittingly proposing to the Oni princess Lum Invader instead of his sweetheart Shinobu, Ataru becomes a conduit for aliens arriving on Earth, causing all sorts of havoc for him and his companions, not to mention his own reputation!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bs0Q5TMYVUTNXCPbuPBNylzqrxk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34163'),
  ('689400744759235385', 'Urusei Yatsura', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hiroshi Kamiya, Sumire Uesaka, Maaya Uchida, Mamoru Miyano, Wataru Takagi, Miyuki Sawashiro', 'TV-14', 'Tokyo, Tomobiki Town. Lum, the gorgeous princess of the invading alien race of Oni is smitten with high school student Ataru Moroboshi. A dedicated womanizer, Ataru is unfazed by Lum’s fierce electric shock attacks and continues his daily hunt for pretty girls. With a host of other unique characters, including girl-next-door Shinobu, elegant shrine maiden Sakura, Lum’s best friends Oyuki, Benten, and Ran, Buddhist Monk Cherry, Ten, the little brat, heir to a wealthy family Shutaro Mendo and the masculine beauty Ryunosuke…it''s a classic slapstick love comedy where anything goes!', 'Tokyo, Tomobiki Town. Lum, the gorgeous princess of the invading alien race of Oni is smitten with high school student Ataru Moroboshi. A dedicated womanizer, Ataru is unfazed by Lum’s fierce electric shock attacks and continues his daily hunt for pretty girls. With a host of other unique characters, including girl-next-door Shinobu, elegant shrine maiden Sakura, Lum’s best friends Oyuki, Benten, and Ran, Buddhist Monk Cherry, Ten, the little brat, heir to a wealthy family Shutaro Mendo and the masculine beauty Ryunosuke…it''s a classic slapstick love comedy where anything goes!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yeF9seq2EWgzhEaEbX3gQPmH6Ay.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:154524'),
  ('193598238994820171', 'Us', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'David Nicholls', null, 'Tom Hollander, Saskia Reeves, Tom Taylor', 'TV-14', 'The poignant and hilarious story of the Petersens during their vacation across Europe where the father Douglas tries to win back the love of his wife Connie and become reconciled with their son Albie.', 'The poignant and hilarious story of the Petersens during their vacation across Europe where the father Douglas tries to win back the love of his wife Connie and become reconciled with their son Albie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWBZqmCdM56vCxpb8YO29k8Bd5n.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110232'),
  ('37929164855111173', 'Us', 2025, 'Drama', 'Chao Planoy', null, 'Pattraphus Borattasuwan, Thasorn Klinnium, Harit Cheewagaroon, Benyapa Jeenprasom, Rattanawadee Wongtong, Patsit Permpoonsavat, Samantha Melanie Coates, Leo Saussay', null, 'Eighteen-year-old Dokrak decides to take a gap year to find herself after finishing high school. She has a part-time job at a coworking space coffee shop, Cuf & Co. It''s here that she crosses paths with twenty-two-year-old dentistry student Pam who ''s a regular at the café to hit the books. As she gets to know Pam, Dokrak develops a crush. When her brother, however, meets Pam, he falls for her at first sight. Kawi turns to Dokrak, asking her to play matchmaker. Because she loves him and wants to see him happy, Dokrak begins coaching him. As time goes on, however, she finds herself unable to ignore her growing feelings for Pam. Before she knows it, she''s fully in love and Pam is Kawi''s girlfriend.', 'Eighteen-year-old Dokrak decides to take a gap year to find herself after finishing high school. She has a part-time job at a coworking space coffee shop, Cuf & Co. It''s here that she crosses paths with twenty-two-year-old dentistry student Pam who ''s a regular at the café to hit the books. As she gets to know Pam, Dokrak develops a crush. When her brother, however, meets Pam, he falls for her at first sight. Kawi turns to Dokrak, asking her to play matchmaker. Because she loves him and wants to see him happy, Dokrak begins coaching him. As time goes on, however, she finds herself unable to ignore her growing feelings for Pam. Before she knows it, she''s fully in love and Pam is Kawi''s girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AdrzjDmSEdeZCCQSWA93XUjYk0P.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:252621'),
  ('13507783410761523', 'USA High', 1997, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Peter Engel', null, 'Josh Holland, Thomas Magiar, Elena Lyons, Marquita Terry, Kristen Miller, Nicholas Guest, Angela Visser, William James Jones', null, 'USA High is an American teen sitcom which ran from August 1997 to June 1999, and ended after 95 episodes, and reran until August 4, 2001 on the USA Network.', 'USA High is an American teen sitcom which ran from August 1997 to June 1999, and ended after 95 episodes, and reran until August 4, 2001 on the USA Network.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/it9TFva1WQIBZzMawgWYi92bBiK.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1792'),
  ('1137719780205099707', 'Usagi Drop', 2011, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Ayu Matsuura, Hiroshi Tsuchida', 'TV-G', 'By force of circumstances, a 30-year-old single man with a full-time job suddenly starts raising a 6-year-old girl. While running each other ragged, the two of them gradually grow into a "family".', 'By force of circumstances, a 30-year-old single man with a full-time job suddenly starts raising a 6-year-old girl. While running each other ragged, the two of them gradually grow into a "family".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMeOuxeY1Djly3xIFoam2H5tU0Q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45213'),
  ('1028179544981798408', 'Use for My Talent', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Jasper Liu, Shen Yue, Dai Yunfan, Su Mengdi, Xiao Ran, Charles Lin, Tan Quan, Yan An', null, 'Because of his incomplete family, Gu Ren Qi has a closed up personality and mysophobia. Shuang Jiao used to have a happy family, but later lost her mother in a car accident, and became a slovenly person. The two became acquainted when Shuang Jiao becomes an employee in Gu Ren Qi''s cleaning company. The two became closer as they get to know each other. Under each other''s influence, they began to heal from their wounds.', 'Because of his incomplete family, Gu Ren Qi has a closed up personality and mysophobia. Shuang Jiao used to have a happy family, but later lost her mother in a car accident, and became a slovenly person. The two became acquainted when Shuang Jiao becomes an employee in Gu Ren Qi''s cleaning company. The two became closer as they get to know each other. Under each other''s influence, they began to heal from their wounds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3cPaJnIwdMWDDLpKHfNkJGxhYMX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:125255'),
  ('759397168720855963', 'User Not Found', 2021, 'Drama', null, 'Min Ji-young', 'Bae Jin-young, Shin So-hyun, Ahn Se-min, Lee Jong-hyuk, Lee Seung-gyu, Yoo Hye-jin, Jung Hyun-ji, Han Ye-ji', null, 'A romance drama about two female high school students who happen to share the same name. When they both transfer to a new school at the same time, hoping to use the opportunity to turn their lives around, they forge a secret contract to swap identities. Shin Yi Joon is the most popular student at his high school. Although he seems tough and aloof on the outside, Shin Yi Joon is actually a huge softie on the inside—and far from getting into fights with other students, he even has a hard time saying no to other people.', 'A romance drama about two female high school students who happen to share the same name. When they both transfer to a new school at the same time, hoping to use the opportunity to turn their lives around, they forge a secret contract to swap identities. Shin Yi Joon is the most popular student at his high school. Although he seems tough and aloof on the outside, Shin Yi Joon is actually a huge softie on the inside—and far from getting into fights with other students, he even has a hard time saying no to other people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5spwn9gNp0DJokaTo0aL4W1QaQJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135687'),
  ('148629896770921116', 'Ushijima the Loan Shark', 2010, 'Drama', 'Masatoshi Yamaguchi', null, 'Takayuki Yamada, Kyosuke Yabe, Hiromi Sakimoto, Maryjun Takahashi, Jessica Kizaki', null, 'Kaoru Ushijima''s Kaukau Finance is the lender of last resort for many of the poorest people in the area: He collects without mercy and without fail.', 'Kaoru Ushijima''s Kaukau Finance is the lender of last resort for many of the poorest people in the area: He collects without mercy and without fail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jiG1hGfDCLYj4S551hJ4S7nKYf.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:45472'),
  ('995071893645886554', 'Ushio and Tora', 2015, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Tasuku Hatanaka, Rikiya Koyama, Mikako Komatsu, Kiyono Yasuno, Kana Hanazawa, Daisuke Namikawa, Nao Nagasawa, Yui Makino', 'TV-14', 'When he stumbles upon Tora, a demon who''s been impaled by a spear, young Ushio frees the beast and demands his help in fighting other agents of evil.', 'When he stumbles upon Tora, a demon who''s been impaled by a spear, young Ushio frees the beast and demands his help in fighting other agents of evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zF0OxtfZlSIGK7SLq77qiAqe7T1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63085'),
  ('1115410533826087165', 'Uta no Prince-sama', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Miyuki Sawashiro', 'TV-14', 'With dreams of becoming a composer and someday writing a song for her favorite idol, Haruka enters the Saotome Academy, a prestigious performing arts school. If successful there, she’ll be able to join the Shining Agency after graduation. However, it won’t be so easy when Haruka is already surrounded by potential idols and composers. On top of that, her homeroom teacher is a current idol, the headmaster was a record-breaking singer, and the academy itself is a chaotic place where anything can happen. Which prince of song will be paired up with Haruka?! Uta no Prince Sama is an exciting, coming-of-age romantic comedy that will be like sweet music to your eyes and ears!', 'With dreams of becoming a composer and someday writing a song for her favorite idol, Haruka enters the Saotome Academy, a prestigious performing arts school. If successful there, she’ll be able to join the Shining Agency after graduation. However, it won’t be so easy when Haruka is already surrounded by potential idols and composers. On top of that, her homeroom teacher is a current idol, the headmaster was a record-breaking singer, and the academy itself is a chaotic place where anything can happen. Which prince of song will be paired up with Haruka?! Uta no Prince Sama is an exciting, coming-of-age romantic comedy that will be like sweet music to your eyes and ears!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5hU5KQXXQyH97uZvnYfNrgBS8zX.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:46095'),
  ('79300664185545675', 'Utawarerumono', 2006, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kentaro Tone, Risa Taneda, Chinatsu Akasaki, Inori Minase, Miyuki Sawashiro, Rie Kugimiya, Sayaka Ohara', 'TV-14', 'Hakuoro has lost his memory after succumbing to serious injuries. But thanks to an elderly woman and her granddaughter Eruruu, he is nursed back to health. His face is covered by a strange irremovable mask and he occasionally sees beastly visions. Eruruu now cares for him as he becomes accustomed to the village and its inhabitants, who all bear strange ears (the women also have tails). Though these people venerate the forces of nature, desecration of an altar forces them to take drastic measures to preserve their lives from the wrath of Mutikapa-sama, guardian of the forest.', 'Hakuoro has lost his memory after succumbing to serious injuries. But thanks to an elderly woman and her granddaughter Eruruu, he is nursed back to health. His face is covered by a strange irremovable mask and he occasionally sees beastly visions. Eruruu now cares for him as he becomes accustomed to the village and its inhabitants, who all bear strange ears (the women also have tails). Though these people venerate the forces of nature, desecration of an altar forces them to take drastic measures to preserve their lives from the wrath of Mutikapa-sama, guardian of the forest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9skPAAxMLG25aYROr3UT1JJi9UQ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:46412'),
  ('1004253349511921365', 'Utopia', 2013, 'Mystery, Drama, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Dennis Kelly', null, 'Adeel Akhtar, Paul Higgins, Neil Maskell, Fiona O''Shaughnessy, Alexandra Roach, Nathan Stewart-Jarrett, Oliver Woollford, Alistair Petrie', 'TV-MA', 'The Utopia Experiments is a legendary graphic novel shrouded in mystery. When a group of strangers find themselves in possession of an original manuscript, their lives suddenly and brutally implode.', 'The Utopia Experiments is a legendary graphic novel shrouded in mystery. When a group of strangers find themselves in possession of an original manuscript, their lives suddenly and brutally implode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snOU6W5CU7aGVSVu29wBWzdzNzi.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:46511'),
  ('1119941759134656018', 'Utopia', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Rob Gleisner, Rob Sitch, Santo Cilauro', null, 'Rob Sitch, Celia Pacquola, Dave Lawson, Kitty Flanagan, Emma-Louise Wilson, Dilruk Jayasinha, Nina Oyama, Lehmo', null, 'Set inside the offices of the “Nation Building Authority”, a federal government organisation responsible for overseeing major infrastructure projects, Utopia explores that moment when bureaucracy and grand dreams collide.', 'Set inside the offices of the “Nation Building Authority”, a federal government organisation responsible for overseeing major infrastructure projects, Utopia explores that moment when bureaucracy and grand dreams collide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ySda8281t4X98oiencwmqmHfDi.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:63699'),
  ('341566798868042103', 'Utopia', 2020, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Mystery', 'Gillian Flynn', null, 'Javon Walton, Sasha Lane, Cory Michael Smith, Dan Byrd, John Cusack, Hadley Robinson, Rainn Wilson, Desmin Borges', 'TV-MA', 'A group of young adults who met online are mercilessly hunted by a shadowy deep state organization after they come into possession of a near-mythical cult underground graphic novel.', 'A group of young adults who met online are mercilessly hunted by a shadowy deep state organization after they come into possession of a near-mythical cult underground graphic novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oMY53BtS9vOTAhKgWr2gNYyLBOw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78903'),
  ('317732396271222147', 'Utopia Falls', 2020, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'R.T. Thorne', 'R.T. Thorne', 'Robyn Alomar, Robbie G.K., Phillip Forest Lewitski, Akiel Julien, Humberly González, Mickeey Nguyen, Devyn Nekoda, Kate Drummond', null, 'In a genre bending take on a coming of age story, a group of teens in a distant future colony uncover an ancient forbidden archive of historical, cultural and musical relics. This discovery forces them to question everything they''ve been taught, and use the power of music to ignite change in their reality to expose the truth.', 'In a genre bending take on a coming of age story, a group of teens in a distant future colony uncover an ancient forbidden archive of historical, cultural and musical relics. This discovery forces them to question everything they''ve been taught, and use the power of music to ignite change in their reality to expose the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rB1ZuAo5fbVr1koA3Z6zur8seBy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97559'),
  ('727697478093540765', 'Uzaki-chan Wants to Hang Out!', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Kenji Akabane, Naomi Ohzora, Ayana Taketatsu, Tomoya Takagi, Yosuke Akimoto, Saori Hayami, Seina Kato, Hideo Ishikawa', 'TV-14', 'Shinichi Sakurai’s one wish is for a little peace and quiet. But Hana Uzaki — his boisterous, well-endowed underclassman — has other plans. All she wants is to hang out and poke fun at him. With the help of her chipper charm and peppy persistence, this might just be the start of a beautiful relationship!', 'Shinichi Sakurai’s one wish is for a little peace and quiet. But Hana Uzaki — his boisterous, well-endowed underclassman — has other plans. All she wants is to hang out and poke fun at him. With the help of her chipper charm and peppy persistence, this might just be the start of a beautiful relationship!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kg7PD9mqKUlJulKTeHzVwHAKqqR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:98986'),
  ('641706707550240355', 'UzaMaid!', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Haruka Shiraishi, Manami Numakura, Mao Ichimichi, Sayaka Harada, Shiori Izawa, Masayuki Katou', null, 'Misha is a little girl who lost her mother at an early age, and now lives with her father. Her father employs a maid named Tsubame, who was a former Self-Defense Force official, and is also a lolicon.', 'Misha is a little girl who lost her mother at an early age, and now lives with her father. Her father employs a maid named Tsubame, who was a former Self-Defense Force official, and is also a lolicon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLbPjLiKeszHq66FzdpT5dqdsav.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82864'),
  ('155281074579822854', 'Uzumaki', 2024, 'Animation, Mystery', null, null, 'Uki Satake, Shin-ichiro Miki, Mariya Ise, Wataru Hatano, Toshio Furukawa, Mika Doi, Takashi Matsuyama, Katsutoshi Matsuzaki', 'TV-MA', 'Kirie tries to escape from her town Kurouzu-cho, where the residents get obsessed with spirals due to an unexplained curse.', 'Kirie tries to escape from her town Kurouzu-cho, where the residents get obsessed with spirals due to an unexplained curse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtQIgqEQEIQnNqLVGTShUf7qLap.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93241'),
  ('196962764252849894', 'V', 1983, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kenneth Johnson', 'Kenneth Johnson', 'Jane Badler, Michael Durrell, Faye Grant, Peter Nelson, David Packer, Neva Patterson, Tommy Petersen, Marc Singer', 'TV-14', 'Fifty spaceships, each three miles across, hover ominously above Earth''s major cities. The Visitors that emerge are humanlike in appearance and extend the hand of friendship. Our planet''s resources are just what these aliens need to survive. And for its future survival, unsuspecting humankind will need... a miracle!', 'Fifty spaceships, each three miles across, hover ominously above Earth''s major cities. The Visitors that emerge are humanlike in appearance and extend the hand of friendship. Our planet''s resources are just what these aliens need to survive. And for its future survival, unsuspecting humankind will need... a miracle!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLD3Oy9rJTrs3ogPpw7OQIPEpgP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14141'),
  ('272557768295795631', 'V', 1984, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kenneth Johnson', null, 'Jane Badler, June Chadwick, Jennifer Cooke, Robert Englund, Faye Grant, Marc Singer, Jeff Yagher', 'TV-14', 'Once again, Earth is the battleground. But now the aliens whose human guise hides their true reptilian natures are wiser. They believe the secret to their survival on Earth lies in the DNA of the newly born half-human, half-spaceling Starchild. But that''s something the world''s Resistance Fighters cannot allow.', 'Once again, Earth is the battleground. But now the aliens whose human guise hides their true reptilian natures are wiser. They believe the secret to their survival on Earth lies in the DNA of the newly born half-human, half-spaceling Starchild. But that''s something the world''s Resistance Fighters cannot allow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aps7fkPWZbhyUvB0hkZ6NV8LtE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75893'),
  ('487276287548835755', 'V', 2009, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Kenneth Johnson, Scott Peters', null, 'Elizabeth Mitchell, Morena Baccarin, Morris Chestnut, Joel Gretsch, Laura Vandervoort, Logan Huffman, Scott Wolf, Christopher Shyer', 'TV-14', 'A re-imagining of the 1980s miniseries about the world''s first encounter with an alien race in which the aliens call themselves The Visitors, and have a seemingly friendly agenda that may or may not be a cover for something more malevolent.', 'A re-imagining of the 1980s miniseries about the world''s first encounter with an alien race in which the aliens call themselves The Visitors, and have a seemingly friendly agenda that may or may not be a cover for something more malevolent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b2w3vq0uvfmahS6dB41WeWByhVy.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:21494'),
  ('803165317840173356', 'V Wars', 2019, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'William Laurin, Glenn Davis', null, 'Ian Somerhalder, Adrian Holmes, Jacky Lai, Kimberly-Sue Murray, Kyle Breitkopf', 'TV-MA', 'After a mysterious disease begins transforming people into vampires, Dr. Luther Swann is pitted against his best friend, now a powerful vampire leader.', 'After a mysterious disease begins transforming people into vampires, Dr. Luther Swann is pitted against his best friend, now a powerful vampire leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/njOxOfBp0d7DgdrMnOH1VugC9yZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81559'),
  ('124409248304409615', 'V: The Final Battle', 1984, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kenneth Johnson', 'Craig Buck, Diane Frolov, Peggy Goldman', 'Jane Badler, Michael Durrell, Robert Englund, Faye Grant, Richard Herd, Thomas Hill, Michael Ironside, Peter Nelson', null, 'A small group of human resistance fighters fight a desperate guerilla war against the genocidal extra-terrestrials who dominate Earth.', 'A small group of human resistance fighters fight a desperate guerilla war against the genocidal extra-terrestrials who dominate Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTvzdwDbH6UajxEY1Deg6oeR2WA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75896'),
  ('80147161604267829', 'V.I.P.', 1998, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Crime', 'J.F. Lawton', null, 'Pamela Anderson, Molly Culver, Shaun Baker, Natalie Raitano, Leah Lail, Angelle Brooks, Dustin Nguyễn', 'TV-14', 'While attending a Hollywood premiere with a famous action star, a crazed fan pulls a gun—but her movie hunk turns into a coward, and it''s Vallery who becomes the hero. Suddenly, she''s thrown into a world of action and danger as owner of a Hollywood protection agency, Vallery Irons Protection (V.I.P.), taking risks to protect others at a price few are willing to pay.', 'While attending a Hollywood premiere with a famous action star, a crazed fan pulls a gun—but her movie hunk turns into a coward, and it''s Vallery who becomes the hero. Suddenly, she''s thrown into a world of action and danger as owner of a Hollywood protection agency, Vallery Irons Protection (V.I.P.), taking risks to protect others at a price few are willing to pay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2pHBPVGn2DpYEAHBdT62nc0untt.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:4397'),
  ('147185323451124971', 'V.I.P. Cop', 2016, 'Drama, Crime, Comedy', 'Ilya Kulikov', null, 'Sergey Burunov, Tatiana Babenkova, Sofya Kashtanova, Roman Popov, Rina Grishina, Svetlana Sukhanova', null, 'The television tragicomic story about a young guy named Grisha Izmailov, who became a policeman and was called to protect peace and order in the most elite area of ​​the city of Moscow and the Russian Federation. The guy has to investigate the cases in which the residents of Rublyovka get involved, and he does this, often exceeding his authority. Grisha is about 30 years old, he is handsome, lonely, rich, cynical, passionate and treats everything with a fair amount of black humor. He takes care of his younger sister Nika, who he is forced to constantly get out of trouble. He regularly mocks his boss, Volodya, who thinks that Grisha was sent to him for all his deadly sins. The main character’s best friend is Mukhich, a colorful, clumsy fat man who has no success with girls. Grisha himself, without exerting effort, knows how to please women, for example, his girlfriend - prostitute Christina, but can never achieve reciprocity from Alena, who has long been in love with.', 'The television tragicomic story about a young guy named Grisha Izmailov, who became a policeman and was called to protect peace and order in the most elite area of ​​the city of Moscow and the Russian Federation. The guy has to investigate the cases in which the residents of Rublyovka get involved, and he does this, often exceeding his authority. Grisha is about 30 years old, he is handsome, lonely, rich, cynical, passionate and treats everything with a fair amount of black humor. He takes care of his younger sister Nika, who he is forced to constantly get out of trouble. He regularly mocks his boss, Volodya, who thinks that Grisha was sent to him for all his deadly sins. The main character’s best friend is Mukhich, a colorful, clumsy fat man who has no success with girls. Grisha himself, without exerting effort, knows how to please women, for example, his girlfriend - prostitute Christina, but can never achieve reciprocity from Alena, who has long been in love with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3la60SBas5hWMP2C5mzb6WXL89S.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:65953'),
  ('976802151994384121', 'V.I.P. Schaukel', 1971, 'Talk, Documentary', 'Margret Dünser', null, 'Margret Dünser', null, 'V.I.P.-Schaukel is a 45 minute documentary-family-news-talk show starring Margret Dünser as Host. The series premiered on Sun May 09, 1971 on ZDF and Folge 37 - Final Show last aired on Fri May 09, 1980.', 'V.I.P.-Schaukel is a 45 minute documentary-family-news-talk show starring Margret Dünser as Host. The series premiered on Sun May 09, 1971 on ZDF and Folge 37 - Final Show last aired on Fri May 09, 1980.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:27320'),
  ('113267379335465315', 'Vacation of Love', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Liu Tao, Chen He, Zhang Jiani, Yang Le, Cheng Xiao, Zhou Lula', null, 'Heartbroken showbiz agent Li Yi finds an unexpected chance at love and a fresh start when the attentive Hou Hao enters her life during a fateful New Year’s Eve.', 'Heartbroken showbiz agent Li Yi finds an unexpected chance at love and a fresh start when the attentive Hou Hao enters her life during a fateful New Year’s Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUg65FEeh0thznOyG8CpuDSUBG9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:117544'),
  ('1129135393181823176', 'Vacation Playhouse', 1963, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, null, null, null, 'The concept of the series was the showing of unaired and unsold television pilots that did not make the television lineup for CBS. The show was successful during its first few seasons due to the fact that the show''s concept, airing unsold and unaired television pilots, was a popular concept in the 1960s. But during its last two seasons on the air, the series did find some trouble due to the fact that the series were running out of pilots to air and, in their 4th season, they began airing repeats from the three seasons prior. During its 1966 summer run, the series aired eights new pilots and two repeats and during its last year airing five new pilots and four repeats.', 'The concept of the series was the showing of unaired and unsold television pilots that did not make the television lineup for CBS. The show was successful during its first few seasons due to the fact that the show''s concept, airing unsold and unaired television pilots, was a popular concept in the 1960s. But during its last two seasons on the air, the series did find some trouble due to the fact that the series were running out of pilots to air and, in their 4th season, they began airing repeats from the three seasons prior. During its 1966 summer run, the series aired eights new pilots and two repeats and during its last year airing five new pilots and four repeats.', null, 5, 'tmdb:tv:24608'),
  ('1024989435871171845', 'Vadhandhi', 2022, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Andrew Louis', 'Andrew Louis', 'S. J. Suryah, Sanjana Krishnamoorthy, Laila, Vivek Prasanna, Smruthi Venkat, Nassar, Vaibhav Murugesan, Aruvi Bala', 'TV-14', 'Vivek, a diligent cop, takes charge of the investigation of the murder of a beautiful young girl, Velonie. The rumours about her that spring up post her death threatens to irrevocably damage Velonie''s image, Vivek must wade through a web of half-truths and confusing leads to solve the case.', 'Vivek, a diligent cop, takes charge of the investigation of the murder of a beautiful young girl, Velonie. The rumours about her that spring up post her death threatens to irrevocably damage Velonie''s image, Vivek must wade through a web of half-truths and confusing leads to solve the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yMlWD4vMzJzJbME8ghTP9a7cVZx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:200881'),
  ('373841283324402816', 'Vagabond', 2019, 'Drama, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Yoo In-sik, Jang Yeong-cheol', 'Jang Young-cheol, Jung Gyeong-sun', 'Lee Seung-gi, Suzy, Shin Sung-rok, Moon Jeong-hee, Baek Yoon-sik, Moon Sung-keun, Lee Kyung-young, Lee Ki-young', 'TV-MA', 'Stuntman Cha Dal-geon gets involved in a tragic airplane crash and ends up discovering a national corruption scandal in the process. Go Hae-ri, the oldest daughter of a deceased marine, decides to work for the National Intelligence Service as a secret ops agent in order to support her mom and younger siblings, although all she wanted to do is to become a civil servant.', 'Stuntman Cha Dal-geon gets involved in a tragic airplane crash and ends up discovering a national corruption scandal in the process. Go Hae-ri, the oldest daughter of a deceased marine, decides to work for the National Intelligence Service as a secret ops agent in order to support her mom and younger siblings, although all she wanted to do is to become a civil servant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Sud9wqG7WZMXesZhPZ4lergRvp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92983'),
  ('824258225440686295', 'Vagrant Queen', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Jem Garrard', null, 'Adriyan Rae, Tim Rozon, Alex McGregor, Paul du Toit', 'TV-14', 'Elida, an orphaned queen who refuses to accept her true title, prefers to scavenge and get into scrapes throughout the galaxy as the Republic government seeks to snuff out her royal bloodline. Elida''s existence is turned upside down when her friend from way back, Isaac, claims that Elida''s mother, Xevelyn, is still alive.', 'Elida, an orphaned queen who refuses to accept her true title, prefers to scavenge and get into scrapes throughout the galaxy as the Republic government seeks to snuff out her royal bloodline. Elida''s existence is turned upside down when her friend from way back, Isaac, claims that Elida''s mother, Xevelyn, is still alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s83DmhvDxeVPu4x4ZpLQ3KmGe0K.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99412'),
