  ('560560677111323087', 'Vaka', 2026, 'Drama', 'Brynja Björk', null, 'Lola Zackow, Jonas Karlsson, Aliette Opheim, Gizem Erdogan, Silas Strand, Malte Gårdinger, Frida Argento, Jörgen Thorsson', null, 'An insomnia epidemic plunges Stockholm into chaos. A prime minister manages the crisis while protecting his son, a nurse fights to save her infected partner, and a teenager protects her neighbor amid the spreading disease.', 'An insomnia epidemic plunges Stockholm into chaos. A prime minister manages the crisis while protecting his son, a nurse fights to save her infected partner, and a teenager protects her neighbor amid the spreading disease.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPzZhv4SiG29e5mWduWIsetEz2N.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:309400'),
  ('1097896237795544545', 'Vakáción a Mézga család', 1980, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', 'József Nepp', null, 'Péter Geszti, Ilona Györi, Margit Földessy, Endre Harkányi', null, 'The exciting summer adventures of the Mezga family is followed on an uninhabited island, for example, which is perhaps not uninhabited after all? And how will Maris neighbour become the next Minister of Health? And how does the Mezga''s family escape from the captivity of the mafia? Everything will be revealed if you look at the Mezga family vacation stories.', 'The exciting summer adventures of the Mezga family is followed on an uninhabited island, for example, which is perhaps not uninhabited after all? And how will Maris neighbour become the next Minister of Health? And how does the Mezga''s family escape from the captivity of the mafia? Everything will be revealed if you look at the Mezga family vacation stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3HEA0BCIRV837iolkiVZqP19898.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69362'),
  ('411286988962321684', 'Val x Love', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'Yuya Hirose, Kaede Hondo, Ai Kakuma, Rina Hidaka, Yumi Hara, Ayaka Shimizu, Yumi Uchiyama, Kotori Koiwai', null, 'High schooler Takuma Akutsu has learned to accept his lonely lot in life and is content surrounded by his studies, but when the god Odin taps him to save the world alongside nine Valkyries fueled by intimacy, Takuma can say good-bye to his solitary existence.', 'High schooler Takuma Akutsu has learned to accept his lonely lot in life and is content surrounded by his studies, but when the god Odin taps him to save the world alongside nine Valkyries fueled by intimacy, Takuma can say good-bye to his solitary existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6TIEhcHYK8fLmgDKxrLE6tieEQQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91027'),
  ('445383079139729385', 'Vale o Escrito: A Guerra do Jogo do Bicho', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Fellipe Awi', null, null, null, 'The "jogo do bicho" (an illegal lottery of numbers) in Rio de Janeiro is controlled by families whose leaders are also patrons of samba schools. Two of these families are experiencing bloody wars of succession.', 'The "jogo do bicho" (an illegal lottery of numbers) in Rio de Janeiro is controlled by families whose leaders are also patrons of samba schools. Two of these families are experiencing bloody wars of succession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qtlckAfiU6OLGTfSCTmtBoNxh1g.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:236267'),
  ('252637798966792770', 'Vale Tudo', 1988, 'Soap, Drama', 'Gilberto Braga, Aguinaldo Silva, Leonor Bassères', 'Aguinaldo Silva, Leonor Bassères, Gilberto Braga', 'Regina Duarte, Antônio Fagundes, Lídia Brondi, Cássio Gabus Mendes, Glória Pires, Carlos Alberto Riccelli, Beatriz Segall, Reginaldo Faria', null, 'Fátima Accioly is a young, callous woman who wants to be rich and successful at any price. After selling her family''s house in the country, she heads to Rio and gets to know dress man César who is unscrupulous himself. Meanwhile, her mother Raquel stays behind without home and money, but finally tries to find her daughter in the big city. Both women come in contact with the rich Roitman family which changes their lives forever.', 'Fátima Accioly is a young, callous woman who wants to be rich and successful at any price. After selling her family''s house in the country, she heads to Rio and gets to know dress man César who is unscrupulous himself. Meanwhile, her mother Raquel stays behind without home and money, but finally tries to find her daughter in the big city. Both women come in contact with the rich Roitman family which changes their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yxd4toG8S8a0dcRF5kTd6u86fBm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46161'),
  ('1126670167243510676', 'Valentina Valiente', 2026, 'Soap, Drama, Family', null, 'Augusto Cabada, Mariana Silva, Fortunata Barrios', 'Mayra Goñi, Rodrigo Brand, Roberto Moll, Haydeé Cáceres, Mariel Ocampo, Alessa Wichtel, Leandra Núñez, Pierina Carcelén', null, 'Valentina is a young, resilient woman who has dedicated her life to raising her younger siblings. However, her life takes an unexpected turn when she discovers she is the heir to a vast fortune, plunging her into a world where power, the past, and hidden agendas will dictate her path. Along the way, she meets Alejandro, a love that seems impossible, yet inevitable.', 'Valentina is a young, resilient woman who has dedicated her life to raising her younger siblings. However, her life takes an unexpected turn when she discovers she is the heir to a vast fortune, plunging her into a world where power, the past, and hidden agendas will dictate her path. Along the way, she meets Alejandro, a love that seems impossible, yet inevitable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/acpPFrmD92AmJeaXQ8i6ZNLS3VZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:316470'),
  ('767623226848377122', 'Valeria', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'María López Castaño', null, 'Diana Gómez, Silma López, Paula Malia, Teresa Riott, Maxi Iglesias, Juanlu González, Federico Aguado, José Pastor', 'TV-MA', 'A writer in a creative and marital crisis finds refuge and support in her three best friends. Based on the novels by Elisabet Benavent.', 'A writer in a creative and marital crisis finds refuge and support in her three best friends. Based on the novels by Elisabet Benavent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9WN7hVLAx7LEhLn5ZPylUEghM4m.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:101918'),
