  ('887334633728406258', 'Válgame Dios', 2012, 'Drama, Soap', 'Monica Montañez', null, 'Sabrina Seara, Eduardo Orozco, Ricardo Álamo, Jean Carlo Simancas, Flávia Gleske, Gigi Zanchetta, Roberto Messuti, Rosmeri Marval', 'NR', '¡Válgame Dios! is a Spanish-language Venezuelan telenovela written by Mónica Montañéz for Venevisión. Sabrina Seara and Eduardo Orozco star as the main protagonists while Ricardo Alamo, Carlota Sosa and Raquel Yanez star as the main antagonists.', '¡Válgame Dios! is a Spanish-language Venezuelan telenovela written by Mónica Montañéz for Venevisión. Sabrina Seara and Eduardo Orozco star as the main protagonists while Ricardo Alamo, Carlota Sosa and Raquel Yanez star as the main antagonists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yuF3eu03BriObBdlXCH4vPwJWmc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45115'),
  ('388392819304044973', 'Valiant Love', 2012, 'Soap, Drama', 'Martha Carrillo, Cristina Garcia, María Zarattini', 'María Zarattini', 'Silvia Navarro, Cristián de la Fuente, Leticia Calderón, César Évora Díaz, Flavio Medina, René Strickler, Laura Carmine, Fernanda Castillo', 'TV-PG', 'Camila Monterde is a beautiful veterinarian whose life has been torn apart by a tragic accident in which her fiancé, Luis, was killed. Hoping to ease her depression, her uncle, Daniel Monterde, invites her to live at his ranch, where she can rest and recover while caring for the many animals he keeps there. Meanwhile, in Chile, Daniel Diaz suddenly receives a letter stating that he has come into a substantial inheritance and must travel to Mexico to claim it. Surprised and curious, he’s about to make the trip when a vicious lie disrupts his plans and lands him in prison, causing him to lose the inheritance and his family. Deeply bitter and hungry for revenge, Daniel travels to Mexico determined to destroy the Monterde family, which he blames for his terrible misfortune. He takes a job at the Monterde ranch to be close to his prey. His vengeance is perfectly planned except for one unexpected development: he and Camila fall passionately in love and that changes everything.', 'Camila Monterde is a beautiful veterinarian whose life has been torn apart by a tragic accident in which her fiancé, Luis, was killed. Hoping to ease her depression, her uncle, Daniel Monterde, invites her to live at his ranch, where she can rest and recover while caring for the many animals he keeps there. Meanwhile, in Chile, Daniel Diaz suddenly receives a letter stating that he has come into a substantial inheritance and must travel to Mexico to claim it. Surprised and curious, he’s about to make the trip when a vicious lie disrupts his plans and lands him in prison, causing him to lose the inheritance and his family. Deeply bitter and hungry for revenge, Daniel travels to Mexico determined to destroy the Monterde family, which he blames for his terrible misfortune. He takes a job at the Monterde ranch to be close to his prey. His vengeance is perfectly planned except for one unexpected development: he and Camila fall passionately in love and that changes everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lg8kA5QLt60bNNf1znu3eldM6mC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42029'),
  ('532382277235279284', 'Valkyria Chronicles', 2009, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, War & Politics', null, null, 'Marina Inoue, Junko Minagawa, Houko Kuwashima, Takahiro Sakurai, Kenji Nomura', 'TV-14', 'When Imperial forces attack the small border town of Bruhl, Welkin Gunther, son of late General Belgen Gunther, is forced to fight for his life alongside Town Watch captain Alicia Melchiott. Along with Welkin''s adopted sister Isara, the three escape to Gallia''s capitol and subsequently join the country''s militia forces. As members of the newly-formed Squad 7, they must work to repel the invading Imperial forces and discover the true purpose of the invasion itself.', 'When Imperial forces attack the small border town of Bruhl, Welkin Gunther, son of late General Belgen Gunther, is forced to fight for his life alongside Town Watch captain Alicia Melchiott. Along with Welkin''s adopted sister Isara, the three escape to Gallia''s capitol and subsequently join the country''s militia forces. As members of the newly-formed Squad 7, they must work to repel the invading Imperial forces and discover the true purpose of the invasion itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/arkbuM5HIZv7cRoftRpZEnGT24E.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:24392'),
  ('343891795733175888', 'Valkyrien', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Thomas Torjussen, Simen Svale Skogsrud, Lars Gudmestad', 'Erik Richter Strand, Bjørn Ekeberg, Kathrine Valen Zeiner', 'Sven Nordin, Pål Sverre Hagen, Pia Halvorsen, Mikkel Bratt Silset, Ellen Birgitte Winther, Laila Goody, Ameli Isungset Agbota, Joachim Rafaelsen', null, 'In an illegal hospital, hidden in an Oslo underground station, a physician is desperately trying to find a cure for his wife''s terminal illness.', 'In an illegal hospital, hidden in an Oslo underground station, a physician is desperately trying to find a cure for his wife''s terminal illness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dm8w5pupunIcnwL7lpVL5BgEtYb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68997'),
  ('531820158255405838', 'Valle salvaje', 2024, 'Drama, Soap', 'Josep Cister Rubio', null, null, null, '1763. The life of Adriana, a brave and loyal woman, suffers an unexpected setback when she receives a devastating blow: her father has died, and, as a result of a secret pact, she must travel from the city of Madrid to Valle Salvaje, in northern Spain, to marry a stranger. A dark secret from her past follows her to the remote valley, home to her fiancé''s family and her troubled aunt, Doña Victoria. There, her life will change forever. She will experience true love, betrayal, and danger as she tries to uncover the truth behind her father''s death.', '1763. The life of Adriana, a brave and loyal woman, suffers an unexpected setback when she receives a devastating blow: her father has died, and, as a result of a secret pact, she must travel from the city of Madrid to Valle Salvaje, in northern Spain, to marry a stranger. A dark secret from her past follows her to the remote valley, home to her fiancé''s family and her troubled aunt, Doña Victoria. There, her life will change forever. She will experience true love, betrayal, and danger as she tries to uncover the truth behind her father''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qB356qujmLpMZrY4TobXE9Wtalm.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:242874'),
  ('1105778630310052274', 'Valley of Tears', 2020, 'War & Politics, Drama', 'Gal Zaid, Amit Cohen, Ron Leshem', 'Daniel Amsel, Izhar Harlev, Amir Gutfreund', 'Aviv Alush, Lior Ashkenazi, Maor Schwitzer, Joy Rieger, Ofer Hayoun, Lee Biran, Imri Biton, Shahar Taboch', 'TV-14', 'On October 6th 1973, the Middle East was shaken by the biggest war it had ever seen. A war that should have been the last one, and that forever changed the region.', 'On October 6th 1973, the Middle East was shaken by the biggest war it had ever seen. A war that should have been the last one, and that forever changed the region.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ZbTPvD31BBlwQd0Vghm4lT9AXq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:111150'),
  ('246044458794442557', 'Valley of the Boom', 2019, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Matthew Carnahan', null, 'Steve Zahn, Bradley Whitford, John Murphy, Oliver Cooper, John Karna, Lamorne Morris, Dakota Shapiro', 'TV-14', 'An adrenaline-fueled ride through the culture of speculation, innovation and disruption during Silicon Valley’s unprecedented tech boom and subsequent bust in the 1990s. This mostly scripted series weaves in select documentary elements that help tell the true inside story of the internet’s formative years.', 'An adrenaline-fueled ride through the culture of speculation, innovation and disruption during Silicon Valley’s unprecedented tech boom and subsequent bust in the 1990s. This mostly scripted series weaves in select documentary elements that help tell the true inside story of the internet’s formative years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ivKrYuFI4r9yOBqvuYJpPX3Bws2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81188'),
  ('933661502997756554', 'Valley of the Dinosaurs', 1974, 'Animation', 'William Hanna', null, 'Mike Road, Alan Oppenheimer, Jackie Earle Haley, Frank Welker, Joan Gardner, Shannon Farnon', null, 'Valley of the Dinosaurs is an animated television series from the Australian studios of Hanna-Barbera that ran for 16 half-hour installments on CBS Saturday Morning from September 7, 1974 to September 4, 1976. Reruns are currently airing on the Boomerang network.', 'Valley of the Dinosaurs is an animated television series from the Australian studios of Hanna-Barbera that ran for 16 half-hour installments on CBS Saturday Morning from September 7, 1974 to September 4, 1976. Reruns are currently airing on the Boomerang network.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lI4SwQjDgmZ4VKdS5dDI5wYsBni.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11709'),
  ('648847247928663903', 'Valley of the Wolves: Ambush', 2007, 'Drama, War & Politics, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Raci Şaşmaz', null, 'Necati Şaşmaz, Erhan Ufak, Yılmaz Meydaneri, Nevin Efe, Ayla Algan', null, 'A continuation series of Osman Sinav''s The Wolves Of The Valley. This produce focuses on politics, National Security and Regional Middle East problems. The Wolves of The Valley: Ambush serie also attracts attention by two film; The Wolves of The Valley: Iraq and The Wolves of The Valley: Palestine.', 'A continuation series of Osman Sinav''s The Wolves Of The Valley. This produce focuses on politics, National Security and Regional Middle East problems. The Wolves of The Valley: Ambush serie also attracts attention by two film; The Wolves of The Valley: Iraq and The Wolves of The Valley: Palestine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wDWkjobSJm8I5r2ctSPtneUjHxT.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:49071'),
  ('1068642369225096066', 'Valley of the Wolves: Terror', 2007, 'War & Politics, Crime, Reality, Drama', 'Raci Şaşmaz', 'Raci Şaşmaz, Bahadır Özdener, Cüneyt Aysan', 'Necati Şaşmaz, Gürkan Uygun, Kenan Çoban, Erhan Ufak, Sönmez Atasoy, Erdem Ergüney, Emin Olcay, Kerem Fırtına', null, 'Polat Alemdar and his friends continue to struggle, in the last two seasons against MAFIA, but in this season against the terrorists organizations, in a particular PKK, Kurdish organization. This season stopped after only two episodes, because political reasons, and replaced with KURTLAR VADISI: PUSU series...', 'Polat Alemdar and his friends continue to struggle, in the last two seasons against MAFIA, but in this season against the terrorists organizations, in a particular PKK, Kurdish organization. This season stopped after only two episodes, because political reasons, and replaced with KURTLAR VADISI: PUSU series...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMWIgcj7TtlYyMjevk8AyBUuQq7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:48253'),
  ('84231861493699352', 'Való Világ', 2002, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'Interactive Real World night-show.', 'Interactive Real World night-show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQ6EfC1igZRNSSsnQbLG2mrOLwj.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:20812'),
  ('262212281552611713', 'Valor', 2017, 'Drama', 'Kyle Jarrow', null, 'Christina Ochoa, Matt Barr, W. Tré Davis, Melissa Roxburgh, Nigel Thatch, Charlie Barnett, Corbin Reid, Tim Griffin', 'TV-14', 'The boundaries between military discipline and human desire are tested on a U.S. Army base that houses an elite unit of helicopter pilots trained to perform clandestine international and domestic missions. The drama unfolds in the present as well as in flashbacks to a failed mission involving one of the first female pilots in the unit, ultimately uncovering layers of personal and government/military secrets and leading to a season-long plan to rescue a group of MIA soldiers.', 'The boundaries between military discipline and human desire are tested on a U.S. Army base that houses an elite unit of helicopter pilots trained to perform clandestine international and domestic missions. The drama unfolds in the present as well as in flashbacks to a failed mission involving one of the first female pilots in the unit, ultimately uncovering layers of personal and government/military secrets and leading to a season-long plan to rescue a group of MIA soldiers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJKRWAp0ZO8zM5VhGlISusLrbXs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71806'),
  ('373286804618566620', 'Válótársak', 2015, null, null, null, 'Eszter Földes, Gabriella Gubás, András Stohl, Péter Scherer, Tamás Lengyel, Mónika Balsai', null, 'Bálint Sáfár, the charming businessman has several affairs, and when his wife Zsófi - with whom he has two children - finds out about his infidelity, she breaks up with him. Bálint decides to move to one of his houses on sale. On the same day Bálint''s subcontractor Joci, who renovates his houses, breaks up with his girlfriend Szonja and decides to stay at this same house. Joci has some serious issues in his private life. His girlfriend Szonja couldn''t get pregnant for years, and after her hormone therapy, he just can''t live with her anymore. Dávid Jakab, successful businessman realises that his wife, Tamara hates him and wants to get a divorce on their 16th anniversary. Dávid asks Bálint if he could stay at his house while he tries to save his marriage. The series follows these freshly-divorced guys'' lives as they try to solve their relationship problems.', 'Bálint Sáfár, the charming businessman has several affairs, and when his wife Zsófi - with whom he has two children - finds out about his infidelity, she breaks up with him. Bálint decides to move to one of his houses on sale. On the same day Bálint''s subcontractor Joci, who renovates his houses, breaks up with his girlfriend Szonja and decides to stay at this same house. Joci has some serious issues in his private life. His girlfriend Szonja couldn''t get pregnant for years, and after her hormone therapy, he just can''t live with her anymore. Dávid Jakab, successful businessman realises that his wife, Tamara hates him and wants to get a divorce on their 16th anniversary. Dávid asks Bálint if he could stay at his house while he tries to save his marriage. The series follows these freshly-divorced guys'' lives as they try to solve their relationship problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLEUofHvPMvXKYcDvOCXEZGvCvv.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:64457'),
  ('1092805455207786334', 'Valvrave the Liberator', 2013, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Ryota Osaka, Ryohei Kimura, Asami Seto, Haruka Tomatsu, Jun Fukuyama, Mamoru Miyano, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Yuki Kaji', 'TV-14', 'Haruto Tokishima, a high school student, discovers Valvrave, a mysterious and very powerful machine, and after controlling it Haruto becomes immortal.', 'Haruto Tokishima, a high school student, discovers Valvrave, a mysterious and very powerful machine, and after controlling it Haruto becomes immortal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/800znNngbnDR2cHg2HXVHxCaKhP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:52896'),
  ('581641225825197373', 'Vamp', 1991, 'Soap, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Antônio Calmon', 'Antônio Calmon, Tiago Santiago, Vinícius Vianna', 'Claudia Ohana, Ney Latorraca, Reginaldo Faria, Joana Fomm, Fábio Assunção, Nuno Leal Maia, Patrícya Travassos, Otávio Augusto', null, 'After making a Faustian bargain with a vampire for fame, a regretful young singer must find a sacred, lost artifact that might revert the curse.', 'After making a Faustian bargain with a vampire for fame, a regretful young singer must find a sacred, lost artifact that might revert the curse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uIU87AvtHQI8tr3kNvO8aegtQRI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:36951'),
  ('175530960788382517', 'Vampire Academy', 2022, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Marguerite MacIntyre, Julie Plec', null, 'Sisi Stringer, Daniela Nieves, Kieron Moore, André Dae Kim, J. August Richards, Jonetta Kaiser, Anita-Joy Uwajeh, Mia McKenna-Bruce', 'TV-MA', 'In a world of privilege and glamour, two young women’s friendship transcends their strikingly different classes as they prepare to complete their education and enter royal vampire society. Based on the young adult novels by Richelle Mead.', 'In a world of privilege and glamour, two young women’s friendship transcends their strikingly different classes as they prepare to complete their education and enter royal vampire society. Based on the young adult novels by Richelle Mead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVwWkJBbOtxM7VKg7PS1IkjYpQc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:125940'),
  ('718904660249980285', 'Vampire Detective', 2016, 'Mystery', null, 'Yoo Young-seon', 'Lee Joon, Oh Jung-se, Lee Se-young, Kim Yoon-hye, Lee Chung-ah, Jo Bok-rae, Jei, Ahn Se-ha', null, 'Private detective Yoon San gets turned into a vampire one day while he was out on a duty. As he meets various clients and cracks cases for them, he also uncovers the mystery surrounding him as well as the secrets from his past.', 'Private detective Yoon San gets turned into a vampire one day while he was out on a duty. As he meets various clients and cracks cases for them, he also uncovers the mystery surrounding him as well as the secrets from his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wObXNGpREf4xIQh7bTaFw7Bqun6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65725'),
  ('684582912998280428', 'Vampire Dormitory', 2024, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kana Ichinose, Shunichi Toki, Yuuichirou Umehara, Wataru Hatano, Yusuke Shirai, Yuki Sakakihara', 'TV-14', 'After Mito loses her parents and is fired from her job, she must fend for herself on the streets disguised as a boy. She comes across a stranger named Ruka and learns his dark secret—he''s a vampire! Ruka invites Mito, still in disguise, to live in an all-boys dorm. Mito exchanges her blood for a place to stay, but a budding romance and her true identity threaten all that hangs in the balance.', 'After Mito loses her parents and is fired from her job, she must fend for herself on the streets disguised as a boy. She comes across a stranger named Ruka and learns his dark secret—he''s a vampire! Ruka invites Mito, still in disguise, to live in an all-boys dorm. Mito exchanges her blood for a place to stay, but a budding romance and her true identity threaten all that hangs in the balance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4HvRKul54BSRFBeY5uaA3354Bz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:238903'),
  ('523725493341900356', 'Vampire Expert', 1995, 'Mystery, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Lam Ching-Ying, Kiki Sheung, Frankie Lam, Mang Hoi, Annie Man Chung-Han, Cheng Pak-Lam, Philip Keung Ho-Man, Bonnie Lai Suk-Yin', null, 'Zhang Tian-shi''s 18th generation disciple, Mao Xiao-fang, heads south to Hong Kong to track down the zombie king. Along the way, he meets Yang Fei-yun, a master of numerology and fortune-telling. Mao gains recognition for his exceptional Taoist abilities, which attracts jealousy from the head of the Seven Sisters Hall, Chung Kwan. Chung is bitter enemies with Mao, but her younger brother Chung Pong, a prodigious student, takes Mao as his teacher. Mao is unaware that Yang is a cunning and treacherous scoundrel. Yang tricks him into a trap, and eventually becomes the Great Demon King. Chung Pong sacrifices his relationship with his lover, Yuh Pak-sum, to become a great Taoist and help Mao defeat Yang.', 'Zhang Tian-shi''s 18th generation disciple, Mao Xiao-fang, heads south to Hong Kong to track down the zombie king. Along the way, he meets Yang Fei-yun, a master of numerology and fortune-telling. Mao gains recognition for his exceptional Taoist abilities, which attracts jealousy from the head of the Seven Sisters Hall, Chung Kwan. Chung is bitter enemies with Mao, but her younger brother Chung Pong, a prodigious student, takes Mao as his teacher. Mao is unaware that Yang is a cunning and treacherous scoundrel. Yang tricks him into a trap, and eventually becomes the Great Demon King. Chung Pong sacrifices his relationship with his lover, Yuh Pak-sum, to become a great Taoist and help Mao defeat Yang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6C5iz8gM6Cnx3CtF6C3dsyNg6Ke.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:76085'),
  ('1103058159339905112', 'Vampire Flower', 2014, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Seo Jae-hyung, Dowoo, Moon Ji-hoo, Lee Seung-yub, Kim Beong-choun, Kim Ga-eun', null, 'Louis is a centuries old vampire who appears to be a teenager. He has fallen in love with Seo-young, a high school student with extraordinary blood. Together, they trek through the land of the vampires to retrieve a long lost flower.', 'Louis is a centuries old vampire who appears to be a teenager. He has fallen in love with Seo-young, a high school student with extraordinary blood. Together, they trek through the land of the vampires to retrieve a long lost flower.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udxtdS3utYEWyszL2CbNWcc6lXI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72770'),
  ('294944130934612033', 'Vampire Girl', 2013, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Marcela Citterio', 'Marcela Citterio', 'Greeicy Rendón, Santiago Talledo, Eduardo Pérez, Lorena García, Juan Manuel Restrepo, Jacqueline Arenal, Juan Pablo Obregon, Linda Lucía Callejas', 'TV-Y7', 'Daisy O''Brian is a normal girl who dreams of a singing career in musical comedy. Her parents are vampires, and per her family tradition, she must decide to become a vampire or not on her 16th birthday. On that day, Daisy decides to stay human to live next to her love, Max, who is her neighbor and classmate. However, that same day, a fatal accident changes her life forever. The doctor says to her parents that she is not going to make it. So, her parents decide to bite Daisy, to save her, turning her into a vampire. This makes Vicente (her younger brother) the only mortal in the family. From that moment, Daisy leads a double life full of risks, where she must attend a human school, hiding her nature, and also go to vampire school and take classes for newly bitten vampires.', 'Daisy O''Brian is a normal girl who dreams of a singing career in musical comedy. Her parents are vampires, and per her family tradition, she must decide to become a vampire or not on her 16th birthday. On that day, Daisy decides to stay human to live next to her love, Max, who is her neighbor and classmate. However, that same day, a fatal accident changes her life forever. The doctor says to her parents that she is not going to make it. So, her parents decide to bite Daisy, to save her, turning her into a vampire. This makes Vicente (her younger brother) the only mortal in the family. From that moment, Daisy leads a double life full of risks, where she must attend a human school, hiding her nature, and also go to vampire school and take classes for newly bitten vampires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mWpTjJO99SMusPHdV12UuMwtoNc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64570'),
  ('150521268039697925', 'Vampire Holmes', 2015, 'Animation, Mystery, Comedy', null, null, 'Yoshinobu Sena, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Ayahi Takagaki', null, 'While crowded in daytime, this London neighborhood has been haunted by a “vampire killer” for many nights. The protagonist wakes up in a residence, with a man calling himself "Holmes" and claiming to have entered the house chasing after a vampire. Unknowingly, the door of the residence has been locked from the outside...', 'While crowded in daytime, this London neighborhood has been haunted by a “vampire killer” for many nights. The protagonist wakes up in a residence, with a man calling himself "Holmes" and claiming to have entered the house chasing after a vampire. Unknowingly, the door of the residence has been locked from the outside...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mL7ydYZ746gCnvNy7qwUthwD6lA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62513'),
  ('157750540592316698', 'Vampire Idol', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Lee Sung Eun, Ha Chul-seung', 'Lee Jung, Kim Woo-bin, Lee Soo-hyuk, Hong Jong-hyun, Bang Min-ah, Kang Min-kyung, Lee Yu-bi, Chun Woo-hee', null, 'A naive vampire prince from Vampire planet visits Earth to see a live performance of his favorite idol contender. He remains stuck on Earth with his three trusted and loyal servants. He then decides to join the competition himself and struggles to become a global pop idol.', 'A naive vampire prince from Vampire planet visits Earth to see a live performance of his favorite idol contender. He remains stuck on Earth with his three trusted and loyal servants. He then decides to join the competition himself and struggles to become a global pop idol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3feX8F9OZLjshJhulsq1eR6F6vO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83200'),
  ('1141531896902809269', 'Vampire in the Garden', 2022, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Megumi Han, Yu Kobayashi, Chiaki Kobayashi, Rica Fukami, Hiroki Touchi, Ai Kakuma', 'TV-14', 'A vampire queen and a human girl join forces against all odds in search of “paradise” — a place where humans and vampires peacefully coexist.', 'A vampire queen and a human girl join forces against all odds in search of “paradise” — a place where humans and vampires peacefully coexist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cL7AmuHxCwDCu8d3kX93NTEDhdw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99772'),
  ('30767990068573800', 'Vampire Knight', 2008, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Matsuri Hino', null, 'Daisuke Kishio, Yui Horie, Mamoru Miyano, Junichi Suwabe, Junko Minagawa, Eri Kitamura, Fumiko Orikasa, Hiroki Yasumoto', 'TV-14', 'At Cross Academy, two student disciplinary committee members are tasked with keeping the peace between a human class and a night class of vampires.', 'At Cross Academy, two student disciplinary committee members are tasked with keeping the peace between a human class and a night class of vampires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eqloipTo5S791bD6zHegJbs2BBV.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:17149'),
  ('28313124964960886', 'Vampire Princess Miyu', 1997, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Miki Nagasawa, Shin-ichiro Miki, Megumi Ogata, Megumi Ogata, Asa Shirakura, Chiharu Tezuka, Mika Kanai, Kokoro Shindô', 'NR', 'Miyu, a vampire girl, acts as a guardian, sending stray demons known as Shinma back to the darkness while publicly posing as a high school student.', 'Miyu, a vampire girl, acts as a guardian, sending stray demons known as Shinma back to the darkness while publicly posing as a high school student.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A5Ro3RpFXAWiV5Ntk7BoMcDcSUE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42460'),
  ('676089703331905810', 'Vampire Prosecutor', 2011, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', null, 'Han Jung-hoon', 'Yeon Jeong-hun, Lee Young-ah, Kim Ji-young, Lee Won-jong, Lee Kyung-young, Kwon Hyun-sang, Kim Soo-hyeon, Kim Eung-soo', null, 'Min Tae Yeon isn''t your typical vampire or your typical prosecutor. Rather than drinking blood from innocent strangers, he opts for blood sold on the black market in the posh bars of Seoul. He also has the uncanny ability to tell where the victim of his cases died, and how they died based on their blood''s smell and taste. The only person who knows of his secret ability is Detective Hwang Soon Bum. They end up working together in a new joint department between police and prosecutors solving murder cases. They are joined by rookie prosecutor Yoo Jung In, and intern Cho Dong Man. Together, they solve murder cases, and Tae Yeon must use his "powers" to find leads on seemingly unsolvable cases. The one mystery he can''t solve is: who was the vampire/serial killer that changed him seven years ago?', 'Min Tae Yeon isn''t your typical vampire or your typical prosecutor. Rather than drinking blood from innocent strangers, he opts for blood sold on the black market in the posh bars of Seoul. He also has the uncanny ability to tell where the victim of his cases died, and how they died based on their blood''s smell and taste. The only person who knows of his secret ability is Detective Hwang Soon Bum. They end up working together in a new joint department between police and prosecutors solving murder cases. They are joined by rookie prosecutor Yoo Jung In, and intern Cho Dong Man. Together, they solve murder cases, and Tae Yeon must use his "powers" to find leads on seemingly unsolvable cases. The one mystery he can''t solve is: who was the vampire/serial killer that changed him seven years ago?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YFhgJ1bsALVSdvLpfY2jZIoL6C.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:42389'),
  ('562226386121021911', 'Vampires', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Benjamin Dupas, Isaure Pisani-Ferry, Anne Cissé', null, 'Juliette Cardinski, Oulaya Amamra, Pierre Lottin, Aliocha Schneider, Kate Moran, Mounir Amamra, Dylan Robert, Suzanne Clément', 'TV-MA', 'A Paris teen who''s half human, half vampire grapples with her emerging powers and family turmoil as she''s pursued by a secret vampire community.', 'A Paris teen who''s half human, half vampire grapples with her emerging powers and family turmoil as she''s pursued by a secret vampire community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l0wFYW4n8XiBdS7heDkW0Pan6uG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99935'),
  ('461709387825321502', 'Vampirina', 2017, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy', 'Chris Nee', null, 'Isabella Crovetti, James Van Der Beek, Lauren Graham, Mitchell Whitfield, Jordan Alexa Davis, ViviAnn Yee, Dee Bradley Baker, Benji Risley', 'TV-Y', 'A young vampire girl faces the joys and trials of being the new kid in town when her family moves from Transylvania to Pennsylvania.', 'A young vampire girl faces the joys and trials of being the new kid in town when her family moves from Transylvania to Pennsylvania.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18Mmri8vmBKbGbiymFPlSHlg71o.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:74323'),
  ('811375007448463661', 'Vampirina: Teenage Vampire', 2025, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Randi Barnes', null, 'Kenzi Richardson, Jiwon Lee, Faith Hedley, Shaun Dixon, Milo Maharlika', 'TV-G', 'Follow a tween vampire girl who leaves the safety of Transylvania to attend a performing arts boarding school. Living amongst humans for the first time, she pursues her passion for music while keeping her vampire identity a secret, something that’s made more challenging when her overprotective father charges an overzealous ghost to live with her at the school.', 'Follow a tween vampire girl who leaves the safety of Transylvania to attend a performing arts boarding school. Living amongst humans for the first time, she pursues her passion for music while keeping her vampire identity a secret, something that’s made more challenging when her overprotective father charges an overzealous ghost to live with her at the school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2o2jksVjFNOhs8NcDuUP6jhR1GP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:275722'),
  ('692763698326095701', 'Van der Valk', 1972, 'Drama', 'Nicolas Freeling', null, 'Barry Foster, Meg Davis, Ronald Hines, Richard Huw', null, 'Van der Valk is a British television series that was produced by Thames Television for the ITV network. It starred Barry Foster in the title role as Dutch detective Commissaris "Piet" van der Valk. Based on the characters and atmosphere of the novels of Nicolas Freeling, the first series was shown in 1972.', 'Van der Valk is a British television series that was produced by Thames Television for the ITV network. It starred Barry Foster in the title role as Dutch detective Commissaris "Piet" van der Valk. Based on the characters and atmosphere of the novels of Nicolas Freeling, the first series was shown in 1972.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7cSyT7qrAVHOdiaUqcZAdj4Jny1.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:12345'),
  ('1152160233153618195', 'Van der Valk', 2020, 'Crime, Drama', 'Chris Murray', null, 'Marc Warren, Maimie McCoy, Darrell D''Silva, Emma Fielding, Azan Ahmed', 'TV-PG', 'Set against the backdrop of the city of Amsterdam, Piet Van der Valk and his team investigate a series of high-profile cases immersed in the worlds of art, politics, addiction, mysticism and the fashion industry.', 'Set against the backdrop of the city of Amsterdam, Piet Van der Valk and his team investigate a series of high-profile cases immersed in the worlds of art, politics, addiction, mysticism and the fashion industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXhLu31ro2O8C5vRBzLjFP4yACO.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:97085'),
  ('198962022455732558', 'Van Helsing', 2016, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Neil LaBute', null, 'Kelly Overton, Rukiya Bernard, Aleks Paunovic', 'TV-14', 'Vanessa Helsing, the daughter of famous vampire hunter and Dracula nemesis Abraham Van Helsing is resurrected five years in the future to find out that vampires have taken over the world and that she possesses unique power over them. She is humanity’s last hope to lead an offensive to take back what has been lost.', 'Vanessa Helsing, the daughter of famous vampire hunter and Dracula nemesis Abraham Van Helsing is resurrected five years in the future to find out that vampires have taken over the world and that she possesses unique power over them. She is humanity’s last hope to lead an offensive to take back what has been lost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8ODGmfNbZQlNhiJl2xQENE2jsk.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:65820'),
