  ('37575211570450081', 'Victoria Small', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Erika Halvorsen, Daniel Burman', null, 'Lola Loyacono, Natalie Pérez, Mariana Genesio Peña, Julieta Díaz, Mica Suárez', 'NR', 'Jazmín, Barbara, Emma and Selva lives are entwined with the birth of Victoria, a newborn girl who makes their wish come true. The daughter of an adoptive mom, a surrogate mother, a transgender sperm donor and a stranger in the right place at the right time, Victoria will find four ways of loving, feeling and wishing, while these four women will have to put their differences aside in order to raise her.', 'Jazmín, Barbara, Emma and Selva lives are entwined with the birth of Victoria, a newborn girl who makes their wish come true. The daughter of an adoptive mom, a surrogate mother, a transgender sperm donor and a stranger in the right place at the right time, Victoria will find four ways of loving, feeling and wishing, while these four women will have to put their differences aside in order to raise her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3SsCtGEbzHITlRfvWbND79YXzMZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:94153'),
