  ('821083585068995936', 'VTuber Legend: How I Went Viral After Forgetting to Turn Off My Stream', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Ayane Sakura, Yu Kobayashi, Saku Mizuno, Machico, Sayaka Kikuchi, Sumire Morohoshi, Ayaka Ohashi, Yoko Hikasa', 'TV-MA', 'Yuki Tanaka is a VTuber at Live-On, one of Japan’s largest VTuber companies, as the polite and ladylike Awayuki Kokorone. One day, she forgets to end the stream, and viewers see her real personality—irreverent, improper, and prone to imbibing after a long day. Yuki is surprised to find that her accident caused her rankings to multiply, so she doubles down and gets to work. She’ll be a star yet!', 'Yuki Tanaka is a VTuber at Live-On, one of Japan’s largest VTuber companies, as the polite and ladylike Awayuki Kokorone. One day, she forgets to end the stream, and viewers see her real personality—irreverent, improper, and prone to imbibing after a long day. Yuki is surprised to find that her accident caused her rankings to multiply, so she doubles down and gets to work. She’ll be a star yet!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6eB42kmJWGZgKecme6jhDeNMQr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:229743'),
  ('345355610040577942', 'Vuelve a mí', 2023, 'Soap, Drama', 'Sergio Mendoza', null, 'Samadhi Zendejas, William Levy, Kimberly Dos Ramos, Rodolfo Salas, Laura Flores, Fernando Ciangherotti, Ximena Herrera, Geraldine Galvan', 'NR', 'The kidnapping of her son unleashes a storm in Nuria García''s life who, in the most difficult moment, meets Santiago Zepeda; together, they find redemption in the face of adversity.', 'The kidnapping of her son unleashes a storm in Nuria García''s life who, in the most difficult moment, meets Santiago Zepeda; together, they find redemption in the face of adversity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sGgYl7voI8T34azn5biA0MRpG3c.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:236921'),
  ('286670632861028362', 'Vuélveme A Querer', null, 'Drama', null, null, null, null, 'Vuelveme A Querer is the title of a Spanish-language telenovela produced by the Mexican television network TV Azteca. It stars Mariana Torres and Jorge Alberti as protagonists.It is a remake of Venezuelan telenovela Destino de Mujer in 1997, produced and broadcast by Venevision and starred by Sonya Smith and Jorge Reyes.', 'Vuelveme A Querer is the title of a Spanish-language telenovela produced by the Mexican television network TV Azteca. It stars Mariana Torres and Jorge Alberti as protagonists.It is a remake of Venezuelan telenovela Destino de Mujer in 1997, produced and broadcast by Venevision and starred by Sonya Smith and Jorge Reyes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJPS1KBe4thPvUGDMcXkDo2QrcQ.jpg', 0, 'tmdb:tv:32854'),
  ('1029718577584083209', 'W: Two Worlds Apart', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Song Jae-jung', null, 'Lee Jong-suk, Han Hyo-joo, Jung Yoo-jin, Lee Tae-hwan, Lee Si-eon, Park Won-sang, Kim Eui-sung, Kang Ki-young', 'NR', 'After being pulled into the webtoon world created by her father, a surgical resident gets entangled in a murder mystery involving the story''s hero.', 'After being pulled into the webtoon world created by her father, a surgical resident gets entangled in a murder mystery involving the story''s hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5sKZZ8APyfoqiAit1DCNnh9vaf0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66330'),
  ('12154224114272646', 'W.I.T.C.H.', 2004, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Elisabetta Gnone, Gary Tomlin', null, 'Kelly Stables, Candi Milo, kittie KaBoom, Liza del Mundo, Christel Khalil, Serena Berman, Dee Bradley Baker, Greg Cipes', 'TV-Y7', 'The Guardians must save Meridian from the evil sorcerer Phobos and Cedric who are searching for Phobos'' sister, the long lost princess of Meridian and true heir to the throne. They later find her and the Guardians then set about saving her from Phobos. When Meridian is freed from evil and true heir takes the throne, a new mysterious sorceress named Nerissa frees Phobos'' top henchmen and reforms them as the Knights of Vengeance. Once the Guardians learn more about the sorceress and her evil plan of reuniting former Guardians, they are able to defeat the Knights only to have more powerful Knights, in addition to the former Guardians attack them.', 'The Guardians must save Meridian from the evil sorcerer Phobos and Cedric who are searching for Phobos'' sister, the long lost princess of Meridian and true heir to the throne. They later find her and the Guardians then set about saving her from Phobos. When Meridian is freed from evil and true heir takes the throne, a new mysterious sorceress named Nerissa frees Phobos'' top henchmen and reforms them as the Knights of Vengeance. Once the Guardians learn more about the sorceress and her evil plan of reuniting former Guardians, they are able to defeat the Knights only to have more powerful Knights, in addition to the former Guardians attack them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8XTBHoLAEN3fa2QgszAgdW0pWne.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:137'),
  ('1112628496364724516', 'W''z', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Katsumi Fukuhara, Akane Fujita', 'TV-14', 'Inspired by house music from a young age, Yukiya spends his free time as a DJ for a crowd of one and uploads his videos online. Like any young teenager, he yearns for something greater than his current life. He wants recognition and importance, but breaking out of his comfort zone means he runs the risk of getting hurt, so the cycle continues. That is, until the day he finally crosses the line of no return and live streams a performance that will change his world forever.', 'Inspired by house music from a young age, Yukiya spends his free time as a DJ for a crowd of one and uploads his videos online. Like any young teenager, he yearns for something greater than his current life. He wants recognition and importance, but breaking out of his comfort zone means he runs the risk of getting hurt, so the cycle continues. That is, until the day he finally crosses the line of no return and live streams a performance that will change his world forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3s3N01PW9TtDl36OEmNcGHsJYNg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83099'),
  ('833650210937051297', 'W/ Bob & David', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Bob Odenkirk, David Cross', 'Eric Hoffman, Jay Johnston, Brian Posehn', 'David Cross, Bob Odenkirk, John Ennis, Jay Johnston, Brian Posehn, Paul F. Tompkins, Tom Kenny, Jill Talley', 'TV-MA', 'After being dishonorably discharged from the Navy Seals, Bob and David are back serving our country the way they do best, making sketch comedy. Four half-hours of brand new comedy featuring all new characters, all new scenes, and most importantly, all new wigs.', 'After being dishonorably discharged from the Navy Seals, Bob and David are back serving our country the way they do best, making sketch comedy. Four half-hours of brand new comedy featuring all new characters, all new scenes, and most importantly, all new wigs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xrLCIv5r1EtS9hNpLzRbNOKGLNy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64113'),
  ('962298674335682101', 'W1A', 2014, 'Comedy', 'John Morton', 'John Morton', 'Hugh Bonneville, Monica Dolan, Jessica Hynes, Sarah Parish, Jason Watkins, Hugh Skinner, David Westhead, Nina Sosanya', 'TV-14', 'The follow-up to ''Twenty Twelve'' as Ian Fletcher takes up the position of ''Head of Values'' at the BBC. His task is to clarify, define, or re-define the core purpose of the BBC across all its functions and to position it confidently for the future, in particular for Licence Fee Renegotiation and Charter Renewal in 2016 and 2017 respectively.', 'The follow-up to ''Twenty Twelve'' as Ian Fletcher takes up the position of ''Head of Values'' at the BBC. His task is to clarify, define, or re-define the core purpose of the BBC across all its functions and to position it confidently for the future, in particular for Licence Fee Renegotiation and Charter Renewal in 2016 and 2017 respectively.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dHnXjiXL9YCxRFlgUCVADAKq8AM.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:62479'),
  ('187245666423410284', 'Waccha Primagi!', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Anna Suzuki, Saho Aono, Chinatsu Hirose, Riko Koike, Umeka Shouji, Konomi Kohara, Mayu Sagara, Yui Ogura', null, '“PriMagi” is a form of entertainment created by singing, dancing and fashion! There''s a secret to this magical, sparkling stage! Yes, seriously, it really is "magic"! The main character, Hibino Matsuri, is a first year junior high school student who yearns to do "PriMagi". One day, she is scouted to join "PriMagi" by the wizard "Miyam", who suddenly appears!! The two of them work together to be at the top of "PriMagi", so they don''t lose to their rivals!', '“PriMagi” is a form of entertainment created by singing, dancing and fashion! There''s a secret to this magical, sparkling stage! Yes, seriously, it really is "magic"! The main character, Hibino Matsuri, is a first year junior high school student who yearns to do "PriMagi". One day, she is scouted to join "PriMagi" by the wizard "Miyam", who suddenly appears!! The two of them work together to be at the top of "PriMagi", so they don''t lose to their rivals!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBkzs9ZT409UMIKIlpVREe2U8Ho.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129599'),
  ('755833870078049652', 'Wacky Races', 1968, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'John Stephenson, Paul Winchell, Don Messick, Daws Butler, Janet Waldo, Dave Willock', 'TV-G', 'Wacky Races is an animated television series produced by Hanna-Barbera that originally aired in 1968. The show is a parody of traditional car races, featuring a variety of eccentric characters and their outlandish vehicles, all racing across different terrains in a madcap competition for first place. The series is centered around a group of 11 racers, each with their own unique vehicle and distinct personality. The main characters include Dick Dastardly and his dog Muttley, who are always trying to cheat and sabotage the other competitors, although they never succeed. Other notable racers include Penelope Pitstop, the glamorous but tough driver; the adventurous Red Max; and the lovable duo, the Slag Brothers, who drive a massive, rock-like car.', 'Wacky Races is an animated television series produced by Hanna-Barbera that originally aired in 1968. The show is a parody of traditional car races, featuring a variety of eccentric characters and their outlandish vehicles, all racing across different terrains in a madcap competition for first place. The series is centered around a group of 11 racers, each with their own unique vehicle and distinct personality. The main characters include Dick Dastardly and his dog Muttley, who are always trying to cheat and sabotage the other competitors, although they never succeed. Other notable racers include Penelope Pitstop, the glamorous but tough driver; the adventurous Red Max; and the lovable duo, the Slag Brothers, who drive a massive, rock-like car.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHeolC3qvELoeq8poh7BsMpBKd9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:985'),
  ('231121576605031853', 'Wacky Races', 2017, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Rebecca Himot, Tramm Wigzell', null, 'Peter Woodward, Billy West, Diedrich Bader, Tom Kenny, Jill Talley, Christopher Judge', 'TV-G', 'Wacky Races (2017) is a reboot of the classic 1968 Hanna-Barbera animated series, bringing a fresh, modern take on the original premise while retaining much of the core essence that made the original show so beloved. The 2017 version, created by Warner Bros. Animation, aired on the Boomerang network and introduced a new generation to the zany, high-speed races of the characters. In this updated series, the characters from the original Wacky Races return, but with a more contemporary style and new backstories. The vehicles are also revamped with more advanced technology and a few new additions to the roster, though the classic ones like Dick Dastardly’s Mean Machine and Penelope Pitstop’s Compact Pussycat are still present.', 'Wacky Races (2017) is a reboot of the classic 1968 Hanna-Barbera animated series, bringing a fresh, modern take on the original premise while retaining much of the core essence that made the original show so beloved. The 2017 version, created by Warner Bros. Animation, aired on the Boomerang network and introduced a new generation to the zany, high-speed races of the characters. In this updated series, the characters from the original Wacky Races return, but with a more contemporary style and new backstories. The vehicles are also revamped with more advanced technology and a few new additions to the roster, though the classic ones like Dick Dastardly’s Mean Machine and Penelope Pitstop’s Compact Pussycat are still present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgmUxN8vPB4WvvWKEhEpWs8SR9D.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:74916'),
  ('950166939542567975', 'Waco', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', 'John Erick Dowdle, Drew Dowdle', null, 'Michael Shannon, Taylor Kitsch, Rory Culkin, Paul Sparks, Andrea Riseborough, Shea Whigham, Melissa Benoist, Julia Garner', 'TV-14', 'The harrowing true story of the 1993 standoff between the FBI, ATF and the Branch Davidians, a spiritual sect led by David Koresh in Waco, TX that resulted in a deadly shootout and fire.', 'The harrowing true story of the 1993 standoff between the FBI, ATF and the Branch Davidians, a spiritual sect led by David Koresh in Waco, TX that resulted in a deadly shootout and fire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14q24aBfJPrjumuWjKKA6Bwml2A.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74140'),
  ('98537929254909494', 'Waco: American Apocalypse', 2023, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'David Thibodeau, Chris Whitcomb, Lee Hancock, Bob Ricks, Kathy Schroeder, David Koresh, Bill Buford', 'TV-MA', 'This docuseries includes never-before-seen material from the infamous 51-day standoff between federal agents and a heavily armed religious group in 1993.', 'This docuseries includes never-before-seen material from the infamous 51-day standoff between federal agents and a heavily armed religious group in 1993.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKsgrhu4qiuePmGmuVCUI84IfAD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:220229'),
  ('142078763463749297', 'Waco: The Aftermath', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', 'Drew Dowdle, John Erick Dowdle', null, 'Michael Shannon, Giovanni Ribisi, Keean Johnson, Abbey Lee, Alex Breaux, John Hoogenakker, Kali Rocha, Michael Luwoye', 'TV-14', 'Explore the wide-ranging fallout succeeding the tragic events that took place in Waco, TX: the trials of the surviving members of the Branch Davidian sect and the rise of homegrown terrorist, Timothy McVeigh.', 'Explore the wide-ranging fallout succeeding the tragic events that took place in Waco, TX: the trials of the surviving members of the Branch Davidian sect and the rise of homegrown terrorist, Timothy McVeigh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7xaVVAAhMJhc5VIRpRa48DLsRru.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:200701'),
  ('1104085851370213256', 'Waffles + Mochi', 2021, 'Kids', 'Erika Thormahlen, Jeremy Konner', null, 'Michelle Obama, Michelle Zamora, Piotr Michael, Jonathan Kidder, Diona Elise Burnett, Katie Leclerc', 'TV-Y', 'Curious puppet pals Waffles and Mochi travel the world exploring the wonders of food and culture while learning how to cook with fresh ingredients.', 'Curious puppet pals Waffles and Mochi travel the world exploring the wonders of food and culture while learning how to cook with fresh ingredients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPpA8DMcMThacHlAo5az83WxwBr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:118439');
