  ('826182793312303053', 'Welcome Back, Kotter', 1975, 'Comedy, Family', 'Alan Sacks, Gabe Kaplan', null, 'Gabe Kaplan, John Travolta, John Sylvester White, Ron Palillo, Robert Hegyes, Lawrence Hilton-Jacobs, Marcia Strassman, Stephen Shortridge', 'TV-14', 'Welcome Back, Kotter is an American television sitcom starring Gabe Kaplan and featuring a young John Travolta. Videotaped in front of a live studio audience, it originally aired on the ABC network from September 9, 1975, to June 8, 1979.', 'Welcome Back, Kotter is an American television sitcom starring Gabe Kaplan and featuring a young John Travolta. Videotaped in front of a live studio audience, it originally aired on the ABC network from September 9, 1975, to June 8, 1979.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xBNM75kZjHdWcE4brawakg1uQQf.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:738'),
  ('1066158373969158895', 'Welcome Home, Mone', 2021, 'Family, Drama', null, null, 'Kaya Kiyohara, Seiyo Uchino, Kyoka Suzuki, Aju Makita, Tatsuya Fuji, Keiko Takeshita, Asano Tadanobu, Saki Takaoka', null, 'Born in September of 1995, Momone Nagaura lived with her parents, grandfather, and sister in Kesennuma City, Miyagi Prefecture. After failing her college entrance exams, she went to live in Tome City with an acquaintance of her grandfather''s. Momone''s life changes when she meets a popular weather forecaster from Tokyo, who teaches her how weather forecasts can predict the future. She decides to study to become a weather forecaster.', 'Born in September of 1995, Momone Nagaura lived with her parents, grandfather, and sister in Kesennuma City, Miyagi Prefecture. After failing her college entrance exams, she went to live in Tome City with an acquaintance of her grandfather''s. Momone''s life changes when she meets a popular weather forecaster from Tokyo, who teaches her how weather forecasts can predict the future. She decides to study to become a weather forecaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYEeM65Z4TQ8tDQ2y2AXcGHlMot.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:123488'),
  ('776620113860363309', 'Welcome to Chippendales', 2022, 'Drama, Crime, Comedy', 'Robert D. Siegel', null, 'Kumail Nanjiani, Murray Bartlett, Annaleigh Ashford, Juliette Lewis', 'TV-MA', 'The outrageous story of Somen “Steve” Banerjee, an Indian immigrant who became the unlikely founder of the world’s greatest male-stripping empire—and let nothing stand in his way in the process.', 'The outrageous story of Somen “Steve” Banerjee, an Indian immigrant who became the unlikely founder of the world’s greatest male-stripping empire—and let nothing stand in his way in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cowPil7lc6c4giarDYWP0ZbK8hs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130567'),
  ('511094537358800654', 'Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ayumu Murase, Ryohei Kimura, Ayaka Asai, Daisuke Ono, Saori Hayami, Takuya Sato, Takaya Kuroda, Mitsuki Saiga', 'TV-14', 'Fourteen-year-old Iruma Suzuki has just been abandoned and sold to a demon by his irresponsible parents! Surprisingly, the next thing he knows he''s living with the demon who has adopted him as his new grandson and has been transferred into a school in the Netherworld where his new demon grandfather works as the principal. Thus begins the cowardly Iruma-kun''s extraordinary school life among the otherworldly as he faces his true self, takes on challenges, and rises to become someone great.', 'Fourteen-year-old Iruma Suzuki has just been abandoned and sold to a demon by his irresponsible parents! Surprisingly, the next thing he knows he''s living with the demon who has adopted him as his new grandson and has been transferred into a school in the Netherworld where his new demon grandfather works as the principal. Thus begins the cowardly Iruma-kun''s extraordinary school life among the otherworldly as he faces his true self, takes on challenges, and rises to become someone great.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aed6I1EMR4Lbk8bdikWrndbn5Og.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:91801'),
  ('1012023135071494151', 'Welcome to Earth', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Will Smith, Dwayne Fields, Erik Weihenmayer, Cody Richardson, Diva Amon', 'TV-PG', 'Will Smith whose curiosity and wonder is positively infectious—is guided by National Geographic Explorers traveling to different corners of the world to get up close and personal with the weirdest, most unusual, dangerous and thrilling spectacles of the planet.', 'Will Smith whose curiosity and wonder is positively infectious—is guided by National Geographic Explorers traveling to different corners of the world to get up close and personal with the weirdest, most unusual, dangerous and thrilling spectacles of the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9x6xh4KCgwMk9PYiosXXFGwI3a.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127700'),
  ('197511096226056376', 'Welcome to Eden', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Joaquín Górriz, Guillermo López Sánchez', null, 'Amaia Salamanca, Amaia Aberasturi, Belinda, Lola Rodríguez, Begoña Vargas, Tomy Aguilera, Dariam Coco, Irene Dev', 'TV-MA', 'Are you happy? With this question, Zoa and four other attractive young people, very active on social networks, are invited to the most exclusive party in history on a secret island, organized by the brand of a new drink. What begins as an exciting journey will soon become the journey of a lifetime. But paradise is not really what it seems - Welcome to Eden.', 'Are you happy? With this question, Zoa and four other attractive young people, very active on social networks, are invited to the most exclusive party in history on a secret island, organized by the brand of a new drink. What begins as an exciting journey will soon become the journey of a lifetime. But paradise is not really what it seems - Welcome to Eden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZO0mtTHAgg9QVscLVtwCcQ7Hgx.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:128010'),
  ('679916422812190703', 'Welcome to Flatch', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Jenny Bicks', null, 'Holmes, Sam Straley, Seann William Scott, Jaime Pressly, Justin Linville, Krystal Smith, Aya Cash, Taylor Ortega', 'TV-14', 'When a documentary crew sets out to explore the lives of residents in a small American town – their dreams, their concerns – they stumble upon the midwestern town of Flatch, which is made up of many eccentric personalities. It’s a place you want to visit and maybe even stay. If there was a decent motel. Which there is not.', 'When a documentary crew sets out to explore the lives of residents in a small American town – their dreams, their concerns – they stumble upon the midwestern town of Flatch, which is made up of many eccentric personalities. It’s a place you want to visit and maybe even stay. If there was a decent motel. Which there is not.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ztJqyTocc1pylks84ZpiRorC8kr.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:129502'),
  ('814154506490946812', 'Welcome to Irabu''s Office', 2009, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Romi Park, Yuji Mitsuya, Yumi Sugimoto', 'TV-MA', 'Welcome to Irabu''s Office, where you may be greeted by a man in a bear mask, holding a giant needle, who’s ready to cure your ills. Get to know the eccentric Dr. Ichirou Irabu who has a fetish for injections, and a rather strange methodology. Despite his weird approach, Dr. Irabu (who changes his appearance more than Madonna), does succeed in helping each of his patients... eventually.', 'Welcome to Irabu''s Office, where you may be greeted by a man in a bear mask, holding a giant needle, who’s ready to cure your ills. Get to know the eccentric Dr. Ichirou Irabu who has a fetish for injections, and a rather strange methodology. Despite his weird approach, Dr. Irabu (who changes his appearance more than Madonna), does succeed in helping each of his patients... eventually.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g2ywT0f5CBQGAetctsTz1nWKqMm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42954'),
  ('893648101106480072', 'Welcome to Japan, Ms. Elf!', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yusuke Kobayashi, Kaede Hondo, Yumi Uchiyama', 'TV-14', 'Kazuhiro Kitase’s only hobby? Sleeping, of course. Since childhood, his dreams have been a portal to exhilarating adventures with an elf girl. During one of their explorations through ancient ruins, they both get scorched by a dragon, and Kazuhiro wakes up like usual. Except this time, he finds a familiar figure in bed beside him—the elf girl from his dreams.', 'Kazuhiro Kitase’s only hobby? Sleeping, of course. Since childhood, his dreams have been a portal to exhilarating adventures with an elf girl. During one of their explorations through ancient ruins, they both get scorched by a dragon, and Kazuhiro wakes up like usual. Except this time, he finds a familiar figure in bed beside him—the elf girl from his dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BifdNaVpUZUkbHYVPVDBYBlqJj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:249031'),
  ('828131755361408225', 'Welcome to Milele', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Jin Dong, Zu Feng, Zhang Yuqi, Liu Guanlin, Liu Mintao, Ding Yongdai, Zhao Ziqi, Kaavie Wong', null, 'In a twist of fate, Ma Jia, a doctor from the First Affiliated Hospital of Jiang University, joins the 25th batch of the China Medical Team, setting off on a journey to Sanah, Africa. Confronted with an entirely unfamiliar environment and significant cultural disparities between China and Africa, Ma Jia grapples with the choice between perseverance and surrender. However, with each hurdle he overcomes, he adjusts his perspective, gradually comprehending the duties and objectives of a Chinese medical aid worker. Over the course of two years in Africa, through physical and mental challenges, as well as emotional and spiritual introspection, Ma Jia and his colleagues stationed in "Milele Village" experience a whirlwind of joy, poignant moments, reunions, and partings. They navigate a complex array of emotions, leading to profound personal development.', 'In a twist of fate, Ma Jia, a doctor from the First Affiliated Hospital of Jiang University, joins the 25th batch of the China Medical Team, setting off on a journey to Sanah, Africa. Confronted with an entirely unfamiliar environment and significant cultural disparities between China and Africa, Ma Jia grapples with the choice between perseverance and surrender. However, with each hurdle he overcomes, he adjusts his perspective, gradually comprehending the duties and objectives of a Chinese medical aid worker. Over the course of two years in Africa, through physical and mental challenges, as well as emotional and spiritual introspection, Ma Jia and his colleagues stationed in "Milele Village" experience a whirlwind of joy, poignant moments, reunions, and partings. They navigate a complex array of emotions, leading to profound personal development.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9XETZnG46EXrPwSPzuJKnMaZ4hv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:239490'),
  ('104220176651334015', 'Welcome to Plathville', 2019, 'Reality, Family', 'A. Smith & Co. Productions', null, 'Kim Plath, Moriah Plath, Barry Plath, Ethan Plath, Lydia Plath', 'TV-PG', 'The nine flaxen-haired children in the Plath family have never had a soda, don''t know who Spiderman or Tom Brady is and have never watched TV, living remotely in rural Georgia with their "follow their own rules" parents Kim and Barry Plath.', 'The nine flaxen-haired children in the Plath family have never had a soda, don''t know who Spiderman or Tom Brady is and have never watched TV, living remotely in rural Georgia with their "follow their own rules" parents Kim and Barry Plath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2vxzApwvpDg71GI6LBIQ7DhxRGm.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:95574'),
  ('959731711715026035', 'Welcome to Samdal-ri', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kwon Hye-ju', null, 'Ji Chang-wook, Shin Hye-sun, Yu Oh-seong, Kim Mi-kyeong, Lee Jae-won, Seo Hyun-chul, Shin Dong-mi, Kang Mi-na', 'TV-14', 'After suffering a fall from grace, a photographer returns to her hometown and bumps into her childhood friend — rekindling an unfinished romance.', 'After suffering a fall from grace, a photographer returns to her hometown and bumps into her childhood friend — rekindling an unfinished romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/98IvA2i0PsTY8CThoHByCKOEAjz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:219651'),
  ('604771580127535938', 'Welcome to Sweden', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Greg Poehler', null, 'Greg Poehler, Josephine Bornebusch, Lena Olin, Claes Månsson, Christopher Wagelin', null, 'The fish-out-of-water story of New York accountant Bruce, who falls in love with a Swedish girl named Emma and follows her to Sweden.', 'The fish-out-of-water story of New York accountant Bruce, who falls in love with a Swedish girl named Emma and follows her to Sweden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pS1Jl528VugcZmBsWicNed5gWO1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:60901'),
  ('558940374623611693', 'Welcome to the Ballroom', 2017, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, 'Kenichi Suemitsu', 'Kentaro Tomita, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Shimba Tsuchiya, Ayane Sakura, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Sumire Morohoshi, Chinatsu Akasaki, Mamiko Noto', 'TV-14', 'Tatara is an average middle school student with no particular dreams until an unexpected incident draws him into the fascinating world of ballroom dancing. “If I can just find one thing to be passionate about...” He dives into the world of dance, believing it''s his opportunity to change. “Dance is a passion!”', 'Tatara is an average middle school student with no particular dreams until an unexpected incident draws him into the fascinating world of ballroom dancing. “If I can just find one thing to be passionate about...” He dives into the world of dance, believing it''s his opportunity to change. “Dance is a passion!”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGf49kruXI3mMpfBD43ZtxXE7MC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72362'),
  ('463118513480996005', 'Welcome to the Family', 2018, 'Comedy, Family', 'Pau Freixas, Ivan Mercadé', 'Daniel González', 'Melani Olivares, Ivan Massagué, Nao Albet, Leïti Sène, Yolanda Ramos, Georgina Amorós, Lluís Xavier Villanueva, Miquel Fernández', 'TV-MA', 'When an evicted single mom''s estranged father dies, she and his second wife cover up his death after learning they''ve been written out of his will.', 'When an evicted single mom''s estranged father dies, she and his second wife cover up his death after learning they''ve been written out of his will.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hM9GjbqMXDOUnLrXjNw9vu98HMr.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:76567'),
  ('339837672722883591', 'Welcome to the House', 2006, 'Drama', null, null, 'Lawrence Cheng Tan-Shui, Christine Ng Wing-Mei, Chung King-Fai, Angelina Lo, Raymond Cho Wing-Lim, Shermon Tang Seung-Man, Kwan Ching, Johnson Lee Sze-Chit', null, 'Welcome to the House is a TVB modern sitcom series broadcast from April 2006 to March 2007. The series surrounded the day-to-day lives of the Ko family.', 'Welcome to the House is a TVB modern sitcom series broadcast from April 2006 to March 2007. The series surrounded the day-to-day lives of the Ko family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sLsaxED5dHQ4FSzIqN8xJgSAuF9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4643'),
  ('133628671396083018', 'Welcome to the N-H-K', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Yutaka Koizumi, Yui Makino, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Sanae Kobayashi, Risa Hayamizu', 'TV-MA', 'Sato''s life – or what''s left of it – is a paranoid mess of conspiracy theories and social anxieties. He''s terrified of the outside world; his apartment is overflowing with the remnants of cheap take-out food; and his retinas have been permanently scarred by a steady diet of internet porn. But maybe it''s not all his fault. After all, the nefarious N.H.K. is out there, and they’re determined to turn society''s fringe-dwellers into a brainwashed lot of jobless, hopeless, futureless recluses. Enter Misaki – a mysterious girl-next-door type who is Sato''s last chance to beat-down his inner demons and venture out into the light of day. She''s ready to help him overcome his crippling phobias, but Sato would rather cower in his existential foxhole and pretend to work on the demo for his virtual sex game. He’s afraid to face the world. She''s strangely desperate to fix a total stranger. Maybe together they can be normal.', 'Sato''s life – or what''s left of it – is a paranoid mess of conspiracy theories and social anxieties. He''s terrified of the outside world; his apartment is overflowing with the remnants of cheap take-out food; and his retinas have been permanently scarred by a steady diet of internet porn. But maybe it''s not all his fault. After all, the nefarious N.H.K. is out there, and they’re determined to turn society''s fringe-dwellers into a brainwashed lot of jobless, hopeless, futureless recluses. Enter Misaki – a mysterious girl-next-door type who is Sato''s last chance to beat-down his inner demons and venture out into the light of day. She''s ready to help him overcome his crippling phobias, but Sato would rather cower in his existential foxhole and pretend to work on the demo for his virtual sex game. He’s afraid to face the world. She''s strangely desperate to fix a total stranger. Maybe together they can be normal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hIsRcWso57zxD2MWBSqze5G4NDS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42821'),
  ('478443259280610203', 'Welcome to the Outcast''s Restaurant!', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shunsuke Takeuchi, Marika Tachibana', 'TV-14', 'When superstar adventurer Dennis gets booted from the world’s strongest party, he teams up with runaway Atelier to serve up his true passion—delicious cuisine. But this not-so-average eatery has not-so-average patrons. Dennis will battle his quirky customers’ troubles with his trusty butcher knife and wok. Visit Adventurer’s Restaurant and fill up your heart and stomach!', 'When superstar adventurer Dennis gets booted from the world’s strongest party, he teams up with runaway Atelier to serve up his true passion—delicious cuisine. But this not-so-average eatery has not-so-average patrons. Dennis will battle his quirky customers’ troubles with his trusty butcher knife and wok. Visit Adventurer’s Restaurant and fill up your heart and stomach!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/caWU2F1DSrrJgoJCSclpSoCWnge.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:286723'),
  ('675383674093730009', 'Welcome to Utmark', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Kim Fupz Aakeson', 'Rozafa Celaj, May-Linda Kosumovic, Marie Blokhus, Alma Günther, Stig Henrik Hoff, Tobias Santelmann, Niklas Gundersen', 'TV-MA', 'Somewhere in the Nordic wilderness, in a place that lives by its own rules, lies Utmark. A corrupt sheriff, cross-dressing farmer, possessed shopkeeper, alcoholic shepherd, nature-loving bootlegger, God-hating pastor, grieving pimp. Everyone knows everyone in this secluded corner of the Nordic North.', 'Somewhere in the Nordic wilderness, in a place that lives by its own rules, lies Utmark. A corrupt sheriff, cross-dressing farmer, possessed shopkeeper, alcoholic shepherd, nature-loving bootlegger, God-hating pastor, grieving pimp. Everyone knows everyone in this secluded corner of the Nordic North.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Zu5ThsK35HOoRrjqc3DjB7g3yI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:120349'),
  ('481460949371239401', 'Welcome to Waikiki', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Song Ji-eun', null, 'Shin Hyun-soo, Mun Ka-young, Lee Yi-kyung, An So-hee, Kim Seon-ho, Kim Ye-won, Bret Allan Lindquist', null, 'Kang Dong-Goo dreams of becoming a movie director, but he is cynical due to bad luck. Cheon Joon-Ki wanted to follow in his father''s footsteps and become an actor, but he is now just a minor actor. Bong-Doo-Sik came to Seoul to become a scenario writer, but things have not been easy for him.', 'Kang Dong-Goo dreams of becoming a movie director, but he is cynical due to bad luck. Cheon Joon-Ki wanted to follow in his father''s footsteps and become an actor, but he is now just a minor actor. Bong-Doo-Sik came to Seoul to become a scenario writer, but things have not been easy for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pggzZamoLNTiRgoYz8WVCISMCqv.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:76557'),
  ('265306409654646587', 'Welcome to Wedding Hell', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Choi I-rang', 'Lee Jin-uk, Lee Yeon-hee, Hwang Seung-eon, Kil Yong-woo, Song Jin-woo, Kim Ju-yeon, Im Ha-ryong, Yun Yoo-sun', null, 'A marriage proposal is supposed to be a happy ending. But for one couple, it becomes the beginning of an uphill struggle over wedding preparations.', 'A marriage proposal is supposed to be a happy ending. But for one couple, it becomes the beginning of an uphill struggle over wedding preparations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5iEn12RF4WQuxwY5kZa5SYu83M.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:196907'),
  ('951719943721267646', 'Welcome to Wrexham', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Ryan Reynolds, Rob Mac', 'TV-MA', 'Documentary series tracking the dreams and worries of Wrexham, a working-class town in North Wales, UK, as two Hollywood stars (Rob McElhenney and Ryan Reynolds) take ownership of the town’s historic yet struggling football club.', 'Documentary series tracking the dreams and worries of Wrexham, a working-class town in North Wales, UK, as two Hollywood stars (Rob McElhenney and Ryan Reynolds) take ownership of the town’s historic yet struggling football club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/53CNogAzbbwepLxQS5jIfGG35MQ.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:126929'),
  ('639226070987404741', 'Welcome, My Friend', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Fırat Parlak', null, 'Tolga Çevik, Ezgi Mola, Özer Atik, Sarp Bozkurt, Fırat Parlak', null, '“Welcome, My Friend” hits the screen every week with episodes full of laughter and fun, featuring surprise guests... Hosted by Tolga Çevik and Ezgi Mola, the show takes viewers to completely different places, times, and situations alongside famous guests each week, and has garnered significant attention and acclaim both on stage and on screen.', '“Welcome, My Friend” hits the screen every week with episodes full of laughter and fun, featuring surprise guests... Hosted by Tolga Çevik and Ezgi Mola, the show takes viewers to completely different places, times, and situations alongside famous guests each week, and has garnered significant attention and acclaim both on stage and on screen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Onffnm3iYAAqnAOxI5JFPT898x.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:126429'),
