  ('1114310644071044445', 'Well-Intended Love', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Chun Feng Yi Du', 'He Dun, Yang Zhun', 'Xu Kaicheng, Wang Shuang, Ian Yi, Huang Qianshuo, Liu Jiaxi, Xu Yulan, He Qianying, Ding Ning', 'TV-14', 'In order to receive a bone marrow transplant quicker and be able to continue her career as an actress, Xia Lin enters into a secret marriage with Ling Yi Zhou, the CEO of a company. Despite the conspiracies and misunderstandings they encounter, the two find true love.', 'In order to receive a bone marrow transplant quicker and be able to continue her career as an actress, Xia Lin enters into a secret marriage with Ling Yi Zhou, the CEO of a company. Despite the conspiracies and misunderstandings they encounter, the two find true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkxtbsmv4aGR4h3etJM77pJ6WZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:86605'),
  ('1053949379263307280', 'Wellington Paranormal', 2018, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jemaine Clement, Taika Waititi', null, 'Mike Minogue, Karen O''Leary, Maaka Pohatu', null, 'New Zealand''s capital is a hotbed of supernatural activity... so Officers Minogue and O''Leary, who featured in the vampire documentary What We Do In The Shadows, take to the streets to investigate all manner of paranormal phenomena.', 'New Zealand''s capital is a hotbed of supernatural activity... so Officers Minogue and O''Leary, who featured in the vampire documentary What We Do In The Shadows, take to the streets to investigate all manner of paranormal phenomena.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eaGpAP4bKMjVlMIoGqKzMRJ2OIG.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:80475'),
  ('589743182272050749', 'Wellmania', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Benjamin Law, Brigid Delaney', null, 'Celeste Barber, J.J. Fong, Lachlan Buchanan, Genevieve Mooy', 'TV-MA', 'Liv, a human tornado, is forced to rethink her live fast die young philosophy after a major health scare. She throws herself into a wellness journey, trying everything she can to reclaim her old life.', 'Liv, a human tornado, is forced to rethink her live fast die young philosophy after a major health scare. She throws herself into a wellness journey, trying everything she can to reclaim her old life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c3F9aMUSwQovZkpEBynxBxN3keo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:195841'),
