  ('1129576865499205477', 'Wentworth', 2013, 'Drama, Crime', 'Lara Radulovich, Reg Watson', null, 'Danielle Cormack, Nicole da Silva, Kate Atkinson, Robbie Magasiva, Kate Jenkinson, Tammy Macintosh, Jacqueline Brennan, Pamela Rabe', 'TV-MA', 'Bea Smith is locked up while awaiting trial for the attempted murder of her husband and must learn how life works in prison. A modern adaptation and sequel of the iconic Prisoner series.', 'Bea Smith is locked up while awaiting trial for the attempted murder of her husband and must learn how life works in prison. A modern adaptation and sequel of the iconic Prisoner series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3nikr0NE3t8UMgI1Ba6hXaeEgKr.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:44856'),
