  ('756779372747655548', 'Wheel of Fortune', 1981, null, 'Merv Griffin', null, 'John Burgess, Tony Barber, Larry Emdur, Ernie Sigley', null, 'Wheel of Fortune is an Australian television game show produced by Grundy Television. The program aired on the Seven Network from 1981 to 2004 and November 2005 to July 2006 and is mostly based on the same general format as the original American version of the program. After Wheel of Fortune ended, the format was revived by the Nine Network in 2008 as Million Dollar Wheel of Fortune, until it was cancelled in June 2008 due to low ratings following arguments from long-time host John Burgess concerning why he did not like the show. An earlier unrelated show also titled Wheel of Fortune had been broadcast on the Nine Network. That version had been developed by Reg Grundy as a radio game show before it transferred to television in 1959.', 'Wheel of Fortune is an Australian television game show produced by Grundy Television. The program aired on the Seven Network from 1981 to 2004 and November 2005 to July 2006 and is mostly based on the same general format as the original American version of the program. After Wheel of Fortune ended, the format was revived by the Nine Network in 2008 as Million Dollar Wheel of Fortune, until it was cancelled in June 2008 due to low ratings following arguments from long-time host John Burgess concerning why he did not like the show. An earlier unrelated show also titled Wheel of Fortune had been broadcast on the Nine Network. That version had been developed by Reg Grundy as a radio game show before it transferred to television in 1959.', null, 4, 'tmdb:tv:4300'),
  ('377329144836535845', 'Wheel of Fortune', 1983, 'Family, Reality', 'Merv Griffin', null, null, 'TV-G', 'This game show sees contestants solve word puzzles, similar to those used in Hangman, to win cash and prizes determined by spinning a giant carnival wheel.', 'This game show sees contestants solve word puzzles, similar to those used in Hangman, to win cash and prizes determined by spinning a giant carnival wheel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6XruJ8a8LFNhrB0L20QcjmDXi6.jpg', 43, 'tmdb:tv:2778'),
  ('387268746914070141', 'Wheel Of Fortune India', 2026, 'Drama, Reality, Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Akshay Kumar, Elnaaz Norouzi', null, 'Recognised by Guinness World Records as the world''s most popular TV game show, Wheel of Fortune arrives in India in spectacular fashion, hosted by Akshay Kumar- Contestants enter a thrilling word game, decoding phrases spanning Bollywood, pop culture and everyday life- Blending entertainment with edge-of- the-seat moments, every alphabet can change the game as players compete for paisa and prizes!', 'Recognised by Guinness World Records as the world''s most popular TV game show, Wheel of Fortune arrives in India in spectacular fashion, hosted by Akshay Kumar- Contestants enter a thrilling word game, decoding phrases spanning Bollywood, pop culture and everyday life- Blending entertainment with edge-of- the-seat moments, every alphabet can change the game as players compete for paisa and prizes!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJEeYiafPQrtFI3d0bpUP7NOmCL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:312551'),
  ('433145553097766495', 'Wheeler Dealers', 2003, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, 'Mike Brewer', 'TV-PG', 'Experienced car dealer Mike Brewer is joined by multi-talented mechanics in a monumental motoring mission: to find and restore iconic cars to later sell for a profit at their LA-based shop. In the series, Mike has the challenging job of finding vehicles that have money-making potential. He then hands them over to a mechanic, who tackles everything from bare metal re-sprays to gearbox swaps to bring them back to their former glory.', 'Experienced car dealer Mike Brewer is joined by multi-talented mechanics in a monumental motoring mission: to find and restore iconic cars to later sell for a profit at their LA-based shop. In the series, Mike has the challenging job of finding vehicles that have money-making potential. He then hands them over to a mechanic, who tackles everything from bare metal re-sprays to gearbox swaps to bring them back to their former glory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AoX3ig7Dl6l8hz3Xj0oREF2AD5g.jpg', 24, 'tmdb:tv:10710'),
  ('100592307487937453', 'When A Man Loves A Woman', 2016, null, 'Krung Ya Chat', null, 'James Ma, Kimberly Ann Voltemas, Tarkoon Karntip, Sheranut Yusananda, Kamolned Ruengsri, Chintara Sukapatana, Tantachj Tharinpirom, Khunakorn Kirdpan', null, 'Sattawat is a doctor whose mother has a gambling addiction, and Anusaniya''s family owns a wealthy company. Sattawat''s mother owes a lot of money to Anusaniya''s company and in order to erase the debt, Sattawat''s mother and Anusaniya''s aunt cook up a plan to marry Sattawat and Anusaniya to each other to get rid of the debt. Anusaniya''s half-uncle, Chayakorn, breaks up with his girlfriend, Somika, and reveals his love for Anusaniya. Anusaniya, not wanting Chayakorn to have any hope, agrees to marry Sattawat. Desperate Somika falls for Sattawat but finds out that he belongs to Anusaniya, her greatest rival. In vengeance, Somika tries everything to split the couple.', 'Sattawat is a doctor whose mother has a gambling addiction, and Anusaniya''s family owns a wealthy company. Sattawat''s mother owes a lot of money to Anusaniya''s company and in order to erase the debt, Sattawat''s mother and Anusaniya''s aunt cook up a plan to marry Sattawat and Anusaniya to each other to get rid of the debt. Anusaniya''s half-uncle, Chayakorn, breaks up with his girlfriend, Somika, and reveals his love for Anusaniya. Anusaniya, not wanting Chayakorn to have any hope, agrees to marry Sattawat. Desperate Somika falls for Sattawat but finds out that he belongs to Anusaniya, her greatest rival. In vengeance, Somika tries everything to split the couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bKutoZPoq89e3dAHp3ZKQFGdFJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69600'),
  ('353490417733109033', 'When a Snail Falls in Love', 2016, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Wang Kai, Wang Ziwen, Yu Heng, Xu Yue, Zhao Yuanyuan, Wu Xiaoyu, Mi Te, Li Longjun', 'TV-14', 'Detective Ji Bai and new criminal profiler Xu Xu may seem like an awkward teacher-student pair at first glance, yet they are actually the best partners in the police force, solving one crime after another. Ji Bai slowly falls in love with Xu Xu, yet she is a girl who is as slow as a snail when it comes to love. Just as Xu Xu starts to reciprocate Ji Bai''s feelings, the dormant "Angel''s Killer" reappears.', 'Detective Ji Bai and new criminal profiler Xu Xu may seem like an awkward teacher-student pair at first glance, yet they are actually the best partners in the police force, solving one crime after another. Ji Bai slowly falls in love with Xu Xu, yet she is a girl who is as slow as a snail when it comes to love. Just as Xu Xu starts to reciprocate Ji Bai''s feelings, the dormant "Angel''s Killer" reappears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7e2FLcsjeIvqtUxVY6O696jA4v5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68342'),
  ('16555148182941414', 'When Calls the Heart', 2014, 'Drama, Western', 'Michael Landon Jr., Brian Bird', null, 'Erin Krakow, Pascale Hutton, Jack Wagner', 'TV-G', 'Elizabeth Thatcher, a young school teacher from a wealthy Eastern family, migrates from the big city to teach school in a small coal mining town in the west.', 'Elizabeth Thatcher, a young school teacher from a wealthy Eastern family, migrates from the big city to teach school in a small coal mining town in the west.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3d8XxE3qDLzeewtaC4DGamI6Ofa.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:61865'),
  ('720951137413409610', 'When Destiny Brings the Demon', 2025, 'Drama', 'Fu Hua', null, 'Arthur Chen, Wang Yinglu, Wang Yiting, Gao Han, Wu Yuheng, Wang Yajia, Zhao Shunran', null, 'Modern-day office drone Zou Yan accidentally stumbles into the world of cultivation and wakes up as Liao Tingyan, a disciple of the Qinggutian Sect. She''s soon selected to serve the reclusive Grandmaster Sima Jiao, a powerful cultivator who''s been secretly sealed inside a mountain for 500 years. Twisted by isolation and rage, he''s cold, hot-tempered, and bent on revenge. Liao Tingyan doesn''t know that "her" original identity is a demonic assassin. But to his surprise, she shows no ill will, no ambition, and no desire at all. Her nature fascinates him. Thus begins an unlikely romance between a villainous immortal and a healing-type "slacker," a connection that defies fate and spans lifetimes.', 'Modern-day office drone Zou Yan accidentally stumbles into the world of cultivation and wakes up as Liao Tingyan, a disciple of the Qinggutian Sect. She''s soon selected to serve the reclusive Grandmaster Sima Jiao, a powerful cultivator who''s been secretly sealed inside a mountain for 500 years. Twisted by isolation and rage, he''s cold, hot-tempered, and bent on revenge. Liao Tingyan doesn''t know that "her" original identity is a demonic assassin. But to his surprise, she shows no ill will, no ambition, and no desire at all. Her nature fascinates him. Thus begins an unlikely romance between a villainous immortal and a healing-type "slacker," a connection that defies fate and spans lifetimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/15yDwRPWsI75RdJaBVgb4K5m94I.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:254476'),
  ('1030234003833982674', 'When Heroes Fly', 2018, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, War & Politics', 'Omri Givon', 'Amir Gutfreund, Omri Givon', 'Tomer Capone, Moshe Ashkenazi, Michael Aloni, Nadav Nates, Ninet Tayeb, Oded Fehr, Gil Frank, Dan Mor', 'TV-MA', 'Eleven years after falling out, four friends, war veterans of a Special Forces unit, reunite for one final mission: to find Yaeli, a former lover of one of them and sister of another. Their journey will take them deep into the Colombian jungle but, as to succeed, first they must confront the trauma that tore them apart.', 'Eleven years after falling out, four friends, war veterans of a Special Forces unit, reunite for one final mission: to find Yaeli, a former lover of one of them and sister of another. Their journey will take them deep into the Colombian jungle but, as to succeed, first they must confront the trauma that tore them apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7RzylOEVrOmdHEGlkJhesoUG4Y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79720'),
  ('202596199834577686', 'When History Meows', 2018, 'Animation, Kids', null, null, 'Yeqiao Yan, Qingyang Li, Wang Zhen, Tong Xinzhu, Li Lanling, Liu Mingyue, Yang Ning, Shen Nianru', 'TV-PG', '"When History Meows" is a historical cartoon based on the history of China, aiming to popularize knowledge of Chinese history to young audiences. 12 plump and cute cats reinterprets the historical events in humorous language.', '"When History Meows" is a historical cartoon based on the history of China, aiming to popularize knowledge of Chinese history to young audiences. 12 plump and cute cats reinterprets the historical events in humorous language.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95yrKv8xrcUL4VlU6L3qJSxEFwN.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:116042'),
  ('864611197883559500', 'When Hope Calls', 2019, 'Drama', 'Alfonso H. Moreno', null, 'Wendy Crewson, Neil Crone', 'TV-G', 'Sisters Lillian and Grace open an orphanage in the 1916 Western town of Brookfield. Caught between the traditions of cattle ranchers and the ambitions of a growing town, the duo strive to find romance and happiness while overcoming the challenges of helping the children in their care.', 'Sisters Lillian and Grace open an orphanage in the 1916 Western town of Brookfield. Caught between the traditions of cattle ranchers and the ambitions of a growing town, the duo strive to find romance and happiness while overcoming the challenges of helping the children in their care.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6XsUEyIu9uPgiUFFbGNmpYqkw71.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:85007'),
  ('913762121403143269', 'When I Fly Towards You', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Zhu Yi', 'Kaixin Tao, Yue An', 'Zhou Yiran, Zhang Miaoyi, Jiang Zhinan, Bian Tianyang, Guo Zhe', null, 'Set off by a sweet chance encounter, 16-year-old Su Zaizai finds herself helplessly drawn to Zhang Lurang — her smart, charming yet distant schoolmate.', 'Set off by a sweet chance encounter, 16-year-old Su Zaizai finds herself helplessly drawn to Zhang Lurang — her smart, charming yet distant schoolmate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjCChwZcEZ9902tUAG1hWZlfOHm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:228547'),
  ('336644793963238915', 'When It Rains, It Pours', 2025, 'Drama', 'Michi Ichiho', 'Hiraki Mari', 'Asahi Ito, Jun Muto, Shiori Akita, Yui Kitamura, Hiroki Matsumoto, Hiroto Kobayashi', null, 'Two lonely coworkers bond over late-night chats, discovering a queer connection that blurs the line between friendship and love.', 'Two lonely coworkers bond over late-night chats, discovering a queer connection that blurs the line between friendship and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1466gHLeSHl5Orh0g72ZxvdHw6T.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:279412'),
  ('794956232878763032', 'When Life Gives You Tangerines', 2025, 'Drama', 'Lim Sang-choon, Kim Won-suk', null, 'IU, Park Bo-gum, Moon So-ri, Park Hae-joon', 'TV-14', 'In Jeju, a spirited girl and a steadfast boy''s island story blossoms into a lifelong tale of setbacks and triumphs — proving love endures across time.', 'In Jeju, a spirited girl and a steadfast boy''s island story blossoms into a lifelong tale of setbacks and triumphs — proving love endures across time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1VC3sEFxYXYDqQUCAnvWfUsYg1s.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:219246'),
  ('796797472669892327', 'When My Love Blooms', 2020, 'Drama, Family', 'Son Jung-hyun, Jeon Hee-young', 'Jeon Hee-young', 'Yoo Ji-tae, Lee Bo-young, Jinyoung, Park Si-yeon, Jeon So-nee, Kim Yeong-hun, Lee Tae-sung, Park Han-sol', 'TV-14', 'In 1993, Jisu and Jaehyeon, who met for the first time at the protest scene and being a first love to each other. After 26 years, Jisu and Jaehyeon accidently reunite.', 'In 1993, Jisu and Jaehyeon, who met for the first time at the protest scene and being a first love to each other. After 26 years, Jisu and Jaehyeon accidently reunite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oCJ5DME12zwigNfSdRq9JGUHXWG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100595'),
  ('756145942764284721', 'When No One Sees Us', 2025, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Daniel Corpas', null, 'Maribel Verdú, Mariela Garriga, Austin Amelio, Ben Temple, Dani Rovira, Lucía Jiménez, Numa Paredes, María Alfonsa Rosso', 'TV-MA', 'Set against the dramatic backdrop of the Spanish Holy Week celebrations, two policewomen try to solve a series of crimes in the Andalusian town of Morón de la Frontera, in the political and cultural region of Seville’s so-called ''deep Spain'', which is home to one of the biggest international U.S. military bases.', 'Set against the dramatic backdrop of the Spanish Holy Week celebrations, two policewomen try to solve a series of crimes in the Andalusian town of Morón de la Frontera, in the political and cultural region of Seville’s so-called ''deep Spain'', which is home to one of the biggest international U.S. military bases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Udqxo93q2AZ7w5sTYe62XZK1IX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:229513'),
