  ('286037115941116745', 'White Sands', 2021, 'Crime, Drama', 'A. J. Kazinski', null, 'Bodil Jørgensen, Jesper Asholt, Camilla Bendix, Anne Louise Hassing, Allan Hyde, Frederikke Dahl Hansen, Herman Bille Lumholt Hakesberg, Anders Brink Madsen', null, 'To solve the brutal murder of a young German surfer, two officers are secretly sent to the tourist paradise Hvide Sande on Denmark''s west coast. No one in the city trusts the police, so they go undercover as a happily married couple from the big city.', 'To solve the brutal murder of a young German surfer, two officers are secretly sent to the tourist paradise Hvide Sande on Denmark''s west coast. No one in the city trusts the police, so they go undercover as a happily married couple from the big city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6GHwPJBNuDj3rCzVyhkJ8L4XzdM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:124601'),
