  ('134000827452995410', 'Who Is Who?', 2015, 'Soap, Comedy, Drama', 'Alexis Estiz, Alberto Slezynger, Laura Sosa', null, 'Marisa del Portillo, Gabriel Rossi, Oka Giner, Kenya Hijuelos, María del Pilar Pérez, Nicolás Maglione, Danna Paola, Eugenio Siller', 'TV-14', 'Is a story about twin brothers, one rich and the other poor, who were separated at birth and reunited several years later by fate. However their polar opposite lives are switched. Through this journey they search and discover themselves.', 'Is a story about twin brothers, one rich and the other poor, who were separated at birth and reunited several years later by fate. However their polar opposite lives are switched. Through this journey they search and discover themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xzMQqTTmjofphjTdeFaPm16G6gp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78292'),
  ('811378594984272007', 'Who Killed Daigoro Tokuyama?', 2016, 'Mystery, Comedy, Drama', 'Yasushi Akimoto', null, 'Yurina Hirate, Neru Nagahama, Risa Watanabe, Yuuka Sugai, Rika Watanabe, Akane Moriya, Yui Imaizumi, Nijika Ishimori', 'NR', 'One morning, students find their homeroom teacher Tokuyama Daigoro’s body on the floor of the classroom. A strange school life begins as the students work hard to hide the presence of their teacher''s corpse in their classroom. Other teachers from the Academy, their homeroom teacher''s wife, his mistress, police, and reporters... One-by-one they visit the classroom and the students face the risk of being discovered. Is it possible to continue to hide it?! And who was it who killed him?!', 'One morning, students find their homeroom teacher Tokuyama Daigoro’s body on the floor of the classroom. A strange school life begins as the students work hard to hide the presence of their teacher''s corpse in their classroom. Other teachers from the Academy, their homeroom teacher''s wife, his mistress, police, and reporters... One-by-one they visit the classroom and the students face the risk of being discovered. Is it possible to continue to hide it?! And who was it who killed him?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xpPoEyFrcjGnSXvB0FnvcNVKTCf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81966'),
