  ('1115827358347946146', 'Wojna Zastępcza', 2026, 'Drama, Crime, War & Politics', null, null, 'Mateusz Więcławek, Paulina Gałązka, Mirosław Haniszewski, Waleria Gorobets, Karol Bernacki, Piotr Witkowski, Mariusz Bonaszewski, Cezary Żak', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dInt1bdlS7aEFl1kXgHG5uUfuJG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:316110'),
  ('360298027961038763', 'Wojny samochodowe', 2016, null, 'Paweł Miszta, Przemysław Szafrański', null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AcqzPZDfhjZZAq896QWmYDWN71N.jpg', 21, 'tmdb:tv:134299'),
  ('733166624335297478', 'Wok of Love', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Seo Sook-hyang', 'Lee Jun-ho, Jung Ryeo-won, Jang Hyuk, Cha Joo-young, Tae Hang-ho, Jo Jae-yun, Kim Hyun-joon, Cha In-Ha', null, 'Chef Seo Poong was once a star chef and worked at the best Chinese restaurant. His popularity faded and he eventually wound up working at a small, failing Chinese restaurant. Meanwhile, Doo Chil-Seong is the owner of a building. He is an ex-gang member and he was in jail for 5 yers.', 'Chef Seo Poong was once a star chef and worked at the best Chinese restaurant. His popularity faded and he eventually wound up working at a small, failing Chinese restaurant. Meanwhile, Doo Chil-Seong is the owner of a building. He is an ex-gang member and he was in jail for 5 yers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTh81YtdEzacHhnmLw1Tef7cBRl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78797'),
  ('1043598777559276257', 'Woke', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Keith Knight, Marshall Todd', null, 'Lamorne Morris, T. Murph, Blake Anderson, Sasheer Zamata', 'TV-MA', 'Keef, an African-American cartoonist, is finally on the verge of mainstream success when an unexpected incident changes everything. He must now navigate the new voices and ideas that confront and challenge him, all without setting aflame everything he''s already built.', 'Keef, an African-American cartoonist, is finally on the verge of mainstream success when an unexpected incident changes everything. He must now navigate the new voices and ideas that confront and challenge him, all without setting aflame everything he''s already built.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tEcADfyR2jsAlYVblK6A9LYi0tW.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:105848'),
  ('511524633560760616', 'Wolf', 2018, 'Action & Adventure, War & Politics', 'Alper Çağlar', 'Alper Çağlar', 'Ahu Türkpençe, Serkan Çayoğlu, Emir Benderlioğlu, Murat Arkın, Fırat Doğruloğlu, Mesut Akusta, Ahmet Pınar, Can Nergis', 'TV-MA', 'Tasked with risky missions across Turkey, members of a special-operations police unit confront danger and tragedy both on the field and at home.', 'Tasked with risky missions across Turkey, members of a special-operations police unit confront danger and tragedy both on the field and at home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSJy27yMybtzou7eiUZTa03zWFI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75365'),
  ('926310026655221412', 'Wolf', 2023, 'Crime', 'Megan Gallagher', null, 'Ukweli Roach, Iwan Rheon, Sacha Dhawan, Juliet Stevenson, Owen Teale, Annes Elwy', null, 'DI Jack Caffery is a young man searching for himself. Obsessed with the neighbour he believes murdered his 10 year-old brother in the 90s, Jack finds himself trying to right the wrongs of others - but at what cost? In an isolated house in Monmouthshire, the wealthy Anchor-Ferrers family find themselves the victims of a psychopath’s cruel games, trapped and terrorised. When the two narratives collide, it’s a thrilling, nail-biting and deeply disturbing race against time.', 'DI Jack Caffery is a young man searching for himself. Obsessed with the neighbour he believes murdered his 10 year-old brother in the 90s, Jack finds himself trying to right the wrongs of others - but at what cost? In an isolated house in Monmouthshire, the wealthy Anchor-Ferrers family find themselves the victims of a psychopath’s cruel games, trapped and terrorised. When the two narratives collide, it’s a thrilling, nail-biting and deeply disturbing race against time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wQB5bOHhzoWhTIR0KlndLUdxHkp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222117'),
  ('995780687612712869', 'Wolf 2039', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Alper Çağlar', 'Alper Çağlar', 'Murat Arkın, Serkan Çayoğlu, Emir Benderlioğlu, Ozan Ağaç, Ahmet Pınar, Doğan Bayraktar, Muhammed Önel, Funda Alkayış', null, 'Second series of the WOLF franchise starts 25 years after the first outing. As alliances wear thin, and notions of global order are shattered, the world of 2039 is on the brink of total war. Dangerous technologies that exceed the grasp of humanity’s control threaten a frayed social fabric. The action-packed story will examine security and war in this near future world.', 'Second series of the WOLF franchise starts 25 years after the first outing. As alliances wear thin, and notions of global order are shattered, the world of 2039 is on the brink of total war. Dangerous technologies that exceed the grasp of humanity’s control threaten a frayed social fabric. The action-packed story will examine security and war in this near future world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gsWdSn0tRHrnL0O0piGXUCoVWmd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:118888'),
  ('549394125548068811', 'Wolf Creek', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Greg McLean, Tony Tilse', null, 'John Jarratt, Tess Haubrich, Matt Day', 'TV-MA', 'An anthology series which centers on different characters being targeted by crazed serial killer Mick Taylor in the Australian outback.', 'An anthology series which centers on different characters being targeted by crazed serial killer Mick Taylor in the Australian outback.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QKrCBkeRFGPJMk4JV0MmMJ5mBv.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66090'),
  ('320717277211355227', 'Wolf Girl & Black Prince', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Takahiro Sakurai, Kanae Itou, Ai Kayano, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Ayumu Murase, Mariya Ise, Mikako Komatsu', 'TV-PG', 'Fed up with her friends’ constant bragging about their boyfriends, high school student Erika Shinohara decides to make up one of her own. When her lie starts unraveling at the seams, her charming schoolmate Kyoya Sata agrees to be her pretend boyfriend, seemingly saving her reputation. She won’t get off that easy, however, as she soon discovers her white knight is actually a blackhearted prince! Now Erika must be at his beck and call or risk her lie being exposed. But is Kyoya really as blackhearted as he seems?', 'Fed up with her friends’ constant bragging about their boyfriends, high school student Erika Shinohara decides to make up one of her own. When her lie starts unraveling at the seams, her charming schoolmate Kyoya Sata agrees to be her pretend boyfriend, seemingly saving her reputation. She won’t get off that easy, however, as she soon discovers her white knight is actually a blackhearted prince! Now Erika must be at his beck and call or risk her lie being exposed. But is Kyoya really as blackhearted as he seems?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uyXTR4jVTV4NvvDyJrhdZIgjc5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68960'),
  ('550798294043621716', 'Wolf Hall', 2015, 'Drama', 'Peter Straughan, Peter Kosminsky, Hilary Mantel', null, 'Mark Rylance, Damian Lewis, Thomas Brodie-Sangster, Joss Porter, Charlie Rowe, Harry Melling, James Larkin', null, 'England in the 1520s is a heartbeat from disaster. If the King dies without a male heir, the country could be destroyed by civil war. Henry VIII wants to annul his marriage of twenty years and marry Anne Boleyn. The Pope and most of Europe oppose him. Into this impasse steps Thomas Cromwell: a wholly original man, a charmer, and a bully, both idealist and opportunist, astute in reading people, and implacable in his ambition. But Henry is volatile: one day tender, one day murderous. Cromwell helps him break the opposition, but what will be the price of his triumph?', 'England in the 1520s is a heartbeat from disaster. If the King dies without a male heir, the country could be destroyed by civil war. Henry VIII wants to annul his marriage of twenty years and marry Anne Boleyn. The Pope and most of Europe oppose him. Into this impasse steps Thomas Cromwell: a wholly original man, a charmer, and a bully, both idealist and opportunist, astute in reading people, and implacable in his ambition. But Henry is volatile: one day tender, one day murderous. Cromwell helps him break the opposition, but what will be the price of his triumph?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGuiMtUQBGxM3ZWosphO2MdYw8o.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61697'),
  ('918643549742952563', 'Wolf King', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Nina Barker-Francis, Ceallach Spellman', 'TV-PG', 'A young commoner comes of age and learns he''s the last of a long line of Werewolves — and heir to the throne.', 'A young commoner comes of age and learns he''s the last of a long line of Werewolves — and heir to the throne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgs2AtxtOMRuVHYjSofbv3P9WnN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:231727'),
  ('424672829966071663', 'Wolf Lake', 2001, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'John Leekley', null, 'Lou Diamond Phillips, Mia Kirshner, Sharon Lawrence, Tim Matheson, Scott Bairstow, Mary Elizabeth Winstead, Graham Greene, Paul Wesley', 'TV-14', '"There are those among us who can move at will between the world of the wolves and the world of the humans. My people call them skin walkers." Seattle police detective John Kanin has a problem. He''s in love, but shortly after agreeing to marry him, his girlfriend disapears. His search leads to her home town, where people are clearly hiding information from him. One of the things they are hiding is the fact that they are all werewolves, as is John''s girlfriend, Ruby.', '"There are those among us who can move at will between the world of the wolves and the world of the humans. My people call them skin walkers." Seattle police detective John Kanin has a problem. He''s in love, but shortly after agreeing to marry him, his girlfriend disapears. His search leads to her home town, where people are clearly hiding information from him. One of the things they are hiding is the fact that they are all werewolves, as is John''s girlfriend, Ruby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/41uZS2rBtgCMT53DRSnzvUCgO70.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12505'),
  ('294983546078333340', 'Wolf Like Me', 2022, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Abe Forsythe', null, 'Isla Fisher, Josh Gad, Emma Lung, Ariel Donoghue, Anthony Taufa, Claire Lovering', 'TV-MA', 'Gary is an emotional wreck and struggles to provide for his daughter since the death of his wife. Mary has a secret she can''t bring herself to share with anyone. The universe brought these two together for a reason.', 'Gary is an emotional wreck and struggles to provide for his daughter since the death of his wife. Mary has a secret she can''t bring herself to share with anyone. The universe brought these two together for a reason.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8eZerQDLDkdvQ7vrv6Slkr36sHX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:136738'),
