  ('601813368939822576', 'Woman', 2017, 'Drama', 'Hande Altaylı', null, 'Özge Özpirinçci, Caner Cindoruk, Bennu Yıldırımlar, Seray Kaya, Ece Özdikici, Devrim Özder Akın, Feyyaz Duman, Gökçe Eyüboğlu', 'TV-PG', 'The story of mother Bahar, who carries the weight and love of two children in their hearts with enthusiasm in their hearts. Bahar, abandoned by her mother when she was eight years old, later lost her grandma and her father. When she thinks she is all alone, she meets Sarp, whom she delicately loves.', 'The story of mother Bahar, who carries the weight and love of two children in their hearts with enthusiasm in their hearts. Bahar, abandoned by her mother when she was eight years old, later lost her grandma and her father. When she thinks she is all alone, she meets Sarp, whom she delicately loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4eY2vftw6yKjfSTd5Z9ky89x36.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:77532'),
  ('740378390097573530', 'Woman in a Veil', 2023, 'Drama', null, 'Lee Jeong-dae', 'Choi Yoon-young, Lee Chae-young, Lee Seon-ho, Shin Go-eun, Lee Eun-hyung, Kim Ga-yeon, Kim Hee-jung', null, 'Jung Gyul Wool loses her vision and ability to walk because of her materialistic husband and his mistress. Despite her shortcomings, she hatches a plot to seek revenge.', 'Jung Gyul Wool loses her vision and ability to walk because of her materialistic husband and his mistress. Despite her shortcomings, she hatches a plot to seek revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ERr09UrnVm0hdXBeefNVtQMxI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:216390'),
