  ('32654162914358128', 'Women''s Murder Club', 2007, 'Crime, Drama', 'Sarah Fain, James Patterson', null, 'Angie Harmon, Laura Harris, Paula Newsome, Aubrey Dollar, Tyrees Allen, Rob Estes, Linda Park, Coby Ryan McLaughlin', null, 'Women''s Murder Club was an American police procedural and legal drama. Longtime friends involved in homicide investigations gather to work off the clock to solve cases. District Attorney Jill has issues with her past, medical examiner Claire is dealing with a husband newly in a wheelchair, and tough Detective Lindsay suddenly finds herself working under her ex-husband. Despite personal issues, they allow young reporter Cindy to join their "club."', 'Women''s Murder Club was an American police procedural and legal drama. Longtime friends involved in homicide investigations gather to work off the clock to solve cases. District Attorney Jill has issues with her past, medical examiner Claire is dealing with a husband newly in a wheelchair, and tough Detective Lindsay suddenly finds herself working under her ex-husband. Despite personal issues, they allow young reporter Cindy to join their "club."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/60wKdEKCzp244Han7HLQF8il0Yb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3371'),
  ('1066464721572471292', 'Wonder Egg Priority', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', null, null, 'Kanata Aikawa, Tomori Kusunoki, Shuka Saito, Hinaki Yano, Yuuya Uchida, Hiroki Takahashi', 'TV-14', 'Ai, a young girl with shut-in tendencies, who tries not to interact with others. She keeps one of her eyes hidden behind her hair. One day, she happens to stop by a deserted arcade, where she meets "Aka." Spinning the gacha at their urging, she acquires a "Wonder Egg," and from that moment, her fate begins to change...', 'Ai, a young girl with shut-in tendencies, who tries not to interact with others. She keeps one of her eyes hidden behind her hair. One day, she happens to stop by a deserted arcade, where she meets "Aka." Spinning the gacha at their urging, she acquires a "Wonder Egg," and from that moment, her fate begins to change...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Ief4J2hkBuaKxUzy9fMqUoh9BY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:111255'),
  ('166954663394145077', 'Wonder Man', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Andrew Guest, Destin Daniel Cretton', null, 'Yahya Abdul-Mateen II, Arian Moayed, X Mayo, Ben Kingsley', 'TV-14', 'Simon and Trevor, two actors at opposite ends of their careers, chase life-changing roles.', 'Simon and Trevor, two actors at opposite ends of their careers, chase life-changing roles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yy9nQlFt2l6UVWzrfhszFCaZ5C.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:198178'),
  ('26757941049317791', 'Wonder Pets!', 2006, 'Animation, Kids', 'Josh Selig, Jennifer Oxley', null, 'Danica Lee, Teala Dunn, Sofie Zamchick, Cooper Corrao, Steven Tyler, Idina Menzel', 'TV-Y', 'When school ends for the day, Linny, Tuck and Ming-Ming -- an animated trio of classroom pets -- morph into heroes who sail the globe in their fantastic Flyboat and use teamwork to help pandas, elephants and other animals who are in trouble.', 'When school ends for the day, Linny, Tuck and Ming-Ming -- an animated trio of classroom pets -- morph into heroes who sail the globe in their fantastic Flyboat and use teamwork to help pandas, elephants and other animals who are in trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qCX45QJccnDdX6jHYkJHDst1o0.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:10867'),
  ('224353071527916828', 'Wonder Showzen', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Vernon Chatman, John Lee', null, 'Vernon Chatman, John Lee, Alyson Levy', 'TV-MA', 'Wonder Showzen is an American sketch comedy television series that aired between 2005 and 2006 on MTV2. It was created by John Lee and Vernon Chatman of PFFR. The show is rated TV-MA. The show''s format is that of educational PBS children''s television shows such as Sesame Street and The Electric Company, parodying the format with adult-oriented content. In addition to general controversial comedy, it satirizes politics, religion, war, sex, and culture with black comedy. Every episode begins with a disclaimer, accompanied by the sound of someone screaming "Don''t eat my baby!", which reads: "Wonder Showzen contains offensive, despicable content that is too controversial and too awesome for actual children. The stark, ugly and profound truths Wonder Showzen exposes may be soul-crushing to the weak of spirit. If you allow a child to watch this show, you are a bad parent or guardian."', 'Wonder Showzen is an American sketch comedy television series that aired between 2005 and 2006 on MTV2. It was created by John Lee and Vernon Chatman of PFFR. The show is rated TV-MA. The show''s format is that of educational PBS children''s television shows such as Sesame Street and The Electric Company, parodying the format with adult-oriented content. In addition to general controversial comedy, it satirizes politics, religion, war, sex, and culture with black comedy. Every episode begins with a disclaimer, accompanied by the sound of someone screaming "Don''t eat my baby!", which reads: "Wonder Showzen contains offensive, despicable content that is too controversial and too awesome for actual children. The stark, ugly and profound truths Wonder Showzen exposes may be soul-crushing to the weak of spirit. If you allow a child to watch this show, you are a bad parent or guardian."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yy9t6HpvQ7brYCc0hjjV2Lnnkpn.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1459'),
  ('459655668464597198', 'Wonder Woman', null, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'David E. Kelley', null, 'Adrianne Palicki, Elizabeth Hurley, Tracie Thoms, Pedro Pascal, Cary Elwes, Justin Bruening', 'TV-PG', 'It''s the modern day, and being Wonder Woman is complicated. Diana is leading a triple life - running a large corporation out of costume and fighting crime in costume in one identity. A never-aired television pilot expected to debut in 2011, but NBC opted not to buy the series.', 'It''s the modern day, and being Wonder Woman is complicated. Diana is leading a triple life - running a large corporation out of costume and fighting crime in costume in one identity. A never-aired television pilot expected to debut in 2011, but NBC opted not to buy the series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9z49hH60xboQF2xMvr43GRocFz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:41246'),
  ('222607882654615756', 'Wonder Woman', 1975, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Stanley Ralph Ross', null, 'Lynda Carter, Lyle Waggoner', 'NR', 'With the strength of Hercules, the wisdom of Athena, the speed of Mercury and the beauty of Aphrodite, she’s Wonder Woman. Beautiful Amazon princess Wonder Woman travels to 1940s America disguised as Diana Prince, assistant to handsome but trouble-prone Major Steve Trevor. Using her golden belt, which imbues her with astonishing strength, her bullet-deflecting bracelets, a golden lasso that dispels dishonesty and an invisible supersonic plane, Wonder Woman combats evil.', 'With the strength of Hercules, the wisdom of Athena, the speed of Mercury and the beauty of Aphrodite, she’s Wonder Woman. Beautiful Amazon princess Wonder Woman travels to 1940s America disguised as Diana Prince, assistant to handsome but trouble-prone Major Steve Trevor. Using her golden belt, which imbues her with astonishing strength, her bullet-deflecting bracelets, a golden lasso that dispels dishonesty and an invisible supersonic plane, Wonder Woman combats evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vHxWO6ahByDWzWufFL48MXaktT.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:4331'),
  ('888008607284856423', 'Wonderfalls', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Todd Holland, Bryan Fuller, Tim Minear', null, 'Caroline Dhavernas, Tyron Leitso, Tracie Thoms, Katie Finneran, Lee Pace, Diana Scarwid, William Sadler', 'TV-PG', 'Jaye Tyler, a recent Brown University graduate with a philosophy degree, holds a dead-end job as a sales clerk at a Niagara Falls gift shop. Jaye is the reluctant participant in conversations with various animal figurines — a wax lion, brass monkey, stuffed bear, and mounted fish, among others — which direct her via oblique instructions to help people in need.', 'Jaye Tyler, a recent Brown University graduate with a philosophy degree, holds a dead-end job as a sales clerk at a Niagara Falls gift shop. Jaye is the reluctant participant in conversations with various animal figurines — a wax lion, brass monkey, stuffed bear, and mounted fish, among others — which direct her via oblique instructions to help people in need.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qioFpx1SwUXrob1ruKBk0lAk6gW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1982'),
  ('983498333391681370', 'Wonderful Days', 2014, 'Drama', 'Lee Kyoung-hee', 'Lee Kyoung-hee', 'Lee Seo-jin, Kim Hee-seon, Ok Taec-yeon, Ryu Seung-su, Lee Elijah, Choi Hwa-jeong, Youn Yuh-jung, Hong Hwa-ri', null, 'Dong-Suk grew up as a smart young boy, but came from a poor family background. He is now a successful prosecutor and comes back to his hometown for the first time in 14 years. There, he happens to meet his first love Hae-Won and falls in love with her all over again.', 'Dong-Suk grew up as a smart young boy, but came from a poor family background. He is now a successful prosecutor and comes back to his hometown for the first time in 14 years. There, he happens to meet his first love Hae-Won and falls in love with her all over again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gkLVekIE4mBBlCSKRWy14kx6Hs8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67615'),
  ('503554216497778137', 'Wonderful Precure!', 2024, 'Animation, Kids, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Maria Naganawa, Atsumi Tanezaki, Satsumi Matsuda, Reina Ueda, Takuma Terashima, Shinnosuke Tachibana, Shinya Takahashi, Kana Ueda', null, 'In Animal Town where humans and animals live together, Iroha who loves animals is very close to her dog Komugi! One day, a mysterious creature called a GaruGaru goes berserk in her city. In order to protect Iroha, Komugi transforms into a human and even a Pretty Cure…!? We have to protect such berserk animals! Let''s join forces and return the animals to the Niko Garden!', 'In Animal Town where humans and animals live together, Iroha who loves animals is very close to her dog Komugi! One day, a mysterious creature called a GaruGaru goes berserk in her city. In order to protect Iroha, Komugi transforms into a human and even a Pretty Cure…!? We have to protect such berserk animals! Let''s join forces and return the animals to the Niko Garden!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2PhiNPB0UyqBu9pHm0cluD0Sh3W.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:243216'),
  ('122278204173572313', 'Wonderful World', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Kim Eun-ji', 'Kim Ji-eun', 'Kim Nam-ju, Cha Eun-woo, Kim Kang-woo, Lim Se-mi, Yang Hye-ji, Cha Soo-yeon, Jeon Jung-il, Park Hyuk-kwon', 'TV-14', 'A mother who unfairly lost her young son, takes revenge against the perpetrator who has been forgiven by the law and heals her wounds.', 'A mother who unfairly lost her young son, takes revenge against the perpetrator who has been forgiven by the law and heals her wounds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6sUmEotEp3gw2j0ThpTL6CdwJd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:227190'),
  ('846977458128643192', 'Wonderland', 2021, 'Reality', '池源', '吴浩宇', 'Jackie Li, Xu Zhisheng, Ren Ke, Wang Feng, Xu Xin, Yan Peilun, Zhou Yiran, Ning Jing', 'TV-Y7', 'A social experiment reality show about the cultivation of an ideal community, inviting 15 guests to Taohuawu, 15KM away from the city center, to live together for 21 days, creating an ideal society in their hearts. See how they live, work, and live in harmony in friction and cooperation. It is also a journey to explore the source of material and spiritual consensus.', 'A social experiment reality show about the cultivation of an ideal community, inviting 15 guests to Taohuawu, 15KM away from the city center, to live together for 21 days, creating an ideal society in their hearts. See how they live, work, and live in harmony in friction and cooperation. It is also a journey to explore the source of material and spiritual consensus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sLzul3ILf7NmuOqrUH25exct3Pe.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:126398'),
  ('484019549429880581', 'Wonderland Junior', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Ryan Zhao, Lian Huai Wei, Gan Wangxing, 张星特, 袁一琦, Ding Xiaoying, Darren Chen, Gu Zicheng', null, '12 young artists stay together in the seaside Wonderland to meet unknown challenges and create a trendy life together. By working hard to win the opportunity to be seen by the audience, they show their talented selves.', '12 young artists stay together in the seaside Wonderland to meet unknown challenges and create a trendy life together. By working hard to win the opportunity to be seen by the audience, they show their talented selves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pma4ghMTDycbYXxI0EULM4WsY8o.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:212814'),
  ('892631654543136211', 'Wonderland of Love', 2023, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Fei Wo Si Cun', 'Fei Wo Si Cun', 'Xu Kai, Jing Tian, Zheng Hehuizi, Gao Han, Zhao Jiamin, Liu Dongqin, Dai Yi, He Fengtian', null, 'Li Ni, the emperor’s overlooked grandson, lives freely as a border general until duty forces him to lead the campaign against a growing rebellion. On the battlefield, he repeatedly crosses paths with Cui Lin, the spirited daughter of a famed general who fights in disguise as a lieutenant. Their strategic duels and constant one-upmanship soon give way to a deeper bond, as rivalry slowly blossoms into love amid the chaos of war.', 'Li Ni, the emperor’s overlooked grandson, lives freely as a border general until duty forces him to lead the campaign against a growing rebellion. On the battlefield, he repeatedly crosses paths with Cui Lin, the spirited daughter of a famed general who fights in disguise as a lieutenant. Their strategic duels and constant one-upmanship soon give way to a deeper bond, as rivalry slowly blossoms into love amid the chaos of war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ril8we8kIBZNyRcMRRiQyP2vtMf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209915'),
  ('1140244458182236056', 'Wonders of Life', 2013, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Professor Brian Cox', 'TV-PG', 'Physicist and professor Brian Cox travels across the globe to uncover the secrets of the most extraordinary phenomenon in the universe: life.', 'Physicist and professor Brian Cox travels across the globe to uncover the secrets of the most extraordinary phenomenon in the universe: life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0o8Y6HdZ1JcQdkrqap7ySY9NW5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46627'),
  ('817790928086792857', 'Wonders of the Solar System', 2010, 'Documentary', null, 'Chris Holt, Michael Lachmann, Paul Olding', 'Professor Brian Cox', 'TV-G', 'In this spellbinding series, Professor Brian Cox visits the most extreme locations on Earth to explain how the laws of physics carved natural wonders across the solar system.', 'In this spellbinding series, Professor Brian Cox visits the most extreme locations on Earth to explain how the laws of physics carved natural wonders across the solar system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPLJuBk7hlSpnte7AnhAZxo5Iu4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32374'),
