  ('915347771639890570', 'Wounded Heart', 2021, 'Family, Drama', 'Tomris Giritlioğlu', null, 'Gökhan Alkan, Yağmur Tanrısevsin, Merve Çağıran, Toprak Can Adıgüzel, Şenay Gürler, İnanç Konukçu, Yonca Şahinbaş, Rıza Akın', null, 'Ferit is the cherished heir apparent of one of the well-established families of Antakya. Ayse, on the other hand, is a lively young girl living in Istanbul who has managed to stand on her own feet. Ferit, who is about to marry Hande, the daughter of the Varoglu Family, confronts the facts before the wedding and his world turns upside down.', 'Ferit is the cherished heir apparent of one of the well-established families of Antakya. Ayse, on the other hand, is a lively young girl living in Istanbul who has managed to stand on her own feet. Ferit, who is about to marry Hande, the daughter of the Varoglu Family, confronts the facts before the wedding and his world turns upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iEIKOUTTa0yyUWOLeQop8KzG5R4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:126248'),
  ('207794466157078796', 'Wounded Love', 2016, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Nuran Evren Şit', 'Gamze Arslan, Hasan Cömert, Nergis Otluoğlu Akoğlu', 'Halit Ergenç, Bergüzar Korel, Onur Saylak, Okan Yalabık, Devrim Özkan, Celile Toyon, Fatih Artman, Boran Kuzum', null, 'Azize finds herself with her 3 children and mother-in-law in a difficult fight. She raises her children while fighting the difficulties of the war period and her husband''s absence whom she loves more than anything. It''s about war, love, greed, treason and sacrifice.', 'Azize finds herself with her 3 children and mother-in-law in a difficult fight. She raises her children while fighting the difficulties of the war period and her husband''s absence whom she loves more than anything. It''s about war, love, greed, treason and sacrifice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v4fiUUJZJZJSLovPoRnxXfBCpJz.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69459'),
  ('96071389668296736', 'Wow! Wow! Wubbzy!', 2006, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Kids, Family', 'Bob Boyle', null, 'Grey DeLisle, Lara Jill Miller, Carlos Alazraqui, Tara Strong', 'TV-Y', 'Happy-go-lucky Wubbzy bounces his way into wacky, fun-filled adventures in the town of Wuzzleburg with his best friends: inventor Widget, book-smart Walden, and sweet-as-can-be Daizy.', 'Happy-go-lucky Wubbzy bounces his way into wacky, fun-filled adventures in the town of Wuzzleburg with his best friends: inventor Widget, book-smart Walden, and sweet-as-can-be Daizy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uaPYHkMe5vwOseuPAVgSUwnvgWN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1346'),
  ('534696565304167067', 'WPC 56', 2013, 'Drama', 'Dominique Moloney', null, 'Claudia Jessie, Charles De''Ath, Oliver Rix, James Barriscale, Mark Healy, Liam Jeavons, John Bowler, Rachel Leskovac', 'TV-PG', 'Drama following WPC Gina Dawson, the first Woman Police Constable to join Brinford Constabulary, a fictional police force in the West Midlands, in 1956. The show focuses on WPC Gina Dawson''s struggle to gain acceptance in the male-dominated police station whilst having to deal with the sexist attitudes that were commonplace at the time.', 'Drama following WPC Gina Dawson, the first Woman Police Constable to join Brinford Constabulary, a fictional police force in the West Midlands, in 1956. The show focuses on WPC Gina Dawson''s struggle to gain acceptance in the male-dominated police station whilst having to deal with the sexist attitudes that were commonplace at the time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sIurHeTbj6pmJoD2JRDzywFtjdO.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:46850'),
  ('1067121066202615755', 'Wreck', 2022, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Ryan J. Brown', null, 'Oscar Kennedy, Thaddea Graham, Alice Nokes, Peter Claffey, Miya Ocego, Jodie Tyack, Amber Grappy', 'TV-MA', 'Aboard the mega cruise ship Sacramentum, 20-year-old new recruit, Jamie, infiltrates the 3000-strong crew in a desperate race to find his missing sister. She was working aboard the same vessel on a previous tour and vanished mid-charter.', 'Aboard the mega cruise ship Sacramentum, 20-year-old new recruit, Jamie, infiltrates the 3000-strong crew in a desperate race to find his missing sister. She was working aboard the same vessel on a previous tour and vanished mid-charter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bR8paDozNtcA1Lf7Qx0Q8Hn7uI.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:169582'),
  ('792641486789751054', 'Wrecked', 2016, 'Comedy, Action & Adventure, Mystery', 'Jordan Shipley, Justin Shipley', null, 'Zach Cregger, Brian Sacca, Jessica Lowe, Asif Ali, Will Greenberg, Rhys Darby, Ally Maki, Brooke Dillman', 'TV-MA', 'Single-camera comedy centering on a diverse group of survivors adjusting to being stranded on an uninhabited island, a dangerous new world where they must face many threats – mostly brought on by themselves. No longer plugged into the rest of the world, the group struggles to navigate their makeshift society while also learning to live without such modern comforts as indoor plumbing, Wi-Fi, social media and Chipotle.', 'Single-camera comedy centering on a diverse group of survivors adjusting to being stranded on an uninhabited island, a dangerous new world where they must face many threats – mostly brought on by themselves. No longer plugged into the rest of the world, the group struggles to navigate their makeshift society while also learning to live without such modern comforts as indoor plumbing, Wi-Fi, social media and Chipotle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h84bOAmmxDa2qfOu6KWDOSEuwLq.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:66556'),
  ('906231967489709919', 'Wrestlemania Rewind', 2014, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Relive the greatest matches and moments in WrestleMania history and discover the amazing stories behind them.', 'Relive the greatest matches and moments in WrestleMania history and discover the amazing stories behind them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kW3ewGEFIEbALti6aVc25hs1Ufh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94327'),
  ('643326270433413758', 'Wrestlers', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Allen Sarven, Doug Basham, Matt Jones', 'TV-MA', 'At a storied professional wrestling organization, new owners and a roster of rising stars strive to make an impact beyond the ring in this docuseries.', 'At a storied professional wrestling organization, new owners and a roster of rising stars strive to make an impact beyond the ring in this docuseries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnC8JNeRZwbPANkuRMhlMtPdF0d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233051'),
  ('1075383066222362303', 'Written in the Stars', 2010, 'Drama, Soap, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Elizabeth Jhin', 'Elizabeth Jhin, Eliane Garcia, Lílian Garcia', 'Humberto Martins, Nathalia Dill, Alexandre Nero, Débora Falabella, Antonio Calloni, Zezé Polessa, Carol Castro, Suzana Faíni', 'NR', 'Ricardo Aguillar, a powerful physician, loses the only and beloved son, the young Daniel, in an accident. After some time he discovers that the boy had frozen the semen before he died. From there he decides to go hunting for the "ideal woman", worthy of being inseminated and become the mother of his grandson. Only fate is about to play a part. When the insemination is finally done and the young woman chosen - the young Viviane - becomes pregnant, the man discovers himself hopelessly in love with her. From then on an unusual and surprising situation will give an electrifying direction to the story: the boy''s spirit begins to prowl the family and, although they are in different plans, father and son will dispute the love of the same woman. It will be a clash between the impossible love, therefore idealized, and the realizable love, carnal, with all that it brings of joy and fulfillment, but also of hurts and uncertainties.', 'Ricardo Aguillar, a powerful physician, loses the only and beloved son, the young Daniel, in an accident. After some time he discovers that the boy had frozen the semen before he died. From there he decides to go hunting for the "ideal woman", worthy of being inseminated and become the mother of his grandson. Only fate is about to play a part. When the insemination is finally done and the young woman chosen - the young Viviane - becomes pregnant, the man discovers himself hopelessly in love with her. From then on an unusual and surprising situation will give an electrifying direction to the story: the boy''s spirit begins to prowl the family and, although they are in different plans, father and son will dispute the love of the same woman. It will be a clash between the impossible love, therefore idealized, and the realizable love, carnal, with all that it brings of joy and fulfillment, but also of hurts and uncertainties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i95XboxtuMY4q4Ln8oR5u2oSeBz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46142'),
  ('602779842478392135', 'Wrong Side of the Rainbow', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Warintorn Panhakarn, Rinrada Kaewbuasai, Khunnarong Pratesrat, Saralee Prasitdumrong, Lorena Schuett, Paradee Wongsawat, Chintara Sukapatana, Sukol Sasijulaka', null, 'When love is twisted into a weapon, pain becomes inevitable. Bound in a complex relationship, Pan, Pie, and Win find themselves entangled in secrets that threaten to destroy them all, as hidden truths slowly surface and push their bonds to the breaking point.', 'When love is twisted into a weapon, pain becomes inevitable. Bound in a complex relationship, Pan, Pie, and Win find themselves entangled in secrets that threaten to destroy them all, as hidden truths slowly surface and push their bonds to the breaking point.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZvoXH95bN5qIEUqKuoeICRZoHR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:318011'),
  ('896123380654142353', 'Wrong Side of the Tracks', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'David Bermejo', null, 'Jose Coronado, Luis Zahera, Felipe Londoño, Laura Ramos, Manuel Tallafé, Manolo Caro, Itziar Atienza, Franky Martín', 'TV-MA', 'When his teenage granddaughter falls victim to the drug dealers overtaking his neighborhood, a fed-up war veteran takes matters into his own hands.', 'When his teenage granddaughter falls victim to the drug dealers overtaking his neighborhood, a fed-up war veteran takes matters into his own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJWFFoMgY0t6CmsbRlR2TBazfqt.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:128015'),
  ('1111929244219854689', 'wtFOCK', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Julie Andem', 'Bram Renders', 'Laura Bekaert, Nell Cattrysse, Nona ’t Jolle, Mathis Mavuela, Ella Van Remortel, Dara Oguntubi, Junes Callaert, Mo Bakker', null, 'The story of Dutch speaking young teenagers and pupils in a high school in Antwerp, and their troubles, scandals and everyday life. Each season is told from a different person''s point of view.', 'The story of Dutch speaking young teenagers and pupils in a high school in Antwerp, and their troubles, scandals and everyday life. Each season is told from a different person''s point of view.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2fBRL2r5vuwbf5z3ryQElwaHXgp.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:85213'),
  ('803635893714602138', 'Wu Assassins', 2019, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'John Wirth, Tony Krantz', 'Jessica Chou', 'Iko Uwais, Byron Mann, Katheryn Winnick, Li Jun Li, Lawrence Kao', 'TV-MA', 'The last in a line of Chosen Ones, a wannabe chef teams up with a homicide detective to unravel an ancient mystery and take down supernatural assassins.', 'The last in a line of Chosen Ones, a wannabe chef teams up with a homicide detective to unravel an ancient mystery and take down supernatural assassins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nhWgmdLveoJNw1GZBkb62aIzyNr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86752'),
  ('1023234129693285578', 'Wu Xin: The Monster Killer', 2015, 'Mystery, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', '蔡藝儂', null, 'Chen Yao, Elvis Han, Jin Chen, Wang Yanlin, Mike Angelo, Mei Han', null, 'Immortal and aimless, Wu Xin has no memory of his origins or purpose. Struggling to survive, he meets kindhearted Yue Ya, who shares her last meal with him. To repay her and sustain themselves, he uses his unique ability—hunting supernatural creatures. Together, they embark on a thrilling journey, battling monsters for those who can pay.', 'Immortal and aimless, Wu Xin has no memory of his origins or purpose. Struggling to survive, he meets kindhearted Yue Ya, who shares her last meal with him. To repay her and sustain themselves, he uses his unique ability—hunting supernatural creatures. Together, they embark on a thrilling journey, battling monsters for those who can pay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eD8JeAr98KX8Xtlxp6RWK9a94qm.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:64532'),
  ('751962405049851813', 'Wu-Tang Clan: Of Mics and Men', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Sacha Jenkins', null, 'U-God, Inspectah Deck, Ol'' Dirty Bastard, Method Man, The GZA, Raekwon, Ghostface Killah, Masta Killa', 'TV-MA', 'Transcending the music documentary genre by creating a new lane that merges music, socio-cultural commentary and and intimate family portrait of the Wu-Tang Clan.', 'Transcending the music documentary genre by creating a new lane that merges music, socio-cultural commentary and and intimate family portrait of the Wu-Tang Clan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8Sl0EAH7m2BCRYSjq8DNfSSVZ8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85999'),
  ('778285621034980533', 'Wu-Tang: An American Saga', 2019, 'Drama', 'Alex Tse, RZA', null, 'Ashton Sanders, Siddiq Saunderson, Shameik Moore, Julian Elijah Martinez, Zolee Griggs, T.J. Atoms, Marcus Callender, Dave East', 'TV-MA', 'In the early 1990s in New York, during the height of the crack cocaine epidemic, a visionary musician named Bobby Diggs aka The RZA begins to form a super group of a dozen young, black men, who will eventually rise to become one of the unlikeliest success stories in American music history.', 'In the early 1990s in New York, during the height of the crack cocaine epidemic, a visionary musician named Bobby Diggs aka The RZA begins to form a super group of a dozen young, black men, who will eventually rise to become one of the unlikeliest success stories in American music history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbZFfquhFg2EOUnKbZedWCs1kWO.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:90870'),
  ('525438698346047798', 'Wunschpunsch', 2001, 'Animation, Kids', null, null, 'Matthias Hummitzsch, Wolfgang Jakob, Karl Rieper, Sebastian Schulz, Tom Pauls, Joachim Kaps, Frauke Poolmann, Bert Franzke', 'NR', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h9gsXeMh8bdPmHCk9RhlSVeFKiB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69758'),
  ('1002795589289714409', 'Wuthering Heights', 2009, 'Drama', 'Coky Giedroyc', 'Peter Bowker', 'Tom Hardy, Charlotte Riley, Andrew Lincoln, Sarah Lancashire, Burn Gorman, Rebecca Night, Tom Payne, Andrew Hawley', null, 'Young orphan Heathcliff is adopted by the wealthy Earnshaw family and moves into their estate, Wuthering Heights. Soon, the new resident falls for his compassionate foster sister, Cathy. The two share a remarkable bond that seems unbreakable until Cathy, feeling the pressure of social convention, suppresses her feelings and marries Edgar Linton, a man of means who befits her stature. Heathcliff vows to win her back.', 'Young orphan Heathcliff is adopted by the wealthy Earnshaw family and moves into their estate, Wuthering Heights. Soon, the new resident falls for his compassionate foster sister, Cathy. The two share a remarkable bond that seems unbreakable until Cathy, feeling the pressure of social convention, suppresses her feelings and marries Edgar Linton, a man of means who befits her stature. Heathcliff vows to win her back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKXXoVHTY7ie7LJvZtNqr0PGZ2j.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8510'),
  ('684373318159887246', 'Wuzzles', 1985, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Michael Eisner', null, 'Henry Gibson, Jo Anne Worley, Alan Oppenheimer, Bill Scott, Tress MacNeille, Stan Freberg, Jim Cummings, Brian Cummings', null, 'Disney''s The Wuzzles is an animated television series created for Saturday morning television, and was first broadcast on September 14, 1985 on CBS. An idea of Michael Eisner for his new Disney television animation studio. The premise is that the main characters are hybrids of two different animals. The original thirteen episodes ran on CBS for their first run. With only 13 episodes of The Wuzzles, it was one of the shortest running animated series produced by Disney. One season later, Wuzzles moved to ABC for reruns, and disappeared from network television after that.', 'Disney''s The Wuzzles is an animated television series created for Saturday morning television, and was first broadcast on September 14, 1985 on CBS. An idea of Michael Eisner for his new Disney television animation studio. The premise is that the main characters are hybrids of two different animals. The original thirteen episodes ran on CBS for their first run. With only 13 episodes of The Wuzzles, it was one of the shortest running animated series produced by Disney. One season later, Wuzzles moved to ABC for reruns, and disappeared from network television after that.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e220dTw8y0pjqYS8IwR7EMSNuEV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2032'),
  ('39216600610887964', 'WWE 205 Live', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Paul Levesque, Vince McMahon', null, 'Greg Hamilton', 'TV-PG', 'WWE''s division of Cruiserweight''s battle it out to decide who is the greatest wrestler under 205lbs.', 'WWE''s division of Cruiserweight''s battle it out to decide who is the greatest wrestler under 205lbs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6NlvoEJH8KxQI58ecTBkcsbQVF.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:68921'),
  ('44006049603562226', 'WWE 24', 2015, 'Documentary, Drama, Talk', 'Paul Levesque, Vince McMahon, John Cena', null, null, 'TV-PG', 'The acclaimed docu-series takes you on a lightning-fast journey through a day in the life of WWE''s most intriguing Superstars and groundbreaking events.', 'The acclaimed docu-series takes you on a lightning-fast journey through a day in the life of WWE''s most intriguing Superstars and groundbreaking events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogROxSfFwFHN3L2K4c9dc9qbvOj.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:64084'),
  ('135682462269442000', 'WWE ECW', 2006, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Paul Heyman, Vince McMahon', null, null, 'TV-14', 'ECW was a professional wrestling television program for WWE, based on the independent Extreme Championship Wrestling promotion that lasted from 1992 to 2001. The show''s name also referred to the ECW brand, in which WWE employees were assigned to work and perform, complementary to WWE''s other brands, Raw and SmackDown. It debuted on June 13, 2006 on Sci Fi in the United States and ran for close to four years until it aired its final episode on February 16, 2010 on the rebranded Syfy. It was replaced the following week with WWE NXT.', 'ECW was a professional wrestling television program for WWE, based on the independent Extreme Championship Wrestling promotion that lasted from 1992 to 2001. The show''s name also referred to the ECW brand, in which WWE employees were assigned to work and perform, complementary to WWE''s other brands, Raw and SmackDown. It debuted on June 13, 2006 on Sci Fi in the United States and ran for close to four years until it aired its final episode on February 16, 2010 on the rebranded Syfy. It was replaced the following week with WWE NXT.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3qIiG22Uy62ZgLLtXkh5PdfiSL.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:3894'),
  ('91002235817735047', 'WWE Evil', 2022, 'Documentary, Drama', 'John Cena', 'John Cena', 'John Cena', 'TV-14', 'A “psychological exposé” into the minds of the most diabolical antagonists in WWE history and their impact on mainstream culture.', 'A “psychological exposé” into the minds of the most diabolical antagonists in WWE history and their impact on mainstream culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2gWOqIpLMP6v0n9RMXbS1IFmC1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:134180'),
