  ('58642243061043883', 'WWF Superstars', 1986, 'Action & Adventure', 'Vince McMahon', 'Bruce Prichard', 'Bret Hart, Michael Hickenbottom, Vince McMahon, Hulk Hogan, Jim Hellwig', 'TV-14', 'WWE''s flagship show of the early-90s featuring great in-ring action, news from the world of sports-entertainment, and more.', 'WWE''s flagship show of the early-90s featuring great in-ring action, news from the world of sports-entertainment, and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEpkEXGlWQFVX5r0EXGpgyqkYhr.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:823'),
  ('371972978633652270', 'WWF Wrestling Challenge', 1986, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Vince McMahon', null, null, 'TV-PG', 'The biggest WWE Superstars of the late 1980s and early ''90s settle their differences in the ring on "Wrestling Challenge"; featuring exciting matches and memorable interviews, this weekly television series captures an important era of WWE history.', 'The biggest WWE Superstars of the late 1980s and early ''90s settle their differences in the ring on "Wrestling Challenge"; featuring exciting matches and memorable interviews, this weekly television series captures an important era of WWE history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d8rY9foYLCVvV1lOAnBY4RUVTnP.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:585'),
  ('1142890666428383005', 'WWII in Color: Road to Victory', 2021, 'Documentary, War & Politics', null, null, 'Trish Bertram', null, 'Gripping historical footage and expert commentary give detailed insights into the leading figures and decisive turning points of World War II.', 'Gripping historical footage and expert commentary give detailed insights into the leading figures and decisive turning points of World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQB8z2VwX9C7tlBiZYX9Z3uNbMA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:153966'),
  ('44479058649565763', 'WWII in HD', 2009, 'Documentary, War & Politics', null, null, 'Gary Sinise, LL Cool J, Steve Zahn, Justin Bartha, Josh Lucas, Tim DeKay, Amy Smart, Mark Hefti', 'TV-PG', 'WWII in HD is a 10-part American documentary television miniseries that originally aired from November 15 to November 19, 2009 on the History Channel. The program focuses on the firsthand experiences of twelve American service members during World War II, including an Army nurse, a member of the Tuskegee Airmen, a second generation Japanese American and prisoner of war, and an Austrian Jewish immigrant. The twelve members recorded their time in both theaters and some had later interviews; found footage from the battlefield was paired with the stories of the twelve service members. The episodes premiered on five consecutive days, with two episodes per day. The series is narrated by Gary Sinise and was produced by Lou Reda Productions in Easton, Pennsylvania, United States.', 'WWII in HD is a 10-part American documentary television miniseries that originally aired from November 15 to November 19, 2009 on the History Channel. The program focuses on the firsthand experiences of twelve American service members during World War II, including an Army nurse, a member of the Tuskegee Airmen, a second generation Japanese American and prisoner of war, and an Austrian Jewish immigrant. The twelve members recorded their time in both theaters and some had later interviews; found footage from the battlefield was paired with the stories of the twelve service members. The episodes premiered on five consecutive days, with two episodes per day. The series is narrated by Gary Sinise and was produced by Lou Reda Productions in Easton, Pennsylvania, United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8YRFvRITEbuqnuNl5DiiQ7ndjL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32236'),
  ('560192843174891628', 'WWW.WAGNARIA!!', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yuichi Nakamura, Haruka Tomatsu, Koki Uchiyama, Sora Amamiya, Nana Mizuki, Hiro Shimono, Yoko Hikasa', 'TV-14', 'Daisuke Higashida gets a job at a restaurant because of family financial difficulties, but no one who works there is normal.', 'Daisuke Higashida gets a job at a restaurant because of family financial difficulties, but no one who works there is normal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4DLznAYyNCGcU5CTi6O8F4qFHeI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68070'),
  ('1063981132282762047', 'Wyatt Earp and the Cowboy War', 2024, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Patrick Reams, Stephen David, Henry Fitzherbert', null, 'Ed Harris, Tim Fellingham, Peter O''Meara, Christina Leonardi', 'TV-14', 'The legendary feud between Wyatt Earp and Ike Clanton unfolds through vivid reenactments in this gritty docudrama about the gunfight that defined an era.', 'The legendary feud between Wyatt Earp and Ike Clanton unfolds through vivid reenactments in this gritty docudrama about the gunfight that defined an era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3J6MdyMKOb5bAEn0C6c3RtuqgT7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259709'),
  ('11767117753115256', 'Wycliffe', 1994, 'Crime, Drama', 'W.J. Burley', null, 'Jack Shepherd, Jimmy Yuill, Helen Masters', 'TV-14', 'Wycliffe is a British television series, based on W. J. Burley''s novels about Detective Superintendent Charles Wycliffe. It was produced by HTV and broadcast on the ITV Network, following a pilot episode on 7 August 1993, between 24 July 1994 and 5 July 1998. The series was filmed in Cornwall, with a production office in Truro. Music for the series was composed by Nigel Hess and was awarded the Royal Television Society award for the best television theme. Wycliffe is played by Jack Shepherd, assisted by DI Doug Kersey and DI Lucy Lane. Each episode deals with a murder investigation. In the early series, the stories are adapted from Burley''s books and are in classic whodunit style, often with quirky characters and plot elements. In later seasons, the tone becomes more naturalistic and there is more emphasis on internal politics within the police.', 'Wycliffe is a British television series, based on W. J. Burley''s novels about Detective Superintendent Charles Wycliffe. It was produced by HTV and broadcast on the ITV Network, following a pilot episode on 7 August 1993, between 24 July 1994 and 5 July 1998. The series was filmed in Cornwall, with a production office in Truro. Music for the series was composed by Nigel Hess and was awarded the Royal Television Society award for the best television theme. Wycliffe is played by Jack Shepherd, assisted by DI Doug Kersey and DI Lucy Lane. Each episode deals with a murder investigation. In the early series, the stories are adapted from Burley''s books and are in classic whodunit style, often with quirky characters and plot elements. In later seasons, the tone becomes more naturalistic and there is more emphasis on internal politics within the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1oq4XHTCPF3hwV4F4ZzkQCMpXS.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:787'),
  ('13055174879814820', 'Wylde Pak', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Paul Watling, Kyle Marshall', null, null, 'TV-Y7', 'Lily and Jack are half-siblings thrown together for a summer who must learn how to navigate their new family dynamic while also helping with the Wylde Pak family''s chaotic pet grooming business.', 'Lily and Jack are half-siblings thrown together for a summer who must learn how to navigate their new family dynamic while also helping with the Wylde Pak family''s chaotic pet grooming business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnrR6NqTxyNHARpth1glmA37vAo.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:286170'),
  ('788163337888514756', 'Wynonna Earp', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Western', 'Emily Andras', null, 'Melanie Scrofano, Tim Rozon, Dominique Provost-Chalkley, Katherine Barrell, Varun Saranga, Greg Lawson, Martina Ortiz Luis', 'TV-14', 'Wyatt Earp''s great granddaughter Wynonna battles demons and other creatures with her unique abilities and a posse of dysfunctional allies - the only thing that can bring the paranormal to justice.', 'Wyatt Earp''s great granddaughter Wynonna battles demons and other creatures with her unique abilities and a posse of dysfunctional allies - the only thing that can bring the paranormal to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnIaDelA81dmFaXrhpz6M6dpGSD.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:65988'),
  ('1017815677611280526', 'Wyrd Sisters', 1997, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Terry Pratchett', null, 'Eleanor Bron, June Whitfield, Jane Horrocks, Annette Crosbie, Jimmy Hibbert, Les Dennis, Christopher Lee, Rob Rackstraw', null, 'When Duke Felmet murders King Verence and takes over the small country of Lancre on the Discworld, a trio of witches—the flowery Magrat Garlick, the lively Nanny Ogg, and their leader Granny Weatherwax—are involuntarily tasked with protecting the king''s infant son.', 'When Duke Felmet murders King Verence and takes over the small country of Lancre on the Discworld, a trio of witches—the flowery Magrat Garlick, the lively Nanny Ogg, and their leader Granny Weatherwax—are involuntarily tasked with protecting the king''s infant son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n12spgrAydi8j1B1IKfp19CmACH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15795'),
  ('507387124583535975', 'X', 2001, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Junichi Suwabe, Kenichi Suzumura, Masaki Aizawa, Houko Kuwashima, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Ryoka Yuzuki, Mamiko Noto, Kumi Sakuma', 'TV-14', 'It''s the year of destiny and 15 year old Kamui Shirō, a powerful psychic, has returned to Toyko after a 6 year absence. He returns to protect his childhood friends, Fūma, and Fūma''s younger sister, Kotori. But destiny and fate are haunting Kamui and pulling in himself and his loved ones. It is his destiny to decide the fate of the world and mankind, no matter if he wants the role or not.', 'It''s the year of destiny and 15 year old Kamui Shirō, a powerful psychic, has returned to Toyko after a 6 year absence. He returns to protect his childhood friends, Fūma, and Fūma''s younger sister, Kotori. But destiny and fate are haunting Kamui and pulling in himself and his loved ones. It is his destiny to decide the fate of the world and mankind, no matter if he wants the role or not.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mblTlK6XNGBrnrK3ftEIv1antZP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3251'),
  ('806338085302357387', 'X Company', 2015, 'Drama', 'Stephanie Morgenstern, Mark Ellis', null, 'Evelyne Brochu, Jack Laskey, Warren Brown, Hugh Dillon, Lara Jean Chorostecki, Torben Liebrecht', 'TV-14', 'An emotionally-driven character drama, set in the thrilling and dangerous world of WWII espionage and covert operations. It follows the stories of five highly skilled young recruits - Canadian, American and British - torn from their ordinary lives to train as agents in an ultra-secret facility on the shores of Lake Ontario. These agents parachute behind enemy lines, where they''re fair game for torture and execution. From elegant hotels to hellholes in the field, it''s one risky operation after another, masterminded by the brains of Camp X.', 'An emotionally-driven character drama, set in the thrilling and dangerous world of WWII espionage and covert operations. It follows the stories of five highly skilled young recruits - Canadian, American and British - torn from their ordinary lives to train as agents in an ultra-secret facility on the shores of Lake Ontario. These agents parachute behind enemy lines, where they''re fair game for torture and execution. From elegant hotels to hellholes in the field, it''s one risky operation after another, masterminded by the brains of Camp X.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1O3REMtCAdrSaPrDxPM3W2fNcEJ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:61933'),
  ('73284232822017074', 'X Factor', 2008, 'Reality, Family', 'Simon Cowell', null, 'Giorgia, Jake La Furia, Paola Iezzi, Achille Lauro, Francesco Gabbani', null, 'X Factor is the Italian version of the British musical talent show The X Factor. The first four seasons aired on Rai 2, but since 2011 it has been broadcast on Sky Uno, with reruns on TV8, after Rai dropped the show due to high costs. Sky Italia acquired the format, extending its broadcast until 2024. Starting from the eleventh season, RTL 102.5 became the official radio station, replacing Radio Deejay and Radio 105. The show was hosted by Francesco Facchinetti (2008-2010), Alessandro Cattelan (2011-2020), Ludovico Tersigni (2021), and Francesca Michielin (2022-2023). From 2024 onwards, Giorgia will take over as host. Since the seventh season, the show has been produced by Fremantle Italia without the collaboration of Magnolia, which had produced the selection episodes in the early seasons.', 'X Factor is the Italian version of the British musical talent show The X Factor. The first four seasons aired on Rai 2, but since 2011 it has been broadcast on Sky Uno, with reruns on TV8, after Rai dropped the show due to high costs. Sky Italia acquired the format, extending its broadcast until 2024. Starting from the eleventh season, RTL 102.5 became the official radio station, replacing Radio Deejay and Radio 105. The show was hosted by Francesco Facchinetti (2008-2010), Alessandro Cattelan (2011-2020), Ludovico Tersigni (2021), and Francesca Michielin (2022-2023). From 2024 onwards, Giorgia will take over as host. Since the seventh season, the show has been produced by Fremantle Italia without the collaboration of Magnolia, which had produced the selection episodes in the early seasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGIDuv3ySOGk8agG34fKMZI7BTB.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:16322'),
  ('1110896972229404962', 'X Femmes', 2008, 'Drama', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'X Femmes is a French television series of short films shown on Canal+ in 2008–2009. They were shot by female directors with the goal of producing erotica from a female point of view.', 'X Femmes is a French television series of short films shown on Canal+ in 2008–2009. They were shot by female directors with the goal of producing erotica from a female point of view.', null, 2, 'tmdb:tv:44793'),
  ('263776048231246497', 'X-Man', 2003, 'Comedy, Talk', null, null, 'Lee Hyuk-jae, Yoo Jae-suk, Kang Ho-dong', null, 'Celebrity guests are split into two teams to compete in various contests. One guest, known only to himself, is designated the "X-Man", and does his best to cause his team to lose the contests. At the end, all guests try to determine the X-Man''s identity.', 'Celebrity guests are split into two teams to compete in various contests. One guest, known only to himself, is designated the "X-Man", and does his best to cause his team to lose the contests. At the end, all guests try to determine the X-Man''s identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqxp7BHGvTcrwU5WZr4FuDCvNNS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:5707'),
  ('742683820322045360', 'X-Men', 1992, 'Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Eric Lewald', null, 'Cedric Smith, Norm Spencer, Catherine Disher, Alison Sealy-Smith, Lenore Zann, Cal Dodd, Alyson Court, George Buza', 'TV-Y7', 'The X-Men are an elite team of mutants, genetically gifted human beings with superpowers, sworn to fight for mutant rights against hostile Government agencies, whilst at the same time protecting mankind from mutant supremacist Magneto who seeks to destroy the human race in return for the atrocities committed against mutant kind.', 'The X-Men are an elite team of mutants, genetically gifted human beings with superpowers, sworn to fight for mutant rights against hostile Government agencies, whilst at the same time protecting mankind from mutant supremacist Magneto who seeks to destroy the human race in return for the atrocities committed against mutant kind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2OFwsFhAobczgJWnVdwd9oZAF2N.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:4574'),
  ('657258765148062036', 'X-Men', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Toshiyuki Morikawa, Kaori Yamagata, Rikiya Koyama, Hideyuki Tanaka, Aya Hisakawa, Yukari Tamura, Katsunosuke Hori', 'TV-14', 'X-Men, still grieving over the death of Phoenix (Jean Grey), are investigating a case of a missing mutant girl in Northern Japan. This leads them to a mysterious virus that turns mutants into monsters. U-Men and the Inner Circle want it.', 'X-Men, still grieving over the death of Phoenix (Jean Grey), are investigating a case of a missing mutant girl in Northern Japan. This leads them to a mysterious virus that turns mutants into monsters. U-Men and the Inner Circle want it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXNDCbP5sjq1FeXBxGovN21VVOG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43146'),
  ('521442841492714427', 'X-Men ''97', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ray Chase, Jennifer Hale, Alison Sealy-Smith, Cal Dodd, JP Karliak, Lenore Zann, George Buza, A.J. LoCascio', 'TV-PG', 'The X-Men, a band of mutants who use their uncanny gifts to protect a world that hates and fears them, are challenged like never before, forced to face a dangerous and unexpected new future.', 'The X-Men, a band of mutants who use their uncanny gifts to protect a world that hates and fears them, are challenged like never before, forced to face a dangerous and unexpected new future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Ycz7yYRf9V4jk3YXwcZhFtbNcF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138502'),
  ('289611083814241002', 'X-Men: Evolution', 2000, 'Kids, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Robert N. Skir, Marty Isenberg, David Wise', null, 'Kirby Morrow, Venus Terzo, David Kaye, Brad Swaile, Maggie O''Hara, Meghan Black, Kirsten Alter, Scott McNeil', 'TV-Y7', 'Teenagers Cyclops, Jean Grey, Rogue, Nightcrawler, Shadowcat, and Spike fight for a world that fears and hates them.', 'Teenagers Cyclops, Jean Grey, Rogue, Nightcrawler, Shadowcat, and Spike fight for a world that fears and hates them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/HEzbwsX1VniBSwZ4LrxwlfWhfW.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:668'),
  ('36433277646777733', 'X-Men: Pryde of the X-Men', 1989, 'Animation, Family, Action & Adventure', null, 'Larry Parr', 'Michael Bell, Earl Boen, Andi Chapman, Pat Fraley, Ron Gans, Dan Gilvezan, Alan Oppenheimer, Patrick Pinney', null, 'Pilot for unproduced X-Men series for NBC, focusing on the matter-phasing Shadow Cat, alias Kitty Pryde. Magneto and the Brotherhood of Mutant Terrorists plan to divert the Scorpio comet to Earth, hoping to create a new ice age for humanity and the era of mutant supremacy. It''s up to the X-Men, and new recruit Kitty, to follow the magentic menace to his spacebound Asteroid M and foil his plan.', 'Pilot for unproduced X-Men series for NBC, focusing on the matter-phasing Shadow Cat, alias Kitty Pryde. Magneto and the Brotherhood of Mutant Terrorists plan to divert the Scorpio comet to Earth, hoping to create a new ice age for humanity and the era of mutant supremacy. It''s up to the X-Men, and new recruit Kitty, to follow the magentic menace to his spacebound Asteroid M and foil his plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hM5e3Pw2xdY3SKtFXbUqPlPJI3T.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:225656'),
  ('451262539586251748', 'X-Rated Queen', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Anna Szymańczyk, Adam Woronowicz, Anna Krotoska, Michał Żurawski, Lise Risom Olsen, Julian Świeżewski, Stanisław Linowski, Jacek Król', null, 'A young woman from a small town in Poland, who once hoped to live as a nun, flees to West Germany and ends up in the sex industry. She was modest by nature and dreamed of a different life, but circumstances led her to a path she never anticipated.', 'A young woman from a small town in Poland, who once hoped to live as a nun, flees to West Germany and ends up in the sex industry. She was modest by nature and dreamed of a different life, but circumstances led her to a path she never anticipated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2BoRnDG9mje2Vo7JZXREYI8w0r.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:255548'),
  ('416965221925546719', 'X-Ray and Vav', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy', 'Lindsay Jones, Jordan Cwierz', null, 'Ray Narvaez Jr., Gavin Free', null, 'Dimwits Ray and Gavin become superheroes X-Ray and Vav!', 'Dimwits Ray and Gavin become superheroes X-Ray and Vav!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yb9nzk34DBw3LmvFDYrkvqq4pNr.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61640'),
  ('1069899849031800242', 'X.X.X: Uncensored', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Ekta Kapoor', null, 'Priyanka Talukdar, Rajat Rawell, Pratima Kazmi, Kyra Dutt, Aparna Sharma, Flora Saini, Scarlett Mellish Wilson', null, 'An erotic anthology series exploring different aspects of love, lust and romance.', 'An erotic anthology series exploring different aspects of love, lust and romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cufcKjv41k4sRJotdxwwHMDl70L.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:82619'),
  ('974739149539389408', 'X&Y', 2023, 'Animation, Mystery', null, null, 'Zhang Youwu, Hao Xianghai, Shen Nianru, Li Shenqian, Teng Xin', 'TV-14', 'Yan Yuechu returned to his hometown to work and made new friends at his workplace. One day, he went to XY Escape Room and found himself deeply attracted to the proprietor, Xu Aiyou. However, that was when he started to experience strange escape room illusions. As Yan Yuechu got to know Xu Aiyou, more and more incidents started to happen around him and even his friends. In the process of solving the escape rooms and finding the mastermind behind all these events, he gradually found himself uncovering the truth behind his lost memories...', 'Yan Yuechu returned to his hometown to work and made new friends at his workplace. One day, he went to XY Escape Room and found himself deeply attracted to the proprietor, Xu Aiyou. However, that was when he started to experience strange escape room illusions. As Yan Yuechu got to know Xu Aiyou, more and more incidents started to happen around him and even his friends. In the process of solving the escape rooms and finding the mastermind behind all these events, he gradually found himself uncovering the truth behind his lost memories...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/syHf4Tsvz3qDl1hG9mGM0i1PB6p.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:139182'),
  ('662823824900305390', 'Xalisso', 2024, 'Drama, Family, Soap', 'Ibou Gueye', null, 'Ndeye Amy Barry, Moussa Seck, Ndiambe Sene, Thierno Gueye, Bineta Samb, Aissatou Diaby, Ahmed Diop Fall, Astou Diaw', null, 'Does money buy happiness? In a society where appearances are far more important than substance, money becomes the sole measure of worth. Its shadow looms over human relationships. Like a summer ebb and flow, money hammers away and leaves its mark. Can it erase the past? Can it determine the future? Sometimes ostentation stems from an inferiority complex...', 'Does money buy happiness? In a society where appearances are far more important than substance, money becomes the sole measure of worth. Its shadow looms over human relationships. Like a summer ebb and flow, money hammers away and leaves its mark. Can it erase the past? Can it determine the future? Sometimes ostentation stems from an inferiority complex...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qieyW88ldeDynvnpF4Udbt55shN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:315237'),
  ('1024343127132927837', 'Xam''d: Lost Memories', 2008, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Michiko Neya, Ayumi Fujimura, Atsushi Abe, Shinnosuke Tachibana, Fumiko Orikasa, Kenji Hamada, Katsuyuki Konishi, Yumi Tamai', null, 'Set on a peaceful island during a violent terrorist attack, a young boy is suddenly transformed into a metal-cased mercenary. But with this great power comes even greater danger. Aiyuki must discover how to master this remarkable new power-or risk having this mysterious fusion of rock, metal and magic destroy him!', 'Set on a peaceful island during a violent terrorist attack, a young boy is suddenly transformed into a metal-cased mercenary. But with this great power comes even greater danger. Aiyuki must discover how to master this remarkable new power-or risk having this mysterious fusion of rock, metal and magic destroy him!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iK2Nxgs2m7Kj2gvgr1OJ537Qjmw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34750'),
  ('655180463544838557', 'Xavier: Renegade Angel', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Vernon Chatman, John Lee, Alyson Levy', null, 'John Lee, Vernon Chatman, Alyson Levy, Jim Tozzi', 'TV-MA', 'Follows the humorous musings of an itinerant humanoid pseudo-shaman and spiritual seeker named Xavier.', 'Follows the humorous musings of an itinerant humanoid pseudo-shaman and spiritual seeker named Xavier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8RPL4LlvjlrrqDx7SFCseMcweC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:14769'),
  ('897768868155077516', 'Xena: Warrior Princess', 1995, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'John Schulian, Robert Tapert', null, 'Lucy Lawless, Renée O''Connor', 'TV-PG', 'Xena is an infamous warrior on a quest to seek redemption for her past sins against the innocent. Accompanied by her comrade-in-arms Gabrielle, the campy couple use their formidable fighting skills to help those who are unable to defend themselves.', 'Xena is an infamous warrior on a quest to seek redemption for her past sins against the innocent. Accompanied by her comrade-in-arms Gabrielle, the campy couple use their formidable fighting skills to help those who are unable to defend themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjUn6GVZVDifLHB7bvVrgZsOfzE.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:4616'),
  ('860812370398848095', 'Xenosaga: The Animation', 2005, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mariko Suzuki, Ai Maeda, Rumi Shishido, Eriko Kawasaki, Koichi Yamadera, Hikaru Midorikawa, Masakazu Morita, Taiten Kusunoki', 'TV-14', 'The year is T.C. 4767. Four thousand years have passed since humanity abandoned its birthplace, the planet Earth. Beset by the hostile alien Gnosis, mankind is now scrambling to find ways to defeat this threat to their existence. The development of KOS-MOS (a specialized android with amazing capabilities) by Vector engineer Shion Uzuki was one response to the threat. But when their ship is destroyed by the Gnosis, Shion and her companions find themselves thrust into the middle of a battle with no clear sides...', 'The year is T.C. 4767. Four thousand years have passed since humanity abandoned its birthplace, the planet Earth. Beset by the hostile alien Gnosis, mankind is now scrambling to find ways to defeat this threat to their existence. The development of KOS-MOS (a specialized android with amazing capabilities) by Vector engineer Shion Uzuki was one response to the threat. But when their ship is destroyed by the Gnosis, Shion and her companions find themselves thrust into the middle of a battle with no clear sides...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NgnvfxGm84Eg5hqkpMk2pw7DC8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34066'),
  ('238157345349187807', 'XHDRBZ', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Gustavo Rodríguez, Eugenio Derbez', null, 'Eugenio Derbez, Consuelo Duval, Sammy Pérez, Miguel luis', null, 'XHDЯBZ. The show was a Mexican sitcom produced by Televisa and broadcast by the Canal de las Estrellas network. XHDRBZ emulates a television channel that broadcasts sketches. When a sketch finished, credits were shown, like in a real television program. XHDЯBZ was created by Eugenio Derbez in 2002, whose series marked his debut as producer. The show ran for two seasons since 2002, until 2006. Derbez ended production, choosing to expand one of the show''s most popular segments, la Familia P.Luche, into its own hour-long show. Both shows are broadcast in the United States on the Galavisión network. Today the show is transmitted in Latin America and Europe.', 'XHDЯBZ. The show was a Mexican sitcom produced by Televisa and broadcast by the Canal de las Estrellas network. XHDRBZ emulates a television channel that broadcasts sketches. When a sketch finished, credits were shown, like in a real television program. XHDЯBZ was created by Eugenio Derbez in 2002, whose series marked his debut as producer. The show ran for two seasons since 2002, until 2006. Derbez ended production, choosing to expand one of the show''s most popular segments, la Familia P.Luche, into its own hour-long show. Both shows are broadcast in the United States on the Galavisión network. Today the show is transmitted in Latin America and Europe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/febmF0cmh5dX3RX0xdogRVS6Khy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16032'),
  ('349740794335977817', 'Xiaolin Chronicles', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation', 'Christy Hui', null, 'Tara Strong, Eric Bauza, Jennifer Hale, David A. Kaye, Michael Donovan, Cree Summer', null, 'The team of "Xiaolin Showdown" return in this sequel series to hunt down Shen Gon Wu. By their side, a new ally joins them in the fight of good vs. evil.', 'The team of "Xiaolin Showdown" return in this sequel series to hunt down Shen Gon Wu. By their side, a new ally joins them in the fight of good vs. evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xunu7Vhk9FZuzw9tecNoDw6UyGo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60306'),
  ('787043648472978606', 'Xiaolin Showdown', 2003, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Christy Hui', null, 'Tara Strong, Grey DeLisle, Tom Kenny, Jeff Bennett, Wayne Knight, Danny Cooksey, Susan Silo, Jason Marsden', 'TV-Y', 'Xiaolin Showdown is an American animated television series that aired on Kids WB and was created by Christy Hui. Set in a world where martial arts battles and Eastern magic are commonplace, the series follows four young warriors in training that battle the forces of evil. They do this by protecting Shen Gong Wu from villains that would use them to conquer the world. Originally airing on the Kids'' WB block of programming on WB Network in 2003, the series ran for 3 seasons and 52 episodes. Typical episodes revolve around a specific Shen Gong Wu being revealed which results in both sides racing to find it. Episodes usually reach a head when one good and one evil character must challenge each other to a magical duel called a Xiaolin Showdown for possession of the artifact. A sequel series titled Xiaolin Chronicles was previewed on August 26, 2013 on Disney XD. It began its long-term run on September 14 the same year.', 'Xiaolin Showdown is an American animated television series that aired on Kids WB and was created by Christy Hui. Set in a world where martial arts battles and Eastern magic are commonplace, the series follows four young warriors in training that battle the forces of evil. They do this by protecting Shen Gong Wu from villains that would use them to conquer the world. Originally airing on the Kids'' WB block of programming on WB Network in 2003, the series ran for 3 seasons and 52 episodes. Typical episodes revolve around a specific Shen Gong Wu being revealed which results in both sides racing to find it. Episodes usually reach a head when one good and one evil character must challenge each other to a magical duel called a Xiaolin Showdown for possession of the artifact. A sequel series titled Xiaolin Chronicles was previewed on August 26, 2013 on Disney XD. It began its long-term run on September 14 the same year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxxwz1kYyb5DBttl2VvmHgdDoRe.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:679'),
  ('723417014104871857', 'Xica da Silva', 1996, 'Soap, Drama', 'Walcyr Carrasco', 'Walcyr Carrasco', 'Taís Araújo, Victor Wagner, Drica Moraes, Carla Cabral, Murilo Rosa, Adriane Galisteu, Carlos Alberto, Eduardo Dussek', 'NR', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWxMIZeg1Mqz0KFOZ1etFdUIuXa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46143'),
  ('451242310349117287', 'XIII', 2008, 'Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Philippe Lyon, David Wolkove', 'William Vance, Jean Van Hamme', 'Stephen McHattie, Jessalyn Gilsig, Val Kilmer, Stephen Dorff, Caterina Murino, Jacqueline Pillon, John Bourgeois, Hrant Alianak', null, 'The first female US President Sally Sheridan is shot dead by a sniper during her Veterans Day speech. Her assassin narrowly escapes the scene with his life, national security hot on his heels - or so it seems. Three months later, an elderly couple discover the body of a wounded man in a tree, wearing a parachute. The young man cannot remember the slightest thing about his own identity.', 'The first female US President Sally Sheridan is shot dead by a sniper during her Veterans Day speech. Her assassin narrowly escapes the scene with his life, national security hot on his heels - or so it seems. Three months later, an elderly couple discover the body of a wounded man in a tree, wearing a parachute. The young man cannot remember the slightest thing about his own identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bUabEbeborjMYya8YB0xqV8phUc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6971'),
  ('469264058853844913', 'XIII: The Series', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Mystery, War & Politics', 'Jean Van Hamme, William Vance', null, 'Stuart Townsend, Roxane Mesquida', null, 'After a plot to kill the president of the USA an agent with lost memories tries to recover his life and memories. Others use him to cover up some dirty business involving high ranking officials from the CIA and the White House.', 'After a plot to kill the president of the USA an agent with lost memories tries to recover his life and memories. Others use him to cover up some dirty business involving high ranking officials from the CIA and the White House.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGr9iZFXCl8XOnHOAj17AYz85fr.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:34639'),
  ('1009470044442252222', 'XO, Kitty', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jenny Han', null, 'Anna Cathcart, Choi Min-yeong, Gia Kim, Sang Heon Lee, Anthony Keyvan, Regan Aliyah, Peter Thurnwald, Philippe Lee', 'TV-14', 'Teen matchmaker Kitty Song Covey thinks she knows everything there is to know about love. But when she moves halfway across the world to reunite with her long-distance boyfriend, she''ll soon realize that relationships are a lot more complicated when it''s your own heart on the line.', 'Teen matchmaker Kitty Song Covey thinks she knows everything there is to know about love. But when she moves halfway across the world to reunite with her long-distance boyfriend, she''ll soon realize that relationships are a lot more complicated when it''s your own heart on the line.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxvTdKAwv27PUfpXOQp6AwWr6V.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:195670'),
  ('157838224338650829', 'Xss The Test', 2026, null, null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:319352'),
  ('995949446383312406', 'Xuan-Yuan Sword: Han Cloud', 2017, 'Drama', null, '이문강, Xu Ting', 'Leon Zhang, Yu Menglong, Guan Xiaotong, Karlina Zhang, Gao Weiguang, Li Chung-lin, Wang Ruizi, Dai Si', null, 'Two sword spirits born from a shattered divine blade—brothers Zhaoyun and Muyun—are raised on opposing sides of a brutal war and reunite as enemies on the battlefield. When the truth of their bond is revealed, they join forces with a tribal princess to find the Emperor Sword, defeat a ruthless warlord, and restore peace to a world torn by conflict.', 'Two sword spirits born from a shattered divine blade—brothers Zhaoyun and Muyun—are raised on opposing sides of a brutal war and reunite as enemies on the battlefield. When the truth of their bond is revealed, they join forces with a tribal princess to find the Emperor Sword, defeat a ruthless warlord, and restore peace to a world torn by conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PjJ6DTZHFClETVOpUUI2f19FF4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72092'),
  ('84984559279523131', 'XX', 2020, 'Drama', null, 'Lee Seul', 'Hani, Hwang Seung-eon, Bae In-hyuk, Lee Jong-won, Shin Jae-whi, Kim Ji-eun, Kim Jun-gyeong, Na Eun-saem', null, 'Yoon Na Na is a well-regarded bartender at XX bar. She takes pride in her work and position as the head bartender. She involves herself in other parts of XX like selecting menu items or setup of the interior. Her dream is to own XX bar. One day, the new owner of XX appears. She is Lee Roo Mi. The two women were best friends 5 years ago, but something happened between them. Yoon Na Na became upset at Lee Roo Mi. Now, Lee Roo Mi tries to make up with Yoon Na Na, but it''s not easy.', 'Yoon Na Na is a well-regarded bartender at XX bar. She takes pride in her work and position as the head bartender. She involves herself in other parts of XX like selecting menu items or setup of the interior. Her dream is to own XX bar. One day, the new owner of XX appears. She is Lee Roo Mi. The two women were best friends 5 years ago, but something happened between them. Yoon Na Na became upset at Lee Roo Mi. Now, Lee Roo Mi tries to make up with Yoon Na Na, but it''s not easy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVx71y4HO32Owv5BiXw2BO0on8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97956'),
  ('139529501596543842', 'xxxHOLiC', 2006, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Jun Fukuyama, Sayaka Ohara, Kazuya Nakai, Shizuka Itoh, Mika Kikuchi, Hisayo Mochizuki, Kazuko Kojima', 'TV-PG', 'Kimihiro Watanuki is a high school student plagued by ayakashi spirits, both of which are invisible to everyone else but him. The series begins when Watanuki stumbles, seemingly by chance, into a shop that grants wishes. The shop is owned by Yūko Ichihara, a mysterious witch of many names and esoteric renown. For a price, she offers to grant Watanuki''s wish to be rid of the spirits. The price, according to Yūko, must be of equal value; so, as payment, he must become Yūko''s temporary, part-time cook and housekeeper.', 'Kimihiro Watanuki is a high school student plagued by ayakashi spirits, both of which are invisible to everyone else but him. The series begins when Watanuki stumbles, seemingly by chance, into a shop that grants wishes. The shop is owned by Yūko Ichihara, a mysterious witch of many names and esoteric renown. For a price, she offers to grant Watanuki''s wish to be rid of the spirits. The price, according to Yūko, must be of equal value; so, as payment, he must become Yūko''s temporary, part-time cook and housekeeper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5yY74hwLcG5rQSe6cEUW3HjO3J9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:36250'),
