  ('1148177389029546398', 'Yes! PreCure 5', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Kids, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuko Sanpei, Junko Takeuchi, Mariya Ise, Ai Nagano, Ai Maeda, Eri Sendai, Miyu Irino, Takeshi Kusao', null, 'Nozomi Yumehara, a regular student, finds a magical book called the Dream Collet in the library and meets Coco and Nuts, two creatures from the Palmier Kingdom. They plead with Nozomi to restore their world, which has been destroyed by an organization called the Nightmares, by completing the Dream Collet and finding the 55 Pinkies to make any wish come true. Meanwhile, the Nightmares are moving into the real world. Once Nozomi agrees to help, Coco and Nuts transform her into the legendary warrior Cure Dream and turn four fellow students into her Pretty Cure team.', 'Nozomi Yumehara, a regular student, finds a magical book called the Dream Collet in the library and meets Coco and Nuts, two creatures from the Palmier Kingdom. They plead with Nozomi to restore their world, which has been destroyed by an organization called the Nightmares, by completing the Dream Collet and finding the 55 Pinkies to make any wish come true. Meanwhile, the Nightmares are moving into the real world. Once Nozomi agrees to help, Coco and Nuts transform her into the legendary warrior Cure Dream and turn four fellow students into her Pretty Cure team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wQy3HqxoTWF3hByfIiMlVJMPolR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:34075'),
  ('341877133523329488', 'Yeşil Vadi''nin Kızı', 2023, 'Drama, Soap', 'Serhat Yiğit, Özge Aras', 'Serhat Yiğit, Özge Aras', 'Beren Gökyıldız, Sezin Bozacı, Onur Dikmen, Özgür Özberk, Ece Ercan, Burak Güneş, Engin Alpateş, Hasan Balliktas', null, 'It is about the life adventure of a girl named Melissa Çelik, who was left without her parents when she was a baby, and who was left in the orphanages. No one knows the truth about what happened to his family. She tries to stay with the family that adopted her, but Besime, the lady of the house, does not want Melissa and is subjected to various tortures.', 'It is about the life adventure of a girl named Melissa Çelik, who was left without her parents when she was a baby, and who was left in the orphanages. No one knows the truth about what happened to his family. She tries to stay with the family that adopted her, but Besime, the lady of the house, does not want Melissa and is subjected to various tortures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h9SChBQEogtVEJRHOxbHUtHahay.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:224344'),
  ('1127565383019720369', 'Yeşilçam', 2021, 'Drama', null, null, 'Çağatay Ulusoy, Afra Saraçoğlu, Selin Şekerci, Selin Kahraman, Bora Akkaş, Yetkin Dikinciler, Özgür Çevik, Altan Erkekli', null, 'Showcasing Turkey of the 1960s, while it follows a film producer who will tell the story of survival in Yesilcam as he experiences the golden age of Turkish cinema.', 'Showcasing Turkey of the 1960s, while it follows a film producer who will tell the story of survival in Yesilcam as he experiences the golden age of Turkish cinema.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jRQA9OTdIm28B9hwJ2cj4Dnp6Rt.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:123725'),
  ('1085716346244039445', 'Yesterday', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Wasuthorn Chaijindar, Thitipong Sangngey, Dina Pophring, Natthanicha Srisawasdiphalodom, Chotipat Suthadsanasoung, Natsakan Chairote, Sattaphong Phiangphor, Patiparn Pataweekarn', null, 'To reclaim his legacy, a betrayed heir teams up with an old ally to battle a ruthless half-brother now ruling a massive business empire.', 'To reclaim his legacy, a betrayed heir teams up with an old ally to battle a ruthless half-brother now ruling a massive business empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ourl3332cUCcgBwlyFcI822bzw6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:304885'),
  ('1042589066536294918', 'YG Future Strategy Office', 2018, 'Comedy', null, 'Moon Sang-hoon', 'SEUNGRI, Lee Jai-jin, Yoo Byung-jae, Son Se-bin, Jinu, Park Chung-hwan, Baek Young-kwang, Choi Shin-deok', null, 'Kpop star Seungri, BIGBANG youngest member, tries to lead a team of blumbing staff at YG''s Future Strategy Office in this mockumentary sitcom.', 'Kpop star Seungri, BIGBANG youngest member, tries to lead a team of blumbing staff at YG''s Future Strategy Office in this mockumentary sitcom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFkAeMduiZwzUJTAuWJ2Sea2O7g.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82834'),
  ('330220813609123182', 'Yin Yang Yo!', 2006, 'Animation, Family, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Kids', 'Bob Boyle', null, 'Stephanie Morgenstern, Scott McCord, Martin Roach, Jamie Watson, Novie Edwards, Megan Fahlenbock, Linda Ballantyne, David Hemblen', 'TV-Y7', 'Two 11-year-old rabbit twins named Yin and Yang train under Master Yo, a grumpy old panda. They learn the sacred art of Woo Foo, a special type of martial arts that involves both might and magic. They must work together to save the world from evil villains and forces that want to destroy, corrupt or take it over. However, through all these adventures, Yin and Yang still portray stereotypical siblings; belligerently antagonistic but still ultimately caring about each other and working together if needed.', 'Two 11-year-old rabbit twins named Yin and Yang train under Master Yo, a grumpy old panda. They learn the sacred art of Woo Foo, a special type of martial arts that involves both might and magic. They must work together to save the world from evil villains and forces that want to destroy, corrupt or take it over. However, through all these adventures, Yin and Yang still portray stereotypical siblings; belligerently antagonistic but still ultimately caring about each other and working together if needed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qb8gxfpjQ2smnnDIEiEsFmK1lqE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:3809'),
  ('527147525493352590', 'Yılan Hikayesi', 1999, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama', 'Osman Yağmurdereli, Tayfun Güneyer', 'Tayfun Güneyer', 'Memet Ali Alabora, Süleyman Turan, Emre Kınay, Nail Kirmizigül, Şevket Çoruh, Ayten Gökçer, Çetin Tekindor, Hakan Bilgin', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nY4OuufXxDTeU8tvvXIU66oxc1R.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:48311'),
  ('706844717859071041', 'Yo amo a Juan Querendón', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Luis Felipe Salamanca, Dago García', 'Juan Carlos Alcalá, Gabriela Ortigoza, Miguel Mesas Vallejo', 'Eduardo Santamarina, Mayrín Villanueva, Alexis Ayala, Arleth Terán, Dacia Arcaraz, Renée Varsi, Sylvia Pasquel, María Marcela', null, 'Yo Amo a Juan Querendón is a Mexican telenovela that aired on Univision at 7pm/6c for one year beginning in February 2007. The plot surrounded the story of Juan Dominguez and his interactions with the Cachon Family. The program was a remake of Pedro El Escamoso, a Colombian telenovela.', 'Yo Amo a Juan Querendón is a Mexican telenovela that aired on Univision at 7pm/6c for one year beginning in February 2007. The plot surrounded the story of Juan Dominguez and his interactions with the Cachon Family. The program was a remake of Pedro El Escamoso, a Colombian telenovela.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UQFQH9FSvLFsu9dTnoGdrMDr5V.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14301'),
  ('930201481561795652', 'Yo Gabba Gabba!', 2007, 'Family, Animation, Kids', 'Christian Jacobs, Scott Schultz', null, 'Lance Robertson, Carmen Osbahr, Cam Clarke, Rob Paulsen, Drew Massey, Erin Pearce, Emma Penrose, Adam Deibert', 'NR', 'Yo Gabba Gabba! is an American children''s television show that airs on the Nick Jr. cable network in the United States and the Nick Jr. networks in the United Kingdom & Ireland, Italy, France and Australia as well as Treehouse TV network in Canada and RTE2 on RTÉjr in Ireland. The show stars five costumed toys-come-to-life and their friend DJ Lance Rock, who explore a single topic in each episode through songs and short storylines in the half-hour program while teaching children life and social skills. It also encourages viewers to move along with and dance with the characters in the program. The show is noted for its indie-culture guest stars and bands, and for drawing visual inspiration from 8-bit video games and H. R. Pufnstuff.', 'Yo Gabba Gabba! is an American children''s television show that airs on the Nick Jr. cable network in the United States and the Nick Jr. networks in the United Kingdom & Ireland, Italy, France and Australia as well as Treehouse TV network in Canada and RTE2 on RTÉjr in Ireland. The show stars five costumed toys-come-to-life and their friend DJ Lance Rock, who explore a single topic in each episode through songs and short storylines in the half-hour program while teaching children life and social skills. It also encourages viewers to move along with and dance with the characters in the program. The show is noted for its indie-culture guest stars and bands, and for drawing visual inspiration from 8-bit video games and H. R. Pufnstuff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h8UHNBBnJwdXVtMIA5OAxJoXWid.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:14759'),
  ('766800167042957027', 'yo no te pido la luna', 2010, null, null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5TYg50tdYgfcHKUkUwkEFOQ1aDs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92393'),
  ('636033822656179638', 'Yo soy Bea', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Miguel Hermoso Arnao, Mónica Estarreado, Berta de la Dehesa, Roberto Correcher, Patricia Montero, Alex Adrover, Olga Velasco, Aure Sánchez', null, 'Yo soy Bea is a Spanish television comedy-drama series which aired on Telecinco from 10 July 2006 to 16 August 2009. The series is an adaptation of the popular Colombian telenovela Yo soy Betty, la fea. Ruth Núñez played the title role of Beatriz "Bea" Pérez Pinzón and Alejandro Tous played Álvaro Aguilar, Bea''s love interest. Yo soy Bea translates to "I am Bea"; it is a pun, with "Bea" sounding like bella, meaning pretty, and like fea, meaning ugly. The Spanish adaptation screened weekdays during the daytime and pulled in, on average, over four million viewers. The series'' record is a 42,1% share. It was Spain''s top rated daytime programme.', 'Yo soy Bea is a Spanish television comedy-drama series which aired on Telecinco from 10 July 2006 to 16 August 2009. The series is an adaptation of the popular Colombian telenovela Yo soy Betty, la fea. Ruth Núñez played the title role of Beatriz "Bea" Pérez Pinzón and Alejandro Tous played Álvaro Aguilar, Bea''s love interest. Yo soy Bea translates to "I am Bea"; it is a pun, with "Bea" sounding like bella, meaning pretty, and like fea, meaning ugly. The Spanish adaptation screened weekdays during the daytime and pulled in, on average, over four million viewers. The series'' record is a 42,1% share. It was Spain''s top rated daytime programme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkM3A5PkWadI5MceIL9PnDvRkT9.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:7769'),
  ('95423429892983483', 'Yo soy Betty, la fea', 1999, 'Soap, Comedy, Drama', 'Fernando Gaitán', 'Fernando Gaitán', 'Ana María Orozco, Jorge Enrique Abello, Natalia Ramírez, Luis Mesa, Scarlet Ortiz, Ricardo Vélez, Mario Duarte, Julián Arango', null, 'Beatriz Pinzón Solano is a brilliant economist with a master''s degree in finance; she has only one flaw: she''s ugly. Everything changes when she starts working at Ecomoda, one of the country''s largest companies, where she meets and falls in love with Armando Mendoza. This time, life will give her a second chance to prove she can become the most desired and beloved woman in the world.', 'Beatriz Pinzón Solano is a brilliant economist with a master''s degree in finance; she has only one flaw: she''s ugly. Everything changes when she starts working at Ecomoda, one of the country''s largest companies, where she meets and falls in love with Armando Mendoza. This time, life will give her a second chance to prove she can become the most desired and beloved woman in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iEBOiXiDGaxVR6w8aKgG5MEusuO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16286'),
  ('686492062668962473', 'Yo Soy Franky', 2015, 'Drama, Family, Comedy, Soap', 'Marcela Citterio', null, 'María Gabriela de Faría, Martín Barba, Maria José Pescador, Danielle Arciniegas, Sergio Borrero, Isabella Castillo, Andrés Mercado, Eduardo Pérez', 'TV-PG', 'An experimental robot attempts to navigate life as a teenage girl.', 'An experimental robot attempts to navigate life as a teenage girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7UVb633RqEooEXjcLm766mG4Ij.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:73265'),
  ('147077833898505586', 'Yo-kai Watch', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Haruka Tomatsu, Tomokazu Seki, Etsuko Kozakura, Aya Endo, Toru Nara, Chie Sato, Aoi Yuuki, Kotori Shigemoto', 'TV-Y7', 'After elementary schooler Keita Amano (Nate Adams) frees a Yo-kai butler named Whisper, he is granted a special watch that allows him to see the Yo-kai causing trouble all around him.', 'After elementary schooler Keita Amano (Nate Adams) frees a Yo-kai butler named Whisper, he is granted a special watch that allows him to see the Yo-kai causing trouble all around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k8EM9rl22UAGtR2YUHNHsnMWggn.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:66562'),
  ('67574060818341441', 'Yo-kai Watch ♪', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Haruka Tomatsu, Tomokazu Seki, Etsuko Kozakura, Aya Endo, Toru Nara, Chie Sato', null, 'The new show will feature unique and returning Yo-kai. The comedy will also center on the original series'' main characters: fifth-grader Keita (Nate in the English version), ghost butler Whisper, and popular Yo-kai like Jibanyan and Komasan. The original cast members for these four characters are returning for this new series.', 'The new show will feature unique and returning Yo-kai. The comedy will also center on the original series'' main characters: fifth-grader Keita (Nate in the English version), ghost butler Whisper, and popular Yo-kai like Jibanyan and Komasan. The original cast members for these four characters are returning for this new series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qp6WV6NuX9Hg1NXThxbXvt1XbuF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197169'),
  ('583836651282601409', 'Yo! Welcome to Korea!', 2017, 'Reality', '조범, 이정은, 박성하', null, 'Kim Joon-hyun, Alberto Mondi', null, 'This Korean reality vacation show explores the cultural differences of foreigners who are in Korea for the first time through their Korean vacation travel log.', 'This Korean reality vacation show explores the cultural differences of foreigners who are in Korea for the first time through their Korean vacation travel log.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wX1mxlacWMhpLL3ap8r4uGCximE.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:74035'),
  ('758318535407364587', 'Yoasobi Gurashi!', 2024, 'Animation', null, null, 'Kofun Penguin, Juri Nagatsuma, Yuka Hanyu', 'TV-MA', 'Meet Kazuto, whose hopes of becoming a photographer didn''t pan out, and Yayoi, who successfully achieved her dream of becoming a model. Two childhood friends who have grown apart... Suddenly find themselves living together! In the beginning, there''s an awkward tension between them, and Yayoi has a secret she can''t tell Kazuto... Then, one night, things start to change... Could they be more than just childhood friends...?!', 'Meet Kazuto, whose hopes of becoming a photographer didn''t pan out, and Yayoi, who successfully achieved her dream of becoming a model. Two childhood friends who have grown apart... Suddenly find themselves living together! In the beginning, there''s an awkward tension between them, and Yayoi has a secret she can''t tell Kazuto... Then, one night, things start to change... Could they be more than just childhood friends...?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3XWuseABZAeGeiHgLJXg69GmbuE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:249891'),
  ('604524021211339038', 'Yogi''s Gang', 1973, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Joseph Barbera', null, 'Allan Melvin, Henry Corden, John Stephenson, Daws Butler, Don Messick, Mel Blanc', 'TV-G', 'Yogi''s Gang is a 30-minute animated series and the second incarnation of Hanna-Barbera''s Yogi Bear which aired 16 half-hour episodes on ABC from September 8, 1973, to December 29, 1973. The show began as Yogi''s Ark Lark, a special TV movie on The ABC Saturday Superstar Movie in 1972. Fifteen original episodes were produced for broadcast on ABC, with the hour-long Yogi''s Ark Lark thrown in as a split-in-half two-parter. After a successful run on Saturday mornings, Yogi Gang returned in 1977 as a segment on the syndicated weekday series, Fred Flintstone and Friends. In the late 1980s, repeats were shown on USA Cartoon Express and later resurfaced on Nickelodeon, Cartoon Network and Boomerang.', 'Yogi''s Gang is a 30-minute animated series and the second incarnation of Hanna-Barbera''s Yogi Bear which aired 16 half-hour episodes on ABC from September 8, 1973, to December 29, 1973. The show began as Yogi''s Ark Lark, a special TV movie on The ABC Saturday Superstar Movie in 1972. Fifteen original episodes were produced for broadcast on ABC, with the hour-long Yogi''s Ark Lark thrown in as a split-in-half two-parter. After a successful run on Saturday mornings, Yogi Gang returned in 1977 as a segment on the syndicated weekday series, Fred Flintstone and Friends. In the late 1980s, repeats were shown on USA Cartoon Express and later resurfaced on Nickelodeon, Cartoon Network and Boomerang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKXaAq12955gqpsag5eHGHsuww3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14698'),
  ('530162473021472917', 'Yogi''s Space Race', 1978, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Iwao Takamoto', null, 'Daws Butler, Frank Welker, Mel Blanc, Patricia Parris, Joe Besser, Marilyn Schreffler, Gary Owens', null, 'Yogi Bear and other Hanna-Barbera figures match wits as they race around the galaxy.', 'Yogi Bear and other Hanna-Barbera figures match wits as they race around the galaxy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/em4REgLz33OxAEIhfoNTXWEjMoK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12266'),
  ('271681712151061398', 'YOHANE THE PARHELION -SUNSHINE in the MIRROR', 2023, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Aika Kobayashi, Yoko Hikasa, Kanako Takatsuki, Arisa Komiya, Ai Furihata, Anju Inami, Shuka Saito, Nanaka Suwa', 'TV-14', 'The story reimagines Yoshiko Tsushima, the school idol afflicted with chuunibyou (adolescent delusions of grandeur), as a magical girl. The story is set in Numazu, a scenic harbor town surrounded by the sea and mountains. Ever since she was little, the girl Yohane has never fit in, and has always felt apart from everyone in town. Her aspirations and true place in this world lie elsewhere. The story follows this girl who can''t follow rules as she journeys into the mysterious world.', 'The story reimagines Yoshiko Tsushima, the school idol afflicted with chuunibyou (adolescent delusions of grandeur), as a magical girl. The story is set in Numazu, a scenic harbor town surrounded by the sea and mountains. Ever since she was little, the girl Yohane has never fit in, and has always felt apart from everyone in town. Her aspirations and true place in this world lie elsewhere. The story follows this girl who can''t follow rules as she journeys into the mysterious world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/be5UVuGboXZzY2T3NBIUmXjWmwa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204849'),
  ('1144063546296348823', 'Yokohama Kaidashi Kikou', 1998, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hekiru Shiina, Akiko Nakagawa, Shozo Iizuka', null, 'In a peaceful post-apocalyptic world where the coasts have been flooded, the robot Alpha is left in charge of a Cafe by her owner who went off travelling. One day, she receives a package containing a camera, which causes Alpha to take a closer look at the little things in life.', 'In a peaceful post-apocalyptic world where the coasts have been flooded, the robot Alpha is left in charge of a Cafe by her owner who went off travelling. One day, she receives a package containing a camera, which causes Alpha to take a closer look at the little things in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAUgoYiD5bMZuFVTOjPIyaa72fS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:79287'),
  ('138106764634778075', 'Yokomizo Seishi Series', 1977, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Ikko Furuya, Isamu Nagato, Tamotsu Hayakawa, Ichirō Arishima', null, 'TV series starring Ikko Furuya, based on the Kosuke Kindaichi mystery novel series by Seishi Yokomizo.', 'TV series starring Ikko Furuya, based on the Kosuke Kindaichi mystery novel series by Seishi Yokomizo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWGKsYHZN0dDsQYsN2BoNUTwEh9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:246695'),
  ('955214817558372402', 'YOLO', 2020, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Michael Cusack', null, 'Sarah Bishop, Michael Cusack, Todor Manojlovic', 'TV-MA', 'Two Australian party girls, Sarah and Rachel, looking for fun times, new experiences, positive vibes, and hopeful horoscopes in the bizarre town of Wollongong. Sarah''s quest is to find love, whereas Rachel hungers for chaos, often bringing them into conflict as they encounter surreal Australiana, strange bush creatures, and eccentric nomads.', 'Two Australian party girls, Sarah and Rachel, looking for fun times, new experiences, positive vibes, and hopeful horoscopes in the bizarre town of Wollongong. Sarah''s quest is to find love, whereas Rachel hungers for chaos, often bringing them into conflict as they encounter surreal Australiana, strange bush creatures, and eccentric nomads.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ayVpd24FepJa5WXXgBbrGwC2Io0.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:106925'),
  ('666063360314674278', 'Yona of the Dawn', 2014, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Chiwa Saito, Tomoaki Maeno, Yusuke Kobayashi', 'TV-14', 'Currently, Hiryuu Palace has no one else next in line for the throne other than the fifteen year old princess, Yona, who had been raised with care. Finally, the night of her sixteenth birthday arrives. She expects it to be a wonderful day spent with her peace-loving father, her servant and friend Hak, and her cousin Soo-won, who she had feelings for... However... That night, Yona goes to visit her father to tell him how she really feels, because he opposes to her getting married to Soo-won. However, when she gets to her room, she encounters a shocking truth.', 'Currently, Hiryuu Palace has no one else next in line for the throne other than the fifteen year old princess, Yona, who had been raised with care. Finally, the night of her sixteenth birthday arrives. She expects it to be a wonderful day spent with her peace-loving father, her servant and friend Hak, and her cousin Soo-won, who she had feelings for... However... That night, Yona goes to visit her father to tell him how she really feels, because he opposes to her getting married to Soo-won. However, when she gets to her room, she encounters a shocking truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKLARBbIVlluToqSNYNQ0XOLhP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61461'),
  ('571798714852913441', 'Yonder', 2022, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Lee Joon-ik', 'O Seung-hyeon, Kim Joung-hoon', 'Shin Ha-kyun, Han Ji-min, Lee Jung-eun, Jung Jin-young, Bae Yu-ram, Cha Soon-bae, Yoon Yi-reh, Choi Dae-sung', null, 'Ja-hyun receives a message from his deceased wife inviting him to reunite with her in a place called ''Yonder''.', 'Ja-hyun receives a message from his deceased wife inviting him to reunite with her in a place called ''Yonder''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRbCAC0YupTtDhfIaRDhC25KtLr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132600'),
  ('466882692691676826', 'Yonderland', 2013, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Mathew Baynton, Laurence Rickard, Simon Farnaby', null, 'Martha Howe-Douglas, Mathew Baynton, Jim Howick, Simon Farnaby, Laurence Rickard, Ben Willbond, Dan Renton Skinner, Stephen Fry', 'TV-PG', 'A bored young mum steps through a portal and discovers a world of incompetent knights, monks who are incapable of lying, and a race of people intent on firing the cleverest amongst them into the sun.', 'A bored young mum steps through a portal and discovers a world of incompetent knights, monks who are incapable of lying, and a race of people intent on firing the cleverest amongst them into the sun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oudkqR3P9qJVgB6QJmHvAV6L1Dw.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:63236'),
  ('698785840615875167', 'Yong Pal', 2015, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Joo Won, Kim Tae-hee, Jo Hyun-jae, Chae Jung-an, Jung Woong-in, Stephanie Lee, Jo Bok-rae, Park Hye-su', null, 'Operating under the alias Yong-pal, a surgeon gets enmeshed in a dark conspiracy involving a chaebol heiress forcibly put in a medically induced coma.', 'Operating under the alias Yong-pal, a surgeon gets enmeshed in a dark conspiracy involving a chaebol heiress forcibly put in a medically induced coma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkfl4cU1OcalMdvK12oKM7p9och.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63311'),
  ('1038331880556053925', 'Yongzheng Dynasty', 1999, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Hu Mei, Eryue He, Liu He-ping', 'Eryue He', 'Jiao Huang, Tang Guoqiang, Wang Huichun, Wang Hui, Du Yulu, Li Dingbao, Du Zhiguo, Zhao Yi', null, 'The series was adapted from Eryue He''s historical novels, which are loosely based on historical events in the reigns of the Kangxi and Yongzheng Emperors in the Qing dynasty (1644–1911).', 'The series was adapted from Eryue He''s historical novels, which are loosely based on historical events in the reigns of the Kangxi and Yongzheng Emperors in the Qing dynasty (1644–1911).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AmMUvTgKp2LYRJIyimEEKIs0swY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80937'),
  ('9736022168782571', 'Yonimo Kimyou na Monogatari Tokubetsuhen', 1990, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tamori', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kUMRtW0Db4K5LrjU8JhXwgCNqju.jpg', 39, 'tmdb:tv:225920'),
  ('337441544434290096', 'Yoroi-Shinden Samurai Troopers', 2026, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hiiro Ishibashi, Junya Enoki, Ayumu Murase, Shunsuke Takeuchi, Kentaro Kumagai, Toshiki Masuda, Lynn, Katsuyuki Konishi', 'TV-14', 'The Demon World once plunged the Human World into terror. With the seal broken and hordes of Demon Soldiers launching an invasion, five young warriors rushed to humanity''s rescue. They were called the Samurai Troopers, and now their battle begins anew!', 'The Demon World once plunged the Human World into terror. With the seal broken and hordes of Demon Soldiers launching an invasion, five young warriors rushed to humanity''s rescue. They were called the Samurai Troopers, and now their battle begins anew!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gTJXC84z3pq9VxVGjbStvMP0I2g.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:293629'),
  ('752469947244408410', 'Yorosen!', 2008, null, null, null, 'Ai Takahashi, Risa Niigaki, Eri Kamei, Sayumi Michishige, Reina Tanaka, Koharu Kusumi, Aika Mitsui, Junjun', null, 'Yorosen! (よろセン!; I am cool teacher, a slang shortening of Yoroshiku sensei!) was a late-night daily Japanese education TV program featuring Hello! Project members as teacher and students. It aired on TV Tokyo from October 6, 2008 to March 27, 2009 (weekdays only) with a running time of about 7 minutes. Yorosen! was the replacement for Berikyuu!, and was later itself replaced by Bijo Houdan. Yorosen! showcased the 3 main groups of Hello! Project: Morning Musume., Berryz Koubou, and ℃-ute. Each episode ended with a segment by Mano Erina.', 'Yorosen! (よろセン!; I am cool teacher, a slang shortening of Yoroshiku sensei!) was a late-night daily Japanese education TV program featuring Hello! Project members as teacher and students. It aired on TV Tokyo from October 6, 2008 to March 27, 2009 (weekdays only) with a running time of about 7 minutes. Yorosen! was the replacement for Berikyuu!, and was later itself replaced by Bijo Houdan. Yorosen! showcased the 3 main groups of Hello! Project: Morning Musume., Berryz Koubou, and ℃-ute. Each episode ended with a segment by Mano Erina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rq0MOzFrdNjbIyzk911mLLFkQ4Y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21551'),
  ('235747793991470427', 'Yoshitsune', 2005, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Hideaki Takizawa, Mari Natsuki, Akira Nakao, Izumi Inamori, Kiyotaka Nanbara, Shun Oguri, Hiroshi Abe, Masaya Katō', 'NR', 'Yoshitsune is a Japanese television drama series originally broadcast between 9 January and 11 December 2005, with a three-part special compilation being aired from 24 December to 25 December 2005. The 44th Taiga Drama, the original work is by Miyao Tomiko, screenplay by Kaneko Narito and starring Hideaki Takizawa.', 'Yoshitsune is a Japanese television drama series originally broadcast between 9 January and 11 December 2005, with a three-part special compilation being aired from 24 December to 25 December 2005. The 44th Taiga Drama, the original work is by Miyao Tomiko, screenplay by Kaneko Narito and starring Hideaki Takizawa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vaGL8Anf4xYYnSuPGV2IW9B2bpd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35394'),
  ('817727411331828772', 'Yosi, the Regretful Spy', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Daniel Burman', 'Andrés Gelós, Natacha Caravia', 'Gustavo Bassani, Minerva Casero, Natalia Oreiro, Alejandro Awada, Carla Quevedo, Marco Antonio Caponi, Matías Mayer, Moran Rosenblatt', 'TV-MA', 'An Argentinian intelligence agent goes undercover in the Jewish community to gather information, unwittingly preparing the ground for anti-Semitic terrorist attacks. Years later, he decides to bring the truth to light.', 'An Argentinian intelligence agent goes undercover in the Jewish community to gather information, unwittingly preparing the ground for anti-Semitic terrorist attacks. Years later, he decides to bring the truth to light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6UcbvUNkyokH1egt6KabLXVuU7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:155646'),
  ('708035516151322552', 'Yotsuiro Biyori', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Animation', null, null, 'Daisuke Ono, Junichi Suwabe, Daiki Yamashita, Yuichi Nakamura', 'TV-14', 'Four men—Gure, Sui, Tokitaka, and Tsubaki—each help run a Japanese tea shop together called Rokuhoudou. When one visits the shop, they are greeted warmly, is served with tea, and are often helped with any problems they may have.', 'Four men—Gure, Sui, Tokitaka, and Tsubaki—each help run a Japanese tea shop together called Rokuhoudou. When one visits the shop, they are greeted warmly, is served with tea, and are often helped with any problems they may have.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xiVuWPbW4ceLdT5rDph3UslReBC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77415'),
  ('542138540507315034', 'You', 2018, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Greg Berlanti, Sera Gamble', null, 'Penn Badgley, Charlotte Ritchie, Griffin Matthews, Anna Camp, Madeline Brewer', 'TV-MA', 'A dangerously charming, intensely obsessive young man goes to extreme measures to insert himself into the lives of those he is transfixed by.', 'A dangerously charming, intensely obsessive young man goes to extreme measures to insert himself into the lives of those he is transfixed by.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oANi0vEE92nuijiZQgPZ88FSxqQ.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:78191'),
  ('1101253910664205555', 'You & Me', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jamie Davis', 'Jamie Davis', 'Harry Lawtey, Jessica Barden, Sophia Brown, Andi Osho, Genesis Lynea, Julie Hesmondhalgh', null, 'Three people experience tragedies they feel they will never overcome. They attempt to find hope and love again in the future, but worry that the past always hold them back.', 'Three people experience tragedies they feel they will never overcome. They attempt to find hope and love again in the future, but worry that the past always hold them back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f8y4aHQrrbGtz7zOyQJbTw6j5uz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:221050'),
  ('712950151106140734', 'You and Everything Else', 2025, 'Drama', null, 'Song Hye-jin', 'Kim Go-eun, Park Ji-hyun, Kim Gun-woo, Kim Jae-won, Moon Woo-jin, Jang Hye-jin, Seo Jeong-yeon, Joo Min-kyung', 'TV-14', 'From teen years to adulthood, two friends linked by warmth and tension grow apart — until one is asked to accompany the other through her final days.', 'From teen years to adulthood, two friends linked by warmth and tension grow apart — until one is asked to accompany the other through her final days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFHooGj9D87pMp7xQK8VhSAfUo8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:224414'),
  ('11060782987882288', 'You and I Are Polar Opposites', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Sayumi Suzushiro, Shogo Sakata, Yuna Taniguchi, Konatsu Hirabayashi, Anji Iwata, Miyuri Shimabukuro, Wataru Katoh, Cocoro Omori', null, 'Suzuki''s a high school girl in love, but the guy she''s fallen for is nothing like her! While she''s cheerful, outgoing, and always trying to fit in, her classmate Yusuke Tani is stoic, quiet, and doesn''t seem to care what people think of him. Will Suzuki be able to overcome her anxieties and ask him out, or will she discover that opposites really don''t attract?', 'Suzuki''s a high school girl in love, but the guy she''s fallen for is nothing like her! While she''s cheerful, outgoing, and always trying to fit in, her classmate Yusuke Tani is stoic, quiet, and doesn''t seem to care what people think of him. Will Suzuki be able to overcome her anxieties and ask him out, or will she discover that opposites really don''t attract?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hRuMU33DBz4z1vaYBRqLLuFFbQ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:278043'),
  ('429376554207888688', 'You and Idol Precure', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Misato Matsuoka, Minami Takahashi, Natsumi Takamori, Yoshino Nanjo, Miharu Hanai, Junichi Suwabe, Sayuri Yahagi, Hiroki Yamada', null, 'Middle school student Uta Sakura loves to sing any chance she gets. But music becomes more than a hobby when she meets Purirun, a fairy whose hometown has plunged into darkness. The Chokkiri Gang took over her land and began stealing her people''s sparkle. Determined to help, Uta is transformed into the legendary protector Cure Idol and vows to return their sparkle through song.', 'Middle school student Uta Sakura loves to sing any chance she gets. But music becomes more than a hobby when she meets Purirun, a fairy whose hometown has plunged into darkness. The Chokkiri Gang took over her land and began stealing her people''s sparkle. Determined to help, Uta is transformed into the legendary protector Cure Idol and vows to return their sparkle through song.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rzFTIeMAhQK3mHHSnkrgo4DdjoP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278378'),
  ('1139444621909061676', 'You Are All Surrounded', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama', null, 'Lee Jung-sun', 'Lee Seung-gi, Cha Seung-won, Go Ara, Ahn Jae-hyun, Oh Yoon-ah, Seo Yi-sook, Lee Yi-kyung, Im Won-hee', 'NR', 'P4: are the new recruits in the violent crimes unit at Gangnam Police Station. The journey of four young cops as they fumble, learn, fall in love and find their way to becoming people the citizens can trust.', 'P4: are the new recruits in the violent crimes unit at Gangnam Police Station. The journey of four young cops as they fumble, learn, fall in love and find their way to becoming people the citizens can trust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qlb4RfxgPIea5Cw22L9RzH1NWww.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61173'),
  ('929059923682863613', 'You Are Beautiful', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Hong Jeong-eun, Hong Mi-ran', 'Jang Keun-suk, Park Shin-hye, Jung Yong-hwa, Lee Hong-gi, Uee, Kang Soo Han, Kim Sung-ryung, Jung Chan', 'TV-14', 'Posing as her twin brother in a boy band, a young woman wins the heart of her bandmates and fans, all the while searching for her long-lost mother.', 'Posing as her twin brother in a boy band, a young woman wins the heart of her bandmates and fans, all the while searching for her long-lost mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jUxyNd6xvfdMG9XiZBnOJe9IeNk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31417'),
  ('1129893512883460775', 'You Are Desire', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Sabrina Zhuang, Zhou Yiran, Chen Heyi, Fan Shiran, Bian Tianyang, Wang Chuan, Liao Yinyue, Jin Chao', null, 'After her parents'' divorce, Lin Yujing moves to a new city and becomes seatmates with Shen Juan, a withdrawn student repeating a year. As they grow closer, her presence begins to change his life. Just as things start to improve, she’s forced to return to her hometown. A year later, they reunite at university, where Lin Yujing helps Shen Juan confront his past and heal, while also discovering her own path in life.', 'After her parents'' divorce, Lin Yujing moves to a new city and becomes seatmates with Shen Juan, a withdrawn student repeating a year. As they grow closer, her presence begins to change his life. Just as things start to improve, she’s forced to return to her hometown. A year later, they reunite at university, where Lin Yujing helps Shen Juan confront his past and heal, while also discovering her own path in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93J5YpXVuu67zMbBBWJl7hUtuSp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:232441'),
  ('555570095723153507', 'You Are Everywhere', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Ömer Özgüner, Ümmü Burhan', 'Deniz Yeşilgün, Esra Çetek Yılmazer', 'Furkan Andıç, Aybüke Pusat, Ali Yağcı, Aslıhan Malbora, Ali Gözüşirin, Deniz Işın, Cem Cücenoğlu, Ayfer Tokatlı', null, 'Whether it''s destiny or life, the best things that happen to you are often hidden behind untold problems. Demir and Selin are stubborn like goats. They claim the same house and have to live together. In addition, when Demir comes to the company where Selin works as a manager, the events will be confused.', 'Whether it''s destiny or life, the best things that happen to you are often hidden behind untold problems. Demir and Selin are stubborn like goats. They claim the same house and have to live together. In addition, when Demir comes to the company where Selin works as a manager, the events will be confused.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJUxPKKxPbN84B5ZQzi7sSI1rrq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90302'),
  ('362827659429198091', 'You Are Mine', 2023, 'Drama', 'Hong-Ru Chen', 'Joe Tsai', 'Parker Mao, Hsiao Hung, Yorke Sun, Angel Hong, Yi-Chieh Lo, Lin Chiao-yuan', null, 'With a smile and a lot of patience, Shun Yu takes on a nightmare boss, determined to succeed no matter how tough things get.', 'With a smile and a lot of patience, Shun Yu takes on a nightmare boss, determined to succeed no matter how tough things get.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wQ8xssE3SdNAdsqq6n5gARmzh6R.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:230241'),
  ('1136206570995321375', 'You are Ms. Servant', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Toshiki Kumagai, Reina Ueda, Eriko Matsui, Hikaru Iida, Lynn, Konomi Inagaki', null, 'Hitoyoshi, a high school kid who lives alone, hears a knock on his door. He opens it to find a strange girl offering to be his maid. She has beautiful black hair, graceful manners, and…a dark past as an assassin. But despite her deadly background and lack of household skills, Hitoyoshi takes her in. As she adjusts to her new life, she begins to experience emotions she’s never felt before.', 'Hitoyoshi, a high school kid who lives alone, hears a knock on his door. He opens it to find a strange girl offering to be his maid. She has beautiful black hair, graceful manners, and…a dark past as an assassin. But despite her deadly background and lack of household skills, Hitoyoshi takes her in. As she adjusts to her new life, she begins to experience emotions she’s never felt before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyFOI6GkIN9JI1qaGLpEkrRlXdc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:242143'),
  ('679783630200308213', 'You Are My Destiny', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Xing Zhaolin, Liang Jie, Fu Jing, Li Jiulin, Wang Deshun', null, 'Two people living on "parallel lines" were never meant to interact, but an unanticipated meeting transforms them into each other''s destiny. On a cruise ship bound for Hungary, fledgling art editor Chen Jiaxin meets the highly-educated Wang Xiyi, heir to a huge conglomerate. Flaring passions are quickly followed by ''I do''s''. Then shortly after the wedding Chen Jiaxin becomes pregnant. She prioritizes family over her career before suffering a miscarriage. Heartbroken, she journeys to Hungary alone. There she endures trials and tribulations. But with perseverance and help from friends, she becomes an accomplished potter. Meanwhile, over seven years of separation Wang Xiyi has matured into someone capable of raising a family. Since so much time has passed, history and possibility converge when the two meet by chance in Hungary.', 'Two people living on "parallel lines" were never meant to interact, but an unanticipated meeting transforms them into each other''s destiny. On a cruise ship bound for Hungary, fledgling art editor Chen Jiaxin meets the highly-educated Wang Xiyi, heir to a huge conglomerate. Flaring passions are quickly followed by ''I do''s''. Then shortly after the wedding Chen Jiaxin becomes pregnant. She prioritizes family over her career before suffering a miscarriage. Heartbroken, she journeys to Hungary alone. There she endures trials and tribulations. But with perseverance and help from friends, she becomes an accomplished potter. Meanwhile, over seven years of separation Wang Xiyi has matured into someone capable of raising a family. Since so much time has passed, history and possibility converge when the two meet by chance in Hungary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6wdKoGISGiTLkvaCXr2ujGkFJ3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:104431'),
  ('1068480145203786301', 'You Are My Fateful Love', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Miles Wei, Zheng Hehuizi, Li Junxian, Li Geyang, Chen Haolan, Rainy Zhang, Eva Hu', null, 'Ruan Yu leaves her stable job to pursue writing but faces plagiarism accusations. Seeking legal help, she reconnects with Xu Huaisong, her high school crush and the inspiration for her novel’s male lead. As they work together through the challenges, old feelings reignite.', 'Ruan Yu leaves her stable job to pursue writing but faces plagiarism accusations. Seeking legal help, she reconnects with Xu Huaisong, her high school crush and the inspiration for her novel’s male lead. As they work together through the challenges, old feelings reignite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWD7slh3uKb9LZNKokSo84zD7xa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:283961'),
  ('1078765263859891278', 'You Are My Glory', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gu Man', null, 'Dilraba Dilmurat, Yang Yang, Pan Yueming, Hu Ke, Wang Yanlin, Sun Yali, Zhao Yingzi, Zheng Hehuizi', null, 'Qiao Jingjing, a celebrity, and Yu Tu, an aerospace engineer were high school classmates. Qiao Jingjing confessed to Yu Tu twice but was rejected both times. Ten years later, Qiao Jingjing became a top celebrity. She wants to become the endorser of a video game but was exposed that her gaming skills are super bad. By chance, she meets Yu Tu, who is now an aerospace engineer and is currently feeling lost about his career. Under Qiao Jingjing''s set-up, Yu Tu becomes her gaming coach. They slowly fall in love over time.', 'Qiao Jingjing, a celebrity, and Yu Tu, an aerospace engineer were high school classmates. Qiao Jingjing confessed to Yu Tu twice but was rejected both times. Ten years later, Qiao Jingjing became a top celebrity. She wants to become the endorser of a video game but was exposed that her gaming skills are super bad. By chance, she meets Yu Tu, who is now an aerospace engineer and is currently feeling lost about his career. Under Qiao Jingjing''s set-up, Yu Tu becomes her gaming coach. They slowly fall in love over time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n2j4J1OwOjAsjxSzavRf5AP76kR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127493'),
  ('94649561043050291', 'You Are My Hero', 2021, 'Drama', null, 'He Jie, Mu Qingyu, 刘紫薇', 'Ma Sichun, Bai Jingting, Wang Yang, Jiang Peiyao, Chen Hao, Zhang Yao', null, 'A story that follows Mi Ka, a new resident at the hospital who meets special ops agent Xing Kelei during an emergency rescue training organized by the SWAT team.', 'A story that follows Mi Ka, a new resident at the hospital who meets special ops agent Xing Kelei during an emergency rescue training organized by the SWAT team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2PD3rQ218D4C0cgCNoQvJLAYDRf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117987'),
  ('1100627608125859523', 'You Are My Lover Friend', 2024, 'Drama', null, 'Hua Gaimian', 'Zhang Xincheng, Wang Yuwen, Wu Junting, Luo Qiuyun, Guan Yue, Guo Yunqi, Lin Junyi', null, 'Tang Yang and Jiang Shi Yan were high school classmates and are close friends for ten years. After finishing school, they both passionately pursued careers in bank credit review and new media communication. Tang Yang helped the families of military martyrs start businesses in her small loan job. Jiang Shi Yan, inspired by their perseverance, made a documentary about their stories, which gained widespread attention. Throughout this journey, the trust and understanding they developed since their teenage years endured various challenges and blossomed into a sincere and beautiful love. They went from being classmates and friends to becoming partners, building a family, and facing life together.', 'Tang Yang and Jiang Shi Yan were high school classmates and are close friends for ten years. After finishing school, they both passionately pursued careers in bank credit review and new media communication. Tang Yang helped the families of military martyrs start businesses in her small loan job. Jiang Shi Yan, inspired by their perseverance, made a documentary about their stories, which gained widespread attention. Throughout this journey, the trust and understanding they developed since their teenage years endured various challenges and blossomed into a sincere and beautiful love. They went from being classmates and friends to becoming partners, building a family, and facing life together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ugf4XlIBcw5x4JMWTuii7uVBG8w.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259771'),
  ('745116422424923472', 'You Are My Makeup Artist', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', null, null, 'Kanawut Traipipattanapong, Janie Tienphosuwan, Jariya Anfone, Nisachon Tuamsoongnuen, Sirinuch Petchurai, Mayurin Pongpudpunth, Premanat Suwannannon, Varayuth Milintachinda', null, 'After a celebrity discovers her wealthy fiancé has been unfaithful, she has a drunken one-night stand with her makeup artist and risks her reputation.', 'After a celebrity discovers her wealthy fiancé has been unfaithful, she has a drunken one-night stand with her makeup artist and risks her reputation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPzIrQpcpa9YK6LSq4adma0jwW5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215521');
