  ('342220872138065168', 'Zemheri', 2020, 'Drama', 'Hilal Saral', 'Sema Ergenekon', 'Alperen Duymaz, Ayça Ayşin Turan, Caner Cindoruk, Hazal Filiz Küçükköse, Şebnem Dönmez, Zerrin Tekindor, Müfit Kayacan, Emir Çubukçu', null, 'Firuze and Ayaz. Two beautiful heart, two family carrying children overhead. Fate brought them together. Her father''s unjust conviction in the elevator accident that killed thirteen people triggered Firuze. Carrying the responsibility of being the man of the house, Ayaz is faced with Firuze, which he sacrificed for his mother when he was about to marry another.', 'Firuze and Ayaz. Two beautiful heart, two family carrying children overhead. Fate brought them together. Her father''s unjust conviction in the elevator accident that killed thirteen people triggered Firuze. Carrying the responsibility of being the man of the house, Ayaz is faced with Firuze, which he sacrificed for his mother when he was about to marry another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/koZdwkUOQy8JsuGcrUdtQZAhakS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97296'),
  ('109401986561408917', 'Zen', 2011, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Rufus Sewell, Caterina Murino, Stanley Townsend, Ben Miles, Ed Stoppard, Nathalie Rapti Gomez, Vincent Riotta, Catherine Spaak', null, 'Zen is a British television mini series produced by Left Bank Pictures for the BBC, co-produced with WGBH Boston for its Masterpiece anthology series, Mediaset and ZDF. It stars Rufus Sewell and Caterina Murino and is based on the Aurelio Zen detective novels by Michael Dibdin. The series was filmed on location in Italy, but the dialogue is in English. The series, which comprises three 90-minute films, was broadcast in the United Kingdom on Sunday evenings from 2 January 2011 on BBC One. The three films were based on the books Vendetta, Cabal and Ratking.', 'Zen is a British television mini series produced by Left Bank Pictures for the BBC, co-produced with WGBH Boston for its Masterpiece anthology series, Mediaset and ZDF. It stars Rufus Sewell and Caterina Murino and is based on the Aurelio Zen detective novels by Michael Dibdin. The series was filmed on location in Italy, but the dialogue is in English. The series, which comprises three 90-minute films, was broadcast in the United Kingdom on Sunday evenings from 2 January 2011 on BBC One. The three films were based on the books Vendetta, Cabal and Ratking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7F6RieTb4Z6MrArT0pZiokYyCw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34943'),
  ('763989843065835916', 'Zenimation', 2020, 'Animation, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'David Bess', null, null, 'TV-G', 'Unplug, relax, and refresh your senses for a moment of mindfulness with Walt Disney Animation Studios’ Zenimation - an animated soundscape experience.', 'Unplug, relax, and refresh your senses for a moment of mindfulness with Walt Disney Animation Studios’ Zenimation - an animated soundscape experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yP7ZZyooWrUGsbROjWGtrqji1Y7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:103822'),
  ('259394988673405568', 'Zenki', 1995, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Chisa Yokoyama, Jurota Kosugi, Kappei Yamaguchi, Eiji Maruyama, Keiichi Nanba, Kiyoyuki Yanada, Megumi Ogata, Shigezo Sasaoka', null, 'In ancient times, a great battle was waged between a master mage, Enno, and an evil demon goddess, Karuma. Enno didn''t have the strength to defeat her alone and was forced to call upon Zenki, a powerful protector demon. After Karuma was defeated, Enno sealed Zenki away in a pillar located inside his temple. 1,200 years after this epic battle, Enno''s descendant, Chiaki, unleashes her family''s powers to summon Zenki.', 'In ancient times, a great battle was waged between a master mage, Enno, and an evil demon goddess, Karuma. Enno didn''t have the strength to defeat her alone and was forced to call upon Zenki, a powerful protector demon. After Karuma was defeated, Enno sealed Zenki away in a pillar located inside his temple. 1,200 years after this epic battle, Enno''s descendant, Chiaki, unleashes her family''s powers to summon Zenki.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sFhXlSqk4FnAvDBaG9YKYnJiE1V.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34663'),
  ('728082150764084936', 'ZENSHU', 2025, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Anna Nagase, Kazuki Ura, Rie Kugimiya, Minori Suzuki, Akio Suyama, Romi Park, Manaka Iwami, Kentaro Tone', 'TV-14', 'After graduating from high school, Natsuko Hirose starts her career as an animator. Her talent quickly flourishes, and she makes her debut as a director in no time. Her first anime becomes a massive hit, sparking a social phenomenon and earning her recognition as an up-and-coming genius director. Her next project is set to be a romantic comedy movie themed around first love! However, having never been in love herself, Natsuko struggles to understand the concept of first love, and as a result, she’s unable to create the storyboard, causing the movie production to come to a standstill. One day, she passes out while working on her storyboard and wakes up in the world of her favorite childhood anime movie "A Tale of Perishing."', 'After graduating from high school, Natsuko Hirose starts her career as an animator. Her talent quickly flourishes, and she makes her debut as a director in no time. Her first anime becomes a massive hit, sparking a social phenomenon and earning her recognition as an up-and-coming genius director. Her next project is set to be a romantic comedy movie themed around first love! However, having never been in love herself, Natsuko struggles to understand the concept of first love, and as a result, she’s unable to create the storyboard, causing the movie production to come to a standstill. One day, she passes out while working on her storyboard and wakes up in the world of her favorite childhood anime movie "A Tale of Perishing."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/okRnvNLpduDKPUIyZbMxJkeek8D.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:249882'),
  ('841121428729973385', 'Zero', 2021, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Massimo Vavassori', 'Giuseppe Dave Seke, Haroun Fall, Beatrice Grannò, Richard Dylan Magon, Daniela Scattolin', 'TV-MA', 'A teenager who can make herself invisible is used by an idiot to take control of the neighborhood and then meets a mysterious art student.', 'A teenager who can make herself invisible is used by an idiot to take control of the neighborhood and then meets a mysterious art student.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/843MWmiaoMOrfnM2kPC96KfLUkt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:119861'),
  ('989001083441813232', 'Zero Chill', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Grace Beedie, Dakota Taylor, Jeremias Amoore, Anastázie Chocholatá, Leonardo Fontes, Jade Ma, Sarah-Jane Potts, Doug Rao', null, 'Talented teen figure skater Kayla is forced to leave everything behind when her family follows her twin brother, Mac, to a prestigious hockey academy.', 'Talented teen figure skater Kayla is forced to leave everything behind when her family follows her twin brother, Mac, to a prestigious hockey academy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y369iTgAG9oP0ffheGM83wNUJFC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:120849'),
  ('781438864330085533', 'Zero Day', 2025, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Eric Newman, Noah Oppenheim, Michael S. Schmidt', null, 'Robert De Niro, Jesse Plemons, Lizzy Caplan, Connie Britton, Joan Allen, Bill Camp, Dan Stevens, McKinley Belcher III', 'TV-MA', 'A former U.S. President is called out of retirement to find the source of a deadly cyberattack, only to discover a vast web of lies and conspiracies.', 'A former U.S. President is called out of retirement to find the source of a deadly cyberattack, only to discover a vast web of lies and conspiracies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odIyR46aAX59dvQ1ON4P53ow1aE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:216082'),
  ('569231658978204628', 'Zero Hour', 2013, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Paul T. Scheuring', null, 'Anthony Edwards, Carmen Ejogo, Scott Michael Foster, Addison Timlin, Jacinda Barrett, Michael Nyqvist, Dinarte de Freitas', null, 'As the publisher of Modern Skeptic Magazine, Hank Galliston has spent his career following clues, debunking myths and cracking conspiracies. But when his beautiful wife, Laila, is abducted from her antique clock shop, Hank gets pulled into one of the most compelling mysteries in human history, stretching around the world and back centuries.', 'As the publisher of Modern Skeptic Magazine, Hank Galliston has spent his career following clues, debunking myths and cracking conspiracies. But when his beautiful wife, Laila, is abducted from her antique clock shop, Hank gets pulled into one of the most compelling mysteries in human history, stretching around the world and back centuries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRExY6DiLcDp4q4o8KJveDNmQwo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43964'),
  ('1100532488084079231', 'Zero Stars', 2026, null, null, null, 'Roisin Conaty, Sara Pascoe', null, 'Roisin Conaty and Sara Pascoe journey across the globe to sample the worst reviewed accommodation, restaurants and experiences.', 'Roisin Conaty and Sara Pascoe journey across the globe to sample the worst reviewed accommodation, restaurants and experiences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cwgOwF5LOcxPKoKXB3kecxWIbBi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:294736'),
