  ('693422292969782777', '我叫赵吴狄之重启', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Leo Yang, Xiang Xin, Cheng Long, Bu Ziying, Jiang Yisheng, Long Sheng, Huang Shuowen, Sun Ying', null, 'After an accident leaves Zhao Wudi with no memory of his past, he finds himself in a dangerous, lawless territory. There, he unexpectedly reunites with Shen Xingyu—unaware that she is his wife—and becomes her bodyguard. As they face a series of deadly threats together, fragments of his memory begin to return, leading Zhao Wudi to rediscover their past and forge a new future by her side.', 'After an accident leaves Zhao Wudi with no memory of his past, he finds himself in a dangerous, lawless territory. There, he unexpectedly reunites with Shen Xingyu—unaware that she is his wife—and becomes her bodyguard. As they face a series of deadly threats together, fragments of his memory begin to return, leading Zhao Wudi to rediscover their past and forge a new future by her side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqHyb8ZRVoWKYs5nLLZzNDTtA8K.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:318831'),
